anos de implementação técnicos","Análise de código e design de soluções","Avaliação de abordagens técnicas","Criação de mapas de implementação","Quebra de requisitos complexos","Avaliação de trade-offs técnicos"],"ru":["Создание технических планов реализации","Анализ кода и проектирование решений","Оценка технических подходов","Создание карт реализации","Разделение сложных требований","Оценка технических компромиссов"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط تنفيذ فنية","تحليل الكود وتصميم الحلول","تقييم النهج الفني","إنشاء خرائط التنفيذ","تقسيم المتطلبات المعقدة","تقييم الاستثمارات الفنية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技术规划","代码库分析","解决方案设计","全面文档","技术方法评估","实现路线图","技术实现计划"],"ja":["テクニカルプランニング","コードベース分析","ソリューションデザイン","包括的なドキュメント","技術的アプローチ評価","実装ロードマップ","技術的実装計画"],"ko":["기술 계획","코드베이스 분석","솔루션 디자인","포괄적인 문서","기술적 접근법 평가","구현 로드맵","기술적 구현 계획"],"es":["planificación técnica","implementación de características","diseño de sistemas","análisis de código","evaluación de enfoques técnicos","creación de planes de implementación"],"fr":["planification technique","mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités","conception de systèmes","analyse de code","évaluation d''approches techniques","création de plans de mise en œuvre"],"de":["technische Planung","Implementierung von Funktionen","Systemdesign","Code-Analyse","Bewertung von technischen Ansätzen","Erstellung von Implementierungsplänen"],"pt":["planejamento técnico","implementação de recursos","análise de código","design de soluções","avaliação de abordagens técnicas","criação de mapas de implementação","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["техническое планирование","реализация функций","анализ кода","проектирование решений","оценка технических подходов","создание карт реализации","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التخطيط الفني","تنفيذ الميزات","تحليل الكود","تصميم الحلول","تقييم النهج الفني","إنشاء خرائط التنفيذ","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"planning","description":"Use when you need to plan technical solutions that are scalable, secure, and maintainable.","bodyPreview":"# Planning\n\nCreate detailed technical implementation plans through research, codebase analysis, solution design, and comprehensive documentation.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Planning new feature implementations\n- Architecting system designs\n- Evaluating technical approaches\n- Creating implementation roadmaps\n- Breaking down complex requirements\n- Assessing technical trade-offs\n\n## Core Responsibilities & Rules\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest,","body":"# Planning\n\nCreate detailed technical implementation plans through research, codebase analysis, solution design, and comprehensive documentation.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Planning new feature implementations\n- Architecting system designs\n- Evaluating technical approaches\n- Creating implementation roadmaps\n- Breaking down complex requirements\n- Assessing technical trade-offs\n\n## Core Responsibilities & Rules\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest, be brutal, straight to the point, and be concise.**\n\n### 1. Research & Analysis\nLoad: `references/research-phase.md`\n**Skip if:** Provided with researcher reports\n\n### 2. Codebase Understanding\nLoad: `references/codebase-understanding.md`\n**Skip if:** Provided with scout reports\n\n### 3. Solution Design\nLoad: `references/solution-design.md`\n\n### 4. Plan Creation & Organization\nLoad: `references/plan-organization.md`\n\n### 5. Task Breakdown & Output Standards\nLoad: `references/output-standards.md`\n\n## Workflow Process\n\n1. **Initial Analysis** → Read codebase docs, understand context\n2. **Research Phase** → Spawn researchers, investigate approaches\n3. **Synthesis** → Analyze reports, identify optimal solution\n4. **Design Phase** → Create architecture, implementation design\n5. **Plan Documentation** → Write comprehensive plan\n6. **Review & Refine** → Ensure completeness, clarity, actionability\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- DO NOT implement code - only create plans\n- Respond with plan file path and summary\n- Ensure self-contained plans with necessary context\n- Include code snippets/pseudocode when clarifying\n- Provide multiple options with trade-offs when appropriate\n- Fully respect the `./docs/development-rules.md` file.\n\n**Plan Directory Structure**\n```\nplans/\nâ””â”€â”€ {date}-plan-name/\n    â”œâ”€â”€ research/\n    â”‚   â”œâ”€â”€ researcher-XX-report.md\n    â”‚   â””â”€â”€ ...\n    â”œâ”€â”€ reports/\n    â”‚   â”œâ”€â”€ XX-report.md\n    â”‚   â””â”€â”€ ...\n    â”œâ”€â”€ scout/\n    â”‚   â”œâ”€â”€ scout-XX-report.md\n    â”‚   â””â”€â”€ ...\n    â”œâ”€â”€ plan.md\n    â”œâ”€â”€ phase-XX-phase-name-here.md\n    â””â”€â”€ ...\n```\n\n## Active Plan State\n\nPrevents version proliferation by tracking current working plan via session state.\n\n### Active vs Suggested Plans\n\nCheck the `## Plan Context` section injected by hooks:\n- **\"Plan: {path}\"** = Active plan, explicitly set via `set-active-plan.cjs` - use for reports\n- **\"Suggested: {path}\"** = Branch-matched, hint only - do NOT auto-use\n- **\"Plan: none\"** = No active plan\n\n### Rules\n\n1. **If \"Plan:\" shows a path**: Ask \"Continue with existing plan? [Y/n]\"\n2. **If \"Suggested:\" shows a path**: Inform user, ask if they want to activate or create new\n3. **If \"Plan: none\"**: Create new plan using naming from `## Naming` section\n4. **Update on create**: Run `node .codex/scripts/set-active-plan.cjs {plan-dir}`\n\n### Report Output Location\n\nAll agents writing reports MUST:\n1. Check `## Naming` section injected by hooks for the computed naming pattern\n2. Active plans use plan-specific reports path\n3. Suggested plans use default reports path (not plan folder)\n\n**Important:** Suggested plans do NOT get plan-specific reports - this prevents pollution of old plan folders.\n\n## Quality Standards\n\n- Be thorough and specific\n- Consider long-term maintainability\n- Research thoroughly when uncertain\n- Address security and performance concerns\n- Make plans detailed enough for junior developers\n- Validate against existing codebase patterns\n\n**Remember:** Plan quality determines implementation success. Be comprehensive and consider all solution aspects.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:23:18.398Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Agents requiring structured implementation planning and documentation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要结构化实施规划和文档编制能力的技术代理。","ja":"技術的なエージェントが構造化された実装計画と文書化の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 구현 계획 및 문서 작성 기능이 필요한 기술 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes técnicos que requieren planificación de implementación estructurada y capacidades de documentación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents techniques nécessitant une planification d''implémentation structurée et des capacités de documentation.","de":"Ideal für technische Agenten, die eine strukturierte Implementierungsplanung und Dokumentationsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Técnicos que requerem planejamento de implementação estruturado e capacidades de documentação.","ru":"Идеально для технических агентов, требующих структурированного планирования реализации и возможностей документирования.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الوكيل الفني التي تتطلب تخطيط التطبيق المهيكل وقدرات التوثيق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create detailed technical implementation plans through research, codebase analysis, and solution design, honoring YAGNI, KISS, and DRY principles, and utilizing comprehensive documentation and implementation roadmaps.","zh":"赋予代理创建通过研究、代码库分析和解决方案设计的详细技术实现计划的能力，遵守YAGNI、KISS和DRY原则，并利用全面文档和实施路线图。","ja":"エージェントが研究、コードベース分析、ソリューション設計を通じて詳細な技術的実装計画を作成する能力を付与し、YAGNI、KISS、DRY原則を遵守し、包括的な文書と実装ロードマップを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 연구, 코드베이스 분석 및 솔루션 설계를 통해 상세한 기술 구현 계획을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, YAGNI, KISS, DRY 원칙을 준수하고, 포괄적인 문서 및 구현 로드맵을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear planes de implementación técnica detallados a través de la investigación, el análisis del código base y el diseño de soluciones, respetando los principios YAGNI, KISS y DRY, y utilizando documentación y mapas de implementación integrales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans d''implémentation technique détaillés grâce à la recherche, à l''analyse du codebase et à la conception de solutions, en respectant les principes YAGNI, KISS et DRY, et en utilisant une documentation et des feuilles de route d''implémentation complètes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, detaillierte technische Implementierungspläne durch Forschung, Codebase-Analyse und Lösungsdesign zu erstellen, die YAGNI-, KISS- und DRY-Prinzipien einhalten und umfassende Dokumentation und Implementierungsstraßenkarten nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem planos de implementação técnicos detalhados por meio de pesquisa, análise de código e design de solução, honrando os princípios YAGNI, KISS e DRY, e utilizando documentação e mapas de implementação abrangentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать подробные технические планы реализации посредством исследований, анализа кодовой базы и проектирования решений, уважая принципы YAGNI, KISS и DRY, и используя всестороннюю документацию и дорожные карты реализации.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء خطط تنفيذ تقني مفصل من خلال البحث و تحليل قاعدة الشفرة وتصميم الحلول ، مع احترام مبادئ YAGNI و KISS و DRY ، واستخدام توثيق وخرائط طريق شاملة للتنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Architecting system designs for new feature implementations","Evaluating technical approaches for complex requirements","Breaking down complex requirements into manageable implementation roadmaps"],"zh":["为新功能实现架构系统设计","评估复杂需求的技术方法","将复杂需求分解为可管理的实施路线图"],"ja":["新機能の実装のためのシステム設計をアーキテクチャ化する","複雑な要件の技術的アプローチを評価する","複雑な要件を管理可能な実装ロードマップに分解する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 구현을 위한 시스템 디자인 아키텍처 구축","복잡한 요구사항에 대한 기술적 접근 방식 평가","복잡한 요구사항을 관리 가능한 구현 로드맵으로 분해"],"es":["Diseñar diseños de sistema para implementaciones de nuevas características","Evaluar enfoques técnicos para requisitos complejos","Dividir requisitos complejos en hojas de ruta de implementación manejables"],"fr":["Concevoir des conceptions de système pour les implémentations de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Évaluer les approches techniques pour les exigences complexes","Décomposer les exigences complexes en feuilles de route d''implémentation gérables"],"de":["Systemdesigns für die Implementierung neuer Funktionen entwerfen","Technische Ansätze für komplexe Anforderungen bewerten","Komplexe Anforderungen in handhabbare Implementierungsstraßen aufteilen"],"pt":["Projetar desenhos de sistema para implementações de recursos novos","Avaliar abordagens técnicas para requisitos complexos","Dividir requisitos complexos em mapas de implementação gerenciáveis"],"ru":["Проектирование системных дизайнов для реализации новых функций","Оценка технических подходов для сложных требований","Разделение сложных требований на управляемые дорожные карты реализации"],"ar":["تصميم تصاميم النظام لتطبيق الميزات الجديدة","تقييم المناهج الفنية للمتطلبات المعقدة","تقسيم المتطلبات المعقدة إلى خرائط طريق تنفيذ قابلة للإدارة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires codebase access for analysis","Honors YAGNI, KISS, and DRY principles, which may limit overly complex solutions"],"zh":["需要代码库访问以进行分析","遵守YAGNI、KISS和DRY原则，这可能会限制过于复杂的解决方案"],"ja":["分析のためにコードベースへのアクセスが必要","YAGNI、KISS、DRY原則を遵守するため、過度に複雑なソリューションが制限される"],"ko":["분석을 위해 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","YAGNI, KISS, DRY 원칙을 준수하여過度로 복잡한 솔루션이 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base para el análisis","Respeta los principios YAGNI, KISS y DRY, lo que puede limitar soluciones excesivamente complejas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au codebase pour l''analyse","Respecte les principes YAGNI, KISS et DRY, ce qui peut limiter les solutions excessivement complexes"],"de":["Benötigt Codebase-Zugriff für die Analyse","Ehrt YAGNI-, KISS- und DRY-Prinzipien, was überschüssig komplexe Lösungen einschränken kann"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código para análise","Honra os princípios YAGNI, KISS e DRY, o que pode limitar soluções excessivamente complexas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе для анализа","Уважает принципы YAGNI, KISS и DRY, что может ограничить чрезмерно сложные решения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة للتحليل","يهتم بمبادئ YAGNI و KISS و DRY ، مما قد يقيد الحلول المعقدة بشكل مفرط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vallafederico/webflow-dev-setup/webflow-page-transitions', 'community', 'vallafederico', 'webflow-dev-setup', 'vallafederico/webflow-dev-setup', 'webflow-page-transitions', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z', '2026-02-18T08:22:54.626Z', NULL, '{"id":"vallafederico/webflow-dev-setup/webflow-page-transitions","name":"webflow-page-transitions","description":{"zh":"Webflow 页面过渡使用 Taxi.js 实现导航和转场架构，提供顺畅的用户体验","ja":"Webflow ページ遷移は Taxi.js を使用してナビゲーションとトランジションアーキテクチャを実現し、スムーズなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供する","ko":"Webflow 페이지 전환은 Taxi.js를 사용하여 네비게이션과 전환 아키텍처를 구현하여 사용자에게 순畅한 경험을 제공합니다","es":"Transiciones de página Webflow con Taxi.js para una arquitectura de navegación eficaz. Mejora la experiencia del usuario con una transición suave entre páginas.","fr":"Transitions de page Webflow avec Taxi.js pour une architecture de navigation efficace. Améliorez l''expérience utilisateur avec une transition fluide entre les pages.","de":"Webflow-Seitenumbrüche mit Taxi.js für eine effiziente Navigationsarchitektur. Verbessern Sie die Benutzererfahrung mit einem fließenden Seitenumbruch zwischen den Seiten.","pt":"Transições de página Webflow com Taxi.js. Arquitetura de navegação e transição para melhorar a experiência do usuário","ru":"Переходы страниц Webflow с помощью Taxi.js. Архитектура навигации и переходов для улучшения пользовательского опыта","ar":"تحولات صفحة الويب فلوي مع Taxi.js. هندسة الملاحة والتحول لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Webflow 页面过渡","ja":"Webflow ページ遷移","ko":"Webflow 페이지 전환","es":"Transiciones de página Webflow","fr":"Transitions de page Webflow","de":"Webflow-Seitenumbrüche","pt":"Transições de Página Webflow","ru":"Переходы страниц Webflow","ar":"تحولات صفحة الويب فلوي","en":"webflow-page-transitions"},"description":{"zh":"Webflow 页面过渡使用 Taxi.js 实现导航和转场架构，提供顺畅的用户体验","ja":"Webflow ページ遷移は Taxi.js を使用してナビゲーションとトランジションアーキテクチャを実現し、スムーズなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供する","ko":"Webflow 페이지 전환은 Taxi.js를 사용하여 네비게이션과 전환 아키텍처를 구현하여 사용자에게 순畅한 경험을 제공합니다","es":"Transiciones de página Webflow con Taxi.js para una arquitectura de navegación eficaz. Mejora la experiencia del usuario con una transición suave entre páginas.","fr":"Transitions de page Webflow avec Taxi.js pour une architecture de navigation efficace. Améliorez l''expérience utilisateur avec une transition fluide entre le...","de":"Webflow-Seitenumbrüche mit Taxi.js für eine effiziente Navigationsarchitektur. Verbessern Sie die Benutzererfahrung mit einem fließenden Seitenumbruch zwisch...","pt":"Transições de página Webflow com Taxi.js. Arquitetura de navegação e transição para melhorar a experiência do usuário","ru":"Переходы страниц Webflow с помощью Taxi.js. Архитектура навигации и переходов для улучшения пользовательского опыта","ar":"تحولات صفحة الويب فلوي مع Taxi.js. هندسة الملاحة والتحول لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用 Taxi.js 实现页面过渡","支持导航和转场架构","提供顺畅的用户体验","支持模块的创建和销毁","支持 onPageIn 和 onPageOut 事件"],"ja":["Taxi.js を使用してページ遷移を実現","ナビゲーションとトランジションアーキテクチャをサポート","スムーズなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供","モジュールの作成と破棄をサポート","onPageIn と onPageOut イベントをサポート"],"ko":["Taxi.js를 사용하여 페이지 전환을 구현","네비게이션과 전환 아키텍처를 지원","사용자에게 순畅한 경험을 제공","모듈의 생성과銷毀을 지원","onPageIn과 onPageOut 이벤트를 지원"],"es":["Transiciones de página suaves","Arquitectura de navegación eficaz","Implementación de Taxi.js","Destruction de módulos","Carga de contenido nuevo","Creación de módulos"],"fr":["Transitions de page fluides","Architecture de navigation efficace","Mise en œuvre de Taxi.js","Destruction de modules","Chargement de contenu nouveau","Création de modules"],"de":["Fließende Seitenumbrüche","Effiziente Navigationsarchitektur","Implementierung von Taxi.js","Zerstörung von Modulen","Laden von neuem Inhalt","Erstellung von Modulen"],"pt":["Navegação e transição suaves","Arquitetura de transição personalizável","Integração com Taxi.js","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Transições de página personalizadas","Otimização para dispositivos móveis"],"ru":["Плавная навигация и переходы","Настраиваемая архитектура переходов","Интеграция с Taxi.js","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Персонализированные переходы между страницами","Оптимизация для мобильных устройств"],"ar":["ملاحة وتحول سلس","هندسة تحول قابلة للتعديل","التكامل مع Taxi.js","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","تحولات صفحة مخصصة","التحسين للاجهزة المحمولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Webflow 页面过渡","Taxi.js","导航","转场架构","用户体验","模块创建","模块销毁"],"ja":["Webflow ページ遷移","Taxi.js","ナビゲーション","トランジションアーキテクチャ","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","モジュール作成","モジュール破棄"],"ko":["Webflow 페이지 전환","Taxi.js","네비게이션","전환 아키텍처","사용자 경험","모듈 생성","모듈销毀"],"es":["transiciones de página webflow","taxi.js","navegación webflow","arquitectura de navegación","experiencia del usuario","desarrollo web","webflow","transiciones suaves"],"fr":["transitions de page webflow","taxi.js","navigation webflow","architecture de navigation","expérience utilisateur","développement web","webflow","transitions fluides"],"de":["webflow-seitenumbrüche","taxi.js","webflow-navigations","navigationsarchitektur","benutzererfahrung","webentwicklung","webflow","fließende seitenumbrüche"],"pt":["transições de página webflow","taxi.js","navegação suave","transição suave","experiência do usuário","arquitetura de transição","desenvolvimento web","webflow","ux"],"ru":["переходы страниц webflow","taxi.js","плавная навигация","плавные переходы","пользовательский опыт","архитектура переходов","веб-разработка","webflow","ux"],"ar":["تحولات صفحة الويب فلوي","taxi.js","ملاحة سلس","تحول سلس","تجربة المستخدم","هندسة التحول","تطوير الويب","webflow","ux"]}},"owner":"vallafederico","repo":"webflow-dev-setup","repoPath":"vallafederico/webflow-dev-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webflow-page-transitions","description":"Manage and implement client-side page transitions using Taxi.js. Use when creating transition animations, handling cross-page state, or debugging navigation.","bodyPreview":"# Webflow Page Transitions\n\nNavigation and transition architecture using Taxi.js.\n\n## Sequence\n1. User clicks link.\n2. `transitionOut` triggers `onPageOut` in current modules.\n3. Modules are destroyed.\n4. New content loads.\n5. Modules are created and `onPageIn` triggers.\n6. `onMount` runs.","body":"# Webflow Page Transitions\n\nNavigation and transition architecture using Taxi.js.\n\n## Sequence\n1. User clicks link.\n2. `transitionOut` triggers `onPageOut` in current modules.\n3. Modules are destroyed.\n4. New content loads.\n5. Modules are created and `onPageIn` triggers.\n6. `onMount` runs.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:22:54.626Z","qualityScore":0}');
