laywright-CLI는 브라우저 작업을 자동화하기 위한 터미널 도구입니다","es":"playwright-cli es una herramienta de automatización de navegador para tareas de ingeniería de software","fr":"playwright-cli est un outil d''automatisation de navigateur pour les tâches d''ingénierie logicielle","de":"playwright-cli ist ein Tool für die Automatisierung von Browsern für Software-Engineering-Aufgaben","pt":"O playwright-cli é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para automação de navegador, permitindo que os desenvolvedores automatizem tarefas de engenharia de sof...","ru":"Playwright-cli - это инструмент командной строки для автоматизации браузера, позволяющий разработчикам автоматизировать задачи программной инженерии эффективно","ar":"playwright-cli هو أداة سطر الأوامر لتأتمة المتصفحات، مما يسمح للمطورين بالتحكم في تطبيقات الهندسة البرمجية بفعالية","en":"Terminal-first AI assistant for software engineering tasks (inspired by Claude Code v2.0.67)"},"definition":{"en":"Terminal-first AI assistant for software engineering tasks (inspired by Claude Code v2.0.67)"},"features":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","终端命令行接口","快捷键支持","截图功能","浏览器交互"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","ターミナルコマンドラインインターフェース","ショートカットキー対応","スクリーンショット機能","ブラウザ操作"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","터미널 명령줄 인터페이스","단축키 지원","스크린샷 기능","브라우저 상호작용"],"es":["Automatización de navegador","Interacción con páginas web","Captura de pantalla","Apertura y cierre de navegador","Navegación y clic en elementos"],"fr":["Automatisation de navigateur","Interaction avec les pages web","Capture d''écran","Ouverture et fermeture de navigateur","Navigation et clic sur les éléments"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","Interaktion mit Webseiten","Bildschirmfoto","Öffnen und Schließen des Browsers","Navigation und Klick auf Elemente"],"pt":["Abre e navega em páginas da web","Interage com elementos da página usando referências","Tira screenshots da página","Fecha o navegador","Suporta comandos personalizados","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Открывает и навигирует по веб-страницам","Взаимодействует с элементами страницы с помощью ссылок","Делает скриншоты страницы","Закрывает браузер","Поддерживает пользовательские команды","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["فتح وتنقل إلى صفحات الويب","التفاعل مع عناصر الصفحة باستخدام المراجع","التقاط لقطات الشاشة من الصفحة","إغلاق المتصفح","دعم الأوامر المخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Playwright-CLI","浏览器自动化","终端工具","AI助手","软件工程","自动化测试"],"ja":["Playwright-CLI","ブラウザ自動化","ターミナルツール","AIアシスタント","ソフトウェアエンジニアリング","自動テスト"],"ko":["Playwright-CLI","브라우저 자동화","터미널 도구","AI 에이전트","소프트웨어 엔지니어링","자동화 테스트"],"es":["automatización de navegador","ingeniería de software","playwright-cli","terminal","asistente de terminal","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","ingénierie logicielle","playwright-cli","terminal","assistant de terminal","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","Software-Engineering","playwright-cli","Terminal","Terminal-Assistent","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["automação de navegador","engenharia de software","playwright-cli","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","automatização de tarefas","linha de comando","browser automation"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","программная инженерия","playwright-cli","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","автоматизация задач","командная строка","browser automation"],"ar":["تأتمة المتصفحات","هندسة البرمجيات","playwright-cli","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","التحكم في المهام","سطر الأوامر","browser automation"]}},"owner":"yusifeng","repo":"formax","repoPath":"yusifeng/formax","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.466Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-cli","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# open new browser\nplaywright-cli open\n# navigate to a page\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\n# interact with the page using refs from the snapshot\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n# take a screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot\n# close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open\n# open and navigate right away\nplaywright-cli ope","body":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# open new browser\nplaywright-cli open\n# navigate to a page\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\n# interact with the page using refs from the snapshot\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n# take a screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot\n# close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open\n# open and navigate right away\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\nplaywright-cli type \"search query\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli dblclick e7\nplaywright-cli fill e5 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli drag e2 e8\nplaywright-cli hover e4\nplaywright-cli select e9 \"option-value\"\nplaywright-cli upload ./document.pdf\nplaywright-cli check e12\nplaywright-cli uncheck e12\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli snapshot --filename=after-click.yaml\nplaywright-cli eval \"document.title\"\nplaywright-cli eval \"el => el.textContent\" e5\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept \"confirmation text\"\nplaywright-cli dialog-dismiss\nplaywright-cli resize 1920 1080\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli go-back\nplaywright-cli go-forward\nplaywright-cli reload\n```\n\n### Keyboard\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli press Enter\nplaywright-cli press ArrowDown\nplaywright-cli keydown Shift\nplaywright-cli keyup Shift\n```\n\n### Mouse\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli mousemove 150 300\nplaywright-cli mousedown\nplaywright-cli mousedown right\nplaywright-cli mouseup\nplaywright-cli mouseup right\nplaywright-cli mousewheel 0 100\n```\n\n### Save as\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot e5\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=page.png\nplaywright-cli pdf --filename=page.pdf\n```\n\n### Tabs\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-new\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/page\nplaywright-cli tab-close\nplaywright-cli tab-close 2\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\n```\n\n### Storage\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli state-save\nplaywright-cli state-save auth.json\nplaywright-cli state-load auth.json\n\n# Cookies\nplaywright-cli cookie-list\nplaywright-cli cookie-list --domain=example.com\nplaywright-cli cookie-get session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123 --domain=example.com --httpOnly --secure\nplaywright-cli cookie-delete session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-clear\n\n# LocalStorage\nplaywright-cli localstorage-list\nplaywright-cli localstorage-get theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-set theme dark\nplaywright-cli localstorage-delete theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-clear\n\n# SessionStorage\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-list\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-get step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-set step 3\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-delete step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-clear\n```\n\n### Network\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli route \"**/*.jpg\" --status=404\nplaywright-cli route \"https://api.example.com/**\" --body=''{\"mock\": true}''\nplaywright-cli route-list\nplaywright-cli unroute \"**/*.jpg\"\nplaywright-cli unroute\n```\n\n### DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli console warning\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli run-code \"async page => await page.context().grantPermissions([''geolocation''])\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\nplaywright-cli video-start\nplaywright-cli video-stop video.webm\n```\n\n### Install\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli install --skills\nplaywright-cli install-browser\n```\n\n### Configuration\n```bash\n# Use specific browser when creating session\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chrome\nplaywright-cli open --browser=firefox\nplaywright-cli open --browser=webkit\nplaywright-cli open --browser=msedge\n# Connect to browser via extension\nplaywright-cli open --extension\n\n# Use persistent profile (by default profile is in-memory)\nplaywright-cli open --persistent\n# Use persistent profile with custom directory\nplaywright-cli open --profile=/path/to/profile\n\n# Start with config file\nplaywright-cli open --config=my-config.json\n\n# Close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n# Delete user data for the default session\nplaywright-cli delete-data\n```\n\n### Browser Sessions\n\n```bash\n# create new browser session named \"mysession\" with persistent profile\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession open example.com --persistent\n# same with manually specified profile directory (use when requested explicitly)\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession open example.com --profile=/path/to/profile\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession click e6\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession close  # stop a named browser\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession delete-data  # delete user data for persistent session\n\nplaywright-cli list\n# Close all browsers\nplaywright-cli close-all\n# Forcefully kill all browser processes\nplaywright-cli kill-all\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/form\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n\nplaywright-cli fill e1 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli fill e2 \"password123\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Example: Multi-tab workflow\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/other\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Example: Debugging with DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Specific tasks\n\n* **Request mocking** [references/request-mocking.md](references/request-mocking.md)\n* **Running Playwright code** [references/running-code.md](references/running-code.md)\n* **Browser session management** [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md)\n* **Storage state (cookies, localStorage)** [references/storage-state.md](references/storage-state.md)\n* **Test generation** [references/test-generation.md](references/test-generation.md)\n* **Tracing** [references/tracing.md](references/tracing.md)\n* **Video recording** [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:23:47.265Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Terminal-based AI Agents needing automated browser interaction and testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动浏览器交互和测试功能的基于终端的AI代理。","ja":"ターミナルベースのAIエージェントが自動ブラウザ操作とテスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동 브라우저 상호작용 및 테스트 기능이 필요한 터미널 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA basados en Terminal que necesitan interacción y capacidades de prueba automatizadas del navegador.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA basés sur Terminal ayant besoin d''interaction et de capacités de test automatisées du navigateur.","de":"Perfekt für Terminal-basierte KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte Browser-Interaktion und Testfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Terminal que necessitam de interação automática do navegador e capacidades de teste.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, основанных на терминале, которые требуют автоматизированного взаимодействия с браузером и возможностей тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الذكي القائم على الطرفية الذي يحتاج إلى تفاعل متصفح أوتوماتيكي وقدرات الاختبار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser tasks using commands like ''open'', ''goto'', and ''click'', leveraging the power of browser automation with protocols like HTTPS and tools like playwright-cli, enabling efficient testing and debugging of web applications.","zh":"赋予代理使用像''open''、''goto''和''click''这样的命令来自动执行浏览器任务的能力，利用像HTTPS这样的协议和像playwright-cli这样的工具的浏览器自动化能力，从而实现对Web应用程序的高效测试和调试。","ja":"エージェントに、''open''、''goto''、''click''などのコマンドを使用してブラウザタスクを自動化する能力を与え、HTTPSなどのプロトコルやplaywright-cliなどのツールを使用したブラウザ自動化の力により、Webアプリケーションの効率的なテストとデバッグを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트에게 ''open'', ''goto'', ''click''와 같은 명령을 사용하여 브라우저 작업을 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜 및 playwright-cli와 같은 도구를 사용한 브라우저 자동화의 힘으로 웹 애플리케이션의 효율적인 테스트 및 디버깅을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas del navegador utilizando comandos como ''abrir'', ''ir a'' y ''hacer clic'', aprovechando el poder de la automatización del navegador con protocolos como HTTPS y herramientas como playwright-cli, lo que permite una prueba y depuración eficientes de aplicaciones web.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tâches du navigateur en utilisant des commandes comme ''ouvrir'', ''aller à'' et ''cliquer'', en exploitant le pouvoir de l''automatisation du navigateur avec des protocoles comme HTTPS et des outils comme playwright-cli, ce qui permet un test et un débogage efficaces des applications web.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Browser-Aufgaben mit Befehlen wie ''öffnen'', ''gehen zu'' und ''klicken'' zu automatisieren, indem es die Power der Browser-Automatisierung mit Protokollen wie HTTPS und Tools wie playwright-cli nutzt, was ein effizientes Testen und Debuggen von Webanwendungen ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar tarefas do navegador usando comandos como ''abrir'', ''ir para'' e ''clique'', aproveitando o poder da automação do navegador com protocolos como HTTPS e ferramentas como playwright-cli, permitindo testes e depuração eficientes de aplicações web.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать задачи браузера с помощью команд типа ''открыть'', ''перейти'' и ''клик'', используя возможности автоматизации браузера с протоколами типа HTTPS и инструментами типа playwright-cli, обеспечивая эффективное тестирование и отладку веб-приложений.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توفير任务 المتصفح باستخدام أوامر مثل ''افتح'' و ''اذهب إلى'' و ''انقر''، مستفيداً من قوة أتمتة المتصفح ببروتوكولات مثل HTTPS وأدوات مثل playwright-cli، وتمكين الاختبار والتصحيح الفعال لتطبيقات الويب."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser testing for web applications","Generating screenshots of web pages","Interacting with web pages using commands like ''type'' and ''press''"],"zh":["为Web应用程序自动执行浏览器测试","生成网页的截图","使用像''type''和''press''这样的命令与网页交互"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションのブラウザテストを自動化する","Webページのスクリーンショットを生成する","''type''や''press''などのコマンドを使用してWebページと交互作用する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 브라우저 테스트 자동화","웹 페이지의 스크린샷 생성","''type'' 및 ''press''와 같은 명령을 사용하여 웹 페이지와 상호 작용"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de navegador para aplicaciones web","Generación de capturas de pantalla de páginas web","Interacción con páginas web utilizando comandos como ''escribir'' y ''presionar''"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de navigateur pour les applications web","Génération de captures d''écran de pages web","Interaction avec les pages web en utilisant des commandes comme ''taper'' et ''appuyer''"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browser-Tests für Webanwendungen","Erzeugung von Screenshots von Webseiten","Interaktion mit Webseiten unter Verwendung von Befehlen wie ''tippen'' und ''drücken''"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de navegador para aplicações web","Gerar capturas de tela de páginas da web","Interação com páginas da web usando comandos como ''digitar'' e ''pressionar''"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования браузера для веб-приложений","Генерация скриншотов веб-страниц","Взаимодействие с веб-страницами с помощью команд типа ''ввести'' и ''нажать''"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار المتصفح لتطبيقات الويب","إنشاء لقطات شاشة من صفحات الويب","التفاعل مع صفحات الويب باستخدام أوامر مثل ''كتابة'' و ''ضغط''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires terminal access","Limited to browser automation tasks"],"zh":["需要终端访问","仅限于浏览器自动化任务"],"ja":["ターミナルアクセスが必要","ブラウザ自動化タスクのみに限定される"],"ko":["터미널 액세스가 필요함","브라우저 자동화 작업만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Terminal","Limitado a tareas de automatización del navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au Terminal","Limité aux tâches d''automatisation du navigateur"],"de":["Benötigt Terminal-Zugriff","Begrenzt auf Browser-Automatisierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao terminal","Limitado a tarefas de automação do navegador"],"ru":["Требует доступа к терминалу","Ограничен задачами автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الطرفية","محدود بمهام أتمتة المتصفح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
