 décisions d''architecture. Elle aide à documenter et à justifier les décisions pour des références futures.","de":"ADR ist eine Fähigkeit, um Architekturentscheidungen aufzuzeichnen. Sie hilft bei der Dokumentation und Rechtfertigung von Entscheidungen für zukünftige Refe...","pt":"ADR é uma habilidade que ajuda a capturar decisões arquiteturais para auditoria e trabalho futuro, melhorando a documentação do projeto.","ru":"ADR - это навык, который помогает записывать архитектурные решения для аудита и будущей работы, улучшая документацию проекта.","ar":"ADR هو مهارة تساعد على توثيق القرارات الهندسية لمراجعة و عمل مستقبلي، و تحسين وثائق المشروع.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["DECISIONS.md","ADR","API","ADR","ADR"],"ja":["DECISIONS.md","ADR","API","ADR","ADR"],"ko":["DECISIONS.md","ADR","API","ADR","ADR"],"es":["Registro de decisiones en un formato estructurado","Inclusión de contexto y alternativas","Enlace a documentos relevantes","Mejora de la colaboración y la documentación","Facilita la revisión y la auditoría de decisiones"],"fr":["Enregistrement des décisions dans un format structuré","Inclusion du contexte et des alternatives","Lien vers des documents pertinents","Amélioration de la collaboration et de la documentation","Facilite l''examen et l''audit des décisions"],"de":["Aufzeichnung von Entscheidungen in einem strukturierten Format","Einbeziehung von Kontext und Alternativen","Verknüpfung mit relevanten Dokumenten","Verbesserung der Zusammenarbeit und der Dokumentation","Erleichtert die Überprüfung und Prüfung von Entscheidungen"],"pt":["Preencha o modelo de ADR em `DECISIONS.md`","Inclua contexto, decisão, alternativas e consequências","Link o ADR em documentos relevantes","Melhore a documentação do projeto","Facilite a auditoria e o trabalho futuro"],"ru":["Заполните шаблон ADR в `DECISIONS.md`","Включите контекст, решение, альтернативы и последствия","Ссылка на ADR в соответствующих документах","Улучшите документацию проекта","Облегчите аудит и будущую работу"],"ar":["املأ قالب ADR في `DECISIONS.md`","شمل السياق، القرار، البديل، العواقب","رابط ADR في الوثائق ذات الصلة","حسن توثيق المشروع","سهل المراجعة و العمل المستقبلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ADR","API","ADR","ADR","DECISIONS.md","ADR"],"ja":["ADR","API","ADR","ADR","DECISIONS.md","ADR"],"ko":["ADR","API","ADR","ADR","DECISIONS.md","ADR"],"es":["ADR","Registro de Decisiones Arquitectónicas","documentación de decisiones","colaboración en equipo","mejora de procesos","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["ADR","Enregistrement des Décisions d''Architecture","documentation des décisions","collaboration d''équipe","amélioration des processus","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["ADR","Aufzeichnung von Architekturentscheidungen","Dokumentation von Entscheidungen","Zusammenarbeit im Team","Prozessverbesserung","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["ADR","decisões arquiteturais","documentação de projeto","auditoria","trabalho futuro","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["ADR","архитектурные решения","документация проекта","аудит","будущая работа","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["ADR","قرارات هندسية","توثيق مشروع","مراجعة","عمل مستقبلي","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"CheekyCodexConjurer","repo":"aera-chart-engine","repoPath":"CheekyCodexConjurer/aera-chart-engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"write_adr","description":"Document architectural decisions with context and consequences.","bodyPreview":"## Purpose\nCapture architectural decisions for audit and future work.\n\n## Steps\n1. Fill the ADR template in `DECISIONS.md`.\n2. Include context, decision, alternatives, consequences.\n3. Link the ADR in relevant docs.","body":"## Purpose\nCapture architectural decisions for audit and future work.\n\n## Steps\n1. Fill the ADR template in `DECISIONS.md`.\n2. Include context, decision, alternatives, consequences.\n3. Link the ADR in relevant docs.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:26:07.750Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing structured decision documentation in Markdown format.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化决策文档的技术写作代理，特别是以Markdown格式呈现。","ja":"技術文章作成エージェントがマークダウン形式で構造化された意思決定文書を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"기술 문서 에이전트가 마크다운 형식으로 구조화된 의사 결정 문서가 필요한 경우에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de escritura técnica que necesitan documentación de decisiones estructuradas en formato Markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rédaction technique nécessitant une documentation de décision structurée au format Markdown.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die eine strukturierte Entscheidungsdokumentation im Markdown-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que necessitam de documentação de decisão estruturada no formato Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технической документации, которым требуется структурированная документация решений в формате Markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الكتابة الفنية الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق تصمیمات منظم في تنسيق Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture architectural decisions with context, alternatives, and consequences, linking them in relevant documents using Markdown files like `DECISIONS.md`.","zh":"赋予代理捕获架构决策的能力，包括上下文、替代方案和后果，并使用Markdown文件（如`DECISIONS.md`）将其链接到相关文档中。","ja":"エージェントがアーキテクチャ上の決定をコンテキスト、代替案、結果とともに 捕捉し、`DECISIONS.md`のようなマークダウンファイルを使用して関連する文書にリンクできるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 아키텍처 의사 결정을 포함하여 맥락, 대체方案 및 결과를 포착할 수 있도록 하며, `DECISIONS.md`와 같은 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 관련 문서에 링크할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar decisiones arquitectónicas con contexto, alternativas y consecuencias, enlazarlas en documentos relevantes utilizando archivos Markdown como `DECISIONES.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer les décisions architecturales avec contexte, alternatives et conséquences, en les reliant dans des documents pertinents en utilisant des fichiers Markdown tels que `DECISIONS.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, architektonische Entscheidungen mit Kontext, Alternativen und Konsequenzen zu erfassen und sie in relevanten Dokumenten unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien wie `ENTSCHEIDUNGEN.md` zu verlinken.","pt":"Permite que os agentes capturem decisões arquiteturais com contexto, alternativas e consequências, vinculando-as em documentos relevantes usando arquivos Markdown como `DECISIONS.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью фиксировать архитектурные решения с контекстом, альтернативами и последствиями, связывая их с соответствующими документами с помощью файлов Markdown, таких как `DECISIONS.md`.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على التقاط القرارات المعمارية مع السياق و البديلات و العواقب، و ربطها في المستندات ذات الصلة باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل `DECISIONS.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting design rationale","Tracking technical debt","Maintaining audit trails for future development"],"zh":["记录设计理由","跟踪技术债务","为未来开发维护审计跟踪"],"ja":["設計理論の記録","技術負債の追跡","将来の開発のための監査ログの維持"],"ko":["디자인 이론 기록","기술 부채 추적","미래 개발을 위한 감사 로그 유지"],"es":["Documentar la justificación del diseño","Rastrear la deuda técnica","Mantener registros de auditoría para futuros desarrollos"],"fr":["Documenter la justification de la conception","Traquer la dette technique","Maintenir des traces d''audit pour les développements futurs"],"de":["Die Begründung des Designs dokumentieren","Die technische Schulden verfolgen","Audit-Protokolle für zukünftige Entwicklungen aufrechterhalten"],"pt":["Documentação da razão de design","Rastreamento de dívida técnica","Manutenção de registros de auditoria para desenvolvimento futuro"],"ru":["Документирование причины проектирования","Отслеживание технического долга","Ведение аудиторских журналов для будущего развития"],"ar":["توثيق سبب التصميم","تتبع الديون الفنية","صيانة سجلات التدقيق للتنمية المستقبلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Markdown files","Limited to text-based decision documentation"],"zh":["需要访问Markdown文件","仅限于基于文本的决策文档"],"ja":["マークダウンファイルへのアクセスが必要","テキストベースの意思決定文書に限定される"],"ko":["마크다운 파일에 접근해야 함","텍스트 기반 의사 결정 문서에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos Markdown","Limitado a la documentación de decisiones basada en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers Markdown","Limité à la documentation de décision basée sur le texte"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Markdown-Dateien","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Entscheidungsdokumentation"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos Markdown","Limitado à documentação de decisão baseada em texto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам Markdown","Ограничен документированием решений на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات Markdown","محدود بالتوثيق القراري القائم على النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('johannesbremer/praxisplaner/shadcn-ui', 'community', 'johannesbremer', 'praxisplaner', 'johannesbremer/praxisplaner', 'shadcn-ui', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z', '2026-02-18T08:25:34.537Z', NULL, '{"id":"johannesbremer/praxisplaner/shadcn-ui","name":"shadcn-ui","description":{"zh":"Shadcn UI, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Radix UI","ja":"Shadcn UITypeScriptTailwind CSSRadix UI","ko":"Shadcn UI, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Radix UI","es":"Shadcn-UI es una colección de componentes de interfaz de usuario diseñados con TypeScript, Tailwind CSS y Radix UI. Soporta Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Laravel y más","fr":"Shadcn-UI est une collection de composants d''interface utilisateur conçus avec TypeScript, Tailwind CSS et Radix UI. Il prend en charge Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Laravel et plus","de":"Shadcn-UI ist eine Sammlung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten, die mit TypeScript, Tailwind CSS und Radix UI entwickelt wurden. Es unterstützt Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Laravel und mehr","pt":"O Shadcn-UI é uma coleção de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis para desenvolvedores, com suporte a Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro e Laravel.","ru":"Shadcn-UI - это коллекция доступных и настраиваемых компонентов UI для разработчиков, с поддержкой Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro и Laravel.","ar":"شادكن-يоу آي هي مجموعة من مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والتعديل لل مطورين، مع دعم للنكست.جس، فايت، ريمكس، أسترو و لارافيل","en":"TBD"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Shadcn UI ","ja":"Shadcn UI","ko":"Shadcn UI ","es":"Shadcn-UI: Componentes de interfaz de usuario para desarr...","fr":"Shadcn-UI: Composants d''interface utilisateur pour dévelo...","de":"Shadcn-UI: Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für Entwickler","pt":"Shadcn-UI: Componentes de UI para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Shadcn-UI: Компоненты UI для Разработчиков","ar":"شادكن-يου آي: مكونات واجهة المستخدم لل مطورين","en":"shadcn-ui"},"description":{"zh":"Shadcn UI, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Radix UI","ja":"Shadcn UITypeScriptTailwind CSSRadix UI","ko":"Shadcn UI, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Radix UI","es":"Shadcn-UI es una colección de componentes de interfaz de usuario diseñados con TypeScript, Tailwind CSS y Radix UI. Soporta Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Lara...","fr":"Shadcn-UI est une collection de composants d''interface utilisateur conçus avec TypeScript, Tailwind CSS et Radix UI. Il prend en charge Next.js, Vite, Remix,...","de":"Shadcn-UI ist eine Sammlung von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten, die mit TypeScript, Tailwind CSS und Radix UI entwickelt wurden. Es unterstützt Next.js, Vite...","pt":"O Shadcn-UI é uma coleção de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis para desenvolvedores, com suporte a Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro e Laravel.","ru":"Shadcn-UI - это коллекция доступных и настраиваемых компонентов UI для разработчиков, с поддержкой Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro и Laravel.","ar":"شادكن-يоу آي هي مجموعة من مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والتعديل لل مطورين، مع دعم للنكست.جس، فايت، ريمكس، أسترو و لارافيل","en":"TBD"},"definition":{"en":"TBD"},"features":{"zh":["TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix"],"ja":["TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix"],"ko":["TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix"],"es":["Componentes de interfaz de usuario diseñados con TypeScript","Soporte para Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Laravel y más","Integración con Tailwind CSS y Radix UI","Accesibilidad y personalización","Compatibilidad con React Hook Form y TanStack Form"],"fr":["Composants d''interface utilisateur conçus avec TypeScript","Prise en charge de Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Laravel et plus","Intégration avec Tailwind CSS et Radix UI","Accessibilité et personnalisation","Compatibilité avec React Hook Form et TanStack Form"],"de":["Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten entwickelt mit TypeScript","Unterstützung für Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Laravel und mehr","Integration mit Tailwind CSS und Radix UI","Zugänglichkeit und Anpassung","Kompatibilität mit React Hook Form und TanStack Form"],"pt":["Componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis","Suporte a Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro e Laravel","Construído com TypeScript, Tailwind CSS e Radix UI","Integração com React Hook Form e TanStack Form","Compatível com vários frameworks e bibliotecas"],"ru":["Доступные и настраиваемые компоненты UI","Поддержка Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro и Laravel","Построено на TypeScript, Tailwind CSS и Radix UI","Интеграция с React Hook Form и TanStack Form","Совместимость с несколькими фреймворками и библиотеками"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والتعديل","دعم للنكست.جس، فايت، ريمكس، أسترو و لارافيل","مبنية على تا입 سكريبت، تيل ويند سي إس و راديكس يُو آي","التكامل مع رياكت هوك فورم و تانستاك فورم","التوافق مع عدة إطارات و مكتبات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Shadcn UI","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix","React Hook Form","TanStack Form"],"ja":["Shadcn UI","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix","React Hook Form","TanStack Form"],"ko":["Shadcn UI","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix","React Hook Form","TanStack Form"],"es":["Shadcn-UI","componentes de interfaz de usuario","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix","Astro","Laravel"],"fr":["Shadcn-UI","composants d''interface utilisateur","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix","Astro","Laravel"],"de":["Shadcn-UI","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix","Astro","Laravel"],"pt":["Shadcn-UI","Componentes de UI","Desenvolvimento web","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix","Astro","Laravel"],"ru":["Shadcn-UI","Компоненты UI","Веб-разработка","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Next.js","Vite","Remix","Astro","Laravel"],"ar":["شادكن-يоу آي","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","تطوير الويب","تا입 سكريبت","تيل ويند سي إس","راديكس يُو آي","النكست.جس","فايت","ريمكس","أسترو","لارافيل"]}},"owner":"johannesbremer","repo":"praxisplaner","repoPath":"johannesbremer/praxisplaner","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Shadcn UI component library - beautifully designed React components built with Radix UI and Tailwind CSS","bodyPreview":"# Shadcn-UI Skill\n\nExpert assistance with shadcn/ui - a collection of beautifully-designed, accessible components built with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Radix UI primitives. Supports Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Laravel, and more.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill should be triggered when:\n\n- Installing or configuring shadcn/ui in any supported framework\n- Adding shadcn/ui components (Button, Dialog, Form, Table, etc.)\n- Implementing forms with React Hook Form or TanStack Form\n- Setting u","body":"# Shadcn-UI Skill\n\nExpert assistance with shadcn/ui - a collection of beautifully-designed, accessible components built with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Radix UI primitives. Supports Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Laravel, and more.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill should be triggered when:\n\n- Installing or configuring shadcn/ui in any supported framework\n- Adding shadcn/ui components (Button, Dialog, Form, Table, etc.)\n- Implementing forms with React Hook Form or TanStack Form\n- Setting up dark mode with shadcn/ui theming\n- Customizing component styles or design tokens\n- Building data tables with sorting/filtering/pagination\n- Working with overlays (dialogs, sheets, popovers, tooltips)\n- Creating accessible navigation components\n- Implementing toast notifications or alerts\n- Using the shadcn CLI to add components\n- Customizing components.json configuration\n- Building charts or carousels with shadcn/ui\n- Questions about shadcn/ui best practices or patterns\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Installation and CLI\n\n```bash\n# Initialize shadcn/ui in a project\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n\n# Add specific components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog form input\n\n# Add all components\nnpx shadcn@latest add\n```\n\n### Basic Button Component\n\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport default function Example() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex gap-2\">\n      <Button>Default</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"destructive\">Delete</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\">Ghost</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"link\">Link</Button>\n      <Button size=\"sm\">Small</Button>\n      <Button size=\"lg\">Large</Button>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Form with Validation\n\n```typescript\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport { z } from \"zod\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Form, FormControl, FormField, FormItem, FormLabel, FormMessage } from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  username: z.string().min(2).max(50),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n})\n\nexport default function ProfileForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    console.log(values)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"username\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Username</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"johndoe\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Submit</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Dialog Component\n\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n\nexport default function Example() {\n  return (\n    <Dialog>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>\n        <Button>Open Dialog</Button>\n      </DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent>\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>Are you sure?</DialogTitle>\n          <DialogDescription>\n            This action cannot be undone.\n          </DialogDescription>\n        </DialogHeader>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Toast Notifications\n\n```typescript\nimport { useToast } from \"@/hooks/use-toast\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport default function Example() {\n  const { toast } = useToast()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      onClick={() => {\n        toast({\n          title: \"Success\",\n          description: \"Your changes have been saved.\",\n        })\n      }}\n    >\n      Show Toast\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Data Table with Sorting\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n\nconst invoices = [\n  { id: \"INV001\", status: \"Paid\", amount: \"$250.00\" },\n  { id: \"INV002\", status: \"Pending\", amount: \"$150.00\" },\n]\n\nexport default function DataTable() {\n  return (\n    <Table>\n      <TableHeader>\n        <TableRow>\n          <TableHead>Invoice</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Status</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Amount</TableHead>\n        </TableRow>\n      </TableHeader>\n      <TableBody>\n        {invoices.map((invoice) => (\n          <TableRow key={invoice.id}>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.id}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.status}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.amount}</TableCell>\n          </TableRow>\n        ))}\n      </TableBody>\n    </Table>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Select Dropdown\n\n```typescript\nimport { Select, SelectContent, SelectItem, SelectTrigger, SelectValue } from \"@/components/ui/select\"\n\nexport default function Example() {\n  return (\n    <Select>\n      <SelectTrigger className=\"w-[180px]\">\n        <SelectValue placeholder=\"Select a fruit\" />\n      </SelectTrigger>\n      <SelectContent>\n        <SelectItem value=\"apple\">Apple</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"banana\">Banana</SelectItem>\n        <SelectItem value=\"orange\">Orange</SelectItem>\n      </SelectContent>\n    </Select>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Dark Mode Setup (Next.js)\n\n```typescript\n// app/providers.tsx\n\"use client\"\n\nimport { ThemeProvider } from \"next-themes\"\n\nexport function Providers({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return (\n    <ThemeProvider attribute=\"class\" defaultTheme=\"system\" enableSystem>\n      {children}\n    </ThemeProvider>\n  )\n}\n\n// Usage in component\nimport { useTheme } from \"next-themes\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ThemeToggle() {\n  const { setTheme } = useTheme()\n\n  return (\n    <Button onClick={() => setTheme(\"dark\")}>Dark Mode</Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Card Component\n\n```typescript\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardDescription, CardHeader, CardTitle } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport default function Example() {\n  return (\n    <Card>\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Card Title</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>Card description goes here</CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        <p>Card content</p>\n      </CardContent>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Combobox (Searchable Select)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Check, ChevronsUpDown } from \"lucide-react\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Command, CommandEmpty, CommandGroup, CommandInput, CommandItem } from \"@/components/ui/command\"\nimport { Popover, PopoverContent, PopoverTrigger } from \"@/components/ui/popover\"\n\nconst frameworks = [\n  { value: \"next\", label: \"Next.js\" },\n  { value: \"react\", label: \"React\" },\n  { value: \"vue\", label: \"Vue\" },\n]\n\nexport default function Combobox() {\n  const [open, setOpen] = React.useState(false)\n  const [value, setValue] = React.useState(\"\")\n\n  return (\n    <Popover open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>\n      <PopoverTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"outline\" className=\"w-[200px] justify-between\">\n          {value || \"Select framework...\"}\n          <ChevronsUpDown className=\"ml-2 h-4 w-4\" />\n        </Button>\n      </PopoverTrigger>\n      <PopoverContent className=\"w-[200px] p-0\">\n        <Command>\n          <CommandInput placeholder=\"Search...\" />\n          <CommandEmpty>No framework found.</CommandEmpty>\n          <CommandGroup>\n            {frameworks.map((framework) => (\n              <CommandItem\n                key={framework.value}\n                onSelect={() => {\n                  setValue(framework.value)\n                  setOpen(false)\n                }}\n              >\n                <Check className={value === framework.value ? \"mr-2 h-4 w-4\" : \"mr-2 h-4 w-4 opacity-0\"} />\n                {framework.label}\n              </CommandItem>\n            ))}\n          </CommandGroup>\n        </Command>\n      </PopoverContent>\n    </Popover>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\nThis skill includes comprehensive documentation in `references/`:\n\n### llms.md\n\nComplete overview of shadcn/ui with links to all components and features. Covers:\n\n- Core principles (Open Code, Composition, Distribution, Beautiful Defaults, AI-Ready)\n- Installation guides for all supported frameworks (Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, Laravel, etc.)\n- Complete component catalog organized by category\n- Dark mode setup for different frameworks\n- Forms integration (React Hook Form, TanStack Form)\n- Advanced topics (monorepo, React 19, Tailwind v4, JavaScript usage)\n- Registry system for publishing/distributing components\n- MCP Server integration for AI assistants\n\n### other.md\n\nAdditional documentation mirroring llms.md content with organized sections for:\n\n- All component categories (Form & Input, Layout & Navigation, Overlays & Dialogs, etc.)\n- Installation instructions by framework\n- Dark mode configuration\n- Registry schemas\n\nUse `view references/llms.md` for quick access to component links and documentation structure.\n\n## Working with This Skill\n\n### For Beginners\n\n1. Start by initializing shadcn/ui: `npx shadcn@latest init`\n2. Add basic components like Button, Input, and Card to learn the patterns\n3. Review the Quick Reference examples above for common use cases\n4. Use `references/llms.md` to explore available components by category\n\n### For Building Forms\n\n1. Install form components: `npx shadcn@latest add form input`\n2. Set up React Hook Form with Zod validation (see Form example above)\n3. Use Field component for labels and error messages\n4. Check the Forms section in references for advanced patterns\n\n### For Complex Components\n\n1. Check component categories in references (Data Table, Command, Combobox)\n2. Install required dependencies (some components use external libraries)\n3. Follow the component-specific documentation links\n4. Customize using Tailwind classes and component props\n\n### For Theming\n\n1. Edit `components.json` to configure paths and styling\n2. Use the Theming guide for customizing colors and design tokens\n3. Set up dark mode using the framework-specific guide\n4. Override CSS variables for fine-grained control\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n### Component Philosophy\n\n- **Open Code**: Components are copied into your project, not installed as dependencies\n- **Composition**: Components are built using Radix UI primitives for accessibility\n- **Customization**: Full control over styling using Tailwind CSS\n- **Copy-paste friendly**: Modify components directly in your codebase\n\n### Installation Model\n\nUnlike traditional libraries, shadcn/ui components are added to your project via CLI:\n\n- Components live in your `components/ui` directory\n- You have full ownership and can modify them\n- No package.json dependency (except for Radix UI and utilities)\n- Update components by re-running `add` command\n\n### components.json\n\nCentral configuration file that controls:\n\n- Component installation paths\n- TypeScript/JavaScript preference\n- Tailwind CSS configuration\n- Style variants (default/new-york)\n- CSS variable usage\n- Import aliases\n\n### Styling Approach\n\n- Uses Tailwind CSS utility classes\n- CSS variables for theming (light/dark mode)\n- `cn()` utility for conditional classes\n- Variants defined using `class-variance-authority`\n\n### Accessibility\n\nAll components built on Radix UI primitives ensure:\n\n- Keyboard navigation\n- Screen reader support\n- ARIA attributes\n- Focus management\n\n### Framework Support\n\nWorks with any React framework through appropriate setup:\n\n- **Next.js**: App Router and Pages Router\n- **Vite**: Standard React setup\n- **Remix**: Requires specific configuration\n- **Astro**: React integration\n- **Laravel**: Via Inertia.js\n- **Others**: Manual installation guide available\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Async Form Submission (Next.js Server Actions)\n\n```typescript\n\"use server\";\nasync function onSubmit(formData: FormData) {\n  const data = {\n    name: formData.get(\"name\"),\n    email: formData.get(\"email\"),\n  };\n  // Process data\n  return { success: true };\n}\n```\n\n### Responsive Dialog/Sheet\n\nUse Dialog for desktop, Sheet for mobile:\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMediaQuery } from \"@/hooks/use-media-query\"\nimport { Dialog, DialogContent } from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\nimport { Sheet, SheetContent } from \"@/components/ui/sheet\"\n\nconst isDesktop = useMediaQuery(\"(min-width: 768px)\")\n\nif (isDesktop) {\n  return <Dialog>...</Dialog>\n}\nreturn <Sheet>...</Sheet>\n```\n\n### Controlled Components\n\n```typescript\nconst [open, setOpen] = useState(false)\nconst [value, setValue] = useState(\"\")\n\n<Dialog open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>\n  <DialogContent>...</DialogContent>\n</Dialog>\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n### Official Documentation\n\n- Main site: https://ui.shadcn.com\n- Components: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components\n- CLI: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/cli\n- Themes: https://ui.shadcn.com/themes\n\n### Tools\n\n- **v0 by Vercel**: AI-powered UI generation with shadcn/ui\n- **Figma**: Design resources available\n- **MCP Server**: AI assistant integration for Claude Code, Cursor, etc.\n\n### Registry\n\nCreate and publish your own component collections:\n\n- Set up private or public registries\n- Share components across projects\n- Use authentication for private registries\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Import Errors\n\nEnsure your `tsconfig.json` has the correct path aliases:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Styling Issues\n\n1. Verify Tailwind CSS is configured with `tailwind.config.js`\n2. Check that globals.css imports are present\n3. Ensure `cn()` utility is in `lib/utils.ts`\n\n### Component Not Found\n\nRun `npx shadcn@latest add <component-name>` to install missing components\n\n## Notes\n\n- Components are framework-agnostic and work with any React setup\n- Dark mode requires theme provider (next-themes or similar)\n- Some components depend on external libraries (date-fns, recharts, etc.)\n- The CLI handles dependency installation automatically\n- Components can be customized without breaking updates\n- Registry system allows publishing custom component collections\n- MCP integration enables AI-powered component installation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:25:34.537Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing beautifully-designed, accessible UI components built with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Radix UI primitives.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 TypeScript、Tailwind CSS 和 Radix UI 基元构建美观设计且可访问的 UI 组件的前端代理。","ja":"TypeScript、Tailwind CSS、Radix UI プリミティブで美しくデザインされたアクセス可能な UI コンポーネントを構築する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 및 Radix UI 기본 요소로 아름답게 설계되고 접근 가능한 UI 구성 요소를 구축해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 좋습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario con un diseño hermoso y accesible, construidos con TypeScript, Tailwind CSS y primitivas de Radix UI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur conçus de manière élégante et accessibles, construits avec TypeScript, Tailwind CSS et les primitives Radix UI.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die wunderschön gestaltete und zugängliche Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen, die mit TypeScript, Tailwind CSS und Radix-UI-Primitiven erstellt werden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de componentes de UI bem projetados e acessíveis construídos com TypeScript, Tailwind CSS e primitivos do Radix UI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуются красиво спроектированные и доступные компоненты пользовательского интерфейса, построенные на основе TypeScript, Tailwind CSS и примитивов Radix UI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم المصممة جمالياً وتوفر إمكانية الوصول، مبنية على TypeScript و Tailwind CSS و primitives Radix UI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create responsive and accessible interfaces using shadcn/ui components, supporting frameworks like Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, and Laravel, while leveraging React Hook Form or TanStack Form for seamless form implementation.","zh":"赋予代理创建响应式和可访问的接口的能力，使用 shadcn/ui 组件，支持像 Next.js、Vite、Remix、Astro 和 Laravel 这样的框架，同时利用 React Hook Form 或 TanStack Form 实现无缝的表单实现。","ja":"shadcn/ui コンポーネントを使用して、Next.js、Vite、Remix、Astro、Laravel などのフレームワークをサポートしながら、React Hook Form または TanStack Form を利用してシームレスなフォーム実装を実現することで、エージェントがレスポンシブでアクセス可能なインターフェイスを作成できるようにします。","ko":"shadcn/ui 구성 요소를 사용하여 Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro 및 Laravel과 같은 프레임워크를 지원하면서 React Hook Form 또는 TanStack Form을 활용하여 무결점의 양식 구현을 통해 에이전트가 반응형 및 접근 가능한 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces responsivas y accesibles utilizando componentes de shadcn/ui, que admiten frameworks como Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro y Laravel, y aprovechan React Hook Form o TanStack Form para una implementación de formularios sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces réactives et accessibles en utilisant les composants shadcn/ui, qui prennent en charge des frameworks tels que Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro et Laravel, tout en exploitant React Hook Form ou TanStack Form pour une mise en œuvre de formulaires transparente.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, responsive und zugängliche Schnittstellen mit shadcn/ui-Komponenten zu erstellen, die Frameworks wie Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro und Laravel unterstützen und React Hook Form oder TanStack Form für eine nahtlose Formulareimplementierung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces responsivas e acessíveis usando componentes shadcn/ui, suportando frameworks como Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro e Laravel, aproveitando React Hook Form ou TanStack Form para implementação de formulários sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать адаптивные и доступные интерфейсы с использованием компонентов shadcn/ui, поддерживая фреймворки типа Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro и Laravel, используя React Hook Form или TanStack Form для бесшовной реализации форм.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إنشاء واجهات مستخدم متجاوبة وتوفر إمكانية الوصول باستخدام مكونات shadcn/ui، مع دعم إطارات مثل Next.js و Vite و Remix و Astro و Laravel، واستخدام React Hook Form أو TanStack Form لتنفيذ Forms بسلاسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring shadcn/ui in supported frameworks for rapid UI development","Implementing accessible and customizable components like Button, Dialog, Form, and Table","Streamlining form handling with React Hook Form or TanStack Form integration"],"zh":["在支持的框架中配置 shadcn/ui 以实现快速 UI 开发","实现可访问且可自定义的组件，如 Button、Dialog、Form 和 Table","使用 React Hook Form 或 TanStack Form 集成简化表单处理"],"ja":["サポートされているフレームワークで shadcn/ui を構成して、迅速な UI 開発を実現する","アクセス可能でカスタマイズ可能なコンポーネント (Button、Dialog、Form、Table など) を実装する","React Hook Form または TanStack Form の統合を使用してフォーム処理を簡素化する"],"ko":["지원되는 프레임워크에서 shadcn/ui를 구성하여 빠른 UI 개발을 구현하는 것","접근 가능하고 사용자 지정 가능한 구성 요소(버튼, 대화 상자, 양식, 테이블 등)를 구현하는 것","React Hook Form 또는 TanStack Form 통합을 사용하여 양식 처리를 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Configuración de shadcn/ui en frameworks compatibles para un desarrollo de interfaz de usuario rápido","Implementación de componentes accesibles y personalizables como Button, Dialog, Form y Table","Optimización del manejo de formularios con la integración de React Hook Form o TanStack Form"],"fr":["Configuration de shadcn/ui dans des frameworks compatibles pour un développement d''interface utilisateur rapide","Mise en œuvre de composants accessibles et personnalisables tels que Button, Dialog, Form et Table","Optimisation de la gestion des formulaires avec l''intégration de React Hook Form ou TanStack Form"],"de":["Konfiguration von shadcn/ui in kompatiblen Frameworks für eine schnelle Entwicklung der Benutzeroberfläche","Implementierung von zugänglichen und anpassbaren Komponenten wie Button, Dialog, Form und Table","Optimierung der Formularverwaltung durch die Integration von React Hook Form oder TanStack Form"],"pt":["Configurando shadcn/ui em frameworks compatíveis para desenvolvimento de UI rápido","Implementando componentes acessíveis e personalizáveis como Button, Dialog, Form e Table","Otimizando tratamento de formulários com integração do React Hook Form ou TanStack Form"],"ru":["Настройка shadcn/ui в поддерживаемых фреймворках для быстрого разработки пользовательского интерфейса","Реализация доступных и настраиваемых компонентов, таких как Button, Dialog, Form и Table","Оптимизация обработки форм с интеграцией React Hook Form или TanStack Form"],"ar":["تهيئة shadcn/ui في الإطارات المدعومة من أجل تطوير UI سريع","تطبيق مكونات وصول ويمكن تخصيصها مثل Button و Dialog و Form و Table","تحسين معالجة الاستمارات عبر التكامل مع React Hook Form أو TanStack Form"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript and compatible framework setup","Limited to supported frameworks like Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro, and Laravel"],"zh":["需要 TypeScript 和兼容的框架设置","仅限于支持的框架，如 Next.js、Vite、Remix、Astro 和 Laravel"],"ja":["TypeScript と互換性のあるフレームワークの設定が必要","Next.js、Vite、Remix、Astro、Laravel などのサポートされているフレームワークに限定される"],"ko":["TypeScript 및 호환되는 프레임워크 설정이 필요함","Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro 및 Laravel과 같은 지원되는 프레임워크로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere TypeScript y configuración de framework compatible","Limitado a frameworks compatibles como Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro y Laravel"],"fr":["Nécessite TypeScript et une configuration de framework compatible","Limité à des frameworks compatibles tels que Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro et Laravel"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript und kompatible Framework-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf kompatible Frameworks wie Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro und Laravel"],"pt":["Exige TypeScript e configuração de framework compatível","Limitado a frameworks compatíveis como Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro e Laravel"],"ru":["Требует TypeScript и настройки совместимого фреймворка","Ограничен поддерживаемыми фреймворками, такими как Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro и Laravel"],"ar":["يتطلب TypeScript و إعداد إطار عمل متوافق","محدود بإطارات داعمة مثل Next.js و Vite و Remix و Astro و Laravel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
