oder setzt die Konfiguration Ihres Projekts via interaktive Fragen und Antworten fort.","pt":"O Conductor Setup é uma ferramenta para inicializar projetos com artefatos de documentação","ru":"Conductor Setup - это инструмент для инициализации проектов с артефактами документации","ar":"Conductor Setup هو أداة لتشغيل المشاريع مع مكونات التوثيق","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Conductor","Q&A","","Conductor/","Conductor"],"ja":["Conductor","Q&A","","Conductor/","Conductor"],"ko":["Conductor","Q&A","","Conductor/","Conductor"],"es":["Crea documentación básica de proyecto","Inicia o reanuda la configuración de proyecto","Preguntas y respuestas interactivas","Artefactos predefinidos de Conductor","Configuración de proyecto personalizada"],"fr":["Créez la documentation de base de projet","Initialisez ou reprenez la configuration de projet","Questions et réponses interactives","Artefacts prédéfinis de Conductor","Configuration de projet personnalisée"],"de":["Erstellen Sie die grundlegende Dokumentation des Projekts","Initialisieren oder setzen Sie die Projekt-Konfiguration fort","Interaktive Fragen und Antworten","Vordefinierte Conductor-Artefakte","Benutzerdefinierte Projekt-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Criação de documentação de projeto","Configuração de workflow","Definição de tecnologias","Criação de guias de estilo","Resumo de configuração","Reinicialização de projeto"],"ru":["Создание документации проекта","Настройка workflow","Определение технологий","Создание руководств по стилю","Резюме настройки","Переинициализация проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء توثيق للمشروع","تكوين سير العمل","تحديد التقنيات","إنشاء دليل الأسلوب","ملخص التكوين","إعادة تشغيل المشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Conductor","Conductor","Q&A","","Conductor/","Conductor"],"ja":["Conductor","Conductor","Q&A","","Conductor/","Conductor"],"ko":["Conductor","Conductor","Q&A","","Conductor/","Conductor"],"es":["conductor setup","configuración de proyecto","inicialización de proyecto","documentación de proyecto","artefactos de conductor","configuración interactiva"],"fr":["configuration de conductor","configuration de projet","initialisation de projet","documentation de projet","artefacts de conductor","configuration interactive"],"de":["conductor setup","projekt konfiguration","projekt initialisierung","projekt dokumentation","conductor artefakte","interaktive konfiguration"],"pt":["Conductor Setup","inicialização de projetos","documentação de projeto","workflow","tecnologias","guias de estilo","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Conductor Setup","инициализация проектов","документация проекта","workflow","технологии","руководства по стилю","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Conductor Setup","تشغيل المشاريع","توثيق المشروع","سير العمل","التقنيات","دليل الأسلوب","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"setup","description":"Initialize project with Conductor artifacts (product definition, tech stack, workflow, style guides)","bodyPreview":"---\ndescription: \"Initialize project with Conductor artifacts (product definition, tech stack, workflow, style guides)\"\nargument-hint: \"[--resume]\"\n---\n\n# Conductor Setup\n\nInitialize or resume Conductor project setup. This command creates foundational project documentation through interactive Q&A.\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\n1. Check if `conductor/` directory already exists in the project root:\n   - If `conductor/product.md` exists: Ask user whether to resume setup or reinitialize\n   - If `conductor/","body":"---\ndescription: \"Initialize project with Conductor artifacts (product definition, tech stack, workflow, style guides)\"\nargument-hint: \"[--resume]\"\n---\n\n# Conductor Setup\n\nInitialize or resume Conductor project setup. This command creates foundational project documentation through interactive Q&A.\n\n## Pre-flight Checks\n\n1. Check if `conductor/` directory already exists in the project root:\n   - If `conductor/product.md` exists: Ask user whether to resume setup or reinitialize\n   - If `conductor/setup_state.json` exists with incomplete status: Offer to resume from last step\n\n2. Detect project type by checking for existing indicators:\n   - **Greenfield (new project)**: No .git, no package.json, no requirements.txt, no go.mod, no src/ directory\n   - **Brownfield (existing project)**: Any of the above exist\n\n3. Load or create `conductor/setup_state.json`:\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n     \"project_type\": \"greenfield|brownfield\",\n     \"current_section\": \"product|guidelines|tech_stack|workflow|styleguides\",\n     \"current_question\": 1,\n     \"completed_sections\": [],\n     \"answers\": {},\n     \"files_created\": [],\n     \"started_at\": \"ISO_TIMESTAMP\",\n     \"last_updated\": \"ISO_TIMESTAMP\"\n   }\n   ```\n\n## Interactive Q&A Protocol\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n\n- Ask ONE question per turn\n- Wait for user response before proceeding\n- Offer 2-3 suggested answers plus \"Type your own\" option\n- Maximum 5 questions per section\n- Update `setup_state.json` after each successful step\n- Validate file writes succeeded before continuing\n\n### Section 1: Product Definition (max 5 questions)\n\n**Q1: Project Name**\n\n```\nWhat is your project name?\n\nSuggested:\n1. [Infer from directory name]\n2. [Infer from package.json/go.mod if brownfield]\n3. Type your own\n```\n\n**Q2: Project Description**\n\n```\nDescribe your project in one sentence.\n\nSuggested:\n1. A web application that [does X]\n2. A CLI tool for [doing Y]\n3. Type your own\n```\n\n**Q3: Problem Statement**\n\n```\nWhat problem does this project solve?\n\nSuggested:\n1. Users struggle to [pain point]\n2. There''s no good way to [need]\n3. Type your own\n```\n\n**Q4: Target Users**\n\n```\nWho are the primary users?\n\nSuggested:\n1. Developers building [X]\n2. End users who need [Y]\n3. Internal teams managing [Z]\n4. Type your own\n```\n\n**Q5: Key Goals (optional)**\n\n```\nWhat are 2-3 key goals for this project? (Press enter to skip)\n```\n\n### Section 2: Product Guidelines (max 3 questions)\n\n**Q1: Voice and Tone**\n\n```\nWhat voice/tone should documentation and UI text use?\n\nSuggested:\n1. Professional and technical\n2. Friendly and approachable\n3. Concise and direct\n4. Type your own\n```\n\n**Q2: Design Principles**\n\n```\nWhat design principles guide this project?\n\nSuggested:\n1. Simplicity over features\n2. Performance first\n3. Developer experience focused\n4. User safety and reliability\n5. Type your own (comma-separated)\n```\n\n### Section 3: Tech Stack (max 5 questions)\n\nFor **brownfield projects**, first analyze existing code:\n\n- Run `Glob` to find package.json, requirements.txt, go.mod, Cargo.toml, etc.\n- Parse detected files to pre-populate tech stack\n- Present findings and ask for confirmation/additions\n\n**Q1: Primary Language(s)**\n\n```\nWhat primary language(s) does this project use?\n\n[For brownfield: \"I detected: Python 3.11, JavaScript. Is this correct?\"]\n\nSuggested:\n1. TypeScript\n2. Python\n3. Go\n4. Rust\n5. Type your own (comma-separated)\n```\n\n**Q2: Frontend Framework (if applicable)**\n\n```\nWhat frontend framework (if any)?\n\nSuggested:\n1. React\n2. Vue\n3. Next.js\n4. None / CLI only\n5. Type your own\n```\n\n**Q3: Backend Framework (if applicable)**\n\n```\nWhat backend framework (if any)?\n\nSuggested:\n1. Express / Fastify\n2. Django / FastAPI\n3. Go standard library\n4. None / Frontend only\n5. Type your own\n```\n\n**Q4: Database (if applicable)**\n\n```\nWhat database (if any)?\n\nSuggested:\n1. PostgreSQL\n2. MongoDB\n3. SQLite\n4. None / Stateless\n5. Type your own\n```\n\n**Q5: Infrastructure**\n\n```\nWhere will this be deployed?\n\nSuggested:\n1. AWS (Lambda, ECS, etc.)\n2. Vercel / Netlify\n3. Self-hosted / Docker\n4. Not decided yet\n5. Type your own\n```\n\n### Section 4: Workflow Preferences (max 4 questions)\n\n**Q1: TDD Strictness**\n\n```\nHow strictly should TDD be enforced?\n\nSuggested:\n1. Strict - tests required before implementation\n2. Moderate - tests encouraged, not blocked\n3. Flexible - tests recommended for complex logic\n```\n\n**Q2: Commit Strategy**\n\n```\nWhat commit strategy should be followed?\n\nSuggested:\n1. Conventional Commits (feat:, fix:, etc.)\n2. Descriptive messages, no format required\n3. Squash commits per task\n```\n\n**Q3: Code Review Requirements**\n\n```\nWhat code review policy?\n\nSuggested:\n1. Required for all changes\n2. Required for non-trivial changes\n3. Optional / self-review OK\n```\n\n**Q4: Verification Checkpoints**\n\n```\nWhen should manual verification be required?\n\nSuggested:\n1. After each phase completion\n2. After each task completion\n3. Only at track completion\n```\n\n### Section 5: Code Style Guides (max 2 questions)\n\n**Q1: Languages to Include**\n\n```\nWhich language style guides should be generated?\n\n[Based on detected languages, pre-select]\n\nOptions:\n1. TypeScript/JavaScript\n2. Python\n3. Go\n4. Rust\n5. All detected languages\n6. Skip style guides\n```\n\n**Q2: Existing Conventions**\n\n```\nDo you have existing linting/formatting configs to incorporate?\n\n[For brownfield: \"I found .eslintrc, .prettierrc. Should I incorporate these?\"]\n\nSuggested:\n1. Yes, use existing configs\n2. No, generate fresh guides\n3. Skip this step\n```\n\n## Artifact Generation\n\nAfter completing Q&A, generate the following files:\n\n### 1. conductor/index.md\n\n```markdown\n# Conductor - [Project Name]\n\nNavigation hub for project context.\n\n## Quick Links\n\n- [Product Definition](./product.md)\n- [Product Guidelines](./product-guidelines.md)\n- [Tech Stack](./tech-stack.md)\n- [Workflow](./workflow.md)\n- [Tracks](./tracks.md)\n\n## Active Tracks\n\n<!-- Auto-populated by /conductor:new-track -->\n\n## Getting Started\n\nRun `/conductor:new-track` to create your first feature track.\n```\n\n### 2. conductor/product.md\n\nTemplate populated with Q&A answers for:\n\n- Project name and description\n- Problem statement\n- Target users\n- Key goals\n\n### 3. conductor/product-guidelines.md\n\nTemplate populated with:\n\n- Voice and tone\n- Design principles\n- Any additional standards\n\n### 4. conductor/tech-stack.md\n\nTemplate populated with:\n\n- Languages (with versions if detected)\n- Frameworks (frontend, backend)\n- Database\n- Infrastructure\n- Key dependencies (for brownfield, from package files)\n\n### 5. conductor/workflow.md\n\nTemplate populated with:\n\n- TDD policy and strictness level\n- Commit strategy and conventions\n- Code review requirements\n- Verification checkpoint rules\n- Task lifecycle definition\n\n### 6. conductor/tracks.md\n\n```markdown\n# Tracks Registry\n\n| Status | Track ID | Title | Created | Updated |\n| ------ | -------- | ----- | ------- | ------- |\n\n<!-- Tracks registered by /conductor:new-track -->\n```\n\n### 7. conductor/code_styleguides/\n\nGenerate selected style guides from `$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/templates/code_styleguides/`\n\n## State Management\n\nAfter each successful file creation:\n\n1. Update `setup_state.json`:\n   - Add filename to `files_created` array\n   - Update `last_updated` timestamp\n   - If section complete, add to `completed_sections`\n2. Verify file exists with `Read` tool\n\n## Completion\n\nWhen all files are created:\n\n1. Set `setup_state.json` status to \"complete\"\n2. Display summary:\n\n   ```\n   Conductor setup complete!\n\n   Created artifacts:\n   - conductor/index.md\n   - conductor/product.md\n   - conductor/product-guidelines.md\n   - conductor/tech-stack.md\n   - conductor/workflow.md\n   - conductor/tracks.md\n   - conductor/code_styleguides/[languages]\n\n   Next steps:\n   1. Review generated files and customize as needed\n   2. Run /conductor:new-track to create your first track\n   ```\n\n## Resume Handling\n\nIf `--resume` argument or resuming from state:\n\n1. Load `setup_state.json`\n2. Skip completed sections\n3. Resume from `current_section` and `current_question`\n4. Verify previously created files still exist\n5. If files missing, offer to regenerate\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If file write fails: Halt and report error, do not update state\n- If user cancels: Save current state for future resume\n- If state file corrupted: Offer to start fresh or attempt recovery\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:26:22.792Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing automated project initialization with Conductor artifacts.","zh":"适合需要使用 Conductor 文档自动初始化项目的项目管理代理。","ja":"Conductor のアーティファクトを使用して自動的にプロジェクトを初期化する必要があるプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Conductor 아티팩트를 사용하여 자동으로 프로젝트를 초기화해야 하는 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de proyectos que necesitan una inicialización de proyectos automatizada con artefactos de Conductor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet ayant besoin d''une initialisation de projet automatisée avec des artefacts Conductor.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Projektinitialisierung mit Conductor-Artefakten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de inicialização automática de projetos com artefatos do Conductor.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по управлению проектами, которым требуется автоматизированная инициализация проектов с артефактами Conductor.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المشاريع الذي يحتاج إلى تهيئة مشروع آلية مع مكونات موسيقار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create foundational project documentation through interactive Q&A, utilizing Conductor artifacts such as product definitions, tech stacks, workflows, and style guides, stored in a `conductor/` directory.","zh":"赋予代理创建基础项目文档的能力，通过交互式 Q&A，利用 Conductor 文档（如产品定义、技术栈、工作流和风格指南），这些文档存储在 `conductor/` 目录中。","ja":"エージェントが Conductor のアーティファクト（_product 定義、tech スタック、ワークフロー、スタイル ガイドなど）を使用して、対話型 Q&A を通じて基本的なプロジェクト ドキュメントを作成できるようにします。これらのアーティファクトは `conductor/` ディレクトリに保存されます。","ko":"에이전트가 Conductor 아티팩트(제품 정의, 기술 스택, 워크플로, 스타일 가이드 등)를 사용하여 대화형 Q&A를 통해 기본 프로젝트 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 이러한 아티팩트는 `conductor/` 디렉토리에 저장됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear documentación de proyecto fundamental a través de preguntas y respuestas interactivas, utilizando artefactos de Conductor como definiciones de producto, pilas tecnológicas, flujos de trabajo y guías de estilo, almacenados en un directorio `conductor/`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une documentation de projet fondamentale à travers des questions et réponses interactives, en utilisant des artefacts Conductor tels que des définitions de produit, des piles technologiques, des flux de travail et des guides de style, stockés dans un répertoire `conductor/`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, grundlegende Projektunterlagen durch interaktive Fragen und Antworten zu erstellen, indem Conductor-Artefakte wie Produktdefinitionen, Technologiestacks, Workflows und Stilrichtlinien verwendet werden, die in einem `conductor/`-Verzeichnis gespeichert sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar documentação de projeto fundamental por meio de perguntas e respostas interativas, utilizando artefatos do Conductor, como definições de produtos, pilhas de tecnologia, fluxos de trabalho e guias de estilo, armazenados em um diretório `conductor/`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать базовую документацию проекта через интерактивные вопросы и ответы, используя артефакты Conductor, такие как определения продукта, технологические стэки, рабочие процессы и руководства по стилю, хранящиеся в директории `conductor/`.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إنشاء توثيق مشروع أساسي من خلال أسئلة وأجوبة تفاعلية، باستخدام مكونات موسيقار مثل تعريفات المنتج وويكبات التكنولوجيا وعمليات العمل ودلائل الأسلوب، المخزنة في دليل `conductor/`."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new projects with predefined workflows","Resuming interrupted project setups","Generating project documentation through interactive Q&A"],"zh":["使用预定义的工作流初始化新项目","恢复中断的项目设置","通过交互式 Q&A 生成项目文档"],"ja":["事前に定義されたワークフローを使用して新しいプロジェクトを初期化する","中断されたプロジェクトの設定を再開する","対話型 Q&A を通じてプロジェクト ドキュメントを生成する"],"ko":["사전에 정의된 워크플로를 사용하여 새로운 프로젝트를 초기화하는 것","중단된 프로젝트 설정을 다시 시작하는 것","대화형 Q&A를 통해 프로젝트 문서를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Inicialización de nuevos proyectos con flujos de trabajo predefinidos","Reanudación de configuraciones de proyectos interrumpidos","Generación de documentación de proyectos a través de preguntas y respuestas interactivas"],"fr":["Initialisation de nouveaux projets avec des flux de travail prédéfinis","Reprise de configurations de projets interrompues","Génération de documentation de projet à travers des questions et réponses interactives"],"de":["Initialisierung neuer Projekte mit vordefinierten Workflows","Wiederherstellung unterbrochener Projektkonfigurationen","Generierung von Projektunterlagen durch interaktive Fragen und Antworten"],"pt":["Inicialização de novos projetos com fluxos de trabalho predefinidos","Retomada de configurações de projeto interrompidas","Geração de documentação de projeto por meio de perguntas e respostas interativas"],"ru":["Инициализация новых проектов с предопределенными рабочими процессами","Возобновление прерванной настройки проекта","Генерация документации проекта через интерактивные вопросы и ответы"],"ar":["تهيئة مشاريع جديدة مع عمليات عمل محددة مسبقًا","استئناف إعدادات المشروع المتوقفة","توليد توثيق المشروع من خلال أسئلة وأجوبة تفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `conductor/` directory access","Limited to Conductor project setup"],"zh":["需要访问 `conductor/` 目录","仅限 Conductor 项目设置"],"ja":["`conductor/` ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","Conductor プロジェクト設定のみに限定される"],"ko":["`conductor/` 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Conductor 프로젝트 설정만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `conductor/`","Limitado a la configuración del proyecto Conductor"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `conductor/`","Limité à la configuration du projet Conductor"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das `conductor/`-Verzeichnis","Begrenzt auf die Conductor-Projektkonfiguration"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `conductor/`","Limitado à configuração do projeto Conductor"],"ru":["Требует доступа к директории `conductor/`","Ограничен настройкой проекта Conductor"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `conductor/`","محدود بتهيئة مشروع موسيقار"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
