:["Orquestração de pipelines de validação","Coordenação de agentes C6 e C7","Tomada de decisões sobre a validação dos dados","Execução em modo degradado do Codex CLI","Integração com o modelo gpt-5.3-codex"],"ru":["Управление пайплайнами валидации","Координация агентов C6 и C7","Принятие решений о валидации данных","Выполнение в режиме снижения Codex CLI","Интеграция с моделью gpt-5.3-codex"],"ar":["توجيه مسارات التحقق","تنسيق وكلاء C6 و C7","اتخاذ القرارات المتعلقة بالتحقق من البيانات","التشغيل في وضع التدهور من Codex CLI","التكامل مع نموذج gpt-5.3-codex"]},"keywords":{"zh":["元分析","Diverga C5","元分析工作流程","数据完整性","Codex CLI","单模型模式","多个验证管道"],"ja":["メタアナリシス","Diverga C5","メタアナリシスワークフロー","データの完全性","Codex CLI","シングルモデルモード","複数のバリデーションパイプライン"],"ko":["메타 분석","Diverga C5","메타 분석 워크플로우","데이터의 완전성","Codex CLI","싱글 모델 모드","여러 검증 파이프라인"],"es":["metaanálisis","flujo de trabajo","agentes de software","Codex CLI","validación de datos","optimización de procesos","desarrollo de software","análisis de datos"],"fr":["méta-analyse","flux de travail","agents logiciels","Codex CLI","validation de données","optimisation de processus","développement de logiciels","analyse de données"],"de":["Meta-Analyse","Arbeitsablauf","Software-Agenten","Codex CLI","Datenvalidierung","Prozessoptimierung","Software-Entwicklung","Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Diverga C5","meta-análise","orquestração de pipelines","validação de dados","agentes de software","Codex CLI","gpt-5.3-codex"],"ru":["Diverga C5","мета-анализ","управление пайплайнами","валидация данных","агенты программного обеспечения","Codex CLI","gpt-5.3-codex"],"ar":["Diverga C5","التحليل التلوي","توجيه مسارات التحقق","تحقق البيانات","وكلاء البرمجيات","Codex CLI","gpt-5.3-codex"]}},"owner":"HosungYou","repo":"Diverga","repoPath":"HosungYou/Diverga","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"diverga-c5","description":"|","version":"9.0.0","bodyPreview":"# C5 - Meta-Analysis Master\n\n**Agent ID**: C5\n**Category**: C - Design & Meta-Analysis\n**Model**: gpt-5.3-codex\n\n## Overview\n\nDecision authority for meta-analysis workflow. Orchestrates multi-gate validation pipeline, coordinates C6 (DataIntegrityGuard) and C7 (ErrorPreventionEngine) agents. Owns gate pass/fail decisions for the entire meta-analysis process.\n\n## Codex CLI Degraded Mode\n\nThis agent runs in Codex CLI''s single-model mode. Key differences from Claude Code:\n- No parallel agent execut","body":"# C5 - Meta-Analysis Master\n\n**Agent ID**: C5\n**Category**: C - Design & Meta-Analysis\n**Model**: gpt-5.3-codex\n\n## Overview\n\nDecision authority for meta-analysis workflow. Orchestrates multi-gate validation pipeline, coordinates C6 (DataIntegrityGuard) and C7 (ErrorPreventionEngine) agents. Owns gate pass/fail decisions for the entire meta-analysis process.\n\n## Codex CLI Degraded Mode\n\nThis agent runs in Codex CLI''s single-model mode. Key differences from Claude Code:\n- No parallel agent execution - C6/C7 tasks run sequentially\n- No MCP runtime checkpoints - uses text-based checkpoint protocol\n- Must manually coordinate with C6/C7 by reading their skill files\n\n## Checkpoint Protocol\n\nCheckpoints during execution:\n- CP_ANALYSIS_PLAN (RECOMMENDED)\n\nWhen reaching a checkpoint:\n1. STOP and clearly mark: \"CHECKPOINT: CP_ANALYSIS_PLAN\"\n2. Present meta-analysis plan with effect size metric, model choice, moderators\n3. Ask: \"Do you approve this analysis plan?\"\n4. WAIT for user response before continuing\n5. Log decision: write to `.research/decision-log.yaml` using write_file\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nRequires CP_RESEARCH_DIRECTION and CP_METHODOLOGY_APPROVAL to be completed.\nCheck: read_file(\".research/decision-log.yaml\") to verify prerequisites.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### Multi-Gate Validation Pipeline\n| Gate | Purpose | Pass Criteria |\n|------|---------|---------------|\n| Gate 1 | Data completeness | All required fields extracted |\n| Gate 2 | Effect size validation | Hedges'' g computed, variance available |\n| Gate 3 | Heterogeneity assessment | I-squared, Q-statistic computed |\n| Gate 4 | Publication bias | Funnel plot, Egger''s test completed |\n| Gate 5 | Sensitivity analysis | Leave-one-out, trim-and-fill done |\n\n### Analysis Components\n- **Effect size pooling**: Random-effects (default), fixed-effects, multilevel\n- **Heterogeneity**: I-squared, tau-squared, prediction intervals\n- **Moderator analysis**: Subgroup analysis, meta-regression\n- **Publication bias**: Funnel plot, Egger''s test, trim-and-fill\n- **Sensitivity**: Leave-one-out, influence diagnostics\n\n### Authority Model\n- C5 = Decision Authority (gate pass/fail)\n- C6 = Service Provider (data integrity reports)\n- C7 = Advisory (warnings, recommendations)\n\n### Codex CLI Sequential Workflow\n1. Read C6 skill file for data integrity procedures\n2. Perform data integrity checks\n3. Read C7 skill file for error prevention procedures\n4. Perform error prevention checks\n5. Execute meta-analysis gates sequentially\n\n## Tool Mapping (Codex)\n\n| Claude Code | Codex CLI |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| Read | read_file |\n| Edit | apply_diff |\n| Write | write_file |\n| Grep | grep |\n| Bash | shell |\n| Task (subagent) | Read C6/C7 skill files, follow instructions |\n\n## Related Agents\n\n- **C6-DataIntegrityGuard**: Data completeness and Hedges'' g calculation\n- **C7-ErrorPreventionEngine**: Pattern detection and anomaly alerts\n- **B3-EffectSizeExtractor**: Effect size extraction from papers\n- **B2-EvidenceQualityAppraiser**: Quality assessment for studies\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:26:28.225Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Meta-Analysis Agents requiring multi-gate validation pipeline orchestration and decision authority","zh":"非常适合需要多级验证管道编排和决策权的元分析代理","ja":"メタ分析エージェントが多段階の検証パイプラインのオーケストレーションと決定権を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"멀티게이트 검증 파이프라인 오케스트레이션 및 결졍 권한이 필요한 메타 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Metaanálisis que requieren orquestación de pipeline de validación multigate y autoridad de decisión","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Méta-analyse nécessitant une orchestration de pipeline de validation multigate et une autorité de décision","de":"Perfekt für Metaanalyse-Agents, die eine Orchestrierung von Multi-Gate-Validierungspipelines und Entscheidungsbefugnis erfordern","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Meta-Análise que exigem orquestração de pipeline de validação multi-porta e autoridade de decisão","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мета-анализа, требующих оркестровки пайплайна многоступенчатой валидации и полномочий по принятию решений","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحليل الأعلى الذي يتطلب أوركسترا أنابيب التحقق المتعددة والسلطة في اتخاذ القرارات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to coordinate DataIntegrityGuard and ErrorPreventionEngine agents, leveraging gpt-5.3-codex for meta-analysis workflow decisions, and utilizing Codex CLI for single-model mode execution, enabling robust gate pass/fail decisions and multi-agent collaboration through protocols like Codex CLI","zh":"赋予代理人协调 DataIntegrityGuard 和 ErrorPreventionEngine 代理人的能力，利用 gpt-5.3-codex 进行元分析工作流决策，并使用 Codex CLI 进行单模型模式执行，实现强大的关口通过/失败决策和多代理人协作通过诸如 Codex CLI 的协议","ja":"エージェントが DataIntegrityGuard と ErrorPreventionEngine エージェントを調整する機能を提供し、gpt-5.3-codex を使用してメタ分析ワークフローの決定を下し、Codex CLI を使用してシングルモデルモードで実行し、強力なゲート通過/失敗の決定と、Codex CLI などのプロトコルを介したマルチエージェントのコラボレーションを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 DataIntegrityGuard 및 ErrorPreventionEngine 에이전트를 조정할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 gpt-5.3-codex를 사용하여 메타 분석 워크플로우 결정 및 Codex CLI를 사용하여 단일 모델 모드에서 실행하여 강력한 게이트 통과/실패 결정 및 Codex CLI와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 다중 에이전트 협력을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a coordinar agentes DataIntegrityGuard y ErrorPreventionEngine, aprovechando gpt-5.3-codex para decisiones de flujo de trabajo de metaanálisis y utilizando Codex CLI para la ejecución en modo de modelo único, lo que permite decisiones sólidas de aprobación/rechazo de puertas y colaboración multiagente a través de protocolos como Codex CLI","fr":"Permet aux agents de coordonner les agents DataIntegrityGuard et ErrorPreventionEngine, en exploitant gpt-5.3-codex pour les décisions de workflow de méta-analyse et en utilisant Codex CLI pour l''exécution en mode modèle unique, permettant ainsi des décisions robustes de passage/échec de portes et une collaboration multi-agents via des protocoles tels que Codex CLI","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, DataIntegrityGuard- und ErrorPreventionEngine-Agents zu koordinieren, indem sie gpt-5.3-codex für Metaanalyse-Workflows nutzen und Codex CLI für die Ausführung im Einmodus-Modus verwenden, wodurch robuste Gate-Übertragungs-/Fehlschlagsentscheidungen und Multiagenten-Kollaboration durch Protokolle wie Codex CLI ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coordenar os agentes DataIntegrityGuard e ErrorPreventionEngine, utilizando gpt-5.3-codex para decisões de fluxo de trabalho de meta-análise e utilizando Codex CLI para execução no modo de modelo único, permitindo decisões robustas de aprovação/reprovação de portas e colaboração entre vários agentes por meio de protocolos como Codex CLI","ru":"Позволяет агентам координировать агентов DataIntegrityGuard и ErrorPreventionEngine, используя gpt-5.3-codex для решений по потоку мета-анализа и используя Codex CLI для выполнения в режиме единой модели, обеспечивая прочные решения о пропуске/замене ворот и сотрудничество между несколькими агентами через протоколы, такие как Codex CLI","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنسيق وكلاء DataIntegrityGuard و ErrorPreventionEngine، باستخدام gpt-5.3-codex لاتخاذ قرارات سير عمل التحليل الأعلى، واستخدام Codex CLI للتشغيل في وضع نموذج واحد، مما يتيح قرارات قوية لقبول / رفض البوابات والتعاون بين عدة وكلاء من خلال بروتوكولات مثل Codex CLI"},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating multi-gate validation pipelines for meta-analysis","Coordinating DataIntegrityGuard and ErrorPreventionEngine agents for enhanced data reliability","Making informed gate pass/fail decisions for the entire meta-analysis process"],"zh":["为元分析编排多级验证管道","协调 DataIntegrityGuard 和 ErrorPreventionEngine 代理人以增强数据可靠性","对整个元分析过程做出明智的关口通过/失败决策"],"ja":["メタ分析のためのマルチゲート検証パイプラインのオーケストレーション","DataIntegrityGuard と ErrorPreventionEngine エージェントの調整によるデータの信頼性の向上","メタ分析全体のゲート通過/失敗の決定についての情報に基づいた意思決定"],"ko":["메타 분석을 위한 멀티게이트 검증 파이프라인 오케스트레이션","DataIntegrityGuard 및 ErrorPreventionEngine 에이전트의 조정에 의한 데이터 신뢰성 향상","전체 메타 분석 과정에 대한 게이트 통과/실패에 대한 정보에 기반한 의사 결정"],"es":["Orquestar pipelines de validación multigate para metaanálisis","Coordinar agentes DataIntegrityGuard y ErrorPreventionEngine para una mayor confiabilidad de los datos","Tomar decisiones informadas de aprobación/rechazo de puertas para todo el proceso de metaanálisis"],"fr":["Orchestrer des pipelines de validation multigate pour la méta-analyse","Coordonner les agents DataIntegrityGuard et ErrorPreventionEngine pour une fiabilité des données améliorée","Prendre des décisions éclairées de passage/échec de portes pour l''ensemble du processus de méta-analyse"],"de":["Orchestrierung von Multi-Gate-Validierungspipelines für die Metaanalyse","Koordinierung von DataIntegrityGuard- und ErrorPreventionEngine-Agents für eine verbesserte Datensicherheit","Treffen von fundierten Gate-Übertragungs-/Fehlschlagsentscheidungen für den gesamten Metaanalyseprozess"],"pt":["Orquestrando pipelines de validação multi-porta para meta-análise","Coordinando agentes DataIntegrityGuard e ErrorPreventionEngine para confiabilidade de dados aprimorada","Tomando decisões informadas de aprovação/reprovação de portas para todo o processo de meta-análise"],"ru":["Оркестровка пайплайнов многоступенчатой валидации для мета-анализа","Координация агентов DataIntegrityGuard и ErrorPreventionEngine для повышения надежности данных","Принятие обоснованных решений о пропуске/замене ворот для всего процесса мета-анализа"],"ar":["أوركسترا أنابيب التحقق المتعددة للتحليل الأعلى","تنسيق وكلاء DataIntegrityGuard و ErrorPreventionEngine لتحسين موثوقية البيانات","اتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة لقبول / رفض البوابات لعملية التحليل الأعلى بأكملها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Runs in Codex CLI''s single-model mode, limiting parallel agent execution","Requires gpt-5.3-codex model compatibility"],"zh":["仅在 Codex CLI 的单模型模式下运行，限制了并行代理执行","需要 gpt-5.3-codex 模型兼容性"],"ja":["Codex CLI のシングルモデルモードでのみ実行され、並列エージェントの実行が制限される","gpt-5.3-codex モデルとの互換性が必要"],"ko":["Codex CLI의 단일 모델 모드에서만 실행되어 병렬 에이전트 실행이 제한됨","gpt-5.3-codex 모델과 호환성이 필요"],"es":["Se ejecuta en el modo de modelo único de Codex CLI, lo que limita la ejecución paralela de agentes","Requiere compatibilidad con el modelo gpt-5.3-codex"],"fr":["S''exécute en mode modèle unique de Codex CLI, limitant ainsi l''exécution parallèle des agents","Nécessite une compatibilité avec le modèle gpt-5.3-codex"],"de":["Läuft im Einmodus-Modus von Codex CLI, was die parallele Ausführung von Agenten einschränkt","Benötigt Kompatibilität mit dem gpt-5.3-codex-Modell"],"pt":["Executa no modo de modelo único do Codex CLI, limitando a execução paralela de agentes","Exige compatibilidade com o modelo gpt-5.3-codex"],"ru":["Выполняется в режиме единой модели Codex CLI, ограничивая параллельное выполнение агентов","Требует совместимости с моделью gpt-5.3-codex"],"ar":["يتشغيل في وضع نموذج واحد من Codex CLI، مما يحد من تنفيذ الوكلاء المتوازي","يتطلب توافقًا مع نموذج gpt-5.3-codex"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
