Solidity 模块骨架和 NatSpec 文档","ja":"scaffold-contract は、DeFi プロトコル開発用のテンプレートを作成するツールであり、標準的な Solidity モジュール スケルトンと NatSpec ドキュメントを提供します","ko":"scaffold-contract는 DeFi 프로토콜 개발 템플릿을 생성하는 도구로서 표준화된 Solidity 모듈 스케ルト와 NatSpec 문서를 제공합니다","es":"El skill scaffold-contract crea un esqueleto de módulo de Solidity con una estructura estándar para desarrollo de protocolos DeFi. Se centra en la estructura...","fr":"Le skill scaffold-contract crée un squelette de module Solidity avec une structure standard pour le développement de protocoles DeFi. Il se concentre sur la ...","de":"Der Skill scaffold-contract erstellt ein Gerüst für ein Solidity-Modul mit einer standardmäßigen Struktur für die Entwicklung von DeFi-Protokollen. Es konzen...","en":"Morpho vault v2 adapters for popular DeFi protocols"},"definition":{"en":"Morpho vault v2 adapters for popular DeFi protocols"},"features":{"zh":["标准化的 Solidity 模块骨架","audit-friendly 结构","NatSpec 文档","适用于 DeFi 协议开发","创建新模块或契约","建立一致的布局"],"ja":["標準的な Solidity モジュール スケルトン","audit-friendly 構造","NatSpec ドキュメント","DeFi プロトコル開発用","新しいモジュールまたは契約の作成","一貫したレイアウトの確立"],"ko":["표준화된 Solidity 모듈 스케ルト","audit-friendly 구조","NatSpec 문서","DeFi 프로토콜 개발을 위한","새 모듈 또는 계약 생성","일관된 레이아웃 설정"],"es":["Estructura estándar para módulos de Solidity","Documentación NatSpec para desarrollo de protocolos DeFi","Se centra en la estructura y las interfaces","No incluye comportamiento o pruebas","Ideal para empezar a desarrollar un nuevo contrato o módulo","Ayuda a establecer una estructura coherente antes de la implementación"],"fr":["Structure standard pour les modules Solidity","Documentation NatSpec pour le développement de protocoles DeFi","Se concentre sur la structure et les interfaces","Ne comprend pas le comportement ou les tests","Idéal pour commencer à développer un nouveau contrat ou module","Aide à établir une structure cohérente avant la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Standardmäßige Struktur für Solidity-Module","NatSpec-Dokumentation für die Entwicklung von DeFi-Protokollen","Konzentriert sich auf die Struktur und die Schnittstellen","Enthält kein Verhalten oder Tests","Ideal zum Starten der Entwicklung eines neuen Vertrags oder Moduls","Hilft bei der Einrichtung einer konsistenten Struktur vor der Implementierung"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DeFi 协议开发","Solidity 模块","audit-friendly","NatSpec 文档","scaffold-contract","模板生成","DeFi 开发工具","区块链开发"],"ja":["DeFi プロトコル開発","Solidity モジュール","audit-friendly","NatSpec ドキュメント","scaffold-contract","テンプレート生成","DeFi 開発ツール","ブロックチェーン開発"],"ko":["DeFi 프로토콜 개발","Solidity 모듈","audit-friendly","NatSpec 문서","scaffold-contract","템플릿 생성","DeFi 개발 도구","블록체인 개발"],"es":["scaffold contract","desarrollo de protocolos DeFi","Solidity","módulos de Solidity","estructura estándar","NatSpec","documentación","contratos inteligentes","desarrollo de blockchain"],"fr":["scaffold contract","développement de protocoles DeFi","Solidity","modules Solidity","structure standard","NatSpec","documentation","contrats intelligents","développement de blockchain"],"de":["scaffold contract","Entwicklung von DeFi-Protokollen","Solidity","Solidity-Module","standardmäßige Struktur","NatSpec","Dokumentation","Smart Contracts","Blockchain-Entwicklung"]}},"owner":"mgnfy-view","repo":"morpho-vault-v2-adapters","repoPath":"mgnfy-view/morpho-vault-v2-adapters","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scaffold-contract","description":"Scaffold new Solidity contract or module skeletons with NatSpec and audit-friendly structure without implementing behavior. Use when starting new modules, adapters, or contracts.","bodyPreview":"# Skill: scaffold-contract\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate a new Solidity module skeleton with a standard, audit-friendly\nstructure and NatSpec documentation, suitable for DeFi protocol development.\n\nThis skill focuses only on structure and interfaces, not behavior or tests.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- Starting a new contract or module\n- Adding a new vault, strategy, adapter, or manager\n- Establishing a consistent layout before implementation begins\n- Preparing a contract surface before `spec-to-implementation`","body":"# Skill: scaffold-contract\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate a new Solidity module skeleton with a standard, audit-friendly\nstructure and NatSpec documentation, suitable for DeFi protocol development.\n\nThis skill focuses only on structure and interfaces, not behavior or tests.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- Starting a new contract or module\n- Adding a new vault, strategy, adapter, or manager\n- Establishing a consistent layout before implementation begins\n- Preparing a contract surface before `spec-to-implementation`\n\n## Inputs Required\n\n- Contract name\n- Module type (e.g. vault, strategy, adapter, library)\n- Upgradeability model (immutable or upgradeable)\n- Solidity version (if different from repo default)\n- Required inheritance (base contracts, mixins)\n- Required interfaces to implement\n\n## Actions\n\n### 1) Generate a Solidity contract skeleton\n\nThe generated contract must include:\n\n- SPDX identifier\n- Solidity pragma\n- Imports following `.codex/constraints/solidity-style.md`\n- Contract declaration\n- Explicit sections for:\n  - constants\n  - immutables\n  - state variables\n  - errors\n  - events\n  - constructor or initializer\n  - external/public function declarations\n  - internal helper functions\n\nAll public and external functions must include NatSpec comments describing:\n- intent\n- parameters\n- return values\n- assumptions (if any)\n\nFunction bodies may be empty or revert with a `NotImplemented`-style custom error where appropriate.\n\n### 2) Define explicit placeholders (TODOs)\n\nAdd inline TODO comments indicating where future work belongs, including:\n- business logic\n- accounting paths\n- external integrations\n- access control checks\n- invariants that must later hold\n\nTODOs must include context explaining what is missing and why.\n\n## Constraints and Safety Rules\n\n- Must not implement business logic\n- Must not generate or modify any tests\n- Must not introduce external calls\n- Must not assume ERC20 compliance\n- Must comply with all rules in `.codex/constraints/solidity-style.md`\n- Storage layout for upgradeable contracts must be:\n  - explicit\n  - append-only\n  - clearly sectioned\n- Public APIs must be:\n  - fully declared\n  - documented\n  - unimplemented where appropriate\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `src/<module-path>/<Contract>.sol`\n\nNo test files, mocks, or scaffolding may be generated by this skill.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Contract compiles with `forge build`\n- Formatting passes `forge fmt`\n- No tests are created or modified\n\n## Handoff\n\nAfter successful execution, this skill should be followed by:\n- `spec-to-implementation` to implement behavior\n- `implementation-to-tests` to generate scenario-based tests\n\n## Example Prompts\n\n- “Use scaffold-contract to create an upgradeable ERC4626-style vault\n  named `MorphoVault` with documented public interfaces only.”\n- “Scaffold a non-upgradeable adapter contract implementing `IMarketAdapter`\n  without adding any logic or tests.”\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:27:09.219Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DeFi-focused AI Agents requiring standardized Solidity contract structures and NatSpec documentation","zh":"适用于需要标准化Solidity合约结构和NatSpec文档的DeFi焦点AI代理","ja":"DeFiに焦点を当てたSolidityコントラクト構造とNatSpecドキュメントを標準化する必要があるAIエージェントに最適","ko":"표준화된 Solidity 계약 구조 및 NatSpec 문서가 필요한 DeFi 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en DeFi que requieren estructuras de contrato de Solidity estandarizadas y documentación de NatSpec","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur DeFi nécessitant des structures de contrat Solidity standardisées et une documentation NatSpec","de":"Ideal für DeFi-fokussierte KI-Agents, die standardisierte Solidity-Vertragsstrukturen und NatSpec-Dokumentation erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em DeFi que exigem estruturas de contrato Solidity padronizadas e documentação NatSpec","ru":"Идеально подходит для децентрализованных финансах ориентированных агентов ИИ, требующих стандартизированных структур контрактов Solidity и документации NatSpec","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكية المتخصصة في التمويل اللامركزي التي تتطلب هياكل عقد Solidity معيارية وتوثيق NatSpec"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create audit-friendly Solidity modules with standard structure and interfaces, leveraging Morpho vault v2 adapters for popular DeFi protocols, and streamlining contract development with consistent layout and documentation","zh":"赋予代理创建审计友好型Solidity模块的能力，具有标准结构和接口，利用Morpho金库v2适配器来支持流行的DeFi协议，并通过一致的布局和文档来简化合同开发","ja":"Morphoの金庫v2アダプターを使用して人気のDeFiプロトコルをサポートし、標準的な構造とインターフェイスを持つオーディットフレンドリーなSolidityモジュールを作成できるようにエージェントに権限を与え、一貫したレイアウトとドキュメントでコントラクト開発を簡素化する","ko":"人気 있는 DeFi 프로토콜을 지원하기 위해 Morpho 금고 v2 어댑터를 사용하여 감사 친화적인 Solidity 모듈을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하고 일관된 레이아웃 및 문서로 계약 개발을 간소화함","es":"Permite a los agentes crear módulos de Solidity de fácil auditoría con estructura y interfaces estándar, aprovechando adaptadores de bóveda Morpho v2 para protocolos DeFi populares y simplificando el desarrollo de contratos con un diseño y documentación coherentes","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des modules Solidity prêts à l''audit avec une structure et des interfaces standard, en exploitant les adaptateurs de vault Morpho v2 pour les protocoles DeFi populaires, et en simplifiant le développement de contrats avec une disposition et une documentation cohérentes","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, prüffreundliche Solidity-Module mit Standardstruktur und -Schnittstellen zu erstellen, indem sie Morpho-Vault-v2-Adapter für beliebte DeFi-Protokolle nutzen und die Vertragserstellung mit konsistenter Layout und Dokumentation vereinfachen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar módulos Solidity com estrutura e interfaces padronizadas, aproveitando adaptadores de cofre Morpho v2 para protocolos DeFi populares e simplificando o desenvolvimento de contrato com layout e documentação consistentes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать модули Solidity с стандартизированной структурой и интерфейсами, используя адаптеры хранилища Morpho v2 для популярных протоколов децентрализованных финансах и упрощая разработку контрактов с последовательной раскладкой и документацией","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء وحدات Solidity ذات هيكل ومواجهة معيارية، مستفيدة من محوّل الخزانة Morpho v2 لأشهر بروتوكولات التمويل اللامركزي، وبتبسيط تطوير العقد بمخطط ووثائق متسقين"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating new contract or module skeletons","Creating standardized vault, strategy, adapter, or manager implementations","Establishing consistent contract layouts for DeFi protocol development","Preparing contract surfaces for spec-to-implementation workflows"],"zh":["生成新的合同或模块骨架","创建标准化的金库、策略、适配器或管理器实现","建立一致的合同布局以进行DeFi协议开发","为规范到实现工作流程准备合同表面"],"ja":["新しいコントラクトまたはモジュールのスケルトンを生成する","標準化された金庫、戦略、適配器、またはマネージャーの実装を作成する","DeFiプロトコルの開発のための一貫したコントラクトレイアウトを確立する","仕様から実装へのワークフローに備えてコントラクトサーフェスを準備する"],"ko":["新的 계약 또는 모듈 스켈레톤 생성","표준화된 보관소, 전략, 어댑터 또는 관리자 구현 생성","DeFi 프로토콜 개발을 위한 일관된 계약 레이아웃 설정","규격에서 구현으로의 워크플로우 준비를 위한 계약 표면 준비"],"es":["Generar esqueletos de contrato o módulo nuevos","Crear implementaciones de bóveda, estrategia, adaptador o administrador estandarizadas","Establecer diseños de contrato coherentes para el desarrollo de protocolos DeFi","Preparar superficies de contrato para flujos de trabajo de especificación a implementación"],"fr":["Générer de nouveaux squelettes de contrat ou de module","Créer des implémentations de vault, de stratégie, d''adaptateur ou de gestionnaire standardisées","Établir des dispositions de contrat cohérentes pour le développement de protocoles DeFi","Préparer les surfaces de contrat pour les flux de travail de spécification à implémentation"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen Vertrags- oder Modulskeletten","Erstellen standardisierter Implementierungen von Tresor, Strategie, Adapter oder Manager","Festlegen konsistenter Vertragslayouts für die Entwicklung von DeFi-Protokollen","Vorbereiten von Vertragsoberflächen für Spezifikations-Implementierungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Geração de esqueletos de contrato ou módulo novos","Criação de implementações de cofre, estratégia, adaptador ou gerente padronizadas","Estabelecimento de layouts de contrato consistentes para desenvolvimento de protocolo DeFi","Preparação de superfícies de contrato para fluxos de trabalho de especificação para implementação"],"ru":["Генерация скелетов нового контракта или модуля","Создание стандартизированных реализаций хранилища, стратегии, адаптера или менеджера","Установление последовательных макетов контрактов для разработки протокола децентрализованных финансах","Подготовка поверхностей контрактов для рабочих процессов спецификации к реализации"],"ar":["توليد هياكل عقد أو وحدات جديدة","إنشاء تنفيذات معيارية للخزانة أو الاستراتيجية أو المحوّل أو المدير","إنشاء مخططات عقد متسقة لتطوير بروتوكول التمويل اللامركزي","إعداد سطوح العقد للعملية من المحدد إلى التنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Focuses only on contract structure and interfaces, not behavior or tests","Requires Solidity development environment and familiarity with DeFi protocols"],"zh":["仅关注合同结构和接口，而不考虑行为或测试","需要Solidity开发环境和DeFi协议的熟悉度"],"ja":["コントラクトの構造とインターフェイスのみに焦点を当て、動作やテストは考慮しない","Solidity開発環境とDeFiプロトコルの熟知度が必要"],"ko":["계약 구조 및 인터페이스만을 고려하며, 동작 또는 테스트는 고려하지 않음","Solidity 개발 환경 및 DeFi 프로토콜에 대한熟悉도가 필요"],"es":["Se centra solo en la estructura y las interfaces del contrato, no en el comportamiento o las pruebas","Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de Solidity y familiaridad con los protocolos DeFi"],"fr":["Se concentre uniquement sur la structure et les interfaces du contrat, et non sur le comportement ou les tests","Nécessite un environnement de développement Solidity et une familiarité avec les protocoles DeFi"],"de":["Konzentriert sich nur auf die Vertragsstruktur und -Schnittstellen, nicht auf das Verhalten oder die Tests","Benötigt eine Solidity-Entwicklungsumgebung und Vertrautheit mit DeFi-Protokollen"],"pt":["Concentra-se apenas na estrutura e interfaces do contrato, não no comportamento ou testes","Exige ambiente de desenvolvimento Solidity e familiaridade com protocolos DeFi"],"ru":["Фокусируется только на структуре и интерфейсах контракта, а не на поведении или тестах","Требует среды разработки Solidity и знакомства с протоколами децентрализованных финансах"],"ar":["يركز فقط على هيكل واجهة العقد، وليس على السلوك أو الاختبارات","يتطلب بيئة تطوير Solidity ودراية ببروتوكولات التمويل اللامركزي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
