omaine","Couche de domaine avec logique métier","Interface de référentiel pour accéder aux données","Validation et règles métier"],"de":["Trennung von Anliegen in Schichten","Abhängigkeiten, die auf das Domänen-Modell zeigen","Domänen-Schicht mit Geschäftslogik","Schnittstelle für den Zugriff auf Daten","Validierung und Geschäftsregeln"],"pt":["Separação de preocupações em camadas","Dependências apontando para o domínio","Análise estatística de código-fonte em Go e Python","Repositório de interfaces e lógica de domínio","Validação e regras de negócios"],"ru":["Разделение проблем на отдельные слои","Зависимости, указывающие на домен","Статистический анализ кода на Go и Python","Репозиторий интерфейсов и логики домена","Валидация и правила бизнеса"],"ar":["فصل المشاكل إلى طبقات منفصلة","الإعتماديات التي تشير إلى المجال","تحليل الكود الإحصائي في Go و Python","مخزن واجهات و منطق المجال","التحقق و قواعد الأعمال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Go语言","清洁架构","软件设计模式","领域逻辑","外部依赖","代码质量","可维护性"],"ja":["Go言語","クリーンアーキテクチャ","ソフトウェア設計パターン","ドメインロジック","外部依存","コード品質","保守性"],"ko":["고","클린 아키텍처","소프트웨어 디자인 패턴","도메인 로직","외부 의존성","코드 품질","유지 보수성"],"es":["arquitectura limpia","desarrollo de software","go","programación","diseño de software","patrones de diseño"],"fr":["architecture propre","développement de logiciels","go","programmation","conception de logiciels","patrons de conception"],"de":["saubere Architektur","Software-Entwicklung","go","Programmierung","Software-Design","Entwurfsmuster"],"pt":["Arquitetura Limpa em Go","Análise estatística de código","Go e Python","Desenvolvimento de software","Design de software","Separação de preocupações","Dependências","Domínio","Repositório de interfaces"],"ru":["Чистая архитектура в Go","Статистический анализ кода","Go и Python","Разработка программного обеспечения","Проектирование программного обеспечения","Разделение проблем","Зависимости","Домен","Репозиторий интерфейсов"],"ar":["هندسة النظافة في Go","تحليل الكود الإحصائي","Go و Python","تطوير البرمجيات","تصميم البرمجيات","فصل المشاكل","الإعتماديات","المجال","مخزن واجهات"]}},"owner":"zskulcsar","repo":"code-stats","repoPath":"zskulcsar/code-stats","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"go-clean-architecture","description":"Expert knowledge in Go clean architecture patterns and best practices","bodyPreview":"# Go Clean Architecture Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nClean Architecture in Go emphasizes separation of concerns through distinct layers, with dependencies pointing inward toward the domain.\n\n## Layer Structure\n\n### Domain Layer (innermost)\n**Location:** `internal/domain/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Business entities (structs)\n- Repository interfaces\n- Domain logic and validation\n- Business rules\n\n**Rules:**\n- NO external dependencies\n- NO framework dependencies\n- Pure business logic\n- Defines contracts for outer l","body":"# Go Clean Architecture Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nClean Architecture in Go emphasizes separation of concerns through distinct layers, with dependencies pointing inward toward the domain.\n\n## Layer Structure\n\n### Domain Layer (innermost)\n**Location:** `internal/domain/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Business entities (structs)\n- Repository interfaces\n- Domain logic and validation\n- Business rules\n\n**Rules:**\n- NO external dependencies\n- NO framework dependencies\n- Pure business logic\n- Defines contracts for outer layers\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// internal/domain/account.go\npackage domain\n\ntype Account struct {\n    ID      string\n    Name    string\n    Type    AccountType\n    Balance int // cents\n}\n\ntype AccountRepository interface {\n    Create(account *Account) error\n    GetByID(id string) (*Account, error)\n    Update(account *Account) error\n    Delete(id string) error\n}\n\n// Domain validation\nfunc (a *Account) Validate() error {\n    if a.Name == \"\" {\n        return ErrInvalidName\n    }\n    if !a.Type.IsValid() {\n        return ErrInvalidType\n    }\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n### Application Layer (middle)\n**Location:** `internal/application/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Business logic services\n- Use case orchestration\n- Service interfaces\n- Cross-cutting concerns\n\n**Rules:**\n- Depends ONLY on domain interfaces\n- NO HTTP dependencies\n- NO database dependencies\n- Orchestrates domain entities\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// internal/application/account_service.go\npackage application\n\nimport \"internal/domain\"\n\ntype AccountService struct {\n    repo domain.AccountRepository // Interface, not concrete type\n}\n\nfunc NewAccountService(repo domain.AccountRepository) *AccountService {\n    return &AccountService{repo: repo}\n}\n\nfunc (s *AccountService) CreateAccount(account *domain.Account) error {\n    if err := account.Validate(); err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"validation failed: %w\", err)\n    }\n\n    if err := s.repo.Create(account); err != nil {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"failed to create account: %w\", err)\n    }\n\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n### Infrastructure Layer (outermost)\n**Location:** `internal/infrastructure/`\n\n**Contains:**\n- Repository implementations\n- HTTP handlers\n- Database logic\n- External service integrations\n\n**Rules:**\n- Implements domain interfaces\n- Can have external dependencies\n- Handlers should be thin (parse → service → respond)\n- Repositories only handle persistence\n\n**Example:**\n```go\n// internal/infrastructure/repository/account_repository.go\npackage repository\n\nimport (\n    \"database/sql\"\n    \"internal/domain\"\n)\n\ntype AccountRepository struct {\n    db *sql.DB\n}\n\nfunc NewAccountRepository(db *sql.DB) *AccountRepository {\n    return &AccountRepository{db: db}\n}\n\nfunc (r *AccountRepository) Create(account *domain.Account) error {\n    query := `INSERT INTO accounts (id, name, type, balance) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)`\n    _, err := r.db.Exec(query, account.ID, account.Name, account.Type, account.Balance)\n    return err\n}\n\n// internal/infrastructure/http/handlers/account_handler.go\npackage handlers\n\ntype AccountHandler struct {\n    service *application.AccountService\n}\n\nfunc (h *AccountHandler) CreateAccount(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // 1. Parse request\n    var req CreateAccountRequest\n    if err := json.NewDecoder(r.Body).Decode(&req); err != nil {\n        http.Error(w, \"invalid request\", http.StatusBadRequest)\n        return\n    }\n\n    // 2. Call service\n    account := req.ToDomain()\n    if err := h.service.CreateAccount(account); err != nil {\n        http.Error(w, err.Error(), http.StatusInternalServerError)\n        return\n    }\n\n    // 3. Return response\n    w.WriteHeader(http.StatusCreated)\n    json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(account)\n}\n```\n\n## Dependency Injection\n\nWire dependencies in main.go:\n\n```go\n// cmd/server/main.go\nfunc main() {\n    // Infrastructure\n    db := setupDatabase()\n\n    // Repositories (concrete implementations)\n    accountRepo := repository.NewAccountRepository(db)\n\n    // Services (injected with interfaces)\n    accountService := application.NewAccountService(accountRepo)\n\n    // Handlers (injected with services)\n    accountHandler := handlers.NewAccountHandler(accountService)\n\n    // Router\n    router := setupRouter(accountHandler)\n\n    http.ListenAndServe(\":8080\", router)\n}\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Repository Pattern\n```go\n// Domain defines interface\ntype Repository interface {\n    Create(entity *Entity) error\n    GetByID(id string) (*Entity, error)\n}\n\n// Infrastructure implements\ntype SQLRepository struct {\n    db *sql.DB\n}\n\nfunc (r *SQLRepository) Create(entity *Entity) error {\n    // SQL implementation\n}\n```\n\n### Service Pattern\n```go\ntype Service struct {\n    repo domain.Repository  // Depend on interface\n}\n\nfunc (s *Service) DoBusinessLogic(entity *domain.Entity) error {\n    // Validate\n    // Transform\n    // Call repository\n    return s.repo.Create(entity)\n}\n```\n\n### Handler Pattern\n```go\nfunc (h *Handler) HandleRequest(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // Parse → Service → Respond\n    req := parseRequest(r)\n    result, err := h.service.Do(req)\n    respond(w, result, err)\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n### ❌ Domain with External Dependencies\n```go\n// BAD: Domain importing database\nimport \"database/sql\"\n\ntype Account struct {\n    db *sql.DB  // ❌ Domain shouldn''t know about database\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Service with HTTP/Database\n```go\n// BAD: Service with HTTP dependency\nfunc (s *Service) Create(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // ❌ Service shouldn''t handle HTTP\n}\n\n// BAD: Service with database dependency\nfunc (s *Service) Create(db *sql.DB, entity *Entity) error {\n    // ❌ Service should use repository interface\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Handler with Business Logic\n```go\n// BAD: Complex logic in handler\nfunc (h *Handler) Create(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    // Parse\n    // ❌ Complex validation\n    // ❌ Calculations\n    // ❌ Business rules\n    // Direct database access\n}\n\n// GOOD: Thin handler\nfunc (h *Handler) Create(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    req := parse(r)\n    result := h.service.Create(req)  // Service has the logic\n    respond(w, result)\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Repository with Business Logic\n```go\n// BAD: Business rules in repository\nfunc (r *Repository) Create(account *Account) error {\n    // ❌ Business validation in repository\n    if account.Balance < 0 && account.Type != \"credit\" {\n        return errors.New(\"invalid\")\n    }\n    // Should only handle persistence\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Strategy\n\n### Domain Tests\n```go\nfunc TestAccount_Validate(t *testing.T) {\n    // Test entity validation\n    // No mocks needed\n}\n```\n\n### Service Tests (Unit)\n```go\nfunc TestService_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    mockRepo := &MockRepository{}  // Mock interface\n    service := NewService(mockRepo)\n    // Test business logic\n}\n```\n\n### Repository Tests (Integration)\n```go\nfunc TestRepository_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    db := setupTestDB()  // Real database\n    repo := NewRepository(db)\n    // Test persistence\n}\n```\n\n### Handler Tests (E2E)\n```go\nfunc TestHandler_Create(t *testing.T) {\n    mockService := &MockService{}\n    handler := NewHandler(mockService)\n    req := httptest.NewRequest(\"POST\", \"/\", body)\n    w := httptest.NewRecorder()\n    handler.Create(w, req)\n    // Test HTTP layer\n}\n```\n\n## Benefits\n\n✅ **Testability**: Easy to mock dependencies\n✅ **Maintainability**: Clear separation of concerns\n✅ **Flexibility**: Easy to swap implementations\n✅ **Independence**: Domain logic independent of frameworks\n✅ **Scalability**: Easy to add features\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Multi-layer applications\n- Complex business logic\n- Long-lived projects\n- Team projects requiring clear boundaries\n- Applications that may change databases/frameworks\n\n## Quick Checklist\n\n- [ ] Domain has no external dependencies\n- [ ] Application uses interfaces, not concrete types\n- [ ] Handlers are thin (parse → service → respond)\n- [ ] Repositories only handle persistence\n- [ ] Dependencies point inward\n- [ ] Business logic in services, not handlers\n- [ ] Each layer has clear responsibility\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:28:06.820Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents specializing in Go and Python, seeking to enforce Clean Architecture principles through statistical analysis of source code.","zh":"适合专门从事Go和Python的代码审查代理，通过源代码的统计分析来强制执行清洁架构原则。","ja":"GoとPythonを専門とするコードレビューのエージェントに最適で、統計分析を通じてクリーンアーキテクチャの原則を強制することができる。","ko":"Go와 Python을 전문으로 하는 코드 검토 에이전트에 적합하며, 통계적 분석을 통해 깨끗한 아키텍처 원칙을 시행하도록 지원한다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código especializados en Go y Python, que buscan hacer cumplir los principios de Arquitectura Limpia a través del análisis estadístico del código fuente.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Révision de Code spécialisés dans Go et Python, cherchant à faire respecter les principes d''Architecture Propre via l''analyse statistique du code source.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die auf Go und Python spezialisiert sind und die Prinzipien der sauberen Architektur durch statistische Analyse des Quellcodes durchsetzen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código especializados em Go e Python, que buscam aplicar os princípios de Arquitetura Limpa por meio da análise estatística do código-fonte.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, специализирующихся на Go и Python, стремящихся обеспечить соблюдение принципов Чистой Архитектуры посредством статистического анализа исходного кода.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مراجعة الشفرة المتخصصين في Go و Python الذين يسعون لفرض مبادئ الهندسة المعمارية النظيفة من خلال التحليل الإحصائي للشفرة المصدرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and enforce separation of concerns in Go applications through distinct layers, utilizing repository interfaces and domain logic, while ensuring no external dependencies and pure business logic within the domain layer.","zh":"赋予代理分析和执行Go应用程序中的关注点分离，通过不同的层，利用存储库接口和领域逻辑，同时确保没有外部依赖和领域层中的纯业务逻辑。","ja":"エージェントにGoアプリケーション内の関心の分離を分析して実施する力を与え、リポジトリインターフェイスやドメインロジックを用いた異なるレイヤーを通じて、外部依存がないことやドメインレイヤー内の純粋なビジネスロジックを保証する。","ko":"에이전트가 Go 애플리케이션 내의 관심사 분리를 분석하고 시행할 수 있도록 해주며, 리포지토리 인터페이스와 도메인 로직을 사용한 별개의 계층을 통해 외부 의존성이 없고 도메인 계층 내의 순수한 비즈니스 로직을 보장한다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar y hacer cumplir la separación de preocupaciones en aplicaciones Go a través de capas distintas, utilizando interfaces de repositorio y lógica de dominio, al mismo tiempo que garantiza que no haya dependencias externas y una lógica de negocio pura dentro de la capa de dominio.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et de faire respecter la séparation des préoccupations dans les applications Go à travers des couches distinctes, en utilisant des interfaces de référentiel et une logique de domaine, tout en s''assurant qu''il n''y a pas de dépendances externes et une logique métier pure au sein de la couche de domaine.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Trennung von Belangen in Go-Anwendungen durch deutliche Schichten zu analysieren und durchzusetzen, indem sie Repository-Schnittstellen und Domänenlogik verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig sicherstellen, dass es keine externen Abhängigkeiten und reine Geschäftslogik innerhalb der Domänen-Schicht gibt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar e aplicar a separação de preocupações em aplicações Go por meio de camadas distintas, utilizando interfaces de repositório e lógica de domínio, garantindo que não haja dependências externas e lógica de negócios pura dentro da camada de domínio.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать и обеспечивать разделение проблем в приложениях Go посредством отдельных слоев, используя интерфейсы хранилищ и логiku домена, гарантируя отсутствие внешних зависимостей и чистой логики бизнеса внутри слоя домена.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحليل وفرض فصل الاهتمامات في تطبيقات Go من خلال طبقات متميزة، باستخدام واجهات مستودع ومنطق المجال، مع ضمان عدم وجود зависимости خارجية و منطق أعمال نقي داخل طبقة المجال."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Go source code for adherence to Clean Architecture principles","Generating statistical reports on layer structure and dependencies in Go applications","Validating domain logic and repository interfaces in Python and Go projects"],"zh":["分析Go源代码以确保遵守清洁架构原则","生成Go应用程序的层结构和依赖关系的统计报告","验证Python和Go项目中的领域逻辑和存储库接口"],"ja":["クリーンアーキテクチャの原則を遵守するためのGoソースコードの分析","Goアプリケーションのレイヤー構造と依存関係の統計レポートの生成","PythonおよびGoプロジェクトのドメインロジックとリポジトリインターフェイスの検証"],"ko":["깨끗한 아키텍처 원칙을 준수하는 Go 소스 코드 분석","Go 애플리케이션의 계층 구조 및 의존성에 대한 통계 보고서 생성","Python 및 Go 프로젝트의 도메인 로직 및 리포지토리 인터페이스 검증"],"es":["Análisis del código fuente de Go para el cumplimiento de los principios de Arquitectura Limpia","Generación de informes estadísticos sobre la estructura de capas y dependencias en aplicaciones Go","Validación de la lógica de dominio y las interfaces de repositorio en proyectos de Python y Go"],"fr":["Analyse du code source Go pour la conformité aux principes d''Architecture Propre","Génération de rapports statistiques sur la structure de couches et les dépendances dans les applications Go","Validation de la logique de domaine et des interfaces de référentiel dans les projets Python et Go"],"de":["Analyse des Go-Quellcodes für die Einhaltung der Prinzipien der sauberen Architektur","Erstellung statistischer Berichte über die Schichtstruktur und Abhängigkeiten in Go-Anwendungen","Validierung der Domänenlogik und Repository-Schnittstellen in Python- und Go-Projekten"],"pt":["Analisar o código-fonte Go para aderência aos princípios de Arquitetura Limpa","Gerar relatórios estatísticos sobre a estrutura de camadas e dependências em aplicações Go","Validar a lógica de domínio e interfaces de repositório em projetos Python e Go"],"ru":["Анализировать исходный код Go на соблюдение принципов Чистой Архитектуры","Генерировать статистические отчеты о структуре слоев и зависимостях в приложениях Go","Проверять логику домена и интерфейсы хранилищ в проектах Python и Go"],"ar":["تحليل الشفرة المصدرية Go لامتثالها لمبادئ الهندسة المعمارية النظيفة","توليد تقارير إحصائية حول هيكل الطبقات والاعتماديات في تطبيقات Go","التحقق من منطق المجال وواجهات المستودع في مشاريع Python و Go"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Go and Python source code analysis","Requires understanding of Clean Architecture principles and layer structure","No framework dependencies allowed within the domain layer"],"zh":["仅限于Go和Python源代码分析","需要了解清洁架构原则和层结构","不允许在领域层内使用框架依赖"],"ja":["GoおよびPythonソースコードの分析のみ","クリーンアーキテクチャの原則とレイヤー構造の理解が必要","ドメインレイヤー内ではフレームワーク依存を使用できない"],"ko":["Go 및 Python 소스 코드 분석에만 한정됨","깨끗한 아키텍처 원칙 및 계층 구조에 대한 이해가 필요함","도메인 계층 내에서는 프레임워크 의존성을 사용할 수 없음"],"es":["Limitado al análisis de código fuente de Go y Python","Requiere comprensión de los principios de Arquitectura Limpia y la estructura de capas","No se permiten dependencias de frameworks dentro de la capa de dominio"],"fr":["Limité à l''analyse du code source Go et Python","Nécessite une compréhension des principes d''Architecture Propre et de la structure de couches","Aucune dépendance de framework n''est autorisée au sein de la couche de domaine"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Go- und Python-Quellcode","Benötigt ein Verständnis der Prinzipien der sauberen Architektur und der Schichtstruktur","Keine Framework-Abhängigkeiten innerhalb der Domänen-Schicht sind erlaubt"],"pt":["Limitado à análise de código-fonte Go e Python","Exige compreensão dos princípios de Arquitetura Limpa e estrutura de camadas","Não são permitidas dependências de estrutura dentro da camada de domínio"],"ru":["Ограничен анализом исходного кода Go и Python","Требует понимания принципов Чистой Архитектуры и структуры слоев","Не допускаются зависимости фреймворка внутри слоя домена"],"ar":["محدود بتحليل الشفرة المصدرية Go و Python","يتطلب فهم مبادئ الهندسة المعمارية النظيفة وهيكل الطبقات","لا يسمح بالاعتماديات الإطار داخل طبقة المجال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
