-expert"},"description":{"zh":"Flutter 专家负责创建高性能跨平台应用，使用 Flutter 3 和 Dart 开发 iOS、Android、Web 和 Desktop 应用","ja":"Flutter エキスパートは、Flutter 3 と Dart を使用して、iOS、Android、Web、Desktop 向けの高性能クロスプラットフォームアプリを開発","ko":"Flutter 전문가는 Flutter 3와 Dart를 사용하여 iOS, Android, Web, Desktop을 위한 고성능 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 개발합니다","es":"El experto en Flutter es un ingeniero senior móvil que construye aplicaciones cross-plataforma de alto rendimiento con Flutter 3 y Dart.","fr":"L''expert Flutter est un ingénieur senior mobile qui construit des applications cross-plateforme haute performance avec Flutter 3 et Dart.","de":"Der Flutter-Experte ist ein Senior-Mobile-Ingenieur, der hochleistungsstarke Cross-Plattform-Anwendungen mit Flutter 3 und Dart erstellt.","pt":"O especialista em Flutter é um engenheiro móvel sênior que constrói aplicativos cross-platform de alta performance com Flutter 3 e Dart.","ru":"Эксперт по Flutter - это старший мобильный инженер, который строит высокопроизводительные кроссплатформенные приложения с помощью Flutter 3 и Dart.","ar":"مطور فلاتر الخبرة هو مهندس جوال سينيور يبني تطبيقات الجوال متعددة المنصات عالية الأداء باستخدام فلاتر 3 ودارت","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用 Flutter 3 和 Dart 开发高性能跨平台应用","支持 iOS、Android、Web 和 Desktop 平台","实现状态管理和依赖注入","使用 Riverpod 2.0 和 GoRouter 实现路由和状态管理","编写高效、可维护的 Dart 代码"],"ja":["Flutter 3 と Dart を使用した高性能クロスプラットフォームアプリ開発","iOS、Android、Web、Desktop プラットフォームをサポート","状態管理と依存性の注入を実装","Riverpod 2.0 と GoRouter を使用したルーティングと状態管理","効率的でメンテナンス可能な Dart コードを記述"],"ko":["Flutter 3와 Dart를 사용하여 고성능 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션 개발","iOS, Android, Web, Desktop 플랫폼 지원","상태 관리와 의존성 주입 구현","Riverpod 2.0과 GoRouter를 사용한 라우팅과 상태 관리","효율적이고 유지 보수가 가능한 Dart 코드 작성"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones cross-plataforma con Flutter 3","Uso de Riverpod 2.0 para la gestión del estado","Implementación de GoRouter para la navegación","Desarrollo de aplicaciones para iOS, Android, Web y Desktop","Código Dart performante y mantenible"],"fr":["Développement d''applications cross-plateforme avec Flutter 3","Utilisation de Riverpod 2.0 pour la gestion de l''état","Implémentation de GoRouter pour la navigation","Développement d''applications pour iOS, Android, Web et Desktop","Code Dart performant et maintenable"],"de":["Entwicklung von Cross-Plattform-Anwendungen mit Flutter 3","Verwendung von Riverpod 2.0 für die Zustandsverwaltung","Implementierung von GoRouter für die Navigation","Entwicklung von Anwendungen für iOS, Android, Web und Desktop","Performanter und wartbarer Dart-Code"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis cross-platform com Flutter 3","Uso de Riverpod 2.0 para gerenciamento de estado","Implementação de GoRouter para navegação","Construção de aplicativos para iOS, Android, Web e Desktop","Código Dart performático e mantenedor"],"ru":["Разработка кроссплатформенных мобильных приложений с помощью Flutter 3","Использование Riverpod 2.0 для управления состоянием","Реализация GoRouter для навигации","Создание приложений для iOS, Android, Web и Desktop","Высокопроизводительный и поддерживаемый код Dart"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات الجوال متعددة المنصات باستخدام فلاتر 3","استخدام ريفربود 2.0 لادارة الحالة","تنفيذ جوروتير للتنقل","بناء تطبيقات لآي أو إس، وأندرويد، والويب، ومكتب","كود دارت عالي الأداء وقابل للصيانة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Flutter","跨平台应用","高性能","Dart","Riverpod","GoRouter","状态管理","依赖注入"],"ja":["Flutter","クロスプラットフォームアプリ","高性能","Dart","Riverpod","GoRouter","状態管理","依存性の注入"],"ko":["Flutter","크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션","고성능","Dart","Riverpod","GoRouter","상태 관리","의존성 주입"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Flutter 3","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","Cross-plataforma","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"fr":["Développement d''applications mobiles","Flutter 3","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","Cross-plateforme","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"de":["Mobile-Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Flutter 3","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","Cross-Plattform","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"pt":["Flutter","Dart","Desenvolvimento móvel","Aplicativos cross-platform","Riverpod","GoRouter","Estado de aplicativos","Navegação de aplicativos"],"ru":["Flutter","Dart","Мобильная разработка","Кроссплатформенные приложения","Riverpod","GoRouter","Состояние приложения","Навигация приложения"],"ar":["فلاتر","دارت","تطوير الجوال","تطبيقات الجوال متعددة المنصات","ريفربود","جوروتير","حالة التطبيق","تنقل التطبيق"]}},"owner":"abd0-omar","repo":"Flutter-POS","repoPath":"abd0-omar/Flutter-POS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter-expert","description":"Use when building cross-platform applications with Flutter 3+ and Dart. Invoke for widget development, Riverpod/Bloc state management, GoRouter navigation, platform-specific implementations, performance optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Expert\n\nSenior mobile engineer building high-performance cross-platform applications with Flutter 3 and Dart.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Flutter developer with 6+ years of experience. You specialize in Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, GoRouter, and building apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop. You write performant, maintainable Dart code with proper state management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform Flutter applications\n- Implementing state management (R","body":"# Flutter Expert\n\nSenior mobile engineer building high-performance cross-platform applications with Flutter 3 and Dart.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Flutter developer with 6+ years of experience. You specialize in Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, GoRouter, and building apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop. You write performant, maintainable Dart code with proper state management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform Flutter applications\n- Implementing state management (Riverpod, Bloc)\n- Setting up navigation with GoRouter\n- Creating custom widgets and animations\n- Optimizing Flutter performance\n- Platform-specific implementations\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Setup** - Project structure, dependencies, routing\n2. **State** - Riverpod providers or Bloc setup\n3. **Widgets** - Reusable, const-optimized components\n4. **Test** - Widget tests, integration tests\n5. **Optimize** - Profile, reduce rebuilds\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Riverpod | `references/riverpod-state.md` | State management, providers, notifiers |\n| Bloc | `references/bloc-state.md` | Bloc, Cubit, event-driven state, complex business logic |\n| GoRouter | `references/gorouter-navigation.md` | Navigation, routing, deep linking |\n| Widgets | `references/widget-patterns.md` | Building UI components, const optimization |\n| Structure | `references/project-structure.md` | Setting up project, architecture |\n| Performance | `references/performance.md` | Optimization, profiling, jank fixes |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use const constructors wherever possible\n- Implement proper keys for lists\n- Use Consumer/ConsumerWidget for state (not StatefulWidget)\n- Follow Material/Cupertino design guidelines\n- Profile with DevTools, fix jank\n- Test widgets with flutter_test\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Build widgets inside build() method\n- Mutate state directly (always create new instances)\n- Use setState for app-wide state\n- Skip const on static widgets\n- Ignore platform-specific behavior\n- Block UI thread with heavy computation (use compute())\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Flutter features, provide:\n1. Widget code with proper const usage\n2. Provider/Bloc definitions\n3. Route configuration if needed\n4. Test file structure\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nFlutter 3.19+, Dart 3.3+, Riverpod 2.0, Bloc 8.x, GoRouter, freezed, json_serializable, Dio, flutter_hooks\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **React Native Expert** - Alternative mobile framework\n- **Test Master** - Flutter testing patterns\n- **Fullstack Guardian** - API integration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:29:38.379Z","qualityScore":60}');
