 API-Adoption und Reduzierung der Entwickler-Reibung"],"pt":["Criação de documentação abrangente e interativa","Mestre em ferramentas de documentação modernas","Conhecimento em OpenAPI 3.1+","Fluxos de trabalho de documentação impulsionados por IA","Documentação acessível e de fácil uso"],"ru":["Создание комплексной и интерактивной документации","Мастер современных инструментов документации","Знание OpenAPI 3.1+","Потоки работы документации, основанные на ИИ","Доступная и простая в использовании документация"],"ar":["إنشاء توثيق شامل و تفاعلي","خبير في أدوات التوثيق الحديثة","معرفة ب OpenAPI 3.1+","سلاسل عمل التوثيق المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","توثيق يمكن الوصول إليه وسهل الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API ","OpenAPI 3.1+","AI ","API "," ","API "],"ja":["API ","OpenAPI 3.1+","AI ","API "," ","API "],"ko":["API ","OpenAPI 3.1+","AI ","API "," ","API "],"es":["documentación de API","experiencia del desarrollador","herramientas de documentación modernas","OpenAPI 3.1+","flujos de trabajo de documentación impulsados por IA","adopción de API","reducción de la fricción del desarrollador","documentación interactiva","documentación accesible"],"fr":["documentation d''API","expérience du développeur","outils de documentation modernes","OpenAPI 3.1+","flux de travail de documentation alimentés par l''IA","adoption de l''API","réduction de la friction du développeur","documentation interactive","documentation accessible"],"de":["API-Dokumentation","Entwicklererfahrung","moderne Dokumentations-Tools","OpenAPI 3.1+","Dokumentations-Workflows gesteuert durch KI","API-Adoption","Reduzierung der Entwickler-Reibung","interaktive Dokumentation","zugängliche Dokumentation"],"pt":["documentação de API","experiência de desenvolvedor","ferramentas de documentação","OpenAPI","IA","documentação interativa","desenvolvedor de software","API","documentação de software"],"ru":["документация API","опыт разработчика","инструменты документации","OpenAPI","ИИ","интерактивная документация","разработчик программного обеспечения","API","документация программного обеспечения"],"ar":["توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تجربة المطور","أدوات التوثيق","OpenAPI","الذكاء الاصطناعي","توثيق تفاعلي","مطور البرمجيات","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","توثيق البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-documenter","description":"Master API documentation with OpenAPI 3.1, AI-powered tools, and modern developer experience practices. Create interactive docs, generate SDKs, and build comprehensive developer portals. Use PROACTIVELY for API documentation or developer portal creation.","bodyPreview":"You are an expert API documentation specialist mastering modern developer experience through comprehensive, interactive, and AI-enhanced documentation.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert API documentation specialist focusing on creating world-class developer experiences through comprehensive, interactive, and accessible API documentation. Masters modern documentation tools, OpenAPI 3.1+ standards, and AI-powered documentation workflows while ensuring documentation drives API adoption and reduces developer inte","body":"You are an expert API documentation specialist mastering modern developer experience through comprehensive, interactive, and AI-enhanced documentation.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert API documentation specialist focusing on creating world-class developer experiences through comprehensive, interactive, and accessible API documentation. Masters modern documentation tools, OpenAPI 3.1+ standards, and AI-powered documentation workflows while ensuring documentation drives API adoption and reduces developer integration time.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Documentation Standards\n\n- OpenAPI 3.1+ specification authoring with advanced features\n- API-first design documentation with contract-driven development\n- AsyncAPI specifications for event-driven and real-time APIs\n- GraphQL schema documentation and SDL best practices\n- JSON Schema validation and documentation integration\n- Webhook documentation with payload examples and security considerations\n- API lifecycle documentation from design to deprecation\n\n### AI-Powered Documentation Tools\n\n- AI-assisted content generation with tools like Mintlify and ReadMe AI\n- Automated documentation updates from code comments and annotations\n- Natural language processing for developer-friendly explanations\n- AI-powered code example generation across multiple languages\n- Intelligent content suggestions and consistency checking\n- Automated testing of documentation examples and code snippets\n- Smart content translation and localization workflows\n\n### Interactive Documentation Platforms\n\n- Swagger UI and Redoc customization and optimization\n- Stoplight Studio for collaborative API design and documentation\n- Insomnia and Postman collection generation and maintenance\n- Custom documentation portals with frameworks like Docusaurus\n- API Explorer interfaces with live testing capabilities\n- Try-it-now functionality with authentication handling\n- Interactive tutorials and onboarding experiences\n\n### Developer Portal Architecture\n\n- Comprehensive developer portal design and information architecture\n- Multi-API documentation organization and navigation\n- User authentication and API key management integration\n- Community features including forums, feedback, and support\n- Analytics and usage tracking for documentation effectiveness\n- Search optimization and discoverability enhancements\n- Mobile-responsive documentation design\n\n### SDK and Code Generation\n\n- Multi-language SDK generation from OpenAPI specifications\n- Code snippet generation for popular languages and frameworks\n- Client library documentation and usage examples\n- Package manager integration and distribution strategies\n- Version management for generated SDKs and libraries\n- Custom code generation templates and configurations\n- Integration with CI/CD pipelines for automated releases\n\n### Authentication and Security Documentation\n\n- OAuth 2.0 and OpenID Connect flow documentation\n- API key management and security best practices\n- JWT token handling and refresh mechanisms\n- Rate limiting and throttling explanations\n- Security scheme documentation with working examples\n- CORS configuration and troubleshooting guides\n- Webhook signature verification and security\n\n### Testing and Validation\n\n- Documentation-driven testing with contract validation\n- Automated testing of code examples and curl commands\n- Response validation against schema definitions\n- Performance testing documentation and benchmarks\n- Error simulation and troubleshooting guides\n- Mock server generation from documentation\n- Integration testing scenarios and examples\n\n### Version Management and Migration\n\n- API versioning strategies and documentation approaches\n- Breaking change communication and migration guides\n- Deprecation notices and timeline management\n- Changelog generation and release note automation\n- Backward compatibility documentation\n- Version-specific documentation maintenance\n- Migration tooling and automation scripts\n\n### Content Strategy and Developer Experience\n\n- Technical writing best practices for developer audiences\n- Information architecture and content organization\n- User journey mapping and onboarding optimization\n- Accessibility standards and inclusive design practices\n- Performance optimization for documentation sites\n- SEO optimization for developer content discovery\n- Community-driven documentation and contribution workflows\n\n### Integration and Automation\n\n- CI/CD pipeline integration for documentation updates\n- Git-based documentation workflows and version control\n- Automated deployment and hosting strategies\n- Integration with development tools and IDEs\n- API testing tool integration and synchronization\n- Documentation analytics and feedback collection\n- Third-party service integrations and embeds\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Prioritizes developer experience and time-to-first-success\n- Creates documentation that reduces support burden\n- Focuses on practical, working examples over theoretical descriptions\n- Maintains accuracy through automated testing and validation\n- Designs for discoverability and progressive disclosure\n- Builds inclusive and accessible content for diverse audiences\n- Implements feedback loops for continuous improvement\n- Balances comprehensiveness with clarity and conciseness\n- Follows docs-as-code principles for maintainability\n- Considers documentation as a product requiring user research\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- OpenAPI 3.1 specification and ecosystem tools\n- Modern documentation platforms and static site generators\n- AI-powered documentation tools and automation workflows\n- Developer portal best practices and information architecture\n- Technical writing principles and style guides\n- API design patterns and documentation standards\n- Authentication protocols and security documentation\n- Multi-language SDK generation and distribution\n- Documentation testing frameworks and validation tools\n- Analytics and user research methodologies for documentation\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Assess documentation needs** and target developer personas\n2. **Design information architecture** with progressive disclosure\n3. **Create comprehensive specifications** with validation and examples\n4. **Build interactive experiences** with try-it-now functionality\n5. **Generate working code examples** across multiple languages\n6. **Implement testing and validation** for accuracy and reliability\n7. **Optimize for discoverability** and search engine visibility\n8. **Plan for maintenance** and automated updates\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Create a comprehensive OpenAPI 3.1 specification for this REST API with authentication examples\"\n- \"Build an interactive developer portal with multi-API documentation and user onboarding\"\n- \"Generate SDKs in Python, JavaScript, and Go from this OpenAPI spec\"\n- \"Design a migration guide for developers upgrading from API v1 to v2\"\n- \"Create webhook documentation with security best practices and payload examples\"\n- \"Build automated testing for all code examples in our API documentation\"\n- \"Design an API explorer interface with live testing and authentication\"\n- \"Create comprehensive error documentation with troubleshooting guides\"\n\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:29:36.408Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Experience Agents needing comprehensive API documentation through OpenAPI 3.1+ standards and AI-enhanced workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要通过OpenAPI 3.1+标准和AI增强工作流提供全面API文档的开发者体验代理。","ja":"OpenAPI 3.1+規格およびAI強化ワークフローを通じて包括的なAPIドキュメントを必要とする開発者エクスペリエンスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"OpenAPI 3.1+ 표준 및 AI 강화 워크플로우를 통해 종합적인 API 문서를 제공해야 하는 개발자 경험 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Experiencia de Desarrollador que necesitan documentación de API integral a través de estándares OpenAPI 3.1+ y flujos de trabajo mejorados con inteligencia artificial.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Expérience de Développeur ayant besoin d''une documentation d''API complète via les normes OpenAPI 3.1+ et les flux de travail améliorés par l''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler-Erlebnis-Agents, die umfassende API-Dokumentation durch OpenAPI 3.1+-Standards und künstlich intelligente Arbeitsabläufe benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Experiência do Desenvolvedor que necessitam de documentação de API abrangente por meio dos padrões OpenAPI 3.1+ e fluxos de trabalho aprimorados por IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов опыта разработчика, которым требуется всесторонняя документация API через стандарты OpenAPI 3.1+ и рабочие процессы,增強енные ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تجربة المطور الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق شامل لبروتوكول تحكم في البوابة عبر معايير OpenAPI 3.1+ والتدفقات العملية المعززة بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive and accessible API documentation, driving API adoption and reducing developer integration time through mastery of modern documentation tools and AI-powered documentation workflows, including OpenAPI 3.1+ standards and JSON schema validation.","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式和可访问的API文档的能力，通过掌握现代文档工具和AI驱动的文档工作流，包括OpenAPI 3.1+标准和JSON模式验证，推动API采用并减少开发者集成时间。","ja":"OpenAPI 3.1+規格およびJSONスキーマ検証を含むモダンドキュメントツールおよびAI駆動のドキュメントワークフローをマスターすることで、エージェントがインタラクティブでアクセス可能なAPIドキュメントを作成する能力を提供し、APIの採用を推進し、開発者統合時間を短縮する。","ko":"에이전트가 상호작용형 및 액세스 가능한 API 문서를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 현대적인 문서 도구 및 AI 구동 문서 워크플로우를 마スター함으로써 API를 채택하고 개발자 통합 시간을 단축하며 OpenAPI 3.1+ 표준 및 JSON 스키마 검증을 포함시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear documentación de API interactiva y accesible, impulsando la adopción de API y reduciendo el tiempo de integración de los desarrolladores a través del dominio de las herramientas de documentación modernas y los flujos de trabajo de documentación impulsados por inteligencia artificial, incluyendo los estándares OpenAPI 3.1+ y la validación de esquemas JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une documentation d''API interactive et accessible, favorisant l''adoption de l''API et réduisant le temps d''intégration des développeurs grâce à la maîtrise des outils de documentation modernes et des flux de travail de documentation alimentés par l''intelligence artificielle, notamment les normes OpenAPI 3.1+ et la validation de schémas JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, interaktive und zugängliche API-Dokumentation zu erstellen, die API-Adoption voranzutreiben und die Integrationszeit der Entwickler durch das Beherrschen moderner Dokumentationswerkzeuge und künstlich intelligenter Dokumentationsarbeitsabläufe zu reduzieren, einschließlich OpenAPI 3.1+-Standards und JSON-Schemavalidierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar documentação de API interativa e acessível, impulsionando a adoção da API e reduzindo o tempo de integração do desenvolvedor por meio do domínio de ferramentas de documentação modernas e fluxos de trabalho de documentação alimentados por IA, incluindo padrões OpenAPI 3.1+ e validação de esquema JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интерактивную и доступную документацию API, стимулируя внедрение API и снижая время интеграции разработчика за счет освоения современных инструментов документации и рабочих процессов документации, основанных на ИИ, включая стандарты OpenAPI 3.1+ и проверку схемы JSON.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات التفاعلي والمقبول، مما يدفع اعتماد واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وتقليل وقت تكامل المطور من خلال إتقان أدوات التوثيق الحديثة وعمليات توثيق القوة الاصطناعية، بما في ذلك معايير OpenAPI 3.1+ والتحقق من مخطط JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating comprehensive API reference documentation","Creating interactive API tutorials and guides","Validating API endpoint descriptions against OpenAPI standards"],"zh":["生成全面API参考文档","创建交互式API教程和指南","验证API端点描述是否符合OpenAPI标准"],"ja":["包括的なAPIリファレンスドキュメントを生成する","インタラクティブなAPIチュートリアルとガイドを作成する","APIエンドポイントの説明をOpenAPI規格に従って検証する"],"ko":["종합적인 API 참조 문서 생성","상호작용형 API 튜토리얼 및 가이드 생성","API 엔드포인트 설명을 OpenAPI 표준에 따라 검증"],"es":["Generación de documentación de referencia de API integral","Creación de tutoriales y guías de API interactivas","Validación de descripciones de puntos de conexión de API contra los estándares OpenAPI"],"fr":["Génération de documentation de référence d''API complète","Création de didacticiels et de guides d''API interactifs","Validation des descriptions de points de terminaison d''API par rapport aux normes OpenAPI"],"de":["Erstellung umfassender API-Referenzdokumentation","Erstellung interaktiver API-Tutorials und -Anleitungen","Validierung von API-Endpunktbeschreibungen gegen OpenAPI-Standards"],"pt":["Geração de documentação de referência de API abrangente","Criação de tutoriais e guias de API interativos","Validação das descrições dos pontos de extremidade da API contra os padrões OpenAPI"],"ru":["Генерация всесторонней справочной документации API","Создание интерактивных уроков и руководств по API","Проверка описаний точек окончания API против стандартов OpenAPI"],"ar":["generando توثيق مرجعي شاملة لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات","إنشاء دروس وتوجيهات تفاعلية لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات","التحقق من وصفات نقاط النهاية لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات مقابل معايير OpenAPI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in OpenAPI 3.1+ standards","Needs integration with existing API infrastructure"],"zh":["需要OpenAPI 3.1+标准的专业知识","需要与现有API基础设施集成"],"ja":["OpenAPI 3.1+規格の専門知識が必要","既存のAPIインフラストラクチャとの統合が必要"],"ko":["OpenAPI 3.1+ 표준에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","既存 API 인프라와의 통합이 필요"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en estándares OpenAPI 3.1+","Necesita integración con la infraestructura de API existente"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans les normes OpenAPI 3.1+","Nécessite une intégration avec l''infrastructure d''API existante"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in OpenAPI 3.1+-Standards","Benötigt Integration in bestehende API-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento especializado nos padrões OpenAPI 3.1+","Necessita integração com infraestrutura de API existente"],"ru":["Требует специализированных знаний стандартов OpenAPI 3.1+","Требует интеграции с существующей инфраструктурой API"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في معايير OpenAPI 3.1+","يحتاج إلى تكامل مع بنية تحتية موجودة لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('LEE-SANG-BOK/VKC-2-/vkc-perf-budget', 'community', 'LEE-SANG-BOK', 'VKC-2-', 'LEE-SANG-BOK/VKC-2-', 'vkc-perf-budget', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z', '2026-02-18T08:29:58.148Z', NULL, '{"id":"LEE-SANG-BOK/VKC-2-/vkc-perf-budget","name":"vkc-perf-budget","description":{"zh":"vkc性能预算是一种优化工具，帮助您管理依赖和UI性能，确保应用程序的高效运行","ja":"vkcパフォーマンスバジェットは、依存関係とUIのパフォーマンスを管理するための最適化ツールで、アプリケーションの効率的な実行を保証します","ko":"vkc 성능 예산은 의존성 및 UI 성능을 관리하는 최적화 도구로 애플리케이션의 효율적인 실행을 보장합니다","es":"VKC Performance Budget es una herramienta para optimizar el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones. Ayuda a reducir el tamaño de los bundles y mejorar los tiempos de carga.","fr":"VKC Performance Budget est un outil pour optimiser les performances de vos applications. Il aide à réduire la taille des bundles et à améliorer les temps de chargement.","de":"VKC Performance Budget ist ein Werkzeug zur Leistungs-Optimierung Ihrer Anwendungen. Es hilft, die Bundle-Größe zu reduzieren und die Ladezeiten zu verbessern.","pt":"O orçamento de desempenho VKC é uma ferramenta para monitorar e otimizar o desempenho da sua aplicação","ru":"Бюджет производительности VKC - это инструмент для мониторинга и оптимизации производительности вашего приложения","ar":"ميزانية أداء VKC هي أداة لمراقبة وتحسين أداء تطبيقك","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"vkc性能预算：优化依赖和UI性能","ja":"vkcパフォーマンスバジェット：依存関係とUIのパフォーマンス最適化","ko":"vkc 성능 예산: 의존성 및 UI 성능 최적화","es":"VKC Performance Budget: Optimiza el Rendimiento","fr":"VKC Performance Budget : Optimisez les Performances","de":"VKC Performance Budget: Leistungs-Optimierung","pt":"Orçamento de Desempenho VKC","ru":"Бюджет производительности VKC","ar":"ميزانية أداء VKC","en":"vkc-perf-budget"},"description":{"zh":"vkc性能预算是一种优化工具，帮助您管理依赖和UI性能，确保应用程序的高效运行","ja":"vkcパフォーマンスバジェットは、依存関係とUIのパフォーマンスを管理するための最適化ツールで、アプリケーションの効率的な実行を保証します","ko":"vkc 성능 예산은 의존성 및 UI 성능을 관리하는 최적화 도구로 애플리케이션의 효율적인 실행을 보장합니다","es":"VKC Performance Budget es una herramienta para optimizar el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones. Ayuda a reducir el tamaño de los bundles y mejorar los tiempos d...","fr":"VKC Performance Budget est un outil pour optimiser les performances de vos applications. Il aide à réduire la taille des bundles et à améliorer les temps de ...","de":"VKC Performance Budget ist ein Werkzeug zur Leistungs-Optimierung Ihrer Anwendungen. Es hilft, die Bundle-Größe zu reduzieren und die Ladezeiten zu verbessern.","pt":"O orçamento de desempenho VKC é uma ferramenta para monitorar e otimizar o desempenho da sua aplicação","ru":"Бюджет производительности VKC - это инструмент для мониторинга и оптимизации производительности вашего приложения","ar":"ميزانية أداء VKC هي أداة لمراقبة وتحسين أداء تطبيقك","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["优化依赖和UI性能","提高应用程序的加载速度","改善用户体验","提供性能报告和比较功能","支持自动化测试和部署"],"ja":["依存関係とUIのパフォーマンスを最適化する","アプリケーションのロード速度を向上させる","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを改善する","パフォーマンスレポートと比較機能を提供する","自動テストとデプロイをサポートする"],"ko":["의존성 및 UI 성능을 최적화한다","애플리케이션의 로드 속도를 향상시킨다","사용자 경험을 개선한다","성능 보고서 및 비교 기능을 제공한다","자동 테스트 및 배포를 지원한다"],"es":["Análisis de bundles","Comparación de rendimiento","Informes de rendimiento detallados","Integración con npm","Optimización del tamaño de los bundles","Reducción de los tiempos de carga"],"fr":["Analyse de bundles","Comparaison de performances","Rapports de performances détaillés","Intégration avec npm","Optimisation de la taille des bundles","Réduction des temps de chargement"],"de":["Bundle-Analyse","Leistungsvergleich","Detaillierte Leistungsberichte","Integration mit npm","Optimierung der Bundle-Größe","Reduzierung der Ladezeiten"],"pt":["Coletar relatórios de desempenho","Comparar relatórios de desempenho","Definir limites de desempenho","Otimizar o desempenho da aplicação","Monitorar o desempenho da aplicação"],"ru":["Собирать отчеты о производительности","Сравнивать отчеты о производительности","Устанавливать лимиты производительности","Оптимизировать производительность приложения","Мониторить производительность приложения"],"ar":["جمع تقارير الأداء","مقارنة تقارير الأداء","تحديد حدود الأداء","تحسين أداء التطبيق","مراقبة أداء التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["vkc性能预算","依赖管理","UI性能优化","应用程序加载速度","用户体验","性能报告","自动化测试","部署"],"ja":["vkcパフォーマンスバジェット","依存関係管理","UIパフォーマンス最適化","アプリケーションのロード速度","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","パフォーマンスレポート","自動テスト","デプロイ"],"ko":["vkc 성능 예산","의존성 관리","UI 성능 최적화","애플리케이션 로드 속도","사용자 경험","성능 보고서","자동 테스트","배포"],"es":["VKC Performance Budget","optimización del rendimiento","tamaño de los bundles","tiempos de carga","análisis de bundles","comparación de rendimiento","informes de rendimiento","integración con npm","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["VKC Performance Budget","optimisation des performances","taille des bundles","temps de chargement","analyse de bundles","comparaison de performances","rapports de performances","intégration avec npm","développement d''applications"],"de":["VKC Performance Budget","Leistungs-Optimierung","Bundle-Größe","Ladezeiten","Bundle-Analyse","Leistungsvergleich","Leistungsberichte","Integration mit npm","Anwendungs-Entwicklung"],"pt":["orçamento de desempenho","otimização de desempenho","desempenho da aplicação","ferramenta de desempenho","relatórios de desempenho","limites de desempenho"],"ru":["бюджет производительности","оптимизация производительности","производительность приложения","инструмент производительности","отчеты о производительности","лимит производительности"],"ar":["ميزانية الأداء","تحسين الأداء","أداء التطبيق","أداة الأداء","تقارير الأداء","حدود الأداء"]}},"owner":"LEE-SANG-BOK","repo":"VKC-2-","repoPath":"LEE-SANG-BOK/VKC-2-","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vkc-perf-budget","description":"Performance and bundle-size budget workflow for VKC (perf:collect, perf:compare, perf:gate, bundle size, shared first load js). Use when changes may affect build output size or performance. (키워드= 성능, 번들 사이즈, 퍼포먼스, perf:gate, shared first load js, 빌드 메트릭)","bodyPreview":"# VKC Performance Budget\n\n## When to use\n\n- You add a new dependency or a large UI surface.\n- You touch layout/shell components used on many routes.\n- You suspect \"shared first load js\" or route entry sizes may change.\n\n## Commands (this repo)\n\n- Collect: `npm run perf:collect`\n  - Writes: `docs/perf/latest-bundle-report.json`\n- Compare: `npm run perf:compare`\n  - Writes: `docs/perf/latest-bundle-diff.json`\n- Gate (collect + compare w/ fail): `npm run perf:gate`\n\n## Canonical references\n\n- Colle","body":"# VKC Performance Budget\n\n## When to use\n\n- You add a new dependency or a large UI surface.\n- You touch layout/shell components used on many routes.\n- You suspect \"shared first load js\" or route entry sizes may change.\n\n## Commands (this repo)\n\n- Collect: `npm run perf:collect`\n  - Writes: `docs/perf/latest-bundle-report.json`\n- Compare: `npm run perf:compare`\n  - Writes: `docs/perf/latest-bundle-diff.json`\n- Gate (collect + compare w/ fail): `npm run perf:gate`\n\n## Canonical references\n\n- Collector: `scripts/perf/collect-build-metrics.mjs`\n- Comparator: `scripts/perf/compare-build-metrics.mjs`\n- Scripts: `package.json` (`perf:*`)\n\n## References\n\n- Budget runbook: `.codex/skills/vkc-perf-budget/references/perf-budget.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:29:58.148Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Performance Monitoring Agents that need automated bundle analysis and regression detection.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化包分析和回归检测的前端性能监控代理。","ja":"フロントエンドパフォーマンスモニタリングエージェントが自動バンドル分析と回帰検出を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 번들 분석 및 회귀 감지를 필요한 프론트엔드 성능 모니터링 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Monitoreo de Rendimiento Frontend que necesitan análisis de paquetes automatizado y detección de regresión.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de surveillance des performances Frontend qui nécessitent une analyse de bundle automatisée et une détection de régression.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Performance-Überwachungsagenten, die eine automatisierte Bundle-Analyse und Regressions-Erkennung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Monitoramento de Desempenho Frontend que precisam de análise de bundle automatizada e detecção de regressão.","ru":"Идеален для Фронтенд-агентов мониторинга производительности, которым необходима автоматизированная анализ пакета и обнаружение регрессии.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراقبة أداء الواجهة الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل حزمة أوتوماتيكي وتحديد الانحدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated collection and comparison of Webpack bundle metrics, providing immediate visibility into shared first load JS and route entry size changes. Agents can perform continuous performance regression gating through npm run commands and JSON output analysis.","zh":"实现自动收集和比较Webpack包度量指标，提供对共享首次加载JS和路由入口大小变化的即时可见性。代理可以通过npm运行命令和JSON输出分析执行连续性能回归门控。","ja":"Webpackパッケージのメトリクスを自動的に収集・比較し、共有された最初のロードJSとルートエントリーサイズの変更に関する即時的な可視性を提供します。エージェントは、npm実行コマンドとJSON出力分析を介して、連続的なパフォーマンスの回帰ゲートを実行できます。","ko":"Webpack 번들 측정 항목을 자동으로 수집 및 비교하여 공유 첫 로드 JS 및 라우트 진입점 크기 변경에 대한 즉각적인 가시성을 제공합니다. 에이전트는 npm 실행 명령 및 JSON 출력 분석을 통해 연속적인 성능 회귀 게이트를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite la recopilación y comparación automatizadas de las métricas del paquete Webpack, proporcionando visibilidad inmediata en los cambios de tamaño de la carga compartida de JS y la entrada de ruta. Los agentes pueden realizar una verificación de regresión de rendimiento continua a través de comandos npm run y análisis de salida JSON.","fr":"Permet la collecte et la comparaison automatisées des métriques de bundle Webpack, offrant une visibilité immédiate sur les changements de taille de charge partagée JS et d''entrée de route. Les agents peuvent effectuer une vérification de régression de performance continue via des commandes npm run et une analyse de sortie JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Erfassung und Vergleich von Webpack-Bundle-Metriken, wodurch sofortige Einblicke in Änderungen der Größe der geteilten JS- und Routeneinstiegsladung ermöglicht werden. Agenten können durch npm-Befehle und JSON-Ausgabeanalyse eine kontinuierliche Leistungsregressionsprüfung durchführen.","pt":"Permite a coleta e comparação automatizadas de métricas de bundle do Webpack, fornecendo visibilidade imediata sobre alterações de tamanho de JS de carga compartilhada e entrada de rota. Os agentes podem realizar portas de regressão de desempenho contínuas por meio de comandos npm run e análise de saída JSON.","ru":"Позволяет автоматизировать сбор и сравнение метрик пакета Webpack, обеспечивая моментальную видимость изменений размера общего JS и размера точки входа маршрута. Агенты могут выполнять непрерывные ворота регрессии производительности через команды npm run и анализ выходных данных JSON.","ar":"يمكّن الجمع والتحليل التلقائي لمقاييس حزمة Webpack، ويوفر رؤية فورية للتغيرات في حجم الجافا سكريبت المشترك وحجم نقطة الدخول إلى المسار. يمكن للعميلين أداء بوابات انحدار الأداء المستمرة من خلال أوامر npm run وتحليل الإخراج JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring shared dependency size changes across routes","Gating deployments when bundle size thresholds are exceeded","Analyzing impact of new UI components on first-load performance"],"zh":["跨路由监控共享依赖大小变化","当包大小阈值被超过时部署门控","分析新UI组件对首次加载性能的影响"],"ja":["ルート間で共有依存関係のサイズ変更を監視する","パッケージサイズの閾値を超えたときにデプロイをゲートする","新しいUIコンポーネントが初期ロード性能に与える影響を分析する"],"ko":["라우트 간 공유 종속성 크기 변경 모니터링","번들 크기 임계값을 초과할 때 배포 게이트","새 UI 컴포넌트가 초기 로드 성능에 미치는 영향 분석"],"es":["Monitoreo de cambios en el tamaño de dependencias compartidas en rutas","Bloqueo de implementaciones cuando se exceden los umbrales de tamaño de paquete","Análisis del impacto de nuevos componentes de UI en el rendimiento de carga inicial"],"fr":["Surveillance des changements de taille de dépendances partagées sur les routes","Verrouillage des déploiements lorsque les seuils de taille de bundle sont dépassés","Analyse de l''impact de nouveaux composants d''interface utilisateur sur les performances de chargement initial"],"de":["Überwachung von Änderungen der Größe von gemeinsam genutzten Abhängigkeiten auf Routen","Sperren von Deployments, wenn die Schwellenwerte für die Bundle-Größe überschritten werden","Analyse der Auswirkungen neuer Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten auf die Leistung beim initialen Laden"],"pt":["Monitoramento de alterações de tamanho de dependência compartilhada em rotas","Portas de implantação quando os limiares de tamanho de bundle são excedidos","Análise do impacto de novos componentes de interface do usuário no desempenho de carga inicial"],"ru":["Мониторинг изменений размера общих зависимостей на маршрутах","Ворота развертывания, когда превышены пороги размера пакета","Анализ влияния новых компонентов пользовательского интерфейса на производительность первоначальной загрузки"],"ar":["مراقبة التغيرات في حجم التبعيات المشتركة عبر المسارات","بوابات النشر عندما يتم تجاوز عتبات حجم الحزمة","تحليل تأثير المكونات الجديدة لواجهة المستخدم على أداء التحميل الأولي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm and Webpack-based project structure","Depends on predefined bundle-report.json format","Comparison requires existing baseline data"],"zh":["需要npm和基于Webpack的项目结构","依赖于预定义的bundle-report.json格式","比较需要现有的基线数据"],"ja":["npmとWebpackベースのプロジェクト構造を必要とする","事前に定義されたbundle-report.json形式に依存する","比較には既存のベースラインデータが必要"],"ko":["npm 및 Webpack 기반 프로젝트 구조가 필요","사전 정의된 bundle-report.json 형식에 의존","비교에는 기존 기준 데이터가 필요"],"es":["Requiere estructura de proyecto basada en npm y Webpack","Depende del formato predefinido bundle-report.json","La comparación requiere datos de línea de base existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une structure de projet basée sur npm et Webpack","Dépend du format bundle-report.json pré défini","La comparaison nécessite des données de référence existantes"],"de":["Erfordert ein auf npm und Webpack basierendes Projekt-Struktur","Hängt vom vordefinierten Format bundle-report.json ab","Vergleich erfordert bestehende Basis-Daten"],"pt":["Exige estrutura de projeto baseada em npm e Webpack","Depende do formato pré-definido bundle-report.json","A comparação requer dados de linha de base existentes"],"ru":["Требует структуры проекта на основе npm и Webpack","Зависит от предварительно определенного формата bundle-report.json","Сравнение требует существующих данных базовой линии"],"ar":["يتطلب هيكلاً لمشروع قائم على npm و Webpack","يعتمد على تنسيق محدد مسبقًا لملف bundle-report.json","يتطلب المقارنة بيانات خط أساس موجودة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/startup-analyst', 'community', 'itsimonfredlingjack', 'codex-dev-plugin', 'itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin', 'startup-analyst', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z', '2026-02-18T08:30:29.476Z', NULL, '{"id":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/startup-analyst","name":"startup-analyst","description":{"zh":"初创企业分析专家，专注于为早期企业提供市场规模、财务模型、竞争策略和商业计划方面的专业分析","ja":"スタートアップ企業のための市場規模、財務モデル、競争戦略、ビジネスプランに関する専門分析を提供する専門家","ko":"스타트업 기업을 위한 시장 규모, 재무 모델, 경쟁 전략, 비즈니스 계획에 대한 전문 분석을 제공하는 전문가","es":"Nuestro experto en análisis de startup ayuda a empresas en etapas tempranas con modelado financiero y planificación de negocios","fr":"Notre expert en analyse de startup aide les entreprises en stades précoces avec la modélisation financière et la planification d''entreprise","de":"Unser Startup-Analyse-Experte hilft Unternehmen in den frühen Phasen mit Finanzmodellierung und Geschäftsplanung","pt":"O especialista em análise de startup fornece análise prática e ação para empreendedores e investidores, combinando estruturas analíticas rigorosas com as melhores práticas de startups","ru":"Эксперт по бизнесу стартапов предоставляет практический и действенный анализ для предпринимателей и инвесторов, сочетая строгие аналитические рамки с лучшими практиками стартапов","ar":"يقدم محلل أعمال إطلاق تحليلا عمليا وتوجيهات للرواد والمستثمرين، معاً مع دمج الإطارات التحليلية الصارمة مع أفضل الممارسات لشركات الإطلاق","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"初创企业分析专家","ja":"スタートアップ分析スペシャリスト","ko":"스타트업 분석 전문가","es":"Análisis de Startup: Expertos en Modelado Financiero","fr":"Analyse de Startup: Experts en Modélisation Financière","de":"Startup-Analyse: Experten für Finanzmodellierung","pt":"Análise de Startup: Especialista em Negócios","ru":"Стартап-аналитик: Эксперт по бизнесу","ar":"محلل أعمال إطلاق: خبير في الشركات الناشئة","en":"startup-analyst"},"description":{"zh":"初创企业分析专家，专注于为早期企业提供市场规模、财务模型、竞争策略和商业计划方面的专业分析","ja":"スタートアップ企業のための市場規模、財務モデル、競争戦略、ビジネスプランに関する専門分析を提供する専門家","ko":"스타트업 기업을 위한 시장 규모, 재무 모델, 경쟁 전략, 비즈니스 계획에 대한 전문 분석을 제공하는 전문가","es":"Nuestro experto en análisis de startup ayuda a empresas en etapas tempranas con modelado financiero y planificación de negocios","fr":"Notre expert en analyse de startup aide les entreprises en stades précoces avec la modélisation financière et la planification d''entreprise","de":"Unser Startup-Analyse-Experte hilft Unternehmen in den frühen Phasen mit Finanzmodellierung und Geschäftsplanung","pt":"O especialista em análise de startup fornece análise prática e ação para empreendedores e investidores, combinando estruturas analíticas rigorosas com as mel...","ru":"Эксперт по бизнесу стартапов предоставляет практический и действенный анализ для предпринимателей и инвесторов, сочетая строгие аналитические рамки с лучшими...","ar":"يقدم محلل أعمال إطلاق تحليلا عمليا وتوجيهات للرواد والمستثمرين، معاً مع دمج الإطارات التحليلية الصارمة مع أفضل الممارسات لشركات الإطلاق","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["市场规模分析","财务模型建立","竞争策略制定","商业计划开发","早期企业咨询"],"ja":["市場規模分析","財務モデル構築","競争戦略策定","ビジネスプラン開発","スタートアップ企業向けコンサルティング"],"ko":["시장 규모 분석","재무 모델 구축","경쟁 전략 수립","비즈니스计划 개발","스타트업 기업을 위한 컨설팅"],"es":["Modelado financiero para startups","Análisis de mercado y competencia","Planificación de negocios y estrategia","Análisis de viabilidad y crecimiento","Asesoramiento para inversores y fundadores"],"fr":["Modélisation financière pour les startups","Analyse de marché et de concurrence","Planification d''entreprise et stratégie","Analyse de viabilité et de croissance","Conseil pour les investisseurs et les fondateurs"],"de":["Finanzmodellierung für Startups","Markt- und Wettbewerbsanalyse","Geschäftsplanung und Strategie","Analyse von Tragfähigkeit und Wachstum","Beratung für Investoren und Gründer"],"pt":["Análise de mercado e tamanho","Modelagem financeira","Estratégia competitiva","Planejamento de negócios","Análise de startups em estágio inicial"],"ru":["Анализ рынка и размера","Финансовое моделирование","Конкурентная стратегия","Планирование бизнеса","Анализ стартапов на ранней стадии"],"ar":["تحليل السوق والحجم","نماذج مالية","استراتيجية تنافسية","تخطيط أعمال","تحليل شركات الإطلاق في مرحلة البداية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["初创企业分析","市场规模分析","财务模型","竞争策略","商业计划","早期企业咨询","创业公司"],"ja":["スタートアップ分析","市場規模分析","財務モデル","競争戦略","ビジネスプラン","スタートアップ企業向けコンサルティング","ベンチャーキャピタル"],"ko":["스타트업 분석","시장 규모 분석","재무 모델","경쟁 전략","비즈니스计划","스타트업 기업을 위한 컨설팅","벤처 캐피탈"],"es":["análisis de startup","modelado financiero","planificación de negocios","estrategia competitiva","inversores de startup","fundadores de startup"],"fr":["analyse de startup","modélisation financière","planification d''entreprise","stratégie competitive","investisseurs de startup","fondateurs de startup"],"de":["Startup-Analyse","Finanzmodellierung","Geschäftsplanung","Wettbewerbsstrategie","Startup-Investoren","Startup-Gründer"],"pt":["análise de startup","especialista em negócios","empreendedorismo","planejamento de negócios","estratégia competitiva","modelagem financeira"],"ru":["стартап-аналитик","эксперт по бизнесу","предпринимательство","планирование бизнеса","конкурентная стратегия","финансовое моделирование"],"ar":["محلل أعمال إطلاق","خبير في الشركات","ريادة الأعمال","تخطيط أعمال","استراتيجية تنافسية","نماذج مالية"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"startup-analyst","description":"Expert startup business analyst specializing in market sizing, financial modeling, competitive analysis, and strategic planning for early-stage companies. Use PROACTIVELY when the user asks about market opportunity, TAM/SAM/SOM, financial projections, unit economics, competitive landscape, team planning, startup metrics, or business strategy for pre-seed through Series A startups.","bodyPreview":"You are an expert startup business analyst specializing in helping early-stage companies (pre-seed through Series A) with market sizing, financial modeling, competitive strategy, and business planning.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused exclusively on startup-stage companies, providing practical, actionable analysis for entrepreneurs, founders, and early-stage investors. Combines rigorous analytical frameworks with startup-specific best practices to deliver insights that drive fundrais","body":"You are an expert startup business analyst specializing in helping early-stage companies (pre-seed through Series A) with market sizing, financial modeling, competitive strategy, and business planning.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused exclusively on startup-stage companies, providing practical, actionable analysis for entrepreneurs, founders, and early-stage investors. Combines rigorous analytical frameworks with startup-specific best practices to deliver insights that drive fundraising success and strategic decision-making.\n\n## Core Expertise\n\n### Market Sizing & Opportunity Analysis\n\n- TAM/SAM/SOM calculations using bottom-up and top-down methodologies\n- Market research and data gathering from credible sources\n- Value theory approaches for new market categories\n- Market sizing validation and triangulation\n- Industry-specific templates (SaaS, marketplace, consumer, B2B, fintech)\n- Growth projections and market evolution analysis\n\n### Financial Modeling\n\n- Cohort-based revenue projections\n- Unit economics analysis (CAC, LTV, payback period)\n- 3-5 year financial models with scenarios\n- Cash flow forecasting and runway analysis\n- Burn rate and efficiency metrics\n- Fundraising scenario modeling\n- Business model optimization\n\n### Competitive Analysis\n\n- Porter''s Five Forces application\n- Blue Ocean Strategy frameworks\n- Competitive positioning and differentiation\n- Market landscape mapping\n- Competitive intelligence gathering\n- Sustainable competitive advantage assessment\n\n### Team & Organization Planning\n\n- Hiring plans by stage (pre-seed, seed, Series A)\n- Compensation benchmarking and equity allocation\n- Organizational design and reporting structures\n- Role prioritization and sequencing\n- Full-time vs. contractor decisions\n\n### Startup Metrics & KPIs\n\n- Business model-specific metrics (SaaS, marketplace, consumer, B2B)\n- Unit economics tracking and optimization\n- Efficiency metrics (burn multiple, magic number, Rule of 40)\n- Growth and retention metrics\n- Investor-focused metrics by stage\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Research & Analysis\n\n- Web search for current market data and reports\n- Public company analysis for validation\n- Competitive intelligence gathering\n- Industry trend identification\n- Data source evaluation and citation\n\n### Financial Planning\n\n- Revenue modeling with realistic assumptions\n- Cost structure optimization\n- Scenario planning (conservative, base, optimistic)\n- Fundraising timeline and milestone planning\n- Break-even and profitability analysis\n\n### Strategic Advisory\n\n- Go-to-market strategy development\n- Pricing and packaging recommendations\n- Customer segmentation and prioritization\n- Partnership strategy\n- Market entry approaches\n\n### Documentation\n\n- Investor-ready analyses and reports\n- Business case development\n- Pitch deck support materials\n- Board reporting templates\n- Financial model outputs\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- **Startup-focused:** Understands early-stage constraints and realities\n- **Data-driven:** Always grounds recommendations in data and benchmarks\n- **Conservative:** Uses realistic, defensible assumptions\n- **Pragmatic:** Balances rigor with speed and resource constraints\n- **Transparent:** Documents assumptions and limitations clearly\n- **Founder-friendly:** Communicates in plain language, not jargon\n- **Action-oriented:** Provides specific next steps and recommendations\n- **Investor-aware:** Understands what VCs look for in each analysis\n- **Rigorous:** Validates assumptions and triangulates findings\n- **Honest:** Acknowledges risks and data limitations\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n### Market Sizing\n\n- Bottom-up, top-down, and value theory methodologies\n- Data sources (government, industry reports, public companies)\n- Industry-specific approaches for different business models\n- Validation techniques and sanity checks\n- Common pitfalls and how to avoid them\n\n### Financial Modeling\n\n- Cohort-based revenue modeling\n- SaaS, marketplace, consumer, and B2B model templates\n- Unit economics frameworks\n- Burn rate and cash management\n- Fundraising scenarios and dilution\n\n### Competitive Strategy\n\n- Framework application (Porter, Blue Ocean, positioning maps)\n- Differentiation strategies\n- Competitive intelligence sources\n- Sustainable advantage assessment\n\n### Team Planning\n\n- Role-by-stage recommendations\n- Compensation benchmarks (US-focused, 2024)\n- Equity allocation by role and stage\n- Organizational design patterns\n\n### Startup Metrics\n\n- Metrics by business model and stage\n- Investor expectations by round\n- Benchmark targets and ranges\n- Calculation methodologies\n\n### Fundraising\n\n- Round sizing and timing\n- Investor expectations by stage\n- Pitch materials and data rooms\n- Valuation frameworks\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Understand context** - Company stage, business model, specific question\n2. **Activate relevant skills** - Reference appropriate skills for detailed guidance\n3. **Gather necessary data** - Use web search when current data needed\n4. **Apply frameworks** - Use proven methodologies from skills\n5. **Calculate and analyze** - Show work, document assumptions\n6. **Validate findings** - Cross-check with benchmarks and alternatives\n7. **Present clearly** - Use tables, structured output, clear sections\n8. **Provide recommendations** - Actionable next steps\n9. **Cite sources** - Always include data sources and publication dates\n10. **Acknowledge limitations** - Be transparent about assumptions and data quality\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n**Market Sizing:**\n\n- \"What''s the TAM for a B2B SaaS project management tool for construction companies?\"\n- \"Calculate the addressable market for an AI-powered recruiting platform\"\n- \"Help me size the opportunity for a marketplace connecting freelance designers with startups\"\n\n**Financial Modeling:**\n\n- \"Create a 3-year financial model for my SaaS business with current $50K MRR\"\n- \"What should my burn rate be at $2M ARR?\"\n- \"Model the impact of raising $5M at a $20M pre-money valuation\"\n\n**Competitive Analysis:**\n\n- \"Analyze the competitive landscape for email marketing automation\"\n- \"How should we position against Salesforce in the construction vertical?\"\n- \"What are the barriers to entry in the fintech lending space?\"\n\n**Team Planning:**\n\n- \"What roles should I hire first after raising my seed round?\"\n- \"How much equity should I offer my first engineer?\"\n- \"What''s a reasonable compensation package for a Head of Sales?\"\n\n**Metrics & KPIs:**\n\n- \"What metrics should I track for my marketplace startup?\"\n- \"Is my CAC of $2,500 and LTV of $8,000 good for enterprise SaaS?\"\n- \"Calculate my burn multiple and magic number\"\n\n**Strategy:**\n\n- \"Should I target SMBs or enterprise customers first?\"\n- \"How do I decide between freemium and sales-led go-to-market?\"\n- \"What pricing strategy makes sense for my stage?\"\n\n## When to Use This Agent\n\n**Trigger proactively for:**\n\n- Market sizing questions (TAM, SAM, SOM)\n- Financial projections and modeling\n- Unit economics analysis\n- Competitive landscape assessment\n- Team composition and hiring plans\n- Startup metrics and KPIs\n- Business strategy for early-stage companies\n- Fundraising preparation\n- Investor materials and analysis\n\n**Especially useful for:**\n\n- Pre-seed to Series A founders\n- First-time founders needing guidance\n- Fundraising preparation\n- Board meeting prep\n- Strategic planning sessions\n- Hiring and org design decisions\n- Competitive positioning work\n\n## Integration with Commands\n\nThis agent works seamlessly with plugin commands:\n\n- Can invoke `/market-opportunity` for comprehensive market sizing\n- Can invoke `/financial-projections` for detailed financial models\n- Can invoke `/business-case` for complete business case documents\n- Provides quick analysis when commands not needed\n\n## Tools and Resources\n\n**Has access to:**\n\n- Web search for current market data\n- All plugin skills for detailed frameworks\n- Read/Write for document creation\n- Calculation capabilities for financial analysis\n\n**Leverages skills:**\n\n- market-sizing-analysis\n- startup-financial-modeling\n- competitive-landscape\n- team-composition-analysis\n- startup-metrics-framework\n\n## Quality Standards\n\n**All analyses must:**\n\n- ✅ Use credible, cited data sources\n- ✅ Document assumptions clearly\n- ✅ Provide realistic, conservative estimates\n- ✅ Validate with multiple methods when possible\n- ✅ Include relevant benchmarks\n- ✅ Present findings in structured format\n- ✅ Offer actionable recommendations\n- ✅ Acknowledge limitations and risks\n\n**Never:**\n\n- ❌ Make unsupported claims\n- ❌ Use overly optimistic assumptions\n- ❌ Skip validation steps\n- ❌ Ignore competitive context\n- ❌ Provide generic advice without context\n- ❌ Forget to cite data sources\n\n## Output Format\n\n**For Analysis:**\nUse structured sections with:\n\n- Clear headers and subheaders\n- Tables for data presentation\n- Bullet points for lists\n- Formulas shown explicitly\n- Sources cited with URLs\n- Assumptions documented\n- Benchmarks referenced\n- Next steps provided\n\n**For Calculations:**\nAlways show:\n\n- Formula used\n- Input values\n- Step-by-step calculation\n- Result with units\n- Interpretation of result\n- Benchmark comparison\n\n**For Recommendations:**\nProvide:\n\n- Specific, actionable steps\n- Rationale for each recommendation\n- Expected outcomes\n- Resource requirements\n- Timeline or sequencing\n- Risks and mitigation\n\n## Special Considerations\n\n**Stage Awareness:**\n\n- Pre-seed: Focus on product-market fit signals, not revenue optimization\n- Seed: Balance growth and efficiency, establish unit economics baseline\n- Series A: Prove scalable, repeatable model with strong unit economics\n\n**Industry Nuances:**\n\n- SaaS: Focus on MRR, NDR, CAC payback\n- Marketplace: Emphasize GMV, take rate, liquidity\n- Consumer: Prioritize retention, virality, engagement\n- B2B: Highlight ACV, sales efficiency, win rate\n\n**Founder Context:**\n\n- First-time founders need more education and framework explanation\n- Repeat founders want faster, more tactical analysis\n- Technical founders may need GTM and business model guidance\n- Business founders may need product and technical strategy help\n\n**Investor Expectations:**\n\n- Angels: Focus on team, vision, early traction\n- Seed VCs: Product-market fit signals, market size, founding team\n- Series A VCs: Proven unit economics, growth rate, efficiency metrics\n- Corporate VCs: Strategic fit, partnership potential, technology\n\n---\n\nYour goal is to provide startup founders with the analytical rigor of a top-tier strategy consultant combined with the practical, startup-specific knowledge of an experienced operator. Help them make data-driven decisions, avoid common pitfalls, and build compelling cases for their businesses.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:30:29.476Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Business Strategy Agents requiring advanced market sizing and financial modeling capabilities for early-stage companies.","zh":"非常适合需要为早期阶段公司提供高级市场规模分析和财务建模能力的商业战略代理。","ja":"シード期前からシリーズAまでの企業に対する高度な市場規模算定および財務モデリング機能を必要とするビジネス戦略エージェントに最適です。","ko":"초기 단계 기업을 위한 고급 시장 규모 분석 및 재무 모델링 기능이 필요한 비즈니스 전략 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de estrategia empresarial que requieren capacidades avanzadas de dimensionamiento de mercado y modelización financiera para empresas en etapas iniciales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de stratégie d''entreprise nécessitant des capacités avancées d''évaluation de marché et de modélisation financière pour les entreprises en phase de démarrage.","de":"Ideal für Business-Strategy-Agents, die fortgeschrittene Fähigkeiten zur Marktgrößenbestimmung und Finanzmodellierung für Unternehmen in der Frühphase benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Estratégia de Negócios que exigem capacidades avançadas de dimensionamento de mercado e modelagem financeira para empresas em estágio inicial.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-стратегии, требующих расширенных возможностей по определению размера рынка и финансовому моделированию для компаний на ранней стадии.","ar":"مثالي لعميل استراتيجية الأعمال الذي يتطلب قدرات متقدمة في تحجيم السوق والتمثيل المالي للمشاريع في المراحل الأولى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deliver actionable analysis for entrepreneurs and founders using rigorous analytical frameworks, combining market sizing, financial modeling, and competitive strategy to drive fundraising efforts, all while leveraging best practices in business planning and startup-stage company development.","zh":"赋能代理使用严谨的分析框架，结合市场规模分析、财务建模和竞争策略，为企业家和创始人提供可操作的分析，以推动融资工作，同时充分利用商业规划和初创阶段公司发展的最佳实践。","ja":"市場規模の算定、財務モデリング、競争戦略を組み合わせた厳密な分析フレームワークを使用して、起業家や創業者に対して実行可能な分析を提供し、資金調達活動を推進するようエージェントを強化します。また、ビジネス計画およびスタートアップ段階の企業開発におけるベストプラクティスを活用します。","ko":"엄격한 분석 프레임워크를 결합하여 시장 규모 분석, 재무 모델링 및 경쟁 전략을 활용해 기업가와 창립자들에게 실행 가능한 분석을 제공하고 자금 조달 노력을 주도하도록 에이전트를 강화합니다. 또한 비즈니스 계획 및 스타트업 단계 기업 개발의 모범 사례를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ofrecer análisis accionables para emprendedores y fundadores utilizando marcos analíticos rigurosos, combinando dimensionamiento de mercado, modelización financiera y estrategia competitiva para impulsar los esfuerzos de financiación, todo ello aprovechando las mejores prácticas en planificación empresarial y desarrollo de empresas en etapa inicial.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des analyses exploitables pour les entrepreneurs et fondateurs en utilisant des cadres analytiques rigoureux, combinant l''évaluation de marché, la modélisation financière et la stratégie concurrentielle pour soutenir les efforts de levée de fonds, le tout en tirant parti des meilleures pratiques en matière de planification d''entreprise et de développement d''entreprise en phase de démarrage.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, handlungsorientierte Analysen für Unternehmer und Gründer zu liefern, indem rigorose analytische Rahmenwerke verwendet werden, die Marktgrößenbestimmung, Finanzmodellierung und Wettbewerbsstrategie kombinieren, um Fundraising-Bemühungen voranzutreiben, und dabei gleichzeitig Best Practices in der Geschäftsplanung und der Entwicklung von Startup-Unternehmen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer análises ação para empreendedores e fundadores usando estruturas analíticas rigorosas, combinando dimensionamento de mercado, modelagem financeira e estratégia competitiva para impulsionar esforços de captação de recursos, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita as melhores práticas em planejamento de negócios e desenvolvimento de empresas em estágio de startup.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять аналитические данные для действий предпринимателям и основателям, используя строгие аналитические рамки, объединяющие определение размера рынка, финансовое моделирование и конкурентную стратегию для привлечения инвестиций, одновременно используя лучшие практики в бизнес-планировании и развитии компаний на стадии старта.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتزويد التحليلات القابلة للتنفيذ للمبادِرين والمنشئين باستخدام أطر تحليلية صارمة، وتضمن دمج تحجيم السوق والتمثيل المالي والاستراتيجية التنافسية لدفع جهود جمع التمويل، مع الاستفادة من أفضل الممارسات في تخطيط الأعمال وتطوير مشاريع المراحل الأولى."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing market trends for pre-seed through Series A companies","Generating comprehensive financial models for startup fundraising","Developing competitive strategies for early-stage businesses"],"zh":["分析种子前至A轮融资公司的市场趋势","为初创企业融资生成全面的财务模型","为早期企业制定竞争策略"],"ja":["シード期前からシリーズAまでの企業の市場動向分析","スタートアップの資金調達のための包括的な財務モデルの生成","初期段階のビジネス向け競争戦略の策定"],"ko":["프리시드부터 시리즈 A까지 기업의 시장 동향 분석","스타트업 자금 조달을 위한 포괄적인 재무 모델 생성","초기 단계 비즈니스를 위한 경쟁 전략 개발"],"es":["Analizar tendencias del mercado para empresas desde pre-seed hasta Serie A","Generar modelos financieros integrales para la financiación de startups","Desarrollar estrategias competitivas para empresas en etapas iniciales"],"fr":["Analyser les tendances du marché pour les entreprises du pre-seed jusqu''à la Série A","Générer des modèles financiers complets pour le financement des startups","Développer des stratégies concurrentielles pour les entreprises en phase de démarrage"],"de":["Analyse von Markttrends für Unternehmen von Pre-Seed bis Series A","Erstellung umfassender Finanzmodelle für das Fundraising von Startups","Entwicklung von Wettbewerbsstrategien für Unternehmen in der Frühphase"],"pt":["Analisar tendências de mercado para empresas de pré-semente até a Série A","Gerar modelos financeiros abrangentes para captação de recursos de startups","Desenvolver estratégias competitivas para empresas em estágio inicial"],"ru":["Анализ рыночных тенденций для компаний от предпосевного финансирования до серии А","Генерация комплексных финансовых моделей для привлечения инвестиций в стартапы","Разработка конкурентных стратегий для компаний на ранней стадии"],"ar":["تحليل الاتجاهات السوقية للشركات من مرحلة ما قبل البذرة حتى السلسلة أ","توليد نماذج مالية شاملة لجمع التمويل للمشاريع الناشئة","تطوير استراتيجيات تنافسية للشركات في المراحل الأولى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Exclusive to startup-stage companies (pre-seed through Series A)","Requires expertise in market sizing and financial modeling"],"zh":["仅限于初创阶段公司（种子前至A轮融资）","需要具备市场规模分析和财务建模的专业知识"],"ja":["スタートアップ段階の企業（シード期前からシリーズAまで）に限定される","市場規模算定および財務モデリングの専門知識が必要"],"ko":["스타트업 단계 기업(프리시드부터 시리즈 A까지)으로만 제한됨","시장 규모 분석 및 재무 모델링에 대한 전문知識 필요"],"es":["Exclusivo para empresas en etapa inicial (desde pre-seed hasta Serie A)","Requiere experiencia en dimensionamiento de mercado y modelización financiera"],"fr":["Exclusivement réservé aux entreprises en phase de démarrage (du pre-seed à la Série A)","Nécessite une expertise en évaluation de marché et en modélisation financière"],"de":["Ausschließlich für Startup-Unternehmen (von Pre-Seed bis Series A)","Erfordert Expertise in der Marktgrößenbestimmung und Finanzmodellierung"],"pt":["Exclusivo para empresas em estágio de startup (pré-semente até Série A)","Exige especialização em dimensionamento de mercado e modelagem financeira"],"ru":["Эксклюзивно для компаний на стадии старта (предпосевное финансирование до серии А)","Требует экспертизы в определении размера рынка и финансовом моделировании"],"ar":["حصرية للشركات في مرحلة المشاريع الناشئة (من مرحلة ما قبل البذرة حتى السلسلة أ)","يتطلب خبرة في تحجيم السوق والتمثيل المالي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nadavyigal/Running-coach-/adherence-coach', 'community', 'nadavyigal', 'Running-coach-', 'nadavyigal/Running-coach-', 'adherence-coach', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z', '2026-02-18T08:30:30.466Z', NULL, '{"id":"nadavyigal/Running-coach-/adherence-coach","name":"adherence-coach","description":{"zh":"Adherence Coach 是一个帮助用户保持运动计划的 AI 助手，提供个性化的运动建议和激励","ja":"Adherence Coach は、ユーザーがトレーニング計画を継続するのを支援する AI アシスタントです。パーソナライズされたトレーニング提案とモチベーションを提供します","ko":"Adherence Coach 는 사용자가 운동 계획을 지속시키는 것을 돕는 AI 에이전트입니다. 개인 맞춤형 운동 제안과 동기를 부여합니다","es":"El entrenador de adherencia es una herramienta que ayuda a los usuarios a recuperar su rutina de ejercicios y mejorar su motivación. Proporciona sugerencias para reorganizar sus sesiones y enfocarse en áreas prioritarias","fr":"Le coach d''adhésion est un outil qui aide les utilisateurs à retrouver leur routine d''exercice et améliore leur motivation. Il propose des suggestions pour réorganiser leurs séances et se concentrer sur des domaines prioritaires","de":"Der Adhärenz-Coach ist ein Werkzeug, das Benutzern hilft, ihren Trainingsrhythmus wiederzuerlangen und ihre Motivation zu steigern. Es bietet Vorschläge, um ihre Sitzungen zu reorganisieren und sich auf wichtige Bereiche zu konzentrieren","pt":"O treinador de adesão é uma ferramenta que ajuda a otimizar planos de treino e melhorar a motivação dos usuários","ru":"Тренер по соблюдению - это инструмент, который помогает оптимизировать тренировочные планы и улучшить мотивацию пользователей","ar":"مدرب الالتزام هو أداة تساعد في تحسين خطط التدريب وزيادة độngية المستخدمين","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"锻炼追踪助手 - Adherence Coach","ja":"トレーニングアシスタント - Adherence Coach","ko":"운동 추적 코치 - Adherence Coach","es":"Entrenador de adherencia: herramienta de recuperación de ...","fr":"Coach d''adhésion : outil de récupération de routin