n sur des domaines prioritaires","Messages de motivation personnalisés","Intégration avec les préférences de l''utilisateur","Analyse de progrès et suivi"],"de":["Analyse von Trainingsroutinen","Vorschläge zur Reorganisation von Sitzungen","Fokus auf wichtige Bereiche","Personalisierte Motivationsnachrichten","Integration mit Benutzervorlieben","Analyse des Fortschritts und Verfolgung"],"pt":["Otimização de planos de treino","Sugestões de reorganização de treinos","Áreas de foco prioritárias","Mensagens de motivação personalizadas","Análise de preferências do usuário","Detecção de lapsos e reentrada em hábitos"],"ru":["Оптимизация тренировочных планов","Предложения по перестановке тренировок","Приоритетные области внимания","Персонализированные мотивационные сообщения","Анализ предпочтений пользователей","Обнаружение пропусков и восстановление привычек"],"ar":["تحسين خطط التدريب","اقتراحات لإعادة تنظيم التدريبات","مناطق التركيز الأولوية","رسائل تحفيزية مخصصة","تحليل تفضيلات المستخدم","كشف الفجوات و إعادة الدخول إلى العادات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Adherence Coach","运动追踪","智能化运动建议","个性化运动计划","运动激励","AI 驱动的运动工具"],"ja":["Adherence Coach","トレーニング追跡","賢いトレーニング提案","パーソナライズされたトレーニング計画","トレーニングモチベーション","人工知能によって駆動されるトレーニングツール"],"ko":["Adherence Coach","운동 추적","지능형 운동 제안","개인 맞춤형 운동 계획","운동 동기 부여","인공 지능으로 구동되는 운동 도구"],"es":["entrenador de adherencia","rutinas de ejercicios","motivación","recuperación de rutinas","análisis de progreso","personalización de mensajes","integración con preferencias de usuario","desarrollo de aplicaciones de fitness","herramientas de motivación"],"fr":["coach d''adhésion","routines d''exercice","motivation","récupération de routines","analyse de progrès","personnalisation de messages","intégration avec les préférences de l''utilisateur","développement d''applications de fitness","outils de motivation"],"de":["Adhärenz-Coach","Trainingsroutinen","Motivation","Wiederherstellung von Routinen","Analyse des Fortschritts","Personalisierung von Nachrichten","Integration mit Benutzervorlieben","Entwicklung von Fitness-Anwendungen","Motivationswerkzeuge"],"pt":["treinador de adesão","otimização de planos de treino","motivação de usuários","inteligência artificial","treinamento personalizado","análise de preferências","detecção de lapsos","reentrada em hábitos"],"ru":["тренер по соблюдению","оптимизация тренировочных планов","мотивация пользователей","искусственный интеллект","персонализированное обучение","анализ предпочтений","обнаружение пропусков","восстановление привычек"],"ar":["مدرب الالتزام","تحسين خطط التدريب","تحفيز المستخدمين","ذكاء اصطناعي","تدريب مخصص","تحليل تفضيلات","كشف الفجوات","إعادة الدخول إلى العادات"]}},"owner":"nadavyigal","repo":"Running-coach-","repoPath":"nadavyigal/Running-coach-","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"adherence-coach","description":"Identifies missed sessions or inconsistency and proposes plan reshuffles with motivational nudges.","bodyPreview":"## When Codex should use it\n- Weekly digest (e.g., Sunday) or when multiple sessions are skipped.\n- When the user asks for help getting back on track.\n\n## Invocation guidance\n1. Provide `Plan`, completed vs. missed workouts, and user preferences (available days, constraints).\n2. Output reshuffle suggestions, prioritized focus areas, and motivational `CoachMessage`.\n3. Keep volume conservative after lapses; bias toward habit re-entry.\n\n## Input schema\nSee `references/input-schema.json`.\n\n## Outpu","body":"## When Codex should use it\n- Weekly digest (e.g., Sunday) or when multiple sessions are skipped.\n- When the user asks for help getting back on track.\n\n## Invocation guidance\n1. Provide `Plan`, completed vs. missed workouts, and user preferences (available days, constraints).\n2. Output reshuffle suggestions, prioritized focus areas, and motivational `CoachMessage`.\n3. Keep volume conservative after lapses; bias toward habit re-entry.\n\n## Input schema\nSee `references/input-schema.json`.\n\n## Output schema\nSee `references/output-schema.json`.\n\n## Integration points\n- UI: Weekly digest card; chat prompt suggestions.\n- API: `v0/app/api/plan/adherence`.\n- Notifications: Email/push via `v0/lib/email.ts`.\n\n## Safety & guardrails\n- If repeated missed sessions due to pain → suggest rest and professional consult, not catch-up volume.\n- Limit catch-up to 1 session per week; avoid stacking intensity.\n- Emit `SafetyFlag` for risky catch-up proposals.\n\n## Telemetry\n- Emit `ai_skill_invoked`, `ai_adjustment_applied` (if reshuffle applied), and `ai_user_feedback` on user rating.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:30:30.466Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Health and Wellness Agents requiring personalized fitness coaching and adherence guidance.","zh":"适用于需要个性化健身指导和依从性指导的健康和健身代理。","ja":"個別のフィットネスコーチングと順守ガイダンスを必要とするヘルス＆ウェルネス エージェントに最適です。","ko":"개인화된 피트니스 코칭과 순응 지침이 필요한 건강 및 웰네스 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Salud y Bienestar que requieren entrenamiento de acondicionamiento físico personalizado y orientación de adherencia.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de santé et de bien-être nécessitant une coachification personnalisée et des conseils d''adhésion.","de":"Ideal für Gesundheits- und Wellness-Agenten, die personalisierte Fitness-Coaching und Adhärenz-Anleitungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Saúde e Bem-estar que exigem treinamento de condicionamento físico personalizado e orientação de adesão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Здоровья и Фитнеса, требующих персонализированного тренерского руководства по фитнесу и рекомендаций по соблюдению режима.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الصحيين واللياقة البدنية الذين يحتاجون إلى تدريب لياقة بدنية شخصي وتوجيه الالتزام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide users with reshuffle suggestions, prioritized focus areas, and motivational messages, utilizing input schema and invocation guidance to drive habit re-entry and consistent workout routines, all while considering user preferences and constraints.","zh":"使代理能够为用户提供重新排列建议、优先考虑的焦点领域和激励信息，利用输入模式和调用指南来驱动习惯重新进入和一致的锻炼常规，同时考虑用户偏好和约束。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーにシャッフル提案、優先する焦点領域、およびモチベーションメッセージを提供できるようにし、入力スキーマおよび呼び出しガイダンスを使用して、ユーザーの好みや制約を考慮しながら、習慣の再参入や一貫した運動ルーチンを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자에게 다시 섞기 제안, 우선순위가 지정된焦点 영역 및 동기 부여 메시지를 제공할 수 있도록 하여 입력 스키마 및 호출 가이드를 사용하여 사용자의 선호도 및 제약 조건을 고려하여 습관 재진입 및 일관된 운동 루틴을 구동합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar a los usuarios sugerencias de reorganización, áreas de enfoque prioritarias y mensajes motivacionales, utilizando esquemas de entrada y orientación de invocación para impulsar la reentrada de hábitos y rutinas de ejercicio consistentes, considerando las preferencias y restricciones del usuario.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir aux utilisateurs des suggestions de réorganisation, des domaines d''intérêt prioritaires et des messages motivationnels, en utilisant des schémas d''entrée et des conseils d''invocation pour stimuler la réentrée des habitudes et des routines d''exercice cohérentes, en tenant compte des préférences et des contraintes de l''utilisateur.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den Benutzern Umstellungs-vorschläge, priorisierte Fokusgebiete und motivierende Nachrichten zu bieten, unter Verwendung von Eingabeschemata und Aufrufanleitungen, um die Wiedereingabe von Gewohnheiten und konsistenten Trainingsroutinen zu fördern, unter Berücksichtigung der Benutzervorlieben und -einschränkungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer aos usuários sugestões de reorganização, áreas de foco prioritárias e mensagens motivacionais, utilizando esquema de entrada e orientação de invocação para impulsionar a reentrada de hábitos e rotinas de treinamento consistentes, considerando as preferências e restrições do usuário.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять пользователям предложения по переупорядочению, приоритизированные области внимания и мотивационные сообщения, используя схему ввода и рекомендации по вызову для стимулирования повторного входа в привычки и постоянные тренировочные режимы, учитывая предпочтения и ограничения пользователя.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تقديم مقترحات إعادة ترتيب للمستخدمين، ومناطق تركيز ذات أولوية، ورسائل تحفيزية، باستخدام مخطط الإدخال وتوجيه الاستدعاء لتحفيز إعادة دخول العادات وروتين التمرين الثابت، مع مراعاة تفضيلات المستخدم والقيود."},"useCases":{"en":["Reshuffling workout plans after skipped sessions","Providing personalized motivational coaching","Analyzing user adherence and suggesting improvements"],"zh":["跳过会话后重新排列锻炼计划","提供个性化的激励指导","分析用户依从性并提出改进建议"],"ja":["スキップセッション後のトレーニングプランの再構成","個別化されたモチベーションコーチングの提供","ユーザーの順応性の分析および改善提案"],"ko":["건너뛴 세션 후 운동 계획을 다시 섞기","개인화된 동기 부여 코칭 제공","사용자 순응도 분석 및 개선 제안"],"es":["Reorganización de planes de entrenamiento después de sesiones saltadas","Proporcionar entrenamiento de motivación personalizado","Análisis de la adherencia del usuario y sugerencia de mejoras"],"fr":["Réorganisation des plans d''entraînement après des séances manquées","Fournir un coaching de motivation personnalisé","Analyse de l''adhésion de l''utilisateur et suggestion d''améliorations"],"de":["Umstellung von Trainingsplänen nach ausgelassenen Sitzungen","Bereitstellung personalisierter Motivations-Coaching","Analyse der Benutzer-Adhärenz und Vorschlag von Verbesserungen"],"pt":["Reorganização de planos de treinamento após sessões perdidas","Fornecimento de treinamento motivacional personalizado","Análise da adesão do usuário e sugestão de melhorias"],"ru":["Пересборка планов тренировок после пропущенных сессий","Предоставление персонализированного мотивационного тренерского руководства","Анализ соблюдения режима пользователя и предложение улучшений"],"ar":["إعادة تنظيم خطط التمرين بعد الجلسات المفقودة","تقديم تدريب تحفيزي شخصي","تحليل امتثال المستخدم وتقديم مقترحات تحسين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user preferences and workout data","Limited to weekly digest or post-lapse scenarios"],"zh":["需要用户偏好和锻炼数据","仅限每周摘要或延迟场景"],"ja":["ユーザーの好みや運動データが必要","週次ダイジェストまたは遅延シナリオのみに限定"],"ko":["사용자 선호도 및 운동 데이터가 필요","주간 요약 또는 지연 시나리오에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere preferencias y datos de entrenamiento del usuario","Limitado a escenarios de resumen semanal o post-lapse"],"fr":["Nécessite les préférences et les données d''entraînement de l''utilisateur","Limité aux scénarios de résumé hebdomadaire ou post-lapse"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzervorlieben und Trainingsdaten","Begrenzt auf Szenarien der wöchentlichen Zusammenfassung oder post-Lapse"],"pt":["Exige preferências do usuário e dados de treinamento","Limitado a cenários de resumo semanal ou pós-interrupção"],"ru":["Требует предпочтений пользователя и данных тренировок","Ограничен сценариями еженедельного обзора или послелапсовыми сценариями"],"ar":["يتطلب تفضيلات المستخدم وبيانات التمرين","محدود بالسيناريوهات المنقحة أسبوعيا أو بعد السيناريوهات الفاصلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('briannadoubt/Raven/raven-component-authoring', 'community', 'briannadoubt', 'Raven', 'briannadoubt/Raven', 'raven-component-authoring', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z', '2026-02-18T08:30:07.837Z', NULL, '{"id":"briannadoubt/Raven/raven-component-authoring","name":"raven-component-authoring","description":{"zh":"Raven 组件作者工具允许开发者将现代 SwiftUI API 运行在浏览器中，实现跨平台开发","ja":"Raven コンポーネントオーサリングは、最新のSwiftUI APIをブラウザで実行し、クロスプラットフォーム開発を実現","ko":"Raven 컴포넌트 저작 도구는 현대적인 SwiftUI API를 브라우저에서 실행하고 크로스 플랫폼 개발을 구현","es":"El skill de creación de componentes Raven permite la compilación cruzada de SwiftUI al DOM, permitiendo que las API de SwiftUI modernas se ejecuten en el navegador.","fr":"Le skill de création de composants Raven permet la compilation croisée de SwiftUI vers le DOM, permettant aux API SwiftUI modernes de s''exécuter dans le navigateur.","de":"Das Raven-Komponenten-Erstellungsskill ermöglicht die Cross-Compilation von SwiftUI zum DOM, sodass moderne SwiftUI-APIs im Browser ausgeführt werden können.","pt":"O skill de authoring de componentes Raven permite a execução de APIs modernas do SwiftUI no navegador","ru":"Навык создания компонентов Raven позволяет запускать современные API SwiftUI в браузере","ar":"مهارة إنشاء مكونات ريفن تسمح بتشغيل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الحديثة من SwiftUI في المتصفح","en":"Cross compilation for SwiftUI to the DOM - Modern SwiftUI APIs running in the browser"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Raven 组件作者工具 - SwiftUI 到 DOM 的跨编译","ja":"Raven コンポーネントオーサリング - SwiftUI を DOM にクロスコンパイル","ko":"Raven 컴포넌트 저작 도구 - SwiftUI를 DOM으로 크로스 컴파일","es":"Creación de componentes Raven para SwiftUI","fr":"Création de composants Raven pour SwiftUI","de":"Erstellung von Raven-Komponenten für SwiftUI","pt":"Crie Componentes Raven com SwiftUI para DOM","ru":"Создание компонентов Raven с помощью SwiftUI для DOM","ar":"إنشاء مكونات ريفن باستخدام SwiftUI ل DOM","en":"raven-component-authoring"},"description":{"zh":"Raven 组件作者工具允许开发者将现代 SwiftUI API 运行在浏览器中，实现跨平台开发","ja":"Raven コンポーネントオーサリングは、最新のSwiftUI APIをブラウザで実行し、クロスプラットフォーム開発を実現","ko":"Raven 컴포넌트 저작 도구는 현대적인 SwiftUI API를 브라우저에서 실행하고 크로스 플랫폼 개발을 구현","es":"El skill de creación de componentes Raven permite la compilación cruzada de SwiftUI al DOM, permitiendo que las API de SwiftUI modernas se ejecuten en el nav...","fr":"Le skill de création de composants Raven permet la compilation croisée de SwiftUI vers le DOM, permettant aux API SwiftUI modernes de s''exécuter dans le navi...","de":"Das Raven-Komponenten-Erstellungsskill ermöglicht die Cross-Compilation von SwiftUI zum DOM, sodass moderne SwiftUI-APIs im Browser ausgeführt werden können.","pt":"O skill de authoring de componentes Raven permite a execução de APIs modernas do SwiftUI no navegador","ru":"Навык создания компонентов Raven позволяет запускать современные API SwiftUI в браузере","ar":"مهارة إنشاء مكونات ريفن تسمح بتشغيل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الحديثة من SwiftUI في المتصفح","en":"Cross compilation for SwiftUI to the DOM - Modern SwiftUI APIs running in the browser"},"definition":{"en":"Cross compilation for SwiftUI to the DOM - Modern SwiftUI APIs running in the browser"},"features":{"zh":["跨编译 SwiftUI 代码到 DOM","支持现代 SwiftUI API","自定义 DOM 结构","事件处理","JavaScriptKit 交互"],"ja":["SwiftUI コードを DOM にクロスコンパイル","最新のSwiftUI APIをサポート","カスタム DOM 構造","イベントハンドリング","JavaScriptKit 相互運用"],"ko":["SwiftUI 코드를 DOM으로 크로스 컴파일","최신 SwiftUI API 지원","사용자 정의 DOM 구조","이벤트 처리","JavaScriptKit 상호 작용"],"es":["Compilación cruzada de SwiftUI al DOM","Ejecución de API de SwiftUI modernas en el navegador","Creación de componentes personalizados con estructura DOM","Manejo de eventos y JavaScriptKit","Compatibilidad con navegadores"],"fr":["Compilation croisée de SwiftUI vers le DOM","Exécution des API SwiftUI modernes dans le navigateur","Création de composants personnalisés avec structure DOM","Gestion des événements et JavaScriptKit","Compatibilité avec les navigateurs"],"de":["Cross-Compilation von SwiftUI zum DOM","Ausführung moderner SwiftUI-APIs im Browser","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Komponenten mit DOM-Struktur","Ereignishandling und JavaScriptKit","Kompatibilität mit Browsern"],"pt":["Compilação cruzada para executar SwiftUI no navegador","Criação de componentes personalizados com estrutura DOM personalizada","Tratamento de eventos personalizado","Interoperação com JavaScriptKit"],"ru":["Перекрестная компиляция для запуска SwiftUI в браузере","Создание пользовательских компонентов с настраиваемой структурой DOM","Пользовательское xử lý событий","Взаимодействие с JavaScriptKit"],"ar":["الترجمة المترابطة لتشغيل SwiftUI في المتصفح","إنشاء مكونات مخصصة بهيئة DOM مخصصة","معالجة الأحداث المخصصة","التفاعل مع JavaScriptKit"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Raven 组件作者工具","SwiftUI","DOM","跨平台开发","跨编译","现代 SwiftUI API","JavaScriptKit"],"ja":["Raven コンポーネントオーサリング","SwiftUI","DOM","クロスプラットフォーム開発","クロスコンパイル","最新のSwiftUI API","JavaScriptKit"],"ko":["Raven 컴포넌트 저작 도구","SwiftUI","DOM","크로스 플랫폼 개발","크로스 컴파일","최신 SwiftUI API","JavaScriptKit"],"es":["creación de componentes Raven","SwiftUI en el navegador","compilación cruzada","DOM","API de SwiftUI","desarrollo de componentes","navegadores","JavaScriptKit"],"fr":["création de composants Raven","SwiftUI dans le navigateur","compilation croisée","DOM","API SwiftUI","développement de composants","navigateurs","JavaScriptKit"],"de":["Erstellung von Raven-Komponenten","SwiftUI im Browser","Cross-Compilation","DOM","SwiftUI-API","Komponentenentwicklung","Browser","JavaScriptKit"],"pt":["SwiftUI","DOM","compilação cruzada","componentes personalizados","tratamento de eventos","JavaScriptKit","desenvolvimento web","tecnologias de frontend"],"ru":["SwiftUI","DOM","перекрестная компиляция","пользовательские компоненты","обработка событий","JavaScriptKit","веб-разработка","фронтенд-технологии"],"ar":["SwiftUI","DOM","الترجمة المترابطة","مكونات مخصصة","معالجة الأحداث","JavaScriptKit","تطوير الويب","تكنولوجيا واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"briannadoubt","repo":"Raven","repoPath":"briannadoubt/Raven","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"raven-component-authoring","description":"Create or extend Raven UI components and modifiers (rendering to VNode/DOM, wiring events, managing state), including JavaScriptKit interop guidelines (DOMBridge, JSClosure, @MainActor).","bodyPreview":"# Raven Component Authoring\n\nUse this skill when adding a new built-in Raven `View`/modifier (or fixing an existing one), especially if it needs custom DOM structure, event handling, or JavaScriptKit interop.\n\n## Where Code Usually Goes\n\n- New views:\n  - `Sources/Raven/Views/Primitives/` for leaf-ish controls (Button, TextField, Toggle, etc.)\n  - `Sources/Raven/Views/Layout/` for layout containers (VStack, Grid, ScrollView, etc.)\n  - `Sources/Raven/Views/Navigation/` for navigation primitives\n-","body":"# Raven Component Authoring\n\nUse this skill when adding a new built-in Raven `View`/modifier (or fixing an existing one), especially if it needs custom DOM structure, event handling, or JavaScriptKit interop.\n\n## Where Code Usually Goes\n\n- New views:\n  - `Sources/Raven/Views/Primitives/` for leaf-ish controls (Button, TextField, Toggle, etc.)\n  - `Sources/Raven/Views/Layout/` for layout containers (VStack, Grid, ScrollView, etc.)\n  - `Sources/Raven/Views/Navigation/` for navigation primitives\n- New modifiers/wrappers:\n  - `Sources/Raven/Modifiers/`\n- DOM/JavaScriptKit bridge code:\n  - `Sources/Raven/Rendering/DOMBridge.swift`\n- Runtime rendering pipeline (coordinator/renderer):\n  - `Sources/RavenRuntime/RenderLoop.swift`\n  - `Sources/RavenRuntime/DOMRenderer.swift`\n\n## Pick The Rendering Strategy\n\n### 1) Composite View (no custom DOM work)\n\nIf the component is just composition, make it a normal `View` with a `body`:\n\n```swift\n@MainActor\npublic struct MyCard<Content: View>: View, Sendable {\n    private let title: String\n    private let content: Content\n\n    @MainActor\n    public init(_ title: String, @ViewBuilder content: () -> Content) {\n        self.title = title\n        self.content = content()\n    }\n\n    @MainActor public var body: some View {\n        VStack(spacing: 12) {\n            Text(title).font(.headline)\n            content\n        }\n        .padding()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2) Primitive View (custom DOM via VNode)\n\nIf you need to emit a specific DOM element tree, make it `PrimitiveView` (`Body == Never`).\n\nImportant rule of thumb:\n- If you need to render child views and/or wire events: implement `_CoordinatorRenderable` (preferred).\n- If it is truly a leaf and has no child views and no event wiring: `toVNode()` can be enough.\n\n#### Preferred: `_CoordinatorRenderable` for events and child rendering\n\nImplement `_render(with:)` so you can:\n- render children via `context.renderChild(...)`\n- register stable handlers via `context.registerClickHandler(...)` and `context.registerInputHandler(...)`\n- persist controllers via `context.persistentState(create:)`\n\n```swift\npublic struct MyButtonLike<Label: View>: View, PrimitiveView, Sendable {\n    public typealias Body = Never\n\n    private let action: @Sendable @MainActor () -> Void\n    private let label: Label\n\n    @MainActor\n    public init(action: @escaping @Sendable @MainActor () -> Void, @ViewBuilder label: () -> Label) {\n        self.action = action\n        self.label = label()\n    }\n}\n\nextension MyButtonLike: _CoordinatorRenderable {\n    @MainActor public func _render(with context: any _RenderContext) -> VNode {\n        let handlerID = context.registerClickHandler(action)\n        let props: [String: VProperty] = [\n            \"onClick\": .eventHandler(event: \"click\", handlerID: handlerID),\n            \"cursor\": .style(name: \"cursor\", value: \"pointer\"),\n        ]\n        return VNode.element(\"button\", props: props, children: [context.renderChild(label)])\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### Leaf: `toVNode()` (only if you do not need coordinator services)\n\n```swift\npublic struct Badge: View, PrimitiveView, Sendable {\n    public typealias Body = Never\n    private let text: String\n\n    @MainActor public init(_ text: String) { self.text = text }\n\n    @MainActor public func toVNode() -> VNode {\n        VNode.element(\n            \"span\",\n            props: [\"class\": .attribute(name: \"class\", value: \"raven-badge\")],\n            children: [.text(text)]\n        )\n    }\n}\n```\n\nIf you put `.eventHandler(...)` in `toVNode()` you will not be able to register the handler with the coordinator, so prefer `_CoordinatorRenderable` for anything interactive.\n\n### 3) Modifier Wrapper: `_ModifierRenderable` (common pattern)\n\nIf the modifier is “wrap one child, add styles/attrs”, implement `_ModifierRenderable`:\n- `toVNode()` builds the wrapper element (no children)\n- default `_render(with:)` renders the wrapped content and splices it in\n\nSee: `Sources/Raven/Core/RenderProtocols.swift`.\n\n## Event Handling Patterns\n\n### Click-like events (no event payload)\n\n- Use `context.registerClickHandler { ... }`\n- Put the returned UUID into `.eventHandler(event: \"click\", handlerID: id)`\n\n### Input/DOM events (need event payload)\n\n- Use `context.registerInputHandler { (event: JSValue) in ... }`\n- Common reads:\n  - text input: `event.target.value.string`\n  - checkbox: `event.target.checked.boolean`\n\nExample (TextField-style):\n\n```swift\nlet handlerID = context.registerInputHandler { event in\n    if let newValue = event.target.value.string {\n        binding.wrappedValue = newValue\n    }\n}\n\nprops[\"onInput\"] = .eventHandler(event: \"input\", handlerID: handlerID)\nprops[\"value\"] = .attribute(name: \"value\", value: binding.wrappedValue)\n```\n\n## State Guidance (Swift 6.2, WASM-Friendly)\n\n- Local value state: `@State` (requires `Value: Sendable`).\n- Two-way parent/child: `@Binding` for the child, pass `$state` from the parent.\n- Shared model state:\n  - Owner view: `@StateObject`\n  - Child views: `@ObservedObject`\n  - If using `ObservableObject` + `@Published`, call `setupPublished()` in `init()`.\n- Non-view “controller” objects that must persist across renders (and may hold JSClosures/JSObjects):\n  - In a `_CoordinatorRenderable` view, use `context.persistentState(create:)`.\n  - Pattern example: `NavigationStack` in `Sources/Raven/Views/Navigation/NavigationStack.swift`.\n\n## Keys And Stable Identity\n\nRaven assigns stable `NodeID`s based on structural position after conversion. If your component produces a variable-length list of children and you need stable identity across inserts/removes/reorders, set `VNode.key` for each repeated child.\n\nRule of thumb: if you would use `ForEach(..., id:)` in SwiftUI, make sure the corresponding VNodes have stable keys somewhere along that repeated subtree.\n\n## JavaScriptKit Interop Guidelines (DOMBridge Interface)\n\nDefault stance: components should describe DOM via `VNode` and let `DOMRenderer` + `DOMBridge` do the JS work. Only reach for JavaScriptKit directly when you truly need an imperative browser API.\n\nWhen you do need JS interop:\n\n- Keep JS-facing code `@MainActor`.\n  - `JSObject`/`JSValue` are not `Sendable`; do not stash them in `Sendable` structs unless they are actor-isolated.\n- Preserve JavaScript `this` binding.\n  - Call methods directly on the object: `_ = element.setAttribute!(...)`, `_ = parent.appendChild!(...)`.\n  - If you need helpers for tricky cases (like `addEventListener`), prefer the existing injected helpers:\n    - `__ravenAddEventListener` / `__ravenRemoveEventListener` (in `Sources/RavenCLI/Generator/HTMLGenerator.swift`)\n- JSClosure lifetime matters.\n  - If you create a `JSClosure`, store it somewhere (dictionary/property) or it will be deallocated and stop firing.\n  - Prefer putting JSClosure management inside `DOMBridge` or a persistent controller (`context.persistentState(create:)`).\n- Avoid “fire-and-forget Task” from JS callbacks unless you know it runs in WASM’s event loop.\n  - `DOMBridge.addGestureEventListener` intentionally calls handlers synchronously for reliability in WASM.\n\n## Build / Validate (Don’t Overbuild)\n\n1. Package checks:\n\n```bash\nswift test\n```\n\n2. If the change affects DOM behavior, verify via a WASM example build (prefer example apps to avoid unrelated CLI failures):\n\n```bash\ncd Examples/TodoApp\nswift build --swift-sdk swift-6.2.3-RELEASE_wasm\n```\n\n3. Optional browser validation loop: use the existing `$raven-dev` skill.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:30:07.837Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cross-Platform Agents needing to run modern SwiftUI APIs in web browsers","zh":"适用于需要在网页浏览器中运行现代SwiftUI API的跨平台代理","ja":"モダンなSwiftUI APIをWebブラウザで実行する必要があるクロスプラットフォームエージェントに最適","ko":"모던한 SwiftUI API를 웹 브라우저에서 실행해야 하는 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que necesitan ejecutar API de SwiftUI modernas en navegadores web","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Plateforme Croisée ayant besoin d''exécuter des API SwiftUI modernes dans les navigateurs web","de":"Perfekt für Cross-Platform-Agents, die moderne SwiftUI-APIs in Webbrowsern ausführen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cross-Platform que precisam executar APIs modernas do SwiftUI em navegadores da web","ru":"Идеально для агентов с поддержкой нескольких платформ, которым необходимо запускать современные API SwiftUI в веб-браузерах","ar":"مثالي لعميل متعدد المنصات الذي يحتاج إلى تشغيل واجهات برمجة تطبيقات SwiftUI الحديثة في متصفحات الويب"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compile SwiftUI views to the DOM, enabling custom DOM structure, event handling, and JavaScriptKit interop for advanced web applications using SwiftUI''s primitives and layout containers","zh":"赋予代理将SwiftUI视图编译到DOM的能力，实现自定义DOM结构、事件处理和JavaScriptKit交互，用于使用SwiftUI的原语和布局容器的高级Web应用程序","ja":"SwiftUIビューをDOMにコンパイルすることで、カスタムDOM構造、イベントハンドリング、JavaScriptKitの相互運用を可能にし、SwiftUIのプリミティブとレイアウトコンテナを使用した高級Webアプリケーションを実現する","ko":"SwiftUI 뷰를 DOM으로 컴파일하여 사용자 지정 DOM 구조, 이벤트 처리 및 JavaScriptKit 상호 운용을 가능하게 하며, SwiftUI의 원시 및 레이아웃 컨테이너를 사용한 고급 웹 애플리케이션을 구현하는 에이전트를 강화한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a compilar vistas de SwiftUI al DOM, lo que permite una estructura de DOM personalizada, control de eventos y interoperabilidad con JavaScriptKit para aplicaciones web avanzadas que utilizan primitivas y contenedores de diseño de SwiftUI","fr":"Permet aux agents de compiler les vues SwiftUI vers le DOM, permettant ainsi une structure de DOM personnalisée, la gestion d''événements et l''interopérabilité avec JavaScriptKit pour des applications web avancées utilisant les primitives et les conteneurs de disposition de SwiftUI","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SwiftUI-Ansichten zur DOM zu kompilieren, ermöglicht eine benutzerdefinierte DOM-Struktur, Ereignishandling und JavaScriptKit-Interop für erweiterte Webanwendungen, die SwiftUI-Primitiven und Layout-Container verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compilar visualizações do SwiftUI para o DOM, permitindo estrutura de DOM personalizada, tratamento de eventos e interoperabilidade do JavaScriptKit para aplicativos web avançados que usam primitivos e contêineres de layout do SwiftUI","ru":"Позволяет агентам компилировать представления SwiftUI в DOM, обеспечивая пользовательскую структуру DOM, обработку событий и взаимодействие с JavaScriptKit для продвинутых веб-приложений, использующих примитивы и контейнеры макета SwiftUI","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تجميع معالجات SwiftUI إلى DOM، مما يتيح هيكلاً مخصصاً لـ DOM ومعالجة الأحداث وتوافق JavaScriptKit لتطبيقات الويب المتقدمة التي تستخدم المكونات الأساسية وحاويات التخطيط من SwiftUI"},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring new Raven Views with custom DOM structures","Implementing event handling for SwiftUI views in the browser","Creating layout containers with SwiftUI''s Grid, VStack, and ScrollView"],"zh":["创建具有自定义DOM结构的新Raven视图","在浏览器中为SwiftUI视图实现事件处理","使用SwiftUI的Grid、VStack和ScrollView创建布局容器"],"ja":["カスタムDOM構造を持つ新しいRavenビューの作成","ブラウザでのSwiftUIビューのイベントハンドリングの実装","SwiftUIのGrid、VStack、ScrollViewを使用したレイアウトコンテナの作成"],"ko":["사용자 지정 DOM 구조를 가진 새로운 Raven 뷰 작성","웹 브라우저에서 SwiftUI 뷰에 대한 이벤트 처리 구현","SwiftUI의 Grid, VStack, ScrollView를 사용하여 레이아웃 컨테이너 만들기"],"es":["Creación de nuevas vistas de Raven con estructuras de DOM personalizadas","Implementación de control de eventos para vistas de SwiftUI en el navegador","Creación de contenedores de diseño con Grid, VStack y ScrollView de SwiftUI"],"fr":["Création de nouvelles vues Raven avec des structures de DOM personnalisées","Mise en œuvre de la gestion d''événements pour les vues SwiftUI dans le navigateur","Création de conteneurs de disposition avec Grid, VStack et ScrollView de SwiftUI"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Raven-Ansichten mit benutzerdefinierten DOM-Strukturen","Implementierung von Ereignishandling für SwiftUI-Ansichten im Browser","Erstellung von Layout-Containern mit Grid, VStack und ScrollView von SwiftUI"],"pt":["Criação de novas visualizações do Raven com estruturas de DOM personalizadas","Implementação de tratamento de eventos para visualizações do SwiftUI no navegador","Criação de contêineres de layout com Grid, VStack e ScrollView do SwiftUI"],"ru":["Создание новых представлений Raven с пользовательскими структурами DOM","Реализация обработки событий для представлений SwiftUI в браузере","Создание контейнеров макета с помощью Grid, VStack и ScrollView из SwiftUI"],"ar":["إنشاء معالجات ريفن الجديدة مع هياكل DOM مخصصة","تنفيذ معالجة الأحداث لمعالجات SwiftUI في المتصفح","إنشاء حاويات تخطيط باستخدام Grid و VStack و ScrollView من SwiftUI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of SwiftUI and DOM compilation","Limited to Raven View/modifier development"],"zh":["需要SwiftUI和DOM编译的知识","仅限于Raven View/修改器开发"],"ja":["SwiftUIとDOMコンパイルの知識が必要","Raven View/修飾子開発のみ"],"ko":["SwiftUI 및 DOM 컴파일에 대한 지식이 필요","Raven View/수정자 개발만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de SwiftUI y compilación de DOM","Limitado al desarrollo de vistas y modificadores de Raven"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de SwiftUI et de la compilation de DOM","Limité au développement de vues et de modificateurs de Raven"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von SwiftUI und DOM-Kompilierung","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Raven-Ansichten und -Modifiern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de SwiftUI e compilação do DOM","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de visualizações/modificadores do Raven"],"ru":["Требует знания SwiftUI и компиляции DOM","Ограничен разработкой представлений/модификаторов Raven"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة SwiftUI وترجمة DOM","محدود بالتطوير الموجه لمعالجات/معدلات ريفن"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
