هام","التحقق من ملفات المهام الموجودة","تحديث المهام الموجودة","معيار命مة الملفات","دعم إنشاء ملفات مهام جديدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 前端","任务分解","快速构建","立即开始工作","自动化","工作流程","工作效率"],"ja":["AI フロントエンド","タスク分解","迅速な構築","すぐに作業を開始","自動化","ワークフロー","作業効率"],"ko":["AI 프론트엔드","작업 분해","신속한 구성","즉시 작업 시작","자동화","워크플로우","작업 효율"],"es":["desglose de tareas frontend","aico","desarrollo de software","productividad","eficiencia","tareas","subtareas","gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["décomposition de tâches frontend","aico","développement de logiciels","productivité","efficacité","tâches","sous-tâches","gestion de projets"],"de":["Frontend-Aufgabenzerlegung","aico","Softwareentwicklung","Produktivität","Effizienz","Aufgaben","Teilaufgaben","Projektmanagement"],"pt":["divisão de tarefas frontend","aico","desenvolvimento frontend","gerenciamento de tarefas","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","produtividade"],"ru":["разбивка задач frontend","aico","разработка frontend","управление задачами","инструменты разработки","производительность"],"ar":["تقسيم المهام الأمامية","aico","تطوير الأمامية","إدارة المهام","أدوات التطوير","الإنتاجية"]}},"owner":"yellinzero","repo":"aico","repoPath":"yellinzero/aico","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"aico-frontend-task-breakdown","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Task Breakdown\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES - READ FIRST\n\n**BEFORE doing anything, you MUST:**\n\n1. **CHECK EXISTING TASK FILE FIRST**:\n   - ALWAYS check if `story-{story-name}.md` already exists in `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`\n   - If exists: READ it and continue from current progress (add new tasks or update existing ones)\n   - If not exists: Create new task breakdown file\n   - **NEVER re-break down existing tasks**\n\n2. **FILE NAMING**:\n   - Pattern: `story-{story-name}.md` (single file per stor","body":"# Task Breakdown\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES - READ FIRST\n\n**BEFORE doing anything, you MUST:**\n\n1. **CHECK EXISTING TASK FILE FIRST**:\n   - ALWAYS check if `story-{story-name}.md` already exists in `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`\n   - If exists: READ it and continue from current progress (add new tasks or update existing ones)\n   - If not exists: Create new task breakdown file\n   - **NEVER re-break down existing tasks**\n\n2. **FILE NAMING**:\n   - Pattern: `story-{story-name}.md` (single file per story)\n   - Example: `story-user-profile.md`\n   - All tasks for this story go into this ONE file\n   - Tasks are separated by `---` dividers\n\n3. **MULTIPLE TASKS IN ONE FILE**:\n   - One file contains ALL tasks for the story\n   - Each task = independently testable section\n   - Clear scope and acceptance criteria per task\n   - Tasks numbered sequentially (Task 1, Task 2, etc.)\n\n4. **ALWAYS SAVE TO CORRECT PATH**:\n   - Path: `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/story-{story-name}.md`\n   - NO exceptions, NO other locations\n\n5. **READ CONTEXT FIRST**:\n   - Read story from `docs/reference/pm/stories/`\n   - Read design from `docs/reference/frontend/designs/` if exists\n   - Read design system from `docs/reference/frontend/design-system.md`\n   - Read constraints from `docs/reference/frontend/constraints.md`\n\n## Language Configuration\n\nBefore generating any content, check `aico.json` in project root for `language` field to determine the output language. If not set, default to English.\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Read story/PRD**: Load from `docs/reference/pm/stories/` or `docs/reference/pm/versions/`\n2. **Read design** (if exists): Load from `docs/reference/frontend/designs/`\n3. **Read constraints**: Load design system and technical constraints\n4. **Identify components**: What UI elements are needed\n5. **Identify interactions**: What logic and events are needed\n6. **Break into tasks**: Independently testable, single responsibility\n7. **Order by dependencies**: Setup → Static UI → Dynamic → Tests\n8. **Generate single file**: Create `story-{story-name}.md` with all tasks in sections\n9. **Update Story file**: Add \"Related Tasks\" section to story file with link to task file\n10. **Summary**: Show created file and next steps\n\n## Task File Format\n\nSee [Task File Template](references/task-file-template.md) for complete structure.\n\n**Key points:**\n\n- Single file contains all tasks for the story\n- Tasks numbered sequentially (Task 1, Task 2, etc.)\n- Each task has: Description, Context, Acceptance Criteria, Scope, Implementation Steps\n- Progress section at the end tracks completion\n- Both story-based and standalone use the same format (only filename differs)\n\n## Updating Story File\n\nAfter generating the task file, **ALWAYS** update the story file to add the \"Related Tasks\" section:\n\n```markdown\n## Related Tasks\n\n### Frontend Tasks\n\nTask breakdown: [docs/reference/frontend/tasks/story-user-profile.md](../frontend/tasks/story-user-profile.md)\n\n**Progress**: 0/5 tasks completed\n\n- [ ] Task 1: Setup Component\n- [ ] Task 2: Implement Header\n- [ ] Task 3: Implement Avatar\n- [ ] Task 4: Implement Bio\n- [ ] Task 5: Add Tests\n```\n\n**Key points:**\n\n- Add this section at the end of the story file (before any existing notes)\n- Include link to the task file\n- Use `- [ ]` checkboxes for each task (will be checked when task completes)\n- List tasks in execution order (Setup → UI → Logic → Tests)\n- Keep the section organized by frontend/backend if both exist\n- Include progress counter (X/Y tasks completed)\n\n## Output Example\n\nAfter breaking down \"user-profile\" story:\n\n```\nCreated task file for story ''user-profile'':\n\n✓ docs/reference/frontend/tasks/story-user-profile.md\n\nTask breakdown includes:\n- Task 1: Setup Component Structure (setup)\n- Task 2: Implement Header Section (feature)\n- Task 3: Implement Avatar Component (feature)\n- Task 4: Implement Bio Section (feature)\n- Task 5: Add Comprehensive Tests (testing)\n\nTotal: 5 tasks\n\nNext steps:\n1. Review task breakdown in story-user-profile.md\n2. Use /frontend.plan to add detailed steps to specific tasks\n3. Use /frontend.implement to start executing tasks\n```\n\n## Key Rules\n\n- ALWAYS create a single file containing all tasks for the story\n- MUST use `story-{story-name}.md` naming (NOT multiple files)\n- ALWAYS include test tasks at the end\n- MUST note dependencies between tasks (in each task''s metadata)\n- Keep tasks focused - not too big, not too small\n- Each task section is self-contained with clear acceptance criteria\n- Separate tasks with `---` dividers\n- Include Story Progress section at the end of file\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- ❌ Tasks too large (full page) → ✅ Break into sections\n- ❌ Tasks too small (add one button) → ✅ Group related work\n- ❌ Skip dependencies → ✅ Note which tasks depend on others\n- ❌ Forget testing → ✅ Always include test tasks\n- ❌ Create multiple files → ✅ Use single file with multiple task sections\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:30:37.854Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Team Management Agents needing structured task breakdown capabilities with Markdown file handling.","zh":"适合需要结构化任务分解能力和Markdown文件处理的AI团队管理代理。","ja":"構造化タスク分解機能とMarkdownファイル処理が必要なAIチーム管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 태스크 분해 능력과 Markdown 파일 처리가 필요한 AI 팀 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de equipos de inteligencia artificial que necesitan capacidades de desglose de tareas estructuradas con manejo de archivos Markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion d''équipe d''intelligence artificielle ayant besoin de capacités de décomposition de tâches structurées avec une gestion de fichiers Markdown.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Team-Management-Agents, die strukturierte Aufgabenzerlegungsfunktionen mit Markdown-Dateihandling benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Equipes de IA que necessitam de capacidades de quebra de tarefas estruturadas com manipulação de arquivos Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления командами ИИ, которым необходимы возможности структурированного разбиения задач с обработкой файлов Markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة فريق الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى возможности تقسيم المهام المنظمة مع معالجة ملفات Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage tasks efficiently by checking existing task files, creating new task breakdown files, and updating tasks in Markdown format, following a strict file naming pattern like `story-{story-name}.md`.","zh":"通过检查现有的任务文件、创建新的任务分解文件以及以Markdown格式更新任务，按照严格的文件命名模式（如`story-{story-name}.md`），使得代理能够高效地管理任务。","ja":"既存のタスクファイルを確認し、新しいタスク分解ファイルを作成し、Markdown形式でタスクを更新することで、エージェントが効率的にタスクを管理できるようにします。ファイル命名パターンは厳格に`story-{story-name}.md`の形式でなければなりません。","ko":"기존 태스크 파일을 확인하고, 새로운 태스크 분해 파일을 생성하며, Markdown 형식으로 태스크를 업데이트함으로써, 에이전트가 효율적으로 태스크를 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 파일 이름 패턴은 엄격히 `story-{story-name}.md` 형식으로 해야 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar tareas de manera eficiente comprobando archivos de tareas existentes, creando nuevos archivos de desglose de tareas y actualizando tareas en formato Markdown, siguiendo un patrón de nomenclatura de archivos estricto como `story-{story-name}.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les tâches de manière efficace en vérifiant les fichiers de tâches existants, en créant de nouveaux fichiers de décomposition de tâches et en mettant à jour les tâches au format Markdown, en suivant un modèle de nommage de fichier strict comme `story-{story-name}.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Aufgaben effizient zu verwalten, indem sie bestehende Aufgabendateien überprüfen, neue Aufgabenzerlegungsdateien erstellen und Aufgaben im Markdown-Format aktualisieren, indem sie einem strengen Dateinamensmuster wie `story-{story-name}.md` folgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar tarefas de forma eficiente, verificando arquivos de tarefas existentes, criando novos arquivos de quebra de tarefas e atualizando tarefas no formato Markdown, seguindo um padrão estrito de nomenclatura de arquivos como `story-{nome-da-historia}.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективного управления задачами, проверяя существующие файлы задач, создавая новые файлы разбиения задач и обновляя задачи в формате Markdown, следуя строгому шаблону именования файлов, например, `story-{имя-истории}.md`.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بإدارة المهام بفعالية من خلال التحقق من الملفات الحالية للمهام وإنشاء ملفات جديدة لتقسيم المهام وتحديث المهام في تنسيق Markdown، متبعة نمطا صارما لاسم الملف مثل `story-{اسم-القصة}.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task breakdown file checks","Generating new task files with proper naming conventions","Updating existing tasks in Markdown files"],"zh":["自动化任务分解文件检查","生成具有适当命名约定的新任务文件","更新Markdown文件中的现有任务"],"ja":["タスク分解ファイルの自動化チェック","適切な命名規約を持つ新しいタスクファイルの生成","Markdownファイル内の既存タスクの更新"],"ko":["태스크 분해 파일 자동화 체크","적절한命명 규약을 갖춘 새로운 태스크 파일 생성","Markdown 파일 내의 기존 태스크 업데이트"],"es":["Automatizar la comprobación de archivos de desglose de tareas","Generar nuevos archivos de tareas con convenciones de nomenclatura adecuadas","Actualizar tareas existentes en archivos Markdown"],"fr":["Automatiser la vérification des fichiers de décomposition de tâches","Générer de nouveaux fichiers de tâches avec des conventions de nommage appropriées","Mettre à jour les tâches existantes dans les fichiers Markdown"],"de":["Automatisieren der Überprüfung von Aufgabenzerlegungsdateien","Erstellen neuer Aufgaben-Dateien mit geeigneten Benennungskonventionen","Aktualisieren bestehender Aufgaben in Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de arquivos de quebra de tarefas","Gerar novos arquivos de tarefas com convenções de nomenclatura apropriadas","Atualizar tarefas existentes em arquivos Markdown"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку файлов разбиения задач","Генерировать новые файлы задач с правильными соглашениями об именовании","Обновлять существующие задачи в файлах Markdown"],"ar":["تأتمتة التحقق من ملفات تقسيم المهام","إنشاء ملفات مهام جديدة مع اتفاقيات命名 مناسبة","تحديث المهام الحالية في ملفات Markdown"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/` directory","Must follow specific file naming pattern","Assumes existing knowledge of Markdown file format"],"zh":["需要访问`docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`目录","必须遵循特定的文件命名模式","假设已有Markdown文件格式的知识"],"ja":["`docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","特定のファイル命名パターンに従わなければならない","Markdownファイル形式の既存の知識を前提とする"],"ko":["`docs/reference/frontend/tasks/` 디렉토리 접근이 필요","특정 파일 이름 패턴을 따라야 함","Markdown 파일 형식에 대한 기존 지식을 전제로 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`","Debe seguir un patrón de nomenclatura de archivos específico","Supone conocimiento existente del formato de archivo Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`","Doit suivre un modèle de nommage de fichier spécifique","Suppose une connaissance existante du format de fichier Markdown"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`","Muss einem bestimmten Dateinamensmuster folgen","Geht von vorhandenem Wissen über das Markdown-Dateiformat aus"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`","Deve seguir um padrão específico de nomenclatura de arquivos","Pressupõe conhecimento prévio do formato de arquivo Markdown"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`","Должно следовать определенному шаблону именования файлов","Предполагает предварительные знания формата файла Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `docs/reference/frontend/tasks/`","يجب اتباع نمط محدد لاسم الملف","يفترض معرفة مسبقة بتنسيق ملف Markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('bebopbabailey/homelab-llm/homelab-durability', 'community', 'bebopbabailey', 'homelab-llm', 'bebopbabailey/homelab-llm', 'homelab-durability', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z', '2026-02-18T08:30:49.987Z', NULL, '{"id":"bebopbabailey/homelab-llm/homelab-durability","name":"homelab-durability","description":{"zh":"Homelab 持久性是指主 monorepo 的可靠性和稳定性，通过 Sources of Truth、Execution Contract 和 Defaults 等特点来实现","ja":"Homelab 耐久性は、主モノレポの信頼性と安定性を指し、ソース・オブ・トゥルース、実行契約、デフォルトなどの特徴を備えています","ko":"Homelab 내구성은 메인 모노레포의 안정성과 신뢰성을 의미하며, Sources of Truth, Execution Contract, Defaults 등으로 구현됩니다","es":"Homelab Durability es un conjunto de recursos y documentos para configurar y ejecutar un entorno de Homelab duradero y eficiente","fr":"Homelab Durability est un ensemble de ressources et de documents pour configurer et exécuter un environnement Homelab durable et efficace","de":"Homelab-Dauerhaftigkeit ist eine Sammlung von Ressourcen und Dokumenten zur Konfiguration und Ausführung eines dauerhaften und effizienten Homelab-Environments","pt":"O Homelab Durabilidade é um conjunto de recursos e diretrizes para melhorar a estabilidade e o desempenho do seu laboratório doméstico","ru":"Надежность Homelab - это набор ресурсов и руководств для улучшения стабильности и производительности вашей домашней лаборатории","ar":"متانة Homelab هي مجموعة من الموارد والإرشادات لتحسين الاستقرار والأداء لمختبرك المنزلي","en":"main monorepo"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Homelab 持久性：可靠的主 monorepo 解决方案","ja":"Homelab 耐久性：信頼性の高い主モノレポソリューション","ko":"Homelab 내구성: 안정적인 메인 모노레포 솔루션","es":"Durabilidad de Homelab: Configuración y Ejecución","fr":"Durabilité de Homelab : Configuration et Exécution","de":"Homelab-Dauerhaftigkeit: Konfiguration und Ausführung","pt":"Homelab Durabilidade: Otimização de Desempenho","ru":"Надежность Homelab: Оптимизация Производительности","ar":"متانة Homelab: تحسين الأداء","en":"homelab-durability"},"description":{"zh":"Homelab 持久性是指主 monorepo 的可靠性和稳定性，通过 Sources of Truth、Execution Contract 和 Defaults 等特点来实现","ja":"Homelab 耐久性は、主モノレポの信頼性と安定性を指し、ソース・オブ・トゥルース、実行契約、デフォルトなどの特徴を備えています","ko":"Homelab 내구성은 메인 모노레포의 안정성과 신뢰성을 의미하며, Sources of Truth, Execution Contract, Defaults 등으로 구현됩니다","es":"Homelab Durability es un conjunto de recursos y documentos para configurar y ejecutar un entorno de Homelab duradero y eficiente","fr":"Homelab Durability est un ensemble de ressources et de documents pour configurer et exécuter un environnement Homelab durable et efficace","de":"Homelab-Dauerhaftigkeit ist eine Sammlung von Ressourcen und Dokumenten zur Konfiguration und Ausführung eines dauerhaften und effizienten Homelab-Environments","pt":"O Homelab Durabilidade é um conjunto de recursos e diretrizes para melhorar a estabilidade e o desempenho do seu laboratório doméstico","ru":"Надежность Homelab - это набор ресурсов и руководств для улучшения стабильности и производительности вашей домашней лаборатории","ar":"متانة Homelab هي مجموعة من الموارد والإرشادات لتحسين الاستقرار والأداء لمختبرك المنزلي","en":"main monorepo"},"definition":{"en":"main monorepo"},"features":{"zh":["Sources of Truth","Execution Contract","Defaults","Download approval threshold","Disk check required","Host confirmation"],"ja":["ソース・オブ・トゥルース","実行契約","デフォルト","ダウンロード承認閾値","ディスクチェックの必要性","ホストの確認"],"ko":["Sources of Truth","Execution Contract","Defaults","다운로드 승인 임계값","디스크 체크 필수","호스트 확인"],"es":["Configuración de fuentes de verdad","Ejecución de contratos estrictos","Establecimiento de umbrales de descarga","Verificación de disco antes de descargas o acciones grandes","Configuración de ritmos de operación"],"fr":["Configuration des sources de vérité","Exécution de contrats stricts","Définition des seuils de téléchargement","Vérification du disque avant les téléchargements ou les actions importantes","Configuration des rythmes d''opération"],"de":["Konfiguration von Wahrheitsquellen","Ausführung von strengen Verträgen","Festlegung von Download-Schwellenwerten","Überprüfung der Festplatte vor Downloads oder großen Aktionen","Konfiguration von Betriebsrhythmen"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho","Melhoria da estabilidade","Recursos de segurança","Documentação técnica","Integração com outras ferramentas"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности","Улучшение стабильности","Механизмы безопасности","Техническая документация","Интеграция с другими инструментами"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","تحسين الاستقرار","ميزات الأمان","التوثيق الفني","التكامل مع أدوات أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Homelab 持久性","主 monorepo","Sources of Truth","Execution Contract","Defaults","开发效率","可靠性","稳定性"],"ja":["Homelab 耐久性","主モノレポ","ソース・オブ・トゥルース","実行契約","デフォルト","開発効率","信頼性","安定性"],"ko":["Homelab 내구성","메인 모노레포","Sources of Truth","Execution Contract","Defaults","개발 효율성","안정성","신뢰성"],"es":["Homelab","durabilidad","configuración","ejecución","fuentes de verdad","contratos estrictos","umbrales de descarga","verificación de disco"],"fr":["Homelab","durabilité","configuration","exécution","sources de vérité","contrats stricts","seuils de téléchargement","vérification du disque"],"de":["Homelab","Dauerhaftigkeit","Konfiguration","Ausführung","Wahrheitsquellen","strenge Verträge","Download-Schwellenwerte","Überprüfung der Festplatte"],"pt":["homelab","desempenho","estabilidade","segurança","documentação técnica","otimização","laboratório doméstico"],"ru":["homelab","производительность","стабильность","безопасность","техническая документация","оптимизация","домашняя лаборатория"],"ar":["homelab","الأداء","الاستقرار","الأمان","التوثيق الفني","تحسين","مختبر منزلي"]}},"owner":"bebopbabailey","repo":"homelab-llm","repoPath":"bebopbabailey/homelab-llm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"homelab-durability","description":"Enforce docs-first, minimal-contract, validation-heavy workflow; prevent cross-host mistakes and scope creep.","bodyPreview":"# Homelab Durability\n\n## Sources of Truth (Must read first)\n- docs/_core/OPERATING_MODEL.md\n- docs/_core/SOURCES_OF_TRUTH.md\n- docs/_core/CHANGE_RULES.md\n- docs/foundation/operating-rhythm.md\n- layer-gateway/CONSTRAINTS.md\n- docs/foundation/topology.md\n- docs/PLATFORM_DOSSIER.md\n\n## Execution Contract (Strict)\n\n## Defaults (Conservative)\n- Download approval threshold: 500MB.\n- Disk check required before any model download/cache action or any explicitly large (>5GB) action: YES.\n- Host confirmati","body":"# Homelab Durability\n\n## Sources of Truth (Must read first)\n- docs/_core/OPERATING_MODEL.md\n- docs/_core/SOURCES_OF_TRUTH.md\n- docs/_core/CHANGE_RULES.md\n- docs/foundation/operating-rhythm.md\n- layer-gateway/CONSTRAINTS.md\n- docs/foundation/topology.md\n- docs/PLATFORM_DOSSIER.md\n\n## Execution Contract (Strict)\n\n## Defaults (Conservative)\n- Download approval threshold: 500MB.\n- Disk check required before any model download/cache action or any explicitly large (>5GB) action: YES.\n- Host confirmation: strict for ops commands, but may be treated as sticky within the same session after explicit confirmation.\n- Violations: HARD-BLOCK for MLX/disk/host/file-list rules; WARN for stylistic rules.\n\n## Workflow Rules (Behavioral)\n- Use `SCRATCH_PAD.md` only when the user asks. This is mainly for use if user needs to run \n  commands themselves or asks to review commands/outputs/diffs; otherwise inline is acceptable.\n- `NOW.md` must reflect the active development task; update it when the active work changes.\n- `NOW.md` contains only active work + a single “NEXT UP” section. Everything else goes to `BACKLOG.md`.\n- Journal entries are append-only. Do not move or delete files in `docs/journal/`.\n  If a correction is needed, add a new dated entry and update `docs/journal/index.md`.\n\n### Required startup declarations\nEvery response MUST begin by stating:\n1) **Host** (Mini vs Studio vs Orin)\n2) **Scope** (layer/service)\n3) **Files** (explicit list of intended files to change)\n\n### Hard-block rules (must refuse)\n- No multi-file edits without an explicit file list.\n- No ops commands unless **Host Check** is explicitly satisfied in the same response.\n- No restarts/service modifications unless **Stage = Validate** and a rollback is specified.\n- No disk repair / fsck / apfs repair / partition changes without explicit user approval.\n- MLX backends: MUST use `mlxctl` + registry as source of truth. No ad-hoc edits or direct `mlx-openai-server` control unless explicitly authorized.\n- Any download/cache/model pull > 500MB requires explicit user approval.\n\n### Disk guardrail\n- Before any model download/cache action or any explicitly large (>5GB) action, require a disk free check command suggestion and STOP until user confirms.\n\n### Default stance\n- Default to read-only inspection first.\n\n### Host Check (required before ops commands)\n- Explicitly confirm target host and its role.\n- If not confirmed, STOP and ask for confirmation.\n\n## Preferred Operating Rhythm\nInventory → Constraints → Minimal contract → Wire → Validate → Codify → Prune\n\n## Output Format (Required)\nMode: Discover|Design|Build|Verify\nStage: Inventory|Constraints|Minimal Contract|Wire|Validate|Codify|Prune\nHost: <explicit>\nScope: <layer/service>\nProposed Change: <one paragraph>\nFiles: <explicit list>\nCommands: <copy/paste safe; no wrapped lines>\nValidation: <commands>\nRollback: <commands>\n\n## How to use\n- Invoke by name: \"use homelab-durability\"\n- Behavior changes:\n  - Host check gate before any ops commands\n  - File list gate before edits\n  - Validation gate requires rollback for restarts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:30:49.987Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for System Administration Agents needing robust homelab setup and maintenance capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的家庭实验室设置和维护能力的系统管理代理。","ja":"システム管理エージェントが堅牢なホームラボセットアップとメンテナンス機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"강력한 홈 랩 설정 및 유지 관리 기능이 필요한 시스템 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Administración de Sistemas que necesitan capacidades robustas de configuración y mantenimiento de homelab.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Administration de Système ayant besoin de capacités robustes de configuration et de maintenance de homelab.","de":"Perfekt für Systemadministration-Agenten, die robuste Homelab-Konfigurations- und Wartungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Administração de Sistema que necessitam de capacidades robustas de configuração e manutenção de homelab.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов системного администрирования, требующих надежных возможностей настройки и обслуживания homelab.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة النظام الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات قوية لإعداد وتحديث مختبر المنزل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce strict execution contracts, manage sources of truth, and optimize disk usage with constraints like download approval thresholds and host confirmation requirements, utilizing Markdown documentation and operating rhythms.","zh":"赋予代理执行严格的执行合同、管理真实数据源、优化磁盘使用并考虑下载批准阈值和主机确认要求等约束，利用Markdown文档和操作节奏。","ja":"エージェントに厳格な実行契約の実施、真実のデータソースの管理、ダウンロードの承認閾値やホストの確認要件などの制約を考慮したディスク使用の最適化を可能にし、Markdownドキュメントや運用リズムを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 엄격한 실행 계약을 강제하고, 진실 된 데이터 소스를 관리하며, 다운로드 승인 임계값 및 호스트 확인 요구 사항 등의 제약 조건을 고려하여 디스크 사용을 최적화 할 수있게 하며, Markdown 문서 및 운영 리듬을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar contratos de ejecución estrictos, gestionar fuentes de verdad y optimizar el uso del disco con restricciones como umbrales de aprobación de descargas y requisitos de confirmación de host, utilizando documentación Markdown y ritmos de operación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter des contrats d''exécution stricts, de gérer les sources de vérité et d''optimiser l''utilisation du disque avec des contraintes comme des seuils d''approbation de téléchargement et des exigences de confirmation d''hôte, en utilisant la documentation Markdown et les rythmes opérationnels.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, strikte Ausführungsverträge durchzusetzen, Quellen der Wahrheit zu verwalten und die Festplattennutzung mit Einschränkungen wie Download-Genehmigungsschwellen und Host-Bestätigungsanforderungen zu optimieren, unter Nutzung von Markdown-Dokumentation und Betriebsrhythmen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor contratos de execução estritos, gerenciar fontes de verdade e otimizar o uso do disco com restrições como limiares de aprovação de download e requisitos de confirmação do host, utilizando documentação Markdown e ritmos operacionais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать строгие контракты выполнения, управлять источниками истины и оптимизировать использование диска с ограничениями, такими как пороги одобрения загрузки и требования подтверждения хоста, используя документацию Markdown и операционные ритмы.","ar":"YTE اوكلاء لفرض عقود تنفيذ صارمة وإدارة مصادر الحقيقة وتنظيم استخدام القرص مع قيود مثل عتبات موافقة التحميل ومتطلبات تأكيد المضيف، باستخدام توثيق Markdown والإيقاعات التشغيلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing operating models","Managing sources of truth","Optimizing disk usage with download thresholds"],"zh":["执行操作模型的强制","管理真实数据源","优化磁盘使用并考虑下载阈值"],"ja":["運用モデルの強制実施","真実のデータソースの管理","ダウンロードの閾値を考慮したディスク使用の最適化"],"ko":["운용 모델의 강제 실행","진실 된 데이터 소스의 관리","다운로드 임계 값을 고려한 디스크 사용 최적화"],"es":["Aplicar modelos de operación","Gestionar fuentes de verdad","Optimizar el uso del disco con umbrales de descarga"],"fr":["Faire respecter les modèles opérationnels","Gérer les sources de vérité","Optimiser l''utilisation du disque avec des seuils de téléchargement"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Betriebsmodellen","Verwalten von Wahrheitsquellen","Optimieren der Festplattennutzung mit Download-Schwellen"],"pt":["Impor modelos operacionais","Gerenciar fontes de verdade","Otimizar uso do disco com limiares de download"],"ru":["Внедрение операционных моделей","Управление источниками истины","Оптимизация использования диска с порогами загрузки"],"ar":["فرض نماذج تشغيلية","إدارة مصادر الحقيقة","تحسين استخدام القرص مع عتبات التحميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to operating models","Limited to 500MB download approval threshold by default","Disk checks are mandatory for large actions"],"zh":["需要严格遵守操作模型","默认下载批准阈值限制为500MB","对于大型操作，磁盘检查是必需的"],"ja":["運用モデルの厳格な遵守が必要","デフォルトのダウンロード承認閾値は500MBに制限される","大きな操作の場合はディスクチェックが必須"],"ko":["운용 모델을 엄격히 준수해야 함","기본 다운로드 승인 임계値는 500MB로 제한됨","대형 작업의 경우 디스크 확인이 필수"],"es":["Requiere una adhesión estricta a los modelos de operación","Limitado a un umbral de aprobación de descarga de 500 MB por defecto","Las comprobaciones de disco son obligatorias para acciones grandes"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte aux modèles opérationnels","Limité à un seuil d''approbation de téléchargement de 500 Mo par défaut","Les vérifications de disque sont obligatoires pour les actions importantes"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung der Betriebsmodelle","Begrenzt auf eine Download-Genehmigungsschwelle von 500 MB standardmäßig","Festplattenprüfungen sind für große Aktionen obligatorisch"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita a modelos operacionais","Limitado a um limiar de aprovação de download de 500MB por padrão","Verificações de disco são obrigatórias para ações grandes"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения операционных моделей","Ограничен до порога одобрения загрузки 500МБ по умолчанию","Проверки диска обязательны для крупных действий"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباعًا صارمًا لنماذج التشغيل","محدود بعتبة موافقة التحميل 500MB افتراضيًا","فحوصات القرص إجبارية للإجراءات الكبيرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/prompt-optimization', 'community', 'itsimonfredlingjack', 'codex-dev-plugin', 'itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin', 'prompt-optimization', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z', '2026-02-18T08:30:55.059Z', NULL, '{"id":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/prompt-optimization","name":"prompt-optimization","description":{"zh":"prompt-optimization 是一种技术，用于优化提示文本以提高开发效率。它涉及分析和解决问题的最佳方法","ja":"プロンプト最適化は、開発効率を向上させるためにプロンプトテキストを最適化する技術です。問題の分析と解決策の実装が含まれます","ko":"프롬프트 최적화는 개발 효율성을 향상시키기 위해 프롬프트 텍스트를 최적화하는 기술입니다. 문제 분석과 해결책 구현이 포함됩니다","es":"La optimización de prompts es una técnica crucial para mejorar la eficiencia de los modelos de lenguaje. Conoce las últimas tendencias y técnicas para desarrolladores.","fr":"L''optimisation de prompts est une technique essentielle pour améliorer l''efficacité des modèles de langage. Découvrez les dernières tendances et techniques pour les développeurs.","de":"Die Prompt-Optimierung ist eine entscheidende Technik, um die Effizienz von Sprachmodellen zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie die neuesten Trends und Techniken für Entwickler.","pt":"A otimização de prompt é uma técnica para melhorar a eficiência dos agentes de IA. Ela envolve a análise e a implementação de soluções personalizadas","ru":"Оптимизация промпта - это техника для повышения эффективности агентов ИИ. Она включает в себя анализ и реализацию индивидуальных решений","ar":"تحسين المحفز هو تقنية لتحسين كفاءة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي. يتضمن تحليل وتنفيذ حلول مخصصة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"prompt-optimization 技术","ja":"プロンプト最適化","ko":"프롬프트 최적화","es":"Optimización de Prompts para Desarrolladores","fr":"Optimisation de Prompts pour Développeurs","de":"Prompt-Optimierung für Entwickler","pt":"Otimização de Prompt para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Оптимизация Промпта для Разработчиков","ar":"