t.js","Приоритизация правил по влиянию"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحسين الأداء","دليل لتحسين الترميز التلقائي وإنشاء الشفرة","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js","التحديد الأفضل للقواعد حسب التأثير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","最佳实践","性能优化","React","Next.js","自动重构","代码生成","数据获取","代码重构"],"ja":["Vercel React","ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","React","Next.js","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","データ取得","コードリファクタリング"],"ko":["버셀 리액트","최적화 가이드","성능 최적화","리액트","넥스트.js","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","데이터 가져오기","코드 리팩토링"],"es":["React","Next.js","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","Vercel","desarrollo web","aplicaciones web","rendimiento de aplicaciones"],"fr":["React","Next.js","optimisation des performances","bonnes pratiques","Vercel","développement web","applications web","performances des applications"],"de":["React","Next.js","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","Vercel","Webentwicklung","Webanwendungen","Anwendungsleistung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas React","Otimização de desempenho React","Next.js","Desempenho de aplicativos","Refatoração automática","Geração de código"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики React","Оптимизация производительности React","Next.js","Производительность приложений","Автоматическая рефакторация","Генерация кода"],"ar":["Vercel React","أفضل الممارسات لتفعل","تحسين الأداء لتفعل","Next.js","أداء التطبيقات","تحسين الترميز التلقائي","إنشاء الشفرة"]}},"owner":"CarlosVerasteguii","repo":"Daticket","repoPath":"CarlosVerasteguii/Daticket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:30:52.822Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js application performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序性能的前端代理。","ja":"React および Next.js アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan un rendimiento óptimo de aplicaciones React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un rendimiento optimal des applications React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes React- und Next.js-Anwendungsverhalten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado de aplicações React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный性能 приложений React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء محسّن لتطبيقات React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 45 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 45 条规则跨 8 个类别进行全面性能优化，包括使用 Vercel 指南进行数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成をエージェントに可能にし、45 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって使用して包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を行い、Vercel ガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化を含む。","ko":"에이전트가 React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 수행하도록 하여, 8개 카테고리에 걸친 45개의 규칙을 사용하여 종합적인 성능 최적화를 수행하며, Vercel 가이드라인을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 45 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización de rendimiento integral, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la agrupación utilizando las pautas de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 45 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation des performances globale, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les directives Vercel.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem es 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung nutzt, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung unter Verwendung der Vercel-Richtlinien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias para otimização abrangente de desempenho, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando diretrizes do Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях для всесторонней оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и пакетирования с использованием рекомендаций Vercel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير تلقيني لتحسينและการ توليد رمز للمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، مستفيداً من 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين شامل للأداء، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحزيم البيانات باستخدام إرشادات Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components","Generating optimized code for server-side data fetching in Next.js","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Reviewing code for performance issues and providing actionable insights"],"zh":["自动优化新 React 组件的性能","为 Next.js 服务器端数据获取生成优化代码","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能","审查代码以查找性能问题并提供可行的见解"],"ja":["新しい React コンポーネントのパフォーマンスを自動で最適化する","Next.js サーバーサイド データ取得の最適化コードを生成する","既存の React と Next.js コードを再構成してより良いパフォーマンスを得る","コードをレビューしてパフォーマンスの問題を特定し、実行可能なインサイトを提供する"],"ko":["새로운 React 컴포넌트의 성능을 자동으로 최적화하는 것","Next.js 서버측 데이터 가져오기용 최적화 코드를 생성하는 것","기존의 React 및 Next.js 코드를 리팩토링하여 더 나은 성능을 얻는 것","코드를 검토하여 성능 문제를 찾고 실행 가능한 통찰력을 제공하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes de React","Generar código optimizado para la recuperación de datos del lado del servidor en Next.js","Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento","Revisar el código en busca de problemas de rendimiento y proporcionar información útil"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React","Générer du code optimisé pour la récupération de données côté serveur dans Next.js","Refactoriser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances"," Examiner le code pour les problèmes de performances et fournir des informations exploitables"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimiertem Code für die Datenabruf auf der Serverseite in Next.js","Refaktorisieren des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für eine bessere Leistung","Überprüfen des Codes auf Leistungsprobleme und Bereitstellen von handhabbaren Erkenntnissen"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React","Gerar código otimizado para busca de dados no servidor em Next.js","Refatorar código existente React e Next.js para melhor desempenho","Revisar código para problemas de desempenho e fornecer informações ações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React","Генерировать оптимизированный код для запроса данных на сервере в Next.js","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности","Проверять код на наличие проблем с производительностью и предоставлять рекомендации для действий"],"ar":["توفير تلقيني لتحسين الأداء للمكونات الجديدة React","توليد رمز محسّن لاسترجاع البيانات على الخادم في Next.js","إعادة هيكلة رمز المكونات الحالية React و Next.js للحصول على أداء أفضل","مراجعة رمز لتحديد مشاكل الأداء وتوفير معلومات للإجراءات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to applications using Vercel","May require manual review of automated refactoring suggestions"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Next.js 的知识","仅限使用 Vercel 的应用程序","可能需要手动审查自动重构建议"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","Vercel を使用するアプリケーションに限定される","自動リファクタリングの提案を手動でレビューすることが必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js에 대한 지식이 필요함","Vercel을 사용하는 애플리케이션에만 제한됨","자동 리팩토링 제안을 수동으로 검토해야 할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan Vercel","Puede requerir una revisión manual de las sugerencias de refactorización automatizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux applications utilisant Vercel","Peut nécessiter une révision manuelle des suggestions de refactoring automatisées"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die Vercel verwenden","Kann eine manuelle Überprüfung der automatisierten Refactoring-Vorschläge erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações que usam Vercel","Pode exigir revisão manual de sugestões de refatoração automatizada"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен для приложений, использующих Vercel","Может потребовать ручного рассмотрения автоматических предложений по рефакторингу"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالمكونات React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم Vercel","يمكن أن يتطلب مراجعة يدوية لاقتراحات التحسين التلقينية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
