ncia","Planificación de equipo y recursos","Investigación estratégica y de mercado"],"fr":["Modèles financiers personnalisables","Prévisions de revenus détaillées","Analyse de marché et de concurrence","Planification d''équipe et de ressources","Recherche stratégique et de marché"],"de":["Anpassbare Finanzmodelle","Detaillierte Umsatzprognosen","Markt- und Wettbewerbsanalyse","Team- und Ressourcenplanung","Strategische und Marktforschung"],"pt":["Criação de modelos financeiros abrangentes","Projeções de receita para 3-5 anos","Análise de mercado e tendências","Plano de equipe e pesquisa estratégica","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание полных финансовых моделей","Прогнозы доходов на 3-5 лет","Анализ рынка и тенденций","План команды и стратегические исследования","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج مالية شاملة","توقعات إيرادات لمدة 3-5 سنوات","تحليل السوق والاتجاهات","خطة الفريق والبحوث الاستراتيجية","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["金融预测","财务模型","收入预测","AI Observability Platform","OTLP","DuckDB","语义约定","AI遥测"],"ja":["金融プロジェクション","財務モデル","収益予測","AI Observability Platform","OTLP","DuckDB","セマンティック規約","AIテレメトリ"],"ko":["금융 예측","재무 모델","수익 예측","AI Observability Platform","OTLP","DuckDB","의미 규약","AI telemetry"],"es":["proyecciones financieras","modelos financieros","análisis de negocios","planificación financiera","startups","empresas","ingresos","gastos","predicciones financieras"],"fr":["prévisions financières","modèles financiers","analyse d''entreprise","planification financière","startups","entreprises","revenus","dépenses","prédictions financières"],"de":["Finanzprognosen","Finanzmodelle","Geschäftsanalyse","Finanzplanung","Startups","Unternehmen","Einnahmen","Ausgaben","Finanzvorhersagen"],"pt":["projeções financeiras","modelos financeiros","startups","empresas de tecnologia","desenvolvimento de software","análise de mercado","plano de equipe"],"ru":["финансовые прогнозы","финансовые модели","стартапы","технологические компании","разработка программного обеспечения","анализ рынка","план команды"],"ar":["التوقعات المالية","النماذج المالية","الشركات الناشئة","شركات التكنولوجيا","تطوير البرمجيات","تحليل السوق","خطة الفريق"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"financial-projections","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  allowed-tools:\n    [\"Read\", \"Write\", \"Edit\", \"Glob\", \"Grep\", \"Bash\", \"WebSearch\", \"WebFetch\"]\nplugin:\n  name: \"startup-business-analyst\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive startup business analysis with market sizing (TAM/SAM/SOM), financial modeling, team planning, and strategic research\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\n# Financial Projections\n\nCreate a comprehensive 3-5 year financial model with revenue projections,","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  allowed-tools:\n    [\"Read\", \"Write\", \"Edit\", \"Glob\", \"Grep\", \"Bash\", \"WebSearch\", \"WebFetch\"]\nplugin:\n  name: \"startup-business-analyst\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive startup business analysis with market sizing (TAM/SAM/SOM), financial modeling, team planning, and strategic research\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\n# Financial Projections\n\nCreate a comprehensive 3-5 year financial model with revenue projections, cost structure, headcount planning, cash flow analysis, and three-scenario modeling (conservative, base, optimistic) for startup financial planning and fundraising.\n\n## What This Command Does\n\nThis command builds a complete financial model including:\n\n1. Cohort-based revenue projections\n2. Detailed cost structure (COGS, S&M, R&D, G&A)\n3. Headcount planning by role\n4. Monthly cash flow analysis\n5. Key metrics (CAC, LTV, burn rate, runway)\n6. Three-scenario analysis\n\n## Instructions for Claude\n\nWhen this command is invoked, follow these steps:\n\n### Step 1: Gather Model Inputs\n\nAsk the user for essential information:\n\n**Business Model:**\n\n- Revenue model (SaaS, marketplace, transaction, etc.)\n- Pricing structure (tiers, average price)\n- Target customer segments\n\n**Starting Point:**\n\n- Current MRR/ARR (if any)\n- Current customer count\n- Current team size\n- Current cash balance\n\n**Growth Assumptions:**\n\n- Expected monthly customer acquisition\n- Customer retention/churn rate\n- Average contract value (ACV)\n- Sales cycle length\n\n**Cost Assumptions:**\n\n- Gross margin or COGS %\n- S&M budget or CAC target\n- Current burn rate (if applicable)\n\n**Funding:**\n\n- Planned fundraising (amount, timing)\n- Pre/post-money valuation\n\n### Step 2: Activate startup-financial-modeling Skill\n\nThe startup-financial-modeling skill provides frameworks. Reference it for:\n\n- Revenue modeling approaches\n- Cost structure templates\n- Headcount planning guidance\n- Scenario analysis methods\n\n### Step 3: Build Revenue Model\n\n**Use Cohort-Based Approach:**\n\nFor each month, track:\n\n1. New customers acquired\n2. Existing customers retained (apply churn)\n3. Revenue per cohort (customers × ARPU)\n4. Expansion revenue (upsells)\n\n**Formula:**\n\n```\nMRR (Month N) = Σ across all cohorts:\n  (Cohort Size × Retention Rate × ARPU) + Expansion\n```\n\n**Project:**\n\n- Monthly detail for Year 1-2\n- Quarterly detail for Year 3\n- Annual for Years 4-5\n\n### Step 4: Model Cost Structure\n\nBreak down operating expenses:\n\n**1. Cost of Goods Sold (COGS)**\n\n- Hosting/infrastructure (% of revenue or fixed)\n- Payment processing (% of revenue)\n- Variable customer support\n- Third-party services\n\nTarget gross margin:\n\n- SaaS: 75-85%\n- Marketplace: 60-70%\n- E-commerce: 40-60%\n\n**2. Sales & Marketing (S&M)**\n\n- Sales team compensation\n- Marketing programs\n- Tools and software\n- Target: 40-60% of revenue (early stage)\n\n**3. Research & Development (R&D)**\n\n- Engineering team\n- Product management\n- Design\n- Target: 30-40% of revenue\n\n**4. General & Administrative (G&A)**\n\n- Executive team\n- Finance, legal, HR\n- Office and facilities\n- Target: 15-25% of revenue\n\n### Step 5: Plan Headcount\n\nCreate role-by-role hiring plan:\n\n**Reference team-composition-analysis skill for:**\n\n- Roles by stage\n- Compensation benchmarks\n- Hiring velocity assumptions\n\n**For each role:**\n\n- Title and department\n- Start date (month/quarter)\n- Base salary\n- Fully-loaded cost (salary × 1.3-1.4)\n- Equity grant\n\n**Track departmental ratios:**\n\n- Engineering: 40-50% of team\n- Sales & Marketing: 25-35%\n- G&A: 10-15%\n- Product/CS: 10-15%\n\n### Step 6: Calculate Cash Flow\n\nMonthly cash flow projection:\n\n```\nBeginning Cash Balance\n+ Cash Collected (revenue, consider payment terms)\n- Operating Expenses\n- CapEx\n= Ending Cash Balance\n\nMonthly Burn = Revenue - Expenses (if negative)\nRunway = Cash Balance / Monthly Burn Rate\n```\n\n**Include Funding Events:**\n\n- Timing of raises\n- Amount raised\n- Use of proceeds\n- Impact on cash balance\n\n### Step 7: Compute Key Metrics\n\nCalculate monthly/quarterly:\n\n**Unit Economics:**\n\n- CAC (S&M spend / new customers)\n- LTV (ARPU × margin% / churn rate)\n- LTV:CAC ratio (target > 3.0)\n- CAC payback period (target < 18 months)\n\n**Efficiency Metrics:**\n\n- Burn multiple (net burn / net new ARR) - target < 2.0\n- Magic number (net new ARR / S&M spend) - target > 0.5\n- Rule of 40 (growth% + margin%) - target > 40%\n\n**Cash Metrics:**\n\n- Monthly burn rate\n- Runway in months\n- Cash efficiency\n\n### Step 8: Create Three Scenarios\n\nBuild conservative, base, and optimistic projections:\n\n**Conservative (P10):**\n\n- New customers: -30% vs. base\n- Churn: +20% vs. base\n- Pricing: -15% vs. base\n- CAC: +25% vs. base\n\n**Base (P50):**\n\n- Most likely assumptions\n- Primary planning scenario\n\n**Optimistic (P90):**\n\n- New customers: +30% vs. base\n- Churn: -20% vs. base\n- Pricing: +15% vs. base\n- CAC: -25% vs. base\n\n### Step 9: Generate Financial Model Report\n\nCreate comprehensive markdown report with tables:\n\n**Section 1: Executive Summary**\n\n- 3-5 year financial snapshot\n- Key metrics at scale\n- Funding requirements\n\n**Section 2: Model Assumptions**\n\n- Revenue model and pricing\n- Growth assumptions\n- Cost structure assumptions\n- Headcount plan summary\n\n**Section 3: Revenue Projections**\nMonthly/quarterly tables showing:\n\n```\n| Month | New Customers | Total Customers | MRR | ARR | Growth % |\n|-------|---------------|-----------------|-----|-----|----------|\n```\n\n**Section 4: Cost Breakdown**\n\n```\n| Department | Year 1 | Year 2 | Year 3 | % Revenue |\n|------------|--------|--------|--------|-----------|\n| COGS       | $X     | $Y     | $Z     | XX%       |\n| S&M        | $X     | $Y     | $Z     | XX%       |\n| R&D        | $X     | $Y     | $Z     | XX%       |\n| G&A        | $X     | $Y     | $Z     | XX%       |\n```\n\n**Section 5: Headcount Plan**\n\n```\n| Department | Current | Year 1 | Year 2 | Year 3 |\n|------------|---------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Engineering| X       | Y      | Z      | W      |\n```\n\n**Section 6: Cash Flow Analysis**\n\n```\n| Quarter | Revenue | Expenses | Net Burn | Cash Balance | Runway |\n|---------|---------|----------|----------|--------------|--------|\n```\n\n**Section 7: Key Metrics**\n\n```\n| Metric | Year 1 | Year 2 | Year 3 | Target |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| CAC | $X | $Y | $Z | <$A |\n| LTV | $X | $Y | $Z | >$B |\n| Burn Multiple | X | Y | Z | <2.0 |\n```\n\n**Section 8: Scenario Analysis**\n\n```\n| Scenario | Year 3 ARR | Customers | Burn | Runway |\n|----------|------------|-----------|------|--------|\n| Conservative | $Xم | Y | $Z | W mo |\n| Base | $X | Y | $Z | W mo |\n| Optimistic | $X | Y | $Z | W mo |\n```\n\n**Section 9: Funding Requirements**\n\n- Amount needed\n- Use of proceeds breakdown\n- Milestones to achieve\n- Expected valuation impact\n\n**Section 10: Validation**\n\n- Sanity checks performed\n- Benchmark comparisons\n- Risk factors\n- Assumptions to monitor\n\n### Step 10: Save Model\n\nOffer to save as markdown file:\n\n- Suggest filename: `financial-projections-YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- Include note that user can convert to Excel/Sheets\n- Provide formulas for key calculations\n\n## Financial Model Best Practices\n\n**Do:**\n\n- Use cohort-based revenue model\n- Include 3 scenarios\n- Show monthly detail (Year 1-2)\n- Calculate key metrics\n- Validate against benchmarks\n- Document all assumptions\n- Show cash flow and runway\n- Include fundraising milestones\n\n**Don''t:**\n\n- Be overly optimistic on growth\n- Underestimate costs\n- Forget fully-loaded compensation\n- Ignore cash timing\n- Skip scenario analysis\n- Use static headcount\n- Forget to validate\n\n## Integration with Other Commands\n\nPairs well with:\n\n- `/market-opportunity` - Use SOM for revenue ceiling\n- `/business-case` - Include projections in business case\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```\nUser: /financial-projections\n\nClaude: I''ll create a comprehensive financial model for your startup. Let me gather the key inputs.\n\nWhat''s your business model?\n→ \"B2B SaaS, subscription-based\"\n\nCurrent state?\n→ \"$50K MRR, 100 customers, 5-person team, $500K cash\"\n\nGrowth assumptions?\n→ \"Expect 15% MoM growth, 10% monthly churn, $500 ACV\"\n\n[Claude builds complete model with all sections]\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Model building takes 45-90 minutes\n- Results in comprehensive planning tool\n- Update monthly to track vs. actuals\n- Share with investors and board\n- Use for fundraising decks\n- Basis for budget and hiring decisions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:31:43.304Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Business Analysis Agents needing advanced financial modeling capabilities with revenue projections and market sizing (TAM/SAM/SOM).","zh":"非常适合需要高级财务建模能力的商业分析代理，包括收入预测和市场规模（TAM/SAM/SOM）","ja":"ビジネス分析エージェントが高度な財務モデリング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。収益予測と市場規模（TAM/SAM/SOM）が含まれます。","ko":"업무 분석 에이전트가 고급 재무 모델링 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. 수익 예측 및 시장 규모(TAM/SAM/SOM)를 포함합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de negocios que necesitan capacidades de modelado financiero avanzado con proyecciones de ingresos y tamaño de mercado (TAM/SAM/SOM).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse commerciale ayant besoin de capacités de modélisation financière avancée avec des prévisions de revenus et une taille de marché (TAM/SAM/SOM).","de":"Perfekt für Geschäftsanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte Finanzmodellierungs-Funktionen mit Umsatzprognosen und Marktgroßenschätzung (TAM/SAM/SOM) benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Negócios que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de modelagem financeira com projetos de receita e dimensionamento de mercado (TAM/SAM/SOM).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-аналитики, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности финансового моделирования с прогнозами доходов и размером рынка (TAM/SAM/SOM).","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الأعمال الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات نمذجة مالية متقدمة مع توقعات الإيرادات وتحجيم السوق (TAM/SAM/SOM)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive 3-5 year financial models with revenue projections, utilizing semantic conventions for AI telemetry and OTLP ingestion for GenAI/LLM workloads, and leveraging DuckDB storage for efficient data management.","zh":"使代理能够创建全面性的3-5年财务模型，包括收入预测，利用语义约定进行AI遥测和OTLP摄取用于GenAI/LLM工作负载，并利用DuckDB存储进行高效的数据管理","ja":"エージェントが包括的な3-5年間の財務モデルを作成できるようにし、収益予測を使用し、AIテレメトリとOTLPの取り込みを使用してGenAI/LLMのワークロードに利用し、DuckDBストレージを使用して効率的なデータ管理を行う","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 3-5년 재무 모델을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 수익 예측을 사용하고, AI 원격 측정 및 OTLP 수집을 사용하여 GenAI/LLM 워크로드에 활용하며, DuckDB 스토리지를 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 관리를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear modelos financieros integrales de 3-5 años con proyecciones de ingresos, utilizando convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA y ingestión de OTLP para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM, y aprovechando el almacenamiento de DuckDB para una gestión de datos eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des modèles financiers complets de 3-5 ans avec des prévisions de revenus, en utilisant des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA et l''ingestion de l''OTLP pour les charges de travail de GenAI/LLM, et en exploitant le stockage de DuckDB pour une gestion des données efficace.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, umfassende Finanzmodelle mit Umsatzprognosen für 3-5 Jahre zu erstellen, unter Verwendung semantischer Konventionen für die Telemetrie von KI und OTLP-Eingabe für GenAI/LLM-Arbeitslasten und unter Ausnutzung des DuckDB-Speichers für eine effiziente Datenverwaltung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar modelos financeiros abrangentes de 3-5 anos com projetos de receita, utilizando convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA e ingestão de OTLP para cargas de trabalho de GenAI/LLM, e aproveitando o armazenamento DuckDB para gestão de dados eficiente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать комплексные финансовые модели на 3-5 лет с прогнозами доходов, используя семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ и ингестию OTLP для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM, и использует хранилище DuckDB для эффективного управления данными.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء نماذج مالية شاملة لمدة 3-5 سنوات مع توقعات الإيرادات، باستخدام الاتفاقيات الدلالية لتелеметрия الذكاء الاصطناعي وامتصاص OTLP لتحملات عمل GenAI/LLM، وتحقيق الاستفادة من تخزين DuckDB لإدارة البيانات الفعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating financial projections for startup businesses","Analyzing market sizing (TAM/SAM/SOM) for strategic research","Creating comprehensive financial models with revenue projections for team planning"],"zh":["为初创企业生成财务预测","分析市场规模（TAM/SAM/SOM）用于战略研究","为团队规划创建包含收入预测的综合财务模型"],"ja":["スタートアップ企業の財務予測を生成する","戦略研究のための市場規模（TAM/SAM/SOM）を分析する","チーム計画のための収益予測を含む包括的な財務モデルを作成する"],"ko":["스타트업 기업을 위한 재무 예측 생성","전략 연구를 위한 시장 규모(TAM/SAM/SOM) 분석","팀 계획을 위한 수익 예측을 포함한 포괄적인 재무 모델 생성"],"es":["Generación de proyecciones financieras para empresas de inicio","Análisis del tamaño del mercado (TAM/SAM/SOM) para investigación estratégica","Creación de modelos financieros integrales con proyecciones de ingresos para la planificación del equipo"],"fr":["Génération de prévisions financières pour les entreprises de démarrage","Analyse de la taille du marché (TAM/SAM/SOM) pour la recherche stratégique","Création de modèles financiers complets avec des prévisions de revenus pour la planification de l''équipe"],"de":["Erstellung von Finanzprognosen für Start-up-Unternehmen","Analyse der Marktgroßenschätzung (TAM/SAM/SOM) für strategische Forschung","Erstellung umfassender Finanzmodelle mit Umsatzprognosen für die Teamplanung"],"pt":["Geração de projeções financeiras para empresas de startup","Análise do dimensionamento do mercado (TAM/SAM/SOM) para pesquisa estratégica","Criação de modelos financeiros abrangentes com projetos de receita para planejamento de equipe"],"ru":["Генерация финансовых прогнозов для стартапов","Анализ размера рынка (TAM/SAM/SOM) для стратегических исследований","Создание комплексных финансовых моделей с прогнозами доходов для планирования команды"],"ar":["توليد توقعات مالية لشركات الإطلاق","تحليل حجم السوق (TAM/SAM/SOM) لبحوث استراتيجية","إنشاء نماذج مالية شاملة مع توقعات الإيرادات لتخطيط الفريق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to financial data and market research","Limited to 3-5 year financial modeling","Dependent on OTLP ingestion and DuckDB storage for data management"],"zh":["需要访问财务数据和市场研究","仅限3-5年财务建模","依赖OTLP摄取和DuckDB存储进行数据管理"],"ja":["財務データと市場研究へのアクセスが必要","財務モデリングは3-5年間に限定される","データ管理のためにOTLPの取り込みとDuckDBストレージに依存する"],"ko":["재무 데이터 및 시장 연구에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","재무 모델링은 3-5년으로 제한됩니다.","데이터 관리를 위해 OTLP 수집 및 DuckDB 스토리지에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos financieros y investigación de mercado","Limitado a la modelización financiera de 3-5 años","Dependiente de la ingestión de OTLP y el almacenamiento de DuckDB para la gestión de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux données financières et à la recherche de marché","Limité à la modélisation financière de 3-5 ans","Dépendant de l''ingestion de l''OTLP et du stockage de DuckDB pour la gestion des données"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf Finanzdaten und Marktforschung","Begrenzt auf die Finanzmodellierung von 3-5 Jahren","Abhängig von der OTLP-Eingabe und dem DuckDB-Speicher für die Datenverwaltung"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados financeiros e pesquisas de mercado","Limitado a modelagem financeira de 3-5 anos","Dependente da ingestão de OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB para gestão de dados"],"ru":["Требует доступа к финансовым данным и рыночным исследованиям","Ограничен финансовым моделированием на 3-5 лет","Зависит от ингестию OTLP и хранилища DuckDB для управления данными"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى البيانات المالية وأبحاث السوق","محدود بنمذجة مالية لمدة 3-5 سنوات","يعتمد على امتصاص OTLP وتخزين DuckDB لإدارة البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yusuke124358/keiba/jravan-spec-to-schema', 'community', 'yusuke124358', 'keiba', 'yusuke124358/keiba', 'jravan-spec-to-schema', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z', '2026-02-18T08:31:51.334Z', NULL, '{"id":"yusuke124358/keiba/jravan-spec-to-schema","name":"jravan-spec-to-schema","description":{"zh":"JRA-VAN Spec 到 Schema 生成工具用于生成和更新 JRA-VAN JSON 模式，并验证输出","ja":"JRA-VAN Spec から Schema 生成ツールは、JRA-VAN JSON スキーマを生成および更新し、出力の検証を実行","ko":"JRA-VAN Spec에서 Schema 생성 도구는 JRA-VAN JSON 스키마를 생성하고 업데이트하며 출력을 검증","es":"jravan-spec-to-schema es una herramienta para generar o actualizar esquemas JSON de JRA-VAN a partir de especificaciones markdown y validar los resultados.","fr":"jravan-spec-to-schema est un outil pour générer ou mettre à jour des schémas JSON JRA-VAN à partir de spécifications markdown et valider les résultats.","de":"jravan-spec-to-schema ist ein Tool zum Erstellen oder Aktualisieren von JSON-Schemata für JRA-VAN aus markdown-Spezifikationen und Überprüfen der Ergebnisse.","pt":"jravan-spec-to-schema é uma ferramenta que gera ou atualiza esquemas JSON JRA-VAN a partir de especificações em markdown e valida as saídas.","ru":"jravan-spec-to-schema — это инструмент, который генерирует или обновляет схемы JSON JRA-VAN из спецификаций markdown и проверяет выходные данные.","ar":"jravan-spec-to-schema هي أداة لتوليد أو تحديث مخططات JSON JRA-VAN من مواصفات markdown وvalidate المخرجات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"JRA-VAN Spec 到 Schema 生成工具","ja":"JRA-VAN Spec から Schema 生成ツール","ko":"JRA-VAN Spec에서 Schema 생성 도구","es":"jravan-spec-to-schema: Generación de Esquemas JSON","fr":"jravan-spec-to-schema : Génération de Schémas JSON","de":"jravan-spec-to-schema: Erstellung von JSON-Schemata","pt":"jravan-spec-to-schema: Ferramenta de Geração de Esquemas","ru":"jravan-spec-to-schema: Инструмент генерации схем","ar":"