ces de l''équipe","Identification des domaines d''amélioration","Élaboration de plans d''action pour améliorer les résultats"],"de":["Entwurf optimaler Teamstrukturen","Planung von Einstellungen und Vergütungsstrategien","Analyse der Teamstruktur und -leistung","Identifizierung von Verbesserungsbereichen","Erstellung von Aktionsplänen zur Ergebnisverbesserung"],"pt":["Otimização de estruturas de equipe","Planejamento de contratação","Estratégias de compensação","Alocação de ações","Análise de mercado","Modelagem financeira"],"ru":["Оптимизация структур команд","Планирование найма","Стратегии компенсации","Распределение акций","Анализ рынка","Финансовое моделирование"],"ar":["تحسين هياكل الفريق","خطط التوظيف","استراتيجيات التعويض","تخصيص الأسهم","تحليل السوق","النمذجة المالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["团队组成分析","AI Observability Platform","OTLP","DuckDB","语义约定","AI遥测","团队结构优化","招聘计划","补偿策略","股权分配"],"ja":["チーム構成分析","AI Observability Platform","OTLP","DuckDB","セマンティック規約","AIテレメトリ","チーム構成最適化","採用計画","補償戦略","株式分配"],"ko":["팀 구성 분석","AI Observability Platform","OTLP","DuckDB","의미 규약","AI 원격 측정","팀 구조 최적화","채용 계획","보상 전략","주식 배분"],"es":["análisis de composición de equipo","startups","estructura de equipo","planificación de contrataciones","estrategias de compensación","desarrollo de equipo","mejora del desempeño","análisis de rendimiento"],"fr":["analyse de composition d''équipe","startups","structure d''équipe","planification des embauches","stratégies de rémunération","développement d''équipe","amélioration des résultats","analyse de performance"],"de":["Teamzusammensetzungsanalyse","Startups","Teamstruktur","Einstellungsplanung","Vergütungsstrategien","Teamentwicklung","Ergebnisverbesserung","Leistungsanalyse"],"pt":["análise de composição de equipe","startups","estruturas de equipe","planejamento de contratação","estratégias de compensação","otimização de equipe","desenvolvimento de equipes","gestão de equipes"],"ru":["анализ состава команды","стартапы","структуры команд","планирование найма","стратегии компенсации","оптимизация команды","развитие команд","управление командами"],"ar":["تحليل تكوين الفريق","رواد الأعمال","هياكل الفريق","خطط التوظيف","استراتيجيات التعويض","تحسين الفريق","تطوير الفريق","إدارة الفريق"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"team-composition-analysis","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  version: 1.0.0\nplugin:\n  name: \"startup-business-analyst\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive startup business analysis with market sizing (TAM/SAM/SOM), financial modeling, team planning, and strategic research\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\n# Team Composition Analysis\n\nDesign optimal team structures, hiring plans, compensation strategies, and equity allocation for early-stage startups from pre-seed through Series A","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  version: 1.0.0\nplugin:\n  name: \"startup-business-analyst\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive startup business analysis with market sizing (TAM/SAM/SOM), financial modeling, team planning, and strategic research\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\n# Team Composition Analysis\n\nDesign optimal team structures, hiring plans, compensation strategies, and equity allocation for early-stage startups from pre-seed through Series A.\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild the right team at the right time with appropriate compensation and equity. Plan role-by-role hiring aligned with revenue milestones, budget constraints, and market benchmarks.\n\n## Team Structure by Stage\n\n### Pre-Seed (0-$500K ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 2-5 people**\n\n**Core Roles:**\n\n- Founders (2-3): Product, engineering, business\n- First engineer (if needed)\n- Contract roles: Design, marketing\n\n**Focus:** Build and validate product-market fit\n\n### Seed ($500K-$2M ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 5-15 people**\n\n**Key Hires:**\n\n- Engineering lead + 2-3 engineers\n- First sales/business development\n- Product manager\n- Marketing/growth lead\n\n**Focus:** Scale product and prove repeatable sales\n\n### Series A ($2M-$10M ARR)\n\n**Team Size: 15-50 people**\n\n**Department Build-Out:**\n\n- Engineering (40%): 6-20 people\n- Sales & Marketing (30%): 5-15 people\n- Customer Success (10%): 2-5 people\n- G&A (10%): 2-5 people\n- Product (10%): 2-5 people\n\n**Focus:** Scale revenue and build repeatable processes\n\n## Role-by-Role Planning\n\n### Engineering Team\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founders write code\n- 0-1 contract developers\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- Engineering Lead (first $150K-$180K)\n- 2-3 Full-Stack Engineers ($120K-$150K)\n- 1 Frontend or Backend Specialist ($130K-$160K)\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- VP Engineering ($180K-$250K + equity)\n- 2-3 Senior Engineers ($150K-$180K)\n- 3-5 Mid-Level Engineers ($120K-$150K)\n- 1-2 Junior Engineers ($90K-$120K)\n- 1 DevOps/Infrastructure ($140K-$170K)\n\n### Sales & Marketing\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founders do sales\n- Contract marketing help\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- First Sales Hire / Head of Sales ($120K-$150K + commission)\n- Marketing/Growth Lead ($100K-$140K)\n- SDR or BDR (if B2B) ($50K-$70K + commission)\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- VP Sales ($150K-$200K + commission + equity)\n- 3-5 Account Executives ($80K-$120K + commission)\n- 2-3 SDRs/BDRs ($50K-$70K + commission)\n- Marketing Manager ($90K-$130K)\n- Content/Demand Gen ($70K-$100K)\n\n### Product Team\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founder as product lead\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- First Product Manager ($120K-$150K)\n- Contract designer\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- Head of Product ($150K-$180K)\n- 1-2 Product Managers ($120K-$150K)\n- Product Designer ($100K-$140K)\n- UX Researcher (optional) ($90K-$130K)\n\n### Customer Success\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Founders handle support\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- First CS hire (optional) ($60K-$90K)\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- CS Manager ($100K-$130K)\n- 2-4 CS Representatives ($60K-$90K)\n- Support Engineer (technical) ($80K-$120K)\n\n### G&A (General & Administrative)\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n- Contractors (accounting, legal)\n\n**Seed:**\n\n- Operations/Office Manager ($70K-$100K)\n- Contract CFO\n\n**Series A:**\n\n- CFO or Finance Lead ($150K-$200K)\n- Recruiter ($80K-$120K)\n- Office Manager / EA ($60K-$90K)\n\n## Compensation Strategy\n\n### Base Salary Benchmarks (US, 2024)\n\n**Engineering:**\n\n- Junior: $90K-$120K\n- Mid-Level: $120K-$150K\n- Senior: $150K-$180K\n- Staff/Principal: $180K-$220K\n- Engineering Manager: $160K-$200K\n- VP Engineering: $180K-$250K\n\n**Sales:**\n\n- SDR/BDR: $50K-$70K base + $50K-$70K commission\n- Account Executive: $80K-$120K base + $80K-$120K commission\n- Sales Manager: $120K-$160K base + $80K-$120K commission\n- VP Sales: $150K-$200K base + $150K-$200K commission\n\n**Product:**\n\n- Product Manager: $120K-$150K\n- Senior PM: $150K-$180K\n- Head of Product: $150K-$180K\n- VP Product: $180K-$220K\n\n**Marketing:**\n\n- Marketing Manager: $90K-$130K\n- Content/Demand Gen: $70K-$100K\n- Head of Marketing: $130K-$170K\n- VP Marketing: $150K-$200K\n\n**Customer Success:**\n\n- CS Representative: $60K-$90K\n- CS Manager: $100K-$130K\n- VP Customer Success: $140K-$180K\n\n### Total Compensation Formula\n\n```\nTotal Comp = Base Salary × 1.30 (benefits & taxes) + Equity Value\n```\n\n**Fully-Loaded Cost:**\n\n- Base salary\n- Payroll taxes (7.65% FICA)\n- Benefits (health insurance, 401k): $10K-$15K per employee\n- Other (workspace, equipment, software): $5K-$10K per employee\n\n**Rule of Thumb:** Multiply base salary by 1.3-1.4 for fully-loaded cost\n\n### Geographic Adjustments\n\n**San Francisco / New York:** +20-30% above benchmarks\n**Seattle / Boston / Los Angeles:** +10-20%\n**Austin / Denver / Chicago:** +0-10%\n**Remote / Other US Cities:** -10-20%\n**International:** Varies widely by country\n\n## Equity Allocation\n\n### Equity by Role and Stage\n\n**Founders:**\n\n- First founder: 40-60%\n- Second founder: 20-40%\n- Third founder: 10-20%\n- Vesting: 4 years with 1-year cliff\n\n**Early Employees (Pre-Seed):**\n\n- First engineer: 0.5-2.0%\n- First 5 employees: 0.25-1.0% each\n\n**Seed Stage Hires:**\n\n- VP/Head level: 0.5-1.5%\n- Senior IC: 0.1-0.5%\n- Mid-level: 0.05-0.25%\n- Junior: 0.01-0.1%\n\n**Series A Hires:**\n\n- C-level (CTO, CFO): 1.0-3.0%\n- VP level: 0.3-1.0%\n- Director level: 0.1-0.5%\n- Senior IC: 0.05-0.2%\n- Mid-level: 0.01-0.1%\n- Junior: 0.005-0.05%\n\n### Equity Pool Sizing\n\n**Option Pool by Round:**\n\n- Pre-Seed: 10-15% reserved\n- Seed: 10-15% top-up\n- Series A: 10-15% top-up\n- Series B+: 5-10% per round\n\n**Pre-Funding Dilution:**\nInvestors often require option pool creation before investment, diluting founders.\n\n**Example:**\n\n```\nPre-money: $10M\nInvestors want 15% option pool post-money\n\nCalculation:\nPost-money: $15M ($10M + $5M investment)\nOption pool: $2.25M (15% × $15M)\nFounders diluted by pool creation before new money\n```\n\n## Organizational Design\n\n### Reporting Structure\n\n**Pre-Seed:**\n\n```\nFounders (flat structure)\n├── Contractors\n└── First hires (report to founders)\n```\n\n**Seed:**\n\n```\nCEO\n├── Engineering Lead (2-4 engineers)\n├── Sales/Growth Lead (1-2 reps)\n├── Product Manager\n└── Operations\n```\n\n**Series A:**\n\n```\nCEO\n├── CTO / VP Engineering (6-20 people)\n│   ├── Engineering Manager(s)\n│   └── Individual Contributors\n├── VP Sales (5-15 people)\n│   ├── Sales Manager\n│   ├── Account Executives\n│   └── SDRs\n├── Head of Product (2-5 people)\n│   ├── Product Managers\n│   └── Designers\n├── Head of Customer Success (2-5 people)\n└── CFO / Finance Lead (2-5 people)\n    ├── Recruiter\n    └── Operations\n```\n\n### Span of Control\n\n**Manager Ratios:**\n\n- First-line managers: 4-8 direct reports\n- Directors: 3-5 direct reports (managers)\n- VPs: 3-5 direct reports (directors)\n- CEO: 5-8 direct reports (executive team)\n\n## Full-Time vs. Contract\n\n### Use Full-Time for:\n\n- Core product development\n- Sales (revenue-generating roles)\n- Mission-critical operations\n- Institutional knowledge roles\n\n### Use Contractors for:\n\n- Specialized short-term needs (legal, accounting)\n- Variable workload (design, marketing campaigns)\n- Skills outside core competency\n- Testing role before FTE hire\n- Geographic expansion before permanent presence\n\n### Cost Comparison\n\n**Full-Time:**\n\n- Lower hourly cost\n- Benefits and overhead\n- Long-term commitment\n- Cultural fit matters\n\n**Contract:**\n\n- Higher hourly rate ($75-$200/hour vs. $40-$100/hour FTE equivalent)\n- No benefits or overhead\n- Flexible engagement\n- Easier to scale up/down\n\n## Hiring Velocity\n\n### Realistic Timeline\n\n**Role Opening to Hire:**\n\n- Junior: 6-8 weeks\n- Mid-Level: 8-12 weeks\n- Senior: 12-16 weeks\n- Executive: 16-24 weeks\n\n**Time to Productivity:**\n\n- Junior: 4-6 months\n- Mid-Level: 2-4 months\n- Senior: 1-3 months\n- Executive: 3-6 months\n\n### Planning Buffer\n\nAlways add 2-3 months buffer to hiring plans.\n\n**Example:**\nIf need engineer by July 1:\n\n- Start recruiting: April 1 (12 weeks)\n- Productivity: September 1 (2 months ramp)\n\n## Budget Planning\n\n### Compensation as % of Revenue\n\n**Early Stage (Seed):**\n\n- Total comp: 120-150% of revenue (burning cash to grow)\n- Engineering: 50-60%\n- Sales: 30-40%\n- Other: 20-30%\n\n**Growth Stage (Series A):**\n\n- Total comp: 70-100% of revenue\n- Engineering: 35-45%\n- Sales: 25-35%\n- Other: 20-30%\n\n### Headcount Budget Formula\n\n```\nTotal Comp Budget = Σ (Role Count × Fully-Loaded Cost × % of Year)\n\nExample:\n3 Engineers × $202K × 100% = $606K\n2 AEs × $230K × 75% (mid-year start) = $345K\n1 PM × $162K × 100% = $162K\nTotal: $1.1M\n```\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\n- **`references/compensation-benchmarks.md`** - Detailed salary data by role, level, and location\n- **`references/equity-calculator.md`** - Equity sizing formulas and dilution scenarios\n\n### Example Files\n\n- **`examples/seed-stage-hiring-plan.md`** - Complete hiring plan for seed-stage SaaS company\n- **`examples/org-chart-evolution.md`** - Organizational design from 5 to 50 people\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo plan team composition:\n\n1. **Identify stage** - Pre-seed, seed, or Series A\n2. **Define roles** - What functions are needed now\n3. **Prioritize hires** - Critical path for business goals\n4. **Set compensation** - Base salary + equity by level\n5. **Plan timeline** - Account for recruiting and ramp time\n6. **Calculate budget** - Fully-loaded cost × headcount\n7. **Design org chart** - Reporting structure and span of control\n8. **Allocate equity** - Fair allocation that preserves pool\n\nFor detailed compensation benchmarks and hiring plan templates, see `references/` and `examples/`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:32:12.860Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Business Strategy Agents needing advanced team planning and composition analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级团队规划和组成分析能力的商业策略代理","ja":"ビジネスストラテジーエージェントが高度なチーム計画と構成分析機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 팀 계획 및 구성 분석 기능이 필요한 비즈니스 전략 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Estrategia Empresarial que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de planificación y análisis de composición de equipo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Stratégie d''Entreprise ayant besoin de capacités avancées de planification et d''analyse de composition d''équipe.","de":"Perfekt für Geschäftsstrategie-Agenten, die erweiterte Teamplanungs- und Zusammensetzungsanalysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Estratégia de Negócios que necessitam de planejamento e análise de composição de equipe avançados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по бизнес-стратегии, которым требуются продвинутые возможности планирования и анализа состава команды.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل استراتيجية الأعمال التي تحتاج إلى تخطيط وتحليل متقدم لقوام الفريق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design optimal team structures, create hiring plans, develop compensation strategies, and allocate equity using semantic conventions for AI telemetry and OTLP ingestion, stored in DuckDB for comprehensive analysis.","zh":"赋予代理设计最优团队结构、创建招聘计划、开发补偿策略和分配股权的能力，使用语义约定进行AI遥测和OTLP摄取，并将其存储在DuckDB中进行全面的分析","ja":"エージェントが最適なチーム構造を設計し、採用計画を作成し、報酬戦略を開発し、語彙的規約を使用してAIテレメトリとOTLPの取り込みを行い、DuckDBに格納して包括的な分析を行うことができる","ko":"에이전트가 최적의 팀 구조를 설계하고, 채용 계획을 만들고, 보상 전략을 개발하고, 의미 규약을 사용하여 AI 원격 측정 및 OTLP 수신을 수행하며, 이를 DuckDB에 저장하여 포괄적인 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 하는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar estructuras de equipo óptimas, crear planes de contratación, desarrollar estrategias de compensación y asignar participaciones utilizando convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA y ingesta de OTLP, almacenadas en DuckDB para un análisis integral.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des structures d''équipe optimales, de créer des plans d''embauche, d''élaborer des stratégies de rémunération et d''attribuer des participations en utilisant des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie IA et l''ingestion OTLP, stockées dans DuckDB pour une analyse complète.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, optimale Teamstrukturen zu entwerfen, Einstellungspläne zu erstellen, Vergütungsstrategien zu entwickeln und Anteile zuzuweisen, indem sie semantische Konventionen für die Telemetrie von künstlicher Intelligenz und die OTLP-Erfassung verwenden, die in DuckDB für eine umfassende Analyse gespeichert werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes projetem estruturas de equipe ótimas, criem planos de contratação, desenvolvam estratégias de compensação e alocem equity utilizando convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA e ingestão de OTLP, armazenadas no DuckDB para análise abrangente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать оптимальные структуры команд, создавать планы набора персонала, разрабатывать стратегии компенсации и распределять акционерный капитал, используя семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ и ингестии OTLP, хранящиеся в DuckDB для всестороннего анализа.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تصميم هياكل فريق مثالية، وإنشاء خطط توظيف، وتطوير استراتيجيات تعويض، وتخصيص الأسهم باستخدام الاتفاقيات الدلالية لتحليل تيليمتري ال IA وامتصاص OTLP، مخزنة في DuckDB لتحليل شامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing team composition for early-stage startups","Generating hiring plans and compensation strategies","Optimizing equity allocation for Series A startups"],"zh":["分析初创公司的团队组成","生成招聘计划和补偿策略","优化A轮初创公司的股权分配"],"ja":["スタートアップのチーム構成を分析する","採用計画と報酬戦略を生成する","シリーズAのスタートアップの株式配分を最適化する"],"ko":["초기 창업 기업의 팀 구성 분석","채용 계획 및 보상 전략 생성","시리즈 A 초기 창업 기업의 주식 할당 최적화"],"es":["Análisis de la composición del equipo para startups en etapas tempranas","Generación de planes de contratación y estrategias de compensación","Optimización de la asignación de participaciones para startups de Serie A"],"fr":["Analyse de la composition de l''équipe pour les startups en stade précoce","Génération de plans d''embauche et de stratégies de rémunération","Optimisation de l''attribution de parts pour les startups de série A"],"de":["Analyse der Teamzusammensetzung für Startups in der Frühphase","Erstellung von Einstellungsplänen und Vergütungsstrategien","Optimierung der Anteilszuweisung für Startups der Serie A"],"pt":["Analisar a composição da equipe para startups em estágio inicial","Gerar planos de contratação e estratégias de compensação","Otimizar a alocação de equity para startups de Série A"],"ru":["Анализ состава команды для стартапов на ранней стадии","Генерация планов набора персонала и стратегий компенсации","Оптимизация распределения акционерного капитала для стартапов серии А"],"ar":["تحليل ترکیة الفريق لبدء التشغيل في مرحلة مبكرة","إنشاء خطط توظيف واستراتيجيات تعويض","تحسين تخصيص الأسهم لبدء التشغيل من السلسلة أ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OTLP ingestion setup","DuckDB storage necessary for data analysis","Limited to early-stage startups from pre-seed through Series A"],"zh":["需要OTLP摄取设置","需要DuckDB存储进行数据分析","仅限初创公司，从种子轮到A轮"],"ja":["OTLPの取り込み設定が必要","データ分析のためにDuckDBのストレージが必要","シードラウンドからシリーズAまでのスタートアップに限定"],"ko":["OTLP 수신 설정이 필요","데이터 분석을 위해 DuckDB 저장소가 필요","시드 라운드부터 시리즈 A까지의 초기 창업 기업에 한정"],"es":["Requiere configuración de ingesta de OTLP","Almacenamiento de DuckDB necesario para el análisis de datos","Limitado a startups en etapas tempranas desde la etapa presemilla hasta la Serie A"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''ingestion OTLP","Stockage DuckDB nécessaire pour l''analyse des données","Limité aux startups en stade précoce de la présemence à la série A"],"de":["Benötigt OTLP-Erfassungseinrichtung","DuckDB-Speicherung erforderlich für die Datenanalyse","Begrenzt auf Startups in der Frühphase von der Vorsaat bis zur Serie A"],"pt":["Requer configuração de ingestão de OTLP","Armazenamento do DuckDB necessário para análise de dados","Limitado a startups em estágio inicial, desde a pré-semente até a Série A"],"ru":["Требуется настройка ингестии OTLP","Необходимо хранение в DuckDB для анализа данных","Ограничен для стартапов на ранней стадии, от предпосева до серии А"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد امتصاص OTLP","الاحتفاظ بالبيانات في DuckDB ضروري للتحليل الشامل","محدود لبدء التشغيل في مرحلة مبكرة، من قبل البذرة إلى السلسلة أ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rrih/rrih.github.io/achievement-tree-design-system', 'community', 'rrih', 'rrih.github.io', 'rrih/rrih.github.io', 'achievement-tree-design-system', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z', '2026-02-18T08:33:03.605Z', NULL, '{"id":"rrih/rrih.github.io/achievement-tree-design-system","name":"achievement-tree-design-system","description":{"zh":"成就树设计系统是一种自定义UI解决方案，帮助开发者创建独特的用户体验","ja":"実績ツリー設計システムは、開発者が独自のユーザーエクスペリエンスを構築できるカスタムUIソリューションです","ko":"성과 트리 디자인 시스템은 개발자가 고유한 사용자 경험을 구축할 수 있는 커스텀 UI 솔루션입니다","es":"El sistema de diseño de árbol de logros permite crear aplicaciones con una interfaz de usuario personalizada y coherente","fr":"Le système de conception d''arbre de réalisations permet de créer des applications avec une interface utilisateur personnalisée et cohérente","de":"Das Achievement-Tree-Design-System ermöglicht die Erstellung von Anwendungen mit einer benutzerdefinierten und konsistenten Benutzeroberfläche","pt":"O sistema de design de árvore de realizações visa criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e coesas.","ru":"Система дизайна дерева достижений направлена на создание индивидуальных и целостных пользовательских интерфейсов.","ar":"ينصب نظام تصميم شجرة الإنجازات على إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة ومتسقة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"自定义成就树设计系统","ja":"カスタム実績ツリー設計システム","ko":"커스텀 성과 트리 디자인 시스템","es":"Diseño de sistema de árbol de logros personalizado","fr":"Système de conception d''arbre de réalisations sur mesure","de":"Benutzerdefiniertes Achievement-Tree-Design-System","pt":"Sistema de Design de Árvore de Realizações","ru":"Система Дизайна Дерева Достижений","ar":"نظام تصميم شجرة الإنجازات","en":"achievement-tree-design-system"},"description":{"zh":"成就树设计系统是一种自定义UI解决方案，帮助开发者创建独特的用户体验","ja":"実績ツリー設計システムは、開発者が独自のユーザーエクスペリエンスを構築できるカスタムUIソリューションです","ko":"성과 트리 디자인 시스템은 개발자가 고유한 사용자 경험을 구축할 수 있는 커스텀 UI 솔루션입니다","es":"El sistema de diseño de árbol de logros permite crear aplicaciones con una interfaz de usuario personalizada y coherente","fr":"Le système de conception d''arbre de réalisations permet de créer des applications avec une interface utilisateur personnalisée et cohérente","de":"Das Achievement-Tree-Design-System ermöglicht die Erstellung von Anwendungen mit einer benutzerdefinierten und konsistenten Benutzeroberfläche","pt":"O sistema de design de árvore de realizações visa criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e coesas.","ru":"Система дизайна дерева достижений направлена на создание индивидуальных и целостных пользовательских интерфейсов.","ar":"ينصب نظام تصميم شجرة الإنجازات على إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة ومتسقة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自定义布局","一致的设计风格","无默认样式依赖","小巧、连贯的设计原子","灵活的间距设置"],"ja":["カスタムレイアウト","一貫したデザインスタイル","デフォルトスタイルへの依存なし","小さくて一貫したデザイン原子","柔軟なスペーシング設定"],"ko":["커스텀 레이아웃","일관된 디자인 스타일","기본 스타일 의존하지 않음","작고 일관된 디자인 원자","유연한 간격 설정"],"es":["Diseño personalizado sin dependencia de CSS global","Uso de Shadow DOM para una mayor flexibilidad","Definición de un ritmo de diseño coherente","Uso de un conjunto pequeño y coherente de primitivas","Evitación de patrones genéricos de diseño"],"fr":["Conception personnalisée sans dépendance à la CSS globale","Utilisation de Shadow DOM pour une plus grande flexibilité","Définition d''un rythme de conception cohérent","Utilisation d''un ensemble petit et cohérent de primitives","Évitement des modèles de conception génériques"],"de":["Benutzerdefiniertes Design ohne Abhängigkeit von globaler CSS","Verwendung von Shadow DOM für eine größere Flexibilität","Definition eines konsistenten Designrhythmus","Verwendung eines kleinen und konsistenten Satzes von Primitiven","Vermeidung von generischen Designmustern"],"pt":["Layout ritmado com unidade de espaçamento base de 8px","Evitação de padrões genéricos de cartão e sombra","Uso de um conjunto pequeno e coeso de primitivas","Consistência de ritmo visual","Nenhum uso de CSS global ou Tailwind"],"ru":["Ритмичная компоновка с базовой единицей间ранения 8 пикселей","Избежание общих шаблонов карты и тени","Использование небольшого и целостного набора примитивов","Последовательность визуального ритма","Нет использования глобального CSS или Tailwind"],"ar":["تنسيق يتبع إيقاعًا مع وحدة المسافة الأساسية 8 بكسل","تجنب الأنماط العامة للبطاقة والظل","استخدام مجموعة صغيرة ومتسقة من البدائيات","اتساق في الإيقاع البصري","لا يتم استخدام CSS عالمي أو Tailwind"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自定义UI","成就树设计系统","设计模式","用户体验","开发者工具","前端开发"],"ja":["カスタムUI","実績ツリー設計システム","デザインパターン","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","開発者ツール","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["커스텀 UI","성과 트리 디자인 시스템","디자인 패턴","사용자 경험","개발자 도구","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["diseño de árbol de logros","sistema de diseño personalizado","Shadow DOM","ritmo de diseño","primitivas de diseño","desarrollo de aplicaciones","interfaz de usuario personalizada","diseño de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["conception d''arbre de réalisations","système de conception personnalisé","Shadow DOM","rythme de conception","primitives de conception","développement d''applications","interface utilisateur personnalisée","conception d''applications web"],"de":["Achievement-Tree-Design","benutzerdefiniertes Design-System","Shadow DOM","Designrhythmus","Designprimitiven","Anwendungsentwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberfläche","Webanwendungsdesign"],"pt":["sistema de design de árvore de realizações","interface de usuário personalizada","layout ritmado","evitar padrões genéricos","desenvolvimento de software","ux design","ui design","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["система дизайна дерева достижений","индивидуальный пользовательский интерфейс","ритмичная компоновка","избежание общих шаблонов","разработка программного обеспечения","ux дизайн","ui дизайн","разработчики"],"ar":["نظام تصميم شجرة الإنجازات","واجهة مستخدم مخصصة","تنسيق يتبع إيقاعًا","تجنب الأنماط العامة","تطوير البرمجيات","ux تصميم","ui تصميم","مطورون"]}},"owner":"rrih","repo":"rrih.github.io","repoPath":"rrih/rrih.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"achievement-tree-design-system","description":"Use when building UI for the achievement-tree app. Enforces a distinctive, zero-base visual + interaction system (NOT generic Codex UI).","bodyPreview":"# Goal\nProduce a UI that does NOT look like default agent-generated apps. It must feel like a crafted product.\n\n# Non-negotiables\n- No reliance on existing global CSS/Tailwind look. The app UI lives in Shadow DOM and ships its own reset + styles.\n- Avoid generic \"card + soft shadow + rounded-lg + gray background\" patterns unless explicitly justified.\n- Use a small, coherent set of primitives with consistent rhythm.\n\n# Visual system (define + follow)\n1) Layout rhythm\n- Base spacing unit: 8px. Use","body":"# Goal\nProduce a UI that does NOT look like default agent-generated apps. It must feel like a crafted product.\n\n# Non-negotiables\n- No reliance on existing global CSS/Tailwind look. The app UI lives in Shadow DOM and ships its own reset + styles.\n- Avoid generic \"card + soft shadow + rounded-lg + gray background\" patterns unless explicitly justified.\n- Use a small, coherent set of primitives with consistent rhythm.\n\n# Visual system (define + follow)\n1) Layout rhythm\n- Base spacing unit: 8px. Use 8/16/24/32/48… only.\n- Typography: define a clear scale (e.g. 12/14/16/20/28/36) and apply intentionally.\n- Use high-contrast text by default. Avoid washed-out gray UI.\n\n2) Shape language\n- Choose one distinctive shape rule and stick to it:\n  - Option: “squircle-ish” nodes + sharp UI chrome\n  - Option: “hard-edge” UI + playful node shapes\n- Buttons are not default rectangles. Define a signature.\n\n3) Motion language (crucial for delight)\n- Micro-interactions are springy and responsive (but not noisy).\n- Panning has subtle inertia; zoom anchors to cursor position.\n- Node add/edit/done transitions must communicate cause→effect.\n\n4) Color strategy\n- Use a limited palette with one accent + one warning + one success.\n- URL capacity meter has a memorable, instrument-like look (not a plain progress bar).\n\n# Interaction principles\n- Every frequent action is 1–2 steps max: add child, edit title, toggle collapse, mark done.\n- Inline edit is default; avoid form-heavy panels.\n- Provide keyboard paths: Enter confirm, Esc cancel, Tab add child, Cmd/Ctrl+Z undo.\n\n# Deliverables expectation\nBefore coding, draft a “UI spec summary” in the response:\n- palette tokens\n- type scale\n- spacing scale\n- shape rules\n- motion rules (durations + easing/spring)\nThen implement to match.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:33:03.605Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing customized, non-generic visual design systems with Shadow DOM and CSS reset capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自定义、非通用视觉设计系统的 UI 集中型代理，具有 Shadow DOM 和 CSS 重置能力。","ja":"Shadow DOM および CSS リセット機能を備えたカスタマイズされた視覚設計システムを必要とする UI フォーカス型エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Shadow DOM 및 CSS 리셋 기능을 갖춘 사용자 지정 시각적 디자인 시스템이 필요한 UI 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en UI que necesitan sistemas de diseño visual personalizados y no genéricos con capacidades de Shadow DOM y restablecimiento de CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''UI nécessitant des systèmes de conception visuelle personnalisés et non génériques avec des capacités de Shadow DOM et de réinitialisation de CSS.","de":"Perfekt für UI-fokussierte Agenten, die benutzerdefinierte, nicht generische visuelle Designsprachen mit Shadow DOM- und CSS-Reset-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que necessitam de sistemas de design visual personalizados, não genéricos, com capacidades de Shadow DOM e reset de CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым требуются настраиваемые, нестандартные визуальные системы дизайна с возможностями Shadow DOM и сброса CSS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعنيين بالواجهة الرسومية التي تحتاج إلى أنظمة تصميم مرئية مخصصة غير عامة مع إمكانيات Shadow DOM وإعادة تعيين CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft unique UI experiences using a small, coherent set of primitives with consistent rhythm, avoiding generic patterns and leveraging base spacing units like 8px for layout rhythm, all within a self-contained visual system.","zh":"赋予代理创建独特的 UI 体验的能力，使用一小套一致的原语、稳定的节奏、避免通用模式，并利用基本的间距单位（如 8px）进行布局节奏，所有这些都在一个自包含的视觉系统中。","ja":"一貫したリズムを持ち、汎用パターンを避け、基本的な間隔単位（例：8px）を使用してレイアウトのリズムを実現する、小規模で一貫したプリミティブのセットを使用して、独自の UI 体験を作成するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"일관된 리듬을 갖춘 작은 규모의 일관된 원시 집합을 사용하여 고유한 UI 경험을 만들 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 일반적인 패턴을 피하고 기본 간격 단위(예: 8px)를 사용하여 레이아웃 리듬을 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear experiencias de UI únicas utilizando un pequeño conjunto coherente de primitivas con ritmo consistente, evitando patrones genéricos y aprovechando unidades de espaciado base como 8px para el ritmo de diseño, todo dentro de un sistema visual autocontenido.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences UI uniques en utilisant un petit ensemble cohérent de primitives avec un rythme constant, en évitant les modèles génériques et en exploitant les unités d''espacement de base comme 8px pour le rythme de disposition, le tout dans un système visuel autonome.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, einzigartige UI-Erlebnisse zu gestalten, indem sie einen kleinen, kohärenten Satz von Primitiven mit konstantem Rhythmus verwenden, generische Muster vermeiden und Basiseinheiten wie 8px für den Layout-Rhythmus nutzen, all dies innerhalb eines selbstenthaltenen visuellen Systems.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar experiências de UI únicas usando um pequeno conjunto coerente de primitivas com ritmo consistente, evitando padrões genéricos e aproveitando unidades de espaçamento base, como 8px, para o ritmo do layout, tudo dentro de um sistema visual autônomo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать уникальные опыт взаимодействия с пользователем, используя небольшой, согласованный набор примитивов с постоянным ритмом, избегая стандартных шаблонов и используя базовые единицы расстояния, такие как 8 пикселей, для ритма расположения, все в пределах самодостаточной визуальной системы.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من создٍ experiencia UI فريدة باستخدام مجموعة صغيرة من البريمتيفات المتناسقة مع إيقاع منتظم، وتجنب الأنماط العامة وتفعيل وحدات المسافة الأساسية مثل 8px لنظام الإيقاع، كل ذلك داخل نظام مرئي مستقل."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing bespoke UI components with custom CSS","Creating consistent visual rhythms across applications","Avoiding generic card-based layouts in favor of tailored designs"],"zh":["使用自定义 CSS 设计定制 UI 组件","跨应用程序创建一致的视觉节奏","避免使用通用的卡片式布局，转而使用定制设计"],"ja":["カスタム CSS を使用してカスタム UI コンポーネントを設計する","アプリケーション全体で一貫した視覚的なリズムを作成する","汎用的なカードベースのレイアウトを避け、代わりにカスタマイズされた設計を使用する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 CSS를 사용하여 사용자 지정 UI 컴포넌트를 설계하는 것","일관된 시각적 리듬을 애플리케이션 전체에 걸쳐 생성하는 것","일반적인 카드 기반 레이아웃을 피하고 대신 사용자 지정 디자인을 사용하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar componentes de UI personalizados con CSS personalizado","Crear ritmos visuales coherentes en varias aplicaciones","Evitar diseños de tarjetas genéricos y utilizar diseños personalizados"],"fr":["Concevoir des composants UI sur mesure avec CSS personnalisé","Créer des rythmes visuels cohérents à travers les applications","Éviter les dispositions de cartes génériques et utiliser des conceptions sur mesure"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte UI-Komponenten mit benutzerdefiniertem CSS entwerfen","Konsistente visuelle Rhythmen über verschiedene Anwendungen hinweg erstellen","Verwenden von maßgeschneiderten Designs anstelle von generischen Kartenlayouts"],"pt":["Projetar componentes de UI personalizados com CSS personalizado","Criar ritmos visuais consistentes em toda a aplicação","Evitar layouts baseados em cartões genéricos em favor de projetos personalizados"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью пользовательского CSS","Создание последовательных визуальных ритмов во всех приложениях","Избежание использования стандартных макетов на основе карточек в пользу индивидуальных проектов"],"ar":["تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة مع CSS مخصص","إنشاء إيقاعات بصرية متسقة عبر التطبيقات","تجنب تخطيطات القائمة على البطاقات العامة لصالح التصاميم المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual CSS styling and layout configuration","Must avoid reliance on global CSS or Tailwind look","Limited to applications where a custom visual system is feasible"],"zh":["需要手动 CSS 样式和布局配置","必须避免依赖全局 CSS 或 Tailwind 外观","仅限于可行的自定义视觉系统的应用程序"],"ja":["手動での CSS スタイルとレイアウトの設定が必要","グローバル CSS または Tailwind の外観への依存を避けなければならない","カスタマイズされた視覚システムが実現可能なアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["수동 CSS 스타일 및 레이아웃 구성이 필요함","전역 CSS 또는 Tailwind 외관에 대한 의존성을 피해야 함","사용자 지정 시각적 시스템이 실현 가능한 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración manual de CSS y diseño de layout","Debe evitar la dependencia de CSS global o la apariencia de Tailwind","Limitado a aplicaciones donde un sistema visual personalizado es factible"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration manuelle de CSS et de disposition","Doit éviter de dépendre de CSS global ou de l''apparence de Tailwind","Limité aux applications où un système visuel personnalisé est faisable"],"de":["Benötigt manuelle CSS-Stilierung und Layout-Konfiguration","Sollte die Abhängigkeit von globaler CSS oder Tailwind-Optik vermeiden","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, in denen ein benutzerdefiniertes visuelles System machbar ist"],"pt":["Exige estilização e configuração de layout de CSS manuais","Deve evitar a dependência de CSS global ou aparência Tailwind","Limitado a aplicações onde um sistema visual personalizado é viável"],"ru":["Требует ручной настройки стилей и конфигурации макета CSS","Необходимо избегать зависимости от глобального CSS или внешнего вида Tailwind","Ограничен для приложений, где возможна реализация индивидуальной визуальной системы"],"ar":["يتطلب تنسيق وضبط تخطيط CSS يدوي","يجب تجنب الاعتماد على CSS العالمي أو مظهر Tailwind","محدود للتطبيقات التي يمكن فيها تحقيق نظام مرئي مخصص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
