ma independiente y concurrente","fr":"Dispatching d''agents parallèles pour enquêter sur des problèmes de manière indépendante et concurrente","de":"Entsenden von Parallelagenten, um Probleme unabhängig und gleichzeitig zu untersuchen","pt":"A técnica de despachar agentes paralelos permite investigar falhas independentes de forma simultânea, economizando tempo e aumentando a eficiência","ru":"Техника диспетчеризации параллельных агентов позволяет исследовать независимые неисправности одновременно, экономя время и увеличивая эффективность","ar":"تقنية توجيه الوكلاء الموازي تسمح بالتحقيق في الأعطال المستقلة بالتوازي، وتوفر الوقت وزيادة الكفاءة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提高故障调查效率","节省时间","支持多个独立任务","实现并行处理","提高系统的吞吐量"],"ja":["障害調査の効率を向上させる","時間を節約する","複数の独立したタスクをサポート","並列処理を実現","システムのスループットを向上させる"],"ko":["오류 조사 효율성을 높임","시간을 절약","여러개의 독립적인 태스크를 지원","병렬 처리를 구현","시스템의 처리량을 향상"],"es":["Investigación concurrente","Problemas independientes","Optimización del tiempo","Trabajo en paralelo","Mejora de la eficiencia"],"fr":["Enquête concurrente","Problèmes indépendants","Optimisation du temps","Travail en parallèle","Amélioration de l''efficacité"],"de":["Gleichzeitige Untersuchung","Unabhängige Probleme","Zeitoptimierung","Arbeit in Parallelschritten","Effizienzsteigerung"],"pt":["Investigação paralela de falhas independentes","Economia de tempo","Aumento da eficiência","Despacho de agentes paralelos","Análise simultânea de múltiplos domínios"],"ru":["Параллельное исследование независимых неисправностей","Экономия времени","Повышение эффективности","Диспетчеризация параллельных агентов","Одновременный анализ нескольких доменов"],"ar":["التحقيق الموازي في الأعطال المستقلة","توفير الوقت","زيادة الكفاءة","توجيه الوكلاء الموازي","التحليل المتزامن لمجالات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["并行代理调度","故障调查","效率提高","时间节约","多任务处理","并行处理"],"ja":["並列エージェントのディスパッチ","障害調査","効率向上","時間節約","多タスク処理","並列処理"],"ko":["병렬 에이전트 디스패치","오류 조사","효율성 향상","시간 절약","다중 태스크 처리","병렬 처리"],"es":["agentes paralelos","investigación concurrente","problemas independientes","optimización del tiempo","trabajo en paralelo","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software"],"fr":["agents parallèles","enquête concurrente","problèmes indépendants","optimisation du temps","travail en parallèle","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels"],"de":["parallele Agenten","gleichzeitige Untersuchung","unabhängige Probleme","Zeitoptimierung","Arbeit in Parallelschritten","Softwareentwicklung","Softwaretests"],"pt":["despachar agentes paralelos","investigação paralela","falhas independentes","economia de tempo","eficiência","desenvolvimento de software","testes paralelos"],"ru":["диспетчеризация параллельных агентов","параллельное исследование","независимые неисправности","экономия времени","эффективность","разработка программного обеспечения","параллельное тестирование"],"ar":["توجيه الوكلاء الموازي","التحقيق الموازي","الأعطال المستقلة","توفير الوقت","الكفاءة","تطوير البرمجيات","الاختبارات الموازية"]}},"owner":"bakwankawa","repo":"lazy-code-skill","repoPath":"bakwankawa/lazy-code-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dispatching-parallel-agents","description":"Use when facing 2+ independent tasks that can be worked on without shared state or sequential dependencies","bodyPreview":"# Dispatching Parallel Agents\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you have multiple unrelated failures (different test files, different subsystems, different bugs), investigating them sequentially wastes time. Each investigation is independent and can happen in parallel.\n\n**Core principle:** Dispatch one agent per independent problem domain. Let them work concurrently.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Multiple failures?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Are they independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Single","body":"# Dispatching Parallel Agents\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you have multiple unrelated failures (different test files, different subsystems, different bugs), investigating them sequentially wastes time. Each investigation is independent and can happen in parallel.\n\n**Core principle:** Dispatch one agent per independent problem domain. Let them work concurrently.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Multiple failures?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Are they independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Single agent investigates all\" [shape=box];\n    \"One agent per problem domain\" [shape=box];\n    \"Can they work in parallel?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Sequential agents\" [shape=box];\n    \"Parallel dispatch\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Multiple failures?\" -> \"Are they independent?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Are they independent?\" -> \"Single agent investigates all\" [label=\"no - related\"];\n    \"Are they independent?\" -> \"Can they work in parallel?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Can they work in parallel?\" -> \"Parallel dispatch\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Can they work in parallel?\" -> \"Sequential agents\" [label=\"no - shared state\"];\n}\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n- 3+ test files failing with different root causes\n- Multiple subsystems broken independently\n- Each problem can be understood without context from others\n- No shared state between investigations\n\n**Don''t use when:**\n- Failures are related (fix one might fix others)\n- Need to understand full system state\n- Agents would interfere with each other\n\n## The Pattern\n\n### 1. Identify Independent Domains\n\nGroup failures by what''s broken:\n- File A tests: Tool approval flow\n- File B tests: Batch completion behavior\n- File C tests: Abort functionality\n\nEach domain is independent - fixing tool approval doesn''t affect abort tests.\n\n### 2. Create Focused Agent Tasks\n\nEach agent gets:\n- **Specific scope:** One test file or subsystem\n- **Clear goal:** Make these tests pass\n- **Constraints:** Don''t change other code\n- **Expected output:** Summary of what you found and fixed\n\n### 3. Dispatch in Parallel\n\nIn Codex: use parallel agents or dispatch one subagent per task with the given scope (see Codex docs: Subagents, Parallel Agents). Example scope per task:\n\n- Task 1: Fix agent-tool-abort.test.ts failures\n- Task 2: Fix batch-completion-behavior.test.ts failures\n- Task 3: Fix tool-approval-race-conditions.test.ts failures\n\nDispatch all three in parallel (or sequentially if your environment prefers).\n\n### 4. Review and Integrate\n\nWhen agents return:\n- Read each summary\n- Verify fixes don''t conflict\n- Run full test suite\n- Integrate all changes\n\n## Agent Prompt Structure\n\nGood agent prompts are:\n1. **Focused** - One clear problem domain\n2. **Self-contained** - All context needed to understand the problem\n3. **Specific about output** - What should the agent return?\n\n```markdown\nFix the 3 failing tests in src/agents/agent-tool-abort.test.ts:\n\n1. \"should abort tool with partial output capture\" - expects ''interrupted at'' in message\n2. \"should handle mixed completed and aborted tools\" - fast tool aborted instead of completed\n3. \"should properly track pendingToolCount\" - expects 3 results but gets 0\n\nThese are timing/race condition issues. Your task:\n\n1. Read the test file and understand what each test verifies\n2. Identify root cause - timing issues or actual bugs?\n3. Fix by:\n   - Replacing arbitrary timeouts with event-based waiting\n   - Fixing bugs in abort implementation if found\n   - Adjusting test expectations if testing changed behavior\n\nDo NOT just increase timeouts - find the real issue.\n\nReturn: Summary of what you found and what you fixed.\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**❌ Too broad:** \"Fix all the tests\" - agent gets lost\n**✅ Specific:** \"Fix agent-tool-abort.test.ts\" - focused scope\n\n**❌ No context:** \"Fix the race condition\" - agent doesn''t know where\n**✅ Context:** Paste the error messages and test names\n\n**❌ No constraints:** Agent might refactor everything\n**✅ Constraints:** \"Do NOT change production code\" or \"Fix tests only\"\n\n**❌ Vague output:** \"Fix it\" - you don''t know what changed\n**✅ Specific:** \"Return summary of root cause and changes\"\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n**Related failures:** Fixing one might fix others - investigate together first\n**Need full context:** Understanding requires seeing entire system\n**Exploratory debugging:** You don''t know what''s broken yet\n**Shared state:** Agents would interfere (editing same files, using same resources)\n\n## Real Example from Session\n\n**Scenario:** 6 test failures across 3 files after major refactoring\n\n**Failures:**\n- agent-tool-abort.test.ts: 3 failures (timing issues)\n- batch-completion-behavior.test.ts: 2 failures (tools not executing)\n- tool-approval-race-conditions.test.ts: 1 failure (execution count = 0)\n\n**Decision:** Independent domains - abort logic separate from batch completion separate from race conditions\n\n**Dispatch:**\n```\nAgent 1 → Fix agent-tool-abort.test.ts\nAgent 2 → Fix batch-completion-behavior.test.ts\nAgent 3 → Fix tool-approval-race-conditions.test.ts\n```\n\n**Results:**\n- Agent 1: Replaced timeouts with event-based waiting\n- Agent 2: Fixed event structure bug (threadId in wrong place)\n- Agent 3: Added wait for async tool execution to complete\n\n**Integration:** All fixes independent, no conflicts, full suite green\n\n**Time saved:** 3 problems solved in parallel vs sequentially\n\n## Key Benefits\n\n1. **Parallelization** - Multiple investigations happen simultaneously\n2. **Focus** - Each agent has narrow scope, less context to track\n3. **Independence** - Agents don''t interfere with each other\n4. **Speed** - 3 problems solved in time of 1\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter agents return:\n1. **Review each summary** - Understand what changed\n2. **Check for conflicts** - Did agents edit same code?\n3. **Run full suite** - Verify all fixes work together\n4. **Spot check** - Agents can make systematic errors\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nFrom debugging session (2025-10-03):\n- 6 failures across 3 files\n- 3 agents dispatched in parallel\n- All investigations completed concurrently\n- All fixes integrated successfully\n- Zero conflicts between agent changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:33:43.359Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multi-Tasking Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain that require concurrent problem-solving capabilities for independent test files and subsystems","zh":"适合于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的多任务代理，需要为独立的测试文件和子系统提供并发问题解决能力","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain などのマルチタスク エージェントに適しています。これらは、独立したテスト ファイルやサブシステムに対して並行問題解決能力が必要です","ko":"AutoGPT와 LangChain 같은 멀티태스킹 에이전트에 적합합니다. 독립적인 테스트 파일과 서브시스템에 대한 병렬 문제 해결 능력이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de multi-tarea como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren capacidades de resolución de problemas concurrentes para archivos de prueba y subsistemas independientes","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de multitâche comme AutoGPT et LangChain qui nécessitent des capacités de résolution de problèmes concurrentes pour des fichiers de test et des sous-systèmes indépendants","de":"Ideal für Multi-Tasking-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die konkurrierende Problem lösende Fähigkeiten für unabhängige Testdateien und Subsysteme benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Multi-Tarefa como AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem capacidades de resolução de problemas concorrentes para arquivos de teste independentes e subsistemas","ru":"Идеально подходит для многофункциональных агентов, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих возможностей параллельного решения проблем для независимых тестовых файлов и подсистем","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء متعددة المهام مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب قدرات حل المشكلات المتزامنة لملفات الاختبار المستقلة والنظم الفرعية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to investigate multiple unrelated failures in parallel, leveraging independent problem domains and concurrent execution, utilizing dot notation for decision-making and graph visualization","zh":"赋予代理同时调查多个无关的故障的能力，利用独立的问题域和并行执行，使用点表示法进行决策和图形可视化","ja":"エージェントが複数の無関係な障害を並行して調査する能力を提供します。独立した問題ドメインと並行実行を利用し、ドット表記を使用して意思決定とグラフの視覚化を行います","ko":"에이전트가 여러 개의 무관한 故障을 병렬로 조사할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 독립적인 문제 도메인과 병렬 실행을 활용하며, 점 표기법을 사용하여 의사 결정과 그래프 시각화를 수행합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes investigar múltiples fallos no relacionados en paralelo, aprovechando dominios de problemas independientes y ejecución concurrente, utilizando notación de puntos para la toma de decisiones y visualización de gráficos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enquêter sur plusieurs défaillances non liées en parallèle, en exploitant des domaines de problèmes indépendants et une exécution concurrente, en utilisant la notation par points pour la prise de décision et la visualisation de graphiques","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, mehrere nicht verwandte Ausfälle parallel zu untersuchen, indem sie unabhängige Problemdomänen und konkurrierende Ausführung nutzen und Punktnotation für die Entscheidungsfindung und Graphenvisualisierung verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a investigar várias falhas não relacionadas em paralelo, aproveitando domínios de problemas independentes e execução concorrente, utilizando notação de pontos para tomada de decisões e visualização de gráficos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью исследовать несколько не связанных между собой сбоев параллельно, используя независимые области задач и параллельную обработку, используя точечную нотацию для принятия решений и визуализации графов","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التحقيق في عدة فشلات غير متعلقة بالتوازي، مستفيدا من مجالات مشكلات مستقلة والتنفيذ المتزامن، مستخدماً التدوين النقطي لاتخاذ القرارات وتصور الرسوم البيانية"},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating multiple test file failures simultaneously","Debugging independent subsystem bugs in parallel","Concurrently analyzing different bug reports"],"zh":["同时调查多个测试文件的故障","并行调试独立的子系统 bug","并发分析不同的 bug 报告"],"ja":["複数のテスト ファイルの障害を同時に調査する","独立したサブシステムのバグを並行してデバッグする","異なるバグ レポートを並行して分析する"],"ko":["여러 개의 테스트 파일의 故障을 동시에 조사한다","독립적인 서브시스템의 버그를 병렬로 디버깅한다","다른 버그 보고서를 병렬로 분석한다"],"es":["Investigar múltiples fallos de archivos de prueba simultáneamente","Depurar errores de subsistemas independientes en paralelo","Analizar concurrentemente diferentes informes de errores"],"fr":["Enquêter sur plusieurs défaillances de fichiers de test simultanément","Déboguer des bogues de sous-systèmes indépendants en parallèle","Analyser en parallèle différents rapports de bogue"],"de":["Mehrfache Testdatei-Fehler simultan untersuchen","Unabhängige Subsystem-Fehler in Parallelschritten debuggen","Verschiedene Fehlerberichte gleichzeitig analysieren"],"pt":["Investigação de várias falhas de arquivos de teste simultaneamente","Depuração de bugs de subsistemas independentes em paralelo","Análise concorrente de diferentes relatórios de bugs"],"ru":["Исследование нескольких сбоев тестовых файлов одновременно","Отладка независимых багов подсистем параллельно","Параллельный анализ разных отчетов об ошибках"],"ar":["تحقيق في عدة فشلات لملفات الاختبار في نفس الوقت","تصحيح الأخطاء في النظم الفرعية المستقلة بالتوازي","تحليل متزامن لتقارير الأخطاء المختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires independent problem domains","Dependent on agent''s ability to handle concurrent tasks"],"zh":["需要独立的问题域","依赖于代理处理并发任务的能力"],"ja":["独立した問題ドメインが必要","エージェントの並行タスク処理能力に依存する"],"ko":["독립적인 문제 도메인이 필요하다","에이전트의 병렬 작업 처리 능력에 의존한다"],"es":["Requiere dominios de problemas independientes","Depende de la capacidad del agente para manejar tareas concurrentes"],"fr":["Nécessite des domaines de problèmes indépendants","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à gérer des tâches concurrentes"],"de":["Benötigt unabhängige Problemdomänen","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, konkurrierende Aufgaben zu bewältigen"],"pt":["Exige domínios de problemas independentes","Depende da capacidade do agente de lidar com tarefas concorrentes"],"ru":["Требует независимых областей задач","Зависит от способности агента обрабатывать параллельные задачи"],"ar":["يتطلب مجالات مشكلات مستقلة","يعتمد على قدرة الوكيل على التعامل مع المهام المتزامنة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
