ミット、プッシュ、PR の作成を自動化","ko":"코드 커밋, 푸시, PR 생성을 자동화하는 ワンクリック 작업 흐름","es":"El flujo de trabajo commit-push-pr es una herramienta para automatizar el proceso de commit, push y creación de solicitudes de extracción en GitHub.","fr":"Le workflow commit-push-pr est un outil pour automatiser le processus de commit, push et création de demandes d''extraction sur GitHub.","de":"Der Workflow commit-push-pr ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung des Prozesses von Commit, Push und Erstellung von Pull-Requests auf GitHub.","pt":"O commit-push-pr é um fluxo de trabalho que automatiza o commit, push e criação de PR. Ele é projetado para economizar tempo e esforço","ru":"Коммит-пуш-пр - это рабочий процесс, который автоматизирует коммит, пуш и создание PR. Он предназначен для экономии времени и усилий","ar":"التزم-ادفع-طلب سحب هو تدفق عمل يوتوماتي ي automatiza عملية الالتزام، الدفع وإنشاء طلب سحب. تم تصميمه لتوفير الوقت والجهد","en":"openclaw credentials and passwords manager with audits for humans and agents."},"definition":{"en":"openclaw credentials and passwords manager with audits for humans and agents."},"features":{"zh":["自动化代码提交","自动推送代码到远程仓库","自动创建 PR","支持 GitHub CLI","支持自定义工作流"],"ja":["コードのコミットを自動化","コードをリモートリポジトリに自動プッシュ","PR を自動作成","GitHub CLI をサポート","カスタムワークフローをサポート"],"ko":["코드 커밋 자동화","코드를 원격 저장소에 자동 푸시","PR 자동 생성","GitHub CLI 지원","사용자 지정 작업 흐름 지원"],"es":["Automatización del flujo de trabajo","Commit y push de cambios","Creación de solicitudes de extracción en GitHub","Verificación de ramas y configuración de origen remoto","Integración con GitHub CLI"],"fr":["Automatisation du workflow","Commit et push des modifications","Création de demandes d''extraction sur GitHub","Vérification des branches et configuration de l''origine distante","Intégration avec GitHub CLI"],"de":["Automatisierung des Workflows","Commit und Push von Änderungen","Erstellung von Pull-Requests auf GitHub","Überprüfung von Branches und Konfiguration des Remote-Origins","Integration mit GitHub CLI"],"pt":["Automatiza o fluxo de trabalho de commit, push e criação de PR","Verifica se o branch atual é o main ou master","Cria um novo commit com as alterações","Faz push das alterações para o repositório remoto","Cria um novo PR com as alterações"],"ru":["Автоматизирует рабочий процесс коммита, пуша и создания PR","Проверяет, является ли текущая ветка main или master","Создаёт новый коммит с изменениями","Делает пуш изменений в удалённый репозиторий","Создаёт новый PR с изменениями"],"ar":["يوتوماتي تدفق العمل من الالتزام، الدفع وإنشاء طلب سحب","يتحقق من أن الفرع الحالي هو الفرع الرئيسي أو الرئيسي","ينشئ التزامًا جديدًا بالتغييرات","يدفع التغييرات إلى المستودع البعيد","ينشئ طلب سحب جديد بالتغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码提交","代码推送","PR 创建","自动化代码管理","GitHub CLI","工作流自动化"],"ja":["コードのコミット","コードのプッシュ","PR の作成","コード管理の自動化","GitHub CLI","ワークフローの自動化"],"ko":["코드 커밋","코드 푸시","PR 생성","코드 관리 자동화","GitHub CLI","작업 흐름 자동화"],"es":["commit push pr","flujo de trabajo","automatización","github cli","solicitudes de extracción","desarrollo de software","integración continua"],"fr":["commit push pr","workflow","automatisation","github cli","demandes d''extraction","développement de logiciels","intégration continue"],"de":["commit push pr","workflow","automatisierung","github cli","pull-requests","softwareentwicklung","kontinuierliche integration"],"pt":["commit push pr","fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvedor","automatizar commit","criar pr","github cli","git branch","desenvolvedor de software"],"ru":["коммит пуш пр","рабочий процесс разработчика","автоматизировать коммит","создать пр","github cli","git ветка","разработчик программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التزم ادفع طلب سحب","تدفق عمل المطور","توفير وقت الالتزام","إنشاء طلب سحب","واجهة команд github","فرع جيت","مطور البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"heyAyushh","repo":"gloves","repoPath":"heyAyushh/gloves","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit-push-pr","description":"Complete workflow to commit changes, push to remote, and create a pull request. Use when you want to ship changes end-to-end in one operation, from local changes to an open PR.","bodyPreview":"# Commit, Push, and Create PR\n\nOne-shot workflow for committing, pushing, and creating a pull request.\n\n## Preconditions\n\n- Modified files exist\n- Remote `origin` is configured\n- GitHub CLI (`gh`) is installed\n- On a working branch (not main/master)\n\n## Steps\n\n1. **Check branch**\n   ```bash\n   BRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)\n   if [ \"$BRANCH\" = \"main\" ] || [ \"$BRANCH\" = \"master\" ]; then\n     echo \"Direct pushes to main/master not allowed\"\n     exit 1\n   fi\n   ```\n\n2. **Stage and commit**","body":"# Commit, Push, and Create PR\n\nOne-shot workflow for committing, pushing, and creating a pull request.\n\n## Preconditions\n\n- Modified files exist\n- Remote `origin` is configured\n- GitHub CLI (`gh`) is installed\n- On a working branch (not main/master)\n\n## Steps\n\n1. **Check branch**\n   ```bash\n   BRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)\n   if [ \"$BRANCH\" = \"main\" ] || [ \"$BRANCH\" = \"master\" ]; then\n     echo \"Direct pushes to main/master not allowed\"\n     exit 1\n   fi\n   ```\n\n2. **Stage and commit**\n   ```bash\n   git add -A\n   git commit -m \"<prefix>: <summary>\"\n   ```\n\n3. **Push**\n   ```bash\n   git push -u origin \"$BRANCH\"\n   ```\n\n4. **Create PR**\n   ```bash\n   gh pr create --title \"<prefix>: <summary>\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n   ## Summary\n   - Change description\n\n   ## Test plan\n   - How to verify\n   EOF\n   )\"\n   ```\n\n## PR Auto-generation Info\n\nWhen generating PR content, use:\n```bash\ngit branch --show-current              # Branch name for intent\ngit merge-base origin/main HEAD        # Merge base\ngit diff --name-status $(git merge-base origin/main HEAD)...HEAD  # Changed files\ngit log origin/main..HEAD --oneline    # Commit history\n```\n\n## Branch Prefix to Commit Prefix\n\n| Branch prefix | Commit prefix |\n|---------------|---------------|\n| feature/      | feat          |\n| fix/          | fix           |\n| refactor/     | refactor      |\n| perf/         | perf          |\n| test/         | test          |\n| docs/         | docs          |\n| build/        | build         |\n| ci/           | ci            |\n| chore/        | chore         |\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\nIf push succeeded but PR creation failed:\n```bash\ngh pr create --title \"Title\" --body \"Message\" --base main\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:34:07.424Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Version Control Agents requiring streamlined Git workflows and GitHub integration.","zh":"适用于需要简化 Git 工作流和 GitHub 集成的版本控制代理的理想选择。","ja":"Git ワークフローを簡素化し、GitHub 統合を必要とするバージョン管理エージェントに最適。","ko":"Git 워크플ロー와 GitHub 통합을 간소화해야 하는 버전 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de control de versiones que requieren flujos de trabajo de Git optimizados y integración con GitHub.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant des flux de travail Git rationalisés et une intégration à GitHub.","de":"Ideal für Version-Control-Agents, die optimierte Git-Workflows und GitHub-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de controle de versão que exigem fluxos de trabalho Git otimizados e integração com o GitHub.","ru":"Идеально для агентов контроля версий, требующих оптимизированных рабочих процессов Git и интеграции с GitHub.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تدفقات عمل Git المبسطة وتكامل GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Git commit, push, and pull request creation using the GitHub CLI, enhancing collaboration and code review with features like branch checking and auditing.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 GitHub CLI 自动执行 Git 提交、推送和拉取请求创建的能力，通过分支检查和审计等功能增强协作和代码审查。","ja":"GitHub CLI を使用して Git コミット、プッシュ、プルリクエストの作成を自動化するエージェントの能力を与え、ブランチのチェックや監査などの機能でコラボレーションやコードレビューを強化します。","ko":"GitHub CLI를 사용하여 Git 커밋, 푸시 및 풀 요청 생성을 자동화하고 브랜치 확인 및 감사와 같은 기능으로 협업 및 코드 검토를 강화하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar el compromiso, el envío y la creación de solicitudes de extracción de Git mediante la CLI de GitHub, mejorando la colaboración y la revisión de código con características como la comprobación de ramas y la auditoría.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser l''engagement, la poussée et la création de demandes d''extraction Git à l''aide de la CLI GitHub, améliorant la collaboration et la révision de code avec des fonctionnalités telles que la vérification des branches et l''audit.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Git-Commit, -Push und -Pull-Request-Erstellung mithilfe der GitHub-CLI zu automatisieren, wodurch die Zusammenarbeit und Code-Überprüfung mit Funktionen wie Branch-Prüfung und Auditing verbessert werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatizem o compromisso do Git, enviem e criem solicitações de pull usando a CLI do GitHub, melhorando a colaboração e a revisão de código com recursos como verificação de branch e auditoria.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать фиксацию изменений Git, отправку и создание запросов на вытягивание с помощью CLI GitHub, улучшая сотрудничество и проверку кода с функциями, такими как проверка веток и аудит.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توفير Automating الالتزام بالتغييرات Git، وارسالها وإنشاء طلبات السحب باستخدام GitHub CLI، مما يعزز التعاون ومراجعة الكود مع الميزات مثل فحص الفرع والتدقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit and push for modified files","Generating pull requests for code review","Enforcing branch permissions to prevent direct pushes to main/master"],"zh":["自动执行修改文件的提交和推送","为代码审查生成拉取请求","强制执行分支权限以防止直接推送到主分支"],"ja":["変更されたファイルのコミットとプッシュを自動化","コードレビュー用のプルリクエストを生成","ブランチの権限を強制してメインブランチへの直接プッシュを防止"],"ko":["수정된 파일의 커밋 및 푸시 자동화","코드 리뷰를 위한 풀 요청 생성","브랜치 권한 적용하여 메인 브랜치에 대한 직접 푸시 방지"],"es":["Automatizar el compromiso y el envío de archivos modificados","Generar solicitudes de extracción para la revisión de código","Aplicar permisos de rama para evitar envíos directos a la rama principal"],"fr":["Automatiser l''engagement et la poussée de fichiers modifiés","Générer des demandes d''extraction pour la révision de code","Faire respecter les autorisations de branche pour empêcher les poussées directes sur la branche principale"],"de":["Automatisieren von Commit und Push für geänderte Dateien","Generieren von Pull-Requests für die Code-Überprüfung","Durchsetzen von Branch-Berechtigungen, um direkte Pushes auf die Hauptbranch zu verhindern"],"pt":["Automatizar o compromisso e envio de arquivos modificados","Gerar solicitações de pull para revisão de código","Impor permissões de branch para evitar envios diretos para main/master"],"ru":["Автоматизировать фиксацию изменений и отправку измененных файлов","Генерировать запросы на вытягивание для проверки кода","Применять разрешения веток, чтобы предотвратить прямые отправки в основную ветку"],"ar":["توفير Automating الالتزام بالتغييرات وارسال الملفات المعدلة","إنشاء طلبات السحب لمراجعة الكود","فرض صلاحيات الفرع لمنع الإرسال المباشر إلى الفرع الرئيسي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Needs remote ''origin'' configuration","Must be used on a working branch (not main/master)"],"zh":["需要安装 GitHub CLI","需要远程 ''origin'' 配置","必须在工作分支（不是主分支）上使用"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールが必要","リモート ''origin'' 構成が必要","ワーキングブランチ（メインブランチではない）上で使用する必要がある"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치 필요","원격 ''origin'' 구성 필요","작업 브랜치(메인 브랜치가 아님)에서 사용해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de GitHub","Necesita configuración remota ''origen''","Debe utilizarse en una rama de trabajo (no en la rama principal)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI GitHub","A besoin d''une configuration distante ''origine''","Doit être utilisé sur une branche de travail (et non sur la branche principale)"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der GitHub-CLI","Benötigt Remote-''origin''-Konfiguration","Muss auf einer Arbeitsbranch (nicht auf der Hauptbranch) verwendet werden"],"pt":["Exige a instalação da CLI do GitHub","Necessita de configuração remota ''origin''","Deve ser usado em um branch de trabalho (não main/master)"],"ru":["Требует установки CLI GitHub","Требует удаленной конфигурации ''origin''","Должно использоваться на рабочей ветке (не основная/мастер)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت GitHub CLI","يحتاج إلى تكوين بعيد ''origin''","يجب استخدامه على فرع العمل (ليس الفرع الرئيسي)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ahrav/scratch-scanner-rs/rule-optimize', 'community', 'ahrav', 'scratch-scanner-rs', 'ahrav/scratch-scanner-rs', 'rule-optimize', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z', '2026-02-18T08:34:18.560Z', NULL, '{"id":"ahrav/scratch-scanner-rs/rule-optimize","name":"rule-optimize","description":{"zh":"规则优化工作流是一种确保规则修改正确性的过程，涉及测试、构建和基准测试","ja":"ルール最適化ワークフローは、ルールの変更が正しく機能することを確認するプロセスです。テスト、ビルド、ベンチマークテストが含まれます","ko":"규칙 최적화 워크플로우는 규칙 수정의 정확성을 보장하는 과정으로 테스트, 빌드, 벤치마크 테스트가 포함됩니다","es":"La optimización de reglas es crucial para mejorar el rendimiento y la eficiencia en los proyectos de desarrollo. Sigue nuestros pasos para optimizar tus reglas.","fr":"L''optimisation des règles est essentielle pour améliorer les performances et l''efficacité dans les projets de développement. Suivez nos étapes pour optimiser vos règles.","de":"Die Optimierung von Regeln ist entscheidend, um die Leistung und Effizienz in Entwicklungsprojekten zu verbessern. Befolgen Sie unsere Schritte, um Ihre Regeln zu optimieren.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"规则优化工作流 - Rule Optimize","ja":"ルール最適化ワークフロー - Rule Optimize","ko":"규칙 최적화 워크플로우 - Rule Optimize","es":"Optimización de Reglas para Desarrolladores","fr":"Optimisation de Règles pour les Développeurs","de":"Regeloptimierung für Entwickler","en":"rule-optimize"},"description":{"zh":"规则优化工作流是一种确保规则修改正确性的过程，涉及测试、构建和基准测试","ja":"ルール最適化ワークフローは、ルールの変更が正しく機能することを確認するプロセスです。テスト、ビルド、ベンチマークテストが含まれます","ko":"규칙 최적화 워크플로우는 규칙 수정의 정확성을 보장하는 과정으로 테스트, 빌드, 벤치마크 테스트가 포함됩니다","es":"La optimización de reglas es crucial para mejorar el rendimiento y la eficiencia en los proyectos de desarrollo. Sigue nuestros pasos para optimizar tus reglas.","fr":"L''optimisation des règles est essentielle pour améliorer les performances et l''efficacité dans les projets de développement. Suivez nos étapes pour optimiser...","de":"Die Optimierung von Regeln ist entscheidend, um die Leistung und Effizienz in Entwicklungsprojekten zu verbessern. Befolgen Sie unsere Schritte, um Ihre Rege...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["运行测试以验证无回归","构建发布版以优化性能","基准测试以比较吞吐量和发现","记录锚点/关键字选择以提高可读性","比较基线以确保优化有效"],"ja":["テストを実行して回帰を検証","リリースビルドを実行してパフォーマンスを最適化","ベンチマークテストを実行してスループットと発見を比較","アンカー/キーワードの選択を文書化して可読性を向上","ベースラインを比較して最適化の有効性を確認"],"ko":["테스트를 실행하여 회귀를 검증","릴리스 빌드를 실행하여 성능을 최적화","벤치마크 테스트를 실행하여 스루풋과 발견을 비교","앵커/키워드 선택을 문서화하여 가독성을 향상","베이스라인을 비교하여 최적화의 유효성을 확인"],"es":["Verificación de regresiones con pruebas","Compilación de versiones de lanzamiento","Análisis de rendimiento y comparación con líneas de base","Documentación de elecciones de anclaje y palabras clave","Optimización de reglas para mejorar la eficiencia"],"fr":["Vérification des régressions avec des tests","Compilation de versions de release","Analyse des performances et comparaison avec des références","Documentation des choix d''ancre et de mots clés","Optimisation des règles pour améliorer l''efficacité"],"de":["Überprüfung von Regressionsfehlern mit Tests","Kompilierung von Release-Versionen","Leistungsanalyse und Vergleich mit Baselines","Dokumentation von Anker- und Schlüsselwortauswahlen","Optimierung von Regeln zur Verbesserung der Effizienz"]},"keywords":{"zh":["规则优化","规则最优化","扫描效率","扫描准确性","规则修改","测试","构建","基准测试"],"ja":["ルール最適化","ルールオプティマイゼーション","スキャニング効率","スキャニング精度","ルール変更","テスト","ビルド","ベンチマークテスト"],"ko":["규칙 최적화","규칙 최적화","스캔 효율","스캔 정확도","규칙 수정","테스트","빌드","벤치마크 테스트"],"es":["optimización de reglas","desarrollo de software","pruebas de regresión","compilación de release","análisis de rendimiento","documentación de reglas","mejora de la eficiencia","desarrollo eficiente"],"fr":["optimisation des règles","développement de logiciels","tests de régression","compilation de release","analyse des performances","documentation des règles","amélioration de l''efficacité","développement efficace"],"de":["Regeloptimierung","Softwareentwicklung","Regressionsfehlertests","Release-Kompilierung","Leistungsanalyse","Regeldokumentation","Effizienzverbesserung","effiziente Entwicklung"]}},"owner":"ahrav","repo":"scratch-scanner-rs","repoPath":"ahrav/scratch-scanner-rs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rule-optimize","description":"Workflow for modifying and benchmarking detection rules","bodyPreview":"# Rule Optimization Workflow\n\nUse after modifying rules in `default_rules.yaml` (loaded by `src/rules/`).\n\n## Checklist\n\n1. [ ] Run `cargo test` to verify no regressions\n2. [ ] Build release: `RUSTFLAGS=\"-C target-cpu=native\" cargo build --release`\n3. [ ] Benchmark against test repos:\n   ```bash\n   ./target/release/scanner-rs ../linux ../gitleaks ../tigerbeetle ../trufflehog\n   ```\n4. [ ] Compare throughput/findings against baseline\n5. [ ] Document anchor/keyword choice if non-obvious (add inlin","body":"# Rule Optimization Workflow\n\nUse after modifying rules in `default_rules.yaml` (loaded by `src/rules/`).\n\n## Checklist\n\n1. [ ] Run `cargo test` to verify no regressions\n2. [ ] Build release: `RUSTFLAGS=\"-C target-cpu=native\" cargo build --release`\n3. [ ] Benchmark against test repos:\n   ```bash\n   ./target/release/scanner-rs ../linux ../gitleaks ../tigerbeetle ../trufflehog\n   ```\n4. [ ] Compare throughput/findings against baseline\n5. [ ] Document anchor/keyword choice if non-obvious (add inline comment)\n\n## Pattern Guidelines\n\nWhen adding or modifying rules:\n\n### Anchors\n- Prefer structured prefixes (`sgp_`, `hvs.`, `AKIA`) over service name keywords\n- Avoid generic patterns like `[a-fA-F0-9]{40}` that match git SHAs\n- Add inline comments explaining non-obvious anchor/keyword choices\n\n### Performance\n- Test rule isolation: `cargo bench --bench rule_isolation -- <rule_id>`\n- Check for backtracking: avoid `.*` followed by greedy quantifiers\n- Prefer character classes over alternation when possible\n\n### Validation\n- Ensure validators don''t make network calls in hot paths\n- Use entropy checks for high-entropy secrets\n- Add checksum validation where applicable (AWS keys, etc.)\n\n## Baseline Comparison\n\nBefore making changes, capture baseline:\n```bash\n# Run 3x and record median throughput\nfor i in 1 2 3; do\n  ./target/release/scanner-rs ../linux 2>&1 | tail -1\ndone\n```\n\nAfter changes, compare:\n```bash\n# Calculate % change\n# Acceptable: <2% regression\n# Investigate: 2-5% regression\n# Block: >5% regression without justification\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `bench-compare` - Criterion benchmark comparison\n- `perf-regression` - Full performance regression workflow\n- `test-strategy` - Choose testing approach for rule changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:34:18.560Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Security Scanning Agents that need to optimize custom detection rules for performance and accuracy.","zh":"适合需要为性能和准确性优化自定义检测规则的安全扫描代理。","ja":"パフォーマンスと精度のためにカスタム検出ルールを最適化する必要があるセキュリティスキャンエージェントに適しています。","ko":"성능과 정확성을 위해 사용자 정의 검색 규칙을 최적화해야 하는 보안 스캔 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de exploración de seguridad que necesitan optimizar reglas de detección personalizadas para el rendimiento y la precisión.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de balayage de sécurité qui ont besoin d''optimiser les règles de détection personnalisées pour les performances et la précision.","de":"Ideal für Sicherheitsscans-Agenten, die benutzerdefinierte Erkennungsregeln für Leistung und Genauigkeit optimieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Digitalização de Segurança que precisam otimizar regras de detecção personalizadas para desempenho e precisão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов сканирования безопасности, которым необходимо оптимизировать пользовательские правила обнаружения для производительности и точности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مسح الأمان التي تحتاج إلى تحسين قواعد الكشف المخصصة للأداء والدقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables systematic benchmarking of rule modifications against real-world codebases like Linux and TigerBeetle. Provides quantitative throughput comparisons and regression testing through cargo test verification before deployment.","zh":"实现对规则修改与真实世界代码库（如Linux和TigerBeetle）进行系统的基准测试。提供通过cargo测试验证在部署前进行的量化吞吐量比较和回归测试。","ja":"ルールの変更をLinuxやTigerBeetleなどの実世界のコードベースに対して体系的にベンチマークすることを可能にします。デプロイ前にcargoテストの検証を介して実行される量的スループット比較とリグレッションテストを提供します。","ko":"규칙 변경을 리눅스 또는 타이거비틀과 같은 실제 코드베이스에 대해 체계적으로 벤치마크하는 것을 가능하게 합니다. 배포 전에 카고 테스트 검증을 통해 수행되는 정량적 처리량 비교 및 회귀 테스트를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la evaluación sistemática de las modificaciones de reglas frente a bases de código del mundo real como Linux y TigerBeetle. Proporciona comparaciones cuantitativas de rendimiento y pruebas de regresión a través de la verificación de cargo test antes de la implementación.","fr":"Permet une évaluation systématique des modifications de règles par rapport à des bases de code du monde réel comme Linux et TigerBeetle. Fournit des comparaisons quantitatives de débit et des tests de régression via la vérification de cargo test avant le déploiement.","de":"Ermöglicht systematische Benchmarking von Regelanpassungen gegenüber realen Codebasen wie Linux und TigerBeetle. Bietet quantitative Durchsatzvergleiche und Regressionsprüfungen durch cargo-Test-Verifizierung vor der Bereitstellung.","pt":"Permite a realização de benchmarking sistemático de modificações de regras contra repositórios de código do mundo real como Linux e TigerBeetle. Fornece comparações quantitativas de throughput e testes de regressão por meio da verificação do cargo test antes da implantação.","ru":"Позволяет проводить систематическое тестирование изменений правил в отношении реальных кодовых баз, таких как Linux и TigerBeetle. Предоставляет количественные сравнения производительности и тестирование регрессии через проверку cargo test до развертывания.","ar":"يتمكن من إجراء اختبارات الأداء المنهجية لتعديلات القواعد ضد قواعد بيانات العالم الحقيقي مثل Linux وTigerBeetle. يوفر مقارنات كمية للإنتاجية واختبارات انحدار من خلال التحقق من اختبار الشحن قبل النشر."},"useCases":{"en":["Benchmarking rule changes against multiple test repositories","Validating rule modifications through cargo test suites","Comparing detection throughput against baseline performance metrics"],"zh":["对多个测试存储库进行规则更改的基准测试","通过cargo测试套件验证规则修改","将检测吞吐量与基线性能指标进行比较"],"ja":["複数のテストリポジトリに対するルール変更のベンチマークテスト","cargoテストスイートを介したルール変更の検証","検出スループットをベースラインパフォーマンスメトリクスと比較"],"ko":["여러 테스트 저장소에 대한 규칙 변경의 벤치마크 테스트","카고 테스트 슈트를 통해 규칙 변경의 검증","검출 처리량을 기준 성능 지표와 비교"],"es":["Evaluación de cambios de reglas contra varios repositorios de prueba","Validación de modificaciones de reglas a través de suites de prueba de cargo","Comparación del rendimiento de detección con métricas de rendimiento de referencia"],"fr":["Évaluation des modifications de règles contre plusieurs référentiels de test","Validation des modifications de règles via des suites de test cargo","Comparaison du débit de détection avec des métriques de performance de référence"],"de":["Bewertung von Regelanpassungen gegenüber mehreren Testrepositories","Validierung von Regelanpassungen durch cargo-Test-Suiten","Vergleich des Erkennungsdurchsatzes mit Basisleistungsmerkmalen"],"pt":["Realizar benchmarking de alterações de regras em vários repositórios de teste","Validar modificações de regras por meio de conjuntos de testes do cargo","Comparar a produção de detecção com métricas de desempenho de referência"],"ru":["Проведение тестирования изменений правил в нескольких тестовых репозиториях","Проверка изменений правил с помощью наборов тестов cargo","Сравнение производительности обнаружения с базовыми метриками производительности"],"ar":["إجراء اختبارات الأداء لتغييرات القواعد في مستودعات اختبار متعددة","التحقق من تعديلات القواعد من خلال مجموعات اختبار الشحن","مقارنة الإنتاجية الكشفية مع مقاييس الأداء المرجعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pre-existing test repositories (e.g., ../linux, ../gitleaks)","Needs Rust toolchain and cargo build system","Depends on native CPU optimization flags (-C target-cpu=native)"],"zh":["需要预先存在的测试存储库（例如../linux, ../gitleaks）","需要Rust工具链和cargo构建系统","依赖于本机CPU优化标志（-C target-cpu=native）"],"ja":["テストリポジトリ（例：../linux、../gitleaks）が事前に存在する必要がある","Rustツールチェーンとcargoビルドシステムが必要","ネイティブCPU最適化フラグ（-C target-cpu=native）に依存"],"ko":["테스트 저장소가 이미 존재해야 함(예: ../linux, ../gitleaks)","러스트 툴체인과 카고 빌드 시스템이 필요함","네이티브 CPU 최적화 플래그(-C target-cpu=native)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere repositorios de prueba preexistentes (p. ej., ../linux, ../gitleaks)","Necesita la cadena de herramientas Rust y el sistema de compilación de cargo","Depende de la optimización de la CPU nativa con indicadores (-C target-cpu=native)"],"fr":["Nécessite des référentiels de test préexistants (par exemple ../linux, ../gitleaks)","Nécessite la chaîne d''outils Rust et le système de construction de cargo","Dépend des indicateurs d''optimisation du CPU natif (-C target-cpu=native)"],"de":["Benötigt vorhergehende Testrepositorys (z. B. ../linux, ../gitleaks)","Benötigt Rust-Toolchain und cargo-Build-System","Hängt von nativen CPU-Optimierungsflags (-C target-cpu=native) ab"],"pt":["Exige repositórios de teste pré-existentes (por exemplo, ../linux, ../gitleaks)","Necessita de conjunto de ferramentas Rust e sistema de compilação do cargo","Depende de flags de otimização de CPU nativa (-C target-cpu=native)"],"ru":["Требует предварительно существующих тестовых репозиториев (например, ../linux, ../gitleaks)","Требует инструментария Rust и системы сборки cargo","Зависит от флагов оптимизации родного CPU (-C target-cpu=native)"],"ar":["يتطلب مستودعات اختبار موجودة مسبقًا (على سبيل المثال ، ../linux ، ../gitleaks)","يحتاج إلى مجموعة أدوات Rust ونظام بناء الشحن","يعتمد على أعلام تحسين وحدة المعالجة المركزية الأصلية (-C target-cpu=native)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ANcpLua/qyl/fix', 'community', 'ANcpLua', 'qyl', 'ANcpLua/qyl', 'fix', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z', '2026-02-18T08:34:11.783Z', NULL, '{"id":"ANcpLua/qyl/fix","name":"fix","description":{"zh":"Fix AI 工作负载的日志问题，支持 OTLP 和 DuckDB","ja":"AI ワークロードのログ問題を修復します。OTLP と DuckDB をサポート","ko":"AI 작업량의 로그 문제를 修復합니다. OTLP 및 DuckDB를 지원","es":"Fix es una plataforma de observabilidad para GenAI/LLM que te permite cuestionar tus logs y solucionar problemas de manera efectiva","fr":"Fix est une plateforme d''observabilité pour GenAI/LLM qui vous permet d''interroger vos logs et de résoudre les problèmes de manière efficace","de":"Fix ist eine Observability-Plattform für GenAI/LLM, die es Ihnen ermöglicht, Ihre Logs zu hinterfragen und Probleme effektiv zu lösen","pt":"A plataforma de observabilidade de IA para GenAI/LLM permite questionar logs e melhorar a eficiência dos workloads. Com OTLP ingestion e DuckDB storage","ru":"Платформа наблюдения за ИИ для GenAI/LLM позволяет анализировать журналы и повышать эффективность рабочих процессов. С использованием OTLP ingestion и DuckDB storage","ar":"منصة مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي للجين آي/إل إل إم تسمح بتحليل السجلات وتحسين كفاءة عملloads. مع OTLP ingestion و DuckDB storage","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Fix AI 工作负载的日志问题","ja":"AI ワークロードのログ問題を修復","ko":"AI 작업량의 로그 문제를 修復","es":"Reparación de errores con fix","fr":"Correction de bogues avec fix","de":"Fehlerbehebung mit fix","pt":"Plataforma de Observabilidade de IA para GenAI/LLM","ru":"Платформа наблюдения за ИИ для GenAI/LLM","ar":"منصة مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي للجين آي/إل إل إم","en":"fix"},"description":{"zh":"Fix AI 工作负载的日志问题，支持 OTLP 和 DuckDB","ja":"AI ワークロードのログ問題を修復します。OTLP と DuckDB をサポート","ko":"AI 작업량의 로그 문제를 修復합니다. OTLP 및 DuckDB를 지원","es":"Fix es una plataforma de observabilidad para GenAI/LLM que te permite cuestionar tus logs y solucionar problemas de manera efectiva","fr":"Fix est une plateforme d''observabilité pour GenAI/LLM qui vous permet d''interroger vos logs et de résoudre les problèmes de manière efficace","de":"Fix ist eine Observability-Plattform für GenAI/LLM, die es Ihnen ermöglicht, Ihre Logs zu hinterfragen und Probleme effektiv zu lösen","pt":"A plataforma de observabilidade de IA para GenAI/LLM permite questionar logs e melhorar a eficiência dos workloads. Com OTLP ingestion e DuckDB storage","ru":"Платформа наблюдения за ИИ для GenAI/LLM позволяет анализировать журналы и повышать эффективность рабочих процессов. С использованием OTLP ingestion и DuckDB...","ar":"منصة مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي للجين آي/إل إل إم تسمح بتحليل السجلات وتحسين كفاءة عملloads. مع OTLP ingestion و DuckDB storage","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"definition":{"en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"features":{"zh":["支持 OTLP 吸收","支持 DuckDB 存储","提供语义约定用于 AI 遥测","支持多种工作流工具","提供了统一的修复管道","支持多种安全审查"],"ja":["OTLP 経由をサポート","DuckDB ストレージをサポート","AI 遥測のためのセマンティック規約を提供","様々なワークフロー ツールをサポート","統一された修復パイプラインを提供","様々なセキュリティレビューをサポート"],"ko":["OTLP를 지원","DuckDB 저장소를 지원","AI 원격 측정을 위한 의미 규약을 제공","다양한 워크플로우 도구를 지원","통합된 修復 파이프라인을 제공","다양한 보안审查를 지원"],"es":["Ingestión de OTLP","Almacenamiento en DuckDB","Convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA","Orquestación de flujo de trabajo","Análisis de logs","Solución de problemas"],"fr":["Ingestion OTLP","Stockage en DuckDB","Conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA","Orchestration de flux de travail","Analyse de logs","Résolution de problèmes"],"de":["OTLP-Ingestion","DuckDB-Speicher","Semantische Konventionen für IA-Telemetrie","Workflow-Orchestrierung","Log-Analyse","Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["OTLP ingestion","DuckDB storage","Semantic conventions for AI telemetry","Multi-agent workflow orchestration","Unified fix pipeline","Adversarial security review"],"ru":["OTLP ingestion","DuckDB storage","Семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ","Оркестровка рабочих процессов с несколькими агентами","Единый пайплайн исправления","Анализ безопасности с помощью противостояния"],"ar":["OTLP ingestion","DuckDB storage","اتفاقيات семантиكية لتعليمات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أوركسترا عمل متعدد الوكلاء","Pipeline موحد للاصلاح","استعراض أمن معارض"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 可观察性","GenAI","LLM","日志问题","OTLP","DuckDB","语义约定","AI 遥测","工作流工具"],"ja":["AI 可観測性","GenAI","LLM","ログ問題","OTLP","DuckDB","セマンティック規約","AI 遥測","ワークフロー ツール"],"ko":["AI 관측","GenAI","LLM","로그 문제","OTLP","DuckDB","의미 규약","AI 원격 측정","워크플로우 도구"],"es":["observabilidad","GenAI","LLM","telemetría de IA","análisis de logs","solución de problemas","orquestación de flujo de trabajo","OTLP","DuckDB"],"fr":["observabilité","GenAI","LLM","télémétrie de l''IA","analyse de logs","résolution de problèmes","orchestration de flux de travail","OTLP","DuckDB"],"de":["Observability","GenAI","LLM","IA-Telemetrie","Log-Analyse","Fehlerbehebung","Workflow-Orchestrierung","OTLP","DuckDB"],"pt":["observabilidade de IA","GenAI","LLM","OTLP ingestion","DuckDB storage","telemetria de IA","orquestação de workflow","segurança adversarial"],"ru":["наблюдение за ИИ","GenAI","LLM","OTLP ingestion","DuckDB storage","телеметрия ИИ","оркестровка рабочих процессов","анализ безопасности"],"ar":["مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","جين آي","إل إل إم","OTLP ingestion","DuckDB storage","تعليمات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أوركسترا عمل","تحليل أمن"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fix","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  allowed-tools: Task, Bash, TodoWrite\nplugin:\n  name: \"workflow-tools\"\n  version: \"2.0.0\"\n  description: \"Multi-agent workflow orchestration: /fix (unified fix pipeline), /red-blue-review (adversarial security), /tournament (competitive coding), /mega-swarm (parallel audit), /deep-think (extended reasoning), /batch-implement (parallel implementation).\"\n  author:\n    name: \"AncpLua\"\n```\n\n\n# FIX PIPELINE\n\n**Issue:** $1\n**Severity:** $2 (default: P1, option","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  allowed-tools: Task, Bash, TodoWrite\nplugin:\n  name: \"workflow-tools\"\n  version: \"2.0.0\"\n  description: \"Multi-agent workflow orchestration: /fix (unified fix pipeline), /red-blue-review (adversarial security), /tournament (competitive coding), /mega-swarm (parallel audit), /deep-think (extended reasoning), /batch-implement (parallel implementation).\"\n  author:\n    name: \"AncpLua\"\n```\n\n\n# FIX PIPELINE\n\n**Issue:** $1\n**Severity:** $2 (default: P1, options: P0|P1|P2|P3)\n**Parallelism:** $3 (default: standard, options: maximum|standard)\n**Mode:** $4 (default: balanced, options: aggressive|balanced|conservative)\n**Quick:** $5 (default: false - skip devil''s advocate phases)\n\n---\n\n## PARALLELISM CONFIGURATIONS\n\n| Parallelism | Agents | Phases | Best For |\n|-------------|--------|--------|----------|\n| **maximum** | 16 | 6→4→3→3 | P0 critical bugs, complex issues |\n| **standard** | 8 | 3→2→1→1 | P1/P2 bugs, focused changes |\n\n## MODE CONFIGURATIONS\n\n| Mode | Behavior |\n|------|----------|\n| **aggressive** | All solutions explored, maximum competition |\n| **balanced** | Top solutions evaluated, devil''s advocate review |\n| **conservative** | Minimal change, high confidence required |\n\n---\n\n## EXECUTION INSTRUCTIONS\n\n<CRITICAL_EXECUTION_REQUIREMENT>\n**RUN ALL PHASES WITHOUT STOPPING.**\n\n1. Execute ALL phases in sequence WITHOUT pausing for user input\n2. DO NOT ask \"should I continue?\" - just continue\n3. Use TodoWrite to track progress\n4. Only stop if: build fails, tests fail, or unrecoverable error\n\n**GATE CHECKPOINTS:** After each phase, validate success before proceeding.\n</CRITICAL_EXECUTION_REQUIREMENT>\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 1: ANALYSIS SWARM\n\n**Maximum parallelism (6 agents) - Use if $3 = maximum**\n**Standard parallelism (3 agents) - Use if $3 = standard or not specified**\n\n### GATE 1: Analysis Validation\n\nBefore proceeding to Phase 2, verify:\n- ≥80% of analysis agents completed successfully\n- At least ONE root cause identified with >60% confidence\n- Impact assessment completed\n\n```\nGATE 1 CHECKPOINT:\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Analysis Agents: [X/Y] completed           │\n│ Root Cause Confidence: [X]%                │\n│ Impact Assessment: [COMPLETE/INCOMPLETE]   │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ VERDICT: PROCEED / HALT                    │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\nIf HALT: Report findings and stop. Do not proceed with incomplete analysis.\n\n---\n\n### Standard Analysis (3 Agents)\n\nLaunch ALL 3 agents in ONE message:\n\n#### Agent 1: Root Cause Analysis\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: deep-debugger\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Hunt root cause\"\nprompt: |\n  ISSUE: [insert $1 here]\n  SEVERITY: [insert $2 here, default P1]\n\n  MISSION: Find the ROOT CAUSE.\n\n  1. What is the exact failure mode?\n  2. List ALL possible causes (5+)\n  3. Evidence for/against each\n  4. Confidence ranking (percentage)\n\n  Output: Root cause with confidence level\n```\n\n#### Agent 2: Impact Assessment\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: metacognitive-guard:arch-reviewer\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Map system impact\"\nprompt: |\n  ISSUE: [insert $1 here]\n\n  ASSESS IMPACT:\n  1. What depends on broken code?\n  2. What will break if we change it?\n  3. Is this local or systemic?\n  4. What invariants are at risk?\n\n  Output: Impact map with risk levels\n```\n\n#### Agent 3: Codebase Context\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-explorer\ndescription: \"Find relevant code\"\nprompt: |\n  ISSUE: [insert $1 here]\n\n  GATHER CONTEXT:\n  1. Find all relevant code paths\n  2. How is this pattern used elsewhere?\n  3. What tests cover this area?\n  4. Recent changes to this code?\n\n  Output: Relevant code locations with file:line references\n```\n\n---\n\n### Maximum Analysis (6 Agents) - Only if $3 = maximum\n\nLaunch ALL 6 agents in ONE message:\n\n#### Agent 1: Root Cause Hunter\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: deep-debugger\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Hunt root cause\"\nprompt: |\n  ISSUE: [insert $1 here]\n\n  MISSION: Find the ROOT CAUSE.\n\n  1. What is the exact failure mode?\n  2. List ALL possible causes (5+)\n  3. Evidence for/against each\n  4. Confidence ranking\n\n  Output: Root cause with 90%+ confidence\n```\n\n#### Agent 2: System Architect\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: metacognitive-guard:arch-reviewer\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Map system impact\"\nprompt: |\n  ISSUE: [insert $1 here]\n\n  MISSION: Map system IMPACT.\n\n  1. What depends on broken code?\n  2. Ripple effects of changes?\n  3. Invariants at risk?\n  4. Is this local or systemic?\n\n  Output: Impact map with risk levels\n```\n\n#### Agent 3: Code Explorer\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-explorer\ndescription: \"Find relevant code\"\nprompt: |\n  ISSUE: [insert $1 here]\n\n  MISSION: Find ALL relevant code.\n\n  1. All code paths involved\n  2. Similar patterns elsewhere\n  3. Test coverage for this area\n  4. Recent changes to this code\n\n  Output: File:line map of relevant code\n```\n\n#### Agent 4: History Detective\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: Explore\ndescription: \"Find change history\"\nprompt: |\n  ISSUE: [insert $1 here]\n\n  MISSION: Find the HISTORY.\n\n  1. When did this break? (git blame/log)\n  2. What commit introduced it?\n  3. Was this working before?\n  4. Related issues/PRs?\n\n  Output: Timeline of changes\n```\n\n#### Agent 5: Pattern Matcher\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-explorer\ndescription: \"Find similar bugs\"\nprompt: |\n  ISSUE: [insert $1 here]\n\n  MISSION: Find SIMILAR bugs.\n\n  1. Same pattern elsewhere in codebase?\n  2. Similar bugs fixed before?\n  3. Common anti-patterns?\n  4. Systemic issues?\n\n  Output: Similar code locations that might have same bug\n```\n\n#### Agent 6: Test Analyzer\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-reviewer\ndescription: \"Analyze test gaps\"\nprompt: |\n  ISSUE: [insert $1 here]\n\n  MISSION: Analyze TEST coverage.\n\n  1. What tests exist for this area?\n  2. Why didn''t tests catch this?\n  3. What tests are missing?\n  4. Test quality issues?\n\n  Output: Test gap analysis\n```\n\n**→ VALIDATE GATE 1, then proceed to Phase 2.**\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 2: SOLUTION DESIGN\n\n**Maximum parallelism (4 agents): 3 architects + devil''s advocate**\n**Standard parallelism (2 agents): 1 architect + devil''s advocate**\n**Quick mode ($5 = true): Skip devil''s advocate**\n\n### GATE 2: Solution Validation\n\nBefore proceeding to Phase 3, verify:\n- At least 2 viable solutions proposed (or 1 if quick mode)\n- Solutions have implementation plans\n- Risk assessment completed\n\n```\nGATE 2 CHECKPOINT:\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Solutions Proposed: [X]                    │\n│ Top Solution Confidence: [X]%              │\n│ Risk Assessment: [COMPLETE/INCOMPLETE]     │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ VERDICT: PROCEED / HALT                    │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Standard Design (2 Agents)\n\n#### Agent: Solution Architect\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-architect\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Design solutions\"\nprompt: |\n  Given Phase 1 analysis, design solutions.\n\n  FOR EACH SOLUTION:\n  1. What it fixes\n  2. Code changes required\n  3. Risk of regression\n  4. Implementation complexity (1-10)\n  5. Confidence (%)\n\n  RANK by: confidence × impact / complexity\n\n  Output: Top 3 solutions with implementation plans\n```\n\n#### Agent: Devil''s Advocate (Skip if $5 = true)\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-reviewer\ndescription: \"Attack all solutions\"\nprompt: |\n  CHALLENGE each proposed solution:\n\n  1. What could go wrong?\n  2. Hidden assumptions?\n  3. Edge cases that break this?\n  4. Better alternatives we''re missing?\n\n  Be HARSH. Find problems.\n\n  Output: Risk analysis and counterarguments\n```\n\n---\n\n### Maximum Design (4 Agents) - Only if $3 = maximum\n\n#### Agent 7: Solution Architect A\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-architect\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Design minimal solution\"\nprompt: |\n  Given Phase 1 analysis, design Solution A.\n\n  Focus: MINIMAL CHANGE approach\n\n  1. Smallest possible fix\n  2. Code changes required\n  3. Risk assessment\n  4. Implementation steps\n\n  Output: Solution A with implementation plan\n```\n\n#### Agent 8: Solution Architect B\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-architect\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Design robust solution\"\nprompt: |\n  Given Phase 1 analysis, design Solution B.\n\n  Focus: ROBUST LONG-TERM approach\n\n  1. Fix + prevent future issues\n  2. Refactoring if needed\n  3. Better abstractions\n  4. Implementation steps\n\n  Output: Solution B with implementation plan\n```\n\n#### Agent 9: Solution Architect C\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: dotnet-mtp-advisor\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Design alternative solution\"\nprompt: |\n  Given Phase 1 analysis, design Solution C.\n\n  Focus: ALTERNATIVE APPROACH\n\n  1. Different paradigm/pattern\n  2. What if we redesign this part?\n  3. Unconventional solutions\n  4. Trade-offs\n\n  Output: Solution C with implementation plan\n```\n\n#### Agent 10: Devil''s Advocate (Skip if $5 = true)\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-reviewer\ndescription: \"Attack all solutions\"\nprompt: |\n  ATTACK all proposed solutions:\n\n  For EACH solution:\n  1. What will break?\n  2. Hidden assumptions?\n  3. Edge cases that fail?\n  4. Why is this wrong?\n\n  Be HARSH. Find problems.\n\n  Output: Risk analysis per solution\n```\n\n**→ SELECT best solution, VALIDATE GATE 2, proceed to Phase 3.**\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 3: IMPLEMENTATION\n\n**Maximum parallelism (3 agents): Test writer + coder + docs**\n**Standard parallelism (1 agent): Single TDD implementer**\n\n### GATE 3: Implementation Validation\n\nBefore proceeding to Phase 4, verify:\n- Implementation compiles\n- Tests exist (failing initially, then passing)\n- No obvious regressions introduced\n\n```\nGATE 3 CHECKPOINT:\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Implementation: [COMPLETE/INCOMPLETE]      │\n│ Tests Written: [YES/NO]                    │\n│ Compiles: [YES/NO]                         │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ VERDICT: PROCEED / HALT                    │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Standard Implementation (1 Agent)\n\n#### Implementation Agent\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-architect\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Implement fix with TDD\"\nprompt: |\n  IMPLEMENT the approved solution.\n\n  FOLLOW TDD:\n  1. Write failing test first\n  2. Implement minimal fix\n  3. Verify test passes\n  4. Refactor if needed\n\n  CHECKLIST:\n  - [ ] Test written and failing\n  - [ ] Fix implemented\n  - [ ] Test passing\n  - [ ] No regressions\n\n  Output: Files changed + verification results\n```\n\n---\n\n### Maximum Implementation (3 Agents) - Only if $3 = maximum\n\n#### Agent 11: Test Writer\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-architect\ndescription: \"Write tests first\"\nprompt: |\n  WRITE TESTS FIRST.\n\n  Based on selected solution:\n  1. Write failing unit test\n  2. Write edge case tests\n  3. Write regression test\n\n  DO NOT implement the fix yet.\n\n  Output: Test files with paths\n```\n\n#### Agent 12: Implementation Coder\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-architect\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Implement the fix\"\nprompt: |\n  IMPLEMENT the selected solution.\n\n  1. Make the minimal code change\n  2. Follow existing patterns\n  3. No unnecessary refactoring\n  4. Add comments only if complex\n\n  Output: Changed files with diffs\n```\n\n#### Agent 13: Documentation Updater\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: Explore\ndescription: \"Check docs needed\"\nprompt: |\n  CHECK what docs need updating:\n\n  1. README changes needed?\n  2. API docs affected?\n  3. CHANGELOG entry?\n  4. Comments in code?\n\n  Output: Documentation updates needed\n```\n\n**→ VALIDATE GATE 3, proceed to Phase 4.**\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 4: VERIFICATION\n\nRun verification commands:\n\n```bash\n# Build\ndotnet build --no-incremental 2>&1 || npm run build 2>&1 || make build 2>&1\n\n# Test\ndotnet test 2>&1 || npm test 2>&1 || make test 2>&1\n\n# Lint\ndotnet format --verify-no-changes 2>&1 || npm run lint 2>&1 || make lint 2>&1\n```\n\n### FINAL GATE: Verification Results\n\n```\nFINAL GATE:\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Build: [PASS/FAIL]                         │\n│ Tests: [PASS/FAIL]                         │\n│ Lint: [PASS/FAIL]                          │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ VERDICT: FIXED / BLOCKED                   │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## FIX SUMMARY\n\nAfter ALL phases complete:\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                      FIX COMPLETE                            ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║ Issue: $1                                                    ║\n║ Severity: $2 │ Parallelism: $3 │ Mode: $4                    ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║ Phase 1: Analysis    │ [X/Y] agents │ Root cause: [X]        ║\n║ Phase 2: Solutions   │ [X/Y] agents │ Selected: [name]       ║\n║ Phase 3: Implement   │ [X/Y] agents │ Files: [count]         ║\n║ Phase 4: Verify      │ Build/Test/Lint: ✅/❌                 ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║ TOTAL AGENTS: [X]    TIME: [X min]                           ║\n║ STATUS: FIXED / BLOCKED                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n| Phase | Gate Status | Findings |\n|-------|-------------|----------|\n| 1. Analysis | PASS/FAIL | [Summary] |\n| 2. Design | PASS/FAIL | [Chosen solution] |\n| 3. Implementation | PASS/FAIL | [Files changed] |\n| 4. Verification | PASS/FAIL | [Results] |\n\n**Issue Status:** FIXED / PARTIALLY FIXED / BLOCKED\n**Next Steps:** [If any]\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:34:11.783Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Observability Agents requiring advanced logging and telemetry analysis for GenAI/LLM workloads.","zh":"适用于需要高级日志记录和遥测分析的 Observability Agents，特别是用于 GenAI/LLM 工作负载。","ja":"GenAI/LLM ワークロードの高度なログ記録とテレメトリ分析を必要とする Observability エージェントに適しています。","ko":"GenAI/LLM 워크로드에 대한 고급 로깅 및 텔레메트리 분석이 필요한 Observability 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de observabilidad que requieren registro y análisis de telemetría avanzados para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''observabilité nécessitant un journalisation et une analyse de télémétrie avancées pour les charges de travail GenAI/LLM.","de":"Ideal für Observability-Agents, die erweiterte Protokollierung und Telemetrie-Analyse für GenAI/LLM-Workloads erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de observabilidade que exigem registro e análise de telemetria avançados para cargas de trabalho GenAI/LLM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов наблюдаемости, требующих расширенного логирования и анализа телеметрии для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل المراقبة التي تتطلب سجل وتحليل تелеметري متقدمين لأنماط عمل GenAI/LLM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to question logs using OTLP ingestion and DuckDB storage, providing semantic conventions for AI telemetry and unified fix pipelines.","zh":"赋予代理使用 OTLP 吸收和 DuckDB 存储来查询日志的能力，为 AI 遥测提供语义约定和统一的修复管道。","ja":"OTLP 経由と DuckDB ストレージを使用してログを問い合わせるエージェントの能力を提供し、AI テレメトリのためのセマンティック規約と統一された修復パイプラインを提供します。","ko":"OTLP 흡수 및 DuckDB 저장소를 사용하여 로그를 쿼리할 수 있는 에이전트의 기능을 제공하고, AI 텔레메트리용 의미 규약 및 통합된 수정 파이프라인을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cuestionar los registros utilizando la ingesta de OTLP y el almacenamiento de DuckDB, proporcionando convenciones semánticas para la telemetría de IA y pipelines de solución unificados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger les journaux en utilisant l''ingestion OTLP et le stockage DuckDB, fournissant des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie IA et des pipelines de correction unifiés.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Logdateien mithilfe der OTLP-Einbindung und des DuckDB-Speichers zu hinterfragen und bietet semantische Konventionen für die künstliche Intelligenz-Telemetrie und einheitliche Behebungs-Pipelines.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a questionar os logs usando ingestão OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB, fornecendo convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA e pipelines de correção unificados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью задавать вопросы логам с помощью ингестии OTLP и хранилища DuckDB, обеспечивая семантические конвенции для телеметрии ИИ и унифицированных конвейеров исправления.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على سؤال السجلات باستخدام استهلاك OTLP وتخزين DuckDB، مع توفير الاتفاقيات الدلالية لتелеметريا الذكاء الاصطناعي ومعالجات الإصلاح الموحدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging GenAI model performance issues","Analyzing LLM workload logs for errors","Implementing unified fix pipelines for AI workflows"],"zh":["调试 GenAI 模型性能问题","分析 LLM 工作负载日志以查找错误","为 AI 工作流实现统一的修复管道"],"ja":["GenAI モデルのパフォーマンスの問題をデバッグする","LLM ワークロードのログをエラーの分析する","AI ワークフローに統一された修復パイプラインを実装する"],"ko":["GenAI 모델 성능 문제 디버깅","LLM 워크로드 로그에서 오류 분석","AI 워크플ロー에 대한 통합 수정 파이프라인 구현"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de rendimiento del modelo GenAI","Análisis de registros de cargas de trabajo de LLM para errores","Implementación de pipelines de solución unificados para flujos de trabajo de IA"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes de performances du modèle GenAI","Analyse des journaux de charge de travail LLM pour les erreurs","Mise en œuvre de pipelines de correction unifiés pour les flux de travail IA"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Leistungsproblemen von GenAI-Modellen","Analyse von LLM-Workload-Protokollen auf Fehler","Implementierung einheitlicher Behebungs-Pipelines für künstliche Intelligenz-Workflows"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de desempenho do modelo GenAI","Análise de logs de carga de trabalho LLM para erros","Implementação de pipelines de correção unificados para fluxos de trabalho de IA"],"ru":["Отладка проблем производительности модели GenAI","Анализ логов рабочей нагрузки LLM на наличие ошибок","Реализация унифицированных конвейеров исправления для рабочих процессов ИИ"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء أداء نموذج GenAI","تحليل سجلات أنماط عمل LLM للأخطاء","تنفيذ معالجات إصلاح موحدة لأنماط عمل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OTLP ingestion compatibility","DuckDB storage dependency","Limited to GenAI/LLM workloads"],"zh":["需要 OTLP 吸收兼容性","依赖于 DuckDB 存储","仅限于 GenAI/LLM 工作负载"],"ja":["OTLP 経由の互換性が必要","DuckDB ストレージに依存している","GenAI/LLM ワークロードのみに限定される"],"ko":["OTLP 흡수 호환성 필요","DuckDB 저장소 종속성","GenAI/LLM 워크로드에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad de ingesta de OTLP","Dependencia de almacenamiento de DuckDB","Limitado a cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité d''ingestion OTLP","Dépendance du stockage DuckDB","Limité aux charges de travail GenAI/LLM"],"de":["Benötigt OTLP-Einbindungskompatibilität","DuckDB-Speicherabhängigkeit","Begrenzt auf GenAI/LLM-Workloads"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com ingestão OTLP","Dependência de armazenamento DuckDB","Limitado a cargas de trabalho GenAI/LLM"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с ингестией OTLP","Зависимость от хранилища DuckDB","Ограничен рабочими нагрузками GenAI/LLM"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع استهلاك OTLP","اعتماد على تخزين DuckDB","محدود لأنماط عمل GenAI/LLM"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/dart', 'community', 'itsimonfredlingjack', 'codex-dev-plugin', 'itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin', 'dart', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z', '2026-02-18T08:34:11.410Z', NULL, '{"id":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/dart","name":"dart","description":{"zh":"Dart 是一种现代的编程语言，用于构建高性能的 Web 和移动应用。它提供了简洁的语法和强大的功能","ja":"Dart は、高速な Web およびモバイル アプリケーションを構築するためのモダンなプログラミング言語です。簡潔な構文と強力な機能を提供します","ko":"Dart 는 현대적인 프로그래밍 언어로, 고성능의 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 사용됩니다. 간결한 구문과 강력한 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Dart es un lenguaje de programación moderno y versátil para desarrollar aplicaciones web y móviles. Ofrece una sintaxis simple y una gran cantidad de bibliotecas y frameworks.","fr":"Dart est un langage de programmation moderne et polyvalent pour développer des applications web et mobiles. Il propose une syntaxe simple et un grand nombre de bibliothèques et de frameworks.","de":"Dart ist eine moderne und vielseitige Programmiersprache für die Entwicklung von Web- und Mobilanwendungen. Es bietet eine einfache Syntax und eine große Anzahl von Bibliotheken und Frameworks.","pt":"Dart é uma linguagem de programação moderna que permite criar aplicativos rápidos e escaláveis. Com sua sintaxe simples e eficiente, é ideal para desenvolvedores que buscam criar soluções inovadoras.","ru":"Dart - современный язык программирования, который позволяет создавать быстрые и масштабируемые приложения. С его простой и эффективной синтаксисом, он идеален для разработчиков, которые хотят создавать инновационные решения.","ar":"دارت هي لغة برمجة حديثة تسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات سريعة وقابلة للتوسيع. مع بنية تحتية بسيطة وفعالة، فهي مثالية للمطورين الذين يبحثون عن حلول مبتكرة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Dart 编程语言","ja":"Dart プログラミング言語","ko":"Dart 프로그래밍 언어","es":"Dart: Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Rápidas y Segura