cription":{"zh":"项目规格撰写器可以自动生成项目文档，涵盖项目的所有必要部分","ja":"プロジェクト仕様書作成ツールは、プロジェクトの全ての必要な部分を網羅したプロジェクトドキュメントを自動生成します","ko":"프로젝트 사양 작성기는 프로젝트의 모든 필요한 부분을 포함한 프로젝트 문서를 자동 생성합니다","es":"El escritor de especificaciones de proyecto genera un documento integral para el proyecto actual con secciones como arquitectura y tecnología","fr":"Le rédacteur de spécifications de projet génère un document complet pour le projet actuel avec des sections comme l''architecture et la technologie","de":"Der Projektspezifikationsautor generiert ein umfassendes Dokument für das aktuelle Projekt mit Abschnitten wie Architektur und Technologie","pt":"O escritor de especificações de projeto gera um documento abrangente com seções como arquitetura, modelo de dados e pseudocódigo","ru":"Автор спецификаций проекта создает комплексный документ со разделами, такими как архитектура, модель данных и псевдокод","ar":"كاتب مواصفات المشروع يولد مستند شامل مع أقسام مثل الهندسة المعمارية ونموذج البيانات والكود الزائف","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动生成项目文档","涵盖项目的所有必要部分","包括架构、数据模型、伪代码等","支持模块关系图和序列图","支持ER图和类图"],"ja":["プロジェクトドキュメントを自動生成","プロジェクトの全ての必要な部分を網羅","アーキテクチャ、データモデル、疑似コードなどを含む","モジュール関係図とシーケンス図をサポート","ER図とクラス図をサポート"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서를 자동 생성","프로젝트의 모든 필요한 부분을 포함","아키텍처, 데이터 모델, 유사 코드 등","모듈 관계도와 시퀀스도를 지원","ER도와 클래스도를 지원"],"es":["Generación de documentación integral","Secciones personalizables como arquitectura y tecnología","Inclusión de pseudocódigo y diagramas de secuencia","Compatibilidad con proyectos de software","Documentación automática y eficiente"],"fr":["Génération de documentation complète","Sections personnalisables comme l''architecture et la technologie","Inclusion de pseudocode et de diagrammes de séquence","Compatibilité avec les projets de logiciel","Documentation automatique et efficace"],"de":["Erstellung von umfassender Dokumentation","Anpassbare Abschnitte wie Architektur und Technologie","Einclusion von Pseudocode und Sequenzdiagrammen","Kompatibilität mit Softwareprojekten","Automatisierte und effiziente Dokumentation"],"pt":["Geração de documento de especificação abrangente","Inclusão de seções como arquitetura e modelo de dados","Suporte a pseudocódigo e diagramas","Geração de diagramas de sequência e ER","Inclusão de diagramas de classes e relacionamentos de módulos"],"ru":["Создание комплексного документа спецификации","Включение разделов, таких как архитектура и модель данных","Поддержка псевдокода и диаграмм","Создание диаграмм последовательности и ER","Включение диаграмм классов и отношений модулей"],"ar":["إنشاء مستند مواصفات شامل","إدراج أقسام مثل الهندسة المعمارية ونموذج البيانات","دعم الكود الزائف والرسومات","إنشاء رسومات التسلسل وER","إدراج رسومات الفئات وعلاقات الوحدات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目规格撰写器","自动生成项目文档","项目文档工具","架构设计","数据模型设计","伪代码生成"],"ja":["プロジェクト仕様書作成ツール","プロジェクトドキュメント自動生成","プロジェクトドキュメントツール","アーキテクチャ設計","データモデル設計","疑似コード生成"],"ko":["프로젝트 사양 작성기","프로젝트 문서 자동 생성","프로젝트 문서 도구","아키텍처 설계","데이터 모델 설계","유사 코드 생성"],"es":["escritor de especificaciones de proyecto","generación de documentación","proyectos de software","arquitectura de software","pseudocódigo","diagramas de secuencia","documentación automática","herramientas de desarrollo","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["rédacteur de spécifications de projet","génération de documentation","projets de logiciel","architecture de logiciel","pseudocode","diagrammes de séquence","documentation automatique","outils de développement","développement de logiciel"],"de":["Projektspezifikationsautor","Erstellung von Dokumentation","Softwareprojekte","Softwarearchitektur","Pseudocode","Sequenzdiagramme","automatisierte Dokumentation","Entwicklungstools","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["escritor de especificações de projeto","geração de documento de especificação","arquitetura de software","modelo de dados","pseudocódigo","diagramas de sequência","diagramas de classes"],"ru":["автор спецификаций проекта","создание документа спецификации","архитектура программного обеспечения","модель данных","псевдокод","диаграммы последовательности","диаграммы классов"],"ar":["كاتب مواصفات المشروع","إنشاء مستند مواصفات","هندسة البرمجيات","نموذج البيانات","الكود الزائف","رسومات التسلسل","رسومات الفئات"]}},"owner":"sinjie2008","repo":"Foundational-Electronics-Core-Systems","repoPath":"sinjie2008/Foundational-Electronics-Core-Systems","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-specification-writer","description":"Generate a complete software specification document for the current project/repo, including architecture, data model, key processes, pseudocode, and Mermaid diagrams (context, container/deployment, module relations, sequence, ER, class, flowchart, state).","bodyPreview":"# Project Specification Writer (Instruction-only)\n\n## Goal\nWhen invoked, produce a **single, comprehensive specification document** for the **current repository/project** with **all required sections**:\n\n1. Architecture and technology choices  \n2. Data model  \n3. Key processes  \n4. Pseudocode  \n5. System context diagram  \n6. Container/deployment overview  \n7. Module relationship diagram (Backend / Frontend)  \n8. Sequence diagram  \n9. ER diagram  \n10. Class diagram (key backend classes)  \n11. Flo","body":"# Project Specification Writer (Instruction-only)\n\n## Goal\nWhen invoked, produce a **single, comprehensive specification document** for the **current repository/project** with **all required sections**:\n\n1. Architecture and technology choices  \n2. Data model  \n3. Key processes  \n4. Pseudocode  \n5. System context diagram  \n6. Container/deployment overview  \n7. Module relationship diagram (Backend / Frontend)  \n8. Sequence diagram  \n9. ER diagram  \n10. Class diagram (key backend classes)  \n11. Flowchart  \n12. State diagram  \n\n**Default output file:** `docs/specification.md`  \n(If `docs/` does not exist, create it. If user requests another path, follow it.)\n\n---\n\n## Invocation behavior\n### Minimal questions policy\nAsk **at most 5** clarifying questions **only if** the repo does not contain enough information to avoid unsafe guessing.  \nIf information is missing, proceed with best-effort inference and add an **“Assumptions & Open Questions”** section near the top.\n\n### No hallucinations rule\nDo **not** invent details. If you cannot locate evidence in the repo, label as:\n- **Assumption**\n- **Unknown/TBD**\n- **Open question**\n\n---\n\n## Repo reconnaissance workflow (do this first)\n1. Identify repo root and high-level structure:\n   - Look for: `README*`, `docs/`, `architecture/`, `ADR*`, `design*`, `SPEC*`.\n2. Detect tech stack and runtime:\n   - Backend signals: `pyproject.toml`, `requirements.txt`, `go.mod`, `pom.xml`, `build.gradle`, `.csproj`, `package.json` (server), `Dockerfile`\n   - Frontend signals: `package.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, `yarn.lock`, `vite.config.*`, `next.config.*`\n3. Detect data layer:\n   - DB migrations: `migrations/`, `prisma/schema.prisma`, `alembic/`, `db/schema.sql`, `knexfile.*`\n   - ORM models: `models/`, `entities/`, `schema/`\n4. Detect deployment:\n   - `docker-compose.yml`, `Dockerfile*`, `k8s/`, `helm/`, `.github/workflows/*`, `terraform/`\n5. Collect “evidence pointers” while reading (file paths + brief notes).  \n   You will use these pointers throughout the spec.\n\n---\n\n## Output requirements (strict)\n- Produce **one Markdown document**.\n- Use **clear headings** matching the 12 required items.\n- All diagrams must be in fenced Mermaid blocks:  \n  \\`\\`\\`mermaid  \n  ...  \n  \\`\\`\\`\n- Each section must be **project-specific** (grounded in repo findings).\n- Keep diagrams at the right abstraction level:\n  - **Context/Container**: high-level systems and deployed containers/services\n  - **Module diagram**: major frontend/backend modules and their dependencies\n  - **Class diagram**: only key backend classes (5–15), not every class\n\n---\n\n# Specification Document Template (write exactly this structure)\n\n# {{Project Name}} — Specification\n**Version:** {{date}}  \n**Repo:** {{repo identifier if known}}  \n**Primary stack:** {{inferred stack}}  \n\n## Assumptions & Open Questions\n- Assumption: ...\n- Open question: ...\n\n## 1. Architecture and technology choices\n### 1.1 Architecture overview\n- System style (e.g., monolith, modular monolith, microservices)\n- Key components and responsibilities\n- Trust boundaries (auth, secrets, network zones) if applicable\n\n### 1.2 Technology choices (with rationale)\nProvide a table:\n| Area | Choice | Evidence | Why this choice | Alternatives considered |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n### 1.3 Non-functional requirements (NFRs)\n- Performance, availability, security, observability, compliance, cost\n- What the repo suggests (or what’s missing)\n\n## 2. Data model\n### 2.1 Conceptual model\n- List core entities and what they represent\n- Identify ownership and lifecycle boundaries\n\n### 2.2 Logical model (tables/collections)\nProvide a table:\n| Entity/Table | Primary key | Key fields | Relationships | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n### 2.3 Data integrity & constraints\n- Uniqueness, foreign keys, soft delete, audit fields, tenancy strategy, etc.\n\n## 3. Key processes\nList 3–7 “key processes” (system behaviors) using this structure:\n- **Process name**\n  - Trigger:\n  - Inputs:\n  - Outputs:\n  - Key steps:\n  - Error cases:\n  - Observability (logs/metrics/traces):\n\n## 4. Pseudocode\nFor each key process, provide pseudocode:\n- Use clear function signatures\n- Include validation, error handling, retries/transactions where relevant\n\nExample format:\n```text\nfunction ProcessName(input):\n  validate input\n  begin transaction (if needed)\n  ...\n  return result\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:34:15.469Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing comprehensive project documentation capabilities with architecture and technology choices, data models, and system context diagrams.","zh":"非常适合需要全面项目文档功能的技术写作代理，包括架构和技术选择、数据模型和系统上下文图。","ja":"技術文書化エージェントが包括的なプロジェクト文書化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。アーキテクチャや技術の選択、データモデル、システムコンテキスト図などを網羅しています。","ko":"기술 문서 작성 에이전트가 포괄적인 프로젝트 문서화 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다. 아키텍처 및 기술 선택, 데이터 모델 및 시스템 컨텍스트 다이어그램이 포함됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Redacción Técnica que necesitan capacidades de documentación de proyecto integral con arquitectura y opciones de tecnología, modelos de datos y diagramas de contexto del sistema.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de capacités de documentation de projet complètes avec architecture et choix technologiques, modèles de données et diagrammes de contexte du système.","de":"Perfekt für technische Schreibagenten, die umfassende Projekt-Dokumentationsfunktionen mit Architektur und Technologieauswahl, Datenmodellen und Systemkontextdiagrammen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Redação Técnica que necessitam de capacidades de documentação de projetos abrangentes, com arquitetura e escolhas de tecnologia, modelos de dados e diagramas de contexto de sistema.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов технического письма, которым требуются всесторонние возможности документирования проектов с архитектурой и технологическими выборами, моделями данных и системными контекстными диаграммами.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الكتابة الفنية التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات وثائق مشروع شاملة مع هندسة ومخاطر تقنية، ونماذج بيانات ومخططات سياق النظام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive specification documents including pseudocode, sequence diagrams, ER diagrams, and class diagrams, utilizing module relationship diagrams and container/deployment overviews, all in a single, cohesive document.","zh":"赋予代理生成包括伪代码、序列图、ER图和类图在内的全面规格说明文档的能力，利用模块关系图和容器/部署概述，所有内容都在单个、连贯的文档中。","ja":"エージェントが包括的な仕様書を作成できるようにします。偽コード、シーケンス図、ER図、クラス図などを生成し、モジュール関係図やコンテナ/デプロイの概要を利用して、1つのドキュメントでまとめています。","ko":"에이전트가 가짜 코드, 시퀀스 다이어그램, ER 다이어그램 및 클래스 다이어그램을 포함한 포괄적인 사양 문서를 생성하도록 합니다. 모듈 관계 다이어그램 및 컨테이너/배포 개요를 사용하여 모든 내용을 하나의 문서에 담습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos de especificación completos que incluyen pseudocódigo, diagramas de secuencia, diagramas ER y diagramas de clases, utilizando diagramas de relación de módulos y contenedores/deployments, todo en un solo documento cohesivo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents de spécification complets comprenant du pseudocode, des diagrammes de séquence, des diagrammes ER et des diagrammes de classes, en utilisant des diagrammes de relation de modules et des aperçus de conteneur/déploiement, le tout dans un document cohésif unique.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Spezifikationsdokumente zu erstellen, die Pseudocode, Sequenzdiagramme, ER-Diagramme und Klassendiagramme enthalten, unter Verwendung von Modulbeziehungsdiagrammen und Container/Bereitstellungsübersichten, alles in einem einzigen, kohärenten Dokument.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem documentos de especificação abrangentes, incluindo pseudocódigo, diagramas de sequência, diagramas ER e diagramas de classe, utilizando diagramas de relacionamento de módulos e visões gerais de contêiner/implementação, tudo em um documento coeso.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать всесторонние документы спецификации, включая псевдокод, диаграммы последовательности, диаграммы ER и диаграммы классов, используя диаграммы отношений модулей и обзоры контейнеров/развертывания, все в одном сплоченном документе.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من توليد وثائق مواصفات شاملة، بما في ذلك الكود الزائف، ومخططات التسلسل، ومخططات الكيان-العلاقة، ومخططات الفئة، باستخدام مخططات علاقات الوحدات وملخصات الحاويات/النشر، كل ذلك في وثيقة متماسكة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project specification document generation for backend and frontend modules","Generating system context diagrams and module relationship diagrams for complex projects","Creating comprehensive data models and ER diagrams for database-driven applications"],"zh":["自动为后端和前端模块生成项目规格说明文档","为复杂项目生成系统上下文图和模块关系图","为数据库驱动的应用程序创建全面数据模型和ER图"],"ja":["バックエンドとフロントエンドモジュールのプロジェクト仕様書を自動生成する","複雑なプロジェクトのシステムコンテキスト図とモジュール関係図を生成する","データベース駆動のアプリケーションの包括的なデータモデルとER図を作成する"],"ko":["백엔드 및 프런트엔드 모듈의 프로젝트 사양 문서를 자동 생성합니다","복잡한 프로젝트의 시스템 컨텍스트 다이어그램 및 모듈 관계 다이어그램을 생성합니다","데이터베이스 구동 애플리케이션의 포괄적인 데이터 모델 및 ER 다이어그램을 생성합니다"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de documentos de especificación de proyecto para módulos backend y frontend","Generar diagramas de contexto del sistema y diagramas de relación de módulos para proyectos complejos","Crear modelos de datos completos y diagramas ER para aplicaciones impulsadas por bases de datos"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de documents de spécification de projet pour les modules backend et frontend","Générer des diagrammes de contexte du système et des diagrammes de relation de modules pour les projets complexes","Créer des modèles de données complets et des diagrammes ER pour les applications pilotées par bases de données"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Projektspezifikationsdokumenten für Backend- und Frontendmodule","Erstellen von Systemkontextdiagrammen und Modulbeziehungsdiagrammen für komplexe Projekte","Erstellen umfassender Datenmodelle und ER-Diagramme für datenbankgesteuerte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de documentos de especificação de projeto para módulos backend e frontend","Gerar diagramas de contexto de sistema e diagramas de relacionamento de módulos para projetos complexos","Criar modelos de dados abrangentes e diagramas ER para aplicações impulsionadas por banco de dados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию документов спецификации проекта для модулей backend и frontend","Генерировать системные контекстные диаграммы и диаграммы отношений модулей для сложных проектов","Создавать всесторонние модели данных и диаграммы ER для приложений, управляемых базой данных"],"ar":["تحقيق آلي لإنشاء مستندات مواصفات المشروع لوحدات الخلفية والأمامية","توليد مخططات سياق النظام ومخططات علاقات الوحدات للمشاريع المعقدة","إنشاء نماذج بيانات شاملة ومخططات الكيان-العلاقة لتطبيقات قواعد البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project repository and specific technical details","Limited to generating documents for projects with well-defined architecture and technology choices"],"zh":["需要访问项目仓库和特定的技术详细信息","仅限于为具有明确架构和技术选择的项目生成文档"],"ja":["プロジェクトリポジトリと特定の技術詳細へのアクセスが必要","明確なアーキテクチャと技術の選択を持つプロジェクトのドキュメント生成に限定される"],"ko":["프로젝트 저장소 및 특정 기술 세부 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","명확한 아키텍처 및 기술 선택을 갖춘 프로젝트의 문서 생성에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio del proyecto y detalles técnicos específicos","Limitado a la generación de documentos para proyectos con arquitectura y opciones de tecnología bien definidas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel de projet et à des détails techniques spécifiques","Limité à la génération de documents pour les projets avec une architecture et des choix technologiques bien définis"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Projekt-Repository und spezifische technische Details","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Dokumenten für Projekte mit gut definierten Architektur und Technologieauswahl"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório do projeto e detalhes técnicos específicos","Limitado à geração de documentos para projetos com arquitetura e escolhas de tecnologia bem definidas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию проекта и специфических технических деталей","Ограничен генерацией документов для проектов с хорошо определённой архитектурой и технологическими выборами"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع المشروع والتفاصيل الفنية المحددة","محدود بتوليد الوثائق للمشاريع ذات الهندسة والاختيارات التكنولوجية المحددة جيدًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('willasas/dcjs/ui-ux-pro-max', 'community', 'willasas', 'dcjs', 'willasas/dcjs', 'ui-ux-pro-max', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z', '2026-02-18T08:34:35.643Z', NULL, '{"id":"willasas/dcjs/ui-ux-pro-max","name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max - SCSS","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max - SCSS","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max - SCSS","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una herramienta de diseño inteligente que ofrece una base de datos de estilos UI y mejores prácticas","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un outil de conception intelligente qui propose une base de données de styles UI et de meilleures pratiques","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein Werkzeug für intelligente Gestaltung, das eine Datenbank mit UI-Stilen und Best Practices bietet","pt":"A UI/UX Pro Max é uma ferramenta de design inteligente que fornece um banco de dados de estilos de UI, paletas de cores e mais. Ela é construída com SCSS e oferece recursos avançados para designers e desenvolvedores.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это инструмент интеллектуального дизайна, который предоставляет базу данных стилей UI, цветовых палитр и многое другое. Он построен на основе SCSS и предлагает расширенные функции для дизайнеров и разработчиков.","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هي أداة تصميم ذكية توفر قاعدة بيانات لأسلوب واجهة المستخدم، وألوان، وتنسيق خطوط، ومخططات، وتوصيات المنتجات، وإرشادات تجربة المستخدم. وهي مبنية باستخدام SCSS وتقدم ميزات متقدمة لمصممي ومتطويرين التطبيقات.","en":"DC Style bulid with scss"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max - ","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max - SCSS","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max - SCSS","es":"UI/UX Pro Max: Diseño Inteligente con SCSS","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max: Intelligence de Conception avec SCSS","de":"UI/UX Pro Max: Design-Intelligenz mit SCSS","pt":"UI/UX Pro Max: Ferramenta de Design Inteligente","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max: Инструмент Интеллектуального Дизайна","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max: أداة تصميم ذكية","en":"ui-ux-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max - SCSS","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max - SCSS","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max - SCSS","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una herramienta de diseño inteligente que ofrece una base de datos de estilos UI y mejores prácticas","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un outil de conception intelligente qui propose une base de données de styles UI et de meilleures pratiques","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein Werkzeug für intelligente Gestaltung, das eine Datenbank mit UI-Stilen und Best Practices bietet","pt":"A UI/UX Pro Max é uma ferramenta de design inteligente que fornece um banco de dados de estilos de UI, paletas de cores e mais. Ela é construída com SCSS e o...","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это инструмент интеллектуального дизайна, который предоставляет базу данных стилей UI, цветовых палитр и многое другое. Он построен на основе...","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هي أداة تصميم ذكية توفر قاعدة بيانات لأسلوب واجهة المستخدم، وألوان، وتنسيق خطوط، ومخططات، وتوصيات المنتجات، وإرشادات تجربة المستخدم. وهي مبنية ...","en":"DC Style bulid with scss"},"definition":{"en":"DC Style bulid with scss"},"features":{"zh":["SCSS","UI","UX","Python","","SCSS"],"ja":["SCSS","UI","UX","Python","","SCSS"],"ko":["SCSS","UI","UX","Python","","SCSS"],"es":["Base de datos de estilos UI","Paletas de colores personalizables","Pares de fuentes recomendados","Tipos de gráficos","Recomendaciones de productos","Mejores prácticas para UX"],"fr":["Base de données de styles UI","Palettes de couleurs personnalisables","Paires de polices recommandées","Types de graphiques","Recommandations de produits","Meilleures pratiques pour UX"],"de":["Datenbank mit UI-Stilen","Anpassbare Farbpaletten","Empfohlene Schriftarten-Paare","Diagrammtypen","Produktempfehlungen","Best Practices für UX"],"pt":["Banco de dados de estilos de UI","Paletas de cores personalizadas","Recursos de design avançados","Integração com SCSS","Otimização para experiência do usuário","Ferramentas de design inteligente"],"ru":["База данных стилей UI","Персонализированные цветовые палитры","Расширенные функции дизайна","Интеграция с SCSS","Оптимизация для пользовательского опыта","Инструменты интеллектуального дизайна"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات لأسلوب واجهة المستخدم","ألوان وتنسيق خطوط","ميزات تصميم متقدمة","دمج مع SCSS","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","أدوات تصميم ذكية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX","SCSS","Python","UI","UX","SCSS","UI/UX Pro Max"],"ja":["UI/UX","SCSS","Python","UI","UX","SCSS","UI/UX Pro Max"],"ko":["UI/UX","SCSS","Python","UI","UX","SCSS","UI/UX Pro Max"],"es":["diseño UI","UX","SCSS","estilos UI","paletas de colores","mejores prácticas","desarrollo web","diseño inteligente"],"fr":["conception UI","UX","SCSS","styles UI","palettes de couleurs","meilleures pratiques","développement web","conception intelligente"],"de":["UI-Design","UX","SCSS","UI-Stile","Farbpaletten","Best Practices","Webentwicklung","intelligente Gestaltung"],"pt":["UI/UX","Design Inteligente","SCSS","Estilos de UI","Paletas de Cores","Experiência do Usuário","Ferramentas de Design","Desenvolvimento Web","Design de Interface"],"ru":["UI/UX","Интеллектуальный Дизайн","SCSS","Стили UI","Цветовые Палитры","Пользовательский Опыт","Инструменты Дизайна","Веб-Разработка","Дизайн Интерфейса"],"ar":["UI/UX","أداة تصميم ذكية","SCSS","أسلوب واجهة المستخدم","ألوان وتنسيق خطوط","تجربة المستخدم","أدوات تصميم","تطوير الويب","تصميم واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"willasas","repo":"dcjs","repoPath":"willasas/dcjs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 8 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Search Relevant Domains\n\nUse `search.py` multiple times to gather comprehensive information. Search until you have enough context.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**Recommended search order:**\n\n1. **Product** - Get style recommendations for product type\n2. **Style** - Get detailed style guide (colors, effects, frameworks)\n3. **Typography** - Get font pairings with Google Fonts imports\n4. **Color** - Get color palette (Primary, Secondary, CTA, Background, Text, Border)\n5. **Landing** - Get page structure (if landing page)\n6. **Chart** - Get chart recommendations (if dashboard/analytics)\n7. **UX** - Get best practices and anti-patterns\n8. **Stack** - Get stack-specific guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\n\n### Step 3: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nIf user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n**AI should:**\n\n```bash\n# 1. Search product type\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --domain product\n\n# 2. Search style (based on industry: beauty, elegant)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant minimal soft\" --domain style\n\n# 3. Search typography\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury\" --domain typography\n\n# 4. Search color palette\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness\" --domain color\n\n# 5. Search landing page structure\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"hero-centric social-proof\" --domain landing\n\n# 6. Search UX guidelines\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation\" --domain ux\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# 7. Search stack guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize all search results and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n7. **Split Into Multiple Files** - For better maintainability:\n   - Separate components into individual files (e.g., `Header.tsx`, `Footer.tsx`)\n   - Extract reusable styles into dedicated files\n   - Keep each file focused and under 200-300 lines\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:34:35.643Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced UI/UX design capabilities with SCSS and Python.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 UI/UX 设计能力的前端代理，支持 SCSS 和 Python。","ja":"SCSS と Python を使用した高度な UI/UX デザイン機能を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"SCSS 및 Python을 사용한 고급 UI/UX 디자인 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de diseño de UI/UX avanzadas con SCSS y Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de conception UI/UX avancées avec SCSS et Python.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte UI/UX-Designfunktionen mit SCSS und Python benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de design UI/UX com SCSS e Python.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности проектирования UI/UX с помощью SCSS и Python.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تصميم UI/UX متقدمة مع SCSS و Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, and font pairings, utilizing SCSS for styling and Python for backend integration, enabling seamless design intelligence and stack-specific best practices.","zh":"使代理能够利用可搜索的 UI 样式、颜色调色板和字体配对数据库，利用 SCSS 进行样式设置，利用 Python 进行后端集成，从而实现无缝的设计智能和堆栈特定最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントが検索可能な UI スタイル、カラーパレット、フォントのペアのデータベースを利用できるようにし、SCSS を使用したスタイリングと Python を使用したバックエンド統合により、シームレスなデザインインテリジェンスとスタック固有のベストプラクティスを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 검색 가능한 UI 스타일, 색상 팔레트 및 글꼴 페ア 데이터베이스를 활용할 수 있도록 하여 SCSS를 사용한 스타일 지정 및 Python을 사용한 백엔드 통합을 통해 무결점의 디자인 인텔리전스 및 스택 특정 최선의 방법을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar una base de datos buscable de estilos de UI, paletas de colores y combinaciones de fuentes, utilizando SCSS para el estilo y Python para la integración de backend, lo que permite una inteligencia de diseño sin problemas y las mejores prácticas específicas de la pila.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter une base de données de styles UI, de palettes de couleurs et de combinaisons de polices, en utilisant SCSS pour le style et Python pour l''intégration backend, ce qui permet une intelligence de conception sans faille et les meilleures pratiques spécifiques à la pile.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, eine durchsuchbare Datenbank von UI-Stilen, Farbpaletten und Schriftkombinationen zu nutzen, wobei SCSS für das Styling und Python für die Backend-Integration verwendet wird, was eine nahtlose Designintelligenz und stapelspezifische Best Practices ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar um banco de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI, paletas de cores e combinações de fontes, utilizando SCSS para estilização e Python para integração de backend, permitindo inteligência de design sem interrupções e práticas recomendadas específicas de pilha.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать поисковую базу данных стилей UI, цветовых палитр и пар комбинаций шрифтов, используя SCSS для стилизации и Python для интеграции бэкенда, обеспечивая бесперебойную интеллектуальность дизайна и рекомендованные практики, специфичные для стека.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط الواجهة المستخدمة وألوان وقوائم خطوط ، باستخدام SCSS للأسلوب و Python للدمج الخلفي ، وتتيح ذكاء التصميم دون انقطاع وأفضل الممارسات المحددة للطوابق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI component generation with consistent styling","Generating harmonious color schemes for web applications","Debugging UX issues with data-driven design guidelines"],"zh":["使用一致的样式自动生成 UI 组件","为 Web 应用程序生成和谐的颜色方案","使用数据驱动的设计指南调试 UX 问题"],"ja":["一貫したスタイリングで UI コンポーネントを自動生成する","Web アプリケーションの調和のとれた色彩スキームを生成する","データ駆動のデザインガイドラインを使用して UX の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["일관된 스타일로 UI 컴포넌트를 자동 생성하는 것","웹 애플리케이션에 대한 조화로운 색상 구성표를 생성하는 것","데이터 주도 디자인 가이드라인을 사용하여 UX 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de componentes de UI con estilos coherentes","Generar esquemas de colores armónicos para aplicaciones web","Depurar problemas de UX con pautas de diseño basadas en datos"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de composants UI avec des styles cohérents","Générer des schémas de couleurs harmonieux pour les applications web","Déboguer les problèmes d''UX avec des directives de conception basées sur les données"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von UI-Komponenten mit konsistenten Stilen","Erzeugen harmonischer Farbschemata für Webanwendungen","Fehlerbehebung bei UX-Problemen mit datengetriebenen Designrichtlinien"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de componentes de UI com estilização consistente","Gerar esquemas de cores harmônicos para aplicações web","Depurar problemas de UX com diretrizes de design baseadas em dados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию компонентов UI с последовательным стилем","Генерировать гармоничные цветовые схемы для веб-приложений","Отлаживать проблемы UX с помощью рекомендаций по дизайну на основе данных"],"ar":["تحويل تلقائي لعناصر واجهة المستخدم مع أسلوب موحد","إنشاء مخططات ألوان متناسقة للتطبيقات الويب","تصحيح أخطاء UX بإرشادات تصميم قائمة على البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python installation","Limited to design intelligence and UI/UX best practices","SCSS compatibility required for styling"],"zh":["需要 Python 安装","仅限设计智能和 UI/UX 最佳实践","需要 SCSS 兼容性进行样式设置"],"ja":["Python のインストールが必要","設計インテリジェンスと UI/UX ベストプラクティスに限定","スタイリングのために SCSS との互換性が必要"],"ko":["Python 설치가 필요합니다.","디자인 인텔리전