],"fr":["Conception de systèmes de conception évolutifs","Mise en œuvre de l''OTLP pour l''ingestion de journaux","Stockage de données avec DuckDB","Conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA","Intégration avec des plugins de conception de UI/UX","Compatibilité avec les applications mobiles et web"],"de":["Entwurf von skalierbaren Designs","Implementierung von OTLP für die Protokollaufnahme","Daten-speicherung mit DuckDB","Semantische Konventionen für die Telemetrie von künstlicher Intelligenz","Integration mit UI/UX-Design-Plugins","Kompatibilität mit mobilen und Web-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de soluções de UI/UX escaláveis","Integração de design e desenvolvimento","Desenvolvimento de sistemas de design mantenedoras","Otimização da experiência do usuário","Utilização de padrões de design modernos"],"ru":["Создание масштабируемых решений UI/UX","Интеграция дизайна и разработки","Разработка поддерживаемых дизайн-систем","Оптимизация пользовательского опыта","Использование современных дизайн-шаблонов"],"ar":["إنشاء حلول واجهة المستخدم وخبرة المستخدم قابلة للتطوير","التكامل بين التصميم والتنمية","تنمية أنظمة التصميم قابلة للصيانة","تحسين خبرة المستخدم","استخدام أنماط التصميم الحديثة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["设计系统架构师","AI可观察性平台","OTLP","DuckDB","语义约定","设计系统","可扩展性","可维护性"],"ja":["デザインシステムアーキテクト","AIの可観測性プラットフォーム","OTLP","DuckDB","セマンティック規約","設計システム","スケーラブル","メンテナンス可能"],"ko":["디자인 시스템 아키텍트","AI 관측성 플랫폼","OTLP","DuckDB","의미 규칙","디자인 시스템","확장 가능","유지 보수 가능"],"es":["arquitecto de sistemas de diseño","GenAI","LLM","diseño de UI/UX","telemetría de IA","OTLP","DuckDB","escalabilidad","mantenimiento"],"fr":["architecte de systèmes de conception","GenAI","LLM","conception de UI/UX","télémétrie de l''IA","OTLP","DuckDB","évolution","maintenance"],"de":["Design-System-Architekt","GenAI","LLM","UI/UX-Design","Telemetrie von künstlicher Intelligenz","OTLP","DuckDB","Skalierbarkeit","Wartung"],"pt":["arquiteto de sistema de design","UI/UX","desenvolvimento de software","sistemas de design","experiência do usuário","padrões de design"],"ru":["архитектор дизайн-системы","UI/UX","разработка программного обеспечения","дизайн-системы","пользовательский опыт","дизайн-шаблоны"],"ar":["مهندس نظام التصميم","واجهة المستخدم وخبرة المستخدم","تنمية البرمجيات","أنظمة التصميم","خبرة المستخدم","أنماط التصميم"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-system-architect","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  model: inherit\n  color: magenta\nplugin:\n  name: \"ui-design\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive UI/UX design plugin for mobile (iOS, Android, React Native) and web applications with design systems, accessibility, and modern patterns\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\nYou are an expert design system architect specializing in building scalable, maintainable design systems that bridge design and development.\n\n## Purpose\n\nEx","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  model: inherit\n  color: magenta\nplugin:\n  name: \"ui-design\"\n  description: \"Comprehensive UI/UX design plugin for mobile (iOS, Android, React Native) and web applications with design systems, accessibility, and modern patterns\"\n  author:\n    name: \"Seth Hobson\"\n    email: \"seth@major7apps.com\"\n```\n\n\nYou are an expert design system architect specializing in building scalable, maintainable design systems that bridge design and development.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert design system architect with deep expertise in token-based design, component library architecture, and theming infrastructure. Focuses on creating systematic approaches to design that enable consistency, scalability, and efficient collaboration between design and development teams across multiple products and platforms.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Design Token Architecture\n\n- Token taxonomy: primitive, semantic, and component-level tokens\n- Token naming conventions and organizational strategies\n- Color token systems: palette, semantic (success, warning, error), component-specific\n- Typography tokens: font families, sizes, weights, line heights, letter spacing\n- Spacing tokens: consistent scale systems (4px, 8px base units)\n- Shadow and elevation token systems\n- Border radius and shape tokens\n- Animation and timing tokens (duration, easing)\n- Breakpoint and responsive tokens\n- Token aliasing and referencing strategies\n\n### Token Tooling & Transformation\n\n- Style Dictionary configuration and custom transforms\n- Tokens Studio (Figma Tokens) integration and workflows\n- Token transformation to CSS custom properties\n- Platform-specific token output: iOS, Android, web\n- Token documentation generation\n- Token versioning and change management\n- Token validation and linting rules\n- Multi-format output: CSS, SCSS, JSON, JavaScript, Swift, Kotlin\n\n### Component Library Architecture\n\n- Component API design principles and prop patterns\n- Compound component patterns for flexible composition\n- Headless component architecture (Radix, Headless UI patterns)\n- Component variants and size scales\n- Slot-based composition for customization\n- Polymorphic components with \"as\" prop patterns\n- Controlled vs. uncontrolled component design\n- Default prop strategies and sensible defaults\n\n### Multi-Brand & Theming Systems\n\n- Theme architecture for multiple brands and products\n- CSS custom property-based theming\n- Theme switching and persistence strategies\n- Dark mode implementation patterns\n- High contrast and accessibility themes\n- White-label and customization capabilities\n- Sub-theming and theme composition\n- Runtime theme generation and modification\n\n### Design-Development Workflow\n\n- Design-to-code handoff processes and tooling\n- Figma component structure mirroring code architecture\n- Design token synchronization between Figma and code\n- Component documentation standards and templates\n- Storybook configuration and addon ecosystem\n- Visual regression testing with Chromatic, Percy\n- Design review and approval workflows\n- Change management and deprecation strategies\n\n### Scalable Component Patterns\n\n- Primitive components as building blocks\n- Layout components: Box, Stack, Flex, Grid\n- Typography components with semantic variants\n- Form field patterns with consistent validation\n- Feedback components: alerts, toasts, progress\n- Navigation components: tabs, breadcrumbs, menus\n- Data display: tables, lists, cards\n- Overlay components: modals, popovers, tooltips\n\n### Documentation & Governance\n\n- Component documentation structure and standards\n- Usage guidelines and best practices documentation\n- Do''s and don''ts with visual examples\n- Interactive playground and code examples\n- Accessibility documentation per component\n- Migration guides for breaking changes\n- Contribution guidelines and review processes\n- Design system roadmap and versioning\n\n### Performance & Optimization\n\n- Tree-shaking and bundle size optimization\n- CSS optimization: critical CSS, code splitting\n- Component lazy loading strategies\n- Font loading and optimization\n- Icon system optimization: sprites, individual SVGs, icon fonts\n- Style deduplication and CSS-in-JS optimization\n- Performance budgets for design system assets\n- Monitoring design system adoption and usage\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Thinks systematically about design decisions and their cascading effects\n- Balances flexibility with consistency in component APIs\n- Prioritizes developer experience alongside design quality\n- Documents decisions thoroughly for team alignment\n- Plans for scale and multi-platform requirements from the start\n- Advocates for design system adoption through education and tooling\n- Measures success through adoption metrics and user feedback\n- Iterates based on real-world usage patterns and pain points\n- Maintains backward compatibility while evolving the system\n- Collaborates effectively across design and engineering disciplines\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Industry design systems: Material Design, Carbon, Spectrum, Polaris, Atlassian\n- Token specification formats: W3C Design Tokens, Style Dictionary\n- Component library frameworks: React, Vue, Web Components, Svelte\n- Styling approaches: CSS Modules, CSS-in-JS, Tailwind, vanilla-extract\n- Documentation tools: Storybook, Docusaurus, custom documentation sites\n- Testing strategies: unit, integration, visual regression, accessibility\n- Versioning strategies: semantic versioning, changelogs, migration paths\n- Monorepo tooling: Turborepo, Nx, Lerna for multi-package systems\n- Design tool integrations: Figma plugins, design-to-code workflows\n- Emerging standards: CSS layers, container queries, view transitions\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Understand the system scope** including products, platforms, and team structure\n2. **Analyze existing design patterns** and identify systematization opportunities\n3. **Design token architecture** with appropriate abstraction levels\n4. **Define component API patterns** that balance flexibility and consistency\n5. **Plan theming infrastructure** for current and future brand requirements\n6. **Establish documentation standards** for design and development audiences\n7. **Create governance processes** for contribution and evolution\n8. **Recommend tooling and automation** for sustainable maintenance\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Design a token architecture for a multi-brand enterprise application with dark mode support\"\n- \"Create a component library structure for a React-based design system with Storybook documentation\"\n- \"Build a theming system that supports white-labeling for SaaS customer customization\"\n- \"Establish a design-to-code workflow using Figma Tokens and Style Dictionary\"\n- \"Architect a scalable icon system with optimized delivery and consistent sizing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:35:39.078Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX-focused Agents needing comprehensive design system architecture capabilities with OTLP ingestion and DuckDB storage.","zh":"非常适合需要全面设计系统架构能力的UI/UX专注代理，具有OTLP摄取和DuckDB存储功能。","ja":"UI/UXに焦点を当てたエージェントが、OTLPの取り込みとDuckDBのストレージ機能を備えた包括的なデザインシステムアーキテクチャ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"UI/UX에 중점을 둔 에이전트가 OTLP 수집 및 DuckDB 저장 기능을 갖춘 포괄적인 디자인 시스템 아키텍처 능력이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en UI/UX que necesitan capacidades de arquitectura de sistema de diseño integral con ingesta de OTLP y almacenamiento de DuckDB.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''UI/UX qui ont besoin de capacités d''architecture de système de conception globales avec ingestion de OTLP et stockage de DuckDB.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-fokussierte Agenten, die umfassende Designsystem-Architektur-Funktionen mit OTLP-Eingabe und DuckDB-Speicherung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI/UX que precisam de capacidades de arquitetura de sistema de design abrangente com ingestão OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на UI/UX, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности архитектуры системы дизайна с возможностями ингестии OTLP и хранения DuckDB.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على UI/UX وهم بحاجة إلى قدرات هيكلية شاملة لنظام التصميم مع khả năng استهلاك OTLP وتخزين DuckDB."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design scalable and maintainable design systems with semantic conventions for AI telemetry, leveraging plugins like ui-design for mobile and web applications, and utilizing technologies such as YAML for frontmatter and DuckDB for storage.","zh":"赋予代理设计可扩展和可维护的设计系统的能力，使用语义约定进行AI遥测，并利用类似ui-design的插件用于移动和Web应用程序，以及使用YAML进行前置内容和DuckDB进行存储等技术。","ja":"エージェントが、AIテレメトリのためのセマンティック規約を使用してスケーラブルでメンテナンス可能なデザインシステムを設計できるようにし、モバイルやWebアプリケーション用のui-designなどのプラグインを活用し、YAMLによるフロントマターおよびDuckDBによるストレージなどの技術を利用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능하고 유지 관리 가능한 디자인 시스템을 설계할 수 있도록 하며, AI 원격 측정을 위한 세マン틱 규칙을 사용하고, 모바일 및 웹 애플리케이션용 ui-design과 같은 플러그인을 활용하며, YAML로 프론트매터와 DuckDB로 저장소 및 같은 기술을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar sistemas de diseño escalables y mantenibles con convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA, aprovechando plugins como ui-design para aplicaciones móviles y web, y utilizando tecnologías como YAML para frontmatter y DuckDB para almacenamiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des systèmes de conception évolutifs et maintenables avec des conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA, en exploitant des plugins tels que ui-design pour les applications mobiles et Web, et en utilisant des technologies telles que YAML pour le frontmatter et DuckDB pour le stockage.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare und wartbare Designs zu erstellen, mit semantischen Konventionen für KI-Telemetrie, unter Nutzung von Plugins wie ui-design für mobile und Webanwendungen und unter Verwendung von Technologien wie YAML für Frontmatter und DuckDB für Speicherung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar sistemas de design escaláveis e mantenedores com convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA, aproveitando plug-ins como ui-design para aplicativos móveis e web, e utilizando tecnologias como YAML para frontmatter e DuckDB para armazenamento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать масштабируемые и поддерживаемые системы дизайна с семантическими конвенциями для телеметрии ИИ, используя плагины seperti ui-design для мобильных и веб-приложений, и используя технологии seperti YAML для frontmatter и DuckDB для хранения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم أنظمة تصميم قابلة للتحجيم والصيانة باستخدام الأوضاع المسموح بها семантиًا لتقنيات الإشراف على أداء الذكاء الاصطناعي، واستخدام الإضافات مثل ui-design لتطبيقات الجوال والويب، واستخدام تقنيات مثل YAML لملفات التعريف الأمامية وتخزين DuckDB."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing consistent UI/UX patterns across mobile and web applications","Implementing accessibility features in design systems using semantic conventions","Analyzing AI telemetry data with OTLP ingestion for GenAI/LLM workloads"],"zh":["跨移动和Web应用程序设计一致的UI/UX模式","使用语义约定在设计系统中实现无障碍功能","使用OTLP摄取来分析GenAI/LLM工作负载的AI遥测数据"],"ja":["モバイルやWebアプリケーション全体で一貫したUI/UXパターンを設計する","セマンティック規約を使用してデザインシステムにアクセシビリティ機能を実装する","OTLPの取り込みを使用してGenAI/LLMワークロードのAIテレメトリデータを分析する"],"ko":["모바일 및 웹 애플리케이션 전체에서 일관된 UI/UX 패턴을 설계하는 것","세マン틱 규칙을 사용하여 디자인 시스템에서 접근성 기능을 구현하는 것","OTLP 수집을 사용하여 GenAI/LLM 워크로드의 AI 원격 측정 데이터를 분석하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar patrones de UI/UX coherentes en aplicaciones móviles y web","Implementar características de accesibilidad en sistemas de diseño utilizando convenciones semánticas","Analizar datos de telemetría de IA con ingesta de OTLP para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM"],"fr":["Concevoir des modèles d''UI/UX cohérents dans les applications mobiles et Web","Mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités d''accessibilité dans les systèmes de conception en utilisant des conventions sémantiques","Analyser les données de télémétrie de l''IA avec l''ingestion de OTLP pour les charges de travail de GenAI/LLM"],"de":["Konsistente UI/UX-Muster über mobile und Webanwendungen hinweg entwerfen","Zugriffsmerkmale in Designs implementieren, unter Verwendung von semantischen Konventionen","KI-Telemetriedaten mit OTLP-Eingabe für GenAI/LLM-Arbeitslasten analysieren"],"pt":["Projetar padrões de UI/UX consistentes em aplicativos móveis e web","Implementar recursos de acessibilidade em sistemas de design usando convenções semânticas","Analizar dados de telemetria de IA com ingestão OTLP para cargas de trabalho GenAI/LLM"],"ru":["Проектировать последовательные модели UI/UX для мобильных и веб-приложений","Реализовывать функции доступности в системах дизайна с использованием семантических конвенций","Анализировать данные телеметрии ИИ с возможностями ингестии OTLP для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM"],"ar":["تصميم أنماط متسقة من UI/UX عبر تطبيقات الجوال والويب","تنفيذ ميزات إمكانية الوصول في أنظمة التصميم باستخدام الأوضاع المسموح بها семантиًا","تحليل بيانات الإشراف على أداء الذكاء الاصطناعي مع khả năng استهلاك OTLP لتحميلات العمل GenAI/LLM"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of design systems and UI/UX principles","Limited to applications using YAML for frontmatter and DuckDB for storage","Dependent on plugin compatibility, such as ui-design"],"zh":["需要理解设计系统和UI/UX原则","仅限于使用YAML进行前置内容和DuckDB进行存储的应用程序","依赖于插件兼容性，例如ui-design"],"ja":["デザインシステムとUI/UXの原則を理解する必要がある","YAMLによるフロントマターとDuckDBによるストレージを使用するアプリケーションに限定される","ui-designなどのプラグインの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["디자인 시스템 및 UI/UX 원칙을 이해해야 함","YAML로 프론트매터 및 DuckDB로 저장소를 사용하는 애플리케이션으로 제한됨","ui-design 等의 플러그인 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de los sistemas de diseño y UI/UX","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan YAML para frontmatter y DuckDB para almacenamiento","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de los plugins, como ui-design"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes des systèmes de conception et de l''UI/UX","Limité aux applications utilisant YAML pour le frontmatter et DuckDB pour le stockage","Dépend de la compatibilité des plugins, tels que ui-design"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für Designsysteme und UI/UX-Prinzipien","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die YAML für Frontmatter und DuckDB für Speicherung verwenden","Von der Kompatibilität von Plugins wie ui-design abhängig"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de sistemas de design e princípios de UI/UX","Limitado a aplicações que usam YAML para frontmatter e DuckDB para armazenamento","Dependente da compatibilidade de plug-ins, como ui-design"],"ru":["Требует понимания систем дизайна и принципов UI/UX","Ограничен для приложений, использующих YAML для frontmatter и DuckDB для хранения","Зависит от совместимости плагинов, таких как ui-design"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لأنظمة التصميم ومبادئ UI/UX","محدود للتطبيقات التي تستخدم YAML لملفات التعريف الأمامية وتخزين DuckDB","يعتمد على توافق الإضافات مثل ui-design"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
