ten Versionen","Sammlung von wichtigen Änderungen und Migrationsleitfäden","Erstellung eines umfassenden Aktualisierungsplans","Optimierung der Softwarearchitektur"],"pt":["Análise de arquivos package.json","Criação de planos de atualização personalizados","Pesquisa de versões mais recentes de dependências","Coleta de alterações quebradoras e guias de migração","Geração de planos de atualização abrangentes"],"ru":["Анализ файлов package.json","Создание индивидуальных планов обновления","Поиск более новых версий зависимостей","Сбор изменений, нарушающих совместимость, и руководств по миграции","Генерация комплексных планов обновления"],"ar":["تحليل ملفات package.json","إنشاء خطط ترقية مخصصة","البحث عن إصدارات أحدث من الإعتماديات","جمع التغييرات التي كسرت التوافق والتوجيهات حول الهجرة","إنشاء خطط ترقية شاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端包升级","package.json分析","最新版本研究","破坏性变化","迁移指南","前端项目优化","兼容性和稳定性","前端包管理"],"ja":["フロントエンドパッケージアップグレード","package.jsonファイル分析","最新バージョン調査","破壊的変更","移行ガイド","フロントエンドプロジェクト最適化","互換性と安定性","フロントエンドパッケージ管理"],"ko":["프론트엔드 패키지 업그레이드","package.json 파일 분석","최신 버전 연구"," 破壊적 변경","마이그레이션 가이드","프론트엔드 프로젝트 최적화","호환성 및 안정성","프론트엔드 패키지 관리"],"es":["actualización de paquetes frontend","gestión de paquetes npm","arquitectura de software","análisis de dependencias","planificación de actualizaciones","seguridad de software","estabilidad de software"],"fr":["mise à jour de paquets frontend","gestion de paquets npm","architecture logicielle","analyse de dépendances","planification de mises à jour","sécurité logicielle","stabilité logicielle"],"de":["Frontend-Paket-Aktualisierung","Paketverwaltung npm","Softwarearchitektur","Abhängigkeitsanalyse","Aktualisierungsplanung","Software-Sicherheit","Software-Stabilität"],"pt":["atualização de pacotes frontend","análise de package.json","plano de atualização","versões mais recentes de dependências","alterações quebradoras","guias de migração"],"ru":["обновление фронтенд-пакетов","анализ package.json","план обновления","более новые версии зависимостей","изменения, нарушающие совместимость","руководства по миграции"],"ar":["ترقية حزمة واجهة المستخدم","تحليل package.json","خطة ترقية","إصدارات أحدث من الإعتماديات","التغييرات التي كسرت التوافق","دلائل الهجرة"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.469Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"package-upgrade","description":"Use when the user asks to analyze package upgrades, check for outdated dependencies, plan npm/NuGet updates, or assess breaking changes in package updates. Triggers on keywords like upgrade packages, outdated, npm update, breaking changes, dependency upgrade, package update, version upgrade.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Package Upgrade Analysis & Planning\n\nYou are to operate as an expert frontend package management specialist, npm ecosystem analyst, and software architecture expert to analyze package.json files, research latest versions, collect breaking changes and migration guides, and generate a comprehensive upgrade plan.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Always thinks hard, plan step by step to-do list first before execute. Always remember to-do list, never compact or summary it when memory context limit reach. A","body":"# Frontend Package Upgrade Analysis & Planning\n\nYou are to operate as an expert frontend package management specialist, npm ecosystem analyst, and software architecture expert to analyze package.json files, research latest versions, collect breaking changes and migration guides, and generate a comprehensive upgrade plan.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Always thinks hard, plan step by step to-do list first before execute. Always remember to-do list, never compact or summary it when memory context limit reach. Always preserve and carry your to-do list through every operation.\n\n---\n\n## Core Anti-Hallucination Protocols\n\n### ASSUMPTION_VALIDATION_CHECKPOINT\nBefore every major operation:\n1. \"What assumptions am I making about [X]?\"\n2. \"Have I verified this with actual code evidence?\"\n3. \"Could I be wrong about [specific pattern/relationship]?\"\n\n### EVIDENCE_CHAIN_VALIDATION\nBefore claiming any relationship:\n- \"I believe package X is compatible because...\" → show actual compatibility matrix\n- \"This version has breaking changes because...\" → cite official changelog\n- \"Migration effort is Y hours because...\" → show evidence from similar migrations\n\n### TOOL_EFFICIENCY_PROTOCOL\n- Batch multiple WebSearch calls for related packages\n- Use parallel Read operations for package.json files\n- Batch package research into groups of 10\n\n### CONTEXT_ANCHOR_SYSTEM\nEvery 10 packages researched:\n1. Re-read the original task description\n2. Verify the current operation aligns with original goals\n3. Update the `Current Focus` in `## Progress` section\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 1: PACKAGE INVENTORY & CURRENT STATE ANALYSIS\n\nBuild package inventory in `ai_task_analysis_notes/frontend-package-upgrade-analysis.md`.\n\n### PHASE 1A: INITIALIZATION AND PACKAGE DISCOVERY\n\nInitialize analysis file with:\n- `## Metadata` - Original prompt and task description\n- `## Progress` - Track phase, items processed, total items\n- `## Package Inventory` - All package.json files and dependencies\n- `## Version Research Results` - Latest versions and changelogs\n- `## Breaking Changes Analysis` - Breaking changes catalog\n- `## Migration Complexity Assessment` - Risk levels and effort estimates\n- `## Upgrade Strategy` - Phased migration plan\n\n**Find all package.json files**:\n```\nsrc/PlatformExampleAppWeb/package.json\nsrc/PlatformExampleAppWeb/apps/*/package.json\nsrc/PlatformExampleAppWeb/libs/*/package.json\n```\n\nFor each package.json, document:\n- Project Name & Location\n- Framework Version\n- Dependencies (categorized: Framework, UI, Build Tools, Testing, Utilities)\n- DevDependencies\n\nCreate **Master Package List** consolidating all unique packages.\n\n### PHASE 1B: PACKAGE USAGE ANALYSIS\n\nFor each unique package, analyze codebase usage:\n- **Projects Using**: Which projects depend on this\n- **Import Count**: Number of files importing\n- **Key Usage Areas**: Where primarily used\n- **Configuration Files**: Config files for this package\n- **Upgrade Risk Level**: Low/Medium/High/Critical based on usage breadth\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 2: WEB RESEARCH & VERSION DISCOVERY\n\n**IMPORTANT: BATCH INTO GROUPS OF 10**\n\nFor EACH package in Master Package List:\n\n### Latest Version Discovery\n- Search: \"[package-name] npm latest version\"\n- Check: https://www.npmjs.com/package/[package-name]\n- Extract: Latest stable version, release date, downloads\n\n### Breaking Changes Research\n- Search: \"[package-name] migration guide [old-version] to [new-version]\"\n- Search: \"[package-name] v[X] breaking changes\"\n- Search: \"[package-name] changelog\"\n- GitHub: Check CHANGELOG.md, releases\n\n### Ecosystem Compatibility\n- Angular version compatibility\n- Check peerDependencies\n- Cross-package dependencies\n\nDocument:\n- Current vs. Latest versions\n- Version gap (major/minor/patch versions behind)\n- Breaking changes with migration steps\n- Deprecation warnings\n- Peer dependency changes\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 3: RISK ASSESSMENT & PRIORITIZATION\n\n### Risk Categories\n- **Critical Risk**: 5+ major versions behind, framework packages, 50+ breaking changes\n- **High Risk**: 3-4 major versions, state management, 20-30 breaking changes\n- **Medium Risk**: 1-2 major versions, some breaking changes\n- **Low Risk**: Patch/minor updates, backward compatible\n\n### Dependency Graph (Upgrade Order)\n1. Foundation packages (Node.js, TypeScript)\n2. Framework packages (Angular Core, CLI)\n3. Framework extensions (Material, RxJS)\n4. Third-party libraries\n5. Dev tools last\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 4: COMPREHENSIVE REPORT GENERATION\n\nGenerate report at `ai_package_upgrade_reports/[YYYY-MM-DD]-frontend-package-upgrade-report.md`:\n\n### Report Structure\n\n1. **Executive Summary**\n2. **Package Inventory by Project**\n3. **Version Gap Analysis**\n4. **Breaking Changes Catalog**\n5. **Migration Complexity Assessment**\n6. **Ecosystem Compatibility Analysis**\n7. **Recommended Upgrade Strategy** (Phased Migration Plan)\n8. **Detailed Migration Guides**\n9. **Testing Strategy**\n10. **Rollback Plan**\n11. **Timeline & Resource Estimation**\n12. **Appendices**\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 5: APPROVAL GATE\n\n**CRITICAL**: Present comprehensive package upgrade report for explicit approval. **DO NOT** proceed without it.\n\n---\n\n## PHASE 6: CONFIDENCE DECLARATION\n\nBefore marking complete, provide:\n\n### Solution Confidence Assessment\n\n**Overall Confidence**: [High 90-100% / Medium 70-89% / Low <70%]\n\n**Evidence Summary**:\n- All package.json files discovered: [count]\n- Web research completed: [X/Y packages]\n- Breaking changes documented: [count]\n- Official sources used: npm, GitHub, official docs\n\n**Assumptions Made**: [List or \"None\"]\n\n**User Confirmation Needed**:\n- IF confidence < 90%: \"Please verify [specific packages] before proceeding\"\n- IF confidence >= 90%: \"Analysis is comprehensive, ready for migration\"\n\n---\n\n## Package Upgrade Guidelines\n\n- **Comprehensive Discovery**: Find ALL package.json files\n- **Web Research Accuracy**: Use official sources only (npm, GitHub, official docs)\n- **Breaking Changes Focus**: Prioritize identifying breaking changes requiring code changes\n- **Risk Assessment**: Evaluate complexity based on breaking changes, usage breadth, dependencies\n- **Practical Planning**: Create actionable phased plan with realistic effort estimates\n- **Evidence-Based Decisions**: Base ALL recommendations on actual research with sources cited\n- **Confidence Declaration**: Declare confidence level; if < 90%, request user confirmation\n- **Batch Processing**: Research packages in batches of 10\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:38:17.660Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced npm package management and upgrade planning capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级npm包管理和升级规划能力的AI代理。","ja":"npmパッケージの管理とアップグレード計画に高度な機能が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 npm 패키지 관리 및 업그레이드 계획 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión y planificación de actualizaciones de paquetes npm.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de capacités avancées de gestion et de planification de mises à jour de packages npm.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte npm-Paketverwaltungs- und Upgrade-Planungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de gerenciamento avançado de pacotes npm e capacidades de planejamento de atualização.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления пакетами npm и планирования обновлений.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة لحزم npm ووظائف التخطيط للترقية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze package.json files, research latest versions, collect breaking changes and migration guides using npm ecosystem analysis, and generate comprehensive upgrade plans in a step-by-step to-do list, ensuring seamless frontend package upgrades.","zh":"赋予代理分析package.json文件、研究最新版本、收集破坏性变化和迁移指南的能力，并使用npm生态系统分析生成一步一步的升级计划，以确保前端包的无缝升级。","ja":"エージェントがpackage.jsonファイルを分析し、最新バージョンを調査し、破壊的な変更と移行ガイドを収集し、npmエコシステム分析を使用して包括的なアップグレード計画をステップバイステップのToDoリストで生成する機能を提供し、フロントエンドパッケージの無停止アップグレードを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 package.json 파일을 분석하고 최신 버전을 연구하며 破壊적인 변경과 마이그레이션 가이드를 수집하고 npm 에코시스템 분석을 사용하여 포괄적인 업그레이드 계획을 단계별로 생성하여 프론트엔드 패키지의 무중단 업그레이드를 보장하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar archivos package.json, investigar las versiones más recientes, recopilar cambios importantes y guías de migración utilizando el análisis del ecosistema npm, y generar planes de actualización integrales en una lista de tareas paso a paso, garantizando actualizaciones de paquetes frontend sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les fichiers package.json, de rechercher les versions les plus récentes, de collecter les changements importants et les guides de migration en utilisant l''analyse de l''écosystème npm, et de générer des plans de mise à jour complets dans une liste de tâches étape par étape, garantissant des mises à jour de paquets frontend sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, package.json-Dateien zu analysieren, die neuesten Versionen zu erforschen, wichtige Änderungen und Migrationsleitfäden unter Verwendung der npm-Ökosystemanalyse zu sammeln und umfassende Upgrade-Pläne in einer schrittweisen To-Do-Liste zu generieren, um eine reibungslose Aktualisierung von Frontend-Paketen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar arquivos package.json, pesquisar as versões mais recentes, coletar alterações de quebra e guias de migração usando a análise do ecossistema npm e gerar planos de atualização abrangentes em uma lista de tarefas passo a passo, garantindo atualizações de pacotes de frontend sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать файлы package.json, исследовать последние версии, собирать критические изменения и руководства по миграции с помощью анализа экосистемы npm, а также генерировать комплексные планы обновления в пошаговом списке дел, обеспечивающих бесперебойные обновления пакетов frontend.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحليل ملفات package.json، والبحث عن الإصدارات الأحدث، وجمع التغييرات التي تسبب فشلاً ودلائل الهجرة باستخدام تحليل نظام إدارة الحزم npm، وتوليد خطط ترقية شاملة في قائمة عمل خطوة بخطوة، مما يضمن تحديث حزمة واجهة المستخدم دون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing package.json files for outdated dependencies","Generating comprehensive upgrade plans with breaking changes and migration guides","Researching latest versions of npm packages for optimal project performance"],"zh":["分析package.json文件以查找过时的依赖项","生成包含破坏性变化和迁移指南的综合升级计划","研究npm包的最新版本以实现最佳项目性能"],"ja":["package.jsonファイルを分析して古い依存関係を探す","破壊的な変更と移行ガイドを含む包括的なアップグレード計画を生成する","npmパッケージの最新バージョンを調査してプロジェクトのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["package.json 파일을 분석하여 오래된 의존 관계를 찾는 것","파괴적인 변경과 마이그레이션 가이드를 포함한 포괄적인 업그레이드 계획을 생성하는 것","npm 패키지의 최신 버전을 조사하여 프로젝트 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Analizar archivos package.json para detectar dependencias obsoletas","Generar planes de actualización integrales con cambios importantes y guías de migración","Investigar las versiones más recientes de los paquetes npm para un rendimiento óptimo del proyecto"],"fr":["Analyser les fichiers package.json pour détecter les dépendances obsolètes","Générer des plans de mise à jour complets avec des changements importants et des guides de migration","Rechercher les versions les plus récentes des packages npm pour une performance optimale du projet"],"de":["Analysieren von package.json-Dateien, um veraltete Abhängigkeiten zu erkennen","Erstellen umfassender Upgrade-Pläne mit wichtigen Änderungen und Migrationsleitfäden","Ermitteln der neuesten Versionen von npm-Paketen für eine optimale Projektperformance"],"pt":["Analisar arquivos package.json para dependências desatualizadas","Gerar planos de atualização abrangentes com alterações de quebra e guias de migração","Pesquisar as versões mais recentes dos pacotes npm para desempenho ótimo do projeto"],"ru":["Анализировать файлы package.json для устаревших зависимостей","Генерировать комплексные планы обновления с критическими изменениями и руководствами по миграции","Искать последние версии пакетов npm для оптимальной производительности проекта"],"ar":["تحليل ملفات package.json للعلاقات غير الحالية","توليد خطط ترقية شاملة مع تغييرات تسبب فشلاً ودلائل الهجرة","البحث عن أحدث إصدارات حزم npm لأداء مثالي للمشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to package.json files","Needs step-by-step planning due to memory context limits","Focused on npm ecosystem, may not be compatible with other package managers"],"zh":["需要访问package.json文件","需要一步一步的规划由于内存上下文限制","专注于npm生态系统，可能与其他包管理器不兼容"],"ja":["package.jsonファイルへのアクセスが必要","メモリコンテキストの制限によりステップバイステップの計画が必要","npmエコシステムに焦点を当てているため、他のパッケージマネージャーと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["package.json 파일에 접근할 수 있어야 함","메모리 컨텍스트 제한으로 인해 단계별 계획이 필요함","npm 에코시스템에 중점을 두고 있으므로 다른 패키지 관리자와 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos package.json","Necesita una planificación paso a paso debido a los límites de contexto de memoria","Se centra en el ecosistema npm, puede que no sea compatible con otros administradores de paquetes"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers package.json","Nécessite une planification étape par étape en raison des limites de contexte de mémoire","Se concentre sur l''écosystème npm, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres gestionnaires de paquets"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf package.json-Dateien","Benötigt eine schrittweise Planung aufgrund von Speicher-Kontext-Grenzen","Konzentriert sich auf das npm-Ökosystem, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Paket-Managern kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos package.json","Necessita de planejamento passo a passo devido a limitações de contexto de memória","Focado no ecossistema npm, pode não ser compatível com outros gerenciadores de pacotes"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам package.json","Требует пошагового планирования из-за ограничений контекста памяти","Фокусируется на экосистеме npm, может быть несовместим с другими менеджерами пакетов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات package.json","يحتاج إلى التخطيط الخطوة بخطوة بسبب قيود السياق الذاكرة","يركز على نظام إدارة الحزم npm، وقد لا يكون متوافقًا مع مديري حزم آخرين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
