 と Next.js アプリのパフォーマンス最適化を支援するガイドです","ko":"Vercel React 최적화 가이드는 React와 Next.js 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 데 필요한 45개 규칙과 8개 카테고리를 제공","es":"Guía completa de optimización del rendimiento para aplicaciones React y Next.js, con 45 reglas en 8 categorías","fr":"Guide complet d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js, avec 45 règles dans 8 catégories","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden zur Leistungsoptimierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen, mit 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","pt":"O guia de melhores práticas da Vercel para React e Next.js oferece 45 regras em 8 categorias para otimizar o desempenho","ru":"Руководство Vercel по лучшим практикам для React и Next.js содержит 45 правил в 8 категориях для оптимизации производительности","ar":"دليل فيرسيل لأفضل الممارسات لري액ت و نيكست.جس يوفر 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء","en":"Un vistazo a mi trayectoria y objetivos como desarrollador."},"definition":{"en":"Un vistazo a mi trayectoria y objetivos como desarrollador."},"features":{"zh":["45 条性能优化规则","8 个优化类别","自动重构和代码生成","适用于 React 和 Next.js 应用","优化数据获取和代码重构","提高应用性能和用户体验"],"ja":["45 のパフォーマンス最適化規則","8 つの最適化カテゴリ","自動リファクタリングとコード生成","React と Next.js アプリケーション対応","データ取得とコードリファクタリングの最適化","アプリケーションのパフォーマンスとユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上"],"ko":["45개 성능 최적화 규칙","8개 최적화 카테고리","자동 리팩토링과 코드 생성","React와 Next.js 애플리케이션 지원","데이터 가져오기와 코드 리팩토링 최적화","애플리케이션 성능과 사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["45 reglas para optimizar el rendimiento","8 categorías para una mejor organización","Guía para la refactorización automática","Optimización del código para React y Next.js","Mejora del rendimiento de las aplicaciones","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones de servidor y cliente"],"fr":["45 règles pour optimiser les performances","8 catégories pour une meilleure organisation","Guide pour la refactoring automatisée","Optimisation du code pour React et Next.js","Amélioration des performances des applications","Compatibilité avec les applications de serveur et de client"],"de":["45 Regeln zur Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien für eine bessere Organisation","Leitfaden für die automatisierte Refactoring","Optimierung des Codes für React und Next.js","Verbesserung der Leistung von Anwendungen","Kompatibilität mit Server- und Client-Anwendungen"],"pt":["45 regras para otimizar o desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar a otimização","Guia para refatoração e geração de código automática","Otimização para React e Next.js","Melhoria do desempenho da aplicação"],"ru":["45 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации оптимизации","Руководство для автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода","Оптимизация для React и Next.js","Улучшение производительности приложения"],"ar":["45 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لترتيب الأولويات لتحسين الأداء","دليل لتحسين و γενرية الكود التلقائية","تحسين أداء ري액ت و نيكست.جس","تحسين أداء التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel","React","Next.js","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","数据获取","代码重构","应用性能","用户体验"],"ja":["Vercel","React","Next.js","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","データ取得","コードリファクタリング","アプリケーションパフォーマンス","ユーザーエクスペリエンス"],"ko":["Vercel","React","Next.js","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","데이터 가져오기","코드 리팩토링","애플리케이션 성능","사용자 경험"],"es":["mejores prácticas de Vercel","optimización del rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo de aplicaciones","refactorización","optimización de código","rendimiento de aplicaciones","Vercel"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques Vercel","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement d''applications","refactoring","optimisation de code","performances des applications","Vercel"],"de":["Best Practices von Vercel","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Anwendungsentwicklung","Refactoring","Code-Optimierung","Anwendungsleistung","Vercel"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas React","Otimização de desempenho React","Next.js","React performance optimization","Vercel React best practices"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики React","Оптимизация производительности React","Next.js","React производительность оптимизация","Vercel React лучшие практики"],"ar":["ري액ت فيرسيل","أفضل الممارسات لري액ت","تحسين أداء ري액ت","نيكست.جس","ري액ت تحسين الأداء","فيرسيل ري액ت أفضل الممارسات"]}},"owner":"nahuelsoria","repo":"nahuelsoria","repoPath":"nahuelsoria/nahuelsoria","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.469Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:39:38.046Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for React and Next.js Code Review Agents needing comprehensive performance optimization rules.","zh":"非常适合需要全面性能优化规则的 React 和 Next.js 代码审查代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のコードレビューエージェントが包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ルールを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전반적인 성능 최적화 규칙이 필요한 React 및 Next.js 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código de React y Next.js que necesitan reglas de optimización de rendimiento completas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code React et Next.js nécessitant des règles d''optimisation des performances complètes.","de":"Perfekt für React- und Next.js-Code-Review-Agents, die umfassende Regeln für Leistungsoptimierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código React e Next.js que necessitam de regras de otimização de desempenho abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ревью кода React и Next.js, требующих комплексных правил оптимизации производительности.","ar":"مثالي لمراجعي كود React و Next.js الذين يحتاجون إلى قواعد تحسين الأداء الشاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides 45 prioritized rules across 8 categories for automated refactoring and code generation, enabling agents to optimize bundling, implement efficient data fetching strategies, and identify performance bottlenecks in React components and Next.js pages.","zh":"跨 8 个类别提供 45 个优先规则，用于自动重构和代码生成，启用代理优化捆绑、实施高效的数据获取策略，并在 React 组件和 Next.js 页面中识别性能瓶颈。","ja":"8 つのカテゴリにわたる 45 の優先ルールを提供し、自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、エージェントがバンドルの最適化、効率的なデータ取得ストラテジーの実施、および React コンポーネントと Next.js ページのパフォーマンスのボトルネックの特定を可能にします。","ko":"8개 범주에 걸쳐 45개의 우선 순위 규칙을 제공하여 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며 에이전트가 번들의 최적화, 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 전략의 구현 및 React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지의 성능 병목 현상을 식별할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Ofrece 45 reglas priorizadas en 8 categorías para refactorización automática y generación de código, lo que permite a los agentes optimizar la agrupación, implementar estrategias de recolección de datos eficientes y identificar cuellos de botella de rendimiento en componentes de React y páginas de Next.js.","fr":"Fournit 45 règles priorisées dans 8 catégories pour une refactoring automatisée et une génération de code, permettant aux agents d''optimiser le regroupement, de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de collecte de données efficaces et d''identifier les goulets d''étranglement des performances dans les composants React et les pages Next.js.","de":"Bietet 45 priorisierte Regeln in 8 Kategorien für automatisierte Refactoring und Codegenerierung, sodass Agenten die Bündelung optimieren, effiziente Datenabfragestrategien implementieren und Leistungsengpässe in React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten identifizieren können.","pt":"Fornece 45 regras priorizadas em 8 categorias para refatoração automatizada e geração de código, permitindo que os agentes otimizem o empacotamento, implementem estratégias de busca de dados eficientes e identifiquem gargalos de desempenho em componentes React e páginas Next.js.","ru":"Предоставляет 45 приоритизированных правил в 8 категориях для автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода, позволяя агентам оптимизировать пакетирование, реализовать эффективные стратегии извлечения данных и выявлять узкие места производительности в компонентах React и страницах Next.js.","ar":"توفر 45 قاعدة مصنفة في 8 فئات للتحديث التلقائي وإنشاء الكود، مما يسمح للوكلاء بتحسين الحزمة وتنفيذ استراتيجيات استرجاع البيانات الفعالة وتحديد معوقات الأداء في مكونات React وصفحات Next.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing code for performance issues","Refactoring existing React/Next.js code","Optimizing bundling strategies","Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)"],"zh":["审查代码以查找性能问题","重构现有的 React/Next.js 代码","优化捆绑策略","实施数据获取（客户端或服务器端）"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題のあるコードをレビューする","既存の React/Next.js コードをリファクタリングする","バンドルの最適化戦略を実施する","データ取得（クライアントサイドまたはサーバーサイド）を実装する"],"ko":["성능 문제가 있는 코드를 검토","기존 React/Next.js 코드를 리팩토링","번들의 최적화 전략을 구현","데이터 가져오기(클라이언트 측 또는 서버 측)를 구현"],"es":["Revisar el código en busca de problemas de rendimiento","Refactorizar el código existente de React/Next.js","Optimizar las estrategias de agrupación","Implementar la recolección de datos (del lado del cliente o del servidor)"],"fr":["Examiner le code pour les problèmes de performances","Refactoriser le code existant de React/Next.js","Optimiser les stratégies de regroupement","Mettre en œuvre la collecte de données (côté client ou serveur)"],"de":["Code auf Leistungsprobleme überprüfen","Bestehenden React/Next.js-Code refaktorisieren","Bündelungsstrategien optimieren","Datenabfrage (Client- oder Server-seitig) implementieren"],"pt":["Revisar código para problemas de desempenho","Refatorar código React/Next.js existente","Otimizar estratégias de empacotamento","Implementar busca de dados (lado do cliente ou servidor)"],"ru":["Просмотр кода на наличие проблем с производительностью","Рефакторинг существующего кода React/Next.js","Оптимизация стратегий пакетирования","Реализация извлечения данных (клиентская или серверная часть)"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود ل مشاكل الأداء","إعادة هيكلة كود React/Next.js الحالي","تحسين استراتيجيات الحزمة","تنفيذ استرجاع البيانات (الجانب العميلي أو الخادم)"]},"limitations":{"en":["React/Next.js specific only","Requires codebase access for full analysis"],"zh":["仅限 React/Next.js","需要代码库访问权限进行全面分析"],"ja":["React/Next.js 専用","完全な分析のためにコードベースへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["React/Next.js 전용","전체 분석을 위한 코드베이스 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Específico solo para React/Next.js","Requiere acceso a la base de código para un análisis completo"],"fr":["Spécifique à React/Next.js uniquement","Nécessite un accès à la base de code pour une analyse complète"],"de":["Nur spezifisch für React/Next.js","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Codebestand für eine vollständige Analyse"],"pt":["Específico apenas para React/Next.js","Requer acesso à base de código para análise completa"],"ru":["Только для React/Next.js","Требует доступа к базе кода для полного анализа"],"ar":["محدود ل React/Next.js فقط","يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة للتحليل الكامل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
