oud Agents requiring streamlined backend configuration management across multiple environments.","ru":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring streamlined backend configuration management across multiple environments.","ar":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring streamlined backend configuration management across multiple environments."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage backend configurations using standardized templates and scripts, integrating seamlessly with repositories and supporting files like SKILL.md, reference.md, and examples.md, leveraging canonical sources for consistency.","zh":"赋予代理高效地管理后端配置的能力，使用标准化模板和脚本，无缝集成存储库和支持文件，如SKILL.md、reference.md和examples.md，利用正典来源以确保一致性。","ja":"エージェントが、標準化されたテンプレートとスクリプトを使用してバックエンドの構成を効率的に管理できるようにし、SKILL.md、reference.md、examples.mdなどのリポジトリやサポートファイルとシームレスに統合し、正典ソースを使用して一貫性を保ちます。","ko":"에이전트가 표준화된 템플릿과 스크립트를 사용하여 백엔드 구성 관리를 효율적으로 수행할 수 있도록 하며, SKILL.md, reference.md 및 examples.md와 같은 저장소 및 지원 파일과 무결점으로 통합하여 정본 소스를 사용하여 일관성을 유지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar eficientemente las configuraciones de backend utilizando plantillas y scripts estandarizados, integrándose perfectamente con repositorios y archivos de soporte como SKILL.md, reference.md y examples.md, aprovechando fuentes canónicas para la consistencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les configurations de backend en utilisant des modèles et des scripts standardisés, s''intégrant sans heurts avec les référentiels et les fichiers de support comme SKILL.md, reference.md et examples.md, en exploitant les sources canoniques pour la cohérence.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Backend-Konfigurationen effizient mithilfe standardisierter Vorlagen und Skripte zu verwalten, integriert sich nahtlos mit Repositorien und unterstützenden Dateien wie SKILL.md, reference.md und examples.md, nutzt kanonische Quellen für Konsistenz.","pt":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage backend configurations using standardized templates and scripts, integrating seamlessly with repositories and supporting files like SKILL.md, reference.md, and examples.md, leveraging canonical sources for consistency.","ru":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage backend configurations using standardized templates and scripts, integrating seamlessly with repositories and supporting files like SKILL.md, reference.md, and examples.md, leveraging canonical sources for consistency.","ar":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage backend configurations using standardized templates and scripts, integrating seamlessly with repositories and supporting files like SKILL.md, reference.md, and examples.md, leveraging canonical sources for consistency."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating backend setup for new projects","Configuring environment variables for deployment","Debugging configuration issues across different backend setups"],"zh":["自动化新项目的后端设置","为部署配置环境变量","调试不同后端设置中的配置问题"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトのバックエンド設定を自動化する","デプロイの環境変数を構成する","異なるバックエンド設定での構成の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["새로운 프로젝트의 백엔드 설정을 자동화하는 것","배포를 위한 환경 변수를 구성하는 것","다른 백엔드 설정에서 발생하는 구성 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración de backend para nuevos proyectos","Configurar variables de entorno para la implementación","Depurar problemas de configuración en diferentes configuraciones de backend"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration de backend pour les nouveaux projets","Configurer des variables d''environnement pour le déploiement","Déboguer les problèmes de configuration dans différentes configurations de backend"],"de":["Automatisieren der Backend-Konfiguration für neue Projekte","Konfigurieren von Umgebungsvariablen für die Bereitstellung","Debuggen von Konfigurationsproblemen in verschiedenen Backend-Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Automating backend setup for new projects","Configuring environment variables for deployment","Debugging configuration issues across different backend setups"],"ru":["Automating backend setup for new projects","Configuring environment variables for deployment","Debugging conf