code pour une optimisation rapide","Guide pour la mise en œuvre de la recherche de données sur le client et sur le serveur"],"de":["45 Regeln für die Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Optimierung","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Auswirkung für eine automatisierte Refactoring","Codegenerierung für eine schnelle Optimierung","Leitfaden für die Implementierung der Datenabfrage auf Client- und Server-Seite"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js","45 regras em 8 categorias para refatoração automática","Guia completo para melhorar a performance","Priorização de regras por impacto","Geração de código automática"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для React и Next.js","45 правил в 8 категориях для автоматической рефакторинга","Полное руководство для улучшения производительности","Приоритизация правил по влиянию","Автоматическая генерация кода"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت و نكست.جس","45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين وتوليد الكود تلقائيًا","دليل شامل لتحسين الأداء","التحديد الأولوي لالقواعد حسب التأثير","توليد الكود تلقائيًا"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","性能优化","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","自动重构","代码生成","应用性能","速度优化","代码优化"],"ja":["Vercel React","パフォーマンス最適化","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","アプリのパフォーマンス","速度最適化","コード最適化"],"ko":["Vercel React","성능 최적화","React 최고의 관행","Next.js 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","애플리케이션 성능","속도 최적화","코드 최적화"],"es":["Vercel React","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","mejores prácticas","desarrollo web","aplicaciones web","rendimiento web"],"fr":["Vercel React","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","meilleures pratiques","développement web","applications web","performances web"],"de":["Vercel React","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Best Practices","Webentwicklung","Webanwendungen","Webleistung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","React e Next.js","Melhores práticas","Refatoração automática","Geração de código"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","React и Next.js","Лучшие практики","Автоматическая рефакторинга","Генерация кода"],"ar":["فركل رياكت","تحسين الأداء","رياكت و نكست.جس","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين وتوليد الكود تلقائيًا","توليد الكود"]}},"owner":"YudaiShiratori","repo":"visa-navi","repoPath":"YudaiShiratori/visa-navi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.469Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:40:05.913Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 性能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のパフォーマンス最適化が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js의 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan un rendimiento optimizado de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend nécessitant un rendement optimisé de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes React- und Next.js-Performance benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado do React e do Next.js.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный性能 React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء محسّن من React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 45 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel''s guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 45 条规则和 8 个类别的综合性能优化，包括使用 Vercel 指南的数据获取和包优化。","ja":"React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、45 の規則と 8 つのカテゴリを使用した包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を実現し、Vercel のガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化を含みます。","ko":"리액트 컴포넌트와 넥스트.js 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 45개의 규칙과 8개의 카테고리를 사용한 포괄적인 성능 최적화를 실현하며, 버셀의 가이드라인을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 45 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización de rendimiento integral, incluida la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la agrupación utilizando las directrices de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 45 règles sur 8 catégories pour une optimisation de performance complète, y compris l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les directives de Vercel.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem es 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine umfassende Leistungsoptimierung nutzt, einschließlich Datenabruf und Bündeloptimierung unter Verwendung der Vercel-Richtlinien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 45 regras em 8 categorias para otimização de desempenho abrangente, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando as diretrizes do Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях для всесторонней оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и упаковки с использованием руководства Vercel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير الترميز التلقائي وإعادة هيكلة مكونات React وصفحات Next.js، باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء الشامل، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحسين التعبئة باستخدام إرشادات Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues","Generating optimized React components","Refactoring existing Next.js code for better performance"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以查找性能问题","生成优化的 React 组件","重构现有的 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題を特定するためのコードレビューの自動化","最適化された React コンポーネントの生成","パフォーマンスの向上のために既存の Next.js コードのリファクタリング"],"ko":["성능 문제를 찾기 위한 코드 리뷰의 자동화","최적화된 리액트 컴포넌트의 생성","성능 개선을 위한 기존의 넥스트.js 코드의 리팩토링"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento","Generación de componentes de React optimizados","Reestructuración de código existente de Next.js para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Automatisation des examens de code pour les problèmes de performance","Génération de composants React optimisés","Réstructuration du code existant de Next.js pour une meilleure performance"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme","Generierung von optimierten React-Komponenten","Neustrukturierung von bestehendem Next.js-Code für bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho","Gerar componentes React otimizados","Refatorar código Next.js existente para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на проблемы с производительностью","Генерировать оптимизированные компоненты React","Рефакторить существующий код Next.js для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["توفير مراجعة الكود التلقائية لمشاكل الأداء","توليد مكونات React المحسّنة","إعادة هيكلة الكود الحالي ل Next.js من أجل أداء أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vercel React and Next.js setup","Limited to React and Next.js applications"],"zh":["需要 Vercel React 和 Next.js 设置","仅限于 React 和 Next.js 应用"],"ja":["Vercel React と Next.js の設定が必要","React と Next.js アプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["버셀 리액트 및 넥스트.js 설정이 필요","리액트 및 넥스트.js 애플리케이션에만 محدود"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Vercel React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones de React y Next.js"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Vercel React et Next.js","Limité aux applications React et Next.js"],"de":["Benötigt Vercel React- und Next.js-Setup","Begrenzt auf React- und Next.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Vercel React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações React e Next.js"],"ru":["Требует настройки Vercel React и Next.js","Ограничен для приложений React и Next.js"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Vercel React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات React و Next.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
