ndaciones de productos","Guías de UX","Mejores prácticas para stacks específicos","Compatibilidad con Python"],"fr":["Base de données de styles d''interface","Palettes de couleurs personnalisables","Recommandations de produits","Guides de UX","Meilleures pratiques pour les stacks spécifiques","Compatibilité avec Python"],"de":["Datenbank mit Benutzeroberflächen-Stilen","Anpassbare Farbpaletten","Produkt-Empfehlungen","UX-Richtlinien","Best Practices für spezifische Stacks","Kompatibilität mit Python"],"pt":["Base de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI","Paletas de cores personalizadas","Combinações de fontes recomendadas","Diretrizes de UX para desenvolvedores","Práticas recomendadas para pilhas específicas"],"ru":["Поисковая база данных стилей UI","Индивидуальные цветовые палитры","Рекомендуемые комбинации шрифтов","Руководства по UX для разработчиков","Рекомендуемые практики для конкретных стеков"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط UI","_palettes الألوان المخصصة","تركيبات الخطوط الموصى بها","إرشادات UX للمطورين","أفضل الممارسات للاستخدامات المحددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX设计","设计智能","设计风格库","色彩调色板","字体配对","UX指南","产品设计推荐","堆栈特定最佳实践"],"ja":["UI/UXデザイン","デザインインテリジェンス","デザインスタイルライブラリ","色彩パレット","フォントのペアリング","UXガイドライン","製品設計推奨","スタック特有のベストプラクティス"],"ko":["UI/UX 디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","디자인 스타일 라이브러리","색상 팔레트","폰트 페어링","UX 가이드ライン","제품 디자인 추천","스택 특정 최적화"],"es":["UI/UX","diseño de interfaz","paletas de colores","recomendaciones de productos","guías de UX","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de software","Python"],"fr":["UI/UX","conception d''interface","palettes de couleurs","recommandations de produits","guides de UX","meilleures pratiques","développement de logiciels","Python"],"de":["UI/UX","Benutzeroberflächen-Design","Farbpaletten","Produkt-Empfehlungen","UX-Richtlinien","Best Practices","Software-Entwicklung","Python"],"pt":["UI/UX","design inteligente","estilos de UI","paletas de cores","combinações de fontes","diretrizes de UX","práticas recomendadas","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["UI/UX","интеллектуальный дизайн","стили UI","цветовые палитры","комбинации шрифтов","руководства по UX","рекомендуемые практики","разработчики"],"ar":["UI/UX","ذكاء التصميم","أنماط UI","_palettes الألوان","تركيبات الخطوط","إرشادات UX","أفضل الممارسات","المطورين"]}},"owner":"Jaydccq","repo":"poker_trainer","repoPath":"Jaydccq/poker_trainer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.469Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 8 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Search Relevant Domains\n\nUse `search.py` multiple times to gather comprehensive information. Search until you have enough context.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**Recommended search order:**\n\n1. **Product** - Get style recommendations for product type\n2. **Style** - Get detailed style guide (colors, effects, frameworks)\n3. **Typography** - Get font pairings with Google Fonts imports\n4. **Color** - Get color palette (Primary, Secondary, CTA, Background, Text, Border)\n5. **Landing** - Get page structure (if landing page)\n6. **Chart** - Get chart recommendations (if dashboard/analytics)\n7. **UX** - Get best practices and anti-patterns\n8. **Stack** - Get stack-specific guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\n\n### Step 3: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nIf user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n**AI should:**\n\n```bash\n# 1. Search product type\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --domain product\n\n# 2. Search style (based on industry: beauty, elegant)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant minimal soft\" --domain style\n\n# 3. Search typography\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury\" --domain typography\n\n# 4. Search color palette\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness\" --domain color\n\n# 5. Search landing page structure\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"hero-centric social-proof\" --domain landing\n\n# 6. Search UX guidelines\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation\" --domain ux\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# 7. Search stack guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize all search results and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n7. **Split Into Multiple Files** - For better maintainability:\n   - Separate components into individual files (e.g., `Header.tsx`, `Footer.tsx`)\n   - Extract reusable styles into dedicated files\n   - Keep each file focused and under 200-300 lines\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:40:31.166Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-oriented Agents needing advanced UI/UX capabilities with Python integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 UI/UX 能力的设计导向型代理，具有 Python 集成功能。","ja":"Python 統合機能を備えた高度な UI/UX 機能を必要とするデザイン志向のエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 UI/UX 기능 및 Python 통합이 필요한 디자인 지향형 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes orientados al Diseño que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de UI/UX con integración de Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents orientés vers la conception nécessitant des capacités de UI/UX avancées avec intégration Python.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte Agenten, die erweiterte UI/UX-Funktionen mit Python-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes orientados ao Design que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de UI/UX com integração Python.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на дизайн, которым требуются продвинутые возможности UI/UX с интеграцией Python.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتجهين إلى التصميم الذين يحتاجون إلى功能 متقدمة لتفاعل واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم مع دمج بايثون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, and UX guidelines, utilizing Python for seamless integration with stack-specific best practices and product recommendations.","zh":"赋予代理利用可搜索的 UI 风格、色彩板、字体配对和 UX 指南数据库的能力，利用 Python 实现与特定堆栈的最佳实践和产品推荐的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが検索可能な UI スタイル、色彩パレット、フォントのペア、UX ガイドラインのデータベースを利用できるようにし、Python を使用してスタック固有のベストプラクティスや製品の推奨とシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 검색 가능한 UI 스타일, 색상 팔레트, 글꼴 페어 및 UX 가이드라인 데이터베이스를 활용할 수 있도록 하며, Python을 사용하여 스택 특정 최선의 관행 및 제품 추천과 무결점으로 통합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar una base de datos buscable de estilos de UI, paletas de colores, combinaciones de fuentes y directrices de UX, utilizando Python para una integración sin problemas con las mejores prácticas y recomendaciones de productos específicas de la pila.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti d''une base de données de styles d''UI, de palettes de couleurs, de combinaisons de polices et de lignes directrices d''UX consultables, en utilisant Python pour une intégration transparente avec les meilleures pratiques et les recommandations de produits spécifiques à la pile.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine durchsuchbare Datenbank von UI-Stilen, Farbpaletten, Schriftkombinationen und UX-Richtlinien zu nutzen, wobei Python für eine nahtlose Integration mit stapelspezifischen Best Practices und Produktempfehlungen verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar um banco de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI, paletas de cores, combinações de fontes e diretrizes de UX, utilizando Python para integração perfeita com as melhores práticas específicas da pilha e recomendações de produtos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать поисковую базу данных стилей UI, цветовых палитр, парных шрифтов и руководств по UX, используя Python для бесшовной интеграции с лучшими практиками, специфичными для стека, и рекомендациями продуктов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط واجهة المستخدم، وألوان وتركيبات خطوط وارشادات تجربة المستخدم، باستخدام بايثون من أجل التكامل السلس مع أفضل الممارسات المحددة للكومة وتوصيات المنتجات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI design decisions with data-driven insights","Generating consistent brand identities through font pairing and color palette suggestions","Debugging UX issues with guidelines and best practices for improved user experience"],"zh":["使用数据驱动的洞察力自动化 UI 设计决策","通过字体配对和色彩板建议生成一致的品牌身份","使用指南和最佳实践调试 UX 问题以提高用户体验"],"ja":["データ駆動の洞察を用いて UI デザインの決定を自動化する","フォントのペアと色彩パレットの提案を通じて一貫したブランド ID を生成する","ガイドラインとベストプラクティスを用いて UX の問題をデバッグし、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる"],"ko":["데이터驱동 인사이트를 사용하여 UI 디자인 결정 자동화","글꼴 페어 및 색상 팔레트 제안을 통해 일관된 브랜드 ID 생성","가이드라인 및 최선의 관행을 사용하여 UX 문제 디버깅 및 사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Automatizar decisiones de diseño de UI con información basada en datos","Generar identidades de marca coherentes a través de sugerencias de combinaciones de fuentes y paletas de colores","Depurar problemas de UX con directrices y mejores prácticas para una mejor experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Automatiser les décisions de conception d''UI avec des informations basées sur des données","Générer des identités de marque cohérentes grâce à des suggestions de combinaisons de polices et de palettes de couleurs","Déboguer les problèmes d''UX avec des lignes directrices et des meilleures pratiques pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Automatisieren von UI-Designentscheidungen mit datengetriebenen Erkenntnissen","Erzeugen von konsistenten Markenidentitäten durch Schrift- und Farbpalettvorschläge","Fehlerbehebung von UX-Problemen mit Richtlinien und Best Practices für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Automatizar decisões de design de UI com insights baseados em dados","Gerar identidades de marca consistentes por meio de sugestões de combinação de fontes e paletas de cores","Depurar problemas de UX com diretrizes e melhores práticas para melhorar a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Автоматизировать решения по дизайну UI с помощью данных, основанных на данных","Генерировать последовательные идентичности бренда с помощью предложений по парным шрифтам и цветовым палитрам","Отладить проблемы UX с помощью руководств и лучших практик для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["أتمتة قرارات تصميم واجهة المستخدم باستخدام معلومات مدعومة بالبيانات","توليد هوية العمل العلامة المتسقة من خلال اقتراحات تجميع الخطوط و_palettes الألوان","تصحيح أخطاء تجربة المستخدم باستخدام الإرشادات وأفضل الممارسات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python installation (Python 3.x recommended)","Operating System-specific installation required (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"zh":["需要 Python 安装（推荐 Python 3.x）","需要操作系统特定的安装（macOS、Ubuntu/Debian、Windows）"],"ja":["Python のインストールが必要（Python 3.x 推奨）","オペレーティングシステム固有のインストールが必要（macOS、Ubuntu/Debian、Windows）"],"ko":["Python 설치 필요(Python 3.x 권장)","운영 체제별 설치 필요(macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python (se recomienda Python 3.x)","Se requiere instalación específica del sistema operativo (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Python (Python 3.x recommandé)","Une installation spécifique du système d''exploitation est requise (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Installation (Python 3.x empfohlen)","Betriebssystem-spezifische Installation erforderlich (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python (Python 3.x recomendado)","Instalação específica do Sistema Operacional requerida (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"ru":["Требуется установка Python (рекомендуется Python 3.x)","Требуется установка, специфичная для операционной системы (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بايثون (يوصى بايثون 3.x)","تثبيت نظام التشغيل المحدد مطلوب (macOS، Ubuntu/Debian، Windows)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
