Stack-spezifische Best Practices"],"pt":["Base de dados de estilos de UI","Paletas de cores personalizadas","Recomendações de produtos","Diretrizes de UX","Práticas recomendadas para desenvolvedores","Compatibilidade com pilhas de tecnologia"],"ru":["База данных стилей UI","Персонализированные цветовые палитры","Рекомендации продуктов","Руководства по UX","Рекомендуемые практики для разработчиков","Совместимость со стеками технологий"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات لأسلوب واجهة المستخدم","ألوان مخصصة","توصيات المنتجات","إرشادات واجهة المستخدم","افتراضات ممارسة للdevelopers","توافق مع chồng تقني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX设计","设计智能","可搜索的UI样式","色彩搭配","字体组合","UX指南","技术最佳实践"],"ja":["UI/UXデザイン","デザインインテリジェンス","検索可能なUIスタイル","色彩組み合わせ","フォントの組み合わせ","UXガイドライン","技術ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["UI/UX디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","검색 가능한 UI 스타일","색상 조합","글꼴 조합","UX 가이드라인","기술 최고의 실践"],"es":["diseño de UI","experiencia de usuario","desarrollo de software","estilos de UI","paletas de colores","parejas de fuentes","tipos de gráficos","recomendaciones de productos"],"fr":["conception UI","expérience utilisateur","développement de logiciels","styles UI","palettes de couleurs","paires de polices","types de graphiques","recommandations de produits"],"de":["UI-Design","Benutzererfahrung","Software-Entwicklung","UI-Stile","Farbpaletten","Schriftartenpaare","Diagrammtypen","Produkt-Empfehlungen"],"pt":["ui/ux design","desenvolvimento de software","inteligência de design","ferramentas de design","desenvolvedores","interfaces de usuário","experiência do usuário","design de produto","tecnologia de design"],"ru":["дизайн ui/ux","разработка программного обеспечения","интеллект дизайна","инструменты дизайна","разработчики","интерфейсы пользователя","опыт пользователя","дизайн продукта","технология дизайна"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تطوير البرمجيات","ذكاء التصميم","أدوات التصميم","المطورون","واجهات المستخدم","تجربة المستخدم","تصميم المنتج","تكنولوجيا التصميم"]}},"owner":"LixvYang","repo":"common-skills","repoPath":"LixvYang/common-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.469Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 8 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Search Relevant Domains\n\nUse `search.py` multiple times to gather comprehensive information. Search until you have enough context.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**Recommended search order:**\n\n1. **Product** - Get style recommendations for product type\n2. **Style** - Get detailed style guide (colors, effects, frameworks)\n3. **Typography** - Get font pairings with Google Fonts imports\n4. **Color** - Get color palette (Primary, Secondary, CTA, Background, Text, Border)\n5. **Landing** - Get page structure (if landing page)\n6. **Chart** - Get chart recommendations (if dashboard/analytics)\n7. **UX** - Get best practices and anti-patterns\n8. **Stack** - Get stack-specific guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\n\n### Step 3: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nIf user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n**AI should:**\n\n```bash\n# 1. Search product type\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --domain product\n\n# 2. Search style (based on industry: beauty, elegant)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant minimal soft\" --domain style\n\n# 3. Search typography\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury\" --domain typography\n\n# 4. Search color palette\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness\" --domain color\n\n# 5. Search landing page structure\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"hero-centric social-proof\" --domain landing\n\n# 6. Search UX guidelines\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation\" --domain ux\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# 7. Search stack guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize all search results and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n7. **Split Into Multiple Files** - For better maintainability:\n   - Separate components into individual files (e.g., `Header.tsx`, `Footer.tsx`)\n   - Extract reusable styles into dedicated files\n   - Keep each file focused and under 200-300 lines\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:40:44.722Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design Agents needing advanced UI/UX design intelligence and Python-based automation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级UI/UX设计智能和Python基于自动化能力的设计代理。","ja":"高度なUI/UXデザインの知能とPythonベースの自動化能力を必要とするデザインエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 UI/UX 디자인 지능 및 Python 기반 자동화 기능이 필요한 디자인 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de diseño que necesitan inteligencia de diseño de interfaz de usuario/interfaz de usuario avanzada y capacidades de automatización basadas en Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conception nécessitant une intelligence de conception UI/UX avancée et des capacités d''automatisation basées sur Python.","de":"Perfekt für Designagenten, die erweiterte UI/UX-Designintelligenz und Python-basierte Automatisierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Design Agents que necessitam de inteligência de design de UI/UX avançada e capacidades de automação baseadas em Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по дизайну, которым необходима продвинутая интеллектуальность дизайна UI/UX и возможности автоматизации на основе Python.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التصميم الذي يحتاج إلى ذكاء تصميم UI/UX متقدم وقدرات أتمتة باستخدام Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, and font pairings, while following UX guidelines and stack-specific best practices, utilizing Python for seamless integration and automation.","zh":"赋予代理人利用可搜索的UI样式、颜色调色板和字体配对数据库的能力，同时遵循UX指南和栈特定的最佳实践，利用Python实现无缝集成和自动化。","ja":"エージェントが検索可能なUIスタイル、カラーパレット、フォントのペアのデータベースを利用できるようにし、同時にUXガイドラインとスタック固有のベストプラクティスに従い、Pythonを使用してシームレスな統合と自動化を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 검색 가능한 UI 스타일, 색상 팔레트 및 글꼴 쌍 데이터베이스를 활용할 수 있도록 하며,同时 UX 가이드라인 및 스택별 최적의 관행을 따르며, Python을 사용하여 무정지 통합 및 자동화를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar una base de datos buscable de estilos de interfaz de usuario, paletas de colores y emparejamientos de fuentes, siguiendo las pautas de UX y las mejores prácticas específicas de la pila, utilizando Python para una integración y automatización sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti d''une base de données recherchable de styles d''interface utilisateur, de palettes de couleurs et de combinaisons de polices, tout en suivant les directives de l''expérience utilisateur et les meilleures pratiques spécifiques à la pile, en utilisant Python pour une intégration et une automatisation sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine durchsuchbare Datenbank von Benutzeroberflächenstilen, Farbpaletten und Schriftkombinationen zu nutzen, während sie UX-Richtlinien und stapelspezifische Best Practices befolgen, und verwendet Python für eine nahtlose Integration und Automatisierung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem um banco de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI, paletas de cores e combinações de fontes, seguindo as diretrizes de UX e as melhores práticas específicas da pilha, utilizando Python para integração e automação sem interrupção.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать поисковую базу данных стилей UI, цветовых палитр и парных шрифтов, следуя руководящим принципам UX и推荐уемым практикам для стека, используя Python для бесшовной интеграции и автоматизации.","ar":"يمكن للعميل استخدام قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط واجهة المستخدم وألوان وقوامات خطوط، مع اتباع إرشادات تجربة المستخدم وأفضل الممارسات المحددة للعبارة، باستخدام Python من أجل التكامل والت 자동 دون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI design decisions with data-driven recommendations","Generating consistent color schemes and typography across products","Debugging UX issues with guidelines and best practices"],"zh":["使用数据驱动的推荐来自动化UI设计决策","生成产品跨越的一致的色彩方案和字体","使用指南和最佳实践来调试UX问题"],"ja":["データ駆動のレコメンドを使用してUIデザインの決定を自動化する","製品全体に一貫したカラースキームとタイポグラフィを生成する","ガイドラインとベストプラクティスを使用してUXの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["데이터 주도 추천을 사용하여 UI 디자인 결정 자동화","제품 전반에 걸친 일관된 색상 구성표 및 타이포그래피 생성","가이드라인 및 최적의 관행을 사용하여 UX 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar decisiones de diseño de interfaz de usuario con recomendaciones basadas en datos","Generar esquemas de color y tipografía coherentes en todos los productos","Depurar problemas de UX con pautas y mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Automatiser les décisions de conception d''interface utilisateur avec des recommandations basées sur les données","Générer des schémas de couleur et de typographie cohérents à travers les produits","Déboguer les problèmes d''UX avec des directives et des meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Automatisieren von Benutzeroberflächendesignentscheidungen mit datengetriebenen Empfehlungen","Erzeugen konsistenter Farbschemata und Typografie über Produkte hinweg","Fehlerbehebung von UX-Problemen mit Richtlinien und Best Practices"],"pt":["Automatizar decisões de design de UI com recomendações baseadas em dados","Gerar esquemas de cores e tipografia consistentes em produtos","Depurar problemas de UX com diretrizes e melhores práticas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать решения по дизайну UI с рекомендациями на основе данных","Генерировать последовательные цветовые схемы и типографику в продуктах","Отладить проблемы UX с рекомендациями и лучшими практиками"],"ar":["أتمتة قرارات تصميم واجهة المستخدم مع توصيات قائمة على البيانات","توليد مخططات الألوان والخطوط المتسقة عبر المنتجات","تصحيح أخطاء تجربة المستخدم مع الإرشادات وأفضل الممارسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python installation (version 3.x)","Limited to design intelligence and UI/UX best practices, not a full-fledged design tool"],"zh":["需要Python安装（版本3.x）","仅限于设计智能和UI/UX最佳实践，不是全功能设计工具"],"ja":["Pythonのインストール（バージョン3.x）が必要","デザインの知能とUI/UXのベストプラクティスに限定されており、フル機能のデザインツールではありません"],"ko":["Python 설치 필요(버전 3.x)","디자인 지능 및 UI/UX 최적의 관행에만 제한되어おり, 완전한 기능의 디자인 툴이 아닙니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python (versión 3.x)","Limitado a la inteligencia de diseño y las mejores prácticas de UI/UX, no es una herramienta de diseño completa"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Python (version 3.x)","Limité à l''intelligence de conception et aux meilleures pratiques de l''interface utilisateur/expérience utilisateur, et non une véritable outil de conception"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Installation (Version 3.x)","Begrenzt auf Designintelligenz und UI/UX-Best Practices, kein umfassendes Designwerkzeug"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python (versão 3.x)","Limitado à inteligência de design e às melhores práticas de UI/UX, não é uma ferramenta de design completa"],"ru":["Требует установки Python (версия 3.x)","Ограничен интеллектуальностью дизайна и лучшими практиками UI/UX, не является полноценным инструментом дизайна"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Python (الإصدار 3.x)","محدود بذكاء تصميم واجهة المستخدم وأفضل الممارسات، وليس أداة تصميم كاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
