лектуальное проектирование","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max: تصميم ذكاء المستخدم","en":"ui-ux-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max, ","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max, ","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max, ","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una base de datos de diseño inteligente que proporciona estilos de interfaz de usuario, paletas de colores y mejores prácticas para desarrol...","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est une base de données de conception intelligente qui fournit des styles d''interface utilisateur, des palettes de couleurs et des meilleures p...","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist eine Datenbank für Design-Intelligenz, die Benutzeroberflächen-Stile, Farbpaletten und Best Practices für Entwickler bereitstellt.","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é uma base de dados de estilos de UI, paletas de cores, combinações de fontes e práticas recomendadas para UX. Melhore a experiência do usuár...","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это база данных стилей UI, цветовых палитр, комбинаций шрифтов и рекомендаций по UX. Улучшите опыт пользователя с нашей интеллектуальной сист...","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هو قاعدة بيانات لأسلوب UI، وألوان، وتركيبات خطوط، وافضل الممارسات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم. تحسين تجربة المستخدم مع دليلنا للتصميم الذكي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["UI","UX","Python","UI/UX","UI/UX","UX"],"ja":["UI/UX","UX","Python","UI/UX","UI/UX","UX"],"ko":["UI/UX","UX","Python","UI/UX","UI/UX","UX"],"es":["Base de datos de estilos de interfaz de usuario","Paletas de colores personalizadas","Parejas de fuentes recomendadas","Tipos de gráficos y recomendaciones de productos","Pautas de UX y mejores prácticas específicas de la pila"],"fr":["Base de données de styles d''interface utilisateur","Palettes de couleurs personnalisées","Paires de polices recommandées","Types de graphiques et recommandations de produits","Lignes directrices UX et meilleures pratiques spécifiques à la pile"],"de":["Datenbank von Benutzeroberflächen-Stilen","Benutzerdefinierte Farbpaletten","Empfohlene Schriftarten-Kombinationen","Diagrammtypen und Produkt-Empfehlungen","UX-Richtlinien und Best Practices spezifisch für die Stapel"],"pt":["Base de dados de estilos de UI","Paletas de cores personalizadas","Combinações de fontes recomendadas","Práticas recomendadas para UX","Recursos de design de inteligência","Integração com Python"],"ru":["База данных стилей UI","Персонализированные цветовые палитры","Рекомендуемые комбинации шрифтов","Рекомендации по UX","Ресурсы интеллектуального проектирования","Интеграция с Python"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات لأسلوب UI","ألوان مخصصة","تركيبات خطوط موصى بها","افضل الممارسات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","مصادر تصميم ذكاء","التكامل مع Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX","UI/UX Pro Max","Python","UX","UI","UI/UX","UX","UI/UX","UI/UX Pro Max"],"ja":["UI/UX","UI/UX Pro Max","Python","UX","UI","UI/UX","UX","UI/UX","UI/UX Pro Max"],"ko":["UI/UX","UI/UX Pro Max","Python","UX","UI","UI/UX","UX","UI/UX","UI/UX Pro Max"],"es":["diseño de interfaz de usuario","experiencia del usuario","estilos de UI","paletas de colores","parejas de fuentes","tipos de gráficos","recomendaciones de productos","pautas de UX"],"fr":["conception d''interface utilisateur","expérience utilisateur","styles d''UI","palettes de couleurs","paires de polices","types de graphiques","recommandations de produits","lignes directrices UX"],"de":["Benutzeroberflächen-Design","Benutzererfahrung","UI-Stile","Farbpaletten","Schriftarten-Kombinationen","Diagrammtypen","Produkt-Empfehlungen","UX-Richtlinien"],"pt":["UI/UX","Design de inteligência","Experiência do usuário","Estilos de UI","Paletas de cores","Combinações de fontes","Práticas recomendadas para UX","Python","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["UI/UX","Интеллектуальное проектирование","Опыт пользователя","Стили UI","Цветовые палитры","Комбинации шрифтов","Рекомендации по UX","Python","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["UI/UX","تصميم ذكاء","تجربة المستخدم","أسلوب UI","ألوان","تركيبات خطوط","افضل الممارسات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","Python","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"lehoangan238","repo":"memorial-park-cphaco","repoPath":"lehoangan238/memorial-park-cphaco","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.469Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 8 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Search Relevant Domains\n\nUse `search.py` multiple times to gather comprehensive information. Search until you have enough context.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**Recommended search order:**\n\n1. **Product** - Get style recommendations for product type\n2. **Style** - Get detailed style guide (colors, effects, frameworks)\n3. **Typography** - Get font pairings with Google Fonts imports\n4. **Color** - Get color palette (Primary, Secondary, CTA, Background, Text, Border)\n5. **Landing** - Get page structure (if landing page)\n6. **Chart** - Get chart recommendations (if dashboard/analytics)\n7. **UX** - Get best practices and anti-patterns\n8. **Stack** - Get stack-specific guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\n\n### Step 3: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nIf user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n**AI should:**\n\n```bash\n# 1. Search product type\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --domain product\n\n# 2. Search style (based on industry: beauty, elegant)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant minimal soft\" --domain style\n\n# 3. Search typography\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury\" --domain typography\n\n# 4. Search color palette\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness\" --domain color\n\n# 5. Search landing page structure\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"hero-centric social-proof\" --domain landing\n\n# 6. Search UX guidelines\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation\" --domain ux\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# 7. Search stack guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize all search results and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n7. **Split Into Multiple Files** - For better maintainability:\n   - Separate components into individual files (e.g., `Header.tsx`, `Footer.tsx`)\n   - Extract reusable styles into dedicated files\n   - Keep each file focused and under 200-300 lines\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:40:53.858Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design Agents needing advanced UI/UX design intelligence with searchable databases of UI styles, color palettes, and font pairings.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 UI/UX 设计智能的设计代理，具有可搜索的 UI 风格、色彩调色板和字体配对数据库。","ja":"UI/UX デザインの高度な知能が必要なデザイン エージェントに最適です。UI スタイル、カラーパレット、フォントのペアの検索可能なデータベースを備えています。","ko":"고급 UI/UX 디자인 인텔리전스가 필요한 디자인 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 검색 가능한 UI 스타일, 색상 팔레트 및 글꼴 페어링 데이터베이스를 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de diseño que necesitan inteligencia de diseño de UI/UX avanzada con bases de datos de estilos de UI, paletas de colores y emparejamientos de fuentes que se pueden buscar.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conception qui ont besoin d''une intelligence de conception UI/UX avancée avec des bases de données de styles d''UI, de palettes de couleurs et de combinaisons de polices qui peuvent être recherchées.","de":"Perfekt für Designagenten, die erweiterte UI/UX-Designintelligenz mit durchsuchbaren Datenbanken von UI-Stilen, Farbpaletten und Schriftkombinationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Design que necessitam de inteligência de design de UI/UX avançada com bases de dados pesquisáveis de estilos de UI, paletas de cores e combinações de fontes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов дизайна, которым необходима продвинутая интеллект UI/UX дизайна с поисковыми базами данных стилей UI, палитр цветов и пар font.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل تصميم الحاجة إلى ذكاء تصميم UI/UX المتقدم مع قواعد بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط UI وألوان وتركيبات خطوط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage a vast database of UI/UX design elements, including stack-specific best practices, UX guidelines, and product recommendations, utilizing Python for seamless integration and workflow automation, and supporting various operating systems such as macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, and Windows.","zh":"赋予代理者利用庞大的 UI/UX 设计元素数据库的能力，包括特定于堆栈的最佳实践、UX 指南和产品推荐，利用 Python 实现无缝集成和工作流自动化，并支持多种操作系统，如 macOS、Ubuntu/Debian 和 Windows。","ja":"エージェントが、スタック固有のベストプラクティス、UX ガイドライン、製品の推奨などを含む UI/UX デザイン要素の膨大なデータベースを利用できるようにします。Python を使用してシームレスな統合とワークフロー自動化を実現し、macOS、Ubuntu/Debian、Windows などのさまざまなオペレーティングシステムをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 UI/UX 디자인 요소의 방대한 데이터베이스를 활용할 수 있도록 해줍니다. 스택별 최선의 방법, UX 가이드라인, 제품 추천 등이 포함되어 있으며, Python을 사용하여 무제한 통합 및 워크플ロー 자동화를实现하며, macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows 등의 다양한 운영 체제를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar una vasta base de datos de elementos de diseño de UI/UX, incluidas las mejores prácticas específicas de la pila, las directrices de UX y las recomendaciones de productos, utilizando Python para una integración y automatización de flujo de trabajo sin problemas, y admitiendo varios sistemas operativos como macOS, Ubuntu/Debian y Windows.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti d''une vaste base de données d''éléments de conception UI/UX, y compris les meilleures pratiques spécifiques à la pile, les directives UX et les recommandations de produits, en utilisant Python pour une intégration et une automatisation du workflow sans problème, et en prenant en charge divers systèmes d''exploitation tels que macOS, Ubuntu/Debian et Windows.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine umfangreiche Datenbank von UI/UX-Design-Elementen zu nutzen, einschließlich stapelspezifischer Best Practices, UX-Richtlinien und Produkt-Empfehlungen, wobei Python für eine nahtlose Integration und Workflow-Automatisierung verwendet wird und verschiedene Betriebssysteme wie macOS, Ubuntu/Debian und Windows unterstützt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem uma vasta base de dados de elementos de design de UI/UX, incluindo as melhores práticas específicas da pilha, diretrizes de UX e recomendações de produtos, utilizando Python para integração e automação de fluxo de trabalho sem problemas, e suporta vários sistemas operacionais, como macOS, Ubuntu/Debian e Windows.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать огромную базу данных элементов дизайна UI/UX, включая лучшие практики, специфичные для стека, руководства по UX и рекомендации продуктов, используя Python для беспрепятственной интеграции и автоматизации рабочего процесса, а также поддерживает различные операционные системы, такие как macOS, Ubuntu/Debian и Windows.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من قاعدة بيانات شاملة من عناصر تصميم UI/UX، بما في ذلك أفضل الممارسات المحددة للرصيد، وإرشادات UX، وتوصيات المنتجات، باستخدام بايثون من أجل التكامل السلس والتشغيل الآلي للعمل، ودعم أنظمة تشغيل متعددة مثل macOS، و Ubuntu/Debian، و Windows."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI design suggestions with Python","Generating consistent color palettes for branding","Debugging UX issues with guidelines and best practices"],"zh":["使用 Python 自动执行 UI 设计建议","为品牌生成一致的色彩调色板","使用指南和最佳实践调试 UX 问题"],"ja":["Python を使用して UI デザインの提案を自動化する","ブランドに一致したカラーパレットを生成する","ガイドラインとベストプラクティスを使用して UX の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["Python을 사용하여 UI 디자인 제안을 자동화하는 것","브랜드에 일관된 색상 팔레트를 생성하는 것","가이드라인 및 최선의 방법을 사용하여 UX 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de sugerencias de diseño de UI con Python","Generación de paletas de colores coherentes para la identidad de marca","Depuración de problemas de UX con directrices y mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Automatisation des suggestions de conception d''UI avec Python","Génération de palettes de couleurs cohérentes pour la marque","Débogage des problèmes d''UX avec des directives et des meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Automatisierung von UI-Designvorschlägen mit Python","Erzeugung konsistenter Farbpaletten für die Markenidentität","Fehlerbehebung von UX-Problemen mit Richtlinien und Best Practices"],"pt":["Automatizar sugestões de design de UI com Python","Gerar paletas de cores consistentes para marcação","Depurar problemas de UX com diretrizes e melhores práticas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать предложения дизайна UI с помощью Python","Генерировать последовательные палитры цветов для брендинга","Отладить проблемы UX с помощью руководств и лучших практик"],"ar":["أتمتة اقتراحات تصميم UI باستخدام بايثون","توليد لوحات ألوان متسقة للعلامات التجارية","تصحيح أخطاء UX باستخدام الإرشادات وأفضل الممارسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python installation (Python 3.x compatible)","Operating system-specific installation commands required"],"zh":["需要 Python 安装（兼容 Python 3.x）","需要特定于操作系统的安装命令"],"ja":["Python のインストールが必要（Python 3.x との互換性あり）","オペレーティングシステム固有のインストール コマンドが必要"],"ko":["Python 설치가 필요합니다(Python 3.x와 호환됨)","운영 체제별 설치 명령어가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python (compatible con Python 3.x)","Se requieren comandos de instalación específicos del sistema operativo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Python (compatible avec Python 3.x)","Des commandes d''installation spécifiques au système d''exploitation sont requises"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Installation (kompatibel mit Python 3.x)","Betriebssystem-spezifische Installationsbefehle sind erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python (compatível com Python 3.x)","Comandos de instalação específicos do sistema operacional são necessários"],"ru":["Требуется установка Python (совместимый с Python 3.x)","Требуются команды установки, специфичные для операционной системы"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بايثون (متوافق مع بايثون 3.x)","يتطلب أوامر تثبيت محددة لنظام التشغيل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
