 desarrolladores","Mejores prácticas para desarrolladores","Compatibilidad con múltiples sistemas operativos"],"fr":["Base de données de styles UI","Palettes de couleurs personnalisables","Recommandations de produits","Directives UX pour les développeurs","Meilleures pratiques pour les développeurs","Compatibilité avec plusieurs systèmes d''exploitation"],"de":["Datenbank von UI-Stilen","Anpassbare Farbpaletten","Produktempfehlungen","UX-Richtlinien für Entwickler","Best Practices für Entwickler","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Betriebssystemen"],"pt":["Base de dados de estilos de UI","Paletas de cores personalizadas","Melhores práticas para desenvolvedores","Recomendações de produtos","Diretrizes de UX","Práticas recomendadas para pilhas específicas"],"ru":["База данных стилей UI","Пользовательские цветовые палитры","Лучшие практики для разработчиков","Рекомендации продуктов","Руководства по UX","Рекомендуемые практики для конкретных стеков"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات لأنماط واجهة المستخدم","ألوان مخصصة","أفضل الممارسات للمطورين","توصيات المنتجات","إرشادات تجربة المستخدم","أفضل الممارسات للكود المحدد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX 设计","设计智能","可搜索数据库","Python 开发","UX 指南","栈特定最佳实践","产品推荐","设计元素"],"ja":["UI/UX デザイン","デザインインテリジェンス","検索可能なデータベース","Python 開発","UX ガイドライン","スタック特有のベストプラクティス","製品推奨","デザイン要素"],"ko":["UI/UX 디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","검색 가능한 데이터베이스","Python 개발","UX 가이드라인","스택 특有的 베스트 프랙티스","제품 추천","디자인 요소"],"es":["UI/UX","diseño inteligente","desarrollo web","estilos UI","paletas de colores","recomendaciones de productos","pautas de UX","mejores prácticas","desarrolladores"],"fr":["UI/UX","conception intelligente","développement web","styles UI","palettes de couleurs","recommandations de produits","directives UX","meilleures pratiques","développeurs"],"de":["UI/UX","Design-Intelligenz","Webentwicklung","UI-Stile","Farbpaletten","Produktempfehlungen","UX-Richtlinien","Best Practices","Entwickler"],"pt":["ui/ux","design inteligente","desenvolvedores","estilos de ui","paletas de cores","melhores práticas","recomendações de produtos","diretrizes de ux"],"ru":["ui/ux","интеллектуальный дизайн","разработчики","стили ui","цветовые палитры","лучшие практики","рекомендации продуктов","руководства по ux"],"ar":["واجهة المستخدم","تصميم ذكي","المطورين","ألوان","أفضل الممارسات","توصيات المنتجات","إرشادات تجربة المستخدم","تصميم واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"spitzheffel","repo":"market","repoPath":"spitzheffel/market","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.469Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 8 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Search Relevant Domains\n\nUse `search.py` multiple times to gather comprehensive information. Search until you have enough context.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**Recommended search order:**\n\n1. **Product** - Get style recommendations for product type\n2. **Style** - Get detailed style guide (colors, effects, frameworks)\n3. **Typography** - Get font pairings with Google Fonts imports\n4. **Color** - Get color palette (Primary, Secondary, CTA, Background, Text, Border)\n5. **Landing** - Get page structure (if landing page)\n6. **Chart** - Get chart recommendations (if dashboard/analytics)\n7. **UX** - Get best practices and anti-patterns\n8. **Stack** - Get stack-specific guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\n\n### Step 3: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nIf user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n**AI should:**\n\n```bash\n# 1. Search product type\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --domain product\n\n# 2. Search style (based on industry: beauty, elegant)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant minimal soft\" --domain style\n\n# 3. Search typography\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury\" --domain typography\n\n# 4. Search color palette\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness\" --domain color\n\n# 5. Search landing page structure\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"hero-centric social-proof\" --domain landing\n\n# 6. Search UX guidelines\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation\" --domain ux\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# 7. Search stack guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\npython3 .shared/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize all search results and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n7. **Split Into Multiple Files** - For better maintainability:\n   - Separate components into individual files (e.g., `Header.tsx`, `Footer.tsx`)\n   - Extract reusable styles into dedicated files\n   - Keep each file focused and under 200-300 lines\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:41:01.204Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design Agents needing advanced UI/UX capabilities with Python integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 UI/UX 功能并集成 Python 的设计代理。","ja":"Python 統合を必要とするデザイン エージェントに最適な UI/UX 機能です。","ko":"파이썬 통합이 필요한 디자인 에이전트에게 적합한 고급 UI/UX 기능입니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Diseño que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de UI/UX con integración de Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conception nécessitant des capacités UI/UX avancées avec une intégration Python.","de":"Perfekt für Design-Agenten, die erweiterte UI/UX-Fähigkeiten mit Python-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Design Agents needing advanced UI/UX capabilities with Python integration.","ru":"Perfect for Design Agents needing advanced UI/UX capabilities with Python integration.","ar":"Perfect for Design Agents needing advanced UI/UX capabilities with Python integration."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, and font pairings, utilizing Python for seamless integration with UX guidelines and stack-specific best practices, including chart types and product recommendations.","zh":"赋予代理人利用可搜索的 UI 风格、颜色调色板和字体配对数据库的能力，利用 Python 实现与 UX 指南和特定堆栈的最佳实践（包括图表类型和产品推荐）无缝集成。","ja":"UI スタイル、カラーパレット、フォントのペアの検索可能なデータベースを利用し、Python を使用して UX ガイドラインやスタック固有のベスト プラクティス（チャート タイプやプロダクトのレコメンデーションなど）とシームレスに統合するエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"검색 가능한 UI 스타일, 색상 팔레트 및 글꼴 페어 데이터베이스를 활용하여 에이전트가 파이썬을 사용하여 UX 가이드라인 및 스택별 모범 사례(차트 유형 및 제품 추천 등)와 무縫으로 통합할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar una base de datos searchable de estilos de UI, paletas de colores y emparejamientos de fuentes, utilizando Python para una integración sin problemas con las pautas de UX y las mejores prácticas específicas de la pila, incluidos los tipos de gráficos y las recomendaciones de productos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter une base de données recherchable de styles d''interface utilisateur, de palettes de couleurs et d''appariements de polices, en utilisant Python pour une intégration transparente avec les lignes directrices d''expérience utilisateur et les meilleures pratiques spécifiques à la pile, y compris les types de graphiques et les recommandations de produits.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine durchsuchbare Datenbank von UI-Stilen, Farbpaletten und Schriftartenpaarungen zu nutzen, wobei Python für eine nahtlose Integration mit UX-Richtlinien und stapelspezifischen Best Practices verwendet wird, einschließlich Charttypen und Produktempfehlungen.","pt":"Empowers agents to leverage a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, and font pairings, utilizing Python for seamless integration with UX guidelines and stack-specific best practices, including chart types and product recommendations.","ru":"Empowers agents to leverage a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, and font pairings, utilizing Python for seamless integration with UX guidelines and stack-specific best practices, including chart types and product recommendations.","ar":"Empowers agents to leverage a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, and font pairings, utilizing Python for seamless integration with UX guidelines and stack-specific best practices, including chart types and product recommendations."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI component design with Python","Generating consistent color schemes and font pairings for branding","Debugging UX issues with data-driven design intelligence"],"zh":["使用 Python 自动化 UI 组件设计","生成一致的颜色方案和字体配对以用于品牌推广","使用数据驱动的设计智能调试 UX 问题"],"ja":["Python を使用して UI コンポーネントの設計を自動化する","ブランディングに一貫した色のスキームとフォントのペアを生成する","データ駆動のデザイン インテリジェンスを使用して UX の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["파이썬을 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트 디자인 자동화","브랜딩을 위한 일관된 색상 스키마 및 글꼴 페어 생성","데이터 주도 설계 인텔리전스를 사용하여 UX 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar el diseño de componentes de UI con Python","Generar esquemas de color y emparejamientos de fuentes coherentes para la marca","Depurar problemas de UX con inteligencia de diseño basada en datos"],"fr":["Automatiser la conception de composants d''interface utilisateur avec Python","Générer des schémas de couleur et des appariements de polices cohérents pour la marque","Déboguer les problèmes d''expérience utilisateur avec l''intelligence de conception basée sur les données"],"de":["Automatisieren des UI-Komponenten-Designs mit Python","Erzeugen konsistenter Farbschemata und Schriftartenpaarungen für die Marke","Fehlerbehebung bei UX-Problemen mit datengetriebener Designintelligenz"],"pt":["Automating UI component design with Python","Generating consistent color schemes and font pairings for branding","Debugging UX issues with data-driven design intelligence"],"ru":["Automating UI component design with Python","Generating consistent color schemes and font pairings for branding","Debugging UX issues with data-driven design intelligence"],"ar":["Automating UI component design with Python","Generating consistent color schemes and font pairings for branding","Debugging UX issues with data-driven design intelligence"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python installation (version 3.x)","Limited to design and UI/UX applications","Dependent on user''s OS for Python installation (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"zh":["需要 Python 安装（版本 3.x）","仅限设计和 UI/UX 应用","依赖于用户的操作系统来安装 Python（macOS、Ubuntu/Debian、Windows）"],"ja":["Python のインストール（バージョン 3.x）が必要","設計と UI/UX アプリケーションに限定される","Python のインストールにはユーザーの OS （macOS、Ubuntu/Debian、Windows）に依存する"],"ko":["파이썬 설치 필요(버전 3.x)","디자인 및 UI/UX 애플리케이션에만 제한","파이썬 설치는 사용자의 OS(맥OS, 우분투/데비안, 윈도우)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python (versión 3.x)","Limitado a aplicaciones de diseño y UI/UX","Dependiente del sistema operativo del usuario para la instalación de Python (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Python (version 3.x)","Limité aux applications de conception et d''interface utilisateur/expérience utilisateur","Dépendant du système d''exploitation de l''utilisateur pour l''installation de Python (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Installation (Version 3.x)","Begrenzt auf Design- und UI/UX-Anwendungen","Abhängig vom Betriebssystem des Benutzers für die Python-Installation (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"pt":["Requires Python installation (version 3.x)","Limited to design and UI/UX applications","Dependent on user''s OS for Python installation (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"ru":["Requires Python installation (version 3.x)","Limited to design and UI/UX applications","Dependent on user''s OS for Python installation (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"ar":["Requires Python installation (version 3.x)","Limited to design and UI/UX applications","Dependent on user''s OS for Python installation (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
