 desarrollo de agentes compacto","fr":"Cadre de développement d''agents compact","de":"Kompaktes Agenten-Entwicklungsframework","pt":"Desenvolvimento Compact de Multi-Agentes","ru":"Компактный фреймворк для разработки многоагентных систем","ar":"إطار عمل متعدد الوكلاء المضغوط","en":"compact"},"description":{"zh":"Compact框架是一种JSON驱动的多代理开发框架，具有智能CLI编排、上下文优先架构和自动化工作流执行功能","ja":"Compactフレームワークは、JSON駆動のマルチエージェント開発フレームワークです。インテリジェントCLIオーケストレーション、コンテキストファーストアーキテクチャ、自動化ワークフローの実行機能を備えています","ko":"컴팩트 프레임워크는 JSON 驱动의 멀티 에이전트 개발 프레임워크로서智能 CLI 오케스트레이션, 컨텍스트 우선 아키텍처 및 자동화 워크플로우 실행 기능을 제공","es":"El marco de desarrollo de agentes compacto es un framework de desarrollo de agentes multiplataforma con CLI de inteligencia artificial y arquitectura de cont...","fr":"Le cadre de développement d''agents compact est un framework de développement d''agents multiplateforme avec une CLI d''intelligence artificielle et une archite...","de":"Das kompakte Agenten-Entwicklungsframework ist ein multiplattformfähiges Framework für die Entwicklung von Agenten mit künstlicher Intelligenz-CLI und Kontex...","pt":"O framework compact é uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de multi-agentes que utiliza JSON e CLI inteligente para orquestrar workflows","ru":"Компактный фреймворк - это платформа для разработки многоагентных систем, использующая JSON и интеллектуальный CLI для оркестровки рабочих процессов","ar":"إطار العمل المضغوط هو منصة لتنمية متعدد الوكلاء التي تستخدم JSON وواجهة سطر الأوامر الذكية لتنسيق سير العمل","en":" JSON-driven multi-agent development framework with   intelligent CLI orchestration (Gemini/Qwen/Codex),   context-first architecture, and automated workflow..."},"definition":{"en":" JSON-driven multi-agent development framework with   intelligent CLI orchestration (Gemini/Qwen/Codex),   context-first architecture, and automated workflow   execution"},"features":{"zh":["智能CLI编排","上下文优先架构","自动化工作流执行","JSON驱动的多代理开发","会话恢复功能","压缩当前会话工作内存"],"ja":["インテリジェントCLIオーケストレーション","コンテキストファーストアーキテクチャ","自動化ワークフローの実行","JSON駆動のマルチエージェント開発","セッション復旧機能","現在のセッションワークメモリの圧縮"],"ko":["智能 CLI 오케스트레이션","컨텍스트 우선 아키텍처","자동화 워크플로우 실행","JSON 驱动의 멀티 에이전트 개발","세션 복구 기능","현재 세션 작업 메모리의 압축"],"es":["Desarrollo de agentes multiplataforma","CLI de inteligencia artificial","Arquitectura de contexto","Ejecución automática de flujos de trabajo","Recuperación de sesiones","Minimización de la reexploración"],"fr":["Développement d''agents multiplateforme","CLI d''intelligence artificielle","Architecture de contexte","Exécution automatique de flux de travail","Récupération de sessions","Minimisation de la réexploration"],"de":["Entwicklung von multiplattformfähigen Agenten","Künstliche Intelligenz-CLI","Kontextarchitektur","Automatisierte Ausführung von Workflows","Sitzungs-Wiederherstellung","Minimierung der Neuerforschung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de multi-agentes com JSON","CLI inteligente para orquestrar workflows","Arquitetura de contexto para melhor desempenho","Execução automática de workflows","Suporte a recuperação de sessão"],"ru":["Разработка многоагентных систем с использованием JSON","Интеллектуальный CLI для оркестровки рабочих процессов","Контекстно-ориентированная архитектура для лучшей производительности","Автоматическая выполнение рабочих процессов","Поддержка восстановления сессии"],"ar":["تنمية متعدد الوكلاء باستخدام JSON","واجهة سطر الأوامر الذكية لتنسيق سير العمل","هندسة السياق لتحسين الأداء","تنفيذ سير العمل آليًا","دعم استعادة جلسة العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Compact框架","JSON驱动","多代理开发","智能CLI编排","上下文优先架构","自动化工作流执行","会话恢复","工作内存压缩"],"ja":["Compactフレームワーク","JSON駆動","マルチエージェント開発","インテリジェントCLIオーケストレーション","コンテキストファーストアーキテクチャ","自動化ワークフローの実行","セッション復旧","ワークメモリ圧縮"],"ko":["컴팩트 프레임워크","JSON 驱动","멀티 에이전트 개발","智能 CLI 오케스트레이션","컨텍스트 우선 아키텍처","자동화 워크플로우 실행","세션 복구","작업 메모리 압축"],"es":["desarrollo de agentes","inteligencia artificial","arquitectura de contexto","CLI","recuperación de sesiones","minimización de la reexploración","framework de desarrollo de agentes","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["développement d''agents","intelligence artificielle","architecture de contexte","CLI","récupération de sessions","minimisation de la réexploration","cadre de développement d''agents","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Entwicklung von Agenten","künstliche Intelligenz","Kontextarchitektur","CLI","Sitzungs-Wiederherstellung","Minimierung der Neuerforschung","Agenten-Entwicklungsframework","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de multi-agentes","framework compact","CLI inteligente","arquitetura de contexto","orquestração de workflows","recuperação de sessão"],"ru":["разработка многоагентных систем","компактный фреймворк","интеллектуальный CLI","контекстно-ориентированная архитектура","оркестровка рабочих процессов","восстановление сессии"],"ar":["تنمية متعدد الوكلاء","إطار العمل المضغوط","واجهة سطر الأوامر الذكية","هندسة السياق","تنسيق سير العمل","استعادة جلسة العمل"]}},"owner":"catlog22","repo":"Claude-Code-Workflow","repoPath":"catlog22/Claude-Code-Workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.469Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"compact","description":"Compact current session memory into structured text for session recovery. Supports custom descriptions and tagging.","bodyPreview":"# Memory Compact Command (/memory:compact)\n\n## 1. Overview\n\nThe `memory:compact` command **compresses current session working memory** into structured text optimized for **session recovery**, extracts critical information, and saves it to persistent storage via MCP `core_memory` tool.\n\n**Core Philosophy**:\n- **Session Recovery First**: Capture everything needed to resume work seamlessly\n- **Minimize Re-exploration**: Include file paths, decisions, and state to avoid redundant analysis\n- **Preser","body":"# Memory Compact Command (/memory:compact)\n\n## 1. Overview\n\nThe `memory:compact` command **compresses current session working memory** into structured text optimized for **session recovery**, extracts critical information, and saves it to persistent storage via MCP `core_memory` tool.\n\n**Core Philosophy**:\n- **Session Recovery First**: Capture everything needed to resume work seamlessly\n- **Minimize Re-exploration**: Include file paths, decisions, and state to avoid redundant analysis\n- **Preserve Train of Thought**: Keep notes and hypotheses for complex debugging\n- **Actionable State**: Record last action result and known issues\n\n## 2. Parameters\n\n- `--description`: Custom session description (optional)\n  - Example: \"completed core-memory module\"\n  - Example: \"debugging JWT refresh - suspected memory leak\"\n- `--tags`: Comma-separated tags for categorization (optional)\n- `--force`: Skip confirmation, save directly\n\n## 3. Structured Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Session ID\n[WFS-ID if workflow session active, otherwise (none)]\n\n## Project Root\n[Absolute path to project root, e.g., D:\\Claude_dms3]\n\n## Objective\n[High-level goal - the \"North Star\" of this session]\n\n## Execution Plan\n[CRITICAL: Embed the LATEST plan in its COMPLETE and DETAILED form]\n\n### Source: [workflow | todo | user-stated | inferred]\n\n<details>\n<summary>Full Execution Plan (Click to expand)</summary>\n\n[PRESERVE COMPLETE PLAN VERBATIM - DO NOT SUMMARIZE]\n- ALL phases, tasks, subtasks\n- ALL file paths (absolute)\n- ALL dependencies and prerequisites\n- ALL acceptance criteria\n- ALL status markers ([x] done, [ ] pending)\n- ALL notes and context\n\nExample:\n## Phase 1: Setup\n- [x] Initialize project structure\n  - Created D:\\Claude_dms3\\src\\core\\index.ts\n  - Added dependencies: lodash, zod\n- [ ] Configure TypeScript\n  - Update tsconfig.json for strict mode\n\n## Phase 2: Implementation\n- [ ] Implement core API\n  - Target: D:\\Claude_dms3\\src\\api\\handler.ts\n  - Dependencies: Phase 1 complete\n  - Acceptance: All tests pass\n\n</details>\n\n## Working Files (Modified)\n[Absolute paths to actively modified files]\n- D:\\Claude_dms3\\src\\file1.ts (role: main implementation)\n- D:\\Claude_dms3\\tests\\file1.test.ts (role: unit tests)\n\n## Reference Files (Read-Only)\n[Absolute paths to context files - NOT modified but essential for understanding]\n- D:\\Claude_dms3\\.claude\\CLAUDE.md (role: project instructions)\n- D:\\Claude_dms3\\src\\types\\index.ts (role: type definitions)\n- D:\\Claude_dms3\\package.json (role: dependencies)\n\n## Last Action\n[Last significant action and its result/status]\n\n## Decisions\n- [Decision]: [Reasoning]\n- [Decision]: [Reasoning]\n\n## Constraints\n- [User-specified limitation or preference]\n\n## Dependencies\n- [Added/changed packages or environment requirements]\n\n## Known Issues\n- [Deferred bug or edge case]\n\n## Changes Made\n- [Completed modification]\n\n## Pending\n- [Next step] or (none)\n\n## Notes\n[Unstructured thoughts, hypotheses, debugging trails]\n```\n\n## 4. Field Definitions\n\n| Field | Purpose | Recovery Value |\n|-------|---------|----------------|\n| **Session ID** | Workflow session identifier (WFS-*) | Links memory to specific stateful task execution |\n| **Project Root** | Absolute path to project directory | Enables correct path resolution in new sessions |\n| **Objective** | Ultimate goal of the session | Prevents losing track of broader feature |\n| **Execution Plan** | Complete plan from any source (verbatim) | Preserves full planning context, avoids re-planning |\n| **Working Files** | Actively modified files (absolute paths) | Immediately identifies where work was happening |\n| **Reference Files** | Read-only context files (absolute paths) | Eliminates re-exploration for critical context |\n| **Last Action** | Final tool output/status | Immediate state awareness (success/failure) |\n| **Decisions** | Architectural choices + reasoning | Prevents re-litigating settled decisions |\n| **Constraints** | User-imposed limitations | Maintains personalized coding style |\n| **Dependencies** | Package/environment changes | Prevents missing dependency errors |\n| **Known Issues** | Deferred bugs/edge cases | Ensures issues aren''t forgotten |\n| **Changes Made** | Completed modifications | Clear record of what was done |\n| **Pending** | Next steps | Immediate action items |\n| **Notes** | Hypotheses, debugging trails | Preserves \"train of thought\" |\n\n## 5. Execution Flow\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Current Session\n\nExtract the following from conversation history:\n\n```javascript\nconst sessionAnalysis = {\n  sessionId: \"\",       // WFS-* if workflow session active, null otherwise\n  projectRoot: \"\",     // Absolute path: D:\\Claude_dms3\n  objective: \"\",       // High-level goal (1-2 sentences)\n  executionPlan: {\n    source: \"workflow\" | \"todo\" | \"user-stated\" | \"inferred\",\n    content: \"\"        // Full plan content - ALWAYS preserve COMPLETE and DETAILED form\n  },\n  workingFiles: [],    // {absolutePath, role} - modified files\n  referenceFiles: [],  // {absolutePath, role} - read-only context files\n  lastAction: \"\",      // Last significant action + result\n  decisions: [],       // {decision, reasoning}\n  constraints: [],     // User-specified limitations\n  dependencies: [],    // Added/changed packages\n  knownIssues: [],     // Deferred bugs\n  changesMade: [],     // Completed modifications\n  pending: [],         // Next steps\n  notes: \"\"            // Unstructured thoughts\n}\n```\n\n### Step 2: Generate Structured Text\n\n```javascript\n// Helper: Generate execution plan section\nconst generateExecutionPlan = (plan) => {\n  const sourceLabels = {\n    ''workflow'': ''workflow (IMPL_PLAN.md)'',\n    ''todo'': ''todo (TodoWrite)'',\n    ''user-stated'': ''user-stated'',\n    ''inferred'': ''inferred''\n  };\n\n  // CRITICAL: Preserve complete plan content verbatim - DO NOT summarize\n  return `### Source: ${sourceLabels[plan.source] || plan.source}\n\n<details>\n<summary>Full Execution Plan (Click to expand)</summary>\n\n${plan.content}\n\n</details>`;\n};\n\nconst structuredText = `## Session ID\n${sessionAnalysis.sessionId || ''(none)''}\n\n## Project Root\n${sessionAnalysis.projectRoot}\n\n## Objective\n${sessionAnalysis.objective}\n\n## Execution Plan\n${generateExecutionPlan(sessionAnalysis.executionPlan)}\n\n## Working Files (Modified)\n${sessionAnalysis.workingFiles.map(f => `- ${f.absolutePath} (role: ${f.role})`).join(''\\n'') || ''(none)''}\n\n## Reference Files (Read-Only)\n${sessionAnalysis.referenceFiles.map(f => `- ${f.absolutePath} (role: ${f.role})`).join(''\\n'') || ''(none)''}\n\n## Last Action\n${sessionAnalysis.lastAction}\n\n## Decisions\n${sessionAnalysis.decisions.map(d => `- ${d.decision}: ${d.reasoning}`).join(''\\n'') || ''(none)''}\n\n## Constraints\n${sessionAnalysis.constraints.map(c => `- ${c}`).join(''\\n'') || ''(none)''}\n\n## Dependencies\n${sessionAnalysis.dependencies.map(d => `- ${d}`).join(''\\n'') || ''(none)''}\n\n## Known Issues\n${sessionAnalysis.knownIssues.map(i => `- ${i}`).join(''\\n'') || ''(none)''}\n\n## Changes Made\n${sessionAnalysis.changesMade.map(c => `- ${c}`).join(''\\n'') || ''(none)''}\n\n## Pending\n${sessionAnalysis.pending.length > 0\n  ? sessionAnalysis.pending.map(p => `- ${p}`).join(''\\n'')\n  : ''(none)''}\n\n## Notes\n${sessionAnalysis.notes || ''(none)''}`\n```\n\n### Step 3: Import to Core Memory via MCP\n\nUse the MCP `core_memory` tool to save the structured text:\n\n```javascript\nmcp__ccw-tools__core_memory({\n  operation: \"import\",\n  text: structuredText\n})\n```\n\nOr via CLI (pipe structured text to import):\n\n```bash\n# Write structured text to temp file, then import\necho \"$structuredText\" | ccw core-memory import\n\n# Or from a file\nccw core-memory import --file /path/to/session-memory.md\n```\n\n**Response Format**:\n```json\n{\n  \"operation\": \"import\",\n  \"id\": \"CMEM-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS\",\n  \"message\": \"Created memory: CMEM-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS\"\n}\n```\n\n### Step 4: Report Recovery ID\n\nAfter successful import, **clearly display the Recovery ID** to the user:\n\n```\n╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  ✓ Session Memory Saved                                                    ║\n║                                                                            ║\n║  Recovery ID: CMEM-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS                                         ║\n║                                                                            ║\n║  To restore: \"Please import memory <ID>\"                                   ║\n║  (MCP: core_memory export | CLI: ccw core-memory export --id <ID>)         ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n## 6. Quality Checklist\n\nBefore generating:\n- [ ] Session ID captured if workflow session active (WFS-*)\n- [ ] Project Root is absolute path (e.g., D:\\Claude_dms3)\n- [ ] Objective clearly states the \"North Star\" goal\n- [ ] Execution Plan: COMPLETE plan preserved VERBATIM (no summarization)\n- [ ] Plan Source: Clearly identified (workflow | todo | user-stated | inferred)\n- [ ] Plan Details: ALL phases, tasks, file paths, dependencies, status markers included\n- [ ] All file paths are ABSOLUTE (not relative)\n- [ ] Working Files: 3-8 modified files with roles\n- [ ] Reference Files: Key context files (CLAUDE.md, types, configs)\n- [ ] Last Action captures final state (success/failure)\n- [ ] Decisions include reasoning, not just choices\n- [ ] Known Issues separates deferred from forgotten bugs\n- [ ] Notes preserve debugging hypotheses if any\n\n## 7. Path Resolution Rules\n\n### Project Root Detection\n1. Check current working directory from environment\n2. Look for project markers: `.git/`, `package.json`, `.claude/`\n3. Use the topmost directory containing these markers\n\n### Absolute Path Conversion\n```javascript\n// Convert relative to absolute\nconst toAbsolutePath = (relativePath, projectRoot) => {\n  if (path.isAbsolute(relativePath)) return relativePath;\n  return path.join(projectRoot, relativePath);\n};\n\n// Example: \"src/api/auth.ts\" → \"D:\\Claude_dms3\\src\\api\\auth.ts\"\n```\n\n### Reference File Categories\n| Category | Examples | Priority |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| Project Config | `.claude/CLAUDE.md`, `package.json`, `tsconfig.json` | High |\n| Type Definitions | `src/types/*.ts`, `*.d.ts` | High |\n| Related Modules | Parent/sibling modules with shared interfaces | Medium |\n| Test Files | Corresponding test files for modified code | Medium |\n| Documentation | `README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md` | Low |\n\n## 8. Plan Detection (Priority Order)\n\n### Priority 1: Workflow Session (IMPL_PLAN.md)\n```javascript\n// Check for active workflow session\nconst manifest = await mcp__ccw-tools__session_manager({\n  operation: \"list\",\n  location: \"active\"\n});\n\nif (manifest.sessions?.length > 0) {\n  const session = manifest.sessions[0];\n  const plan = await mcp__ccw-tools__session_manager({\n    operation: \"read\",\n    session_id: session.id,\n    content_type: \"plan\"\n  });\n  sessionAnalysis.sessionId = session.id;\n  sessionAnalysis.executionPlan.source = \"workflow\";\n  sessionAnalysis.executionPlan.content = plan.content;\n}\n```\n\n### Priority 2: TodoWrite (Current Session Todos)\n```javascript\n// Extract from conversation - look for TodoWrite tool calls\n// Preserve COMPLETE todo list with all details\nconst todos = extractTodosFromConversation();\nif (todos.length > 0) {\n  sessionAnalysis.executionPlan.source = \"todo\";\n  // Format todos with full context - preserve status markers\n  sessionAnalysis.executionPlan.content = todos.map(t =>\n    `- [${t.status === ''completed'' ? ''x'' : t.status === ''in_progress'' ? ''>'' : '' ''}] ${t.content}`\n  ).join(''\\n'');\n}\n```\n\n### Priority 3: User-Stated Plan\n```javascript\n// Look for explicit plan statements in user messages:\n// - \"Here''s my plan: 1. ... 2. ... 3. ...\"\n// - \"I want to: first..., then..., finally...\"\n// - Numbered or bulleted lists describing steps\nconst userPlan = extractUserStatedPlan();\nif (userPlan) {\n  sessionAnalysis.executionPlan.source = \"user-stated\";\n  sessionAnalysis.executionPlan.content = userPlan;\n}\n```\n\n### Priority 4: Inferred Plan\n```javascript\n// If no explicit plan, infer from:\n// - Task description and breakdown discussion\n// - Sequence of actions taken\n// - Outstanding work mentioned\nconst inferredPlan = inferPlanFromDiscussion();\nif (inferredPlan) {\n  sessionAnalysis.executionPlan.source = \"inferred\";\n  sessionAnalysis.executionPlan.content = inferredPlan;\n}\n```\n\n## 9. Notes\n\n- **Timing**: Execute at task completion or before context switch\n- **Frequency**: Once per independent task or milestone\n- **Recovery**: New session can immediately continue with full context\n- **Knowledge Graph**: Entity relationships auto-extracted for visualization\n- **Absolute Paths**: Critical for cross-session recovery on different machines\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:41:29.666Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code or AutoGPT requiring efficient session management and recovery through JSON-driven workflows.","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 或 AutoGPT 这样的高级 AI 代理，需要通过 JSON 驱动的工作流实现高效的会话管理和恢复。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの高度な AI エージェントに適しており、JSON ドリブンのワークフローを介した効率的なセッション管理と復旧が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code 또는 AutoGPT와 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 JSON 구동 워크플로를 통해 효율적인 세션 관리 및 복구가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avanzados como Claude Code o AutoGPT que requieren un manejo de sesión eficiente y recuperación a través de flujos de trabajo impulsados por JSON.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de l''IA avancée comme Claude Code ou AutoGPT nécessitant une gestion de session efficace et une récupération via des flux de travail alimentés par JSON.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie Claude Code oder AutoGPT, die eine effiziente Sitzungsverwaltung und Wiederherstellung durch JSON-gesteuerte Workflows erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Claude Code ou AutoGPT que requerem gerenciamento de sessão eficiente e recuperação por meio de fluxos de trabalho impulsionados por JSON.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code или AutoGPT, требующих эффективного управления сессиями и восстановления через рабочие процессы, управляемые JSON.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المتقدمين مثل Claude Code أو AutoGPT الذين يتطلبون إدارة جلسة فعالة واستعادة من خلال سير عمل مدفوعة ب JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compress current session working memory into structured text optimized for seamless session recovery, leveraging intelligent CLI orchestration via Gemini/Qwen/Codex and context-first architecture, while utilizing MCP core_memory tool for automated workflow execution and persistent storage.","zh":"赋予代理将当前会话工作内存压缩为优化的结构化文本，以实现无缝的会话恢复，利用 Gemini/Qwen/Codex 的智能 CLI 编排和上下文优先架构，同时使用 MCP core_memory 工具实现自动化工作流执行和持久存储。","ja":"エージェントに現在のセッションの作業メモリを最適化された構造化テキストに圧縮する機能を付与し、Gemini/Qwen/Codex の高度な CLI オーケストレーションとコンテキスト優先アーキテクチャを活用して、シームレスなセッションの復旧を可能にし、MCP core_memory ツールを使用して自動化されたワークフローの実行と永続的なストレージを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 현재 세션의 작업 메모리를 최적화된 구조화된 텍스트로 압축하여 무손실 세션 복구를 가능하게 하며 Gemini/Qwen/Codex의 智能 CLI 오케스트레이션 및 컨텍스트 우선 아키텍처를 활용하고 MCP core_memory 툴을 사용하여 자동화된 워크플로우 실행 및 영속적 저장소를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a comprimir la memoria de trabajo de la sesión actual en texto estructurado optimizado para una recuperación de sesión sin problemas, aprovechando la orquestación de CLI inteligente a través de Gemini/Qwen/Codex y arquitectura de contexto primero, mientras utiliza la herramienta core_memory de MCP para la ejecución de flujo de trabajo automatizada y almacenamiento persistente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de compresser la mémoire de travail de la session actuelle en texte structuré optimisé pour une récupération de session sans accroc, en exploitant l''orchestration de CLI intelligente via Gemini/Qwen/Codex et l''architecture de contexte premier, tout en utilisant l''outil core_memory de MCP pour l''exécution de flux de travail automatisée et le stockage persistant.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die aktuelle Sitzungsarbeitsmemorie in strukturierten Text zu komprimieren, der für eine nahtlose Sitzungswiederherstellung optimiert ist, indem es die intelligente CLI-Orchestrierung über Gemini/Qwen/Codex und Kontext-erst-Architektur nutzt, während es das MCP core_memory-Tool für die automatisierte Workflow-Ausführung und persistenten Speicherung verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a comprimir a memória de trabalho da sessão atual em texto estruturado otimizado para recuperação de sessão sem problemas, aproveitando orquestração de CLI inteligente via Gemini/Qwen/Codex e arquitetura orientada ao contexto, enquanto utiliza a ferramenta core_memory do MCP para execução de fluxo de trabalho automatizada e armazenamento persistente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью сжимать текущую рабочую память сессии в структурированный текст, оптимизированный для бесперебойного восстановления сессии, используя интеллектуальную оркестрацию CLI через Gemini/Qwen/Codex и контекстно-ориентированную архитектуру, а также использует инструмент core_memory от MCP для автоматизированного выполнения рабочих процессов и постоянного хранения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ضغط الذاكرة العاملة للجلسة الحالية إلى نص منظم محسّن لاستعادة الجلسة دون انقطاع، مستفيداً من أوركسترا CLI الذكية من خلال Gemini/Qwen/Codex وهندسة موجهة السياق، بينما يستخدم أداة core_memory من MCP لتنفيذ تلقائي لتدفق العمل وتخزين مستمر."},"useCases":{"en":["Compressing session data for efficient recovery","Automating workflow execution with MCP core_memory tool","Extracting critical information for minimized re-exploration"],"zh":["压缩会话数据以实现高效的恢复","使用 MCP core_memory 工具实现工作流自动化执行","提取关键信息以最小化重新探索"],"ja":["セッションデータを圧縮して効率的な復旧を実現する","MCP core_memory ツールを使用してワークフローの自動化実行を実現する","重要な情報を抽出して再探索を最小限に抑える"],"ko":["세션 데이터를 압축하여 효율적인 복구를 구현한다","MCP core_memory 툴을 사용하여 워크플로우 자동화 실행을 구현한다","중요한 정보를 추출하여 재탐색을 최소화한다"],"es":["Comprimir datos de sesión para una recuperación eficiente","Automatizar la ejecución de flujos de trabajo con la herramienta core_memory de MCP","Extraer información crítica para minimizar la reexploración"],"fr":["Compresser les données de session pour une récupération efficace","Automatiser l''exécution de flux de travail avec l''outil core_memory de MCP","Extraire les informations critiques pour minimiser la réexploration"],"de":["Sitzungsdaten komprimieren für eine effiziente Wiederherstellung","Automatisieren der Workflow-Ausführung mit dem MCP core_memory-Tool","Kritische Informationen extrahieren, um die Wiedererkundung zu minimieren"],"pt":["Comprimir dados de sessão para recuperação eficiente","Automatizar execução de fluxo de trabalho com ferramenta core_memory do MCP","Extrair informações críticas para minimizar a re-exploração"],"ru":["Сжатие данных сессии для эффективного восстановления","Автоматизация выполнения рабочих процессов с помощью инструмента core_memory от MCP","Извлечение критической информации для минимизации повторного исследования"],"ar":["ضغط بيانات الجلسة لاستعادة فعالة","تأتمة تنفيذ تدفق العمل بأداة core_memory من MCP","استخراج المعلومات الحاسمة لتقليل إعادة الاستكشاف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP core_memory tool integration","Dependent on JSON-driven multi-agent development framework","Limited to context-first architecture compatibility"],"zh":["需要 MCP core_memory 工具集成","依赖于 JSON 驱动的多代理开发框架","仅限于上下文优先架构兼容性"],"ja":["MCP core_memory ツールの統合が必要","JSON ドリブンのマルチエージェント開発フレームワークに依存する","コンテキスト優先アーキテクチャの互換性に限定される"],"ko":["MCP core_memory 툴 통합이 필요하다","JSON 구동 멀티 에이전트 개발 프레임워크에 의존한다","컨텍스트 우선 아키텍처 호환성에 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere integración con la herramienta core_memory de MCP","Dependiente del marco de desarrollo de multiagentes impulsado por JSON","Limitado a la compatibilidad con la arquitectura de contexto primero"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec l''outil core_memory de MCP","Dépendant du cadre de développement de multi-agents alimenté par JSON","Limité à la compatibilité avec l''architecture de contexte premier"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration mit dem MCP core_memory-Tool","Abhängig von der JSON-gesteuerten Multi-Agent-Entwicklungsframework","Begrenzt auf die Kompatibilität mit der Kontext-erst-Architektur"],"pt":["Requer integração com ferramenta core_memory do MCP","Dependente de estrutura de desenvolvimento de multi-agente impulsionada por JSON","Limitado à compatibilidade com arquitetura orientada ao contexto"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с инструментом core_memory от MCP","Зависит от многоагентной платформы разработки, управляемой JSON","Ограничен совместимостью с контекстно-ориентированной архитектурой"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع أداة core_memory من MCP","يعتمد على إطار عمل تطوير متعدد الوكلاء مدفوعًا ب JSON","محدود بالتوافق مع هندسة موجهة السياق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
