ion de fichiers de configuration pour PHPStan","Correction des erreurs PHPStan dans le code WordPress","Gestion des classes de plugins et de thèmes tiers","Compatibilité avec WordPress et PHPStan"],"de":["Analyse von PHP-Code mit PHPStan","Erzeugung von Konfigurationsdateien für PHPStan","Korrektur von PHPStan-Fehlern in WordPress-Code","Handhabung von Klassen von Drittanbieter-Plugins und -Themes","Kompatibilität mit WordPress und PHPStan"],"pt":["Configuração e atualização de arquivos de configuração","Geração e atualização de baseline","Correção de erros PHPStan via PHPDoc","Manipulação de classes de plugins e temas de terceiros"],"ru":["Настройка и обновление файлов конфигурации","Генерация и обновление базовой линии","Исправление ошибок PHPStan через PHPDoc","Обработка классов плагинов и тем от третьих лиц"],"ar":["تكوين وتحديث ملفات التكوين","توليد وتحديث الخط الأساسي","تصحيح أخطاء PHPStan عبر PHPDoc","تعامل مع فئات الإضافات والمواضيع من الأطراف الثالثة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WP PHPStan","WordPress 代码分析","PHPStan","代码优化","性能提高","安全性增强"],"ja":["WP PHPStan","WordPress コード分析","PHPStan","コード最適化","パフォーマンス向上","セキュリティ強化"],"ko":["WP PHPStan","워드프레스 코드 분석","PHPStan","코드 최적화","성능 향상","보안 강화"],"es":["WP PHPStan","análisis de código PHP","PHPStan","WordPress","desarrollo de plugins","seguridad de código","calidad de código","depuración de código"],"fr":["WP PHPStan","analyse de code PHP","PHPStan","WordPress","développement de plugins","sécurité de code","qualité de code","débogage de code"],"de":["WP PHPStan","PHP-Code-Analyse","PHPStan","WordPress","Plugin-Entwicklung","Code-Sicherheit","Code-Qualität","Fehlersuche im Code"],"pt":["WP PHPStan","análise de código","WordPress","qualidade de código","configuração","baseline","erros PHPStan"],"ru":["WP PHPStan","анализ кода","WordPress","качество кода","настройка","базовая линия","ошибки PHPStan"],"ar":["WP PHPStan","تحليل الرمز","ووردبريس","جودة الرمز","تكوين","الخط الأساسي","أخطاء PHPStan"]}},"owner":"WPdoaction","repo":"animal-shelter","repoPath":"WPdoaction/animal-shelter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.469Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-phpstan","description":"Use when configuring, running, or fixing PHPStan static analysis in WordPress projects (plugins/themes/sites): phpstan.neon setup, baselines, WordPress-specific typing, and handling third-party plugin classes.","bodyPreview":"# WP PHPStan\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill when working on PHPStan in a WordPress codebase, for example:\n\n- setting up or updating `phpstan.neon` / `phpstan.neon.dist`\n- generating or updating `phpstan-baseline.neon`\n- fixing PHPStan errors via WordPress-friendly PHPDoc (REST requests, hooks, query results)\n- handling third-party plugin/theme classes safely (stubs/autoload/targeted ignores)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- `wp-project-triage` output (run first if you haven''t)\n- Whether adding/updating C","body":"# WP PHPStan\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill when working on PHPStan in a WordPress codebase, for example:\n\n- setting up or updating `phpstan.neon` / `phpstan.neon.dist`\n- generating or updating `phpstan-baseline.neon`\n- fixing PHPStan errors via WordPress-friendly PHPDoc (REST requests, hooks, query results)\n- handling third-party plugin/theme classes safely (stubs/autoload/targeted ignores)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- `wp-project-triage` output (run first if you haven''t)\n- Whether adding/updating Composer dev dependencies is allowed (stubs).\n- Whether changing the baseline is allowed for this task.\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Discover PHPStan entrypoints (deterministic)\n1. Inspect PHPStan setup (config, baseline, scripts):\n   - `node skills/wp-phpstan/scripts/phpstan_inspect.mjs`\n\nPrefer the repo’s existing `composer` script (e.g. `composer run phpstan`) when present.\n\n### 1) Ensure WordPress core stubs are loaded\n\n`szepeviktor/phpstan-wordpress` or `php-stubs/wordpress-stubs` are effectively required for most WordPress plugin/theme repos. Without it, expect a high volume of errors about unknown WordPress core functions.\n\n- Confirm the package is installed (see `composer.dependencies` in the inspect report).\n- Ensure the PHPStan config references the stubs (see `references/third-party-classes.md`).\n\n### 2) Ensure a sane `phpstan.neon` for WordPress projects\n\n- Keep `paths` focused on first-party code (plugin/theme directories).\n- Exclude generated and vendored code (`vendor/`, `node_modules/`, build artifacts, tests unless explicitly analyzed).\n- Keep `ignoreErrors` entries narrow and documented.\n\nSee:\n- `references/configuration.md`\n\n### 3) Fix errors with WordPress-specific typing (preferred)\n\nPrefer correcting types over ignoring errors. Common WP patterns that need help:\n\n- REST endpoints: type request parameters using `WP_REST_Request<...>`\n- Hook callbacks: add accurate `@param` types for callback args\n- Database results and iterables: use array shapes or object shapes for query results\n- Action Scheduler: type `$args` array shapes for job callbacks\n\nSee:\n- `references/wordpress-annotations.md`\n\n### 4) Handle third-party plugin/theme classes (only when needed)\n\nWhen integrating with plugins/themes not present in the analysis environment:\n\n- First, confirm the dependency is real (installed/required).\n- Prefer plugin-specific stubs already used in the repo (common examples: `php-stubs/woocommerce-stubs`, `php-stubs/acf-pro-stubs`).\n- If PHPStan still cannot resolve classes, add targeted `ignoreErrors` patterns for the specific vendor prefix.\n\nSee:\n- `references/third-party-classes.md`\n\n### 5) Baseline management (use as a migration tool, not a trash bin)\n\n- Generate a baseline once for legacy code, then reduce it over time.\n- Do not “baseline” newly introduced errors.\n\nSee:\n- `references/configuration.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Run PHPStan using the discovered command (`composer run ...` or `vendor/bin/phpstan analyse`).\n- Confirm the baseline file (if used) is included and didn’t grow unexpectedly.\n- Re-run after changing `ignoreErrors` to ensure patterns are not masking unrelated issues.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\n- “Class not found”:\n  - confirm autoloading/stubs, or add a narrow ignore pattern\n- Huge error counts after enabling PHPStan:\n  - reduce `paths`, add `excludePaths`, start at a lower level, then ratchet up\n- Inconsistent types around hooks / REST params:\n  - add explicit PHPDoc (see references) rather than runtime guards\n\n## Escalation\n\n- If a type depends on a third-party plugin API you can’t confirm, ask for the dependency version or source before inventing types.\n- If fixing requires adding new Composer dependencies (stubs/extensions), confirm it with the user first.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:42:25.582Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for WordPress Development Agents needing advanced PHPStan configuration and error fixing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级PHPStan配置和错误修复功能的WordPress开发代理。","ja":"WordPress開発エージェントが高度なPHPStan構成とエラーフィクシング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 PHPStan 구성 및 오류 수정 기능이 필요한 WordPress 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de WordPress que necesitan una configuración avanzada de PHPStan y capacidades de corrección de errores.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement WordPress ayant besoin d''une configuration avancée de PHPStan et de capacités de correction d''erreurs.","de":"Perfekt für WordPress-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte PHPStan-Konfiguration und Fehlerbehebungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento do WordPress que necessitam de configuração avançada do PHPStan e capacidades de correção de erros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки WordPress, которым необходима расширенная настройка PHPStan и возможности исправления ошибок.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير ووردبريس التي تحتاج إلى تكوين متقدم لبرنامج PHPStan وقدرات تصحيح الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and optimize PHPStan for WordPress projects, including setting up phpstan.neon files, generating baselines, and fixing errors via WordPress-friendly PHPDoc, all while safely handling third-party plugins and themes using stubs, autoload, and targeted ignores.","zh":"赋予代理配置和优化WordPress项目的PHPStan的能力，包括设置phpstan.neon文件、生成基线、通过WordPress友好的PHPDoc修复错误，同时安全地处理第三方插件和主题，使用存根、自动加载和有针对性的忽略。","ja":"エージェントがWordPressプロジェクトのPHPStanを構成して最適化する能力を提供します。phpstan.neonファイルの設定、ベースラインの生成、WordPressに優しいPHPDocを使用したエラーの修正、スタブ、オートロード、ターゲットを絞った無視を使用して、第三者プラグインとテーマを安全に処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 WordPress 프로젝트의 PHPStan을 구성하고 최적화할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. phpstan.neon 파일 설정, 기준선 생성, WordPress에 적합한 PHPDoc을 사용한 오류 수정, 스텁, 자동 로드, 대상 지정 무시를 사용하여 서드 파티 플러그인과 테마를 안전하게 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar y optimizar PHPStan para proyectos de WordPress, incluyendo la configuración de archivos phpstan.neon, la generación de líneas base y la corrección de errores mediante PHPDoc amigo de WordPress, y todo ello mientras se manejan de forma segura plugins y temas de terceros utilizando stubs, autoload y omisiones dirigidas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et d''optimiser PHPStan pour les projets WordPress, notamment en configurant les fichiers phpstan.neon, en générant des lignes de base et en corrigeant les erreurs via PHPDoc adapté à WordPress, le tout en gérant de manière sécurisée les plugins et thèmes tiers à l''aide de stubs, d''autoload et d''ignorations ciblées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, PHPStan für WordPress-Projekte zu konfigurieren und zu optimieren, einschließlich der Einrichtung von phpstan.neon-Dateien, der Generierung von Baselines und der Fehlerbehebung über WordPress-freundliches PHPDoc, und zwar unter sicherer Handhabung von Drittanbieter-Plug-ins und -Themes mithilfe von Stubs, Autoload und gezielten Ignorierungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar e otimizar o PHPStan para projetos do WordPress, incluindo a configuração de arquivos phpstan.neon, geração de linhas de base e correção de erros via PHPDoc amigável ao WordPress, além de lidar de forma segura com plug-ins e temas de terceiros usando stubs, autoload e ignoração direcionada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настраивать и оптимизировать PHPStan для проектов WordPress, включая настройку файлов phpstan.neon, генерацию базовых линий и исправление ошибок с помощью PHPDoc, дружественного к WordPress, а также безопасное взаимодействие с плагинами и темами третьих сторон с помощью stubs, autoload и нацеленного игнорирования.","ar":"تمكين العوامل من تكوين وضبط برنامج PHPStan لمشاريع ووردبريس، بما في ذلك إعداد ملفات phpstan.neon وإنشاء أساسيات وتحديد الأخطاء من خلال وثائق PHPDoc الصديقة لووردبريس، مع التعامل الآمن مع الإضافات والمواضيع من طرف ثالث باستخدام الأشكال المُقاومة وتحميلها تلقائيًا والتجاهل المستهدف."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring phpstan.neon files for WordPress projects","Generating and updating phpstan-baseline.neon files","Fixing PHPStan errors in WordPress codebases using PHPDoc","Safely integrating third-party plugins and themes into PHPStan"],"zh":["为WordPress项目配置phpstan.neon文件","生成和更新phpstan-baseline.neon文件","使用PHPDoc在WordPress代码库中修复PHPStan错误","使用存根、自动加载和有针对性的忽略安全地将第三方插件和主题集成到PHPStan"],"ja":["WordPressプロジェクト用のphpstan.neonファイルを構成する","phpstan-baseline.neonファイルを生成して更新する","PHPDocを使用してWordPressコードベースのPHPStanエラーを修正する","スタブ、オートロード、ターゲットを絞った無視を使用して、第三者プラグインとテーマを安全にPHPStanに統合する"],"ko":["WordPress 프로젝트용 phpstan.neon 파일 구성","phpstan-baseline.neon 파일 생성 및 업데이트","PHPDoc을 사용하여 WordPress 코드베이스의 PHPStan 오류 수정","스텁, 자동 로드, 대상 지정 무시를 사용하여 서드 파티 플러그인과 테마를 안전하게 PHPStan에 통합"],"es":["Configuración de archivos phpstan.neon para proyectos de WordPress","Generación y actualización de archivos phpstan-baseline.neon","Corrección de errores de PHPStan en bases de código de WordPress mediante PHPDoc","Integración segura de plugins y temas de terceros en PHPStan"],"fr":["Configuration des fichiers phpstan.neon pour les projets WordPress","Génération et mise à jour des fichiers phpstan-baseline.neon","Correction des erreurs PHPStan dans les bases de code WordPress via PHPDoc","Intégration sécurisée de plugins et de thèmes tiers dans PHPStan"],"de":["Konfiguration von phpstan.neon-Dateien für WordPress-Projekte","Erstellung und Aktualisierung von phpstan-baseline.neon-Dateien","Behebung von PHPStan-Fehlern in WordPress-Codebasen mithilfe von PHPDoc","Sichere Integration von Drittanbieter-Plug-ins und -Themes in PHPStan"],"pt":["Configurando arquivos phpstan.neon para projetos do WordPress","Gerando e atualizando arquivos phpstan-baseline.neon","Corrigindo erros do PHPStan em código-fonte do WordPress usando PHPDoc","Integrando de forma segura plug-ins e temas de terceiros ao PHPStan"],"ru":["Настройка файлов phpstan.neon для проектов WordPress","Генерация и обновление файлов phpstan-baseline.neon","Исправление ошибок PHPStan в коде WordPress с помощью PHPDoc","Безопасная интеграция плагинов и тем третьих сторон в PHPStan"],"ar":["تكوين ملفات phpstan.neon لمشاريع ووردبريس","إنشاء وتحديث ملفات phpstan-baseline.neon","تصحيح أخطاء برنامج PHPStan في.codes ووردبريس باستخدام وثائق PHPDoc","التكامل الآمن للإضافات والمواضيع من طرف ثالث مع برنامج PHPStan"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires wp-project-triage output","Limited to WordPress and PHPStan environments","Needs specific input on whether adding or updating configurations"],"zh":["需要wp-project-triage输出","仅限WordPress和PHPStan环境","需要关于是否添加或更新配置的具体输入"],"ja":["wp-project-triageの出力を必要とする","WordPressとPHPStanの環境のみに限定される","構成を追加または更新するかどうかの具体的な入力を必要とする"],"ko":["wp-project-triage 출력이 필요","WordPress 및 PHPStan 환경에만 한정","구성 추가 또는 업데이트 여부에 대한 구체적인 입력이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la salida de wp-project-triage","Limitado a entornos de WordPress y PHPStan","Necesita una entrada específica sobre si se agregan o actualizan configuraciones"],"fr":["Nécessite la sortie de wp-project-triage","Limité aux environnements WordPress et PHPStan","Nécessite une entrée spécifique sur l''ajout ou la mise à jour des configurations"],"de":["Benötigt die Ausgabe von wp-project-triage","Begrenzt auf WordPress- und PHPStan-Umgebungen","Benötigt eine spezifische Eingabe darüber, ob Konfigurationen hinzugefügt oder aktualisiert werden"],"pt":["Exige saída do wp-project-triage","Limitado a ambientes do WordPress e PHPStan","Necessita de entrada específica sobre adicionar ou atualizar configurações"],"ru":["Требует вывода wp-project-triage","Ограничен средами WordPress и PHPStan","Требует конкретного ввода о добавлении или обновлении конфигураций"],"ar":["يتطلب إخراج wp-project-triage","محدود بالبيئات ووردبريس وبرنامج PHPStan","يحتاج إلى إدخال محدد حول إضافة أو تحديث التكوينات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
