جمة_SYSY إلى MIPS","en":"create-sysy-testcase"},"description":{"zh":"SysY测试用例创建是将标准C/C++竞赛代码转换为严格的SysY，并生成有效的测试数据","ja":"SysYテストケース作成は、標準C/C++競技プログラミングコードをStrict SysYに変換し、有効なテストデータを生成すること","ko":"SysY 테스트 케이스 생성은 표준 C/C++ 경쟁 프로그래밍 코드를 Strict SysY로 변환하고 유효한 테스트 데이터를 생성","es":"Convierte código C/C++ en Strict SysY y genera datos de prueba válidos para tu compilador SysY a MIPS. Aprende las reglas gramaticales estrictas para crear c...","fr":"Convertissez du code C/C++ en Strict SysY et générez des données de test valides pour votre compilateur SysY en MIPS. Apprenez les règles grammaticales stric...","de":"Wandeln Sie C/C++-Code in Strict SysY um und generieren Sie gültige Testdaten für Ihren SysY-zu-MIPS-Compiler. Erfahren Sie die strengen Grammatikregeln, um ...","pt":"Converte código C/C++ em Strict SysY e gere dados de teste válidos para o compilador SysY para MIPS.","ru":"Преобразуйте код C/C++ в Strict SysY и генерируйте действительные тестовые данные для компилятора SysY для MIPS.","ar":"قم بتحويل التعليمات البرمجية C/C++ إلى Strict SysY وإنشاء بيانات اختبار صالحة لترجمة_SYSY إلى MIPS.","en":"Test your SysY to MIPS Compiler and Share your Testcases."},"definition":{"en":"Test your SysY to MIPS Compiler and Share your Testcases."},"features":{"zh":["支持C/C++代码转换","生成有效的测试数据","严格的SysY语法规则","支持多种测试用例","易于使用的界面"],"ja":["C/C++コード変換のサポート","有効なテストデータの生成","厳格なSysYの文法ルール","多種多様なテストケースのサポート","使いやすいインターフェイス"],"ko":["C/C++ 코드 변환 지원","유효한 테스트 데이터 생성","엄격한 SysY 문법 규칙","다양한 테스트 케이스 지원","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스"],"es":["Conversión de código C/C++ en Strict SysY","Generación de datos de prueba válidos","Reglas gramaticales estrictas para casos de prueba efectivos","Compatibilidad con compiladores SysY a MIPS","Creación de casos de prueba personalizados"],"fr":["Conversion de code C/C++ en Strict SysY","Génération de données de test valides","Règles grammaticales strictes pour des cas de test efficaces","Compatibilité avec les compilateurs SysY en MIPS","Création de cas de test personnalisés"],"de":["Umwandlung von C/C++-Code in Strict SysY","Generierung von gültigen Testdaten","Strengen Grammatikregeln für effektive Testfälle","Kompatibilität mit SysY-zu-MIPS-Compilern","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Testfällen"],"pt":["Conversão de código C/C++ em Strict SysY","Geração de dados de teste válidos","Compatibilidade com o compilador SysY para MIPS","Compartilhamento de testes com a comunidade de desenvolvedores","Adesão às regras gramaticais do SysY","Suporte à criação de testes personalizados"],"ru":["Преобразование кода C/C++ в Strict SysY","Генерация действительных тестовых данных","Совместимость с компилятором SysY для MIPS","Обмен тестами с разработчиками","Соблюдение грамматических правил SysY","Поддержка создания пользовательских тестов"],"ar":["تحويل التعليمات البرمجية C/C++ إلى Strict SysY","إنشاء بيانات اختبار صالحة","التوافق مع مترجم_SYSY إلى MIPS","مشاركة الاختبارات مع مجتمع المطورين","الامتثال للقواعد النحوية لل_SYSY","دعم إنشاء اختبارات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SysY测试用例创建","C/C++代码转换","SysY语法规则","测试数据生成","编译器开发","竞赛编程"],"ja":["SysYテストケース作成","C/C++コード変換","SysYの文法ルール","テストデータ生成","コンパイラ開発","競技プログラミング"],"ko":["SysY 테스트 케이스 생성","C/C++代码変환","SysY 문법 규칙","테스트 데이터 생성","컴파일러 개발","경쟁 프로그래밍"],"es":["SysY","compilador","MIPS","código C/C++","datos de prueba","reglas gramaticales","casos de prueba","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de compiladores"],"fr":["SysY","compilateur","MIPS","code C/C++","données de test","règles grammaticales","cas de test","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de compilateurs"],"de":["SysY","Compiler","MIPS","C/C++-Code","Testdaten","Grammatikregeln","Testfälle","Softwareentwicklung","Compiler-Engineering"],"pt":["compilador SysY","MIPS","testes de compilador","Strict SysY","conversão de código","dados de teste","desenvolvedores","programação competitiva","engenharia de compiladores"],"ru":["компилятор SysY","MIPS","тесты компилятора","Strict SysY","преобразование кода","тестовые данные","разработчики","конкурентное программирование","инженерия компиляторов"],"ar":["مترجم_SYSY","MIPS","اختبارات المترجم","Strict SysY","تحويل التعليمات البرمجية","بيانات الاختبار","مطورون","برمجة تنافسية","هندسة المترجمات"]}},"owner":"oNya685","repo":"SysYTest","repoPath":"oNya685/SysYTest","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-sysy-testcase","description":"Convert C/C++ code into Strict SysY testcases using Python automation scripts.","bodyPreview":"# SysY Testcase Conversion Workflow\n\nYou are an expert compiler engineer. Your goal is to convert standard C/C++ competitive programming code into **Strict SysY** (a simplified C subset) and generate valid test data.\n\n## Non-Negotiable Grammar Rules\n**Adhere to these rules strictly.** Read `references/sysy_lang_grammar.md` **only** if you encounter an obscure syntax edge case not covered here.\n\n| Feature | Constraint | Fix / Refactor |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Prototypes** | **Implicit** | **D","body":"# SysY Testcase Conversion Workflow\n\nYou are an expert compiler engineer. Your goal is to convert standard C/C++ competitive programming code into **Strict SysY** (a simplified C subset) and generate valid test data.\n\n## Non-Negotiable Grammar Rules\n**Adhere to these rules strictly.** Read `references/sysy_lang_grammar.md` **only** if you encounter an obscure syntax edge case not covered here.\n\n| Feature | Constraint | Fix / Refactor |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Prototypes** | **Implicit** | **Do NOT** write `int getint();` or `int printf(...);`. |\n| **Memory / Size** | **Max 4MB Total** (MARS Limit) | **Scale Down Constants**. `1e6` $\\to$ `1e4`. Total `int` elements < 500,000. |\n| **Preprocessor** | **BANNED** (`#include`, `#define`, `#ifdef`) | Use `const int` for constants. Delete imports. |\n| **Types** | `int`, `void` **ONLY** | No `long long`, `float`, `double`, `char`, `bool`. |\n| **Pointers** | **BANNED** (`int *p`, `&x`, `*ptr`) | Pass arrays as `int a[]`. Use **return values** for scalar outputs (no `void f(int *res)`). |\n| **Arrays** | **1D Arrays ONLY** | Flatten `int a[N][M]` $\\to$ `int a[N*M]`. **No VLAs**. |\n| **Loops** | **`for` loops ONLY**. **No declarations inside `()`** | Move vars out: `int i; for(i=0;...)`. No `do-while`. No `while`. turn `while(1)` into `for(;;)`. |\n| **Returns** | **Non-void funcs MUST return** | Add dummy `return 0;` at end of function, **even after infinite loops**. |\n| **Conditions As Values** | `Exp → AddExp` (arithmetic only) | Do **NOT** use relational / logical expressions as values, e.g. `return a < b;` or `x = (a < b);`. Rewrite: `if (a < b) return 1; return 0;` or `x = 0; if (a < b) x = 1;`. |\n| **Input** | `int getint()` **ONLY** | No `scanf`, `cin`, `getchar`. |\n| **Output** | `printf` **ONLY** | Format string is a **SysY `StringConst`**: **only** `%d` is allowed as a format placeholder, and the **only** escape sequence is `\\n` (backslash may appear **only** in `\\n`). **No** other format specifiers/modifiers (e.g. `%c`, `%s`, `%%`, `%05d`) and **no** other escapes (e.g. `\\\\`, `\\\"`, `\\t`, `\\r`, `\\0`). Ensure the number of `, Exp` arguments equals the number of `%d`. |\n| **Parentheses** | `PrimaryExp → ''('' Exp '')''` and `Exp → AddExp` | `(...)` as an expression can wrap **arithmetic only**. Besides mandatory syntax like `if (Cond)` / `for (...; Cond; ...)`, do **NOT** add extra parentheses around conditions (any `== != < > <= >= && || !`). Rewrite via precedence/distribution, e.g. `if (t2 > 0 && (a == 42 || a == 47))` $\\to$ `if (t2 > 0 && a == 42 || t2 > 0 && a == 47)`. |\n| **Operators** | No Bitwise (`<<`, `>>`, `&`, `|`, `^`) | Use arithmetic: `*2`, `/2`, `%2`. Use lookup tables. |\n| **Structs** | **BANNED** | Split into parallel arrays (e.g., `x[N]`, `y[N]`). |\n| **Globals** | Encouraged for large arrays | Prevent stack overflow in SysY runtime, keep totol size < 4MB. |\n| **Input Data** | **Strictly 1 Integer Per Line** (`in.txt`) | No spaces (`1 2`). Must be `1\\n2`. Matches MIPS syscall. If `testfile.txt` uses a **sentinel** to stop reading (e.g., `if (ch == 0) break;`, `while (x != 0)`, `while (1) { x=getint(); if (x==0) break; }`), then `in.txt` must **explicitly include that sentinel value as the last integer**. **Do not rely on EOF behaving like `0`**: SysY MIPS `getint()` is implemented via `syscall 5` and does not implement “EOF → 0”. |\n\n## Execution Protocol\n\nFollow these steps sequentially.\n\n### Step 1: Initialize\n\nUse the helper script to create the directory and placeholder files.\n\n```bash\npython3 .codex/skills/create-sysy-testcase/scripts/init_case.py <TARGET_DIR>\n```\n\n### Step 2: Write Logic (The Intelligence Part)\n\nTranslate the source logic into Strict SysY. Focus your \"thinking\" here.\n\n- **Scale Down**: If original code has `MAXN = 100000`, change it smaller to fix up to MARS''s address space limit(about 4MB). Ensure logic consistency.\n- **Refactor** logic to fit the constraints above (e.g., flatten 2D arrays).\n- **Write** the code to `testfile.txt`.\n- **Write** input data to `in.txt` (newline-separated integers only) matching your scaled-down size. If the program reads until a sentinel (e.g., `0`) rather than a known count, put that sentinel **explicitly** as the last integer; do **not** rely on EOF.\n\n```bash\ncat <<''EOF'' > <TARGET_DIR>/testfile.txt\n// ... your converted SysY code ...\nEOF\n\ncat <<''EOF'' > <TARGET_DIR>/in.txt\n// ... your input numbers ...\nEOF\n```\n\n### Step 3: Compile, Run & Verify\n\nUse the runner script. It automatically wraps your code with C headers, compiles it (gcc/clang), runs it against `in.txt`, and generates `ans.txt`.\n\n```bash\npython3 .codex/skills/create-sysy-testcase/scripts/run_case.py <TARGET_DIR>\n```\n\n### Step 4: Fix & Retry\n\nIf Step 3 reports a **COMPILE ERROR** or **RUNTIME ERROR**:\n\n1. Read the error output.\n2. Fix the logic in `testfile.txt`.\n3. Rerun Step 3.\n\n## Translation Strategy Tips\n- SysY input (`in.txt`) must be **newline-separated integers**.\n- If the original problem uses strings (e.g., \"PUSH\", \"POP\"), map them to integers (e.g., 1, 2) in your translation logic.\n- **MIPS Compatibility Check**: `in.txt` **must not** contain spaces between numbers.\n- **Never use EOF as a terminator**: if the program’s input loop expects a terminator value (commonly `0`, sometimes `-1`/`-999`), put that value **explicitly** at the end of `in.txt` (and keep it on its own line).\n- **Strengthen `in.txt` slightly**: prefer including a mix of small/edge values (e.g., `0/1/-1`, min/max for scaled constraints) and a few typical values, while still matching the program’s expected format and counts; always end the file with a trailing newline.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:42:28.202Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Compiler Agents needing to convert C/C++ code into Strict SysY and generate valid test data for MIPS compilers.","zh":"适用于需要将C/C++代码转换为严格SysY并为MIPS编译器生成有效测试数据的编译器代理。","ja":"MIPSコンパイラのテスト用にC/C++コードをStrict SysYに変換し、有効なテストデータを生成するコンパイラエージェントに最適です。","ko":"MIPS 컴파일러를 위한 테스트 데이터 생성 및 C/C++ 코드를 엄격한 SysY로 변환해야 하는 컴파일 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Compiladores que necesitan convertir código C/C++ en Strict SysY y generar datos de prueba válidos para compiladores MIPS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de compilation ayant besoin de convertir le code C/C++ en Strict SysY et de générer des données de test valides pour les compilateurs MIPS.","de":"Ideal für Compiler-Agents, die C/C++-Code in Strict SysY umwandeln und gültige Testdaten für MIPS-Compiler generieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Compiladores que precisam converter código C/C++ em Strict SysY e gerar dados de teste válidos para compiladores MIPS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для компиляторных агентов, которым необходимо преобразовывать код C/C++ в Strict SysY и генерировать действительные тестовые данные для компиляторов MIPS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مترجم الذي يحتاج إلى تحويل رمز سي/سي++ إلى Strict SysY وتوليد بيانات اختبار صالحة لمترجمات MIPS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to adhere to non-negotiable grammar rules and convert standard C/C++ competitive programming code into Strict SysY, generating valid test data and ensuring compatibility with MIPS compilers using implicit prototypes and strict syntax constraints.","zh":"赋予代理遵守严格语法规则的能力，并将标准C/C++竞赛编程代码转换为严格SysY，生成有效测试数据，并确保与MIPS编译器的兼容性，使用隐式原型和严格语法约束。","ja":"エージェントが非交渉の文法ルールに従い、標準のC/C++競技プログラミングコードをStrict SysYに変換し、有効なテストデータを生成し、MIPSコンパイラとの互換性を確保するための暗黙のプロトタイプと厳格な構文制約を使用することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 비토의 가능한 문법 규칙을 준수하고, 표준 C/C++ 경쟁 프로그래밍 코드를 엄격한 SysY로 변환하여, 유효한 테스트 데이터를 생성하고, MIPS 컴파일러와의 호환성을 보장하며, 암시적 프로토타입 및 엄격한 구문 제약을 사용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a adherirse a reglas gramaticales no negociables y convertir código de programación competitiva C/C++ estándar en Strict SysY, generando datos de prueba válidos y asegurando la compatibilidad con los compiladores MIPS utilizando prototipos implícitos y restricciones de sintaxis estrictas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de se conformer à des règles grammaticales non négociables et de convertir le code de programmation compétitive C/C++ standard en Strict SysY, en générant des données de test valides et en assurant la compatibilité avec les compilateurs MIPS en utilisant des prototypes implicites et des contraintes de syntaxe strictes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, sich an nicht verhandelbare Grammatikregeln zu halten und Standard-C/C++-Wettbewerbscode in Strict SysY umzuwandeln, gültige Testdaten zu generieren und die Kompatibilität mit MIPS-Compilern unter Verwendung von impliziten Prototypen und strengen Syntaxbeschränkungen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aderir a regras gramaticais inegociáveis e converter código de programação competitiva padrão C/C++ em Strict SysY, gerando dados de teste válidos e garantindo compatibilidade com compiladores MIPS usando protótipos implícitos e restrições de sintaxe rigorosas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью следовать неоспоримым грамматическим правилам и преобразовывать стандартный конкурентный код C/C++ в Strict SysY, генерируя действительные тестовые данные и обеспечивая совместимость с компиляторами MIPS с помощью неявных прототипов и строгих синтаксических ограничений.","ar":"يمكن العميل من الالتزام بقواعد النحو الغير قابلة للتفاوض وتحويل رمز البرمجة التنافسي القياسي سي/سي++ إلى Strict SysY ، وتوليد بيانات اختبار صالحة وضمان التوافق مع مترجمات MIPS باستخدام البروتوكولات الضمنية والقيود الصارمة للنحو."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting C/C++ code into Strict SysY for MIPS compiler testing","Generating valid test data for SysY to MIPS compiler validation","Debugging SysY code for compatibility with MIPS compilers","Refactoring C/C++ code to adhere to Strict SysY grammar rules"],"zh":["将C/C++代码转换为严格SysY以进行MIPS编译器测试","为SysY到MIPS编译器验证生成有效测试数据","调试SysY代码以确保与MIPS编译器的兼容性","重构C/C++代码以遵守严格SysY语法规则"],"ja":["MIPSコンパイラのテスト用にC/C++コードをStrict SysYに変換する","SysYからMIPSコンパイラの検証用に有効なテストデータを生成する","MIPSコンパイラとの互換性を確保するためにSysYコードをデバッグする","Strict SysYの文法ルールに従うためにC/C++コードをリファクタリングする"],"ko":["MIPS 컴파일러 테스트를 위한 C/C++ 코드를 엄격한 SysY로 변환","SysY에서 MIPS 컴파일러로의 유효성 검증을 위한 테스트 데이터 생성","MIPS 컴파일러와의 호환성을 보장하기 위한 SysY 코드 디버깅","엄격한 SysY 문법 규칙을 준수하기 위한 C/C++ 코드 리팩토링"],"es":["Conversión de código C/C++ en Strict SysY para pruebas de compilador MIPS","Generación de datos de prueba válidos para la validación del compilador SysY a MIPS","Depuración de código SysY para la compatibilidad con los compiladores MIPS","Reestructuración de código C/C++ para adherirse a las reglas gramaticales de Strict SysY"],"fr":["Conversion de code C/C++ en Strict SysY pour les tests de compilateur MIPS","Génération de données de test valides pour la validation du compilateur SysY à MIPS","Débogage de code SysY pour la compatibilité avec les compilateurs MIPS","Réorganisation de code C/C++ pour se conformer aux règles grammaticales de Strict SysY"],"de":["Umwandlung von C/C++-Code in Strict SysY für MIPS-Compiler-Tests","Generierung gültiger Testdaten für die Validierung des SysY-zu-MIPS-Compilers","Fehlersuche in SysY-Code für die Kompatibilität mit MIPS-Compilern","Neustrukturierung von C/C++-Code, um den Grammatikregeln von Strict SysY zu entsprechen"],"pt":["Conversão de código C/C++ em Strict SysY para teste de compilador MIPS","Geração de dados de teste válidos para validação do compilador SysY para MIPS","Depuração de código SysY para compatibilidade com compiladores MIPS","Reestruturação de código C/C++ para atender às regras gramaticais de Strict SysY"],"ru":["Преобразование кода C/C++ в Strict SysY для тестирования компилятора MIPS","Генерация действительных тестовых данных для проверки компилятора SysY для MIPS","Отладка кода SysY для совместимости с компиляторами MIPS","Рефакторинг кода C/C++ для соблюдения грамматических правил Strict SysY"],"ar":["تحويل رمز سي/سي++ إلى Strict SysY لاختبار مترجم MIPS","توليد بيانات اختبار صالحة لمصادقة مترجم SysY إلى MIPS","تصحيح رمز SysY للتوافق مع مترجمات MIPS","إعادة بناء رمز سي/سي++ لخضوعه لقواعد النحو الصارمة Strict SysY"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to SysY language grammar rules","Limited to converting C/C++ code into Strict SysY","Implicit prototypes must be used"],"zh":["需要严格遵守SysY语言语法规则","仅限于将C/C++代码转换为严格SysY","必须使用隐式原型"],"ja":["SysY言語の文法ルールに厳格に従う必要がある","C/C++コードをStrict SysYに変換することのみに限定される","暗黙のプロトタイプを使用する必要がある"],"ko":["엄격한 SysY 언어 문법 규칙을 준수해야 함","C/C++ 코드를 엄격한 SysY로 변환하는 것만 가능","암시적 프로토타입을 사용해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una adhesión estricta a las reglas gramaticales del lenguaje SysY","Limitado a la conversión de código C/C++ en Strict SysY","Deben utilizarse prototipos implícitos"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte aux règles grammaticales du langage SysY","Limité à la conversion de code C/C++ en Strict SysY","Des prototypes implicites doivent être utilisés"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung der Grammatikregeln der Sprache SysY","Begrenzt auf die Umwandlung von C/C++-Code in Strict SysY","Implizite Prototypen müssen verwendet werden"],"pt":["Exige adesão rigorosa às regras gramaticais da linguagem SysY","Limitado à conversão de código C/C++ em Strict SysY","Devem ser usados protótipos implícitos"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения грамматических правил языка SysY","Ограничен преобразованием кода C/C++ в Strict SysY","Необходимо использовать неявные прототипы"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام الصارم بقواعد النحو للغة SysY","محدود بتحويل رمز سي/سي++ إلى Strict SysY","يجب استخدام البروتوكولات الضمنية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('duplojs/utils/writeJsDoc', 'community', 'duplojs', 'utils', 'duplojs/utils', 'writeJsDoc', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:42:43.014Z', NULL, '{"id":"duplojs/utils/writeJsDoc","name":"writeJsDoc","description":{"zh":"writeJsDoc DuploJS @duplojs/utils, TypeScript","ja":"writeJsDoc DuploJS @duplojs/utils, TypeScript","ko":"writeJsDoc DuploJS @duplojs/utils, TypeScript","es":"writeJsDoc es una herramienta para crear documentación JSDoc para proyectos TypeScript, enfocada en una buena experiencia del desarrollador y tipos fuertes","fr":"writeJsDoc est un outil pour créer une documentation JSDoc pour les projets TypeScript, axé sur une bonne expérience du développeur et des types forts","de":"writeJsDoc ist ein Tool zur Erstellung von JSDoc-Dokumentationen für TypeScript-Projekte, mit Fokus auf eine gute Entwicklererfahrung und starke Typen","pt":"A ferramenta writeJsDoc é utilizada para criar documentação JSDoc para projetos JavaScript, com foco em tipagem forte e DX","ru":"Инструмент writeJsDoc используется для создания документации JSDoc для проектов JavaScript, с фокусом на сильной типизации и DX","ar":"تُستخدم أداة writeJsDoc لإنشاء وثائق JSDoc لمشاريع الجافا سكريبت، مع التركيز على التدوين القوي و DX","en":"@duplojs/utils is the TypeScript utility toolbox used across the DuploJS ecosystem. It focuses on strong typing, good DX, and small composable primitives that scale from simple helpers to full validation pipelines."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"writeJsDoc: DuploJS ","ja":"writeJsDoc: DuploJS","ko":"writeJsDoc: DuploJS ","es":"Escribe documentación JSDoc con writeJsDoc","fr":"Écrivez la documentation JSDoc avec writeJsDoc","de":"Schreiben Sie JSDoc-Dokumentation mit writeJsDoc","pt":"writeJsDoc: Ferramenta de Documentação JavaScript","ru":"writeJsDoc: Инструмент для создания документации Ja