,"Fehler und Ausfälle reduzieren","Benutzererfahrung verbessern","Entwicklungsprozess effizienter gestalten"],"pt":["Escolha a camada de teste certa","Torne o aplicativo observável","Elimine a não determinismo","Maximize o sinal e minimize o ruído","Cubra riscos do usuário","Faça com que as falhas sejam ações"],"ru":["Выберите правильный уровень тестирования","Сделайте приложение наблюдаемым","Исключите неопределенность","Максимально увеличьте сигнал и минимизируйте шум","Покройте риски пользователя","Сделайте так, чтобы неудачи были(actionable)"],"ar":["اختر طبقة الاختبار الصحيحة","اجعل التطبيق قابلا للملاحظة","إزالة عدم التحديد","امكسيمم الإشارة وتقليل الضوضاء","غط ريسك المستخدم","اجعل الأخطاء قابلة للتنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端测试","可靠性测试","快速交付","测试层","非确定性","测试效率"],"ja":["フロントエンドテスト","信頼性テスト","迅速なデリバリー","テスト層","非決定性","テスト効率"],"ko":["프론트엔드 테스팅","신뢰성 테스팅","빠른 배포","테스트 레이어","비결정성","테스트 효율성"],"es":["pruebas frontend","test frontend","desarrollo de aplicaciones","seguridad de la aplicación","confiabilidad del código","pruebas de interfaz de usuario","desarrollo de software","pruebas automatizadas","pruebas de seguridad"],"fr":["test frontend","développement d''applications","sécurité de l''application","fiabilité du code","tests d''interface utilisateur","développement de logiciels","tests automatisés","tests de sécurité"],"de":["Frontend-Tests","Anwendungsentwicklung","Sicherheit der Anwendung","Zuverlässigkeit des Codes","Benutzeroberflächen-Tests","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierte Tests","Sicherheitstests"],"pt":["testes frontend","confiança rápida","refatoração segura","falhas minimizadas","risco do usuário","teste de unidade","teste de integração","teste de sistema"],"ru":["фронтенд-тестирование","быстрая конфиденциальность","безопасная рефакторинг","минимизированные неудачи","риск пользователя","юнит-тестирование","интеграционное тестирование","системное тестирование"],"ar":["اختبار الواجهة الأمامية","ثقة سريعة","إعادة هيكلة آمنة","أخطاء مقلصة","خطر المستخدم","اختبار الوحدة","اختبار التكامل","اختبار النظام"]}},"owner":"chongdashu","repo":"phaserjs-tinyswords","repoPath":"chongdashu/phaserjs-tinyswords","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-testing","description":"Plan, implement, and debug frontend tests: unit/integration/E2E/visual/a11y. Use for Playwright/Cypress/Vitest/Jest/RTL, flaky test triage, CI stabilization, and canvas/WebGL games (Phaser) needing deterministic input + screenshot/state assertions.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Testing\n\nUnlock reliable confidence fast: enable safe refactors by choosing the right test layer, making the app observable, and eliminating nondeterminism so failures are actionable.\n\n## Philosophy: Confidence Per Minute\n\nFrontend tests fail for two reasons: the product is broken, or the test is lying. Your job is to maximize signal and minimize “test is lying”.\n\n**Before writing a test, ask**:\n- What user risk am I covering (money, progression, auth, data loss, “can’t start” crashes","body":"# Frontend Testing\n\nUnlock reliable confidence fast: enable safe refactors by choosing the right test layer, making the app observable, and eliminating nondeterminism so failures are actionable.\n\n## Philosophy: Confidence Per Minute\n\nFrontend tests fail for two reasons: the product is broken, or the test is lying. Your job is to maximize signal and minimize “test is lying”.\n\n**Before writing a test, ask**:\n- What user risk am I covering (money, progression, auth, data loss, “can’t start” crashes)?\n- What’s the narrowest layer that catches this bug class (pure logic vs UI vs full browser)?\n- What nondeterminism exists (time, RNG, async loading, network, animations, fonts, GPU)?\n- What “ready” signal can I wait on besides `setTimeout`?\n- What should a failure print/screenshot so it’s diagnosable in CI?\n\n**Core principles**:\n1. **Test the contract, not the implementation**: assert stable user-meaningful outcomes and public seams.\n2. **Prefer determinism over retries**: make time/RNG/network controllable; remove flake at the source.\n3. **Observe like a debugger**: console errors, network failures, screenshots, and state dumps on failure.\n4. **One critical flow first**: a reliable smoke test beats 50 flaky tests.\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\nPick the test type by the cheapest layer that provides the needed confidence:\n\n- **Unit tests** (fastest): pure functions, reducers, validators, math, pathfinding, deterministic simulation steps.\n- **Component/integration tests** (medium): UI behavior with mocked IO (React Testing Library / Vue Testing Library / Testing Library DOM).\n- **E2E tests** (slowest, highest confidence): critical user flows across routing, storage, real bundling/runtime.\n- **Visual regression** (specialized): layout/pixel regressions; for canvas/WebGL, only after locking determinism.\n- **A11y checks**: great for DOM UIs; limited value for pure canvas unless you expose accessible DOM overlays.\n\n## Quick Start (Any Project)\n\n1. **Define 1 smoke flow**: “page loads → user can start → one key action works”.\n2. **Choose runner**:\n   - Prefer **Playwright** for browser E2E + screenshots.\n   - Prefer **Testing Library** for DOM component behavior.\n   - Prefer **unit tests** for logic you can run without a browser.\n3. **Add a “ready” signal** in the app (DOM marker, window flag, or game event) and wait on that.\n4. **Fail loudly**: treat console errors and failed requests as test failures.\n5. **Stabilize**: seed RNG, freeze time, fix viewport/DPR, disable animations, and remove network variability.\n\n## Playwright Patterns (Especially Useful For Games)\n\nUse Playwright when you need “real browser” confidence:\n- Drive input via mouse/keyboard/touch; treat the canvas like the user does.\n- Add a **test seam**: expose a small, stable test API on `window` (read-only state + a few commands).\n- Prefer `waitForFunction`-style readiness over sleep; gate on “scene ready” / “assets loaded” / “first frame rendered”.\n- For screenshots: lock viewport, device scale factor, fonts, and animation timing.\n- For 9-slice / canvas UI regressions: add a dedicated UI harness scene/page and assert via targeted screenshots (see `references/phaser-canvas-testing.md`).\n\nIf using the Playwright MCP tools (browser automation inside Codex), follow the same mindset:\n- Use `browser_console_messages` and `browser_network_requests` to catch silent failures.\n- Use `browser_evaluate` to assert `window.__TEST__` state and to set up deterministic mode.\n- Use `browser_take_screenshot` for visual assertions after determinism is enforced.\n\n## Reconnaissance-Then-Action (Borrowed From Real Debugging)\n\nWhen a UI is dynamic, don’t guess selectors—recon first, then act:\n\nQuick decision guide:\n\n```\nTask → Is it static HTML (no JS runtime needed)?\n  ├─ Yes → read the HTML to find stable selectors/content, then automate\n  └─ No  → treat as dynamic: run the app, wait for readiness, then inspect rendered state\n```\n\n1. **Navigate and wait for readiness**:\n   - For many webapps: wait for a meaningful “loaded” element (preferred).\n   - `networkidle` can help for SPAs, but avoid it if the app uses websockets/polling.\n2. **Capture evidence** (what the user actually sees):\n   - screenshot (full page for DOM; targeted for canvas)\n   - console errors + failed requests\n3. **Discover selectors** from the rendered state:\n   - prefer role/text/label selectors over brittle CSS\n4. **Execute actions** using discovered selectors and re-check state.\n\nCommon pitfall:\n❌ Inspect/interact before the app is ready.\n✅ Wait on an explicit ready signal (DOM marker or `window.__TEST__.ready`), not a sleep.\n\n## Server Lifecycle Helper (Playwright E2E)\n\nWhen the dev server isn’t already running, use the bundled helper as a black box:\n- Run `python scripts/with_server.py --help` first.\n- Start one (or multiple) servers, wait for their ports, then run your test command.\n\nExample:\n```bash\npython scripts/with_server.py --server \"npm run dev\" --port 5173 -- npm test\n```\n\n## Flake Reduction Checklist\n\n- Replace sleeps with explicit readiness conditions.\n- Control time (`Date.now`, timers), RNG, and animation loops.\n- Make network deterministic (mock, record/replay, or run against a seeded local backend).\n- Eliminate “first-run” differences (asset caches, fonts) or warm them explicitly.\n- Lock environment: viewport, DPR, locale/timezone, and rendering settings.\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n❌ **Testing the wrong layer**: E2E tests for pure logic.\nBetter: unit tests for logic; reserve E2E for integration contracts.\n\n❌ **Testing implementation details**: asserting DOM structure/classnames or internal engine objects.\nBetter: assert user-meaningful outputs (text, navigation, score/HP changes) or a small stable test seam.\n\n❌ **Sleep-driven tests**: `wait 2s then click`.\nBetter: wait on explicit readiness (DOM marker, event, `window` flag).\n\n❌ **Uncontrolled randomness**: RNG/time-based behaviors in assertions.\nBetter: seed RNG, freeze time, and assert stable invariants.\n\n❌ **Pixel snapshots without determinism** (especially canvas/WebGL).\nBetter: add deterministic mode first; then screenshot selectively.\n\n❌ **Snapshot explosion**: hundreds of snapshots that no one can interpret.\nBetter: keep snapshots targeted (critical screens); prefer specific assertions for behavior.\n\n❌ **Retries as a strategy**: “just bump retries in CI”.\nBetter: fix readiness and determinism; use retries only as temporary guardrails.\n\n## Variation Guidance (Prevent One-Size-Fits-All)\n\nVary the approach based on:\n- **UI type**: DOM app vs canvas/WebGL game vs hybrid.\n- **Risk**: core revenue/progression flows get E2E first; edge UI polish gets component tests.\n- **CI constraints**: headless-only, limited GPU, slow CPUs, no audio devices.\n- **Test seam availability**: if you can add a stable `window.__TEST__` API, assert state; if not, stick to black-box input/output.\n\n## Remember\n\nYou can make almost any frontend (including canvas/WebGL games) testable by adding a tiny, stable seam for readiness + state. This skill is meant to empower creative, high-signal testing rather than cargo-cult checklists. Aim for tests that are boring to maintain: deterministic, explicit about readiness, and rich in failure evidence. One reliable smoke test is the foundation; everything else compounds from there.\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\nRead these only when needed:\n- `references/playwright-mcp-cheatsheet.md`: patterns for using Playwright MCP tools for assertions, waiting, and diagnostics.\n- `references/phaser-canvas-testing.md`: deterministic mode + hooks for Phaser/canvas/WebGL games.\n- `references/flake-reduction.md`: deeper flake triage and stabilization tactics.\n\nUse these scripts as black boxes (run `--help` first; don’t read source unless you must):\n- `scripts/with_server.py`: start/wait/stop one or more dev servers around a test command.\n- `scripts/imgdiff.py`: lightweight screenshot diff helper (requires `pip install pillow`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:42:36.888Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for QA-focused AI Agents seeking to maximize signal and minimize false positives in frontend testing scenarios.","zh":"非常适合专注于质量保证的AI智能体，旨在最大化前端测试场景中的有效信号并最小化误报。","ja":"QAに焦点を当てたAIエージェントに最適で、フロントエンドテストシナリオにおけるシグナルの最大化と誤検知の最小化を図ります。","ko":"QA에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에 이상적이며, 프론트엔드 테스트 시나리오에서 신호를 극대화하고 오탐지를 최소화합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA con enfoque en QA que buscan maximizar la señal y minimizar los falsos positivos en escenarios de pruebas de frontend.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur les tests QA qui cherchent à maximiser le signal et à minimiser les faux positifs dans les scénarios de test de frontend.","de":"Ideal für QA-fokussierte KI-Agents, die das Signal maximieren und falsche Positivergebnisse in Frontend-Testsszenarien minimieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco em QA que buscam maximizar o sinal e minimizar falsos positivos em cenários de teste de frontend.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на QA, стремящихся максимизировать сигнал и минимизировать ложные положительные результаты в сценариях тестирования frontend.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على اختبار الجودة ويستهدف تعظيم الإشارة وتقليل الإيجابيات الكاذبة في سيناريوهات اختبار واجهة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write reliable frontend tests by choosing the right test layer, making the app observable, and eliminating nondeterminism, ensuring failures are actionable and covering critical user risks such as money, progression, auth, data loss, and crashes.","zh":"通过选择合适的测试层、使应用程序可观测以及消除非确定性，使智能体能够编写可靠的前端测试，确保故障是可操作的，并覆盖关键的用户风险领域，如资金、进度、认证、数据丢失和崩溃。","ja":"適切なテストレイヤーの選択、アプリケーションの観測可能性の確保、非確実性の排除を通じて、エージェントが信頼性の高いフロントエンドテストを作成できるようにし、障害に対処可能であることを保証し、資金、進行状況、認証、データ損失、クラッシュなどの重要なユーザーリスクをカバーします。","ko":"적절한 테스트 계층 선택, 애플리케이션 관측 가능성 확보, 비결정적 요소 제거를 통해 에이전트가 신뢰할 수 있는 프론트엔드 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 지원하며, 결함이 실행 가능하도록 보장하고 금전, 진행 상황, 인증, 데이터 손실 및 충돌과 같은 중요한 사용자 위험을 포괄합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas de frontend confiables eligiendo la capa de prueba adecuada, haciendo que la aplicación sea observable y eliminando la no determinismo, asegurando que los errores sean procesables y cubriendo riesgos críticos del usuario como dinero, progreso, autenticación, pérdida de datos y bloqueos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rédiger des tests de frontend fiables en choisissant la bonne couche de test, en rendant l''application observable et en éliminant la non-déterminisme, garantissant que les défaillances soient exploitables et couvrent des risques critiques pour l''utilisateur tels que l''argent, la progression, l''authentification, la perte de données et les blocages.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, zuverlässige Frontend-Tests zu schreiben, indem sie die richtige Testebene wählen, die Anwendung beobachtbar machen und die Nichtdeterminismus eliminieren, um sicherzustellen, dass Fehler auswertbar sind und kritische Benutzerrisiken wie Geld, Fortschritt, Authentifizierung, Datenverlust und Abstürze abgedeckt sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar testes de frontend confiáveis, escolhendo a camada de teste certa, tornando o aplicativo observável e eliminando a não determinismo, garantindo que as falhas sejam ações e cobrindo riscos críticos do usuário, como dinheiro, progressão, autenticação, perda de dados e falhas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать надежные frontend-тесты, выбирая правильный уровень тестирования, делая приложение наблюдаемым и устраняя недетерминизм, гарантируя, что сбои являются осязаемыми и покрывают критические риски пользователей, такие как деньги, прогресс, аутентификация, потеря данных и сбои.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على كتابة اختبارات واجهة المستخدم الموثوقة عن طريق اختيار طبقة الاختبار الصحيحة وجعل التطبيق مرئيًا وإزالة عدم التحديد، مما يضمن أن الفشل يكون قابلًا للتنفيذ ويتضمن مخاطر المستخدم الحيوية مثل المال والتقدم والتحقق والبيانات المفقودة والانهيارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating frontend test suite development to ensure coverage of user risk areas","Debugging nondeterministic test failures to improve test reliability","Optimizing test layers for maximum confidence per minute in frontend applications"],"zh":["自动化前端测试套件开发，以确保覆盖用户风险区域","调试非确定性的测试失败以提高测试可靠性","优化测试层，以在每分钟内获得对前端应用程序的最大信心"],"ja":["ユーザーリスク領域のカバレッジを確保するためのフロントエンドテストスイート開発の自動化","テストの信頼性を向上させるための非確定的なテスト失敗のデバッグ","フロントエンドアプリケーションにおける分単位の信頼性を最大化するためのテストレイヤーの最適化"],"ko":["사용자 위험 영역의 커버리지를 보장하기 위한 프론트엔드 테스트 스위트 개발 자동화","테스트 신뢰성을 향상시키기 위한 비결정적 테스트 실패 디버깅","프론트엔드 애플리케이션에서 분당 최대 신뢰도를 위한 테스트 계층 최적화"],"es":["Automatización del desarrollo de conjuntos de pruebas de frontend para garantizar la cobertura de áreas de riesgo del usuario","Depuración de fallos de pruebas no deterministas para mejorar la confiabilidad de las pruebas","Optimización de las capas de prueba para obtener la máxima confianza por minuto en aplicaciones de frontend"],"fr":["Automatisation du développement de jeux de tests de frontend pour assurer la couverture des domaines de risque de l''utilisateur","Débogage des défaillances de tests non déterministes pour améliorer la fiabilité des tests","Optimisation des couches de test pour obtenir une confiance maximale par minute dans les applications de frontend"],"de":["Automatisierung der Entwicklung von Frontend-Test-Suiten, um die Abdeckung von Benutzer-Risikobereichen sicherzustellen","Fehlerbehebung nicht deterministischer Testfehler, um die Testzuverlässigkeit zu verbessern","Optimierung der Testebenen für maximale Zuverlässigkeit pro Minute in Frontend-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar o desenvolvimento do conjunto de testes de frontend para garantir a cobertura das áreas de risco do usuário","Depurar falhas de teste não determinísticas para melhorar a confiabilidade do teste","Otimizar as camadas de teste para obter a confiança máxima por minuto em aplicações de frontend"],"ru":["Автоматизировать разработку набора тестов frontend, чтобы гарантировать покрытие областей риска пользователей","Отладить неопределенные сбои тестов, чтобы повысить надежность тестирования","Оптимизировать уровни тестирования, чтобы получить максимальную уверенность в минуту в приложениях frontend"],"ar":["تتمة تطور اختبار واجهة المستخدم تلقائيًا لضمان تغطية مناطق مخاطر المستخدم","تصحيح أخطاء الاختبار غير المحددة لتحسين موثوقية الاختبار","تحسين طبقات الاختبار للحصول على أقصى قدر من الثقة في دقيقة في تطبيقات واجهة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of frontend development principles","Nondeterminism in tests must be addressed for reliable results"],"zh":["需要理解前端开发原则","必须解决测试中的非确定性问题才能获得可靠的结果"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発原則の理解が必要","信頼できる結果を得るには、テスト内の非確実性に対処する必要がある"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 원칙에 대한 이해가 필요함","신뢰할 수 있는 결과를 얻으려면 테스트의 비결정적 요소를 해결해야 함"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de desarrollo de frontend","La no determinismo en las pruebas debe abordarse para obtener resultados confiables"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de développement de frontend","La non-déterminisme dans les tests doit être traitée pour obtenir des résultats fiables"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse der Frontend-Entwicklungsprinzipien","Die Nichtdeterminismus in den Tests muss behoben werden, um zuverlässige Ergebnisse zu erzielen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de desenvolvimento de frontend","A não determinismo nos testes deve ser abordada para obter resultados confiáveis"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов разработки frontend","Недетерминизм в тестах должен быть устранен для получения надежных результатов"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ تطوير واجهة المستخدم","يجب معالجة عدم التحديد في الاختبارات للحصول على نتائج موثوقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('go-go-golems/docmgr/cursor-git-commit', 'community', 'go-go-golems', 'docmgr', 'go-go-golems/docmgr', 'cursor-git-commit', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:43:10.333Z', NULL, '{"id":"go-go-golems/docmgr/cursor-git-commit","name":"cursor-git-commit","description":{"zh":"使用一致的 Git 提交工作流程来提高代码质量","ja":"一貫した Git コミットのワークフローを使用してコードの品質を高める","ko":"일관된 Git 커밋 워크플로를 사용하여 코드 품질을 높입니다","es":"Cursor Git Commit es una herramienta que te ayuda a utilizar un flujo de trabajo de commit consistente, inspeccionando cambios y evitando ruido en tus commits","fr":"Cursor Git Commit est un outil qui vous aide à utiliser un workflow de commit cohérent, en inspectant les modifications et en évitant les erreurs dans vos commits","de":"Cursor Git Commit ist ein Tool, das Ihnen hilft, einen konsistenten Commit-Workflow zu verwenden, indem es Änderungen überprüft und Fehler in Ihren Commits vermeidet","pt":"O Cursor Git Commit é uma ferramenta que ajuda a manter uma rotina de commit consistente, evitando erros comuns no Git","ru":"Cursor Git Commit - это инструмент, который помогает поддерживать последовательную рутину коммитов, избегая распространенных ошибок в Git","ar":"Cursor Git Commit هي أداة تساعد على الحفاظ على روتين للاستحواذ منتظم، وتجنب الأخطاء الشائعة في Git","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git 提交最佳实践","ja":"Git コミットのベストプラクティス","ko":"Git 커밋 최적화","es":"Mejora tus commits con Cursor Git Commit","fr":"Améliorez vos commits avec Cursor Git Commit","de":"Verbessern Sie Ihre Commits mit Cursor Git Commit","pt":"Cursor Git Commit: Melhore Sua Rotina de Commit","ru":"Cursor Git Commit: Улучшите Свою Рутину Коммитов","ar":"Cursor Git Commit: تحسين روتينك للاستحواذ","en":"cursor-git-commit"},"description":{"zh":"使用一致的 Git 提交工作流程来提高代码质量","ja":"一貫した Git コミットのワークフローを使用してコードの品質を高める","ko":"일관된 Git 커밋 워크플로를 사용하여 코드 품질을 높입니다","es":"Cursor Git Commit es una herramienta que te ayuda a utilizar un flujo de trabajo de commit consistente, inspeccionando cambios y evitando ruido en tus commits","fr":"Cursor Git Commit est un outil qui vous aide à utiliser un workflow de commit cohérent, en inspectant les modifications et en évitant les erreurs dans vos co...","de":"Cursor Git Commit ist ein Tool, das Ihnen hilft, einen konsistenten Commit-Workflow zu verwenden, indem es Änderungen überprüft und Fehler in Ihren Commits v...","pt":"O Cursor Git Commit é uma ferramenta que ajuda a manter uma rotina de commit consistente, evitando erros comuns no Git","ru":"Cursor Git Commit - это инструмент, который помогает поддерживать последовательную рутину коммитов, избегая распространенных ошибок в Git","ar":"Cursor Git Commit هي أداة تساعد على الحفاظ على روتين للاستحواذ منتظم، وتجنب الأخطاء الشائعة في Git","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["检查更改","分阶段提交","避免提交噪音","验证已分阶段的文件","记录提交哈希"],"ja":["変更の確認","段階的なコミット","コミットノイズの回避","ステージングされたファイルの検証","コミットハッシュの記録"],"ko":["변경 사항 확인","단계적인 커밋","커밋 노イズ 피하기","스테이징된 파일 확인","커밋 해시 기록"],"es":["Inspección de cambios antes de commit","Revisión de diferencias en archivos","Indexación intencional de archivos","Verificación del conjunto de archivos indexados","Registro de commits con mensaje y hash"],"fr":[" Inspection des modifications avant de commit","Révision des différences dans les fichiers","Indexation intentionnelle des fichiers","Vérification de l''ensemble des fichiers indexés","Enregistrement des commits avec message et hash"],"de":["Überprüfung von Änderungen vor dem Commit","Überprüfung von Differenzen in Dateien","Intentionale Indexierung von Dateien","Überprüfung des Satzes von indexierten Dateien","Aufzeichnung von Commits mit Nachricht und Hash"],"pt":["Inspeção de status","Revisão de diferenças","Estágio intencional de arquivos","Verificação do conjunto de arquivos estágios","Commit e registro de hash"],"ru":["Проверка статуса","Просмотр различий","Намеренное стадирование файлов","Проверка набора стадированных файлов","Коммит и запись хэша"],"ar":["فحص الحالة","استعراض الاختلافات","مرحلة Files متعمدة","التحقق من مجموعة الملفات المضاف","التفويض وتسجيل الهاش"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 提交","代码质量","版本控制","一致的工作流程","提交最佳实践","Git 工具"],"ja":["Git コミット","コード品質","バージョン管理","一貫したワークフロー","コミットベストプラクティス","Git ツール"],"ko":["Git 커밋","코드 품질","버전 관리","일관된 워크플로","커밋 최적화","Git 도구"],"es":["Git","commit","flujo de trabajo","desarrollo de software","herramientas de Git","mejora de commits","gestión de versiones"],"fr":["Git","commit","workflow","développement de logiciels","outils Git","amélioration des commits","gestion de versions"],"de":["Git","commit","Workflow","Software-Entwicklung","Git-Tools","Verbesserung von Commits","Versionierung"],"pt":["git commit","rotina de commit","erro no git","ferramenta de commit","git status","git diff","git add","git commit -m"],"ru":["git commit","рутина коммитов","ошибка в git","инструмент коммита","git status","git diff","git add","git commit -m"],"ar":["git commit","روتين للاستحواذ","خطأ في git","أداة الاستحواذ","git status","git diff","git add","git commit -m"]}},"owner":"go-go-golems","repo":"docmgr","repoPath":"go-go-golems/docmgr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cursor-git-commit","description":"Provide a pre-commit checklist and staging hygiene (review diffs, stage specific files, avoid common noise like dist/ or .env, and fix mistakes with reset/rm --cached/amend). Use when the user is about to commit, asks for a commit workflow, or needs help cleaning up staged files.","bodyPreview":"# Cursor Git Commit\n\n## Overview\n\nUse a consistent commit workflow: inspect changes, stage intentionally, and avoid committing noise.\n\n## Checklist (run before committing)\n\n1. Inspect status: `git status --porcelain`\n2. Review diffs:\n   - unstaged: `git diff --stat`\n   - staged: `git diff --cached --stat`\n3. Stage intentionally: `git add path/to/file ...`\n4. Verify staged set: `git diff --cached --name-only`\n5. Commit and record hash:\n   - `git commit -m \"...\"` then `git rev-parse HEAD`\n\n## Fix","body":"# Cursor Git Commit\n\n## Overview\n\nUse a consistent commit workflow: inspect changes, stage intentionally, and avoid committing noise.\n\n## Checklist (run before committing)\n\n1. Inspect status: `git status --porcelain`\n2. Review diffs:\n   - unstaged: `git diff --stat`\n   - staged: `git diff --cached --stat`\n3. Stage intentionally: `git add path/to/file ...`\n4. Verify staged set: `git diff --cached --name-only`\n5. Commit and record hash:\n   - `git commit -m \"...\"` then `git rev-parse HEAD`\n\n## Fix common mistakes\n- Unstage one file: `git reset HEAD path/to/file`\n- Unstage everything: `git reset HEAD`\n- Remove noise already committed (keep on disk): `git rm --cached path/to/noise` then add to `.gitignore` and `git commit --amend --no-edit`\n\n## Reference\n- Full checklist + ignore guidance: `references/git-commit-instructions.md`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:43:10.333Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise Git workflow management and commit history tracking.","zh":"适用于需要精确 Git 工作流管理和提交历史记录的开发代理。","ja":"Git ワークフロー管理とコミット履歴の追跡が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 Git 워크플ロー 관리와 커밋 기록 추적이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren un manejo preciso del flujo de trabajo de Git y un seguimiento de la historia de commits.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion précise du workflow Git et un suivi de l''historique des commits.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine präzise Git-Workflow-Verwaltung und eine Commit-Historien-Verfolgung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento preciso do fluxo de trabalho do Git e rastreamento do histórico de commits.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих точного управления рабочим процессом Git и отслеживания истории коммитов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب إدارة دقيقة لتدفق العمل Git وتعقب تاريخ الالتزامات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain a clean and intentional commit history by utilizing Git commands such as `git status`, `git diff`, and `git commit`, ensuring a consistent and noise-free workflow through protocols like Git porcelain and staged file management.","zh":"通过使用诸如 `git status`、`git diff` 和 `git commit` 的 Git 命令，赋予代理维护干净和故意的提交历史的能力，确保通过 Git 瓷器和暂存文件管理等协议实现一致和无噪音的工作流程。","ja":"Git コマンド (`git status`、`git diff`、`git commit` など) を使用することで、エージェントにクリーンで意図的なコミット履歴を維持する能力を与え、Git 瓷器やステージングされたファイル管理などのプロトコルを通じて一貫性とノイズのないワークフローを保証します。","ko":"Git 명령(`git status`, `git diff`, `git commit` 등)을 사용함으로써 에이전트가 깨끗하고 의도적인 커밋 기록을 유지할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Git 도자기 및暂存 파일 관리 등의 프로토콜을 통해 일관성과 노이즈가 없는 워크플로를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener un historial de commits limpio e intencional utilizando comandos de Git como `git status`, `git diff` y `git commit`, garantizando un flujo de trabajo consistente y libre de ruido a través de protocolos como Git porcelain y gestión de archivos en espera.","fr":"Habilite les agents à maintenir un historique de commits propre et intentionnel en utilisant des commandes Git telles que `git status`, `git diff` et `git commit`, garantissant un workflow cohérent et sans bruit via des protocoles tels que Git porcelain et la gestion de fichiers en attente.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ein sauberes und intentionales Commit-Verlauf durch die Verwendung von Git-Befehlen wie `git status`, `git diff` und `git commit` zu verwalten, wodurch ein konsistenter und geräuscharmer Workflow durch Protokolle wie Git Porzellan und gestufte Dateiverwaltung gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter um histórico de commits limpo e intencional, utilizando comandos Git como `git status`, `git diff` e `git commit`, garantindo um fluxo de trabalho consistente e livre de ruídos por meio de protocolos como Git porcelain e gerenciamento de arquivos em estágio.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать чистую и намеренную историю коммитов, используя команды Git, такие как `git status`, `git diff` и `git commit`, обеспечивая последовательный и бесперебойный рабочий процесс через протоколы, такие как Git porcelain и управление файлами в стадии.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على تاريخ الالتزامات نظيف ومنهجي من خلال استخدام أوامر Git مثل `git status` و `git diff` و `git commit`، مما يضمن تدفق عمل متسق وخالي من الضوضاء من خلال بروتوكولات مثل Git porcelain وإدارة الملفات المجدولة."},"useCases":{"en":["Inspecting and staging changes for commit","Verifying staged file sets before commit","Recording and tracking commit hashes for version control"],"zh":["检查和暂存更改以提交","验证提交前暂存的文件集","记录和跟踪提交哈希以进行版本控制"],"ja":["変更を検査してコミットするためのステージング","コミット前のステージングされたファイルセットの検証","バージョン管理のためのコミットハッシュの記録と追跡"],"ko":["커밋을 위해 변경 사항을 검사하고暂存하기","커밋 전에暂存된 파일 집합을 검증하기","버전 관리를 위한 커밋 해시의 기록 및 추적"],"es":["Inspeccionar y preparar cambios para el commit","Verificar conjuntos de archivos en espera antes del commit","Grabar y realizar un seguimiento de los hashes de commit para el control de versiones"],"fr":["Inspecter et préparer les modifications pour le commit","Vérifier les ensembles de fichiers en attente avant le commit","Enregistrer et suivre les hachages de commit pour le contrôle de version"],"de":["Änderungen für das Commit überprüfen und vorbereiten","Vorbereitete Dateisätze vor dem Commit überprüfen","Commit-Hashes für die Versionskontrolle aufzeichnen und verfolgen"],"pt":["Inspecionar e preparar alterações para commit","Verificar conjuntos de arquivos em estágio antes do commit","Gravar e rastrear hashes de commit para controle de versão"],"ru":["Осмотр и подготовка изменений для коммита","Проверка наборов файлов в стадии перед коммитом","Запись и отслеживание хэшей коммитов для контроля версий"],"ar":["فحص وتحضير التغييرات للالتزام","تحقق من مجموعات الملفات المجدولة قبل الالتزام","تسجيل وتعقب هاشات الالتزام للتحكم في الإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Command-line interface access needed","Does not support automated commit message generation"],"zh":["需要 Git 安装和配置","需要命令行接口访问","不支持自动提交消息生成"],"ja":["Git のインストールと設定が必要","コマンドラインインターフェイスへのアクセスが必要","自動コミットメッセージ生成はサポートされていない"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요","명령줄 인터페이스 액세스가 필요","자동 커밋 메시지 생성을 지원하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de Git","Se requiere acceso a la interfaz de línea de comandos","No admite la generación automática de mensajes de commit"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","L''accès à l''interface de ligne de commande est nécessaire","N''a pas de prise en charge pour la génération automatique des messages de commit"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von Git","Zugriff auf die Kommandozeilenoberfläche ist erforderlich","Unterstützt keine automatische Generierung von Commit-Mitteilungen"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Git","Acesso à interface de linha de comando é necessário","Não suporta geração automática de mensagens de commit"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Необходим доступ к командной строке","Не поддерживает автоматическую генерацию сообщений коммита"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Git","مطلوب الوصول إلى واجهة سطر الأوامر","لا يدعم توليد رسائل الالتزام تلقائيًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('shoootyou/get-shit-done-multi/gsd-discuss-phase', 'community', 'shoootyou', 'get-shit-done-multi', 'shoootyou/get-shit-done-multi', 'gsd-discuss-phase', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:43:09.939Z', NULL, '{"id":"shoootyou/get-shit-done-multi/gsd-discuss-phase","name":"gsd-discuss-phase","description":{"zh":"gsd-discuss-phase 是一个支持多 CLI 的 Get Shit Done 分支，用于 Claude、Copilot 和 Codex 的规范驱动开发工作流","ja":"gsd-discuss-phase は、Claude、Copilot、Codex 用のマルチ CLI サポートを備えた Get Shit Done のフォークです","ko":"gsd-discuss-phase 는 Claude, Copilot 및 Codex 용 멀티 CLI 지원을 갖춘 Get Shit Done 의 분기입니다","es":"gsd-discuss-phase es una herramienta de desarrollo que ayuda a tomar decisiones informadas a través de un flujo de trabajo específico","fr":"gsd-discuss-phase est un outil de développement qui aide à prendre des décisions éclairées à travers un flux de travail spécifique","de":"gsd-discuss-phase ist ein Entwicklungstool, das bei der Entscheidungsfindung durch einen spezifischen Workflow hilft","pt":"O gsd-discuss-phase é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que ajuda a tomar decisões de implementação com multi-CLI, criando um arquivo CONTEXT.md para guiar a pesquisa e o planejamento.","ru":"gsd-discuss-phase - это инструмент для разработки, который помогает принимать решения об реализации с поддержкой multi-CLI, создавая файл CONTEXT.md для руководства исследований и планирования.","ar":"gsd-discuss-phase هي أداة تطوير تساعد في اتخاذ قرارات التنفيذ مع دعم multi-CLI، وتُنشئ ملف CONTEXT.md لإرشاد البحث والتخطيط.","en":"Fork of Get Shit Done (TÂCHES) with multi-CLI support. Spec-driven development workflows for Claude, Copilot, and Codex with unified project state."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"gsd-discuss-phase 技术解析","ja":"gsd-discuss-phase の技術的分析","ko":"gsd-discuss-phase 기술 분석","es":"gsd-discuss-phase: Flujo de trabajo para desarrollo","fr":"gsd-discuss-phase: Flux de travail pour le développement","de":"gsd-discuss-phase: Workflow für die Entwicklung","pt":"gsd-discuss-phase: Ferramenta de Desenvolvimento","ru":"gsd-discuss-phase: Инструмент для разработки","ar":"gsd-discuss-phase: أداة تطوير","en":"gsd-discuss-phase"},"description":{"zh":"gsd-discuss-phase 是一个支持多 CLI 的 Get Shit Done 分支，用于 Claude、Copilot 和 Codex 的规范驱动开发工作流","ja":"gsd-discuss-phase は、Claude、Copilot、Codex 用のマルチ CLI サポートを備えた Get Shit Done のフォークです","ko":"gsd-discuss-phase 는 Claude, Copilot 및 Codex 용 멀티 CLI 지원을 갖춘 Get Shit Done 의 분기입니다","es":"gsd-discuss-phase es una herramienta de desarrollo que ayuda a tomar decisiones informadas a través de un flujo de trabajo específico","fr":"gsd-discuss-phase est un outil de développement qui aide à prendre des décisions éclairées à travers un flux de travail spécifique","de":"gsd-discuss-phase ist ein Entwicklungstool, das bei der Entscheidungsfindung durch einen spezifischen Workflow hilft","pt":"O gsd-discuss-phase é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que ajuda a tomar decisões de implementação com multi-CLI, criando um arquivo CONTEXT.md para guiar a...","ru":"gsd-discuss-phase - это инструмент для разработки, который помогает принимать решения об реализации с поддержкой multi-CLI, создавая файл CONTEXT.md для руко...","ar":"gsd-discuss-phase هي أداة تطوير تساعد في اتخاذ قرارات التنفيذ مع دعم multi-CLI، وتُنشئ ملف CONTEXT.md لإرشاد البحث والتخطيط.","en":"Fork of Get Shit Done (TÂCHES) with multi-CLI support. Spec-driven development workflows for Claude, Copilot, and Codex with unified project state."},"definition":{"en":"Fork of Get Shit Done (TÂCHES) with multi-CLI support. Spec-driven development workflows for Claude, Copilot, and Codex with unified project state."},"features":{"zh":["支持多 CLI","规范驱动开发工作流","用于 Claude、Copilot 和 Codex","统一项目状态","输出 CONTEXT.md 文件"],"ja":["マルチ CLI サポート","規範駆動開発ワークフロー","Claude、Copilot、Codex 用","統一されたプロジェクト状態","CONTEXT.md ファイルの出力"],"ko":["멀티 CLI 지원","규范 주도 개발 워크플로우","Claude, Copilot 및 Codex 용","통합 프로젝트 상태","CONTEXT.md 파일 출력"],"es":["Análisis de fases para identificar áreas grises","Presentación de áreas grises para selección del usuario","Análisis en profundidad de cada área seleccionada","Creación de un archivo CONTEXT.md con decisiones claras","Compatibilidad con múltiples CLI"],"fr":["Analyse de phases pour identifier les zones grises","Présentation des zones grises pour sélection utilisateur","Analyse approfondie de chaque zone sélectionnée","Création d''un fichier CONTEXT.md avec des décisions claires","Compatibilité avec plusieurs CLI"],"de":["Analyse von Phasen zur Identifizierung von Grauzonen","Präsentation von Grauzonen für die Benutzerauswahl","Tiefenanalyse jeder ausgewählten Zone","Erstellung einer CONTEXT.md-Datei mit klaren Entscheidungen","Kompatibilität mit mehreren CLI"],"pt":["Suporte a multi-CLI","Criação de arquivo CONTEXT.md","Identificação de áreas cinzentas","Discussão de áreas selecionadas","Tomada de decisões de implementação"],"ru":["Поддержка multi-CLI","Создание файла CONTEXT.md","Определение серых зон","Обсуждение выбранных областей","Принятие решений об реализации"],"ar":["دعم multi-CLI","إنشاء ملف CONTEXT.md","تحديد المناطق الرمادية","مناقشة المناطق المحددة","اتخاذ قرارات التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["gsd-discuss-phase","Get Shit Done","多 CLI","规范驱动开发","Claude","Copilot","Codex","开发工作流"],"ja":["gsd-discuss-phase","Get Shit Done","マルチ CLI","規範駆動開発","Claude","Copilot","Codex","開発ワークフロー"],"ko":["gsd-discuss-phase","Get Shit Done","멀티 CLI","규范 주도 개발","Claude","Copilot","Codex","개발 워크플로우"],"es":["desarrollo de software","flujo de trabajo","herramienta de desarrollo","decisión informada","análisis de fases","compatibilidad con CLI","desarrollo ágil","gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","flux de travail","outil de développement","décision éclairée","analyse de phases","compatibilité avec CLI","développement agile","gestion de projets"],"de":["Software-Entwicklung","Workflow","Entwicklungstool","fundierte Entscheidung","Phasenanalyse","Kompatibilität mit CLI","agiles Entwicklung","Projektmanagement"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","multi-CLI","CONTEXT.md","tomada de decisões","implementação de software"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты для разработки","multi-CLI","CONTEXT.md","принятие решений","реализация программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","multi-CLI","CONTEXT.md","اتخاذ القرارات","تنفيذ البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"shoootyou","repo":"get-shit-done-multi","repoPath":"shoootyou/get-shit-done-multi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gsd-discuss-phase","description":"Gather phase context through adaptive questioning before planning","bodyPreview":"<objective>\nExtract implementation decisions that downstream agents need — researcher and planner will use CONTEXT.md to know what to investigate and what choices are locked.\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Analyze the phase to identify gray areas (UI, UX, behavior, etc.)\n2. Present gray areas — user selects which to discuss\n3. Deep-dive each selected area until satisfied\n4. Create CONTEXT.md with decisions that guide research and planning\n\n**Output:** `{phase}-CONTEXT.md` — decisions clear enough that do","body":"<objective>\nExtract implementation decisions that downstream agents need — researcher and planner will use CONTEXT.md to know what to investigate and what choices are locked.\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Analyze the phase to identify gray areas (UI, UX, behavior, etc.)\n2. Present gray areas — user selects which to discuss\n3. Deep-dive each selected area until satisfied\n4. Create CONTEXT.md with decisions that guide research and planning\n\n**Output:** `{phase}-CONTEXT.md` — decisions clear enough that downstream agents can act without asking the user again\n</objective>\n\n<execution_context>\n@.codex/get-shit-done/workflows/discuss-phase.md\n@.codex/get-shit-done/templates/context.md\n</execution_context>\n\n<context>\nPhase number: $ARGUMENTS (required)\n\n**Load project state:**\n@.planning/STATE.md\n\n**Load roadmap:**\n@.planning/ROADMAP.md\n</context>\n\n<process>\n1. Validate phase number (error if missing or not in roadmap)\n2. Check if CONTEXT.md exists (offer update/view/skip if yes)\n3. **Analyze phase** — Identify domain and generate phase-specific gray areas\n4. **Present gray areas** — Multi-select: which to discuss? (NO skip option)\n5. **Deep-dive each area** — 4 questions per area, then offer more/next\n6. **Write CONTEXT.md** — Sections match areas discussed\n7. Offer next steps (research or plan)\n\n**CRITICAL: Scope guardrail**\n- Phase boundary from ROADMAP.md is FIXED\n- Discussion clarifies HOW to implement, not WHETHER to add more\n- If user suggests new capabilities: \"That''s its own phase. I''ll note it for later.\"\n- Capture deferred ideas — don''t lose them, don''t act on them\n\n**Domain-aware gray areas:**\nGray areas depend on what''s being built. Analyze the phase goal:\n- Something users SEE → layout, density, interactions, states\n- Something users CALL → responses, errors, auth, versioning\n- Something users RUN → output format, flags, modes, error handling\n- Something users READ → structure, tone, depth, flow\n- Something being ORGANIZED → criteria, grouping, naming, exceptions\n\nGenerate 3-4 **phase-specific** gray areas, not generic categories.\n\n**Probing depth:**\n- Ask 4 questions per area before checking\n- \"More questions about [area], or move to next?\"\n- If more → ask 4 more, check again\n- After all areas → \"Ready to create context?\"\n\n**Do NOT ask about (Claude handles these):**\n- Technical implementation\n- Architecture choices\n- Performance concerns\n- Scope expansion\n</process>\n\n<success_criteria>\n- Gray areas identified through intelligent analysis\n- User chose which areas to discuss\n- Each selected area explored until satisfied\n- Scope creep redirected to deferred ideas\n- CONTEXT.md captures decisions, not vague vision\n- User knows next steps\n</success_criteria>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:43:09.939Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents requiring structured spec-driven development workflows with multi-CLI support for Claude, Copilot, and Codex.","zh":"适用于需要结构化规格驱动开发工作流的开发人员代理，并支持多个CLI，包括Claude、Copilot和Codex。","ja":"Claude、Copilot、Codex 向けのマルチ CLI サポートを備えた構造化された仕様駆動型開発ワークフローを必要とする開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 사양 기반 개발 워크플로우와 Claude, Copilot, Codex를 위한 멀티 CLI 지원이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren flujos de trabajo de desarrollo basados en especificaciones estructuradas con soporte multi-CLI para Claude, Copilot y Codex.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des flux de travail de développement basés sur des spécifications structurées avec un support multi-CLI pour Claude, Copilot et Codex.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsagenten, die strukturierte spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklungswerkflüsse mit Multi-CLI-Unterstützung für Claude, Copilot und Codex erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedores que exigem fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento direcionados por especificações estruturadas com suporte a múltiplos CLI para Claude, Copilot e Codex.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, требующих структурированных рабочих процессов разработки, управляемых спецификациями, с поддержкой нескольких CLI для Claude, Copilot и Codex.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يتطلب سير عمل تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات الهيكلية مع دعم CLI متعددة لكلود، كوبيلوت وكودكس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create unified project states by extracting implementation decisions and generating CONTEXT.md files, utilizing spec-driven development and multi-CLI support for guided research and planning, while leveraging Markdown file formats like CONTEXT.md.","zh":"赋予代理创建统一项目状态的能力，通过提取实现决策和生成CONTEXT.md文件，利用规格驱动开发和多CLI支持进行指导研究和规划，同时利用Markdown文件格式，如CONTEXT.md。","ja":"実装の決定を抽出し、CONTEXT.md ファイルを生成することで、エージェントが統一されたプロジェクト状態を作成できるようにします。仕様駆動型開発とマルチ CLI サポートを利用したガイド付きの研究と計画を行い、CONTEXT.md のような Markdown ファイル形式を活用します。","ko":"구현 결정과 CONTEXT.md 파일을 생성하여 에이전트가 통일된 프로젝트 상태를 만들 수 있도록 합니다. 사양 기반 개발과 멀티 CLI 지원을 사용하여 가이드 연구와 계획을 수행하며 CONTEXT.md와 같은 마크다운 파일 형식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear estados de proyecto unificados extrayendo decisiones de implementación y generando archivos CONTEXT.md, utilizando el desarrollo basado en especificaciones y el soporte multi-CLI para la investigación y la planificación guiadas, aprovechando formatos de archivo Markdown como CONTEXT.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des états de projet unifiés en extrayant les décisions d''implémentation et en générant des fichiers CONTEXT.md, en utilisant le développement basé sur des spécifications et le support multi-CLI pour la recherche et la planification guidées, en exploitant les formats de fichiers Markdown tels que CONTEXT.md.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, einheitliche Projektzustände zu erstellen, indem Implementierungsentscheidungen extrahiert und CONTEXT.md-Dateien generiert werden, unter Verwendung von spezifikationsgetriebener Entwicklung und Multi-CLI-Unterstützung für geleitete Forschung und Planung, wobei Markdown-Dateiformate wie CONTEXT.md genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem estados de projeto unificados, extrair decisões de implementação e gerar arquivos CONTEXT.md, utilizando desenvolvimento direcionado por especificações e suporte a múltiplos CLI para pesquisa e planejamento orientados, aproveitando formatos de arquivo Markdown como CONTEXT.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать унифицированные состояния проекта, извлекать решения по реализации и генерировать файлы CONTEXT.md, используя разработку, управляемую спецификациями, и поддержку нескольких CLI для руководства исследованиями и планированием, используя форматы файлов Markdown, такие как CONTEXT.md.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إنشاء حالات مشروع موحدة من خلال استخراج قرارات التنفيذ وتوليد ملفات CONTEXT.md، باستخدام التطوير المدفوع بالمواصفات ودعم CLI المتعددة للبحث والتخطيط الموجه، مع الاستفادة من تنسيقات الملفات Markdown مثل CONTEXT.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating decision documentation for researcher and planner agents","Generating CONTEXT.md files for unified project states","Streamlining spec-driven development workflows for multiple CLIs"],"zh":["为研究人员和规划代理自动记录决策文档","为统一项目状态生成CONTEXT.md文件","为多个CLI优化规格驱动开发工作流"],"ja":["研究者およびプランナー エージェントのための意思決定文書の自動化","統一されたプロジェクト状態のためのCONTEXT.mdファイルの生成","複数のCLIのための仕様駆動型開発ワークフローの最適化"],"ko":["연구자 및 계획 에이전트를 위한 의사 결정 문서 자동화","통일된 프로젝트 상태를 위한 CONTEXT.md 파일 생성","여러 CLI를 위한 사양 기반 개발 워크플로우 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de la documentación de decisiones para agentes de investigación y planificación","Generación de archivos CONTEXT.md para estados de proyecto unificados","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo basados en especificaciones para varios CLI"],"fr":["Automatisation de la documentation des décisions pour les agents de recherche et de planification","Génération de fichiers CONTEXT.md pour des états de projet unifiés","Optimisation des flux de travail de développement basés sur des spécifications pour plusieurs CLI"],"de":["Automatisierung der Entscheidungsdokumentation für Forschungs- und Planungsagenten","Generierung von CONTEXT.md-Dateien für einheitliche Projektzustände","Optimierung von spezifikationsgetriebenen Entwicklungswerkflüssen für mehrere CLI"],"pt":["Automatizar a documentação de decisões para agentes de pesquisador e planejador","Gerar arquivos CONTEXT.md para estados de projeto unificados","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento direcionados por especificações para vários CLI"],"ru":["Автоматизировать документацию решений для агентов-исследователей и планировщиков","Генерировать файлы CONTEXT.md для унифицированных состояний проекта","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы разработки, управляемые спецификациями, для нескольких CLI"],"ar":["تحسين توثيق القرارات لعميل الباحث والمخطط","توليد ملفات CONTEXT.md لتحقيق حالات مشروع موحدة","تبسيط سير عمل التطوير المدفوع بالمواصفات للعديد من CLI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Markdown file access for CONTEXT.md generation","Limited to spec-driven development workflows for Claude, Copilot, and Codex"],"zh":["需要Markdown文件访问权限以生成CONTEXT.md","仅限于Claude、Copilot和Codex的规格驱动开发工作流"],"ja":["CONTEXT.mdの生成にはMarkdownファイルへのアクセスが必要","Claude、Copilot、Codexの仕様駆動型開発ワークフローに限定"],"ko":["CONTEXT.md 생성을 위해 마크다운 파일 액세스가 필요","Claude, Copilot, Codex의 사양 기반 개발 워크플로우에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos Markdown para la generación de CONTEXT.md","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de desarrollo basados en especificaciones para Claude, Copilot y Codex"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers Markdown pour la génération de CONTEXT.md","Limité aux flux de travail de développement basés sur des spécifications pour Claude, Copilot et Codex"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Markdown-Dateien für die Generierung von CONTEXT.md","Begrenzt auf spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklungswerkflüsse für Claude, Copilot und Codex"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos Markdown para geração de CONTEXT.md","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento direcionados por especificações para Claude, Copilot e Codex"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам Markdown для генерации CONTEXT.md","Ограничен рабочими процессами разработки, управляемыми спецификациями, для Claude, Copilot и Codex"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات Markdown لتوليد CONTEXT.md","محدود بسير عمل التطوير المدفوع بالمواصفات لكلود، كوبيلوت وكودكس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
