,"ja":"Laravel Fortifyは、認証ルーティングとコントローラーを提供するヘッドレス認証バックエンドです","ko":"Laravel Fortify는 인증 라우팅 및 컨트롤러를 제공하는 헤드리스 인증 백엔드입니다","es":"Fortify es un backend de autenticación headless para aplicaciones Laravel, proporcionando rutas y controladores de autenticación","fr":"Fortify est un backend d''authentification headless pour les applications Laravel, fournissant des routes et des contrôleurs d''authentification","de":"Fortify ist ein headless Authentifizierungs-Backend für Laravel-Anwendungen, das Authentifizierungsrouten und -Controller bereitstellt","pt":"Laravel Fortify é um backend de autenticação headless que fornece rotas e controladores de autenticação para aplicações Laravel.","ru":"Laravel Fortify — это головной бэкенд аутентификации, который предоставляет маршруты и контроллеры аутентификации для приложений Laravel.","ar":"لارافيل فورتيفي هو خلفية مصححة راسية توفر مسارات ومراقبة مصححة لتطبيقات لارافيل.","en":"A personal assistant and RAG service showcasing Laravel AI SDK."},"definition":{"en":"A personal assistant and RAG service showcasing Laravel AI SDK."},"features":{"zh":["提供身份验证路由和控制器","支持自定义业务逻辑","简化Laravel应用程序的开发","提供可定制的用户创建和密码验证","支持多种认证方式"],"ja":["認証ルーティングとコントローラーを提供する","カスタムビジネスロジックをサポートする","Laravelアプリケーションの開発を簡素化する","カスタマイズ可能なユーザー作成とパスワードバリデーションを提供する","多種多様な認証方式をサポートする"],"ko":["인증 라우팅 및 컨트롤러를 제공","사용자 정의 비즈니스 로직을 지원","Laravel 애플리케이션 개발을 단순화","사용자 정의 가능한 사용자 생성 및 패스워드 유효성 검사를 제공","다양한 인증 방법을 지원"],"es":["Rutas de autenticación personalizables","Controladores de autenticación para Laravel","Lógica de negocio personalizable","Integración con Laravel AI SDK","Documentación detallada y guías de uso"],"fr":["Routes d''authentification personnalisables","Contrôleurs d''authentification pour Laravel","Logique métier personnalisable","Intégration avec Laravel AI SDK","Documentation détaillée et guides d''utilisation"],"de":["Anpassbare Authentifizierungsrouten","Authentifizierungscontroller für Laravel","Anpassbare Geschäftslogik","Integration mit Laravel AI SDK","Detaillierte Dokumentation und Anleitungen"],"pt":["Roteamento de autenticação","Controladores de autenticação","Lógica de negócios personalizável","Validação de senha","Criação de usuário"],"ru":["Маршрутизация аутентификации","Контроллеры аутентификации","Пользовательская логика бизнеса","Валидация пароля","Создание пользователя"],"ar":["مسارات مصححة","مراقبة مصححة","منطق عمل قابل للتعديل","تحقق كلمة المرور","إنشاء مستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Laravel Fortify","身份验证后端","Laravel应用程序","认证路由","控制器","自定义业务逻辑","用户创建","密码验证"],"ja":["Laravel Fortify","認証バックエンド","Laravelアプリケーション","認証ルーティング","コントローラー","カスタムビジネスロジック","ユーザー作成","パスワードバリデーション"],"ko":["Laravel Fortify","인증 백엔드","Laravel 애플리케이션","인증 라우팅","컨트롤러","사용자 정의 비즈니스 로직","사용자 생성","패스워드 유효성 검사"],"es":["Fortify","Laravel","autenticación","headless","backend","desarrollo web","Laravel AI SDK","rutas de autenticación","controladores de autenticación"],"fr":["Fortify","Laravel","authentification","headless","backend","développement web","Laravel AI SDK","routes d''authentification","contrôleurs d''authentification"],"de":["Fortify","Laravel","Authentifizierung","headless","Backend","Webentwicklung","Laravel AI SDK","Authentifizierungsrouten","Authentifizierungscontroller"],"pt":["Laravel Fortify","autenticação headless","rotas de autenticação","controladores de autenticação","desenvolvimento de aplicações","Laravel"],"ru":["Laravel Fortify","головной бэкенд аутентификации","маршруты аутентификации","контроллеры аутентификации","разработка приложений","Laravel"],"ar":["لارافيل فورتيفي","خلفية مصححة راسية","مسارات مصححة","مراقبة مصححة","تطوير التطبيقات","لارافيل"]}},"owner":"joshcirre","repo":"larrykonn","repoPath":"joshcirre/larrykonn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"developing-with-fortify","description":"Laravel Fortify headless authentication backend development. Activate when implementing authentication features including login, registration, password reset, email verification, two-factor authentication (2FA/TOTP), profile updates, headless auth, authentication scaffolding, or auth guards in Laravel applications.","bodyPreview":"# Laravel Fortify Development\n\nFortify is a headless authentication backend that provides authentication routes and controllers for Laravel applications.\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Laravel Fortify patterns and documentation.\n\n## Usage\n\n- **Routes**: Use `list-routes` with `only_vendor: true` and `action: \"Fortify\"` to see all registered endpoints\n- **Actions**: Check `app/Actions/Fortify/` for customizable business logic (user creation, password validation, etc.)\n- **Confi","body":"# Laravel Fortify Development\n\nFortify is a headless authentication backend that provides authentication routes and controllers for Laravel applications.\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Laravel Fortify patterns and documentation.\n\n## Usage\n\n- **Routes**: Use `list-routes` with `only_vendor: true` and `action: \"Fortify\"` to see all registered endpoints\n- **Actions**: Check `app/Actions/Fortify/` for customizable business logic (user creation, password validation, etc.)\n- **Config**: See `config/fortify.php` for all options including features, guards, rate limiters, and username field\n- **Contracts**: Look in `Laravel\\Fortify\\Contracts\\` for overridable response classes (`LoginResponse`, `LogoutResponse`, etc.)\n- **Views**: All view callbacks are set in `FortifyServiceProvider::boot()` using `Fortify::loginView()`, `Fortify::registerView()`, etc.\n\n## Available Features\n\nEnable in `config/fortify.php` features array:\n\n- `Features::registration()` - User registration\n- `Features::resetPasswords()` - Password reset via email\n- `Features::emailVerification()` - Requires User to implement `MustVerifyEmail`\n- `Features::updateProfileInformation()` - Profile updates\n- `Features::updatePasswords()` - Password changes\n- `Features::twoFactorAuthentication()` - 2FA with QR codes and recovery codes\n\n> Use `search-docs` for feature configuration options and customization patterns.\n\n## Setup Workflows\n\n### Two-Factor Authentication Setup\n\n```\n- [ ] Add TwoFactorAuthenticatable trait to User model\n- [ ] Enable feature in config/fortify.php\n- [ ] Run migrations for 2FA columns\n- [ ] Set up view callbacks in FortifyServiceProvider\n- [ ] Create 2FA management UI\n- [ ] Test QR code and recovery codes\n```\n\n> Use `search-docs` for TOTP implementation and recovery code handling patterns.\n\n### Email Verification Setup\n\n```\n- [ ] Enable emailVerification feature in config\n- [ ] Implement MustVerifyEmail interface on User model\n- [ ] Set up verifyEmailView callback\n- [ ] Add verified middleware to protected routes\n- [ ] Test verification email flow\n```\n\n> Use `search-docs` for MustVerifyEmail implementation patterns.\n\n### Password Reset Setup\n\n```\n- [ ] Enable resetPasswords feature in config\n- [ ] Set up requestPasswordResetLinkView callback\n- [ ] Set up resetPasswordView callback\n- [ ] Define password.reset named route (if views disabled)\n- [ ] Test reset email and link flow\n```\n\n> Use `search-docs` for custom password reset flow patterns.\n\n### SPA Authentication Setup\n\n```\n- [ ] Set ''views'' => false in config/fortify.php\n- [ ] Install and configure Laravel Sanctum\n- [ ] Use ''web'' guard in fortify config\n- [ ] Set up CSRF token handling\n- [ ] Test XHR authentication flows\n```\n\n> Use `search-docs` for integration and SPA authentication patterns.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Custom Authentication Logic\n\nOverride authentication behavior using `Fortify::authenticateUsing()` for custom user retrieval or `Fortify::authenticateThrough()` to customize the authentication pipeline. Override response contracts in `AppServiceProvider` for custom redirects.\n\n### Registration Customization\n\nModify `app/Actions/Fortify/CreateNewUser.php` to customize user creation logic, validation rules, and additional fields.\n\n### Rate Limiting\n\nConfigure via `fortify.limiters.login` in config. Default configuration throttles by username + IP combination.\n\n## Key Endpoints\n\n| Feature                | Method   | Endpoint                                    |\n|------------------------|----------|---------------------------------------------|\n| Login                  | POST     | `/login`                                    |\n| Logout                 | POST     | `/logout`                                   |\n| Register               | POST     | `/register`                                 |\n| Password Reset Request | POST     | `/forgot-password`                          |\n| Password Reset         | POST     | `/reset-password`                           |\n| Email Verify Notice    | GET      | `/email/verify`                             |\n| Resend Verification    | POST     | `/email/verification-notification`          |\n| Password Confirm       | POST     | `/user/confirm-password`                    |\n| Enable 2FA             | POST     | `/user/two-factor-authentication`           |\n| Confirm 2FA            | POST     | `/user/confirmed-two-factor-authentication` |\n| 2FA Challenge          | POST     | `/two-factor-challenge`                     |\n| Get QR Code            | GET      | `/user/two-factor-qr-code`                  |\n| Recovery Codes         | GET/POST | `/user/two-factor-recovery-codes`           |"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:43:30.696Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for PHP-based AI Agents needing advanced Laravel authentication and authorization capabilities with Fortify","zh":"非常适合需要高级Laravel身份验证和授权能力的PHP基于AI代理，具有Fortify","ja":"Laravelによる高度な認証および認可機能を必要とするPHPベースのAIエージェントに最適です。Fortifyを使用","ko":"Fortify를 사용하여 고급 Laravel 인증 및 권한 부여 기능이 필요한 PHP 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en PHP que necesitan capacidades de autenticación y autorización avanzadas de Laravel con Fortify","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur PHP nécessitant des fonctionnalités d''authentification et d''autorisation avancées de Laravel avec Fortify","de":"Perfekt für PHP-basierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Laravel-Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsfunktionen mit Fortify benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em PHP que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de autenticação e autorização do Laravel com Fortify","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе PHP, которым необходимы расширенные возможности аутентификации и авторизации Laravel с Fortify","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المبنيين على بي إتش بي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للتحقق والتحكم بالوصول مع Fortify"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Laravel Fortify''s headless authentication backend, providing customizable business logic for user creation, password validation, and authentication routes, utilizing Laravel AI SDK and interacting with Fortify''s controllers and actions","zh":"赋予代理使用Laravel Fortify的无头身份验证后端，提供可自定义的业务逻辑用于用户创建、密码验证和身份验证路由，利用Laravel AI SDK并与Fortify的控制器和操作进行交互","ja":"Laravel Fortifyのヘッドレス認証バックエンドを利用できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、ユーザー作成、パスワード検証、認証ルートのためのカスタマイズ可能なビジネスロジックを提供し、Laravel AI SDKを利用し、Fortifyのコントローラーおよびアクションとやり取りする","ko":"Laravel Fortify의 헤드리스 인증 백엔드를 사용할 수 있도록 에이전트를赋予权限하여 사용자 생성, 비밀번호 검증 및 인증 루트에 대한 사용자 정의 가능한 비즈니스 논리를 제공하고 Laravel AI SDK를 사용하여 Fortify의 컨트롤러 및 액션과 상호 작용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar el backend de autenticación headless de Laravel Fortify, proporcionando lógica de negocio personalizable para la creación de usuarios, la validación de contraseñas y las rutas de autenticación, utilizando el SDK de AI de Laravel e interactuando con los controladores y acciones de Fortify","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter le backend d''authentification headless de Laravel Fortify, fournissant une logique métier personnalisable pour la création d''utilisateurs, la validation des mots de passe et les routes d''authentification, en utilisant le SDK d''AI de Laravel et en interagissant avec les contrôleurs et les actions de Fortify","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Laravels Fortify-Headless-Authentifizierungs-Backend zu nutzen, indem sie eine anpassbare Geschäftlogik für die Benutzererstellung, die Passwortvalidierung und die Authentifizierungswege bereitstellen, unter Verwendung des Laravel-AI-SDK und der Interaktion mit Fortifys Controllern und Aktionen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o back-end de autenticação headless do Laravel Fortify, fornecendo lógica de negócios personalizável para criação de usuário, validação de senha e rotas de autenticação, utilizando o SDK de IA do Laravel e interagindo com os controladores e ações do Fortify","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать безголовый бэкенд аутентификации Laravel Fortify, предоставляя настраиваемую бизнес-логику для создания пользователей, валидации пароля и маршрутов аутентификации, используя SDK ИИ Laravel и взаимодействуя с контроллерами и действиями Fortify","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الاستفادة من خلفية التحقق بدون واجهة لمستخدم Laravel Fortify، وتقديم منطق أعمال مخصص لإنشاء المستخدمين وتحقق كلمة المرور وطرق التحقق، باستخدام SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي الخاص بلارافيل والتفاعل مع التحكمات وإجراءات Fortify"},"useCases":{"en":["Customizing Fortify''s authentication routes and controllers","Implementing business logic for user creation and password validation","Debugging Fortify-related issues using search-docs and list-routes"],"zh":["自定义Fortify的身份验证路由和控制器","实现用户创建和密码验证的业务逻辑","使用search-docs和list-routes调试Fortify相关问题"],"ja":["Fortifyの認証ルートとコントローラーのカスタマイズ","ユーザー作成とパスワード検証のビジネスロジックの実装","search-docsとlist-routesを使用したFortify関連の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["Fortify의 인증 루트 및 컨트롤러를 사용자 정의","사용자 생성 및 비밀번호 검증의 비즈니스 논리를 구현","search-docs 및 list-routes를 사용하여 Fortify 관련 문제를 디버깅"],"es":["Personalizar las rutas y controladores de autenticación de Fortify","Implementar lógica de negocio para la creación de usuarios y la validación de contraseñas","Depurar problemas relacionados con Fortify utilizando search-docs y list-routes"],"fr":["Personnaliser les routes et les contrôleurs d''authentification de Fortify","Mettre en œuvre une logique métier pour la création d''utilisateurs et la validation des mots de passe","Déboguer les problèmes liés à Fortify en utilisant search-docs et list-routes"],"de":["Anpassen der Authentifizierungswege und -controller von Fortify","Implementierung von Geschäftlogik für die Benutzererstellung und die Passwortvalidierung","Fehlerbehebung bei Fortify-bezogenen Problemen unter Verwendung von search-docs und list-routes"],"pt":["Personalizar as rotas e controladores de autenticação do Fortify","Implementar lógica de negócios para criação de usuário e validação de senha","Depurar problemas relacionados ao Fortify usando search-docs e list-routes"],"ru":["Настройка маршрутов и контроллеров аутентификации Fortify","Реализация бизнес-логики для создания пользователей и валидации пароля","Отладка проблем, связанных с Fortify, используя search-docs и list-routes"],"ar":["تخصيص مسارات ومراقبة التحقق من Fortify","تنفيذ منطق الأعمال لإنشاء المستخدمين وتحقق كلمة المرور","تصحيح أخطاء متعلقة بFortify باستخدام search-docs و list-routes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Laravel application setup","Limited to Laravel Fortify''s functionality and customization options"],"zh":["需要Laravel应用程序设置","仅限Laravel Fortify的功能和自定义选项"],"ja":["Laravelアプリケーションの設定が必要","Laravel Fortifyの機能とカスタマイズオプションに限定"],"ko":["Laravel 애플리케이션 설정이 필요","Laravel Fortify의 기능 및 사용자 정의 옵션에 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de la aplicación Laravel","Limitado a la funcionalidad y las opciones de personalización de Laravel Fortify"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''application Laravel","Limité à la fonctionnalité et aux options de personnalisation de Laravel Fortify"],"de":["Benötigt eine Laravel-Anwendungskonfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Funktionalität und die Anpassungsoptionen von Laravel Fortify"],"pt":["Requer configuração de aplicativo Laravel","Limitado às funcionalidades e opções de personalização do Laravel Fortify"],"ru":["Требуется настройка приложения Laravel","Ограничен функциональностью и вариантами настройки Laravel Fortify"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق لارافيل","محدود بالوظائف وخيارات التخصيص الخاصة بلارافيل Fortify"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nihiyama/ffq/codegen-bug-fix', 'community', 'nihiyama', 'ffq', 'nihiyama/ffq', 'codegen-bug-fix', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:43:21.749Z', NULL, '{"id":"nihiyama/ffq/codegen-bug-fix","name":"codegen-bug-fix","description":{"zh":"代码生成 Bug 修复技能是一种基于文件的 FIFO 队列，用于修复 Bug 并提高代码质量","ja":"コード生成バグ修正スキルは、バグを修正しコード品質を向上させるためのファイルベースのFIFOキューです","ko":"코드 생성 버그 수정 스킬은 버그를 수정하고 코드 품질을 향상시키기 위한 파일 기반 FIFO 큐입니다","es":"Codegen Bug Fix es una habilidad que permite a los desarrolladores solucionar errores de manera efectiva en su código mediante una implementación en Go.","fr":"Codegen Bug Fix est une compétence qui permet aux développeurs de résoudre les bogues de manière efficace dans leur code à l''aide d''une implémentation en Go.","de":"Codegen Bug Fix ist eine Fähigkeit, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Fehler in ihrem Code effektiv zu beheben, indem sie eine Go-Implementierung verwenden.","pt":"O Codegen Bug Fix é uma habilidade que permite corrigir bugs de código de forma eficiente, com abordagem orientada a testes e estilo de código existente.","ru":"Codegen Bug Fix — это навык, который позволяет исправлять ошибки кода эффективно, с тест-ориентированным подходом и существующим стилем кода.","ar":"Codegen Bug Fix هو مهارة يسمح بتصحيح أخطاء الكود بفعالية، مع نهج مدفوع بالاختبار وأسلوب الكود الحالي.","en":"File-based FIFO Queue"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码生成 Bug 修复技能","ja":"コード生成バグ修正スキル","ko":"코드 생성 버그 수정 스킬","es":"Reparación de errores Codegen","fr":"Correction de bogues Codegen","de":"Codegen-Fehlerbehebung","pt":"Corrija Bugs de Código com Codegen Bug Fix","ru":"Исправьте ошибки кода с помощью Codegen Bug Fix","ar":"اصلاح أخطاء الكود باستخدام Codegen Bug Fix","en":"codegen-bug-fix"},"description":{"zh":"代码生成 Bug 修复技能是一种基于文件的 FIFO 队列，用于修复 Bug 并提高代码质量","ja":"コード生成バグ修正スキルは、バグを修正しコード品質を向上させるためのファイルベースのFIFOキューです","ko":"코드 생성 버그 수정 스킬은 버그를 수정하고 코드 품질을 향상시키기 위한 파일 기반 FIFO 큐입니다","es":"Codegen Bug Fix es una habilidad que permite a los desarrolladores solucionar errores de manera efectiva en su código mediante una implementación en Go.","fr":"Codegen Bug Fix est une compétence qui permet aux développeurs de résoudre les bogues de manière efficace dans leur code à l''aide d''une implémentation en Go.","de":"Codegen Bug Fix ist eine Fähigkeit, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Fehler in ihrem Code effektiv zu beheben, indem sie eine Go-Implementierung verwenden.","pt":"O Codegen Bug Fix é uma habilidade que permite corrigir bugs de código de forma eficiente, com abordagem orientada a testes e estilo de código existente.","ru":"Codegen Bug Fix — это навык, который позволяет исправлять ошибки кода эффективно, с тест-ориентированным подходом и существующим стилем кода.","ar":"Codegen Bug Fix هو مهارة يسمح بتصحيح أخطاء الكود بفعالية، مع نهج مدفوع بالاختبار وأسلوب الكود الحالي.","en":"File-based FIFO Queue"},"definition":{"en":"File-based FIFO Queue"},"features":{"zh":["基于文件的 FIFO 队列","测试驱动开发","使用 Serena MCP 工具","提高代码质量","自动化修复代码 Bug"],"ja":["ファイルベースのFIFOキュー","テスト駆動開発","Serena MCPツールを使用","コード品質の向上","コードのバグを自動的に修正"],"ko":["파일 기반 FIFO 큐","테스트 주도 개발","Serena MCP 도구 사용","코드 품질 향상","코드의 버그를 자동으로 수정"],"es":["Implementación en Go","Enfoque de desarrollo dirigido por pruebas","Estilo de código existente","Herramientas de Serena MCP","Solución de errores basada en problemas","Sin cambios en el comportamiento existente"],"fr":["Implémentation en Go","Développement piloté par les tests","Style de code existant","Outils Serena MCP","Résolution de bogues basée sur les problèmes","Sans changement de comportement existant"],"de":["Implementierung in Go","Testgetriebene Entwicklung","Bestehender Code-Stil","Serena MCP-Tools","Fehlerbehebung basierend auf Problemen","Ohne Änderung des bestehenden Verhaltens"],"pt":["Abordagem orientada a testes","Estilo de código existente","Uso de ferramentas Serena MCP","Correção de bugs de forma eficiente","Manutenção do comportamento existente"],"ru":["Тест-ориентированный подход","Существующий стиль кода","Использование инструментов Serena MCP","Исправление ошибок кода эффективно","Сохранение существующего поведения"],"ar":["نهج مدفوع بالاختبار","أسلوب الكود الحالي","استخدام أدوات Serena MCP","تصحيح أخطاء الكود بفعالية","الحفاظ على السلوك الحالي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码生成","Bug 修复","测试驱动开发","Serena MCP","代码质量","自动化修复","文件基于 FIFO 队列"],"ja":["コード生成","バグ修正","テスト駆動開発","Serena MCP","コード品質","自動修正","ファイルベースのFIFOキュー"],"ko":["코드 생성","버그 수정","테스트 주도 개발","Serena MCP","코드 품질","자동 수정","파일 기반 FIFO 큐"],"es":["reparación de errores","codificación","desarrollo de software","Go","pruebas","estilo de código","herramientas de desarrollo","Codegen Bug Fix"],"fr":["correction de bogues","codage","développement de logiciels","Go","tests","style de code","outils de développement","Codegen Bug Fix"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung","Codierung","Softwareentwicklung","Go","Tests","Code-Stil","Entwicklungstools","Codegen Bug Fix"],"pt":["correção de bugs","codegen bug fix","abordagem orientada a testes","estilo de código","ferramentas serena mcp","desenvolvimento de software","correção de erros"],"ru":["исправление ошибок","codegen bug fix","тест-ориентированный подход","стиль кода","инструменты serena mcp","разработка программного обеспечения","исправление ошибок кода"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء","codegen bug fix","نهج مدفوع بالاختبار","أسلوب الكود","أدوات serena mcp","تطوير البرمجيات","تصحيح أخطاء الكود"]}},"owner":"nihiyama","repo":"ffq","repoPath":"nihiyama/ffq","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"codegen-bug-fix","description":"Fix bugs using TDD starting from README + Issue (following codegen-test), aligning with existing implementation conventions, and leveraging Serena MCP semantic search/editing to implement changes with high performance and race-safety in mind.","bodyPreview":"# Codegen Bug Fix Skill\n\n## Purpose\n- Understand the bug and the remediation approach based on README.md and the Issue, then produce a Go implementation.\n- Proceed in a **test-driven** manner and match the **existing code style** (naming, design, structure, error handling).\n- Use Serena MCP tools to “read less, find precisely, and edit accurately.”\n\n## When to use\n- When a bug fix is required based on an Issue.\n- When you want to fix only the problem without changing existing behavior.\n- When th","body":"# Codegen Bug Fix Skill\n\n## Purpose\n- Understand the bug and the remediation approach based on README.md and the Issue, then produce a Go implementation.\n- Proceed in a **test-driven** manner and match the **existing code style** (naming, design, structure, error handling).\n- Use Serena MCP tools to “read less, find precisely, and edit accurately.”\n\n## When to use\n- When a bug fix is required based on an Issue.\n- When you want to fix only the problem without changing existing behavior.\n- When the change requires attention to performance or data races (race conditions).\n\n## Deliverables (expected output)\n- Create **tests** that reproduce the bug and verify the fix (**conform to the generate-test skill**).\n- **Tests** that transition from failing → passing (**conform to the generate-test skill**).\n- **Production code** that makes the tests pass.\n  - All tests and static analysis must complete successfully.\n- Minimal README/comment/documentation updates (only if necessary)\n\n---\n\n## Execution steps (follow this order)\n\n### 0) Safety measures before changes\n- Do not break existing APIs/behavior.\n  - Ensure the fix does not unintentionally change the specification.\n  - Only change behavior when there is clear evidence in the Issue/README.\n  - If a behavior change is necessary, ask for confirmation.\n- Keep changes minimal. Do **not** do opportunistic refactors.\n  - If refactoring is needed, create a separate Issue.\n  - Use GitHub MCP to create the Issue.\n\n### 1) Identify the Issue and confirm requirements (read README + Issue)\n1. Get the **current branch name**:\n  - `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`\n2. Extract the **Issue number** from the branch name (example):\n  - `feature/issue-<issue_number>-`\n3. Read the Issue\n  - Use GitHub MCP.\n4. Check README.md / CONTRIBUTING / docs for the **expected usage, constraints, and compatibility**.\n5. Finalize acceptance criteria as bullet points and convert them into **test perspectives**.\n  - Test perspectives must follow the `codegen-test` skill.\n\n> If you cannot extract the Issue number, look for clues in README / Issue list / PRs / commit messages. If still unclear, ask the user which Issue should be targeted.\n\n### 2) Find the project’s existing style (grep + Serena)\n**Goal:** Match existing patterns (structs, errors, return values, naming, test style).\n\n- First, create an “entry point” using grep / git grep:\n  - `grep -En \"keyword|TypeName|funcName\" -r .`\n  - `grep -En --include=''*.go'' \"keyword|TypeName|funcName\" -r .`\n  - `git grep -nE \"keyword|TypeName|funcName\" -- ''*.go''`\n- Then use Serena MCP to locate the “right place” without over-reading:\n  - `get_symbols_overview` (high-level symbol overview)\n  - `find_symbol` (jump to type/function/method definitions)\n  - `find_referencing_symbols` (find call sites/usages)\n  - Use `insert_after_symbol` / `replace_symbol_body` etc. for **pinpoint edits**\n  - Avoid reading entire large files; fetch only what you need\n\n### 3) Write tests first (follow the generate-test skill)\n- **First, add a test that reproduces the bug** and confirm it fails (red).\n- Test strategy:\n  - Table-driven tests (happy path / error cases / boundary values)\n  - A testable design with injectable dependencies\n    - But do not overuse interfaces.\n    - Keep the design simple.\n  - For external I/O, use interfaces/mocks/in-memory approaches\n    - Do not use external modules.\n- In this step, the `codegen-test` skill instructions are the **top priority**.\n\n### 4) Implement (minimal changes, high performance, idiomatic Go)\n**Design principles**\n- Keep names **short and unambiguous**, so the meaning is clear in a single word. Avoid vague words or overly long compounds.\n- Follow `gofmt` / `gopls`, and prefer the standard library.\n- Think about **data structures first**, then logic—choose structures suited to the problem to improve performance and maintainability.\n- Avoid nested if/else; prefer early returns and happy-path flows.\n- A bug fix should be minimal: do not add new features.\n\n**Performance checklist (apply as needed)**\n- Avoid unnecessary allocations:\n  - Pre-allocate slices when appropriate: `make([]T, 0, n)`\n  - Estimate capacity if appending in loops\n- Use `map[string]struct{}` for sets (no value payload)\n- Aim for “zero-copy”:\n  - Avoid repeated `[]byte`↔`string` conversions (do it once at boundaries)\n  - Handle large data via references/slices\n- Do not overuse `fmt.Sprintf` in hot paths; consider `strings.Builder` or `bytes.Buffer` when needed.\n\n### 5) Tests, static checks, and race checks\n- Run tests (including race checks):\n  - `task go:test`\n- If the change might impact performance, run benchmarks:\n  - `task go:bench`\n\n### 6) Rules to avoid data races\n- Make reads/writes to shared state explicit and protect them with one of:\n  - mutex / RWMutex\n  - ownership transfer via channels\n  - atomic (only when applicable)\n- Do not share “apparently safe” maps/slices (even read-only requires careful construction timing).\n- Increase reproducibility by running concurrency in tests (`t.Parallel()` and/or goroutines) for race-prone areas.\n\n---\n\n## Final report output (keep it short)\n- Output as a Markdown report:\n  - Filename: `<issue_number>_<datetime>_bug_fix_report.md`\n- Issue summary (acceptance criteria)\n- Changes (by file)\n- Added test perspectives\n- Commands executed\n- Performance/race considerations (if applicable)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:43:21.749Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Optimization Agents requiring precise bug fixing and remediation in Go programming language","zh":"适用于需要在Go编程语言中进行精确的错误修复和补救的代码优化代理","ja":"Goプログラミング言語で正確なバグ修正と修復を必要とするコード最適化エージェントに最適","ko":"Go 프로그래밍 언어에서 정확한 버그 수정 및 복구를 요구하는 코드 최적화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de optimización de código que requieren una corrección y remediación de errores precisas en el lenguaje de programación Go","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''optimisation de code nécessitant une correction et une remédiation de bogues précises dans le langage de programmation Go","de":"Ideal für Code-Optimierungsagenten, die eine präzise Fehlerbehebung und -behebung in der Go-Programmiersprache erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Otimização de Código que exigem correção e remediação de bugs precisas na linguagem de programação Go","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации кода, требующих точного исправления и устранения ошибок в языке программирования Go","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمثل للتعليمات البرمجية الذين يحتاجون إلى إصلاح دقيق وعلاج للعيوب في لغة برمجة Go"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce high-quality Go implementations using a test-driven approach, matching existing code style and leveraging Serena MCP tools for efficient editing and issue resolution based on README.md and Issue tracking","zh":"赋予代理产生高质量的Go实现，使用测试驱动的方法，匹配现有的代码风格，并利用Serena MCP工具进行高效的编辑和问题解决，基于README.md和问题跟踪","ja":"エージェントがテスト駆動アプローチを使用して、高品質のGo実装を生成できるようにし、既存のコードスタイルに合わせて、Serena MCPツールを使用して効率的に編集および問題を解決する、README.mdおよび問題追跡に基づいて","ko":"에이전트가 테스트 주도 접근 방식을 사용하여 높은 품질의 Go 구현을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 기존 코드 스타일과 일치시키고, Serena MCP 툴을 사용하여 효율적으로 편집 및 문제를 해결하며, README.md 및 문제 추적을 기반으로 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir implementaciones de alta calidad en Go utilizando un enfoque dirigido por pruebas, coincidiendo con el estilo de código existente y aprovechando las herramientas de Serena MCP para una edición y resolución de problemas eficientes basadas en README.md y seguimiento de problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire des implementations de haute qualité en Go en utilisant une approche pilotée par les tests, en faisant correspondre le style de code existant et en exploitant les outils Serena MCP pour une édition et une résolution de problèmes efficaces basées sur README.md et suivi des problèmes","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige Go-Implementierungen unter Verwendung eines testgetriebenen Ansatzes zu produzieren, der den bestehenden Code-Stil entspricht und die Serena-MCP-Tools für effizientes Editieren und Problemlösung auf der Grundlage von README.md und Fehlerverfolgung nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir implementações de alta qualidade em Go usando uma abordagem orientada a testes, correspondendo ao estilo de código existente e aproveitando as ferramentas Serena MCP para edição eficiente e resolução de problemas com base em README.md e rastreamento de problemas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высококачественные реализации на Go, используя тестово-ориентированный подход, соответствующий существующему стилю кода и использующий инструменты Serena MCP для эффективного редактирования и решения проблем на основе README.md и отслеживания проблем","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنتاج تنفيذات عالية الجودة في Go باستخدام نهج قائم على الاختبارات، مطابقًا لأسلوب الكود الموجود واستفادة من أدوات Serena MCP للتعديل الفعال وحل المشكلات dựa على README.md وتتبع القضايا"},"useCases":{"en":["Fixing bugs in Go applications based on Issue reports","Implementing remediation approaches in a test-driven manner","Maintaining existing code style and structure in Go projects"],"zh":["根据问题报告修复Go应用程序中的错误","以测试驱动的方式实施补救方法","在Go项目中维护现有的代码风格和结构"],"ja":["問題レポートに基づいてGoアプリケーションのバグを修正する","テスト駆動アプローチで修復方法を実装する","Goプロジェクトで既存のコードスタイルと構造を維持する"],"ko":["문제 보고서를 기반으로 Go 애플리케이션의 버그를 수정함","테스트 주도 접근 방식으로 복구 방법을 구현함","Go 프로젝트에서 기존 코드 스타일 및 구조를 유지함"],"es":["Corrección de errores en aplicaciones Go en función de informes de problemas","Implementación de enfoques de remediación de manera dirigida por pruebas","Mantenimiento del estilo y estructura de código existentes en proyectos Go"],"fr":["Correction de bogues dans les applications Go en fonction des rapports de problèmes","Mise en œuvre d''approches de remédiation de manière pilotée par les tests","Maintenance du style et de la structure de code existants dans les projets Go"],"de":["Behebung von Fehlern in Go-Anwendungen auf der Grundlage von Fehlerberichten","Implementierung von Behebungsansätzen auf testgetriebene Weise","Beibehaltung des bestehenden Code-Stils und der Code-Struktur in Go-Projekten"],"pt":["Corrigir bugs em aplicativos Go com base em relatórios de problemas","Implementar abordagens de remediação de forma orientada a testes","Manter o estilo e a estrutura de código existente em projetos Go"],"ru":["Исправление ошибок в приложениях Go на основе отчетов об ошибках","Реализация подходов к устранению ошибок в тестово-ориентированном порядке","Поддержание существующего стиля и структуры кода в проектах Go"],"ar":["إصلاح العيوب في تطبيقات Go بناءً على تقارير المشكلات","تنفيذ نهج العلاج بطريقة قائمة على الاختبارات","الحفاظ على أسلوب الكود وهيكلة الكود الحالية في مشاريع Go"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to README.md and Issue tracking information","Limited to Go programming language","Dependent on Serena MCP tools for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要访问README.md和问题跟踪信息","仅限于Go编程语言","依赖于Serena MCP工具以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["README.mdおよび問題追跡情報へのアクセスが必要","Goプログラミング言語のみ","Serena MCPツールに依存して最適なパフォーマンスを実現"],"ko":["README.md 및 문제 추적 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Go 프로그래밍 언어만 해당함","Serena MCP 툴에 의존하여 최적의 성능을 달성함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la información de README.md y seguimiento de problemas","Limitado al lenguaje de programación Go","Dependiente de las herramientas de Serena MCP para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux informations de README.md et suivi des problèmes","Limité au langage de programmation Go","Dépendant des outils Serena MCP pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf README.md- und Fehlerverfolgungsinformationen","Begrenzt auf die Go-Programmiersprache","Abhängig von den Serena-MCP-Tools für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Exige acesso a informações de README.md e rastreamento de problemas","Limitado à linguagem de programação Go","Dependente das ferramentas Serena MCP para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информации README.md и отслеживанию проблем","Ограничен языком программирования Go","Зависит от инструментов Serena MCP для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات README.md وتتبع القضايا","محدود بلغة برمجة Go","يعتمد على أدوات Serena MCP للأداء الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
