''aide pour les tâches courantes"],"de":["Installation von curatierten Fähigkeiten","Installation von experimentellen Fähigkeiten","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten","Integration mit GitHub","Verwendung von Hilfs-Skripten für häufige Aufgaben"],"pt":["Instalação de skills a partir de repositórios como o GitHub","Suporte a skills experimentais","Listagem de skills disponíveis","Instalação de skills personalizados","Uso de scripts de ajuda para tarefas específicas","Compatibilidade com skills curatorados e experimentais"],"ru":["Установка умений из репозиториев, таких как GitHub","Поддержка экспериментальных умений","Перечень доступных умений","Установка пользовательских умений","Использование вспомогательных скриптов для конкретных задач","Совместимость с кириллическими и экспериментальными умениями"],"ar":["تثبيت المهارات من المخازن مثل جيثب","دعم المهارات التجريبية","قائمة المهارات المتاحة","تثبيت مهارات مخصصة","استخدام سكريبتات مساعدة لمهام محددة","توافق مع المهارات المحددة والتجريبية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技能安装器","GitHub","实验性技能","自定义技能","helper脚本","技能管理","开发者工具"],"ja":["スキルインストーラー","GitHub","実験的スキル","カスタムスキル","helperスクリプト","スキル管理","開発者ツール"],"ko":["스킬 설치기","GitHub","실험적인 스킬","사용자 지정 스킬","helper 스크립트","스킬 관리","개발자 도구"],"es":["instalador de habilidades","desarrollo de habilidades","habilidades curadas","habilidades experimentales","GitHub","scripts de ayuda","instalación de habilidades","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["installateur de compétences","développement de compétences","compétences curées","compétences expérimentales","GitHub","scripts d''aide","installation de compétences","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Fähigkeits-Installer","Fähigkeits-Entwicklung","curatierte Fähigkeiten","experimentelle Fähigkeiten","GitHub","Hilfs-Skripte","Fähigkeits-Installation","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["instalador de habilidades","skills","github","instalação de skills","desenvolvimento de skills","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","tecnologias de skills","soluções de instalação de skills"],"ru":["установщик навыков","умения","github","установка умений","разработка умений","инструменты разработки","технологии умений","решения для установки умений"],"ar":["مثبت مهارات","مهارات","جيثب","تثبيت مهارات","تطوير مهارات","أدوات التطوير","تكنولوجيا المهارات","حلول تثبيت المهارات"]}},"owner":"takashabe","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"takashabe/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-installer","description":"Install Codex skills into $CODEX_HOME/skills from a curated list or a GitHub repo path. Use when a user asks to list installable skills, install a curated skill, or install a skill from another repo (including private repos).","bodyPreview":"# Skill Installer\n\nHelps install skills. By default these are from https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated, but users can also provide other locations. Experimental skills live in https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.experimental and can be installed the same way.\n\nUse the helper scripts based on the task:\n- List skills when the user asks what is available, or if the user uses this skill without specifying what to do. Default listing is `.curated`, but you can pa","body":"# Skill Installer\n\nHelps install skills. By default these are from https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated, but users can also provide other locations. Experimental skills live in https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.experimental and can be installed the same way.\n\nUse the helper scripts based on the task:\n- List skills when the user asks what is available, or if the user uses this skill without specifying what to do. Default listing is `.curated`, but you can pass `--path skills/.experimental` when they ask about experimental skills.\n- Install from the curated list when the user provides a skill name.\n- Install from another repo when the user provides a GitHub repo/path (including private repos).\n\nInstall skills with the helper scripts.\n\n## Communication\n\nWhen listing skills, output approximately as follows, depending on the context of the user''s request. If they ask about experimental skills, list from `.experimental` instead of `.curated` and label the source accordingly:\n\"\"\"\nSkills from {repo}:\n1. skill-1\n2. skill-2 (already installed)\n3. ...\nWhich ones would you like installed?\n\"\"\"\n\nAfter installing a skill, tell the user: \"Restart Codex to pick up new skills.\"\n\n## Scripts\n\nAll of these scripts use network, so when running in the sandbox, request escalation when running them.\n\n- `scripts/list-skills.py` (prints skills list with installed annotations)\n- `scripts/list-skills.py --format json`\n- Example (experimental list): `scripts/list-skills.py --path skills/.experimental`\n- `scripts/install-skill-from-github.py --repo <owner>/<repo> --path <path/to/skill> [<path/to/skill> ...]`\n- `scripts/install-skill-from-github.py --url https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/tree/<ref>/<path>`\n- Example (experimental skill): `scripts/install-skill-from-github.py --repo openai/skills --path skills/.experimental/<skill-name>`\n\n## Behavior and Options\n\n- Defaults to direct download for public GitHub repos.\n- If download fails with auth/permission errors, falls back to git sparse checkout.\n- Aborts if the destination skill directory already exists.\n- Installs into `$CODEX_HOME/skills/<skill-name>` (defaults to `~/.codex/skills`).\n- Multiple `--path` values install multiple skills in one run, each named from the path basename unless `--name` is supplied.\n- Options: `--ref <ref>` (default `main`), `--dest <path>`, `--method auto|download|git`.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Curated listing is fetched from `https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated` via the GitHub API. If it is unavailable, explain the error and exit.\n- Private GitHub repos can be accessed via existing git credentials or optional `GITHUB_TOKEN`/`GH_TOKEN` for download.\n- Git fallback tries HTTPS first, then SSH.\n- The skills at https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.system are preinstalled, so no need to help users install those. If they ask, just explain this. If they insist, you can download and overwrite.\n- Installed annotations come from `$CODEX_HOME/skills`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:44:31.098Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing seamless skill integration from GitHub repositories like https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated","zh":"非常适合需要从GitHub存储库（如https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated）无缝集成技能的AI智能体","ja":"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated などのGitHubリポジトリからのシームレスなスキル統合を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です","ko":"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated와 같은 GitHub 저장소에서 원활한 스킬 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan una integración de habilidades sin problemas desde repositorios de GitHub como https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une intégration de compétences transparente à partir de référentiels GitHub tels que https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Fähigkeitsintegration aus GitHub-Repositorys wie https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de integração de habilidades sem interrupções de repositórios do GitHub como https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция навыков из репозиториев GitHub, таких как https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى دمج مهارات متواصلة من مستودعات GitHub مثل https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to install and manage skills from curated and experimental repositories using helper scripts, facilitating tasks via HTTPS protocol and leveraging GitHub-hosted skill locations","zh":"通过辅助脚本赋能智能体从精选和实验性存储库安装和管理技能，利用HTTPS协议和GitHub托管的技能位置来简化任务","ja":"ヘルパースクリプトを使用して、キュレーションおよび実験的なリポジトリからスキルをインストールおよび管理し、HTTPSプロトコルを介したタスクの実行とGitHubホスト型のスキルロケーションの活用を可能にします","ko":"도우미 스크립트를 사용하여 선별된 및 실험적 저장소에서 스킬을 설치 및 관리하고, HTTPS 프로토콜을 통한 작업 수행과 GitHub 호스팅 스킬 위치 활용을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a instalar y gestionar habilidades desde repositorios curados y experimentales utilizando scripts de ayuda, facilitando tareas a través del protocolo HTTPS y aprovechando las ubicaciones de habilidades alojadas en GitHub","fr":"Permet aux agents d''installer et de gérer des compétences à partir de référentiels curés et expérimentaux en utilisant des scripts d''aide, facilitant les tâches via le protocole HTTPS et exploitant les emplacements de compétences hébergés sur GitHub","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Fähigkeiten aus kuratierten und experimentellen Repositorys mithilfe von Hilfs-Skripten zu installieren und zu verwalten, wodurch Aufgaben über das HTTPS-Protokoll erleichtert und die auf GitHub gehosteten Fähigkeitsstandorte genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a instalar e gerenciar habilidades de repositórios curados e experimentais usando scripts de ajuda, facilitando tarefas via protocolo HTTPS e aproveitando locais de habilidades hospedados no GitHub","ru":"Позволяет агентам устанавливать и управлять навыками из курируемых и экспериментальных репозиториев с помощью вспомогательных скриптов, облегчая задачи через протокол HTTPS и используя размещения навыков, размещенных на GitHub","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تركيب وتشغيل المهارات من المستودعات المعدة والتجريبية باستخدام سكريبتات مساعدة، وتسهيل المهام عبر بروتوكول HTTPS وتفضيل مواقع المهارات المضيفة على جيت هاب"},"useCases":{"en":["Listing available skills from .curated or .experimental repositories","Installing specific skills from custom GitHub locations","Managing skill repositories for agent customization"],"zh":[".curated或.experimental存储库中列出可用技能","从自定义GitHub位置安装特定技能","管理技能存储库以实现智能体定制"],"ja":[".curated または .experimental リポジトリから利用可能なスキルを一覧表示","カスタムGitHubロケーションから特定のスキルをインストール","エージェントカスタマイズのためのスキルリポジトリの管理"],"ko":[".curated 또는 .experimental 저장소에서 사용 가능한 스킬 목록 조회","사용자 정의 GitHub 위치에서 특정 스킬 설치","에이전트 사용자 지정을 위한 스킬 저장소 관리"],"es":["Listar habilidades disponibles desde repositorios .curated o .experimental","Instalar habilidades específicas desde ubicaciones personalizadas de GitHub","Gestionar repositorios de habilidades para la personalización del agente"],"fr":["Lister les compétences disponibles à partir de référentiels .curated ou .experimental","Installer des compétences spécifiques à partir d''emplacements GitHub personnalisés","Gérer les référentiels de compétences pour la personnalisation de l''agent"],"de":["Auflisten verfügbarer Fähigkeiten aus .curated- oder .experimental-Repositorys","Installieren spezifischer Fähigkeiten von benutzerdefinierten GitHub-Orten","Verwalten von Fähigkeits-Repositorys für die Anpassung des Agents"],"pt":["Listar habilidades disponíveis de repositórios .curated ou .experimental","Instalar habilidades específicas de locais personalizados do GitHub","Gerenciar repositórios de habilidades para personalização do agente"],"ru":["Перечисление доступных навыков из репозиториев .curated или .experimental","Установка конкретных навыков из пользовательских мест GitHub","Управление репозиториями навыков для настройки агента"],"ar":["استعراض المهارات المتاحة من مستودعات .curated أو .experimental","تركيب مهارات محددة من مواقع جيت هاب المخصصة","إدارة مستودعات المهارات لتخصيص الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GitHub-hosted skill repositories","Limited to skills compatible with the agent''s architecture"],"zh":["需要访问GitHub托管的技能存储库","仅限于与智能体架构兼容的技能"],"ja":["GitHubホスト型のスキルリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","エージェントのアーキテクチャと互換性のあるスキルに限定される"],"ko":["GitHub 호스팅 스킬 저장소에 대한 액세스 필요","에이전트 아키텍처와 호환되는 스킬로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a repositorios de habilidades alojados en GitHub","Limitado a habilidades compatibles con la arquitectura del agente"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux référentiels de compétences hébergés sur GitHub","Limité aux compétences compatibles avec l''architecture de l''agent"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf auf GitHub gehostete Fähigkeits-Repositorys","Begrenzt auf Fähigkeiten, die mit der Architektur des Agents kompatibel sind"],"pt":["Requer acesso a repositórios de habilidades hospedados no GitHub","Limitado a habilidades compatíveis com a arquitetura do agente"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиториям навыков, размещенным на GitHub","Ограничен навыками, совместимыми с архитектурой агента"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودعات المهارات المضيفة على جيت هاب","محدود بالمهارات المتوافقة مع هيكل الوكيل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ThalesGroup/agilab/agilab-streamlit-pages', 'community', 'ThalesGroup', 'agilab', 'ThalesGroup/agilab', 'agilab-streamlit-pages', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:45:03.174Z', NULL, '{"id":"ThalesGroup/agilab/agilab-streamlit-pages","name":"agilab-streamlit-pages","description":{"zh":"AGILAB 项目致力于探索工程中的 AI 应用，AGILAB Streamlit 页面技能帮助工程师快速实验 AI 驱动方法。","ja":"AGILAB プロジェクトは、エンジニアリングにおける AI の応用を探ることを目的としています。AGILAB Streamlit ページスキルは、エンジニアが AI ドリブンの方法で実験を迅速に実行するのに役立ちます。","ko":"AGILAB 프로젝트는 엔지니어링에서 AI를 활용하는 것을 목표로 합니다. AGILAB 스트림릿 페이지 스킬은 엔지니어가 AI 드라이브 방법으로 실험을 빠르게 수행할 수 있도록 도와줍니다.","es":"AGILAB Streamlit Pages es una herramienta para experimentar con métodos de IA en ingeniería. Ayuda a los ingenieros a trabajar de forma eficiente con la IA","fr":"AGILAB Streamlit Pages est un outil pour expérimenter avec des méthodes d''IA en ingénierie. Il aide les ingénieurs à travailler de manière efficace avec l''IA","de":"AGILAB Streamlit Pages ist ein Tool, um mit KI-Methoden in der Ingenieure zu experimentieren. Es hilft Ingenieuren, effizient mit der KI zu arbeiten","en":"AGILAB project purpose is to explore AI for engineering. It is designed to help engineers quickly experiment with AI-driven methods."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AGILAB Streamlit 页面技能","ja":"AGILAB Streamlit ページスキル","ko":"AGILAB 스트림릿 페이지 스킬","es":"AGILAB Streamlit Pages: Experimentación con AI para Ingen...","fr":"AGILAB Streamlit Pages: Expérimentation avec l''IA pour l''...","de":"AGILAB Streamlit Pages: Experimentieren mit KI für Ingeni...","en":"agilab-streamlit-pages"},"description":{"zh":"AGILAB 项目致力于探索工程中的 AI 应用，AGILAB Streamlit 页面技能帮助工程师快速实验 AI 驱动方法。","ja":"AGILAB プロジェクトは、エンジニアリングにおける AI の応用を探ることを目的としています。AGILAB Streamlit ページスキルは、エンジニアが AI ドリブンの方法で実験を迅速に実行するのに役立ちます。","ko":"AGILAB 프로젝트는 엔지니어링에서 AI를 활용하는 것을 목표로 합니다. AGILAB 스트림릿 페이지 스킬은 엔지니어가 AI 드라이브 방법으로 실험을 빠르게 수행할 수 있도록 도와줍니다.","es":"AGILAB Streamlit Pages es una herramienta para experimentar con métodos de IA en ingeniería. Ayuda a los ingenieros a trabajar de forma eficiente con la IA","fr":"AGILAB Streamlit Pages est un outil pour expérimenter avec des méthodes d''IA en ingénierie. Il aide les ingénieurs à travailler de manière efficace avec l''IA","de":"AGILAB Streamlit Pages ist ein Tool, um mit KI-Methoden in der Ingenieure zu experimentieren. Es hilft Ingenieuren, effizient mit der KI zu arbeiten","en":"AGILAB project purpose is to explore AI for engineering. It is designed to help engineers quickly experiment with AI-driven methods."},"definition":{"en":"AGILAB project purpose is to explore AI for engineering. It is designed to help engineers quickly experiment with AI-driven methods."},"features":{"zh":["快速实验 AI 驱动方法","提高工程效率","支持 Streamlit 页面编辑","提供 Session State 规则以避免常见崩溃","支持 widget 返回值和计算导出状态"],"ja":["AI ドリブンの方法で実験を迅速に実行","エンジニアリングの効率を高める","Streamlit ページの編集をサポート","セッション状態ルールを提供して一般的なクラッシュを避ける","ウィジェットの戻り値と計算された導出状態をサポート"],"ko":["AI 드라이브 방법으로 실험을 빠르게 수행","엔지니어링 효율을 높여라","스트림릿 페이지 편집을 지원","세션 상태 규칙을 제공하여 일반적인 크래시를 피함","위젯 반환 값 및 계산된 파생 상태를 지원"],"es":["Experimentación con métodos de IA en ingeniería","Trabajo eficiente con la IA","Uso de Streamlit para la creación de páginas","Reglas de estado de sesión para evitar errores comunes","Asignación de valores a widgets de forma segura"],"fr":["Expérimentation avec des méthodes d''IA en ingénierie","Travail efficace avec l''IA","Utilisation de Streamlit pour la création de pages","Règles d''état de session pour éviter les erreurs courantes","Assignment de valeurs aux widgets de manière sécurisée"],"de":["Experimentieren mit KI-Methoden in der Ingenieure","Effizientes Arbeiten mit der KI","Verwendung von Streamlit für die Erstellung von Seiten","Regeln für den Sitzungsstatus, um häufige Fehler zu vermeiden","Zuweisung von Werten zu Widgets auf sichere Weise"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AGILAB","Streamlit","AI 驱动方法","工程效率","Session State","widget","Streamlit 页面编辑"],"ja":["AGILAB","Streamlit","AI ドリブンの方法","エンジニアリングの効率","セッション状態","ウィジェット","Streamlit ページの編集"],"ko":["AGILAB","스트림릿","AI 드라이브 방법","엔지니어링 효율","세션 상태","위젯","스트림릿 페이지 편집"],"es":["AGILAB Streamlit Pages","experimentación con IA","ingeniería","Streamlit","estado de sesión","widgets","desarrollo de software","IA para ingenieros"],"fr":["AGILAB Streamlit Pages","expérimentation avec l''IA","ingénierie","Streamlit","état de session","widgets","développement de logiciels","IA pour ingénieurs"],"de":["AGILAB Streamlit Pages","Experimentieren mit KI","Ingenieure","Streamlit","Sitzungsstatus","Widgets","Software-Entwicklung","KI für Ingenieure"]}},"owner":"ThalesGroup","repo":"agilab","repoPath":"ThalesGroup/agilab","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agilab-streamlit-pages","description":"Streamlit page authoring patterns for AGILAB (session_state safety, keys, rerun, UX).","bodyPreview":"# Streamlit Pages Skill (AGILAB)\n\nUse this skill when editing:\n- `src/agilab/AGILAB.py`\n- `src/agilab/pages/*.py`\n- `src/agilab/apps-pages/*/src/*/*.py`\n\n## Session State Rules (Avoid Common Crashes)\n\n- Never assign `st.session_state[\"k\"] = …` **after** a widget with `key=\"k\"` was created.\n  - Prefer `st.session_state.setdefault(\"k\", default)` before the widget.\n  - Or use widget return values and compute derived state separately.\n\n- If you need to “reset” a widget value:\n  - Use a different key","body":"# Streamlit Pages Skill (AGILAB)\n\nUse this skill when editing:\n- `src/agilab/AGILAB.py`\n- `src/agilab/pages/*.py`\n- `src/agilab/apps-pages/*/src/*/*.py`\n\n## Session State Rules (Avoid Common Crashes)\n\n- Never assign `st.session_state[\"k\"] = …` **after** a widget with `key=\"k\"` was created.\n  - Prefer `st.session_state.setdefault(\"k\", default)` before the widget.\n  - Or use widget return values and compute derived state separately.\n\n- If you need to “reset” a widget value:\n  - Use a different key (versioned key pattern), or\n  - Gate the reset behind a rerun and only mutate state before widget creation.\n\n## Recommended Pattern\n\n1. Initialize defaults with `setdefault` at the top of the page.\n2. Render widgets.\n3. Read values from widgets, compute derived state, store under *different* keys.\n\n## Rerun API\n\n- Do not use `st.experimental_rerun()`; use `st.rerun()`.\n\n## Key Hygiene\n\n- Every widget must have a stable, unique key.\n- Prefer namespaced keys: `f\\\"{page_id}:df_files\\\"`, not `\"df_files\"`.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:45:03.174Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced data visualization and experimentation capabilities with Streamlit","zh":"非常适合需要使用Streamlit进行高级数据可视化和实验的Python分析代理","ja":"Streamlitを使用した高度なデータ可視化と実験が必要なPython分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Streamlit를 사용하여 고급 데이터 시각화와 실험을 수행하는 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos avanzadas y experimentación con Streamlit","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python nécessitant des capacités de visualisation de données avancées et d''expérimentation avec Streamlit","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Datenvisualisierungs- und Experimentierungsfunktionen mit Streamlit benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que precisam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados e experimentação com Streamlit","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа Python, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации данных и экспериментирования со Streamlit","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة للرؤية والتحليل البيانات مع Streamlit"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rapidly prototype and experiment with AI-driven methods using Streamlit pages, seamlessly integrating with AGILAB project files such as `AGILAB.py` and `pages/*.py`, while efficiently managing session state with `st.session_state` and widget return values","zh":"赋予代理快速原型设计和使用Streamlit页面进行AI驱动方法的实验能力，实现与AGILAB项目文件（如`AGILAB.py`和`pages/*.py`）的无缝集成，并使用`st.session_state`高效管理会话状态和控件返回值","ja":"エージェントにStreamlitページを使用してAI駆動方法を迅速にプロトタイプ化し実験する能力を与え、AGILABプロジェクトファイル（例：`AGILAB.py`および`pages/*.py`）とのシームレスな統合を実現し、`st.session_state`を使用してセッション状態とウィジェットの戻り値を効率的に管理する","ko":"에이전트가 Streamlit 페이지를 사용하여 AI 구동 방법을 신속하게 프로토타입화하고 실험할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, AGILAB 프로젝트 파일(예: `AGILAB.py` 및 `pages/*.py`)과无缝하게 통합하고 `st.session_state`를 사용하여 세션 상태와 위젯 반환 값을 효율적으로 관리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a prototipar y experimentar rápidamente con métodos impulsados por IA utilizando páginas de Streamlit, integrándose de forma transparente con archivos de proyecto AGILAB como `AGILAB.py` y `pages/*.py`, mientras gestiona eficientemente el estado de sesión con `st.session_state` y valores de retorno de widgets","fr":"Permet aux agents de prototyper et d''expérimenter rapidement des méthodes pilotées par l''IA en utilisant des pages Streamlit, s''intégrant sans effort avec des fichiers de projet AGILAB tels que `AGILAB.py` et `pages/*.py`, tout en gérant efficacement l''état de session avec `st.session_state` et les valeurs de retour des widgets","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, schnell mit AI-getriebenen Methoden zu prototypisieren und zu experimentieren, indem sie Streamlit-Seiten verwenden, die nahtlos in AGILAB-Projektdateien wie `AGILAB.py` und `pages/*.py` integriert sind, während sie den Sitzungsstatus mit `st.session_state` und Widget-Rückgabewerten effizient verwalten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a prototipar e experimentar rapidamente métodos impulsionados por IA usando páginas Streamlit, integrando-se perfeitamente com arquivos de projeto AGILAB, como `AGILAB.py` e `pages/*.py`, e gerenciando eficientemente o estado da sessão com `st.session_state` e valores de retorno de widgets","ru":"Позволяет агентам быстро прототипировать и экспериментировать с методами, основанными на ИИ, используя страницы Streamlit, бесшовно интегрируясь с файлами проекта AGILAB, такими как `AGILAB.py` и `pages/*.py`, и эффективно управляя состоянием сессии с помощью `st.session_state` и значений возврата виджетов","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء نماذج أولية وتجريب أساليب مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي بسرعة باستخدام صفحات Streamlit، وتكاملها بشكل متكامل مع ملفات مشروع AGILAB مثل `AGILAB.py` و `pages/*.py` ، وإدارة حالة الجلسة بشكل فعال باستخدام `st.session_state` وقيم إرجاع الويدجيت"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging session state crashes","Generating interactive AI-driven dashboards","Experimenting with AI methods using Streamlit widgets"],"zh":["会话状态崩溃的调试","生成交互式AI驱动仪表盘","使用Streamlit控件实验AI方法"],"ja":["セッション状態クラッシュのデバッグ","インタラクティブなAI駆動ダッシュボードの生成","Streamlitウィジェットを使用したAI方法の実験"],"ko":["세션 상태 충돌 디버깅","대화형 AI 구동 대시보드 생성","Streamlit 위젯을 사용한 AI 방법 실험"],"es":["Depuración de errores de estado de sesión","Generación de paneles de control interactivos impulsados por IA","Experimentación con métodos de IA utilizando widgets de Streamlit"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs d''état de session","Génération de tableaux de bord interactifs pilotés par l''IA","Expérimentation avec des méthodes d''IA en utilisant des widgets Streamlit"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Sitzungsstatusabstürzen","Erzeugung interaktiver AI-getriebener Dashboards","Experimentieren mit AI-Methoden unter Verwendung von Streamlit-Widgets"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de estado de sessão","Geração de painéis interativos impulsionados por IA","Experimentação com métodos de IA usando widgets Streamlit"],"ru":["Отладка сбоев состояния сессии","Генерация интерактивных панелей, основанных на ИИ","Экспериментирование с методами ИИ, используя виджеты Streamlit"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء حالة الجلسة","إنشاء لوحات تحكم تفاعلية مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","التجريب مع أساليب الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام ويدجيت Streamlit"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and Streamlit installation","Specific to AGILAB project structure and files","Must adhere to session state rules to avoid crashes"],"zh":["需要Python和Streamlit安装","特定于AGILAB项目结构和文件","必须遵守会话状态规则以避免崩溃"],"ja":["PythonとStreamlitのインストールが必要","AGILABプロジェクト構造とファイルに特有","クラッシュを避けるためにセッション状態の規則に従う必要がある"],"ko":["Python 및 Streamlit 설치가 필요","AGILAB 프로젝트 구조 및 파일에 특정","충돌을 피하기 위해 세션 상태 규칙을 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Python y Streamlit","Específico de la estructura y archivos del proyecto AGILAB","Debe cumplir con las reglas de estado de sesión para evitar bloqueos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Python et Streamlit","Spécifique de la structure et des fichiers du projet AGILAB","Doit respecter les règles d''état de session pour éviter les blocages"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Python und Streamlit","Spezifisch für die Struktur und Dateien des AGILAB-Projekts","Muss die Regeln für den Sitzungsstatus einhalten, um Abstürze zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python e Streamlit","Específico para estrutura e arquivos de projeto AGILAB","Deve aderir às regras de estado de sessão para evitar falhas"],"ru":["Требует установки Python и Streamlit","Специфичен для структуры и файлов проекта AGILAB","Должен соблюдать правила состояния сессии, чтобы избежать сбоев"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بايثون و Streamlit","محدد لهيكل وملفات مشروع AGILAB","يجب اتباع قواعد حالة الجلسة لتجنب الأعطال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tidalhq/lint-action/release', 'community', 'tidalhq', 'lint-action', 'tidalhq/lint-action', 'release', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:45:10.518Z', NULL, '{"id":"tidalhq/lint-action/release","name":"release","description":{"zh":"Release 技术文档用于自动化版本发布流程，包括版本号增加和 Git 标签推送。它可以确保代码库的版本一致性","ja":"Release スキルはバージョン公開プロセスを自動化するために使用され、バージョン番号の増加と Git タグのプッシュを含みます","ko":"Release 기술 문서는 버전发布 프로세스를 자동화하고 버전 번호를 증가시키며 Git 태그를 푸시하여 코드 저장소의 버전 일관성을 유지합니다","es":"El skill de release automatiza el proceso de lanzamiento de versión, incluyendo el bump de versión y el etiquetado","fr":"Le skill de release automatise le processus de publication de version, incluant le bump de version et l''étiquetage","de":"Der Release-Skill automatisiert den Versionsveröffentlichungsprozess, einschließlich Versionssprung und Tagging","pt":"A skill de release é uma ferramenta para automatizar o processo de release de software, garantindo que as alterações sejam commitadas, versionadas e publicadas corretamente","ru":"Навык выпуска - это инструмент для автоматизации процесса выпуска программного обеспечения, гарантирующий, что изменения будут зафиксированы, пронумерованы и опубликованы корректно","ar":"مهارة الإصدار هي أداة لتحسين عملية الإصدار البرمجية، وتضمن أن يتم.commit وتسجيل وإصدار التغييرات بشكل صحيح","en":"fork of https://github.com/wearerequired/lint-action"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Release 技术文档 - 自动化版本发布","ja":"Release スキル - 自動バージョン公開","ko":"Release 기술 문서 - 자동 버전发布","es":"Herramienta de lanzamiento de versión","fr":"Outil de publication de version","de":"Version-Release-Tool","pt":"Habilite a Skill de Release para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Активируйте навык выпуска для разработчиков","ar":"تفعيل مهارة الإصدار لل مطورين","en":"release"},"description":{"zh":"Release 技术文档用于自动化版本发布流程，包括版本号增加和 Git 标签推送。它可以确保代码库的版本一致性","ja":"Release スキルはバージョン公開プロセスを自動化するために使用され、バージョン番号の増加と Git タグのプッシュを含みます","ko":"Release 기술 문서는 버전发布 프로세스를 자동화하고 버전 번호를 증가시키며 Git 태그를 푸시하여 코드 저장소의 버전 일관성을 유지합니다","es":"El skill de release automatiza el proceso de lanzamiento de versión, incluyendo el bump de versión y el etiquetado","fr":"Le skill de release automatise le processus de publication de version, incluant le bump de version et l''étiquetage","de":"Der Release-Skill automatisiert den Versionsveröffentlichungsprozess, einschließlich Versionssprung und Tagging","pt":"A skill de release é uma ferramenta para automatizar o processo de release de software, garantindo que as alterações sejam commitadas, versionadas e publicad...","ru":"Навык выпуска - это инструмент для автоматизации процесса выпуска программного обеспечения, гарантирующий, что изменения будут зафиксированы, пронумерованы и...","ar":"مهارة الإصدار هي أداة لتحسين عملية الإصدار البرمجية، وتضمن أن يتم.commit وتسجيل وإصدار التغييرات بشكل صحيح","en":"fork of https://github.com/wearerequired/lint-action"},"definition":{"en":"fork of https://github.com/wearerequired/lint-action"},"features":{"zh":["自动化版本发布","版本号增加","Git 标签推送","代码库版本一致性","简化版本管理"],"ja":["自動バージョン公開","バージョン番号の増加","Git タグのプッシュ","コードリポジトリのバージョンの一貫性","バージョン管理の簡素化"],"ko":["자동 버전发布","버전 번호 증가","Git 태그 푸시","코드 저장소 버전 일관성","버전 관리 간소화"],"es":["Bump de versión automático","Etiquetado de versiones","Confirmación de estado de repositorio","Lectura de versión actual desde package.json"],"fr":["Bump de version automatique","Étiquetage de versions","Confirmation de l''état du référentiel","Lecture de la version actuelle depuis package.json"],"de":["Automatischer Versionssprung","Tagging von Versionen","Bestätigung des Repository-Status","Lesen der aktuellen Version aus package.json"],"pt":["Automatização do processo de release","Commit e versionamento automático","Publicação de tags no GitHub","Leitura da versão atual do package.json","Determinação do nome da tag principal"],"ru":["Автоматизация процесса выпуска","Автоматическое коммитирование и версионирование","Публикация тегов в GitHub","Чтение текущей версии package.json","Определение имени основной теговой метки"],"ar":["أتمتة عملية الإصدار","التعهد والتسجيل التلقائي","نشر التصنيفات في جيت هاب","قراءة الإصدار الحالي من package.json","تحديد اسم العلامة الرئيسية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Release 技术文档","自动化版本发布","版本管理","Git 标签","代码库版本一致性"],"ja":["Release スキル","自動バージョン公開","バージョン管理","Git タグ","コードリポジトリのバージョンの一貫性"],"ko":["Release 기술 문서","자동 버전发布","버전 관리","Git 태그","코드 저장소 버전 일관성"],"es":["lanzamiento de versión","bump de versión","etiquetado de versiones","automatización de procesos","desarrollo de software","gestión de versiones"],"fr":["publication de version","bump de version","étiquetage de versions","automatisation de processus","développement de logiciel","gestion de versions"],"de":["Versionsveröffentlichung","Versionssprung","Tagging von Versionen","Automatisierung von Prozessen","Software-Entwicklung","Versionsverwaltung"],"pt":["skill de release","automatização de release","desenvolvimento de software","github","package.json","versionamento"],"ru":["навык выпуска","автоматизация выпуска","разработка программного обеспечения","github","package.json","версионирование"],"ar":["مهارة الإصدار","أتمتة الإصدار","تطوير البرمجيات","جيت هاب","package.json","التسجيل"]}},"owner":"tidalhq","repo":"lint-action","repoPath":"tidalhq/lint-action","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release","description":"Bump package version, commit all changes, tag release, retag major, push commit and tags.","bodyPreview":"# Release Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user asks to release or “commit, bump, and push tags”.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) **Preflight**\n   - Run `git status --short --branch` and confirm the repo is clean or that all changes should be included.\n   - Read current version from `package.json` (Node): `node -p \"require(''./package.json'').version\"`.\n   - Determine the major tag name to move (e.g., `v2` for `2.x.x`).\n\n2) **Version bump**\n   - Bump patch unless the user specified.\n   - Command: `npm version patc","body":"# Release Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user asks to release or “commit, bump, and push tags”.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) **Preflight**\n   - Run `git status --short --branch` and confirm the repo is clean or that all changes should be included.\n   - Read current version from `package.json` (Node): `node -p \"require(''./package.json'').version\"`.\n   - Determine the major tag name to move (e.g., `v2` for `2.x.x`).\n\n2) **Version bump**\n   - Bump patch unless the user specified.\n   - Command: `npm version patch --no-git-tag-version`.\n   - If the user specifies a version or bump type, use that instead (`minor`, `major`, or explicit `x.y.z`).\n\n3) **Build (if applicable)**\n   - If the repo bundles artifacts (e.g., `dist/` via `ncc`), rebuild after the version bump so the bundled version is correct.\n   - Typical command: `yarn build` (or project-specific build step).\n\n4) **Commit**\n   - Stage all relevant changes for the release (including rebuilt artifacts).\n   - Commit message format:\n     - Subject: `Release vX.Y.Z` (use new version)\n     - Optional body: short bullets describing key changes if already known.\n\n5) **Tagging**\n   - Create annotated tag for the new version: `git tag -a vX.Y.Z -m \"vX.Y.Z\"`.\n   - Retag the major alias to the new commit (e.g., `v2`): `git tag -f v2`.\n\n6) **Push**\n   - Push branch: `git push origin <branch>`.\n   - Push tags: `git push origin vX.Y.Z` and force-push the major alias tag: `git push -f origin v2`.\n   - If network fails, rerun with escalation per environment rules.\n\n## Notes\n\n- If there are unrelated local changes, ask before including them.\n- Always report the final commit SHA and the tags pushed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:45:10.518Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Deployment Agents requiring automated version control and release management using Git and npm","zh":"适用于需要使用 Git 和 npm 的自动化版本控制和发布管理的部署代理","ja":"Git と npm を使用した自動化されたバージョン管理とリリース管理を必要とするデプロイエージェントに適しています","ko":"Git 및 npm을 사용하는 자동화된 버전 관리 및 릴리스 관리가 필요한 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de implementación que requieren control de versiones automatizado y administración de lanzamientos utilizando Git y npm","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de déploiement nécessitant un contrôle de version automatisé et une gestion de versions utilisant Git et npm","de":"Ideal für Deployment-Agents, die automatisierte Versionskontrolle und Release-Management mit Git und npm benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de implantação que exigem controle de versão automatizado e gerenciamento de lançamento usando Git e npm","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов развертывания, требующих автоматизированного управления версиями и выпусками с помощью Git и npm","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تتطلب التحكم التلقائي في الإصدار و إدارة الإصدار باستخدام Git و npm"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to commit, bump, and push tags using npm version and Git, streamlining the release process with automated version bumps and tag management, leveraging package.json and git status","zh":"赋予代理提交、升级和推送标签的能力，使用 npm 版本和 Git 流程简化发布过程，自动化版本升级和标签管理，利用 package.json 和 git 状态","ja":"エージェントにコミット、バンプ、プッシュタグの機能を付与し、npm バージョンと Git を使用してリリースプロセスを簡素化し、自動バージョンアップとタグ管理を実現し、package.json と git 状態を利用する","ko":"에이전트가 커밋, 버мп, 푸시 태그를 사용할 수 있도록 하여 npm 버전 및 Git을 사용하여 릴리스 프로세스를 간소화하고 자동 버전 업그레이드 및 태그 관리를 통해 package.json 및 Git 상태를 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a confirmar, incrementar y enviar etiquetas utilizando npm versión y Git, simplificando el proceso de lanzamiento con incrementos de versión automatizados y gestión de etiquetas, aprovechando package.json y git status","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider, d''incrémenter et de pousser des balises à l''aide de npm version et Git, rationalisant le processus de version avec des increments de version automatisés et une gestion de balises, en exploitant package.json et git status","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Commits durchzuführen, die Versionsnummer zu erhöhen und Tags mithilfe von npm-Version und Git zu pushen, wodurch der Release-Prozess durch automatisierte Versionsnummern und Tag-Management mit package.json und git status rationalisiert wird","pt":"Permite que os agentes façam commit, aumentem e enviem tags usando npm version e Git, simplificando o processo de lançamento com aumentos de versão automatizados e gerenciamento de tags, aproveitando package.json e git status","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность совершать коммиты, увеличивать версию и отправлять теги с помощью npm version и Git, оптимизируя процесс выпуска за счет автоматического увеличения версии и управления тегами, используя package.json и git status","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التعديل ورفع الإصدارات و إرسال التصنيفات باستخدام إصدار npm و Git، و يبسط عملية إصدار بإصدارات تلقائية و إدارة التصنيفات، مستفيدا من package.json و حالة Git"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating patch version bumps for minor updates","Generating and pushing new tags for major releases using Git","Validating repository cleanliness with git status before release"],"zh":["自动化为次要更新补丁版本","使用 Git 为主要版本生成和推送新标签","在发布前使用 git 状态验证存储库的清洁度"],"ja":["マイナーアップデートのパッチバージョンの自動化","Git を使用してメジャーリリースの新しいタグを生成してプッシュする","リリース前に git 状態を使用してリポジトリのクリーンさを検証する"],"ko":["소규모 업데이트를 위한 패치 버전 자동화","Git을 사용하여 주요 릴리스를 위한 새로운 태그를 생성 및 푸시","릴리스 전에 Git 상태를 사용하여 저장소의 깨끗함을 확인"],"es":["Automatizar incrementos de versión de revisión para actualizaciones menores","Generar y enviar nuevas etiquetas para lanzamientos importantes utilizando Git","Validar la limpieza del repositorio con git status antes del lanzamiento"],"fr":["Automatiser les increments de version de correctif pour les mises à jour mineures","Générer et pousser de nouvelles balises pour les versions majeures à l''aide de Git","Valider la propreté du référentiel avec git status avant la version"],"de":["Automatisieren von Patch-Version-Incrementen für kleine Updates","Erzeugen und Pushen neuer Tags für große Releases unter Verwendung von Git","Überprüfen der Sauberkeit des Repositorys mit git status vor dem Release"],"pt":["Automatizar aumentos de versão de patch para atualizações menores","Gerar e enviar novas tags para lançamentos principais usando Git","Validar a limpeza do repositório com git status antes do lançamento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать увеличение версии патча для незначительных обновлений","Генерировать и отправлять новые теги для основных выпусков с помощью Git","Проверять чистоту репозитория с помощью git status перед выпуском"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات إصدار باتش آلية لتحديثات صغيرة","إنشاء و إرسال تصنيفات جديدة للإصدارات الرئيسية باستخدام Git","التحقق من نظافة المستودع باستخدام حالة Git قبل الإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git and npm installed","Limited to Node-based projects with package.json","Assumes a clean or intentionally dirty repository state"],"zh":["需要安装 Git 和 npm","仅限于具有 package.json 的基于 Node 的项目","假设存储库状态是干净或故意脏"],"ja":["Git と npm をインストールする必要がある","package.json を持つ Node ベースのプロジェクトに限定される","リポジトリ状態がクリーンまたは意図的に汚れていると仮定する"],"ko":["Git 및 npm을 설치해야 함","package.json을 갖는 Node 기반 프로젝트에만 제한됨","저장소 상태가 깨끗하거나 의도적으로 더러운 것으로 가정"],"es":["Requiere Git y npm instalados","Limitado a proyectos basados en Node con package.json","Supone un estado de repositorio limpio o intencionalmente sucio"],"fr":["Nécessite Git et npm installés","Limité aux projets basés sur Node avec package.json","Suppose un état de référentiel propre ou intentionnellement sale"],"de":["Benötigt Git und npm installiert","Begrenzt auf Node-basierte Projekte mit package.json","Geht von einem sauberen oder absichtlich schmutzigen Repository-Zustand aus"],"pt":["Exige Git e npm instalados","Limitado a projetos baseados em Node com package.json","Supõe um estado de repositório limpo ou intencionalmente sujo"],"ru":["Требует установленного Git и npm","Ограничен проектами на основе Node с package.json","Предполагает чистое или намеренно грязное состояние репозитория"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Git و npm","محدود بمشاريع Node مع package.json","يفترض حالة مستودع نظيف أو متسخ عمدا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('zaziedlm/openai-agents-python/docs-sync', 'community', 'zaziedlm', 'openai-agents-python', 'zaziedlm/openai-agents-python', 'docs-sync', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:45:18.977Z', NULL, '{"id":"zaziedlm/openai-agents-python/docs-sync","name":"docs-sync","description":{"zh":"docs-sync是一种通过比较主分支特性和配置选项与当前文档结构来识别文档覆盖范围的差距和不准确性，并提出有针对性的改进的技术。","ja":"docs-syncは、メインブランチの機能と設定オプションを現在のドキュメント構造と比較して、ドキュメントのカバー範囲のギャップと不正確性を特定し、ターゲットを絞った改善を提案する技術です。","ko":"docs-sync는 메인 브랜치의 기능과 설정 옵션을 현재 문서 구조와 비교하여 문서 범위의 차이점과 부정확성을 식별하고, 대상이 되는 개선을 제안하는 기술입니다.","es":"Docs Sync es una herramienta que ayuda a identificar lagunas y errores en la documentación, proponiendo mejoras específicas. Analiza la estructura de la documentación y compara características y opciones de configuración.","fr":"Docs Sync est un outil qui aide à identifier les lacunes et les erreurs dans la documentation, en proposant des améliorations ciblées. Il analyse la structure de la documentation et compare les fonctionnalités et les options de configuration.","de":"Docs Sync ist ein Tool, das dabei hilft, Lücken und Fehler in der Dokumentation zu identifizieren und gezielte Verbesserungen vorzuschlagen. Es analysiert die Dokumentenstruktur und vergleicht Funktionen und Konfigurationsoptionen.","pt":"A ferramenta Docs Sync é uma solução para identificar lacunas e imprecisões na documentação, comparando recursos e opções de configuração.","ru":"Инструмент Docs Sync является решением для выявления пробелов и неточностей в документации, сравнивая функции и опции конфигурации.","ar":"أداة دокс سينك هي حل لتحديد الفجوات والغموض في الوثائق، من خلال مقارنة الميزات وخيارات التكوين.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"docs-sync: 文档同步与优化","ja":"docs-sync: ドキュメントの同期と最適化","ko":"docs-sync: 문서 동기화 및 최적화","es":"Docs Sync: Mejora la cobertura de la documentación","fr":"Docs Sync: Améliorez la couverture de la documentation","de":"Docs Sync: Verbessern Sie die Dokumentenabdeckung","pt":"Docs Sync: Ferramenta de Análise de Documentação","ru":"Docs Sync: Инструмент для анализа документации","ar":"دокс سينك: أداة تحليل الوثائق","en":"docs-sync"},"description":{"zh":"docs-sync是一种通过比较主分支特性和配置选项与当前文档结构来识别文档覆盖范围的差距和不准确性，并提出有针对性的改进的技术。","ja":"docs-syncは、メインブランチの機能と設定オプションを現在のドキュメント構造と比較して、ドキュメントのカバー範囲のギャップと不正確性を特定し、ターゲットを絞った改善を提案する技術です。","ko":"docs-sync는 메인 브랜치의 기능과 설정 옵션을 현재 문서 구조와 비교하여 문서 범위의 차이점과 부정확성을 식별하고, 대상이 되는 개선을 제안하는 기술입니다.","es":"Docs Sync es una herramienta que ayuda a identificar lagunas y errores en la documentación, proponiendo mejoras específicas. Analiza la estructura de la docu...","fr":"Docs Sync est un outil qui aide à identifier les lacunes et les erreurs dans la documentation, en proposant des améliorations ciblées. Il analyse la structur...","de":"Docs Sync ist ein Tool, das dabei hilft, Lücken und Fehler in der Dokumentation zu identifizieren und gezielte Verbesserungen vorzuschlagen. Es analysiert di...","pt":"A ferramenta Docs Sync é uma solução para identificar lacunas e imprecisões na documentação, comparando recursos e opções de configuração.","ru":"Инструмент Docs Sync является решением для выявления пробелов и неточностей в документации, сравнивая функции и опции конфигурации.","ar":"أداة دокс سينك هي حل لتحديد الفجوات والغموض في الوثائق، من خلال مقارنة الميزات وخيارات التكوين.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["识别文档覆盖范围的差距和不准确性","比较主分支特性和配置选项与当前文档结构","提出有针对性的改进","支持多分支比较","自动化文档更新"],"ja":["ドキュメントのカバー範囲のギャップと不正確性を特定","メインブランチの機能と設定オプションを現在のドキュメント構造と比較","ターゲットを絞った改善を提案","複数ブランチの比較をサポート","ドキュメントの自動更新"],"ko":["문서 범위의 차이점과 부정확성을 식별","메인 브랜치의 기능과 설정 옵션을 현재 문서 구조와 비교","대상이 되는 개선을 제안","다중 브랜치 비교를 지원","문서 자동 업데이트"],"es":["Identifica lagunas en la cobertura de la documentación","Analiza la estructura de la documentación","Compara características y opciones de configuración","Propone mejoras específicas","Análisis de la rama principal y la rama base"],"fr":["Identifie les lacunes dans la couverture de la documentation","Analyse la structure de la documentation","Compare les fonctionnalités et les options de configuration","Propose des améliorations ciblées","Analyse de la branche principale et de la branche de base"],"de":["Identifiziert Lücken in der Dokumentenabdeckung","Analysiert die Dokumentenstruktur","Vergleicht Funktionen und Konfigurationsoptionen","Schlägt gezielte Verbesserungen vor","Analyse des Hauptzweigs und des Basiszweigs"],"pt":["Análise de lacunas na documentação","Comparação de recursos e opções de configuração","Identificação de imprecisões na documentação","Proposta de melhorias targetizadas","Análise do diff entre branches"],"ru":["Анализ пробелов в документации","Сравнение функций и опций конфигурации","Выявление неточностей в документации","Предложение целевых улучшений","Анализ diff между ветками"],"ar":["تحليل الفجوات في الوثائق","مقارنة الميزات وخيارات التكوين","تحديد الغموض في الوثائق","طرح تحسينات مستهدفة","تحليل الاختلافات بين الفروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["文档同步","docs-sync","文档覆盖范围","文档不准确性","自动化文档更新","多分支比较"],"ja":["ドキュメント同期","docs-sync","ドキュメントのカバー範囲","ドキュメントの不正確性","ドキュメントの自動更新","複数ブランチの比較"],"ko":["문서 동기화","docs-sync","문서 범위","문서 부정확성","문서 자동 업데이트","다중 브랜치 비교"],"es":["docs sync","sincronización de documentación","cobertura de documentación","análisis de documentación","mejora de documentación","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["docs sync","synchronisation de documentation","couverture de documentation","analyse de documentation","amélioration de documentation","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["docs sync","dokumentensynchronisation","dokumentenabdeckung","dokumentenanalyse","dokumentenverbesserung","softwareentwicklung","entwicklungstools"],"pt":["análise de documentação","ferramenta de análise","documentação de software","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade da documentação","melhoria da documentação"],"ru":["анализ документации","инструмент для анализа","документация программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","качество документации","улучшение документации"],"ar":["تحليل الوثائق","أداة التحليل","وثائق البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الوثائق","تحسين الوثائق"]}},"owner":"zaziedlm","repo":"openai-agents-python","repoPath":"zaziedlm/openai-agents-python","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs-sync","description":"Analyze main branch implementation and configuration to find missing, incorrect, or outdated documentation in docs/. Use when asked to audit doc coverage, sync docs with code, or propose doc updates/structure changes. Only update English docs under docs/** and never touch translated docs under docs/ja, docs/ko, or docs/zh. Provide a report and ask for approval before editing docs.","bodyPreview":"# Docs Sync\n\n## Overview\n\nIdentify doc coverage gaps and inaccuracies by comparing main branch features and configuration options against the current docs structure, then propose targeted improvements.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Confirm scope and base branch\n   - Identify the current branch and default branch (usually `main`).\n   - Prefer analyzing the current branch to keep work aligned with in-flight changes.\n   - If the current branch is not `main`, analyze only the diff vs `main` to scope doc updates.","body":"# Docs Sync\n\n## Overview\n\nIdentify doc coverage gaps and inaccuracies by comparing main branch features and configuration options against the current docs structure, then propose targeted improvements.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Confirm scope and base branch\n   - Identify the current branch and default branch (usually `main`).\n   - Prefer analyzing the current branch to keep work aligned with in-flight changes.\n   - If the current branch is not `main`, analyze only the diff vs `main` to scope doc updates.\n   - Avoid switching branches if it would disrupt local changes; use `git show main:<path>` or `git worktree add` when needed.\n\n2. Build a feature inventory from the selected scope\n   - If on `main`: inventory the full surface area and review docs comprehensively.\n   - If not on `main`: inventory only changes vs `main` (feature additions/changes/removals).\n   - Focus on user-facing behavior: public exports, configuration options, environment variables, CLI commands, default values, and documented runtime behaviors.\n   - Capture evidence for each item (file path + symbol/setting).\n   - Use targeted search to find option types and feature flags (for example: `rg \"Settings\"`, `rg \"Config\"`, `rg \"os.environ\"`, `rg \"OPENAI_\"`).\n   - When the topic involves OpenAI platform features, invoke `$openai-knowledge` to pull current details from the OpenAI Developer Docs MCP server instead of guessing, while treating the SDK source code as the source of truth when discrepancies appear.\n\n3. Doc-first pass: review existing pages\n   - Walk each relevant page under `docs/` (excluding `docs/ja`, `docs/ko`, and `docs/zh`).\n   - Identify missing mentions of important, supported options (opt-in flags, env vars), customization points, or new features from `src/agents/` and `examples/`.\n   - Propose additions where users would reasonably expect to find them on that page.\n\n4. Code-first pass: map features to docs\n   - Review the current docs information architecture under `docs/` and `mkdocs.yml`.\n   - Determine the best page/section for each feature based on existing patterns and the API reference structure under `docs/ref`.\n   - Identify features that lack any doc page or have a page but no corresponding content.\n   - Note when a structural adjustment would improve discoverability.\n   - When improving `docs/ref/*` pages, treat the corresponding docstrings/comments in `src/` as the source of truth. Prefer updating those code comments so regenerated reference docs stay correct, instead of hand-editing the generated pages.\n\n5. Detect gaps and inaccuracies\n   - **Missing**: features/configs present in main but absent in docs.\n   - **Incorrect/outdated**: names, defaults, or behaviors that diverge from main.\n   - **Structural issues** (optional): pages overloaded, missing overviews, or mis-grouped topics.\n\n6. Produce a Docs Sync Report and ask for approval\n   - Provide a clear report with evidence, suggested doc locations, and proposed edits.\n   - Ask the user whether to proceed with doc updates.\n\n7. If approved, apply changes (English only)\n   - Edit only English docs in `docs/**`.\n   - Do **not** edit `docs/ja`, `docs/ko`, or `docs/zh`.\n   - Keep changes aligned with the existing docs style and navigation.\n   - Update `mkdocs.yml` when adding or renaming pages.\n   - Build docs with `make build-docs` after edits to verify the docs site still builds.\n\n## Output format\n\nUse this template when reporting findings:\n\nDocs Sync Report\n\n- Doc-first findings\n  - Page + missing content -> evidence + suggested insertion point\n- Code-first gaps\n  - Feature + evidence -> suggested doc page/section (or missing page)\n- Incorrect or outdated docs\n  - Doc file + issue + correct info + evidence\n- Structural suggestions (optional)\n  - Proposed change + rationale\n- Proposed edits\n  - Doc file -> concise change summary\n- Questions for the user\n\n## References\n\n- `references/doc-coverage-checklist.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:45:18.977Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Documentation Agents needing to identify coverage gaps and inaccuracies in documentation structure","zh":"适用于需要识别文档覆盖缺口和不准确之处的文档代理","ja":"ドキュメントエージェントがドキュメント構造のカバレージギャップや不正確性を特定する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"문서 에이전트가 문서 구조의 커버리지 격차와 부정확성을 식별해야 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de documentación que necesitan identificar brechas de cobertura y errores en la estructura de la documentación","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de documentation ayant besoin d''identifier les lacunes de couverture et les inexactitudes dans la structure de la documentation","de":"Ideal für Dokumentationsagenten, die Abdeckungslücken und Ungenauigkeiten in der Dokumentenstruktur identifizieren müssen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Documentação que precisam identificar lacunas de cobertura e imprecisões na estrutura da documentação","ru":"Идеально для агентов документации, которым необходимо выявлять пробелы в покрытии и неточности в структуре документации","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الوثائقية الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديد الفجوات في التغطية والغموض في هيكل الوثائق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compare main branch features and configuration options against the current docs structure, proposing targeted improvements using diff analysis and branch comparison, and supporting documentation updates through scoped analysis of the current branch vs the default branch, usually ''main''","zh":"赋予代理比较主分支功能和配置选项与当前文档结构，并通过差异分析和分支比较提出有针对性的改进建议，同时通过当前分支与默认分支的范围分析支持文档更新，通常为''main''","ja":"メインブランチの機能と構成オプションを現在のドキュメント構造と比較し、差分分析とブランチ比較を使用してターゲットを絞った改善を提案し、現在のブランチとデフォルトブランチ（通常は''main''）の範囲分析を介してドキュメントの更新をサポートする","ko":"메인 브랜치의 기능과 구성 옵션을 현재 문서 구조와 비교하고, 차이 분석과 브랜치 비교를 사용하여 타겟을 좁은 개선을 제안하며, 현재 브랜치와 기본 브랜치(일반적으로 ''main'')의 범위 분석을 통해 문서 업데이트를 지원","es":"Permite a los agentes comparar las características de la rama principal y las opciones de configuración con la estructura actual de la documentación, proponiendo mejoras dirigidas mediante análisis de diferencias y comparación de ramas, y apoyando las actualizaciones de la documentación a través del análisis de alcance de la rama actual versus la rama predeterminada, generalmente ''main''","fr":"Permet aux agents de comparer les fonctionnalités de la branche principale et les options de configuration avec la structure actuelle de la documentation, en proposant des améliorations ciblées à l''aide de l''analyse des différences et de la comparaison des branches, et en soutenant les mises à jour de la documentation grâce à l''analyse de portée de la branche actuelle par rapport à la branche par défaut, généralement ''main''","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Hauptbranchenmerkmale und Konfigurationsoptionen mit der aktuellen Dokumentenstruktur zu vergleichen, gezielte Verbesserungen unter Verwendung von Differenzanalyse und Branchenvergleich vorzuschlagen und Dokumentenaktualisierungen durch einen bereichsbezogenen Vergleich der aktuellen mit der Standardbranch, in der Regel ''main'', zu unterstützen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a comparar recursos da branch principal e opções de configuração com a estrutura atual dos documentos, propondo melhorias direcionadas usando análise de diferenças e comparação de branch, e apoiando atualizações de documentação por meio de análise com escopo da branch atual versus a branch padrão, geralmente ''main''","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью сравнивать функции основной ветки и параметры конфигурации с текущей структурой документации, предлагая целенаправленные улучшения с использованием анализа различий и сравнения веток, и поддерживая обновления документации посредством анализа с ограниченным объемом текущей ветки по сравнению с веткой по умолчанию, обычно ''main''","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من مقارنة ميزات الفرع الرئيسي وخيارات التكوين بالهيكل الحالي للوثائق، وتقديم تحسينات موجهة باستخدام تحليل الفرق ومقارنة الفرع، ودعم تحديثات الوثائق من خلال تحليل نطاق الفرع الحالي مقابل الفرع الافتراضي، وعادة ''main''"},"useCases":{"en":["Identifying doc coverage gaps","Analyzing inaccuracies in documentation structure","Proposing targeted improvements to documentation"],"zh":["识别文档覆盖缺口","分析文档结构的不准确性","提出文档的有针对性的改进"],"ja":["ドキュメントのカバレージギャップの特定","ドキュメント構造の不正確性の分析","ドキュメントのターゲットを絞った改善の提案"],"ko":["문서 커버리지 격차 식별","문서 구조의 부정확성 분석","문서의 타겟을 좁은 개선 제안"],"es":["Identificar brechas de cobertura de la documentación","Analizar inexactitudes en la estructura de la documentación","Proponer mejoras dirigidas a la documentación"],"fr":["Identifier les lacunes de couverture de la documentation","Analyser les inexactitudes dans la structure de la documentation","Proposer des améliorations ciblées pour la documentation"],"de":["Identifizierung von Abdeckungslücken in der Dokumentation","Analyse von Ungenauigkeiten in der Dokumentenstruktur","Vorschlag gezielter Verbesserungen für die Dokumentation"],"pt":["Identificar lacunas de cobertura dos documentos","Analizar imprecisões na estrutura da documentação","Propor melhorias direcionadas para a documentação"],"ru":["Выявление пробелов в покрытии документации","Анализ неточностей в структуре документации","Предложение целенаправленных улучшений документации"],"ar":["تحديد فجوات التغطية في الوثائق","تحليل الغموض في هيكل الوثائق","اقتراح تحسينات موجهة للوثائق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the main branch and default branch","Limited to analyzing differences between the current branch and the main branch"],"zh":["需要访问主分支和默认分支","仅限于分析当前分支和主分支之间的差异"],"ja":["メインブランチとデフォルトブランチへのアクセスが必要","現在のブランチとメインブランチの間の差異の分析のみ"],"ko":["메인 브랜치와 기본 브랜치에 대한 액세스가 필요","현재 브랜치와 메인 브랜치 사이의 차이 분석만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la rama principal y a la rama predeterminada","Limitado a analizar las diferencias entre la rama actual y la rama principal"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à la branche principale et à la branche par défaut","Limité à l''analyse des différences entre la branche actuelle et la branche principale"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Haupt- und die Standardbranch","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Unterschieden zwischen der aktuellen und der Hauptbranch"],"pt":["Exige acesso à branch principal e à branch padrão","Limitado à análise de diferenças entre a branch atual e a branch principal"],"ru":["Требует доступа к основной ветке и ветке по умолчанию","Ограничен анализом различий между текущей веткой и основной веткой"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الفرع الرئيسي والفرع الافتراضي","محدود بتحليل الفرق بين الفرع الحالي والفرع الرئيسي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jaxxstorm/landlord/openspec-explore', 'community', 'jaxxstorm', 'landlord', 'jaxxstorm/landlord', 'openspec-explore', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:44:48.774Z', NULL, '{"id":"jaxxstorm/landlord/openspec-explore","name":"openspec-explore","description":{"zh":"openspec-explore技能允许您探索和可视化代码库，创建OpenSpec文档","ja":"openspec-exploreスキルは、コードベースを探索して可視化し、OpenSpecドキュメントを作成することを可能にします","ko":"openspec-explore 기술은 코드베이스를 탐색하고 시각화하여 OpenSpec 문서를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"El modo de exploración de OpenSpec permite a los desarrolladores investigar y planificar sin implementar código, creando artefactos como propuestas y diseños","fr":"Le mode d''exploration d''OpenSpec permet aux développeurs d''investiguer et de planifier sans implémenter de code, en créant des artefacts tels que des propositions et des conceptions","de":"Der Explorationsmodus von OpenSpec ermöglicht es Entwicklern, zu untersuchen und zu planen, ohne Code zu implementieren, und dabei Artefakte wie Vorschläge und Entwürfe zu erstellen","pt":"O modo de exploração OpenSpec é um recurso que permite pensar e visualizar livremente, sem implementar código","ru":"Режим исследования OpenSpec - это функция, которая позволяет глубоко подумать и визуализировать без реализации кода","ar":"وضع الاستكشاف OpenSpec هو ميزة تسمح بالتفكير والتصور بحرية دون تنفيذ الكود","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-explore技能：探索和可视化","ja":"openspec-exploreスキル：探索と可視化","ko":"openspec-explore 기술: 탐색 및 시각화","es":"Explora OpenSpec: modo de exploración para desarrolladores","fr":"Découvrez OpenSpec: mode d''exploration pour les développeurs","de":"Entdecken Sie OpenSpec: Explorationsmodus für Entwickler","pt":"Modo de Exploração OpenSpec","ru":"Режим исследования OpenSpec","ar":"وضع الاستكشاف OpenSpec","en":"openspec-explore"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-explore技能允许您探索和可视化代码库，创建OpenSpec文档","ja":"openspec-exploreスキルは、コードベースを探索して可視化し、OpenSpecドキュメントを作成することを可能にします","ko":"openspec-explore 기술은 코드베이스를 탐색하고 시각화하여 OpenSpec 문서를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"El modo de exploración de OpenSpec permite a los desarrolladores investigar y planificar sin implementar código, creando artefactos como propuestas y diseños","fr":"Le mode d''exploration d''OpenSpec permet aux développeurs d''investiguer et de planifier sans implémenter de code, en créant des artefacts tels que des proposi...","de":"Der Explorationsmodus von OpenSpec ermöglicht es Entwicklern, zu untersuchen und zu planen, ohne Code zu implementieren, und dabei Artefakte wie Vorschläge u...","pt":"O modo de exploração OpenSpec é um recurso que permite pensar e visualizar livremente, sem implementar código","ru":"Режим исследования OpenSpec - это функция, которая позволяет глубоко подумать и визуализировать без реализации кода","ar":"وضع الاستكشاف OpenSpec هو ميزة تسمح بالتفكير والتصور بحرية دون تنفيذ الكود","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["探索代码库","可视化代码结构","创建OpenSpec文档","搜索代码","阅读文件"],"ja":["コードベースの探索","コード構造の可視化","OpenSpecドキュメントの作成","コードの検索","ファイルの読み取り"],"ko":["코드베이스 탐색","코드 구조 시각화","OpenSpec 문서 생성","코드 검색","파일 읽기"],"es":["Investigación de código sin implementación","Creación de artefactos OpenSpec","Planificación y diseño de características","No requiere implementación de código","Permite la lectura de archivos y búsqueda de código"],"fr":["Investigation de code sans implémentation","Création d''artefacts OpenSpec","Planification et conception de fonctionnalités","Nécessite pas d''implémentation de code","Permet la lecture de fichiers et la recherche de code"],"de":["Untersuchung von Code ohne Implementierung","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten","Planung und Entwurf von Funktionen","Erfordert keine Implementierung von Code","Ermöglicht das Lesen von Dateien und die Suche nach Code"],"pt":["Pensar e visualizar livremente","Investigar o código e a base de código","Criar artefatos OpenSpec","Não implementar código","Usar comandos como /opsx:new ou /opsx:ff"],"ru":["Глубоко подумать и визуализировать","Исследовать код и кодовую базу","Создавать артефакты OpenSpec","Не реализовывать код","Использовать команды как /opsx:new или /opsx:ff"],"ar":["التفكير والتصور بحرية","التحقيق في الكود وقاعدة الكود","إنشاء مكونات OpenSpec","عدم تنفيذ الكود","استخدام أوامر مثل /opsx:new أو /opsx:ff"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-explore","代码库探索","可视化","OpenSpec","代码搜索","文件阅读"],"ja":["openspec-explore","コードベース探索","可視化","OpenSpec","コード検索","ファイル読み取り"],"ko":["openspec-explore","코드베이스 탐색","시각화","OpenSpec","코드 검색","파일 읽기"],"es":["OpenSpec","modo de exploración","desarrollo de software","investigación de código","planificación de características","diseño de software","artefactos OpenSpec"],"fr":["OpenSpec","mode d''exploration","développement de logiciels","investigation de code","planification de fonctionnalités","conception de logiciels","artefacts OpenSpec"],"de":["OpenSpec","Explorationsmodus","Softwareentwicklung","Codeuntersuchung","Funktionsplanung","Softwareentwurf","OpenSpec-Artefakte"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","modo de exploração","OpenSpec","investigação de código","artefatos OpenSpec","comandos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","режим исследования","OpenSpec","исследование кода","артефакты OpenSpec","команды разработки"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","وضع الاستكشاف","OpenSpec","تحقيق الكود","مكونات OpenSpec","أوامر التطوير"]}},"owner":"jaxxstorm","repo":"landlord","repoPath":"jaxxstorm/landlord","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s c","body":"Enter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n```bash\nopenspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type | Where to Capture |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made | `design.md` |\n   | Scope changed | `proposal.md` |\n   | New work identified | `tasks.md` |\n   | Assumption invalidated | Relevant artifact |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:44:48.774Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced conversation exploration and OpenSpec artifact creation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级对话探索和 OpenSpec 文档创建能力的 AI 代理。","ja":"高度な会話の探索と OpenSpec アーティファクトの作成機能が必要な AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 대화 탐색 및 OpenSpec 아티팩트 생성 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una exploración de conversación avanzada y capacidades de creación de artefactos OpenSpec.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une exploration de conversation avancée et de capacités de création d''artefacts OpenSpec.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Konversations-Exploration und OpenSpec-Artefakt-Erstellungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de exploração de conversas avançadas e capacidades de criação de artefatos OpenSpec.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности исследования разговоров и создания артефактов OpenSpec.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإي الأي التي تحتاج إلى استكشاف محادثات متقدم وإنشاء ميزات مفتوحة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to think deeply and visualize freely, following conversations wherever they go, while creating OpenSpec proposals, designs, and specs, all without writing code, using protocols like `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff` for implementation.","zh":"赋予代理深入思考和自由可视化的能力，遵循对话的任何方向，同时创建 OpenSpec 提案、设计和规格，而无需编写代码，使用诸如 `/opsx:new` 或 `/opsx:ff` 的协议进行实现。","ja":"エージェントに深く考え、自由に視覚化する能力を与え、会話のどこにでも従いながら、OpenSpec の提案、設計、仕様を作成します。コードの記述は不要で、 `/opsx:new` または `/opsx:ff` などのプロトコルを使用して実装します。","ko":"에이전트가 깊이 생각하고 자유롭게 시각화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 대화의 어디로든 따라가며 OpenSpec 제안, 설계, 사양을 생성합니다. 코드를 작성할 필요는 없으며 `/opsx:new` 또는 `/opsx:ff`와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a pensar profundamente y visualizar libremente, siguiendo las conversaciones allá donde vayan, mientras crean propuestas, diseños y especificaciones OpenSpec, todo sin escribir código, utilizando protocolos como `/opsx:new` o `/opsx:ff` para la implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réfléchir profondément et de visualiser librement, en suivant les conversations où qu''elles aillent, tout en créant des propositions, des conceptions et des spécifications OpenSpec, le tout sans écrire de code, en utilisant des protocoles tels que `/opsx:new` ou `/opsx:ff` pour la mise en œuvre.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, tief zu denken und frei zu visualisieren, indem sie Gespräche überall hin verfolgen, während sie OpenSpec-Vorschläge, Entwürfe und Spezifikationen erstellen, all dies ohne Code zu schreiben, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie `/opsx:new` oder `/opsx:ff` für die Implementierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pensar profundamente e visualizar livremente, seguindo as conversas aonde elas forem, enquanto cria propostas, projetos e especificações OpenSpec, tudo sem escrever código, usando protocolos como `/opsx:new` ou `/opsx:ff` para implementação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью глубоко размышлять и свободно визуализировать, следуя за разговорами, куда бы они ни вели, создавая предложения, проекты и спецификации OpenSpec, все без написания кода, используя протоколы, такие как `/opsx:new` или `/opsx:ff`, для реализации.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل تفكير عميق وتخيل حرة ، متابعة المحادثات حيثماذهبت ، مع إنشاء مقترحات وتصاميم ومواصفات مفتوحة ، كل ذلك بدون كتابة رمز ، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل `/opsx:new` أو `/opsx:ff` للتنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Exploring complex conversation topics","Generating OpenSpec artifacts like proposals and designs","Investigating codebases without modifying them"],"zh":["探索复杂的对话主题","生成 OpenSpec 文档，如提案和设计","调查代码库而不修改它们"],"ja":["複雑な会話のトピックを探索する","OpenSpec のアーティファクト such as 提案と設計を生成する","コードベースを変更せずに調査する"],"ko":["복잡한 대화 주제를 탐색한다","OpenSpec 아티팩트 such as 제안 및 설계를 생성한다","코드베이스를 수정하지 않고 조사한다"],"es":["Explorar temas de conversación complejos","Generar artefactos OpenSpec como propuestas y diseños","Investigar bases de código sin modificarlas"],"fr":["Explorer des sujets de conversation complexes","Générer des artefacts OpenSpec tels que des propositions et des conceptions","Investiguer des bases de code sans les modifier"],"de":["Komplexe Gesprächsthemen erkunden","OpenSpec-Artefakte wie Vorschläge und Entwürfe generieren","Codebasen untersuchen, ohne sie zu ändern"],"pt":["Explorar tópicos de conversação complexos","Gerar artefatos OpenSpec, como propostas e projetos","Investigar repositórios de código sem modificá-los"],"ru":["Изучать сложные темы разговоров","Генерировать артефакты OpenSpec, такие как предложения и проекты","Изучать кодовые базы без их изменения"],"ar":["استكشاف مواضيع محادثة معقدة","إنشاء ميزات مفتوحة مثل المقترحات والتصاميم","تحقيق في قواعد البيانات بدون تعديلها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires user to exit explore mode for implementation using `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`"],"zh":["在探索模式下不能编写代码或实现功能","需要用户退出探索模式，使用 `/opsx:new` 或 `/opsx:ff` 进行实现"],"ja":["探索モードでコードを記述したり、機能を実装したりしてはならない","実装するには `/opsx:new` または `/opsx:ff` を使用して、ユーザーが探索モードを終了する必要がある"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현할 수 없음","구현하려면 `/opsx:new` 또는 `/opsx:ff`를 사용하여 사용자가 탐색 모드를 종료해야 함"],"es":["No debe escribir código o implementar características en el modo de exploración","Requiere que el usuario salga del modo de exploración para la implementación utilizando `/opsx:new` o `/opsx:ff`"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou implémenter des fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Exige que l''utilisateur quitte le mode d''exploration pour la mise en œuvre en utilisant `/opsx:new` ou `/opsx:ff`"],"de":["Darf keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen im Explorationsmodus implementieren","Benutzer muss den Explorationsmodus verlassen, um mithilfe von `/opsx:new` oder `/opsx:ff` zu implementieren"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar recursos no modo de exploração","Exige que o usuário saia do modo de exploração para implementação usando `/opsx:new` ou `/opsx:ff`"],"ru":["Не должно писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме исследования","Требует от пользователя выхода из режима исследования для реализации с помощью `/opsx:new` или `/opsx:ff`"],"ar":["لا يجب كتابة الرمز أو تنفيذ الميزات في وضع الاستكشاف","يتطلب من المستخدم الخروج من وضع الاستكشاف للتنفيذ باستخدام `/opsx:new` أو `/opsx:ff`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
