boss","repo":"loofi-fedora-tweaks","repoPath":"loofitheboss/loofi-fedora-tweaks","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"validate","description":"Check release readiness — version alignment, tests, lint, docs, packaging.","bodyPreview":"# Validate Release Readiness\n\n## Run\n```bash\nbash scripts/workflow-runner.sh {VERSION} validate\n```\n\n## Manual Checks\n1. Version alignment:\n   - `python -c \"import sys; sys.path.insert(0,''loofi-fedora-tweaks''); from version import __version__; print(__version__)\"`\n   - `grep ''^Version:'' loofi-fedora-tweaks.spec | awk ''{print $2}''`\n2. Tests pass: `PYTHONPATH=loofi-fedora-tweaks python -m pytest tests/ -q`\n3. Lint clean: `flake8 loofi-fedora-tweaks/ --max-line-length=150 --ignore=E501,W503,E402,E7","body":"# Validate Release Readiness\n\n## Run\n```bash\nbash scripts/workflow-runner.sh {VERSION} validate\n```\n\n## Manual Checks\n1. Version alignment:\n   - `python -c \"import sys; sys.path.insert(0,''loofi-fedora-tweaks''); from version import __version__; print(__version__)\"`\n   - `grep ''^Version:'' loofi-fedora-tweaks.spec | awk ''{print $2}''`\n2. Tests pass: `PYTHONPATH=loofi-fedora-tweaks python -m pytest tests/ -q`\n3. Lint clean: `flake8 loofi-fedora-tweaks/ --max-line-length=150 --ignore=E501,W503,E402,E722`\n4. CHANGELOG has version entry\n5. README version references correct\n6. Build scripts executable\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:45:17.257Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python-based AI Agents needing automated release validation and testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化发布验证和测试功能的基于Python的AI代理。","ja":"PythonベースのAIエージェントが自動化されたリリース検証とテスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 릴리스 검증 및 테스트 기능이 필요한 Python 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Python que necesitan capacidades de validación y prueba de lanzamiento automatizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Python nécessitant 