],"es":["Contexto de propagación","Piscinas de trabajadores","Apagado elegante","Gorutinas","Control de presión","Uso de memoria"],"fr":["Propagation de contexte","Piscines de travailleurs","Arrêt élégant","Goroutines","Contrôle de pression","Utilisation de la mémoire"],"de":["Kontextweitergabe","Arbeitspool","Elegantes Herunterfahren","Goroutinen","Druckkontrolle","Speicherverwendung"],"pt":["Context propagation","Worker pools","Graceful shutdown","Idempotent consumers","Goroutine model","Backpressure"],"ru":["Контекстная пропагация","Пулы рабочих","Плавное завершение","Идемпотентные потребители","Модель горутин","Бэкпрессура"],"ar":["انتشار السياق","برك العمال","إيقاف تشغيل لطيف","مستهلكات متطابقة","نموذج Горوتين","ضغط خلفي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Go后端开发","高性能CRM","事件驱动架构","人工智能治理","多租户安全","Go开发","后端开发","CRM解决方案"],"ja":["Goバックエンド開発","高性能CRM","イベントドリブンアーキテクチャ","人工知能ガバナンス","マルチテナントセキュリティ","Go開発","バックエンド開発","CRMソリューション"],"ko":["Go 백엔드 개발","고성능 CRM","이벤트驱동 아키텍처","인공지능 거버넌스","멀티 테넌트 보안","Go 개발","백엔드 개발","CRM 솔루션"],"es":["desarrollo de backend","lenguaje de programación Go","contexto de propagación","piscinas de trabajadores","apagado elegante","gorutinas","control de presión","uso de memoria"],"fr":["développement backend","langage de programmation Go","propagation de contexte","piscines de travailleurs","arrêt élégant","goroutines","contrôle de pression","utilisation de la mémoire"],"de":["Backend-Entwicklung","Programmiersprache Go","Kontextweitergabe","Arbeitspool","elegantes Herunterfahren","Goroutinen","Druckkontrolle","Speicherverwendung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento backend","Go","context propagation","worker pools","shutdown gracioso","idempotent consumers","goroutine model","backpressure","desenvolvedores Go"],"ru":["разработка бэкенда","Go","контекстная пропагация","пулы рабочих","плавное завершение","идемпотентные потребители","модель горутин","бэкпрессура","разработчики Go"],"ar":["تطوير الخلفية","Go","انتشار السياق","برك العمال","إيقاف تشغيل لطيف","مستهلكات متطابقة","نموذج Горوتين","ضغط خلفي","مطورون Go"]}},"owner":"Mrgig7","repo":"Multi-Agent-Enterprise-CRM","repoPath":"Mrgig7/Multi-Agent-Enterprise-CRM","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"backend-go","description":"Builds high-performance Go services for Kafka consumers, projectors, and infra components.","bodyPreview":"You are a Go systems engineer.\n\nUse:\n\n- Context propagation\n- Worker pools\n- Graceful shutdown\n- Idempotent consumers\n\nPrimary responsibilities:\n\n- Kafka consumers\n- Read model projectors\n- Snapshot builders\n- Background jobs\n\nExplain:\n\n- Goroutine model\n- Backpressure\n- Memory usage\n- Retry strategy","body":"You are a Go systems engineer.\n\nUse:\n\n- Context propagation\n- Worker pools\n- Graceful shutdown\n- Idempotent consumers\n\nPrimary responsibilities:\n\n- Kafka consumers\n- Read model projectors\n- Snapshot builders\n- Background jobs\n\nExplain:\n\n- Goroutine model\n- Backpressure\n- Memory usage\n- Retry strategy\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:45:35.787Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Go-based AI Agents needing advanced event-driven architecture and Kafka consumer management.","zh":"适用于需要高级事件驱动架构和Kafka消费者管理的Go语言AI代理。","ja":"GoベースのAIエージェントが高度なイベント駆動型アーキテクチャとKafkaコンシューマー管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 이벤트 驱动 아키텍처 및 카프카 소비자 관리가 필요한 Go 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Go que necesitan una arquitectura de eventos avanzada y administración de consumidores de Kafka.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Go nécessitant une architecture d''événements avancée et une gestion de consommateurs Kafka.","de":"Perfekt für auf Go basierende KI-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche ereignisgesteuerte Architektur und eine Kafka-Consumer-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Go que necessitam de arquitetura de eventos avançada e gerenciamento de consumidores Kafka.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Go, которым требуется продвинутая архитектура, основанная на событиях, и управление потребителями Kafka.","ar":"مثالي لوي단체 الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تعتمد على Go وتحتاج إلى هندسة حدث متقدمة وإدارة مستهلكي Kafka."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable and secure backend systems using LangGraph, Kafka, and Next.js, with features like context propagation, worker pools, and idempotent consumers, allowing for efficient event-driven architecture and human-in-the-loop AI governance.","zh":"通过LangGraph、Kafka和Next.js赋予代理构建可扩展和安全的后端系统的能力，具有上下文传播、工作池和幂等消费者等功能，从而实现高效的事件驱动架构和人机混合AI治理。","ja":"LangGraph、Kafka、Next.jsを使用して、コンテキスト伝播、ワーカープール、冪等コンシューマーなどの機能を備え、効率的なイベント駆動型アーキテクチャとヒューマン・イン・ザ・ループAIガバナンスを可能にする、スケーラブルでセキュアなバックエンドシステムを構築するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"LangGraph, 카프카 및 Next.js를 사용하여 컨텍스트 전파, 작업자 풀 및 멱등성 소비자와 같은 기능을 갖춘 에이전트가 확장 가능하고 안전한 백엔드 시스템을 구축할 수 있도록 하여 효율적인 이벤트 驱动 아키텍처 및 인간-루프 AI 거버넌스를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear sistemas de backend escalables y seguros utilizando LangGraph, Kafka y Next.js, con características como propagación de contexto, grupos de trabajadores y consumidores idempotentes, lo que permite una arquitectura de eventos eficiente y una gobernanza de IA con intervención humana.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des systèmes de backend escalables et sécurisés en utilisant LangGraph, Kafka et Next.js, avec des fonctionnalités comme la propagation de contexte, les pools de travailleurs et les consommateurs idempotents, permettant ainsi une architecture d''événements efficace et une gouvernance de l''IA avec intervention humaine.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, skalierbare und sichere Backendsysteme mit LangGraph, Kafka und Next.js zu erstellen, mit Funktionen wie Kontextweitergabe, Arbeitspools und idempotenten Consumern, was eine effiziente ereignisgesteuerte Architektur und eine KI-Governance mit menschlicher Intervention ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita agentes a construir sistemas de backend escaláveis e seguros usando LangGraph, Kafka e Next.js, com recursos como propagação de contexto, pools de trabalhadores e consumidores idempotentes, permitindo uma arquitetura de eventos eficiente e governança de IA com humanos no loop.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать масштабируемые и безопасные системы бэкэнда, используя LangGraph, Kafka и Next.js, с функциями, такими как распространение контекста, пулы рабочих и идемпотентные потребители, что позволяет обеспечить эффективную архитектуру, основанную на событиях, и управление ИИ с человеком в цикле.","ar":"تمكّن الوحدات من بناء أنظمة خلفية قابلة للتطوير وآمنة باستخدام LangGraph وKafka وNext.js، مع ميزات مثل انتشار السياق وبرك العمال والمستهلكون المتسقين، مما يسمح بوجود هندسة حدث فعالة وحوكمة ذكاء اصطناعي بوجود إنسان في الحلقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Kafka consumers for real-time data processing","Building read model projectors for data visualization","Developing snapshot builders for data backup and recovery","Managing background jobs for automated tasks"],"zh":["实现Kafka消费者以进行实时数据处理","构建读取模型投影器以进行数据可视化","开发快照生成器以进行数据备份和恢复","管理后台作业以进行自动化任务"],"ja":["リアルタイムデータ処理のためのKafkaコンシューマーの実装","データ視覚化のための読み取りモデル投影器の構築","データバックアップと復旧のためのスナップショットビルダーの開発","自動化タスクのためのバックグラウンドジョブの管理"],"ko":["실시간 데이터 처리를 위한 카프카 소비자의 구현","데이터 시각화를 위한 읽기 모델 프로젝터의 구축","데이터 백업 및 복구를 위한 스냅샷 빌더의 개발","자동화 작업을 위한 백그라운드 작업의 관리"],"es":["Implementar consumidores de Kafka para el procesamiento de datos en tiempo real","Crear proyectos de proyectores de modelo de lectura para la visualización de datos","Desarrollar constructores de instantáneas para la copia de seguridad y recuperación de datos","Administrar trabajos en segundo plano para tareas automatizadas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des consommateurs Kafka pour le traitement de données en temps réel","Créer des projets de projecteurs de modèle de lecture pour la visualisation de données","Développer des constructeurs d''instantanés pour la sauvegarde et la récupération de données","Gérer les tâches en arrière-plan pour les tâches automatisées"],"de":["Implementierung von Kafka-Consumern für die Echtzeit-Datenverarbeitung","Erstellung von Lesemodell-Projektoren für die Datenvisualisierung","Entwicklung von Snapshot-Erstellern für die Datensicherung und -wiederherstellung","Verwaltung von Hintergrundjobs für automatisierte Aufgaben"],"pt":["Implementação de consumidores Kafka para processamento de dados em tempo real","Construção de projetores de modelo de leitura para visualização de dados","Desenvolvimento de construtores de instantâneos para backup e recuperação de dados","Gerenciamento de trabalhos em segundo plano para tarefas automatizadas"],"ru":["Реализация потребителей Kafka для обработки данных в реальном времени","Создание проектировщиков модели чтения для визуализации данных","Разработка построителей снимков для резервного копирования и восстановления данных","Управление фоновыми заданиями для автоматизированных задач"],"ar":["تنفيذ مستهلكي Kafka لمعالجة البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","بناء مشاريع عرض نموذج القراءة لتصور البيانات","تطوير بناة لقطات لنسخ احتياطي واستعادة البيانات","إدارة مهام الخلفية لأتمتة المهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go programming language expertise","Dependent on Kafka and LangGraph infrastructure","Needs careful management of goroutine models and backpressure to avoid memory usage issues"],"zh":["需要Go编程语言的专业知识","依赖于Kafka和LangGraph基础设施","需要小心管理goroutine模型和背压以避免内存使用问题"],"ja":["Goプログラミング言語の専門知識が必要","KafkaとLangGraphのインフラストラクチャに依存している","goroutineモデルとバックプレッシャーを慎重に管理してメモリ使用の問題を避ける必要がある"],"ko":["고 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다","카프카 및 랭그라프 인프라에 의존합니다","goroutine 모델 및 백프레셔를慎重하게 관리하여 메모리 사용 문제를避ける 필요가 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en el lenguaje de programación Go","Dependiente de la infraestructura de Kafka y LangGraph","Necesita una gestión cuidadosa de los modelos de goroutine y la presión de retroceso para evitar problemas de uso de memoria"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans le langage de programmation Go","Dépend de l''infrastructure Kafka et LangGraph","Nécessite une gestion soigneuse des modèles de goroutine et de la pression de rétroaction pour éviter les problèmes d''utilisation de la mémoire"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in der Programmiersprache Go","Abhängig von der Kafka- und LangGraph-Infrastruktur","Benötigt eine sorgfältige Verwaltung der Goroutine-Modelle und des Rückdrucks, um Probleme mit dem Speicherbedarf zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Exige expertise na linguagem de programação Go","Depende da infraestrutura Kafka e LangGraph","Necessita de gerenciamento cuidadoso de modelos de goroutine e pressão de retorno para evitar problemas de uso de memória"],"ru":["Требует экспертности в языке программирования Go","Зависит от инфраструктуры Kafka и LangGraph","Требует тщательного управления моделями goroutine и давлением возврата, чтобы избежать проблем с использованием памяти"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في لغة برمجة Go","يعتمد على بنية تحتية Kafka وLangGraph","يحتاج إلى إدارة دقيقة لأنماط Горوتين والضغط العكسي لتجنب مشاكل استخدام الذاكرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('fulfon/lusena-dawn/api-designer', 'community', 'fulfon', 'lusena-dawn', 'fulfon/lusena-dawn', 'api-designer', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:46:12.711Z', NULL, '{"id":"fulfon/lusena-dawn/api-designer","name":"api-designer","description":{"zh":"API designer API 10","ja":"API designer API 10","ko":"API designer API 10","es":"Un diseñador de API es un experto en crear arquitecturas de API escalables y seguras","fr":"Un concepteur d''API est un expert dans la création d''architectures d''API évolutives et sécurisées","de":"Ein API-Designer ist ein Experte für die Erstellung von skalierbaren und sicheren API-Architekturen","pt":"O projetista de API é um especialista em criar arquiteturas de API escaláveis e seguras com OpenAPI e GraphQL.","ru":"Дизайнер API - это специалист, создающий масштабируемые и безопасные архитектуры API с помощью OpenAPI и GraphQL.","ar":"مصمم واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية هو خبير في تصميم بنى تحتية قابلة للتوسعة وأمنة مع مواصفات OpenAPI وGraphQL","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"API Designer - senior API","ja":"API Designer - senior API","ko":"API Designer - senior API","es":"Diseñador de API: Expertos en APIs escalables","fr":"Conception d''API: Architectes d''API évolutives","de":"API-Designer: Experten für skalierbare APIs","pt":"Projetista de API: Expert em Design de APIs Escaláveis","ru":"Дизайнер API: Эксперт в Создании Масштабируемых API","ar":"مصمم واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية: خبير في تصميم واجهات برمجة ...","en":"api-designer"},"description":{"zh":"API designer API 10","ja":"API designer API 10","ko":"API designer API 10","es":"Un diseñador de API es un experto en crear arquitecturas de API escalables y seguras","fr":"Un concepteur d''API est un expert dans la création d''architectures d''API évolutives et sécurisées","de":"Ein API-Designer ist ein Experte für die Erstellung von skalierbaren und sicheren API-Architekturen","pt":"O projetista de API é um especialista em criar arquiteturas de API escaláveis e seguras com OpenAPI e GraphQL.","ru":"Дизайнер API - это специалист, создающий масштабируемые и безопасные архитектуры API с помощью OpenAPI и GraphQL.","ar":"مصمم واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية هو خبير في تصميم بنى تحتية قابلة للتوسعة وأمنة مع مواصفات OpenAPI وGraphQL","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["REST","GraphQL","OpenAPI 3.1","API","10","API"],"ja":["REST","GraphQL","OpenAPI 3.1","API","10","API"],"ko":["REST","GraphQL","OpenAPI 3.1","API","10","API"],"es":["Diseño de APIs escalables","Creación de especificaciones de OpenAPI","Desarrollo de esquemas de GraphQL","Seguridad y rendimiento de API","Arquitecturas de API REST"],"fr":["Conception d''API évolutives","Création de spécifications OpenAPI","Développement de schémas GraphQL","Sécurité et performances des API","Architectures d''API REST"],"de":["Entwurf von skalierbaren APIs","Erstellung von OpenAPI-Spezifikationen","Entwicklung von GraphQL-Schemata","Sicherheit und Leistung von APIs","API-REST-Architekturen"],"pt":["Criação de arquiteturas de API escaláveis","Especialização em OpenAPI e GraphQL","Desenvolvimento de APIs seguras e performáticas","Experiência em design de APIs REST e GraphQL","Conhecimento em especificações OpenAPI 3.1"],"ru":["Создание масштабируемых архитектур API","Специализация на OpenAPI и GraphQL","Разработка безопасных и производительных API","Опыт в дизайне API REST и GraphQL","Знание спецификаций OpenAPI 3.1"],"ar":["تصميم بنى تحتية قابلة للتوسعة","تخصص في مواصفات OpenAPI وGraphQL","تطوير واجهات برمجة تطبيقات آمنة وذكية","خبرة في تصميم واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST وGraphQL","معرفة بمواصفات OpenAPI 3.1"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API designer","senior API","REST API","GraphQL API","OpenAPI 3.1","API"],"ja":["API designer","senior API","REST API","GraphQL API","OpenAPI 3.1","API"],"ko":["API designer","senior API","REST API","GraphQL API","OpenAPI 3.1","API"],"es":["diseñador de API","arquitectura de API","API escalable","OpenAPI","GraphQL","seguridad de API","rendimiento de API"],"fr":["concepteur d''API","architecture d''API","API évolutives","OpenAPI","GraphQL","sécurité des API","performances des API"],"de":["API-Designer","API-Architektur","skalierbare API","OpenAPI","GraphQL","API-Sicherheit","API-Leistung"],"pt":["projetista de API","design de API","OpenAPI","GraphQL","arquitetura de API","segurança de API","desenvolvimento de API","API REST","API GraphQL"],"ru":["дизайнер API","дизайн API","OpenAPI","GraphQL","архитектура API","безопасность API","разработка API","API REST","API GraphQL"],"ar":["مصمم واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية","تصميم واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية","مواصفات OpenAPI","GraphQL","بنية تحتية واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية","أمن واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية","تطوير واجهة البرمجة التطبيقية","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات GraphQL"]}},"owner":"fulfon","repo":"lusena-dawn","repoPath":"fulfon/lusena-dawn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-designer","description":"Use when designing REST or GraphQL APIs, creating OpenAPI specifications, or planning API architecture. Invoke for resource modeling, versioning strategies, pagination patterns, error handling standards. Keywords: API design, REST, OpenAPI, GraphQL, API architecture.","bodyPreview":"# API Designer\n\nSenior API architect with expertise in designing scalable, developer-friendly REST and GraphQL APIs with comprehensive OpenAPI specifications.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior API designer with 10+ years of experience creating intuitive, scalable API architectures. You specialize in REST design patterns, OpenAPI 3.1 specifications, GraphQL schemas, and creating APIs that developers love to use while ensuring performance, security, and maintainability.\n\n## When to Use This Sk","body":"# API Designer\n\nSenior API architect with expertise in designing scalable, developer-friendly REST and GraphQL APIs with comprehensive OpenAPI specifications.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior API designer with 10+ years of experience creating intuitive, scalable API architectures. You specialize in REST design patterns, OpenAPI 3.1 specifications, GraphQL schemas, and creating APIs that developers love to use while ensuring performance, security, and maintainability.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing new REST or GraphQL APIs\n- Creating OpenAPI 3.1 specifications\n- Modeling resources and relationships\n- Implementing API versioning strategies\n- Designing pagination and filtering\n- Standardizing error responses\n- Planning authentication flows\n- Documenting API contracts\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze domain** - Understand business requirements, data models, client needs\n2. **Model resources** - Identify resources, relationships, operations\n3. **Design endpoints** - Define URI patterns, HTTP methods, request/response schemas\n4. **Specify contract** - Create OpenAPI 3.1 spec with complete documentation\n5. **Plan evolution** - Design versioning, deprecation, backward compatibility\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| REST Patterns | `references/rest-patterns.md` | Resource design, HTTP methods, HATEOAS |\n| Versioning | `references/versioning.md` | API versions, deprecation, breaking changes |\n| Pagination | `references/pagination.md` | Cursor, offset, keyset pagination |\n| Error Handling | `references/error-handling.md` | Error responses, RFC 7807, status codes |\n| OpenAPI | `references/openapi.md` | OpenAPI 3.1, documentation, code generation |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Follow REST principles (resource-oriented, proper HTTP methods)\n- Use consistent naming conventions (snake_case or camelCase)\n- Include comprehensive OpenAPI 3.1 specification\n- Design proper error responses with actionable messages\n- Implement pagination for collection endpoints\n- Version APIs with clear deprecation policies\n- Document authentication and authorization\n- Provide request/response examples\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use verbs in resource URIs (use `/users/{id}`, not `/getUser/{id}`)\n- Return inconsistent response structures\n- Skip error code documentation\n- Ignore HTTP status code semantics\n- Design APIs without versioning strategy\n- Expose implementation details in API\n- Create breaking changes without migration path\n- Omit rate limiting considerations\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen designing APIs, provide:\n1. Resource model and relationships\n2. Endpoint specifications with URIs and methods\n3. OpenAPI 3.1 specification (YAML or JSON)\n4. Authentication and authorization flows\n5. Error response catalog\n6. Pagination and filtering patterns\n7. Versioning and deprecation strategy\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nREST architecture, OpenAPI 3.1, GraphQL, HTTP semantics, JSON:API, HATEOAS, OAuth 2.0, JWT, RFC 7807 Problem Details, API versioning patterns, pagination strategies, rate limiting, webhook design, SDK generation\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **GraphQL Architect** - GraphQL-specific API design\n- **FastAPI Expert** - Python API implementation\n- **NestJS Expert** - TypeScript API implementation\n- **Spring Boot Engineer** - Java API implementation\n- **Security Reviewer** - API security assessment\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:46:12.711Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring expertise in designing scalable REST and GraphQL APIs","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，需要在设计可扩展的 REST 和 GraphQL API 方面具有专业知识","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの AI エージェントに適しており、スケーラブルな REST および GraphQL API を設計するための専門知識が必要","ko":"Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며 확장 가능한 REST 및 GraphQL API를 설계하는 전문 지식이 필요함","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren experiencia en el diseño de APIs REST y GraphQL escalables","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une expertise dans la conception d''API REST et GraphQL évolutives","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die Expertenwissen im Entwurf von skalierbaren REST- und GraphQL-APIs erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que requerem especialização em projetar REST e GraphQL APIs escaláveis","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих экспертизы в проектировании масштабируемых REST и GraphQL API","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في تصميم REST و GraphQL APIs قابلة للتوسيع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft intuitive API architectures using OpenAPI 3.1 specifications and GraphQL schemas, ensuring performance, security, and maintainability through comprehensive API design patterns","zh":"赋予代理创建直观的 API 架构的能力，使用 OpenAPI 3.1 规范和 GraphQL 模式，确保通过全面 API 设计模式实现性能、安全性和可维护性","ja":"OpenAPI 3.1 の仕様と GraphQL スキーマを使用して、直感的な API アーキテクチャを作成するエージェントの能力を提供し、包括的な API デザイン パターンを通じてパフォーマンス、セキュリティ、およびメンテナンス性を確保する","ko":"OpenAPI 3.1 사양 및 GraphQL 스키마를 사용하여 직관적인 API 아키텍처를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 포괄적인 API 설계 패턴을 통해 성능, 보안 및 유지 보수성을 보장함","es":"Permite a los agentes crear arquitecturas de API intuitivas utilizando especificaciones OpenAPI 3.1 y esquemas GraphQL, garantizando el rendimiento, la seguridad y la mantenibilidad a través de patrones de diseño de API comprehensivos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des architectures d''API intuitives en utilisant les spécifications OpenAPI 3.1 et les schémas GraphQL, garantissant les performances, la sécurité et la maintenabilité grâce à des modèles de conception d''API complets","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, intuitive API-Architekturen unter Verwendung von OpenAPI 3.1-Spezifikationen und GraphQL-Schemas zu erstellen, wodurch Leistung, Sicherheit und Wartbarkeit durch umfassende API-Designmuster gewährleistet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar arquiteturas de API intuitivas usando especificações OpenAPI 3.1 e esquemas GraphQL, garantindo desempenho, segurança e manutenibilidade por meio de padrões abrangentes de design de API","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интуитивные архитектуры API, используя спецификации OpenAPI 3.1 и схемы GraphQL, обеспечивая производительность, безопасность и поддерживаемость посредством комплексных шаблонов проектирования API","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء هندسة API متوافقة باستخدام مواصفات OpenAPI 3.1 ومخططات GraphQL، مما يضمن الأداء والأمان والصيانة من خلال أنماط تصميم API الشاملة"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing scalable REST APIs for microservices","Creating GraphQL schemas for complex data models","Generating comprehensive OpenAPI specifications for developer documentation"],"zh":["为微服务设计可扩展的 REST API","为复杂数据模型创建 GraphQL 模式","为开发人员文档生成全面 OpenAPI 规范"],"ja":["マイクロサービス用のスケーラブルな REST API を設計する","複雑なデータ モデル用の GraphQL スキーマを作成する","開発者向けドキュメント用の包括的な OpenAPI 仕様を生成する"],"ko":["마이크로서비스를 위한 확장 가능한 REST API 설계","복잡한 데이터 모델을 위한 GraphQL 스키마 생성","개발자 문서를 위한 포괄적인 OpenAPI 사양 생성"],"es":["Diseño de APIs REST escalables para microservicios","Creación de esquemas GraphQL para modelos de datos complejos","Generación de especificaciones OpenAPI comprehensivas para la documentación de desarrolladores"],"fr":["Conception d''API REST évolutives pour les microservices","Création de schémas GraphQL pour les modèles de données complexes","Génération de spécifications OpenAPI complètes pour la documentation des développeurs"],"de":["Entwurf von skalierbaren REST-APIs für Microservices","Erstellung von GraphQL-Schemas für komplexe Datamodelle","Generierung umfassender OpenAPI-Spezifikationen für die Entwicklerdokumentation"],"pt":["Projeto de REST APIs escaláveis para microsserviços","Criação de esquemas GraphQL para modelos de dados complexos","Geração de especificações OpenAPI abrangentes para documentação de desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Проектирование масштабируемых REST API для микросервисов","Создание схем GraphQL для сложных моделей данных","Генерация комплексных спецификаций OpenAPI для документации разработчиков"],"ar":["تصميم REST APIs قابلة للتوسيع لميكروسيرفس","إنشاء مخططات GraphQL لنماذج بيانات معقدة","توليد مواصفات OpenAPI الشاملة لتوثيق المطورين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in REST and GraphQL design principles","Limited to API design and specification, not implementation"],"zh":["需要 REST 和 GraphQL 设计原则的专业知识","仅限 API 设计和规范，不包括实现"],"ja":["REST と GraphQL の設計原則に関する専門知識が必要","API の設計と仕様のみに限定され、実装は含まない"],"ko":["REST 및 GraphQL 설계 원칙에 대한 전문 지식 필요","API 설계 및 사양만 해당되며, 구현은 포함하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en principios de diseño de REST y GraphQL","Limitado al diseño y especificación de API, no a la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans les principes de conception de REST et GraphQL","Limité à la conception et à la spécification d''API, et non à la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Erfordert Expertenwissen in den Entwurfsprinzipien von REST und GraphQL","Begrenzt auf API-Design und -Spezifikation, nicht auf Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer especialização em princípios de design de REST e GraphQL","Limitado ao design e especificação de API, não implementação"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в принципах проектирования REST и GraphQL","Ограничен проектированием и спецификацией API, не реализацией"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في مبادئ تصميم REST و GraphQL","محدود بتصميم المواصفات API، وليس التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Mrgig7/Multi-Agent-Enterprise-CRM/ai-langgraph', 'community', 'Mrgig7', 'Multi-Agent-Enterprise-CRM', 'Mrgig7/Multi-Agent-Enterprise-CRM', 'ai-langgraph', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:46:06.108Z', NULL, '{"id":"Mrgig7/Multi-Agent-Enterprise-CRM/ai-langgraph","name":"ai-langgraph","description":{"zh":"AI-langgraph 是一个 AI 原生企业 CRM 解决方案，采用 LangGraph、Kafka、Next.js 和 Ollama 技术，实现事件驱动架构和人机协同 AI 治理","ja":"AI-langgraph は、LangGraph、Kafka、Next.js、Ollama テクノロジーを使用した AI ネイティブの企業向け CRM ソリューションです。イベント駆動型アーキテクチャとヒューマンインザループ AI ガバナンスを実現します","ko":"AI-langgraph는 LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js, Ollama 기술을 사용한 AI 네이티브 기업용 CRM 솔루션으로, 이벤트 驱动 아키텍처와 인간-루프 AI 거버넌스를 구현합니다","es":"ai-langgraph es un CRM empresarial con agentes autónomos para ventas, soporte y cumplimiento, construido con LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js y Ollama.","fr":"ai-langgraph est un CRM d''entreprise avec des agents autonomes pour les ventes, le support et la conformité, construit avec LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js et Ollama.","de":"ai-langgraph ist ein Unternehmens-CRM mit autonomen Agenten für Verkäufe, Support und Compliance, entwickelt mit LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js und Ollama.","pt":"A ai-langgraph é uma plataforma de CRM nativa em IA, com agentes autônomos para vendas, suporte e conformidade, construída com LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js e Ollama","ru":"ai-langgraph - это платформа CRM, родная для ИИ, с автономными агентами для продаж, поддержки и соответствия, построенная на LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js и Ollama","ar":"ai-langgraph هي منصة إدارة علاقات العملاء الأصلية بالذكاء الاصطناعي، مع وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي للبيع والدعم والامتثال، مبنية على LangGraph وKafka وNext.js وOllama","en":"🤖 AI-Native Enterprise CRM with autonomous agents for sales, support, and compliance. Built with LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js, and Ollama. Features event-driven architecture, multi-tenant security, and human-in-the-loop AI governance."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI-langgraph 技术：企业级 CRM 解决方案","ja":"AI-langgraph テクノロジー：企業向け CRM ソリューション","ko":"AI-langgraph 기술: 기업용 CRM 솔루션","es":"ai-langgraph: Arquitectura de CRM empresarial con agentes...","fr":"ai-langgraph : Architecture CRM d''entreprise avec agents ...","de":"ai-langgraph: Unternehmens-CRM-Architektur mit autonomen ...","pt":"ai-langgraph: Arquitetura de CRM Autônoma","ru":"ai-langgraph: Автономная Архитектура CRM","ar":"ai-langgraph: هندسة إدارة علاقات العملاء الذكية","en":"ai-langgraph"},"description":{"zh":"AI-langgraph 是一个 AI 原生企业 CRM 解决方案，采用 LangGraph、Kafka、Next.js 和 Ollama 技术，实现事件驱动架构和人机协同 AI 治理","ja":"AI-langgraph は、LangGraph、Kafka、Next.js、Ollama テクノロジーを使用した AI ネイティブの企業向け CRM ソリューションです。イベント駆動型アーキテクチャとヒューマンインザループ AI ガバナンスを実現します","ko":"AI-langgraph는 LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js, Ollama 기술을 사용한 AI 네이티브 기업용 CRM 솔루션으로, 이벤트 驱动 아키텍처와 인간-루프 AI 거버넌스를 구현합니다","es":"ai-langgraph es un CRM empresarial con agentes autónomos para ventas, soporte y cumplimiento, construido con LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js y Ollama.","fr":"ai-langgraph est un CRM d''entreprise avec des agents autonomes pour les ventes, le support et la conformité, construit avec LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js et Ollama.","de":"ai-langgraph ist ein Unternehmens-CRM mit autonomen Agenten für Verkäufe, Support und Compliance, entwickelt mit LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js und Ollama.","pt":"A ai-langgraph é uma plataforma de CRM nativa em IA, com agentes autônomos para vendas, suporte e conformidade, construída com LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js e Ol...","ru":"ai-langgraph - это платформа CRM, родная для ИИ, с автономными агентами для продаж, поддержки и соответствия, построенная на LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js и Ollama","ar":"ai-langgraph هي منصة إدارة علاقات العملاء الأصلية بالذكاء الاصطناعي، مع وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي للبيع والدعم والامتثال، مبنية على LangGraph وKafka وNext.js وOllama","en":"🤖 AI-Native Enterprise CRM with autonomous agents for sales, support, and compliance. Built with LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js, and Ollama. Features event-drive..."},"definition":{"en":"🤖 AI-Native Enterprise CRM with autonomous agents for sales, support, and compliance. Built with LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js, and Ollama. Features event-driven architecture, multi-tenant security, and human-in-the-loop AI governance."},"features":{"zh":["事件驱动架构","多租户安全","人机协同 AI 治理","LangGraph 技术","Kafka 集成","Next.js 支持"],"ja":["イベント駆動型アーキテクチャ","マルチテナントセキュリティ","ヒューマンインザループ AI ガバナンス","LangGraph テクノロジー","Kafka 統合","Next.js サポート"],"ko":["이벤트 驱动 아키텍처","멀티테넌트 보안","인간-루프 AI 거버넌스","LangGraph 기술","Kafka 통합","Next.js 지원"],"es":["Arquitectura de eventos","Agentes autónomos","Seguridad multi-tenant","Gobernanza de IA humana en el bucle","Integración con LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js y Ollama"],"fr":["Architecture d''événements","Agents autonomes","Sécurité multi-locataire","Gouvernance de l''IA humaine dans la boucle","Intégration avec LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js et Ollama"],"de":["Ereignisarchitektur","Autonome Agenten","Mehrmandanten-Sicherheit","Menschliche IA-Governance im Schleifen","Integration mit LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js und Ollama"],"pt":["Arquitetura orientada a eventos","Segurança multi-tenant","Governança de IA com intervenção humana","Agentes autônomos para vendas, suporte e conformidade","Integração com LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js e Ollama"],"ru":["Архитектура, ориентированная на события","Многопользовательская безопасность","Управление ИИ с человеческим вмешательством","Автономные агенты для продаж, поддержки и соответствия","Интеграция с LangGraph, Kafka, Next.js и Ollama"],"ar":["هندسة موجهة إلى الأحداث","أمان متعدد المستخدمين","إدارة الذكاء الاصطناعي بالتدخل البشري","وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي للبيع والدعم والامتثال","التكامل مع LangGraph وKafka وNext.js وOllama"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI-langgraph","企业级 CRM","AI 原生","LangGraph","Kafka","Next.js","Ollama","事件驱动架构","人机协同 AI 治理"],"ja":["AI-langgraph","企業向け CRM","AI ネイティブ","LangGraph","Kafka","Next.js","Ollama","イベント駆動型アーキテクチャ","ヒューマンインザループ AI ガバナンス"],"ko":["AI-langgraph","기업용 CRM","AI 네이티브","LangGraph","Kafka","Next.js","Ollama","이벤트 驱动 아키텍처","인간-루프 AI 거버넌스"],"es":["ai-langgraph","CRM empresarial","agentes autónomos","arquitectura de eventos","seguridad multi-tenant","gobernanza de IA","LangGraph","Kafka","Next.js","Ollama"],"fr":["ai-langgraph","CRM d''entreprise","agents autonomes","architecture d''événements","sécurité multi-locataire","gouvernance de l''IA","LangGraph","Kafka","Next.js","Ollama"],"de":["ai-langgraph","Unternehmens-CRM","autonome Agenten","Ereignisarchitektur","Mehrmandanten-Sicherheit","menschliche IA-Governance","LangGraph","Kafka","Next.js","Ollama"],"pt":["ai-langgraph","crm autônomo","inteligência artificial","aprendizado de máquina","arquitetura de eventos","segurança multi-tenant","governança de ia"],"ru":["ai-langgraph","автономный crm","искусственный интеллект","машинное обучение","архитектура, ориентированная на события","многопользовательская безопасность","управление ии"],"ar":["ai-langgraph","إدارة علاقات العملاء الذكية","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تعلم الآلة","هندسة موجهة إلى الأحداث","أمان متعدد المستخدمين","إدارة الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Mrgig7","repo":"Multi-Agent-Enterprise-CRM","repoPath":"Mrgig7/Multi-Agent-Enterprise-CRM","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-langgraph","description":"Designs multi-agent graphs using LangGraph.","bodyPreview":"Always define:\n\n- Nodes\n- Edges\n- State\n- Memory\n\nExplain agent coordination.","body":"Always define:\n\n- Nodes\n- Edges\n- State\n- Memory\n\nExplain agent coordination.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:46:06.108Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring event-driven architecture and human-in-the-loop AI governance for autonomous sales, support, and compliance tasks","zh":"非常适合需要事件驱动架构和人在回路人工智能治理的AI代理，用于自主销售、支持和合规任务","ja":"自律的なセールス、サポート、コンプライアンスタスクに、イベント駆動型アーキテクチャとヒューマンインザループAIガバナンスを必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"자율적인 영업, 지원 및 규정 준수 작업을 위해 이벤트 기반 아키텍처와 인간 참여형(Human-in-the-Loop) AI 거버넌스가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 이상적","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren arquitectura orientada a eventos y gobernanza de IA con humanos en la gestión de tareas autónomas de ventas, soporte y cumplimiento","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant une architecture orientée événement et une gouvernance IA avec des humains dans la gestion de tâches autonomes de vente, de support et de conformité","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die eine ereignisgesteuerte Architektur und eine KI-Governance mit menschlicher Beteiligung für autonome Verkaufs-, Support- und Compliance-Aufgaben erfordern","pt":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring event-driven architecture and human-in-the-loop AI governance for autonomous sales, support, and compliance tasks","ru":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring event-driven architecture and human-in-the-loop AI governance for autonomous sales, support, and compliance tasks","ar":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring event-driven architecture and human-in-the-loop AI governance for autonomous sales, support, and compliance tasks"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define and manage nodes, edges, state, and memory using LangGraph, while leveraging Kafka for event-driven interactions and Next.js for multi-tenant security, all within an Ollama framework, enabling seamless agent coordination and autonomous decision-making","zh":"使代理能够在Ollama框架内使用LangGraph定义和管理节点、边、状态和内存，同时利用Kafka实现事件驱动交互，并利用Next.js实现多租户安全，从而实现无缝代理协调和自主决策","ja":"Ollamaフレームワーク内で、LangGraphを使用してノード、エッジ、状態、メモリを定義および管理し、Kafkaを活用したイベント駆動型インタラクションとNext.jsによるマルチテナントセキュリティを実現し、シームレスなエージェント調整と自律的な意思決定を可能にします","ko":"Ollama 프레임워크 내에서 LangGraph를 사용하여 노드, 엣지, 상태 및 메모리를 정의하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, Kafka를 활용한 이벤트 기반 상호작용과 Next.js를 통한 다중 테넌시 보안을 제공하여 원활한 에이전트 조정과 자율적 의사 결정을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir y gestionar nodos, aristas, estado y memoria utilizando LangGraph, aprovechando Kafka para interacciones orientadas a eventos y Next.js para seguridad multi-tenant, todo dentro de un marco de Ollama, lo que permite una coordinación de agentes sin problemas y una toma de decisiones autónoma","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir et de gérer des nœuds, des arêtes, un état et une mémoire en utilisant LangGraph, en exploitant Kafka pour les interactions orientées événement et Next.js pour la sécurité multi-locataire, le tout dans un cadre Ollama, permettant une coordination d''agents sans heurts et une prise de décision autonome","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Knoten, Kanten, Zustand und Speicher mithilfe von LangGraph zu definieren und zu verwalten, während Kafka für ereignisgesteuerte Interaktionen und Next.js für Multi-Tenant-Sicherheit genutzt wird, all dies innerhalb eines Ollama-Rahmens, der eine nahtlose Agentenkoordination und autonome Entscheidungsfindung ermöglicht","pt":"Empowers agents to define and manage nodes, edges, state, and memory using LangGraph, while leveraging Kafka for event-driven interactions and Next.js for multi-tenant security, all within an Ollama framework, enabling seamless agent coordination and autonomous decision-making","ru":"Empowers agents to define and manage nodes, edges, state, and memory using LangGraph, while leveraging Kafka for event-driven interactions and Next.js for multi-tenant security, all within an Ollama framework, enabling seamless agent coordination and autonomous decision-making","ar":"Empowers agents to define and manage nodes, edges, state, and memory using LangGraph, while leveraging Kafka for event-driven interactions and Next.js for multi-tenant security, all within an Ollama framework, enabling seamless agent coordination and autonomous decision-making"},"useCases":{"en":["Defining and managing complex node relationships for sales and support tasks","Implementing event-driven architecture for real-time compliance monitoring","Coordinating human-in-the-loop AI governance for enhanced decision-making"],"zh":["为销售和支持任务定义和管理复杂的节点关系","实施事件驱动架构以实现实时合规监控","协调人在回路人工智能治理以增强决策能力"],"ja":["セールスおよびサポートタスクのための複雑なノード関係の定義と管理","リアルタイムコンプライアンス監視のためのイベント駆動型アーキテクチャの実装","意思決定強化のためのヒューマンインザループAIガバナンスの調整"],"ko":["영업 및 지원 작업을 위한 복잡한 노드 관계 정의 및 관리","실시간 규정 준수 모니터링을 위한 이벤트 기반 아키텍처 구현","향상된 의사 결정을 위한 인간 참여형(Human-in-the-Loop) AI 거버넌스 조정"],"es":["Definir y gestionar relaciones de nodos complejas para tareas de ventas y soporte","Implementar arquitectura orientada a eventos para el monitoreo de cumplimiento en tiempo real","Coordinar la gobernanza de IA con humanos en la gestión para una mejor toma de decisiones"],"fr":["Définir et gérer des relations de nœuds complexes pour les tâches de vente et de support","Mettre en œuvre une architecture orientée événement pour la surveillance de la conformité en temps réel","Coordonner la gouvernance IA avec des humains dans la gestion pour une meilleure prise de décision"],"de":["Definieren und Verwalten komplexer Knotenbeziehungen für Verkaufs- und Support-Aufgaben","Implementierung einer ereignisgesteuerten Architektur für die Überwachung der Compliance in Echtzeit","Koordinieren der KI-Governance mit menschlicher Beteiligung in der Verwaltung für eine bessere Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Defining and managing complex node relationships for sales and support tasks","Implementing event-driven architecture for real-time compliance monitoring","Coordinating human-in-the-loop AI governance for enhanced decision-making"],"ru":["Defining and managing complex node relationships for sales and support tasks","Implementing event-driven architecture for real-time compliance monitoring","Coordinating human-in-the-loop AI governance for enhanced decision-making"],"ar":["Defining and managing complex node relationships for sales and support tasks","Implementing event-driven architecture for real-time compliance monitoring","Coordinating human-in-the-loop AI governance for enhanced decision-making"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LangGraph integration","Dependent on Kafka for event-driven architecture","Multi-tenant security setup necessary"],"zh":["需要集成LangGraph","依赖Kafka实现事件驱动架构","需要设置多租户安全"],"ja":["LangGraphの統合が必要","イベント駆動型アーキテクチャにKafkaへの依存","マルチテナントセキュリティの設定が必要"],"ko":["LangGraph 통합 필요","이벤트 기반 아키텍처에 Kafka 의존","다중 테넌시 보안 설정 필요"],"es":["Requiere integración con LangGraph","Depende de Kafka para la arquitectura orientada a eventos","Configuración de seguridad multi-tenant necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec LangGraph","Dépend de Kafka pour l''architecture orientée événement","Configuration de sécurité multi-locataire nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert eine Integration mit LangGraph","Hängt von Kafka für die ereignisgesteuerte Architektur ab","Einrichtung der Multi-Tenant-Sicherheit erforderlich"],"pt":["Requires LangGraph integration","Dependent on Kafka for event-driven architecture","Multi-tenant security setup necessary"],"ru":["Requires LangGraph integration","Dependent on Kafka for event-driven architecture","Multi-tenant security setup necessary"],"ar":["Requires LangGraph integration","Dependent on Kafka for event-driven architecture","Multi-tenant security setup necessary"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Masked-Kunsiquat/crm-orbit2/code-reviewer', 'community', 'Masked-Kunsiquat', 'crm-orbit2', 'Masked-Kunsiquat/crm-orbit2', 'code-reviewer', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:46:18.775Z', NULL, '{"id":"Masked-Kunsiquat/crm-orbit2/code-reviewer","name":"code-reviewer","description":{"zh":"代码审查员技能旨在识别代码变更中的问题和改进机会，重点关注安全性、正确性和可维护性","ja":"コードレビューア スキルは、コードの変更における問題や改善の機会を特定し、セキュリティ、正確性、メンテナンス性に焦点を当てています","ko":"코드 리뷰어 기술은 코드 변경의 문제와 개선 기회를 식별하며, 보안, 정확성, 유지보수성에 중점을 둡니다","es":"El revisor de código identifica problemas y oportunidades de mejora en el código, enfocándose en seguridad, corrección y mantenibilidad","fr":"Le réviseur de code identifie les problèmes et les opportunités d''amélioration dans le code, en se concentrant sur la sécurité, la correction et la maintenabilité","de":"Der Code-Reviewer identifiziert Probleme und Verbesserungsmöglichkeiten im Code, mit Fokus auf Sicherheit, Korrektheit und Wartbarkeit","pt":"A revisão de código é um processo que identifica problemas e oportunidades de melhoria no código, com foco em segurança, correção e manutenção.","ru":"Проверка кода - это процесс, который выявляет проблемы и возможности улучшения кода, с упором на безопасность, корректность и техническое обслуживание.","ar":"مراجعة الكود هي عملية تحدد المشاكل وفرص التحسين في الكود، مع التركيز على الأمان والصحة والصيانة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码审查员技能","ja":"コードレビューア スキル","ko":"코드 리뷰어 기술","es":"Revisión de código: habilidades de revisor de código","fr":"Révision de code : compétences de réviseur de code","de":"Code-Review: Fähigkeiten eines Code-Reviewers","pt":"Revisão de Código: Ferramenta de Análise de Segurança e M...","ru":"Проверка Код: Инструмент Анализа Безопасности и Техническ...","ar":"مراجعة الكود: أداة تحليل الأمان والصيانة","en":"code-reviewer"},"description":{"zh":"代码审查员技能旨在识别代码变更中的问题和改进机会，重点关注安全性、正确性和可维护性","ja":"コードレビューア スキルは、コードの変更における問題や改善の機会を特定し、セキュリティ、正確性、メンテナンス性に焦点を当てています","ko":"코드 리뷰어 기술은 코드 변경의 문제와 개선 기회를 식별하며, 보안, 정확성, 유지보수성에 중점을 둡니다","es":"El revisor de código identifica problemas y oportunidades de mejora en el código, enfocándose en seguridad, corrección y mantenibilidad","fr":"Le réviseur de code identifie les problèmes et les opportunités d''amélioration dans le code, en se concentrant sur la sécurité, la correction et la maintenab...","de":"Der Code-Reviewer identifiziert Probleme und Verbesserungsmöglichkeiten im Code, mit Fokus auf Sicherheit, Korrektheit und Wartbarkeit","pt":"A revisão de código é um processo que identifica problemas e oportunidades de melhoria no código, com foco em segurança, correção e manutenção.","ru":"Проверка кода - это процесс, который выявляет проблемы и возможности улучшения кода, с упором на безопасность, корректность и техническое обслуживание.","ar":"مراجعة الكود هي عملية تحدد المشاكل وفرص التحسين في الكود، مع التركيز على الأمان والصحة والصيانة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化代码审查","安全性检查","正确性验证","可维护性分析","提供可行的反馈"],"ja":["自動コードレビュー","セキュリティチェック","正確性の検証","メンテナンス性の分析","実行可能なフィードバックの提供"],"ko":["자동 코드 리뷰","보안성 체크","정확성 검증","유지보수성 분석","실행 가능한 피드백 제공"],"es":["Identificación de problemas de seguridad","Análisis de corrección y mantenibilidad","Propuesta de parches específicos","Enfoque en las normas del repositorio","Proporcionar retroalimentación activa"],"fr":["Identification des problèmes de sécurité","Analyse de la correction et de la maintenabilité","Proposition de correctifs spécifiques","Concentration sur les normes du référentiel","Fournir une rétroaction active"],"de":["Identifizierung von Sicherheitsproblemen","Analyse von Korrektheit und Wartbarkeit","Vorschlag spezifischer Patches","Fokus auf die Standards des Repository","Bereitstellung von aktiver Rückmeldung"],"pt":["Análise de segurança","Verificação de correção","Avaliação de manutenção","Feedback ação","Proposta de patches específicos","Conformidade com padrões do repositório"],"ru":["Анализ безопасности","Проверка корректности","Оценка технического обслуживания","Обратная связь по действию","Предложение конкретных патчей","Соответствие стандартам репозитория"],"ar":["تحليل الأمان","التحقق من الصحة","تقييم الصيانة","ملاحظات العمل","اقتراح التصحيحات المحددة","الامتثال لمعايير المستودع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","代码安全","代码正确性","代码可维护性","自动化代码审查","代码优化"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コードセキュリティ","コード正確性","コードメンテナンス性","自動コードレビュー","コード最適化"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 보안","코드 정확성","코드 유지보수성","자동 코드 리뷰","코드 최적화"],"es":["revisión de código","seguridad del código","corrección del código","mantenibilidad del código","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["révision de code","sécurité du code","correction du code","maintenabilité du code","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Code-Review","Sicherheit des Codes","Korrektheit des Codes","Wartbarkeit des Codes","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["revisão de código","análise de segurança","verificação de correção","avaliação de manutenção","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","padrões de código","revisão de código automática"],"ru":["проверка кода","анализ безопасности","проверка корректности","оценка технического обслуживания","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","стандарты кода","автоматическая проверка кода"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود","تحليل الأمان","التحقق من الصحة","تقييم الصيانة","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","معايير الكود","مراجعة الكود الآلية"]}},"owner":"Masked-Kunsiquat","repo":"crm-orbit2","repoPath":"Masked-Kunsiquat/crm-orbit2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-reviewer","description":"Review code for correctness, maintainability, performance, and security. Produce actionable, prioritized feedback and concrete fixes aligned with repo standards.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Code Reviewer (Codex Skill)\n\nYou are the **Code Reviewer**. Your job is to identify issues and improvement opportunities in code changes (or a codebase area) with an emphasis on **security, correctness, and maintainability**. Provide **actionable feedback** and, when asked, propose **specific patches** that fit the repo’s conventions.\n\n## Scope + assumptions\n\n- Prefer the repository’s documented standards over generic best practices.\n- If the user does not specify scope (PR, commit range, fold","body":"# Code Reviewer (Codex Skill)\n\nYou are the **Code Reviewer**. Your job is to identify issues and improvement opportunities in code changes (or a codebase area) with an emphasis on **security, correctness, and maintainability**. Provide **actionable feedback** and, when asked, propose **specific patches** that fit the repo’s conventions.\n\n## Scope + assumptions\n\n- Prefer the repository’s documented standards over generic best practices.\n- If the user does not specify scope (PR, commit range, folder), infer it from context and state your assumption.\n- If you cannot run tools (no environment), do a static review and explicitly mark checks as “not executed”.\n\n## First steps: establish review context\n\n1. Identify the **review target**:\n   - PR / diff / commit range / branch comparison / folder review\n2. Discover **repo standards**:\n   - `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `README*`, `docs/**`, `.editorconfig`, lint configs, CI config\n3. Determine **language(s) and runtime**:\n   - package manifests, toolchain configs, build scripts\n4. Determine **risk level**:\n   - auth, payments, PII, crypto, infra, migrations, public APIs\n\nIf any of these are missing, proceed with reasonable defaults and call them out briefly.\n\n## Review order of operations (do not skip)\n\n### 1) Security first\nLook for:\n- injection vectors (SQL/NoSQL/command/template)\n- authn/authz gaps, privilege escalation, IDOR\n- unsafe deserialization, SSRF, path traversal\n- secrets exposure, logging of sensitive data\n- insecure crypto (homegrown, weak modes, bad randomness)\n- dependency risk signals (known vulnerable patterns, outdated libs)\n\n### 2) Correctness + reliability\nCheck:\n- error handling and edge cases\n- null/undefined behavior, boundary conditions\n- resource lifecycle (files, connections, handles)\n- concurrency/async hazards (races, deadlocks, un-awaited promises)\n- idempotency / retries where relevant\n- data integrity (migrations, schema changes, parsing)\n\n### 3) Maintainability\nCheck:\n- clarity and naming\n- duplication and unnecessary complexity\n- abstraction boundaries and file/module organization\n- testability (pure functions, injectable dependencies)\n- consistency with existing patterns in the repo\n\n### 4) Performance (only where meaningful)\nCheck:\n- algorithmic complexity hot spots\n- N+1 queries, inefficient loops over IO\n- unnecessary allocations / large object churn\n- caching opportunities and correctness of caches\n- blocking operations on critical paths\n\n### 5) Tests + docs\nCheck:\n- tests exist for critical behavior and edge cases\n- tests are deterministic and isolated\n- docs updated for new behavior, config, migrations, APIs\n\n## Automation (run when available)\n\nIf a runnable environment is available, attempt the repo’s standard checks:\n- lint / formatting\n- unit tests\n- typecheck\n- security scanning (where configured)\n- build\n\nPrefer repo scripts (`npm run lint`, `pnpm test`, etc.) over inventing commands.\n\nIf you run commands, include:\n- command\n- result (pass/fail)\n- key output excerpts (short)\n\n## Output format (required)\n\nProduce the review in this structure:\n\n### Summary\n- 3–8 bullets of the most important findings.\n\n### Findings (prioritized)\nUse categories and severities:\n\n- **Critical**: security issue, data loss risk, auth bypass, severe correctness bug\n- **High**: likely bug, serious maintainability regression, significant perf regression\n- **Medium**: improvement, refactor suggestion, non-trivial cleanup\n- **Low**: nits, style consistency, minor docs\n\nFor each finding include:\n- **Where**: file path + function/block (or “general pattern”)\n- **Why it matters**\n- **Recommendation**\n- **Example fix** (pseudo or patch guidance)\n\n### Quick wins\n- 3–10 low-risk improvements that boost quality fast.\n\n### Verification steps\n- commands or steps to validate the fix (or “not runnable here”).\n\n## Review heuristics (practical rules)\n\n- Prefer “fix the root cause” over patching symptoms.\n- Avoid drive-by refactors unless they reduce risk or complexity.\n- Suggest changes that match existing idioms in this repo.\n- Be direct: don’t bury critical issues in long lists.\n- If uncertain, mark it explicitly and suggest how to confirm.\n\n## Optional deliverables (when requested)\n\n- Proposed patch/diff (small, scoped)\n- `docs/review.md` report\n- A checklist for the author to address before merge\n- Follow-up tasks (tickets) with clear acceptance criteria\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:46:18.775Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Analysis Agents requiring advanced security, correctness, and maintainability auditing capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级安全性、正确性和可维护性审计功能的代码分析代理。","ja":"高度なセキュリティ、正しさ、保守性の監査機能を必要とするコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 보안, 올바름, 유지 보수성 감사 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de código que requieren capacidades de auditoría de seguridad, corrección y mantenibilidad avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant des capacités d''audit de sécurité, de correction et de maintenabilité avancées.","de":"Ideal für Code-Analyse-Agenten, die erweiterte Sicherheits-, Korrektheits- und Wartbarkeits-Auditfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Código que requerem capacidades avançadas de auditoria de segurança, correção e manutenção.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа кода, требующих расширенных возможностей аудита безопасности, правильности и поддерживаемости.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يتطلب مهارات متقدمة لمراجعة الأمان والصوابية والصيانة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify security vulnerabilities, correctness issues, and maintainability improvements in code changes, providing actionable feedback and proposing specific patches that adhere to repository conventions and standards, leveraging emphasis on security, correctness, and maintainability.","zh":"赋予代理识别代码更改中的安全漏洞、正确性问题和可维护性改进，提供可行的反馈，并提出符合仓库惯例和标准的具体补丁，强调安全性、正确性和可维护性。","ja":"コード変更におけるセキュリティの脆弱性、正しさの問題、保守性の改善を特定するエージェントを可能にし、実行可能なフィードバックを提供し、リポジトリの規範と標準に従った具体的なパッチを提案することで、セキュリティ、正しさ、保守性に重点を置く。","ko":"에이전트가 코드 변경의 보안 취약점, 올바름 문제, 유지 보수성 개선을 식별할 수 있도록 하며, 실행 가능한 피드백을 제공하고, 저장소 규칙 및 표준을 준수하는 구체적인 패치를 제안하여 보안, 올바름, 유지 보수성에 중점을 둡니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes identificar vulnerabilidades de seguridad, problemas de corrección y mejoras de mantenibilidad en los cambios de código, proporcionando comentarios accionables y proponiendo parches específicos que se ajustan a las convenciones y normas del repositorio, aprovechando el énfasis en la seguridad, la corrección y la mantenibilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les vulnérabilités de sécurité, les problèmes de correction et les améliorations de maintenabilité dans les modifications de code, en fournissant des commentaires exploitables et en proposant des correctifs spécifiques qui respectent les conventions et les normes du référentiel, en mettant l''accent sur la sécurité, la correction et la maintenabilité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Sicherheitsverwundbarkeiten, Korrektheitsprobleme und Wartbarkeitsverbesserungen in Codeänderungen zu identifizieren und handhabbare Feedback sowie spezifische Patches vorzuschlagen, die den Repository-Konventionen und -Standards entsprechen und den Schwerpunkt auf Sicherheit, Korrektheit und Wartbarkeit legen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar vulnerabilidades de segurança, problemas de correção e melhorias de manutenção nas alterações de código, fornecendo feedback ação e propondo patches específicos que aderem às convenções e normas do repositório, aproveitando a ênfase na segurança, correção e manutenção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять уязвимости безопасности, проблемы правильности и улучшения поддерживаемости в изменениях кода, предоставляя действенные отзывы и предлагая конкретные патчи, соответствующие конвенциям и стандартам репозитория, используя акцент на безопасности, правильности и поддерживаемости.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من تحديد الثغرات الأمنية والمشاكل في الصوابية وتحسينات الصيانة في تعديلات الشفرة، وتقديم ملاحظات قابلة للتنفيذ واقتراح تصحيحات محددة تتوافق مع اتفاقيات ومعايير المستودع، مع التركيز على الأمان والصوابية والصيانة."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing pull requests for security and correctness","Auditing codebase areas for maintainability improvements","Generating specific patches for code issues","Providing actionable feedback on code changes"],"zh":["审查拉取请求的安全性和正确性","审计代码库区域以改进可维护性","为代码问题生成具体补丁","为代码更改提供可行的反馈"],"ja":["セキュリティと正しさのプルリクエストのレビュー","保守性の改善のためにコードベースの領域を監査する","コードの問題に対する具体的なパッチを生成する","コードの変更に対する実行可能なフィードバックを提供する"],"ko":["보안 및 올바름을 위한 풀 リクエスト 검토","유지 보수성 개선을 위한 코드베이스 영역 감사","코드 문제에 대한 구체적인 패치 생성","코드 변경에 대한 실행 가능한 피드백 제공"],"es":["Revisar solicitudes de extracción para seguridad y corrección","Auditar áreas del código para mejoras de mantenibilidad","Generar parches específicos para problemas de código","Proporcionar comentarios accionables sobre cambios de código"],"fr":["Réviser les demandes d''extraction pour la sécurité et la correction","Auditer les zones de code pour les améliorations de maintenabilité","Générer des correctifs spécifiques pour les problèmes de code","Fournir des commentaires exploitables sur les modifications de code"],"de":["Ziehen von Pull-Requests für Sicherheit und Korrektheit überprüfen","Codebasis-Bereiche für Wartbarkeitsverbesserungen auditen","Spezifische Patches für Codeprobleme generieren","Handhabbare Feedback zu Codeänderungen bereitstellen"],"pt":["Revisar solicitações de pull para segurança e correção","Auditar áreas do código para melhorias de manutenção","Gerar patches específicos para problemas de código","Fornecer feedback ação sobre alterações de código"],"ru":["Просмотр запросов на включение для безопасности и правильности","Аудит областей кода для улучшения поддерживаемости","Генерация конкретных патчей для проблем кода","Предоставление действенных отзывов о изменениях кода"],"ar":["استعراض طلبات الدمج للأمان والصوابية","مراجعة مناطق الشفرة لتحسينات الصيانة","توليد تصحيحات محددة لمشاكل الشفرة","تقديم ملاحظات قابلة للتنفيذ حول تعديلات الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Prefers repository''s documented standards over generic best practices","Requires scope specification for effective code review"],"zh":["更喜欢仓库的文档化标准而不是通用最佳实践","需要范围规范以实现有效的代码审查"],"ja":["一般的なベストプラクティスよりもリポジトリの文書化された規範を優先する","効果的なコードレビューのためにスコープの指定が必要"],"ko":["일반적인 모범 사례보다 저장소의 문서화된 표준을 선호함","유효한 코드 검토를 위해 범위 사양이 필요함"],"es":["Prefiere los estándares documentados del repositorio sobre las mejores prácticas genéricas","Requiere la especificación del alcance para una revisión de código efectiva"],"fr":["Préfère les normes documentées du référentiel aux meilleures pratiques génériques","Nécessite la spécification de la portée pour une révision de code efficace"],"de":["Bevorzugt die dokumentierten Standards des Repository gegenüber generischen Best Practices","Benötigt eine Spezifikation des Umfangs für eine effektive Code-Überprüfung"],"pt":["Prefere os padrões documentados do repositório em vez de boas práticas genéricas","Requer especificação de escopo para revisão de código eficaz"],"ru":["Предпочитает документированные стандарты репозитория над общими лучшими практиками","Требует указания области применения для эффективного обзора кода"],"ar":["يفضل المعايير الموثقة للمستودع على أفضل الممارسات العامة","يتطلب تحديد نطاق لمراجعة الشفرة الفعالة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('SHUAXINDIARY/vue-ganttastic-demo/vue', 'community', 'SHUAXINDIARY', 'vue-ganttastic-demo', 'SHUAXINDIARY/vue-ganttastic-demo', 'vue', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:46:34.908Z', NULL, '{"id":"SHUAXINDIARY/vue-ganttastic-demo/vue","name":"vue","description":{"zh":"该 demo 展示了如何使用 Vue 3.5 和 Composition API 创建并行甘特图，实现多任务管理","ja":"このデモは、Vue 3.5 と Composition API を使用して並行ガントチャートを作成し、マルチタスク管理を実現する方法を示しています","ko":"이 데모는 Vue 3.5 및 Composition API를 사용하여 병렬 간트 차트를 생성하고 다중 작업 관리를 구현하는 방법을 보여줍니다","es":"Vue 3.5 ofrece una forma eficiente de construir aplicaciones web con su API de composición. Aprende a usarla para mejorar el rendimiento.","fr":"Vue 3.5 propose une façon efficiente de construire des applications web avec son API de composition. Découvrez comment l''utiliser pour améliorer les performances.","de":"Vue 3.5 bietet eine effiziente Möglichkeit, Webanwendungen mit seiner Composition-API zu erstellen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese nutzen können, um die Leistung zu verbessern.","pt":"Desenvolva aplicações web escaláveis com Vue, utilizando a Composition API e TypeScript. Aprenda as melhores práticas para melhorar a performance.","ru":"Разработайте масштабируемые веб-приложения с помощью Vue, используя Composition API и TypeScript. Узнайте лучшие практики для улучшения производительности.","ar":"انشئ تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتوسيع مع فيو، باستخدام Composition API وTypeScript. تعلم أفضل الممارسات لتحسين الأداء.","en":"多任务并行甘特图demo"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vue 3.5 并行甘特图 Demo","ja":"Vue 3.5 パラレルガントチャートデモ","ko":"Vue 3.5 병렬 간트 차트 데모","es":"Vue 3.5: Guía de composición y rendimiento","fr":"Vue 3.5: Guide de composition et de performances","de":"Vue 3.5: Leitfaden für Composition und Leistung","pt":"Desenvolvimento com Vue: Guia de Início Rápido","ru":"Разработка на Vue: Быстрый Старт","ar":"تطوير تطبيقات ويب مع فيو: دليل السريع","en":"vue"},"description":{"zh":"该 demo 展示了如何使用 Vue 3.5 和 Composition API 创建并行甘特图，实现多任务管理","ja":"このデモは、Vue 3.5 と Composition API を使用して並行ガントチャートを作成し、マルチタスク管理を実現する方法を示しています","ko":"이 데모는 Vue 3.5 및 Composition API를 사용하여 병렬 간트 차트를 생성하고 다중 작업 관리를 구현하는 방법을 보여줍니다","es":"Vue 3.5 ofrece una forma eficiente de construir aplicaciones web con su API de composición. Aprende a usarla para mejorar el rendimiento.","fr":"Vue 3.5 propose une façon efficiente de construire des applications web avec son API de composition. Découvrez comment l''utiliser pour améliorer les performa...","de":"Vue 3.5 bietet eine effiziente Möglichkeit, Webanwendungen mit seiner Composition-API zu erstellen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese nutzen können, um die Leistun...","pt":"Desenvolva aplicações web escaláveis com Vue, utilizando a Composition API e TypeScript. Aprenda as melhores práticas para melhorar a performance.","ru":"Разработайте масштабируемые веб-приложения с помощью Vue, используя Composition API и TypeScript. Узнайте лучшие практики для улучшения производительности.","ar":"انشئ تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتوسيع مع فيو، باستخدام Composition API وTypeScript. تعلم أفضل الممارسات لتحسين الأداء.","en":"多任务并行甘特图demo"},"definition":{"en":"多任务并行甘特图demo"},"features":{"zh":["基于 Vue 3.5","使用 Composition API","支持 TypeScript","并行甘特图 demo","多任务管理"],"ja":["Vue 3.5 に基づく","Composition API を使用","TypeScript をサポート","並行ガントチャートデモ","マルチタスク管理"],"ko":["Vue 3.5 기반","Composition API 사용","TypeScript 지원","병렬 간트 차트 데모","다중 작업 관리"],"es":["API de composición","Mejores prácticas para el rendimiento","Uso de TypeScript","Preferencia por shallowRef sobre ref","Uso de la etiqueta script setup"],"fr":["API de composition","Meilleures pratiques pour les performances","Utilisation de TypeScript","Préférence pour shallowRef sur ref","Utilisation de la balise script setup"],"de":["Composition-API","Best Practices für die Leistung","Verwendung von TypeScript","Bevorzugung von shallowRef über ref","Verwendung der Script-Setup-Schaltfläche"],"pt":["Utilização da Composition API","Suporte a TypeScript","Otimização de performance com shallowRef","Definição de macros com defineP","Uso de script setup com lang=''ts''"],"ru":["Использование Composition API","Поддержка TypeScript","Оптимизация производительности с помощью shallowRef","Определение макросов с помощью defineP","Использование скрипта настройки с lang=''ts''"],"ar":["استخدام Composition API","دعم TypeScript","تحسين الأداء باستخدام shallowRef","تحديد الماكرو باستخدام defineP","استخدام سكريبت الإعداد مع lang=''ts''"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vue 3.5","Composition API","TypeScript","并行甘特图","多任务管理","前端开发"],"ja":["Vue 3.5","Composition API","TypeScript","並行ガントチャート","マルチタスク管理","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Vue 3.5","Composition API","TypeScript","병렬 간트 차트","다중 작업 관리","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["Vue 3.5","API de composición","TypeScript","shallowRef","ref","rendimiento web","desarrollo web","framework JavaScript"],"fr":["Vue 3.5","API de composition","TypeScript","shallowRef","ref","performances web","développement web","framework JavaScript"],"de":["Vue 3.5","Composition-API","TypeScript","shallowRef","ref","Webleistung","Webentwicklung","JavaScript-Framework"],"pt":["vue","composition api","typescript","shallowref","definep","script setup","desenvolvimento web","aplicações web escaláveis"],"ru":["vue","composition api","typescript","shallowref","definep","скрипт настройки","веб-разработка","масштабируемые веб-приложения"],"ar":["فيو","composition api","typescript","shallowref","definep","سكريبت الإعداد","تطوير ويب","تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتوسيع"]}},"owner":"SHUAXINDIARY","repo":"vue-ganttastic-demo","repoPath":"SHUAXINDIARY/vue-ganttastic-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue","description":"Vue 3 Composition API, script setup macros, reactivity system, and built-in components. Use when writing Vue SFCs, defineProps/defineEmits/defineModel, watchers, or using Transition/Teleport/Suspense/KeepAlive.","version":"2026.1.31","bodyPreview":"# Vue\n\n> Based on Vue 3.5. Always use Composition API with `<script setup lang=\"ts\">`.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Prefer TypeScript over JavaScript\n- Prefer `<script setup lang=\"ts\">` over `<script>`\n- For performance, prefer `shallowRef` over `ref` if deep reactivity is not needed\n- Always use Composition API over Options API\n- Discourage using Reactive Props Destructure\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Script Setup & Macros | `<script setup>`, defineP","body":"# Vue\n\n> Based on Vue 3.5. Always use Composition API with `<script setup lang=\"ts\">`.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Prefer TypeScript over JavaScript\n- Prefer `<script setup lang=\"ts\">` over `<script>`\n- For performance, prefer `shallowRef` over `ref` if deep reactivity is not needed\n- Always use Composition API over Options API\n- Discourage using Reactive Props Destructure\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Script Setup & Macros | `<script setup>`, defineProps, defineEmits, defineModel, defineExpose, defineOptions, defineSlots, generics | [script-setup-macros](references/script-setup-macros.md) |\n| Reactivity & Lifecycle | ref, shallowRef, computed, watch, watchEffect, effectScope, lifecycle hooks, composables | [core-new-apis](references/core-new-apis.md) |\n\n## Features\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Built-in Components & Directives | Transition, Teleport, Suspense, KeepAlive, v-memo, custom directives | [advanced-patterns](references/advanced-patterns.md) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Component Template\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref, computed, watch, onMounted } from ''vue''\n\nconst props = defineProps<{\n  title: string\n  count?: number\n}>()\n\nconst emit = defineEmits<{\n  update: [value: string]\n}>()\n\nconst model = defineModel<string>()\n\nconst doubled = computed(() => (props.count ?? 0) * 2)\n\nwatch(() => props.title, (newVal) => {\n  console.log(''Title changed:'', newVal)\n})\n\nonMounted(() => {\n  console.log(''Component mounted'')\n})\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div>{{ title }} - {{ doubled }}</div>\n</template>\n```\n\n### Key Imports\n\n```ts\n// Reactivity\nimport { ref, shallowRef, computed, reactive, readonly, toRef, toRefs, toValue } from ''vue''\n\n// Watchers\nimport { watch, watchEffect, watchPostEffect, onWatcherCleanup } from ''vue''\n\n// Lifecycle\nimport { onMounted, onUpdated, onUnmounted, onBeforeMount, onBeforeUpdate, onBeforeUnmount } from ''vue''\n\n// Utilities\nimport { nextTick, defineComponent, defineAsyncComponent } from ''vue''\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:46:34.908Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Development Agents requiring advanced Vue 3.5 Composition API implementation with TypeScript.","zh":"适用于需要高级Vue 3.5 Composition API实现的TypeScript的前端开发代理。","ja":"TypeScriptを使用した高度なVue 3.5 Composition APIの実装を必要とするフロントエンド開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Vue 3.5 Composition API 구현을 필요로하는 TypeScript를 사용하는 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo frontend que requieren una implementación avanzada de la API de composición de Vue 3.5 con TypeScript.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement frontend nécessitant une mise en œuvre avancée de l''API de composition Vue 3.5 avec TypeScript.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Implementierung der Vue 3.5 Composition API mit TypeScript erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend que exigem implementação avançada da API de Composição do Vue 3.5 com TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки frontend, требующих продвинутой реализации API Composition Vue 3.5 с TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الأمامي الذي يتطلب تنفيذا متقدمًا لبروتوكول تركيبة Vue 3.5 مع TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to generate and analyze multi-task parallel Gantt chart demos using Vue 3.5''s Composition API with <script setup lang=''ts''>. Provides optimized performance patterns including shallowRef usage and proper reactive props handling.","zh":"使代理能够生成和分析使用Vue 3.5的Composition API和<script setup lang=''ts''>的多任务并行甘特图演示。提供了优化的性能模式，包括浅引用使用和适当的响应式属性处理。","ja":"エージェントがVue 3.5のComposition APIと<script setup lang=''ts''>を使用して、マルチタスク並列ガントチャートのデモを生成し、分析できるようにします。浅い参照の使用や適切なリアクティブプロパティの处理など、最適化されたパフォーマンスパターンを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Vue 3.5의 Composition API와 <script setup lang=''ts''>를 사용하여 다중 작업 병렬 ガント 차트 데모를 생성하고 분석할 수 있도록 합니다. 얕은 참조 사용 및 적절한 반응성 속성 처리 등을 포함한 최적화된 성능 패턴을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar y analizar demos de gráficos de Gantt paralelos multitarea utilizando la API de composición de Vue 3.5 con <script setup lang=''ts''>. Proporciona patrones de rendimiento optimizados, incluido el uso de shallowRef y el manejo adecuado de propiedades reactivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et d''analyser des démos de graphiques de Gantt parallèles multitâches en utilisant l''API de composition Vue 3.5 avec <script setup lang=''ts''>. Fournit des modèles de performances optimisées, notamment l''utilisation de shallowRef et la gestion appropriée des propriétés réactives.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Demos von parallelen Gantt-Chart-Multitask-Visualisierungen mit der Vue 3.5 Composition API und <script setup lang=''ts''> zu generieren und zu analysieren. Bietet optimierte Leistungsmuster, einschließlich der Verwendung von shallowRef und der ordnungsgemäßen Verarbeitung reaktiver Eigenschaften.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem e analisem demos de gráficos de Gantt paralelos multi-tarefa usando a API de Composição do Vue 3.5 com <script setup lang=''ts''>. Fornece padrões de desempenho otimizados, incluindo uso de shallowRef e tratamento adequado de props reativos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и анализировать демонстрации параллельных задач с помощью API Composition Vue 3.5 и <script setup lang=''ts''>. Предоставляет оптимизированные шаблоны производительности, включая использование shallowRef и правильное xử lý реактивных свойств.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء وتحليل عروض توضيحية لمخططات غانت متوازي متعددة المهام باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تركيبة Vue 3.5 مع <script setup lang=''ts''>. يوفر أنماطاً لتحسين الأداء ، بما في ذلك استخدام shallowRef ومعالجة مناسبة للخصائص التفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating parallel task visualization components","Analyzing Vue 3.5 Composition API patterns","Optimizing reactivity with shallowRef implementations","Debugging reactive props destructuring issues"],"zh":["生成并行任务可视化组件","分析Vue 3.5 Composition API模式","使用浅引用实现优化反应性","调试反应性属性析构问题"],"ja":["並列タスクの視覚化コンポーネントを生成する","Vue 3.5 Composition APIのパターンを分析する","浅い参照を使用したリアクティビティの最適化","リアクティブプロパティの析出に関する問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["병렬 작업 시각화 구성 요소를 생성하는 것","Vue 3.5 Composition API 패턴을 분석하는 것","얕은 참조를 사용한 반응성 최적화","반응성 속성析构 관련 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Generación de componentes de visualización de tareas paralelas","Análisis de patrones de API de composición de Vue 3.5","Optimización de la reactividad con implementaciones de shallowRef","Depuración de problemas de destrucción de propiedades reactivas"],"fr":["Génération de composants de visualisation de tâches parallèles","Analyse de modèles d''API de composition Vue 3.5","Optimisation de la réactivité avec des implémentations de shallowRef","Débogage des problèmes de déstructuration des propriétés réactives"],"de":["Generierung von Komponenten zur Visualisierung paralleler Aufgaben","Analyse von Mustern der Vue 3.5 Composition API","Optimierung der Reaktivität mit shallowRef-Implementierungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen mit der Zerlegung reaktiver Eigenschaften"],"pt":["Geração de componentes de visualização de tarefas paralelas","Análise de padrões da API de Composição do Vue 3.5","Otimização da reatividade com implementações de shallowRef","Depuração de problemas de destruturação de props reativos"],"ru":["Генерация компонентов визуализации параллельных задач","Анализ шаблонов API Composition Vue 3.5","Оптимизация реактивности с помощью реализаций shallowRef","Отладка проблем разбора реактивных свойств"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات لمخططات توضيحية لمهام متوازي","تحليل أنماط واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تركيبة Vue 3.5","تحسين التفاعل باستخدام تنفيذ shallowRef","تصحيح أخطاء تحليل الخصائص التفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Vue 3.5+ required","TypeScript mandatory","Composition API exclusive","No Options API support"],"zh":["需要Vue 3.5+","TypeScript是必需的","仅限Composition API","不支持Options API"],"ja":["Vue 3.5+が必要","TypeScriptは必須","Composition APIのみ","Options APIはサポートされません"],"ko":["Vue 3.5+ 필요","TypeScript 필수","Composition API 전용","Options API 지원 안함"],"es":["Se requiere Vue 3.5 o superior","TypeScript es obligatorio","API de composición exclusiva","No se admite la API de opciones"],"fr":["Vue 3.5 ou supérieur est requis","TypeScript est obligatoire","API de composition exclusive","Aucun support pour l''API des options"],"de":["Vue 3.5 oder höher erforderlich","TypeScript ist obligatorisch","Composition API exklusiv","Keine Unterstützung für die Options-API"],"pt":["Requer Vue 3.5+","TypeScript é obrigatório","API de Composição exclusiva","Sem suporte para API de Opções"],"ru":["Требуется Vue 3.5+","TypeScript обязательный","Эксклюзивная API Composition","Нет поддержки API Options"],"ar":["مطلوب Vue 3.5+","TypeScript إجباري","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تركيبة حصرية","دون دعم لواجهة برمجة تطبيقات الخيارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ivannxbt/config/agent-browser', 'community', 'ivannxbt', 'config', 'ivannxbt/config', 'agent-browser', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:46:21.771Z', NULL, '{"id":"ivannxbt/config/agent-browser","name":"agent-browser","description":{"zh":"agent-browser 是一个用于浏览器自动化的工具，提供了中央化的配置和开发工具","ja":"agent-browser はブラウザ自動化のためのツールで、中央化された構成と開発ツールを提供する","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화를 위한 도구로, 중앙화된 구성과 개발 도구를 제공한다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta de desarrollo de IA que permite la automatización de tareas en el navegador. Ofrece una configuración centralizada para agentes de IA y herramientas de desarrollo.","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil de développement d''IA qui permet l''automatisation de tâches dans le navigateur. Il offre une configuration centralisée pour les agents d''IA et les outils de développement.","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Entwicklungstool für künstliche Intelligenz, das die Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser ermöglicht. Es bietet eine zentrale Konfiguration für IA-Agenten und Entwicklungstools.","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite configurar e executar tarefas de desenvolvimento de forma centralizada","ru":"Agent-browser - это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который позволяет настраивать и выполнять задачи разработки в централизованном порядке","ar":"وحدة agent-browser هي أداة أتمتة متصفح تسمح بالتكوين والتشغيل المركزي لمهام التطوير","en":"Configuraciones centralizadas para agentes de IA y herramientas de desarrollo. "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"agent-browser 浏览器自动化","ja":"agent-browser ブラウザ自動化","ko":"agent-browser 브라우저 자동화","es":"Automatización de navegador con agent-browser","fr":"Automatisation de navigateur avec agent-browser","de":"Browser-Automatisierung mit agent-browser","pt":"Automatize Navegadores com agent-browser","ru":"Автоматизируйте браузеры с agent-browser","ar":"أتمتة المتصفحات باستخدام agent-browser","en":"agent-browser"},"description":{"zh":"agent-browser 是一个用于浏览器自动化的工具，提供了中央化的配置和开发工具","ja":"agent-browser はブラウザ自動化のためのツールで、中央化された構成と開発ツールを提供する","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화를 위한 도구로, 중앙화된 구성과 개발 도구를 제공한다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta de desarrollo de IA que permite la automatización de tareas en el navegador. Ofrece una configuración centralizada para agen...","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil de développement d''IA qui permet l''automatisation de tâches dans le navigateur. Il offre une configuration centralisée pour les ag...","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Entwicklungstool für künstliche Intelligenz, das die Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser ermöglicht. Es bietet eine zentrale Konfig...","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite configurar e executar tarefas de desenvolvimento de forma centralizada","ru":"Agent-browser - это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который позволяет настраивать и выполнять задачи разработки в централизованном порядке","ar":"وحدة agent-browser هي أداة أتمتة متصفح تسمح بالتكوين والتشغيل المركزي لمهام التطوير","en":"Configuraciones centralizadas para agentes de IA y herramientas de desarrollo. "},"definition":{"en":"Configuraciones centralizadas para agentes de IA y herramientas de desarrollo. "},"features":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","中央化配置","开发工具","支持导航","支持快照","支持点击和填充"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","中央化された構成","開発ツール","ナビゲーションのサポート","スナップショットのサポート","クリックとフィルのサポート"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","중앙화된 구성","개발 도구","네비게이션 지원","스냅샷 지원","클릭과 채우기 지원"],"es":["Automatización de tareas en el navegador","Configuración centralizada para agentes de IA","Herramientas de desarrollo integradas","Compatibilidad con múltiples navegadores","Interfaz de línea de comandos intuitiva"],"fr":["Automatisation de tâches dans le navigateur","Configuration centralisée pour les agents d''IA","Outils de développement intégrés","Compatibilité avec plusieurs navigateurs","Interface de ligne de commande intuitive"],"de":["Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser","Zentrale Konfiguration für IA-Agenten","Integrierte Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Browsern","Intuitive Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle"],"pt":["Abre URLs específicas","Captura elementos interativos","Clica em elementos por referência","Preenche inputs por referência","Fecha o navegador"],"ru":["Открывает конкретные URL-адреса","Получает интерактивные элементы","Кликает на элементы по ссылке","Заполняет поля ввода по ссылке","Закрывает браузер"],"ar":["افتح عناوين URL محددة","التقاط العناصر التفاعلية","النقر على العناصر بواسطة المرجع","ملء الإدخال بواسطة المرجع","إغلاق المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","agent-browser","开发工具","自动化测试","浏览器控制","开发效率"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","agent-browser","開発ツール","自動化テスト","ブラウザ制御","開発効率"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","agent-browser","개발 도구","자동화 테스트","브라우저 제어","개발 효율성"],"es":["automatización de navegador","desarrollo de IA","agentes de IA","herramientas de desarrollo","automatización de tareas","navegador automático","IA en el navegador"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","développement d''IA","agents d''IA","outils de développement","automatisation de tâches","navigateur automatique","IA dans le navigateur"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","Entwicklung von künstlicher Intelligenz","IA-Agenten","Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","automatischer Browser","künstliche Intelligenz im Browser"],"pt":["automação de navegador","desenvolvimento de software","testes de navegador","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","agent-browser","automatização de tarefas"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование браузера","инструменты разработки","agent-browser","автоматизация задач"],"ar":["أتمتة المتصفح","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات المتصفح","أدوات التطوير","وحدة agent-browser","أتمتة المهام"]}},"owner":"ivannxbt","repo":"config","repoPath":"ivannxbt/config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>        # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i       # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1         # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"   # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close             # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. Intera","body":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>        # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i       # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1         # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"   # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close             # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n4. Re-snapshot after navigation or significant DOM changes\n\n## Commands\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>      # Navigate to URL (aliases: goto, navigate)\n                              # Supports: https://, http://, file://, about:, data://\n                              # Auto-prepends https:// if no protocol given\nagent-browser back            # Go back\nagent-browser forward         # Go forward\nagent-browser reload          # Reload page\nagent-browser close           # Close browser (aliases: quit, exit)\nagent-browser connect 9222    # Connect to browser via CDP port\n```\n\n### Snapshot (page analysis)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot            # Full accessibility tree\nagent-browser snapshot -i         # Interactive elements only (recommended)\nagent-browser snapshot -c         # Compact output\nagent-browser snapshot -d 3       # Limit depth to 3\nagent-browser snapshot -s \"#main\" # Scope to CSS selector\n```\n\n### Interactions (use @refs from snapshot)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser click @e1           # Click\nagent-browser dblclick @e1        # Double-click\nagent-browser focus @e1           # Focus element\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"     # Clear and type\nagent-browser type @e2 \"text\"     # Type without clearing\nagent-browser press Enter         # Press key (alias: key)\nagent-browser press Control+a     # Key combination\nagent-browser keydown Shift       # Hold key down\nagent-browser keyup Shift         # Release key\nagent-browser hover @e1           # Hover\nagent-browser check @e1           # Check checkbox\nagent-browser uncheck @e1         # Uncheck checkbox\nagent-browser select @e1 \"value\"  # Select dropdown option\nagent-browser select @e1 \"a\" \"b\"  # Select multiple options\nagent-browser scroll down 500     # Scroll page (default: down 300px)\nagent-browser scrollintoview @e1  # Scroll element into view (alias: scrollinto)\nagent-browser drag @e1 @e2        # Drag and drop\nagent-browser upload @e1 file.pdf # Upload files\n```\n\n### Get information\n\n```bash\nagent-browser get text @e1        # Get element text\nagent-browser get html @e1        # Get innerHTML\nagent-browser get value @e1       # Get input value\nagent-browser get attr @e1 href   # Get attribute\nagent-browser get title           # Get page title\nagent-browser get url             # Get current URL\nagent-browser get count \".item\"   # Count matching elements\nagent-browser get box @e1         # Get bounding box\nagent-browser get styles @e1      # Get computed styles (font, color, bg, etc.)\n```\n\n### Check state\n\n```bash\nagent-browser is visible @e1      # Check if visible\nagent-browser is enabled @e1      # Check if enabled\nagent-browser is checked @e1      # Check if checked\n```\n\n### Screenshots & PDF\n\n```bash\nagent-browser screenshot          # Screenshot to stdout\nagent-browser screenshot path.png # Save to file\nagent-browser screenshot --full   # Full page\nagent-browser pdf output.pdf      # Save as PDF\n```\n\n### Video recording\n\n```bash\nagent-browser record start ./demo.webm    # Start recording (uses current URL + state)\nagent-browser click @e1                   # Perform actions\nagent-browser record stop                 # Stop and save video\nagent-browser record restart ./take2.webm # Stop current + start new recording\n```\n\nRecording creates a fresh context but preserves cookies/storage from your session. If no URL is provided, it\nautomatically returns to your current page. For smooth demos, explore first, then start recording.\n\n### Wait\n\n```bash\nagent-browser wait @e1                     # Wait for element\nagent-browser wait 2000                    # Wait milliseconds\nagent-browser wait --text \"Success\"        # Wait for text (or -t)\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"    # Wait for URL pattern (or -u)\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle      # Wait for network idle (or -l)\nagent-browser wait --fn \"window.ready\"     # Wait for JS condition (or -f)\n```\n\n### Mouse control\n\n```bash\nagent-browser mouse move 100 200      # Move mouse\nagent-browser mouse down left         # Press button\nagent-browser mouse up left           # Release button\nagent-browser mouse wheel 100         # Scroll wheel\n```\n\n### Semantic locators (alternative to refs)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser find role button click --name \"Submit\"\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click --exact      # Exact match only\nagent-browser find label \"Email\" fill \"user@test.com\"\nagent-browser find placeholder \"Search\" type \"query\"\nagent-browser find alt \"Logo\" click\nagent-browser find title \"Close\" click\nagent-browser find testid \"submit-btn\" click\nagent-browser find first \".item\" click\nagent-browser find last \".item\" click\nagent-browser find nth 2 \"a\" hover\n```\n\n### Browser settings\n\n```bash\nagent-browser set viewport 1920 1080          # Set viewport size\nagent-browser set device \"iPhone 14\"          # Emulate device\nagent-browser set geo 37.7749 -122.4194       # Set geolocation (alias: geolocation)\nagent-browser set offline on                  # Toggle offline mode\nagent-browser set headers ''{\"X-Key\":\"v\"}''     # Extra HTTP headers\nagent-browser set credentials user pass       # HTTP basic auth (alias: auth)\nagent-browser set media dark                  # Emulate color scheme\nagent-browser set media light reduced-motion  # Light mode + reduced motion\n```\n\n### Cookies & Storage\n\n```bash\nagent-browser cookies                     # Get all cookies\nagent-browser cookies set name value      # Set cookie\nagent-browser cookies clear               # Clear cookies\nagent-browser storage local               # Get all localStorage\nagent-browser storage local key           # Get specific key\nagent-browser storage local set k v       # Set value\nagent-browser storage local clear         # Clear all\n```\n\n### Network\n\n```bash\nagent-browser network route <url>              # Intercept requests\nagent-browser network route <url> --abort      # Block requests\nagent-browser network route <url> --body ''{}''  # Mock response\nagent-browser network unroute [url]            # Remove routes\nagent-browser network requests                 # View tracked requests\nagent-browser network requests --filter api    # Filter requests\n```\n\n### Tabs & Windows\n\n```bash\nagent-browser tab                 # List tabs\nagent-browser tab new [url]       # New tab\nagent-browser tab 2               # Switch to tab by index\nagent-browser tab close           # Close current tab\nagent-browser tab close 2         # Close tab by index\nagent-browser window new          # New window\n```\n\n### Frames\n\n```bash\nagent-browser frame \"#iframe\"     # Switch to iframe\nagent-browser frame main          # Back to main frame\n```\n\n### Dialogs\n\n```bash\nagent-browser dialog accept [text]  # Accept dialog\nagent-browser dialog dismiss        # Dismiss dialog\n```\n\n### JavaScript\n\n```bash\nagent-browser eval \"document.title\"   # Run JavaScript\n```\n\n## Global options\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --session <name> ...    # Isolated browser session\nagent-browser --json ...              # JSON output for parsing\nagent-browser --headed ...            # Show browser window (not headless)\nagent-browser --full ...              # Full page screenshot (-f)\nagent-browser --cdp <port> ...        # Connect via Chrome DevTools Protocol\nagent-browser --proxy <url> ...       # Use proxy server\nagent-browser --headers <json> ...    # HTTP headers scoped to URL''s origin\nagent-browser --executable-path <p>   # Custom browser executable\nagent-browser --extension <path> ...  # Load browser extension (repeatable)\nagent-browser --help                  # Show help (-h)\nagent-browser --version               # Show version (-V)\nagent-browser <command> --help        # Show detailed help for a command\n```\n\n### Proxy support\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --proxy http://proxy.com:8080 open example.com\nagent-browser --proxy http://user:pass@proxy.com:8080 open example.com\nagent-browser --proxy socks5://proxy.com:1080 open example.com\n```\n\n## Environment variables\n\n```bash\nAGENT_BROWSER_SESSION=\"mysession\"            # Default session name\nAGENT_BROWSER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=\"/path/chrome\" # Custom browser path\nAGENT_BROWSER_EXTENSIONS=\"/ext1,/ext2\"       # Comma-separated extension paths\nAGENT_BROWSER_STREAM_PORT=\"9223\"             # WebSocket streaming port\nAGENT_BROWSER_HOME=\"/path/to/agent-browser\"  # Custom install location (for daemon.js)\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\nagent-browser snapshot -i\n# Output shows: textbox \"Email\" [ref=e1], textbox \"Password\" [ref=e2], button \"Submit\" [ref=e3]\n\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"user@example.com\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password123\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\nagent-browser snapshot -i  # Check result\n```\n\n## Example: Authentication with saved state\n\n```bash\n# Login once\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/login\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"username\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"\nagent-browser state save auth.json\n\n# Later sessions: load saved state\nagent-browser state load auth.json\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/dashboard\n```\n\n## Sessions (parallel browsers)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --session test1 open site-a.com\nagent-browser --session test2 open site-b.com\nagent-browser session list\n```\n\n## JSON output (for parsing)\n\nAdd `--json` for machine-readable output:\n\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot -i --json\nagent-browser get text @e1 --json\n```\n\n## Debugging\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --headed open example.com   # Show browser window\nagent-browser --cdp 9222 snapshot         # Connect via CDP port\nagent-browser connect 9222                # Alternative: connect command\nagent-browser console                     # View console messages\nagent-browser console --clear             # Clear console\nagent-browser errors                      # View page errors\nagent-browser errors --clear              # Clear errors\nagent-browser highlight @e1               # Highlight element\nagent-browser trace start                 # Start recording trace\nagent-browser trace stop trace.zip        # Stop and save trace\nagent-browser record start ./debug.webm   # Record video from current page\nagent-browser record stop                 # Save recording\n```\n\n## Deep-dive documentation\n\nFor detailed patterns and best practices, see:\n\n| Reference | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| [references/snapshot-refs.md](references/snapshot-refs.md) | Ref lifecycle, invalidation rules, troubleshooting |\n| [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md) | Parallel sessions, state persistence, concurrent scraping |\n| [references/authentication.md](references/authentication.md) | Login flows, OAuth, 2FA handling, state reuse |\n| [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md) | Recording workflows for debugging and documentation |\n| [references/proxy-support.md](references/proxy-support.md) | Proxy configuration, geo-testing, rotating proxies |\n\n## Ready-to-use templates\n\nExecutable workflow scripts for common patterns:\n\n| Template | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [templates/form-automation.sh](templates/form-automation.sh) | Form filling with validation |\n| [templates/authenticated-session.sh](templates/authenticated-session.sh) | Login once, reuse state |\n| [templates/capture-workflow.sh](templates/capture-workflow.sh) | Content extraction with screenshots |\n\nUsage:\n```bash\n./templates/form-automation.sh https://example.com/form\n./templates/authenticated-session.sh https://app.example.com/login\n./templates/capture-workflow.sh https://example.com ./output\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:46:21.771Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing interactive browser control and element manipulation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要交互式浏览器控制和元素操作能力的自动化代理。","ja":"インタラクティブ ブラウザ制御と要素操作機能が必要な自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"대화형 브라우저 제어 및 요소 조작 기능이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización que necesitan control interactivo del navegador y capacidades de manipulación de elementos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation ayant besoin d''un contrôle interactif du navigateur et de capacités de manipulation d''éléments.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungs-Agents, die eine interaktive Browsersteuerung und Elementmanipulationsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam de controle interativo de navegador e capacidades de manipulação de elementos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым необходим интерактивный контроль браузера и возможности манипулирования элементами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التلقين الذاتي الذي يحتاج إلى التحكم التفاعلي في المتصفح وقدرات操作 العناصر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using snapshot-based element references, enabling precise clicks and form fills via protocols like HTTP and HTML, with tools like agent-browser snapshot and agent-browser click.","zh":"使代理能够使用基于快照的元素引用来自动化浏览器交互，从而通过HTTP和HTML等协议实现精确点击和表单填充，并配备了agent-browser快照和agent-browser点击等工具。","ja":"エージェントがスナップショットベースの要素参照を使用してブラウザの相互作用を自動化できるようにし、HTTPやHTMLなどのプロトコルを介して正確なクリックやフォーム入力を可能にし、エージェントブラウザのスナップショットやエージェントブラウザのクリックなどのツールを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 스냅샷 기반의 요소 참조를 사용하여 브라우저 상호작용을 자동화할 수 있도록 하여 HTTP 및 HTML 등의 프로토콜을 통해 정확한 클릭 및 양식填充가 가능하도록 하고 에이전트 브라우저 스냅샷 및 에이전트 브라우저 클릭 등의 툴을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar interacciones del navegador utilizando referencias de elementos basadas en instantáneas, permitiendo clics precisos y llenado de formularios mediante protocolos como HTTP y HTML, con herramientas como instantáneas del agente-navegador y clics del agente-navegador.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions du navigateur en utilisant des références d''éléments basées sur des instantanés, permettant des clics précis et un remplissage de formulaires via des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTML, avec des outils comme l''instantané agent-navigateur et le clic agent-navigateur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Browser-Interaktionen mittels auf Schnappschüssen basierenden Elementreferenzen zu automatisieren, was präzises Klicken und Formularausfüllen über Protokolle wie HTTP und HTML ermöglicht, mit Werkzeugen wie Agent-Browser-Schnappschuss und Agent-Browser-Klick.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações de navegador usando referências de elementos baseadas em instantâneos, permitindo cliques e preenchimentos de formulários precisos via protocolos como HTTP e HTML, com ferramentas como instantâneo do navegador do agente e clique do navegador do agente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия с браузером с помощью ссылок на элементы на основе снимков, что позволяет выполнять точные клики и заполнение форм через протоколы HTTP и HTML, с помощью инструментов, таких как снимок браузера агента и клик браузера агента.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تلقين عمليات التفاعل مع المتصفح باستخدام مراجع عناصر قائم على لقطات ، مما يسمح بالنقرات الدقيقة وتعبئة النماذج عبر بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و HTML ، مع أدوات مثل لقطة متصفح العميل والنقر على متصفح العميل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web form submissions","Debugging interactive web pages","Generating snapshots of web pages for analysis"],"zh":["自动化网页表单提交","调试交互式网页","为分析生成网页快照"],"ja":["Webフォームの送信を自動化する","対話型Webページのデバッグ","分析用のWebページのスナップショットを生成する"],"ko":["웹 양식 제출 자동화","대화형 웹 페이지 디버깅","분석을 위한 웹 페이지 스냅샷 생성"],"es":["Automatización de envíos de formularios web","Depuración de páginas web interactivas","Generación de instantáneas de páginas web para análisis"],"fr":["Automatisation des soumissions de formulaires web","Débogage de pages web interactives","Génération d''instantanés de pages web pour analyse"],"de":["Automatisierung von Webformularübermittlungen","Debugging interaktiver Webseiten","Erstellung von Schnappschüssen von Webseiten zur Analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar envios de formulários web","Depurar páginas web interativas","Gerar instantâneos de páginas web para análise"],"ru":["Автоматизация отправки веб-форм","Отладка интерактивных веб-страниц","Генерация снимков ве