oppement de logiciels","Intégration avec des outils de productivité"],"de":["Aufgabenverwaltung","Verbesserung der nachhaltigen Aufmerksamkeit","Lese- und Schreibzugriff auf den Fokus-Zustand in JSON","Kompatibilität mit der Software-Entwicklung","Integration mit Produktivitätstools"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de tarefas","Armazenamento de estado em arquivo JSON","Definição de tempo estimado para a tarefa","Adição de contexto e subtarefas"],"ru":["Управление задачами","Хранение состояния в файле JSON","Определение оценочного времени для задачи","Добавление контекста и подзадач"],"ar":["إدارة المهام","تخزين الحالة في ملف JSON","تحديد وقت تقديري للمهمة","إضافة سياق و مهام فرعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Focus 技术","集中注意力","任务管理","开发者工具","编程效率","代码管理"],"ja":["Focus 技術","集中力","タスク管理","開発者ツール","プログラミング効率","コード管理"],"ko":["Focus 기술","집중력","태스크 관리","개발자 도구","프로그래밍 효율","코드 관리"],"es":["enfoque","gestión de tareas","atención sostenida","desarrollo de software","productividad","JSON","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["focus","gestion des tâches","attention soutenue","développement de logiciels","productivité","JSON","outils de développement"],"de":["Fokus","Aufgabenverwaltung","nachhaltige Aufmerksamkeit","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität","JSON","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["foco","gerenciamento de tarefas","produtividade","atention sustentada","skill de foco","desenvolvimento de habilidades"],"ru":["фокус","управление задачами","производительность","устойчивое внимание","навык фокуса","развитие навыков"],"ar":["تركيز","إدارة المهام","إنتاجية","انتباه مستدام","مهارة التركيز","تنمية المهارات"]}},"owner":"maciejjankowski","repo":"dtc-compass","repoPath":"maciejjankowski/dtc-compass","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"focus","description":"Set or check current focus task for ADHD executive function support. Use when user says focus on, working on, my focus is, what am I working on, or needs help staying on task. Manages focus state and redirects tangents.","bodyPreview":"# Focus - Set Current Task\n\nManage the current focus task to support sustained attention.\n\n## State File\n\nRead and write focus state to: `.codex/skills/_state/current_focus.json`\n\nSchema:\n```json\n{\n  \"task\": \"string - what we''re working on\",\n  \"started_at\": \"ISO timestamp\",\n  \"time_estimate_minutes\": \"number or null\",\n  \"context\": \"string - any relevant context\",\n  \"subtasks\": [\"list of smaller steps if broken down\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Setting Focus\n\nWhen user sets a new focus:\n\n1. Read current state fro","body":"# Focus - Set Current Task\n\nManage the current focus task to support sustained attention.\n\n## State File\n\nRead and write focus state to: `.codex/skills/_state/current_focus.json`\n\nSchema:\n```json\n{\n  \"task\": \"string - what we''re working on\",\n  \"started_at\": \"ISO timestamp\",\n  \"time_estimate_minutes\": \"number or null\",\n  \"context\": \"string - any relevant context\",\n  \"subtasks\": [\"list of smaller steps if broken down\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Setting Focus\n\nWhen user sets a new focus:\n\n1. Read current state from `.codex/skills/_state/current_focus.json`\n2. If there was a previous focus, acknowledge it briefly (\"Switching from X\")\n3. Write new focus with:\n   - task: what they said\n   - started_at: current ISO timestamp\n   - time_estimate_minutes: if they mentioned time, otherwise null\n   - context: any relevant details\n4. Confirm with a brief, action-oriented message:\n   - State the focus task clearly\n   - If time estimate given, note it\n   - Give the first concrete step if the task is vague\n\n## Checking Focus\n\nWhen user asks \"what am I working on\" or seems lost:\n\n1. Read `.codex/skills/_state/current_focus.json`\n2. If no focus set: suggest setting one\n3. If focus exists:\n   - State the task\n   - Calculate time elapsed since started_at\n   - Remind of any subtasks\n   - Suggest next action\n\n## Tangent Detection\n\nWhen user brings up something unrelated to current focus:\n\n1. Politely note this seems like a tangent\n2. Suggest using the `tangent` skill to capture it for later\n3. Redirect back to the current focus task\n\nDo not lecture. Do not ask questions. State what we''re doing and move forward.\n\n## Example Responses\n\nSetting focus:\n```\nFocus set: Write Q1 roadmap document\n\nTime estimate: 45 minutes\nStarted: now\n\nFirst step: Open the roadmap template and list the 3 main sections.\n```\n\nChecking focus:\n```\nCurrent focus: Write Q1 roadmap document\nTime elapsed: 23 minutes (of estimated 45)\n\nNext: Complete the timeline section.\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:47:32.319Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Management Agents requiring sustained attention and focus tracking capabilities.","zh":"适合需要持续关注和跟踪能力的任务管理代理。","ja":"継続的な注意とフォーカス追跡機能が必要なタスク管理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"지속적인 주의와 집중 추적 기능이 필요한 태스크 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de tareas que requieren capacidades de seguimiento de atención y enfoque sostenidas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant une attention et une concentration soutenues.","de":"Ideal für Task-Management-Agents, die eine nachhaltige Aufmerksamkeit und Fokussierungsfähigkeit erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que exigem atenção e capacidades de rastreamento de foco sustentadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, требующих устойчивого внимания и возможностей отслеживания фокуса.","ar":"مثالية للوكيلات إدارة المهام التي تتطلب انتباها مستمرا وقدرات تتبع التركيز."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage current tasks using JSON state files, providing features like time estimation, context setting, and subtask breakdown using ISO timestamps and JSON schema.","zh":"使代理能够使用JSON状态文件管理当前任务，提供时间估算、上下文设置和子任务分解等功能，使用ISO时间戳和JSON模式。","ja":"エージェントがJSON状態ファイルを使用して現在のタスクを管理できるようにし、時間の推定、コンテキストの設定、ISOタイムスタンプとJSONスキーマを使用したサブタスクの分解などの機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 JSON 상태 파일을 사용하여 현재 작업을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 시간 추정, 컨텍스트 설정 및 ISO 타임스탬프와 JSON 스키마를 사용한 하위 작업 분해와 같은 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar tareas actuales utilizando archivos de estado JSON, proporcionando características como estimación de tiempo, configuración de contexto y desglose de subtareas utilizando timestamps ISO y esquema JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les tâches actuelles en utilisant des fichiers d''état JSON, offrant des fonctionnalités telles que l''estimation du temps, la configuration du contexte et la décomposition des sous-tâches en utilisant des timestamps ISO et un schéma JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, aktuelle Aufgaben mithilfe von JSON-Zustandsdateien zu verwalten, Funktionen wie Zeitberechnung, Kontextfestlegung und Unteraufgabenzerlegung unter Verwendung von ISO-Timestamps und JSON-Schema bereitzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar tarefas atuais usando arquivos de estado JSON, fornecendo recursos como estimativa de tempo, definição de contexto e quebra de subtarefas usando carimbos de data e hora ISO e esquema JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять текущими задачами с помощью файлов состояния JSON, предоставляя функции, такие как оценка времени, установка контекста и разбиение на подзадачи с использованием меток времени ISO и схемы JSON.","ar":"تمكين الوكيلات من إدارة المهام الحالية باستخدام ملفات حالة JSON، وتوفير ميزات مثل تقدير الوقت وإعداد السياق وتقسيم المهام الفرعية باستخدام توقيعات التاريخ والوقت ISO ومخطط JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Setting and tracking current tasks","Breaking down large tasks into smaller subtasks","Estimating time requirements for tasks"],"zh":["设置和跟踪当前任务","将大任务分解为较小的子任务","估算任务的时间要求"],"ja":["現在のタスクの設定と追跡","大きなタスクを小さなサブタスクに分解する","タスクの時間要件の推定"],"ko":["현재 작업 설정 및 추적","큰 작업을 작은 하위 작업으로 분해","작업에 대한 시간 요구 사항 추정"],"es":["Configuración y seguimiento de tareas actuales","División de tareas grandes en subtareas más pequeñas","Estimación de los r