Native (iOS, macOS, Linux)","Kompatibilität mit Kotlin/JVM (Desktop und Server)","Java-Paketstruktur","Einheitliche Tests im Root-Paket","Multi-Plattform-Unterstützung"],"pt":["Port do Apache Lucene do Java para o Kotlin","Suporte a várias plataformas, incluindo Android, iOS, macOS e Linux","Uso de Kotlin Multiplatform para criar bibliotecas multiplataforma","Compatibilidade com Kotlin/JVM e Kotlin/Native","Suporte a testes unitários e integração contínua"],"ru":["Порт Apache Lucene из Java в Kotlin","Поддержка нескольких платформ, включая Android, iOS, macOS и Linux","Использование Kotlin Multiplatform для создания многоплатформенных библиотек","Совместимость с Kotlin/JVM и Kotlin/Native","Поддержка модульных тестов и непрерывной интеграции"],"ar":["نقل Apache Lucene من Java إلى Kotlin","دعم عدة منصات ، بما في ذلك Android و iOS و macOS و Linux","استخدام Kotlin Multiplatform لإنشاء مكتبات متعددة المنصات","التوافق مع Kotlin/JVM و Kotlin/Native","دعم الاختبارات الوحدة وتكامل مستمر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Lucene-KMP","Java","Apache Lucene","Kotlin","Kotlin/","Kotlin/Native","Kotlin/JVM"],"ja":["Lucene-KMP","Java","Apache Lucene","Kotlin","Kotlin/","Kotlin/Native","Kotlin/JVM"],"ko":["Lucene-KMP","Java","Apache Lucene","Kotlin","Kotlin/","Kotlin/Native","Kotlin/JVM"],"es":["Apache Lucene","Kotlin Multiplatform","lucene-kmp","portar código Java","desarrollo multiplataforma","Kotlin/Android","Kotlin/Native","Kotlin/JVM"],"fr":["Apache Lucene","Kotlin Multiplateforme","lucene-kmp","porter du code Java","développement multiplateforme","Kotlin/Android","Kotlin/Native","Kotlin/JVM"],"de":["Apache Lucene","Kotlin Multiplattform","lucene-kmp","Java-Code portieren","Multi-Plattform-Entwicklung","Kotlin/Android","Kotlin/Native","Kotlin/JVM"],"pt":["Apache Lucene","Kotlin Multiplatform","port do Java para o Kotlin","bibliotecas multiplataforma","desenvolvimento de software","Kotlin/JVM","Kotlin/Native","testes unitários"],"ru":["Apache Lucene","Kotlin Multiplatform","порт из Java в Kotlin","многоплатформенные библиотеки","разработка программного обеспечения","Kotlin/JVM","Kotlin/Native","модульные тесты"],"ar":["Apache Lucene","Kotlin Multiplatform","نقل من Java إلى Kotlin","مكتبات متعددة المنصات","تطوير البرمجيات","Kotlin/JVM","Kotlin/Native","اختبارات الوحدة"]}},"owner":"nehemiaharchives","repo":"bbl-lucene","repoPath":"nehemiaharchives/bbl-lucene","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"port","description":"Port a class/interface from java lucene into platform agnostic kotlin common lucene-kmp codebase","bodyPreview":"## overall project description\nI''m porting Apache Lucene from Java to platform agnostic kotlin common to make multiplatform library `lucene-kmp` which supports Kotlin/Android, Kotlin/Native(iOS, macOS, Linux), and Kotlin/JVM(desktop and server).\n\n## java package structure\nFor example, in `core` module, the root package is: `lucene/lucene/core/src/java/org/apache/lucene/`\n`core` module''s unit tests are in root package: `lucene/lucene/core/src/test/org/apache/lucene/`\nAnd those root contains sub p","body":"## overall project description\nI''m porting Apache Lucene from Java to platform agnostic kotlin common to make multiplatform library `lucene-kmp` which supports Kotlin/Android, Kotlin/Native(iOS, macOS, Linux), and Kotlin/JVM(desktop and server).\n\n## java package structure\nFor example, in `core` module, the root package is: `lucene/lucene/core/src/java/org/apache/lucene/`\n`core` module''s unit tests are in root package: `lucene/lucene/core/src/test/org/apache/lucene/`\nAnd those root contains sub packages such as analysis, codecs, document, index, internal, search, store, util and their sub packages.\n\n## kmp package structure\nFor example, in `core` module, the root package for port destination is: `lucene-kmp/core/src/commonMain/kotlin/org/gnit/lucenekmp/`\nlucene-kmp `core` module for unit tests are in the root package: `lucene-kmp/core/src/commonTest/kotlin/org/gnit/lucenekmp/`\nAnd it contains sub packages such as analysis, codecs, document, index, internal, search, store, util, and especially the one which is not found in java lucene: jdkport\n\n## package name convention on porting process\nFor classes/interfaces in sub packages which is made by lucene, which is \"analysis, codecs, document, index, internal, search, store, util\", we will respect exact same java lucene''s sub packagename for both \"code\" and \"unit test\".\n\nFor example,\nin case of code, org.apache.lucene.document.BinaryDocValuesField has been ported to org.gnit.lucenekmp.document.BinaryDocValuesField\nin case of unit test, org.apache.lucenep.util.TestUnicodeUtil has been ported to org.gnit.lucenekmp.util.TestUnicodeUtil\n\n## about jdkport package\nDuring the porting process there was JDK classes which is used in Java lucene but have no equivalent pair in kotlin standard library (standard library of kotlin common). To smooth the porting process I decided to port also those JDK classes into \"package org.gnit.lucenekmp.jdkport\" which is located in lucene-kmp/core/src/commonMain/kotlin/org/gnit/lucenekmp/jdkport\n\nThere are some edge case such as Double. jdk and kotlin standard lib both has Double class but the some jdk Double functions are not found in kotlin ones. In such case, I created a kotlin file contains extension functions to fill the functionality pair gap. The file name convention for extension function is for example \"for Double class, kt file is named DoubleExt.kt\"\n\nSo for classes/intefaces in jdkport sub packages, we will NOT respect jdk package names but all JDK classes/interfaces will be ported to jdkport sub package. The name of the classes/interfaces will be kept exact same.\n\nFor example,\njava.util.BitSet which is used in lucene java but no equivalent exsits in kotlin std lib will be ported to org.gnit.lucenekmp.jdkport.BitSet\njava.lang.Character has been ported to org.gnit.lucenekmp.jdkport.Character\njava.net.Inet4Address has been ported to org.gnit.lucenekmp.jdkport.Inet4Address\n\nnaming convention for unit tests for those classes will be ClassNameTest, which is for example:\norg.gnit.lucenekmp.jdkport.CharacterTest and org.gnit.lucenekmp.jdkport.Inet4AddressTest\n\nPort of Classloader.java and ServiceLoader.java is does as skeleton with no operation functions because I still did not decide how to walk around this JVM specific feature in kotlin common. So creating unit tests for Classloader and ServiceLoader is also skipped for now.\n\nAnd because jdk package structure will be lost, for only jdk port class/interface, we add `@Ported` annotation to the class like `@Ported(from = \"java.lang.Character\")`\n\n## Steps to Port\n\nStep 1. Create the exact same of the class/interface by replacing .java to .kt in the target package. e.g. `ClazzToPort.java` to `ClazzToPort.kt`\nStep 2. First copy import statements which starts with `org.apache.lucene` by replacing it with `org.gnit.lucenekmp` do not port jdk import statements at this time.\nStep 3. run `get_file_problems` tool of jetbrains mcp server to the file. unresolved reference compilation error means un-ported-dependency class/interface, leave current class as it is and start over from Step 1 for that class.\nStep 4. After import-statements-only class/interface file `ClazzToPort.kt` get no compilation error with `get_file_problems`, start porting the body of the code.\nStep 5. During porting body of the class, if you find any jdk specific class used, try to find it in `jdkport` package and if you find import it and use it.\nStep 6. If you did not find `jdkport` class/interface, do one of the following:\nCase 1 -> Functional interface: interfaces in `java.util.function` should be replaced with kotlin function representation, e.g. `Predicate<T>` to be `(T) -> Boolean`, `IntFunction<R>` to be `(Int) -> R`\nCase 2 -> Collection operation such as `.stream()` or `map` should be replaced with idiomatic kotlin equivalents. array creation should be done with `Array(size){ i-> entry }` style.\nCase 3 -> `java.lang.Thread` related classes are mostly ported to `jdkport` so use it but if not found port it using kotlin coroutine `Job` and related coroutine building block mimicking the behavior as much as possible.\nCase 4 -> Large but mostly static method utility jdk classes such as `java.lang.Math` are ported partially. port only specific missing static method by adding that specific kotlin function to existing `jdkport` class.\nCase 5 -> Complex reflections or java.security or other jdk specific things which can not be translated into KMP common code should be bypassed by creating empty no-op class and functions throwing UnsupportedOperationException()\nCase 6 -> ClassLoader related logic, should be replaced with hard coded class names and constructors. see examples of existing already ported `NamedSPILoader.java` and `NamedSPILoader.kt`\nCase else -> go to Step 7 which is porting new jdk port\nStep 7. Create a empty kotlin class/interface `jdkport` and try to find if all the dependencies or super class, super interface is already in `jdkport` package, if not found, port super class/interface recursively.  \nStep 8. If all the super class/interface of the jdk class ported into `jdkport` package, start porting the jdkport class.\nStep 9. If there are no missing `jdkport` class, and if there are no un-ported-dependency class/interface from Java Lucene, port the code of the `ClazzToPort.kt`\nStep 10. After porting logic and behaviors code, run `get_file_problems` tool of jetbrains mcp server and edit and iterate over until all errors resolves.\n\n## Code Style of Port\nStyle 1. Ease of side by side comparison: The property names, var/val names, method/function names, inner class names, all the names should be exactly same and appear in exact order as java lucene counter part so that those who read the class can easily compare the logic and behavior of the code when porting and debugging. However, there is exceptions on getters and setters: java''s ordinal getters and setters should be replaced with get() and set() of kotlin public val/var to avoid compilation error e.g. ```Platform declaration clash: The following declarations have the same JVM signature (getBasicModel()Lorg/gnit/lucenekmp/search/similarities/BasicModel;):\n    fun `<get-basicModel>`(): BasicModel defined in org.gnit.lucenekmp.search.similarities.DFRSimilarity\n    fun getBasicModel(): BasicModel defined in org.gnit.lucenekmp.search.similarities.DFRSimilarity``` in such case, do not port `getBasicModel()` but make `public val basicModel` publicly accessible.\nStyle 2. Do not add function/property/value/class/interface which is not in java lucene. This will make it difficult to compare the logic and behavior.\nStyle 3. Comment: port also the comments. Javadoc need to be translated to Kdoc. Block comments and slash comments need to be ported exactly same order as it appear in java lucene code.\nStyle 4. Companion object: java''s static methods or static classes needs to be ported into kotlin''s `companion object {}` and breaks the side by side style rule 1 but allowed.\nStyle 5. Nullability: Get advantage of the kotlin language of null handling as much as possible by trying to use none-nullable var, val as much as possible. if a java lucene specifically inserts `null` to the val/var, then it can be nullable to mimic the behavior. If the value is kotlin-none-nullable, `Objects.requireNonNull()` or `assert(someVariable != null)` can be omitted but if it is nullable in kotlin, use top level function `requireNotNull()`.\nStyle 6. Use idiomatic kotlin: Get advantage of the kotlin language to write simple, concise, smart, easy to understand code while following the exact same logic and behavior while porting.\nStyle 6.1. String concatenation using + operator in java need to be replaced with kotlin string interpolation. e.g. `\"DFR \" + basicModel.toString() + afterEffect.toString() + normalization.toString();` to be ported into `\"DFR $basicModel$afterEffect$normalization\"`\nStyle 6.2. Two comparisons should be converted to a range check: e.g. `assert docID >= 0 && docID < maxDoc;` to be `assert(docID in 0..<maxDoc)`\nStyle 7. Avoid numeric value mismatch: in Java Byte and Int or Long and Double is implicitly widened, but in Kotlin they are not; use explicit toX conversions or parentheses to preserve numeric type and operator behavior.\nStyle 8. Junit Test method/function inheritance: in unit tests defined in Java Junit super classes are executed in sub test classes, but in Kotlin unit testing using kotlin.test, super class unit test functions needs to be explicitly inherited in sub classes to be executed. So find all `fun testXXX()` methods in super test class and add `@Test` annotation and define inherited class `override fun testXXX() = super.testXXX()` where XXX is the name of the test function.\nStyle 9. Atomics: Add `@OptIn(ExperimentalAtomicApi::class)` to var/val/function when you use classes in `kotlin.concurrent.atomics`\n    Style 9.1 `fun incrementAndGet()`: Int is deprecated. Use `incrementAndFetch()` instead.\n    Style 9.2 do not use `fun get()`, use `fun load()` instead\n    Style 9.3 do not use `fun addAndGet()`, use `fun addAndFetch()` instead\nStyle 10. assert keyword in java need to be replaced with `assert()` function with `import org.gnit.lucenekmp.jdkport.assert`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:47:27.468Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Kotlin-focused AI coding agents needing to leverage Apache Lucene''s capabilities across multiple platforms","zh":"适合需要利用Apache Lucene功能的Kotlin专注的AI编码代理，跨多个平台","ja":"Apache Luceneの機能を複数のプラットフォームで利用する必要があるKotlinに特化したAIコーディングエージェントに最適","ko":"Apache Lucene의 기능을 여러 플랫폼에서 활용해야 하는 Kotlin에 중점을 둔 AI 코딩 에이전트에게 이상적","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación de inteligencia artificial enfocados en Kotlin que necesitan aprovechar las capacidades de Apache Lucene en varias plataformas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage d''intelligence artificielle axés sur Kotlin qui ont besoin d''exploiter les capacités d''Apache Lucene sur plusieurs plateformes","de":"Ideal für Kotlin-fokussierte KI-Coding-Agents, die die Möglichkeiten von Apache Lucene auf mehreren Plattformen nutzen müssen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de codificação de IA focados em Kotlin que precisam aproveitar as capacidades do Apache Lucene em várias plataformas","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодирования ИИ, ориентированных на Kotlin, которым необходимо использовать возможности Apache Lucene на нескольких платформах","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء البرمجة الإصطناعية التي تركز على Kotlin والتي تحتاج إلى استخدام إمكانيات Apache Lucene عبر منصات متعددة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to port Apache Lucene from Java to Kotlin Multiplatform, enabling support for Kotlin/Android, Kotlin/Native, and Kotlin/JVM through the lucene-kmp library, utilizing Kotlin''s common codebase for seamless multiplatform compatibility","zh":"赋予代理从Java到Kotlin Multiplatform移植Apache Lucene的能力，通过lucene-kmp库，实现对Kotlin/Android、Kotlin/Native和Kotlin/JVM的支持，利用Kotlin的通用代码库实现无缝的跨平台兼容性","ja":"エージェントにApache LuceneをJavaからKotlin Multiplatformに移植する能力を付与し、lucene-kmpライブラリを通じてKotlin/Android、Kotlin/Native、Kotlin/JVMをサポートし、Kotlinの共通コードベースを利用してシームレスなマルチプラットフォームの互換性を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 Java에서 Kotlin Multiplatform으로 Apache Lucene를 이식할 수 있도록 하여 lucene-kmp 라이브러리를 통해 Kotlin/Android, Kotlin/Native, Kotlin/JVM을 지원하고 Kotlin의 공통 코드베이스를 활용하여 무ipc의 멀티플랫폼 호환성을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a portar Apache Lucene de Java a Kotlin Multiplatform, lo que permite la compatibilidad con Kotlin/Android, Kotlin/Native y Kotlin/JVM a través de la biblioteca lucene-kmp, utilizando la base de código común de Kotlin para una compatibilidad multiplataforma sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de porter Apache Lucene de Java à Kotlin Multiplatform, permettant ainsi la prise en charge de Kotlin/Android, Kotlin/Native et Kotlin/JVM via la bibliothèque lucene-kmp, en utilisant la base de code commune de Kotlin pour une compatibilité multiplateforme transparente","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Apache Lucene von Java auf Kotlin Multiplatform zu portieren, wodurch die Unterstützung für Kotlin/Android, Kotlin/Native und Kotlin/JVM über die Bibliothek lucene-kmp ermöglicht wird, die die gemeinsame Codebasis von Kotlin für eine nahtlose Multiplattform-Kompatibilität nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a portar o Apache Lucene do Java para o Kotlin Multiplatform, permitindo suporte a Kotlin/Android, Kotlin/Native e Kotlin/JVM por meio da biblioteca lucene-kmp, utilizando a base de código comum do Kotlin para compatibilidade multiplataforma sem problemas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью переносить Apache Lucene из Java в Kotlin Multiplatform, обеспечивая поддержку Kotlin/Android, Kotlin/Native и Kotlin/JVM через библиотеку lucene-kmp, используя общую базу кода Kotlin для беспроблемной совместимости на нескольких платформах","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من نقل Apache Lucene من Java إلى Kotlin Multiplatform، وتمكين الدعم لKotlin/Android وKotlin/Native وKotlin/JVM من خلال مكتبة lucene-kmp، واستخدام قاعدة الشفرة المشتركة لKotlin لتحقيق التوافق المتعدد منصات بدون مشاكل"},"useCases":{"en":["Porting Java packages to Kotlin for enhanced platform support","Migrating Apache Lucene core modules to Kotlin Multiplatform","Developing unit tests for Kotlin/Native and Kotlin/JVM environments"],"zh":["将Java包移植到Kotlin以增强平台支持","将Apache Lucene核心模块移植到Kotlin Multiplatform","为Kotlin/Native和Kotlin/JVM环境开发单元测试"],"ja":["JavaパッケージをKotlinに移植してプラットフォームのサポートを強化する","Apache LuceneのコアモジュールをKotlin Multiplatformに移植する","Kotlin/NativeとKotlin/JVMの環境向けにユニットテストを開発する"],"ko":["Java 패키지를 Kotlin으로 이식하여 플랫폼 지원을 강화하는 것","Apache Lucene의 핵심 모듈을 Kotlin Multiplatform으로 이식하는 것","Kotlin/Native와 Kotlin/JVM 환경을 위한 유닛 테스트를 개발하는 것"],"es":["Portar paquetes de Java a Kotlin para una mayor compatibilidad de plataformas","Migrar módulos principales de Apache Lucene a Kotlin Multiplatform","Desarrollar pruebas unitarias para entornos Kotlin/Native y Kotlin/JVM"],"fr":["Porter des packages Java vers Kotlin pour une prise en charge de plateforme améliorée","Migrer des modules principaux d''Apache Lucene vers Kotlin Multiplatform","Développer des tests unitaires pour les environnements Kotlin/Native et Kotlin/JVM"],"de":["Portieren von Java-Paketen zu Kotlin für eine verbesserte Plattformkompatibilität","Migration von Apache Lucene-Kernmodulen zu Kotlin Multiplatform","Entwicklung von Unit-Tests für Kotlin/Native- und Kotlin/JVM-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Transferir pacotes Java para Kotlin para melhor suporte à plataforma","Migrar módulos principais do Apache Lucene para Kotlin Multiplatform","Desenvolver testes unitários para ambientes Kotlin/Native e Kotlin/JVM"],"ru":["Портировать пакеты Java в Kotlin для улучшения поддержки платформы","Мигрировать основные модули Apache Lucene в Kotlin Multiplatform","Разрабатывать модульные тесты для сред Kotlin/Native и Kotlin/JVM"],"ar":["نقل حزم Java إلى Kotlin لتحسين دعم المنصات","نقل وحدات Apache Lucene الأساسية إلى Kotlin Multiplatform","تطوير اختبارات الوحدة للبيئات Kotlin/Native وKotlin/JVM"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Java and Kotlin programming languages","Limited to Apache Lucene and Kotlin Multiplatform ecosystem","Dependent on compatibility with Kotlin''s multiplatform framework"],"zh":["需要Java和Kotlin编程语言的知识","仅限Apache Lucene和Kotlin Multiplatform生态系统","依赖于Kotlin的多平台框架的兼容性"],"ja":["JavaとKotlinのプログラミング言語の知識が必要","Apache LuceneとKotlin Multiplatformのエコシステムに限定される","Kotlinのマルチプラットフォームフレームワークの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["Java와 Kotlin 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 지식이 필요","Apache Lucene와 Kotlin Multiplatform 에코システム으로 제한","Kotlin의 멀티플랫폼 프레임워크의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los lenguajes de programación Java y Kotlin","Limitado al ecosistema de Apache Lucene y Kotlin Multiplatform","Dependiente de la compatibilidad con el marco de trabajo multiplataforma de Kotlin"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des langages de programmation Java et Kotlin","Limité à l''écosystème d''Apache Lucene et Kotlin Multiplatform","Dépendant de la compatibilité avec le cadre de travail multiplateforme de Kotlin"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Programmiersprachen Java und Kotlin","Begrenzt auf das Ökosystem von Apache Lucene und Kotlin Multiplatform","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität mit dem Multiplattform-Framework von Kotlin"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento das linguagens de programação Java e Kotlin","Limitado ao ecossistema Apache Lucene e Kotlin Multiplatform","Dependente da compatibilidade com o framework multiplataforma do Kotlin"],"ru":["Требует знания языков программирования Java и Kotlin","Ограничен экосистемой Apache Lucene и Kotlin Multiplatform","Зависит от совместимости с фреймворком multiplataforma Kotlin"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة لغات البرمجة Java وKotlin","محدود بنظام Apache Lucene وKotlin Multiplatform","يعتمد على التوافق مع إطار العمل متعددة المنصات من Kotlin"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('maciejjankowski/dtc-compass/break', 'community', 'maciejjankowski', 'dtc-compass', 'maciejjankowski/dtc-compass', 'break', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:47:34.013Z', NULL, '{"id":"maciejjankowski/dtc-compass/break","name":"break","description":{"zh":"Break 技能帮助开发者记录休息时间、设定休息目标，保持健康的工作节奏。","ja":"Break スキルは、開発者が休憩時間を記録し、休憩目標を設定し、健康的な作業リズムを維持するのに役立ちます。","ko":"Break 스킬은 개발자가 휴식 시간을 기록하고 휴식 목표를 설정하며 건강한 작업 리듬을 유지하는 데 도움이 됩니다.","es":"El skill ''break'' permite a los desarrolladores gestionar su ritmo laboral de manera efectiva, registrando pausas y estableciendo intenciones para mejorar la productividad","fr":"Le skill ''break'' permet aux développeurs de gérer leur rythme de travail de manière efficace, en enregistrant des pauses et en établissant des intentions pour améliorer la productivité","de":"Das ''break''-Skill ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihren Arbeitsrhythmus effektiv zu managen, indem sie Pausen eintragen und Absichten festlegen, um die Produktivität zu verbessern","pt":"A pausa é uma habilidade que ajuda a manter um ritmo de trabalho saudável, registrando pausas e definindo intenções para melhorar a produtividade.","ru":"Перерыв - это навык, который помогает поддерживать здоровый ритм работы, регистрируя перерывы и определяя намерения для улучшения производительности.","ar":"الإيقاف المؤقت هو مهارة تساعد على الحفاظ على إيقاع عمل صحي، بتسجيل الإيقافات وتحديد النوايا لتحسين الإنتاجية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"休息和恢复: Break 技能","ja":"休憩と復帰: Break スキル","ko":"휴식과 복귀: Break 스킬","es":"Descanso y Regreso - Gestión de Ritmo Laboral","fr":"Pause et Retour - Gestion du Rythme de Travail","de":"Pause und Rückkehr - Arbeitsrhythmus-Management","pt":"Pausa: Otimizando o Ritmo de Trabalho com Logs e Intenções","ru":"Перерыв: Оптимизация Ритма Работы с Журналами и Намерениями","ar":"إيقاف