ción de resultados típicos","Verificación de la conformidad con los requisitos de tamaño de letra para dispositivos móviles"],"fr":["Révision de la divulgation de la FTC","Vérification de la conformité avec les exigences de plateforme","Analyse de la divulgation de liens matériels","Révision de la divulgation de résultats typiques","Vérification de la conformité avec les exigences de taille de police pour les appareils mobiles"],"de":["Überprüfung der FTC-Offenlegung","Überprüfung der Konformität mit den Plattformanforderungen","Analyse der Offenlegung von materiellem Zusammenhang","Überprüfung der Offenlegung von typischen Ergebnissen","Überprüfung der Konformität mit den Anforderungen an die Schriftgröße für mobile Geräte"],"pt":["Verificação de requisitos de divulgação da FTC","Verificação de relações de afiliação","Verificação de resultados típicos","Verificação de endossos pagos"],"ru":["Проверка требований к раскрытию информации ФТС","Проверка аффилированных отношений","Проверка типичных результатов","Проверка оплаченных эндорсментов"],"ar":["فحص متطلبات الإفصاح عن لجنة التجارة الفيدرالية","فحص علاقات التأهيل","فحص النتائج النموذجية","فحص الدعم المدفوع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["合规性检查","媒体购买","监管要求","平台标准","FTC披露","创意内容"],"ja":["コンプライアンスチェック","メディア購入","規制要件","プラットフォームの標準","FTC開示","創作コンテンツ"],"ko":["준수 확인","미디어 구매","규제 요구 사항","플랫폼 표준","FTC 공개","크리에이티브 콘텐츠"],"es":["comprobación de cumplimiento","revisión de contenido","cumplimiento regulatorio","divulgación de la FTC","conformidad con plataformas","análisis de contenido"],"fr":["vérification de conformité","révision de contenu","conformité réglementaire","divulgation de la FTC","conformité avec les plateformes","analyse de contenu"],"de":["Compliance-Prüfung","Inhaltsüberprüfung","regulatorische Konformität","FTC-Offenlegung","Konformität mit Plattformen","Inhaltsanalyse"],"pt":["conformidade regulatória","compra de mídia","verificação de criativos","requisitos de divulgação da FTC","relações de afiliação","resultados típicos","endossos pagos"],"ru":["соблюдение регуляторных требований","покупка медиа","проверка творческих работ","требования к раскрытию информации ФТС","аффилированные отношения","типичные результаты","оплаченные эндорсменты"],"ar":["الامتثال اللوائحي","شراء الوسائط","فحص الإبداع","متطلبات الإفصاح عن لجنة التجارة الفيدرالية","علاقات التأهيل","النتائج النموذجية","الدعم المدفوع"]}},"owner":"WalkerHi11","repo":"mediabuy-plugins","repoPath":"WalkerHi11/mediabuy-plugins","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"compliance-check","description":"Review ads and landing pages for compliance issues including FTC disclosure requirements, platform policy compliance, and restricted claims. Use before launching campaigns, when ads get rejected, or when auditing existing creative.","bodyPreview":"# Compliance Check\r\n\r\nReview creative for regulatory and platform compliance.\r\n\r\n## Process\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Check FTC Disclosure Requirements\r\n\r\n**Required Disclosures:**\r\n- Material connections (paid/sponsored)\r\n- Affiliate relationships\r\n- Typical results (if showing testimonials)\r\n- Paid endorsements\r\n\r\n**Disclosure Placement:**\r\n- Must be clear and conspicuous\r\n- Close to the claim\r\n- Same format as claim (video = video disclosure)\r\n- Mobile-readable size\r\n\r\n**Common FTC Issues:**\r\n- Hidden d","body":"# Compliance Check\r\n\r\nReview creative for regulatory and platform compliance.\r\n\r\n## Process\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Check FTC Disclosure Requirements\r\n\r\n**Required Disclosures:**\r\n- Material connections (paid/sponsored)\r\n- Affiliate relationships\r\n- Typical results (if showing testimonials)\r\n- Paid endorsements\r\n\r\n**Disclosure Placement:**\r\n- Must be clear and conspicuous\r\n- Close to the claim\r\n- Same format as claim (video = video disclosure)\r\n- Mobile-readable size\r\n\r\n**Common FTC Issues:**\r\n- Hidden disclosures in fine print\r\n- Disclosures that require scrolling\r\n- \"Results not typical\" buried at end\r\n- Influencer posts without #ad\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Verify Platform Policy Compliance\r\n\r\n**Facebook/Meta Policies:**\r\n- No before/after images implying unrealistic results\r\n- No personal attributes targeting (\"Are you overweight?\")\r\n- No misleading claims\r\n- No prohibited content (weapons, adult, etc.)\r\n- Landing page must match ad claims\r\n\r\n**TikTok Policies:**\r\n- Similar to Meta plus TikTok-specific rules\r\n- Authenticity requirements\r\n- No misleading information\r\n\r\n**Google/YouTube Policies:**\r\n- Healthcare restrictions\r\n- Financial service requirements\r\n- Destination requirements\r\n\r\n**Native Ad Policies:**\r\n- Varies by network\r\n- Generally stricter on health claims\r\n- Editorial-style requirements\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Flag Restricted Claims\r\n\r\n**Health Claims:**\r\n- Disease treatment/cure claims\r\n- Drug-like claims\r\n- Specific medical outcomes\r\n- \"Clinically proven\" without evidence\r\n\r\n**Financial Claims:**\r\n- Income guarantees\r\n- \"Get rich quick\" implications\r\n- Investment returns promises\r\n\r\n**Before/After:**\r\n- Unrealistic transformations\r\n- Implied guaranteed results\r\n- Time-specific promises\r\n\r\n**Testimonials:**\r\n- Atypical results presented as typical\r\n- Fake reviews/testimonials\r\n- Undisclosed paid testimonials\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Suggest Compliant Alternatives\r\n\r\n**Reframing Techniques:**\r\n- \"May help support...\" vs \"Cures...\"\r\n- \"Users reported...\" vs \"You will...\"\r\n- \"Individual results vary\" disclaimer\r\n- Opinion-based language\r\n\r\n**Safe Phrasing:**\r\n| Problematic | Compliant Alternative |\r\n|-------------|----------------------|\r\n| \"Lose 30 lbs in 30 days\" | \"Supports healthy weight management\" |\r\n| \"Cures diabetes\" | \"Supports healthy blood sugar levels\" |\r\n| \"Make $10K/month\" | \"Income potential varies\" |\r\n| \"Guaranteed results\" | \"Results may vary\" |\r\n\r\n### Step 5: Output Compliance Report\r\n\r\n```\r\n## COMPLIANCE CHECK: [Creative/Campaign Name]\r\n\r\n### REVIEW SUMMARY\r\n\r\n**Overall Risk Level:** [Low / Medium / High / Critical]\r\n**Issues Found:** [#]\r\n**Platforms Reviewed For:** [FB, TikTok, Google, Native]\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FTC COMPLIANCE\r\n\r\n**Disclosure Status:** [Compliant / Needs Work / Non-Compliant]\r\n\r\n**Required Disclosures:**\r\n- [ ] Affiliate relationship disclosed\r\n- [ ] Sponsored content marked\r\n- [ ] Typical results disclaimer present\r\n- [ ] Material connections clear\r\n\r\n**Issues Found:**\r\n1. [Issue description]\r\n   - Location: [Where in creative]\r\n   - Severity: [Low/Medium/High]\r\n   - Fix: [Recommended solution]\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### PLATFORM POLICY COMPLIANCE\r\n\r\n**Facebook/Meta:**\r\n| Policy Area | Status | Issue | Fix |\r\n|-------------|--------|-------|-----|\r\n| Personal attributes | [Pass/Fail] | [Issue] | [Fix] |\r\n| Before/after | [Pass/Fail] | [Issue] | [Fix] |\r\n| Health claims | [Pass/Fail] | [Issue] | [Fix] |\r\n| Landing page match | [Pass/Fail] | [Issue] | [Fix] |\r\n\r\n**TikTok:**\r\n| Policy Area | Status | Issue | Fix |\r\n|-------------|--------|-------|-----|\r\n| [Area] | [Pass/Fail] | [Issue] | [Fix] |\r\n\r\n**[Other Platforms]:**\r\n...\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### CLAIM ANALYSIS\r\n\r\n**Claims Made:**\r\n1. \"[Claim from creative]\"\r\n   - Type: [Health/Financial/Results]\r\n   - Status: [Safe / Risky / Prohibited]\r\n   - Evidence required: [What''s needed to support]\r\n   - Recommendation: [Keep/Modify/Remove]\r\n\r\n2. \"[Claim from creative]\"\r\n   ...\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FLAGGED CONTENT\r\n\r\n**HIGH RISK (Must Fix):**\r\n1. **Issue:** [Description]\r\n   - Location: [Where]\r\n   - Why it''s a problem: [Explanation]\r\n   - Compliant alternative: \"[Suggested rewording]\"\r\n\r\n**MEDIUM RISK (Should Fix):**\r\n1. **Issue:** [Description]\r\n   ...\r\n\r\n**LOW RISK (Consider Fixing):**\r\n1. **Issue:** [Description]\r\n   ...\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### TESTIMONIALS/SOCIAL PROOF\r\n\r\n**Testimonials Used:**\r\n1. [Testimonial description]\r\n   - Disclosure present: [Yes/No]\r\n   - Typical results: [Yes/No/Unclear]\r\n   - Recommendation: [Action needed]\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### LANDING PAGE COMPLIANCE\r\n\r\n**Page:** [URL]\r\n\r\n| Element | Status | Issue |\r\n|---------|--------|-------|\r\n| Claims match ad | [Pass/Fail] | [Issue] |\r\n| Disclosures present | [Pass/Fail] | [Issue] |\r\n| Terms/Privacy linked | [Pass/Fail] | [Issue] |\r\n| Contact info | [Pass/Fail] | [Issue] |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### RECOMMENDED CHANGES\r\n\r\n**Critical (Before Launch):**\r\n1. [ ] [Change required]\r\n2. [ ] [Change required]\r\n\r\n**Important (Soon):**\r\n1. [ ] [Change recommended]\r\n\r\n**Optional (Best Practice):**\r\n1. [ ] [Enhancement]\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### COMPLIANT COPY ALTERNATIVES\r\n\r\n**Original:** \"[Problematic text]\"\r\n**Compliant Version:** \"[Rewritten text]\"\r\n**Why:** [Explanation of change]\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### APPROVAL CHECKLIST\r\n\r\nBefore launching, confirm:\r\n- [ ] All high-risk issues resolved\r\n- [ ] Disclosures in place\r\n- [ ] Claims substantiated or softened\r\n- [ ] Landing page matches ad\r\n- [ ] Platform-specific requirements met\r\n- [ ] Legal/compliance team approved (if applicable)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### RISK ASSESSMENT\r\n\r\n**If Launched As-Is:**\r\n- Ad rejection likelihood: [Low/Medium/High]\r\n- Account risk: [Low/Medium/High]\r\n- Legal risk: [Low/Medium/High]\r\n- Reputation risk: [Low/Medium/High]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Compliance Resources\r\n\r\n**FTC Guidelines:**\r\n- Endorsement Guides\r\n- Health Claims guidance\r\n- Made in USA rules\r\n\r\n**Platform Policies:**\r\n- Meta Advertising Policies\r\n- TikTok Advertising Policies\r\n- Google Ads Policies\r\n\r\n**Safe Practices:**\r\n- When in doubt, soften the claim\r\n- Document evidence for claims\r\n- Use \"may,\" \"can help,\" \"supports\"\r\n- Always disclose relationships\r\n\r\nSource: Affiliate Research, FTC guidelines\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:47:57.491Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Regulatory Compliance Agents needing advanced FTC disclosure requirements checking","zh":"Perfect for Regulatory Compliance Agents needing advanced FTC disclosure requirements checking","ja":"Perfect for Regulatory Compliance Agents needing advanced FTC disclosure requirements checking","ko":"Perfect for Regulatory Compliance Agents needing advanced FTC disclosure requirements checking","es":"Perfecto para agentes de cumplimiento normativo que necesitan comprobar los requisitos de divulgación avanzados de la FTC","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conformité réglementaire ayant besoin de vérifier les exigences de divulgation avancées de la FTC","de":"Perfekt für Regulatory Compliance Agents, die erweiterte FTC-Offenlegungsvorschriften überprüfen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conformidade Regulatória que necessitam de verificação avançada dos requisitos de divulgação da FTC","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по соблюдению нормативных требований, которым необходима проверка раскрытия информации в соответствии с требованиями FTC","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الامتثال التنظيمي الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق المتقدم من متطلبات الإفصاح عن لجنة التجارة الاتحادية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review creative content for regulatory and platform compliance, ensuring clear and conspicuous disclosures of material connections, affiliate relationships, and paid endorsements, while validating compliance with FTC guidelines and protocols such as disclosure placement and mobile-readable size","zh":"Empowers agents to review creative content for regulatory and platform compliance, ensuring clear and conspicuous disclosures of material connections, affiliate relationships, and paid endorsements, while validating compliance with FTC guidelines and protocols such as disclosure placement and mobile-readable size","ja":"Empowers agents to review creative content for regulatory and platform compliance, ensuring clear and conspicuous disclosures of material connections, affiliate relationships, and paid endorsements, while validating compliance with FTC guidelines and protocols such as disclosure placement and mobile-readable size","ko":"Empowers agents to review creative content for regulatory and platform compliance, ensuring clear and conspicuous disclosures of material connections, affiliate relationships, and paid endorsements, while validating compliance with FTC guidelines and protocols such as disclosure placement and mobile-readable size","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar contenido creativo para cumplimiento normativo y de plataforma, garantizando divulgaciones claras y evidentes de conexiones materiales, relaciones de afiliación y patrocinios pagados, mientras valida el cumplimiento de las directrices y protocolos de la FTC, como la colocación de divulgaciones y tamaño legible en dispositivos móviles","fr":"Permet aux agents de réviser le contenu créatif pour la conformité réglementaire et de plateforme, en garantissant des divulgations claires et évidentes des liens matériels, des relations d''affiliation et des parrainages payés, tout en validant la conformité avec les lignes directrices et les protocoles de la FTC, tels que le placement des divulgations et la taille lisible sur les appareils mobiles","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kreative Inhalte auf regulatorische und plattformübergreifende Konformität zu überprüfen, indem es klare und deutliche Offenlegungen von wesentlichen Verbindungen, Affiliate-Beziehungen und bezahlten Empfehlungen sicherstellt, während es gleichzeitig die Einhaltung der FTC-Richtlinien und -Protokolle wie Offenlegungsplatzierung und mobil-lesbare Größe validiert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar o conteúdo criativo para cumprimento regulatório e de plataforma, garantindo divulgações claras e evidentes de conexões materiais, relações de afiliados e patrocínios pagos, ao mesmo tempo em que valida o cumprimento das diretrizes e protocolos da FTC, como colocação de divulgações e tamanho legível em dispositivos móveis","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять творческий контент на соответствие нормативным требованиям и требованиям платформы, обеспечивая ясные и очевидные раскрытия существенных связей, партнерских отношений и оплаченных рекомендаций, а также проверяет соответствие руководящим принципам и протоколам FTC, таким как размещение раскрытий и размер шрифта, читаемый на мобильных устройствах","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية مراجعة المحتوى الإبداعي لامتثال التنظيمي والمنصة، وضمان الإفصاح الواضح عن الاتصالات المادية وعلاقات التأهيل والدعم المالي، مع التحقق في الوقت نفسه من الامتثال لإرشادات وبروتوكولات لجنة التجارة الاتحادية، مثل وضع الإفصاح وحجم النص القابل للقراءة على الأجهزة المحمولة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating FTC disclosure requirement checks for sponsored content","Validating affiliate relationship disclosures in marketing materials","Reviewing testimonial claims for compliance with typical results guidelines"],"zh":["Automating FTC disclosure requirement checks for sponsored content","Validating affiliate relationship disclosures in marketing materials","Reviewing testimonial claims for compliance with typical results guidelines"],"ja":["Automating FTC disclosure requirement checks for sponsored content","Validating affiliate relationship disclosures in marketing materials","Reviewing testimonial claims for compliance with typical results guidelines"],"ko":["Automating FTC disclosure requirement checks for sponsored content","Validating affiliate relationship disclosures in marketing materials","Reviewing testimonial claims for compliance with typical results guidelines"],"es":["Automatizar las comprobaciones de requisitos de divulgación de la FTC para contenido patrocinado","Validar divulgaciones de relaciones de afiliación en materiales de marketing","Revisar afirmaciones de testimonios para cumplimiento con las pautas de resultados típicos"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications des exigences de divulgation de la FTC pour le contenu parrainé","Valider les divulgations de relations d''affiliation dans les matériaux de marketing","Réviser les allégations de témoignages pour la conformité avec les lignes directrices de résultats typiques"],"de":["Automatisierung der Überprüfung der FTC-Offenlegungsvorschriften für gesponserten Inhalt","Validierung von Affiliate-Beziehungs-Offenlegungen in Marketingmaterialien","Überprüfung von Testimonial-Behauptungen auf Konformität mit den Richtlinien für typische Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Automatizar verificação de requisitos de divulgação da FTC para conteúdo patrocinado","Validar divulgações de relações de afiliados em materiais de marketing","Revisar alegações de testemunhos para cumprimento com diretrizes de resultados típicos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку требований к раскрытию информации в соответствии с требованиями FTC для спонсируемого контента","Проверять раскрытия партнерских отношений в маркетинговых материалах","Проверять утверждения в отзывах на соответствие руководящим принципам типичных результатов"],"ar":["توسيع التحقق الأوتوماتيكي لمتطلبات الإفصاح عن لجنة التجارة الاتحادية للمحتوى الممول","التحقق من إفصاحات علاقات التأهيل في مواد التسويق","مراجعة ادعاءات الشهادات لامتثالها لإرشادات النتائج النموذجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of FTC regulations and guidelines","Limited to media buying operations and creative content review","May require additional plugins for comprehensive compliance checking"],"zh":["Requires knowledge of FTC regulations and guidelines","Limited to media buying operations and creative content review","May require additional plugins for comprehensive compliance checking"],"ja":["Requires knowledge of FTC regulations and guidelines","Limited to media buying operations and creative content review","May require additional plugins for comprehensive compliance checking"],"ko":["Requires knowledge of FTC regulations and guidelines","Limited to media buying operations and creative content review","May require additional plugins for comprehensive compliance checking"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las regulaciones y directrices de la FTC","Limitado a operaciones de compra de medios y revisión de contenido creativo","Puede requerir complementos adicionales para una verificación de cumplimiento integral"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des réglementations et des lignes directrices de la FTC","Limité aux opérations d''achat de médias et à la révision de contenu créatif","Peut nécessiter des plug-ins supplémentaires pour une vérification de conformité complète"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der FTC-Vorschriften und -Richtlinien","Begrenzt auf Medienkaufbetrieb und kreative Inhaltsprüfung","Kann zusätzliche Plug-ins für eine umfassende Konformitätsprüfung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento das regulamentações e diretrizes da FTC","Limitado a operações de compra de mídia e revisão de conteúdo criativo","Pode exigir plugins adicionais para verificação de conformidade abrangente"],"ru":["Требует знания нормативных требований и руководящих принципов FTC","Ограничен операциями по покупке медиа и проверке творческого контента","Может требовать дополнительных плагинов для комплексной проверки соответствия"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة التنظيمات والإرشادات التي تضعها لجنة التجارة الاتحادية","محدود للعمليات الشرائية للوسائط ومراجعة المحتوى الإبداعي"," قد يتطلب إضافات إضافية للتحقق الشامل من الامتثال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Exaphis/baby-copilot/unslop', 'community', 'Exaphis', 'baby-copilot', 'Exaphis/baby-copilot', 'unslop', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:48:15.326Z', NULL, '{"id":"Exaphis/baby-copilot/unslop","name":"unslop","description":{"zh":"unslop 是一个小型的代码补全工具，能够优化代码质量，删除不必要的代码","ja":"unslop は小さなコード補完ツールで、コードの品質を最適化し、不要なコードを削除します","ko":"unslop는 작은 코드 완성 도구로 코드 품질을 최적화하고 불필요한 코드를 제거합니다","es":"Unslop es una herramienta de finalización de código que elimina el código innecesario y los comentarios","fr":"Unslop est un outil de complétion de code qui supprime le code inutile et les commentaires","de":"Unslop ist ein Code-Vervollständigungstool, das unnötigen Code und Kommentare entfernt","pt":"Unslop é uma ferramenta de conclusão de código que ajuda a remover código desnecessário gerado por IA.","ru":"Unslop - это инструмент для автозаполнения кода, который помогает удалить ненужный код, сгенерированный ИИ.","ar":"أنسلوب هي أداة استكمال الشفرة التي تساعد على إزالة الشفرة غير الضرورية التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الإصدارات الاصطناعية.","en":"A teeny code completion tool."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"unslop 代码补全工具","ja":"unslop コード補完ツール","ko":"unslop 코드 완성 도구","es":"Herramienta de finalización de código unslop","fr":"Outil de complétion de code unslop","de":"Code-Vervollständigungstool unslop","pt":"Unslop: Ferramenta de Conclusão de Código","ru":"Unslop: Инструмент для автозаполнения кода","ar":"أنسلوب: أداة استكمال الشفرة","en":"unslop"},"description":{"zh":"unslop 是一个小型的代码补全工具，能够优化代码质量，删除不必要的代码","ja":"unslop は小さなコード補完ツールで、コードの品質を最適化し、不要なコードを削除します","ko":"unslop는 작은 코드 완성 도구로 코드 품질을 최적화하고 불필요한 코드를 제거합니다","es":"Unslop es una herramienta de finalización de código que elimina el código innecesario y los comentarios","fr":"Unslop est un outil de complétion de code qui supprime le code inutile et les commentaires","de":"Unslop ist ein Code-Vervollständigungstool, das unnötigen Code und Kommentare entfernt","pt":"Unslop é uma ferramenta de conclusão de código que ajuda a remover código desnecessário gerado por IA.","ru":"Unslop - это инструмент для автозаполнения кода, который помогает удалить ненужный код, сгенерированный ИИ.","ar":"أنسلوب هي أداة استكمال الشفرة التي تساعد على إزالة الشفرة غير الضرورية التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الإصدارات الاصطناعية.","en":"A teeny code completion tool."},"definition":{"en":"A teeny code completion tool."},"features":{"zh":["检查代码差异","删除不必要的代码","优化代码质量","去除多余的注释","去除不必要的防御检查"],"ja":["コードの差異を確認","不要なコードを削除","コードの品質を最適化","余分なコメントを削除","不要な防御チェックを削除"],"ko":["코드 차이를 확인","불필요한 코드를 제거","코드 품질을 최적화","불필요한 주석을 제거","불필요한 방어 체크를 제거"],"es":["Elimina comentarios innecesarios","Suprime comprobaciones defensivas adicionales","Elimina casts a any para evitar problemas de tipos","Suprime pruebas que no testean código real","Mantiene un estilo de código consistente"],"fr":["Supprime les commentaires inutiles","Élimine les vérifications défensives supplémentaires","Supprime les casts à any pour éviter les problèmes de types","Supprime les tests qui ne testent pas de code réel","Maintient un style de code cohérent"],"de":["Entfernt unnötige Kommentare","Entfernt zusätzliche defensive Überprüfungen","Entfernt Casts zu any, um Typprobleme zu vermeiden","Entfernt Tests, die keinen echten Code testen","Hält einen konsistenten Code-Stil ein"],"pt":["Remoção de comentários excessivos","Otimização de verificações defensivas","Correção de problemas de tipo","Otimização de testes","Manutenção do estilo do código"],"ru":["Удаление лишних комментариев","Оптимизация защитных проверок","Исправление проблем с типами","Оптимизация тестов","Поддержание стиля кода"],"ar":["إزالة التعليقات الزائدة","تحسين الفحوصات الدفاعية","تصحيح مشاكل النوع","تحسين الاختبارات","الحفاظ على نمط الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码补全工具","代码优化","代码质量","代码差异","代码检查","代码完善"],"ja":["コード補完ツール","コード最適化","コード品質","コードの差異","コードチェック","コード完善"],"ko":["코드 완성 도구","코드 최적화","코드 품질","코드 차이","코드 확인","코드 완성"],"es":["herramienta de finalización de código","desarrollo de software","optimización de código","eliminación de código innecesario","mejora del código","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["outil de complétion de code","développement de logiciels","optimisation de code","élimination de code inutile","amélioration du code","développement d''applications"],"de":["Code-Vervollständigungstool","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Optimierung","Entfernen von unnötigem Code","Code-Verbesserung","Anwendungs-Entwicklung"],"pt":["otimização de código","conclusão de código","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","remoção de código excessivo","melhoria de código"],"ru":["оптимизация кода","автозаполнение кода","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","удаление лишнего кода","улучшение кода"],"ar":["تحسين الشفرة","استكمال الشفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","إزالة الشفرة الزائدة","تحسين الشفرة"]}},"owner":"Exaphis","repo":"baby-copilot","repoPath":"Exaphis/baby-copilot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"unslop","description":"Only use when explicitly specified by the user.","bodyPreview":"Check the diff against main, and remove all AI generated slop introduced in this branch.\n\nThis includes:\n- Extra comments that a human wouldn''t add or is inconsistent with the rest of the file\n- Extra defensive checks or try/catch blocks that are abnormal for that area of the codebase (especially if called by trusted / validated codepaths)\n- Casts to any to get around type issues\n- Tests that do not test actual code\n- Any other style that is inconsistent with the file\n\nReport at the end with onl","body":"Check the diff against main, and remove all AI generated slop introduced in this branch.\n\nThis includes:\n- Extra comments that a human wouldn''t add or is inconsistent with the rest of the file\n- Extra defensive checks or try/catch blocks that are abnormal for that area of the codebase (especially if called by trusted / validated codepaths)\n- Casts to any to get around type issues\n- Tests that do not test actual code\n- Any other style that is inconsistent with the file\n\nReport at the end with only a 1-3 sentence summary of what you changed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:48:15.326Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Code Review Agents maintaining codebase integrity by removing AI-generated artifacts.","zh":"对于代码审查代理维护代码库的完整性，通过删除AI生成的构件至关重要。","ja":"コードレビュー代理がコードベースの完全性を維持するために、AIによって生成されたアーティファクトを削除するために不可欠です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 코드베이스의 무결성을 유지하기 위해 AI가 생성한 아티팩트를 제거하는 데 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de revisión de código que mantienen la integridad de la base de código eliminando artefactos generados por IA.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de révision de code qui maintiennent l''intégrité de la base de code en supprimant les artefacts générés par l''IA.","de":"Wichtig für Code-Review-Agenten, die die Integrität der Codebasis durch Entfernen von durch KI generierten Artefakten aufrechterhalten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Revisão de Código que mantêm a integridade da base de código removendo artefatos gerados por IA.","ru":"Необходим для агентов проверки кода, поддерживающих целостность кодовой базы путем удаления артефактов, сгенерированных ИИ.","ar":"ضروري لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي ي維 الحفاظ على سلامة قاعدة الشفرة من خلال إزالة الملفات المولدة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated detection and removal of AI-generated code slop by analyzing git diffs against main. Specifically targets inconsistent comments, unnecessary defensive checks, type casting workarounds, and irrelevant tests that violate codebase style consistency.","zh":"通过分析git差异来实现自动检测和删除AI生成的代码杂乱，特别针对违反代码库样式一致性的不一致注释、不必要的防御性检查、类型强制转换的变通方法以及无关测试。","ja":"Gitの差分を分析して、AIによって生成されたコードの雑さを自動的に検出して削除します。特に、コードベースのスタイルの一貫性を侵害する不一致なコメント、不要な防御的チェック、型キャストの回避策、および無関係なテストを対象とします。","ko":"Git 차이를 분석하여 AI가 생성한 코드의 비용을 자동으로 감지하고 제거합니다. 특히, 코드베이스 스타일 일관성을 위반하는 일관되지 않은 주석, 불필요한 방어적 확인, 유형 강제 변환의 우회 및 관련 없는 테스트를 대상으로 합니다.","es":"Permite la detección y eliminación automatizada de código sucio generado por IA analizando las diferencias de git con la rama principal. Se centra específicamente en comentarios inconsistentes, comprobaciones defensivas innecesarias, soluciones de tipo de casting y pruebas irrelevantes que violan la consistencia del estilo de la base de código.","fr":"Permet la détection et la suppression automatiques du code sale généré par l''IA en analysant les différences de git par rapport à la branche principale. Cible spécifiquement les commentaires incohérents, les vérifications défensives inutiles, les solutions de casting de type et les tests non pertinents qui violent la cohérence du style de la base de code.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Erkennung und Entfernung von durch KI generiertem Code-Schmutz durch die Analyse von Git-Diffs gegenüber dem Hauptzweig. Zielt speziell auf inkonsistente Kommentare, unnötige defensive Prüfungen, Typ-Casting-Umgehungen und irrelevante Tests ab, die die Konsistenz des Code-Stils verletzen.","pt":"Permite a detecção e remoção automatizada de código de lixo gerado por IA, analisando diffs do git em relação ao main. Especificamente, destaca comentários inconsistentes, verificações defensivas desnecessárias, soluções de trabalho para casting de tipos e testes irrelevantes que violam a consistência do estilo da base de código.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять автоматическое обнаружение и удаление кода мусора, сгенерированного ИИ, путем анализа git-диффов по отношению к основной ветке. Конкретно нацелен на несоответствующие комментарии, ненужные оборонительные проверки, обходы типа кастинга и нерелевантные тесты, которые нарушают согласованность стиля кодовой базы.","ar":"تمكن من الكشف التلقائي وإزالة شفرة القمامة المولدة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي عن طريق تحليل الفروقات في جيت مقابل الفرع الرئيسي. يركز بشكل خاص على التعليقات غير المتسقة والتحقق الدفاعي غير الضروري وطرق حل مشاكل تحويل النوع والاختبارات غير ذات الصلة التي تنتهك συνέISTENCE أسلوب قاعدة الشفرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Cleaning AI-generated code commits before merging","Maintaining consistent code style across collaborative projects","Removing redundant defensive programming patterns","Eliminating type casting workarounds in TypeScript codebases"],"zh":["在合并之前清理AI生成的代码提交","在协作项目中保持一致的代码样式","删除冗余的防御性编程模式","从TypeScript代码库中消除类型强制转换的变通方法"],"ja":["マージする前にAIによって生成されたコードのコミットをクリーンアップする","共同プロジェクトで一貫したコードスタイルを維持する","冗長な防御的プログラミングパターンを削除する","TypeScriptコードベースから型キャストの回避策を排除する"],"ko":["병합하기 전에 AI가 생성한 코드 커밋을 정리합니다.","협력 프로젝트에서 일관된 코드 스타일을 유지합니다.","중복된 방어적 프로그래밍 패턴을 제거합니다.","TypeScript 코드베이스에서 유형 강제 변환의 우회를 제거합니다."],"es":["Limpieza de commits de código generado por IA antes de la fusión","Mantenimiento de un estilo de código coherente en proyectos colaborativos","Eliminación de patrones de programación defensiva redundantes","Eliminación de soluciones de tipo de casting en bases de código de TypeScript"],"fr":["Nettoyage des commits de code généré par l''IA avant la fusion","Maintenance d''un style de code cohérent dans les projets collaboratifs","Élimination de modèles de programmation défensive redondants","Élimination des solutions de casting de type dans les bases de code TypeScript"],"de":["Reinigung von Commits mit durch KI generiertem Code vor dem Zusammenführen","Aufrechterhaltung eines konsistenten Code-Stils in kooperativen Projekten","Entfernung redundanter Muster defensiver Programmierung","Entfernung von Typ-Casting-Umgehungen in TypeScript-Codebasen"],"pt":["Limpar commits de código gerados por IA antes de mesclar","Manter estilo de código consistente em projetos colaborativos","Remover padrões de programação defensiva redundantes","Eliminar soluções de trabalho para casting de tipos em bases de código TypeScript"],"ru":["Очистка коммитов кода, сгенерированного ИИ, перед слиянием","Поддержание согласованного стиля кода в совместных проектах","Удаление избыточных паттернов защитного программирования","Удаление обходов типа кастинга в кодовых базах TypeScript"],"ar":["تنظيف التزامات شفرة الكود المولدة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي قبل الدمج","الحفاظ على أسلوب متسق للشفرة في المشاريع التعاونية","إزالة أنماط البرمجة الدفاعية الزائدة","إزالة حلول تحويل النوع في قواعد الشفرة TypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git repository with main branch comparison","Limited to code style inconsistencies detectable through diff analysis","Depends on existing human-written codebase for style reference"],"zh":["需要带有主分支比较的git仓库","仅限于可通过差异分析检测的代码样式不一致","依赖于现有的人类编写的代码库作为样式参考"],"ja":["メインブランチの比較が可能なGitリポジトリが必要","差分分析によって検出可能なコードスタイルの不一致に限定される","スタイルの参考として既存の人間が書いたコードベースに依存する"],"ko":["메인 브랜치 비교가 가능한 Git 리포지토리가 필요합니다.","차이 분석으로 감지할 수 있는 코드 스타일 불일치를 제한합니다.","스타일 참조로 기존의 사람이 작성한 코드베이스에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere un repositorio de git con comparación de la rama principal","Limitado a las inconsistencias de estilo de código detectables a través del análisis de diferencias","Depende de una base de código existente escrita por humanos para la referencia de estilo"],"fr":["Nécessite un référentiel git avec comparaison de la branche principale","Limité aux incohérences de style de code détectables via l''analyse des différences","Dépend d''une base de code existante écrite par des humains pour la référence de style"],"de":["Erfordert ein Git-Repository mit Vergleich des Hauptzweigs","Begrenzt auf Code-Stil-Inkonsistenzen, die durch Differenzanalyse erkennbar sind","Hängt von einer bestehenden, von Menschen geschriebenen Codebasis für die Stilreferenz ab"],"pt":["Requer repositório git com comparação de ramo principal","Limitado a inconsistências de estilo de código detectáveis por meio de análise de diff","Depende de base de código existente escrita por humanos para referência de estilo"],"ru":["Требует репозитория git с сравнением основной ветки","Ограничен несоответствиями стиля кода, обнаруживаемыми с помощью анализа диффов","Зависит от существующей кодовой базы, написанной человеком, для ссылки на стиль"],"ar":["يتطلب مستودع جيت مع مقارنة الفرع الرئيسي","محدود bằng inconsistências في أسلوب الشفرة التي يمكن الكشف عنها من خلال تحليل الفروقات","يعتمد على قاعدة شفرة موجودة مكتوبة من قبل الإنسان لمرجع أسلوب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/general', 'community', 'itsimonfredlingjack', 'codex-dev-plugin', 'itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin', 'general', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:48:55.334Z', NULL, '{"id":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin/general","name":"general","description":{"zh":"通用AI代理技能是一种能够进行分析和解决问题的技术。它包括Brief analysis、Implementation和Trade-offs和notes等方面","ja":"汎用AIエージェントスキルは、分析と問題解決を行う技術です。Brief analysis、Implementation、Trade-offsとnotesなどを含みます","ko":"일반 AI 에이전트 기술은 분석과 문제 해결을 수행하는 기술입니다. Brief analysis, Implementation, Trade-offs와 notes 등을 포함합니다","es":"La habilidad general es una función que permite analizar y resolver problemas de forma efectiva. Nuestro análisis y soluciones pueden mejorar tus proyectos de desarrollo","fr":"La compétence générale est une fonction qui permet d''analyser et de résoudre des problèmes de manière efficace. Notre analyse et nos solutions peuvent améliorer vos projets de développement","de":"Die allgemeine Fähigkeit ist eine Funktion, die es ermöglicht, Probleme effektiv zu analysieren und zu lösen. Unsere Analyse und Lösungen können Ihre Entwicklungsvorhaben verbessern","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"通用AI代理技能","ja":"汎用AIエージェントスキル","ko":"일반 AI 에이전트 기술","es":"Análisis de habilidad general para desarrolladores","fr":"Analyse de compétence générale pour les développeurs","de":"Allgemeine Fähigkeitsanalyse für Entwickler","en":"general"},"description":{"zh":"通用AI代理技能是一种能够进行分析和解决问题的技术。它包括Brief analysis、Implementation和Trade-offs和notes等方面","ja":"汎用AIエージェントスキルは、分析と問題解決を行う技術です。Brief analysis、Implementation、Trade-offsとnotesなどを含みます","ko":"일반 AI 에이전트 기술은 분석과 문제 해결을 수행하는 기술입니다. Brief analysis, Implementation, Trade-offs와 notes 등을 포함합니다","es":"La habilidad general es una función que permite analizar y resolver problemas de forma efectiva. Nuestro análisis y soluciones pueden mejorar tus proyectos d...","fr":"La compétence générale est une fonction qui permet d''analyser et de résoudre des problèmes de manière efficace. Notre analyse et nos solutions peuvent amélio...","de":"Die allgemeine Fähigkeit ist eine Funktion, die es ermöglicht, Probleme effektiv zu analysieren und zu lösen. Unsere Analyse und Lösungen können Ihre Entwick...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分析和解决问题","实现技术","权衡和注意事项","XML输出格式","多语言支持"],"ja":["分析と問題解決","実装技術","トレードオフと注意事項","XML出力形式","多言語対応"],"ko":["분석 및 문제 해결","구현 기술","트레이드 오프 및注意事項","XML 출력 형식","다중 언어 지원"],"es":["Análisis de problemas","Resolución de problemas","Implementación de soluciones","Consideración de trade-offs","Notas y recomendaciones"],"fr":["Analyse de problèmes","Résolution de problèmes","Mise en œuvre de solutions","Prise en compte des compromis","Notes et recommandations"],"de":["Problemanalyse","Problemlösung","Implementierung von Lösungen","Berücksichtigung von Trade-offs","Hinweise und Empfehlungen"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理技能","分析和解决问题","实现技术","权衡和注意事项","XML输出格式","多语言支持","人工智能技术"],"ja":["AIエージェントスキル","分析と問題解決","実装技術","トレードオフと注意事項","XML出力形式","多言語対応","人工知能技術"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 기술","분석 및 문제 해결","구현 기술","트레이드 오프 및注意事項","XML 출력 형식","다중 언어 지원","인공 지능 기술"],"es":["desarrollo de software","análisis de problemas","resolución de problemas","implementación de soluciones","competencia general","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","analyse de problèmes","résolution de problèmes","mise en œuvre de solutions","compétence générale","développement d''applications"],"de":["Softwareentwicklung","Problemanalyse","Problemlösung","Implementierung von Lösungen","allgemeine Fähigkeit","Anwendungsentwicklung"]}},"owner":"itsimonfredlingjack","repo":"codex-dev-plugin","repoPath":"itsimonfredlingjack/codex-dev-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"general","description":"Skill for general tasks.","bodyPreview":"## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```","body":"## Output Format\n\n```xml\n<result>\n  <analysis>Brief analysis</analysis>\n  <solution>Implementation</solution>\n  <considerations>Trade-offs and notes</considerations>\n</result>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:48:55.334Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Versatile Agents requiring broad applicability across various domains and tasks.","zh":"适用于需要在各个领域和任务中具有广泛适用性的多功能代理。","ja":"様々なドメインやタスクで広く適用可能な汎用エージェントに適しています。","ko":"다양한 도메인과 작업에서 폭넓게 적용 가능한 다기능 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Versátiles que requieren una amplia aplicabilidad en diversos dominios y tareas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents polyvalents nécessitant une applicabilité étendue dans divers domaines et tâches.","de":"Ideal für vielseitige Agenten, die eine breite Anwendbarkeit in verschiedenen Bereichen und Aufgaben erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Versáteis que requerem aplicabilidade ampla em vários domínios e tarefas.","ru":"Идеально для универсальных агентов, требующих широкой применимости в различных областях и задачах.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتعددين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطبيق واسع في مجالات و مهام متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process and generate human-like text using general knowledge, leveraging XML output formats for structured data exchange and facilitating seamless integration with other AI systems through protocols like HTTP and data formats such as XML and JSON.","zh":"使代理能够使用通用知识处理和生成类似人类的文本，利用XML输出格式进行结构化数据交换，并通过HTTP等协议和XML、JSON等数据格式与其他AI系统实现无缝集成。","ja":"一般知識を利用して人間のようなテキストを処理および生成するエージェントを可能にし、XML出力形式を使用した構造化データ交換を実現し、HTTPなどのプロトコルやXML、JSONなどのデータ形式を通じて他のAIシステムとの無縫な統合を促進します。","ko":"일반 지식을 사용하여 인간과 같은 텍스트를 처리 및 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, XML 출력 형식을 사용한 구조화된 데이터 교환을 실현하며, HTTP와 같은 프로토콜 및 XML, JSON과 같은 데이터 형식을 통해 다른 AI 시스템과의無縫한 통합을 촉진합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a procesar y generar texto similar al humano utilizando conocimientos generales, aprovechando formatos de salida XML para el intercambio de datos estructurados y facilitando una integración sin problemas con otros sistemas de inteligencia artificial a través de protocolos como HTTP y formatos de datos como XML y JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter et de générer du texte similaire à celui des humains en utilisant des connaissances générales, en exploitant les formats de sortie XML pour l''échange de données structurées et en facilitant une intégration transparente avec d''autres systèmes d''intelligence artificielle via des protocoles tels que HTTP et des formats de données tels que XML et JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, menschenähnlichen Text zu verarbeiten und zu generieren, indem allgemeines Wissen genutzt wird, wobei XML-Ausgabeformate für den Austausch strukturierter Daten verwendet und eine nahtlose Integration mit anderen KI-Systemen über Protokolle wie HTTP und Datenformate wie XML und JSON ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar e gerar textos semelhantes aos humanos usando conhecimento geral, aproveitando formatos de saída XML para troca de dados estruturados e facilitando uma integração sem problemas com outros sistemas de IA por meio de protocolos como HTTP e formatos de dados como XML e JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать и генерировать тексты, похожие на человеческие, используя общие знания, используя форматы выходных данных XML для обмена структурированными данными и облегчая бесшовную интеграцию с другими системами ИИ через протоколы, такие как HTTP, и форматы данных, такие как XML и JSON.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلالها معالجة ونشر نصوص تشبه الإنسانية باستخدام المعرفة العامة، واستخدام صيغ الإخراج XML لتبادل البيانات المهيكلة، وتسهيل التكامل السلس مع أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وصيغ البيانات مثل XML و JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating concise analysis reports","Creating structured data outputs in XML format","Providing brief summaries of complex topics"],"zh":["生成简洁的分析报告","创建结构化数据输出以XML格式","提供复杂主题的简要摘要"],"ja":["簡潔な分析レポートの生成","構造化データ出力をXML形式で作成","複雑なトピックの簡潔なサマリーの提供"],"ko":["간결한 분석 보고서 생성","구조화된 데이터 출력을 XML 형식으로 생성","복잡한 주제의 간단한 요약 제공"],"es":["Generar informes de análisis concisos","Crear salidas de datos estructuradas en formato XML","Proporcionar resúmenes breves de temas complejos"],"fr":["Générer des rapports d''analyse concis","Créer des sorties de données structurées au format XML","Fournir des résumés courts de sujets complexes"],"de":["Erstellen von präzisen Analyseberichten","Erzeugen von strukturierten Daten Ausgaben im XML-Format","Bereitstellen von kurzen Zusammenfassungen komplexer Themen"],"pt":["Gerar relatórios de análise concisos","Criar saídas de dados estruturados no formato XML","Fornecer resumos breves de tópicos complexos"],"ru":["Генерировать краткие аналитические отчеты","Создавать структурированные данные в формате XML","Предоставлять краткие резюме сложных тем"],"ar":["إنشاء تقارير تحليلية موجزة","إنشاء مخرجات بيانات مهيكلة بصيغة XML","تقديم ملخصات موجزة لمواضيع معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to text-based output","Requires specific XML parsing capabilities","General knowledge may not cover highly specialized domains"],"zh":["仅限文本输出","需要特定的XML解析能力","一般知识可能不涵盖高度专业的领域"],"ja":["テキスト出力のみ","特定のXMLパース機能が必要","一般知識では高度に専門的なドメインをカバーできない"],"ko":["텍스트 출력만 가능","특정 XML 파싱 기능이 필요","일반 지식은 고도로 전문적인 도메인을 다루지 못할 수 있음"],"es":["Limitado a salidas de texto","Requiere capacidades de análisis de XML específicas","El conocimiento general puede no cubrir dominios altamente especializados"],"fr":["Limité aux sorties de texte","Nécessite des capacités d''analyse XML spécifiques","Les connaissances générales peuvent ne pas couvrir les domaines hautement spécialisés"],"de":["Begrenzt auf Textausgaben","Erfordert spezifische XML-Parsing-Fähigkeiten","Das allgemeine Wissen kann nicht alle hochspezialisierten Bereiche abdecken"],"pt":["Limitado a saídas baseadas em texto","Requer capacidades de análise XML específicas","O conhecimento geral pode não cobrir domínios altamente especializados"],"ru":["Ограничен выводом текста","Требует специальных возможностей по парсингу XML","Общие знания могут не охватывать высокоспециализированные области"],"ar":["محدود بالخرج القائم على النص","يتطلب قدرات تحليل XML محددة","المعرفة العامة قد لا تغطي المجالات المتخصصة للغاية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('MykolaPinchuk/QAMAS/onboard', 'community', 'MykolaPinchuk', 'QAMAS', 'MykolaPinchuk/QAMAS', 'onboard', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.470Z', '2026-02-18T08:48:29.484Z', NULL, '{"id":"MykolaPinchuk/QAMAS/onboard","name":"onboard","description":{"zh":"Onboard技能用于VSC Codex中的Q/A MAS工具，实现快速上手和高效开发。它通过读取特定文件，进行有界发现，并打开所需文件以提高开发效率","ja":"OnboardスキルはVSC CodexのQ/A MASツールを迅速に起動し、開発効率を高めるために設計されています。特定のファイルを読み込み、有界発見を行い、必要なファイルを開くことで開発者をサポートします","ko":"Onboard 기능은 VSC Codex의 Q/A MAS 도구를 빠르게 설정하고 개발 효율을 높이기 위해 설계되었습니다. 특정 파일을 읽고, 유계 발견을 수행하며, 필요한 파일을 열어 개발자를 지원합니다","es":"Onboard es una herramienta de QA para VSC Codex que simplifica el proceso de integración. Lee archivos importantes y realiza un descubrimiento limitado para identificar archivos adicionales necesarios.","fr":"Onboard est un outil de QA pour VSC Codex qui simplifie le processus d''intégration. Il lit des fichiers importants et effectue une découverte limitée pour identifier des fichiers supplémentaires nécessaires.","de":"Onboard ist ein QA-Tool für VSC Codex, das den Integrationsprozess vereinfacht. Es liest wichtige Dateien und führt eine begrenzte Entdeckung durch, um zusätzliche erforderliche Dateien zu identifizieren.","pt":"A ferramenta Onboard é um repositório para QA e desenvolvimento em VSC Codex, que fornece recursos para melhorar a produtividade","ru":"Инструмент Onboard - это репозиторий для QA и разработки в VSC Codex, который предоставляет ресурсы для повышения производительности","ar":"أداة Onboard هي مستودع لضمان الجودة والتنمية في VSC Codex، الذي يقدم موارد لتحسين الإنتاجية","en":"Repo for Q/A MAS tool in VSC Codex"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Onboard技能：VSC Codex中的Q/A MAS工具","ja":"Onboardスキル：VSC CodexのQ/A MASツール","ko":"Onboard 기능: VSC Codex의 Q/A MAS 도구","es":"Onboard: Herramienta de QA para VSC Codex","fr":"Onboard : Outil de QA pour VSC Code