,"description":{"zh":"前端专家能够创建高性能、语义化的 UI，确保无障碍和生产级的用户体验","ja":"フロントエンドエキスパートは、アクセシブルで生産性の高い UI を構築し、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","ko":"프론트엔드 전문가는 접근성과 성능을 갖춘 UI를 개발하여 사용자 경험을 개선합니다","es":"Desarrolla interfaces de usuario accesibles y de producción con estructura semántica clara y estética distintiva","fr":"Développez des interfaces utilisateur accessibles et de production avec structure sémantique claire et esthétique distinctive","de":"Entwickeln Sie zugängliche und produktionsreife Benutzeroberflächen mit klarer semantischer Struktur und distinktiver Ästhetik","pt":"Desenvolva interfaces de usuário acessíveis e de produção com estrutura semântica clara. Aprenda a aplicar HTML semântico e criar uma hierarquia lógica de ca...","ru":"Создайте доступные и производственные интерфейсы пользователя с четкой семантической структурой. Узнайте, как применять семантический HTML и создавать логиче...","ar":"قم بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم قابلة للوصول وذات جودة إنتاجية مع هيكل семантиكي واضح. تعلم كيفية تطبيق HTML семантиكي وإنشاء هرمية логية للعناوين","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["语义化的 HTML 结构","逻辑性和顺序性的标题层次","合适的元素选择","无障碍和生产级的 UI"],"ja":["セマンティックな HTML 構造","論理性と順序性のある見出し階層","適切な要素の選択","アクセシブルで生産性の高い UI"],"ko":["의미론적인 HTML 구조","논리적이고 순차적인 제목 계층","적절한 요소 선택","접근성과 성능을 갖춘 UI"],"es":["Estructura semántica clara con elementos de referencia","Jerarquía de encabezados lógica y secuencial","Uso de elementos semánticos para cada caso de uso","Accesibilidad en la interfaz de usuario","Diseño de producción de alta calidad"],"fr":["Structure sémantique claire avec des éléments de repère","Hiérarchie des en-têtes logique et séquentielle","Utilisation d''éléments sémantiques pour chaque cas d''utilisation","Accessibilité dans l''interface utilisateur","Conception de production de haute qualité"],"de":["Klare semantische Struktur mit Bezugs-elementen","Logische und sequenzielle Überschriftenhierarchie","Verwendung semantischer Elemente für jeden Anwendungsfall","Barrierefreie Benutzeroberfläche","Produktionsreife Hochqualitäts-Design"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de UI acessível","Estrutura semântica clara","Hierarquia lógica de cabeçalhos","Uso de HTML semântico","Criação de interfaces de usuário de produção"],"ru":["Создание доступного UI","Четкая семантическая структура","Логическая иерархия заголовков","Применение семантического HTML","Создание производственных интерфейсов пользователя"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة مستخدم قابلة للوصول","هيكل семантиكي واضح","هرمية логية للعناوين","تطبيق HTML семантиكي","إنشاء واجهات مستخدم ذات جودة إنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端开发","语义化 HTML","无障碍 UI","生产级 UI","前端专家","UI 开发"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発","セマンティックな HTML","アクセシブル UI","生産性の高い UI","フロントエンドエキスパート","UI 開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발","의미론적인 HTML","접근성 UI","성능을 갖춘 UI","프론트엔드 전문가","UI 개발"],"es":["frontend experto","desarrollo de ui","accesibilidad","estructura semántica","diseño de producción","interfaces de usuario","semantic html","desarrollo web"],"fr":["expert en frontend","développement d''ui","accessibilité","structure sémantique","conception de production","interfaces utilisateur","html sémantique","développement web"],"de":["frontend-experte","entwicklung von ui","barrierefreiheit","semantische struktur","produktionsreife design","benutzeroberflächen","semantisches html","webentwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","ui acessível","html semântico","estrutura semântica","hierarquia de cabeçalhos","interfaces de usuário","produção de ui"],"ru":["фронтенд-разработка","доступный ui","семантический html","семантическая структура","иерархия заголовков","интерфейсы пользователя","производство ui"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم","واجهة مستخدم قابلة للوصول","html семантиكي","هيكل семантиكي","هرمية العناوين","واجهات المستخدم","إنتاج واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"jorijn","repo":"meshcore-stats","repoPath":"jorijn/meshcore-stats","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-expert","description":"Frontend UI/UX design and implementation for HTML/CSS/JS including semantic structure, responsive layout, accessibility compliance, and visual design direction. Use for building or reviewing web pages/components, fixing accessibility issues, improving styling/responsiveness, or making UI/UX decisions.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Expert\n\n## Overview\nDeliver accessible, production-grade frontend UI with a distinctive aesthetic and clear semantic structure.\n\n## Core Expertise Areas\n\n### Semantic HTML\n- Enforce proper document structure with landmark elements (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<article>`, `<section>`, `<aside>`, `<footer>`)\n- Keep heading hierarchy logical and sequential (h1 -> h2 -> h3)\n- Choose the most semantic element for each use case (`<button>` for actions, `<a>` for navigation, `<time>` for","body":"# Frontend Expert\n\n## Overview\nDeliver accessible, production-grade frontend UI with a distinctive aesthetic and clear semantic structure.\n\n## Core Expertise Areas\n\n### Semantic HTML\n- Enforce proper document structure with landmark elements (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<article>`, `<section>`, `<aside>`, `<footer>`)\n- Keep heading hierarchy logical and sequential (h1 -> h2 -> h3)\n- Choose the most semantic element for each use case (`<button>` for actions, `<a>` for navigation, `<time>` for dates)\n- Validate correct lists, tables (headers/captions), and form elements\n- Prefer native semantics; add ARIA only when required\n\n### Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)\n- Ensure keyboard access and visible focus for all interactive elements\n- Meet color contrast ratios (4.5:1 normal text, 3:1 large text)\n- Provide meaningful alt text and labeled form controls\n- Announce dynamic content changes to assistive tech when needed\n- Manage focus in modals/dialogs/SPA navigation\n\n### CSS Best Practices\n- Use maintainable CSS architecture and consistent naming\n- Implement mobile-first responsive layouts with appropriate breakpoints\n- Use flexbox/grid correctly for layout\n- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` and `prefers-color-scheme`\n- Avoid overly specific or expensive selectors\n- Keep text readable at 200% zoom\n\n### UI/UX Design Principles\n- Maintain clear visual hierarchy and consistent spacing\n- Ensure touch targets meet minimum size (44x44px)\n- Provide feedback for user actions (loading, success, error)\n- Reduce cognitive load with clear information architecture\n\n### Performance & Best Practices\n- Optimize images and use appropriate formats (WebP, SVG)\n- Prioritize critical CSS; defer non-critical assets\n- Use lazy loading where appropriate\n- Avoid unnecessary DOM nesting\n\n## Design Direction (Distinctive Aesthetic)\n- Define purpose, audience, constraints, and target devices\n- Commit to a bold, intentional style (brutalist, editorial, retro-futuristic, organic, maximalist, minimal, etc.)\n- Pick a single memorable visual idea and execute it precisely\n\n### Aesthetic Guidance\n- **Typography**: Choose distinctive display + body fonts; avoid default stacks (Inter/Roboto/Arial/system) and overused trendy choices\n- **Color**: Use a cohesive palette with dominant colors and sharp accents; avoid timid palettes and purple-on-white defaults\n- **Motion**: Prefer a few high-impact animations (page load, staggered reveals, key hovers)\n- **Composition**: Use asymmetry, overlap, grid-breaking elements, and intentional negative space\n- **Backgrounds**: Add atmosphere via gradients, texture/noise, patterns, layered depth\n\n### Match Complexity to Vision\n- Minimalist designs require precision in spacing and typography\n- Maximalist designs require richer layout, effects, and animation\n\n## Working Methodology\n- Structure semantic HTML first, then layer in styling and interactions\n- Check keyboard-only flow and screen reader expectations\n- Prioritize issues by impact: accessibility barriers first, then semantics, then enhancements\n\n## Output Standards\n- Provide working code, not just guidance\n- Explain trade-offs when multiple options exist\n- Suggest quick validation steps (keyboard-only pass, screen reader spot check, axe)\n\n## Quality Checklist\n- Semantic HTML elements used appropriately\n- Heading hierarchy is logical\n- Images have alt text\n- Form controls are labeled\n- Interactive elements are keyboard accessible\n- Focus indicators are visible\n- Color is not the only means of conveying information\n- Color contrast meets WCAG AA\n- Page is responsive and readable at multiple sizes\n- Touch targets are sufficiently sized\n- Loading and error states are handled\n- ARIA is used correctly and only when necessary\n\nPush creative boundaries while keeping the UI usable and inclusive.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:48:41.629Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring production-grade frontend UI implementation with semantic HTML and clear aesthetic structure.","zh":"适合需要生产级前端UI实现的Web开发代理，具有语义HTML和清晰的美学结构。","ja":"生産レベルのフロントエンドUI実装が必要なWeb開発エージェントに適しています。セマンティックHTMLと明確な美的構造を備えています。","ko":"제작급 프론트엔드 UI 구현이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 의미 있는 HTML과 분명한 미적 구조를 가지고 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo web que requieren una implementación de interfaz de usuario frontend de nivel de producción con HTML semántico y estructura estética clara.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant une mise en œuvre d''interface utilisateur frontend de niveau de production avec un HTML sémantique et une structure esthétique claire.","de":"Ideal für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine Produktions-Grade-Frontend-Benutzeroberflächen-Implementierung mit semantischem HTML und klarer ästhetischer Struktur benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que exigem implementação de interface do usuário de frontend de produção com HTML semântico e estrutura estética clara.","ru":"Идеально для агентов веб-разработки, требующих реализации производственной передней части с семантическим HTML и четкой эстетической структурой.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الويب الذي يتطلب تنفيذ واجهة المستخدم الأمامية من الدرجة الإنتاجية مع HTML семантиكي وهيكل جمالي واضح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft accessible, semantic HTML documents with logical heading hierarchies, utilizing landmark elements like `<header>`, `<nav>`, and `<main>`, and applying semantic elements such as `<button>` for actions and `<a>` for navigation, ensuring a distinctive and clear user interface.","zh":"赋予代理创建可访问的、语义HTML文档的能力，具有逻辑的标题层次结构，利用地标元素如`<header>`、`<nav>`和`<main>`，并应用语义元素如`<button>`进行操作和`<a>`进行导航，确保清晰的用户界面。","ja":"エージェントがアクセス可能でセマンティックなHTMLドキュメントを作成できるようにし、論理的な見出し階層構造を持ち、`<header>`、`<nav>`、`<main>`などのランドマーク要素や、`<button>`による操作と`<a>`によるナビゲーションなどのセマンティック要素を使用し、明確なユーザーインターフェイスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 접근 가능한 의미 있는 HTML 문서를 작성할 수 있도록 하며, 논리적인 제목 계층 구조를 가지며, `<header>`、`<nav>` 및 `<main>` 등의 랜드마크 요소와 `<button>`을 통한 작업 및 `<a>`를 통한 내비게이션 등의 의미 있는 요소를 사용하여, 분명한 사용자 인터페이스를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear documentos HTML accesibles y semánticos con jerarquías de encabezados lógicos, utilizando elementos de referencia como `<header>`, `<nav>` y `<main>`, y aplicando elementos semánticos como `<button>` para acciones y `<a>` para navegación, asegurando una interfaz de usuario distintiva y clara.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des documents HTML accessibles et sémantiques avec des hiérarchies d''en-tête logiques, en utilisant des éléments de repère tels que `<header>`, `<nav>` et `<main>`, et en appliquant des éléments sémantiques tels que `<button>` pour les actions et `<a>` pour la navigation, garantissant une interface utilisateur distinctive et claire.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, zugängliche, semantische HTML-Dokumente mit logischen Überschriftenhierarchien zu erstellen, indem sie Referenz-Elemente wie `<header>`, `<nav>` und `<main>` verwenden und semantische Elemente wie `<button>` für Aktionen und `<a>` für Navigation anwenden, um eine deutliche und klare Benutzeroberfläche sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar documentos HTML acessíveis e semânticos com hierarquias de cabeçalhos lógicas, utilizando elementos de referência como `<header>`, `<nav>` e `<main>`, e aplicando elementos semânticos como `<button>` para ações e `<a>` para navegação, garantindo uma interface do usuário distinta e clara.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать доступные и семантические документы HTML с логической иерархией заголовков, используя ориентировочные элементы, такие как `<header>`, `<nav>` и `<main>`, и применяя семантические элементы, такие как `<button>` для действий и `<a>` для навигации, обеспечивая характерную и четкую пользовательский интерфейс.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء مستندات HTML قابلة للوصول وذات دلالة مع هيكل هرمي منطقي للعناوين، باستخدام عناصر إشارة مثل `<header>` و `<nav>` و `<main>`، وتطبيق عناصر دلالية مثل `<button>` للأفعال و `<a>` للملاحة، مما يضمن واجهة مستخدم مميزة وواضحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing proper document structure with landmark elements","Generating semantic HTML for improved accessibility","Creating logical heading hierarchies for better content organization"],"zh":["强制执行正确的文档结构，使用地标元素","生成语义HTML以提高可访问性","创建逻辑标题层次结构以改善内容组织"],"ja":["ランドマーク要素を使用した適切なドキュメント構造の適用","アクセシビリティの向上のためのセマンティックHTMLの生成","コンテンツの整理のための論理的な見出し階層構造の作成"],"ko":["랜드마크 요소를 사용한 올바른 문서 구조 적용","접근성 향상을 위한 의미 있는 HTML 생성","내용의 정리를 위한 논리적인 제목 계층 구조의 생성"],"es":["Aplicar una estructura de documento adecuada con elementos de referencia","Generar HTML semántico para mejorar la accesibilidad","Crear jerarquías de encabezados lógicos para una mejor organización de contenido"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une structure de document appropriée avec des éléments de repère","Générer du HTML sémantique pour améliorer l''accessibilité","Créer des hiérarchies d''en-tête logiques pour une meilleure organisation du contenu"],"de":["Eine ordnungsgemäße Dokumentenstruktur mit Referenz-Elementen durchsetzen","Semantisches HTML für verbesserte Zugänglichkeit generieren","Logische Überschriftenhierarchien für eine bessere Inhaltsorganisation erstellen"],"pt":["Impor estrutura de documento adequada com elementos de referência","Gerar HTML semântico para melhor acessibilidade","Criar hierarquias de cabeçalhos lógicas para melhor organização de conteúdo"],"ru":["Внедрение правильной структуры документа с ориентировочными элементами","Генерация семантического HTML для улучшения доступности","Создание логических иерархий заголовков для лучшей организации контента"],"ar":["إلزام هيكل المستند الصحيح مع عناصر الإشارة","إنتاج HTML دال على تحسين إمكانية الوصول","إنشاء هرمية منطقية للعناوين من أجل تنظيم المحتوى بشكل أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of HTML5 semantic elements","Limited to frontend development scope"],"zh":["需要HTML5语义元素的知识","仅限前端开发范围"],"ja":["HTML5セマンティック要素の知識が必要","フロントエンド開発の範囲のみ"],"ko":["HTML5 의미 요소에 대한 지식이 필요","프론트엔드 개발 범위에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los elementos semánticos de HTML5","Limitado al ámbito de desarrollo frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en éléments sémantiques HTML5","Limité à la portée du développement frontend"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über semantische HTML5-Elemente","Begrenzt auf den Umfang der Frontend-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de elementos semânticos HTML5","Limitado ao escopo de desenvolvimento de frontend"],"ru":["Требует знания семантических элементов HTML5","Ограничен только областью разработки передней части"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة عناصر HTML5 الدلالية","محدود بنطاق تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list/code-review', 'community', 'thewoolleyman', 'tab-groups-windows-list', 'thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list', 'code-review', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:49:08.818Z', NULL, '{"id":"thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list/code-review","name":"code-review","description":{"zh":"代码审查技能是开发人员必备的技能，涉及代码审查流程和最佳实践","ja":"コードレビュースキルは開発者必須のスキルであり、コードレビューのプロセスとベストプラクティスを含む","ko":"코드 리뷰 스킬은 개발자가 반드시 갖추어야 하는 스킬로 코드 리뷰 프로세스와 최고의 관행을 포함합니다","es":"La revisión de código es crucial para garantizar la calidad y seguridad de un proyecto. Sigue nuestros pasos críticos para mejorar tu flujo de trabajo","fr":"La revérification de code est cruciale pour assurer la qualité et la sécurité d''un projet. Suivez nos étapes critiques pour améliorer votre flux de travail","de":"Die Code-Überprüfung ist entscheidend, um die Qualität und Sicherheit eines Projekts zu gewährleisten. Befolgen Sie unsere kritischen Schritte, um Ihren Arbeitsablauf zu verbessern","pt":"A revisão de código é um processo crítico para garantir a qualidade e a manutenção do código. Siga nossas dicas para realizar revisões de código de forma eficaz","ru":"Код-ревью - это критический процесс для обеспечения качества и поддержки кода. Следуйте нашим советам, чтобы проводить код-ревью эффективно","ar":"مراجعة الكود هي عملية حاسمة لضمان جودة و صيانة الكود. اتبع نصائحنا لإجراء مراجعات الكود بفعالية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码审查技能","ja":"コードレビュースキル","ko":"코드 리뷰 스킬","es":"Revisión de código: Mejora tu flujo de trabajo","fr":"Revérification de code : améliorez votre flux de travail","de":"Code-Review: Verbessern Sie Ihren Arbeitsablauf","pt":"Revisão de Código: Melhores Práticas para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Код-ревью: Лучшие практики для разработчиков","ar":"مراجعة الكود: أفضل الممارسات للمطورين","en":"code-review"},"description":{"zh":"代码审查技能是开发人员必备的技能，涉及代码审查流程和最佳实践","ja":"コードレビュースキルは開発者必須のスキルであり、コードレビューのプロセスとベストプラクティスを含む","ko":"코드 리뷰 스킬은 개발자가 반드시 갖추어야 하는 스킬로 코드 리뷰 프로세스와 최고의 관행을 포함합니다","es":"La revisión de código es crucial para garantizar la calidad y seguridad de un proyecto. Sigue nuestros pasos críticos para mejorar tu flujo de trabajo","fr":"La revérification de code est cruciale pour assurer la qualité et la sécurité d''un projet. Suivez nos étapes critiques pour améliorer votre flux de travail","de":"Die Code-Überprüfung ist entscheidend, um die Qualität und Sicherheit eines Projekts zu gewährleisten. Befolgen Sie unsere kritischen Schritte, um Ihren Arbe...","pt":"A revisão de código é um processo crítico para garantir a qualidade e a manutenção do código. Siga nossas dicas para realizar revisões de código de forma eficaz","ru":"Код-ревью - это критический процесс для обеспечения качества и поддержки кода. Следуйте нашим советам, чтобы проводить код-ревью эффективно","ar":"مراجعة الكود هي عملية حاسمة لضمان جودة و صيانة الكود. اتبع نصائحنا لإجراء مراجعات الكود بفعالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["代码审查流程","代码质量保证","开发效率提高","最佳实践","代码安全审查"],"ja":["コードレビューのプロセス","コード品質の保証","開発効率の向上","ベストプラクティス","コードのセキュリティレビュー"],"ko":["코드 리뷰 프로세스","코드 품질 보증","개발 효율성 향상","최선의 관행","코드 보안 리뷰"],"es":["Carga del archivo workflow.xml","Lectura del contenido del archivo","Pasar la ruta del archivo yaml como parámetro","Mejora de la calidad y seguridad del proyecto","Optimización del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Chargement du fichier workflow.xml","Lecture du contenu du fichier","Passer le chemin du fichier yaml en tant que paramètre","Amélioration de la qualité et de la sécurité du projet","Optimisation du flux de travail"],"de":["Laden der Datei workflow.xml","Lesen des Inhalts der Datei","Übergeben des Pfads der yaml-Datei als Parameter","Verbesserung der Qualität und Sicherheit des Projekts","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs"],"pt":["Análise de código-fonte","Avaliação de conformidade","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Redução de erros e bugs","Otimização do desempenho","Integração contínua"],"ru":["Анализ исходного кода","Оценка соответствия","Улучшение качества кода","Снижение ошибок и багов","Оптимизация производительности","Непрерывная интеграция"],"ar":["تحليل الكود المصدري","تقييم المطابقة","تحسين جودة الكود","تقليل الأخطاء و العيوب","تحسين الأداء","التكامل المستمر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","代码质量","开发效率","代码安全","代码最佳实践","代码审查流程"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コード品質","開発効率","コードセキュリティ","コードベストプラクティス","コードレビューのプロセス"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 품질","개발 효율성","코드 보안","코드 최고의 관행","코드 리뷰 프로세스"],"es":["revisión de código","flujo de trabajo","calidad del código","seguridad del proyecto","optimización del flujo de trabajo","mejora de la calidad"],"fr":["revérification de code","flux de travail","qualité du code","sécurité du projet","optimisation du flux de travail","amélioration de la qualité"],"de":["Code-Überprüfung","Arbeitsablauf","Code-Qualität","Projektsicherheit","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs","Qualitätsverbesserung"],"pt":["revisão de código","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade do código","análise de código","melhoria do código","otimização do desempenho","integração contínua","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["код-ревью","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","анализ кода","улучшение кода","оптимизация производительности","непрерывная интеграция","разработчики"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","تحليل الكود","تحسين الكود","تحسين الأداء","التكامل المستمر","المطورين"]}},"owner":"thewoolleyman","repo":"tab-groups-windows-list","repoPath":"thewoolleyman/tab-groups-windows-list","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-review","description":"Perform an ADVERSARIAL Senior Developer code review that finds 3-10 specific problems in every story. Challenges everything: code quality, test coverage, architecture compliance, security, performance. NEVER accepts `looks good` - must find minimum issues and can auto-fix with user approval.","bodyPreview":"IT IS CRITICAL THAT YOU FOLLOW THESE STEPS - while staying in character as the current agent persona you may have loaded:\n\n<steps CRITICAL=\"TRUE\">\n1. Always LOAD the FULL @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml\n2. READ its entire contents - this is the CORE OS for EXECUTING the specific workflow-config @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows/4-implementation/code-review/workflow.yaml\n3. Pass the yaml path @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows/4-implementation/code-review/workflow.yaml as ''workfl","body":"IT IS CRITICAL THAT YOU FOLLOW THESE STEPS - while staying in character as the current agent persona you may have loaded:\n\n<steps CRITICAL=\"TRUE\">\n1. Always LOAD the FULL @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml\n2. READ its entire contents - this is the CORE OS for EXECUTING the specific workflow-config @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows/4-implementation/code-review/workflow.yaml\n3. Pass the yaml path @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows/4-implementation/code-review/workflow.yaml as ''workflow-config'' parameter to the workflow.xml instructions\n4. Follow workflow.xml instructions EXACTLY as written to process and follow the specific workflow config and its instructions\n5. Save outputs after EACH section when generating any documents from templates\n</steps>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:49:08.818Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring rigorous workflow validation and code analysis through XML and YAML configurations.","zh":"适合需要严格的工作流验证和通过XML和YAML配置进行代码分析的开发代理。","ja":"XMLおよびYAML構成を介した厳格なワークフローの検証とコード分析を必要とする開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"XML 및 YAML 구성 통해 엄격한 워크플로우 검증 및 코드 분석이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una validación de flujo de trabajo rigurosa y análisis de código a través de configuraciones XML y YAML.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une validation de flux de travail rigoureuse et une analyse de code via des configurations XML et YAML.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungss_agenten, die eine strenge Workflow-Validierung und Code-Analyse durch XML- und YAML-Konfigurationen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem validação rigorosa de fluxo de trabalho e análise de código por meio de configurações XML e YAML.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих строгой проверки рабочего процесса и анализа кода посредством конфигураций XML и YAML.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب التحقق الصارم من تدفق العمل وتحليل الشفرة من خلال التكوينات XML و YAML."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute specific workflows by loading and reading the core OS defined in workflow.xml, and then passing the yaml path to workflow.yaml for precise code-review implementations, leveraging XML and YAML parsing capabilities.","zh":"使代理能够通过加载和读取工作流中定义的核心操作系统来执行特定的工作流，workflow.xml，并将yaml路径传递给workflow.yaml以实现精确的代码审查，利用XML和YAML解析能力。","ja":"エージェントがワークフロー.xmlで定義されたコアOSを読み込み、ワークフロー.yamlへのyamlパスを渡して、特定のワークフローを実行できるようにし、XMLおよびYAMLの解析機能を利用して、精密なコードレビューの実装を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 워크플로우.xml에서 정의된 핵심 운영 체제를 로드하고 읽은 다음 워크플로우.yaml로 yaml 경로를 전달하여 특정 워크플로우를 실행할 수 있도록 하며, XML 및 YAML 파싱 기능을 활용하여 정밀한 코드 리뷰 구현을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar flujos de trabajo específicos cargando y leyendo el sistema operativo principal definido en workflow.xml, y luego pasando la ruta yaml a workflow.yaml para implementaciones de revisión de código precisas, aprovechando las capacidades de análisis XML y YAML.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des flux de travail spécifiques en chargeant et en lisant le système d''exploitation principal défini dans workflow.xml, puis en passant le chemin yaml à workflow.yaml pour des mises en œuvre de révision de code précises, en exploitant les capacités d''analyse XML et YAML.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bestimmte Workflows auszuführen, indem sie das im workflow.xml definierte Betriebssystem laden und lesen und dann den yaml-Pfad an workflow.yaml für präzise Code-Review-Implementierungen übergeben, wodurch die XML- und YAML-Verarbeitungsfähigkeiten genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar fluxos de trabalho específicos carregando e lendo o sistema operacional principal definido no workflow.xml, e em seguida passando o caminho yaml para workflow.yaml para implementações precisas de revisão de código, aproveitando as capacidades de análise XML e YAML.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять конкретные рабочие процессы, загружая и считывая основную операционную систему, определённую в workflow.xml, а затем передавая путь yaml в workflow.yaml для точных реализаций проверки кода, используя возможности парсинга XML и YAML.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تنفيذ تدفقات عمل محددة عن طريق تحميل و قراءة نظام التشغيل الأساسي المحدد في workflow.xml، ثم نقل مسار الـ yaml إلى workflow.yaml لتنفيذات دقيقة لمراجعة الشفرة، مستفيداً من قدرات تحليل XML و YAML."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating workflow configurations through workflow.xml and workflow.yaml","Executing code-review tasks based on predefined workflow configurations","Debugging workflow implementations by analyzing XML and YAML files"],"zh":["通过workflow.xml和workflow.yaml验证工作流配置","基于预定义的工作流配置执行代码审查任务","通过分析XML和YAML文件调试工作流实现"],"ja":["ワークフロー.xmlおよびワークフロー.yamlを介したワークフローコンフィギュレーションの検証","事前に定義されたワークフローコンフィギュレーションに基づいてコードレビュータスクを実行","XMLおよびYAMLファイルの分析によるワークフロー実装のデバッグ"],"ko":["workflow.xml 및 workflow.yaml을 통해 워크플로우 구성을 검증하는 것","사전에 정의된 워크플로우 구성을 기반으로 코드 리뷰 태스크를 수행하는 것","XML 및 YAML 파일을 분석하여 워크플로우 구현을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Validar configuraciones de flujo de trabajo a través de workflow.xml y workflow.yaml","Ejecutar tareas de revisión de código basadas en configuraciones de flujo de trabajo predefinidas","Depurar implementaciones de flujo de trabajo analizando archivos XML y YAML"],"fr":["Valider les configurations de flux de travail via workflow.xml et workflow.yaml","Exécuter des tâches de révision de code basées sur des configurations de flux de travail prédéfinies","Déboguer les mises en œuvre de flux de travail en analysant les fichiers XML et YAML"],"de":["Workflow-Konfigurationen über workflow.xml und workflow.yaml validieren","Code-Review-Aufgaben auf der Grundlage von vordefinierten Workflow-Konfigurationen ausführen","Workflow-Implementierungen durch Analyse von XML- und YAML-Dateien debuggen"],"pt":["Validar configurações de fluxo de trabalho por meio de workflow.xml e workflow.yaml","Executar tarefas de revisão de código com base em configurações de fluxo de trabalho predefinidas","Depurar implementações de fluxo de trabalho analisando arquivos XML e YAML"],"ru":["Проверять конфигурации рабочего процесса с помощью workflow.xml и workflow.yaml","Выполнять задачи проверки кода на основе предварительно определённых конфигураций рабочего процесса","Отлаживать реализации рабочего процесса, анализируя файлы XML и YAML"],"ar":["التحقق من تكوينات تدفق العمل من خلال workflow.xml و workflow.yaml","تنفيذ مهام مراجعة الشفرة استناداً إلى تكوينات تدفق العمل المحددة مسبقاً","تصحيح أخطاء تنفيذ تدفق العمل عن طريق تحليل ملفات XML و YAML"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to specific project directories like @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks and @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows","Mandatory loading and reading of full workflow.xml contents","Dependent on correct passing of yaml path to workflow.yaml for code-review workflows"],"zh":["需要访问特定的项目目录，如@{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks和@{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows","必须加载和读取完整的workflow.xml内容","依赖于正确传递yaml路径到workflow.yaml以进行代码审查工作流"],"ja":["特定のプロジェクトディレクトリ（例：@{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasksおよび@{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows）へのアクセスが必要","ワークフロー.xmlの全内容を読み込むことが必須","コードレビューのワークフロー実行には、yamlパスをワークフロー.yamlに正しく渡す必要がある"],"ko":["특정 프로젝트 디렉토리(@{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks 및 @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows)への 액세스가 필요함","workflow.xml의 전체 내용을 로드하고 읽는 것이 필수임","코드 리뷰 워크플로우를 위해 yaml 경로를 workflow.yaml에 올바르게 전달하는 것이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a directorios de proyecto específicos como @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks y @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows","Carga y lectura obligatoria de todo el contenido de workflow.xml","Dependiente de la correcta transmisión de la ruta yaml a workflow.yaml para flujos de trabajo de revisión de código"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des répertoires de projet spécifiques tels que @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks et @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows","Chargement et lecture obligatoires du contenu complet de workflow.xml","Dépend de la transmission correcte du chemin yaml à workflow.yaml pour les flux de travail de révision de code"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf bestimmte Projektverzeichnisse wie @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks und @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows","Pflicht zur Ladung und zum Lesen des gesamten Inhalts von workflow.xml","Abhängig von der korrekten Übermittlung des yaml-Pfads an workflow.yaml für Code-Review-Workflows"],"pt":["Exige acesso a diretórios de projeto específicos como @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks e @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows","Carregamento e leitura obrigatórios de todo o conteúdo do workflow.xml","Dependente da passagem correta do caminho yaml para workflow.yaml para fluxos de trabalho de revisão de código"],"ru":["Требует доступа к конкретным директориям проекта, таким как @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks и @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows","Обязательная загрузка и чтение всего содержимого workflow.xml","Зависит от правильной передачи пути yaml в workflow.yaml для рабочих процессов проверки кода"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى دلائل مشروع محددة مثل @{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks و @{project-root}/_bmad/bmm/workflows","تحميل و قراءة إجبارية لمحتوى workflow.xml الكامل","يعتمد على نقل صحيح لمسار الـ yaml إلى workflow.yaml لتدفقات عمل مراجعة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ANcpLua/qyl/mega-swarm', 'community', 'ANcpLua', 'qyl', 'ANcpLua/qyl', 'mega-swarm', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:49:43.088Z', NULL, '{"id":"ANcpLua/qyl/mega-swarm","name":"mega-swarm","description":{"es":"Mega-Swarm es una plataforma de observabilidad para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM que ofrece ingesta de OTLP y almacenamiento en DuckDB para un análisis más profundo","fr":"Mega-Swarm est une plateforme d''observabilité pour les charges de travail GenAI/LLM qui offre l''ingestion OTLP et le stockage DuckDB pour une analyse plus approfondie","de":"Mega-Swarm ist eine Observability-Plattform für GenAI/LLM-Workloads, die OTLP-Ingestion und DuckDB-Speicher für eine tiefere Analyse bietet","pt":"A plataforma Mega-Swarm é uma solução de observabilidade de IA para workloads de GenAI/LLM, com recursos como ingestão OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB.","ru":"Платформа Мега-Сwarm - это решение для наблюдения за ИИ для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM, с функциями như ввод данных OTLP и хранилище DuckDB.","ar":"منصة ميجا-سورم هي حل مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحميل العمل من GenAI/LLM، مع ميزات مثل استهلاك OTLP وتخزين DuckDB.","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Mega-Swarm: Plataforma de Observabilidad para GenAI/LLM","fr":"Mega-Swarm: Plateforme d''Observabilité pour GenAI/LLM","de":"Mega-Swarm: Observability-Plattform für GenAI/LLM","pt":"Mega-Swarm: Plataforma de Observabilidade de IA","ru":"Мега-Сwarm: Платформа для наблюдения за ИИ","ar":"ميجا-سورم: منصة مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"mega-swarm"},"description":{"es":"Mega-Swarm es una plataforma de observabilidad para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM que ofrece ingesta de OTLP y almacenamiento en DuckDB para un análisis más...","fr":"Mega-Swarm est une plateforme d''observabilité pour les charges de travail GenAI/LLM qui offre l''ingestion OTLP et le stockage DuckDB pour une analyse plus ap...","de":"Mega-Swarm ist eine Observability-Plattform für GenAI/LLM-Workloads, die OTLP-Ingestion und DuckDB-Speicher für eine tiefere Analyse bietet","pt":"A plataforma Mega-Swarm é uma solução de observabilidade de IA para workloads de GenAI/LLM, com recursos como ingestão OTLP e armazenamento DuckDB.","ru":"Платформа Мега-Сwarm - это решение для наблюдения за ИИ для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM, с функциями như ввод данных OTLP и хранилище DuckDB.","ar":"منصة ميجا-سورم هي حل مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحميل العمل من GenAI/LLM، مع ميزات مثل استهلاك OTLP وتخزين DuckDB.","en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"definition":{"en":" question your logs | AI Observability Platform for GenAI/LLM workloads. OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, semantic conventions for AI telemetry."},"features":{"es":["Ingesta de OTLP","Almacenamiento en DuckDB","Convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA","Análisis de logs","Optimización de cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM"],"fr":["Ingestion OTLP","Stockage DuckDB","Conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie de l''IA","Analyse de logs","Optimisation des charges de travail GenAI/LLM"],"de":["OTLP-Ingestion","DuckDB-Speicher","Semantische Konventionen für IA-Telemetrie","Log-Analyse","Optimierung von GenAI/LLM-Workloads"],"pt":["Ingestão OTLP","Armazenamento DuckDB","Convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA","Suporte a workloads de GenAI/LLM","Análise e monitoramento de desempenho","Integração com plugins de workflow"],"ru":["Ввод данных OTLP","Хранилище DuckDB","Семантические соглашения для телеметрии ИИ","Поддержка рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM","Анализ и мониторинг производительности","Интеграция с плагинами рабочего процесса"],"ar":["استهلاك OTLP","تخزين DuckDB","التقاليد الدلالية لمراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم تحميل العمل من GenAI/LLM","تحليل ومراقبة الأداء","التكامل مع إضافات سير العمل"]},"keywords":{"es":["GenAI","LLM","Observabilidad","OTLP","DuckDB","Telemetría de IA","Análisis de logs","Optimización de cargas de trabajo"],"fr":["GenAI","LLM","Observabilité","OTLP","DuckDB","Télémétrie de l''IA","Analyse de logs","Optimisation des charges de travail"],"de":["GenAI","LLM","Observability","OTLP","DuckDB","IA-Telemetrie","Log-Analyse","Optimierung von Workloads"],"pt":["Observabilidade de IA","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","Telemetria de IA","Análise de desempenho","Monitoramento de IA","Plataforma de observabilidade"],"ru":["Наблюдение за ИИ","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","Телеметрия ИИ","Анализ производительности","Мониторинг ИИ","Платформа для наблюдения"],"ar":["مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","GenAI","LLM","OTLP","DuckDB","مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل الأداء","مراقبة الذكاء الاصطناعي","منصة مراقبة"]}},"owner":"ANcpLua","repo":"qyl","repoPath":"ANcpLua/qyl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mega-swarm","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  allowed-tools: Task, TodoWrite\nplugin:\n  name: \"workflow-tools\"\n  version: \"2.0.0\"\n  description: \"Multi-agent workflow orchestration: /fix (unified fix pipeline), /red-blue-review (adversarial security), /tournament (competitive coding), /mega-swarm (parallel audit), /deep-think (extended reasoning), /batch-implement (parallel implementation).\"\n  author:\n    name: \"AncpLua\"\n```\n\n\n# MEGA SWARM AUDIT\n\n**Scope:** $1 (default: full - options: full|src|test","body":"## Source Metadata\n\n```yaml\nfrontmatter:\n  allowed-tools: Task, TodoWrite\nplugin:\n  name: \"workflow-tools\"\n  version: \"2.0.0\"\n  description: \"Multi-agent workflow orchestration: /fix (unified fix pipeline), /red-blue-review (adversarial security), /tournament (competitive coding), /mega-swarm (parallel audit), /deep-think (extended reasoning), /batch-implement (parallel implementation).\"\n  author:\n    name: \"AncpLua\"\n```\n\n\n# MEGA SWARM AUDIT\n\n**Scope:** $1 (default: full - options: full|src|tests|config|security)\n**Focus:** $2 (optional focus area or concern)\n**Mode:** $3 (default: full - options: full|quick|focused)\n**Quick:** $4 (default: false - if true, same as mode=quick)\n\n---\n\n## MODE CONFIGURATIONS\n\n| Mode | Agents | Best For |\n|------|--------|----------|\n| **full** | 12 | Complete codebase audit, release readiness |\n| **quick** | 6 | Fast health check, CI integration |\n| **focused** | 8 | Deep dive on specific concern area |\n\n### Agent Selection by Mode\n\n**Full Mode (12 agents):** All auditors\n**Quick Mode (6 agents):** Security, Performance, Tests, Code Quality, Bugs, Architecture\n**Focused Mode (8 agents):** Based on $2 focus area + related auditors\n\n---\n\n## EXECUTION INSTRUCTIONS\n\n**YOU MUST USE THE TASK TOOL TO LAUNCH PARALLEL AGENTS.**\n\nREQUIRED BEHAVIOR:\n- Full mode ($3 = full or unspecified): Launch 12 agents\n- Quick mode ($3 = quick OR $4 = true): Launch 6 agents\n- Focused mode ($3 = focused): Launch 8 agents relevant to focus area\n- Use the Task tool with subagent_type parameter\n- Launch ALL agents in ONE message\n- Each Task call must have: description, prompt, subagent_type\n- WAIT for agents to complete, then synthesize results\n\n**YOUR NEXT MESSAGE MUST CONTAIN Task TOOL CALLS for the selected mode.**\n\n---\n\n## GATE: Audit Completion\n\nAfter agents complete, validate results:\n\n```\nAUDIT GATE:\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Mode: [full/quick/focused]                                 │\n│ Agents Completed: [X/Y]                                    │\n│ Agents Failed: [count]                                     │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ If ≥80% completed: SYNTHESIZE results                      │\n│ If <80% completed: REPORT partial + offer retry            │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## QUICK MODE AGENTS (6 Essential Auditors)\n\nUse if $3 = quick OR $4 = true. Launch ALL 6 in ONE message:\n\n1. **Architecture Auditor** - SOLID, coupling, design\n2. **Security Auditor** - OWASP, injection, auth\n3. **Performance Auditor** - N+1, memory, blocking\n4. **Test Coverage Auditor** - Gaps, quality, flaky\n5. **Code Quality Auditor** - Dead code, duplication\n6. **Bug Hunter** - Null refs, race conditions\n\n---\n\n## THE SWARM - FULL MODE (12 Parallel Agents)\n\nLaunch ALL in ONE message. For each agent, use the Task tool with the specified subagent_type and adapt the prompt to include the user''s scope ($1) and focus ($2).\n\n### Agent 1: Architecture Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: metacognitive-guard:arch-reviewer\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Audit architecture\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Architecture & Design\n\n  1. Is the architecture sound?\n  2. Coupling/cohesion issues?\n  3. SOLID violations?\n  4. Scalability concerns?\n\n  Output: Architecture issues with severity (P0-P3)\n```\n\n### Agent 2: Security Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-reviewer\ndescription: \"Audit security\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Security\n\n  1. Injection vulnerabilities?\n  2. Auth/authz issues?\n  3. Secrets exposed?\n  4. Input validation?\n  5. OWASP Top 10?\n\n  Output: Security issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 3: Performance Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-explorer\ndescription: \"Audit performance\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Performance\n\n  1. N+1 queries?\n  2. Memory leaks?\n  3. Unnecessary allocations?\n  4. Blocking calls?\n  5. Cache misses?\n\n  Output: Performance issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 4: Test Coverage Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-reviewer\ndescription: \"Audit test coverage\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Test Quality\n\n  1. Coverage gaps?\n  2. Flaky tests?\n  3. Missing edge cases?\n  4. Test quality issues?\n  5. Integration test gaps?\n\n  Output: Test issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 5: Code Quality Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-reviewer\ndescription: \"Audit code quality\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Code Quality\n\n  1. Dead code?\n  2. Duplications?\n  3. Complex functions (cyclomatic)?\n  4. Magic numbers/strings?\n  5. Naming issues?\n\n  Output: Quality issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 6: Error Handling Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: deep-debugger\ndescription: \"Audit error handling\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Error Handling\n\n  1. Swallowed exceptions?\n  2. Missing error handling?\n  3. Poor error messages?\n  4. Unhandled edge cases?\n  5. Recovery mechanisms?\n\n  Output: Error handling issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 7: API Contract Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-explorer\ndescription: \"Audit API contracts\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: API Contracts\n\n  1. Breaking changes?\n  2. Version compatibility?\n  3. Documentation accuracy?\n  4. Response consistency?\n  5. Error response format?\n\n  Output: API issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 8: Dependency Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: Explore\ndescription: \"Audit dependencies\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Dependencies\n\n  1. Outdated packages?\n  2. Security vulnerabilities?\n  3. License issues?\n  4. Unnecessary dependencies?\n  5. Version conflicts?\n\n  Output: Dependency issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 9: Configuration Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: Explore\ndescription: \"Audit configuration\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Configuration\n\n  1. Hardcoded values?\n  2. Missing env vars?\n  3. Config validation?\n  4. Secrets management?\n  5. Environment parity?\n\n  Output: Config issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 10: Documentation Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: Explore\ndescription: \"Audit documentation\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Documentation\n\n  1. Outdated docs?\n  2. Missing docs?\n  3. Code comments?\n  4. README accuracy?\n  5. API documentation?\n\n  Output: Doc issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 11: Consistency Auditor\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: feature-dev:code-reviewer\ndescription: \"Audit consistency\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  AUDIT: Consistency\n\n  1. Naming conventions?\n  2. Code style violations?\n  3. Pattern inconsistencies?\n  4. File organization?\n  5. Import ordering?\n\n  Output: Consistency issues with severity\n```\n\n### Agent 12: Bug Hunter\n```yaml\nsubagent_type: deep-debugger\nmodel: opus\ndescription: \"Hunt for bugs\"\nprompt: |\n  SCOPE: [insert $1 here, default: full]\n  FOCUS: [insert $2 here if provided]\n\n  HUNT: Active Bugs\n\n  1. Null reference risks?\n  2. Race conditions?\n  3. Off-by-one errors?\n  4. Resource leaks?\n  5. Logic errors?\n\n  Output: Potential bugs with severity\n```\n\n---\n\n## SWARM SYNTHESIS\n\nAfter ALL 12 agents complete, synthesize results:\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                    MEGA SWARM REPORT                             ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║ Agents Deployed: 12          Time: [X min]                       ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║                     ISSUES BY SEVERITY                           ║\n║  P0 (Critical):  [count]                                         ║\n║  P1 (High):      [count]                                         ║\n║  P2 (Medium):    [count]                                         ║\n║  P3 (Low):       [count]                                         ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║                     ISSUES BY CATEGORY                           ║\n║  Security:       [count]  │  Performance:    [count]             ║\n║  Architecture:   [count]  │  Tests:          [count]             ║\n║  Code Quality:   [count]  │  Errors:         [count]             ║\n║  API:            [count]  │  Dependencies:   [count]             ║\n║  Config:         [count]  │  Docs:           [count]             ║\n║  Consistency:    [count]  │  Bugs:           [count]             ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n### P0 Issues (Fix Immediately)\n| # | Category | Issue | Location |\n|---|----------|-------|----------|\n| 1 | [cat] | [description] | [file:line] |\n\n### P1 Issues (Fix Soon)\n| # | Category | Issue | Location |\n|---|----------|-------|----------|\n| 1 | [cat] | [description] | [file:line] |\n\n### Recommended Fix Order\n1. [Most critical issue]\n2. [Second most critical]\n3. [Third most critical]\n\n**Next Command:**\n```\n/turbo-fix issue=\"[P0 issue description]\" severity=P0\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:49:43.088Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code requiring parallel audit capabilities for GenAI/LLM workloads","zh":"适用于高级AI代理，如Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code，需要并行审计功能以用于GenAI/LLM工作负载","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeなどの高度なAIエージェントに適しており、GenAI/LLMのワークロードに対する並列監査機能を必要とする","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, GenAI/LLM 워크로드를 위한 병렬 감사 기능을 필요로 함","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que requieren capacidades de auditoría paralela para cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA avancés comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant des capacités d''audit parallèle pour les charges de travail GenAI/LLM","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die parallele Auditfunktionen für GenAI/LLM-Workloads erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que requerem capacidades de auditoria paralela para cargas de trabalho de GenAI/LLM","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих параллельных возможностей аудита для рабочих нагрузок GenAI/LLM","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدمين مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يتطلبون قدرات تدقيق متوازية لتحملات عمل GenAI/LLM"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform mega-swarm audits with OTLP ingestion, DuckDB storage, and semantic conventions for AI telemetry, enabling advanced observability and analysis of AI workloads through unified fix pipelines and adversarial security reviews","zh":"赋予代理执行大规模群集审计的能力，具有OTLP摄取、DuckDB存储和AI遥测的语义约定，通过统一的修复管道和对抗性安全审查，实现对AI工作负载的高级可观察性和分析","ja":"OTLPの取り込み、DuckDBのストレージ、AIテレメトリのセマンティック規約を備えたメガスウォーム監査を実行するエージェントを可能にし、統一された修復パイプラインと対抗的セキュリティレビューを通じて、AIワークロードの高度な可観測性と分析を可能にする","ko":"에이전트가 메가 스와ーム 감사를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, OTLP 수집, DuckDB 저장소 및 AI 텔레메트리에 대한 시맨틱 규칙을 통해 고급 관찰 가능성 및 분석이 가능하며, 통일된 수정 파이프라인 및 적대적 보안 검토를 통해 AI 워크로드를 분석할 수 있음","es":"Habilita a los agentes para realizar auditorías de megaenjambre con ingesta OTLP, almacenamiento DuckDB y convenciones semánticas para telemetría de IA, lo que permite una observabilidad y análisis avanzados de las cargas de trabajo de IA a través de tuberías de solución unificadas y revisiones de seguridad adversarias","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de mega-essaim avec ingestion OTLP, stockage DuckDB et conventions sémantiques pour la télémétrie d''IA, permettant ainsi une observabilité et une analyse avancées des charges de travail d''IA via des pipelines de correction unifiés et des examens de sécurité adverses","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Mega-Schwarm-Audits mit OTLP-Eingabe, DuckDB-Speicherung und semantischen Konventionen für KI-Telemetrie durchzuführen, wodurch eine erweiterte Beobachtbarkeit und Analyse von KI-Workloads über einheitliche Reparaturpipelines und feindliche Sicherheitsprüfungen ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de mega-enxame com ingestão de OTLP, armazenamento de DuckDB e convenções semânticas para telemetria de IA, permitindo observabilidade e análise avançadas de cargas de trabalho de IA por meio de pipelines de reparo unificados e revisões de segurança adversárias","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять аудиты mega-роя с помощью ингестии OTLP, хранилища DuckDB и семантических соглашений для телеметрии ИИ, обеспечивая продвинутую наблюдаемость и анализ рабочих нагрузок ИИ посредством унифицированных конвейеров исправления и обзоров безопасности противника","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من أداء تدقيقات السرب الكبير مع استهلاك OTLP و تخزين DuckDB و الاتفاقيات المعمارية لمراقبة أداء الذكاء الاصطناعي، و تمكين رصد متقدم و تحليل لتحملات عمل الذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال خطوط أنابيب إصلاح موحدة و مراجعات أمنية معادية"},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing large-scale GenAI models","Performing parallel security reviews","Analyzing AI workload telemetry data with DuckDB"],"zh":["大规模GenAI模型的审计","并行安全审查的执行","使用DuckDB分析AI工作负载的遥测数据"],"ja":["大規模なGenAIモデルを監査する","並列セキュリティレビューを実行する","DuckDBを使用してAIワークロードのテレメトリデータを分析する"],"ko":["대규모 GenAI 모델을 감사함","병렬 보안 검토를 수행함","DuckDB를 사용하여 AI 워크로드의 텔레메트리 데이터를 분석함"],"es":["Auditoría de modelos GenAI a gran escala","Realización de revisiones de seguridad paralelas","Análisis de datos de telemetría de cargas de trabajo de IA con DuckDB"],"fr":["Audit de modèles GenAI à grande échelle","Réalisations d''examen de sécurité parallèle","Analyse des données de télémétrie des charges de travail d''IA avec DuckDB"],"de":["Auditing von GenAI-Modellen im großen Maßstab","Durchführung paralleler Sicherheitsprüfungen","Analyse von KI-Workload-Telemetriedaten mit DuckDB"],"pt":["Auditoria de modelos de GenAI em larga escala","Realização de revisões de segurança paralelas","Análise de dados de telemetria de carga de trabalho de IA com DuckDB"],"ru":["Аудит крупномасштабных моделей GenAI","Проведение параллельных обзоров безопасности","Анализ данных телеметрии рабочей нагрузки ИИ с помощью DuckDB"],"ar":["تدقيق نماذج GenAI على نطاق واسع","إجراء مراجعات أمنية متوازية","تحليل بيانات مراقبة أداء تحملات عمل الذكاء الاصطناعي مع DuckDB"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OTLP ingestion capabilities","DuckDB storage dependency","Limited to GenAI/LLM workloads"],"zh":["需要OTLP摄取功能","依赖DuckDB存储","仅限于GenAI/LLM工作负载"],"ja":["OTLPの取り込み機能が必要","DuckDBのストレージに依存する","GenAI/LLMのワークロードのみに限定される"],"ko":["OTLP 수집 기능이 필요함","DuckDB 저장소에 의존함","GenAI/LLM 워크로드에만限定됨"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de ingesta OTLP","Dependencia del almacenamiento DuckDB","Limitado a cargas de trabajo de GenAI/LLM"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités d''ingestion OTLP","Dépendance du stockage DuckDB","Limité aux charges de travail GenAI/LLM"],"de":["Erfordert OTLP-Eingabefunktionen","DuckDB-Speicherabhängigkeit","Begrenzt auf GenAI/LLM-Workloads"],"pt":["Requer capacidades de ingestão de OTLP","Dependência de armazenamento de DuckDB","Limitado a cargas de trabalho de GenAI/LLM"],"ru":["Требует возможностей ингестии OTLP","Зависимость от хранилища DuckDB","Ограничен рабочими нагрузками GenAI/LLM"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات استهلاك OTLP","اعتماد على تخزين DuckDB","محدود بتحملات عمل GenAI/LLM"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ryokun6/ryos/localize', 'community', 'ryokun6', 'ryos', 'ryokun6/ryos', 'localize', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:49:35.484Z', NULL, '{"id":"ryokun6/ryos/localize","name":"localize","description":{"zh":"应用程序本地化是开发全球化应用的关键步骤，涉及多语言支持和文化适应","ja":"アプリケーションのローカライズはグローバル化されたアプリを開発する上で重要なステップであり、複数言語のサポートと文化への適応を含む","ko":"애플리케이션 로컬라이제이션은 글로벌 애플리케이션 개발의 중요한 단계로, 다국어 지원과 문화적 적응이 포함","es":"Localiza tu aplicación siguiendo nuestros pasos para extraer cadenas codificadas y reemplazarlas con llamadas a la función de traducción","fr":"Localisez votre application en suivant nos étapes pour extraire les chaînes codées et les remplacer par des appels à la fonction de traduction","de":"Lokalisieren Sie Ihre Anwendung, indem Sie unsere Schritte befolgen, um codierte Zeichenfolgen zu extrahieren und durch Aufrufe der Übersetzungsfunktion zu ersetzen","pt":"Localizar aplicativos com ryOS é um processo que envolve a extração de strings hardcoded, substituição por chamadas t() e adição de traduções.","ru":"Локализация приложений с ryOS включает в себя извлечение жестко закодированных строк, замену их на вызовы t() и добавление переводов.","ar":"تطوير تطبيقات محلية مع ryOS هو عملية تشمل استخراج السلاسل المرتبطة، واستبدالها بدعوات t() وإضافة الترجمات.","en":"ryOS, made with Cursor"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"应用程序本地化技巧","ja":"ローカライズアプリケーション開発","ko":"로컬라이제이션 애플리케이션 개발","es":"Localiza tu aplicación con facilidad","fr":"Localisez votre application avec facilité","de":"Lokalisieren Sie Ihre Anwendung einfach","pt":"Localizar Aplicativos com ryOS","ru":"Локализация приложений с ryOS","ar":"تطوير تطبيقات محلية مع ryOS","en":"localize"},"description":{"zh":"应用程序本地化是开发全球化应用的关键步骤，涉及多语言支持和文化适应","ja":"アプリケーションのローカライズはグローバル化されたアプリを開発する上で重要なステップであり、複数言語のサポートと文化への適応を含む","ko":"애플리케이션 로컬라이제이션은 글로벌 애플리케이션 개발의 중요한 단계로, 다국어 지원과 문화적