다","es":"La herramienta de ayuda de PR de código base genera nombres de ramas y descripciones para solicitudes de extracción de código de base","fr":"L''outil d''aide de PR de code de base génère des noms de branches et des descriptions pour les demandes d''extraction de code de base","de":"Das Core-PR-Hilfs-Tool generiert Branch-Namen und -Beschreibungen für Pull-Requests von Core-Code","pt":"O Core PR Helper é uma ferramenta que ajuda a criar PRs com nomes de branch e descrições personalizadas com base nas alterações do conversação","ru":"Core PR Helper - это инструмент, который помогает создавать PR с настраиваемыми именами веток и описаниями на основе изменений в разговоре","ar":"مساعد تعبئة الطلبات الأساسية هو أداة تساعد على إنشاء طلبات Pull مع أسماء الفروع والوصف المخصص بناءً على التغييرات في المحادثة","en":"Calimero"},"definition":{"en":"Calimero"},"features":{"zh":["自动化分支名称生成","自动化 PR 描述生成","支持多种类型的提交","支持自定义的提交格式","提高开发效率"],"ja":["ブランチ名の自動生成","PR 説明の自動生成","複数のコミットタイプをサポート","カスタムコミット形式をサポート","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["브랜치 이름 자동 생성","PR 설명 자동 생성","여러 유형의 커밋 지원","사용자 정의 커밋 형식 지원","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Genera nombres de ramas personalizadas","Crea descripciones de PR en formato estándar","Infiere cambios a partir de la conversación","Proporciona un patrón de nombre de rama consistente","Soporta varios tipos de commits"],"fr":["Génère des noms de branches personnalisés","Crée des descriptions de PR au format standard","Deduit les modifications à partir de la conversation","Fournit un modèle de nom de branche cohérent","Prend en charge plusieurs types de commits"],"de":["Generiert benutzerdefinierte Branch-Namen","Erstellt PR-Beschreibungen im Standardformat","Leitet Änderungen aus der Konversation ab","Bietet ein konsistentes Branch-Namensmuster","Unterstützt mehrere Commit-Typen"],"pt":["Gera nomes de branch personalizados","Cria descrições de PR personalizadas","Baseia-se nas alterações do conversação","segue o padrão {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}","Suporta tipos de commit como feat, fix, docs"],"ru":["Генерирует настраиваемые имена веток","Создает настраиваемые описания PR","Базируется на изменениях в разговоре","Следует шаблону {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}","Поддерживает типы коммитов как feat, fix, docs"],"ar":["ينشئ أسماء الفروع المخصصة","يخلق وصفاً مخصصاً لطلبات Pull","يعتمد على التغييرات في المحادثة","يتبع نمط {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}","يدعم أنواع الإلتزام مثل feat, fix, docs"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Core PR 助手工具","自动化分支名称","自动化 PR 描述","开发效率","代码提交","Git 工作流"],"ja":["Core PR ヘルパーツール","ブランチ名の自動生成","PR 説明の自動生成","開発効率","コードのコミット","Git ワークフロー"],"ko":["Core PR 헬퍼 도구","브랜치 이름 자동 생성","PR 설명 자동 생성","개발 효율성","코드 커밋","Git 작업 흐름"],"es":["herramienta de ayuda de PR","nombres de ramas personalizadas","descripciones de PR","código de base","automatización de PR","generación de nombres de ramas","formato de descripción de PR","tipo de commit"],"fr":["outil d''aide de PR","noms de branches personnalisés","descriptions de PR","code de base","automatisation de PR","génération de noms de branches","format de description de PR","type de commit"],"de":["Core-PR-Hilfs-Tool","benutzerdefinierte Branch-Namen","PR-Beschreibungen","Core-Code","Automatisierung von Pull-Requests","Generierung von Branch-Namen","Format von PR-Beschreibungen","Commit-Typ"],"pt":["Core PR Helper","PRs personalizadas","nomes de branch","descrições de PR","ferramenta de auxílio para PRs","criação de PRs","alterações do conversação"],"ru":["Core PR Helper","настраиваемые PR","имена веток","описания PR","инструмент для создания PR","создание PR","изменения в разговоре"],"ar":["مساعد تعبئة الطلبات الأساسية","طلبات Pull المخصصة","أسماء الفروع","وصف طلبات Pull","أداة لإنشاء طلبات Pull","إنشاء طلبات Pull","التغييرات في المحادثة"]}},"owner":"calimero-network","repo":"core","repoPath":"calimero-network/core","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"core-pr-helper","description":"Suggests one appropriate branch name and a PR description in the project template (title, Description, Test plan, Documentation update) for Calimero core. Use when creating a PR for core, or when the user asks for a branch name and PR description.","bodyPreview":"# Core PR Helper\n\nWhen the user asks for a branch name and PR description for core:\n\n1. Infer the change from the conversation (recent edits, stated scope, or ask briefly if unclear).\n2. Output **one** branch name, then the PR body in the exact format below.\n\n## Branch name\n\n- **One** name only. Use lowercase, hyphens; no slashes.\n- Pattern: `{type}-{scope}-{short-summary}` (e.g. `feat-meroctl-install-flow`, `fix-runtime-wasm-imports`).\n- Types (match repo commit types): `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `","body":"# Core PR Helper\n\nWhen the user asks for a branch name and PR description for core:\n\n1. Infer the change from the conversation (recent edits, stated scope, or ask briefly if unclear).\n2. Output **one** branch name, then the PR body in the exact format below.\n\n## Branch name\n\n- **One** name only. Use lowercase, hyphens; no slashes.\n- Pattern: `{type}-{scope}-{short-summary}` (e.g. `feat-meroctl-install-flow`, `fix-runtime-wasm-imports`).\n- Types (match repo commit types): `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `refactor`, `test`, `chore`, `perf`, `build`, `ci`, `style`, `revert`.\n- Scope: crate or area (e.g. `meroctl`, `runtime`, `sdk`, `server`, `network`, `storage`). Omit scope if change is cross-cutting.\n\n## PR description format\n\nUse this structure exactly (matches `.github/pull_request_template.md`). Fill each section from the inferred change; keep placeholders only where the user must fill in (e.g. issue number, links).\n\n```markdown\n# [product] short description\n\nReplace `[product]` with the crate or area (e.g. `[meroctl]`, `[runtime]`, `[sdk]`). Use imperative mood for the description (e.g. \"Add install flow\" or \"Fix WASM import resolution\").\n\n## Description\n\nBrief description of the change and which issue is fixed (if any). Include relevant motivation and context. List any dependencies that are required for this change.\n\n## Test plan\n\nWhat was run to verify (e.g. `cargo test -p crate-name`, manual steps). Is it possible to add a test case to the e2e tests? For UI changes, mention screenshots or videos if applicable.\n\n## Documentation update\n\nWhich public or internal docs (if any) need updates. If none, state \"None\" or \"N/A\". Note: documentation **has to be updated** no later than **one day** after merge.\n```\n\n## Output\n\n1. **Branch:** `single-branch-name`\n2. **PR description:** (the filled template as above)\n\nDo not offer multiple branch names; choose the single most appropriate one.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:50:23.128Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing standardized branch naming and PR description generation for core repositories.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化分支命名和PR描述生成的核心仓库的开发代理。","ja":"標準化されたブランチ名とPRの説明の生成が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 분기 이름 및 PR 설명 생성이 필요한 코어 저장소의 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan un nombre de rama estandarizado y generación de descripciones de PR para repositorios centrales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''un nom de branche standardisé et d''une génération de descriptions de PR pour les référentiels centraux.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die standardisierte Branch-Namensgebung und PR-Beschreibungsgenerierung für Kern-Repositorys benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de nomenclatura de branch padronizada e geração de descrição de PR para repositórios principais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима стандартизированная номенклатура веток и генерация описания PR для основных репозиториев.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تسمية فرع معيارية وإنشاء وصف PR لمستودعات رئيسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to infer changes from conversations and generate consistent branch names and PR bodies in a specific format, utilizing lowercase, hyphens, and patterns like {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}, while matching repository commit types such as feat, fix, and docs.","zh":"赋予代理人根据对话推断更改并生成一致的分支名称和PR正文的能力，使用特定的格式，例如小写字母、连字符和{类型}-{范围}-{简要摘要}等模式，同时匹配存储库提交类型，例如feat、fix和docs。","ja":"エージェントに会話から変更を推測し、特定の形式で一貫したブランチ名とPR本文を生成する能力を与えます。小文字、ハイフン、{タイプ}-{スコープ}-{簡単なサマリー}などのパターンを使用し、feat、fix、docsなどのリポジトリコミットタイプに一致します。","ko":"에이전트가 대화에서 변경을 추론하고 일관된 분기 이름 및 PR 본문을 특정 형식으로 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 소문자, 하이픈, {유형}-{범위}-{간단한 요약}과 같은 패턴을 사용하며 feat, fix, docs와 같은 리포지토리 커밋 유형과 일치합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a inferir cambios a partir de conversaciones y generar nombres de rama y cuerpos de PR consistentes en un formato específico, utilizando minúsculas, guiones y patrones como {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}, mientras coincide con los tipos de confirmación de repositorio como feat, fix y docs.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déduire les modifications à partir des conversations et de générer des noms de branche et des corps de PR cohérents dans un format spécifique, en utilisant des minuscules, des traits d''union et des modèles tels que {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}, tout en correspondant aux types de validation de référentiel tels que feat, fix et docs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Änderungen aus Konversationen abzuleiten und konsistente Branch-Namen und PR-Texte in einem bestimmten Format zu generieren, unter Verwendung von Kleinbuchstaben, Bindestrichen und Mustern wie {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}, während es mit Repository-Commit-Typen wie feat, fix und docs übereinstimmt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a inferir alterações a partir de conversas e gerar nomes de branch e corpos de PR consistentes em um formato específico, utilizando letras minúsculas, hífen e padrões como {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}, enquanto corresponde a tipos de commit de repositório como feat, fix e docs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выводить изменения из разговоров и генерировать последовательные имена веток и тела PR в определенном формате, используя строчные буквы, дефисы и шаблоны типа {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}, при этом соответствуя типам коммитов репозитория, таким как feat, fix и docs.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من استنتاج التغييرات من المحادثات وتوليد أسماء فرع وجسم طلبات السحب بتركيب معين، باستخدام الحروف الصغيرة والشرطات وأنماط مثل {type}-{scope}-{short-summary}، مع مطابقة أنواع الإدخال في المستودع مثل feat و fix و docs."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating branch name suggestions based on recent edits or stated scope","Generating PR descriptions in a standardized format for core repositories","Inferring change types from conversation history to determine appropriate PR labels"],"zh":["根据最近的编辑或声明的范围自动建议分支名称","为核心仓库生成标准化格式的PR描述","根据会话历史推断更改类型以确定适当的PR标签"],"ja":["最近の編集や宣言されたスコープに基づいてブランチ名を自動的に提案する","コアリポジトリの標準化された形式のPR説明を生成する","会話の履歴に基づいて変更の種類を推測して適切なPRラベルを決定する"],"ko":["최근 편집 또는 선언된 범위에 따라 분기 이름을 자동으로 제안하는 것","코어 저장소에 대한 표준화된 형식의 PR 설명을 생성하는 것","대화 기록에 따라 변경 유형을 추론하여 적절한 PR 레이블을 결정하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de sugerencias de nombres de rama en función de ediciones recientes o ámbito declarado","Generación de descripciones de PR en un formato estandarizado para repositorios centrales","Inferencia de tipos de cambios a partir del historial de conversaciones para determinar las etiquetas de PR adecuadas"],"fr":["Automatisation des suggestions de noms de branche en fonction des éditions récentes ou de la portée déclarée","Génération de descriptions de PR dans un format standardisé pour les référentiels centraux","Dédution des types de modifications à partir de l''historique des conversations pour déterminer les libellés de PR appropriés"],"de":["Automatisierung von Branch-Namensvorschlägen auf der Grundlage von kürzlichen Bearbeitungen oder deklariertem Umfang","Generierung von PR-Beschreibungen in einem standardisierten Format für Kern-Repositorys","Ableitung von Änderungstypen aus der Konversationshistorie, um geeignete PR-Labels zu bestimmen"],"pt":["Automatizar sugestões de nomes de branch com base em edições recentes ou escopo declarado","Gerar descrições de PR em formato padronizado para repositórios principais","Inferir tipos de alterações a partir do histórico de conversas para determinar rótulos de PR apropriados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать предложения имен веток на основе недавних правок или заявленного объема","Генерировать описания PR в стандартизированном формате для основных репозиториев","Выводить типы изменений из истории разговоров для определения подходящих меток PR"],"ar":["توفير اقتراحات أسماء فرع آليّة استناداً إلى التحريرات الأخيرة أو النطاق المُعلن","إنشاء نصوص طلبات السحب بتركيب معياري لمستودعات رئيسية","استنتاج أنواع التغييرات من سجل المحادثات لتحديد تعليمات طلبات السحب المناسبة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires conversation history or recent edits to infer change","Limited to generating a single branch name and PR body per request","Must adhere to a specific naming pattern and format"],"zh":["需要会话历史或最近的编辑来推断更改","每次请求仅限生成一个分支名称和PR正文","必须遵循特定的命名模式和格式"],"ja":["変更を推測するために会話履歴または最近の編集が必要","1回のリクエストで1つのブランチ名とPR本文のみを生成できる","特定の命名パターンと形式に従う必要がある"],"ko":["변경을 추론하기 위해 대화 기록 또는 최근 편집이 필요함","한 번의 요청으로 하나의 분기 이름 및 PR 본문만 생성할 수 있음","특정 명명 패턴 및 형식에 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere un historial de conversaciones o ediciones recientes para inferir el cambio","Limitado a la generación de un solo nombre de rama y cuerpo de PR por solicitud","Debe adherirse a un patrón de nomenclatura y formato específico"],"fr":["Nécessite un historique de conversations ou des éditions récentes pour déduire le changement","Limité à la génération d''un seul nom de branche et corps de PR par demande","Doit se conformer à un modèle de nommage et un format spécifique"],"de":["Benötigt einen Konversationsverlauf oder kürzliche Bearbeitungen, um Änderungen abzuleiten","Begrenzt auf die Generierung eines einzigen Branch-Namens und PR-Textes pro Anfrage","Muss einem bestimmten Namensmuster und Format entsprechen"],"pt":["Exige histórico de conversas ou edições recentes para inferir alteração","Limitado a gerar um único nome de branch e corpo de PR por solicitação","Deve aderir a um padrão de nomenclatura específico e formato"],"ru":["Требует истории разговоров или недавних правок для вывода изменений","Ограничен генерацией единственного имени ветки и тела PR на запрос","Должен соответствовать определенному шаблону наименования и формату"],"ar":["يتطلب سجلاً للمحادثات أو تحريراً حديثاً لاستنتاج التغيير","محدود بإنشاء اسم فرع واحد وجسم طلب سحب واحد لكل طلب","يجب الالتزام بنمط تسمية معين وتركيب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('OpenZeppelin/ui-builder/commit', 'community', 'OpenZeppelin', 'ui-builder', 'OpenZeppelin/ui-builder', 'commit', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:50:19.823Z', NULL, '{"id":"OpenZeppelin/ui-builder/commit","name":"commit","description":{"zh":"Commit 技能提供了 UI Builder 项目的标准化提交指南，确保代码质量和安全","ja":"Commit スキルは、UI Builder プロジェクトの標準化コミットを提供し、コード品質とセキュリティを確保する","ko":"Commit 스킬은 UI Builder 프로젝트의 표준화 커밋을 제공하여 코드 품질과 보안을 확보합니다","es":"La habilidad Commit para UI Builder guía la creación de compromisos siguiendo el estándar de Commits Convencionales del proyecto","fr":"La compétence Commit pour UI Builder guide la création d''engagements en suivant la norme de Commits Conventionnels du projet","de":"Die Commit-Fähigkeit für UI Builder leitet die Erstellung von Commits unter Einhaltung des Conventional Commits-Standards des Projekts","pt":"O Commit Skill para UI Builder é uma ferramenta que ajuda a seguir o padrão de Commits para melhorar a colaboração e a qualidade do código","ru":"Навык Commit для UI Builder является инструментом, который помогает следовать стандарту коммитов для улучшения сотрудничества и качества кода","ar":"مهارة Commit ل UI Builder هي أداة تساعد على اتباع معيار Commits لتحسين التعاون وجودة الكود","en":"UI Builder is an open-source blockchain development tool that helps developers and non-developers create user-friendly interfaces for smart contract interaction by providing a chain-agnostic form builder that generates standalone \"mini apps\" without requiring backend infrastructure."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Commit 技能：UI Builder 项目的标准化提交","ja":"Commit スキル：UI Builder プロジェクトの標準化コミット","ko":"Commit 스킬: UI Builder 프로젝트의 표준화 커밋","es":"Commit Skill para UI Builder","fr":"Compétence Commit pour UI Builder","de":"Commit-Fähigkeit für UI Builder","pt":"Commit Skill para UI Builder: Padrão de Commits","ru":"Навык Commit для UI Builder: Стандарт Коммитов","ar":"مهارة Commit ل UI Builder: معيار Commits","en":"commit"},"description":{"zh":"Commit 技能提供了 UI Builder 项目的标准化提交指南，确保代码质量和安全","ja":"Commit スキルは、UI Builder プロジェクトの標準化コミットを提供し、コード品質とセキュリティを確保する","ko":"Commit 스킬은 UI Builder 프로젝트의 표준화 커밋을 제공하여 코드 품질과 보안을 확보합니다","es":"La habilidad Commit para UI Builder guía la creación de compromisos siguiendo el estándar de Commits Convencionales del proyecto","fr":"La compétence Commit pour UI Builder guide la création d''engagements en suivant la norme de Commits Conventionnels du projet","de":"Die Commit-Fähigkeit für UI Builder leitet die Erstellung von Commits unter Einhaltung des Conventional Commits-Standards des Projekts","pt":"O Commit Skill para UI Builder é uma ferramenta que ajuda a seguir o padrão de Commits para melhorar a colaboração e a qualidade do código","ru":"Навык Commit для UI Builder является инструментом, который помогает следовать стандарту коммитов для улучшения сотрудничества и качества кода","ar":"مهارة Commit ل UI Builder هي أداة تساعد على اتباع معيار Commits لتحسين التعاون وجودة الكود","en":"UI Builder is an open-source blockchain development tool that helps developers and non-developers create user-friendly interfaces for smart contract interact..."},"definition":{"en":"UI Builder is an open-source blockchain development tool that helps developers and non-developers create user-friendly interfaces for smart contract interaction by providing a chain-agnostic form builder that generates standalone \"mini apps\" without requiring backend infrastructure."},"features":{"zh":["标准化提交格式","GPG 签名支持","预提交钩子支持","Commit 消息体规范","作用域和主题支持"],"ja":["標準化コミット形式","GPG 署名対応","事前コミットフック対応","コミットメッセージ体規約","スコープとサブジェクト対応"],"ko":["표준화 커밋 형식","GPG 서명 지원","사전 커밋 후크 지원","커밋 메시지 본문 규약","범위와 주제 지원"],"es":["Seguimiento del estándar de Commits Convencionales","Firma GPG obligatoria para todos los compromisos","Ejecución de hooks de pre-compromiso","Formato de compromiso personalizable","Compatibilidad con infraestructura de backend opcional"],"fr":["Suivi de la norme de Commits Conventionnels","Signature GPG obligatoire pour tous les engagements","Exécution de hooks de pré-engagement","Format d''engagement personnalisable","Compatibilité avec l''infrastructure de backend optionnelle"],"de":["Einhaltung des Conventional Commits-Standards","Verpflichtende GPG-Signatur für alle Commits","Ausführung von Pre-Commit-Hooks","Anpassbares Commit-Format","Kompatibilität mit optionaler Backend-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Seguir o padrão de Commits","GPG signing obrigatório","Pre-commit hooks obrigatórios","Formato de commit personalizável","Compatibilidade com UI Builder"],"ru":["Следование стандарту коммитов","Обязательная подпись GPG","Обязательные хуки предкоммита","Настраиваемый формат коммита","Совместимость с UI Builder"],"ar":["اتباع معيار Commits","التوقيع GPG إلزامي","_hooks الـ pre-commit إلزامية","تنسيق Commit قابل للتعديل","التوافق مع UI Builder"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Commit 技能","UI Builder","标准化提交","GPG 签名","预提交钩子","代码质量","代码安全"],"ja":["Commit スキル","UI Builder","標準化コミット","GPG 署名","事前コミットフック","コード品質","コードセキュリティ"],"ko":["Commit 스킬","UI Builder","표준화 커밋","GPG 서명","사전 커밋 후크","코드 품질","코드 보안"],"es":["Commit Skill","UI Builder","Commits Convencionales","desarrollo de blockchain","interfaces de usuario","contratos inteligentes","GPG","pre-commit hooks"],"fr":["Compétence Commit","UI Builder","Commits Conventionnels","développement de blockchain","interfaces utilisateur","contrats intelligents","GPG","hooks de pré-engagement"],"de":["Commit-Fähigkeit","UI Builder","Conventional Commits","Blockchain-Entwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Smart Contracts","GPG","Pre-Commit-Hooks"],"pt":["Commit Skill","UI Builder","padrão de Commits","GPG signing","pre-commit hooks","desenvolvimento de software","colaboração","qualidade do código"],"ru":["Навык Commit","UI Builder","стандарт коммитов","подпись GPG","хуки предкоммита","разработка программного обеспечения","сотрудничество","качество кода"],"ar":["مهارة Commit","UI Builder","معيار Commits","التوقيع GPG","hooks الـ pre-commit","تطوير البرمجيات","التعاون","جودة الكود"]}},"owner":"OpenZeppelin","repo":"ui-builder","repoPath":"OpenZeppelin/ui-builder","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"Creates commits following the monorepos Conventional Commits standard with proper GPG signing, scope selection, and pre-commit validation. Reminds about changesets for package changes. Use when creating commits, writing commit messages, or when the user asks to commit changes.","bodyPreview":"# Commit Skill for UI Builder Monorepo\n\nThis skill guides committing changes following the project''s Conventional Commits standard.\n\n## Critical Requirements\n\n1. **Always run commits outside sandbox** - Full shell permissions required for GPG signing and pre-commit hooks\n2. **Never use `--no-gpg-sign`** - All commits must be GPG-signed\n3. **Never use `--no-verify`** - Pre-commit hooks must run\n\n## Commit Format\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n### Rules","body":"# Commit Skill for UI Builder Monorepo\n\nThis skill guides committing changes following the project''s Conventional Commits standard.\n\n## Critical Requirements\n\n1. **Always run commits outside sandbox** - Full shell permissions required for GPG signing and pre-commit hooks\n2. **Never use `--no-gpg-sign`** - All commits must be GPG-signed\n3. **Never use `--no-verify`** - Pre-commit hooks must run\n\n## Commit Format\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n### Rules\n\n| Rule               | Requirement                                                          |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Header max length  | 100 characters                                                       |\n| Subject case       | lowercase (never sentence-case, start-case, pascal-case, upper-case) |\n| Subject ending     | No period                                                            |\n| Scope              | **Required** (scope-empty is enforced)                               |\n| Body line length   | Max 100 characters                                                   |\n| Body leading blank | Required if body present                                             |\n\n## Commit Types\n\n| Type       | Description                                             |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `feat`     | New feature                                             |\n| `fix`      | Bug fix                                                 |\n| `docs`     | Documentation only                                      |\n| `style`    | Formatting, whitespace (no code change)                 |\n| `refactor` | Code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature |\n| `perf`     | Performance improvement                                 |\n| `test`     | Adding or correcting tests                              |\n| `build`    | Build system or external dependencies                   |\n| `ci`       | CI configuration changes                                |\n| `chore`    | Other changes (not src or test)                         |\n| `revert`   | Reverts a previous commit                               |\n| `wip`      | Work in progress (avoid if possible)                    |\n\n## Allowed Scopes\n\nThe commitlint config enforces these scopes:\n\n| Scope              | Description                      |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------- |\n| `ui`               | UI components and styling        |\n| `api`              | API-related code                 |\n| `auth`             | Authentication and authorization |\n| `builder`          | Builder app functionality        |\n| `export`           | Export functionality             |\n| `deps`             | Dependencies                     |\n| `config`           | Configuration files              |\n| `ci`               | CI/CD configuration              |\n| `utils`            | Utility functions                |\n| `docs`             | Documentation                    |\n| `tests`            | Test-related changes             |\n| `release`          | Release automation               |\n| `adapter`          | Generic adapter changes          |\n| `adapter-evm`      | EVM adapter                      |\n| `adapter-evm-core` | EVM core package                 |\n| `adapter-polkadot` | Polkadot adapter                 |\n| `adapter-solana`   | Solana adapter                   |\n| `adapter-stellar`  | Stellar adapter                  |\n| `adapter-midnight` | Midnight adapter                 |\n| `common`           | Common/shared code               |\n\n### Extended Scopes (Update commitlint if needed)\n\nThese scopes are commonly used but may need to be added to `commitlint.config.js`:\n\n- `spec` / `specs` - Specification documents\n- `adapters` - Multiple adapters\n- `changeset` - Changeset files\n- `core` - Core functionality\n- `form` - Form-related code\n\n## Commit Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Stage changes\ngit add <files>\n\n# 2. Commit with HEREDOC (recommended for multi-line messages)\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\nfeat(builder): add new contract template selector\n\nImplements a dropdown component for selecting contract templates\nwith search functionality and categorization support.\nEOF\n)\"\n\n# Or use interactive Commitizen\npnpm commit\n```\n\n## Changeset Reminder\n\n**Before committing changes to `packages/` directory, check if a changeset is needed.**\n\nA changeset is required when:\n\n- Adding features to published packages\n- Fixing bugs in published packages\n- Making breaking changes\n\nCheck for existing changesets:\n\n```bash\nls .changeset/*.md\n```\n\nIf no changeset exists for your changes, create one:\n\n```bash\npnpm changeset\n```\n\nLinked adapter packages (versioned together):\n\n- `@openzeppelin/ui-builder-adapter-evm`\n- `@openzeppelin/ui-builder-adapter-evm-core` (bundled, not published separately)\n- `@openzeppelin/ui-builder-adapter-polkadot`\n- `@openzeppelin/ui-builder-adapter-solana`\n- `@openzeppelin/ui-builder-adapter-stellar`\n- `@openzeppelin/ui-builder-adapter-midnight`\n\n## Pre-commit Hooks\n\nThe following checks run automatically:\n\n1. **File permission check**: Ensures correct file modes\n2. **Formatting**: Runs Prettier via `pnpm fix-all`\n3. **Linting**: Runs ESLint\n4. **Re-staging**: Auto-stages formatting fixes\n\nIf pre-commit fails, fix the issues and commit again.\n\n## Pre-push Hooks\n\nBefore pushing, these checks run:\n\n1. **Linting**: Full lint pass\n2. **Adapter compliance**: `pnpm lint:adapters`\n3. **Export versions sync**: Updates `apps/builder/src/export/versions.ts` if needed\n\nIf versions.ts is updated, you must amend your commit:\n\n```bash\ngit add apps/builder/src/export/versions.ts\ngit commit --amend --no-edit\n```\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nIndicate breaking changes with `!` after type/scope:\n\n```bash\nfeat(api)!: change response format to JSON\n```\n\nOr with a footer:\n\n```\nfeat(api): change response format\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Response format changed from XML to JSON.\nAll clients must update their parsers.\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### Sandbox Mode Errors\n\n**Symptom**: Commit fails with permission errors, GPG signing fails, or hooks don''t run.\n\n**Fix**: Run commit commands with full shell permissions (outside sandbox).\n\n### Invalid Scope\n\n**Symptom**: `scope-enum` error from commitlint.\n\n**Fix**: Use one of the allowed scopes above, or update `commitlint.config.js` to add a new scope if justified.\n\n### Subject Case Error\n\n**Symptom**: `subject-case` error.\n\n**Fix**: Use lowercase for the entire subject:\n\n- Bad: `Add new feature`\n- Good: `add new feature`\n\n## Examples from Commit History\n\n```bash\n# Feature with scope\nfeat(adapter-polkadot): add network icons for Polkadot ecosystem\n\n# Fix with scope\nfix(builder): correct ecosystem order in feature flag tests\n\n# Refactor with scope\nrefactor(adapter-evm): migrate to use adapter-evm-core\n\n# Chore without specific scope (use broader category)\nchore: update export versions for ui-types 1.4.0 and ui-utils 1.1.1\n\n# Documentation\ndocs(specs): update spec 008 and 009 for wallet extraction\n\n# Performance improvement\nperf(builder): fix slow dev server startup (minutes to seconds)\n\n# With PR reference\nfeat(adapter-evm-core): Extract reusable EVM core modules (#309)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Stage and commit interactively\ngit add . && pnpm commit\n\n# Check commit format is valid\necho \"feat(builder): add feature\" | npx commitlint\n\n# View recent commit formats for reference\ngit log --oneline -10\n\n# Amend last commit (only if not pushed!)\ngit commit --amend\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:50:19.823Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized commit formatting and GPG signing.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交格式和 GPG 签名的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが標準化されたコミット形式と GPG 署名を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 형식 및 GPG 서명을 필요로 하는 코드 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de código que necesitan un formato de confirmación estandarizado y firma GPG.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant un format de commit standardisé et une signature GPG.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agents, die ein standardisiertes Commit-Format und eine GPG-Signatur benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de formatação de commit padronizada e assinatura GPG.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, требующих стандартизированного форматирования коммитов и подписи GPG.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق إلتزام موحد وتوقيع GPG."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce Conventional Commits standards, ensuring all commits are GPG-signed and validated through pre-commit hooks, utilizing formats like `<type>(<scope>): <subject>` for clear commit messages.","zh":"赋予代理人执行标准提交规范的能力，确保所有提交都经过 GPG 签名并通过预提交钩子进行验证，使用类似 `<类型>(<范围>): <主题>` 的格式进行清晰的提交消息。","ja":"エージェントが従慣性コミット標準を強制することを可能にし、すべてのコミットが GPG 署名され、プレコミットフックを介して検証され、 `<タイプ>(<スコープ>): <サブジェクト>` のような形式を使用して明確なコミットメッセージが得られる。","ko":"에이전트가 표준 커밋 규칙을 강제할 수 있도록 하며, 모든 커밋이 GPG 서명되고, 사전 커밋 훅을 통해 검증되며, `<타입>(<범위>): <주제>`와 같은 형식을 사용하여 명확한 커밋 메시지를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar los estándares de Commits Convencionales, asegurando que todos los commits estén firmados con GPG y validados a través de hooks de pre-commit, utilizando formatos como `<type>(<scope>): <subject>` para mensajes de commit claros.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les normes de Commits Conventionnels, en garantissant que tous les commits soient signés avec GPG et validés via des hooks de pré-commit, en utilisant des formats tels que `<type>(<scope>): <subject>` pour des messages de commit clairs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Standards von Conventional Commits durchzusetzen, indem sichergestellt wird, dass alle Commits mit GPG signiert und durch Pre-Commit-Hooks validiert werden, unter Verwendung von Formaten wie `<type>(<scope>): <subject>` für klare Commit-Mitteilungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes imponham os padrões de Commits Convencionais, garantindo que todos os commits sejam assinados com GPG e validados por meio de hooks de pré-commit, utilizando formatos como `<type>(<scope>): <subject>` para mensagens de commit claras.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов Конвенциональных Коммитов, гарантируя, что все коммиты подписаны с помощью GPG и проверены с помощью хуков предкоммита, используя форматы типа `<type>(<scope>): <subject>` для ясных сообщений коммита.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء صلاحية فرض معايير الإلتزامات التقليدية، مما يضمن أن يتم توقيع جميع الإلتزامات بواسطة GPG وتحققها من خلال hooks قبل الإلتزام، باستخدام تنسيقات مثل `<type>(<scope>): <subject>` لمessages إلتزام واضحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing commit messages across a monorepo","Automating GPG signing for secure commits","Validating commit formats before push"],"zh":["在单一仓库中标准化提交消息","自动为安全提交进行 GPG 签名","在推送前验证提交格式"],"ja":["モノレポ全体でコミットメッセージを標準化する","セキュアなコミットのための GPG 署名を自動化する","プッシュ前にコミット形式を検証する"],"ko":["単일 저장소에서 커밋 메시지를 표준화하는 것","안전한 커밋을 위한 GPG 서명을 자동화하는 것","푸시 전에 커밋 형식을 확인하는 것"],"es":["Estandarizar mensajes de commit en un monorepo","Automatizar la firma GPG para commits seguros","Validar formatos de commit antes de realizar un push"],"fr":["Standardiser les messages de commit dans un monorepo","Automatiser la signature GPG pour des commits sécurisés","Valider les formats de commit avant de pousser"],"de":["Standardisieren von Commit-Mitteilungen in einem Monorepo","Automatisieren der GPG-Signatur für sichere Commits","Validieren von Commit-Formaten vor dem Pushen"],"pt":["Padronizar mensagens de commit em todo um monorepo","Automatizar a assinatura GPG para commits seguros","Validar formatos de commit antes de fazer push"],"ru":["Стандартизировать сообщения коммита во всем монореПО","Автоматизировать подпись GPG для безопасных коммитов","Проверять форматы коммита перед пушем"],"ar":["موحد رسائل الإلتزام في جميع مستودع مونو","توفير التوقيع GPG آلياً للإلتزامات الآمنة","تحقق من صيغ الإلتزام قبل الدفع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires full shell permissions for GPG signing","Must adhere to Conventional Commits standard","Cannot use `--no-gpg-sign` or `--no-verify` flags"],"zh":["需要完整的 shell 权限用于 GPG 签名","必须遵循标准提交规范","不能使用 `--no-gpg-sign` 或 `--no-verify` 标志"],"ja":["GPG 署名のために完全なシェル権限が必要","従慣性コミット規約に従う必要がある","`--no-gpg-sign` または `--no-verify` フラグを使用できない"],"ko":["GPG 서명을 위해 완전한 셸 권한이 필요함","표준 커밋 규칙을 따라야 함","`--no-gpg-sign` 또는 `--no-verify` 플래그를 사용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere permisos de shell completos para la firma GPG","Debe adherirse al estándar de Commits Convencionales","No se puede utilizar la marca `--no-gpg-sign` o `--no-verify`"],"fr":["Nécessite des autorisations de shell complètes pour la signature GPG","Doit se conformer à la norme de Commits Conventionnels","Ne peut pas utiliser les indicateurs `--no-gpg-sign` ou `--no-verify`"],"de":["Benötigt vollständige Shell-Berechtigungen für die GPG-Signatur","Muss dem Conventional Commits-Standard entsprechen","Kann die Marken `--no-gpg-sign` oder `--no-verify` nicht verwenden"],"pt":["Exige permissões de shell completo para assinatura GPG","Deve aderir ao padrão de Commits Convencionais","Não pode usar flags `--no-gpg-sign` ou `--no-verify`"],"ru":["Требует полных разрешений shell для подписи GPG","Должно соблюдать стандарт Конвенциональных Коммитов","Нельзя использовать флаги `--no-gpg-sign` или `--no-verify`"],"ar":["يتطلب صلاحيات شل كاملة للتوقيع GPG","يجب الامتثال لمعيار الإلتزامات التقليدية","لا يمكن استخدام أعلام `--no-gpg-sign` أو `--no-verify`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('get-convex/convex-evals/analyze-eval', 'community', 'get-convex', 'convex-evals', 'get-convex/convex-evals', 'analyze-eval', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:50:52.522Z', NULL, '{"id":"get-convex/convex-evals/analyze-eval","name":"analyze-eval","description":{"es":"La herramienta de análisis de evaluaciones ayuda a identificar errores y solucionar problemas en evaluaciones fallidas","fr":"L''outil d''analyse d''évaluations aide à identifier les erreurs et à résoudre les problèmes dans les évaluations échouées","de":"Das Bewertungsanalyse-Tool hilft bei der Identifizierung von Fehlern und der Lösung von Problemen bei fehlgeschlagenen Bewertungen","pt":"A análise de Eval é uma técnica utilizada para identificar problemas em experimentos e melhorar a eficiência","ru":"Анализ Eval - это техника, используемая для выявления проблем в экспериментах и повышения эффективности","ar":"تحليل Eval هو تقنية تستخدم لتحديد المشاكل في التجارب وتحسين الكفاءة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Análisis de evaluaciones: Evalúe errores y soluciones","fr":"Analyse d''évaluations : Évaluez les erreurs et les solutions","de":"Analyse von Bewertungen: Fehler und Lösungen bewerten","pt":"Análise de Eval: Entenda o que é e como funciona","ru":"Анализ Eval: Что это такое и как это работает","ar":"تحليل Eval: ما هو وكيف يعمل","en":"analyze-eval"},"description":{"es":"La herramienta de análisis de evaluaciones ayuda a identificar errores y solucionar problemas en evaluaciones fallidas","fr":"L''outil d''analyse d''évaluations aide à identifier les erreurs et à résoudre les problèmes dans les évaluations échouées","de":"Das Bewertungsanalyse-Tool hilft bei der Identifizierung von Fehlern und der Lösung von Problemen bei fehlgeschlagenen Bewertungen","pt":"A análise de Eval é uma técnica utilizada para identificar problemas em experimentos e melhorar a eficiência","ru":"Анализ Eval - это техника, используемая для выявления проблем в экспериментах и повышения эффективности","ar":"تحليل Eval هو تقنية تستخدم لتحديد المشاكل في التجارب وتحسين الكفاءة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Identificación de errores en evaluaciones fallidas","Análisis de registros de evaluaciones","Solución de problemas en evaluaciones","Visualización de resultados de evaluaciones","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Soporte para múltiples formatos de evaluación"],"fr":["Identification des erreurs dans les évaluations échouées","Analyse des journaux d''évaluations","Résolution de problèmes dans les évaluations","Visualisation des résultats d''évaluations","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Prise en charge de plusieurs formats d''évaluation"],"de":["Identifizierung von Fehlern bei fehlgeschlagenen Bewertungen","Analyse von Bewertungsprotokollen","Lösung von Problemen bei Bewertungen","Visualisierung von Bewertungsergebnissen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Bewertungsformate"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas em experimentos","Análise de URLs de experimentos","Extração de IDs de avaliação","Análise de falhas em avaliações","Otimização de experimentos","Melhoria da eficiência"],"ru":["Выявление проблем в экспериментах","Анализ URL-адресов экспериментов","Извлечение идентификаторов оценки","Анализ неудач в оценках","Оптимизация экспериментов","Повышение эффективности"],"ar":["تحديد المشاكل في التجارب","تحليل عناوين URL للتجارب","استخراج معرفات التقييم","تحليل الفشل في التقييمات","تحسين التجارب","تحسين الكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"es":["análisis de evaluaciones","evaluación fallida","solución de problemas","visualización de resultados","integración con herramientas de desarrollo","soporte para múltiples formatos de evaluación","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","evaluación de software"],"fr":["analyse d''évaluations","évaluation échouée","résolution de problèmes","visualisation des résultats","intégration avec des outils de développement","prise en charge de plusieurs formats d''évaluation","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels","évaluation de logiciels"],"de":["Bewertungsanalyse","fehlgeschlagene Bewertung","Lösung von Problemen","Visualisierung von Ergebnissen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Bewertungsformate","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Tests","Software-Bewertung"],"pt":["análise de eval","experimentos","eficiência","problemas em experimentos","análise de URLs","extração de IDs","otimização de experimentos","melhoria da eficiência"],"ru":["анализ eval","эксперименты","эффективность","проблемы в экспериментах","анализ URL-адресов","извлечение идентификаторов","оптимизация экспериментов","повышение эффективности"],"ar":["تحليل eval","التجارب","الكفاءة","المشاكل في التجارب","تحليل عناوين URL","استخراج معرفات","تحسين التجارب","تحسين الكفاءة"]}},"owner":"get-convex","repo":"convex-evals","repoPath":"get-convex/convex-evals","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"analyze-eval","description":"Investigate a single failing eval from the convex-evals system. Use when the user shares a visualizer URL pointing to a specific eval, asks about a specific failing eval, or references a specific eval ID.","bodyPreview":"# Analyze Eval\n\n## When to use\n\n- User shares a URL like `https://convex-evals.netlify.app/experiment/.../run/$runId/$category/$evalId`\n- User asks \"why did this eval fail?\" or \"what went wrong with this eval?\"\n- User references a specific eval ID\n\n## Step 1: Extract the eval ID from the URL\n\nThe visualizer URL pattern is:\n\n```\n/experiment/$experimentId/run/$runId/$category/$evalId?tab=steps\n```\n\n- `$runId` — the Convex document ID for the run (e.g. `jn7922j1w29pdxm76bj9ps0enx80mg9e`)\n- `$evalId","body":"# Analyze Eval\n\n## When to use\n\n- User shares a URL like `https://convex-evals.netlify.app/experiment/.../run/$runId/$category/$evalId`\n- User asks \"why did this eval fail?\" or \"what went wrong with this eval?\"\n- User references a specific eval ID\n\n## Step 1: Extract the eval ID from the URL\n\nThe visualizer URL pattern is:\n\n```\n/experiment/$experimentId/run/$runId/$category/$evalId?tab=steps\n```\n\n- `$runId` — the Convex document ID for the run (e.g. `jn7922j1w29pdxm76bj9ps0enx80mg9e`)\n- `$evalId` — the Convex document ID for the specific eval (e.g. `jh73jvjz2n00gfeve1dt5h963s80mbc6`)\n\nYou need the **evalId** to query.\n\n## Step 2: Query the debug action\n\nRun the internal action from the `evalScores/` directory. Always use `--prod` to query the production database (where CI writes results):\n\n```bash\nnpx convex run --prod debug:getEvalDebugInfo ''{\"evalId\": \"<evalId>\"}''\n```\n\nThis returns a JSON object with:\n\n| Field | Contents |\n|-------|----------|\n| `eval` | Name, category, evalPath, status (pass/fail + failure reason), task text |\n| `run` | Model name, provider, experiment name, run status |\n| `steps` | Array of step results: filesystem, install, deploy, tsc, eslint, tests — each with pass/fail/skipped and failure reason |\n| `outputFiles` | Map of file path -> file content from the model''s generated output (unzipped) |\n| `evalSourceFiles` | Map of file path -> file content from the eval source (answer dir, grader, TASK.txt, etc.) |\n\n## Step 3: Analyze the failure\n\nWith the data returned, compare:\n\n1. **Which step failed?** — Check `steps` for the first entry with `status.kind === \"failed\"`. The `failureReason` field has the error message.\n2. **What did the model generate?** — Look at `outputFiles` for the model''s code.\n3. **What was expected?** — Look at `evalSourceFiles` for the answer directory and grader test files.\n4. **What was the task?** — Check `eval.task` for the TASK.txt content.\n\nCommon failure patterns:\n- **eslint fail** — Check the failure reason for the specific lint rule violated. Compare the model output against the answer to spot the lint issue.\n- **tsc fail** — TypeScript compilation error. Check the failure reason for the specific type error.\n- **convex dev fail** — Schema or function definition issues that prevent Convex from deploying.\n- **tests fail** — The grader tests didn''t pass. Compare `outputFiles` against `evalSourceFiles` (look for files like `grader.test.ts` or `answer/`) to understand what the tests expected.\n\n## Step 4: Classify and report findings\n\nClassify the failure as one of:\n- **MODEL_FAULT**: The model genuinely got it wrong\n- **OVERLY_STRICT**: The eval/lint/test requirements are unreasonable for what was asked\n- **AMBIGUOUS_TASK**: The task description is unclear and the model''s interpretation was reasonable\n- **KNOWN_GAP**: Check evalSourceFiles for a GAPS.txt that documents this issue\n\nSummarize:\n1. The eval name, model, and experiment\n2. Which step failed and the exact error\n3. The classification and reasoning\n4. The relevant code from the model output that caused the failure\n5. What the correct code should look like (from the answer/eval source)\n6. Whether any action is recommended (config change, task clarification, etc.)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:50:52.522Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing advanced evaluation analysis capabilities for Convex experiments","zh":"非常适合需要高级评估分析能力的Convex实验调试代理","ja":"Convex実験の高度な評価分析機能を必要とするデバッグエージェントに最適","ko":"Convex 실험을 위한 고급 평가 분석 기능이 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración que necesitan capacidades de análisis de evaluación avanzadas para experimentos Convex","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de débogage ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse d''évaluation avancées pour les expériences Convex","de":"Perfekt für Debugging-Agents, die erweiterte Auswerteanalysefunktionen für Convex-Experimente benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de depuração que necessitam de capacidades de análise de avaliação avançadas para experimentos Convex","ru":"Идеально для агентов отладки, требующих продвинутых возможностей анализа оценки для экспериментов Convex","ar":"مثالي لعمليات فك الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات تحليل تقييم متقدمة لتقارير Convex"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract eval IDs from URLs and analyze failed evaluations using the Convex visualizer URL pattern, providing insights into experiment runs and categories","zh":"使代理能够从URL中提取评估ID，并使用Convex可视化器URL模式分析失败的评估，提供对实验运行和类别的洞察","ja":"エージェントがURLから評価IDを抽出し、ConvexビジュアライザーのURLパターンを使用して失敗した評価を分析することを可能にし、実験の実行とカテゴリに関する洞察を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 URL에서 평가 ID를 추출하고 Convex 시각화기 URL 패턴을 사용하여 실패한 평가를 분석하여 실험 실행 및 범주에 대한 통찰력을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer IDs de evaluación de URLs y analizar evaluaciones fallidas utilizando el patrón de URL del visualizador Convex, proporcionando información sobre las ejecuciones de experimentos y categorías","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des ID d''évaluation à partir d''URL et d''analyser des évaluations ayant échoué en utilisant le modèle d''URL du visualiseur Convex, fournissant des informations sur les exécutions d''expériences et les catégories","de":"Ermöglich es Agents, Auswertungs-IDs aus URLs zu extrahieren und fehlgeschlagene Auswertungen unter Verwendung des Convex-Visualizer-URL-Musters zu analysieren, um Einblicke in Experimentläufe und Kategorien zu gewähren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair IDs de avaliação de URLs e analisar avaliações com falha usando o padrão de URL do visualizador Convex, fornecendo informações sobre execuções de experimentos e categorias","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать идентификаторы оценки из URL и анализировать неудавшиеся оценки с помощью шаблона URL визуализатора Convex, предоставляя информацию о запусках экспериментов и категориях","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من استخراج معرفات التقييم من عناوين URL وتحليل التقييمات الفاشلة باستخدام نمط عنوان URL للعرض Convex، مما يوفر رؤى حول تشغيل التجارب والفئات"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging failed evaluations","Extracting eval IDs from visualizer URLs","Analyzing Convex experiment runs and categories"],"zh":["调试失败的评估","从可视化器URL中提取评估ID","分析Convex实验运行和类别"],"ja":["失敗した評価のデバッグ","ビジュアライザーのURLから評価IDを抽出","Convex実験の実行とカテゴリの分析"],"ko":["실패한 평가 디버깅","시각화기 URL에서 평가 ID 추출","Convex 실험 실행 및 범주 분석"],"es":["Depuración de evaluaciones fallidas","Extracción de IDs de evaluación de URLs de visualizador","Análisis de ejecuciones de experimentos y categorías Convex"],"fr":["Débogage d''évaluations having échoué","Extraction d''ID d''évaluation à partir d''URL de visualiseur","Analyse d''exécutions d''expériences et de catégories Convex"],"de":["Fehlersuche bei fehlgeschlagenen Auswertungen","Extraktion von Auswertungs-IDs aus Visualizer-URLs","Analyse von Convex-Experimentläufen und -Kategorien"],"pt":["Depuração de avaliações com falha","Extração de IDs de avaliação de URLs de visualizador","Análise de execuções de experimentos Convex e categorias"],"ru":["Отладка неудавшихся оценок","Извлечение идентификаторов оценки из URL визуализатора","Анализ запусков экспериментов Convex и категорий"],"ar":["فك شفرة التقييمات الفاشلة","استخراج معرفات التقييم من عناوين URL للعرض","تحليل تشغيل التجارب Convex والفئات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex document ID and eval ID","Specific to Convex visualizer URL pattern"],"zh":["需要Convex文档ID和评估ID","特定于Convex可视化器URL模式"],"ja":["ConvexドキュメントIDと評価IDが必要","ConvexビジュアライザーのURLパターンに特有"],"ko":["Convex 문서 ID 및 평가 ID가 필요","Convex 시각화기 URL 패턴에 특정"],"es":["Requiere ID de documento Convex y ID de evaluación","Específico del patrón de URL del visualizador Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite l''ID de document Convex et l''ID d''évaluation","Spécifique au modèle d''URL du visualiseur Convex"],"de":["Benötigt Convex-Dokumenten-ID und Auswertungs-ID","Spezifisch für das Convex-Visualizer-URL-Muster"],"pt":["Requer ID do documento Convex e ID de avaliação","Específico para o padrão de URL do visualizador Convex"],"ru":["Требует идентификатора документа Convex и идентификатора оценки","Спецефичен для шаблона URL визуализатора Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب معرف وثيقة Convex ومعرف التقييم","محدد لنمط عنوان URL للعرض Convex"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('TencentBlueKing/bk-weweb/bk-weweb', 'community', 'TencentBlueKing', 'bk-weweb', 'TencentBlueKing/bk-weweb', 'bk-weweb', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:50:26.654Z', NULL, '{"id":"TencentBlueKing/bk-weweb/bk-weweb","name":"bk-weweb","description":{"zh":"BK-WeWeb 是腾讯蓝鲸团队开源的轻量级微前端框架，支持快速构建现代化 Web 应用","ja":"BK-WeWeb はテンセント ブルーウェール チームがオープンソースした軽量マイクロフロントエンド フレームワーク","ko":"BK-WeWeb는 텐센트 블루웨일 팀이 오픈소스한 경량 마이크로 프론트엔드 프레임워크","es":"BK-WeWeb es un framework de microfrontend ligero y flexible, basado en Web Components, que soporta aplicaciones y módulos web","fr":"BK-WeWeb est un cadre de microfrontend léger et flexible, basé sur les Web Components, qui prend en charge les applications et les modules web","de":"BK-WeWeb ist ein leichtes und flexibles Mikrofrontend-Framework, das auf Web Components basiert und Webanwendungen und -module unterstützt","pt":"O BK-WeWeb é um framework de micro frontend leve e open source que suporta dois modos de execução: microaplicativos e micromódulos.","ru":"BK-WeWeb - легкий и открытый микрофронтенд-фреймворк, поддерживающий два режима выполнения: микроприложения и микромодули.","ar":"BK-WeWeb هو إطار عمل микرو جبهة خفيف ومفتوح المصدر يدعم نمطي التشغيل: التطبيقات والمكونات الإضافية الدقيقة.","en":"蓝鲸微前端"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"BK-WeWeb 微前端框架 - 腾讯蓝鲸开源技术","ja":"BK-WeWeb マイクロフロントエンド フレームワーク - テンセント ブルーウェール オープンソース","ko":"BK-WeWeb 마이크로 프론트엔드 프레임워크 - 텐센트 블루웨일 오픈소스","es":"BK-WeWeb: Framework de Microfrontend de Tencent","fr":"BK-WeWeb : Cadre de Microfrontend de Tencent","de":"BK-WeWeb: Mikrofrontend-Framework von Tencent","pt":"BK-WeWeb: Framework de Micro Frontend","ru":"BK-WeWeb: Микрофронтенд-фреймворк","ar":"BK-WeWeb: إطار عمل 微 للجبهة","en":"bk-weweb"},"description":{"zh":"BK-WeWeb 是腾讯蓝鲸团队开源的轻量级微前端框架，支持快速构建现代化 Web 应用","ja":"BK-WeWeb はテンセント ブルーウェール チームがオープンソースした軽量マイクロフロントエンド フレームワーク","ko":"BK-WeWeb는 텐센트 블루웨일 팀이 오픈소스한 경량 마이크로 프론트엔드 프레임워크","es":"BK-WeWeb es un framework de microfrontend ligero y flexible, basado en Web Components, que soporta aplicaciones y módulos web","fr":"BK-WeWeb est un cadre de microfrontend léger et flexible, basé sur les Web Components, qui prend en charge les applications et les modules web","de":"BK-WeWeb ist ein leichtes und flexibles Mikrofrontend-Framework, das auf Web Components basiert und Webanwendungen und -module unterstützt","pt":"O BK-WeWeb é um framework de micro frontend leve e open source que suporta dois modos de execução: microaplicativos e micromódulos.","ru":"BK-WeWeb - легкий и открытый микрофронтенд-фреймворк, поддерживающий два режима выполнения: микроприложения и микромодули.","ar":"BK-WeWeb هو إطار عمل микرو جبهة خفيف ومفتوح المصدر يدعم نمطي التشغيل: التطبيقات والمكونات الإضافية الدقيقة.","en":"蓝鲸微前端"},"definition":{"en":"蓝鲸微前端"},"features":{"zh":["轻量级微前端框架","基于 Web Components 技术","支持微应用和微模块两种模式","快速构建现代化 Web 应用","易于集成和扩展"],"ja":["軽量マイクロフロントエンド フレームワーク","Web Components 技術を基盤","マイクロアプリとマイクロモジュールの 2 つのモードをサポート","モダンな Web アプリの迅速な構築","簡単な統合と拡張"],"ko":["경량 마이크로 프론트엔드 프레임워크","Web Components 기술을 기반","마이크로 애플리케이션과 마이크로 모듈의 2가지 모드를 지원","모던한 Web 애플리케이션의 빠른 구축","쉬운 통합과 확장"],"es":["Soporte para aplicaciones y módulos web","Basado en Web Components","Instalación sencilla con npm","Dos modos de ejecución: microaplicación y micromódulo","Flexibilidad para crear componentes personalizados"],"fr":["Prise en charge des applications et des modules web","Basé sur les Web Components","Installation simple avec npm","Deux modes d''exécution : microapplication et micromodule","Flexibilité pour créer des composants personnalisés"],"de":["Unterstützung für Webanwendungen und -module","Basierend auf Web Components","Einfache Installation mit npm","Zwei Ausführungsmodi: Mikroanwendung und Mikromodul","Flexibilität für die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Komponenten"],"pt":["Suporte a microaplicativos e micromódulos","Baseado em Web Components","Instalação fácil via npm","Dois modos de execução: microaplicativos e micromódulos","Suporte a componentes web personalizados"],"ru":["Поддержка микроприложений и микромодулей","Основан на Web Components","Легкая установка через npm","Два режима выполнения: микроприложения и микромодули","Поддержка пользовательских веб-компонентов"],"ar":["دعم التطبيقات والمكونات الإضافية الدقيقة","مبني على مكونات الويب","تثبيت سهل عبر npm","نمطان من أنماط التشغيل: التطبيقات والمكونات الإضافية الدقيقة","دعم مكونات الويب المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["微前端","Web Components","腾讯蓝鲸","轻量级框架","现代化 Web 应用","快速构建"],"ja":["マイクロフロントエンド","Web Components","テンセント ブルーウェール","軽量フレームワーク","モダンな Web アプリ","迅速な構築"],"ko":["마이크로 프론트엔드","Web Components","텐센트 블루웨일","경량 프레임워크","모던한 Web 애플리케이션","빠른 구축"],"es":["microfrontend","BK-WeWeb","Web Components","desarrollo web","aplicaciones modulares","módulos web","framework de microfrontend","Tencent"],"fr":["microfrontend","BK-WeWeb","Web Components","développement web","applications modulaires","modules web","cadre de microfrontend","Tencent"],"de":["Mikrofrontend","BK-WeWeb","Web Components","Webentwicklung","modulare Anwendungen","Webmodule","Mikrofrontend-Framework","Tencent"],"pt":["micro frontend","BK-WeWeb","framework de micro frontend","Web Components","desenvolvimento web","aplicações web modulares","escalabilidade"],"ru":["микрофронтенд","BK-WeWeb","микрофронтенд-фреймворк","Web Components","веб-разработка","модульные веб-приложения","масштабируемость"],"ar":["مايكرو جبهة","BK-WeWeb","إطار عمل مايكرو جبهة","مكونات الويب","تطوير الويب","تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتحديث","التحجيم"]}},"owner":"TencentBlueKing","repo":"bk-weweb","repoPath":"TencentBlueKing/bk-weweb","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bk-weweb","description":"蓝鲸 BK-WeWeb 微前端框架使用指南。帮助用户使用 bk-weweb 实现微应用和微模块的加载、隔离和通信。当用户询问微前端、bk-weweb、子应用加载、JS沙箱、CSS隔离、预加载或需要创建微前端应用时使用此 skill。","bodyPreview":"# BK-WeWeb 微前端框架\n\nBK-WeWeb 是腾讯蓝鲸团队开源的轻量级微前端框架，基于 Web Components 技术，支持微应用和微模块两种模式。\n\n## 快速开始\n\n### 安装\n\n```bash\nnpm install @blueking/bk-weweb\n```\n\n### 在主应用中引入\n\n```typescript\n// main.ts\nimport ''@blueking/bk-weweb'';\n```\n\n## 两种运行模式\n\n| 模式             | 说明             | 入口类型 | 适用场景           |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | -------- | ------------------ |\n| **微应用 (app)** | 加载完整远程应用 | HTML     | 独立部署的完整应用 |\n| **微模块 (js)**  | 加载远程 JS 模块 | JS       | 远程组件、插件系统 |\n\n## 基础用法\n\n### Web Component 标签方式\n\n`","body":"# BK-WeWeb 微前端框架\n\nBK-WeWeb 是腾讯蓝鲸团队开源的轻量级微前端框架，基于 Web Components 技术，支持微应用和微模块两种模式。\n\n## 快速开始\n\n### 安装\n\n```bash\nnpm install @blueking/bk-weweb\n```\n\n### 在主应用中引入\n\n```typescript\n// main.ts\nimport ''@blueking/bk-weweb'';\n```\n\n## 两种运行模式\n\n| 模式             | 说明             | 入口类型 | 适用场景           |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | -------- | ------------------ |\n| **微应用 (app)** | 加载完整远程应用 | HTML     | 独立部署的完整应用 |\n| **微模块 (js)**  | 加载远程 JS 模块 | JS       | 远程组件、插件系统 |\n\n## 基础用法\n\n### Web Component 标签方式\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <!-- 微应用 -->\n  <bk-weweb\n    id=\"child-app\"\n    url=\"http://localhost:8001/\"\n    :scope-js=\"true\"\n    :scope-css=\"true\"\n  />\n\n  <!-- 微模块 -->\n  <bk-weweb\n    id=\"chart-module\"\n    mode=\"js\"\n    url=\"http://localhost:8002/widget.js\"\n  />\n</template>\n```\n\n### Hooks API 方式\n\n```typescript\nimport { loadApp, mount, unmount } from ''@blueking/bk-weweb'';\n\n// 加载并挂载微应用\nawait loadApp({\n  url: ''http://localhost:8001/'',\n  id: ''my-app'',\n  scopeJs: true,\n  scopeCss: true,\n  data: { userId: ''123'', token: ''xxx'' },\n});\nmount(''my-app'', document.getElementById(''container''));\n\n// 卸载\nunmount(''my-app'');\n```\n\n## 核心 API\n\n### 生命周期 Hooks\n\n| API                                       | 说明                                           |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `loadApp(props)`                          | 加载微应用，返回 `Promise<MicroAppModel>`      |\n| `loadInstance(props)`                     | 加载微模块，返回 `Promise<MicroInstanceModel>` |\n| `mount(appKey, container?, callback?)`    | 挂载到容器                                     |\n| `unmount(appKey)`                         | 卸载应用/模块                                  |\n| `activated(appKey, container, callback?)` | 激活（用于 keepAlive 模式）                    |\n| `deactivated(appKey)`                     | 停用（用于 keepAlive 模式）                    |\n| `unload(url)`                             | 删除缓存                                       |\n\n### 预加载 Hooks\n\n| API                         | 说明           |\n| --------------------------- | -------------- |\n| `preLoadApp(options)`       | 预加载微应用   |\n| `preLoadInstance(options)`  | 预加载微模块   |\n| `preLoadSource(sourceList)` | 预加载资源文件 |\n\n### 启动配置\n\n```typescript\nimport weWeb from ''@blueking/bk-weweb'';\n\nweWeb.start({\n  collectBaseSource: true, // 收集主应用资源供子应用共享\n  webComponentTag: ''my-micro-app'', // 自定义标签名\n  fetchSource: async (url, options) => {\n    // 自定义资源获取（如添加认证头）\n    const response = await fetch(url, {\n      ...options,\n      headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` },\n    });\n    return response.text();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## 配置属性速查\n\n### 微应用属性 (mode=\"app\" 或默认)\n\n| 属性             | 类型            | 默认值  | 说明                   |\n| ---------------- | --------------- | ------- | ---------------------- |\n| `url`            | `string`        | -       | **必填**，应用入口 URL |\n| `id`             | `string`        | -       | 应用唯一标识符         |\n| `scopeJs`        | `boolean`       | `true`  | JS 沙箱隔离            |\n| `scopeCss`       | `boolean`       | `true`  | CSS 样式隔离           |\n| `scopeLocation`  | `boolean`       | `false` | 路由隔离               |\n| `setShadowDom`   | `boolean`       | `false` | 使用 Shadow DOM        |\n| `keepAlive`      | `boolean`       | `false` | 缓存模式               |\n| `showSourceCode` | `boolean`       | `false` | 显示源码               |\n| `data`           | `object/string` | -       | 传递数据               |\n| `initSource`     | `string[]`      | -       | 初始化资源             |\n\n### 微模块属性 (mode=\"js\")\n\n| 属性             | 类型            | 默认值  | 说明                   |\n| ---------------- | --------------- | ------- | ---------------------- |\n| `url`            | `string`        | -       | **必填**，JS 模块 URL  |\n| `id`             | `string`        | -       | **必填**，模块唯一标识 |\n| `mode`           | `''js''`          | -       | **必填**，设为 `''js''`  |\n| `scopeJs`        | `boolean`       | `false` | JS 沙箱隔离            |\n| `scopeCss`       | `boolean`       | `true`  | CSS 样式隔离           |\n| `keepAlive`      | `boolean`       | `false` | 缓存模式               |\n| `showSourceCode` | `boolean`       | `true`  | 显示源码               |\n| `data`           | `object/string` | -       | 传递数据               |\n\n## 子应用开发\n\n### 全局变量\n\n子应用中可通过以下全局变量获取运行时信息：\n\n```typescript\nif (window.__POWERED_BY_BK_WEWEB__) {\n  const appKey = window.__BK_WEWEB_APP_KEY__; // 应用标识\n  const data = window.__BK_WEWEB_DATA__; // 主应用传递的数据\n  const realWindow = window.rawWindow; // 原始 window\n  const realDocument = window.rawDocument; // 原始 document\n}\n```\n\n### 微模块 render 规范\n\n微模块需导出包含 `render` 方法的对象：\n\n```typescript\n// widget.js\nexport default {\n  render(container: HTMLElement, data: Record<string, unknown>) {\n    container.innerHTML = `<div>Hello ${data.name}</div>`;\n\n    // 返回销毁函数\n    return () => {\n      container.innerHTML = '''';\n    };\n  },\n\n  // 可选：其他方法供主应用调用\n  update(newData) {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n  getState() {\n    return {\n      /* ... */\n    };\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## 框架集成示例\n\n### Vue 3\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\n  import { ref, onMounted, onBeforeUnmount } from ''vue'';\n  import { loadApp, mount, unmount } from ''@blueking/bk-weweb'';\n\n  const containerRef = ref<HTMLElement>();\n  const appId = ''child-app'';\n\n  onMounted(async () => {\n    await loadApp({\n      url: ''http://localhost:8001/'',\n      id: appId,\n      scopeJs: true,\n      scopeCss: true,\n      data: { userId: ''123'' },\n    });\n    mount(appId, containerRef.value!);\n  });\n\n  onBeforeUnmount(() => unmount(appId));\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div\n    ref=\"containerRef\"\n    class=\"app-container\"\n  ></div>\n</template>\n```\n\n### React\n\n```tsx\nimport { useRef, useEffect } from ''react'';\nimport { loadApp, mount, unmount } from ''@blueking/bk-weweb'';\n\nconst MicroApp: React.FC = () => {\n  const containerRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n  const appId = ''child-app'';\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const load = async () => {\n      await loadApp({\n        url: ''http://localhost:8001/'',\n        id: appId,\n        scopeJs: true,\n        scopeCss: true,\n      });\n      if (containerRef.current) {\n        mount(appId, containerRef.current);\n      }\n    };\n    load();\n    return () => unmount(appId);\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      ref={containerRef}\n      style={{ height: ''600px'' }}\n    />\n  );\n};\n```\n\n## 预加载策略\n\n```typescript\nimport { preLoadApp, mount } from ''@blueking/bk-weweb'';\n\n// 页面加载完成后预加载\nwindow.addEventListener(''load'', () => {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    preLoadApp({\n      url: ''http://localhost:8001/'',\n      id: ''dashboard'',\n      scopeJs: true,\n    });\n  }, 2000); // 延迟避免影响首屏\n});\n\n// 需要时直接挂载（无需等待加载）\nfunction showDashboard() {\n  mount(''dashboard'', document.getElementById(''container''));\n}\n```\n\n## 常见问题\n\n### 1. 子应用加载失败\n\n- 检查 CORS 配置，确保允许跨域\n- 检查 URL 是否正确\n- 查看控制台错误信息\n\n### 2. 样式冲突\n\n- 确认 `scopeCss` 已开启\n- 考虑使用 `setShadowDom` 获得更彻底隔离\n- 检查是否使用了 `!important`\n\n### 3. 子应用路由不工作\n\n- 开启 `scopeLocation` 实现路由隔离\n- 确认路由模式（hash/history）\n\n### 4. 访问主应用全局变量\n\n```typescript\n// 子应用中访问真实 window\nconst realWindow = window.rawWindow || window;\nconst mainConfig = realWindow.__MAIN_APP_CONFIG__;\n```\n\n## 详细参考文档\n\n- [Hooks API 详解](references/hooks-api.md)\n- [微应用配置](references/micro-app.md)\n- [微模块配置](references/micro-module.md)\n\n## 类型定义\n\n```typescript\nimport {\n  loadApp,\n  loadInstance,\n  mount,\n  unmount,\n  activated,\n  deactivated,\n  unload,\n  preLoadApp,\n  preLoadInstance,\n  preLoadSource,\n  WewebMode,\n  type IAppModelProps,\n  type IJsModelProps,\n  type BaseModel,\n} from ''@blueking/bk-weweb'';\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:50:26.654Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing lightweight micro-frontend framework capabilities with Web Components technology","zh":"适合需要轻量级微前端框架能力的前端代理，采用Web Components技术","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが軽量なマイクロフロントエンドフレームワーク機能を必要とする場合に最適です。Web Components技術を使用します","ko":"웹 컴포넌트 기술을 사용하는 경량 마이크로 프론트엔드 프레임워크 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de framework de micro-frontend ligero con tecnología de Componentes Web","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de framework de micro-frontend léger avec la technologie de Composants Web","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die leichte Micro-Frontend-Framework-Funktionen mit Web-Components-Technologie benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de framework de micro-frontend leve com tecnologia de Componentes da Web","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы возможности легкого микро-фронтенд фреймворка с технологией Веб-компонентов","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إطار عمل микرو واجهة المستخدم الخفيف مع تقنية مكونات الويب"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build micro-applications and micro-modules using the BK-WeWeb framework, supporting both HTML and JS entry points with Web Components, and enables the integration of remote applications and modules","zh":"赋予代理构建微应用程序和微模块的能力，使用BK-WeWeb框架，支持HTML和JS入口点以及Web Components，并能够集成远程应用程序和模块","ja":"BK-WeWebフレームワークを使用して、マイクロアプリケーションとマイクロモジュールを構築するエージェントの能力を提供します。HTMLおよびJSのエントリポイントをサポートし、Web Componentsを使用し、リモートアプリケーションやモジュールを統合できる","ko":"BK-WeWeb 프레임워크를 사용하여 마이크로 애플리케이션과 마이크로 모듈을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. HTML 및 JS 入력 포인트를 지원하며 웹 컴포넌트를 사용하고 원격 애플리케이션 및 모듈을 통합할 수 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir micro-aplicaciones y micro-módulos utilizando el framework BK-WeWeb, que admite tanto puntos de entrada HTML como JS con Componentes Web, y permite la integración de aplicaciones y módulos remotos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des micro-applications et des micro-modules en utilisant le framework BK-WeWeb, qui prend en charge à la fois les points d''entrée HTML et JS avec des Composants Web, et permet l''intégration d''applications et de modules distants","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Micro-Anwendungen und Micro-Module mit dem Framework BK-WeWeb zu erstellen, das sowohl HTML- als auch JS-Einstiegspunkte mit Web-Components unterstützt und die Integration von Remote-Anwendungen und -Modulen ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir microaplicações e módulos micro usando o framework BK-WeWeb, suportando tanto pontos de entrada HTML quanto JS com Componentes da Web, e permite a integração de aplicações e módulos remotos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать микроприложения и микромодули с использованием фреймворка BK-WeWeb, поддерживающего как HTML, так и JS точки входа с Веб-компонентами, и позволяет интегрировать удаленные приложения и модули","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء تطبيقات ومكونات دقيقة باستخدام إطار BK-WeWeb ، الذي يدعم نقاط الدخول HTML و JS مع مكونات الويب ، ويسمح بتكامل التطبيقات والمكونات البعيدة"},"useCases":{"en":["Building micro-applications with remote HTML entry points","Loading remote JS modules for modular functionality","Creating independent deployable applications with micro-frontend architecture"],"zh":["使用远程HTML入口点构建微应用程序","加载远程JS模块以实现模块化功能","使用微前端架构创建独立部署的应用程序"],"ja":["リモートHTMLエントリポイントを使用してマイクロアプリケーションを構築する","リモートJSモジュールを読み込んでモジュール化された機能を実現する","マイクロフロントエンドアーキテクチャを使用して独立してデプロイ可能なアプリケーションを作成する"],"ko":["원격 HTML 入력 포인트를 사용하여 마이크로 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","원격 JS 모듈을 로드하여 모듈화된 기능을 구현하는 것","마이크로 프론트엔드 아키텍처를 사용하여 독립적으로 배포 가능한 애플리케이션을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Construir micro-aplicaciones con puntos de entrada HTML remotos","Cargar módulos JS remotos para funcionalidad modular","Crear aplicaciones independientes implementables con arquitectura de micro-frontend"],"fr":["Créer des micro-applications avec des points d''entrée HTML distants","Charger des modules JS distants pour une fonctionnalité modulaire","Créer des applications déployables indépendantes avec une architecture de micro-frontend"],"de":["Micro-Anwendungen mit Remote-HTML-Einstiegspunkten erstellen","Remote-JS-Module für modulare Funktionalität laden","Unabhängige bereitstellbare Anwendungen mit Micro-Frontend-Architektur erstellen"],"pt":["Construção de microaplicações com pontos de entrada HTML remotos","Carregamento de módulos JS remotos para funcionalidade modular","Criação de aplicações independentes implantáveis com arquitetura de micro-frontend"],"ru":["Создание микроприложений с удаленными точками входа HTML","Загрузка удаленных модулей JS для модульной функциональности","Создание независимых развертываемых приложений с микро-фронтенд архитектурой"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات دقيقة مع نقاط الدخول HTML البعيدة","تحميل وحدات JS البعيدة لوظيفة الوحدات","إنشاء تطبيقات مستقلة قابلة للتثبيت مع هندسة واجهة المستخدم الدقيقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation of @blueking/bk-weweb","Limited to Web Components technology"],"zh":["需要安装@blueking/bk-weweb的npm","仅限于Web Components技术"],"ja":["@blueking/bk-wewebのnpmをインストールする必要がある","Web Components技術のみに限定される"],"ko":["@blueking/bk-weweb의 npm을 설치해야 함","웹 컴포넌트 기술만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación de npm de @blueking/bk-weweb","Limitado a la tecnología de Componentes Web"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm de @blueking/bk-weweb","Limité à la technologie de Composants Web"],"de":["Benötigt npm-Installation von @blueking/bk-weweb","Begrenzt auf Web-Components-Technologie"],"pt":["Exige instalação do npm @blueking/bk-weweb","Limitado à tecnologia de Componentes da Web"],"ru":["Требует установки npm @blueking/bk-weweb","Ограничен технологией Веб-компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm @blueking/bk-weweb","محدود بتقنية مكونات الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
