ekyll","Opção de usar data atual ou personalizada","Guias passo a passo para criação de conteúdo"],"ru":["Создание постов программ с исходным кодом и скриншотом","Создание постов блогов для обновлений и объявлений","Поддержка Apple II Applesoft BASIC","Интеграция с сайтом Apple II Programs Jekyll","Возможность использовать текущую дату или настраиваемую","Пошаговые руководства для создания контента"],"ar":["إنشاء منشورات برنامج مع код مصدر وصور الشاشة","إنشاء منشورات مدونة للمتحديثات والإعلانات","دعم Apple II Applesoft BASIC","التكامل مع موقع Apple II Programs Jekyll","خيار استخدام التاريخ الحالي أو المخصص","دليل خطوة بخطوة لإنشاء المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Apple II ","Applesoft BASIC","Jekyll","Program Post","Blog Post"," ","SEO"],"ja":["Apple II","Applesoft BASIC","Jekyll","Program Post","Blog Post","SEO","Developer"],"ko":["Apple II ","Applesoft BASIC","Jekyll","Program Post","Blog Post","SEO"," "],"es":["Apple II","Programs Jekyll","crear contenido nuevo","publicaciones de programas","blogs","desarrollo web","Jekyll","Apple II Programs"],"fr":["Apple II","Programs Jekyll","créer du contenu nouveau","publications de programmes","blogs","développement web","Jekyll","Apple II Programs"],"de":["Apple II","Programs Jekyll","neuen Inhalt erstellen","Programm-Beiträge","Blogs","Webentwicklung","Jekyll","Apple II Programs"],"pt":["novo conteúdo","Apple II","programas","blogs","Jekyll","desenvolvimento web","criação de conteúdo","posts de programas","posts de blogs"],"ru":["новый контент","Apple II","программы","блоги","Jekyll","веб-разработка","создание контента","посты программ","посты блогов"],"ar":["المحتوى الجديد","آبل 2","البرامج","المدونات","Jekyll","تطوير الويب","إنشاء المحتوى","منشورات البرنامج","منشورات المدونة"]}},"owner":"thelbane","repo":"Apple-II-Programs","repoPath":"thelbane/Apple-II-Programs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"new-content","description":"Create new Apple II program posts or blog posts for this Jekyll site. Use when the user wants to add a new program, start a new post, create content, or asks about adding programs or blog entries.","bodyPreview":"# Creating New Content\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new program posts or blog posts for the Apple II Programs Jekyll site.\n\n## Content Types\n\n**Program Post**: Showcases an Apple II Applesoft BASIC program with source code, screenshot, and description.\n\n**Blog Post**: General updates, announcements, or articles about the site or Apple II topics.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nAsk the user:\n1. **Type**: Program or blog post?\n2. **Title**: What should it be called?\n3. **Date**: Use today''s date or a","body":"# Creating New Content\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new program posts or blog posts for the Apple II Programs Jekyll site.\n\n## Content Types\n\n**Program Post**: Showcases an Apple II Applesoft BASIC program with source code, screenshot, and description.\n\n**Blog Post**: General updates, announcements, or articles about the site or Apple II topics.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nAsk the user:\n1. **Type**: Program or blog post?\n2. **Title**: What should it be called?\n3. **Date**: Use today''s date or a specific date?\n\nFor programs, also ask:\n4. **Program type**: One-liner or two-liner?\n5. **Performance**: Runs OK at 1MHz or slow?\n6. **Source code**: Provide the Applesoft BASIC code\n\n---\n\n## Creating a Program Post\n\n### Required Files\n\n| File | Location | Purpose |\n|------|----------|---------|\n| Post | `docs/programs/_posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md` | Main post file |\n| Source | `docs/_includes/src/slug.txt` | Applesoft source code |\n| Screenshot | `docs/media/slug.png` or `.gif` or `.jpg` | Full-size image |\n| Thumbnail | `docs/media/slug-tn.png` | Thumbnail (smaller version) |\n\n### Post Template\n\n```markdown\n---\nlayout: post\ntitle: Program Title\ndate: YYYY-MM-DD\ndescription: Brief description of the program\ntags: program one-liner 1mhz-ok\nauthor: Lee Fastenau\nscreenshot: /media/slug.png\nthumbnail: /media/slug-tn.png\nsource: /src/slug.txt\ndiscussion:\n    -\n        name: Discussion Link Name\n        url: https://example.com/link\n---\n\nDescription of the program and any usage instructions.\n```\n\n### Tag Options\n\n| Tag | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| `program` | **Required** for all programs |\n| `one-liner` | Program fits on one line |\n| `two-liner` | Program fits on two lines |\n| `1mhz-ok` | Runs well on 1MHz Apple II |\n| `1mhz-slow` | Runs slow on 1MHz (triggers warp mode in emulator) |\n| `notable` | Featured/award-winning program |\n| `monochrome` | Best viewed in monochrome mode |\n\n### Source File Format\n\nCreate `docs/_includes/src/slug.txt` with the raw Applesoft code. Each logical line should be on its own line:\n\n```\n0HGR2:FORN=1TO100:HCOLOR=RND(1)*7+1:HPLOTX,Y:NEXT\n```\n\nFor two-liners, use two lines:\n\n```\n0FIRST LINE OF CODE HERE\n1SECOND LINE OF CODE HERE\n```\n\n---\n\n## Creating a Blog Post\n\n### Post Template\n\n```markdown\n---\nlayout: post\ntitle: Post Title\ndate: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS -0700\ntags: updates\nauthor: Lee Fastenau\n---\n\nBlog post content here.\n\nUse `<!--more-->` to create an excerpt break.\n```\n\n### Common Blog Tags\n\n- `updates` - Site updates and announcements\n- `emulation` - Emulator-related content\n\n### Including Images\n\nUse the img include:\n\n```liquid\n{% include img.html src=\"/assets/images/post/image-name.png\" caption=\"Image caption\" alt=\"Alt text description\" %}\n```\n\n### Including Code Snippets\n\nUse the applesoft include:\n\n```liquid\n{% capture source_code -%}\n0YOUR CODE HERE\n{%- endcapture %}{% include applesoft.md src=source_code %}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n- **Slug**: Lowercase, hyphen-separated (e.g., `my-program-name`)\n- **Date format**: `YYYY-MM-DD` or `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS -0700` for specific times\n- **Filename**: `YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md`\n\n## Media Guidelines\n\n- **Screenshots**: Use PNG for static, GIF for animated, JPG for photos\n- **Thumbnails**: Should be `-tn.png` suffix, smaller version of screenshot\n- Place all media in `docs/media/`\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n### Program Post\n\n- [ ] Create post file: `docs/programs/_posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md`\n- [ ] Create source file: `docs/_includes/src/slug.txt`\n- [ ] Add screenshot: `docs/media/slug.png|gif|jpg`\n- [ ] Add thumbnail: `docs/media/slug-tn.png`\n- [ ] Frontmatter includes: layout, title, date, description, tags, author, screenshot, thumbnail, source\n- [ ] Tags include `program` plus line count and performance tags\n\n### Blog Post\n\n- [ ] Create post file: `docs/_posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md`\n- [ ] Frontmatter includes: layout, title, date, tags, author\n- [ ] Add images to `docs/assets/images/post/` if needed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:50:20.931Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing to generate program posts or blog posts for the Apple II Programs Jekyll site.","zh":"非常适合需要为 Apple II 程序 Jekyll 站点生成程序帖子或博客帖子的内容创建代理。","ja":"Apple II プログラムの Jekyll サイトでプログラム投稿やブログ投稿を生成する必要があるコンテンツ作成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Apple II 프로그램 Jekyll 사이트에서 프로그램 게시물이나 블로그 게시물 생성이 필요한 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de creación de contenido que necesitan generar publicaciones de programas o entradas de blog para el sitio Jekyll de Programas Apple II.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de contenu qui ont besoin de générer des publications de programmes ou des billets de blog pour le site Jekyll des Programmes Apple II.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Erstellung-Agenten, die Programm-Beiträge oder Blog-Beiträge für die Apple II-Programme Jekyll-Website generieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que precisam gerar posts de programas ou posts de blog para o site Apple II Programs Jekyll.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по созданию контента, которым необходимо генерировать посты программ или посты в блоге для сайта Apple II Programs Jekyll.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء منشورات برنامج أو منشورات مدونة لموقع Apple II Programs Jekyll."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create new content types, including program posts with Applesoft BASIC source code and blog posts with general updates, utilizing Jekyll site compatibility and markdown formatting.","zh":"赋予代理创建新内容类型的能力，包括带有 Applesoft BASIC 源代码的程序帖子和带有一般更新的博客帖子，利用 Jekyll 站点兼容性和 Markdown 格式。","ja":"Applesoft BASIC ソースコードを含むプログラム投稿や一般的な更新を含むブログ投稿などの新しいコンテンツタイプを作成するエージェントの能力を提供し、Jekyll サイトの互換性と Markdown フォーマットを利用します。","ko":"Applesoft BASIC 소스 코드를 포함한 프로그램 게시물이나 일반 업데이트를 포함한 블로그 게시물 같은 새로운 콘텐츠 유형을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Jekyll 사이트 호환성과 Markdown 형식을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear nuevos tipos de contenido, incluidas publicaciones de programas con código fuente Applesoft BASIC y entradas de blog con actualizaciones generales, utilizando la compatibilidad del sitio Jekyll y el formato de markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouveaux types de contenu, notamment des publications de programmes avec du code source Applesoft BASIC et des billets de blog avec des mises à jour générales, en utilisant la compatibilité du site Jekyll et le formatage markdown.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Inhaltsarten zu erstellen, einschließlich Programmbeiträgen mit Applesoft-BASIC-Quellcode und Blogbeiträgen mit allgemeinen Updates, unter Verwendung der Jekyll-Website-Kompatibilität und Markdown-Formatierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos tipos de conteúdo, incluindo posts de programas com código-fonte Applesoft BASIC e posts de blog com atualizações gerais, utilizando a compatibilidade do site Jekyll e formatação markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые типы контента, включая посты программ с исходным кодом Applesoft BASIC и посты в блоге с общими обновлениями, используя совместимость сайта Jekyll и форматирование markdown.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء أنواع جديدة من المحتوى، بما في ذلك منشورات البرامج مع код مصدر Applesoft BASIC ومنشورات المدونة مع التحديثات العامة، باستخدام توافق موقع Jekyll وتدوين markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating program posts with Applesoft BASIC source code","Creating blog posts for Apple II topic announcements","Automating content creation for the Apple II Programs Jekyll site"],"zh":["生成带有 Applesoft BASIC 源代码的程序帖子","为 Apple II 主题公告创建博客帖子","自动为 Apple II 程序 Jekyll 站点生成内容"],"ja":["Applesoft BASIC ソースコードを含むプログラム投稿を生成する","Apple II トピックのアナウンスのためのブログ投稿を作成する","Apple II プログラムの Jekyll サイトのためのコンテンツの自動生成"],"ko":["Applesoft BASIC 소스 코드를 포함한 프로그램 게시물 생성","Apple II 주제 공지사항을 위한 블로그 게시물 생성","Apple II 프로그램 Jekyll 사이트를 위한 콘텐츠 자동 생성"],"es":["Generación de publicaciones de programas con código fuente Applesoft BASIC","Creación de entradas de blog para anuncios de temas de Apple II","Automatización de la creación de contenido para el sitio Jekyll de Programas Apple II"],"fr":["Génération de publications de programmes avec du code source Applesoft BASIC","Création de billets de blog pour les annonces de sujets Apple II","Automatisation de la création de contenu pour le site Jekyll des Programmes Apple II"],"de":["Generierung von Programmbeiträgen mit Applesoft-BASIC-Quellcode","Erstellung von Blogbeiträgen für Ankündigungen von Apple-II-Themen","Automatisierung der Inhaltsvergabe für die Apple-II-Programme-Jekyll-Website"],"pt":["Geração de posts de programas com código-fonte Applesoft BASIC","Criação de posts de blog para anúncios de tópicos Apple II","Automação da criação de conteúdo para o site Apple II Programs Jekyll"],"ru":["Генерация постов программ с исходным кодом Applesoft BASIC","Создание постов в блоге для объявлений тем Apple II","Автоматизация создания контента для сайта Apple II Programs Jekyll"],"ar":["إنشاء منشورات برنامج مع код مصدر Applesoft BASIC","إنشاء منشورات مدونة لإعلانات مواضيع Apple II","أتمتة إنشاء المحتوى لموقع Apple II Programs Jekyll"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jekyll site compatibility","Limited to Apple II Programs and Applesoft BASIC content","No support for other programming languages or platforms"],"zh":["需要 Jekyll 站点兼容性","仅限 Apple II 程序和 Applesoft BASIC 内容","不支持其他编程语言或平台"],"ja":["Jekyll サイトの互換性が必要","Apple II プログラムと Applesoft BASIC コンテンツのみ","他のプログラミング言語またはプラットフォームはサポートされていません"],"ko":["Jekyll 사이트 호환성이 필요","Apple II 프로그램과 Applesoft BASIC 콘텐츠만 가능","다른 프로그래밍 언어 또는 플랫폼을 지원하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con el sitio Jekyll","Limitado a contenido de Programas Apple II y Applesoft BASIC","No admite otros lenguajes de programación o plataformas"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité du site Jekyll","Limité au contenu des Programmes Apple II et Applesoft BASIC","N''a pas de prise en charge pour d''autres langages de programmation ou plateformes"],"de":["Benötigt Jekyll-Website-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf Apple-II-Programme- und Applesoft-BASIC-Inhalte","Keine Unterstützung für andere Programmiersprachen oder Plattformen"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com o site Jekyll","Limitado ao conteúdo do Apple II Programs e Applesoft BASIC","Sem suporte para outras linguagens de programação ou plataformas"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с сайтом Jekyll","Ограничен контентом Apple II Programs и Applesoft BASIC","Нет поддержки для других языков программирования или платформ"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع موقع Jekyll","محدود بمحتوى Apple II Programs و Applesoft BASIC","لا يدعم لغات البرمجة أو المنصات الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
