el contexto de base de datos de CodeSpirit","Arquitectura de tres capas para la gestión de bases de datos"],"fr":["Prise en charge de MySQL et SQL Server","Création de fichiers de migration indépendants","Utilisation de commandes de migration d''Entity Framework","Compatibilité avec le contexte de base de données de CodeSpirit","Architecture à trois couches pour la gestion de bases de données"],"de":["Unterstützung für MySQL und SQL Server","Erstellung von unabhängigen Migrationsskripten","Verwendung von Entity Framework-Migrationsbefehlen","Kompatibilität mit dem CodeSpirit-Datenbankkontext","Dreischichtenarchitektur für die Datenbankverwaltung"],"pt":["Suporte a migração de bancos de dados MySQL e SQL Server","Geração de código inteligente com motor de geração de código","Colaboração profunda com IA para desenvolvimento de software","Arquitetura de três camadas para DbContext","Comandos básicos para migração de bancos de dados"],"ru":["Поддержка миграции баз данных MySQL и SQL Server","Интеллектуальная генерация кода с помощью движка генерации кода","Глубокое сотрудничество с ИИ для разработки программного обеспечения","Трехуровневая архитектура для DbContext","Базовые команды для миграции баз данных"],"ar":["دعم هجرة قواعد البيانات MySQL و SQL Server","توليد رمز ذكي مع محرك توليد الرمز","تعاون عميق مع الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرمجيات","هيكل ثلاثي الطبقات للDbContext","أوامر أساسية لهجرة قواعد البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["数据库迁移","db-migration","CodeSpirit","MySQL","SQL Server","数据库管理"],"ja":["データベース移行","db-migration","CodeSpirit","MySQL","SQL Server","データベース管理"],"ko":["데이터베이스 마이그레이션","db-migration","CodeSpirit","MySQL","SQL Server","데이터베이스 관리"],"es":["migración de bases de datos","CodeSpirit","full-stack","low-code","AI","Entity Framework","MySQL","SQL Server","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["migration de bases de données","CodeSpirit","full-stack","low-code","IA","Entity Framework","MySQL","SQL Server","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Datenbankmigration","CodeSpirit","Full-Stack","Low-Code","KI","Entity Framework","MySQL","SQL Server","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["migração de banco de dados","CodeSpirit","desenvolvimento full-stack","baixo código","IA","MySQL","SQL Server","DbContext"],"ru":["миграция базы данных","CodeSpirit","полный стек","низкий код","ИИ","MySQL","SQL Server","DbContext"],"ar":["هجرة قاعدة البيانات","CodeSpirit","تطوير كامل","كود منخفض","الذكاء الاصطناعي","MySQL","SQL Server","DbContext"]}},"owner":"xin-lai","repo":"CodeSpirit","repoPath":"xin-lai/CodeSpirit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"db-migration","description":"指导同时为 MySQL 和 SQL Server 创建数据库迁移。使用数据库特定的 DbContext，处理数据库差异，配置雪花ID。当用户需要创建迁移、修改实体、或遇到迁移错误时使用。","bodyPreview":"# 多数据库迁移 Skill\n\n## 快速开始\n\nCodeSpirit 项目支持 MySQL 和 SQL Server 双数据库，**必须**为每个数据库创建独立的迁移文件。\n\n### 基本命令\n\n```powershell\n# MySQL 迁移\ndotnet ef migrations add MigrationName --context MySql{Service}DbContext --output-dir Data/Migrations/MySql\n\n# SQL Server 迁移\ndotnet ef migrations add MigrationName --context SqlServer{Service}DbContext --output-dir Data/Migrations/SqlServer\n```\n\n---\n\n## DbContext 架构\n\n### 三层继承结构\n\n```\nMultiDatabaseDbContextBase (多数据库基类)\n    ↓\n{Service}DbContext (服务基础上下文，运行时使用)\n    ↓\nMySql{Ser","body":"# 多数据库迁移 Skill\n\n## 快速开始\n\nCodeSpirit 项目支持 MySQL 和 SQL Server 双数据库，**必须**为每个数据库创建独立的迁移文件。\n\n### 基本命令\n\n```powershell\n# MySQL 迁移\ndotnet ef migrations add MigrationName --context MySql{Service}DbContext --output-dir Data/Migrations/MySql\n\n# SQL Server 迁移\ndotnet ef migrations add MigrationName --context SqlServer{Service}DbContext --output-dir Data/Migrations/SqlServer\n```\n\n---\n\n## DbContext 架构\n\n### 三层继承结构\n\n```\nMultiDatabaseDbContextBase (多数据库基类)\n    ↓\n{Service}DbContext (服务基础上下文，运行时使用)\n    ↓\nMySql{Service}DbContext / SqlServer{Service}DbContext (数据库特定上下文，用于迁移)\n```\n\n### 关键要点\n\n1. **运行时使用基础 DbContext**：`{Service}DbContext`（如 `ExamDbContext`）\n2. **迁移使用特定 DbContext**：`MySql{Service}DbContext` 或 `SqlServer{Service}DbContext`\n3. **数据库差异处理**：通过 `DatabaseSpecificConfigurations` 类统一处理\n\n---\n\n## 工作流程\n\n### 步骤 1：修改实体或配置\n\n修改实体类或实体配置类（`IEntityTypeConfiguration<T>`）后，准备创建迁移。\n\n### 步骤 2：检查雪花 ID 配置\n\n如果实体使用 `IIdGenerator` 生成 ID，**必须**在实体配置中添加：\n\n```csharp\nbuilder.Property(x => x.Id).ValueGeneratedNever();\n```\n\n**常见错误**：\n```\nCannot insert explicit value for identity column in table ''Products'' \nwhen IDENTITY_INSERT is set to OFF\n```\n\n**解决方案**：添加 `ValueGeneratedNever()` 配置。\n\n### 步骤 3：为 MySQL 创建迁移\n\n```powershell\n# 切换到 API 项目目录\ncd Src/ApiServices/CodeSpirit.{Service}Api\n\n# 创建 MySQL 迁移\ndotnet ef migrations add {MigrationName} `\n  --context MySql{Service}DbContext `\n  --output-dir Data/Migrations/MySql\n```\n\n**参数说明**：\n- `--context`：**必须**使用 `MySql{Service}DbContext`\n- `--output-dir`：指定迁移文件输出目录\n\n### 步骤 4：为 SQL Server 创建迁移\n\n```powershell\n# 在同一项目目录下\ndotnet ef migrations add {MigrationName} `\n  --context SqlServer{Service}DbContext `\n  --output-dir Data/Migrations/SqlServer\n```\n\n**重要**：迁移名称应保持一致，但文件会分别存储在 `MySql/` 和 `SqlServer/` 目录下。\n\n### 步骤 5：验证迁移文件\n\n检查迁移文件是否正确：\n\n- [ ] MySQL 迁移文件在 `Data/Migrations/MySql/` 目录\n- [ ] SQL Server 迁移文件在 `Data/Migrations/SqlServer/` 目录\n- [ ] 迁移文件包含正确的数据库特定配置（如 MySQL 的 `datetime(6)`）\n- [ ] 雪花 ID 字段配置了 `ValueGeneratedNever()`（如适用）\n\n### 步骤 6：应用迁移到本地开发环境\n\n```powershell\n# 应用 MySQL 迁移\ndotnet ef database update --context MySql{Service}DbContext\n\n# 应用 SQL Server 迁移\ndotnet ef database update --context SqlServer{Service}DbContext\n```\n\n---\n\n## 迁移命名规范\n\n| 场景 | 命名示例 |\n|------|---------|\n| 初始创建 | `InitialCreate` |\n| 添加实体 | `Add{EntityName}` |\n| 添加字段 | `Add{FieldName}To{EntityName}` |\n| 修改字段 | `Update{FieldName}In{EntityName}` |\n| 删除字段 | `Remove{FieldName}From{EntityName}` |\n| 添加索引 | `AddIndexTo{EntityName}` |\n\n---\n\n## 数据库差异处理\n\n### MySQL 特定配置\n\n通过 `DatabaseSpecificConfigurations.ApplyMySqlConfigurations()` 自动处理：\n\n- **DateTime**：映射为 `datetime(6)`（微秒精度）\n- **默认值**：`GETUTCDATE()` → `CURRENT_TIMESTAMP(6)`\n- **字符串**：`varchar(n) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci`\n- **长文本**：超过 1000 字符使用 `text`\n- **布尔**：`tinyint(1)`\n- **Identity 字段**：限制最大长度为 256\n\n### SQL Server 特定配置\n\n通过 `DatabaseSpecificConfigurations.ApplySqlServerConfigurations()` 处理：\n\n- 使用 EF Core 默认配置\n- 仅处理 Identity 字段长度限制（256）\n\n---\n\n## 常见错误和解决方案\n\n### 错误 1：使用了错误的 DbContext\n\n**错误信息**：\n```\nNo design-time factory found for ''ExamDbContext''\n```\n\n**原因**：使用了基础 DbContext 而非数据库特定的 DbContext。\n\n**解决方案**：使用 `MySqlExamDbContext` 或 `SqlServerExamDbContext`。\n\n### 错误 2：雪花 ID 配置缺失\n\n**错误信息**：\n```\nCannot insert explicit value for identity column\n```\n\n**解决方案**：在实体配置中添加 `ValueGeneratedNever()`：\n\n```csharp\nbuilder.Property(x => x.Id).ValueGeneratedNever();\n```\n\n### 错误 3：迁移文件位置错误\n\n**问题**：迁移文件没有按数据库类型分离存储。\n\n**解决方案**：使用 `--output-dir` 参数明确指定目录：\n\n```powershell\n--output-dir Data/Migrations/MySql\n--output-dir Data/Migrations/SqlServer\n```\n\n---\n\n## 实用脚本\n\n### validate-migration.ps1\n\n检查迁移是否使用了正确的 DbContext：\n\n```powershell\n# 使用方式\n.\\Scripts\\validate-migration.ps1 -MigrationFile \"Data/Migrations/MySql/20260123_AddProduct.cs\"\n```\n\n### apply-migrations.ps1\n\n一键应用 MySQL 和 SQL Server 迁移：\n\n```powershell\n# 使用方式\n.\\Scripts\\apply-migrations.ps1 -ServiceName \"ExamApi\"\n```\n\n详见 [scripts/](scripts/) 目录。\n\n---\n\n## 检查清单\n\n创建迁移前：\n\n- [ ] 确认实体或配置已修改\n- [ ] 检查雪花 ID 配置（如适用）\n- [ ] 确认使用正确的 DbContext（`MySql{Service}DbContext` / `SqlServer{Service}DbContext`）\n- [ ] 确认迁移名称符合规范\n- [ ] 确认输出目录正确（`Data/Migrations/MySql` / `Data/Migrations/SqlServer`）\n\n创建迁移后：\n\n- [ ] 验证迁移文件位置正确\n- [ ] 检查数据库特定配置是否正确应用\n- [ ] 在本地开发环境测试迁移\n- [ ] 提交迁移文件到版本控制\n\n---\n\n## 最佳实践\n\n1. **始终使用数据库特定的 DbContext**：避免使用基础 DbContext 创建迁移\n2. **迁移文件分离存储**：MySQL 和 SQL Server 迁移文件分别存储\n3. **迁移名称保持一致**：同一功能的两套迁移使用相同名称\n4. **先创建后应用**：先创建迁移文件，验证无误后再应用\n5. **定期同步迁移**：确保 MySQL 和 SQL Server 迁移逻辑一致\n\n---\n\n## 示例\n\n### 示例 1：添加新实体\n\n```powershell\n# 1. 创建 Product 实体和配置\n# 2. 为 MySQL 创建迁移\ndotnet ef migrations add AddProduct `\n  --context MySqlMallDbContext `\n  --output-dir Data/Migrations/MySql\n\n# 3. 为 SQL Server 创建迁移\ndotnet ef migrations add AddProduct `\n  --context SqlServerMallDbContext `\n  --output-dir Data/Migrations/SqlServer\n\n# 4. 应用迁移\ndotnet ef database update --context MySqlMallDbContext\ndotnet ef database update --context SqlServerMallDbContext\n```\n\n### 示例 2：添加字段\n\n```powershell\n# 1. 在 Product 实体中添加 Price 字段\n# 2. 创建迁移\ndotnet ef migrations add AddPriceToProduct `\n  --context MySqlMallDbContext `\n  --output-dir Data/Migrations/MySql\n\ndotnet ef migrations add AddPriceToProduct `\n  --context SqlServerMallDbContext `\n  --output-dir Data/Migrations/SqlServer\n```\n\n---\n\n## 相关资源\n\n- [数据库规范文档](../../rules/database.mdc)\n- [迁移脚本](scripts/)\n- [迁移示例](examples.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:51:20.783Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing automated database migration capabilities for MySQL and SQL Server","zh":"非常适合需要自动化MySQL和SQL Server数据库迁移功能的全栈代理","ja":"MySQLとSQL Serverの自動データベース移行機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"MySQL과 SQL Server의 자동화된 데이터베이스 마이그레이션 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full-Stack que necesitan capacidades de migración de base de datos automatizadas para MySQL y SQL Server","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant des capacités de migration de base de données automatisées pour MySQL et SQL Server","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die automatisierte Datenbank-Migrationsfunktionen für MySQL und SQL Server benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que necessitam de capacidades de migração de banco de dados automatizadas para MySQL e SQL Server","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, которым необходимы автоматизированные возможности миграции баз данных для MySQL и SQL Server","ar":"مثالي لعميل.Full-Stack الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات هجرة قاعدة البيانات التلقائي لماي سي كيو ال و سيكوال سيرفر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage database schema changes using Entity Framework Core, enabling seamless migrations with dotnet ef commands and supporting multiple database contexts like MySqlDbContext and SqlServerDbContext","zh":"赋予代理管理数据库架构更改的能力，使用实体框架核心，实现dotnet ef命令的无缝迁移，并支持多个数据库上下文，如MySqlDbContext和SqlServerDbContext","ja":"エージェントにデータベースのスキーマ変更を管理する能力を与え、Entity Framework Coreを使用してdotnet efコマンドによるシームレスな移行を可能にし、MySqlDbContextやSqlServerDbContextのような複数のデータベースコンテキストをサポートする","ko":"에이전트에게 데이터베이스 스키마 변경을 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 엔티티 프레임워크 코어를 사용하여 dotnet ef 명령어를 통해 무결점 마이그레이션을 가능하게 하며, MySqlDbContext와 SqlServerDbContext와 같은 다중 데이터베이스 컨텍스트를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar cambios en el esquema de base de datos utilizando Entity Framework Core, lo que permite migraciones sin problemas con comandos dotnet ef y admite múltiples contextos de base de datos como MySqlDbContext y SqlServerDbContext","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les modifications du schéma de base de données à l''aide d''Entity Framework Core, ce qui permet des migrations sans problème avec des commandes dotnet ef et prend en charge plusieurs contextes de base de données comme MySqlDbContext et SqlServerDbContext","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Änderungen an der Datenbank-Schemadefinition mit Entity Framework Core zu verwalten, was eine reibungslose Migration mit dotnet ef-Befehlen ermöglicht und mehrere Datenbank-Kontexte wie MySqlDbContext und SqlServerDbContext unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar alterações no esquema do banco de dados usando Entity Framework Core, permitindo migrações sem interrupções com comandos dotnet ef e suportando vários contextos de banco de dados, como MySqlDbContext e SqlServerDbContext","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять изменениями схемы базы данных, используя Entity Framework Core, обеспечивая бесшовные миграции с помощью команд dotnet ef и поддерживая несколько контекстов баз данных, таких как MySqlDbContext и SqlServerDbContext","ar":"تمكين العميل من إدارة التغييرات في مخطط قاعدة البيانات باستخدام Entity Framework Core، مما يتيح الهجرات دون انقطاع باستخدام أوامر dotnet ef ودعم سياقات قاعدة بيانات متعددة مثل MySqlDbContext و SqlServerDbContext"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating database migrations for MySQL and SQL Server","Generating migration files with specific output directories","Managing multi-database projects with independent migration files"],"zh":["自动化MySQL和SQL Server的数据库迁移","生成具有特定输出目录的迁移文件","管理具有独立迁移文件的多数据库项目"],"ja":["MySQLとSQL Serverのデータベース移行の自動化","特定の出力ディレクトリを持つ移行ファイルの生成","独立した移行ファイルを持つ多データベースプロジェクトの管理"],"ko":["MySQL과 SQL Server의 데이터베이스 마이그레이션 자동화","특정 출력 디렉토리를 갖는 마이그레이션 파일 생성","독립적인 마이그레이션 파일을 갖는 다중 데이터베이스 프로젝트 관리"],"es":["Automatizar las migraciones de base de datos para MySQL y SQL Server","Generar archivos de migración con directorios de salida específicos","Administrar proyectos de varias bases de datos con archivos de migración independientes"],"fr":["Automatiser les migrations de base de données pour MySQL et SQL Server","Générer des fichiers de migration avec des répertoires de sortie spécifiques","Gérer des projets de plusieurs bases de données avec des fichiers de migration indépendants"],"de":["Automatisieren von Datenbank-Migrationen für MySQL und SQL Server","Erstellen von Migrationsdateien mit bestimmten Ausgabeverzeichnissen","Verwalten von Projekten mit mehreren Datenbanken und unabhängigen Migrationsdateien"],"pt":["Automatizar migrações de banco de dados para MySQL e SQL Server","Gerar arquivos de migração com diretórios de saída específicos","Gerenciar projetos de multi-banco de dados com arquivos de migração independentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать миграции баз данных для MySQL и SQL Server","Генерировать файлы миграции с конкретными выходными директориями","Управлять проектами с несколькими базами данных и независимыми файлами миграции"],"ar":["تحويل هجرات قاعدة البيانات تلقائيًا لماي سي كيو ال وسيكوال سيرفر","توليد ملفات الهجرة مع امتدادات مخرجات محددة","إدارة مشاريع قاعدة بيانات متعددة مع ملفات هجرة مستقلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET Core environment","Limited to MySQL and SQL Server databases","Needs separate migration files for each database"],"zh":[".NET Core环境的要求","仅限于MySQL和SQL Server数据库","每个数据库需要单独的迁移文件"],"ja":[".NET Core環境の要件","MySQLとSQL Serverデータベースのみの対応","各データベースに独立した移行ファイルの必要性"],"ko":[".NET Core 환경 요구","MySQL과 SQL Serverデータ베이스만 지원","각 데이터베이스에 대한 별도의 마이그레이션 파일 필요"],"es":["Requiere un entorno .NET Core","Limitado a bases de datos MySQL y SQL Server","Necesita archivos de migración separados para cada base de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement .NET Core","Limité aux bases de données MySQL et SQL Server","Nécessite des fichiers de migration séparés pour chaque base de données"],"de":["Benötigt eine .NET Core-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf MySQL- und SQL Server-Datenbanken","Benötigt separate Migrationsdateien für jede Datenbank"],"pt":["Requer ambiente .NET Core","Limitado a bancos de dados MySQL e SQL Server","Necessita de arquivos de migração separados para cada banco de dados"],"ru":["Требуется среда .NET Core","Ограничен базами данных MySQL и SQL Server","Требуются отдельные файлы миграции для каждой базы данных"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة .NET Core","محدود لقواعد البيانات ماي سي كيو ال وسيكوال سيرفر","يحتاج إلى ملفات هجرة منفصلة لكل قاعدة بيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tanepiper/teskooano/shader-sdf', 'community', 'tanepiper', 'teskooano', 'tanepiper/teskooano', 'shader-sdf', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:51:54.784Z', NULL, '{"id":"tanepiper/teskooano/shader-sdf","name":"shader-sdf","description":{"es":"Shader SDF es un simulador 3D de N-cuerpos que utiliza ThreeJS para renderizar formas complejas. Aprende a crear tus propias simulaciones con funciones de distancia firmadas","fr":"Shader SDF est un simulateur 3D de N-corps qui utilise ThreeJS pour rendre des formes complexes. Apprenez à créer vos propres simulations avec des fonctions de distance signées","de":"Shader SDF ist ein 3D-N-Körper-Simulator, der ThreeJS verwendet, um komplexe Formen zu rendern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihre eigenen Simulationen mit signierten Distanzfunktionen erstellen","pt":"O simulador 3D multi-câmera com Shader SDF é uma ferramenta poderosa para renderização em tempo real, permitindo a criação de cenas complexas e interativas","ru":"Мульти-камерный 3D-симулятор с Shader SDF является мощным инструментом для рендеринга в реальном времени, позволяющим создавать сложные и интерактивные сцены","ar":"محاكي الجسم الثلاثي الأبعاد متعددة الكاميرات مع شيدر SDF هو أداة قوية لتصيير الوقت الفعلي، مما يسمح بإنشاء مشاهد معقدة ومتفاعلة","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Shader SDF: Simulador 3D de N-cuerpos con ThreeJS","fr":"Shader SDF : Simulateur 3D N-corps avec ThreeJS","de":"Shader SDF: 3D-N-Körper-Simulator mit ThreeJS","pt":"Simulador 3D Multi-câmera com Shader SDF","ru":"Мульти-камерный 3D-симулятор с Shader SDF","ar":"محاكي الجسم الثلاثي الأبعاد متعددة الكاميرات مع شيدر SDF","en":"shader-sdf"},"description":{"es":"Shader SDF es un simulador 3D de N-cuerpos que utiliza ThreeJS para renderizar formas complejas. Aprende a crear tus propias simulaciones con funciones de di...","fr":"Shader SDF est un simulateur 3D de N-corps qui utilise ThreeJS pour rendre des formes complexes. Apprenez à créer vos propres simulations avec des fonctions ...","de":"Shader SDF ist ein 3D-N-Körper-Simulator, der ThreeJS verwendet, um komplexe Formen zu rendern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihre eigenen Simulationen mit signierte...","pt":"O simulador 3D multi-câmera com Shader SDF é uma ferramenta poderosa para renderização em tempo real, permitindo a criação de cenas complexas e interativas","ru":"Мульти-камерный 3D-симулятор с Shader SDF является мощным инструментом для рендеринга в реальном времени, позволяющим создавать сложные и интерактивные сцены","ar":"محاكي الجسم الثلاثي الأبعاد متعددة الكاميرات مع شيدر SDF هو أداة قوية لتصيير الوقت الفعلي، مما يسمح بإنشاء مشاهد معقدة ومتفاعلة","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"definition":{"en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"features":{"es":["Simulación 3D de N-cuerpos","Uso de funciones de distancia firmadas","Renderizado con ThreeJS","Creación de formas complejas","Personalización de la simulación"],"fr":["Simulation 3D de N-corps","Utilisation de fonctions de distance signées","Rendu avec ThreeJS","Création de formes complexes","Personnalisation de la simulation"],"de":["3D-N-Körper-Simulation","Verwendung signierter Distanzfunktionen","Rendern mit ThreeJS","Erstellung komplexer Formen","Anpassung der Simulation"],"pt":["Simulação 3D multi-câmera","Renderização em tempo real","Funções de distância assinada para formas complexas","Criação de cenas interativas","Suporte a múltiplas câmeras"],"ru":["Мульти-камерная 3D-симуляция","Рендеринг в реальном времени","Функции подписанной дистанции для сложных форм","Создание интерактивных сцен","Поддержка нескольких камер"],"ar":["محاكاة الجسم الثلاثي الأبعاد متعددة الكاميرات","التصيير في الوقت الفعلي","دوال المسافة الموقعة لأشكال معقدة","إنشاء مشاهد متفاعلة","دعم الكاميرات المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"es":["Shader SDF","Simulación 3D","N-cuerpos","ThreeJS","Funciones de distancia firmadas","Renderizado","Formas complejas","Desarrollo de juegos"],"fr":["Shader SDF","Simulation 3D","N-corps","ThreeJS","Fonctions de distance signées","Rendu","Formes complexes","Développement de jeux"],"de":["Shader SDF","3D-Simulation","N-Körper","ThreeJS","Signierte Distanzfunktionen","Rendern","Komplexe Formen","Spielentwicklung"],"pt":["Shader SDF","Simulador 3D","Renderização em tempo real","Funções de distância assinada","Criação de cenas interativas","Desenvolvimento de jogos","Realidade virtual"],"ru":["Shader SDF","3D-симулятор","Рендеринг в реальном времени","Функции подписанной дистанции","Создание интерактивных сцен","Разработка игр","Виртуальная реальность"],"ar":["شيدر SDF","محاكي الجسم الثلاثي الأبعاد","التصيير في الوقت الفعلي","دوال المسافة الموقعة","إنشاء مشاهد متفاعلة","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shader-sdf","description":"Signed Distance Functions (SDFs) in GLSL—2D/3D shape primitives, boolean operations (union, intersection, subtraction), smooth blending, repetition, and raymarching fundamentals. Use when creating procedural shapes, text effects, smooth morphing, or raymarched 3D scenes.","bodyPreview":"# Shader SDFs\n\nSigned Distance Functions return the distance from a point to a shape''s surface. Negative = inside, positive = outside, zero = on surface.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```glsl\n// 2D circle SDF\nfloat sdCircle(vec2 p, float r) {\n  return length(p) - r;\n}\n\n// Usage\nfloat d = sdCircle(uv - 0.5, 0.3);\n\n// Render\nvec3 color = d < 0.0 ? vec3(1.0) : vec3(0.0);           // Hard edge\nvec3 color = vec3(smoothstep(0.01, 0.0, d));            // Soft edge\nvec3 color = vec3(smoothstep(0.02, 0.0, abs(d)));","body":"# Shader SDFs\n\nSigned Distance Functions return the distance from a point to a shape''s surface. Negative = inside, positive = outside, zero = on surface.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```glsl\n// 2D circle SDF\nfloat sdCircle(vec2 p, float r) {\n  return length(p) - r;\n}\n\n// Usage\nfloat d = sdCircle(uv - 0.5, 0.3);\n\n// Render\nvec3 color = d < 0.0 ? vec3(1.0) : vec3(0.0);           // Hard edge\nvec3 color = vec3(smoothstep(0.01, 0.0, d));            // Soft edge\nvec3 color = vec3(smoothstep(0.02, 0.0, abs(d)));       // Outline\n```\n\n## 2D Primitives\n\n### Circle\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdCircle(vec2 p, float r) {\n  return length(p) - r;\n}\n```\n\n### Box\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdBox(vec2 p, vec2 b) {\n  vec2 d = abs(p) - b;\n  return length(max(d, 0.0)) + min(max(d.x, d.y), 0.0);\n}\n```\n\n### Rounded Box\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdRoundedBox(vec2 p, vec2 b, float r) {\n  vec2 d = abs(p) - b + r;\n  return length(max(d, 0.0)) + min(max(d.x, d.y), 0.0) - r;\n}\n```\n\n### Line Segment\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdSegment(vec2 p, vec2 a, vec2 b) {\n  vec2 pa = p - a;\n  vec2 ba = b - a;\n  float h = clamp(dot(pa, ba) / dot(ba, ba), 0.0, 1.0);\n  return length(pa - ba * h);\n}\n```\n\n### Triangle\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdTriangle(vec2 p, vec2 p0, vec2 p1, vec2 p2) {\n  vec2 e0 = p1 - p0, e1 = p2 - p1, e2 = p0 - p2;\n  vec2 v0 = p - p0, v1 = p - p1, v2 = p - p2;\n  vec2 pq0 = v0 - e0 * clamp(dot(v0, e0) / dot(e0, e0), 0.0, 1.0);\n  vec2 pq1 = v1 - e1 * clamp(dot(v1, e1) / dot(e1, e1), 0.0, 1.0);\n  vec2 pq2 = v2 - e2 * clamp(dot(v2, e2) / dot(e2, e2), 0.0, 1.0);\n  float s = sign(e0.x * e2.y - e0.y * e2.x);\n  vec2 d = min(min(\n    vec2(dot(pq0, pq0), s * (v0.x * e0.y - v0.y * e0.x)),\n    vec2(dot(pq1, pq1), s * (v1.x * e1.y - v1.y * e1.x))),\n    vec2(dot(pq2, pq2), s * (v2.x * e2.y - v2.y * e2.x)));\n  return -sqrt(d.x) * sign(d.y);\n}\n```\n\n### Ring\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdRing(vec2 p, float r, float thickness) {\n  return abs(length(p) - r) - thickness;\n}\n```\n\n### Polygon (N-sided)\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdPolygon(vec2 p, float r, int n) {\n  float a = atan(p.x, p.y) + 3.141592;\n  float s = 6.283185 / float(n);\n  return cos(floor(0.5 + a / s) * s - a) * length(p) - r;\n}\n```\n\n### Star\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdStar(vec2 p, float r, int n, float m) {\n  float an = 3.141592 / float(n);\n  float en = 3.141592 / m;\n  vec2 acs = vec2(cos(an), sin(an));\n  vec2 ecs = vec2(cos(en), sin(en));\n\n  float bn = mod(atan(p.x, p.y), 2.0 * an) - an;\n  p = length(p) * vec2(cos(bn), abs(sin(bn)));\n  p -= r * acs;\n  p += ecs * clamp(-dot(p, ecs), 0.0, r * acs.y / ecs.y);\n\n  return length(p) * sign(p.x);\n}\n```\n\n## 3D Primitives\n\n### Sphere\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdSphere(vec3 p, float r) {\n  return length(p) - r;\n}\n```\n\n### Box\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdBox(vec3 p, vec3 b) {\n  vec3 q = abs(p) - b;\n  return length(max(q, 0.0)) + min(max(q.x, max(q.y, q.z)), 0.0);\n}\n```\n\n### Rounded Box\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdRoundBox(vec3 p, vec3 b, float r) {\n  vec3 q = abs(p) - b;\n  return length(max(q, 0.0)) + min(max(q.x, max(q.y, q.z)), 0.0) - r;\n}\n```\n\n### Cylinder\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdCylinder(vec3 p, float h, float r) {\n  vec2 d = abs(vec2(length(p.xz), p.y)) - vec2(r, h);\n  return min(max(d.x, d.y), 0.0) + length(max(d, 0.0));\n}\n```\n\n### Torus\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdTorus(vec3 p, vec2 t) {\n  vec2 q = vec2(length(p.xz) - t.x, p.y);\n  return length(q) - t.y;\n}\n```\n\n### Cone\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdCone(vec3 p, vec2 c, float h) {\n  vec2 q = h * vec2(c.x / c.y, -1.0);\n  vec2 w = vec2(length(p.xz), p.y);\n  vec2 a = w - q * clamp(dot(w, q) / dot(q, q), 0.0, 1.0);\n  vec2 b = w - q * vec2(clamp(w.x / q.x, 0.0, 1.0), 1.0);\n  float k = sign(q.y);\n  float d = min(dot(a, a), dot(b, b));\n  float s = max(k * (w.x * q.y - w.y * q.x), k * (w.y - q.y));\n  return sqrt(d) * sign(s);\n}\n```\n\n### Capsule\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdCapsule(vec3 p, vec3 a, vec3 b, float r) {\n  vec3 pa = p - a, ba = b - a;\n  float h = clamp(dot(pa, ba) / dot(ba, ba), 0.0, 1.0);\n  return length(pa - ba * h) - r;\n}\n```\n\n### Plane\n\n```glsl\nfloat sdPlane(vec3 p, vec3 n, float h) {\n  return dot(p, n) + h;\n}\n```\n\n## Boolean Operations\n\n### Union (OR)\n\n```glsl\nfloat opUnion(float d1, float d2) {\n  return min(d1, d2);\n}\n```\n\n### Intersection (AND)\n\n```glsl\nfloat opIntersection(float d1, float d2) {\n  return max(d1, d2);\n}\n```\n\n### Subtraction (NOT)\n\n```glsl\nfloat opSubtraction(float d1, float d2) {\n  return max(-d1, d2);\n}\n```\n\n### Smooth Union\n\n```glsl\nfloat opSmoothUnion(float d1, float d2, float k) {\n  float h = clamp(0.5 + 0.5 * (d2 - d1) / k, 0.0, 1.0);\n  return mix(d2, d1, h) - k * h * (1.0 - h);\n}\n```\n\n### Smooth Intersection\n\n```glsl\nfloat opSmoothIntersection(float d1, float d2, float k) {\n  float h = clamp(0.5 - 0.5 * (d2 - d1) / k, 0.0, 1.0);\n  return mix(d2, d1, h) + k * h * (1.0 - h);\n}\n```\n\n### Smooth Subtraction\n\n```glsl\nfloat opSmoothSubtraction(float d1, float d2, float k) {\n  float h = clamp(0.5 - 0.5 * (d2 + d1) / k, 0.0, 1.0);\n  return mix(d2, -d1, h) + k * h * (1.0 - h);\n}\n```\n\n## Transformations\n\n### Translation\n\n```glsl\n// Move shape by offset\nfloat d = sdCircle(p - offset, r);\n```\n\n### Rotation (2D)\n\n```glsl\nmat2 rot2D(float a) {\n  float s = sin(a), c = cos(a);\n  return mat2(c, -s, s, c);\n}\n\n// Rotate point around origin\nvec2 rotatedP = rot2D(angle) * p;\nfloat d = sdBox(rotatedP, size);\n```\n\n### Rotation (3D)\n\n```glsl\nmat3 rotateX(float a) {\n  float s = sin(a), c = cos(a);\n  return mat3(1, 0, 0, 0, c, -s, 0, s, c);\n}\n\nmat3 rotateY(float a) {\n  float s = sin(a), c = cos(a);\n  return mat3(c, 0, s, 0, 1, 0, -s, 0, c);\n}\n\nmat3 rotateZ(float a) {\n  float s = sin(a), c = cos(a);\n  return mat3(c, -s, 0, s, c, 0, 0, 0, 1);\n}\n```\n\n### Scale\n\n```glsl\n// Scale shape\nfloat d = sdCircle(p / scale, r) * scale;\n```\n\n### Symmetry\n\n```glsl\n// Mirror across Y axis\np.x = abs(p.x);\nfloat d = sdCircle(p - vec2(0.3, 0.0), 0.1);\n```\n\n## Domain Operations\n\n### Repetition (Infinite)\n\n```glsl\nfloat opRepeat(vec2 p, vec2 spacing) {\n  vec2 q = mod(p + spacing * 0.5, spacing) - spacing * 0.5;\n  return sdCircle(q, 0.1);\n}\n```\n\n### Repetition (Limited)\n\n```glsl\nfloat opRepeatLimited(vec3 p, float spacing, vec3 count) {\n  vec3 q = p - spacing * clamp(round(p / spacing), -count, count);\n  return sdSphere(q, 0.1);\n}\n```\n\n### Twist\n\n```glsl\nfloat opTwist(vec3 p, float k) {\n  float c = cos(k * p.y);\n  float s = sin(k * p.y);\n  mat2 m = mat2(c, -s, s, c);\n  vec3 q = vec3(m * p.xz, p.y);\n  return sdBox(q, vec3(0.5));\n}\n```\n\n### Bend\n\n```glsl\nfloat opBend(vec3 p, float k) {\n  float c = cos(k * p.x);\n  float s = sin(k * p.x);\n  mat2 m = mat2(c, -s, s, c);\n  vec3 q = vec3(m * p.xy, p.z);\n  return sdBox(q, vec3(0.5));\n}\n```\n\n### Onion (Hollow)\n\n```glsl\nfloat opOnion(float d, float thickness) {\n  return abs(d) - thickness;\n}\n```\n\n### Round\n\n```glsl\nfloat opRound(float d, float r) {\n  return d - r;\n}\n```\n\n## 2D Rendering Techniques\n\n### Anti-aliased Edge\n\n```glsl\nfloat aa = fwidth(d) * 1.5;\nfloat mask = smoothstep(aa, -aa, d);\n```\n\n### Outline\n\n```glsl\nfloat outline = smoothstep(thickness + aa, thickness - aa, abs(d));\n```\n\n### Glow\n\n```glsl\nfloat glow = exp(-d * falloff);\n```\n\n### Drop Shadow\n\n```glsl\nfloat shadow = smoothstep(0.0, blur, sdShape(p - shadowOffset));\n```\n\n## 3D Raymarching (Basic)\n\n```glsl\nfloat map(vec3 p) {\n  float d = sdSphere(p, 1.0);\n  d = opSmoothUnion(d, sdBox(p - vec3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), vec3(0.5)), 0.2);\n  return d;\n}\n\nvec3 calcNormal(vec3 p) {\n  vec2 e = vec2(0.001, 0.0);\n  return normalize(vec3(\n    map(p + e.xyy) - map(p - e.xyy),\n    map(p + e.yxy) - map(p - e.yxy),\n    map(p + e.yyx) - map(p - e.yyx)\n  ));\n}\n\nfloat raymarch(vec3 ro, vec3 rd) {\n  float t = 0.0;\n  for (int i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\n    vec3 p = ro + rd * t;\n    float d = map(p);\n    if (d < 0.001) break;\n    if (t > 100.0) break;\n    t += d;\n  }\n  return t;\n}\n\nvoid mainImage(out vec4 fragColor, in vec2 fragCoord) {\n  vec2 uv = (fragCoord - 0.5 * iResolution.xy) / iResolution.y;\n\n  vec3 ro = vec3(0.0, 0.0, 3.0);  // Ray origin\n  vec3 rd = normalize(vec3(uv, -1.0));  // Ray direction\n\n  float t = raymarch(ro, rd);\n\n  vec3 color = vec3(0.0);\n  if (t < 100.0) {\n    vec3 p = ro + rd * t;\n    vec3 n = calcNormal(p);\n    vec3 light = normalize(vec3(1.0, 1.0, 1.0));\n    float diff = max(dot(n, light), 0.0);\n    color = vec3(diff);\n  }\n\n  fragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n}\n```\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\nshader-sdf/\n├── SKILL.md\n├── references/\n│   ├── 2d-primitives.md      # All 2D shapes\n│   ├── 3d-primitives.md      # All 3D shapes\n│   └── operations.md         # All operations\n└── scripts/\n    ├── primitives/\n    │   ├── 2d.glsl           # 2D shape functions\n    │   └── 3d.glsl           # 3D shape functions\n    ├── operations.glsl       # Boolean & domain ops\n    └── examples/\n        ├── logo.glsl         # 2D logo example\n        └── raymarch.glsl     # 3D raymarching example\n```\n\n## Reference\n\n- `references/2d-primitives.md` — Complete 2D shape library\n- `references/3d-primitives.md` — Complete 3D shape library\n- `references/operations.md` — All boolean and domain operations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:51:54.784Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for 3D Visualization Agents needing to generate and manipulate complex signed distance fields for real-time rendering.","zh":"适合需要生成和操作复杂有符号距离场的3D可视化代理，用于实时渲染。","ja":"3Dビジュアライゼーションエージェントがリアルタイムレンダリングのために複雑な符号付き距離フィールドを生成および操作する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"실시간 렌더링을 위해 복잡한 서명된 거리 필드를 생성 및 조작해야 하는 3D 시각화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de visualización 3D que necesitan generar y manipular campos de distancia firmados complejos para renderizado en tiempo real.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de visualisation 3D ayant besoin de générer et de manipuler des champs de distance signés complexes pour un rendu en temps réel.","de":"Ideal für 3D-Visualisierungsagenten, die komplexe signierte Distanzfelder für Echtzeit-Rendering erstellen und manipulieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Visualização 3D que precisam gerar e manipular campos de distância assinados complexos para renderização em tempo real.","ru":"Идеально для агентов 3D-визуализации, которым необходимо генерировать и манипулировать сложными подписанными полями расстояний для рендеринга в реальном времени.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المرئية ثلاثية الأبعاد الذين يحتاجون إلى生成 وحوصل حقول المسافة الموقعة المعقدة للتحويل في الوقت الفعلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to programmatically construct and render 3D scenes using GLSL SDFs within a Three.js environment. It provides direct access to multi-camera setups and N-body simulation capabilities for creating dynamic visualizations.","zh":"使代理能够在Three.js环境中使用GLSL SDF编程构建和渲染3D场景。它提供了直接访问多相机设置和N体模拟功能，以创建动态可视化。","ja":"エージェントがThree.js環境内でGLSL SDFを使用して3Dシーンをプログラム的に構築およびレンダリングできるようにします。マルチカメラ設定やN体シミュレーション機能への直接アクセスを提供し、ダイナミックな可視化を作成できます。","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js 환경 내에서 GLSL SDF를 사용하여 3D 장면을 프로그래밍 방식으로 구축 및 렌더링 할 수 있도록 합니다. 다중 카메라 설정 및 N-체 시뮬레이션 기능에 대한 직접 액세스를 제공하여 동적 시각화를 생성합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes construir y renderizar escenas 3D de forma programática utilizando SDF de GLSL en un entorno Three.js. Proporciona acceso directo a configuraciones de multicámara y capacidades de simulación N-cuerpos para crear visualizaciones dinámicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire et de rendre des scènes 3D de manière programmatique en utilisant des SDF GLSL dans un environnement Three.js. Il fournit un accès direct aux configurations de multicaméra et aux capacités de simulation N-corps pour créer des visualisations dynamiques.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, 3D-Szenen programmgesteuert mit GLSL-SDF in einer Three.js-Umgebung zu erstellen und zu rendern. Bietet direkten Zugriff auf Multikamera-Setups und N-Körper-Simulationsfunktionen für die Erstellung dynamischer Visualisierungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes construam e renderizem cenas 3D programaticamente usando SDFs GLSL em um ambiente Three.js. Ele fornece acesso direto a configurações de multicâmera e capacidades de simulação N-corpo para criar visualizações dinâmicas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам программно строить и рендерить 3D-сцены с помощью SDF GLSL в среде Three.js. Он обеспечивает прямой доступ к настройкам нескольких камер и возможностям симуляции N-тела для создания динамических визуализаций.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من بناء وتحويل المشاهد ثلاثية الأبعاد برمجيًا باستخدام SDFs GLSL في بيئة Three.js. يوفر وصولًا مباشرًا إلى إعدادات الكاميرا المتعددة وقدرات محاكاة N-جسم لإنشاء تصورات ديناميكية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating real-time 3D visualizations for physics simulations","Prototyping complex SDF shapes for shader development","Creating interactive N-body gravitational simulations","Rendering soft-edge and hard-edge SDF visualizations with smoothstep"],"zh":["为物理模拟生成实时3D可视化","为着色器开发原型化复杂的SDF形状","创建交互式N体引力模拟","使用smoothstep渲染软边缘和硬边缘SDF可视化"],"ja":["物理シミュレーションのためのリアルタイム3Dビジュアライゼーションを生成する","シェーダ開発のための複雑なSDF形状のプロトタイピング","インタラクティブなN体重力シミュレーションを作成する","smoothstepを使用してソフトエッジとハードエッジのSDFビジュアライゼーションをレンダリングする"],"ko":["물리 시뮬레이션을 위한 실시간 3D 시각화를 생성하는 것","쉐이더 개발을 위한 복잡한 SDF 모양의 프로토 타이핑","대화형 N-체 중력 시뮬레이션을 생성하는 것","smoothstep를 사용하여 소프트 에지 및 하드 에지 SDF 시각화를 렌더링하는 것"],"es":["Generar visualizaciones 3D en tiempo real para simulaciones de física","Prototipado de formas SDF complejas para el desarrollo de sombreadores","Creación de simulaciones gravitacionales interactivas N-cuerpo","Representación de visualizaciones SDF con bordes suaves y bordes duros con smoothstep"],"fr":["Générer des visualisations 3D en temps réel pour des simulations de physique","Prototyper des formes SDF complexes pour le développement de sombreurs","Créer des simulations gravitationnelles interactives N-corps","Rendu de visualisations SDF avec des bords doux et des bords durs avec smoothstep"],"de":["Erstellen von Echtzeit-3D-Visualisierungen für Physiksimulationen","Prototyping komplexer SDF-Formen für die Entwicklung von Shadern","Erstellung interaktiver N-Körper-Schweresimulations","Rendering von SDF-Visualisierungen mit weichen und harten Kanten mit Smoothstep"],"pt":["Geração de visualizações 3D em tempo real para simulações de física","Prototipagem de formas SDF complexas para desenvolvimento de sombreadores","Criação de simulações gravitacionais interativas de N-corpo","Renderização de visualizações SDF com bordos macios e duros com smoothstep"],"ru":["Генерация визуализаций 3D в реальном времени для физических симуляций","Прототипирование сложных форм SDF для разработки шейдеров","Создание интерактивных гравитационных симуляций N-тела","Рендеринг визуализаций SDF с мягкими и жёсткими краями с помощью smoothstep"],"ar":["توليد تصورات ثلاثية الأبعاد في الوقت الفعلي لمحاكاة الفيزياء","نماذج أولية لأشكال SDF المعقدة لتطوير المظلل","إنشاء محاكاة جاذبية تفاعلية للجسم N","تحويل تصورات SDF ذات الحواف الناعمة والقاسية مع smoothstep"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WebGL and Three.js environment","GLSL shader expertise needed for advanced modifications","Limited to SDF-based rendering techniques"],"zh":["需要WebGL和Three.js环境","需要GLSL着色器专长进行高级修改","仅限SDF基于渲染技术"],"ja":["WebGLとThree.js環境が必要","高度な変更にはGLSLシェーダーの専門知識が必要","SDFベースのレンダリング技術のみ"],"ko":["WebGL 및 Three.js 환경이 필요합니다.","고급 수정에는 GLSL 셰이더 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","SDF 기반 렌더링 기술만 해당"],"es":["Requiere un entorno WebGL y Three.js","Se necesita experiencia en sombreadores GLSL para modificaciones avanzadas","Limitado a técnicas de renderizado basadas en SDF"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement WebGL et Three.js","Une expertise en sombreurs GLSL est nécessaire pour des modifications avancées","Limité aux techniques de rendu basées sur SDF"],"de":["Benötigt eine WebGL- und Three.js-Umgebung","GLSL-Shader-Expertenwissen wird für erweiterte Modifikationen benötigt","Begrenzt auf SDF-basierte Rendering-Techniken"],"pt":["Requer ambiente WebGL e Three.js","É necessária especialização em sombreadores GLSL para modificações avançadas","Limitado a técnicas de renderização baseadas em SDF"],"ru":["Требуется среда WebGL и Three.js","Требуется экспертиза в шейдерах GLSL для продвинутых модификаций","Ограничен техниками рендеринга на основе SDF"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة WebGL و Three.js","يتطلب خبرة في المظلل GLSL للتعديلات المتقدمة","محدود بالتقنيات التي تعتمد على SDF للتحويل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('konecty/Konecty/codigo-limpo', 'community', 'konecty', 'Konecty', 'konecty/Konecty', 'codigo-limpo', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:51:46.213Z', NULL, '{"id":"konecty/Konecty/codigo-limpo","name":"codigo-limpo","description":{"zh":"Konecty代码整洁原则旨在提升代码质量和可维护性，包括KISS和YAGNI等原则","ja":"Konectyのコードクリーニングは、コードの品質とメンテナンス性を向上させるための原則です","ko":"Konecty의 코드 리팩토링 원칙은 코드 품질과 유지 보수성을 향상시키기 위한 가이드라인입니다","pt":"O Código Limpo é uma abordagem de desenvolvimento que visa criar código simples, legível e fácil de manter","ru":"Чистый Код - это подход к разработке, направленный на создание простого, читаемого и легко поддерживаемого кода","ar":"الكود النقي هو نهج تطوير يهدف إلى إنشاء كود بسيط وقابل للقراءة وسهل الصيانة","en":"Konecty Open source Tech Business Platform"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Konecty代码整洁原则","ja":"Konectyコードクリーニング","ko":"Konecty 코드 리팩토링","pt":"Código Limpo: Princípios para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Чистый Код: Принципы для Разработчиков","ar":"كود نقي: مبادئ للمطورين","en":"codigo-limpo"},"description":{"zh":"Konecty代码整洁原则旨在提升代码质量和可维护性，包括KISS和YAGNI等原则","ja":"Konectyのコードクリーニングは、コードの品質とメンテナンス性を向上させるための原則です","ko":"Konecty의 코드 리팩토링 원칙은 코드 품질과 유지 보수성을 향상시키기 위한 가이드라인입니다","pt":"O Código Limpo é uma abordagem de desenvolvimento que visa criar código simples, legível e fácil de manter","ru":"Чистый Код - это подход к разработке, направленный на создание простого, читаемого и легко поддерживаемого кода","ar":"الكود النقي هو نهج تطوير يهدف إلى إنشاء كود بسيط وقابل للقراءة وسهل الصيانة","en":"Konecty Open source Tech Business Platform"},"definition":{"en":"Konecty Open source Tech Business Platform"},"features":{"zh":["KISS（Keep It Simple, Stupid）原则","YAGNI（You Aren''t Gonna Need It）原则","简单直接的逻辑","避免过早的抽象","优化代码可读性"],"ja":["KISS（Keep It Simple, Stupid）原則","YAGNI（You Aren''t Gonna Need It）原則","簡単なロジック","抽象化の遅延","コードの可読性の向上"],"ko":["KISS（Keep It Simple, Stupid）원칙","YAGNI（You Aren''t Gonna Need It）원칙","단순하고 직접적인 논리","추상화의 지연","코드의 가독성 향상"],"pt":["Princípio KISS (Keep It Simple, Stupid)","Princípio YAGNI (You Aren''t Gonna Need It)","Código simples e legível","Lógica direta e fácil de entender","Evite abstrações prematuras"],"ru":["Принцип KISS (Keep It Simple, Stupid)","Принцип YAGNI (You Aren''t Gonna Need It)","Простой и читаемый код","Прямая и легко понимаемая логика","Избегайте преждевременных абстракций"],"ar":["مبدأ KISS (Keep It Simple, Stupid)","مبدأ YAGNI (You Aren''t Gonna Need It)","كود بسيط وقابل للقراءة","منطق مباشر وسهل الفهم","تجنب الاستهلاك المبكر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码整洁","Konecty","KISS","YAGNI","代码质量","可维护性","软件开发原则"],"ja":["コードクリーニング","Konecty","KISS","YAGNI","コード品質","メンテナンス性","ソフトウェア開発原則"],"ko":["코드 리팩토링","Konecty","KISS","YAGNI","코드 품질","유지 보수성","소프트웨어 개발 원칙"],"pt":["código limpo","desenvolvimento de software","princípios de desenvolvimento","KISS","YAGNI","código simples","legibilidade de código"],"ru":["чистый код","разработка программного обеспечения","принципы разработки","KISS","YAGNI","простой код","читаемость кода"],"ar":["كود نقي","تطوير البرمجيات","مبادئ التطوير","KISS","YAGNI","كود بسيط","قابلية قراءة الكود"]}},"owner":"konecty","repo":"Konecty","repoPath":"konecty/Konecty","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"codigo-limpo","description":"Princípios e padrões de código limpo para o projeto Konecty backend. Aplica KISS, YAGNI, DRY, SOLID, prefer-const, programação funcional, p-limit para concorrência e error handling centralizado. Use ao gerar ou revisar código Node.js/TypeScript backend.","bodyPreview":"# Código Limpo - Konecty Backend\n\n## Princípios Fundamentais\n\n### KISS (Keep It Simple, Stupid)\n**Mantenha simples.** Simplicidade é a maior sofisticação.\n\n- Funções com uma responsabilidade clara\n- Lógica direta e fácil de entender\n- Evite abstrações prematuras\n- Se parece complexo, provavelmente está errado\n\n### YAGNI (You Aren''t Gonna Need It)\n**Não implemente o que não precisa agora.**\n\n- Resolva o problema atual, não problemas futuros hipotéticos\n- Adicionar complexidade só quando comprovad","body":"# Código Limpo - Konecty Backend\n\n## Princípios Fundamentais\n\n### KISS (Keep It Simple, Stupid)\n**Mantenha simples.** Simplicidade é a maior sofisticação.\n\n- Funções com uma responsabilidade clara\n- Lógica direta e fácil de entender\n- Evite abstrações prematuras\n- Se parece complexo, provavelmente está errado\n\n### YAGNI (You Aren''t Gonna Need It)\n**Não implemente o que não precisa agora.**\n\n- Resolva o problema atual, não problemas futuros hipotéticos\n- Adicionar complexidade só quando comprovadamente necessária\n- É mais fácil adicionar depois do que remover agora\n\n### DRY (Don''t Repeat Yourself)\n**Não se repita.**\n\n- Extraia lógica duplicada em funções/módulos\n- Use middlewares para lógica compartilhada\n- Constantes em arquivos de configuração\n\n### SOLID\n**Single Responsibility, Open/Closed, Liskov Substitution, Interface Segregation, Dependency Inversion**\n\n- **S**: Um módulo/função = uma responsabilidade\n- **O**: Aberto para extensão, fechado para modificação\n- **L**: Subtipos devem ser substituíveis por seus tipos base\n- **I**: Interfaces pequenas e específicas\n- **D**: Dependa de abstrações, não de implementações concretas\n\n---\n\n## Regras de Código\n\n### 1. prefer-const\n**Sempre use `const`, nunca `let`** (exceto quando mutação é necessária).\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Errado\nlet users = [];\nfor (let i = 0; i < results.length; i++) {\n  users.push(results[i]);\n}\n\n// ✅ Correto\nconst users = results.map(result => result);\n```\n\n**Por quê?**\n- Previne mutações acidentais\n- Código mais previsível\n- Facilita debugging\n\n### 2. Programação Funcional\n**Use `map`, `reduce`, `filter`, `flatMap` ao invés de `for` loops.**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Errado\nlet activeUsers = [];\nfor (let i = 0; i < users.length; i++) {\n  if (users[i].active) {\n    activeUsers.push(users[i].id);\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ Correto\nconst activeUsers = users\n  .filter(user => user.active)\n  .map(user => user.id);\n```\n\n**Por quê?**\n- Mais expressivo e declarativo\n- Menos propenso a erros\n- Melhor para composição\n\n### 3. Evitar while(true)\n**Nunca use `while(true)`.** Prefira recursão ou condições explícitas.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Errado\nwhile (true) {\n  const job = await queue.getNext();\n  if (!job) break;\n  await processJob(job);\n}\n\n// ✅ Correto (Recursivo)\nconst processQueue = async (): Promise<void> => {\n  const job = await queue.getNext();\n  if (!job) return;\n  await processJob(job);\n  return processQueue();\n};\n\n// ✅ Correto (Iterativo com condição explícita)\nlet hasMoreJobs = true;\nwhile (hasMoreJobs) {\n  const job = await queue.getNext();\n  hasMoreJobs = job !== null;\n  if (hasMoreJobs) {\n    await processJob(job);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. no-magic-numbers\n**Todos os números devem ser constantes nomeadas.**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Errado\nif (users.length > 100) {\n  await sendEmail(admin, ''Too many users'');\n}\nsetTimeout(retry, 5000);\n\n// ✅ Correto\nconst MAX_USERS_BEFORE_ALERT = 100;\nconst RETRY_DELAY_MS = 5000;\n\nif (users.length > MAX_USERS_BEFORE_ALERT) {\n  await sendEmail(admin, ''Too many users'');\n}\nsetTimeout(retry, RETRY_DELAY_MS);\n```\n\n**Constantes Comuns:**\n```typescript\n// Tempo\nconst MILLISECONDS_PER_SECOND = 1000;\nconst SECONDS_PER_MINUTE = 60;\nconst MINUTES_PER_HOUR = 60;\nconst HOURS_PER_DAY = 24;\n\n// Database\nconst DEFAULT_PAGE_SIZE = 20;\nconst MAX_PAGE_SIZE = 100;\nconst CONNECTION_POOL_SIZE = 10;\n\n// API\nconst DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_MS = 30_000;\nconst MAX_RETRIES = 3;\nconst RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE = 60;\n```\n\n### 5. Controle de Concorrência Assíncrona\n\n> ⚠️ **Nota**: Bluebird está deprecated em 2026. Use alternativas modernas abaixo.\n\n**Problema**: Executar múltiplas operações assíncronas com controle de paralelismo.\n\n#### Opção 1: p-limit (Recomendada)\n\n```typescript\nimport pLimit from ''p-limit'';\n\nconst API_CONCURRENCY = 5;\n\nconst sendEmails = async (users: User[]): Promise<void> => {\n  const limit = pLimit(API_CONCURRENCY);\n  \n  await Promise.all(\n    users.map(user => limit(() => sendEmail(user)))\n  );\n};\n```\n\n**Vantagens**: Simples, mantido, funcional puro.\n\n#### Opção 2: Chunking Funcional (Sem Dependências)\n\n```typescript\nconst chunk = <T>(array: T[], size: number): T[][] =>\n  Array.from(\n    { length: Math.ceil(array.length / size) },\n    (_, index) => array.slice(index * size, (index + 1) * size)\n  );\n\nconst DB_BATCH_SIZE = 10;\n\nconst processDocuments = async (docs: Document[]): Promise<void> => {\n  const chunks = chunk(docs, DB_BATCH_SIZE);\n  \n  await chunks.reduce(\n    async (previousBatch, currentChunk) => {\n      await previousBatch;\n      return Promise.all(currentChunk.map(processDoc));\n    },\n    Promise.resolve([])\n  );\n};\n```\n\n**Vantagens**: Sem dependências, funcional.\n\n#### Opção 3: Bluebird (Legado - Deprecated)\n\n```typescript\n// ⚠️ NÃO USE EM CÓDIGO NOVO - Apenas para manutenção de código legado\nimport Bluebird from ''bluebird'';\n\nconst CONCURRENCY_LIMIT = 5;\nawait Bluebird.map(users, sendEmail, { concurrency: CONCURRENCY_LIMIT });\n```\n\n#### Limites de Concorrência Recomendados\n\n```typescript\n// Operações de Banco de Dados\nconst DB_CONCURRENCY = 10;\n\n// Chamadas de API Externa\nconst API_CONCURRENCY = 5;\n\n// Operações de I/O (arquivos)\nconst IO_CONCURRENCY = 3;\n\n// Processamento Pesado (CPU-bound)\nconst CPU_CONCURRENCY = 2;\n```\n\n#### Comparação\n\n| Opção | Prós | Contras | Quando Usar |\n|-------|------|---------|-------------|\n| **p-limit** | Simples, mantido | Dependência externa | Padrão para novo código |\n| **Chunking** | Sem deps, funcional | Mais verbose | Projetos sem dependências extras |\n| **Bluebird** | - | Deprecated | Apenas código legado |\n\n**Quando aplicar controle de concorrência:**\n- ✅ Processar múltiplos documentos do DB\n- ✅ Fazer múltiplas chamadas HTTP\n- ✅ Processar múltiplos arquivos\n- ❌ Operações muito rápidas (< 10ms)\n- ❌ Já existe controle no destino (pool do DB)\n\n---\n\n## Padrões Node.js/TypeScript Backend\n\n### Async/Await\n**Sempre prefira async/await sobre callbacks.**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Evite callbacks\ndb.find({ active: true }, (err, users) => {\n  if (err) return handleError(err);\n  processUsers(users);\n});\n\n// ✅ Use async/await\nconst findActiveUsers = async (): Promise<User[]> => {\n  try {\n    const users = await db.find({ active: true });\n    return users;\n  } catch (error) {\n    handleError(error);\n    throw error;\n  }\n};\n```\n\n### Interfaces e Types\n**Sempre defina tipos para parâmetros e retornos.**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Sem tipagem\nconst processUser = async (id, options) => { ... }\n\n// ✅ Com tipagem completa\ninterface ProcessUserOptions {\n  sendEmail?: boolean;\n  updateCache?: boolean;\n}\n\nconst processUser = async (\n  id: string,\n  options: ProcessUserOptions = {}\n): Promise<User> => { ... }\n```\n\n### Error Handling Centralizado\n\n**Use `express-async-errors` + hierarquia de errors + middleware centralizado.**\n\n#### 1. Instalar Dependência\n\n```bash\nnpm install express-async-errors\n```\n\n#### 2. Criar Hierarquia de Errors\n\n```typescript\n// types/errors.ts\nexport class AppError extends Error {\n  constructor(\n    message: string,\n    public statusCode: number = 500,\n    public details?: string[]\n  ) {\n    super(message);\n    this.name = this.constructor.name;\n    Error.captureStackTrace(this, this.constructor);\n  }\n}\n\nexport class ValidationError extends AppError {\n  constructor(message: string, details: string[] = []) {\n    super(message, 400, details);\n  }\n}\n\nexport class NotFoundError extends AppError {\n  constructor(message = ''Resource not found'') {\n    super(message, 404);\n  }\n}\n\nexport class UnauthorizedError extends AppError {\n  constructor(message = ''Unauthorized'') {\n    super(message, 401);\n  }\n}\n\nexport class ForbiddenError extends AppError {\n  constructor(message = ''Forbidden'') {\n    super(message, 403);\n  }\n}\n\nexport class ConflictError extends AppError {\n  constructor(message = ''Conflict'') {\n    super(message, 409);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### 3. Middleware de Error Handling\n\n```typescript\n// middleware/errorHandler.ts\nimport { Request, Response, NextFunction } from ''express'';\nimport { AppError } from ''../types/errors'';\nimport { logger } from ''../lib/logger'';\n\nconst HTTP_INTERNAL_ERROR = 500;\nconst HTTP_BAD_REQUEST = 400;\n\nexport const errorHandler = (\n  err: Error | AppError,\n  req: Request,\n  res: Response,\n  next: NextFunction\n): void => {\n  let statusCode = HTTP_INTERNAL_ERROR;\n  let message = ''Internal Server Error'';\n  let details: string[] | undefined;\n\n  // AppError e subclasses\n  if (err instanceof AppError) {\n    statusCode = err.statusCode;\n    message = err.message;\n    details = err.details;\n  } \n  // Mongoose ValidationError\n  else if (err.name === ''ValidationError'') {\n    statusCode = HTTP_BAD_REQUEST;\n    message = ''Validation failed'';\n    details = Object.values((err as any).errors).map((e: any) => e.message);\n  } \n  // Mongoose CastError\n  else if (err.name === ''CastError'') {\n    statusCode = HTTP_BAD_REQUEST;\n    message = ''Invalid ID format'';\n  }\n  // MongoDB Duplicate Key\n  else if ((err as any).code === 11000) {\n    statusCode = 409;\n    message = ''Duplicate entry'';\n    const field = Object.keys((err as any).keyPattern)[0];\n    details = [`${field} already exists`];\n  }\n\n  // Log estruturado\n  logger.error({\n    error: {\n      name: err.name,\n      message: err.message,\n      stack: err.stack,\n    },\n    statusCode,\n    path: req.path,\n    method: req.method,\n    body: req.body,\n    userId: (req as any).user?.id,\n  }, ''Request error'');\n\n  // Resposta padronizada\n  res.status(statusCode).json({\n    success: false,\n    message,\n    ...(details && { details }),\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n    path: req.path,\n  });\n};\n```\n\n#### 4. Setup no App\n\n```typescript\n// app.ts\nimport ''express-async-errors'';  // ⚠️ IMPORTANTE: importar NO TOPO\nimport express from ''express'';\nimport { errorHandler } from ''./middleware/errorHandler'';\n\nconst app = express();\n\napp.use(express.json());\n\n// ... suas rotas aqui ...\n\n// ⚠️ CRÍTICO: errorHandler deve ser o ÚLTIMO middleware\napp.use(errorHandler);\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n#### 5. Uso nas Rotas\n\n```typescript\n// routes/users.ts\nimport { NotFoundError, ValidationError } from ''../types/errors'';\n\nconst HTTP_CREATED = 201;\n\n// Com express-async-errors, não precisa try-catch manual\nexport const createUser = async (req: Request, res: Response): Promise<void> => {\n  // Validação com Zod\n  const validatedInput = CreateUserSchema.parse(req.body); // Lança erro se inválido\n  \n  // Verificações de negócio\n  const existingUser = await User.findOne({ email: validatedInput.email });\n  if (existingUser) {\n    throw new ConflictError(''Email already in use'');\n  }\n  \n  const user = await User.create(validatedInput);\n  \n  res.status(HTTP_CREATED).json({\n    success: true,\n    data: {\n      id: user._id.toString(),\n      name: user.name,\n      email: user.email,\n    },\n  });\n};\n\nexport const getUserById = async (req: Request, res: Response): Promise<void> => {\n  const user = await User.findById(req.params.id);\n  \n  if (!user) {\n    throw new NotFoundError(`User ${req.params.id} not found`);\n  }\n  \n  res.json({\n    success: true,\n    data: user,\n  });\n};\n```\n\n**Vantagens do Error Handling Centralizado:**\n- Consistência em todas as respostas de erro\n- Menos código duplicado\n- Logging automático de todos os errors\n- Fácil adicionar novos tipos de erro\n- Async errors capturados automaticamente\n\n---\n\n## Padrões Async Modernos\n\n### for-await-of para Streams e Iterables\n\n**Use para processar streams assíncronos.**\n\n```typescript\n// Processar stream de dados\nconst processStream = async (stream: AsyncIterable<Chunk>): Promise<void> => {\n  const results: Result[] = [];\n  \n  for await (const chunk of stream) {\n    const processed = await processChunk(chunk);\n    results.push(processed);\n  }\n  \n  return results;\n};\n\n// Async generator\nasync function* fetchPaginated(endpoint: string): AsyncGenerator<User[]> {\n  const PAGE_SIZE = 100;\n  let page = 1;\n  let hasMore = true;\n  \n  while (hasMore) {\n    const response = await api.get(`${endpoint}?page=${page}&size=${PAGE_SIZE}`);\n    yield response.data;\n    hasMore = response.data.length === PAGE_SIZE;\n    page++;\n  }\n}\n\n// Uso\nconst allUsers: User[] = [];\nfor await (const userBatch of fetchPaginated(''/users'')) {\n  allUsers.push(...userBatch);\n}\n```\n\n### Promise.allSettled para Operações Independentes\n\n**Use quando algumas operações podem falhar sem afetar outras.**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Promise.allSettled - continua mesmo com falhas\nconst sendNotifications = async (users: User[]): Promise<void> => {\n  const results = await Promise.allSettled(\n    users.map(user => sendEmail(user))\n  );\n  \n  const succeeded = results.filter(r => r.status === ''fulfilled'').length;\n  const failed = results.filter(r => r.status === ''rejected'').length;\n  \n  logger.info({ succeeded, failed }, ''Notifications sent'');\n  \n  // Log apenas os que falharam\n  results.forEach((result, index) => {\n    if (result.status === ''rejected'') {\n      logger.error({ \n        userId: users[index].id, \n        error: result.reason \n      }, ''Failed to send email'');\n    }\n  });\n};\n\n// ❌ Promise.all - falha tudo se um falhar\nconst sendNotificationsBad = async (users: User[]): Promise<void> => {\n  await Promise.all(users.map(sendEmail)); // Um erro para tudo\n};\n```\n\n**Quando usar cada um:**\n\n| Método | Quando Usar | Comportamento |\n|--------|-------------|---------------|\n| `Promise.all` | Todas devem suceder | Rejeita no primeiro erro |\n| `Promise.allSettled` | Independentes, algumas podem falhar | Sempre resolve, retorna status de cada |\n| `Promise.race` | Primeiro a completar vence | Resolve/rejeita com primeiro resultado |\n| `Promise.any` | Qualquer sucesso serve | Resolve com primeiro sucesso |\n\n### Logging Estruturado\n**Use Pino para logging estruturado.**\n\n```typescript\nimport pino from ''pino'';\n\nconst logger = pino({\n  level: process.env.LOG_LEVEL || ''info'',\n});\n\n// ✅ Log estruturado\nlogger.info({ userId, action: ''login'' }, ''User logged in'');\nlogger.error({ error, userId }, ''Failed to process user'');\n\n// ❌ Evite console.log\nconsole.log(''User logged in:'', userId);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Estrutura de Arquivos\n\n### Organização por Feature\n```\nsrc/\n├── imports/\n│   ├── auth/\n│   │   ├── login.ts\n│   │   ├── otp.ts\n│   │   └── types.ts\n│   ├── data/\n│   │   └── api/\n│   │       ├── find.ts\n│   │       ├── create.ts\n│   │       └── update.ts\n│   └── utils/\n│       ├── dateUtils.ts\n│       └── validators.ts\n└── server/\n    ├── routes/\n    │   └── api/\n    └── middleware/\n```\n\n### Nomenclatura\n- **Módulos/Arquivos**: camelCase (`userService.ts`)\n- **Classes**: PascalCase (`UserService`)\n- **Funções**: camelCase (`findUserById`)\n- **Constants**: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE\n- **Types/Interfaces**: PascalCase (`UserDocument`, `ApiResponse`)\n\n---\n\n## Validação e Type Safety\n\n### Zod para Validação\n**Use Zod para validar dados de entrada.**\n\n```typescript\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nconst CreateUserSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(1),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  age: z.number().positive().optional(),\n});\n\ntype CreateUserInput = z.infer<typeof CreateUserSchema>;\n\nexport const createUser = async (input: unknown): Promise<User> => {\n  const validatedInput = CreateUserSchema.parse(input);\n  // validatedInput é tipado como CreateUserInput\n  return db.users.create(validatedInput);\n};\n```\n\n### TypeScript Strict Mode\n**Sempre use strict mode.**\n\n```json\n// tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noImplicitAny\": true,\n    \"strictNullChecks\": true,\n    \"strictFunctionTypes\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Database (MongoDB)\n\n### Mongoose com TypeScript\n**Defina schemas e types corretamente.**\n\n```typescript\nimport { Schema, model, Document } from ''mongoose'';\n\ninterface IUser extends Document {\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n  active: boolean;\n  createdAt: Date;\n}\n\nconst UserSchema = new Schema<IUser>({\n  name: { type: String, required: true },\n  email: { type: String, required: true, unique: true },\n  active: { type: Boolean, default: true },\n  createdAt: { type: Date, default: Date.now },\n});\n\nexport const User = model<IUser>(''User'', UserSchema);\n```\n\n### Queries Eficientes\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use lean() para leitura quando não precisa de document\nconst users = await User.find({ active: true }).lean();\n\n// ✅ Use select para buscar apenas campos necessários\nconst userEmails = await User.find({ active: true })\n  .select(''email'')\n  .lean();\n\n// ✅ Use indexes apropriados\nUserSchema.index({ email: 1 });\nUserSchema.index({ active: 1, createdAt: -1 });\n```\n\n---\n\n## API Design\n\n### Middleware Pattern\n**Use middlewares para lógica compartilhada.**\n\n```typescript\n// Middleware de autenticação\nexport const authenticate = async (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n  try {\n    const token = req.headers.authorization?.replace(''Bearer '', '''');\n    if (!token) {\n      throw new UnauthorizedError(''No token provided'');\n    }\n    \n    const decoded = await verifyToken(token);\n    req.user = decoded;\n    next();\n  } catch (error) {\n    next(error);\n  }\n};\n\n// Uso\nrouter.get(''/protected'', authenticate, async (req, res) => {\n  res.json({ user: req.user });\n});\n```\n\n### Error Handling Middleware\n**Centralize tratamento de erros.**\n\n```typescript\nexport const errorHandler = (\n  error: Error,\n  req: Request,\n  res: Response,\n  next: NextFunction\n) => {\n  logger.error({ error, path: req.path }, ''Request error'');\n  \n  if (error instanceof AppError) {\n    return res.status(error.statusCode).json({\n      error: error.message,\n      code: error.code,\n    });\n  }\n  \n  res.status(500).json({\n    error: ''Internal server error'',\n  });\n};\n```\n\n### Response Patterns\n**Padronize respostas da API.**\n\n```typescript\n// Success\ninterface SuccessResponse<T> {\n  success: true;\n  data: T;\n}\n\n// Error\ninterface ErrorResponse {\n  success: false;\n  error: string;\n  code?: string;\n}\n\n// Helper\nconst sendSuccess = <T>(res: Response, data: T) => {\n  res.json({ success: true, data });\n};\n\nconst sendError = (res: Response, statusCode: number, message: string) => {\n  res.status(statusCode).json({ success: false, error: message });\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance\n\n### Connection Pooling\n**Use connection pooling para database.**\n\n```typescript\nconst MONGODB_OPTIONS = {\n  maxPoolSize: 10,\n  minPoolSize: 2,\n  socketTimeoutMS: 45000,\n};\n\nawait mongoose.connect(MONGODB_URI, MONGODB_OPTIONS);\n```\n\n### Caching com Redis\n**Cache operações custosas.**\n\n```typescript\nimport Redis from ''ioredis'';\n\nconst redis = new Redis({\n  host: process.env.REDIS_HOST,\n  port: Number(process.env.REDIS_PORT),\n});\n\nconst CACHE_TTL_SECONDS = 300; // 5 minutes\n\nconst getCachedUser = async (id: string): Promise<User | null> => {\n  const cached = await redis.get(`user:${id}`);\n  if (cached) {\n    return JSON.parse(cached);\n  }\n  \n  const user = await User.findById(id).lean();\n  if (user) {\n    await redis.setex(`user:${id}`, CACHE_TTL_SECONDS, JSON.stringify(user));\n  }\n  \n  return user;\n};\n```\n\n### Graceful Shutdown\n**Implemente shutdown gracioso.**\n\n```typescript\nconst gracefulShutdown = async () => {\n  logger.info(''Shutting down gracefully...'');\n  \n  // Pare de aceitar novas conexões\n  server.close();\n  \n  // Aguarde requisições em andamento\n  await Promise.all([\n    mongoose.connection.close(),\n    redis.quit(),\n  ]);\n  \n  logger.info(''Shutdown complete'');\n  process.exit(0);\n};\n\nprocess.on(''SIGTERM'', gracefulShutdown);\nprocess.on(''SIGINT'', gracefulShutdown);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Segurança\n\n### Input Validation\n**Sempre valide entrada do usuário.**\n\n```typescript\n// Use Zod para validação\nconst input = InputSchema.parse(req.body);\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\n**Use variáveis de ambiente para configuração sensível.**\n\n```typescript\n// .env (não commitar)\nDATABASE_URL=mongodb://...\nJWT_SECRET=...\nAPI_KEY=...\n\n// Uso\nimport dotenv from ''dotenv'';\ndotenv.config();\n\nconst config = {\n  databaseUrl: process.env.DATABASE_URL!,\n  jwtSecret: process.env.JWT_SECRET!,\n};\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting\n**Implemente rate limiting.**\n\n```typescript\nimport rateLimit from ''express-rate-limit'';\n\nconst RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS = 15 * 60 * 1000; // 15 minutes\nconst MAX_REQUESTS_PER_WINDOW = 100;\n\nconst limiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS,\n  max: MAX_REQUESTS_PER_WINDOW,\n  message: ''Too many requests from this IP'',\n});\n\napp.use(''/api/'', limiter);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Testes\n\n### Unit Tests\n**Teste lógica de negócio isoladamente.**\n\n```typescript\nimport { findActiveUsers } from ''./userService'';\n\ndescribe(''userService'', () => {\n  describe(''findActiveUsers'', () => {\n    it(''should return only active users'', async () => {\n      const users = await findActiveUsers();\n      \n      expect(users).toHaveLength(2);\n      expect(users.every(u => u.active)).toBe(true);\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Integration Tests\n**Teste fluxos completos.**\n\n```typescript\ndescribe(''POST /api/users'', () => {\n  it(''should create user and return 201'', async () => {\n    const response = await request(app)\n      .post(''/api/users'')\n      .send({\n        name: ''Test User'',\n        email: ''test@example.com'',\n      });\n    \n    expect(response.status).toBe(201);\n    expect(response.body.data).toHaveProperty(''id'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist Rápido\n\nAntes de commitar código, verifique:\n\n- [ ] Usou `const` ao invés de `let`?\n- [ ] Evitou `for` loops (usou `map/filter/reduce`)?\n- [ ] Não tem números mágicos?\n- [ ] Usou p-limit ou chunking para loops assíncronos com +3 itens?\n- [ ] Evitou `while(true)`?\n- [ ] Importou `express-async-errors` no app.ts?\n- [ ] Errors customizados (ValidationError, NotFoundError, etc)?\n- [ ] Logging estruturado com Pino?\n- [ ] Validação de input com Zod?\n- [ ] Tipos TypeScript para funções e interfaces?\n- [ ] Código segue KISS/YAGNI/DRY/SOLID?\n- [ ] Middlewares para lógica compartilhada?\n- [ ] ErrorHandler é o último middleware?\n- [ ] Testes cobrem casos principais?\n\n---\n\n## Recursos Adicionais\n\n- [examples/](examples/) - Exemplos práticos de cada padrão\n- Bluebird: http://bluebirdjs.com/docs/api-reference.html\n- Pino: https://getpino.io\n- Zod: https://zod.dev\n\n---\n\n**Lembre-se**: Código limpo não é sobre seguir regras cegamente, mas sobre escrever código que é fácil de entender, manter e modificar. Use bom senso!\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:51:46.213Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing adherence to simplicity principles like KISS and YAGNI.","zh":"非常适合需要遵循简单原则（如KISS和YAGNI）的代码审查代理","ja":"KISSやYAGNIなどのシンプルさの原則に従うことが必要なコードレビュー代理に最適","ko":"KISS와 YAGNI 같은 단순성 원칙을 준수해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan adherirse a principios de simplicidad como KISS y YAGNI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code ayant besoin de respecter des principes de simplicité comme KISS et YAGNI.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die die Einhaltung von Einfachheitsprinzipien wie KISS und YAGNI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de aderência a princípios de simplicidade como KISS e YAGNI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ревью кода, требующих соблюдения принципов простоты, таких как KISS и YAGNI.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مراجعة الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى الالتزام بمبادئ البساطة مثل KISS و YAGNI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain simplicity through clear function responsibilities, direct logic, and avoidance of premature abstractions, following principles like KISS and YAGNI to ensure code quality.","zh":"赋予代理维护简单性，通过明确的函数职责、直接的逻辑和避免过早的抽象，遵循KISS和YAGNI原则以确保代码质量","ja":"シンプルさの維持を代理に任せ、明確な関数の責任、直接的なロジック、および過早な抽象の回避を通じて、KISSおよびYAGNIの原則に従ってコードの品質を確保","ko":"에이전트가 단순성을 유지하도록 하여, 명확한 함수 책임, 직접 논리 및 미리 추상의 회피를 통해 KISS 및 YAGNI 원칙을 따르도록 코드 품질을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener la simplicidad a través de responsabilidades de función claras, lógica directa y evitación de abstracciones prematuras, siguiendo principios como KISS y YAGNI para garantizar la calidad del código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir la simplicité grâce à des responsabilités de fonction claires, une logique directe et une évitement des abstractions prématurées, en suivant des principes comme KISS et YAGNI pour assurer la qualité du code.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Einfachheit durch klare Funktionsverantwortlichkeiten, direkte Logik und Vermeidung von verfrühten Abstraktionen zu wahren, indem sie Prinzipien wie KISS und YAGNI befolgen, um die Code-Qualität sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter a simplicidade por meio de responsabilidades de função claras, lógica direta e evasão de abstrações prematuras, seguindo princípios como KISS e YAGNI para garantir a qualidade do código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать простоту посредством ясных функциональных обязанностей, прямой логики и избегания преждевременных абстракций, следуя принципам KISS и YAGNI для обеспечения качества кода.","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من الحفاظ على البساطة من خلال مسؤوليات الوظائف الواضحة والمنطق المباشر وتجنب التجريدات المسبقة، اتباعاً لمبادئ KISS و YAGNI لضمان جودة الشفرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Simplifying complex codebases","Implementing YAGNI for reduced complexity","Reviewing code for adherence to KISS principles"],"zh":["简化复杂的代码库","实施YAGNI以降低复杂性","审查代码以遵循KISS原则"],"ja":["複雑なコードベースの簡素化","YAGNIの実装による複雑性の削減","KISS原則への準拠のためのコードレビュー"],"ko":["복잡한 코드베이스 단순화","YAGNI를 통한 복잡성 감소","KISS 원칙 준수 코드 리뷰"],"es":["Simplificación de bases de código complejas","Implementación de YAGNI para reducir la complejidad","Revisión de código para adherirse a los principios KISS"],"fr":["Simplification de bases de code complexes","Mise en œuvre de YAGNI pour réduire la complexité","Révision de code pour se conformer aux principes KISS"],"de":["Vereinfachung komplexer Codebasen","Implementierung von YAGNI zur Reduzierung der Komplexität","Überprüfung von Code zur Einhaltung der KISS-Prinzipien"],"pt":["Simplificação de bases de código complexas","Implementação de YAGNI para reduzir a complexidade","Revisão de código para aderência aos princípios KISS"],"ru":["Упрощение сложных баз кода","Реализация YAGNI для уменьшения сложности","Проверка кода на соблюдение принципов KISS"],"ar":["تبسّط قواعد الشفرة المعقدة","تنفيذ YAGNI لتقليل التعقيد","مراجعة الشفرة لامتثال مبادئ KISS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual implementation of principles","May not be suitable for highly complex or dynamic systems"],"zh":["需要手动实现原则","可能不适合高度复杂或动态系统"],"ja":["原則の手動実装の必要性","高度に複雑または動的なシステムには適さない可能性"],"ko":["원칙의 수동 구현 필요","높은 복잡도 또는 동적 시스템에는 적합하지 않을 수"],"es":["Requiere implementación manual de principios","Puede no ser adecuado para sistemas altamente complejos o dinámicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une mise en œuvre manuelle des principes","Peut ne pas être adapté pour les systèmes hautement complexes ou dynamiques"],"de":["Benötigt manuelle Implementierung von Prinzipien","Kann für hochkomplexe oder dynamische Systeme nicht geeignet sein"],"pt":["Requer implementação manual dos princípios","Pode não ser adequado para sistemas altamente complexos ou dinâmicos"],"ru":["Требует ручной реализации принципов","Может быть не подходящим для высоко сложных или динамических систем"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذاً يدويًا للمبادئ","قد لا يكون مناسبًاpara النظم المعقدة أو الديناميكية للغاية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('elmagnificogi/elmagnificogi.github.io/article-review', 'community', 'elmagnificogi', 'elmagnificogi.github.io', 'elmagnificogi/elmagnificogi.github.io', 'article-review', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:51:20.263Z', NULL, '{"id":"elmagnificogi/elmagnificogi.github.io/article-review","name":"article-review","description":{"zh":"文章审查技能提供自动化文档检查和润色的功能，帮助开发者提高写作质量和效率","ja":"記事レビュースキルは、自動化ドキュメントのチェックと編集の機能を提供し、開発者の書き込みの品質と効率を向上させます","ko":"기사 검토 기술은 자동화 문서 검사 및润色的 기능을 제공하여 개발자의 작성 品質과 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"La revisión de artículos es una herramienta que ayuda a los desarrolladores a revisar y mejorar su contenido. Sigue nuestros pasos para corregir errores y mejorar la calidad de tus artículos.","fr":"La révision d''articles est un outil qui aide les développeurs à réviser et améliorer leur contenu. Suivez nos étapes pour corriger les erreurs et améliorer la qualité de vos articles.","de":"Die Überprüfung von Artikeln ist ein Werkzeug, das Entwicklern hilft, ihren Inhalt zu überprüfen und zu verbessern. Folgen Sie unseren Schritten, um Fehler zu korrigieren und die Qualität Ihrer Artikel zu verbessern.","pt":"A revisão de artigo é uma ferramenta que ajuda a melhorar a qualidade do conteúdo, corrigindo erros e melhorando a escrita.","ru":"Проверка статьи - это инструмент, который помогает улучшить качество контента, исправляя ошибки и улучшая написание.","ar":"مراجعة المقال هي أداة تساعد على تحسين جودة المحتوى من خلال تصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين الكتابة.","en":"Click here to see my blog"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"文章审查技能 - 自动化文档检查和润色","ja":"記事レビュースキル - 自動化ドキュメントのチェックと編集","ko":"기사 검토 기술 - 자동화 문서 검사 및润色","es":"Revisión de Artículos: Herramienta de Revisión de Contenido","fr":"Révision d''Articles: Outil de Révision de Contenu","de":"Artikel-Überprüfung: Werkzeug für Inhaltsüberprüfung","pt":"Revisão de Artigo: Ferramenta de Análise de Conteúdo","ru":"Проверка Статьи: Инструмент Анализа Контента","ar":"مراجعة المقال: أداة تحليل المحتوى","en":"article-review"},"description":{"zh":"文章审查技能提供自动化文档检查和润色的功能，帮助开发者提高写作质量和效率","ja":"記事レビュースキルは、自動化ドキュメントのチェックと編集の機能を提供し、開発者の書き込みの品質と効率を向上させます","ko":"기사 검토 기술은 자동화 문서 검사 및润色的 기능을 제공하여 개발자의 작성 品質과 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"La revisión de artículos es una herramienta que ayuda a los desarrolladores a revisar y mejorar su contenido. Sigue nuestros pasos para corregir errores y me...","fr":"La révision d''articles est un outil qui aide les développeurs à réviser et améliorer leur contenu. Suivez nos étapes pour corriger les erreurs et améliorer l...","de":"Die Überprüfung von Artikeln ist ein Werkzeug, das Entwicklern hilft, ihren Inhalt zu überprüfen und zu verbessern. Folgen Sie unseren Schritten, um Fehler z...","pt":"A revisão de artigo é uma ferramenta que ajuda a melhorar a qualidade do conteúdo, corrigindo erros e melhorando a escrita.","ru":"Проверка статьи - это инструмент, который помогает улучшить качество контента, исправляя ошибки и улучшая написание.","ar":"مراجعة المقال هي أداة تساعد على تحسين جودة المحتوى من خلال تصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين الكتابة.","en":"Click here to see my blog"},"definition":{"en":"Click here to see my blog"},"features":{"zh":["自动化检查文档中的文字书写错误","忽略标点符号、中英混排的问题","对全文进行润色","模仿文档中书写的风格和语气"],"ja":["ドキュメント内の文字の書き間違いを自動的にチェック","句読点や中英混在の問題を無視","全文を編集","ドキュメント内の書き方のスタイルとトーンを模倣"],"ko":["문서 내의 문자 오류를 자동으로 검사","구두점이나 중영혼용 문제를 무시","전체 문서를润色","문서 내의 작성 스타일과 토드를 모방"],"es":["Revisión de errores de escritura","Corrección de errores de puntuación y ortografía","Mejora de la calidad del contenido","Estilo y tono personalizados","Revisión y aprobación del contenido"],"fr":["Révision des erreurs d''écriture","Correction des erreurs de ponctuation et d''orthographe","Amélioration de la qualité du contenu","Style et ton personnalisés","Révision et approbation du contenu"],"de":["Überprüfung von Schreibfehlern","Korrektur von Punktuations- und Rechtschreibfehlern","Verbesserung der Qualität des Inhalts","Personalisierter Stil und Ton","Überprüfung und Genehmigung des Inhalts"],"pt":["Análise de erros de escrita","Correção de erros de pontuação","Melhoria da clareza e da coerência do texto","Análise de estilo e tom do texto","Sugestões de melhoria para o conteúdo"],"ru":["Анализ ошибок написания","Исправление ошибок пунктуации","Улучшение ясности и связности текста","Анализ стиля и тона текста","Предложения по улучшению контента"],"ar":["تحليل أخطاء الكتابة","تصحيح أخطاء الإملاء","تحسين وضوح وترابط النص","تحليل أسلوب وطابع النص","اقتراحات لتحسين المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["文章审查","自动化文档检查","润色","写作质量","开发者工具","文档编辑"],"ja":["記事レビュー","自動化ドキュメントのチェック","編集","書き込みの品質","開発者ツール","ドキュメント編集"],"ko":["기사 검토","자동화 문서 검사","润色","작성 品質","개발자 도구","문서 편집"],"es":["revisión de artículos","herramienta de revisión de contenido","desarrollo de contenido","corrección de errores","mejora de la calidad","estilo y tono personalizados"],"fr":["révision d''articles","outil de révision de contenu","développement de contenu","correction d''erreurs","amélioration de la qualité","style et ton personnalisés"],"de":["Überprüfung von Artikeln","Werkzeug für die Überprüfung von Inhalten","Inhaltsentwicklung","Korrektur von Fehlern","Verbesserung der Qualität","personalisierter Stil und Ton"],"pt":["revisão de artigo","análise de conteúdo","melhoria da escrita","correção de erros","estilo e tom do texto","desenvolvimento de conteúdo"],"ru":["проверка статьи","анализ контента","улучшение написания","исправление ошибок","стиль и тон текста","разработка контента"],"ar":["مراجعة المقال","تحليل المحتوى","تحسين الكتابة","تصحيح الأخطاء","أسلوب وطابع النص","تطوير المحتوى"]}},"owner":"elmagnificogi","repo":"elmagnificogi.github.io","repoPath":"elmagnificogi/elmagnificogi.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"article-review","description":"审查和润色博客文章内容，检查书写错误并根据既有风格进行润色。用于处理符合“年-月-日-文章标题”命名规则的文章文件。","bodyPreview":"# 文章内容审查\n\n为 Agent 提供的详细指令。\n\n## 使用时机\n\n- 在以下情况使用此技能\n- 如果文档名称符合“年-月-日-文章标题”的规则，类似：`2015-11-11-RaspberryStartup-5`\n- 如果只是要审查文章，那么只用执行指令的1、2、3步骤即可\n- 如果要审查润色文章，那么执行所有步骤\n\n## 指令\n\n- 1.帮我检查一下当前文档中是否存在文字书写错误\n- 2.忽略标点符号、中英混排的问题\n- 3.完成上述检查和修改后，先向我简要汇报修改点，等待我确认\n- 4.阅读当前文档，并模仿文档中书写的风格和语气，对全文进行润色","body":"# 文章内容审查\n\n为 Agent 提供的详细指令。\n\n## 使用时机\n\n- 在以下情况使用此技能\n- 如果文档名称符合“年-月-日-文章标题”的规则，类似：`2015-11-11-RaspberryStartup-5`\n- 如果只是要审查文章，那么只用执行指令的1、2、3步骤即可\n- 如果要审查润色文章，那么执行所有步骤\n\n## 指令\n\n- 1.帮我检查一下当前文档中是否存在文字书写错误\n- 2.忽略标点符号、中英混排的问题\n- 3.完成上述检查和修改后，先向我简要汇报修改点，等待我确认\n- 4.阅读当前文档，并模仿文档中书写的风格和语气，对全文进行润色\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:51:20.263Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, or LangChain requiring advanced text analysis and review capabilities.","zh":"适用于Claude、AutoGPT或LangChain等语言代理，需要高级文本分析和审查能力。","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、またはLangChainなどの言語エージェントに適しており、高度なテキスト分析およびレビュー機能を必要とする。","ko":"Claude, AutoGPT 또는 LangChain과 같은 언어 에이전트에 적합하며, 고급 텍스트 분석 및 검토 기능을 필요로 함.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje como Claude, AutoGPT o LangChain que requieren capacidades avanzadas de análisis y revisión de texto.","fr":"Idéal pour des agents de langage tels que Claude, AutoGPT ou LangChain nécessitant des capacités avancées d''analyse et de révision de texte.","de":"Ideal für Sprachagenten wie Claude, AutoGPT oder LangChain, die erweiterte Textanalyse- und Überprüfungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem como Claude, AutoGPT ou LangChain que requerem capacidades avançadas de análise e revisão de texto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, таких как Claude, AutoGPT или LangChain, требующих продвинутых возможностей анализа и проверки текста.","ar":"مثالي لعميل لغة مثل Claude، AutoGPT أو LangChain يتطلبون قدرات متقدمة لتحليل النص واستعراضه."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform detailed article reviews, checking for textual errors, ignoring specific formatting issues like markups and mixed language texts, and providing a brief report of modifications before proceeding with content refinement, utilizing natural language processing techniques.","zh":"使代理能够执行详细的文章审查，检查文本错误，忽略特定的格式问题（如标记和混合语言文本），并在继续内容精炼之前提供修改的简要报告，利用自然语言处理技术。","ja":"エージェントが詳細な記事のレビューを実行できるようにし、テキストのエラーをチェックし、特定のフォーマットの問題（マークアップや混合言語テキストなど）を無視し、コンテンツの洗練を進める前に修正の簡単な報告書を提供し、自然言語処理技術を利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 상세한 기사 검토를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 텍스트 오류를 확인하고 특정 형식 문제(마크업이나 혼합 언어 텍스트 등)를 무시하며, 내용을 정련하기 전에 수정에 대한 간단한 보고서를 제공하며, 자연어 처리 기술을 활용함.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar revisiones detalladas de artículos, comprobando errores textuales, ignorando problemas de formato específicos como marcas y textos de lenguaje mixto, y proporcionando un informe breve de las modificaciones antes de proceder con el perfeccionamiento del contenido, utilizando técnicas de procesamiento de lenguaje natural.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des révisions d''articles détaillées, en vérifiant les erreurs textuelles, en ignorant des problèmes de formatage spécifiques tels que les balises et les textes de langage mixte, et en fournissant un rapport succinct des modifications avant de procéder à l''affinement du contenu, en utilisant des techniques de traitement automatique des langues.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, detaillierte Artikelrezensionen durchzuführen, textuelle Fehler zu überprüfen, bestimmte Formatierungsprobleme wie Markierungen und gemischte Sprachtexte zu ignorieren und einen kurzen Bericht über die Änderungen vor der Weiterverarbeitung zur Inhaltsverfeinerung zu liefern, unter Verwendung von Techniken des natürlichen Sprachverarbeitung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizarem revisões detalhadas de artigos, verificando erros textuais, ignorando questões de formatação específicas como marcações e textos de línguas mistas, e fornecendo um relatório breve de modificações antes de prosseguir com o aprimoramento do conteúdo, utilizando técnicas de processamento de linguagem natural.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить подробные обзоры статей, проверяя текстовые ошибки, игнорируя конкретные проблемы форматирования, такие как маркеры и смешанные языковые тексты, и предоставляя краткий отчет о внесенных изменениях до продолжения усовершенствования контента, используя методы обработки естественного языка.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إجراء استعراضات مفصلة للمقالات، وتحقق الأخطاء النصية، وتجاهل مشاكل التنسيق المحددة مثل العلامات والنصوص اللغوية المختلطة، وتقديم تقرير قصير عن التعديلات قبل المتابعة مع تحسين المحتوى، باستخدام تقنيات معالجة اللغة الطبيعية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating article error checking","Refining document content for better readability","Generating style-consistent text expansions"],"zh":["自动化文章错误检查","为更好的可读性而改进文档内容","生成风格一致的文本扩展"],"ja":["記事のエラーの自動チェック","読みやすさの向上のために文書のコンテンツを洗練する","スタイル一致のテキスト拡張を生成する"],"ko":["기사 오류 자동 체크","가독성을 향상시키기 위한 문서 내용 정련","스타일 일치하는 텍스트 확장을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la comprobación de errores en artículos","Perfeccionamiento del contenido de documentos para una mejor legibilidad","Generación de expansiones de texto consistentes con el estilo"],"fr":["Automatisation de la vérification des erreurs dans les articles","Affinement du contenu des documents pour une meilleure lisibilité","Génération d''expansions de texte cohérentes avec le style"],"de":["Automatisierung der Fehlerüberprüfung in Artikeln","Verfeinerung des Dokumenteninhalts für bessere Lesbarkeit","Erzeugung von stil-konsistenten Texterweiterungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a verificação de erros de artigos","Aprimorar o conteúdo de documentos para melhor legibilidade","Gerar expansões de texto consistentes com o estilo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку ошибок в статьях","Усовершенствовать контент документов для лучшей читаемости","Генерировать расширения текста, соответствующие стилю"],"ar":["توفير التلقائية لاستعراض أخطاء المقال","تحسين محتوى الوثائق من أجل قراءة أفضل","توليد توسعات نصية متسقة مع الأسلوب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific document naming conventions","Limited to textual content review and refinement"],"zh":["需要特定的文档命名约定","仅限于文本内容的审查和精炼"],"ja":["特定のドキュメント命名規約が必要","テキストコンテンツのレビューと洗練のみに限定"],"ko":["특정 문서 이름 규칙이 필요","텍스트 내용의 검토 및 정련에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere convenciones de nomenclatura de documentos específicas","Limitado a la revisión y refinamiento de contenido textual"],"fr":["Nécessite des conventions de dénomination de documents spécifiques","Limité à la révision et à l''affinement du contenu textuel"],"de":["Erfordert spezifische Dokumentenbenennungskonventionen","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung und Verfeinerung von Textinhalt"],"pt":["Requer convenções de nomenclatura de documentos específicas","Limitado à revisão e refinamento de conteúdo textual"],"ru":["Требует конкретных соглашений об именовании документов","Ограничен проверкой и усовершенствованием текстового контента"],"ar":["يتطلب اتفاقيات تسمية محددة للوثائق","محدود بالاستعراضและการ tinhنة للمحتوى النصي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('FixMyBerlin/tilda-geo/add-static-dataset', 'community', 'FixMyBerlin', 'tilda-geo', 'FixMyBerlin/tilda-geo', 'add-static-dataset', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:51:33.581Z', NULL, '{"id":"FixMyBerlin/tilda-geo/add-static-dataset","name":"add-static-dataset","description":{"zh":"TILDA 的静态数据集功能允许开发者添加新的 GeoJSON 数据集，支持上传和集成","ja":"TILDA の静的データセット機能を使用すると、開発者は新しい GeoJSON データセットを追加してアップロードおよび統合できます","ko":"TILDA의 정적 데이터셋 기능을 사용하면 개발자가 새로운 GeoJSON 데이터셋을 추가하여 업로드하고 통합할 수 있습니다","es":"TILDA permite agregar conjuntos de datos estáticos GeoJSON para mejorar la infraestructura de bicicletas y aparcamiento. Agrega una nueva carpeta de conjunto de datos estático a app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson.","fr":"TILDA permet d''ajouter des ensembles de données statiques GeoJSON pour améliorer l''infrastructure de bicyclette et de stationnement. Ajoute un nouveau dossier de jeu de données statique à app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson.","de":"TILDA ermöglicht das Hinzufügen statischer GeoJSON-Datensätze, um die Infrastruktur für Fahrräder und Parken zu verbessern. Fügt einen neuen Ordner für statische Datensätze zu app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson hinzu.","pt":"O skill add-static-dataset permite adicionar um novo conjunto de dados estáticos ao seu aplicativo, facilitando a integração de dados GeoJSON.","ru":"Навык add-static-dataset позволяет добавить новый статический набор данных в ваше приложение, упрощая интеграцию данных GeoJSON.","ar":"تمكّن مهارة add-static-dataset من إضافة مجموعة بيانات ثابتة جديدة إلى تطبيقك، مما يسهل دمج بيانات GeoJSON.","en":"TILDA provides access to bicycle and parking infrastructure data from OpenStreetMap (OSM) for administrative staff."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"添加静态数据集 - TILDA 开发者指南","ja":"静的データセットを追加 - TILDA 開発者ガイド","ko":"정적 데이터셋 추가 - TILDA 개발자 가이드","es":"Agregar conjunto de datos estático con TILDA","fr":"Ajouter un ensemble de données statiques avec TILDA","de":"Statisches Datenset mit TILDA hinzufügen","pt":"Adicionar Conjunto de Dados Estáticos","ru":"Добавить статический набор данных","ar":"إضافة مجموعة بيانات ثابتة","en":"add-static-dataset"},"description":{"zh":"TILDA 的静态数据集功能允许开发者添加新的 GeoJSON 数据集，支持上传和集成","ja":"TILDA の静的データセット機能を使用すると、開発者は新しい GeoJSON データセットを追加してアップロードおよび統合できます","ko":"TILDA의 정적 데이터셋 기능을 사용하면 개발자가 새로운 GeoJSON 데이터셋을 추가하여 업로드하고 통합할 수 있습니다","es":"TILDA permite agregar conjuntos de datos estáticos GeoJSON para mejorar la infraestructura de bicicletas y aparcamiento. Agrega una nueva carpeta de conjunto...","fr":"TILDA permet d''ajouter des ensembles de données statiques GeoJSON pour améliorer l''infrastructure de bicyclette et de stationnement. Ajoute un nouveau dossie...","de":"TILDA ermöglicht das Hinzufügen statischer GeoJSON-Datensätze, um die Infrastruktur für Fahrräder und Parken zu verbessern. Fügt einen neuen Ordner für stati...","pt":"O skill add-static-dataset permite adicionar um novo conjunto de dados estáticos ao seu aplicativo, facilitando a integração de dados GeoJSON.","ru":"Навык add-static-dataset позволяет добавить новый статический набор данных в ваше приложение, упрощая интеграцию данных GeoJSON.","ar":"تمكّن مهارة add-static-dataset من إضافة مجموعة بيانات ثابتة جديدة إلى تطبيقك، مما يسهل دمج بيانات GeoJSON.","en":"TILDA provides access to bicycle and parking infrastructure data from OpenStreetMap (OSM) for administrative staff."},"definition":{"en":"TILDA provides access to bicycle and parking infrastructure data from OpenStreetMap (OSM) for administrative staff."},"features":{"zh":["添加新的 GeoJSON 数据集","支持上传和集成 GeoJSON 文件","轻松管理和更新数据集","兼容多种数据格式","提高开发效率和数据处理能力"],"ja":["新しい GeoJSON データセットを追加","GeoJSON ファイルのアップロードと統合をサポート","データセットの管理と更新を簡素化","複数のデータ形式をサポート","開発効率とデータ処理能力を向上"],"ko":["新的 GeoJSON 데이터셋을 추가","GeoJSON 파일 업로드 및 통합 지원","데이터셋 관리 및 업데이트 간소화","다양한 데이터 형식 지원","개발 효율성 및 데이터 처리 능력 향상"],"es":["Agrega conjuntos de datos estáticos GeoJSON","Mejora la infraestructura de bicicletas y aparcamiento","Crea una nueva carpeta de conjunto de datos estático","Permite la integración de archivos GeoJSON","Soporta la creación de carpetas de grupo y subcarpetas"],"fr":["Ajoute des ensembles de données statiques GeoJSON","Améliore l''infrastructure de bicyclette et de stationnement","Crée un nouveau dossier de jeu de données statique","Permet l''intégration de fichiers GeoJSON","Prend en charge la création de dossiers de groupe et de sous-dossiers"],"de":["Fügt statische GeoJSON-Datensätze hinzu","Verbessert die Infrastruktur für Fahrräder und Parken","Erstellt einen neuen Ordner für statische Datensätze","Ermöglicht die Integration von GeoJSON-Dateien","Unterstützt die Erstellung von Gruppenordnern und Unterordnern"],"pt":["Adiciona um novo conjunto de dados estáticos ao aplicativo","Facilita a integração de dados GeoJSON","Permite a criação de pastas de grupo e sub-pastas","Suporta uploads de arquivos GeoJSON","Integração com OpenStreetMap (OSM)"],"ru":["Добавляет новый статический набор данных в приложение","Упрощает интеграцию данных GeoJSON","Позволяет создавать папки групп и подпапки","Поддерживает загрузку файлов GeoJSON","Интеграция с OpenStreetMap (OSM)"],"ar":["تُضيف مجموعة بيانات ثابتة جديدة إلى التطبيق","تسهل دمج بيانات GeoJSON","تمكّن من إنشاء مجلدات مجموعة وفرعية","تدعم تحميل ملفات GeoJSON","الدمج مع OpenStreetMap (OSM)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TILDA","静态数据集","GeoJSON","开发者工具","数据集管理","数据处理","开发效率"],"ja":["TILDA","静的データセット","GeoJSON","開発者ツール","データセット管理","データ処理","開発効率"],"ko":["TILDA","정적 데이터셋","GeoJSON","개발자 도구","데이터셋 관리","데이터 처리","개발 효율성"],"es":["conjunto de datos estático","GeoJSON","infraestructura de bicicletas","aparcamiento","TILDA","dataviz","desarrollo de software","integración de datos"],"fr":["ensemble de données statiques","GeoJSON","infrastructure de bicyclette","stationnement","TILDA","dataviz","développement de logiciels","intégration de données"],"de":["statischer Datensatz","GeoJSON","Infrastruktur für Fahrräder","Parken","TILDA","Datenvizualisierung","Softwareentwicklung","Datenintegration"],"pt":["add-static-dataset","conjunto de dados estáticos","GeoJSON","OpenStreetMap","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","integração de dados","uploads de arquivos","pastas de grupo","sub-pastas"],"ru":["add-static-dataset","статический набор данных","GeoJSON","OpenStreetMap","разработка приложений","интеграция данных","загрузка файлов","папки групп","подпапки"],"ar":["add-static-dataset","مجموعة بيانات ثابتة","GeoJSON","OpenStreetMap","تطوير التطبيقات","دمج البيانات","تحميل الملفات","مجلدات مجموعة","مجلدات فرعية"]}},"owner":"FixMyBerlin","repo":"tilda-geo","repoPath":"FixMyBerlin/tilda-geo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-static-dataset","description":"Add a new static dataset to app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson. Infers config from prompt, asks for missing data, uses types to guide required fields.","bodyPreview":"# Add Static Dataset\n\nAdds a new static dataset folder to `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`. The `/geojson` folder is a symlink.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new GeoJSON dataset\n- User mentions adding static data, geojson files, \"uploads\", or datasets\n- User provides a geojson file path and wants it integrated\n\n## Required Information\n\nExtract from user prompt or ask if missing:\n\n1. **Group folder** (e.g., `region-berlin`, `region-bb`) - parent folder name\n2. **Sub-folder name** (e.","body":"# Add Static Dataset\n\nAdds a new static dataset folder to `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson`. The `/geojson` folder is a symlink.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new GeoJSON dataset\n- User mentions adding static data, geojson files, \"uploads\", or datasets\n- User provides a geojson file path and wants it integrated\n\n## Required Information\n\nExtract from user prompt or ask if missing:\n\n1. **Group folder** (e.g., `region-berlin`, `region-bb`) - parent folder name\n2. **Sub-folder name** (e.g., `berlin-bezirke`) - dataset folder name (must be valid slug). **Must include region/group prefix**: for `region-berlin` use `berlin-<name>`, not just `<name>`\n3. **GeoJSON file path** - absolute path to source file on disk\n4. **Regions** - array of region slugs (e.g., `[''infravelo'']`, `[''berlin'']`)\n5. **Optional**: transformation needs, style preferences, category, attribution, license\n\n## Process\n\n### 1. Create Folder Structure\n\n```bash\napp/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/<GROUP_FOLDER>/<SUB_FOLDER>/\n```\n\n**Important**: `/geojson` is a symlink. Create folders in `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/` path.\n\nCreate directory if group folder doesn''t exist. Ensure sub-folder name follows naming convention (see Required Information above).\n\n### 2. Move GeoJSON File\n\n- Move source file to `<SUB_FOLDER>/<FILENAME>.geojson`\n- Run prettier from `app/` directory (prettier config is in app/): `cd app && bunx prettier --write scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/<GROUP_FOLDER>/<SUB_FOLDER>/<FILENAME>.geojson`\n\n### 3. Create transform.ts (if needed)\n\nOnly if transformation required. Use helpers from `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/_utils`:\n\n- `transformUtils.ts` - property transformations\n- `defaultLayerStyles.ts` - default styling helpers\n- `translateUtils.ts` - translation helpers\n\nExample:\n\n```typescript\nimport { FeatureCollection } from \"geojson\";\n\nexport const transform = (data: FeatureCollection) => {\n  // Use helper functions from _utils when possible\n  return data;\n};\n```\n\n### 4. Create meta.ts\n\n**Critical**: Research similar datasets in same group folder first.\n\n**Before writing meta.ts**:\n\n1. List all datasets in `<GROUP_FOLDER>/` directory\n2. Read 2-3 similar `meta.ts` files (similar geometry type, similar purpose)\n3. Infer patterns:\n   - Category from similar datasets\n   - Attribution patterns\n   - License conventions\n   - Style patterns\n   - Inspector settings\n4. If unclear, ask user to confirm or provide missing data\n\n**Required fields** (from `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/types.ts`):\n\n- `regions`: RegionSlug[] (required)\n- `public`: boolean (required)\n- `dataSourceType`: ''local'' (required)\n- `configs`: Array with at least one config (required)\n\n**Config required fields**:\n\n- `name`: string\n- `attributionHtml`: string\n- `inspector`: { enabled: boolean, ... } or { enabled: false }\n- `layers`: Layer[] (required)\n\n**Config optional fields**:\n\n- `category`: StaticDatasetCategoryKey | null\n- `updatedAt`: string\n- `description`: string\n- `dataSourceMarkdown`: string\n- `licence`: License type (see types.ts)\n- `licenceOsmCompatible`: ''licence'' | ''waiver'' | ''no''\n- `legends`: Legend[]\n\n**Style/Legend**: If not specified, make best guess:\n\n- Use `defaultLayerStyles()` from `_utils/defaultLayerStyles.ts` for simple cases\n- For polygons: fill + outline\n- For lines: colored line with width\n- For points: circle markers\n- Create appropriate legend entries\n\n**Example structure**:\n\n```typescript\nimport { MetaData } from \"../../../types\";\nimport { defaultLayerStyles } from \"../../_utils/defaultLayerStyles\";\n\nexport const data: MetaData = {\n  regions: [\"infravelo\"], // From user or infer from group folder\n  public: true,\n  dataSourceType: \"local\",\n  configs: [\n    {\n      name: \"Dataset Name\",\n      category: \"berlin/misc\", // Infer from similar datasets\n      attributionHtml: \"Source Name\", // Ask if unclear\n      licence: \"DL-DE/ZERO-2.0\", // Infer from similar datasets\n      inspector: { enabled: false }, // Default unless specified\n      layers: defaultLayerStyles(), // Or custom layers\n    },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### 5. Verify Command\n\nCheck `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/updateStaticDatasets.ts` for correct params:\n\n- `--folder-filter=<SUB_FOLDER_NAME>` (matches full path, so sub-folder name works)\n- `--env=dev` (or staging/production, required)\n\n**One-click command** (replace `<SUB_FOLDER_NAME>` with actual folder name):\n\n```bash\nbun --env-file=.env ./scripts/StaticDatasets/updateStaticDatasets.ts --folder-filter=<SUB_FOLDER_NAME> --env=dev\n```\n\nNote: `updateDownloadSources.ts` is for WFS downloads (requires downloadConfig.ts). Use `updateStaticDatasets.ts` for local GeoJSON files.\n\n### 6. Verify TypeScript Compilation\n\n**Always run this after creating or modifying TypeScript files** (meta.ts, transform.ts, or any imports):\n\n```bash\nnpm run type-check:deploy\n```\n\nThis temporarily removes the `geojson` symlink, runs TypeScript type-checking, and restores the symlink. It simulates the Docker build environment where symlinks aren''t available, ensuring your code will compile correctly during builds.\n\n## Validation\n\nBefore completing:\n\n1. ✅ Folder structure created\n2. ✅ GeoJSON file moved and prettier run\n3. ✅ transform.ts created only if needed\n4. ✅ meta.ts follows type structure (check with TypeScript)\n5. ✅ Similar datasets in group folder reviewed for patterns\n6. ✅ Command verified and provided as one-click action\n7. ✅ `npm run type-check:deploy` run successfully (see Step 6)\n\n## References\n\n- Types: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/types.ts`\n- Examples: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/region-berlin/*/meta.ts`\n- Utils: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/geojson/_utils/`\n- Docs: `docs/Features-Parameter-Deeplinks.md`, `docs/Regional-Masks.md`\n- Update script: `app/scripts/StaticDatasets/updateStaticDatasets.ts`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:51:33.581Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GeoData Analysis Agents needing seamless integration of static GeoJSON datasets.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝集成静态GeoJSON数据集的GeoData分析代理。","ja":"静的GeoJSONデータセットをシームレスに統合する必要があるGeoData分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정적 GeoJSON 데이터셋을 無断으로 통합해야 하는 지理 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de GeoData que necesitan una integración sin problemas de conjuntos de datos GeoJSON estáticos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de GeoData ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente de jeux de données GeoJSON statiques.","de":"Perfekt für GeoData-Analyse-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration statischer GeoJSON-Datensätze benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de GeoData que precisam de integração sem interrupções de conjuntos de dados GeoJSON estáticos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа геоданных, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция статических наборов данных GeoJSON.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل البيانات الجغرافية المكانية التي تحتاج إلى دمج متواصل لبيانات GeoJSON الثابتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate new static GeoJSON datasets into the app''s scripts, utilizing symlinks for efficient data management and providing access to bicycle and parking infrastructure data from OpenStreetMap (OSM) for administrative staff, supporting file formats like GeoJSON.","zh":"赋予代理将新静态GeoJSON数据集集成到应用程序脚本中，利用符号链接进行高效的数据管理，并为管理人员提供来自OpenStreetMap（OSM）的自行车和停车基础设施数据，支持GeoJSON等文件格式。","ja":"エージェントが新しい静的GeoJSONデータセットをアプリケーションのスクリプトに統合できるようにし、シンボリックリンクを使用して効率的なデータ管理を行い、管理スタッフがOpenStreetMap（OSM）からの自転車と駐車施設のデータにアクセスできるようにし、GeoJSONなどのファイル形式をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 정적 GeoJSON 데이터셋을 애플리케이션 스크립트에 통합할 수 있도록 하고 시ンボ릭 링크를 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 관리를 수행하며 관리 직원이 OpenStreetMap(OSM)에서 제공하는 자전거 및 주차 인프라 데이터에 액세스할 수 있도록 하며 GeoJSON을 포함한 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar nuevos conjuntos de datos GeoJSON estáticos en los scripts de la aplicación, utilizando symlinks para una gestión de datos eficiente y proporcionando acceso a datos de infraestructura de bicicletas y aparcamiento de OpenStreetMap (OSM) para el personal administrativo, compatible con formatos de archivo como GeoJSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer de nouveaux jeux de données GeoJSON statiques dans les scripts de l''application, en utilisant des symlinks pour une gestion de données efficace et en fournissant un accès aux données d''infrastructure de bicyclette et de stationnement d''OpenStreetMap (OSM) pour le personnel administratif, en prenant en charge des formats de fichier tels que GeoJSON.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, neue statische GeoJSON-Datensätze in die Skripte der App zu integrieren, indem symlinks für eine effiziente Datenverwaltung verwendet werden und Zugriff auf Daten zur Fahrrad- und Parkinfrastruktur von OpenStreetMap (OSM) für das Administrationspersonal bereitgestellt wird, wobei Formate wie GeoJSON unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar novos conjuntos de dados GeoJSON estáticos nos scripts do aplicativo, utilizando symlinks para gerenciamento eficiente de dados e fornecendo acesso a dados de infraestrutura de bicicletas e estacionamento da OpenStreetMap (OSM) para o pessoal administrativo, suportando formatos de arquivo como GeoJSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать новые статические наборы данных GeoJSON в скрипты приложения, используя symlinks для эффективного управления данными и предоставляя доступ к данным о велосипедной и парковочной инфраструктуре из OpenStreetMap (OSM) для административного персонала, поддерживая форматы файлов, такие как GeoJSON.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من دمج مجموعات بيانات GeoJSON الثابتة الجديدة في سكريبتات التطبيق، باستخدام الروابط الرمزية للتحكم الفعال في البيانات وتوفير الوصول إلى بيانات البنية التحتية للدراجات الهوائية ومواقف السيارات من OpenStreetMap (OSM) لأعضاء الموظفين الإداريين، مع دعم صيغ الملفات مثل GeoJSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding new bicycle infrastructure datasets","Integrating parking data from OpenStreetMap","Uploading custom GeoJSON files for analysis"],"zh":["添加新的自行车基础设施数据集","集成OpenStreetMap的停车数据","上传自定义GeoJSON文件进行分析"],"ja":["新しい自転車インフラストラクチャデータセットを追加する","OpenStreetMapからの駐車データを統合する","カスタムGeoJSONファイルをアップロードして分析する"],"ko":["新的 자전거 인프라스트럭처 데이터셋 추가","OpenStreetMap의 주차 데이터 통합","사용자 정의 GeoJSON 파일을 업로드하여 분석"],"es":["Agregar nuevos conjuntos de datos de infraestructura de bicicletas","Integrar datos de aparcamiento de OpenStreetMap","Subir archivos GeoJSON personalizados para análisis"],"fr":["Ajouter de nouveaux jeux de données d''infrastructure de bicyclette","Intégrer des données de stationnement d''OpenStreetMap","Télécharger des fichiers GeoJSON personnalisés pour analyse"],"de":["Hinzufügen neuer Datensätze zur Fahrradinfrastruktur","Integrieren von Parkdaten aus OpenStreetMap","Hochladen von benutzerdefinierten GeoJSON-Dateien für die Analyse"],"pt":["Adicionar novos conjuntos de dados de infraestrutura de bicicletas","Integrar dados de estacionamento da OpenStreetMap","Fazer upload de arquivos GeoJSON personalizados para análise"],"ru":["Добавление новых наборов данных о велосипедной инфраструктуре","Интеграция данных о парковке из OpenStreetMap","Загрузка пользовательских файлов GeoJSON для анализа"],"ar":["إضافة مجموعات بيانات جديدة للبنية التحتية للدراجات الهوائية","دمج بيانات مواقف السيارات من OpenStreetMap","تحميل ملفات GeoJSON المخصصة للتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided GeoJSON file path","Dependent on OpenStreetMap (OSM) data availability","Symlink setup necessary for /geojson folder"],"zh":["需要用户提供GeoJSON文件路径","依赖OpenStreetMap（OSM）数据的可用性","需要设置/geojson文件夹的符号链接"],"ja":["ユーザーが提供するGeoJSONファイルパスが必要","OpenStreetMap（OSM）データの可用性に依存","/geojsonフォルダーのシンボリックリンクの設定が必要"],"ko":["사용자 제공 GeoJSON 파일 경로 필요","OpenStreetMap(OSM) 데이터 가용성에 의존","/geojson 폴더의 심볼릭 링크 설정 필요"],"es":["Requiere la ruta del archivo GeoJSON proporcionada por el usuario","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de datos de OpenStreetMap (OSM)","Configuración de symlin necesaria para la carpeta /geojson"],"fr":["Nécessite le chemin du fichier GeoJSON fourni par l''utilisateur","Dépend de la disponibilité des données d''OpenStreetMap (OSM)","Configuration de symlin nécessaire pour le dossier /geojson"],"de":["Benötigt den vom Benutzer bereitgestellten Pfad der GeoJSON-Datei","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit von OpenStreetMap (OSM)-Daten","Symlink-Einrichtung notwendig für das Verzeichnis /geojson"],"pt":["Requer caminho do arquivo GeoJSON fornecido pelo usuário","Dependente da disponibilidade de dados da OpenStreetMap (OSM)","Configuração de symlink necessária para a pasta /geojson"],"ru":["Требует пути к файлу GeoJSON, предоставленного пользователем","Зависит от доступности данных OpenStreetMap (OSM)","Необходимо настроить symlink для папки /geojson"],"ar":["يتطلب مسار ملف GeoJSON المقدم من قبل المستخدم","يعتمد على توافر بيانات OpenStreetMap (OSM)","يتطلب إعداد الارتباطات الرمزية للمجلد /geojson"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
