ón del rendimiento y seguimiento de logs","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Révision de code en trois niveaux de priorité","Analyse de sécurité et de protection des données","Vérification des bases de données et des migrations","Optimisation des performances et suivi des logs","Intégration avec des outils de développement existants","Support pour plusieurs langages de programmation"],"de":["Code-Review in drei Prioritätsstufen","Sicherheits- und Datenschutzanalyse","Überprüfung von Datenbanken und Migrationen","Leistungsoptimierung und Log-Verfolgung","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Três níveis de prioridade para revisão de código","Verificação de segurança e proteção de dados","Análise de banco de dados e migração","Otimização de desempenho e boas práticas","Integração com git para revisão de código","Relatórios detalhados de revisão de código"],"ru":["Три уровня приоритета для код-ревью","Проверка безопасности и защиты данных","Анализ базы данных и миграции","Оптимизация производительности и лучшие практики","Интеграция с git для код-ревью","Детальные отчеты о код-ревью"],"ar":["ثلاثة مستويات من الأولوية لمراجعة الكود","التحقق من الأمان وحماية البيانات","تحليل قاعدة البيانات والهجرة","تحسين الأداء وأفضل الممارسات","التكامل مع جيت لمراجعة الكود","تقارير مفصلة عن مراجعة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","智能代码生成","代码安全","代码性能优化","代码审查工作流程","CodeSpirit","代码质量"],"ja":["コードレビュー","智能コード生成","コードセキュリティ","コードパフォーマンス最適化","コードレビュー作業フロー","CodeSpirit","コード品質"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","智能 코드 생성","코드 보안","코드 성능 최적화","코드 리뷰 작업 흐름","CodeSpirit","코드 품질"],"es":["revisión de código","code review","desarrollo de software","calidad del código","seguridad del código","optimización del rendimiento","herramientas de desarrollo","integración de código"],"fr":["révision de code","code review","développement de logiciels","qualité du code","sécurité du code","optimisation des performances","outils de développement","intégration de code"],"de":["Code-Review","Code-Prüfung","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität","Code-Sicherheit","Leistungsoptimierung","Entwicklungstools","Code-Integration"],"pt":["revisão de código","ferramenta de revisão de código","qualidade de código","segurança de código","otimização de desempenho","boas práticas de codificação","git","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["код-ревью","инструмент код-ревью","качество кода","безопасность кода","оптимизация производительности","лучшие практики кодирования","git","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود","أداة مراجعة الكود","جودة الكود","أمان الكود","تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات في البرمجة","جيت","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"xin-lai","repo":"CodeSpirit","repoPath":"xin-lai/CodeSpirit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-review","description":"基于 CodeSpirit 项目规范进行系统化代码审查。检查安全、数据库、异步编程、多语言、DTO、控制器、服务类等规范。当用户需要审查代码、检查代码质量、或准备提交代码时使用。","bodyPreview":"# 代码审查 Skill\n\n## 快速开始\n\nCodeSpirit 代码审查采用三级优先级体系：\n\n1. **🔴 严重级别**：必须修复（安全、数据库、异步编程、反射调用）\n2. **🟡 重要级别**：影响质量（多语言、DTO、控制器、服务类）\n3. **🟢 建议级别**：最佳实践（注释、命名、性能优化）\n\n---\n\n## 审查工作流程\n\n### 步骤 1：确定审查范围\n\n明确需要审查的文件列表（通过 git status、文件列表等方式）。\n\n### 步骤 2：执行严重级别检查（🔴 优先）\n\n按优先级依次检查，发现严重问题立即标记：\n\n1. **安全与数据保护** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/security.mdc)\n   - [ ] 密码明文存储、SQL注入、敏感信息泄露\n   - [ ] DTO返回敏感字段（需 `[JsonIgnore]`）\n\n2. **数据库与迁移** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/database.mdc)\n   - [ ] 雪花ID缺少 `ValueGeneratedNever()` 配置","body":"# 代码审查 Skill\n\n## 快速开始\n\nCodeSpirit 代码审查采用三级优先级体系：\n\n1. **🔴 严重级别**：必须修复（安全、数据库、异步编程、反射调用）\n2. **🟡 重要级别**：影响质量（多语言、DTO、控制器、服务类）\n3. **🟢 建议级别**：最佳实践（注释、命名、性能优化）\n\n---\n\n## 审查工作流程\n\n### 步骤 1：确定审查范围\n\n明确需要审查的文件列表（通过 git status、文件列表等方式）。\n\n### 步骤 2：执行严重级别检查（🔴 优先）\n\n按优先级依次检查，发现严重问题立即标记：\n\n1. **安全与数据保护** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/security.mdc)\n   - [ ] 密码明文存储、SQL注入、敏感信息泄露\n   - [ ] DTO返回敏感字段（需 `[JsonIgnore]`）\n\n2. **数据库与迁移** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/database.mdc)\n   - [ ] 雪花ID缺少 `ValueGeneratedNever()` 配置\n   - [ ] 迁移使用错误的 DbContext（必须用数据库特定的）\n   - [ ] 多租户实体缺少 `IMultiTenant` 接口\n\n3. **异步编程** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/performance.mdc)\n   - [ ] 使用 `Task.Result` 或 `Task.Wait()` 阻塞调用\n   - [ ] I/O 操作未使用 async/await\n\n4. **反射调用（新增）**\n   - [ ] 使用反射调用扩展方法（应使用回调委托）\n   - [ ] 反射导致编译时类型安全缺失\n\n5. **依赖注入** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/dependency-injection.mdc)\n   - [ ] 服务类缺少生命周期标记接口\n   - [ ] 手动重复注册已自动注册的服务\n\n6. **包管理** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/package-management.mdc)\n   - [ ] 项目文件中指定版本（应在 Directory.Packages.props）\n   - [ ] 冗余包引用（传递依赖已可用）\n\n### 步骤 3：执行重要级别检查（🟡）\n\n1. **多语言国际化** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/i18n.mdc)\n   - [ ] 硬编码字符串（需使用 `_localizer`）\n   - [ ] DTO 缺少 `[Display]` 特性\n   - [ ] 验证消息未本地化\n\n2. **DTO 规范** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/dto.mdc)\n   - [ ] 缺少验证特性（`[Required]`、`[StringLength]`）\n   - [ ] 查询 DTO 未继承 `QueryDtoBase`\n\n3. **控制器规范** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/controller.mdc)\n   - [ ] 缺少 `[DisplayName]` 特性\n   - [ ] 返回类型不是 `ActionResult<ApiResponse<T>>`\n\n4. **服务类规范** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/service.mdc)\n   - [ ] 未继承 `BaseCRUDService` 或实现 `IBaseCRUDService`\n   - [ ] 缺少 XML 文档注释\n\n5. **EF Core 查询优化**\n   - [ ] 只读查询缺少 `AsNoTracking()`\n   - [ ] N+1 查询问题（需用 `Include()`）\n\n### 步骤 4：执行建议级别检查（🟢）\n\n1. **代码注释** - 复杂逻辑添加注释\n2. **命名规范** → 📖 [详细规范](mdc:../../rules/naming-conventions.mdc)\n3. **时间处理** - 优先使用 UTC 时间\n4. **序列化** - 统一使用 Newtonsoft.Json\n5. **性能优化** - 投影查询、分布式锁、事件驱动\n\n### 步骤 5：生成审查报告\n\n使用 [report-template.md](report-template.md) 生成结构化审查报告：\n\n1. **📊 统计摘要**（优先显示）- 问题数量和优先级\n2. **🔴 严重问题** - 必须修复\n3. **🟡 重要问题** - 影响质量\n4. **🟢 建议改进** - 最佳实践\n\n---\n\n## 📌 特别注意：权限系统\n\n**CodeSpirit 采用自动权限生成**，大部分情况无需配置 `[Permission]` 特性。\n\n### ✅ 不要标记为问题\n- 标准 CRUD 操作缺少 `[RequirePermission]`（框架自动生成）\n\n### ❌ 应标记为问题\n- 需要权限继承但未用 `[Permission]` 配置\n- 公开 API 未标记 `[AllowAnonymous]`\n\n**示例**：\n```csharp\n// ✅ 自动生成权限（无需配置）\n[HttpPost]\n[DisplayName(\"创建用户\")]\npublic async Task<ActionResult> Create(CreateDto dto) { }\n\n// ✅ 需要权限继承时才配置\n[HttpPut(\"{id}\")]\n[Permission(AllowInheritedPermissions = new[] { \"users_manage\" })]\n[DisplayName(\"更新用户\")]\npublic async Task<ActionResult> Update(long id, UpdateDto dto) { }\n```\n\n---\n\n## 常见问题速查\n\n### 反射调用扩展方法 🔴\n```csharp\n// ❌ 错误\nmethod?.Invoke(null, new object[] { services, configuration });\n\n// ✅ 正确：使用回调委托\nthis.ConfigureStandardInfrastructureServices(services, configuration, (s, c) =>\n{\n    s.AddCodeSpiritMultiTenant(c);\n});\n```\n\n### 硬编码字符串 🟡\n```csharp\n// ❌ 错误\nreturn SuccessResponse(\"操作成功！\");\n\n// ✅ 正确\nreturn SuccessResponse(message: _localizer[\"Common.Save\"].Value);\n```\n\n### 阻塞调用 🔴\n```csharp\n// ❌ 错误\nvar result = _repository.GetListAsync().Result;\n\n// ✅ 正确\nvar result = await _repository.GetListAsync();\n```\n\n### 多租户隔离缺失 🔴\n```csharp\n// ❌ 错误\npublic class Question : AuditableEntityBase<long> { }\n\n// ✅ 正确\npublic class Question : AuditableEntityBase<long>, IMultiTenant\n{\n    public string TenantId { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 审查技巧\n\n### 按文件类型审查\n- **实体**：接口实现、多租户、审计字段、雪花ID\n- **DTO**：验证特性、Display特性、多语言\n- **服务**：基类继承、依赖注入、XML注释、异步\n- **控制器**：特性标记、返回类型、权限控制\n\n### 使用工具辅助\n- **Grep/搜索**：搜索 `Task.Result`、`Task.Wait()`、`method.Invoke`、硬编码字符串\n- **ReadLints**：检查编辑过的文件的 linter 错误\n- **规则文档**：参考 24 个规则文件的详细说明\n\n---\n\n## 相关资源\n\n- 📖 [项目规范文档](../../rules/) - 24 个规范文件\n- 📋 [审查报告模板](report-template.md) - 标准化报告格式\n- 🔒 [安全规范](../../rules/security.mdc)\n- 🗄️ [数据库规范](../../rules/database.mdc)\n- 🚀 [启动框架规范](../../rules/startup-framework.mdc)\n- 🌐 [多语言规范](../../rules/i18n.mdc)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:51:18.364Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing advanced code review and analysis capabilities for security, database, and performance optimization.","zh":"适合需要高级代码审查和分析功能的全栈代理，尤其是在安全、数据库和性能优化方面。","ja":"セキュリティ、データベース、パフォーマンス最適化の高度なコードレビューと分析機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"보안, 데이터베이스, 성능 최적화와 같은 고급 코드 리뷰 및 분석 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full-Stack que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de revisión y análisis de código para seguridad, base de datos y optimización de rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack ayant besoin de capacités avancées de révision et d''analyse de code pour la sécurité, la base de données et l''optimisation des performances.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die erweiterte Code-Überprüfungs- und Analysefunktionen für Sicherheit, Datenbank und Leistungsoptimierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de revisão e análise de código para segurança, banco de dados e otimização de desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Full-Stack агентов, которые требуют продвинутых возможностей проверки и анализа кода для безопасности, базы данных и оптимизации производительности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتكاملين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لمراجعة وتحليل الشفرة لأغراض الأمان وقاعدة البيانات وتحسين الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough code audits using a three-tier priority system, checking for severe issues like SQL injection and sensitive information leaks, and providing suggestions for best practices such as annotation and naming conventions, all while leveraging intelligent code generation engines.","zh":"赋予代理执行彻底的代码审计的能力，使用三层优先级系统，检查严重问题，如SQL注入和敏感信息泄漏，并提供最佳实践的建议，如注释和命名约定，同时利用智能代码生成引擎。","ja":"三層優先度システムを使用して、SQLインジェクションや機密情報漏洩などの深刻な問題をチェックし、注釈や命名規則などのベストプラクティスに関する提案を提供し、インテリジェントなコード生成エンジンを活用して、徹底的なコード監査を実行するエージェントの能力を提供します。","ko":"-three 계층 우선순위 시스템을 사용하여 심각한 문제인 SQL 주입 및 민감한 정보 누출을 확인하고, 주석 및 명명 규칙과 같은 모범 사례에 대한 제안을 제공하며, 지능형 코드 생성 엔진을 활용하여 철저한 코드 감사를 수행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de código exhaustivas utilizando un sistema de priorización de tres niveles, que comprueba problemas graves como inyección SQL y fugas de información confidencial, y proporciona sugerencias para las mejores prácticas, como anotación y convenciones de nomenclatura, todo ello aprovechando los motores de generación de código inteligentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de code approfondis en utilisant un système de priorisation à trois niveaux, qui vérifie les problèmes graves tels que l''injection SQL et les fuites d''informations sensibles, et fournit des suggestions pour les meilleures pratiques telles que l''annotation et les conventions de nommage, le tout en exploitant les moteurs de génération de code intelligents.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gründliche Code-Audits durchzuführen, indem sie ein dreistufiges Prioritätssystem verwenden, um schwerwiegende Probleme wie SQL-Injection und Datenlecks zu überprüfen und Vorschläge für Best Practices wie Annotation und Namenskonventionen zu liefern, während sie intelligente Code-Generierungsmotoren nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de código abrangentes utilizando um sistema de prioridade de três níveis, verificando problemas graves como injeção de SQL e vazamentos de informações sensíveis, e fornecendo sugestões de boas práticas, como anotação e convenções de nomenclatura, aproveitando os motores de geração de código inteligentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные аудиты кода с помощью трехуровневой системы приоритизации, проверяя серьезные проблемы, такие как внедрение SQL и утечки конфиденциальной информации, и предоставляя рекомендации по лучшим практикам, таким как аннотация и соглашения об именах, используя智能ные движки генерации кода.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إجراء تدقيقات شاملة للشفرة باستخدام نظام أولويات من ثلاثة مستويات، للتحقق من مشاكل خطيرة مثل الحقن SQL وتسرب المعلومات الحساسة، وتقديم اقتراحات لأفضل الممارسات مثل التعليق وأسماء التسمية، مع الاستفادة من محركات توليد الشفرة الذكية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating security vulnerability detection in backend code","Reviewing database migration scripts for potential issues","Optimizing code performance by identifying bottlenecks and suggesting improvements"],"zh":["后端代码中的安全漏洞自动检测","数据库迁移脚本的潜在问题审查","通过识别瓶颈和建议改进来优化代码性能"],"ja":["バックエンドコードでのセキュリティ脆弱性の自動検出","データベース移行スクリプトの潜在的な問題のレビュー","ボトルネックの特定と改善の提案を通じてコードのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["백엔드 코드의 보안 취약성 자동 감지","데이터베이스 마이그레이션 스크립트의 잠재적인 문제 검토","병목 현상을 식별하고 개선 사항을 제안하여 코드 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la detección de vulnerabilidades de seguridad en el código backend","Revisión de scripts de migración de base de datos para posibles problemas","Optimización del rendimiento del código al identificar cuellos de botella y sugerir mejoras"],"fr":["Automatisation de la détection des vulnérabilités de sécurité dans le code backend","Révision des scripts de migration de base de données pour les problèmes potentiels","Optimisation des performances du code en identifiant les goulots d''étranglement et en suggérant des améliorations"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erkennung von Sicherheitslücken im Backend-Code","Überprüfung von Datenbank-Migrations-Skripten auf mögliche Probleme","Optimierung der Code-Leistung durch Identifizierung von Engpässen und Vorschlagen von Verbesserungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a detecção de vulnerabilidades de segurança em código de backend","Revisar scripts de migração de banco de dados para problemas potenciais","Otimizar o desempenho do código, identificando gargalos e sugerindo melhorias"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обнаружение уязвимостей безопасности в бэкенд-коде","Проверять скрипты миграции базы данных на потенциальные проблемы","Оптимизировать производительность кода, выявляя узкие места и предлагая улучшения"],"ar":["توسيع الكشف التلقائي عن نقاط الضعف في أمان الشفرة الخلفية","مراجعة نصوص هجرة قاعدة البيانات للتحقق من المشاكل المحتملة","تحسين أداء الشفرة، من خلال تحديد العوائق وتقديم اقتراحات للتحسين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repository or file system","Limited to specific programming languages and frameworks supported by CodeSpirit"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库或文件系统","仅限CodeSpirit支持的特定编程语言和框架"],"ja":["コードリポジトリまたはファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","CodeSpiritでサポートされている特定のプログラミング言語とフレームワークに限定される"],"ko":["코드 저장소 또는 파일 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요함","CodeSpirit에서 지원하는 특정 프로그래밍 언어 및 프레임워크로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de código o al sistema de archivos","Limitado a lenguajes de programación y marcos específicos compatibles con CodeSpirit"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel de code ou au système de fichiers","Limité à des langages de programmation et des frameworks spécifiques pris en charge par CodeSpirit"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Code-Repository oder das Dateisystem","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Programmiersprachen und Frameworks, die von CodeSpirit unterstützt werden"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório de código ou sistema de arquivos","Limitado a linguagens de programação e estruturas específicas suportadas pelo CodeSpirit"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию кода или файловой системе","Ограничен конкретными языками программирования и фреймворками, поддерживаемыми CodeSpirit"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع الشفرة أو نظام الملفات","محدود بلغات البرمجة والإطارات الخاصة المدعومة من قبل CodeSpirit"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xin-lai/CodeSpirit/ai-development', 'community', 'xin-lai', 'CodeSpirit', 'xin-lai/CodeSpirit', 'ai-development', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:51:42.461Z', NULL, '{"id":"xin-lai/CodeSpirit/ai-development","name":"ai-development","description":{"zh":"CodeSpirit 是一个革命性的全栈低代码 + AI 开发框架，通过智能代码生成引擎和深度 AI 协同实现后端驱动的全栈开发","ja":"CodeSpirit は、スマートコード生成エンジンとディープ AI 協同を通じて、バックエンド駆動のフルスタック開発を実現する革命的なフルスタック低コード + AI 開発フレームワーク","ko":"CodeSpirit는 지능형 코드 생성 엔진과 심층 AI 협력을 통해 백엔드 구동 풀스택 개발을 달성하는 혁신적인 풀스택 저코드 + AI 개발 프레임워크","es":"CodeSpirit es un framework de desarrollo de IA de bajo código que permite la generación de código inteligente y la colaboración profunda con la IA","fr":"CodeSpirit est un framework de développement d''IA à faible code qui permet la génération de code intelligent et la collaboration approfondie avec l''IA","de":"CodeSpirit ist ein Low-Code-KI-Entwicklungsframework, das die intelligente Codegenerierung und die tiefe KI-Zusammenarbeit ermöglicht","pt":"CodeSpirit é um framework de desenvolvimento de IA que permite a criação de aplicações de forma rápida e eficiente","ru":"CodeSpirit - это фреймворк разработки ИИ, который позволяет создавать приложения быстро и эффективно","ar":"CodeSpirit هو إطار عمل لتنمية الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات بسرعة وكفاءة","en":"CodeSpirit is a revolutionary full-stack low-code + AI development framework that achieves backend-driven full-stack development paradigm through intelligent code generation engine and deep AI collaboration."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI 开发框架 - CodeSpirit","ja":"AI 開発フレームワーク - CodeSpirit","ko":"AI 개발 프레임워크 - CodeSpirit","es":"Desarrollo de IA con CodeSpirit","fr":"Développement d''IA avec CodeSpirit","de":"KI-Entwicklung mit CodeSpirit","pt":"Desenvolvimento de IA com CodeSpirit","ru":"Разработка ИИ с CodeSpirit","ar":"تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي مع CodeSpirit","en":"ai-development"},"description":{"zh":"CodeSpirit 是一个革命性的全栈低代码 + AI 开发框架，通过智能代码生成引擎和深度 AI 协同实现后端驱动的全栈开发","ja":"CodeSpirit は、スマートコード生成エンジンとディープ AI 協同を通じて、バックエンド駆動のフルスタック開発を実現する革命的なフルスタック低コード + AI 開発フレームワーク","ko":"CodeSpirit는 지능형 코드 생성 엔진과 심층 AI 협력을 통해 백엔드 구동 풀스택 개발을 달성하는 혁신적인 풀스택 저코드 + AI 개발 프레임워크","es":"CodeSpirit es un framework de desarrollo de IA de bajo código que permite la generación de código inteligente y la colaboración profunda con la IA","fr":"CodeSpirit est un framework de développement d''IA à faible code qui permet la génération de code intelligent et la collaboration approfondie avec l''IA","de":"CodeSpirit ist ein Low-Code-KI-Entwicklungsframework, das die intelligente Codegenerierung und die tiefe KI-Zusammenarbeit ermöglicht","pt":"CodeSpirit é um framework de desenvolvimento de IA que permite a criação de aplicações de forma rápida e eficiente","ru":"CodeSpirit - это фреймворк разработки ИИ, который позволяет создавать приложения быстро и эффективно","ar":"CodeSpirit هو إطار عمل لتنمية الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات بسرعة وكفاءة","en":"CodeSpirit is a revolutionary full-stack low-code + AI development framework that achieves backend-driven full-stack development paradigm through intelligent..."},"definition":{"en":"CodeSpirit is a revolutionary full-stack low-code + AI development framework that achieves backend-driven full-stack development paradigm through intelligent code generation engine and deep AI collaboration."},"features":{"zh":["AI 表单填充","AI 长任务处理","LLM 结构化任务","低代码开发","AI 协同开发","全栈开发"],"ja":["AI フォームフィル","AI ロングタスク処理","LLM 構造化タスク","低コード開発","AI 協同開発","フルスタック開発"],"ko":["AI 폼 填充","AI 장기 작업 처리","LLM 구조화 작업","저코드 개발","AI 협력 개발","풀스택 개발"],"es":["Generación de código inteligente","Colaboración profunda con la IA","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA de bajo código","Soporte para tareas de IA asincrónicas","Análisis y generación de contenido con LLM"],"fr":["Génération de code intelligent","Collaboration approfondie avec l''IA","Développement d''applications d''IA à faible code","Prise en charge des tâches d''IA asynchrones","Analyse et génération de contenu avec LLM"],"de":["Intelligente Codegenerierung","Tiefe KI-Zusammenarbeit","Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen mit Low-Code","Unterstützung für asynchrone KI-Aufgaben","Inhaltsanalyse und -generierung mit LLM"],"pt":["Geração de código inteligente","Colaboração em profundidade com IA","Três modos de funcionamento: AI forma filling, AI long task processing e LLM structured task","Suporte a tarefas em segundo plano","Análise e geração de conteúdo com LLM"],"ru":["Интеллектуальная генерация кода","Глубокое сотрудничество с ИИ","Три режима работы: AI форма заполнения, AI длинная обработка задач и LLM структурированная задача","Поддержка фоновых задач","Анализ и генерация контента с LLM"],"ar":["توليد كود ذكي","تعاون عميق مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","ثلاثة أوضاع للعمل: ملء النموذج الذكي، معالجة المهام الطويلة الذكية، ومهمة المنظمة الذكية","دعم المهام في الخلفية","تحليل وإنشاء المحتوى مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 开发","低代码开发","全栈开发","AI 协同","智能代码生成","深度 AI 协同","CodeSpirit","AI 表单填充","AI 长任务处理"],"ja":["AI 開発","低コード開発","フルスタック開発","AI 協同","スマートコード生成","ディープ AI 協同","CodeSpirit","AI フォームフィル","AI ロングタスク処理"],"ko":["AI 개발","저코드 개발","풀스택 개발","AI 협력","지능형 코드 생성","심층 AI 협력","CodeSpirit","AI 폼 填充","AI 장기 작업 처리"],"es":["desarrollo de IA","CodeSpirit","framework de desarrollo de IA","generación de código inteligente","colaboración con la IA","aplicaciones de IA de bajo código"],"fr":["développement d''IA","CodeSpirit","framework de développement d''IA","génération de code intelligent","collaboration avec l''IA","applications d''IA à faible code"],"de":["KI-Entwicklung","CodeSpirit","KI-Entwicklungsframework","intelligente Codegenerierung","KI-Zusammenarbeit","KI-Anwendungen mit Low-Code"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de ia","code spirit","geração de código inteligente","colaboração em profundidade com ia","ai forma filling","ai long task processing","llm structured task"],"ru":["разработка ии","code spirit","интеллектуальная генерация кода","глубокое сотрудничество с ии","ai форма заполнения","ai длинная обработка задач","llm структурированная задача"],"ar":["تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","code spirit","توليد كود ذكي","تعاون عميق مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","ملء النموذج الذكي","معالجة المهام الطويلة الذكية","مهمة المنظمة الذكية"]}},"owner":"xin-lai","repo":"CodeSpirit","repoPath":"xin-lai/CodeSpirit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-development","description":"指导在 CodeSpirit 项目中集成 AI 功能的完整开发流程。包括 AI 表单填充、AI 长任务处理、LLM 集成和提示词工程。当用户需要添加 AI 功能、集成 LLM、或开发 AI 驱动的业务功能时使用。","bodyPreview":"# AI 功能开发 Skill\n\n## 快速开始\n\nCodeSpirit 项目支持三种 AI 功能模式：\n\n1. **AI 表单填充**：零代码方案，自动生成 AI 填充端点\n2. **AI 长任务处理**：异步任务，支持进度跟踪\n3. **LLM 结构化任务**：使用 LLMAssistant 进行内容分析和生成\n\n---\n\n## 模式选择决策树\n\n```\n需要AI功能？\n├── 单字段触发填充？\n│   └── 是 → AI 表单填充（字段触发模式）\n│\n├── 用户自定义需求填充整个表单？\n│   └── 是 → AI 表单填充（全局填充模式）\n│\n├── 批量生成/长时间任务？\n│   └── 是 → AI 长任务处理\n│\n└── 内容分析/审核/生成？\n    └── 是 → LLM 结构化任务\n```\n\n---\n\n## 场景 1：AI 表单填充（零代码方案）\n\n### 适用场景\n\n- 用户输入触发字段后，AI 智能填充其他相关字段\n- 用户在表单顶部输入自定义需求，AI 一次性填充整个表单\n\n### 工作流程\n\n#### 步骤 1：注册 AI 服务\n\n在 `Program.","body":"# AI 功能开发 Skill\n\n## 快速开始\n\nCodeSpirit 项目支持三种 AI 功能模式：\n\n1. **AI 表单填充**：零代码方案，自动生成 AI 填充端点\n2. **AI 长任务处理**：异步任务，支持进度跟踪\n3. **LLM 结构化任务**：使用 LLMAssistant 进行内容分析和生成\n\n---\n\n## 模式选择决策树\n\n```\n需要AI功能？\n├── 单字段触发填充？\n│   └── 是 → AI 表单填充（字段触发模式）\n│\n├── 用户自定义需求填充整个表单？\n│   └── 是 → AI 表单填充（全局填充模式）\n│\n├── 批量生成/长时间任务？\n│   └── 是 → AI 长任务处理\n│\n└── 内容分析/审核/生成？\n    └── 是 → LLM 结构化任务\n```\n\n---\n\n## 场景 1：AI 表单填充（零代码方案）\n\n### 适用场景\n\n- 用户输入触发字段后，AI 智能填充其他相关字段\n- 用户在表单顶部输入自定义需求，AI 一次性填充整个表单\n\n### 工作流程\n\n#### 步骤 1：注册 AI 服务\n\n在 `Program.cs` 或 API 配置类中：\n\n```csharp\n// 注册 LLM 服务（必需）\nbuilder.Services.AddLLMServices();\n\n// 注册 AI 表单填充自动端点（推荐）\nbuilder.Services.AddAiFormFillEndpoints();\n\nvar app = builder.Build();\n\n// 启用 AI 填充中间件\napp.UseAiFormFillEndpoints();\n```\n\n#### 步骤 2：配置 DTO\n\n**字段触发模式**：\n```csharp\n[AiFormFill(TriggerField = nameof(Topic))]\npublic class CreateQuestionDto\n{\n    [Required]\n    [DisplayName(\"主题\")]\n    public string Topic { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n    \n    [DisplayName(\"题目内容\")]\n    [AiFieldFill(Priority = 1, CustomDescription = \"根据主题生成的题目内容\")]\n    public string? Content { get; set; }\n    \n    [DisplayName(\"选项A\")]\n    [AiFieldFill(Priority = 2)]\n    public string? OptionA { get; set; }\n}\n```\n\n**全局填充模式**：\n```csharp\n[AiFormFill(GlobalFillPrompt = \"描述您想创建的内容\")]\npublic class CreateContentDto\n{\n    [DisplayName(\"标题\")]\n    public string? Title { get; set; }\n    \n    [DisplayName(\"内容\")]\n    public string? Content { get; set; }\n}\n```\n\n#### 步骤 3：测试 AI 填充\n\n系统自动生成 `POST /api/{controller}/ai-fill` 端点，无需编写控制器代码。\n\n**请求示例**：\n```json\nPOST /api/questions/ai-fill\n{\n  \"topic\": \"人工智能\"\n}\n```\n\n**响应示例**：\n```json\n{\n  \"topic\": \"人工智能\",\n  \"content\": \"人工智能是计算机科学的一个分支...\",\n  \"optionA\": \"...\"\n}\n```\n\n### AiFormFillAttribute 参数\n\n| 属性 | 类型 | 默认值 | 说明 |\n|------|------|--------|------|\n| `TriggerField` | string | \"\" | 触发字段名称，为空时启用全局模式 |\n| `IgnoreFields` | string[] | [] | 需要忽略的字段列表 |\n| `CustomPromptTemplate` | string | \"\" | 自定义提示词模板 |\n| `ApiEndpoint` | string | \"ai-fill\" | API端点路径 |\n| `EnableCache` | bool | true | 是否启用缓存 |\n| `Temperature` | double | 0.1 | 温度参数，控制随机性 |\n\n### 自定义提示词模板\n\n```csharp\n[AiFormFill(\n    TriggerField = nameof(Topic),\n    CustomPromptTemplate = \"基于主题 ''{Topic}'' 生成相关内容，要求专业准确\")]\npublic class CustomPromptDto { }\n```\n\n---\n\n## 场景 2：AI 长任务处理\n\n### 适用场景\n\n- 批量生成题目、问卷等耗时较长的任务\n- 需要进度跟踪和日志输出的任务\n\n### 工作流程\n\n#### 步骤 1：创建任务请求 DTO\n\n```csharp\npublic class GenerateQuestionsRequest\n{\n    public string Topic { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n    public int Count { get; set; }\n    public string Difficulty { get; set; } = \"Medium\";\n}\n```\n\n#### 步骤 2：创建任务状态响应类\n\n```csharp\npublic class AiTaskStatus\n{\n    public string Status { get; set; }       // \"pending\", \"processing\", \"completed\", \"failed\"\n    public int Progress { get; set; }        // 0-100\n    public List<string> Logs { get; set; }   // 日志列表\n    public object? Result { get; set; }      // 任务结果\n    public string? ErrorMessage { get; set; } // 错误消息\n}\n```\n\n#### 步骤 3：实现异步任务 API\n\n```csharp\n[HttpPost(\"ai/generate-async\")]\n[HeaderOperation(\"AI智能生成\", \"aiForm\", \n    Icon = \"fa-solid fa-magic\",\n    StatusApi = \"/exam/api/Questions/ai/task-status\",  // 状态查询 API（必需）\n    PollingInterval = 2000,                             // 轮询间隔（毫秒）\n    MaxPollingTime = 300000,                            // 最大轮询时间（5分钟）\n    FormTitle = \"生成配置\",\n    StepsTitle = \"AI生成进度\",\n    LogTitle = \"生成日志\",\n    ResultTitle = \"生成结果\")]\n[DisplayName(\"AI智能生成题目\")]\npublic async Task<ActionResult<ApiResponse<string>>> GenerateQuestionsAsync(\n    [FromBody] GenerateQuestionsRequest request)\n{\n    var taskId = await _aiGeneratorService.GenerateAsync(request);\n    return SuccessResponse(taskId);\n}\n```\n\n#### 步骤 4：实现状态查询 API\n\n```csharp\n[HttpGet(\"ai/task-status\")]\n[DisplayName(\"查询任务状态\")]\npublic async Task<ActionResult<ApiResponse<AiTaskStatus>>> GetTaskStatus(\n    [FromQuery] string taskId)\n{\n    var status = await _aiGeneratorService.GetTaskStatusAsync(taskId);\n    return SuccessResponse(status);\n}\n```\n\n#### 步骤 5：实现服务层逻辑\n\n```csharp\npublic class AiGeneratorService : IScopedDependency\n{\n    private readonly LLMAssistant _llmAssistant;\n    private readonly IMemoryCache _cache;\n    \n    public async Task<string> GenerateAsync(GenerateQuestionsRequest request)\n    {\n        var taskId = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();\n        \n        // 初始化任务状态\n        var status = new AiTaskStatus\n        {\n            Status = \"pending\",\n            Progress = 0,\n            Logs = new List<string>()\n        };\n        _cache.Set($\"ai_task_{taskId}\", status);\n        \n        // 后台执行任务\n        _ = Task.Run(async () => await ProcessTaskAsync(taskId, request));\n        \n        return taskId;\n    }\n    \n    private async Task ProcessTaskAsync(string taskId, GenerateQuestionsRequest request)\n    {\n        var status = _cache.Get<AiTaskStatus>($\"ai_task_{taskId}\");\n        status.Status = \"processing\";\n        status.Logs.Add(\"开始生成题目...\");\n        \n        try\n        {\n            for (int i = 0; i < request.Count; i++)\n            {\n                status.Progress = (int)((i + 1) * 100.0 / request.Count);\n                status.Logs.Add($\"正在生成第 {i + 1} 题...\");\n                \n                // 调用 LLM 生成题目\n                var question = await _llmAssistant.GenerateContentAsync(\n                    $\"生成一道关于{request.Topic}的{request.Difficulty}难度题目\");\n                \n                // 保存题目\n                // ...\n            }\n            \n            status.Status = \"completed\";\n            status.Progress = 100;\n            status.Logs.Add(\"生成完成！\");\n        }\n        catch (Exception ex)\n        {\n            status.Status = \"failed\";\n            status.ErrorMessage = ex.Message;\n            status.Logs.Add($\"生成失败: {ex.Message}\");\n        }\n    }\n    \n    public async Task<AiTaskStatus> GetTaskStatusAsync(string taskId)\n    {\n        return _cache.Get<AiTaskStatus>($\"ai_task_{taskId}\") \n            ?? new AiTaskStatus { Status = \"not_found\" };\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 场景 3：LLM 结构化任务\n\n### 适用场景\n\n- 内容审核和分析\n- 结构化数据提取\n- 批量处理任务\n\n### 工作流程\n\n#### 步骤 1：注入 LLMAssistant\n\n```csharp\npublic class AuditService : IScopedDependency\n{\n    private readonly LLMAssistant _llmAssistant;\n    \n    public AuditService(LLMAssistant llmAssistant)\n    {\n        _llmAssistant = llmAssistant;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 步骤 2：创建提示词模板\n\n```csharp\npublic static class PromptTemplates\n{\n    public const string QuestionAudit = @\"你是一个专业的题目审核专家。\n\n任务：审核以下题目是否符合要求。\n\n题目内容：{Content}\n选项：{Options}\n\n要求：\n1. 题目内容清晰准确\n2. 选项设计合理\n3. 只有一个正确答案\n\n输出格式（JSON）：\n{{\n  \"\"isValid\"\": true/false,\n  \"\"issues\"\": [\"\"问题1\"\", \"\"问题2\"\"],\n  \"\"suggestions\"\": [\"\"建议1\"\", \"\"建议2\"\"]\n}}\";\n}\n```\n\n#### 步骤 3：定义响应 DTO\n\n```csharp\npublic class AuditResult\n{\n    public bool IsValid { get; set; }\n    public List<string> Issues { get; set; } = new();\n    public List<string> Suggestions { get; set; } = new();\n}\n```\n\n#### 步骤 4：调用 LLM 处理\n\n```csharp\npublic async Task<AuditResult> AuditQuestionAsync(QuestionDto question)\n{\n    var prompt = PromptTemplates.QuestionAudit\n        .Replace(\"{Content}\", question.Content)\n        .Replace(\"{Options}\", string.Join(\", \", question.Options));\n    \n    var result = await _llmAssistant.ProcessStructuredTaskWithTemplateAsync<AuditResult>(\n        \"question_audit\",\n        new { question },\n        new StructuredTaskOptions \n        { \n            EnableRetry = true, \n            MaxRetries = 2 \n        });\n    \n    if (result.IsSuccess)\n    {\n        return result.Result!;\n    }\n    \n    throw new BusinessException($\"审核失败: {string.Join(\"; \", result.Errors)}\");\n}\n```\n\n#### 步骤 5：批量处理\n\n```csharp\npublic async Task<List<AuditResult>> BatchAuditAsync(List<QuestionDto> questions)\n{\n    var batchResult = await _llmAssistant.ProcessBatchStructuredTaskAsync<QuestionDto, AuditResult>(\n        questions,\n        batch => BuildBatchPrompt(batch),\n        new BatchProcessingOptions \n        { \n            BatchSize = 10,\n            MaxRetries = 2,\n            DelayBetweenBatches = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(1),\n            ContinueOnFailure = true\n        });\n    \n    return batchResult.SuccessResults\n        .Where(r => r.IsSuccess)\n        .Select(r => r.Result!)\n        .ToList();\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 提示词工程最佳实践\n\n### 1. 角色设定清晰\n\n```markdown\n你是一个专业的{角色}。\n```\n\n### 2. 任务描述具体\n\n```markdown\n任务：根据以下信息生成一道高质量的题目。\n\n主题：{Topic}\n题型：{QuestionType}\n难度：{Difficulty}\n```\n\n### 3. 输出格式明确\n\n```markdown\n输出格式（JSON）：\n{\n  \"Content\": \"string, 必填。题目内容\",\n  \"OptionA\": \"string, 必填。选项A内容\",\n  \"OptionB\": \"string, 必填。选项B内容\"\n}\n```\n\n### 4. 约束条件清晰\n\n```markdown\n要求：\n1. 题目内容不超过 2000 字符\n2. 选项设计合理，避免明显错误\n3. 只有一个正确答案\n```\n\n### 5. 提供示例（复杂场景）\n\n```markdown\n示例：\n输入：主题=\"人工智能\"，难度=\"Medium\"\n输出：{\n  \"Content\": \"人工智能的核心技术包括哪些？\",\n  \"OptionA\": \"机器学习、深度学习、自然语言处理\",\n  ...\n}\n```\n\n### 提示词模板\n\n参见 [prompt-templates/](prompt-templates/) 目录：\n- `question-generator.txt`：题目生成提示词\n- `content-audit.txt`：内容审核提示词\n- `survey-generator.txt`：问卷生成提示词\n\n---\n\n## 错误处理\n\n### 常见错误类型\n\n| 错误类型 | 原因 | 处理方式 |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| 401 Unauthorized | API 密钥无效 | 检查配置，更新密钥 |\n| 400 Bad Request | 模型名称错误 | 验证模型名称是否正确 |\n| 429 Too Many Requests | 请求限流 | 添加重试和延迟 |\n| Timeout | 请求超时 | 增加超时时间，拆分请求 |\n| JSON解析失败 | 响应格式不正确 | 使用 ILLMJsonProcessor 自动修复 |\n\n### 自动错误处理\n\n系统自动处理：\n- ✅ **流式模式检测**：自动检测\"只支持流式模式\"的模型并重试\n- ✅ **JSON 自动修复**：截断、括号不匹配、引号错误等\n- ✅ **重试机制**：支持配置重试次数和延迟\n\n### 错误处理示例\n\n```csharp\npublic async Task<T> SafeGenerateAsync<T>(string prompt) where T : class\n{\n    try\n    {\n        var result = await _llmAssistant.ProcessStructuredTaskWithTemplateAsync<T>(\n            \"template\", \n            new { prompt },\n            new StructuredTaskOptions { EnableRetry = true, MaxRetries = 3 });\n        \n        if (result.IsSuccess)\n        {\n            return result.Result!;\n        }\n        \n        _logger.LogError(\"AI生成失败: {Errors}\", string.Join(\"; \", result.Errors));\n        throw new BusinessException(\"AI生成失败，请稍后重试\");\n    }\n    catch (HttpRequestException ex)\n    {\n        _logger.LogError(ex, \"LLM API请求失败\");\n        throw new BusinessException(\"AI服务暂时不可用\");\n    }\n    catch (TaskCanceledException ex)\n    {\n        _logger.LogError(ex, \"LLM请求超时\");\n        throw new BusinessException(\"AI响应超时，请缩短输入或稍后重试\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 性能优化\n\n### 缓存策略\n\n```csharp\n[AiFormFill(\n    TriggerField = nameof(Topic),\n    EnableCache = true,               // 启用缓存\n    CacheExpirationMinutes = 30       // 30分钟过期\n)]\n```\n\n**缓存键规则**：包含输入内容的哈希值，相同输入直接返回缓存结果。\n\n### 批量处理优化\n\n```csharp\nvar options = new BatchProcessingOptions\n{\n    BatchSize = 10,                              // 每批10条\n    DelayBetweenBatches = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(1), // 批次间延迟\n    MaxRetries = 2,                              // 最大重试次数\n    ContinueOnFailure = true                     // 失败时继续处理\n};\n```\n\n### Token 控制\n\n- 合理设置 `MaxTokens`，避免过度消耗\n- 使用缓存减少重复请求\n- 长文本分段处理\n- 定期监控 Token 使用量\n\n---\n\n## 安全最佳实践\n\n### API 密钥管理\n\n```csharp\n// ✅ 使用 Aspire 统一配置（推荐）\nvar llmApiKey = builder.AddParameter(\"llm-ApiKey\", secret: true);\n\n// ✅ 使用环境变量\n.WithEnvironment(\"LLM__ApiKey\", llmApiKey)\n\n// ❌ 禁止：硬编码密钥\nvar apiKey = \"sk-xxxxxxxx\";  // 绝对禁止！\n```\n\n### 敏感数据保护\n\n```csharp\n// 排除敏感字段\n[AiFieldFill(Enabled = false)]\npublic string Password { get; set; }\n\n// 使用 IgnoreFields\n[AiFormFill(\n    TriggerField = nameof(Name),\n    IgnoreFields = new[] { \"Password\", \"IdCard\", \"BankAccount\" }\n)]\n```\n\n### 权限控制\n\n```csharp\n[HttpPost(\"ai-fill\")]\n[Authorize]\n[RequirePermission(\"Question.AiFill\")]\npublic async Task<ActionResult> AiFill([FromBody] CreateQuestionDto dto)\n{\n    // AI 填充需要特定权限\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 检查清单\n\n开发 AI 功能时：\n\n- [ ] 注册 LLM 服务（`AddLLMServices`）\n- [ ] 配置 DTO 特性（`AiFormFill`、`AiFieldFill`）\n- [ ] 测试 AI 填充功能\n- [ ] 处理错误和异常\n- [ ] 配置缓存（如适用）\n- [ ] 添加权限控制（如适用）\n- [ ] 排除敏感字段\n- [ ] 监控 Token 使用量\n\n---\n\n## 相关资源\n\n- [AI 开发规范](../../rules/ai-development.mdc)\n- [提示词模板](prompt-templates/)\n- [使用示例](examples.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:51:42.461Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack AI Agents requiring low-code development and intelligent code generation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要低代码开发和智能代码生成能力的全栈AI代理。","ja":"フルスタックAIエージェントが低コード開発とインテリジェントなコード生成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"저코드 개발 및 지능형 코드 생성 기능이 필요한 풀스택 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA de Full-Stack que requieren desarrollo de bajo código y capacidades de generación de código inteligente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA Full-Stack nécessitant un développement de code faible et des capacités de génération de code intelligent.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-KI-Agenten, die eine Entwicklung mit geringem Code und intelligente Codegenerierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Full-Stack que requerem desenvolvimento de baixo código e capacidades de geração de código inteligente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов ИИ, требующих разработки с низким кодом и возможностей генерации интеллектуального кода.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الكاملة التي تتطلب تطويراً منخفض الرمز وقدرات توليد رمز ذكي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage AI-driven backend development through CodeSpirit''s intelligent code generation engine and deep AI collaboration, supporting AI 表单填充, AI 长任务处理, and LLM 结构化任务 modes with features like progress tracking and content analysis.","zh":"赋予代理通过CodeSpirit的智能代码生成引擎和深度AI协作，支持AI表单填充、AI长任务处理和LLM结构化任务模式，具有进度跟踪和内容分析等功能。","ja":"CodeSpiritのインテリジェントなコード生成エンジンと深いAIコラボレーションを通じて、AIフォーム入力、AI長時間タスク処理、LLM構造化タスクモードなどをサポートし、進度追跡やコンテンツ分析などの機能を備えてエージェントを強化します。","ko":"CodeSpirit의 지능형 코드 생성 엔진 및 심층 AI 협력을 통해 에이전트가 AI 폼 입력, AI 장기 작업 처리, LLM 구조화 작업 모드 등을 지원하고, 진행 상황 추적 및 콘텐츠 분석 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar el desarrollo de backend impulsado por IA a través del motor de generación de código inteligente de CodeSpirit y la colaboración profunda de IA, que admite los modos de tarea estructurada de AI 表单填充, AI 长任务处理 y LLM con características como seguimiento de progreso y análisis de contenido.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti du développement de backend piloté par l''IA via le moteur de génération de code intelligent de CodeSpirit et la collaboration profonde de l''IA, en prenant en charge les modes de tâche structurée de AI 表单填充, AI 长任务处理 et LLM avec des fonctionnalités telles que le suivi des progrès et l''analyse de contenu.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Backend-Entwicklung mit künstlicher Intelligenz durch den intelligenten Code-Generierungsmotor von CodeSpirit und die tiefe KI-Zusammenarbeit zu nutzen, unterstützt AI-Formulare, AI-Langzeitverarbeitung und LLM-Strukturierungsaufgaben mit Funktionen wie Fortschrittsverfolgung und Inhaltsanalyse.","pt":"Permite que os agentes usem o desenvolvimento de backend impulsionado por IA por meio do motor de geração de código inteligente do CodeSpirit e da colaboração profunda de IA, com suporte a modos de tarefas estruturadas de LLM, preenchimento de formulários de IA e processamento de tarefas longas de IA, com recursos como acompanhamento de progresso e análise de conteúdo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать разработку бэкенда, управляемую ИИ, благодаря двигателю генерации интеллектуального кода CodeSpirit и глубокому сотрудничеству ИИ, поддерживающему режимы структурированных задач LLM, заполнение форм ИИ и обработку длинных задач ИИ, с функциями seperti отслеживание прогресса и анализ содержимого.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من تطوير الخلفية المُدارة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال محرك توليد الرمز الذكي الخاص ب CodeSpirit والتعاون العميق للذكاء الاصطناعي، مع دعم أوضاع المهام المنظمة ل LLM وتعبئة استمارات الذكاء الاصطناعي ومعالجة المهام الطويلة للذكاء الاصطناعي، مع ميزات مثل تتبع التقدم وتحليل المحتوى."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating form filling with AI-driven data generation","Generating content through LLM-based structured tasks","Managing long-running tasks with asynchronous processing and progress tracking"],"zh":["通过AI驱动的数据生成自动化表单填充","通过LLM基的结构化任务生成内容","通过异步处理和进度跟踪管理长时间运行的任务"],"ja":["AI駆動のデータ生成によるフォーム入力の自動化","LLMベースの構造化タスクによるコンテンツ生成","非同期処理と進度追跡による長時間実行タスクの管理"],"ko":["AI 주도 데이터 생성을 통한 폼 입력 자동화","LLM 기반의 구조화 작업을 통한 콘텐츠 생성","비동기 처리 및 진행 상황 추적을 통한 장기 실행 작업 관리"],"es":["Automatizar el llenado de formularios con generación de datos impulsada por IA","Generar contenido a través de tareas estructuradas basadas en LLM","Administrar tareas de larga duración con procesamiento asíncrono y seguimiento de progreso"],"fr":["Automatiser le remplissage de formulaires avec une génération de données pilotée par l''IA","Générer du contenu via des tâches structurées basées sur LLM","Gérer des tâches longues avec un traitement asynchrone et un suivi des progrès"],"de":["Automatisieren des Formularausfüllens mit künstlicher Intelligenz-gesteuerter Datengenerierung","Erzeugen von Inhalten durch LLM-basierte Strukturierungsaufgaben","Verwalten von Langzeitverarbeitungsaufgaben mit asynchroner Verarbeitung und Fortschrittsverfolgung"],"pt":["Automatizar o preenchimento de formulários com geração de dados impulsionada por IA","Gerar conteúdo por meio de tarefas estruturadas baseadas em LLM","Gerenciar tarefas de longa duração com processamento assíncrono e acompanhamento de progresso"],"ru":["Автоматизировать заполнение форм с генерацией данных, управляемой ИИ","Генерировать контент через структурированные задачи на основе LLM","Управлять长ыми задачами с асинхронной обработкой и отслеживанием прогресса"],"ar":["تأتمة ملء الاستمارات بواسطة توليد بيانات مدعوم بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي","توليد المحتوى من خلال مهام منظّمة قائمة على LLM","إدارة المهام الطويلة مع المعالجة غير المتزامنة وتتبع التقدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CodeSpirit framework integration","Dependent on AI service registration and availability"],"zh":["需要CodeSpirit框架集成","依赖于AI服务注册和可用性"],"ja":["CodeSpiritフレームワークの統合が必要","AIサービス登録と可用性に依存"],"ko":["CodeSpirit 프레임워크 통합이 필요합니다","AI 서비스 등록 및 가용성에 종속"],"es":["Requiere integración con el marco de trabajo de CodeSpirit","Dependiente del registro y la disponibilidad del servicio de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le cadre de travail de CodeSpirit","Dépend de l''enregistrement et de la disponibilité du service IA"],"de":["Benötigt eine Integration mit dem CodeSpirit-Framework","Hängt von der Registrierung und Verfügbarkeit des KI-Dienstes ab"],"pt":["Exige integração com o framework CodeSpirit","Depende do registro e disponibilidade do serviço de IA"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с фреймворком CodeSpirit","Зависит от регистрации и доступности сервиса ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مع إطار العمل CodeSpirit","يعتمد على تسجيل وتوفر خدمة الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tanepiper/teskooano/postfx-bloom', 'community', 'tanepiper', 'teskooano', 'tanepiper/teskooano', 'postfx-bloom', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:52:03.342Z', NULL, '{"id":"tanepiper/teskooano/postfx-bloom","name":"postfx-bloom","description":{"zh":"PostFX Bloom是一种基于ThreeJS的多摄像机3D N体模拟器，能够实现惊人的光照效果","ja":"PostFX BloomはThreeJSを使用したマルチカメラ3D N体シミュレーターであり、驚異的な光照射効果を実現します","ko":"PostFX Bloom는 ThreeJS를 사용한 멀티 카메라 3D N체 시뮬레이터로驚異的な 광효과를 구현합니다","es":"PostFX Bloom es un simulador 3D que utiliza ThreeJS para crear efectos de bloom. Permite agregar un toque de realismo a tus escenas","fr":"PostFX Bloom est un simulateur 3D qui utilise ThreeJS pour créer des effets de bloom. Il permet d''ajouter une touche de réalisme à vos scènes","de":"PostFX Bloom ist ein 3D-Simulator, der ThreeJS verwendet, um Bloom-Effekte zu erstellen. Er ermöglicht es, Ihren Szenen einen Hauch von Realismus hinzuzufügen","pt":"O PostFX Bloom é uma ferramenta para criar efeitos de brilho 3D realistas com ThreeJS. Ela oferece recursos avançados para melhorar suas cenas 3D.","ru":"PostFX Bloom — это инструмент для создания реалистичных 3D-блум-эффектов с помощью ThreeJS. Он предлагает продвинутые функции для улучшения ваших 3D-сцен.","ar":"بوست إف إكس ب룸 هو أداة لإنشاء تأثيرات البريق 3D الواقعية باستخدام ThreeJS. يوفر ميزات متقدمة لتحسين المشاهدات 3D.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PostFX Bloom: 三维N体模拟器","ja":"PostFX Bloom: 3D N体シミュレーター","ko":"PostFX Bloom: 3D N체 시뮬레이터","es":"PostFX Bloom: Simulador 3D con ThreeJS","fr":"PostFX Bloom : Simulateur 3D avec ThreeJS","de":"PostFX Bloom: 3D-Simulator mit ThreeJS","pt":"PostFX Bloom: Efeitos de Brilho 3D com ThreeJS","ru":"PostFX Bloom: 3D-Блум-эффекты с ThreeJS","ar":"بوست إف إكس ب룸: تأثيرات البريق 3D باستخدام ThreeJS","en":"postfx-bloom"},"description":{"zh":"PostFX Bloom是一种基于ThreeJS的多摄像机3D N体模拟器，能够实现惊人的光照效果","ja":"PostFX BloomはThreeJSを使用したマルチカメラ3D N体シミュレーターであり、驚異的な光照射効果を実現します","ko":"PostFX Bloom는 ThreeJS를 사용한 멀티 카메라 3D N체 시뮬레이터로驚異的な 광효과를 구현합니다","es":"PostFX Bloom es un simulador 3D que utiliza ThreeJS para crear efectos de bloom. Permite agregar un toque de realismo a tus escenas","fr":"PostFX Bloom est un simulateur 3D qui utilise ThreeJS pour créer des effets de bloom. Il permet d''ajouter une touche de réalisme à vos scènes","de":"PostFX Bloom ist ein 3D-Simulator, der ThreeJS verwendet, um Bloom-Effekte zu erstellen. Er ermöglicht es, Ihren Szenen einen Hauch von Realismus hinzuzufügen","pt":"O PostFX Bloom é uma ferramenta para criar efeitos de brilho 3D realistas com ThreeJS. Ela oferece recursos avançados para melhorar suas cenas 3D.","ru":"PostFX Bloom — это инструмент для создания реалистичных 3D-блум-эффектов с помощью ThreeJS. Он предлагает продвинутые функции для улучшения ваших 3D-сцен.","ar":"بوست إف إكس ب룸 هو أداة لإنشاء تأثيرات البريق 3D الواقعية باستخدام ThreeJS. يوفر ميزات متقدمة لتحسين المشاهدات 3D.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"definition":{"en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"features":{"zh":["基于ThreeJS的多摄像机3D N体模拟","使用UnrealBloomPass实现光照效果","支持多种光照模式","高性能渲染","易于集成"],"ja":["ThreeJSを使用したマルチカメラ3D N体シミュレーター","UnrealBloomPassを使用した光照射効果","複数の光照射モードをサポート","高性能レンダリング","簡単な統合"],"ko":["ThreeJS를 사용한 멀티 카메라 3D N체 시뮬레이터","UnrealBloomPass를 사용한 광효과","여러 가지 광효과 모드를 지원","고성능 렌더링","쉽게 통합"],"es":["Efectos de bloom personalizables","Compatibilidad con ThreeJS","Integración con React","Soporte para múltiples cámaras","Simulación de cuerpos en 3D"],"fr":["Effets de bloom personnalisables","Compatibilité avec ThreeJS","Intégration avec React","Prise en charge de plusieurs caméras","Simulation de corps en 3D"],"de":["Anpassbare Bloom-Effekte","Kompatibilität mit ThreeJS","Integration mit React","Unterstützung für mehrere Kameras","Simulation von Körpern in 3D"],"pt":["Efeitos de brilho realistas","Compatibilidade com ThreeJS","Recursos avançados de pós-processamento","Instalação fácil com npm","Integração com @react-three/fiber"],"ru":["Реалистичные блум-эффекты","Совместимость с ThreeJS","Продвинутые функции постобработки","Легкая установка с помощью npm","Интеграция с @react-three/fiber"],"ar":["تأثيرات البريق الواقعية","التوافق مع ThreeJS","ميزات متقدمة لما بعد المعالجة","تثبيت سهل مع npm","التكامل مع @react-three/fiber"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ThreeJS","UnrealBloomPass","3D N体模拟","多摄像机","光照效果","高性能渲染","易于集成"],"ja":["ThreeJS","UnrealBloomPass","3D N体シミュレーター","マルチカメラ","光照射効果","高性能レンダリング","簡単な統合"],"ko":["ThreeJS","UnrealBloomPass","3D N체 시뮬레이터","멀티 카메라","광효과","고성능 렌더링","쉽게 통합"],"es":["postfx bloom","threejs","react","efectos de bloom","simulación 3d","cuerpos en 3d","postprocesamiento"],"fr":["postfx bloom","threejs","react","effets de bloom","simulation 3d","corps en 3d","post-traitement"],"de":["postfx bloom","threejs","react","bloom-effekte","3d-simulation","körper in 3d","postbearbeitung"],"pt":["postfx bloom","threejs","efeitos de brilho 3d","pós-processamento","react three fiber","desenvolvimento de jogos","realidade virtual"],"ru":["postfx bloom","threejs","3d-блум-эффекты","постобработка","react three fiber","разработка игр","виртуальная реальность"],"ar":["بوست إف إكس ب룸","threejs","تأثيرات البريق 3D","ما بعد المعالجة","react three fiber","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"postfx-bloom","description":"Bloom and glow effects using Three.js UnrealBloomPass with React Three Fiber. Use when implementing glow, bloom, luminance-based effects, selective bloom on specific meshes, or neon/ethereal lighting. Essential for cyberpunk aesthetics, energy effects, magic spells, and UI glow.","bodyPreview":"# Post-Processing Bloom\n\nBloom effects using UnrealBloomPass for luminance-based glow and selective object bloom.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install three @react-three/fiber @react-three/postprocessing\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { Canvas } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport { EffectComposer, Bloom } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <mesh>\n        <sphereGeometry args={[1, 32, 32]} />\n        <meshStandardMaterial emissive=\"#00F5FF\" emissiveIntensity=","body":"# Post-Processing Bloom\n\nBloom effects using UnrealBloomPass for luminance-based glow and selective object bloom.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install three @react-three/fiber @react-three/postprocessing\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { Canvas } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport { EffectComposer, Bloom } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <mesh>\n        <sphereGeometry args={[1, 32, 32]} />\n        <meshStandardMaterial emissive=\"#00F5FF\" emissiveIntensity={2} />\n      </mesh>\n\n      <EffectComposer>\n        <Bloom\n          luminanceThreshold={0.2}\n          luminanceSmoothing={0.9}\n          intensity={1.5}\n        />\n      </EffectComposer>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### How Bloom Works\n\n1. **Threshold** — Pixels brighter than threshold are extracted\n2. **Blur** — Extracted pixels are blurred in multiple passes\n3. **Composite** — Blurred result is added back to original image\n\n### Key Parameters\n\n| Parameter            | Range | Description                                     |\n| -------------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `luminanceThreshold` | 0-1   | Brightness cutoff for bloom (lower = more glow) |\n| `luminanceSmoothing` | 0-1   | Softness of threshold transition                |\n| `intensity`          | 0-10  | Bloom brightness multiplier                     |\n| `radius`             | 0-1   | Blur spread/size                                |\n| `levels`             | 1-9   | Blur quality/iterations                         |\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Cosmic Glow Effect\n\n```tsx\nimport { EffectComposer, Bloom } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\nimport { KernelSize } from \"postprocessing\";\n\nfunction CosmicBloom() {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <Bloom\n        luminanceThreshold={0.1}\n        luminanceSmoothing={0.9}\n        intensity={2.5}\n        radius={0.8}\n        kernelSize={KernelSize.LARGE}\n        mipmapBlur\n      />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Neon Cyberpunk Bloom\n\n```tsx\n// High-contrast neon with sharp falloff\nfunction NeonBloom() {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <Bloom\n        luminanceThreshold={0.4}\n        luminanceSmoothing={0.2}\n        intensity={3.0}\n        radius={0.4}\n        mipmapBlur\n      />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n\n// Emissive material for neon objects\nfunction NeonTube({ color = \"#FF00FF\" }) {\n  return (\n    <mesh>\n      <cylinderGeometry args={[0.05, 0.05, 2]} />\n      <meshStandardMaterial\n        emissive={color}\n        emissiveIntensity={4}\n        toneMapped={false}\n      />\n    </mesh>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Selective Bloom with Layers\n\n```tsx\nimport { useRef } from \"react\";\nimport { useThree } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport { EffectComposer, SelectiveBloom } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction SelectiveGlow() {\n  const glowRef = useRef();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {/* Non-blooming object */}\n      <mesh position={[-2, 0, 0]}>\n        <boxGeometry />\n        <meshStandardMaterial color=\"#333\" />\n      </mesh>\n\n      {/* Blooming object */}\n      <mesh ref={glowRef} position={[2, 0, 0]}>\n        <sphereGeometry args={[0.5, 32, 32]} />\n        <meshStandardMaterial emissive=\"#00F5FF\" emissiveIntensity={3} />\n      </mesh>\n\n      <EffectComposer>\n        <SelectiveBloom\n          selection={glowRef}\n          luminanceThreshold={0.1}\n          intensity={2}\n          mipmapBlur\n        />\n      </EffectComposer>\n    </>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Multi-Selection Bloom\n\n```tsx\nimport { Selection, Select, EffectComposer } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\nimport { SelectiveBloom } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction MultiSelectBloom() {\n  return (\n    <Selection>\n      {/* Non-blooming */}\n      <mesh position={[-2, 0, 0]}>\n        <boxGeometry />\n        <meshStandardMaterial color=\"#333\" />\n      </mesh>\n\n      {/* Blooming objects wrapped in Select */}\n      <Select enabled>\n        <mesh position={[0, 0, 0]}>\n          <sphereGeometry args={[0.5]} />\n          <meshStandardMaterial emissive=\"#00F5FF\" emissiveIntensity={2} />\n        </mesh>\n      </Select>\n\n      <Select enabled>\n        <mesh position={[2, 0, 0]}>\n          <octahedronGeometry args={[0.5]} />\n          <meshStandardMaterial emissive=\"#FF00FF\" emissiveIntensity={2} />\n        </mesh>\n      </Select>\n\n      <EffectComposer>\n        <SelectiveBloom luminanceThreshold={0.1} intensity={1.5} mipmapBlur />\n      </EffectComposer>\n    </Selection>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Animated Bloom Intensity\n\n```tsx\nimport { useRef } from \"react\";\nimport { useFrame } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport { EffectComposer, Bloom } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction PulsingBloom() {\n  const bloomRef = useRef();\n\n  useFrame(({ clock }) => {\n    if (bloomRef.current) {\n      const pulse = Math.sin(clock.elapsedTime * 2) * 0.5 + 1.5;\n      bloomRef.current.intensity = pulse;\n    }\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <Bloom\n        ref={bloomRef}\n        luminanceThreshold={0.2}\n        intensity={1.5}\n        mipmapBlur\n      />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Audio-Reactive Bloom\n\n```tsx\nfunction AudioReactiveBloom({ audioData }) {\n  const bloomRef = useRef();\n\n  useFrame(() => {\n    if (bloomRef.current && audioData) {\n      // Map bass frequency (0-255) to bloom intensity (1-4)\n      const bassLevel = audioData[0] / 255;\n      bloomRef.current.intensity = 1 + bassLevel * 3;\n\n      // Map mid frequencies to threshold\n      const midLevel = audioData[4] / 255;\n      bloomRef.current.luminanceThreshold = 0.1 + (1 - midLevel) * 0.3;\n    }\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <Bloom\n        ref={bloomRef}\n        luminanceThreshold={0.2}\n        intensity={1.5}\n        mipmapBlur\n      />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Emissive Materials\n\n### Standard Emissive Setup\n\n```tsx\n// For bloom to work, objects need emissive materials\nfunction GlowingSphere({ color = \"#00F5FF\", intensity = 2 }) {\n  return (\n    <mesh>\n      <sphereGeometry args={[1, 32, 32]} />\n      <meshStandardMaterial\n        color=\"#000\"\n        emissive={color}\n        emissiveIntensity={intensity}\n        toneMapped={false} // Important: prevents HDR clamping\n      />\n    </mesh>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Emissive with Texture\n\n```tsx\nimport { useTexture } from \"@react-three/drei\";\n\nfunction EmissiveTextured() {\n  const emissiveMap = useTexture(\"/glow-pattern.png\");\n\n  return (\n    <mesh>\n      <planeGeometry args={[2, 2]} />\n      <meshStandardMaterial\n        emissiveMap={emissiveMap}\n        emissive=\"#FFFFFF\"\n        emissiveIntensity={3}\n        toneMapped={false}\n      />\n    </mesh>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Shader Material with Emissive\n\n```tsx\nimport { shaderMaterial } from \"@react-three/drei\";\nimport { extend } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\n\nconst GlowMaterial = shaderMaterial(\n  { uTime: 0, uColor: [0, 0.96, 1], uIntensity: 2.0 },\n  // Vertex shader\n  `\n    varying vec2 vUv;\n    void main() {\n      vUv = uv;\n      gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n    }\n  `,\n  // Fragment shader - outputs HDR values for bloom\n  `\n    uniform float uTime;\n    uniform vec3 uColor;\n    uniform float uIntensity;\n    varying vec2 vUv;\n\n    void main() {\n      float pulse = sin(uTime * 2.0) * 0.3 + 0.7;\n      vec3 glow = uColor * uIntensity * pulse;\n      gl_FragColor = vec4(glow, 1.0);\n    }\n  `,\n);\n\nextend({ GlowMaterial });\n\nfunction PulsingGlowMesh() {\n  const materialRef = useRef();\n\n  useFrame(({ clock }) => {\n    materialRef.current.uTime = clock.elapsedTime;\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <mesh>\n      <sphereGeometry args={[1, 32, 32]} />\n      <glowMaterial ref={materialRef} toneMapped={false} />\n    </mesh>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Resolution Scaling\n\n```tsx\n<EffectComposer\n  multisampling={0} // Disable MSAA for performance\n>\n  <Bloom\n    luminanceThreshold={0.2}\n    intensity={1.5}\n    mipmapBlur // More efficient blur method\n    radius={0.8}\n    levels={5} // Reduce for performance (default: 8)\n  />\n</EffectComposer>\n```\n\n### Mobile-Optimized Bloom\n\n```tsx\nimport { useDetectGPU } from \"@react-three/drei\";\n\nfunction AdaptiveBloom() {\n  const { tier } = useDetectGPU();\n\n  const config =\n    tier < 2\n      ? { levels: 3, radius: 0.5, intensity: 1.0 }\n      : { levels: 5, radius: 0.8, intensity: 1.5 };\n\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer multisampling={tier < 2 ? 0 : 4}>\n      <Bloom\n        luminanceThreshold={0.2}\n        luminanceSmoothing={0.9}\n        mipmapBlur\n        {...config}\n      />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Temporal Collapse Theme\n\nBloom configuration for the New Year countdown cosmic aesthetic:\n\n```tsx\n// Cosmic void with cyan/magenta glow\nfunction TemporalCollapseBloom() {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <Bloom\n        luminanceThreshold={0.15}\n        luminanceSmoothing={0.9}\n        intensity={2.0}\n        radius={0.85}\n        mipmapBlur\n      />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n\n// Color palette for emissive materials\nconst TEMPORAL_COLORS = {\n  cyan: \"#00F5FF\",\n  magenta: \"#FF00FF\",\n  gold: \"#FFD700\",\n  void: \"#050508\",\n};\n\n// Time digit with glow\nfunction GlowingDigit({ digit, color = TEMPORAL_COLORS.cyan }) {\n  return (\n    <Text3D font=\"/fonts/cosmic.json\" size={2} height={0.2}>\n      {digit}\n      <meshStandardMaterial\n        color=\"#111\"\n        emissive={color}\n        emissiveIntensity={3}\n        toneMapped={false}\n      />\n    </Text3D>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue                       | Solution                                                    |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| No bloom visible            | Ensure `emissiveIntensity > 1` and `toneMapped={false}`     |\n| Bloom too subtle            | Lower `luminanceThreshold`, increase `intensity`            |\n| Performance issues          | Reduce `levels`, enable `mipmapBlur`, disable multisampling |\n| Selective bloom not working | Verify `ref` is passed and object has emissive material     |\n| Bloom bleeding everywhere   | Raise `luminanceThreshold` to isolate bright areas          |\n\n## Reference\n\n- See `postfx-composer` for EffectComposer setup patterns\n- See `postfx-effects` for combining bloom with other effects\n- See `shaders-glsl` for custom emissive shader techniques\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:52:03.342Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 3D Visualization Agents needing advanced post-processing bloom effects and ThreeJS integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级后期处理光芒效果和ThreeJS集成的3D可视化代理。","ja":"ThreeJSの統合と高度なポストプロセッシングブルーム効果が必要な3Dビジュアライゼーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"ThreeJS 통합 및 고급 후처리 블룸 효과가 필요한 3D 시각화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de visualización 3D que necesitan efectos de floración de postprocesamiento avanzados y integración con ThreeJS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de visualisation 3D ayant besoin d''effets de floraison de post-traitement avancés et d''intégration avec ThreeJS.","de":"Perfekt für 3D-Visualisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Post-Bloom-Effekte und ThreeJS-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Visualização 3D que precisam de efeitos de bloom de pós-processamento avançados e integração com o ThreeJS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов 3D-визуализации, требующих продвинутых эффектов блума постобработки и интеграции с ThreeJS.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مرئية 3D التي تحتاج إلى تأثيرات بلاوم متقدمة بعد المعالجة وتكامل ThreeJS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create stunning luminance-based glow and selective object bloom effects using UnrealBloomPass and @react-three/postprocessing, unlocking next-level 3D rendering capabilities with ThreeJS and @react-three/fiber.","zh":"赋予代理创建基于亮度的辉光和选择性对象光芒效果的能力，使用UnrealBloomPass和@react-three/postprocessing，解锁ThreeJS和@react-three/fiber的下一代3D渲染能力。","ja":"UnrealBloomPassと@react-three/postprocessingを使用して、輝度ベースの輝きと選択的なオブジェクトのブルーム効果を作成するエージェントを可能にし、ThreeJSと@react-three/fiberの次世代の3Dレンダリング能力を解放します。","ko":"UnrealBloomPass와 @react-three/postprocessing를 사용하여 밝기 기반의 광효과와 선택적 객체 블룸 효과를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 ThreeJS 및 @react-three/fiber의 차세대 3D 렌더링 기능을解锁합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear un deslumbrante resplandor basado en luminancia y efectos de floración de objetos selectivos utilizando UnrealBloomPass y @react-three/postprocessing, desbloqueando capacidades de renderizado 3D de nivel avanzado con ThreeJS y @react-three/fiber.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un éclat de luminance époustouflant et des effets de floraison d''objets selectifs en utilisant UnrealBloomPass et @react-three/postprocessing, déverrouillant les capacités de rendu 3D de niveau supérieur avec ThreeJS et @react-three/fiber.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ein atemberaubendes, luminanzbasiertes Leuchten und selektive Objekt-Bloom-Effekte mit UnrealBloomPass und @react-three/postprocessing zu erstellen, entriegelt damit nächsthöhere 3D-Renderfähigkeiten mit ThreeJS und @react-three/fiber.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem efeitos de brilho baseados em luminância e efeitos de bloom de objeto seletivo usando UnrealBloomPass e @react-three/postprocessing, desbloqueando capacidades de renderização 3D de próxima geração com ThreeJS e @react-three/fiber.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать потрясающие эффекты свечения на основе яркости и селективные эффекты блума объектов с помощью UnrealBloomPass и @react-three/postprocessing, разблокируя возможности рендеринга 3D следующего уровня с ThreeJS и @react-three/fiber.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء تأثيرات إضاءة ومؤشرات ضوئية مبنية على اللمعان وتأثيرات بلاوم انتقائية للأشياء باستخدام UnrealBloomPass و @react-three/postprocessing، وتحرير إمكانيات التصور الثلاثي الأبعاد التالية مع ThreeJS و @react-three/fiber."},"useCases":{"en":["Enhancing 3D scenes with realistic bloom effects","Creating immersive experiences with selective object glow","Optimizing 3D rendering performance with post-processing techniques"],"zh":["使用真实的光芒效果增强3D场景","创建具有选择性对象光芒的沉浸式体验","使用后期处理技术优化3D渲染性能"],"ja":["リアルなブルーム効果で3Dシーンを強化する","選択的なオブジェクトの輝きで没入型体験を作成する","ポストプロセッシング技術で3Dレンダリングのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["실제적인 블룸 효과로 3D 장면을 강화하는 것","선택적 객체의 광효과로 몰입형 경험을 생성하는 것","후처리 기술로 3D 렌더링 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Mejorar las escenas 3D con efectos de floración realistas","Crear experiencias inmersivas con resplandor de objetos selectivos","Optimizar el rendimiento de renderizado 3D con técnicas de postprocesamiento"],"fr":["Améliorer les scènes 3D avec des effets de floraison realistes","Créer des expériences immersives avec un éclat d''objets selectifs","Optimiser les performances de rendu 3D avec des techniques de post-traitement"],"de":["3D-Szenen mit realistischen Bloom-Effekten verbessern","Immersive Erfahrungen mit selektivem Objektglow erstellen","3D-Renderleistung mit Post-Bearbeitungstechniken optimieren"],"pt":["Melhorar cenas 3D com efeitos de bloom realistas","Criar experiências imersivas com brilho de objeto seletivo","Otimizar o desempenho de renderização 3D com técnicas de pós-processamento"],"ru":["Улучшать 3D-сцены реалистичными эффектами блума","Создавать иммерсивные trải nghiệm с селективным свечением объектов","Оптимизировать производительность рендеринга 3D с помощью техник постобработки"],"ar":["تحسين المشاهد الثلاثية الأبعاد بتأثيرات بلاوم реалистية","إنشاء تجارب غامرة مع إضاءة الأشياء الانتقائية","تحسين أداء التصور الثلاثي الأبعاد باستخدام تقنيات المعالجة بعد الإنتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation of three, @react-three/fiber, and @react-three/postprocessing","Limited to ThreeJS and React-based environments"],"zh":["需要安装three、@react-three/fiber和@react-three/postprocessing的npm","仅限ThreeJS和React环境"],"ja":["three、@react-three/fiber、@react-three/postprocessingのnpmのインストールが必要","ThreeJSとReactに基づく環境のみ"],"ko":["three, @react-three/fiber, @react-three/postprocessing의 npm 설치가 필요함","ThreeJS 및 React 기반 환경에서만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación de npm de three, @react-three/fiber y @react-three/postprocessing","Limitado a entornos basados en ThreeJS y React"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm de three, @react-three/fiber et @react-three/postprocessing","Limité aux environnements basés sur ThreeJS et React"],"de":["Benötigt npm-Installation von three, @react-three/fiber und @react-three/postprocessing","Begrenzt auf ThreeJS- und React-basierte Umgebungen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do npm de three, @react-three/fiber e @react-three/postprocessing","Limitado a ambientes baseados em ThreeJS e React"],"ru":["Требует установки npm three, @react-three/fiber и @react-three/postprocessing","Ограничен средами на основе ThreeJS и React"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm ل three و @react-three/fiber و @react-three/postprocessing","محدود بالبيئات القائمة على ThreeJS و React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tanepiper/teskooano/postfx-router', 'community', 'tanepiper', 'teskooano', 'tanepiper/teskooano', 'postfx-router', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:52:06.297Z', NULL, '{"id":"tanepiper/teskooano/postfx-router","name":"postfx-router","description":{"zh":"PostFX Router是一种基于ThreeJS的多相机3D N体模拟器，能够实现后处理效果的路由和组合","ja":"PostFX RouterはThreeJSを使用したマルチカメラ3D N体シミュレータで、ポスト処理効果のルーティングと組み合わせを実現します","ko":"PostFX Router는 ThreeJS 기반의 멀티 카메라 3D N-체 시뮬레이터로 후처리 효과의 라우팅과 조합을 구현합니다","es":"El PostFX Router es un simulador 3D de N-cuerpos que utiliza ThreeJS para simular escenas complejas con múltiples cámaras","fr":"Le PostFX Router est un simulateur 3D N-corps qui utilise ThreeJS pour simuler des scènes complexes avec plusieurs caméras","de":"Der PostFX Router ist ein 3D-N-Körper-Simulator, der ThreeJS verwendet, um komplexe Szenen mit mehreren Kameras zu simulieren","pt":"O postfx-router é um roteador de pós-processamento 3D que direciona para habilidades especializadas com base em requisitos de pós-processamento. Ele utiliza o ThreeJS para simular cenas 3D complexas","ru":"Postfx-router — это маршрутизатор постобработки 3D, который направляет на специализированные навыки на основе требований постобработки. Он использует ThreeJS для симуляции сложных 3D-сцен","ar":"postfx-router هو مسار التأثيرات البصرية ثلاثية الأبعاد التي توجه إلى مهارات متخصصة بناءً على متطلبات المعالجة اللاحقة. إنه يستخدم ThreeJS لتحسين المشاهد ثلاثية الأبعاد المعقدة","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PostFX Router：三维N体模拟路由器","ja":"PostFX Router：3D N体シミュレータのルーティング","ko":"PostFX Router: 3D N-체 시뮬레이터 라우터","es":"PostFX Router: Simulador 3D de N-cuerpos","fr":"PostFX Router : Simulateur 3D N-corps","de":"PostFX Router: 3D-N-Körper-Simulator","pt":"postfx-router: Roteador de Pós-processamento 3D"