avec plusieurs caméras","Utilise ThreeJS pour le rendu graphique","Protocole de routage de post-traitement personnalisable","Chargement de compétences spécialisées"],"de":["3D-N-Körper-Simulation","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Kameras","Verwendet ThreeJS für die Grafikrendering","Anpassbares Post-Processing-Routing","Laden von spezialisierten Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Roteamento de pós-processamento 3D","Suporte a várias câmeras","Simulação de cenas 3D complexas com ThreeJS","Classificação de efeitos","Combinação de habilidades"],"ru":["Маршрутизация постобработки 3D","Поддержка нескольких камер","Симуляция сложных 3D-сцен с ThreeJS","Классификация эффектов","Объединение навыков"],"ar":["توجيه المعالجة اللاحقة ثلاثية الأبعاد","دعم كاميرات متعددة","تحسين المشاهد ثلاثية الأبعاد المعقدة مع ThreeJS","تصنيف التأثيرات","دمج المهارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ThreeJS","3D N体模拟","后处理效果","路由和组合","信号匹配规则","SKILL.md文件","快速路由"],"ja":["ThreeJS","3D N体シミュレーション","ポスト処理効果","ルーティングと組み合わせ","信号マッチングルール","SKILL.mdファイル","クイックルーティング"],"ko":["ThreeJS","3D N-체 시뮬레이션","후처리 효과","라우팅과 조합","신호 매칭 규칙","SKILL.md 파일","快速 라우팅"],"es":["simulador 3D","N-cuerpos","ThreeJS","post-procesamiento","enrutamiento","múltiples cámaras","gráficos 3D","desarrollo de juegos"],"fr":["simulateur 3D","N-corps","ThreeJS","post-traitement","routage","plusieurs caméras","graphiques 3D","développement de jeux"],"de":["3D-Simulator","N-Körper","ThreeJS","Post-Processing","Routing","mehrere Kameras","3D-Grafik","Spieleentwicklung"],"pt":["postfx-router","pós-processamento 3D","ThreeJS","simulação 3D","roteamento de efeitos","desenvolvimento de jogos","realidade virtual"],"ru":["postfx-router","постобработка 3D","ThreeJS","симуляция 3D","маршрутизация эффектов","разработка игр","виртуальная реальность"],"ar":["postfx-router","المعالجة اللاحقة ثلاثية الأبعاد","ThreeJS","تحسين ثلاثية الأبعاد","توجيه التأثيرات","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"postfx-router","description":"Router for Three.js post-processing effects domain. Use when implementing visual effects like bloom, glow, chromatic aberration, vignette, depth of field, color grading, or any screen-space effects. Routes to 3 specialized skills for bloom, effects, and composer setup.","bodyPreview":"# Post-Processing Router\n\nRoutes to 3 specialized skills based on post-processing requirements.\n\n## Routing Protocol\n\n1. **Classify** — Identify effect type from user request\n2. **Match** — Apply signal matching rules below\n3. **Combine** — Most production scenes need 2-3 skills together\n4. **Load** — Read matched SKILL.md files before implementation\n\n## Quick Route\n\n### Tier 1: Core (Start Here)\n\n| Need                            | Skill             | Signals","body":"# Post-Processing Router\n\nRoutes to 3 specialized skills based on post-processing requirements.\n\n## Routing Protocol\n\n1. **Classify** — Identify effect type from user request\n2. **Match** — Apply signal matching rules below\n3. **Combine** — Most production scenes need 2-3 skills together\n4. **Load** — Read matched SKILL.md files before implementation\n\n## Quick Route\n\n### Tier 1: Core (Start Here)\n\n| Need                            | Skill             | Signals                                                                 |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Pipeline setup, effect ordering | `postfx-composer` | EffectComposer, setup, pipeline, render target, custom pass, multi-pass |\n| Glow, luminance effects         | `postfx-bloom`    | bloom, glow, neon, emissive, luminance, UnrealBloom, selective bloom    |\n| Cinematic polish, color         | `postfx-effects`  | vignette, chromatic, DOF, grain, color grade, LUT, aberration           |\n\n## Signal Matching\n\n### Primary Signals\n\n**postfx-composer** (always start here for new projects):\n\n- \"set up post-processing\"\n- \"configure effect pipeline\"\n- \"create custom effect/pass\"\n- \"render targets\", \"effect ordering\"\n\n**postfx-bloom**:\n\n- \"bloom\", \"glow\", \"luminance\", \"neon\", \"emissive\"\n- \"selective bloom\", \"object glow\", \"UnrealBloomPass\"\n\n**postfx-effects**:\n\n- \"chromatic aberration\", \"vignette\", \"depth of field\", \"DOF\"\n- \"film grain\", \"noise\", \"color grading\", \"LUT\", \"tone mapping\"\n- \"scanlines\", \"CRT\", \"god rays\"\n\n### Confidence Scoring\n\n- **High (3+ signals)** — Route directly to matched skill\n- **Medium (1-2 signals)** — Route with composer as foundation\n- **Low (0 signals)** — Start with `postfx-composer` for setup\n\n## Common Combinations\n\n### Basic Post-Processing Setup (2 skills)\n\n```\npostfx-composer → Pipeline architecture, effect ordering\npostfx-bloom    → Basic glow effects\n```\n\n### Cinematic Scene (3 skills)\n\n```\npostfx-composer → Pipeline setup, tone mapping\npostfx-bloom    → Subtle glow on lights\npostfx-effects  → Vignette, grain, color grading\n```\n\n### Neon/Cyberpunk Aesthetic (2 skills)\n\n```\npostfx-bloom    → High-intensity selective bloom\npostfx-effects  → Chromatic aberration, vignette\n```\n\n### Custom Effect Development (1-2 skills)\n\n```\npostfx-composer → Custom Effect class, shader writing\npostfx-effects  → Reference existing effects\n```\n\n## Decision Table\n\n| Effect Type     | Complexity | Primary Skill | Supporting Skill |\n| --------------- | ---------- | ------------- | ---------------- |\n| Glow/bloom only | Simple     | bloom         | composer         |\n| Cinematic look  | Medium     | effects       | composer + bloom |\n| Custom effect   | Complex    | composer      | -                |\n| Selective bloom | Medium     | bloom         | composer         |\n| Color grading   | Simple     | effects       | composer         |\n| Full production | Complex    | All three     | -                |\n\n## Effect Categories\n\n### Lighting Effects → postfx-bloom\n\n- Bloom/glow, selective bloom, emissive enhancement, HDR luminance\n\n### Camera Effects → postfx-effects\n\n- Chromatic aberration, vignette, depth of field, lens distortion\n\n### Color Effects → postfx-effects\n\n- Tone mapping, color grading, LUT, hue/saturation\n\n### Texture Effects → postfx-effects\n\n- Film grain, noise, scanlines, CRT\n\n### Architecture → postfx-composer\n\n- EffectComposer setup, effect ordering, custom effects, render targets\n\n## Integration with Other Domains\n\n### With R3F (r3f-\\*)\n\n```\nr3f-fundamentals → Scene setup\npostfx-composer  → Effect pipeline\npostfx-bloom     → Object glow\n```\n\n### With Shaders (shaders-\\*)\n\n```\nshaders-glsl     → Custom effect shader code\npostfx-composer  → Wrap in Effect class\n```\n\n### With Particles (particles-\\*)\n\n```\nparticles-systems → Particle emitters\npostfx-bloom      → Particle glow\npostfx-effects    → Atmosphere\n```\n\n### With Audio (audio-\\*)\n\n```\naudio-analysis    → Frequency data\npostfx-bloom      → Audio-reactive bloom\npostfx-effects    → Audio-reactive aberration\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Effect               | Skill             |\n| -------------------- | ----------------- |\n| Bloom                | `postfx-bloom`    |\n| Selective Bloom      | `postfx-bloom`    |\n| Vignette             | `postfx-effects`  |\n| Chromatic Aberration | `postfx-effects`  |\n| Depth of Field       | `postfx-effects`  |\n| Film Grain/Noise     | `postfx-effects`  |\n| Color Grading        | `postfx-effects`  |\n| LUT                  | `postfx-effects`  |\n| Tone Mapping         | `postfx-effects`  |\n| Custom Effects       | `postfx-composer` |\n| Render Targets       | `postfx-composer` |\n\n## Temporal Collapse Stack\n\n```\npostfx-composer → HDR pipeline, tone mapping, adaptive quality\npostfx-bloom    → Cosmic glow on digits, particles, UI\npostfx-effects  → Vignette (void edge), subtle chromatic, grain\n```\n\n## Fallback Behavior\n\n- **No framework context** → Assume @react-three/postprocessing\n- **Unclear effect type** → Start with `postfx-composer` + `postfx-bloom`\n- **Performance concerns** → Prioritize `postfx-composer` optimization patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:52:06.297Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual AI Agents requiring advanced 3D simulation and post-processing capabilities, particularly those leveraging ThreeJS for complex N-body simulations.","zh":"适合需要高级 3D 模拟和后期处理能力的视觉 AI 代理，特别是那些利用 ThreeJS 进行复杂 N 体模拟的代理。","ja":"ThreeJS を使用した複雑な N 体シミュレーションを必要とする高度な 3D シミュレーションとポスト処理機能を備えたビジュアル AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"ThreeJS를 사용한 복잡한 N체 시뮬레이션을 필요로 하는 고급 3D 시뮬레이션 및 후처리 기능을備えた 시각 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial visuales que requieren simulación 3D avanzada y capacidades de post-procesamiento, particularmente aquellos que utilizan ThreeJS para simulaciones de N-cuerpos complejas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle visuelle nécessitant une simulation 3D avancée et des capacités de post-traitement, en particulier ceux qui utilisent ThreeJS pour des simulations de N-corps complexes.","de":"Ideal für visuelle KI-Agents, die erweiterte 3D-Simulations- und Postprocessing-Fähigkeiten erfordern, insbesondere solche, die ThreeJS für komplexe N-Körper-Simulationen nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Visuais que exigem simulação 3D avançada e capacidades de pós-processamento, particularmente aqueles que utilizam ThreeJS para simulações de N-corpos complexas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для визуальных агентов ИИ, требующих передовых возможностей 3D-симуляции и постобработки, особенно тех, кто использует ThreeJS для сложных симуляций N-тел.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المرئية الذين يتطلبون محاكاة متقدمة ثلاثية الأبعاد وقدرات المعالجة اللاحقة، خاصة أولئك الذين يستفيدون من ThreeJS لمحاكاة الجسيمات النوعية المعقدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to route and combine specialized skills for tailored post-processing effects, utilizing a routing protocol that classifies, matches, and combines skills based on specific requirements, all within a Multi-camera ThreeJS powered environment.","zh":"赋予代理路由和组合专用技能以实现定制的后期处理效果的能力，利用一种路由协议根据特定的要求对技能进行分类、匹配和组合，全都在多摄像头 ThreeJS 环境中进行。","ja":"特定要件に基づいてスキルを分類、照合、組み合わせるルーティングプロトコルを使用し、カスタマイズされたポスト処理効果を実現するために、エージェントに専用スキルをルーティングおよび組み合わせる機能を提供します。すべてがマルチカメラ ThreeJS 環境内で行われます。","ko":"특정 요구 사항에 따라 스킬을 분류, 일치 및 결합하는 라우팅 프로토콜을 사용하여 사용자 정의 후처리 효과를实现하는 기능을 에이전트에 제공하며, 모든 작업이 멀티 카메라 ThreeJS 환경에서 수행됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enrutar y combinar habilidades especializadas para efectos de post-procesamiento personalizados, utilizando un protocolo de enrutamiento que clasifica, combina y empareja habilidades según requisitos específicos, todo dentro de un entorno de ThreeJS con múltiples cámaras.","fr":"Permet aux agents de router et de combiner des compétences spécialisées pour des effets de post-traitement personnalisés, en utilisant un protocole de routage qui classe, correspond et combine des compétences en fonction de besoins spécifiques, le tout dans un environnement ThreeJS avec plusieurs caméras.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, spezialisierte Fähigkeiten für maßgeschneiderte Postprocessing-Effekte zu routen und zu kombinieren, indem ein Routing-Protokoll verwendet wird, das Fähigkeiten basierend auf spezifischen Anforderungen klassifiziert, abgleicht und kombiniert, alles innerhalb einer Multi-Kamera-Umgebung von ThreeJS.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a encaminhar e combinar habilidades especializadas para efeitos de pós-processamento personalizados, utilizando um protocolo de encaminhamento que classifica, combina e associa habilidades com base em requisitos específicos, todos dentro de um ambiente Multi-câmera alimentado pelo ThreeJS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью маршрутизации и комбинации специализированных навыков для индивидуальных эффектов постобработки, используя протокол маршрутизации, который классифицирует, сопоставляет и комбинирует навыки на основе конкретных требований, все внутри многокамерной среды, работающей под управлением ThreeJS.","ar":"يُ賦ّى الوكلاء القدرة على توجيه ومزج المهارات المتخصصة لأ.effects مخصصة للمعالجة اللاحقة، باستخدام بروتوكول التوجيه الذي يصنف ويتطابق ويمزج المهارات بناءً على متطلبات محددة، كل ذلك داخل بيئة متعدد الكاميرات مدعومة من ThreeJS."},"useCases":{"en":["Simulating complex N-body interactions with precise post-processing effects","Automating the combination of multiple skills for customized 3D visualizations","Debugging and optimizing post-processing pipelines for improved performance"],"zh":["模拟复杂的 N 体相互作用并实现精确的后期处理效果","自动化多个技能的组合以实现自定义的 3D 可视化","调试和优化后期处理管道以提高性能"],"ja":["複雑な N 体の相互作用をシミュレートし、精密なポスト処理効果を実現する","複数のスキルを自動的に組み合わせてカスタマイズされた 3D 可視化を実現する","ポスト処理パイプラインをデバッグおよび最適化してパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["복잡한 N체 상호 작용을 시뮬레이션하고 정밀한 후처리 효과를 구현하는 것","여러 스킬을 자동으로 결합하여 사용자 정의 3D 시각화를 구현하는 것","후처리 파이프라인을 디버깅 및 최적화하여 성능을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Simulación de interacciones de N-cuerpos complejas con efectos de post-procesamiento precisos","Automatización de la combinación de múltiples habilidades para visualizaciones 3D personalizadas","Depuración y optimización de tuberías de post-procesamiento para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Simulation d''interactions de N-corps complexes avec des effets de post-traitement précis","Automatisation de la combinaison de plusieurs compétences pour des visualisations 3D personnalisées","Débogage et optimisation des pipelines de post-traitement pour améliorer les performances"],"de":["Simulierung komplexer N-Körper-Interaktionen mit präzisen Postprocessing-Effekten","Automatisierung der Kombination mehrerer Fähigkeiten für maßgeschneiderte 3D-Visualisierungen","Fehlerbehebung und Optimierung von Postprocessing-Pipelines für verbesserte Leistung"],"pt":["Simulando interações complexas de N-corpos com efeitos de pós-processamento precisos","Automatizando a combinação de várias habilidades para visualizações 3D personalizadas","Depurando e otimizando pipelines de pós-processamento para melhorar o desempenho"],"ru":["Моделирование сложных взаимодействий N-тел с точными эффектами постобработки","Автоматизация комбинации нескольких навыков для индивидуальных 3D-визуализаций","Отладка и оптимизация конвейеров постобработки для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["محاكاة التفاعلات المعقدة للجسيمات النوعية مع آثار دقيقة للمعالجة اللاحقة","تأتميم الجمع بين مهارات متعددة لتصورات مرئية ثلاثية الأبعاد مخصصة","تصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين خطوط أنابيب المعالجة اللاحقة لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ThreeJS compatibility","Dependent on specialized skill availability for routing","N-body simulation complexity may impact performance"],"zh":["需要 ThreeJS 兼容性","依赖于专用技能的可用性进行路由","N 体模拟的复杂性可能会影响性能"],"ja":["ThreeJS の互換性が必要","ルーティングのために専用スキルの可用性に依存する","N 体シミュレーションの複雑さはパフォーマンスに影響を与える可能性がある"],"ko":["ThreeJS 호환성이 필요함","라우팅을 위해専用 스킬의 가용성에 의존함","N체 시뮬레이션의 복잡성은 성능에 영향을 미칠 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con ThreeJS","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de habilidades especializadas para el enrutamiento","La complejidad de la simulación de N-cuerpos puede afectar el rendimiento"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec ThreeJS","Dépend de la disponibilité de compétences spécialisées pour le routage","La complexité de la simulation de N-corps peut avoir un impact sur les performances"],"de":["Benötigt ThreeJS-Kompatibilität","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit spezialisierter Fähigkeiten für das Routing","Die Komplexität der N-Körper-Simulation kann sich auf die Leistung auswirken"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com o ThreeJS","Depende da disponibilidade de habilidades especializadas para roteamento","A complexidade da simulação de N-corpos pode impactar o desempenho"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с ThreeJS","Зависит от наличия специализированных навыков для маршрутизации","Сложность симуляции N-тел может влиять на производительность"],"ar":["يتطلب 호환ًا مع ThreeJS","يعتمد على توافر مهارات متخصصة للتوجيه","قد تؤثر تعقيد محاكاة الجسيمات النوعية على الأداء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tanepiper/teskooano/shader-noise', 'community', 'tanepiper', 'teskooano', 'tanepiper/teskooano', 'shader-noise', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:52:07.138Z', NULL, '{"id":"tanepiper/teskooano/shader-noise","name":"shader-noise","description":{"zh":"Shader Noise是一种多摄像头的ThreeJS驱动的3D N体模拟器，用于创建自然随机效果","ja":"Shader NoiseはマルチカメラのThreeJS駆動の3D N体シミュレーターで、自然なランダム効果を作成","ko":"Shader Noise는 다중 카메라의 ThreeJS 구동 3D N-체 시뮬레이터로 자연스러운 랜덤 효과를 생성","es":"Shader Noise es un simulador 3D de N-cuerpos que utiliza ThreeJS y GLSL para generar patrones naturales","fr":"Shader Noise est un simulateur 3D N-corps qui utilise ThreeJS et GLSL pour générer des motifs naturels","de":"Shader Noise ist ein 3D-N-Körper-Simulator, der ThreeJS und GLSL verwendet, um natürliche Muster zu erzeugen","pt":"O Shader Noise é um simulador 3D de N-corpos que utiliza ruído procedural para criar simulações realistas. Baseado em ThreeJS, oferece uma variedade de recursos para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Шейдер-шум - это симулятор 3D N-тел, который использует процедурный шум для создания реалистичных симуляций. Основанный на ThreeJS, он предлагает ряд функций для разработчиков.","ar":"ضوضاء الشادر هو محاكي 3D متعدد الكاميرات الذي يستخدم ضجيج إجرائي لإنشاء محاكيات واقعية. مبني على ثلاثي الأبعاد، يقدم مجموعة من الميزات للمطورين.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Shader Noise：三维N体模拟器","ja":"Shader Noise：3D N体シミュレーター","ko":"Shader Noise: 3D N-체 시뮬레이터","es":"Shader Noise: Simulador 3D de N-cuerpos con ThreeJS","fr":"Shader Noise : Simulateur 3D N-corps avec ThreeJS","de":"Shader Noise: 3D-N-Körper-Simulator mit ThreeJS","pt":"Shader Noise: Simulador 3D de N-corpos com ThreeJS","ru":"Шейдер-шум: Мультикамерный симулятор 3D N-тел","ar":"ضوضاء الشادر: محاكي 3D متعدد الكاميرات","en":"shader-noise"},"description":{"zh":"Shader Noise是一种多摄像头的ThreeJS驱动的3D N体模拟器，用于创建自然随机效果","ja":"Shader NoiseはマルチカメラのThreeJS駆動の3D N体シミュレーターで、自然なランダム効果を作成","ko":"Shader Noise는 다중 카메라의 ThreeJS 구동 3D N-체 시뮬레이터로 자연스러운 랜덤 효과를 생성","es":"Shader Noise es un simulador 3D de N-cuerpos que utiliza ThreeJS y GLSL para generar patrones naturales","fr":"Shader Noise est un simulateur 3D N-corps qui utilise ThreeJS et GLSL pour générer des motifs naturels","de":"Shader Noise ist ein 3D-N-Körper-Simulator, der ThreeJS und GLSL verwendet, um natürliche Muster zu erzeugen","pt":"O Shader Noise é um simulador 3D de N-corpos que utiliza ruído procedural para criar simulações realistas. Baseado em ThreeJS, oferece uma variedade de recur...","ru":"Шейдер-шум - это симулятор 3D N-тел, который использует процедурный шум для создания реалистичных симуляций. Основанный на ThreeJS, он предлагает ряд функций...","ar":"ضوضاء الشادر هو محاكي 3D متعدد الكاميرات الذي يستخدم ضجيج إجرائي لإنشاء محاكيات واقعية. مبني على ثلاثي الأبعاد، يقدم مجموعة من الميزات للمطورين.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"definition":{"en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"features":{"zh":["多摄像头支持","ThreeJS驱动","自然随机效果","3D N体模拟","动画支持"],"ja":["マルチカメラ対応","ThreeJS駆動","自然なランダム効果","3D N体シミュレーション","アニメーション対応"],"ko":["다중 카메라 지원","ThreeJS 구동","자연스러운 랜덤 효과","3D N-체 시뮬레이션","애니메이션 지원"],"es":["Simulación 3D de N-cuerpos con ThreeJS","Generación de ruido de sombreado con GLSL","Patrones naturales con ruido de sombreado","Compatibilidad con uv y uTime","Ajustes de rango para resultados personalizados"],"fr":["Simulation 3D N-corps avec ThreeJS","Génération de bruit de shader avec GLSL","Motifs naturels avec bruit de shader","Compatibilité avec uv et uTime","Ajustements de plage pour résultats personnalisés"],"de":["3D-N-Körper-Simulation mit ThreeJS","Erzeugung von Shader-Rauschen mit GLSL","Natürliche Muster mit Shader-Rauschen","Kompatibilität mit uv und uTime","Bereichsanpassungen für benutzerdefinierte Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Simulação 3D de N-corpos","Ruído procedural para padrões naturais","Baseado em ThreeJS","Suporte a múltiplas câmeras","Animação e efeitos visuais personalizados"],"ru":["Симуляция 3D N-тел","Процедурный шум для натуральных узоров","Основан на ThreeJS","Поддержка нескольких камер","Настройка анимации и визуальных эффектов"],"ar":["محاكاة 3D متعدد الكاميرات","ضجيج إجرائي لأنماط طبيعية","مبني على ثلاثي الأبعاد","دعم متعدد الكاميرات","تخصيص الرسوم المتحركة والأFFECTS المرئية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Shader Noise","ThreeJS","3D N体模拟","自然随机效果","多摄像头","动画支持"],"ja":["Shader Noise","ThreeJS","3D N体シミュレーション","自然なランダム効果","マルチカメラ","アニメーション対応"],"ko":["Shader Noise","ThreeJS","3D N-체 시뮬레이션","자연스러운 랜덤 효과","다중 카메라","애니메이션 지원"],"es":["shader noise","simulador 3D","ThreeJS","GLSL","ruido de sombreado","patrones naturales","N-cuerpos"],"fr":["shader noise","simulateur 3D","ThreeJS","GLSL","bruit de shader","motifs naturels","N-corps"],"de":["shader noise","3D-Simulator","ThreeJS","GLSL","Shader-Rauschen","natürliche Muster","N-Körper"],"pt":["Shader Noise","Simulador 3D","Ruído procedural","ThreeJS","Desenvolvimento de jogos","Efeitos visuais","Animação 3D"],"ru":["Шейдер-шум","Симулятор 3D","Процедурный шум","ThreeJS","Разработка игр","Визуальные эффекты","Анимация 3D"],"ar":["ضوضاء الشادر","محاكي 3D","ضجيج إجرائي","ثلاثي الأبعاد","تطوير الألعاب","الأFFECTS المرئية","الرسوم المتحركة 3D"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shader-noise","description":"Procedural noise functions in GLSL—Perlin, simplex, Worley/cellular, value noise, FBM (Fractal Brownian Motion), turbulence, and domain warping. Use when creating organic textures, terrain, clouds, water, fire, or any natural-looking procedural patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Shader Noise\n\nProcedural noise creates natural-looking randomness. Unlike `random()`, noise is coherent—nearby inputs produce nearby outputs.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```glsl\n// Simple usage\nfloat n = snoise(uv * 5.0);              // Simplex 2D\nfloat n = snoise(vec3(uv, uTime));       // Animated 3D\nfloat n = fbm(uv, 4);                    // Layered detail\n\n// Common range adjustments\nfloat n01 = n * 0.5 + 0.5;               // [-1,1] → [0,1]\nfloat sharp = step(0.0, n);              // Binary thresh","body":"# Shader Noise\n\nProcedural noise creates natural-looking randomness. Unlike `random()`, noise is coherent—nearby inputs produce nearby outputs.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```glsl\n// Simple usage\nfloat n = snoise(uv * 5.0);              // Simplex 2D\nfloat n = snoise(vec3(uv, uTime));       // Animated 3D\nfloat n = fbm(uv, 4);                    // Layered detail\n\n// Common range adjustments\nfloat n01 = n * 0.5 + 0.5;               // [-1,1] → [0,1]\nfloat sharp = step(0.0, n);              // Binary threshold\nfloat smooth = smoothstep(-0.2, 0.2, n); // Soft threshold\n```\n\n## Noise Types Comparison\n\n| Type    | Speed   | Quality  | Use Case              |\n| ------- | ------- | -------- | --------------------- |\n| Value   | Fastest | Blocky   | Quick prototypes      |\n| Perlin  | Fast    | Good     | General purpose       |\n| Simplex | Fast    | Best     | Modern default        |\n| Worley  | Slower  | Cellular | Cells, cracks, scales |\n\n## Value Noise\n\nInterpolated random values at grid points. Simple but blocky.\n\n```glsl\nfloat random(vec2 st) {\n  return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898, 78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n}\n\nfloat valueNoise(vec2 st) {\n  vec2 i = floor(st);\n  vec2 f = fract(st);\n\n  // Smoothstep interpolation\n  vec2 u = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n\n  // Four corners\n  float a = random(i);\n  float b = random(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0));\n  float c = random(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0));\n  float d = random(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0));\n\n  // Bilinear interpolation\n  return mix(mix(a, b, u.x), mix(c, d, u.x), u.y);\n}\n```\n\n## Simplex Noise (Recommended)\n\nBest quality-to-performance ratio. Use this as default.\n\n### 2D Simplex\n\n```glsl\nvec3 permute(vec3 x) { return mod(((x*34.0)+1.0)*x, 289.0); }\n\nfloat snoise(vec2 v) {\n  const vec4 C = vec4(0.211324865405187, 0.366025403784439,\n                      -0.577350269189626, 0.024390243902439);\n  vec2 i  = floor(v + dot(v, C.yy));\n  vec2 x0 = v - i + dot(i, C.xx);\n  vec2 i1 = (x0.x > x0.y) ? vec2(1.0, 0.0) : vec2(0.0, 1.0);\n  vec4 x12 = x0.xyxy + C.xxzz;\n  x12.xy -= i1;\n  i = mod(i, 289.0);\n  vec3 p = permute(permute(i.y + vec3(0.0, i1.y, 1.0)) + i.x + vec3(0.0, i1.x, 1.0));\n  vec3 m = max(0.5 - vec3(dot(x0,x0), dot(x12.xy,x12.xy), dot(x12.zw,x12.zw)), 0.0);\n  m = m*m;\n  m = m*m;\n  vec3 x = 2.0 * fract(p * C.www) - 1.0;\n  vec3 h = abs(x) - 0.5;\n  vec3 ox = floor(x + 0.5);\n  vec3 a0 = x - ox;\n  m *= 1.79284291400159 - 0.85373472095314 * (a0*a0 + h*h);\n  vec3 g;\n  g.x = a0.x * x0.x + h.x * x0.y;\n  g.yz = a0.yz * x12.xz + h.yz * x12.yw;\n  return 130.0 * dot(m, g);\n}\n```\n\n### 3D Simplex\n\n```glsl\nvec4 permute(vec4 x) { return mod(((x*34.0)+1.0)*x, 289.0); }\nvec4 taylorInvSqrt(vec4 r) { return 1.79284291400159 - 0.85373472095314 * r; }\n\nfloat snoise(vec3 v) {\n  const vec2 C = vec2(1.0/6.0, 1.0/3.0);\n  const vec4 D = vec4(0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0);\n\n  vec3 i  = floor(v + dot(v, C.yyy));\n  vec3 x0 = v - i + dot(i, C.xxx);\n\n  vec3 g = step(x0.yzx, x0.xyz);\n  vec3 l = 1.0 - g;\n  vec3 i1 = min(g.xyz, l.zxy);\n  vec3 i2 = max(g.xyz, l.zxy);\n\n  vec3 x1 = x0 - i1 + C.xxx;\n  vec3 x2 = x0 - i2 + C.yyy;\n  vec3 x3 = x0 - D.yyy;\n\n  i = mod(i, 289.0);\n  vec4 p = permute(permute(permute(\n    i.z + vec4(0.0, i1.z, i2.z, 1.0))\n    + i.y + vec4(0.0, i1.y, i2.y, 1.0))\n    + i.x + vec4(0.0, i1.x, i2.x, 1.0));\n\n  float n_ = 0.142857142857;\n  vec3 ns = n_ * D.wyz - D.xzx;\n\n  vec4 j = p - 49.0 * floor(p * ns.z * ns.z);\n\n  vec4 x_ = floor(j * ns.z);\n  vec4 y_ = floor(j - 7.0 * x_);\n\n  vec4 x = x_ *ns.x + ns.yyyy;\n  vec4 y = y_ *ns.x + ns.yyyy;\n  vec4 h = 1.0 - abs(x) - abs(y);\n\n  vec4 b0 = vec4(x.xy, y.xy);\n  vec4 b1 = vec4(x.zw, y.zw);\n\n  vec4 s0 = floor(b0)*2.0 + 1.0;\n  vec4 s1 = floor(b1)*2.0 + 1.0;\n  vec4 sh = -step(h, vec4(0.0));\n\n  vec4 a0 = b0.xzyw + s0.xzyw*sh.xxyy;\n  vec4 a1 = b1.xzyw + s1.xzyw*sh.zzww;\n\n  vec3 p0 = vec3(a0.xy, h.x);\n  vec3 p1 = vec3(a0.zw, h.y);\n  vec3 p2 = vec3(a1.xy, h.z);\n  vec3 p3 = vec3(a1.zw, h.w);\n\n  vec4 norm = taylorInvSqrt(vec4(dot(p0,p0), dot(p1,p1), dot(p2,p2), dot(p3,p3)));\n  p0 *= norm.x;\n  p1 *= norm.y;\n  p2 *= norm.z;\n  p3 *= norm.w;\n\n  vec4 m = max(0.6 - vec4(dot(x0,x0), dot(x1,x1), dot(x2,x2), dot(x3,x3)), 0.0);\n  m = m * m;\n  return 42.0 * dot(m*m, vec4(dot(p0,x0), dot(p1,x1), dot(p2,x2), dot(p3,x3)));\n}\n```\n\n## Worley (Cellular) Noise\n\nCreates cell-like patterns. Great for scales, cracks, caustics.\n\n```glsl\nvec2 random2(vec2 st) {\n  st = vec2(dot(st, vec2(127.1, 311.7)), dot(st, vec2(269.5, 183.3)));\n  return fract(sin(st) * 43758.5453123);\n}\n\nfloat worley(vec2 st) {\n  vec2 i_st = floor(st);\n  vec2 f_st = fract(st);\n\n  float minDist = 1.0;\n\n  // Check 3x3 neighborhood\n  for (int y = -1; y <= 1; y++) {\n    for (int x = -1; x <= 1; x++) {\n      vec2 neighbor = vec2(float(x), float(y));\n      vec2 point = random2(i_st + neighbor);\n\n      // Animate points\n      // point = 0.5 + 0.5 * sin(uTime + 6.2831 * point);\n\n      vec2 diff = neighbor + point - f_st;\n      float dist = length(diff);\n      minDist = min(minDist, dist);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return minDist;\n}\n\n// F2 - F1 variant (cracks/veins)\nvec2 worley2(vec2 st) {\n  vec2 i_st = floor(st);\n  vec2 f_st = fract(st);\n\n  float f1 = 1.0;  // Closest\n  float f2 = 1.0;  // Second closest\n\n  for (int y = -1; y <= 1; y++) {\n    for (int x = -1; x <= 1; x++) {\n      vec2 neighbor = vec2(float(x), float(y));\n      vec2 point = random2(i_st + neighbor);\n      vec2 diff = neighbor + point - f_st;\n      float dist = length(diff);\n\n      if (dist < f1) {\n        f2 = f1;\n        f1 = dist;\n      } else if (dist < f2) {\n        f2 = dist;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  return vec2(f1, f2);\n}\n```\n\n## FBM (Fractal Brownian Motion)\n\nLayer multiple noise octaves for natural detail at all scales.\n\n```glsl\nfloat fbm(vec2 st, int octaves) {\n  float value = 0.0;\n  float amplitude = 0.5;\n  float frequency = 1.0;\n\n  for (int i = 0; i < octaves; i++) {\n    value += amplitude * snoise(st * frequency);\n    frequency *= 2.0;      // Lacunarity\n    amplitude *= 0.5;      // Gain/Persistence\n  }\n\n  return value;\n}\n\n// Configurable FBM\nfloat fbm(vec2 st, int octaves, float lacunarity, float gain) {\n  float value = 0.0;\n  float amplitude = 0.5;\n  float frequency = 1.0;\n\n  for (int i = 0; i < octaves; i++) {\n    value += amplitude * snoise(st * frequency);\n    frequency *= lacunarity;\n    amplitude *= gain;\n  }\n\n  return value;\n}\n```\n\n### FBM Variants\n\n```glsl\n// Ridged FBM (mountains, lightning)\nfloat ridgedFbm(vec2 st, int octaves) {\n  float value = 0.0;\n  float amplitude = 0.5;\n  float frequency = 1.0;\n\n  for (int i = 0; i < octaves; i++) {\n    float n = snoise(st * frequency);\n    n = 1.0 - abs(n);  // Ridge\n    n = n * n;          // Sharpen\n    value += amplitude * n;\n    frequency *= 2.0;\n    amplitude *= 0.5;\n  }\n\n  return value;\n}\n\n// Turbulence (absolute value, always positive)\nfloat turbulence(vec2 st, int octaves) {\n  float value = 0.0;\n  float amplitude = 0.5;\n  float frequency = 1.0;\n\n  for (int i = 0; i < octaves; i++) {\n    value += amplitude * abs(snoise(st * frequency));\n    frequency *= 2.0;\n    amplitude *= 0.5;\n  }\n\n  return value;\n}\n```\n\n## Domain Warping\n\nDistort the input coordinates with noise for organic shapes.\n\n```glsl\n// Simple domain warp\nfloat warpedNoise(vec2 st) {\n  vec2 q = vec2(\n    snoise(st),\n    snoise(st + vec2(5.2, 1.3))\n  );\n\n  return snoise(st + q * 2.0);\n}\n\n// Double domain warp (more complex)\nfloat doubleWarp(vec2 st) {\n  vec2 q = vec2(\n    fbm(st, 4),\n    fbm(st + vec2(5.2, 1.3), 4)\n  );\n\n  vec2 r = vec2(\n    fbm(st + q * 4.0 + vec2(1.7, 9.2), 4),\n    fbm(st + q * 4.0 + vec2(8.3, 2.8), 4)\n  );\n\n  return fbm(st + r * 4.0, 4);\n}\n\n// Animated warp\nfloat animatedWarp(vec2 st, float time) {\n  vec2 q = vec2(\n    fbm(st + vec2(0.0, 0.0), 4),\n    fbm(st + vec2(5.2, 1.3), 4)\n  );\n\n  vec2 r = vec2(\n    fbm(st + q * 4.0 + vec2(1.7, 9.2) + 0.15 * time, 4),\n    fbm(st + q * 4.0 + vec2(8.3, 2.8) + 0.126 * time, 4)\n  );\n\n  return fbm(st + r * 4.0, 4);\n}\n```\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n### Terrain Height\n\n```glsl\nfloat terrainHeight(vec2 pos) {\n  float height = 0.0;\n\n  // Base terrain\n  height += fbm(pos * 0.01, 6) * 100.0;\n\n  // Mountains (ridged)\n  height += ridgedFbm(pos * 0.005, 4) * 200.0;\n\n  // Detail\n  height += snoise(pos * 0.1) * 5.0;\n\n  return height;\n}\n```\n\n### Clouds\n\n```glsl\nfloat clouds(vec2 uv, float time) {\n  vec2 motion = vec2(time * 0.1, 0.0);\n\n  float density = fbm(uv * 3.0 + motion, 5);\n  density = smoothstep(0.0, 0.5, density);\n\n  return density;\n}\n```\n\n### Fire/Flames\n\n```glsl\nfloat fire(vec2 uv, float time) {\n  // Upward motion\n  uv.y -= time * 2.0;\n\n  // Turbulent distortion\n  float turb = turbulence(uv * 4.0, 4);\n\n  // Fade out at top\n  float fade = 1.0 - uv.y;\n\n  return turb * fade;\n}\n```\n\n### Water Caustics\n\n```glsl\nfloat caustics(vec2 uv, float time) {\n  vec2 w = worley2(uv * 8.0 + time * 0.5);\n  return pow(1.0 - w.x, 3.0);\n}\n```\n\n### Marble/Stone\n\n```glsl\nfloat marble(vec2 uv) {\n  float n = fbm(uv * 2.0, 4);\n  float veins = sin(uv.x * 10.0 + n * 10.0);\n  return veins * 0.5 + 0.5;\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n| Technique                       | Impact                     |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| Fewer octaves in FBM            | Major speedup              |\n| 2D vs 3D noise                  | 2D ~2x faster              |\n| Bake to texture                 | Massive speedup for static |\n| Lower frequency = fewer samples | Faster                     |\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\nshader-noise/\n├── SKILL.md\n├── references/\n│   ├── noise-comparison.md    # Visual comparison of types\n│   └── optimization.md        # Performance techniques\n└── scripts/\n    ├── noise/\n    │   ├── simplex2d.glsl     # Copy-paste simplex 2D\n    │   ├── simplex3d.glsl     # Copy-paste simplex 3D\n    │   ├── worley.glsl        # Copy-paste Worley\n    │   └── fbm.glsl           # FBM variants\n    └── examples/\n        ├── terrain.glsl       # Terrain generation\n        ├── clouds.glsl        # Cloud shader\n        └── fire.glsl          # Fire effect\n```\n\n## Reference\n\n- `references/noise-comparison.md` — Visual comparison of noise types\n- `references/optimization.md` — Performance optimization techniques\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:52:07.138Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Graphics and Simulation Agents needing procedural noise generation for natural-looking randomness in 3D environments.","zh":"适用于需要程序性噪声生成以实现 3D 环境中自然外观随机性的图形和模拟代理。","ja":"3D 環境における自然な外観のランダム性を実現するための手続き型ノイズ生成が必要なグラフィックスおよびシミュレーションエージェントに適しています。","ko":"3D 환경에서 자연스러운 외관의 무작위성을 구현하기 위한 절차적 노이즈 생성이 필요한 그래픽스 및 시뮬레이션 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gráficos y simulación que necesitan generación de ruido procedural para aleatoriedad con aspecto natural en entornos 3D.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de graphiques et de simulation nécessitant une génération de bruit procédural pour un aspect aléatoire naturel dans les environnements 3D.","de":"Perfekt für Grafik- und Simulationsagenten, die eine prozedurale Rauschgenerierung für natürliche Zufälligkeit in 3D-Umgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Gráficos e de Simulação que necessitam de geração de ruído procedural para aleatoriedade com aparência natural em ambientes 3D.","ru":"Идеально подходит для графических и симуляционных агентов, которым требуется генерация процедурного шума для естественной случайности в 3D-средах.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الرسومية و محاكاة الحاجة إلى توليد الضوضاء الإجرائي للاعتباطية ذو المظهر الطبيعى في بيئات 3D."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create realistic, coherent noise patterns using Simplex noise and fractal brownian motion (fbm) in ThreeJS, enabling advanced 3D N-body simulations with animated, layered detail.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Simplex 噪声和分形布朗运动（fbm）在 ThreeJS 中创建逼真的连贯噪声模式，从而实现具有动画、分层细节的高级 3D N 体模拟。","ja":"Simplex ノイズとフラクタルブラウンモーション（fbm）を使用して ThreeJS でリアルな一貫性のあるノイズパターンを作成できるため、動画や層状の詳細を備えた高度な 3D N 体シミュレーションを可能にします。","ko":"Simplex 노이즈와 프랙탈 브라운 운동(fbm)을 사용하여 ThreeJS에서 실제적인 일관된 노이즈 패턴을 생성할 수 있어, 애니메이션 및 계층적 세부 사항을 갖춘 고급 3D N-체 시뮬레이션을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear patrones de ruido realistas y coherentes utilizando ruido Simplex y movimiento browniano fractal (fbm) en ThreeJS, lo que permite simulaciones avanzadas de N-cuerpos 3D con detalles animados y en capas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des modèles de bruit réalistes et cohérents en utilisant le bruit Simplex et le mouvement brownien fractal (fbm) dans ThreeJS, permettant ainsi des simulations avancées de N-corps 3D avec des détails animés et superposés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, realistische und kohärente Rauschmuster mit Simplex-Rauschen und fraktalem Brownian-Motion (fbm) in ThreeJS zu erstellen, wodurch erweiterte 3D-N-Körper-Simulationen mit animierten und geschichteten Details ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem padrões de ruído realistas e coerentes usando ruído Simplex e movimento marrom fractal (fbm) no ThreeJS, permitindo simulações avançadas de N-corpos 3D com detalhe animado e em camadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать реалистичные и связные шаблоны шума с использованием шума Simplex и фрактального коричневого движения (fbm) в ThreeJS, что позволяет выполнять продвинутые симуляции 3D N-тел с анимированными и многослойными деталями.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء أنماط ضوضاء реалистية ومتسقة باستخدام ضجيج سيمبلكس وحركة براون الفракتالية (fbm) في ThreeJS، مما يسمح بمحاكاة متقدمة للنظام N-جسم 3D مع تفاصيل متحركة ومُطبقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating procedural terrain for 3D simulations","Creating realistic water or cloud effects using noise functions","Simulating complex N-body systems with animated noise patterns"],"zh":["为 3D 模拟生成程序性地形","使用噪声函数创建逼真的水或云效果","模拟具有动画噪声模式的复杂 N 体系统"],"ja":["3D シミュレーションのための手続き型テラーン生成","ノイズ関数を使用してリアルな水や雲の効果を作成","アニメーション化されたノイズパターンを備えた複雑な N 体システムのシミュレーション"],"ko":["3D 시뮬레이션을 위한 절차적 지형 생성","노이즈 함수를 사용하여 실제적인 물이나 구름 효과 생성","애니메이션 노이즈 패턴을 갖춘 복잡한 N-체 시스템 시뮬레이션"],"es":["Generar terreno procedural para simulaciones 3D","Crear efectos de agua o nube realistas utilizando funciones de ruido","Simular sistemas complejos de N-cuerpos con patrones de ruido animados"],"fr":["Générer des terrains procéduraux pour des simulations 3D","Créer des effets d''eau ou de nuage réalistes en utilisant des fonctions de bruit","Simuler des systèmes complexes de N-corps avec des modèles de bruit animés"],"de":["Erzeugen von prozeduralem Gelände für 3D-Simulationen","Erstellen realistischer Wasser- oder Wolken-effekte unter Verwendung von Rauschfunktionen","Simulieren komplexer N-Körper-Systeme mit animierten Rauschmustern"],"pt":["Gerar terreno procedural para simulações 3D","Criar efeitos realistas de água ou nuvens usando funções de ruído","Simular sistemas N-corpos complexos com padrões de ruído animados"],"ru":["Генерация процедурного рельефа для 3D-симуляций","Создание реалистичных эффектов воды или облаков с помощью функций шума","Моделирование сложных систем N-тел с анимированными шаблонами шума"],"ar":["توليد أرض إجرائي لتحاكي 3D","إنشاء تأثيرات مائية أو سحابية реалистية باستخدام دوال الضوضاء","محاكاة أنظمة N-جسم معقدة مع أنماط ضوضاء متحركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ThreeJS library","GLSL compatibility necessary","Limited to procedural noise generation"],"zh":["需要 ThreeJS 库","GLSL 兼容性必要","仅限程序性噪声生成"],"ja":["ThreeJS ライブラリが必要","GLSL との互換性が必要","手続き型ノイズ生成のみ"],"ko":["ThreeJS 라이브러리 필요","GLSL 호환성 필요","절차적 노이즈 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca ThreeJS","Compatibilidad con GLSL necesaria","Limitado a la generación de ruido procedural"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque ThreeJS","Compatibilité avec GLSL nécessaire","Limité à la génération de bruit procédural"],"de":["Benötigt die ThreeJS-Bibliothek","GLSL-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die prozedurale Rauschgenerierung"],"pt":["Requer a biblioteca ThreeJS","Compatibilidade com GLSL necessária","Limitado à geração de ruído procedural"],"ru":["Требуется библиотека ThreeJS","Необходима совместимость с GLSL","Ограничен генерацией процедурного шума"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة ThreeJS","مطابقة GLSL ضرورية","محدود بتوليد الضوضاء الإجرائي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('datenoio/iterabledata/testing-patterns', 'community', 'datenoio', 'iterabledata', 'datenoio/iterabledata', 'testing-patterns', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:52:29.839Z', NULL, '{"id":"datenoio/iterabledata/testing-patterns","name":"testing-patterns","description":{"zh":"Python 测试模式库是一个用于读写和转换数据文件的库，支持多种数据文件格式。它提供了一个简单的 API 来读写和转换数据文件。","ja":"Python テストパターンライブラリは、データファイルを読み書きして変換するためのライブラリです。多様なデータファイル形式をサポートしています。","ko":"Python 테스트 패턴 라이브러리는 데이터 파일을 읽고 쓰고 변환하기 위한 라이브러리입니다. 다양한 데이터 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"La biblioteca testing-patterns es una herramienta Python para leer, escribir y convertir archivos de datos con formatos como BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML y más","fr":"La bibliothèque testing-patterns est un outil Python pour lire, écrire et convertir des fichiers de données avec des formats tels que BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML et plus","de":"Die Bibliothek testing-patterns ist ein Python-Tool zum Lesen, Schreiben und Konvertieren von Datendateien in Formaten wie BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML und mehr","pt":"A biblioteca testing-patterns é uma ferramenta em Python para ler, escrever e converter arquivos de dados em vários formatos.","ru":"Библиотека testing-patterns - это инструмент в Python для чтения, записи и преобразования файлов данных в различных форматах.","ar":"مكتبة testing-patterns هي أداة في بايثون لقراءة وكتابة وتحويل ملفات البيانات في صيغ متعددة.","en":"Python library to read, write and convert data files with formats BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML and many others"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Python 测试模式库 - 支持多种数据文件格式","ja":"Python テストパターンライブラリ - 多様なデータファイル形式をサポート","ko":"Python 테스트 패턴 라이브러리 - 다양한 데이터 파일 형식 지원","es":"Patrones de testing para formatos de datos","fr":"Modèles de test pour formats de données","de":"Testmuster für Datenformate","pt":"Padrões de Teste em Python","ru":"Шаблоны тестирования в Python","ar":"نماذج الاختبار في بايثون","en":"testing-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Python 测试模式库是一个用于读写和转换数据文件的库，支持多种数据文件格式。它提供了一个简单的 API 来读写和转换数据文件。","ja":"Python テストパターンライブラリは、データファイルを読み書きして変換するためのライブラリです。多様なデータファイル形式をサポートしています。","ko":"Python 테스트 패턴 라이브러리는 데이터 파일을 읽고 쓰고 변환하기 위한 라이브러리입니다. 다양한 데이터 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"La biblioteca testing-patterns es una herramienta Python para leer, escribir y convertir archivos de datos con formatos como BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC...","fr":"La bibliothèque testing-patterns est un outil Python pour lire, écrire et convertir des fichiers de données avec des formats tels que BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Par...","de":"Die Bibliothek testing-patterns ist ein Python-Tool zum Lesen, Schreiben und Konvertieren von Datendateien in Formaten wie BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, ...","pt":"A biblioteca testing-patterns é uma ferramenta em Python para ler, escrever e converter arquivos de dados em vários formatos.","ru":"Библиотека testing-patterns - это инструмент в Python для чтения, записи и преобразования файлов данных в различных форматах.","ar":"مكتبة testing-patterns هي أداة في بايثون لقراءة وكتابة وتحويل ملفات البيانات في صيغ متعددة.","en":"Python library to read, write and convert data files with formats BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML and many others"},"definition":{"en":"Python library to read, write and convert data files with formats BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML and many others"},"features":{"zh":["支持多种数据文件格式","简单的 API","读写和转换数据文件","支持 BSON、JSON、NDJSON、Parquet、ORC、XLS、XLSX、XML 等格式","轻松测试和验证数据文件"],"ja":["多様なデータファイル形式をサポート","シンプルな API","データファイルを読み書きして変換","BSON、JSON、NDJSON、Parquet、ORC、XLS、XLSX、XML などの形式をサポート","データファイルのテストと検証を簡単に行う"],"ko":["다양한 데이터 파일 형식 지원","간단한 API","데이터 파일 읽기 및 쓰기 및 변환","BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML 등의 형식 지원","데이터 파일 테스트 및 검증을 쉽게 수행"],"es":["Lectura y escritura de archivos de datos en múltiples formatos","Conversión entre formatos de datos","Compatibilidad con formatos como BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML","Estructura de testing flexible y personalizable","Soporte para pruebas unitarias y de integración"],"fr":["Lecture et écriture de fichiers de données dans de nombreux formats","Conversion entre formats de données","Compatibilité avec des formats tels que BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML","Structure de test flexible et personnalisable","Support pour les tests unitaires et d''intégration"],"de":["Lesen und Schreiben von Datendateien in verschiedenen Formaten","Konvertierung zwischen Datenformaten","Kompatibilität mit Formaten wie BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML","Flexible und anpassbare Teststruktur","Unterstützung für Einheitstests und Integrations-tests"],"pt":["Leitura e escrita de arquivos em formatos BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML","Conversão de arquivos entre formatos","Testes unitários e de integração","Suporte a vários formatos de arquivos","Fácil integração com outras bibliotecas Python"],"ru":["Чтение и запись файлов в форматах BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML","Преобразование файлов между форматами","Юнит-тесты и интеграционные тесты","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Легкая интеграция с другими библиотеками Python"],"ar":["قراءة وكتابة الملفات في صيغ BSON, JSON, NDJSON, Parquet, ORC, XLS, XLSX, XML","تحويل الملفات بين الصيغ","اختبارات الوحدة واختبارات التكامل","دعم للعديد من صيغ الملفات","تكامل سهل مع مكتبات بايثون الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python 测试模式库","数据文件读写","数据文件转换","BSON","JSON","NDJSON","Parquet","ORC","XLS","XLSX","XML"],"ja":["Python テストパターンライブラリ","データファイル読み書き","データファイル変換","BSON","JSON","NDJSON","Parquet","ORC","XLS","XLSX","XML"],"ko":["Python 테스트 패턴 라이브러리","데이터 파일 읽기 및 쓰기","데이터 파일 변환","BSON","JSON","NDJSON","Parquet","ORC","XLS","XLSX","XML"],"es":["patrones de testing","formatos de datos","biblioteca python","lectura y escritura de datos","conversión de datos","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración"],"fr":["modèles de test","formats de données","bibliothèque python","lecture et écriture de données","conversion de données","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration"],"de":["testmuster","datenformate","python-bibliothek","lesen und schreiben von daten","datenkonvertierung","einheitstests","integrations-tests"],"pt":["testing-patterns","python","biblioteca","arquivos de dados","formatos de arquivos","leitura e escrita","conversão de arquivos","testes unitários","testes de integração"],"ru":["testing-patterns","python","библиотека","файлы данных","форматы файлов","чтение и запись","преобразование файлов","юнит-тесты","интеграционные тесты"],"ar":["testing-patterns","بايثون","مكتبة","ملفات البيانات","صيغ الملفات","قراءة وكتابة","تحويل الملفات","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات التكامل"]}},"owner":"datenoio","repo":"iterabledata","repoPath":"datenoio/iterabledata","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-patterns","description":"Testing conventions, patterns, and best practices for IterableData. Use when writing tests, debugging test failures, or establishing test coverage.","bodyPreview":"# Testing Patterns\r\n\r\n## Test Structure\r\n\r\n### File Naming\r\n\r\n- Test files: `test_*.py` in `tests/` directory\r\n- One test file per format/feature: `test_csv.py`, `test_parquet.py`\r\n- Test classes: `Test*` (e.g., `TestCSV`, `TestParquet`)\r\n- Test functions: `test_*` (e.g., `test_read`, `test_write`)\r\n\r\n### Running Tests\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# All tests\r\npytest --verbose\r\n\r\n# Specific test file\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py -v\r\n\r\n# Specific test function\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py::TestCSV::test_read -v\r\n\r\n# Pa","body":"# Testing Patterns\r\n\r\n## Test Structure\r\n\r\n### File Naming\r\n\r\n- Test files: `test_*.py` in `tests/` directory\r\n- One test file per format/feature: `test_csv.py`, `test_parquet.py`\r\n- Test classes: `Test*` (e.g., `TestCSV`, `TestParquet`)\r\n- Test functions: `test_*` (e.g., `test_read`, `test_write`)\r\n\r\n### Running Tests\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# All tests\r\npytest --verbose\r\n\r\n# Specific test file\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py -v\r\n\r\n# Specific test function\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py::TestCSV::test_read -v\r\n\r\n# Parallel execution\r\npytest -n auto\r\n\r\n# With coverage\r\npytest --cov=iterable --cov-report=html\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Patterns\r\n\r\n### Basic Read Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_read(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''testdata/test.csv'') as source:\r\n        rows = list(source)\r\n        assert len(rows) > 0\r\n        assert isinstance(rows[0], dict)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Basic Write Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_write(self, tmp_path):\r\n    output = tmp_path / ''output.csv''\r\n    data = [{''col1'': ''val1'', ''col2'': ''val2''}]\r\n    \r\n    with open_iterable(output, ''w'') as dest:\r\n        dest.write_bulk(data)\r\n    \r\n    # Verify written data\r\n    with open_iterable(output) as source:\r\n        rows = list(source)\r\n        assert rows == data\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Compression Tests\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_gzip_compression(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''testdata/test.csv.gz'') as source:\r\n        rows = list(source)\r\n        assert len(rows) > 0\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Bulk Operations Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_read_bulk(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''testdata/test.csv'') as source:\r\n        chunks = list(source.read_bulk(size=100))\r\n        assert len(chunks) > 0\r\n        assert all(isinstance(chunk, list) for chunk in chunks)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Edge Cases\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_empty_file(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''testdata/empty.csv'') as source:\r\n        rows = list(source)\r\n        assert rows == []\r\n\r\ndef test_malformed_data(self):\r\n    with pytest.raises(ValueError):\r\n        with open_iterable(''testdata/malformed.csv'') as source:\r\n            list(source)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Missing Dependencies\r\n\r\n```python\r\n@pytest.mark.skipif(\r\n    not HAS_OPTIONAL_DEPENDENCY,\r\n    reason=\"Optional dependency not installed\"\r\n)\r\ndef test_optional_format(self):\r\n    # Test format that requires optional dependency\r\n    pass\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Data\r\n\r\n- Store test files in `testdata/` directory\r\n- Use descriptive names: `test_simple.csv`, `test_nested.json`\r\n- Include edge cases: empty files, malformed data\r\n- Test with various encodings for text formats\r\n- Test with compression: `.gz`, `.bz2`, `.zst`, etc.\r\n\r\n## Test Coverage\r\n\r\n### Required Coverage\r\n\r\n- All public methods\r\n- Error handling paths\r\n- Edge cases (empty files, malformed data)\r\n- Compression variants\r\n- Encoding variants (for text formats)\r\n\r\n### Coverage Report\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npytest --cov=iterable --cov-report=html\r\n# Opens htmlcov/index.html\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Organization\r\n\r\n### Class-Based Tests\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass TestCSV:\r\n    def test_read(self):\r\n        pass\r\n    \r\n    def test_write(self):\r\n        pass\r\n    \r\n    def test_read_bulk(self):\r\n        pass\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Fixtures\r\n\r\nUse pytest fixtures for common setup:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n@pytest.fixture\r\ndef sample_data():\r\n    return [{''col1'': ''val1'', ''col2'': ''val2''}]\r\n\r\ndef test_write_with_fixture(sample_data, tmp_path):\r\n    output = tmp_path / ''output.csv''\r\n    with open_iterable(output, ''w'') as dest:\r\n        dest.write_bulk(sample_data)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Python Version Support\r\n\r\nTests should pass for:\r\n- Python 3.10\r\n- Python 3.11\r\n- Python 3.12\r\n\r\nUse `pytest` markers if version-specific behavior needed:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n@pytest.mark.skipif(\r\n    sys.version_info < (3, 11),\r\n    reason=\"Requires Python 3.11+\"\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Best Practices\r\n\r\n1. **Always use context managers**: `with open_iterable(...) as source:`\r\n2. **Use temporary directories**: `tmp_path` fixture for write tests\r\n3. **Test both read and write**: Verify round-trip when possible\r\n4. **Test compression**: Include compressed variants\r\n5. **Test edge cases**: Empty files, single row, large files\r\n6. **Skip optional dependencies**: Use `@pytest.mark.skipif` appropriately\r\n7. **Clear assertions**: Use descriptive assert messages\r\n8. **Isolated tests**: Each test should be independent\r\n\r\n## Common Test Patterns\r\n\r\n### Round-Trip Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_round_trip(self, tmp_path):\r\n    original = [{''a'': 1, ''b'': 2}, {''a'': 3, ''b'': 4}]\r\n    output = tmp_path / ''output.csv''\r\n    \r\n    # Write\r\n    with open_iterable(output, ''w'') as dest:\r\n        dest.write_bulk(original)\r\n    \r\n    # Read back\r\n    with open_iterable(output) as source:\r\n        result = list(source)\r\n    \r\n    assert result == original\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Streaming Test\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndef test_streaming(self):\r\n    with open_iterable(''large_file.csv'') as source:\r\n        count = 0\r\n        for row in source:\r\n            count += 1\r\n            if count >= 100:\r\n                break\r\n        assert count == 100\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Debugging Tests\r\n\r\n### Verbose Output\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npytest -vv  # Very verbose\r\npytest -s   # Show print statements\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Run Last Failed\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npytest --lf  # Last failed\r\npytest --ff  # Failed first\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Debug Specific Test\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npytest tests/test_csv.py::TestCSV::test_read -v -s\r\n```\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:52:29.839Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Processing Agents needing to read, write, and convert various data file formats such as JSON, Parquet, and XML.","zh":"非常适合需要读取、写入和转换各种数据文件格式（如JSON、Parquet和XML）的数据处理代理。","ja":"JSON、Parquet、XMLなどの様々なデータファイル形式を読み書きまたは変換する必要があるデータ処理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"JSON, Parquet, XML 등의 다양한 데이터 파