e visuelle Effekte","Kompatibilität mit ThreeJS","Anwendung von Beleuchtungs- und Textureffekten","Unterstützung für erweiterte Grafiken"],"pt":["Simulação 3D de N-corpos","Combinação de múltiplos efeitos de shader","Suporte a vignette, grain e chromatic aberration","Personalização de efeitos visuais","Integração com o ThreeJS"],"ru":["Симуляция 3D N-тел","Комбинирование нескольких эффектов шейдеров","Поддержка виньетки, зерна и хроматического аберрации","Настройка визуальных эффектов","Интеграция с ThreeJS"],"ar":["محاكاة الجسم الثلاثي الأبعاد","دمج التأثيرات المتعددة للشaders","دعم الفينيت، الحبوب والانحراف اللوني","تخصيص التأثيرات البصرية","التكامل مع ThreeJS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Shader Effects","ThreeJS","3D 模拟","N-body 模拟","视觉效果","开发技术"],"ja":["Shader Effects","ThreeJS","3D シミュレーション","N-body シミュレーション","視覚効果","開発技術"],"ko":["Shader Effects","ThreeJS","3D 시뮬레이션","N-body 시뮬레이션","시각 효과","개발 기술"],"es":["shader effects","simulador 3D","efectos visuales","desarrollo de juegos","realidad virtual","ThreeJS","gráficos avanzados"],"fr":["effets de shader","simulateur 3D","effets visuels","développement de jeux","réalité virtuelle","ThreeJS","graphiques avancés"],"de":["Shader-Effekte","3D-Simulator","visuelle Effekte","Spielentwicklung","Virtual Reality","ThreeJS","erweiterte Grafiken"],"pt":["efeitos de shader","simulador 3D","ThreeJS","shaders","efeitos visuais","desenvolvimento de jogos","programação gráfica"],"ru":["эффекты шейдеров","симулятор 3D","ThreeJS","шейдеры","визуальные эффекты","разработка игр","графическое программирование"],"ar":["أثر المعالِجات","محاكي الجسم الثلاثي الأبعاد","ThreeJS","الشaders","التأثيرات البصرية","تطوير الألعاب","البرمجة الرسومية"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shader-effects","description":"Visual shader effects—glow/bloom, chromatic aberration, distortion, vignette, film grain, scanlines, glitch, dissolve, outline, and fresnel. Use when adding visual polish, post-processing effects, or stylized rendering to shaders.","bodyPreview":"# Shader Effects\n\nVisual effects that add polish, style, and atmosphere to shader output.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```glsl\n// Combine multiple effects\nvec3 color = baseColor;\ncolor = applyVignette(color, uv, 0.5);\ncolor = applyGrain(color, uv, uTime, 0.1);\ncolor = applyChromaticAberration(color, uv, 0.005);\n```\n\n## Glow / Bloom\n\n### Simple Glow\n\n```glsl\n// Distance-based glow\nfloat glow(float d, float radius, float intensity) {\n  return pow(radius / max(d, 0.001), intensity);\n}\n\n// Usage\nfloat d = sdCir","body":"# Shader Effects\n\nVisual effects that add polish, style, and atmosphere to shader output.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```glsl\n// Combine multiple effects\nvec3 color = baseColor;\ncolor = applyVignette(color, uv, 0.5);\ncolor = applyGrain(color, uv, uTime, 0.1);\ncolor = applyChromaticAberration(color, uv, 0.005);\n```\n\n## Glow / Bloom\n\n### Simple Glow\n\n```glsl\n// Distance-based glow\nfloat glow(float d, float radius, float intensity) {\n  return pow(radius / max(d, 0.001), intensity);\n}\n\n// Usage\nfloat d = sdCircle(uv, 0.2);\nvec3 color = vec3(glow(d, 0.1, 2.0)) * glowColor;\n```\n\n### Bloom (Multi-sample)\n\n```glsl\n// Sample in cross pattern for cheap bloom\nvec3 bloom(sampler2D tex, vec2 uv, float radius) {\n  vec3 color = vec3(0.0);\n  float total = 0.0;\n\n  for (float x = -4.0; x <= 4.0; x += 1.0) {\n    for (float y = -4.0; y <= 4.0; y += 1.0) {\n      float weight = 1.0 / (1.0 + length(vec2(x, y)));\n      color += texture2D(tex, uv + vec2(x, y) * radius).rgb * weight;\n      total += weight;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return color / total;\n}\n```\n\n### Gaussian Blur (Separable)\n\n```glsl\n// Horizontal pass\nvec3 blurH(sampler2D tex, vec2 uv, float radius) {\n  vec3 color = vec3(0.0);\n  float weights[5] = float[](0.227, 0.194, 0.121, 0.054, 0.016);\n\n  color += texture2D(tex, uv).rgb * weights[0];\n  for (int i = 1; i < 5; i++) {\n    vec2 offset = vec2(float(i) * radius, 0.0);\n    color += texture2D(tex, uv + offset).rgb * weights[i];\n    color += texture2D(tex, uv - offset).rgb * weights[i];\n  }\n\n  return color;\n}\n\n// Vertical pass (same, swap x/y)\n```\n\n## Chromatic Aberration\n\n```glsl\nvec3 chromaticAberration(sampler2D tex, vec2 uv, float amount) {\n  vec2 dir = uv - 0.5;\n  vec2 offset = dir * amount;\n\n  vec3 color;\n  color.r = texture2D(tex, uv + offset).r;\n  color.g = texture2D(tex, uv).g;\n  color.b = texture2D(tex, uv - offset).b;\n\n  return color;\n}\n\n// Radial chromatic aberration (stronger at edges)\nvec3 radialCA(sampler2D tex, vec2 uv, float amount) {\n  vec2 dir = uv - 0.5;\n  float dist = length(dir);\n  vec2 offset = dir * amount * dist;\n\n  vec3 color;\n  color.r = texture2D(tex, uv + offset).r;\n  color.g = texture2D(tex, uv).g;\n  color.b = texture2D(tex, uv - offset).b;\n\n  return color;\n}\n```\n\n## Distortion\n\n### Wave Distortion\n\n```glsl\nvec2 waveDistort(vec2 uv, float time, float freq, float amp) {\n  uv.x += sin(uv.y * freq + time) * amp;\n  uv.y += cos(uv.x * freq + time) * amp;\n  return uv;\n}\n```\n\n### Barrel/Pincushion Distortion\n\n```glsl\nvec2 barrelDistort(vec2 uv, float amount) {\n  vec2 centered = uv - 0.5;\n  float r2 = dot(centered, centered);\n  vec2 distorted = centered * (1.0 + amount * r2);\n  return distorted + 0.5;\n}\n```\n\n### Heat Haze\n\n```glsl\nvec2 heatHaze(vec2 uv, float time, float intensity) {\n  float noise = snoise(vec3(uv * 10.0, time));\n  return uv + vec2(noise) * intensity;\n}\n```\n\n### Ripple\n\n```glsl\nvec2 ripple(vec2 uv, vec2 center, float time, float freq, float amp) {\n  vec2 dir = uv - center;\n  float dist = length(dir);\n  float wave = sin(dist * freq - time) * amp;\n  return uv + normalize(dir) * wave;\n}\n```\n\n## Vignette\n\n```glsl\nvec3 vignette(vec3 color, vec2 uv, float intensity, float smoothness) {\n  vec2 centered = uv - 0.5;\n  float dist = length(centered);\n  float vig = smoothstep(0.5, 0.5 - smoothness, dist * intensity);\n  return color * vig;\n}\n\n// Colored vignette\nvec3 coloredVignette(vec3 color, vec2 uv, vec3 vigColor, float intensity) {\n  vec2 centered = uv - 0.5;\n  float dist = length(centered);\n  float vig = smoothstep(0.0, 0.5, dist * intensity);\n  return mix(color, vigColor, vig);\n}\n```\n\n## Film Grain\n\n```glsl\nfloat random(vec2 st) {\n  return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898, 78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n}\n\nvec3 filmGrain(vec3 color, vec2 uv, float time, float intensity) {\n  float grain = random(uv + fract(time)) * 2.0 - 1.0;\n  return color + grain * intensity;\n}\n\n// Animated grain (smoother)\nvec3 animatedGrain(vec3 color, vec2 uv, float time, float intensity) {\n  float x = (uv.x + 4.0) * (uv.y + 4.0) * (time * 10.0);\n  float grain = mod((mod(x, 13.0) + 1.0) * (mod(x, 123.0) + 1.0), 0.01) - 0.005;\n  return color + grain * intensity * 50.0;\n}\n```\n\n## Scanlines\n\n```glsl\nvec3 scanlines(vec3 color, vec2 uv, float count, float intensity) {\n  float scanline = sin(uv.y * count * 3.14159) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n  return color * (1.0 - intensity + scanline * intensity);\n}\n\n// CRT-style scanlines\nvec3 crtScanlines(vec3 color, vec2 fragCoord, float intensity) {\n  float scanline = sin(fragCoord.y * 0.7) * 0.1 * intensity;\n  float flicker = sin(uTime * 10.0) * 0.01 * intensity;\n  return color * (1.0 - scanline - flicker);\n}\n```\n\n## Glitch\n\n```glsl\nvec3 glitch(sampler2D tex, vec2 uv, float time, float intensity) {\n  // Random block offset\n  float blockTime = floor(time * 20.0);\n  float blockRand = random(vec2(blockTime, 0.0));\n\n  if (blockRand > 0.9) {\n    // Horizontal shift\n    float shift = (random(vec2(uv.y, blockTime)) - 0.5) * intensity;\n    uv.x += shift;\n  }\n\n  // Color channel split\n  vec3 color;\n  color.r = texture2D(tex, uv + vec2(intensity * 0.01, 0.0)).r;\n  color.g = texture2D(tex, uv).g;\n  color.b = texture2D(tex, uv - vec2(intensity * 0.01, 0.0)).b;\n\n  // Random color inversion blocks\n  if (random(vec2(floor(uv.y * 20.0), blockTime)) > 0.98) {\n    color = 1.0 - color;\n  }\n\n  return color;\n}\n\n// Digital glitch with blocks\nvec3 blockGlitch(sampler2D tex, vec2 uv, float time, float intensity) {\n  vec2 blockSize = vec2(0.1, 0.05);\n  vec2 block = floor(uv / blockSize);\n  float blockRand = random(block + floor(time * 10.0));\n\n  if (blockRand > 1.0 - intensity * 0.1) {\n    uv.x += (blockRand - 0.5) * 0.1;\n  }\n\n  return texture2D(tex, uv).rgb;\n}\n```\n\n## Dissolve\n\n```glsl\nvec3 dissolve(vec3 color, vec2 uv, float progress, float edgeWidth, vec3 edgeColor) {\n  float noise = snoise(uv * 10.0);\n\n  // Discard dissolved pixels\n  if (noise < progress) {\n    discard;\n  }\n\n  // Edge glow\n  float edge = smoothstep(progress, progress + edgeWidth, noise);\n  return mix(edgeColor, color, edge);\n}\n\n// With alpha instead of discard\nvec4 dissolveAlpha(vec3 color, vec2 uv, float progress, float edgeWidth, vec3 edgeColor) {\n  float noise = snoise(uv * 10.0);\n\n  float alpha = smoothstep(progress - edgeWidth, progress, noise);\n  float edge = smoothstep(progress, progress + edgeWidth, noise);\n  vec3 finalColor = mix(edgeColor, color, edge);\n\n  return vec4(finalColor, alpha);\n}\n```\n\n## Outline\n\n```glsl\n// SDF-based outline\nvec3 sdfOutline(float d, vec3 fillColor, vec3 outlineColor, float outlineWidth) {\n  float aa = fwidth(d);\n  float fill = smoothstep(aa, -aa, d);\n  float outline = smoothstep(aa, -aa, abs(d) - outlineWidth);\n\n  return mix(vec3(0.0), mix(outlineColor, fillColor, fill), max(fill, outline));\n}\n\n// Texture-based outline (sample neighbors)\nfloat textureOutline(sampler2D tex, vec2 uv, float thickness) {\n  float alpha = texture2D(tex, uv).a;\n\n  float outline = 0.0;\n  for (float x = -1.0; x <= 1.0; x += 1.0) {\n    for (float y = -1.0; y <= 1.0; y += 1.0) {\n      outline += texture2D(tex, uv + vec2(x, y) * thickness).a;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return clamp(outline - alpha * 9.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n```\n\n## Fresnel / Rim Light\n\n```glsl\n// 3D fresnel (needs view direction and normal)\nfloat fresnel(vec3 viewDir, vec3 normal, float power) {\n  return pow(1.0 - max(dot(viewDir, normal), 0.0), power);\n}\n\n// 2D fake fresnel (based on UV distance from center)\nfloat fakeFresnel2D(vec2 uv, float power) {\n  vec2 centered = uv - 0.5;\n  float dist = length(centered) * 2.0;\n  return pow(dist, power);\n}\n\n// Usage\nvec3 color = baseColor;\nfloat rim = fresnel(viewDir, normal, 3.0);\ncolor += rimColor * rim * rimIntensity;\n```\n\n## Color Grading\n\n### Contrast / Brightness / Saturation\n\n```glsl\nvec3 adjustContrast(vec3 color, float contrast) {\n  return (color - 0.5) * contrast + 0.5;\n}\n\nvec3 adjustBrightness(vec3 color, float brightness) {\n  return color + brightness;\n}\n\nvec3 adjustSaturation(vec3 color, float saturation) {\n  float gray = dot(color, vec3(0.299, 0.587, 0.114));\n  return mix(vec3(gray), color, saturation);\n}\n```\n\n### Color Remap\n\n```glsl\nvec3 colorRemap(vec3 color, vec3 shadowColor, vec3 highlightColor) {\n  float luma = dot(color, vec3(0.299, 0.587, 0.114));\n  return mix(shadowColor, highlightColor, luma);\n}\n```\n\n### Posterize\n\n```glsl\nvec3 posterize(vec3 color, float levels) {\n  return floor(color * levels) / levels;\n}\n```\n\n## Dithering\n\n```glsl\n// Bayer 4x4 dithering\nfloat bayer4x4(vec2 fragCoord) {\n  int x = int(mod(fragCoord.x, 4.0));\n  int y = int(mod(fragCoord.y, 4.0));\n\n  int bayer[16] = int[](\n    0, 8, 2, 10,\n    12, 4, 14, 6,\n    3, 11, 1, 9,\n    15, 7, 13, 5\n  );\n\n  return float(bayer[y * 4 + x]) / 16.0;\n}\n\nvec3 dither(vec3 color, vec2 fragCoord, float levels) {\n  float threshold = bayer4x4(fragCoord);\n  return floor(color * levels + threshold) / levels;\n}\n```\n\n## Combining Effects\n\n```glsl\nvec3 applyEffects(vec3 color, vec2 uv, float time) {\n  // Order matters!\n\n  // 1. Distortion (modify UVs first)\n  // Already applied to texture sampling\n\n  // 2. Color adjustments\n  color = adjustContrast(color, 1.1);\n  color = adjustSaturation(color, 1.2);\n\n  // 3. Chromatic aberration\n  // (apply during texture sampling)\n\n  // 4. Vignette\n  color = vignette(color, uv, 1.2, 0.4);\n\n  // 5. Film grain (last, before final output)\n  color = filmGrain(color, uv, time, 0.05);\n\n  return color;\n}\n```\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\nshader-effects/\n├── SKILL.md\n├── references/\n│   ├── effect-order.md       # Recommended effect ordering\n│   └── performance.md        # Effect costs\n└── scripts/\n    ├── effects/\n    │   ├── glow.glsl         # Glow/bloom\n    │   ├── distortion.glsl   # Distortion effects\n    │   ├── color.glsl        # Color grading\n    │   └── retro.glsl        # CRT/retro effects\n    └── examples/\n        ├── cyberpunk.glsl    # Cyberpunk style combo\n        └── vintage.glsl      # Vintage film look\n```\n\n## Reference\n\n- `references/effect-order.md` — Recommended order for combining effects\n- `references/performance.md` — Performance cost of each effect\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:52:34.550Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Graphics Agents requiring advanced shader-effect capabilities in ThreeJS environments.","zh":"适用于需要在ThreeJS环境中使用高级shader-effect功能的图形代理。","ja":"ThreeJS環境で高度なシェーダー効果機能を必要とするグラフィックスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"ThreeJS 환경에서 고급 셰이더 효과 기능이 필요한 그래픽 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gráficos que requieren capacidades de efectos de sombreado avanzados en entornos ThreeJS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents graphiques nécessitant des capacités de sombreado avancées dans les environnements ThreeJS.","de":"Ideal für Grafikagenten, die erweiterte Shader-Effekt-Funktionen in ThreeJS-Umgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agents Gráficos que exigem capacidades avançadas de efeitos de shader em ambientes ThreeJS.","ru":"Идеально для Графических Агентов, требующих расширенных возможностей эффектов шейдеров в средах ThreeJS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الرسومات الذي يتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لتأثيرات الشيدر في بيئات ThreeJS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate visually stunning effects using GLSL, including vignette, grain, and chromatic aberration, directly within 3D N-body simulators, enhancing their ability to add polish, style, and atmosphere to shader output via protocols like WebGL.","zh":"赋予代理使用GLSL生成视觉效果惊人的效果的能力，包括晕影、颗粒和色差，在3D N-body模拟器中直接使用，增强其通过WebGL等协议为着色器输出添加光泽、样式和氛围的能力。","ja":"GLSLを使用して、ヴィネット、グレイン、色収差などの視覚的に惊異的な効果を生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、3D N-bodyシミュレーター内で直接使用し、WebGLなどのプロトコルを介してシェーダーの出力に潤沢さ、スタイル、雰囲気を加える能力を強化します。","ko":"GLSL을 사용하여 뷰니엣, 그레인, 색수차 등 시각적으로惊异한 효과를 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 3D N-body 시뮬레이터 내에서 직접 사용하고 WebGL 등 프로토콜을 통해 셰이더 출력에 광沢, 스타일, 분위기를 추가하는 능력을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar efectos visualmente impresionantes utilizando GLSL, incluyendo viñeta, grano y aberración cromática, directamente dentro de simuladores de N-cuerpos 3D, mejorando su capacidad para agregar brillo, estilo y atmósfera a la salida del sombreado a través de protocolos como WebGL.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des effets visuellement époustouflants en utilisant GLSL, notamment la vignette, le grain et l''aberration chromatique, directement à l''intérieur des simulateurs de N-corps 3D, améliorant leur capacité à ajouter de la brillance, du style et de l''atmosphère à la sortie du sombreado via des protocoles comme WebGL.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, visuell atemberaubende Effekte mit GLSL zu generieren, einschließlich Vignette, Korn und chromatischer Aberration, direkt innerhalb von 3D-N-Körper-Simulatoren, und verbessert ihre Fähigkeit, Glanz, Stil und Atmosphäre zur Shader-Ausgabe über Protokolle wie WebGL hinzuzufügen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar efeitos visualmente deslumbrantes usando GLSL, incluindo vignette, grain e aberração cromática, diretamente dentro de simuladores 3D N-corpos, melhorando sua capacidade de adicionar polimento, estilo e atmosfera à saída do shader via protocolos como WebGL.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать визуально потрясающие эффекты с помощью GLSL, включая виньетку, зернистость и хроматическую аберрацию,直接 внутри 3D N-тел симуляторов, повышая их способность добавлять полировку, стиль и атмосферу к выводу шейдера через протоколы như WebGL.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكيل من توليد تأثيرات مرئية مبهجة باستخدام GLSL، بما في ذلك الفينيت، والحبوب، والانحراف اللوني، مباشرة داخل محاكيات الجسم 3D N، مما يعزز قدرته على إضافة لمسة، ونمط، وغيمة إلى إخراج الشيدر عبر بروتوكولات مثل WebGL."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying glow and bloom effects to 3D objects","Combining multiple shader effects for unique visual styles","Debugging complex shader code using ThreeJS"],"zh":["将发光和辉光效果应用于3D对象","组合多个着色器效果以实现独特的视觉样式","使用ThreeJS调试复杂的着色器代码"],"ja":["3Dオブジェクトにグローとブルーム効果を適用する","複数のシェーダー効果を組み合わせてユニークな視覚スタイルを実現する","ThreeJSを使用して複雑なシェーダーコードをデバッグする"],"ko":["3D 객체에 발광과 블룸 효과를 적용하는 것","여러 셰이더 효과를 결합하여 고유한 시각적 스타일을 구현하는 것","ThreeJS를 사용하여 복잡한 셰이더 코드를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Aplicar efectos de resplandor y floración a objetos 3D","Combinar varios efectos de sombreado para estilos visuales únicos","Depurar código de sombreado complejo utilizando ThreeJS"],"fr":["Appliquer des effets de glow et de bloom sur des objets 3D","Combiner plusieurs effets de sombreado pour des styles visuels uniques","Déboguer du code de sombreado complexe en utilisant ThreeJS"],"de":["Glow- und Bloom-Effekte auf 3D-Objekte anwenden","Mehrere Shader-Effekte für einzigartige visuelle Stile kombinieren","Komplexen Shader-Code mit ThreeJS debuggen"],"pt":["Aplicar efeitos de brilho e flor em objetos 3D","Combinar vários efeitos de shader para estilos visuais únicos","Depurar código de shader complexo usando ThreeJS"],"ru":["Применение эффектов свечения и расцвета к 3D объектам","Объединение нескольких эффектов шейдеров для уникальных визуальных стилей","Отладка сложного кода шейдера с помощью ThreeJS"],"ar":["تطبيق تأثيرات التلألؤ والزهرة على الكائنات 3D","مجموعة تأثيرات الشيدر المتعددة لنمط مرئي فريد","تصحيح أخطاء رمز الشيدر المعقد باستخدام ThreeJS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of GLSL and ThreeJS","Limited to WebGL-compatible browsers and environments"],"zh":["需要GLSL和ThreeJS的知识","仅限于支持WebGL的浏览器和环境"],"ja":["GLSLとThreeJSの知識が必要","WebGLに対応したブラウザと環境に限られる"],"ko":["GLSL과 ThreeJS의 지식이 필요함","WebGL을 지원하는 브라우저와 환경에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de GLSL y ThreeJS","Limitado a navegadores y entornos compatibles con WebGL"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en GLSL et ThreeJS","Limité aux navigateurs et environnements compatibles WebGL"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von GLSL und ThreeJS","Begrenzt auf WebGL-kompatible Browser und Umgebungen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de GLSL e ThreeJS","Limitado a navegadores e ambientes compatíveis com WebGL"],"ru":["Требует знания GLSL и ThreeJS","Ограничен только браузерами и средами, совместимыми с WebGL"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة GLSL و ThreeJS","محدود بالمتصفحات والبيئات المتوافقة مع WebGL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tanepiper/teskooano/particles-gpu', 'community', 'tanepiper', 'teskooano', 'tanepiper/teskooano', 'particles-gpu', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:52:14.061Z', NULL, '{"id":"tanepiper/teskooano/particles-gpu","name":"particles-gpu","description":{"zh":"particles-gpu是一个基于ThreeJS的3D N-body模拟器，使用GPU实例和自定义着色器来高效渲染大量粒子","ja":"particles-gpuはThreeJSベースの3D N-bodyシミュレーターで、GPUインスタンスとカスタムシェーダーを使用して大量のパーティクルを効率的にレンダリングします","ko":"particles-gpu는 ThreeJS 기반의 3D N-body 시뮬레이터로, GPU 인스턴스와 커스텀 셰이더를 사용하여大量의 粒子를 효율적으로 렌더링합니다","es":"El simulador de partículas con GPU es una herramienta de simulación 3D que utiliza la biblioteca ThreeJS para renderizar grandes cantidades de partículas de manera eficiente","fr":"Le simulateur de particules avec GPU est un outil de simulation 3D qui utilise la bibliothèque ThreeJS pour rendre de grandes quantités de particules de manière efficace","de":"Der Partikelsimulator mit GPU ist ein Werkzeug für 3D-Simulationen, das die Bibliothek ThreeJS verwendet, um große Mengen an Partikeln effizient zu rendern","pt":"O simulador 3D de partículas com GPU é uma ferramenta poderosa para renderizar grandes quantidades de partículas de forma eficiente","ru":"Симулятор 3D частиц на GPU является мощным инструментом для эффективного рендеринга больших количеств частиц","ar":"محاكي الجسيمات 3D مع GPU هو أداة قوية لتحسين جودة عرض الجسيمات الكبيرة","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"particles-gpu：高效的GPU粒子渲染","ja":"particles-gpu：高性能のGPUパーティクルレンダリング","ko":"particles-gpu: 효율적인 GPU 粒子 렌더링","es":"Simulador 3D de partículas con GPU","fr":"Simulateur 3D de particules avec GPU","de":"3D-Partikelsimulator mit GPU","pt":"Simulador 3D de Partículas com GPU","ru":"Симулятор 3D частиц на GPU","ar":"محاكي الجسيمات 3D مع GPU","en":"particles-gpu"},"description":{"zh":"particles-gpu是一个基于ThreeJS的3D N-body模拟器，使用GPU实例和自定义着色器来高效渲染大量粒子","ja":"particles-gpuはThreeJSベースの3D N-bodyシミュレーターで、GPUインスタンスとカスタムシェーダーを使用して大量のパーティクルを効率的にレンダリングします","ko":"particles-gpu는 ThreeJS 기반의 3D N-body 시뮬레이터로, GPU 인스턴스와 커스텀 셰이더를 사용하여大量의 粒子를 효율적으로 렌더링합니다","es":"El simulador de partículas con GPU es una herramienta de simulación 3D que utiliza la biblioteca ThreeJS para renderizar grandes cantidades de partículas de ...","fr":"Le simulateur de particules avec GPU est un outil de simulation 3D qui utilise la bibliothèque ThreeJS pour rendre de grandes quantités de particules de mani...","de":"Der Partikelsimulator mit GPU ist ein Werkzeug für 3D-Simulationen, das die Bibliothek ThreeJS verwendet, um große Mengen an Partikeln effizient zu rendern","pt":"O simulador 3D de partículas com GPU é uma ferramenta poderosa para renderizar grandes quantidades de partículas de forma eficiente","ru":"Симулятор 3D частиц на GPU является мощным инструментом для эффективного рендеринга больших количеств частиц","ar":"محاكي الجسيمات 3D مع GPU هو أداة قوية لتحسين جودة عرض الجسيمات الكبيرة","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"definition":{"en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"features":{"zh":["高效的GPU粒子渲染","支持10k-1M+个粒子实例","基于ThreeJS的3D N-body模拟","使用GPU实例和自定义着色器","高性能的渲染能力"],"ja":["高性能のGPUパーティクルレンダリング","10k-1M+個のパーティクルインスタンスをサポート","ThreeJSベースの3D N-bodyシミュレーション","GPUインスタンスとカスタムシェーダーを使用","高性能のレンダリング能力"],"ko":["효율적인 GPU 粒子 렌더링","10k-1M+개의 粒子 인스턴스를 지원","ThreeJS 기반의 3D N-body 시뮬레이션","GPU 인스턴스와 커스텀 셰이더를 사용","고성능의 렌더링 능력"],"es":["Renderizado eficiente de partículas con GPU","Soporte para grandes cantidades de partículas (10k-1M+)","Utiliza la biblioteca ThreeJS para la simulación 3D","Permite la personalización de shaders","Compatibilidad con React y @react-three/fiber"],"fr":["Rendu efficace de particules avec GPU","Prise en charge de grandes quantités de particules (10k-1M+)","Utilise la bibliothèque ThreeJS pour la simulation 3D","Permet la personnalisation de shaders","Compatibilité avec React et @react-three/fiber"],"de":["Effizientes Rendern von Partikeln mit GPU","Unterstützung für große Mengen an Partikeln (10k-1M+)","Verwendet die Bibliothek ThreeJS für die 3D-Simulation","Ermöglicht die Anpassung von Shadern","Kompatibilität mit React und @react-three/fiber"],"pt":["Renderização eficiente de grandes quantidades de partículas","Utilização da unidade de processamento gráfico para melhorar o desempenho","Suporte a múltiplas câmeras","Customização de shaders para personalizar a aparência das partículas","Integração com bibliotecas de JavaScript como React e ThreeJS"],"ru":["Эффективный рендеринг больших количеств частиц","Использование графического процессора для повышения производительности","Поддержка нескольких камер","Настройка шейдеров для персонализации вида частиц","Интеграция с библиотеками JavaScript, такими как React и ThreeJS"],"ar":["تحسين جودة عرض الجسيمات الكبيرة","استخدام وحدة المعالجة الرسومية لتحسين الأداء","دعم الكاميرات المتعددة","تخصيص شيدر لتحسين مظهر الجسيمات","التكامل مع مكتبات جافاسكريبت مثل ري액ت وثري جيه اس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GPU粒子渲染","ThreeJS","3D N-body模拟","GPU实例","自定义着色器","高性能渲染","particles-gpu"],"ja":["GPUパーティクルレンダリング","ThreeJS","3D N-bodyシミュレーション","GPUインスタンス","カスタムシェーダー","高性能レンダリング","particles-gpu"],"ko":["GPU 粒子 렌더링","ThreeJS","3D N-body 시뮬레이션","GPU 인스턴스","커스텀 셰이더","고성능 렌더링","particles-gpu"],"es":["simulador de partículas","GPU","ThreeJS","renderizado 3D","partículas","shaders","React","@react-three/fiber"],"fr":["simulateur de particules","GPU","ThreeJS","rendu 3D","particules","shaders","React","@react-three/fiber"],"de":["Partikelsimulator","GPU","ThreeJS","3D-Rendering","Partikel","Shaders","React","@react-three/fiber"],"pt":["simulador 3D de partículas","GPU","renderização eficiente","partículas","ThreeJS","React","JavaScript","desenvolvimento de jogos","simulação"],"ru":["симулятор 3D частиц","GPU","эффективный рендеринг","частицы","ThreeJS","React","JavaScript","разработка игр","симуляция"],"ar":["محاكي الجسيمات 3D","GPU","تحسين جودة العرض","جسيمات","ثري جيه اس","ري액ت","جافاسكريبت","تطوير الألعاب","محاكاة"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"particles-gpu","description":"GPU-based particle systems using instanced rendering, buffer attributes, Points geometry, and custom shaders. Use when rendering thousands to millions of particles efficiently, creating particle effects like snow, rain, stars, or abstract visualizations.","bodyPreview":"# GPU Particles\n\nRender massive particle counts (10k-1M+) efficiently using GPU instancing and custom shaders.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```tsx\nimport { useRef, useMemo } from \"react\";\nimport { useFrame } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport * as THREE from \"three\";\n\nfunction Particles({ count = 10000 }) {\n  const points = useRef<THREE.Points>(null!);\n\n  const positions = useMemo(() => {\n    const pos = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      pos[i * 3] = (Math.random() - 0.","body":"# GPU Particles\n\nRender massive particle counts (10k-1M+) efficiently using GPU instancing and custom shaders.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```tsx\nimport { useRef, useMemo } from \"react\";\nimport { useFrame } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport * as THREE from \"three\";\n\nfunction Particles({ count = 10000 }) {\n  const points = useRef<THREE.Points>(null!);\n\n  const positions = useMemo(() => {\n    const pos = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      pos[i * 3] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10;\n      pos[i * 3 + 1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10;\n      pos[i * 3 + 2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10;\n    }\n    return pos;\n  }, [count]);\n\n  return (\n    <points ref={points}>\n      <bufferGeometry>\n        <bufferAttribute\n          attach=\"attributes-position\"\n          count={count}\n          array={positions}\n          itemSize={3}\n        />\n      </bufferGeometry>\n      <pointsMaterial size={0.05} color=\"#ffffff\" />\n    </points>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Rendering Approaches\n\n| Approach       | Particle Count | Complexity | Use Case                |\n| -------------- | -------------- | ---------- | ----------------------- |\n| Points         | 10k - 500k     | Low        | Simple particles, stars |\n| Instanced Mesh | 1k - 100k      | Medium     | 3D geometry particles   |\n| Custom Shader  | 100k - 10M     | High       | Maximum control         |\n\n## Points Geometry\n\nSimplest approach—each particle is a screen-facing point sprite.\n\n### Basic Points\n\n```tsx\nfunction BasicPoints({ count = 5000 }) {\n  const positions = useMemo(() => {\n    const pos = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      const theta = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n      const phi = Math.acos(2 * Math.random() - 1);\n      const r = Math.cbrt(Math.random()) * 5;\n\n      pos[i * 3] = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.cos(theta);\n      pos[i * 3 + 1] = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.sin(theta);\n      pos[i * 3 + 2] = r * Math.cos(phi);\n    }\n    return pos;\n  }, [count]);\n\n  return (\n    <points>\n      <bufferGeometry>\n        <bufferAttribute\n          attach=\"attributes-position\"\n          count={count}\n          array={positions}\n          itemSize={3}\n        />\n      </bufferGeometry>\n      <pointsMaterial\n        size={0.1}\n        sizeAttenuation={true}\n        transparent={true}\n        opacity={0.8}\n        depthWrite={false}\n        blending={THREE.AdditiveBlending}\n      />\n    </points>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Points with Texture\n\n```tsx\nfunction TexturedPoints({ count = 5000 }) {\n  const texture = useTexture(\"/particle.png\");\n\n  return (\n    <points>\n      <bufferGeometry>{/* ... positions ... */}</bufferGeometry>\n      <pointsMaterial\n        size={0.5}\n        map={texture}\n        transparent={true}\n        alphaTest={0.01}\n        depthWrite={false}\n        blending={THREE.AdditiveBlending}\n      />\n    </points>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Custom Attributes\n\nAdd per-particle data like color, size, velocity:\n\n```tsx\nfunction ColoredParticles({ count = 10000 }) {\n  const { positions, colors, sizes } = useMemo(() => {\n    const pos = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n    const col = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n    const siz = new Float32Array(count);\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      // Position\n      pos[i * 3] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10;\n      pos[i * 3 + 1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10;\n      pos[i * 3 + 2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10;\n\n      // Color (HSL to RGB)\n      const color = new THREE.Color();\n      color.setHSL(Math.random(), 0.8, 0.5);\n      col[i * 3] = color.r;\n      col[i * 3 + 1] = color.g;\n      col[i * 3 + 2] = color.b;\n\n      // Size\n      siz[i] = 0.05 + Math.random() * 0.1;\n    }\n\n    return { positions: pos, colors: col, sizes: siz };\n  }, [count]);\n\n  return (\n    <points>\n      <bufferGeometry>\n        <bufferAttribute\n          attach=\"attributes-position\"\n          count={count}\n          array={positions}\n          itemSize={3}\n        />\n        <bufferAttribute\n          attach=\"attributes-color\"\n          count={count}\n          array={colors}\n          itemSize={3}\n        />\n        <bufferAttribute\n          attach=\"attributes-size\"\n          count={count}\n          array={sizes}\n          itemSize={1}\n        />\n      </bufferGeometry>\n      <pointsMaterial\n        vertexColors\n        size={0.1}\n        sizeAttenuation\n        transparent\n        depthWrite={false}\n      />\n    </points>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Custom Shader Particles\n\nMaximum control over particle appearance and animation:\n\n```tsx\nconst vertexShader = `\n  attribute float aSize;\n  attribute vec3 aColor;\n  attribute float aAlpha;\n  \n  uniform float uTime;\n  uniform float uPixelRatio;\n  \n  varying vec3 vColor;\n  varying float vAlpha;\n  \n  void main() {\n    vColor = aColor;\n    vAlpha = aAlpha;\n    \n    vec4 mvPosition = modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n    \n    // Size attenuation\n    gl_PointSize = aSize * uPixelRatio * (300.0 / -mvPosition.z);\n    gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mvPosition;\n  }\n`;\n\nconst fragmentShader = `\n  varying vec3 vColor;\n  varying float vAlpha;\n  \n  void main() {\n    // Circular particle\n    float dist = length(gl_PointCoord - 0.5);\n    if (dist > 0.5) discard;\n    \n    // Soft edge\n    float alpha = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.4, 0.5, dist);\n    \n    gl_FragColor = vec4(vColor, alpha * vAlpha);\n  }\n`;\n\nfunction ShaderParticles({ count = 50000 }) {\n  const points = useRef<THREE.Points>(null!);\n\n  const { positions, sizes, colors, alphas } = useMemo(() => {\n    const pos = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n    const siz = new Float32Array(count);\n    const col = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n    const alp = new Float32Array(count);\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      pos[i * 3] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20;\n      pos[i * 3 + 1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20;\n      pos[i * 3 + 2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20;\n\n      siz[i] = 10 + Math.random() * 20;\n\n      const color = new THREE.Color();\n      color.setHSL(0.6 + Math.random() * 0.2, 0.8, 0.5);\n      col[i * 3] = color.r;\n      col[i * 3 + 1] = color.g;\n      col[i * 3 + 2] = color.b;\n\n      alp[i] = 0.3 + Math.random() * 0.7;\n    }\n\n    return { positions: pos, sizes: siz, colors: col, alphas: alp };\n  }, [count]);\n\n  useFrame(({ clock }) => {\n    points.current.material.uniforms.uTime.value = clock.elapsedTime;\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <points ref={points}>\n      <bufferGeometry>\n        <bufferAttribute\n          attach=\"attributes-position\"\n          count={count}\n          array={positions}\n          itemSize={3}\n        />\n        <bufferAttribute\n          attach=\"attributes-aSize\"\n          count={count}\n          array={sizes}\n          itemSize={1}\n        />\n        <bufferAttribute\n          attach=\"attributes-aColor\"\n          count={count}\n          array={colors}\n          itemSize={3}\n        />\n        <bufferAttribute\n          attach=\"attributes-aAlpha\"\n          count={count}\n          array={alphas}\n          itemSize={1}\n        />\n      </bufferGeometry>\n      <shaderMaterial\n        vertexShader={vertexShader}\n        fragmentShader={fragmentShader}\n        uniforms={{\n          uTime: { value: 0 },\n          uPixelRatio: { value: Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2) },\n        }}\n        transparent\n        depthWrite={false}\n        blending={THREE.AdditiveBlending}\n      />\n    </points>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Animated Particles\n\n### Position Animation in Shader\n\n```glsl\n// Vertex shader with animation\nattribute vec3 aVelocity;\nattribute float aPhase;\n\nuniform float uTime;\n\nvoid main() {\n  vec3 pos = position;\n\n  // Simple oscillation\n  pos.y += sin(uTime * 2.0 + aPhase) * 0.5;\n\n  // Velocity-based movement\n  pos += aVelocity * uTime;\n\n  // Wrap around bounds\n  pos = mod(pos + 10.0, 20.0) - 10.0;\n\n  vec4 mvPosition = modelViewMatrix * vec4(pos, 1.0);\n  gl_PointSize = 10.0 * (300.0 / -mvPosition.z);\n  gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mvPosition;\n}\n```\n\n### CPU Animation (for dynamic systems)\n\n```tsx\nfunction AnimatedParticles({ count = 10000 }) {\n  const points = useRef<THREE.Points>(null!);\n\n  const velocities = useMemo(() => {\n    const vel = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      vel[i * 3] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.02;\n      vel[i * 3 + 1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.02;\n      vel[i * 3 + 2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.02;\n    }\n    return vel;\n  }, [count]);\n\n  useFrame(() => {\n    const positions = points.current.geometry.attributes.position\n      .array as Float32Array;\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      positions[i * 3] += velocities[i * 3];\n      positions[i * 3 + 1] += velocities[i * 3 + 1];\n      positions[i * 3 + 2] += velocities[i * 3 + 2];\n\n      // Wrap around\n      for (let j = 0; j < 3; j++) {\n        if (positions[i * 3 + j] > 5) positions[i * 3 + j] = -5;\n        if (positions[i * 3 + j] < -5) positions[i * 3 + j] = 5;\n      }\n    }\n\n    points.current.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n  });\n\n  // ... geometry setup\n}\n```\n\n## Instanced Mesh Particles\n\nFor 3D geometry particles (not just points):\n\n```tsx\nfunction InstancedParticles({ count = 1000 }) {\n  const mesh = useRef<THREE.InstancedMesh>(null!);\n  const dummy = useMemo(() => new THREE.Object3D(), []);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      dummy.position.set(\n        (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10,\n        (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10,\n        (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10,\n      );\n      dummy.rotation.set(Math.random() * Math.PI, Math.random() * Math.PI, 0);\n      dummy.scale.setScalar(0.05 + Math.random() * 0.1);\n      dummy.updateMatrix();\n      mesh.current.setMatrixAt(i, dummy.matrix);\n    }\n    mesh.current.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\n  }, [count, dummy]);\n\n  useFrame(({ clock }) => {\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      mesh.current.getMatrixAt(i, dummy.matrix);\n      dummy.matrix.decompose(dummy.position, dummy.quaternion, dummy.scale);\n\n      dummy.rotation.x += 0.01;\n      dummy.rotation.y += 0.01;\n\n      dummy.updateMatrix();\n      mesh.current.setMatrixAt(i, dummy.matrix);\n    }\n    mesh.current.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <instancedMesh ref={mesh} args={[undefined, undefined, count]}>\n      <icosahedronGeometry args={[1, 0]} />\n      <meshStandardMaterial color=\"#ff6b6b\" />\n    </instancedMesh>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Buffer Geometry Patterns\n\n### Sphere Distribution\n\n```tsx\nfunction spherePositions(count: number, radius: number) {\n  const positions = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n    const theta = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n    const phi = Math.acos(2 * Math.random() - 1);\n    const r = Math.cbrt(Math.random()) * radius; // Cube root for uniform volume\n\n    positions[i * 3] = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.cos(theta);\n    positions[i * 3 + 1] = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.sin(theta);\n    positions[i * 3 + 2] = r * Math.cos(phi);\n  }\n\n  return positions;\n}\n```\n\n### Galaxy Spiral\n\n```tsx\nfunction galaxyPositions(count: number, arms: number, spin: number) {\n  const positions = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n    const armIndex = i % arms;\n    const armAngle = (armIndex / arms) * Math.PI * 2;\n\n    const radius = Math.random() * 5;\n    const spinAngle = radius * spin;\n    const angle = armAngle + spinAngle;\n\n    // Add randomness\n    const randomX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5 * radius;\n    const randomY = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.2;\n    const randomZ = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5 * radius;\n\n    positions[i * 3] = Math.cos(angle) * radius + randomX;\n    positions[i * 3 + 1] = randomY;\n    positions[i * 3 + 2] = Math.sin(angle) * radius + randomZ;\n  }\n\n  return positions;\n}\n```\n\n### Grid Distribution\n\n```tsx\nfunction gridPositions(countPerAxis: number, spacing: number) {\n  const count = countPerAxis ** 3;\n  const positions = new Float32Array(count * 3);\n  const offset = (countPerAxis - 1) * spacing * 0.5;\n\n  let index = 0;\n  for (let x = 0; x < countPerAxis; x++) {\n    for (let y = 0; y < countPerAxis; y++) {\n      for (let z = 0; z < countPerAxis; z++) {\n        positions[index * 3] = x * spacing - offset;\n        positions[index * 3 + 1] = y * spacing - offset;\n        positions[index * 3 + 2] = z * spacing - offset;\n        index++;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  return positions;\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n| Technique                     | Impact                            |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| Use Points over InstancedMesh | 5-10x faster for simple particles |\n| GPU animation (shader) vs CPU | 10-100x faster at scale           |\n| Disable depthWrite            | Faster blending                   |\n| Use Float32Array              | Required for buffers              |\n| Frustum culling (default on)  | Skip off-screen                   |\n\n### Optimal Settings\n\n```tsx\n<pointsMaterial\n  transparent\n  depthWrite={false} // Faster blending\n  blending={THREE.AdditiveBlending} // Good for glowing particles\n  sizeAttenuation // Perspective-correct size\n/>\n```\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\nparticles-gpu/\n├── SKILL.md\n├── references/\n│   ├── buffer-patterns.md     # Distribution patterns\n│   └── shader-examples.md     # Complete shader examples\n└── scripts/\n    ├── particles/\n    │   ├── basic-points.tsx   # Simple points setup\n    │   ├── shader-points.tsx  # Custom shader particles\n    │   └── instanced.tsx      # Instanced mesh particles\n    └── distributions/\n        ├── sphere.ts          # Sphere distribution\n        ├── galaxy.ts          # Galaxy spiral\n        └── grid.ts            # Grid distribution\n```\n\n## Reference\n\n- `references/buffer-patterns.md` — Position distribution patterns\n- `references/shader-examples.md` — Complete particle shaders\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:52:14.061Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Graphics Agents needing high-performance 3D particle simulations with GPU instancing and custom shaders.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能3D粒子模拟、GPU实例化和自定义着色器的图形代理。","ja":"高性能の3Dパーティクルシミュレーション、GPUインスタンシング、カスタムシェーダーが必要なグラフィックスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고성능 3D 파티클 시뮬레이션, GPU 인스턴싱 및 사용자 지정 셰이더가 필요한 그래픽 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes gráficos que necesitan simulaciones de partículas 3D de alto rendimiento con instanciación de GPU y shaders personalizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents graphiques nécessitant des simulations de particules 3D haute performance avec instanciation de GPU et shaders personnalisés.","de":"Perfekt für Grafikagenten, die hochleistungsstarke 3D-Partikelsimulationen mit GPU-Instanziierung und benutzerdefinierten Shadern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Gráficos que necessitam de simulações de partículas 3D de alto desempenho com instanciamento de GPU e sombreadores personalizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Графических Агентов, которым необходимы симуляции 3D-частиц с высокими производительными возможностями, поддержкой инстансирования GPU и настраиваемыми шейдерами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الرسومات الذي يحتاج إلى محاكاة الجسيمات ثلاثية الأبعاد عالية الأداء مع مثيلات GPU والشaders المخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to render massive particle counts efficiently using ThreeJS, React, and WebGL, enabling advanced data visualization and interactive 3D experiences with custom shaders and GPU acceleration.","zh":"赋予代理使用ThreeJS、React和WebGL高效渲染大量粒子数的能力，从而实现高级数据可视化和交互式3D体验，并支持自定义着色器和GPU加速。","ja":"ThreeJS、React、WebGLを使用して大量のパーティクル数を効率的にレンダリングするエージェントの能力を提供し、カスタムシェーダーとGPUアクセラレーションをサポートした高度なデータ可視化とインタラクティブな3D体験を可能にします。","ko":"ThreeJS, React 및 WebGL를 사용하여大量의 파티클 수를 효율적으로 렌더링할 수 있는 에이전트의 기능을 제공하여 고급 데이터 시각화 및 상호작용형 3D 경험을 가능하게 하며 사용자 지정 셰이더 및 GPU 가속을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a renderizar cuentas de partículas masivas de manera eficiente utilizando ThreeJS, React y WebGL, lo que permite una visualización avanzada de datos y experiencias 3D interactivas con shaders personalizados y aceleración de GPU.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rendre des comptes de particules massives de manière efficace en utilisant ThreeJS, React et WebGL, ce qui permet une visualisation avancée de données et des expériences 3D interactives avec des shaders personnalisés et une accélération de GPU.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, massive Partikelmengen effizient mit ThreeJS, React und WebGL zu rendern, was eine erweiterte Datenvisualisierung und interaktive 3D-Erfahrungen mit benutzerdefinierten Shadern und GPU-Beschleunigung ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a renderizar contagens de partículas massivas de forma eficiente usando ThreeJS, React e WebGL, permitindo visualizações de dados avançadas e experiências interativas 3D com sombreadores personalizados e aceleração de GPU.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно рендерить огромное количество частиц, используя ThreeJS, React и WebGL, обеспечивая продвинутую визуализацию данных и интерактивные 3D-опыты с настраиваемыми шейдерами и ускорением GPU.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تقديم عروض جسيمات ضخمة بكفاءة باستخدام ThreeJS و React و WebGL، وتمكين تحقق بيانات متقدم وخبرات تفاعلية ثلاثية الأبعاد مع شفرات مخصصة وتسريع GPU."},"useCases":{"en":["Simulating complex 3D systems with massive particle counts","Generating interactive 3D visualizations for scientific data","Optimizing GPU performance for real-time particle simulations"],"zh":["模拟具有大量粒子数的复杂3D系统","生成科学数据的交互式3D可视化","优化GPU性能以进行实时粒子模拟"],"ja":["大量のパーティクル数を含む複雑な3Dシステムのシミュレーション","科学データのインタラクティブな3D可視化の生成","リアルタイムパーティクルシミュレーションのためのGPUパフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["大量의 파티클 수를 가진 복잡한 3D 시스템 시뮬레이션","과학 데이터를 위한 상호작용형 3D 시각화 생성","실시간 파티클 시뮬레이션을 위한 GPU 성능 최적화"],"es":["Simulación de sistemas 3D complejos con cuentas de partículas masivas","Generación de visualizaciones 3D interactivas para datos científicos","Optimización del rendimiento de GPU para simulaciones de partículas en tiempo real"],"fr":["Simulation de systèmes 3D complexes avec des comptes de particules massives","Génération de visualisations 3D interactives pour des données scientifiques","Optimisation des performances de GPU pour des simulations de particules en temps réel"],"de":["Simulierung komplexer 3D-Systeme mit massiven Partikelmengen","Erzeugung interaktiver 3D-Visualisierungen für wissenschaftliche Daten","Optimierung der GPU-Leistung für Echtzeit-Partikelsimulationen"],"pt":["Simular sistemas complexos 3D com contagens massivas de partículas","Gerar visualizações interativas 3D para dados científicos","Otimizar o desempenho da GPU para simulações de partículas em tempo real"],"ru":["Моделирование сложных 3D-систем с巨альными количествами частиц","Генерация интерактивных 3D-визуализаций для научных данных","Оптимизация производительности GPU для симуляций частиц в реальном времени"],"ar":["محاكاة أنظمة معقدة ثلاثية الأبعاد مع عدة جسيمات كبيرة","توليد تمثيلات تفاعلية ثلاثية الأبعاد للبيانات العلمية","تحسين أداء GPU لتحاكي الجسيمات في الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WebGL-compatible browser or environment","Dependent on React and ThreeJS libraries","Limited to particle counts between 10k-1M+ due to GPU instancing constraints"],"zh":["需要WebGL兼容的浏览器或环境","依赖于React和ThreeJS库","由于GPU实例化限制，粒子数仅限于10k-1M+之间"],"ja":["WebGL互換のブラウザまたは環境が必要","ReactとThreeJSライブラリに依存している","GPUインスタンシングの制約により、パーティクル数は10k-1M+の範囲に限定される"],"ko":["WebGL 호환 브라우저 또는 환경이 필요함","React 및 ThreeJS 라이브러리에 의존함","GPU 인스턴싱 제한으로 인해 파티클 수는 10k-1M+ 범위 내로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un navegador o entorno compatible con WebGL","Dependiente de las bibliotecas React y ThreeJS","Limitado a cuentas de partículas entre 10k-1M+ debido a las limitaciones de instanciación de GPU"],"fr":["Nécessite un navigateur ou un environnement compatible avec WebGL","Dépendant des bibliothèques React et ThreeJS","Limité à des comptes de particules entre 10k-1M+ en raison des contraintes d''instanciation de GPU"],"de":["Benötigt einen WebGL-kompatiblen Browser oder eine Umgebung","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken React und ThreeJS","Begrenzt auf Partikelmengen zwischen 10k-1M+ aufgrund der Einschränkungen der GPU-Instanziierung"],"pt":["Requer um navegador ou ambiente compatível com WebGL","Dependente das bibliotecas React e ThreeJS","Limitado a contagens de partículas entre 10k-1M+ devido a restrições de instanciamento de GPU"],"ru":["Требует браузера или среды, совместимой с WebGL","Зависит от библиотек React и ThreeJS","Ограничен количеством частиц от 10 тыс. до 1 млн+ из-за ограничений инстансирования GPU"],"ar":["يتطلب متصفحًا أو بيئة متوافقة مع WebGL","يعتمد على مكتبات React و ThreeJS","محدود بعدد الجسيمات بين 10 آلاف و 1 مليون+ بسبب قيود مثيلات GPU"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tanepiper/teskooano/postfx-effects', 'community', 'tanepiper', 'teskooano', 'tanepiper/teskooano', 'postfx-effects', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:52:37.616Z', NULL, '{"id":"tanepiper/teskooano/postfx-effects","name":"postfx-effects","description":{"zh":"PostFX效果是一个基于ThreeJS的3D N-body模拟器，提供电影级和样式化效果","ja":"PostFXエフェクトはThreeJSを使用した3D N-bodyシミュレーターで、映画のようなエフェクトとスタイリッシュな効果を提供します","ko":"PostFX 효과는 ThreeJS를 기반으로 하는 3D N-body 시뮬레이터로 영화급 및 스타일리시한 효과를 제공합니다","es":"postfx-effects es un simulador 3D de n-cuerpos con múltiples cámaras que utiliza @react-three/postprocessing para crear efectos cinematográficos y estilísticos","fr":"postfx-effects est un simulateur 3D de n-corps avec plusieurs caméras qui utilise @react-three/postprocessing pour créer des effets cinématiques et stylistiques","de":"postfx-effects ist ein 3D-N-Körper-Simulator mit mehreren Kameras, der @react-three/postprocessing verwendet, um cinematografische und stilistische Effekte zu erstellen","pt":"A biblioteca @react-three/postprocessing permite adicionar efeitos post-processing a cenas 3D criadas com ThreeJS, melhorando a experiência visual.","ru":"Библиотека @react-three/postprocessing позволяет добавлять эффекты пост-обработки к 3D-сценам, созданным с помощью ThreeJS, улучшая визуальный опыт.","ar":"سماح مكتبة @react-three/postprocessing بإضافة تأثيرات بعد المعالجة إلى المشاهد ثلاثية الأبعاد التي تم إنشاؤها باستخدام ThreeJS، مما يحسن من التجربة البصرية.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PostFX效果：ThreeJS 3D模拟器","ja":"PostFXエフェクト：ThreeJS 3Dシミュレーター","ko":"PostFX 효과: ThreeJS 3D 시뮬레이터","es":"Efectos de postprocesado 3D con postfx-effects","fr":"Effets de post-traitement 3D avec postfx-effects","de":"3D-Postbearbeitungseffekte mit postfx-effects","pt":"Efeitos Post-Processing em 3D com ThreeJS","ru":"Эффекты пост-обработки в 3D с ThreeJS","ar":"التأثيرات بعد المعالجة في 3D باستخدام ThreeJS","en":"postfx-effects"},"description":{"zh":"PostFX效果是一个基于ThreeJS的3D N-body模拟器，提供电影级和样式化效果","ja":"PostFXエフェクトはThreeJSを使用した3D N-bodyシミュレーターで、映画のようなエフェクトとスタイリッシュな効果を提供します","ko":"PostFX 효과는 ThreeJS를 기반으로 하는 3D N-body 시뮬레이터로 영화급 및 스타일리시한 효과를 제공합니다","es":"postfx-effects es un simulador 3D de n-cuerpos con múltiples cámaras que utiliza @react-three/postprocessing para crear efectos cinematográficos y estilísticos","fr":"postfx-effects est un simulateur 3D de n-corps avec plusieurs caméras qui utilise @react-three/postprocessing pour créer des effets cinématiques et stylistiques","de":"postfx-effects ist ein 3D-N-Körper-Simulator mit mehreren Kameras, der @react-three/postprocessing verwendet, um cinematografische und stilistische Effekte z...","pt":"A biblioteca @react-three/postprocessing permite adicionar efeitos post-processing a cenas 3D criadas com ThreeJS, melhorando a experiência visual.","ru":"Библиотека @react-three/postprocessing позволяет добавлять эффекты пост-обработки к 3D-сценам, созданным с помощью ThreeJS, улучшая визуальный опыт.","ar":"سماح مكتبة @react-three/postprocessing بإضافة تأثيرات بعد المعالجة إلى المشاهد ثلاثية الأبعاد التي تم إنشاؤها باستخدام ThreeJS، مما يحسن من التجربة البصرية.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"definition":{"en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"features":{"zh":["支持电影级和样式化效果","使用@react-three/postprocessing实现","基于ThreeJS的3D N-body模拟器","提供ChromaticAberration、Vignette、Noise等效果","易于集成和使用"],"ja":["映画のようなエフェクトとスタイリッシュな効果をサポート","@react-three/postprocessingを使用して実現","ThreeJSを使用した3D N-bodyシミュレーター","ChromaticAberration、Vignette、Noiseなどのエフェクトを提供","簡単に統合して使用できます"],"ko":["영화급 및 스타일리시한 효과를 지원","@react-three/postprocessing을 사용하여 구현","ThreeJS를 기반으로 하는 3D N-body 시뮬레이터","ChromaticAberration, Vignette, Noise 등의 효과를 제공","쉽게 통합하여 사용할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Efectos de postprocesado 3D","Cinematografía y estilo","Múltiples cámaras","Simulador 3D de n-cuerpos","Integración con @react-three/postprocessing"],"fr":["Effets de post-traitement 3D","Cinématographie et style","Plusieurs caméras","Simulateur 3D de n-corps","Intégration avec @react-three/postprocessing"],"de":["3D-Postbearbeitungseffekte","Cinematografik und Stil","Mehrere Kameras","3D-N-Körper-Simulator","Integration mit @react-three/postprocessing"],"pt":["Efeitos cinematográficos e estilísticos","Compatibilidade com ThreeJS","Fácil integração com @react-three/fiber","Suporte a múltiplos efeitos","Personalização de efeitos"],"ru":["Кинематографические и стилистические эффекты","Совместимость с ThreeJS","Легкая интеграция с @react-three/fiber","Поддержка нескольких эффектов","Настройка эффектов"],"ar":["التأثيرات السينمائية والстиلاستية","التوافق مع ThreeJS","التكامل السهل مع @react-three/fiber","دعم تأثيرات متعددة","تخصيص التأثيرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PostFX效果","ThreeJS","3D N-body模拟器","电影级效果","样式化效果","@react-three/postprocessing"],"ja":["PostFXエフェクト","ThreeJS","3D N-bodyシミュレーター","映画のようなエフェクト","スタイリッシュな効果","@react-three/postprocessing"],"ko":["PostFX 효과","ThreeJS","3D N-body 시뮬레이터","영화급 효과","스타일리시한 효과","@react-three/postprocessing"],"es":["postfx-effects","efectos de postprocesado 3D","cinematografía 3D","estilo 3D","simulador 3D de n-cuerpos","react-three","postprocessing"],"fr":["postfx-effects","effets de post-traitement 3D","cinématographie 3D","style 3D","simulateur 3D de n-corps","react-three","postprocessing"],"de":["postfx-effects","3D-Postbearbeitungseffekte","Cinematografik 3D","Stil 3D","3D-N-Körper-Simulator","react-three","postprocessing"],"pt":["efeitos post-processing","ThreeJS","react-three","cenas 3D","técnicas de renderização","desenvolvimento de jogos","realidade virtual","realidade aumentada"],"ru":["эффекты пост-обработки","ThreeJS","react-three","3D-сцены","техники рендеринга","разработка игр","виртуальная реальность","дополненная реальность"],"ar":["التأثيرات بعد المعالجة","ThreeJS","react-three","مشاهد ثلاثية الأبعاد","تقنيات العرض","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي","الواقع المعزز"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"postfx-effects","description":"Post-processing visual effects including chromatic aberration, vignette, depth of field, film grain, color grading, and LUT support. Use when adding cinematic polish, retro aesthetics, camera simulation, or atmospheric effects to 3D scenes. Essential for mood, style, and visual storytelling.","bodyPreview":"# Post-Processing Effects\n\nCinematic and stylistic effects using @react-three/postprocessing.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install @react-three/postprocessing postprocessing\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { Canvas } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport {\n  EffectComposer,\n  ChromaticAberration,\n  Vignette,\n  Noise,\n} from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction CinematicScene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Scene />\n      <EffectComposer>\n        <ChromaticAberration offset={[0.002, 0.002]} />\n        <Vig","body":"# Post-Processing Effects\n\nCinematic and stylistic effects using @react-three/postprocessing.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install @react-three/postprocessing postprocessing\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { Canvas } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport {\n  EffectComposer,\n  ChromaticAberration,\n  Vignette,\n  Noise,\n} from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction CinematicScene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Scene />\n      <EffectComposer>\n        <ChromaticAberration offset={[0.002, 0.002]} />\n        <Vignette darkness={0.5} offset={0.3} />\n        <Noise opacity={0.05} />\n      </EffectComposer>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Core Effects\n\n### Chromatic Aberration\n\nRGB channel separation for lens distortion or glitch effects.\n\n```tsx\nimport { ChromaticAberration } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\nimport { BlendFunction } from \"postprocessing\";\nimport { Vector2 } from \"three\";\n\n// Subtle cinematic fringing\nfunction SubtleChromaticAberration() {\n  return (\n    <ChromaticAberration\n      offset={new Vector2(0.001, 0.001)}\n      radialModulation\n      modulationOffset={0.2}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\n// Intense glitch effect\nfunction GlitchChromaticAberration() {\n  const offsetRef = useRef();\n\n  useFrame(({ clock }) => {\n    if (offsetRef.current) {\n      const glitch = Math.random() > 0.95 ? 0.01 : 0.002;\n      offsetRef.current.offset.set(glitch, glitch * 0.5);\n    }\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <ChromaticAberration\n      ref={offsetRef}\n      offset={new Vector2(0.002, 0.002)}\n      blendFunction={BlendFunction.NORMAL}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Vignette\n\nDarkened edges for focus and cinematic framing.\n\n```tsx\nimport { Vignette } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\n// Soft cinematic vignette\nfunction CinematicVignette() {\n  return (\n    <Vignette\n      offset={0.3} // Distance from center before darkening\n      darkness={0.5} // How dark edges become\n      eskil={false} // Use natural vignette formula\n    />\n  );\n}\n\n// Harsh spotlight effect\nfunction SpotlightVignette() {\n  return <Vignette offset={0.1} darkness={0.9} eskil={true} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Depth of Field\n\nSimulated camera focus with bokeh blur.\n\n```tsx\nimport { DepthOfField } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\n// Focus on specific distance\nfunction StaticDOF() {\n  return (\n    <DepthOfField\n      focusDistance={0.02}\n      focalLength={0.05}\n      bokehScale={3}\n      height={480}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\n// Focus follows target object\nfunction TrackingDOF({ targetRef }) {\n  const dofRef = useRef();\n  const { camera } = useThree();\n\n  useFrame(() => {\n    if (targetRef.current && dofRef.current) {\n      const distance = camera.position.distanceTo(targetRef.current.position);\n      dofRef.current.target = distance;\n    }\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <DepthOfField\n      ref={dofRef}\n      focusDistance={0}\n      focalLength={0.02}\n      bokehScale={2}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Noise / Film Grain\n\n```tsx\nimport { Noise } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\nimport { BlendFunction } from \"postprocessing\";\n\n// Subtle film grain\nfunction FilmGrain() {\n  return <Noise opacity={0.04} blendFunction={BlendFunction.OVERLAY} />;\n}\n\n// Heavy VHS noise\nfunction VHSNoise() {\n  return <Noise opacity={0.15} blendFunction={BlendFunction.SCREEN} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Color Grading\n\n```tsx\nimport { HueSaturation, BrightnessContrast } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\n// Desaturated cinematic look\nfunction CinematicGrade() {\n  return (\n    <>\n      <HueSaturation hue={0} saturation={-0.2} />\n      <BrightnessContrast brightness={-0.05} contrast={0.1} />\n    </>\n  );\n}\n\n// Warm sunset mood\nfunction SunsetGrade() {\n  return (\n    <>\n      <HueSaturation hue={0.05} saturation={0.15} />\n      <BrightnessContrast brightness={0.02} contrast={0.05} />\n    </>\n  );\n}\n\n// Cold sci-fi atmosphere\nfunction SciFiGrade() {\n  return (\n    <>\n      <HueSaturation hue={-0.1} saturation={-0.1} />\n      <BrightnessContrast brightness={-0.1} contrast={0.15} />\n    </>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### LUT (Lookup Table)\n\n```tsx\nimport { LUT } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\nimport { LookupTexture } from \"postprocessing\";\n\nfunction LUTGrading() {\n  const [lut, setLut] = useState(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    LookupTexture.createLookupTexture(\"/luts/cinematic.cube\").then(setLut);\n  }, []);\n\n  if (!lut) return null;\n  return <LUT lut={lut} tetrahedralInterpolation />;\n}\n```\n\n### Tone Mapping\n\n```tsx\nimport { ToneMapping } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\nimport { ToneMappingMode } from \"postprocessing\";\n\nfunction CinematicToneMapping() {\n  return <ToneMapping mode={ToneMappingMode.ACES_FILMIC} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Scanlines / CRT Effect\n\n```tsx\nimport { Scanline } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction CRTScanlines() {\n  return (\n    <Scanline\n      density={1.25}\n      opacity={0.15}\n      blendFunction={BlendFunction.OVERLAY}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### God Rays\n\n```tsx\nimport { GodRays } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction VolumetricLight() {\n  const sunRef = useRef();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      <mesh ref={sunRef} position={[0, 5, -10]}>\n        <sphereGeometry args={[1, 32, 32]} />\n        <meshBasicMaterial color=\"#FFF8E0\" />\n      </mesh>\n\n      <EffectComposer>\n        {sunRef.current && (\n          <GodRays sun={sunRef.current} exposure={0.5} decay={0.9} blur />\n        )}\n      </EffectComposer>\n    </>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Combining Effects\n\n### Cinematic Stack\n\n```tsx\nfunction CinematicStack() {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <ToneMapping mode={ToneMappingMode.ACES_FILMIC} />\n      <HueSaturation saturation={-0.15} />\n      <BrightnessContrast brightness={-0.05} contrast={0.1} />\n      <ChromaticAberration offset={[0.001, 0.001]} />\n      <Vignette darkness={0.4} offset={0.3} />\n      <Noise opacity={0.03} blendFunction={BlendFunction.OVERLAY} />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Retro VHS Stack\n\n```tsx\nfunction VHSStack() {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <HueSaturation saturation={-0.3} />\n      <BrightnessContrast contrast={0.2} />\n      <ChromaticAberration offset={[0.005, 0.002]} />\n      <Scanline density={1.5} opacity={0.1} />\n      <Noise opacity={0.1} blendFunction={BlendFunction.SCREEN} />\n      <Vignette darkness={0.6} offset={0.2} />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Dream Sequence Stack\n\n```tsx\nfunction DreamStack() {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <DepthOfField focusDistance={0.01} focalLength={0.1} bokehScale={4} />\n      <Bloom luminanceThreshold={0.3} intensity={0.8} />\n      <HueSaturation saturation={0.2} hue={0.05} />\n      <BrightnessContrast brightness={0.1} />\n      <Vignette darkness={0.3} offset={0.4} />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Animated Effects\n\n### Time-Driven Color Shift\n\n```tsx\nfunction TimeDrivenEffects() {\n  const hueRef = useRef();\n  const vignetteRef = useRef();\n\n  useFrame(({ clock }) => {\n    const t = clock.elapsedTime;\n    if (hueRef.current) hueRef.current.hue = Math.sin(t * 0.1) * 0.1;\n    if (vignetteRef.current)\n      vignetteRef.current.darkness = 0.4 + Math.sin(t * 2) * 0.1;\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <HueSaturation ref={hueRef} saturation={0} hue={0} />\n      <Vignette ref={vignetteRef} darkness={0.4} offset={0.3} />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Audio-Reactive Effects\n\n```tsx\nfunction AudioReactiveEffects({ audioData }) {\n  const chromaRef = useRef();\n  const vignetteRef = useRef();\n\n  useFrame(() => {\n    if (!audioData) return;\n    const bass = audioData[0] / 255;\n    const mid = audioData[4] / 255;\n\n    if (chromaRef.current) {\n      const offset = 0.001 + bass * 0.005;\n      chromaRef.current.offset.set(offset, offset * 0.5);\n    }\n    if (vignetteRef.current) {\n      vignetteRef.current.darkness = 0.3 + mid * 0.3;\n    }\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <ChromaticAberration ref={chromaRef} offset={[0.001, 0.001]} />\n      <Vignette ref={vignetteRef} darkness={0.4} offset={0.3} />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Temporal Collapse Theme\n\nEffects stack for cosmic countdown aesthetic:\n\n```tsx\nfunction TemporalCollapseEffects() {\n  const chromaRef = useRef();\n\n  useFrame(({ clock }) => {\n    if (chromaRef.current) {\n      const pulse = Math.sin(clock.elapsedTime * 1.5) * 0.001;\n      chromaRef.current.offset.set(0.002 + pulse, 0.001 + pulse * 0.5);\n    }\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      <ToneMapping mode={ToneMappingMode.ACES_FILMIC} />\n      <HueSaturation hue={-0.05} saturation={-0.1} />\n      <BrightnessContrast brightness={-0.05} contrast={0.1} />\n      <ChromaticAberration ref={chromaRef} offset={[0.002, 0.001]} />\n      <Vignette darkness={0.5} offset={0.25} />\n      <Noise opacity={0.02} blendFunction={BlendFunction.OVERLAY} />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n| Technique             | Impact | Solution                         |\n| --------------------- | ------ | -------------------------------- |\n| Multiple blur effects | High   | Combine DOF with bloom carefully |\n| High DOF resolution   | High   | Use `height={480}` or lower      |\n| LUT loading           | Medium | Preload, cache texture           |\n| Many effects          | Medium | Order effects efficiently        |\n\n```tsx\nfunction OptimizedEffects() {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer multisampling={0}>\n      <ToneMapping mode={ToneMappingMode.ACES_FILMIC} />\n      <Vignette darkness={0.4} />\n      <Noise opacity={0.02} />\n      <Bloom intensity={1} mipmapBlur levels={4} />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Reference\n\n- See `postfx-composer` for EffectComposer setup and render targets\n- See `postfx-bloom` for dedicated bloom techniques\n- See `postfx-router` for effect selection guidance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:52:37.616Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual AI Agents needing cinematic 3D simulation capabilities with post-processing effects","zh":"非常适合需要电影级3D模拟能力和后处理效果的视觉AI代理","ja":"シネマティック3Dシミュレーション能力とポストプロセッシング効果を必要とするビジュアルAIエージェントに最適","ko":"시네마틱 3D 시뮬레이션 기능과 후처리 효과가 필요한 비주얼 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial visuales que necesitan capacidades de simulación 3D cinematográfica con efectos de postprocesamiento","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle visuels nécessitant des capacités de simulation 3D cinématographique avec des effets de post-traitement","de":"Perfekt für visuelle KI-Agents, die eine kinematographische 3D-Simulationsfähigkeit mit Postprocessing-Effekten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Visuais que precisam de capacidades de simulação 3D cinematográfica com efeitos de pós-processamento","ru":"Идеально для визуальных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы возможности кинематографической 3D-симуляции с эффектами постобработки","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات محاكاة 3D السينمائية مع تأثيرات ما بعد المعالجة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create immersive 3D scenes with cinematic and stylistic effects using @react-three/postprocessing, enabling the application of ChromaticAberration, Vignette, and Noise effects to simulate realistic environments","zh":"使代理能够使用@react-three/postprocessing创建具有电影和风格化效果的沉浸式3D场景，实现对色差、光圈和噪点效果的应用以模拟真实环境","ja":"@react-three/postprocessingを使用して、シネマティックおよびスタイリッシュなエフェクトを使用した臨場感のある3Dシーンを作成できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、色収差、ヴィネット、ノイズのエフェクトを適用してリアルな環境をシミュレート","ko":"@react-three/postprocessing을 사용하여 영화적이고 스타일화된 효과를 사용한 몰입형 3D 장면을 생성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화하여, 색상 畸変, 비네팅, 노イズ 효과를 적용하여 실제 환경을 시뮬레이트","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear escenas 3D inmersivas con efectos cinematográficos y estilísticos utilizando @react-three/postprocessing, lo que permite la aplicación de efectos de aberración cromática, viñeta y ruido para simular entornos realistas","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des scènes 3D immersives avec des effets cinématographiques et stylistiques en utilisant @react-three/postprocessing, permettant l''application d''effets d''aberration chromatique, de vignette et de bruit pour simuler des environnements réalistes","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, immersive 3D-Szenen mit kinematographischen und stilistischen Effekten unter Verwendung von @react-three/postprocessing zu erstellen, wodurch die Anwendung von Effekten wie Chromatische Aberration, Vignette und Rauschen zur Simulation realistischer Umgebungen ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar cenas 3D imersivas com efeitos cinematográficos e estilísticos usando @react-three/postprocessing, permitindo a aplicação de efeitos de Aberração Cromática, Vignette e Ruído para simular ambientes realistas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать иммерсивные 3D-сцены с кинематографическими и стилистическими эффектами, используя @react-three/postprocessing, что позволяет применять эффекты Хроматической Аберрации, Виньетки и Шума для симуляции реалистичных окружений","ar":"يمكن العميل من إنشاء مشاهد 3D غامرة مع تأثيرات سينمائية وأسلوبية باستخدام @react-three/postprocessing، مما يسمح بتطبيق تأثيرات الانحراف اللوني وefeito de Vignette والضجيج لتحقيق بيئات واقعية"},"useCases":{"en":["Simulating N-body interactions with ThreeJS","Applying post-processing effects for cinematic rendering","Generating 3D scenes with stylized visual effects"],"zh":["使用ThreeJS模拟N体相互作用","应用后处理效果进行电影渲染","生成具有风格化视觉效果的3D场景"],"ja":["ThreeJSを使用してN体相互作用をシミュレートする","ポストプロセッシング効果を適用して映画的レンダリングを行う","スタイリッシュな視覚効果を使用した3Dシーンを生成する"],"ko":["ThreeJS를 사용하여 N체 상호작용을 시뮬레이션","후처리 효과를 적용하여 영화적 렌더링","스타일화된 시각적 효과를 사용한 3D 장면 생성"],"es":["Simulación de interacciones de cuerpo N con ThreeJS","Aplicación de efectos de postprocesamiento para renderizado cinematográfico","Generación de escenas 3D con efectos visuales estilizados"],"fr":["Simulation d''interactions de corps N avec ThreeJS","Application d''effets de post-traitement pour un rendu cinématographique","Génération de scènes 3D avec des effets visuels stylisés"],"de":["Simulieren von N-Körper-Wechselwirkungen mit ThreeJS","Anwenden von Postprocessing-Effekten für kinematographisches Rendering","Generieren von 3D-Szenen mit stilisierten visuellen Effekten"],"pt":["Simulando interações N-corpo com ThreeJS","Aplicando efeitos de pós-processamento para renderização cinematográfica","Gerando cenas 3D com efeitos visuais estilizados"],"ru":["Моделирование взаимодействий N-тела с помощью ThreeJS","Применение эффектов постобработки для кинематографической визуализации","Генерация 3D-сцен с стилизованными визуальными эффектами"],"ar":["محاكاة تفاعلات الجسم N مع ThreeJS","تطبيق تأثيرات ما بعد المعالجة للتصيير السينمائي","إنتاج مشاهد 3D مع تأثيرات بصرية مصممة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires @react-three/postprocessing and postprocessing libraries","Dependent on React and ThreeJS ecosystems"],"zh":["需要@react-three/postprocessing和后处理库","依赖于React和ThreeJS生态系统"],"ja":["@react-three/postprocessingとポストプロセッシングライブラリが必要","ReactとThreeJSのエコシステムに依存"],"ko":["@react-three/postprocessing과 후처리 라이브러리 필요","React와 ThreeJS 생태계에 의존"],"es":["Requiere @react-three/postprocessing y bibliotecas de postprocesamiento","Dependiente de los ecosistemas React y ThreeJS"],"fr":["Nécessite @react-three/postprocessing et des bibliothèques de post-traitement","Dépendante des écosystèmes React et ThreeJS"],"de":["Benötigt @react-three/postprocessing und Postprocessing-Bibliotheken","Von den Ökosystemen React und ThreeJS abhängig"],"pt":["Requer @react-three/postprocessing e bibliotecas de pós-processamento","Dependente dos ecossistemas React e ThreeJS"],"ru":["Требует @react-three/postprocessing и библиотек постобработки","Зависит от экосистем React и ThreeJS"],"ar":["يتطلب @react-three/postprocessing ومكتبات ما بعد المعالجة","يعتمد على بيئات React و ThreeJS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tanepiper/teskooano/particles-router', 'community', 'tanepiper', 'teskooano', 'tanepiper/teskooano', 'particles-router', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:53:09.782Z', NULL, '{"id":"tanepiper/teskooano/particles-router","name":"particles-router","description":{"zh":"particles-router是一种基于ThreeJS的多相机3D N体模拟器，用于智能路由粒子系统","ja":"particles-routerはThreeJSを使用したマルチカメラ3D N体シミュレーターで、粒子システムのスマートルーティングを行う","ko":"particles-router는 ThreeJS 기반의 멀티 카메라 3D N-체 시뮬레이터를 사용하여 粒子 시스템의 스마트 라우팅을 thực現","es":"El Particles Router es un simulador 3D de partículas que utiliza ThreeJS para crear efectos visuales impresionantes. Permite la creación de sistemas de partículas personalizados.","fr":"Particles Router est un simulateur 3D de particules qui utilise ThreeJS pour créer des effets visuels impressionnants. Il permet la création de systèmes de particules personnalisés.","de":"Der Particles Router ist ein 3D-Partikelsimulator, der ThreeJS verwendet, um beeindruckende visuelle Effekte zu erzeugen. Er ermöglicht die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Partikelsystemen.","pt":"O Partículas Router é um simulador 3D de N-corpos que utiliza a tecnologia ThreeJS para fornecer experiências de desenvolvimento avançadas.","ru":"Particles Router — это симулятор 3D N-тел, который использует технологию ThreeJS для предоставления расширенных возможностей разработки.","ar":"موجه الجسيمات هو محاكي 3D N-جسم يعتمد على محرك ThreeJS لتقديم تجارب تطوير متقدمة.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"particles-router：三维N体模拟路由器","ja":"particles-router：3D N体シミュレーターラウター","ko":"particles-router: 3D N-체 시뮬레이터 라우터","es":"Particles Router: Simulador 3D de Partículas","fr":"Particles Router : Simulateur 3D de Particules","de":"Particles Router: 3D-Partikelsimulator","pt":"Partículas Router: Simulador 3D de N-corpos com ThreeJS","ru":"Particles Router: Многокамерный симулятор 3D N-тел","ar":"موجه الجسيمات: محاكي 3D N-جسم بمحرك ThreeJS","en":"particles-router"},"description":{"zh":"particles-router是一种基于ThreeJS的多相机3D N体模拟器，用于智能路由粒子系统","ja":"particles-routerはThreeJSを使用したマルチカメラ3D N体シミュレーターで、粒子システムのスマートルーティングを行う","ko":"particles-router는 ThreeJS 기반의 멀티 카메라 3D N-체 시뮬레이터를 사용하여 粒子 시스템의 스마트 라우팅을 thực現","es":"El Particles Router es un simulador 3D de partículas que utiliza ThreeJS para crear efectos visuales impresionantes. Permite la creación de sistemas de partí...","fr":"Particles Router est un simulateur 3D de particules qui utilise ThreeJS pour créer des effets visuels impressionnants. Il permet la création de systèmes de p...","de":"Der Particles Router ist ein 3D-Partikelsimulator, der ThreeJS verwendet, um beeindruckende visuelle Effekte zu erzeugen. Er ermöglicht die Erstellung von be...","pt":"O Partículas Router é um simulador 3D de N-corpos que utiliza a tecnologia ThreeJS para fornecer experiências de desenvolvimento avançadas.","ru":"Particles Router — это симулятор 3D N-тел, который использует технологию ThreeJS для предоставления расширенных возможностей разработки.","ar":"موجه الجسيمات هو محاكي 3D N-جسم يعتمد على محرك ThreeJS لتقديم تجارب تطوير متقدمة.","en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"definition":{"en":"A Multi-camera ThreeJS powered 3D N-body simulator"},"features":{"zh":["基于ThreeJS的3D渲染","多相机支持","智能粒子系统路由","高性能N体模拟","可扩展的架构"],"ja":["ThreeJSを使用した3Dレンダリング","マルチカメラ対応","スマート粒子システムルーティング","高性能N体シミュレーション","拡張可能なアーキテクチャ"],"ko":["ThreeJS 기반의 3D 렌더링","멀티 카메라 지원","스마트 粒子 시스템 라우팅","고성능 N-체 시뮬레이션","확장 가능한 아키텍처"],"es":["Simulación 3D de partículas","Uso de ThreeJS para efectos visuales","Creación de sistemas de partículas personalizados","Protocolo de enrutamiento para tarea específicas","Carga de habilidades de sistema de partículas"],"fr":["Simulation 3D de particules","Utilisation de ThreeJS pour des effets visuels","Création de systèmes de particules personnalisés","Protocole de routage pour tâches spécifiques","Chargement de compétences de systèmes de particules"],"de":["3D-Partikelsimulation","Verwendung von ThreeJS für visuelle Effekte","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Partikelsystemen","Routing-Protokoll für spezifische Aufgaben","Laden von Fähigkeiten von Partikelsystemen"],"pt":["Simulação 3D de N-corpos","Tecnologia ThreeJS","Sistemas de partículas especializados","Protocolo de roteamento avançado","Compatibilidade com múltiplas câmeras"],"ru":["Симуляция 3D N-тел","Технология ThreeJS","Специализированные системы частиц","Расширенный протокол маршрутизации","Возможность работы с несколькими камерами"],"ar":["محاكاة 3D N-جسم","تكنولوجيا ThreeJS","أنظمة جسيمات متخصصة","بروتوكول التوجيه المتقدم","توافق مع كاميرات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["particles-router","ThreeJS","3D N体模拟","粒子系统","智能路由","多相机支持"],"ja":["particles-router","ThreeJS","3D N体シミュレーション","粒子システム","スマートルーティング","マルチカメラ対応"],"ko":["particles-router","ThreeJS","3D N-체 시뮬레이션"," 粒子 시스템","스마트 라우팅","멀티 카메라 지원"],"es":["simulador 3D de partículas","ThreeJS","sistemas de partículas","efectos visuales","desarrollo de juegos","simulación de física","partículas router"],"fr":["simulateur 3D de particules","ThreeJS","systèmes de particules","effets visuels","développement de jeux","simulation de physique","particules router"],"de":["3D-Partikelsimulator","ThreeJS","Partikelsysteme","visuelle Effekte","Spieleentwicklung","Physiksimulation","Partikels Router"],"pt":["simulador 3D","N-corpos","ThreeJS","sistemas de partículas","desenvolvimento de jogos","realidade virtual","gráficos 3D"],"ru":["симулятор 3D","N-тел","ThreeJS","системы частиц","разработка игр","виртуальная реальность","гриффики 3D"],"ar":["محاكي 3D","N-جسم","ThreeJS","أنظمة الجسيمات","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي","الرسومات 3D"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"particles-router","description":"Decision framework for particle system projects. Routes to specialized particle skills (gpu, physics, lifecycle) based on task requirements. Use when building particle effects or needing guidance on which particle techniques to combine.","bodyPreview":"# Particles Router\n\nRoutes to 3 specialized particle system skills based on task requirements.\n\n## Routing Protocol\n\n1. **Classify** — Identify particle effect type and scale\n2. **Match** — Find skill(s) with highest signal match\n3. **Combine** — Most particle systems need 2-3 skills together\n4. **Load** — Read matched SKILL.md files before implementation\n\n## Quick Route\n\n### Tier 1: Core (Always Consider)\n\n| Task Type | Skill                 | Primary Signal Words","body":"# Particles Router\n\nRoutes to 3 specialized particle system skills based on task requirements.\n\n## Routing Protocol\n\n1. **Classify** — Identify particle effect type and scale\n2. **Match** — Find skill(s) with highest signal match\n3. **Combine** — Most particle systems need 2-3 skills together\n4. **Load** — Read matched SKILL.md files before implementation\n\n## Quick Route\n\n### Tier 1: Core (Always Consider)\n\n| Task Type | Skill                 | Primary Signal Words                                           |\n| --------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Rendering | `particles-gpu`       | points, instanced, buffer, shader, thousands, performance      |\n| Motion    | `particles-physics`   | gravity, wind, attract, force, velocity, turbulence, collision |\n| Spawning  | `particles-lifecycle` | emit, spawn, fade, trail, pool, birth, death, age              |\n\n## Signal Matching Rules\n\n### Priority Order\n\nWhen multiple signals present, resolve by priority:\n\n1. **Performance concern** — \"millions of particles\" → `particles-gpu` first\n2. **Motion type** — \"swirling\", \"attracted to\" → `particles-physics`\n3. **Emission pattern** — \"burst\", \"continuous\", \"trails\" → `particles-lifecycle`\n4. **Default** — All three skills usually needed together\n\n### Confidence Scoring\n\n- **High (3+ signals)** — Route immediately\n- **Medium (1-2 signals)** — Include all three skills (typical)\n- **Low (0 signals)** — Ask: \"Describe the particle effect you want\"\n\n## Common Combinations\n\n### Basic Particle System (All 3 skills)\n\n```\nparticles-gpu       → Buffer setup, shader rendering\nparticles-physics   → Gravity, basic motion\nparticles-lifecycle → Emission, fade out\n```\n\nWiring: GPU provides rendering foundation, lifecycle handles spawning/death, physics adds motion.\n\n### Snow/Rain Effect (3 skills)\n\n```\nparticles-gpu       → Points with texture\nparticles-physics   → Gravity, wind, turbulence\nparticles-lifecycle → Continuous emission, recycling\n```\n\nWiring: Lifecycle emits continuously, physics handles falling + drift, GPU renders efficiently.\n\n### Explosion (3 skills)\n\n```\nparticles-gpu       → Instanced or points rendering\nparticles-physics   → Radial velocity, drag\nparticles-lifecycle → Burst emission, fade + shrink\n```\n\nWiring: Lifecycle bursts particles, physics applies outward force + slowdown, GPU handles scale.\n\n### Fire/Smoke (3 skills)\n\n```\nparticles-gpu       → Custom shader with noise\nparticles-physics   → Upward force, turbulence\nparticles-lifecycle → Continuous emit, color gradient, size over life\n```\n\nWiring: Lifecycle manages color/size curves, physics adds flicker motion, GPU renders with blend modes.\n\n### Swarm/Flock (2-3 skills)\n\n```\nparticles-gpu       → Instanced mesh (if 3D shapes)\nparticles-physics   → Attractors, flow fields, separation\nparticles-lifecycle → (Optional) Population management\n```\n\nWiring: Physics dominates with behavioral forces, GPU handles rendering.\n\n### Magic Trail (3 skills)\n\n```\nparticles-gpu       → Points with glow shader\nparticles-physics   → Follow path, slight randomness\nparticles-lifecycle → Trail history, fade along length\n```\n\nWiring: Lifecycle stores position history, GPU renders with alpha gradient.\n\n### Confetti (3 skills)\n\n```\nparticles-gpu       → Instanced flat planes\nparticles-physics   → Gravity, tumbling rotation, air resistance\nparticles-lifecycle → Burst emission, ground collision death\n```\n\nWiring: Physics handles realistic falling, lifecycle manages burst and cleanup.\n\n## Decision Table\n\n| Effect Type   | GPU Focus       | Physics Focus      | Lifecycle Focus     |\n| ------------- | --------------- | ------------------ | ------------------- |\n| Stars/sparkle | Points, static  | Minimal            | Twinkle (alpha)     |\n| Snow/rain     | Points, texture | Gravity, wind      | Continuous, recycle |\n| Fire          | Shader, blend   | Upward, turbulence | Color/size curves   |\n| Explosion     | High count      | Radial, drag       | Burst, fade         |\n| Smoke         | Soft shader     | Rise, curl         | Slow fade, grow     |\n| Swarm         | Instanced       | Attractors, fields | Spawn/death         |\n| Trail         | Line or points  | Path following     | Position history    |\n| Dust          | Small points    | Brownian           | Random spawn        |\n\n## Particle Count Guidelines\n\n| Count            | Approach             | Skills Priority                     |\n| ---------------- | -------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| < 100            | Simple, any approach | lifecycle > physics > gpu           |\n| 100 - 1,000      | Points or instanced  | All equal                           |\n| 1,000 - 10,000   | GPU-focused          | gpu > physics > lifecycle           |\n| 10,000 - 100,000 | GPU essential        | gpu >> physics (shader) > lifecycle |\n| > 100,000        | Full GPU/compute     | gpu only, physics in shader         |\n\n## Skill Dependencies\n\n```\nparticles-gpu (rendering foundation)\n├── particles-physics (motion layer)\n└── particles-lifecycle (management layer)\n```\n\n- `particles-gpu` is always needed for rendering\n- `particles-physics` and `particles-lifecycle` are independent but complementary\n- For simple effects, you might skip physics OR lifecycle, rarely both\n\n## Fallback Behavior\n\n- **Unknown effect** → Start with all three skills\n- **Performance issues** → Focus on `particles-gpu` optimization\n- **Motion problems** → Deep-dive `particles-physics`\n- **Spawning/timing issues** → Focus on `particles-lifecycle`\n\n## Quick Decision Flowchart\n\n```\nUser Request\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────────────┐\n│ Rendering particles?    │──Yes──▶ particles-gpu (always)\n└─────────────────────────┘\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────────────┐\n│ Movement/forces needed? │──Yes──▶ + particles-physics\n└─────────────────────────┘\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────────────┐\n│ Birth/death/emission?   │──Yes──▶ + particles-lifecycle\n└─────────────────────────┘\n     │\n     ▼\nMost effects need all 3 skills\n```\n\n## Effect Recipes\n\n### Quick Start Templates\n\n| Effect             | Start With                             |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| Ambient dust       | gpu (points) + lifecycle (continuous)  |\n| Button sparkle     | gpu (points) + lifecycle (burst, fade) |\n| Character trail    | gpu + lifecycle (trail)                |\n| Weather            | All three                              |\n| Magic spell        | All three                              |\n| Data visualization | gpu + lifecycle                        |\n\n## Integration with Other Domains\n\n| Combined With       | Use Case                                |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `shader-noise`      | Turbulent motion, organic shapes        |\n| `shader-effects`    | Glow, chromatic aberration on particles |\n| `r3f-performance`   | Optimization, culling, LOD              |\n| `gsap-fundamentals` | Scripted particle animations            |\n| `audio-reactive`    | Music-driven particle effects           |\n\n## Reference\n\nSee individual skill files for detailed patterns:\n\n- `/mnt/skills/user/particles-gpu/SKILL.md`\n- `/mnt/skills/user/particles-physics/SKILL.md`\n- `/mnt/skills/user/particles-lifecycle/SKILL.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:53:09.782Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Graphics Rendering Agents needing advanced 3D particle simulation capabilities with ThreeJS","zh":"适合需要高级 3D 粒子模拟功能的 Graphics Rendering Agents，支持 ThreeJS","ja":"ThreeJS を使用した高度な 3D 粒子シミュレーション機能を必要とする Graphics Rendering エージェントに最適","ko":"ThreeJS를 사용하는 고급 3D 粒子 시뮬레이션 기능이 필요한 Graphics Rendering 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de renderizado de gráficos que necesitan capacidades de simulación de partículas 3D avanzadas con ThreeJS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de rendu graphique ayant besoin de capacités de simulation de particules 3D avancées avec ThreeJS","de":"Perfekt für Grafik-Rendering-Agents, die erweiterte 3D-Partikelsimulationsfunktionen mit ThreeJS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Renderização Gráfica que necessitam de capacidades de simulação de partículas 3D avançadas com ThreeJS","ru":"Идеально подходит для графических агентов-рендереров, требующих продвинутых возможностей симуляции 3D-частиц с ThreeJS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مرسومة الرسومات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات محاكاة الجسيمات ثلاثية الأبعاد المتقدمة مع ThreeJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to route tasks to specialized particle system skills using a multi-camera 3D N-body simulator, leveraging protocols like Classify, Match, Combine, and Load, with support for reading SKILL.md files","zh":"使得代理能够使用多摄像头 3D N-body 模拟器将任务路由到专用粒子系统技能，利用 Classify、Match、Combine 和 Load 等协议，并支持读取 SKILL.md 文件","ja":"エージェントがタスクを専用の粒子システムスキルにルーティングできるようにし、Classify、Match、Combine、Load などのプロトコルを使用したマルチカメラ 3D N-body シミュレーターを活用し、SKILL.md ファイルの読み取りをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 멀티 카메라 3D N-body 시뮬레이터를 사용하여 태스크를専用 粒子 시스템 スキルに 라우팅할 수 있도록 하며, Classify, Match, Combine, Load 等의 프로토콜을 利用하며, SKILL.md 파일을 읽을 수 있도록 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enrutrar tareas a habilidades de sistemas de partículas especializadas utilizando un simulador de múltiples cámaras 3D N-cuerpos, aprovechando protocolos como Clasificar, Coincidir, Combinar y Cargar, con soporte para leer archivos SKILL.md","fr":"Permet aux agents de router les tâches vers des compétences de systèmes de particules spécialisées en utilisant un simulateur de corps N 3D multi-caméra, en exploitant des protocoles tels que Classify, Match, Combine et Load, avec prise en charge de la lecture de fichiers SKILL.md","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Aufgaben an spezialisierte Partikelsystemfähigkeiten zu routen, indem sie einen Multi-Kamera-3D-N-Körper-Simulator verwenden, der Protokolle wie Klassifizieren, Abgleichen, Kombinieren und Laden nutzt, mit Unterstützung für das Lesen von SKILL.md-Dateien","pt":"Habilita os agentes a encaminhar tarefas para habilidades de sistemas de partículas especializadas usando um simulador 3D de múltiplas câmeras N-corpos, aproveitando protocolos como Classify, Match, Combine e Load, com suporte para leitura de arquivos SKILL.md","ru":"Позволяет агентам направлять задачи к специализированным навыкам системы частиц, используя симулятор многокамерной 3D-системы N-тел, использующий протоколы Classify, Match, Combine и Load, с поддержкой чтения файлов SKILL.md","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توجيه المهام إلى مهارات أنظمة الجسيمات المتخصصة باستخدام محاكي 3D متعددة الكاميرات N-جسم ، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل التصنيف والطابق والتجميع والتحميل ، مع دعم قراءة ملفات SKILL.md"},"useCases":{"en":["Simulating complex particle effects for data visualization","Routing tasks to specialized particle systems based on task requirements","Combining multiple particle systems for advanced 3D rendering"],"zh":["模拟复杂的粒子效果用于数据可视化","根据任务要求将任务路由到专用粒子系统","合并多个粒子系统用于高级 3D 渲染"],"ja":["データ視覚化のための複雑な粒子効果のシミュレーション","タスク要件に基づいてタスクを専用の粒子システムにルーティング","複数の粒子システムを組み合わせて高度な 3D レンダリングを行う"],"ko":["데이터 시각화를 위한 복잡한 粒子 효과의 시뮬레이션","태스크 요구 사항에 따라 태스크를専用 粒子 시스템에 라우팅","複数の 粒子 시스템을 結合하여 고급 3D 렌더링을 수행"],"es":["Simulación de efectos de partículas complejos para la visualización de datos","Enrutamiento de tareas a sistemas de partículas especializados en función de los requisitos de las tareas","Combinación de múltiples sistemas de partículas para un renderizado 3D avanzado"],"fr":["Simulation d''effets de particules complexes pour la visualisation de données","Acheminement de tâches vers des systèmes de particules spécialisés en fonction des exigences des tâches","Combinaison de plusieurs systèmes de particules pour un rendu 3D avancé"],"de":["Simulierung komplexer Partikeleffekte für die Datenvisualisierung","Weiterleitung von Aufgaben an spezialisierte Partikelsysteme basierend auf den Aufgabenanforderungen","Kombination mehrerer Partikelsysteme für ein erweitertes 3D-Rendering"],"pt":["Simulando efeitos de partículas complexos para visualização de dados","Encaminhando tarefas para sistemas de partículas especializados com base nos requisitos da tarefa","Combinando vários sistemas de partículas para renderização 3D avançada"],"ru":["Моделирование сложных эффектов частиц для визуализации данных","Направление задач к специализированным системам частиц на основе требований задачи","Объединение нескольких систем частиц для продвинутой 3D-рендеринга"],"ar":["محاكاة تأثيرات الجسيمات المعقدة للرؤية البيانية للبيانات","توجيه المهام إلى أنظمة الجسيمات المتخصصة بناءً على متطلبات المهمة","دمج عدة أنظمة الجسيمات للتصيير ثلاثي الأبعاد المتقدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ThreeJS library integration","Limited to 3D N-body simulation tasks"],"zh":["需要集成 ThreeJS 库","仅限 3D N-body 模拟任务"],"ja":["ThreeJS ライブラリの統合が必要","3D N-body シミュレーションタスクのみ"],"ko":["ThreeJS 라이브러리의 통합이 필요","3D N-body 시뮬레이션 태스크만"],"es":["Requiere integración de la biblioteca ThreeJS","Limitado a tareas de simulación de N-cuerpos 3D"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la bibliothèque ThreeJS","Limité aux tâches de simulation de corps N 3D"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der ThreeJS-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf 3D-N-Körper-Simulationsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer integração da biblioteca ThreeJS","Limitado a tarefas de simulação 3D N-corpos"],"ru":["Требует интеграции библиотеки ThreeJS","Ограничен задачами симуляции 3D-системы N-тел"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مكتبة ThreeJS","محدود بمهام محاكاة 3D N-جسم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
