эффектов","Гибкая архитектура рендеринга","Поддержка нескольких камер","Интеграция с React Three Fiber"],"ar":["محاكاة 3D ثلاثية الأبعاد تعتمد على ThreeJS","إنشاء تأثيرات بصرية مخصصة","هندسة رندر مرنة","دعم لكاميرات متعددة","التكامل مع React Three Fiber"]},"keywords":{"zh":["三维仿真","后处理效果","ThreeJS","React","多相机支持","自定义渲染管道"],"ja":["3Dシミュレーション","ポストプロセッシング","ThreeJS","React","マルチカメラ対応","カスタムレンダリングパイプライン"],"ko":["3D 시뮬레이션","후처리 효과","ThreeJS","React","멀티 카메라 지원","커스텀 렌더링 파이프라인"],"es":["simulador 3D","N-cuerpos","ThreeJS","post-procesamiento","efectos visuales","React","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","tecnologías de vanguardia"],"fr":["simulateur 3D","N-corps","ThreeJS","post-traitement","effets visuels","React","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","technologies de pointe"],"de":["3D-Simulator","N-Körper","ThreeJS","Post-Bearbeitung","visuelle Effekte","React","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","Spitzen-Technologien"],"pt":["simulação 3D","ThreeJS","efeitos visuais","renderização","React Three Fiber","desenvolvimento de jogos","realidade virtual"],"ru":["симуляция 3D","ThreeJS","визуальные эффекты","рендеринг","React Three Fiber","разработка игр","виртуальная реальность"],"ar":["محاكاة 3D","ThreeJS","تأثيرات بصرية","رندر","React Three Fiber","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي"]}},"owner":"tanepiper","repo":"teskooano","repoPath":"tanepiper/teskooano","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"postfx-composer","description":"EffectComposer setup and architecture for Three.js post-processing pipelines. Use when setting up multi-pass rendering, combining effects, creating custom passes, managing render targets, or building reusable effect stacks. Foundation skill for all post-processing work.","bodyPreview":"# Post-Processing Composer\n\nEffectComposer architecture, render pipelines, and custom pass creation.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install @react-three/postprocessing postprocessing three\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { Canvas } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport { EffectComposer, Bloom, Vignette } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Scene />\n      <EffectComposer>\n        <Bloom intensity={1} />\n        <Vignette darkness={0.5} />\n      </EffectComposer>","body":"# Post-Processing Composer\n\nEffectComposer architecture, render pipelines, and custom pass creation.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install @react-three/postprocessing postprocessing three\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { Canvas } from \"@react-three/fiber\";\nimport { EffectComposer, Bloom, Vignette } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Scene />\n      <EffectComposer>\n        <Bloom intensity={1} />\n        <Vignette darkness={0.5} />\n      </EffectComposer>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Render Pipeline Flow\n\n```\nScene Render → EffectComposer → Effect 1 → Effect 2 → ... → Screen\n                    ↓\n              [Render Target A]  →  [Render Target B]  →  [Screen]\n```\n\n### EffectComposer Configuration\n\n```tsx\nimport { EffectComposer } from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\nimport { HalfFloatType } from \"three\";\n\nfunction PostProcessing() {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer\n      enabled={true}\n      depthBuffer={true}\n      stencilBuffer={false}\n      multisampling={8}\n      frameBufferType={HalfFloatType}\n    >\n      {/* Effects processed in order */}\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Effect Ordering\n\n### Recommended Order\n\n```tsx\n<EffectComposer>\n  {/* 1. Scene modification (needs scene data) */}\n  <SSAO />\n  <DepthOfField />\n\n  {/* 2. Lighting/color effects */}\n  <Bloom />\n  <ToneMapping />\n\n  {/* 3. Color grading */}\n  <HueSaturation />\n  <BrightnessContrast />\n  <LUT />\n\n  {/* 4. Screen-space effects */}\n  <ChromaticAberration />\n  <Vignette />\n\n  {/* 5. Noise/grain (always last) */}\n  <Noise />\n</EffectComposer>\n```\n\n### Why Order Matters\n\n```tsx\n// WRONG: Bloom after color grading reduces glow\n<EffectComposer>\n  <HueSaturation saturation={-0.5} />\n  <Bloom intensity={2} />\n</EffectComposer>\n\n// CORRECT: Bloom before color grading\n<EffectComposer>\n  <Bloom intensity={2} />\n  <HueSaturation saturation={-0.5} />\n</EffectComposer>\n```\n\n## Conditional Effects\n\n### Toggle Effects at Runtime\n\n```tsx\nfunction DynamicEffects({ enableBloom, enableDOF }) {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      {enableBloom && <Bloom luminanceThreshold={0.2} intensity={1.5} />}\n      {enableDOF && <DepthOfField focusDistance={0.02} focalLength={0.05} />}\n      <Vignette darkness={0.4} />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Effect Presets\n\n```tsx\nconst PRESETS = {\n  cinematic: {\n    bloom: { intensity: 0.8, threshold: 0.3 },\n    vignette: { darkness: 0.5, offset: 0.3 },\n    grain: { opacity: 0.03 },\n  },\n  scifi: {\n    bloom: { intensity: 2.0, threshold: 0.1 },\n    chromatic: { offset: [0.003, 0.003] },\n    vignette: { darkness: 0.6, offset: 0.2 },\n  },\n  minimal: { vignette: { darkness: 0.3, offset: 0.4 } },\n};\n\nfunction PresetEffects({ preset = \"cinematic\" }) {\n  const config = PRESETS[preset];\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer>\n      {config.bloom && <Bloom {...config.bloom} />}\n      {config.chromatic && (\n        <ChromaticAberration offset={config.chromatic.offset} />\n      )}\n      {config.vignette && <Vignette {...config.vignette} />}\n      {config.grain && <Noise {...config.grain} />}\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Custom Effects\n\n### Basic Custom Effect\n\n```tsx\nimport { Effect } from \"postprocessing\";\nimport { Uniform } from \"three\";\nimport { forwardRef, useMemo } from \"react\";\n\nclass ColorShiftEffect extends Effect {\n  constructor({ shift = 0.0 }) {\n    super(\n      \"ColorShiftEffect\",\n      /* glsl */ `\n      uniform float shift;\n\n      void mainImage(const in vec4 inputColor, const in vec2 uv, out vec4 outputColor) {\n        vec3 color = inputColor.rgb;\n        float hueShift = shift * uv.x;\n        color.r = color.r * cos(hueShift) - color.g * sin(hueShift);\n        color.g = color.r * sin(hueShift) + color.g * cos(hueShift);\n        outputColor = vec4(color, inputColor.a);\n      }\n    `,\n      {\n        uniforms: new Map([[\"shift\", new Uniform(shift)]]),\n      },\n    );\n  }\n\n  set shift(value) {\n    this.uniforms.get(\"shift\").value = value;\n  }\n}\n\nconst ColorShift = forwardRef(({ shift = 0 }, ref) => {\n  const effect = useMemo(() => new ColorShiftEffect({ shift }), []);\n  useEffect(() => {\n    effect.shift = shift;\n  }, [shift, effect]);\n  return <primitive ref={ref} object={effect} />;\n});\n```\n\n### Custom Effect with Time\n\n```tsx\nclass PulseEffect extends Effect {\n  constructor() {\n    super(\n      \"PulseEffect\",\n      /* glsl */ `\n      uniform float uTime;\n      uniform float uIntensity;\n\n      void mainImage(const in vec4 inputColor, const in vec2 uv, out vec4 outputColor) {\n        float pulse = sin(uTime * 2.0) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n        float vignette = 1.0 - length(uv - 0.5) * pulse * uIntensity;\n        outputColor = vec4(inputColor.rgb * vignette, inputColor.a);\n      }\n    `,\n      {\n        uniforms: new Map([\n          [\"uTime\", new Uniform(0)],\n          [\"uIntensity\", new Uniform(0.5)],\n        ]),\n      },\n    );\n  }\n\n  update(renderer, inputBuffer, deltaTime) {\n    this.uniforms.get(\"uTime\").value += deltaTime;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Render Targets\n\n### Manual Render Target Management\n\n```tsx\nimport { useFBO } from \"@react-three/drei\";\n\nfunction CustomRenderPipeline() {\n  const { gl, scene, camera } = useThree();\n  const targetA = useFBO({ width: 1024, height: 1024 });\n\n  useFrame(() => {\n    gl.setRenderTarget(targetA);\n    gl.render(scene, camera);\n    gl.setRenderTarget(null);\n    gl.render(scene, camera);\n  });\n\n  return null;\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Patterns\n\n### Resolution Scaling\n\n```tsx\nfunction ScaledEffects() {\n  const { size } = useThree();\n  const scale = 0.5;\n\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer frameBufferType={HalfFloatType} multisampling={0}>\n      <Bloom\n        intensity={1.5}\n        width={size.width * scale}\n        height={size.height * scale}\n      />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Adaptive Quality\n\n```tsx\nimport { useDetectGPU } from \"@react-three/drei\";\n\nfunction AdaptiveQuality() {\n  const { tier } = useDetectGPU();\n\n  const quality = useMemo(() => {\n    if (tier >= 3) return { multisampling: 8, bloomLevels: 8 };\n    if (tier >= 2) return { multisampling: 4, bloomLevels: 5 };\n    return { multisampling: 0, bloomLevels: 3 };\n  }, [tier]);\n\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer multisampling={quality.multisampling}>\n      <Bloom levels={quality.bloomLevels} />\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Temporal Collapse Setup\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  EffectComposer,\n  Bloom,\n  ChromaticAberration,\n  Vignette,\n  Noise,\n  ToneMapping,\n} from \"@react-three/postprocessing\";\nimport { ToneMappingMode, BlendFunction } from \"postprocessing\";\nimport { HalfFloatType } from \"three\";\n\nfunction TemporalCollapseComposer({ children }) {\n  return (\n    <EffectComposer multisampling={4} frameBufferType={HalfFloatType}>\n      <ToneMapping mode={ToneMappingMode.ACES_FILMIC} />\n      <Bloom\n        luminanceThreshold={0.15}\n        luminanceSmoothing={0.9}\n        intensity={2.0}\n        radius={0.85}\n        mipmapBlur\n      />\n      <ChromaticAberration\n        offset={[0.002, 0.001]}\n        radialModulation\n        modulationOffset={0.3}\n      />\n      <Vignette darkness={0.6} offset={0.25} />\n      <Noise opacity={0.025} blendFunction={BlendFunction.OVERLAY} />\n      {children}\n    </EffectComposer>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Reference\n\n- See `postfx-bloom` for bloom-specific techniques\n- See `postfx-effects` for individual effect configurations\n- See `shaders-glsl` for writing custom effect shaders\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:52:49.214Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual AI Agents requiring advanced 3D rendering and post-processing capabilities with ThreeJS","zh":"适用于需要高级 3D 渲染和后期处理能力的视觉 AI 代理，支持 ThreeJS","ja":"ThreeJS を使用した高度な 3D レンダリングとポストプロセッシング機能を必要とするビジュアル AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"ThreeJS를 사용한 고급 3D 렌더링 및 후처리 기능을 필요로 하는 시각적 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA visuales que requieren capacidades de renderizado 3D avanzadas y posprocesamiento con ThreeJS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA visuels nécessitant des capacités de rendu 3D avancées et de post-traitement avec ThreeJS","de":"Ideal für visuelle KI-Agents, die erweiterte 3D-Rendering- und Postprocessing-Funktionen mit ThreeJS benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Visuais que exigem renderização 3D avançada e capacidades de pós-processamento com ThreeJS","ru":"Идеально подходит для визуальных агентов ИИ, требующих продвинутой 3D-рендеринга и возможностей постобработки с ThreeJS","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المرئية الذين يتطلبون تقديم 3D متقدم وقدرات المعالجة بعد الإنتاج مع ThreeJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create stunning visual effects using EffectComposer architecture, custom render pipelines, and ThreeJS, enabling the integration of post-processing techniques like Bloom and Vignette into their 3D simulations","zh":"赋予代理创建惊人的视觉效果的能力，使用 EffectComposer 架构、自定义渲染管线和 ThreeJS，实现将 Bloom 和 Vignette 等后期处理技术集成到他们的 3D 模拟中","ja":"EffectComposer アーキテクチャ、カスタムレンダーパイプライン、ThreeJS を使用して、代理が驚異的な視覚効果を作成できるようにします。Bloom や Vignette などのポストプロセッシング技術を 3D シミュレーションに統合できるようにします","ko":"에이전트가 효과적인 EffectComposer 아키텍처, 사용자 정의 렌더링 파이프라인 및 ThreeJS를 사용하여惊人的 시각적 효과를 만들 수 있도록 합니다. Bloom 및 Vignette와 같은 후처리 기술을 3D 시뮬레이션에 통합할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear efectos visuales impresionantes utilizando la arquitectura EffectComposer, tuberías de renderizado personalizadas y ThreeJS, lo que permite la integración de técnicas de posprocesamiento como Bloom y Vignette en sus simulaciones 3D","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des effets visuels époustouflants en utilisant l''architecture EffectComposer, des pipelines de rendu personnalisés et ThreeJS, permettant ainsi l''intégration de techniques de post-traitement comme Bloom et Vignette dans leurs simulations 3D","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, atemberaubende visuelle Effekte zu erstellen, indem sie die EffectComposer-Architektur, benutzerdefinierte Render-Pipelines und ThreeJS verwenden, wodurch die Integration von Postprocessing-Techniken wie Bloom und Vignette in ihre 3D-Simulationen ermöglicht wird","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem efeitos visuais deslumbrantes usando a arquitetura EffectComposer, pipelines de renderização personalizados e ThreeJS, permitindo a integração de técnicas de pós-processamento como Bloom e Vignette em suas simulações 3D","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать потрясающие визуальные эффекты, используя архитектуру EffectComposer, пользовательские конвейеры рендеринга и ThreeJS, что позволяет интегрировать методы постобработки, такие как Bloom и Vignette, в их 3D-симуляции","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تأثيرات بصرية مذهلة باستخدام هندسة EffectComposer وخطوط أنابيب تحرير مخصصة و ThreeJS، وتمكين دمج تقنيات المعالجة بعد الإنتاج مثل Bloom و Vignette في محاكاتهم ثلاثية الأبعاد"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating immersive 3D environments with multi-camera support","Simulating complex N-body systems with custom pass creation","Enhancing visual fidelity with post-processing effects like Bloom and Vignette"],"zh":["创建支持多相机的沉浸式 3D 环境","使用自定义通行证创建复杂的 N 体系统模拟","使用 Bloom 和 Vignette 等后期处理效果增强视觉保真度"],"ja":["マルチカメラ対応の没入型 3D 環境を作成する","カスタムパスの作成を使用して複雑な N 体システムをシミュレートする","Bloom や Vignette などのポストプロセッシング効果を使用して視覚の保真度を高める"],"ko":["다중 카메라 지원을 가진 몰입형 3D 환경을 생성하는 것","사용자 정의 패스를 사용하여 복잡한 N-체계 시스템을 시뮬레이션하는 것","Bloom 및 Vignette와 같은 후처리 효과를 사용하여 시각적忠实도를 향상