o-testingは、高パフォーマンスのRustルールエンジンです。並列テストとベンチマークテストに対応しています。","ko":"ordo-testing은 높은 성능의 Rust 규칙 엔진으로, 병렬 테스트 및 벤치마킹을 지원하여 효율적인 Rust 애플리케이션 개발을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Ordo Testing es un motor de reglas de alto rendimiento construido en Rust, ideal para pruebas y benchmarking","fr":"Ordo Testing est un moteur de règles haute performance construit en Rust, idéal pour les tests et le benchmarking","de":"Ordo-Testing ist eine Hochleistungs-Regelmaschine in Rust, ideal für Tests und Benchmarking","pt":"O Ordo Testing é um motor de regras de alto desempenho construído em Rust, projetado para testes e benchmarking de alta performance","ru":"Ordo Testing - это высокопроизводительный движок правил, построенный на Rust, предназначенный для тестирования и бенчмаркинга","ar":"أورديو تيستينج هو محرك قواعد أداء عالي مبني على رست، مصمم للاختبار وتحسين الأداء","en":"A high-performance rule engine built in Rust"},"definition":{"en":"A high-performance rule engine built in Rust"},"features":{"zh":["高性能规则引擎","并行测试支持","benchmarking支持","Rust语言开发","高效的测试框架"],"ja":["高パフォーマンスのルールエンジン","並列テストに対応","ベンチマークテストに対応","Rust言語で開発","効率的なテストフレームワーク"],"ko":["높은 성능의 규칙 엔진","병렬 테스트 지원","벤치마킹 지원","Rust 언어 개발","효율적인 테스트 프레임워크"],"es":["Motor de reglas de alto rendimiento","Construido en Rust","Pruebas unitarias y de integración","Benchmarking de reglas","Soporte para pruebas paralelas","Integración con Cargo"],"fr":["Moteur de règles haute performance","Construit en Rust","Tests unitaires et d''intégration","Benchmarking de règles","Prise en charge des tests parallèles","Intégration avec Cargo"],"de":["Hochleistungs-Regelmaschine","In Rust entwickelt","Einheitliche und Integrations-tests","Benchmarking von Regeln","Unterstützung für parallele Tests","Integration mit Cargo"],"pt":["Motor de regras de alto desempenho","Testes unitários e de integração","Suporte a paralelismo","Integração com Cargo","Exemplos de testes em Rust"],"ru":["Высокопроизводительный движок правил","Юнит-тесты и интеграционные тесты","Параллельное выполнение","Интеграция с Cargo","Примеры тестов на Rust"],"ar":["محرك قواعد أداء عالي","اختبارات الوحدة واختبارات التكامل","دعم التشارك","التكامل مع كارجو","أمثلة للاختبارات في رست"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ordo-testing","Rust规则引擎","高性能规则引擎","并行测试","benchmarking","Rust开发"],"ja":["ordo-testing","Rustルールエンジン","高パフォーマンスのルールエンジン","並列テスト","ベンチマークテスト","Rust開発"],"ko":["ordo-testing","Rust 규칙 엔진","높은 성능의 규칙 엔진","병렬 테스트","벤치마킹","Rust 개발"],"es":["Ordo Testing","motor de reglas","Rust","pruebas unitarias","benchmarking","reglas de negocio","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["Ordo Testing","moteur de règles","Rust","tests unitaires","benchmarking","règles métier","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Ordo-Testing","Regelmaschine","Rust","Einheitliche Tests","Benchmarking","Geschäftsregeln","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["Ordo Testing","Rust","Testes unitários","Benchmarking","Desempenho","Motor de regras","Paralelismo","Cargo","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Ordo Testing","Rust","Юнит-тесты","Бенчмаркинг","Производительность","Движок правил","Параллельное выполнение","Cargo","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أورديو تيستينج","رست","اختبارات الوحدة","تحسين الأداء","أداء","محرك قواعد","التشارك","كارجو","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Pama-Lee","repo":"Ordo","repoPath":"Pama-Lee/Ordo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ordo-testing","description":"Ordo testing and benchmarking guide. Includes unit tests, integration tests, Criterion benchmarks, k6 load tests, CI configuration. Use for writing tests, performance analysis, continuous integration.","bodyPreview":"# Ordo Testing and Benchmarking\n\n## Unit Tests\n\n### Running Tests\n\n```bash\n# Run all tests\ncargo test\n\n# Run specific crate\ncargo test --package ordo-core\ncargo test --package ordo-server\n\n# Run specific test\ncargo test test_full_workflow\n\n# Show output\ncargo test -- --nocapture\n\n# Parallel control\ncargo test -- --test-threads=4\n```\n\n### Test Example\n\n```rust\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n    use ordo_core::prelude::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn test_rule_execution() {\n        let mut rule","body":"# Ordo Testing and Benchmarking\n\n## Unit Tests\n\n### Running Tests\n\n```bash\n# Run all tests\ncargo test\n\n# Run specific crate\ncargo test --package ordo-core\ncargo test --package ordo-server\n\n# Run specific test\ncargo test test_full_workflow\n\n# Show output\ncargo test -- --nocapture\n\n# Parallel control\ncargo test -- --test-threads=4\n```\n\n### Test Example\n\n```rust\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n    use ordo_core::prelude::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn test_rule_execution() {\n        let mut ruleset = RuleSet::new(\"test\", \"start\");\n        \n        ruleset.add_step(\n            Step::decision(\"start\", \"Start\")\n                .branch(Condition::from_string(\"value > 10\"), \"high\")\n                .default(\"low\")\n                .build()\n        );\n        \n        ruleset.add_step(Step::terminal(\"high\", \"High\", \n            TerminalResult::new(\"HIGH\")));\n        ruleset.add_step(Step::terminal(\"low\", \"Low\", \n            TerminalResult::new(\"LOW\")));\n\n        let executor = RuleExecutor::new();\n        \n        // Test high value\n        let input: Value = serde_json::from_str(r#\"{\"value\": 20}\"#).unwrap();\n        let result = executor.execute(&ruleset, input).unwrap();\n        assert_eq!(result.code, \"HIGH\");\n        \n        // Test low value\n        let input: Value = serde_json::from_str(r#\"{\"value\": 5}\"#).unwrap();\n        let result = executor.execute(&ruleset, input).unwrap();\n        assert_eq!(result.code, \"LOW\");\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn test_expression_eval() {\n        let evaluator = Evaluator::new();\n        let parser = ExprParser::new();\n        \n        let expr = parser.parse(\"age >= 18 && status == \\\"active\\\"\").unwrap();\n        let ctx = Context::from_json(r#\"{\"age\": 25, \"status\": \"active\"}\"#).unwrap();\n        let result = evaluator.eval(&expr, &ctx).unwrap();\n        \n        assert_eq!(result, Value::Bool(true));\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Tests\n\n### gRPC Tests\n\n```bash\ncargo test --package ordo-server --test grpc_test\n```\n\n### UDS Tests\n\n```bash\ncargo test --package ordo-server --test uds_test\n```\n\n## Benchmarks\n\n### Running Criterion Benchmarks\n\n```bash\n# All benchmarks\ncargo bench --package ordo-core\n\n# Specific benchmarks\ncargo bench --package ordo-core --bench engine_bench\ncargo bench --package ordo-core --bench jit_comparison_bench\ncargo bench --package ordo-core --bench schema_jit_bench\ncargo bench --package ordo-core --bench optimization_bench\n```\n\n### Benchmark Files\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `engine_bench.rs` | Overall engine performance |\n| `jit_comparison_bench.rs` | JIT vs interpreter comparison |\n| `jit_realistic_bench.rs` | Realistic JIT scenarios |\n| `jit_stress_bench.rs` | JIT stress testing |\n| `schema_jit_bench.rs` | Schema JIT performance |\n| `optimization_bench.rs` | Optimization effectiveness |\n\n### Writing Benchmarks\n\n```rust\nuse criterion::{black_box, criterion_group, criterion_main, Criterion};\nuse ordo_core::prelude::*;\n\nfn bench_rule_execution(c: &mut Criterion) {\n    let mut ruleset = RuleSet::new(\"bench\", \"start\");\n    // ... setup rules\n    \n    let executor = RuleExecutor::new();\n    let input: Value = serde_json::from_str(r#\"{\"value\": 100}\"#).unwrap();\n    \n    c.bench_function(\"rule_execution\", |b| {\n        b.iter(|| {\n            executor.execute(&ruleset, black_box(input.clone()))\n        })\n    });\n}\n\ncriterion_group!(benches, bench_rule_execution);\ncriterion_main!(benches);\n```\n\n## k6 Load Testing\n\n### Running Load Tests\n\n```bash\n# Basic test\n./scripts/benchmark.sh\n\n# Custom parameters\n./scripts/benchmark.sh \\\n    -h localhost \\\n    -p 8080 \\\n    -d 60s \\\n    -u 50 \\\n    -r 500 \\\n    --rule order_discount \\\n    --analyze\n```\n\n### Parameter Reference\n\n| Parameter | Description | Default |\n|-----------|-------------|---------|\n| `-h, --host` | Server address | localhost |\n| `-p, --port` | Port | 8080 |\n| `-d, --duration` | Test duration | 30s |\n| `-u, --vus` | Virtual users | 10 |\n| `-r, --rps` | Target RPS | 100 |\n| `--rule` | Rule name to test | order_discount |\n| `--analyze` | Show CPU analysis | false |\n\n### Custom k6 Script\n\n```javascript\nimport http from ''k6/http'';\nimport { check } from ''k6'';\n\nexport const options = {\n    scenarios: {\n        constant_load: {\n            executor: ''constant-arrival-rate'',\n            rate: 100,\n            timeUnit: ''1s'',\n            duration: ''30s'',\n            preAllocatedVUs: 10,\n        },\n    },\n    thresholds: {\n        http_req_duration: [''p(95)<500'', ''p(99)<1000''],\n    },\n};\n\nexport default function() {\n    const url = ''http://localhost:8080/api/v1/execute/my-rule'';\n    const payload = JSON.stringify({\n        input: { value: Math.random() * 1000 }\n    });\n    \n    const response = http.post(url, payload, {\n        headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n    });\n    \n    check(response, {\n        ''status is 200'': (r) => r.status === 200,\n        ''response time < 100ms'': (r) => r.timings.duration < 100,\n    });\n}\n```\n\n## CI Configuration\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\nKey workflow file: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`\n\n```yaml\n# Test job\ntest:\n  runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n  strategy:\n    matrix:\n      os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]\n      rust: [stable, beta]\n  steps:\n    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n    - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@master\n      with:\n        toolchain: ${{ matrix.rust }}\n    - run: cargo test --all-features\n```\n\n### Local CI Simulation\n\n```bash\n# Format check\ncargo fmt --all -- --check\n\n# Clippy check\ncargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings\n\n# Test\ncargo test --all-features\n\n# Build\ncargo build --release\n```\n\n## Test Coverage\n\n```bash\n# Install tarpaulin\ncargo install cargo-tarpaulin\n\n# Generate coverage report\ncargo tarpaulin --out Html --output-dir coverage/\n\n# Or use llvm-cov\ncargo install cargo-llvm-cov\ncargo llvm-cov --html\n```\n\n## Frontend Testing\n\n```bash\ncd ordo-editor\n\n# Run tests\npnpm test\n\n# Run specific package tests\npnpm --filter @ordo-engine/editor-core test\n```\n\n## Key Files\n\n- `crates/ordo-core/benches/` - Rust benchmarks\n- `crates/ordo-server/tests/` - Server integration tests\n- `scripts/benchmark.sh` - k6 load test script\n- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` - CI configuration\n- `ordo-editor/packages/core/src/engine/__tests__/` - Frontend tests\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:53:06.321Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust-based AI Agents needing high-performance rule engine capabilities for efficient testing and benchmarking.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能规则引擎功能的Rust-based AI代理，用于高效测试和基准测试。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントに最適で、高パフォーマンスのルールエンジン機能を必要とする効率的なテストとベンチマークテストに使用する。","ko":"고성능 규칙 엔진 기능이 필요한 Rust 기반 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며 효율적인 테스트 및 벤치마크 테스트에 사용된다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Rust que necesitan capacidades de motor de reglas de alto rendimiento para pruebas y benchmarking eficientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Rust nécessitant des capacités de moteur de règles haute performance pour des tests et un benchmarking efficaces.","de":"Perfekt für auf Rust basierende KI-Agents, die hochleistungsstarke Regelmotoren für effizientes Testen und Benchmarking benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA baseados em Rust que precisam de capacidades de mecanismo de regras de alto desempenho para testes e benchmarking eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Rust, которым необходимы возможности высокопроизводительного движка правил для эффективного тестирования и бенчмаркинга.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى روست الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات محرك قواعد أداء عالٍ لاختبارات واختبار الأداء الفعالين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Cargo for running unit tests, executing specific test cases, and controlling parallel test threads, utilizing Rust''s performance capabilities for ordo-core and ordo-server crates.","zh":"赋予代理使用Cargo运行单元测试、执行特定测试用例以及控制并行测试线程的能力，利用Rust的性能能力为ordo-core和ordo-servercrate提供支持。","ja":"エージェントにCargoを使用してユニットテストを実行し、特定のテストケースを実行し、並列テストスレッドを制御する機能を提供し、Rustのパフォーマンス機能を使用してordo-coreとordo-serverクレートを活用する。","ko":"에이전트에게 Cargo를 사용하여 유닛 테스트를 실행하고 특정 테스트 케이스를 실행하고 병렬 테스트 스레드를 제어하는 기능을 제공하며, Rust의 성능 기능을 사용하여 ordo-core와 ordo-server 크레이트를 활용한다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar Cargo para ejecutar pruebas unitarias, ejecutar casos de prueba específicos y controlar hilos de prueba paralelos, aprovechando las capacidades de rendimiento de Rust para los crates ordo-core y ordo-server.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser Cargo pour exécuter des tests unitaires, exécuter des cas de test spécifiques et contrôler des threads de test parallèles, en exploitant les capacités de performance de Rust pour les crates ordo-core et ordo-server.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Cargo zu nutzen, um Einheitstests auszuführen, spezifische Testfälle auszuführen und parallele Testthreads zu kontrollieren, wobei die Leistungsfähigkeiten von Rust für die ordo-core- und ordo-server-Crates genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o Cargo para executar testes unitários, executar casos de teste específicos e controlar threads de teste paralelos, utilizando as capacidades de desempenho do Rust para os crates ordo-core e ordo-server.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать Cargo для запуска юнит-тестов, выполнения конкретных тестовых случаев и управления параллельными потоками тестирования, используя возможности Rust по производительности для крейтов ordo-core и ordo-server.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الاستفادة من Cargo لتشغيل الاختبارات الوحدوية وتنفيذ حالات اختبار معينة ومراقبة threads الاختبار المتوازي، مع استخدام إمكانيات أداء روست للعلب ordo-core و ordo-server."},"useCases":{"en":["Running comprehensive unit tests with Cargo","Benchmarking ordo-core and ordo-server performance","Executing specific test cases like test_full_workflow"],"zh":["使用Cargo运行综合单元测试","基准测试ordo-core和ordo-server性能","执行特定测试用例，如test_full_workflow"],"ja":["Cargoを使用して包括的なユニットテストを実行する","ordo-coreとordo-serverのパフォーマンスをベンチマークテストする","特定のテストケースを実行する、たとえばtest_full_workflow"],"ko":["Cargo를 사용하여 포괄적인 유닛 테스트를 실행한다","ordo-core와 ordo-server의 성능을 벤치마크 테스트한다","특정 테스트 케이스를 실행한다, 예를 들어 test_full_workflow"],"es":["Ejecutar pruebas unitarias completas con Cargo","Realizar benchmarking del rendimiento de ordo-core y ordo-server","Ejecutar casos de prueba específicos como test_full_workflow"],"fr":["Exécuter des tests unitaires complets avec Cargo","Effectuer un benchmarking des performances de ordo-core et ordo-server","Exécuter des cas de test spécifiques comme test_full_workflow"],"de":["Umfangreiche Einheitstests mit Cargo ausführen","Leistungsbewertung von ordo-core und ordo-server durchführen","Spezifische Testfälle wie test_full_workflow ausführen"],"pt":["Executar testes unitários abrangentes com o Cargo","Benchmarcar o desempenho do ordo-core e ordo-server","Executar casos de teste específicos como test_full_workflow"],"ru":["Запуск комплексных юнит-тестов с помощью Cargo","Бенчмаркинг производительности ordo-core и ordo-server","Выполнение конкретных тестовых случаев, таких как test_full_workflow"],"ar":["تشغيل الاختبارات الوحدوية الشاملة مع Cargo","اختبار الأداء ل ordo-core و ordo-server","تنفيذ حالات اختبار معينة مثل test_full_workflow"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust and Cargo installation","Specific to ordo-testing and its crates (ordo-core, ordo-server)"],"zh":["需要安装Rust和Cargo","仅限于ordo-testing及其crate（ordo-core、ordo-server）"],"ja":["RustとCargoのインストールが必要","ordo-testingとそのクレート（ordo-core、ordo-server）に限定される"],"ko":["Rust와 Cargo의 설치가 필요하다","ordo-testing及其 크레이트（ordo-core、ordo-server）에만 국한된다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Rust y Cargo","Específico para ordo-testing y sus crates (ordo-core, ordo-server)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Rust et Cargo","Spécifique à ordo-testing et ses crates (ordo-core, ordo-server)"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Rust und Cargo","Spezifisch für ordo-testing und seine Crates (ordo-core, ordo-server)"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Rust e do Cargo","Específico para ordo-testing e seus crates (ordo-core, ordo-server)"],"ru":["Требуется установка Rust и Cargo","Ограничен для ordo-testing и его крейтов (ordo-core, ordo-server)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت روست و Cargo","محدد ل ordo-testing و علبه (ordo-core و ordo-server)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
