ntas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Flux de travail déterministes","Tolérance aux défaillances","Interactivité","Évolutivité","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Deterministische Arbeitsabläufe","Fehlertoleranz","Interaktivität","Skalierbarkeit","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Fluxo de trabalho determinístico","UX conversacional tolerante a falhas","Interação com issues e commits","Execução de qualidade e testes","Atualização de status de issues"],"ru":["Определенный рабочий процесс","Устойчивый к ошибкам разговорный UX","Взаимодействие с задачами и коммитами","Выполнение проверок качества и тестов","Обновление статуса задач"],"ar":["تدفق عمل محدد","واجهة مستخدم محادثاتية مقاومة للأخطاء","التفاعل مع المهام والالتزامات","تنفيذ فحص الجودة والاختبارات","تحديث حالة المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Landing the Plane","工作流构建","确定性工作流","交互式工作流","容错","对话式用户体验","质量门","自动化测试","代码更新","版本控制"],"ja":["ランディング・ザ・プレーン","ワークフローの構築","決定的なワークフロー","インタラクティブなワークフロー","障害耐性","会話型ユーザーエクスペリエンス","品質ゲート","自動テスト","コード更新","バージョン管理"],"ko":["랜딩 더 플레인","워크플로우 구축","결정적 워크플로우","상호작용 워크플로우","장애 내성","대화형 사용자 경험","품질 게이트","자동 테스트","코드 업데이트","버전 관리"],"es":["landing the plane","framework","flujos de trabajo","deterministas","tolerantes a fallos","interactividad","escalabilidad","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["landing the plane","cadre","flux de travail","déterministes","tolérants aux défaillances","interactivité","évolutivité","développement de logiciels"],"de":["landing the plane","framework","arbeitsabläufe","deterministisch","fehlertolerant","interaktivität","skalierbarkeit","softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho determinístico","ux conversacional","tolerante a falhas","issues e commits","qualidade e testes","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["определенный рабочий процесс","разговорный ux","устойчивый к ошибкам","задачи и коммиты","проверка качества и тесты","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تدفق عمل محدد","واجهة مستخدم محادثاتية","مقاومة للأخطاء","المهام والالتزامات","فحص الجودة والاختبارات","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"radiantlogicinc","repo":"fastworkflow","repoPath":"radiantlogicinc/fastworkflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"landing-the-plane","description":"Completes work sessions by running quality gates, syncing bd, pushing to remote, and handing off. Use when ending a work session, landing the plane, session completion, or when the user asks to wrap up or finish work.","bodyPreview":"# Landing the Plane (Session Completion)\n\nWhen ending a work session, complete ALL steps below. Work is NOT complete until `git push` succeeds.\n\n## Mandatory workflow\n\n1. **File issues for remaining work** – Create issues (e.g. via `bd create`) for anything that needs follow-up.\n2. **Run quality gates** (if code changed) – Tests, linters, builds.\n3. **Update issue status** – Close finished work, update in-progress items (`bd close <id>`, `bd update <id> --status ...`).\n4. **PUSH TO REMOTE** – Ma","body":"# Landing the Plane (Session Completion)\n\nWhen ending a work session, complete ALL steps below. Work is NOT complete until `git push` succeeds.\n\n## Mandatory workflow\n\n1. **File issues for remaining work** – Create issues (e.g. via `bd create`) for anything that needs follow-up.\n2. **Run quality gates** (if code changed) – Tests, linters, builds.\n3. **Update issue status** – Close finished work, update in-progress items (`bd close <id>`, `bd update <id> --status ...`).\n4. **PUSH TO REMOTE** – Mandatory:\n   ```bash\n   git pull --rebase\n   bd sync\n   git push\n   git status   # MUST show \"up to date with origin\"\n   ```\n5. **Clean up** – Clear stashes, prune remote branches.\n6. **Verify** – All changes committed AND pushed.\n7. **Hand off** – Provide context for next session.\n\n## Critical rules\n\n- Activate the local Python environment before running scripts/tests.\n- Work is NOT complete until `git push` succeeds.\n- NEVER stop before pushing – that leaves work stranded locally.\n- NEVER say \"ready to push when you are\" – you must push.\n- If push fails, resolve and retry until it succeeds.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:53:13.887Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring structured workflow management with fault-tolerant conversational UX","zh":"适用于需要结构化工作流管理和容错对话式用户体验的 DevOps 代理的理想选择","ja":"構造化されたワークフロー管理とフォールトトレラントな会話型 UX を必要とする DevOps エージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 워크플로우 관리 및 오류 허용 대화형 UX가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren una gestión de flujo de trabajo estructurada con una experiencia de usuario conversacional con tolerancia a fallos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une gestion de flux de travail structurée avec une expérience utilisateur conversationnelle à tolérance de panne","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine strukturierte Workflow-Verwaltung mit einer fehlertoleranten konversationellen Benutzeroberfläche erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho estruturado com UX conversacional tolerante a falhas","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих структурированного управления рабочим процессом с устойчивой к сбоям разговорной UX","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديڤوبس الذي يتطلب إدارة تدفق عمل منظم مع واجهة مستخدم محادثات معادلة للخطأ"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage large-scale deterministic interactive workflows with mandatory quality gates, including running tests, linters, and builds via Git, and updating issue status with tools like `bd create` and `bd update`","zh":"赋予代理管理大规模确定性交互式工作流的能力，包括强制性质量门控，通过 Git 运行测试、linters 和构建，并使用 `bd create` 和 `bd update` 等工具更新问题状态","ja":"エージェントに、大規模な決定的なインタラクティブなワークフローを管理する能力を与え、強制的な品質ゲートを含み、Git を介してテスト、リンター、ビルドを実行し、`bd create` および `bd update` などのツールを使用して問題の状態を更新する","ko":"에이전트에 대규모 결정적 상호작용 워크플로를 관리하는 능력을 부여하며, 강제적인 품질 게이트를 포함하여 Git을 통해 테스트, 린터, 빌드를 실행하고 `bd create` 및 `bd update`와 같은 도구를 사용하여 문제 상태를 업데이트한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar flujos de trabajo interactivos deterministas a gran escala con puertas de calidad obligatorias, incluyendo la ejecución de pruebas, linters y compilaciones a través de Git, y la actualización del estado de los problemas con herramientas como `bd create` y `bd update`","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des flux de travail interactifs déterministes à grande échelle avec des portes de qualité obligatoires, notamment l''exécution de tests, de linters et de builds via Git, et la mise à jour du statut des problèmes avec des outils tels que `bd create` et `bd update`","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, große deterministische interaktive Workflows mit obligatorischen Qualitätsprüfungen zu verwalten, einschließlich Ausführung von Tests, Lintern und Builds über Git und Aktualisierung des Status von Problemen mit Tools wie `bd create` und `bd update`","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem fluxos de trabalho interativos determinísticos em grande escala com portais de qualidade obrigatórios, incluindo a execução de testes, lint e compilações via Git, e atualização do status da questão com ferramentas como `bd create` e `bd update`","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять большими масштабными детерминированными интерактивными рабочими процессами с обязательными воротами качества, включая запуск тестов, линтеров и сборок через Git, и обновление статуса проблемы с помощью инструментов seperti `bd create` и `bd update`","ar":"تمكن العميل من إدارة تدفقات عمل تفاعلية حتمية بمقياس كبير مع بوابات جودة إجبارية، بما في ذلك تشغيل الاختبارات، و لينتر، و المجمعات عبر جيت، وتحديث حالة القضية باستخدام أدوات مثل `bd create` و `bd update`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating session completion workflows","Generating issues for remaining work via `bd create`","Updating issue status with `bd close` and `bd update` commands"],"zh":["自动完成会话完成工作流","通过 `bd create` 生成剩余工作问题","使用 `bd close` 和 `bd update` 命令更新问题状态"],"ja":["セッション完了ワークフローを自動化する","`bd create` を使用して残りの作業の問題を生成する","`bd close` および `bd update` コマンドを使用して問題の状態を更新する"],"ko":["세션 완료 워크플ロー 자동화","`bd create`를 사용하여 남은 작업 문제 생성","`bd close` 및 `bd update` 명령을 사용하여 문제 상태 업데이트하기"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de finalización de sesiones","Generación de problemas para el trabajo restante a través de `bd create`","Actualización del estado de los problemas con los comandos `bd close` y `bd update`"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de fin de session","Génération de problèmes pour le travail restant via `bd create`","Mise à jour du statut des problèmes avec les commandes `bd close` et `bd update`"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sitzungsabschluss-Workflows","Erstellung von Problemen für die verbleibende Arbeit über `bd create`","Aktualisierung des Status von Problemen mit den Befehlen `bd close` und `bd update`"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de conclusão de sessão","Gerar problemas para o trabalho restante via `bd create`","Atualizar status do problema com comandos `bd close` e `bd update`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы завершения сеанса","Генерировать проблемы для оставшейся работы через `bd create`","Обновлять статус проблемы с помощью команд `bd close` и `bd update`"],"ar":["تأتمة تدفقات عمل إكمال الجلسة","توليد مشاكل للعمل المتبقي عبر `bd create`","تحديث حالة المشكلة باستخدام أوامر `bd close` و `bd update`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git for version control","Mandatory workflow steps must be followed for completion","Specifically designed for interactive workflows with a conversational UX"],"zh":["需要 Git 进行版本控制","必须按照强制工作流步骤才能完成","专门为具有对话式 UX 的交互式工作流设计"],"ja":["バージョン管理には Git が必要","完了するには強制ワークフローの手順に従う必要がある","会話型 UX を備えたインタラクティブなワークフロー専用に設計"],"ko":["버전 관리를 위해 Git이 필요","완료를 위해 강제 워크플로우 단계를 따라야 함","대화형 UX를 갖춘 상호작용 워크플로우専용으로 설계"],"es":["Requiere Git para el control de versiones","Los pasos de flujo de trabajo obligatorios deben seguirse para la finalización","Diseñado específicamente para flujos de trabajo interactivos con una experiencia de usuario conversacional"],"fr":["Nécessite Git pour le contrôle de version","Les étapes de flux de travail obligatoires doivent être suivies pour l''achèvement","Conçu spécifiquement pour les flux de travail interactifs avec une expérience utilisateur conversationnelle"],"de":["Benötigt Git für die Versionskontrolle","Die obligatorischen Workflow-Schritte müssen für die Fertigstellung befolgt werden","Speziell für interaktive Workflows mit einer konversationellen Benutzeroberfläche konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige Git para controle de versão","Etapes de fluxo de trabalho obrigatórias devem ser seguidas para conclusão","Especificamente projetado para fluxos de trabalho interativos com UX conversacional"],"ru":["Требует Git для контроля версий","Обязательные шаги рабочего процесса должны быть выполнены для завершения","Специально разработан для интерактивных рабочих процессов с разговорной UX"],"ar":["يتطلب جيت للسيطرة على الإصدار","يجب اتباع خطوات تدفق العمل الإجبارية لإكمالها","صمم خصيصا لتدفقات العمل التفاعلية مع واجهة المستخدم المحادثات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kweaver-ai/adp/bkn-modeling', 'community', 'kweaver-ai', 'adp', 'kweaver-ai/adp', 'bkn-modeling', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z', '2026-02-18T08:53:33.309Z', NULL, '{"id":"kweaver-ai/adp/bkn-modeling","name":"bkn-modeling","description":{"zh":"BKN建模是一种业务知识网络建模解决方案，用于简化数据复杂性和实现统一数据访问。它通过ontology、VEGA和DataFlow管道提供统一的数据管理","ja":"BKNモデリングは、ビジネス知識ネットワークモデリングソリューションであり、データの複雑さを簡素化し、統一されたデータアクセスを実現するために使用されます。これは、オントロジー、VEGA、DataFlowパイプラインを通じて統一されたデータ管理を提供します","ko":"BKN 모델링은 비즈니스 지식 네트워크 모델링 솔루션으로, 데이터 복잡성을 간소화하고 統一된 데이터 액세스를 달성하기 위해 사용됩니다. 이것은 온톨로지, VEGA 및 DataFlow 파이프라인을 통해 統一된 데이터 관리를 제공합니다","es":"El modelado BKN es una plataforma de datos inteligente que conecta fuentes de datos heterogéneas con agentes de IA. Proporciona acceso unificado a los datos y procesamiento de datos a través de DataFlow","fr":"La modélisation BKN est une plateforme de données intelligente qui relie les sources de données hétérogènes aux agents d''IA. Elle fournit un accès unifié aux données et un traitement de données via DataFlow","de":"Die BKN-Modellierung ist eine intelligente Datenplattform, die heterogene Datenquellen mit KI-Agents verbindet. Sie bietet einheitlichen Zugriff auf die Daten und Datenverarbeitung über DataFlow","pt":"A plataforma ADP é uma solução inteligente que conecta fontes de dados heterogêneas e agentes de IA, permitindo a modelagem de conhecimento empresarial com BKN.","ru":"Платформа ADP — это интеллектуальное решение, которое соединяет разнообразные источники данных и агентов ИИ, позволяя моделировать бизнес-знания с помощью BKN.","ar":"منصة ADP هي حل ذكي يربط مصادر البيانات المتفاوتة ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي، مما يسمح ببناء نموذج معرفة الأعمال مع BKN.","en":"ADP is an intelligent data platform that bridges the gap between heterogeneous data sources and AI agents. It abstracts data complexity through business knowledge networks (Ontology), provides unified data access (VEGA), and orchestrates data processing through DataFlow pipelines."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"BKN建模：业务知识网络建模解决方案","ja":"BKNモデリング：ビジネス知識ネットワークモデリングソリューション","ko":"BKN 모델링: 비즈니스 지식 네트워크 모델링 솔루션","es":"Modelado BKN: Plataforma de Datos Inteligente","fr":"Modélisation BKN : Plateforme de Données Intelligente","de":"BKN-Modellierung: Intelligente Datenplattform","pt":"Modelagem BKN: Plataforma de Dados Inteligente","ru":"BKN-моделирование: Интеллектуальная платформа данных","ar":"بناء نموذج BKN: منصة بيانات ذكية","en":"bkn-modeling"},"description":{"zh":"BKN建模是一种业务知识网络建模解决方案，用于简化数据复杂性和实现统一数据访问。它通过ontology、VEGA和DataFlow管道提供统一的数据管理","ja":"BKNモデリングは、ビジネス知識ネットワークモデリングソリューションであり、データの複雑さを簡素化し、統一されたデータアクセスを実現するために使用されます。これは、オントロジー、VEGA、DataFlowパイプラインを通じて統一されたデータ管理を提供します","ko":"BKN 모델링은 비즈니스 지식 네트워크 모델링 솔루션으로, 데이터 복잡성을 간소화하고 統一된 데이터 액세스를 달성하기 위해 사용됩니다. 이것은 온톨로지, VEGA 및 DataFlow 파이프라인을 통해 統一된 데이터 관리를 제공합니다","es":"El modelado BKN es una plataforma de datos inteligente que conecta fuentes de datos heterogéneas con agentes de IA. Proporciona acceso unificado a los datos ...","fr":"La modélisation BKN est une plateforme de données intelligente qui relie les sources de données hétérogènes aux agents d''IA. Elle fournit un accès unifié aux...","de":"Die BKN-Modellierung ist eine intelligente Datenplattform, die heterogene Datenquellen mit KI-Agents verbindet. Sie bietet einheitlichen Zugriff auf die Date...","pt":"A plataforma ADP é uma solução inteligente que conecta fontes de dados heterogêneas e agentes de IA, permitindo a modelagem de conhecimento empresarial com BKN.","ru":"Платформа ADP — это интеллектуальное решение, которое соединяет разнообразные источники данных и агентов ИИ, позволяя моделировать бизнес-знания с помощью BKN.","ar":"منصة ADP هي حل ذكي يربط مصادر البيانات المتفاوتة ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي، مما يسمح ببناء نموذج معرفة الأعمال مع BKN.","en":"ADP is an intelligent data platform that bridges the gap between heterogeneous data sources and AI agents. It abstracts data complexity through business know..."},"definition":{"en":"ADP is an intelligent data platform that bridges the gap between heterogeneous data sources and AI agents. It abstracts data complexity through business knowledge networks (Ontology), provides unified data access (VEGA), and orchestrates data processing through DataFlow pipelines."},"features":{"zh":["业务知识网络建模","统一数据访问","数据处理管道","ontology管理","VEGA支持"],"ja":["ビジネス知識ネットワークモデリング","統一されたデータアクセス","データ処理パイプライン","オントロジー管理","VEGAサポート"],"ko":["비즈니스 지식 네트워크 모델링","統一된 데이터 액세스","데이터 처리 파이프라인","온톨로지 관리","VEGA 지원"],"es":["Acceso unificado a los datos","Procesamiento de datos a través de DataFlow","Modelado de conocimiento empresarial","Soporte para fuentes de datos heterogéneas","Integración con agentes de IA"],"fr":["Accès unifié aux données","Traitement de données via DataFlow","Modélisation des connaissances métier","Prise en charge de sources de données hétérogènes","Intégration avec les agents d''IA"],"de":["Einheitlicher Zugriff auf die Daten","Datenverarbeitung über DataFlow","Modellierung von Geschäftswissen","Unterstützung für heterogene Datenquellen","Integration mit KI-Agents"],"pt":["Modelagem de conhecimento empresarial","Conexão de fontes de dados heterogêneas","Integração com agentes de IA","Criação de redes de conhecimento","Suporte a pipelines de processamento de dados"],"ru":["Моделирование бизнес-знаний","Соединение разнообразных источников данных","Интеграция с агентами ИИ","Создание сетей знаний","Поддержка конвейеров обработки данных"],"ar":["بناء نموذج معرفة الأعمال","ربط مصادر البيانات المتفاوتة","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء شبكات معرفة","دعم خطوط أنابيب معالجة البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["BKN建模","业务知识网络","数据管理","统一数据访问","ontology","VEGA","DataFlow"],"ja":["BKNモデリング","ビジネス知識ネットワーク","データ管理","統一されたデータアクセス","オントロジー","VEGA","DataFlow"],"ko":["BKN 모델링","비즈니스 지식 네트워크","데이터 관리","統一된 데이터 액세스","온톨로지","VEGA","DataFlow"],"es":["modelado BKN","plataforma de datos inteligente","acceso unificado a los datos","procesamiento de datos","DataFlow","conocimiento empresarial","agentes de IA"],"fr":["modélisation BKN","plateforme de données intelligente","accès unifié aux données","traitement de données","DataFlow","connaissances métier","agents d''IA"],"de":["BKN-Modellierung","intelligente Datenplattform","einheitlicher Zugriff auf die Daten","Datenverarbeitung","DataFlow","Geschäftswissen","KI-Agents"],"pt":["modelagem de conhecimento empresarial","plataforma de dados inteligente","conexão de fontes de dados","integração com agentes de IA","BKN","ADP","dados heterogêneos"],"ru":["моделирование бизнес-знаний","интеллектуальная платформа данных","соединение источников данных","интеграция с агентами ИИ","BKN","ADP","разнообразные данные"],"ar":["بناء نموذج معرفة الأعمال","منصة بيانات ذكية","ربط مصادر البيانات","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","BKN","ADP","بيانات متباينة"]}},"owner":"kweaver-ai","repo":"adp","repoPath":"kweaver-ai/adp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bkn-modeling","description":"编写和验证 BKN（业务知识网络）建模文件。用于创建实体类、关系类、行动类定义，或修改现有的 .bkn 文件。当用户提到业务知识网络、知识网络、BKN 文件时使用。","bodyPreview":"# BKN 业务知识网络建模\n\n辅助编写 BKN (Business Knowledge Network) 业务知识网络建模文件。\n\n## 快速开始\n\n### 创建新的知识网络\n\n1. 使用模板创建：`docs/ontology/bkn_docs/templates/network.bkn.template`\n2. 参考样例：`docs/ontology/bkn_docs/examples/k8s-topology.bkn`\n3. 查阅规范：`docs/ontology/bkn_docs/SPECIFICATION.md`\n\n### BKN 文件结构\n\n```markdown\n---\ntype: network\nid: my-network\nname: 我的网络\nversion: 1.0.0\n---\n\n# 网络标题\n\n## Entity: entity_id\n...\n\n## Relation: relation_id\n...\n\n## Action: action_id\n...\n```\n\n## 三种类型\n\n### 实体类 (Entity)\n\n描述业务对象，直接映射数据视图：\n\n```ma","body":"# BKN 业务知识网络建模\n\n辅助编写 BKN (Business Knowledge Network) 业务知识网络建模文件。\n\n## 快速开始\n\n### 创建新的知识网络\n\n1. 使用模板创建：`docs/ontology/bkn_docs/templates/network.bkn.template`\n2. 参考样例：`docs/ontology/bkn_docs/examples/k8s-topology.bkn`\n3. 查阅规范：`docs/ontology/bkn_docs/SPECIFICATION.md`\n\n### BKN 文件结构\n\n```markdown\n---\ntype: network\nid: my-network\nname: 我的网络\nversion: 1.0.0\n---\n\n# 网络标题\n\n## Entity: entity_id\n...\n\n## Relation: relation_id\n...\n\n## Action: action_id\n...\n```\n\n## 三种类型\n\n### 实体类 (Entity)\n\n描述业务对象，直接映射数据视图：\n\n```markdown\n## Entity: pod\n\n**Pod实例** - 描述\n\n### 数据来源\n\n| 类型 | ID |\n|------|-----|\n| data_view | view_id |\n\n> **主键**: `id` | **显示属性**: `pod_name`\n```\n\n**配置模式**:\n- **完全映射**: 只声明数据来源，自动继承所有字段\n- **属性覆盖**: 仅声明需要特殊配置的属性\n- **完整定义**: 完整声明所有属性（精细控制）\n\n### 关系类 (Relation)\n\n描述两个实体之间的关联：\n\n```markdown\n## Relation: pod_belongs_node\n\n**Pod属于节点**\n\n| 起点 | 终点 | 类型 |\n|------|------|------|\n| pod | node | direct |\n\n### 映射规则\n\n| 起点属性 | 终点属性 |\n|----------|----------|\n| pod_node_name | node_name |\n```\n\n### 行动类 (Action)\n\n描述可执行的操作：\n\n```markdown\n## Action: restart_pod\n\n**重启Pod**\n\n| 绑定实体 | 行动类型 |\n|----------|----------|\n| pod | modify |\n\n### 触发条件\n\n```yaml\nfield: pod_status\noperation: in\nvalue: [Unknown, Failed]\n`` `\n\n### 工具配置\n\n| 类型 | 工具ID |\n|------|--------|\n| tool | kubectl_delete_pod |\n\n### 参数绑定\n\n| 参数 | 来源 | 绑定 |\n|------|------|------|\n| pod | property | pod_name |\n```\n\n## 常用操作\n\n### 添加实体\n\n1. 在 `# 实体定义` section 下添加 `## Entity: {id}`\n2. 声明数据来源（必须）\n3. 声明主键和显示属性（必须）\n4. 可选：属性覆盖、逻辑属性\n\n### 添加关系\n\n1. 在 `# 关系定义` section 下添加 `## Relation: {id}`\n2. 声明起点、终点、类型（必须）\n3. 声明映射规则（必须）\n\n### 添加行动\n\n1. 在 `# 行动定义` section 下添加 `## Action: {id}`\n2. 声明绑定实体和行动类型（必须）\n3. 声明工具配置和参数绑定（必须）\n4. 可选：触发条件、调度配置\n\n## 增量导入\n\nBKN 支持动态增量导入，任何 `.bkn` 文件可直接导入到已有的知识网络。\n\n### 文件类型\n\n| type | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| `entity` | 单个实体，独立文件 |\n| `relation` | 单个关系，独立文件 |\n| `action` | 单个行动，独立文件 |\n| `fragment` | 混合片段，包含多个定义 |\n| `delete` | 删除标记 |\n\n### 导入行为\n\n- **ID 不存在**: 新增定义\n- **ID 已存在**: 更新定义（覆盖）\n- **type: delete**: 删除指定定义\n\n### 稳定性要求（重要）\n\n- **幂等**：同一文件重复导入，结果必须一致\n- **确定性**：同一批输入文件（不依赖目录遍历顺序）导入结果必须一致\n- **冲突处理**：同一个 `(network, type, id)` 在同一批次重复定义时，默认应 fail-fast（推荐）\n\n### 行动治理（重要）\n\n行动连接执行面（tool/mcp），建议遵循：\n\n- 导入不等于启用；启用/执行需要独立权限与审计\n- Action 文档中明确：触发、影响范围、权限与前置条件、回滚/失败策略\n\n### 新增实体示例\n\n创建独立文件 `deployment.bkn`:\n\n```markdown\n---\ntype: entity\nid: deployment\nname: Deployment\nnetwork: k8s-network\n---\n\n# Deployment\n\n## 数据来源\n\n| 类型 | ID |\n|------|-----|\n| data_view | deployment_view |\n\n> **主键**: `id` | **显示属性**: `deployment_name`\n```\n\n导入后自动添加到 `k8s-network`。\n\n## 命名规范\n\n| 类型 | 格式 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 网络 ID | snake_case | `k8s_topology` |\n| 实体 ID | snake_case | `pod`, `node` |\n| 关系 ID | snake_case | `pod_belongs_node` |\n| 行动 ID | snake_case | `restart_pod` |\n\n## 验证清单\n\n编写完成后检查：\n\n- [ ] Frontmatter 包含 type, id, name, version\n- [ ] 每个实体有数据来源、主键、显示属性\n- [ ] 每个关系有起点、终点、映射规则\n- [ ] 每个行动有绑定实体、工具配置、参数绑定\n- [ ] ID 使用 snake_case 格式\n- [ ] 表格格式正确\n\n## 参考文档\n\n- [架构设计](../../docs/ontology/bkn_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)\n- [语言规范](../../docs/ontology/bkn_docs/SPECIFICATION.md)\n- 样例：\n  - [单文件模式](../../docs/ontology/bkn_docs/examples/k8s-topology.bkn)\n  - [按类型拆分](../../docs/ontology/bkn_docs/examples/k8s-network/)\n  - [每定义一文件](../../docs/ontology/bkn_docs/examples/k8s-modular/) - 推荐大规模场景\n- 模板文件：\n  - [网络模板](../../docs/ontology/bkn_docs/templates/network.bkn.template)\n  - [实体模板](../../docs/ontology/bkn_docs/templates/entity.bkn.template)\n  - [关系模板](../../docs/ontology/bkn_docs/templates/relation.bkn.template)\n  - [行动模板](../../docs/ontology/bkn_docs/templates/action.bkn.template)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:53:33.309Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Graph Agents needing advanced business knowledge network modeling capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级业务知识网络建模能力的知识图谱代理。","ja":"高度なビジネス知識ネットワークモデリング機能を必要とするノールグラフエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 비즈니스 지식 네트워크 모델링 기능이 필요한 지식 그래프 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gráficos de Conocimiento que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de modelado de redes de conocimiento empresarial.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Graphique de Connaissance nécessitant des capacités avancées de modélisation de réseaux de connaissances métier.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensgraphen-Agenten, die erweiterte Geschäftskenntnis-Netzwerk-Modellierfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Knowledge Graph Agents needing advanced business knowledge network modeling capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Knowledge Graph Agents needing advanced business knowledge network modeling capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Knowledge Graph Agents needing advanced business knowledge network modeling capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage complex business knowledge networks using ontology-based data access and DataFlow pipelines, leveraging VEGA for unified data access and SPECIFICATION.md for guideline adherence.","zh":"使代理能够使用本体论基于的数据访问和DataFlow管道创建和管理复杂的业务知识网络，利用VEGA实现统一的数据访问，并遵循SPECIFICATION.md指南。","ja":"エージェントが、オントロジーに基づくデータアクセスとDataFlowパイプラインを使用して、複雑なビジネス知識ネットワークを作成および管理できるようにし、VEGAを使用して統一されたデータアクセスを提供し、SPECIFICATION.mdガイドラインに従います。","ko":"에이전트가 온톨로지 기반 데이터 액세스 및 DataFlow 파이프라인을 사용하여 복잡한 비즈니스 지식 네트워크를 생성 및 관리할 수 있도록 하며, VEGA를 사용하여 통일된 데이터 액세스를 제공하고 SPECIFICATION.md 지침을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar redes de conocimiento empresarial complejas utilizando acceso a datos basado en ontologías y tuberías de DataFlow, aprovechando VEGA para acceso unificado a datos y SPECIFICATION.md para adherirse a las pautas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des réseaux de connaissances métier complexes en utilisant un accès aux données basé sur des ontologies et des pipelines DataFlow, en exploitant VEGA pour un accès unifié aux données et SPECIFICATION.md pour le respect des lignes directrices.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Geschäftskenntnis-Netzwerke zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem sie ontologiebasierten Datenzugriff und DataFlow-Pipelines verwenden, wobei VEGA für den einheitlichen Datenzugriff und SPECIFICATION.md für die Einhaltung der Richtlinien genutzt wird.","pt":"Empowers agents to create and manage complex business knowledge networks using ontology-based data access and DataFlow pipelines, leveraging VEGA for unified data access and SPECIFICATION.md for guideline adherence.","ru":"Empowers agents to create and manage complex business knowledge networks using ontology-based data access and DataFlow pipelines, leveraging VEGA for unified data access and SPECIFICATION.md for guideline adherence.","ar":"Empowers agents to create and manage complex business knowledge networks using ontology-based data access and DataFlow pipelines, leveraging VEGA for unified data access and SPECIFICATION.md for guideline adherence."},"useCases":{"en":["Modeling entity relationships for data integration","Creating knowledge networks for heterogeneous data sources","Orchestrating data processing through DataFlow pipelines"],"zh":["为数据集成建模实体关系","为异构数据源创建知识网络","通过DataFlow管道编排数据处理"],"ja":["データ統合のためのエンティティ関係のモデリング","異種データソースのための知識ネットワークの作成","DataFlowパイプラインを介したデータ処理のオーケストレーション"],"ko":["데이터 통합을 위한 엔티티 관계 모델링","이종 데이터 소스의 지식 네트워크 생성","DataFlow 파이프라인을 통한 데이터 처리 오케스트레이션"],"es":["Modelado de relaciones de entidades para la integración de datos","Creación de redes de conocimiento para fuentes de datos heterogéneas","Orquestación del procesamiento de datos a través de tuberías de DataFlow"],"fr":["Modélisation des relations d''entités pour l''intégration de données","Création de réseaux de connaissances pour des sources de données hétérogènes","Orchestration du traitement de données via des pipelines DataFlow"],"de":["Modellierung von Entitätsbeziehungen für die Datenintegration","Erstellung von Wissensnetzwerken für heterogene Datenquellen","Orchestrierung der Datenverarbeitung durch DataFlow-Pipelines"],"pt":["Modeling entity relationships for data integration","Creating knowledge networks for heterogeneous data sources","Orchestrating data processing through DataFlow pipelines"],"ru":["Modeling entity relationships for data integration","Creating knowledge networks for heterogeneous data sources","Orchestrating data processing through DataFlow pipelines"],"ar":["Modeling entity relationships for data integration","Creating knowledge networks for heterogeneous data sources","Orchestrating data processing through DataFlow pipelines"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Business Knowledge Network (BKN) concepts","Familiarity with VEGA and DataFlow pipelines necessary","Adherence to SPECIFICATION.md guidelines required"],"zh":["需要了解业务知识网络(BKN)概念","需要熟悉VEGA和DataFlow管道","需要遵循SPECIFICATION.md指南"],"ja":["ビジネス知識ネットワーク(BKN)の概念の理解が必要","VEGAおよびDataFlowパイプラインの知識が必要","SPECIFICATION.mdガイドラインの遵守が必要"],"ko":["비즈니스 지식 네트워크(BKN) 개념에 대한 이해가 필요","VEGA 및 DataFlow 파이프라인에 대한 지식이 필요","SPECIFICATION.md 지침을 따르는 것이 필요"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los conceptos de Red de Conocimiento Empresarial (BKN)","Familiaridad con VEGA y tuberías de DataFlow necesaria","Adhesión a las pautas de SPECIFICATION.md requerida"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des concepts de Réseau de Connaissances Métier (BKN)","Familiarité avec VEGA et les pipelines DataFlow nécessaire","Adhésion aux lignes directrices de SPECIFICATION.md requise"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Konzepte von Geschäftskenntnis-Netzwerken (BKN)","Vertrautheit mit VEGA und DataFlow-Pipelines erforderlich","Einhaltung der Richtlinien von SPECIFICATION.md erforderlich"],"pt":["Requires understanding of Business Knowledge Network (BKN) concepts","Familiarity with VEGA and DataFlow pipelines necessary","Adherence to SPECIFICATION.md guidelines required"],"ru":["Requires understanding of Business Knowledge Network (BKN) concepts","Familiarity with VEGA and DataFlow pipelines necessary","Adherence to SPECIFICATION.md guidelines required"],"ar":["Requires understanding of Business Knowledge Network (BKN) concepts","Familiarity with VEGA and DataFlow pipelines necessary","Adherence to SPECIFICATION.md guidelines required"]}