escription":{"zh":"Vite Three.js 性能优化技术，包括 InstancedMesh、遮挡剔除和几何共享等关键技术","ja":"Vite Three.js のパフォーマンス最適化テクニック、InstancedMesh、オクルージョンカリング、ジオメトリ共有など","ko":"Vite Three.js 성능 최적화를 위한 기술, InstancedMesh, Occlusion Culling, Geometry Sharing 등","es":"Patrones de rendimiento para aplicaciones de voxel con Three.js y Vite. Mejora el rendimiento con técnicas como InstancedMesh y occlusion culling","fr":"Modèles de performances pour les applications de voxel avec Three.js et Vite. Améliorez les performances avec des techniques comme InstancedMesh et occlusion...","de":"Leistungsmodelle für Voxel-Anwendungen mit Three.js und Vite. Verbessern Sie die Leistung mit Techniken wie InstancedMesh und Occlusion Culling","pt":"O vtj-performance é um conjunto de técnicas de otimização de desempenho para aplicações voxel-based com Vite e Three.js.","ru":"Vtj-performance - это набор техник оптимизации производительности для voxel-based приложений с Vite и Three.js.","ar":"vtj-performance هو مجموعة من تقنيات تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات voxel-based مع Vite و Three.js.","en":"Maybe it''s what the Minecraft official website looks like in 2030"},"definition":{"en":"Maybe it''s what the Minecraft official website looks like in 2030"},"features":{"zh":["InstancedMesh","遮挡剔除","几何共享","Idle Queue"],"ja":["InstancedMesh","オクルージョンカリング","ジオメトリ共有","Idle Queue"],"ko":["InstancedMesh","Occlusion Culling","Geometry Sharing","Idle Queue"],"es":["InstancedMesh para renderizado por lotes","Occlusion culling para saltar bloques ocultos","Geometry sharing para geometrías compartidas","Idle queue para generación de chunks no bloqueante"],"fr":["InstancedMesh pour le rendu par lots","Occlusion culling pour ignorer les blocs cachés","Geometry sharing pour des géométries partagées","Idle queue pour la génération de chunks non bloquante"],"de":["InstancedMesh für Batch-Rendering","Occlusion Culling für versteckte Blöcke","Geometry Sharing für gemeinsame Geometrien","Idle Queue für nicht-blockierende Chunk-Generierung"],"pt":["InstancedMesh para renderização em lote de objetos semelhantes","Occlusion culling para evitar renderização de blocos ocultos","Geometry sharing para compartilhar geometrias entre blocos","Idle queue para geração de chunks sem bloqueio"],"ru":["InstancedMesh для пакетной отрисовки похожих объектов","Occlusion culling для исключения отрисовки скрытых блоков","Geometry sharing для совместного использования геометрий между блоками","Idle queue для генерации чанков без блокировки"],"ar":["InstancedMesh لترندر الكائنات الشبيهة بشكل مجمّع","Occlusion culling لتجنب ترندر الكتل المخفيّة","Geometry sharing لمشاركة الهندسة بين الكتل","Idle queue لتوليد الشريحة بدون حجب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vite Three.js","性能优化","InstancedMesh","遮挡剔除","几何共享","voxel 基础应用"],"ja":["Vite Three.js","パフォーマンス最適化","InstancedMesh","オクルージョンカリング","ジオメトリ共有","ボクセルベースアプリケーション"],"ko":["Vite Three.js","성능 최적화","InstancedMesh","Occlusion Culling","Geometry Sharing","voxel 기반 애플리케이션"],"es":["optimización de rendimiento","Vite Three.js","aplicaciones de voxel","InstancedMesh","occlusion culling","geometry sharing","idle queue"],"fr":["optimisation des performances","Vite Three.js","applications de voxel","InstancedMesh","occlusion culling","geometry sharing","idle queue"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung","Vite Three.js","Voxel-Anwendungen","InstancedMesh","Occlusion Culling","Geometry Sharing","Idle Queue"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho","vite","three.js","voxel-based","instancedmesh","occlusion culling","geometry sharing","idle queue"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","vite","three.js","voxel-based","instancedmesh","occlusion culling","geometry sharing","idle queue"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","vite","three.js","voxel-based","instancedmesh","occlusion culling","geometry sharing","idle queue"]}},"owner":"hexianWeb","repo":"Third-Person-MC","repoPath":"hexianWeb/Third-Person-MC","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vtj-performance","description":"Optimizes Three.js rendering performance. Use when rendering large numbers of objects, optimizing frame rates, implementing streaming, or managing memory in voxel/block-based scenes.","bodyPreview":"# vite-threejs Performance Optimization\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance patterns for voxel-based Three.js applications.\n\n**Key techniques:**\n- **InstancedMesh**: Batch render thousands of similar objects\n- **Occlusion culling**: Skip hidden blocks\n- **Geometry sharing**: Single geometry for all blocks\n- **Idle queue**: Non-blocking chunk generation\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Technique | Use When | Benefit |\n|-----------|----------|---------|\n| InstancedMesh | 100+ similar objects | Reduced draw calls |\n|","body":"# vite-threejs Performance Optimization\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance patterns for voxel-based Three.js applications.\n\n**Key techniques:**\n- **InstancedMesh**: Batch render thousands of similar objects\n- **Occlusion culling**: Skip hidden blocks\n- **Geometry sharing**: Single geometry for all blocks\n- **Idle queue**: Non-blocking chunk generation\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Technique | Use When | Benefit |\n|-----------|----------|---------|\n| InstancedMesh | 100+ similar objects | Reduced draw calls |\n| Occlusion culling | Voxel terrain | Fewer vertices processed |\n| Geometry sharing | Multiple meshes same shape | Lower memory |\n| Swap-and-pop | Dynamic instance removal | O(1) deletion |\n| Idle queue | Background tasks | No frame drops |\n\n## InstancedMesh Pattern\n\n```javascript\nconst geometry = new THREE.BoxGeometry(1, 1, 1)  // Shared\nconst material = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x888888 })\nconst mesh = new THREE.InstancedMesh(geometry, material, count)\n\nmesh.instanceMatrix.setUsage(THREE.DynamicDrawUsage)\n\n// Set instance at index\nmesh.setMatrixAt(index, matrix)\nmesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true\n```\n\n**Full patterns:** See [references/instanced-mesh.md](references/instanced-mesh.md)\n\n## O(1) Instance Removal\n\n```javascript\n// Swap last instance into deleted slot\nconst lastIndex = mesh.count - 1\nif (index < lastIndex) {\n  mesh.getMatrixAt(lastIndex, tempMatrix)\n  mesh.setMatrixAt(index, tempMatrix)\n}\nmesh.count--\nmesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true\n```\n\n**Implementation details:** See [references/swap-and-pop.md](references/swap-and-pop.md)\n\n## Occlusion Culling\n\nSkip blocks completely surrounded by other blocks:\n\n```javascript\nif (isBlockObscured(x, y, z)) return  // Skip rendering\nrenderBlock(x, y, z)\n```\n\n**Algorithm:** See [references/occlusion-culling.md](references/occlusion-culling.md)\n\n## Idle Queue\n\n```javascript\n// Schedule work without blocking main thread\nidleQueue.enqueue(''chunk'', () => {\n  chunk.generateData()\n}, priority)\n```\n\n**API reference:** See [references/idle-queue.md](references/idle-queue.md)\n\n## Memory Management\n\n```javascript\ndestroy() {\n  // Dispose materials\n  if (Array.isArray(mesh.material)) {\n    mesh.material.forEach(m => m?.dispose())\n  } else {\n    mesh.material?.dispose()\n  }\n  \n  // Remove from scene\n  scene.remove(mesh)\n  mesh = null\n}\n```\n\n**Complete patterns:** See [references/memory-management.md](references/memory-management.md)\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- ❌ Creating geometry per object\n- ❌ Using `splice()` for instance removal\n- ❌ Forgetting `needsUpdate = true`\n- ❌ Synchronous chunk generation\n\n**Full catalog:** See [references/common-mistakes.md](references/common-mistakes.md)\n\n## Configuration\n\n```javascript\nexport const CHUNK_CONFIG = {\n  chunkWidth: 64,      // Balance draw calls vs memory\n  viewDistance: 1,     // 1 = 3x3 chunk grid\n  unloadPadding: 1,    // Hysteresis for unloading\n}\n```\n\n**Tuning guide:** See [references/configuration.md](references/configuration.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:54:40.369Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 3D Visualization Agents needing advanced performance optimization techniques for voxel-based applications.","zh":"适用于需要高级性能优化技术的基于voxel的3D可视化代理","ja":"ボクセルベースのアプリケーションに高度なパフォーマンス最適化技術を必要とする3Dビジュアライゼーションエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 성능 최적화 기술이 필요한 Voxell 기반 3D 시각화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de visualización 3D que necesitan técnicas avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones basadas en voxel.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de visualisation 3D ayant besoin de techniques avancées d''optimisation des performances pour des applications basées sur des voxels.","de":"Perfekt für 3D-Visualisierungsagenten, die fortgeschrittene Leistungsoptimierungstechniken für voxelbasierte Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Visualização 3D que necessitam de técnicas avançadas de otimização de desempenho para aplicações baseadas em voxel.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов 3D-визуализации, требующих продвинутых методов оптимизации производительности для приложений на основе вокселей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المرئيين ثلاثي الأبعاد الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين الأداء لتطبيقات قائم على الفوكسلات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to batch render thousands of similar objects using InstancedMesh, skip hidden blocks with occlusion culling, and utilize geometry sharing for optimized Three.js performance, all while leveraging idle queues for non-blocking chunk generation.","zh":"赋予代理批量渲染成千上万个类似对象的能力，使用InstancedMesh，使用遮挡剔除跳过隐藏的方块，并利用几何共享来优化Three.js的性能，同时利用空闲队列进行非阻塞的块生成","ja":"InstancedMeshを使用して数千の同様のオブジェクトをバッチレンダリングし、遮挡剔除で隠れたブロックをスキップし、幾何学的共有を使用してThree.jsのパフォーマンスを最適化し、アイドルキューやノンブロッキングのチャンク生成を活用することでエージェントに力を与える","ko":"에이전트가 InstancedMesh를 사용하여 수천 개의 유사한 객체를 일괄 렌더링하고, Occlusion Culling을 사용하여 숨겨진 블록을 건너뛰고, 기하학적 공유를 통해 Three.js 성능을 최적화하고, idle 큐를 사용하여 비차단 chunk 생성을 사용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a renderizar por lotes miles de objetos similares utilizando InstancedMesh, saltar bloques ocultos con recorte de oclusión y utilizar el intercambio de geometría para un rendimiento optimizado de Three.js, todo mientras aprovecha las colas inactivas para la generación de trozos sin bloqueo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rendre par lots des milliers d''objets similaires à l''aide d''InstancedMesh, de sauter les blocs cachés avec le recadrage d''occlusion et d''utiliser le partage de géométrie pour des performances Three.js optimisées, le tout en exploitant les files d''attente inactives pour une génération de chunks sans blocage.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Tausende von ähnlichen Objekten mit InstancedMesh zu rendern, versteckte Blöcke mit Occlusion Culling zu überspringen und Geometrieteilung für optimierte Three.js-Leistung zu nutzen, und zwar unter Ausnutzung der Leerlaufwartezeiten für nicht blockierende Chunkgenerierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a renderizar em lote milhares de objetos semelhantes usando InstancedMesh, pular blocos ocultos com corte de oclusão e utilizar compartilhamento de geometria para desempenho otimizado do Three.js, tudo isso aproveitando filas ociosas para geração de pedaços sem bloqueio.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью пакетной отрисовки тысяч подобных объектов с помощью InstancedMesh, пропуска скрытых блоков с помощью окуклюзии и использования общей геометрии для оптимизированного производительности Three.js, при этом используя пустые очереди для нек-blocking генерации чанков.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلاله معالجة آلاف الكائنات المماثلة باستخدام InstancedMesh، وتخطي الكتل المخفية باستخدام تقنية التعتيم، واستخدام المشاركة الهندسية لأداء Three.js المتقدم، مع الاستفادة من الطوابير المتوقفة لإنشاء قطع غير محظورة."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing voxel-based Minecraft-like applications for smoother rendering","Implementing InstancedMesh for reduced draw calls in complex 3D scenes","Improving overall performance with geometry sharing and occlusion culling"],"zh":["为类似Minecraft的基于voxel的应用程序优化渲染以获得更平滑的渲染","在复杂的3D场景中实现InstancedMesh以减少绘制调用","使用几何共享和遮挡剔除来提高整体性能"],"ja":["Minecraftのようなボクセルベースのアプリケーションのレンダリングを最適化して滑らかなレンダリングを実現する","複雑な3DシーンでInstancedMeshを実装して描画コールを削減する","幾何学的共有と遮挡剔除を使用して全体的なパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["Minecraft와 같은 Voxell 기반 애플리케이션의 렌더링을 최적화하여 더 부드러운 렌더링을实现하는 것","복잡한 3D 장면에서 InstancedMesh를 구현하여 그리기 호출을 줄이는 것","기하학적 공유와 Occlusion Culling을 사용하여 전체 성능을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Optimizar aplicaciones basadas en voxel similares a Minecraft para un renderizado más suave","Implementar InstancedMesh para reducir las llamadas de dibujo en escenas 3D complejas","Mejorar el rendimiento general con el intercambio de geometría y el recorte de oclusión"],"fr":["Optimiser les applications basées sur des voxels similaires à Minecraft pour un rendu plus fluide","Mettre en œuvre InstancedMesh pour réduire les appels de dessin dans les scènes 3D complexes","Améliorer les performances globales avec le partage de géométrie et le recadrage d''occlusion"],"de":["Voxelbasierte Anwendungen ähnlich wie Minecraft für ein reibungsloseres Rendering optimieren","InstancedMesh implementieren, um Zeichenaufgaben in komplexen 3D-Szenen zu reduzieren","Die Gesamtleistung mit Geometrieteilung und Occlusion Culling verbessern"],"pt":["Otimizar aplicações baseadas em voxel semelhantes ao Minecraft para renderização mais suave","Implementar InstancedMesh para reduzir chamadas de desenho em cenas 3D complexas","Melhorar o desempenho geral com compartilhamento de geometria e corte de oclusão"],"ru":["Оптимизировать приложения на основе вокселей, подобные Minecraft, для более плавной отрисовки","Реализовать InstancedMesh для уменьшения количества вызовов рисования в сложных 3D-сценах","Улучшить общую производительность с помощью общей геометрии и окуклюзии"],"ar":["تحسين تطبيقات الفوكسلات المماثلة لمايكروسوفت لإنشاء رسومات أكثر سلاسة","تنفيذ InstancedMesh لتقليل عدد مرات呼 إلى الرسومات في المشاهد ثلاثية الأبعاد المعقدة","تحسين الأداء العام باستخدام المشاركة الهندسية وتقنية التعتيم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with Three.js and voxel-based applications","Limited to applications with similar object rendering needs"],"zh":["需要熟悉Three.js和基于voxel的应用程序","仅限于具有类似对象渲染需求的应用程序"],"ja":["Three.jsとボクセルベースのアプリケーションに精通している必要がある","同様のオブジェクトのレンダリングのニーズがあるアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["Three.js 및 Voxell 기반 애플리케이션에 대한 熟悉도 필요","유사한 객체 렌더링需求이 있는 애플리케이션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con Three.js y aplicaciones basadas en voxel","Limitado a aplicaciones con necesidades de renderizado de objetos similares"],"fr":["Nécessite une familiarité avec Three.js et les applications basées sur des voxels","Limité aux applications ayant des besoins de rendu d''objets similaires"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Three.js und voxelbasierten Anwendungen","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen mit ähnlichen Objektwiedergabebedarfen"],"pt":["Exige familiaridade com Three.js e aplicações baseadas em voxel","Limitado a aplicações com necessidades de renderização de objetos semelhantes"],"ru":["Требует знакомства с Three.js и приложениями на основе вокселей","Ограничен для приложений с подобными потребностями в отрисовке объектов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة سابقة ب Three.js وتطبيقات الفوكسلات","محدود للتطبيقات التي تحتاج إلى عرض كائنات مماثلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
