iption":{"zh":"shadcn/ui是一个基于Radix UI和Tailwind CSS的可重用和可访问的React组件集合。它允许您直接复制组件到您的项目中，实现全面的自定义控制","ja":"shadcn/uiは、Radix UIとTailwind CSSに基づいた再利用可能でアクセシブルなReactコンポーネントのコレクションです。プロジェクト内でコンポーネントを直接コピーすることで、完全なカスタマイズ制御が可能になります","ko":"shadcn/ui는 Radix UI와 Tailwind CSS를 기반으로 하는 재사용 가능한 접근 가능한 리액트 컴포넌트의 모음입니다. 프로젝트 내에서 컴포넌트를 직접 복사하여 완전한 커스터마이즈 제어가 가능합니다","es":"Shadcn/ui es una colección de componentes de React reutilizables y accesibles construidos con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"Shadcn/ui est une collection de composants React réutilisables et accessibles construits avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","de":"Shadcn/ui ist eine Sammlung von wiederverwendbaren und zugänglichen React-Komponenten, die mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS erstellt wurden","pt":"shadcn/ui é uma coleção de componentes React reutilizáveis e acessíveis construídos com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","ru":"shadcn/ui - это коллекция повторно используемых и доступных компонентов React, построенных на основе Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","ar":"shadcn/ui هي مجموعة من مكونات ري액ت القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والوصول مبنية على راديكس يو آي وتايل ويند سي إس","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["基于Radix UI和Tailwind CSS","可重用和可访问的React组件","直接复制组件到项目中","实现全面的自定义控制","无需package.json依赖"],"ja":["Radix UIとTailwind CSSに基づいた","再利用可能でアクセシブルなReactコンポーネント","プロジェクト内でコンポーネントを直接コピーする","完全なカスタマイズ制御を実現する","package.json依存関係不要"],"ko":["Radix UI와 Tailwind CSS를 기반으로","재사용 가능한 접근 가능한 리액트 컴포넌트","프로젝트 내에서 컴포넌트를 직접 복사할 수","완전한 커스터마이즈 제어를 가능하게","package.json 의존성 불필요"],"es":["Componentes personalizables y accesibles","Construidos con Radix UI y Tailwind CSS","No requiere dependencia en package.json","Copia componentes directamente en tu proyecto","Permite una propiedad total del código"],"fr":["Composants personnalisables et accessibles","Construits avec Radix UI et Tailwind CSS","Nécessite pas de dépendance dans package.json","Copie des composants directement dans votre projet","Permet une propriété totale du code"],"de":["Anpassbare und zugängliche Komponenten","Erstellt mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS","Benötigt keine Abhängigkeit in package.json","Kopiert Komponenten direkt in Ihr Projekt","Ermöglicht eine volle Eigentümerschaft des Codes"],"pt":["Componentes reutilizáveis e acessíveis","Construídos com Radix UI e Tailwind CSS","Permite personalização total","Não requer dependência de pacote","Cópias de componentes diretamente no projeto"],"ru":["Повторно используемые и доступные компоненты","Построены на основе Radix UI и Tailwind CSS","Позволяет полностью настраивать","Не требует зависимости от пакета","Копии компонентов напрямую в проект"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام والوصول","مبنية على راديكس يو آي وتايل ويند سي إس","تمكن من التخصيص الكامل","لا تتطلب зависимости حزمة","نسخ من المكونات مباشرة إلى المشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn/ui","React组件","可访问","自定义控制","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["shadcn/ui","Reactコンポーネント","アクセシブル","カスタマイズ制御","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["shadcn/ui","리액트 컴포넌트","접근 가능","커스터마이즈 제어","Radix UI","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["shadcn/ui","React","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","componentes personalizables","accesibilidad","desarrollo web"],"fr":["shadcn/ui","React","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","composants personnalisables","accessibilité","développement web"],"de":["shadcn/ui","React","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","anpassbare Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["shadcn/ui","React","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","componentes reutilizáveis","acessibilidade","personalização","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["shadcn/ui","React","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","повторно используемые компоненты","доступность","настройка","веб-разработка"],"ar":["shadcn/ui","ري액ت","تايل ويند سي إس","راديكس يو آي","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","الوصول","التخصيص","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"nilecui","repo":"SkillsBase","repoPath":"nilecui/SkillsBase","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-shadcn-ui","description":"Use when building React UI components, implementing design systems, or needing pre-built accessible components - leverages shadcn/ui primitives and shadcnblocks.com (829 production-ready blocks) for rapid interface development","bodyPreview":"# Using shadcn/ui\n\n## Overview\n\nshadcn/ui is a collection of re-usable, accessible React components built on Radix UI and Tailwind CSS. Unlike traditional component libraries, shadcn/ui copies components directly into your project, giving you full ownership and customization control.\n\n**Core principle:** Components live in your codebase. You own the code. No package.json dependency.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use shadcn/ui when:**\n- Building React applications with Tailwind CSS\n- Need accessible, custom","body":"# Using shadcn/ui\n\n## Overview\n\nshadcn/ui is a collection of re-usable, accessible React components built on Radix UI and Tailwind CSS. Unlike traditional component libraries, shadcn/ui copies components directly into your project, giving you full ownership and customization control.\n\n**Core principle:** Components live in your codebase. You own the code. No package.json dependency.\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use shadcn/ui when:**\n- Building React applications with Tailwind CSS\n- Need accessible, customizable UI components\n- Want pre-built patterns without library lock-in\n- Implementing common UI patterns (forms, dialogs, dropdowns, etc.)\n- Starting new projects that need design system foundation\n- Need production-ready blocks for hero sections, pricing, testimonials, etc.\n\n**shadcnblocks.com integration:**\n- 829 blocks across 42 categories\n- Production-ready sections (Hero, Navbar, Footer, Pricing, Testimonials, etc.)\n- Copy-paste directly into your project\n- Built with same shadcn/ui primitives\n\n**Don''t use for:**\n- Non-React projects\n- Projects without Tailwind CSS\n- When you need a locked, versioned component library\n- Simple HTML/CSS projects\n\n## Installation Workflow\n\n### 1. Initialize shadcn/ui\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n**Configuration prompts:**\n- Style: Default or New York\n- Color: Slate, Gray, Zinc, etc.\n- CSS variables: Yes (recommended)\n- Tailwind config: Use CSS variables for colors\n\n### 2. Add Components\n\n```bash\n# Add specific components\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\nnpx shadcn@latest add form\n\n# Add multiple at once\nnpx shadcn@latest add button card dialog dropdown-menu\n```\n\n**Components install to:** `components/ui/`\n\n### 3. Using shadcnblocks.com\n\n**Visit:** https://www.shadcnblocks.com/blocks\n\n**Workflow:**\n1. Browse category (Hero, Pricing, Testimonial, etc.)\n2. Find desired block\n3. Click \"Copy Code\"\n4. Paste into your component file\n5. Install any missing shadcn/ui dependencies\n6. Customize colors, text, and layout\n\n## Component Categories Reference\n\n| Category | Common Use Cases | Example Components |\n|----------|------------------|-------------------|\n| **Forms** | User input, validation | Input, Textarea, Select, Checkbox, Radio Group |\n| **Overlays** | Modals, popovers | Dialog, Popover, Tooltip, Sheet |\n| **Navigation** | Menus, dropdowns | Dropdown Menu, Navigation Menu, Tabs |\n| **Feedback** | User notifications | Alert, Toast, Progress, Skeleton |\n| **Data Display** | Tables, cards, badges | Table, Card, Badge, Avatar |\n| **Layout** | Containers, separators | Separator, Aspect Ratio, Scroll Area |\n\n## shadcnblocks.com Categories (829 blocks)\n\n### Layout & Navigation (200 blocks)\n- **Hero** (162 blocks): Landing page headers with CTAs\n- **Navbar** (13 blocks): Navigation headers\n- **Footer** (18 blocks): Page footers\n- **Banner** (7 blocks): Announcement bars\n\n### Content Sections (367 blocks)\n- **Feature** (266 blocks): Product feature showcases\n- **Blog** (22 blocks): Blog layouts and cards\n- **Gallery** (47 blocks): Image galleries\n- **Timeline** (14 blocks): Event timelines\n- **Team** (10 blocks): Team member profiles\n- **About** (10 blocks): About us sections\n\n### Business Components (116 blocks)\n- **Pricing** (35 blocks): Pricing tables and cards\n- **Testimonial** (28 blocks): Customer testimonials\n- **Case Studies** (9 blocks): Success stories\n- **Integration** (16 blocks): Integration showcases\n- **Service/Services** (21 blocks): Service offerings\n- **Stats** (17 blocks): Statistics displays\n\n### User Engagement (64 blocks)\n- **CTA** (25 blocks): Call-to-action sections\n- **Contact** (13 blocks): Contact forms\n- **Signup/Login** (17 blocks): Authentication forms\n- **Waitlist** (2 blocks): Email capture\n- **Community** (7 blocks): Community features\n\n### Information Display (82 blocks)\n- **FAQ** (15 blocks): Frequently asked questions\n- **Comparison** (10 blocks): Feature comparisons\n- **Logos** (11 blocks): Logo grids\n- **Resources** (4 blocks): Resource libraries\n- **Download** (12 blocks): Download sections\n- **Changelog** (7 blocks): Update logs\n- **Careers** (9 blocks): Job listings\n- **Compliance** (3 blocks): Legal/privacy sections\n\n## Quick Start Example\n\n```typescript\n// 1. Add button component\n// $ npx shadcn@latest add button\n\n// 2. Import and use\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function MyComponent() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Button variant=\"default\">Click me</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"destructive\">Delete</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n      <Button variant=\"ghost\">Subtle</Button>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Form Pattern with shadcn/ui\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add form input button\n\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Form,\n  FormControl,\n  FormField,\n  FormItem,\n  FormLabel,\n  FormMessage,\n} from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\n\nconst formSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(\"Invalid email address\"),\n  password: z.string().min(8, \"Password must be at least 8 characters\"),\n})\n\nexport function LoginForm() {\n  const form = useForm<z.infer<typeof formSchema>>({\n    resolver: zodResolver(formSchema),\n    defaultValues: {\n      email: \"\",\n      password: \"\",\n    },\n  })\n\n  function onSubmit(values: z.infer<typeof formSchema>) {\n    console.log(values)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className=\"space-y-4\">\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"email\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input placeholder=\"you@example.com\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <FormField\n          control={form.control}\n          name=\"password\"\n          render={({ field }) => (\n            <FormItem>\n              <FormLabel>Password</FormLabel>\n              <FormControl>\n                <Input type=\"password\" {...field} />\n              </FormControl>\n              <FormMessage />\n            </FormItem>\n          )}\n        />\n        <Button type=\"submit\">Sign In</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Dialog/Modal Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add dialog button\n\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ConfirmDialog() {\n  return (\n    <Dialog>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>\n        <Button variant=\"destructive\">Delete Account</Button>\n      </DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent>\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>Are you absolutely sure?</DialogTitle>\n          <DialogDescription>\n            This action cannot be undone. This will permanently delete your\n            account and remove your data from our servers.\n          </DialogDescription>\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"flex justify-end gap-3\">\n          <Button variant=\"outline\">Cancel</Button>\n          <Button variant=\"destructive\">Delete</Button>\n        </div>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Using Blocks from shadcnblocks.com\n\n### Example: Adding a Hero Section\n\n**1. Visit:** https://www.shadcnblocks.com/blocks\n**2. Navigate to:** Hero category\n**3. Select a design**\n**4. Click \"Copy Code\"**\n**5. Create component:**\n\n```typescript\n// app/components/hero.tsx\n// (Paste copied code from shadcnblocks.com)\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"container flex flex-col items-center gap-8 pt-20 pb-12\">\n      <h1 className=\"text-6xl font-bold text-center\">\n        Build amazing products\n      </h1>\n      <p className=\"text-xl text-muted-foreground text-center max-w-2xl\">\n        Get started with production-ready components built with shadcn/ui\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"flex gap-4\">\n        <Button size=\"lg\">Get Started</Button>\n        <Button size=\"lg\" variant=\"outline\">Learn More</Button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**6. Install missing components:**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\n```\n\n**7. Import and use:**\n```typescript\nimport { Hero } from \"@/components/hero\"\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  return <Hero />\n}\n```\n\n### Example: Adding a Pricing Section\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add card button badge\n\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardFooter,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/card\"\nimport { Badge } from \"@/components/ui/badge\"\n\nexport function Pricing() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"container py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">\n        Simple, transparent pricing\n      </h2>\n      <div className=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n        <Card>\n          <CardHeader>\n            <CardTitle>Starter</CardTitle>\n            <CardDescription>Perfect for trying out</CardDescription>\n          </CardHeader>\n          <CardContent>\n            <div className=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-2\">$9</div>\n            <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">per month</p>\n          </CardContent>\n          <CardFooter>\n            <Button className=\"w-full\">Get Started</Button>\n          </CardFooter>\n        </Card>\n\n        <Card className=\"border-primary\">\n          <CardHeader>\n            <Badge className=\"w-fit mb-2\">Most Popular</Badge>\n            <CardTitle>Pro</CardTitle>\n            <CardDescription>For growing businesses</CardDescription>\n          </CardHeader>\n          <CardContent>\n            <div className=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-2\">$29</div>\n            <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">per month</p>\n          </CardContent>\n          <CardFooter>\n            <Button className=\"w-full\">Get Started</Button>\n          </CardFooter>\n        </Card>\n\n        <Card>\n          <CardHeader>\n            <CardTitle>Enterprise</CardTitle>\n            <CardDescription>For large organizations</CardDescription>\n          </CardHeader>\n          <CardContent>\n            <div className=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-2\">Custom</div>\n            <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">contact us</p>\n          </CardContent>\n          <CardFooter>\n            <Button className=\"w-full\" variant=\"outline\">Contact Sales</Button>\n          </CardFooter>\n        </Card>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Customization\n\n### Theme Colors\n\nEdit `app/globals.css` or `styles/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    --primary-foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... more CSS variables */\n  }\n\n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode colors */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Component Variants\n\nComponents use `class-variance-authority` for variants:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\n// Available variants:\n<Button variant=\"default\">Default</Button>\n<Button variant=\"destructive\">Destructive</Button>\n<Button variant=\"outline\">Outline</Button>\n<Button variant=\"secondary\">Secondary</Button>\n<Button variant=\"ghost\">Ghost</Button>\n<Button variant=\"link\">Link</Button>\n\n// Available sizes:\n<Button size=\"default\">Default</Button>\n<Button size=\"sm\">Small</Button>\n<Button size=\"lg\">Large</Button>\n<Button size=\"icon\">Icon</Button>\n```\n\n### Extending Components\n\nEdit the component file directly in `components/ui/`:\n\n```typescript\n// components/ui/button.tsx\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center...\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground...\",\n        destructive: \"bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground...\",\n        // Add custom variant:\n        success: \"bg-green-600 text-white hover:bg-green-700\",\n      },\n      // ... rest of variants\n    }\n  }\n)\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Loading States\n\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton() {\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(false)\n\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={isLoading}>\n      {isLoading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {isLoading ? \"Loading...\" : \"Submit\"}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Toast Notifications\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add toast\n\nimport { useToast } from \"@/hooks/use-toast\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nexport function ToastExample() {\n  const { toast } = useToast()\n\n  return (\n    <Button\n      onClick={() => {\n        toast({\n          title: \"Success!\",\n          description: \"Your changes have been saved.\",\n        })\n      }}\n    >\n      Show Toast\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Data Tables\n\n```typescript\n// Install: npx shadcn@latest add table\n\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n\nconst invoices = [\n  { invoice: \"INV001\", status: \"Paid\", amount: \"$250.00\" },\n  { invoice: \"INV002\", status: \"Pending\", amount: \"$150.00\" },\n]\n\nexport function InvoiceTable() {\n  return (\n    <Table>\n      <TableHeader>\n        <TableRow>\n          <TableHead>Invoice</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Status</TableHead>\n          <TableHead>Amount</TableHead>\n        </TableRow>\n      </TableHeader>\n      <TableBody>\n        {invoices.map((invoice) => (\n          <TableRow key={invoice.invoice}>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.invoice}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.status}</TableCell>\n            <TableCell>{invoice.amount}</TableCell>\n          </TableRow>\n        ))}\n      </TableBody>\n    </Table>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Installing as npm package | shadcn/ui copies code. Run `npx shadcn@latest add [component]` |\n| Importing from `shadcn` | Import from `@/components/ui/[component]` |\n| Not installing dependencies | Each component may need additional packages (listed in CLI) |\n| Modifying in node_modules | Components live in your `components/ui/` - edit directly |\n| Forgetting Tailwind config | Run `npx shadcn@latest init` to configure properly |\n| Skipping shadcnblocks.com | Don''t build common sections from scratch - use 829 ready blocks |\n\n## Workflow Summary\n\n**Starting new project:**\n1. `npx shadcn@latest init`\n2. Add needed components: `npx shadcn@latest add button card dialog`\n3. Browse shadcnblocks.com for section blocks\n4. Copy blocks, install dependencies, customize\n\n**Adding new feature:**\n1. Identify needed components (form, dialog, etc.)\n2. `npx shadcn@latest add [components]`\n3. Check shadcnblocks.com for similar patterns\n4. Build or adapt from block\n5. Customize colors and content\n\n**Customizing:**\n1. Edit component files in `components/ui/` directly\n2. Modify `globals.css` for theme colors\n3. Add variants using `class-variance-authority` patterns\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Official Docs:** https://ui.shadcn.com\n- **shadcnblocks.com:** https://www.shadcnblocks.com/blocks (829 blocks)\n- **Components:** https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components\n- **Themes:** https://ui.shadcn.com/themes\n- **Examples:** https://ui.shadcn.com/examples\n\n## Integration with Other Tools\n\n**Works seamlessly with:**\n- Next.js (App Router or Pages)\n- Remix\n- Astro\n- Vite + React\n- React Hook Form\n- Zod validation\n- Tailwind CSS\n- Radix UI (under the hood)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:55:49.825Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents building React applications with Tailwind CSS and needing customizable, accessible UI components.","zh":"非常适合使用 Tailwind CSS 构建 React 应用程序的前端代理，需要可定制和可访问的 UI 组件。","ja":"Tailwind CSS と React アプリケーションを構築するフロントエンド エージェントに最適で、カスタマイズ可能でアクセス可能な UI コンポーネントが必要です。","ko":"Tailwind CSS와 함께 React 애플리케이션을 구축하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 사용자 지정 가능하고 접근 가능한 UI 컴포넌트가 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que construyen aplicaciones de React con Tailwind CSS y necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizables y accesibles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui construisent des applications React avec Tailwind CSS et ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables et accessibles.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die React-Anwendungen mit Tailwind CSS erstellen und anpassbare, zugängliche Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend que constroem aplicações React com Tailwind CSS e necessitam de componentes de UI personalizáveis e acessíveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов фронтенда, строящих приложения React с Tailwind CSS и требующих настраиваемых и доступных компонентов интерфейса пользователя.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يبنيون تطبيقات React باستخدام Tailwind CSS والذين يحتاجون إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل والمتوافقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create fully customizable and accessible React components using Radix UI and Tailwind CSS, giving them full ownership and control over their codebase by copying components directly into their project, eliminating package.json dependencies.","zh":"赋予代理创建完全可定制和可访问的 React 组件的能力，使用 Radix UI 和 Tailwind CSS，通过直接将组件复制到项目中，消除了对 package.json 依赖的需求，从而让代理完全拥有和控制自己的代码库。","ja":"Radix UI と Tailwind CSS を使用して、完全にカスタマイズ可能でアクセス可能な React コンポーネントを作成するエージェントを可能にします。プロジェクトコードベースに直接コンポーネントをコピーすることで、package.json 依存関係の必要性を排除し、コードベースの完全な所有権と管理をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"Radix UI와 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 완전히 사용자 지정 가능하고 접근 가능한 React 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다. 프로젝트 코드베이스에 직접 컴포넌트를 복사함으로써 package.json 종속성의 필요성을 제거하고 코드베이스에 대한 완전한 소유권과 제어를 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de React completamente personalizables y accesibles utilizando Radix UI y Tailwind CSS, lo que les da la propiedad y el control total sobre su base de código al copiar componentes directamente en su proyecto, eliminando las dependencias de package.json.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants React entièrement personnalisables et accessibles en utilisant Radix UI et Tailwind CSS, leur donnant ainsi la pleine propriété et le contrôle sur leur base de code en copiant des composants directement dans leur projet, éliminant les dépendances de package.json.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, vollständig anpassbare und zugängliche React-Komponenten mit Radix UI und Tailwind CSS zu erstellen, wodurch sie die volle Eigentümerschaft und Kontrolle über ihren Codebasis haben, indem sie Komponenten direkt in ihr Projekt kopieren und die Abhängigkeiten von package.json eliminieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes React completamente personalizáveis e acessíveis usando Radix UI e Tailwind CSS, dando-lhes total propriedade e controle sobre a base de código, copiando componentes diretamente para o projeto e eliminando dependências do package.json.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать полностью настраиваемые и доступные компоненты React, используя Radix UI и Tailwind CSS, давая им полный контроль над кодовой базой, копируя компоненты trựcно в проект и устраняя зависимости package.json.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على إنشاء مكونات React قابلة للتعديل والمتوافقة完全ًا باستخدام Radix UI و Tailwind CSS، مع إعطائهم السيطرة الكاملة على قاعدة الشفرة من خلال نسخ المكونات مباشرة إلى المشروع وإزالة التبعيات package.json."},"useCases":{"en":["Building responsive and accessible React applications with Tailwind CSS","Customizing UI components for unique design requirements","Streamlining development by copying components directly into the project codebase"],"zh":["使用 Tailwind CSS 构建响应式和可访问的 React 应用程序","为满足独特的设计要求而定制 UI 组件","通过直接将组件复制到项目代码库中来简化开发"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS を使用してレスポンシブでアクセス可能な React アプリケーションを構築する","独自のデザイン要件に合わせて UI コンポーネントをカスタマイズする","コンポーネントを直接プロジェクトコードベースにコピーすることで開発を合理化する"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 반응형 및 접근 가능한 React 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","고유한 디자인 요구 사항에 맞게 UI 컴포넌트를 사용자 지정하는 것","컴포넌트를 직접 프로젝트 코드베이스에 복사하여 개발을 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones de React responsivas y accesibles con Tailwind CSS","Personalizar componentes de interfaz de usuario para requisitos de diseño únicos","Optimizar el desarrollo al copiar componentes directamente en la base de código del proyecto"],"fr":["Construire des applications React réactives et accessibles avec Tailwind CSS","Personnaliser les composants d''interface utilisateur pour des exigences de conception uniques","Optimiser le développement en copiant des composants directement dans la base de code du projet"],"de":["Erstellen von responsiven und zugänglichen React-Anwendungen mit Tailwind CSS","Anpassen von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für einzigartige Designanforderungen","Optimieren der Entwicklung durch direktes Kopieren von Komponenten in die Projektcodebasis"],"pt":["Construir aplicações React responsivas e acessíveis com Tailwind CSS","Personalizar componentes de UI para requisitos de design únicos","Otimizar o desenvolvimento copiando componentes diretamente para a base de código do projeto"],"ru":["Строить отзывчивые и доступные приложения React с Tailwind CSS","Настроить компоненты интерфейса пользователя для уникальных требований дизайна","Оптимизировать разработку, копируя компоненты trựcно в кодовую базу проекта"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات React الاستجابة والمتوافقة مع Tailwind CSS","تخصيص مكونات واجهة المستخدم لاحتياجات التصميم الفريدة","تحسين التطوير من خلال نسخ المكونات مباشرة إلى قاعدة الشفرة للمشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and Tailwind CSS setup","Limited to React applications","No package.json dependency management"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Tailwind CSS 设置","仅限 React 应用程序","无 package.json 依赖管理"],"ja":["React と Tailwind CSS の設定が必要","React アプリケーションに限定される","package.json 依存関係の管理がない"],"ko":["React 및 Tailwind CSS 설정이 필요합니다.","React 애플리케이션에만 제한됨","package.json 종속성 관리 없음"],"es":["Requiere configuración de React y Tailwind CSS","Limitado a aplicaciones de React","No hay administración de dependencias de package.json"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de React et Tailwind CSS","Limité aux applications React","Aucune gestion des dépendances de package.json"],"de":["Benötigt React- und Tailwind-CSS-Setup","Begrenzt auf React-Anwendungen","Keine Abhängigkeitsverwaltung von package.json"],"pt":["Requer configuração do React e Tailwind CSS","Limitado a aplicações React","Não há gerenciamento de dependências do package.json"],"ru":["Требует настройки React и Tailwind CSS","Ограничен для приложений React","Нет управления зависимостями package.json"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد React و Tailwind CSS","محدود للتطبيقات React","لا يوجد إدارة للاعتماديات package.json"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nilecui/SkillsBase/DevOps Engineer', 'community', 'nilecui', 'SkillsBase', 'nilecui/SkillsBase', 'DevOps Engineer', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z', '2026-02-18T08:55:47.430Z', NULL, '{"id":"nilecui/SkillsBase/DevOps Engineer","name":"DevOps Engineer","description":{"zh":"DevOps 10CI/CD","ja":"DevOps 10CI/CD","ko":"DevOps 10CI/CD","es":"El ingeniero DevOps es responsable de automatizar pipelines de CI/CD, infraestructura como código y despliegue automatizado","fr":"L''ingénieur DevOps est responsable de l''automatisation des pipelines de CI/CD, de l''infrastructure en tant que code et du déploiement automatique","de":"Der DevOps-Ingenieur ist verantwortlich für die Automatisierung von CI/CD-Pipelines, Infrastruktur als Code und automatisierter Bereitstellung","pt":"O engenheiro DevOps é um especialista em automatizar pipelines CI/CD e garantir a confiabilidade da infraestrutura","ru":"Инженер DevOps - это специалист по автоматизации CI/CD-пайплайнов и обеспечению надежности инфраструктуры","ar":"مهندس DevOps هو متخصص في تلقيم أنابيب CI/CD وضمان موثوقية البنية التحتية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"DevOps ","ja":"DevOps","ko":"DevOps ","es":"Ingeniero DevOps: automatización y entrega continua","fr":"Ingénieur DevOps: automation et livraison continue","de":"DevOps-Ingenieur: Automatisierung und kontinuierliche Lie...","pt":"Engenheiro DevOps: Especialista em Pipelines CI/CD","ru":"Инженер DevOps: Специалист по CI/CD-пайплайнам","ar":"مهندس DevOps: متخصص في أنابيب CI/CD","en":"DevOps Engineer"},"description":{"zh":"DevOps 10CI/CD","ja":"DevOps 10CI/CD","ko":"DevOps 10CI/CD","es":"El ingeniero DevOps es responsable de automatizar pipelines de CI/CD, infraestructura como código y despliegue automatizado","fr":"L''ingénieur DevOps est responsable de l''automatisation des pipelines de CI/CD, de l''infrastructure en tant que code et du déploiement automatique","de":"Der DevOps-Ingenieur ist verantwortlich für die Automatisierung von CI/CD-Pipelines, Infrastruktur als Code und automatisierter Bereitstellung","pt":"O engenheiro DevOps é um especialista em automatizar pipelines CI/CD e garantir a confiabilidade da infraestrutura","ru":"Инженер DevOps - это специалист по автоматизации CI/CD-пайплайнов и обеспечению надежности инфраструктуры","ar":"مهندس DevOps هو متخصص في تلقيم أنابيب CI/CD وضمان موثوقية البنية التحتية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["CI/CD","","IaC","",""],"ja":["CI/CD","","IaC","",""],"ko":["CI/CD","","IaC","",""],"es":["Automatización de pipelines de CI/CD","Infraestructura como código","Despliegue automatizado","Garantía de la calidad y la fiabilidad","Optimización de los procesos de desarrollo y operaciones"],"fr":["Automation des pipelines de CI/CD","Infrastructure en tant que code","Déploiement automatique","Garantie de la qualité et de la fiabilité","Optimisation des processus de développement et d''exploitation"],"de":["Automatisierung von CI/CD-Pipelines","Infrastruktur als Code","Automatisierte Bereitstellung","Sicherstellung der Qualität und Zuverlässigkeit","Optimierung der Entwicklungs- und Betriebsprozesse"],"pt":["Automação de pipelines CI/CD","Infraestrutura como código","Automação de implantação","Monitoramento e resposta a incidentes","Garantia de confiabilidade"],"ru":["Автоматизация CI/CD-пайплайнов","Инфраструктура как код","Автоматизация развертывания","Мониторинг и реагирование на инциденты","Обеспечение надежности"],"ar":["تلقيم أنابيب CI/CD","البنية التحتية كود","تلقيم التنفيذ","مراقبة واستجابة للحوادث","ضمان الموثوقية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DevOps","CI/CD","IaC","","",""],"ja":["DevOps","CI/CD","IaC","","",""],"ko":["DevOps","CI/CD","IaC","","",""],"es":["DevOps","ingeniero DevOps","automatización de pipelines","infraestructura como código","despliegue automatizado","ciudad de entrega continua","garantía de la calidad"],"fr":["DevOps","ingénieur DevOps","automatisation des pipelines","infrastructure en tant que code","déploiement automatique","ville de livraison continue","garantie de la qualité"],"de":["DevOps","DevOps-Ingenieur","Automatisierung von Pipelines","Infrastruktur als Code","automatisierte Bereitstellung","Stadt der kontinuierlichen Lieferung","Sicherstellung der Qualität"],"pt":["DevOps","CI/CD","Infraestrutura como código","Automação de implantação","Monitoramento","Confiabilidade","Engenheiro DevOps"],"ru":["DevOps","CI/CD","Инфраструктура как код","Автоматизация развертывания","Мониторинг","Надежность","Инженер DevOps"],"ar":["DevOps","CI/CD","البنية التحتية كود","تلقيم التنفيذ","مراقبة","موثوقية","مهندس DevOps"]}},"owner":"nilecui","repo":"SkillsBase","repoPath":"nilecui/SkillsBase","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"DevOps Engineer","description":"DevOps specialist for CI/CD, infrastructure as code, and deployment automation. Invoke for pipelines, Docker, Kubernetes, cloud platforms, GitOps. Keywords: DevOps, CI/CD, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, GitHub Actions.","bodyPreview":"# DevOps Engineer\n\nSenior DevOps engineer specializing in CI/CD pipelines, infrastructure as code, and deployment automation.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior DevOps engineer with 10+ years of experience. You operate with three perspectives:\n- **Build Hat**: Automating build, test, and packaging\n- **Deploy Hat**: Orchestrating deployments across environments\n- **Ops Hat**: Ensuring reliability, monitoring, and incident response\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up CI/CD pipelines (GitHu","body":"# DevOps Engineer\n\nSenior DevOps engineer specializing in CI/CD pipelines, infrastructure as code, and deployment automation.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior DevOps engineer with 10+ years of experience. You operate with three perspectives:\n- **Build Hat**: Automating build, test, and packaging\n- **Deploy Hat**: Orchestrating deployments across environments\n- **Ops Hat**: Ensuring reliability, monitoring, and incident response\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up CI/CD pipelines (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins)\n- Containerizing applications (Docker, Docker Compose)\n- Kubernetes deployments and configurations\n- Infrastructure as code (Terraform, Pulumi)\n- Cloud platform configuration (AWS, GCP, Azure)\n- Deployment strategies (blue-green, canary, rolling)\n- Building internal developer platforms and self-service tools\n- Incident response, on-call, and production troubleshooting\n- Release automation and artifact management\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Assess** - Understand application, environments, requirements\n2. **Design** - Pipeline structure, deployment strategy\n3. **Implement** - IaC, Dockerfiles, CI/CD configs\n4. **Deploy** - Roll out with verification\n5. **Monitor** - Set up observability, alerts\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| GitHub Actions | `references/github-actions.md` | Setting up CI/CD pipelines, GitHub workflows |\n| Docker | `references/docker-patterns.md` | Containerizing applications, writing Dockerfiles |\n| Kubernetes | `references/kubernetes.md` | K8s deployments, services, ingress, pods |\n| Terraform | `references/terraform-iac.md` | Infrastructure as code, AWS/GCP provisioning |\n| Deployment | `references/deployment-strategies.md` | Blue-green, canary, rolling updates, rollback |\n| Platform | `references/platform-engineering.md` | Self-service infra, developer portals, golden paths, Backstage |\n| Release | `references/release-automation.md` | Artifact management, feature flags, multi-platform CI/CD |\n| Incidents | `references/incident-response.md` | Production outages, on-call, MTTR, postmortems, runbooks |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use infrastructure as code (never manual changes)\n- Implement health checks and readiness probes\n- Store secrets in secret managers (not env files)\n- Enable container scanning in CI/CD\n- Document rollback procedures\n- Use GitOps for Kubernetes (ArgoCD, Flux)\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Deploy to production without explicit approval\n- Store secrets in code or CI/CD variables\n- Skip staging environment testing\n- Ignore resource limits in containers\n- Use `latest` tag in production\n- Deploy on Fridays without monitoring\n\n## Output Templates\n\nProvide: CI/CD pipeline config, Dockerfile, K8s/Terraform files, deployment verification, rollback procedure\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nGitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins, CircleCI, Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, ArgoCD, Flux, Terraform, Pulumi, Crossplane, AWS/GCP/Azure, Prometheus, Grafana, PagerDuty, Backstage, LaunchDarkly, Flagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:55:47.430Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring streamlined CI/CD pipeline automation and infrastructure as code management.","zh":"适合需要简化CI/CD流水线自动化和基础设施即代码管理的云代理。","ja":"CI/CDパイプラインの自動化とインフラストラクチャーとしてのコード管理を簡素化するクラウドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"클라우드 에이전트가 CI/CD 파이프라인 자동화와 인프라스트럭처 코드 관리를 단순화하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Nube que requieren una automatización de tuberías de CI/CD optimizada y una gestión de infraestructura como código.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant une automation de pipeline CI/CD rationalisée et une gestion d''infrastructure en tant que code.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die eine optimierte Automatisierung von CI/CD-Pipelines und eine Infrastruktur-als-Code-Verwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que exigem automação de pipeline de CI/CD simplificada e gerenciamento de infraestrutura como código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих оптимизированной автоматизации конвейера CI/CD и управления инфраструктурой как кодом.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يتطلب تسهيلات خط أنابيب CI/CD و إدارة البنية التحتية كود"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate deployments across environments using infrastructure as code, automate build, test, and packaging, and ensure reliability through monitoring and incident response, leveraging CI/CD pipelines and deployment automation protocols.","zh":"赋予代理人跨环境部署的能力，使用基础设施即代码，自动化构建、测试和包装，并通过监控和事件响应确保可靠性，利用CI/CD流水线和部署自动化协议。","ja":"エージェントに、インフラストラクチャーとしてのコードを使用して環境間でデプロイをオーケストレーションし、ビルド、テスト、パッケージの自動化を行い、CI/CDパイプラインとデプロイ自動化プロトコルを利用して監視とインシデント対応を介して信頼性を確保する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 인프라스트럭처 코드를 사용하여 환경 간에 배포를 오케스트레이션하고, 빌드, 테스트, 패키징의 자동화를 수행하며, 모니터링과 사건 대응을 통해 신뢰성을 보장하고, CI/CD 파이프라인과 배포 자동화 프로토콜을 활용하는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes orquestar implementaciones en varios entornos utilizando infraestructura como código, automatizar la compilación, las pruebas y el empaquetado, y garantizar la confiabilidad a través de la supervisión y la respuesta a incidentes, aprovechando las tuberías de CI/CD y los protocolos de automatización de implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer les déploiements dans plusieurs environnements en utilisant l''infrastructure en tant que code, d''automatiser la construction, les tests et l''emballage, et de garantir la fiabilité grâce à la surveillance et à la réponse aux incidents, en exploitant les pipelines CI/CD et les protocoles d''automatisation de déploiement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Deployments in verschiedenen Umgebungen mithilfe von Infrastruktur-als-Code zu orchestrieren, Build-, Test- und Verpackungsschritte zu automatisieren und die Zuverlässigkeit durch Überwachung und Reaktion auf Zwischenfälle sicherzustellen, indem CI/CD-Pipelines und Deploy-Automatisierungsprotokolle genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar implantações em vários ambientes usando infraestrutura como código, automatizar compilação, teste e embalagem, e garantir confiabilidade por meio de monitoramento e resposta a incidentes, aproveitando os pipelines CI/CD e protocolos de automação de implantação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать развертывания в различных средах с использованием инфраструктуры как кода, автоматизировать сборку, тестирование и упаковку, а также обеспечивать надежность за счет мониторинга и реагирования на инциденты, используя конвейеры CI/CD и протоколы автоматизации развертывания.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة عمليات النشر عبر بيئات متعددة باستخدام البنية التحتية كود، وتأتمة عملية البناء والاختبار والتغليف، وضمان الموثوقية من خلال مراقبة الاستجابة للحوادث، واستخدام أنابيب CI/CD وبروتوكولات 자동ات النشر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating build, test, and packaging for efficient software delivery","Deploying applications across multiple environments with ease","Ensuring reliability and monitoring system performance for prompt incident response"],"zh":["为高效的软件交付自动化构建、测试和包装","轻松地跨多个环境部署应用程序","确保可靠性和监控系统性能以实现及时的事件响应"],"ja":["効率的なソフトウェアデリバリーのためのビルド、テスト、パッケージの自動化","複数の環境でのアプリケーションのデプロイを容易にする","信頼性を確保し、システムのパフォーマンスを監視して迅速なインシデント対応を実現する"],"ko":["효율적인 소프트웨어 전달을 위한 빌드, 테스트, 패키징 자동화","여러 환경에서의 애플리케이션 배포를 쉽게 하기","신뢰성을 보장하고 시스템 성능을 모니터링하여 즉각적인 사건 대응을 구현하기"],"es":["Automatizar la compilación, las pruebas y el empaquetado para una entrega de software eficiente","Implementar aplicaciones en varios entornos con facilidad","Garantizar la confiabilidad y supervisar el rendimiento del sistema para una respuesta rápida a incidentes"],"fr":["Automatiser la construction, les tests et l''emballage pour une livraison de logiciels efficace","Déployer des applications dans plusieurs environnements avec facilité","Garantir la fiabilité et surveiller les performances du système pour une réponse rapide aux incidents"],"de":["Automatisieren von Build-, Test- und Verpackungsschritten für eine effiziente Software-Lieferung","Bereitstellen von Anwendungen in verschiedenen Umgebungen mit Leichtigkeit","Sicherstellen der Zuverlässigkeit und Überwachung der Systemleistung für eine schnelle Reaktion auf Zwischenfälle"],"pt":["Automatizar compilação, teste e embalagem para entrega de software eficiente","Implantar aplicações em vários ambientes com facilidade","Garantir confiabilidade e monitorar o desempenho do sistema para resposta rápida a incidentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сборку, тестирование и упаковку для эффективной поставки программного обеспечения","Развертывать приложения в нескольких средах с легкостью","Обеспечивать надежность и мониторить производительность системы для оперативного реагирования на инциденты"],"ar":["تأتمة عملية البناء والاختبار والتغليف لنشر البرمجيات بفعالية","نشر التطبيقات عبر بيئات متعددة بسهولة","ضمان الموثوقية ومراقبة أداء النظام للاستجابة السريعة للحوادث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in CI/CD pipelines and infrastructure as code","Dependent on specific deployment environments and technologies","Needs access to version control systems like GitHub for pipeline integration"],"zh":["需要CI/CD流水线和基础设施即代码的专业知识","依赖于特定的部署环境和技术","需要访问版本控制系统，如GitHub，用于流水线集成"],"ja":["CI/CDパイプラインとインフラストラクチャーとしてのコードの専門知識が必要","特定のデプロイ環境とテクノロジーに依存する","パイプライン統合のためにGitHubなどのバージョン管理システムへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["CI/CD 파이프라인과 인프라스트럭처 코드의 전문 지식이 필요함","특정 배포 환경과 기술에 의존함","파이프라인 통합을 위해 GitHub와 같은 버전 관리 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en tuberías de CI/CD y gestión de infraestructura como código","Dependiente de entornos de implementación y tecnologías específicas","Necesita acceso a sistemas de control de versiones como GitHub para la integración de tuberías"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise dans les pipelines CI/CD et la gestion d''infrastructure en tant que code","Dépendante d''environnements de déploiement et de technologies spécifiques","Nécessite un accès aux systèmes de contrôle de version comme GitHub pour l''intégration de pipelines"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung mit CI/CD-Pipelines und Infrastruktur-als-Code-Verwaltung","Abhängig von spezifischen Deploy-Umgebungen und Technologien","Benötigt Zugriff auf Versionskontrollsysteme wie GitHub für die Pipeline-Integration"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento especializado em pipelines de CI/CD e infraestrutura como código","Depende de ambientes de implantação e tecnologias específicas","Necessita acesso a sistemas de controle de versão como o GitHub para integração de pipeline"],"ru":["Требует специализированных знаний в области конвейеров CI/CD и инфраструктуры как кода","Зависит от конкретных сред развертывания и технологий","Требует доступа к системам контроля версий, таким как GitHub, для интеграции конвейера"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة متخصصة في أنابيب CI/CD والبنية التحتية كود","يعتمد على بيئات النشر والتكنولوجيا المحددة","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى أنظمة التحكم في الإصدارات مثل جيثب لدمج الأنابيب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('octarine-public/wrapper/octarine-wrapper', 'community', 'octarine-public', 'wrapper', 'octarine-public/wrapper', 'octarine-wrapper', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z', '2026-02-18T08:56:02.428Z', NULL, '{"id":"octarine-public/wrapper/octarine-wrapper","name":"octarine-wrapper","description":{"zh":"Octarine Wrapper 是一个基于 TypeScript 的 SDK 封装，提供了严格的类型检查和代码风格统一。它支持 TypeScript 5.x 严格模式和 ESLint + Prettier 代码风格检查","ja":"Octarine Wrapper は TypeScript ベースの SDK ラッパーで、厳格な型チェックとコードスタイルの統一を提供します。TypeScript 5.x の厳格モードと ESLint + Prettier のコードスタイルチェックをサポートしています","ko":"Octarine Wrapper는 TypeScript 기반의 SDK 래퍼로 엄격한 타입 검사와 코드 스타일 통일을 제공합니다. TypeScript 5.x의 엄격 모드와 ESLint + Prettier의 코드 스타일 검사를 지원합니다","es":"El Octarine Wrapper es un SDK de TypeScript que proporciona una amplia gama de herramientas y utilidades para el desarrollo de aplicaciones avanzadas","fr":"Octarine Wrapper est un SDK TypeScript qui fournit une large gamme d''outils et d''utilitaires pour le développement d''applications avancées","de":"Der Octarine Wrapper ist ein TypeScript-SDK, das eine breite Palette von Tools und Utilities für die Entwicklung von fortschrittlichen Anwendungen bietet","pt":"A Octarine Wrapper é uma biblioteca TypeScript que fornece funcionalidades avançadas para desenvolvedores, incluindo SDK e extensões JavaScript","ru":"Octarine Wrapper - это библиотека TypeScript, которая предоставляет расширенные функции для разработчиков, включая SDK и расширения JavaScript","ar":"Octarine Wrapper هي مكتبة TypeScript توفر 기능 متقدمة للمطورين، بما في ذلك SDK وامتدادات JavaScript","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Octarine Wrapper：TypeScript SDK 封装","ja":"Octarine Wrapper：TypeScript SDK ラッパー","ko":"Octarine Wrapper：TypeScript SDK 래퍼","es":"Octarine Wrapper: SDK de TypeScript para desarrollo avanzado","fr":"Octarine Wrapper : SDK TypeScript pour développement avancé","de":"Octarine Wrapper: TypeScript-SDK für fortschrittliche Ent...","pt":"Octarine Wrapper: Biblioteca TypeScript para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Octarine Wrapper: TypeScript-библиотека для разработчиков","ar":"Octarine Wrapper: مكتبة TypeScript لالمطورين","en":"octarine-wrapper"},"description":{"zh":"Octarine Wrapper 是一个基于 TypeScript 的 SDK 封装，提供了严格的类型检查和代码风格统一。它支持 TypeScript 5.x 严格模式和 ESLint + Prettier 代码风格检查","ja":"Octarine Wrapper は TypeScript ベースの SDK ラッパーで、厳格な型チェックとコードスタイルの統一を提供します。TypeScript 5.x の厳格モードと ESLint + Prettier のコードスタイルチェックをサポートしています","ko":"Octarine Wrapper는 TypeScript 기반의 SDK 래퍼로 엄격한 타입 검사와 코드 스타일 통일을 제공합니다. TypeScript 5.x의 엄격 모드와 ESLint + Prettier의 코드 스타일 검사를 지원합니다","es":"El Octarine Wrapper es un SDK de TypeScript que proporciona una amplia gama de herramientas y utilidades para el desarrollo de aplicaciones avanzadas","fr":"Octarine Wrapper est un SDK TypeScript qui fournit une large gamme d''outils et d''utilitaires pour le développement d''applications avancées","de":"Der Octarine Wrapper ist ein TypeScript-SDK, das eine breite Palette von Tools und Utilities für die Entwicklung von fortschrittlichen Anwendungen bietet","pt":"A Octarine Wrapper é uma biblioteca TypeScript que fornece funcionalidades avançadas para desenvolvedores, incluindo SDK e extensões JavaScript","ru":"Octarine Wrapper - это библиотека TypeScript, которая предоставляет расширенные функции для разработчиков, включая SDK и расширения JavaScript","ar":"Octarine Wrapper هي مكتبة TypeScript توفر 기능 متقدمة للمطورين، بما في ذلك SDK وامتدادات JavaScript","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["基于 TypeScript 5.x 严格模式","支持 ESLint + Prettier 代码风格检查","提供严格的类型检查","支持 node ≥ 18","包含 JS 内置扩展（Number、BigInt、Array、Math）"],"ja":["TypeScript 5.x の厳格モードに基づく","ESLint + Prettier のコードスタイルチェックをサポート","厳格な型チェックを提供","node ≥ 18 をサポート","JS 内置拡張（Number、BigInt、Array、Math）を含む"],"ko":["TypeScript 5.x의 엄격 모드 기반","ESLint + Prettier의 코드 스타일 검사를 지원","엄격한 타입 검사를 제공","node ≥ 18을 지원","JS 내장 확장（Number、BigInt、Array、Math）을 포함"],"es":["Compatibilidad con TypeScript 5.x","Integración con ESLint y Prettier","Soporte para node ≥ 18","Extensión de tipos de datos JavaScript","Utilidades y herramientas para desarrollo avanzado"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec TypeScript 5.x","Intégration avec ESLint et Prettier","Prise en charge de node ≥ 18","Extension des types de données JavaScript","Utilitaires et outils pour le développement avancé"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit TypeScript 5.x","Integration mit ESLint und Prettier","Unterstützung für node ≥ 18","Erweiterung der JavaScript-Datentypen","Utilities und Tools für die fortschrittliche Entwicklung"],"pt":["SDK avançado","Extensões JavaScript","Suporte a TypeScript 5.x","Integração com ESLint e Prettier","Comandos para verificar tipos e lint"],"ru":["Расширенный SDK","Расширения JavaScript","Поддержка TypeScript 5.x","Интеграция с ESLint и Prettier","Команды для проверки типов и lint"],"ar":["SDK متقدم","امتدادات JavaScript","دعم TypeScript 5.x","تكامل مع ESLint و Prettier","أوامر للتحقق من الأنواع وLint"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TypeScript SDK","Octarine Wrapper","严格类型检查","代码风格统一","ESLint","Prettier","nodejs"],"ja":["TypeScript SDK","Octarine Wrapper","厳格な型チェック","コードスタイルの統一","ESLint","Prettier","nodejs"],"ko":["TypeScript SDK","Octarine Wrapper","엄격한 타입 검사","코드 스타일 통일","ESLint","Prettier","nodejs"],"es":["Octarine Wrapper","TypeScript","SDK","desarrollo de aplicaciones","JavaScript","ESLint","Prettier","node"],"fr":["Octarine Wrapper","TypeScript","SDK","développement d''applications","JavaScript","ESLint","Prettier","node"],"de":["Octarine Wrapper","TypeScript","SDK","Anwendungsentwicklung","JavaScript","ESLint","Prettier","node"],"pt":["Octarine Wrapper","TypeScript","JavaScript","SDK","Desenvolvimento de software","Bibliotecas TypeScript","Extensões JavaScript","ESLint","Prettier"],"ru":["Octarine Wrapper","TypeScript","JavaScript","SDK","Разработка программного обеспечения","Библиотеки TypeScript","Расширения JavaScript","ESLint","Prettier"],"ar":["Octarine Wrapper","TypeScript","JavaScript","SDK","تطوير البرمجيات","مكتبات TypeScript","امتدادات JavaScript","ESLint","Prettier"]}},"owner":"octarine-public","repo":"wrapper","repoPath":"octarine-public/wrapper","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"octarine-wrapper","description":"Conventions and layout for octarine-wrapper (TS SDK for Dota 2). Use when editing code, adding abilities/items/modifiers, or working with prototypes/scripts_files.","bodyPreview":"**Stack:** TypeScript 5.x strict, ESLint + Prettier, node ≥ 18. Commands: `yarn check-types`, `yarn lint`, `yarn check-circular`.\n\n---\n\n**Repo root**\n\n- **wrapper/** — All SDK code (Base, Enums, Native, Objects, GUI, Menu, Managers, Utils, Helpers, Resources, Tests).\n- **prototypes/** — JS built-in extensions (Number, BigInt, Array, Math). Files: `array.ts`, `bigint.ts`, `index.ts`, `math.ts`, `number.ts`. In scripts: `import \"github.com/octarine-public/wrapper/prototypes/bigint\"` etc.\n- **scrip","body":"**Stack:** TypeScript 5.x strict, ESLint + Prettier, node ≥ 18. Commands: `yarn check-types`, `yarn lint`, `yarn check-circular`.\n\n---\n\n**Repo root**\n\n- **wrapper/** — All SDK code (Base, Enums, Native, Objects, GUI, Menu, Managers, Utils, Helpers, Resources, Tests).\n- **prototypes/** — JS built-in extensions (Number, BigInt, Array, Math). Files: `array.ts`, `bigint.ts`, `index.ts`, `math.ts`, `number.ts`. In scripts: `import \"github.com/octarine-public/wrapper/prototypes/bigint\"` etc.\n- **scripts_files/** — Script assets. Read via `wrapper/Utils/readFile.ts` and `tryFindFile(path)` — path is resolved relative to the script folder inside `scripts_files/`. Contents: `images/`, `materials/`, `menu/`, `models/`, `particles/` (subfolders range_display, range_line, range_linear, target, vbe, etc.), `translations/` (cn.json, en.json, ru.json), `network_particles.json`, `network_projectile.json`.\n- **index.ts** (root) — Main entry: imports `global`, `translations`, re-exports from `wrapper/Imports`. Scripts import the wrapper via this file. **global.ts** — imports `prototypes/index` (loaded by index).\n- Types at root: `octarine.d.ts`, `octarine-core.d.ts`, `standard.d.ts`.\n\n---\n\n**wrapper/ — folders and files**\n\n- **Base/** — Base types: AABB, Color, Vector2/3/4, Matrix3x4, QAngle, Quaternion, Particle, Rectangle, PlayerData, EntityProperties, etc.\n- **Objects/Base/** — Base entity classes: Ability.ts, Building.ts, Creep.ts, Courier, CustomPickRules, AdditionalWearable, CameraBounds, CreepPathCorner, etc.\n- **Enums/** — All enums (ABILITY_TYPES, DOTA_ABILITY_BEHAVIOR, DOTA_UNIT_TARGET_*, DOTA_RUNES, DAMAGE_TYPES, EventPriority, modifierstate, Team, etc.). File names PascalCase or UPPER_SNAKE.\n- **Native/** — Engine native calls.\n- **Objects/Abilities/** — Abilities. Subfolders by owner in PascalCase (hero or unit: Axe, AntiMage, Invoker, Courier, Roshan, BeastmasterBoar, …) and **Base/** for shared; inside each folder — files named by ability id (e.g. `axe_battle_hunger.ts`).\n- **Objects/Items/** — Items. Flat list of `item_*.ts` files (item_branches.ts, item_ultimate_scepter.ts, etc.).\n- **Objects/Modifiers/** — Modifiers. Subfolders: **Abilities/** (many files), **Base/** (modifier_bashed, modifier_rooted, modifier_stunned, etc.), **Buildings/**, **Items/**, **Runes/** (modifier_rune_arcane, modifier_rune_haste, etc.). File names: `modifier_*.ts`.\n- **Objects/Heroes/**, **Creeps/**, **Units/**, **Buildings/** — Heroes, creeps, units, buildings (files/subfolders by id or type).\n- **Objects/DataBook/** — AbilityData, Inventory, UnitData, UnitModifierManager, PlayerCustomData.\n- **GUI/**, **Menu/**, **Managers/** — UI and managers (CLowerHUD, CMinimap, CShop, EventsSDK, etc.).\n- **Utils/**, **Helpers/** — readFile, tryFindFile, ArrayExtensions, GameState, Math, Protobuf, DotaMap, Sleeper, etc.\n- **Resources/** — ParseEntityLump, ParseGNV, ParseMaterial, ParseTRMP, ParseUtils.\n- **Tests/** — Abilities.ts, Modifiers.ts, Units.ts.\n\n---\n\n**Naming**\n\n- Entity file = game id: `item_aghanims_shard.ts`, `modifier_rune_haste.ts`, `npc_dota_hero_axe.ts`.\n- Class = PascalCase from id: ItemAghanimsShard, ModifierRuneHaste, NpcDotaHeroAxe. Extend from the right base in `wrapper/Base/` or `wrapper/Objects/Base/`.\n- New enum — in `wrapper/Enums/`, file name by meaning (PascalCase).\n\n---\n\n**Adding a new entity**\n\n- **Ability:** In `wrapper/Objects/Abilities/<Owner>/` — subfolder is PascalCase by owner (hero or unit, e.g. Axe, Invoker, Courier, Roshan, BeastmasterBoar); use **Base/** for shared abilities. File name = ability id (e.g. `axe_battle_hunger.ts`); class extends the appropriate base Ability.\n- **Item:** New file `item_<id>.ts` in `wrapper/Objects/Items/`; class Item*.\n- **Modifier:** In the right Modifiers subfolder (Abilities / Items / Base / Runes / Buildings); file `modifier_<id>.ts`; class Modifier*.\n- **New enum:** File in `wrapper/Enums/`.\n\nWhen adding assets (textures, particles, translations) — put them in the right **scripts_files/** subfolders and access via `readFile`/`tryFindFile` with a path relative to `scripts_files/`.\n\n---\n\n**Response style**\n\n- Minimal edits; do not refactor unrelated code.\n- When suggesting multiple new files — one full example + “same pattern for …” with path and name.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:56:02.428Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript-based AI Agents needing advanced SDK development and native object management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级 SDK 开发和本地对象管理功能的基于 TypeScript 的 AI 代理。","ja":"TypeScript ベースの AI エージェントに適しており、SDK 開発とネイティブ オブジェクト管理機能が必要です。","ko":"TypeScript 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 고급 SDK 개발 및 네이티브 객체 관리 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en TypeScript que requieren un desarrollo de SDK avanzado y capacidades de gestión de objetos nativos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur TypeScript nécessitant un développement de SDK avancé et des capacités de gestion d''objets natifs.","de":"Perfekt für auf TypeScript basierende KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte SDK-Entwicklung und native Objektverwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que precisam de desenvolvimento de SDK avançado e capacidades de gerenciamento de objetos nativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, которым требуются продвинутые возможности разработки SDK и управления родными объектами.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل إيه آي التي تعتمد على TypeScript وتحتاج إلى تطوير SDK متقدم وقدرات إدارة كائنات محلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage complex SDKs using TypeScript 5.x strict, ESLint, and Prettier, while extending JS built-in prototypes like Number, BigInt, and Array, and leveraging node.js version 18 or higher for efficient execution.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理复杂的 SDK 的能力，使用 TypeScript 5.x 严格、ESLint 和 Prettier，同时扩展 JS 内置原型，如 Number、BigInt 和 Array，并利用 node.js 版本 18 或更高版本实现高效执行。","ja":"TypeScript 5.x 厳格、ESLint、Prettier を使用して複雑な SDK を作成および管理するエージェントを可能にし、Number、BigInt、Array などの JS のビルトインプロトタイプを拡張し、node.js バージョン 18 以上を使用して効率的な実行を実現します。","ko":"TypeScript 5.x 엄격한 모드, ESLint, Prettier를 사용하여 복잡한 SDK를 만들고 관리할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, Number, BigInt, Arrayなどの JS 내장 프로토 타입을 확장하고 node.js 버전 18이상에서 효율적인 실행을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar SDK complejos utilizando TypeScript 5.x estricto, ESLint y Prettier, mientras se extienden los prototipos integrados de JS como Number, BigInt y Array, y aprovechan la versión 18 o superior de node.js para una ejecución eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des SDK complexes en utilisant TypeScript 5.x strict, ESLint et Prettier, tout en étendant les prototypes intégrés de JS tels que Number, BigInt et Array, et en exploitant la version 18 ou supérieure de node.js pour une exécution efficace.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, komplexe SDKs mit TypeScript 5.x strict, ESLint und Prettier zu erstellen und zu verwalten, während die JS-integrierten Prototypen wie Number, BigInt und Array erweitert werden und node.js-Version 18 oder höher für eine effiziente Ausführung genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar SDKs complexos usando TypeScript 5.x strict, ESLint e Prettier, além de estender protótipos internos do JS como Number, BigInt e Array, e aproveitar a versão 18 ou superior do node.js para execução eficiente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять сложными SDK, используя TypeScript 5.x strict, ESLint и Prettier, а также расширять встроенные прототипы JS, такие как Number, BigInt и Array, и использовать версию 18 или выше node.js для эффективного выполнения.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء وإدارة SDKs معقدة باستخدام TypeScript 5.x strict و ESLint و Prettier، بالإضافة إلى توسيع البروتوتايب المدمجة في JS مثل Number و BigInt و Array، وتحقيق الإصدار 18 أو أعلى من node.js من أجل التنفيذ الفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing and testing SDKs with yarn check-types and yarn lint commands","Extending JavaScript built-in prototypes for custom functionality","Managing native objects and resources within the wrapper framework"],"zh":["使用 yarn check-types 和 yarn lint 命令开发和测试 SDK","扩展 JavaScript 内置原型以实现自定义功能","在包装框架内管理本地对象和资源"],"ja":["yarn check-types および yarn lint コマンドを使用して SDK を開発およびテストする","JavaScript のビルトインプロトタイプを拡張してカスタム機能を実現する","ラッパーフレームワーク内でネイティブオブジェクトおよびリソースを管理する"],"ko":["yarn check-types 및 yarn lint 명령을 사용하여 SDK를 개발 및 테스트합니다.","JavaScript 내장 프로토 타입을 확장하여 사용자 지정 기능을 구현합니다.","래퍼 프레임워크 내에서 네이티브 객체 및 리소스를 관리합니다."],"es":["Desarrollar y probar SDK con los comandos yarn check-types y yarn lint","Extender los prototipos integrados de JavaScript para funcionalidades personalizadas","Gestionar objetos y recursos nativos dentro del marco de wrapper"],"fr":["Développer et tester des SDK avec les commandes yarn check-types et yarn lint","Étendre les prototypes intégrés de JavaScript pour des fonctionnalités personnalisées","Gérer les objets et les ressources natifs dans le cadre de wrapper"],"de":["Entwickeln und Testen von SDKs mit den Befehlen yarn check-types und yarn lint","Erweitern der JS-integrierten Prototypen für benutzerdefinierte Funktionalitäten","Verwalten von nativen Objekten und Ressourcen innerhalb des Wrapper-Frameworks"],"pt":["Desenvolver e testar SDKs com comandos yarn check-types e yarn lint","Estender protótipos internos do JavaScript para funcionalidades personalizadas","Gerenciar objetos e recursos nativos dentro do framework de wrapper"],"ru":["Разработка и тестирование SDK с помощью команд yarn check-types и yarn lint","Расширение встроенных прототипов JavaScript для пользовательской функциональности","Управление родными объектами и ресурсами внутри фреймворка-оболочки"],"ar":["تطوير واختبار SDKs باستخدام أوامر yarn check-types و yarn lint","توسيع البروتوتايب المدمجة في JavaScript للوظائف المخصصة","إدارة الكائنات والموارد المحلية داخل إطار Wrapper"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires node.js version 18 or higher","TypeScript 5.x strict compatibility only","Dependent on yarn package manager for commands like yarn check-types and yarn lint"],"zh":["需要 node.js 版本 18 或更高版本","仅兼容 TypeScript 5.x 严格模式","依赖于 yarn 包管理器以使用诸如 yarn check-types 和 yarn lint 之类的命令"],"ja":["node.js バージョン 18 以上が必要","TypeScript 5.x 厳格モードのみとの互換性","yarn check-types や yarn lint などのコマンドを使用するために yarn パッケージマネージャーに依存"],"ko":["node.js 버전 18 이상이 필요합니다.","TypeScript 5.x 엄격한 모드만과 호환됩니다.","yarn check-types 및 yarn lint와 같은 명령을 사용하는 데 yarn 패키지 관리자에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere la versión 18 o superior de node.js","Compatibilidad solo con TypeScript 5.x estricto","Dependiente del gestor de paquetes yarn para comandos como yarn check-types y yarn lint"],"fr":["Nécessite la version 18 ou supérieure de node.js","Compatibilité uniquement avec TypeScript 5.x strict","Dépendant du gestionnaire de paquets yarn pour des commandes comme yarn check-types et yarn lint"],"de":["Benötigt node.js-Version 18 oder höher","Kompatibilität nur mit TypeScript 5.x strict","Abhängig vom Paket-Manager yarn für Befehle wie yarn check-types und yarn lint"],"pt":["Exige node.js versão 18 ou superior","Compatibilidade apenas com TypeScript 5.x strict","Dependente do gerenciador de pacotes yarn para comandos como yarn check-types e yarn lint"],"ru":["Требует node.js версии 18 или выше","Совместимость только с TypeScript 5.x strict","Зависит от менеджера пакетов yarn для команд, таких как yarn check-types и yarn lint"],"ar":["يتطلب node.js الإصدار 18 أو أعلى","التوافق مع TypeScript 5.x strict فقط","يعتمد على مدير الحزم yarn للأوامر مثل yarn check-types و yarn lint"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('matsuni-kk/agent_template_public/agent-deploy', 'community', 'matsuni-kk', 'agent_template_public', 'matsuni-kk/agent_template_public', 'agent-deploy', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z', '2026-02-18T08:55:48.354Z', NULL, '{"id":"matsuni-kk/agent_template_public/agent-deploy","name":"agent-deploy","description":{"zh":"Agent Deploy 是一个用于生成和部署域特定代理的框架，提供了快速和高效的开发体验","ja":"Agent Deploy はドメイン特定エージェントを生成およびデプロイするためのフレームワークであり、迅速で高効率な開発体験を提供する","ko":"Agent Deploy는 도메인 특정 에이전트를 생성하고 배포하기 위한 프레임워크로 빠르고 효율적인 개발 경험을 제공합니다","es":"El marco de trabajo de agentes es una plantilla para la generación de agentes específicos de dominio. Ofrece un flujo de trabajo para implementar y desplegar agentes en GitHub.","fr":"Le cadre de travail d''agents est un modèle pour la génération d''agents spécifiques à un domaine. Il propose un flux de travail pour déployer et mettre en œuvre des agents sur GitHub.","de":"Das Agenten-Arbeitsframework ist eine Vorlage für die Erzeugung von domänen-spezifischen Agents. Es bietet einen Arbeitsablauf zur Implementierung und Bereitstellung von Agents in GitHub.","pt":"O framework de template de agente permite a geração de agentes específicos de domínio. Siga as instruções para implantar seu agente personalizado","ru":"Фреймворк шаблона агента позволяет генерировать домен-специфичных агентов. Следуйте инструкциям, чтобы развернуть вашего индивидуального агента","ar":"إطار عمل قالب للوكلاء يسمح بالتحكم في الوكلاء المحدد لمنطقة معينة. اتبع الإرشادات لتوزيع وكيلك المخصص","en":"Agent Template Framework for Domain-Specific Agent Generation - Public Version"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Agent Deploy 框架：域特定代理生成","ja":"Agent Deploy フレームワーク：ドメイン特定エージェント生成","ko":"Agent Deploy 프레임워크: 도메인 특정 에이전트 생성","es":"Implementación de Agentes: Marco de Trabajo para Desarrol...","fr":"Déploiement d''Agents : Cadre de Travail pour les Développ...","de":"Agent-Implementierung: Arbeitsframework für Entwickler","pt":"Implantação de Agentes: Framework de Template para Geraçã...","ru":"Развертывание Агентов: Фреймворк Шаблона для Генерации До...","ar":"توزيع الوكلاء: إطار عمل قالب للتحكم في الوكلاء المحدد لمن...","en":"agent-deploy"},"description":{"zh":"Agent Deploy 是一个用于生成和部署域特定代理的框架，提供了快速和高效的开发体验","ja":"Agent Deploy はドメイン特定エージェントを生成およびデプロイするためのフレームワークであり、迅速で高効率な開発体験を提供する","ko":"Agent Deploy는 도메인 특정 에이전트를 생성하고 배포하기 위한 프레임워크로 빠르고 효율적인 개발 경험을 제공합니다","es":"El marco de trabajo de agentes es una plantilla para la generación de agentes específicos de dominio. Ofrece un flujo de trabajo para implementar y desplegar...","fr":"Le cadre de travail d''agents est un modèle pour la génération d''agents spécifiques à un domaine. Il propose un flux de travail pour déployer et mettre en œuv...","de":"Das Agenten-Arbeitsframework ist eine Vorlage für die Erzeugung von domänen-spezifischen Agents. Es bietet einen Arbeitsablauf zur Implementierung und Bereit...","pt":"O framework de template de agente permite a geração de agentes específicos de domínio. Siga as instruções para implantar seu agente personalizado","ru":"Фреймворк шаблона агента позволяет генерировать домен-специфичных агентов. Следуйте инструкциям, чтобы развернуть вашего индивидуального агента","ar":"إطار عمل قالب للوكلاء يسمح بالتحكم في الوكلاء المحدد لمنطقة معينة. اتبع الإرشادات لتوزيع وكيلك المخصص","en":"Agent Template Framework for Domain-Specific Agent Generation - Public Version"},"definition":{"en":"Agent Template Framework for Domain-Specific Agent Generation - Public Version"},"features":{"zh":["快速生成和部署域特定代理","支持多平台同期","提供 Preflight 检查和 gh CLI 认证","支持脚本更新和同步","生成 GitHub 私有仓库 URL"],"ja":["ドメイン特定エージェントを迅速に生成およびデプロイする","マルチプラットフォーム同期をサポートする","Preflight チェックと gh CLI 認証を提供する","スクリプト更新と同期をサポートする","GitHub プライベートリポジトリ URL を生成する"],"ko":["도메인 특정 에이전트를 빠르게 생성하고 배포합니다","멀티 플랫폼 同기화를 지원합니다","Preflight 확인과 gh CLI 인증을 제공합니다","스크립트 업데이트 및 同기화를 지원합니다","GitHub 프라이ベ트 리포지토리 URL을 생성합니다"],"es":["Generación de agentes personalizados","Despliegue en GitHub","Flujo de trabajo para la implementación","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Autenticación con gh CLI"],"fr":["Génération d''agents personnalisés","Déploiement sur GitHub","Flux de travail pour la mise en œuvre","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Authentification avec gh CLI"],"de":["Erzeugung von benutzerdefinierten Agents","Bereitstellung in GitHub","Arbeitsablauf für die Implementierung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Authentifizierung mit gh CLI"],"pt":["Geração de agentes específicos de domínio","Implantação em repositórios GitHub privados","Verificação de pré-voo para garantir a implantação correta","Suporte à sincronização de multiplataformas","Recursos de script para personalização","Integração com a CLI do GitHub"],"ru":["Генерация домен-специфичных агентов","Развертывание в приватных репозиториях GitHub","Предполетная проверка для обеспечения правильного развертывания","Поддержка синхронизации мультиплатформ","Ресурсы скриптов для настройки","Интеграция с CLI GitHub"],"ar":["التحكم في الوكلاء المحدد لمنطقة معينة","التوزيع في مستودعات GitHub الخاصة","فحص ما قبل الطيران لضمان التوزيع الصحيح","دعم مزامنة منصات متعددة","موارد البرمجيات للتعديل","الدمج مع واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agent Deploy","域特定代理","生成和部署","多平台同期","Preflight 检查","gh CLI 认证"],"ja":["Agent Deploy","ドメイン特定エージェント","生成およびデプロイ","マルチプラットフォーム同期","Preflight チェック","gh CLI 認証"],"ko":["Agent Deploy","도메인 특정 에이전트","생성 및 배포","멀티 플랫폼 同기화","Preflight 확인","gh CLI 인증"],"es":["agentes personalizados","despliegue de agentes","github","flujo de trabajo","implementación de agentes","dominios específicos"],"fr":["agents personnalisés","déploiement d''agents","github","flux de travail","mise en œuvre d''agents","domaines spécifiques"],"de":["benutzerdefinierte Agents","Bereitstellung von Agents","github","Arbeitsablauf","Implementierung von Agents","bestimmte Domänen"],"pt":["framework de template de agente","geração de agentes","implantação de agentes","repositórios GitHub privados","sincronização de multiplataformas","script de personalização","CLI do GitHub"],"ru":["фреймворк шаблона агента","генерация агентов","развертывание агентов","приватные репозитории GitHub","синхронизация мультиплатформ","ресурсы скриптов","CLI GitHub"],"ar":["إطار عمل قالب للوكلاء","التحكم في الوكلاء","توزيع الوكلاء","مستودعات GitHub الخاصة","مزامنة منصات متعددة","موارد البرمجيات","واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub"]}},"owner":"matsuni-kk","repo":"agent_template_public","repoPath":"matsuni-kk/agent_template_public","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-deploy","description":"生成したエージェントをGitHubプライベートリポジトリとして公開する。「デプロイ」「リポジトリ作成」「公開」を依頼されたときに使用する。","bodyPreview":"# Agent Deploy Workflow\n\n生成したエージェントをGitHubプライベートリポジトリとして公開する。主成果物はGitHubリポジトリURL。\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Preflight（事前確認）\n- `./assets/deploy_checklist.md` を先に読み、必須項目を確認する。\n- 対象エージェントのディレクトリパスを確認する（output/{agent_name}/）。\n- 以下のファイルが存在するか確認する:\n  - CLAUDE.md（必須）\n  - README.md（必須）\n  - .cursor/skills/（必須）\n  - scripts/（推奨）\n- gh CLI が認証済みか確認する。\n\n### 2. マルチプラットフォーム同期\n- update_agent_master.py を **Claude起点で** 実行してマスターファイルを同期する:\n  ```bash\n  cd output/{agent_name}\n  python3 scripts/update_agent_master.py --","body":"# Agent Deploy Workflow\n\n生成したエージェントをGitHubプライベートリポジトリとして公開する。主成果物はGitHubリポジトリURL。\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Preflight（事前確認）\n- `./assets/deploy_checklist.md` を先に読み、必須項目を確認する。\n- 対象エージェントのディレクトリパスを確認する（output/{agent_name}/）。\n- 以下のファイルが存在するか確認する:\n  - CLAUDE.md（必須）\n  - README.md（必須）\n  - .cursor/skills/（必須）\n  - scripts/（推奨）\n- gh CLI が認証済みか確認する。\n\n### 2. マルチプラットフォーム同期\n- update_agent_master.py を **Claude起点で** 実行してマスターファイルを同期する:\n  ```bash\n  cd output/{agent_name}\n  python3 scripts/update_agent_master.py --source claude --force\n  ```\n- 同期対象:\n  - CLAUDE.md → AGENTS.md\n  - CLAUDE.md → .github/copilot-instructions.md\n  - CLAUDE.md → .gemini/GEMINI.md\n  - CLAUDE.md → .kiro/steering/KIRO.md\n\n### 3. .gitignore 確認\n- .gitignore が存在しない場合は作成する。\n- `./assets/gitignore_template.md` を参照する。\n- 以下を除外対象に含める:\n  - .env\n  - *.log\n  - node_modules/\n  - .DS_Store\n\n### 4. Git初期化・コミット\n- 以下の手順でGitリポジトリを初期化する:\n  ```bash\n  cd output/{agent_name}\n  git init\n  git add .\n  git commit -m \"Initial release: {Agent Name}\n\n  🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n  Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\"\n  ```\n\n### 5. GitHubリポジトリ作成（プライベート）\n- gh CLI でプライベートリポジトリを作成する:\n  ```bash\n  gh repo create {agent_name} --private --source=. --push\n  ```\n- リポジトリURLを記録する。\n\n### 6. QC（必須）\n- `recommended_subagents` のQC Subagent（`qa-skill-qc`）に評価を委譲する。\n- Subagentは `./evaluation/deploy_criteria.md` をReadし、QCを実施する。\n- 指摘を最小差分で反映する（最大3回）。\n\n### 7. バックログ反映\n- リポジトリURLをタスクリストに記録する。\n- deploy_done=true を記録する。\n\n### 8. デプロイ後クリーンアップ（推奨）\n- デプロイ完了（push成功 + リポジトリURL取得）後、ローカルの `output/{agent_name}/` を削除して作業生成物を片付ける。\n- 破壊的操作になるため、削除前にユーザーへ削除対象パスを提示し、明示的な許可を得る。\n- 可能なら `post-deploy-cleanup` Skill に委譲して実行する（対象: output/ と Flow/ などの一時ファイル）。\n\nsubagent_policy:\n  - 品質ループ（QC/チェック/フィードバック）は必ずサブエージェントへ委譲する\n  - サブエージェントの指摘を反映し、反映結果（修正有無/理由）を成果物に残す\n\nrecommended_subagents:\n  - qa-skill-qc: 必須ファイル存在、マルチプラットフォーム同期、リポジトリ作成を検査\n\n## Resources\n- assets: ./assets/deploy_checklist.md\n- assets: ./assets/gitignore_template.md\n- evaluation: ./evaluation/deploy_criteria.md\n- scripts: scripts/update_agent_master.py\n- triggers: ./triggers/next_action_triggers.md\n\n## Next Action\n- triggers: ./triggers/next_action_triggers.md\n\n起動条件に従い、条件を満たすSkillを自動実行する。\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:55:48.354Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring streamlined deployment to GitHub private repositories, such as those built with Claude Code or AutoGPT.","zh":"适用于需要简化部署到 GitHub 私有仓库的 AI 代理，例如使用 Claude Code 或 AutoGPT 构建的代理。","ja":"GitHub のプライベートリポジトリへのデプロイをストリームライン化する必要がある Claude Code または AutoGPT で構築されたものなどの AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 개인 저장소에 대한 배포를 간소화해야 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. Claude Code 또는 AutoGPT로 구축된 에이전트와 같은 경우가 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren una implementación optimizada en repositorios privados de GitHub, como aquellos construidos con Claude Code o AutoGPT.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant un déploiement simplifié vers les dépôts privés GitHub, tels que ceux construits avec Claude Code ou AutoGPT.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die eine optimierte Bereitstellung in privaten GitHub-Repositorys erfordern, wie z.B. solche, die mit Claude Code oder AutoGPT erstellt wurden.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA que exigem implantação simplificada para repositórios privados do GitHub, como aqueles construídos com Claude Code ou AutoGPT.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих упрощенной развертки в приватные репозитории GitHub, такие как те, которые построены с помощью Claude Code или AutoGPT.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يتطلبون نشرًا مبسطًا لمستودعات GitHub الخاصة، مثل تلك التي تم بناؤها باستخدام Claude Code أو AutoGPT."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate the deployment of domain-specific agent templates, leveraging GitHub CLI for authentication and facilitating multi-platform synchronization through Python scripts like update_agent_master.py, ensuring seamless integration with required files like CLAUDE.md and README.md.","zh":"赋予代理自动化部署特定于领域的代理模板的能力，利用 GitHub CLI 进行身份验证，并通过 Python 脚本（如 update_agent_master.py）实现跨平台同步，确保与所需文件（如 CLAUDE.md 和 README.md）进行无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントは、GitHub CLI を使用した認証と Python スクリプト（update_agent_master.py など）を介したマルチプラットフォーム同期を利用して、ドメイン固有のエージェントテンプレートのデプロイを自動化する機能を提供し、必要なファイル（CLAUDE.md や README.md など）とシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트는 도메인 특정 에이전트 템플릿의 배포를 자동화하고 GitHub CLI를 사용한 인증 및 Python 스크립트(예: update_agent_master.py)를 통해 멀티 플랫폼 동기화를 제공하여 필요한 파일(예: CLAUDE.md 및 README.md)과 무결점으로 통합할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la implementación de plantillas de agentes específicas del dominio, aprovechando GitHub CLI para la autenticación y facilitando la sincronización multiplataforma a través de scripts de Python como update_agent_master.py, garantizando una integración sin problemas con archivos necesarios como CLAUDE.md y README.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser le déploiement de modèles d''agents spécifiques au domaine, en exploitant GitHub CLI pour l''authentification et en facilitant la synchronisation multiplateforme via des scripts Python tels que update_agent_master.py, assurant une intégration sans problème avec des fichiers nécessaires comme CLAUDE.md et README.md.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Bereitstellung von branchenspezifischen Agenten-Vorlagen zu automatisieren, indem GitHub CLI für die Authentifizierung genutzt und eine Multi-Plattform-Synchronisierung durch Python-Skripte wie update_agent_master.py erleichtert wird, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit erforderlichen Dateien wie CLAUDE.md und README.md gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a automatizar a implantação de modelos de agentes específicos de domínio, utilizando o GitHub CLI para autenticação e facilitando a sincronização multiplataforma por meio de scripts Python como update_agent_master.py, garantindo integração perfeita com arquivos necessários como CLAUDE.md e README.md.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность автоматизировать развертку шаблонов агентов, специфичных для области, используя GitHub CLI для аутентификации и облегчая многоплатформенную синхронизацию с помощью скриптов Python, таких как update_agent_master.py, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с необходимыми файлами, такими как CLAUDE.md и README.md.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تلقين نشر قوالب وكلاء محددة النطاق، باستخدام GitHub CLI للتحقق وتسهيل التزامن عبر منصات متعددة باستخدام نصوص Python مثل update_agent_master.py، ضمان التكامل السلس مع الملفات المطلوبة مثل CLAUDE.md وREADME.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating agent template deployment to GitHub private repositories","Generating and synchronizing master files across platforms using update_agent_master.py","Validating and confirming the presence of essential files such as CLAUDE.md, README.md, and .cursor/skills/"],"zh":["自动将代理模板部署到 GitHub 私有仓库","使用 update_agent_master.py 在多个平台上生成和同步主文件","验证和确认必备文件（如 CLAUDE.md、README.md 和 .cursor/skills/）的存在"],"ja":["GitHub のプライベートリポジトリにエージェントテンプレートを自動的にデプロイする","update_agent_master.py を使用して複数のプラットフォームでマスター ファイルを生成および同期する","必須ファイル (CLAUDE.md、README.md、.cursor/skills/ など) の存在を検証して確認する"],"ko":["에이전트 템플릿을 GitHub 개인 저장소에 자동으로 배포하는 것","update_agent_master.py를 사용하여 여러 플랫폼에서 마스터 파일을 생성하고 동기화하는 것","必要한 파일(CLAUDE.md, README.md, .cursor/skills/ 등)의 존재를 확인하고 검증하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la implementación de plantillas de agentes en repositorios privados de GitHub","Generar y sincronizar archivos maestros en varias plataformas utilizando update_agent_master.py","Validar y confirmar la presencia de archivos esenciales como CLAUDE.md, README.md y .cursor/skills/"],"fr":["Automatiser le déploiement de modèles d''agents vers les dépôts privés GitHub","Générer et synchroniser des fichiers maîtres sur plusieurs plateformes en utilisant update_agent_master.py","Valider et confirmer la présence de fichiers essentiels tels que CLAUDE.md, README.md et .cursor/skills/"],"de":["Automatisieren der Bereitstellung von Agenten-Vorlagen in privaten GitHub-Repositorys","Erzeugen und Synchronisieren von Master-Dateien auf mehreren Plattformen mithilfe von update_agent_master.py","Überprüfen und Bestätigen der Anwesenheit von essentiellen Dateien wie CLAUDE.md, README.md und .cursor/skills/"],"pt":["Automatizar a implantação de modelos de agentes para repositórios privados do GitHub","Gerar e sincronizar arquivos mestres em várias plataformas usando update_agent_master.py","Validar e confirmar a presença de arquivos essenciais como CLAUDE.md, README.md e .cursor/skills/"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертку шаблонов агентов в приватные репозитории GitHub","Генерировать и синхронизировать мастер-файлы на нескольких платформах с помощью update_agent_master.py","Проверять и подтверждать наличие необходимых файлов, таких как CLAUDE.md, README.md и .cursor/skills/"],"ar":["تلقين نشر قوالب الوكلاء إلى مستودعات GitHub الخاصة","إنشاء وتزامن الملفات الرئيسية عبر منصات متعددة باستخدام update_agent_master.py","التحقق من وجود الملفات الأساسية مثل CLAUDE.md وREADME.md و.cursor/skills/"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI authentication","Mandatory files like CLAUDE.md and README.md must exist in the agent directory","Python 3.x compatibility required for script execution"],"zh":["需要 GitHub CLI 身份验证","必须在代理目录中存在必需文件，如 CLAUDE.md 和 README.md","需要 Python 3.x 兼容性来执行脚本"],"ja":["GitHub CLI 認証が必要","エージェントディレクトリに必須ファイル (CLAUDE.md、README.md など) が存在する必要がある","スクリプトの実行には Python 3.x 互換性が必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 인증이 필요함","에이전트 디렉토리에 필수 파일(CLAUDE.md, README.md 등)이 존재해야 함","스크립트 실행을 위해 Python 3.x 호환성이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere autenticación de GitHub CLI","Archivos obligatorios como CLAUDE.md y README.md deben existir en el directorio del agente","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x para la ejecución de scripts"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification GitHub CLI","Des fichiers obligatoires tels que CLAUDE.md et README.md doivent exister dans le répertoire de l''agent","Une compatibilité Python 3.x est requise pour l''exécution des scripts"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub CLI-Authentifizierung","Pflichtdateien wie CLAUDE.md und README.md müssen im Agenten-Verzeichnis vorhanden sein","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität wird für die Skriptausführung benötigt"],"pt":["Exige autenticação do GitHub CLI","Arquivos obrigatórios como CLAUDE.md e README.md devem existir no diretório do agente","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária para execução de scripts"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации GitHub CLI","Обязательные файлы, такие как CLAUDE.md и README.md, должны существовать в директории агента","Требуется совместимость с Python 3.x для выполнения скриптов"],"ar":["يتطلب التحقق من GitHub CLI","يجب أن توجد الملفات الإلزامية مثل CLAUDE.md وREADME.md في دليل الوكيل","مطلوب توافق مع Python 3.x لتنفيذ البرامج النصية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
