":"El bot de Discord de Pokémon Gacha Pokestar permite agregar movimientos personalizados. Sigue estos pasos para implementarlos","fr":"Le bot Discord Pokémon Gacha Pokestar permet d''ajouter des mouvements personnalisés. Suivez ces étapes pour les implémenter","de":"Der Pokémon-Gacha-Discord-Bot Pokestar ermöglicht das Hinzufügen benutzerdefinierter Bewegungen. Befolgen Sie diese Schritte, um sie zu implementieren","pt":"O skill ''add-move'' permite adicionar movimentos personalizados ao Pokestar. Confira como modificar os arquivos necessários.","ru":"Навык ''add-move'' позволяет добавлять пользовательские движения в Pokestar. Проверьте, как изменить необходимые файлы.","ar":"المهارة ''add-move'' تسمح بإضافة حركات مخصصة إلى Pokestar. راجع كيفية تعديل الملفات الضرورية.","en":"Pokemon Gacha Discord Bot"},"definition":{"en":"Pokemon Gacha Discord Bot"},"features":{"zh":["添加新招式","修改枚举","移动实现","支持 Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot","易于使用的 API"],"ja":["新しい技の追加","列挙型の変更","技の実装","ポケモンガチャディスコードボットのサポート","使いやすい API"],"ko":["새로운 기술 추가","열거형 수정","기술 구현","포켓몬 가차 디스코드 봇 지원","사용하기 쉬운 API"],"es":["Implementación de movimientos personalizados","Edición de archivos de enumeración de batalla","Adición de implementaciones de movimientos","Compatibilidad con tipos de Pokémon","Configuración de poder de movimientos","Integración con el bot de Discord de Pokémon Gacha"],"fr":["Implémentation de mouvements personnalisés","Édition de fichiers d''énumération de bataille","Ajout d''implémentations de mouvements","Compatibilité avec les types de Pokémon","Configuration de la puissance des mouvements","Intégration avec le bot Discord Pokémon Gacha"],"de":["Implementierung benutzerdefinierter Bewegungen","Bearbeitung von Schlachtenumerationsdateien","Hinzufügen von Bewegungsimplementierungen","Kompatibilität mit Pokémon-Typen","Konfiguration der Bewegungskraft","Integration mit dem Pokémon-Gacha-Discord-Bot"],"pt":["Adicionar movimentos personalizados","Modificar arquivos de enumeração de batalha","Implementar movimentos em JavaScript","Utilizar o bot de Discord Pokémon Gacha","Customizar o tipo e poder do movimento"],"ru":["Добавление пользовательских движений","Изменение файлов перечисления битвы","Реализация движений на JavaScript","Использование бота Discord Pokémon Gacha","Настройка типа и силы движения"],"ar":["إضافة حركات مخصصة","تعديل ملفات تعداد المعركة","تنفيذ الحركات في JavaScript","استخدام بوت ديسكورد Pokémon Gacha","تخصيص نوع وقوة الحركة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["add-move 技能","Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot","添加新招式","修改枚举","移动实现","Discord Bot 开发","Pokémon 技术"],"ja":["add-move スキル","ポケモンガチャディスコードボット","新しい技の追加","列挙型の変更","技の実装","ディスコードボット開発","ポケモン技術"],"ko":["add-move 스킬","포켓몬 가차 디스코드 봇","새로운 기술 추가","열거형 수정","기술 구현","디스코드 봇 개발","포켓몬 기술"],"es":["Pokestar","bot de Discord","Pokémon Gacha","movimientos personalizados","implementación de movimientos","tipos de Pokémon","desarrollo de bots","programación de Discord","juegos de rol en línea"],"fr":["Pokestar","bot Discord","Pokémon Gacha","mouvements personnalisés","implémentation de mouvements","types de Pokémon","développement de bots","programmation Discord","jeux de rôle en ligne"],"de":["Pokestar","Discord-Bot","Pokémon-Gacha","benutzerdefinierte Bewegungen","Implementierung von Bewegungen","Pokémon-Typen","Bot-Entwicklung","Discord-Programmierung","Online-Rollenspiele"],"pt":["pokestar","discord bot","pokemon gacha","adicionar movimentos","customizar movimentos","javascript","desenvolvimento de bots"],"ru":["pokestar","discord бот","pokemon gacha","добавление движений","настройка движений","javascript","разработка ботов"],"ar":["pokestar","بوت ديسكورد","pokemon gacha","إضافة حركات","تخصيص حركات","javascript","تطوير البوتات"]}},"owner":"ewei068","repo":"pokestar","repoPath":"ewei068/pokestar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-move","description":"Add new moves to the battle system. Use when implementing attack, status, or support moves for Pokemon.","bodyPreview":"# Adding Moves to Pokestar\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify:**\n\n1. `src/enums/battleEnums.js` - Add `moveIdEnum.YOUR_MOVE` entry (ONLY if not exists)\n2. `src/battle/data/moves.js` - Add the move implementation\n\n**DO NOT** modify other moves or `battleConfig.js` unless explicitly asked.\n\n## Move Structure\n\n```javascript\n[moveIdEnum.MOVE_NAME]: new Move({\n  id: moveIdEnum.MOVE_NAME,\n  name: \"Move Name\",\n  type: pokemonTypes.TYPE,           // FIRE, WATER, GRASS, etc.\n  power: 80,","body":"# Adding Moves to Pokestar\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify:**\n\n1. `src/enums/battleEnums.js` - Add `moveIdEnum.YOUR_MOVE` entry (ONLY if not exists)\n2. `src/battle/data/moves.js` - Add the move implementation\n\n**DO NOT** modify other moves or `battleConfig.js` unless explicitly asked.\n\n## Move Structure\n\n```javascript\n[moveIdEnum.MOVE_NAME]: new Move({\n  id: moveIdEnum.MOVE_NAME,\n  name: \"Move Name\",\n  type: pokemonTypes.TYPE,           // FIRE, WATER, GRASS, etc.\n  power: 80,                         // Base damage (null for non-damaging)\n  accuracy: 100,                     // Hit chance % (null = always hits)\n  cooldown: 3,                       // Turns before reusable\n  targetType: targetTypes.ENEMY,     // ENEMY, ALLY, ANY\n  targetPosition: targetPositions.FRONT, // FRONT, BACK, ANY, SELF, NON_SELF\n  targetPattern: targetPatterns.SINGLE,  // See references/target-patterns.md\n  tier: moveTiers.POWER,             // BASIC, POWER, ULTIMATE\n  damageType: damageTypes.PHYSICAL,  // PHYSICAL, SPECIAL, OTHER\n  description: \"Move description\",\n  execute() { /* implementation */ },\n}),\n```\n\n## Execute Context\n\n**NOTE:** The `execute` function binds `this` to the `MoveInstance.js` `MoveInstance` class, with properties such as:\n\n**Example Properties:**\n\n- `this.source` - User of the move\n- `this.primaryTarget` - Main target selected\n- `this.allTargets` - All affected targets (based on pattern)\n- `this.missedTargets` - Targets that were missed\n- `this.battle` - Battle instance\n- `this.power`, `this.type`, `this.id` - Move properties\n\n## Example Generic Methods\n\nAll generic methods are available in `MoveInstance.js`. These are some common examples:\n\n```javascript\n// Deal damage to all targets\nthis.genericDealAllDamage();\n// Returns { damageInstances: {targetId: damage}, totalDamageDealt: number }\n\n// Custom damage calculation\nthis.genericDealAllDamage({\n  calculateDamageFunction: (args) =>\n    this.source.calculateMoveDamage(args) * 1.5,\n  offTargetDamageMultiplier: 0.5,\n  backTargetDamageMultiplier: 0.7,\n  attackOverride: this.source.getStat(\"def\"),\n});\n\n// Apply status (BURN, PARALYSIS, FROZEN, SLEEP, POISON)\nthis.genericApplyAllStatus({\n  statusId: statusConditions.BURN,\n  probability: 0.3,\n});\n\n// Apply effect (see references/effects.md)\nthis.genericApplyAllEffects({\n  effectId: \"atkUp\",\n  duration: 3,\n  probability: 0.5,\n});\n\n// Single target effect\nthis.genericApplySingleEffect({\n  target: this.primaryTarget,\n  effectId: \"shield\",\n  duration: 3,\n  initialArgs: { shield: 100 },\n});\n\n// Combat readiness\nthis.genericChangeAllCombatReadiness({ amount: 25, action: \"boost\" }); // or \"reduce\"\n\n// Healing\nthis.genericHealAllTargets({ healPercent: 25 });\nthis.genericHealSingleTarget({ target, healAmount: 100 });\n```\n\n## Move Tags\n\nOptional `tags` array for ability interactions:\n\n- `\"punch\"` - Boosted by Iron Fist ability\n- `\"slice\"` - Boosted by Sharpness ability\n- `\"charge\"` - Two-turn move\n\n## Dynamic Move Properties\n\nUse `overrideFields` to change properties based on context:\n\n```javascript\noverrideFields: (options) => {\n  if (options.source?.speciesId === pokemonIdEnum.SPECIAL_FORM) {\n    return { power: 120, description: \"Enhanced version\" };\n  }\n},\n```\n\n## Useful BattlePokemon Methods\n\n- `pokemon.getStat(\"atk\")` - Get effective stat\n- `pokemon.hasType(pokemonTypes.FIRE)` - Check type\n- `pokemon.applyEffect(id, duration, source, initialArgs)`\n- `pokemon.dispellEffect(effectId)` - Remove effect\n- `pokemon.removeStatus()` - Clear status condition\n- `pokemon.dealDamage(amount, target, info)` - Deal damage\n- `pokemon.giveHeal(amount, target, info)` - Heal\n- `pokemon.boostCombatReadiness(source, amount)`\n- `pokemon.getPartyPokemon()` - Get ally array\n- `pokemon.isFainted` - Check if fainted\n\n## References\n\n- `references/target-patterns.md` - Visual guide to target patterns\n- `references/effects.md` - List of all buff/debuff effect IDs\n- `references/pattern-*.md` - Code examples for common move types\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:56:09.267Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Discord Bot Agents needing Pokémon move customization capabilities in JavaScript","zh":"非常适合需要在JavaScript中定制Pokémon移动能力的Discord Bot代理","ja":"JavaScriptでポケモンの技のカスタマイズ機能を必要とするDiscord Botエージェントに最適","ko":"JavaScript에서 포켓몬 이동 사용자 지정 기능이 필요한 Discord Bot 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de bots de Discord que necesitan capacidades de personalización de movimientos de Pokémon en JavaScript","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de bots Discord ayant besoin de capacités de personnalisation de mouvements de Pokémon en JavaScript","de":"Perfekt für Discord-Bot-Agenten, die Pokémon-Move-Anpassungsfähigkeiten in JavaScript benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Bot do Discord que necessitam de capacidades de personalização de movimentos de Pokémon em JavaScript","ru":"Идеально для агентов Discord Bot, которым необходимы возможности настройки движений Pokémon в JavaScript","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديسكورد بوت الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تخصيص حركات بوكيمون في جافاسكريبت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement custom Pokémon moves using JavaScript, modifying battleEnums.js and moves.js files, and leveraging enums like moveIdEnum and pokemonTypes","zh":"赋予代理实现自定义的Pokémon移动使用JavaScript的能力，修改battleEnums.js和moves.js文件，并利用枚举如moveIdEnum和pokemonTypes","ja":"エージェントにJavaScriptを使用してカスタムポケモンの技を実装する能力を付与し、battleEnums.jsとmoves.jsファイルを修正し、moveIdEnumやpokemonTypesなどの列挙型を利用する","ko":"에이전트에 JavaScript를 사용하여 사용자 지정 포켓몬 이동을 구현하는 기능을 부여하고 battleEnums.js 및 moves.js 파일을 수정하고 moveIdEnum 및 pokemonTypes 등의 열거형을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar movimientos personalizados de Pokémon utilizando JavaScript, modificando los archivos battleEnums.js y moves.js, y aprovechando enums como moveIdEnum y pokemonTypes","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des mouvements de Pokémon personnalisés en utilisant JavaScript, en modifiant les fichiers battleEnums.js et moves.js, et en exploitant des énumérations comme moveIdEnum et pokemonTypes","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Pokémon-Moves mit JavaScript zu implementieren, indem die Dateien battleEnums.js und moves.js modifiziert und Enums wie moveIdEnum und pokemonTypes genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar movimentos personalizados de Pokémon usando JavaScript, modificando arquivos battleEnums.js e moves.js e aproveitando enums como moveIdEnum e pokemonTypes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать пользовательские движения Pokémon, используя JavaScript, изменяя файлы battleEnums.js и moves.js, и использует перечисления, такие как moveIdEnum и pokemonTypes","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تنفيذ حركات بوكيمون المخصصة باستخدام جافاسكريبت ، و تعديل ملفات battleEnums.js و moves.js ، و الاستفادة من التعدادات مثل moveIdEnum و pokemonTypes"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing new Pokémon moves","Modifying existing move properties like power and type","Extending battle mechanics with custom moves"],"zh":["实现新的Pokémon移动","修改现有移动属性，如力量和类型","使用自定义移动扩展战斗机制"],"ja":["新しいポケモンの技の実装","既存の技の特性の変更、例えば力やタイプ","カスタム技を使用した戦闘メカニズムの拡張"],"ko":["新的 포켓몬 이동 구현","기존 이동 속성 수정, 예를 들어 힘과 유형","사용자 지정 이동을 사용한 전투 메커니즘 확장"],"es":["Implementar nuevos movimientos de Pokémon","Modificar propiedades de movimientos existentes como poder y tipo","Ampliar la mecánica de batalla con movimientos personalizados"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre de nouveaux mouvements de Pokémon","Modifier les propriétés de mouvements existants comme la puissance et le type","Étendre la mécanique de bataille avec des mouvements personnalisés"],"de":["Implementierung neuer Pokémon-Moves","Modifizierung von Eigenschaften bestehender Moves wie Kraft und Typ","Erweiterung der Kampfmechanik mit benutzerdefinierten Moves"],"pt":["Implementar novos movimentos de Pokémon","Modificar propriedades de movimentos existentes, como poder e tipo","Estender mecânicas de batalha com movimentos personalizados"],"ru":["Реализация новых движений Pokémon","Модификация существующих свойств движений, таких как сила и тип","Расширение механик боя с пользовательскими движениями"],"ar":["تنفيذ حركات بوكيمون الجديدة","تعديل خصائص الحركات الموجودة ، مثل القوة والنوع","توسيع ميكانيكا المعركة مع الحركات المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires modification of specific files like battleEnums.js and moves.js","JavaScript environment needed","Limited to Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot ecosystem"],"zh":["需要修改特定的文件，如battleEnums.js和moves.js","需要JavaScript环境","仅限于Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot生态系统"],"ja":["特定のファイルの修正が必要、例えばbattleEnums.jsとmoves.js","JavaScript環境が必要","ポケモンガチャDiscord Botのエコシステムにのみ限定"],"ko":["특정 파일 수정 필요, 예를 들어 battleEnums.js 및 moves.js","JavaScript 환경 필요","포켓몬 가차 Discord Bot 생태계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la modificación de archivos específicos como battleEnums.js y moves.js","Se necesita un entorno de JavaScript","Limitado al ecosistema de Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot"],"fr":["Nécessite la modification de fichiers spécifiques comme battleEnums.js et moves.js","Un environnement JavaScript est nécessaire","Limité à l''écosystème de Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot"],"de":["Erfordert die Modifizierung spezifischer Dateien wie battleEnums.js und moves.js","Ein JavaScript-Umgebung ist erforderlich","Begrenzt auf das Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer modificação de arquivos específicos, como battleEnums.js e moves.js","Ambiente JavaScript necessário","Limitado ao ecossistema do Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot"],"ru":["Требуется изменение определенных файлов, таких как battleEnums.js и moves.js","Необходимо окружение JavaScript","Ограничен экосистемой Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot"],"ar":["يتطلب تعديل ملفات محددة مثل battleEnums.js و moves.js","بيئة جافاسكريبت ضرورية","محدود بنظام بوكيمون غاشا ديسكورد بوت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
