Gacha-Pokémon-Discord-Bot implementieren","Dateien wie battleEnums.js und abilities.js bearbeiten","Beschreibungen und Namen für Fähigkeiten erstellen","Spielereahrung mit einzigartigen Fähigkeiten anpassen"],"pt":["Adicione habilidades personalizadas ao Pokestar","Modifique os arquivos src/enums/battleEnums.js e src/battle/data/abilities.js","Crie implementações de habilidades personalizadas","Não modifique outras habilidades ou battleConfig.js","Aprenda com o exemplo de estrutura de habilidade"],"ru":["Добавьте пользовательские способности в Pokestar","Измените файлы src/enums/battleEnums.js и src/battle/data/abilities.js","Создайте реализации пользовательских способностей","Не изменяйте другие способности или battleConfig.js","Узнайте из примера структуры способности"],"ar":["أضف قدرات مخصصة إلى Pokestar","قم بتعديل الملفات src/enums/battleEnums.js و src/battle/data/abilities.js","أنشئ تنفيذات للقدرات المخصصة","لا تقم بتعديل القدرات الأخرى أو battleConfig.js","تعلم من مثال هيكل القدرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pokémon Gacha","Discord Bot","添加能力","自定义能力","游戏开发","机器人开发"],"ja":["ポケモンガチャ","ディスコードボット","アビリティ追加","カスタムアビリティ","ゲーム開発","ボット開発"],"ko":["포켓몬 ガチャ","디스코드 봇","능력 추가","커스텀 능력","게임 개발","봇 개발"],"es":["add-ability","Pokestar","bot de Discord Gacha Pokémon","habilidades personalizadas","desarrollo de juegos","programación de juegos","Discord bot","Gacha Pokémon","personalización de juegos"],"fr":["add-ability","Pokestar","bot Discord Gacha Pokémon","capacités personnalisées","développement de jeux","programmation de jeux","bot Discord","Gacha Pokémon","personnalisation de jeux"],"de":["add-ability","Pokestar","Gacha-Pokémon-Discord-Bot","benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten","Spieleentwicklung","Spieleprogrammierung","Discord-Bot","Gacha-Pokémon","Spielanpassung"],"pt":["add-ability","Pokestar","bot de discord","habilidades personalizadas","desenvolvimento de jogos","javascript","discord bot","jogo de pokemon"],"ru":["add-ability","Pokestar","бот дискорд","пользовательские способности","разработка игр","javascript","discord бот","игра покемон"],"ar":["add-ability","Pokestar","بوت ديسكورد","قدرات مخصصة","تطوير الألعاب","javascript","بوت ديسكورد","لعبة بوكيمون"]}},"owner":"ewei068","repo":"pokestar","repoPath":"ewei068/pokestar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-ability","description":"Add Pokemon abilities to the battle system. Use when implementing passive abilities that trigger on events.","bodyPreview":"# Adding Abilities to Pokestar\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify:**\n\n1. `src/enums/battleEnums.js` - Add `abilityIdEnum.YOUR_ABILITY` entry (ONLY if not exists)\n2. `src/battle/data/abilities.js` - Add the ability implementation\n\n**DO NOT** modify other abilities or `battleConfig.js` unless explicitly asked.\n\n## Ability Structure\n\n```javascript\n[abilityIdEnum.ABILITY_NAME]: new Ability({\n  id: abilityIdEnum.ABILITY_NAME,\n  name: \"Ability Name\",\n  description: \"Description of what the ability","body":"# Adding Abilities to Pokestar\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify:**\n\n1. `src/enums/battleEnums.js` - Add `abilityIdEnum.YOUR_ABILITY` entry (ONLY if not exists)\n2. `src/battle/data/abilities.js` - Add the ability implementation\n\n**DO NOT** modify other abilities or `battleConfig.js` unless explicitly asked.\n\n## Ability Structure\n\n```javascript\n[abilityIdEnum.ABILITY_NAME]: new Ability({\n  id: abilityIdEnum.ABILITY_NAME,\n  name: \"Ability Name\",\n  description: \"Description of what the ability does\",\n  abilityAdd({ battle, target }) {\n    // Called when ability is applied (battle start)\n    return {\n      // Properties to store for later use in abilityRemove\n      listenerId: this.registerListenerFunction({...}),\n    };\n  },\n  abilityRemove({ battle, target, properties }) {\n    // Called when ability is removed\n    battle.unregisterListener(properties.listenerId);\n  },\n}),\n```\n\n## Properties Pattern\n\nReturn state from `abilityAdd` that you''ll need in `abilityRemove`:\n\n```javascript\nabilityAdd({ battle, target }) {\n  return {\n    listenerId: this.registerListenerFunction({...}),\n    originalValue: target.getStat(\"atk\"),\n    triggered: false,\n  };\n},\nabilityRemove({ battle, target, properties }) {\n  battle.unregisterListener(properties.listenerId);\n}\n```\n\n## Event Listener Registration\n\nAbilities have a class-level `registerListenerFunction` method that automatically includes the ability instance:\n\n```javascript\nabilityAdd({ battle, target }) {\n  return {\n    listenerId: this.registerListenerFunction({\n      battle,\n      target,\n      eventName: battleEventEnum.AFTER_DAMAGE_DEALT,\n      callback: ({ damage, abilityInstance }) => {\n        // abilityInstance.data contains the properties\n        // Perform ability logic\n      },\n      conditionCallback: getIsSourcePokemonCallback(target),\n    }),\n  };\n},\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\nRefer to `references/pattern-*` for common ability implementations.\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n1. **Always Clean Up Listeners**: Failing to unregister listeners causes memory leaks.\n\n2. **Event Argument Modification**: Return modified values from callbacks:\n\n   ```javascript\n   callback: (args) => {\n     return { damage: Math.floor(args.damage * 0.5) };\n   };\n   ```\n\n3. **abilityInstance**: Access stored properties via `abilityInstance.data` in callbacks.\n\n4. **Source vs Target**: Use the right condition callback:\n   - `getIsSourcePokemonCallback` - when this Pokemon is dealing damage/using moves\n   - `getIsTargetPokemonCallback` - when this Pokemon is receiving damage/effects\n\n## References\n\n- `add-event-listener` skill - Common event types and condition callbacks\n- `references/pattern-*` - Common ability implementation patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:56:39.069Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Discord Bot Agents specializing in Pokémon Gacha games needing custom ability implementation.","zh":"非常适合专门从事 Pokémon Gacha 游戏的 Discord Bot 代理，需要自定义能力实现。","ja":"Pokémon Gacha ゲームでカスタム能力実装が必要な Discord Bot エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Pokémon Gacha 게임에서 사용자 정의 능력 구현이 필요한 Discord Bot 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de bot de Discord especializados en juegos de Pokémon Gacha que necesitan implementación de habilidades personalizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de bot Discord spécialisés dans les jeux de Pokémon Gacha nécessitant une mise en œuvre d''abilités personnalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Discord-Bot-Agents, die auf Pokémon-Gacha-Spiele spezialisiert sind und eine benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeitsimplementierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Bot do Discord especializados em jogos de Pokémon Gacha que necessitam de implementação de habilidades personalizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ботов Discord, специализирующихся на играх Pokémon Gacha, требующих настраиваемой реализации способностей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل بوت ديسكورد المتخصص في ألعاب بوكيمون جاتشا التي تحتاج إلى تنفيذ قدرات مخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot functionality by adding new abilities using JavaScript, modifying `battleEnums.js` and `abilities.js` files, and utilizing the `Ability` class for implementation.","zh":"赋予代理扩展 Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot 功能的能力，方法是使用 JavaScript 添加新能力，修改 `battleEnums.js` 和 `abilities.js` 文件，并利用 `Ability` 类进行实现。","ja":"JavaScript を使用して新しい能力を追加し、`battleEnums.js` と `abilities.js` ファイルを変更し、`Ability` クラスを使用して実装することで、Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot の機能を拡張するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"JavaScript를 사용하여 새로운 능력을 추가하고, `battleEnums.js`와 `abilities.js` 파일을 수정하며, `Ability` 클래스를 사용하여 구현함으로써 Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot의 기능을 확장하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ampliar la funcionalidad del bot de Discord de Pokémon Gacha agregando nuevas habilidades mediante JavaScript, modificando los archivos `battleEnums.js` y `abilities.js`, y utilizando la clase `Ability` para la implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre la fonctionnalité du bot Discord Pokémon Gacha en ajoutant de nouvelles capacités à l''aide de JavaScript, en modifiant les fichiers `battleEnums.js` et `abilities.js`, et en utilisant la classe `Ability` pour la mise en œuvre.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Funktionalität des Pokémon-Gacha-Discord-Bots zu erweitern, indem neue Fähigkeiten mithilfe von JavaScript hinzugefügt, die Dateien `battleEnums.js` und `abilities.js` modifiziert und die Klasse `Ability` für die Implementierung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a funcionalidade do Bot do Discord de Pokémon Gacha adicionando novas habilidades usando JavaScript, modificando os arquivos `battleEnums.js` e `abilities.js` e utilizando a classe `Ability` para implementação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расширить функциональность бота Discord для Pokémon Gacha, добавляя новые способности с помощью JavaScript, изменяя файлы `battleEnums.js` и `abilities.js` и используя класс `Ability` для реализации.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية توسيع وظائف بوت ديسكورد لبوكيمون جاتشا بإضافة قدرات جديدة باستخدام لغة جافاسكريبت، وتنقيح الملفات `battleEnums.js` و `abilities.js` واستخدام فئة `Ability` لتنفيذها."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing custom abilities for Pokémon","Modifying existing ability implementations in `abilities.js`","Extending the `battleEnums.js` file for new ability IDs"],"zh":["为 Pokémon 实现自定义能力","修改 `abilities.js` 中现有的能力实现","扩展 `battleEnums.js` 文件以获得新的能力 ID"],"ja":["Pokémon のカスタム能力の実装","`abilities.js` の既存の能力実装の変更","新しい能力 ID を取得するために `battleEnums.js` ファイルの拡張"],"ko":["Pokémon의 사용자 정의 능력 구현","`abilities.js`의 기존 능력 구현 수정","새로운 능력 ID를 얻기 위한 `battleEnums.js` 파일 확장"],"es":["Implementar habilidades personalizadas para Pokémon","Modificar implementaciones de habilidades existentes en `abilities.js`","Ampliar el archivo `battleEnums.js` para nuevos IDs de habilidades"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des capacités personnalisées pour Pokémon","Modifier les mises en œuvre de capacités existantes dans `abilities.js`","Étendre le fichier `battleEnums.js` pour de nouveaux IDs de capacités"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten für Pokémon implementieren","Vorhandene Fähigkeitsimplementierungen in `abilities.js` modifizieren","Die Datei `battleEnums.js` für neue Fähigkeits-IDs erweitern"],"pt":["Implementar habilidades personalizadas para Pokémon","Modificar implementações de habilidades existentes em `abilities.js`","Estender o arquivo `battleEnums.js` para novos IDs de habilidades"],"ru":["Реализация пользовательских способностей для Pokémon","Изменение существующих реализаций способностей в `abilities.js`","Расширение файла `battleEnums.js` для новых идентификаторов способностей"],"ar":["تنفيذ قدرات مخصصة لبوكيمون","تعديل تنفيذات القدرات الحالية في `abilities.js`","توسيع ملف `battleEnums.js` لأرقام تعريف القدرات الجديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires modification of specific files (`battleEnums.js` and `abilities.js`)","JavaScript programming language required","Limited to Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot ecosystem"],"zh":["需要修改特定文件 (`battleEnums.js` 和 `abilities.js`)","需要 JavaScript 编程语言","仅限于 Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot 生态系统"],"ja":["特定のファイル (`battleEnums.js` と `abilities.js`) の変更が必要","JavaScript プログラミング言語が必要","Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot エコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["특정 파일 (`battleEnums.js`와 `abilities.js`)의 수정이 필요","JavaScript 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot 생태계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la modificación de archivos específicos (`battleEnums.js` y `abilities.js`)","Se requiere el lenguaje de programación JavaScript","Limitado al ecosistema de bot de Discord de Pokémon Gacha"],"fr":["Nécessite la modification de fichiers spécifiques (`battleEnums.js` et `abilities.js`)","Le langage de programmation JavaScript est requis","Limité à l''écosystème du bot Discord Pokémon Gacha"],"de":["Erfordert die Modifizierung spezifischer Dateien (`battleEnums.js` und `abilities.js`)","Die Programmiersprache JavaScript ist erforderlich","Begrenzt auf das Ökosystem des Pokémon-Gacha-Discord-Bots"],"pt":["Requer modificação de arquivos específicos (`battleEnums.js` e `abilities.js`)","Linguagem de programação JavaScript necessária","Limitado ao ecossistema do Bot do Discord de Pokémon Gacha"],"ru":["Требует изменения конкретных файлов (`battleEnums.js` и `abilities.js`)","Требуется язык программирования JavaScript","Ограничен экосистемой бота Discord для Pokémon Gacha"],"ar":["يتطلب تعديل ملفات محددة (`battleEnums.js` و `abilities.js`)","لغة برمجة جافاسكريبت مطلوبة","محدود بنظام بوت ديسكورد لبوكيمون جاتشا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
