Configurer des commandes avec facilité","Intégration avec Discord","Prise en charge des commandes interactives","Personnalisation de la configuration du bot"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Befehlskategorien","Konfigurieren von Befehlen mit Leichtigkeit","Integration mit Discord","Unterstützung für interaktive Befehle","Anpassung der Bot-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Criação de comandos personalizados","Adição de categorias de comandos","Implementação de comandos em JavaScript","Integração com o bot do Discord Pokémon Gacha","Personalização da interface do usuário"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских команд","Добавление категорий команд","Реализация команд на JavaScript","Интеграция с ботом Discord Pokémon Gacha","Настройка интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["إنشاء أوامر مخصصة","إضافة فئات الأوامر","تنفيذ الأوامر بلغة جافاسكريبت","التكامل مع بوت ديسكورد بوكيمون جاشا","تخصيص واجهة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Discord 机器人","创建命令","命令类别","JavaScript","交互式 UI","自定义命令"],"ja":["Discord ボット","コマンド作成","コマンドカテゴリ","JavaScript","インタラクティブ UI","カスタムコマンド"],"ko":["디스코드 봇","명령 생성","명령 카테고리","JavaScript","대화형 UI","사용자 정의 명령"],"es":["discord bot","pokémon gacha","crear comandos","configurar comandos","desarrollo de bots","discord developer"],"fr":["bot discord","pokémon gacha","créer des commandes","configurer des commandes","développement de bots","discord développeur"],"de":["discord bot","pokémon gacha","befehle erstellen","befehle konfigurieren","bot entwickeln","discord entwickler"],"pt":["criar comandos","bot do Discord","Pokémon Gacha","comandos personalizados","JavaScript","desenvolvimento de bots","integração com Discord"],"ru":["создание команд","бот Discord","Pokémon Gacha","пользовательские команды","JavaScript","разработка ботов","интеграция с Discord"],"ar":["إنشاء أوامر","بوت ديسكورد","بوكيمون جاشا","أوامر مخصصة","جافاسكريبت","تطوير البوتات","التكامل مع ديسكورد"]}},"owner":"ewei068","repo":"pokestar","repoPath":"ewei068/pokestar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-command","description":"Add Discord commands to the bot. Use when implementing new slash commands or message commands.","bodyPreview":"# Creating Commands\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify:**\n\n1. `src/config/commandConfig.js` - Add category (if needed) and command configuration\n2. `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js` - Implement the command\n\n**For interactive UI commands:** Also refer to the `create-deact-element` skill.\n\n## Step 1: Add Command Category (if needed)\n\nIf an appropriate category doesn''t exist, add it to `commandCategoryConfigRaw`:\n\n```javascript\nconst commandCategoryConfigRaw = {\n  // ... existing categorie","body":"# Creating Commands\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Files to modify:**\n\n1. `src/config/commandConfig.js` - Add category (if needed) and command configuration\n2. `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js` - Implement the command\n\n**For interactive UI commands:** Also refer to the `create-deact-element` skill.\n\n## Step 1: Add Command Category (if needed)\n\nIf an appropriate category doesn''t exist, add it to `commandCategoryConfigRaw`:\n\n```javascript\nconst commandCategoryConfigRaw = {\n  // ... existing categories\n  yourCategory: {\n    name: \"Your Category\",\n    description: \"Description of this category\",\n    folder: \"yourCategory\",\n    commands: [\"yourcommand\"],\n  },\n};\n```\n\nThen create the directory: `src/commands/yourCategory/`\n\n## Step 2: Add to Category Commands List\n\nAdd your command name to the appropriate category''s `commands` array:\n\n```javascript\nyourCategory: {\n  // ...\n  commands: [\"existingcommand\", \"yourcommand\"],  // Add here\n},\n```\n\n## Step 3: Add Command Configuration\n\nAdd your command to `commandConfigRaw`:\n\n```javascript\nyourcommand: {\n  name: \"Your Command\",\n  aliases: [\"yourcommand\", \"yc\"],  // First alias is the primary command name\n  description: \"Short description for help text\",\n  longDescription: \"Detailed description shown in /help yourcommand\",\n  execute: \"yourCommand.js\",  // File in src/commands/<category>/\n  args: {\n    requiredArg: {\n      type: \"string\",\n      description: \"Description of the argument\",\n      optional: false,\n      variable: false,\n    },\n    optionalArg: {\n      type: \"int\",\n      description: \"Optional argument\",\n      optional: true,\n      variable: false,\n    },\n  },\n  stages: [stageNames.ALPHA, stageNames.BETA, stageNames.PROD],\n  exp: 10,      // Optional: XP reward\n  money: 25,    // Optional: Money reward\n},\n```\n\n### Argument Types\n\n| Type      | Discord.js Method | Description        |\n| --------- | ----------------- | ------------------ |\n| `string`  | `getString()`     | Text input         |\n| `int`     | `getInteger()`    | Integer number     |\n| `bool`    | `getBoolean()`    | True/false         |\n| `user`    | `getUser()`       | @mentioned user    |\n| `channel` | `getChannel()`    | #channel reference |\n\n### Argument Options\n\n| Property      | Type      | Description                                    |\n| ------------- | --------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `type`        | `string`  | One of the types above                         |\n| `description` | `string`  | Shown in slash command hints                   |\n| `optional`    | `boolean` | Whether argument is required                   |\n| `variable`    | `boolean` | If true, captures remaining args (string only) |\n| `enum`        | `any[]`   | Restrict to specific values                    |\n\n## Step 4: Implement the Command\n\nCreate `src/commands/<category>/yourCommand.js`:\n\n```javascript\nconst yourCommandMessageCommand = async (message) => {\n  // Parse args from message.content\n  // Execute command logic\n  // Send response via message.channel.send()\n};\n\nconst yourCommandSlashCommand = async (interaction) => {\n  // Get args from interaction.options\n  // Execute command logic\n  // Send response via interaction.reply()\n};\n\nmodule.exports = {\n  message: yourCommandMessageCommand,\n  slash: yourCommandSlashCommand,\n};\n```\n\n## Subcommands\n\nFor commands with subcommands (e.g., `/party add`):\n\n### Parent Command (entry point only)\n\n```javascript\nparty: {\n  name: \"Party\",\n  aliases: [\"party\"],\n  description: \"Entry point for party commands\",\n  subcommands: [\"partyinfo\", \"partyadd\", \"partyremove\"],  // List subcommands\n  args: {},\n  stages: [stageNames.ALPHA, stageNames.BETA, stageNames.PROD],\n  // NO execute property - parent is just an entry point\n},\n```\n\n### Subcommand\n\n```javascript\npartyadd: {\n  name: \"Party Add\",\n  aliases: [\"partyadd\", \"pa\"],\n  description: \"Add a Pokemon to your party\",\n  execute: \"partyAdd.js\",\n  args: { /* ... */ },\n  stages: [stageNames.ALPHA, stageNames.BETA, stageNames.PROD],\n  parent: \"party\",  // Reference to parent command\n},\n```\n\n**Naming convention:** Subcommand ID is `parentsubcommand` (e.g., `partyadd`, `tradeinfo`).\n\n## Command Implementation Patterns\n\nSee `references/` for implementation examples:\n\n- `pattern-simple-command.md` - Basic command without interactive UI\n- `pattern-deact-command.md` - Command using Deact for interactive UI\n- `pattern-args-parsing.md` - Parsing arguments from message and slash commands\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n1. **Command ID must be alphabetic and lowercase**: The config validates that command IDs have no capital letters.\n\n2. **Stages control availability**: Only include stages where the command should be active:\n   - `stageNames.ALPHA` - Development/testing\n   - `stageNames.BETA` - Beta testing\n   - `stageNames.PROD` - Production\n\n3. **Argument names in slash commands**: Use `getString(\"argname\")` where `argname` is lowercase.\n\n4. **Variable arguments**: Only the last argument can have `variable: true`.\n\n5. **Enum values**: For args with `enum`, the values must match exactly what users can input.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `create-deact-element` - Creating interactive UI components\n- `deact-component-callback` - Handling button clicks and selections\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:57:04.096Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Discord Bot Agents needing customizable command configurations and implementations.","zh":"非常适合需要可自定义命令配置和实现的Discord Bot代理。","ja":"Discord Botエージェントがカスタマイズ可能なコマンド構成と実装を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"사용자 지정 명령 구성 및 구현이 필요한 Discord Bot 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de bot de Discord que necesitan configuraciones y implementaciones de comandos personalizables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de bot Discord nécessitant des configurations et des implémentations de commandes personnalisables.","de":"Perfekt für Discord-Bot-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte Befehlskonfigurationen und -implementierungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Bot do Discord que precisam de configurações de comando personalizáveis e implementações.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ботов Discord, требующих настраиваемых конфигураций команд и реализаций.","ar":"مثالي لوفاء بوت ديسكورد الذين بحاجة إلى تكوين أوامر قابل للتعديل والتنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend Discord bot functionality by creating custom commands using JavaScript, modifying command configurations in files like `commandConfig.js`, and implementing command logic in files like `<category>/<command>.js`, while also supporting interactive UI commands through elements created with skills like `create-deact-element`.","zh":"赋予代理扩展Discord机器人功能的能力，通过使用JavaScript创建自定义命令，修改如`commandConfig.js`的命令配置文件，并在如`<category>/<command>.js`的文件中实现命令逻辑，同时也支持通过如`create-deact-element`技能创建的元素进行交互式UI命令。","ja":"エージェントにDiscordボットの機能を拡張する能力を与え、JavaScriptを使用してカスタムコマンドを作成し、`commandConfig.js`のようなコマンド構成ファイルを修正し、`<category>/<command>.js`のようなファイルでコマンドロジックを実装することができ、また`create-deact-element`のようなスキルで作成された要素を通じてインタラクティブなUIコマンドもサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Discord 봇 기능을 확장할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 JavaScript를 사용하여 사용자 지정 명령을 만들고 `commandConfig.js`와 같은 명령 구성 파일을 수정하며 `<category>/<command>.js`와 같은 파일에서 명령 논리를 구현하는 동시에 `create-deact-element`와 같은 스킬로 생성된 요소를 통해 상호 작용형 UI 명령을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ampliar la funcionalidad del bot de Discord creando comandos personalizados mediante JavaScript, modificando configuraciones de comandos en archivos como `commandConfig.js` e implementando lógica de comandos en archivos como `<category>/<command>.js`, y también admite comandos de interfaz de usuario interactivos a través de elementos creados con habilidades como `create-deact-element`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre la fonctionnalité du bot Discord en créant des commandes personnalisées à l''aide de JavaScript, en modifiant les configurations de commande dans des fichiers tels que `commandConfig.js` et en implémentant la logique de commande dans des fichiers tels que `<category>/<command>.js`, tout en prenant en charge les commandes d''interface utilisateur interactives via des éléments créés avec des compétences comme `create-deact-element`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Funktionalität des Discord-Bots zu erweitern, indem sie benutzerdefinierte Befehle mithilfe von JavaScript erstellen, Befehlskonfigurationen in Dateien wie `commandConfig.js` ändern und Befehlslogik in Dateien wie `<category>/<command>.js` implementieren, während auch interaktive Benutzeroberflächenbefehle durch Elemente unterstützt werden, die mit Fähigkeiten wie `create-deact-element` erstellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a funcionalidade do bot do Discord criando comandos personalizados usando JavaScript, modificando configurações de comando em arquivos como `commandConfig.js` e implementando lógica de comando em arquivos como `<category>/<command>.js`, além de suportar comandos de interface do usuário interativos por meio de elementos criados com habilidades como `create-deact-element`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам расширить функциональность бота Discord, создавая пользовательские команды с помощью JavaScript, изменяя конфигурации команд в файлах типа `commandConfig.js` и реализуя логику команд в файлах типа `<category>/<command>.js`, а также поддерживая интерактивные команды UI посредством элементов, созданных с помощью навыков типа `create-deact-element`.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من تعزيز وظائف بوت ديسكورد عن طريق إنشاء أوامر مخصصة باستخدام لغة جافاسكريبت، و تعديل إعدادات الأوامر في ملفات مثل `commandConfig.js` وتنفيذ منطق الأوامر في ملفات مثل `<category>/<command>.js`، بالإضافة إلى دعم أوامر واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية من خلال عناصر تم إنشاؤها باستخدام مهارات مثل `create-deact-element`."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom Pokémon Gacha commands","Implementing interactive UI elements for Discord bot commands","Organizing command categories and configurations in `commandCategoryConfigRaw`"],"zh":["创建自定义的宝可梦Gacha命令","为Discord机器人命令实现交互式UI元素","在`commandCategoryConfigRaw`中组织命令分类和配置"],"ja":["カスタムポケモンガチャコマンドを作成する","DiscordボットコマンドのインタラクティブなUI要素を実装する","`commandCategoryConfigRaw`でコマンドカテゴリと構成を整理する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 포켓몬 가차 명령을 생성하는 것","Discord 봇 명령을 위한 상호 작용형 UI 요소를 구현하는 것","`commandCategoryConfigRaw`에서 명령 분류 및 구성 조직"],"es":["Crear comandos personalizados de Pokémon Gacha","Implementar elementos de interfaz de usuario interactivos para comandos de bot de Discord","Organizar categorías y configuraciones de comandos en `commandCategoryConfigRaw`"],"fr":["Créer des commandes personnalisées de Pokémon Gacha","Implémenter des éléments d''interface utilisateur interactifs pour les commandes de bot Discord","Organiser les catégories et les configurations de commandes dans `commandCategoryConfigRaw`"],"de":["Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Pokémon-Gacha-Befehle","Implementieren interaktiver Benutzeroberflächenelemente für Discord-Bot-Befehle","Organisieren von Befehlskategorien und -konfigurationen in `commandCategoryConfigRaw`"],"pt":["Criação de comandos personalizados de Pokémon Gacha","Implementação de elementos de interface de usuário interativos para comandos de bot do Discord","Organização de categorias e configurações de comando em `commandCategoryConfigRaw`"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских команд Pokémon Gacha","Реализация интерактивных элементов UI для команд бота Discord","Организация категорий и конфигураций команд в `commandCategoryConfigRaw`"],"ar":["إنشاء أوامر مخصصة لجاشا بوكيمون","تنفيذ عناصر واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية لأوامر بوت ديسكورد","تنظيم فئات وإعدادات الأوامر في `commandCategoryConfigRaw`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JavaScript knowledge","Modification of specific files like `src/config/commandConfig.js` and `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js`","Intended for Discord bot development only"],"zh":["需要JavaScript知识","需要修改特定文件如`src/config/commandConfig.js`和`src/commands/<category>/<command>.js`","仅适用于Discord机器人开发"],"ja":["JavaScriptの知識が必要","特定のファイル such as `src/config/commandConfig.js` and `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js` を修正する必要がある","Discordボット開発のみを目的としている"],"ko":["JavaScript 지식이 필요합니다.","특정 파일을 수정해야 하는데, 예를 들어 `src/config/commandConfig.js`와 `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js`","Discord 봇 개발 전용"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de JavaScript","Modificación de archivos específicos como `src/config/commandConfig.js` y `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js`","Diseñado solo para el desarrollo de bots de Discord"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en JavaScript","Modification de fichiers spécifiques tels que `src/config/commandConfig.js` et `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js`","Conçu uniquement pour le développement de bots Discord"],"de":["Benötigt JavaScript-Kenntnisse","Änderung bestimmter Dateien wie `src/config/commandConfig.js` und `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js`","Nur für die Entwicklung von Discord-Bots konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de JavaScript","Modificação de arquivos específicos como `src/config/commandConfig.js` e `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js`","Destinado apenas ao desenvolvimento de bot do Discord"],"ru":["Требует знаний JavaScript","Изменение конкретных файлов типа `src/config/commandConfig.js` и `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js`","Предназначен только для разработки бота Discord"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة جافاسكريبت","تعديل ملفات محددة مثل `src/config/commandConfig.js` و `src/commands/<category>/<command>.js`","مصمم فقط لتنمية بوت ديسكورد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
