","ru":"Self-Reviewer: Инструмент для проверки кода","ar":"Self-Reviewer: أداة مراجعة الشفرة","en":"self-reviewer"},"description":{"zh":"自我评审技能是 Salesforce 开发任务的综合评估基准，用于验证 Apex、LWC、Flows 等代码","ja":"自己レビュー スキルは Salesforce 開発タスクの包括的ベンチマークであり、Apex、LWC、Flows などのコードを検証する","ko":"자기평가 스킬은 Salesforce 개발 작업의 종합적인 벤치마크로서 Apex, LWC, Flows 등의 코드를 검증","es":"Self-Reviewer es un benchmark integral para evaluar agentes de codificación AI en tareas de desarrollo de Salesforce, incluyendo Apex, LWC, Flows y más","fr":"Self-Reviewer est un benchmark complet pour évaluer les agents de codage AI sur les tâches de développement Salesforce, incluant Apex, LWC, Flows et plus","de":"Self-Reviewer ist ein umfassendes Benchmark für die Bewertung von AI-Coding-Agenten bei Salesforce-Entwicklungsaufgaben, einschließlich Apex, LWC, Flows und ...","pt":"O Self-Reviewer é uma ferramenta de verificação de código que avalia a qualidade do código Apex, LWC, Flows e mais","ru":"Self-Reviewer — это инструмент для проверки кода, который оценивает качество кода Apex, LWC, Flows и многое другое","ar":"Self-Reviewer هو أداة مراجعة الشفرة التي تقييم جودة الشفرة Apex، LWC، Flows وغيرها","en":"The first comprehensive benchmark for evaluating AI coding agents on Salesforce development tasks. Tests Apex, LWC, Flows, and more."},"definition":{"en":"The first comprehensive benchmark for evaluating AI coding agents on Salesforce development tasks. Tests Apex, LWC, Flows, and more."},"features":{"zh":["评估 Apex 代码","验证 LWC 代码","检查 Flows 配置","提高代码质量","减少错误率","提高开发效率"],"ja":["Apex コードの評価","LWC コードの検証","Flows 構成の確認","コード品質の向上","エラー率の削減","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["Apex 코드 평가","LWC 코드 검증","Flows 구성 확인","코드 품질 향상","오류율 감소","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Evaluación de Apex","Evaluación de LWC","Evaluación de Flows","Protocolo de verificación independiente","Aplicación de la principios de verificación de Boris Cherny"],"fr":["Évaluation d''Apex","Évaluation de LWC","Évaluation de Flows","Protocole de vérification indépendant","Application des principes de vérification de Boris Cherny"],"de":["Bewertung von Apex","Bewertung von LWC","Bewertung von Flows","Unabhängiges Verifizierungsprotokoll","Anwendung der Verifizierungsprinzipien von Boris Cherny"],"pt":["Verificação de código Apex","Verificação de código LWC","Verificação de Flows","Protocolo de verificação em 3 etapas","Melhoria da qualidade do código"],"ru":["Проверка кода Apex","Проверка кода LWC","Проверка Flows","Протокол проверки в 3 этапа","Улучшение качества кода"],"ar":["مراجعة الشفرة Apex","مراجعة الشفرة LWC","مراجعة Flows","بروتوكول المراجعة في 3 خطوات","تحسين جودة الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Salesforce","AI 编码代理","自我评审技能","Apex","LWC","Flows","代码评估","代码验证","开发质量"],"ja":["Salesforce","AI コーディングエージェント","自己レビュー スキル","Apex","LWC","Flows","コード評価","コード検証","開発品質"],"ko":["Salesforce","AI 코딩 에이전트","자기평가 스킬","Apex","LWC","Flows","코드 평가","코드 검증","개발 품질"],"es":["Self-Reviewer","Agentes de codificación AI","Desarrollo de Salesforce","Apex","LWC","Flows","Protocolo de verificación","Boris Cherny","Benchmark de codificación AI"],"fr":["Self-Reviewer","Agents de codage AI","Développement Salesforce","Apex","LWC","Flows","Protocole de vérification","Boris Cherny","Benchmark de codage AI"],"de":["Self-Reviewer","AI-Coding-Agenten","Salesforce-Entwicklung","Apex","LWC","Flows","Verifizierungsprotokoll","Boris Cherny","Benchmark für AI-Coding"],"pt":["Self-Reviewer","Verificação de código","Desenvolvimento do Salesforce","Apex","LWC","Flows","Qualidade do código"],"ru":["Self-Reviewer","Проверка кода","Разработка Salesforce","Apex","LWC","Flows","Качество кода"],"ar":["Self-Reviewer","مراجعة الشفرة","تطوير Salesforce","Apex","LWC","Flows","جودة الشفرة"]}},"owner":"yasarshaikh","repo":"SF-bench","repoPath":"yasarshaikh/SF-bench","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"self-reviewer","description":"Performs independent self-review of completed work to catch issues before they become problems. The agent invokes this skill when completing tasks, reviewing changes, or validating quality.","bodyPreview":"# Self-Reviewer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill implements Boris Cherny''s verification principle: \"The most important thing to get great results — give Claude a way to verify its work.\"\n\nThe self-reviewer acts as an independent judge, applying critical scrutiny to work before it''s considered complete.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- After completing any code change\n- Before declaring a task done\n- When reviewing a PR or change\n- When quality is uncertain\n\n## The Verification Protocol\n\n### Step 1: Re-Rea","body":"# Self-Reviewer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill implements Boris Cherny''s verification principle: \"The most important thing to get great results — give Claude a way to verify its work.\"\n\nThe self-reviewer acts as an independent judge, applying critical scrutiny to work before it''s considered complete.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- After completing any code change\n- Before declaring a task done\n- When reviewing a PR or change\n- When quality is uncertain\n\n## The Verification Protocol\n\n### Step 1: Re-Read the Requirement\n\nBefore reviewing code, re-read the original request:\n- What was actually asked?\n- What are the acceptance criteria?\n- Are there implicit requirements?\n\n### Step 2: Review the Diff\n\nRead the diff as if you''re a senior code reviewer:\n\n```\nFOR EACH CHANGE:\n  □ Is this change necessary for the task?\n  □ Could this be simpler?\n  □ Does it follow existing patterns?\n  □ Is it the minimal change needed?\n```\n\n### Step 3: Check for Common Issues\n\n#### Security Issues\n```\n□ No hardcoded secrets\n□ No PII exposed\n□ No internal URLs/IPs\n□ Input validation present\n```\n\n#### Code Quality Issues\n```\n□ No debug prints left\n□ No commented-out code\n□ No TODO without issue link\n□ No magic numbers\n□ No duplicate code\n```\n\n#### Style Issues\n```\n□ Consistent naming\n□ Proper indentation\n□ Import order correct\n□ Line length within limits\n```\n\n### Step 4: Verify It Works\n\nDon''t assume — verify:\n\n```\n□ Run the code (not just compile)\n□ Test the happy path\n□ Test an error case\n□ Check for regressions\n```\n\n### Step 5: Ask Critical Questions\n\n```\n1. Would I approve this PR if someone else submitted it?\n2. Would I be proud to have my name on this code?\n3. Is there anything that could embarrass the team?\n4. Is the change smaller than it could be?\n```\n\n## Red Flags to Catch\n\n### Over-Engineering\n```\nSIGNS:\n- Abstract classes with single implementation\n- Factories for simple instantiation\n- Configuration for non-varying values\n- Interfaces with one implementer\n\nACTION: Simplify\n```\n\n### Under-Testing\n```\nSIGNS:\n- Happy path only\n- No edge cases\n- No error scenarios\n- \"It should work\"\n\nACTION: Add tests\n```\n\n### Scope Creep\n```\nSIGNS:\n- Refactoring unrelated code\n- \"While I''m here\" changes\n- Formatting changes in unrelated files\n- New features not in requirements\n\nACTION: Revert extras, separate PR\n```\n\n### Fragility\n```\nSIGNS:\n- No error handling\n- Assumed inputs always valid\n- No null checks\n- No timeout/retry\n\nACTION: Add defensive code\n```\n\n## The Final Checklist\n\nBefore saying \"done\", complete this checklist:\n\n```\nFUNCTIONALITY:\n□ Meets the original requirement\n□ No regressions introduced\n□ Edge cases handled\n□ Errors handled gracefully\n\nQUALITY:\n□ Code is readable\n□ Follows existing patterns\n□ Properly documented\n□ Tests pass\n\nSAFETY:\n□ No secrets exposed\n□ No security issues\n□ No performance issues\n□ No breaking changes\n\nMINIMAL:\n□ Every line is necessary\n□ No scope creep\n□ No over-engineering\n□ Smallest possible change\n```\n\n## Self-Deception Traps\n\nWatch for these cognitive biases:\n\n### Confirmation Bias\n\"It works because I expect it to work\"\n→ **Test with unexpected inputs**\n\n### Sunk Cost Fallacy\n\"I spent hours on this approach, it must be right\"\n→ **Willing to start over if needed**\n\n### Optimism Bias\n\"The edge cases probably don''t matter\"\n→ **Test the edge cases anyway**\n\n### Anchoring\n\"The first solution I thought of is best\"\n→ **Consider at least one alternative**\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen self-reviewing, document findings:\n\n```markdown\n## Self-Review: [Task/PR]\n\n### Requirement Check\n- [ ] Meets requirements: YES/NO\n\n### Quality Check\n- Passed: X items\n- Warnings: Y items\n- Failed: Z items\n\n### Issues Found\n1. [Issue description] - [Severity] - [Fixed: YES/NO]\n\n### Final Assessment\n- [ ] Ready to merge: YES/NO\n- [ ] Confidence: HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW\n\n### Notes\n[Any observations or concerns]\n```\n\n## Integration with Hooks\n\nThe self-reviewer integrates with:\n- `verify_work.py` hook — Automated checks\n- `session_complete.py` hook — Session logging\n- Pre-commit hooks — Blocking checks\n\nRun manual review in addition to automated checks.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:57:21.666Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing rigorous code verification and validation on Salesforce development tasks","zh":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing rigorous code verification and validation on Salesforce development tasks","ja":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing rigorous code verification and validation on Salesforce development tasks","ko":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing rigorous code verification and validation on Salesforce development tasks","es":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing rigorous code verification and validation on Salesforce development tasks","fr":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing rigorous code verification and validation on Salesforce development tasks","de":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing rigorous code verification and validation on Salesforce development tasks","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de codificação de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de verificação e validação rigorosas de código em tarefas de desenvolvimento do Salesforce","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым требуются строгая проверка и верификация кода для задач разработки Salesforce","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الترميز الذكية مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى التحقق والتحقق الصارم من الشفرة في مهام تطوير Salesforce"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to critically scrutinize Apex, LWC, and Flows code changes using Boris Cherny''s verification principle, ensuring high-quality results through the self-reviewer''s independent judgment and verification protocol","zh":"Empowers agents to critically scrutinize Apex, LWC, and Flows code changes using Boris Cherny''s verification principle, ensuring high-quality results through the self-reviewer''s independent judgment and verification protocol","ja":"Empowers agents to critically scrutinize Apex, LWC, and Flows code changes using Boris Cherny''s verification principle, ensuring high-quality results through the self-reviewer''s independent judgment and verification protocol","ko":"Empowers agents to critically scrutinize Apex, LWC, and Flows code changes using Boris Cherny''s verification principle, ensuring high-quality results through the self-reviewer''s independent judgment and verification protocol","es":"Empowers agents to critically scrutinize Apex, LWC, and Flows code changes using Boris Cherny''s verification principle, ensuring high-quality results through the self-reviewer''s independent judgment and verification protocol","fr":"Empowers agents to critically scrutinize Apex, LWC, and Flows code changes using Boris Cherny''s verification principle, ensuring high-quality results through the self-reviewer''s independent judgment and verification protocol","de":"Empowers agents to critically scrutinize Apex, LWC, and Flows code changes using Boris Cherny''s verification principle, ensuring high-quality results through the self-reviewer''s independent judgment and verification protocol","pt":"Habilita os agentes a examinarem criticamente as alterações de código Apex, LWC e Flows usando o princípio de verificação de Boris Cherny, garantindo resultados de alta qualidade por meio do julgamento independente e do protocolo de verificação do auto-revisor","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью критически проанализировать изменения кода Apex, LWC и Flows, используя принцип верификации Бориса Черного, гарантируя высококачественные результаты посредством независимой оценки и протокола верификации самопроверяющего","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فحص التغييرات في Apex و LWC و Flows بشكل نقدي باستخدام مبدأ التحقق لبوريس تشيرني، مما يضمن نتائجعالية الجودة من خلال الحكم المستقل وبروتوكول التحقق للمراجع الذاتي"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for Apex and LWC projects","Validating Flows configurations before deployment","Debugging Salesforce development tasks using the self-reviewer''s verification protocol"],"zh":["Automating code reviews for Apex and LWC projects","Validating Flows configurations before deployment","Debugging Salesforce development tasks using the self-reviewer''s verification protocol"],"ja":["Automating code reviews for Apex and LWC projects","Validating Flows configurations before deployment","Debugging Salesforce development tasks using the self-reviewer''s verification protocol"],"ko":["Automating code reviews for Apex and LWC projects","Validating Flows configurations before deployment","Debugging Salesforce development tasks using the self-reviewer''s verification protocol"],"es":["Automating code reviews for Apex and LWC projects","Validating Flows configurations before deployment","Debugging Salesforce development tasks using the self-reviewer''s verification protocol"],"fr":["Automating code reviews for Apex and LWC projects","Validating Flows configurations before deployment","Debugging Salesforce development tasks using the self-reviewer''s verification protocol"],"de":["Automating code reviews for Apex and LWC projects","Validating Flows configurations before deployment","Debugging Salesforce development tasks using the self-reviewer''s verification protocol"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para projetos Apex e LWC","Validar configurações de Flows antes da implantação","Depurar tarefas de desenvolvimento do Salesforce usando o protocolo de verificação do auto-revisor"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода для проектов Apex и LWC","Валидировать конфигурации Flows перед развертыванием","Отлаживать задачи разработки Salesforce, используя протокол верификации самопроверяющего"],"ar":["آليّة مراجعة الشفرة للتطبيقات Apex و LWC","التحقق من تكوينات Flows قبل النشر","تصحيح الأخطاء في مهام تطوير Salesforce باستخدام بروتوكول التحقق للمراجع الذاتي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Salesforce development environment access","Limited to Salesforce development tasks like Apex, LWC, and Flows"],"zh":["Requires Salesforce development environment access","Limited to Salesforce development tasks like Apex, LWC, and Flows"],"ja":["Requires Salesforce development environment access","Limited to Salesforce development tasks like Apex, LWC, and Flows"],"ko":["Requires Salesforce development environment access","Limited to Salesforce development tasks like Apex, LWC, and Flows"],"es":["Requires Salesforce development environment access","Limited to Salesforce development tasks like Apex, LWC, and Flows"],"fr":["Requires Salesforce development environment access","Limited to Salesforce development tasks like Apex, LWC, and Flows"],"de":["Requires Salesforce development environment access","Limited to Salesforce development tasks like Apex, LWC, and Flows"],"pt":["Requer acesso 