sos como fatias verticais completas","Testes contínuos para garantir a qualidade do código","Integração com Claude Code e outros assistentes de codificação de IA","Leitura de arquivos de especificação para implementação","Avaliação do impacto das alterações antes da implementação"],"ru":["Разработка функций как небольших, полных вертикальных срезов","Непрерывное тестирование для обеспечения качества кода","Интеграция с Claude Code и другими помощниками кодирования ИИ","Чтение файлов спецификации для реализации","Оценка воздействия изменений перед реализацией"],"ar":["تنفيذ الميزات كشرائح رأسية كاملة","الاختبار المستمر لضمان جودة الكود","التكامل مع Claude Code و مساعدات 编码 الأخرى الإصدار","قراءة ملفات المواصفات للتنفيذ","تقييم تأثير التغييرات قبل التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["规格驱动开发","轻量框架","AI 编码助手","Claude Code","功能实现","垂直切片","持续测试"],"ja":["規格駆動開発","軽量フレームワーク","AI コーディング アシスタント","Claude Code","機能実装","垂直スライス","継続的なテスト"],"ko":["규격 주도 개발","경량 프레임워크","AI 코딩 도구","Claude Code","기능 구현","수직 슬라이스","지속적인 테스트"],"es":["desarrollo de software","especificaciones","pruebas continuas","asistentes de codificación AI","Claude Code","implementación de características"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","spécifications","tests continus","assistants de codage AI","Claude Code","mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités"],"de":["Software-Entwicklung","Spezifikationen","kontinuierliche Tests","AI-Coding-Assistenten","Claude Code","Implementierung von Funktionen"],"pt":["implementação de recursos","desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações","Claude Code","assistente de codificação de IA","testes contínuos","qualidade do código"],"ru":["реализация функций","разработка, управляемая спецификациями","Claude Code","помощник кодирования ИИ","непрерывное тестирование","качество кода"],"ar":["تنفيذ الميزات","تطوير موجه بالمواصفات","Claude Code","مساعد 编码 الإصدار","الاختبار المستمر","جودة الكود"]}},"owner":"heiko-braun","repo":"draft","repoPath":"heiko-braun/draft","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implement","description":"Implement features with phase checkpoints. Use after a spec exists in .claude/specs/ or when implementing a confirmed specification.","bodyPreview":"# Implementation\n\nYou implement features as small, complete vertical slices with continuous testing.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- After the spec skill has created and confirmed a specification\n- When user says \"implement\" and a spec file exists\n- When user explicitly references a spec file\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Load Spec & Assess Blast Radius\n\nRead the relevant `/specs/{feature}.md` file. If multiple specs exist and it''s unclear which one, ask the user.\n\nBefore writing any code, assess the change:\n\n-","body":"# Implementation\n\nYou implement features as small, complete vertical slices with continuous testing.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- After the spec skill has created and confirmed a specification\n- When user says \"implement\" and a spec file exists\n- When user explicitly references a spec file\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Load Spec & Assess Blast Radius\n\nRead the relevant `/specs/{feature}.md` file. If multiple specs exist and it''s unclear which one, ask the user.\n\nBefore writing any code, assess the change:\n\n- **Which modules/files will this touch?** List them. If the spec has an \"Affected Modules\" section, verify it''s still accurate.\n- **Are we modifying shared code?** Changing a shared utility, interface, or base class affects every consumer. Flag this to the user.\n- **Can we contain the change?** Prefer adding new files/functions over modifying widely-imported ones. Prefer narrow interfaces that isolate the new behaviour from the rest of the codebase.\n- **Are we adding new dependencies?** Each dependency is a coupling point. Avoid unless clearly justified.\n\nIf the blast radius is wider than expected, flag it: *\"This will touch N modules beyond what the spec anticipated. Want to proceed or restructure?\"*\n\n### 2. Implement\n\nImplement the spec as **one integrated piece** — types, logic, wiring, and tests together. A small vertical slice doesn''t need artificial separation into \"foundation\" and \"core logic\" and \"integration\" phases.\n\nUse TodoWrite to track progress against the spec''s acceptance criteria.\n\n**Design for modularity as you go:**\n- Place new behaviour behind clear interfaces — functions, types, modules — so callers don''t depend on implementation details.\n- Avoid reaching into the internals of other modules. If you need something, use or extend its public interface.\n- Keep new files/functions narrowly focused. One responsibility per unit.\n- If a change to shared code is unavoidable, make the interface change first, verify existing tests still pass, then build the new behaviour on top.\n\n**Test continuously:**\n- After each meaningful change, run existing tests to catch regressions early.\n- Write tests for new behaviour as you implement it, not after.\n- If the project has a linter or build step, run it periodically — don''t wait until the end.\n\n### 3. Verify & Complete\n\nBefore marking the feature complete:\n\n1. Run the **full test suite** — not just new tests.\n2. Run the **build/linter** if the project has one.\n3. Re-read the spec''s acceptance criteria and check each one explicitly.\n4. Report: \"Criterion met\" or \"Needs attention: {issue}\" for each.\n\nOnly mark complete when all criteria pass and the build is green.\n\nAfter successful implementation:\n- **Update spec status** from `proposed` to `implemented`\n- Check off completed acceptance criteria in the spec file\n- Add any notes about implementation decisions\n\n## Checkpoint Behaviour\n\nSince each spec is a small vertical slice, heavy checkpointing is unnecessary.\n\n**Do checkpoint** (pause and ask the user) when:\n- The blast radius turns out wider than expected\n- You face a design decision with trade-offs the user should weigh\n- A test failure reveals a deeper issue that changes the approach\n\n**Skip checkpoint** for:\n- Normal forward progress within the spec\n- Minor follow-up fixes\n- Formatting/cleanup\n- When user explicitly says \"continue without asking\"\n\n## Recovery\n\nIf implementation is interrupted:\n- TodoWrite preserves progress\n- Spec file shows which criteria are done\n- User can say \"continue implementing {feature}\" to resume\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:57:26.098Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents like Claude Code needing structured spec-driven development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化规格驱动开发能力的代码生成代理，如 Claude Code。","ja":"構造化された仕様駆動開発機能を必要とする Claude Code のようなコード生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 사양 드리븐 개발 기능이 필요한 Claude Code와 같은 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de código como Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo dirigidas por especificaciones estructuradas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de code comme Claude Code qui nécessitent des capacités de développement dirigées par des spécifications structurées.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungsagenten wie Claude Code, die strukturierte spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Código como Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento direcionado por especificações estruturadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации кода, таких как Claude Code, требующих структурированных возможностей разработки на основе спецификаций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل توليد الكود مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تطوير موجهة بمواصفات منظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement features as small, complete vertical slices with continuous testing, utilizing spec files in Markdown format, assessing blast radius, and streamlining development with AI coding assistants.","zh":"赋予代理以实现小型、完整的垂直切片功能，具有连续测试，利用 Markdown 格式的规格文件，评估影响范围，并通过 AI 编码助手简化开发。","ja":"エージェントに、連続テストを備えた小さな完全な垂直スライスの機能を実装する能力を与え、Markdown形式の仕様ファイルを利用し、影響範囲を評価し、AIコードアシストを使用して開発を簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트에 작은 완전한 수직 슬라이스의 기능을 구현하는 능력을 부여하여 연속 테스트를 수행하고 Markdown 형식의 사양 파일을 사용하여 영향을 평가하고 AI 코딩 어시스턴트를 사용하여 개발을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar características como pequeñas rebanadas verticales completas con pruebas continuas, utilizando archivos de especificaciones en formato Markdown, evaluando el radio de explosión y optimizando el desarrollo con asistentes de codificación de inteligencia artificial.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''implémenter des fonctionnalités en tant que petites tranches verticales complètes avec des tests continus, en utilisant des fichiers de spécifications au format Markdown, en évaluant la portée des explosions et en optimisant le développement avec des assistants de codage basés sur l''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Funktionen als kleine, vollständige vertikale Schnitte mit kontinuierlichen Tests zu implementieren, unter Verwendung von Spezifikationsdateien im Markdown-Format, Bewertung des Blast-Radius und Optimierung der Entwicklung mit künstlicher Intelligenz-basierten Codierassistenten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar recursos como pequenas fatias verticais completas com teste contínuo, utilizando arquivos de especificação no formato Markdown, avaliando o raio de explosão e otimizando o desenvolvimento com assistentes de codificação de IA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать функции как небольшие, полные вертикальные срезы с непрерывным тестированием, используя файлы спецификаций в формате Markdown, оценивая радиус взрыва и оптимизируя разработку с помощью помощников кодирования ИИ.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تنفيذ الميزات كقطع رأسية صغيرة كاملة مع الاختبار المستمر، باستخدام ملفات المواصفات بالتنسيق Markdown، وتقييم نصف قطر الانفجار، وتبسيط التطوير بمساعدة مساعدي الترميز الذكي."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing new features based on confirmed specifications","Assessing code changes with continuous testing","Streamlining development with AI-driven spec analysis"],"zh":["根据确认的规格实现新功能","使用连续测试评估代码更改","使用 AI 驱动的规格分析简化开发"],"ja":["確認された仕様に基づいて新しい機能を実装する","連続テストを使用してコードの変更を評価する","AI駆動の仕様解析を使用して開発を簡素化する"],"ko":["확인된 사양을 기반으로 새로운 기능을 구현한다","연속 테스트를 사용하여 코드 변경을 평가한다","AI 구동 사양 분석을 사용하여 개발을 간소화한다"],"es":["Implementación de nuevas características basadas en especificaciones confirmadas","Evaluación de cambios de código con pruebas continuas","Optimización del desarrollo con análisis de especificaciones impulsado por inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités basées sur des spécifications confirmées","Évaluation des modifications de code avec des tests continus","Optimisation du développement avec une analyse de spécifications basée sur l''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Implementierung neuer Funktionen basierend auf bestätigten Spezifikationen","Bewertung von Codeänderungen mit kontinuierlichen Tests","Optimierung der Entwicklung mit spezifikationsgetriebener Analyse durch künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["Implementação de novos recursos com base em especificações confirmadas","Avaliação de alterações de código com teste contínuo","Otimização do desenvolvimento com análise de especificações impulsionada por IA"],"ru":["Реализация новых функций на основе подтвержденных спецификаций","Оценка изменений кода с помощью непрерывного тестирования","Оптимизация разработки с помощью анализа спецификаций на основе ИИ"],"ar":["تنفيذ ميزات جديدة بناءً على مواصفات مؤكدة","تقييم تغييرات الكود باستخدام الاختبار المستمر","تبسيط التطوير بتحليل المواصفات المدفوع بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing spec file in /specs/{feature}.md format","Limited to spec-driven development workflow"],"zh":["需要已有的规格文件，格式为 /specs/{feature}.md","仅限于规格驱动开发工作流"],"ja":["既存の仕様ファイル（/specs/{feature}.md形式）が必要","仕様駆動開発ワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["기존의 사양 파일이 필요합니다. 형식: /specs/{feature}.md","사양 드리븐 개발 워크플로에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere un archivo de especificaciones existente en formato /specs/{característica}.md","Limitado al flujo de trabajo de desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de spécifications existant au format /specs/{fonctionnalité}.md","Limité au flux de travail de développement dirigé par des spécifications"],"de":["Benötigt eine vorhandene Spezifikationsdatei im Format /specs/{Funktion}.md","Begrenzt auf den spezifikationsgetriebenen Entwicklungswerkfluss"],"pt":["Exige arquivo de especificação existente no formato /specs/{feature}.md","Limitado ao fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento direcionado por especificações"],"ru":["Требует существующего файла спецификации в формате /specs/{feature}.md","Ограничен workflow''ом разработки на основе спецификаций"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف مواصفات موجود بالتنسيق /specs/{feature}.md","محدود بتدفق عمل التطوير الموجه بمواصفات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('F3-Nation/f3-nation/f3-dev-servers', 'community', 'F3-Nation', 'f3-nation', 'F3-Nation/f3-nation', 'f3-dev-servers', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z', '2026-02-18T08:57:53.037Z', NULL, '{"id":"F3-Nation/f3-nation/f3-dev-servers","name":"f3-dev-servers","description":{"zh":"F3 Nation 开发服务器为本地开发提供了三个必需的服务：Caddy、API 和 Map。","ja":"F3 Nation 開発サーバーは、ローカル開発のために 3 つの必須サービス、Caddy、API、Map を提供します。","ko":"F3 네이션 개발 서버는 로컬 개발을 위해 필요한 세 가지 서비스를 제공합니다: 캐디, API, 맵","es":"El monorepo de F3 Nation requiere tres servidores de desarrollo para funcionar correctamente. Aprende a iniciar los servicios de Caddy, API y Mapa para el desarrollo local.","fr":"Le monorepo de F3 Nation nécessite trois serveurs de développement pour fonctionner correctement. Découvrez comment démarrer les services Caddy, API et Carte pour le développement local.","de":"Das F3-Nation-Monorepo benötigt drei Entwicklungsserver, um ordnungsgemäß zu funktionieren. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Dienste Caddy, API und Karte für die lokale Entwicklung starten.","pt":"O F3 Nation Monorepo oferece uma forma eficiente de iniciar os servidores de desenvolvimento local. Inicie os três servidores necessários com comandos Shell.","ru":"Монорепозиторий F3 Nation предоставляет эффективный способ запуска локальных серверов разработки. Запустите три необходимых сервера с помощью команд Shell.","ar":"يقدم مونوريبوزиторي F3 Nation طريقة فعالة لتشغيل خادمات التطوير المحلية. ابدأ ثلاث خادمات مطلوبة باستخدام أوامر Shell.","en":"F3 Nation Monorepo"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"F3 Nation 开发服务器","ja":"F3 Nation 開発サーバー","ko":"F3 네이션 개발 서버","es":"Servidores de Desarrollo F3 Nation","fr":"Serveurs de Développement F3 Nation","de":"F3 Nation Entwicklungsserver","pt":"Servidores de Desenvolvimento F3 Nation","ru":"Серверы разработки F3 Nation","ar":"خادمات التطوير F3 Nation","en":"f3-dev-servers"},"description":{"zh":"F3 Nation 开发服务器为本地开发提供了三个必需的服务：Caddy、API 和 Map。","ja":"F3 Nation 開発サーバーは、ローカル開発のために 3 つの必須サービス、Caddy、API、Map を提供します。","ko":"F3 네이션 개발 서버는 로컬 개발을 위해 필요한 세 가지 서비스를 제공합니다: 캐디, API, 맵","es":"El monorepo de F3 Nation requiere tres servidores de desarrollo para funcionar correctamente. Aprende a iniciar los servicios de Caddy, API y Mapa para el de...","fr":"Le monorepo de F3 Nation nécessite trois serveurs de développement pour fonctionner correctement. Découvrez comment démarrer les services Caddy, API et Carte...","de":"Das F3-Nation-Monorepo benötigt drei Entwicklungsserver, um ordnungsgemäß zu funktionieren. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Dienste Caddy, API und Karte für die lo...","pt":"O F3 Nation Monorepo oferece uma forma eficiente de iniciar os servidores de desenvolvimento local. Inicie os três servidores necessários com comandos Shell.","ru":"Монорепозиторий F3 Nation предоставляет эффективный способ запуска локальных серверов разработки. Запустите три необходимых сервера с помощью команд Shell.","ar":"يقدم مونوريبوزиторي F3 Nation طريقة فعالة لتشغيل خادمات التطوير المحلية. ابدأ ثلاث خادمات مطلوبة باستخدام أوامر Shell.","en":"F3 Nation Monorepo"},"definition":{"en":"F3 Nation Monorepo"},"features":{"zh":["启动 Caddy 服务","启动 API 服务","启动 Map 服务","支持并行启动","支持背景运行","支持自定义工作目录"],"ja":["Caddy サービスを起動","API サービスを起動","Map サービスを起動","並行起動をサポート","バックグラウンド実行をサポート","カスタム作業ディレクトリをサポート"],"ko":["캐디 서비스 시작","API 서비스 시작","맵 서비스 시작","병렬 시작 지원","백그라운드 실행 지원","사용자 지정 작업 디렉토리 지원"],"es":["Iniciar los tres servidores de desarrollo necesarios","Configurar y ejecutar los servicios de Caddy, API y Mapa","Desarrollo local de F3 Nation","Uso de comandos Shell para iniciar los servicios","Ejecución paralela de los servicios con `block_until_ms: 0`"],"fr":["Démarrez les trois serveurs de développement nécessaires","Configurez et exécutez les services Caddy, API et Carte","Développement local de F3 Nation","Utilisation de commandes Shell pour démarrer les services","Exécution parallèle des services avec `block_until_ms: 0`"],"de":["Starten Sie die drei Entwicklungsserver, die erforderlich sind","Konfigurieren und Ausführen der Dienste Caddy, API und Karte","Lokale Entwicklung von F3 Nation","Verwendung von Shell-Befehlen zum Starten der Dienste","Parallele Ausführung der Dienste mit `block_until_ms: 0`"],"pt":["Iniciação de três servidores de desenvolvimento","Uso de comandos Shell para iniciar os serviços","Configuração do Caddy com o arquivo Caddyfile","Iniciação do API com o comando pnpm","Iniciação do Map com o comando pnpm","Desenvolvimento local da F3 Nation"],"ru":["Запуск трех серверов разработки","Использование команд Shell для запуска служб","Настройка Caddy с помощью файла Caddyfile","Запуск API с помощью команды pnpm","Запуск Map с помощью команды pnpm","Локальное развитие F3 Nation"],"ar":["تشغيل ثلاث خادمات تطوير","استخدام أوامر Shell لتشغيل الخدمات","تكوين Caddy باستخدام ملف Caddyfile","تشغيل API باستخدام أمر pnpm","تشغيل Map باستخدام أمر pnpm","التطوير المحلي لـ F3 Nation"]},"keywords":{"zh":["F3 Nation","开发服务器","本地开发","Caddy","API","Map","并行启动","背景运行","自定义工作目录"],"ja":["F3 Nation","開発サーバー","ローカル開発","Caddy","API","Map","並行起動","バックグラウンド実行","カスタム作業ディレクトリ"],"ko":["F3 네이션","개발 서버","로컬 개발","캐디","API","맵","병렬 시작","백그라운드 실행","사용자 지정 작업 디렉토리"],"es":["F3 Nation","desarrollo local","servidores de desarrollo","Caddy","API","Mapa","monorepo","comandos Shell","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["F3 Nation","développement local","serveurs de développement","Caddy","API","Carte","monorepo","commandes Shell","développement de logiciels"],"de":["F3 Nation","lokale Entwicklung","Entwicklungsserver","Caddy","API","Karte","Monorepo","Shell-Befehle","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["F3 Nation Monorepo","servidores de desenvolvimento","comandos Shell","Caddy","pnpm","desenvolvimento local","F3 Nation","monorepo","servidores de desenvolvimento local"],"ru":["Монорепозиторий F3 Nation","серверы разработки","команды Shell","Caddy","pnpm","локальное развитие","F3 Nation","монорепозиторий","серверы разработки локально"],"ar":["مونوريبوزиторي F3 Nation","خادمات التطوير","أوامر Shell","Caddy","pnpm","التطوير المحلي","F3 Nation","مونوريبوزиторي","خادمات التطوير المحلية"]}},"owner":"F3-Nation","repo":"f3-nation","repoPath":"F3-Nation/f3-nation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"f3-dev-servers","description":"Start and manage f3-nation development servers (Caddy, API, Map). Use when the user wants to start dev servers, check if services are running, or troubleshoot the local development environment.","bodyPreview":"# F3 Nation Development Servers\n\nStart the three dev servers needed for local f3-nation development.\n\n## Starting All Services (Agent Method)\n\nThe agent CAN start all three services by running Shell commands with `block_until_ms: 0` to background them immediately.\n\nRun these in parallel with `block_until_ms: 0` and `working_directory` set to the repo root:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Caddy\ncaddy run --config Caddyfile\n\n# 2. API\nPORT=3001 pnpm -F f3-nation-api dev\n\n# 3. Map\nPORT=3000 pnpm -F f3-nation-map dev","body":"# F3 Nation Development Servers\n\nStart the three dev servers needed for local f3-nation development.\n\n## Starting All Services (Agent Method)\n\nThe agent CAN start all three services by running Shell commands with `block_until_ms: 0` to background them immediately.\n\nRun these in parallel with `block_until_ms: 0` and `working_directory` set to the repo root:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Caddy\ncaddy run --config Caddyfile\n\n# 2. API\nPORT=3001 pnpm -F f3-nation-api dev\n\n# 3. Map\nPORT=3000 pnpm -F f3-nation-map dev\n```\n\nNote: nvm/rbenv/jenv should be auto-loaded via `~/.zshenv` so no prefix needed.\n\n**Agent workflow:**\n\n1. Run check-status.sh first to see what''s already running\n2. Start only the services that aren''t running (use `block_until_ms: 0` for each)\n3. Wait 5 seconds for services to initialize\n4. Run check-status.sh again to verify all services are up\n5. Optionally read terminal output files to check for startup errors\n\n## Quick Check: Are Services Running?\n\nRun the status check script from the repo root:\n\n```bash\n.cursor/skills/f3-dev-servers/scripts/check-status.sh\n```\n\nThis script uses `nc` (netcat) for fast port checking (~1 second). It checks ports 443, 3000, and 3001.\n\nOr check manually:\n\n```bash\n# Fast check with netcat\nnc -z localhost 443 && echo \"Caddy OK\" || echo \"Caddy DOWN\"\nnc -z localhost 3000 && echo \"Map OK\" || echo \"Map DOWN\"\nnc -z localhost 3001 && echo \"API OK\" || echo \"API DOWN\"\n```\n\nNote: Avoid using `lsof` for port checks on macOS - it takes 30+ seconds.\n\n## Manual Startup (User Method)\n\nIf the user prefers to start manually in named terminals:\n\n### 1. Caddy (reverse proxy) - in `caddy` terminal\n\n```bash\ncaddy run --config Caddyfile\n```\n\nCaddy proxies:\n\n- `https://map.f3nation.test` → `localhost:3000`\n- `https://api.f3nation.test` → `localhost:3001`\n\n### 2. API Server - in `api` terminal\n\n```bash\nPORT=3001 pnpm -F f3-nation-api dev\n```\n\n### 3. Map App - in `map` terminal\n\n```bash\nPORT=3000 pnpm -F f3-nation-map dev\n```\n\n## Startup Order\n\nStart in this order for best results:\n\n1. Caddy first (handles HTTPS)\n2. API second (the map app depends on API endpoints)\n3. Map app last\n\n## Verifying Startup Success\n\nAfter starting, check terminal outputs for these success indicators:\n\n- **Caddy**: Look for `\"msg\":\"serving initial configuration\"`\n- **API**: Look for `✓ Ready in X.Xs`\n- **Map**: Look for `✓ Ready in X.Xs`\n\n## Stopping Services\n\nTo stop services, use `pkill` (faster than lsof):\n\n```bash\npkill -f \"caddy run\"\npkill -f \"f3-nation-api dev\"\npkill -f \"f3-nation-map dev\"\n```\n\nOr kill by port (slower, lsof takes 30+ seconds on macOS):\n\n```bash\nkill -9 $(lsof -t -i :3000)  # Map\nkill -9 $(lsof -t -i :3001)  # API\nsudo kill -9 $(lsof -t -i :443)   # Caddy (needs sudo for port 443)\n```\n\nFor user-started services in IDE terminals, press `Ctrl+C` in the terminal.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Port already in use\n\n```bash\n# Find what''s using the port\nlsof -i :3000\n\n# Kill it\nkill -9 <PID>\n```\n\n### Node version warning\n\nIf you see this warning:\n\n```\nWARN  Unsupported engine: wanted: {\"node\":\">=20.19.0\"} (current: {\"node\":\"v18.20.4\"...})\n```\n\nThe `~/.zshenv` file may be missing or misconfigured. It should contain:\n\n```bash\nexport NVM_DIR=\"$HOME/.nvm\"\n[ -s \"$NVM_DIR/nvm.sh\" ] && \\. \"$NVM_DIR/nvm.sh\"\n```\n\nThis ensures nvm is loaded for all zsh shells, including non-interactive ones from Cursor.\n\n### Caddy certificate issues\n\nEnsure the certificate files exist in the project root:\n\n- `map.f3nation.test+1-cert.pem`\n- `map.f3nation.test+1-key.pem`\n\nIf missing, regenerate with mkcert:\n\n```bash\nmkcert map.f3nation.test api.f3nation.test\n```\n\n### Database not running\n\nIf you see database connection errors, ensure PostgreSQL/Docker is running:\n\n```bash\ndocker ps  # Check if postgres container is running\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:57:53.037Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing simultaneous development server management for F3 Nation Monorepo","zh":"非常适合需要同时进行全栈开发服务器管理的F3 Nation Monorepo的全栈代理","ja":"F3 Nation Monorepoのフルスタックエージェントが同時に開発サーバー管理を行う必要がある場合に最適","ko":"F3 Nation Monorepo의 풀스택 에이전트가 동시에 개발 서버 관리를 수행해야 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan gestión simultánea de servidores de desarrollo para F3 Nation Monorepo","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack nécessitant une gestion simultanée de serveurs de développement pour F3 Nation Monorepo","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine simultane Entwicklungsserververwaltung für F3 Nation Monorepo benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Full Stack que precisam de gestão simultânea de servidor de desenvolvimento para o Monorepo da Nação F3","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым требуется одновременное управление сервером разработки для Monorepo F3 Nation","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرمجيات الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة متزامنة للخادم التطويعي لمنصة F3 Nation Monorepo"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to start and manage Caddy, API, and Map development servers in parallel using Shell commands, leveraging `block_until_ms: 0` for immediate backgrounding and `working_directory` for repo root synchronization, while utilizing protocols like Caddyfile and libraries such as pnpm","zh":"赋予代理开始和管理Caddy、API和Map开发服务器的能力，使用Shell命令并行运行，利用`block_until_ms: 0`进行立即后台运行和`working_directory`进行仓库根目录同步，同时利用Caddyfile等协议和pnpm等库","ja":"Caddy、API、およびMap開発サーバーを開始および管理するエージェントの能力を提供し、シェルコマンドを使用して並列実行し、`block_until_ms: 0`を使用して即時のバックグラウンド実行と`working_directory`を使用してリポジトリルートディレクトリの同期を実現し、Caddyfileなどのプロトコルやpnpmなどのライブラリを利用","ko":"에이전트가 Caddy, API 및 Map 개발 서버를 시작하고 관리할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, Shell 명령어를 사용하여 병렬로 실행하고, `block_until_ms: 0`를 사용하여 즉시 백그라운드 실행과 `working_directory`를 사용하여 저장소 루트 디렉토리 동기화를 수행하며, Caddyfile 등의 프로토콜과 pnpm 등의 라이브러리를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a iniciar y gestionar servidores de desarrollo Caddy, API y Map en paralelo utilizando comandos Shell, aprovechando `block_until_ms: 0` para el trasfondo inmediato y `working_directory` para la sincronización de la raíz del repositorio, mientras utiliza protocolos como Caddyfile y bibliotecas como pnpm","fr":"Permet aux agents de démarrer et de gérer les serveurs de développement Caddy, API et Map en parallèle en utilisant des commandes Shell, en exploitant `block_until_ms: 0` pour le passage en arrière-plan immédiat et `working_directory` pour la synchronisation de la racine du référentiel, tout en utilisant des protocoles tels que Caddyfile et des bibliothèques telles que pnpm","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Caddy-, API- und Map-Entwicklungsserver parallel mithilfe von Shell-Befehlen zu starten und zu verwalten, wobei `block_until_ms: 0` für das sofortige Hintergrundausführen und `working_directory` für die Synchronisierung der Repository-Wurzel genutzt wird, während Protokolle wie Caddyfile und Bibliotheken wie pnpm verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a iniciar e gerenciar servidores de desenvolvimento Caddy, API e Map em paralelo usando comandos Shell, aproveitando `block_until_ms: 0` para background imediato e `working_directory` para sincronização da raiz do repositório, enquanto utiliza protocolos como Caddyfile e bibliotecas como pnpm","ru":"Позволяет агентам запускать и управлять серверами разработки Caddy, API и Map параллельно с помощью команд Shell, используя `block_until_ms: 0` для немедленного вынесения в фон и `working_directory` для синхронизации корневого каталога репозитория, а также использует протоколы типа Caddyfile и библиотеки вроде pnpm","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتشغيل و إدارة خادم التطوير Caddy و API و Map بالتوازي باستخدام أوامر Shell، مع الاستفادة من `block_until_ms: 0` للحفظ الفوري في الخلفية و `working_directory` لمزامنة جذر مخزن الإصدارات، مع استخدام بروتوكولات مثل Caddyfile ومكتبات مثل pnpm"},"useCases":{"en":["Starting all F3 Nation development services","Managing Caddy server with custom configurations","Running API and Map servers in parallel for local development"],"zh":["启动所有F3 Nation开发服务","使用自定义配置管理Caddy服务器","并行运行API和Map服务器进行本地开发"],"ja":["すべてのF3 Nation開発サービスを起動","カスタム構成でCaddyサーバーを管理","APIおよびMapサーバーを並列実行してローカル開発"],"ko":["모든 F3 Nation 개발 서비스 시작","사용자 지정 구성으로 Caddy 서버 관리","API 및 Map 서버를 병렬로 실행하여 로컬 개발"],"es":["Iniciar todos los servicios de desarrollo de F3 Nation","Gestionar el servidor Caddy con configuraciones personalizadas","Ejecutar servidores API y Map en paralelo para el desarrollo local"],"fr":["Démarrer tous les services de développement F3 Nation","Gérer le serveur Caddy avec des configurations personnalisées","Exécuter les serveurs API et Map en parallèle pour le développement local"],"de":["Alle F3 Nation-Entwicklungsdienste starten","Caddy-Server mit benutzerdefinierten Konfigurationen verwalten","API- und Map-Server parallel für die lokale Entwicklung ausführen"],"pt":["Iniciar todos os serviços de desenvolvimento da Nação F3","Gerenciar servidor Caddy com configurações personalizadas","Executar servidores API e Map em paralelo para desenvolvimento local"],"ru":["Запуск всех сервисов разработки F3 Nation","Управление сервером Caddy с настраиваемыми конфигурациями","Запуск серверов API и Map параллельно для локальной разработки"],"ar":["تشغيل جميع خدمات التطوير لمنصة F3 Nation","إدارة خادم Caddy بإعدادات مخصصة","تشغيل خادم API و خادم Map بالتوازي من أجل التطوير المحلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the F3 Nation Monorepo","Needs pnpm and Caddy installed","Limited to local development environment"],"zh":["需要访问F3 Nation Monorepo","需要安装pnpm和Caddy","仅限本地开发环境"],"ja":["F3 Nation Monorepoへのアクセスが必要","pnpmおよびCaddyのインストールが必要","ローカル開発環境でのみ使用可能"],"ko":["F3 Nation Monorepo에 접근할 수 있어야 함","pnpm과 Caddy가 설치되어 있어야 함","로컬 개발 환경에서만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al Monorepo de F3 Nation","Necesita pnpm y Caddy instalados","Limitado al entorno de desarrollo local"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au Monorepo F3 Nation","Nécessite pnpm et Caddy installés","Limité à l''environnement de développement local"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das F3 Nation-Monorepo","Benötigt pnpm und Caddy installiert","Begrenzt auf die lokale Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao Monorepo da Nação F3","Necessita de pnpm e Caddy instalados","Limitado ao ambiente de desenvolvimento local"],"ru":["Требует доступа к Monorepo F3 Nation","Требует установки pnpm и Caddy","Ограничен локальной средой разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى منصة Monorepo F3 Nation","يحتاج إلى تثبيت pnpm و Caddy","محدود بالبيئة التطويرية المحلية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
