的代码审查过程，专注于生产就绪性、错误处理和项目约定","ja":"コードレビューツールは、構造化されたコードレビュー过程を提供し、生産性、エラーハンドリング、プロジェクト規約に焦点を当てています","ko":"코드 리뷰 도구는 구조화된 코드 리뷰 프로세스를 제공하며 생산 준비, 오류 처리 및 프로젝트 규약에 중점을 둡니다","es":"El revisor de código es una herramienta integral para evaluar la calidad del código en tareas de desarrollo de Salesforce.","fr":"Le réviseur de code est un outil complet pour évaluer la qualité du code dans les tâches de développement Salesforce.","de":"Der Code-Reviewer ist ein umfassendes Tool zur Bewertung der Code-Qualität bei Salesforce-Entwicklungsaufgaben.","pt":"O Code Reviewer é uma ferramenta de análise de código que ajuda os desenvolvedores a melhorar a qualidade do código-fonte","ru":"Code Reviewer - это инструмент для анализа кода, который помогает разработчикам улучшить качество исходного кода","ar":"مُراجِع الشفرة هو أداة لمراجعة الشفرات البرمجية تساعد المطورين على تحسين جودة الشفرة المصدرية","en":"The first comprehensive benchmark for evaluating AI coding agents on Salesforce development tasks. Tests Apex, LWC, Flows, and more."},"definition":{"en":"The first comprehensive benchmark for evaluating AI coding agents on Salesforce development tasks. Tests Apex, LWC, Flows, and more."},"features":{"zh":["结构化代码审查过程","生产就绪性评估","错误处理检查","项目约定遵守","Apex、LWC、Flows支持"],"ja":["構造化されたコードレビュー过程","生産性評価","エラーハンドリングの確認","プロジェクト規約の遵守","Apex、LWC、Flowsのサポート"],"ko":["구조화된 코드 리뷰 프로세스","생산 준비 평가","오류 처리 확인","프로젝트 규약 준수","Apex, LWC, Flows 지원"],"es":["Evaluación de la producción","Manejo de errores","Adherencia a convenciones de proyecto","Proceso de revisión de código estructurado","Cumplimiento de los estándares SF-Bench"],"fr":["Évaluation de la production","Gestion des erreurs","Adhésion aux conventions de projet","Processus de révision de code structuré","Respect des normes SF-Bench"],"de":["Bewertung der Produktion","Fehlerbehandlung","Einhaltung von Projekt konventionen","Strukturierter Code-Review-Prozess","Einhaltung der SF-Bench-Standards"],"pt":["Análise de código-fonte","Avaliação da qualidade do código","Verificação de erros e exceções","Compatibilidade com Salesforce","Integração com Apex, LWC e Flows"],"ru":["Анализ исходного кода","Оценка качества кода","Проверка ошибок и исключений","Совместимость с Salesforce","Интеграция с Apex, LWC и Flows"],"ar":["تحليل الشفرة المصدرية","تقييم جودة الشفرة","فحص الأخطاء والاستثناءات","التوافق مع Salesforce","التكامل مع Apex، LWC و Flows"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Salesforce","代码审查","AI编码代理","Apex","LWC","Flows","生产就绪性","错误处理"],"ja":["Salesforce","コードレビュー","AIコーディングエージェント","Apex","LWC","Flows","生産性","エラーハンドリング"],"ko":["Salesforce","코드 리뷰","AI 코딩 에이전트","Apex","LWC","Flows","생산 준비","오류 처리"],"es":["revisión de código","desarrollo de Salesforce","evaluación de código","calidad del código","SF-Bench","Apex","LWC","Flows"],"fr":["révision de code","développement Salesforce","évaluation de code","qualité du code","SF-Bench","Apex","LWC","Flows"],"de":["Code-Review","Salesforce-Entwicklung","Code-Bewertung","Code-Qualität","SF-Bench","Apex","LWC","Flows"],"pt":["code reviewer","análise de código","qualidade do código","Salesforce","Apex","LWC","Flows","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["code reviewer","анализ кода","качество кода","Salesforce","Apex","LWC","Flows","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مُراجِع الشفرة","تحليل الشفرة","جودة الشفرة","Salesforce","Apex","LWC","Flows","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"yasarshaikh","repo":"SF-bench","repoPath":"yasarshaikh/SF-bench","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-reviewer","description":"Performs code reviews following SF-Bench quality standards. The agent invokes this skill when reviewing code, evaluating pull requests, or assessing code quality for production-readiness.","bodyPreview":"# Code Reviewer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides a structured code review process following SF-Bench quality standards. It focuses on production-readiness, error handling, and adherence to project conventions.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Reviewing code changes or pull requests\n- Assessing code quality before merging\n- Evaluating production-readiness\n- Checking adherence to project standards\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n### Critical (Must Fix)\n\n#### Error Handling\n- [ ] Retry logic for transient ope","body":"# Code Reviewer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides a structured code review process following SF-Bench quality standards. It focuses on production-readiness, error handling, and adherence to project conventions.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Reviewing code changes or pull requests\n- Assessing code quality before merging\n- Evaluating production-readiness\n- Checking adherence to project standards\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n### Critical (Must Fix)\n\n#### Error Handling\n- [ ] Retry logic for transient operations (API calls, org creation)\n- [ ] Exponential backoff implemented correctly (2^n pattern)\n- [ ] Errors logged with full context (task ID, attempt number, error details)\n- [ ] No silent failures (all exceptions handled or propagated)\n\n#### Resource Management\n- [ ] Scratch orgs deleted in finally blocks\n- [ ] Context managers used for file/connection handling\n- [ ] No resource leaks (unclosed connections, orphaned processes)\n- [ ] Timeouts set for external operations\n\n#### Security\n- [ ] No hardcoded secrets or credentials\n- [ ] API keys read from environment variables\n- [ ] Sensitive data not logged\n- [ ] Input validation for user-provided data\n\n### Important (Should Fix)\n\n#### Code Quality\n- [ ] PEP 8 compliance (line length 100)\n- [ ] Type hints on all function signatures\n- [ ] Docstrings follow Google style format\n- [ ] Functions focused and small (< 50 lines)\n\n#### Logging\n- [ ] Structured logging with appropriate levels\n- [ ] Context included (task ID, operation name)\n- [ ] Debug logs for troubleshooting\n- [ ] No excessive logging in hot paths\n\n#### Testing\n- [ ] Unit tests for new functionality\n- [ ] Edge cases covered\n- [ ] Error conditions tested\n- [ ] Test coverage meets threshold (≥80%)\n\n### Suggestions (Nice to Have)\n\n#### Performance\n- [ ] Parallel processing where safe\n- [ ] Caching for expensive operations\n- [ ] Batch API calls when possible\n- [ ] No unnecessary iterations\n\n#### Documentation\n- [ ] Complex logic explained in comments\n- [ ] README updated if needed\n- [ ] Docstrings accurate and complete\n- [ ] Examples provided for non-obvious usage\n\n## Review Process\n\n### Step 1: Understand the Change\n1. Read the PR description or commit message\n2. Identify the scope (files changed, components affected)\n3. Understand the intended behavior\n\n### Step 2: Check Critical Issues\n1. Scan for error handling patterns\n2. Verify resource cleanup\n3. Check for security issues\n4. Identify any breaking changes\n\n### Step 3: Review Code Quality\n1. Check adherence to style guidelines\n2. Verify type hints and docstrings\n3. Assess test coverage\n4. Review logging practices\n\n### Step 4: Validate Functionality\n1. Trace the code path mentally\n2. Identify edge cases\n3. Check error scenarios\n4. Verify business logic correctness\n\n### Step 5: Provide Feedback\n1. Prioritize issues (Critical > Important > Suggestions)\n2. Provide specific line references\n3. Suggest alternatives when rejecting\n4. Acknowledge good patterns\n\n## Feedback Format\n\n### For Issues\n```\n**[CRITICAL/IMPORTANT/SUGGESTION]** Line XX-YY\n\n**Issue**: [Brief description of the problem]\n\n**Why**: [Explanation of why this is problematic]\n\n**Suggestion**: [Recommended fix or alternative]\n```\n\n### For Approval\n```\n**Approved**\n\nChanges look good. Key observations:\n- [Positive observation 1]\n- [Positive observation 2]\n\nMinor suggestions (non-blocking):\n- [Optional improvement 1]\n```\n\n## SF-Bench Specific Patterns\n\n### Retry Pattern (Required for transient operations)\n```python\n# Expected pattern\nfor attempt in range(max_retries):\n    try:\n        result = operation()\n        return result\n    except TransientError as e:\n        if attempt < max_retries - 1:\n            delay = initial_delay * (2 ** attempt)\n            logger.warning(f\"Attempt {attempt + 1} failed, retrying in {delay}s...\")\n            time.sleep(delay)\n            continue\n        raise\n```\n\n### Cleanup Pattern (Required for scratch orgs)\n```python\n# Expected pattern\ntry:\n    org_alias = create_scratch_org()\n    # ... operations ...\nfinally:\n    delete_scratch_org(org_alias)  # Always executes\n```\n\n### Logging Pattern (Required for operations)\n```python\n# Expected pattern\nlogger.info(f\"Starting operation for task {task_id}\")\nlogger.debug(f\"Input preview: {input[:500]}...\")\nlogger.error(f\"Operation failed: {error}\", exc_info=True)\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Flag\n\n### Silent Failures\n```python\n# BAD\ntry:\n    operation()\nexcept Exception:\n    pass  # Silent failure\n\n# GOOD\ntry:\n    operation()\nexcept Exception as e:\n    logger.error(f\"Operation failed: {e}\", exc_info=True)\n    raise\n```\n\n### Resource Leaks\n```python\n# BAD\norg = create_scratch_org()\ndeploy(org)\n# org never deleted if deploy fails\n\n# GOOD\norg = create_scratch_org()\ntry:\n    deploy(org)\nfinally:\n    delete_scratch_org(org)\n```\n\n### Hardcoded Secrets\n```python\n# BAD\napi_key = \"sk-12345abcde\"\n\n# GOOD\napi_key = os.environ.get(\"API_KEY\")\n```\n\n### Missing Type Hints\n```python\n# BAD\ndef process(data):\n    return result\n\n# GOOD\ndef process(data: Dict[str, Any]) -> List[Result]:\n    return result\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:57:10.561Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Salesforce Development Agents requiring comprehensive code review and validation for Apex, LWC, and Flows.","zh":"适合需要对 Apex、LWC 和 Flows 进行全面代码审查和验证的 Salesforce 开发代理。","ja":"Apex、LWC、Flows に対する包括的なコードレビューと検証を必要とする Salesforce 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Apex, LWC, Flows에 대한 포괄적인 코드 리뷰 및 유효성을 검사해야 하는 Salesforce 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de Salesforce que requieren una revisión y validación de código comprehensiva para Apex, LWC y Flows.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Salesforce nécessitant une révision et une validation de code complètes pour Apex, LWC et Flows.","de":"Ideal für Salesforce-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine umfassende Code-Überprüfung und -Validierung für Apex, LWC und Flows benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do Salesforce que exigem uma revisão e validação de código abrangentes para Apex, LWC e Flows.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке Salesforce, требующих всестороннего обзора и проверки кода для Apex, LWC и Flows.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير Salesforce التي تتطلب مراجعة وتصديق شاملة للكود ل Apax و LWC و Flows."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce production-readiness, error handling, and adherence to SF-Bench quality standards, ensuring high-quality code through rigorous review checklists and critical assessments like retry logic for transient operations.","zh":"赋予代理人执行生产就绪性、错误处理和遵循 SF-Bench 质量标准的能力，通过严格的审查清单和关键评估（如暂时操作的重试逻辑）确保高质量的代码。","ja":"エージェントに生産性、エラー処理、SF-Bench 品質基準の遵守を実施する能力を与え、厳格なレビューチェックリストや一時的な操作のリトライロジックなどの重要な評価を通じて、高品質のコードを保証します。","ko":"에이전트에게 생산 준비, 오류 처리 및 SF-Bench 품질 표준을 준수하도록 실행하는 능력을 부여하여 엄격한 검토 체크리스트 및 일시적 작업의 재시도 로직과 같은 임계 평가를 통해 높은 품질의 코드를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a garantizar la preparación para la producción, el manejo de errores y el cumplimiento de los estándares de calidad SF-Bench, asegurando un código de alta calidad a través de listas de verificación rigurosas y evaluaciones críticas como la lógica de reintento para operaciones transitorias.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''assurer la préparation à la production, la gestion des erreurs et le respect des normes de qualité SF-Bench, garantissant un code de haute qualité grâce à des listes de vérification rigoureuses et à des évaluations critiques comme la logique de réessai pour les opérations transitoires.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Produktionsreife, Fehlerbehandlung und Einhaltung der SF-Bench-Qualitätsstandards sicherzustellen, indem sie hochwertigen Code durch strenge Überprüfungslisten und kritische Bewertungen wie Wiederholungslogik für transitorische Operationen gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor a prontidão para produção, tratamento de erros e aderência aos padrões de qualidade do SF-Bench, garantindo um código de alta qualidade por meio de listas de verificação rigorosas e avaliações críticas, como lógica de repetição para operações transitórias.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать готовность к производству, обработку ошибок и соблюдение стандартов качества SF-Bench, гарантируя высококачественный код посредством тщательных проверочных списков и критических оценок, таких как логика повторных попыток для транзитных операций.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من فرض جاهزية الإنتاج ومعالجة الأخطاء والامتثال لمعايير جودة SF-Bench، مما يضمن رمزًا عالي الجودة من خلال قوائم مراجعة صارمة وتقييمات حرجة مثل منطق إعادة المحاولة للعمليات العابرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing code changes for production-readiness","Assessing code quality before merging pull requests","Evaluating adherence to project conventions and standards"],"zh":["审查代码更改以确保生产就绪性","评估代码质量以便在合并拉取请求之前","评估项目约定和标准的遵守情况"],"ja":["生産性のあるコード変更のレビュー","プルリクエストのマージ前にコード品質を評価する","プロジェクト規約と基準の遵守状況を評価する"],"ko":["생산 준비를 위해 코드 변경 사항을 검토하는 것","풀 요청을 병합하기 전에 코드 품질을 평가하는 것","프로젝트 규약 및 표준 준수状況을 평가하는 것"],"es":["Revisar los cambios de código para la preparación para la producción","Evaluar la calidad del código antes de fusionar solicitudes de extracción","Evaluar el cumplimiento de las convenciones y estándares del proyecto"],"fr":["Réviser les modifications de code pour la préparation à la production","Évaluer la qualité du code avant de fusionner les demandes d''extraction","Évaluer le respect des conventions et des normes du projet"],"de":["Überprüfen von Code-Änderungen auf Produktionsreife","Bewerten der Code-Qualität vor dem Zusammenführen von Pull-Requests","Bewerten der Einhaltung der Projekt-Konventionen und -Standards"],"pt":["Revisar alterações de código para prontidão para produção","Avaliar a qualidade do código antes de mesclar solicitações de pull","Avaliar a aderência às convenções e padrões do projeto"],"ru":["Просмотр изменений кода для готовности к производству","Оценка качества кода перед слиянием запросов на pull","Оценка соблюдения проектных конвенций и стандартов"],"ar":["استعراض تغييرات الكود لجاهزية الإنتاج","تقييم جودة الكود قبل دمج طلبات السحب","تقييم الامتثال لأعراف ومعايير المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to Salesforce development tasks","Requires understanding of Apex, LWC, Flows, and SF-Bench quality standards"],"zh":["仅适用于 Salesforce 开发任务","需要了解 Apex、LWC、Flows 和 SF-Bench 质量标准"],"ja":["Salesforce 開発タスクに特有のもの","Apex、LWC、Flows、SF-Bench 品質基準の理解が必要"],"ko":["Salesforce 개발 작업에만 특정","Apex, LWC, Flows 및 SF-Bench 품질 표준에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Específico para tareas de desarrollo de Salesforce","Requiere comprensión de Apex, LWC, Flows y estándares de calidad SF-Bench"],"fr":["Spécifique aux tâches de développement Salesforce","Nécessite une compréhension d''Apex, LWC, Flows et des normes de qualité SF-Bench"],"de":["Spezifisch für Salesforce-Entwicklungsaufgaben","Benötigt Verständnis von Apex, LWC, Flows und SF-Bench-Qualitätsstandards"],"pt":["Específico para tarefas de desenvolvimento do Salesforce","Exige compreensão de Apex, LWC, Flows e padrões de qualidade do SF-Bench"],"ru":["Конкретно для задач разработки Salesforce","Требует понимания Apex, LWC, Flows и стандартов качества SF-Bench"],"ar":["محدد لمهام تطوير Salesforce","يتطلب فهم Apex و LWC و Flows ومعايير جودة SF-Bench"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
