WC y Flows","Resolución de problemas de patch y scratch org","Estrategias de depuración para test failures","Análisis de causas raíz"],"fr":["Méthodologie de débogage systématique","Identification des erreurs dans Apex, LWC et Flows","Résolution des problèmes de patch et scratch org","Stratégies de débogage pour les échecs de test","Analyse des causes profondes"],"de":["Systematische Debugging-Methodik","Fehleridentifizierung in Apex, LWC und Flows","Behebung von Patch- und Scratch-Org-Problemen","Debugging-Strategien für Testfehler","Analyse der Ursachen"],"pt":["Métodologia sistemática de solução de problemas","Avaliação de falhas e erros de aplicação de patches","Depuração de problemas de scratch org","Estratégias de depuração para testes","Investigação de causas raiz"],"ru":["Систематическая методология решения проблем","Оценка неудач и ошибок применения патчей","Отладка проблем scratch org","Стратегии отладки для тестов","Изучение коренных причин"],"ar":["منهجية 系统 لحل المشكلات","تقييم فشل وتطبيق أخطاء التصحيحات","تصحيح مشاكل scratch org","استراتيجيات التصحيح للاختبارات","تحقيق الأسباب الجذرية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Salesforce开发","Apex","LWC","Flows","故障诊断","问题解决","开发任务"],"ja":["Salesforce開発","Apex","LWC","Flows","トラブルシューティング","問題解決","開発タスク"],"ko":["Salesforce 개발","Apex","LWC","Flows","문제 해결","개발 작업","트러블슈팅"],"es":["Salesforce","Troubleshooter","depuración","Apex","LWC","Flows","desarrollo de Salesforce","resolución de problemas","debugging"],"fr":["Salesforce","Troubleshooter","débogage","Apex","LWC","Flows","développement Salesforce","résolution de problèmes","debugging"],"de":["Salesforce","Troubleshooter","Debugging","Apex","LWC","Flows","Salesforce-Entwicklung","Fehlerbehebung","Problembehebung"],"pt":["Salesforce","desenvolvimento","solução de problemas","troubleshooter","apex","lwc","fluxos","depuração"],"ru":["Salesforce","разработка","решение проблем","troubleshooter","apex","lwc","потоки","отладка"],"ar":["Salesforce","التطوير","حل المشكلات","troubleshooter","apex","lwc","السيالات","التصحيح"]}},"owner":"yasarshaikh","repo":"SF-bench","repoPath":"yasarshaikh/SF-bench","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"troubleshooter","description":"Diagnoses and resolves evaluation failures, patch application errors, and Salesforce issues. The agent invokes this skill when debugging problems, investigating errors, or troubleshooting failures.","bodyPreview":"# Troubleshooter\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides systematic troubleshooting methodology for SF-Bench issues. It covers evaluation failures, patch application errors, scratch org problems, and debugging strategies.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Evaluation failures or unexpected errors\n- Patch application issues\n- Scratch org creation or deployment problems\n- Debugging test failures\n- Investigating root causes\n\n## Troubleshooting Methodology\n\n### Step 1: Categorize the Error\n\n| Category | Indic","body":"# Troubleshooter\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides systematic troubleshooting methodology for SF-Bench issues. It covers evaluation failures, patch application errors, scratch org problems, and debugging strategies.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Evaluation failures or unexpected errors\n- Patch application issues\n- Scratch org creation or deployment problems\n- Debugging test failures\n- Investigating root causes\n\n## Troubleshooting Methodology\n\n### Step 1: Categorize the Error\n\n| Category | Indicators | Approach |\n|----------|------------|----------|\n| Tool Bug | Affects all tasks, reproducible | Fix in codebase |\n| Model Limitation | Affects specific task types | Document, adjust prompts |\n| Platform Constraint | Salesforce-specific errors | Work within limits |\n| Configuration | Missing env vars, bad config | Fix configuration |\n| Transient | Intermittent, network-related | Retry with backoff |\n\n### Step 2: Gather Evidence\n\n1. **Check Logs**\n   ```bash\n   # View recent logs\n   ls -la logs/\n\n   # Search for errors\n   grep -r \"ERROR\" logs/\n\n   # View specific task log\n   cat logs/<run_id>/<model>/<task_id>.log\n   ```\n\n2. **Check Git Status**\n   ```bash\n   # Verify no manual tweaks\n   git status\n\n   # View applied patch\n   git diff\n   ```\n\n3. **Check Scratch Org**\n   ```bash\n   # List orgs\n   sf org list --all\n\n   # View org details\n   sf org display -o <alias>\n\n   # Check deployment status\n   sf project deploy report -o <alias>\n   ```\n\n### Step 3: Identify Root Cause\n\nUse the error message to narrow down:\n\n```\nError Message → Category → Root Cause → Fix\n```\n\n### Step 4: Apply Fix and Verify\n\n1. Apply the fix\n2. Run relevant tests\n3. Verify the issue is resolved\n4. Document if pattern-based\n\n## Common Error Patterns\n\n### Patch Application Failures\n\n#### Error: \"patch does not apply\"\n**Cause**: Patch context doesn''t match file content\n\n**Diagnosis**:\n```bash\n# Check file content\ncat <file-path>\n\n# Check patch preview\nhead -50 solution.patch\n```\n\n**Solutions**:\n1. Verify correct repository version\n2. Use fuzzy matching: `git apply --3way`\n3. Regenerate solution with updated context\n\n#### Error: \"corrupt patch at line X\"\n**Cause**: Malformed patch format\n\n**Diagnosis**:\n```bash\n# Validate patch syntax\ngit apply --check solution.patch\n```\n\n**Solutions**:\n1. Check for markdown fences in patch\n2. Remove standalone +/- lines\n3. Verify patch header format\n\n### Scratch Org Failures\n\n#### Error: \"SCRATCH_ORG_LIMIT_EXCEEDED\"\n**Cause**: Daily scratch org creation limit reached\n\n**Diagnosis**:\n```bash\n# Check org limits\nsf limits api display -o <devhub>\n```\n\n**Solutions**:\n1. Delete unused scratch orgs\n2. Wait for daily limit reset\n3. Use different DevHub\n\n#### Error: \"InvalidOrgForCreate\"\n**Cause**: DevHub not authenticated or expired\n\n**Diagnosis**:\n```bash\n# Check DevHub status\nsf org list --all | grep DevHub\n```\n\n**Solutions**:\n1. Re-authenticate: `sf org login web -d`\n2. Verify DevHub features enabled\n3. Check org expiration\n\n### Deployment Failures\n\n#### Error: \"CANNOT_ENABLE_DEVELOPER_MODE\"\n**Cause**: Scratch org config issue\n\n**Diagnosis**:\n```bash\n# Check scratch def\ncat config/project-scratch-def.json\n```\n\n**Solutions**:\n1. Verify features in scratch def\n2. Check for conflicting settings\n3. Use minimal scratch def\n\n#### Error: \"Test coverage is XX%, at least 75% required\"\n**Cause**: Insufficient test coverage\n\n**Diagnosis**:\n```bash\n# Run tests with coverage\nsf apex run test -o <alias> -c -r human\n```\n\n**Solutions**:\n1. Add more test methods\n2. Cover edge cases\n3. Check for uncovered branches\n\n### API Failures\n\n#### Error: \"rate_limit_exceeded\"\n**Cause**: AI provider rate limit\n\n**Diagnosis**:\n- Check request frequency\n- Review provider dashboard\n\n**Solutions**:\n1. Implement rate limiting\n2. Use exponential backoff\n3. Switch to different provider\n\n#### Error: \"invalid_api_key\"\n**Cause**: Missing or incorrect API key\n\n**Diagnosis**:\n```bash\n# Check environment\necho $ROUTELLM_API_KEY | head -c 10\n```\n\n**Solutions**:\n1. Verify key in .env\n2. Source environment: `source .env`\n3. Regenerate API key\n\n## Diagnostic Commands\n\n### Preflight Diagnostics\n```bash\n# Run preflight checks\npython -c \"\nfrom sfbench.utils.preflight import PreflightValidator\nv = PreflightValidator()\nr = v.run_all_checks(''model-name'', ''provider'')\nprint(''PASSED'' if r.passed else ''FAILED'')\nfor c in r.checks:\n    print(f''{c.name}: {c.status}'')\n\"\n```\n\n### Scratch Org Diagnostics\n```bash\n# Create debug org\nsf org create scratch -f config/project-scratch-def.json -a debug-org -d 1\n\n# Deploy and check\nsf project deploy start -o debug-org\n\n# Run specific test\nsf apex run test -o debug-org -n TestClassName -r human -c\n\n# Cleanup\nsf org delete scratch -o debug-org -p\n```\n\n### Patch Diagnostics\n```bash\n# Validate patch\ngit apply --check solution.patch\n\n# Apply with verbose output\ngit apply -v solution.patch\n\n# Apply with fallback strategies\ngit apply --3way solution.patch\ngit apply --reject solution.patch\n```\n\n## Escalation Path\n\nIf issue persists after troubleshooting:\n\n1. **Document the Issue**\n   - Error message\n   - Steps to reproduce\n   - Environment details\n   - Attempted solutions\n\n2. **Update activeContext.md**\n   - Add to \"Blockers\" section\n   - Note impact on current work\n\n3. **Create Issue**\n   - Use bug report template\n   - Include all diagnostic information\n   - Tag appropriately\n\n## Prevention Strategies\n\n### For Patch Issues\n- Validate patches before applying\n- Use multi-strategy fallback\n- Clean patches before application\n\n### For Scratch Org Issues\n- Monitor org limits\n- Always cleanup in finally blocks\n- Use retry with exponential backoff\n\n### For API Issues\n- Implement rate limiting\n- Cache responses where appropriate\n- Use circuit breaker pattern for repeated failures\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:58:01.880Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing systematic troubleshooting for Salesforce development tasks","zh":"非常适合需要系统性故障排除的Salesforce开发任务的AI编码代理，如Claude Code和AutoGPT","ja":"Salesforce開発タスクのための体系的なトラブルシューティングが必要なAIコーディングエージェント、たとえばClaude CodeやAutoGPTに最適","ko":"시스템적인 문제 해결이 필요한 Salesforce 개발 작업을 위한 AI 코딩 에이전트인 Claude Code 및 AutoGPT에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan una depuración sistemática para tareas de desarrollo de Salesforce","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant un dépannage systématique pour les tâches de développement Salesforce","de":"Perfekt für AI-Coding-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die ein systematisches Troubleshooting für Salesforce-Entwicklungsaufgaben benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação de IA, como Claude Code e AutoGPT, que necessitam de solução de problemas sistemáticos para tarefas de desenvolvimento do Salesforce","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым необходим системный подход к устранению неполадок для задач разработки Salesforce","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البرمجيين للذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى تصحيح أخطاء منهجي لمهام تطوير Salesforce"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to debug Apex, LWC, and Flows using a comprehensive methodology, including evaluation failures, patch application errors, and scratch org problems, all utilizing SF-Bench","zh":"赋予代理使用综合方法调试Apex、LWC和Flows，包括评估故障、补丁应用错误和scratch org问题，全都利用SF-Bench","ja":"SF-Benchを利用して、評価の失敗、パッチ適用のエラー、およびスクラッチオーグの問題を含む包括的な方法で、Apex、LWC、Flowsをデバッグするためのエージェントをエンパワーメント","ko":"SF-Bench를 사용하여 평가 실패, 패치 적용 오류 및 스크래치 오그 문제를 포함한 포괄적인 방법으로 에이전트가 Apex, LWC 및 Flows를 디버깅할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a depurar Apex, LWC y Flows utilizando una metodología integral, que incluye la evaluación de errores, errores de aplicación de parches y problemas de organización de scratch, todo utilizando SF-Bench","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer Apex, LWC et Flows en utilisant une méthodologie complète, y compris l''évaluation des échecs, les erreurs d''application des correctifs et les problèmes d''organisation de scratch, le tout en utilisant SF-Bench","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Apex, LWC und Flows mithilfe einer umfassenden Methodik zu debuggen, einschließlich Auswertung von Fehlern, Anwendungsfehlern von Patches und Problemen mit der Scratch-Organisation, alles unter Verwendung von SF-Bench","pt":"Habilita os agentes a depurar Apex, LWC e Flows usando uma metodologia abrangente, incluindo avaliação de falhas, erros de aplicação de patches e problemas de org scratch, todos utilizando o SF-Bench","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отладки Apex, LWC и Flows с использованием комплексной методологии, включая оценку неудач, ошибки применения патчей и проблемы создания и развертывания scratch-организаций, все с использованием SF-Bench","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصحيح أخطاء Apex و LWC و Flows باستخدام منهجية شاملة، بما في ذلك تقييم الفشل وأخطاء تطبيق التصحيحات ومشاكل إنشاء وتوزيع scratch org ، كل ذلك باستخدام SF-Bench"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging test failures in Salesforce environments","Investigating root causes of evaluation failures","Resolving patch application issues in Apex and LWC","Troubleshooting scratch org creation and deployment problems"],"zh":["在Salesforce环境中调试测试失败","调查评估失败的根本原因","在Apex和LWC中解决补丁应用问题","解决scratch org创建和部署问题"],"ja":["Salesforce環境におけるテストの失敗をデバッグする","評価の失敗の根本原因を調査する","ApexおよびLWCにおけるパッチ適用の問題を解決する","スクラッチオーグの作成および展開の問題をトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["Salesforce 환경에서 테스트 실패 디버깅","평가 실패의根本 원인 조사","Apex 및 LWC에서 패치 적용 문제 해결","스크래치 오그 생성 및 배포 문제 해결"],"es":["Depuración de errores de prueba en entornos de Salesforce","Investigación de las causas raíz de los errores de evaluación","Resolución de problemas de aplicación de parches en Apex y LWC","Solución de problemas de creación y implementación de organizaciones de scratch"],"fr":["Débogage des échecs de test dans les environnements Salesforce","Recherche des causes profondes des échecs d''évaluation","Résolution des problèmes d''application des correctifs dans Apex et LWC","Dépannage des problèmes de création et de déploiement d''organisations de scratch"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Testfehlern in Salesforce-Umgebungen","Ermittlung der Ursachen von Auswertungsfehlern","Behebung von Anwendungsfehlern von Patches in Apex und LWC","Behebung von Problemen bei der Erstellung und Bereitstellung von Scratch-Organisationen"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de teste em ambientes do Salesforce","Investigação das causas raiz das falhas de avaliação","Resolução de problemas de aplicação de patches em Apex e LWC","Solução de problemas de criação e implantação de org scratch"],"ru":["Отладка сбоев тестирования в средах Salesforce","Изучение коренных причин неудач оценки","Решение проблем с применением патчей в Apex и LWC","Устранение неполадок создания и развертывания scratch-организаций"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء فشل الاختبار في بيئات Salesforce","تحقيق في الأسباب الجذرية لفشل التقييم","حل مشاكل تطبيق الإصلاحات في Apex و LWC","تصحيح أخطاء إنشاء وتوزيع scratch org"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SF-Bench setup","Specific to Salesforce development tasks","Apex, LWC, and Flows knowledge necessary"],"zh":["需要SF-Bench设置","特定于Salesforce开发任务","需要Apex、LWC和Flows知识"],"ja":["SF-Benchの設定が必要","Salesforce開発タスクに特有","Apex、LWC、Flowsの知識が必要"],"ko":["SF-Bench 설정이 필요","Salesforce 개발 작업에 특정","Apex, LWC, Flows 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de SF-Bench","Específico para tareas de desarrollo de Salesforce","Conocimiento de Apex, LWC y Flows necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de SF-Bench","Spécifique aux tâches de développement Salesforce","Connaissances d''Apex, LWC et Flows nécessaires"],"de":["Benötigt SF-Bench-Konfiguration","Spezifisch für Salesforce-Entwicklungsaufgaben","Kenntnisse von Apex, LWC und Flows erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração do SF-Bench","Específico para tarefas de desenvolvimento do Salesforce","Conhecimento de Apex, LWC e Flows necessário"],"ru":["Требуется настройка SF-Bench","Конкретно для задач разработки Salesforce","Необходимо знание Apex, LWC и Flows"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد SF-Bench","محدد لمهام تطوير Salesforce","معلومات Apex و LWC و Flows ضرورية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('SETI/rms-cloud-tasks/run-all-checks', 'community', 'SETI', 'rms-cloud-tasks', 'SETI/rms-cloud-tasks', 'run-all-checks', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z', '2026-02-18T08:58:01.884Z', NULL, '{"id":"SETI/rms-cloud-tasks/run-all-checks","name":"run-all-checks","description":{"zh":"run-all-checks 脚本用于执行所有项目检查，包括代码检查和文档检查，并自动修复错误","ja":"run-all-checks スクリプトは、すべてのプロジェクトチェック（コードチェックとドキュメントチェック）を実行し、エラーを自動的に修復します","ko":"run-all-checks 스크립트는 모든 프로젝트 체크(코드 체크 및 문서 체크)를 실행하고 에러를 자동으로 수정합니다","es":"El script run-all-checks ejecuta todas las comprobaciones de proyecto, incluyendo ruff, mypy, pytest y Sphinx docs, y soluciona errores","fr":"Le script run-all-checks exécute toutes les vérifications de projet, notamment ruff, mypy, pytest et Sphinx docs, et résout les erreurs","de":"Das Script run-all-checks führt alle Projektprüfungen aus, einschließlich ruff, mypy, pytest und Sphinx docs, und behebt Fehler","pt":"O script run-all-checks executa todas as verificações do projeto e corrige erros encontrados","ru":"Скрипт run-all-checks запускает все проверки проекта и исправляет найденные ошибки","ar":"سكريبت run-all-checks يشغل جميع فحوصات المشروع ويعالج الأخطاء الموجودة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"运行所有检查 - 代码检查和错误修复","ja":"全てのチェックを実行 - コードチェックとエラーフィックス","ko":"모든 체크 실행 - 코드 체크 및 에러 수정","es":"Ejecutar todos los controles de proyecto","fr":"Exécuter toutes les vérifications de projet","de":"Alle Projektprüfungen ausführen","pt":"Executar Todos os Testes","ru":"Запустить Все Проверки","ar":"تشغيل جميع الفحوصات","en":"run-all-checks"},"description":{"zh":"run-all-checks 脚本用于执行所有项目检查，包括代码检查和文档检查，并自动修复错误","ja":"run-all-checks スクリプトは、すべてのプロジェクトチェック（コードチェックとドキュメントチェック）を実行し、エラーを自動的に修復します","ko":"run-all-checks 스크립트는 모든 프로젝트 체크(코드 체크 및 문서 체크)를 실행하고 에러를 자동으로 수정합니다","es":"El script run-all-checks ejecuta todas las comprobaciones de proyecto, incluyendo ruff, mypy, pytest y Sphinx docs, y soluciona errores","fr":"Le script run-all-checks exécute toutes les vérifications de projet, notamment ruff, mypy, pytest et Sphinx docs, et résout les erreurs","de":"Das Script run-all-checks führt alle Projektprüfungen aus, einschließlich ruff, mypy, pytest und Sphinx docs, und behebt Fehler","pt":"O script run-all-checks executa todas as verificações do projeto e corrige erros encontrados","ru":"Скрипт run-all-checks запускает все проверки проекта и исправляет найденные ошибки","ar":"سكريبت run-all-checks يشغل جميع فحوصات المشروع ويعالج الأخطاء الموجودة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["执行所有项目检查","自动修复错误","支持代码检查和文档检查","可并行执行检查","易于使用的脚本"],"ja":["すべてのプロジェクトチェックを実行","エラーを自動的に修復","コードチェックとドキュメントチェックをサポート","チェックを並行して実行可能","使いやすいスクリプト"],"ko":["모든 프로젝트 체크를 실행","에러를 자동으로 수정","코드 체크와 문서 체크를 지원","체크를 병렬로 실행할 수 있음","사용하기 쉬운 스크립트"],"es":["Ejecuta comprobaciones de código con ruff y mypy","Ejecuta pruebas unitarias con pytest","Genera documentación con Sphinx docs","Soluciona errores de forma automática","Permite la ejecución paralela de comprobaciones"],"fr":["Exécute les vérifications de code avec ruff et mypy","Exécute les tests unitaires avec pytest","Génère la documentation avec Sphinx docs","Résout les erreurs de manière automatique","Permet l''exécution parallèle des vérifications"],"de":["Führt Code-Prüfungen mit ruff und mypy aus","Führt Unit-Tests mit pytest aus","Generiert Dokumentation mit Sphinx docs","Behebt Fehler automatisch","Ermöglicht die parallele Ausführung von Prüfungen"],"pt":["Executa verificações de código","Executa testes de unidade","Gera documentação com Sphinx","Corrige erros encontrados","Suporta execução paralela"],"ru":["Выполняет проверки кода","Выполняет модульные тесты","Генерирует документацию с помощью Sphinx","Исправляет найденные ошибки","Поддерживает параллельное выполнение"],"ar":["يشغل فحوصات الشفرة","يشغل اختبارات الوحدة","يولد وثائق باستخدام Sphinx","يعالج الأخطاء الموجودة","يدعم التشغيل الموازي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码检查","错误修复","自动化脚本","项目检查","代码质量","稳定性","run-all-checks"],"ja":["コードチェック","エラーフィックス","自動化スクリプト","プロジェクトチェック","コード品質","安定性","run-all-checks"],"ko":["코드 체크","에러 수정","자동화 스크립트","프로젝트 체크","코드 품질","안정성","run-all-checks"],"es":["run-all-checks","comprobaciones de proyecto","ruff","mypy","pytest","Sphinx docs","desarrollo de software","pruebas unitarias","documentación"],"fr":["run-all-checks","vérifications de projet","ruff","mypy","pytest","Sphinx docs","développement de logiciels","tests unitaires","documentation"],"de":["run-all-checks","Projektprüfungen","ruff","mypy","pytest","Sphinx docs","Software-Entwicklung","Unit-Tests","Dokumentation"],"pt":["run-all-checks","verificações de código","testes de unidade","documentação","erros","execução paralela","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["run-all-checks","проверки кода","модульные тесты","документация","ошибки","параллельное выполнение","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["run-all-checks","فحوصات الشفرة","اختبارات الوحدة","توثيق","أخطاء","تشغيل موازي","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"SETI","repo":"rms-cloud-tasks","repoPath":"SETI/rms-cloud-tasks","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"run-all-checks","description":"Run all linting, type checking, tests, and documentation builds for the rms-cloud-tasks project. Check for errors and warnings, then fix any problems found. Use when the user asks to run checks, verify the build, run CI locally, or fix lint/type/test errors.","bodyPreview":"# Run All Checks\n\nExecute all project checks (ruff, mypy, pytest, Sphinx docs) and fix any errors found.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nRun all checks and fix errors:\n\n1. Execute the run-all-checks script (or run checks manually).\n2. Review output for errors and warnings.\n3. Fix any issues found.\n4. Re-run checks to verify fixes.\n\n## Preferred Method: Script\n\nFrom project root with venv activated:\n\n```bash\n./scripts/run-all-checks.sh\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n- `-p, --parallel` — Run code checks and docs in parallel (de","body":"# Run All Checks\n\nExecute all project checks (ruff, mypy, pytest, Sphinx docs) and fix any errors found.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nRun all checks and fix errors:\n\n1. Execute the run-all-checks script (or run checks manually).\n2. Review output for errors and warnings.\n3. Fix any issues found.\n4. Re-run checks to verify fixes.\n\n## Preferred Method: Script\n\nFrom project root with venv activated:\n\n```bash\n./scripts/run-all-checks.sh\n```\n\nOptions:\n\n- `-p, --parallel` — Run code checks and docs in parallel (default).\n- `-s, --sequential` — Run all checks one after another (easier to debug).\n- `-c, --code` — Only ruff, mypy, pytest.\n- `-d, --docs` — Only Sphinx documentation build.\n- `-h, --help` — Show usage.\n\n## Check Commands (Manual)\n\nAll commands assume project root and `source venv/bin/activate` (or `venv\\Scripts\\activate` on Windows).\n\n### Code (from project root)\n\n```bash\n# Lint (ruff)\npython -m ruff check src tests examples\npython -m ruff format --check src tests examples\n\n# Type check (mypy)\npython -m mypy src tests examples\n\n# Tests (pytest)\npython -m pytest tests -q\n```\n\n### Documentation (from project root)\n\n```bash\ncd docs && make clean && make html SPHINXOPTS=\"-W\"\n```\n\nThe script and docs build use `SPHINXOPTS=\"-W\"` so Sphinx treats warnings as errors; the docs check fails if any warnings are produced.\n\n## Execution Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```text\nCheck Progress:\n- [ ] Ruff check (src, tests, examples)\n- [ ] Ruff format --check\n- [ ] Mypy (src, tests, examples)\n- [ ] Pytest (tests)\n- [ ] Docs build without warnings\n- [ ] All errors fixed\n- [ ] Re-verify all checks pass\n```\n\n### Step 1: Run All Checks\n\n**Option A – Script (recommended):**\n\n```bash\n./scripts/run-all-checks.sh\n```\n\n**Option B – Sequential manual:**\n\n```bash\nsource venv/bin/activate\npython -m ruff check src tests examples && \\\npython -m ruff format --check src tests examples && \\\npython -m mypy src tests examples && \\\npython -m pytest tests -q && \\\n(cd docs && make clean && make html SPHINXOPTS=\"-W\")\n```\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Results\n\nCheck output for:\n\n- **Errors**: Must be fixed (non-zero exit code).\n- **Warnings**: Must be fixed. The docs build is run with `SPHINXOPTS=\"-W\"`, so Sphinx warnings cause the documentation check to fail.\n\nCommon error types:\n\n| Check   | Error Pattern              | Typical Fix                          |\n|---------|----------------------------|--------------------------------------|\n| ruff    | `F401` unused import       | Remove import                        |\n| ruff    | `UP035` typing import      | Use `collections.abc` for ABCs       |\n| ruff    | `ARG001` unused argument   | Prefix with `_` or `# noqa: ARG001`  |\n| mypy    | `error: ... is not defined` | Add import or fix typo               |\n| mypy    | `assignment`, `attr-defined` | Add type annotations or `# type: ignore[...]` |\n| pytest  | `FAILED` or `ERROR`        | Fix test or code under test          |\n| sphinx  | `WARNING: duplicate object`| Add `:no-index:` or fix duplicate    |\n\n### Step 3: Fix Issues\n\nFor each error:\n\n1. Read the error message and file/line.\n2. Open the file and apply the appropriate fix.\n3. Re-run the failing check to confirm.\n\n### Step 4: Re-verify\n\nAfter fixing, run all checks again:\n\n```bash\n./scripts/run-all-checks.sh\n```\n\nAll checks should pass with exit code 0.\n\n## Common Fixes Reference\n\n### Ruff Unused Argument (ARG001)\n\nFor pytest fixtures that are dependencies but not directly used:\n\n```python\ndef my_fixture(other_fixture: None) -> None:  # noqa: ARG001\n    ...\n```\n\n### Ruff UP035 (typing → collections.abc)\n\nUse `collections.abc` for `AsyncGenerator`, `Iterable`, etc.:\n\n```python\nfrom collections.abc import AsyncGenerator, Iterable\n```\n\n### Sphinx Duplicate Object Warning\n\nAdd `:no-index:` to automodule directive:\n\n```rst\n.. automodule:: cloud_tasks.config\n   :members:\n   :no-index:\n```\n\n### Mypy in Tests\n\nTests use overrides in `pyproject.toml` (`module = \"tests.*\"`) for `method-assign` and `attr-defined` (mocks). For other mypy errors in tests, add targeted `# type: ignore[code]` or fix the type.\n\n### Type Annotation Errors\n\nFor union or forward-reference issues:\n\n```python\nfrom __future__ import annotations  # Add at top of file\n```\n\n## Success Criteria\n\nAll checks pass when:\n\n- `ruff check src tests examples` → \"All checks passed!\"\n- `ruff format --check src tests examples` → \"All files formatted\"\n- `mypy src tests examples` → \"Success: no issues found\"\n- `pytest tests -q` → All tests pass\n- `make html SPHINXOPTS=\"-W\"` (in docs/) → Build completes with exit 0 (no errors or warnings)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:58:01.884Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing automated testing and validation with ruff, mypy, pytest, and Sphinx docs.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 ruff、mypy、pytest 和 Sphinx 文档进行自动化测试和验证的代码审查代理。","ja":"ruff、mypy、pytest、Sphinx ドキュメントを使用した自動テストと検証が必要なコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"ruff, mypy, pytest 및 Sphinx 문서를 사용한 자동 테스트 및 유효성 검사가 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan pruebas y validación automatizadas con ruff, mypy, pytest y documentos de Sphinx.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Révision de Code nécessitant des tests et une validation automatisés avec ruff, mypy, pytest et des documents Sphinx.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die automatisierte Tests und Validierung mit ruff, mypy, pytest und Sphinx-Dokumenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de testes e validação automatizados com ruff, mypy, pytest e documentos Sphinx.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по проверке кода, которым требуются автоматизированное тестирование и проверка с помощью ruff, mypy, pytest и документации Sphinx.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعين للرمز البرمجي الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبارات وتحقق آليين مع ruff و mypy و pytest و مستندات Sphinx."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute comprehensive project checks, identify errors, and ensure code quality using parallel processing with options like --parallel, while integrating tools such as ruff for linting, mypy for type checking, pytest for unit testing, and Sphinx for documentation validation.","zh":"赋予代理执行全面项目检查、识别错误和确保代码质量的能力，使用诸如 --parallel 之类的并行处理选项，同时集成诸如 ruff 用于 linting、mypy 用于类型检查、pytest 用于单元测试以及 Sphinx 用于文档验证的工具。","ja":"エージェントが --parallel などのオプションを使用した並列処理で、プロジェクトの徹底的なチェックを実行し、エラーを識別し、コードの品質を確保する機能を提供します。並行して、ruff による linting、mypy による型チェック、pytest によるユニットテスト、および Sphinx によるドキュメントの検証などのツールを統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 --parallel과 같은 옵션을 사용한 병렬 처리로 전체 프로젝트를 확인하고 오류를 식별하며 코드 품질을 보장하는 기능을 제공합니다.同時に ruff를 사용한 린팅, mypy를 사용한 타입 체킹, pytest를 사용한 유닛 테스팅, Sphinx를 사용한 문서 유효성 검사와 같은 도구를 통합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar comprobaciones de proyecto integrales, identificar errores y garantizar la calidad del código utilizando el procesamiento paralelo con opciones como --parallel, al integrar herramientas como ruff para la verificación de estilo, mypy para la comprobación de tipos, pytest para las pruebas unitarias y Sphinx para la validación de la documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des vérifications de projet complètes, d''identifier les erreurs et de garantir la qualité du code en utilisant le traitement parallèle avec des options comme --parallel, tout en intégrant des outils tels que ruff pour le linting, mypy pour la vérification de types, pytest pour les tests unitaires et Sphinx pour la validation de la documentation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Projektprüfungen durchzuführen, Fehler zu identifizieren und die Code-Qualität unter Verwendung von Parallelverarbeitung mit Optionen wie --parallel zu gewährleisten, während es Tools wie ruff für Linting, mypy für Typüberprüfung, pytest für Unit-Tests und Sphinx für Dokumentenvalidierung integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar verificações de projeto abrangentes, identificar erros e garantir a qualidade do código usando processamento paralelo com opções como --parallel, ao integrar ferramentas como ruff para análise de lint, mypy para verificação de tipo, pytest para teste unitário e Sphinx para validação de documentação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять всесторонние проверки проекта, выявлять ошибки и гарантировать качество кода с помощью параллельной обработки с опциями như --parallel, интегрируя инструменты seperti ruff для проверки линта, mypy для проверки типа, pytest для модульного тестирования и Sphinx для проверки документации.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ فحص مشروع شامل وتحديد الأخطاء وضمان جودة الرمز البرمجي باستخدام المعالجة الموازية مع خيارات مثل --parallel، من خلال دمج أدوات مثل ruff للتنقيح وmypy للتحقق من النوع وpytest لاختبار الوحدة وSphinx لتحقق المستندات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews with ruff and mypy","Validating documentation with Sphinx","Debugging projects using pytest"],"zh":["使用 ruff 和 mypy 自动化代码审查","使用 Sphinx 验证文档","使用 pytest 调试项目"],"ja":["ruff と mypy を使用したコードレビューの自動化","Sphinx を使用したドキュメントの検証","pytest を使用したプロジェクトのデバッグ"],"ko":["ruff와 mypy를 사용한 코드 리뷰 자동화","Sphinx를 사용한 문서 유효성 검사","pytest를 사용한 프로젝트 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar revisiones de código con ruff y mypy","Validar documentación con Sphinx","Depurar proyectos utilizando pytest"],"fr":["Automatiser la révision de code avec ruff et mypy","Valider la documentation avec Sphinx","Déboguer les projets en utilisant pytest"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews mit ruff und mypy","Validieren von Dokumentationen mit Sphinx","Debuggen von Projekten mit pytest"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código com ruff e mypy","Validar documentação com Sphinx","Depurar projetos usando pytest"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода с помощью ruff и mypy","Проверить документацию с помощью Sphinx","Отладить проекты с помощью pytest"],"ar":["تحقيق مراجعة الرمز البرمجي أوتوماتيكيًا مع ruff وmypy","تحقق من الوثائق مع Sphinx","تصحيح مشاريع باستخدام pytest"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires activation of virtual environment (venv)","Limited to projects with compatible scripts and tools (ruff, mypy, pytest, Sphinx)"],"zh":["需要激活虚拟环境（venv）","仅限于具有兼容脚本和工具（ruff、mypy、pytest、Sphinx）的项目"],"ja":["仮想環境（venv）のアクティブ化が必要","ruff、mypy、pytest、Sphinx などの互換スクリプトとツールを持つプロジェクトに限定"],"ko":["가상 환경(venv)을 활성화해야 함","ruff, mypy, pytest, Sphinx와 같은 호환되는 스크립트와 도구를 갖춘 프로젝트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la activación del entorno virtual (venv)","Limitado a proyectos con scripts y herramientas compatibles (ruff, mypy, pytest, Sphinx)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''activation de l''environnement virtuel (venv)","Limité à des projets avec des scripts et des outils compatibles (ruff, mypy, pytest, Sphinx)"],"de":["Erfordert die Aktivierung der virtuellen Umgebung (venv)","Begrenzt auf Projekte mit kompatiblen Skripten und Tools (ruff, mypy, pytest, Sphinx)"],"pt":["Requer ativação do ambiente virtual (venv)","Limitado a projetos com scripts e ferramentas compatíveis (ruff, mypy, pytest, Sphinx)"],"ru":["Требует активации виртуальной среды (venv)","Ограничен проектами с совместимыми скриптами и инструментами (ruff, mypy, pytest, Sphinx)"],"ar":["يتطلب تفعيل بيئة افتراضية (venv)","محدود بمشاريع ذات نصوص وادوات متوافقة (ruff وmypy وpytest وSphinx)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
