":"Benchmark Runner: Оптимизация разработки Salesforce","ar":"Benchmark Runner: تحسين تطوير Salesforce","en":"benchmark-runner"},"description":{"zh":"该技能提供了执行 SF-Bench 评估、理解评分方法和管理评估流程的专业知识","ja":"このスキルは、SF-Bench の評価を実行し、スコアリング方法を理解し、評価パイプラインを管理する専門知識を提供します","ko":"이 스킬은 SF-Bench 평가를 실행하고 평가 방법을 이해하며 평가 파이프라인을 관리하는 전문 지식을 제공합니다","es":"El benchmark-runner es una habilidad que proporciona experiencia en la ejecución de evaluaciones SF-Bench y la gestión del proceso de evaluación","fr":"Le benchmark-runner est une compétence qui fournit une expertise dans l''exécution des évaluations SF-Bench et la gestion du processus d''évaluation","de":"Der Benchmark-Runner ist eine Fähigkeit, die Erfahrung bei der Ausführung von SF-Bench-Bewertungen und der Verwaltung des Bewertungsprozesses bietet","pt":"O Benchmark Runner é uma habilidade que fornece expertise em execução de avaliações SF-Bench e gestão de pipeline de avaliação.","ru":"Benchmark Runner — это навык, который предоставляет экспертизу в выполнении оценок SF-Bench и управлении пайплайном оценки.","ar":"Benchmark Runner هو مهارة توفر خبرة في تشغيل تقييمات SF-Bench وإدارة خط أنابيب التقييم.","en":"The first comprehensive benchmark for evaluating AI coding agents on Salesforce development tasks. Tests Apex, LWC, Flows, and more."},"definition":{"en":"The first comprehensive benchmark for evaluating AI coding agents on Salesforce development tasks. Tests Apex, LWC, Flows, and more."},"features":{"zh":["执行 SF-Bench 评估","理解评分方法","管理评估流程","支持 Apex、LWC、Flows 等开发任务","提供评估结果和指标"],"ja":["SF-Bench の評価を実行","スコアリング方法を理解","評価パイプラインを管理","Apex、LWC、Flows などの開発タスクをサポート","評価結果と指標を提供"],"ko":["SF-Bench 평가를 실행","평가 방법을 이해","평가 파이프라인을 관리","Apex, LWC, Flows 등의 개발 작업을 지원","평가 결과와 지표를 제공"],"es":["Ejecución de evaluaciones SF-Bench","Gestión del proceso de evaluación","Análisis de resultados y métricas","Validación de API Key y DevHub","Gestión de checkpoints y resultados"],"fr":["Exécution des évaluations SF-Bench","Gestion du processus d''évaluation","Analyse des résultats et des métriques","Validation de la clé API et de DevHub","Gestion des points de contrôle et des résultats"],"de":["Ausführung von SF-Bench-Bewertungen","Verwaltung des Bewertungsprozesses","Analyse von Ergebnissen und Metriken","Validierung von API-Schlüssel und DevHub","Verwaltung von Prüfpunkten und Ergebnissen"],"pt":["Execução de avaliações SF-Bench","Gestão de pipeline de avaliação","Entendimento da metodologia de pontuação","Trabalho com scripts de avaliação","Gerenciamento de checkpoints e resultados"],"ru":["Выполнение оценок SF-Bench","Управление пайплайном оценки","Понимание методологии оценки","Работа со скриптами оценки","Управление контрольными точками и результатами"],"ar":["تشغيل تقييمات SF-Bench","إدارة خط أنابيب التقييم","فهم منهجية التقييم","العمل مع نصوص التقييم","إدارة نقاط التفتيش والنتائج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Salesforce AI 编码代理","基准测试","SF-Bench","Apex","LWC","Flows","开发任务","评估流程","评分方法"],"ja":["Salesforce AI コーディングエージェント","ベンチマークテスト","SF-Bench","Apex","LWC","Flows","開発タスク","評価パイプライン","スコアリング方法"],"ko":["Salesforce AI 코딩 에이전트","벤치마크 테스트","SF-Bench","Apex","LWC","Flows","개발 작업","평가 파이프라인","평가 방법"],"es":["benchmark-runner","agentes de codificación de IA","desarrollo de Salesforce","evaluaciones SF-Bench","gestión de evaluación","análisis de resultados","validación de API Key","DevHub"],"fr":["benchmark-runner","agents de codage IA","développement Salesforce","évaluations SF-Bench","gestion de l''évaluation","analyse des résultats","validation de la clé API","DevHub"],"de":["Benchmark-Runner","IA-Coding-Agenten","Salesforce-Entwicklung","SF-Bench-Bewertungen","Bewertungsverwaltung","Ergebnisanalyse","API-Schlüssel-Validierung","DevHub"],"pt":["Benchmark Runner","Desenvolvimento Salesforce","Avaliação de agentes de codificação AI","SF-Bench","Gestão de pipeline de avaliação","Metodologia de pontuação"],"ru":["Benchmark Runner","Разработка Salesforce","Оценка агентов кодирования ИИ","SF-Bench","Управление пайплайном оценки","Методология оценки"],"ar":["Benchmark Runner","تطوير Salesforce","تقييم وكلاء الإصدار للذكاء الاصطناعي","SF-Bench","إدارة خط أنابيب التقييم","منهجية التقييم"]}},"owner":"yasarshaikh","repo":"SF-bench","repoPath":"yasarshaikh/SF-bench","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"benchmark-runner","description":"Guides evaluation workflow execution for SF-Bench. The agent invokes this skill when running evaluations, discussing scoring methodology, or working with the evaluation pipeline.","bodyPreview":"# Benchmark Runner\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides expertise in executing SF-Bench evaluations, understanding the scoring methodology, and managing the evaluation pipeline.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Running or discussing evaluation workflows\n- Questions about scoring or metrics\n- Working with evaluation scripts\n- Managing checkpoints and results\n- Understanding task execution flow\n\n## Evaluation Pipeline\n\n### Pipeline Stages\n\n```\n1. Preflight Checks\n   ├── API Key validation\n   ├── DevHub","body":"# Benchmark Runner\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides expertise in executing SF-Bench evaluations, understanding the scoring methodology, and managing the evaluation pipeline.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Running or discussing evaluation workflows\n- Questions about scoring or metrics\n- Working with evaluation scripts\n- Managing checkpoints and results\n- Understanding task execution flow\n\n## Evaluation Pipeline\n\n### Pipeline Stages\n\n```\n1. Preflight Checks\n   ├── API Key validation\n   ├── DevHub connectivity\n   ├── Scratch org capacity\n   └── LLM model validation\n\n2. Solution Generation\n   ├── Load task definition\n   ├── Generate prompt from task\n   ├── Call AI provider API\n   └── Validate git diff format\n\n3. Task Execution\n   ├── Clone task repository\n   ├── Apply solution patch\n   ├── Create scratch org\n   ├── Deploy to scratch org\n   └── Execute validation\n\n4. Validation\n   ├── Deployment validation (code compiles/deploys)\n   ├── Test validation (unit tests pass)\n   └── Functional validation (business outcome achieved)\n\n5. Scoring & Reporting\n   ├── Calculate component scores\n   ├── Aggregate results\n   ├── Generate reports (JSON + Markdown)\n   └── Create checkpoint\n```\n\n### Running Evaluations\n\n#### Basic Evaluation\n```bash\npython scripts/evaluate.py \\\n    --model grok-4.1-fast \\\n    --tasks data/tasks/verified.json\n```\n\n#### With Functional Validation\n```bash\npython scripts/evaluate.py \\\n    --model claude-3-opus \\\n    --tasks data/tasks/realistic.json \\\n    --functional\n```\n\n#### Resume from Checkpoint\n```bash\npython scripts/evaluate.py \\\n    --model gemini-pro \\\n    --tasks data/tasks/verified.json \\\n    --output results/existing-run-dir/\n```\n\n#### With Pre-Generated Solutions\n```bash\npython scripts/evaluate.py \\\n    --model gpt-4 \\\n    --tasks data/tasks/verified.json \\\n    --solutions solutions/gpt-4/\n```\n\n## Scoring Methodology\n\n### Component Weights\n\n| Component | Weight | Description |\n|-----------|--------|-------------|\n| Deployment | 10% | Code deploys without errors |\n| Tests | 20% | Unit tests pass |\n| Functional | 50% | Business outcome achieved |\n| Bulk | 10% | Handles 200+ records |\n| No Tweaks | 10% | No manual modifications needed |\n\n### Score Calculation\n```python\nscore = (\n    deploy_score * 0.10 +\n    test_score * 0.20 +\n    functional_score * 0.50 +\n    bulk_score * 0.10 +\n    no_tweaks_score * 0.10\n)\n```\n\n### Pass/Fail Criteria\n\n- **Pass**: Score ≥ 0.6 (60%)\n- **Fail**: Score < 0.6\n- **Partial**: Some components pass, others fail\n\n## Task Types\n\n### Apex Tasks\n- Trigger implementation\n- Class development\n- Test class creation\n- Bulk operation handling\n\n### LWC Tasks\n- Component creation\n- Apex controller integration\n- Event handling\n- Wire service usage\n\n### Flow Tasks\n- Record-triggered flows\n- Screen flows\n- Scheduled flows\n- Flow variables and formulas\n\n### Architecture Tasks\n- Cross-cutting concerns\n- Integration patterns\n- Multi-object solutions\n\n## Checkpoint Management\n\n### Checkpoint Structure\n```json\n{\n    \"evaluation_id\": \"run-20260127-123456\",\n    \"completed_tasks\": [\"task-001\", \"task-002\"],\n    \"results\": {...},\n    \"metadata\": {\n        \"model\": \"grok-4.1-fast\",\n        \"provider\": \"routellm\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-01-27T12:34:56Z\"\n    },\n    \"hash\": \"sha256:abc123...\"\n}\n```\n\n### Resume Behavior\n1. Load checkpoint from output directory\n2. Verify checkpoint integrity (hash)\n3. Skip completed tasks\n4. Continue from next pending task\n5. Merge results on completion\n\n## Result Schema (v2)\n\n### SWE-bench Compatible Format\n```json\n{\n    \"model_name_or_path\": \"grok-4.1-fast\",\n    \"instance_id\": \"task-001\",\n    \"model_patch\": \"--- a/file.cls\\n+++ b/file.cls\\n...\",\n    \"resolved\": true,\n    \"scores\": {\n        \"deploy\": 1.0,\n        \"tests\": 1.0,\n        \"functional\": 1.0,\n        \"bulk\": 1.0,\n        \"no_tweaks\": 1.0,\n        \"total\": 1.0\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting Evaluations\n\n### Common Issues\n\n#### Preflight Failure\n- Check API key environment variables\n- Verify DevHub authentication: `sf org list --all`\n- Check scratch org limits\n\n#### Solution Generation Failure\n- Verify model is available via provider\n- Check API key permissions\n- Review rate limit status\n\n#### Deployment Failure\n- Check patch format (valid git diff)\n- Review Salesforce error messages\n- Verify scratch org is active\n\n#### Validation Failure\n- Check test assertions\n- Review functional validation script\n- Verify test data setup\n\n### Debug Commands\n```bash\n# Check DevHub orgs\nsf org list --all\n\n# View scratch org details\nsf org display -o <alias>\n\n# Run tests manually\nsf apex run test -o <alias> -n <TestClass> -r human\n\n# Execute anonymous Apex\nsf apex run -o <alias> -f test-script.apex\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:58:02.767Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Agents requiring comprehensive evaluation and benchmarking on Salesforce development tasks","zh":"适用于需要对 Salesforce 开发任务进行全面评估和基准测试的 AI 编码代理","ja":"Salesforce 開発タスクの総合的な評価とベンチマーク テストを必要とする AI コーディング エージェントに適しています","ko":"Salesforce 개발 작업에 대한 종합적인 평가 및 벤치마킹이 필요한 AI 코딩 에이전트에 적합함","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación de IA que requieren una evaluación y benchmarking comprehensivos en tareas de desarrollo de Salesforce","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage IA nécessitant une évaluation et un benchmarking complets pour les tâches de développement Salesforce","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Agents, die eine umfassende Bewertung und Benchmarking für Salesforce-Entwicklungsaufgaben erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação de IA que exigem avaliação e benchmarking abrangentes em tarefas de desenvolvimento do Salesforce","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодирования ИИ, требующих всесторонней оценки и бенчмаркинга задач разработки Salesforce","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الترميز الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون تقييمًا وتحديدًا شاملين لمهام تطوير Salesforce"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute SF-Bench evaluations, leveraging API Key validation and DevHub checks to assess Apex, LWC, Flows, and more, with a deep understanding of scoring methodology and evaluation pipeline management","zh":"赋予代理执行 SF-Bench 评估的能力，利用 API Key 验证和 DevHub 检查来评估 Apex、LWC、Flows 等，并深入理解评分方法和评估流水线管理","ja":"SF-Bench 評価の実行をエージェントに可能にし、API キーの検証と DevHub チェックを使用して Apex、LWC、Flows などを評価し、スコアリング方法と評価パイプライン管理を深く理解する","ko":"에이전트가 SF-Bench 평가를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, API 키 검증 및 DevHub 확인을 사용하여 Apex, LWC, Flows 등을 평가하고, 평가 방법 및 평가 파이프라인 관리를 깊이 이해함","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar evaluaciones de SF-Bench, aprovechando la validación de la clave de API y las comprobaciones de DevHub para evaluar Apex, LWC, Flows y más, con una comprensión profunda de la metodología de puntuación y la gestión de la canalización de evaluación","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des évaluations SF-Bench, en exploitant la validation de la clé API et les vérifications DevHub pour évaluer Apex, LWC, Flows et plus, avec une compréhension approfondie de la méthodologie de notation et de la gestion de la pipeline d''évaluation","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SF-Bench-Bewertungen auszuführen, indem es die API-Schlüsselvalidierung und DevHub-Prüfungen nutzt, um Apex, LWC, Flows und mehr zu bewerten, mit einem tiefen Verständnis der Bewertungsmethode und der Verwaltung der Bewertungspipeline","pt":"Habilita agentes a executar avaliações SF-Bench, utilizando a validação da Chave de API e verificações do DevHub para avaliar Apex, LWC, Flows e muito mais, com uma compreensão profunda da metodologia de pontuação e gerenciamento de pipeline de avaliação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять оценки SF-Bench, используя проверку ключа API и проверки DevHub для оценки Apex, LWC, Flows и многое другое, с глубоким пониманием методологии оценки и управления конвейером оценки","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ تقييمات SF-Bench، باستخدام التحقق من مفتاح API وعمليات فحص DevHub لتقييم Apex و LWC و Flows والمزيد، مع فهم عميق لمنهجية التقييم وإدارة خط أنابيب التقييم"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SF-Bench evaluations for Apex and LWC","Debugging scoring discrepancies in Salesforce development tasks","Managing evaluation pipelines for Flows and other Salesforce components"],"zh":["自动化 Apex 和 LWC 的 SF-Bench 评估","调试 Salesforce 开发任务中的评分不一致问题","管理 Flows 和其他 Salesforce 组件的评估流水线"],"ja":["Apex と LWC の SF-Bench 評価の自動化","Salesforce 開発タスクのスコアリングの不一致をデバッグする","Flows と他の Salesforce コンポーネントの評価パイプラインを管理する"],"ko":["Apex 및 LWC에 대한 SF-Bench 평가 자동화","Salesforce 개발 작업의 평가 점수 불일치 디버깅","Flows 및 기타 Salesforce 구성 요소의 평가 파이프라인 관리"],"es":["Automatizar evaluaciones de SF-Bench para Apex y LWC","Depurar discrepancias en la puntuación en tareas de desarrollo de Salesforce","Administrar canalizaciones de evaluación para Flows y otros componentes de Salesforce"],"fr":["Automatiser les évaluations SF-Bench pour Apex et LWC","Déboguer les écarts de notation dans les tâches de développement Salesforce","Gérer les pipelines d''évaluation pour Flows et d''autres composants Salesforce"],"de":["Automatisieren von SF-Bench-Bewertungen für Apex und LWC","Fehlerbehebung bei Abweichungen in der Punktzahl bei Salesforce-Entwicklungsaufgaben","Verwalten von Bewertungspipelines für Flows und andere Salesforce-Komponenten"],"pt":["Automatizar avaliações SF-Bench para Apex e LWC","Depurar discrepâncias de pontuação em tarefas de desenvolvimento do Salesforce","Gerenciar pipelines de avaliação para Flows e outros componentes do Salesforce"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оценки SF-Bench для Apex и LWC","Отлаживать несоответствия оценок в задачах разработки Salesforce","Управлять конвейерами оценки для Flows и других компонентов Salesforce"],"ar":["توفير تقييمات SF-Bench لأبكس و LWC","تصحيح اختلافات التقييم في مهام تطوير Salesforce","إدارة خطوط أنابيب التقييم لتدفقات Salesforce والمكونات الأخرى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires valid API Key for Salesforce","Limited to Salesforce development tasks and SF-Bench evaluations"],"zh":["需要有效的 Salesforce API Key","仅限 Salesforce 开发任务和 SF-Bench 评估"],"ja":["有効な Salesforce API キーが必要","Salesforce 開発タスクと SF-Bench 評価のみ"],"ko":["유효한 Salesforce API 키가 필요함","Salesforce 개발 작업 및 SF-Bench 평가에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API válida para Salesforce","Limitado a tareas de desarrollo de Salesforce y evaluaciones de SF-Bench"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé API valide pour Salesforce","Limité aux tâches de développement Salesforce et aux évaluations SF-Bench"],"de":["Erfordert einen gültigen API-Schlüssel für Salesforce","Begrenzt auf Salesforce-Entwicklungsaufgaben und SF-Bench-Bewertungen"],"pt":["Exige Chave de API válida para o Salesforce","Limitado a tarefas de desenvolvimento do Salesforce e avaliações SF-Bench"],"ru":["Требуется действительный ключ API для Salesforce","Ограничен задачами разработки Salesforce и оценками SF-Bench"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح API صالحًا لSalesforce","محدود بمهام تطوير Salesforce وتقييمات SF-Bench"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
