e nouvelles fonctionnalités","Planification d''efforts de refactorisation","Planification de migrations de systèmes","Planification de changements d''architecture","Décomposition d''exigences complexes","Validation de plans existants"],"de":["Erstellung von Plänen für neue Funktionen","Planung von Refactoring-Bemühungen","Planung von Systemmigrationen","Planung von Architekturänderungen","Zerlegung komplexer Anforderungen","Validierung bestehender Pläne"],"pt":["Criação de planos para novos recursos","Planejamento de esforços de refatoração","Planejamento de migrações de sistema","Planejamento de alterações de arquitetura","Divisão de requisitos complexos","Validação de planos existentes"],"ru":["Создание планов для новых функций","Планирование усилий по рефакторингу","Планирование миграций системы","Планирование изменений архитектуры","Разделение сложных требований","Проверка существующих планов"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط لميزات جديدة","تخطيط الجهود لإعادة هيكلة","تخطيط هجرات النظام","تخطيط تغييرات الهندسة المعمارية","تقسيم المتطلبات المعقدة","التحقق من خطط موجودة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["计划生成器","结构化计划","验证计划","新功能计划","重构计划","系统迁移计划","架构更改计划","需求分解","计划验证"],"ja":["プラン生成","構造化計画","検証計画","新機能計画","リファクタリング計画","システム移行計画","アーキテクチャ変更計画","要件分解","計画検証"],"ko":["계획 생성기","구조화된 계획","검증 계획","新的 기능 계획","리팩토링 계획","시스템 마이그레이션 계획","아키텍처 변경 계획","요구사항 분해","계획 검증"],"es":["generador de planes","planificación de software","desarrollo de software","gestión de proyectos","refactorización","migración de sistemas","arquitectura de software"],"fr":["générateur de plans","planification de logiciel","développement de logiciel","gestion de projets","refactorisation","migration de systèmes","architecture de logiciel"],"de":["Plan-Generator","Software-Planung","Software-Entwicklung","Projektmanagement","Refactoring","Systemmigration","Software-Architektur"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","gerador de planos","planejamento de projeto","análise de requisitos","validação de planos","desenvolvimento ágil","metodologias de desenvolvimento","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","planejamento de recursos"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","планировщик проектов","планирование проекта","анализ требований","проверка планов","гибкая разработка","методологии разработки","инструменты разработки","планирование ресурсов"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","مولد خطط","تخطيط المشروع","تحليل المتطلبات","التحقق من خطط","التطوير المرون","منهجيات التطوير","أدوات التطوير","تخطيط الموارد"]}},"owner":"oimiragieo","repo":"agent-studio","repoPath":"oimiragieo/agent-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan-generator","description":"Creates structured plans from requirements. Generates comprehensive plans with steps, dependencies, risks, and success criteria. Coordinates with specialist agents for planning input and validates plan completeness.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"<identity>\nPlan Generator Skill - Creates structured, validated plans from requirements by coordinating with specialist agents and generating comprehensive planning artifacts.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Creating plans for new features\n- Planning refactoring efforts\n- Planning system migrations\n- Planning architecture changes\n- Breaking down complex requirements\n- Validating existing plans\n</capabilities>\n\n<instructions>\n<execution_process>\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\n\nParse user require","body":"<identity>\nPlan Generator Skill - Creates structured, validated plans from requirements by coordinating with specialist agents and generating comprehensive planning artifacts.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Creating plans for new features\n- Planning refactoring efforts\n- Planning system migrations\n- Planning architecture changes\n- Breaking down complex requirements\n- Validating existing plans\n</capabilities>\n\n<instructions>\n<execution_process>\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\n\nParse user requirements:\n\n- Extract explicit requirements\n- Identify implicit requirements\n- Determine planning scope\n- Assess complexity\n\n### Step 2: Coordinate Specialists\n\nRequest planning input from relevant agents:\n\n- **Analyst**: Business requirements and market context\n- **PM**: Product requirements and user stories\n- **Architect**: Technical architecture and design\n- **Database Architect**: Data requirements\n- **UX Expert**: Interface requirements\n\n### Step 3: Generate Plan Structure\n\nCreate plan following template:\n\n- Load template from `.cursor/templates/plan-template.md`\n- Define objectives\n- Break down into steps (≤7 steps per section)\n- Identify dependencies\n- Assign agents to steps\n\n### Step 4: Assess Risks\n\nIdentify risks and mitigation:\n\n- Technical risks\n- Resource risks\n- Timeline risks\n- Dependency risks\n- Mitigation strategies\n\n### Step 5: Validate Plan\n\nValidate plan completeness:\n\n- All requirements addressed\n- Dependencies mapped\n- Success criteria defined\n- Risks identified\n- Plan is feasible\n\n### Step 6: Generate Artifacts\n\nCreate plan artifacts:\n\n- Plan markdown: `.cursor/context/artifacts/plan-<id>.md`\n- Plan JSON: `.cursor/context/artifacts/plan-<id>.json`\n- Plan summary\n  </execution_process>\n\n<plan_types>\n**Feature Development Plan**:\n\n- Objectives: Feature goals\n- Steps: Analysis → Design → Implementation → Testing\n- Agents: Analyst → PM → Architect → Developer → QA\n\n**Refactoring Plan**:\n\n- Objectives: Code quality goals\n- Steps: Analysis → Planning → Implementation → Validation\n- Agents: Code Reviewer → Refactoring Specialist → Developer → QA\n\n**Migration Plan**:\n\n- Objectives: Migration goals\n- Steps: Analysis → Planning → Execution → Validation\n- Agents: Architect → Legacy Modernizer → Developer → QA\n\n**Architecture Plan**:\n\n- Objectives: Architecture goals\n- Steps: Analysis → Design → Validation → Documentation\n- Agents: Architect → Database Architect → Security Architect → Technical Writer\n  </plan_types>\n\n<integration>\n**Integration with Planner Agent**:\nPlanner agent uses this skill to:\n- Generate plans from requirements\n- Coordinate specialist input\n- Validate plan completeness\n- Track plan execution\n</integration>\n\n<best_practices>\n\n1. **Coordinate Early**: Get specialist input before finalizing plan\n2. **Keep Steps Focused**: ≤7 steps per plan section\n3. **Map Dependencies**: Clearly identify prerequisites\n4. **Assess Risks**: Identify and mitigate risks proactively\n5. **Validate Thoroughly**: Ensure plan is complete and feasible\n   </best_practices>\n   </instructions>\n\n<examples>\n<formatting_example>\n**Example Plan Output**\n\n**Command**: \"Generate plan for user authentication feature\"\n\n**Generated Plan**:\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: User Authentication Feature\n\n## Objectives\n\n- Implement JWT-based authentication\n- Support login, logout, and session management\n- Provide secure password handling\n\n## Steps\n\n### Step 1: Requirements Analysis\n\n- **Agent**: analyst\n- **Dependencies**: none\n- **Tasks**: Analyze auth requirements, research best practices\n- **Success Criteria**: Requirements document complete\n\n### Step 2: Architecture Design\n\n- **Agent**: architect\n- **Dependencies**: Step 1\n- **Tasks**: Design auth architecture, select technologies\n- **Success Criteria**: Architecture document complete\n\n### Step 3: Implementation\n\n- **Agent**: developer\n- **Dependencies**: Step 2\n- **Tasks**: Implement auth endpoints, JWT handling, password hashing\n- **Success Criteria**: All tests passing, code reviewed\n\n### Step 4: Testing\n\n- **Agent**: qa\n- **Dependencies**: Step 3\n- **Tasks**: Write tests, perform security testing\n- **Success Criteria**: Test coverage >80%, security validated\n```\n\n</formatting_example>\n</examples>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:58:47.700Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured planning and validation capabilities for complex projects.","zh":"适合需要结构化规划和验证复杂项目能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが複雑なプロジェクトに構造化された計画と検証機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 복잡한 프로젝트에 구조화된 계획 및 검증 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de planificación y validación estructuradas para proyectos complejos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de planification et de validation structurées pour les projets complexes.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die strukturierte Planungs- und Validierungsfunktionen für komplexe Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de planejamento estruturado e capacidades de validação para projetos complexos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы структурированное планирование и возможности проверки для сложных проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى تخطيط منظم وقدرات التحقق للمشاريع المعقدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive planning artifacts by coordinating with specialist agents, breaking down complex requirements, and validating existing plans using protocols like refactoring efforts and system migrations.","zh":"使得代理能够通过与专家代理协调、分解复杂需求、使用重构工作和系统迁移等协议来验证现有计划，从而生成全面规划文档。","ja":"エージェントが専門家エージェントと協調して、複雑な要件を分解し、リファクタリング作業やシステム移行などのプロトコルを使用して既存の計画を検証することで、包括的な計画アーティファクトを生成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 전문가 에이전트와 협조하여 복잡한 요구 사항을 분해하고 리팩토링 작업 및 시스템 마이그레이션 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 기존 계획을 검증함으로써 포괄적인 계획 아티팩트를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar artefactos de planificación integrales coordinando con agentes especialistas, descomponiendo requisitos complejos y validando planes existentes utilizando protocolos como esfuerzos de refactorización y migraciones de sistemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des artefacts de planification complets en coordonnant avec des agents spécialisés, en décomposant les exigences complexes et en validant les plans existants à l''aide de protocoles tels que les efforts de refactoring et les migrations de systèmes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Planungsartefakte zu generieren, indem sie mit Spezialagenten koordinieren, komplexe Anforderungen aufbrechen und bestehende Pläne unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Refactoring-Bemühungen und Systemmigrationen validieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar artefatos de planejamento abrangentes, coordenando com agentes especializados, quebrando requisitos complexos e validando planos existentes usando protocolos como esforços de refatoração e migrações de sistema.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать комплексные планировочные артефакты, координируя работу со специалистами-агентами, разбивая сложные требования и проверяя существующие планы с использованием протоколов, таких как рефакторинг и миграция систем.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء مخططات شاملة من خلال التنسيق مع الوكلاء المتخصصين، وتكسير المتطلبات المعقدة، والتحقق من خطط موجودة باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل جهود إعادة الهيكلة وعمليات النقل النظام."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating plans for new feature implementations","Planning and executing system migrations","Validating and refining existing project plans"],"zh":["为新功能实现创建计划","规划和执行系统迁移","验证和完善现有项目计划"],"ja":["新機能の実装計画の作成","システム移行の計画と実行","既存のプロジェクト計画の検証と改良"],"ko":["새로운 기능 구현을 위한 계획 생성","시스템 마이그레이션의 계획 및 실행","기존 프로젝트 계획의 검증 및 개선"],"es":["Creación de planes para la implementación de nuevas características","Planificación y ejecución de migraciones de sistemas","Validación y refinamiento de planes de proyecto existentes"],"fr":["Création de plans pour la mise en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Planification et exécution de migrations de systèmes","Validation et affinement de plans de projet existants"],"de":["Erstellung von Plänen für die Implementierung neuer Funktionen","Planung und Ausführung von Systemmigrationen","Validierung und Verfeinerung bestehender Projektpläne"],"pt":["Criação de planos para implementações de novos recursos","Planejamento e execução de migrações de sistema","Validação e aperfeiçoamento de planos de projeto existentes"],"ru":["Создание планов для реализации новых функций","Планирование и выполнение системных миграций","Проверка и доработка существующих проектных планов"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط لتنفيذ ميزات جديدة","التخطيط وتطبيق عمليات النقل للنظام","التحقق من صحة وخلق خطط مشروع موجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear user requirements","Dependent on specialist agents for coordination"],"zh":["需要明确的用户需求","依赖专家代理的协调"],"ja":["明確なユーザーの要件が必要","専門家エージェントの協調に依存"],"ko":["명확한 사용자 요구 사항 필요","전문가 에이전트의 협조에 의존"],"es":["Requiere requisitos de usuario claros","Depende de agentes especialistas para la coordinación"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences d''utilisateur claires","Dépend des agents spécialisés pour la coordination"],"de":["Benötigt klare Benutzeranforderungen","Ist von Spezialagenten für die Koordination abhängig"],"pt":["Exige requisitos de usuário claros","Dependente de agentes especializados para coordenação"],"ru":["Требует четких требований пользователя","Зависит от специалистов-агентов для координации"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات واضحة للمستخدم","يعتمد على وكلاء متخصصين للتنسيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
