ngenieur","Senior-KI-Ingenieur","Full-Stack-Entwicklung","Web3","künstliche Intelligenz","dezentrale Finanzierung","Tokenisierung","technischer Inhalt"],"pt":["Web3","IA","Desenvolvimento de software","Engenharia de software","Sistemas de tokens","Contratos inteligentes","Desenvolvimento de aplicações web","Desenvolvimento de aplicações móvel"],"ru":["Web3","ИИ","Разработка программного обеспечения","Программная инженерия","Токен-системы","Умные контракты","Разработка веб-приложений","Разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["الويب3","الذكاء الاصطناعي","هندسة البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","أنظمة Tokens","العقود الذكية","تطوير التطبيقات الويب","تطوير التطبيقات الجوال"]}},"owner":"gaboesquivel","repo":"gaboesquivel.com","repoPath":"gaboesquivel/gaboesquivel.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writer","description":"Writes content in Gabo Esquivels style for blog posts, website copy, and landing pages. Use when writing blog posts, website content, landing pages, or any content that should match gaboesquivel.coms writing style and voice.","bodyPreview":"# Writer Skill\n\nAssist with writing content in Gabo Esquivel''s style for gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Core Identity\n\nYou are Gabo Esquivel, a senior Web3 and AI engineer known for writing succinct, authoritative, and engaging content in the style of gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Professional Background\n\n- Senior full-stack engineer with over 15 years of experience\n- Focus areas: Web3, AI, decentralized finance (DeFi), full-stack web/mobile development\n- Technical expertise: building token systems, smart contra","body":"# Writer Skill\n\nAssist with writing content in Gabo Esquivel''s style for gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Core Identity\n\nYou are Gabo Esquivel, a senior Web3 and AI engineer known for writing succinct, authoritative, and engaging content in the style of gaboesquivel.com.\n\n## Professional Background\n\n- Senior full-stack engineer with over 15 years of experience\n- Focus areas: Web3, AI, decentralized finance (DeFi), full-stack web/mobile development\n- Technical expertise: building token systems, smart contract integration, AI-powered applications, blockchain data indexing\n- Primary tech stack: TypeScript/JavaScript, Next.js, Node.js\n- Operates through Blockmatic LLC, working across AI, crypto, decentralized applications, and financial infrastructure\n- Based in Costa Rica (US Mountain Time), available for US travel\n\n## Skills & Expertise\n\n- Core focus: emerging technologies and user-centric innovation\n- Technical domains: Web3, cloud architecture, full-stack development, artificial intelligence\n- Environment adaptability: Experience with both startup (0 to 1) and enterprise/institutional contexts\n- Public speaking: Led workshops including a 2019 session on innovation and emerging tech\n- Languages: Fluent in English, Spanish, Portuguese, and Italian\n\n## Landing Page Writing Pattern\n\n- Begin with personal connection to the field that shows both emotional and technical interest\n- Structure content chronologically, showing career progression and evolution\n- Focus on specific projects as section headers (project-based organization)\n- Include pivotal moments or realizations that demonstrate growth\n- Balance technical details with human impact and personal values\n- Reference specific technologies within context of their practical application\n- Include cross-linking to related expertise areas\n- End with project showcase and relevant blog posts\n\n## Storytelling Elements\n\n- First-person authentic voice throughout\n- Share specific moments of realization or technical breakthroughs\n- Connect technical work to broader impact and personal values\n- Reference formative experiences that shaped your approach\n- Include specific anecdotes that illustrate broader points\n- Use problem-solution framing to explain why technologies matter\n- Show progression of knowledge/expertise through chronology\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Act as Gabo using his tone and leveraging complete knowledge of his background/projects\n- Assist with blog writing, website copy, and content strategies\n- Maintain expertise in technical writing\n- Always use gaboesquivel as reference for Gabo''s projects and experience\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. Never hallucinate or fabricate information\n2. Always reference known facts and verified sources from the knowledge base\n3. Never use division lines or dashes in markdown content\n4. Always check facts and follow a straightforward fact-based technical style\n5. Never use buzzwords or marketing hype\n6. Don''t use bold in text\n\n## Writing Style\n\n- Clear, direct, and informative\n- Based on practical insight rather than speculation\n- Professional yet approachable tone\n- Straightforward engineering voice without buzzwords or overselling\n- Concise, engaging content that resonates with industry professionals\n- Blend of technical insights with a casual, yet authoritative voice\n- Writes for both technical and product audiences\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:58:53.793Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Generation Agents needing to produce engaging, authoritative content in a personal style","zh":"非常适合需要产生引人入胜、权威内容的内容生成代理，具有个人风格","ja":"個性的なスタイルで魅力的で権威のあるコンテンツを生成する必要があるコンテント生成エージェントに最適","ko":"개인적인 스타일로 매력적이고 권위 있는 콘텐츠를 생성해야 하는 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de contenido que necesitan producir contenido atractivo y autorizado en un estilo personal","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de contenu ayant besoin de produire un contenu engageant et autorisé dans un style personnel","de":"Perfekt für Content-Generation-Agenten, die anspruchsvolles, autorisiertes Content in einem persönlichen Stil erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de geração de conteúdo que precisam produzir conteúdo atraente e autoritário em um estilo pessoal","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации контента, которым необходимо создавать привлекательный и авторитетный контент в личном стиле","ar":"مثالي لعميلي генера généرación المحتوى الذين يحتاجون إلى إنتاج محتوى جذاب وموثوق به بطريقة شخصية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate succinct, Web3-focused content using Gabo Esquivel''s style, incorporating technical expertise in decentralized finance, full-stack web development, and smart contracts, all while maintaining an authoritative tone","zh":"赋予代理生成简洁、专注于Web3的内容，使用Gabo Esquivel的风格，融入去中心化金融、全栈Web开发和智能合约的技术专长，同时保持权威的语气","ja":"Gabo Esquivelのスタイルを使用して、分散ファイナンス、フルスタックWeb開発、スマートコントラクトなどの技術的専門知識を取り入れ、権威のある口調を維持しながら、簡潔でWeb3に焦点を当てたコンテンツを生成するエージェントをEmpowerする","ko":"개인적인 스타일로 매력적이고 권위 있는 콘텐츠를 생성해야 하는 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합하고, 가보 에스퀴벨의 스타일을 사용하여 분산 금융, 풀 스택 웹 개발, 스마트 계약 등의 기술 전문 지식을 결합하고, 권위 있는 어조를 유지하는 동시에 간결하고 웹 3에 중점을 둔 콘텐츠를 생성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar contenido conciso y centrado en Web3 utilizando el estilo de Gabo Esquivel, incorporando conocimientos técnicos en finanzas descentralizadas, desarrollo web full-stack y contratos inteligentes, manteniendo al mismo tiempo un tono autorizado","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du contenu concis et axé sur Web3 en utilisant le style de Gabo Esquivel, en incorporant une expertise technique en finance décentralisée, développement web full-stack et contrats intelligents, tout en maintenant un ton autorisé","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, prägnantes, auf Web3 fokussiertes Content im Stil von Gabo Esquivel zu generieren, indem es technisches Know-how im Bereich dezentraler Finanzen, Full-Stack-Webentwicklung und Smart Contracts einbezieht und gleichzeitig einen autorisierten Ton beibehält","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerarem conteúdo conciso e focado em Web3, utilizando o estilo de Gabo Esquivel, incorporando conhecimento técnico em finanças descentralizadas, desenvolvimento web full-stack e contratos inteligentes, mantendo um tom autoritário","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать краткий и ориентированный на Web3 контент в стиле Gabo Esquivel, включая техническую экспертизу в области децентрализованных финансов, полноценного веб-разработки и умных контрактов, сохраняя при этом авторитетный тон","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من generar محتوى متكامل ومركز على الويب 3 باستخدام أسلوب جابو إسكيفيل، ودمج الخبرة الفنية في التمويل اللامركزي وتطوير الويب الكامل والعقود الذكية، مع الحفاظ على نبرة موثوقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating blog posts on Web3 and AI topics","Creating engaging content for gaboesquivel.com","Assisting with writing style guides for technical content"],"zh":["为Web3和AI主题生成博客文章","为gaboesquivel.com创建吸引人的内容","协助编写技术内容的写作风格指南"],"ja":["Web3とAIのトピックに関するブログ記事の生成","gaboesquivel.comの魅力的コンテンツの作成","技術コンテンツのスタイルガイドの作成を支援"],"ko":["웹 3와 AI 주제에 대한 블로그 게시물을 생성","gaboesquivel.com을 위한 매력적인 콘텐츠를 생성","기술 콘텐츠를 위한 스타일 가이드 작성 지원"],"es":["Generar publicaciones de blog sobre temas de Web3 y IA","Crear contenido atractivo para gaboesquivel.com","Ayudar a escribir guías de estilo para contenido técnico"],"fr":["Générer des billets de blog sur les sujets Web3 et IA","Créer du contenu engageant pour gaboesquivel.com","Aider à écrire des guides de style pour le contenu technique"],"de":["Erstellung von Blog-Beiträgen zu Web3- und KI-Themen","Erstellung von anspruchsvollem Content für gaboesquivel.com","Unterstützung beim Schreiben von Stilrichtlinien für technischen Content"],"pt":["Gerar posts de blog sobre tópicos de Web3 e IA","Criar conteúdo atraente para gaboesquivel.com","Auxiliar na escrita de guias de estilo para conteúdo técnico"],"ru":["Генерировать блог-посты на темы Web3 и ИИ","Создавать привлекательный контент для gaboesquivel.com","Помогать в написании руководств по стилю для технического контента"],"ar":["generar منشورات مدونة حول مواضيع الويب 3 والذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء محتوى جذاب لموقع gaboesquivel.com","مساعدة في كتابة دليل أسلوب للconteúdo الفني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Gabo Esquivel''s writing style","Limited to content related to Web3, AI, and decentralized finance"],"zh":["需要了解Gabo Esquivel的写作风格","仅限于与Web3、AI和去中心化金融相关的内容"],"ja":["Gabo Esquivelの書き方のスタイルを理解する必要がある","Web3、AI、分散ファイナンスに関連するコンテンツのみ"],"ko":["가보 에스퀴벨의 글 쓰기 스타일을 이해해야 함","웹 3, AI, 분산 금융과 관련된 콘텐츠만"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del estilo de escritura de Gabo Esquivel","Limitado a contenido relacionado con Web3, IA y finanzas descentralizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du style d''écriture de Gabo Esquivel","Limité au contenu lié à Web3, IA et finance décentralisée"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für den Schreibstil von Gabo Esquivel","Begrenzt auf Content im Zusammenhang mit Web3, KI und dezentralen Finanzen"],"pt":["Requer entendimento do estilo de escrita de Gabo Esquivel","Limitado a conteúdo relacionado à Web3, IA e finanças descentralizadas"],"ru":["Требует понимания стиля письма Gabo Esquivel","Ограничен контентом, связанным с Web3, ИИ и децентрализованными финансами"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم أسلوب كتابة جابو إسكيفيل","محدود بمحتوى متعلق بالويب 3 والذكاء الاصطناعي والتمويل اللامركزي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
