"Exportação de artefatos de gráfico para Neo4j/Gephi","Detecção de comunidade com networkx","Instalação com pip"],"ru":["Создание двудольного графа людей и файлов","Расчет риска собственности","Экспорт графических артефактов в Neo4j/Gephi","Обнаружение сообщества с networkx","Установка с помощью pip"],"ar":["إنشاء مخطط ثنائي القسم للأشخاص والملفات","حساب مخاطر الملكية","تصدير الملفات المخططة إلى Neo4j/Gephi","اكتشاف المجتمع مع networkx","التثبيت باستخدام pip"]},"keywords":{"zh":["安全所有权地图","文件和人员的关系图","所有权风险","代码安全","Python 3","networkx","Neo4j","Gephi"],"ja":["セキュリティ所有権マップ","ファイルと人の関係性","所有権リスク","コードのセキュリティ","Python 3","networkx","Neo4j","Gephi"],"ko":["보안 소유권 맵","파일과 사람의 관계 그래프","소유권 위험","코드 보안","Python 3","networkx","Neo4j","Gephi"],"es":["seguridad de código","propietarios de seguridad","grafo bipartito","historial de Git","riesgo de propiedad","Neo4j","Gephi","networkx"],"fr":["sécurité de code","propriétaires de sécurité","graphique bipartite","historique de Git","risque de propriété","Neo4j","Gephi","networkx"],"de":["Code-Sicherheit","Sicherheitseigentümer","bipartiter Graph","Git-Historie","Eigentumsrisiko","Neo4j","Gephi","networkx"],"pt":["segurança de código aberto","risco de propriedade","gráfico bipartido","networkx","neo4j","gephi","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de segurança"],"ru":["безопасность открытого кода","риск собственности","двудольный граф","networkx","neo4j","gephi","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты безопасности"],"ar":["أمان الكود المفتوح","مخاطر الملكية","مخطط ثنائي القسم","networkx","neo4j","gephi","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الأمان"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-ownership-map","description":"Analyze git repositories to build a security ownership topology (people-to-file), compute bus factor and sensitive-code ownership, and export CSV/JSON for graph databases and visualization. Trigger only when the user explicitly wants a security-oriented ownership or bus-factor analysis grounded in git history (for example: orphaned sensitive code, security maintainers, CODEOWNERS reality checks for risk, sensitive hotspots, or ownership clusters). Do not trigger for general maintainer lists or non-security ownership questions.","bodyPreview":"# Security Ownership Map\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild a bipartite graph of people and files from git history, then compute ownership risk and export graph artifacts for Neo4j/Gephi. Also build a file co-change graph (Jaccard similarity on shared commits) to cluster files by how they move together while ignoring large, noisy commits.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python 3\n- `networkx` (required; community detection is enabled by default)\n\nInstall with:\n\n```bash\npip install networkx\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Scope the re","body":"# Security Ownership Map\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild a bipartite graph of people and files from git history, then compute ownership risk and export graph artifacts for Neo4j/Gephi. Also build a file co-change graph (Jaccard similarity on shared commits) to cluster files by how they move together while ignoring large, noisy commits.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python 3\n- `networkx` (required; community detection is enabled by default)\n\nInstall with:\n\n```bash\npip install networkx\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Scope the repo and time window (optional `--since/--until`).\n2. Decide sensitivity rules (use defaults or provide a CSV config).\n3. Build the ownership map with `scripts/run_ownership_map.py` (co-change graph is on by default; use `--cochange-max-files` to ignore supernode commits).\n4. Communities are computed by default; graphml output is optional (`--graphml`).\n5. Query the outputs with `scripts/query_ownership.py` for bounded JSON slices.\n6. Persist and visualize (see `references/neo4j-import.md`).\n\nBy default, the co-change graph ignores common “glue” files (lockfiles, `.github/*`, editor config) so clusters reflect actual code movement instead of shared infra edits. Override with `--cochange-exclude` or `--no-default-cochange-excludes`. Dependabot commits are excluded by default; override with `--no-default-author-excludes` or add patterns via `--author-exclude-regex`.\n\nIf you want to exclude Linux build glue like `Kbuild` from co-change clustering, pass:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo /path/to/linux \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --cochange-exclude \"**/Kbuild\"\n```\n\n## Quick start\n\nRun from the repo root:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --since \"12 months ago\" \\\n  --emit-commits\n```\n\nDefaults: author identity, author date, and merge commits excluded. Use `--identity committer`, `--date-field committer`, or `--include-merges` if needed.\n\nExample (override co-change excludes):\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --cochange-exclude \"**/Cargo.lock\" \\\n  --cochange-exclude \"**/.github/**\" \\\n  --no-default-cochange-excludes\n```\n\nCommunities are computed by default. To disable:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --no-communities\n```\n\n## Sensitivity rules\n\nBy default, the script flags common auth/crypto/secret paths. Override by providing a CSV file:\n\n```\n# pattern,tag,weight\n**/auth/**,auth,1.0\n**/crypto/**,crypto,1.0\n**/*.pem,secrets,1.0\n```\n\nUse it with `--sensitive-config path/to/sensitive.csv`.\n\n## Output artifacts\n\n`ownership-map-out/` contains:\n\n- `people.csv` (nodes: people)\n- `files.csv` (nodes: files)\n- `edges.csv` (edges: touches)\n- `cochange_edges.csv` (file-to-file co-change edges with Jaccard weight; omitted with `--no-cochange`)\n- `summary.json` (security ownership findings)\n- `commits.jsonl` (optional, if `--emit-commits`)\n- `communities.json` (computed by default from co-change edges when available; includes `maintainers` per community; disable with `--no-communities`)\n- `cochange.graph.json` (NetworkX node-link JSON with `community_id` + `community_maintainers`; falls back to `ownership.graph.json` if no co-change edges)\n- `ownership.graphml` / `cochange.graphml` (optional, if `--graphml`)\n\n`people.csv` includes timezone detection based on author commit offsets: `primary_tz_offset`, `primary_tz_minutes`, and `timezone_offsets`.\n\n## LLM query helper\n\nUse `scripts/query_ownership.py` to return small, JSON-bounded slices without loading the full graph into context.\n\nExamples:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out people --limit 10\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out files --tag auth --bus-factor-max 1\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out person --person alice@corp --limit 10\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out file --file crypto/tls\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out cochange --file crypto/tls --limit 10\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section orphaned_sensitive_code\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out community --id 3\n```\n\nUse `--community-top-owners 5` (default) to control how many maintainers are stored per community.\n\n## Basic security queries\n\nRun these to answer common security ownership questions with bounded output:\n\n```bash\n# Orphaned sensitive code (stale + low bus factor)\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section orphaned_sensitive_code\n\n# Hidden owners for sensitive tags\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section hidden_owners\n\n# Sensitive hotspots with low bus factor\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section bus_factor_hotspots\n\n# Auth/crypto files with bus factor <= 1\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out files --tag auth --bus-factor-max 1\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out files --tag crypto --bus-factor-max 1\n\n# Who is touching sensitive code the most\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out people --sort sensitive_touches --limit 10\n\n# Co-change neighbors (cluster hints for ownership drift)\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out cochange --file path/to/file --min-jaccard 0.05 --limit 20\n\n# Community maintainers (for a cluster)\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out community --id 3\n\n# Monthly maintainers for the community containing a file\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/community_maintainers.py \\\n  --data-dir ownership-map-out \\\n  --file network/card.c \\\n  --since 2025-01-01 \\\n  --top 5\n\n# Quarterly buckets instead of monthly\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/community_maintainers.py \\\n  --data-dir ownership-map-out \\\n  --file network/card.c \\\n  --since 2025-01-01 \\\n  --bucket quarter \\\n  --top 5\n```\n\nNotes:\n- Touches default to one authored commit (not per-file). Use `--touch-mode file` to count per-file touches.\n- Use `--window-days 90` or `--weight recency --half-life-days 180` to smooth churn.\n- Filter bots with `--ignore-author-regex ''(bot|dependabot)''`.\n- Use `--min-share 0.1` to show stable maintainers only.\n- Use `--bucket quarter` for calendar quarter groupings.\n- Use `--identity committer` or `--date-field committer` to switch from author attribution.\n- Use `--include-merges` to include merge commits (excluded by default).\n\n### Summary format (default)\n\nUse this structure, add fields if needed:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"orphaned_sensitive_code\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crypto/tls/handshake.rs\",\n      \"last_security_touch\": \"2023-03-12T18:10:04+00:00\",\n      \"bus_factor\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"hidden_owners\": [\n    {\n      \"person\": \"alice@corp\",\n      \"controls\": \"63% of auth code\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Graph persistence\n\nUse `references/neo4j-import.md` when you need to load the CSVs into Neo4j. It includes constraints, import Cypher, and visualization tips.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `bus_factor_hotspots` in `summary.json` lists sensitive files with low bus factor; `orphaned_sensitive_code` is the stale subset.\n- If `git log` is too large, narrow with `--since` or `--until`.\n- Compare `summary.json` against CODEOWNERS to highlight ownership drift.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:59:01.354Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced security visualization and risk assessment capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级安全可视化和风险评估能力的Python分析代理。","ja":"Python分析エージェントに高度なセキュリティ可視化とリスク評価機能が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 보안 시각화 및 위험 평가 기능이 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de visualización de seguridad avanzada y evaluación de riesgos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python nécessitant des capacités de visualisation de sécurité avancée et d''évaluation des risques.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Sicherheitsvisualisierungs- und Risikobewertungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de visualização de segurança avançada e capacidades de avaliação de risco.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым требуются передовые возможности визуализации безопасности и оценки риска.","ar":"مثالي لعميل分析 بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى تصور متقدم للأمان وتقييم المخاطر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compute ownership risk and export graph artifacts for Neo4j/Gephi, utilizing libraries like networkx for community detection and bipartite graph construction, while analyzing git history and file co-change graphs.","zh":"赋予代理计算所有权风险和导出图形工件到Neo4j/Gephi的能力，利用像networkx这样的库进行社区检测和二分图构造，同时分析git历史记录和文件共同更改图。","ja":"エージェントが所有権リスクを計算し、Neo4j/Gephiにグラフアーティファクトをエクスポートすることを可能にし、networkxなどのライブラリを使用してコミュニティ検出と二部グラフ構築を行い、同時にgit履歴とファイルの共同変更グラフを分析します。","ko":"에이전트가 소유권 위험을 계산하고 Neo4j/Gephi에 그래프 아티팩트를 내보내는 기능을 제공하며, networkx와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 커뮤니티 감지 및 이분 그래프 구성을 수행하며,同時에 git 기록 및 파일 공통 변경 그래프를 분석합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a calcular el riesgo de propiedad y exportar artefactos gráficos para Neo4j/Gephi, utilizando bibliotecas como networkx para la detección de comunidades y la construcción de grafos bipartitos, mientras se analiza el historial de git y los grafos de co-cambio de archivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de calculer le risque de propriété et d''exporter des artefacts graphiques pour Neo4j/Gephi, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme networkx pour la détection de communautés et la construction de graphes bipartites, tout en analysant l''historique de git et les graphes de co-changement de fichiers.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Eigentumsrisiko zu berechnen und Graph-Artefakte für Neo4j/Gephi zu exportieren, indem Bibliotheken wie networkx für die Erkennung von Communities und den Aufbau von Bipartit-Graphen verwendet werden, während die Git-Historie und die Datei-Co-Änderungs-Graphen analysiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a calcular o risco de propriedade e exportar artefatos de gráfico para Neo4j/Gephi, utilizando bibliotecas como networkx para detecção de comunidade e construção de gráficos bipartidos, ao mesmo tempo em que analisa o histórico do git e gráficos de co-mudança de arquivos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вычислять риск собственности и экспортировать графические артефакты для Neo4j/Gephi, используя библиотеки типа networkx для обнаружения сообществ и построения бипартитных графов, а также анализируя историю git и графики совместных изменений файлов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على حساب مخاطر الملكية وتصدير مكونات الرسم البياني إلى Neo4j/Gephi، باستخدام مكتبات مثل networkx للكشف عن المجتمع وبناء الرسومات ثنائية الجانب، وفي نفس الوقت تحليل تاريخ git ورسومات التغيير المشترك للملفات."},"useCases":{"en":["Building bipartite graphs of people and files from git history","Computing ownership risk and exporting graph artifacts","Clustering files by co-change similarity using Jaccard similarity on shared commits"],"zh":["从git历史记录中构建人和文件的二分图","计算所有权风险并导出图形工件","使用Jaccard相似度对共享提交的文件进行聚类"],"ja":["git履歴から人とファイルの二部グラフを構築する","所有権リスクを計算しグラフアーティファクトをエクスポートする","共有コミットのJaccard類似度を使用してファイルをクラスタリングする"],"ko":["git 기록에서 사람과 파일의 이분 그래프를 구축하는 것","소유권 위험을 계산하고 그래프 아티팩트를 내보내는 것","공유 커밋의 Jaccard 유사도를 사용하여 파일을 클러스터링하는 것"],"es":["Construir grafos bipartitos de personas y archivos a partir del historial de git","Calcular el riesgo de propiedad y exportar artefactos gráficos","Agrupar archivos por similitud de co-cambio utilizando la similitud de Jaccard en commits compartidos"],"fr":["Construire des graphes bipartites de personnes et de fichiers à partir de l''historique de git","Calculer le risque de propriété et exporter des artefacts graphiques","Regrouper des fichiers par similarité de co-changement en utilisant la similarité de Jaccard sur les commits partagés"],"de":["Bipartite-Graphen von Personen und Dateien aus der Git-Historie aufbauen","Eigentumsrisiko berechnen und Graph-Artefakte exportieren","Dateien nach Ähnlichkeit von Co-Änderungen gruppieren, indem die Jaccard-Ähnlichkeit in gemeinsamen Commits verwendet wird"],"pt":["Construção de gráficos bipartidos de pessoas e arquivos a partir do histórico do git","Cálculo do risco de propriedade e exportação de artefatos de gráfico","Agrupamento de arquivos por similaridade de co-mudança usando similaridade de Jaccard em commits compartilhados"],"ru":["Построение бипартитных графов людей и файлов из истории git","Вычисление риска собственности и экспорт графических артефактов","Кластеризация файлов по подобию совместных изменений с использованием подобия Джаккарда в общих коммитах"],"ar":["بناء رسومات ثنائية الجانب للأشخاص والملفات من تاريخ git","حساب مخاطر الملكية وتصدير مكونات الرسم البياني","تجميع الملفات حسب تشابه التغيير المشترك باستخدام تشابه جاكارد في التعديلات المشتركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3","Dependent on networkx library","Limited to analyzing git history and file co-change graphs"],"zh":["需要Python 3","依赖于networkx库","仅限分析git历史记录和文件共同更改图"],"ja":["Python 3が必要","networkxライブラリに依存している","git履歴とファイルの共同変更グラフの分析のみ"],"ko":["Python 3이 필요함","networkx 라이브러리에 의존함","git 기록 및 파일 공통 변경 그래프 분석에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere Python 3","Dependiente de la biblioteca networkx","Limitado al análisis del historial de git y los grafos de co-cambio de archivos"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3","Dépendant de la bibliothèque networkx","Limité à l''analyse de l''historique de git et des graphes de co-changement de fichiers"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3","Abhängig von der Bibliothek networkx","Begrenzt auf die Analyse der Git-Historie und der Datei-Co-Änderungs-Graphen"],"pt":["Requer Python 3","Dependente da biblioteca networkx","Limitado à análise do histórico do git e gráficos de co-mudança de arquivos"],"ru":["Требуется Python 3","Зависит от библиотеки networkx","Ограничен анализом истории git и графиков совместных изменений файлов"],"ar":["يتطلب بايثون 3","يعتمد على مكتبة networkx","محدود بتحليل تاريخ git ورسومات التغيير المشترك للملفات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('callstackincubator/agent-device/agent-device', 'community', 'callstackincubator', 'agent-device', 'callstackincubator/agent-device', 'agent-device', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z', '2026-02-18T08:58:55.530Z', NULL, '{"id":"callstackincubator/agent-device/agent-device","name":"agent-device","description":{"zh":"agent-device是一个CLI工具，用于控制iOS和Android设备，用于AI代理的移动自动化","ja":"agent-deviceは、モバイル自動化のためにiOSとAndroidデバイスを制御するCLIツールです","ko":"agent-device는 모바일 자동화를 위한 iOS 및 Android 장치를 제어하는 CLI 도구입니다","es":"Agent-device es una herramienta de línea de comandos para controlar dispositivos iOS y Android, ideal para la automatización móvil y la exploración de agentes.","fr":"Agent-device est un outil de ligne de commande pour contrôler les appareils iOS et Android, idéal pour l''automatisation mobile et l''exploration d''agents.","de":"Agent-device ist ein Befehlszeilen-Tool zum Steuern von iOS- und Android-Geräten, ideal für die mobile Automatisierung und die Erkundung von Agenten.","pt":"O agent-device é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para controlar dispositivos móveis iOS e Android para agentes de IA, permitindo a automação de tarefas","ru":"Agent-device — это инструмент командной строки для управления мобильными устройствами iOS и Android для агентов ИИ, позволяющий автоматизировать задачи","ar":"وسيط-جهاز هو أداة سطر أوامر لتحكم أجهزة محمولة آي أو إس وأندرويد للوكلاء الذكية، مما يسمحโดย توفير المهام","en":"CLI to control iOS and Android devices for AI agents"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"agent-device：移动自动化CLI工具","ja":"agent-device：モバイル自動化CLIツール","ko":"agent-device: 모바일 자동화 CLI 도구","es":"Automatización Móvil con agent-device","fr":"Automatisation Mobile avec agent-device","de":"Mobile Automation mit agent-device","pt":"Automatize Dispositivos Móveis com agent-device","ru":"Автоматизация Мобильных Устройств с agent-de