avegação","Suporte a sessões autenticadas","Gerenciamento de múltiplas guias em execução","Alternativa ao Playwright MCP"],"ru":["Прямое управление Chrome через DevTools Protocol","Унифицированный интерфейс для автоматизации задач навигации","Поддержка аутентифицированных сессий","Управление несколькими вкладками в запущенном браузере","Альтернатива Playwright MCP"],"ar":["التحكم المباشر في Chrome من خلال DevTools Protocol","واجهة موحدة لتحسين مهام المتصفح","دعم للجلسات المعتمدة","إدارة متعددة من علامات التبويب في المتصفح التشغيل","بديل ل Playwright MCP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Chrome 浏览器控制","DevTools Protocol","零依赖开发","单一统一接口","自动启动 Chrome","多标签页管理","认证会话控制","浏览技能"],"ja":["Chrome ブラウザ制御","DevTools Protocol","依存関係ゼロ","シングル統一インターフェイス","自動起動 Chrome","多タブページ管理","認証セッション制御","ブラウジングスキル"],"ko":["Chrome 브라우저 제어","DevTools Protocol","무의존성 개발","단일 통합 인터페이스","자동 시작 Chrome","다중 탭 페이지 관리","인증 세션 제어","브라우징 스킬"],"es":["control de Chrome","DevTools Protocol","Claude Code","automatización de navegador","sesiones autenticadas","gestión de pestañas"],"fr":["contrôle de Chrome","DevTools Protocol","Claude Code","automatisation de navigateur","sessions authentifiées","gestion d''onglets"],"de":["Chrome-Steuerung","DevTools Protocol","Claude Code","Browser-Automatisierung","authentifizierte Sitzungen","Registerkarten-Verwaltung"],"pt":["controle de navegador","Chrome Direct","DevTools Protocol","automação de tarefas de navegação","Claude Code","plugin de navegação","Playwright MCP"],"ru":["управление браузером","Chrome Direct","DevTools Protocol","автоматизация задач навигации","Claude Code","плагин навигации","Playwright MCP"],"ar":["تحكم المتصفح","Chrome Direct","DevTools Protocol","تحسين مهام المتصفح","Claude Code","إضافة المتصفح","Playwright MCP"]}},"owner":"obra","repo":"superpowers-chrome","repoPath":"obra/superpowers-chrome","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"browsing","description":"Use when you need direct browser control - teaches Chrome DevTools Protocol for controlling existing browser sessions, multi-tab management, form automation, and content extraction via use_browser MCP tool","bodyPreview":"# Browsing with Chrome Direct\n\n## Overview\n\nControl Chrome via DevTools Protocol using the `use_browser` MCP tool. Single unified interface with auto-starting Chrome.\n\n**Announce:** \"I''m using the browsing skill to control Chrome.\"\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use this when:**\n- Controlling authenticated sessions\n- Managing multiple tabs in running browser\n- Playwright MCP unavailable or excessive\n\n**Use Playwright MCP when:**\n- Need fresh browser instances\n- Generating screenshots/PDFs\n- Prefer higher-le","body":"# Browsing with Chrome Direct\n\n## Overview\n\nControl Chrome via DevTools Protocol using the `use_browser` MCP tool. Single unified interface with auto-starting Chrome.\n\n**Announce:** \"I''m using the browsing skill to control Chrome.\"\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use this when:**\n- Controlling authenticated sessions\n- Managing multiple tabs in running browser\n- Playwright MCP unavailable or excessive\n\n**Use Playwright MCP when:**\n- Need fresh browser instances\n- Generating screenshots/PDFs\n- Prefer higher-level abstractions\n\n## Auto-Capture\n\nEvery DOM action (navigate, click, type, select, eval, keyboard_press) automatically saves:\n- `{prefix}.png` — viewport screenshot\n- `{prefix}.md` — page content as structured markdown\n- `{prefix}.html` — full rendered DOM\n- `{prefix}-console.txt` — browser console messages\n\nFiles are saved to the session directory with sequential prefixes (001-navigate, 002-click, etc.). You must check these before using extract or screenshot actions.\n\n## The use_browser Tool\n\nSingle MCP tool with action-based interface. Chrome auto-starts on first use.\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `action` (required): Operation to perform\n- `tab_index` (optional): Tab to operate on (default: 0)\n- `selector` (optional): CSS selector for element operations\n- `payload` (optional): Action-specific data\n- `timeout` (optional): Timeout in ms for await operations (default: 5000)\n\n## Actions Reference\n\n### Navigation\n- **navigate**: Navigate to URL\n  - `payload`: URL string\n  - Example: `{action: \"navigate\", payload: \"https://example.com\"}`\n\n- **await_element**: Wait for element to appear\n  - `selector`: CSS selector\n  - `timeout`: Max wait time in ms\n  - Example: `{action: \"await_element\", selector: \".loaded\", timeout: 10000}`\n\n- **await_text**: Wait for text to appear\n  - `payload`: Text to wait for\n  - Example: `{action: \"await_text\", payload: \"Welcome\"}`\n\n### Interaction\n- **click**: Click element\n  - `selector`: CSS selector\n  - Example: `{action: \"click\", selector: \"button.submit\"}`\n\n- **type**: Type text into input (append `\\n` to submit)\n  - `selector`: CSS selector\n  - `payload`: Text to type\n  - Example: `{action: \"type\", selector: \"#email\", payload: \"user@example.com\\n\"}`\n\n- **select**: Select dropdown option\n  - `selector`: CSS selector\n  - `payload`: Option value(s)\n  - Example: `{action: \"select\", selector: \"select[name=state]\", payload: \"CA\"}`\n\n### Extraction\n- **extract**: Get page content\n  - `payload`: Format (''markdown''|''text''|''html'')\n  - `selector`: Optional - limit to element\n  - Example: `{action: \"extract\", payload: \"markdown\"}`\n  - Example: `{action: \"extract\", payload: \"text\", selector: \"h1\"}`\n\n- **attr**: Get element attribute\n  - `selector`: CSS selector\n  - `payload`: Attribute name\n  - Example: `{action: \"attr\", selector: \"a.download\", payload: \"href\"}`\n\n- **eval**: Execute JavaScript\n  - `payload`: JavaScript code\n  - Example: `{action: \"eval\", payload: \"document.title\"}`\n\n### Export\n- **screenshot**: Capture screenshot of a specific element\n  - `payload`: Filename\n  - `selector`: Optional - screenshot specific element\n  - Viewport screenshots are auto-captured after every DOM action. Use this only when you need a specific element.\n  - Example: `{action: \"screenshot\", payload: \"/tmp/chart.png\", selector: \".chart\"}`\n\n### Tab Management\n- **list_tabs**: List all open tabs\n  - Example: `{action: \"list_tabs\"}`\n\n- **new_tab**: Create new tab\n  - Example: `{action: \"new_tab\"}`\n\n- **close_tab**: Close tab\n  - `tab_index`: Tab to close\n  - Example: `{action: \"close_tab\", tab_index: 2}`\n\n### Browser Mode Control\n- **show_browser**: Make browser window visible (headed mode)\n  - Example: `{action: \"show_browser\"}`\n  - ⚠️ **WARNING**: Restarts Chrome, reloads pages via GET, loses POST state\n\n- **hide_browser**: Switch to headless mode (invisible browser)\n  - Example: `{action: \"hide_browser\"}`\n  - ⚠️ **WARNING**: Restarts Chrome, reloads pages via GET, loses POST state\n\n- **browser_mode**: Check current browser mode and profile\n  - Example: `{action: \"browser_mode\"}`\n  - Returns: `{\"headless\": true|false, \"mode\": \"headless\"|\"headed\", \"running\": true|false, \"profile\": \"name\", \"profileDir\": \"/path\"}`\n\n### Profile Management\n- **set_profile**: Change Chrome profile (must kill Chrome first)\n  - Example: `{action: \"set_profile\", \"payload\": \"browser-user\"}`\n  - ⚠️ **WARNING**: Chrome must be stopped first\n\n- **get_profile**: Get current profile name and directory\n  - Example: `{action: \"get_profile\"}`\n  - Returns: `{\"profile\": \"name\", \"profileDir\": \"/path\"}`\n\n**Default behavior**: Chrome starts in **headless mode** with **\"superpowers-chrome\" profile**.\n\n**Critical caveats when toggling modes**:\n1. **Chrome must restart** - Cannot switch headless/headed mode on running Chrome\n2. **Pages reload via GET** - All open tabs are reopened with GET requests\n3. **POST state is lost** - Form submissions, POST results, and POST-based navigation will be lost\n4. **Session state is lost** - Any client-side state (JavaScript variables, etc.) is cleared\n5. **Cookies/auth may persist** - Uses same user data directory, so logged-in sessions may survive\n\n**When to use headed mode**:\n- Debugging visual rendering issues\n- Demonstrating browser behavior to user\n- Testing features that only work with visible browser\n- Debugging issues that don''t reproduce in headless mode\n\n**When to stay in headless mode** (default):\n- All other cases - faster, cleaner, less intrusive\n- Screenshots work perfectly in headless mode\n- Most automation works identically in both modes\n\n**Profile management**:\nProfiles store persistent browser data (cookies, localStorage, extensions, auth sessions).\n\n**Profile locations**:\n- macOS: `~/Library/Caches/superpowers/browser-profiles/{name}/`\n- Linux: `~/.cache/superpowers/browser-profiles/{name}/`\n- Windows: `%LOCALAPPDATA%/superpowers/browser-profiles/{name}/`\n\n**When to use separate profiles**:\n- **Default profile (\"superpowers-chrome\")**: General automation, shared sessions\n- **Agent-specific profiles**: Isolate different agents'' browser state\n  - Example: browser-user agent uses \"browser-user\" profile\n- **Task-specific profiles**: Testing with different user contexts\n  - Example: \"test-logged-in\" vs \"test-logged-out\"\n\n**Profile data persists across**:\n- Chrome restarts\n- Mode toggles (headless ↔ headed)\n- System reboots (data is in cache directory)\n\n**To use a different profile**:\n1. Kill Chrome if running: `await chromeLib.killChrome()`\n2. Set profile: `{action: \"set_profile\", \"payload\": \"my-profile\"}`\n3. Start Chrome: Next navigate/action will use new profile\n\n## Quick Start Pattern\n\n```\nNavigate and extract:\n{action: \"navigate\", payload: \"https://example.com\"}\n{action: \"await_element\", selector: \"h1\"}\n{action: \"extract\", payload: \"text\", selector: \"h1\"}\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Fill and Submit Form\n```\n{action: \"navigate\", payload: \"https://example.com/login\"}\n{action: \"await_element\", selector: \"input[name=email]\"}\n{action: \"type\", selector: \"input[name=email]\", payload: \"user@example.com\"}\n{action: \"type\", selector: \"input[name=password]\", payload: \"pass123\\n\"}\n{action: \"await_text\", payload: \"Welcome\"}\n```\n\nThe `\\n` at the end of the password submits the form.\n\n### Multi-Tab Workflow\n```\n{action: \"list_tabs\"}\n{action: \"click\", tab_index: 2, selector: \"a.email\"}\n{action: \"await_element\", tab_index: 2, selector: \".content\"}\n{action: \"extract\", tab_index: 2, payload: \"text\", selector: \".amount\"}\n```\n\n### Dynamic Content\n```\n{action: \"navigate\", payload: \"https://example.com\"}\n{action: \"type\", selector: \"input[name=q]\", payload: \"query\"}\n{action: \"click\", selector: \"button.search\"}\n{action: \"await_element\", selector: \".results\"}\n{action: \"extract\", payload: \"text\", selector: \".result-title\"}\n```\n\n### Get Link Attribute\n```\n{action: \"navigate\", payload: \"https://example.com\"}\n{action: \"await_element\", selector: \"a.download\"}\n{action: \"attr\", selector: \"a.download\", payload: \"href\"}\n```\n\n### Execute JavaScript\n```\n{action: \"eval\", payload: \"document.querySelectorAll(''a'').length\"}\n{action: \"eval\", payload: \"Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(''a'')).map(a => a.href)\"}\n```\n\n### Resize Viewport (Responsive Testing)\nUse `eval` to resize the browser window for testing responsive layouts:\n```\n{action: \"eval\", payload: \"window.resizeTo(375, 812); ''Resized to mobile''\"}\n{action: \"eval\", payload: \"window.resizeTo(768, 1024); ''Resized to tablet''\"}\n{action: \"eval\", payload: \"window.resizeTo(1920, 1080); ''Resized to desktop''\"}\n```\n\n**Note**: This resizes the window, not device emulation. It won''t change:\n- Device pixel ratio (retina displays)\n- Touch events\n- User-Agent string\n\nFor most responsive testing, window resize is sufficient.\n\n### Clear Cookies\nUse `eval` to clear cookies accessible to JavaScript:\n```\n{action: \"eval\", payload: \"document.cookie.split('';'').forEach(c => { document.cookie = c.trim().split(''='')[0] + ''=;expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT;path=/''; }); ''Cookies cleared''\"}\n```\n\n**Note**: This clears cookies accessible to JavaScript. It won''t clear:\n- httpOnly cookies (server-side only)\n- Cookies from other domains\n\nFor most logout/reset scenarios, this is sufficient.\n\n### Scroll Page\n```\n{action: \"eval\", payload: \"window.scrollTo(0, document.body.scrollHeight); ''Scrolled to bottom''\"}\n{action: \"eval\", payload: \"window.scrollTo(0, 0); ''Scrolled to top''\"}\n{action: \"eval\", payload: \"document.querySelector(''.target'').scrollIntoView(); ''Scrolled to element''\"}\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n**Always wait before interaction:**\nDon''t click or fill immediately after navigate - pages need time to load.\n\n```\n// BAD - might fail if page slow\n{action: \"navigate\", payload: \"https://example.com\"}\n{action: \"click\", selector: \"button\"}  // May fail!\n\n// GOOD - wait first\n{action: \"navigate\", payload: \"https://example.com\"}\n{action: \"await_element\", selector: \"button\"}\n{action: \"click\", selector: \"button\"}\n```\n\n**Use specific selectors:**\nAvoid generic selectors that match multiple elements.\n\n```\n// BAD - matches first button\n{action: \"click\", selector: \"button\"}\n\n// GOOD - specific\n{action: \"click\", selector: \"button[type=submit]\"}\n{action: \"click\", selector: \"#login-button\"}\n```\n\n**Submit forms with \\n:**\nAppend newline to text to submit forms automatically.\n\n```\n{action: \"type\", selector: \"#search\", payload: \"query\\n\"}\n```\n\n**Check content first:**\nExtract page content to verify selectors before building workflow.\n\n```\n{action: \"extract\", payload: \"html\"}\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Element not found:**\n- Use `await_element` before interaction\n- Verify selector with `extract` action using ''html'' format\n\n**Timeout errors:**\n- Increase timeout: `{timeout: 30000}` for slow pages\n- Wait for specific element instead of text\n\n**Tab index out of range:**\n- Use `list_tabs` to get current indices\n- Tab indices change when tabs close\n\n**eval returns `[object Object]`:**\n- Use `JSON.stringify()` for complex objects: `{action: \"eval\", payload: \"JSON.stringify({name: ''test''})\"}`\n- For async functions: `{action: \"eval\", payload: \"JSON.stringify(await yourAsyncFunction())\"}`\n\n## Test Automation (Advanced)\n\n<details>\n<summary>Click to expand test automation guidance</summary>\n\nWhen building test automation, you have two approaches:\n\n### Approach 1: use_browser MCP (Simple Tests)\nBest for: Single-step tests, direct Claude control during conversation\n\n```json\n{\"action\": \"navigate\", \"payload\": \"https://app.com\"}\n{\"action\": \"click\", \"selector\": \"#test-button\"}\n{\"action\": \"eval\", \"payload\": \"JSON.stringify({passed: document.querySelector(''.success'') !== null})\"}\n```\n\n### Approach 2: chrome-ws CLI (Complex Tests)\nBest for: Multi-step test suites, standalone automation scripts\n\n**Key insight**: `chrome-ws` is the reference implementation showing proper Chrome DevTools Protocol usage. When `use_browser` doesn''t work as expected, examine how `chrome-ws` handles the same operation.\n\n```bash\n# Example: Automated form testing\n./chrome-ws navigate 0 \"https://app.com/form\"\n./chrome-ws fill 0 \"#email\" \"test@example.com\"\n./chrome-ws click 0 \"button[type=submit]\"\n./chrome-ws wait-text 0 \"Success\"\n```\n\n### When use_browser Fails\n1. **Check chrome-ws source code** - It shows the correct CDP pattern\n2. **Use chrome-ws to verify** - Test the same operation via CLI\n3. **Adapt the pattern** - Apply the working CDP approach to use_browser\n\n### Common Test Automation Patterns\n- **Form validation**: Fill forms, check error states\n- **UI state testing**: Click elements, verify DOM changes\n- **Performance testing**: Measure load times, capture metrics\n- **Screenshot comparison**: Capture before/after states\n\n</details>\n\n## Advanced Usage\n\nFor command-line usage outside Claude Code, see [COMMANDLINE-USAGE.md](COMMANDLINE-USAGE.md).\n\nFor detailed examples, see [EXAMPLES.md](EXAMPLES.md).\n\n## Protocol Reference\n\nFull CDP documentation: https://chromedevtools.github.io/devtools-protocol/\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:59:28.337Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code requiring direct Chrome browser control via DevTools Protocol for seamless browsing experiences.","zh":"适用于需要通过DevTools Protocol直接控制Chrome浏览器的AI代理，如Claude Code，提供无缝的浏览体验。","ja":"DevTools Protocolを介してChromeブラウザを直接制御する必要があるAIエージェント、たとえばClaude Codeに適しています。","ko":"DevTools Protocol을 통해 Chrome 브라우저를 직접 제어해야 하는 AI 에이전트인 Claude Code와 같은 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code que requieren control directo del navegador Chrome a través del protocolo DevTools para experiencias de navegación sin interrupciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code nécessitant un contrôle direct du navigateur Chrome via le protocole DevTools pour des expériences de navigation sans interruption.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine direkte Steuerung des Chrome-Browsers über das DevTools-Protokoll für eine nahtlose Browsingerfahrung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code que requerem controle direto do navegador Chrome via Protocolo DevTools para experiências de navegação sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих прямого контроля над браузером Chrome через протокол DevTools для бесперебойного просмотра.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكية مثل Claude Code التي تتطلب التحكم المباشر في متصفح Chrome عبر بروتوكول DevTools لتجارب تصفح متواصلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to control Chrome via DevTools Protocol, enabling single unified interface management with auto-starting Chrome, perfect for authenticated sessions and multi-tab management using the `use_browser` MCP tool, all without relying on Playwright MCP for zero-dependency efficiency.","zh":"赋予代理控制Chrome的能力，通过DevTools Protocol实现统一的界面管理，包括自动启动Chrome，非常适合认证会话和使用`use_browser` MCP工具进行多标签管理，不依赖Playwright MCP实现零依赖效率。","ja":"エージェントがChromeをDevTools Protocolを介して制御できるようにし、統一されたインターフェイス管理を実現し、Chromeの自動起動や、`use_browser` MCPツールを使用したマルチタブ管理を可能にし、Playwright MCPに依存しない零依存の効率を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 DevTools Protocol을 통해 Chrome를 제어할 수 있도록 하여,統一된 인터페이스 관리를 구현하고, Chrome의 자동 시작 및 `use_browser` MCP 도구를 사용한 멀티 탭 관리를 가능하게 하며, Playwright MCP에 의존하지 않는 무의존성 효율을 실현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes controlar Chrome a través del protocolo DevTools, lo que permite una gestión de interfaz unificada con Chrome de inicio automático, perfecto para sesiones autenticadas y gestión de varias pestañas utilizando la herramienta MCP `use_browser`, todo sin depender de Playwright MCP para una eficiencia sin dependencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contrôler Chrome via le protocole DevTools, permettant une gestion d''interface unifiée avec Chrome de démarrage automatique, parfait pour les sessions authentifiées et la gestion de plusieurs onglets en utilisant l''outil MCP `use_browser`, le tout sans dépendre de Playwright MCP pour une efficacité sans dépendance.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Chrome über das DevTools-Protokoll zu steuern, was eine einheitliche Schnittstellenverwaltung mit automatisch startendem Chrome ermöglicht, perfekt für authentifizierte Sitzungen und die Verwaltung mehrerer Registerkarten unter Verwendung des MCP-Tools `use_browser`, all dies ohne Abhängigkeit von Playwright MCP für eine abhängigkeitsfreie Effizienz.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a controlar o Chrome via Protocolo DevTools, permitindo gerenciamento de interface unificada com inicialização automática do Chrome, perfeito para sessões autenticadas e gerenciamento de multi-abas usando a ferramenta MCP `use_browser`, tudo sem depender do Playwright MCP para eficiência de zero dependência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью контролировать Chrome через протокол DevTools, обеспечивая управление единой унифицированной интерфейсом с автоматическим запуском Chrome, идеально подходит для аутентифицированных сессий и управления несколькими вкладками с помощью инструмента MCP `use_browser`, все без зависимости от Playwright MCP для эффективности с нулевой зависимостью.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من التحكم في Chrome عبر بروتوكول DevTools، مما يتيح إدارة واجهة موحدة مع بدء تشغيل Chrome تلقائي، مناسب للمجلسات المصدقة وإدارة علامات التبويب المتعددة باستخدام أداة MCP `use_browser`، كل ذلك دون الاعتماد على Playwright MCP من أجل كفاءة بلا تعطل."},"useCases":{"en":["Controlling authenticated browser sessions","Managing multiple tabs in a running Chrome browser instance","Bypassing Playwright MCP for specific browsing tasks"],"zh":["控制认证浏览会话","管理运行中的Chrome浏览器实例中的多个标签","绕过Playwright MCP进行特定的浏览任务"],"ja":["認証付きブラウザセッションの制御","実行中のChromeブラウザインスタンス内の複数のタブの管理","特定のブラウジングタスクに対してPlaywright MCPをバイパス"],"ko":["인증된 브라우저 세션 제어","실행 중인 Chrome 브라우저 인스턴스 내의 여러 탭 관리","특정 브라우징 작업을 위해 Playwright MCP를 우회"],"es":["Controlar sesiones de navegador autenticadas","Administrar varias pestañas en una instancia de Chrome en ejecución","Saltar Playwright MCP para tareas de navegación específicas"],"fr":["Contrôler les sessions de navigateur authentifiées","Gérer plusieurs onglets dans une instance de Chrome en cours d''exécution","Contourner Playwright MCP pour des tâches de navigation spécifiques"],"de":["Authentifizierte Browser-Sitzungen steuern","Mehrere Registerkarten in einer laufenden Chrome-Browser-Instanz verwalten","Playwright MCP für bestimmte Browsing-Aufgaben umgehen"],"pt":["Controle de sessões de navegador autenticadas","Gerenciamento de múltiplas abas em uma instância de navegador Chrome em execução","Contornar o Playwright MCP para tarefas de navegação específicas"],"ru":["Контроль аутентифицированных сессий браузера","Управление несколькими вкладками в запущенной экземпляре браузера Chrome","Обход Playwright MCP для определенных задач просмотра"],"ar":["التحكم في جلسات المتصفح المصدقة","إدارة علامات التبويب المتعددة في مثيل متصفح Chrome قيد التشغيل","التجاوز حول Playwright MCP لمهام التصفح المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome browser installation","Dependent on DevTools Protocol compatibility","Not suitable for generating screenshots or PDFs"],"zh":["需要Chrome浏览器安装","依赖DevTools Protocol兼容性","不适合生成截图或PDF"],"ja":["Chromeブラウザのインストールが必要","DevTools Protocolの互換性に依存","スクリーンショットまたはPDFの生成に不適"],"ko":["Chrome 브라우저 설치가 필요","DevTools Protocol 호환성에 의존","스크린샷 또는 PDF 생성에 부적합"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del navegador Chrome","Dependiente de la compatibilidad del protocolo DevTools","No es adecuado para generar capturas de pantalla o PDF"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du navigateur Chrome","Dépend de la compatibilité du protocole DevTools","N''est pas adapté pour générer des captures d''écran ou des PDF"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des Chrome-Browsers","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität des DevTools-Protokolls","Nicht geeignet für die Generierung von Screenshots oder PDFs"],"pt":["Requer instalação do navegador Chrome","Dependente da compatibilidade do Protocolo DevTools","Não é adequado para gerar capturas de tela ou PDFs"],"ru":["Требуется установка браузера Chrome","Зависит от совместимости протокола DevTools","Не подходит для генерации снимков экрана или PDF"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت متصفح Chrome","يعتمد على توافق بروتوكول DevTools","غير مناسب لإنشاء لقطات الشاشة أو مستندات PDF"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Dart Best Practices', 'community', 'HoangNguyen0403', 'agent-skills-standard', 'HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard', 'Dart Best Practices', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z', '2026-02-18T08:59:35.718Z', NULL, '{"id":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard/Dart Best Practices","name":"Dart Best Practices","description":{"zh":"Dart 语言的最佳实践指南，帮助开发者编写高质量的代码","ja":"Dart のベストプラクティスガイド、クオリティの高いコードを書くためのヒント","ko":"Dart 언어의 최선의 관행 가이드, 개발자가 높은 품질의 코드를 작성하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Las mejores prácticas de Dart para desarrolladores incluyen evitar variables globales y utilizar `const` y `final` para garantizar la inmutabilidad.","fr":"Les bonnes pratiques Dart pour les développeurs incluent l''évitement des variables globales et l''utilisation de `const` et `final` pour assurer l''immuabilité.","de":"Die besten Praktiken für Dart-Entwickler umfassen das Vermeiden globaler Variablen und die Verwendung von `const` und `final` für die Gewährleistung der Unveränderlichkeit.","pt":"Melhores práticas para escrever código Dart limpo e manutenível, incluindo dicas de escopo, imutabilidade e configuração.","ru":"Лучшие практики для написания чистого и поддерживаемого кода на Dart, включая советы по области видимости, неизменности и конфигурации.","ar":"أفضل الممارسات لكتابة رمز دارت نظيف وقابل للصيانة، بما في ذلك نصائح حول نطاق وثبات وتكوين.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Dart 最佳实践指南","ja":"Dart ベストプラクティス","ko":"Dart 최고의 실천 방법","es":"Mejores prácticas de Dart para desarrolladores","fr":"Bonnes pratiques Dart pour les développeurs","de":"Dart-Best-Practices für Entwickler","pt":"Melhores Práticas Dart para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Лучшие практики Dart для разработчиков","ar":"أفضل الممارسات لغة دارت لل مطورين","en":"Dart Best Practices"},"description":{"zh":"Dart 语言的最佳实践指南，帮助开发者编写高质量的代码","ja":"Dart のベストプラクティスガイド、クオリティの高いコードを書くためのヒント","ko":"Dart 언어의 최선의 관행 가이드, 개발자가 높은 품질의 코드를 작성하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Las mejores prácticas de Dart para desarrolladores incluyen evitar variables globales y utilizar `const` y `final` para garantizar la inmutabilidad.","fr":"Les bonnes pratiques Dart pour les développeurs incluent l''évitement des variables globales et l''utilisation de `const` et `final` pour assurer l''immuabilité.","de":"Die besten Praktiken für Dart-Entwickler umfassen das Vermeiden globaler Variablen und die Verwendung von `const` und `final` für die Gewährleistung der Unve...","pt":"Melhores práticas para escrever código Dart limpo e manutenível, incluindo dicas de escopo, imutabilidade e configuração.","ru":"Лучшие практики для написания чистого и поддерживаемого кода на Dart, включая советы по области видимости, неизменности и конфигурации.","ar":"أفضل الممارسات لكتابة رمز دارت نظيف وقابل للصيانة، بما في ذلك نصائح حول نطاق وثبات وتكوين.","en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and p..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of Agent Skills Standard and Best Practice for Programming Languages, Frameworks that help our AI Agent follow best practies on frameworks and programming laguages"},"features":{"zh":["避免使用全局变量","使用私有全局变量时以 `_` 开头","优先使用 `const` 和 `final`","使用 `--dart-define` 配置秘密信息","遵循 PascalCase 和 camelCase 命名规范"],"ja":["グローバル変数の使用を避ける","プライベートグローバル変数の場合 `_` で始める","`const` と `final` を優先して使用する","秘密情報の設定に `--dart-define` を使用する","PascalCase と camelCase の命名規則に従う"],"ko":["전역 변수 사용을 피하세요","사용하는 경우 개인 정보를 `_`로 시작","`const`와 `final`을 우선 사용","비밀 정보를 설정하는 데 `--dart-define`을 사용","PascalCase와 camelCase의 명명 규칙을 따름"],"es":["Evitación de variables globales","Uso de `const` y `final` para inmutabilidad","Configuración con `--dart-define`","Naming con PascalCase y camelCase","Preferencia de comillas simples para cadenas"],"fr":["Évitement des variables globales","Utilisation de `const` et `final` pour l''immuabilité","Configuration avec `--dart-define`","Nomage avec PascalCase et camelCase","Préférence des guillemets simples pour les chaînes"],"de":["Vermeidung globaler Variablen","Verwendung von `const` und `final` für Unveränderlichkeit","Konfiguration mit `--dart-define`","Benennung mit PascalCase und camelCase","Bevorzugung einfacher Anführungszeichen für Zeichenfolgen"],"pt":["Evite variáveis globais","Use const e final para imutabilidade","Configure segredos com --dart-define","Siga as convenções de nomenclatura effective-dart","Prefira aspas simples para strings"],"ru":["Избегайте глобальных переменных","Используйте const и final для неизменности","Настройте секреты с --dart-define","Следуйте соглашениям об именовании effective-dart","Предпочитайте одинарные кавычки для строк"],"ar":["تجنب المتغيرات العالمية","استخدم const و final للثبات","اعمل إعدادات السر مع --dart-define","اتبع اتفاقيات التسمية effective-dart","افضل استعمال علامات الاقتباس الفردي لل سلسلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Dart 最佳实践","Dart 编码规范","Dart 语言指南","Dart 开发最佳实践","Dart 代码质量","Dart 编程规范"],"ja":["Dart ベストプラクティス","Dart コーディング規約","Dart 言語ガイド","Dart 開発ベストプラクティス","Dart コード品質","Dart プログラミング規約"],"ko":["Dart 최선의 실천 방법","Dart 코딩 규칙","Dart 언어 가이드","Dart 개발 최선의 실천 방법","Dart 코드 품질","Dart 프로그래밍 규칙"],"es":["Dart","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de software","programación eficiente","código limpio","inmutabilidad","configuración","naming"],"fr":["Dart","bonnes pratiques","développement de logiciels","programmation efficace","code propre","immuabilité","configuration","nomage"],"de":["Dart","beste Praktiken","Software-Entwicklung","effiziente Programmierung","sauberer Code","Unveränderlichkeit","Konfiguration","Benennung"],"pt":["melhores práticas dart","desenvolvimento dart","código dart limpo","manutenção de código","linguagem de programação dart","effective-dart"],"ru":["лучшие практики dart","разработка на dart","чистый код dart","поддержка кода","язык программирования dart","effective-dart"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات لغة دارت","تطوير دارت","رمز دارت نظيف","صيانة الرمز","لغة البرمجة دارت","effective-dart"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Dart Best Practices","description":"General purity standards for Dart development.","bodyPreview":"# Dart Best Practices\n\n## **Priority: P1 (OPERATIONAL)**\n\nBest practices for writing clean, maintainable Dart code.\n\n- **Scoping**:\n  - No global variables.\n  - Private globals (if required) must start with `_`.\n- **Immutability**: Use `const` > `final` > `var`.\n- **Config**: Use `--dart-define` for secrets. Never hardcode API keys.\n- **Naming**: Follow [effective-dart](https://dart.dev/guides/language/effective-dart) (PascalCase classes, camelCase members).\n- **Strings**: Prefer single quotes;","body":"# Dart Best Practices\n\n## **Priority: P1 (OPERATIONAL)**\n\nBest practices for writing clean, maintainable Dart code.\n\n- **Scoping**:\n  - No global variables.\n  - Private globals (if required) must start with `_`.\n- **Immutability**: Use `const` > `final` > `var`.\n- **Config**: Use `--dart-define` for secrets. Never hardcode API keys.\n- **Naming**: Follow [effective-dart](https://dart.dev/guides/language/effective-dart) (PascalCase classes, camelCase members).\n- **Strings**: Prefer single quotes; use double quotes only for interpolation needs.\n- **Trailing Commas**: Always use trailing commas for multi-line literals/params.\n- **Expression Bodies**: Prefer `=>` for single-expression functions/getters.\n- **Collections**:\n  - Use `.map`, `.where`, `.fold`, `.any` over manual loops when clarity improves.\n  - Type empty collections (`<String>[]`, `<String, User>{}`) to avoid `dynamic`.\n  - Use collection `if`/`for` and spread operators for composable lists/maps.\n- **Async**: Always `await` futures unless intentionally fire-and-forget.\n\n```dart\nimport ''models/user.dart''; // Good\nimport ''package:app/models/user.dart''; // Avoid local absolute\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T08:59:35.718Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Dart-based AI Agents seeking to maintain clean, readable, and scalable codebases.","zh":"适用于基于Dart的AI代理，旨在保持代码库清洁、可读和可扩展。","ja":"DartベースのAIエージェントに適しており、クリーンで読みやすく、拡張可能なコードベースを維持することを目指しています。","ko":"Dart 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 깨끗하고 읽기 쉽고 확장 가능한 코드베이스를 유지하도록 설계되었습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Dart que buscan mantener bases de código limpias, legibles y escalables.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Dart souhaitant maintenir des bases de code propres, lisibles et évolutives.","de":"Ideal für Dart-basierte KI-Agents, die saubere, lesbare und skalierbare Codebasen aufrechterhalten möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Dart que buscam manter código-fonte limpo, legível e escalável.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Dart, стремящихся поддерживать чистый, читаемый и масштабируемый код.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على Dart الذين يسعون للحفاظ على قواعد بيانات نظيفة وقابلة للقراءة وقابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write efficient Dart code by following best practices such as scoping, immutability, and secure configuration using --dart-define, while adhering to the effective-dart style guide for naming conventions and string handling.","zh":"通过遵循最佳实践（例如范围、不可变性和使用--dart-define进行安全配置），并遵循effective-dart风格指南的命名约定和字符串处理，赋予代理写出高效的Dart代码的能力。","ja":"ベストプラクティス（スコーピング、不変性、--dart-defineを使用したセキュアな構成など）に従い、effective-dartスタイルガイドの命名規則と文字列処理に従うことで、効率的なDartコードを書くエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"범위, 불변성 및 --dart-define을 사용한 보안 구성과 같은 모범 사례를 따르고 effective-dart 스타일 가이드의 명명 규칙 및 문자열 처리를 따름으로써 효율적인 Dart 코드를 작성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes escribir un código Dart eficiente siguiendo las mejores prácticas, como el ámbito, la inmutabilidad y la configuración segura utilizando --dart-define, mientras se adhiere a la guía de estilo effective-dart para convenciones de nomenclatura y manejo de cadenas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire un code Dart efficace en suivant les meilleures pratiques, telles que la portée, l''immuabilité et la configuration sécurisée à l''aide de --dart-define, tout en respectant le guide de style effective-dart pour les conventions de nommage et le traitement des chaînes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, effizienten Dart-Code zu schreiben, indem sie bewährte Verfahren wie Gültigkeitsbereich, Unveränderlichkeit und sichere Konfiguration mit --dart-define befolgen, während sie sich an die effective-dart-Stilrichtlinie für Namenskonventionen und Zeichenfolgenverarbeitung halten.","pt":"Habilita agentes a escrever código Dart eficiente seguindo as melhores práticas, como escopo, imutabilidade e configuração segura usando --dart-define, enquanto adere ao guia de estilo effective-dart para convenções de nomenclatura e manipulação de strings.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать эффективный код Dart, следуя лучшим практикам, таким как область видимости, неизменность и безопасная конфигурация с помощью --dart-define, при этом соблюдая руководство по стилю effective-dart для соглашений об именах и обработки строк.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من كتابة رمز Dart فعال من خلال اتباع أفضل الممارسات مثل نطاق وعدم القابلية للتغيير والتكوين الآمن باستخدام --dart-define ، في حين الالتزام بدليل النمط effective-dart للتسميات والتعامل مع السلاسل."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing scoping rules to avoid global variables","Implementing immutable data structures with const, final, and var","Securing API keys and secrets through command-line definitions"],"zh":["强制执行范围规则以避免全局变量","使用const、final和var实现不可变数据结构","通过命令行定义保护API密钥和机密"],"ja":["グローバル変数を避けるためにスコーピング規則を強制する","const、final、varを使用して不変データ構造を実装する","コマンドライン定義を使用してAPIキーとシークレットを保護する"],"ko":["전역 변수를 피하기 위해 범위 규칙을 강제로 적용하는 것","const, final 및 var를 사용하여 불변 데이터 구조를 구현하는 것","명령줄 정의를 사용하여 API 키 및 비밀을 보호하는 것"],"es":["Aplicar reglas de ámbito para evitar variables globales","Implementar estructuras de datos inmutables con const, final y var","Proteger claves de API y secretos a través de definiciones de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des règles de portée pour éviter les variables globales","Implémenter des structures de données immuables avec const, final et var","Sécuriser les clés d''API et les secrets via des définitions de ligne de commande"],"de":["Gültigkeitsbereichsregeln durchsetzen, um globale Variablen zu vermeiden","Implementierung unveränderlicher Datenstrukturen mit const, final und var","Sicherung von API-Schlüsseln und Geheimnissen durch Befehlszeilendefinitionen"],"pt":["Aplicar regras de escopo para evitar variáveis globais","Implementar estruturas de dados imutáveis com const, final e var","Proteger chaves de API e segredos por meio de definições de linha de comando"],"ru":["Применение правил области видимости для избежания глобальных переменных","Реализация неизменных структур данных с помощью const, final и var","Защита ключей API и секретов с помощью определений командной строки"],"ar":["تطبيق قواعد النطاق لتجنب المتغيرات العالمية","تنفيذ هياكل بيانات غير قابلة للتغيير باستخدام const و final و var","حماية مفاتيح API والأسرار من خلال التعريفات السطرية للوحدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to specific naming conventions (PascalCase and camelCase)","Demands careful handling of mutable and immutable variables"],"zh":["需要遵循特定的命名约定（PascalCase和camelCase）","需要小心处理可变和不可变变量"],"ja":["特定の命名規則（PascalCaseとcamelCase）に従う必要がある","可変と不変の変数のハンドリングに注意が必要"],"ko":["특정 명명 규칙(PascalCase 및 camelCase)을 따라야 함","가변 및 불변 변수의 처리에 주의가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere adherirse a convenciones de nomenclatura específicas (PascalCase y camelCase)","Exige un manejo cuidadoso de variables mutables e inmutables"],"fr":["Nécessite d''adhérer à des conventions de nommage spécifiques (PascalCase et camelCase)","Exige une manipulation soigneuse des variables mutables et immuables"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung spezifischer Namenskonventionen (PascalCase und camelCase)","Fordert eine sorgfältige Handhabung von veränderlichen und unveränderlichen Variablen"],"pt":["Exige adesão a convenções de nomenclatura específicas (PascalCase e camelCase)","Exige manipulação cuidadosa de variáveis mutáveis e imutáveis"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения определенных соглашений об именах (PascalCase и camelCase)","Требует тщательной обработки изменяемых и неизменных переменных"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بالاتفاقيات المحددة للتسمية (PascalCase و camelCase)","يتطلب التعامل بحذر مع المتغيرات القابلة للتغيير والثابتة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
