larifying snippet optimization goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to snippet content","Validating snippet outcomes against search intent","Generating actionable steps for snippet implementation"],"ko":["Clarifying snippet optimization goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to snippet content","Validating snippet outcomes against search intent","Generating actionable steps for snippet implementation"],"es":["Clarifying snippet optimization goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to snippet content","Validating snippet outcomes against search intent","Generating actionable steps for snippet implementation"],"fr":["Clarifying snippet optimization goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to snippet content","Validating snippet outcomes against search intent","Generating actionable steps for snippet implementation"],"de":["Clarifying snippet optimization goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to snippet content","Validating snippet outcomes against search intent","Generating actionable steps for snippet implementation"],"pt":["Clarifying snippet optimization goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to snippet content","Validating snippet outcomes against search intent","Generating actionable steps for snippet implementation"],"ru":["Clarifying snippet optimization goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to snippet content","Validating snippet outcomes against search intent","Generating actionable steps for snippet implementation"],"ar":["Clarifying snippet optimization goals and constraints","Applying SEO best practices to snippet content","Validating snippet outcomes against search intent","Generating actionable steps for snippet implementation"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear goals and inputs for effective operation","Limited to SEO snippet hunter domain expertise","Needs detailed examples from resources for complex scenarios"],"zh":["Requires clear goals and inputs for effe