el tamaño de los datos","Masking para ocultar información confidencial","Caching para mejorar el acceso a los datos","Particionado para optimizar el uso de la memoria","Aplicación de estrategias de compaction y caching"],"fr":["Techniques de compression pour réduire la taille des données","Masking pour masquer les informations confidentielles","Caching pour améliorer l''accès aux données","Partitionnement pour optimiser l''utilisation de la mémoire","Application de stratégies de compaction et de caching"],"de":["Komprimierungstechniken zur Reduzierung der Datengröße","Masking zur Verbergen von vertraulichen Informationen","Caching zur Verbesserung des Datenzugriffs","Partitionierung zur Optimierung des Speicherbedarfs","Anwendung von Komprimierungs- und Caching-Strategien"],"pt":["Compacção de contexto","Mascaramento de dados","Técnicas de cache","Partição de contexto","Otimização de janelas de contexto"],"ru":["Сжатие контекста","Маскирование данных","Методы кэширования","Разделение контекста","Оптимизация контекстных окон"],"ar":["ضغط السياق","إخفاء البيانات","تقنيات تخزين البيانات المؤقتة","تقسيم السياق","تحسين نافذة السياق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文优化","AI模型优化","压缩策略","屏蔽技术","缓存机制","分区优化","自然语言处理"],"ja":["コンテキスト最適化","AIモデルの最適化","圧縮戦略","隠蔽技術","キャッシングメカニズム","パーティショニング最適化","自然言語処理"],"ko":["컨텍스트 최적화","AI 모델 최적화","압축 전략","마스킹 기술","캐싱 메커니즘","파티셔닝 최적화","자연어 처리"],"es":["optimización de contexto","técnicas de compresión","masking","caching","particionado","compaction","desarrollo de aplicaciones","rendimiento de aplicaciones"],"fr":["optimisation de contexte","techniques de compression","masking","caching","partitionnement","compaction","développement d''applications","performances des applications"],"de":["Kontextoptimierung","Komprimierungstechniken","Masking","Caching","Partitionierung","Komprimierung","Anwendungsentwicklung","Anwendungsleistung"],"pt":["otimização de contexto","compacção de contexto","mascaramento de dados","técnicas de cache","partição de contexto","desenvolvimento de ai","biblioteca de habilidades de agente"],"ru":["оптимизация контекста","сжатие контекста","маскирование данных","методы кэширования","разделение контекста","разработка ai","библиотека навыков агента"],"ar":["تحسين السياق","ضغط السياق","إخفاء البيانات","تقنيات تخزين البيانات المؤقتة","تقسيم السياق","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","مكتبة مهارات الوكيل"]}},"owner":"legendaryabhi","repo":"agent-skills-hub","repoPath":"legendaryabhi/agent-skills-hub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-optimization","description":"Apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies","bodyPreview":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective con","body":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nApply compaction, masking, and caching strategies\n\nUse this skill when working with apply compaction, masking, and caching strategies.\n# Context Optimization Techniques\n\nContext optimization extends the effective capacity of limited context windows through strategic compression, masking, caching, and partitioning. The goal is not to magically increase context windows but to make better use of available capacity. Effective optimization can double or triple effective context capacity without requiring larger models or longer contexts.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Context limits constrain task complexity\n- Optimizing for cost reduction (fewer tokens = lower costs)\n- Reducing latency for long conversations\n- Implementing long-running agent systems\n- Needing to handle larger documents or conversations\n- Building production systems at scale\n\n## Core Concepts\n\nContext optimization extends effective capacity through four primary strategies: compaction (summarizing context near limits), observation masking (replacing verbose outputs with references), KV-cache optimization (reusing cached computations), and context partitioning (splitting work across isolated contexts).\n\nThe key insight is that context quality matters more than quantity. Optimization preserves signal while reducing noise. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard, and when to apply each technique.\n\n## Detailed Topics\n\n### Compaction Strategies\n\n**What is Compaction**\nCompaction is the practice of summarizing context contents when approaching limits, then reinitializing a new context window with the summary. This distills the contents of a context window in a high-fidelity manner, enabling the agent to continue with minimal performance degradation.\n\nCompaction typically serves as the first lever in context optimization. The art lies in selecting what to keep versus what to discard.\n\n**Compaction Implementation**\nCompaction works by identifying sections that can be compressed, generating summaries that capture essential points, and replacing full content with summaries. Priority for compression goes to tool outputs (replace with summaries), old turns (summarize early conversation), retrieved docs (summarize if recent versions exist), and never compress system prompt.\n\n**Summary Generation**\nEffective summaries preserve different elements depending on message type:\n\nTool outputs: Preserve key findings, metrics, and conclusions. Remove verbose raw output.\n\nConversational turns: Preserve key decisions, commitments, and context shifts. Remove filler and back-and-forth.\n\nRetrieved documents: Preserve key facts and claims. Remove supporting evidence and elaboration.\n\n### Observation Masking\n\n**The Observation Problem**\nTool outputs can comprise 80%+ of token usage in agent trajectories. Much of this is verbose output that has already served its purpose. Once an agent has used a tool output to make a decision, keeping the full output provides diminishing value while consuming significant context.\n\nObservation masking replaces verbose tool outputs with compact references. The information remains accessible if needed but does not consume context continuously.\n\n**Masking Strategy Selection**\nNot all observations should be masked equally:\n\nNever mask: Observations critical to current task, observations from the most recent turn, observations used in active reasoning.\n\nConsider masking: Observations from 3+ turns ago, verbose outputs with key points extractable, observations whose purpose has been served.\n\nAlways mask: Repeated outputs, boilerplate headers/footers, outputs already summarized in conversation.\n\n### KV-Cache Optimization\n\n**Understanding KV-Cache**\nThe KV-cache stores Key and Value tensors computed during inference, growing linearly with sequence length. Caching the KV-cache across requests sharing identical prefixes avoids recomputation.\n\nPrefix caching reuses KV blocks across requests with identical prefixes using hash-based block matching. This dramatically reduces cost and latency for requests with common prefixes like system prompts.\n\n**Cache Optimization Patterns**\nOptimize for caching by reordering context elements to maximize cache hits. Place stable elements first (system prompt, tool definitions), then frequently reused elements, then unique elements last.\n\nDesign prompts to maximize cache stability: avoid dynamic content like timestamps, use consistent formatting, keep structure stable across sessions.\n\n### Context Partitioning\n\n**Sub-Agent Partitioning**\nThe most aggressive form of context optimization is partitioning work across sub-agents with isolated contexts. Each sub-agent operates in a clean context focused on its subtask without carrying accumulated context from other subtasks.\n\nThis approach achieves separation of concerns—the detailed search context remains isolated within sub-agents while the coordinator focuses on synthesis and analysis.\n\n**Result Aggregation**\nAggregate results from partitioned subtasks by validating all partitions completed, merging compatible results, and summarizing if still too large.\n\n### Budget Management\n\n**Context Budget Allocation**\nDesign explicit context budgets. Allocate tokens to categories: system prompt, tool definitions, retrieved docs, message history, and reserved buffer. Monitor usage against budget and trigger optimization when approaching limits.\n\n**Trigger-Based Optimization**\nMonitor signals for optimization triggers: token utilization above 80%, degradation indicators, and performance drops. Apply appropriate optimization techniques based on context composition.\n\n## Practical Guidance\n\n### Optimization Decision Framework\n\nWhen to optimize:\n- Context utilization exceeds 70%\n- Response quality degrades as conversations extend\n- Costs increase due to long contexts\n- Latency increases with conversation length\n\nWhat to apply:\n- Tool outputs dominate: observation masking\n- Retrieved documents dominate: summarization or partitioning\n- Message history dominates: compaction with summarization\n- Multiple components: combine strategies\n\n### Performance Considerations\n\nCompaction should achieve 50-70% token reduction with less than 5% quality degradation. Masking should achieve 60-80% reduction in masked observations. Cache optimization should achieve 70%+ hit rate for stable workloads.\n\nMonitor and iterate on optimization strategies based on measured effectiveness.\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Compaction Trigger**\n```python\nif context_tokens / context_limit > 0.8:\n    context = compact_context(context)\n```\n\n**Example 2: Observation Masking**\n```python\nif len(observation) > max_length:\n    ref_id = store_observation(observation)\n    return f\"[Obs:{ref_id} elided. Key: {extract_key(observation)}]\"\n```\n\n**Example 3: Cache-Friendly Ordering**\n```python\n# Stable content first\ncontext = [system_prompt, tool_definitions]  # Cacheable\ncontext += [reused_templates]  # Reusable\ncontext += [unique_content]  # Unique\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. Measure before optimizing—know your current state\n2. Apply compaction before masking when possible\n3. Design for cache stability with consistent prompts\n4. Partition before context becomes problematic\n5. Monitor optimization effectiveness over time\n6. Balance token savings against quality preservation\n7. Test optimization at production scale\n8. Implement graceful degradation for edge cases\n\n## Integration\n\nThis skill builds on context-fundamentals and context-degradation. It connects to:\n\n- multi-agent-patterns - Partitioning as isolation\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization effectiveness\n- memory-systems - Offloading context to memory\n\n## References\n\nInternal reference:\n- [Optimization Techniques Reference](./references/optimization_techniques.md) - Detailed technical reference\n\nRelated skills in this collection:\n- context-fundamentals - Context basics\n- context-degradation - Understanding when to optimize\n- evaluation - Measuring optimization\n\nExternal resources:\n- Research on context window limitations\n- KV-cache optimization techniques\n- Production engineering guides\n\n---\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n**Created**: 2025-12-20\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-20\n**Author**: Agent Skills for Context Engineering Contributors\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:00:30.561Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Language Agents requiring strategic context window management through compaction, masking, and caching strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要通过压缩、掩蔽和缓存策略进行战略性上下文窗口管理的高级语言代理。","ja":"圧縮、マスキング、キャッシュ戦略による戦略的なコンテキストウィンドウ管理を必要とする高度な言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"압축, 마스킹 및 캐싱 전략을 통한 전략적 컨텍스트 창 관리를 필요로 하는 고급 언어 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje Avanzados que requieren gestión estratégica de la ventana de contexto a través de estrategias de compactación, enmascaramiento y caché.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Langage Avancés nécessitant une gestion stratégique de la fenêtre de contexte via des stratégies de compactage, de masquage et de mise en cache.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche Sprachagenten, die eine strategische Kontextfensterverwaltung durch Kompaktierungs-, Maskierungs- und Cachestrategien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem Avançados que requerem gerenciamento estratégico de janela de contexto por meio de compactação, mascaramento e estratégias de cache.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых языковых агентов, требующих стратегического управления контекстным окном посредством компактации, маскирования и кэширования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل لغة متقدمة تتطلب إدارة نافذة سياق استراتيجية من خلال استراتيجيات الضغط والتخفي والذاكرة المؤقتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend effective context capacity using techniques like compression, masking, caching, and partitioning, effectively doubling or tripling the usable context window through strategic optimization, leveraging libraries and protocols for enhanced performance.","zh":"通过压缩、掩蔽、缓存和分区等技术，使代理能够扩展有效的上下文容量，通过战略优化有效将可用上下文窗口扩大一倍或两倍，并利用库和协议来提升性能。","ja":"圧縮、マスキング、キャッシュ、パーティショニングなどの技術を使用して効果的なコンテキスト容量を拡張し、戦略的最適化により使用可能なコンテキストウィンドウを実質的に2倍または3倍にし、ライブラリとプロトコルを活用してパフォーマンスを向上させます。","ko":"압축, 마스킹, 캐싱 및 분할과 같은 기술을 사용하여 에이전트가 효과적인 컨텍스트 용량을 확장할 수 있도록 지원하며, 전략적 최적화를 통해 사용 가능한 컨텍스트 창을 효과적으로 두 배 또는 세 배로 늘리고, 향상된 성능을 위해 라이브러리와 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ampliar la capacidad de contexto efectiva utilizando técnicas como la compresión, el enmascaramiento, la caché y la partición, duplicando o triplicando efectivamente la ventana de contexto utilizable a través de la optimización estratégica, aprovechando bibliotecas y protocolos para un rendimiento mejorado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre la capacité de contexte effective en utilisant des techniques telles que la compression, le masquage, la mise en cache et le partitionnement, doublant ou triplant efficacement la fenêtre de contexte utilisable grâce à l''optimisation stratégique, en exploitant les bibliothèques et les protocoles pour améliorer les performances.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die effektive Kontextkapazität durch Techniken wie Komprimierung, Maskierung, Caching und Partitionierung zu erweitern, indem sie die nutzbare Kontextfenster durch strategische Optimierung effektiv verdoppeln oder verdreifachen, indem sie Bibliotheken und Protokolle für eine verbesserte Leistung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a capacidade de contexto eficaz usando técnicas como compressão, mascaramento, cache e partições, efetivamente dobrando ou triplicando a janela de contexto usável por meio de otimização estratégica, aproveitando bibliotecas e protocolos para desempenho aprimorado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расширить эффективную емкость контекста с помощью техник сжатия, маскирования, кэширования и разделения, эффективно удваивая или утраивая используемое контекстное окно посредством стратегической оптимизации, используя библиотеки и протоколы для повышения производительности.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل تمديد السعة الفعالة للسياق باستخدام تقنيات مثل الضغط والتخفي والذاكرة المؤقتة والتقسيم، وزيادة نافذة السياق القابلة للاستخدام بشكل فعال倍 أو ثلاثة مرات من خلال التحسين الاستراتيجي، واستخدام المكتبات والبروتوكولات لأداء محسن."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying compaction strategies to reduce context size","Implementing masking techniques to focus on relevant context","Utilizing caching to improve response times in limited context windows"],"zh":["应用压缩策略以减少上下文大小","实施掩蔽技术以专注于相关上下文","利用缓存来提高有限上下文窗口中的响应速度"],"ja":["コンテキストサイズを削減するための圧縮戦略の適用","関連するコンテキストに焦点を当てるためのマスキング技術の実装","限られたコンテキストウィンドウでの応答時間を改善するためのキャッシュの利用"],"ko":["컨텍스트 크기를 줄이기 위한 압축 전략 적용","관련 컨텍스트에 초점을 맞추기 위한 마스킹 기술 구현","제한된 컨텍스트 창에서 응답 시간을 개선하기 위한 캐싱 활용"],"es":["Aplicar estrategias de compactación para reducir el tamaño del contexto","Implementar técnicas de enmascaramiento para centrarse en el contexto relevante","Utilizar la caché para mejorar los tiempos de respuesta en ventanas de contexto limitadas"],"fr":["Appliquer des stratégies de compactage pour réduire la taille du contexte","Mettre en œuvre des techniques de masquage pour se concentrer sur le contexte pertinent","Utiliser la mise en cache pour améliorer les temps de réponse dans les fenêtres de contexte limitées"],"de":["Kompaktierungsstrategien anwenden, um die Kontextgröße zu reduzieren","Maskierungstechniken implementieren, um sich auf den relevanten Kontext zu konzentrieren","Caching nutzen, um die Antwortzeiten in begrenzten Kontextfenstern zu verbessern"],"pt":["Aplicar estratégias de compactação para reduzir o tamanho do contexto","Implementar técnicas de mascaramento para se concentrar no contexto relevante","Utilizar cache para melhorar os tempos de resposta em janelas de contexto limitadas"],"ru":["Применять стратегии компактации для уменьшения размера контекста","Реализовывать техники маскирования для фокусировки на релевантном контексте","Использовать кэш для улучшения времени ответа в ограниченных контекстных окнах"],"ar":["تطبيق استراتيجيات الضغط لتقليل حجم السياق","تنفيذ تقنيات التخفي للتركيز على السياق ذي الصلة","استخدام الذاكرة المؤقتة لتحسين أوقات الاستجابة في نوافذ سياق محدودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to available context window capacity","Requires strategic application of optimization techniques"],"zh":["受限于可用上下文窗口容量","需要战略性地应用优化技术"],"ja":["利用可能なコンテキストウィンドウ容量に限定される","最適化技術の戦略的な適用が必要"],"ko":["사용 가능한 컨텍스트 창 용량으로 제한됨","최적화 기술의 전략적 적용이 필요함"],"es":["Limitado a la capacidad de la ventana de contexto disponible","Requiere una aplicación estratégica de técnicas de optimización"],"fr":["Limité à la capacité de la fenêtre de contexte disponible","Nécessite une application stratégique de techniques d''optimisation"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die verfügbare Kontextfensterkapazität","Erfordert eine strategische Anwendung von Optimierungstechniken"],"pt":["Limitado à capacidade da janela de contexto disponível","Exige aplicação estratégica de técnicas de otimização"],"ru":["Ограничен доступной емкостью контекстного окна","Требует стратегического применения техник оптимизации"],"ar":["محدود بالسعة المتاحة لنافذة السياق","يتطلب تطبيق استراتيجي لتقنيات التحسين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('LiamVDB1/opencode-config/frontend-patterns', 'community', 'LiamVDB1', 'opencode-config', 'LiamVDB1/opencode-config', 'frontend-patterns', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z', '2026-02-18T09:00:16.451Z', NULL, '{"id":"LiamVDB1/opencode-config/frontend-patterns","name":"frontend-patterns","description":{"zh":"现代前端开发模式，用于构建高性能的 React 和 Next.js 应用","ja":"最新のフロントエンド開発パターンを使用して、高パフォーマンスの React と Next.js アプリケーションを構築します","ko":"최신 프론트엔드 개발 패턴을 사용하여 고성능의 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션을 구축합니다","es":"Patrones de frontend para mejorar el rendimiento y la experiencia del usuario en aplicaciones React y Next.js","fr":"Modèles de développement frontend pour améliorer les performances et l''expérience utilisateur dans les applications React et Next.js","de":"Frontend-Entwicklungsmuster für die Verbesserung der Leistung und Benutzererfahrung in React- und Next.js-Anwendungen","pt":"Padrões de frontend para React, Next.js e interfaces de usuário performáticas. Aprenda a melhorar a eficiência e a escalabilidade dos seus projetos.","ru":"Фронтенд-шаблоны для React, Next.js и производительных пользовательских интерфейсов. Узнайте, как улучшить эффективность и масштабируемость своих проектов.","ar":"نماط الجبهة الأمامية لري액ت ونيكست.جس وواجهات المستخدم عالية الأداء. تعلم كيف تحسن الكفاءة وال قابلية للتوسع لمشاريعك.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"前端开发模式 - React 和 Next.js 性能优化","ja":"フロントエンド開発パターン - React と Next.js のパフォーマンス最適化","ko":"프론트엔드 개발 패턴 - React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화","es":"Patrones de frontend para React y Next.js","fr":"Modèles de développement frontend pour React et Next.js","de":"Frontend-Entwicklungsmuster für React und Next.js","pt":"Padrões de Frontend para React e Next.js","ru":"Фронтенд-шаблоны для React и Next.js","ar":"نماط الجبهة الأمامية لري액ت ونيكست.جس","en":"frontend-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"现代前端开发模式，用于构建高性能的 React 和 Next.js 应用","ja":"最新のフロントエンド開発パターンを使用して、高パフォーマンスの React と Next.js アプリケーションを構築します","ko":"최신 프론트엔드 개발 패턴을 사용하여 고성능의 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션을 구축합니다","es":"Patrones de frontend para mejorar el rendimiento y la experiencia del usuario en aplicaciones React y Next.js","fr":"Modèles de développement frontend pour améliorer les performances et l''expérience utilisateur dans les applications React et Next.js","de":"Frontend-Entwicklungsmuster für die Verbesserung der Leistung und Benutzererfahrung in React- und Next.js-Anwendungen","pt":"Padrões de frontend para React, Next.js e interfaces de usuário performáticas. Aprenda a melhorar a eficiência e a escalabilidade dos seus projetos.","ru":"Фронтенд-шаблоны для React, Next.js и производительных пользовательских интерфейсов. Узнайте, как улучшить эффективность и масштабируемость своих проектов.","ar":"نماط الجبهة الأمامية لري액ت ونيكست.جس وواجهات المستخدم عالية الأداء. تعلم كيف تحسن الكفاءة وال قابلية للتوسع لمشاريعك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["React 组件构建","状态管理","数据获取和缓存","性能优化","表单处理和验证"],"ja":["React コンポーネントの構築","ステート管理","データ取得とキャッシュ","パフォーマンス最適化","フォームの処理と検証"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트 구축","상태 관리","데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱","성능 최적화","폼 처리 및 유효성 검사"],"es":["Patrones de composición de componentes","Gestión de estado con useState y useReducer","Implementación de fetching de datos con SWR y React Query","Optimización de rendimiento con memoización y virtualización","Trabajo con formularios y validación con Zod schemas"],"fr":["Modèles de composition de composants","Gestion de l''état avec useState et useReducer","Implémentation du fetching de données avec SWR et React Query","Optimisation des performances avec la mémoisation et la virtualisation","Travail avec des formulaires et validation avec Zod schemas"],"de":["Muster für die Komposition von Komponenten","Zustandsverwaltung mit useState und useReducer","Implementierung des Datenabholens mit SWR und React Query","Leistungsoptimierung mit Memoisierung und Virtualisierung","Arbeit mit Formularen und Validierung mit Zod-Schemas"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de componentes React","Gerenciamento de estado com useState e useReducer","Implementação de busca de dados com SWR e React Query","Otimização de desempenho com memoização e virtualização","Trabalho com formulários e validação"],"ru":["Разработка компонентов React","Управление состоянием с помощью useState и useReducer","Реализация запросов данных с помощью SWR и React Query","Оптимизация производительности с помощью мемоизации и виртуализации","Работа с формами и валидацией"],"ar":["تطوير مكونات ري액ت","إدارة الحالة باستخدام useState و useReducer","تنفيذ استعلام البيانات باستخدام SWR و React Query","تحسين الأداء باستخدام التخزين المؤقت والتحسين","العمل مع النماذج والتحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端开发模式","React","Next.js","性能优化","状态管理","数据获取","表单处理"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発パターン","React","Next.js","パフォーマンス最適化","ステート管理","データ取得","フォームの処理"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 패턴","React","Next.js","성능 최적화","상태 관리","데이터 가져오기","폼 처리"],"es":["patrones de frontend","desarrollo frontend","React","Next.js","rendimiento","experiencia del usuario","composición de componentes","gestión de estado"],"fr":["modèles de développement frontend","développement frontend","React","Next.js","performances","expérience utilisateur","composition de composants","gestion de l''état"],"de":["Frontend-Entwicklungsmuster","Frontend-Entwicklung","React","Next.js","Leistung","Benutzererfahrung","Komposition von Komponenten","Zustandsverwaltung"],"pt":["padrões de frontend","react","next.js","desenvolvimento de componentes","gerenciamento de estado","busca de dados","otimização de desempenho","formulários e validação"],"ru":["фронтенд-шаблоны","react","next.js","разработка компонентов","управление состоянием","запросы данных","оптимизация производительности","формы и валидация"],"ar":["نماط الجبهة الأمامية","ري액ت","نيكست.جس","تطوير المكونات","إدارة الحالة","استعلام البيانات","تحسين الأداء","النماذج والتحقق"]}},"owner":"LiamVDB1","repo":"opencode-config","repoPath":"LiamVDB1/opencode-config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.472Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-patterns","description":"Frontend development patterns for React, Next.js, state management, performance optimization, and UI best practices.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Development Patterns\n\nModern frontend patterns for React, Next.js, and performant user interfaces.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building React components (composition, props, rendering)\n- Managing state (useState, useReducer, Zustand, Context)\n- Implementing data fetching (SWR, React Query, server components)\n- Optimizing performance (memoization, virtualization, code splitting)\n- Working with forms (validation, controlled inputs, Zod schemas)\n- Handling client-side routing and navigation","body":"# Frontend Development Patterns\n\nModern frontend patterns for React, Next.js, and performant user interfaces.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building React components (composition, props, rendering)\n- Managing state (useState, useReducer, Zustand, Context)\n- Implementing data fetching (SWR, React Query, server components)\n- Optimizing performance (memoization, virtualization, code splitting)\n- Working with forms (validation, controlled inputs, Zod schemas)\n- Handling client-side routing and navigation\n- Building accessible, responsive UI patterns\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Composition Over Inheritance\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Component composition\ninterface CardProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  variant?: ''default'' | ''outlined''\n}\n\nexport function Card({ children, variant = ''default'' }: CardProps) {\n  return <div className={`card card-${variant}`}>{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardHeader({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"card-header\">{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function CardBody({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"card-body\">{children}</div>\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Card>\n  <CardHeader>Title</CardHeader>\n  <CardBody>Content</CardBody>\n</Card>\n```\n\n### Compound Components\n\n```typescript\ninterface TabsContextValue {\n  activeTab: string\n  setActiveTab: (tab: string) => void\n}\n\nconst TabsContext = createContext<TabsContextValue | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function Tabs({ children, defaultTab }: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  defaultTab: string\n}) {\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState(defaultTab)\n\n  return (\n    <TabsContext.Provider value={{ activeTab, setActiveTab }}>\n      {children}\n    </TabsContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function TabList({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <div className=\"tab-list\">{children}</div>\n}\n\nexport function Tab({ id, children }: { id: string, children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const context = useContext(TabsContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''Tab must be used within Tabs'')\n\n  return (\n    <button\n      className={context.activeTab === id ? ''active'' : ''''}\n      onClick={() => context.setActiveTab(id)}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </button>\n  )\n}\n\n// Usage\n<Tabs defaultTab=\"overview\">\n  <TabList>\n    <Tab id=\"overview\">Overview</Tab>\n    <Tab id=\"details\">Details</Tab>\n  </TabList>\n</Tabs>\n```\n\n### Render Props Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface DataLoaderProps<T> {\n  url: string\n  children: (data: T | null, loading: boolean, error: Error | null) => React.ReactNode\n}\n\nexport function DataLoader<T>({ url, children }: DataLoaderProps<T>) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T | null>(null)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true)\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    fetch(url)\n      .then(res => res.json())\n      .then(setData)\n      .catch(setError)\n      .finally(() => setLoading(false))\n  }, [url])\n\n  return <>{children(data, loading, error)}</>\n}\n\n// Usage\n<DataLoader<Market[]> url=\"/api/markets\">\n  {(markets, loading, error) => {\n    if (loading) return <Spinner />\n    if (error) return <Error error={error} />\n    return <MarketList markets={markets!} />\n  }}\n</DataLoader>\n```\n\n## Custom Hooks Patterns\n\n### State Management Hook\n\n```typescript\nexport function useToggle(initialValue = false): [boolean, () => void] {\n  const [value, setValue] = useState(initialValue)\n\n  const toggle = useCallback(() => {\n    setValue(v => !v)\n  }, [])\n\n  return [value, toggle]\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst [isOpen, toggleOpen] = useToggle()\n```\n\n### Async Data Fetching Hook\n\n```typescript\ninterface UseQueryOptions<T> {\n  onSuccess?: (data: T) => void\n  onError?: (error: Error) => void\n  enabled?: boolean\n}\n\nexport function useQuery<T>(\n  key: string,\n  fetcher: () => Promise<T>,\n  options?: UseQueryOptions<T>\n) {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<T | null>(null)\n  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false)\n\n  const refetch = useCallback(async () => {\n    setLoading(true)\n    setError(null)\n\n    try {\n      const result = await fetcher()\n      setData(result)\n      options?.onSuccess?.(result)\n    } catch (err) {\n      const error = err as Error\n      setError(error)\n      options?.onError?.(error)\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false)\n    }\n  }, [fetcher, options])\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (options?.enabled !== false) {\n      refetch()\n    }\n  }, [key, refetch, options?.enabled])\n\n  return { data, error, loading, refetch }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst { data: markets, loading, error, refetch } = useQuery(\n  ''markets'',\n  () => fetch(''/api/markets'').then(r => r.json()),\n  {\n    onSuccess: data => console.log(''Fetched'', data.length, ''markets''),\n    onError: err => console.error(''Failed:'', err)\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### Debounce Hook\n\n```typescript\nexport function useDebounce<T>(value: T, delay: number): T {\n  const [debouncedValue, setDebouncedValue] = useState<T>(value)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handler = setTimeout(() => {\n      setDebouncedValue(value)\n    }, delay)\n\n    return () => clearTimeout(handler)\n  }, [value, delay])\n\n  return debouncedValue\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState('''')\nconst debouncedQuery = useDebounce(searchQuery, 500)\n\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (debouncedQuery) {\n    performSearch(debouncedQuery)\n  }\n}, [debouncedQuery])\n```\n\n## State Management Patterns\n\n### Context + Reducer Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface State {\n  markets: Market[]\n  selectedMarket: Market | null\n  loading: boolean\n}\n\ntype Action =\n  | { type: ''SET_MARKETS''; payload: Market[] }\n  | { type: ''SELECT_MARKET''; payload: Market }\n  | { type: ''SET_LOADING''; payload: boolean }\n\nfunction reducer(state: State, action: Action): State {\n  switch (action.type) {\n    case ''SET_MARKETS'':\n      return { ...state, markets: action.payload }\n    case ''SELECT_MARKET'':\n      return { ...state, selectedMarket: action.payload }\n    case ''SET_LOADING'':\n      return { ...state, loading: action.payload }\n    default:\n      return state\n  }\n}\n\nconst MarketContext = createContext<{\n  state: State\n  dispatch: Dispatch<Action>\n} | undefined>(undefined)\n\nexport function MarketProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const [state, dispatch] = useReducer(reducer, {\n    markets: [],\n    selectedMarket: null,\n    loading: false\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <MarketContext.Provider value={{ state, dispatch }}>\n      {children}\n    </MarketContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport function useMarkets() {\n  const context = useContext(MarketContext)\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''useMarkets must be used within MarketProvider'')\n  return context\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Memoization\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ useMemo for expensive computations\nconst sortedMarkets = useMemo(() => {\n  return markets.sort((a, b) => b.volume - a.volume)\n}, [markets])\n\n// ✅ useCallback for functions passed to children\nconst handleSearch = useCallback((query: string) => {\n  setSearchQuery(query)\n}, [])\n\n// ✅ React.memo for pure components\nexport const MarketCard = React.memo<MarketCardProps>(({ market }) => {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"market-card\">\n      <h3>{market.name}</h3>\n      <p>{market.description}</p>\n    </div>\n  )\n})\n```\n\n### Code Splitting & Lazy Loading\n\n```typescript\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from ''react''\n\n// ✅ Lazy load heavy components\nconst HeavyChart = lazy(() => import(''./HeavyChart''))\nconst ThreeJsBackground = lazy(() => import(''./ThreeJsBackground''))\n\nexport function Dashboard() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Suspense fallback={<ChartSkeleton />}>\n        <HeavyChart data={data} />\n      </Suspense>\n\n      <Suspense fallback={null}>\n        <ThreeJsBackground />\n      </Suspense>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Virtualization for Long Lists\n\n```typescript\nimport { useVirtualizer } from ''@tanstack/react-virtual''\n\nexport function VirtualMarketList({ markets }: { markets: Market[] }) {\n  const parentRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null)\n\n  const virtualizer = useVirtualizer({\n    count: markets.length,\n    getScrollElement: () => parentRef.current,\n    estimateSize: () => 100,  // Estimated row height\n    overscan: 5  // Extra items to render\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={parentRef} style={{ height: ''600px'', overflow: ''auto'' }}>\n      <div\n        style={{\n          height: `${virtualizer.getTotalSize()}px`,\n          position: ''relative''\n        }}\n      >\n        {virtualizer.getVirtualItems().map(virtualRow => (\n          <div\n            key={virtualRow.index}\n            style={{\n              position: ''absolute'',\n              top: 0,\n              left: 0,\n              width: ''100%'',\n              height: `${virtualRow.size}px`,\n              transform: `translateY(${virtualRow.start}px)`\n            }}\n          >\n            <MarketCard market={markets[virtualRow.index]} />\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Form Handling Patterns\n\n### Controlled Form with Validation\n\n```typescript\ninterface FormData {\n  name: string\n  description: string\n  endDate: string\n}\n\ninterface FormErrors {\n  name?: string\n  description?: string\n  endDate?: string\n}\n\nexport function CreateMarketForm() {\n  const [formData, setFormData] = useState<FormData>({\n    name: '''',\n    description: '''',\n    endDate: ''''\n  })\n\n  const [errors, setErrors] = useState<FormErrors>({})\n\n  const validate = (): boolean => {\n    const newErrors: FormErrors = {}\n\n    if (!formData.name.trim()) {\n      newErrors.name = ''Name is required''\n    } else if (formData.name.length > 200) {\n      newErrors.name = ''Name must be under 200 characters''\n    }\n\n    if (!formData.description.trim()) {\n      newErrors.description = ''Description is required''\n    }\n\n    if (!formData.endDate) {\n      newErrors.endDate = ''End date is required''\n    }\n\n    setErrors(newErrors)\n    return Object.keys(newErrors).length === 0\n  }\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {\n    e.preventDefault()\n\n    if (!validate()) return\n\n    try {\n      await createMarket(formData)\n      // Success handling\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Error handling\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n      <input\n        value={formData.name}\n        onChange={e => setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, name: e.target.value }))}\n        placeholder=\"Market name\"\n      />\n      {errors.name && <span className=\"error\">{errors.name}</span>}\n\n      {/* Other fields */}\n\n      <button type=\"submit\">Create Market</button>\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Error Boundary Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninterface ErrorBoundaryState {\n  hasError: boolean\n  error: Error | null\n}\n\nexport class ErrorBoundary extends React.Component<\n  { children: React.ReactNode },\n  ErrorBoundaryState\n> {\n  state: ErrorBoundaryState = {\n    hasError: false,\n    error: null\n  }\n\n  static getDerivedStateFromError(error: Error): ErrorBoundaryState {\n    return { hasError: true, error }\n  }\n\n  componentDidCatch(error: Error, errorInfo: React.ErrorInfo) {\n    console.error(''Error boundary caught:'', error, errorInfo)\n  }\n\n  render() {\n    if (this.state.hasError) {\n      return (\n        <div className=\"error-fallback\">\n          <h2>Something went wrong</h2>\n          <p>{this.state.error?.message}</p>\n          <button onClick={() => this.setState({ hasError: false })}>\n            Try again\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      )\n    }\n\n    return this.props.children\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\n<ErrorBoundary>\n  <App />\n</ErrorBoundary>\n```\n\n## Animation Patterns\n\n### Framer Motion Animations\n\n```typescript\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from ''framer-motion''\n\n// ✅ List animations\nexport function AnimatedMarketList({ markets }: { markets: Market[] }) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {markets.map(market => (\n        <motion.div\n          key={market.id}\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}\n          animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n          exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}\n        >\n          <MarketCard market={market} />\n        </motion.div>\n      ))}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  )\n}\n\n// ✅ Modal animations\nexport function Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }: ModalProps) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {isOpen && (\n        <>\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"modal-overlay\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            onClick={onClose}\n          />\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"modal-content\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 20 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1, y: 0 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 20 }}\n          >\n            {children}\n          </motion.div>\n        </>\n      )}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Accessibility Patterns\n\n### Keyboard Navigation\n\n```typescript\nexport function Dropdown({ options, onSelect }: DropdownProps) {\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false)\n  const [activeIndex, setActiveIndex] = useState(0)\n\n  const handleKeyDown = (e: React.KeyboardEvent) => {\n    switch (e.key) {\n      case ''ArrowDown'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        setActiveIndex(i => Math.min(i + 1, options.length - 1))\n        break\n      case ''ArrowUp'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        setActiveIndex(i => Math.max(i - 1, 0))\n        break\n      case ''Enter'':\n        e.preventDefault()\n        onSelect(options[activeIndex])\n        setIsOpen(false)\n        break\n      case ''Escape'':\n        setIsOpen(false)\n        break\n    }\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      role=\"combobox\"\n      aria-expanded={isOpen}\n      aria-haspopup=\"listbox\"\n      onKeyDown={handleKeyDown}\n    >\n      {/* Dropdown implementation */}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Focus Management\n\n```typescript\nexport function Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }: ModalProps) {\n  const modalRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null)\n  const previousFocusRef = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null)\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (isOpen) {\n      // Save currently focused element\n      previousFocusRef.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement\n\n      // Focus modal\n      modalRef.current?.focus()\n    } else {\n      // Restore focus when closing\n      previousFocusRef.current?.focus()\n    }\n  }, [isOpen])\n\n  return isOpen ? (\n    <div\n      ref={modalRef}\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      tabIndex={-1}\n      onKeyDown={e => e.key === ''Escape'' && onClose()}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </div>\n  ) : null\n}\n```\n\n**Remember**: Modern frontend patterns enable maintainable, performant user interfaces. Choose patterns that fit your project complexity.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:00:16.451Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing expertise in modern React and Next.js development patterns","zh":"非常适合需要现代 React 和 Next.js 开发模式专业知识的全栈代理","ja":"モダンな React と Next.js の開発パターンに精通しているフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"최근의 React와 Next.js 개발 패턴에 전문 지식이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan experiencia en patrones de desarrollo de React y Next.js modernos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui ont besoin d''expertise dans les modèles de développement React et Next.js modernes","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die Expertenwissen in modernen React- und Next.js-Entwicklungsmustern benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de especialização em padrões de desenvolvimento modernos do React e Next.js","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full Stack, которым необходимы знания в области современных шаблонов разработки React и Next.js","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى الخبرة في أنماط التطوير الحديثة ل React و Next.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize frontend performance using memoization, virtualization, and code splitting, while leveraging libraries like SWR and React Query for seamless data fetching and state management with useState, useReducer, and Zustand","zh":"赋予代理商使用记忆化、虚拟化和代码拆分来优化前端性能的能力，同时利用像 SWR 和 React Query 的库来实现无缝的数据获取和使用 useState、useReducer 和 Zustand 的状态管理","ja":"メモ化、仮想化、コード分割を使用してフロントエンドのパフォーマンスを最適化し、SWRやReact Queryなどのライブラリを使用してuseState、useReducer、Zustandなどの状態管理をシームレスに実行するためのエージェントの能力を付与","ko":"메모화, 가상화, 코드 분할 등을 사용하여 프론트엔드 성능을 최적화하고, SWR, React Query 등의 라이브러리를 사용하여 useState, useReducer, Zustand 등의 상태 관리를 무결하게 수행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el rendimiento del frontend utilizando memoización, virtualización y división de código, mientras aprovecha bibliotecas como SWR y React Query para una obtención y administración de datos y estados sin problemas con useState, useReducer y Zustand","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances du frontend en utilisant la mémoisation, la virtualisation et le fractionnement de code, tout en exploitant des bibliothèques comme SWR et React Query pour une récupération et une gestion de données et d''états sans problème avec useState, useReducer et Zustand","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Frontend-Leistung zu optimieren, indem sie Memoisierung, Virtualisierung und Code-Splitting verwenden, während sie Bibliotheken wie SWR und React Query für eine nahtlose Datenabfrage und Zustandsverwaltung mit useState, useReducer und Zustand nutzen","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem o desempenho do frontend usando memoização, virtualização e divisão de código, aproveitando bibliotecas como SWR e React Query para busca e gerenciamento de estado sem problemas com useState, useReducer e Zustand","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать производительность frontend с помощью мемоизации, виртуализации и разделения кода, используя библиотеки seperti SWR и React Query для безпроблемной загрузки данных и управления состоянием с useState, useReducer и Zustand","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تحسين أداء الواجهة الأمامية باستخدام التخزين المؤقت، والتحويل الافتراضي، وقسمة الشفرة، واستخدام المكتبات مثل SWR و React Query للتحميل السلس للبيانات وإدارة الحالة مع useState، useReducer و Zustand"},"useCases":{"en":["Building performant React components with composition and props","Implementing efficient data fetching with React Query and server components","Optimizing form handling with validation and controlled inputs using Zod schemas"],"zh":["使用组合和属性构建高性能的 React 组件","使用 React Query 和服务器组件实现高效的数据获取","使用 Zod 模式的验证和受控输入来优化表单处理"],"ja":["コンポジションとプロップを使用してパフォーマンスの高い React コンポーネントを構築する","React Query とサーバーコンポーネントを使用して効率的なデータ取得を実装する","Zod スキーマを使用したバリデーションと制御された入力を使用してフォームの処理を最適化する"],"ko":["구성과 속성을 사용하여 고성능의 리액트 컴포넌트를 구축","리액트 쿼리와 서버 컴포넌트를 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 구현","Zod 스키마를 사용한 유효성 검사와 제어된 입력을 사용하여 폼 처리 최적화"],"es":["Crear componentes React de alto rendimiento con composición y props","Implementar una obtención de datos eficiente con React Query y componentes de servidor","Optimizar el manejo de formularios con validación y entradas controladas utilizando esquemas Zod"],"fr":["Créer des composants React performants avec composition et props","Mettre en œuvre une récupération de données efficace avec React Query et des composants serveur","Optimiser la gestion des formulaires avec validation et entrées contrôlées en utilisant des schémas Zod"],"de":["Erstellen von leistungsstarken React-Komponenten mit Komposition und Props","Effiziente Datenabfrage mit React Query und Serverkomponenten implementieren","Optimieren der Formularverarbeitung mit Validierung und gesteuerten Eingaben unter Verwendung von Zod-Schemata"],"pt":["Construir componentes React performáticos com composição e props","Implementar busca de dados eficiente com React Query e componentes do servidor","Otimizar tratamento de formulários com validação e entradas controladas usando esquemas Zod"],"ru":["Создание высокопроизводительных компонентов React с помощью композиции и props","Реализация эффективной загрузки данных с помощью React Query и компонентов сервера","Оптимизация обработки форм с помощью валидации и контролируемых входных данных с использованием схем Zod"],"ar":["بناء مكونات React عالية الأداء باستخدام التكوين والخصائص","تنفيذ تحميل البيانات الفعال باستخدام React Query ومكونات الخادم","تحسين معالجة النماذج باستخدام التحقق والمدخلات المسيطرة باستخدام مخططات Zod"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js ecosystems","Focused on client-side routing and navigation"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Next.js 生态系统的知识","专注于客户端路由和导航"],"ja":["React と Next.js のエコシステムの知識が必要","クライアントサイドのルーティングとナビゲーションに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["리액트와 넥스트 자스의 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요","클라이언트 측 라우팅과 탐색에 중점을 두고 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas React y Next.js","Se centra en la routificación y navegación del lado del cliente"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur les écosystèmes React et Next.js","Se concentre sur la routage et la navigation côté client"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React- und Next.js-Ökosysteme","Konzentriert sich auf Client-Seitige Routenfindung und Navigation"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos ecossistemas React e Next.js","Focado em roteamento e navegação do lado do cliente"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем React и Next.js","Сосредоточен на клиентской маршрутизации и навигации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بيئات React و Next.js","مركز على التوجيه والتسجيل على جانب العميل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
