presentaciones de PowerPoint de manera programática. Agrega diapositivas, títulos y contenido con facilidad","fr":"La bibliothèque python-pptx permet de créer des présentations PowerPoint de manière programmatique. Ajoutez des diapositives, des titres et du contenu avec f...","de":"Die Bibliothek python-pptx ermöglicht die Erstellung von PowerPoint-Präsentationen in programmatischer Weise. Fügen Sie Folien, Titel und Inhalt leicht hinzu","pt":"A biblioteca python-pptx permite criar apresentações personalizadas com Python. Crie slides com títulos, subtítulos e conteúdo.","ru":"Библиотека python-pptx позволяет создавать индивидуальные презентации с помощью Python. Создайте слайды с заголовками, подзаголовками и содержанием.","ar":"سماح مكتبة python-pptx بإنشاء عروض تقديمية مخصصة باستخدام Python. أنشئ شرائح بعناوين و عناوين فرعية و محتوى.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["PPTX","Python","PPTX","pptx","Inches Pt"],"ja":["PPTX","Python","PPTX","pptx","Inches Pt"],"ko":["PPTX","Python","PPTX","pptx","Inches Pt"],"es":["Creación de presentaciones de PowerPoint","Adición de diapositivas y títulos","Inserción de contenido en diapositivas","Manipulación de presentaciones existentes","Compatibilidad con diferentes versiones de PowerPoint"],"fr":["Création de présentations PowerPoint","Ajout de diapositives et de titres","Insertion de contenu dans des diapositives","Manipulation de présentations existantes","Compatibilité avec différentes versions de PowerPoint"],"de":["Erstellung von PowerPoint-Präsentationen","Hinzufügen von Folien und Titeln","Einfügen von Inhalt in Folien","Manipulation von bestehenden Präsentationen","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen PowerPoint-Versionen"],"pt":["Criação de apresentações personalizadas","Adição de títulos e subtítulos","Inserção de conteúdo","Customização de layouts","Suporte ao formato PPTX"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных презентаций","Добавление заголовков и подзаголовков","Вставка содержания","Настройка макетов","Поддержка формата PPTX"],"ar":["إنشاء عروض تقديمية مخصصة","إضافة عناوين و عناوين فرعية","إدراج المحتوى","تخصيص تصاميم","دعم الصيغة PPTX"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PPTX","Python PPTX","pptx","PPTX","Python","Inches Pt"],"ja":["PPTX","Python PPTX","pptx","PPTX","Python","Inches Pt"],"ko":["PPTX","Python PPTX","pptx","PPTX","Python","Inches Pt"],"es":["python-pptx","PowerPoint","presentaciones","diapositivas","títulos","contenido","manipulación de presentaciones","biblioteca python"],"fr":["python-pptx","PowerPoint","présentations","diapositives","titres","contenu","manipulation de présentations","bibliothèque python"],"de":["python-pptx","PowerPoint","Präsentationen","Folien","Titel","Inhalt","Manipulation von Präsentationen","Python-Bibliothek"],"pt":["python-pptx","apresentações","PPTX","Python","desenvolvimento","slides","títulos","subtítulos"],"ru":["python-pptx","презентации","PPTX","Python","разработка","слайды","заголовки","подзаголовки"],"ar":["python-pptx","عروض تقديمية","PPTX","Python","تطوير","شرائح","عناوين","عناوين فرعية"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pptx","description":"Presentation creation, editing, and analysis. When Claude needs to work with presentations (.pptx files) for creating new presentations, modifying content, working with layouts, adding speaker notes, or any presentation tasks.","bodyPreview":"# PowerPoint Processing\n\n## Creating Presentations (Python)\n\n```python\nfrom pptx import Presentation\nfrom pptx.util import Inches, Pt\n\nprs = Presentation()\n\n# Add title slide\ntitle_slide_layout = prs.slide_layouts[0]\nslide = prs.slides.add_slide(title_slide_layout)\ntitle = slide.shapes.title\nsubtitle = slide.placeholders[1]\ntitle.text = \"Hello, World!\"\nsubtitle.text = \"python-pptx demo\"\n\n# Add content slide\nbullet_slide_layout = prs.slide_layouts[1]\nslide = prs.slides.add_slide(bullet_slide_layo","body":"# PowerPoint Processing\n\n## Creating Presentations (Python)\n\n```python\nfrom pptx import Presentation\nfrom pptx.util import Inches, Pt\n\nprs = Presentation()\n\n# Add title slide\ntitle_slide_layout = prs.slide_layouts[0]\nslide = prs.slides.add_slide(title_slide_layout)\ntitle = slide.shapes.title\nsubtitle = slide.placeholders[1]\ntitle.text = \"Hello, World!\"\nsubtitle.text = \"python-pptx demo\"\n\n# Add content slide\nbullet_slide_layout = prs.slide_layouts[1]\nslide = prs.slides.add_slide(bullet_slide_layout)\nshapes = slide.shapes\ntitle_shape = shapes.title\nbody_shape = shapes.placeholders[1]\ntitle_shape.text = \"Key Points\"\ntf = body_shape.text_frame\ntf.text = \"First bullet point\"\np = tf.add_paragraph()\np.text = \"Second bullet point\"\np.level = 1\n\nprs.save(''presentation.pptx'')\n```\n\n## Adding Images\n\n```python\nfrom pptx.util import Inches\n\nblank_layout = prs.slide_layouts[6]\nslide = prs.slides.add_slide(blank_layout)\n\nleft = Inches(1)\ntop = Inches(1)\nwidth = Inches(5)\nslide.shapes.add_picture(''image.png'', left, top, width=width)\n```\n\n## Adding Tables\n\n```python\nrows, cols = 3, 4\nleft = Inches(1)\ntop = Inches(2)\nwidth = Inches(6)\nheight = Inches(1.5)\n\ntable = slide.shapes.add_table(rows, cols, left, top, width, height).table\n\n# Set column widths\ntable.columns[0].width = Inches(2)\n\n# Add content\ntable.cell(0, 0).text = \"Header 1\"\ntable.cell(1, 0).text = \"Data 1\"\n```\n\n## Adding Charts\n\n```python\nfrom pptx.chart.data import CategoryChartData\nfrom pptx.enum.chart import XL_CHART_TYPE\n\nchart_data = CategoryChartData()\nchart_data.categories = [''East'', ''West'', ''Midwest'']\nchart_data.add_series(''Sales'', (19.2, 21.4, 16.7))\n\nx, y, cx, cy = Inches(2), Inches(2), Inches(6), Inches(4.5)\nslide.shapes.add_chart(\n    XL_CHART_TYPE.COLUMN_CLUSTERED, x, y, cx, cy, chart_data\n)\n```\n\n## Editing Existing Presentations\n\n```python\nprs = Presentation(''existing.pptx'')\n\n# Access slides\nfor slide in prs.slides:\n    for shape in slide.shapes:\n        if shape.has_text_frame:\n            print(shape.text_frame.text)\n\n# Modify text\nslide = prs.slides[0]\nslide.shapes.title.text = \"New Title\"\n\nprs.save(''modified.pptx'')\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Use slide layouts for consistency\n- Keep text minimal, use visuals\n- Use Inches() or Pt() for sizing\n- Save frequently during creation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:01:25.165Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Presentation Analysis Agents needing advanced PowerPoint document processing capabilities.","zh":"非常適合需要高級PowerPoint文檔處理能力的演示分析代理","ja":"プレゼンテーション分析エージェントが高度なPowerPointドキュメント処理能力を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 파워포인트 문서 처리 기능이 필요한 프레젠테이션 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Presentaciones que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de documentos de PowerPoint avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Présentation nécessitant des fonctionnalités de traitement de documents PowerPoint avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Präsentationsanalyseagenten, die erweiterte PowerPoint-Dokumentenverarbeitungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de análise de apresentação que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de documentos do PowerPoint.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа презентаций, которым требуются расширенные возможности обработки документов PowerPoint.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل العروض التقديمية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لمعالجة مستندات PowerPoint."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manipulate PowerPoint presentations using the python-pptx library, enabling precise control over slide layouts, shapes, and text formatting, including support for Inches and Pt units.","zh":"使代理能够使用python-pptx库创建和操作PowerPoint演示文稿，从而对幻灯片布局、形状和文本格式ting具有精确的控制，包括英寸和點單位的支持","ja":"python-pptxライブラリを使用してエージェントがPowerPointプレゼンテーションを作成および操作できるようにし、スライドレイアウト、シェイプ、テキストフォーマットに対する正確な制御を可能にし、インチおよびPt単位のサポートを含む","ko":"파이썬-pptx 라이브러리를 사용하여 에이전트가 파워포인트 프레젠테이션을 생성하고 조작할 수 있도록 하여 슬라이드 레이아웃, 모양, 텍스트 형식 지정에 대한 정확한 제어를 가능하게 하며, 인치 및 Pt 단위를 포함한 지원","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y manipular presentaciones de PowerPoint mediante la biblioteca python-pptx, lo que permite un control preciso sobre los diseños de diapositivas, formas y formato de texto, incluido el soporte para unidades de Pulgadas y Pt.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de manipuler des présentations PowerPoint à l''aide de la bibliothèque python-pptx, permettant un contrôle précis sur les dispositions de diapositives, les formes et le formatage du texte, y compris la prise en charge des unités de pouces et de points.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, PowerPoint-Präsentationen mit der Bibliothek python-pptx zu erstellen und zu manipulieren, wodurch eine präzise Kontrolle über die Folienlayouts, Formen und Textformatierung möglich ist, einschließlich der Unterstützung für Zoll- und Pt-Einheiten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e manipular apresentações do PowerPoint usando a biblioteca python-pptx, permitindo controle preciso sobre layouts de slides, formas e formatação de texto, incluindo suporte a unidades Polegadas e Pt.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и манипулировать презентациями PowerPoint с помощью библиотеки python-pptx, обеспечивая точный контроль над расположением слайдов, формами и форматированием текста, включая поддержку единиц Дюймов и Пт.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء وتعديل عروض PowerPoint باستخدام مكتبة python-pptx، مما يتيح التحكم الدقيق في تخطيط الشرائح والأشكال وتنسيق النص، بما في ذلك دعم الوحدات البولنديه و Pt."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating presentation templates with custom layouts","Automating slide content population from data sources","Creating interactive presentations with dynamic text and shapes"],"zh":["生成具有自定义布局的演示模板","从数据源自动填充幻灯片内容","创建具有动态文本和形状的交互式演示"],"ja":["カスタムレイアウトを持つプレゼンテーションテンプレートを生成する","データソースからスライドコンテンツを自動で埋める","動的テキストとシェイプを持つインタラクティブなプレゼンテーションを作成する"],"ko":["사용자 정의 레이아웃을 갖는 프레젠테이션 템플릿 생성","데이터 소스로부터 슬라이드 콘텐츠 자동 채우기","동적 텍스트 및 모양을 갖는 상호 작용 프레젠테이션 생성"],"es":["Generación de plantillas de presentación con diseños personalizados","Automatización de la población de contenido de diapositivas desde fuentes de datos","Creación de presentaciones interactivas con texto y formas dinámicos"],"fr":["Génération de modèles de présentation avec des dispositions personnalisées","Automatisation de la population de contenu de diapositives à partir de sources de données","Création de présentations interactives avec du texte et des formes dynamiques"],"de":["Erstellung von Präsentationsvorlagen mit benutzerdefinierten Layouts","Automatisierung der Beschriftung von Folieninhalten aus Datenquellen","Erstellung von interaktiven Präsentationen mit dynamischem Text und Formen"],"pt":["Geração de modelos de apresentação com layouts personalizados","Automatização da população de conteúdo de slides a partir de fontes de dados","Criação de apresentações interativas com texto e formas dinâmicas"],"ru":["Генерация шаблонов презентаций с индивидуальными макетами","Автоматизация заполнения содержимого слайдов из источников данных","Создание интерактивных презентаций с динамическим текстом и формами"],"ar":["إنشاء قوالب عرض تقديمي مع تخطيط مخصص","تأتمة ملء محتوى الشرائح من مصادر البيانات","إنشاء عروض تقديمية تفاعلية مع نص و أشكال ديناميكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x environment","Limited to PowerPoint file format (.pptx)"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x环境","仅限PowerPoint文件格式(.pptx)"],"ja":["Python 3.x環境が必要","PowerPointファイル形式(.pptx)のみ"],"ko":["파이썬 3.x 환경 필요","파워포인트 파일 형식(.pptx)만 해당"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Python 3.x","Limitado al formato de archivo PowerPoint (.pptx)"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python 3.x","Limité au format de fichier PowerPoint (.pptx)"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python 3.x-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf das PowerPoint-Dateiformat (.pptx)"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python 3.x","Limitado ao formato de arquivo do PowerPoint (.pptx)"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python 3.x","Ограничен форматом файла PowerPoint (.pptx)"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python 3.x","محدود بформات ملف PowerPoint (.pptx)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('boisenoise/skills-collections/context-compression', 'community', 'boisenoise', 'skills-collections', 'boisenoise/skills-collections', 'context-compression', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z', '2026-02-18T09:00:57.435Z', NULL, '{"id":"boisenoise/skills-collections/context-compression","name":"context-compression","description":{"zh":"上下文压缩是指优化任务完成所需的代币数量，包括重新获取成本。","ja":"コンテキスト圧縮は、タスクを完了するために必要なトークンの数を最適化することです。","ko":"컨텍스트 압축은 태스크를 완료하는 데 필요한 토큰 수를 최적화하는 것입니다.","es":"La compresión de contexto es crucial para optimizar el rendimiento de los agentes cuando se generan millones de tokens de historial de conversación. Aprende a aplicar estrategias efectivas.","fr":"La compression de contexte est cruciale pour optimiser les performances des agents lorsqu''il est généré des millions de jetons d''historique de conversation. Découvrez comment appliquer des stratégies efficaces.","de":"Die Kontextkomprimierung ist entscheidend, um die Leistung von Agenten zu optimieren, wenn Millionen von Token des Konversationsverlaufs generiert werden. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Strategien anwenden können.","pt":"A compressão de contexto é uma técnica para otimizar o desempenho dos agentes de IA, minimizando tokens e reduzindo custos.","ru":"Сжатие контекста - это техника для оптимизации производительности агентов ИИ, минимизирующая токены и снижающая затраты.","ar":"ضغط السياق هو تقنية لتحسين أداء وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي، بتقليل الرموز وتخفيض التكاليف.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"上下文压缩技术","ja":"コンテキスト圧縮","ko":"컨텍스트 압축","es":"Compresión de contexto: optimiza el rendimiento de tus ag...","fr":"Compression de contexte: améliorez les performances de vo...","de":"Kontextkomprimierung: Optimieren Sie die Leistung Ihrer A...","pt":"Compressão de Contexto: Otimização de Tokens","ru":"Сжатие контекста: стратегии оптимизации","ar":"ضغط السياق: تحسين الأداء","en":"context-compression"},"description":{"zh":"上下文压缩是指优化任务完成所需的代币数量，包括重新获取成本。","ja":"コンテキスト圧縮は、タスクを完了するために必要なトークンの数を最適化することです。","ko":"컨텍스트 압축은 태스크를 완료하는 데 필요한 토큰 수를 최적화하는 것입니다.","es":"La compresión de contexto es crucial para optimizar el rendimiento de los agentes cuando se generan millones de tokens de historial de conversación. Aprende ...","fr":"La compression de contexte est cruciale pour optimiser les performances des agents lorsqu''il est généré des millions de jetons d''historique de conversation. ...","de":"Die Kontextkomprimierung ist entscheidend, um die Leistung von Agenten zu optimieren, wenn Millionen von Token des Konversationsverlaufs generiert werden. Er...","pt":"A compressão de contexto é uma técnica para otimizar o desempenho dos agentes de IA, minimizando tokens e reduzindo custos.","ru":"Сжатие контекста - это техника для оптимизации производительности агентов ИИ, минимизирующая токены и снижающая затраты.","ar":"ضغط السياق هو تقنية لتحسين أداء وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي، بتقليل الرموز وتخفيض التكاليف.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"zh":["优化任务完成效率","减少代币数量","重新获取成本最小化","适用于大规模对话历史"],"ja":["タスクの完了効率を最適化","トークンの数を削減","再取得コストを最小化","大規模な会話履歴に適応"],"ko":["태스크 완료 효율을 최적화","토큰 수를 줄임","재取得 비용을 최소화","대규모 대화 기록에 적합"],"es":["Reducción de tokens de historial de conversación","Mejora del rendimiento de los agentes","Optimización de la recuperación de información","Reducción de costos de procesamiento","Aplicación de estrategias de compresión efectivas"],"fr":["Réduction des jetons d''historique de conversation","Amélioration des performances des agents","Optimisation de la récupération d''informations","Réduction des coûts de traitement","Application de stratégies de compression efficaces"],"de":["Reduzierung der Token des Konversationsverlaufs","Verbesserung der Leistung von Agenten","Optimierung der Wiederherstellung von Informationen","Reduzierung der Verarbeitungskosten","Anwendung von effektiven Komprimierungsstrategien"],"pt":["Otimização de tokens","Redução de custos","Melhoria do desempenho","Minimização de tokens","Flexibilidade em agentes de IA"],"ru":["Оптимизация токенов","Снижение затрат","Улучшение производительности","Минимизация токенов","Гибкость в агентах ИИ"],"ar":["تحسين الرموز","تخفيض التكاليف","تحسين الأداء","تقليل الرموز","المرونة في وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文压缩","任务优化","代币压缩","会话历史","对话效率"],"ja":["コンテキスト圧縮","タスク最適化","トークン圧縮","会話履歴","対話効率"],"ko":["컨텍스트 압축","태스크 최적화","토큰 압축","대화 기록","대화 효율"],"es":["compresión de contexto","optimización de agentes","rendimiento de agentes","recuperación de información","reducción de costos","estrategias de compresión","tokens de historial de conversación","agentes de software"],"fr":["compression de contexte","optimisation d''agents","performances des agents","récupération d''informations","réduction des coûts","stratégies de compression","jetons d''historique de conversation","agents de logiciel"],"de":["Kontextkomprimierung","Optimierung von Agenten","Leistung von Agenten","Wiederherstellung von Informationen","Reduzierung der Kosten","Komprimierungsstrategien","Token des Konversationsverlaufs","Software-Agenten"],"pt":["compressão de contexto","otimização de tokens","agentes de IA","desempenho","custos","tokens","tecnologia de IA"],"ru":["сжатие контекста","оптимизация токенов","агенты ИИ","производительность","затраты","токены","технология ИИ"],"ar":["ضغط السياق","تحسين الرموز","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","الأداء","التكاليف","الرموز","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-compression","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to compress context, summarize conversation history, implement compaction, reduce token usage, or mentions context compression, structured summarization, tokens-per-task optimization, or long-running agent sessions exceeding context limits.","bodyPreview":"# Context Compression Strategies\n\nWhen agent sessions generate millions of tokens of conversation history, compression becomes mandatory. The naive approach is aggressive compression to minimize tokens per request. The correct optimization target is tokens per task: total tokens consumed to complete a task, including re-fetching costs when compression loses critical information.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Agent sessions exceed context window limits\n- Codebases exceed conte","body":"# Context Compression Strategies\n\nWhen agent sessions generate millions of tokens of conversation history, compression becomes mandatory. The naive approach is aggressive compression to minimize tokens per request. The correct optimization target is tokens per task: total tokens consumed to complete a task, including re-fetching costs when compression loses critical information.\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Agent sessions exceed context window limits\n- Codebases exceed context windows (5M+ token systems)\n- Designing conversation summarization strategies\n- Debugging cases where agents \"forget\" what files they modified\n- Building evaluation frameworks for compression quality\n\n## Core Concepts\n\nContext compression trades token savings against information loss. Three production-ready approaches exist:\n\n1. **Anchored Iterative Summarization**: Maintain structured, persistent summaries with explicit sections for session intent, file modifications, decisions, and next steps. When compression triggers, summarize only the newly-truncated span and merge with the existing summary. Structure forces preservation by dedicating sections to specific information types.\n\n2. **Opaque Compression**: Produce compressed representations optimized for reconstruction fidelity. Achieves highest compression ratios (99%+) but sacrifices interpretability. Cannot verify what was preserved.\n\n3. **Regenerative Full Summary**: Generate detailed structured summaries on each compression. Produces readable output but may lose details across repeated compression cycles due to full regeneration rather than incremental merging.\n\nThe critical insight: structure forces preservation. Dedicated sections act as checklists that the summarizer must populate, preventing silent information drift.\n\n## Detailed Topics\n\n### Why Tokens-Per-Task Matters\n\nTraditional compression metrics target tokens-per-request. This is the wrong optimization. When compression loses critical details like file paths or error messages, the agent must re-fetch information, re-explore approaches, and waste tokens recovering context.\n\nThe right metric is tokens-per-task: total tokens consumed from task start to completion. A compression strategy saving 0.5% more tokens but causing 20% more re-fetching costs more overall.\n\n### The Artifact Trail Problem\n\nArtifact trail integrity is the weakest dimension across all compression methods, scoring 2.2-2.5 out of 5.0 in evaluations. Even structured summarization with explicit file sections struggles to maintain complete file tracking across long sessions.\n\nCoding agents need to know:\n- Which files were created\n- Which files were modified and what changed\n- Which files were read but not changed\n- Function names, variable names, error messages\n\nThis problem likely requires specialized handling beyond general summarization: a separate artifact index or explicit file-state tracking in agent scaffolding.\n\n### Structured Summary Sections\n\nEffective structured summaries include explicit sections:\n\n```markdown\n## Session Intent\n[What the user is trying to accomplish]\n\n## Files Modified\n- auth.controller.ts: Fixed JWT token generation\n- config/redis.ts: Updated connection pooling\n- tests/auth.test.ts: Added mock setup for new config\n\n## Decisions Made\n- Using Redis connection pool instead of per-request connections\n- Retry logic with exponential backoff for transient failures\n\n## Current State\n- 14 tests passing, 2 failing\n- Remaining: mock setup for session service tests\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Fix remaining test failures\n2. Run full test suite\n3. Update documentation\n```\n\nThis structure prevents silent loss of file paths or decisions because each section must be explicitly addressed.\n\n### Compression Trigger Strategies\n\nWhen to trigger compression matters as much as how to compress:\n\n| Strategy | Trigger Point | Trade-off |\n|----------|---------------|-----------|\n| Fixed threshold | 70-80% context utilization | Simple but may compress too early |\n| Sliding window | Keep last N turns + summary | Predictable context size |\n| Importance-based | Compress low-relevance sections first | Complex but preserves signal |\n| Task-boundary | Compress at logical task completions | Clean summaries but unpredictable timing |\n\nThe sliding window approach with structured summaries provides the best balance of predictability and quality for most coding agent use cases.\n\n### Probe-Based Evaluation\n\nTraditional metrics like ROUGE or embedding similarity fail to capture functional compression quality. A summary may score high on lexical overlap while missing the one file path the agent needs.\n\nProbe-based evaluation directly measures functional quality by asking questions after compression:\n\n| Probe Type | What It Tests | Example Question |\n|------------|---------------|------------------|\n| Recall | Factual retention | \"What was the original error message?\" |\n| Artifact | File tracking | \"Which files have we modified?\" |\n| Continuation | Task planning | \"What should we do next?\" |\n| Decision | Reasoning chain | \"What did we decide about the Redis issue?\" |\n\nIf compression preserved the right information, the agent answers correctly. If not, it guesses or hallucinates.\n\n### Evaluation Dimensions\n\nSix dimensions capture compression quality for coding agents:\n\n1. **Accuracy**: Are technical details correct? File paths, function names, error codes.\n2. **Context Awareness**: Does the response reflect current conversation state?\n3. **Artifact Trail**: Does the agent know which files were read or modified?\n4. **Completeness**: Does the response address all parts of the question?\n5. **Continuity**: Can work continue without re-fetching information?\n6. **Instruction Following**: Does the response respect stated constraints?\n\nAccuracy shows the largest variation between compression methods (0.6 point gap). Artifact trail is universally weak (2.2-2.5 range).\n\n## Practical Guidance\n\n### Three-Phase Compression Workflow\n\nFor large codebases or agent systems exceeding context windows, apply compression through three phases:\n\n1. **Research Phase**: Produce a research document from architecture diagrams, documentation, and key interfaces. Compress exploration into a structured analysis of components and dependencies. Output: single research document.\n\n2. **Planning Phase**: Convert research into implementation specification with function signatures, type definitions, and data flow. A 5M token codebase compresses to approximately 2,000 words of specification.\n\n3. **Implementation Phase**: Execute against the specification. Context remains focused on the spec rather than raw codebase exploration.\n\n### Using Example Artifacts as Seeds\n\nWhen provided with a manual migration example or reference PR, use it as a template to understand the target pattern. The example reveals constraints that static analysis cannot surface: which invariants must hold, which services break on changes, and what a clean migration looks like.\n\nThis is particularly important when the agent cannot distinguish essential complexity (business requirements) from accidental complexity (legacy workarounds). The example artifact encodes that distinction.\n\n### Implementing Anchored Iterative Summarization\n\n1. Define explicit summary sections matching your agent''s needs\n2. On first compression trigger, summarize truncated history into sections\n3. On subsequent compressions, summarize only new truncated content\n4. Merge new summary into existing sections rather than regenerating\n5. Track which information came from which compression cycle for debugging\n\n### When to Use Each Approach\n\n**Use anchored iterative summarization when:**\n- Sessions are long-running (100+ messages)\n- File tracking matters (coding, debugging)\n- You need to verify what was preserved\n\n**Use opaque compression when:**\n- Maximum token savings required\n- Sessions are relatively short\n- Re-fetching costs are low\n\n**Use regenerative summaries when:**\n- Summary interpretability is critical\n- Sessions have clear phase boundaries\n- Full context review is acceptable on each compression\n\n### Compression Ratio Considerations\n\n| Method | Compression Ratio | Quality Score | Trade-off |\n|--------|-------------------|---------------|-----------|\n| Anchored Iterative | 98.6% | 3.70 | Best quality, slightly less compression |\n| Regenerative | 98.7% | 3.44 | Good quality, moderate compression |\n| Opaque | 99.3% | 3.35 | Best compression, quality loss |\n\nThe 0.7% additional tokens retained by structured summarization buys 0.35 quality points. For any task where re-fetching costs matter, this trade-off favors structured approaches.\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Debugging Session Compression**\n\nOriginal context (89,000 tokens, 178 messages):\n- 401 error on /api/auth/login endpoint\n- Traced through auth controller, middleware, session store\n- Found stale Redis connection\n- Fixed connection pooling, added retry logic\n- 14 tests passing, 2 failing\n\nStructured summary after compression:\n\n```markdown\n## Session Intent\nDebug 401 Unauthorized error on /api/auth/login despite valid credentials.\n\n## Root Cause\nStale Redis connection in session store. JWT generated correctly but session could not be persisted.\n\n## Files Modified\n- auth.controller.ts: No changes (read only)\n- middleware/cors.ts: No changes (examined)\n- config/redis.ts: Fixed connection pooling configuration\n- services/session.service.ts: Added retry logic for transient failures\n- tests/auth.test.ts: Updated mock setup\n\n## Test Status\n14 passing, 2 failing (mock setup issues)\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Fix remaining test failures (mock session service)\n2. Run full test suite\n3. Deploy to staging\n```\n\n**Example 2: Probe Response Quality**\n\nAfter compression, asking \"What was the original error?\":\n\nGood response (structured summarization):\n> \"The original error was a 401 Unauthorized response from the /api/auth/login endpoint. Users received this error with valid credentials. Root cause was stale Redis connection in session store.\"\n\nPoor response (aggressive compression):\n> \"We were debugging an authentication issue. The login was failing. We fixed some configuration problems.\"\n\nThe structured response preserves endpoint, error code, and root cause. The aggressive response loses all technical detail.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. Optimize for tokens-per-task, not tokens-per-request\n2. Use structured summaries with explicit sections for file tracking\n3. Trigger compression at 70-80% context utilization\n4. Implement incremental merging rather than full regeneration\n5. Test compression quality with probe-based evaluation\n6. Track artifact trail separately if file tracking is critical\n7. Accept slightly lower compression ratios for better quality retention\n8. Monitor re-fetching frequency as a compression quality signal\n\n## Integration\n\nThis skill connects to several others in the collection:\n\n- context-degradation - Compression is a mitigation strategy for degradation\n- context-optimization - Compression is one optimization technique among many\n- evaluation - Probe-based evaluation applies to compression testing\n- memory-systems - Compression relates to scratchpad and summary memory patterns\n\n## References\n\nInternal reference:\n- [Evaluation Framework Reference](./references/evaluation-framework.md) - Detailed probe types and scoring rubrics\n\nRelated skills in this collection:\n- context-degradation - Understanding what compression prevents\n- context-optimization - Broader optimization strategies\n- evaluation - Building evaluation frameworks\n\nExternal resources:\n- Factory Research: Evaluating Context Compression for AI Agents (December 2025)\n- Research on LLM-as-judge evaluation methodology (Zheng et al., 2023)\n- Netflix Engineering: \"The Infinite Software Crisis\" - Three-phase workflow and context compression at scale (AI Summit 2025)\n\n---\n\n## Skill Metadata\n\n**Created**: 2025-12-22\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-26\n**Author**: Agent Skills for Context Engineering Contributors\n**Version**: 1.1.0\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:00:57.435Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for long-running AI Agents managing massive codebases and complex multi-step tasks.","zh":"对于长期运行的AI代理管理大量代码库和复杂的多步骤任务至关重要。","ja":"大量のコードベースと複雑なマルチステップタスクを管理する長時間実行されるAIエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"대규모 코드베이스와 복잡한 다단계 작업을 관리하는 장기 실행 AI 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de IA de larga duración que gestionan enormes códigos y tareas complejas de varios pasos.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''IA à long terme gérant de grandes bases de code et des tâches complexes à plusieurs étapes.","de":"Wesentlich für lang laufende KI-Agents, die massive Codebasen und komplexe Mehrschritt-Aufgaben verwalten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de IA de longa duração que gerenciam massive bases de código e tarefas complexas de múltiplos passos.","ru":"Необходимо для долгосрочных агентов ИИ, управляющих огромными кодовыми базами и сложными многоступенчатыми задачами.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تعمل لمدة طويلة لإدارة قواعد الشفرة الضخمة والمهام المعقدة متعددة الخطوات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Optimizes token usage per task by intelligently compressing conversation history while preserving critical information, preventing context window overflow and reducing costly re-fetching operations.","zh":"通过智能地压缩对话历史同时保留关键信息，优化每个任务的令牌使用，防止上下文窗口溢出并减少昂贵的重新获取操作。","ja":"会話履歴を賢く圧縮しながら重要な情報を保持することで、各タスクのトークン使用を最適化し、コンテキストウィンドウのオーバーフローを防ぎ、高価な再取得操作を削減します。","ko":"대화 기록을 지능적으로 압축하여 중요한 정보를 보존함으로써 각 작업의 토큰 사용을 최적화하고, 문맥 창 오버플로를 방지하며, 비용이 많이 드는 재검索 작업을 줄입니다.","es":"Optimiza el uso de tokens por tarea mediante la compresión inteligente del historial de conversación, preservando la información crítica, evitando el desbordamiento de la ventana de contexto y reduciendo las operaciones de recuperación costosas.","fr":"Optimise l''utilisation de jetons par tâche en compressant de manière intelligente l''historique de conversation, en préservant les informations critiques, en évitant le débordement de la fenêtre de contexte et en réduisant les opérations de reprise coûteuses.","de":"Optimiert die Token-Nutzung pro Aufgabe durch intelligente Komprimierung der Konversationshistorie, wobei kritische Informationen erhalten bleiben, ein Kontextfenster-Overflows verhindert wird und kostspielige Neuabrufoperationen reduziert werden.","pt":"Otimiza o uso de tokens por tarefa, comprimindo inteligentemente o histórico de conversa enquanto preserva as informações críticas, evitando o transbordamento da janela de contexto e reduzindo as operações de re-recuperação dispendiosas.","ru":"Оптимизирует использование токенов на задачу, умно сжимая историю разговора, сохраняя при этом важную информацию, предотвращая переполнение контекстного окна и снижая количество дорогих операций по повторному получению.","ar":"يحسن استخدام الرموز لكل مهمة عن طريق ضغط ذكي لتاريخ المحادثة مع الحفاظ على المعلومات الحرجة، ومنع 溢ة نافذة السياق وتقليل العمليات المكلفة لإعادة الاسترجاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing agent sessions exceeding millions of tokens","Compressing codebase context beyond standard window limits","Reducing total token consumption per task completion"],"zh":["管理超过数百万令牌的代理会话","压缩超出标准窗口限制的代码库上下文","减少每个任务完成的总令牌消耗"],"ja":["数百万トークンを超えるエージェントセッションの管理","標準ウィンドウ限界を超えるコードベースコンテキストの圧縮","各タスク完了時の総トークン消費量の削減"],"ko":["수백만 토큰을 초과하는 에이전트 세션 관리","표준 창 제한을 초과하는 코드베이스 문맥 압축","각 작업 완료 시 총 토큰 소비量 감소"],"es":["Gestión de sesiones de agente que exceden millones de tokens","Compresión del contexto de la base de código más allá de los límites de la ventana estándar","Reducción del consumo total de tokens por finalización de tarea"],"fr":["Gestion de sessions d''agent dépassant des millions de jetons","Compression du contexte de la base de code au-delà des limites de la fenêtre standard","Réduction de la consommation totale de jetons par achèvement de tâche"],"de":["Verwaltung von Agentsitzungen, die Millionen von Token überschreiten","Komprimierung des Codebase-Kontexts über die Standardfensterlimits hinaus","Verringerung des Gesamttokenverbrauchs pro Aufgabenerfüllung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de sessões de agente que excedem milhões de tokens","Compressão do contexto da base de código além dos limites padrão da janela","Redução do consumo total de tokens por conclusão de tarefa"],"ru":["Управление сессиями агентов, превышающих миллионы токенов","Сжатие контекста кодовой базы за пределами стандартных оконных ограничений","Снижение общего потребления токенов на задачу"],"ar":["إدارة جلسات الوكيل التي تتجاوز ملايين الرموز","ضغط سياق قاعدة الشفرة ما وراء حدود النافذة القياسية","تقليل الاستهلاك الإجمالي للرموز لكل إكمال للمهمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires careful tuning to avoid losing critical information","Performance depends on original context quality and structure"],"zh":["需要仔细调整以避免丢失关键信息","性能取决于原始上下文质量和结构"],"ja":["重要な情報を失わないように慎重に調整する必要がある","パフォーマンスは、元のコンテキストの品質と構造に依存する"],"ko":["중요한 정보를 잃지 않도록 주의 깊게 조정해야 함","성능은 원래 문맥의 품질 및 구조에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere un ajuste cuidadoso para evitar la pérdida de información crítica","El rendimiento depende de la calidad y la estructura del contexto original"],"fr":["Nécessite un réglage soigneux pour éviter la perte d''informations critiques","Les performances dépendent de la qualité et de la structure du contexte d''origine"],"de":["Erfordert eine sorgfältige Einstellung, um den Verlust kritischer Informationen zu vermeiden","Die Leistung hängt von der Qualität und Struktur des ursprünglichen Kontexts ab"],"pt":["Requer ajuste cuidadoso para evitar perder informações críticas","O desempenho depende da qualidade e estrutura originais do contexto"],"ru":["Требует тщательной настройки, чтобы не потерять важную информацию","Производительность зависит от качества и структуры исходного контекста"],"ar":["يتطلب ضبطاً دقيقاً لتجنب فقدان المعلومات الحرجة","تعتمد الأداء على جودة وهيكل السياق الأصلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
