ração","desenvolvimento de software","inteligência artificial","auditoria de prontidão","otimização de processos"],"ru":["здоровье проекта","агенты ИИ","документация","рабочие процессы","сотрудничество","разработка программного обеспечения","искусственный интеллект","аудит готовности","оптимизация процессов"],"ar":["صحة المشروع","وكلااء الذكاء الاصطناعي","توثيق","عمليات","تعاون","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تدقيق جاهزية","تحسين العمليات"]}},"owner":"fefogarcia","repo":"approved-skills","repoPath":"fefogarcia/approved-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-health","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Project Health: AI-Agent Readiness Auditing\n\n**Status**: Active\n**Updated**: 2026-01-30\n**Focus**: Ensuring documentation and workflows are executable by AI agents\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill evaluates project health from an **AI-agent perspective** - not just whether docs are well-written for humans, but whether future Claude Code sessions can:\n\n1. **Understand** the documentation without ambiguity\n2. **Execute** workflows by following instructions literally\n3. **Resume** work effectively with p","body":"# Project Health: AI-Agent Readiness Auditing\n\n**Status**: Active\n**Updated**: 2026-01-30\n**Focus**: Ensuring documentation and workflows are executable by AI agents\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill evaluates project health from an **AI-agent perspective** - not just whether docs are well-written for humans, but whether future Claude Code sessions can:\n\n1. **Understand** the documentation without ambiguity\n2. **Execute** workflows by following instructions literally\n3. **Resume** work effectively with proper context handoff\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Before handing off a project to another AI session\n- When onboarding AI agents to contribute to a codebase\n- After major refactors to ensure docs are still AI-executable\n- When workflows fail because agents \"didn''t understand\"\n- Periodic health checks for AI-maintained projects\n\n## Agent Selection Guide\n\n| Situation | Use Agent | Why |\n|-----------|-----------|-----|\n| \"Will another Claude session understand this?\" | **context-auditor** | Checks for ambiguous references, implicit knowledge, incomplete examples |\n| \"Will this workflow actually execute?\" | **workflow-validator** | Verifies steps are discrete, ordered, and include verification |\n| \"Can a new session pick up where I left off?\" | **handoff-checker** | Validates SESSION.md, phase tracking, context preservation |\n| Full project health audit | All three | Comprehensive AI-readiness assessment |\n\n## Key Principles\n\n### 1. Literal Interpretation\n\nAI agents follow instructions literally. Documentation that works for humans (who fill in gaps) may fail for agents.\n\n**Human-friendly** (ambiguous):\n> \"Update the config file with your settings\"\n\n**AI-friendly** (explicit):\n> \"Edit `wrangler.jsonc` and set `account_id` to your Cloudflare account ID (find it at dash.cloudflare.com → Overview → Account ID)\"\n\n### 2. Explicit Over Implicit\n\nNever assume the agent knows:\n- Which file you mean\n- What \"obvious\" next steps are\n- Environment state or prerequisites\n- What success looks like\n\n### 3. Verification at Every Step\n\nAgents can''t tell if something \"feels right\". Include verification:\n- Expected output after each command\n- How to check if a step succeeded\n- What to do if it failed\n\n## Agents\n\n### context-auditor\n\n**Purpose**: Evaluate AI-readability of documentation\n\n**Checks**:\n- Instructions use imperative verbs (actionable)\n- File paths are explicit (not \"the config file\")\n- Success criteria are measurable\n- No ambiguous references (\"that thing\", \"as discussed\")\n- Code examples are complete (not fragments)\n- Dependencies/prerequisites stated explicitly\n- Error handling documented\n\n**Output**: AI-Readability Score (0-100) with specific issues\n\n### workflow-validator\n\n**Purpose**: Verify processes are executable when followed literally\n\n**Checks**:\n- Steps are discrete and ordered\n- Each step has clear input/output\n- No implicit knowledge required\n- Environment assumptions documented\n- Verification step after each action\n- Failure modes and recovery documented\n- No \"obvious\" steps omitted\n\n**Output**: Executability Score (0-100) with step-by-step analysis\n\n### handoff-checker\n\n**Purpose**: Ensure session continuity for multi-session work\n\n**Checks**:\n- SESSION.md or equivalent exists\n- Current phase/status clear\n- Next actions documented\n- Blockers/decisions needed listed\n- Context for future sessions preserved\n- Git checkpoint pattern in use\n- Architecture decisions documented with rationale\n\n**Output**: Handoff Quality Score (0-100) with continuity gaps\n\n## Templates\n\n### AI-Readable Documentation Template\n\nSee `templates/AI_READABLE_DOC.md` for a template that ensures AI-readability.\n\nKey sections:\n- **Prerequisites** (explicit environment/state requirements)\n- **Steps** (numbered, discrete, with verification)\n- **Expected Output** (what success looks like)\n- **Troubleshooting** (common failures and fixes)\n\n### Handoff Checklist\n\nSee `templates/HANDOFF_CHECKLIST.md` for ensuring clean session handoffs.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### 1. \"See Above\" References\n\n```markdown\n# Bad\nAs mentioned above, configure the database.\n\n# Good\nConfigure the database by running:\n`npx wrangler d1 create my-db`\n```\n\n### 2. Implicit File Paths\n\n```markdown\n# Bad\nUpdate the config with your API key.\n\n# Good\nAdd your API key to `.dev.vars`:\n```\nAPI_KEY=your-key-here\n```\n```\n\n### 3. Missing Verification\n\n```markdown\n# Bad\nRun the migration.\n\n# Good\nRun the migration:\n`npx wrangler d1 migrations apply my-db --local`\n\nVerify with:\n`npx wrangler d1 execute my-db --local --command \"SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type=''table''\"`\n\nExpected output: Should show your table names.\n```\n\n### 4. Assumed Context\n\n```markdown\n# Bad\nNow deploy (you know the drill).\n\n# Good\nDeploy to production:\n`npx wrangler deploy`\n\nVerify deployment at: https://your-worker.your-subdomain.workers.dev\n```\n\n## Relationship to Other Tools\n\n| Tool | Focus | Audience |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| `project-docs-auditor` | Traditional doc quality (links, freshness, structure) | Human readers |\n| `project-health` skill | AI-agent readiness (executability, clarity, handoff) | Claude sessions |\n| `docs-workflow` skill | Creating/managing specific doc files | Both |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Full audit**: \"Run all project-health agents on this repo\"\n2. **Check one aspect**: \"Use context-auditor to check AI-readability\"\n3. **Before handoff**: \"Use handoff-checker before I end this session\"\n\n## Success Metrics\n\nA healthy project scores:\n- **Context Auditor**: 80+ (AI can understand without clarification)\n- **Workflow Validator**: 90+ (steps execute literally without failure)\n- **Handoff Checker**: 85+ (new session can resume immediately)\n\nProjects below these thresholds have documentation debt that will slow future AI sessions.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:01:58.836Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing to ensure project documentation and workflows are executable and ambiguity-free","zh":"适合于Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain等AI代理，需要确保项目文档和工作流程是可执行和无歧义的","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどのAIエージェントに適しており、プロジェクトのドキュメントとワークフローが実行可能であいまいさのないことを保証する必要がある","ko":"클라우드 코드, 오토지피티, 랭체인 등의 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 프로젝트 문서와 워크플로우가 실행 가능하고 모호하지 않은 것을 보장하는 데 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan asegurarse de que la documentación del proyecto y los flujos de trabajo sean ejecutables y libres de ambigüedad","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain qui ont besoin de s''assurer que la documentation de projet et les flux de travail sont exécutables et exempts d''ambiguïté","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die sicherstellen müssen, dass die Projektdokumentation und die Workflows ausführbar und frei von Mehrdeutigkeit sind","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que precisam garantir que a documentação do projeto e os fluxos de trabalho sejam executáveis e livres de ambiguidade","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходимо обеспечить выполнение документации проекта и рабочих процессов без двусмысленностей","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى ضمان أن تكون مستندات المشروع وعمليات العمل قابلة للتنفيذ وخالية من الغموض"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to understand documentation literally, execute workflows accurately, and resume work effectively with precision, leveraging AI-agent readiness auditing and ensuring compatibility with remote environments, while supporting executable documentation and literal workflow execution","zh":"赋予代理理解文档的能力，准确执行工作流程，并高效地恢复工作，利用AI代理就绪性审计，确保与远程环境的兼容性，同时支持可执行文档和字面工作流执行","ja":"エージェントにドキュメントを字面的に理解し、ワークフローを正確に実行し、高精度で効果的に作業を再開する能力を与え、AIエージェントの準備性を監査し、リモート環境との互換性を確保し、実行可能なドキュメントと字面のワークフロー実行をサポートする","ko":"에이전트가 문서를 문자 그대로 이해하고 워크플로우를 정확하게 실행하며 높은 정확도로 효율적으로 작업을 재개할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, AI 에이전트의 준비 감사와 원격 환경과의 호환성을 보장하며, 실행 가능한 문서와 문자 그대로의 워크플로우 실행을 지원합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes entender la documentación de manera literal, ejecutar flujos de trabajo con precisión y reanudar el trabajo de manera efectiva con precisión, aprovechando la auditoría de preparación de agentes de IA y asegurando la compatibilidad con entornos remotos, mientras se admite la documentación ejecutable y la ejecución de flujos de trabajo literal","fr":"Permet aux agents de comprendre la documentation de manière littérale, d''exécuter les flux de travail avec précision et de reprendre le travail de manière efficace avec précision, en exploitant l''audit de préparation des agents IA et en assurant la compatibilité avec les environnements distants, tout en supportant la documentation exécutable et l''exécution littérale des flux de travail","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Dokumentation wörtlich zu verstehen, Workflows genau auszuführen und die Arbeit effektiv und genau wieder aufzunehmen, indem die Auditierung der KI-Agenten-Bereitschaft genutzt und die Kompatibilität mit Remote-Umgebungen sichergestellt wird, während die ausführbare Dokumentation und die wörtliche Ausführung von Workflows unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compreender a documentação literalmente, executar fluxos de trabalho com precisão e retomar o trabalho de forma eficaz com precisão, utilizando auditoria de prontidão de agente de IA e garantindo compatibilidade com ambientes remotos, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta documentação executável e execução literal de fluxos de trabalho","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью понимать документацию буквально, выполнять рабочие процессы точно и возобновлять работу эффективно с точностью, используя аудит готовности агента ИИ и обеспечение совместимости с удаленными средами, а также поддержку выполнения документации и буквального выполнения рабочих процессов","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فهم المستندات بشكل حرفي والعمل على سير عمل بدقة واستئناف العمل بفعالية ودقة، من خلال استخدام تدقيق جاهزية الوكيل الذكي وضمان التوافق مع البيئات عن بُعد، مع دعم المستندات القابلة للتنفيذ والتنفيذ الحرفي لسير العمل"},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing project documentation for AI-agent executability","Ensuring workflow instructions are literal and unambiguous","Resuming work sessions with precision and accuracy"],"zh":["审计项目文档的AI代理可执行性","确保工作流指令是字面和无歧义的","以精度和准确性恢复工作会话"],"ja":["プロジェクトのドキュメントのAIエージェント実行可能性を監査する","ワークフロー指令が字面的であいまいさのないことを確認する","精度と正確性で作業セッションを再開する"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서의 AI 에이전트 실행 가능성 감사","워크플로우 지침이 문자 그대로이고 모호하지 않은 것을 확인","정밀도와 정확도로 작업 세션을 재개"],"es":["Auditoría de la documentación del proyecto para la ejecutabilidad de los agentes de IA","Asegurarse de que las instrucciones de los flujos de trabajo sean literales y no ambiguas","Reanudar las sesiones de trabajo con precisión y exactitud"],"fr":["Audit de la documentation de projet pour l''exécutabilité des agents IA","S''assurer que les instructions de flux de travail soient littérales et non ambiguës","Reprendre les sessions de travail avec précision et exactitude"],"de":["Prüfung der Projektdokumentation auf Ausführbarkeit durch KI-Agents","Sicherstellen, dass die Anweisungen für die Workflows wörtlich und nicht mehrdeutig sind","Wiederaufnahme der Arbeitsitzungen mit Präzision und Genauigkeit"],"pt":["Auditoria de documentação do projeto para executabilidade de agente de IA","Garantir que as instruções do fluxo de trabalho sejam literais e inequívocas","Retomar sessões de trabalho com precisão e exatidão"],"ru":["Проверка документации проекта на выполнение агентом ИИ","Обеспечение того, что инструкции рабочего процесса являются буквальными и недвусмысленными","Возобновление рабочих сессий с точностью и точностью"],"ar":["تدقيق مستندات المشروع للتنفيذ بواسطة عمليات إدارة الوكيل الذكي","ضمان أن تكون تعليمات سير العمل حرفية وواضحة","استئناف جلسات العمل بدقة ودقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project documentation and workflows to be security-scanned and approved","Focuses on AI-agent perspective, may not cover human-centric documentation aspects"],"zh":["需要项目文档和工作流程经过安全扫描和批准","关注AI代理的视角，可能不涵盖人为中心的文档方面"],"ja":["プロジェクトのドキュメントとワークフローがセキュリティスキャンと承認を必要とする","AIエージェントの視点に焦点を当て、人間中心のドキュメントの側面をカバーしない可能性がある"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서와 워크플로우가 보안 스캔과 승인을 필요로 함","AI 에이전트의 관점에 초점을 맞추고, 인간 중심의 문서 측면을 다루지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere que la documentación del proyecto y los flujos de trabajo sean examinados de seguridad y aprobados","Se centra en la perspectiva del agente de IA, puede que no cubra aspectos de documentación centrados en humanos"],"fr":["Nécessite que la documentation de projet et les flux de travail soient examinés pour la sécurité et approuvés","Se concentre sur la perspective de l''agent IA, peut ne pas couvrir les aspects de documentation centrés sur l''humain"],"de":["Erfordert, dass die Projektdokumentation und die Workflows auf Sicherheit geprüft und genehmigt werden","Konzentriert sich auf die Perspektive des KI-Agents, kann Aspekte der menschenzentrierten Dokumentation nicht abdecken"],"pt":["Exige que a documentação do projeto e os fluxos de trabalho sejam digitalizados e aprovados","Concentra-se na perspectiva do agente de IA, pode não abranger aspectos de documentação centrados no ser humano"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы документация проекта и рабочие процессы были просканированы на безопасность и одобрены","Сосредоточен на перспективе агента ИИ, может не охватывать аспекты документации, ориентированные на человека"],"ar":["يتطلب أن تكون مستندات المشروع وسير العمل قد خضعت لتدقيق أمني وموافقة","يركز على منظور عمليات إدارة الوكيل الذكي، قد لا يغطي جوانب المستندات الموجهة للإنسان"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('aiskillstore/marketplace/daily-meeting-update', 'community', 'aiskillstore', 'marketplace', 'aiskillstore/marketplace', 'daily-meeting-update', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z', '2026-02-18T09:02:34.066Z', NULL, '{"id":"aiskillstore/marketplace/daily-meeting-update","name":"daily-meeting-update","description":{"zh":"每日会议更新技能通过交互式面试生成日常会议更新，支持Claude、Codex和Claude Code","ja":"デイリーミーティング更新スキルは、インタラクティブなインタビューを通じて日常会議更新を生成し、Claude、Codex、Claude Codeをサポート","ko":"일일 미팅 업데이트 스킬은 상호작용 인터뷰를 통해 일일 미팅 업데이트를 생성하며 Claude, Codex, Claude Code를 지원","es":"El skill de actualización de reunión diaria genera un resumen de reuniones diarias a través de una entrevista interactiva, verificando la configuración de las herramientas","fr":"Le skill de mise à jour de réunion quotidienne génère un résumé de réunions quotidiennes via un entretien interactif, en vérifiant la configuration des outils","de":"Das tägliche Meeting-Update-Skill generiert ein tägliches Meeting-Update durch ein interaktives Interview, indem es die Tool-Konfiguration überprüft","pt":"A ferramenta de atualização de reunião diária gera relatórios personalizados por meio de uma entrevista interativa, verificando integrações e histórico de sessões.","ru":"Инструмент ежедневного обновления встречи генерирует настраиваемые отчеты с помощью интерактивного интервью, проверяя интеграции и историю сеансов.","ar":"أداة تحديث الاجتماع اليومي تنتج تقارير مخصصة من خلال مقابلة تفاعلية، وتتحقق من التكاملات وسجلات الجلسات.","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"每日会议更新 - 通过交互式面试生成日常会议更新","ja":"デイリーミーティング更新 - インタラクティブなインタビューによる日常会議更新","ko":"일일 미팅 업데이트 - 상호작용 인터뷰를 통한 일일 미팅 업데이트","es":"Actualización de reunión diaria","fr":"Mise à jour de réunion quotidienne","de":"Täglicher Meeting-Update","pt":"Atualização de Reunião Diária - Ferramenta de Integração","ru":"Ежедневное обновление встречи - Инструмент интеграции","ar":"تحديث اجتماع يومي - أداة التكامل","en":"daily-meeting-update"},"description":{"zh":"每日会议更新技能通过交互式面试生成日常会议更新，支持Claude、Codex和Claude Code","ja":"デイリーミーティング更新スキルは、インタラクティブなインタビューを通じて日常会議更新を生成し、Claude、Codex、Claude Codeをサポート","ko":"일일 미팅 업데이트 스킬은 상호작용 인터뷰를 통해 일일 미팅 업데이트를 생성하며 Claude, Codex, Claude Code를 지원","es":"El skill de actualización de reunión diaria genera un resumen de reuniones diarias a través de una entrevista interactiva, verificando la configuración de la...","fr":"Le skill de mise à jour de réunion quotidienne génère un résumé de réunions quotidiennes via un entretien interactif, en vérifiant la configuration des outils","de":"Das tägliche Meeting-Update-Skill generiert ein tägliches Meeting-Update durch ein interaktives Interview, indem es die Tool-Konfiguration überprüft","pt":"A ferramenta de atualização de reunião diária gera relatórios personalizados por meio de uma entrevista interativa, verificando integrações e histórico de se...","ru":"Инструмент ежедневного обновления встречи генерирует настраиваемые отчеты с помощью интерактивного интервью, проверяя интеграции и историю сеансов.","ar":"أداة تحديث الاجتماع اليومي تنتج تقارير مخصصة من خلال مقابلة تفاعلية، وتتحقق من التكاملات وسجلات الجلسات.","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"zh":["支持Claude、Codex和Claude Code","交互式面试生成日常会议更新","安全审计的技能","一键安装","质量验证"],"ja":["Claude、Codex、Claude Codeをサポート","インタラクティブなインタビューによる日常会議更新の生成","セキュリティ監査済みのスキル","ワンクリックインストール","品質検証"],"ko":["Claude, Codex, Claude Code 지원","상호작용 인터뷰를 통한 일일 미팅 업데이트 생성","보안 감사된 스킬","일키 설치","품질 검증"],"es":["Entrevista interactiva para generar actualizaciones de reuniones","Verificación de la configuración de las herramientas","Integración con Claude Code, GitHub y Jira","Selección de elementos relevantes a través de multiSelect","Resumen de sesiones de ayer"],"fr":["Entretien interactif pour générer des mises à jour de réunions","Vérification de la configuration des outils","Intégration avec Claude Code, GitHub et Jira","Sélection d''éléments pertinents via multiSelect","Résumé des sessions de la veille"],"de":["Interaktives Interview zur Generierung von Meeting-Updates","Überprüfung der Tool-Konfiguration","Integration mit Claude Code, GitHub und Jira","Auswahl von relevanten Elementen über multiSelect","Zusammenfassung der Sitzungen von gestern"],"pt":["Entrevista interativa para personalizar relatórios","Verificação de integrações com Claude Code, GitHub e Jira","Geração de relatórios diários com base em histórico de sessões","Seleção de itens relevantes via multiSelect","Integração com gh CLI e jira CLI"],"ru":["Интерактивное интервью для настройки отчетов","Проверка интеграций с Claude Code, GitHub и Jira","Генерация ежедневных отчетов на основе истории сеансов","Выбор актуальных элементов через multiSelect","Интеграция с gh CLI и jira CLI"],"ar":["مقابلة تفاعلية لتحديد تقارير مخصصة","تحقق من التكاملات مع Claude Code و GitHub و Jira","إنشاء تقارير يومية بناءً على سجلات الجلسات","اختيار العناصر ذات الصلة عبرmultiSelect","التكامل مع gh CLI و jira CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["每日会议更新","交互式面试","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","安全审计","一键安装","质量验证"],"ja":["デイリーミーティング更新","インタラクティブなインタビュー","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","セキュリティ監査","ワンクリックインストール","品質検証"],"ko":["일일 미팅 업데이트","상호작용 인터뷰","Claude","Codex","Claude Code","보안 감사","일키 설치","품질 검증"],"es":["actualización de reunión diaria","entrevista interactiva","configuración de herramientas","integración con Claude Code","GitHub","Jira","desarrollo de software","gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["mise à jour de réunion quotidienne","entretien interactif","configuration des outils","intégration avec Claude Code","GitHub","Jira","développement de logiciels","gestion de projets"],"de":["täglicher Meeting-Update","interaktives Interview","Tool-Konfiguration","Integration mit Claude Code","GitHub","Jira","Software-Entwicklung","Projektmanagement"],"pt":["atualização de reunião diária","ferramenta de integração","entrevista interativa","relatórios personalizados","integração com Claude Code","integração com GitHub","integração com Jira"],"ru":["ежедневное обновление встречи","инструмент интеграции","интерактивное интервью","настраиваемые отчеты","интеграция с Claude Code","интеграция с GitHub","интеграция с Jira"],"ar":["تحديث اجتماع يومي","أداة التكامل","مقابلة تفاعلية","تقارير مخصصة","التكامل مع Claude Code","التكامل مع GitHub","التكامل مع Jira"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"daily-meeting-update","description":"Interactive daily standup/meeting update generator. Use when user says daily, standup, scrum update, status update, what did I do yesterday, prepare for meeting, morning update, or team sync. Pulls activity from GitHub, Jira, and Claude Code session history. Conducts 4-question interview (yesterday, today, blockers, discussion topics) and generates formatted Markdown update.","bodyPreview":"# Daily Meeting Update\n\nGenerate a daily standup/meeting update through an **interactive interview**. Never assume tools are configured—ask first.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nSTART\n  │\n  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Phase 1: DETECT & OFFER INTEGRATIONS                │\n│ • Check: Claude Code history? gh CLI? jira CLI?     │\n│ • Claude Code → Pull yesterday''s session digest     │\n│   → User selects relevant items via multiSelect     │\n│ • GitHub/Jira → Ask user, pull if","body":"# Daily Meeting Update\n\nGenerate a daily standup/meeting update through an **interactive interview**. Never assume tools are configured—ask first.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nSTART\n  │\n  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Phase 1: DETECT & OFFER INTEGRATIONS                │\n│ • Check: Claude Code history? gh CLI? jira CLI?     │\n│ • Claude Code → Pull yesterday''s session digest     │\n│   → User selects relevant items via multiSelect     │\n│ • GitHub/Jira → Ask user, pull if approved          │\n│ • Pull data NOW (before interview)                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Phase 2: INTERVIEW (with insights)                  │\n│ • Show pulled data as context                       │\n│ • Yesterday: \"I see you merged PR #123, what else?\" │\n│ • Today: What will you work on?                     │\n│ • Blockers: Anything blocking you?                  │\n│ • Topics: Anything to discuss at end of meeting?    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Phase 3: GENERATE UPDATE                            │\n│ • Combine interview answers + tool data             │\n│ • Format as clean Markdown                          │\n│ • Present to user                                   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Detect & Offer Integrations\n\n### Step 1: Silent Detection\n\nCheck for available integrations **silently** (suppress errors, don''t show to user):\n\n| Integration | Detection |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| **Claude Code History** | `~/.claude/projects` directory exists with `.jsonl` files |\n| GitHub CLI | `gh auth status` succeeds |\n| Jira CLI | `jira` command exists |\n| Atlassian MCP | `mcp__atlassian__*` tools available |\n| Git | Inside a git repository |\n\n### Step 2: Offer GitHub/Jira Integrations (if available)\n\n> **Claude Code users:** Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool for all questions in this phase.\n\n**GitHub/Git:**\n\nIf `HAS_GH` or `HAS_GIT`:\n\n```\n\"I detected you have GitHub/Git configured. Want me to pull your recent activity (commits, PRs, reviews)?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull the info\"\n- \"No, I''ll provide everything manually\"\n```\n\nIf yes:\n\n```\n\"Which repositories/projects should I check?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Just the current directory\" (if in a git repo)\n- \"I''ll list the repos\" → user provides list\n```\n\n**Jira:**\n\nIf `HAS_JIRA_CLI` or `HAS_ATLASSIAN_MCP`:\n\n```\n\"I detected you have Jira configured. Want me to pull your tickets?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull my tickets\"\n- \"No, I''ll provide everything manually\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Pull GitHub/Jira Data (if approved)\n\n**GitHub/Git** — For each approved repo:\n- Commits by user since yesterday\n- PRs opened/merged by user\n- Reviews done by user\n\n**Jira** — Tickets assigned to user, updated in last 24h\n\n**Key insight**: Store results to use as context in Phase 2 interview.\n\n### Step 4: Offer Claude Code History\n\nThis integration captures everything you worked on with Claude Code — useful for recalling work that isn''t in git or Jira.\n\n**Detection:**\n```bash\nls ~/.claude/projects/*/*.jsonl 2>/dev/null | head -1\n```\n\n**If Claude Code history exists, ask:**\n\n```\n\"I can also pull your Claude Code session history from yesterday. This can help recall work that isn''t in git/Jira (research, debugging, planning). Want me to check?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"Yes, pull my Claude Code sessions\"\n- \"No, I have everything I need\"\n```\n\n**If yes, run the digest script:**\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --format json\n```\n\n**Then present sessions with multiSelect:**\n\nUse `AskUserQuestionTool` with `multiSelect: true` to let user pick relevant items:\n\n```\n\"Here are your Claude Code sessions from yesterday. Select the ones relevant to your standup:\"\n\nOptions (multiSelect):\n- \"Fix authentication bug (backend-api)\"\n- \"Implement OAuth flow (backend-api)\"\n- \"Update homepage styles (frontend-app)\"\n- \"Research payment providers (docs)\"\n```\n\n**Key insight:** User selects which sessions are work-related. Personal projects or experiments can be excluded.\n\n**Do NOT run digest script when:**\n- User explicitly says \"No\" to Claude Code history\n- User says they''ll provide everything manually\n- `~/.claude/projects` directory doesn''t exist\n\n**If digest script fails:**\n- Fallback: Skip Claude Code integration silently, proceed with interview\n- Common issues: Python not installed, no sessions from yesterday, permission errors\n- Do NOT block the standup flow — the script is supplemental, not required\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Interview (with insights)\n\n> **Claude Code users:** Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool to conduct the interview. This provides a better UX with structured options.\n\n**Use pulled data as context** to make questions smarter.\n\n### Question 1: Yesterday\n\n**If data was pulled**, show it first:\n\n```\n\"Here''s what I found from your activity:\n- Merged PR #123: fix login timeout\n- 3 commits in backend-api\n- Reviewed PR #456 (approved)\n\nAnything else you worked on yesterday that I missed?\"\n```\n\n**If no data pulled:**\n\n```\n\"What did you work on yesterday/since the last standup?\"\n```\n\nIf user response is vague, ask follow-up:\n- \"Can you give more details about X?\"\n- \"Did you complete anything specific?\"\n\n### Question 2: Today\n\n```\n\"What will you work on today?\"\n\nOptions:\n- [Text input - user types freely]\n```\n\n**If Jira data was pulled**, you can suggest:\n\n```\n\"I see you have these tickets assigned:\n- PROJ-123: Implement OAuth flow (In Progress)\n- PROJ-456: Fix payment bug (To Do)\n\nWill you work on any of these today?\"\n```\n\n### Question 3: Blockers\n\n```\n\"Do you have any blockers or impediments?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"No blockers\"\n- \"Yes, I have blockers\" → follow-up for details\n```\n\n### Question 4: Topics for Discussion\n\n```\n\"Any topic you want to bring up at the end of the daily?\"\n\nOptions:\n- \"No, nothing to discuss\"\n- \"Yes\" → follow-up for details\n\nExamples of topics:\n- Technical decision that needs input\n- Alignment with another team\n- Question about prioritization\n- Announcement or info for the team\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: Generate Update\n\nCombine all information into clean Markdown:\n\n```markdown\n# Daily Update - [DATE]\n\n## Yesterday\n- [Items from interview]\n- [Items from GitHub/Jira if pulled]\n\n## Today\n- [Items from interview]\n\n## Blockers\n- [Blockers or \"No blockers\"]\n\n## PRs & Reviews (if pulled from GitHub)\n- [PRs opened]\n- [PRs merged]\n- [Reviews done]\n\n## Jira (if pulled from Jira)\n- [Tickets updated]\n\n## Topics for Discussion\n- [Topics or \"None\"]\n\n---\n*Links:*\n- [PR links]\n- [Ticket links]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Interview is primary** — Tools supplement, they don''t replace human context\n2. **Consent before access** — Always ask before pulling from any integration\n3. **Context-aware questions** — Show pulled data during interview to trigger memory (\"I see you merged PR #123...\")\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Phase | Action | Tool |\n|-------|--------|------|\n| 1. Detect & Offer | Check gh/jira/claude history, ask user, pull data | Bash (silent), AskUserQuestionTool* |\n| 2. Interview | Ask 4 questions with insights | AskUserQuestionTool* |\n| 3. Generate | Format Markdown | Output text |\n\n*Claude Code only: Use `AskUserQuestionTool` tool for structured questions.\n\n### Claude Code Digest Script\n\n```bash\n# Get yesterday''s sessions as JSON\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --format json\n\n# Get today''s sessions\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --date today --format json\n\n# Filter to specific project\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/daily-meeting-update/scripts/claude_digest.py --project ~/my-app --format json\n```\n\n---\n\n## Example Session\n\n```\nClaude: \"Let''s prepare your daily! I detected GitHub configured. Want me to pull your recent activity?\"\nUser: \"Yes\"\n\nClaude: \"Which repos should I check?\"\nUser: \"backend-api and frontend-app\"\n\n[Claude pulls GitHub data silently]\n\nClaude: \"I can also pull your Claude Code session history from yesterday. Want me to check?\"\nUser: \"Yes\"\n\n[Claude runs digest script, gets 5 sessions]\n\nClaude: \"Here are your Claude Code sessions from yesterday. Select the ones relevant to your standup:\"\n  ☑ Fix authentication timeout bug (backend-api)\n  ☑ Implement OAuth flow (backend-api)\n  ☐ Update personal blog (blog) - [user unchecks personal project]\n  ☑ Research payment providers (docs)\n  ☐ Debugging test failures (experiments)\n\nUser: [selects 3 relevant items]\n\nClaude: \"Here''s what I found from your activity:\n- Merged PR #120: fix login timeout\n- Opened PR #125: feat: add OAuth flow\n- Reviewed PR #123 (approved), PR #456 (changes requested)\n- 5 commits in backend-api\n- [From Claude Code] Fix authentication timeout bug\n- [From Claude Code] Implement OAuth flow\n- [From Claude Code] Research payment providers\n\nAnything else you worked on yesterday that I missed?\"\nUser: \"No, that covers it\"\n\nClaude: \"What will you work on today?\"\nUser: \"Continue the OAuth feature and deploy to staging\"\n\nClaude: \"Any blockers?\"\nUser: \"No\"\n\nClaude: \"Any topic to bring up at the end of the daily?\"\nUser: \"Yes, I want to discuss the architecture of the new payments module\"\n\n[Claude generates update]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Output Example\n\n```markdown\n# Daily Update - 2026-01-22\n\n## Yesterday\n- Worked on authentication feature\n- Research on payment providers\n- Merged PR #120 (fix: login timeout)\n- Opened PR #125 (feat: add OAuth flow)\n\n## Today\n- Continue OAuth feature\n- Deploy to staging\n\n## Blockers\n- No blockers\n\n## PRs & Reviews\n- **Opened:** PR #125 - feat: add OAuth flow\n- **Merged:** PR #120 - fix: login timeout\n- **Reviews:** PR #123 (approved), PR #456 (changes requested)\n\n## Topics for Discussion\n- Architecture of the new payments module\n\n---\n*Links:*\n- https://github.com/org/repo/pull/125\n- https://github.com/org/repo/pull/120\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Avoid | Why (Expert Knowledge) | Instead |\n|-------|------------------------|---------|\n| Run gh/jira without asking | Users may have personal repos visible, or be in a sensitive project context they don''t want exposed | Always ask first, let user choose repos |\n| Assume current directory is the only project | Developers often work on 2-5 repos simultaneously (frontend, backend, infra) | Ask \"Which projects are you working on?\" |\n| Skip interview even with tool data | Tools capture WHAT happened but miss WHY and context (research, meetings, planning) | Interview is primary, tools supplement |\n| Generate update before all 4 questions | User might have critical blocker or discussion topic that changes the narrative | Complete interview, then generate |\n| Include raw commit messages | Commit messages are often cryptic (\"fix\", \"wip\") and don''t tell the story | Summarize into human-readable outcomes |\n| Ask for data after interview | Showing insights during interview makes questions smarter (\"I see you merged PR #123, anything else?\") | Pull data first, then interview with context |\n\n---\n\n## NEVER\n\n- **NEVER assume tools are configured** — Many devs have gh installed but not authenticated, or jira CLI pointing to wrong instance\n- **NEVER skip the \"Topics for Discussion\" question** — This is often the most valuable part of standup that tools can''t capture\n- **NEVER generate more than 15 bullets** — Standup should be <2 minutes to read; long updates lose the audience\n- **NEVER include ticket/PR numbers without context** — \"PROJ-123\" means nothing; always include title or summary\n- **NEVER pull data from repos user didn''t explicitly approve** — Even if you can see other repos, respect boundaries\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:02:34.066Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing automated daily standup meeting updates through interactive interviews.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化每日站立会议更新的生产力代理，通过交互式访谈实现更新。","ja":"毎日のスタンドアップミーティングの更新を自動化するために、インタラクティブなインタビューを通じて更新する必要がある生産性エージェントに最適です。","ko":"매일의 스탠드업 미팅 업데이트를 자동화하기 위해 대화형 인터뷰를 통해 업데이트하는 생산성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de productividad que necesitan actualizaciones de reuniones diarias automatizadas a través de entrevistas interactivas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de productivité ayant besoin de mises à jour de réunions quotidiennes automatisées via des entrevues interactives.","de":"Perfekt für Produktivitätsagenten, die automatisierte tägliche Besprechungs-Updates durch interaktive Interviews benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade que precisam de atualizações de reuniões diárias automatizadas por meio de entrevistas interativas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов производительности, которым требуются автоматические обновления ежедневных встреч через интерактивные интервью.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الإنتاجية التي تحتاج إلى تحديثات اجتماعات يومية آلية من خلال مقابلة تفاعلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate daily meeting updates via multiSelect interactions, leveraging Claude Code history, GitHub, and Jira CLI integrations for seamless data retrieval and user selection.","zh":"赋予代理人通过多选交互生成每日会议更新的能力，利用Claude Code历史记录、GitHub和Jira CLI集成实现无缝的数据检索和用户选择。","ja":"クラウドコードの履歴、GitHub、およびJira CLIの統合を利用して、エージェントがマルチセレクトのやり取りを介して毎日のミーティングの更新を生成できるようにします。","ko":"클라우드 코드 기록, 깃허브 및 지라 CLI 통합을 활용하여 에이전트가 다중 선택 상호 작용을 통해 일일 미팅 업데이트를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar actualizaciones de reuniones diarias a través de interacciones multiSelect, aprovechando la historia de Claude Code, GitHub y las integraciones de Jira CLI para una recuperación y selección de datos sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des mises à jour de réunions quotidiennes via des interactions multiSelect, en exploitant l''historique de Claude Code, GitHub et les intégrations Jira CLI pour une récupération et une sélection de données sans accroc.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, tägliche Besprechungs-Updates über multiSelect-Interaktionen zu generieren, indem es die Geschichte von Claude Code, GitHub und Jira-CLI-Integrationen für eine nahtlose Datenerfassung und Benutzerauswahl nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar atualizações de reuniões diárias por meio de interações multiSelect, aproveitando a história do Claude Code, GitHub e integrações da CLI do Jira para recuperação de dados e seleção de usuário sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать ежедневные обновления встреч через взаимодействия multiSelect, используя историю Claude Code, GitHub и интеграции Jira CLI для бесшовного извлечения данных и выбора пользователя.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من توليد تحديثات اجتماعات يومية من خلال تفاعلات متعددة، واستخدام سجل كلود كود، وجيت هاب، وتكاملات واجهة سطر الأوامر جيرا للحصول على بيانات المستخدم وتحديدها بسهولة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating daily standup reports","Generating meeting digests from Claude Code history","Pulling relevant session data from GitHub and Jira"],"zh":["自动化每日站立报告","从Claude Code历史记录生成会议摘要","从GitHub和Jira拉取相关会话数据"],"ja":["毎日のスタンドアップレポートの自動化","クラウドコードの履歴からミーティングの要約を生成する","GitHubとJiraから関連するセッションデータを取得する"],"ko":["매일의 스탠드업 리포트를 자동화하기","클라우드 코드 기록에서 미팅 요약을 생성하기","깃허브와 지라에서 관련 세션 데이터를 가져오기"],"es":["Automatización de informes de reuniones diarias","Generación de resúmenes de reuniones a partir de la historia de Claude Code","Extracción de datos de sesión relevantes de GitHub y Jira"],"fr":["Automatisation des rapports de réunions quotidiennes","Génération de résumés de réunions à partir de l''historique de Claude Code","Extraction de données de session pertinentes de GitHub et Jira"],"de":["Automatisierung von täglichen Besprechungsberichten","Erzeugung von Besprechungszusammenfassungen aus der Geschichte von Claude Code","Abruf von relevanten Sitzungsdaten von GitHub und Jira"],"pt":["Automatizar relatórios de reuniões diárias","Gerar resumos de reuniões a partir da história do Claude Code","Retirar dados de sessão relevantes do GitHub e Jira"],"ru":["Автоматизация ежедневных отчетов о встречах","Генерация сводок встреч из истории Claude Code","Извлечение соответствующих данных сеанса из GitHub и Jira"],"ar":["تحسين تقارير الاجتماعات اليومية","إنتاج ملخصات الاجتماعات من سجل كلود كود","استخراج بيانات الجلسة ذات الصلة من جيت هاب وجيرا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code, GitHub, or Jira CLI configuration","Needs user input for integration detection and data selection"],"zh":["需要Claude Code、GitHub或Jira CLI的配置","需要用户输入以检测集成和选择数据"],"ja":["クラウドコード、GitHub、またはJira CLIの構成が必要","統合の検出とデータの選択のためにユーザー入力が必要"],"ko":["클라우드 코드, 깃허브 또는 지라 CLI 구성이 필요함","통합 감지 및 데이터 선택을 위해 사용자 입력이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Claude Code, GitHub o Jira CLI","Necesita entrada de usuario para la detección de integración y selección de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Claude Code, GitHub ou Jira CLI","Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la détection d''intégration et la sélection de données"],"de":["Benötigt Konfiguration von Claude Code, GitHub oder Jira CLI","Benötigt Benutzereingabe für die Integrationserkennung und Datenauswahl"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Claude Code, GitHub ou Jira CLI","Necessita de entrada do usuário para detecção de integração e seleção de dados"],"ru":["Требует настройки Claude Code, GitHub или Jira CLI","Требует ввода пользователя для обнаружения интеграции и выбора данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين كلود كود، أو جيت هاب، أو واجهة سطر الأوامر جيرا","يحتاج إلى إدخال المستخدم لتحديد التكامل وتحديد البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('fierzone/agent-skills-standard/Flutter Dependency Injection (Injectable)', 'community', 'fierzone', 'agent-skills-standard', 'fierzone/agent-skills-standard', 'Flutter Dependency Injection (Injectable)', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z', '2026-02-18T09:02:24.278Z', NULL, '{"id":"fierzone/agent-skills-standard/Flutter Dependency Injection (Injectable)","name":"Flutter Dependency Injection (Injectable)","description":{"zh":"Flutter Injectable, ","ja":"Flutter Injectable","ko":"Flutter Injectable ","es":"Inyección de dependencias en Flutter con Injectable es una técnica para gestionar automáticamente las dependencias entre clases. Mejora la eficiencia y reduce la complejidad","fr":"L''injection de dépendances dans Flutter avec Injectable est une technique pour gérer automatiquement les dépendances entre les classes. Améliore l''efficacité et réduit la complexité","de":"Die Abhängigkeitsinjektion in Flutter mit Injectable ist eine Technik zur automatischen Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten zwischen Klassen. Verbessert die Effizienz und reduziert die Komplexität","pt":"O Injectable é uma biblioteca que simplifica a gestão de dependências de classes no Flutter. Ele utiliza o get_it para automatizar o registro e a injeção de dependências.","ru":"Injectable - это библиотека, которая упрощает управление зависимостями классов в Flutter. Она использует get_it для автоматизации регистрации и внедрения зависимостей.","ar":"Injectable هو مكتبة يُسهل إدارة الاعتماديات الفصول في Flutter. هو يستخدم get_it لتحسين التسجيل والحقن التلقائي للاعتماديات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Flutter Injectable ","ja":"Flutter ","ko":"Flutter Injectable ","es":"Inyección de dependencias en Flutter con Injectable","fr":"Injection de dépendances Flutter avec Injectable","de":"Flutter-Abhängigkeitsinjektion mit Injectable","pt":"Injeção de