 Abhängigkeiten","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten mit get_it","Verwendung von @injectable-Anmerkungen","Unterstützung für @LazySingleton","Organisierte Struktur mit Modulen","Einfache und effiziente Implementierung"],"pt":["Gestão automática de dependências de classes","Utilização do get_it para registro e injeção de dependências","Suporte a injeção de dependências lazy","Melhoria da organização e escalabilidade do aplicativo","Simplificação da gestão de dependências de terceiros"],"ru":["Автоматическое управление зависимостями классов","Использование get_it для регистрации и внедрения зависимостей","Поддержка отложенной внедрения зависимостей","Улучшение организации и масштабируемости приложения","Упрощение управления зависимостями третьих сторон"],"ar":["إدارة تلقائية للاعتماديات الفصول","استخدام get_it لتسجيل وحقن الاعتماديات","دعم حقن الاعتماد المُرتّب","تحسين التنظيم وقابلية التوسّع للتطبيق","تبسيط إدارة الاعتماديات الخارجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Flutter Injectable","get_it","Dependency Injection","Flutter","Modular Structure","Automated Registration","LazySingleton"],"ja":["Flutter Injectable","get_it","Dependency Injection","Flutter","","","LazySingleton"],"ko":["Flutter Injectable","get_it","Dependency Injection","Flutter","","","LazySingleton"],"es":["inyección de dependencias","flutter","injectable","get_it","desarrollo de software","patrones de diseño","eficiencia","complejidad","registro automático"],"fr":["injection de dépendances","flutter","injectable","get_it","développement de logiciels","modèles de conception","efficacité","complexité","enregistrement automatique"],"de":["abhängigkeitsinjektion","flutter","injectable","get_it","software-entwicklung","entwurfsmuster","effizienz","komplexität","automatisches registrieren"],"pt":["injeção de dependência","flutter","injectable","get_it","gestão de dependências","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","design de software","programação"],"ru":["внедрение зависимостей","flutter","injectable","get_it","управление зависимостями","разработка приложений","проектирование программного обеспечения","программирование"],"ar":["حقن الاعتماد","flutter","injectable","get_it","إدارة الاعتماديات","تطوير التطبيقات","تصميم البرمجيات","البرمجة"]}},"owner":"fierzone","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"fierzone/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Flutter Dependency Injection (Injectable)","description":"Standards for automated service locator setup using injectable and get_it.","bodyPreview":"# Dependency Injection\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\nAutomated class dependency management using `get_it` and `injectable`.\n\n## Structure\n\n```text\ncore/injection/\n├── injection.dart # Initialization & setup\n└── modules/ # Third-party dependency modules (Dio, Storage)\n```\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **Automated Registration**: Use `@injectable` annotations; avoid manual registry calls.\n- **@LazySingleton**: Default for repositories, services, and data sources (init on demand).\n- **@injectable","body":"# Dependency Injection\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\nAutomated class dependency management using `get_it` and `injectable`.\n\n## Structure\n\n```text\ncore/injection/\n├── injection.dart # Initialization & setup\n└── modules/ # Third-party dependency modules (Dio, Storage)\n```\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n- **Automated Registration**: Use `@injectable` annotations; avoid manual registry calls.\n- **@LazySingleton**: Default for repositories, services, and data sources (init on demand).\n- **@injectable (Factory)**: Default for BLoCs to ensure state resets on every request.\n- **Abstract Injection**: Always register implementations as abstract interfaces (`as: IService`).\n- **Modules**: Use `@module` for registering third-party instances (e.g., `Dio`, `SharedPreferences`).\n- **Constructor Injection**: Use mandatory constructor parameters; `injectable` resolves them.\n- **Test Mocks**: Swap implementations in `setUp` using `getIt.registerLazySingleton` for testing.\n\n## Reference & Examples\n\nFor module configuration and initialization templates:\nSee [references/REFERENCE.md](references/REFERENCE.md).\n\n## Related Topics\n\nlayer-based-clean-architecture | testing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:02:24.278Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile App Agents requiring efficient Flutter application development with automated dependency management using get_it and injectable.","zh":"适用于需要高效Flutter应用开发的移动应用代理，具有使用get_it和injectable自动化依赖管理的功能。","ja":"get_itとinjectableを使用した自動化された依存関係管理を必要とするモバイルアプリエージェント向けのFlutterアプリケーション開発に最適です。","ko":"get_it과 injectable을 사용한 자동화된 의존성 관리가 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트를 위한 Flutter 애플리케이션 개발에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que requieren un desarrollo de aplicaciones Flutter eficiente con gestión de dependencias automatizada utilizando get_it e injectable.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Applications Mobiles nécessitant un développement d''applications Flutter efficace avec une gestion de dépendances automatisée en utilisant get_it et injectable.","de":"Ideal für Mobile App-Agents, die eine effiziente Flutter-Anwendungsentwicklung mit automatisierter Abhängigkeitsverwaltung unter Verwendung von get_it und injectable erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que exigem desenvolvimento de aplicativos Flutter eficiente com gerenciamento de dependências automatizado usando get_it e injectable.","ru":"Идеально для агентов мобильных приложений, требующих эффективного разработки приложений Flutter с автоматизированным управлением зависимостями с помощью get_it и injectable.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطبيقات المتنقلة التي تتطلب تطوير تطبيقات Flutter فعالة مع إدارة التبعيات الآلية باستخدام get_it و injectable."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline Flutter app development by utilizing automated class dependency management with @injectable annotations, avoiding manual registry calls, and implementing @LazySingleton for repositories, services, and data sources, all while leveraging get_it for initialization and setup.","zh":"赋予代理人使用@injectable注释实现自动化类依赖管理、避免手动注册调用、为仓库、服务和数据源实现@LazySingleton，并利用get_it进行初始化和设置，从而简化Flutter应用开发。","ja":"@injectable注釈を使用した自動化されたクラス依存関係管理を実現し、手動での登録呼び出しを避け、リポジトリ、サービス、データソースに対して@LazySingletonを実装し、get_itを使用して初期化と設定を行うことで、Flutterアプリ開発を効率化します。","ko":"@injectable 注释을 사용하여 자동화된 클래스 종속성 관리를 구현하고, 수동 등록 호출을 피하고, 저장소, 서비스 및 데이터 소스에 대해 @LazySingleton을 구현하며, get_it을 사용하여 초기화 및 설정을 수행하여 Flutter 앱 개발을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el desarrollo de aplicaciones Flutter utilizando la gestión automática de dependencias de clases con anotaciones @injectable, evitando llamadas de registro manuales e implementando @LazySingleton para repositorios, servicios y fuentes de datos, todo mientras aprovecha get_it para la inicialización y configuración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser le développement d''applications Flutter en utilisant la gestion automatisée des dépendances de classes avec des annotations @injectable, en évitant les appels de registre manuels et en mettant en œuvre @LazySingleton pour les référentiels, les services et les sources de données, le tout en exploitant get_it pour l''initialisation et la configuration.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Flutter-App-Entwicklung durch die Verwendung der automatischen Klassenabhängigkeitsverwaltung mit @injectable-Anmerkungen zu optimieren, manuelle Registrierungsanrufe zu vermeiden und @LazySingleton für Repositorys, Dienste und Datenquellen zu implementieren, alles unter Ausnutzung von get_it für Initialisierung und Einrichtung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a simplificar o desenvolvimento de aplicativos Flutter, utilizando o gerenciamento automatizado de dependência de classes com anotações @injectable, evitando chamadas de registro manuais e implementando @LazySingleton para repositórios, serviços e fontes de dados, tudo isso aproveitando get_it para inicialização e configuração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью упростить разработку приложений Flutter, используя автоматизированное управление зависимостями классов с помощью аннотаций @injectable, избегая ручных вызовов регистрации и реализуя @LazySingleton для хранилищ, сервисов и источников данных, все это при помощи get_it для инициализации и настройки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تبسيط تطوير تطبيقات Flutter، باستخدام إدارة التبعيات الطبقات التلقائية مع تعليقات @injectable، وتجنب المكالمات التسجيل اليدوية وتنفيذ @LazySingleton للمخازن والخدمات ومصادر البيانات، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من get_it للت初ية والإعداد."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating dependency registration with @injectable","Implementing lazy singleton instances for repositories and services","Organizing third-party dependencies into modular structures"],"zh":["使用@injectable自动化依赖注册","为仓库和服务实现懒加载单例","将第三方依赖组织到模块结构中"],"ja":["@injectableを使用した依存関係登録の自動化","リポジトリとサービスに対するLazy Singletonの実装","第三者依存関係をモジュラー構造に組織する"],"ko":["@injectable을 사용한 의존성 등록 자동화"," 저장소 및 서비스를 위한 Lazy Singleton 구현","제3자 의존성 모듈 구조화"],"es":["Automatizar el registro de dependencias con @injectable","Implementar instancias de singleton perezosas para repositorios y servicios","Organizar dependencias de terceros en estructuras modulares"],"fr":["Automatiser l''enregistrement des dépendances avec @injectable","Mettre en œuvre des instances de singleton paresseuses pour les référentiels et les services","Organiser les dépendances tierces en structures modulaires"],"de":["Automatisieren der Registrierung von Abhängigkeiten mit @injectable","Implementieren von faulen Singleton-Instanzen für Repositorys und Dienste","Organisieren von Drittanbieter-Abhängigkeiten in modularen Strukturen"],"pt":["Automatizar registro de dependências com @injectable","Implementar instâncias singleton preguiçosas para repositórios e serviços","Organizar dependências de terceiros em estruturas modulares"],"ru":["Автоматизировать регистрацию зависимостей с помощью @injectable","Реализовать ленивые одиночные экземпляры для хранилищ и сервисов","Организовать зависимости третьих сторон в модульные структуры"],"ar":["تأتمتة تسجيل التبعيات مع @injectable","تنفيذ مثيلات Singleton الكسولة للمخازن والخدمات","تنظيم التبعيات الثالثة في هياكل متجانسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires get_it and injectable libraries","Flutter-specific implementation"],"zh":["需要get_it和injectable库","仅适用于Flutter实现"],"ja":["get_itとinjectableライブラリが必要","Flutter実装専用"],"ko":["get_it 및 injectable 라이브러리 필요","Flutter 구현 전용"],"es":["Requiere las bibliotecas get_it e injectable","Implementación específica de Flutter"],"fr":["Nécessite les bibliothèques get_it et injectable","Implémentation spécifique à Flutter"],"de":["Benötigt die Bibliotheken get_it und injectable","Flutter-spezifische Implementierung"],"pt":["Exige bibliotecas get_it e injectable","Implementação específica do Flutter"],"ru":["Требует библиотек get_it и injectable","Реализация специфичная для Flutter"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبات get_it و injectable","تنفيذ خاص بال Flutter"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
