s branches","Lister tous les worktrees","Supprimer des worktrees après fusion","Travailler sur plusieurs branches en même temps"],"de":["Worktrees für Feature-Branches erstellen","Worktrees mit neuen Branches erstellen","Alle Worktrees auflisten","Worktrees nach der Zusammenführung entfernen","Auf mehreren Branches gleichzeitig arbeiten"],"pt":["Crie worktrees para branches de recursos","Crie worktrees com branches novos","Liste todos os worktrees","Remova worktrees após mesclagem","Trabalhe em múltiplas branches simultaneamente","Evite stash ou commit de trabalho em andamento"],"ru":["Создайте worktrees для функциональных веток","Создайте worktrees с новыми ветками","Перечислите все worktrees","Удалите worktrees после слияния","Работайте с несколькими ветками одновременно","Избегайте stash или commit работы в процессе"],"ar":["أنشئ worktrees لفرع الميزات","أنشئ worktrees مع فروع جديدة","قائمة جميع worktrees","إزالة worktrees بعد الدمج","العمل على فروع متعددة في نفس الوقت","تجنب stash أو commit العمل قيد التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 高级技巧","worktree","Git 多分支","Git 同时工作","Git stashing","Git 提交"],"ja":["Git アドバンスド","worktree","Git 複数ブランチ","Git 同時作業","Git ステージング","Git コミット"],"ko":["Git 고급 기능","worktree","Git 여러 분기","Git 동시 작업","Git stash","Git 커밋"],"es":["git avanzado","worktrees","ramas git","desarrollo de software","control de versiones","git worktree","trabajo en equipo","colaboración en código"],"fr":["git avancé","worktrees","branches git","développement de logiciels","contrôle de versions","git worktree","travail d''équipe","collaboration de code"],"de":["git erweitert","worktrees","git-branchs","software-entwicklung","versionskontrolle","git worktree","teamarbeit","code-kollaboration"],"pt":["git avançado","worktrees","branches","stash","commit","repositório","desenvolvimento","controle de versão"],"ru":["расширенный git","worktrees","ветки","stash","commit","репозиторий","разработка","контроль версий"],"ar":["جيت متقدم","worktrees","فروع","stash","commit","مستودع","التطوير","مراقبة الإصدار"]}},"owner":"haniakrim21","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"haniakrim21/everything-claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-advanced","description":"Advanced git workflows including worktrees, bisect, interactive rebase, hooks, and recovery techniques","bodyPreview":"# Git Advanced\n\n## Worktrees\n\n```bash\n# Create a worktree for a feature branch (avoids stashing)\ngit worktree add ../feature-auth feature/auth\n\n# Create a worktree with a new branch\ngit worktree add ../hotfix-123 -b hotfix/123 origin/main\n\n# List all worktrees\ngit worktree list\n\n# Remove a worktree after merging\ngit worktree remove ../feature-auth\n```\n\nWorktrees let you work on multiple branches simultaneously without stashing or committing WIP. Each worktree has its own working directory but sh","body":"# Git Advanced\n\n## Worktrees\n\n```bash\n# Create a worktree for a feature branch (avoids stashing)\ngit worktree add ../feature-auth feature/auth\n\n# Create a worktree with a new branch\ngit worktree add ../hotfix-123 -b hotfix/123 origin/main\n\n# List all worktrees\ngit worktree list\n\n# Remove a worktree after merging\ngit worktree remove ../feature-auth\n```\n\nWorktrees let you work on multiple branches simultaneously without stashing or committing WIP. Each worktree has its own working directory but shares the same `.git` repository.\n\n## Bisect\n\n```bash\n# Start bisect, mark current as bad and known good commit\ngit bisect start\ngit bisect bad HEAD\ngit bisect good v1.5.0\n\n# Git checks out a midpoint commit. Test it, then mark:\ngit bisect good   # if this commit works\ngit bisect bad    # if this commit is broken\n\n# Automate with a test script\ngit bisect start HEAD v1.5.0\ngit bisect run npm test\n\n# When done, reset\ngit bisect reset\n```\n\nBisect performs binary search across commits to find which commit introduced a bug. Automated bisect with `run` is the fastest approach.\n\n## Interactive Rebase\n\n```bash\n# Rebase last 5 commits interactively\ngit rebase -i HEAD~5\n\n# Common operations in the editor:\n# pick   - keep commit as-is\n# reword - change commit message\n# edit   - stop to amend the commit\n# squash - merge into previous commit, keep both messages\n# fixup  - merge into previous commit, discard this message\n# drop   - remove the commit entirely\n\n# Rebase feature branch onto latest main\ngit fetch origin\ngit rebase origin/main\n\n# Continue after resolving conflicts\ngit rebase --continue\n\n# Abort if things go wrong\ngit rebase --abort\n```\n\n## Git Hooks\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/sh\n# .git/hooks/pre-commit\n\n# Run linter on staged files only\nSTAGED_FILES=$(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=d | grep -E ''\\.(ts|tsx|js|jsx)$'')\nif [ -n \"$STAGED_FILES\" ]; then\n  npx eslint $STAGED_FILES --fix\n  git add $STAGED_FILES\nfi\n```\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/sh\n# .git/hooks/commit-msg\n\n# Enforce conventional commit format\nCOMMIT_MSG=$(cat \"$1\")\nPATTERN=\"^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|test|chore)(\\(.+\\))?: .{1,72}$\"\n\nif ! echo \"$COMMIT_MSG\" | head -1 | grep -qE \"$PATTERN\"; then\n  echo \"Error: Commit message must follow Conventional Commits format\"\n  echo \"Example: feat(auth): add OAuth2 login flow\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/sh\n# .git/hooks/pre-push\n\n# Run tests before pushing\nnpm test\nif [ $? -ne 0 ]; then\n  echo \"Tests failed. Push aborted.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n## Recovery Techniques\n\n```bash\n# Undo last commit but keep changes staged\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\n# Recover a deleted branch using reflog\ngit reflog\ngit checkout -b recovered-branch HEAD@{3}\n\n# Recover a file from a specific commit\ngit checkout abc1234 -- path/to/file.ts\n\n# Find lost commits (dangling after reset or rebase)\ngit fsck --lost-found\ngit show <dangling-commit-sha>\n\n# Undo a rebase\ngit reflog\ngit reset --hard HEAD@{5}  # point before rebase started\n```\n\n## Useful Aliases\n\n```bash\n# ~/.gitconfig\n[alias]\n  lg = log --graph --oneline --decorate --all\n  st = status -sb\n  co = checkout\n  unstage = reset HEAD --\n  last = log -1 HEAD --stat\n  branches = branch -a --sort=-committerdate\n  stash-all = stash push --include-untracked\n  conflicts = diff --name-only --diff-filter=U\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Force-pushing to shared branches without `--force-with-lease`\n- Rebasing commits that have already been pushed and shared\n- Committing large binary files without Git LFS\n- Using `git add .` without reviewing `git diff --staged`\n- Not using `.gitignore` for build artifacts, dependencies, and secrets\n- Keeping long-lived feature branches instead of merging frequently\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Worktrees used for parallel branch work instead of stashing\n- [ ] `git bisect run` automates bug-finding with a test command\n- [ ] Interactive rebase cleans up commits before merging to main\n- [ ] Pre-commit hooks run linting on staged files\n- [ ] Commit message format enforced via commit-msg hook\n- [ ] `--force-with-lease` used instead of `--force` when force-pushing\n- [ ] Reflog consulted before any destructive operation\n- [ ] `.gitignore` covers build outputs, dependencies, and environment files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:02:46.915Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Version Control Agents requiring simultaneous branch management and worktree functionality.","zh":"适用于需要同时管理分支和工作树的版本控制代理的理想选择。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが同時にブランチ管理とワークツリー機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"동시에 브랜치 관리와 워크트리 기능이 필요한 버전 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de control de versiones que requieren una gestión de ramas y funcionalidad de worktree simultáneas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant une gestion de branches et une fonctionnalité de worktree simultanées.","de":"Ideal für Version-Control-Agents, die eine gleichzeitige Verwaltung von Branches und Worktree-Funktionalität erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Controle de Versão que exigem gerenciamento de branch simultâneo e funcionalidade de worktree.","ru":"Идеально для агентов контроля версий, требующих одновременного управления ветками и функциональности worktree.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التحكم في الإصدار التي تتطلب إدارة فرع متزامن ووظيفة شجرة العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple Git branches simultaneously using worktrees, avoiding stashing or committing work-in-progress, and leveraging commands like ''git worktree add'' and ''git worktree list'' for seamless repository management.","zh":"使代理能够使用工作树同时管理多个Git分支，避免暂存或提交工作进度，并利用诸如''git worktree add''和''git worktree list''命令实现无缝的仓库管理。","ja":"エージェントがワークツリーを使用して複数のGitブランチを同時に管理できるようにし、作業中の変更を一時保存またはコミットすることを避け、''git worktree add''や''git worktree list''などのコマンドを使用してリポジトリ管理をスムーズに行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 워크트리를 사용하여 여러 개의 Git 브랜치를 동시에 관리할 수 있도록 하여 작업 중인 변경 사항을 임시 저장 또는 커밋하지 않으며, ''git worktree add'' 및 ''git worktree list''와 같은 명령을 사용하여 리포지토리 관리를 원활하게 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar múltiples ramas de Git simultáneamente utilizando worktrees, evitando el almacenamiento temporal o el compromiso de trabajo en curso, y aprovechando comandos como ''git worktree add'' y ''git worktree list'' para una gestión de repositorio sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs branches Git simultanément en utilisant des worktrees, en évitant de stocker ou de valider le travail en cours, et en exploitant des commandes comme ''git worktree add'' et ''git worktree list'' pour une gestion de référentiel sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehrere Git-Branches simultan mit Worktrees zu verwalten, ohne Arbeit im Bearbeitungsmodus zu speichern oder zu committen, und nutzt Befehle wie ''git worktree add'' und ''git worktree list'' für eine reibungslose Repository-Verwaltung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem várias branches Git simultaneamente usando worktrees, evitando estocagem ou comprometimento de trabalho em andamento, e aproveitando comandos como ''git worktree add'' e ''git worktree list'' para gerenciamento de repositório sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять несколькими ветками Git одновременно с помощью worktree, избегая stash или commit незавершенной работы, и используя команды như ''git worktree add'' и ''git worktree list'' для бесперебойного управления репозиторием.","ar":"تمكين العوامل من إدارة فروع متعددة من جيت同時 باستخدام أشجار العمل، وتجنب تخزين أو إلتزام العمل قيد التنفيذ، واستخدام أوامر مثل ''git worktree add'' و ''git worktree list'' من أجل إدارة مستودع بدون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating worktrees for feature branches","Managing hotfix branches with separate working directories","Listing and removing worktrees after merging"],"zh":["为功能分支创建工作树","使用单独的工作目录管理热修复分支","合并后列出和删除工作树"],"ja":["機能ブランチ用のワークツリーを作成する","独立した作業ディレクトリを使用してホットフィックスブランチを管理する","マージ後にワークツリーを一覧表示して削除する"],"ko":["기능 브랜치에 대한 워크트리 생성","개별 작업 디렉토리를 사용하여 핫픽스 브랜치 관리","병합 후 워크트리 나열 및 제거"],"es":["Crear worktrees para ramas de características","Administrar ramas de corrección de errores con directorios de trabajo separados","Listar y eliminar worktrees después de la fusión"],"fr":["Créer des worktrees pour les branches de fonctionnalités","Gérer les branches de correction de bogues avec des répertoires de travail séparés","Lister et supprimer les worktrees après la fusion"],"de":["Worktrees für Funktionsbranchs erstellen","Hotfix-Branches mit separaten Arbeitsverzeichnissen verwalten","Worktrees nach dem Merge auflisten und entfernen"],"pt":["Criar worktrees para branches de recursos","Gerenciar branches de hotfix com diretórios de trabalho separados","Listar e remover worktrees após mesclagem"],"ru":["Создание worktree для веток функций","Управление ветками hotfix с отдельными рабочими директориями","Перечисление и удаление worktree после слияния"],"ar":["إنشاء أشجار العمل لفروع الميزات","إدارة فروع الإصلاح السريع مع مصادقة العمل المنفصلة","قائمة و إزالة أشجار العمل بعد الدمج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Limited to Git version control system"],"zh":["需要Git安装","仅限Git版本控制系统"],"ja":["Gitのインストールが必要","Gitバージョン管理システムのみ"],"ko":["Git 설치 필요","Git 버전 관리 시스템만 해당"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Git","Limitado al sistema de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Git","Limité au système de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation","Begrenzt auf Git-Versionssystem"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Git","Limitado ao sistema de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требует установки Git","Ограничен системой контроля версий Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت جيت","محدود بنظام التحكم في الإصدار جيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
