генты","документация","рабочие процессы","выполнение","возобновление работы","ясность","точность","оптимизация"],"ar":["صحة المشروع","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","وثائق","تدفقات العمل","تشغيل","استئناف العمل","وضوح","دقة","تحسين"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-health","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Project Health: AI-Agent Readiness Auditing\n\n**Status**: Active\n**Updated**: 2026-01-30\n**Focus**: Ensuring documentation and workflows are executable by AI agents\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill evaluates project health from an **AI-agent perspective** - not just whether docs are well-written for humans, but whether future Claude Code sessions can:\n\n1. **Understand** the documentation without ambiguity\n2. **Execute** workflows by following instructions literally\n3. **Resume** work effectively with p","body":"# Project Health: AI-Agent Readiness Auditing\n\n**Status**: Active\n**Updated**: 2026-01-30\n**Focus**: Ensuring documentation and workflows are executable by AI agents\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill evaluates project health from an **AI-agent perspective** - not just whether docs are well-written for humans, but whether future Claude Code sessions can:\n\n1. **Understand** the documentation without ambiguity\n2. **Execute** workflows by following instructions literally\n3. **Resume** work effectively with proper context handoff\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Before handing off a project to another AI session\n- When onboarding AI agents to contribute to a codebase\n- After major refactors to ensure docs are still AI-executable\n- When workflows fail because agents \"didn''t understand\"\n- Periodic health checks for AI-maintained projects\n\n## Agent Selection Guide\n\n| Situation | Use Agent | Why |\n|-----------|-----------|-----|\n| \"Will another Claude session understand this?\" | **context-auditor** | Checks for ambiguous references, implicit knowledge, incomplete examples |\n| \"Will this workflow actually execute?\" | **workflow-validator** | Verifies steps are discrete, ordered, and include verification |\n| \"Can a new session pick up where I left off?\" | **handoff-checker** | Validates SESSION.md, phase tracking, context preservation |\n| Full project health audit | All three | Comprehensive AI-readiness assessment |\n\n## Key Principles\n\n### 1. Literal Interpretation\n\nAI agents follow instructions literally. Documentation that works for humans (who fill in gaps) may fail for agents.\n\n**Human-friendly** (ambiguous):\n> \"Update the config file with your settings\"\n\n**AI-friendly** (explicit):\n> \"Edit `wrangler.jsonc` and set `account_id` to your Cloudflare account ID (find it at dash.cloudflare.com → Overview → Account ID)\"\n\n### 2. Explicit Over Implicit\n\nNever assume the agent knows:\n- Which file you mean\n- What \"obvious\" next steps are\n- Environment state or prerequisites\n- What success looks like\n\n### 3. Verification at Every Step\n\nAgents can''t tell if something \"feels right\". Include verification:\n- Expected output after each command\n- How to check if a step succeeded\n- What to do if it failed\n\n## Agents\n\n### context-auditor\n\n**Purpose**: Evaluate AI-readability of documentation\n\n**Checks**:\n- Instructions use imperative verbs (actionable)\n- File paths are explicit (not \"the config file\")\n- Success criteria are measurable\n- No ambiguous references (\"that thing\", \"as discussed\")\n- Code examples are complete (not fragments)\n- Dependencies/prerequisites stated explicitly\n- Error handling documented\n\n**Output**: AI-Readability Score (0-100) with specific issues\n\n### workflow-validator\n\n**Purpose**: Verify processes are executable when followed literally\n\n**Checks**:\n- Steps are discrete and ordered\n- Each step has clear input/output\n- No implicit knowledge required\n- Environment assumptions documented\n- Verification step after each action\n- Failure modes and recovery documented\n- No \"obvious\" steps omitted\n\n**Output**: Executability Score (0-100) with step-by-step analysis\n\n### handoff-checker\n\n**Purpose**: Ensure session continuity for multi-session work\n\n**Checks**:\n- SESSION.md or equivalent exists\n- Current phase/status clear\n- Next actions documented\n- Blockers/decisions needed listed\n- Context for future sessions preserved\n- Git checkpoint pattern in use\n- Architecture decisions documented with rationale\n\n**Output**: Handoff Quality Score (0-100) with continuity gaps\n\n## Templates\n\n### AI-Readable Documentation Template\n\nSee `templates/AI_READABLE_DOC.md` for a template that ensures AI-readability.\n\nKey sections:\n- **Prerequisites** (explicit environment/state requirements)\n- **Steps** (numbered, discrete, with verification)\n- **Expected Output** (what success looks like)\n- **Troubleshooting** (common failures and fixes)\n\n### Handoff Checklist\n\nSee `templates/HANDOFF_CHECKLIST.md` for ensuring clean session handoffs.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### 1. \"See Above\" References\n\n```markdown\n# Bad\nAs mentioned above, configure the database.\n\n# Good\nConfigure the database by running:\n`npx wrangler d1 create my-db`\n```\n\n### 2. Implicit File Paths\n\n```markdown\n# Bad\nUpdate the config with your API key.\n\n# Good\nAdd your API key to `.dev.vars`:\n```\nAPI_KEY=your-key-here\n```\n```\n\n### 3. Missing Verification\n\n```markdown\n# Bad\nRun the migration.\n\n# Good\nRun the migration:\n`npx wrangler d1 migrations apply my-db --local`\n\nVerify with:\n`npx wrangler d1 execute my-db --local --command \"SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type=''table''\"`\n\nExpected output: Should show your table names.\n```\n\n### 4. Assumed Context\n\n```markdown\n# Bad\nNow deploy (you know the drill).\n\n# Good\nDeploy to production:\n`npx wrangler deploy`\n\nVerify deployment at: https://your-worker.your-subdomain.workers.dev\n```\n\n## Relationship to Other Tools\n\n| Tool | Focus | Audience |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| `project-docs-auditor` | Traditional doc quality (links, freshness, structure) | Human readers |\n| `project-health` skill | AI-agent readiness (executability, clarity, handoff) | Claude sessions |\n| `docs-workflow` skill | Creating/managing specific doc files | Both |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Full audit**: \"Run all project-health agents on this repo\"\n2. **Check one aspect**: \"Use context-auditor to check AI-readability\"\n3. **Before handoff**: \"Use handoff-checker before I end this session\"\n\n## Success Metrics\n\nA healthy project scores:\n- **Context Auditor**: 80+ (AI can understand without clarification)\n- **Workflow Validator**: 90+ (steps execute literally without failure)\n- **Handoff Checker**: 85+ (new session can resume immediately)\n\nProjects below these thresholds have documentation debt that will slow future AI sessions.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:01:58.193Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing advanced project auditing and workflow execution capabilities.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等需要高级项目审计和工作流执行能力的 AI 代理。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの、高度なプロジェクト監査とワークフロー実行機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드, 오토 GPT, 랭체인 등 고급 프로젝트 감사 및 워크플ロー 실행 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de auditoría de proyectos y ejecución de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités avancées d''audit de projet et d''exécution de flux de travail.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die erweiterte Projekt-Audit- und Workflow-Ausführungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de auditoria de projetos e execução de fluxos de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности аудита проектов и выполнения рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوسائط الذكية مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لمراجعة المشاريع وتنفيذ سير العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate project health by ensuring documentation clarity, executable workflows, and effective work resumption using literal instruction following and workflow execution protocols.","zh":"使代理能够通过确保文档清晰、可执行的工作流和有效的工作恢复（使用字面指令跟随和工作流执行协议）来评估项目健康状况。","ja":"代理が、文書の明確性、実行可能なワークフロー、およびリテラルな指示の遵守とワークフロー実行プロトコルを使用した効果的な作業の再開を確保することで、プロジェクトのヘルス状態を評価できるようにします。","ko":"代理가 문서의明確性, 실행 가능한 워크플로 및 리터럴한 지시의 준수와 워크플로우 실행 프로토콜을 사용한 효과적인 작업 재개를 보장함으로써 프로젝트 건강 상태를 평가할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar la salud del proyecto asegurando la claridad de la documentación, flujos de trabajo ejecutables y una reanudación efectiva del trabajo utilizando protocolos de seguimiento de instrucciones literales y ejecución de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer la santé du projet en garantissant la clarté de la documentation, des flux de travail exécutables et une reprise de travail efficace en utilisant des protocoles de suivi d''instructions littérales et d''exécution de flux de travail.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Projektgesundheit zu bewerten, indem die Klarheit der Dokumentation, ausführbare Workflows und eine effektive Wiederaufnahme der Arbeit unter Verwendung von Protokollen für die wörtliche Anweisungsverfolgung und Workflow-Ausführung sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar a saúde do projeto garantindo clareza da documentação, fluxos de trabalho executáveis e retomada eficaz do trabalho usando seguimento de instruções literais e protocolos de execução de fluxos de trabalho.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценить здоровье проекта, гарантируя ясность документации, выполнение рабочих процессов и эффективное возобновление работы с помощью буквального выполнения инструкций и протоколов выполнения рабочих процессов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تقييم صحة المشروع من خلال ضمان وضوح المستندات وسير العمل القابل للتنفيذ واستئناف العمل الفعال باستخدام اتباع تعليمات حرفية وبروتوكولات تنفيذ سير العمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing documentation for AI-agent executability","Validating workflow instructions for literal execution","Ensuring seamless work resumption by AI agents"],"zh":["审计 AI 代理可执行的文档","验证工作流指令以进行字面执行","确保 AI 代理的无缝工作恢复"],"ja":["AI エージェントによる実行可能な文書の監査","リテラルな実行のためのワークフロー指令の検証","AI エージェントによる無慣工作再開の確保"],"ko":["AI 에이전트에 의한 실행 가능한 문서의 감사","리터럴한 실행을 위한 워크플로우 지침의 검증","AI 에이전트에 의한 무중단 작업 재개의 보장"],"es":["Auditoría de documentación para la ejecutabilidad de los agentes de IA","Validación de instrucciones de flujo de trabajo para la ejecución literal","Garantía de una reanudación de trabajo sin problemas por parte de los agentes de IA"],"fr":["Audit de la documentation pour l''exécutabilité des agents IA","Validation des instructions de flux de travail pour l''exécution littérale","Assurance d''une reprise de travail sans problème par les agents IA"],"de":["Prüfung der Dokumentation auf die Ausführbarkeit durch KI-Agents","Validierung von Workflow-Anweisungen für die wörtliche Ausführung","Sicherstellung einer nahtlosen Wiederaufnahme der Arbeit durch KI-Agents"],"pt":["Auditoria de documentação para executabilidade de agentes de IA","Validação de instruções de fluxo de trabalho para execução literal","Garantia de retomada de trabalho sem interrupção por agentes de IA"],"ru":["Проверка документации на выполнимость агентами ИИ","Валидация инструкций рабочего процесса для буквального выполнения","Обеспечение бесперебойного возобновления работы агентами ИИ"],"ar":["مراجعة وثائق لتنفيذ عمليات الوسائط الذكية","تحقق من تعليمات سير العمل لتنفيذ حرفي","ضمان استئناف العمل دون انقطاع من قبل عمليات الوسائط الذكية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires accessible project documentation","Limited to evaluating workflows executable by AI agents"],"zh":["需要可访问的项目文档","仅限于评估由 AI 代理可执行的工作流"],"ja":["アクセス可能なプロジェクト文書が必要","AI エージェントによって実行可能なワークフローのみを評価可能"],"ko":["접근 가능한 프로젝트 문서가 필요","AI 에이전트에 의해 실행 가능한 워크플로만 평가 가능"],"es":["Requiere documentación de proyecto accesible","Limitado a la evaluación de flujos de trabajo ejecutables por agentes de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite une documentation de projet accessible","Limité à l''évaluation des flux de travail exécutables par les agents IA"],"de":["Benötigt zugängliche Projekt-Dokumentation","Begrenzt auf die Bewertung von Workflows, die von KI-Agents ausgeführt werden können"],"pt":["Requer documentação de projeto acessível","Limitado à avaliação de fluxos de trabalho executáveis por agentes de IA"],"ru":["Требуется доступная документация проекта","Ограничен оценкой рабочих процессов, которые могут быть выполнены агентами ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب وثائق مشروع يمكن الوصول إليها","محدود بتقييم سير العمل التي يمكن تنفيذها بواسطة عمليات الوسائط الذكية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
