if","Connexion des systèmes d''intelligence artificielle avec des outils externes","Prise en charge du protocole de contexte de modèle","Modèles de prompt prédéfinis","Accès aux ressources de données externes"],"de":["Skalierbare Serverarchitektur","Verbindung von KI-Systemen mit externen Tools","Unterstützung des Modellkontextprotokolls","Vordefinierte Prompt-Vorlagen","Zugriff auf externe Datenressourcen"],"pt":["Conexão de sistemas de IA com ferramentas externas","Acesso a fontes de dados externas","Uso de prompt templates pré-definidos","Arquitetura de servidor flexível","Integração com recursos de IA","Suporte a vários protocolos de comunicação"],"ru":["Подключение систем ИИ к внешним инструментам","Доступ к внешним источникам данных","Использование предварительно определенных шаблонов запросов","Гибкая архитектура сервера","Интеграция с ресурсами ИИ","Поддержка нескольких протоколов связи"],"ar":["ربط أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي بأدوات خارجية","الوصول إلى مصادر بيانات خارجية","استخدام قوالب طلب مسبقة التعريف","هيكل خادم مرن","التكامل مع موارد الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم بروتوكولات اتصال متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCP Builder","Model Context Protocol","AI 系统连接","服务器架构","工具","资源","提示","编程语言"],"ja":["MCP Builder","Model Context Protocol","AI システム接続","サーバーアーキテクチャ","ツール","リソース","プロンプト","プログラミング言語"],"ko":["MCP Builder","Model Context Protocol","AI 시스템 연결","서버 아키텍처","도구","리소스","프롬프트","프로그래밍 언어"],"es":["MCP Builder","servidores MCP","protocolo de contexto de modelo","inteligencia artificial","herramientas externas","fuentes de datos","arquitectura de servidor","plantillas de prompt"],"fr":["MCP Builder","serveurs MCP","protocole de contexte de modèle","intelligence artificielle","outils externes","sources de données","architecture de serveur","modèles de prompt"],"de":["MCP Builder","MCP-Server","Modellkontextprotokoll","Künstliche Intelligenz","externe Tools","Datenquellen","Serverarchitektur","Prompt-Vorlagen"],"pt":["MCP","Construtor MCP","Servidores MCP","Sistemas de IA","Ferramentas externas","Fontes de dados externas","Arquitetura de servidor","Integração de IA"],"ru":["MCP","MCP Builder","Серверы MCP","Системы ИИ","Внешние инструменты","Внешние источники данных","Архитектура сервера","Интеграция ИИ"],"ar":["بناء MCP","خادم MCP","أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات خارجية","مصادر بيانات خارجية","هيكل الخادم","تكامل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"quadradois","repo":"antigravity-kit-v2.0","repoPath":"quadradois/antigravity-kit-v2.0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-builder","description":"MCP (Model Context Protocol) server building principles. Tool design, resource patterns, best practices.","bodyPreview":"# MCP Builder\n\n> Principles for building MCP servers.\n\n---\n\n## 1. MCP Overview\n\n### What is MCP?\n\nModel Context Protocol - standard for connecting AI systems with external tools and data sources.\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| **Tools** | Functions AI can call |\n| **Resources** | Data AI can read |\n| **Prompts** | Pre-defined prompt templates |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Server Architecture\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nmy-mcp-server/\n├── src/\n│   └── index.ts      # Main entry","body":"# MCP Builder\n\n> Principles for building MCP servers.\n\n---\n\n## 1. MCP Overview\n\n### What is MCP?\n\nModel Context Protocol - standard for connecting AI systems with external tools and data sources.\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| **Tools** | Functions AI can call |\n| **Resources** | Data AI can read |\n| **Prompts** | Pre-defined prompt templates |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Server Architecture\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nmy-mcp-server/\n├── src/\n│   └── index.ts      # Main entry\n├── package.json\n└── tsconfig.json\n```\n\n### Transport Types\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Stdio** | Local, CLI-based |\n| **SSE** | Web-based, streaming |\n| **WebSocket** | Real-time, bidirectional |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Tool Design Principles\n\n### Good Tool Design\n\n| Principle | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| Clear name | Action-oriented (get_weather, create_user) |\n| Single purpose | One thing well |\n| Validated input | Schema with types and descriptions |\n| Structured output | Predictable response format |\n\n### Input Schema Design\n\n| Field | Required? |\n|-------|-----------|\n| Type | Yes - object |\n| Properties | Define each param |\n| Required | List mandatory params |\n| Description | Human-readable |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Resource Patterns\n\n### Resource Types\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Static | Fixed data (config, docs) |\n| Dynamic | Generated on request |\n| Template | URI with parameters |\n\n### URI Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Fixed | `docs://readme` |\n| Parameterized | `users://{userId}` |\n| Collection | `files://project/*` |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Error Handling\n\n### Error Types\n\n| Situation | Response |\n|-----------|----------|\n| Invalid params | Validation error message |\n| Not found | Clear \"not found\" |\n| Server error | Generic error, log details |\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Return structured errors\n- Don''t expose internal details\n- Log for debugging\n- Provide actionable messages\n\n---\n\n## 6. Multimodal Handling\n\n### Supported Types\n\n| Type | Encoding |\n|------|----------|\n| Text | Plain text |\n| Images | Base64 + MIME type |\n| Files | Base64 + MIME type |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Security Principles\n\n### Input Validation\n\n- Validate all tool inputs\n- Sanitize user-provided data\n- Limit resource access\n\n### API Keys\n\n- Use environment variables\n- Don''t log secrets\n- Validate permissions\n\n---\n\n## 8. Configuration\n\n### Claude Desktop Config\n\n| Field | Purpose |\n|-------|---------|\n| command | Executable to run |\n| args | Command arguments |\n| env | Environment variables |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Testing\n\n### Test Categories\n\n| Type | Focus |\n|------|-------|\n| Unit | Tool logic |\n| Integration | Full server |\n| Contract | Schema validation |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Best Practices Checklist\n\n- [ ] Clear, action-oriented tool names\n- [ ] Complete input schemas with descriptions\n- [ ] Structured JSON output\n- [ ] Error handling for all cases\n- [ ] Input validation\n- [ ] Environment-based configuration\n- [ ] Logging for debugging\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** MCP tools should be simple, focused, and well-documented. The AI relies on descriptions to use them correctly.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:02:48.244Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for TypeScript developers building AI agent tooling through the Model Context Protocol.","zh":"适用于通过模型上下文协议构建AI代理工具的TypeScript开发人员。","ja":"モデルのコンテキストプロトコルを通じてAIエージェントツールを構築するTypeScript開発者にとって不可欠です。","ko":"모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜을 통해 AI 에이전트 도구를 구축하는 TypeScript 개발자에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Essential for TypeScript developers building AI agent tooling through the Model Context Protocol.","fr":"Essential for TypeScript developers building AI agent tooling through the Model Context Protocol.","de":"Essential for TypeScript developers building AI agent tooling through the Model Context Protocol.","pt":"Essencial para desenvolvedores TypeScript que constroem ferramentas de agentes de IA por meio do Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo.","ru":"Необходимо для разработчиков TypeScript, создающих инструменты агентов ИИ через протокол контекста модели.","ar":"ضروري لمطوري TypeScript الذين يبنين أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال بروتوكول سياق النموذج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides structured architecture patterns for implementing MCP servers with Tools, Resources, and Prompts. Enables seamless integration between AI systems and external data sources through standardized protocols.","zh":"为实现MCP服务器的Tools、Resources和Prompts提供了结构化的架构模式。通过标准化协议，实现AI系统和外部数据源之间的无缝集成。","ja":"MCPサーバーをツール、リソース、プロンプトで実装するための構造化されたアーキテクチャパターンを提供します。標準化されたプロトコルを通じて、AIシステムと外部データソースの間でシームレスな統合を可能にします。","ko":"MCP 서버의 툴, 리소스, 프롬프트를 구현하기 위한 구조화된 아키텍처 패턴을 제공합니다. 표준화된 프로토콜을 통해 AI 시스템과 외부 데이터 소스 간의無縫な 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Provides structured architecture patterns for implementing MCP servers with Tools, Resources, and Prompts. Enables seamless integration between AI systems and external data sources through standardized protocols.","fr":"Provides structured architecture patterns for implementing MCP servers with Tools, Resources, and Prompts. Enables seamless integration between AI systems and external data sources through standardized protocols.","de":"Provides structured architecture patterns for implementing MCP servers with Tools, Resources, and Prompts. Enables seamless integration between AI systems and external data sources through standardized protocols.","pt":"Fornece padrões de arquitetura estruturados para implementar servidores MCP com Ferramentas, Recursos e Dicas. Permite integração perfeita entre sistemas de IA e fontes de dados externas por meio de protocolos padronizados.","ru":"Предоставляет структурированные шаблоны архитектуры для реализации серверов MCP с инструментами, ресурсами и подсказками. Обеспечивает бесшовную интеграцию между системами ИИ и внешними источниками данных через стандартизированные протоколы.","ar":"توفر أنماطًا معمارية منظمّة لتنفيذ خواديم MCP مع أدوات وموارد واقتراحات. تمكّن من التكامل السلس بين أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي ومصادر البيانات الخارجية من خلال بروتوكولات معيارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing custom Tools for AI function calling","Exposing Resources for AI data access","Creating pre-defined Prompt templates for consistent interactions","Structuring MCP server projects with TypeScript"],"zh":["实现AI函数调用自定义工具","暴露资源以访问AI数据","为一致的交互创建预定义的提示模板","使用TypeScript结构MCP服务器项目"],"ja":["AI関数呼び出し用のカスタムツールを実装する","AIデータへのアクセス用にリソースを公開する","一貫したやり取りのための事前定義されたプロンプトテンプレートを作成する","TypeScriptを使用してMCPサーバープロジェクトを構造化する"],"ko":["AI 함수 호출을 위한 사용자 정의 도구 구현","AI 데이터 액세스를 위한 리소스 노출","일관된 상호 작용을 위한 사전 정의된 프롬프트 템플릿 생성","TypeScript를 사용하여 MCP 서버 프로젝트 구조화"],"es":[