user asks to create architecture diagrams, system diagrams, visualize codebase structure, or generate excalidraw files.","bodyPreview":"# Excalidraw Diagram Generator\n\nGenerate architecture diagrams as `.excalidraw` files directly from codebase analysis.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**User just asks:**\n```\n\"Generate an architecture diagram for this project\"\n\"Create an excalidraw diagram of the system\"\n\"Visualize this codebase as an excalidraw file\"\n```\n\n**Claude Code will:**\n1. Analyze the codebase (any language/framework)\n2. Identify components, services, databases, APIs\n3. Map relationships and data flows\n4. Generate valid `.excalidr","body":"# Excalidraw Diagram Generator\n\nGenerate architecture diagrams as `.excalidraw` files directly from codebase analysis.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**User just asks:**\n```\n\"Generate an architecture diagram for this project\"\n\"Create an excalidraw diagram of the system\"\n\"Visualize this codebase as an excalidraw file\"\n```\n\n**Claude Code will:**\n1. Analyze the codebase (any language/framework)\n2. Identify components, services, databases, APIs\n3. Map relationships and data flows\n4. Generate valid `.excalidraw` JSON with dynamic IDs and labels\n\n**No prerequisites:** Works without existing diagrams, Terraform, or specific file types.\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### 1. NEVER Use Diamond Shapes\n\nDiamond arrow connections are broken in raw Excalidraw JSON. Use styled rectangles instead:\n\n| Semantic Meaning | Rectangle Style |\n|------------------|-----------------|\n| Orchestrator/Hub | Coral (`#ffa8a8`/`#c92a2a`) + strokeWidth: 3 |\n| Decision Point | Orange (`#ffd8a8`/`#e8590c`) + dashed stroke |\n\n### 2. Labels Require TWO Elements\n\nThe `label` property does NOT work in raw JSON. Every labeled shape needs:\n\n```json\n// 1. Shape with boundElements reference\n{\n  \"id\": \"my-box\",\n  \"type\": \"rectangle\",\n  \"boundElements\": [{ \"type\": \"text\", \"id\": \"my-box-text\" }]\n}\n\n// 2. Separate text element with containerId\n{\n  \"id\": \"my-box-text\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"containerId\": \"my-box\",\n  \"text\": \"My Label\"\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Elbow Arrows Need Three Properties\n\nFor 90-degree corners (not curved):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"arrow\",\n  \"roughness\": 0,        // Clean lines\n  \"roundness\": null,     // Sharp corners\n  \"elbowed\": true        // 90-degree mode\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Arrow Edge Calculations\n\nArrows must start/end at shape edges, not centers:\n\n| Edge | Formula |\n|------|---------|\n| Top | `(x + width/2, y)` |\n| Bottom | `(x + width/2, y + height)` |\n| Left | `(x, y + height/2)` |\n| Right | `(x + width, y + height/2)` |\n\n**Detailed arrow routing:** See `references/arrows.md`\n\n---\n\n## Element Types\n\n| Type | Use For |\n|------|---------|\n| `rectangle` | Services, databases, containers, orchestrators |\n| `ellipse` | Users, external systems, start/end points |\n| `text` | Labels inside shapes, titles, annotations |\n| `arrow` | Data flow, connections, dependencies |\n| `line` | Grouping boundaries, separators |\n\n**Full JSON format:** See `references/json-format.md`\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Codebase\n\nDiscover components by looking for:\n\n| Codebase Type | What to Look For |\n|---------------|------------------|\n| Monorepo | `packages/*/package.json`, workspace configs |\n| Microservices | `docker-compose.yml`, k8s manifests |\n| IaC | Terraform/Pulumi resource definitions |\n| Backend API | Route definitions, controllers, DB models |\n| Frontend | Component hierarchy, API calls |\n\n**Use tools:**\n- `Glob` → `**/package.json`, `**/Dockerfile`, `**/*.tf`\n- `Grep` → `app.get`, `@Controller`, `CREATE TABLE`\n- `Read` → README, config files, entry points\n\n### Step 2: Plan Layout\n\n**Vertical flow (most common):**\n```\nRow 1: Users/Entry points (y: 100)\nRow 2: Frontend/Gateway (y: 230)\nRow 3: Orchestration (y: 380)\nRow 4: Services (y: 530)\nRow 5: Data layer (y: 680)\n\nColumns: x = 100, 300, 500, 700, 900\nElement size: 160-200px x 80-90px\n```\n\n**Other patterns:** See `references/examples.md`\n\n### Step 3: Generate Elements\n\nFor each component:\n1. Create shape with unique `id`\n2. Add `boundElements` referencing text\n3. Create text with `containerId`\n4. Choose color based on type\n\n**Color palettes:** See `references/colors.md`\n\n### Step 4: Add Connections\n\nFor each relationship:\n1. Calculate source edge point\n2. Plan elbow route (avoid overlaps)\n3. Create arrow with `points` array\n4. Match stroke color to destination type\n\n**Arrow patterns:** See `references/arrows.md`\n\n### Step 5: Add Grouping (Optional)\n\nFor logical groupings:\n- Large transparent rectangle with `strokeStyle: \"dashed\"`\n- Standalone text label at top-left\n\n### Step 6: Validate and Write\n\nRun validation before writing. Save to `docs/` or user-specified path.\n\n**Validation checklist:** See `references/validation.md`\n\n---\n\n## Quick Arrow Reference\n\n**Straight down:**\n```json\n{ \"points\": [[0, 0], [0, 110]], \"x\": 590, \"y\": 290 }\n```\n\n**L-shape (left then down):**\n```json\n{ \"points\": [[0, 0], [-325, 0], [-325, 125]], \"x\": 525, \"y\": 420 }\n```\n\n**U-turn (callback):**\n```json\n{ \"points\": [[0, 0], [50, 0], [50, -125], [20, -125]], \"x\": 710, \"y\": 440 }\n```\n\n**Arrow width/height** = bounding box of points:\n```\npoints [[0,0], [-440,0], [-440,70]] → width=440, height=70\n```\n\n**Multiple arrows from same edge** - stagger positions:\n```\n5 arrows: 20%, 35%, 50%, 65%, 80% across edge width\n```\n\n---\n\n## Default Color Palette\n\n| Component | Background | Stroke |\n|-----------|------------|--------|\n| Frontend | `#a5d8ff` | `#1971c2` |\n| Backend/API | `#d0bfff` | `#7048e8` |\n| Database | `#b2f2bb` | `#2f9e44` |\n| Storage | `#ffec99` | `#f08c00` |\n| AI/ML | `#e599f7` | `#9c36b5` |\n| External APIs | `#ffc9c9` | `#e03131` |\n| Orchestration | `#ffa8a8` | `#c92a2a` |\n| Message Queue | `#fff3bf` | `#fab005` |\n| Cache | `#ffe8cc` | `#fd7e14` |\n| Users | `#e7f5ff` | `#1971c2` |\n\n**Cloud-specific palettes:** See `references/colors.md`\n\n---\n\n## Quick Validation Checklist\n\nBefore writing file:\n- [ ] Every shape with label has boundElements + text element\n- [ ] Text elements have containerId matching shape\n- [ ] Multi-point arrows have `elbowed: true`, `roundness: null`\n- [ ] Arrow x,y = source shape edge point\n- [ ] Arrow final point offset reaches target edge\n- [ ] No diamond shapes\n- [ ] No duplicate IDs\n\n**Full validation algorithm:** See `references/validation.md`\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Labels don''t appear | Use TWO elements (shape + text), not `label` property |\n| Arrows curved | Add `elbowed: true`, `roundness: null`, `roughness: 0` |\n| Arrows floating | Calculate x,y from shape edge, not center |\n| Arrows overlapping | Stagger start positions across edge |\n\n**Detailed bug fixes:** See `references/validation.md`\n\n---\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File | Contents |\n|------|----------|\n| `references/json-format.md` | Element types, required properties, text bindings |\n| `references/arrows.md` | Routing algorithm, patterns, bindings, staggering |\n| `references/colors.md` | Default, AWS, Azure, GCP, K8s palettes |\n| `references/examples.md` | Complete JSON examples, layout patterns |\n| `references/validation.md` | Checklists, validation algorithm, bug fixes |\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Location:** `docs/architecture/` or user-specified\n- **Filename:** Descriptive, e.g., `system-architecture.excalidraw`\n- **Testing:** Open in https://excalidraw.com or VS Code extension\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:03:12.235Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Architecture Analysis Agents needing advanced diagram generation capabilities in excalidraw format.","zh":"适用于需要高级图表生成功能的架构分析代理，特别是在excalidraw格式方面。","ja":"アーキテクチャ分析エージェントが高度な図表生成機能を必要とする場合、excalidraw形式での利用に最適です。","ko":"고급 도면 생성 기능이 필요한 아키텍처 분석 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 excalidraw 형식에서입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Análisis de Arquitectura que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de diagramas en formato excalidraw.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''Analyse d''Architecture ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération de diagrammes au format excalidraw.","de":"Perfekt für Architekturanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte Diagrammgenerierungsfunktionen im Excalidraw-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Arquitetura que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de diagramas no formato excalidraw.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа архитектуры, требующих продвинутых возможностей генерации диаграмм в формате excalidraw.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل بنية تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتوليد الرسومات بالتنسيق excalidraw."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate valid .excalidraw files directly from codebase analysis, mapping relationships and data flows between components, services, databases, and APIs, utilizing codebase analysis and diagram generation capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理直接从代码库分析生成有效的.excalidraw文件的能力，映射组件、服务、数据库和API之间的关系和数据流，利用代码库分析和图表生成功能。","ja":"コードベース分析から直接有効な.excalidrawファイルを生成する機能をエージェントに与え、コンポーネント、サービス、データベース、API間の関係やデータフローをコードベース分析と図表生成機能を利用してマッピングします。","ko":"에이전트가 코드베이스 분석에서 직접 유효한 .excalidraw 파일을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 컴포넌트, 서비스, 데이터베이스 및 API 간의 관계와 데이터 흐름을 코드베이스 분석 및 도면 생성 기능을 사용하여 매핑합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar archivos .excalidraw válidos directamente desde el análisis del código, mapeando relaciones y flujos de datos entre componentes, servicios, bases de datos y API, utilizando capacidades de análisis y generación de diagramas del código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers .excalidraw valides directement à partir de l''analyse du codebase, en cartographiant les relations et les flux de données entre les composants, les services, les bases de données et les API, en utilisant les capacités d''analyse et de génération de diagrammes du codebase.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, gültige .excalidraw-Dateien direkt aus der Codebase-Analyse zu generieren, indem Beziehungen und Datenflüsse zwischen Komponenten, Diensten, Datenbanken und APIs kartiert werden, unter Verwendung der Codebase-Analyse- und Diagrammgenerierungsfunktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquivos .excalidraw válidos diretamente da análise do código, mapeando relacionamentos e fluxos de dados entre componentes, serviços, bancos de dados e APIs, utilizando capacidades de análise e geração de diagramas do código.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать действительные файлы .excalidraw напрямую из анализа кодовой базы, сопоставляя отношения и потоки данных между компонентами, службами, базами данных и API, используя возможности анализа кодовой базы и генерации диаграмм.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من توليد ملفات .excalidraw صالحة مباشرة من تحليل قاعدة الشفرة، وربط العلاقات والتدفقات البيانية بين المكونات والخدمات وقواعد البيانات وواجهات البرمجة، مستفيداً من قدرات تحليل قاعدة الشفرة وتوليد الرسومات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating architecture diagrams for codebase visualization","Creating excalidraw files for system documentation","Visualizing codebase relationships and data flows"],"zh":["为代码库可视化生成架构图表","为系统文档创建excalidraw文件","可视化代码库之间的关系和数据流"],"ja":["コードベースの可視化のためのアーキテクチャ図表の生成","システム文書化のためのexcalidrawファイルの作成","コードベース間の関係やデータフローの可視化"],"ko":["코드베이스 시각화를 위한 아키텍처 도면 생성","시스템 문서화를 위한 excalidraw 파일 생성","코드베이스 간의 관계와 데이터 흐름 시각화"],"es":["Generación de diagramas de arquitectura para la visualización del código","Creación de archivos excalidraw para la documentación del sistema","Visualización de las relaciones y flujos de datos del código"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes d''architecture pour la visualisation du codebase","Création de fichiers excalidraw pour la documentation du système","Visualisation des relations et des flux de données du codebase"],"de":["Generierung von Architekturdiagrammen für die Visualisierung der Codebase","Erstellung von Excalidraw-Dateien für die Systemdokumentation","Visualisierung der Beziehungen und Datenflüsse der Codebase"],"pt":["Gerar diagramas de arquitetura para visualização do código","Criar arquivos excalidraw para documentação do sistema","Visualizar relacionamentos e fluxos de dados do código"],"ru":["Генерировать диаграммы архитектуры для визуализации кодовой базы","Создавать файлы excalidraw для документации системы","Визуализировать отношения и потоки данных кодовой базы"],"ar":["توليد رسومات بنية لتصوير قاعدة الشفرة","إنشاء ملفات excalidraw لتوثيق النظام","تصوير العلاقات والتدفقات البيانية لقاعدة الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires codebase access for analysis","Limited to generating .excalidraw files"],"zh":["需要代码库访问权限进行分析","仅限生成.excalidraw文件"],"ja":["分析のためにコードベースへのアクセスが必要",".excalidrawファイルの生成のみ"],"ko":["분석을 위해 코드베이스 액세스가 필요",".excalidraw 파일 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código para el análisis","Limitado a la generación de archivos .excalidraw"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au codebase pour l''analyse","Limité à la génération de fichiers .excalidraw"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Code für die Analyse","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von .excalidraw-Dateien"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código para análise","Limitado a gerar arquivos .excalidraw"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе для анализа","Ограничен генерацией файлов .excalidraw"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة للتحليل","محدود بتوليد ملفات .excalidraw"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Anit-1to10x/10x-Accountability-Coach/excalidraw', 'community', 'Anit-1to10x', '10x-Accountability-Coach', 'Anit-1to10x/10x-Accountability-Coach', 'excalidraw', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z', '2026-02-18T09:03:08.859Z', NULL, '{"id":"Anit-1to10x/10x-Accountability-Coach/excalidraw","name":"excalidraw","description":{"zh":"Excalidraw . ","ja":"Excalidraw","ko":"Excalidraw, ","es":"Excalidraw es una herramienta que genera diagramas de arquitectura a partir del análisis del codebase.","fr":"Excalidraw est un outil qui génère des diagrammes d''architecture à partir de l''analyse du codebase.","de":"Excalidraw ist ein Tool, das Architekturdiagramme aus der Codebase-Analyse generiert.","pt":"O Excalidraw é uma ferramenta que gera diagramas de arquitetura a partir da análise do código","ru":"Excalidraw - это инструмент, который генерирует диаграммы архитектуры из анализа кода","ar":"إكسكاليدرو هو أداة تنشئ مخططات هيكلية من تحليل شفرة المصدر","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Excalidraw ","ja":"Excalidraw","ko":"Excalidraw ","es":"Generador de diagramas Excalidraw para desarrolladores","fr":"Générateur de diagrammes Excalidraw pour les développeurs","de":"Excalidraw-Diagramm-Generator für Entwickler","pt":"Excalidraw: Gerador de Diagramas de Arquitetura","ru":"Excalidraw: Генератор диаграмм архитектуры","ar":"إكسكالي德رو: مولد مخططات الهيكل","en":"excalidraw"},"description":{"zh":"Excalidraw . ","ja":"Excalidraw","ko":"Excalidraw, ","es":"Excalidraw es una herramienta que genera diagramas de arquitectura a partir del análisis del codebase.","fr":"Excalidraw est un outil qui génère des diagrammes d''architecture à partir de l''analyse du codebase.","de":"Excalidraw ist ein Tool, das Architekturdiagramme aus der Codebase-Analyse generiert.","pt":"O Excalidraw é uma ferramenta que gera diagramas de arquitetura a partir da análise do código","ru":"Excalidraw - это инструмент, который генерирует диаграммы архитектуры из анализа кода","ar":"إكسكاليدرو هو أداة تنشئ مخططات هيكلية من تحليل شفرة المصدر","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":[" "," ","API"," "],"ja":["","","API",""],"ko":["","","API",""],"es":["Análisis de codebase","Identificación de componentes y servicios","Mapeo de relaciones y flujos de datos","Generación de archivos .excalidraw válidos"],"fr":["Analyse du codebase","Identification des composants et des services","Cartographie des relations et des flux de données","Génération de fichiers .excalidraw valides"],"de":["Codebase-Analyse","Identifizierung von Komponenten und Diensten","Abbilden von Beziehungen und Datenflüssen","Erstellung gültiger .excalidraw-Dateien"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas de arquitetura como arquivos .excalidraw","Análise de código em qualquer linguagem ou framework","Identificação de componentes, serviços, bancos de dados e APIs","Mapeamento de relacionamentos e fluxos de dados","Geração de diagramas personalizados"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм архитектуры как файлов .excalidraw","Анализ кода на любом языке или фреймворке","Определение компонентов, сервисов, баз данных и API","Сопоставление отношений и потоков данных","Генерация индивидуальных диаграмм"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات هيكلية كملفات .excalidraw","تحليل شفرة المصدر بأي لغة أو إطار","تحديد المكونات والخدمات وقواعد البيانات وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات","ربط العلاقات ونسق البيانات","إنشاء مخططات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Excalidraw"," ","API"," "," "," "],"ja":["Excalidraw","","API","","",""],"ko":["Excalidraw","","API","","",""],"es":["Excalidraw","diagramas de arquitectura","análisis de codebase","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","generación de diagramas"],"fr":["Excalidraw","diagrammes d''architecture","analyse du codebase","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","génération de diagrammes"],"de":["Excalidraw","Architekturdiagramme","Codebase-Analyse","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools","Diagramm-Generierung"],"pt":["excalidraw","diagramas de arquitetura","gerador de diagramas","análise de código","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["excalidraw","диаграммы архитектуры","генератор диаграмм","анализ кода","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إكسكاليدرو","مخططات هيكلية","مولد مخططات","تحليل شفرة المصدر","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Anit-1to10x","repo":"10x-Accountability-Coach","repoPath":"Anit-1to10x/10x-Accountability-Coach","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"excalidraw","description":"Generate architecture diagrams as .excalidraw files from codebase analysis. Use when the user asks to create architecture diagrams, system diagrams, visualize codebase structure, or generate excalidraw files.","bodyPreview":"# Excalidraw Diagram Generator\n\nGenerate architecture diagrams as `.excalidraw` files directly from codebase analysis.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**User just asks:**\n```\n\"Generate an architecture diagram for this project\"\n\"Create an excalidraw diagram of the system\"\n\"Visualize this codebase as an excalidraw file\"\n```\n\n**Claude Code will:**\n1. Analyze the codebase (any language/framework)\n2. Identify components, services, databases, APIs\n3. Map relationships and data flows\n4. Generate valid `.excalidr","body":"# Excalidraw Diagram Generator\n\nGenerate architecture diagrams as `.excalidraw` files directly from codebase analysis.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**User just asks:**\n```\n\"Generate an architecture diagram for this project\"\n\"Create an excalidraw diagram of the system\"\n\"Visualize this codebase as an excalidraw file\"\n```\n\n**Claude Code will:**\n1. Analyze the codebase (any language/framework)\n2. Identify components, services, databases, APIs\n3. Map relationships and data flows\n4. Generate valid `.excalidraw` JSON with dynamic IDs and labels\n\n**No prerequisites:** Works without existing diagrams, Terraform, or specific file types.\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### 1. NEVER Use Diamond Shapes\n\nDiamond arrow connections are broken in raw Excalidraw JSON. Use styled rectangles instead:\n\n| Semantic Meaning | Rectangle Style |\n|------------------|-----------------|\n| Orchestrator/Hub | Coral (`#ffa8a8`/`#c92a2a`) + strokeWidth: 3 |\n| Decision Point | Orange (`#ffd8a8`/`#e8590c`) + dashed stroke |\n\n### 2. Labels Require TWO Elements\n\nThe `label` property does NOT work in raw JSON. Every labeled shape needs:\n\n```json\n// 1. Shape with boundElements reference\n{\n  \"id\": \"my-box\",\n  \"type\": \"rectangle\",\n  \"boundElements\": [{ \"type\": \"text\", \"id\": \"my-box-text\" }]\n}\n\n// 2. Separate text element with containerId\n{\n  \"id\": \"my-box-text\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"containerId\": \"my-box\",\n  \"text\": \"My Label\"\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Elbow Arrows Need Three Properties\n\nFor 90-degree corners (not curved):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"arrow\",\n  \"roughness\": 0,        // Clean lines\n  \"roundness\": null,     // Sharp corners\n  \"elbowed\": true        // 90-degree mode\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Arrow Edge Calculations\n\nArrows must start/end at shape edges, not centers:\n\n| Edge | Formula |\n|------|---------|\n| Top | `(x + width/2, y)` |\n| Bottom | `(x + width/2, y + height)` |\n| Left | `(x, y + height/2)` |\n| Right | `(x + width, y + height/2)` |\n\n**Detailed arrow routing:** See `references/arrows.md`\n\n---\n\n## Element Types\n\n| Type | Use For |\n|------|---------|\n| `rectangle` | Services, databases, containers, orchestrators |\n| `ellipse` | Users, external systems, start/end points |\n| `text` | Labels inside shapes, titles, annotations |\n| `arrow` | Data flow, connections, dependencies |\n| `line` | Grouping boundaries, separators |\n\n**Full JSON format:** See `references/json-format.md`\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Codebase\n\nDiscover components by looking for:\n\n| Codebase Type | What to Look For |\n|---------------|------------------|\n| Monorepo | `packages/*/package.json`, workspace configs |\n| Microservices | `docker-compose.yml`, k8s manifests |\n| IaC | Terraform/Pulumi resource definitions |\n| Backend API | Route definitions, controllers, DB models |\n| Frontend | Component hierarchy, API calls |\n\n**Use tools:**\n- `Glob` → `**/package.json`, `**/Dockerfile`, `**/*.tf`\n- `Grep` → `app.get`, `@Controller`, `CREATE TABLE`\n- `Read` → README, config files, entry points\n\n### Step 2: Plan Layout\n\n**Vertical flow (most common):**\n```\nRow 1: Users/Entry points (y: 100)\nRow 2: Frontend/Gateway (y: 230)\nRow 3: Orchestration (y: 380)\nRow 4: Services (y: 530)\nRow 5: Data layer (y: 680)\n\nColumns: x = 100, 300, 500, 700, 900\nElement size: 160-200px x 80-90px\n```\n\n**Other patterns:** See `references/examples.md`\n\n### Step 3: Generate Elements\n\nFor each component:\n1. Create shape with unique `id`\n2. Add `boundElements` referencing text\n3. Create text with `containerId`\n4. Choose color based on type\n\n**Color palettes:** See `references/colors.md`\n\n### Step 4: Add Connections\n\nFor each relationship:\n1. Calculate source edge point\n2. Plan elbow route (avoid overlaps)\n3. Create arrow with `points` array\n4. Match stroke color to destination type\n\n**Arrow patterns:** See `references/arrows.md`\n\n### Step 5: Add Grouping (Optional)\n\nFor logical groupings:\n- Large transparent rectangle with `strokeStyle: \"dashed\"`\n- Standalone text label at top-left\n\n### Step 6: Validate and Write\n\nRun validation before writing. Save to `docs/` or user-specified path.\n\n**Validation checklist:** See `references/validation.md`\n\n---\n\n## Quick Arrow Reference\n\n**Straight down:**\n```json\n{ \"points\": [[0, 0], [0, 110]], \"x\": 590, \"y\": 290 }\n```\n\n**L-shape (left then down):**\n```json\n{ \"points\": [[0, 0], [-325, 0], [-325, 125]], \"x\": 525, \"y\": 420 }\n```\n\n**U-turn (callback):**\n```json\n{ \"points\": [[0, 0], [50, 0], [50, -125], [20, -125]], \"x\": 710, \"y\": 440 }\n```\n\n**Arrow width/height** = bounding box of points:\n```\npoints [[0,0], [-440,0], [-440,70]] → width=440, height=70\n```\n\n**Multiple arrows from same edge** - stagger positions:\n```\n5 arrows: 20%, 35%, 50%, 65%, 80% across edge width\n```\n\n---\n\n## Default Color Palette\n\n| Component | Background | Stroke |\n|-----------|------------|--------|\n| Frontend | `#a5d8ff` | `#1971c2` |\n| Backend/API | `#d0bfff` | `#7048e8` |\n| Database | `#b2f2bb` | `#2f9e44` |\n| Storage | `#ffec99` | `#f08c00` |\n| AI/ML | `#e599f7` | `#9c36b5` |\n| External APIs | `#ffc9c9` | `#e03131` |\n| Orchestration | `#ffa8a8` | `#c92a2a` |\n| Message Queue | `#fff3bf` | `#fab005` |\n| Cache | `#ffe8cc` | `#fd7e14` |\n| Users | `#e7f5ff` | `#1971c2` |\n\n**Cloud-specific palettes:** See `references/colors.md`\n\n---\n\n## Quick Validation Checklist\n\nBefore writing file:\n- [ ] Every shape with label has boundElements + text element\n- [ ] Text elements have containerId matching shape\n- [ ] Multi-point arrows have `elbowed: true`, `roundness: null`\n- [ ] Arrow x,y = source shape edge point\n- [ ] Arrow final point offset reaches target edge\n- [ ] No diamond shapes\n- [ ] No duplicate IDs\n\n**Full validation algorithm:** See `references/validation.md`\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Labels don''t appear | Use TWO elements (shape + text), not `label` property |\n| Arrows curved | Add `elbowed: true`, `roundness: null`, `roughness: 0` |\n| Arrows floating | Calculate x,y from shape edge, not center |\n| Arrows overlapping | Stagger start positions across edge |\n\n**Detailed bug fixes:** See `references/validation.md`\n\n---\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File | Contents |\n|------|----------|\n| `references/json-format.md` | Element types, required properties, text bindings |\n| `references/arrows.md` | Routing algorithm, patterns, bindings, staggering |\n| `references/colors.md` | Default, AWS, Azure, GCP, K8s palettes |\n| `references/examples.md` | Complete JSON examples, layout patterns |\n| `references/validation.md` | Checklists, validation algorithm, bug fixes |\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Location:** `docs/architecture/` or user-specified\n- **Filename:** Descriptive, e.g., `system-architecture.excalidraw`\n- **Testing:** Open in https://excalidraw.com or VS Code extension\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:03:08.859Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced architecture diagram generation capabilities in excalidraw format.","zh":"非常适合需要高级架构图生成能力的代码分析代理，特别是支持excalidraw格式。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが高度なアーキテクチャ図生成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。特にexcalidraw形式をサポートします。","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트가 고급 아키텍처 다이어그램 생성 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. 특히 excalidraw 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de diagramas de arquitectura en formato excalidraw.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant des capacités avancées de génération de diagrammes d''architecture au format excalidraw.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Architekturdiagramm-Generierungsfunktionen im excalidraw-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de diagramas de arquitetura no formato excalidraw.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Кодов, требующих передовых возможностей генерации диаграмм архитектуры в формате excalidraw.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء رسومات هيكلية بالتنسيق excalidraw."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate valid .excalidraw files directly from codebase analysis, identifying components, services, databases, and APIs, and mapping relationships and data flows using codebase analysis and excalidraw file generation.","zh":"赋予代理直接从代码库分析生成有效的.excalidraw文件的能力，识别组件、服务、数据库和API，并使用代码库分析和excalidraw文件生成来映射关系和数据流。","ja":"コードベース分析から直接有効な.excalidrawファイルを生成する機能をエージェントに与え、コンポーネント、サービス、データベース、APIを識別し、コードベース分析とexcalidrawファイル生成を使用して関係とデータフローをマッピングします。","ko":"에이전트가 코드베이스 분석에서 직접有效한 .excalidraw 파일을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 구성 요소, 서비스, 데이터베이스 및 API를 식별하고 코드베이스 분석 및 excalidraw 파일 생성을 사용하여 관계 및 데이터 흐름을 매핑합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar archivos .excalidraw válidos directamente desde el análisis de la base de código, identificando componentes, servicios, bases de datos y API, y mapeando relaciones y flujos de datos utilizando el análisis de la base de código y la generación de archivos excalidraw.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers .excalidraw valides directement à partir de l''analyse de la base de code, en identifiant les composants, les services, les bases de données et les API, et en cartographiant les relations et les flux de données à l''aide de l''analyse de la base de code et de la génération de fichiers excalidraw.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, gültige .excalidraw-Dateien direkt aus der Codebase-Analyse zu generieren, indem sie Komponenten, Dienste, Datenbanken und APIs identifizieren und Beziehungen und Datenflüsse mit Codebase-Analyse und excalidraw-Dateigenerierung kartieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquivos .excalidraw válidos diretamente da análise da base de código, identificando componentes, serviços, bancos de dados e APIs, e mapeando relacionamentos e fluxos de dados usando a análise da base de código e a geração de arquivos excalidraw.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать действительные файлы .excalidraw直接 из анализа кодовой базы, выявляя компоненты, сервисы, базы данных и API, и отображая взаимосвязи и потоки данных с помощью анализа кодовой базы и генерации файлов excalidraw.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء ملفات .excalidraw صالحة مباشرة من تحليل قاعدة الشفرة، وتحديد المكونات والخدمات وقواعد البيانات وواجهات البرمجة التطبيقية، وتنسيق العلاقات وتدفقات البيانات باستخدام تحليل قاعدة الشفرة وإنشاء ملفات excalidraw."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating architecture diagrams for codebases","Visualizing system components and data flows as excalidraw files","Creating excalidraw diagrams for project planning and documentation"],"zh":["为代码库生成架构图","将系统组件和数据流可视化为excalidraw文件","为项目规划和文档创建excalidraw图表"],"ja":["コードベースのアーキテクチャ図を生成する","システムコンポーネントとデータフローをexcalidrawファイルとして視覚化する","プロジェクト計画とドキュメントのためにexcalidraw図表を作成する"],"ko":["코드베이스에 대한 아키텍처 다이어그램 생성","시스템 구성 요소 및 데이터 흐름을 excalidraw 파일로 시각화","프로젝트 계획 및 문서화를 위한 excalidraw 다이어그램 생성"],"es":["Generar diagramas de arquitectura para bases de código","Visualizar componentes del sistema y flujos de datos como archivos excalidraw","Crear diagramas excalidraw para planificación y documentación de proyectos"],"fr":["Générer des diagrammes d''architecture pour les bases de code","Visualiser les composants du système et les flux de données sous forme de fichiers excalidraw","Créer des diagrammes excalidraw pour la planification et la documentation de projets"],"de":["Erstellen von Architekturdiagrammen für Codebases","Visualisieren von Systemkomponenten und Datenflüssen als excalidraw-Dateien","Erstellen von excalidraw-Diagrammen für Projektplanung und Dokumentation"],"pt":["Gerar diagramas de arquitetura para bases de código","Visualizar componentes de sistema e fluxos de dados como arquivos excalidraw","Criar diagramas excalidraw para planejamento e documentação de projetos"],"ru":["Генерировать диаграммы архитектуры для кодовых баз","Визуализировать системные компоненты и потоки данных как файлы excalidraw","Создавать диаграммы excalidraw для планирования и документации проектов"],"ar":["إنشاء رسومات هيكلية لقواعد الشفرة","تجسيد مكونات النظام وتدفقات البيانات كملفات excalidraw","إنشاء رسومات excalidraw لتخطيط المشاريع وتوثيقها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires codebase access for analysis","Excalidraw file format only"],"zh":["需要代码库访问权限进行分析","仅支持excalidraw文件格式"],"ja":["分析のためにコードベースへのアクセスが必要","excalidrawファイル形式のみをサポート"],"ko":["분석을 위해 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","excalidraw 파일 형식만 지원"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código para el análisis","Solo formato de archivo excalidraw"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code pour l''analyse","Seul format de fichier excalidraw"],"de":["Benötigt Codebase-Zugriff für die Analyse","Nur excalidraw-Dateiformat"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código para análise","Formato de arquivo excalidraw apenas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе для анализа","Только формат файла excalidraw"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة للتحليل","تنسيق ملف excalidraw فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
