","en":"agent-browser"},"description":{"zh":"agent-browser是一个强大的浏览器自动化工具，支持导航、截图、点击和填充等功能","ja":"agent-browserは強力なブラウザ自動化ツールで、ナビゲーション、スクリーンショット、クリック、フィルインなどの機能をサポートしています","ko":"agent-browser는 강력한 브라우저 자동화 도구로, 내비게이션, 스크린샷, 클릭 및 填充 등의 기능을 지원합니다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta de automatización de navegador para desarrolladores. Permite la automatización de tareas en el navegador.","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil d''automatisation de navigateur pour les développeurs. Il permet d''automatiser des tâches dans le navigateur.","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Browser-Automatisierungstool für Entwickler. Es ermöglicht die Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser.","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite navegar, capturar elementos e interagir com páginas web.","ru":"Agent-browser - это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который позволяет навигировать, захватывать элементы и взаимодействовать с веб-страницами.","ar":"agent-browser هو أداة أتمتة متصفح تسمح بالتنقل والتقاط العناصر والتفاعل مع صفحات الويب.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["支持导航到指定URL","支持截图和获取交互元素","支持点击和填充表单","支持关闭浏览器"],"ja":["指定のURLへのナビゲーションをサポート","スクリーンショットと交互要素の取得をサポート","クリックとフィルインをサポート","ブラウザの閉じるをサポート"],"ko":["지정된 URL로의 내비게이션을 지원","스크린샷 및 상호 작용 요소의 가져오기를 지원","클릭 및 필드를 지원","브라우저의 닫기를 지원"],"es":["Automatización de tareas en el navegador","Instalación y uso rápido","Soporte para Chromium","Interacción con elementos de la página web","Captura de pantalla y análisis de elementos","Cierre del navegador"],"fr":["Automatisation de tâches dans le navigateur","Installation et démarrage rapide","Prise en charge de Chromium","Interaction avec les éléments de la page web","Capture d''écran et analyse des éléments","Fermeture du navigateur"],"de":["Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser","Installation und schneller Einstieg","Unterstützung für Chromium","Interaktion mit Elementen der Webseite","Bildschirmaufnahme und Analyse von Elementen","Schließen des Browsers"],"pt":["Navegação automática","Captura de elementos interativos","Clique em elementos por referência","Preenchimento de formulários","Fechamento do navegador"],"ru":["Автоматическая навигация","Захват интерактивных элементов","Клик по элементам по ссылке","Заполнение форм","Закрытие браузера"],"ar":["التنقل التلقائي","التقاط العناصر التفاعلية","النقر على العناصر بواسطة المرجع","ملء الاستمارات","إغلاق المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","agent-browser","自动化工具","开发效率","浏览器操作","自动化测试"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","agent-browser","自動化ツール","開発効率","ブラウザ操作","自動化テスト"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","agent-browser","자동화 도구","개발 효율성","브라우저 작동","자동화 테스트"],"es":["automatización de navegador","agent-browser","desarrollo web","Chromium","automatización de tareas","interacción con elementos web","captura de pantalla","análisis de elementos"],"fr":["automatisation de navigateur","agent-browser","développement web","Chromium","automatisation de tâches","interaction avec les éléments web","capture d''écran","analyse des éléments"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","agent-browser","Webentwicklung","Chromium","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Interaktion mit Web-Elementen","Bildschirmaufnahme","Analyse von Elementen"],"pt":["automação de navegador","agent-browser","navegação automática","captura de elementos"," clique em elementos","preenchimento de formulários","fechamento do navegador","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","agent-browser","автоматическая навигация","захват элементов","клик по элементам","заполнение форм","закрытие браузера","веб-разработка"],"ar":["أتمتة متصفح","agent-browser","التنقل التلقائي","التقاط العناصر","النقر على العناصر","ملء الاستمارات","إغلاق المتصفح","تطوير ويب"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g agent-browser\nagent-browser install  # Download Chromium\n```\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>           # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i          # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1            # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"      # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close                # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-","body":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g agent-browser\nagent-browser install  # Download Chromium\n```\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>           # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i          # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1            # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"      # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close                # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n4. Re-snapshot after navigation or significant DOM changes\n\n## Commands\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>           # Navigate to URL\nagent-browser back                 # Go back\nagent-browser forward              # Go forward\nagent-browser reload               # Reload page\nagent-browser close                # Close browser\n```\n\n### Snapshot (page analysis)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot             # Full accessibility tree\nagent-browser snapshot -i          # Interactive elements only (recommended)\nagent-browser snapshot -c          # Compact output\nagent-browser snapshot -d 3        # Limit depth to 3\n```\n\n### Interactions (use @refs from snapshot)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser click @e1            # Click\nagent-browser dblclick @e1         # Double-click\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"      # Clear and type\nagent-browser type @e2 \"text\"      # Type without clearing\nagent-browser press Enter          # Press key\nagent-browser press Control+a      # Key combination\nagent-browser hover @e1            # Hover\nagent-browser check @e1            # Check checkbox\nagent-browser uncheck @e1          # Uncheck checkbox\nagent-browser select @e1 \"value\"   # Select dropdown\nagent-browser scroll down 500      # Scroll page\nagent-browser scrollintoview @e1   # Scroll element into view\n```\n\n### Get information\n\n```bash\nagent-browser get text @e1         # Get element text\nagent-browser get value @e1        # Get input value\nagent-browser get title            # Get page title\nagent-browser get url              # Get current URL\n```\n\n### Screenshots\n\n```bash\nagent-browser screenshot           # Screenshot to stdout\nagent-browser screenshot path.png  # Save to file\nagent-browser screenshot --full    # Full page\n```\n\n### Wait\n\n```bash\nagent-browser wait @e1             # Wait for element\nagent-browser wait 2000            # Wait milliseconds\nagent-browser wait --text \"Success\"  # Wait for text\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle  # Wait for network idle\n```\n\n### Semantic locators (alternative to refs)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser find role button click --name \"Submit\"\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click\nagent-browser find label \"Email\" fill \"user@test.com\"\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\nagent-browser snapshot -i\n# Output shows: textbox \"Email\" [ref=e1], textbox \"Password\" [ref=e2], button \"Submit\" [ref=e3]\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"user@example.com\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password123\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\nagent-browser snapshot -i  # Check result\n```\n\n## Example: Authentication with saved state\n\n```bash\n# Login once\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/login\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"username\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"\nagent-browser state save auth.json\n\n# Later sessions: load saved state\nagent-browser state load auth.json\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/dashboard\n```\n\n## Sessions (parallel browsers)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --session test1 open site-a.com\nagent-browser --session test2 open site-b.com\nagent-browser session list\n```\n\n## JSON output (for parsing)\n\nAdd `--json` for machine-readable output:\n\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot -i --json\nagent-browser get text @e1 --json\n```\n\n## Debugging\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open example.com --headed  # Show browser window\nagent-browser console                    # View console messages\nagent-browser errors                     # View page errors\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:03:12.115Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing advanced browser interaction capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级浏览器交互能力的自动化代理。","ja":"高度なブラウザの操作機能が必要な自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 브라우저 상호 작용 기능이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan capacidades de interacción avanzada con el navegador.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant des capacités d''interaction avancée avec le navigateur.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Browser-Interaktionsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de interação com navegador.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, требующих расширенных возможностей взаимодействия с браузером.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التأهيل الذاتي الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتفاعل المتصفح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser tasks using Chromium, enabling navigation to specific URLs, capturing snapshots of interactive elements, and performing actions like clicking and filling inputs via refs, all through a simple command-line interface.","zh":"赋予代理自动化浏览器任务的能力，使用Chromium，实现导航到特定URL，捕获交互元素的快照，并通过refs执行点击和填充输入等操作，所有这些都可以通过简单的命令行界面完成。","ja":"エージェントにChromiumを使用してブラウザのタスクを自動化する能力を与え、特定のURLへのナビゲーション、インタラクティブ要素のスナップショットのキャプチャ、refs経由でのクリックと入力の埋め込みなどのアクションを実行できる、すべてをシンプルなコマンドラインインターフェイスで実行可能。","ko":"에이전트에 브라우저 작업을 자동화하는 능력을 부여하여, 크로미움을 사용하여 특정 URL로의 탐색, 상호 작용 요소의 스냅샷을 캡처하고, 참조를 통해 클릭 및 입력을 채우는 등의 작업을 수행할 수 있으며, 모두 단순한 명령줄 인터페이스를 통해 가능합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas del navegador utilizando Chromium, lo que permite navegar a URLs específicas, capturar instantáneas de elementos interactivos y realizar acciones como hacer clic y rellenar entradas vía refs, todo a través de una interfaz de línea de comandos sencilla.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tâches du navigateur en utilisant Chromium, ce qui permet de naviguer vers des URL spécifiques, de capturer des instantanés d''éléments interactifs et d''effectuer des actions comme le clic et le remplissage des entrées via des refs, le tout via une interface de ligne de commande simple.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Browser-Aufgaben mit Chromium zu automatisieren, wodurch die Navigation zu bestimmten URLs, das Erfassen von Schnappschüssen interaktiver Elemente und das Ausführen von Aktionen wie Klicken und Ausfüllen von Eingaben über refs ermöglicht wird, alles über eine einfache Kommandozeilenoberfläche.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar tarefas do navegador usando o Chromium, permitindo a navegação para URLs específicas, captura de instantâneos de elementos interativos e realização de ações como clicar e preencher entradas via refs, tudo através de uma interface de linha de comando simples.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать задачи браузера с помощью Chromium, что позволяет перемещаться по конкретным URL-адресам, захватывать снимки интерактивных элементов и выполнять действия, такие как клик и заполнение входных данных через ссылки, все через простой интерфейс командной строки.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على أتمتة مهام المتصفح باستخدام كروم، مما يسمح بالتنقل إلى عناوين URL محددة وقبض لقطات من العناصر التفاعلية والقيام بأفعال مثل النقر وملء الإدخالات عبر المراجع، كل ذلك من خلال واجهة بسيطة لسطر الأوامر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web data extraction","Generating interactive element maps","Debugging web application workflows"],"zh":["自动化网页数据提取","生成交互元素地图","调试网页应用程序工作流"],"ja":["ウェブデータの自動抽出","インタラクティブ要素のマップの生成","ウェブアプリケーションのワークフローのデバッグ"],"ko":["웹 데이터 추출 자동화","상호 작용 요소 맵 생성","웹 애플리케이션 워크플로우 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la extracción de datos web","Generación de mapas de elementos interactivos","Depuración de flujos de trabajo de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''extraction de données web","Génération de cartes d''éléments interactifs","Débogage de flux de travail d''applications web"],"de":["Automatisierung der Webdatenextraktion","Erzeugung von Karten interaktiver Elemente","Fehlersuche in Webanwendungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Automação de extração de dados da web","Geração de mapas de elementos interativos","Depuração de fluxos de trabalho de aplicativos web"],"ru":["Автоматизация извлечения данных из веб-страниц","Генерация карт интерактивных элементов","Отладка рабочих процессов веб-приложений"],"ar":["أتمتة استخراج البيانات من الويب","إنشاء خرائط للعناصر التفاعلية","تصحيح أخطاء سير عمل التطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chromium download and installation","Command-line interface only","Global installation required via npm"],"zh":["需要下载和安装Chromium","仅支持命令行界面","需要通过npm进行全局安装"],"ja":["Chromiumのダウンロードとインストールが必要","コマンドラインインターフェイスのみのサポート","npm経由でのグローバルインストールが必要"],"ko":["크로미움 다운로드 및 설치가 필요","명령줄 인터페이스만 지원","npm을 통해 전역 설치가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la descarga e instalación de Chromium","Solo interfaz de línea de comandos","Instalación global requerida vía npm"],"fr":["Nécessite le téléchargement et l''installation de Chromium","Interface de ligne de commande uniquement","Installation globale requise via npm"],"de":["Benötigt den Download und die Installation von Chromium","Nur Kommandozeilenoberfläche","Globale Installation über npm erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer download e instalação do Chromium","Interface de linha de comando apenas","Instalação global necessária via npm"],"ru":["Требуется скачивание и установка Chromium","Только интерфейс командной строки","Требуется глобальная установка через npm"],"ar":["يتطلب تنزيل وتثبيت كروم","واجهة سطر الأوامر فقط","تثبيت عالمي مطلوب عبر npm"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ruvnet/agentic-flow/V3 Core Implementation', 'community', 'ruvnet', 'agentic-flow', 'ruvnet/agentic-flow', 'V3 Core Implementation', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z', '2026-02-18T09:03:33.061Z', NULL, '{"id":"ruvnet/agentic-flow/V3 Core Implementation","name":"V3 Core Implementation","description":{"zh":"V3 Core 实现提供了在 Claude Code/Agent SDK 中集成替代低成本 AI 模型的能力，实现 Domain-Driven Design 原则、清晰架构模式和现代 TypeScript 最佳实践","ja":"V3 Core 実装は、Claude Code/Agent SDK で代替の低コスト AI モデルを統合し、Domain-Driven Design 原則、クリーンアーキテクチャパターン、そしてモダンな TypeScript ベストプラクティスを実現","ko":"V3 Core 구현은 Claude Code/Agent SDK에서 대체 저렴한 AI 모델을 통합하여 Domain-Driven Design 원칙, 깨끗한 아키텍처 패턴 및 최신 TypeScript 모범 사례를 구현","es":"La implementación V3 Core permite a los desarrolladores implementar módulos de TypeScript para claude-flow v3 siguiendo principios de diseño de dominio y patrones de arquitectura limpia.","fr":"La mise en œuvre V3 Core permet aux développeurs d''implémenter des modules TypeScript pour claude-flow v3 en suivant les principes de conception de domaine et les modèles d''architecture propre.","de":"Die V3-Core-Implementierung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, TypeScript-Module für claude-flow v3 zu implementieren, indem sie die Prinzipien des Domain-Driven Design und die Muster der sauberen Architektur befolgen.","pt":"A Implementação V3 Core permite desenvolver agentes de inteligência artificial de baixo custo e alta eficiência, utilizando o Claude Code e seguindo princípios de Domain-Driven Design","ru":"V3 Core Реализация позволяет разработать агенты искусственного интеллекта с низкими затратами и высокой эффективностью, используя Claude Code и следуя принципам Domain-Driven Design","ar":"تنفيذ V3 Core يسمح بتطوير وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي منخفض التكلفة والكفاءة العالية، باستخدام كلود كود ومتبعًا مبادئ تصميم الدومين","en":"Easily switch between alternative low-cost AI models in Claude Code/Agent SDK. For those comfortable using Claude agents and commands, it lets you take what you''ve created and deploy fully hosted agents for real business purposes. Use Claude Code to get the agent working, then deploy it in your f..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"V3 Core 实现 - 低成本 AI 模型集成","ja":"V3 Core 実装 - 低コスト AI モデル切り替え","ko":"V3 Core 구현 - 저렴한 AI 모델 전환","es":"Implementación V3 Core - Desarrollo de Agentes AI","fr":"Mise en œuvre V3 Core - Développement d''agents AI","de":"V3 Core-Implementierung - Entwicklung von KI-Agents","pt":"Implementação V3 Core: Desenvolvimento de Agentes Claude","ru":"V3 Core Реализация: Разработка Агентов Claude","ar":"تنفيذ V3 Core: تطوير وكلاء كلود","en":"V3 Core Implementation"},"description":{"zh":"V3 Core 实现提供了在 Claude Code/Agent SDK 中集成替代低成本 AI 模型的能力，实现 Domain-Driven Design 原则、清晰架构模式和现代 TypeScript 最佳实践","ja":"V3 Core 実装は、Claude Code/Agent SDK で代替の低コスト AI モデルを統合し、Domain-Driven Design 原則、クリーンアーキテクチャパターン、そしてモダンな TypeScript ベストプラクティスを実現","ko":"V3 Core 구현은 Claude Code/Agent SDK에서 대체 저렴한 AI 모델을 통합하여 Domain-Driven Design 원칙, 깨끗한 아키텍처 패턴 및 최신 TypeScript 모범 사례를 구현","es":"La implementación V3 Core permite a los desarrolladores implementar módulos de TypeScript para claude-flow v3 siguiendo principios de diseño de dominio y pat...","fr":"La mise en œuvre V3 Core permet aux développeurs d''implémenter des modules TypeScript pour claude-flow v3 en suivant les principes de conception de domaine e...","de":"Die V3-Core-Implementierung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, TypeScript-Module für claude-flow v3 zu implementieren, indem sie die Prinzipien des Domain-Driven Des...","pt":"A Implementação V3 Core permite desenvolver agentes de inteligência artificial de baixo custo e alta eficiência, utilizando o Claude Code e seguindo princípi...","ru":"V3 Core Реализация позволяет разработать агенты искусственного интеллекта с низкими затратами и высокой эффективностью, используя Claude Code и следуя принци...","ar":"تنفيذ V3 Core يسمح بتطوير وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي منخفض التكلفة والكفاءة العالية، باستخدام كلود كود ومتبعًا مبادئ تصميم الدومين","en":"Easily switch between alternative low-cost AI models in Claude Code/Agent SDK. For those comfortable using Claude agents and commands, it lets you take what ..."},"definition":{"en":"Easily switch between alternative low-cost AI models in Claude Code/Agent SDK. For those comfortable using Claude agents and commands, it lets you take what you''ve created and deploy fully hosted agents for real business purposes. Use Claude Code to get the agent working, then deploy it in your favorite cloud."},"features":{"zh":["轻松切换替代低成本 AI 模型","支持 Domain-Driven Design 原则","实现清晰架构模式","现代 TypeScript 最佳实践","全面的测试覆盖","支持多云平台部署"],"ja":["代替の低コスト AI モデルを簡単に切り替え","Domain-Driven Design 原則をサポート","クリーンアーキテクチャパターンを実現","モダンな TypeScript ベストプラクティス","包括的なテストカバー","複数のクラウドプラットフォームへのデプロイをサポート"],"ko":["대체 저렴한 AI 모델을 쉽게 전환","Domain-Driven Design 원칙 지원","깨끗한 아키텍처 패턴 구현","최신 TypeScript 모범 사례","전面的 테스트 커버","다중 클라우드 플랫폼 배포 지원"],"es":["Implementación de módulos de TypeScript para claude-flow v3","Seguimiento de principios de diseño de dominio","Patrones de arquitectura limpia","Cobertura de pruebas completa","Despliegue en cloud"],"fr":["Implémentation de modules TypeScript pour claude-flow v3","Suivi des principes de conception de domaine","Modèles d''architecture propre","Couverture de tests complète","Déploiement dans le cloud"],"de":["Implementierung von TypeScript-Modulen für claude-flow v3","Befolgen der Prinzipien des Domain-Driven Design","Muster der sauberen Architektur","Umfassende Testabdeckung","Bereitstellung in der Cloud"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de agentes de inteligência artificial de baixo custo","Utilização do Claude Code e seguimento de princípios de Domain-Driven Design","Implementação de arquitetura limpa e moderna","Cobertura de testes abrangente","Integração com nuvens favoritas","Flexibilidade para switch entre modelos de IA alternativos"],"ru":["Разработка агентов искусственного интеллекта с низкими затратами","Использование Claude Code и следование принципам Domain-Driven Design","Реализация чистой и современной архитектуры","Полное покрытие тестов","Интеграция с любимыми облаками","Гибкость для переключения между альтернативными моделями ИИ"],"ar":["تطوير وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي منخفض التكلفة","استخدام كلود كود و متابعة مبادئ تصميم الدومين","تنفيذ هيكل نظيف و حديث","تغطية اختبارات شاملة","دمج مع السحابات المفضلة","مرونة للتبديل بين نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي البديلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["V3 Core 实现","低成本 AI 模型","Claude Code","Agent SDK","Domain-Driven Design","TypeScript","云平台部署"],"ja":["V3 Core 実装","低コスト AI モデル","Claude Code","Agent SDK","Domain-Driven Design","TypeScript","クラウドプラットフォームへのデプロイ"],"ko":["V3 Core 구현","저렴한 AI 모델","Claude Code","Agent SDK","Domain-Driven Design","TypeScript","클라우드 플랫폼 배포"],"es":["implementación V3 Core","desarrollo de agentes AI","claude-flow v3","TypeScript","diseño de dominio","arquitectura limpia","despliegue en cloud"],"fr":["mise en œuvre V3 Core","développement d''agents AI","claude-flow v3","TypeScript","conception de domaine","architecture propre","déploiement dans le cloud"],"de":["V3-Core-Implementierung","Entwicklung von KI-Agents","claude-flow v3","TypeScript","Domain-Driven Design","saubere Architektur","Bereitstellung in der Cloud"],"pt":["V3 Core Implementação","Desenvolvimento de agentes de IA","Claude Code","Domain-Driven Design","Arquitetura limpa","Testes abrangentes","Integração com nuvens","Modelos de IA alternativos"],"ru":["V3 Core Реализация","Разработка агентов ИИ","Claude Code","Domain-Driven Design","Чистая архитектура","Полное покрытие тестов","Интеграция с облаками","Альтернативные модели ИИ"],"ar":["تنفيذ V3 Core","تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","كلود كود","تصميم الدومين","هيكل نظيف","تغطية اختبارات شاملة","دمج مع السحابات","نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي البديلة"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"agentic-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/agentic-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"V3 Core Implementation","description":"Core module implementation for claude-flow v3. Implements DDD domains, clean architecture patterns, dependency injection, and modular TypeScript codebase with comprehensive testing.","bodyPreview":"# V3 Core Implementation\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nImplements the core TypeScript modules for claude-flow v3 following Domain-Driven Design principles, clean architecture patterns, and modern TypeScript best practices with comprehensive test coverage.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Initialize core implementation\nTask(\"Core foundation\", \"Set up DDD domain structure and base classes\", \"core-implementer\")\n\n# Domain implementation (parallel)\nTask(\"Task domain\", \"Implement task management domain with ent","body":"# V3 Core Implementation\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nImplements the core TypeScript modules for claude-flow v3 following Domain-Driven Design principles, clean architecture patterns, and modern TypeScript best practices with comprehensive test coverage.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Initialize core implementation\nTask(\"Core foundation\", \"Set up DDD domain structure and base classes\", \"core-implementer\")\n\n# Domain implementation (parallel)\nTask(\"Task domain\", \"Implement task management domain with entities and services\", \"core-implementer\")\nTask(\"Session domain\", \"Implement session management domain\", \"core-implementer\")\nTask(\"Health domain\", \"Implement health monitoring domain\", \"core-implementer\")\n```\n\n## Core Implementation Architecture\n\n### Domain Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── core/\n│   ├── kernel/                     # Microkernel pattern\n│   │   ├── claude-flow-kernel.ts\n│   │   ├── domain-registry.ts\n│   │   └── plugin-loader.ts\n│   │\n│   ├── domains/                    # DDD Bounded Contexts\n│   │   ├── task-management/\n│   │   │   ├── entities/\n│   │   │   ├── value-objects/\n│   │   │   ├── services/\n│   │   │   ├── repositories/\n│   │   │   └── events/\n│   │   │\n│   │   ├── session-management/\n│   │   ├── health-monitoring/\n│   │   ├── lifecycle-management/\n│   │   └── event-coordination/\n│   │\n│   ├── shared/                     # Shared kernel\n│   │   ├── domain/\n│   │   │   ├── entity.ts\n│   │   │   ├── value-object.ts\n│   │   │   ├── domain-event.ts\n│   │   │   └── aggregate-root.ts\n│   │   │\n│   │   ├── infrastructure/\n│   │   │   ├── event-bus.ts\n│   │   │   ├── dependency-container.ts\n│   │   │   └── logger.ts\n│   │   │\n│   │   └── types/\n│   │       ├── common.ts\n│   │       ├── errors.ts\n│   │       └── interfaces.ts\n│   │\n│   └── application/                # Application services\n│       ├── use-cases/\n│       ├── commands/\n│       ├── queries/\n│       └── handlers/\n```\n\n## Base Domain Classes\n\n### Entity Base Class\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/domain/entity.ts\nexport abstract class Entity<T> {\n  protected readonly _id: T;\n  private _domainEvents: DomainEvent[] = [];\n\n  constructor(id: T) {\n    this._id = id;\n  }\n\n  get id(): T {\n    return this._id;\n  }\n\n  public equals(object?: Entity<T>): boolean {\n    if (object == null || object == undefined) {\n      return false;\n    }\n\n    if (this === object) {\n      return true;\n    }\n\n    if (!(object instanceof Entity)) {\n      return false;\n    }\n\n    return this._id === object._id;\n  }\n\n  protected addDomainEvent(domainEvent: DomainEvent): void {\n    this._domainEvents.push(domainEvent);\n  }\n\n  public getUncommittedEvents(): DomainEvent[] {\n    return this._domainEvents;\n  }\n\n  public markEventsAsCommitted(): void {\n    this._domainEvents = [];\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Value Object Base Class\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/domain/value-object.ts\nexport abstract class ValueObject<T> {\n  protected readonly props: T;\n\n  constructor(props: T) {\n    this.props = Object.freeze(props);\n  }\n\n  public equals(object?: ValueObject<T>): boolean {\n    if (object == null || object == undefined) {\n      return false;\n    }\n\n    if (this === object) {\n      return true;\n    }\n\n    return JSON.stringify(this.props) === JSON.stringify(object.props);\n  }\n\n  get value(): T {\n    return this.props;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Aggregate Root\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/domain/aggregate-root.ts\nexport abstract class AggregateRoot<T> extends Entity<T> {\n  private _version: number = 0;\n\n  get version(): number {\n    return this._version;\n  }\n\n  protected incrementVersion(): void {\n    this._version++;\n  }\n\n  public applyEvent(event: DomainEvent): void {\n    this.addDomainEvent(event);\n    this.incrementVersion();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Task Management Domain Implementation\n\n### Task Entity\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/entities/task.entity.ts\nimport { AggregateRoot } from \"../../../shared/domain/aggregate-root\";\nimport { TaskId } from \"../value-objects/task-id.vo\";\nimport { TaskStatus } from \"../value-objects/task-status.vo\";\nimport { Priority } from \"../value-objects/priority.vo\";\nimport { TaskAssignedEvent } from \"../events/task-assigned.event\";\n\ninterface TaskProps {\n  id: TaskId;\n  description: string;\n  priority: Priority;\n  status: TaskStatus;\n  assignedAgentId?: string;\n  createdAt: Date;\n  updatedAt: Date;\n}\n\nexport class Task extends AggregateRoot<TaskId> {\n  private props: TaskProps;\n\n  private constructor(props: TaskProps) {\n    super(props.id);\n    this.props = props;\n  }\n\n  static create(description: string, priority: Priority): Task {\n    const task = new Task({\n      id: TaskId.create(),\n      description,\n      priority,\n      status: TaskStatus.pending(),\n      createdAt: new Date(),\n      updatedAt: new Date(),\n    });\n\n    return task;\n  }\n\n  static reconstitute(props: TaskProps): Task {\n    return new Task(props);\n  }\n\n  public assignTo(agentId: string): void {\n    if (this.props.status.equals(TaskStatus.completed())) {\n      throw new Error(\"Cannot assign completed task\");\n    }\n\n    this.props.assignedAgentId = agentId;\n    this.props.status = TaskStatus.assigned();\n    this.props.updatedAt = new Date();\n\n    this.applyEvent(\n      new TaskAssignedEvent(this.id.value, agentId, this.props.priority),\n    );\n  }\n\n  public complete(result: TaskResult): void {\n    if (!this.props.assignedAgentId) {\n      throw new Error(\"Cannot complete unassigned task\");\n    }\n\n    this.props.status = TaskStatus.completed();\n    this.props.updatedAt = new Date();\n\n    this.applyEvent(\n      new TaskCompletedEvent(this.id.value, result, this.calculateDuration()),\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Getters\n  get description(): string {\n    return this.props.description;\n  }\n  get priority(): Priority {\n    return this.props.priority;\n  }\n  get status(): TaskStatus {\n    return this.props.status;\n  }\n  get assignedAgentId(): string | undefined {\n    return this.props.assignedAgentId;\n  }\n  get createdAt(): Date {\n    return this.props.createdAt;\n  }\n  get updatedAt(): Date {\n    return this.props.updatedAt;\n  }\n\n  private calculateDuration(): number {\n    return this.props.updatedAt.getTime() - this.props.createdAt.getTime();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Task Value Objects\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/value-objects/task-id.vo.ts\nexport class TaskId extends ValueObject<string> {\n  private constructor(value: string) {\n    super({ value });\n  }\n\n  static create(): TaskId {\n    return new TaskId(crypto.randomUUID());\n  }\n\n  static fromString(id: string): TaskId {\n    if (!id || id.length === 0) {\n      throw new Error(\"TaskId cannot be empty\");\n    }\n    return new TaskId(id);\n  }\n\n  get value(): string {\n    return this.props.value;\n  }\n}\n\n// src/core/domains/task-management/value-objects/task-status.vo.ts\ntype TaskStatusType =\n  | \"pending\"\n  | \"assigned\"\n  | \"in_progress\"\n  | \"completed\"\n  | \"failed\";\n\nexport class TaskStatus extends ValueObject<TaskStatusType> {\n  private constructor(status: TaskStatusType) {\n    super({ value: status });\n  }\n\n  static pending(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"pending\");\n  }\n  static assigned(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"assigned\");\n  }\n  static inProgress(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"in_progress\");\n  }\n  static completed(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"completed\");\n  }\n  static failed(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"failed\");\n  }\n\n  get value(): TaskStatusType {\n    return this.props.value;\n  }\n\n  public isPending(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"pending\";\n  }\n  public isAssigned(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"assigned\";\n  }\n  public isInProgress(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"in_progress\";\n  }\n  public isCompleted(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"completed\";\n  }\n  public isFailed(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"failed\";\n  }\n}\n\n// src/core/domains/task-management/value-objects/priority.vo.ts\ntype PriorityLevel = \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\" | \"critical\";\n\nexport class Priority extends ValueObject<PriorityLevel> {\n  private constructor(level: PriorityLevel) {\n    super({ value: level });\n  }\n\n  static low(): Priority {\n    return new Priority(\"low\");\n  }\n  static medium(): Priority {\n    return new Priority(\"medium\");\n  }\n  static high(): Priority {\n    return new Priority(\"high\");\n  }\n  static critical(): Priority {\n    return new Priority(\"critical\");\n  }\n\n  get value(): PriorityLevel {\n    return this.props.value;\n  }\n\n  public getNumericValue(): number {\n    const priorities = { low: 1, medium: 2, high: 3, critical: 4 };\n    return priorities[this.value];\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Domain Services\n\n### Task Scheduling Service\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/services/task-scheduling.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from \"../../../shared/infrastructure/dependency-container\";\nimport { Task } from \"../entities/task.entity\";\nimport { Priority } from \"../value-objects/priority.vo\";\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class TaskSchedulingService {\n  public prioritizeTasks(tasks: Task[]): Task[] {\n    return tasks.sort(\n      (a, b) => b.priority.getNumericValue() - a.priority.getNumericValue(),\n    );\n  }\n\n  public canSchedule(task: Task, agentCapacity: number): boolean {\n    if (agentCapacity <= 0) return false;\n\n    // Critical tasks always schedulable\n    if (task.priority.equals(Priority.critical())) return true;\n\n    // Other logic based on capacity\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  public calculateEstimatedDuration(task: Task): number {\n    // Simple heuristic - would use ML in real implementation\n    const baseTime = 300000; // 5 minutes\n    const priorityMultiplier = {\n      low: 0.5,\n      medium: 1.0,\n      high: 1.5,\n      critical: 2.0,\n    };\n\n    return baseTime * priorityMultiplier[task.priority.value];\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Repository Interfaces & Implementations\n\n### Task Repository Interface\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/repositories/task.repository.ts\nexport interface ITaskRepository {\n  save(task: Task): Promise<void>;\n  findById(id: TaskId): Promise<Task | null>;\n  findByAgentId(agentId: string): Promise<Task[]>;\n  findByStatus(status: TaskStatus): Promise<Task[]>;\n  findPendingTasks(): Promise<Task[]>;\n  delete(id: TaskId): Promise<void>;\n}\n```\n\n### SQLite Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/repositories/sqlite-task.repository.ts\n@Injectable()\nexport class SqliteTaskRepository implements ITaskRepository {\n  constructor(\n    @Inject(\"Database\") private db: Database,\n    @Inject(\"Logger\") private logger: ILogger,\n  ) {}\n\n  async save(task: Task): Promise<void> {\n    const sql = `\n      INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tasks (\n        id, description, priority, status, assigned_agent_id, created_at, updated_at\n      ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)\n    `;\n\n    await this.db.run(sql, [\n      task.id.value,\n      task.description,\n      task.priority.value,\n      task.status.value,\n      task.assignedAgentId,\n      task.createdAt.toISOString(),\n      task.updatedAt.toISOString(),\n    ]);\n\n    this.logger.debug(`Task saved: ${task.id.value}`);\n  }\n\n  async findById(id: TaskId): Promise<Task | null> {\n    const sql = \"SELECT * FROM tasks WHERE id = ?\";\n    const row = await this.db.get(sql, [id.value]);\n\n    return row ? this.mapRowToTask(row) : null;\n  }\n\n  async findPendingTasks(): Promise<Task[]> {\n    const sql =\n      \"SELECT * FROM tasks WHERE status = ? ORDER BY priority DESC, created_at ASC\";\n    const rows = await this.db.all(sql, [\"pending\"]);\n\n    return rows.map((row) => this.mapRowToTask(row));\n  }\n\n  private mapRowToTask(row: any): Task {\n    return Task.reconstitute({\n      id: TaskId.fromString(row.id),\n      description: row.description,\n      priority: Priority.fromString(row.priority),\n      status: TaskStatus.fromString(row.status),\n      assignedAgentId: row.assigned_agent_id,\n      createdAt: new Date(row.created_at),\n      updatedAt: new Date(row.updated_at),\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Application Layer\n\n### Use Case Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/application/use-cases/assign-task.use-case.ts\n@Injectable()\nexport class AssignTaskUseCase {\n  constructor(\n    @Inject(\"TaskRepository\") private taskRepository: ITaskRepository,\n    @Inject(\"AgentRepository\") private agentRepository: IAgentRepository,\n    @Inject(\"DomainEventBus\") private eventBus: DomainEventBus,\n    @Inject(\"Logger\") private logger: ILogger,\n  ) {}\n\n  async execute(command: AssignTaskCommand): Promise<AssignTaskResult> {\n    try {\n      // 1. Validate command\n      await this.validateCommand(command);\n\n      // 2. Load aggregates\n      const task = await this.taskRepository.findById(command.taskId);\n      if (!task) {\n        throw new TaskNotFoundError(command.taskId);\n      }\n\n      const agent = await this.agentRepository.findById(command.agentId);\n      if (!agent) {\n        throw new AgentNotFoundError(command.agentId);\n      }\n\n      // 3. Business logic\n      if (!agent.canAcceptTask(task)) {\n        throw new AgentCannotAcceptTaskError(command.agentId, command.taskId);\n      }\n\n      task.assignTo(command.agentId);\n      agent.acceptTask(task.id);\n\n      // 4. Persist changes\n      await Promise.all([\n        this.taskRepository.save(task),\n        this.agentRepository.save(agent),\n      ]);\n\n      // 5. Publish domain events\n      const events = [\n        ...task.getUncommittedEvents(),\n        ...agent.getUncommittedEvents(),\n      ];\n\n      for (const event of events) {\n        await this.eventBus.publish(event);\n      }\n\n      task.markEventsAsCommitted();\n      agent.markEventsAsCommitted();\n\n      // 6. Return result\n      this.logger.info(\n        `Task ${command.taskId.value} assigned to agent ${command.agentId}`,\n      );\n\n      return AssignTaskResult.success({\n        taskId: task.id,\n        agentId: command.agentId,\n        assignedAt: new Date(),\n      });\n    } catch (error) {\n      this.logger.error(\n        `Failed to assign task ${command.taskId.value}:`,\n        error,\n      );\n      return AssignTaskResult.failure(error);\n    }\n  }\n\n  private async validateCommand(command: AssignTaskCommand): Promise<void> {\n    if (!command.taskId) {\n      throw new ValidationError(\"Task ID is required\");\n    }\n    if (!command.agentId) {\n      throw new ValidationError(\"Agent ID is required\");\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Dependency Injection Setup\n\n### Container Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/infrastructure/dependency-container.ts\nimport { Container } from \"inversify\";\nimport { TYPES } from \"./types\";\n\nexport class DependencyContainer {\n  private container: Container;\n\n  constructor() {\n    this.container = new Container();\n    this.setupBindings();\n  }\n\n  private setupBindings(): void {\n    // Repositories\n    this.container\n      .bind<ITaskRepository>(TYPES.TaskRepository)\n      .to(SqliteTaskRepository)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    this.container\n      .bind<IAgentRepository>(TYPES.AgentRepository)\n      .to(SqliteAgentRepository)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    // Services\n    this.container\n      .bind<TaskSchedulingService>(TYPES.TaskSchedulingService)\n      .to(TaskSchedulingService)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    // Use Cases\n    this.container\n      .bind<AssignTaskUseCase>(TYPES.AssignTaskUseCase)\n      .to(AssignTaskUseCase)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    // Infrastructure\n    this.container\n      .bind<ILogger>(TYPES.Logger)\n      .to(ConsoleLogger)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    this.container\n      .bind<DomainEventBus>(TYPES.DomainEventBus)\n      .to(InMemoryDomainEventBus)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n  }\n\n  get<T>(serviceIdentifier: symbol): T {\n    return this.container.get<T>(serviceIdentifier);\n  }\n\n  bind<T>(serviceIdentifier: symbol): BindingToSyntax<T> {\n    return this.container.bind<T>(serviceIdentifier);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Modern TypeScript Configuration\n\n### Strict TypeScript Setup\n\n```json\n// tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"lib\": [\"ES2022\"],\n    \"module\": \"NodeNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"NodeNext\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"./dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"exactOptionalPropertyTypes\": true,\n    \"noImplicitReturns\": true,\n    \"noFallthroughCasesInSwitch\": true,\n    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\": true,\n    \"noImplicitOverride\": true,\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"emitDecoratorMetadata\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"allowSyntheticDefaultImports\": true,\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"src/*\"],\n      \"@core/*\": [\"src/core/*\"],\n      \"@shared/*\": [\"src/core/shared/*\"],\n      \"@domains/*\": [\"src/core/domains/*\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\", \"**/*.test.ts\", \"**/*.spec.ts\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Implementation\n\n### Domain Unit Tests\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/__tests__/entities/task.entity.test.ts\ndescribe(\"Task Entity\", () => {\n  let task: Task;\n\n  beforeEach(() => {\n    task = Task.create(\"Test task\", Priority.medium());\n  });\n\n  describe(\"creation\", () => {\n    it(\"should create task with pending status\", () => {\n      expect(task.status.isPending()).toBe(true);\n      expect(task.description).toBe(\"Test task\");\n      expect(task.priority.equals(Priority.medium())).toBe(true);\n    });\n\n    it(\"should generate unique ID\", () => {\n      const task1 = Task.create(\"Task 1\", Priority.low());\n      const task2 = Task.create(\"Task 2\", Priority.low());\n\n      expect(task1.id.equals(task2.id)).toBe(false);\n    });\n  });\n\n  describe(\"assignment\", () => {\n    it(\"should assign to agent and change status\", () => {\n      const agentId = \"agent-123\";\n\n      task.assignTo(agentId);\n\n      expect(task.assignedAgentId).toBe(agentId);\n      expect(task.status.isAssigned()).toBe(true);\n    });\n\n    it(\"should emit TaskAssignedEvent when assigned\", () => {\n      const agentId = \"agent-123\";\n\n      task.assignTo(agentId);\n\n      const events = task.getUncommittedEvents();\n      expect(events).toHaveLength(1);\n      expect(events[0]).toBeInstanceOf(TaskAssignedEvent);\n    });\n\n    it(\"should not allow assignment of completed task\", () => {\n      task.assignTo(\"agent-123\");\n      task.complete(TaskResult.success(\"done\"));\n\n      expect(() => task.assignTo(\"agent-456\")).toThrow(\n        \"Cannot assign completed task\",\n      );\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Integration Tests\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/__tests__/integration/task-repository.integration.test.ts\ndescribe(\"TaskRepository Integration\", () => {\n  let repository: SqliteTaskRepository;\n  let db: Database;\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    db = new Database(\":memory:\");\n    await setupTasksTable(db);\n    repository = new SqliteTaskRepository(db, new ConsoleLogger());\n  });\n\n  afterEach(async () => {\n    await db.close();\n  });\n\n  it(\"should save and retrieve task\", async () => {\n    const task = Task.create(\"Test task\", Priority.high());\n\n    await repository.save(task);\n    const retrieved = await repository.findById(task.id);\n\n    expect(retrieved).toBeDefined();\n    expect(retrieved!.id.equals(task.id)).toBe(true);\n    expect(retrieved!.description).toBe(\"Test task\");\n    expect(retrieved!.priority.equals(Priority.high())).toBe(true);\n  });\n\n  it(\"should find pending tasks ordered by priority\", async () => {\n    const lowTask = Task.create(\"Low priority\", Priority.low());\n    const highTask = Task.create(\"High priority\", Priority.high());\n\n    await repository.save(lowTask);\n    await repository.save(highTask);\n\n    const pending = await repository.findPendingTasks();\n\n    expect(pending).toHaveLength(2);\n    expect(pending[0].id.equals(highTask.id)).toBe(true); // High priority first\n    expect(pending[1].id.equals(lowTask.id)).toBe(true);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Performance Optimizations\n\n### Entity Caching\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/infrastructure/entity-cache.ts\n@Injectable()\nexport class EntityCache<T extends Entity<any>> {\n  private cache = new Map<string, { entity: T; timestamp: number }>();\n  private readonly ttl: number = 300000; // 5 minutes\n\n  set(id: string, entity: T): void {\n    this.cache.set(id, { entity, timestamp: Date.now() });\n  }\n\n  get(id: string): T | null {\n    const cached = this.cache.get(id);\n    if (!cached) return null;\n\n    // Check TTL\n    if (Date.now() - cached.timestamp > this.ttl) {\n      this.cache.delete(id);\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    return cached.entity;\n  }\n\n  invalidate(id: string): void {\n    this.cache.delete(id);\n  }\n\n  clear(): void {\n    this.cache.clear();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- [ ] **Domain Isolation**: 100% clean dependency boundaries\n- [ ] **Test Coverage**: >90% unit test coverage for domain logic\n- [ ] **Type Safety**: Strict TypeScript compilation with zero any types\n- [ ] **Performance**: <50ms average use case execution time\n- [ ] **Memory Efficiency**: <100MB heap usage for core domains\n- [ ] **Plugin Architecture**: Modular domain loading capability\n\n## Related V3 Skills\n\n- `v3-ddd-architecture` - DDD architectural design\n- `v3-mcp-optimization` - MCP server integration\n- `v3-memory-unification` - AgentDB repository integration\n- `v3-swarm-coordination` - Swarm domain implementation\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Complete Core Implementation\n\n```bash\n# Full core module implementation\nTask(\"Core implementation\",\n     \"Implement all core domains with DDD patterns and comprehensive testing\",\n     \"core-implementer\")\n```\n\n### Domain-Specific Implementation\n\n```bash\n# Single domain implementation\nTask(\"Task domain implementation\",\n     \"Implement task management domain with entities, services, and repositories\",\n     \"core-implementer\")\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:03:33.061Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-focused AI Agents seeking to implement Domain-Driven Design principles and clean architecture patterns in Claude Code/Agent SDK environments.","zh":"适合专注于TypeScript的AI代理，旨在在Claude Code/Agent SDK环境中实现领域驱动设计原则和清晰架构模式的代理。","ja":"TypeScriptに焦点を当てたAIエージェントに最適で、Claude Code/Agent SDK環境でドメイン駆動設計の原則とクリーンアーキテクチャパターンを実装するエージェント。","ko":"TypeScript에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, Claude Code/Agent SDK 환경에서 도메인 주도 설계 원칙과 깨끗한 아키텍처 패턴을 구현하는 에이전트입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA enfocados en TypeScript que buscan implementar principios de diseño orientado a dominios y patrones de arquitectura limpia en entornos de Claude Code/Agent SDK.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur TypeScript qui cherchent à mettre en œuvre des principes de conception orientée domaine et des modèles d''architecture propre dans des environnements Claude Code/Agent SDK.","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-fokussierte KI-Agents, die Prinzipien des Domain-Driven Design und Muster einer sauberen Architektur in Claude Code/Agent SDK-Umgebungen implementieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em TypeScript que buscam implementar princípios de Domain-Driven Design e padrões de arquitetura limpa em ambientes de Claude Code/Agent SDK.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на TypeScript, стремящихся реализовать принципы Domain-Driven Design и шаблоны чистой архитектуры в средах Claude Code/Agent SDK.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تركز على TypeScript وتسعى إلى تنفيذ مبادئ Domain-Driven Design وأنماط بنية نظيفة في بيئات Claude Code/Agent SDK."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy fully hosted agents for real business purposes by easily switching between alternative low-cost AI models, leveraging comprehensive test coverage and modern TypeScript best practices, including Domain-Driven Design and clean architecture patterns.","zh":"使代理能够通过轻松切换替代低成本AI模型，利用全面测试覆盖和现代TypeScript最佳实践（包括领域驱动设计和清晰架构模式），部署完全托管的代理以实现真正的业务目的。","ja":"代替の低コストAIモデルを容易に切り替えることで、包括的なテストカバレッジと最新のTypeScriptベストプラクティス（ドメイン駆動設計とクリーンアーキテクチャパターンを含む）を活用して、完全にホストされたエージェントを本格的なビジネス目的で展開できるようになります。","ko":"대체 저비용 AI 모델을 쉽게 전환하여, 포괄적인 테스트 커버리지와 최신 TypeScript 모범 사례(도메인 주도 설계 및 깨끗한 아키텍처 패턴 포함)를 활용하여 완전히 호스팅된 에이전트를 실제 비즈니스 목적으로 배포할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar agentes completamente alojados para propósitos comerciales reales mediante el cambio fácil entre modelos de IA de bajo costo alternativos, aprovechando una cobertura de prueba integral y las mejores prácticas modernas de TypeScript, incluidos el diseño orientado a dominios y los patrones de arquitectura limpia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des agents entièrement hébergés à des fins commerciales réelles en passant facilement d''un modèle de IA à faible coût à un autre, en exploitant une couverture de test complète et les meilleures pratiques modernes de TypeScript, y compris la conception orientée domaine et les modèles d''architecture propre.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, vollständig gehostete Agents für reale Geschäftszwecke bereitzustellen, indem sie leicht zwischen alternativen kostengünstigen KI-Modellen wechseln, eine umfassende Testabdeckung und moderne TypeScript-Best-Practices nutzend, einschließlich Domain-Driven Design und sauberer Architekturmuster.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar agentes totalmente hospedados para fins comerciais reais, alternando facilmente entre modelos de IA de baixo custo alternativos, aproveitando uma cobertura de teste abrangente e as melhores práticas modernas de TypeScript, incluindo Domain-Driven Design e padrões de arquitetura limpa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать полностью хостинговые агенты для реальных бизнес-целей, легко переключаясь между альтернативными низкозатратными моделями ИИ, используя полное тестовое покрытие и современные лучшие практики TypeScript, включая Domain-Driven Design и шаблоны чистой архитектуры.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من نشر عمليات وكيل محتوي completamente لاستخدامات تجارية حقيقية من خلال التبديل بسهولة بين نماذج ذكاء اصطناعي بديلة منخفضة التكلفة، واستخدام تغطية اختبار شاملة وأفضل الممارسات الحديثة لبرمجة TypeScript، بما في ذلك مبادئ Domain-Driven Design وأنماط البنية النظيفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing task management domains with entity relationships","Setting up DDD domain structures and base classes for claude-flow v3","Deploying hosted agents for business purposes using Claude Code"],"zh":["实现具有实体关系的任务管理域","设置DDD域结构和claude-flow v3的基类","使用Claude Code部署托管代理以实现业务目的"],"ja":["エンティティ関係を持つタスク管理ドメインの実装","DDDドメイン構造とclaude-flow v3のベースクラスの設定","Claude Codeを使用したビジネス目的のホストエージェントの展開"],"ko":["엔티티 관계가 있는 태스크 관리 도메인 구현","DDD 도메인 구조 및 claude-flow v3의 기본 클래스 설정","Claude Code를 사용하여 비즈니스 목적의 호스팅 에이전트 배포"],"es":["Implementar dominios de gestión de tareas con relaciones de entidades","Configurar estructuras de dominio DDD y clases base para claude-flow v3","Implementar agentes alojados para propósitos comerciales mediante Claude Code"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des domaines de gestion de tâches avec des relations d''entités","Configurer des structures de domaine DDD et des classes de base pour claude-flow v3","Déployer des agents hébergés pour des fins commerciales à l''aide de Claude Code"],"de":["Implementieren von Task-Management-Domains mit Entity-Beziehungen","Einrichten von DDD-Domain-Strukturen und Basis-Klassen für claude-flow v3","Bereitstellen von gehosteten Agents für Geschäftszwecke unter Verwendung von Claude Code"],"pt":["Implementar domínios de gerenciamento de tarefas com relacionamentos de entidades","Configurar estruturas de domínio DDD e classes base para claude-flow v3","Implantar agentes hospedados para fins comerciais usando Claude Code"],"ru":["Реализовать домены управления задачами с отношениями сущностей","Настроить структуры домена DDD и базовые классы для claude-flow v3","Развертывать хостинговые агенты для бизнес-целей с помощью Claude Code"],"ar":["تنفيذ مجالات إدارة المهام مع علاقات الكيانات","إعداد هياكل المجال DDD والفئات الأساسية ل claude-flow v3","نشر عمليات وكيل محتوي لاستخدامات تجارية باستخدام Claude Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comfort with using Claude agents and commands","Specific to Claude Code/Agent SDK and TypeScript environments","Needs comprehensive test coverage for robust implementation"],"zh":["需要熟悉使用Claude代理和命令","特定于Claude Code/Agent SDK和TypeScript环境","需要全面测试覆盖以实现强大的实现"],"ja":["Claudeエージェントとコマンドの使用に慣れている必要がある","Claude Code/Agent SDKおよびTypeScript環境に特有のもの","堅牢な実装には包括的なテストカバレッジが必要"],"ko":["Claude 에이전트 및 명령어 사용에 익숙해야 함","Claude Code/Agent SDK 및 TypeScript 환경에 특정","강력한 구현을 위해서는 포괄적인 테스트 커버리지가 필요"],"es":["Requiere comodidad al utilizar agentes y comandos de Claude","Específico para entornos de Claude Code/Agent SDK y TypeScript","Necesita una cobertura de prueba integral para una implementación robusta"],"fr":["Nécessite une certaine familiarité avec les agents et les commandes de Claude","Spécifique aux environnements Claude Code/Agent SDK et TypeScript","Nécessite une couverture de test complète pour une mise en œuvre robuste"],"de":["Erfordert Vertrautheit mit der Verwendung von Claude-Agents und -Befehlen","Spezifisch für Claude Code/Agent SDK- und TypeScript-Umgebungen","Benötigt eine umfassende Testabdeckung für eine robuste Implementierung"],"pt":["Exige confort com o uso de agentes e comandos Claude","Específico para ambientes Claude Code/Agent SDK e TypeScript","Necessita de cobertura de teste abrangente para implementação robusta"],"ru":["Требует комфорта с использованием агентов и команд Claude","Специфичен для сред Claude Code/Agent SDK и TypeScript","Требует полного тестового покрытия для надежной реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب الراحة مع استخدام عمليات وكيل Claude والأوامر","محدد لبيئات Claude Code/Agent SDK وبرمجة TypeScript","يحتاج إلى تغطية اختبار شاملة لتنفيذ متين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tachyon-zcash/ragu/book-refine', 'community', 'tachyon-zcash', 'ragu', 'tachyon-zcash/ragu', 'book-refine', 0, 0, 20, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z', '2026-02-18T09:03:47.960Z', NULL, '{"id":"tachyon-zcash/ragu/book-refine","name":"book-refine","description":{"zh":"Rust,Rust","ja":"RustRust","ko":"Rust, Rust","es":"Book Refine es un marco de datos de prueba de lenguaje Rust que mejora la infraestructura de reseñas de libros","fr":"Book Refine est un cadre de données de preuve de langage Rust qui améliore l''infrastructure de critiques de livres","de":"Book Refine ist ein Rust-Sprach-Nachweis-Datenrahmen, der die Infrastruktur für Buchbewertungen verbessert","pt":"Book Refine é um framework de dados de prova de linguagem Rust que melhora a infraestrutura de revisão de livros","ru":"Book Refine - это фреймворк доказательств языка Rust, который улучшает инфраструктуру рецензирования книг","ar":"Book Refine هو إطار عمل لغة روست لحمل البيانات الذي يحسّن بنية المراجعة الكتابية","en":"Rust language proof-carrying data framework"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Rust ","ja":"Rust","ko":"Rust ","es":"Book Refine: Marco de datos de prueba de lenguaje Rust","fr":"Book Refine: Cadre de données de preuve de langage Rust","de":"Book Refine: Rust-Sprach-Nachweis-Datenrahmen","pt":"Book Refine: Framework de Dados de Prova de Linguagem Rust","ru":"Book Refine: Фреймворк доказательств языка Rust","ar":"Book Refine: إطار عمل لغة روست لحمل البيانات","en":"book-refine"},"description":{"zh":"Rust,Rust","ja":"RustRust","ko":"Rust, Rust","es":"Book Refine es un marco de datos de prueba de lenguaje Rust que mejora la infraestructura de reseñas de libros","fr":"Book Refine est un cadre de données de preuve de langage Rust qui améliore l''infrastructure de critiques de livres","de":"Book Refine ist ein Rust-Sprach-Nachweis-Datenrahmen, der die Infrastruktur für Buchbewertungen verbessert","pt":"Book Refine é um framework de dados de prova de linguagem Rust que melhora a infraestrutura de revisão de livros","ru":"Book Refine - это фреймворк доказательств языка Rust, который улучшает инфраструктуру рецензирования книг","ar":"Book Refine هو إطار عمل لغة روست لحمل البيانات الذي يحسّن بنية المراجعة الكتابية","en":"Rust language proof-carrying data framework"},"definition":{"en":"Rust language proof-carrying data framework"},"features":{"zh":["Rust","","","EnterPlanMode","",""],"ja":["Rust","","","EnterPlanMode","",""],"ko":["Rust","","","EnterPlanMode","",""],"es":["Marco de datos de prueba de lenguaje Rust","Mejora la infraestructura de reseñas de libros","Incorpora la retroalimentación del usuario","Utiliza el modo de planificación para la aprobación del usuario","Análisis y auditoría de la infraestructura de reseñas de libros"],"fr":["Cadre de données de preuve de langage Rust","Améliore l''infrastructure de critiques de livres","Intègre la rétroaction de l''utilisateur","Utilise le mode de planification pour l''approbation de l''utilisateur","Analyse et audit de l''infrastructure de critiques de livres"],"de":["Rust-Sprach-Nachweis-Datenrahmen","Verbessert die Infrastruktur für Buchbewertungen","Integriert die Rückmeldung des Benutzers","Verwendet den Planungsmodus für die Benutzerfreigabe","Analyse und Prüfung der Infrastruktur für Buchbewertungen"],"pt":["Framework de dados de prova de linguagem Rust","Melhoria da infraestrutura de revisão de livros","Análise e auditoria de feedback de usuários","Plano de execução personalizado","Integração com sistemas de revisão de livros existentes","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de dados"],"ru":["Фреймворк доказательств языка Rust","Улучшение инфраструктуры рецензирования книг","Анализ и аудит отзывов пользователей","План выполнения, адаптированный к потребностям пользователя","Интеграция с существующими системами рецензирования книг","Поддержка нескольких форматов данных"],"ar":["إطار عمل لغة روست لحمل البيانات","تحسين بنية المراجعة الكتابية","تحليل ومراجعة意见 المستخدمين","خطة تنفيذ مخصصة","التكامل مع أنظمة مراجعة الكتب الحالية","دعم عدة صيغ للبيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust","Rust","proof-carrying","data framework","EnterPlanMode","book review system","Rust","dev"],"ja":["Rust","Rust","proof-carrying","data framework","EnterPlanMode","book review system","Rust","dev"],"ko":["Rust","Rust","proof-carrying","data framework","EnterPlanMode","book review system","Rust","dev"],"es":["Book Refine","Rust","Marco de datos","Reseñas de libros","Infraestructura de reseñas","Retroalimentación del usuario","Planificación","Análisis de datos"],"fr":["Book Refine","Rust","Cadre de données","Critiques de livres","Infrastructure de critiques","Rétroaction de l''utilisateur","Planification","Analyse de données"],"de":["Book Refine","Rust","Datenrahmen","Buchbewertungen","Infrastruktur für Buchbewertungen","Rückmeldung des Benutzers","Planung","Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Book Refine","Rust","framework de dados","revisão de livros","infraestrutura de revisão","análise de feedback","plano de execução","integração de sistemas","linguagem Rust"],"ru":["Book Refine","Rust","фреймворк доказательств","рецензирование книг","инфраструктура рецензирования","анализ отзывов","план выполнения","интеграция систем","язык Rust"],"ar":["Book Refine","روست","إطار عمل لحمل البيانات","مراجعة الكتب","بنية المراجعة","تحليل آراء","خطة تنفيذ","تكامل الأنظمة","لغة روست"]}},"owner":"tachyon-zcash","repo":"ragu","repoPath":"tachyon-zcash/ragu","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"book-refine","description":"Incorporate feedback into book review policies, standards, and infrastructure","bodyPreview":"# Book Refine\n\nIncorporate the user''s feedback into the book review system. The feedback is in\n`$ARGUMENTS` and/or in the preceding conversation context. This skill modifies\nthe book review infrastructure itself to make future reviews better.\n\n**You MUST use plan mode (EnterPlanMode) for this skill.** Do all analysis and\nauditing first, present a plan for the user''s approval, and only then execute.\n\n## Step 1: Read Everything\n\nRead ALL of these files before doing anything else:\n\n- `.claude/revie","body":"# Book Refine\n\nIncorporate the user''s feedback into the book review system. The feedback is in\n`$ARGUMENTS` and/or in the preceding conversation context. This skill modifies\nthe book review infrastructure itself to make future reviews better.\n\n**You MUST use plan mode (EnterPlanMode) for this skill.** Do all analysis and\nauditing first, present a plan for the user''s approval, and only then execute.\n\n## Step 1: Read Everything\n\nRead ALL of these files before doing anything else:\n\n- `.claude/review-shared/writing.md` — Shared writing rules (used by book-review and code-review)\n- `.claude/review-shared/math.md` — Shared math notation rules (used by book-review and code-review)\n- `.claude/book-review/standards.md` — Master standards shared across all book reviewers\n- All files matching `.claude/book-review/*.md` — Per-focus review policies\n- `.claude/skills/book-review/SKILL.md` — Book review orchestration\n- `.claude/skills/book-refine/SKILL.md` — This file\n\n## Step 2: Understand the Feedback\n\nThe user''s feedback could be anything. Common forms:\n\n- **A specific rewrite**: \"I''d write it like: ...\" — the user is showing you\n  their preferred style by example. Extract the implicit rule.\n- **A complaint about a review**: \"Stop flagging X\" or \"That''s not actually\n  wrong\" — a policy is too aggressive or incorrect.\n- **A gap**: \"You missed that...\" or \"You should also check for...\" — a policy\n  is missing coverage.\n- **A new dimension**: \"I need reviews to also check for...\" — need a new\n  policy file entirely.\n- **A process change**: \"Reviews should work differently...\" — the skill\n  orchestration needs modification.\n- **A cross-cutting concern**: something that doesn''t fit neatly into one\n  policy, or that requires reviewers to coordinate.\n\n## Step 3: Generalize\n\nDon''t just record the specific instance — extract the underlying principle.\nExamples:\n\n| User says | Generalized rule |\n|-----------|-----------------|\n| \"I''d write ''the prover constructs'' not ''a prover constructs''\" | Use definite articles for named protocol roles (the prover, the verifier) |\n| \"This section should have come before the definition\" | Motivating examples and intuition should precede formal definitions |\n| \"The math reviewer missed that alpha was reused\" | Check that notation is consistent with prior chapters, not just within the current one |\n| \"Stop complaining about sentence fragments in bullet points\" | Sentence fragments are acceptable in bullet points when the meaning is clear from the list context |\n| \"Don''t rewrap it like that, do it like this\" | A formatting correction — the user is showing a preferred rewrapping pattern. Add a before/after example to `.claude/book-review/formatting-examples.md` under the appropriate category, and refine the rule in `formatting.md` if the correction reveals a gap. |\n| \"You should check that code examples actually match the current API\" | (New review dimension: code accuracy. Create `.claude/book-review/code.md`) |\n\nIf you''re not sure how to generalize a specific correction into a principle,\nask the user. Don''t guess — a wrong generalization is worse than none.\n\n## Step 4: Audit the Entire Policy System\n\nBefore deciding where to put anything, review the full set of policies and\nstandards as a whole. Look for:\n\n- **Duplication**: Does this rule (or something close to it) already exist\n  somewhere? If so, strengthen or clarify the existing rule rather than adding\n  a second one. If the same concept appears in multiple places, consolidate.\n- **Contradictions**: Does the new rule conflict with anything already in the\n  policies? If so, resolve the conflict — ask the user if it''s ambiguous which\n  should win.\n- **Consolidation opportunities**: Has the policy system grown rules that are\n  specific cases of a more general principle? If so, propose replacing them\n  with the generalization.\n- **Misplaced rules**: Are any existing rules in the wrong file? A rule in\n  `grammar.md` that''s really about document structure belongs in\n  `structure.md`. Flag and propose moves.\n- **Scope creep**: Is a policy file accumulating rules outside its stated scope?\n  If so, propose splitting or redistributing.\n- **Staleness**: Do any existing rules seem outdated given the user''s latest\n  feedback? The user''s new feedback might implicitly supersede an older rule.\n\nInclude any findings from this audit in your plan, even if they go beyond the\nuser''s immediate feedback. The goal is to keep the policy system coherent as it\ngrows.\n\n## Step 5: Plan the Changes\n\nEnter plan mode (EnterPlanMode). Your plan should include:\n\n1. **The generalized principle(s)** extracted from the feedback.\n2. **Where each change goes** and why:\n   - Cross-cutting writing rule (shared with code-review) → `.claude/review-shared/writing.md`\n   - Cross-cutting math rule (shared with code-review) → `.claude/review-shared/math.md`\n   - General book standard (all book reviewers) → `.claude/book-review/standards.md`\n   - Focus-specific rule (one reviewer) → the appropriate `.claude/book-review/*.md`\n   - New review dimension → new `.claude/book-review/{name}.md`\n   - Process/orchestration change → appropriate `.claude/skills/book-*/SKILL.md`\n   - Learning process change → this file\n3. **Audit findings** — any duplication, contradictions, consolidation\n   opportunities, or misplaced rules discovered in Step 4, with proposed fixes.\n4. **The specific edits** you intend to make, quoted clearly enough for the\n   user to approve or reject each one.\n\nWhen in doubt between general and specific placement, prefer the more specific\nlocation. A rule can always be promoted to `.claude/book-review/standards.md` later if it\nturns out to be universal.\n\nWait for user approval before proceeding.\n\n## Step 6: Execute\n\nAfter the user approves the plan:\n\n- Edit the target file(s). Add new rules in the appropriate section.\n- For `.claude/book-review/standards.md`, add to the appropriate existing\n  section or create a new section if none fits.\n- If creating a new policy file, follow the same structure as existing ones\n  (Scope, then themed sections).\n- Execute any consolidation, deduplication, or moves identified in the audit.\n\n## Step 7: Report\n\nTell the user:\n\n1. **What principle(s) you extracted** — each generalized rule, stated clearly\n2. **Where you put each one** — which file and section\n3. **The exact new text** — quote what you added or changed\n4. **Audit actions taken** — any deduplication, consolidation, or moves beyond\n   the immediate feedback\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:03:47.960Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced Review Agents needing Rust-based proof-carrying data frameworks for refining book reviews.","zh":"非常适合需要基于Rust的携带证明数据框架来完善书评的高级评审智能体。","ja":"書評の洗練のためにRustベースの証明運搬データフレームワークを必要とする高度なレビューエージェントに最適です。","ko":"서평 개선을 위해 Rust 기반의 증명 전달 데이터 프레임워크가 필요한 고급 검토 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión avanzada que necesitan marcos de datos que llevan pruebas basados en Rust para refinar las reseñas de libros.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision avancée ayant besoin de cadres de données à preuve basés sur Rust pour affiner les critiques de livres.","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte Überprüfungsagenten, die Rust-basierte Beweis-tragende Datenframeworks zur Verfeinerung von Buchrezensionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão Avançada que necessitam de estruturas de dados baseadas em Rust para refinar as avaliações de livros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов проверки, которым требуются рамки доказательства, основанные на Rust, для совершенствования обзоров книг.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة المتقدمة الذين يحتاجون إلى إطارات بيانات تقرير الأدلة التي تعتمد على Rust لتحسين المراجعات الكتابية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to incorporate user feedback into book review systems using Rust language and plan mode, enhancing future reviews with improved auditing and analysis capabilities, including reading files like `.claude/review`.","zh":"使智能体能够使用Rust语言和计划模式将用户反馈整合到书评系统中，通过改进的审计和分析能力（包括读取`.claude/review`等文件）来增强未来的评论质量。","ja":"Rust言語と計画モードを使用して、ユーザーフィードバックを書評システムに組み込むことでエージェントを強化し、`.claude/review`などのファイル読み込みを含む監査と分析能力を向上させ、将来のレビューを改善します。","ko":"Rust 언어와 플랜 모드를 사용하여 사용자 피드백을 서평 시스템에 통합할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화하며, `.claude/review`와 같은 파일 읽기를 포함한 개선된 감사 및 분석 기능으로 향후 리뷰를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a incorporar retroalimentación de los usuarios en los sistemas de reseñas de libros utilizando el lenguaje Rust y el modo de planificación, mejorando las reseñas futuras con capacidades de auditoría y análisis mejoradas, incluyendo la lectura de archivos como `.claude/review`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer les commentaires des utilisateurs dans les systèmes de critiques de livres en utilisant le langage Rust et le mode de planification, améliorant les critiques futures avec des capacités d''audit et d''analyse améliorées, y compris la lecture de fichiers tels que `.claude/review`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Benutzerfeedback in Buchrezensionssysteme mithilfe der Rust-Sprache und des Planmodus zu integrieren, wodurch zukünftige Rezensionen mit verbesserten Überwachungs- und Analysefunktionen, einschließlich dem Lesen von Dateien wie `.claude/review`, verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a incorporar feedback do usuário nos sistemas de revisão de livros usando a linguagem Rust e o modo de plano, melhorando as revisões futuras com capacidades de auditoria e análise aprimoradas, incluindo a leitura de arquivos como `.claude/review`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью включать обратную связь пользователей в системы обзора книг с использованием языка Rust и режима планирования, улучшая будущие обзоры с помощью улучшенных возможностей аудита и анализа, включая чтение файлов, таких как `.claude/review`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على دمج ملاحظات المستخدم في أنظمة مراجعة الكتب باستخدام لغة Rust ووضع التخطيط، وتحسين المراجعات المستقبلية مع قدرات التدقيق والتحليل المحسنة، بما في ذلك قراءة الملفات مثل `.claude/review`."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining book reviews based on user feedback","Auditing and analyzing review infrastructure","Modifying review systems for improved future reviews"],"zh":["基于用户反馈完善书评","审计和分析评审基础设施","改进评审系统以提升未来评论质量"],"ja":["ユーザーフィードバックに基づく書評の洗練","レビューインフラの監査と分析","将来のレビュー改善のためのレビューシステムの修正"],"ko":["사용자 피드백을 기반으로 서평 개선","검토 인프라 감사 및 분석","향후 리뷰 개선을 위한 검토 시스템 수정"],"es":["Refinar las reseñas de libros en función de la retroalimentación de los usuarios","Auditoría y análisis de la infraestructura de reseñas","Modificar los sistemas de reseñas para mejorar las reseñas futuras"],"fr":["Affiner les critiques de livres en fonction des commentaires des utilisateurs","Audit et analyse de l''infrastructure de critiques","Modifier les systèmes de critiques pour améliorer les critiques futures"],"de":["Buchrezensionen basierend auf Benutzerfeedback verfeinern","Überwachung und Analyse der Rezensionsinfrastruktur","Rezensionssysteme für verbesserte zukünftige Rezensionen modifizieren"],"pt":["Aprimorar as avaliações de livros com base no feedback do usuário","Auditoria e análise da infraestrutura de revisão","Modificar os sistemas de revisão para melhorar as revisões futuras"],"ru":["Уточнение обзоров книг на основе обратной связи пользователей","Аудит и анализ инфраструктуры обзора","Модификация систем обзора для улучшения будущих обзоров"],"ar":["تحسين المراجعات الكتابية بناءً على ملاحظات المستخدم","مراجعة وتحليل بنية المراجعة","تعديل أنظمة المراجعة لتحسين المراجعات المستقبلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires plan mode (EnterPlanMode)","Rust language dependency","Specific file access needed (e.g., `.claude/review`)"],"zh":["需要计划模式（EnterPlanMode）","依赖Rust语言","需要特定文件访问权限（如`.claude/review`）"],"ja":["計画モード（EnterPlanMode）が必要","Rust言語への依存","特定ファイルへのアクセスが必要（例：`.claude/review`）"],"ko":["플랜 모드 필요（EnterPlanMode）","Rust 언어 의존성","특정 파일 액세스 필요（예: `.claude/review`）"],"es":["Requiere el modo de planificación (EnterPlanMode)","Dependencia del lenguaje Rust","Se necesita acceso a archivos específicos (por ejemplo, `.claude/review`)"],"fr":["Nécessite le mode de planification (EnterPlanMode)","Dépendance de la langue Rust","Un accès à des fichiers spécifiques est nécessaire (par exemple, `.claude/review`)"],"de":["Benötigt den Planmodus (EnterPlanMode)","Rust-Sprachabhängigkeit","Spezifischer Dateizugriff erforderlich (z. B. `.claude/review`)"],"pt":["Requer modo de plano (EnterPlanMode)","Dependência da linguagem Rust","Acesso a arquivos específicos necessário (por exemplo, `.claude/review`)"],"ru":["Требуется режим планирования (EnterPlanMode)","Зависимость от языка Rust","Требуется доступ к определенным файлам (например, `.claude/review`)"],"ar":["يتطلب وضع التخطيط (EnterPlanMode)","اعتماد على لغة Rust","يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات محددة (على سبيل المثال `.claude/review`)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('DonaldMurillo/momentum-cms/agent-browser', 'community', 'DonaldMurillo', 'momentum-cms', 'DonaldMurillo/momentum-cms', 'agent-browser', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z', '2026-02-18T09:03:53.090Z', NULL, '{"id":"DonaldMurillo/momentum-cms/agent-browser","name":"agent-browser","description":{"zh":"agent-browser是一种浏览器自动化工具，提供了一种简单的方式来自动化浏览器操作","ja":"agent-browserはブラウザ自動化ツールであり、ブラウザ操作を自動化するための簡単な方法を提供する","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화 도구로 브라우저操作을 자동화하기 위한 간단한 방법을 제공합니다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta para automatizar tareas en el navegador. Permite navegar, hacer capturas de pantalla y interactuar con elementos web.","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil pour automatiser les tâches dans le navigateur. Il permet de naviguer, de capturer des écrans et d''interagir avec des éléments web.","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser. Es ermöglicht die Navigation, das Erstellen von Screenshots und die Interaktion mit Web-Elementen.","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite automatizar tarefas de forma eficiente. Com ele, você pode abrir URLs, capturar elementos e interagir com páginas da web.","ru":"Agent-browser — это утилита автоматизации браузера, которая позволяет автоматизировать задачи эффективно. С ее помощью вы можете открывать URL, захватывать элементы и взаимодействовать с веб-страницами.","ar":"agent-browser هو أداة أتمتة المتصفح التي تمكنك من أتمتة المهام بطريقة فعالة. يمكنك استخدامها لفتح عناوين URL، وتحديد عناصر، والتفاعل مع صفحات الويب.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"浏览器自动化工具 - agent-browser","ja":"ブラウザ自動化ツール - agent-browser","ko":"브라우저 자동화 도구 - agent-browser","es":"Automatización de navegador con agent-browser","fr":"Automation de navigateur avec agent-browser","de":"Browser-Automatisierung mit agent-browser","pt":"Automatize Navegação com agent-browser","ru":"Автоматизация браузера с agent-browser","ar":"أتمتة المتصفح مع agent-browser","en":"agent-browser"},"description":{"zh":"agent-browser是一种浏览器自动化工具，提供了一种简单的方式来自动化浏览器操作","ja":"agent-browserはブラウザ自動化ツールであり、ブラウザ操作を自動化するための簡単な方法を提供する","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화 도구로 브라우저操作을 자동화하기 위한 간단한 방법을 제공합니다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta para automatizar tareas en el navegador. Permite navegar, hacer capturas de pantalla y interactuar con elementos web.","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil pour automatiser les tâches dans le navigateur. Il permet de naviguer, de capturer des écrans et d''interagir avec des éléments web.","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser. Es ermöglicht die Navigation, das Erstellen von Screenshots und die Interaktion mit W...","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite automatizar tarefas de forma eficiente. Com ele, você pode abrir URLs, capturar elemen...","ru":"Agent-browser — это утилита автоматизации браузера, которая позволяет автоматизировать задачи эффективно. С ее помощью вы можете открывать URL, захватывать э...","ar":"agent-browser هو أداة أتمتة المتصفح التي تمكنك من أتمتة المهام بطريقة فعالة. يمكنك استخدامها لفتح عناوين URL، وتحديد عناصر، والتفاعل مع صفحات الويب.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","简单的操作","支持多种浏览器","自动化表单填写","自动化点击和选择"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","簡単な操作","複数のブラウザをサポート","フォームの自動化","クリックと選択の自動化"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","간단한操作","다중 브라우저 지원","폼 자동화","클릭 및 선택 자동화"],"es":["Navegación automática","Captura de pantalla y referencia de elementos","Interacción con elementos web","Actualización de referencias después de cambios en el DOM","Soporte para comandos personalizados"],"fr":["Navigation automatique","Capture d''écran et référence d''éléments","Interaction avec des éléments web","Mise à jour des références après des changements dans le DOM","Prise en charge de commandes personnalisées"],"de":["Automatische Navigation","Screenshot-Erstellung und Elementreferenzierung","Interaktion mit Web-Elementen","Aktualisierung der Referenzen nach DOM-Änderungen","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Befehle"],"pt":["Abertura de URLs","Captura de elementos da página","Interação com elementos da página","Atualização de referências após mudanças no DOM","Suporte a comandos personalizados"],"ru":["Открытие URL","Захват элементов страницы","Взаимодействие с элементами страницы","Обновление ссылок после изменений в DOM","Поддержка пользовательских команд"],"ar":["فتح عناوين URL","تحديد عناصر الصفحة","التفاعل مع عناصر الصفحة","تحديث المراجع بعد التغييرات في DOM","دعم أوامر مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","agent-browser","自动化测试","浏览器操作","开发工具","自动化开发"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","agent-browser","自動化テスト","ブラウザ操作","開発ツール","自動化開発"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","agent-browser","자동화 테스트","브라우저操作","개발도구","자동화개발"],"es":["automatización de navegador","agent-browser","interacción con elementos web","navegación automática","captura de pantalla","referencia de elementos","dom","programación web"],"fr":["automation de navigateur","agent-browser","interaction avec des éléments web","navigation automatique","capture d''écran","référence d''éléments","dom","programmation web"],"de":["browser-automatisierung","agent-browser","interaktion mit web-elementen","automatische navigation","screenshot-erstellung","elementreferenzierung","dom","webprogrammierung"],"pt":["automação de navegador","agent-browser","automatizar tarefas","ferramenta de automação","desenvolvimento web","testes de navegador"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","agent-browser","автоматизировать задачи","утилита автоматизации","веб-разработка","тесты браузера"],"ar":["أتمتة المتصفح","agent-browser","أتمتة المهام","أداة أتمتة","تطوير الويب","اختبارات المتصفح"]}},"owner":"DonaldMurillo","repo":"momentum-cms","repoPath":"DonaldMurillo/momentum-cms","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Browser automation CLI for AI agents. Use when the user needs to interact with websites, including navigating pages, filling forms, clicking buttons, taking screenshots, extracting data, testing web apps, or automating any browser task. Triggers include requests to open a website, fill out a form, click a button, take a screenshot, scrape data from a page, test this web app, login to a site, automate browser actions, or any task requiring programmatic web interaction.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nEvery browser automation follows this pattern:\n\n1. **Navigate**: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. **Snapshot**: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (get element refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. **Interact**: Use refs to click, fill, select\n4. **Re-snapshot**: After navigation or DOM changes, get fresh refs\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\nagent-browser snapshot -i\n# Output: @e1 [input type=\"email\"], @e2 [input type=\"password\"], @e3 [b","body":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nEvery browser automation follows this pattern:\n\n1. **Navigate**: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. **Snapshot**: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (get element refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. **Interact**: Use refs to click, fill, select\n4. **Re-snapshot**: After navigation or DOM changes, get fresh refs\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\nagent-browser snapshot -i\n# Output: @e1 [input type=\"email\"], @e2 [input type=\"password\"], @e3 [button] \"Submit\"\n\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"user@example.com\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password123\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\nagent-browser snapshot -i  # Check result\n```\n\n## Essential Commands\n\n```bash\n# Navigation\nagent-browser open <url>              # Navigate (aliases: goto, navigate)\nagent-browser close                   # Close browser\n\n# Snapshot\nagent-browser snapshot -i             # Interactive elements with refs (recommended)\nagent-browser snapshot -s \"#selector\" # Scope to CSS selector\n\n# Interaction (use @refs from snapshot)\nagent-browser click @e1               # Click element\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"         # Clear and type text\nagent-browser type @e2 \"text\"         # Type without clearing\nagent-browser select @e1 \"option\"     # Select dropdown option\nagent-browser check @e1               # Check checkbox\nagent-browser press Enter             # Press key\nagent-browser scroll down 500         # Scroll page\n\n# Get information\nagent-browser get text @e1            # Get element text\nagent-browser get url                 # Get current URL\nagent-browser get title               # Get page title\n\n# Wait\nagent-browser wait @e1                # Wait for element\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle # Wait for network idle\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/page\"    # Wait for URL pattern\nagent-browser wait 2000               # Wait milliseconds\n\n# Capture\nagent-browser screenshot              # Screenshot to temp dir\nagent-browser screenshot --full       # Full page screenshot\nagent-browser pdf output.pdf          # Save as PDF\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Submission\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/signup\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"Jane Doe\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"jane@example.com\"\nagent-browser select @e3 \"California\"\nagent-browser check @e4\nagent-browser click @e5\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\n```\n\n### Authentication with State Persistence\n\n```bash\n# Login once and save state\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/login\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"$USERNAME\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"$PASSWORD\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"\nagent-browser state save auth.json\n\n# Reuse in future sessions\nagent-browser state load auth.json\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/dashboard\n```\n\n### Data Extraction\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/products\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser get text @e5           # Get specific element text\nagent-browser get text body > page.txt  # Get all page text\n\n# JSON output for parsing\nagent-browser snapshot -i --json\nagent-browser get text @e1 --json\n```\n\n### Parallel Sessions\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --session site1 open https://site-a.com\nagent-browser --session site2 open https://site-b.com\n\nagent-browser --session site1 snapshot -i\nagent-browser --session site2 snapshot -i\n\nagent-browser session list\n```\n\n### Visual Browser (Debugging)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --headed open https://example.com\nagent-browser highlight @e1          # Highlight element\nagent-browser record start demo.webm # Record session\n```\n\n### iOS Simulator (Mobile Safari)\n\n```bash\n# List available iOS simulators\nagent-browser device list\n\n# Launch Safari on a specific device\nagent-browser -p ios --device \"iPhone 16 Pro\" open https://example.com\n\n# Same workflow as desktop - snapshot, interact, re-snapshot\nagent-browser -p ios snapshot -i\nagent-browser -p ios tap @e1          # Tap (alias for click)\nagent-browser -p ios fill @e2 \"text\"\nagent-browser -p ios swipe up         # Mobile-specific gesture\n\n# Take screenshot\nagent-browser -p ios screenshot mobile.png\n\n# Close session (shuts down simulator)\nagent-browser -p ios close\n```\n\n**Requirements:** macOS with Xcode, Appium (`npm install -g appium && appium driver install xcuitest`)\n\n**Real devices:** Works with physical iOS devices if pre-configured. Use `--device \"<UDID>\"` where UDID is from `xcrun xctrace list devices`.\n\n## Ref Lifecycle (Important)\n\nRefs (`@e1`, `@e2`, etc.) are invalidated when the page changes. Always re-snapshot after:\n\n- Clicking links or buttons that navigate\n- Form submissions\n- Dynamic content loading (dropdowns, modals)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser click @e5              # Navigates to new page\nagent-browser snapshot -i            # MUST re-snapshot\nagent-browser click @e1              # Use new refs\n```\n\n## Semantic Locators (Alternative to Refs)\n\nWhen refs are unavailable or unreliable, use semantic locators:\n\n```bash\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click\nagent-browser find label \"Email\" fill \"user@test.com\"\nagent-browser find role button click --name \"Submit\"\nagent-browser find placeholder \"Search\" type \"query\"\nagent-browser find testid \"submit-btn\" click\n```\n\n## Deep-Dive Documentation\n\n| Reference                                                            | When to Use                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| [references/commands.md](references/commands.md)                     | Full command reference with all options                   |\n| [references/snapshot-refs.md](references/snapshot-refs.md)           | Ref lifecycle, invalidation rules, troubleshooting        |\n| [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md) | Parallel sessions, state persistence, concurrent scraping |\n| [references/authentication.md](references/authentication.md)         | Login flows, OAuth, 2FA handling, state reuse             |\n| [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md)       | Recording workflows for debugging and documentation       |\n| [references/proxy-support.md](references/proxy-support.md)           | Proxy configuration, geo-testing, rotating proxies        |\n\n## Ready-to-Use Templates\n\n| Template                                                                 | Description                         |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| [templates/form-automation.sh](templates/form-automation.sh)             | Form filling with validation        |\n| [templates/authenticated-session.sh](templates/authenticated-session.sh) | Login once, reuse state             |\n| [templates/capture-workflow.sh](templates/capture-workflow.sh)           | Content extraction with screenshots |\n\n```bash\n./templates/form-automation.sh https://example.com/form\n./templates/authenticated-session.sh https://app.example.com/login\n./templates/capture-workflow.sh https://example.com ./output\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:03:53.090Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automated Testing Agents needing advanced browser automation capabilities with snapshot and interaction features","zh":"适用于需要高级浏览器自动化功能的自动化测试代理，包括快照和交互功能","ja":"高度なブラウザ自動化機能とスナップショットおよびインタラクション機能を必要とする自動テストエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 브라우저 자동화 기능 및 스냅샷 및 상호 작용 기능이 필요한 자동화 테스트 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Pruebas Automatizadas que necesitan capacidades de automatización avanzada de navegadores con características de instantánea y de interacción","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Test Automatisés nécessitant des capacités d''automatisation de navigateur avancées avec des fonctionnalités de capture d''écran et d''interaction","de":"Perfekt für automatisierte Testagenten, die erweiterte Browser-Automatisierungsfunktionen mit Momentaufnahme- und Interaktionsfunktionen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste Automatizados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de automação de navegador com recursos de snapshot e interação","ru":"Идеально для автоматизированных агентов тестирования, которым требуются продвинутые возможности автоматизации браузера с функциями снимка и взаимодействия","ar":"مثالي لعمليات اختبار الآلي التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة في تشغيل المتصفح مع ميزات لقطة و تفاعل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using snapshot references like @e1, @e2, and perform actions such as click, fill, and select, leveraging protocols like HTTP and HTML element references","zh":"赋予代理使用快照引用（如@e1、@e2）自动化浏览器交互，并执行诸如单击、填充和选择等操作，利用HTTP和HTML元素引用等协议","ja":"エージェントがスナップショット参照（@e1、@e2など）を使用してブラウザーの相互作用を自動化し、クリック、入力、選択などのアクションを実行できるようにし、HTTPやHTML要素参照などのプロトコルを利用","ko":"에이전트가 스냅샷 참조(@e1, @e2 등)를 사용하여 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화하고 클릭, 填充, 선택 등과 같은 작업을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, HTTP 및 HTML 요소 참조와 같은 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar interacciones del navegador utilizando referencias de instantánea como @e1, @e2, y realizar acciones como hacer clic, rellenar y seleccionar, aprovechando protocolos como HTTP y referencias de elementos HTML","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions de navigateur en utilisant des références de capture d''écran comme @e1, @e2, et d''effectuer des actions telles que cliquer, remplir et sélectionner, en exploitant des protocoles comme HTTP et des références d''éléments HTML","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Browser-Interaktionen mithilfe von Momentaufnahmeverweisen wie @e1, @e2 zu automatisieren und Aktionen wie Klicken, Ausfüllen und Auswählen durchzuführen, indem Protokolle wie HTTP und HTML-Elementverweise genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações do navegador usando referências de snapshot como @e1, @e2 e realizar ações como clicar, preencher e selecionar, aproveitando protocolos como HTTP e referências de elementos HTML","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера с помощью ссылок на снимок như @e1, @e2 и выполнять действия, такие как клик, заполнение и выбор, используя протоколы, такие как HTTP и ссылки на элементы HTML","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشغيل التفاعلات المتصفح باستخدام مراجع لقطة مثل @e1، @e2، وأداء إجراءات مثل النقر وملء واختيار، واستغلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وإشارات عناصر HTML"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating form submissions on web pages","Interacting with dynamic web content using snapshot references","Debugging browser-based applications with snapshot and re-snapshot capabilities"],"zh":["在网页上自动提交表单","使用快照引用与动态网页内容进行交互","使用快照和重新快照功能调试基于浏览器的应用程序"],"ja":["ウェブページでのフォームの自動送信","スナップショット参照を使用した動的ウェブコンテンツとの相互作用","スナップショットと再スナップショット機能を使用したブラウザーベースのアプリケーションのデバッグ"],"ko":["웹 페이지上的 자동 폼 제출","스냅샷 참조를 사용한 동적 웹 콘텐츠와의 상호 작용","스냅샷 및 재스냅샷 기능을 사용한 브라우저 기반 애플리케이션 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la presentación de formularios en páginas web","Interactuar con contenido web dinámico utilizando referencias de instantánea","Depurar aplicaciones basadas en navegador con capacidades de instantánea y reinstantánea"],"fr":["Automatiser la soumission de formulaires sur les pages web","Interagir avec le contenu web dynamique en utilisant des références de capture d''écran","Déboguer des applications basées sur navigateur avec des fonctionnalités de capture d''écran et de recapture d''écran"],"de":["Automatisieren des Formularabsendens auf Webseiten","Interagieren mit dynamischem Webinhalt unter Verwendung von Momentaufnahmeverweisen","Debuggen von browserbasierten Anwendungen mit Momentaufnahme- und erneuter Momentaufnahmefunktion"],"pt":["Automatizar envios de formulários em páginas web","Interagir com conteúdo web dinâmico usando referências de snapshot","Depurar aplicações baseadas em navegador com capacidades de snapshot e re-snapshot"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отправку форм на веб-страницах","Взаимодействовать с динамическим веб-контентом с помощью ссылок на снимок","Отладить браузерные приложения с возможностями снимка и повторного снимка"],"ar":["أتمتة إرسال النماذج على صفحات الويب","التفاعل مع المحتوى الديناميكي للويب باستخدام مراجع لقطة","تصحيح أخطاء التطبيقات المبنية على المتصفح مع إمكانيات لقطة وإعادة لقطة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires browser access and navigation capabilities","Limited to HTTP and HTML-based web pages"],"zh":["需要浏览器访问和导航功能","仅限于HTTP和HTML基于的网页"],"ja":["ブラウザーアクセスとナビゲーション機能が必要","HTTPとHTMLベースのウェブページのみに限定"],"ko":["브라우저 액세스 및 탐색 기능이 필요","HTTP 및 HTML 기반의 웹 페이지에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso y capacidad de navegación del navegador","Limitado a páginas web basadas en HTTP y HTML"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès et des capacités de navigation de navigateur","Limité aux pages web basées sur HTTP et HTML"],"de":["Benötigt Browser-Zugriff und -Navigation","Begrenzt auf HTTP- und HTML-basierte Webseiten"],"pt":["Exige acesso e capacidades de navegação do navegador","Limitado a páginas web baseadas em HTTP e HTML"],"ru":["Требует доступа и возможностей навигации браузера","Ограничен веб-страницами на основе HTTP и HTML"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى المتصفح وقدراته الملاحية","محدود بالصفحات الإلكترونية القائمة على بروتوكول HTTP و HTML"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
