x HNSW","Quantification","Recherche en sous-milisecondes (<100µs)"],"de":["Semantische Suche auf der Grundlage von Vektoren","Geschwindigkeit 150x-12,500x höher als traditionelle Lösungen","HNSW-Indizes","Quantisierung","Suche in Submillisekunden (<100µs)"],"pt":["Operações de vetor 150x-12.500x mais rápidas","Índice HNSW para busca eficiente","Quantização para redução de dimensionalidade","Busca em sub-milésimos de segundo (<100µs)"],"ru":["Операции с векторами 150x-12.500x быстрее","Индекс HNSW для эффективного поиска","Квантование для снижения размерности","Поиск за доли миллисекунды (<100µs)"],"ar":["عمليات المتجه 150x-12,500x أسرع","فهرس HNSW للبحث الفعال","التكميم لتقليل الأبعاد","البحث في أجزاء من الملي ثانية (<100µs)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AgentDB","向量搜索","高性能搜索","向量数据库","HNSW 索引","量化","毫秒级搜索"],"ja":["AgentDB","ベクターサーチ","高性能検索","ベクターデータベース","HNSW インデックス","量化","ミリ秒級検索"],"ko":["AgentDB","벡터 검색","고성능 검색","벡터 데이터베이스","HNSW 인덱싱","양자화","밀리초级 검색"],"es":["búsqueda vectorial","AgentDB","semántica","vectores","HNSW","cuantización","submilisegundos"],"fr":["recherche vectorielle","AgentDB","sémantique","vecteurs","HNSW","quantification","sous-milisecondes"],"de":["Vektor-Suche","AgentDB","Semantik","Vektoren","HNSW","Quantisierung","Submillisekunden"],"pt":["pesquisa de vetor","busca semântica","vetor database","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de busca","tecnologia de busca"],"ru":["векторный поиск","семантический поиск","векторная база данных","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация поиска","технология поиска"],"ar":["بحث المتجه","بحث семантиكي","قاعدة بيانات المتجه","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين البحث","تكنولوجيا البحث"]}},"owner":"adebold","repo":"warehouse-network","repoPath":"adebold/warehouse-network","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"AgentDB Vector Search","description":"Implement semantic vector search with AgentDB for intelligent document retrieval, similarity matching, and context-aware querying. Use when building RAG systems, semantic search engines, or intelligent knowledge bases.","bodyPreview":"# AgentDB Vector Search\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nImplements vector-based semantic search using AgentDB''s high-performance vector database with **150x-12,500x faster** operations than traditional solutions. Features HNSW indexing, quantization, and sub-millisecond search (<100µs).\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js 18+\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow or standalone)\n- OpenAI API key (for embeddings) or custom embedding model\n\n## Quick Start with CLI\n\n### Initialize Vector Database\n\n```bash\n# Initia","body":"# AgentDB Vector Search\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nImplements vector-based semantic search using AgentDB''s high-performance vector database with **150x-12,500x faster** operations than traditional solutions. Features HNSW indexing, quantization, and sub-millisecond search (<100µs).\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js 18+\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow or standalone)\n- OpenAI API key (for embeddings) or custom embedding model\n\n## Quick Start with CLI\n\n### Initialize Vector Database\n\n```bash\n# Initialize with default dimensions (1536 for OpenAI ada-002)\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./vectors.db\n\n# Custom dimensions for different embedding models\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./vectors.db --dimension 768  # sentence-transformers\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./vectors.db --dimension 384  # all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n\n# Use preset configurations\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./vectors.db --preset small   # <10K vectors\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./vectors.db --preset medium  # 10K-100K vectors\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./vectors.db --preset large   # >100K vectors\n\n# In-memory database for testing\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./vectors.db --in-memory\n```\n\n### Query Vector Database\n\n```bash\n# Basic similarity search\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./vectors.db \"[0.1,0.2,0.3,...]\"\n\n# Top-k results\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./vectors.db \"[0.1,0.2,0.3]\" -k 10\n\n# With similarity threshold (cosine similarity)\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./vectors.db \"0.1 0.2 0.3\" -t 0.75 -m cosine\n\n# Different distance metrics\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./vectors.db \"[...]\" -m euclidean  # L2 distance\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./vectors.db \"[...]\" -m dot        # Dot product\n\n# JSON output for automation\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./vectors.db \"[...]\" -f json -k 5\n\n# Verbose output with distances\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./vectors.db \"[...]\" -v\n```\n\n### Import/Export Vectors\n\n```bash\n# Export vectors to JSON\nnpx agentdb@latest export ./vectors.db ./backup.json\n\n# Import vectors from JSON\nnpx agentdb@latest import ./backup.json\n\n# Get database statistics\nnpx agentdb@latest stats ./vectors.db\n```\n\n## Quick Start with API\n\n```typescript\nimport { createAgentDBAdapter, computeEmbedding } from ''agentic-flow/reasoningbank'';\n\n// Initialize with vector search optimizations\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb/vectors.db'',\n  enableLearning: false, // Vector search only\n  enableReasoning: true, // Enable semantic matching\n  quantizationType: ''binary'', // 32x memory reduction\n  cacheSize: 1000, // Fast retrieval\n});\n\n// Store document with embedding\nconst text = ''The quantum computer achieved 100 qubits'';\nconst embedding = await computeEmbedding(text);\n\nawait adapter.insertPattern({\n  id: '''',\n  type: ''document'',\n  domain: ''technology'',\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\n    embedding,\n    text,\n    metadata: { category: ''quantum'', date: ''2025-01-15'' },\n  }),\n  confidence: 1.0,\n  usage_count: 0,\n  success_count: 0,\n  created_at: Date.now(),\n  last_used: Date.now(),\n});\n\n// Semantic search with MMR (Maximal Marginal Relevance)\nconst queryEmbedding = await computeEmbedding(''quantum computing advances'');\nconst results = await adapter.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\n  domain: ''technology'',\n  k: 10,\n  useMMR: true, // Diverse results\n  synthesizeContext: true, // Rich context\n});\n```\n\n## Core Features\n\n### 1. Vector Storage\n\n```typescript\n// Store with automatic embedding\nawait db.storeWithEmbedding({\n  content: ''Your document text'',\n  metadata: { source: ''docs'', page: 42 },\n});\n```\n\n### 2. Similarity Search\n\n```typescript\n// Find similar documents\nconst similar = await db.findSimilar(''quantum computing'', {\n  limit: 5,\n  minScore: 0.75,\n});\n```\n\n### 3. Hybrid Search (Vector + Metadata)\n\n```typescript\n// Combine vector similarity with metadata filtering\nconst results = await db.hybridSearch({\n  query: ''machine learning models'',\n  filters: {\n    category: ''research'',\n    date: { $gte: ''2024-01-01'' },\n  },\n  limit: 20,\n});\n```\n\n## Advanced Usage\n\n### RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation)\n\n```typescript\n// Build RAG pipeline\nasync function ragQuery(question: string) {\n  // 1. Get relevant context\n  const context = await db.searchSimilar(await embed(question), { limit: 5, threshold: 0.7 });\n\n  // 2. Generate answer with context\n  const prompt = `Context: ${context.map(c => c.text).join(''\\n'')}\nQuestion: ${question}`;\n\n  return await llm.generate(prompt);\n}\n```\n\n### Batch Operations\n\n```typescript\n// Efficient batch storage\nawait db.batchStore(\n  documents.map(doc => ({\n    text: doc.content,\n    embedding: doc.vector,\n    metadata: doc.meta,\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n## MCP Server Integration\n\n```bash\n# Start AgentDB MCP server for Claude Code\nnpx agentdb@latest mcp\n\n# Add to Claude Code (one-time setup)\nclaude mcp add agentdb npx agentdb@latest mcp\n\n# Now use MCP tools in Claude Code:\n# - agentdb_query: Semantic vector search\n# - agentdb_store: Store documents with embeddings\n# - agentdb_stats: Database statistics\n```\n\n## Performance Benchmarks\n\n```bash\n# Run comprehensive benchmarks\nnpx agentdb@latest benchmark\n\n# Results:\n# ✅ Pattern Search: 150x faster (100µs vs 15ms)\n# ✅ Batch Insert: 500x faster (2ms vs 1s for 100 vectors)\n# ✅ Large-scale Query: 12,500x faster (8ms vs 100s at 1M vectors)\n# ✅ Memory Efficiency: 4-32x reduction with quantization\n```\n\n## Quantization Options\n\nAgentDB provides multiple quantization strategies for memory efficiency:\n\n### Binary Quantization (32x reduction)\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''binary'', // 768-dim → 96 bytes\n});\n```\n\n### Scalar Quantization (4x reduction)\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''scalar'', // 768-dim → 768 bytes\n});\n```\n\n### Product Quantization (8-16x reduction)\n\n```typescript\nconst adapter = await createAgentDBAdapter({\n  quantizationType: ''product'', // 768-dim → 48-96 bytes\n});\n```\n\n## Distance Metrics\n\n```bash\n# Cosine similarity (default, best for most use cases)\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./db.sqlite \"[...]\" -m cosine\n\n# Euclidean distance (L2 norm)\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./db.sqlite \"[...]\" -m euclidean\n\n# Dot product (for normalized vectors)\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./db.sqlite \"[...]\" -m dot\n```\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n### HNSW Indexing\n\n- **O(log n) search complexity**\n- **Sub-millisecond retrieval** (<100µs)\n- **Automatic index building**\n\n### Caching\n\n- **1000 pattern in-memory cache**\n- **<1ms pattern retrieval**\n- **Automatic cache invalidation**\n\n### MMR (Maximal Marginal Relevance)\n\n- **Diverse result sets**\n- **Avoid redundancy**\n- **Balance relevance and diversity**\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n1. **Enable HNSW indexing**: Automatic with AgentDB, 10-100x faster\n2. **Use quantization**: Binary (32x), Scalar (4x), Product (8-16x) memory reduction\n3. **Batch operations**: 500x faster for bulk inserts\n4. **Match dimensions**: 1536 (OpenAI), 768 (sentence-transformers), 384 (MiniLM)\n5. **Similarity threshold**: Start at 0.7 for quality, adjust based on use case\n6. **Enable caching**: 1000 pattern cache for frequent queries\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Issue: Slow search performance\n\n```bash\n# Check if HNSW indexing is enabled (automatic)\nnpx agentdb@latest stats ./vectors.db\n\n# Expected: <100µs search time\n```\n\n### Issue: High memory usage\n\n```bash\n# Enable binary quantization (32x reduction)\n# Use in adapter: quantizationType: ''binary''\n```\n\n### Issue: Poor relevance\n\n```bash\n# Adjust similarity threshold\nnpx agentdb@latest query ./db.sqlite \"[...]\" -t 0.8  # Higher threshold\n\n# Or use MMR for diverse results\n# Use in adapter: useMMR: true\n```\n\n### Issue: Wrong dimensions\n\n```bash\n# Check embedding model dimensions:\n# - OpenAI ada-002: 1536\n# - sentence-transformers: 768\n# - all-MiniLM-L6-v2: 384\n\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./db.sqlite --dimension 768\n```\n\n## Database Statistics\n\n```bash\n# Get comprehensive stats\nnpx agentdb@latest stats ./vectors.db\n\n# Shows:\n# - Total patterns/vectors\n# - Database size\n# - Average confidence\n# - Domains distribution\n# - Index status\n```\n\n## Performance Characteristics\n\n- **Vector Search**: <100µs (HNSW indexing)\n- **Pattern Retrieval**: <1ms (with cache)\n- **Batch Insert**: 2ms for 100 vectors\n- **Memory Efficiency**: 4-32x reduction with quantization\n- **Scalability**: Handles 1M+ vectors efficiently\n- **Latency**: Sub-millisecond for most operations\n\n## Learn More\n\n- GitHub: https://github.com/ruvnet/agentic-flow/tree/main/packages/agentdb\n- Documentation: node_modules/agentic-flow/docs/AGENTDB_INTEGRATION.md\n- MCP Integration: `npx agentdb@latest mcp` for Claude Code\n- Website: https://agentdb.ruv.io\n- CLI Help: `npx agentdb@latest --help`\n- Command Help: `npx agentdb@latest help <command>`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:04:43.830Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring high-performance semantic search capabilities, such as those utilizing Node.js and OpenAI API for advanced data querying.","zh":"适用于需要高性能语义搜索能力的AI代理，例如使用Node.js和OpenAI API进行高级数据查询的代理。","ja":"Node.jsとOpenAI APIを使用して高度なデータ検索を実行するなど、高パフォーマンスのセマンティック検索機能を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"노드js와 오픈ai api를 사용하여 고급 데이터 쿼리를 수행하는 등 고성능의 의미 검색 기능이 필요한 ai 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que requieren capacidades de búsqueda semántica de alto rendimiento, como aquellos que utilizan Node.js y la API de OpenAI para consultas de datos avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités de recherche sémantique haute performance, tels que ceux utilisant Node.js et l''API OpenAI pour des requêtes de données avancées.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die hochleistungsstarke semantische Suchfunktionen erfordern, wie z.B. solche, die Node.js und die OpenAI-API für erweiterte Datenabfragen verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que requerem capacidades de busca semântica de alto desempenho, como aqueles que utilizam Node.js e OpenAI API para consultas de dados avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих высокопроизводительных семантических возможностей поиска, таких как те, которые используют Node.js и OpenAI API для продвинутых запросов данных.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء الإصطناعية التي تتطلب قدرات بحث دلالية عالية الأداء، مثل تلك التي تستخدم Node.js و OpenAI API لاستعلامات البيانات المتقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform vector-based semantic search using AgentDB''s high-performance vector database, featuring HNSW indexing, quantization, and sub-millisecond search, all while leveraging OpenAI API key for embeddings or custom embedding models.","zh":"通过AgentDB的高性能向量数据库实现向量基语义搜索，支持HNSW索引、量化和亚毫秒搜索，同时利用OpenAI API密钥进行嵌入或自定义嵌入模型。","ja":"AgentDBの高パフォーマンスベクトルデータベースを使用して、ベクトルベースのセマンティック検索を実現します。HNSW索引、量子化、サブミリ秒検索を搭載し、OpenAI APIキーを使用して埋め込みまたはカスタム埋め込みモデルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트db의 고성능 벡터 데이터베이스를 사용하여 벡터 기반 의미 검색을 구현합니다. hnsw 인덱싱, 양자화, 아毫초 검색을 지원하며 오픈ai api 키를 사용하여 임베딩 또는 사용자 정의 임베딩 모델을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar búsquedas semánticas basadas en vectores utilizando la base de datos de vectores de alto rendimiento de AgentDB, con indexación HNSW, cuantización y búsqueda en submilisegundos, todo mientras aprovecha la clave de API de OpenAI para incrustaciones o modelos de incrustación personalizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des recherches sémantiques basées sur des vecteurs en utilisant la base de données de vecteurs haute performance d''AgentDB, dotée d''indexation HNSW, de quantification et de recherche en sous-milliseconde, le tout en exploitant la clé d''API OpenAI pour les embeddings ou les modèles d''embedding personnalisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, vektorbasierte semantische Suchen durchzuführen, indem sie die hochleistungsstarke Vektordatenbank von AgentDB nutzen, die über HNSW-Indexierung, Quantisierung und Suchen in Submillisekunden verfügt, und dies alles, während die OpenAI-API-Schlüssel für Einbettungen oder benutzerdefinierte Einbettungsmodelle genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar buscas semânticas baseadas em vetores usando o banco de dados de vetores de alto desempenho do AgentDB, com recursos como indexação HNSW, quantização e busca em submilissegundos, tudo isso aproveitando a chave da API do OpenAI para embeddings ou modelos de embedding personalizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять векторные семантические поиски с использованием высокопроизводительной векторной базы данных AgentDB, оснащенной индексированием HNSW, квантованием и поиском за субмиллисекунды, все это при использовании ключа API OpenAI для вложений или пользовательских моделей вложений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من أداء عمليات بحث دلالية تعتمد على المتجهات باستخدام قاعدة بيانات المتجهات عالية الأداء من AgentDB، وتتميز بالفهرسة HNSW والكمية والبحث في أقل من ملي ثانية، مع الاستفادة من مفتاح API OpenAI للتعبيات أو نماذج التعبيات المخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Accelerating data retrieval with 150x-12,500x faster operations than traditional solutions","Implementing efficient semantic search in B2B warehouse marketplace platforms","Enhancing search functionality with sub-millisecond response times (<100µs)"],"zh":["通过150x-12,500x更快的操作速度加速数据检索，与传统解决方案相比","在B2B仓库市场平台中实现高效的语义搜索","通过亚毫秒响应时间(<100µs)增强搜索功能"],"ja":["従来のソリューションに比べて150x-12,500x高速な操作でデータの取得を加速する","B2B倉庫マーケットプレースプラットフォームで効率的なセマンティック検索を実装する","サブミリ秒のレスポンスタイム(<100µs)で検索機能を強化する"],"ko":["150x-12,500x 더 빠른 속도로 데이터 검색을 가속화하여 전통적인 솔루션과 비교","b2b 창고 시장 플랫폼에서 효율적인 의미 검색을 구현","아毫초 응답 시간(<100µs)으로 검색 기능을 강화"],"es":["Acelerar la recuperación de datos con operaciones 150x-12.500x más rápidas que las soluciones tradicionales","Implementar búsquedas semánticas eficientes en plataformas de mercado de almacenes B2B","Mejorar la funcionalidad de búsqueda con tiempos de respuesta en submilisegundos (<100µs)"],"fr":["Accélérer la récupération de données avec des opérations 150x-12 500x plus rapides que les solutions traditionnelles","Mettre en œuvre des recherches sémantiques efficaces sur les plateformes de marché de entrepôts B2B","Améliorer la fonctionnalité de recherche avec des temps de réponse en sous-milliseconde (<100µs)"],"de":["Datenabruf mit 150x-12.500x schnelleren Operationen als herkömmliche Lösungen beschleunigen","Effiziente semantische Suchen in B2B-Warenhaus-Marktplattformen implementieren","Suchfunktion mit Antwortzeiten im Submillisekundenbereich (<100µs) verbessern"],"pt":["Acelerando a recuperação de dados com operações 150x-12.500x mais rápidas do que as soluções tradicionais","Implementando busca semântica eficiente em plataformas de marketplace de armazéns B2B","Melhorando a funcionalidade de busca com tempos de resposta em submilissegundos (<100µs)"],"ru":["Ускорение извлечения данных с операциями, которые в 150-12 500 раз быстрее традиционных решений","Реализация эффективного семантического поиска на платформах B2B-warehouse","Улучшение функциональности поиска с временем ответа менее чем за субмиллисекунду (<100 мкс)"],"ar":["تعزيز استرجاع البيانات بعمليات أسرع 150-12,500 مرة من الحلول التقليدية","تنفيذ بحث دلالية فعال في منصات سوق التخزين التجارية إلى تجارية","تحسين وظيفة البحث بأوقات استجابة أقل من ملي ثانية (<100 ميكرو ثانية)"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js 18+","Needs AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow or standalone)","Requires OpenAI API key (for embeddings) or custom embedding model"],"zh":["需要Node.js 18+","需要AgentDB v1.0.7+（通过agentic-flow或独立）","需要OpenAI API密钥（用于嵌入）或自定义嵌入模型"],"ja":["Node.js 18+が必要","AgentDB v1.0.7+（agentic-flowまたはスタンドアロンを介して）が必要","OpenAI APIキー（埋め込み用）またはカスタム埋め込みモデルが必要"],"ko":["노드js 18+ 필요","에이전트db v1.0.7+(agentic-flow 또는 독립적으로) 필요","오픈ai api 키(임베딩 용) 또는 사용자 정의 임베딩 모델 필요"],"es":["Requiere Node.js 18+","Necesita AgentDB v1.0.7+ (a través de agentic-flow o de forma independiente)","Requiere clave de API de OpenAI (para incrustaciones) o modelo de incrustación personalizado"],"fr":["Nécessite Node.js 18+","Nécessite AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow ou en tant que produit autonome)","Nécessite une clé d''API OpenAI (pour les embeddings) ou un modèle d''embedding personnalisé"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js 18+","Benötigt AgentDB v1.0.7+ (über agentic-flow oder als eigenständige Lösung)","Benötigt OpenAI-API-Schlüssel (für Einbettungen) oder benutzerdefiniertes Einbettungsmodell"],"pt":["Requer Node.js 18+","Necessita AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow ou standalone)","Requer chave da API do OpenAI (para embeddings) ou modelo de embedding personalizado"],"ru":["Требует Node.js 18+","Требует AgentDB v1.0.7+ (через agentic-flow или как отдельный продукт)","Требует ключ API OpenAI (для вложений) или пользовательскую модель вложений"],"ar":["يتطلب Node.js 18+","يتطلب AgentDB الإصدار 1.0.7+ (عبر agentic-flow أو منفردًا)","يتطلب مفتاح API OpenAI (للتعبيات) أو نموذج تعبئة مخصص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('VledicFranco/organon/organon-file-creation', 'community', 'VledicFranco', 'organon', 'VledicFranco/organon', 'organon-file-creation', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z', '2026-02-18T09:04:52.672Z', NULL, '{"id":"VledicFranco/organon/organon-file-creation","name":"organon-file-creation","description":{"zh":"Organon文件创建工作流实现PROTO-ORG-6协议，创建有效的Organon文件","ja":"オルガノンファイル作成ワークフローはPROTO-ORG-6プロトコルを実装し、有効なオルガノンファイルを作成します","ko":"오르가논 파일 생성 워크플로우는 PROTO-ORG-6 프로토콜을 구현하여 유효한 오르가논 파일을 생성합니다","es":"El skill de creación de archivos Organon implementa PROTO-ORG-6 y crea archivos válidos con la estructura y referencias correctas","fr":"Le skill de création de fichiers Organon met en œuvre PROTO-ORG-6 et crée des fichiers valides avec la structure et les références correctes","de":"Das Skill für die Erstellung von Organon-Dateien implementiert PROTO-ORG-6 und erstellt gültige Dateien mit der richtigen Struktur und Verweisen","pt":"O Organon File Creation é um fluxo de trabalho que cria arquivos Organon válidos. Ele implementa o PROTO-ORG-6 e fornece estrutura e referências corretas.","ru":"Создание файлов Organon - это рабочий процесс, создающий действительные файлы Organon. Он реализует PROTO-ORG-6 и обеспечивает правильную структуру и ссылки.","ar":"إنشاء ملفات أورغانون هو تدفق عمل يخلق ملفات أورغانون صالحة. يطبق PROTO-ORG-6 ويوفر هيكلاً ومراجعًا صحيحين.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Organon文件创建工作流","ja":"オルガノンファイル作成ワークフロー","ko":"오르가논 파일 생성 워크플로우","es":"Creación de archivos Organon","fr":"Création de fichiers Organon","de":"Erstellung von Organon-Dateien","pt":"Criação de Arquivos Organon","ru":"Создание файлов Organon","ar":"إنشاء ملفات أورغانون","en":"organon-file-creation"},"description":{"zh":"Organon文件创建工作流实现PROTO-ORG-6协议，创建有效的Organon文件","ja":"オルガノンファイル作成ワークフローはPROTO-ORG-6プロトコルを実装し、有効なオルガノンファイルを作成します","ko":"오르가논 파일 생성 워크플로우는 PROTO-ORG-6 프로토콜을 구현하여 유효한 오르가논 파일을 생성합니다","es":"El skill de creación de archivos Organon implementa PROTO-ORG-6 y crea archivos válidos con la estructura y referencias correctas","fr":"Le skill de création de fichiers Organon met en œuvre PROTO-ORG-6 et crée des fichiers valides avec la structure et les références correctes","de":"Das Skill für die Erstellung von Organon-Dateien implementiert PROTO-ORG-6 und erstellt gültige Dateien mit der richtigen Struktur und Verweisen","pt":"O Organon File Creation é um fluxo de trabalho que cria arquivos Organon válidos. Ele implementa o PROTO-ORG-6 e fornece estrutura e referências corretas.","ru":"Создание файлов Organon - это рабочий процесс, создающий действительные файлы Organon. Он реализует PROTO-ORG-6 и обеспечивает правильную структуру и ссылки.","ar":"إنشاء ملفات أورغانون هو تدفق عمل يخلق ملفات أورغانون صالحة. يطبق PROTO-ORG-6 ويوفر هيكلاً ومراجعًا صحيحين.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建有效的Organon文件","正确的位置和结构","正确的引用","实现PROTO-ORG-6协议","支持添加新域","支持添加新功能"],"ja":["有効なオルガノンファイルを作成","正しい位置と構造","正しい参照","PROTO-ORG-6プロトコルを実装","新しいドメインの追加をサポート","新しい機能の追加をサポート"],"ko":["유효한 오르가논 파일을 생성","정확한 위치와 구조","정확한 참조","PROTO-ORG-6 프로토콜을 구현","새 도메인의 추가를 지원","새 기능의 추가를 지원"],"es":["Implementación de PROTO-ORG-6","Creación de archivos Organon válidos","Estructura y referencias correctas","Compatibilidad con ETHOS.md","Compatibilidad con PHILOSOPHY.md","Compatibilidad con PROTOCOL.md"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de PROTO-ORG-6","Création de fichiers Organon valides","Structure et références correctes","Compatibilité avec ETHOS.md","Compatibilité avec PHILOSOPHY.md","Compatibilité avec PROTOCOL.md"],"de":["Implementierung von PROTO-ORG-6","Erstellung von gültigen Organon-Dateien","Richtige Struktur und Verweise","Kompatibilität mit ETHOS.md","Kompatibilität mit PHILOSOPHY.md","Kompatibilität mit PROTOCOL.md"],"pt":["Criação de arquivos Organon válidos","Implementação do PROTO-ORG-6","Estrutura e referências corretas","Suporte à adição de novos domínios","Suporte à adição de novas funcionalidades"],"ru":["Создание действительных файлов Organon","Реализация PROTO-ORG-6","Правильная структура и ссылки","Поддержка добавления новых доменов","Поддержка добавления новых функций"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات أورغانون صالحة","تطبيق PROTO-ORG-6","هيكل ومراجع صحيحين","دعم إضافة مجالات جديدة","دعم إضافة ميزات جديدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Organon文件创建","PROTO-ORG-6协议","有效的Organon文件","正确的位置和结构","正确的引用","添加新域","添加新功能","オルガノンファイル作成ワークフロー"],"ja":["オルガノンファイル作成","PROTO-ORG-6プロトコル","有効なオルガノンファイル","正しい位置と構造","正しい参照","新しいドメインの追加","新しい機能の追加","オルガノンファイル作成ワークフロー"],"ko":["오르가논 파일 생성","PROTO-ORG-6 프로토콜","유효한 오르가논 파일","정확한 위치와 구조","정확한 참조","새 도메인의 추가","새 기능의 추가","오르가논 파일 생성 워크플로우"],"es":["creación de archivos Organon","PROTO-ORG-6","ETHOS.md","PHILOSOPHY.md","PROTOCOL.md","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","organon file creation"],"fr":["création de fichiers Organon","PROTO-ORG-6","ETHOS.md","PHILOSOPHY.md","PROTOCOL.md","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","organon file creation"],"de":["Erstellung von Organon-Dateien","PROTO-ORG-6","ETHOS.md","PHILOSOPHY.md","PROTOCOL.md","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen","organon file creation"],"pt":["Organon File Creation","PROTO-ORG-6","arquivos Organon","estrutura de arquivos","referências corretas","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Создание файлов Organon","PROTO-ORG-6","файлы Organon","структура файлов","правильные ссылки","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات أورغانون","PROTO-ORG-6","ملفات أورغانون","هيكل الملفات","مراجع صحيحة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"VledicFranco","repo":"organon","repoPath":"VledicFranco/organon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"organon-file-creation","description":"Creates new organon files (ETHOS.md, PHILOSOPHY.md, PROTOCOL.md, README.md) with correct structure, frontmatter, scope inheritance, and bidirectional references. Use when adding a new domain, feature, component, or scope that needs organon documentation. Replaces ad-hoc file creation with validated workflow.","bodyPreview":"# Organon File Creation Workflow\n\n> Implements PROTO-ORG-6 from `organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md`. Creates valid organon files with correct placement, structure, and references.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- **Adding a new domain** that needs its own ETHOS.md\n- **Adding a new feature** organon (cross-cutting capability)\n- **Creating PHILOSOPHY.md** for design rationale\n- **Creating PROTOCOL.md** for step-by-step procedures\n- **Adding a new scope directory** that needs a","body":"# Organon File Creation Workflow\n\n> Implements PROTO-ORG-6 from `organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md`. Creates valid organon files with correct placement, structure, and references.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- **Adding a new domain** that needs its own ETHOS.md\n- **Adding a new feature** organon (cross-cutting capability)\n- **Creating PHILOSOPHY.md** for design rationale\n- **Creating PROTOCOL.md** for step-by-step procedures\n- **Adding a new scope directory** that needs a README.md router\n\n**Purpose:** Ensure every organon file is created correctly from the start — right location, right structure, right frontmatter, right inheritance.\n\n---\n\n## Context Loading\n\n1. Load templates and structure:\n   - Read `book-llms/templates.md` (copy-paste scaffolds for each artifact type)\n   - Read `book-llms/scopes.md` (scope classification: product, domain, feature, component)\n   - Read `book-llms/frontmatter-system.md` (complete YAML frontmatter schema)\n2. Load quality standards:\n   - Read `book-llms/ETHOS.md` (meta-organon constraints — what every organon must follow)\n   - Read `CLAUDE.md` (project-level constraints)\n3. Load parent scope:\n   - Read the parent scope''s ETHOS.md (new file must inherit, never contradict)\n\n---\n\n## Steps\n\n### Step 1: Classify Scope\n\nDetermine the scope of the new file:\n\n| Scope | Question It Answers | Characteristics |\n|-------|-------------------|-----------------|\n| **product** | \"What is this project?\" | Top-level, inherits from meta-organon only |\n| **domain** | \"What business concepts exist?\" | Bounded context, ≥3 unique concepts, own lifecycle |\n| **feature** | \"What can users do?\" | Cross-cutting capability, used by multiple domains |\n| **component** | \"Where is the code?\" | Code module, dependency relationships |\n| **methodology** | \"How do we work?\" | Process documentation, separate from product |\n\n**Decision heuristic:** Has ≥3 unique concepts + lifecycle → domain. Crosses multiple domains → feature. Users think in code terms → component.\n\n### Step 2: Check Parent Scope\n\nLoad the parent scope''s ETHOS.md. The new file must:\n- **Inherit** all parent constraints (never relax them)\n- **Add** constraints specific to this scope\n- **Reference** the parent in `inherits_from` frontmatter field\n\n### Step 3: Select Template\n\nBased on the artifact type, load the correct template from `book-llms/templates.md`:\n\n| Artifact | Template Section | Required Sections |\n|----------|-----------------|-------------------|\n| ETHOS.md | Ethos Template | Identity (IS/IS NOT), Invariants, Principles, Decision Heuristics |\n| PHILOSOPHY.md | Philosophy Template | The Problem, The Bet, Design Decisions, Trade-offs |\n| PROTOCOL.md | Protocol Template | Goal, Preconditions, Steps, Verification, Recovery |\n| README.md | README Router Template | Contents table with paths, types, descriptions |\n\n### Step 4: Determine File Placement\n\nFollow Pattern A (dedicated `organon/` directory):\n\n```\norganon/\n├── domains/\n│   └── <domain-name>/\n│       ├── ETHOS.md\n│       ├── PHILOSOPHY.md\n│       └── README.md\n├── features/\n│   └── <feature-name>/\n│       ├── ETHOS.md\n│       └── README.md\n└── protocols/\n    └── PROTOCOLS.md\n```\n\nFor product-level scope: place directly in `organon/`.\n\n### Step 5: Generate Frontmatter\n\nFill in all required fields:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntype: [constraints|rationale|procedures|navigation]\nscope: [product|domain|feature|component|methodology]\nname: [kebab-case-name]\nversion: \"1.0\"\nsummary: [One-sentence, max 200 chars]\ntoken_estimate: [number, ~12 tokens/line]\n# Type-specific fields (e.g., invariants_count for constraints)\ninherits_from: [parent-scope-names]\nload_priority: [high|medium|low]\naudience: [llm, human]\n---\n```\n\nUse `organon generate` if available to auto-generate frontmatter scaffold.\n\n### Step 6: Write Content\n\nFollow the template''s section structure exactly:\n\n**For ETHOS.md:**\n- Write ≥3 IS statements (specific, not generic)\n- Write ≥3 IS NOT statements (real boundaries)\n- Write ≥3 invariants with enforcement mechanisms\n- Write ≥3 prioritized principles (lower number wins)\n- Write ≥5 decision heuristics (situation → action)\n\n**For PHILOSOPHY.md:**\n- Write problem statement with root causes\n- Write the bet (falsifiable hypothesis)\n- Write ≥5 trade-offs with rationale\n- Write ≥3 alternatives considered\n\n**For PROTOCOL.md:**\n- Write clear goal statement\n- Write ≥3 preconditions\n- Write numbered steps with decision points\n- Write verification checklist\n- Write recovery table\n\n**For README.md:**\n- Keep under 100 lines (router, not content)\n- Include contents table with all children\n\n### Step 7: Validate\n\n```bash\ncd packages/tools && npx organon validate <path-to-new-file>\n```\n\nRuns all 4 validation stages:\n1. **Schema** — frontmatter structure is valid\n2. **Content** — required sections present\n3. **References** — file paths resolve\n4. **Relationships** — inheritance chain is valid\n\n### Step 8: Check Bidirectional References\n\nIf the new file references other organon files, ensure those files reference back:\n- If creating a protocol with `workflow: <name>`, ensure the workflow has `protocol_id` matching\n- If setting `inherits_from: [parent]`, ensure parent exists\n- If setting `related_files`, ensure those files exist\n\n```bash\ncd packages/tools && npx organon verify --gate triplets\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification\n\n- [ ] `organon validate` passes all 4 stages\n- [ ] File is in the correct directory per scope classification\n- [ ] Frontmatter has all required fields (type, scope, name, version, summary, token_estimate)\n- [ ] Section headings match the template for this artifact type\n- [ ] Parent scope constraints are inherited, not contradicted\n- [ ] Bidirectional references are complete (no orphans)\n\n---\n\n## Error Recovery\n\n| Failure | Recovery Action |\n|---------|-----------------|\n| Wrong scope classification | Re-read `book-llms/scopes.md`. Apply the decision heuristic (≥3 concepts → domain, cross-cutting → feature). |\n| `organon validate` schema stage fails | Check frontmatter against `book-llms/frontmatter-system.md`. Common issues: missing required field, wrong type enum value. |\n| `organon validate` content stage fails | Re-read template from `book-llms/templates.md`. Add missing sections. |\n| Parent scope contradiction | Remove or weaken the contradicting constraint. Child scopes can only add, never relax. |\n| Missing template section | Re-read the template. Every section in the template is required unless explicitly marked optional. |\n| Bidirectional reference broken | Add the missing back-reference in the target file. Run `organon verify --gate triplets` to confirm. |\n| File placed in wrong directory | Move file to correct location per Pattern A. Update any references to the old path. |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:04:52.672Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Management Agents needing standardized organon file creation with PROTO-ORG-6 protocol compliance.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化的 Organon 文件创建并遵守PROTO-ORG-6协议的知识管理代理。","ja":"PROTO-ORG-6プロトコルに準拠した標準化されたオルガノンファイルの作成を必要とするナレッジマネジメントエージェントに最適。","ko":"PROTO-ORG-6 프로토콜을 준수하는 표준화된 오르가논 파일 생성이 필요한 지식 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Conocimiento que necesitan la creación de archivos organon estandarizados con cumplimiento del protocolo PROTO-ORG-6.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion des Connaissances nécessitant la création de fichiers organon standardisés avec une conformité au protocole PROTO-ORG-6.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die die Erstellung standardisierter Organon-Dateien mit PROTO-ORG-6-Protokollkonformität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que necessitam de criação de arquivos organon padronizados com conformidade com o protocolo PROTO-ORG-6.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления знаниями, требующих стандартизированного создания файлов органон с соблюдением протокола PROTO-ORG-6.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المعرفة الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء ملفات органون معيارية مع متابعة بروتوكول PROTO-ORG-6."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate valid organon files with correct placement, structure, and references, utilizing ETHOS.md, PHILOSOPHY.md, and PROTOCOL.md for comprehensive documentation, and adhering to protocols outlined in organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md.","zh":"赋予代理生成有效的Organon文件，具有正确的放置、结构和引用，利用ETHOS.md、PHILOSOPHY.md和PROTOCOL.md进行综合文档记录，并遵守organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md中概述的协议。","ja":"ETHOS.md、PHILOSOPHY.md、PROTOCOL.mdを使用して包括的なドキュメントを作成し、organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.mdに記載されたプロトコルに従って、正しい配置、構造、参照を持つ有効なオルガノンファイルを生成するエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"ETHOS.md, PHILOSOPHY.md, PROTOCOL.md를 사용하여 포괄적인 문서를 생성하고, organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md에記載된 프로토콜을 따르며, 올바른 배치, 구조 및 참조를 가진 유효한 오르가논 파일을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar archivos organon válidos con colocación, estructura y referencias correctas, utilizando ETHOS.md, PHILOSOPHY.md y PROTOCOL.md para una documentación integral, y siguiendo los protocolos descritos en organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers organon valides avec un placement, une structure et des références corrects, en utilisant ETHOS.md, PHILOSOPHY.md et PROTOCOL.md pour une documentation complète, et en respectant les protocoles décrits dans organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, gültige Organon-Dateien mit korrekter Platzierung, Struktur und Referenzen zu generieren, indem sie ETHOS.md, PHILOSOPHY.md und PROTOCOL.md für eine umfassende Dokumentation verwenden und den in organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md beschriebenen Protokollen folgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquivos organon válidos com posicionamento correto, estrutura e referências, utilizando ETHOS.md, PHILOSOPHY.md e PROTOCOL.md para documentação abrangente, e aderindo aos protocolos delineados em organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать действительные файлы органон с правильным размещением, структурой и ссылками, используя ETHOS.md, PHILOSOPHY.md и PROTOCOL.md для всесторонней документации, и придерживаясь протоколов, изложенных в organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء ملفات органون صالحة مع وضع وتركيب ومراجع đúngين، باستخدام ETHOS.md و PHILOSOPHY.md و PROTOCOL.md لتدوين شاملة، والامتثال للبروتوكولات المحددة في organon/protocols/PROTOCOLS.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new domain directories with compliant ETHOS.md files","Adding cross-cutting features with properly structured organon files","Generating PHILOSOPHY.md for design rationale and PROTOCOL.md for step-by-step procedures","Initializing new scope directories with required organon files"],"zh":["创建包含合规的ETHOS.md文件的新域目录","使用正确结构化的Organon文件添加跨领域特性","生成用于设计理由的PHILOSOPHY.md和用于分步骤程序的PROTOCOL.md","初始化包含所需Organon文件的新范围目录"],"ja":["ETHOS.mdファイルを含む新しいドメインディレクトリを作成","正しく構造化されたオルガノンファイルを使用してクロスカット機能を追加","設計の理由となるPHILOSOPHY.mdとステップバイステップの手順となるPROTOCOL.mdを生成","必要なオルガノンファイルを含む新しいスコープディレクトリを初期化"],"ko":["준수된 ETHOS.md 파일을 포함하는 새로운 도메인 디렉토리를 생성","올바르게 구조화된 오르가논 파일을 사용하여 크로스 컷팅 특성을 추가","디자인 가치에 대한 PHILOSOPHY.md와 단계별 절차에 대한 PROTOCOL.md를 생성","필요한 오르가논 파일을 포함하는 새로운 범위 디렉토리를 초기화"],"es":["Crear nuevos directorios de dominio con archivos ETHOS.md compatibles","Agregar características transversales con archivos organon estructurados adecuadamente","Generar PHILOSOPHY.md para la justificación del diseño y PROTOCOL.md para procedimientos paso a paso","Inicializar nuevos directorios de alcance con los archivos organon requeridos"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux répertoires de domaine avec des fichiers ETHOS.md compatibles","Ajouter des fonctionnalités transversales avec des fichiers organon structurés correctement","Générer PHILOSOPHY.md pour la justification de la conception et PROTOCOL.md pour les procédures étape par étape","Initialiser de nouveaux répertoires d''étendue avec les fichiers organon requis"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Domänenverzeichnisse mit kompatiblen ETHOS.md-Dateien","Hinzufügen von übergreifenden Funktionen mit ordnungsgemäß strukturierten Organon-Dateien","Erzeugen von PHILOSOPHY.md für die Designbegründung und PROTOCOL.md für schrittweise Verfahren","Initialisieren neuer Bereichsverzeichnisse mit den erforderlichen Organon-Dateien"],"pt":["Criando novos diretórios de domínio com arquivos ETHOS.md conformes","Adicionando recursos transversais com arquivos organon estruturados corretamente","Gerando PHILOSOPHY.md para fundamentação de design e PROTOCOL.md para procedimentos passo a passo","Inicializando novos diretórios de escopo com arquivos organon necessários"],"ru":["Создание новых директорий домена с файлами ETHOS.md, соответствующими требованиям","Добавление поперечных функций с правильно структурированными файлами органон","Генерация PHILOSOPHY.md для обоснования дизайна и PROTOCOL.md для пошаговых процедур","Инициализация новых директорий области видимости с необходимыми файлами органон"],"ar":["إنشاء أدلة مجال جديدة مع ملفات ETHOS.md متوافقة","إضافة ميزات متقاطعة مع ملفات органون منظمات بشكل صحيح","توليد PHILOSOPHY.md لأساس تصميم و PROTOCOL.md لإجراءات خطوة بخطوة","ت 초기化 أدلة نطاق جديدة مع ملفات органون مطلوبة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to PROTO-ORG-6 protocol","Specific to organon file structure and protocols"],"zh":["需要遵守PROTO-ORG-6协议","特定于Organon文件结构和协议"],"ja":["PROTO-ORG-6プロトコルに従う必要がある","オルガノンファイルの構造とプロトコルに特有"],"ko":["PROTO-ORG-6 프로토콜을 따르야 함","오르가논 파일 구조 및 프로토콜에 특정"],"es":["Requiere la adherencia al protocolo PROTO-ORG-6","Específico para la estructura de archivos organon y protocolos"],"fr":["Requiert la conformité au protocole PROTO-ORG-6","Spécifique à la structure des fichiers organon et aux protocoles"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des PROTO-ORG-6-Protokolls","Spezifisch für die Organon-Dateistruktur und -protokolle"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao protocolo PROTO-ORG-6","Específico para estrutura de arquivos organon e protocolos"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения протокола PROTO-ORG-6","Конкретно для структуры файлов органон и протоколов"],"ar":["يتطلب الامتثال لبروتوكول PROTO-ORG-6","محدد لتركيب ملفات органون والبروتوكولات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pembee-app/pembee-marketing/schema-markup', 'community', 'pembee-app', 'pembee-marketing', 'pembee-app/pembee-marketing', 'schema-markup', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z', '2026-02-18T09:04:53.865Z', NULL, '{"id":"pembee-app/pembee-marketing/schema-markup","name":"schema-markup","description":{"zh":"Schema 标记是一种结构化数据格式，帮助搜索引擎了解内容并实现丰富的搜索结果。通过实现 Schema 标记，开发者可以提高网站的搜索引擎排名和可见性","ja":"スキーマ マークアップは、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、豊富な検索結果を実現するための構造化データ形式です。スキーマ マークアップを実装することで、開発者は Web サイトの検索エンジンランキングと可視性を向上させることができます","ko":"스키마 마크업은 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 풍부한 검색 결과를 구현하는 데 필요한 구조화된 데이터 형식입니다. 스키마 마크업을 구현함으로써 개발자는 웹 사이트의 검색 엔진 순위와 가시성을 향상시킬 수 있습니다","es":"El marcado de esquema es fundamental para que los motores de búsqueda entiendan el contenido y muestren resultados enriquecidos. Aprende a implementarlo","fr":"Les balises de schéma sont essentielles pour que les moteurs de recherche comprennent le contenu et affichent des résultats enrichis. Découvrez comment les implémenter","de":"Schema-Markup ist entscheidend, damit Suchmaschinen den Inhalt verstehen und erweiterte Ergebnisse anzeigen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es implementieren","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Schema 标记 - 结构化数据和搜索引擎优化","ja":"スキーマ マークアップ - 構造化データと検索エンジン最適化","ko":"스키마 마크업 - 구조화 데이터와 검색 엔진 최적화","es":"Marcado de esquema para desarrolladores","fr":"Balises de schéma pour les développeurs","de":"Schema-Markup für Entwickler","en":"schema-markup"},"description":{"zh":"Schema 标记是一种结构化数据格式，帮助搜索引擎了解内容并实现丰富的搜索结果。通过实现 Schema 标记，开发者可以提高网站的搜索引擎排名和可见性","ja":"スキーマ マークアップは、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、豊富な検索結果を実現するための構造化データ形式です。スキーマ マークアップを実装することで、開発者は Web サイトの検索エンジンランキングと可視性を向上させることができます","ko":"스키마 마크업은 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 풍부한 검색 결과를 구현하는 데 필요한 구조화된 데이터 형식입니다. 스키마 마크업을 구현함으로써 개발자는 웹 사이트의 검색 엔진 순위와 가시성을 향상시킬 수 있습니다","es":"El marcado de esquema es fundamental para que los motores de búsqueda entiendan el contenido y muestren resultados enriquecidos. Aprende a implementarlo","fr":"Les balises de schéma sont essentielles pour que les moteurs de recherche comprennent le contenu et affichent des résultats enrichis. Découvrez comment les i...","de":"Schema-Markup ist entscheidend, damit Suchmaschinen den Inhalt verstehen und erweiterte Ergebnisse anzeigen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es implementieren","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["结构化数据格式","提高搜索引擎排名","实现丰富的搜索结果","支持 schema.org 标准","易于实现和维护"],"ja":["構造化データ形式","検索エンジンランキングの向上","豊富な検索結果の実現","schema.org 標準のサポート","実装と保守が容易"],"ko":["구조화된 데이터 형식","검색 엔진 순위 향상","풍부한 검색 결과 구현","schema.org 표준 지원","구현과 유지 보수가 쉬움"],"es":["Mejora la comprensión de los motores de búsqueda","Habilita resultados enriquecidos en la búsqueda","Incrementa la visibilidad en los resultados de búsqueda","Ayuda a los usuarios a encontrar contenido relevante","Es compatible con la mayoría de los motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["Améliore la compréhension des moteurs de recherche","Active les résultats enrichis dans la recherche","Augmente la visibilité dans les résultats de recherche","Aide les utilisateurs à trouver du contenu pertinent","Est compatible avec la plupart des moteurs de recherche"],"de":["Verbessert die Verständlichkeit der Suchmaschinen","Aktiviert erweiterte Ergebnisse in der Suche","Erhöht die Sichtbarkeit in den Suchergebnissen","Hilft den Benutzern, relevanten Inhalt zu finden","Ist mit den meisten Suchmaschinen kompatibel"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Schema 标记","结构化数据","搜索引擎优化","schema.org","丰富的搜索结果","提高搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["スキーマ マークアップ","構造化データ","検索エンジン最適化","schema.org","豊富な検索結果","検索エンジンランキングの向上"],"ko":["스키마 마크업","구조화된 데이터","검색 엔진 최적화","schema.org","풍부한 검색 결과","검색 엔진 순위 향상"],"es":["marcado de esquema","schema.org","resultados enriquecidos","SEO para desarrolladores","optimización de búsqueda","contenido estructurado"],"fr":["balises de schéma","schema.org","résultats enrichis","SEO pour les développeurs","optimisation de recherche","contenu structuré"],"de":["Schema-Markup","schema.org","erweiterte Ergebnisse","SEO für Entwickler","Suchmaschinenoptimierung","strukturierter Inhalt"]}},"owner":"pembee-app","repo":"pembee-marketing","repoPath":"pembee-app/pembee-marketing","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"schema-markup","description":"When the user wants to add, fix, or optimize schema markup and structured data on their site. Also use when the user mentions schema markup, structured data, JSON-LD, rich snippets, schema.org, FAQ schema, product schema, review schema, or breadcrumb schema. For broader SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type","body":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type** - What kind of page? What''s the primary content? What rich results are possible?\n\n2. **Current State** - Any existing schema? Errors in implementation? Which rich results already appearing?\n\n3. **Goals** - Which rich results are you targeting? What''s the business value?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Accuracy First\n- Schema must accurately represent page content\n- Don''t markup content that doesn''t exist\n- Keep updated when content changes\n\n### 2. Use JSON-LD\n- Google recommends JSON-LD format\n- Easier to implement and maintain\n- Place in `<head>` or end of `<body>`\n\n### 3. Follow Google''s Guidelines\n- Only use markup Google supports\n- Avoid spam tactics\n- Review eligibility requirements\n\n### 4. Validate Everything\n- Test before deploying\n- Monitor Search Console\n- Fix errors promptly\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Types\n\n| Type | Use For | Required Properties |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| Organization | Company homepage/about | name, url |\n| WebSite | Homepage (search box) | name, url |\n| Article | Blog posts, news | headline, image, datePublished, author |\n| Product | Product pages | name, image, offers |\n| SoftwareApplication | SaaS/app pages | name, offers |\n| FAQPage | FAQ content | mainEntity (Q&A array) |\n| HowTo | Tutorials | name, step |\n| BreadcrumbList | Any page with breadcrumbs | itemListElement |\n| LocalBusiness | Local business pages | name, address |\n| Event | Events, webinars | name, startDate, location |\n\n**For complete JSON-LD examples**: See [references/schema-examples.md](references/schema-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Organization (Company Page)\nRequired: name, url\nRecommended: logo, sameAs (social profiles), contactPoint\n\n### Article/BlogPosting\nRequired: headline, image, datePublished, author\nRecommended: dateModified, publisher, description\n\n### Product\nRequired: name, image, offers (price + availability)\nRecommended: sku, brand, aggregateRating, review\n\n### FAQPage\nRequired: mainEntity (array of Question/Answer pairs)\n\n### BreadcrumbList\nRequired: itemListElement (array with position, name, item)\n\n---\n\n## Multiple Schema Types\n\nYou can combine multiple schema types on one page using `@graph`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation and Testing\n\n### Tools\n- **Google Rich Results Test**: https://search.google.com/test/rich-results\n- **Schema.org Validator**: https://validator.schema.org/\n- **Search Console**: Enhancements reports\n\n### Common Errors\n\n**Missing required properties** - Check Google''s documentation for required fields\n\n**Invalid values** - Dates must be ISO 8601, URLs fully qualified, enumerations exact\n\n**Mismatch with page content** - Schema doesn''t match visible content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Static Sites\n- Add JSON-LD directly in HTML template\n- Use includes/partials for reusable schema\n\n### Dynamic Sites (React, Next.js)\n- Component that renders schema\n- Server-side rendered for SEO\n- Serialize data to JSON-LD\n\n### CMS / WordPress\n- Plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, Schema Pro)\n- Theme modifications\n- Custom fields to structured data\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Schema Implementation\n```json\n// Full JSON-LD code block\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"...\",\n  // Complete markup\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Validates in Rich Results Test\n- [ ] No errors or warnings\n- [ ] Matches page content\n- [ ] All required properties included\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of page is this?\n2. What rich results are you hoping to achieve?\n3. What data is available to populate the schema?\n4. Is there existing schema on the page?\n5. What''s your tech stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For overall SEO including schema review\n- **programmatic-seo**: For templated schema at scale\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:04:53.865Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO-focused Agents needing structured data implementation for rich search results.","zh":"非常适合需要为丰富搜索结果实施结构化数据的SEO焦点代理","ja":"SEOに焦点を当てたエージェントが構造化データを実装して豊富な検索結果を実現するのに最適","ko":"豊富한 검색 결과를 위한 구조화된 데이터 구현이 필요한 SEO 중심 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes enfocados en SEO que necesitan implementación de datos estructurados para resultados de búsqueda ricos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur le SEO qui nécessitent une mise en œuvre de données structurées pour des résultats de recherche riches.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-fokussierte Agenten, die eine Implementierung von strukturierten Daten für reiche Suchergebnisse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em SEO que necessitam de implementação de dados estruturados para resultados de busca ricos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на SEO, которым требуется реализация структурированных данных для обогащенных результатов поиска.","ar":"مثالي لعميل يركز على تحسين محركات البحث ويتطلب تنفيذ بيانات منسقة لنتائج بحث غنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement schema.org markup, enabling search engines to understand content and display rich results using protocols like JSON-LD, and optimizing for technical keywords like page type and product marketing context.","zh":"赋予代理实施schema.org标记的能力，使搜索引擎能够理解内容并使用JSON-LD等协议显示丰富的结果，同时优化技术关键词如页面类型和产品营销背景","ja":"エージェントがschema.orgマークアップを実装できるようにし、検索エンジンがコンテンツを理解し、JSON-LDなどのプロトコルを使用して豊富な結果を表示し、ページタイプや製品マーケティングコンテキストなどの技術キーワードを最適化","ko":"에이전트가 schema.org 마크를 구현할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 검색 엔진이 콘텐츠를 이해하고 JSON-LD 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 풍부한 결과를 표시하며 페이지 유형 및 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 등의 기술 키워드를 최적화","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar la marca schema.org, lo que permite a los motores de búsqueda comprender el contenido y mostrar resultados ricos utilizando protocolos como JSON-LD, y optimizando para palabras clave técnicas como tipo de página y contexto de marketing de productos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre la balise schema.org, ce qui permet aux moteurs de recherche de comprendre le contenu et d''afficher des résultats riches en utilisant des protocoles comme JSON-LD, et en optimisant pour des mots-clés techniques comme le type de page et le contexte de marketing de produits.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die schema.org-Markierung zu implementieren, sodass Suchmaschinen den Inhalt verstehen und reiche Ergebnisse mithilfe von Protokollen wie JSON-LD anzeigen können, und optimiert für technische Schlüsselwörter wie Seitentyp und Produktmarketing-Kontext.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar marcação schema.org, permitindo que os mecanismos de busca entendam o conteúdo e exibam resultados ricos usando protocolos como JSON-LD, e otimizando para palavras-chave técnicas como tipo de página e contexto de marketing de produtos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать маркировку schema.org, что позволяет поисковым системам понимать контент и отображать обогащенные результаты с использованием протоколов типа JSON-LD, и оптимизирует для технических ключевых слов, таких как тип страницы и контекст маркетинга продукта.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تنفيذ تعليمات schema.org، مما يسمح لمحركات البحث بفهم المحتوى وعرض نتائج غنية باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل JSON-LD، ويتوافق مع الكلمات الرئيسية الفنية مثل نوع الصفحة وسياق تسويق المنتج."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing schema markup for product pages","Generating rich results in search engine results pages (SERPs)","Enhancing content understanding for voice assistants"],"zh":["为产品页面实施schema标记","在搜索引擎结果页面（SERPs）中生成丰富的结果","增强语音助手的内容理解"],"ja":["製品ページのschemaマークアップを実装する","検索エンジン結果ページ（SERPs）で豊富な結果を生成する","ボイスアシスタントのコンテンツ理解を強化する"],"ko":["제품 페이지의 스키마 마크업을 구현","검색 엔진 결과 페이지(SERPs)에서 풍부한 결과를 생성","음성 애플리케이션의 콘텐츠 이해를增强"],"es":["Implementar la marca de esquema para páginas de productos","Generar resultados ricos en las páginas de resultados de los motores de búsqueda (SERPs)","Mejorar la comprensión del contenido para asistentes de voz"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la balise de schéma pour les pages de produits","Générer des résultats riches dans les pages de résultats des moteurs de recherche (SERPs)","Améliorer la compréhension du contenu pour les assistants vocaux"],"de":["Implementierung der Schemamarkierung für Produktseiten","Erzeugen von reichen Ergebnissen in den Suchmaschinenergebnisseiten (SERPs)","Verbesserung des Inhaltsverständnisses für Sprachassistenten"],"pt":["Implementar marcação de esquema para páginas de produtos","Gerar resultados ricos em páginas de resultados de mecanismos de busca (SERPs)","Melhorar a compreensão do conteúdo para assistentes de voz"],"ru":["Реализация маркировки схемы для страниц продукции","Генерация обогащенных результатов в страницах результатов поисковых систем (SERPs)","Улучшение понимания контента для голосовых помощников"],"ar":["تنفيذ علامات النظام لصفحات المنتجات","توليد نتائج غنية في صفحات نتائج محركات البحث (SERPs)","تحسين فهم المحتوى للمساعدين الصوتيين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of schema.org vocabulary","Needs access to page type and content information"],"zh":["需要理解schema.org词汇表","需要访问页面类型和内容信息"],"ja":["schema.orgの語彙表を理解する必要がある","ページタイプとコンテンツ情報へのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["스키마.org 어휘집을 이해해야 함","페이지 유형 및 콘텐츠 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del vocabulario schema.org","Necesita acceso a la información del tipo de página y del contenido"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du vocabulaire schema.org","Nécessite un accès aux informations de type de page et de contenu"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis des schema.org-Vokabulars","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Informationen zum Seitentyp und zum Inhalt"],"pt":["Requer entendimento do vocabulário schema.org","Necessita acesso a informações de tipo de página e conteúdo"],"ru":["Требует понимания словаря schema.org","Требует доступа к информации о типе страницы и контенте"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم المفردات schema.org","يتطلب وصولاً إلى معلومات نوع الصفحة والمحتوى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
