optimisation des performances"],"de":["Modell-Design mit optimalen ORM-Mustern","Implementierung von Ansichten (FBV, CBV, DRF-Viewsets)","Entwicklung von APIs mit Django REST Framework","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Tests und Leistungs-Optimierung"],"pt":["Projeto de modelo com padrões ORM ótimos","Implementação de views (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets)","Desenvolvimento de API com Django REST Framework","Otimização de desempenho","Autenticação e autorização"],"ru":["Проектирование модели с оптимальными шаблонами ORM","Реализация представлений (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets)","Разработка API с помощью Django REST Framework","Оптимизация производительности","Аутентификация и авторизация"],"ar":["تصميم نموذج مع أنماط ORM مُثلى","تنفيذ مناظير (FBV، CBV، DRF viewsets)","تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع إطار Django REST","تحسين الأداء","التحقق والتصريح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Django 后端开发","Django REST Framework","Django 模型设计","Django 视图实现","Django 表单处理","Django 认证与授权","Django 测试与性能优化","Python 后端开发"],"ja":["Django バックエンド開発","Django REST Framework","Django モデル設計","Django ビュー実装","Django フォーム処理","Django 認証と認可","Django テストとパフォーマンス最適化","Python バックエンド開発"],"ko":["장고 백엔드 개발","장고 REST 프레임워크","장고 모델 설계","장고 뷰 구현","장고 폼 처리","장고 인증 및 인가","장고 테스트 및 성능 최적화","Python 백엔드 개발"],"es":["Django","Desarrollo backend","Python","Django REST Framework","Modelos","Vistas","Autenticación","Pruebas","Optimización del rendimiento"],"fr":["Django","Développement backend","Python","Django REST Framework","Modèles","Vues","Authentification","Tests","Optimisation des performances"],"de":["Django","Backend-Entwicklung","Python","Django REST Framework","Modelle","Ansichten","Authentifizierung","Tests","Leistungs-Optimierung"],"pt":["Django","Desenvolvimento de backend","Python","Django REST Framework","ORM","Autenticação","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Django","Разработка бэкенда","Python","Django REST Framework","ORM","Аутентификация","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["Django","تطوير الخلفية","Python","إطار Django REST","ORM","التحقق","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"juanelojga","repo":"aiecommerce","repoPath":"juanelojga/aiecommerce","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.473Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"django-expert","description":"Expert Django backend development guidance. Use when creating Django models, views, serializers, or APIs; debugging ORM queries or migrations; optimizing database performance; implementing authentication; writing tests; or working with Django REST Framework. Follows Django best practices and modern patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Django Expert\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides expert guidance for Django backend development with comprehensive coverage of models, views, Django REST Framework, forms, authentication, testing, and performance optimization. It follows official Django best practices and modern Python conventions to help you build robust, maintainable applications.\n\n**Key Capabilities:**\n- Model design with optimal ORM patterns\n- View implementation (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets)\n- Django REST Framework API developm","body":"# Django Expert\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides expert guidance for Django backend development with comprehensive coverage of models, views, Django REST Framework, forms, authentication, testing, and performance optimization. It follows official Django best practices and modern Python conventions to help you build robust, maintainable applications.\n\n**Key Capabilities:**\n- Model design with optimal ORM patterns\n- View implementation (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets)\n- Django REST Framework API development\n- Query optimization and performance tuning\n- Authentication and permissions\n- Testing strategies and patterns\n- Security best practices\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when you encounter these triggers:\n\n**Model & Database Work:**\n- \"Create a Django model for...\"\n- \"Optimize this queryset/database query\"\n- \"Generate migrations for...\"\n- \"Design database schema for...\"\n- \"Fix N+1 query problem\"\n\n**View & API Development:**\n- \"Create an API endpoint for...\"\n- \"Build a Django view that...\"\n- \"Implement DRF serializer/viewset\"\n- \"Add filtering/pagination to API\"\n\n**Authentication & Security:**\n- \"Implement authentication/permissions\"\n- \"Create custom user model\"\n- \"Secure this endpoint/view\"\n\n**Testing & Quality:**\n- \"Write tests for this Django app\"\n- \"Debug this Django error/issue\"\n- \"Review Django code for issues\"\n\n**Performance & Optimization:**\n- \"This Django view is slow\"\n- \"Optimize database queries\"\n- \"Add caching to...\"\n\n**Production Deployment:**\n- \"Deploy Django to production\"\n- \"Configure Django for production\"\n- \"Set up HTTPS/SSL for Django\"\n- \"Production settings checklist\"\n- \"Configure production database/cache\"\n\n## Instructions\n\nFollow this workflow when handling Django development requests:\n\n### 1. Analyze the Request and Gather Context\n\n**Identify the task type:**\n- Model design (database schema, relationships, migrations)\n- View/API development (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets, serializers)\n- Query optimization (N+1 problems, database performance)\n- Authentication/permissions (user models, access control)\n- Testing (unit tests, integration tests, fixtures)\n- Security review (CSRF, XSS, SQL injection, permissions)\n- Production deployment (settings, HTTPS, database, caching, monitoring)\n- Template rendering (Django templates, context processors)\n\n**Leverage available context:**\n- If `django-ai-boost` MCP server is available, use it to understand project structure and existing patterns\n- Read relevant existing code to understand conventions\n- Check Django version for compatibility considerations\n\n### 2. Load Relevant Reference Documentation\n\nBased on the task type, reference the appropriate bundled documentation:\n\n- **Models/ORM work** -> `references/models-and-orm.md`\n  - Model design patterns and field choices\n  - Relationship configurations (ForeignKey, ManyToMany)\n  - Custom managers and QuerySet methods\n  - Migration strategies\n\n- **View/API development** -> `references/views-and-urls.md` + `references/drf-guidelines.md`\n  - FBV vs CBV decision criteria\n  - DRF serializers, viewsets, and routers\n  - URL configuration patterns\n  - Middleware and request/response handling\n\n- **Performance issues** -> `references/performance-optimization.md`\n  - Query optimization techniques (select_related, prefetch_related)\n  - Caching strategies (Redis, Memcached, database caching)\n  - Database indexing and query profiling\n  - Connection pooling and async patterns\n\n- **Production deployment** -> `references/production-deployment.md`\n  - Critical settings (DEBUG, SECRET_KEY, ALLOWED_HOSTS)\n  - HTTPS and SSL/TLS configuration\n  - Database and cache configuration\n  - Static/media file serving\n  - Error monitoring and logging\n  - Deployment process and health checks\n\n- **Security concerns** -> `references/security-checklist.md`\n  - CSRF/XSS/SQL injection prevention\n  - Authentication and authorization patterns\n  - Secure configuration practices\n  - Input validation and sanitization\n\n- **Testing tasks** -> `references/testing-strategies.md`\n  - Test structure and organization\n  - Fixtures and factories\n  - Mocking external dependencies\n  - Coverage and CI/CD integration\n\n### 3. Implement Following Django Best Practices\n\n**Code quality standards:**\n- Follow PEP 8 and Django coding style\n- Use Django built-ins over third-party packages when possible\n- Keep views thin, use services/managers for business logic\n- Write descriptive variable names and add docstrings for complex logic\n- Handle errors gracefully with appropriate exceptions\n\n**Django-specific patterns:**\n- Use `select_related()` for FK/OneToOne, `prefetch_related()` for reverse FK/M2M\n- Leverage class-based views and mixins for code reuse\n- Use Django forms/serializers for validation\n- Follow Django''s migration workflow (never edit applied migrations)\n- Use Django''s built-in security features (CSRF tokens, auth decorators)\n\n**API development (DRF):**\n- Use ModelSerializer for standard CRUD operations\n- Implement proper pagination and filtering\n- Use appropriate permission classes\n- Follow RESTful conventions for endpoints\n- Version APIs when making breaking changes\n\n### 4. Validate and Test\n\nBefore presenting the solution:\n\n**Code review:**\n- Check for N+1 query problems (use Django Debug Toolbar mentally)\n- Verify proper error handling and edge cases\n- Ensure security best practices are followed\n- Confirm migrations are clean and reversible\n\n**Testing considerations:**\n- Suggest or write appropriate tests for new functionality\n- Verify test coverage for critical paths\n- Check that fixtures/factories are maintainable\n\n**Performance check:**\n- Review database queries for efficiency\n- Consider caching opportunities\n- Verify proper use of database indexes\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n**references/** - Comprehensive Django documentation loaded into context as needed\n\nThese reference files provide detailed guidance beyond this SKILL.md overview:\n\n- **`references/models-and-orm.md`** (~11k words)\n  - Model field types and best practices\n  - Relationship configurations (ForeignKey, OneToOne, ManyToMany)\n  - Custom managers and QuerySet methods\n  - Migration patterns and common pitfalls\n  - Database-level constraints and indexes\n\n- **`references/views-and-urls.md`** (~17k words)\n  - Function-based vs class-based view trade-offs\n  - CBV mixins and inheritance patterns\n  - URL routing and reverse resolution\n  - Middleware implementation\n  - Request/response lifecycle\n\n- **`references/drf-guidelines.md`** (~18k words)\n  - Serializer patterns (ModelSerializer, nested serializers)\n  - ViewSet and router configurations\n  - Pagination, filtering, and search\n  - Authentication and permission classes\n  - API versioning strategies\n  - Performance optimization for APIs\n\n- **`references/testing-strategies.md`** (~18k words)\n  - Test organization and structure\n  - Factory patterns vs fixtures\n  - Testing views, models, and serializers\n  - Mocking external services\n  - Test database optimization\n  - CI/CD integration\n\n- **`references/security-checklist.md`** (~12k words)\n  - CSRF protection implementation\n  - XSS prevention techniques\n  - SQL injection defense\n  - Authentication best practices\n  - Permission and authorization patterns\n  - Secure settings configuration\n\n- **`references/performance-optimization.md`** (~14k words)\n  - Query optimization (select_related, prefetch_related, only, defer)\n  - Database indexing strategies\n  - Caching layers (Redis, Memcached, database cache)\n  - Database connection pooling\n  - Profiling and monitoring tools\n  - Async views and background tasks\n\n- **`references/production-deployment.md`** (~20k words)\n  - Critical settings (DEBUG, SECRET_KEY, ALLOWED_HOSTS)\n  - Database configuration and connection pooling\n  - HTTPS/SSL configuration and security headers\n  - Static and media file serving\n  - Caching with Redis/Memcached\n  - Email configuration for production\n  - Error monitoring with Sentry\n  - Logging and health checks\n  - Zero-downtime deployment strategies\n\n- **`references/examples.md`** - Practical implementation examples\n  - Model design with custom managers\n  - N+1 query optimization\n  - DRF API endpoint implementation\n  - Writing Django tests\n\n## Additional Notes\n\n**Django Version Compatibility:**\n- Consider LTS releases (4.2, 5.2) for production\n- Check deprecation warnings when upgrading\n- Use `django-upgrade` tool for automated migration\n\n**Common Pitfalls to Avoid:**\n- Circular imports (use lazy references)\n- Missing `related_name` on relationships\n- Forgetting database indexes on frequently queried fields\n- Using `get()` without exception handling\n- N+1 queries in templates and serializers\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:05:37.173Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Web Development Agents needing expert Django backend development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要专家Django后端开发能力的Python Web开发代理。","ja":"Python Web開発エージェントがDjangoバックエンド開発の専門能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Django 백엔드 개발 전문 능력이 필요한 Python 웹 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web de Python que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de backend de Django expertas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web Python nécessitant des capacités de développement de backend Django expertes.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Web-Development-Agents, die Expertenfähigkeiten im Bereich Django-Backend-Entwicklung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web Python que precisam de capacidades de desenvolvimento de backend Django especializadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки Python, которым необходимы возможности экспертного бэкенд-разработки на Django.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق الويب بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تطوير خلفية دجنجو الخبيرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build robust Django applications with optimal ORM patterns, Django REST Framework API development, and comprehensive testing, following official Django best practices and modern Python conventions, leveraging view implementation with FBV, CBV, and DRF viewsets.","zh":"赋予代理构建强大的Django应用程序的能力，具有最佳的ORM模式、Django REST Framework API开发和全面测试，遵循官方Django最佳实践和现代Python惯例，利用FBV、CBV和DRF视图集实现视图。","ja":"エージェントが強力なDjangoアプリケーションを構築できるようにすることで、最適なORMパターン、Django REST Framework API開発、そして包括的なテストを行い、公式のDjangoベストプラクティスと最新のPython規約に従い、FBV、CBV、DRFビューセットを使用したビューの実装を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 강력한 Django 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 해주며, 최적의 ORM 패턴, Django REST Framework API 개발 및 포괄적인 테스트를 수행하고, 공식 Django 최선의 관행 및 최신 Python 규약을 따르며, FBV, CBV 및 DRF 뷰セット을 사용한 뷰 구현을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones Django robustas con patrones de ORM óptimos, desarrollo de API de Django REST Framework y pruebas exhaustivas, siguiendo las mejores prácticas oficiales de Django y las convenciones de Python modernas, aprovechando la implementación de vistas con FBV, CBV y conjuntos de vistas de DRF.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications Django robustes avec des modèles de ORM optimaux, un développement d''API Django REST Framework et des tests exhaustifs, en suivant les meilleures pratiques officielles de Django et les conventions Python modernes, en exploitant la mise en œuvre des vues avec FBV, CBV et les jeux de vues de DRF.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste Django-Anwendungen mit optimalen ORM-Mustern, Django-REST-Framework-API-Entwicklung und umfassenden Tests zu erstellen, indem sie offizielle Django-Best-Practices und moderne Python-Konventionen befolgen und die Implementierung von Ansichten mit FBV, CBV und DRF-Viewsets nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações Django robustas com padrões de ORM ótimos, desenvolvimento de API do Django REST Framework e testes abrangentes, seguindo as melhores práticas oficiais do Django e convenções Python modernas, aproveitando a implementação de visualização com FBV, CBV e conjuntos de visualização do DRF.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать прочные приложения Django с оптимальными шаблонами ORM, разработкой API-фреймворка Django REST и всесторонним тестированием, следуя официальным лучшим практикам Django и современным соглашениям Python, используя реализацию представлений с помощью FBV, CBV и наборов представлений DRF.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات دجنجو قوية مع أنماط ORM المثلى، وتطوير واجهة برمجة تطبيقات إطار دجنجو REST، والاختبارات الشاملة، مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات الرسمية لدجنجو والاتفاقيات البايثونية الحديثة، واستغلال تنفيذ العرض مع FBV وCBV ومجموعات العرض DRF."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing optimal database models with Django''s ORM","Implementing scalable Django REST Framework APIs","Debugging and testing Django applications for performance optimization"],"zh":["使用Django的ORM设计最优的数据库模型","实现可扩展的Django REST Framework API","调试和测试Django应用程序以优化性能"],"ja":["DjangoのORMを使用して最適なデータベースモデルを設計する","拡張可能なDjango REST Framework APIを実装する","パフォーマンス最適化のためにDjangoアプリケーションをデバッグしてテストする"],"ko":["Django의 ORM을 사용하여 최적의 데이터베이스 모델을 설계하는 것","확장 가능한 Django REST Framework API를 구현하는 것","성능 최적화를 위해 Django 애플리케이션을 디버깅하고 테스트하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar modelos de base de datos óptimos con el ORM de Django","Implementar APIs escalables de Django REST Framework","Depurar y probar aplicaciones de Django para la optimización del rendimiento"],"fr":["Concevoir des modèles de base de données optimaux avec l''ORM de Django","Mettre en œuvre des API scalables de Django REST Framework","Déboguer et tester les applications Django pour l''optimisation des performances"],"de":["Optimale Datenbankmodelle mit dem Django-ORM entwerfen","Skalierbare Django-REST-Framework-APIs implementieren","Django-Anwendungen für die Leistungsoptimierung debuggen und testen"],"pt":["Projeto de modelos de banco de dados ótimos com ORM do Django","Implementação de APIs escaláveis do Django REST Framework","Depuração e teste de aplicações Django para otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Проектирование оптимальных моделей базы данных с помощью ORM Django","Реализация масштабируемых API-фреймворка Django REST","Отладка и тестирование приложений Django для оптимизации производительности"],"ar":["تصميم نماذج قواعد البيانات المثلى مع ORM دجنجو","تنفيذ واجهات برمجة تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع لإطار دجنجو REST","تصحيح الأخطاء واختبار تطبيقات دجنجو لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and Django installation","Limited to Django backend development","Follows official Django best practices, which may not be compatible with older versions"],"zh":["需要Python和Django安装","仅限Django后端开发","遵循官方Django最佳实践，这可能与旧版本不兼容"],"ja":["PythonとDjangoのインストールが必要","Djangoバックエンド開発のみ","公式のDjangoベストプラクティスに従うため、古いバージョンと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["Python 및 Django 설치가 필요함","Django 백엔드 개발만 해당함","공식 Django 최선의 관행을 따르므로, 오래된 버전과 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Python y Django","Limitado al desarrollo de backend de Django","Sigue las mejores prácticas oficiales de Django, que pueden no ser compatibles con versiones anteriores"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Python et de Django","Limité au développement de backend de Django","Suit les meilleures pratiques officielles de Django, qui peuvent ne pas être compatibles avec les versions antérieures"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Python und Django","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Django-Backends","Befolgt offizielle Django-Best-Practices, die möglicherweise nicht mit älteren Versionen kompatibel sind"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python e do Django","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de backend do Django","Segue as melhores práticas oficiais do Django, que podem não ser compatíveis com versões mais antigas"],"ru":["Требует установки Python и Django","Ограничен разработкой бэкенда Django","Следует официальным лучшим практикам Django, которые могут быть несовместимы со старыми версиями"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بايثون ودجنجو","محدود بتطوير خلفية دجنجو","يتبع أفضل الممارسات الرسمية لدجنجو، والتي قد لا تكون متوافقة مع الإصدارات القديمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
