hie","de":"Frontend-Design: Prinzipien und Philosophie","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Frontend: Design Intuitivo","ru":"Фронтенд-дизайн: минимизация когнитивной нагрузки","ar":"تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية: تجربة مستخدم بسيطة","en":"frontend-design"},"description":{"zh":"前端设计系统旨在减少认知负担，实现交互的直观性，尊重人类心理和行为模式","ja":"フロントエンドデザインシステムは、認知負荷を減らし、インタラクションを直感的にすることを目的とし、人間の心理と行動パターンを尊重する","ko":"프론트엔드 디자인 시스템은认知負担을 줄이고 상호작용의 직관성을 구현하여 인간의 심리와 행동 패턴을 존중합니다","es":"El diseño frontend se centra en minimizar la carga cognitiva y hacer que las interacciones sean intuitivas. Los principios de diseño deben respetar la psicol...","fr":"La conception frontend se concentre sur la minimisation de la charge cognitive et la création d''interactions intuitives. Les principes de conception doivent ...","de":"Das Frontend-Design konzentriert sich auf die Minimierung der kognitiven Belastung und die Schaffung intuitiver Interaktionen. Die Designprinzipien müssen di...","pt":"O design de frontend visa minimizar a carga cognitiva e tornar as interações intuitivas, respeitando a psicologia humana e os padrões comportamentais","ru":"Фронтенд-дизайн направлен на минимизацию когнитивной нагрузки и сделать взаимодействие интуитивным, уважая человеческую психологию и поведенческие закономерн...","ar":"يهدف تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية إلى تقليل الحمل المعرفي وجعل التفاعلات بديهية، مع احترام النفس البشرية والأنماط السلوكية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["减少认知负担","实现交互的直观性","尊重人类心理和行为模式","简单直观的设计","提高用户体验"],"ja":["認知負荷を減らす","インタラクションを直感的にする","人間の心理と行動パターンを尊重する","シンプルで直感的な設計","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上"],"ko":["인지 부하 감소","상호작용의 직관성 구현","인간의 심리와 행동 패턴 존중","단순하고 직관적인 디자인","사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Minimización de la carga cognitiva","Diseño intuitivo y natural","Respeto a la psicología humana","Limitaciones cognitivas","Interacciones eficientes","Experiencia de usuario óptima"],"fr":["Minimisation de la charge cognitive","Conception intuitive et naturelle","Respect de la psychologie humaine","Limites cognitives","Interactions efficaces","Expérience utilisateur optimale"],"de":["Minimierung der kognitiven Belastung","Intuitives und naturliches Design","Respekt für die menschliche Psychologie","Kognitive Grenzen","Effiziente Interaktionen","Optimale Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Minimização da carga cognitiva","Interações intuitivas","Respeito à psicologia humana","Padrões comportamentais","Simplicidade e naturalidade"],"ru":["Минимизация когнитивной нагрузки","Интуитивное взаимодействие","Уважение к человеческой психологии","Поведенческие закономерности","Простота и естественность"],"ar":["تقليل الحمل المعرفي","تفاعلات بديهية","احترام النفس البشرية","الأنماط السلوكية","البساطة والطبيعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","用户体验","交互设计","设计系统","认知负担","直观性"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","インタラクション設計","デザインシステム","認知負荷","直感性"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","사용자 경험","상호작용 디자인","디자인 시스템","인지 부하","직관성"],"es":["diseño frontend","principios de diseño","filosofía de diseño","experiencia de usuario","interfaz de usuario","carga cognitiva","psicología humana","limitaciones cognitivas"],"fr":["conception frontend","principes de conception","philosophie de conception","expérience utilisateur","interface utilisateur","charge cognitive","psychologie humaine","limites cognitives"],"de":["frontend-design","designprinzipien","designphilosophie","benutzererfahrung","benutzeroberfläche","kognitive belastung","menschliche psychologie","kognitive grenzen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de frontend","design de frontend","experiência do usuário","simplicidade","psicologia humana","padrões comportamentais"],"ru":["фронтенд-дизайн","разработка фронтенда","опыт пользователя","простота","человеческая психология","поведенческие закономерности"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تجربة المستخدم","البساطة","النفس البشرية","الأنماط السلوكية"]}},"owner":"HexAI-inc","repo":"v0-futuristic-website-design","repoPath":"HexAI-inc/v0-futuristic-website-design","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Elite Tier Web UI standards, including pixel-perfect retro aesthetics, immersive layouts, and UX psychology protocols.","bodyPreview":"<domain_overview>\n# Frontend Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Minimize cognitive load and make interactions intuitive. Every design decision should respect human psychology, behavioral patterns, and cognitive limitations. The designer bears complexity so the user experiences simplicity.\n> **Core Principle:** Good design is invisible - users should accomplish their goals without noticing the design itself. Design should feel effortless and natural, aligning with how humans naturally think and beh","body":"<domain_overview>\n# Frontend Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Minimize cognitive load and make interactions intuitive. Every design decision should respect human psychology, behavioral patterns, and cognitive limitations. The designer bears complexity so the user experiences simplicity.\n> **Core Principle:** Good design is invisible - users should accomplish their goals without noticing the design itself. Design should feel effortless and natural, aligning with how humans naturally think and behave.\n\n## ⚠️ Core Protocols & Standards\n**ANTI-AI AESTHETIC MANDATE (CRITICAL):** Never use generic aesthetics that give the impression of being AI-generated. This includes overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliché color schemes (especially purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts, and repetitive component patterns.\n**ABSOLUTELY FORBIDDEN:** The \"Cyberpunk\" aesthetic is strictly prohibited. Do NOT use neon glows, matrix rain, glitch effects, or \"high-tech\" dark modes unless explicitly requested for a specific context. This cliché is the hallmark of lazy AI generation.\nSpecifically avoid template-driven designs that lack context-specific character. This skill aims to create distinctive, original, and production-level frontends. Realize functional, high-fidelity code by paying extraordinary attention to aesthetic details and creative decisions.\n\n**CRITICAL PROTOCOL:** The detailed rules are stored in separate reference files. You **MUST** use the `Read` tool to load these files into your context **BEFORE** starting any design work. Do not assume you know the contents.\n\n- **[frontend_reference.md](frontend_reference.md)**: Contains Technical Standards, Aesthetic Signatures, and Creative Protocols.\n- **[animation_reference.md](animation_reference.md)**: Contains 2025 Motion Standards, Physics-based animation rules, and Micro-interactions.\n- **[css_art_reference.md](css_art_reference.md)**: **FOR VISUAL OBJECTS.** Use this when asked to \"draw\" or \"create\" complex items (Swords, Logos, Icons) using code. Defines Geometric Composition & LCH Materials.\n- **[security-protocols.md](security-protocols.md)**: Contains critical Frontend Security rules.\n\n## 🎬 Core Animation Principles\n> **Motion Mandate:** Animation must be **Physics-Based** (Springs), **Continuous** (No Teleportation), and **Meaningful** (Storytelling).\n\n- **Continuity:** State changes must morph, not cut (View Transitions).\n- **Weight:** Objects must feel like they have mass (Use Spring Animations).\n- **Focus:** Animation guides attention; it does not distract.\n- **Narrative:** Every motion tells a story about where an element came from and where it is going.\n*(See `animation_reference.md` for the full 12-Principle Framework)*\n\n## 🔗 Related & Required Skills\nWhen executing Frontend tasks, you **MUST** integrate these complementary skills to ensure architectural integrity:\n\n| Skill | Purpose in Frontend Context |\n|-------|-----------------------------|\n| **`brainstorming`** | **MANDATORY PRE-REQUISITE.** Before ANY design work, use this to interrogate the user''s vague instructions and crystallize the \"Screenplay/Narrative\" defined in `frontend_reference.md`. |\n| **`clean-code`** | **MANDATORY.** Ensures component modularity, cleaner hooks/state logic, and security compliance. Prevents \"spaghetti UI code\". |\n| **`tdd-mastery`** | **MANDATORY.** \"Iron Law\" applies to components too. Use for visual regression tests and logic verification before coding UI. |\n| **`optimization-mastery`** | Use for Performance Audits (Lighthouse, Core Web Vitals), reducing bundle size, and optimizing re-renders. |\n| **`backend-design`** | Consult this when defining API data shapes, error handling states, and ensuring type safety across the network boundary. |\n| **`planning-mastery`** | Use this to break down complex UI implementations into \"Atomic\" deliverables (Atoms -> Molecules -> Organisms). |\n\n## 🛠️ Automation Scripts\nUse the following script to audit your implementation:\n- **`scripts/js/ux-audit.js`**: Run this to perform a heuristic analysis of the UI for consistency, accessibility (contrast/spacing), and compliance with the design tokens.\n  - *Usage:* `node scripts/js/ux-audit.js`\n</domain_overview>"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:06:28.477Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI-focused Agents like Cursor and Claude Code needing intuitive interaction design principles.","zh":"适用于像 Cursor 和 Claude Code 这样的面向 UI 的 Agent，需要直观的交互设计原则。","ja":"Cursor や Claude Code などの UI フォーカスのエージェントに最適であり、直感的なインタラクション設計原則が必要です。","ko":"Cursor 및 Claude Code와 같은 UI 중심의 에이전트에게 적합하며, 직관적인 상호 작용 설계 원칙이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario como Cursor y Claude Code que necesitan principios de diseño de interacción intuitivos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur tels que Cursor et Claude Code nécessitant des principes de conception d''interaction intuitifs.","de":"Ideal für benutzeroberflächenorientierte Agenten wie Cursor und Claude Code, die intuitive Interaktionsdesignprinzipien benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes focados em UI, como Cursor e Claude Code, que necessitam de princípios de design de interação intuitiva.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, таких как Cursor и Claude Code, которые требуют интуитивных принципов проектирования взаимодействия.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذين يركزون على واجهة المستخدم مثل Cursor و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى مبادئ تصميم التفاعل غير المباشر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create minimalist and human-centered design systems, leveraging principles of cognitive psychology and behavioral patterns to minimize cognitive load, utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to craft seamless user experiences.","zh":"赋予代理创建极简和以人为本的设计系统的能力，利用认知心理学和行为模式的原则来最小化认知负荷，利用 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 来打造无缝的用户体验。","ja":"エージェントが認知心理学と行動パターンの原則を利用して、認知負荷を最小限に抑えた、ミニマルでユーザーセントリックなデザインシステムを作成できるようにします。HTML、CSS、JavaScript を使用して、シームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 인지 심리학 및 행동 패턴의 원리를 활용하여 인지 부하를 최소화한极简 및 사용자 중심의 디자인 시스템을 만들 수 있도록 합니다. HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여无缝な 사용자 경험을 구축합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear sistemas de diseño minimalistas y centrados en el ser humano, aprovechando los principios de psicología cognitiva y patrones de comportamiento para minimizar la carga cognitiva, utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript para crear experiencias de usuario perfectas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des systèmes de conception minimalistes et centrés sur l''humain, en exploitant les principes de psychologie cognitive et les modèles de comportement pour minimiser la charge cognitive, en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour créer des expériences utilisateur parfaites.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, minimalistische und benutzerzentrierte Designs zu erstellen, indem es die Prinzipien der kognitiven Psychologie und Verhaltensmuster nutzt, um die kognitive Belastung zu minimieren, und HTML, CSS und JavaScript verwendet, um nahtlose Benutzererfahrungen zu gestalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem sistemas de design minimalistas e centrados no ser humano, utilizando princípios de psicologia cognitiva e padrões comportamentais para minimizar a carga cognitiva, utilizando HTML, CSS e JavaScript para criar experiências de usuário perfeitas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать минималистичные и человеко-ориентированные системы дизайна, используя принципы когнитивной психологии и поведенческие закономерности для минимизации когнитивной нагрузки, используя HTML, CSS и JavaScript для создания бесшовных пользовательских опытов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء أنظمة التصميم المنهجية والمتوافقة مع الإنسان، مستخدمة مبادئ علم النفس الإدراكي والأنماط السلوكية لتقليل الحمل المعرفي، وتستخدم HTML و CSS و JavaScript لإنشاء تجارب المستخدم المتواصلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing intuitive navigation menus for web applications","Crafting responsive and accessible UI components using CSS Grid and Flexbox","Optimizing user flow and conversion rates through data-driven design decisions"],"zh":["为 Web 应用程序设计直观的导航菜单","使用 CSS Grid 和 Flexbox 制作响应式和无障碍的 UI 组件","通过数据驱动的设计决策来优化用户流程和转化率"],"ja":["Web アプリケーションのための直感的なナビゲーションメニューの設計","CSS Grid と Flexbox を使用したレスポンシブでアクセシブルな UI コンポーネントの作成","データ駆動のデザイン決定を通じてユーザーフローとコンバージョン率の最適化"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 직관적인 내비게이션 메뉴 설계","CSS Grid 및 Flexbox를 사용한 반응형 및 접근 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 제작","데이터 주도 설계 결정 통해 사용자 흐름 및 전환율 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar menús de navegación intuitivos para aplicaciones web","Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario responsivos y accesibles mediante CSS Grid y Flexbox","Optimizar el flujo de usuario y las tasas de conversión a través de decisiones de diseño basadas en datos"],"fr":["Concevoir des menus de navigation intuitifs pour les applications Web","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur responsifs et accessibles à l''aide de CSS Grid et Flexbox","Optimiser le flux utilisateur et les taux de conversion grâce à des décisions de conception basées sur les données"],"de":["Intuitive Navigationsmenüs für Webanwendungen entwerfen","Mit CSS Grid und Flexbox reaktionsfreudige und zugängliche Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten erstellen","Durch datengetriebene Designentscheidungen den Benutzerfluss und die Umwandlungsrate optimieren"],"pt":["Projetar menus de navegação intuitivos para aplicações web","Criar componentes de UI responsivos e acessíveis usando CSS Grid e Flexbox","Otimizar o fluxo de usuário e as taxas de conversão por meio de decisões de design baseadas em dados"],"ru":["Проектировать интуитивно понятные меню навигации для веб-приложений","Создавать отзывчивые и доступные компоненты UI, используя CSS Grid и Flexbox","Оптимизировать поток пользователя и коэффициенты конверсии посредством решений по дизайну, основанных на данных"],"ar":["تصميم قوائم التنقل غير المباشرة لتطبيقات الويب","تصميم مكونات واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية والمتوافقة باستخدام CSS Grid و Flexbox","تحسين تدفق المستخدم ومعدلات التحويل من خلال قرارات التصميم القائمة على البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of human psychology and behavioral patterns","Dependent on design tools like Figma, Sketch, or Adobe XD for implementation"],"zh":["需要了解人类心理学和行为模式","依赖于设计工具如 Figma、Sketch 或 Adobe XD 来实现"],"ja":["人間の心理学と行動パターンの理解が必要","実装には Figma、Sketch、または Adobe XD などのデザインツールに依存する"],"ko":["인간 심리학 및 행동 패턴에 대한 이해가 필요함","구현에는 Figma, Sketch 또는 Adobe XD와 같은 디자인 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión de la psicología humana y los patrones de comportamiento","Depende de herramientas de diseño como Figma, Sketch o Adobe XD para la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la psychologie humaine et des modèles de comportement","Dépend de l''utilisation d''outils de conception tels que Figma, Sketch ou Adobe XD pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verständnis der menschlichen Psychologie und Verhaltensmuster","Ist von Designwerkzeugen wie Figma, Sketch oder Adobe XD für die Implementierung abhängig"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de psicologia humana e padrões comportamentais","Depende de ferramentas de design como Figma, Sketch ou Adobe XD para implementação"],"ru":["Требует понимания человеческой психологии и поведенческих закономерностей","Зависит от инструментов дизайна, таких как Figma, Sketch или Adobe XD, для реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا للنفسية البشرية والأنماط السلوكية","يعتمد على أدوات التصميم مثل Figma و Sketch أو Adobe XD للتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
