Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles con 50+ estilos y 97 paletas de colores","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour applications web et mobiles avec 50+ styles et 97 palettes de couleurs","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassendes Design-Handbuch für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen mit 50+ Stilen und 97 Farbpaletten","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é um guia de design abrangente para aplicações web e móveis, com 50+ estilos e 97 paletas de cores.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это комплексное руководство по дизайну для веб- и мобильных приложений, содержащее 50+ стилей и 97 цветовых палитр.","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هو دليل تصميم شامل للتطبيقات الويب والجوال، يحتوي على 50+ نمطًا و 97 لوحة ألوان","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["50+样式","97色板","57字体组合","99用户体验准则","25种图表类型"],"ja":["50+スタイル","97のカラーパレット","57のフォントペア","99のUXガイドライン","25種類のチャートタイプ"],"ko":["50+ 스타일","97 색상","57 폰트 조합","99 사용자 경험 가이드라인","25 종류의 차트 유형"],"es":["50+ estilos de diseño","97 paletas de colores","57 parejas de fuentes","99 pautas de experiencia de usuario","25 tipos de gráficos"],"fr":["50+ styles de conception","97 palettes de couleurs","57 paires de polices","99 lignes directrices d''expérience utilisateur","25 types de graphiques"],"de":["50+ Design-Stile","97 Farbpaletten","57 Schriftarten","99 Benutzererfahrungsvorgaben","25 Grafiktypen"],"pt":["50+ estilos","97 paletas de cores","57 combinações de fontes","99 diretrizes de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"ru":["50+ стилей","97 цветовых палитр","57 комбинаций шрифтов","99 руководств по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["50+ نمطًا","97 لوحة ألوان","57 زوجًا من الخطوط","99 إرشادًا لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","25 نوعًا من الرسومات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI设计","UX设计","设计智能","网页设计","移动应用设计"],"ja":["UIデザイン","UXデザイン","デザインインテリジェンス","ウェブデザイン","モバイルアプリケーションデザイン"],"ko":["UI 디자인","UX 디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","웹 디자인","모바일 애플리케이션 디자인"],"es":["diseño ui/ux","aplicaciones web","aplicaciones móviles","estilos de diseño","paletas de colores","experiencia de usuario"],"fr":["conception ui/ux","applications web","applications mobiles","styles de conception","palettes de couleurs","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["design ui/ux","web-anwendungen","mobile-anwendungen","design-stile","farbpaletten","benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["design de interface de usuário","ui/ux","desenvolvimento web","aplicações móveis","guias de design","estilos de design"],"ru":["дизайн интерфейса пользователя","ui/ux","веб-разработка","мобильные приложения","руководства по дизайну","стили дизайна"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","ui/ux","تطوير الويب","تطبيقات الجوال","دلائل التصميم","أسلوب التصميم"]}},"owner":"nandiraju","repo":"osakhi-website","repoPath":"nandiraju/osakhi-website","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implem","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\r\n\r\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\r\n\r\n## When to Apply\r\n\r\nReference these guidelines when:\r\n- Designing new UI components or pages\r\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\r\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\r\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\r\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\r\n\r\n## Rule Categories by Priority\r\n\r\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\r\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\r\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\r\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\r\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\r\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\r\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\r\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference\r\n\r\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\r\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\r\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\r\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\r\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\r\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\r\n\r\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\r\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\r\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\r\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\r\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\r\n\r\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\r\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\r\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\r\n\r\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\r\n\r\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\r\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\r\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\r\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\r\n\r\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\r\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\r\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\r\n\r\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\r\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\r\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\r\n\r\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\r\n\r\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\r\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\r\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\r\n\r\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\r\n\r\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\r\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\r\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\r\n\r\n## How to Use\r\n\r\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\nCheck if Python is installed:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 --version || python --version\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\r\n\r\n**macOS:**\r\n```bash\r\nbrew install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\r\n```bash\r\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Windows:**\r\n```powershell\r\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## How to Use This Skill\r\n\r\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\r\n\r\nExtract key information from user request:\r\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\r\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\r\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\r\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis command:\r\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\r\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\r\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\r\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\r\n```\r\n\r\n**When to use detailed searches:**\r\n\r\n| Need | Domain | Example |\r\n|------|--------|---------|\r\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\r\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\r\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\r\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\r\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\r\n\r\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Search Reference\r\n\r\n### Available Domains\r\n\r\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\r\n|--------|---------|------------------|\r\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\r\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\r\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\r\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\r\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\r\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\r\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\r\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\r\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\r\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\r\n\r\n### Available Stacks\r\n\r\n| Stack | Focus |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\r\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\r\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\r\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\r\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\r\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\r\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\r\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\r\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Example Workflow\r\n\r\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\r\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\r\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\r\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\r\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\r\n\r\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Output Formats\r\n\r\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\r\n\r\n# Markdown - best for documentation\r\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tips for Better Results\r\n\r\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\r\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\r\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\r\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\r\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\r\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\r\n\r\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\r\n\r\n### Icons & Visual Elements\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\r\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\r\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\r\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\r\n\r\n### Interaction & Cursor\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\r\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\r\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\r\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\r\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\r\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\r\n\r\n### Layout & Spacing\r\n\r\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\r\n|------|----|----- |\r\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\r\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\r\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\r\n\r\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\r\n\r\n### Visual Quality\r\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\r\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\r\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\r\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\r\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\r\n\r\n### Interaction\r\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\r\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\r\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\r\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\r\n\r\n### Light/Dark Mode\r\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\r\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\r\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\r\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\r\n\r\n### Layout\r\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\r\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\r\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\r\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\r\n\r\n### Accessibility\r\n- [ ] All images have alt text\r\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\r\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\r\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:06:41.761Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-Focused AI Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX guidelines across multiple technology stacks.","zh":"非常适合需要跨多个技术栈的综合UI/UX指南的设计导向AI代理。","ja":"デザイン重視のAIエージェントが複数のテクノロジースタック全体で包括的なUI/UXガイドラインを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"다중 기술 스택 전반에 걸친 포괄적인 UI/UX 가이드라인이 필요한 디자인 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA enfocados en el diseño que necesitan directrices de UI/UX integrales en varios stacks de tecnología.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur la conception nécessitant des lignes directrices UI/UX complètes sur plusieurs piles de technologie.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte KI-Agents, die umfassende UI/UX-Richtlinien über mehrere Technologie-Stacks benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA com foco em design que necessitam de diretrizes abrangentes de UI/UX em várias pilhas de tecnologia.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на дизайн, которым требуются комплексные рекомендации по UI/UX для нескольких технологических стеков.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي ذوي التركيز على التصميم الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات شاملة لاتصال المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم عبر عدة مجموعات تكنولوجية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides immediate access to 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, and 99 UX guidelines with priority-based recommendations for web and mobile applications. Enables rapid design decision-making across 9 technology stacks with searchable database capabilities.","zh":"提供对97个颜色调色板、57个字体配对和99个UX指南的即时访问，包括针对Web和移动应用程序的基于优先级的推荐。启用跨9个技术栈的快速设计决策，并具有可搜索的数据库功能。","ja":"97のカラーパレット、57のフォントペア、99のUXガイドラインへの即時アクセスを提供し、Webおよびモバイルアプリケーション向けの優先度ベースの推奨事項を含む。9つのテクノロジースタック全体での迅速な設計意思決定を可能にし、検索可能なデータベース機能を備えている。","ko":"97개의 색상 팔레트, 57개의 글꼴 조합 및 99개의 UX 가이드ライン에 대한 즉시 액세스를 제공하며 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 우선순위 기반 추천을 포함합니다. 9개의 기술 스택을 아우르는 빠른 디자인 의사 결정을 활성화하며 검색 가능한 데이터베이스 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Ofrece acceso inmediato a 97 paletas de colores, 57 combinaciones de fuentes y 99 directrices de UX con recomendaciones basadas en prioridades para aplicaciones web y móviles. Permite una toma de decisiones de diseño rápida en 9 pilas de tecnología con capacidades de base de datos searchable.","fr":"Fournit un accès immédiat à 97 palettes de couleurs, 57 appariements de polices et 99 lignes directrices UX avec des recommandations basées sur les priorités pour les applications Web et mobiles. Permet une prise de décision de conception rapide sur 9 piles de technologie avec des capacités de base de données recherchables.","de":"Bietet sofortigen Zugriff auf 97 Farbpaletten, 57 Schriftkombinationen und 99 UX-Richtlinien mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen. Ermöglicht schnelle Designentscheidungen über 9 Technologie-Stacks mit durchsuchbaren Datenbankfunktionen.","pt":"Fornece acesso imediato a 97 paletas de cores, 57 combinações de fontes e 99 diretrizes de UX com recomendações baseadas em prioridade para aplicações web e móveis. Permite a tomada de decisões de design rápida em 9 pilhas de tecnologia com capacidades de banco de dados pesquisável.","ru":"Предоставляет мгновенный доступ к 97 цветовым палитрам, 57 парным шрифтам и 99 рекомендациям по UX с рекомендациями, основанными на приоритете, для веб- и мобильных приложений. Позволяет быстро принимать решения по дизайну в 9 технологических стеках с возможностью поиска в базе данных.","ar":"يوفر الوصول الفوري إلى 97 لوحة ألوان، و 57 زوجًا من خطوط الطباعة، و 99 إرشادية لاتصال المستخدم مع توصيات ذات أولوية لقواعد التطبيقات الويب والجوال. يسهل اتخاذ قرارات التصميم بسرعة عبر 9 مجموعات تكنولوجية مع إمكانيات قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating design system components","Selecting optimal color palettes for branding","Implementing UX best practices for dashboards","Choosing typography combinations for landing pages","Validating UI code against accessibility standards"],"zh":["生成设计系统组件","为品牌选择最佳颜色调色板","为仪表板实施UX最佳实践","为着陆页选择字体组合","验证UI代码是否符合无障碍标准"],"ja":["デザインシステムコンポーネントを生成する","ブランドに最適なカラーパレットを選択する","ダッシュボードにUXのベストプラクティスを実装する","ランディングページにフォントの組み合わせを選択する","UIコードをアクセシビリティ標準に従って検証する"],"ko":["디자인 시스템 구성 요소를 생성하는 것","브랜드에 최적의 색상 팔레트를 선택하는 것","대시보드에 UX 최선의 실践을 구현하는 것","랜딩 페이지에 글꼴 조합을 선택하는 것","UI 코드를 접근성 표준에 따라 검증하는 것"],"es":["Generación de componentes de sistema de diseño","Selección de paletas de colores óptimas para la marca","Implementación de las mejores prácticas de UX para paneles","Elección de combinaciones de tipografía para páginas de destino","Validación del código de UI contra los estándares de accesibilidad"],"fr":["Génération de composants de système de conception","Sélection de palettes de couleurs optimales pour la marque","Mise en œuvre des meilleures pratiques UX pour les tableaux de bord","Choix de combinaisons de typographie pour les pages de destination","Validation du code UI contre les normes d''accessibilité"],"de":["Erzeugung von Design-System-Komponenten","Auswahl optimaler Farbpaletten für die Marke","Implementierung von UX-Best-Practices für Dashboards","Wahl von Typografie-Kombinationen für Zielseiten","Validierung von UI-Code gegen Accessibility-Standards"],"pt":["Gerar componentes do sistema de design","Selecionar paletas de cores ótimas para marca","Implementar as melhores práticas de UX para dashboards","Escolher combinações de tipografia para páginas de destino","Validar código de UI contra padrões de acessibilidade"],"ru":["Генерировать компоненты системы дизайна","Выбирать оптимальные цветовые палитры для бренда","Реализовывать лучшие практики UX для панелей управления","Выбирать комбинации шрифтов для посадочных страниц","Проверять код UI на соответствие стандартам доступности"],"ar":["توليد مكونات نظام التصميم","اختيار لوحات الألوان المثلى للعلامة التجارية","تنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لاتصال المستخدم لألواح التحكم","اختيار مجموعات الخطوط للصفحات الهبوطية","التحقق من صحة رمز الواجهة المستخدمة مقابل معايير الوصول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires design context input from agent","Limited to 9 specified technology stacks","Database search functionality dependent on proper query formatting"],"zh":["需要代理输入设计上下文","仅限于9个指定的技术栈","数据库搜索功能依赖于正确的查询格式"],"ja":["エージェントからデザインコンテキストの入力が必要","9つの指定されたテクノロジースタックに限定される","データベースの検索機能は正しいクエリ形式に依存する"],"ko":["에이전트에서 디자인 문脈 입력이 필요함","9개의 지정된 기술 스택으로 제한됨","데이터베이스 검색 기능은 올바른 쿼리 형식에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere entrada de contexto de diseño del agente","Limitado a 9 pilas de tecnología especificadas","La funcionalidad de búsqueda de la base de datos depende de la formato de consulta adecuado"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de contexte de conception de l''agent","Limité à 9 piles de technologie spécifiées","La fonctionnalité de recherche de la base de données dépend de la mise en forme de la requête appropriée"],"de":["Benötigt Design-Kontext-Eingabe vom Agent","Begrenzt auf 9 spezifizierte Technologie-Stacks","Die Datenbank-Suchfunktion hängt von der korrekten Abfrage-Formatierung ab"],"pt":["Requer entrada de contexto de design do agente","Limitado a 9 pilhas de tecnologia especificadas","Funcionalidade de pesquisa de banco de dados dependente de formatação de consulta adequada"],"ru":["Требует ввода контекста дизайна от агента","Ограничен 9 указанными технологическими стеками","Функциональность поиска базы данных зависит от правильного форматирования запроса"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال سياق تصميم من الوكيل","محدود ب 9 مجموعات تكنولوجية محددة","تعتمد وظيفة البحث في قاعدة البيانات على صياغة استعلام مناسبة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
