fr":"shadcn-ui est une collection de composants personnalisables et accessibles pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur dans vos applications","de":"shadcn-ui ist eine Sammlung von anpassbaren und zugänglichen Komponenten, um die Benutzererfahrung in Ihren Anwendungen zu verbessern","pt":"shadcn-ui é uma coleção de componentes UI personalizáveis e acessíveis para construir aplicações web.","ru":"shadcn-ui - это коллекция настраиваемых и доступных компонентов UI для построения веб-приложений.","ar":"شادcn-يوي هي مجموعة من مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل والوصول لإنشاء تطبيقات الويب.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","shadcn/ui","CSS"],"ja":["Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","shadcn/ui","CSS"],"ko":["Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","shadcn/ui","CSS"],"es":["Componentes personalizables","Accesibilidad garantizada","Integración con Radix UI y Base UI","Compatibilidad con Tailwind CSS","Código abierto y reutilizable","Documentación detallada"],"fr":["Composants personnalisables","Accessibilité garantie","Intégration avec Radix UI et Base UI","Compatibilité avec Tailwind CSS","Code ouvert et réutilisable","Documentation détaillée"],"de":["Anpassbare Komponenten","Garantierte Zugänglichkeit","Integration mit Radix UI und Base UI","Kompatibilität mit Tailwind CSS","Offener und wiederverwendbarer Code","Detaillierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Componentes UI personalizáveis","Acessibilidade garantida","Integração fácil","Código reutilizável","Compatibilidade com Radix UI e Base UI"],"ru":["Настраиваемые компоненты UI","Гарантированная доступность","Легкая интеграция","Переиспользуемый код","Совместимость с Radix UI и Base UI"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل","دعم إمكانية الوصول","دمج سهل","код قابل لإعادة الاستخدام","التوافق مع Radix UI و Base UI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","CSS","shadcn/ui","frontend","UI"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","CSS","shadcn/ui","frontend","UI"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","UI","CSS","shadcn/ui","frontend","UI"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes web","accesibilidad","personalización","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","frontend"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants web","accessibilité","personnalisation","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","développement web","frontend"],"de":["shadcn-ui","Webkomponenten","Zugänglichkeit","Anpassung","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","Frontend"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes UI","personalização","acessibilidade","Radix UI","Base UI","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","компоненты UI","настраиваемость","доступность","Radix UI","Base UI","веб-разработка"],"ar":["شادcn-يوي","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","تخصيص","دعم إمكانية الوصول","Radix UI","Base UI","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"lucasromanh","repo":"OdontoSis","repoPath":"lucasromanh/OdontoSis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Expert guidance for integrating and building applications with shadcn/ui components, including component discovery, installation, customization, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full owner","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full ownership**: Components live in your codebase, not node_modules\n- **Complete customization**: Modify styling, behavior, and structure freely, including choosing between Radix UI or Base UI primitives\n- **No version lock-in**: Update components selectively at your own pace\n- **Zero runtime overhead**: No library bundle, just the code you need\n\n## Component Discovery and Installation\n\n### 1. Browse Available Components\n\nUse the shadcn MCP tools to explore the component catalog and Registry Directory:\n- **List all components**: Use `list_components` to see the complete catalog\n- **Get component metadata**: Use `get_component_metadata` to understand props, dependencies, and usage\n- **View component demos**: Use `get_component_demo` to see implementation examples\n\n### 2. Component Installation\n\nThere are two approaches to adding components:\n\n**A. Direct Installation (Recommended)**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add [component-name]\n```\n\nThis command:\n- Downloads the component source code (adapting to your config: Radix vs Base UI)\n- Installs required dependencies\n- Places files in `components/ui/`\n- Updates your `components.json` config\n\n**B. Manual Integration**\n1. Use `get_component` to retrieve the source code\n2. Create the file in `components/ui/[component-name].tsx`\n3. Install peer dependencies manually\n4. Adjust imports if needed\n\n### 3. Registry and Custom Registries\n\nIf working with a custom registry (defined in `components.json`) or exploring the Registry Directory:\n- Use `get_project_registries` to list available registries\n- Use `list_items_in_registries` to see registry-specific components\n- Use `view_items_in_registries` for detailed component information\n- Use `search_items_in_registries` to find specific components\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Initial Configuration\n\nFor **new projects**, use the `create` command to customize everything (style, fonts, component library):\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest create\n```\n\nFor **existing projects**, initialize configuration:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `components.json` with your configuration:\n- **style**: default, new-york (classic) OR choose new visual styles like Vega, Nova, Maia, Lyra, Mira\n- **baseColor**: slate, gray, zinc, neutral, stone\n- **cssVariables**: true/false for CSS variable usage\n- **tailwind config**: paths to Tailwind files\n- **aliases**: import path shortcuts\n- **rsc**: Use React Server Components (yes/no)\n- **rtl**: Enable RTL support (optional)\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\nshadcn/ui components require:\n- **React** (18+)\n- **Tailwind CSS** (3.0+)\n- **Primitives**: Radix UI OR Base UI (depending on your choice)\n- **class-variance-authority** (for variant styling)\n- **clsx** and **tailwind-merge** (for class composition)\n\n## Component Architecture\n\n### File Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/              # shadcn components\n│   │   ├── button.tsx\n│   │   ├── card.tsx\n│   │   └── dialog.tsx\n│   └── [custom]/        # your composed components\n│       └── user-card.tsx\n├── lib/\n│   └── utils.ts         # cn() utility\n└── app/\n    └── page.tsx\n```\n\n### The `cn()` Utility\n\nAll shadcn components use the `cn()` helper for class merging:\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx, type ClassValue } from \"clsx\"\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\"\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs))\n}\n```\n\nThis allows you to:\n- Override default styles without conflicts\n- Conditionally apply classes\n- Merge Tailwind classes intelligently\n\n## Customization Best Practices\n\n### 1. Theme Customization\n\nEdit your Tailwind config and CSS variables in `app/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    /* ... more variables */\n  }\n  \n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode overrides */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Component Variants\n\nUse `class-variance-authority` (cva) for variant logic:\n\n```typescript\nimport { cva } from \"class-variance-authority\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground\",\n        outline: \"border border-input\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Extending Components\n\nCreate wrapper components in `components/` (not `components/ui/`):\n\n```typescript\n// components/custom-button.tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton({ \n  loading, \n  children, \n  ...props \n}: ButtonProps & { loading?: boolean }) {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={loading} {...props}>\n      {loading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {children}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Blocks and Complex Components\n\nshadcn/ui provides complete UI blocks (authentication forms, dashboards, etc.):\n\n1. **List available blocks**: Use `list_blocks` with optional category filter\n2. **Get block source**: Use `get_block` with the block name\n3. **Install blocks**: Many blocks include multiple component files\n\nBlocks are organized by category:\n- **calendar**: Calendar interfaces\n- **dashboard**: Dashboard layouts\n- **login**: Authentication flows\n- **sidebar**: Navigation sidebars\n- **products**: E-commerce components\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll shadcn/ui components are built on Radix UI primitives, ensuring:\n- **Keyboard navigation**: Full keyboard support out of the box\n- **Screen reader support**: Proper ARIA attributes\n- **Focus management**: Logical focus flow\n- **Disabled states**: Proper disabled and aria-disabled handling\n\nWhen customizing, maintain accessibility:\n- Keep ARIA attributes\n- Preserve keyboard handlers\n- Test with screen readers\n- Maintain focus indicators\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Building\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\n// Use with react-hook-form for validation\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\n```\n\n### Dialog/Modal Patterns\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n```\n\n### Data Display\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Import Errors\n- Check `components.json` for correct alias configuration\n- Verify `tsconfig.json` includes the `@` path alias:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"compilerOptions\": {\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### Style Conflicts\n- Ensure Tailwind CSS is properly configured\n- Check that `globals.css` is imported in your root layout\n- Verify CSS variable names match between components and theme\n\n### Missing Dependencies\n- Run component installation via CLI to auto-install deps\n- Manually check `package.json` for required Radix UI packages\n- Use `get_component_metadata` to see dependency lists\n\n### Version Compatibility\n- shadcn/ui v4 requires React 18+ and Next.js 13+ (if using Next.js)\n- Some components require specific Radix UI versions\n- Check documentation for breaking changes between versions\n\n## Validation and Quality\n\nBefore committing components:\n1. **Type check**: Run `tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript\n2. **Lint**: Run your linter to catch style issues\n3. **Test accessibility**: Use tools like axe DevTools\n4. **Visual QA**: Test in light and dark modes\n5. **Responsive check**: Verify behavior at different breakpoints\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to the following resource files for detailed guidance:\n- `resources/setup-guide.md` - Step-by-step project initialization\n- `resources/component-catalog.md` - Complete component reference\n- `resources/customization-guide.md` - Theming and variant patterns\n- `resources/migration-guide.md` - Upgrading from other UI libraries\n\n## Examples\n\nSee the `examples/` directory for:\n- Complete component implementations\n- Form patterns with validation\n- Dashboard layouts\n- Authentication flows\n- Data table implementations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:08:06.411Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in customizable UI component integration with Radix UI, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合专门从事可定制UI组件集成的Radix UI、Base UI和Tailwind CSS的前端代理。","ja":"Radix UI、Base UI、Tailwind CSSのカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントの統合に特化したフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Radix UI, Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS의 사용자 정의 가능한 UI 구성 요소를 통합하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend especializados en la integración de componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizables con Radix UI, Base UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend spécialisés dans l''intégration de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables avec Radix UI, Base UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf die Integration von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Radix UI, Base UI und Tailwind CSS spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend especializados em integração de componentes de interface do usuário personalizáveis com Radix UI, Base UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на интеграции настраиваемых компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с Radix UI, Base UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين ي chuyênون في دمج مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتخصيص مع Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components from shadcn/ui, leveraging full ownership and customization capabilities with Tailwind CSS, while following best practices for component discovery and implementation.","zh":"赋予代理集成美丽设计、可访问和可定制的组件的能力，利用shadcn/ui，充分利用Tailwind CSS的所有权和定制能力，同时遵循组件发现和实施的最佳实践。","ja":"shadcn/uiを利用して、美しく設計されたアクセシブルでカスタマイズ可能なコンポーネントを統合するエージェントの能力を付与し、Tailwind CSSの所有権とカスタマイズ能力を最大限に活用しながら、コンポーネントの発見と実装のベストプラクティスに従う。","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn/ui를 사용하여 아름답게 설계된 접근성 및 사용자 정의 가능한 구성 요소를 통합할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Tailwind CSS의 모든 소유권 및 사용자 정의 기능을 완전히 활용하여 구성 요소 검색 및 구현에 대한 모범 사례를 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar componentes hermosamente diseñados, accesibles y personalizables de shadcn/ui, aprovechando la propiedad y las capacidades de personalización completas con Tailwind CSS, siguiendo las mejores prácticas para el descubrimiento y la implementación de componentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer des composants conçus de manière élégante, accessibles et personnalisables à partir de shadcn/ui, en exploitant pleinement la propriété et les capacités de personnalisation avec Tailwind CSS, tout en suivant les meilleures pratiques pour la découverte et la mise en œuvre de composants.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, schön gestaltete, zugängliche und anpassbare Komponenten von shadcn/ui zu integrieren, die volle Eigentümerschaft und Anpassungsfähigkeiten mit Tailwind CSS nutzen, unter Einhaltung der besten Praktiken für die Komponentenentdeckung und -implementierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar componentes projetados de forma acessível e personalizáveis do shadcn/ui, aproveitando a propriedade e capacidades de personalização completas com Tailwind CSS, seguindo as melhores práticas para descoberta e implementação de componentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать красиво спроектированные, доступные и настраиваемые компоненты из shadcn/ui, используя полную собственность и возможности настройки с Tailwind CSS, следуя лучшим практикам для обнаружения и реализации компонентов.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على دمج مكونات مصممة بطريقة جميلة و قابلة للوصول و قابلة للتخصيص من shadcn/ui، مستفيداً من ملكية كاملة وقدرات تخصيص مع Tailwind CSS، مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات لاكتشاف وتنفيذ المكونات."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating shadcn/ui components into existing frontend projects for enhanced accessibility and customization","Customizing shadcn/ui components with Tailwind CSS for tailored UI designs","Discovering and implementing new components from the shadcn/ui collection to enhance application UI"],"zh":["将shadcn/ui组件集成到现有的前端项目中，以增强可访问性和可定制性","使用Tailwind CSS定制shadcn/ui组件，以实现个性化的UI设计","发现和实现shadcn/ui集合中的新组件，以增强应用程序UI"],"ja":["既存のフロントエンドプロジェクトにshadcn/uiコンポーネントを統合してアクセシビリティとカスタマイズ性を高める","Tailwind CSSを使用してshadcn/uiコンポーネントをカスタマイズし、カスタマイズされたUIデザインを実現する","shadcn/uiコレクションから新しいコンポーネントを発見して実装し、アプリケーションUIを強化する"],"ko":["기존 프론트엔드 프로젝트에 shadcn/ui 구성 요소를 통합하여 접근성 및 사용자 정의 기능을 향상시키는 것","Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 shadcn/ui 구성 요소를 사용자 정의하여 맞춤형 UI 디자인을 구현하는 것","shadcn/ui 컬렉션에서 새로운 구성 요소를 발견하여 구현하고, 애플리케이션 UI를 강화하는 것"],"es":["Integrar componentes de shadcn/ui en proyectos frontend existentes para mejorar la accesibilidad y la personalización","Personalizar componentes de shadcn/ui con Tailwind CSS para diseños de UI personalizados","Descubrir e implementar nuevos componentes de la colección shadcn/ui para mejorar la UI de la aplicación"],"fr":["Intégrer des composants shadcn/ui dans des projets frontend existants pour améliorer l''accessibilité et la personnalisation","Personnaliser des composants shadcn/ui avec Tailwind CSS pour des conceptions d''interface utilisateur sur mesure","Découvrir et mettre en œuvre de nouveaux composants de la collection shadcn/ui pour améliorer l''interface utilisateur de l''application"],"de":["Komponenten von shadcn/ui in bestehende Frontend-Projekte integrieren, um die Zugänglichkeit und Anpassungsfähigkeit zu verbessern","Komponenten von shadcn/ui mit Tailwind CSS anpassen, um maßgeschneiderte Benutzeroberflächendesigns zu erstellen","Neue Komponenten aus der shadcn/ui-Sammlung entdecken und implementieren, um die Benutzeroberfläche der Anwendung zu verbessern"],"pt":["Integrar componentes do shadcn/ui em projetos frontend existentes para melhorar a acessibilidade e personalização","Personalizar componentes do shadcn/ui com Tailwind CSS para projetos de UI personalizados","Descobrir e implementar novos componentes da coleção shadcn/ui para melhorar a UI do aplicativo"],"ru":["Интегрировать компоненты shadcn/ui в существующие проекты frontend для улучшения доступности и настройки","Настроить компоненты shadcn/ui с помощью Tailwind CSS для индивидуального дизайна пользовательского интерфейса","Обнаружить и реализовать новые компоненты из коллекции shadcn/ui для улучшения пользовательского интерфейса приложения"],"ar":["دمج مكونات shadcn/ui في مشاريع واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الحالية لتحسين سهولة الوصول والتخصيص","تخصيص مكونات shadcn/ui باستخدام Tailwind CSS لتصاميم واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","اكتشاف وتنفيذ مكونات جديدة من مجموعة shadcn/ui لتحسين واجهة المستخدم للتطبيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual component copying into the project","Not a traditional component library, but rather a collection of reusable components"],"zh":["需要手动将组件复制到项目中","不是传统的组件库，而是一个可重用的组件集合"],"ja":["コンポーネントをプロジェクトに手動でコピーする必要がある","従来のコンポーネントライブラリではなく、再利用可能なコンポーネントのコレクションである"],"ko":["구성 요소를 프로젝트에 수동으로 복사해야 하는 필요가 있음","전통적인 구성 요소 라이브러리가 아닌 재사용 가능한 구성 요소의 컬렉션"],"es":["Requiere la copia manual de componentes en el proyecto","No es una biblioteca de componentes tradicional, sino más bien una colección de componentes reutilizables"],"fr":["Nécessite la copie manuelle de composants dans le projet","N''est pas une bibliothèque de composants traditionnelle, mais plutôt une collection de composants réutilisables"],"de":["Erfordert das manuelle Kopieren von Komponenten in das Projekt","Ist keine herkömmliche Komponentenbibliothek, sondern eher eine Sammlung von wiederverwendbaren Komponenten"],"pt":["Requer cópia manual de componentes no projeto","Não é uma biblioteca de componentes tradicional, mas sim uma coleção de componentes reutilizáveis"],"ru":["Требует ручной копии компонентов в проект","Не является традиционной библиотекой компонентов, а скорее коллекцией повторно используемых компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب نسخاً يدوية للمكونات في المشروع","ليست مكتبة مكونات تقليدية، بل مجموعة من المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
