adcn-ui是一个可定制的组件集合，帮助开发者构建美观且可访问的应用","ja":"shadcn-uiはカスタマイズ可能なコンポーネントのコレクションで、開発者が美しくアクセス可能なアプリケーションを構築するのに役立ちます","ko":"shadcn-ui는 개발자가 아름답고 접근성이 뛰어난 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 도와주는 사용자 정의 가능한 컴포넌트 컬렉션입니다","es":"shadcn-ui es una colección de componentes personalizables y accesibles para frontend, construidos con Radix UI o Base UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"shadcn-ui est une collection de composants personnalisables et accessibles pour le frontend, construits avec Radix UI ou Base UI et Tailwind CSS","de":"shadcn-ui ist eine Sammlung von anpassbaren und zugänglichen Komponenten für das Frontend, erstellt mit Radix UI oder Base UI und Tailwind CSS","pt":"shadcn-ui é uma coleção de componentes reutilizáveis para frontend, construídos com Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS","ru":"shadcn-ui — это коллекция переиспользуемых компонентов для frontend, построенных с использованием Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS","ar":"شادكن-يو آي هي مجموعة من المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام للواجهة الأمامية، مبنية باستخدام راديكس يو آي أو بيس يو آي وتايلويند سي إس إس","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["可定制的组件","基于Radix UI或Base UI","使用Tailwind CSS","可访问性强","美观设计"],"ja":["カスタマイズ可能なコンポーネント","Radix UIまたはBase UIを基盤とする","Tailwind CSSを使用","アクセス可能","美しいデザイン"],"ko":["사용자 정의 가능한 컴포넌트","Radix UI 또는 Base UI를 기반으로","Tailwind CSS를 사용","접근성이 뛰어난","아름다운 디자인"],"es":["Componentes personalizables y accesibles","Construidos con Radix UI o Base UI y Tailwind CSS","Integración sencilla en proyectos frontend","Mejores prácticas para la integración de componentes","Código de ejemplo para una implementación rápida"],"fr":["Composants personnalisables et accessibles","Construits avec Radix UI ou Base UI et Tailwind CSS","Intégration simple dans les projets frontend","Meilleures pratiques pour l''intégration de composants","Exemple de code pour une mise en œuvre rapide"],"de":["Anpassbare und zugängliche Komponenten","Erstellt mit Radix UI oder Base UI und Tailwind CSS","Einfache Integration in Frontend-Projekte","Beste Praktiken für die Integration von Komponenten","Codebeispiel für eine schnelle Implementierung"],"pt":["Componentes reutilizáveis e personalizáveis","Construídos com Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS","Acessibilidade e usabilidade garantidas","Fácil integração e personalização","Flexibilidade e escalabilidade"],"ru":["Переиспользуемые и настраиваемые компоненты","Построены с использованием Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS","Гарантия доступности и удобства использования","Легкая интеграция и настройка","Гибкость и масштабируемость"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام و تخصيص","مبنية باستخدام راديكس يو آي أو بيس يو آي وتايلويند سي إس إس","ضمان وصولية وسهولة الاستخدام","تكامل و تخصيص سهل","مرونة و قابلة للتوسيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","组件集成","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","可访问性","美观设计"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","コンポーネント統合","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","アクセス可能","美しいデザイン"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","컴포넌트 통합","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","접근성","아름다운 디자인"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes frontend","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","integración de componentes","desarrollo frontend","mejores prácticas"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants frontend","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","intégration de composants","développement frontend","meilleures pratiques"],"de":["shadcn-ui","Frontend-Komponenten","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","Komponenten-Integration","Frontend-Entwicklung","beste Praktiken"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes frontend","reutilizáveis","personalizáveis","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","acessibilidade","usabilidade"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","компоненты frontend","переиспользуемые","настраиваемые","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","доступность","удобство использования"],"ar":["شادكن-يو آي","مكونات الواجهة الأمامية","قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"," قابلة للتخصيص","راديكس يو آي","بيس يو آي","تايلويند سي إس إس","الوصولية","سهولة الاستخدام"]}},"owner":"lucasromanh","repo":"padel-react","repoPath":"lucasromanh/padel-react","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Expert guidance for integrating and building applications with shadcn/ui components, including component discovery, installation, customization, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full owner","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full ownership**: Components live in your codebase, not node_modules\n- **Complete customization**: Modify styling, behavior, and structure freely, including choosing between Radix UI or Base UI primitives\n- **No version lock-in**: Update components selectively at your own pace\n- **Zero runtime overhead**: No library bundle, just the code you need\n\n## Component Discovery and Installation\n\n### 1. Browse Available Components\n\nUse the shadcn MCP tools to explore the component catalog and Registry Directory:\n- **List all components**: Use `list_components` to see the complete catalog\n- **Get component metadata**: Use `get_component_metadata` to understand props, dependencies, and usage\n- **View component demos**: Use `get_component_demo` to see implementation examples\n\n### 2. Component Installation\n\nThere are two approaches to adding components:\n\n**A. Direct Installation (Recommended)**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add [component-name]\n```\n\nThis command:\n- Downloads the component source code (adapting to your config: Radix vs Base UI)\n- Installs required dependencies\n- Places files in `components/ui/`\n- Updates your `components.json` config\n\n**B. Manual Integration**\n1. Use `get_component` to retrieve the source code\n2. Create the file in `components/ui/[component-name].tsx`\n3. Install peer dependencies manually\n4. Adjust imports if needed\n\n### 3. Registry and Custom Registries\n\nIf working with a custom registry (defined in `components.json`) or exploring the Registry Directory:\n- Use `get_project_registries` to list available registries\n- Use `list_items_in_registries` to see registry-specific components\n- Use `view_items_in_registries` for detailed component information\n- Use `search_items_in_registries` to find specific components\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Initial Configuration\n\nFor **new projects**, use the `create` command to customize everything (style, fonts, component library):\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest create\n```\n\nFor **existing projects**, initialize configuration:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `components.json` with your configuration:\n- **style**: default, new-york (classic) OR choose new visual styles like Vega, Nova, Maia, Lyra, Mira\n- **baseColor**: slate, gray, zinc, neutral, stone\n- **cssVariables**: true/false for CSS variable usage\n- **tailwind config**: paths to Tailwind files\n- **aliases**: import path shortcuts\n- **rsc**: Use React Server Components (yes/no)\n- **rtl**: Enable RTL support (optional)\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\nshadcn/ui components require:\n- **React** (18+)\n- **Tailwind CSS** (3.0+)\n- **Primitives**: Radix UI OR Base UI (depending on your choice)\n- **class-variance-authority** (for variant styling)\n- **clsx** and **tailwind-merge** (for class composition)\n\n## Component Architecture\n\n### File Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/              # shadcn components\n│   │   ├── button.tsx\n│   │   ├── card.tsx\n│   │   └── dialog.tsx\n│   └── [custom]/        # your composed components\n│       └── user-card.tsx\n├── lib/\n│   └── utils.ts         # cn() utility\n└── app/\n    └── page.tsx\n```\n\n### The `cn()` Utility\n\nAll shadcn components use the `cn()` helper for class merging:\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx, type ClassValue } from \"clsx\"\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\"\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs))\n}\n```\n\nThis allows you to:\n- Override default styles without conflicts\n- Conditionally apply classes\n- Merge Tailwind classes intelligently\n\n## Customization Best Practices\n\n### 1. Theme Customization\n\nEdit your Tailwind config and CSS variables in `app/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    /* ... more variables */\n  }\n  \n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode overrides */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Component Variants\n\nUse `class-variance-authority` (cva) for variant logic:\n\n```typescript\nimport { cva } from \"class-variance-authority\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground\",\n        outline: \"border border-input\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Extending Components\n\nCreate wrapper components in `components/` (not `components/ui/`):\n\n```typescript\n// components/custom-button.tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton({ \n  loading, \n  children, \n  ...props \n}: ButtonProps & { loading?: boolean }) {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={loading} {...props}>\n      {loading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {children}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Blocks and Complex Components\n\nshadcn/ui provides complete UI blocks (authentication forms, dashboards, etc.):\n\n1. **List available blocks**: Use `list_blocks` with optional category filter\n2. **Get block source**: Use `get_block` with the block name\n3. **Install blocks**: Many blocks include multiple component files\n\nBlocks are organized by category:\n- **calendar**: Calendar interfaces\n- **dashboard**: Dashboard layouts\n- **login**: Authentication flows\n- **sidebar**: Navigation sidebars\n- **products**: E-commerce components\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll shadcn/ui components are built on Radix UI primitives, ensuring:\n- **Keyboard navigation**: Full keyboard support out of the box\n- **Screen reader support**: Proper ARIA attributes\n- **Focus management**: Logical focus flow\n- **Disabled states**: Proper disabled and aria-disabled handling\n\nWhen customizing, maintain accessibility:\n- Keep ARIA attributes\n- Preserve keyboard handlers\n- Test with screen readers\n- Maintain focus indicators\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Building\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\n// Use with react-hook-form for validation\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\n```\n\n### Dialog/Modal Patterns\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n```\n\n### Data Display\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Import Errors\n- Check `components.json` for correct alias configuration\n- Verify `tsconfig.json` includes the `@` path alias:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"compilerOptions\": {\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### Style Conflicts\n- Ensure Tailwind CSS is properly configured\n- Check that `globals.css` is imported in your root layout\n- Verify CSS variable names match between components and theme\n\n### Missing Dependencies\n- Run component installation via CLI to auto-install deps\n- Manually check `package.json` for required Radix UI packages\n- Use `get_component_metadata` to see dependency lists\n\n### Version Compatibility\n- shadcn/ui v4 requires React 18+ and Next.js 13+ (if using Next.js)\n- Some components require specific Radix UI versions\n- Check documentation for breaking changes between versions\n\n## Validation and Quality\n\nBefore committing components:\n1. **Type check**: Run `tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript\n2. **Lint**: Run your linter to catch style issues\n3. **Test accessibility**: Use tools like axe DevTools\n4. **Visual QA**: Test in light and dark modes\n5. **Responsive check**: Verify behavior at different breakpoints\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to the following resource files for detailed guidance:\n- `resources/setup-guide.md` - Step-by-step project initialization\n- `resources/component-catalog.md` - Complete component reference\n- `resources/customization-guide.md` - Theming and variant patterns\n- `resources/migration-guide.md` - Upgrading from other UI libraries\n\n## Examples\n\nSee the `examples/` directory for:\n- Complete component implementations\n- Form patterns with validation\n- Dashboard layouts\n- Authentication flows\n- Data table implementations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:07:45.882Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in accessible and customizable UI component integration with Radix UI, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"适用于专门从事无障碍和可定制UI组件集成的前端代理，特别是与Radix UI、Base UI和Tailwind CSS集成。","ja":"Radix UI、Base UI、Tailwind CSSとのUIコンポーネントの統合に特化したフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Radix UI, Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS와의 UI 컴포넌트 통합에 전문적인 프런트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que se especializan en la integración de componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables con Radix UI, Base UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend spécialisés dans l''intégration de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables avec Radix UI, Base UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf die Integration von zugänglichen und anpassbaren Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Radix UI, Base UI und Tailwind CSS spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend especializados em integração de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis com Radix UI, Base UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на интеграции доступных и настраиваемых компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с Radix UI, Base UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين ي专نون في دمج مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والقابلة للتخصيص مع Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate and customize beautifully designed components following best practices, leveraging full ownership of the UI components and utilizing Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理集成和自定义美丽设计的组件的能力，遵循最佳实践，利用UI组件的完全所有权，并利用Radix UI或Base UI和Tailwind CSS进行无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが、ベストプラクティスに従って美しく設計されたコンポーネントを統合およびカスタマイズできるようにし、UIコンポーネントの完全な所有権を利用し、Radix UIまたはBase UIとTailwind CSSを使用してシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 최고의 실践을 따라 아름답게 설계된 컴포넌트를 통합 및 사용자 정의할 수 있도록 하며, UI 컴포넌트에 대한 완전한 소유권을 활용하며, Radix UI 또는 Base UI와 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여无缝 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar y personalizar componentes diseñados de manera hermosa siguiendo las mejores prácticas, aprovechando la propiedad total de los componentes de la interfaz de usuario y utilizando Radix UI o Base UI y Tailwind CSS para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer et de personnaliser des composants conçus de manière élégante en suivant les meilleures pratiques, en exploitant la pleine propriété des composants de l''interface utilisateur et en utilisant Radix UI ou Base UI et Tailwind CSS pour une intégration sans accroc.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, schöner gestaltete Komponenten zu integrieren und anzupassen, indem sie die besten Praktiken befolgen, die volle Eigentümerschaft der Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten nutzen und Radix UI oder Base UI und Tailwind CSS für eine nahtlose Integration verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar e personalizar componentes projetados de forma elegante, seguindo as melhores práticas, aproveitando ao máximo a propriedade dos componentes de UI e utilizando Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS para integração perfeita.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать и настраивать красиво спроектированные компоненты, следуя лучшим практикам, используя полный контроль над компонентами пользовательского интерфейса и используя Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على دمج مكونات مصممة بطريقة جميلة وتخصيصها اتباعًا لأفضل الممارسات، والاستفادة الكاملة من ملكية مكونات واجهة المستخدم واستخدام Radix UI أو Base UI و Tailwind CSS من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating shadcn/ui components into existing projects for enhanced accessibility","Customizing UI components with Tailwind CSS for personalized branding","Discovering and implementing reusable components for efficient frontend development"],"zh":["将shadcn/ui组件集成到现有项目中以提高无障碍性","使用Tailwind CSS对UI组件进行自定义以实现个性化品牌","发现和实现可重用的组件以实现高效的前端开发"],"ja":["既存のプロジェクトにshadcn/uiコンポーネントを統合してアクセシビリティを高める","Tailwind CSSを使用してUIコンポーネントをカスタマイズして個別のブランディングを行う","再利用可能なコンポーネントを発見して実装して、効率的なフロントエンド開発を行う"],"ko":["기존 프로젝트에 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트를 통합하여 접근성을 향상시킵니다","Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트를 사용자 정의하여 개인화된 브랜딩을 구현합니다","재사용 가능한 컴포넌트를 발견하고 구현하여 효율적인 프런트엔드 개발을 구현합니다"],"es":["Integrar componentes de shadcn/ui en proyectos existentes para mejorar la accesibilidad","Personalizar componentes de la interfaz de usuario con Tailwind CSS para una marca personalizada","Descubrir e implementar componentes reutilizables para un desarrollo de frontend eficiente"],"fr":["Intégrer des composants shadcn/ui dans des projets existants pour améliorer l''accessibilité","Personnaliser des composants d''interface utilisateur avec Tailwind CSS pour une marque personnalisée","Découvrir et mettre en œuvre des composants réutilisables pour un développement de frontend efficace"],"de":["shadcn/ui-Komponenten in bestehende Projekte integrieren, um die Zugänglichkeit zu verbessern","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Tailwind CSS personalisieren, um eine personalisierte Marke zu erstellen","Wiederverwendbare Komponenten entdecken und implementieren, um eine effiziente Frontend-Entwicklung zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Integrar componentes shadcn/ui em projetos existentes para acessibilidade aprimorada","Personalizar componentes de UI com Tailwind CSS para marca personalizada","Descobrir e implementar componentes reutilizáveis para desenvolvimento de frontend eficiente"],"ru":["Интегрировать компоненты shadcn/ui в существующие проекты для улучшения доступности","Настроить компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с помощью Tailwind CSS для персонализированной марки","Обнаружить и реализовать многократно используемые компоненты для эффективного разработки frontend"],"ar":["دمج مكونات shadcn/ui في المشاريع الحالية لتحسين سهولة الوصول","تخصيص مكونات واجهة المستخدم باستخدام Tailwind CSS للعلامة التجارية الشخصية","اكتشاف وتطبيق مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام من أجل تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية بكفاءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual component copying into the project","Not a traditional component library"],"zh":["需要手动将组件复制到项目中","不是传统的组件库"],"ja":["コンポーネントをプロジェクトに手動でコピーする必要がある","従来のコンポーネントライブラリではない"],"ko":["컴포넌트를 프로젝트에 수동으로 복사해야 합니다","전통적인 컴포넌트 라이브러리가 아님"],"es":["Requiere la copia manual de componentes en el proyecto","No es una biblioteca de componentes tradicional"],"fr":["Nécessite une copie manuelle de composants dans le projet","N''est pas une bibliothèque de composants traditionnelle"],"de":["Benötigt manuelles Kopieren von Komponenten in das Projekt","Ist keine traditionelle Komponentenbibliothek"],"pt":["Exige cópia manual de componentes para o projeto","Não é uma biblioteca de componentes tradicional"],"ru":["Требует ручной копии компонентов в проект","Не является традиционной библиотекой компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب نسخة يدوية من المكونات إلى المشروع","ليست مكتبة مكونات تقليدية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
