 Radix UI e Base UI","Compatibilidade com Tailwind CSS","Código de alta qualidade e legível"],"ru":["Настройка компонентов","Доступность во всех компонентах","Интеграция с Radix UI и Base UI","Совместимость с Tailwind CSS","Высококачественный и читаемый код"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة للتخصيص","سهولة الوصول إلى جميع المكونات","التكامل مع Radix UI و Base UI","التوافق مع Tailwind CSS","كود عالي الجودة وقابل للقراءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","组件集成","可定制","前端开发","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","コンポーネント統合","カスタマイズ可能","フロントエンド開発","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","컴포넌트 통합","사용자 정의","프론트엔드 개발","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes frontend","desarrollo de aplicaciones","personalización de componentes","accesibilidad en aplicaciones","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants frontend","développement d''applications","personnalisation de composants","accessibilité dans les applications","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"de":["shadcn-ui","Frontend-Komponenten","Anwendungsentwicklung","Anpassung von Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit in Anwendungen","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes personalizáveis","acessibilidade","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento frontend","interface de usuário"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","настраиваемые компоненты","доступность","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","фронтенд-разработка","интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["shadcn-ui","مكونات قابلة للتخصيص","سهولة الوصول","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"Ashisharjun12","repo":"rabf-frontend","repoPath":"Ashisharjun12/rabf-frontend","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Expert guidance for integrating and building applications with shadcn/ui components, including component discovery, installation, customization, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full owner","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full ownership**: Components live in your codebase, not node_modules\n- **Complete customization**: Modify styling, behavior, and structure freely, including choosing between Radix UI or Base UI primitives\n- **No version lock-in**: Update components selectively at your own pace\n- **Zero runtime overhead**: No library bundle, just the code you need\n\n## Component Discovery and Installation\n\n### 1. Browse Available Components\n\nUse the shadcn MCP tools to explore the component catalog and Registry Directory:\n- **List all components**: Use `list_components` to see the complete catalog\n- **Get component metadata**: Use `get_component_metadata` to understand props, dependencies, and usage\n- **View component demos**: Use `get_component_demo` to see implementation examples\n\n### 2. Component Installation\n\nThere are two approaches to adding components:\n\n**A. Direct Installation (Recommended)**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add [component-name]\n```\n\nThis command:\n- Downloads the component source code (adapting to your config: Radix vs Base UI)\n- Installs required dependencies\n- Places files in `components/ui/`\n- Updates your `components.json` config\n\n**B. Manual Integration**\n1. Use `get_component` to retrieve the source code\n2. Create the file in `components/ui/[component-name].tsx`\n3. Install peer dependencies manually\n4. Adjust imports if needed\n\n### 3. Registry and Custom Registries\n\nIf working with a custom registry (defined in `components.json`) or exploring the Registry Directory:\n- Use `get_project_registries` to list available registries\n- Use `list_items_in_registries` to see registry-specific components\n- Use `view_items_in_registries` for detailed component information\n- Use `search_items_in_registries` to find specific components\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Initial Configuration\n\nFor **new projects**, use the `create` command to customize everything (style, fonts, component library):\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest create\n```\n\nFor **existing projects**, initialize configuration:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `components.json` with your configuration:\n- **style**: default, new-york (classic) OR choose new visual styles like Vega, Nova, Maia, Lyra, Mira\n- **baseColor**: slate, gray, zinc, neutral, stone\n- **cssVariables**: true/false for CSS variable usage\n- **tailwind config**: paths to Tailwind files\n- **aliases**: import path shortcuts\n- **rsc**: Use React Server Components (yes/no)\n- **rtl**: Enable RTL support (optional)\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\nshadcn/ui components require:\n- **React** (18+)\n- **Tailwind CSS** (3.0+)\n- **Primitives**: Radix UI OR Base UI (depending on your choice)\n- **class-variance-authority** (for variant styling)\n- **clsx** and **tailwind-merge** (for class composition)\n\n## Component Architecture\n\n### File Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/              # shadcn components\n│   │   ├── button.tsx\n│   │   ├── card.tsx\n│   │   └── dialog.tsx\n│   └── [custom]/        # your composed components\n│       └── user-card.tsx\n├── lib/\n│   └── utils.ts         # cn() utility\n└── app/\n    └── page.tsx\n```\n\n### The `cn()` Utility\n\nAll shadcn components use the `cn()` helper for class merging:\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx, type ClassValue } from \"clsx\"\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\"\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs))\n}\n```\n\nThis allows you to:\n- Override default styles without conflicts\n- Conditionally apply classes\n- Merge Tailwind classes intelligently\n\n## Customization Best Practices\n\n### 1. Theme Customization\n\nEdit your Tailwind config and CSS variables in `app/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    /* ... more variables */\n  }\n  \n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode overrides */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Component Variants\n\nUse `class-variance-authority` (cva) for variant logic:\n\n```typescript\nimport { cva } from \"class-variance-authority\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground\",\n        outline: \"border border-input\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Extending Components\n\nCreate wrapper components in `components/` (not `components/ui/`):\n\n```typescript\n// components/custom-button.tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton({ \n  loading, \n  children, \n  ...props \n}: ButtonProps & { loading?: boolean }) {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={loading} {...props}>\n      {loading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {children}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Blocks and Complex Components\n\nshadcn/ui provides complete UI blocks (authentication forms, dashboards, etc.):\n\n1. **List available blocks**: Use `list_blocks` with optional category filter\n2. **Get block source**: Use `get_block` with the block name\n3. **Install blocks**: Many blocks include multiple component files\n\nBlocks are organized by category:\n- **calendar**: Calendar interfaces\n- **dashboard**: Dashboard layouts\n- **login**: Authentication flows\n- **sidebar**: Navigation sidebars\n- **products**: E-commerce components\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll shadcn/ui components are built on Radix UI primitives, ensuring:\n- **Keyboard navigation**: Full keyboard support out of the box\n- **Screen reader support**: Proper ARIA attributes\n- **Focus management**: Logical focus flow\n- **Disabled states**: Proper disabled and aria-disabled handling\n\nWhen customizing, maintain accessibility:\n- Keep ARIA attributes\n- Preserve keyboard handlers\n- Test with screen readers\n- Maintain focus indicators\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Building\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\n// Use with react-hook-form for validation\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\n```\n\n### Dialog/Modal Patterns\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n```\n\n### Data Display\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Import Errors\n- Check `components.json` for correct alias configuration\n- Verify `tsconfig.json` includes the `@` path alias:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"compilerOptions\": {\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### Style Conflicts\n- Ensure Tailwind CSS is properly configured\n- Check that `globals.css` is imported in your root layout\n- Verify CSS variable names match between components and theme\n\n### Missing Dependencies\n- Run component installation via CLI to auto-install deps\n- Manually check `package.json` for required Radix UI packages\n- Use `get_component_metadata` to see dependency lists\n\n### Version Compatibility\n- shadcn/ui v4 requires React 18+ and Next.js 13+ (if using Next.js)\n- Some components require specific Radix UI versions\n- Check documentation for breaking changes between versions\n\n## Validation and Quality\n\nBefore committing components:\n1. **Type check**: Run `tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript\n2. **Lint**: Run your linter to catch style issues\n3. **Test accessibility**: Use tools like axe DevTools\n4. **Visual QA**: Test in light and dark modes\n5. **Responsive check**: Verify behavior at different breakpoints\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to the following resource files for detailed guidance:\n- `resources/setup-guide.md` - Step-by-step project initialization\n- `resources/component-catalog.md` - Complete component reference\n- `resources/customization-guide.md` - Theming and variant patterns\n- `resources/migration-guide.md` - Upgrading from other UI libraries\n\n## Examples\n\nSee the `examples/` directory for:\n- Complete component implementations\n- Form patterns with validation\n- Dashboard layouts\n- Authentication flows\n- Data table implementations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:07:38.665Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Development Agents specializing in React-based UI implementation with accessibility and customization.","zh":"适合专注于基于React的UI实现、可访问性和自定义的前端开发代理。","ja":"ReactベースのUI実装、可達性、カスタマイズに特化したフロントエンド開発エージェントに最適。","ko":"리액트 기반 UI 구현, 접근성 및 사용자 지정에 전문적인 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de frontend que se especializan en la implementación de interfaz de usuario basada en React con accesibilidad y personalización.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement frontend spécialisés dans la mise en œuvre d''interfaces utilisateur basées sur React avec accessibilité et personnalisation.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die sich auf die Implementierung von React-basierten Benutzeroberflächen mit Barrierefreiheit und Anpassung spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend especializados em implementação de UI baseada em React com acessibilidade e personalização.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки фронтенда, специализирующихся на реализации интерфейса пользователя на основе React с доступностью и настройкой.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يطورون واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المتخصصة في تنفيذ واجهة المستخدم القائمة على React مع إمكانية الوصول والتخصيص."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct integration of production-ready UI components by copying customizable code into projects, leveraging Radix UI primitives and Tailwind CSS for full design system control without external dependencies.","zh":"通过将可定制的代码复制到项目中，利用Radix UI原语和Tailwind CSS实现生产就绪的UI组件的直接集成，实现对设计系统的完全控制，而无需外部依赖。","ja":"Radix UIのプリミティブとTailwind CSSを利用して、カスタマイズ可能なコードをプロジェクトにコピーすることで、外部依存関係なくデザインシステムを完全に制御できる、プロダクションレディのUIコンポーネントの直接統合を可能にします。","ko":"Radix UI 기본 요소와 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 프로젝트에 사용자 정의 가능한 코드를 복사함으로써 외부 종속성 없이 디자인 시스템을 완전히 제어할 수 있는 생산 준비가 완료된 UI 구성 요소의 직접 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite la integración directa de componentes de interfaz de usuario listos para la producción copiando código personalizable en proyectos, aprovechando los primitivos de Radix UI y Tailwind CSS para un control total del sistema de diseño sin dependencias externas.","fr":"Permet l''intégration directe de composants d''interface utilisateur prêts pour la production en copiant du code personnalisable dans les projets, en exploitant les primitives Radix UI et Tailwind CSS pour un contrôle total du système de conception sans dépendances externes.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Integration von produktionsreifen Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten durch das Kopieren von anpassbarem Code in Projekte, indem die Radix-UI-Primitiven und Tailwind-CSS für eine vollständige Kontrolle des Designs ohne externe Abhängigkeiten genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite a integração direta de componentes de UI prontos para produção, copiando código personalizável para projetos, aproveitando primitivos da Radix UI e Tailwind CSS para controle total do sistema de design sem dependências externas.","ru":"Позволяет осуществлять прямую интеграцию компонентов интерфейса пользователя, готовых к производству, путем копирования настраиваемого кода в проекты, используя примитивы Radix UI и Tailwind CSS для полного контроля над системой дизайна без внешних зависимостей.","ar":"يسمح بالتكامل المباشر لمكونات واجهة المستخدم الجاهزة للانتاج عن طريق نسخ رمز قابل للتعديل في المشاريع، واستخدام بدائيات Radix UI و Tailwind CSS للتحكم الكامل في نظام التصميم بدون أي اعتمادية خارجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing accessible form components","Customizing design system tokens","Generating responsive layout templates","Building compliant admin interfaces"],"zh":["实现可访问的表单组件","自定义设计系统令牌","生成响应式布局模板","构建兼容的管理界面"],"ja":["アクセシブルなフォームコンポーネントの実装","デザインシステムトークンのカスタマイズ","レスポンシブレイアウトテンプレートの生成","互換性のある管理インターフェースの構築"],"ko":["접근 가능한 폼 구성 요소 구현","디자인 시스템 토큰 사용자 지정","응답형 레이아웃 템플릿 생성","호환 가능한 관리 인터페이스 구축"],"es":["Implementar componentes de formulario accesibles","Personalizar tokens del sistema de diseño","Generar plantillas de diseño responsivas","Crear interfaces de administración compatibles"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des composants de formulaire accessibles","Personnaliser les jetons du système de conception","Générer des modèles de disposition responsifs","Construire des interfaces d''administration conformes"],"de":["Zugängliche Formularkomponenten implementieren","Designsystem-Tokens anpassen","Responsive Layout-Vorlagen generieren","Konforme Admin-Oberflächen erstellen"],"pt":["Implementação de componentes de formulário acessíveis","Personalização de tokens do sistema de design","Geração de modelos de layout responsivos","Construção de interfaces de administração conformes"],"ru":["Реализация доступных компонентов форм","Настройка токенов системы дизайна","Генерация адаптивных шаблонов макета","Создание интерфейсов администрирования в соответствии с требованиями"],"ar":["تنفيذ مكونات النماذج القابلة للوصول","تخصيص رموز نظام التصميم","توليد قوالب تخطيط مستجيبة","بناء واجهات إدارة متوافقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React project environment","Needs Tailwind CSS configuration","Components must be manually copied into codebase"],"zh":["需要React项目环境","需要Tailwind CSS配置","组件必须手动复制到代码库中"],"ja":["Reactプロジェクト環境が必要","Tailwind CSSの設定が必要","コンポーネントをコードベースに手動でコピーする必要がある"],"ko":["리액트 프로젝트 환경이 필요합니다.","테일윈드 CSS 구성이 필요합니다.","구성 요소를 코드베이스에 수동으로 복사해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno de proyecto React","Necesita configuración de Tailwind CSS","Los componentes deben copiarse manualmente en la base de código"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de projet React","Nécessite une configuration Tailwind CSS","Les composants doivent être copiés manuellement dans la base de code"],"de":["Benötigt eine React-Projektumgebung","Benötigt Tailwind-CSS-Konfiguration","Komponenten müssen manuell in den Codebase kopiert werden"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de projeto React","Necessita de configuração do Tailwind CSS","Os componentes devem ser copiados manualmente para a base de código"],"ru":["Требует среды проекта React","Требует настройки Tailwind CSS","Компоненты должны быть вручную скопированы в кодовую базу"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة مشروع React","يحتاج إلى تكوين Tailwind CSS","يجب نسخ المكونات يدويا إلى قاعدة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('paumrch/cuatro/core-web-vitals', 'community', 'paumrch', 'cuatro', 'paumrch/cuatro', 'core-web-vitals', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z', '2026-02-18T09:08:01.552Z', NULL, '{"id":"paumrch/cuatro/core-web-vitals","name":"core-web-vitals","description":{"zh":"核心网页生命指标优化是为了提高网页的加载速度、交互性和视觉稳定性","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化は、ウェブページのロード速度、インタラクティブ性、視覚的安定性を向上させるために行われます","ko":"코어 웹 바이탈 최적화는 웹 페이지의 로딩 속도, 상호 작용성 및 시각적 안정성을 향상시키는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"Optimice sus métricas de Core Web Vitals para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y la clasificación en Google. Aprenda sobre LCP, INP y CLS.","fr":"Optimisez vos métriques de Core Web Vitals pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et le référencement Google. Découvrez le LCP, l''INP et le CLS.","de":"Optimieren Sie Ihre Core-Web-Vitals-Metriken, um die Benutzererfahrung und die Google-Bewertung zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie mehr über LCP, INP und CLS.","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals para melhorar o desempenho e a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals для улучшения производительности и пользовательского опыта.","ar":"تحسين معايير الويب الأساسية لتحسين الأداء وتجربة المستخدم","en":"4 de Junio''s Site built with Next JS and Headless Wordpress."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"核心网页生命指标优化","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化","ko":"코어 웹 바이탈 최적화","es":"Optimización de Core Web Vitals para desarrolladores","fr":"Optimisation des Core Web Vitals pour les développeurs","de":"Core Web Vitals-Optimierung für Entwickler","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals","ar":"تحسين معايير الويب الأساسية","en":"core-web-vitals"},"description":{"zh":"核心网页生命指标优化是为了提高网页的加载速度、交互性和视觉稳定性","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化は、ウェブページのロード速度、インタラクティブ性、視覚的安定性を向上させるために行われます","ko":"코어 웹 바이탈 최적화는 웹 페이지의 로딩 속도, 상호 작용성 및 시각적 안정성을 향상시키는 것을 목표로 합니다","es":"Optimice sus métricas de Core Web Vitals para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y la clasificación en Google. Aprenda sobre LCP, INP y CLS.","fr":"Optimisez vos métriques de Core Web Vitals pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et le référencement Google. Découvrez le LCP, l''INP et le CLS.","de":"Optimieren Sie Ihre Core-Web-Vitals-Metriken, um die Benutzererfahrung und die Google-Bewertung zu verbessern. Erfahren Sie mehr über LCP, INP und CLS.","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals para melhorar o desempenho e a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals для улучшения производительности и пользовательского опыта.","ar":"تحسين معايير الويب الأساسية لتحسين الأداء وتجربة المستخدم","en":"4 de Junio''s Site built with Next JS and Headless Wordpress."},"definition":{"en":"4 de Junio''s Site built with Next JS and Headless Wordpress."},"features":{"zh":["优化加载速度（LCP）","提高交互性（INP）","改善视觉稳定性（CLS）","提高 Google 搜索排名","增强用户体验","提高网站转化率"],"ja":["ロード速度（LCP）を最適化","インタラクティブ性（INP）を向上させる","視覚的安定性（CLS）を改善","Google 検索ランキングを向上させる","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","ウェブサイトの転換率を向上させる"],"ko":["로딩 속도(LCP) 최적화","상호 작용성(INP) 향상","시각적 안정성(CLS) 개선","구글 검색 순위 향상","사용자 경험 향상","웹 사이트 전환률 향상"],"es":["Optimización de LCP (Loading Performance)","Mejora de la interactividad con INP (Interactivity Performance)","Optimización de CLS (Visual Stability)","Análisis de las métricas al 75 percentil","Mejora de la clasificación en Google","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Optimisation du LCP (Performances de chargement)","Amélioration de l''interactivité avec l''INP (Performances d''interactivité)","Optimisation du CLS (Stabilité visuelle)","Analyse des métriques au 75e percentile","Amélioration du référencement Google","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Optimierung von LCP (Ladeleistung)","Verbesserung der Interaktivität mit INP (Interaktivitätsleistung)","Optimierung von CLS (Visuelle Stabilität)","Analyse der Metriken im 75. Perzentil","Verbesserung der Google-Bewertung","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Otimização de LCP (Loading)","Otimização de INP (Interativity)","Otimização de CLS (Visual Stability)","Melhoria do ranqueamento no Google","Melhoria da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Оптимизация LCP (Загрузка)","Оптимизация INP (Интерактивность)","Оптимизация CLS (Визуальная стабильность)","Улучшение рейтинга в Google","Улучшение пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تحسين LCP (تحميل)","تحسين INP (التفاعل)","تحسين CLS (استقرار بصرية)","تحسين التصنيف في جوجل","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["核心网页生命指标","网页性能优化","Google 搜索排名","用户体验","加载速度","交互性","视觉稳定性","LCP","INP","CLS"],"ja":["Core Web Vitals","ウェブページのパフォーマンス最適化","Google 検索ランキング","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","ロード速度","インタラクティブ性","視覚的安定性","LCP","INP","CLS"],"ko":["코어 웹 바이탈","웹 페이지 성능 최적화","구글 검색 순위","사용자 경험","로딩 속도","상호 작용성","시각적 안정성","LCP","INP","CLS"],"es":["Core Web Vitals","Optimización de sitios web","Experiencia del usuario","Clasificación en Google","LCP","INP","CLS","Desarrollo web","SEO"],"fr":["Core Web Vitals","Optimisation de sites web","Expérience utilisateur","Référencement Google","LCP","INP","CLS","Développement web","SEO"],"de":["Core Web Vitals","Optimierung von Websites","Benutzererfahrung","Google-Bewertung","LCP","INP","CLS","Webentwicklung","SEO"],"pt":["Core Web Vitals","Otimização de desempenho","Experiência do usuário","Ranqueamento no Google","Velocidade de carregamento","Interatividade","Estabilidade visual"],"ru":["Core Web Vitals","Оптимизация производительности","Пользовательский опыт","Рейтинг в Google","Скорость загрузки","Интерактивность","Визуальная стабильность"],"ar":["معايير الويب الأساسية","تحسين الأداء","تجربة المستخدم","التصنيف في جوجل","سرعة التحميل","التفاعل","استقرار بصرية"]}},"owner":"paumrch","repo":"cuatro","repoPath":"paumrch/cuatro","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"core-web-vitals","description":"Optimize Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) for better page experience and search ranking. Use when asked to improve Core Web Vitals, fix LCP, reduce CLS, optimize INP, page experience optimization, or fix layout shifts.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page","body":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page visits must meet \"Good\" thresholds.\n\n---\n\n## LCP: Largest Contentful Paint\n\nLCP measures when the largest visible content element renders. Usually this is:\n- Hero image or video\n- Large text block\n- Background image\n- `<svg>` element\n\n### Common LCP issues\n\n**1. Slow server response (TTFB > 800ms)**\n```\nFix: CDN, caching, optimized backend, edge rendering\n```\n\n**2. Render-blocking resources**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Blocks rendering -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/all-styles.css\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Critical CSS inlined, rest deferred -->\n<style>/* Critical above-fold CSS */</style>\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/styles.css\" as=\"style\" \n      onload=\"this.onload=null;this.rel=''stylesheet''\">\n```\n\n**3. Slow resource load times**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ No hints, discovered late -->\n<img src=\"/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Hero\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Preloaded with high priority -->\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.webp\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n<img src=\"/hero.webp\" alt=\"Hero\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n```\n\n**4. Client-side rendering delays**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Content loads after JavaScript\nuseEffect(() => {\n  fetch(''/api/hero-text'').then(r => r.json()).then(setHeroText);\n}, []);\n\n// ✅ Server-side or static rendering\n// Use SSR, SSG, or streaming to send HTML with content\nexport async function getServerSideProps() {\n  const heroText = await fetchHeroText();\n  return { props: { heroText } };\n}\n```\n\n### LCP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] TTFB < 800ms (use CDN, edge caching)\n- [ ] LCP image preloaded with fetchpriority=\"high\"\n- [ ] LCP image optimized (WebP/AVIF, correct size)\n- [ ] Critical CSS inlined (< 14KB)\n- [ ] No render-blocking JavaScript in <head>\n- [ ] Fonts don''t block text rendering (font-display: swap)\n- [ ] LCP element in initial HTML (not JS-rendered)\n```\n\n### LCP element identification\n```javascript\n// Find your LCP element\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  const entries = list.getEntries();\n  const lastEntry = entries[entries.length - 1];\n  console.log(''LCP element:'', lastEntry.element);\n  console.log(''LCP time:'', lastEntry.startTime);\n}).observe({ type: ''largest-contentful-paint'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## INP: Interaction to Next Paint\n\nINP measures responsiveness across ALL interactions (clicks, taps, key presses) during a page visit. It reports the worst interaction (at 98th percentile for high-traffic pages).\n\n### INP breakdown\n\nTotal INP = **Input Delay** + **Processing Time** + **Presentation Delay**\n\n| Phase | Target | Optimization |\n|-------|--------|--------------|\n| Input Delay | < 50ms | Reduce main thread blocking |\n| Processing | < 100ms | Optimize event handlers |\n| Presentation | < 50ms | Minimize rendering work |\n\n### Common INP issues\n\n**1. Long tasks blocking main thread**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Long synchronous task\nfunction processLargeArray(items) {\n  items.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n}\n\n// ✅ Break into chunks with yielding\nasync function processLargeArray(items) {\n  const CHUNK_SIZE = 100;\n  for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i += CHUNK_SIZE) {\n    const chunk = items.slice(i, i + CHUNK_SIZE);\n    chunk.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n    \n    // Yield to main thread\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 0));\n    // Or use scheduler.yield() when available\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**2. Heavy event handlers**\n```javascript\n// ❌ All work in handler\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Heavy computation\n  const result = calculateComplexThing();\n  // DOM updates\n  updateUI(result);\n  // Analytics\n  trackEvent(''click'');\n});\n\n// ✅ Prioritize visual feedback\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Immediate visual feedback\n  button.classList.add(''loading'');\n  \n  // Defer non-critical work\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    const result = calculateComplexThing();\n    updateUI(result);\n  });\n  \n  // Use requestIdleCallback for analytics\n  requestIdleCallback(() => trackEvent(''click''));\n});\n```\n\n**3. Third-party scripts**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Eagerly loaded, blocks interactions\n<script src=\"https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js\"></script>\n\n// ✅ Lazy loaded on interaction or visibility\nconst loadWidget = () => {\n  import(''https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js'')\n    .then(widget => widget.init());\n};\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', loadWidget, { once: true });\n```\n\n**4. Excessive re-renders (React/Vue)**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Re-renders entire tree\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <ExpensiveComponent /> {/* Re-renders on every count change */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// ✅ Memoized expensive components\nconst MemoizedExpensive = React.memo(ExpensiveComponent);\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <MemoizedExpensive />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### INP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] No tasks > 50ms on main thread\n- [ ] Event handlers complete quickly (< 100ms)\n- [ ] Visual feedback provided immediately\n- [ ] Heavy work deferred with requestIdleCallback\n- [ ] Third-party scripts don''t block interactions\n- [ ] Debounced input handlers where appropriate\n- [ ] Web Workers for CPU-intensive operations\n```\n\n### INP debugging\n```javascript\n// Identify slow interactions\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (entry.duration > 200) {\n      console.warn(''Slow interaction:'', {\n        type: entry.name,\n        duration: entry.duration,\n        processingStart: entry.processingStart,\n        processingEnd: entry.processingEnd,\n        target: entry.target\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''event'', buffered: true, durationThreshold: 16 });\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLS: Cumulative Layout Shift\n\nCLS measures unexpected layout shifts. A shift occurs when a visible element changes position between frames without user interaction.\n\n**CLS Formula:** `impact fraction × distance fraction`\n\n### Common CLS causes\n\n**1. Images without dimensions**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Causes layout shift when loaded -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Space reserved -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4/3; width: 100%;\">\n```\n\n**2. Ads, embeds, and iframes**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Unknown size until loaded -->\n<iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\"></iframe>\n\n<!-- ✅ Reserve space with min-height -->\n<div style=\"min-height: 250px;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\" height=\"250\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio container -->\n<div style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/...\" \n          style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></iframe>\n</div>\n```\n\n**3. Dynamically injected content**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Inserts content above viewport\nnotifications.prepend(newNotification);\n\n// ✅ Insert below viewport or use transform\nconst insertBelow = viewport.bottom < newNotification.top;\nif (insertBelow) {\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n} else {\n  // Animate in without shifting\n  newNotification.style.transform = ''translateY(-100%)'';\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    newNotification.style.transform = '''';\n  });\n}\n```\n\n**4. Web fonts causing FOUT**\n```css\n/* ❌ Font swap shifts text */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n}\n\n/* ✅ Optional font (no shift if slow) */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: optional;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Or match fallback metrics */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: swap;\n  size-adjust: 105%; /* Match fallback size */\n  ascent-override: 95%;\n  descent-override: 20%;\n}\n```\n\n**5. Animations triggering layout**\n```css\n/* ❌ Animates layout properties */\n.animate {\n  transition: height 0.3s, width 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Use transform instead */\n.animate {\n  transition: transform 0.3s;\n}\n.animate.expanded {\n  transform: scale(1.2);\n}\n```\n\n### CLS optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] All images have width/height or aspect-ratio\n- [ ] All videos/embeds have reserved space\n- [ ] Ads have min-height containers\n- [ ] Fonts use font-display: optional or matched metrics\n- [ ] Dynamic content inserted below viewport\n- [ ] Animations use transform/opacity only\n- [ ] No content injected above existing content\n```\n\n### CLS debugging\n```javascript\n// Track layout shifts\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (!entry.hadRecentInput) {\n      console.log(''Layout shift:'', entry.value);\n      entry.sources?.forEach(source => {\n        console.log(''  Shifted element:'', source.node);\n        console.log(''  Previous rect:'', source.previousRect);\n        console.log(''  Current rect:'', source.currentRect);\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''layout-shift'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Measurement tools\n\n### Lab testing\n- **Chrome DevTools** → Performance panel, Lighthouse\n- **WebPageTest** → Detailed waterfall, filmstrip\n- **Lighthouse CLI** → `npx lighthouse <url>`\n\n### Field data (real users)\n- **Chrome User Experience Report (CrUX)** → BigQuery or API\n- **Search Console** → Core Web Vitals report\n- **web-vitals library** → Send to your analytics\n\n```javascript\nimport {onLCP, onINP, onCLS} from ''web-vitals'';\n\nfunction sendToAnalytics({name, value, rating}) {\n  gtag(''event'', name, {\n    event_category: ''Web Vitals'',\n    value: Math.round(name === ''CLS'' ? value * 1000 : value),\n    event_label: rating\n  });\n}\n\nonLCP(sendToAnalytics);\nonINP(sendToAnalytics);\nonCLS(sendToAnalytics);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Framework quick fixes\n\n### Next.js\n```jsx\n// LCP: Use next/image with priority\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n<Image src=\"/hero.jpg\" priority fill alt=\"Hero\" />\n\n// INP: Use dynamic imports\nconst HeavyComponent = dynamic(() => import(''./Heavy''), { ssr: false });\n\n// CLS: Image component handles dimensions automatically\n```\n\n### React\n```jsx\n// LCP: Preload in head\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.jpg\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" />\n\n// INP: Memoize and useTransition\nconst [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();\nstartTransition(() => setExpensiveState(newValue));\n\n// CLS: Always specify dimensions in img tags\n```\n\n### Vue/Nuxt\n```vue\n<!-- LCP: Use nuxt/image with preload -->\n<NuxtImg src=\"/hero.jpg\" preload loading=\"eager\" />\n\n<!-- INP: Use async components -->\n<component :is=\"() => import(''./Heavy.vue'')\" />\n\n<!-- CLS: Use aspect-ratio CSS -->\n<img :style=\"{ aspectRatio: ''16/9'' }\" />\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [web.dev LCP](https://web.dev/articles/lcp)\n- [web.dev INP](https://web.dev/articles/inp)\n- [web.dev CLS](https://web.dev/articles/cls)\n- [Performance skill](../performance/SKILL.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:08:01.552Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Performance Optimization Agents focusing on Google Search ranking and user experience through Core Web Vitals metrics like LCP, INP, and CLS.","zh":"适合专注于Google搜索排名和通过Core Web Vitals指标（如LCP、INP和CLS）来优化用户体验的性能优化代理。","ja":"Google検索のランキングとCore Web Vitalsメトリクス（LCP、INP、CLSなど）を使用したユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化に重点を置くパフォーマンス最適化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Google 검색 순위 및 Core Web Vitals 메트릭(LCP, INP, CLS 등)을 통해 사용자 경험을 최적화하는 성능 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de optimización de rendimiento que se centran en el ranking de Google Search y la experiencia del usuario a través de métricas de Core Web Vitals como LCP, INP y CLS.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''optimisation des performances qui se concentrent sur le classement Google Search et l''expérience utilisateur via des métriques Core Web Vitals comme LCP, INP et CLS.","de":"Ideal für Performance-Optimierungsagenten, die sich auf die Google-Suchmaschinen-Optimierung und die Benutzererfahrung durch Core-Web-Vitals-Metriken wie LCP, INP und CLS konzentrieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Otimização de Desempenho que se concentram no ranking do Google Search e na experiência do usuário por meio de métricas de Core Web Vitals, como LCP, INP e CLS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации производительности, ориентированных на рейтинг Google Search и опыт пользователя через метрики Core Web Vitals, такие как LCP, INP и CLS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتخصصين في تحسين الأداء الذين يركزون على تصنيف جوجل للبحث وتجربة المستخدم من خلال مقاييس Core Web Vitals مثل LCP و INP و CLS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize website performance by targeting the three Core Web Vitals metrics, ensuring better Google Search rankings and enhanced user experience through improved Loading (LCP), Interactivity (INP), and Visual Stability (CLS) at the 75th percentile.","zh":"赋予代理优化网站性能的能力，通过针对三个Core Web Vitals指标，确保更好的Google搜索排名和通过改进加载（LCP）、交互性（INP）和视觉稳定性（CLS）在第75百分位来增强用户体验。","ja":"エージェントに、3つのCore Web Vitalsメトリクスをターゲットにしてウェブサイトのパフォーマンスを最適化する能力を与え、ローディング（LCP）、インタラクティビティ（INP）、視覚的安定性（CLS）を改善することで、Google検索のランキングを向上させ、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを高める。","ko":"에이전트가 웹사이트 성능을 최적화 할 수 있도록하여, 세 가지 Core Web Vitals 메트릭스를 대상으로 하여 Google 검색 순위를 향상시키고, 로딩(LCP), 상호작용(INP), 시각적 안정성(CLS)을 향상시켜 75번째 백분위에서 사용자 경험을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el rendimiento del sitio web al apuntar a las tres métricas de Core Web Vitals, asegurando mejores clasificaciones de Google Search y una experiencia de usuario mejorada a través de una mejora de la carga (LCP), la interactividad (INP) y la estabilidad visual (CLS) en el percentil 75.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances du site Web en ciblant les trois métriques Core Web Vitals, garantissant de meilleures classements Google Search et une expérience utilisateur améliorée via une amélioration du chargement (LCP), de l''interactivité (INP) et de la stabilité visuelle (CLS) au 75e percentile.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Website-Leistung zu optimieren, indem sie auf die drei Core-Web-Vitals-Metriken abzielen, um bessere Google-Suchmaschinen-Rankings und eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung durch eine verbesserte Ladezeit (LCP), Interaktivität (INP) und visuelle Stabilität (CLS) im 75. Perzentil sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho do site, visando as três métricas de Core Web Vitals, garantindo melhores classificações no Google Search e experiência do usuário aprimorada por meio de carregamento (LCP), interatividade (INP) e estabilidade visual (CLS) no percentil 75.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать производительность сайта, ориентируясь на три метрики Core Web Vitals, обеспечивая лучшие рейтинги Google Search и улучшенный опыт пользователя за счет улучшения загрузки (LCP), интерактивности (INP) и визуальной стабильности (CLS) на 75-м процентиле.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين أداء الموقع من خلال استهداف ثلاثة مقاييس Core Web Vitals، مما يضمن تصنيفات جوجل للبحث الأفضل وتجربة مستخدم محسنة من خلال التحسينات في التحميل (LCP) والتفاعل (INP) والاستقرار البصري (CLS) عندPercentil 75."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing LCP metrics to reduce loading times below 2.5 seconds","Improving INP scores by optimizing interactivity to 200ms or less","Debugging CLS issues to achieve visual stability scores of 0.1 or less"],"zh":["分析LCP指标以将加载时间减少到2.5秒以下","通过优化交互性至200ms或以下来提高INP评分","调试CLS问题以实现视觉稳定性评分0.1或以下"],"ja":["ローディング時間を2.5秒以下に削減するためにLCPメトリクスを分析する","インタラクティビティを200ms以下に最適化することでINPスコアを向上させる","視覚的安定性スコアを0.1以下に達成するためにCLSの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["로딩 시간을 2.5초 이하로 줄이기 위해 LCP 메트릭스 분석","200ms 이하로 상호작용을 최적화하여 INP 점수를 향상","시각적 안정성 점수를 0.1 이하로 달성하기 위해 CLS 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Analizar las métricas LCP para reducir los tiempos de carga por debajo de 2,5 segundos","Mejorar las puntuaciones INP al optimizar la interactividad a 200 ms o menos","Depurar problemas CLS para lograr puntuaciones de estabilidad visual de 0,1 o menos"],"fr":["Analyser les métriques LCP pour réduire les temps de chargement en dessous de 2,5 secondes","Améliorer les scores INP en optimisant l''interactivité à 200 ms ou moins","Déboguer les problèmes CLS pour atteindre des scores de stabilité visuelle de 0,1 ou moins"],"de":["LCP-Metriken analysieren, um Ladezeiten unter 2,5 Sekunden zu reduzieren","INP-Scores verbessern, indem die Interaktivität auf 200 ms oder weniger optimiert wird","CLS-Probleme debuggen, um visuelle Stabilitätsscores von 0,1 oder weniger zu erreichen"],"pt":["Analisar métricas de LCP para reduzir os tempos de carregamento abaixo de 2,5 segundos","Melhorar os escores de INP, otimizando a interatividade para 200ms ou menos","Depurar problemas de CLS para alcançar escores de estabilidade visual de 0,1 ou menos"],"ru":["Анализировать метрики LCP для снижения времени загрузки ниже 2,5 секунд","Улучшать оценки INP, оптимизируя интерактивность до 200 мс или меньше","Отлаживать проблемы CLS для достижения оценок визуальной стабильности 0,1 или меньше"],"ar":["تحليل مقاييس LCP لتقليل أوقات التحميل إلى أقل من 2.5 ثانية","تحسين درجات INP عن طريق تحسين التفاعل إلى 200 مللي ثانية أو أقل","تصحيح أخطاء CLS لتحقيق درجات الاستقرار البصري 0.1 أو أقل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Google''s 75th percentile measurement","Applies to websites built with frameworks like Next JS and Headless WordPress","Focuses on three specific metrics: LCP, INP, and CLS"],"zh":["需要了解Google的第75百分位测量","仅适用于使用Next JS和Headless WordPress等框架构建的网站","仅关注三个特定的指标：LCP、INP和CLS"],"ja":["Googleの第75パーセントルの測定の理解が必要","Next JSやHeadless WordPressなどのフレームワークで構築されたウェブサイトのみに適用","LCP、INP、CLSの3つの特定のメトリクスのみに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["Google의 75번째 백분위 측정 이해 필요","Next JS 및 Headless WordPress와 같은 프레임워크로 구축 된 웹 사이트에만 적용","LCP, INP, CLS의 3 가지 특정 메트릭스에만 초점"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la medición del percentil 75 de Google","Se aplica a sitios web construidos con frameworks como Next JS y Headless WordPress","Se centra en tres métricas específicas: LCP, INP y CLS"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la mesure du 75e percentile de Google","S''applique aux sites Web construits avec des frameworks comme Next JS et Headless WordPress","Se concentre sur trois métriques spécifiques : LCP, INP et CLS"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis der 75. Perzentil-Messung von Google","Wird auf Websites angewendet, die mit Frameworks wie Next JS und Headless WordPress erstellt wurden","Konzentriert sich auf drei spezifische Metriken: LCP, INP und CLS"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da medição do percentil 75 do Google","Aplica-se a sites construídos com frameworks como Next JS e Headless WordPress","Concentra-se em três métricas específicas: LCP, INP e CLS"],"ru":["Требует понимания измерения 75-го процентиля Google","Применяется к сайтам, построенным с помощью фреймворков, таких как Next JS и Headless WordPress","Сосредоточен на трех конкретных метриках: LCP, INP и CLS"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم قياس Percentil 75 من جوجل","ينطبق على المواقع التي بنيت باستخدام إطارات مثل Next JS و Headless WordPress","يركز على ثلاثة مقاييس محددة: LCP و INP و CLS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rifandani/fe-monorepo/core-web-vitals', 'community', 'rifandani', 'fe-monorepo', 'rifandani/fe-monorepo', 'core-web-vitals', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z', '2026-02-18T09:08:15.063Z', NULL, '{"id":"rifandani/fe-monorepo/core-web-vitals","name":"core-web-vitals","description":{"zh":"Core Web Vitals 优化是指针对三个影响 Google 搜索排名和用户体验的关键指标进行优化，包括 LCP、INP 和 CLS","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化は、Google 検索ランキングとユーザー体験に影響を与える 3 つの重要な指標、LCP、INP、CLS を最適化すること","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화는 Google 검색 순위와 사용자 경험에 영향을 미치는 3 가지 핵심 지표인 LCP, INP 및 CLS를 최적화하는 것을 의미합니다","es":"Optimización de Core Web Vitals para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y el posicionamiento en Google Search","fr":"Optimisation des Core Web Vitals pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et le référencement Google","de":"Core Web Vitals-Optimierung zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung und des Google-Suchergebnisses","pt":"A otimização de Core Web Vitals é fundamental para melhorar a experiência do usuário e o ranking no Google. Ela envolve a medição de três métricas principais: LCP, INP e CLS.","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals имеет важное значение для улучшения пользовательского опыта и рейтинга в Google. Она включает в себя измерение трех основных метрик: LCP, INP и CLS.","ar":"تحسين Core Web Vitals ضروري لتحسين تجربة المستخدم وتصنيف جوجل. وهو يتضمن قياس ثلاثة مقاييس أساسية: LCP و INP و CLS.","en":"https://rifandani-fe-monorepo-spa.vercel.app/ , https://rifandani-fe-monorepo-web.vercel.app/"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Core Web Vitals 优化","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화","es":"Optimización de Core Web Vitals para desarrolladores","fr":"Optimisation des Core Web Vitals pour les développeurs","de":"Core Web Vitals-Optimierung für Entwickler","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals","ar":"تحسين Core Web Vitals","en":"core-web-vitals"},"description":{"zh":"Core Web Vitals 优化是指针对三个影响 Google 搜索排名和用户体验的关键指标进行优化，包括 LCP、INP 和 CLS","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化は、Google 検索ランキングとユーザー体験に影響を与える 3 つの重要な指標、LCP、INP、CLS を最適化すること","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화는 Google 검색 순위와 사용자 경험에 영향을 미치는 3 가지 핵심 지표인 LCP, INP 및 CLS를 최적화하는 것을 의미합니다","es":"Optimización de Core Web Vitals para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y el posicionamiento en Google Search","fr":"Optimisation des Core Web Vitals pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et le référencement Google","de":"Core Web Vitals-Optimierung zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung und des Google-Suchergebnisses","pt":"A otimização de Core Web Vitals é fundamental para melhorar a experiência do usuário e o ranking no Google. Ela envolve a medição de três métricas principais...","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals имеет важное значение для улучшения пользовательского опыта и рейтинга в Google. Она включает в себя измерение трех основных метр...","ar":"تحسين Core Web Vitals ضروري لتحسين تجربة المستخدم وتصنيف جوجل. وهو يتضمن قياس ثلاثة مقاييس أساسية: LCP و INP و CLS.","en":"https://rifandani-fe-monorepo-spa.vercel.app/ , https://rifandani-fe-monorepo-web.vercel.app/"},"definition":{"en":"https://rifandani-fe-monorepo-spa.vercel.app/ , https://rifandani-fe-monorepo-web.vercel.app/"},"features":{"zh":["LCP（最大内容绘制）优化","INP（输入延迟）优化","CLS（累计布局偏移）优化","提高用户体验","改善 Google 搜索排名","提高网页性能"],"ja":["LCP（最大コンテンツ描画）最適化","INP（入力遅延）最適化","CLS（累積レイアウトシフト）最適化","ユーザー体験の向上","Google 検索ランキングの改善","Web ページのパフォーマンスの向上"],"ko":["LCP（최대 콘텐츠 페인팅）최적화","INP（입력 지연）최적화","CLS（누적 레이아웃 시프트）최적화","사용자 경험 개선","Google 검색 순위 개선","웹 페이지 성능 개선"],"es":["Optimización de LCP (Loading)","Optimización de INP (Interactividad)","Optimización de CLS (Estabilidad visual)","Análisis de las métricas de Core Web Vitals","Mejora del posicionamiento en Google Search","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Optimisation de LCP (Chargement)","Optimisation de INP (Interactivité)","Optimisation de CLS (Stabilité visuelle)","Analyse des métriques de Core Web Vitals","Amélioration du référencement Google","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Optimierung von LCP (Ladezeit)","Optimierung von INP (Interaktivität)","Optimierung von CLS (Visuelle Stabilität)","Analyse der Core-Web-Vitals-Metriken","Verbesserung des Google-Suchergebnisses","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Otimização de LCP ( Largest Contentful Paint )","Otimização de INP ( Interaction to Next Paint )","Otimização de CLS ( Cumulative Layout Shift )","Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Aumento do ranking no Google","Análise de desempenho de página"],"ru":["Оптимизация LCP ( Largest Contentful Paint )","Оптимизация INP ( Interaction to Next Paint )","Оптимизация CLS ( Cumulative Layout Shift )","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Повышение рейтинга в Google","Анализ производительности страницы"],"ar":["تحسين LCP ( Largest Contentful Paint )","تحسين INP ( Interaction to Next Paint )","تحسين CLS ( Cumulative Layout Shift )","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","تحسين تصنيف جوجل","تحليل أداء الصفحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Core Web Vitals","LCP","INP","CLS","网页性能","用户体验","Google 搜索排名","最適化","性能优化"],"ja":["Core Web Vitals","LCP","INP","CLS","Web ページのパフォーマンス","ユーザー体験","Google 検索ランキング","最適化","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["Core Web Vitals","LCP","INP","CLS","웹 페이지 성능","사용자 경험","Google 검색 순위","최적화","성능 최적화"],"es":["Core Web Vitals","Optimización de Core Web Vitals","LCP","INP","CLS","Experiencia del usuario","Posicionamiento en Google Search","Desarrollo web"],"fr":["Core Web Vitals","Optimisation des Core Web Vitals","LCP","INP","CLS","Expérience utilisateur","Référencement Google","Développement web"],"de":["Core Web Vitals","Core-Web-Vitals-Optimierung","LCP","INP","CLS","Benutzererfahrung","Google-Suchergebnis","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["Core Web Vitals","Otimização de site","Experiência do usuário","Ranking no Google","LCP","INP","CLS","Desempenho de página","Otimização de SEO"],"ru":["Core Web Vitals","Оптимизация сайта","Пользовательский опыт","Рейтинг в Google","LCP","INP","CLS","Производительность страницы","Оптимизация SEO"],"ar":["Core Web Vitals","تحسين الموقع","تجربة المستخدم","تصنيف جوجل","LCP","INP","CLS","أداء الصفحة","تحسين SEO"]}},"owner":"rifandani","repo":"fe-monorepo","repoPath":"rifandani/fe-monorepo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"core-web-vitals","description":"Optimize Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) for better page experience and search ranking. Use when asked to improve Core Web Vitals, fix LCP, reduce CLS, optimize INP, page experience optimization, or fix layout shifts.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page","body":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page visits must meet \"Good\" thresholds.\n\n---\n\n## LCP: Largest Contentful Paint\n\nLCP measures when the largest visible content element renders. Usually this is:\n- Hero image or video\n- Large text block\n- Background image\n- `<svg>` element\n\n### Common LCP issues\n\n**1. Slow server response (TTFB > 800ms)**\n```\nFix: CDN, caching, optimized backend, edge rendering\n```\n\n**2. Render-blocking resources**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Blocks rendering -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/all-styles.css\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Critical CSS inlined, rest deferred -->\n<style>/* Critical above-fold CSS */</style>\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/styles.css\" as=\"style\" \n      onload=\"this.onload=null;this.rel=''stylesheet''\">\n```\n\n**3. Slow resource load times**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ No hints, discovered late -->\n<img src=\"/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Hero\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Preloaded with high priority -->\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.webp\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n<img src=\"/hero.webp\" alt=\"Hero\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n```\n\n**4. Client-side rendering delays**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Content loads after JavaScript\nuseEffect(() => {\n  fetch(''/api/hero-text'').then(r => r.json()).then(setHeroText);\n}, []);\n\n// ✅ Server-side or static rendering\n// Use SSR, SSG, or streaming to send HTML with content\nexport async function getServerSideProps() {\n  const heroText = await fetchHeroText();\n  return { props: { heroText } };\n}\n```\n\n### LCP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] TTFB < 800ms (use CDN, edge caching)\n- [ ] LCP image preloaded with fetchpriority=\"high\"\n- [ ] LCP image optimized (WebP/AVIF, correct size)\n- [ ] Critical CSS inlined (< 14KB)\n- [ ] No render-blocking JavaScript in <head>\n- [ ] Fonts don''t block text rendering (font-display: swap)\n- [ ] LCP element in initial HTML (not JS-rendered)\n```\n\n### LCP element identification\n```javascript\n// Find your LCP element\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  const entries = list.getEntries();\n  const lastEntry = entries[entries.length - 1];\n  console.log(''LCP element:'', lastEntry.element);\n  console.log(''LCP time:'', lastEntry.startTime);\n}).observe({ type: ''largest-contentful-paint'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## INP: Interaction to Next Paint\n\nINP measures responsiveness across ALL interactions (clicks, taps, key presses) during a page visit. It reports the worst interaction (at 98th percentile for high-traffic pages).\n\n### INP breakdown\n\nTotal INP = **Input Delay** + **Processing Time** + **Presentation Delay**\n\n| Phase | Target | Optimization |\n|-------|--------|--------------|\n| Input Delay | < 50ms | Reduce main thread blocking |\n| Processing | < 100ms | Optimize event handlers |\n| Presentation | < 50ms | Minimize rendering work |\n\n### Common INP issues\n\n**1. Long tasks blocking main thread**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Long synchronous task\nfunction processLargeArray(items) {\n  items.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n}\n\n// ✅ Break into chunks with yielding\nasync function processLargeArray(items) {\n  const CHUNK_SIZE = 100;\n  for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i += CHUNK_SIZE) {\n    const chunk = items.slice(i, i + CHUNK_SIZE);\n    chunk.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n    \n    // Yield to main thread\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 0));\n    // Or use scheduler.yield() when available\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**2. Heavy event handlers**\n```javascript\n// ❌ All work in handler\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Heavy computation\n  const result = calculateComplexThing();\n  // DOM updates\n  updateUI(result);\n  // Analytics\n  trackEvent(''click'');\n});\n\n// ✅ Prioritize visual feedback\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Immediate visual feedback\n  button.classList.add(''loading'');\n  \n  // Defer non-critical work\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    const result = calculateComplexThing();\n    updateUI(result);\n  });\n  \n  // Use requestIdleCallback for analytics\n  requestIdleCallback(() => trackEvent(''click''));\n});\n```\n\n**3. Third-party scripts**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Eagerly loaded, blocks interactions\n<script src=\"https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js\"></script>\n\n// ✅ Lazy loaded on interaction or visibility\nconst loadWidget = () => {\n  import(''https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js'')\n    .then(widget => widget.init());\n};\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', loadWidget, { once: true });\n```\n\n**4. Excessive re-renders (React/Vue)**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Re-renders entire tree\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <ExpensiveComponent /> {/* Re-renders on every count change */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// ✅ Memoized expensive components\nconst MemoizedExpensive = React.memo(ExpensiveComponent);\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <MemoizedExpensive />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### INP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] No tasks > 50ms on main thread\n- [ ] Event handlers complete quickly (< 100ms)\n- [ ] Visual feedback provided immediately\n- [ ] Heavy work deferred with requestIdleCallback\n- [ ] Third-party scripts don''t block interactions\n- [ ] Debounced input handlers where appropriate\n- [ ] Web Workers for CPU-intensive operations\n```\n\n### INP debugging\n```javascript\n// Identify slow interactions\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (entry.duration > 200) {\n      console.warn(''Slow interaction:'', {\n        type: entry.name,\n        duration: entry.duration,\n        processingStart: entry.processingStart,\n        processingEnd: entry.processingEnd,\n        target: entry.target\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''event'', buffered: true, durationThreshold: 16 });\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLS: Cumulative Layout Shift\n\nCLS measures unexpected layout shifts. A shift occurs when a visible element changes position between frames without user interaction.\n\n**CLS Formula:** `impact fraction × distance fraction`\n\n### Common CLS causes\n\n**1. Images without dimensions**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Causes layout shift when loaded -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Space reserved -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4/3; width: 100%;\">\n```\n\n**2. Ads, embeds, and iframes**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Unknown size until loaded -->\n<iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\"></iframe>\n\n<!-- ✅ Reserve space with min-height -->\n<div style=\"min-height: 250px;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\" height=\"250\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio container -->\n<div style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/...\" \n          style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></iframe>\n</div>\n```\n\n**3. Dynamically injected content**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Inserts content above viewport\nnotifications.prepend(newNotification);\n\n// ✅ Insert below viewport or use transform\nconst insertBelow = viewport.bottom < newNotification.top;\nif (insertBelow) {\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n} else {\n  // Animate in without shifting\n  newNotification.style.transform = ''translateY(-100%)'';\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    newNotification.style.transform = '''';\n  });\n}\n```\n\n**4. Web fonts causing FOUT**\n```css\n/* ❌ Font swap shifts text */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n}\n\n/* ✅ Optional font (no shift if slow) */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: optional;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Or match fallback metrics */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: swap;\n  size-adjust: 105%; /* Match fallback size */\n  ascent-override: 95%;\n  descent-override: 20%;\n}\n```\n\n**5. Animations triggering layout**\n```css\n/* ❌ Animates layout properties */\n.animate {\n  transition: height 0.3s, width 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Use transform instead */\n.animate {\n  transition: transform 0.3s;\n}\n.animate.expanded {\n  transform: scale(1.2);\n}\n```\n\n### CLS optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] All images have width/height or aspect-ratio\n- [ ] All videos/embeds have reserved space\n- [ ] Ads have min-height containers\n- [ ] Fonts use font-display: optional or matched metrics\n- [ ] Dynamic content inserted below viewport\n- [ ] Animations use transform/opacity only\n- [ ] No content injected above existing content\n```\n\n### CLS debugging\n```javascript\n// Track layout shifts\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (!entry.hadRecentInput) {\n      console.log(''Layout shift:'', entry.value);\n      entry.sources?.forEach(source => {\n        console.log(''  Shifted element:'', source.node);\n        console.log(''  Previous rect:'', source.previousRect);\n        console.log(''  Current rect:'', source.currentRect);\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''layout-shift'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Measurement tools\n\n### Lab testing\n- **Chrome DevTools** → Performance panel, Lighthouse\n- **WebPageTest** → Detailed waterfall, filmstrip\n- **Lighthouse CLI** → `npx lighthouse <url>`\n\n### Field data (real users)\n- **Chrome User Experience Report (CrUX)** → BigQuery or API\n- **Search Console** → Core Web Vitals report\n- **web-vitals library** → Send to your analytics\n\n```javascript\nimport {onLCP, onINP, onCLS} from ''web-vitals'';\n\nfunction sendToAnalytics({name, value, rating}) {\n  gtag(''event'', name, {\n    event_category: ''Web Vitals'',\n    value: Math.round(name === ''CLS'' ? value * 1000 : value),\n    event_label: rating\n  });\n}\n\nonLCP(sendToAnalytics);\nonINP(sendToAnalytics);\nonCLS(sendToAnalytics);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Framework quick fixes\n\n### Next.js\n```jsx\n// LCP: Use next/image with priority\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n<Image src=\"/hero.jpg\" priority fill alt=\"Hero\" />\n\n// INP: Use dynamic imports\nconst HeavyComponent = dynamic(() => import(''./Heavy''), { ssr: false });\n\n// CLS: Image component handles dimensions automatically\n```\n\n### React\n```jsx\n// LCP: Preload in head\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.jpg\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" />\n\n// INP: Memoize and useTransition\nconst [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();\nstartTransition(() => setExpensiveState(newValue));\n\n// CLS: Always specify dimensions in img tags\n```\n\n### Vue/Nuxt\n```vue\n<!-- LCP: Use nuxt/image with preload -->\n<NuxtImg src=\"/hero.jpg\" preload loading=\"eager\" />\n\n<!-- INP: Use async components -->\n<component :is=\"() => import(''./Heavy.vue'')\" />\n\n<!-- CLS: Use aspect-ratio CSS -->\n<img :style=\"{ aspectRatio: ''16/9'' }\" />\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [web.dev LCP](https://web.dev/articles/lcp)\n- [web.dev INP](https://web.dev/articles/inp)\n- [web.dev CLS](https://web.dev/articles/cls)\n- [Performance skill](../performance/SKILL.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:08:15.063Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents focusing on Google Search ranking and user experience through Core Web Vitals metrics like LCP, INP, and CLS.","zh":"非常适合专注于Google搜索排名和通过核心Web指标（如LCP、INP和CLS）来改善用户体验的SEO优化代理。","ja":"Google検索ランキングとCore Web Vitalsメトリクス（LCP、INP、CLS）を通じたユーザーエクスペリエンスに焦点を当てたSEO最適化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Google 검색 순위 및 Core Web Vitals 메트릭(LCP, INP, CLS)을 통해 사용자 경험을 향상하는 SEO 최적화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de SEO que se centran en el posicionamiento en Google Search y la experiencia del usuario a través de métricas de Core Web Vitals como LCP, INP y CLS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation du SEO qui se concentrent sur le classement de Google Search et l''expérience utilisateur via les métriques de Core Web Vitals comme LCP, INP et CLS.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Optimierungsagenten, die sich auf die Google-Suchmaschinen-Positionierung und die Benutzererfahrung durch Core-Web-Vitals-Metriken wie LCP, INP und CLS konzentrieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de SEO que se concentram no ranking do Google Search e na experiência do usuário por meio de métricas de Core Web Vitals como LCP, INP e CLS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по оптимизации SEO, ориентированных на рейтинг Google Search и пользовательский опыт через метрики Core Web Vitals, такие как LCP, INP и CLS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين محركات البحث التي تركز على تصنيف بحث جوجل و تجربة المستخدم من خلال مقاييس Core Web Vitals مثل LCP و INP و CLS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize web pages for better loading performance, interactivity, and visual stability, leveraging metrics like Largest Contentful Paint (LCP), Input Delay (INP), and Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) to improve user experience and search engine rankings.","zh":"赋予代理优化网页以实现更好的加载性能、交互性和视觉稳定性，利用最大内容绘制（LCP）、输入延迟（INP）和累积布局偏移（CLS）等指标来改善用户体验和搜索引擎排名。","ja":"エージェントに、Largest Contentful Paint（LCP）、Input Delay（INP）、Cumulative Layout Shift（CLS）などのメトリクスを利用して、より良いロードパフォーマンス、インタラクティビティ、視覚的安定性を持つWebページを最適化する力を与え、ユーザーエクスペリエンスと検索エンジンランキングを向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 Largest Contentful Paint(LCP), Input Delay(INP), Cumulative Layout Shift(CLS) 등의 메트릭스를 활용하여 더 나은 로딩 성능, 상호 작용성, 시각적 안정성을 가진 웹 페이지를 최적화할 수 있도록 하여, 사용자 경험과 검색 엔진 순위를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar las páginas web para un mejor rendimiento de carga, interactividad y estabilidad visual, aprovechando métricas como Largest Contentful Paint (LCP), Input Delay (INP) y Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y los rankings de los motores de búsqueda.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les pages Web pour de meilleures performances de chargement, d''interactivité et de stabilité visuelle, en exploitant des métriques comme Largest Contentful Paint (LCP), Input Delay (INP) et Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et les classements des moteurs de recherche.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Webseiten für eine bessere Ladeleistung, Interaktivität und visuelle Stabilität zu optimieren, indem es Metriken wie Largest Contentful Paint (LCP), Input Delay (INP) und Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) nutzt, um die Benutzererfahrung und die Suchmaschinenrankings zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar páginas da web para um melhor desempenho de carregamento, interatividade e estabilidade visual, utilizando métricas como Largest Contentful Paint (LCP), Input Delay (INP) e Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) para melhorar a experiência do usuário e os rankings dos mecanismos de busca.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать веб-страницы для лучшей производительности загрузки, интерактивности и визуальной стабильности, используя метрики, такие как Largest Contentful Paint (LCP), Input Delay (INP) и Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS), для улучшения пользовательского опыта и рейтинга поисковых систем.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تحسين صفحات الويب لتحقيق أداء تحميل أفضل وتفاعل وثبات بصري، باستخدام مقاييس مثل Largest Contentful Paint (LCP) و Input Delay (INP) و Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) لتحسين تجربة المستخدم وتصنيف محركات البحث."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing LCP for faster page loading","Improving INP for enhanced user interactivity","Reducing CLS for better visual stability"],"zh":["优化LCP以实现更快的页面加载","提高INP以增强用户交互性","降低CLS以实现更好的视觉稳定性"],"ja":["ページロードの高速化のためのLCPの最適化","ユーザーインタラクティビティの向上のためのINPの改善","視覚的安定性の向上のためのCLSの低減"],"ko":["페이지 로딩 성능 향상을 위한 LCP 최적화","사용자 상호 작용성 향상을 위한 INP 개선","시각적 안정성 향상을 위한 CLS 감소"],"es":["Optimizar LCP para una carga de página más rápida","Mejorar INP para una mayor interactividad del usuario","Reducir CLS para una mejor estabilidad visual"],"fr":["Optimiser LCP pour un chargement de page plus rapide","Améliorer INP pour une interactivité utilisateur améliorée","Réduire CLS pour une meilleure stabilité visuelle"],"de":["LCP optimieren, um eine schnellere Seitenladung zu erreichen","INP verbessern, um eine erhöhte Benutzerinteraktivität zu erreichen","CLS reduzieren, um eine bessere visuelle Stabilität zu erreichen"],"pt":["Otimizar LCP para carregamento de página mais rápido","Melhorar INP para interatividade do usuário aprimorada","Reduzir CLS para melhor estabilidade visual"],"ru":["Оптимизировать LCP для более быстрой загрузки страницы","Улучшить INP для повышения пользовательской интерактивности","Снизить CLS для лучшей визуальной стабильности"],"ar":["تحسين LCP لتحميل صفحة أسرع","تحسين INP لتعزيز التفاعل مع المستخدم","تقليل CLS لتحقيق استقرار بصري أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Google''s 75th percentile measurement","Focuses on three specific Core Web Vitals metrics"],"zh":["需要了解Google的75百分位测量","仅关注三个特定的Core Web Vitals指标"],"ja":["Googleの75パーセンタイル測定の理解が必要","Core Web Vitalsメトリクスのうち3つのみに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["Google의 75 백분위 측정 이해 필요","Core Web Vitals 메트릭스 중 3개만 집중"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la medición del percentil 75 de Google","Se centra en tres métricas específicas de Core Web Vitals"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la mesure du 75e percentile de Google","Se concentre sur trois métriques spécifiques de Core Web Vitals"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis der 75-Prozent-Messung von Google","Konzentriert sich auf drei spezifische Core-Web-Vitals-Metriken"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da medição do 75º percentil do Google","Concentra-se em três métricas específicas de Core Web Vitals"],"ru":["Требует понимания измерения 75-го процентиля Google","Сосредоточен на трех конкретных метриках Core Web Vitals"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم قياس النسبة المئوية 75 لجوجل","يركز على ثلاثة مقاييس محددة من Core Web Vitals"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
