업그레이드 평가와 선택적 파일 병합을 제공합니다","es":"El analizador de actualización de Rails evalúa la aplicación y proporciona un informe detallado sobre la viabilidad de la actualización.","fr":"L''outil d''analyse de mise à jour de Rails évalue l''application et fournit un rapport détaillé sur la faisabilité de la mise à jour.","de":"Das Rails-Upgrade-Analyse-Tool bewertet die Anwendung und liefert einen detaillierten Bericht über die Durchführbarkeit des Upgrades.","pt":"O skill-rails-upgrade é uma ferramenta que analisa aplicativos Rails e fornece avaliações de upgrade.","ru":"Навык skill-rails-upgrade - это инструмент, который анализирует приложения Rails и предоставляет оценки обновления.","ar":"المهارة skill-rails-upgrade هي أداة تقوم بتحليل تطبيقات ريلز وتقديم تقييمات للترقية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分析 Rails 应用程序","提供全面升级评估","选择性文件合并","验证 Rails 应用程序","检查 Gemfile 和 config/application.rb"],"ja":["Rails アプリケーションの分析","包括的なアップグレード評価の提供","選択的なファイルマージ","Rails アプリケーションの検証","Gemfile と config/application.rb の確認"],"ko":["Rails 애플리케이션 분석","포괄적인 업그레이드 평가 제공","선택적 파일 병합","Rails 애플리케이션 검증","Gemfile 및 config/application.rb 확인"],"es":["Análisis de la aplicación Rails","Informe detallado sobre la viabilidad de la actualización","Recomendaciones para la actualización","Verificación de la existencia de archivos necesarios","Análisis de la configuración de la aplicación"],"fr":["Analyse de l''application Rails","Rapport détaillé sur la faisabilité de la mise à jour","Recommandations pour la mise à jour","Vérification de l''existence de fichiers nécessaires","Analyse de la configuration de l''application"],"de":["Analyse der Rails-Anwendung","Detaillierter Bericht über die Durchführbarkeit des Upgrades","Empfehlungen für das Upgrade","Überprüfung der Existenz erforderlicher Dateien","Analyse der Anwendungs-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Análise de aplicativos Rails","Avaliação de upgrade","Verificação de arquivos de configuração","Merge seletivo de arquivos","Relatório de upgrade personalizado"],"ru":["Анализ приложений Rails","Оценка обновления","Проверка файлов конфигурации","Выборочное слияние файлов","Пользовательский отчет об обновлении"],"ar":["تحليل تطبيقات ريلز","تقييم الترقية","تحقق من ملفات التكوين","دمج ملفات اختياري","تقرير الترقية المخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rails 升级","Rails 升级分析","Rails 应用程序升级","Gemfile","config/application.rb","选择性文件合并"],"ja":["Rails アップグレード","Rails アップグレード分析","Rails アプリケーションアップグレード","Gemfile","config/application.rb","選択的なファイルマージ"],"ko":["Rails 업그레이드","Rails 업그레이드 분석","Rails 애플리케이션 업그레이드","Gemfile","config/application.rb","선택적 파일 병합"],"es":["actualización de Rails","analizador de actualización de Rails","optimización de Rails","informe de actualización de Rails","recomendaciones de actualización de Rails","desarrollo de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["mise à jour de Rails","outils d''analyse de mise à jour de Rails","optimisation de Rails","rapport de mise à jour de Rails","recommandations de mise à jour de Rails","développement d''applications web"],"de":["Rails-Upgrade","Rails-Upgrade-Analyse-Tool","Optimierung von Rails","Upgrade-Bericht für Rails","Empfehlungen für das Rails-Upgrade","Webanwendungs-Entwicklung"],"pt":["upgrade do rails","análise de aplicativos rails","avaliação de upgrade","otimização de desempenho","segurança de aplicativos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["обновление rails","анализ приложений rails","оценка обновления","оптимизация производительности","безопасность приложений","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["ترقية ريلز","تحليل تطبيقات ريلز","تقييم الترقية","تحسين الأداء","أمان التطبيقات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-rails-upgrade","description":"Analyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments","bodyPreview":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nAnalyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments\n\nUse this skill when working with analyze rails apps and provide upgrade assessments.\n# Rails Upgrade Analyzer\n\nAnalyze the current Rails application and provide a comprehensive upgrade assessment with selective file merging.\n\n## Step 1: Verify Rails Application\n\nCheck that we''re in a Rails application by looking for these files:\n- `Gemfile` (must exist and contain ''rails'')\n- `config/application.rb` (Rails application","body":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nAnalyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments\n\nUse this skill when working with analyze rails apps and provide upgrade assessments.\n# Rails Upgrade Analyzer\n\nAnalyze the current Rails application and provide a comprehensive upgrade assessment with selective file merging.\n\n## Step 1: Verify Rails Application\n\nCheck that we''re in a Rails application by looking for these files:\n- `Gemfile` (must exist and contain ''rails'')\n- `config/application.rb` (Rails application config)\n- `config/environment.rb` (Rails environment)\n\nIf any of these are missing or don''t indicate a Rails app, stop and inform the user this doesn''t appear to be a Rails application.\n\n## Step 2: Get Current Rails Version\n\nExtract the current Rails version from:\n1. First, check `Gemfile.lock` for the exact installed version (look for `rails (x.y.z)`)\n2. If not found, check `Gemfile` for the version constraint\n\nReport the exact current version (e.g., `7.1.3`).\n\n## Step 3: Find Latest Rails Version\n\nUse the GitHub CLI to fetch the latest Rails release:\n\n```bash\ngh api repos/rails/rails/releases/latest --jq ''.tag_name''\n```\n\nThis returns the latest stable version tag (e.g., `v8.0.1`). Strip the ''v'' prefix for comparison.\n\nAlso check recent tags to understand the release landscape:\n\n```bash\ngh api repos/rails/rails/tags --jq ''.[0:10] | .[].name''\n```\n\n## Step 4: Determine Upgrade Type\n\nCompare current and latest versions to classify the upgrade:\n\n- **Patch upgrade**: Same major.minor, different patch (e.g., 7.1.3 → 7.1.5)\n- **Minor upgrade**: Same major, different minor (e.g., 7.1.3 → 7.2.0)\n- **Major upgrade**: Different major version (e.g., 7.1.3 → 8.0.0)\n\n## Step 5: Fetch Upgrade Guide\n\nUse WebFetch to get the official Rails upgrade guide:\n\nURL: `https://guides.rubyonrails.org/upgrading_ruby_on_rails.html`\n\nLook for sections relevant to the version jump. The guide is organized by target version with sections like:\n- \"Upgrading from Rails X.Y to Rails X.Z\"\n- Breaking changes\n- Deprecation warnings\n- Configuration changes\n- Required migrations\n\nExtract and summarize the relevant sections for the user''s specific upgrade path.\n\n## Step 6: Fetch Rails Diff\n\nUse WebFetch to get the diff between versions from railsdiff.org:\n\nURL: `https://railsdiff.org/{current_version}/{target_version}`\n\nFor example: `https://railsdiff.org/7.1.3/8.0.0`\n\nThis shows:\n- Changes to default configuration files\n- New files that need to be added\n- Modified initializers\n- Updated dependencies\n- Changes to bin/ scripts\n\nSummarize the key file changes.\n\n## Step 7: Check JavaScript Dependencies\n\nRails applications often include JavaScript packages that should be updated alongside Rails. Check for and report on these dependencies.\n\n### 7.1: Identify JS Package Manager\n\nCheck which package manager the app uses:\n\n```bash\n# Check for package.json (npm/yarn)\nls package.json 2>/dev/null\n\n# Check for importmap (Rails 7+)\nls config/importmap.rb 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n### 7.2: Check Rails-Related JS Packages\n\nIf `package.json` exists, check for these Rails-related packages:\n\n```bash\n# Extract current versions of Rails-related packages\ncat package.json | grep -E ''\"@hotwired/|\"@rails/|\"stimulus\"|\"turbo-rails\"'' || echo \"No Rails JS packages found\"\n```\n\n**Key packages to check:**\n\n| Package | Purpose | Version Alignment |\n|---------|---------|-------------------|\n| `@hotwired/turbo-rails` | Turbo Drive/Frames/Streams | Should match Rails version era |\n| `@hotwired/stimulus` | Stimulus JS framework | Generally stable across Rails versions |\n| `@rails/actioncable` | WebSocket support | Should match Rails version |\n| `@rails/activestorage` | Direct uploads | Should match Rails version |\n| `@rails/actiontext` | Rich text editing | Should match Rails version |\n| `@rails/request.js` | Rails UJS replacement | Should match Rails version era |\n\n### 7.3: Check for Updates\n\nFor npm/yarn projects, check for available updates:\n\n```bash\n# Using npm\nnpm outdated @hotwired/turbo-rails @hotwired/stimulus @rails/actioncable @rails/activestorage 2>/dev/null\n\n# Or check latest versions directly\nnpm view @hotwired/turbo-rails version 2>/dev/null\nnpm view @rails/actioncable version 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n### 7.4: Check Importmap Pins (if applicable)\n\nIf the app uses importmap-rails, check `config/importmap.rb` for pinned versions:\n\n```bash\ncat config/importmap.rb | grep -E ''pin.*turbo|pin.*stimulus|pin.*@rails'' || echo \"No importmap pins found\"\n```\n\nTo update importmap pins:\n```bash\nbin/importmap pin @hotwired/turbo-rails\nbin/importmap pin @hotwired/stimulus\n```\n\n### 7.5: JS Dependency Summary\n\nInclude in the upgrade summary:\n\n```\n### JavaScript Dependencies\n\n**Package Manager**: [npm/yarn/importmap/none]\n\n| Package | Current | Latest | Action |\n|---------|---------|--------|--------|\n| @hotwired/turbo-rails | 8.0.4 | 8.0.12 | Update recommended |\n| @rails/actioncable | 7.1.0 | 8.0.0 | Update with Rails |\n| ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\n**Recommended JS Updates:**\n- Run `npm update @hotwired/turbo-rails` (or yarn equivalent)\n- Run `npm update @rails/actioncable @rails/activestorage` to match Rails version\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 8: Generate Upgrade Summary\n\nProvide a comprehensive summary including all findings from Steps 1-7:\n\n### Version Information\n- Current version: X.Y.Z\n- Latest version: A.B.C\n- Upgrade type: [Patch/Minor/Major]\n\n### Upgrade Complexity Assessment\n\nRate the upgrade as **Small**, **Medium**, or **Large** based on:\n\n| Factor | Small | Medium | Large |\n|--------|-------|--------|-------|\n| Version jump | Patch only | Minor version | Major version |\n| Breaking changes | None | Few, well-documented | Many, significant |\n| Config changes | Minimal | Moderate | Extensive |\n| Deprecations | None active | Some to address | Many requiring refactoring |\n| Dependencies | Compatible | Some updates needed | Major dependency updates |\n\n### Key Changes to Address\n\nList the most important changes the user needs to handle:\n1. Configuration file updates\n2. Deprecated methods/features to update\n3. New required dependencies\n4. Database migrations needed\n5. Breaking API changes\n\n### Recommended Upgrade Steps\n\n1. Update test suite and ensure passing\n2. Review deprecation warnings in current version\n3. Update Gemfile with new Rails version\n4. Run `bundle update rails`\n5. Update JavaScript dependencies (see JS Dependencies section)\n6. **DO NOT run `rails app:update` directly** - use the selective merge process below\n7. Run database migrations\n8. Run test suite\n9. Review and update deprecated code\n\n### Resources\n\n- Rails Upgrade Guide: https://guides.rubyonrails.org/upgrading_ruby_on_rails.html\n- Rails Diff: https://railsdiff.org/{current}/{target}\n- Release Notes: https://github.com/rails/rails/releases/tag/v{target}\n\n---\n\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nAnalyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments\n\nUse this skill when working with analyze rails apps and provide upgrade assessments.\n## Step 9: Selective File Update (replaces `rails app:update`)\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Do NOT run `rails app:update` as it overwrites files without considering local customizations. Instead, follow this selective merge process:\n\n### 9.1: Detect Local Customizations\n\nBefore any upgrade, identify files with local customizations:\n\n```bash\n# Check for uncommitted changes\ngit status\n\n# List config files that differ from a fresh Rails app\n# These are the files we need to be careful with\ngit diff HEAD --name-only -- config/ bin/ public/\n```\n\nCreate a mental list of files in these categories:\n- **Custom config files**: Files with project-specific settings (i18n, mailer, etc.)\n- **Modified bin scripts**: Scripts with custom behavior (bin/dev with foreman, etc.)\n- **Standard files**: Files that haven''t been customized\n\n### 9.2: Analyze Required Changes from Railsdiff\n\nBased on the railsdiff output from Step 6, categorize each changed file:\n\n| Category | Action | Example |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| **New files** | Create directly | `config/initializers/new_framework_defaults_X_Y.rb` |\n| **Unchanged locally** | Safe to overwrite | `public/404.html` (if not customized) |\n| **Customized locally** | Manual merge needed | `config/application.rb`, `bin/dev` |\n| **Comment-only changes** | Usually skip | Minor comment updates in config files |\n\n### 9.3: Create Upgrade Plan\n\nPresent the user with a clear upgrade plan:\n\n```\n## Upgrade Plan: Rails X.Y.Z → A.B.C\n\n### New Files (will be created):\n- config/initializers/new_framework_defaults_A_B.rb\n- bin/ci (new CI script)\n\n### Safe to Update (no local customizations):\n- public/400.html\n- public/404.html\n- public/500.html\n\n### Needs Manual Merge (local customizations detected):\n- config/application.rb\n  └─ Local: i18n configuration\n  └─ Rails: [describe new Rails changes if any]\n\n- config/environments/development.rb\n  └─ Local: letter_opener mailer config\n  └─ Rails: [describe new Rails changes]\n\n- bin/dev\n  └─ Local: foreman + Procfile.dev setup\n  └─ Rails: changed to simple ruby script\n\n### Skip (comment-only or irrelevant changes):\n- config/puma.rb (only comment changes)\n```\n\n### 9.4: Execute Upgrade Plan\n\nAfter user confirms the plan:\n\n#### For New Files:\nCreate them directly using the content from railsdiff or by extracting from a fresh Rails app:\n\n```bash\n# Generate a temporary fresh Rails app to extract new files\ncd /tmp && rails new rails_template --skip-git --skip-bundle\n# Then copy needed files\n```\n\nOr use the Rails generator for specific files:\n```bash\nbin/rails app:update:configs  # Only updates config files, still interactive\n```\n\n#### For Safe Updates:\nOverwrite these files as they have no local customizations.\n\n#### For Manual Merges:\nFor each file needing merge, show the user:\n\n1. **Current local version** (their customizations)\n2. **New Rails default** (from railsdiff)\n3. **Suggested merged version** that:\n   - Keeps all local customizations\n   - Adds only essential new Rails functionality\n   - Removes deprecated settings\n\nExample merge for `config/application.rb`:\n```ruby\n# KEEP local customizations:\nconfig.i18n.available_locales = [:de, :en]\nconfig.i18n.default_locale = :de\nconfig.i18n.fallbacks = [:en]\n\n# ADD new Rails 8.1 settings if needed:\n# (usually none required - new defaults come via new_framework_defaults file)\n```\n\n### 9.5: Handle Active Storage Migrations\n\nAfter file updates, run any new migrations:\n\n```bash\nbin/rails db:migrate\n```\n\nCheck for new migrations that were added:\n```bash\nls -la db/migrate/ | tail -10\n```\n\n### 9.6: Verify Upgrade\n\nAfter completing the merge:\n\n1. Start the Rails server and check for errors:\n   ```bash\n   bin/dev  # or bin/rails server\n   ```\n\n2. Check the Rails console:\n   ```bash\n   bin/rails console\n   ```\n\n3. Run the test suite:\n   ```bash\n   bin/rails test\n   ```\n\n4. Review deprecation warnings in logs\n\n---\n\n## Step 10: Finalize Framework Defaults\n\nAfter verifying the app works:\n\n1. Review `config/initializers/new_framework_defaults_X_Y.rb`\n2. Enable each new default one by one, testing after each\n3. Once all defaults are enabled and tested, update `config/application.rb`:\n   ```ruby\n   config.load_defaults X.Y  # Update to new version\n   ```\n4. Delete the `new_framework_defaults_X_Y.rb` file\n\n---\n\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nAnalyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments\n\nUse this skill when working with analyze rails apps and provide upgrade assessments.\n## Error Handling\n\n- If `gh` CLI is not authenticated, instruct the user to run `gh auth login`\n- If railsdiff.org doesn''t have the exact versions, try with major.minor.0 versions\n- If the app is already on the latest version, congratulate the user and note any upcoming releases\n- If local customizations would be lost, ALWAYS stop and show the user what would be overwritten before proceeding\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Never overwrite without checking** - Always check for local customizations first\n2. **Preserve user intent** - Local customizations exist for a reason\n3. **Minimal changes** - Only add what''s necessary for the new Rails version\n4. **Transparency** - Show the user exactly what will change before doing it\n5. **Reversibility** - User should be able to `git checkout` to restore if needed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:08:20.665Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Ruby-focused Agents needing advanced Rails application analysis and upgrade planning capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Rails 应用程序分析和升级规划能力的 Ruby 专注代理。","ja":"Ruby に焦点を当てたエージェントが高度な Rails アプリケーション分析とアップグレード計画機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Rails 애플리케이션 분석 및 업그레이드 계획 기능이 필요한 Ruby 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en Ruby que necesitan capacidades de análisis y planificación de actualización de aplicaciones Rails avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur Ruby nécessitant des capacités d''analyse et de planification de mise à niveau d''applications Rails avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Ruby-fokussierte Agenten, die erweiterte Rails-Anwendungsanalyse- und Upgrade-Planungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Ruby que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise e planejamento de atualização de aplicativos Rails.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на Ruby, которым необходимы расширенные возможности анализа и планирования обновления приложений Rails.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المهتمين بلغة Ruby الذين يحتاجون إلى القدرات المتقدمة لتحليل وتخطيط ترقية تطبيقات Rails."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze Rails applications and provide comprehensive upgrade assessments with selective file merging, utilizing files like ''Gemfile'' and ''config/application.rb'' to verify Rails applications and assess upgrade requirements.","zh":"赋予代理分析 Rails 应用程序和提供全面的升级评估能力，利用诸如 ''Gemfile'' 和 ''config/application.rb'' 之类的文件来验证 Rails 应用程序并评估升级需求，同时支持选择性文件合并。","ja":"エージェントが Rails アプリケーションを分析し、選択的なファイル統合を使用して包括的なアップグレード評価を提供する能力を付与します。''Gemfile'' や ''config/application.rb'' などのファイルを使用して Rails アプリケーションを検証し、アップグレード要件を評価します。","ko":"에이전트가 Rails 애플리케이션을 분석하고 선택적 파일 병합을 사용하여 포괄적인 업그레이드 평가를 제공할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다. ''Gemfile'' 및 ''config/application.rb''와 같은 파일을 사용하여 Rails 애플리케이션을 확인하고 업그레이드 요구 사항을 평가합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar aplicaciones Rails y proporcionar evaluaciones de actualización comprehensivas con fusión selectiva de archivos, utilizando archivos como ''Gemfile'' y ''config/application.rb'' para verificar aplicaciones Rails y evaluar los requisitos de actualización.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les applications Rails et de fournir des évaluations de mise à niveau complètes avec une fusion sélective de fichiers, en utilisant des fichiers tels que ''Gemfile'' et ''config/application.rb'' pour vérifier les applications Rails et évaluer les besoins de mise à niveau.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Rails-Anwendungen zu analysieren und umfassende Upgrade-Bewertungen mit selektivem Dateimerging bereitzustellen, indem Dateien wie ''Gemfile'' und ''config/application.rb'' verwendet werden, um Rails-Anwendungen zu überprüfen und Upgrade-Anforderungen zu bewerten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar aplicativos Rails e fornecer avaliações abrangentes de atualização com mesclagem seletiva de arquivos, utilizando arquivos como ''Gemfile'' e ''config/application.rb'' para verificar aplicativos Rails e avaliar os requisitos de atualização.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать приложения Rails и предоставлять всесторонние оценки обновления с избирательным слиянием файлов, используя файлы типа ''Gemfile'' и ''config/application.rb'' для проверки приложений Rails и оценки требований к обновлению.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحليل تطبيقات Rails وتقديم تقييمات شاملة للترقية مع دمج ملفات انتقائي، باستخدام ملفات مثل ''Gemfile'' و ''config/application.rb'' للتحقق من تطبيقات Rails وتقييم متطلبات الترقية."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Rails apps for upgrade compatibility","Generating comprehensive upgrade assessments","Merging selective files for seamless upgrades"],"zh":["分析 Rails 应用程序以检查升级兼容性","生成全面的升级评估","合并选择性文件以实现无缝升级"],"ja":["アップグレードの互換性を確認するための Rails アプリケーションの分析","包括的なアップグレード評価の生成","シームレスなアップグレードを実現するための選択的なファイルの統合"],"ko":["업그레이드 호환성을 확인하기 위한 Rails 애플리케이션 분석","포괄적인 업그레이드 평가 생성","무결점 업그레이드를 위한 선택적 파일 병합"],"es":["Analizar aplicaciones Rails para la compatibilidad de actualización","Generar evaluaciones de actualización comprehensivas","Combinar archivos selectivos para actualizaciones sin problemas"],"fr":["Analyser les applications Rails pour la compatibilité de mise à niveau","Générer des évaluations de mise à niveau complètes","Fusionner des fichiers sélectifs pour des mises à niveau sans problème"],"de":["Rails-Anwendungen auf Upgrade-Kompatibilität analysieren","Umfassende Upgrade-Bewertungen generieren","Selektive Dateien für reibungslose Upgrades zusammenführen"],"pt":["Analisar aplicativos Rails para compatibilidade de atualização","Gerar avaliações abrangentes de atualização","Mesclar arquivos seletivos para atualizações sem interrupção"],"ru":["Анализ приложений Rails для совместимости обновления","Генерация всесторонних оценок обновления","Слияние избирательных файлов для бесшовного обновления"],"ar":["تحليل تطبيقات Rails للتوافق مع الترقية","生成 تقييمات شاملة للترقية","دمج الملفات الانتقائية لترقية بدون انقطاع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires presence of ''Gemfile'' and ''config/application.rb'' files","Limited to Rails applications only"],"zh":["需要 ''Gemfile'' 和 ''config/application.rb'' 文件存在","仅限 Rails 应用程序"],"ja":["''Gemfile'' と ''config/application.rb'' ファイルの存在が必要","Rails アプリケーションにのみ限られる"],"ko":["''Gemfile'' 및 ''config/application.rb'' 파일 존재 필요","Rails 애플리케이션에만 한정"],"es":["Requiere la presencia de los archivos ''Gemfile'' y ''config/application.rb''","Limitado a aplicaciones Rails solo"],"fr":["Requiert la présence des fichiers ''Gemfile'' et ''config/application.rb''","Limité aux applications Rails uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert die Anwesenheit der Dateien ''Gemfile'' und ''config/application.rb''","Begrenzt auf Rails-Anwendungen nur"],"pt":["Exige a presença dos arquivos ''Gemfile'' e ''config/application.rb''","Limitado apenas a aplicativos Rails"],"ru":["Требует наличия файлов ''Gemfile'' и ''config/application.rb''","Ограничен только приложениями Rails"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود ملفات ''Gemfile'' و ''config/application.rb''","محدود بتطبيقات Rails فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block/skill-rails-upgrade', 'community', 'andre-sugai', 'cine-explorer-mvp-block', 'andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block', 'skill-rails-upgrade', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z', '2026-02-18T09:08:37.164Z', NULL, '{"id":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block/skill-rails-upgrade","name":"skill-rails-upgrade","description":{"zh":"Rails 升级分析工具用于分析 Rails 应用程序并提供升级评估，帮助开发者优化应用程序","ja":"Rails アップグレード アナライザーは、Rails アプリケーションを分析し、アップグレード評価を提供することで、開発者がアプリケーションを最適化するのに役立ちます","ko":"Rails 업그레이드 분석기는 Rails 애플리케이션을 분석하고 업그레이드 평가를 제공하여 개발자가 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El analizador de actualización de Rails ayuda a identificar áreas de mejora en su aplicación y proporciona un informe detallado para una actualización segura.","fr":"L''outil d''analyse de mise à niveau de Rails aide à identifier les domaines d''amélioration dans votre application et fournit un rapport détaillé pour une mise à niveau sécurisée.","de":"Das Rails-Upgrade-Analyse-Tool hilft bei der Identifizierung von Verbesserungsbereichen in Ihrer Anwendung und liefert einen detaillierten Bericht für ein sicheres Upgrade.","pt":"Análise de aplicativos Rails e avaliação de upgrade para melhorar o desempenho","ru":"Анализ приложений Rails и оценка обновления для улучшения производительности","ar":"تحليل تطبيقات ريلز وتقييم الترقية لتحسين الأداء","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Rails 升级分析工具","ja":"Rails アップグレード アナライザー","ko":"Rails 업그레이드 분석기","es":"Analizador de Actualización de Rails","fr":"Analyseur de Mise à Niveau de Rails","de":"Rails-Upgrade-Analyse","pt":"Otimização de Upgrade do Rails","ru":"Улучшение обновления Rails","ar":"تحسين ترقية ريلز","en":"skill-rails-upgrade"},"description":{"zh":"Rails 升级分析工具用于分析 Rails 应用程序并提供升级评估，帮助开发者优化应用程序","ja":"Rails アップグレード アナライザーは、Rails アプリケーションを分析し、アップグレード評価を提供することで、開発者がアプリケーションを最適化するのに役立ちます","ko":"Rails 업그레이드 분석기는 Rails 애플리케이션을 분석하고 업그레이드 평가를 제공하여 개발자가 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El analizador de actualización de Rails ayuda a identificar áreas de mejora en su aplicación y proporciona un informe detallado para una actualización segura.","fr":"L''outil d''analyse de mise à niveau de Rails aide à identifier les domaines d''amélioration dans votre application et fournit un rapport détaillé pour une mise...","de":"Das Rails-Upgrade-Analyse-Tool hilft bei der Identifizierung von Verbesserungsbereichen in Ihrer Anwendung und liefert einen detaillierten Bericht für ein si...","pt":"Análise de aplicativos Rails e avaliação de upgrade para melhorar o desempenho","ru":"Анализ приложений Rails и оценка обновления для улучшения производительности","ar":"تحليل تطبيقات ريلز وتقييم الترقية لتحسين الأداء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分析 Rails 应用程序","提供升级评估","选择性文件合并","验证 Rails 应用程序","检查 Gemfile 和 config/application.rb"],"ja":["Rails アプリケーションの分析","アップグレード評価の提供","選択的なファイルのマージ","Rails アプリケーションの検証","Gemfile と config/application.rb の確認"],"ko":["Rails 애플리케이션 분석","업그레이드 평가 제공","선택적 파일 병합","Rails 애플리케이션 검증","Gemfile 및 config/application.rb 확인"],"es":["Análisis de la aplicación Rails","Informe detallado de actualización","Verificación de la aplicación Rails","Fusión selectiva de archivos","Recomendaciones para una actualización segura"],"fr":["Analyse de l''application Rails","Rapport détaillé de mise à niveau","Vérification de l''application Rails","Fusion sélective de fichiers","Recommandations pour une mise à niveau sécurisée"],"de":["Analyse der Rails-Anwendung","Detaillierter Upgrade-Bericht","Überprüfung der Rails-Anwendung","Selektive Dateifusion","Empfehlungen für ein sicheres Upgrade"],"pt":["Análise de aplicativos Rails","Avaliação de upgrade","Mesclagem seletiva de arquivos","Verificação de aplicativos Rails","Análise de dependências"],"ru":["Анализ приложений Rails","Оценка обновления","Выборочное слияние файлов","Проверка приложений Rails","Анализ зависимостей"],"ar":["تحليل تطبيقات ريلز","تقييم الترقية","دمج ملفات انتقائي","تحقق من تطبيقات ريلز","تحليل الاعتماديات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rails 升级","Rails 分析","Rails 优化","Rails 性能","Rails 安全","Rails 开发"],"ja":["Rails アップグレード","Rails 分析","Rails 最適化","Rails パフォーマンス","Rails セキュリティ","Rails 開発"],"ko":["Rails 업그레이드","Rails 분석","Rails 최적화","Rails 성능","Rails 보안","Rails 개발"],"es":["actualización de Rails","análisis de aplicación","informe de actualización","verificación de Rails","fusión de archivos","recomendaciones de actualización"],"fr":["mise à niveau de Rails","analyse d''application","rapport de mise à niveau","vérification de Rails","fusion de fichiers","recommandations de mise à niveau"],"de":["Rails-Upgrade","Anwendungsanalyse","Upgrade-Bericht","Rails-Überprüfung","Dateifusion","Upgrade-Empfehlungen"],"pt":["upgrade do rails","otimização de aplicativos","análise de desempenho","ferramenta de upgrade","aplicativos rails","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["обновление rails","оптимизация приложений","анализ производительности","инструмент обновления","приложения rails","веб-разработка"],"ar":["ترقية ريلز","تحسين تطبيقات","تحليل الأداء","أداة ترقية","تطبيقات ريلز","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-rails-upgrade","description":"Analyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments","bodyPreview":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nAnalyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments\n\nUse this skill when working with analyze rails apps and provide upgrade assessments.\n# Rails Upgrade Analyzer\n\nAnalyze the current Rails application and provide a comprehensive upgrade assessment with selective file merging.\n\n## Step 1: Verify Rails Application\n\nCheck that we''re in a Rails application by looking for these files:\n- `Gemfile` (must exist and contain ''rails'')\n- `config/application.rb` (Rails application","body":"## When to Use This Skill\n\nAnalyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments\n\nUse this skill when working with analyze rails apps and provide upgrade assessments.\n# Rails Upgrade Analyzer\n\nAnalyze the current Rails application and provide a comprehensive upgrade assessment with selective file merging.\n\n## Step 1: Verify Rails Application\n\nCheck that we''re in a Rails application by looking for these files:\n- `Gemfile` (must exist and contain ''rails'')\n- `config/application.rb` (Rails application config)\n- `config/environment.rb` (Rails environment)\n\nIf any of these are missing or don''t indicate a Rails app, stop and inform the user this doesn''t appear to be a Rails application.\n\n## Step 2: Get Current Rails Version\n\nExtract the current Rails version from:\n1. First, check `Gemfile.lock` for the exact installed version (look for `rails (x.y.z)`)\n2. If not found, check `Gemfile` for the version constraint\n\nReport the exact current version (e.g., `7.1.3`).\n\n## Step 3: Find Latest Rails Version\n\nUse the GitHub CLI to fetch the latest Rails release:\n\n```bash\ngh api repos/rails/rails/releases/latest --jq ''.tag_name''\n```\n\nThis returns the latest stable version tag (e.g., `v8.0.1`). Strip the ''v'' prefix for comparison.\n\nAlso check recent tags to understand the release landscape:\n\n```bash\ngh api repos/rails/rails/tags --jq ''.[0:10] | .[].name''\n```\n\n## Step 4: Determine Upgrade Type\n\nCompare current and latest versions to classify the upgrade:\n\n- **Patch upgrade**: Same major.minor, different patch (e.g., 7.1.3 → 7.1.5)\n- **Minor upgrade**: Same major, different minor (e.g., 7.1.3 → 7.2.0)\n- **Major upgrade**: Different major version (e.g., 7.1.3 → 8.0.0)\n\n## Step 5: Fetch Upgrade Guide\n\nUse WebFetch to get the official Rails upgrade guide:\n\nURL: `https://guides.rubyonrails.org/upgrading_ruby_on_rails.html`\n\nLook for sections relevant to the version jump. The guide is organized by target version with sections like:\n- \"Upgrading from Rails X.Y to Rails X.Z\"\n- Breaking changes\n- Deprecation warnings\n- Configuration changes\n- Required migrations\n\nExtract and summarize the relevant sections for the user''s specific upgrade path.\n\n## Step 6: Fetch Rails Diff\n\nUse WebFetch to get the diff between versions from railsdiff.org:\n\nURL: `https://railsdiff.org/{current_version}/{target_version}`\n\nFor example: `https://railsdiff.org/7.1.3/8.0.0`\n\nThis shows:\n- Changes to default configuration files\n- New files that need to be added\n- Modified initializers\n- Updated dependencies\n- Changes to bin/ scripts\n\nSummarize the key file changes.\n\n## Step 7: Check JavaScript Dependencies\n\nRails applications often include JavaScript packages that should be updated alongside Rails. Check for and report on these dependencies.\n\n### 7.1: Identify JS Package Manager\n\nCheck which package manager the app uses:\n\n```bash\n# Check for package.json (npm/yarn)\nls package.json 2>/dev/null\n\n# Check for importmap (Rails 7+)\nls config/importmap.rb 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n### 7.2: Check Rails-Related JS Packages\n\nIf `package.json` exists, check for these Rails-related packages:\n\n```bash\n# Extract current versions of Rails-related packages\ncat package.json | grep -E ''\"@hotwired/|\"@rails/|\"stimulus\"|\"turbo-rails\"'' || echo \"No Rails JS packages found\"\n```\n\n**Key packages to check:**\n\n| Package | Purpose | Version Alignment |\n|---------|---------|-------------------|\n| `@hotwired/turbo-rails` | Turbo Drive/Frames/Streams | Should match Rails version era |\n| `@hotwired/stimulus` | Stimulus JS framework | Generally stable across Rails versions |\n| `@rails/actioncable` | WebSocket support | Should match Rails version |\n| `@rails/activestorage` | Direct uploads | Should match Rails version |\n| `@rails/actiontext` | Rich text editing | Should match Rails version |\n| `@rails/request.js` | Rails UJS replacement | Should match Rails version era |\n\n### 7.3: Check for Updates\n\nFor npm/yarn projects, check for available updates:\n\n```bash\n# Using npm\nnpm outdated @hotwired/turbo-rails @hotwired/stimulus @rails/actioncable @rails/activestorage 2>/dev/null\n\n# Or check latest versions directly\nnpm view @hotwired/turbo-rails version 2>/dev/null\nnpm view @rails/actioncable version 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n### 7.4: Check Importmap Pins (if applicable)\n\nIf the app uses importmap-rails, check `config/importmap.rb` for pinned versions:\n\n```bash\ncat config/importmap.rb | grep -E ''pin.*turbo|pin.*stimulus|pin.*@rails'' || echo \"No importmap pins found\"\n```\n\nTo update importmap pins:\n```bash\nbin/importmap pin @hotwired/turbo-rails\nbin/importmap pin @hotwired/stimulus\n```\n\n### 7.5: JS Dependency Summary\n\nInclude in the upgrade summary:\n\n```\n### JavaScript Dependencies\n\n**Package Manager**: [npm/yarn/importmap/none]\n\n| Package | Current | Latest | Action |\n|---------|---------|--------|--------|\n| @hotwired/turbo-rails | 8.0.4 | 8.0.12 | Update recommended |\n| @rails/actioncable | 7.1.0 | 8.0.0 | Update with Rails |\n| ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\n**Recommended JS Updates:**\n- Run `npm update @hotwired/turbo-rails` (or yarn equivalent)\n- Run `npm update @rails/actioncable @rails/activestorage` to match Rails version\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 8: Generate Upgrade Summary\n\nProvide a comprehensive summary including all findings from Steps 1-7:\n\n### Version Information\n- Current version: X.Y.Z\n- Latest version: A.B.C\n- Upgrade type: [Patch/Minor/Major]\n\n### Upgrade Complexity Assessment\n\nRate the upgrade as **Small**, **Medium**, or **Large** based on:\n\n| Factor | Small | Medium | Large |\n|--------|-------|--------|-------|\n| Version jump | Patch only | Minor version | Major version |\n| Breaking changes | None | Few, well-documented | Many, significant |\n| Config changes | Minimal | Moderate | Extensive |\n| Deprecations | None active | Some to address | Many requiring refactoring |\n| Dependencies | Compatible | Some updates needed | Major dependency updates |\n\n### Key Changes to Address\n\nList the most important changes the user needs to handle:\n1. Configuration file updates\n2. Deprecated methods/features to update\n3. New required dependencies\n4. Database migrations needed\n5. Breaking API changes\n\n### Recommended Upgrade Steps\n\n1. Update test suite and ensure passing\n2. Review deprecation warnings in current version\n3. Update Gemfile with new Rails version\n4. Run `bundle update rails`\n5. Update JavaScript dependencies (see JS Dependencies section)\n6. **DO NOT run `rails app:update` directly** - use the selective merge process below\n7. Run database migrations\n8. Run test suite\n9. Review and update deprecated code\n\n### Resources\n\n- Rails Upgrade Guide: https://guides.rubyonrails.org/upgrading_ruby_on_rails.html\n- Rails Diff: https://railsdiff.org/{current}/{target}\n- Release Notes: https://github.com/rails/rails/releases/tag/v{target}\n\n---\n\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nAnalyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments\n\nUse this skill when working with analyze rails apps and provide upgrade assessments.\n## Step 9: Selective File Update (replaces `rails app:update`)\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Do NOT run `rails app:update` as it overwrites files without considering local customizations. Instead, follow this selective merge process:\n\n### 9.1: Detect Local Customizations\n\nBefore any upgrade, identify files with local customizations:\n\n```bash\n# Check for uncommitted changes\ngit status\n\n# List config files that differ from a fresh Rails app\n# These are the files we need to be careful with\ngit diff HEAD --name-only -- config/ bin/ public/\n```\n\nCreate a mental list of files in these categories:\n- **Custom config files**: Files with project-specific settings (i18n, mailer, etc.)\n- **Modified bin scripts**: Scripts with custom behavior (bin/dev with foreman, etc.)\n- **Standard files**: Files that haven''t been customized\n\n### 9.2: Analyze Required Changes from Railsdiff\n\nBased on the railsdiff output from Step 6, categorize each changed file:\n\n| Category | Action | Example |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| **New files** | Create directly | `config/initializers/new_framework_defaults_X_Y.rb` |\n| **Unchanged locally** | Safe to overwrite | `public/404.html` (if not customized) |\n| **Customized locally** | Manual merge needed | `config/application.rb`, `bin/dev` |\n| **Comment-only changes** | Usually skip | Minor comment updates in config files |\n\n### 9.3: Create Upgrade Plan\n\nPresent the user with a clear upgrade plan:\n\n```\n## Upgrade Plan: Rails X.Y.Z → A.B.C\n\n### New Files (will be created):\n- config/initializers/new_framework_defaults_A_B.rb\n- bin/ci (new CI script)\n\n### Safe to Update (no local customizations):\n- public/400.html\n- public/404.html\n- public/500.html\n\n### Needs Manual Merge (local customizations detected):\n- config/application.rb\n  └─ Local: i18n configuration\n  └─ Rails: [describe new Rails changes if any]\n\n- config/environments/development.rb\n  └─ Local: letter_opener mailer config\n  └─ Rails: [describe new Rails changes]\n\n- bin/dev\n  └─ Local: foreman + Procfile.dev setup\n  └─ Rails: changed to simple ruby script\n\n### Skip (comment-only or irrelevant changes):\n- config/puma.rb (only comment changes)\n```\n\n### 9.4: Execute Upgrade Plan\n\nAfter user confirms the plan:\n\n#### For New Files:\nCreate them directly using the content from railsdiff or by extracting from a fresh Rails app:\n\n```bash\n# Generate a temporary fresh Rails app to extract new files\ncd /tmp && rails new rails_template --skip-git --skip-bundle\n# Then copy needed files\n```\n\nOr use the Rails generator for specific files:\n```bash\nbin/rails app:update:configs  # Only updates config files, still interactive\n```\n\n#### For Safe Updates:\nOverwrite these files as they have no local customizations.\n\n#### For Manual Merges:\nFor each file needing merge, show the user:\n\n1. **Current local version** (their customizations)\n2. **New Rails default** (from railsdiff)\n3. **Suggested merged version** that:\n   - Keeps all local customizations\n   - Adds only essential new Rails functionality\n   - Removes deprecated settings\n\nExample merge for `config/application.rb`:\n```ruby\n# KEEP local customizations:\nconfig.i18n.available_locales = [:de, :en]\nconfig.i18n.default_locale = :de\nconfig.i18n.fallbacks = [:en]\n\n# ADD new Rails 8.1 settings if needed:\n# (usually none required - new defaults come via new_framework_defaults file)\n```\n\n### 9.5: Handle Active Storage Migrations\n\nAfter file updates, run any new migrations:\n\n```bash\nbin/rails db:migrate\n```\n\nCheck for new migrations that were added:\n```bash\nls -la db/migrate/ | tail -10\n```\n\n### 9.6: Verify Upgrade\n\nAfter completing the merge:\n\n1. Start the Rails server and check for errors:\n   ```bash\n   bin/dev  # or bin/rails server\n   ```\n\n2. Check the Rails console:\n   ```bash\n   bin/rails console\n   ```\n\n3. Run the test suite:\n   ```bash\n   bin/rails test\n   ```\n\n4. Review deprecation warnings in logs\n\n---\n\n## Step 10: Finalize Framework Defaults\n\nAfter verifying the app works:\n\n1. Review `config/initializers/new_framework_defaults_X_Y.rb`\n2. Enable each new default one by one, testing after each\n3. Once all defaults are enabled and tested, update `config/application.rb`:\n   ```ruby\n   config.load_defaults X.Y  # Update to new version\n   ```\n4. Delete the `new_framework_defaults_X_Y.rb` file\n\n---\n\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nAnalyze Rails apps and provide upgrade assessments\n\nUse this skill when working with analyze rails apps and provide upgrade assessments.\n## Error Handling\n\n- If `gh` CLI is not authenticated, instruct the user to run `gh auth login`\n- If railsdiff.org doesn''t have the exact versions, try with major.minor.0 versions\n- If the app is already on the latest version, congratulate the user and note any upcoming releases\n- If local customizations would be lost, ALWAYS stop and show the user what would be overwritten before proceeding\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Never overwrite without checking** - Always check for local customizations first\n2. **Preserve user intent** - Local customizations exist for a reason\n3. **Minimal changes** - Only add what''s necessary for the new Rails version\n4. **Transparency** - Show the user exactly what will change before doing it\n5. **Reversibility** - User should be able to `git checkout` to restore if needed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:08:37.164Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Ruby-focused Agents needing advanced Rails application analysis and upgrade assessments.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Rails 应用程序分析和升级评估的 Ruby 专注代理。","ja":"Ruby に焦点を当てたエージェントが高度な Rails アプリケーション分析とアップグレード評価を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Rails 애플리케이션 분석 및 업그레이드 평가가 필요한 Ruby 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en Ruby que necesitan análisis y evaluaciones de actualización de aplicaciones avanzadas de Rails.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur Ruby nécessitant une analyse et des évaluations de mise à niveau d''applications Rails avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Ruby-fokussierte Agenten, die erweiterte Analysen und Upgrade-Bewertungen für Rails-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em Ruby que necessitam de análise avançada de aplicativos Rails e avaliações de upgrade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на Ruby, которые требуют продвинутого анализа приложений Rails и оценок обновления.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على روبي والذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم لتطبيقات ريلز وتقييمات للترقية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze Rails applications, providing comprehensive upgrade assessments with selective file merging, by verifying the presence of critical files like ''Gemfile'' and ''config/application.rb''.","zh":"使代理能够分析 Rails 应用程序，并通过验证 ''Gemfile'' 和 ''config/application.rb'' 等关键文件的存在，提供全面升级评估和选择性文件合并。","ja":"エージェントが Rails アプリケーションを分析し、''Gemfile'' および ''config/application.rb'' などの重要なファイルの存在を確認することで、包括的なアップグレード評価と選択的なファイルのマージを提供する。","ko":"에이전트가 Rails 애플리케이션을 분석하여 ''Gemfile'' 및 ''config/application.rb''와 같은 중요한 파일의 존재를 확인하고, 완전한 업그레이드 평가 및 선택적 파일 병합을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para analizar aplicaciones de Rails, proporcionando evaluaciones de actualización completas con fusión de archivos selectivos, verificando la presencia de archivos críticos como ''Gemfile'' y ''config/application.rb''.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les applications Rails, fournissant des évaluations de mise à niveau complètes avec fusion de fichiers sélectifs, en vérifiant la présence de fichiers critiques tels que ''Gemfile'' et ''config/application.rb''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Rails-Anwendungen zu analysieren und umfassende Upgrade-Bewertungen mit selektiver Dateizusammenführung bereitzustellen, indem sie die Anwesenheit kritischer Dateien wie ''Gemfile'' und ''config/application.rb'' überprüfen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar aplicativos Rails, fornecendo avaliações de upgrade abrangentes com mesclagem seletiva de arquivos, verificando a presença de arquivos críticos como ''Gemfile'' e ''config/application.rb''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать приложения Rails, предоставляя комплексные оценки обновления с избирательным слиянием файлов, проверяя наличие критических файлов, таких как ''Gemfile'' и ''config/application.rb''.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تحليل تطبيقات ريلز، وتقديم تقييمات ترقية شاملة مع دمج ملفات انتقائي، من خلال التحقق من وجود ملفات حرجة مثل ''Gemfile'' و ''config/application.rb''."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Rails apps for upgrade readiness","Generating comprehensive upgrade assessments","Merging selective files for seamless upgrades"],"zh":["分析 Rails 应用程序的升级准备情况","生成全面升级评估","合并选择性文件以实现无缝升级"],"ja":["Rails アプリケーションのアップグレードの準備状況を分析する","包括的なアップグレード評価を生成する","選択的なファイルをマージして無停止アップグレードを実現する"],"ko":["Rails 애플리케이션의 업그레이드 준비 상태를 분석함","포괄적인 업그레이드 평가를 생성함","선택적인 파일을 병합하여 무중단 업그레이드를 달성함"],"es":["Análisis de aplicaciones de Rails para la preparación de actualizaciones","Generación de evaluaciones de actualización completas","Fusión de archivos selectivos para actualizaciones sin problemas"],"fr":["Analyse d''applications Rails pour la préparation des mises à niveau","Génération d''évaluations de mise à niveau complètes","Fusion de fichiers sélectifs pour des mises à niveau sans problème"],"de":["Analyse von Rails-Anwendungen für die Upgrade-Vorbereitung","Erstellung umfassender Upgrade-Bewertungen","Zusammenführung von ausgewählten Dateien für reibungslose Upgrades"],"pt":["Analisar aplicativos Rails para prontidão de upgrade","Gerar avaliações de upgrade abrangentes","Mesclar arquivos seletivos para upgrades sem interrupções"],"ru":["Анализ приложений Rails на предмет готовности к обновлению","Генерация комплексных оценок обновления","Слияние избирательных файлов для бесшовных обновлений"],"ar":["تحليل تطبيقات ريلز لجاهزية الترقية","توليد تقييمات ترقية شاملة","دمج ملفات انتقائية لترقيات دون انقطاع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires presence of ''Gemfile'' and ''config/application.rb'' files","Specific to Rails applications"],"zh":["需要 ''Gemfile'' 和 ''config/application.rb'' 文件存在","仅限 Rails 应用程序"],"ja":["''Gemfile'' および ''config/application.rb'' ファイルの存在が必要","Rails アプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["''Gemfile'' 및 ''config/application.rb'' 파일의 존재가 필요함","Rails 애플리케이션 전용"],"es":["Requiere la presencia de los archivos ''Gemfile'' y ''config/application.rb''","Específico para aplicaciones de Rails"],"fr":["Nécessite la présence des fichiers ''Gemfile'' et ''config/application.rb''","Spécifique aux applications Rails"],"de":["Erfordert die Anwesenheit der Dateien ''Gemfile'' und ''config/application.rb''","Spezifisch für Rails-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige a presença de arquivos ''Gemfile'' e ''config/application.rb''","Específico para aplicativos Rails"],"ru":["Требует наличия файлов ''Gemfile'' и ''config/application.rb''","Конкретно для приложений Rails"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود ملفات ''Gemfile'' و ''config/application.rb''","محدد لتطبيقات ريلز"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
