 для производства","Поддержка TypeScript","Использование Rolldown bundler и Oxc transformer","Условная конфигурация с `loadEnv`"],"ar":["خادم تطوير سريع مع ESM أصلي","ترجمة إنتاج محسّنة","دعم TypeScript","استخدام Rolldown bundler و Oxc transformer","تكوين مشروط مع `loadEnv`"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vite","前端构建工具","TypeScript","ESM","快速开发服务器","优化生产构建","条件配置","环境变量加载"],"ja":["Vite","フロントエンド ビルド ツール","TypeScript","ESM","高速な開発サーバー","最適化されたプロダクション ビルド","条件付き構成","環境変数の読み込み"],"ko":["Vite","프론트엔드 빌드 도구","TypeScript","ESM","빠른 개발 서버","최적화된 프로덕션 빌드","조건부 구성","환경 변수 로드"],"es":["Vite","frontend","construcción de frontend","desarrollo web","TypeScript","ESM","CommonJS","compilaciones de producción"],"fr":["Vite","frontend","construction de frontend","développement web","TypeScript","ESM","CommonJS","compilations de production"],"de":["Vite","Frontend","Frontend-Build","Web-Entwicklung","TypeScript","ESM","CommonJS","Produktions-Builds"],"pt":["Vite","ferramenta de build frontend","servidor de desenvolvimento rápido","compilação de produção otimizada","TypeScript","Rolldown bundler","Oxc transformer","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Vite","инструмент сборки frontend","быстрый сервер разработки","оптимизированная сборка для производства","TypeScript","Rolldown bundler","Oxc transformer","веб-разработка"],"ar":["Vite","أداة بناء واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","خادم تطوير سريع","ترجمة إنتاج محسّنة","TypeScript","Rolldown bundler","Oxc transformer","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"WOOWOOYONG","repo":"Curl-Ticket","repoPath":"WOOWOOYONG/Curl-Ticket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vite","description":"Vite build tool configuration, plugin API, SSR, and Vite 8 Rolldown migration. Use when working with Vite projects, vite.config.ts, Vite plugins, or building libraries/SSR apps with Vite.","version":"2026.1.31","bodyPreview":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](refere","body":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| Features | `import.meta.glob`, asset queries (`?raw`, `?url`), `import.meta.env`, HMR API | [core-features](references/core-features.md) |\n| Plugin API | Vite-specific hooks, virtual modules, plugin ordering | [core-plugin-api](references/core-plugin-api.md) |\n\n## Build & SSR\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Build & SSR | Library mode, SSR middleware mode, `ssrLoadModule`, JavaScript API | [build-and-ssr](references/build-and-ssr.md) |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Environment API | Vite 6+ multi-environment support, custom runtimes | [environment-api](references/environment-api.md) |\n| Rolldown Migration | Vite 8 changes: Rolldown bundler, Oxc transformer, config migration | [rolldown-migration](references/rolldown-migration.md) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### CLI Commands\n\n```bash\nvite              # Start dev server\nvite build        # Production build\nvite preview      # Preview production build\nvite build --ssr  # SSR build\n```\n\n### Common Config\n\n```ts\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [],\n  resolve: { alias: { ''@'': ''/src'' } },\n  server: { port: 3000, proxy: { ''/api'': ''http://localhost:8080'' } },\n  build: { target: ''esnext'', outDir: ''dist'' },\n})\n```\n\n### Official Plugins\n\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue` - Vue 3 SFC support\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx` - Vue 3 JSX\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react` - React with Oxc/Babel\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react-swc` - React with SWC\n- `@vitejs/plugin-legacy` - Legacy browser support\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:08:39.851Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents needing fast and optimized build tools with native ESM and HMR support.","zh":"非常适合需要快速和优化的构建工具，并且支持原生 ESM 和 HMR 的前端开发代理。","ja":"フロントエンド開発エージェントが高速で最適化されたビルドツールを必要とする場合に最適です。ネイティブの ESM と HMR をサポートしています。","ko":"高速이고 최적화된 빌드 도구가 필요한 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 네이티브 ESM과 HMR를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo frontend que necesitan herramientas de compilación rápidas y optimizadas con soporte nativo para ESM y HMR.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement frontend ayant besoin d''outils de construction rapides et optimisés avec un support natif pour ESM et HMR.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die schnellere und optimierte Build-Tools mit nativem ESM- und HMR-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend que necessitam de ferramentas de compilação rápidas e otimizadas com suporte nativo a ESM e HMR.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки фронтенда, которым необходимы быстрые и оптимизированные инструменты сборки с родной поддержкой ESM и HMR.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل وكيل تطوير الواجهة الأمامية التي تحتاج إلى أدوات بناء سريعة ومحسنة مع دعم أصلي ل ESM و HMR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create fast dev servers and optimized production builds using Vite''s Rolldown-powered bundler and Oxc transformer, with support for TypeScript and ESM modules.","zh":"赋予代理创建快速的开发服务器和使用 Vite 的 Rolldown 动力打包器和 Oxc 转换器优化的生产构建的能力，支持 TypeScript 和 ESM 模块。","ja":"Vite の Rolldown パワードバンドラーと Oxc トランスフォーマーを使用して、TypeScript と ESM モジュールをサポートする快速な開発サーバーと最適化されたプロダクションビルドを作成するエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"Vite의 Rolldown 기반 번들러와 Oxc 트랜스포머를 사용하여 TypeScript와 ESM 모듈을 지원하는 빠른 개발 서버와 최적화된 프로덕션 빌드를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear servidores de desarrollo rápidos y compilaciones de producción optimizadas utilizando el empacador Rolldown de Vite y el transformador Oxc, con soporte para TypeScript y módulos ESM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des serveurs de développement rapides et des builds de production optimisés en utilisant le bundleur Rolldown de Vite et le transformateur Oxc, avec un support pour TypeScript et les modules ESM.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, schnelle Entwicklungsserver und optimierte Produktionsbuilds mit Vites Rolldown-basiertem Bundler und Oxc-Transformer zu erstellen, mit Unterstützung für TypeScript und ESM-Module.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar servidores de desenvolvimento rápidos e compilações de produção otimizadas usando o empacotador Rolldown do Vite e o transformador Oxc, com suporte para TypeScript e módulos ESM.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать быстрые серверы разработки и оптимизированные сборки производства с помощью пакетировщика Vite Rolldown и трансформатора Oxc, с поддержкой TypeScript и модулей ESM.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إنشاء خوادم تطوير سريعة وعمليات بناء الإنتاج المثلى باستخدام حزمة Vite Rolldown ومحول Oxc ، مع دعم ل TypeScript ووحدات ESM."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Vite projects with conditional configs and environment variables","Optimizing production builds for faster load times","Creating fast and responsive dev servers with native ESM and HMR support"],"zh":["使用条件配置和环境变量配置 Vite 项目","优化生产构建以实现更快的加载时间","创建快速响应的开发服务器，并支持原生 ESM 和 HMR"],"ja":["条件付き構成と環境変数を使用して Vite プロジェクトを構成する","プロダクション