poPath":"boomNDS/new_portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vite","description":"Vite build tool configuration, plugin API, SSR, and Vite 8 Rolldown migration. Use when working with Vite projects, vite.config.ts, Vite plugins, or building libraries/SSR apps with Vite.","version":"2026.1.31","bodyPreview":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](refere","body":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| Features | `import.meta.glob`, asset queries (`?raw`, `?url`), `import.meta.env`, HMR API | [core-features](references/core-features.md) |\n| Plugin API | Vite-specific hooks, virtual modules, plugin ordering | [core-plugin-api](references/core-plugin-api.md) |\n\n## Build & SSR\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Build & SSR | Library mode, SSR middleware mode, `ssrLoadModule`, JavaScript API | [build-and-ssr](references/build-and-ssr.md) |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Environment API | Vite 6+ multi-environment support, custom runtimes | [environment-api](references/environment-api.md) |\n| Rolldown Migration | Vite 8 changes: Rolldown bundler, Oxc transformer, config migration | [rolldown-migration](references/rolldown-migration.md) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### CLI Commands\n\n```bash\nvite              # Start dev server\nvite build        # Production build\nvite preview      # Preview production build\nvite build --ssr  # SSR build\n```\n\n### Common Config\n\n```ts\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [],\n  resolve: { alias: { ''@'': ''/src'' } },\n  server: { port: 3000, proxy: { ''/api'': ''http://localhost:8080'' } },\n  build: { target: ''esnext'', outDir: ''dist'' },\n})\n```\n\n### Official Plugins\n\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue` - Vue 3 SFC support\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx` - Vue 3 JSX\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react` - React with Oxc/Babel\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react-swc` - React with SWC\n- `@vitejs/plugin-legacy` - Legacy browser support\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:08:52.690Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing fast and optimized development server capabilities with native ESM and HMR support.","zh":"非常适合需要快速且优化的开发服务器功能的前端代理，具有原生 ESM 和 HMR 支持。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高速で最適化された開発サーバーキャパシティとネイティブの ESM および HMR サポートを必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 빠르고 최적화된 개발 서버 기능 및 네이티브 ESM 및 HMR 지원을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de servidor de desarrollo rápido y optimizado con soporte nativo para ESM y HMR.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de serveur de développement rapide et optimisé avec un support natif pour ESM et HMR.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine schnelle und optimierte Entwicklungsserver-Funktion mit nativem ESM- und HMR-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de servidor de desenvolvimento rápidas e otimizadas com suporte nativo a ESM e HMR.","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются быстрые и оптимизированные возможности сервера разработки с родной поддержкой ESM и HMR.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات خادم تطوير سريع ومحسّن مع دعم أصلي لمواصفات الشريط وأتمتة إعادة التحميل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build next-generation frontend applications using Vite''s fast dev server, optimized production builds, and Rolldown-powered bundler, while utilizing TypeScript and ESM modules for enhanced performance and maintainability.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Vite 的快速开发服务器、优化的生产构建和 Rolldown 驱动的捆绑器，利用 TypeScript 和 ESM 模块提高性能和可维护性，从而构建下一代前端应用程序。","ja":"Vite の高速開発サーバー、最適化されたプロダクションビルド、および Rolldown ドライブのバンドラーを使用し、TypeScript および ESM モジュールを利用してパフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を高めることで、次世代のフロントエンドアプリケーションを構築するエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"Vite 의 빠른 개발 서버, 최적화된 프로덕션 빌드 및 Rolldown 파워드 번들러를 사용하여 에이전트가 다음 세대의 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, 타입스크립트 및 ESM 모듈을 사용하여 성능 및 유지 관리성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones frontend de próxima generación utilizando el servidor de desarrollo rápido de Vite, compilaciones de producción optimizadas y un empaquetador impulsado por Rolldown, mientras utiliza módulos TypeScript y ESM para un rendimiento y mantenimiento mejorados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications frontend de nouvelle génération en utilisant le serveur de développement rapide de Vite, des builds de production optimisés et un bundleur alimenté par Rolldown, tout en utilisant des modules TypeScript et ESM pour améliorer les performances et la maintenabilité.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Next-Generation-Frontend-Anwendungen zu erstellen, die Vites schnellen Entwicklungsserver, optimierte Produktionsbuilds und einen von Rolldown angetriebenen Bundler verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig TypeScript- und ESM-Module für verbesserte Leistung und Wartbarkeit nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações frontend de próxima geração usando o servidor de desenvolvimento rápido do Vite, compilações de produção otimizadas e empacotador alimentado pelo Rolldown, aproveitando módulos TypeScript e ESM para desempenho e manutenibilidade aprimorados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать приложения frontend нового поколения, используя быстрый сервер разработки Vite, оптимизированные сборки для производства и пакетизатор на основе Rolldown, а также используя модули TypeScript и ESM для повышения производительности и поддерживаемости.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية من الجيل التالي باستخدام خادم التطوير السريع من Vite والترجمات الإنتاجية المُحسّنة والمدمجة مدعومة من Rolldown، مع الاستفادة من وحدة TypeScript ووحدات ESM لتحسين الأداء والصيانة."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Vite projects with conditional configs and environment variables","Optimizing production builds for faster load times","Developing applications with native ESM and HMR support"],"zh":["使用条件配置和环境变量配置 Vite 项目","优化生产构建以实现更快的加载时间","使用原生 ESM 和 HMR 支持开发应用程序"],"ja":["条件付き構成と環境変数を使用して Vite プロジェクトを構成する","プロダクションビルドを最適化して読み込み時間を短縮する","ネイティブの ESM および HMR サポートを使用してアプリケーションを開発する"],"ko":["조건부 구성 및 환경 변수를 사용하여 Vite 프로젝트 구성하기","프로덕션 빌드를 최적화하여 로드 시간을 단축하기","ネイティブ ESM 및 HMR 지원을 사용하여 애플리케이션 개발하기"],"es":["Configuración de proyectos Vite con configuraciones condicionales y variables de entorno","Optimización de compilaciones de producción para tiempos de carga más rápidos","Desarrollo de aplicaciones con soporte nativo para ESM y HMR"],"fr":["Configuration de projets Vite avec des configurations conditionnelles et des variables d''environnement","Optimisation des builds de production pour des temps de chargement plus rapides","Développement d''applications avec un support natif pour ESM et HMR"],"de":["Konfiguration von Vite-Projekten mit bedingten Konfigurationen und Umgebungsvariablen","Optimierung von Produktionsbuilds für schnellere Ladezeiten","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit nativem ESM- und HMR-Unterstützung"],"pt":["Configurando projetos Vite com configurações condicionais e variáveis de ambiente","Otimizando compilações de produção para tempos de carregamento mais rápidos","Desenvolvendo aplicações com suporte nativo a ESM e HMR"],"ru":["Настройка проектов Vite с условными конфигурациями и переменными среды","Оптимизация сборок для производства для более быстрого времени загрузки","Разработка приложений с родной поддержкой ESM и HMR"],"ar":["تكوين مشاريع Vite باستخدام التهيئة الشرطية ومتغيرات البيئة","تحسين الترجمات الإنتاجية لأوقات تحميل أسرع"," تطوير التطبيقات بدعم أصلي لمواصفات الشريط وأتمتة إعادة التحميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite 8 beta or later","Only supports ESM modules, avoiding CommonJS"],"zh":["需要 Vite 8 beta 或更高版本","仅支持 ESM 模块，避免 CommonJS"],"ja":["Vite 8 ベータまたは後のバージョンが必要","CommonJS を避けて ESM モジュールのみをサポート"],"ko":["Vite 8 베타 또는 이후 버전이 필요","CommonJS를 피하고 ESM 모듈만 지원"],"es":["Requiere Vite 8 beta o posterior","Solo admite módulos ESM, evitando CommonJS"],"fr":["Nécessite Vite 8 beta ou ultérieur","N''aide que les modules ESM, en évitant CommonJS"],"de":["Benötigt Vite 8 Beta oder höher","Unterstützt nur ESM-Module, vermeidet CommonJS"],"pt":["Exige Vite 8 beta ou posterior","Apenas suporta módulos ESM, evitando CommonJS"],"ru":["Требуется Vite 8 бета или позже","Поддерживает только модули ESM, избегая CommonJS"],"ar":["يتطلب Vite 8 بيتا أو أحدث","يدعم فقط وحدات ESM، متجاهلاً CommonJS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('MartletAI/martlet.ai/core-web-vitals', 'community', 'MartletAI', 'martlet.ai', 'MartletAI/martlet.ai', 'core-web-vitals', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z', '2026-02-18T09:08:09.304Z', NULL, '{"id":"MartletAI/martlet.ai/core-web-vitals","name":"core-web-vitals","description":{"zh":"Core Web Vitals 优化是针对三大指标的优化：LCP、INP 和 CLS，直接影响 Google 搜索排名和用户体验","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化は、3 つの指標：LCP、INP、CLS に対する最適化であり、Google 検索ランキングとユーザーエクスペリエンスに直接影響します","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화는 3가지 지표: LCP, INP, CLS를 위한 최적화로 Google 검색 순위와 사용자 경험에 직접적인 영향을 미칩니다","es":"La optimización de Core Web Vitals implica mejorar la carga, interactividad y estabilidad visual de una página web para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y el posicionamiento en Google Search","fr":"L''optimisation des Core Web Vitals consiste à améliorer le chargement, l''interactivité et la stabilité visuelle d''une page web pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et le référencement sur Google Search","de":"Die Optimierung von Core Web Vitals umfasst die Verbesserung der Ladezeit, Interaktivität und visuellen Stabilität einer Webseite, um die Benutzererfahrung und die Platzierung in Google Search zu verbessern","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals para melhorar a experiência do usuário e o ranking no Google. Aprenda sobre os três principais métricos: LCP, INP e CLS.","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals для улучшения пользовательского опыта и рейтинга в Google. Узнайте о трех основных метриках: LCP, INP и CLS.","ar":"تحسين Core Web Vitals لتحسين تجربة المستخدم وترتيب جوجل. تعرف على ثلاثة مقاييس الأساسية: LCP و INP و CLS.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Core Web Vitals 优化","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화","es":"Optimización de Core Web Vitals","fr":"Optimisation des Core Web Vitals","de":"Core Web Vitals Optimierung","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals для разработчиков","ar":"تحسين Core Web Vitals لمنصة مطورين","en":"core-web-vitals"},"description":{"zh":"Core Web Vitals 优化是针对三大指标的优化：LCP、INP 和 CLS，直接影响 Google 搜索排名和用户体验","ja":"Core Web Vitals 最適化は、3 つの指標：LCP、INP、CLS に対する最適化であり、Google 検索ランキングとユーザーエクスペリエンスに直接影響します","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화는 3가지 지표: LCP, INP, CLS를 위한 최적화로 Google 검색 순위와 사용자 경험에 직접적인 영향을 미칩니다","es":"La optimización de Core Web Vitals implica mejorar la carga, interactividad y estabilidad visual de una página web para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y ...","fr":"L''optimisation des Core Web Vitals consiste à améliorer le chargement, l''interactivité et la stabilité visuelle d''une page web pour améliorer l''expérience ut...","de":"Die Optimierung von Core Web Vitals umfasst die Verbesserung der Ladezeit, Interaktivität und visuellen Stabilität einer Webseite, um die Benutzererfahrung u...","pt":"Otimização de Core Web Vitals para melhorar a experiência do usuário e o ranking no Google. Aprenda sobre os três principais métricos: LCP, INP e CLS.","ru":"Оптимизация Core Web Vitals для улучшения пользовательского опыта и рейтинга в Google. Узнайте о трех основных метриках: LCP, INP и CLS.","ar":"تحسين Core Web Vitals لتحسين تجربة المستخدم وترتيب جوجل. تعرف على ثلاثة مقاييس الأساسية: LCP و INP و CLS.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["LCP（最大内容绘制）优化","INP（交互性）优化","CLS（视觉稳定性）优化","Google 搜索排名影响","用户体验改善","性能优化指南"],"ja":["LCP（最大コンテンツペイント）最適化","INP（インタラクティブ性）最適化","CLS（視覚的安定性）最適化","Google 検索ランキングへの影響","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの改善","パフォーマンス最適化ガイド"],"ko":["LCP(최대 콘텐츠 페인팅) 최적화","INP(상호작용성) 최적화","CLS(시각적 안정성) 최적화","Google 검색 순위에 대한 영향","사용자 경험 개선","성능 최적화 가이드"],"es":["Optimización de LCP (Loading Performance)","Mejora de la interactividad con INP (Interactivity Performance)","Redución de la CLS (Visual Stability) para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Análisis del 75 percentil para garantizar una buena experiencia del usuario","Mejora del posicionamiento en Google Search mediante la optimización de Core Web Vitals","Análisis y monitoreo de los métricos de Core Web Vitals para identificar áreas de mejora"],"fr":["Optimisation de LCP (Performance de chargement)","Amélioration de l''interactivité avec INP (Performance d''interactivité)","Réduction de la CLS (Stabilité visuelle) pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur","Analyse du 75e centile pour garantir une bonne expérience utilisateur","Amélioration du référencement sur Google Search grâce à l''optimisation des Core Web Vitals","Analyse et surveillance des métriques de Core Web Vitals pour identifier les domaines d''amélioration"],"de":["Optimierung von LCP (Ladeleistung)","Verbesserung der Interaktivität mit INP (Interaktivitätsleistung)","Reduzierung von CLS (Visuelle Stabilität) für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung","Analyse des 75. Perzentils, um eine gute Benutzererfahrung zu gewährleisten","Verbesserung der Platzierung in Google Search durch die Optimierung von Core Web Vitals","Analyse und Überwachung der Core Web Vitals-Metriken, um Bereiche für Verbesserungen zu identifizieren"],"pt":["Otimização de LCP (Largest Contentful Paint) para carregamento rápido","Melhoria de INP (Interaction to Next Paint) para interatividade","Otimização de CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift) para estabilidade visual","Análise de desempenho no 75º percentil para garantir a experiência do usuário","Implementação de práticas de codificação para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Monitoramento contínuo do desempenho para garantir a otimização"],"ru":["Оптимизация LCP (Largest Contentful Paint) для быстрой загрузки","Улучшение INP (Interaction to Next Paint) для интерактивности","Оптимизация CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift) для визуальной стабильности","Анализ производительности на 75-м процентиле для обеспечения пользовательского опыта","Реализация практик кодирования для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Постоянный мониторинг производительности для обеспечения оптимизации"],"ar":["تحسين LCP (Largest Contentful Paint) لتحميل سريع","تحسين INP (Interaction to Next Paint) للتفاعل","تحسين CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift) للاستقرار البصري","تحليل الأداء فيPercentil 75 لضمان تجربة المستخدم","تنفيذ ممارسات الترميز لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","مراقبة مستمرة للأداء لضمان التحسين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Core Web Vitals","LCP","INP","CLS","Google 搜索排名","用户体验","性能优化","Web 开发","SEO"],"ja":["Core Web Vitals","LCP","INP","CLS","Google 検索ランキング","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","パフォーマンス最適化","Web 開発","SEO"],"ko":["Core Web Vitals","LCP","INP","CLS","Google 검색 순위","사용자 경험","성능 최적화","웹 개발","SEO"],"es":["Core Web Vitals","Optimización de página web","Experiencia del usuario","Posicionamiento en Google Search","LCP","INP","CLS","Análisis de rendimiento","Mejora de la velocidad de carga"],"fr":["Core Web Vitals","Optimisation de page web","Expérience utilisateur","Référencement sur Google Search","LCP","INP","CLS","Analyse de performances","Amélioration de la vitesse de chargement"],"de":["Core Web Vitals","Optimierung von Webseiten","Benutzererfahrung","Platzierung in Google Search","LCP","INP","CLS","Leistungsanalyse","Verbesserung der Ladezeit"],"pt":["Core Web Vitals","Otimização de desempenho","Experiência do usuário","LCP","INP","CLS","Desenvolvimento web","Otimização de SEO","Melhoria de desempenho"],"ru":["Core Web Vitals","Оптимизация производительности","Пользовательский опыт","LCP","INP","CLS","Веб-разработка","Оптимизация SEO","Улучшение производительности"],"ar":["Core Web Vitals","تحسين الأداء","تجربة المستخدم","LCP","INP","CLS","تطوير الويب","تحسين SEO","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"MartletAI","repo":"martlet.ai","repoPath":"MartletAI/martlet.ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"core-web-vitals","description":"Optimize Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) for better page experience and search ranking. Use when asked to improve Core Web Vitals, fix LCP, reduce CLS, optimize INP, page experience optimization, or fix layout shifts.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page","body":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page visits must meet \"Good\" thresholds.\n\n---\n\n## LCP: Largest Contentful Paint\n\nLCP measures when the largest visible content element renders. Usually this is:\n- Hero image or video\n- Large text block\n- Background image\n- `<svg>` element\n\n### Common LCP issues\n\n**1. Slow server response (TTFB > 800ms)**\n```\nFix: CDN, caching, optimized backend, edge rendering\n```\n\n**2. Render-blocking resources**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Blocks rendering -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/all-styles.css\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Critical CSS inlined, rest deferred -->\n<style>/* Critical above-fold CSS */</style>\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/styles.css\" as=\"style\" \n      onload=\"this.onload=null;this.rel=''stylesheet''\">\n```\n\n**3. Slow resource load times**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ No hints, discovered late -->\n<img src=\"/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Hero\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Preloaded with high priority -->\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.webp\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n<img src=\"/hero.webp\" alt=\"Hero\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n```\n\n**4. Client-side rendering delays**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Content loads after JavaScript\nuseEffect(() => {\n  fetch(''/api/hero-text'').then(r => r.json()).then(setHeroText);\n}, []);\n\n// ✅ Server-side or static rendering\n// Use SSR, SSG, or streaming to send HTML with content\nexport async function getServerSideProps() {\n  const heroText = await fetchHeroText();\n  return { props: { heroText } };\n}\n```\n\n### LCP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] TTFB < 800ms (use CDN, edge caching)\n- [ ] LCP image preloaded with fetchpriority=\"high\"\n- [ ] LCP image optimized (WebP/AVIF, correct size)\n- [ ] Critical CSS inlined (< 14KB)\n- [ ] No render-blocking JavaScript in <head>\n- [ ] Fonts don''t block text rendering (font-display: swap)\n- [ ] LCP element in initial HTML (not JS-rendered)\n```\n\n### LCP element identification\n```javascript\n// Find your LCP element\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  const entries = list.getEntries();\n  const lastEntry = entries[entries.length - 1];\n  console.log(''LCP element:'', lastEntry.element);\n  console.log(''LCP time:'', lastEntry.startTime);\n}).observe({ type: ''largest-contentful-paint'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## INP: Interaction to Next Paint\n\nINP measures responsiveness across ALL interactions (clicks, taps, key presses) during a page visit. It reports the worst interaction (at 98th percentile for high-traffic pages).\n\n### INP breakdown\n\nTotal INP = **Input Delay** + **Processing Time** + **Presentation Delay**\n\n| Phase | Target | Optimization |\n|-------|--------|--------------|\n| Input Delay | < 50ms | Reduce main thread blocking |\n| Processing | < 100ms | Optimize event handlers |\n| Presentation | < 50ms | Minimize rendering work |\n\n### Common INP issues\n\n**1. Long tasks blocking main thread**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Long synchronous task\nfunction processLargeArray(items) {\n  items.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n}\n\n// ✅ Break into chunks with yielding\nasync function processLargeArray(items) {\n  const CHUNK_SIZE = 100;\n  for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i += CHUNK_SIZE) {\n    const chunk = items.slice(i, i + CHUNK_SIZE);\n    chunk.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n    \n    // Yield to main thread\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 0));\n    // Or use scheduler.yield() when available\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**2. Heavy event handlers**\n```javascript\n// ❌ All work in handler\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Heavy computation\n  const result = calculateComplexThing();\n  // DOM updates\n  updateUI(result);\n  // Analytics\n  trackEvent(''click'');\n});\n\n// ✅ Prioritize visual feedback\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Immediate visual feedback\n  button.classList.add(''loading'');\n  \n  // Defer non-critical work\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    const result = calculateComplexThing();\n    updateUI(result);\n  });\n  \n  // Use requestIdleCallback for analytics\n  requestIdleCallback(() => trackEvent(''click''));\n});\n```\n\n**3. Third-party scripts**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Eagerly loaded, blocks interactions\n<script src=\"https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js\"></script>\n\n// ✅ Lazy loaded on interaction or visibility\nconst loadWidget = () => {\n  import(''https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js'')\n    .then(widget => widget.init());\n};\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', loadWidget, { once: true });\n```\n\n**4. Excessive re-renders (React/Vue)**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Re-renders entire tree\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <ExpensiveComponent /> {/* Re-renders on every count change */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// ✅ Memoized expensive components\nconst MemoizedExpensive = React.memo(ExpensiveComponent);\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <MemoizedExpensive />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### INP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] No tasks > 50ms on main thread\n- [ ] Event handlers complete quickly (< 100ms)\n- [ ] Visual feedback provided immediately\n- [ ] Heavy work deferred with requestIdleCallback\n- [ ] Third-party scripts don''t block interactions\n- [ ] Debounced input handlers where appropriate\n- [ ] Web Workers for CPU-intensive operations\n```\n\n### INP debugging\n```javascript\n// Identify slow interactions\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (entry.duration > 200) {\n      console.warn(''Slow interaction:'', {\n        type: entry.name,\n        duration: entry.duration,\n        processingStart: entry.processingStart,\n        processingEnd: entry.processingEnd,\n        target: entry.target\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''event'', buffered: true, durationThreshold: 16 });\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLS: Cumulative Layout Shift\n\nCLS measures unexpected layout shifts. A shift occurs when a visible element changes position between frames without user interaction.\n\n**CLS Formula:** `impact fraction × distance fraction`\n\n### Common CLS causes\n\n**1. Images without dimensions**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Causes layout shift when loaded -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Space reserved -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4/3; width: 100%;\">\n```\n\n**2. Ads, embeds, and iframes**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Unknown size until loaded -->\n<iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\"></iframe>\n\n<!-- ✅ Reserve space with min-height -->\n<div style=\"min-height: 250px;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\" height=\"250\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio container -->\n<div style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/...\" \n          style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></iframe>\n</div>\n```\n\n**3. Dynamically injected content**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Inserts content above viewport\nnotifications.prepend(newNotification);\n\n// ✅ Insert below viewport or use transform\nconst insertBelow = viewport.bottom < newNotification.top;\nif (insertBelow) {\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n} else {\n  // Animate in without shifting\n  newNotification.style.transform = ''translateY(-100%)'';\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    newNotification.style.transform = '''';\n  });\n}\n```\n\n**4. Web fonts causing FOUT**\n```css\n/* ❌ Font swap shifts text */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n}\n\n/* ✅ Optional font (no shift if slow) */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: optional;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Or match fallback metrics */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: swap;\n  size-adjust: 105%; /* Match fallback size */\n  ascent-override: 95%;\n  descent-override: 20%;\n}\n```\n\n**5. Animations triggering layout**\n```css\n/* ❌ Animates layout properties */\n.animate {\n  transition: height 0.3s, width 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Use transform instead */\n.animate {\n  transition: transform 0.3s;\n}\n.animate.expanded {\n  transform: scale(1.2);\n}\n```\n\n### CLS optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] All images have width/height or aspect-ratio\n- [ ] All videos/embeds have reserved space\n- [ ] Ads have min-height containers\n- [ ] Fonts use font-display: optional or matched metrics\n- [ ] Dynamic content inserted below viewport\n- [ ] Animations use transform/opacity only\n- [ ] No content injected above existing content\n```\n\n### CLS debugging\n```javascript\n// Track layout shifts\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (!entry.hadRecentInput) {\n      console.log(''Layout shift:'', entry.value);\n      entry.sources?.forEach(source => {\n        console.log(''  Shifted element:'', source.node);\n        console.log(''  Previous rect:'', source.previousRect);\n        console.log(''  Current rect:'', source.currentRect);\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''layout-shift'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Measurement tools\n\n### Lab testing\n- **Chrome DevTools** → Performance panel, Lighthouse\n- **WebPageTest** → Detailed waterfall, filmstrip\n- **Lighthouse CLI** → `npx lighthouse <url>`\n\n### Field data (real users)\n- **Chrome User Experience Report (CrUX)** → BigQuery or API\n- **Search Console** → Core Web Vitals report\n- **web-vitals library** → Send to your analytics\n\n```javascript\nimport {onLCP, onINP, onCLS} from ''web-vitals'';\n\nfunction sendToAnalytics({name, value, rating}) {\n  gtag(''event'', name, {\n    event_category: ''Web Vitals'',\n    value: Math.round(name === ''CLS'' ? value * 1000 : value),\n    event_label: rating\n  });\n}\n\nonLCP(sendToAnalytics);\nonINP(sendToAnalytics);\nonCLS(sendToAnalytics);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Framework quick fixes\n\n### Next.js\n```jsx\n// LCP: Use next/image with priority\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n<Image src=\"/hero.jpg\" priority fill alt=\"Hero\" />\n\n// INP: Use dynamic imports\nconst HeavyComponent = dynamic(() => import(''./Heavy''), { ssr: false });\n\n// CLS: Image component handles dimensions automatically\n```\n\n### React\n```jsx\n// LCP: Preload in head\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.jpg\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" />\n\n// INP: Memoize and useTransition\nconst [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();\nstartTransition(() => setExpensiveState(newValue));\n\n// CLS: Always specify dimensions in img tags\n```\n\n### Vue/Nuxt\n```vue\n<!-- LCP: Use nuxt/image with preload -->\n<NuxtImg src=\"/hero.jpg\" preload loading=\"eager\" />\n\n<!-- INP: Use async components -->\n<component :is=\"() => import(''./Heavy.vue'')\" />\n\n<!-- CLS: Use aspect-ratio CSS -->\n<img :style=\"{ aspectRatio: ''16/9'' }\" />\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [web.dev LCP](https://web.dev/articles/lcp)\n- [web.dev INP](https://web.dev/articles/inp)\n- [web.dev CLS](https://web.dev/articles/cls)\n- [Performance skill](../performance/SKILL.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:08:09.304Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Performance Analysis Agents needing automated Core Web Vitals optimization and monitoring.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化核心Web性能指标优化和监控的Web性能分析代理。","ja":"Webパフォーマンス分析エージェントが自動化されたCore Web Vitalsの最適化と監視を必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"자동화된 Core Web Vitals 최적화 및 모니터링이 필요한 Web 성능 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Rendimiento Web que necesitan optimización y seguimiento automatizados de los Vitales de la Web Central.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Performance Web ayant besoin d''une optimisation et d''un suivi automatiques des Vitales de la Web Centrale.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Performance-Analyse-Agents, die eine automatisierte Optimierung und Überwachung der Core Web Vitals benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Desempenho da Web que necessitam de otimização e monitoramento automatizados de Core Web Vitals.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа производительности веб-приложений, требующих автоматизированной оптимизации и мониторинга Core Web Vitals.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل أداء الويب الذي يحتاج إلى تحسين وتحديث آلي لمعايير الويب الأساسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated measurement and optimization of LCP (Largest Contentful Paint), INP (Interaction to Next Paint), and CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift) at the 75th percentile threshold. Provides actionable insights for improving Google Search ranking and user experience metrics.","zh":"启用自动测量和优化LCP（最大内容绘制），INP（交互到下一次绘制）和CLS（累积布局偏移）在第75百分位阈值。提供可行的见解以改善Google搜索排名和用户体验指标。","ja":"LCP（最大コンテンツ描画）、INP（インタラクションから次の描画）、CLS（累積レイアウトシフト）の自動測定と最適化を75パーセンタイルのしきい値で有効にする。Google検索ランキングとユーザーエクスペリエンスのメトリクスを改善するための実行可能な洞察を提供する。","ko":"LCP(최대 콘텐츠 페인팅), INP(상호작용부터 다음 페인팅), CLS(누적 레이아웃 시프트)의 자동 측정 및 최적화를 75百분위 수준에서 활성화합니다. Google 검색 순위 및 사용자 경험 메트릭을 개선하는 데 대한 실행 가능한洞察을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la medición y optimización automática de LCP (Pintura de Contenido más Grande), INP (Interacción hasta la siguiente Pintura) y CLS (Desplazamiento de Diseño Acumulado) en el umbral del percentil 75. Proporciona conocimientos aprovechables para mejorar los métricos de ranking de búsqueda de Google y experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Permet la mesure et l''optimisation automatique de LCP (Peinture de Contenu la Plus Grande), INP (Interaction jusqu''à la prochaine Peinture) et CLS (Déplacement de Disposition Cumulatif) au seuil du 75e percentile. Fournit des connaissances exploitables pour améliorer les métriques de classement de recherche Google et d''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Messung und Optimierung von LCP (Größte inhaltsbezogene Zeichnung), INP (Interaktion bis zur nächsten Zeichnung) und CLS (Kumulativer Layoutversatz) bei der 75. Perzentilschwelle. Bietet handhabbare Erkenntnisse zur Verbesserung der Google-Suchrangliste und Benutzererfahrungsmetriken.","pt":"Habilita a medição e otimização automatizadas de LCP (Pintura de Conteúdo Mais Amplo), INP (Interação até a Próxima Pintura) e CLS (Mudança de Layout Cumulativa) no limiar do percentil 75. Fornece insights ações para melhorar os métricos de classificação do Google Search e experiência do usuário.","ru":"Позволяет автоматизировать измерение и оптимизацию LCP (Крупнейшая контентная краска), INP (Взаимодействие до следующей краски) и CLS (Кумулятивный сдвиг компоновки) на пороге 75-го процентиля. Предоставляет рекомендации для улучшения метрик рейтинга Google Search и пользовательского опыта.","ar":"يمكنه تمكين القياس والتحسين الآلي لـ LCP (أعلى لوحة محتوى) و INP (التفاعل حتى الطلاء التالي) و CLS (الانفجار التراكمي للتنسيق) عند عتبة 百分位 75. يوفر رؤى قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين متريكات تصنيف بحث جوجل و متريكات تجربة المستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating LCP optimization for critical resources","Debugging INP issues in interactive web applications","Identifying and fixing CLS-causing layout shifts","Generating performance reports for SEO compliance"],"zh":["自动化关键资源的LCP优化","调试交互式Web应用中的INP问题","识别和修复导致CLS的布局偏移","为SEO合规生成性能报告"],"ja":["重要なリソースのLCP最適化の自動化","インタラクティブなWebアプリケーションのINPの問題のデバッグ","CLSを引き起こすレイアウトシフトの特定と修正","SEOへの準拠のためのパフォーマンスレポートの生成"],"ko":["중요한 리소스의 LCP 최적화를 자동화하는 것","인터랙티브 웹 애플리케이션의 INP 문제 디버깅","CLS를 유발하는 레이아웃 시프트를 식별 및 수정","SEO 준수에 대한 성능 보고서 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la optimización de LCP para recursos críticos","Depuración de problemas de INP en aplicaciones web interactivas","Identificación y corrección de desplazamientos de diseño que causan CLS","Generación de informes de rendimiento para el cumplimiento de SEO"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''optimisation de LCP pour les ressources critiques","Débogage des problèmes d''INP dans les applications Web interactives","Identification et correction des déplacements de disposition provoquant CLS","Génération de rapports de performance pour la conformité SEO"],"de":["Automatisierung der LCP-Optimierung für kritische Ressourcen","Fehlerbehebung bei INP-Problemen in interaktiven Webanwendungen","Identifizierung und Behebung von Layoutversätzen, die CLS verursachen","Erstellung von Leistungsberichten für SEO-Konformität"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização do LCP para recursos críticos","Depurar problemas de INP em aplicações web interativas","Identificar e corrigir deslocamentos de layout que causam CLS","Gerar relatórios de desempenho para conformidade com SEO"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию LCP для критических ресурсов","Отладить проблемы с INP в интерактивных веб-приложениях","Определить и исправить сдвиги компоновки, вызывающие CLS","Генерировать отчеты о производительности для соответствия требованиям SEO"],"ar":["توفير تحسين آلي لـ LCP للموارد الحرجة","تصحيح مشاكل INP في التطبيقات الإلكترونية التفاعلية","تحديد وتحديث تحركات التنسيق التي تسبب CLS","إنشاء تقارير أداء للامتثال لتحسين محركات البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to real user monitoring data","Browser performance API dependency","Measurement accuracy depends on network conditions"],"zh":["需要访问真实用户监控数据","浏览器性能API依赖","测量准确性取决于网络条件"],"ja":["実際のユーザーモニタリングデータへのアクセスが必要","ブラウザパフォーマンスAPIへの依存","測定の正確性はネットワーク条件に依存"],"ko":["실제 사용자 모니터링 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요함","브라우저 성능 API 의존","측정 정확도는 네트워크 조건에 따라 달라짐"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de seguimiento de usuarios reales","Dependencia de la API de rendimiento del navegador","La precisión de la medición depende de las condiciones de la red"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données de suivi d''utilisateurs réels","Dépendance de l''API de performance du navigateur","La précision de la mesure dépend des conditions du réseau"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Echtzeit-Nutzungsdaten","Abhängigkeit von der Browser-Performance-API","Die Messgenauigkeit hängt von den Netzwerkbedingungen ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados de monitoramento de usuários reais","Dependência da API de desempenho do navegador","A precisão da medição depende das condições de rede"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным мониторинга реальных пользователей","Зависимость от браузерного API производительности","Точность измерения зависит от условий сети"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات مراقبة المستخدمين الحقيقيين","اعتماد على واجهة برمجة تطبيقات أداء المتصفح","دقة القياس تعتمد على ظروف الشبكة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
