입니다","es":"Vite es una herramienta de compilación de frontend de próxima generación con servidor de desarrollo rápido y construcciones de producción optimizadas","fr":"Vite est un outil de build frontend de nouvelle génération avec serveur de développement rapide et constructions de production optimisées","de":"Vite ist ein Next-Generation-Frontend-Build-Tool mit schnellem Entwicklungsserver und optimierten Produktionsbuilds","pt":"Vite é uma ferramenta de build frontend de próxima geração, com servidor de desenvolvimento rápido e otimizado para produção","ru":"Vite — это инструмент построения frontend нового поколения, с быстрым сервером разработки и оптимизированным для производства","ar":"Vite هي أداة بناء واجهة المستخدم الأمامية من الجيل التالي، مع خادم تطوير سريع ومحسّن للانتاج","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速开发服务器","优化的生产构建","原生 ESM 支持","HMR支持","TypeScript 支持"],"ja":["高速な開発サーバー","最適化されたプロダクションビルド","ネイティブ ESM サポート","HMR サポート","TypeScript サポート"],"ko":["빠른 개발 서버","최적화된 프로덕션 빌드","네이티브 ESM 지원","HMR 지원","TypeScript 지원"],"es":["Servidor de desarrollo rápido con soporte para ESM y HMR","Construcciones de producción optimizadas","Soporte para TypeScript","Configuración condicional","Carga de variables de entorno"],"fr":["Serveur de développement rapide avec prise en charge de ESM et HMR","Constructions de production optimisées","Prise en charge de TypeScript","Configuration conditionnelle","Chargement de variables d''environnement"],"de":["Schneller Entwicklungsserver mit Unterstützung für ESM und HMR","Optimierte Produktionsbuilds","Unterstützung für TypeScript","Bedingte Konfiguration","Laden von Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["Servidor de desenvolvimento rápido com ESM nativo","Otimizado para produção com Rolldown bundler","Suporte a TypeScript com `vite.config.ts`","Always use ESM, evitar CommonJS","Configuração condicional com `defineConfig`"],"ru":["Быстрый сервер разработки с родным ESM","Оптимизирован для производства с Rolldown bundler","Поддержка TypeScript с `vite.config.ts`","Always use ESM, избегать CommonJS","Условная конфигурация с `defineConfig`"],"ar":["خادم تطوير سريع مع ESM أصلي","محسّن للانتاج مع Rolldown bundler","دعم TypeScript مع `vite.config.ts`","استخدام دائم ESM، تجنب CommonJS","تكوين مشروط مع `defineConfig`"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vite","前端构建工具","快速开发服务器","优化的生产构建","ESM","HMR","TypeScript"],"ja":["Vite","フロントエンドビルドツール","高速な開発サーバー","最適化されたプロダクションビルド","ESM","HMR","TypeScript"],"ko":["Vite","프론트엔드 빌드 툴","빠른 개발 서버","최적화된 프로덕션 빌드","ESM","HMR","TypeScript"],"es":["Vite","herramienta de compilación de frontend","servidor de desarrollo rápido","construcciones de producción optimizadas","TypeScript","ESM","HMR","Rolldown","Oxc"],"fr":["Vite","outil de build frontend","serveur de développement rapide","constructions de production optimisées","TypeScript","ESM","HMR","Rolldown","Oxc"],"de":["Vite","Frontend-Build-Tool","schneller Entwicklungsserver","optimierte Produktionsbuilds","TypeScript","ESM","HMR","Rolldown","Oxc"],"pt":["Vite","ferramenta de build frontend","servidor de desenvolvimento rápido","ESM nativo","TypeScript","Rolldown bundler","otimizado para produção"],"ru":["Vite","инструмент построения frontend","быстрый сервер разработки","родной ESM","TypeScript","Rolldown bundler","оптимизирован для производства"],"ar":["Vite","أداة بناء واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","خادم تطوير سريع","ESM أصلي","TypeScript","Rolldown bundler","محسّن للانتاج"]}},"owner":"devjaime","repo":"orienta-ai","repoPath":"devjaime/orienta-ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vite","description":"Vite build tool configuration, plugin API, SSR, and Vite 8 Rolldown migration. Use when working with Vite projects, vite.config.ts, Vite plugins, or building libraries/SSR apps with Vite.","version":"2026.1.31","bodyPreview":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](refere","body":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| Features | `import.meta.glob`, asset queries (`?raw`, `?url`), `import.meta.env`, HMR API | [core-features](references/core-features.md) |\n| Plugin API | Vite-specific hooks, virtual modules, plugin ordering | [core-plugin-api](references/core-plugin-api.md) |\n\n## Build & SSR\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Build & SSR | Library mode, SSR middleware mode, `ssrLoadModule`, JavaScript API | [build-and-ssr](references/build-and-ssr.md) |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Environment API | Vite 6+ multi-environment support, custom runtimes | [environment-api](references/environment-api.md) |\n| Rolldown Migration | Vite 8 changes: Rolldown bundler, Oxc transformer, config migration | [rolldown-migration](references/rolldown-migration.md) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### CLI Commands\n\n```bash\nvite              # Start dev server\nvite build        # Production build\nvite preview      # Preview production build\nvite build --ssr  # SSR build\n```\n\n### Common Config\n\n```ts\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [],\n  resolve: { alias: { ''@'': ''/src'' } },\n  server: { port: 3000, proxy: { ''/api'': ''http://localhost:8080'' } },\n  build: { target: ''esnext'', outDir: ''dist'' },\n})\n```\n\n### Official Plugins\n\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue` - Vue 3 SFC support\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx` - Vue 3 JSX\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react` - React with Oxc/Babel\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react-swc` - React with SWC\n- `@vitejs/plugin-legacy` - Legacy browser support\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:08:58.084Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing fast and optimized development server capabilities with native ESM and HMR support.","zh":"非常适合需要快速和优化的开发服务器功能的前端代理，具有原生ESM和HMR支持。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高速で最適化された開発サーバーキャパビリティを必要とする場合に最適です。ネイティブESMとHMRをサポートしています。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 빠르고 최적화된 개발 서버 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다. 네이티브 ESM 및 HMR를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de servidor de desarrollo rápido y optimizado con soporte nativo para ESM y HMR.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de serveur de développement rapide et optimisé avec un support natif pour ESM et HMR.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die ein schnelles und optimiertes Entwicklungsserver-Tool mit nativer ESM- und HMR-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing fast and optimized development server capabilities with native ESM and HMR support.","ru":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing fast and optimized development server capabilities with native ESM and HMR support.","ar":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing fast and optimized development server capabilities with native ESM and HMR support."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build fast and optimized frontend applications using Vite''s Rolldown-powered bundler and Oxc transformer, with support for TypeScript and conditional configurations via `vite.config.ts` and `defineConfig`.","zh":"赋予代理构建快速和优化的前端应用程序的能力，使用Vite的Rolldown驱动的打包器和Oxc转换器，并支持TypeScript和通过`vite.config.ts`和`defineConfig`进行条件配置。","ja":"ViteのRolldown駆動のバンドラーとOxcトランスフォーマーを使用して、高速で最適化されたフロントエンドアプリケーションを構築するためのエージェントをエンパワーメントします。TypeScriptと、`vite.config.ts`および`defineConfig`による条件付きコンフィギュレーションもサポートします。","ko":"Vite의 Rolldown 기반 번들러와 Oxc 변환기를 사용하여 빠르고 최적화된 프론트엔드 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다. TypeScript와 `vite.config.ts` 및 `defineConfig`를 통해 조건부 구성도 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones frontend rápidas y optimizadas utilizando el bundler de Vite con tecnología Rolldown y el transformador Oxc, con soporte para TypeScript y configuraciones condicionales a través de `vite.config.ts` y `defineConfig`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications frontend rapides et optimisées en utilisant le bundler Vite avec la technologie Rolldown et le transformateur Oxc, avec un support pour TypeScript et des configurations conditionnelles via `vite.config.ts` et `defineConfig`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, schnelle und optimierte Frontend-Anwendungen mit Vites Rolldown-Technologie und Oxc-Transformer zu erstellen, mit Unterstützung für TypeScript und bedingte Konfigurationen über `vite.config.ts` und `defineConfig`.","pt":"Empowers agents to build fast and optimized frontend applications using Vite''s Rolldown-powered bundler and Oxc transformer, with support for TypeScript and conditional configurations via `vite.config.ts` and `defineConfig`.","ru":"Empowers agents to build fast and optimized frontend applications using Vite''s Rolldown-powered bundler and Oxc transformer, with support for TypeScript and conditional configurations via `vite.config.ts` and `defineConfig`.","ar":"Empowers agents to build fast and optimized frontend applications using Vite''s Rolldown-powered bundler and Oxc transformer, with support for TypeScript and conditional configurations via `vite.config.ts` and `defineConfig`."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Vite projects with `vite.config.ts` for optimized production builds","Utilizing ESM and avoiding CommonJS for better module management","Leveraging `loadEnv` for environment-specific configurations"],"zh":["使用`vite.config.ts`配置Vite项目以实现优化的生产版本","利用ESM并避免CommonJS以实现更好的模块管理","利用`loadEnv`实现环境特定的配置"],"ja":["`vite.config.ts`を使用してViteプロジェクトを最適化されたプロダクションビルド用に構成する","ESMを利用しCommonJSを避けてより良いモジュール管理を実現する","`loadEnv`を利用して環境固有のコンフィギュレーションを実現する"],"ko":["`vite.config.ts`를 사용하여 최적화된 프로덕션 빌드를 위한 Vite 프로젝트 구성","ESM을 사용하고 CommonJS를 피하여 더 나은 모듈 관리를 구현","`loadEnv`를 사용하여 환경별 구성 구현"],"es":["Configuración de proyectos Vite con `vite.config.ts` para compilaciones de producción optimizadas","Uso de ESM y evitación de CommonJS para una mejor gestión de módulos","Uso de `loadEnv` para configuraciones específicas del entorno"],"fr":["Configuration de projets Vite avec `vite.config.ts` pour des builds de production optimisés","Utilisation d''ESM et évitement de CommonJS pour une meilleure gestion de modules","Utilisation de `loadEnv` pour des configurations spécifiques à l''environnement"],"de":["Konfiguration von Vite-Projekten mit `vite.config.ts` für optimierte Produktionsbuilds","Verwendung von ESM und Vermeidung von CommonJS für eine bessere Modulverwaltung","Verwendung von `loadEnv` für umgebungspezifische Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Configuring Vite projects with `vite.config.ts` for optimized production builds","Utilizing ESM and avoiding CommonJS for better module management","Leveraging `loadEnv` for environment-specific configurations"],"ru":["Configuring Vite projects with `vite.config.ts` for optimized production builds","Utilizing ESM and avoiding CommonJS for better module management","Leveraging `loadEnv` for environment-specific configurations"],"ar":["Configuring Vite projects with `vite.config.ts` for optimized production builds","Utilizing ESM and avoiding CommonJS for better module management","Leveraging `loadEnv` for environment-specific configurations"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite 8 beta or higher for Rolldown-powered features","Dependent on native ESM support"],"zh":["需要Vite 8 beta或更高版本才能使用Rolldown驱动的功能","依赖于原生ESM支持"],"ja":["Rolldown駆動の機能を使用するにはVite 8 beta以上が必要","ネイティブESMサポートに依存している"],"ko":["Rolldown 기반 기능을 사용하려면 Vite 8 베타 이상이 필요","네이티브 ESM 지원에 의존"],"es":["Requiere Vite 8 beta o superior para características con tecnología Rolldown","Dependiente del soporte nativo para ESM"],"fr":["Nécessite Vite 8 beta ou supérieur pour les fonctionnalités avec technologie Rolldown","Dépendant du support natif pour ESM"],"de":["Benötigt Vite 8 Beta oder höher für Funktionen mit Rolldown-Technologie","Abhängig von der nativen Unterstützung für ESM"],"pt":["Requires Vite 8 beta or higher for Rolldown-powered features","Dependent on native ESM support"],"ru":["Requires Vite 8 beta or higher for Rolldown-powered features","Dependent on native ESM support"],"ar":["Requires Vite 8 beta or higher for Rolldown-powered features","Dependent on native ESM support"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
