:["Indexierung von Introspektionsevents","Unterstützung für gängige ERC-Schnittstellen","Effektive Domain-Modellierung","Kernimplementierung von Torii","Integration mit Rust Pattern"],"pt":["Implementação da Torii em Rust","Modelagem de domínio com entidades e objetos de valor","Padrões de programação em Rust","Indexação de eventos de introspecção","Suporte a interfaces ERC comuns"],"ru":["Реализация Torii на Rust","Моделирование домена с сущностями и объектами значения","Шаблоны программирования на Rust","Индексация событий интроспекции","Поддержка общих интерфейсов ERC"],"ar":["تنفيذ Torii باستخدام Rust","نمذجة المجال باستخدام الكيانات وأجسام القيمة","أنماط البرمجة في Rust","تحديث فهرس أحداث التأمل","دعم واجهات ERC الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["m09-domain","Torii","领域模型","索引","ERC接口","Rust","唯一标识符"],"ja":["m09-domain","Torii","ドメインモデル","索引","ERCインターフェイス","Rust","一意の識別子"],"ko":["m09-domain","Torii","도메인 모델","색인화","ERC 인터페이스","Rust","고유 식별자"],"es":["Torii","m09-domain","indexación de eventos","interfaces ERC","modelización de dominio","Rust Pattern","desarrollo de software","tecnologías de desarrollo"],"fr":["Torii","m09-domain","indexation d''événements","interfaces ERC","modélisation de domaine","Rust Pattern","développement de logiciels","technologies de développement"],"de":["Torii","m09-domain","Indexierung von Events","ERC-Schnittstellen","Domain-Modellierung","Rust Pattern","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstechnologien"],"pt":["m09-domain","Torii","Rust","modelagem de domínio","padrões de programação","indexação de eventos","ERC","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["m09-domain","Torii","Rust","моделирование домена","шаблоны программирования","индексация событий","ERC","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["م09-نطاق","Torii","Rust","نمذجة المجال","أنماط البرمجة","تحديث فهرس الأحداث","ERC","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"dojoengine","repo":"torii-core","repoPath":"dojoengine/torii-core","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m09-domain","description":"CRITICAL: Use for domain modeling. Triggers: domain model, DDD, domain-driven design, entity, value object, aggregate, repository pattern, business rules, validation, invariant, 领域模型, 领域驱动设计, 业务规则","bodyPreview":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique ident","body":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique identity |\n| Value Object | struct + Clone/Copy | Shareable, immutable |\n| Aggregate Root | struct owns children | Clear ownership tree |\n| Repository | trait | Abstracts persistence |\n| Domain Event | enum | Captures state changes |\n| Service | impl block / free fn | Stateless operations |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore creating a domain type:\n\n1. **What''s the concept''s identity?**\n   - Needs unique identity → Entity (Id field)\n   - Interchangeable by value → Value Object (Clone/Copy)\n\n2. **What invariants must hold?**\n   - Always valid → private fields + validated constructor\n   - Transition rules → type state pattern\n\n3. **Who owns this data?**\n   - Single owner (parent) → owned field\n   - Shared reference → Arc/Rc\n   - Weak reference → Weak\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nTo domain constraints (Layer 3):\n\n```\n\"How should I model a Transaction?\"\n    ↑ Ask: What domain rules govern transactions?\n    ↑ Check: domain-fintech (audit, precision requirements)\n    ↑ Check: Business stakeholders (what invariants?)\n```\n\n| Design Question | Trace To | Ask |\n|-----------------|----------|-----|\n| Entity vs Value Object | domain-* | What makes two instances \"the same\"? |\n| Aggregate boundaries | domain-* | What must be consistent together? |\n| Validation rules | domain-* | What business rules apply? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nTo implementation (Layer 1):\n\n```\n\"Model as Entity\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Owned, unique\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Newtype for Id\n\n\"Model as Value Object\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Clone/Copy OK\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Validate at construction\n\n\"Model as Aggregate\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Parent owns children\n    ↓ m02-resource: Consider Rc for shared within aggregate\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| DDD Concept | Rust Pattern | Example |\n|-------------|--------------|---------|\n| Value Object | Newtype | `struct Email(String);` |\n| Entity | Struct + ID | `struct User { id: UserId, ... }` |\n| Aggregate | Module boundary | `mod order { ... }` |\n| Repository | Trait | `trait UserRepo { fn find(...) }` |\n| Domain Event | Enum | `enum OrderEvent { Created, ... }` |\n\n## Pattern Templates\n\n### Value Object\n\n```rust\nstruct Email(String);\n\nimpl Email {\n    pub fn new(s: &str) -> Result<Self, ValidationError> {\n        validate_email(s)?;\n        Ok(Self(s.to_string()))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Entity\n\n```rust\nstruct UserId(Uuid);\n\nstruct User {\n    id: UserId,\n    email: Email,\n    // ... other fields\n}\n\nimpl PartialEq for User {\n    fn eq(&self, other: &Self) -> bool {\n        self.id == other.id  // Identity equality\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Aggregate\n\n```rust\nmod order {\n    pub struct Order {\n        id: OrderId,\n        items: Vec<OrderItem>,  // Owned children\n        // ...\n    }\n\n    impl Order {\n        pub fn add_item(&mut self, item: OrderItem) {\n            // Enforce aggregate invariants\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Why Wrong | Better |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| Primitive obsession | No type safety | Newtype wrappers |\n| Public fields with invariants | Invariants violated | Private + accessor |\n| Leaked aggregate internals | Broken encapsulation | Methods on root |\n| String for semantic types | No validation | Validated newtype |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Type-driven implementation | m05-type-driven |\n| Ownership for aggregates | m01-ownership |\n| Domain error handling | m13-domain-error |\n| Specific domain rules | domain-* |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:09:30.165Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Rust-based AI Agents requiring domain-driven design and ERC interface implementation.","zh":"适用于需要基于领域驱动设计和ERC接口实现的Rust AI代理。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントで、ドメイン駆動設計とERCインターフェースの実装が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"도메인 주도 설계 및 ERC 인터페이스 구현이 필요한 러스트 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA basados en Rust que requieren diseño orientado a dominios y implementación de interfaz ERC.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Rust nécessitant une conception orientée vers le domaine et une mise en œuvre d''interface ERC.","de":"Ideal für auf Rust basierende KI-Agents, die ein domänengetriebenes Design und eine ERC-Schnittstellenimplementierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Rust que exigem design orientado a domínio e implementação de interface ERC.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Rust, требующих проектирования, ориентированного на предметную область, и реализации интерфейса ERC.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على روست الذي يتطلب تصميمًا مدفوعًا بال领域 وتنفيذ واجهة ERC."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to model complex domains using Entity and Value Object patterns, maintaining invariants and aggregate boundaries, while integrating with Torii for event indexing and common ERC interfaces.","zh":"赋予代理使用实体和值对象模式来建模复杂域，保持不变量和聚合边界，同时与Torii集成以进行事件索引和通用ERC接口。","ja":"エージェントがエンティティと値オブジェクトのパターンを使用して複雑なドメインをモデル化し、不変性と集約境界を維持しながら、Toriiを介してイベントのインデックス付けと一般的なERCインターフェースを実現する。","ko":"에이전트가 엔티티 및 값 개체 패턴을 사용하여 복잡한 도메인을 모델링하고 불변성 및 집계 경계를 유지하는 동시에 Torii를 통해 이벤트 인덱싱 및 일반 ERC 인터페이스를 통합할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a modelar dominios complejos utilizando patrones de Entidad y Objeto de Valor, manteniendo invariantes y límites de agregado, mientras se integra con Torii para indexación de eventos y interfaces ERC comunes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de modéliser des domaines complexes en utilisant des modèles d''entité et d''objet de valeur, en maintenant les invariants et les limites d''agrégat, tout en s''intégrant à Torii pour l''indexation d''événements et les interfaces ERC courantes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, komplexe Domänen mithilfe von Entitäts- und Wertobjektmustern zu modellieren, während sie Invarianten und Aggregatgrenzen beibehalten und sich in Torii für Ereignisindexierung und gemeinsame ERC-Schnittstellen integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a modelar domínios complexos usando padrões de Entidade e Objeto de Valor, mantendo invariantes e limites de agregado, ao mesmo tempo em que se integra ao Torii para indexação de eventos e interfaces ERC comuns.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью моделировать сложные домены с помощью шаблонов Сущность и Объект значения, сохраняя инварианты и границы агрегатов, а также интегрируясь с Torii для индексации событий и общих интерфейсов ERC.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على نمذجة المجالات المعقدة باستخدام أنماط الكيان والقيمة ، مع الحفاظ على الثوابت وحدود التجميع ، في نفس الوقت الذي يتكامل مع Torii لفهرسة الأحداث وواجهات ERC المشتركة."},"useCases":{"en":["Modeling ERC interfaces for smart contract interactions","Implementing domain-driven design for blockchain applications","Indexing introspect events with Torii"],"zh":["为智能合约交互建模ERC接口","为区块链应用程序实施领域驱动设计","使用Torii索引内省事件"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトとの相互作用のためのERCインターフェースのモデル化","ブロックチェーンアプリケーションのためのドメイン駆動設計の実装","Toriiを使用したイベントのインデックス付け"],"ko":["스마트 계약 상호작용을 위한 ERC 인터페이스 모델링","블록체인 애플리케이션을 위한 도메인 주도 설계 구현","Torii를 사용한 이벤트 인덱싱"],"es":["Modelado de interfaces ERC para interacciones de contratos inteligentes","Implementación de diseño orientado a dominios para aplicaciones de blockchain","Indexación de eventos introspectivos con Torii"],"fr":["Modélisation d''interfaces ERC pour les interactions de contrats intelligents","Mise en œuvre d''une conception orientée vers le domaine pour les applications de blockchain","Indexation d''événements introspectifs avec Torii"],"de":["Modellierung von ERC-Schnittstellen für Smart-Contract-Interaktionen","Implementierung von domänengetriebenem Design für Blockchain-Anwendungen","Indexierung von Introspektevents mit Torii"],"pt":["Modelagem de interfaces ERC para interações de contrato inteligente","Implementação de design orientado a domínio para aplicações de blockchain","Indexação de eventos de introspecção com Torii"],"ru":["Моделирование интерфейсов ERC для взаимодействия с умными контрактами","Реализация проектирования, ориентированного на предметную область, для приложений блокчейна","Индексация событий интроспекции с помощью Torii"],"ar":["نمذجة واجهات ERC للتفاعلات العقود الذكية","تنفيذ تصميم مدفوع بال领域 لتطبيقات سلاسل الكتل","فهرسة أحداث التأمل مع Torii"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming language","Torii integration needed","Focus on ERC interfaces and domain modeling"],"zh":["需要Rust编程语言","需要Torii集成","重点关注ERC接口和领域建模"],"ja":["Rustプログラミング言語が必要","Toriiの統合が必要","ERCインターフェースとドメインモデリングに重点を置く"],"ko":["러스트 프로그래밍 언어 필요","토리 통합 필요","ERC 인터페이스 및 도메인 모델링에 중점"],"es":["Requiere lenguaje de programación Rust","Se necesita integración con Torii","Enfocarse en interfaces ERC y modelado de dominios"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Rust","Intégration à Torii nécessaire","Se concentre sur les interfaces ERC et la modélisation de domaines"],"de":["Erfordert Rust-Programmiersprache","Torii-Integration erforderlich","Fokus auf ERC-Schnittstellen und Domänenmodellierung"],"pt":["Exige linguagem de programação Rust","Necessária integração com Torii","Foco em interfaces ERC e modelagem de domínio"],"ru":["Требуется язык программирования Rust","Необходима интеграция с Torii","Фокус на интерфейсах ERC и моделировании домена"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة برمجة روست","يتطلب تكامل مع Torii","التركيز على واجهات ERC ونمذجة المجال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
