 обеспечения","Технология блокчейна","Индексирование событий","Анализ ошибок"],"ar":["Torii","ملكية البيانات","التأمل","واجهات ERC","إدارة البيانات","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا البلوكشين","فهرسة الأحداث","تحليل الأخطاء"]}},"owner":"dojoengine","repo":"torii-core","repoPath":"dojoengine/torii-core","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m01-ownership","description":"CRITICAL: Use for ownership/borrow/lifetime issues. Triggers: E0382, E0597, E0506, E0507, E0515, E0716, E0106, value moved, borrowed value does not live long enough, cannot move out of, use of moved value, ownership, borrow, lifetime, a, static, move, clone, Copy, 所有权, 借用, 生命周期","bodyPreview":"# Ownership & Lifetimes\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Who should own this data, and for how long?**\n\nBefore fixing ownership errors, understand the data''s role:\n- Is it shared or exclusive?\n- Is it short-lived or long-lived?\n- Is it transformed or just read?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0382 | \"Clone it\" | Who should own this data? |\n| E0597 | \"Extend lifetime\" | Is the scope bound","body":"# Ownership & Lifetimes\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Who should own this data, and for how long?**\n\nBefore fixing ownership errors, understand the data''s role:\n- Is it shared or exclusive?\n- Is it short-lived or long-lived?\n- Is it transformed or just read?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0382 | \"Clone it\" | Who should own this data? |\n| E0597 | \"Extend lifetime\" | Is the scope boundary correct? |\n| E0506 | \"End borrow first\" | Should mutation happen elsewhere? |\n| E0507 | \"Clone before move\" | Why are we moving from a reference? |\n| E0515 | \"Return owned\" | Should caller own the data? |\n| E0716 | \"Bind to variable\" | Why is this temporary? |\n| E0106 | \"Add ''a\" | What is the actual lifetime relationship? |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore fixing an ownership error, ask:\n\n1. **What is this data''s domain role?**\n   - Entity (unique identity) → owned\n   - Value Object (interchangeable) → clone/copy OK\n   - Temporary (computation result) → maybe restructure\n\n2. **Is the ownership design intentional?**\n   - By design → work within constraints\n   - Accidental → consider redesign\n\n3. **Fix symptom or redesign?**\n   - If Strike 3 (3rd attempt) → escalate to Layer 2\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nWhen errors persist, trace to design layer:\n\n```\nE0382 (moved value)\n    ↑ Ask: What design choice led to this ownership pattern?\n    ↑ Check: m09-domain (is this Entity or Value Object?)\n    ↑ Check: domain-* (what constraints apply?)\n```\n\n| Persistent Error | Trace To | Question |\n|-----------------|----------|----------|\n| E0382 repeated | m02-resource | Should use Arc/Rc for sharing? |\n| E0597 repeated | m09-domain | Is scope boundary at right place? |\n| E0506/E0507 | m03-mutability | Should use interior mutability? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nFrom design decisions to implementation:\n\n```\n\"Data needs to be shared immutably\"\n    ↓ Use: Arc<T> (multi-thread) or Rc<T> (single-thread)\n\n\"Data needs exclusive ownership\"\n    ↓ Use: move semantics, take ownership\n\n\"Data is read-only view\"\n    ↓ Use: &T (immutable borrow)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Ownership | Cost | Use When |\n|---------|-----------|------|----------|\n| Move | Transfer | Zero | Caller doesn''t need data |\n| `&T` | Borrow | Zero | Read-only access |\n| `&mut T` | Exclusive borrow | Zero | Need to modify |\n| `clone()` | Duplicate | Alloc + copy | Actually need a copy |\n| `Rc<T>` | Shared (single) | Ref count | Single-thread sharing |\n| `Arc<T>` | Shared (multi) | Atomic ref count | Multi-thread sharing |\n| `Cow<T>` | Clone-on-write | Alloc if mutated | Might modify |\n\n## Error Code Reference\n\n| Error | Cause | Quick Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----------|\n| E0382 | Value moved | Clone, reference, or redesign ownership |\n| E0597 | Reference outlives owner | Extend owner scope or restructure |\n| E0506 | Assign while borrowed | End borrow before mutation |\n| E0507 | Move out of borrowed | Clone or use reference |\n| E0515 | Return local reference | Return owned value |\n| E0716 | Temporary dropped | Bind to variable |\n| E0106 | Missing lifetime | Add `''a` annotation |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why Bad | Better |\n|--------------|---------|--------|\n| `.clone()` everywhere | Hides design issues | Design ownership properly |\n| Fight borrow checker | Increases complexity | Work with the compiler |\n| `''static` for everything | Restricts flexibility | Use appropriate lifetimes |\n| Leak with `Box::leak` | Memory leak | Proper lifetime design |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Need smart pointers | m02-resource |\n| Need interior mutability | m03-mutability |\n| Data is domain entity | m09-domain |\n| Learning ownership concepts | m14-mental-model |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:11:04.942Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Smart Contract Agents needing advanced ERC interface implementation and event indexing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级ERC接口实现和事件索引功能的智能合约代理。","ja":"スマートコントラクトエージェントが高度なERCインターフェイスの実装とイベントインデックス機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 ERC 인터페이스 구현 및 이벤트 인덱싱 기능이 필요한 스마트 계약 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Smart Contract que necesitan una implementación avanzada de la interfaz ERC y capacidades de indexación de eventos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Smart Contract ayant besoin d''une mise en œuvre avancée de l''interface ERC et de capacités d''indexation d''événements.","de":"Perfekt für Smart-Contract-Agents, die eine erweiterte ERC-Schnittstellenimplementierung und Ereignis-Indexierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Contrato Inteligente que necessitam de implementação avançada de interface ERC e capacidades de indexação de eventos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов умных контрактов, которым необходима продвинутая реализация интерфейса ERC и возможности индексации событий.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات العميل الذكية التي تحتاج إلى تنفيذ متقدم لواجهة ERC وقدرات فهرسة الأحداث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage data ownership and lifetimes effectively, utilizing Torii''s core implementation to index introspect events and interact with common ERC interfaces, addressing errors like E0382 and E0597 through informed design questions about data roles and scopes.","zh":"赋予代理管理数据所有权和生命周期的能力，利用Torii的核心实现来索引反射事件并与常见的ERC接口交互，通过关于数据角色和范围的明智设计问题来解决E0382和E0597等错误。","ja":"エージェントがデータの所有権とライフサイクルを効果的に管理できるようにし、Toriiのコア実装を使用して反射イベントをインデックス化し、一般的なERCインターフェイスとやり取りし、データの役割と範囲についての情報に基づいた設計の質問を通じてE0382およびE0597などのエラーに対処します。","ko":"에이전트가 데이터 소유권 및 수명을 효과적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, Torii의 핵심 구현을 사용하여 반사 이벤트를 인덱싱하고 일반적인 ERC 인터페이스와 상호 작용하여 데이터 역할 및 범위에 대한 정보에 기반한 설계 질문을 통해 E0382 및 E0597などの 오류를 해결합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar la propiedad y los tiempos de vida de los datos de manera efectiva, utilizando la implementación principal de Torii para indexar eventos introspectivos y interactuar con interfaces ERC comunes, abordando errores como E0382 y E0597 a través de preguntas de diseño informadas sobre roles y alcances de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement la propriété et les durées de vie des données, en utilisant la mise en œuvre principale de Torii pour indexer les événements introspectifs et interagir avec les interfaces ERC courantes, en résolvant les erreurs comme E0382 et E0597 grâce à des questions de conception éclairées sur les rôles et les portées des données.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Eigentums- und Lebensdauer der Daten effektiv zu verwalten, indem sie die Kernimplementierung von Torii nutzen, um introspektive Ereignisse zu indexieren und mit gemeinsamen ERC-Schnittstellen zu interagieren, und Fehler wie E0382 und E0597 durch informierte Designfragen zu Datenrollen und -bereichen zu beheben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar a propriedade e os tempos de vida dos dados de forma eficaz, utilizando a implementação principal do Torii para indexar eventos de introspecção e interagir com interfaces ERC comuns, abordando erros como E0382 e E0597 por meio de questões de design informadas sobre papéis e escopos de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять владением и сроками жизни данных, используя основную реализацию Torii для индексации интроспективных событий и взаимодействия с общими интерфейсами ERC, решая ошибки, такие как E0382 и E0597, посредством информированных вопросов дизайна о ролях и областях данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة ملكية البيانات وأعطاءها حياة فعالة، باستخدام التنفيذ الرئيسي لـ Torii لفهرسة أحداث التأمل وتفاعلها مع واجهات ERC الشائعة، ومعالجة أخطاء مثل E0382 و E0597 من خلال أسئلة تصميم مستنيرة حول أدوار بيانات والنطاقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging ownership errors in smart contracts","Implementing shared or exclusive data access patterns","Determining optimal data lifetimes for ERC-based applications"],"zh":["调试智能合约中的所有权错误","实现共享或独占的数据访问模式","确定基于ERC的应用程序的最佳数据生命周期"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトの所有権エラーのデバッグ","共有または排他的データアクセスパターンの実装","ERCベースのアプリケーションの最適なデータライフサイクルの決定"],"ko":["스마트 계약의 소유권 오류 디버깅","공유 또는 독점적 데이터 액세스 패턴 구현","ERC 기반 애플리케이션의 최적 데이터 수명 결정"],"es":["Depuración de errores de propiedad en smart contracts","Implementación de patrones de acceso a datos compartidos o exclusivos","Determinación de tiempos de vida de datos óptimos para aplicaciones basadas en ERC"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs de propriété dans les smart contracts","Mise en œuvre de modèles d''accès aux données partagés ou exclusifs","Détermination des durées de vie de données optimales pour les applications basées sur ERC"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Eigentumsfehlern in Smart Contracts","Implementierung von gemeinsamen oder exklusiven Datenzugriffsmustern","Bestimmung optimaler Datenlebensdauern für auf ERC basierende Anwendungen"],"pt":["Depuração de erros de propriedade em contratos inteligentes","Implementação de padrões de acesso a dados compartilhados ou exclusivos","Determinação de tempos de vida ótimos de dados para aplicações baseadas em ERC"],"ru":["Отладка ошибок владения в умных контрактах","Реализация паттернов доступа к данным, общим или исключительным","Определение оптимальных сроков жизни данных для приложений на основе ERC"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء ملكية في العقود الذكية","تنفيذ أنماط الوصول إلى البيانات المشتركة أو الحصرية","تحديد أوقات الحياة المثلى للبيانات لتطبيقات ERC"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Torii and ERC interfaces","Limited to smart contract development on compatible platforms"],"zh":["需要了解Torii和ERC接口","仅限于兼容平台上的智能合约开发"],"ja":["ToriiとERCインターフェイスの理解が必要","互換性のあるプラットフォームでのスマートコントラクト開発のみ"],"ko":["Torii 및 ERC 인터페이스에 대한 이해가 필요","호환 플랫폼에서 스마트 계약 개발만 가능"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de Torii y interfaces ERC","Limitado al desarrollo de smart contracts en plataformas compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de Torii et des interfaces ERC","Limité au développement de smart contracts sur des plateformes compatibles"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis von Torii und ERC-Schnittstellen","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Smart Contracts auf kompatiblen Plattformen"],"pt":["Requer entendimento do Torii e interfaces ERC","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de contratos inteligentes em plataformas compatíveis"],"ru":["Требует понимания Torii и интерфейсов ERC","Ограничен разработкой умных контрактов на совместимых платформах"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم Torii وواجهات ERC","محدود بتطوير العقود الذكية على منصات متوافقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
