"],"ru":["Анализ текущей структуры папок","Удаление дубликатов файлов","Оптимизация структуры папок","Улучшение производительности","Создание логической структуры папок"],"ar":["تحليل هيكل المجلدات الحالي","إزالة الملفات المكررة","تحسين هيكل المجلدات","تحسين الإنتاجية","إنشاء هيكل مجلدات منطقي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["文件整理","文件组织","文件结构","文件优化","文件查找","文件归档","文件管理","文件工具","文件软件"],"ja":["ファイル整理","ファイル組織","ファイル構造","ファイル最適化","ファイル検索","ファイルアーカイブ","ファイル管理","ファイルツール","ファイルソフトウェア"],"ko":["파일 정리","파일 구조","파일 최적화","파일 검색","파일 아카이브","파일 관리","파일 도구","파일 소프트웨어","파일 조직"],"es":["organizador de archivos","estructura de carpetas","productividad","archivos duplicados","ordenar carpetas","herramientas de productividad"],"fr":["organisateur de fichiers","structure de dossiers","productivité","fichiers en double","ordonner des dossiers","outils de productivité"],"de":["Datei-Organisator","Ordnerstruktur","Produktivität","doppelte Dateien","Ordner ordnen","Produktivitätstools"],"pt":["organizador de arquivos","otimização de pastas","eliminação de arquivos duplicados","produtividade","estrutura de pastas","ferramenta de organização"],"ru":["органайзер файлов","оптимизация папок","удаление дубликатов файлов","производительность","структура папок","инструмент организации"],"ar":["منظم الملفات","تحسين المجلدات","إزالة الملفات المكررة","الإنتاجية","هيكل المجلدات","أداة التنظيم"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.474Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"file-organizer","description":"Intelligently organizes files and folders by understanding context, finding duplicates, and suggesting better organizational structures. Use when user wants to clean up directories, organize downloads, remove duplicates, or restructure projects.","bodyPreview":"# File Organizer\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Your Downloads folder is a chaotic mess\n- You can''t find files because they''re scattered everywhere\n- You have duplicate files taking up space\n- Your folder structure doesn''t make sense anymore\n- You want to establish better organization habits\n- You''re starting a new project and need a good structure\n- You''re cleaning up before archiving old projects\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Current Structure**: Reviews your folders and files to unde","body":"# File Organizer\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Your Downloads folder is a chaotic mess\n- You can''t find files because they''re scattered everywhere\n- You have duplicate files taking up space\n- Your folder structure doesn''t make sense anymore\n- You want to establish better organization habits\n- You''re starting a new project and need a good structure\n- You''re cleaning up before archiving old projects\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Current Structure**: Reviews your folders and files to understand what you have\n2. **Finds Duplicates**: Identifies duplicate files across your system\n3. **Suggests Organization**: Proposes logical folder structures based on your content\n4. **Automates Cleanup**: Moves, renames, and organizes files with your approval\n5. **Maintains Context**: Makes smart decisions based on file types, dates, and content\n6. **Reduces Clutter**: Identifies old files you probably don''t need anymore\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests file organization help:\n\n1. **Understand the Scope**\n\n   Ask clarifying questions:\n\n   - Which directory needs organization? (Downloads, Documents, entire home folder?)\n   - What''s the main problem? (Can''t find things, duplicates, too messy, no structure?)\n   - Any files or folders to avoid? (Current projects, sensitive data?)\n   - How aggressively to organize? (Conservative vs. comprehensive cleanup)\n\n2. **Analyze Current State**\n\n   Review the target directory:\n\n   ```bash\n   # Get overview of current structure\n   ls -la [target_directory]\n\n   # Check file types and sizes\n   find [target_directory] -type f -exec file {} \\; | head -20\n\n   # Identify largest files\n   du -sh [target_directory]/* | sort -rh | head -20\n\n   # Count file types\n   find [target_directory] -type f | sed ''s/.*\\.//'' | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn\n   ```\n\n   Summarize findings:\n\n   - Total files and folders\n   - File type breakdown\n   - Size distribution\n   - Date ranges\n   - Obvious organization issues\n\n3. **Identify Organization Patterns**\n\n   Based on the files, determine logical groupings:\n\n   **By Type**:\n\n   - Documents (PDFs, DOCX, TXT)\n   - Images (JPG, PNG, SVG)\n   - Videos (MP4, MOV)\n   - Archives (ZIP, TAR, DMG)\n   - Code/Projects (directories with code)\n   - Spreadsheets (XLSX, CSV)\n   - Presentations (PPTX, KEY)\n\n   **By Purpose**:\n\n   - Work vs. Personal\n   - Active vs. Archive\n   - Project-specific\n   - Reference materials\n   - Temporary/scratch files\n\n   **By Date**:\n\n   - Current year/month\n   - Previous years\n   - Very old (archive candidates)\n\n4. **Find Duplicates**\n\n   When requested, search for duplicates:\n\n   ```bash\n   # Find exact duplicates by hash\n   find [directory] -type f -exec md5 {} \\; | sort | uniq -d\n\n   # Find files with similar names\n   find [directory] -type f -printf ''%f\\n'' | sort | uniq -d\n\n   # Find similar-sized files\n   find [directory] -type f -printf ''%s %p\\n'' | sort -n\n   ```\n\n   For each set of duplicates:\n\n   - Show all file paths\n   - Display sizes and modification dates\n   - Recommend which to keep (usually newest or best-named)\n   - **Important**: Always ask for confirmation before deleting\n\n5. **Propose Organization Plan**\n\n   Present a clear plan before making changes:\n\n   ```markdown\n   # Organization Plan for [Directory]\n\n   ## Current State\n\n   - X files across Y folders\n   - [Size] total\n   - File types: [breakdown]\n   - Issues: [list problems]\n\n   ## Proposed Structure\n\n   [Directory]/\n   ├── Work/\n   │ ├── Projects/\n   │ ├── Documents/\n   │ └── Archive/\n   ├── Personal/\n   │ ├── Photos/\n   │ ├── Documents/\n   │ └── Media/\n   └── Downloads/\n   ├── To-Sort/\n   └── Archive/\n\n   ## Changes I''ll Make\n\n   1. **Create new folders**: [list]\n   2. **Move files**:\n      - X PDFs → Work/Documents/\n      - Y images → Personal/Photos/\n      - Z old files → Archive/\n   3. **Rename files**: [any renaming patterns]\n   4. **Delete**: [duplicates or trash files]\n\n   ## Files Needing Your Decision\n\n   - [List any files you''re unsure about]\n\n   Ready to proceed? (yes/no/modify)\n   ```\n\n6. **Execute Organization**\n\n   After approval, organize systematically:\n\n   ```bash\n   # Create folder structure\n   mkdir -p \"path/to/new/folders\"\n\n   # Move files with clear logging\n   mv \"old/path/file.pdf\" \"new/path/file.pdf\"\n\n   # Rename files with consistent patterns\n   # Example: \"YYYY-MM-DD - Description.ext\"\n   ```\n\n   **Important Rules**:\n\n   - Always confirm before deleting anything\n   - Log all moves for potential undo\n   - Preserve original modification dates\n   - Handle filename conflicts gracefully\n   - Stop and ask if you encounter unexpected situations\n\n7. **Provide Summary and Maintenance Tips**\n\n   After organizing:\n\n   ```markdown\n   # Organization Complete! ✨\n\n   ## What Changed\n\n   - Created [X] new folders\n   - Organized [Y] files\n   - Freed [Z] GB by removing duplicates\n   - Archived [W] old files\n\n   ## New Structure\n\n   [Show the new folder tree]\n\n   ## Maintenance Tips\n\n   To keep this organized:\n\n   1. **Weekly**: Sort new downloads\n   2. **Monthly**: Review and archive completed projects\n   3. **Quarterly**: Check for new duplicates\n   4. **Yearly**: Archive old files\n\n   ## Quick Commands for You\n\n   # Find files modified this week\n\n   find . -type f -mtime -7\n\n   # Sort downloads by type\n\n   [custom command for their setup]\n\n   # Find duplicates\n\n   [custom command]\n   ```\n\n   Want to organize another folder?\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Folder Naming\n\n- Use clear, descriptive names\n- Avoid spaces (use hyphens or underscores)\n- Be specific: \"client-proposals\" not \"docs\"\n- Use prefixes for ordering: \"01-current\", \"02-archive\"\n\n### File Naming\n\n- Include dates: \"2024-10-17-meeting-notes.md\"\n- Be descriptive: \"q3-financial-report.xlsx\"\n- Avoid version numbers in names (use version control instead)\n- Remove download artifacts: \"document-final-v2 (1).pdf\" → \"document.pdf\"\n\n### When to Archive\n\n- Projects not touched in 6+ months\n- Completed work that might be referenced later\n- Old versions after migration to new systems\n- Files you''re hesitant to delete (archive first)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:11:08.467Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing advanced file management and organization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级文件管理和组织功能的生产力代理。","ja":"高度なファイル管理および組織機能を必要とする生産性エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 파일 관리 및 조직 기능이 필요한 생산성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Productividad que necesitan capacidades de gestión y organización de archivos avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de productivité ayant besoin de capacités de gestion et d''organisation de fichiers avancées.","de":"Ideal für Produktivitätsagenten, die erweiterte Dateiverwaltungs- und Organisationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento e organização de arquivos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов продуктивности, которым требуются расширенные возможности управления и организации файлов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإنتاجية الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة في إدارة الملفات والتنظيم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze current folder structures, eliminate duplicate files, and establish better organization habits using protocols like file system scanning and metadata analysis.","zh":"使代理能够分析当前的文件夹结构，消除重复文件，并使用文件系统扫描和元数据分析等协议建立更好的组织习惯。","ja":"エージェントが現在のフォルダ構造を分析し、重複ファイルを排除し、ファイルシステムのスキャニングやメタデータ分析などのプロトコルを使用してより良い組織習慣を確立できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 현재 폴더 구조를 분석하고 중복 파일을 제거하며 파일 시스템 스캔 및 메타데이터 분석 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 더 나은 조직習慣을 확립할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar las estructuras de carpetas actuales, eliminar archivos duplicados y establecer mejores hábitos de organización utilizando protocolos como el análisis del sistema de archivos y el análisis de metadatos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les structures de dossiers actuelles, d''éliminer les fichiers en double et d''établir de meilleures habitudes d''organisation en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''analyse du système de fichiers et l''analyse des métadonnées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die aktuellen Ordnerstrukturen zu analysieren, doppelte Dateien zu eliminieren und bessere Organisationsgewohnheiten unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Dateisystemscanning und Metadatenanalyse zu etablieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar as estruturas de pastas atuais, eliminar arquivos duplicados e estabelecer melhores hábitos de organização usando protocolos como varredura do sistema de arquivos e análise de metadados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать текущие структуры папок, удалять дубликаты файлов и устанавливать лучшие привычки организации с помощью протоколов, таких как сканирование файловой системы и анализ метаданных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل هياكل المجلدات الحالية وإزالة الملفات المكررة وإنشاء عادات تنظيم أفضل باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل مسح نظام الملفات وتحليل البيانات الوصفية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating folder structure reviews","Eliminating duplicate files to free up disk space","Establishing consistent naming conventions","Reorganizing downloads folders"],"zh":["自动化文件夹结构审查","消除重复文件以释放磁盘空间","建立一致的命名约定","重新组织下载文件夹"],"ja":["フォルダ構造のレビューを自動化する","重複ファイルを削除してディスク空間を解放する","一貫した命名規則を確立する","ダウンロードフォルダを再構成する"],"ko":["폴더 구조 검토 자동화","중복 파일을 제거하여 디스크 공간을 해제하는こと","일관된 이름 규칙을 설정하는 것","다운로드 폴더를 재구성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de la estructura de carpetas","Eliminar archivos duplicados para liberar espacio en disco","Establecer convenciones de nomenclatura coherentes","Reorganizar las carpetas de descargas"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de la structure de dossiers","Éliminer les fichiers en double pour libérer de l''espace disque","Établir des conventions de dénomination cohérentes","Réorganiser les dossiers de téléchargement"],"de":["Automatisieren von Ordnerstruktur-Überprüfungen","Entfernen von doppelten Dateien, um Festplattenspeicherplatz freizumachen","Festlegen konsistenter Benennungskonventionen","Neuorganisieren von Download-Ordnern"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões da estrutura de pastas","Eliminar arquivos duplicados para liberar espaço em disco","Estabelecer convenções de nomenclatura consistentes","Reorganizar pastas de downloads"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обзор структуры папок","Удалить дубликаты файлов для освобождения места на диске","Установить последовательные соглашения об именах","Переорганизовать папки загрузок"],"ar":["تأتميم مراجعة هياكل المجلدات","إزالة الملفات المكررة لتحرير مساحة القرص","إنشاء اتفاقيات تسمية متسقة","إعادة تنظيم مجلدات التنزيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access","May require user input for customization","Limited to local file systems"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问","可能需要用户输入进行自定义","仅限于本地文件系统"],"ja":["ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","カスタマイズのためにユーザー入力が必要になる場合がある","ローカルファイルシステムのみに限定される"],"ko":["파일 시스템 액세스가 필요함","사용자 입력이 필요할 수 있는 사용자 지정 제한","로컬 파일 시스템만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos","Puede requerir la entrada del usuario para la personalización","Limitado a sistemas de archivos locales"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers","Peut nécessiter une saisie utilisateur pour la personnalisation","Limité aux systèmes de fichiers locaux"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem","Kann Benutzereingaben für die Anpassung erfordern","Begrenzt auf lokale Dateisysteme"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos","Pode requerer entrada do usuário para personalização","Limitado a sistemas de arquivos locais"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе","Может требовать ввода пользователя для настройки","Ограничен локальными файловыми системами"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات","قد يتطلب إدخال المستخدم للتعديل","محدود بنظم الملفات المحلية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
