igo"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности","Решение проблем с утечкой памяти","Разработка пользовательских шейдеров","Реализация функций WebGPU","Лучшие практики для настройки проектов","Правила для проверки кода"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","حل مشكلات泄漏 الذاكرة","تنمية شادرات مخصصة","تنفيذ ميزات ويب جي بي يو","أفضل الممارسات لتهيئة المشاريع","قواعد لمراجعة التعليمات البرمجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Three.js性能优化","Three.js最佳实践","WebGL优化","JavaScript性能优化","Three.js开发","WebGPU","性能优化指南","Three.js规则"],"ja":["Three.jsパフォーマンス最適化","Three.jsベストプラクティス","WebGL最適化","JavaScriptパフォーマンス最適化","Three.js開発","WebGPU","パフォーマンス最適化ガイド","Three.jsルール"],"ko":["Three.js 성능 최적화","Three.js 모범 사례","WebGL 최적화","JavaScript 성능 최적화","Three.js 개발","WebGPU","성능 최적화 가이드","Three.js 규칙"],"es":["Three.js","optimización de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","WebGPU","shaders personalizados","mrdoob"],"fr":["Three.js","optimisation des performances","bonnes pratiques","développement d''applications","WebGPU","shaders personnalisés","mrdoob"],"de":["Three.js","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","Anwendungsentwicklung","WebGPU","benutzerdefinierte Shaders","mrdoob"],"pt":["Three.js","Otimização de desempenho","Desenvolvimento de jogos","WebGL","WebGPU","Shaders personalizados","Vazamentos de memória","Melhores práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Three.js","Оптимизация производительности","Разработка игр","WebGL","WebGPU","Пользовательские шейдеры","Утечка памяти","Лучшие практики разработки"],"ar":["ثري جيه إس","تحسين الأداء","تنمية الألعاب","ويب جي ال","ويب جي بي يو","شادرات مخصصة","泄漏 الذاكرة","أفضل الممارسات للتنمية"]}},"owner":"rickyraz","repo":"learn-three-typegpu-claude","repoPath":"rickyraz/learn-three-typegpu-claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"three-best-practices","description":"Three.js performance optimization and best practices guidelines. Use when writing, reviewing, or optimizing Three.js code. Triggers on tasks involving 3D scenes, WebGL/WebGPU rendering, geometries, materials, textures, lighting, shaders, or TSL.","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Three.js Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Three.js applications. Contains 100+ rules across 17 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n> Based on official guidelines from Three.js `llms` branch maintained by mrdoob.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Setting up a new Three.js project\n- Writing or reviewing Three.js code\n- Optimizing performance or fixing memory leaks\n- Working with custom shaders (GLSL or TSL)\n- Implementing WebGPU features\n- Buil","body":"# Three.js Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Three.js applications. Contains 100+ rules across 17 categories, prioritized by impact.\n\n> Based on official guidelines from Three.js `llms` branch maintained by mrdoob.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Setting up a new Three.js project\n- Writing or reviewing Three.js code\n- Optimizing performance or fixing memory leaks\n- Working with custom shaders (GLSL or TSL)\n- Implementing WebGPU features\n- Building VR/AR experiences with WebXR\n- Integrating physics engines\n- Optimizing for mobile devices\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 0 | Modern Setup & Imports | FUNDAMENTAL | `setup-` |\n| 1 | Memory Management & Dispose | CRITICAL | `memory-` |\n| 2 | Render Loop Optimization | CRITICAL | `render-` |\n| 3 | Geometry & Buffer Management | HIGH | `geometry-` |\n| 4 | Material & Texture Optimization | HIGH | `material-` |\n| 5 | Lighting & Shadows | MEDIUM-HIGH | `lighting-` |\n| 6 | Scene Graph Organization | MEDIUM | `scene-` |\n| 7 | Shader Best Practices (GLSL) | MEDIUM | `shader-` |\n| 8 | TSL (Three.js Shading Language) | MEDIUM | `tsl-` |\n| 9 | Loading & Assets | MEDIUM | `loading-` |\n| 10 | Camera & Controls | LOW-MEDIUM | `camera-` |\n| 11 | Animation System | MEDIUM | `animation-` |\n| 12 | Physics Integration | MEDIUM | `physics-` |\n| 13 | WebXR / VR / AR | MEDIUM | `webxr-` |\n| 14 | Audio | LOW-MEDIUM | `audio-` |\n| 15 | Mobile Optimization | HIGH | `mobile-` |\n| 16 | Production | HIGH | `error-`, `migration-` |\n| 17 | Debug & DevTools | LOW | `debug-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 0. Modern Setup (FUNDAMENTAL)\n\n- `setup-use-import-maps` - Use Import Maps, not old CDN scripts\n- `setup-choose-renderer` - WebGLRenderer (default) vs WebGPURenderer (TSL/compute)\n- `setup-animation-loop` - Use `renderer.setAnimationLoop()` not manual RAF\n- `setup-basic-scene-template` - Complete modern scene template\n\n### 1. Memory Management (CRITICAL)\n\n- `memory-dispose-geometry` - Always dispose geometries\n- `memory-dispose-material` - Always dispose materials and textures\n- `memory-dispose-textures` - Dispose dynamically created textures\n- `memory-dispose-render-targets` - Always dispose WebGLRenderTarget\n- `memory-dispose-recursive` - Use recursive disposal for hierarchies\n- `memory-dispose-on-unmount` - Dispose in React cleanup/unmount\n- `memory-renderer-dispose` - Dispose renderer when destroying view\n- `memory-reuse-objects` - Reuse geometries and materials\n\n### 2. Render Loop (CRITICAL)\n\n- `render-single-raf` - Single requestAnimationFrame loop\n- `render-conditional` - Render on demand for static scenes\n- `render-delta-time` - Use delta time for animations\n- `render-avoid-allocations` - Never allocate in render loop\n- `render-cache-computations` - Cache expensive computations\n- `render-frustum-culling` - Enable frustum culling\n- `render-update-matrix-manual` - Disable auto matrix updates for static objects\n- `render-pixel-ratio` - Limit pixel ratio to 2\n- `render-antialias-wisely` - Use antialiasing judiciously\n\n### 3. Geometry (HIGH)\n\n- `geometry-buffer-geometry` - Always use BufferGeometry\n- `geometry-merge-static` - Merge static geometries\n- `geometry-instanced-mesh` - Use InstancedMesh for identical objects\n- `geometry-lod` - Use Level of Detail for complex models\n- `geometry-index-buffer` - Use indexed geometry\n- `geometry-vertex-count` - Minimize vertex count\n- `geometry-attributes-typed` - Use appropriate typed arrays\n- `geometry-interleaved` - Consider interleaved buffers\n\n### 4. Materials & Textures (HIGH)\n\n- `material-reuse` - Reuse materials across meshes\n- `material-simplest-sufficient` - Use simplest material that works\n- `material-texture-size-power-of-two` - Power-of-two texture dimensions\n- `material-texture-compression` - Use compressed textures (KTX2/Basis)\n- `material-texture-mipmaps` - Enable mipmaps appropriately\n- `material-texture-anisotropy` - Use anisotropic filtering for floors\n- `material-texture-atlas` - Use texture atlases\n- `material-avoid-transparency` - Minimize transparent materials\n- `material-onbeforecompile` - Use onBeforeCompile for shader mods (or TSL)\n\n### 5. Lighting & Shadows (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `lighting-limit-lights` - Minimize dynamic lights\n- `lighting-bake-static` - Bake lighting for static scenes\n- `lighting-shadow-camera-tight` - Fit shadow camera tightly\n- `lighting-shadow-map-size` - Choose appropriate shadow resolution\n- `lighting-shadow-selective` - Enable shadows selectively\n- `lighting-shadow-cascade` - Use CSM for large scenes\n- `lighting-probe` - Use Light Probes\n\n### 6. Scene Graph (MEDIUM)\n\n- `scene-group-objects` - Use Groups for organization\n- `scene-layers` - Use Layers for selective rendering\n- `scene-visible-toggle` - Use visible flag, not add/remove\n- `scene-flatten-static` - Flatten static hierarchies\n- `scene-name-objects` - Name objects for debugging\n- `scene-object-pooling` - Use object pooling\n\n### 7. Shaders GLSL (MEDIUM)\n\n- `shader-precision` - Use appropriate precision\n- `shader-avoid-branching` - Minimize branching\n- `shader-precompute-cpu` - Precompute on CPU\n- `shader-avoid-discard` - Avoid discard, use alphaTest\n- `shader-texture-lod` - Use textureLod for known mip levels\n- `shader-uniform-arrays` - Prefer uniform arrays\n- `shader-varying-interpolation` - Use flat when appropriate\n- `shader-chunk-injection` - Use Three.js shader chunks\n\n### 8. TSL - Three.js Shading Language (MEDIUM)\n\n- `tsl-why-use` - Use TSL instead of onBeforeCompile\n- `tsl-setup-webgpu` - WebGPU setup for TSL\n- `tsl-complete-reference` - Full TSL type system and functions\n- `tsl-material-slots` - Material node properties reference\n- `tsl-node-materials` - Use NodeMaterial classes\n- `tsl-basic-operations` - Types, operations, swizzling\n- `tsl-functions` - Creating TSL functions with Fn()\n- `tsl-conditionals` - If, select, loops in TSL\n- `tsl-textures` - Textures and triplanar mapping\n- `tsl-post-processing` - bloom, blur, dof, ao\n- `tsl-compute-shaders` - GPGPU and compute operations\n- `tsl-glsl-to-tsl` - GLSL to TSL translation\n\n### 9. Loading & Assets (MEDIUM)\n\n- `loading-draco-compression` - Use Draco for large meshes\n- `loading-gltf-preferred` - Use glTF format\n- `gltf-loading-optimization` - Full loader setup with DRACO/Meshopt/KTX2\n- `loading-progress-feedback` - Show loading progress\n- `loading-async-await` - Use async/await for loading\n- `loading-lazy` - Lazy load non-critical assets\n- `loading-cache-assets` - Enable caching\n- `loading-dispose-unused` - Unload unused assets\n\n### 10. Camera & Controls (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `camera-near-far` - Set tight near/far planes\n- `camera-fov` - Choose appropriate FOV\n- `camera-controls-damping` - Use damping for smooth controls\n- `camera-resize-handler` - Handle resize properly\n- `camera-orbit-limits` - Set orbit control limits\n\n### 11. Animation (MEDIUM)\n\n- `animation-system` - AnimationMixer, blending, morph targets, skeletal\n\n### 12. Physics (MEDIUM)\n\n- `physics-integration` - Rapier, Cannon-es integration patterns\n\n### 13. WebXR (MEDIUM)\n\n- `webxr-setup` - VR/AR buttons, controllers, hit testing\n\n### 14. Audio (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `audio-spatial` - PositionalAudio, HRTF, spatial sound\n\n### 15. Optimization (HIGH)\n\n- `mobile-optimization` - Mobile-specific optimizations and checklist\n- `raycasting-optimization` - BVH, layers, GPU picking\n\n### 16. Production (HIGH)\n\n- `error-handling-recovery` - WebGL context loss and recovery\n- `migration-checklist` - Breaking changes by version\n\n### 17. Debug (LOW)\n\n- `debug-stats` - Use Stats.js\n- `debug-helpers` - Use built-in helpers\n- `debug-gui` - Use lil-gui for tweaking\n- `debug-renderer-info` - Check renderer.info\n- `debug-conditional` - Remove debug code in production\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/setup-use-import-maps.md\nrules/memory-dispose-geometry.md\nrules/tsl-complete-reference.md\nrules/mobile-optimization.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- BAD code example with explanation\n- GOOD code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Modern Import Maps\n\n```html\n<script type=\"importmap\">\n{\n  \"imports\": {\n    \"three\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.182.0/build/three.module.js\",\n    \"three/addons/\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.182.0/examples/jsm/\",\n    \"three/tsl\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.182.0/build/three.tsl.js\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### Proper Disposal\n\n```javascript\nfunction disposeObject(obj) {\n  if (obj.geometry) obj.geometry.dispose();\n  if (obj.material) {\n    if (Array.isArray(obj.material)) {\n      obj.material.forEach(m => m.dispose());\n    } else {\n      obj.material.dispose();\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### TSL Basic Usage\n\n```javascript\nimport { texture, uv, color, time, sin } from ''three/tsl'';\n\nconst material = new THREE.MeshStandardNodeMaterial();\nmaterial.colorNode = texture(map).mul(color(0xff0000));\nmaterial.colorNode = color(0x00ff00).mul(sin(time).mul(0.5).add(0.5));\n```\n\n### Mobile Detection\n\n```javascript\nconst isMobile = /Android|iPhone|iPad|iPod/i.test(navigator.userAgent);\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, isMobile ? 1.5 : 2));\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:11:39.177Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Graphics Agents needing advanced Three.js performance optimization and best practices for WebGPU and custom shaders","zh":"非常适合需要高级Three.js性能优化和WebGPU及自定义着色器最佳实践的图形代理","ja":"Three.jsのパフォーマンス最適化とWebGPUおよびカスタムシェーダーのベストプラクティスが必要なグラフィックスエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 Three.js 성능 최적화 및 WebGPU 및 사용자 정의 셰이더에 대한 모범 사례가 필요한 그래픽 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes gráficos que necesitan una optimización avanzada del rendimiento de Three.js y las mejores prácticas para WebGPU y sombreadores personalizados","fr":"Parfait pour les agents graphiques ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée des performances de Three.js et des meilleures pratiques pour WebGPU et des shaders personnalisés","de":"Perfect für Grafikagenten, die eine erweiterte Leistungsoptimierung für Three.js und die besten Praktiken für WebGPU und benutzerdefinierte Shaders benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Gráficos que necessitam de otimização de desempenho avançada do Three.js e melhores práticas para WebGPU e shaders personalizados","ru":"Идеально подходит для Графических Агентов, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация производительности Three.js и лучшие практики для WebGPU и пользовательских шейдеров","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الرسومات الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين أداء متقدم لبرامج Three.js وأفضل الممارسات لبرامج WebGPU والشفرات المخصصة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize Three.js applications with 100+ rules across 17 categories, prioritized by impact, using official guidelines from the Three.js `llms` branch, and leveraging GLSL or TSL for custom shaders and WebGPU features","zh":"赋予代理优化Three.js应用程序的能力，跨17个类别的100+规则，根据影响程度优先，使用Three.js `llms`分支的官方指南，并利用GLSL或TSL进行自定义着色器和WebGPU功能","ja":"Three.jsアプリケーションを最適化するエージェントの能力を与え、17のカテゴリにわたる100以上のルールを提供し、影響度に基づいて優先順位を付けて公式のガイドラインからThree.js `llms`ブランチを利用し、GLSLまたはTSLを使用してカスタムシェーダーとWebGPU機能を活用","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js 애플리케이션을 최적화 할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 17 개의 범주에 걸쳐 100 개 이상의 규칙을 제공하고 영향을받는 순서로 우선순위를 지정하고 공식 가이드 라인에서 Three.js `llms` 분기를 사용하여 GLSL 또는 TSL을 사용하여 사용자 정의 셰이더 및 WebGPU 기능을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de Three.js con más de 100 reglas en 17 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, utilizando las pautas oficiales de la rama `llms` de Three.js y aprovechando GLSL o TSL para sombreadores personalizados y características de WebGPU","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications Three.js avec plus de 100 règles dans 17 catégories, priorisées par impact, en utilisant les directives officielles de la branche `llms` de Three.js et en exploitant GLSL ou TSL pour les shaders personnalisés et les fonctionnalités WebGPU","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Three.js-Anwendungen mit über 100 Regeln in 17 Kategorien zu optimieren, priorisiert nach Auswirkung, unter Verwendung der offiziellen Richtlinien des `llms`-Zweigs von Three.js und unter Nutzung von GLSL oder TSL für benutzerdefinierte Shaders und WebGPU-Funktionen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicações Three.js com 100+ regras em 17 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, utilizando diretrizes oficiais do branch `llms` do Three.js e aproveitando GLSL ou TSL para shaders personalizados e recursos do WebGPU","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения Three.js более чем 100 правилами в 17 категориях, отсортированными по влиянию, используя официальные рекомендации из ветки `llms` Three.js и использующие GLSL или TSL для пользовательских шейдеров и функций WebGPU","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين تطبيقات Three.js بمehr من 100 قاعدة في 17 فئة ، مصنفة حسب التأثير ، باستخدام إرشادات رسمية من فرع `llms` من Three.js وتحسين GLSL أو TSL لشفرات مخصصة وميزات WebGPU"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing Three.js project performance","Debugging memory leaks in WebGPU applications","Implementing custom shaders with GLSL or TSL","Reviewing and refining Three.js code for better performance"],"zh":["优化Three.js项目性能","调试WebGPU应用程序的内存泄漏","使用GLSL或TSL实现自定义着色器","审查和改进Three.js代码以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["Three.jsプロジェクトのパフォーマンスを最適化する","WebGPUアプリケーションのメモリーリークをデバッグする","GLSLまたはTSLを使用してカスタムシェーダーを実装する","Three.jsコードをレビューしてパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["Three.js 프로젝트 성능 최적화","WebGPU 애플리케이션의 메모리 누수를 디버깅","GLSL 또는 TSL을 사용하여 사용자 정의 셰이더 구현","Three.js 코드를 검토하여 성능을 개선"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de proyectos de Three.js","Depurar fugas de memoria en aplicaciones de WebGPU","Implementar sombreadores personalizados con GLSL o TSL","Revisar y perfeccionar el código de Three.js para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances des projets Three.js","Déboguer les fuites de mémoire dans les applications WebGPU","Mettre en œuvre des shaders personnalisés avec GLSL ou TSL","Réviser et affiner le code Three.js pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Optimieren des Leistungsverhaltens von Three.js-Projekten","Beheben von Speicherlecks in WebGPU-Anwendungen","Implementieren von benutzerdefinierten Shadern mit GLSL oder TSL","Überprüfen und Verfeinern des Three.js-Codes für eine bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho do projeto Three.js","Depurar vazamentos de memória em aplicações WebGPU","Implementar shaderrs personalizados com GLSL ou TSL","Revisar e aperfeiçoar o código Three.js para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность проекта Three.js","Отладить утечки памяти в приложениях WebGPU","Реализовать пользовательские шейдеры с помощью GLSL или TSL","Просмотреть и усовершенствовать код Three.js для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["تحسين أداء مشروع Three.js","تصحيح تسربات الذاكرة في تطبيقات WebGPU","تنفيذ شفرات مخصصة باستخدام GLSL أو TSL","مراجعة وتحسين код Three.js لتحقيق أداء أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Three.js and WebGPU","Limited to Three.js applications","Dependent on official Three.js guidelines and updates"],"zh":["需要Three.js和WebGPU的知识","仅限Three.js应用程序","依赖于官方Three.js指南和更新"],"ja":["Three.jsとWebGPUの知識が必要","Three.jsアプリケーションに限定","公式のThree.jsガイドラインと更新に依存"],"ko":["Three.js 및 WebGPU에 대한 지식이 필요","Three.js 애플리케이션으로 제한됨","공식 Three.js 가이드라인 및 업데이트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Three.js y WebGPU","Limitado a aplicaciones de Three.js","Dependiente de las pautas oficiales de Three.js y actualizaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Three.js et de WebGPU","Limité aux applications Three.js","Dépendant des directives officielles de Three.js et des mises à jour"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Three.js und WebGPU","Begrenzt auf Three.js-Anwendungen","Abhängig von den offiziellen Richtlinien von Three.js und Updates"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Three.js e WebGPU","Limitado a aplicações Three.js","Dependente de diretrizes oficiais do Three.js e atualizações"],"ru":["Требует знания Three.js и WebGPU","Ограничен приложениями Three.js","Зависит от официальных рекомендаций Three.js и обновлений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة برامج Three.js و WebGPU","محدود بتطبيقات Three.js","يعتمد على إرشادات رسمية من Three.js وتحديثات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
