' génère des tests exhaustifs qui échouent selon les principes de la phase rouge de TDD","de":"Der Fähigkeitsagent ''tdd-workflows-tdd-red'' generiert umfassende fehlende Tests nach den Grundsätzen der roten Phase von TDD","pt":"TDD Workflows TDD Red é uma habilidade que gera testes falhos abrangentes para definir comportamento esperado e cobertura de casos de bordo","ru":"TDD-Workflows TDD Red — это умение, которое генерирует полные неудачные тесты для определения ожидаемого поведения и покрытия граничных случаев","ar":"سير عمل TDD TDD الأحمر هو مهارة ت动生成 اختبارات فاشلة شاملة لتحديد السلوك المتوقع وتغطية الحالات الحدودية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["TDD","API","TDD","","TDD"],"ja":["TDD","API","TDD","","TDD"],"ko":["TDD","API","TDD","","TDD"],"es":["Generación de pruebas exhaustivas que fallan","Cobertura de casos de borde antes de la implementación","Definición del comportamiento esperado mediante pruebas automatizadas","Compatibilidad con el agente de automatización de pruebas","Integración con el flujo de trabajo de TDD"],"fr":["Génération de tests exhaustifs qui échouent","Couverture des cas de bordure avant la mise en œuvre","Définition du comportement attendu via des tests automatisés","Compatibilité avec l''agent d''automatisation de tests","Intégration avec le flux de travail TDD"],"de":["Erzeugung umfassender fehlender Tests","Abdeckung von Randfällen vor der Implementierung","Definition des erwarteten Verhaltens durch automatisierte Tests","Kompatibilität mit dem Testautomatisierungsagenten","Integration mit dem TDD-Workflow"],"pt":["Geração de testes falhos abrangentes","Definição de comportamento esperado","Cobertura de casos de bordo","Integração com test-automator agent","Suporte à fase TDD Red"],"ru":["Генерация полных неудачных тестов","Определение ожидаемого поведения","Покрытие граничных случаев","Интеграция с test-automator agent","Поддержка фазы TDD Red"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة شاملة","تحديد السلوك المتوقع","تغطية الحالات الحدودية","التكامل مع وكيل اختبار التلقائي","دعم مرحلة TDD الأحمر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TDD","TDD ","TDD","API","TDD","TDD"],"ja":["TDD","TDD","TDD","API","TDD","TDD"],"ko":["TDD","TDD ","TDD","API","TDD","TDD"],"es":["TDD","pruebas de software","flujo de trabajo de TDD","fase roja de TDD","automatización de pruebas","desarrollo de software","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración"],"fr":["TDD","tests logiciels","flux de travail TDD","phase rouge de TDD","automatisation de tests","développement logiciel","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration"],"de":["TDD","Softwaretests","TDD-Workflow","rote Phase von TDD","Testautomatisierung","Softwareentwicklung","Einheitstests","IntegrationsTests"],"pt":["TDD","Testes Falhos","TDD Red","Desenvolvimento Orientado a Testes","Test-automator agent","Cobertura de Casos de Bordo"],"ru":["TDD","Неудачные Тесты","TDD Red","Разработка, Ориентированная на Тестирование","Test-automator agent","Покрытие Граничных Случаев"],"ar":["TDD","اختبارات فاشلة","TDD الأحمر","تطوير البرمجيات الموجهة بالاختبار","وكيل اختبار التلقائي","تغطية الحالات الحدودية"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tdd-workflows-tdd-red","description":"Generate failing tests for the TDD red phase to define expected behavior and edge cases.","bodyPreview":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against p","body":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against production systems\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Identify behaviors, constraints, and edge cases.\n2. Generate failing tests that define expected outcomes.\n3. Ensure failures are due to missing behavior, not setup errors.\n4. Document how to run tests and verify failures.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Keep test data isolated and avoid production environments.\n- Avoid flaky external dependencies in the red phase.\n\n## Role\n\nGenerate failing tests using Task tool with subagent_type=\"unit-testing::test-automator\".\n\n## Prompt Template\n\n\"Generate comprehensive FAILING tests for: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Core Requirements\n\n1. **Test Structure**\n   - Framework-appropriate setup (Jest/pytest/JUnit/Go/RSpec)\n   - Arrange-Act-Assert pattern\n   - should_X_when_Y naming convention\n   - Isolated fixtures with no interdependencies\n\n2. **Behavior Coverage**\n   - Happy path scenarios\n   - Edge cases (empty, null, boundary values)\n   - Error handling and exceptions\n   - Concurrent access (if applicable)\n\n3. **Failure Verification**\n   - Tests MUST fail when run\n   - Failures for RIGHT reasons (not syntax/import errors)\n   - Meaningful diagnostic error messages\n   - No cascading failures\n\n4. **Test Categories**\n   - Unit: Isolated component behavior\n   - Integration: Component interaction\n   - Contract: API/interface contracts\n   - Property: Mathematical invariants\n\n## Framework Patterns\n\n**JavaScript/TypeScript (Jest/Vitest)**\n- Mock dependencies with `vi.fn()` or `jest.fn()`\n- Use `@testing-library` for React components\n- Property tests with `fast-check`\n\n**Python (pytest)**\n- Fixtures with appropriate scopes\n- Parametrize for multiple test cases\n- Hypothesis for property-based tests\n\n**Go**\n- Table-driven tests with subtests\n- `t.Parallel()` for parallel execution\n- Use `testify/assert` for cleaner assertions\n\n**Ruby (RSpec)**\n- `let` for lazy loading, `let!` for eager\n- Contexts for different scenarios\n- Shared examples for common behavior\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n- Readable test names documenting intent\n- One behavior per test\n- No implementation leakage\n- Meaningful test data (not ''foo''/''bar'')\n- Tests serve as living documentation\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Tests passing immediately\n- Testing implementation vs behavior\n- Complex setup code\n- Multiple responsibilities per test\n- Brittle tests tied to specifics\n\n## Edge Case Categories\n\n- **Null/Empty**: undefined, null, empty string/array/object\n- **Boundaries**: min/max values, single element, capacity limits\n- **Special Cases**: Unicode, whitespace, special characters\n- **State**: Invalid transitions, concurrent modifications\n- **Errors**: Network failures, timeouts, permissions\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- Complete test files with imports\n- Documentation of test purpose\n- Commands to run and verify failures\n- Metrics: test count, coverage areas\n- Next steps for green phase\"\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter generation:\n1. Run tests - confirm they fail\n2. Verify helpful failure messages\n3. Check test independence\n4. Ensure comprehensive coverage\n\n## Example (Minimal)\n\n```typescript\n// auth.service.test.ts\ndescribe(''AuthService'', () => {\n  let authService: AuthService;\n  let mockUserRepo: jest.Mocked<UserRepository>;\n\n  beforeEach(() => {\n    mockUserRepo = { findByEmail: jest.fn() } as any;\n    authService = new AuthService(mockUserRepo);\n  });\n\n  it(''should_return_token_when_valid_credentials'', async () => {\n    const user = { id: ''1'', email: ''test@example.com'', passwordHash: ''hashed'' };\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(user);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''test@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(true);\n    expect(result.token).toBeDefined();\n  });\n\n  it(''should_fail_when_user_not_found'', async () => {\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(null);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''none@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(false);\n    expect(result.error).toBe(''INVALID_CREDENTIALS'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\nTest requirements: $ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:12:05.550Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Test-Driven Development Agents needing comprehensive test coverage following TDD red phase principles","zh":"适用于需要全面测试覆盖的测试驱动开发代理，遵循TDD红色阶段原则","ja":"テスト駆動開発エージェントが包括的なテストカバレッジを必要とするTDD赤相応の原則に従うことが理想的","ko":"전면적인 테스트 커버리지가 필요한 테스트 주도 개발 에이전트에 적합하며 TDD 적색 단계 원칙을 따름","es":"Ideal para agentes de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas que necesitan una cobertura de prueba integral siguiendo los principios de la fase roja de TDD","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement piloté par les tests nécessitant une couverture de test complète suivant les principes de la phase rouge de TDD","de":"Ideal für Test-Driven-Development-Agents, die eine umfassende Testabdeckung nach den Prinzipien der TDD-Rotphase benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes que necessitam de cobertura de teste abrangente seguindo os princípios da fase vermelha do TDD","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, управляемой тестированием, которым требуется всестороннее тестовое покрытие в соответствии с принципами красной фазы TDD","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير القائمة على الاختبار التي تحتاج إلى تغطية اختبارية شاملة تتماشى مع مبادئ الطور الأحمر لاختبار التطوير الموجه"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate failing tests that capture expected behavior, ensuring edge case coverage and proper definition of expected behavior using test-automator agents, leveraging principles of Test-Driven Development and behavior-driven development protocols","zh":"赋予代理生成无法通过的测试以捕获预期行为，确保边缘情况覆盖和使用测试自动化代理的预期行为的适当定义，利用测试驱动开发和行为驱动开发协议的原则","ja":"テスト自動化エージェントを利用して、期待される動作を確実に捕捉し、エッジケースのカバレッジと期待される動作の適切な定義を保証することができないテストを生成するためのエージェントをEmpowerする、テスト駆動開発と動作駆動開発プロトコルの原則を利用する","ko":"테스트 자동화 에이전트를 활용하여 기대하는 동작을 확실히 캡처하고, 에지 케이스의 커버리지와 기대하는 동작의 적절한 정의를 보장하는 실패하는 테스트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여, 테스트 주도 개발과 행동 주도 개발 프로토콜의 원리를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar pruebas fallidas que capturan el comportamiento esperado, asegurando la cobertura de casos límite y la definición adecuada del comportamiento esperado utilizando agentes de automatización de pruebas, aprovechando los principios del Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas y los protocolos de desarrollo dirigido por el comportamiento","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des tests qui échouent en capturant le comportement attendu, en garantissant la couverture des cas limite et la définition appropriée du comportement attendu en utilisant des agents d''automatisation de tests, en exploitant les principes du développement piloté par les tests et les protocoles de développement piloté par le comportement","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, fehlgeschlagene Tests zu generieren, die das erwartete Verhalten erfassen, indem sie die Abdeckung von Randfällen und die ordnungsgemäße Definition des erwarteten Verhaltens unter Verwendung von Testautomatisierungsagenten sicherstellen, die Prinzipien der Test-Driven-Development und die Protokolle der verhaltensgesteuerten Entwicklung nutzend","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar testes com falha que capturam o comportamento esperado, garantindo a cobertura de casos de bordo e a definição adequada do comportamento esperado usando agentes automatizadores de testes, aproveitando os princípios do Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes e protocolos de desenvolvimento dirigido por comportamento","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать неудавшиеся тесты, которые захватывают ожидаемое поведение, обеспечивая покрытие граничных случаев и правильное определение ожидаемого поведения с помощью агентов-автоматизаторов тестов, используя принципы разработки, управляемой тестированием, и протоколы разработки, управляемой поведением","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة تلتقط السلوك المتوقع، مما يضمن تغطية الحالات الحدية وتحديد السلوك المتوقع بشكل صحيح باستخدام عوامل تلقيم الاختبارات، مستفيدة من مبادئ اختبار التطوير الموجه وبروتوكولات التطوير الموجه بالسلوك"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test creation for new features","Generating failing tests for edge cases","Defining expected behavior for complex systems"],"zh":["为新功能自动创建测试","为边缘情况生成无法通过的测试","为复杂系统定义预期行为"],"ja":["新機能の自動テストの作成","エッジケースのためのテストを生成する","複雑なシステムの期待される動作の定義"],"ko":["새로운 기능에 대한 자동 테스트 생성","에지 케이스에 대한 실패하는 테스트 생성","복잡한 시스템에 대한 기대하는 동작 정의"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de pruebas para nuevas características","Generación de pruebas fallidas para casos límite","Definición del comportamiento esperado para sistemas complejos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de tests pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités","Génération de tests qui échouent pour les cas limite","Définition du comportement attendu pour les systèmes complexes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Testerstellung für neue Funktionen","Generierung fehlgeschlagener Tests für Randfälle","Definition des erwarteten Verhaltens für komplexe Systeme"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de testes para recursos novos","Gerar testes com falha para casos de bordo","Definir o comportamento esperado para sistemas complexos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание тестов для новых функций","Генерировать неудавшиеся тесты для граничных случаев","Определить ожидаемое поведение для сложных систем"],"ar":["تحويل إنشاء الاختبارات إلى أتمتيكية لملحقات جديدة","إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة للحالات الحدية","تحديد السلوك المتوقع لأنظمة معقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to TDD red phase","Not applicable for performance benchmarks","Excludes tests running against production environments"],"zh":["仅限于TDD红色阶段","不适用于性能基准测试","排除在生产环境中运行的测试"],"ja":["TDD赤相に限定される","パフォーマンスベンチマークには適用できない","生産環境でのテストの実行を除外する"],"ko":["TDD 적색 단계에만 제한됨","성능 벤치마크에는 적용할 수 없음","프로덕션 환경에서 실행되는 테스트를 제외"],"es":["Limitado a la fase roja de TDD","No aplicable para benchmarks de rendimiento","Excluye pruebas que se ejecutan en entornos de producción"],"fr":["Limité à la phase rouge de TDD","Non applicable pour les benchmarks de performance","Exclut les tests qui s''exécutent dans des environnements de production"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die TDD-Rotphase","Nicht anwendbar für Leistungsbenchmarks","Schließt Tests aus, die in Produktionsumgebungen ausgeführt werden"],"pt":["Limitado à fase vermelha do TDD","Não aplicável para benchmarks de desempenho","Exclui testes em execução contra ambientes de produção"],"ru":["Ограничен красной фазой TDD","Не применимо для эталонов производительности","Исключает тесты, запускаемые против производственных сред"],"ar":["محدود بالطور الأحمر لاختبار التطوير الموجه","لا يطبق على معايير الأداء","يستثني الاختبارات التي تعمل ضد بيئات الإنتاج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
