von Timeouts und Fehlern","Kontextvariablen und Utility-Funktionen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de sessão","Estratégias de seletor","Prevenção de timeouts e falhas","Melhores práticas para páginas lentas e SPAs","Variáveis de contexto e funções de utilidade"],"ru":["Управление сессиями","Стратегии селектора","Предотвращение таймаутов и сбоев","Лучшие практики для медленных страниц и SPAs","Контекстные переменные и утилитные функции"],"ar":["إدارة الجلسات","استراتيجيات المحدد","منع انتهاء الوقت و الفشل","أفضل الممارسات للصفحات البطيئة و SPAs","متغيرات السياق و دوال الفائدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Playwriter","会话管理","选择器策略","规则","最佳实践","技术文档"],"ja":["Playwriter","セッション管理","セレクタ戦略","ルール","ベストプラクティス","技術ドキュメント"],"ko":["Playwriter","세션 관리","선택자 전략","규칙","모범 사례","기술 문서"],"es":["playwriter","documentación para desarrolladores","gestión de sesiones","tiempos de espera","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","mejores prácticas","eficiencia en el desarrollo"],"fr":["playwriter","documentation pour les développeurs","gestion de sessions","délais d''attente","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","meilleures pratiques","efficacité dans le développement"],"de":["playwriter","Dokumentation für Entwickler","Sitzungsverwaltung","Timeouts","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Best Practices","Effizienz in der Entwicklung"],"pt":["playwriter","desenvolvimento web","gerenciamento de sessão","estratégias de seletor","prevenção de timeouts","melhores práticas para SPAs","variáveis de contexto","funções de utilidade"],"ru":["playwriter","веб-разработка","управление сессиями","стратегии селектора","предотвращение таймаутов","лучшие практики для SPAs","контекстные переменные","утилитные функции"],"ar":["playwriter","تطوير الويب","إدارة الجلسات","استراتيجيات المحدد","منع انتهاء الوقت","أفضل الممارسات للصفحات البطيئة","متغيرات السياق","دوال الفائدة"]}},"owner":"ohadf2015","repo":"boggle-new","repoPath":"ohadf2015/boggle-new","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwriter","description":"Control the user own Chrome browser via Playwriter extension with Playwright code snippets in a stateful local js sandbox via playwriter cli. Automate web interactions, take screenshots, inspect accessibility trees, debug & profile web applications. Run `playwriter skill` command to read the complete up to date skill","bodyPreview":"## REQUIRED: Read Full Documentation First\n\n**Before using playwriter, you MUST run this command:**\n\n```bash\nplaywriter skill\n```\n\nThis outputs the complete documentation including:\n- Session management and timeout configuration\n- Selector strategies (and which ones to AVOID)\n- Rules to prevent timeouts and failures\n- Best practices for slow pages and SPAs\n- Context variables, utility functions, and more\n\n**Do NOT skip this step.** The quick examples below will fail without understanding timeout","body":"## REQUIRED: Read Full Documentation First\n\n**Before using playwriter, you MUST run this command:**\n\n```bash\nplaywriter skill\n```\n\nThis outputs the complete documentation including:\n- Session management and timeout configuration\n- Selector strategies (and which ones to AVOID)\n- Rules to prevent timeouts and failures\n- Best practices for slow pages and SPAs\n- Context variables, utility functions, and more\n\n**Do NOT skip this step.** The quick examples below will fail without understanding timeouts, selector rules, and common pitfalls from the full docs.\n\n## Minimal Example (after reading full docs)\n\n```bash\nplaywriter session new\nplaywriter -s 1 -e \"await page.goto(''https://example.com'')\"\n```\n\nIf `playwriter` is not found, use `npx playwriter@latest` or `bunx playwriter@latest`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:11:48.654Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Automation Agents requiring precise session management and timeout configuration for complex workflows.","zh":"适用于需要精确会话管理和超时配置的高级自动化代理的理想选择，特别适用于复杂的工作流。","ja":"高度な自動化エージェントが複雑なワークフローでセッション管理とタイムアウトの設定を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 자동화 에이전트에 적합하며, 세션 관리와 타임아웃 구성이 필요한 복잡한 워크플로우에서 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización Avanzados que requieren una gestión de sesión precisa y configuración de tiempo de espera para flujos de trabajo complejos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation avancés nécessitant une gestion de session précise et une configuration de délai d''attente pour les flux de travail complexes.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte Automatisierungsagenten, die eine präzise Sitzungsverwaltung und Timeout-Konfiguration für komplexe Workflows erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação Avançados que requerem gerenciamento de sessão preciso e configuração de tempo limite para fluxos de trabalho complexos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов автоматизации, требующих точного управления сессиями и настройки таймаута для сложных рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التutomatio المتقدم الذي يتطلب إدارة جلسة دقيقة وتكوين مهلة زمنية لعمليات عمل معقدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage sessions effectively, utilizing selector strategies and context variables to prevent timeouts and failures, while leveraging utility functions for optimal performance, particularly on slow pages and Single-Page Applications (SPAs).","zh":"赋予代理有效管理会话的能力，利用选择器策略和上下文变量来防止超时和故障，同时利用实用函数实现最佳性能，特别是在慢速页面和单页应用程序（SPAs）中。","ja":"セレクタ戦略とコンテキスト変数を使用してタイムアウトと故障を防ぎ、ユーティリティ関数を使用して最適なパフォーマンスを実現することで、エージェントがセッションを効果的に管理できるようにします。特に、遅いページやシングルページアプリケーション（SPAs）で。","ko":"선택자 전략과 컨텍스트 변수를 사용하여 타임아웃과 실패를 방지하고, 유틸리티 함수를 사용하여 최적의 성능을 달성하여 에이전트가 세션을 효과적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 특히, 느린 페이지와 싱글 페이지 애플리케이션(SPA)에서.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar sesiones de manera efectiva, utilizando estrategias de selectores y variables de contexto para prevenir tiempos de espera y fallos, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha las funciones de utilidad para un rendimiento óptimo, particularmente en páginas lentas y Aplicaciones de Página Única (SPAs).","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les sessions de manière efficace, en utilisant des stratégies de sélecteurs et des variables de contexte pour prévenir les délais d''attente et les défaillances, tout en exploitant les fonctions d''utilité pour des performances optimales, en particulier sur les pages lentes et les Applications à Page Unique (SPAs).","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Sitzungen effektiv zu verwalten, indem sie Selektorstrategien und Kontextvariablen verwenden, um Timeouts und Ausfälle zu verhindern, während sie gleichzeitig Utility-Funktionen für optimale Leistung nutzen, insbesondere auf langsamen Seiten und Single-Page-Anwendungen (SPAs).","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar sessões de forma eficaz, utilizando estratégias de seletor e variáveis de contexto para prevenir timeouts e falhas, aproveitando funções de utilidade para desempenho ótimo, particularmente em páginas lentas e Aplicativos de Página Única (SPAs).","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять сессиями, используя стратегии селекторов и переменные контекста для предотвращения таймаутов и сбоев, а также использует функции утилит для оптимальной производительности, особенно на медленных страницах и Одностраничных Приложениях (SPAs).","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إدارة الجلسات بفعالية، باستخدام استراتيجيات الانتقاء ومتغيرات السياق لمنع انتهاء المهلة وفشل، واستخدام وظائف المرافق لأداء مثالي، خاصة على الصفحات البطيئة وتطبيقات صفحة واحدة (SPAs)."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating complex workflows with advanced session management","Debugging and preventing timeouts in critical application flows","Optimizing interaction with slow pages and SPAs using best practices"],"zh":["自动化具有高级会话管理的复杂工作流","调试和防止关键应用程序流中的超时","使用最佳实践优化与慢速页面和单页应用程序的交互"],"ja":["高度なセッション管理を備えた複雑なワークフローの自動化","重要なアプリケーションフローでのタイムアウトのデバッグと防止","遅いページやシングルページアプリケーションとのインタラクションの最適化"],"ko":["고급 세션 관리를 갖춘 복잡한 워크플로우의 자동화","중요한 애플리케이션 흐름에서 타임아웃의 디버깅 및 방지","느린 페이지와 싱글 페이지 애플리케이션과의 상호 작용 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo complejos con gestión de sesión avanzada","Depurar y prevenir tiempos de espera en flujos de aplicaciones críticas","Optimizar la interacción con páginas lentas y SPAs utilizando las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail complexes avec une gestion de session avancée","Déboguer et prévenir les délais d''attente dans les flux d''applications critiques","Optimiser l''interaction avec les pages lentes et les SPAs en utilisant les meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Komplexe Workflows mit erweiterter Sitzungsverwaltung automatisieren","Zeitüberschreitungen in kritischen Anwendungsflüssen debuggen und verhindern","Interaktion mit langsamen Seiten und SPAs mithilfe von Best Practices optimieren"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho complexos com gerenciamento de sessão avançado","Depurar e prevenir timeouts em fluxos de aplicativos críticos","Otimizar interação com páginas lentas e SPAs usando boas práticas"],"ru":["Автоматизация сложных рабочих процессов с продвинутым управлением сессиями","Отладка и предотвращение таймаутов в критических потоках приложений","Оптимизация взаимодействия с медленными страницами и Одностраничными Приложениями (SPAs) с использованием最佳 практик"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات العمل المعقدة مع إدارة جلسة متقدمة","تصحيح الأخطاء ومنع انتهاء المهلة في تدفقات التطبيقات الحاسمة","تحسين التفاعل مع الصفحات البطيئة وتطبيقات صفحة واحدة (SPAs) باستخدام أفضل الممارسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires initial setup with ''playwriter skill'' command for documentation","Demands careful selector strategy selection to avoid failures","Mandatory understanding of rules to prevent timeouts"],"zh":["需要使用“playwriter skill”命令进行初始设置以获取文档","需要仔细选择选择器策略以避免故障","必须了解规则以防止超时"],"ja":["ドキュメントの取得のために「playwriter skill」コマンドでの初期設定が必要","故障を避けるためにセレクタ戦略の慎重な選択が必要","タイムアウトを防ぐためにルールの理解が必須"],"ko":["문서를 얻기 위해 ''playwriter skill'' 명령으로 초기 설정이 필요","故障를 피하기 위해 선택자 전략을慎重하게 선택해야 함","타임아웃을 방지하기 위해 규칙을理解해야 함"],"es":["Requiere configuración inicial con el comando ''playwriter skill'' para la documentación","Exige una cuidadosa selección de la estrategia de selectores para evitar fallos","Conocimiento obligatorio de las reglas para prevenir tiempos de espera"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration initiale avec la commande ''playwriter skill'' pour la documentation","Exige une sélection soignée de la stratégie de sélecteurs pour éviter les défaillances","Compréhension obligatoire des règles pour prévenir les délais d''attente"],"de":["Benötigt eine anfängliche Konfiguration mit dem ''playwriter skill''-Befehl für die Dokumentation","Fordert eine sorgfältige Auswahl der Selektorstrategie, um Ausfälle zu vermeiden","Verlangt ein obligatorisches Verständnis der Regeln, um Timeouts zu verhindern"],"pt":["Exige configuração inicial com o comando ''playwriter skill'' para documentação","Exige seleção cuidadosa da estratégia de seletor para evitar falhas","Exige compreensão obrigatória das regras para prevenir timeouts"],"ru":["Требует начальной настройки с помощью команды ''playwriter skill'' для документации","Требует тщательного выбора стратегии селектора для предотвращения сбоев","Требует обязательного понимания правил для предотвращения таймаутов"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادًا أوليًا بأمر ''playwriter skill'' للتوثيق","يتطلب اختيارًا محددًا لاستراتيجية الانتقاء لتجنب الفشل","يتطلب فهمًا إلزاميًا للقواعد لمنع انتهاء المهلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/tdd-workflows-tdd-red', 'community', 'xiangteng007', 'XXT-AGENT', 'xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT', 'tdd-workflows-tdd-red', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:12:12.426Z', NULL, '{"id":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/tdd-workflows-tdd-red","name":"tdd-workflows-tdd-red","description":{"zh":"TDD ","ja":"TDD","ko":"TDD ","es":"Este skill genera pruebas exhaustivas que fallen siguiendo los principios de la fase roja de TDD para definir el comportamiento esperado","fr":"Ce skill génère des tests exhaustifs qui échouent en suivant les principes de la phase rouge de TDD pour définir le comportement attendu","de":"Dieses Skill erzeugt umfassende fehlschlagende Tests, die den Grundsätzen der roten Phase von TDD folgen, um das erwartete Verhalten zu definieren","pt":"O TDD Workflows: TDD Red ajuda a criar testes falhos que definem o comportamento esperado. Use para iniciar a fase vermelha do TDD e melhorar a cobertura de testes.","ru":"TDD Workflows: TDD Red помогает создавать фейлинг-тесты, определяющие ожидаемое поведение. Используйте для начала красной фазы TDD и улучшения покрытия тестов.","ar":"سير عمل TDD: TDD الأحمر يساعد على إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة تعرف السلوك المتوقع. استخدم لبدء المرحلة الحمراء من TDD وتحسين تغطية الاختبار.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"TDD ","ja":"TDD","ko":"TDD ","es":"Flujos de trabajo TDD: Red Phase","fr":"Workflows TDD: Phase Rouge","de":"TDD-Workflows: Red-Phase","pt":"TDD Workflows: Testes Falhos com TDD Red","ru":"TDD Workflows: Красный Фаз TDD С Фailing Тестами","ar":"سير عمل TDD: اختبارات فاشلة مع TDD الأحمر","en":"tdd-workflows-tdd-red"},"description":{"zh":"TDD ","ja":"TDD","ko":"TDD ","es":"Este skill genera pruebas exhaustivas que fallen siguiendo los principios de la fase roja de TDD para definir el comportamiento esperado","fr":"Ce skill génère des tests exhaustifs qui échouent en suivant les principes de la phase rouge de TDD pour définir le comportement attendu","de":"Dieses Skill erzeugt umfassende fehlschlagende Tests, die den Grundsätzen der roten Phase von TDD folgen, um das erwartete Verhalten zu definieren","pt":"O TDD Workflows: TDD Red ajuda a criar testes falhos que definem o comportamento esperado. Use para iniciar a fase vermelha do TDD e melhorar a cobertura de ...","ru":"TDD Workflows: TDD Red помогает создавать фейлинг-тесты, определяющие ожидаемое поведение. Используйте для начала красной фазы TDD и улучшения покрытия тестов.","ar":"سير عمل TDD: TDD الأحمر يساعد على إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة تعرف السلوك المتوقع. استخدم لبدء المرحلة الحمراء من TDD وتحسين تغطية الاختبار.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["TDD "," ","TDD","API"," "],"ja":["TDD","","TDD","API",""],"ko":["TDD "," ","TDD","API"," "],"es":["Genera pruebas exhaustivas que fallen","Define el comportamiento esperado","Cubre casos de borde antes de la implementación","Se utiliza en la fase roja de TDD","No se utiliza en las fases verde o refactor"],"fr":["Générez des tests exhaustifs qui échouent","Définir le comportement attendu","Couvre les cas de bordure avant la mise en œuvre","Utilisé dans la phase rouge de TDD","Ne pas utiliser dans les phases verte ou refactor"],"de":["Erstellt umfassende fehlschlagende Tests","Definiert das erwartete Verhalten","Deckt Randfälle vor der Implementierung ab","Wird in der roten Phase von TDD verwendet","Wird nicht in den Phasen Grün oder Refactor verwendet"],"pt":["Criação de testes falhos abrangentes","Definição do comportamento esperado","Cobertura de testes antes da implementação","Início da fase vermelha do TDD","Melhoria da cobertura de testes","Testes automatizados"],"ru":["Создание полных фейлинг-тестов","Определение ожидаемого поведения","Покрытие тестов до реализации","Начало красной фазы TDD","Улучшение покрытия тестов","Автоматизированные тесты"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات فاشلة شاملة","تحديد السلوك المتوقع","تغطية الاختبار قبل التنفيذ","بدء المرحلة الحمراء من TDD","تحسين تغطية الاختبار","اختبارات آلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TDD","TDD "," ","API"," "," "],"ja":["TDD","TDD","","API","",""],"ko":["TDD","TDD "," ","API"," "," "],"es":["TDD","Desarrollo de software","Pruebas que fallen","Fase roja","Comportamiento esperado","Casos de borde"],"fr":["TDD","Développement de logiciels","Tests qui échouent","Phase rouge","Comportement attendu","Cas de bordure"],"de":["TDD","Softwareentwicklung","Fehlschlagende Tests","Rote Phase","Erwartetes Verhalten","Randfälle"],"pt":["TDD","Testes Falhos","Fase Vermelha","Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes","Testes Automatizados","Cobertura de Testes","Melhoria da Cobertura de Testes","Início da Fase Vermelha do TDD"],"ru":["TDD","Фейлинг-тесты","Красная Фаза","Разработка, Руководимая Тестами","Автоматизированные Тесты","Покрытие Тестов","Улучшение Покрытия Тестов","Начало Красной Фазы TDD"],"ar":["TDD","اختبارات فاشلة","المرحلة الحمراء","التطوير الموجه بالاختبار","اختبارات آلية","تغطية الاختبار","تحسين تغطية الاختبار","بدء المرحلة الحمراء من TDD"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tdd-workflows-tdd-red","description":"Generate failing tests for the TDD red phase to define expected behavior and edge cases.","bodyPreview":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against p","body":"Write comprehensive failing tests following TDD red phase principles.\n\n[Extended thinking: Generates failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agent.]\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting the TDD red phase for new behavior\n- You need failing tests that capture expected behavior\n- You want edge case coverage before implementation\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You are in the green or refactor phase\n- You only need performance benchmarks\n- Tests must run against production systems\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Identify behaviors, constraints, and edge cases.\n2. Generate failing tests that define expected outcomes.\n3. Ensure failures are due to missing behavior, not setup errors.\n4. Document how to run tests and verify failures.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Keep test data isolated and avoid production environments.\n- Avoid flaky external dependencies in the red phase.\n\n## Role\n\nGenerate failing tests using Task tool with subagent_type=\"unit-testing::test-automator\".\n\n## Prompt Template\n\n\"Generate comprehensive FAILING tests for: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## Core Requirements\n\n1. **Test Structure**\n   - Framework-appropriate setup (Jest/pytest/JUnit/Go/RSpec)\n   - Arrange-Act-Assert pattern\n   - should_X_when_Y naming convention\n   - Isolated fixtures with no interdependencies\n\n2. **Behavior Coverage**\n   - Happy path scenarios\n   - Edge cases (empty, null, boundary values)\n   - Error handling and exceptions\n   - Concurrent access (if applicable)\n\n3. **Failure Verification**\n   - Tests MUST fail when run\n   - Failures for RIGHT reasons (not syntax/import errors)\n   - Meaningful diagnostic error messages\n   - No cascading failures\n\n4. **Test Categories**\n   - Unit: Isolated component behavior\n   - Integration: Component interaction\n   - Contract: API/interface contracts\n   - Property: Mathematical invariants\n\n## Framework Patterns\n\n**JavaScript/TypeScript (Jest/Vitest)**\n- Mock dependencies with `vi.fn()` or `jest.fn()`\n- Use `@testing-library` for React components\n- Property tests with `fast-check`\n\n**Python (pytest)**\n- Fixtures with appropriate scopes\n- Parametrize for multiple test cases\n- Hypothesis for property-based tests\n\n**Go**\n- Table-driven tests with subtests\n- `t.Parallel()` for parallel execution\n- Use `testify/assert` for cleaner assertions\n\n**Ruby (RSpec)**\n- `let` for lazy loading, `let!` for eager\n- Contexts for different scenarios\n- Shared examples for common behavior\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n- Readable test names documenting intent\n- One behavior per test\n- No implementation leakage\n- Meaningful test data (not ''foo''/''bar'')\n- Tests serve as living documentation\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Tests passing immediately\n- Testing implementation vs behavior\n- Complex setup code\n- Multiple responsibilities per test\n- Brittle tests tied to specifics\n\n## Edge Case Categories\n\n- **Null/Empty**: undefined, null, empty string/array/object\n- **Boundaries**: min/max values, single element, capacity limits\n- **Special Cases**: Unicode, whitespace, special characters\n- **State**: Invalid transitions, concurrent modifications\n- **Errors**: Network failures, timeouts, permissions\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- Complete test files with imports\n- Documentation of test purpose\n- Commands to run and verify failures\n- Metrics: test count, coverage areas\n- Next steps for green phase\"\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter generation:\n1. Run tests - confirm they fail\n2. Verify helpful failure messages\n3. Check test independence\n4. Ensure comprehensive coverage\n\n## Example (Minimal)\n\n```typescript\n// auth.service.test.ts\ndescribe(''AuthService'', () => {\n  let authService: AuthService;\n  let mockUserRepo: jest.Mocked<UserRepository>;\n\n  beforeEach(() => {\n    mockUserRepo = { findByEmail: jest.fn() } as any;\n    authService = new AuthService(mockUserRepo);\n  });\n\n  it(''should_return_token_when_valid_credentials'', async () => {\n    const user = { id: ''1'', email: ''test@example.com'', passwordHash: ''hashed'' };\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(user);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''test@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(true);\n    expect(result.token).toBeDefined();\n  });\n\n  it(''should_fail_when_user_not_found'', async () => {\n    mockUserRepo.findByEmail.mockResolvedValue(null);\n\n    const result = await authService.authenticate(''none@example.com'', ''pass'');\n\n    expect(result.success).toBe(false);\n    expect(result.error).toBe(''INVALID_CREDENTIALS'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\nTest requirements: $ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:12:12.426Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Test Automation Agents needing to implement Test-Driven Development (TDD) workflows with comprehensive test coverage","zh":"非常适合需要实施基于测试驱动开发（TDD）工作流程并具有全面测试覆盖的测试自动化代理","ja":"テスト自動化エージェントがテスト駆動開発（TDD）ワークフローを実装し、包括的なテストカバレッジを持つ必要がある場合に最適","ko":"테스트 자동화 에이전트가 테스트 주도 개발(TDD) 워크플ロー와 완전한 테스트 커버리지 구현이 필요한 경우 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de pruebas que necesitan implementar flujos de trabajo de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas (TDD) con una cobertura de pruebas comprehensiva","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation de tests ayant besoin de mettre en œuvre des flux de travail de développement piloté par les tests (TDD) avec une couverture de tests complète","de":"Perfekt für Testautomatisierungsagenten, die Workflows für testgetriebene Entwicklung (TDD) mit umfassender Testabdeckung implementieren müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Testes que precisam implementar fluxos de trabalho de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes (TDD) com cobertura de teste abrangente","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации тестирования, которым необходимо реализовывать рабочие процессы разработки, управляемой тестированием (TDD) с полным охватом тестирования","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء اختبار التلقائي الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ سير عمل التطوير القائم على الاختبار (TDD) مع تغطية اختبار شاملة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate failing tests that properly define expected behavior using test-automator agents, following TDD red phase principles and ensuring edge case coverage before implementation","zh":"赋予代理生成正确定义预期行为的失败测试的能力，使用测试自动化代理，遵循TDD红色阶段原则，并在实施之前确保边缘情况覆盖","ja":"エージェントがTDDの赤い段階の原則に従い、実装前にエッジケースのカバレッジを確保することにより、期待される動作を適切に定義した失敗テストを生成する能力を与える","ko":"에이전트가 테스트 자동화 에이전트를 사용하여 TDD 적색 단계 원칙을 따르고 구현 전에 에지 케이스 커버리지를 보장함으로써 예상된 동작을 올바르게 정의하는 실패 테스트를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar pruebas fallidas que definan adecuadamente el comportamiento esperado utilizando agentes automatizadores de pruebas, siguiendo los principios de la fase roja de TDD y asegurando la cobertura de casos límite antes de la implementación","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des tests qui échouent et qui définissent correctement le comportement attendu en utilisant des agents d''automatisation de tests, en suivant les principes de la phase rouge de TDD et en assurant la couverture des cas limites avant la mise en œuvre","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, fehlgeschlagene Tests zu generieren, die das erwartete Verhalten ordnungsgemäß definieren, indem Testautomatisierungsagenten verwendet werden, die den Prinzipien der TDD-Rotphase folgen und die Abdeckung von Randfällen vor der Implementierung sicherstellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar testes com falha que definam adequadamente o comportamento esperado usando agentes de automação de testes, seguindo os princípios da fase vermelha do TDD e garantindo a cobertura de casos limite antes da implementação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать неудачные тесты, которые должным образом определяют ожидаемое поведение с помощью агентов автоматизации тестирования, следуя принципам красной фазы TDD и обеспечивая покрытие пограничных случаев до реализации","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد اختبارات فاشلة تعرف السلوك المتوقع بشكل صحيح باستخدام وكلاء اختبار التلقائي، متبعة مبادئ المرحلة الحمراء من TDD وضمان تغطية الحالات الحدية قبل التنفيذ"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test creation for new behavior","Generating failing tests for expected behavior","Ensuring edge case coverage before implementation"],"zh":["为新行为自动化测试创建","为预期行为生成失败测试","在实施之前确保边缘情况覆盖"],"ja":["新しい動作のための自動テストの作成","期待される動作のための失敗テストの生成","実装前にエッジケースのカバレッジを確保"],"ko":["새로운 행동을 위한 자동 테스트 생성","예상된 행동을 위한 실패 테스트 생성","구현 전에 에지 케이스 커버리지 보장"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de pruebas para nuevo comportamiento","Generar pruebas fallidas para comportamiento esperado","Asegurar la cobertura de casos límite antes de la implementación"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de tests pour un nouveau comportement","Générer des tests qui échouent pour un comportement attendu","Assurer la couverture des cas limites avant la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Automatisieren der Testerstellung für neues Verhalten","Generieren von fehlgeschlagenen Tests für erwartetes Verhalten","Sicherstellen der Abdeckung von Randfällen vor der Implementierung"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de testes para novo comportamento","Gerar testes com falha para comportamento esperado","Garantir a cobertura de casos limite antes da implementação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание тестов для нового поведения","Генерировать неудачные тесты для ожидаемого поведения","Обеспечить покрытие пограничных случаев до реализации"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في إنشاء الاختبارات للسلوك الجديد","توليد اختبارات فاشلة للسلوك المتوقع","ضمان تغطية الحالات الحدية قبل التنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Only applicable during the TDD red phase","Not suitable for performance benchmarks","Tests must be designed to capture expected behavior"],"zh":["仅在TDD红色阶段适用","不适用于性能基准测试","测试必须被设计为捕获预期行为"],"ja":["TDDの赤い段階でのみ適用可能","パフォーマンスベンチマークには適さない","テストは期待される動作を捉えるように設計する必要がある"],"ko":["TDD 적색 단계에서만 적용 가능","성능 벤치마크에는 적합하지 않음","테스트는 예상된 동작을 捕获하기 위해 설계되어야 함"],"es":["Solo aplicable durante la fase roja de TDD","No adecuado para pruebas de rendimiento","Las pruebas deben estar diseñadas para capturar el comportamiento esperado"],"fr":["N''est applicable que pendant la phase rouge de TDD","Non adapté pour les tests de performance","Les tests doivent être conçus pour capturer le comportement attendu"],"de":["Nur anwendbar während der TDD-Rotphase","Nicht geeignet für Leistungsbenchmarks","Die Tests müssen so konzipiert sein, dass sie das erwartete Verhalten erfassen"],"pt":["Apenas aplicável durante a fase vermelha do TDD","Não adequado para benchmarks de desempenho","Os testes devem ser projetados para capturar o comportamento esperado"],"ru":["Применимо только во время красной фазы TDD","Не подходит для тестирования производительности","Тесты должны быть разработаны для захвата ожидаемого поведения"],"ar":["ينطبق فقط خلال مرحلة TDD الحمراء","لا يصلح لاختبارات الأداء","يجب تصميم الاختبارات لالتقاط السلوك المتوقع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
