х фоновых задач","Исключительный опыт разработчика","Готовые к использованию интеграции","Обработка конвейеров ИИ","Синхронизация рабочих процессов интеграции","Обработка批elor миллионов записей"],"ar":["إنشاء مهام خلفية موثوقة","تجربة مطور استثنائية","دمج جاهزة للاستخدام","معالجة أنابيب الذكاء الاصطناعي","مزامنة سير عمل التكامل","معالجة دفعات من ملايين السجلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Trigger.dev","后台任务","工作流程","批处理作业","Temporal","TypeScript"],"ja":["Trigger.dev","バックグラウンドジョブ","ワークフロー","バッチジョブ","Temporal","TypeScript"],"ko":["Trigger.dev","백그라운드 작업","워크플로우","배치 작업","Temporal","TypeScript"],"es":["Trigger.dev","trabajos en segundo plano","desarrollo de software","integración de APIs","pipelines de IA","flujos de trabajo","trabajos por lotes","escalabilidad"],"fr":["Trigger.dev","tâches en arrière-plan","développement de logiciels","intégration d''API","pipelines d''IA","flux de travail","tâches par lots","évolutivité"],"de":["Trigger.dev","Hintergrundjobs","Software-Entwicklung","API-Integration","KI-Pipelines","Integrations-Workflows","Batch-Jobs","Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["trabalhos em segundo plano","Trigger.dev","desenvolvedores TypeScript","integrações","pipelines de IA","workflows de integração","batches de dados","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["фоновые задачи","Trigger.dev","разработчики на TypeScript","интеграции","конвейеры ИИ","рабочие процессы интеграции","пакеты данных","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["المهام الخلفية","تريجر.ديف","مطوري TypeScript","دمج","أنابيب الذكاء الاصطناعي","سير عمل التكامل","دفعات البيانات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"trigger-dev","description":"Trigger.dev expert for background jobs, AI workflows, and reliable async execution with excellent developer experience and TypeScript-first design. Use when: trigger.dev, trigger dev, background task, ai background job, long running task.","bodyPreview":"# Trigger.dev Integration\n\nYou are a Trigger.dev expert who builds reliable background jobs with\nexceptional developer experience. You understand that Trigger.dev bridges\nthe gap between simple queues and complex orchestration - it''s \"Temporal\nmade easy\" for TypeScript developers.\n\nYou''ve built AI pipelines that process for minutes, integration workflows\nthat sync across dozens of services, and batch jobs that handle millions\nof records. You know the power of built-in integrations and the import","body":"# Trigger.dev Integration\n\nYou are a Trigger.dev expert who builds reliable background jobs with\nexceptional developer experience. You understand that Trigger.dev bridges\nthe gap between simple queues and complex orchestration - it''s \"Temporal\nmade easy\" for TypeScript developers.\n\nYou''ve built AI pipelines that process for minutes, integration workflows\nthat sync across dozens of services, and batch jobs that handle millions\nof records. You know the power of built-in integrations and the importance\nof proper task design.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- trigger-dev-tasks\n- ai-background-jobs\n- integration-tasks\n- scheduled-triggers\n- webhook-handlers\n- long-running-tasks\n- task-queues\n- batch-processing\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Basic Task Setup\n\nSetting up Trigger.dev in a Next.js project\n\n### AI Task with OpenAI Integration\n\nUsing built-in OpenAI integration with automatic retries\n\n### Scheduled Task with Cron\n\nTasks that run on a schedule\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Giant Monolithic Tasks\n\n### ❌ Ignoring Built-in Integrations\n\n### ❌ No Logging\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Task timeout kills execution without clear error | critical | # Configure explicit timeouts: |\n| Non-serializable payload causes silent task failure | critical | # Always use plain objects: |\n| Environment variables not synced to Trigger.dev cloud | critical | # Sync env vars to Trigger.dev: |\n| SDK version mismatch between CLI and package | high | # Always update together: |\n| Task retries cause duplicate side effects | high | # Use idempotency keys: |\n| High concurrency overwhelms downstream services | high | # Set queue concurrency limits: |\n| trigger.config.ts not at project root | high | # Config must be at package root: |\n| wait.for in loops causes memory issues | medium | # Batch instead of individual waits: |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `nextjs-app-router`, `vercel-deployment`, `ai-agents-architect`, `llm-architect`, `email-systems`, `stripe-integration`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:12:16.290Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Pipeline Agents requiring reliable background job execution with Temporal workflows in TypeScript","zh":"适用于需要在TypeScript中使用Temporal工作流执行可靠后台作业的AI Pipeline代理","ja":"TypeScriptでTemporalワークフローを使用して信頼性の高いバックグラウンドジョブを実行する必要があるAIパイプラインエージェントに最適","ko":"TypeScript에서 Temporal 워크플로를 사용하여 안정적인 배경 작업을 실행해야 하는 AI 파이프라인 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de canalización de IA que requieren una ejecución de trabajo en segundo plano confiable con flujos de trabajo temporales en TypeScript","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de pipeline d''IA nécessitant une exécution de tâche en arrière-plan fiable avec des flux de travail temporaires en TypeScript","de":"Ideal für AI-Pipeline-Agents, die eine zuverlässige Ausführung von Hintergrundaufgaben mit temporären Workflows in TypeScript erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pipeline de IA que necessitam de execução confiável de jobs em segundo plano com workflows Temporal em TypeScript","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов AI Pipeline, требующих надежного выполнения фоновых задач с использованием рабочих процессов Temporal в TypeScript","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء خطوط أنابيب الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تتطلب تنفيذًا موثوقًا للوظائف في الخلفية باستخدام مهام Temporal في TypeScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable AI pipelines with exceptional developer experience, leveraging built-in integrations and handling millions of records with ease, using Trigger.dev''s simplified Temporal workflows for TypeScript developers","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展的AI管道的能力，提供异常的开发者体验，利用内置集成并轻松处理数百万条记录，使用Trigger.dev简化的TypeScript开发者的Temporal工作流","ja":"エージェントが拡張可能なAIパイプラインを構築し、内蔵の統合を利用して数百万のレコードを簡単に処理し、Trigger.devのTypeScript開発者向けのシンプル化されたTemporalワークフローを使用することで、開発者の体験を向上させる","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능한 AI 파이프라인을 구축하고, 내장된 통합을 활용하여 수백만 개의 레코드를 쉽게 처리하며, Trigger.dev의 TypeScript 개발자를 위한 단순화된 Temporal 워크플로를 사용하여 개발자 경험을 향상시킵니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir canalizaciones de IA escalables con una experiencia de desarrollo excepcional, aprovechando las integraciones incorporadas y manejando millones de registros con facilidad, utilizando los flujos de trabajo temporales simplificados de Trigger.dev para desarrolladores de TypeScript","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des pipelines d''IA évolutifs avec une expérience de développement exceptionnelle, en exploitant les intégrations intégrées et en gérant des millions d''enregistrements avec facilité, en utilisant les flux de travail temporaires simplifiés de Trigger.dev pour les développeurs de TypeScript","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, skalierbare AI-Pipelines mit außergewöhnlicher Entwicklererfahrung zu erstellen, indem sie die integrierten Integrationen nutzen und millionen von Datensätzen mühelos verarbeiten, indem sie die vereinfachten Temporal-Workflows von Trigger.dev für TypeScript-Entwickler verwenden","pt":"Capacita os agentes a construir pipelines de IA escaláveis com excepcional experiência de desenvolvedor, aproveitando integrações internas e lidando com milhões de registros com facilidade, usando os workflows Temporal simplificados do Trigger.dev para desenvolvedores TypeScript","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать масштабируемые AI-конвейеры с превосходным опытом разработки, используя встроенные интеграции и легко обрабатывая миллионы записей с помощью упрощенных рабочих процессов Temporal от Trigger.dev для разработчиков TypeScript","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من بناء خطوط أنابيب ذكاء اصطناعي قابلة للتوسع مع تجربة ممتازة للمطورين، والاستفادة من التكاملات المضمنة والتعامل مع ملايين السجلات بسهولة، باستخدام مهام Trigger.dev المبسطة لـ Temporal لمطوري TypeScript"},"useCases":{"en":["Building reliable background jobs for AI pipeline processing","Integrating workflows across dozens of services with Trigger.dev","Handling batch jobs for millions of records with built-in integrations"],"zh":["构建可靠的后台作业用于AI管道处理","使用Trigger.dev在数十个服务中集成工作流","使用内置集成处理数百万条记录的批处理作业"],"ja":["AIパイプライン処理用の信頼性の高いバックグラウンドジョブを構築する","Trigger.devを使用して数十のサービスをまたぐワークフローを統合する","内蔵の統合を使用して数百万のレコードのバッチジョブを処理する"],"ko":["AI 파이프라인 처리를 위한 안정적인 배경 작업을 구축하는こと","Trigger.dev를 사용하여 수십 개의 서비스를またぐ 워크플로를 통합하는 것","내장된 통합을 사용하여 수백만 개의 레코드의 배치 작업을 처리하는 것"],"es":["Construir trabajos en segundo plano confiables para el procesamiento de canalizaciones de IA","Integrar flujos de trabajo en decenas de servicios con Trigger.dev","Manejar trabajos por lotes para millones de registros con integraciones incorporadas"],"fr":["Construire des tâches en arrière-plan fiables pour le traitement des pipelines d''IA","Intégrer des flux de travail à travers des dizaines de services avec Trigger.dev","Gérer des tâches par lots pour des millions d''enregistrements avec des intégrations intégrées"],"de":["Erstellen von zuverlässigen Hintergrundaufgaben für die Verarbeitung von AI-Pipelines","Integration von Workflows über Dutzende von Diensten mit Trigger.dev","Verarbeiten von Batch-Aufträgen für Millionen von Datensätzen mit integrierten Integrationen"],"pt":["Construção de jobs em segundo plano confiáveis para processamento de pipeline de IA","Integração de workflows em dezenas de serviços com Trigger.dev","Manipulação de jobs em lote para milhões de registros com integrações incorporadas"],"ru":["Создание надежных фоновых задач для обработки AI-конвейер