plementação de NetworkPolicy","Configuração de PodSecurityPolicy","Gerenciamento de RBAC","Aplicação de Pod Security Standards","Proteção de clusters contra ameaças","Melhores práticas para segurança do Kubernetes"],"ru":["Реализация NetworkPolicy","Настройка PodSecurityPolicy","Управление RBAC","Применение Pod Security Standards","Защита кластеров от угроз","Лучшие практики безопасности Kubernetes"],"ar":["تنفيذ سياسة الشبكة","تكوين سياسة أمان الحاويات","إدارة التحكم في الوصول المستند إلى دور","تطبيق معايير أمان الحاويات","حماية المجموعات من التهديدات","أفضل الممارسات لأمان كوبيرنيتيس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kubernetes 安全","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","Pod 安全标准","容器安全","云原生安全"],"ja":["Kubernetes セキュリティ","NetworkPolicy","PodSecurityPolicy","RBAC","Pod セキュリティ標準","コンテナ セキュリティ","クラウドネイティブ セキュリティ"],"ko":["쿠버네티스 보안","네트워크 정책","파드 보안 정책","RBAC","파드 보안 표준","컨테이너 보안","클라우드 네이티브 보안"],"es":["seguridad de kubernetes","políticas de seguridad","networkpolicy","podsecuritypolicy","rbac","seguridad de pods","mejores prácticas de seguridad"],"fr":["sécurité kubernetes","politiques de sécurité","networkpolicy","podsecuritypolicy","rbac","sécurité des pods","meilleures pratiques de sécurité"],"de":["kubernetes-sicherheit","sicherheitsrichtlinien","networkpolicy","podsecuritypolicy","rbac","sicherheit von pods","sicherheitsbest practices"],"pt":["segurança do kubernetes","políticas de segurança","networkpolicy","podsecuritypolicy","rbac","pod security standards","segurança de cluster","melhores práticas de segurança"],"ru":["безопасность kubernetes","политики безопасности","networkpolicy","podsecuritypolicy","rbac","стандарты безопасности под","безопасность кластера","лучшие практики безопасности"],"ar":["أمان كوبيرنيتيس","سياسات الأمان","سياسة الشبكة","سياسة أمان الحاويات","التحكم في الوصول المستند إلى دور","معايير أمان الحاويات","أمان المجموعة","أفضل الممارسات لأمان كوبيرنيتيس"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"k8s-security-policies","description":"Implement Kubernetes security policies including NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, and RBAC for production-grade security. Use when securing Kubernetes clusters, implementing network isolation, or enforcing pod security standards.","bodyPreview":"# Kubernetes Security Policies\n\nComprehensive guide for implementing NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC, and Pod Security Standards in Kubernetes.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to kubernetes security policies\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required","body":"# Kubernetes Security Policies\n\nComprehensive guide for implementing NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, RBAC, and Pod Security Standards in Kubernetes.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to kubernetes security policies\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement defense-in-depth security for Kubernetes clusters using network policies, pod security standards, and RBAC.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Implement network segmentation\n- Configure pod security standards\n- Set up RBAC for least-privilege access\n- Create security policies for compliance\n- Implement admission control\n- Secure multi-tenant clusters\n\n## Pod Security Standards\n\n### 1. Privileged (Unrestricted)\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: privileged-ns\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: privileged\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: privileged\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: privileged\n```\n\n### 2. Baseline (Minimally restrictive)\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: baseline-ns\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: baseline\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: baseline\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: baseline\n```\n\n### 3. Restricted (Most restrictive)\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: restricted-ns\n  labels:\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: restricted\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: restricted\n    pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: restricted\n```\n\n## Network Policies\n\n### Default Deny All\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: default-deny-all\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  podSelector: {}\n  policyTypes:\n  - Ingress\n  - Egress\n```\n\n### Allow Frontend to Backend\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-frontend-to-backend\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  podSelector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: backend\n  policyTypes:\n  - Ingress\n  ingress:\n  - from:\n    - podSelector:\n        matchLabels:\n          app: frontend\n    ports:\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 8080\n```\n\n### Allow DNS\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: NetworkPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-dns\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  podSelector: {}\n  policyTypes:\n  - Egress\n  egress:\n  - to:\n    - namespaceSelector:\n        matchLabels:\n          name: kube-system\n    ports:\n    - protocol: UDP\n      port: 53\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `assets/network-policy-template.yaml`\n\n## RBAC Configuration\n\n### Role (Namespace-scoped)\n```yaml\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Role\nmetadata:\n  name: pod-reader\n  namespace: production\nrules:\n- apiGroups: [\"\"]\n  resources: [\"pods\"]\n  verbs: [\"get\", \"watch\", \"list\"]\n```\n\n### ClusterRole (Cluster-wide)\n```yaml\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: ClusterRole\nmetadata:\n  name: secret-reader\nrules:\n- apiGroups: [\"\"]\n  resources: [\"secrets\"]\n  verbs: [\"get\", \"watch\", \"list\"]\n```\n\n### RoleBinding\n```yaml\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: RoleBinding\nmetadata:\n  name: read-pods\n  namespace: production\nsubjects:\n- kind: User\n  name: jane\n  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n- kind: ServiceAccount\n  name: default\n  namespace: production\nroleRef:\n  kind: Role\n  name: pod-reader\n  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `references/rbac-patterns.md`\n\n## Pod Security Context\n\n### Restricted Pod\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nmetadata:\n  name: secure-pod\nspec:\n  securityContext:\n    runAsNonRoot: true\n    runAsUser: 1000\n    fsGroup: 1000\n    seccompProfile:\n      type: RuntimeDefault\n  containers:\n  - name: app\n    image: myapp:1.0\n    securityContext:\n      allowPrivilegeEscalation: false\n      readOnlyRootFilesystem: true\n      capabilities:\n        drop:\n        - ALL\n```\n\n## Policy Enforcement with OPA Gatekeeper\n\n### ConstraintTemplate\n```yaml\napiVersion: templates.gatekeeper.sh/v1\nkind: ConstraintTemplate\nmetadata:\n  name: k8srequiredlabels\nspec:\n  crd:\n    spec:\n      names:\n        kind: K8sRequiredLabels\n      validation:\n        openAPIV3Schema:\n          type: object\n          properties:\n            labels:\n              type: array\n              items:\n                type: string\n  targets:\n    - target: admission.k8s.gatekeeper.sh\n      rego: |\n        package k8srequiredlabels\n        violation[{\"msg\": msg, \"details\": {\"missing_labels\": missing}}] {\n          provided := {label | input.review.object.metadata.labels[label]}\n          required := {label | label := input.parameters.labels[_]}\n          missing := required - provided\n          count(missing) > 0\n          msg := sprintf(\"missing required labels: %v\", [missing])\n        }\n```\n\n### Constraint\n```yaml\napiVersion: constraints.gatekeeper.sh/v1beta1\nkind: K8sRequiredLabels\nmetadata:\n  name: require-app-label\nspec:\n  match:\n    kinds:\n      - apiGroups: [\"apps\"]\n        kinds: [\"Deployment\"]\n  parameters:\n    labels: [\"app\", \"environment\"]\n```\n\n## Service Mesh Security (Istio)\n\n### PeerAuthentication (mTLS)\n```yaml\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: PeerAuthentication\nmetadata:\n  name: default\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  mtls:\n    mode: STRICT\n```\n\n### AuthorizationPolicy\n```yaml\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: AuthorizationPolicy\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-frontend\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: backend\n  action: ALLOW\n  rules:\n  - from:\n    - source:\n        principals: [\"cluster.local/ns/production/sa/frontend\"]\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Implement Pod Security Standards** at namespace level\n2. **Use Network Policies** for network segmentation\n3. **Apply least-privilege RBAC** for all service accounts\n4. **Enable admission control** (OPA Gatekeeper/Kyverno)\n5. **Run containers as non-root**\n6. **Use read-only root filesystem**\n7. **Drop all capabilities** unless needed\n8. **Implement resource quotas** and limit ranges\n9. **Enable audit logging** for security events\n10. **Regular security scanning** of images\n\n## Compliance Frameworks\n\n### CIS Kubernetes Benchmark\n- Use RBAC authorization\n- Enable audit logging\n- Use Pod Security Standards\n- Configure network policies\n- Implement secrets encryption at rest\n- Enable node authentication\n\n### NIST Cybersecurity Framework\n- Implement defense in depth\n- Use network segmentation\n- Configure security monitoring\n- Implement access controls\n- Enable logging and monitoring\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**NetworkPolicy not working:**\n```bash\n# Check if CNI supports NetworkPolicy\nkubectl get nodes -o wide\nkubectl describe networkpolicy <name>\n```\n\n**RBAC permission denied:**\n```bash\n# Check effective permissions\nkubectl auth can-i list pods --as system:serviceaccount:default:my-sa\nkubectl auth can-i ''*'' ''*'' --as system:serviceaccount:default:my-sa\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `assets/network-policy-template.yaml` - Network policy examples\n- `assets/pod-security-template.yaml` - Pod security policies\n- `references/rbac-patterns.md` - RBAC configuration patterns\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `k8s-manifest-generator` - For creating secure manifests\n- `gitops-workflow` - For automated policy deployment\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:12:56.901Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Security Agents requiring advanced Kubernetes security policy implementation and management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级Kubernetes安全策略实现和管理能力的云安全代理。","ja":"クラウドセキュリティエージェントが高度なKubernetesセキュリティポリシーの実装と管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Kubernetes 보안 정책 구현 및 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 클라우드 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de seguridad en la nube que requieren una implementación y gestión avanzada de políticas de seguridad de Kubernetes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité cloud nécessitant une mise en œuvre et une gestion avancées des politiques de sécurité Kubernetes.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Kubernetes-Sicherheitsrichtlinienimplementierung und -verwaltungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança em Nuvem que exigem implementação e gerenciamento avançados de políticas de segurança do Kubernetes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности в облаке, требующих продвинутой реализации и управления политиками безопасности Kubernetes.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل أمن السحابة التي تتطلب تنفيذًا وتدارة متقدمين لقوانين أمان كوبيرنتيس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy, and RBAC, ensuring secure Kubernetes deployments with Pod Security Standards, and providing actionable steps for validation and verification using Kubernetes APIs and CLI tools.","zh":"赋予代理执行NetworkPolicy、PodSecurityPolicy和RBAC的能力，确保具有Pod安全标准的安全Kubernetes部署，并提供使用Kubernetes API和CLI工具进行验证和验证的可行步骤。","ja":"エージェントにNetworkPolicy、PodSecurityPolicy、RBACを実施する能力を与え、Pod Security Standardsを備えた安全なKubernetesデプロイを保証し、Kubernetes APIおよびCLIツールを使用した検証と検証のための実行可能なステップを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy 및 RBAC를 시행할 수 있도록 하여 Pod 보안 표준이 있는 보안 Kubernetes 배포를 보장하며 Kubernetes API 및 CLI 도구를 사용하여 검증 및 확인에 대한 조치 가능한 단계를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy y RBAC, garantizando implementaciones de Kubernetes seguras con estándares de seguridad de pod, y proporcionando pasos acciónables para la validación y verificación utilizando APIs y herramientas de CLI de Kubernetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy et RBAC, garantissant des déploiements Kubernetes sécurisés avec des normes de sécurité de pod, et fournissant des étapes actionnables pour la validation et la vérification à l''aide d''API et d''outils CLI Kubernetes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy und RBAC durchzusetzen, um sichere Kubernetes-Bereitstellungen mit Pod-Sicherheitsstandards sicherzustellen und handhabbare Schritte für Validierung und Überprüfung mithilfe von Kubernetes-APIs und CLI-Tools bereitzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy e RBAC, garantindo implantações seguras do Kubernetes com Padrões de Segurança de Pod, e fornecendo etapas práticas para validação e verificação usando APIs e ferramentas de linha de comando do Kubernetes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов полномочиями по обеспечению NetworkPolicy, PodSecurityPolicy и RBAC, гарантируя безопасные развертывания Kubernetes с стандартами безопасности подов, и предоставляя действенные шаги для проверки и верификации с использованием API и инструментов командной строки Kubernetes.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل صلاحيات تنفيذ سياسة الشبكة وسياسة أمان الحاوية و RBAC، مما يضمن نشرات كوبيرنتيس الآمنة مع معايير أمان الحاوية، ويوفر خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ للتأكد والتحقق باستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات وأدوات سطر الأوامر لكوبيرنتيس."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing NetworkPolicy for secure pod communication","Enforcing PodSecurityPolicy for container runtime security","Configuring RBAC for fine-grained access control in Kubernetes clusters","Validating Pod Security Standards for compliance and security audits"],"zh":["实现NetworkPolicy以实现安全的Pod通信","执行PodSecurityPolicy以实现容器运行时安全","配置RBAC以实现Kubernetes集群中的细粒度访问控制","验证Pod安全标准以进行合规性和安全审计"],"ja":["セキュアなPod通信のためのNetworkPolicyの実装","コンテナランタイムセキュリティのためのPodSecurityPolicyの適用","Kubernetesクラスタ内の细粒度アクセス制御のためのRBACの構成","Pod Security Standardsの検証によるコンプライアンスとセキュリティ監査"],"ko":["보안 Pod 통신을 위한 NetworkPolicy 구현","컨테이너 런타임 보안을 위한 PodSecurityPolicy 시행","Kubernetes 클러스터 내 세분화된 액세스 제어를 위한 RBAC 구성","합规 및 보안 감사를 위한 Pod 보안 표준 확인"],"es":["Implementación de NetworkPolicy para una comunicación segura entre pods","Aplicación de PodSecurityPolicy para la seguridad de tiempo de ejecución de contenedores","Configuración de RBAC para un control de acceso granular en clusters de Kubernetes","Validación de estándares de seguridad de pod para cumplimiento y auditorías de seguridad"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de NetworkPolicy pour une communication sécurisée entre pods","Application de PodSecurityPolicy pour la sécurité du runtime de conteneur","Configuration de RBAC pour un contrôle d''accès granulaire dans les clusters Kubernetes","Validation des normes de sécurité de pod pour la conformité et les audits de sécurité"],"de":["Implementierung von NetworkPolicy für eine sichere Kommunikation zwischen Pods","Durchsetzung von PodSecurityPolicy für die Laufzeit-Sicherheit von Containern","Konfiguration von RBAC für eine granulare Zugriffssteuerung in Kubernetes-Clustern","Validierung von Pod-Sicherheitsstandards für die Einhaltung und Sicherheitsaudits"],"pt":["Implementação da NetworkPolicy para comunicação segura de pods","Aplicação da PodSecurityPolicy para segurança de tempo de execução de contêiner","Configuração do RBAC para controle de acesso granular em clusters do Kubernetes","Validação dos Padrões de Segurança de Pod para conformidade e auditorias de segurança"],"ru":["Реализация NetworkPolicy для безопасной коммуникации подов","Применение PodSecurityPolicy для безопасности контейнеров во время выполнения","Настройка RBAC для детального контроля доступа в кластерах Kubernetes","Проверка стандартов безопасности подов для соответствия и аудита безопасности"],"ar":["تنفيذ سياسة الشبكة للاتصالات الآمنة بين الحاويات","تنفيذ سياسة أمان الحاوية لأمان وقت تشغيل الحاوية","تكوين RBAC للتحكم الدقيق في الوصول إلى клаسترات كوبيرنتيس","التأكد من معايير أمان الحاوية للامتثال والتدقيق الأمني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kubernetes cluster access","Limited to Kubernetes security policy domain","Needs clarification of goals, constraints, and required inputs for effective policy implementation"],"zh":["需要Kubernetes集群访问","仅限Kubernetes安全策略域","需要对目标、约束和所需输入进行澄清以有效实施策略"],"ja":["Kubernetesクラスタへのアクセスが必要","Kubernetesセキュリティポリシードメインに限定される","効果的なポリシーの実施には、目標、制約、必要な入力についての明確化が必要"],"ko":["Kubernetes 클러스터 액세스가 필요함","Kubernetes 보안 정책 도메인에만 제한됨","목표, 제약 및 필요한 입력에 대한 명확화가 효과적인 정책 구현에 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a un cluster de Kubernetes","Limitado al dominio de políticas de seguridad de Kubernetes","Necesita aclarar los objetivos, restricciones y entradas requeridas para una implementación de política efectiva"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à un cluster Kubernetes","Limité au domaine des politiques de sécurité Kubernetes","Nécessite une clarification des objectifs, des contraintes et des entrées requises pour une mise en œuvre de politique efficace"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf einen Kubernetes-Cluster","Begrenzt auf den Bereich der Kubernetes-Sicherheitsrichtlinien","Benötigt eine Klärung der Ziele, Einschränkungen und erforderlichen Eingaben für eine effektive Richtlinienimplementierung"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao cluster do Kubernetes","Limitado ao domínio de políticas de segurança do Kubernetes","Necessita de esclarecimento de objetivos, restrições e entradas necessárias para implementação eficaz de políticas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кластеру Kubernetes","Ограничен доменом политики безопасности Kubernetes","Требует уточнения целей, ограничений и необходимых входных данных для эффективной реализации политики"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى кластер كوبيرنتيس","محدود بنطاق سياسات أمان كوبيرنتيس","يحتاج إلى توضيح الأهداف والقيود والمدخلات المطلوبة للتنفيذ الفعال للسياسة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
