uración de nuevos proyectos con Conductor","Mantenimiento de la consistencia en las sesiones de desarrollo asistidas por IA"],"fr":["Implémentation du contexte comme artefact géré","Cohérence dans les interactions IA","Alignement de l''équipe à travers la documentation de projet","Configuration de nouveaux projets avec Conductor","Maintenance de la cohérence dans les sessions de développement assistées par IA"],"de":["Implementierung des Kontexts als verwaltetes Artefakt","Konsistenz in den KI-Interaktionen","Teamsausrichtung durch strukturierte Projektunterlagen","Einrichtung neuer Projekte mit Conductor","Wartung der Konsistenz in den KI-unterstützten Entwicklungssitzungen"],"pt":["Implementação de contexto como um artefato gerenciado","Interações de IA consistentes","Alinhamento da equipe através de documentação de projeto estruturada","Configuração de novos projetos com Conductor","Manutenção de consistência em sessões de desenvolvimento assistidas por IA"],"ru":["Реализация контекста как управляемого артефакта","Последовательные взаимодействия ИИ","Выравнивание команды через структурированную документацию проекта","Настройка новых проектов с Conductor","Поддержание последовательности в сессиях разработки, помеченных ИИ"],"ar":["تنفيذ السياق كartifact قابل للإدارة","تفاعلات ذكاء اصطناعي متسقة","تحديد الفريق من خلال وثائق مشروع منظم","إعداد مشاريع جديدة مع Conductor","الحفاظ على التماسك في جلسات التطوير المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["上下文驱动开发","AI交互","团队协调","结构化项目文档","Conductor","代码管理","软件开发方法"],"ja":["コンテキスト駆動開発","AIのやり取り","チームの調整","構造化されたプロジェクト文書","Conductor","コード管理","ソフトウェア開発方法"],"ko":["컨텍스트 주도 개발","AI 상호 작용","팀 조정","구조화된 프로젝트 문서","Conductor","코드 관리","소프트웨어 개발 방법"],"es":["desarrollo dirigido por contexto","interacciones de IA","documentación de proyectos","conductor","desarrollo asistido por IA","gestión de contexto","coherencia en IA","alineación de equipo"],"fr":["développement piloté par le contexte","interactions IA","documentation de projet","conductor","développement assisté par IA","gestion du contexte","cohérence en IA","alignement de l''équipe"],"de":["kontextgetriebene entwicklung","KI-Interaktionen","projektunterlagen","conductor","KI-unterstützte entwicklung","kontextverwaltung","konsistenz in KI","teamsausrichtung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento dirigido por contexto","contexto como artefato","interações de IA","alinhamento da equipe","Conductor","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de contexto"],"ru":["контекстно-ориентированное развитие","контекст как артефакт","взаимодействия ИИ","выравнивание команды","Conductor","разработка программного обеспечения","управление контекстом"],"ar":["التطوير الموجه بالسياق","السياق كartifact","تفاعلات ذكاء اصطناعي","تحديد الفريق","Conductor","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة السياق"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-driven-development","description":"Use this skill when working with Conductors context-driven development methodology, managing project context artifacts, or understanding the relationship between product.md, tech-stack.md, and workflow.md files.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Context-Driven Development\n\nGuide for implementing and maintaining context as a managed artifact alongside code, enabling consistent AI interactions and team alignment through structured project documentation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new projects with Conductor\n- Understanding the relationship between context artifacts\n- Maintaining consistency across AI-assisted development sessions\n- Onboarding team members to an existing Conductor project\n- Deciding when to update context d","body":"# Context-Driven Development\n\nGuide for implementing and maintaining context as a managed artifact alongside code, enabling consistent AI interactions and team alignment through structured project documentation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new projects with Conductor\n- Understanding the relationship between context artifacts\n- Maintaining consistency across AI-assisted development sessions\n- Onboarding team members to an existing Conductor project\n- Deciding when to update context documents\n- Managing greenfield vs brownfield project contexts\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\nContext-Driven Development treats project context as a first-class artifact managed alongside code. Instead of relying on ad-hoc prompts or scattered documentation, establish a persistent, structured foundation that informs all AI interactions.\n\nKey principles:\n\n1. **Context precedes code**: Define what you''re building and how before implementation\n2. **Living documentation**: Context artifacts evolve with the project\n3. **Single source of truth**: One canonical location for each type of information\n4. **AI alignment**: Consistent context produces consistent AI behavior\n\n## The Workflow\n\nFollow the **Context → Spec & Plan → Implement** workflow:\n\n1. **Context Phase**: Establish or verify project context artifacts exist and are current\n2. **Specification Phase**: Define requirements and acceptance criteria for work units\n3. **Planning Phase**: Break specifications into phased, actionable tasks\n4. **Implementation Phase**: Execute tasks following established workflow patterns\n\n## Artifact Relationships\n\n### product.md - Defines WHAT and WHY\n\nPurpose: Captures product vision, goals, target users, and business context.\n\nContents:\n\n- Product name and one-line description\n- Problem statement and solution approach\n- Target user personas\n- Core features and capabilities\n- Success metrics and KPIs\n- Product roadmap (high-level)\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Product vision or goals change\n- New major features are planned\n- Target audience shifts\n- Business priorities evolve\n\n### product-guidelines.md - Defines HOW to Communicate\n\nPurpose: Establishes brand voice, messaging standards, and communication patterns.\n\nContents:\n\n- Brand voice and tone guidelines\n- Terminology and glossary\n- Error message conventions\n- User-facing copy standards\n- Documentation style\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Brand guidelines change\n- New terminology is introduced\n- Communication patterns need refinement\n\n### tech-stack.md - Defines WITH WHAT\n\nPurpose: Documents technology choices, dependencies, and architectural decisions.\n\nContents:\n\n- Primary languages and frameworks\n- Key dependencies with versions\n- Infrastructure and deployment targets\n- Development tools and environment\n- Testing frameworks\n- Code quality tools\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Adding new dependencies\n- Upgrading major versions\n- Changing infrastructure\n- Adopting new tools or patterns\n\n### workflow.md - Defines HOW to Work\n\nPurpose: Establishes development practices, quality gates, and team workflows.\n\nContents:\n\n- Development methodology (TDD, etc.)\n- Git workflow and commit conventions\n- Code review requirements\n- Testing requirements and coverage targets\n- Quality assurance gates\n- Deployment procedures\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- Team practices evolve\n- Quality standards change\n- New workflow patterns are adopted\n\n### tracks.md - Tracks WHAT''S HAPPENING\n\nPurpose: Registry of all work units with status and metadata.\n\nContents:\n\n- Active tracks with current status\n- Completed tracks with completion dates\n- Track metadata (type, priority, assignee)\n- Links to individual track directories\n\nUpdate when:\n\n- New tracks are created\n- Track status changes\n- Tracks are completed or archived\n\n## Context Maintenance Principles\n\n### Keep Artifacts Synchronized\n\nEnsure changes in one artifact reflect in related documents:\n\n- New feature in product.md → Update tech-stack.md if new dependencies needed\n- Completed track → Update product.md to reflect new capabilities\n- Workflow change → Update all affected track plans\n\n### Update tech-stack.md When Adding Dependencies\n\nBefore adding any new dependency:\n\n1. Check if existing dependencies solve the need\n2. Document the rationale for new dependencies\n3. Add version constraints\n4. Note any configuration requirements\n\n### Update product.md When Features Complete\n\nAfter completing a feature track:\n\n1. Move feature from \"planned\" to \"implemented\" in product.md\n2. Update any affected success metrics\n3. Document any scope changes from original plan\n\n### Verify Context Before Implementation\n\nBefore starting any track:\n\n1. Read all context artifacts\n2. Flag any outdated information\n3. Propose updates before proceeding\n4. Confirm context accuracy with stakeholders\n\n## Greenfield vs Brownfield Handling\n\n### Greenfield Projects (New)\n\nFor new projects:\n\n1. Run `/conductor:setup` to create all artifacts interactively\n2. Answer questions about product vision, tech preferences, and workflow\n3. Generate initial style guides for chosen languages\n4. Create empty tracks registry\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n- Full control over context structure\n- Define standards before code exists\n- Establish patterns early\n\n### Brownfield Projects (Existing)\n\nFor existing codebases:\n\n1. Run `/conductor:setup` with existing codebase detection\n2. System analyzes existing code, configs, and documentation\n3. Pre-populate artifacts based on discovered patterns\n4. Review and refine generated context\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n- Extract implicit context from existing code\n- Reconcile existing patterns with desired patterns\n- Document technical debt and modernization plans\n- Preserve working patterns while establishing standards\n\n## Benefits\n\n### Team Alignment\n\n- New team members onboard faster with explicit context\n- Consistent terminology and conventions across the team\n- Shared understanding of product goals and technical decisions\n\n### AI Consistency\n\n- AI assistants produce aligned outputs across sessions\n- Reduced need to re-explain context in each interaction\n- Predictable behavior based on documented standards\n\n### Institutional Memory\n\n- Decisions and rationale are preserved\n- Context survives team changes\n- Historical context informs future decisions\n\n### Quality Assurance\n\n- Standards are explicit and verifiable\n- Deviations from context are detectable\n- Quality gates are documented and enforceable\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nconductor/\n├── index.md              # Navigation hub linking all artifacts\n├── product.md            # Product vision and goals\n├── product-guidelines.md # Communication standards\n├── tech-stack.md         # Technology preferences\n├── workflow.md           # Development practices\n├── tracks.md             # Work unit registry\n├── setup_state.json      # Resumable setup state\n├── code_styleguides/     # Language-specific conventions\n│   ├── python.md\n│   ├── typescript.md\n│   └── ...\n└── tracks/\n    └── <track-id>/\n        ├── spec.md\n        ├── plan.md\n        ├── metadata.json\n        └── index.md\n```\n\n## Context Lifecycle\n\n1. **Creation**: Initial setup via `/conductor:setup`\n2. **Validation**: Verify before each track\n3. **Evolution**: Update as project grows\n4. **Synchronization**: Keep artifacts aligned\n5. **Archival**: Document historical decisions\n\n## Context Validation Checklist\n\nBefore starting implementation on any track, validate context:\n\n### Product Context\n\n- [ ] product.md reflects current product vision\n- [ ] Target users are accurately described\n- [ ] Feature list is up to date\n- [ ] Success metrics are defined\n\n### Technical Context\n\n- [ ] tech-stack.md lists all current dependencies\n- [ ] Version numbers are accurate\n- [ ] Infrastructure targets are correct\n- [ ] Development tools are documented\n\n### Workflow Context\n\n- [ ] workflow.md describes current practices\n- [ ] Quality gates are defined\n- [ ] Coverage targets are specified\n- [ ] Commit conventions are documented\n\n### Track Context\n\n- [ ] tracks.md shows all active work\n- [ ] No stale or abandoned tracks\n- [ ] Dependencies between tracks are noted\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\nAvoid these context management mistakes:\n\n### Stale Context\n\nProblem: Context documents become outdated and misleading.\nSolution: Update context as part of each track''s completion process.\n\n### Context Sprawl\n\nProblem: Information scattered across multiple locations.\nSolution: Use the defined artifact structure; resist creating new document types.\n\n### Implicit Context\n\nProblem: Relying on knowledge not captured in artifacts.\nSolution: If you reference something repeatedly, add it to the appropriate artifact.\n\n### Context Hoarding\n\nProblem: One person maintains context without team input.\nSolution: Review context artifacts in pull requests; make updates collaborative.\n\n### Over-Specification\n\nProblem: Context becomes so detailed it''s impossible to maintain.\nSolution: Keep artifacts focused on decisions that affect AI behavior and team alignment.\n\n## Integration with Development Tools\n\n### IDE Integration\n\nConfigure your IDE to display context files prominently:\n\n- Pin conductor/product.md for quick reference\n- Add tech-stack.md to project notes\n- Create snippets for common patterns from style guides\n\n### Git Hooks\n\nConsider pre-commit hooks that:\n\n- Warn when dependencies change without tech-stack.md update\n- Remind to update product.md when feature branches merge\n- Validate context artifact syntax\n\n### CI/CD Integration\n\nInclude context validation in pipelines:\n\n- Check tech-stack.md matches actual dependencies\n- Verify links in context documents resolve\n- Ensure tracks.md status matches git branch state\n\n## Session Continuity\n\nConductor supports multi-session development through context persistence:\n\n### Starting a New Session\n\n1. Read index.md to orient yourself\n2. Check tracks.md for active work\n3. Review relevant track''s plan.md for current task\n4. Verify context artifacts are current\n\n### Ending a Session\n\n1. Update plan.md with current progress\n2. Note any blockers or decisions made\n3. Commit in-progress work with clear status\n4. Update tracks.md if status changed\n\n### Handling Interruptions\n\nIf interrupted mid-task:\n\n1. Mark task as `[~]` with note about stopping point\n2. Commit work-in-progress to feature branch\n3. Document any uncommitted decisions in plan.md\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Read context first**: Always read relevant artifacts before starting work\n2. **Small updates**: Make incremental context changes, not massive rewrites\n3. **Link decisions**: Reference context when making implementation choices\n4. **Version context**: Commit context changes alongside code changes\n5. **Review context**: Include context artifact reviews in code reviews\n6. **Validate regularly**: Run context validation checklist before major work\n7. **Communicate changes**: Notify team when context artifacts change significantly\n8. **Preserve history**: Use git to track context evolution over time\n9. **Question staleness**: If context feels wrong, investigate and update\n10. **Keep it actionable**: Every context item should inform a decision or behavior\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:13:00.627Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conductor Agents requiring structured project documentation and consistent AI interactions through context-driven development","zh":"适合需要结构化项目文档和通过上下文驱动开发的一致性 AI 交互的 Conductor 代理","ja":"構造化されたプロジェクト文書とコンテキスト駆動開発を通じた一貫性のある AI インタラクションを必要とする Conductor エージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 문서와 문맥에 의한 개발을 통해 일관된 AI 상호 작용을 필요로 하는 Conductor 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Conductor que requieren documentación de proyecto estructurada y una interacción de IA coherente a través del desarrollo dirigido por contexto","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Conductor nécessitant une documentation de projet structurée et des interactions d''IA cohérentes via le développement piloté par le contexte","de":"Ideal für Conductor-Agents, die eine strukturierte Projektdokumentation und konsistente KI-Interaktionen durch kontextgetriebene Entwicklung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Condutores que requerem documentação de projeto estruturada e interações de IA consistentes por meio do desenvolvimento orientado por contexto","ru":"Идеально для Кондукторов-агентов, требующих структурированной документации проекта и последовательных взаимодействий ИИ посредством контекстно-ориентированного развития","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الموجهين الذين يتطلبون توثيق مشروع منظم وتفاعلات ذكاء اصطناعي متسقة من خلال التطوير القائم على السياق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain consistency across AI-assisted development sessions by implementing and managing context as a managed artifact alongside code, utilizing structured project documentation and enabling team alignment through Conductor projects, while understanding the relationship between context artifacts and deciding when to update context","zh":"赋予代理维持 AI 辅助开发会话的一致性，通过实施和管理上下文作为代码旁边的管理工件，利用结构化项目文档，并通过 Conductor 项目使团队保持一致，同时理解上下文工件之间的关系并决定何时更新上下文","ja":"エージェントに、コードとともに管理されたアーティファクトとしてのコンテキストを実装および管理することで、構造化されたプロジェクト文書を利用し、Conductor プロジェクトを通じてチームの整合性を可能にし、コンテキスト・アーティファクト間の関係を理解し、コンテキストを更新するタイミングを決定することで、AI アシスト開発セッションの一貫性を維持する力を与える","ko":"에이전트에게 코드와 함께 관리되는 아티팩트로서의 문맥을 구현 및 관리함으로써 구조화된 프로젝트 문서를 활용하고 Conductor 프로젝트를 통해 팀의 일관성을 가능하게 하며 문맥 아티팩트 간의 관계를 이해하고 문맥을 업데이트할 때를 결정함으로써 AI 지원 개발 세션의 일관성을 유지할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener la coherencia en todas las sesiones de desarrollo asistidas por IA implementando y gestionando el contexto como un artefacto administrado junto con el código, utilizando la documentación de proyecto estructurada y permitiendo la alineación del equipo a través de proyectos Conductor, mientras entiende la relación entre los artefactos de contexto y decide cuándo actualizar el contexto","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir la cohérence à travers toutes les sessions de développement assistées par IA en mettant en œuvre et en gérant le contexte comme un artefact géré aux côtés du code, en utilisant la documentation de projet structurée et en permettant l''alignement de l''équipe via les projets Conductor, tout en comprenant la relation entre les artefacts de contexte et en décidant quand mettre à jour le contexte","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Konsistenz über alle KI-gestützten Entwicklungssitzungen hinweg zu bewahren, indem es den Kontext als verwaltetes Artefakt neben dem Code implementiert und verwaltet, strukturierte Projektdokumentation nutzt und Teamausrichtung durch Conductor-Projekte ermöglicht, während es das Verhältnis zwischen Kontextartefakten versteht und entscheidet, wann der Kontext aktualisiert werden soll","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter a consistência em todas as sessões de desenvolvimento assistidas por IA, implementando e gerenciando o contexto como um artefato gerenciado ao lado do código, utilizando a documentação de projeto estruturada e permitindo o alinhamento da equipe por meio de projetos Condutores, enquanto compreende a relação entre artefatos de contexto e decide quando atualizar o contexto","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать последовательность на всех сессиях разработки с помощью ИИ, реализуя и управляя контекстом в качестве управляемого артефакта наряду с кодом, используя структурированную документацию проекта и обеспечивая выравнивание команды посредством проектов Кондуктора, а также понимая отношение между артефактами контекста и решая, когда обновлять контекст","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على الاتساق في جميع جلسات التطوير التي تدعمها الذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال تنفيذ وإدارة السياق كartifact محكم إلى جانب الكود، واستخدام توثيق المشروع المنظم وتمكين انسجام الفريق من خلال مشاريع الموجه، مع فهم العلاقة بين مكونات السياق و 결정 متى تحديث السياق"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up new projects with Conductor","Maintaining consistency across AI-assisted development sessions","Onboarding team members to an existing Conductor project","Understanding the relationship between context artifacts","Deciding when to update context"],"zh":["使用 Conductor 设置新项目","在 AI 辅助开发会话中保持一致性","将团队成员纳入现有的 Conductor 项目","理解上下文工件之间的关系","决定何时更新上下文"],"ja":["Conductor を使用して新しいプロジェクトを設定する","AI アシスト開発セッションの一貫性を維持する","チームメンバーを既存の Conductor プロジェクトにオンボードする","コンテキスト・アーティファクト間の関係を理解する","コンテキストを更新するタイミングを決定する"],"ko":["Conductor 를 사용하여 새로운 프로젝트를 설정","AI 지원 개발 세션에서 일관성을 유지","팀원을 기존 Conductor 프로젝트에 온보딩","문맥 아티팩트 간의 관계를 이해","문맥을 업데이트할 때를 결정"],"es":["Configuración de nuevos proyectos con Conductor","Mantener la coherencia en todas las sesiones de desarrollo asistidas por IA","Incorporación de miembros del equipo a un proyecto Conductor existente","Comprensión de la relación entre los artefactos de contexto","Decidir cuándo actualizar el contexto"],"fr":["Configuration de nouveaux projets avec Conductor","Maintenir la cohérence à travers toutes les sessions de développement assistées par IA","Intégration de membres d''équipe à un projet Conductor existant","Compréhension de la relation entre les artefacts de contexte","Décider quand mettre à jour le contexte"],"de":["Einrichten neuer Projekte mit Conductor","Konsistenz über alle KI-gestützten Entwicklungssitzungen hinweg bewahren","Teammitglieder in ein bestehendes Conductor-Projekt aufnehmen","Verständnis des Verhältnisses zwischen Kontextartefakten","Entscheiden, wann der Kontext aktualisiert werden soll"],"pt":["Configuração de novos projetos com Conductor","Manutenção da consistência em todas as sessões de desenvolvimento assistidas por IA","Integração de novos membros da equipe a um projeto Conductor existente","Compreensão da relação entre artefatos de contexto","Decisão de quando atualizar o contexto"],"ru":["Настройка новых проектов с помощью Кондуктора","Поддержание последовательности на всех сессиях разработки с помощью ИИ","Ввод новых членов команды в существующий проект Кондуктора","Понимание отношения между артефактами контекста","Решение о том, когда обновлять контекст"],"ar":["تكوين مشاريع جديدة مع الموجه","الحفاظ على الاتساق في جميع جلسات التطوير التي تدعمها الذكاء الاصطناعي","إضافة أعضاء جدد في الفريق إلى مشروع الموجه القائم","فهم العلاقة بين مكونات السياق","القرار بشأن متى تحديث السياق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Conductor project setup","Limited to AI-assisted development sessions","Needs consistent team alignment and structured project documentation"],"zh":["需要 Conductor 项目设置","仅限 AI 辅助开发会话","需要团队的一致性和结构化项目文档"],"ja":["Conductor プロジェクトの設定が必要","AI アシスト開発セッションのみ","チームの整合性と構造化されたプロジェクト文書が必要"],"ko":["Conductor 프로젝트 설정이 필요","AI 지원 개발 세션만","팀의 일관성과 구조화된 프로젝트 문서가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración del proyecto Conductor","Limitado a sesiones de desarrollo asistidas por IA","Necesita una alineación coherente del equipo y documentación de proyecto estructurada"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Conductor","Limité aux sessions de développement assistées par IA","Nécessite une alignement cohérent de l''équipe et une documentation de projet structurée"],"de":["Benötigt Conductor-Projekteinrichtung","Begrenzt auf KI-gestützte Entwicklungssitzungen","Benötigt konsistente Teamausrichtung und strukturierte Projektdokumentation"],"pt":["Exige configuração do projeto Conductor","Limitado a sessões de desenvolvimento assistidas por IA","Necessita de alinhamento de equipe consistente e documentação de projeto estruturada"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Кондуктора","Ограничен сессиями разработки с помощью ИИ","Требует последовательного выравнивания команды и структурированной документации проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع الموجه","محدود بالجلسات التي تدعمها الذكاء الاصطناعي","يحتاج إلى انسجام الفريق الثابت وتوثيق المشروع المنظم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
