Salesforce-Leistung","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Anwendungen","Integration mit Apex und Lightning"],"pt":["Lightning Web Component com serviço Wire","Gatilho Apex em massa com padrão de manipulador","Apex Queueable para processamento em segundo plano","Reativo vinculação de dados com Lightning Data Service","Separação de preocupações com padrão de manipulador","Prevenção de recursividade com padrão de manipulador"],"ru":["Lightning Web Component с сервисом Wire","Массовый триггер Apex с шаблоном обработчика","Apex Queueable для фоновой обработки","Реактивное связывание данных с Lightning Data Service","Разделение проблем с шаблоном обработчика","Предотвращение рекурсии с шаблоном обработчика"],"ar":["مكونات الويب الخفيفة مع خدمة واير","محدد Apex بالجملة مع نمط المعالج","Apex Queueable لمعالجة الخلفية","ربط بيانات تفاعلي مع خدمة بيانات الويب الخفيفة","فصل الاهتمامات بنمط المعالج","منع التكرار بنمط المعالج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Salesforce开发","Lightning Web Component","Apex编程","Bulkified Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Salesforce性能优化","Wire Service","Salesforce平台"],"ja":["Salesforce開発","Lightning Web Component","Apexプログラミング","Bulkified Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Salesforceパフォーマンス最適化","Wire Service","Salesforceプラットフォーム"],"ko":["Salesforce 개발","Lightning Web Component","Apex 프로그래밍","Bulkified Apex Trigger","Queueable Apex","Salesforce 성능 최적화","Wire Service","Salesforce 플랫폼"],"es":["desarrollo de salesforce","patrones de lightning web component","apex trigger","servicio de cableado","optimización del rendimiento","aplicaciones personalizadas","integración con apex","salesforce development","lightning web component patterns"],"fr":["développement salesforce","modèles de composant web lightning","apex trigger","service de câblage","optimisation des performances","applications personnalisées","intégration avec apex","salesforce development","lightning web component patterns"],"de":["salesforce-entwicklung","muster von lightning-web-komponenten","apex-trigger","verbindungsdienst","optimierung der leistung","benutzerdefinierte anwendungen","integration mit apex","salesforce development","lightning web component muster"],"pt":["desenvolvimento salesforce","lightning web component","apex","wire service","gatilho apex","queueable apex","desenvolvimento de aplicações","plataforma salesforce","tecnologias de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["разработка salesforce","lightning web component","apex","сервис wire","триггер apex","queueable apex","разработка приложений","платформа salesforce","технологии разработки"],"ar":["تطوير سيلز فورس","مكونات الويب الخفيفة","apex","خدمة واير","محدد apex","queueable apex","تطوير التطبيقات","منصة سيلز فورس","تقنيات التطوير"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"salesforce-development","description":"Expert patterns for Salesforce platform development including Lightning Web Components (LWC), Apex triggers and classes, REST/Bulk APIs, Connected Apps, and Salesforce DX with scratch orgs and 2nd generation packages (2GP). Use when: salesforce, sfdc, apex, lwc, lightning web components.","bodyPreview":"# Salesforce Development\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Lightning Web Component with Wire Service\n\nUse @wire decorator for reactive data binding with Lightning Data Service\nor Apex methods. @wire fits LWC''s reactive architecture and enables\nSalesforce performance optimizations.\n\n\n### Bulkified Apex Trigger with Handler Pattern\n\nApex triggers must be bulkified to handle 200+ records per transaction.\nUse handler pattern for separation of concerns, testability, and\nrecursion prevention.\n\n\n### Queueable Apex for","body":"# Salesforce Development\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Lightning Web Component with Wire Service\n\nUse @wire decorator for reactive data binding with Lightning Data Service\nor Apex methods. @wire fits LWC''s reactive architecture and enables\nSalesforce performance optimizations.\n\n\n### Bulkified Apex Trigger with Handler Pattern\n\nApex triggers must be bulkified to handle 200+ records per transaction.\nUse handler pattern for separation of concerns, testability, and\nrecursion prevention.\n\n\n### Queueable Apex for Async Processing\n\nUse Queueable Apex for async processing with support for non-primitive\ntypes, monitoring via AsyncApexJob, and job chaining. Limit: 50 jobs\nper transaction, 1 child job when chaining.\n\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ SOQL Inside Loops\n\n### ❌ DML Inside Loops\n\n### ❌ Hardcoding IDs\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | medium | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | high | See docs |\n| Issue | critical | See docs |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:14:06.425Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Integration Agents needing advanced Salesforce customization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Salesforce定制功能的云集成代理。","ja":"高度なSalesforceカスタマイズ機能を必要とするクラウド統合エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Salesforce 사용자 정의 기능이 필요한 클라우드 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de integración en la nube que necesitan capacidades de personalización avanzadas de Salesforce.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intégration cloud nécessitant des capacités de personnalisation avancées de Salesforce.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Integration-Agents, die erweiterte Anpassungsmöglichkeiten für Salesforce benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Integração em Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades de personalização avançadas do Salesforce.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции в облаке, требующих расширенных возможностей настройки Salesforce.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التكامل السحابي التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات مخصصة متقدمة من Salesforce."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Lightning Web Components with Wire Service for reactive data binding, utilize Bulkified Apex Triggers with Handler Pattern for efficient record handling, and implement Queueable Apex for asynchronous processing, all while optimizing Salesforce performance.","zh":"赋予代理使用Lightning Web Components与Wire Service进行反应式数据绑定、使用批量化Apex触发器与处理程序模式进行高效记录处理，以及实现Queueable Apex进行异步处理，同时优化Salesforce性能。","ja":"Lightning Web ComponentsとWire Serviceを使用してリアクティブなデータバインディングを実現し、バルク化Apexトリガーとハンドラーパターンを使用して効率的なレコード処理を行い、Queueable Apexを使用して非同期処理を実現し、同時にSalesforceのパフォーマンスを最適化します。","ko":"Lightning Web Components와 Wire Service를 사용하여 반응형 데이터 바인딩을 가능하게 하고, 벌크화된 Apex 트리거와 핸들러 패턴을 사용하여 효율적인 레코드 처리를 수행하며, Queueable Apex를 사용하여 비동기 처리를 구현하며, 동시에 Salesforce 성능을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar los componentes web de Lightning con el servicio Wire para enlaces de datos reactivos, utilizar desencadenadores Apex bulkificados con patrón de controlador para un manejo de registros eficiente y implementar Queueable Apex para procesamiento asíncrono, todo mientras se optimiza el rendimiento de Salesforce.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les composants Web Lightning avec le service Wire pour un binding de données réactif, d''utiliser des déclencheurs Apex bulkifiés avec un motif de gestionnaire pour une gestion de dossiers efficace et de mettre en œuvre Queueable Apex pour un traitement asynchrone, le tout en optimisant les performances de Salesforce.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Lightning-Web-Komponenten mit Wire-Service für reaktive Datenbindung zu nutzen, Bulkified Apex-Trigger mit Handler-Muster für effizientes Datensatz-Handling zu verwenden und Queueable Apex für asynchrone Verarbeitung zu implementieren, all dies bei gleichzeitiger Optimierung der Salesforce-Leistung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar os Componentes Web Lightning com o Serviço Wire para vinculação de dados reativa, utilizar Gatilhos Apex em massa com o padrão Handler para manipulação eficiente de registros e implementar Queueable Apex para processamento assíncrono, tudo isso otimizando o desempenho do Salesforce.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать компоненты Lightning Web с сервисом Wire для реактивного связывания данных, использовать триггеры Apex в пакетном режиме с шаблоном Handler для эффективной обработки записей и реализовывать Queueable Apex для асинхронной обработки, все это при оптимизации производительности Salesforce.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من الاستفادة من مكونات الويب Lightning مع خدمة الوイヤر للربط التفاعلي للبيانات، واستخدام أجهزة Apex المجمعة مع نمط المعالج لتعامل السجلات بكفاءة، وتنفيذ Queueable Apex للمعالجة غير المتزامنة، مع تحسين أداء Salesforce."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom Lightning Web Components with @wire decorator","Developing bulkified Apex triggers with handler pattern for large-scale data processing","Implementing Queueable Apex for asynchronous tasks and workflow automation"],"zh":["使用@wire装饰器构建自定义Lightning Web Components","开发批量化Apex触发器与处理程序模式用于大规模数据处理","实现Queueable Apex用于异步任务和工作流自动化"],"ja":["@wireデコレータを使用してカスタムLightning Web Componentsを構築する","バルク化Apexトリガーとハンドラーパターンを使用して大規模なデータ処理を開発する","Queueable Apexを使用して非同期タスクとワークフローオートメーションを実現する"],"ko":["@wire 데코레이터를 사용하여 사용자 지정 Lightning Web Components를 구축하는 것","벌크화된 Apex 트리거와 핸들러 패턴을 사용하여 대규모 데이터 처리를 개발하는 것","Queueable Apex를 사용하여 비동기 작업과 워크플로 자동화를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Creación de componentes web personalizados de Lightning con decorador @wire","Desarrollo de desencadenadores Apex bulkificados con patrón de controlador para el procesamiento de datos a gran escala","Implementación de Queueable Apex para tareas asíncronas y automatización de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Création de composants Web Lightning personnalisés avec décorateur @wire","Développement de déclencheurs Apex bulkifiés avec motif de gestionnaire pour le traitement de données à grande échelle","Mise en œuvre de Queueable Apex pour les tâches asynchrones et l''automatisation des flux de travail"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Lightning-Web-Komponenten mit @wire-Decorator","Entwicklung bulkifizierter Apex-Trigger mit Handler-Muster für groß angelegte Datenverarbeitung","Implementierung von Queueable Apex für asynchrone Aufgaben und Workflow-Automatisierung"],"pt":["Construir componentes personalizados Lightning Web com decorador @wire","Desenvolver gatilhos Apex em massa com padrão Handler para processamento de dados em grande escala","Implementar Queueable Apex para tarefas assíncronas e automação de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских компонентов Lightning Web с декоратором @wire","Разработка триггеров Apex в пакетном режиме с шаблоном Handler для обработки больших объемов данных","Реализация Queueable Apex для асинхронных задач и автоматизации рабочего процесса"],"ar":["بناء مكونات الويب Lightning المخصصة مع مُزين @wire","تطوير أجهزة Apex المجمعة بنمط المعالج لمعالجة البيانات على نطاق واسع","تنفيذ Queueable Apex للمهام غير المتزامنة وتوضيح سير عمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Salesforce Developer Edition or higher","Apex programming skills necessary","Limited to Salesforce ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Salesforce开发者版或更高版本","需要Apex编程技能","仅限于Salesforce生态系统"],"ja":["Salesforce Developer Edition以上が必要","Apexプログラミングスキルが必要","Salesforceエコシステムに限定される"],"ko":["Salesforce 개발자 에디션 또는更 높은 버전이 필요","Apex 프로그래밍 기술이 필요","Salesforce 생태계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere edición de desarrollador de Salesforce o superior","Se requieren habilidades de programación Apex","Limitado al ecosistema de Salesforce"],"fr":["Nécessite l''édition développeur de Salesforce ou supérieure","Des compétences en programmation Apex sont nécessaires","Limité à l''écosystème Salesforce"],"de":["Benötigt Salesforce-Entwickleredition oder höher","Apex-Programmierkenntnisse erforderlich","Begrenzt auf das Salesforce-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Exige Edição de Desenvolvedor do Salesforce ou superior","Habilidades de programação Apex necessárias","Limitado ao ecossistema do Salesforce"],"ru":["Требует издания Salesforce для разработчиков или выше","Необходимы навыки программирования Apex","Ограничен экосистемой Salesforce"],"ar":["يتطلب إصدار مطور Salesforce أو أعلى","مهارات برمجة Apex ضرورية","محدود بنظام البيئة Salesforce"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
