lateforme"],"de":["Deklaration von Schlüsseln in plugin.xml oder registry.properties","Cloud-Registrierungsaktualisierungen für JetBrains-IDEs","Anpassung der Funktionalität der Plattform","Integration mit der IntelliJ-API","Kompatibilität mit IntelliJ IDEA und der Plattform"],"pt":["Definição de chaves de registro","Atualizações de registro remoto","Integração com plugin.xml e registry.properties","Suporte a notificações em nuvem","Criação de plugins personalizados"],"ru":["Определение ключей реестра","Удаленные обновления реестра","Интеграция с plugin.xml и registry.properties","Поддержка уведомлений в облаке","Создание пользовательских плагинов"],"ar":["تعريف مفاتيح السجل","تحديثات سجل عن بُعد","التكامل مع plugin.xml و registry.properties","دعم الإشعارات السحابية","إنشاء البرامج المساعدة المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["IntelliJ 注册表 API","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ Platform","注册表键","云注册表","plugin.xml","registry.properties"],"ja":["IntelliJ レジストリ API","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ Platform","レジストリ キー","クラウド レジストリ","plugin.xml","registry.properties"],"ko":["IntelliJ 레지스트리 API","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ 플랫폼","레지스트리 키","클라우드 레지스트리","plugin.xml","registry.properties"],"es":["Registro de IntelliJ","IntelliJ IDEA","Plataforma IntelliJ","API de IntelliJ","Desarrollo de plugins","Personalización de la plataforma","Actualizaciones de registro en la nube","JetBrains IDEs"],"fr":["Registre IntelliJ","IntelliJ IDEA","Plateforme IntelliJ","API IntelliJ","Développement de plugins","Personnalisation de la plateforme","Mises à jour de registre cloud","IDE JetBrains"],"de":["IntelliJ-Registrierung","IntelliJ IDEA","IntelliJ-Plattform","IntelliJ-API","Plugin-Entwicklung","Anpassung der Plattform","Cloud-Registrierungsaktualisierungen","JetBrains-IDEs"],"pt":["registro intellij","api de registro","plugins personalizados","produtividade","desenvolvimento de plugins","intellij platform"],"ru":["реестр intellij","api реестра","пользовательские плагины","производительность","разработка плагинов","интедж платформа"],"ar":["سجل إنتيج","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات السجل","البرامج المساعدة المخصصة","الإنتاجية","تطوير البرامج المساعدة","منصة إنتيج"]}},"owner":"JetBrains","repo":"intellij-community","repoPath":"JetBrains/intellij-community","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"registry","description":"Guidelines for using the IntelliJ Registry API. Use when working with registry keys or feature flags.","bodyPreview":"# Working with Registry\n\nGuidelines for using the IntelliJ Registry API.\n\n## Documentation\n\n- **Defining Registry Keys**: [Registry.md](../docs/IntelliJ-Platform/4_man/Registry.md) - How to declare keys in `plugin.xml` or `registry.properties`\n- **Cloud Registry**: [Cloud Registry and Notifications.md](../docs/IntelliJ-Platform/4_man/Cloud%20Registry%20and%20Notifications.md) - Remote registry updates for JetBrains IDEs\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Defining a Registry Key\n\nAlways prefer declaring in","body":"# Working with Registry\n\nGuidelines for using the IntelliJ Registry API.\n\n## Documentation\n\n- **Defining Registry Keys**: [Registry.md](../docs/IntelliJ-Platform/4_man/Registry.md) - How to declare keys in `plugin.xml` or `registry.properties`\n- **Cloud Registry**: [Cloud Registry and Notifications.md](../docs/IntelliJ-Platform/4_man/Cloud%20Registry%20and%20Notifications.md) - Remote registry updates for JetBrains IDEs\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Defining a Registry Key\n\nAlways prefer declaring in `plugin.xml` (not `registry.properties`):\n\n```xml\n<registryKey key=\"my.feature.enabled\"\n             defaultValue=\"true\"\n             description=\"Enables my feature\"\n             restartRequired=\"false\"/>\n```\n\nTo override in a dependent plugin:\n```xml\n<registryKey key=\"my.feature.enabled\"\n             defaultValue=\"false\"\n             description=\"Enables my feature\"\n             restartRequired=\"false\"\n             overrides=\"true\"/>\n```\n\n### Using Registry.is() - Avoid Redundant Defaults\n\nDon''t use default value when application is fully loaded - the default comes from registry extension:\n\n```kotlin\n// Bad - redundant default\nRegistry.`is`(\"my.key\", false)\n\n// Good - default from extension\nRegistry.`is`(\"my.key\")\n```\n\n### Early Startup: Registry.is() with Default Value\n\nWhen code may run before `COMPONENTS_LOADED` state (e.g., during EULA dialog, splash screen),\nyou MUST use `Registry.is(key, defaultValue)` with an explicit default:\n\n```kotlin\n// Required for early startup code\nRegistry.`is`(\"my.key\", false)  // default must match registry.properties\n```\n\n**How to find the default value:**\n1. Search in `community/platform/util/resources/misc/registry.properties`\n2. Or check the `<registryKey>` declaration in `plugin.xml`\n\n**Why:** `Registry.is(key)` without default throws an exception if called before\n`LoadingState.COMPONENTS_LOADED`. The safe overload returns the provided default\nwhen Registry is not yet initialized.\n\n### Override via Command Line\n\nFor testing or run configurations:\n```\n-Dmy.registry.key=value\n```\n\n## Registry in Tests\n\nUse `@RegistryKey` annotation instead of `Registry.get().setValue()`:\n\n```kotlin\n@Test\n@RegistryKey(key = \"my.registry.key\", value = \"true\")\nfun testWithRegistryEnabled() { ... }\n```\n\nSee [writing-tests.md](../writing-tests/SKILL.md#registry-values-in-tests) for more test patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:14:26.745Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for IntelliJ Platform Agents requiring seamless integration with the IntelliJ Registry API for efficient plugin development.","zh":"适用于需要与IntelliJ Registry API无缝集成以实现高效插件开发的IntelliJ Platform Agents。","ja":"IntelliJ Registry APIとのシームレスな統合を必要とするIntelliJ Platform Agentsに最適です。","ko":"인텔리J 레지스트리 API와의無縫統合이 필요한 인텔리J 플랫폼 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de la plataforma IntelliJ que requieren una integración sin problemas con la API del Registro de IntelliJ para un desarrollo de plugins eficiente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de la plateforme IntelliJ nécessitant une intégration transparente avec l''API du Registre IntelliJ pour un développement de plugins efficace.","de":"Ideal für IntelliJ-Plattform-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit der IntelliJ-Registrierungs-API für eine effiziente Plug-in-Entwicklung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal for IntelliJ Platform Agents requiring seamless integration with the IntelliJ Registry API for efficient plugin development.","ru":"Ideal for IntelliJ Platform Agents requiring seamless integration with the IntelliJ Registry API for efficient plugin development.","ar":"Ideal for IntelliJ Platform Agents requiring seamless integration with the IntelliJ Registry API for efficient plugin development."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to declare registry keys in plugin.xml or registry.properties, facilitating remote registry updates for JetBrains IDEs through Cloud Registry and Notifications, utilizing the IntelliJ Registry API for streamlined plugin configuration.","zh":"赋予代理声明plugin.xml或registry.properties中的注册表键，通过Cloud Registry和Notifications实现远程注册表更新，利用IntelliJ Registry API简化插件配置。","ja":"エージェントがplugin.xmlまたはregistry.propertiesにレジストリキーを宣言できるようにし、Cloud RegistryとNotificationsを介してリモートレジストリ更新を容易にし、IntelliJ Registry APIを使用してプラグイン構成を簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 plugin.xml 또는 registry.properties에 레지스트리 키를 선언할 수 있도록 하여 클라우드 레지스트리 및 알림을 통해 원격 레지스트리 업데이트를 가능하게 하고 인텔리J 레지스트리 API를 사용하여 플러그인 구성을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a declarar claves de registro en plugin.xml o registry.properties, facilitando actualizaciones de registro remoto para los IDE de JetBrains a través de Cloud Registry y Notificaciones, utilizando la API del Registro de IntelliJ para una configuración de plugins optimizada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclarer des clés de registre dans plugin.xml ou registry.properties, facilitant les mises à jour de registre à distance pour les IDE JetBrains via Cloud Registry et Notifications, en utilisant l''API du Registre IntelliJ pour une configuration de plugins rationalisée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Registrierungsschlüssel in plugin.xml oder registry.properties zu deklarieren, erleichtert Remote-Registrierungsaktualisierungen für JetBrains-IDEs über Cloud-Registrierung und Benachrichtigungen, indem die IntelliJ-Registrierungs-API für eine optimierte Plug-in-Konfiguration verwendet wird.","pt":"Empowers agents to declare registry keys in plugin.xml or registry.properties, facilitating remote registry updates for JetBrains IDEs through Cloud Registry and Notifications, utilizing the IntelliJ Registry API for streamlined plugin configuration.","ru":"Empowers agents to declare registry keys in plugin.xml or registry.properties, facilitating remote registry updates for JetBrains IDEs through Cloud Registry and Notifications, utilizing the IntelliJ Registry API for streamlined plugin configuration.","ar":"Empowers agents to declare registry keys in plugin.xml or registry.properties, facilitating remote registry updates for JetBrains IDEs through Cloud Registry and Notifications, utilizing the IntelliJ Registry API for streamlined plugin configuration."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining registry keys for plugin configuration","Implementing cloud registry updates for remote notifications","Utilizing registry properties for plugin development"],"zh":["定义注册表键以用于插件配置","实现云注册表更新以用于远程通知","利用注册表属性以用于插件开发"],"ja":["プラグイン構成に使用するレジストリキーの定義","リモート通知に使用するクラウドレジストリ更新の実装","プラグイン開発に使用するレジストリプロパティの利用"],"ko":["플러그인 구성에 사용되는 레지스트리 키의 정의","원격 알림에 사용되는 클라우드 레지스트리 업데이트의 구현","플러그인 개발에 사용되는 레지스트리 속성의 활용"],"es":["Definir claves de registro para la configuración de plugins","Implementar actualizaciones de registro en la nube para notificaciones remotas","Utilizar propiedades de registro para el desarrollo de plugins"],"fr":["Définir des clés de registre pour la configuration de plugins","Mettre en œuvre des mises à jour de registre dans le cloud pour les notifications à distance","Utiliser des propriétés de registre pour le développement de plugins"],"de":["Registrierungsschlüssel für die Plug-in-Konfiguration definieren","Cloud-Registrierungsaktualisierungen für Remote-Benachrichtigungen implementieren","Registrierungseigenschaften für die Plug-in-Entwicklung nutzen"],"pt":["Defining registry keys for plugin configuration","Implementing cloud registry updates for remote notifications","Utilizing registry properties for plugin development"],"ru":["Defining registry keys for plugin configuration","Implementing cloud registry updates for remote notifications","Utilizing registry properties for plugin development"],"ar":["Defining registry keys for plugin configuration","Implementing cloud registry updates for remote notifications","Utilizing registry properties for plugin development"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires IntelliJ Platform or IntelliJ IDEA","Plugin development knowledge necessary","Specific to JetBrains IDEs"],"zh":["需要IntelliJ Platform或IntelliJ IDEA","需要插件开发知识","仅适用于JetBrains IDEs"],"ja":["IntelliJ PlatformまたはIntelliJ IDEAが必要","プラグイン開発の知識が必要","JetBrains IDEsのみに対応"],"ko":["인텔리J 플랫폼 또는 인텔리J 아이디어가 필요","플러그인 개발 지식이 필요","제트브레인즈 IDE만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la plataforma IntelliJ o IntelliJ IDEA","Conocimientos de desarrollo de plugins necesarios","Específico para los IDE de JetBrains"],"fr":["Nécessite la plateforme IntelliJ ou IntelliJ IDEA","Connaissances en développement de plugins nécessaires","Spécifique aux IDE JetBrains"],"de":["Benötigt die IntelliJ-Plattform oder IntelliJ IDEA","Plug-in-Entwicklungskenntnisse erforderlich","Spezifisch für JetBrains-IDEs"],"pt":["Requires IntelliJ Platform or IntelliJ IDEA","Plugin development knowledge necessary","Specific to JetBrains IDEs"],"ru":["Requires IntelliJ Platform or IntelliJ IDEA","Plugin development knowledge necessary","Specific to JetBrains IDEs"],"ar":["Requires IntelliJ Platform or IntelliJ IDEA","Plugin development knowledge necessary","Specific to JetBrains IDEs"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('GELLIFY/acme-app/better-auth-security-best-practices', 'community', 'GELLIFY', 'acme-app', 'GELLIFY/acme-app', 'better-auth-security-best-practices', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:14:28.568Z', NULL, '{"id":"GELLIFY/acme-app/better-auth-security-best-practices","name":"better-auth-security-best-practices","description":{"zh":"Better Auth 的安全最佳实践提供了秘密管理和安全配置的指导，帮助开发者打造更安全的全栈应用","ja":"Better Auth のセキュリティベストプラクティスでは、シークレット管理とセキュアな設定についてのガイドを提供し、開発者がより安全なフルスタックアプリケーションを構築できるように支援します","ko":"Better Auth의 보안 최선의 방법은 비밀 관리와 보안 구성에 대한 지침을 제공하여 개발자가 더 안전한 풀스택 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"Better Auth proporciona una forma segura de gestionar la autenticación, incluyendo la gestión de secretos y la configuración de tokens de sesión","fr":"Better Auth offre une façon sécurisée de gérer l''authentification, y compris la gestion des secrets et la configuration des jetons de session","de":"Better Auth bietet eine sichere Möglichkeit, die Authentifizierung zu verwalten, einschließlich Secret-Management und Konfiguration von Sitzungstoken","pt":"Melhores práticas de segurança de autenticação com o Better Auth. Aprenda a configurar o segredo e gerenciar sessões de forma segura.","ru":"Лучшие практики безопасности аутентификации с помощью Better Auth. Узнайте, как настроить секрет и управлять сессиями безопасно.","ar":"أفضل ممارسات أمن المصادقة مع Better Auth. تعلم كيفية إعداد السر وتحكم الجلسات بأمان.","en":"This is template for GELLIFY full-stack app configured to use the best integrations for our standard projects."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Better Auth 安全最佳实践","ja":"Better Auth セキュリティベストプラクティス","ko":"Better Auth 보안 최선의 방법","es":"Mejores prácticas de seguridad de autenticación","fr":"Meilleures pratiques de sécurité d''authentification","de":"Best Practices für Authentifizierungssicherheit","pt":"Melhores Práticas de Segurança de Autenticação","ru":"Лучшие практики безопасности аутентификации","ar":"أفضل ممارسات أمن المصادقة","en":"better-auth-security-best-practices"},"description":{"zh":"Better Auth 的安全最佳实践提供了秘密管理和安全配置的指导，帮助开发者打造更安全的全栈应用","ja":"Better Auth のセキュリティベストプラクティスでは、シークレット管理とセキュアな設定についてのガイドを提供し、開発者がより安全なフルスタックアプリケーションを構築できるように支援します","ko":"Better Auth의 보안 최선의 방법은 비밀 관리와 보안 구성에 대한 지침을 제공하여 개발자가 더 안전한 풀스택 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 도와줍니다","es":"Better Auth proporciona una forma segura de gestionar la autenticación, incluyendo la gestión de secretos y la configuración de tokens de sesión","fr":"Better Auth offre une façon sécurisée de gérer l''authentification, y compris la gestion des secrets et la configuration des jetons de session","de":"Better Auth bietet eine sichere Möglichkeit, die Authentifizierung zu verwalten, einschließlich Secret-Management und Konfiguration von Sitzungstoken","pt":"Melhores práticas de segurança de autenticação com o Better Auth. Aprenda a configurar o segredo e gerenciar sessões de forma segura.","ru":"Лучшие практики безопасности аутентификации с помощью Better Auth. Узнайте, как настроить секрет и управлять сессиями безопасно.","ar":"أفضل ممارسات أمن المصادقة مع Better Auth. تعلم كيفية إعداد السر وتحكم الجلسات بأمان.","en":"This is template for GELLIFY full-stack app configured to use the best integrations for our standard projects."},"definition":{"en":"This is template for GELLIFY full-stack app configured to use the best integrations for our standard projects."},"features":{"zh":["秘密管理","安全配置","会话令牌签名","敏感数据加密","安全COOKIE生成"],"ja":["シークレット管理","セキュアな設定","セッショントークンの署名","敏感データの暗号化","セキュアなCOOKIEの生成"],"ko":["비밀 관리","보안 구성","세션 토큰 서명","민감한 데이터 암호화","보안 쿠키 생성"],"es":["Gestión de secretos","Configuración de tokens de sesión","Gestión de cookies seguras","Integración con entornos de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con variables de entorno"],"fr":["Gestion des secrets","Configuration des jetons de session","Gestion de cookies sécurisées","Intégration avec les environnements de développement","Compatibilité avec les variables d''environnement"],"de":["Secret-Management","Konfiguration von Sitzungstoken","Verwaltung von sicheren Cookies","Integration mit Entwicklungsumgebungen","Kompatibilität mit Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["Configuração de segredo","Gerenciamento de sessões","Assinatura de tokens de sessão","Criação de cookies seguros","Integração com ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Настройка секрета","Управление сессиями","Подписание токенов сессий","Создание безопасных cookie","Интеграция с средами разработки"],"ar":["إعداد السر","تحكم الجلسات","التوقيع على رموز الجلسات","إنشاء كعكات آمنة","التكامل مع بيئات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Better Auth","安全最佳实践","秘密管理","安全配置","全栈应用安全","会话令牌签名","敏感数据加密"],"ja":["Better Auth","セキュリティベストプラクティス","シークレット管理","セキュアな設定","フルスタックアプリケーションセキュリティ","セッショントークンの署名","敏感データの暗号化"],"ko":["Better Auth","보안 최선의 방법","비밀 관리","보안 구성","풀스택 애플리케이션 보안","세션 토큰 서명","민감한 데이터 암호화"],"es":["autenticación segura","gestión de secretos","tokens de sesión","cookies seguras","desarrollo de aplicaciones","seguridad de autenticación","mejores prácticas de seguridad","autenticación en línea"],"fr":["authentification sécurisée","gestion des secrets","jetons de session","cookies sécurisées","développement d''applications","sécurité d''authentification","meilleures pratiques de sécurité","authentification en ligne"],"de":["sichere Authentifizierung","Secret-Management","Sitzungstoken","sichere Cookies","Anwendungsentwicklung","Authentifizierungssicherheit","beste Sicherheitspraktiken","Online-Authentifizierung"],"pt":["segurança de autenticação","melhores práticas de segurança","autenticação de desenvolvedores","gerenciamento de sessões","segredo de autenticação","desenvolvimento de aplicações seguras"],"ru":["безопасность аутентификации","лучшие практики безопасности","аутентификация разработчиков","управление сессиями","секрет аутентификации","разработка безопасных приложений"],"ar":["أمن المصادقة","أفضل ممارسات الأمن","مصادقة المطورين","تحكم الجلسات","سر المصادقة","تطوير تطبيقات آمنة"]}},"owner":"GELLIFY","repo":"acme-app","repoPath":"GELLIFY/acme-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"better-auth-security-best-practices","description":"This skill provides guidance for implementing security features that span across Better Auth, including rate limiting, CSRF protection, session security, trusted origins, secret management, OAuth security, IP tracking, and security auditing. These topics are not covered in individual plugin skills.","bodyPreview":"## Secret Management\n\nThe auth secret is the foundation of Better Auth''s security. It''s used for signing session tokens, encrypting sensitive data, and generating secure cookies.\n\n### Configuring the Secret\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  secret: process.env.BETTER_AUTH_SECRET, // or via `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` env\n});\n```\n\nBetter Auth looks for secrets in this order:\n1. `options.secret` in your config\n2. `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` environment variable","body":"## Secret Management\n\nThe auth secret is the foundation of Better Auth''s security. It''s used for signing session tokens, encrypting sensitive data, and generating secure cookies.\n\n### Configuring the Secret\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  secret: process.env.BETTER_AUTH_SECRET, // or via `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` env\n});\n```\n\nBetter Auth looks for secrets in this order:\n1. `options.secret` in your config\n2. `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` environment variable\n3. `AUTH_SECRET` environment variable\n\n### Secret Requirements\n\nBetter Auth validates your secret and will:\n- **Reject** default/placeholder secrets in production\n- **Warn** if the secret is shorter than 32 characters\n- **Warn** if entropy is below 120 bits\n\nGenerate a secure secret:\n\n```bash\nopenssl rand -base64 32\n```\n\n**Important**: Never commit secrets to version control. Use environment variables or a secrets manager.\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\nRate limiting protects your authentication endpoints from brute-force attacks and abuse.\nBy default, rate limiting is enabled in production but disabled in development. To explicitly enable it, set `rateLimit.enabled` to `true` in your auth config.\nBetter Auth applies rate limiting to all endpoints by default.\n\nEach plugin can optionally have it''s own configuration to adjust rate-limit rules for a given endpoint.\n\n### Default Configuration\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  rateLimit: {\n    enabled: true, // Default: true in production\n    window: 10, // Time window in seconds (default: 10)\n    max: 100, // Max requests per window (default: 100)\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Storage Options\n\nConfigure where rate limit counters are stored:\n\n```ts\nrateLimit: {\n  storage: \"database\", // Options: \"memory\", \"database\", \"secondary-storage\"\n}\n```\n\n- **`memory`**: Fast, but resets on server restart (default when no secondary storage)\n- **`database`**: Persistent, but adds database load\n- **`secondary-storage`**: Uses configured secondary storage like Redis (default when available)\n\n**Note**: It is not recommended to use `memory` especially on serverless platforms.\n\n### Custom Storage\n\nImplement your own rate limit storage:\n\n```ts\nrateLimit: {\n  customStorage: {\n    get: async (key) => {\n      // Return { count: number, expiresAt: number } or null\n    },\n    set: async (key, data) => {\n      // Store the rate limit data\n    },\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Per-Endpoint Rules\n\nBetter Auth applies stricter limits to sensitive endpoints by default:\n- `/sign-in`, `/sign-up`, `/change-password`, `/change-email`: 3 requests per 10 seconds\n\nOverride or customize rules for specific paths:\n\n```ts\nrateLimit: {\n  customRules: {\n    \"/api/auth/sign-in/email\": {\n      window: 60, // 1 minute window\n      max: 5, // 5 attempts\n    },\n    \"/api/auth/some-safe-endpoint\": false, // Disable rate limiting\n  },\n}\n```\n\n## CSRF Protection\n\nBetter Auth implements multiple layers of CSRF protection to prevent cross-site request forgery attacks.\n\n### How CSRF Protection Works\n\n1. **Origin Header Validation**: When cookies are present, the `Origin` or `Referer` header must match a trusted origin\n2. **Fetch Metadata**: Uses `Sec-Fetch-Site`, `Sec-Fetch-Mode`, and `Sec-Fetch-Dest` headers to detect cross-site requests\n3. **First-Login Protection**: Even without cookies, validates origin when Fetch Metadata indicates a cross-site navigation\n\n### Configuration\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  advanced: {\n    disableCSRFCheck: false, // Default: false (keep enabled)\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Warning**: Only disable CSRF protection for testing or if you have an alternative CSRF mechanism in place.\n\n### Fetch Metadata Blocking\n\nBetter Auth automatically blocks requests where:\n- `Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-site` AND\n- `Sec-Fetch-Mode: navigate` AND\n- `Sec-Fetch-Dest: document`\n\nThis prevents form-based CSRF attacks even on first login when no session cookie exists.\n\n## Trusted Origins\n\nTrusted origins control which domains can make authenticated requests to your Better Auth instance. This protects against open redirect attacks and cross-origin abuse.\n\n### Configuring Trusted Origins\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  baseURL: \"https://api.example.com\",\n  trustedOrigins: [\n    \"https://app.example.com\",\n    \"https://admin.example.com\",\n  ],\n});\n```\n\n**Note**: The `baseURL` origin is automatically trusted.\n\n### Environment Variable\n\nSet trusted origins via environment variable (comma-separated):\n\n```bash\nBETTER_AUTH_TRUSTED_ORIGINS=https://app.example.com,https://admin.example.com\n```\n\n### Wildcard Patterns\n\nSupport for subdomain wildcards:\n\n```ts\ntrustedOrigins: [\n  \"*.example.com\", // Matches any subdomain\n  \"https://*.example.com\", // Protocol-specific wildcard\n  \"exp://192.168.*.*:*/*\", // Custom schemes (e.g., Expo)\n]\n```\n\n### Dynamic Trusted Origins\n\nCompute trusted origins based on the request:\n\n```ts\ntrustedOrigins: async (request) => {\n  // Validate against database, header, etc.\n  const tenant = getTenantFromRequest(request);\n  return [`https://${tenant}.myapp.com`];\n}\n```\n\n### What Gets Validated\n\nBetter Auth validates these URL parameters against trusted origins:\n- `callbackURL` - Where to redirect after authentication\n- `redirectTo` - General redirect parameter\n- `errorCallbackURL` - Where to redirect on errors\n- `newUserCallbackURL` - Where to redirect new users\n- `origin` - Request origin header\n- and more... \n\nInvalid URLs receive a 403 Forbidden response.\n\n## Session Security\n\nSessions control how long users stay authenticated and how session data is secured.\n\n### Session Expiration\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  session: {\n    expiresIn: 60 * 60 * 24 * 7, // 7 days (default)\n    updateAge: 60 * 60 * 24, // Refresh session every 24 hours (default)\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Fresh Sessions for Sensitive Actions\n\nThe `freshAge` setting defines how recently a user must have authenticated to perform sensitive operations:\n\n```ts\nsession: {\n  freshAge: 60 * 60 * 24, // 24 hours (default)\n}\n```\n\nUse this to require re-authentication for actions like changing passwords or viewing sensitive data.\n\n### Session Caching Strategies\n\nCache session data in cookies to reduce database queries:\n\n```ts\nsession: {\n  cookieCache: {\n    enabled: true,\n    maxAge: 60 * 5, // 5 minutes\n    strategy: \"compact\", // Options: \"compact\", \"jwt\", \"jwe\"\n  },\n}\n```\n\n- **`compact`**: Base64url + HMAC-SHA256 (smallest, signed)\n- **`jwt`**: HS256 JWT (standard, signed)\n- **`jwe`**: A256CBC-HS512 encrypted (largest, encrypted)\n\n**Note**: Use `jwe` strategy when session data contains sensitive information that shouldn''t be readable client-side.\n\n\n## Cookie Security\n\nBetter Auth uses secure cookie defaults but allows customization for specific deployment scenarios.\n\n### Default Cookie Settings\n\n- **`secure`**: `true` when baseURL uses HTTPS or in production\n- **`sameSite`**: `\"lax\"` (prevents CSRF while allowing normal navigation)\n- **`httpOnly`**: `true` (prevents JavaScript access)\n- **`path`**: `\"/\"` (available site-wide)\n- **Prefix**: `__Secure-` when secure is enabled\n\n### Custom Cookie Configuration\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  advanced: {\n    useSecureCookies: true, // Force secure cookies\n    cookiePrefix: \"myapp\", // Custom prefix (default: \"better-auth\")\n    defaultCookieAttributes: {\n      sameSite: \"strict\", // Stricter CSRF protection\n      path: \"/auth\", // Limit cookie scope\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Per-Cookie Configuration\n\nCustomize specific cookies:\n\n```ts\nadvanced: {\n  cookies: {\n    session_token: {\n      name: \"auth-session\",\n      attributes: {\n        sameSite: \"strict\",\n      },\n    },\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Cross-Subdomain Cookies\n\nShare authentication across subdomains:\n\n```ts\nadvanced: {\n  crossSubDomainCookies: {\n    enabled: true,\n    domain: \".example.com\", // Note the leading dot\n    additionalCookies: [\"session_token\", \"session_data\"],\n  },\n}\n```\n\n**Security Note**: Cross-subdomain cookies expand the attack surface. Only enable if you need authentication sharing and trust all subdomains.\n\n## OAuth / Social Provider Security\n\nWhen using social login providers, Better Auth implements industry-standard security measures.\n\n### PKCE (Proof Key for Code Exchange)\n\nBetter Auth automatically uses PKCE for all OAuth flows:\n\n1. Generates a 128-character random `code_verifier`\n2. Creates a `code_challenge` using S256 (SHA-256)\n3. Sends `code_challenge_method: \"S256\"` in the authorization URL\n4. Validates the code exchange with the original verifier\n\nThis prevents authorization code interception attacks.\n\n### State Parameter Security\n\nThe state parameter prevents CSRF attacks on OAuth callbacks:\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  account: {\n    storeStateStrategy: \"cookie\", // Options: \"cookie\" (default), \"database\"\n  },\n});\n```\n\nState tokens:\n- Are 32-character random strings\n- Expire after 10 minutes\n- Contain callback URLs and PKCE verifier (encrypted)\n\n### Encrypting OAuth Tokens\n\nEncrypt stored access and refresh tokens in the database:\n\n```ts\naccount: {\n  encryptOAuthTokens: true, // Uses AES-256-GCM\n}\n```\n\n**Recommendation**: Enable this if you store OAuth tokens for API access on behalf of users.\n\n### Skipping State Cookie Check\n\nFor mobile apps or specific OAuth flows where cookies aren''t available:\n\n```ts\naccount: {\n  skipStateCookieCheck: true, // Not recommended for web apps\n}\n```\n\n**Warning**: Only use this for mobile apps that cannot maintain cookies across redirects.\n\n## IP-Based Security\n\nBetter Auth tracks IP addresses for rate limiting and session security.\n\n### IP Address Configuration\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  advanced: {\n    ipAddress: {\n      ipAddressHeaders: [\"x-forwarded-for\", \"x-real-ip\"], // Headers to check\n      disableIpTracking: false, // Keep enabled for rate limiting\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### IPv6 Subnet Configuration\n\nFor rate limiting, IPv6 addresses can be grouped by subnet:\n\n```ts\nadvanced: {\n  ipAddress: {\n    ipv6Subnet: 64, // Options: 128, 64, 48, 32 (default: 64)\n  },\n}\n```\n\nSmaller values group more addresses together, which is useful when users share IPv6 prefixes.\n\n### Trusted Proxy Headers\n\nWhen behind a reverse proxy, enable trusted headers:\n\n```ts\nadvanced: {\n  trustedProxyHeaders: true, // Trust x-forwarded-host, x-forwarded-proto\n}\n```\n\n**Security Note**: Only enable this if you trust your proxy. Malicious clients could spoof these headers otherwise.\n\n## Database Hooks for Security Auditing\n\nUse database hooks to implement security auditing and monitoring.\n\n### Setting Up Audit Logging\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  databaseHooks: {\n    session: {\n      create: {\n        after: async ({ data, ctx }) => {\n          await auditLog(\"session.created\", {\n            userId: data.userId,\n            ip: ctx?.request?.headers.get(\"x-forwarded-for\"),\n            userAgent: ctx?.request?.headers.get(\"user-agent\"),\n          });\n        },\n      },\n      delete: {\n        before: async ({ data }) => {\n          await auditLog(\"session.revoked\", { sessionId: data.id });\n        },\n      },\n    },\n    user: {\n      update: {\n        after: async ({ data, oldData }) => {\n          if (oldData?.email !== data.email) {\n            await auditLog(\"user.email_changed\", {\n              userId: data.id,\n              oldEmail: oldData?.email,\n              newEmail: data.email,\n            });\n          }\n        },\n      },\n    },\n    account: {\n      create: {\n        after: async ({ data }) => {\n          await auditLog(\"account.linked\", {\n            userId: data.userId,\n            provider: data.providerId,\n          });\n        },\n      },\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Blocking Operations\n\nReturn `false` from a `before` hook to prevent an operation:\n\n```ts\ndatabaseHooks: {\n  user: {\n    delete: {\n      before: async ({ data }) => {\n        // Prevent deletion of protected users\n        if (protectedUserIds.includes(data.id)) {\n          return false;\n        }\n      },\n    },\n  },\n}\n```\n\n## Background Tasks for Timing Attack Prevention\n\nSensitive operations should complete in constant time to prevent timing attacks.\n\n### Configuring Background Tasks\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  advanced: {\n    backgroundTasks: {\n      handler: (promise) => {\n        // Platform-specific handler\n        // Vercel: waitUntil(promise)\n        // Cloudflare: ctx.waitUntil(promise)\n        waitUntil(promise);\n      },\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\nThis ensures operations like sending emails don''t affect response timing, which could leak information about whether a user exists.\n\n## Account Enumeration Prevention\n\nBetter Auth implements several measures to prevent attackers from discovering valid accounts.\n\n### Built-in Protections\n\n1. **Consistent Response Messages**: Password reset always returns \"If this email exists in our system, check your email for the reset link\"\n2. **Dummy Operations**: When a user isn''t found, Better Auth still performs token generation and database lookups with dummy values\n3. **Background Email Sending**: Emails are sent asynchronously to prevent timing differences\n\n### Additional Recommendations\n\nFor sign-up and sign-in endpoints, consider:\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  emailAndPassword: {\n    enabled: true,\n    // Generic error messages (implement in your error handling)\n  },\n});\n```\n\nReturn generic error messages like \"Invalid credentials\" rather than \"User not found\" or \"Incorrect password\".\n\n## Complete Security Configuration Example\n\n```ts\nimport { betterAuth } from \"better-auth\";\n\nexport const auth = betterAuth({\n  secret: process.env.BETTER_AUTH_SECRET,\n  baseURL: \"https://api.example.com\",\n  trustedOrigins: [\n    \"https://app.example.com\",\n    \"https://*.preview.example.com\",\n  ],\n  \n  // Rate limiting\n  rateLimit: {\n    enabled: true,\n    storage: \"secondary-storage\",\n    customRules: {\n      \"/api/auth/sign-in/email\": { window: 60, max: 5 },\n      \"/api/auth/sign-up/email\": { window: 60, max: 3 },\n    },\n  },\n  \n  // Session security\n  session: {\n    expiresIn: 60 * 60 * 24 * 7, // 7 days\n    updateAge: 60 * 60 * 24, // 24 hours\n    freshAge: 60 * 60, // 1 hour for sensitive actions\n    cookieCache: {\n      enabled: true,\n      maxAge: 300,\n      strategy: \"jwe\", // Encrypted session data\n    },\n  },\n  \n  // OAuth security\n  account: {\n    encryptOAuthTokens: true,\n    storeStateStrategy: \"cookie\",\n  },\n  \n  \n  // Advanced settings\n  advanced: {\n    useSecureCookies: true,\n    cookiePrefix: \"myapp\",\n    defaultCookieAttributes: {\n      sameSite: \"lax\",\n    },\n    ipAddress: {\n      ipAddressHeaders: [\"x-forwarded-for\"],\n      ipv6Subnet: 64,\n    },\n    backgroundTasks: {\n      handler: (promise) => waitUntil(promise),\n    },\n  },\n  \n  // Security auditing\n  databaseHooks: {\n    session: {\n      create: {\n        after: async ({ data, ctx }) => {\n          console.log(`New session for user ${data.userId}`);\n        },\n      },\n    },\n    user: {\n      update: {\n        after: async ({ data, oldData }) => {\n          if (oldData?.email !== data.email) {\n            console.log(`Email changed for user ${data.id}`);\n          }\n        },\n      },\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Security Checklist\n\nBefore deploying to production:\n\n- [ ] **Secret**: Use a strong, unique secret (32+ characters, high entropy)\n- [ ] **HTTPS**: Ensure `baseURL` uses HTTPS\n- [ ] **Trusted Origins**: Configure all valid origins (frontend, mobile apps)\n- [ ] **Rate Limiting**: Keep enabled with appropriate limits\n- [ ] **CSRF Protection**: Keep enabled (`disableCSRFCheck: false`)\n- [ ] **Secure Cookies**: Enabled automatically with HTTPS\n- [ ] **OAuth Tokens**: Consider `encryptOAuthTokens: true` if storing tokens\n- [ ] **Background Tasks**: Configure for serverless platforms\n- [ ] **Audit Logging**: Implement via `databaseHooks` or `hooks`\n- [ ] **IP Tracking**: Configure headers if behind a proxy\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:14:28.568Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing robust authentication and secret management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的身份验证和密钥管理功能的全栈代理。","ja":"強力な認証およびシークレット管理機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"강력한 인증 및 시크릿 관리 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full-Stack que necesitan capacidades de autenticación robustas y gestión de secretos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant une authentification robuste et des capacités de gestion de secrets.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die robuste Authentifizierung und Geheimnisverwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que necessitam de capacidades robustas de autenticação e gerenciamento de segredos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, которым необходимы надежные возможности аутентификации и управления секретами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء متكاملون الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات قوية للتأكيد وتحكم المعلومات السرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure authentication protocols using environment variables and TypeScript, providing a foundation for secure session token signing, sensitive data encryption, and secure cookie generation via the Better Auth library.","zh":"使代理能够使用环境变量和TypeScript实现安全的身份验证协议，为安全的会话令牌签名、敏感数据加密和通过Better Auth库生成安全的Cookie提供了基础。","ja":"エージェントが環境変数とTypeScriptを使用して安全な認証プロトコルを実装できるようにし、安全なセッショントークンの署名、敏感データの暗号化、およびBetter Authライブラリを介して安全なCookieの生成の基盤を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 환경 변수와 TypeScript를 사용하여 안전한 인증 프로토콜을 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 안전한 세션 토큰 서명, 민감한 데이터 암호화 및 Better Auth 라이브러리를 통해 안전한 쿠키 생성의 기초를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar protocolos de autenticación seguros utilizando variables de entorno y TypeScript, proporcionando una base para la firma de tokens de sesión seguros, el cifrado de datos sensibles y la generación de cookies seguras a través de la biblioteca Better Auth.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des protocoles d''authentification sécurisés en utilisant des variables d''environnement et TypeScript, fournissant une base pour la signature de jetons de session sécurisés, le chiffrement de données sensibles et la génération de cookies sécurisés via la bibliothèque Better Auth.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sichere Authentifizierungsprotokolle mithilfe von Umgebungsvariablen und TypeScript zu implementieren, wodurch eine Grundlage für die sichere Signierung von Sitzungstoken, die Verschlüsselung sensibler Daten und die sichere Generierung von Cookies über die Better-Auth-Bibliothek geschaffen wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar protocolos de autenticação seguros usando variáveis de ambiente e TypeScript, fornecendo uma base para assinatura de token de sessão segura, criptografia de dados sensíveis e geração de cookies seguros via a biblioteca Better Auth.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать безопасные протоколы аутентификации с помощью переменных окружения и TypeScript, обеспечивая основу для безопасной подписи токенов сеанса, шифрования чувствительных данных и безопасной генерации файлов cookie через библиотеку Better Auth.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ بروتوكولات التأكيد الآمنة باستخدام متغيرات البيئة وTypeScript، ما يوفر أساسًا لتعيين توكن الدورة الآمنة وتشفير البيانات الحساسة وتوليد ملفات تعريف الارتباط الآمنة من خلال مكتبة Better Auth."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring auth secrets for secure session management","Encrypting sensitive data using environment variables","Generating secure cookies for authentication"],"zh":["为安全的会话管理配置身份验证密钥","使用环境变量加密敏感数据","为身份验证生成安全的Cookie"],"ja":["安全なセッション管理のための認証シークレットの構成","環境変数を使用した敏感データの暗号化","認証のための安全なCookieの生成"],"ko":["안전한 세션 관리를 위한 인증 시크릿 구성","환경 변수를 사용한 민감한 데이터 암호화","인증을 위한 안전한 쿠키 생성"],"es":["Configuración de secretos de autenticación para la gestión de sesiones seguras","Cifrado de datos sensibles mediante variables de entorno","Generación de cookies seguras para la autenticación"],"fr":["Configuration des secrets d''authentification pour la gestion de sessions sécurisées","Chiffrement de données sensibles à l''aide de variables d''environnement","Génération de cookies sécurisés pour l''authentification"],"de":["Konfiguration von Authentifizierungsgeheimnissen für die sichere Sitzungsverwaltung","Verschlüsselung sensibler Daten mithilfe von Umgebungsvariablen","Sichere Generierung von Cookies für die Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Configurando segredos de autenticação para gerenciamento de sessão seguro","Criptografando dados sensíveis usando variáveis de ambiente","Gerando cookies seguros para autenticação"],"ru":["Настройка секретов аутентификации для безопасного управления сеансами","Шифрование чувствительных данных с помощью переменных окружения","Генерация безопасных файлов cookie для аутентификации"],"ar":["تكوين أسرار التأكيد للأدارة الآمنة للجلسة","تشفير البيانات الحساسة باستخدام متغيرات البيئة","توليد ملفات تعريف الارتباط الآمنة للتأكيد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Better Auth library integration","Dependent on environment variable configuration (e.g., BETTER_AUTH_SECRET)"],"zh":["需要Better Auth库集成","依赖于环境变量配置（例如BETTER_AUTH_SECRET）"],"ja":["Better Authライブラリの統合が必要","環境変数の構成（例：BETTER_AUTH_SECRET）に依存"],"ko":["Better Auth 라이브러리 통합이 필요","환경 변수 구성(예: BETTER_AUTH_SECRET)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración de la biblioteca Better Auth","Dependiente de la configuración de variables de entorno (por ejemplo, BETTER_AUTH_SECRET)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la bibliothèque Better Auth","Dépend de la configuration des variables d''environnement (par exemple, BETTER_AUTH_SECRET)"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der Better-Auth-Bibliothek","Hängt von der Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen ab (z. B. BETTER_AUTH_SECRET)"],"pt":["Requer integração com a biblioteca Better Auth","Dependente da configuração de variáveis de ambiente (por exemplo, BETTER_AUTH_SECRET)"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с библиотекой Better Auth","Зависит от конфигурации переменных окружения (например, BETTER_AUTH_SECRET)"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع مكتبة Better Auth","يعتمد على تكوين متغيرات البيئة (على سبيل المثال ، BETTER_AUTH_SECRET)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
