，优先考虑用户中心测试","ja":"Angular テスト Jest は、Angular アプリケーションをテストするためのツールであり、ユーザー中心のテストを優先します","ko":"Angular 테스트 Jest 는 Angular 애플리케이션을 테스트하는 도구로, 사용자 중심 테스트를 우선합니다","es":"Angular Testing con Jest es una colección de componentes para probar aplicaciones Angular de manera accesible y hermosa","fr":"Test Angular avec Jest est une collection de composants pour tester des applications Angular de manière accessible et élégante","de":"Angular-Testing mit Jest ist eine Sammlung von Komponenten, um Angular-Anwendungen auf eine zugängliche und schöne Weise zu testen","pt":"Teste de Angular com Jest é uma abordagem de teste que prioriza a experiência do usuário, utilizando @testing-library/angular para simular comportamentos reais","ru":"Тестирование Angular с Jest - это подход к тестированию, который отдает приоритет опыту пользователя, используя @testing-library/angular для симуляции реальн...","ar":"اختبار أنجولار مع Jest هو نهج للاختبار يركز على تجربة المستخدم، باستخدام @testing-library/angular لمحاكاة السلوكيات الحقيقية","en":"A collection of beautiful and accessible components for Angular based in Shadcn/ui and Ng-zorro. Fully open source and free ❤️"},"definition":{"en":"A collection of beautiful and accessible components for Angular based in Shadcn/ui and Ng-zorro. Fully open source and free ❤️"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Jest 和 @testing-library/angular 进行测试","优先考虑用户中心测试","支持 Angular v21+","使用语义查询","遵循 Angular v20+ 标准","支持无障碍测试"],"ja":["Jest と @testing-library/angular を使用してテストします","ユーザー中心のテストを優先します","Angular v21+ をサポートします","セマンティック クエリを使用します","Angular v20+ 標準に準拠します","アクセシビリティ テストをサポートします"],"ko":["Jest 와 @testing-library/angular 를 사용하여 테스트합니다","사용자 중심 테스트를 우선합니다","Angular v21+ 를 지원합니다","의미적 쿼리를 사용합니다","Angular v20+ 표준을 준수합니다","접근성 테스트를 지원합니다"],"es":["Pruebas centradas en el usuario con @testing-library/angular","Compatibilidad con Angular v21+","Enfoque en la accesibilidad con consultas semánticas","Soporte para componentes autónomos y señales","Uso de control de flujo @if/@for"],"fr":["Tests centrés sur l''utilisateur avec @testing-library/angular","Compatibilité avec Angular v21+","Accent sur l''accessibilité avec des requêtes sémantiques","Prise en charge des composants autonomes et des signaux","Utilisation du contrôle de flux @if/@for"],"de":["Benutzerzentrierte Tests mit @testing-library/angular","Kompatibilität mit Angular v21+","Fokus auf Barrierefreiheit mit semantischen Abfragen","Unterstützung für autarke Komponenten und Signale","Verwendung der Flusskontrolle @if/@for"],"pt":["Teste de componentes Angular com Jest","Uso de @testing-library/angular para simular comportamentos reais","Priorização de testes centrados no usuário","Compatibilidade com Angular v21+","Suporte a testes de acessibilidade"],"ru":["Тестирование компонентов Angular с Jest","Использование @testing-library/angular для симуляции реального поведения","Приоритет тестов, ориентированных на пользователя","Совместимость с Angular v21+","Поддержка тестов доступности"],"ar":["اختبار مكونات Angular مع Jest","استخدام @testing-library/angular لمحاكاة السلوكيات الحقيقية","التركيز على اختبارات مركزة على المستخدم","التوافق مع Angular v21+","دعم اختبارات إمكانية الوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular 测试","Jest","用户中心测试","Angular v21+","语义查询","无障碍测试","Angular v20+ 标准"],"ja":["Angular テスト","Jest","ユーザー中心テスト","Angular v21+","セマンティック クエリ","アクセシビリティ テスト","Angular v20+ 標準"],"ko":["Angular 테스트","Jest","사용자 중심 테스트","Angular v21+","의미적 쿼리","접근성 테스트","Angular v20+ 표준"],"es":["pruebas de angular","jest","testing-library","angular v21+","pruebas centradas en el usuario","accesibilidad","componentes autónomos","señales"],"fr":["tests angular","jest","testing-library","angular v21+","tests centrés sur l''utilisateur","accessibilité","composants autonomes","signaux"],"de":["angular-testing","jest","testing-library","angular v21+","benutzerzentrierte tests","barrierefreiheit","autarke komponenten","signale"],"pt":["teste de angular","jest","testing-library","angular v21+","teste de componente","acessibilidade","desenvolvimento de software","teste de unidade","teste de integração"],"ru":["тестирование angular","jest","testing-library","angular v21+","тестирование компонентов","доступность","разработка программного обеспечения","юнит-тестирование","интеграционное тестирование"],"ar":["اختبار أنجولار","jest","testing-library","angular v21+","اختبار المكونات","إمكانية الوصول","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار الوحدة","اختبار التكامل"]}},"owner":"zard-ui","repo":"zardui","repoPath":"zard-ui/zardui","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-testing","description":"Write unit and integration tests for Angular v21+ applications using Jest with @testing-library/angular, focusing on user-centric testing, AAA pattern, and modern Angular patterns (Standalone components, Signals). Use for testing components, services, and HTTP interactions with Jest globals and Testing Library DOM matchers.","bodyPreview":"# Angular Testing with Jest\n\nTest Angular v21+ applications with Jest and @testing-library/angular, prioritizing user-centric testing over implementation details.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- **User-Centric Testing:** Simulate real user behavior using `@testing-library/angular`. Avoid testing implementation details or private state.\n- **Modern Angular:** Follow Angular v20+ standards (Standalone components, Signals, `@if/@for` control flow).\n- **Accessibility:** Use semantic queries (getByRole, getByL","body":"# Angular Testing with Jest\n\nTest Angular v21+ applications with Jest and @testing-library/angular, prioritizing user-centric testing over implementation details.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- **User-Centric Testing:** Simulate real user behavior using `@testing-library/angular`. Avoid testing implementation details or private state.\n- **Modern Angular:** Follow Angular v20+ standards (Standalone components, Signals, `@if/@for` control flow).\n- **Accessibility:** Use semantic queries (getByRole, getByLabelText) that promote accessible markup.\n\n## Framework & Syntax\n\n### Jest Globals\n\nAlways use Jest globals:\n- `describe`, `it`, `expect`, `jest` (e.g., `jest.fn()`, `jest.spyOn()`)\n- Never use `jasmine`, `spyOn`, or `done()`\n\n### Testing Library DOM Matchers\n\nUse `@testing-library/jest-dom` matchers for better assertions:\n\n```typescript\n// Good - Use jest-dom matchers\nexpect(button).toHaveClass(''primary'');\nexpect(text).toBeVisible();\nexpect(element).toHaveTextContent(''Hello'');\nexpect(button).toBeDisabled();\n\n// Bad - Avoid direct DOM manipulation\nexpect(element.classList.contains(''name'')).toBe(true);\nexpect(element.style.display).toBe(''none'');\n```\n\n## Test Structure (AAA Pattern)\n\n### Strict AAA Guidelines\n\nStructure every test into **Arrange**, **Act**, and **Assert** blocks:\n\n1. **Leave exactly one empty line** between Arrange/Act/Assert blocks\n2. **Do NOT include** `// Arrange` or `// Act` or `// Assert` comments\n3. **Use meaningful test titles** with active voice\n\n### Test Naming\n\n- Use active voice, describe what the test does\n- Avoid \"should\" phrasing\n\n```typescript\n// Bad - Generic \"should\" title\nit(''should handle submit'', () => { });\n\n// Good - Descriptive and specific\nit(''prevents submission when the email field is invalid'', () => { });\n\n// Good - Clear behavior description\nit(''updates the profile when the save button is clicked'', () => { });\n```\n\n## Component Testing Strategy\n\n### Isolation\n\nEach `it` block must be self-contained. Use `beforeEach` only for setup truly shared across all tests.\n\n### Query Selection\n\nUse Testing Library queries in order of preference:\n1. `screen.getByRole()` - Most accessible and semantic\n2. `screen.getByLabelText()` - For form elements\n3. `screen.getByText()` - For static text content\n4. `screen.getByTestId()` - Last resort only\n\n### User Interactions\n\nUse `userEvent` from `@testing-library/user-event` for realistic interactions instead of native DOM events.\n\n### Public API Testing\n\nTest only public fields and methods. Test `protected` or `private` logic only through public triggers (user interactions, input changes, public method calls).\n\n### Business Logic Focus\n\nDo not test Angular''s built-in directives (like `@if`, `@for`). Test the component''s unique inputs, outputs, and business logic.\n\n## Mocking & Async\n\n### Effective Mocking\n\nUse `jest.spyOn()` or `jest.fn()` to isolate dependencies. Avoid importing heavy modules; mock services and APIs at the boundary.\n\n### Async Handling\n\nUse `async/await` for all promises returned by queries or events. Never leave a promise unhandled.\n\n### Signals\n\nUpdate signal state via `component.mySignal.set()` and verify the UI updates automatically.\n\n### HTTP\n\nUse `HttpTestingController` and `provideHttpClientTesting()` for service tests.\n\n## Best Practices Summary\n\n1. **User-Centric:** Test what users see and interact with\n2. **AAA Pattern:** Arrange, Act, Assert with clear separation\n3. **Meaningful Names:** Active voice, specific behavior\n4. **Isolation:** Each test is self-contained\n5. **Accessibility:** Use semantic queries (getByRole, getByLabelText)\n6. **Public API Only:** Don''t test private implementation\n7. **Async Handling:** Always await promises and user events\n8. **Mock at Boundaries:** Mock services, not internal logic\n9. **Business Logic Focus:** Don''t test Angular''s built-in directives\n10. **DOM Matchers:** Use jest-dom for readable assertions\n\nFor complete usage examples and patterns, see [references/testing-jest-patterns.md](references/testing-patterns.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:14:55.518Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in Angular application testing with Jest and @testing-library/angular.","zh":"非常适合专门从事Angular应用程序测试的前端代理，使用Jest和@testing-library/angular。","ja":"Angularアプリケーションのテストを専門とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。Jestおよび@testing-library/angularを使用します。","ko":"Angular 애플리케이션 테스트를 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Jest 및 @testing-library/angular를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend especializados en pruebas de aplicaciones Angular con Jest y @testing-library/angular.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend spécialisés dans les tests d''applications Angular avec Jest et @testing-library/angular.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf die Testung von Angular-Anwendungen mit Jest und @testing-library/angular spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend especializados em testes de aplicativos Angular com Jest e @testing-library/angular.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на тестировании приложений Angular с помощью Jest и @testing-library/angular.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية المتخصصة في اختبار التطبيقات Angular مع Jest و @testing-library/angular."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write user-centric tests for Angular v21+ applications, utilizing semantic queries like getByRole and getByLabelText, while following modern Angular standards with Standalone components and Signals.","zh":"赋予代理写面向用户的测试的能力，用于Angular v21+应用程序，利用像getByRole和getByLabelText这样的语义查询，同时遵循现代Angular标准，使用独立组件和信号。","ja":"Angular v21+アプリケーション向けのユーザー中心のテストを記述するエージェントを可能にします。getByRoleやgetByLabelTextなどのセマンティクス쿼リを利用し、Standaloneコンポーネントやシグナルなどの現代のAngular標準に従います。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular v21+ 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 중심 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 해줍니다. getByRole 및 getByLabelText와 같은 의미 쿼리를 사용하며 독립 구성 요소 및 신호와 같은 최신 Angular 표준을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir pruebas centradas en el usuario para aplicaciones Angular v21+, utilizando consultas semánticas como getByRole y getByLabelText, mientras sigue los estándares modernos de Angular con componentes autónomos y señales.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests centrés sur l''utilisateur pour les applications Angular v21+, en utilisant des requêtes sémantiques comme getByRole et getByLabelText, tout en suivant les normes modernes d''Angular avec des composants autonomes et des signaux.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, benutzerzentrierte Tests für Angular-Anwendungen v21+ zu schreiben, indem sie semantische Abfragen wie getByRole und getByLabelText verwenden, während sie die modernen Angular-Standards mit eigenständigen Komponenten und Signalen einhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes centrados no usuário para aplicações Angular v21+, utilizando consultas semânticas como getByRole e getByLabelText, enquanto segue os padrões modernos do Angular com componentes autônomos e sinais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать пользовательские тесты для приложений Angular v21+, используя семантические запросы, такие как getByRole и getByLabelText, при этом следуя современным стандартам Angular с автономными компонентами и сигналами.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من كتابة اختبارات مركزة على المستخدم لتطبيقات Angular v21+، مع استخدام استفسارات семانتيكية مثل getByRole و getByLabelText، مع اتباع معايير Angular الحديثة مع المكونات المستقلة والإشارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing end-to-end tests for Angular components with Jest","Debugging accessibility issues using @testing-library/angular","Validating user interactions with Angular applications"],"zh":["使用Jest为Angular组件编写端到端测试","使用@testing-library/angular调试可访问性问题","验证Angular应用程序的用户交互"],"ja":["Jestを使用してAngularコンポーネントのエンドツーエンドテストを記述する","@testing-library/angularを使用してアクセシビリティの問題をデバッグする","Angularアプリケーションのユーザーインタラクションを検証する"],"ko":["Jest를 사용하여 Angular 컴포넌트의 종단 간 테스트를 작성하는 것","@testing-library/angular를 사용하여 접근성 문제를 디버깅하는 것","Angular 애플리케이션의 사용자 상호 작용을 검증하는 것"],"es":["Escritura de pruebas de extremo a extremo para componentes Angular con Jest","Depuración de problemas de accesibilidad utilizando @testing-library/angular","Validación de interacciones de usuario con aplicaciones Angular"],"fr":["Écriture de tests de bout en bout pour les composants Angular avec Jest","Débogage des problèmes d''accessibilité en utilisant @testing-library/angular","Validation des interactions utilisateur avec les applications Angular"],"de":["Schreiben von End-to-End-Tests für Angular-Komponenten mit Jest","Debuggen von Zugriffsproblemen mit @testing-library/angular","Validierung von Benutzerinteraktionen mit Angular-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Escrita de testes de ponta a ponta para componentes Angular com Jest","Depuração de problemas de acessibilidade usando @testing-library/angular","Validação de interações do usuário com aplicações Angular"],"ru":["Написание тестов конца в конца для компонентов Angular с помощью Jest","Отладка проблем доступности с помощью @testing-library/angular","Проверка взаимодействия пользователя с приложениями Angular"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية للمكونات Angular مع Jest","تصحيح أخطاء إمكانية الوصول باستخدام @testing-library/angular","تحقق من تفاعل المستخدم مع تطبيقات Angular"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular v21+","Limited to Jest testing framework","Dependent on @testing-library/angular"],"zh":["需要Angular v21+","仅限于Jest测试框架","依赖于@testing-library/angular"],"ja":["Angular v21+が必要","Jestテストフレームワークのみ","@testing-library/angularに依存"],"ko":["Angular v21+ 필요","Jest 테스트 프레임워크만 해당","@testing-library/angular에 의존"],"es":["Requiere Angular v21+","Limitado al marco de pruebas Jest","Dependiente de @testing-library/angular"],"fr":["Nécessite Angular v21+","Limité au framework de test Jest","Dépendant de @testing-library/angular"],"de":["Erfordert Angular v21+","Begrenzt auf das Jest-Testframework","Abhängig von @testing-library/angular"],"pt":["Exige Angular v21+","Limitado ao quadro de testes Jest","Dependente de @testing-library/angular"],"ru":["Требует Angular v21+","Ограничен только фреймворком тестирования Jest","Зависит от @testing-library/angular"],"ar":["يتطلب Angular v21+","محدود بإطار الاختبار Jest","يعتمد على @testing-library/angular"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
