、uview-plus和unocss等技术","ja":"antfuは、uniapp、vite、vue3、typescript、uview-plus、unocssなどの技術を使用した高速開発テンプレートです","ko":"antfu는 uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript, uview-plus, unocss 등을 사용한 빠른 개발 템플릿입니다","es":"La plantilla de desarrollo rápido de Antfu combina uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript y uview-plus para una colaboración en equipo eficiente","fr":"Le modèle de développement rapide d''Antfu combine uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript et uview-plus pour une collaboration d''équipe efficace","de":"Die Schnellstart-Vorlage von Antfu kombiniert uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript und uview-plus für eine effiziente Teamzusammenarbeit","pt":"Antfu é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento web que combina uniapp, vite, vue3 e typescript para um desenvolvimento rápido e eficiente.","ru":"Antfu - это инструмент для веб-разработки, который объединяет uniapp, vite, vue3 и typescript для быстрой и эффективной разработки.","ar":"أنتفو هي أداة تطوير ويب تتضمن uniapp وvite وvue3 وtypescript من أجل تطوير سريع وفعال.","en":"使用uniapp+vite+vue3+typescript+uview-plus+unocss 搭建的适合团队协作的快速开发模版"},"definition":{"en":"使用uniapp+vite+vue3+typescript+uview-plus+unocss 搭建的适合团队协作的快速开发模版"},"features":{"zh":["使用uniapp+vite+vue3+typescript+uview-plus+unocss","支持团队协作","快速开发","使用pnpm作为包管理器","使用TypeScript（严格模式）","使用Vitest进行测试"],"ja":["uniapp+vite+vue3+typescript+uview-plus+unocssを使用","チームコラボレーションをサポート","高速開発","pnpmをパッケージマネージャーとして使用","TypeScript（厳格モード）を使用","Vitestを使用してテスト"],"ko":["uniapp+vite+vue3+typescript+uview-plus+unocss 사용","팀 협업 지원","빠른 개발","pnpm을 패키지 매니저로 사용","TypeScript（严格 모드）를 사용","Vitest를 사용하여 테스트"],"es":["uniapp para el desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","vite para la creación de aplicaciones web","vue3 para el desarrollo de interfaces de usuario","typescript para la seguridad y la mantenibilidad del código","uview-plus para la creación de componentes personalizados"],"fr":["uniapp pour le développement d''applications mobiles","vite pour la création d''applications web","vue3 pour le développement d''interfaces utilisateur","typescript pour la sécurité et la maintenabilité du code","uview-plus pour la création de composants personnalisés"],"de":["uniapp für die Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","vite für die Erstellung von Webanwendungen","vue3 für die Entwicklung von Benutzeroberflächen","typescript für die Sicherheit und die Wartbarkeit des Codes","uview-plus für die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Komponenten"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento rápido com uniapp e vite","Suporte a vue3 e typescript","Configurações de linting e formatação com @antfu/eslint-config","Testes com Vitest","Hooks de git com simple-git-hooks e lint-staged"],"ru":["Быстрая разработка с uniapp и vite","Поддержка vue3 и typescript","Настройки линтинга и форматирования с @antfu/eslint-config","Тестирование с Vitest","Гит-хуки с simple-git-hooks и lint-staged"],"ar":["التطوير السريع مع uniapp وvite","دعم vue3 وtypescript","إعدادات لينтинغ وتنسيق مع @antfu/eslint-config","اختبارات مع Vitest","Hooks git مع simple-git-hooks وlint-staged"]},"keywords":{"zh":["antfu","快速开发模版","团队协作","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","unocss"],"ja":["antfu","高速開発テンプレート","チームコラボレーション","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","unocss"],"ko":["antfu","빠른 개발 템플릿","팀 협업","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","unocss"],"es":["desarrollo rápido","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","colaboración en equipo","plantilla de desarrollo","aplicaciones móviles","aplicaciones web"],"fr":["développement rapide","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","collaboration d''équipe","modèle de développement","applications mobiles","applications web"],"de":["Schnellstart","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","Teamzusammenarbeit","Schnellstart-Vorlage","mobile Anwendungen","Webanwendungen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento web","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","antfu","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento rápido","eficiência"],"ru":["веб-разработка","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","antfu","инструмент для разработки","быстрая разработка","эффективность"],"ar":["تطوير ويب","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","أنتفو","أداة تطوير","تطوير سريع","كفاءة"]}},"owner":"oyjt","repo":"uniapp-vue3-template","repoPath":"oyjt/uniapp-vue3-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"antfu","description":"Anthony Fus {Opinionated} preferences and best practices for web development","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePres","body":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePress (in `docs/`) |\n\n---\n\n## Core Stack\n\n### Package Manager (pnpm)\n\nUse pnpm as the package manager.\n\nFor monorepo setups, use pnpm workspaces:\n\n```yaml\n# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - ''packages/*''\n```\n\n\nUse pnpm named catalogs in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` to manage dependency versions:\n\n| Catalog | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `prod` | Production dependencies |\n| `inlined` | Dependencies inlined by bundler |\n| `dev` | Development tools (linter, bundler, testing, dev-server) |\n| `frontend` | Frontend libraries bundled into frontend |\n\nCatalog names are not limited to the above and can be adjusted based on needs. Avoid using default catalog.\n\n#### @antfu/ni\n\nUse `@antfu/ni` for unified package manager commands. It auto-detects the package manager (pnpm/npm/yarn/bun) based on lockfile.\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `ni` | Install dependencies |\n| `ni <pkg>` | Add dependency |\n| `ni -D <pkg>` | Add dev dependency |\n| `nr <script>` | Run script |\n| `nu` | Upgrade dependencies |\n| `nun <pkg>` | Uninstall dependency |\n| `nci` | Clean install (like `pnpm i --frozen-lockfile`) |\n| `nlx <pkg>` | Execute package (like `npx`) |\n\nInstall globally with `pnpm i -g @antfu/ni` if the commands are not found.\n\n### TypeScript (Strict Mode)\n\nAlways use TypeScript with strict mode enabled.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ESM (ECMAScript Modules)\n\nAlways work in ESM mode. Set `\"type\": \"module\"` in `package.json`.\n\n---\n\n## Code Quality\n\n### ESLint (@antfu/eslint-config)\n\nUse `@antfu/eslint-config` for both formatting and linting. This eliminates the need for Prettier.\n\nCreate `eslint.config.js` with `// @ts-check` comment:\n\n```js\n// @ts-check\nimport antfu from ''@antfu/eslint-config''\n\nexport default antfu()\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWhen getting linting errors, try to fix them with `nr lint --fix`. Don''t add `lint:fix` script.\n\n### Git Hooks (simple-git-hooks + lint-staged)\n\nUse `simple-git-hooks` with `lint-staged` for pre-commit linting:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"simple-git-hooks\": {\n    \"pre-commit\": \"pnpm i --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts --offline && npx lint-staged\"\n  },\n  \"lint-staged\": {\n    \"*\": \"eslint --fix\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"prepare\": \"npx simple-git-hooks\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Unit Testing (Vitest)\n\nUse Vitest for unit testing.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"vitest\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Conventions:**\n\n- Place test files next to source files: `foo.ts` → `foo.test.ts` (same directory)\n- High-level tests go in `tests/` directory in each package\n- Use `describe` and `it` API (not `test`)\n- Use `expect` API for assertions\n- Use `assert` only for TypeScript null assertions\n- Use `toMatchSnapshot` for complex output assertions\n- Use `toMatchFileSnapshot` with explicit file path and extension for language-specific output (exclude those files from linting)\n\n---\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Publishing (Library Projects)\n\nFor library projects, publish through GitHub Releases triggered by `bumpp`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"release\": \"bumpp -r\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Documentation (VitePress)\n\nUse VitePress for documentation. Place docs under `docs/` directory.\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── .vitepress/\n│   └── config.ts\n├── index.md\n└── guide/\n    └── getting-started.md\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"docs:dev\": \"vitepress dev docs\",\n    \"docs:build\": \"vitepress build docs\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n### Project Setup\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| @antfu/eslint-config | ESLint flat config for formatting and linting | [antfu-eslint-config](references/antfu-eslint-config.md) |\n| GitHub Actions | Preferred workflows using sxzz/workflows | [github-actions](references/github-actions.md) |\n| .gitignore | Preferred .gitignore for JS/TS projects | [gitignore](references/gitignore.md) |\n| VS Code Extensions | Recommended extensions for development | [vscode-extensions](references/vscode-extensions.md) |\n\n### Development\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| App Development | Preferences for Vue/Vite/Nuxt/UnoCSS web applications | [app-development](references/app-development.md) |\n| Library Development | Preferences for bundling and publishing TypeScript libraries | [library-development](references/library-development.md) |\n| Monorepo | pnpm workspaces, centralized alias, Turborepo | [monorepo](references/monorepo.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:15:00.883Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined web development with uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript, uview-plus, and unocss","zh":"非常适合需要使用uniapp、vite、vue3、typescript、uview-plus和unocss进行流线化Web开发的前端代理","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがuniapp、vite、vue3、typescript、uview-plus、unocssを使用してWeb開発をストリームライン化するのに最適","ko":"유니앱, 바이트, 뷰3, 타입스크립트, 유뷰 플러스, 언오씨에스를 사용하여 웹 개발을 스트림 라인화하는 프론트 엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo web optimizado con uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript, uview-plus y unocss","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un développement web rationalisé avec uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript, uview-plus et unocss","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes Web-Development mit uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript, uview-plus und unocss benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de desenvolvimento web simplificado com uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript, uview-plus e unocss","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходим упрощенный веб-разработка с помощью uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript, uview-plus и unocss","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تبسيط تطوير الويب مع uniapp و vite و vue3 و typescript و uview-plus و unocss"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage pnpm for package management, TypeScript in strict mode for robust coding, and Vitest for efficient testing, all while adhering to @antfu/eslint-config for linting and formatting without Prettier","zh":"赋予代理使用pnpm进行包管理、严格模式下的TypeScript进行强大的编码、Vitest进行高效测试，同时遵守@antfu/eslint-config进行linting和格式化，而无需Prettier","ja":"エージェントがpnpmを使用してパッケージ管理を行い、厳格モードのTypeScriptを使用して堅牢なコーディングを行い、Vitestを使用して効率的なテストを行い、同時に@antfu/eslint-configに従ってlintingとフォーマットを行うことを可能にし、Prettierは不要","ko":"에이전트가 pnpm을 사용하여 패키지 관리를 수행하고, 엄격한 모드下的 타입스크립트를 사용하여 강력한 코딩을 수행하며, Vitest를 사용하여 효율적인 테스트를 수행하며,同時に @antfu/eslint-config에 따라 린팅과 포맷팅을 수행하며, 프리티어는 필요하지 않음","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar pnpm para la gestión de paquetes, TypeScript en modo estricto para un codificado robusto y Vitest para pruebas eficientes, todo mientras se adhiere a @antfu/eslint-config para la verificación y el formato sin Prettier","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti de pnpm pour la gestion des paquets, de TypeScript en mode strict pour une codification robuste et de Vitest pour des tests efficaces, le tout en respectant @antfu/eslint-config pour la vérification et le formatage sans Prettier","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, pnpm für das Paketmanagement, TypeScript im Strict-Modus für robustes Codieren und Vitest für effizientes Testen zu nutzen, all dies unter Beachtung von @antfu/eslint-config für die Überprüfung und Formatierung ohne Prettier","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o pnpm para gerenciamento de pacotes, TypeScript no modo estrito para codificação robusta e Vitest para testes eficientes, tudo isso seguindo o @antfu/eslint-config para análise de código e formatação sem Prettier","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать pnpm для управления пакетами, TypeScript в строгом режиме для надежного кодирования и Vitest для эффективного тестирования, все это при соблюдении @antfu/eslint-config для контроля кода и форматирования без Prettier","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من استخدام pnpm لإدارة الحزم و TypeScript في الوضع الصارم لتحقيق كود قوي و Vitest لاختبارات فعالة، كل ذلك مع اتباع @antfu/eslint-config للتحليل والتدوين بدون Prettier"},"useCases":{"en":["Building high-performance web applications with uniapp and vue3","Streamlining development workflows with vite and unocss","Implementing robust testing with Vitest and maintaining code quality with simple-git-hooks and lint-staged"],"zh":["使用uniapp和vue3构建高性能Web应用","使用vite和unocss简化开发工作流","使用Vitest和simple-git-hooks以及lint-staged实现强大的测试和代码质量维护"],"ja":["uniappとvue3を使用して高性能なWebアプリケーションを構築","viteとunocssを使用して開発ワークフローを簡素化","Vitestとsimple-git-hooksおよびlint-stagedを使用して堅牢なテストとコード品質の維持を実現"],"ko":["유니앱과 뷰3를 사용하여 고성능 웹 애플리케이션을 구축","바이트와 언오씨에스를 사용하여 개발 워크플로우를 단순화","비테스트와 심플 깃 후크 및 린트 스테이징을 사용하여 강력한 테스트와 코드 품질 유지"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones web de alto rendimiento con uniapp y vue3","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con vite y unocss","Implementación de pruebas robustas con Vitest y mantenimiento de la calidad del código con simple-git-hooks y lint-staged"],"fr":["Création d''applications web haute performance avec uniapp et vue3","Optimisation des flux de travail de développement avec vite et unocss","Mise en œuvre de tests robustes avec Vitest et maintien de la qualité du code avec simple-git-hooks et lint-staged"],"de":["Erstellung von Hochleistungs-Webanwendungen mit uniapp und vue3","Optimierung von Entwicklungsworkflows mit vite und unocss","Implementierung robuster Tests mit Vitest und Wartung der Codequalität mit simple-git-hooks und lint-staged"],"pt":["Construir aplicações web de alto desempenho com uniapp e vue3","Simplificar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com vite e unocss","Implementar testes robustos com Vitest e manter a qualidade do código com simple-git-hooks e lint-staged"],"ru":["Создание высокопроизводительных веб-приложений с помощью uniapp и vue3","Упрощение рабочих процессов разработки с помощью vite и unocss","Реализация надежного тестирования с помощью Vitest и поддержание качества кода с помощью simple-git-hooks и lint-staged"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات ويب عالية الأداء مع uniapp و vue3","تبسيط سير عمل التطوير باستخدام vite و unocss","تنفيذ اختبارات قوية مع Vitest والحفاظ على جودة الكود مع simple-git-hooks و lint-staged"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with TypeScript and Vue3 ecosystem","Optimized for team collaboration with specific tooling and configurations"],"zh":["需要熟悉TypeScript和Vue3生态系统","针对团队协作进行优化，具有特定的工具和配置"],"ja":["TypeScriptとVue3のエコシステムに精通している必要がある","チームコラボレーション用に最適化されており、特定のツールと設定が必要"],"ko":["타입스크립트와 뷰3 생태계에 익숙해야 함","팀 협업을 위한 최적화로 특정 도구와 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con TypeScript y el ecosistema de Vue3","Optimizado para la colaboración en equipo con herramientas y configuraciones específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de TypeScript et de l''écosystème Vue3","Optimisé pour la collaboration d''équipe avec des outils et des configurations spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse von TypeScript und dem Vue3-Ökosystem","Optimiert für die Teamzusammenarbeit mit spezifischen Tools und Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Exige familiaridade com TypeScript e o ecossistema Vue3","Otimizado para colaboração em equipe com ferramentas e configurações específicas"],"ru":["Требует знания TypeScript и экосистемы Vue3","Оптимизирован для командной работы с определенными инструментами и конфигурациями"],"ar":["يتطلب دراية بِ TypeScript وبيئة Vue3","مُحسّن لتعاون الفريق باستخدام أدوات وتكوينات محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('EpicenterHQ/epicenter/github-issues', 'community', 'EpicenterHQ', 'epicenter', 'EpicenterHQ/epicenter', 'github-issues', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:14:51.755Z', NULL, '{"id":"EpicenterHQ/epicenter/github-issues","name":"github-issues","description":{"zh":"本指南提供了有关如何撰写高质量的 GitHub 问题和 PR 评论的建议，帮助您提高开发效率","ja":"このガイドラインでは、GitHub の問題と PR コメントの書き方に関するアドバイスを提供し、開発効率を向上させる方法を紹介します","ko":"이 가이드는 GitHub 이슈 및 PR 코멘트 작성 방법에 대한 조언을 제공하여 개발 효율성을 높여줍니다","es":"Guía para comentarios efectivos en GitHub Issues y PR, evitando patrones anti-útiles","fr":"Guide pour des commentaires efficaces sur GitHub Issues et PR, en évitant les modèles anti-utiles","de":"Leitfaden für effektive Kommentare in GitHub Issues und PR, anti-nützliche Muster vermeidend","pt":"Otimização de respostas em issues do GitHub para desenvolvedores, com dicas para melhorar a experiência do usuário","ru":"Оптимизация ответов на issues в GitHub для разработчиков, с советами для улучшения пользовательского опыта","ar":"تحسين الإجابات على الإشكالات في جيثب للمطورين، مع نصائح لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":"Press shortcut → speak → get text. Free and open source. More local-first apps soon ❤️"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub 问题和 PR 评论指南","ja":"GitHub の問題と PR コメントガイドライン","ko":"GitHub 이슈 및 PR 코멘트 가이드라인","es":"Guía de comentarios de GitHub Issues","fr":"Guide des commentaires GitHub Issues","de":"GitHub Issues Kommentar-Leitfaden","pt":"Dicas de SEO para GitHub Issues","ru":"Советы по SEO для GitHub Issues","ar":"نصائح تحسين محركات البحث ل이슈ات جيثب","en":"github-issues"},"description":{"zh":"本指南提供了有关如何撰写高质量的 GitHub 问题和 PR 评论的建议，帮助您提高开发效率","ja":"このガイドラインでは、GitHub の問題と PR コメントの書き方に関するアドバイスを提供し、開発効率を向上させる方法を紹介します","ko":"이 가이드는 GitHub 이슈 및 PR 코멘트 작성 방법에 대한 조언을 제공하여 개발 효율성을 높여줍니다","es":"Guía para comentarios efectivos en GitHub Issues y PR, evitando patrones anti-útiles","fr":"Guide pour des commentaires efficaces sur GitHub Issues et PR, en évitant les modèles anti-utiles","de":"Leitfaden für effektive Kommentare in GitHub Issues und PR, anti-nützliche Muster vermeidend","pt":"Otimização de respostas em issues do GitHub para desenvolvedores, com dicas para melhorar a experiência do usuário","ru":"Оптимизация ответов на issues в GitHub для разработчиков, с советами для улучшения пользовательского опыта","ar":"تحسين الإجابات على الإشكالات في جيثب للمطورين، مع نصائح لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":"Press shortcut → speak → get text. Free and open source. More local-first apps soon ❤️"},"definition":{"en":"Press shortcut → speak → get text. Free and open source. More local-first apps soon ❤️"},"features":{"zh":["避免过度结构化的回复","不使用公式化的开场白","不重述明显的内容","避免企业公告风格"],"ja":["過度構造化された返信を避ける","公式的な挨拶を使用しない","明らかな内容を繰り返さない","企業広告のような表現を避ける"],"ko":["과도한 구조화된 응답 피하기","공식적인 인사 사용 안함","분명한 내용을 반복하지 않기","기업 광고 같은 표현 피하기"],"es":["Evita respuestas sobre-estructuradas","Mantén un tono conversacional","No repitas lo obvio","Evita anuncios corporativos","Mantén la simplicidad en tus respuestas"],"fr":["Évitez les réponses sur-structurées","Maintenez un ton conversationnel","Ne répétez pas l''évident","Évitez les annonces corporatives","Maintenez la simplicité dans vos réponses"],"de":["Vermeiden Sie über-strukturierte Antworten","Halten Sie einen konversationellen Ton","Wiederholen Sie nicht das Offensichtliche","Vermeiden Sie Unternehmensankündigungen","Halten Sie die Einfachheit in Ihren Antworten"],"pt":["Evite respostas sobre-estruturadas","Não use aberturas formulaicas","Não repita o óbvio","Evite anúncios corporativos","Use parágrafos conversacionais","Ajuste o tom à conversa"],"ru":["Избегайте чрезмерно структурированных ответов","Не используйте формульные начала","Не повторяйте очевидное","Избегайте корпоративных объявлений","Используйте разговорные параграфы","Соответствуйте тон разговору"],"ar":["تجنب الإجابات المهيأة بشكل مبالغ","لا تستخدم افتتاحيات شبهة","لا تكرر الواضح","تجنب الإعلانات الشركية","استخدم الفقرات الحوارية","اجعل النبرة تتناسب مع المحادثة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub 问题","PR 评论","开发效率","代码审查","协作开发"],"ja":["GitHub の問題","PR コメント","開発効率","コードレビュー","コラボレーション開発"],"ko":["GitHub 이슈","PR 코멘트","개발 효율성","코드 리뷰","협업 개발"],"es":["GitHub Issues","comentarios efectivos","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de software","colaboración en equipo","gestión de proyectos","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["GitHub Issues","commentaires efficaces","meilleures pratiques","développement de logiciels","collaboration d''équipe","gestion de projets","outils de développement"],"de":["GitHub Issues","effektive Kommentare","beste Praktiken","Software-Entwicklung","Team-Kollaboration","Projekt-Management","Entwicklungs-Tools"],"pt":["github issues","otimização de respostas","dicas de seo","desenvolvedores","experiência do usuário","qualidade das respostas","práticas recomendadas"],"ru":["github issues","оптимизация ответов","советы по seo","разработчики","пользовательский опыт","качество ответов","рекомендуемые практики"],"ar":["إشكالات جيثب","تحسين الإجابات","نصائح تحسين محركات البحث","مطورين","تجربة المستخدم","جودة الإجابات","ممارسات موصى بها"]}},"owner":"EpicenterHQ","repo":"epicenter","repoPath":"EpicenterHQ/epicenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-issues","description":"GitHub issue comment guidelines for community interaction. Use when responding to GitHub issues, bug reports, feature requests, or any GitHub discussion.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Issue & PR Comment Guidelines\n\n## Anti-Patterns (Avoid These)\n\n- **Over-structured responses**: Don''t use headers, numbered sections, or bullet lists for simple replies. A conversational paragraph is usually better.\n- **Formulaic openings**: Don''t start every comment identically. Match the tone to the conversation.\n- **Restating what''s obvious**: If someone asked a question, just answer it. Don''t recap what they said.\n- **Corporate announcements**: \"We are pleased to announce...\" — just","body":"# GitHub Issue & PR Comment Guidelines\n\n## Anti-Patterns (Avoid These)\n\n- **Over-structured responses**: Don''t use headers, numbered sections, or bullet lists for simple replies. A conversational paragraph is usually better.\n- **Formulaic openings**: Don''t start every comment identically. Match the tone to the conversation.\n- **Restating what''s obvious**: If someone asked a question, just answer it. Don''t recap what they said.\n- **Corporate announcements**: \"We are pleased to announce...\" — just say what changed.\n\nFollow [writing-voice](../writing-voice/SKILL.md) for tone.\n\nFollow [writing-voice](../writing-voice/SKILL.md) for tone.\n\n## Opening Pattern\n\nAlways start with a personal greeting using the user''s GitHub handle:\n\n- \"Hey @username, thank you for the issue\"\n- \"Hey everyone, thanks for the notice!\"\n- \"Hey all, thanks for the issue!\"\n\n## Core Elements\n\n### 1. Acknowledgment\n\n- Start by acknowledging their issue/contribution\n- Express empathy for problems: \"sorry to hear this!\", \"sorry to hear your shortcut was lost!\"\n- Apologize for delays: \"I apologize for the delayed response\"\n\n### 2. Good News Delivery\n\nWhen announcing features or fixes:\n\n- \"good news!\" or \"Good news!\"\n- Add celebration emoji sparingly\n- Credit contributors: \"Thank you for the inspiration\" or \"Thank you and @user1 and @user2 for the inspiration\"\n\n### 3. Debugging Offers\n\nFor complex issues, offer direct help:\n\n- \"If you have time, I would love to hop on a call with you, and we can debug this together\"\n- \"Let''s hop on a call sometime in the coming days, and I''ll debug it with you\"\n- Always include cal.com link: \"https://cal.com/epicenter/whispering\"\n- Add availability: \"I''m free as early as tomorrow\"\n\n### 4. Discord Promotion\n\nWhen appropriate, mention Discord:\n\n- \"PS: I''ve also recently created a Discord group, and I''d love for you to join! You can ping me directly for more features.\"\n- Include link: \"https://go.epicenter.so/discord\"\n\n### 5. Follow-up Questions\n\nAsk clarifying questions to understand the issue better:\n\n- \"To clarify, could you confirm that this issue persists even with the latest v7.1.0 installer?\"\n- \"Did you ever get a popup to grant permission to access recording devices?\"\n- \"Does this happen when you make recordings for more than 4 seconds?\"\n\n### 6. Closing\n\nEnd with gratitude:\n\n- \"Thank you!\"\n- \"Thanks again!\"\n- \"Thank you again for your help and will be taking a look!\"\n- \"My pleasure!\" (when thanked)\n\n## Response Examples\n\n### Feature Implementation Response\n\n```\nHey @username, thank you for the issue, and good news! [Whispering v7.1.0](link) now includes the [feature]! Thank you for the inspiration.\n\n[Brief description of how it works]\n\nPS: I''ve also recently created a Discord group, and I''d love for you to join! You can ping me directly for more features.\n\nhttps://go.epicenter.so/discord\n```\n\n### Debugging Response\n\n```\nHey @username, so sorry to hear this! I apologize for the delayed response; I was finalizing [the latest release v7.1.0](link).\n\nTo clarify, could you confirm that this issue persists even with the latest v7.1.0 installer?\n\nIf you have time, I would love to hop on a call with you, and we can debug this together. You can book a meeting with me using my cal.com link right here, I''m free as early as tomorrow:\n\nhttps://cal.com/epicenter/whispering\n\nThank you!\n```\n\n### Quick Acknowledgment\n\n```\nHey @username, sorry to hear [problem]! Did you ever get a fix?\n```\n\n### PR Discussion (back-and-forth)\n\n```\nGood catch! Updated to only clear the dev app cache in nuke mode.\n\nThe flow is now:\n- `bun clean`: artifacts and node_modules\n- `bun nuke`: above + Rust targets + dev cache\n\nLet me know if you want a confirmation prompt before clearing.\n```\n\n## Writing Style Notes\n\nSee [writing-voice](../writing-voice/SKILL.md) for punctuation and tone guidelines.\n\n- Use casual, approachable language\n- Be genuinely enthusiastic about user contributions\n- Reference specific users and give credit\n- Link to relevant issues, releases, or commits\n- Keep responses personal and conversational\n- Avoid corporate or overly formal language\n- PR comments can be brief: ongoing discussions don''t need full greetings/closings\n- Match the energy: short question gets short answer, detailed report gets detailed response\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:14:51.755Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing to manage and respond to GitHub issues and PR comments effectively.","zh":"非常适合需要有效管理和响应 GitHub 问题和 PR 评论的对话式代理。","ja":"GitHub の問題と PR のコメントを効果的に管理し、応答する必要がある会話エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 이슈와 PR 댓글을 효과적으로 관리하고 응답해야 하는 대화형 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Conversacionales que necesitan gestionar y responder a incidencias y comentarios de GitHub de manera efectiva.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Conversationnels ayant besoin de gérer et de répondre aux problèmes et commentaires GitHub de manière efficace.","de":"Perfekt für Conversational Agents, die GitHub-Probleme und PR-Kommentare effektiv verwalten und beantworten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conversação que precisam gerenciar e responder a problemas do GitHub e comentários de PR de forma eficaz.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Конверсационных Агентов, которым необходимо эффективно управлять и отвечать на проблемы GitHub и комментарии PR.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل المحادثة التي تحتاج إلى إدارة واستجابة لمشاكل جيت هاب وتعليقات طلبات السحب بشكل فعال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate conversational paragraphs, avoiding over-structured responses, formulaic openings, and restating obvious information, while matching the tone to the conversation and providing direct answers to questions, all within the context of GitHub issues and PR comments using markdown formatting.","zh":"赋予代理生成对话式段落的能力，避免过度结构化的响应、公式化的开头和重复明显的信息，同时使语气与对话相匹配，并在 GitHub 问题和 PR 评论的上下文中使用 Markdown 格式提供直接的答案。","ja":"会話エージェントに、会話式の文章を生成する能力を与え、過度に構造化された応答、式的な開幕、明らかな情報の繰り返しを避け、会話に合わせたトーンで直接的な質問に対する回答を GitHub の問題と PR のコメントのコンテキストで Markdown フォーマットを使用して提供する。","ko":"에이전트가 대화형 단락을 생성할 수 있도록 해주어 과도한 구조화된 응답, 공식적인 시작, 명백한 정보의 반복 등을 피하고 대화에 맞는 음调으로 직접적인 질문에 대한 답변을 GitHub 이슈와 PR 댓글의 contexto에서 Markdown 형식을 사용하여 제공할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar párrafos conversacionales, evitando respuestas sobre-estructuradas, aperturas formuladas y la reiteración de información obvia, al mismo tiempo que se ajusta el tono a la conversación y se proporcionan respuestas directas a las preguntas, todo dentro del contexto de los problemas y comentarios de GitHub utilizando formato markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des paragraphes conversationnels, en évitant les réponses trop structurées, les ouvertures formulaires et la répétition d''informations évidentes, tout en adaptant le ton à la conversation et en fournissant des réponses directes aux questions, le tout dans le contexte des problèmes et commentaires GitHub en utilisant le formatage markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, konversationelle Absätze zu generieren, indem sie über-strukturierte Antworten, formelhafte Einleitungen und die Wiederholung offensichtlicher Informationen vermeiden, während sie den Ton an die Konversation anpassen und direkte Antworten auf Fragen liefern, all dies im Kontext von GitHub-Problemen und PR-Kommentaren unter Verwendung von Markdown-Formatierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar parágrafos conversacionais, evitando respostas superestruturadas, aberturas formuladas e repetição de informações óbvias, ao mesmo tempo em que combina o tom com a conversa e fornece respostas diretas às perguntas, tudo dentro do contexto de problemas do GitHub e comentários de PR usando formatação markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать разговорные абзацы, избегая чрезмерно структурированных ответов, формульных открытий и повторения очевидной информации, а также соответствует тону разговора и обеспечивает прямые ответы на вопросы, все это в контексте проблем GitHub и комментариев PR с использованием форматирования markdown.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توليد فقرات محادثية، وتجنب الاستجابات المتشابهة الهيكلية والافتتاحيات الشكلية وإعادة informations واضحة، مع مطابقة النبرة للمحادثة وتقديم إجابات مباشرة للأسئلة، كل ذلك في سياق مشاكل جيت هاب وتعليقات طلبات السحب باستخدام تنسيق markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Responding to GitHub issues with conversational tone","Generating comments for PRs that avoid corporate announcements","Automating the process of answering frequent questions in GitHub issues"],"zh":["用对话式语气响应 GitHub 问题","生成避免公司公告的 PR 评论","自动回答 GitHub 问题中频繁出现的问题"],"ja":["会話式のトーンで GitHub の問題に応答する","企業広告を避けた PR のコメントを生成する","GitHub の問題で頻繁に発生する質問に自動で答える"],"ko":["대화형 음调으로 GitHub 이슈에 응답한다","기업 발표를 피하는 PR 댓글을 생성한다","GitHub 이슈에서 빈번하게 발생하는 질문에 자동으로 답한다"],"es":["Responder a incidencias de GitHub con un tono conversacional","Generar comentarios para PR que eviten anuncios corporativos","Automatizar el proceso de respuesta a preguntas frecuentes en incidencias de GitHub"],"fr":["Répondre aux problèmes GitHub avec un ton conversationnel","Générer des commentaires pour les PR qui évitent les annonces corporatives","Automatiser le processus de réponse aux questions fréquentes dans les problèmes GitHub"],"de":["Auf GitHub-Probleme mit konversationellem Ton antworten","Kommentare für PRs generieren, die corporate Bekanntmachungen vermeiden","Den Prozess der Beantwortung häufiger Fragen in GitHub-Problemen automatisieren"],"pt":["Responder a problemas do GitHub com tom conversacional","Gerar comentários para PRs que evitem anúncios corporativos","Automatizar o processo de responder a perguntas frequentes em problemas do GitHub"],"ru":["Отвечать на проблемы GitHub с разговорным тоном","Генерировать комментарии для PR, которые избегают корпоративных объявлений","Автоматизировать процесс ответа на часто задаваемые вопросы в проблемах GitHub"],"ar":["الاستجابة لمشاكل جيت هاب بنبرة محادثية","توليد تعليقات لطلبات السحب التي تتجنب الإعلانات الشركية","تأتمتة عملية الإجابة على الأسئلة الشائعة في مشاكل جيت هاب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of GitHub issues and PR comment guidelines","Limited to text-based responses"],"zh":["需要了解 GitHub 问题和 PR 评论的指导方针","仅限文本响应"],"ja":["GitHub の問題と PR のコメントのガイドラインの理解が必要","テキストベースの応答のみ"],"ko":["GitHub 이슈와 PR 댓글의 가이드라인을 이해해야 한다","텍스트 기반 응답만 가능"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de las directrices de incidencias y comentarios de GitHub","Limitado a respuestas basadas en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des directives de problèmes et commentaires GitHub","Limité aux réponses basées sur le texte"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für die Richtlinien von GitHub-Problemen und PR-Kommentaren","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Antworten"],"pt":["Requer entendimento das diretrizes de problemas do GitHub e comentários de PR","Limitado a respostas baseadas em texto"],"ru":["Требует понимания руководств по проблемам GitHub и комментариям PR","Ограничен текстовыми ответами"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم إرشادات مشاكل جيت هاب و تعليقات طلبات السحب","محدود بالاستجابات القائمة على النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
