я EUCORA","ar":"نماذج كوبرنيتس لـ EUCORA","en":"kubernetes-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Kubernetes 模式为 EUCORA 生产部署提供了标准化的应用工程、审批、打包和交付流程","ja":"Kubernetes パターンは、EUCORA 生産デプロイメントのためのアプリケーションエンジニアリング、承認、パッケージング、配信の標準化されたプロセスを提供します","ko":"쿠버네티스 패턴은 EUCORA 프로덕션 배포를 위한 애플리케이션 엔지니어링, 승인, 패키징 및 전달의 표준화된 프로세스를 제공합니다","es":"Patrones de Kubernetes para despliegues de producción de EUCORA, incluyendo estrategias de implementación y configuración","fr":"Modèles de Kubernetes pour les déploiements de production EUCORA, y compris les stratégies de déploiement et de configuration","de":"Kubernetes-Muster für EUCORA-Produktionsbereitstellungen, einschließlich Implementierungs- und Konfigurationsstrategien","pt":"Padrões de recursos do Kubernetes para implantações de produção do EUCORA, incluindo Deployments, Services, ConfigMaps e mais","ru":"Шаблоны ресурсов Kubernetes для производственных развертываний EUCORA, включая Deployments, Services, ConfigMaps и многое другое","ar":"نماذج موارد كوبرنيتس لعمليات النشر الإنتاجية لـ EUCORA، بما في ذلك Deployments و Services و ConfigMaps وغيرها","en":"EUCORA — End-User Computing Orchestration & Reliability Architecture — an AI-enabled control plane that standardizes how applications are engineered, approve..."},"definition":{"en":"EUCORA — End-User Computing Orchestration & Reliability Architecture — an AI-enabled control plane that standardizes how applications are engineered, approved, packaged, and delivered across our global endpoint estate."},"features":{"zh":["标准化的应用工程和审批流程","自动化的应用打包和交付","Kubernetes 资源模式的最佳实践","支持 RollingUpdate、健康探测和资源限制","支持 ClusterIP 和 LoadBalancer 服务","支持 External Secrets Operator 和 Vault"],"ja":["アプリケーションエンジニアリングと承認の標準化されたプロセス","自動化されたアプリケーションパッケージングと配信","Kubernetes リソース パターンのベスト プラクティス","RollingUpdate、ヘルス プローブ、リソース制限のサポート","ClusterIP と LoadBalancer サービスのサポート","External Secrets Operator と Vault のサポート"],"ko":["표준화된 애플리케이션 엔지니어링 및 승인 프로세스","자동화된 애플리케이션 패키징 및 전달","쿠버네티스 리소스 패턴의 최고의 관행","RollingUpdate, 건강 프로브 및 리소스 제한의 지원","ClusterIP 및 LoadBalancer 서비스의 지원","External Secrets Operator 및 Vault의 지원"],"es":["Despliegues con actualización continua","Sondeos de salud y límites de recursos","Servicios con ClusterIP y LoadBalancer","Configuración con ConfigMaps y Secretos","Ingress con nginx-ingress y cert-manager","Estrategia de recreación para Singleton"],"fr":["Déploiements avec mise à jour continue","Sondes de santé et limites de ressources","Services avec ClusterIP et LoadBalancer","Configuration avec ConfigMaps et Secrets","Ingress avec nginx-ingress et cert-manager","Stratégie de recréation pour Singleton"],"de":["Bereitstellungen mit kontinuierlicher Aktualisierung","Gesundheitsprüfungen und Ressourcenlimits","Dienste mit ClusterIP und LoadBalancer","Konfiguration mit ConfigMaps und Geheimnissen","Ingress mit nginx-ingress und cert-manager","Rekreationstrategie für Singleton"],"pt":["Padrões de implantação com RollingUpdate e health probes","Serviços com ClusterIP e LoadBalancer","ConfigMaps para configuração não sensível","Segredos com External Secrets Operator e Vault","Ingress com nginx-ingress e cert-manager"],"ru":["Шаблоны развертывания с RollingUpdate и health probes","Службы с ClusterIP и LoadBalancer","ConfigMaps для ненасыщенной конфигурации","Секреты с External Secrets Operator и Vault","Ingress с nginx-ingress и cert-manager"],"ar":["نماذج النشر مع RollingUpdate و health probes","خدمات مع ClusterIP و LoadBalancer","ConfigMaps للتحكم غير الحساس","أسرار مع External Secrets Operator و Vault","Ingress مع nginx-ingress و cert-manager"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kubernetes 模式","EUCORA 生产部署","Kubernetes 资源模式","自动化部署","可靠性工程","应用工程","审批流程","应用打包","应用交付"],"ja":["Kubernetes パターン","EUCORA 生産デプロイメント","Kubernetes リソース パターン","自動化デプロイメント","信頼性エンジニアリング","アプリケーションエンジニアリング","承認プロセス","アプリケーションパッケージング","アプリケーション配信"],"ko":["쿠버네티스 패턴","EUCORA 프로덕션 배포","쿠버네티스 리소스 패턴","자동화 배포","안정성 엔지니어링","애플리케이션 엔지니어링","승인 프로세스","애플리케이션 패키징","애플리케이션 전달"],"es":["patrones de kubernetes","eucora","despliegues de producción","estrategias de implementación","configuración de kubernetes","kubernetes para desarrolladores","desarrollo de aplicaciones en kubernetes","kubernetes en la nube","orquestación de contenedores"],"fr":["modèles de kubernetes","eucora","déploiements de production","stratégies de déploiement","configuration de kubernetes","kubernetes pour les développeurs","développement d''applications sur kubernetes","kubernetes dans le cloud","orchestration de conteneurs"],"de":["kubernetes-muster","eucora","produktionsbereitstellungen","implementierungsstrategien","konfiguration von kubernetes","kubernetes für entwickler","anwendungsentwicklung mit kubernetes","kubernetes in der cloud","container-orchestrierung"],"pt":["Kubernetes","EUCORA","Padrões de recursos","Implantação de produção","Deployments","Services","ConfigMaps","Segredos","Ingress"],"ru":["Kubernetes","EUCORA","Шаблоны ресурсов","Производственные развертывания","Deployments","Службы","ConfigMaps","Секреты","Ingress"],"ar":["كوبرنيتس","EUCORA","نماذج موارد","عمليات النشر الإنتاجية","Deployments","خدمات","ConfigMaps","أسرار","Ingress"]}},"owner":"buildworksai","repo":"EUCORA","repoPath":"buildworksai/EUCORA","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kubernetes-patterns","description":"Kubernetes deployment patterns for EUCORA including Deployments, Services, ConfigMaps, Secrets, Ingress, and Helm. Use when deploying to Kubernetes, configuring k8s resources, or managing container orchestration.","bodyPreview":"# Kubernetes Patterns\n\nKubernetes resource patterns for EUCORA production deployments.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Resource | Pattern |\n|----------|---------|\n| Deployments | RollingUpdate, health probes, resource limits |\n| Services | ClusterIP (internal), LoadBalancer (external) |\n| ConfigMaps | Non-sensitive configuration |\n| Secrets | External Secrets Operator + Vault |\n| Ingress | nginx-ingress + cert-manager |\n| Singleton | Recreate strategy (Celery Beat) |\n\n---\n\n## Deployment Patterns\n\n##","body":"# Kubernetes Patterns\n\nKubernetes resource patterns for EUCORA production deployments.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Resource | Pattern |\n|----------|---------|\n| Deployments | RollingUpdate, health probes, resource limits |\n| Services | ClusterIP (internal), LoadBalancer (external) |\n| ConfigMaps | Non-sensitive configuration |\n| Secrets | External Secrets Operator + Vault |\n| Ingress | nginx-ingress + cert-manager |\n| Singleton | Recreate strategy (Celery Beat) |\n\n---\n\n## Deployment Patterns\n\n### Standard API Deployment\n\n```yaml\n# k8s/backend-deployment.yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-api\n  namespace: eucora\n  labels:\n    app: eucora\n    component: api\nspec:\n  replicas: 3\n  strategy:\n    type: RollingUpdate\n    rollingUpdate:\n      maxSurge: 1\n      maxUnavailable: 0\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: eucora\n      component: api\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        app: eucora\n        component: api\n    spec:\n      serviceAccountName: eucora-api\n\n      containers:\n        - name: api\n          image: eucora/backend:latest\n          ports:\n            - containerPort: 8000\n              name: http\n\n          # Environment from ConfigMap/Secret\n          envFrom:\n            - configMapRef:\n                name: eucora-config\n            - secretRef:\n                name: eucora-secrets\n\n          # Health probes\n          livenessProbe:\n            httpGet:\n              path: /health/live/\n              port: http\n            initialDelaySeconds: 30\n            periodSeconds: 10\n            failureThreshold: 3\n\n          readinessProbe:\n            httpGet:\n              path: /health/ready/\n              port: http\n            initialDelaySeconds: 5\n            periodSeconds: 5\n            failureThreshold: 3\n\n          # Resource limits (MANDATORY)\n          resources:\n            requests:\n              cpu: 500m\n              memory: 512Mi\n            limits:\n              cpu: 1000m\n              memory: 1Gi\n\n          # Volume mounts\n          volumeMounts:\n            - name: static-files\n              mountPath: /app/staticfiles\n\n      volumes:\n        - name: static-files\n          persistentVolumeClaim:\n            claimName: eucora-static-pvc\n\n      # Pod anti-affinity for HA\n      affinity:\n        podAntiAffinity:\n          preferredDuringSchedulingIgnoredDuringExecution:\n            - weight: 100\n              podAffinityTerm:\n                labelSelector:\n                  matchLabels:\n                    app: eucora\n                    component: api\n                topologyKey: kubernetes.io/hostname\n```\n\n### Celery Worker Deployment\n\n```yaml\n# k8s/celery-worker-deployment.yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-celery-worker\n  namespace: eucora\nspec:\n  replicas: 2\n  strategy:\n    type: RollingUpdate\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: eucora\n      component: celery-worker\n  template:\n    spec:\n      containers:\n        - name: worker\n          image: eucora/backend:latest\n          command: [\"celery\", \"-A\", \"config\", \"worker\", \"-l\", \"info\", \"-c\", \"4\"]\n\n          envFrom:\n            - configMapRef:\n                name: eucora-config\n            - secretRef:\n                name: eucora-secrets\n\n          resources:\n            requests:\n              cpu: 250m\n              memory: 512Mi\n            limits:\n              cpu: 1000m\n              memory: 1Gi\n\n          # Liveness probe for worker\n          livenessProbe:\n            exec:\n              command:\n                - celery\n                - -A\n                - config\n                - inspect\n                - ping\n            initialDelaySeconds: 60\n            periodSeconds: 30\n            timeoutSeconds: 10\n```\n\n### Celery Beat (Singleton Pattern)\n\n```yaml\n# k8s/celery-beat-deployment.yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-celery-beat\n  namespace: eucora\nspec:\n  replicas: 1  # MUST be 1 - singleton\n  strategy:\n    type: Recreate  # Prevent duplicate schedulers\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: eucora\n      component: celery-beat\n  template:\n    spec:\n      containers:\n        - name: beat\n          image: eucora/backend:latest\n          command: [\"celery\", \"-A\", \"config\", \"beat\", \"-l\", \"info\"]\n\n          resources:\n            requests:\n              cpu: 100m\n              memory: 256Mi\n            limits:\n              cpu: 200m\n              memory: 512Mi\n```\n\n---\n\n## Service Patterns\n\n### ClusterIP (Internal)\n\n```yaml\n# k8s/api-service.yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-api\n  namespace: eucora\nspec:\n  type: ClusterIP\n  selector:\n    app: eucora\n    component: api\n  ports:\n    - name: http\n      port: 80\n      targetPort: 8000\n```\n\n### Headless Service (StatefulSets)\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-db-headless\nspec:\n  type: ClusterIP\n  clusterIP: None  # Headless\n  selector:\n    app: eucora\n    component: postgres\n  ports:\n    - port: 5432\n```\n\n---\n\n## ConfigMap and Secrets\n\n### ConfigMap (Non-Sensitive)\n\n```yaml\n# k8s/configmap.yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: ConfigMap\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-config\n  namespace: eucora\ndata:\n  DEBUG: \"False\"\n  ALLOWED_HOSTS: \"eucora.example.com\"\n  CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS: \"https://eucora.example.com\"\n  CELERY_BROKER_URL: \"redis://redis:6379/0\"\n  LOG_LEVEL: \"INFO\"\n```\n\n### External Secrets (Azure Key Vault)\n\n```yaml\n# k8s/external-secret.yaml\napiVersion: external-secrets.io/v1beta1\nkind: ExternalSecret\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-secrets\n  namespace: eucora\nspec:\n  refreshInterval: 1h\n  secretStoreRef:\n    name: azure-keyvault\n    kind: ClusterSecretStore\n  target:\n    name: eucora-secrets\n    creationPolicy: Owner\n  data:\n    - secretKey: DATABASE_URL\n      remoteRef:\n        key: eucora-database-url\n    - secretKey: SECRET_KEY\n      remoteRef:\n        key: eucora-django-secret-key\n    - secretKey: INTUNE_CLIENT_SECRET\n      remoteRef:\n        key: eucora-intune-client-secret\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ingress with TLS\n\n```yaml\n# k8s/ingress.yaml\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Ingress\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-ingress\n  namespace: eucora\n  annotations:\n    kubernetes.io/ingress.class: nginx\n    cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer: letsencrypt-prod\n    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/proxy-body-size: \"100m\"\n    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-redirect: \"true\"\nspec:\n  tls:\n    - hosts:\n        - eucora.example.com\n        - api.eucora.example.com\n      secretName: eucora-tls\n  rules:\n    - host: eucora.example.com\n      http:\n        paths:\n          - path: /\n            pathType: Prefix\n            backend:\n              service:\n                name: eucora-frontend\n                port:\n                  number: 80\n    - host: api.eucora.example.com\n      http:\n        paths:\n          - path: /\n            pathType: Prefix\n            backend:\n              service:\n                name: eucora-api\n                port:\n                  number: 80\n```\n\n---\n\n## PersistentVolumeClaims\n\n```yaml\n# k8s/pvc.yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: PersistentVolumeClaim\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-static-pvc\n  namespace: eucora\nspec:\n  accessModes:\n    - ReadWriteMany\n  storageClassName: azure-file\n  resources:\n    requests:\n      storage: 10Gi\n---\napiVersion: v1\nkind: PersistentVolumeClaim\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-media-pvc\n  namespace: eucora\nspec:\n  accessModes:\n    - ReadWriteMany\n  storageClassName: azure-file\n  resources:\n    requests:\n      storage: 50Gi\n```\n\n---\n\n## Namespace and RBAC\n\n```yaml\n# k8s/namespace.yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora\n  labels:\n    name: eucora\n    environment: production\n---\napiVersion: v1\nkind: ServiceAccount\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-api\n  namespace: eucora\n---\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Role\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-api-role\n  namespace: eucora\nrules:\n  - apiGroups: [\"\"]\n    resources: [\"configmaps\", \"secrets\"]\n    verbs: [\"get\", \"list\"]\n---\napiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\nkind: RoleBinding\nmetadata:\n  name: eucora-api-rolebinding\n  namespace: eucora\nsubjects:\n  - kind: ServiceAccount\n    name: eucora-api\nroleRef:\n  kind: Role\n  name: eucora-api-role\n  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io\n```\n\n---\n\n## Health Probes\n\n| Probe | Purpose | When Fails |\n|-------|---------|------------|\n| **Liveness** | Is container alive? | Restart container |\n| **Readiness** | Can accept traffic? | Remove from Service |\n| **Startup** | Still starting? | Delay liveness checks |\n\n```yaml\nlivenessProbe:\n  httpGet:\n    path: /health/live/\n    port: 8000\n  initialDelaySeconds: 30\n  periodSeconds: 10\n  failureThreshold: 3\n\nreadinessProbe:\n  httpGet:\n    path: /health/ready/\n    port: 8000\n  initialDelaySeconds: 5\n  periodSeconds: 5\n  failureThreshold: 3\n\nstartupProbe:\n  httpGet:\n    path: /health/live/\n    port: 8000\n  initialDelaySeconds: 10\n  periodSeconds: 10\n  failureThreshold: 30  # 5 min startup window\n```\n\n---\n\n## Helm Values (Reference)\n\n```yaml\n# values.yaml\nreplicaCount: 3\n\nimage:\n  repository: eucora/backend\n  tag: latest\n  pullPolicy: Always\n\nresources:\n  requests:\n    cpu: 500m\n    memory: 512Mi\n  limits:\n    cpu: 1000m\n    memory: 1Gi\n\ningress:\n  enabled: true\n  className: nginx\n  annotations:\n    cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer: letsencrypt-prod\n  hosts:\n    - host: eucora.example.com\n      paths:\n        - path: /\n          pathType: Prefix\n  tls:\n    - secretName: eucora-tls\n      hosts:\n        - eucora.example.com\n\npostgresql:\n  enabled: true\n  auth:\n    existingSecret: eucora-secrets\n    secretKeys:\n      adminPasswordKey: POSTGRES_PASSWORD\n\nredis:\n  enabled: true\n  auth:\n    enabled: false\n```\n\n---\n\n## Commands Reference\n\n```bash\n# Apply manifests\nkubectl apply -f k8s/namespace.yaml\nkubectl apply -f k8s/\n\n# Check deployment status\nkubectl get deployments -n eucora\nkubectl rollout status deployment/eucora-api -n eucora\n\n# View logs\nkubectl logs -f deployment/eucora-api -n eucora\n\n# Scale deployment\nkubectl scale deployment/eucora-api --replicas=5 -n eucora\n\n# Rollback\nkubectl rollout undo deployment/eucora-api -n eucora\n\n# Debug pod\nkubectl exec -it deployment/eucora-api -n eucora -- /bin/bash\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ FORBIDDEN | ✅ CORRECT |\n|--------------|------------|\n| No resource limits | Always set limits |\n| No health probes | Liveness + readiness mandatory |\n| Secrets in ConfigMap | Use External Secrets |\n| Root containers | Run as non-root user |\n| Single replica for API | ≥3 replicas for HA |\n| Multiple Celery Beat | Exactly 1 replica (Recreate) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:14:54.800Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing standardized Kubernetes resource management and deployment patterns.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化Kubernetes资源管理和部署模式的DevOps代理。","ja":"Kubernetesリソース管理および展開パターンの標準化を必要とするDevOpsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 Kubernetes 리소스 관리 및 배포 패턴이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión y patrones de implementación de recursos de Kubernetes estandarizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion et de modèles de déploiement de ressources Kubernetes standardisés.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine standardisierte Verwaltung und Bereitstellungsmodelle für Kubernetes-Ressourcen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes DevOps que necessitam de gestão de recursos do Kubernetes padronizados e padrões de implantação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым необходима стандартизированная управление ресурсами Kubernetes и шаблоны развертывания.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة موارد Kubernetes ومخططات النشر المعتمدة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate EUCORA production deployments with RollingUpdate, health probes, and resource limits using Kubernetes Deployments, Services, and ConfigMaps, while securing sensitive data with External Secrets Operator and Vault.","zh":"赋予代理以RollingUpdate、健康探针和资源限制使用Kubernetes Deployments、Services和ConfigMaps来编排EUCORA生产部署，同时使用External Secrets Operator和Vault保护敏感数据。","ja":"RollingUpdate、ヘルスプローブ、リソース制限を使用してKubernetes Deployments、Services、ConfigMapsでEUCORAのプロダクション展開をオーケストレーションし、External Secrets OperatorとVaultで機密データを保護することが代理者に可能になります。","ko":"RollingUpdate, 헬스 프로브 및 리소스 제한을 사용하여 Kubernetes Deployments, Services 및 ConfigMaps로 EUCORA 프로덕션 배포를 오케스트레이션하고, External Secrets Operator 및 Vault로 민감한 데이터를 보호하는 에이전트를 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a orquestar despliegues de producción de EUCORA con RollingUpdate, sondas de salud y límites de recursos utilizando implementaciones de Kubernetes, servicios y ConfigMaps, mientras se protege los datos sensibles con External Secrets Operator y Vault.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer les déploiements de production EUCORA avec RollingUpdate, les sondes de santé et les limites de ressources en utilisant les déploiements Kubernetes, les services et les ConfigMaps, tout en sécurisant les données sensibles avec External Secrets Operator et Vault.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, EUCORA-Produktionsbereitstellungen mit RollingUpdate, Gesundheitsprüfungen und Ressourcenlimits mithilfe von Kubernetes-Bereitstellungen, -Diensten und -ConfigMaps zu orchestrieren, während sensible Daten mit External Secrets Operator und Vault gesichert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar implantações de produção EUCORA com RollingUpdate, sondas de saúde e limites de recursos usando implantações do Kubernetes, Serviços e ConfigMaps, enquanto protege dados sensíveis com External Secrets Operator e Vault.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать производственные развертывания EUCORA с RollingUpdate, пробами здоровья и ограничениями ресурсов с использованием развертываний Kubernetes, сервисов и конфигурационных карт, одновременно защищая конфиденциальные данные с помощью External Secrets Operator и Vault.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من اوركسترا توزيعات الإنتاج EUCORA مع RollingUpdate واختبارات الصحة ومحددات الموارد باستخدام عمليات النشر في Kubernetes والخدمات والخرائط التكوينية، مع حماية البيانات الحساسة مع External Secrets Operator و Vault"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating deployment rollouts with RollingUpdate strategy","Configuring ClusterIP and LoadBalancer Services for internal and external access","Securing sensitive configuration with External Secrets Operator and Vault"],"zh":["使用RollingUpdate策略自动执行部署滚动更新","配置ClusterIP和LoadBalancer Services用于内部和外部访问","使用External Secrets Operator和Vault保护敏感配置"],"ja":["RollingUpdate戦略を使用して展開のローリングアップデートを自動化する","ClusterIPとLoadBalancer Servicesを内部および外部アクセスのために構成する","External Secrets OperatorとVaultを使用して機密構成を保護する"],"ko":["RollingUpdate 전략을 사용하여 배포 롤아웃을 자동화하는 것","클러스터 IP 및 로드 밸런서 서비스를 내부 및 외부 액세스를 위한 구성","External Secrets Operator 및 Vault를 사용하여 민감한 구성 보호"],"es":["Automatizar las implementaciones de despliegue con la estrategia RollingUpdate","Configurar los servicios ClusterIP y LoadBalancer para el acceso interno y externo","Proteger la configuración sensible con External Secrets Operator y Vault"],"fr":["Automatiser les déploiements de mise à jour avec la stratégie RollingUpdate","Configurer les services ClusterIP et LoadBalancer pour l''accès interne et externe","Sécuriser la configuration sensible avec External Secrets Operator et Vault"],"de":["Automatisieren von Bereitstellungsrollouts mit der RollingUpdate-Strategie","Konfigurieren von ClusterIP- und LoadBalancer-Diensten für internen und externen Zugriff","Sichern von sensibler Konfiguration mit External Secrets Operator und Vault"],"pt":["Automatizar lançamentos de implantação com estratégia RollingUpdate","Configurar Serviços ClusterIP e LoadBalancer para acesso interno e externo","Proteger configuração sensível com External Secrets Operator e Vault"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывание роллов с стратегией RollingUpdate","Настроить сервисы ClusterIP и LoadBalancer для внутреннего и внешнего доступа","Защитить конфиденциальную конфигурацию с помощью External Secrets Operator и Vault"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات النشر مع استراتيجية RollingUpdate","تكوين خدمات ClusterIP و LoadBalancer للوصول الداخلي والخارجي","حماية التكوين الحساس مع External Secrets Operator و Vault"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kubernetes cluster setup","Limited to EUCORA production deployments","Dependent on nginx-ingress and cert-manager for Ingress management"],"zh":["需要Kubernetes集群设置","仅限EUCORA生产部署","依赖nginx-ingress和cert-manager进行Ingress管理"],"ja":["Kubernetesクラスタセットアップが必要","EUCORAのプロダクション展開のみ","Ingress管理のためにnginx-ingressとcert-managerに依存"],"ko":["Kubernetes 클러스터 설정이 필요함","EUCORA 프로덕션 배포만 해당","Ingress 관리를 위해 nginx-ingress 및 cert-manager에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de clúster de Kubernetes","Limitado a despliegues de producción de EUCORA","Dependiente de nginx-ingress y cert-manager para la gestión de Ingress"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de cluster Kubernetes","Limité aux déploiements de production EUCORA","Dépend de nginx-ingress et cert-manager pour la gestion des Ingress"],"de":["Benötigt eine Kubernetes-Cluster-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf EUCORA-Produktionsbereitstellungen","Abhängig von nginx-ingress und cert-manager für die Ingress-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Exige configuração do cluster do Kubernetes","Limitado a implantações de produção EUCORA","Dependente de nginx-ingress e cert-manager para gerenciamento de Ingress"],"ru":["Требует настройки кластера Kubernetes","Ограничен производственными развертываниями EUCORA","Зависит от nginx-ingress и cert-manager для управления Ingress"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد клаستر Kubernetes","محدود بتوزيعات الإنتاج EUCORA","يعتمد على nginx-ingress و cert-manager لإدارة Ingress"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('MhL5/mhl5.vercel.app/tiptap', 'community', 'MhL5', 'mhl5.vercel.app', 'MhL5/mhl5.vercel.app', 'tiptap', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:15:15.469Z', NULL, '{"id":"MhL5/mhl5.vercel.app/tiptap","name":"tiptap","description":{"zh":"Tiptap是一个高性能的富文本编辑器，支持React 19+、Tailwind v4和shadcn/ui。快速开始使用Tiptap，只需5分钟","ja":"Tiptapは高性能のリッチテキストエディターで、React 19+、Tailwind v4、shadcn/uiをサポートします。Tiptapを使用して5分で開始","ko":"Tiptap은 고성능 리치 텍스트 편집기로 React 19+, Tailwind v4 및 shadcn/ui를 지원합니다. Tiptap으로 5분만에 시작하십시오","es":"Tiptap es un editor de texto enriquecido para Next.js que ofrece funcionalidades personalizables y es compatible con shadcn registry.","fr":"Tiptap est un éditeur de texte enrichi pour Next.js qui propose des fonctionnalités personnalisables et est compatible avec shadcn registry.","de":"Tiptap ist ein Rich-Text-Editor für Next.js, der anpassbare Funktionen bietet und mit shadcn registry kompatibel ist.","pt":"O Tiptap é um editor de texto rico para Next.js, permitindo a criação de conteúdo personalizado com facilidade","ru":"Tiptap - это редактор богатого текста для Next.js, позволяющий создавать пользовательский контент с легкостью","ar":"ت프트اب هو محرر نص غني ل Next.js، يسمح بإنشاء محتوى مخصص بسهولة","en":"Next js 16 Portfolio with custom shadcn registry"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tiptap富文本编辑器 - 下一代编辑器解决方案","ja":"Tiptapリッチテキストエディター - 次世代のエディター溶","ko":"Tiptap 리치 텍스트 편집기 - 차세대 편집기 솔루션","es":"Tiptap: Editor de texto enriquecido para Next.js","fr":"Tiptap : Éditeur de texte enrichi pour Next.js","de":"Tiptap: Rich-Text-Editor für Next.js","pt":"Tiptap Editor: Ferramenta de Texto Enriquecido para Next.js","ru":"Tiptap Редактор: Инструмент для Создания Богатого Текста ...","ar":"ت프트اب محرر: أداة النص الغني ل Next.js","en":"tiptap"},"description":{"zh":"Tiptap是一个高性能的富文本编辑器，支持React 19+、Tailwind v4和shadcn/ui。快速开始使用Tiptap，只需5分钟","ja":"Tiptapは高性能のリッチテキストエディターで、React 19+、Tailwind v4、shadcn/uiをサポートします。Tiptapを使用して5分で開始","ko":"Tiptap은 고성능 리치 텍스트 편집기로 React 19+, Tailwind v4 및 shadcn/ui를 지원합니다. Tiptap으로 5분만에 시작하십시오","es":"Tiptap es un editor de texto enriquecido para Next.js que ofrece funcionalidades personalizables y es compatible con shadcn registry.","fr":"Tiptap est un éditeur de texte enrichi pour Next.js qui propose des fonctionnalités personnalisables et est compatible avec shadcn registry.","de":"Tiptap ist ein Rich-Text-Editor für Next.js, der anpassbare Funktionen bietet und mit shadcn registry kompatibel ist.","pt":"O Tiptap é um editor de texto rico para Next.js, permitindo a criação de conteúdo personalizado com facilidade","ru":"Tiptap - это редактор богатого текста для Next.js, позволяющий создавать пользовательский контент с легкостью","ar":"ت프트اب هو محرر نص غني ل Next.js، يسمح بإنشاء محتوى مخصص بسهولة","en":"Next js 16 Portfolio with custom shadcn registry"},"definition":{"en":"Next js 16 Portfolio with custom shadcn registry"},"features":{"zh":["支持React 19+","支持Tailwind v4","支持shadcn/ui","高性能","可定制"],"ja":["React 19+をサポート","Tailwind v4をサポート","shadcn/uiをサポート","高性能","カスタマイズ可能"],"ko":["React 19+ 지원","Tailwind v4 지원","shadcn/ui 지원","고성능","사용자 정의 가능"],"es":["Compatibilidad con Next.js 16","Registro personalizado de shadcn","Soporte para React 19+","Integración con Tailwind v4","Funcionalidades de edición de texto avanzadas"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec Next.js 16","Registre personnalisé de shadcn","Prise en charge de React 19+","Intégration avec Tailwind v4","Fonctionnalités d''édition de texte avancées"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Next.js 16","Benutzerdefiniertes shadcn-Register","Unterstützung für React 19+","Integration mit Tailwind v4","Erweiterte Textbearbeitungsfunktionen"],"pt":["Editor de texto rico personalizável","Integração com Next.js","Suporte a React 19+","Uso de Tailwind v4","Registro personalizado com shadcn/ui"],"ru":["Пользовательский редактор богатого текста","Интеграция с Next.js","Поддержка React 19+","Использование Tailwind v4","Пользовательский реестр с shadcn/ui"],"ar":["محرر نص غني قابل للتخصيص","التكامل مع Next.js","دعم React 19+","استخدام Tailwind v4","السجل المخصص مع shadcn/ui"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tiptap","富文本编辑器","React","Tailwind","shadcn/ui","高性能","可定制"],"ja":["Tiptap","リッチテキストエディター","React","Tailwind","shadcn/ui","高性能","カスタマイズ可能"],"ko":["Tiptap","리치 텍스트 편집기","React","Tailwind","shadcn/ui","고성능","사용자 정의 가능"],"es":["Tiptap","Next.js","editor de texto enriquecido","shadcn registry","React 19+","Tailwind v4","desarrollo web","edición de texto avanzada"],"fr":["Tiptap","Next.js","éditeur de texte enrichi","shadcn registry","React 19+","Tailwind v4","développement web","édition de texte avancée"],"de":["Tiptap","Next.js","Rich-Text-Editor","shadcn-Register","React 19+","Tailwind v4","Webentwicklung","erweiterte Textbearbeitung"],"pt":["Tiptap","Next.js","Editor de texto rico","React 19+","Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","Desenvolvimento web","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Tiptap","Next.js","Редактор богатого текста","React 19+","Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","Веб-разработка","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["ت프트اب","Next.js","محرر نص غني","React 19+","Tailwind v4","shadcn/ui","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"MhL5","repo":"mhl5.vercel.app","repoPath":"MhL5/mhl5.vercel.app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tiptap","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```","body":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- `@tiptap/pm` is required peer dependency (ProseMirror engine)\n- StarterKit bundles 20+ essential extensions (headings, lists, bold, italic, etc.)\n- Image/color/typography are common additions not in StarterKit\n\n**Important**: If using Tiptap v3.14.0+, drag handle functionality requires minimum v3.14.0 (regression fixed in that release). For Pro extensions with drag handles, React 18 is recommended due to tippyjs-react dependency.\n\n### 2. Create SSR-Safe Editor\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor, EditorContent } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\n\nexport function Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    content: ''<p>Hello World!</p>'',\n    immediatelyRender: false, // ⚠️ CRITICAL for SSR/Next.js\n    editorProps: {\n      attributes: {\n        class: ''prose prose-sm focus:outline-none min-h-[200px] p-4'',\n      },\n    },\n  })\n\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- **Always set `immediatelyRender: false`** for Next.js/SSR apps (prevents hydration mismatch)\n- Without this, you''ll see: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n- This is the #1 error reported by Tiptap users\n\n### 3. Add Tailwind Typography (Optional but Recommended)\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tailwindcss/typography\n```\n\nUpdate your `tailwind.config.ts`:\n```typescript\nimport typography from ''@tailwindcss/typography''\n\nexport default {\n  plugins: [typography],\n}\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Provides default prose styling for headings, lists, links, etc.\n- Without it, formatted content looks unstyled\n- Alternative: Use custom Tailwind classes with `.tiptap` selector\n\n---\n\n## The 3-Step Setup Process\n\n### Step 1: Choose Your Integration Method\n\n**Option A: shadcn Minimal Tiptap Component (Recommended)**\n\nInstall the pre-built shadcn component:\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap/main/registry/block-registry.json\n```\n\nThis installs:\n- Fully-featured editor component with toolbar\n- Image upload support\n- Code block with syntax highlighting\n- Typography extension configured\n- Dark mode support\n\n**Option B: Build Custom Editor (Full Control)**\n\nUse templates from this skill:\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal editor setup\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Option A: Faster setup, opinionated UI\n- Option B: Complete customization, headless approach\n- Both work with React + Tailwind v4\n\n### Step 2: Configure Extensions\n\nExtensions add functionality to your editor:\n\n```typescript\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport Image from ''@tiptap/extension-image''\nimport Link from ''@tiptap/extension-link''\nimport Typography from ''@tiptap/extension-typography''\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      // Customize built-in extensions\n      heading: {\n        levels: [1, 2, 3],\n      },\n      bulletList: {\n        keepMarks: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Image.configure({\n      inline: true,\n      allowBase64: false, // ⚠️ Prevent base64 bloat\n      resize: {\n        enabled: true,\n        directions: [''top-right'', ''bottom-right'', ''bottom-left'', ''top-left''],\n        minWidth: 100,\n        minHeight: 100,\n        alwaysPreserveAspectRatio: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Link.configure({\n      openOnClick: false,\n      HTMLAttributes: {\n        class: ''text-primary underline'',\n      },\n    }),\n    Typography, // Smart quotes, dashes, etc.\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- Set `allowBase64: false` to prevent huge JSON payloads\n- Use upload handler pattern (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n- Extension order matters - dependencies must load first\n\n### Step 3: Handle Image Uploads (If Needed)\n\n**Pattern**: Base64 preview → background upload → replace with URL\n\nSee `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` for full implementation:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Editor } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nasync function uploadImageToR2(file: File, env: Env): Promise<string> {\n  // 1. Create base64 preview for immediate display\n  const reader = new FileReader()\n  const base64 = await new Promise<string>((resolve) => {\n    reader.onload = () => resolve(reader.result as string)\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file)\n  })\n\n  // 2. Insert preview into editor\n  editor.chain().focus().setImage({ src: base64 }).run()\n\n  // 3. Upload to R2 in background\n  const formData = new FormData()\n  formData.append(''file'', file)\n\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/upload'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    body: formData,\n  })\n\n  const { url } = await response.json()\n\n  // 4. Replace base64 with permanent URL\n  editor.chain()\n    .focus()\n    .updateAttributes(''image'', { src: url })\n    .run()\n\n  return url\n}\n```\n\n**Why this pattern:**\n- Immediate user feedback (preview)\n- No database bloat from base64\n- Works with Cloudflare R2\n- Graceful error handling\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n✅ Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` for SSR apps\n✅ Install `@tailwindcss/typography` for prose styling\n✅ Use upload handler for images (not base64)\n✅ Memoize editor configuration to prevent re-renders\n✅ Include `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency\n\n### Never Do\n\n❌ Use `immediatelyRender: true` (default) with Next.js/SSR\n❌ Store images as base64 in database (use URL after upload)\n❌ Forget to add `prose` classes to editor container\n❌ Load more than 100 widgets in collaborative mode\n❌ Use Create React App (v3 incompatible - use Vite)\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **7** documented issues:\n\n### Issue #1: SSR Hydration Mismatch\n**Error**: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856), [#5602](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5602)\n**Why It Happens**: Default `immediatelyRender: true` breaks Next.js hydration\n**Prevention**: Template includes `immediatelyRender: false` by default\n\n### Issue #2: Editor Re-renders on Every Keystroke\n**Error**: Laggy typing, poor performance in large documents\n**Source**: [Tiptap Performance Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor#immediatelyrender)\n**Why It Happens**: `useEditor()` hook re-renders component on every change\n**Prevention**: Use `useEditorState()` hook or memoization patterns (see templates)\n\n### Issue #3: Tailwind Typography Not Working\n**Error**: Headings/lists render unstyled, no formatting visible\n**Source**: [shadcn Tiptap Discussion](https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/discussions/1729)\n**Why It Happens**: Missing `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n**Prevention**: Skill includes typography plugin installation in checklist\n\n### Issue #4: Image Upload Base64 Bloat\n**Error**: JSON payloads become megabytes, slow saves, database bloat\n**Source**: [Tiptap Image Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions/nodes/image#usage)\n**Why It Happens**: Default allows base64, no upload handler configured\n**Prevention**: R2 upload template with URL replacement pattern\n\n### Issue #5: Build Errors in Create React App\n**Error**: \"jsx-runtime\" module resolution errors after upgrading to v3\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6812](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6812)\n**Why It Happens**: CRA incompatibility with v3 module structure\n**Prevention**: Skill documents Vite as preferred bundler + provides working config\n\n### Issue #6: ProseMirror Multiple Versions Conflict\n**Error**: `Error: Looks like multiple versions of prosemirror-model were loaded`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #577](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/577) (131 comments), [Issue #6171](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6171)\n**Why It Happens**: Installing additional Tiptap extensions can pull different versions of prosemirror-model or prosemirror-view, creating duplicate dependencies in node_modules. The unique-id extension is particularly problematic in testing environments.\n**Prevention**: Use package resolutions to force a single ProseMirror version\n\n```json\n// package.json\n{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"prosemirror-model\": \"~1.21.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-view\": \"~1.33.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-state\": \"~1.4.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOr reinstall dependencies:\n```bash\nrm -rf node_modules package-lock.json\nnpm install\n```\n\n**Note**: The @tiptap/pm package is designed to prevent this issue, but extensions may still introduce conflicts.\n\n### Issue #7: EditorProvider vs useEditor Confusion (Community-sourced)\n**Error**: `SSR has been detected, please set ''immediatelyRender'' explicitly to ''false''` (when both used together)\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856 Comment](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856#issuecomment-2493124171)\n**Why It Happens**: Users commonly use EditorProvider and useEditor together, but EditorProvider is a wrapper around useEditor for React Context setup - they should not be used simultaneously.\n**Prevention**: Choose one pattern only\n\n**Incorrect Pattern**:\n```typescript\n// Don''t use both together\n<EditorProvider>\n  <MyComponent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  const editor = useEditor({ ... }) // ❌ Wrong - EditorProvider already created editor\n}\n```\n\n**Correct Patterns**:\n```typescript\n// Option 1: Use EditorProvider only\n<EditorProvider immediatelyRender={false} extensions={[StarterKit]}>\n  <EditorContent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\n// Option 2: Use useEditor only\nfunction Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    immediatelyRender: false,\n  })\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Files Reference\n\n### Tailwind Prose Styling (tiptap-prose.css)\n\n```css\n/* Apply to editor container */\n.tiptap {\n  /* Tailwind Typography */\n  @apply prose prose-sm sm:prose-base lg:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none;\n\n  /* Custom overrides */\n  h1 {\n    @apply text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    @apply text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    @apply my-4 text-base leading-7;\n  }\n\n  ul, ol {\n    @apply my-4 ml-6;\n  }\n\n  code {\n    @apply bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono;\n  }\n\n  pre {\n    @apply bg-muted p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto;\n  }\n\n  blockquote {\n    @apply border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Why these settings:**\n- `prose` classes provide consistent formatting\n- `dark:prose-invert` handles dark mode automatically\n- Custom overrides use semantic Tailwind v4 colors\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Collaborative Editing with Y.js\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport Collaboration from ''@tiptap/extension-collaboration''\nimport * as Y from ''yjs''\n\nconst ydoc = new Y.Doc()\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      history: false, // Disable history for collaboration\n    }),\n    Collaboration.configure({\n      document: ydoc,\n    }),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**When to use**: Real-time multi-user editing (Notion-like)\n**See**: `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` for full example\n\n### Pattern 2: Markdown Support\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport { Markdown } from ''@tiptap/markdown''\n\n// Load editor with markdown content\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [StarterKit, Markdown],\n  content: ''# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown**!'',\n  contentType: ''markdown'',  // ⚠️ CRITICAL: Must specify or content parsed as HTML\n  immediatelyRender: false,\n})\n\n// Get markdown from editor\nconst markdownOutput = editor.getMarkdown()\n\n// Insert markdown content\neditor.commands.setContent(''## New heading'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\neditor.commands.insertContent(''**Bold** text'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\n```\n\n**When to use**: Storing content as markdown, displaying/editing rich text\n**Install**: `npm install @tiptap/markdown@3.16.0`\n**Status**: Beta (released Oct 2025, API stable but may change)\n**CRITICAL**: Always specify `contentType: ''markdown''` when setting markdown content\n\n**Recent Fixes** (v3.15.0-v3.16.0):\n- Fixed incorrect Markdown output when underline is mixed with bold/italic and ranges don''t fully overlap\n- Improved serialization for overlapping formatting marks\n- Source: [v3.16.0 Release](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/releases/tag/v3.16.0)\n\n### Pattern 3: Form Integration with react-hook-form\n\n```typescript\nimport { useForm, Controller } from ''react-hook-form''\n\nfunction BlogForm() {\n  const { control, handleSubmit } = useForm()\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)}>\n      <Controller\n        name=\"content\"\n        control={control}\n        render={({ field }) => (\n          <Editor\n            content={field.value}\n            onUpdate={({ editor }) => {\n              field.onChange(editor.getHTML())\n            }}\n          />\n        )}\n      />\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**When to use**: Blog posts, comments, any form-based content\n\n---\n\n## Using Bundled Resources\n\n### Scripts (scripts/)\n\nNo executable scripts for this skill.\n\n### Templates (templates/)\n\n**Required for all projects:**\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal React editor component\n- `templates/package.json` - Required dependencies\n\n**Optional based on needs:**\n- `templates/minimal-tiptap-setup.sh` - shadcn component installation\n- `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` - R2 upload handler\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n- `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` - Y.js collaboration\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n\n**When to load these**: Claude should reference templates when user asks to:\n- Set up tiptap editor\n- Add image uploads\n- Configure collaborative editing\n- Style with Tailwind prose\n\n### References (references/)\n\n- `references/tiptap-docs.md` - Key documentation links\n- `references/common-errors.md` - Error troubleshooting guide\n- `references/extension-catalog.md` - Popular extensions list\n\n**When Claude should load these**: Troubleshooting errors, exploring extensions, understanding API\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Topics\n\n### Custom Extensions\n\nCreate your own Tiptap extensions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Node } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nconst CustomNode = Node.create({\n  name: ''customNode'',\n\n  group: ''block'',\n\n  content: ''inline*'',\n\n  parseHTML() {\n    return [{ tag: ''div[data-custom]'' }]\n  },\n\n  renderHTML({ HTMLAttributes }) {\n    return [''div'', { ''data-custom'': '''', ...HTMLAttributes }, 0]\n  },\n\n  addCommands() {\n    return {\n      insertCustomNode: () => ({ commands }) => {\n        return commands.insertContent({ type: this.name })\n      },\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Custom widgets, embeds, interactive elements\n\n### Slash Commands\n\nAdd Notion-like `/` commands:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Extension } from ''@tiptap/core''\nimport Suggestion from ''@tiptap/suggestion''\n\nconst SlashCommands = Extension.create({\n  name: ''slashCommands'',\n\n  addOptions() {\n    return {\n      suggestion: {\n        char: ''/'',\n        items: ({ query }) => {\n          return [\n            { title: ''Heading 1'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).setHeading({ level: 1 }).run()\n            }},\n            { title: ''Bullet List'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).toggleBulletList().run()\n            }},\n          ]\n        },\n      },\n    }\n  },\n\n  addProseMirrorPlugins() {\n    return [Suggestion({ editor: this.editor, ...this.options.suggestion })]\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Productivity shortcuts, quick formatting\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n**Required**:\n- `@tiptap/react@^3.16.0` - React integration (React 19 supported)\n- `@tiptap/starter-kit@^3.16.0` - Essential extensions bundle\n- `@tiptap/pm@^3.16.0` - ProseMirror peer dependency\n- `react@^19.0.0` - React framework\n\n**React Version Compatibility**:\n- **Core Tiptap**: Supports React 19 as of v2.10.0\n- **UI Components**: Work best with React 18 (Next.js 15 recommended per [official docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/getting-started/install/nextjs))\n- **Pro Extensions**: May require React 18 - drag-handle extension depends on archived tippyjs-react without React 19 support ([Issue #5876](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5876))\n\n**Optional**:\n- `@tiptap/extension-audio@^3.16.0` - Audio support (NEW in v3.16.0)\n- `@tiptap/extension-image@^3.16.0` - Image support\n- `@tiptap/extension-link@^3.16.0` - Link support (NEW in v3, included in StarterKit)\n- `@tiptap/extension-color@^3.16.0` - Text color\n- `@tiptap/extension-typography@^3.16.0` - Smart typography\n- `@tiptap/extension-collaboration@^3.16.0` - Real-time collaboration\n- `@tiptap/extension-markdown@^3.16.0` - Markdown support (Beta)\n- `@tailwindcss/typography@^0.5.19` - Prose styling\n- `yjs@^13.6.0` - Collaborative editing backend\n- `react-medium-image-zoom@^5.2.0` - Image zoom functionality\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **Tiptap**: https://tiptap.dev\n- **Installation Guide**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/installation/react\n- **Extensions**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions\n- **API Reference**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: https://github.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap\n- **Context7 Library ID**: tiptap/tiptap\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-21)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@tiptap/react\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/starter-kit\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/pm\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-audio\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-image\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-color\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-text-style\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-typography\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-link\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-markdown\": \"^3.16.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@tailwindcss/typography\": \"^0.5.19\",\n    \"react\": \"^19.2.3\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"^19.2.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Example\n\nThis skill is based on real-world implementations:\n- **GitLab**: Uses Tiptap for issue/MR descriptions\n- **Statamic CMS**: Tiptap as default rich text editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: 3.14M downloads/week\n\n**Token Savings**: ~71% (14k → 4k tokens)\n**Errors Prevented**: 7/7 documented errors (5 critical setup + 2 community patterns)\n**Validation**: ✅ SSR compatibility, ✅ Image uploads, ✅ Tailwind v4, ✅ Performance, ✅ React 19 compatibility\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Problem: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Solution**: Add `immediatelyRender: false` to your `useEditor()` config\n\n### Problem: Headings/lists look unstyled\n**Solution**: Install `@tailwindcss/typography` and add `prose` classes to editor container\n\n### Problem: Editor lags when typing\n**Solution**: Use `useEditorState()` hook instead of `useEditor()` for read-only rendering, or memoize editor configuration\n\n### Problem: Images make JSON huge\n**Solution**: Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension config and use upload handler (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n\n### Problem: Build fails in Create React App\n**Solution**: Switch to Vite - CRA incompatible with Tiptap v3. See cloudflare-worker-base skill for Vite setup.\n\n---\n\n## Complete Setup Checklist\n\nUse this checklist to verify your setup:\n\n- [ ] Installed `@tiptap/react`, `@tiptap/starter-kit`, `@tiptap/pm`\n- [ ] Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` config\n- [ ] Installed `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n- [ ] Added `prose` classes to editor container\n- [ ] Configured image upload handler (if using images)\n- [ ] Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension\n- [ ] Editor renders without hydration errors\n- [ ] Formatted text displays correctly (headings, lists, etc.)\n- [ ] Dev server runs without TypeScript errors\n- [ ] Production build succeeds\n\n---\n\n**Questions? Issues?**\n\n1. Check `references/common-errors.md` for troubleshooting\n2. Verify `immediatelyRender: false` is set\n3. Check official docs: https://tiptap.dev\n4. Ensure `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency is installed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:15:15.469Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced rich text editing capabilities with React and Tailwind integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级富文本编辑功能的前端代理，特别是与 React 和 Tailwind 集成的场景。","ja":"React と Tailwind の統合を必要とするフロントエンドエージェント向けの高度なリッチテキスト編集機能に最適です。","ko":"React와 Tailwind 통합이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트를 위한 고급 리치 텍스트 편집 기능에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de edición de texto rico avanzadas con integración de React y Tailwind.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de modification de texte enrichi avancées avec une intégration de React et Tailwind.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Funktionen für die Bearbeitung von Rich-Text benötigen, mit Integration von React und Tailwind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de edição de texto rico com integração do React e Tailwind.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности редактирования форматированного текста с интеграцией React и Tailwind.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تحرير النص الغني المتقدمة مع تكامل React و Tailwind."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create customized rich text editors using @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, and @tiptap/pm, with support for extensions like image, color, text style, and typography, all managed through a custom shadcn registry.","zh":"赋予代理创建自定义富文本编辑器的能力，使用 @tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit 和 @tiptap/pm，并支持诸如图像、颜色、文本样式和排版等扩展，所有这些都通过自定义的 shadcn 注册表进行管理。","ja":"@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit、@tiptap/pm を使用して、カスタム富テキストエディターを作成するエージェントを可能にし、画像、色、テキストスタイル、タイポグラフィなどの拡張機能をサポートし、すべてをカスタムの shadcn レジストリで管理します。","ko":"@tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, @tiptap/pm을 사용하여 커스텀 리치 텍스트 편집기를 생성하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 이미지, 색상, 텍스트 스타일, 타이포그래피 등의 확장 기능을 지원하며, 모든 것을 커스텀 shadcn 레지스트리에서 관리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear editores de texto rico personalizados utilizando @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit y @tiptap/pm, con soporte para extensiones como imagen, color, estilo de texto y tipografía, todas gestionadas a través de un registro personalizado de shadcn.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des éditeurs de texte enrichi personnalisés en utilisant @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit et @tiptap/pm, avec une prise en charge des extensions telles que l''image, la couleur, le style de texte et la typographie, toutes gérées via un registre shadcn personnalisé.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Rich-Text-Editoren mit @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit und @tiptap/pm zu erstellen, mit Unterstützung für Erweiterungen wie Bild, Farbe, Textstil und Typografie, die alle über ein benutzerdefiniertes shadcn-Register verwaltet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar editores de texto rico personalizados usando @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit e @tiptap/pm, com suporte a extensões como imagem, cor, estilo de texto e tipografia, todos gerenciados por meio de um registro personalizado shadcn.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать индивидуальные редакторы форматированного текста, используя @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit и @tiptap/pm, с поддержкой расширений, таких как изображение, цвет, стиль текста и типография, все управляемые через пользовательский реестр shadcn.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء محررين لنص غني مخصصين باستخدام @tiptap/react و @tiptap/starter-kit و @tiptap/pm، مع دعم لمكملات مثل الصورة واللون وأسلوب النص والطباعة، جميعها يتم إدارتها من خلال سجل مخصص shadcn."},"useCases":{"en":["Customizing rich text editors for Next.js applications","Integrating @tiptap/extension-image for image handling","Utilizing @tiptap/extension-color for text color customization"],"zh":["为 Next.js 应用程序自定义富文本编辑器","集成 @tiptap/extension-image 进行图像处理","利用 @tiptap/extension-color 进行文本颜色自定义"],"ja":["Next.js アプリケーションのための富テキストエディターのカスタマイズ","@tiptap/extension-image の統合による画像処理","@tiptap/extension-color を使用したテキスト色のカスタマイズ"],"ko":["Next.js 애플리케이션을 위한 리치 텍스트 편집기 커스텀","@tiptap/extension-image를 사용한 이미지 처리","@tiptap/extension-color를 사용한 텍스트 색상 커스텀"],"es":["Personalizar editores de texto rico para aplicaciones Next.js","Integrar @tiptap/extension-image para el manejo de imágenes","Utilizar @tiptap/extension-color para la personalización del color del texto"],"fr":["Personnaliser les éditeurs de texte enrichi pour les applications Next.js","Intégrer @tiptap/extension-image pour la gestion des images","Utiliser @tiptap/extension-color pour la personnalisation de la couleur du texte"],"de":["Rich-Text-Editoren für Next.js-Anwendungen anpassen","Integration von @tiptap/extension-image für die Bildverwaltung","Verwendung von @tiptap/extension-color für die Anpassung der Textfarbe"],"pt":["Personalizar editores de texto rico para aplicativos Next.js","Integrar @tiptap/extension-image para manipulação de imagens","Utilizar @tiptap/extension-color para personalização da cor do texto"],"ru":["Настройка редакторов форматированного текста для приложений Next.js","Интеграция @tiptap/extension-image для обработки изображений","Использование @tiptap/extension-color для настройки цвета текста"],"ar":["تخصيص محررات النص الغني لتطبيقات Next.js","دمج @tiptap/extension-image لمعالجة الصور","استخدام @tiptap/extension-color لتخصيص لون النص"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React 19+, Tailwind v4, and shadcn/ui","Dependent on @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, and @tiptap/pm versions"],"zh":["需要 React 19+、Tailwind v4 和 shadcn/ui","依赖于 @tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit 和 @tiptap/pm 版本"],"ja":["React 19+、Tailwind v4、shadcn/ui が必要","@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit、@tiptap/pm のバージョンに依存"],"ko":["React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui가 필요","@tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, @tiptap/pm 버전에 의존"],"es":["Requiere React 19+, Tailwind v4 y shadcn/ui","Dependiente de las versiones de @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit y @tiptap/pm"],"fr":["Nécessite React 19+, Tailwind v4 et shadcn/ui","Dépendant des versions de @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit et @tiptap/pm"],"de":["Benötigt React 19+, Tailwind v4 und shadcn/ui","Abhängig von den Versionen von @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit und @tiptap/pm"],"pt":["Exige React 19+, Tailwind v4 e shadcn/ui","Dependente das versões @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit e @tiptap/pm"],"ru":["Требует React 19+, Tailwind v4 и shadcn/ui","Зависит от версий @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit и @tiptap/pm"],"ar":["يتطلب React 19+ و Tailwind v4 و shadcn/ui","يعتمد على إصدارات @tiptap/react و @tiptap/starter-kit و @tiptap/pm"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
