,"Conexión y firma de wallets con Freighter","Creación y envío de transacciones","Emisión y gestión de activos en Stellar","Uso de SDK de cliente en JavaScript, Python, Go y Rust"],"fr":["Développement de contrats intelligents avec Soroban","Développement de frontend avec React, Next.js et Node.js","Connexion et signature de wallets avec Freighter","Création et envoi de transactions","Émission et gestion d''actifs sur Stellar","Utilisation de SDK de client en JavaScript, Python, Go et Rust"],"de":["Entwicklung von Smart Contracts mit Soroban","Entwicklung von Frontend mit React, Next.js und Node.js","Verbindung und Unterschrift von Wallets mit Freighter","Erstellung und Senden von Transaktionen","Ausgabe und Verwaltung von Assets auf Stellar","Verwendung von Client-SDKs in JavaScript, Python, Go und Rust"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de contratos inteligentes com Soroban","Integração de carteiras com Freighter","Criação e gerenciamento de ativos na Stellar","Uso de SDKs de cliente em JavaScript, Python, Go e Rust","Verificação de provas de conhecimento zero","Desenvolvimento de frontend com React, Next.js e Node.js"],"ru":["Разработка умных контрактов с помощью Soroban","Интеграция кошельков с Freighter","Создание и управление активами на Stellar","Использование клиентских SDK на JavaScript, Python, Go и Rust","Проверка доказательств с нулевым знанием","Разработка frontend с помощью React, Next.js и Node.js"],"ar":["تطوير العقود الذكية مع سوروبان","تكامل المحافظ مع فريتر","إنشاء وإدارة الأصول على ستيلار","استخدام SDKs العميل في جافاسكريبت، بايثون، جو وروست","تحقق من براهين المعرفة الصفري","تطوير واجهة المستخدم مع رياكت، نكست.جس وノود.جس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Stellar 开发","Soroban 智能合约","Stellar dApp","钱包连接","交易构建","Stellar 资产","零知识证明","区块链开发","Web3 开发"],"ja":["Stellar 開発","Soroban スマートコントラクト","Stellar dApp","ウォレット接続","トランザクション構築","Stellar アセット","零知識証明","ブロックチェーン開発","Web3 開発"],"ko":["스텔라 개발","소로반 스마트 컨트랙트","스텔라 dApp","월렛 연결","트랜잭션 구축","스텔라 자산","零知識證明","블록체인 개발","Web3 개발"],"es":["desarrollo stellar","soroban","contratos inteligentes","wallets","transacciones","activos en stellar","sdk de cliente","javascript","python","go","rust"],"fr":["développement stellar","soroban","contrats intelligents","wallets","transactions","actifs sur stellar","sdk de client","javascript","python","go","rust"],"de":["stellar-entwicklung","soroban","smart contracts","wallets","transaktionen","assets auf stellar","client-sdk","javascript","python","go","rust"],"pt":["desenvolvimento stellar","soroban","contratos inteligentes","integração de carteiras","stellar asset","sdk cliente","prova de conhecimento zero","react","next.js","node.js"],"ru":["разработка на stellar","soroban","умные контракты","интеграция кошельков","активы на stellar","клиентские sdk","доказательства с нулевым знанием","react","next.js","node.js"],"ar":["تطوير ستيلار","سوروبان","عقود ذكية","تكامل المحافظ","أصول ستيلار","sdk عميل","براهين المعرفة الصفري","رياكت","نكست.جس","نود.جس"]}},"owner":"kindfi-org","repo":"kindfi","repoPath":"kindfi-org/kindfi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"stellar-dev","description":"End-to-end Stellar development playbook. Covers Soroban smart contracts (Rust SDK), Stellar CLI, JavaScript/Python/Go SDKs for client apps, Stellar RPC (preferred) and Horizon API (legacy), Stellar Assets vs Soroban tokens (SAC bridge), wallet integration (Freighter, Stellar Wallets Kit), smart accounts with passkeys, status-sensitive zero-knowledge proof patterns, testing strategies, security patterns, and common pitfalls. Optimized for payments, asset tokenization, DeFi, privacy-aware applications, and financial applications. Use when building on Stellar, Soroban, or working with XLM, Stellar Assets, trustlines, anchors, SEPs, ZK proofs, or the Stellar RPC/Horizon APIs.","bodyPreview":"# Stellar Development Skill (Soroban-first)\n\n## What this Skill is for\n\nUse this Skill when the user asks for:\n\n- Soroban smart contract development (Rust)\n- Stellar dApp frontend work (React / Next.js / Node.js)\n- Wallet connection + signing flows (Freighter, etc.)\n- Transaction building / sending / confirmation\n- Stellar Asset issuance and management\n- Client SDK usage (JavaScript, Python, Go, Rust)\n- Zero-knowledge proof verification (where supported by target network/protocol)\n- Privacy-pres","body":"# Stellar Development Skill (Soroban-first)\n\n## What this Skill is for\n\nUse this Skill when the user asks for:\n\n- Soroban smart contract development (Rust)\n- Stellar dApp frontend work (React / Next.js / Node.js)\n- Wallet connection + signing flows (Freighter, etc.)\n- Transaction building / sending / confirmation\n- Stellar Asset issuance and management\n- Client SDK usage (JavaScript, Python, Go, Rust)\n- Zero-knowledge proof verification (where supported by target network/protocol)\n- Privacy-preserving applications (privacy pools, confidential tokens)\n- Local testing and deployment\n- Security hardening and audit-style reviews\n\n## What this Skill is NOT for\n\n- Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, or other non-Stellar blockchain development\n- Stellar node/validator operation (see [validators docs](https://developers.stellar.org/docs/validators))\n- General Rust programming unrelated to Soroban\n- Stellar protocol governance or CAP authoring\n\n## Default stack decisions (opinionated)\n\n### 1. Smart Contracts: Soroban (Rust)\n\n- Use Soroban SDK (`soroban-sdk` crate) for all smart contract development\n- Contracts compile to WebAssembly (WASM)\n- Use `#![no_std]` - standard library not available\n- 64KB contract size limit - use release optimizations\n- Prefer Stellar Assets over custom token contracts when possible\n\n### 2. Client SDK: stellar-sdk (JavaScript) first\n\n- Use `@stellar/stellar-sdk` for browser and Node.js applications\n- Supports both Stellar RPC and legacy Horizon API\n- Full transaction building, signing, and submission\n- Soroban contract deployment and invocation\n\n### 3. API Access: Stellar RPC first (Horizon legacy-focused)\n\n- **Prefer Stellar RPC** for new projects (JSON-RPC, real-time state)\n- **Horizon API** remains available for legacy compatibility and historical-query workflows\n- RPC: 7-day history for most methods; `getLedgers` queries back to genesis (Infinite Scroll)\n- Use Hubble/Galexie for comprehensive historical data beyond RPC\n\n### 4. Token Strategy: Stellar Assets first\n\n- **Prefer Stellar Assets** (classic issuance + trustlines) for fungible tokens\n- Built-in ecosystem support (wallets, exchanges, anchors)\n- Stellar Asset Contracts (SAC) provide Soroban interoperability\n- Use custom Soroban tokens only for complex logic requirements\n\n### 5. Testing\n\n- **Local**: Use Stellar Quickstart Docker for local network\n- **Testnet**: Use Testnet with Friendbot for funding\n- **Unit tests**: Compile to native for fast iteration\n- **Integration tests**: Deploy to local/testnet\n\n### 6. Wallet Integration\n\n- **Freighter** is the primary browser wallet\n- Use Stellar Wallets Kit for multi-wallet support\n- Wallet Standard for consistent connection patterns\n\n### 7. Freshness policy\n\n- Verify volatile facts (protocol support, RPC endpoints, CAP/SEP status, SDK API changes) against official docs before asserting them as current.\n\n## Operating procedure (how to execute tasks)\n\n### 1. Classify the task layer\n\n- Smart contract layer (Soroban/Rust)\n- Client SDK/scripts layer (JS/Python/Go)\n- Frontend/wallet layer\n- Asset management layer (issuance, trustlines)\n- Testing/CI layer\n- Infrastructure (RPC/Horizon/indexing)\n\n### Quick routing\n\n- Need custom on-chain logic? → [contracts-soroban.md](contracts-soroban.md)\n- Building a frontend/dApp? → [frontend-stellar-sdk.md](frontend-stellar-sdk.md)\n- Issuing or managing tokens? → [stellar-assets.md](stellar-assets.md)\n- Zero-knowledge proofs or privacy? → [zk-proofs.md](zk-proofs.md)\n- Setting up tests/CI? → [testing.md](testing.md)\n- Querying chain data or indexing? → [api-rpc-horizon.md](api-rpc-horizon.md) (also see [Data Docs](https://developers.stellar.org/docs/data))\n- Security review? → [security.md](security.md)\n- Hit an error? → [common-pitfalls.md](common-pitfalls.md)\n- Need upgrade/factory/governance/DeFi architecture patterns? → [advanced-patterns.md](advanced-patterns.md)\n- Need SEP/CAP guidance and standards links? → [standards-reference.md](standards-reference.md)\n\n### 2. Pick the right building blocks\n\n- Contracts: Soroban Rust SDK + Stellar CLI\n- Frontend: stellar-sdk (JS) + Freighter/Wallets Kit\n- Backend: stellar-sdk (JS/Python/Go) + RPC\n- Assets: Classic operations or SAC for Soroban interop\n- Testing: Quickstart (local) or Testnet\n\n### 3. Implement with Stellar-specific correctness\n\nAlways be explicit about:\n\n- Network passphrase (Mainnet vs Testnet vs local)\n- Source account + sequence number\n- Fee + resource limits (for Soroban)\n- Authorization requirements\n- Trustline status for assets\n- Contract storage types (temporary vs persistent vs instance)\n\n### 4. Add tests\n\n- Unit tests: Native compilation with `#[test]`\n- Integration tests: Local Quickstart or Testnet\n- Contract tests: Use `Env` from soroban-sdk\n- Frontend tests: Mock wallet/RPC interactions\n\n### 5. Deliverables expectations\n\nWhen you implement changes, provide:\n\n- Exact files changed + diffs\n- Commands to install/build/test/deploy\n- Network configuration (passphrase, RPC endpoint)\n- Risk notes for signing/fees/storage/authorization\n\n## Progressive disclosure (read when needed)\n\n- Smart contracts: [contracts-soroban.md](contracts-soroban.md)\n- Frontend + wallets: [frontend-stellar-sdk.md](frontend-stellar-sdk.md)\n- Testing strategy: [testing.md](testing.md)\n- Stellar Assets: [stellar-assets.md](stellar-assets.md)\n- Zero-knowledge proofs: [zk-proofs.md](zk-proofs.md)\n- API access (RPC/Horizon): [api-rpc-horizon.md](api-rpc-horizon.md)\n- Security checklist: [security.md](security.md)\n- Common pitfalls: [common-pitfalls.md](common-pitfalls.md)\n- Advanced architecture patterns: [advanced-patterns.md](advanced-patterns.md)\n- SEP/CAP standards map: [standards-reference.md](standards-reference.md)\n- Ecosystem projects: [ecosystem.md](ecosystem.md)\n- Reference links: [resources.md](resources.md)\n\n## Keywords\n\nstellar, soroban, xlm, smart contracts, rust, wasm, webassembly, rpc, horizon,\nfreighter, stellar-sdk, soroban-sdk, stellar-cli, trustline, anchor, sep, passkey,\nsmart wallet, sac, stellar asset contract, defi, token, nft, scaffold stellar, constructor, upgrade, factory, governance, standards,\nzero-knowledge, zk, zk-snark, groth16, bn254, poseidon, pairing, privacy, confidential, noir, risc zero, privacy pool, merkle tree\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:15:12.822Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Blockchain Agents specializing in Stellar network development and Soroban smart contract deployment.","zh":"非常适合专门从事Stellar网络开发和Soroban智能合约部署的区块链代理。","ja":"Stellarネットワーク開発とSorobanスマートコントラクトのデプロイを専門とするブロックチェーンエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Stellar 네트워크 개발 및 Soroban 스마트 계약 배포를 전문으로 하는 블록체인 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Blockchain especializados en desarrollo de red Stellar y despliegue de contratos inteligentes Soroban.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Blockchain spécialisés dans le développement de réseaux Stellar et le déploiement de contrats intelligents Soroban.","de":"Perfekt für Blockchain-Agents, die auf Stellar-Netzwerk-Entwicklung und Soroban-Smart-Contract-Deployment spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Blockchain especializados no desenvolvimento da rede Stellar e na implantação de contratos inteligentes Soroban.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов блокчейна, специализирующихся на разработке сети Stellar и развертывании умных контрактов Soroban.","ar":"مثالي لعميل بلوكشين المتخصص في تطوير شبكة ستيلار وتحديث عقود سموبان الذكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build and manage Stellar dApps with milestone-based escrows, leveraging React, Next.js, and Node.js for frontend development, while utilizing Client SDKs in JavaScript, Python, Go, and Rust for seamless transaction handling and asset management.","zh":"赋予代理构建和管理Stellar dApps的能力，采用里程碑式的托管，利用React、Next.js和Node.js进行前端开发，同时利用JavaScript、Python、Go和Rust的客户端SDK实现无缝的交易处理和资产管理。","ja":"Stellar dAppsを構築および管理するエージェントを可能にし、React、Next.js、Node.jsを使用したフロントエンド開発を里程碑ベースのエスクローで行い、JavaScript、Python、Go、RustのクライアントSDKを使用してスムーズな取引処理と資産管理を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Stellar dApps를 구축 및 관리할 수 있도록 하며, React, Next.js 및 Node.js를 사용한 프론트엔드 개발을 里程碑 기반의 에스크로에서 진행하며, JavaScript, Python, Go 및 Rust의 클라이언트 SDK를 사용하여 무결점의 트랜잭션 처리 및 자산 관리를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y gestionar dApps de Stellar con escrows basados en hitos, aprovechando React, Next.js y Node.js para el desarrollo frontend, mientras utiliza SDK de cliente en JavaScript, Python, Go y Rust para un manejo de transacciones y gestión de activos sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des dApps Stellar avec des escrows basés sur des étapes, en exploitant React, Next.js et Node.js pour le développement frontend, tout en utilisant des SDK clients en JavaScript, Python, Go et Rust pour un traitement de transactions et une gestion d''actifs sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Stellar-dApps mit meilensteinbasierten Escrows zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem React, Next.js und Node.js für die Frontend-Entwicklung genutzt werden, während Client-SDKs in JavaScript, Python, Go und Rust für eine nahtlose Transaktionsverarbeitung und Vermögensverwaltung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir e gerenciar dApps Stellar com escrows baseados em marcos, aproveitando React, Next.js e Node.js para o desenvolvimento frontend, enquanto utiliza SDKs de cliente em JavaScript, Python, Go e Rust para um tratamento de transações e gerenciamento de ativos sem interrupções.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать и управлять dApps Stellar с эскроу на основе вех, используя React, Next.js и Node.js для разработки frontend, а также использует клиентские SDK на JavaScript, Python, Go и Rust для бесшовного xử lý транзакций и управления активами.","ar":"يمكن للعميل بناء وتشغيل تطبيقات ستيلار داب مع إدارة الإسكات المعتمدة على المراحل، واستخدام رياكت ونكست دوت js ونود دوت js لتطوير الواجهة الأمامية، في حين استخدام SDK العميل في جافاسكريبت وبايثون وغو وروست للتعامل مع المعاملات وإدارة الأصول بشكل متماسك."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing Soroban smart contracts in Rust for secure and efficient transaction processing","Implementing wallet connection and signing flows using Freighter for streamlined user experience","Building and managing Stellar assets with advanced issuance and management capabilities"],"zh":["使用Rust开发Soroban智能合约，实现安全高效的交易处理","使用Freighter实现钱包连接和签名流程，提供流畅的用户体验","构建和管理Stellar资产，具有高级发行和管理能力"],"ja":["Rustを使用してSorobanスマートコントラクトを開発し、安全で効率的な取引処理を実現する","Freighterを使用してウォレット接続と署名フローを実装し、スムーズなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供する","Stellar資産を構築および管理し、高度な発行および管理機能を備える"],"ko":["Rust를 사용하여 Soroban 스마트 계약을 개발하여 보안 및 효율적인 트랜잭션 처리를 구현합니다.","Freighter를 사용하여 지갑 연결 및 서명 흐름을 구현하여 원활한 사용자 경험을 제공합니다.","Stellar 자산을 구축 및 관리하며, 고급 발행 및 관리 기능을 제공합니다."],"es":["Desarrollar contratos inteligentes Soroban en Rust para un procesamiento de transacciones seguro y eficiente","Implementar flujos de conexión y firma de wallet utilizando Freighter para una experiencia de usuario fluida","Crear y gestionar activos Stellar con capacidades de emisión y gestión avanzadas"],"fr":["Développer des contrats intelligents Soroban en Rust pour un traitement de transactions sécurisé et efficace","Mettre en œuvre des flux de connexion et de signature de portefeuille en utilisant Freighter pour une expérience utilisateur fluide","Créer et gérer des actifs Stellar avec des capacités d''émission et de gestion avancées"],"de":["Soroban-Smart-Contracts in Rust für sichere und effiziente Transaktionsverarbeitung entwickeln","Wallet-Verbindungs- und Signierflüsse mit Freighter für eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung implementieren","Stellar-Assets mit erweiterten Ausgabe- und Verwaltungsfunktionen erstellen und verwalten"],"pt":["Desenvolver contratos inteligentes Soroban em Rust para processamento de transações seguro e eficiente","Implementar fluxos de conexão e assinatura de carteira usando Freighter para experiência do usuário simplificada","Construir e gerenciar ativos Stellar com capacidades avançadas de emissão e gerenciamento"],"ru":["Разрабатывать умные контракты Soroban на Rust для безопасной и эффективной обработки транзакций","Реализовывать потоки подключения и подписи кошелька с использованием Freighter для упрощения пользовательского опыта","Создавать и управлять активами Stellar с расширенными возможностями выпуска и управления"],"ar":["تطوير عقود سموبان الذكية بلغة روست للتعاملات الآمنة والمتماسكة","تنفيذ تدفقات الاتصال والتوقيع للمحفظة باستخدام فريتير لتجربة المستخدم المبسطة","بناء وتشغيل أصول ستيلار مع إمكانيات متقدمة للصك والتشغيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Rust for Soroban smart contract development","Limited to Stellar network and compatible protocols","Dependent on Client SDK availability for specific programming languages"],"zh":["需要Rust知识来开发Soroban智能合约","仅限于Stellar网络和兼容协议","依赖客户端SDK的可用性来支持特定的编程语言"],"ja":["Sorobanスマートコントラクトの開発にはRustの知識が必要","Stellarネットワークと互換性のあるプロトコルにのみ制限される","特定のプログラミング言語をサポートするためにクライアントSDKの可用性に依存する"],"ko":["Soroban 스마트 계약 개발을 위해 Rust 지식이 필요합니다.","Stellar 네트워크 및 호환 프로토콜에만 제한됩니다.","특정 프로그래밍 언어를 지원하기 위해 클라이언트 SDK의 가용성에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Rust para el desarrollo de contratos inteligentes Soroban","Limitado a la red Stellar y protocolos compatibles","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de SDK de cliente para lenguajes de programación específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Rust pour le développement de contrats intelligents Soroban","Limité au réseau Stellar et aux protocoles compatibles","Dépend de la disponibilité des SDK clients pour les langages de programmation spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Rust für die Entwicklung von Soroban-Smart-Contracts","Begrenzt auf das Stellar-Netzwerk und kompatible Protokolle","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit von Client-SDKs für bestimmte Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Rust para desenvolvimento de contratos inteligentes Soroban","Limitado à rede Stellar e protocolos compatíveis","Dependente da disponibilidade do SDK do cliente para linguagens de programação específicas"],"ru":["Требует знания Rust для разработки умных контрактов Soroban","Ограничен сетью Stellar и совместимыми протоколами","Зависит от наличия клиентского SDK для конкретных языков программирования"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بلغة روست لتطوير عقود سموبان الذكية","محدود بشبكة ستيلار والبروتوكولات المتوافقة","يعتمد على توافر SDK العميل لأي لغة برمجة محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yspreen/dotfiles/asc-build-lifecycle', 'community', 'yspreen', 'dotfiles', 'yspreen/dotfiles', 'asc-build-lifecycle', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:16:01.038Z', NULL, '{"id":"yspreen/dotfiles/asc-build-lifecycle","name":"asc-build-lifecycle","description":{"zh":"ASC 构建生命周期管理Skill 用于管理构建状态、处理和保留","ja":"ASC ビルド ライフサイクル管理Skill はビルド状態、処理、保留を管理するために使用","ko":"ASC 빌드 라이프사이클 관리 Skill은 빌드 상태, 처리 및 보존을 관리하는 데 사용","es":"ASC Build Lifecycle es una habilidad que permite gestionar el estado de compilación, procesamiento y retención. Ayuda a encontrar la compilación correcta y a gestionar flujos de distribución de manera efectiva.","fr":"ASC Build Lifecycle est une compétence qui permet de gérer l''état de compilation, le traitement et la rétention. Elle aide à trouver la bonne compilation et à gérer les flux de distribution de manière efficace.","de":"ASC Build Lifecycle ist eine Fähigkeit, die es ermöglicht, den Build-Zustand, die Verarbeitung und die Aufbewahrung zu verwalten. Sie hilft dabei, die richtige Build zu finden und Distribution-Flows effektiv zu verwalten.","pt":"O ASC Build Lifecycle é uma habilidade que permite gerenciar o estado de compilação, processamento e retenção. Use comandos para encontrar a compilação certa e inspecionar o estado de processamento.","ru":"ASC Build Lifecycle — это навык, который позволяет управлять состоянием сборки, обработки и хранения. Используйте команды, чтобы найти правильную сборку и просмотреть состояние обработки.","ar":"ASC Build Lifecycle هو مهارة يسمح بإدارة حالة البناء والمعالجة والاحتفاظ. استخدم أوامر لfinding البناء الصحيح وتفحص حالة المعالجة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ASC 构建生命周期管理","ja":"ASC ビルド ライフサイクル管理","ko":"ASC 빌드 라이프사이클 관리","es":"ASC Build Lifecycle: Gestión de Ciclo de Vida de Compilación","fr":"ASC Build Lifecycle : Gestion du Cy