"Traitement et rétention de compilations","Recherche de la bonne compilation","Gestion des flux de distribution","Prise en charge des plates-formes comme IOS","Intégration avec des outils de distribution comme TestFlight"],"de":["Verwaltung des Build-Zustands","Verarbeitung und Aufbewahrung von Builds","Suche nach der richtigen Build","Verwaltung von Distribution-Flows","Unterstützung für Plattformen wie IOS","Integration mit Distributionstools wie TestFlight"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado de compilação","Processamento de compilação","Retenção de compilação","Encontrar a compilação certa","Inspecionar o estado de processamento","Fluxos de distribuição"],"ru":["Управление состоянием сборки","Обработка сборки","Хранение сборки","Найти правильную сборку","Просмотреть состояние обработки","Потоки распространения"],"ar":["إدارة حالة البناء","معالجة البناء","الاحتفاظ بالبناء","العثور على البناء الصحيح","تفحص حالة المعالجة","تدفقات التوزيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ASC 构建生命周期管理","构建状态管理","构建处理","构建保留","最新构建查询","最近构建列表查询","构建信息查询"],"ja":["ASC ビルド ライフサイクル管理","ビルド状態の管理","ビルドリクエストの処理","ビルドレコードの保留","最新ビルドの照会","最近のビルドリストの照会","ビルド情報の照会"],"ko":["ASC 빌드 라이프사이클 관리","빌드 상태 관리","빌드 요청 처리","빌드 기록 보존","최신 빌드 조회","최근 빌드 목록 조회","빌드 정보 조회"],"es":["ASC Build Lifecycle","gestión de compilación","ciclo de vida de la compilación","estado de compilación","procesamiento de compilación","retención de compilación","distribución de aplicaciones","TestFlight","IOS"],"fr":["ASC Build Lifecycle","gestion de compilation","cycle de vie de la compilation","état de compilation","traitement de compilation","rétention de compilation","distribution d''applications","TestFlight","IOS"],"de":["ASC Build Lifecycle","Build-Management","Lebenszyklus von Builds","Build-Zustand","Build-Verarbeitung","Build-Aufbewahrung","App-Verteilung","TestFlight","IOS"],"pt":["ASC Build Lifecycle","gerenciamento de compilação","estado de compilação","processamento de compilação","retenção de compilação","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","compilação de aplicativos"],"ru":["ASC Build Lifecycle","управление сборкой","состояние сборки","обработка сборки","хранение сборки","разработка приложений","сборка приложений"],"ar":["ASC Build Lifecycle","إدارة البناء","حالة البناء","معالجة البناء","الاحتفاظ بالبناء","تطوير التطبيقات","بناء التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"yspreen","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"yspreen/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"asc-build-lifecycle","description":"Track build processing, find latest builds, and clean up old builds with asc. Use when managing build retention or waiting on processing.","bodyPreview":"# ASC Build Lifecycle\n\nUse this skill to manage build state, processing, and retention.\n\n## Find the right build\n- Latest build:\n  - `asc builds latest --app \"APP_ID\" --version \"1.2.3\" --platform IOS`\n- Recent builds:\n  - `asc builds list --app \"APP_ID\" --sort -uploadedDate --limit 10`\n\n## Inspect processing state\n- `asc builds info --build \"BUILD_ID\"`\n\n## Distribution flows\n- Prefer end-to-end:\n  - `asc publish testflight --app \"APP_ID\" --ipa \"./app.ipa\" --group \"GROUP_ID\" --wait`\n  - `asc publ","body":"# ASC Build Lifecycle\n\nUse this skill to manage build state, processing, and retention.\n\n## Find the right build\n- Latest build:\n  - `asc builds latest --app \"APP_ID\" --version \"1.2.3\" --platform IOS`\n- Recent builds:\n  - `asc builds list --app \"APP_ID\" --sort -uploadedDate --limit 10`\n\n## Inspect processing state\n- `asc builds info --build \"BUILD_ID\"`\n\n## Distribution flows\n- Prefer end-to-end:\n  - `asc publish testflight --app \"APP_ID\" --ipa \"./app.ipa\" --group \"GROUP_ID\" --wait`\n  - `asc publish appstore --app \"APP_ID\" --ipa \"./app.ipa\" --version \"1.2.3\" --wait --submit --confirm`\n\n## Cleanup\n- Preview expiration:\n  - `asc builds expire-all --app \"APP_ID\" --older-than 90d --dry-run`\n- Apply expiration:\n  - `asc builds expire-all --app \"APP_ID\" --older-than 90d --confirm`\n- Single build:\n  - `asc builds expire --build \"BUILD_ID\"`\n\n## Notes\n- `asc builds upload` prepares upload operations only; use `asc publish` for end-to-end flows.\n- For long processing times, use `--wait`, `--poll-interval`, and `--timeout` where supported.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:16:01.038Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing automated build lifecycle management with ASC","zh":"非常适合需要使用ASC进行自动化构建生命周期管理的DevOps代理","ja":"ASCを使用した自動化されたビルドライフサイクル管理が必要なDevOpsエージェントに最適","ko":"ASC를 사용하여 자동화된 빌드 生命周期 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión automatizada del ciclo de vida de compilación con ASC","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion automatique du cycle de vie de construction avec ASC","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine automatisierte Build-Lebenszyklusverwaltung mit ASC benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de compilação automatizado com ASC","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, которым необходим автоматизированный менеджмент жизненного цикла сборки с помощью ASC","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة دورة حياة البناء الآلي مع ASC"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage build state, processing, and retention using ASC builds commands, facilitating end-to-end distribution flows via TestFlight and IPA files","zh":"赋予代理管理构建状态、处理和保留的能力，使用ASC构建命令，通过TestFlight和IPA文件实现端到端的分发流程","ja":"ASCビルドコマンドを使用して、ビルド状態、処理、保留を管理し、TestFlightおよびIPAファイルを介してエンドツーエンドの配布フローを容易にするエージェントをエンパワーメントする","ko":"ASC 빌드 명령을 사용하여 빌드 상태, 처리 및 보존을 관리하고 TestFlight 및 IPA 파일을 통해 최종 사용자까지의 배포 흐름을 용이하게 하는 에이전트를赋予权한","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado de compilación, el procesamiento y la retención utilizando comandos de compilación de ASC, lo que facilita flujos de distribución de extremo a extremo a través de TestFlight y archivos IPA","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état de construction, le traitement et la rétention en utilisant des commandes de construction ASC, facilitant ainsi les flux de distribution de bout en bout via TestFlight et des fichiers IPA","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Build-Zustand, die Verarbeitung und die Aufbewahrung mithilfe von ASC-Build-Befehlen zu verwalten, wodurch End-to-End-Verteilungsflüsse über TestFlight und IPA-Dateien erleichtert werden","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar estado de compilação, processamento e retenção usando comandos de compilação ASC, facilitando fluxos de distribuição de ponta a ponta via TestFlight e arquivos IPA","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять состоянием сборки, обработкой и хранением с помощью команд сборки ASC, облегчая конечные потоки распределения через TestFlight и файлы IPA","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة حالة البناء والمعالجة والاحتفاظ باستخدام أوامر بناء ASC، وتسهيل تدفقات التوزيع من النهاية إلى النهاية عبر TestFlight وملفات IPA"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating latest build retrieval for iOS apps","Inspecting build processing state for troubleshooting","Streamlining distribution flows to TestFlight"],"zh":["自动化最新构建检索用于iOS应用","检查构建处理状态用于故障排除","简化TestFlight的分发流程"],"ja":["iOSアプリ用の最新ビルドの取得を自動化する","トラブルシューティング用にビルド処理状態を検査する","TestFlightへの配布フローを簡素化する"],"ko":["iOS 애플리케이션을 위한 최신 빌드 검색 자동화","트러블슈팅을 위한 빌드 처리 상태 검사","TestFlight를 통한 배포 흐름 단순화"],"es":["Automatización de la recuperación de la compilación más reciente para aplicaciones iOS","Inspección del estado de procesamiento de la compilación para la solución de problemas","Optimización de flujos de distribución a TestFlight"],"fr":["Automatisation de la récupération de la construction la plus récente pour les applications iOS","Inspection de l''état de traitement de la construction pour la résolution de problèmes","Optimisation des flux de distribution vers TestFlight"],"de":["Automatisierung der Abrufung des neuesten Builds für iOS-Apps","Überprüfung des Build-Verarbeitungszustands zur Fehlersuche","Optimierung der Verteilungsflüsse zu TestFlight"],"pt":["Automatizar recuperação da compilação mais recente para aplicativos iOS","Inspecionar estado de processamento de compilação para solução de problemas","Otimizar fluxos de distribuição para TestFlight"],"ru":["Автоматизировать получение последней сборки для приложений iOS","Проверять состояние обработки сборки для устранения неполадок","Оптимизировать потоки распределения для TestFlight"],"ar":["أتمتة استرجاع البناء الأخير لتطبيقات iOS","فحص حالة معالجة البناء لتصحيح الأخطاء","تبسيط تدفقات التوزيع إلى TestFlight"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ASC CLI installation","Limited to iOS platform for specified commands"],"zh":["需要ASC CLI安装","仅限iOS平台用于指定命令"],"ja":["ASC CLIのインストールが必要","指定されたコマンドはiOSプラットフォームに限定"],"ko":["ASC CLI 설치가 필요","지정된 명령은 iOS 플랫폼에서만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de ASC CLI","Limitado a la plataforma iOS para los comandos especificados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de ASC CLI","Limité à la plate-forme iOS pour les commandes spécifiées"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von ASC CLI","Begrenzt auf die iOS-Plattform für die angegebenen Befehle"],"pt":["Requer instalação do ASC CLI","Limitado à plataforma iOS para comandos especificados"],"ru":["Требуется установка ASC CLI","Ограничен для платформы iOS для указанных команд"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ASC CLI","محدود لمنصة iOS للأوامر المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tigrisdata/tigris-blog/xe-writing-style', 'community', 'tigrisdata', 'tigris-blog', 'tigrisdata/tigris-blog', 'xe-writing-style', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:15:07.054Z', NULL, '{"id":"tigrisdata/tigris-blog/xe-writing-style","name":"xe-writing-style","description":{"zh":"Xe Iaso博客写作风格是一种独特的写作风格，能够将凌乱的笔记转化为高质量的博客文章。通过阅读相关参考文件和示例文章，开发者可以掌握这种写作风格","ja":"Xe Iasoブログスタイルは、メモを高品質な記事に変える独自のスタイルです。関連する参考ファイルと記事を読むことで、開発者はこのスタイルをマスターできます","ko":"Xe Iaso 블로그 스타일은凌乱한 메모를 고품질 블로그 게시물로 변환하는 고유한 스타일입니다. 관련 참조 파일과 게시물 예를 읽음으로써 개발자는 이 스타일을 마스터할 수 있습니다","es":"El estilo de escritura Xe es una herramienta para transformar notas en posts de blog coherentes y atractivos","fr":"Le style d''écriture Xe est un outil pour transformer des notes en articles de blog cohérents et attractifs","de":"Der Xe-Schreibstil ist ein Werkzeug, um Notizen in kohärente und ansprechende Blog-Beiträge zu verwandeln","pt":"O xe-writing-style é uma técnica de escrita de blog que transforma notas desorganizadas em posts de blog que soam como Xe Iaso. Aprenda a melhorar seu tom e estilo.","ru":"xe-writing-style - это техника написания блогов, которая преображает беспорядочные заметки в блог-посты, звучащие как Xe Iaso. Узнайте, как улучшить ваш тон и стиль.","ar":"xe-writing-style هو تقنية كتابة مدونة تحول الملاحظات غير المنظمة إلى منشورات مدونة ت звучит مثل Xe Iaso. تعلم كيفية تحسين نبرة وأسلوبك.","en":"A blog dedicated to all things storage!"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Xe Iaso博客写作风格 - 技术开发指南","ja":"Xe Iasoブログスタイル - 開発者向けガイド","ko":"Xe Iaso 블로그 스타일 - 개발자 안내서","es":"Estilo de escritura Xe: transforma notas en posts de blog","fr":"Style d''écriture Xe : transformez des notes en articles d...","de":"Xe-Schreibstil: verwandele Notizen in Blog-Beiträge","pt":"xe-writing-style: Técnicas de Escrita de Blog Inspiradas ...","ru":"xe-writing-style: Техники написания блогов в стиле Xe Iaso","ar":"xe-writing-style: تقنيات كتابة المدونة بالشكل الملهم من X...","en":"xe-writing-style"},"description":{"zh":"Xe Iaso博客写作风格是一种独特的写作风格，能够将凌乱的笔记转化为高质量的博客文章。通过阅读相关参考文件和示例文章，开发者可以掌握这种写作风格","ja":"Xe Iasoブログスタイルは、メモを高品質な記事に変える独自のスタイルです。関連する参考ファイルと記事を読むことで、開発者はこのスタイルをマスターできます","ko":"Xe Iaso 블로그 스타일은凌乱한 메모를 고품질 블로그 게시물로 변환하는 고유한 스타일입니다. 관련 참조 파일과 게시물 예를 읽음으로써 개발자는 이 스타일을 마스터할 수 있습니다","es":"El estilo de escritura Xe es una herramienta para transformar notas en posts de blog coherentes y atractivos","fr":"Le style d''écriture Xe est un outil pour transformer des notes en articles de blog cohérents et attractifs","de":"Der Xe-Schreibstil ist ein Werkzeug, um Notizen in kohärente und ansprechende Blog-Beiträge zu verwandeln","pt":"O xe-writing-style é uma técnica de escrita de blog que transforma notas desorganizadas em posts de blog que soam como Xe Iaso. Aprenda a melhorar seu tom e ...","ru":"xe-writing-style - это техника написания блогов, которая преображает беспорядочные заметки в блог-посты, звучащие как Xe Iaso. Узнайте, как улучшить ваш тон ...","ar":"xe-writing-style هو تقنية كتابة مدونة تحول الملاحظات غير المنظمة إلى منشورات مدونة ت звучит مثل Xe Iaso. تعلم كيفية تحسين نبرة وأسلوبك.","en":"A blog dedicated to all things storage!"},"definition":{"en":"A blog dedicated to all things storage!"},"features":{"zh":["独特的写作风格","通过语气和风格转换笔记","支持多种情感寄托","提供示例文章和参考文件","易于掌握和使用","提高博客文章质量"],"ja":["独自のスタイル","トーンとスタイルを使用してメモを変換","複数の感情表現をサポート","記事例と参考ファイルを提供","習得と使用が容易","記事の品質を向上させる"],"ko":["고유한 스타일","톤과 스타일을 사용하여 메모를 변환","複数의 감정 표현을 지원","게시물 예와 참조 파일을 제공","쉽게 마스터하고 사용","게시물의 품질을 향상"],"es":["Transformación de notas desorganizadas en posts de blog coherentes","Tono y voz personalizados según el registro emocional","Estructura narrativa y scaffold para ensayos y críticas","Enfoque en identidad, sanación y vulnerabilidad","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de archivo"],"fr":["Transformation de notes désorganisées en articles de blog cohérents","Tonalité et voix personnalisées selon le registre émotionnel","Structure narrative et scaffold pour essais et critiques","Focus sur l''identité, la guérison et la vulnérabilité","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats de fichiers"],"de":["Umwandlung unorganisierter Notizen in kohärente Blog-Beiträge","Personalisierter Ton und Stimme nach emotionaler Registrierung","Narrative Struktur und Scaffold für Essays und Kritiken","Fokus auf Identität, Heilung und Verletzlichkeit","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Dateiformaten"],"pt":["Transformação de notas desorganizadas em posts de blog","Técnicas de escrita para melhorar o tom e estilo","Inspiração no estilo de Xe Iaso","Melhoria da qualidade do conteúdo","Aumento da produtividade na escrita"],"ru":["Преображение беспорядочных заметок в блог-посты","Техники письма для улучшения тона и стиля","Вдохновение от стиля Xe Iaso","Улучшение качества контента","Повышение производительности письма"],"ar":["تحويل الملاحظات غير المنظمة إلى منشورات مدونة","تقنيات الكتابة لتحسين النبرة والأسلوب","الإلهام من أسلوب Xe Iaso","تحسين جودة المحتوى","زيادة الإنتاجية في الكتابة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Xe Iaso博客写作风格","技术开发指南","博客文章写作","语气和风格转换","情感寄托","示例文章","参考文件","开发者工具"],"ja":["Xe Iasoブログスタイル","開発者向けガイド","記事作成","トーンとスタイル変換","感情表現","記事例","参考ファイル","開発者ツール"],"ko":["Xe Iaso 블로그 스타일","개발자 안내서","게시물 작성","톤과 스타일 변환","감정 표현","게시물 예","참조 파일","개발자 도구"],"es":["estilo de escritura Xe","transformación de notas","contenido de blog coherente","tono y voz personalizados","estructura narrativa","identidad y sanación","vulnerabilidad y coming out","gestión de emociones"],"fr":["style d''écriture Xe","transformation de notes","contenu de blog cohérent","tonalité et voix personnalisées","structure narrative","identité et guérison","vulnérabilité et coming out","gestion des émotions"],"de":["Xe-Schreibstil","Umwandlung unorganisierter Notizen","kohärenter Blog-Inhalt","personalisierter Ton und Stimme","narrative Struktur","Identität und Heilung","Verletzlichkeit und Coming-Out","Emotionsmanagement"],"pt":["xe-writing-style","técnicas de escrita de blog","Xe Iaso","escrita de conteúdo","melhoria do tom e estilo","produtividade na escrita"],"ru":["xe-writing-style","техники написания блогов","Xe Iaso","написание контента","улучшение тона и стиля","производительность письма"],"ar":["xe-writing-style","تقنيات كتابة المدونة","Xe Iaso","كتابة المحتوى","تحسين النبرة والأسلوب","الإنتاجية في الكتابة"]}},"owner":"tigrisdata","repo":"tigris-blog","repoPath":"tigrisdata/tigris-blog","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"xe-writing-style","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Xe Iaso Blog Post Writer\n\nTransform messy notes into blog posts that sound like Xe Iaso. Read\n`references/voice-tone.md` for detailed voice characteristics. Read 2-3 random\nexample posts from `assets/` to calibrate tone. Then read the reference file\nthat matches the post''s emotional register:\n\n- `references/story-circle.md` — Narrative arc scaffold (essays, critiques,\n  journey posts)\n- `references/emotional-personal.md` — Identity, healing, vulnerability, coming\n  out, grief\n- `references/fic","body":"# Xe Iaso Blog Post Writer\n\nTransform messy notes into blog posts that sound like Xe Iaso. Read\n`references/voice-tone.md` for detailed voice characteristics. Read 2-3 random\nexample posts from `assets/` to calibrate tone. Then read the reference file\nthat matches the post''s emotional register:\n\n- `references/story-circle.md` — Narrative arc scaffold (essays, critiques,\n  journey posts)\n- `references/emotional-personal.md` — Identity, healing, vulnerability, coming\n  out, grief\n- `references/fiction-mythic.md` — Technical parables, second-person fiction,\n  supernatural framing\n- `references/humor-satire.md` — Cursed projects, deadpan humor, satirical\n  commentary\n- `references/spirituality.md` — Meditation, belief-as-tool,\n  programming-consciousness parallels\n\nMost posts blend 2-3 of these modes. Read whichever apply.\n\n## Hard Rules\n\nNon-negotiable constraints:\n\n1. **Successive paragraphs must not start with the same letter.** If paragraph N\n   starts with \"T\", paragraph N+1 must start with a different letter. Rewrite\n   sentence openings as needed. Character dialogue blocks (`<Conv>`) do not\n   count as paragraphs for this rule.\n2. **Write for peers, not beginners.** Assume professional-level technical\n   context.\n3. **No corporate or marketing tone.** No \"leverage\", \"synergy\", \"empower\",\n   \"streamline\", \"harness\", \"unlock\". Write like a human talking to another\n   human.\n4. **Admit uncertainty.** \"I think\", \"I suspect\", \"I''m not sure\" when genuinely\n   uncertain.\n5. **Show tradeoffs.** Never present a solution without its costs.\n6. **Context before implementation.** Explain why something matters before\n   showing how.\n\n## Voice in Brief\n\nXe writes like a senior engineer talking to a peer over drinks: confident but\nhonest, opinionated but fair, technical but human. The narrator is always\npresent as a real person with feelings, mistakes, and strong opinions.\n\nMarkers that distinguish this voice from generic technical writing:\n\n- Casual intensifiers: \"literally\", \"honestly\", \"kinda\", \"super\", \"really\"\n- Direct emotional statements: \"This is horrifying.\", \"I love this.\", \"I hate\n  that this makes sense.\"\n- Self-deprecation: \"I felt like a dunce.\", \"I literally have no idea what I am\n  doing wrong.\"\n- Em dashes and parenthetical asides for conversational cadence\n- Rhetorical questions for disbelief: \"You can see how this doesn''t scale,\n  right?\"\n- Sentence fragments for emphasis. Single-sentence paragraphs for pacing.\n- Xe-isms: \"cursed\", \"accursed abomination\", \"Just Works™\", \"napkin math\",\n  \"github hellthreads\"\n\nRead `references/voice-tone.md` for the full style guide including narrative\nmodes, vocabulary, and values.\n\n## Structure\n\nChoose the pattern that fits the material:\n\n| Pattern                                                                                   | Best for            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| Personal hook → journey → technical detail → lessons                                      | Experience posts    |\n| Problem statement → evidence → insight → pragmatic conclusion                             | Critiques, essays   |\n| Setup → walkthrough → results → reflection                                                | Tutorials, projects |\n| Current state → historical context → analysis → forward look                              | Industry commentary |\n| Satirical warning → dramatic stakes → technical walkthrough → \"it works\" horror → caveats | Cursed projects     |\n\nFor longer posts with a narrative journey (essays, critiques), read\n`references/story-circle.md` for the 8-beat story circle scaffold.\n\n## Openings\n\nLead with one of:\n\n- **Personal memory**: \"A while ago, I got really frustrated at my Samsung S7.\"\n- **Historical/cultural analogy**: \"Cloth is one of the most important goods a\n  society can produce.\"\n- **Direct tension**: \"Anubis has kind of exploded in popularity in the last\n  week.\"\n- **Pop culture/sci-fi hook**: \"In Blade Runner, Deckard hunts down\n  replicants...\"\n- **Satirical warning box** followed by dramatic stakes (for cursed content)\n\nNever open with a generic thesis or \"In this post, I will...\"\n\n## Closings\n\n- Tie back to the opening hook or tension\n- End with forward momentum, an open question, or a sober reality check\n- Often followed by `---` then supplementary material (related links, credits,\n  stream plugs)\n- Sometimes a final character dialogue as a coda\n\n## Character Dialogue System\n\nXe''s posts use character dialogue components to inject humor, stage internal\ndebate, provide asides, and pace long sections. This is one of the most\ndistinctive features.\n\n### Characters\n\n| Character | Role                                                            | Typical moods                                       |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| Cadey     | Xe''s main voice for asides, emotional reactions, and commentary | coffee, aha, enby, percussive-maintenance, facepalm |\n| Aoi       | Asks clarifying questions, expresses confusion or surprise      | coffee, wut, sus, grin, facepalm                    |\n| Mara      | Provides helpful context, technical explanations, links         | hacker, happy                                       |\n| Numa      | Corrections, dark humor, \"well actually\" moments                | delet, happy, smug, neutral                         |\n\n### Dialogue Syntax\n\nSingle aside (standalone comment):\n\n```jsx\n<Conv name=\"Cadey\" mood=\"coffee\">\n  Is this how we end up losing the craft?\n</Conv>\n```\n\nMulti-character exchange (wrap in `<ConvP>`):\n\n```jsx\n<ConvP>\n  <Conv name=\"Aoi\" mood=\"wut\">\n    Wait, really?\n  </Conv>\n  <Conv name=\"Cadey\" mood=\"aha\">\n    Yep!\n  </Conv>\n</ConvP>\n```\n\n### When to Use Dialogue\n\n- Break up long technical sections with a reaction or joke\n- Ask the question the reader is thinking (usually Aoi)\n- Provide tangential-but-useful info without derailing the text (usually Mara)\n- Deliver a punchline or emotional beat (usually Cadey or Numa)\n- Stage a mini-debate that illuminates tradeoffs\n\n## Signature Devices\n\n- **Friend reaction lists**: Bullet-pointed quotes from friends reacting to\n  ideas\n- **Napkin math**: Explicit back-of-envelope calculations, step by step\n- **Satirical warning boxes**: Legal-warning-style disclaimers before cursed\n  content\n- **`<details>` folds**: Long code blocks in\n  `<details><summary>Longer code block</summary>...</details>`\n- **Blockquote citations**: External quotes in `<blockquote>` with\n  `\\-[Source](url)` attribution\n- **Pop culture anchoring**: Anime, games, sci-fi references woven into\n  technical arguments\n\n## MDX Format\n\nPosts are MDX (Markdown + JSX). Component imports vary by platform.\n\n### Personal Blog (xeiaso.net)\n\n```mdx\n---\ntitle: \"Post Title\"\ndesc: \"One-line description\"\ndate: YYYY-MM-DD\nhero:\n  ai: \"Photo credit or AI model name\"\n  file: \"hero-image-slug\"\n  prompt: \"Image description\"\n  social: false\n---\n\nimport Conv from \"../../_components/XeblogConv.tsx\";\n\n;\n```\n\nImages: `<Picture path=\"blog/YYYY/post-slug/image-name\" desc=\"Alt text\"/>`\n\n### Company Blog (Tigris)\n\n```mdx\n---\nslug: post-slug\ntitle: \"Post Title\"\ndescription: |\n  Multi-line SEO description\nkeywords: [...]\nauthors: [xe]\ntags: [...]\n---\n\nimport Conv from \"@site/src/components/Conv\";\n\n;\n```\n\nImages: Standard `<img>` with imported files. Admonitions: `:::note ... :::`\n\n## Body Writing Checklist\n\n- Vary paragraph length (single-sentence emphasis vs. longer explanations)\n- Code blocks are complete and copy-pasteable with file path comments when\n  helpful\n- Inline code for commands and technical terms: `git push`, `HTTP/2`\n- Links are dense and inline (cite sources, reference prior art, link docs)\n- `<details>` for code blocks that would break reading flow\n- Use `---` horizontal rules for major thematic breaks\n\n## Process\n\n1. Accept the user''s brain dump without requiring organization\n2. Read `references/voice-tone.md`\n3. Read 2-3 random example posts from `assets/` for tone calibration\n4. Read the reference files that match the post''s mode:\n   - Narrative arc → `references/story-circle.md`\n   - Personal/vulnerable → `references/emotional-personal.md`\n   - Fiction/parable → `references/fiction-mythic.md`\n   - Humor/satire → `references/humor-satire.md`\n   - Spiritual themes → `references/spirituality.md`\n5. Choose a structure pattern and draft\n6. Review: successive-paragraph rule, no corporate tone, voice matches examples\n7. Show draft to user and iterate\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:15:07.054Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Generation Agents needing to emulate the Xe Iaso writing style for blog posts on storage topics.","zh":"非常适合需要模仿Xe Iaso写作风格来撰写存储主题博客的内容生成智能体。","ja":"ストレージトピックに関するブログ投稿において、Xe Iasoの執筆スタイルを模倣する必要があるコンテンツ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"스토리지 주제에 관한 블로그 게시물에서 Xe Iaso의 글쓰기 스타일을 모방해야 하는 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de contenido que necesitan emular el estilo de escritura Xe Iaso para publicaciones de blog sobre temas de almacenamiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de contenu ayant besoin d''émuler le style d''écriture Xe Iaso pour les billets de blog sur les sujets de stockage.","de":"Perfekt für Inhaltsgenerierungsagenten, die den Xe-Iaso-Schreibstil für Blog-Beiträge zu Speicherthemen emulieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Conteúdo que precisam emular o estilo de escrita Xe Iaso para posts de blog sobre tópicos de armazenamento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по генерации контента, которым необходимо эмулировать стиль письма Xe Iaso для блог-постов на темы хранения.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء توليد المحتوى الذين يحتاجون إلى محاكاة أسلوب الكتابة Xe Iaso من أجل منشورات المدونة حول مواضيع التخزين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform messy notes into cohesive blog posts using narrative arc scaffolds, emotional tone calibration, and voice characteristics defined in Markdown files like `references/voice-tone.md`, enabling the generation of engaging content with a consistent tone.","zh":"使智能体能够使用叙事弧支架、情感语调校准以及`references/voice-tone.md`等Markdown文件中定义的声音特征，将杂乱的笔记转化为连贯的博客文章，从而生成具有一致语调的引人入胜的内容。","ja":"ナラティブアークの骨組み、感情的なトーンの調整、および`references/voice-tone.md`のようなMarkdownファイルで定義された声の特性を使用して、乱雑なメモをまとまりのあるブログ投稿に変換し、一貫したトーンで魅力的なコンテンツを生成することをエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"서사적 흐름 구조, 감정적 어조 보정, 그리고 `references/voice-tone.md`와 같은 Markdown 파일에 정의된 음성 특성을 사용하여 지저분한 노트를 일관성 있는 블로그 글로 변환함으로써 일관된 어조로 매력적인 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar notas desordenadas en publicaciones de blog coherentes utilizando estructuras de arco narrativo, calibración del tono emocional y características de voz definidas en archivos Markdown como `references/voice-tone.md`, lo que permite la generación de contenido atractivo con un tono consistente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des notes désorganisées en billets de blog cohérents en utilisant des structures d''arc narratif, une calibration du ton émotionnel et des caractéristiques de voix définies dans des fichiers Markdown comme `references/voice-tone.md`, permettant ainsi la génération de contenu engageant avec un ton consistant.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, unordentliche Notizen in kohärente Blog-Beiträge umzuwandeln, indem sie Erzählbögen, emotionale Tonkalibrierung und in Markdown-Dateien wie `references/voice-tone.md` definierte Sprachmerkmale verwenden, was die Generierung von ansprechendem Inhalt mit einem konsistenten Ton ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar notas desorganizadas em posts de blog coesos usando estruturas de arco narrativo, calibração de tom emocional e características de voz definidas em arquivos Markdown como `references/voice-tone.md`, permitindo a geração de conteúdo atraente com um tom consistente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать беспорядочные заметки в связные блог-посты, используя нарративные арки, калибровку эмоционального тона и характеристики голоса, определенные в файлах Markdown, таких как `references/voice-tone.md`, что позволяет генерировать увлекательный контент с последовательным тоном.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل الملاحظات غير المنظمة إلى منشورات مدونة متسقة باستخدام هياكل القصة وضبط النبرة العاطفية وخصائص الصوت المحددة في ملفات Markdown مثل `references/voice-tone.md`، مما يسمح بالمحتوى المثير للاهتمام مع نبرة ثابتة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating blog posts with a narrative arc using `references/story-circle.md`","Calibrating tone for emotional and personal posts with `references/emotional-personal.md`","Creating content with a consistent Xe Iaso voice tone"],"zh":["使用`references/story-circle.md`生成具有叙事弧的博客文章","使用`references/emotional-personal.md`为情感化和个人化的帖子校准语调","创建具有一致Xe Iaso声音语调的内容"],"ja":["`references/story-circle.md`を使用してナラティブアークのあるブログ投稿を生成する","`references/emotional-personal.md`を使用して感情的かつ個人的な投稿のトーンを調整する","一貫したXe Iasoの声のトーンでコンテンツを作成する"],"ko":["`references/story-circle.md`를 사용하여 서사적 흐름을 가진 블로그 게시물 생성","`references/emotional-personal.md`를 사용하여 감정적이고 개인적인 게시물의 어조 보정","일관된 Xe Iaso 음성 어조로 콘텐츠 생성"],"es":["Generar publicaciones de blog con un arco narrativo utilizando `references/story-circle.md`","Calibrar el tono para publicaciones emocionales y personales con `references/emotional-personal.md`","Crear contenido con un tono de voz consistente Xe Iaso"],"fr":["Générer des billets de blog avec un arc narratif en utilisant `references/story-circle.md`","Calibrer le ton pour les publications émotionnelles et personnelles avec `references/emotional-personal.md`","Créer du contenu avec un ton de voix cohérent Xe Iaso"],"de":["Erstellen von Blog-Beiträgen mit einem Erzählbogen unter Verwendung von `references/story-circle.md`","Kalibrieren des Tons für emotionale und persönliche Beiträge mit `references/emotional-personal.md`","Erstellen von Inhalten mit einem konsistenten Xe-Iaso-Sprechton"],"pt":["Gerar posts de blog com um arco narrativo usando `references/story-circle.md`","Calibrar o tom para posts emocionais e pessoais com `references/emotional-personal.md`","Criar conteúdo com um tom de voz Xe Iaso consistente"],"ru":["Генерировать блог-посты с нарративной аркой, используя `references/story-circle.md`","Калибровать тон для эмоциональных и личных постов с `references/emotional-personal.md`","Создавать контент с последовательным тоном голоса Xe Iaso"],"ar":["генерация منشورات المدونة مع قصة محيطة باستخدام `references/story-circle.md`","ضبط النبرة للمنشورات العاطفية والشخصية مع `references/emotional-personal.md`","إنشاء المحتوى بنبرة صوت Xe Iaso الثابتة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to reference files like `references/voice-tone.md` and `assets/` example posts","Limited to generating content in the style of Xe Iaso","Needs calibration through reading example posts and reference files"],"zh":["需要访问参考文件，如`references/voice-tone.md`和`assets/`示例帖子","仅限于生成Xe Iaso风格的内容","需要通过阅读示例帖子和参考文件进行校准"],"ja":["`references/voice-tone.md`や`assets/`の例示投稿などの参照ファイルへのアクセスが必要","Xe Iasoのスタイルのコンテンツ生成に限定される","例示投稿と参照ファイルを読んで調整する必要がある"],"ko":["`references/voice-tone.md` 및 `assets/` 예시 게시물과 같은 참조 파일에 대한 접근 필요","Xe Iaso 스타일의 콘텐츠 생성으로 제한됨","예시 게시물과 참조 파일을 읽고 보정해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de referencia como `references/voice-tone.md` y publicaciones de ejemplo en `assets/`","Limitado a la generación de contenido en el estilo de Xe Iaso","Necesita calibración a través de la lectura de publicaciones de ejemplo y archivos de referencia"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des fichiers de référence tels que `references/voice-tone.md` et des publications d''exemple dans `assets/`","Limité à la génération de contenu dans le style de Xe Iaso","Nécessite une calibration à travers la lecture de publications d''exemple et de fichiers de référence"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Referenzdateien wie `references/voice-tone.md` und Beispielbeiträge in `assets/`","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Inhalten im Stil von Xe Iaso","Benötigt eine Kalibrierung durch das Lesen von Beispielbeiträgen und Referenzdateien"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de referência como `references/voice-tone.md` e posts de exemplo em `assets/`","Limitado à geração de conteúdo no estilo Xe Iaso","Necessita de calibração por meio da leitura de posts de exemplo e arquivos de referência"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам-справочникам, таким как `references/voice-tone.md` и примерам постов в `assets/`","Ограничен генерацией контента в стиле Xe Iaso","Требует калибровки путем чтения примеров постов и справочных файлов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات المراجع مثل `references/voice-tone.md` ومنشورات الأمثلة في `assets/`","محدود بالمحتوى المولَّد بنمط Xe Iaso","يحتاج إلى ضبط من خلال قراءة منشورات الأمثلة وملفات المراجع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
