ation d''API","Nettoyage de commentaires non compatibles","Synchronisation de la documentation avec les modifications de code"],"de":["TSDoc-Formatvorlagen","Typdokumentationsrichtlinien","Wartungsworkflows","Erstellung von API-Dokumentationen","Bereinigung nicht kompatibler Kommentare","Synchronisierung der Dokumentation mit Codeänderungen"],"pt":["Modelos de formato TSDoc","Diretrizes de documentação de tipo","Fluxos de trabalho de manutenção","Revisão da qualidade da documentação","Criação de documentação de API abrangente","Limpeza de comentários não conformes"],"ru":["Шаблоны формата TSDoc","Руководства по документации типа","Рабочие процессы обслуживания","Проверка качества документации","Создание всесторонней документации API","Очистка несовместимых комментариев"],"ar":["قوالب صيغة TSDoc","إرشادات توثيق النوع","تدفقات العمل للصيانة","مراجعة جودة التوثيق","إنشاء توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الشاملة","تنظيف التعليقات غير المتوافقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码文档","AI能力","TSDoc","类型文档","API文档","代码质量","文档效率","开发工作流"],"ja":["コードドキュメント","AI機能","TSDoc","タイプドキュメント","APIドキュメント","コードの品質","ドキュメントの効率","開発ワークフロー"],"ko":["코드 문서","AI 기능","TSDoc","유형 문서","API 문서","코드 품질","문서 효율","개발 워크플로"],"es":["documentación de código","tsdoc","tipo de documentación","flujo de trabajo de mantenimiento","creación de documentación de api","limpieza de comentarios","sincronización de documentación","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["documentation de code","tsdoc","type de documentation","flux de travail de maintenance","création de documentation d''api","nettoyage de commentaires","synchronisation de la documentation","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["code-dokumentation","tsdoc","typdokumentation","wartungsworkflow","erstellung von api-dokumentationen","bereinigung von kommentaren","synchronisierung der dokumentation","software-entwicklung","entwicklertools"],"pt":["documentação de código","ferramenta de código aberto","TSDoc","documentação de tipo","fluxos de trabalho de manutenção","qualidade da documentação","API","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["документация кода","открытый инструментарий","TSDoc","документация типа","рабочие процессы обслуживания","качество документации","API","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["توثيق الشفرة","أداة الكود المفتوح","TSDoc","توثيق النوع","تدفقات العمل للصيانة","جودة التوثيق","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"youdotcom-oss","repo":"dx-toolkit","repoPath":"youdotcom-oss/dx-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-documentation","description":"TSDoc standards for TypeScript/JavaScript code. Automatically invoked when writing, reviewing, or editing any TSDoc comments, code documentation, or API documentation. (project)","bodyPreview":"# Code Documentation Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides TSDoc format templates, type documentation guidelines, and maintenance workflows. Use this when:\n- Writing or editing TSDoc comments for any function, type, or module\n- Reviewing documentation quality\n- Creating comprehensive API documentation\n- Documenting complex type structures\n- Cleaning up non-compliant comments (performance notes, timestamps, inline explanations)\n- Synchronizing out-of-sync TSDoc with code changes\n- Removing orpha","body":"# Code Documentation Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides TSDoc format templates, type documentation guidelines, and maintenance workflows. Use this when:\n- Writing or editing TSDoc comments for any function, type, or module\n- Reviewing documentation quality\n- Creating comprehensive API documentation\n- Documenting complex type structures\n- Cleaning up non-compliant comments (performance notes, timestamps, inline explanations)\n- Synchronizing out-of-sync TSDoc with code changes\n- Removing orphaned documentation for deleted code\n\n**Key Standard**: No `@example` sections - tests and stories serve as living examples.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n- **Creating TSDoc**: See [workflow.md](references/workflow.md) for the generation workflow\n- **Maintaining TSDoc**: See [maintenance.md](references/maintenance.md) for cleanup and sync guidelines\n\nThis skill contains detailed templates for:\n- Public API Functions\n- Internal Module Documentation\n- Public and Internal Types\n- Helper Functions\n- Behavioral Programming Functions\n- Special Annotations (Security, Performance, Deprecated)\n- Type Documentation (Complex Objects, Unions, Functions, Utilities, Branded Types, etc.)\n\n## Navigation\n\n- [workflow.md](references/workflow.md) - TSDoc generation workflow (4 phases)\n- [maintenance.md](references/maintenance.md) - Comment policy, sync tasks, orphaned doc handling\n- [public-api-templates.md](references/public-api-templates.md) - Templates for public-facing APIs\n- [internal-templates.md](references/internal-templates.md) - Templates for internal code and modules\n- [type-documentation.md](references/type-documentation.md) - Comprehensive type documentation templates\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **typescript-lsp**: Use for type verification and discovery during documentation workflow. Essential for Phase 1 (type analysis) and Phase 2 (usage discovery) of the TSDoc generation process. Run `lsp-hover` to verify signatures, `lsp-references` to find usages, and `lsp-symbols` to understand file structure.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:16:12.913Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript Documentation Agents needing to maintain API reference quality.","zh":"非常适合需要维护API参考质量的TypeScript文档代理。","ja":"APIリファレンスの品質を維持する必要があるTypeScriptドキュメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"API 참조 품질을 유지해야 하는 TypeScript 문서 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de documentación de TypeScript que necesitan mantener la calidad de la referencia de API.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de documentation TypeScript qui ont besoin de maintenir la qualité de la référence d''API.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript-Dokumentationsagenten, die die Qualität der API-Referenz aufrechterhalten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Documentação TypeScript que precisam manter a qualidade da referência de API.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов документации TypeScript, которым необходимо поддерживать качество справки API.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء وثائق TypeScript الذين يحتاجون إلى الحفاظ على جودة مرجع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enforces TSDoc compliance across codebases by generating standardized comments, synchronizing documentation with code changes, and removing non-compliant elements like performance notes and inline explanations.","zh":"通过生成标准化注释、同步文档与代码变更、以及移除不符合要求的元素（如性能说明和内联解释），在整个代码库中强制执行TSDoc合规性。","ja":"標準化されたコメントの生成、コード変更とのドキュメントの同期、パフォーマンスノートやインライン説明などの非準拠要素の削除により、コードベース全体でTSDoc準拠を強制します。","ko":"표준화된 주석 생성, 코드 변경 사항과 문서 동기화, 성능 노트 및 인라인 설명과 같은 비준수 요소 제거를 통해 코드베이스 전체에 TSDoc 준수를 강제합니다.","es":"Aplica el cumplimiento de TSDoc en todos los códigos generando comentarios estandarizados, sincronizando la documentación con los cambios de código y eliminando elementos no compatibles como notas de rendimiento y explicaciones en línea.","fr":"Assure le respect de la norme TSDoc à travers les bases de code en générant des commentaires standardisés, en synchronisant la documentation avec les modifications de code et en supprimant les éléments non conformes tels que les notes de performances et les explications en ligne.","de":"Durchsetzt die TSDoc-Konformität über Codebasen hinweg, indem standardisierte Kommentare generiert, die Dokumentation mit Codeänderungen synchronisiert und nicht konforme Elemente wie Leistungsnotizen und Inline-Erklärungen entfernt werden.","pt":"Impõe a conformidade com o TSDoc em todas as bases de código, gerando comentários padronizados, sincronizando a documentação com alterações de código e removendo elementos não conformes, como notas de desempenho e explicações em linha.","ru":"Принудительно обеспечивает соблюдение стандартов TSDoc во всех кодовых базах, генерируя стандартизированные комментарии, синхронизируя документацию с изменениями кода и удаляя несовместимые элементы, такие как заметки о производительности и встроенные объяснения.","ar":"ينفذ الامتثال لمعيار TSDoc عبر جميع قواعد البيانات بالكود، من خلال توليد تعليقات موحدة، وتنسيق الوثائق مع التغييرات في الكود، وإزالة العناصر غير المطابقة مثل ملاحظات الأداء والتوضيحات السطرية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating TSDoc format templates for functions and types","Synchronizing out-of-sync documentation after code changes","Cleaning up non-compliant comments and orphaned documentation"],"zh":["为函数和类型生成TSDoc格式模板","在代码变更后同步不同步的文档","清理不符合要求的注释和孤立的文档"],"ja":["関数と型のためのTSDoc形式テンプレートの生成","コード変更後の非同期ドキュメントの同期","非準拠のコメントと孤立したドキュメントのクリーンアップ"],"ko":["함수 및 유형에 대한 TSDoc 형식 템플릿 생성","코드 변경 후 동기화되지 않은 문서 동기화","비준수 주석 및 고아 문서 정리"],"es":["Generar plantillas de formato TSDoc para funciones y tipos","Sincronizar la documentación desactualizada después de los cambios de código","Limpiar comentarios no compatibles y documentación huérfana"],"fr":["Générer des modèles de format TSDoc pour les fonctions et les types","Synchroniser la documentation obsolète après les modifications de code","Nettoyer les commentaires non conformes et la documentation orpheline"],"de":["Erzeugen von TSDoc-Formatvorlagen für Funktionen und Typen","Synchronisieren veralteter Dokumentation nach Codeänderungen","Bereinigen nicht konformer Kommentare und verwaister Dokumentation"],"pt":["Geração de modelos de formato TSDoc para funções e tipos","Sincronização da documentação desatualizada após alterações de código","Limpeza de comentários não conformes e documentação órfã"],"ru":["Генерация шаблонов формата TSDoc для функций и типов","Синхронизация устаревшей документации после изменений кода","Очистка несовместимых комментариев и осиротевшей документации"],"ar":["توليد قوالب بتنسيق TSDoc للدوال والأنواع","مزامنة الوثائق غير المتزامنة بعد التغييرات في الكود","تنظيف التعليقات غير المتوافقة والوثائق اليتمية"]},"limitations":{"en":["TypeScript/JavaScript focus only","Requires existing codebase with documentation needs","Limited to TSDoc standard conventions"],"zh":["仅专注于TypeScript/JavaScript","需要已有代码库且存在文档需求","仅限于TSDoc标准约定"],"ja":["TypeScript/JavaScriptのみに焦点を当てている","ドキュメントの必要性がある既存のコードベースが必要","TSDoc標準規約に限定されている"],"ko":["TypeScript/JavaScript에만 초점을 맞춤","문서화 필요성이 있는 기존 코드베이스 필요","TSDoc 표준 규칙으로 제한됨"],"es":["Enfoque solo en TypeScript/JavaScript","Requiere una base de código existente con necesidades de documentación","Limitado a las convenciones estándar de TSDoc"],"fr":["Se concentre uniquement sur TypeScript/JavaScript","Nécessite une base de code existante avec des besoins de documentation","Limité aux conventions standard de TSDoc"],"de":["Fokus nur auf TypeScript/JavaScript","Benötigt eine bestehende Codebasis mit Dokumentationsbedürfnissen","Begrenzt auf die Standardkonventionen von TSDoc"],"pt":["Foco apenas em TypeScript/JavaScript","Exige base de código existente com necessidades de documentação","Limitado às convenções padrão do TSDoc"],"ru":["Фокус только на TypeScript/JavaScript","Требует существующей кодовой базы с потребностями в документации","Ограничен стандартными соглашениями TSDoc"],"ar":["التركيز فقط على TypeScript/JavaScript","يتطلب قاعدة بيانات بالكود موجودة مع احتياجات وثائقية","محدود بالاتفاقيات المعيارية لمعيار TSDoc"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('funfix/database/cats-effect-io', 'community', 'funfix', 'database', 'funfix/database', 'cats-effect-io', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:16:19.267Z', NULL, '{"id":"funfix/database/cats-effect-io","name":"cats-effect-io","description":{"es":"Cats Effect IO es una herramienta de base de datos para JVM que proporciona una forma efectiva de manejar efectos laterales y concurrencia estructurada","fr":"Cats Effect IO est un outil de base de données pour JVM qui offre une façon efficace de gérer les effets secondaires et la concurrence structurée","de":"Cats Effect IO ist ein Datenbank-Toolkit für JVM, das eine effektive Möglichkeit bietet, Nebeneffekte und strukturierte Konkurrenz zu verwalten","pt":"O Cats Effect IO é uma ferramenta de banco de dados para JVM que ajuda a gerenciar efeitos colaterais em aplicações Scala.","ru":"Cats Effect IO — это инструментарий базы данных для JVM, который помогает управлять побочными эффектами в приложениях Scala.","ar":"كэтس إيفكت آي أو هو أداة قاعدة بيانات لجافا في إم يساعد في إدارة الآثار الجانبية في تطبيقات سكالا","en":"Database toolkit for the JVM"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Cats Effect IO: Herramienta de base de datos para JVM","fr":"Cats Effect IO : Outil de base de données pour JVM","de":"Cats Effect IO: Datenbank-Toolkit für JVM","pt":"Cats Effect IO: Toolkit de Banco de Dados para JVM","ru":"Cats Effect IO: Инструментарий базы данных для JVM","ar":"كэтس إيفكت آي أو: أداة قاعدة بيانات لجافا في إم","en":"cats-effect-io"},"description":{"es":"Cats Effect IO es una herramienta de base de datos para JVM que proporciona una forma efectiva de manejar efectos laterales y concurrencia estructurada","fr":"Cats Effect IO est un outil de base de données pour JVM qui offre une façon efficace de gérer les effets secondaires et la concurrence structurée","de":"Cats Effect IO ist ein Datenbank-Toolkit für JVM, das eine effektive Möglichkeit bietet, Nebeneffekte und strukturierte Konkurrenz zu verwalten","pt":"O Cats Effect IO é uma ferramenta de banco de dados para JVM que ajuda a gerenciar efeitos colaterais em aplicações Scala.","ru":"Cats Effect IO — это инструментарий базы данных для JVM, который помогает управлять побочными эффектами в приложениях Scala.","ar":"كэтس إيفكت آي أو هو أداة قاعدة بيانات لجافا في إم يساعد في إدارة الآثار الجانبية في تطبيقات سكالا","en":"Database toolkit for the JVM"},"definition":{"en":"Database toolkit for the JVM"},"features":{"es":["Gestión de efectos laterales como valores de efecto","Concurrencia estructurada con parTraverse y parMapN","Adquisición y liberación de recursos con Resource","Puntos de entrada de programa con IOApp","Soporte para Java bloqueante con IO.blocking y IO.interruptible"],"fr":["Gestion des effets secondaires comme des valeurs d''effet","Concurrence structurée avec parTraverse et parMapN","Acquisition et libération de ressources avec Resource","Points d''entrée de programme avec IOApp","Prise en charge de Java bloquant avec IO.blocking et IO.interruptible"],"de":["Verwaltung von Nebeneffekten wie Effektwerten","Strukturierte Konkurrenz mit parTraverse und parMapN","Erwerb und Freigabe von Ressourcen mit Resource","Programmeinstiegspunkte mit IOApp","Unterstützung für Java-Blockierung mit IO.blocking und IO.interruptible"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de efeitos colaterais","Suporte a Scala","Integração com JVM","Recursos de concorrência estruturada","Gerenciamento de recursos com Resource"],"ru":["Управление побочными эффектами","Поддержка Scala","Интеграция с JVM","Возможности структурированной конкурентности","Управление ресурсами с помощью Resource"],"ar":["إدارة الآثار الجانبية","دعم سكالا","التكامل مع جافا في إم","ميزات الت конкурентية المنظمة","إدارة الموارد مع Resource"]},"keywords":{"es":["Cats Effect IO","herramienta de base de datos","JVM","efectos laterales","concurrencia estructurada","desarrollo de software","programación funcional"],"fr":["Cats Effect IO","outil de base de données","JVM","effets secondaires","concurrence structurée","développement de logiciels","programmation fonctionnelle"],"de":["Cats Effect IO","Datenbank-Toolkit","JVM","Nebeneffekte","strukturierte Konkurrenz","Software-Entwicklung","funktionale Programmierung"],"pt":["Cats Effect IO","JVM","Scala","gerenciamento de efeitos colaterais","concorrência estruturada","Resource","IO","SyncIO","F"],"ru":["Cats Effect IO","JVM","Scala","управление побочными эффектами","структурированная конкурентность","Resource","IO","SyncIO","F"],"ar":["كэтس إيفكت آي أو","جافا في إم","سكالا","إدارة الآثار الجانبية","الت конкурентية المنظمة","Resource","IO","SyncIO","F"]}},"owner":"funfix","repo":"database","repoPath":"funfix/database","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cats-effect-io","description":"Scala functional programming with Cats Effect IO and typeclasses. Use for wrapping side effects, modeling purity, choosing Sync/Async/Temporal/Concurrent, handling blocking I/O, and composing resources, fibers, and concurrency safely.","bodyPreview":"# Cats Effect IO (Scala)\n\n## Quick start\n- Treat every side effect as an effect value: return `IO[A]`, `SyncIO[A]`, or `F[A]` with `F[_]: Sync`/`Async`/`Temporal` as needed.\n- Wrap Java blocking calls with `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`).\n- Use `Resource` to acquire/release resources and `IOApp` for program entry points.\n- Prefer structured concurrency (`parTraverse`, `parMapN`, `background`, `Supervisor`) over manual fiber management.\n- Read `referenc","body":"# Cats Effect IO (Scala)\n\n## Quick start\n- Treat every side effect as an effect value: return `IO[A]`, `SyncIO[A]`, or `F[A]` with `F[_]: Sync`/`Async`/`Temporal` as needed.\n- Wrap Java blocking calls with `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`).\n- Use `Resource` to acquire/release resources and `IOApp` for program entry points.\n- Prefer structured concurrency (`parTraverse`, `parMapN`, `background`, `Supervisor`) over manual fiber management.\n- Read `references/cats-effect-io.md` for concepts, recipes, and FAQ guidance.\n- For deeper `Resource` guidance, use the `cats-effect-resource` skill (install: `npx skills add https://github.com/alexandru/skills --skill cats-effect-resource`).\n\n## Workflow\n1. Classify side effects and choose the effect type: `IO` directly or polymorphic `F[_]` with the smallest required Cats Effect typeclass (`Sync`, `Async`, `Temporal`, `Concurrent`).\n2. Wrap side-effectful code using `IO(...)`, `IO.blocking`, `IO.interruptible`, or `IO.async` (or their `Sync`/`Async` equivalents).\n3. Manage resources with `Resource` or `bracket` and keep acquisition/release inside effects.\n4. Compose effects with `flatMap`/for-comprehensions and collection combinators (`traverse`, `parTraverse`).\n5. Use concurrency primitives (`Ref`, `Deferred`, `Queue`, `Semaphore`, `Supervisor`) and structured concurrency to avoid fiber leaks.\n\n## Side-effect rules (apply to `IO`, `SyncIO`, and to `F[_]: Sync/Async`)\n- All side-effectful functions must return results wrapped in `IO` (or `F[_]` with Cats Effect typeclasses).\n- Side-effects include all non-determinism (call sites are not referentially transparent):\n  - Any I/O (files, sockets, console, databases).\n  - `Instant.now()`, `Random.nextInt()`.\n  - Any read from shared mutable state (the read itself is the side effect).\n  - Returning mutable data structures (for example, `Array[Int]`).\n\n## Blocking I/O rules\n- Java blocking methods must be wrapped in `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`) so they run on the blocking pool.\n- Prefer `IO.interruptible` for methods that may throw `InterruptedException` or `IOException`, but not for resource disposal.\n- Use `IO.blocking` for cleanup/disposal (`Closeable#close`, `AutoCloseable#close`).\n\n## Output expectations\n- Make side effects explicit in signatures (`IO`/`SyncIO` or `F[_]: Sync/Async`); the guidance here applies equally to concrete `IO` and polymorphic `F[_]`.\n- Use the smallest typeclass constraint that supports the needed operations.\n- Keep effects as values; do not execute effects in constructors or top-level vals.\n\n## References\n- Load `references/cats-effect-io.md` for documentation summary and patterns.\n- For concrete samples, read `references/cats-effect-io.md`.\n- Use the `cats-effect-resource` skill for Resource-specific workflows and patterns (install: `npx skills add https://github.com/alexandru/skills --skill cats-effect-resource`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:16:19.267Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Scala-based AI Agents requiring efficient database operations and concurrency management","zh":"适用于需要高效数据库操作和并发管理的 Scala 基础 AI 代理","ja":"ScalaベースのAIエージェントが効率的なデータベース操作とコンカレンシー管理を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"효율적인 데이터베이스操作과 병행성 관리가 필요한 Scala 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Scala que requieren operaciones de base de datos eficientes y gestión de concurrencia","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Scala nécessitant des opérations de base de données efficaces et une gestion de la concurrence","de":"Ideal für Scala-basierte KI-Agenten, die effiziente Datenbankoperationen und Konkurrenzmanagement erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Scala que exigem operações de banco de dados eficientes e gerenciamento de concorrência","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Scala, требующих эффективных операций с базой данных и управления конкурентностью","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على سكالا الذي يتطلب عمليات قاعدة بيانات فعالة وإدارة تزامن"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle side effects with IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A] using Sync, Async, or Temporal type classes, while utilizing Resource for resource management and IOApp for program entry points, all through structured concurrency with parTraverse, parMapN, and Supervisor","zh":"赋予代理使用 Sync、Async 或 Temporal 类型类处理副作用，使用 IO[A]、SyncIO[A] 或 F[A]，同时利用 Resource 进行资源管理和 IOApp 进行程序入口点，所有通过结构化并发使用 parTraverse、parMapN 和 Supervisor","ja":"Sync、Async、または Temporal 型クラスを使用して IO[A]、SyncIO[A]、または F[A] で副作用を処理し、Resource でリソース管理を行い、IOApp でプログラムのエントリーポイントを提供し、parTraverse、parMapN、Supervisor を使用した構造化コンカレンシー","ko":"Sync, Async 또는 Temporal 유형 클래스를 사용하여 IO[A], SyncIO[A] 또는 F[A]로 부작용을 처리하고 Resource를 사용하여 리소스 관리를 performs하고 IOApp를 사용하여 프로그램 진입점을 제공하며 parTraverse, parMapN 및 Supervisor를 사용한 구조화된 병행성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar efectos secundarios con IO[A], SyncIO[A] o F[A] utilizando las clases de tipo Sync, Async o Temporal, mientras utiliza Resource para la gestión de recursos y IOApp para puntos de entrada de programas, todo a través de la concurrencia estructurada con parTraverse, parMapN y Supervisor","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les effets secondaires avec IO[A], SyncIO[A] ou F[A] en utilisant les classes de type Sync, Async ou Temporal, tout en utilisant Resource pour la gestion des ressources et IOApp pour les points d''entrée des programmes, le tout via la concurrence structurée avec parTraverse, parMapN et Supervisor","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Nebeneffekte mit IO[A], SyncIO[A] oder F[A] unter Verwendung der Typklassen Sync, Async oder Temporal zu handhaben, während Resource für die Ressourcenverwaltung und IOApp für Programm-Einstiegspunkte verwendet wird, alles über strukturierte Konkurrenz mit parTraverse, parMapN und Supervisor","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com efeitos colaterais com IO[A], SyncIO[A] ou F[A] usando as classes de tipo Sync, Async ou Temporal, enquanto utiliza o Resource para gerenciamento de recursos e IOApp para pontos de entrada de programas, tudo por meio da concorrência estruturada com parTraverse, parMapN e Supervisor","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать побочные эффекты с помощью IO[A], SyncIO[A] или F[A] с использованием классов типов Sync, Async или Temporal, а также использует Resource для управления ресурсами и IOApp для точек входа программ, все это благодаря структурированной конкурентности с parTraverse, parMapN и Supervisor","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من التعامل مع الآثار الجانبية باستخدام IO[A]، SyncIO[A] أو F[A] باستخدام فئات النوع Sync، Async أو Temporal، في حين يستخدم Resource لإدارة الموارد و IOApp لنقاط الدخول إلى البرامج، وكل ذلك من خلال التزامن المنظم مع parTraverse و parMapN و Supervisor"},"useCases":{"en":["Managing database connections with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible","Implementing concurrent data processing using parTraverse and parMapN","Building scalable applications with Supervisor and background tasks"],"zh":["使用 IO.blocking 或 IO.interruptible 管理数据库连接","使用 parTraverse 和 parMapN 实现并发数据处理","使用 Supervisor 和后台任务构建可扩展应用程序"],"ja":["IO.blocking または IO.interruptible を使用したデータベース接続の管理","parTraverse と parMapN を使用したコンカレントデータ処理の実装","Supervisor とバックグラウンドタスクを使用したスケーラブルなアプリケーションの構築"],"ko":["IO.blocking 또는 IO.interruptible을 사용한 데이터베이스 연결 관리","parTraverse 및 parMapN을 사용한 병렬 데이터 처리 구현","Supervisor 및 백그라운드 작업을 사용한 확장 가능한 애플리케이션 구축"],"es":["Gestión de conexiones de base de datos con IO.blocking o IO.interruptible","Implementación de procesamiento de datos concurrente utilizando parTraverse y parMapN","Creación de aplicaciones escalables con Supervisor y tareas en segundo plano"],"fr":["Gestion des connexions de base de données avec IO.blocking ou IO.interruptible","Mise en œuvre du traitement de données concurrent en utilisant parTraverse et parMapN","Création d''applications évolutives avec Supervisor et tâches en arrière-plan"],"de":["Verwaltung von Datenbankverbindungen mit IO.blocking oder IO.interruptible","Implementierung von konkurrierendem Datenverarbeitung mithilfe von parTraverse und parMapN","Erstellung von skalierbaren Anwendungen mit Supervisor und Hintergrundaufgaben"],"pt":["Gerenciando conexões de banco de dados com IO.blocking ou IO.interruptible","Implementando processamento de dados concorrente usando parTraverse e parMapN","Construindo aplicações escaláveis com Supervisor e tarefas em segundo plano"],"ru":["Управление подключениями к базе данных с помощью IO.blocking или IO.interruptible","Реализация конкурентной обработки данных с помощью parTraverse и parMapN","Создание масштабируемых приложений с помощью Supervisor и фоновых задач"],"ar":["إدارة الاتصالات بقاعدة البيانات باستخدام IO.blocking أو IO.interruptible","تنفيذ معالجة البيانات المتزامنة باستخدام parTraverse و parMapN","بناء التطبيقات القابلة للتحجيم مع Supervisor والمهام الخلفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JVM environment","Scala programming language dependency","Manual fiber management not recommended"],"zh":["需要 JVM 环境","Scala 编程语言依赖","手动纤维管理不推荐"],"ja":["JVM 環境が必要","Scala プログラミング言語への依存","手動でのファイバ管理は推奨されない"],"ko":["JVM 환경 필요","Scala 프로그래밍 언어 종속","수동 파이버 관리는 권장되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere entorno JVM","Dependencia del lenguaje de programación Scala","No se recomienda la gestión manual de fibras"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement JVM","Dépendance du langage de programmation Scala","La gestion manuelle des fibres n''est pas recommandée"],"de":["Benötigt eine JVM-Umgebung","Abhängigkeit von der Scala-Programmiersprache","Manuelle Faserverwaltung wird nicht empfohlen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente JVM","Dependência da linguagem de programação Scala","Gerenciamento manual de fibras não recomendado"],"ru":["Требует среды JVM","Зависимость от языка программирования Scala","Ручное управление волокнами не рекомендуется"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة JVM","اعتماد على لغة برمجة سكالا","التحكم اليدوي في الألياف غير مشجع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('way-platform/tachograph-go/way-magefile', 'community', 'way-platform', 'tachograph-go', 'way-platform/tachograph-go', 'way-magefile', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:16:37.863Z', NULL, '{"id":"way-platform/tachograph-go/way-magefile","name":"way-magefile","description":{"es":"way-magefile es un SDK de Go para trabajar con archivos tachográficos (.DDD). Permite la automatización de tareas y la gestión de dependencias con Mage.","fr":"way-magefile est un SDK Go pour les fichiers tachographiques (.DDD). Il permet l''automatisation de tâches et la gestion de dépendances avec Mage.","de":"way-magefile ist ein Go-SDK für Tachographen-Dateien (.DDD). Es ermöglicht die Automatisierung von Aufgaben und die Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten mit Mage.","pt":"O way-magefile é uma ferramenta de construção para projetos Go que permite automatizar tarefas e gerenciar dependências de forma eficiente","ru":"way-magefile - это инструмент для автоматизации задач и управления зависимостями в проектах на Go","ar":"way-magefile هي أداة بناء لمشاريع جوجو التي تتيح لك توفير الوقت والجهود من خلال تلقيم المهام والاعتماديات","en":"Go SDK for tachograph (.DDD) files"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"way-magefile: SDK de Go para archivos tachográficos","fr":"way-magefile: SDK Go pour fichiers tachographiques","de":"way-magefile: Go-SDK für Tachographen-Dateien","pt":"way-magefile: SDK Go para Arquivos Tachograph","ru":"way-magefile: SDK для файлов тахографа на Go","ar":"way-magefile: SDK جوجو لملفات تاكوغراف","en":"way-magefile"},"description":{"es":"way-magefile es un SDK de Go para trabajar con archivos tachográficos (.DDD). Permite la automatización de tareas y la gestión de dependencias con Mage.","fr":"way-magefile est un SDK Go pour les fichiers tachographiques (.DDD). Il permet l''automatisation de tâches et la gestion de dépendances avec Mage.","de":"way-magefile ist ein Go-SDK für Tachographen-Dateien (.DDD). Es ermöglicht die Automatisierung von Aufgaben und die Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten mit Mage.","pt":"O way-magefile é uma ferramenta de construção para projetos Go que permite automatizar tarefas e gerenciar dependências de forma eficiente","ru":"way-magefile - это инструмент для автоматизации задач и управления зависимостями в проектах на Go","ar":"way-magefile هي أداة بناء لمشاريع جوجو التي تتيح لك توفير الوقت والجهود من خلال تلقيم المهام والاعتماديات","en":"Go SDK for tachograph (.DDD) files"},"definition":{"en":"Go SDK for tachograph (.DDD) files"},"features":{"es":["SDK de Go para archivos tachográficos (.DDD)","Automatización de tareas con Mage","Gestión de dependencias entre tareas","Creación de scripts de construcción para proyectos Go","Instalación, construcción, limpieza y lanzamiento de proyectos"],"fr":["SDK Go pour les fichiers tachographiques (.DDD)","Automatisation de tâches avec Mage","Gestion de dépendances entre tâches","Création de scripts de construction pour les projets Go","Installation, construction, nettoyage et lancement de projets"],"de":["Go-SDK für Tachographen-Dateien (.DDD)","Automatisierung von Aufgaben mit Mage","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten zwischen Aufgaben","Erstellung von Build-Skripten für Go-Projekte","Installation, Bau, Reinigung und Veröffentlichung von Projekten"],"pt":["Automatização de tarefas","Gestão de dependências","Construção de projetos Go","Integração com Mage","Suporte a arquivos tachograph (.DDD)"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач","Управление зависимостями","Сборка проектов на Go","Интеграция с Mage","Поддержка файлов тахографа (.DDD)"],"ar":["تلقيم المهام","إدارة الإعتماديات","بناء مشاريع جوجو","التكامل مع Mage","دعم ملفات تاكوغراف (.DDD)"]},"keywords":{"es":["way-magefile","SDK de Go","archivos tachográficos","Mage","automatización de tareas","gestión de dependencias","proyectos Go","construcción de proyectos","tachógrafos"],"fr":["way-magefile","SDK Go","fichiers tachographiques","Mage","automatisation de tâches","gestion de dépendances","projets Go","construction de projets","tachygraphes"],"de":["way-magefile","Go-SDK","Tachographen-Dateien","Mage","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten","Go-Projekte","Build-Projekte","Tachographen"],"pt":["way-magefile","SDK Go","arquivos tachograph","construção de projetos","automatização de tarefas","gestão de dependências","Mage","Go","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["way-magefile","SDK для Go","файлы тахографа","сборка проектов","автоматизация задач","управление зависимостями","Mage","Go","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["way-magefile","SDK جوجو","ملفات تاكوغراف","بناء المشاريع","تلقيم المهام","إدارة الإعتماديات","Mage","جوجو","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"way-platform","repo":"tachograph-go","repoPath":"way-platform/tachograph-go","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"way-magefile","description":"Build tool for Go projects. Use when the user wants to create, edit, or understand Way-specific Magefiles, build targets, or automate Go project tasks.","bodyPreview":"# Mage\n\nMage is a make-like build tool using Go. You write plain-old go functions, and Mage automatically uses them as Makefile-like runnable targets.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating build scripts for Go projects.\n- Automating tasks (install, build, clean, release).\n- Managing dependencies between tasks.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Magefiles\n\n- Any Go file with `//go:build mage` (or `+build mage` for older Go).\n- Usually named `magefile.go` or placed in `magefiles/` directory.\n- `package main`.\n\n### 2","body":"# Mage\n\nMage is a make-like build tool using Go. You write plain-old go functions, and Mage automatically uses them as Makefile-like runnable targets.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating build scripts for Go projects.\n- Automating tasks (install, build, clean, release).\n- Managing dependencies between tasks.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Magefiles\n\n- Any Go file with `//go:build mage` (or `+build mage` for older Go).\n- Usually named `magefile.go` or placed in `magefiles/` directory.\n- `package main`.\n\n### 2. Targets\n\n- Exported functions with specific signatures:\n- `func Target()`\n- `func Target() error`\n- `func Target(ctx context.Context) error`\n- First sentence of doc comment is the short description (`mage -l`).\n\n### 3. Dependencies\n\n- Use `mg.Deps(Func)` to declare dependencies.\n- Dependencies run exactly once per execution.\n- `mg.Deps` runs in parallel; `mg.SerialDeps` runs serially.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo create a new magefile:\n`mage -init`\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n**Running Commands:**\nUse `github.com/magefile/mage/sh` for shell execution.\n\n```go\nimport \"github.com/magefile/mage/sh\"\n// ...\nerr := sh.Run(\"go\", \"build\", \"./...\")\n```\n\n**Clean Up:**\n\n```go\nimport \"github.com/magefile/mage/sh\"\n// ...\nsh.Rm(\"bin\")\n```\n\n## References\n\n- **Way Conventions**: See [references/way-style.md](references/way-style.md) for Way-specific patterns and helpers.\n- **API Documentation**: See [references/api.md](references/api.md) for `mg`, `sh`, and `target` package details.\n- **Examples**: See [references/examples.md](references/examples.md) for common patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:16:37.863Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Go-based AI Agents requiring automated build and task management capabilities for their projects.","zh":"适用于需要自动化构建和任务管理功能的 Go 基础 AI 代理的理想选择。","ja":"Go ベースの AI エージェントがプロジェクトで自動化されたビルドとタスク管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"프로젝트에서 자동화 된 빌드 및 작업 관리 기능이 필요한 Go 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de AI basados en Go que requieren capacidades de gestión de compilación y tarea automatizadas para sus proyectos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Go nécessitant des capacités de construction et de gestion de tâches automatisées pour leurs projets.","de":"Ideal für Go-basierte KI-Agents, die automatisierte Build- und Task-Management-Funktionen für ihre Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em Go que exigem capacidades de gerenciamento de compilação e tarefa automatizados para seus projetos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Go, требующих автоматизированных возможностей управления сборкой и задачами для своих проектов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى Go الذي يتطلب إمكانيات إدارة البناء وال任务 الآلي لمشاريعه."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage build scripts, automate tasks like installation, building, and cleaning, and handle dependencies between tasks using plain-old Go functions and Magefiles, specifically leveraging the .DDD file format for tachograph data.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理构建脚本、自动化诸如安装、构建和清理等任务的能力，并使用普通的 Go 函数和 Magefiles 处理任务之间的依赖，特别利用 .DDD 文件格式处理tachograph数据。","ja":"エージェントがビルドスクリプトを作成して管理し、インストール、ビルド、クリーンなどのタスクを自動化し、プレーンオールドGo関数とMagefilesを使用してタスク間の依存関係を処理し、特にtachographデータのDDDファイル形式を利用する能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 빌드 스크립트를 생성하고 관리하고, 설치, 빌드, 클리닝などの 작업을 자동화하고, 평범한 Go 함수와 Magefiles를 사용하여 작업 간의 의존성을 처리하며, 특히 tachograph 데이터의 .DDD 파일 형식을 활용하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar scripts de compilación, automatizar tareas como la instalación, la compilación y la limpieza, y gestionar dependencias entre tareas utilizando funciones de Go simples y Magefiles, aprovechando específicamente el formato de archivo .DDD para datos de tacógrafo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des scripts de construction, d''automatiser des tâches comme l''installation, la construction et le nettoyage, et de gérer les dépendances entre les tâches en utilisant des fonctions Go simples et des Magefiles, en exploitant spécifiquement le format de fichier .DDD pour les données de tachygraphe.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Build-Skripte zu erstellen und zu verwalten, Aufgaben wie Installation, Build und Bereinigung zu automatisieren und Abhängigkeiten zwischen Aufgaben mithilfe einfacher Go-Funktionen und Magefiles zu verwalten, wobei insbesondere das .DDD-Dateiformat für Tachographendaten genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar scripts de compilação, automatizar tarefas como instalação, compilação e limpeza, e lidar com dependências entre tarefas usando funções Go simples e arquivos Mage, aproveitando especificamente o formato de arquivo .DDD para dados de tacógrafo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять скриптами сборки, автоматизировать задачи, такие как установка, сборка и очистка, и обрабатывать зависимости между задачами с помощью простых функций Go и файлов Mage, специально используя формат файла .DDD для данных тахографа.","ar":"يسمح للعميل أن يخلق ويدرّب سيناريوهات بناء، وتشغيل مهام آلي مثل التثبيت والبناء والتنظيف، وتحديد الاعتماديات بين المهام باستخدام دوال Go العادية والملفات Mage، واستخدام صيغة ملف .DDD لبيانات التاكوجراف تحديدا."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating build processes for Go projects","Managing dependencies between installation, build, and release tasks","Creating custom Magefiles for specific project needs"],"zh":["自动化 Go 项目的构建过程","管理安装、构建和发布任务之间的依赖关系","为特定项目需求创建自定义的 Magefiles"],"ja":["Go プロジェクトのビルド プロセスを自動化する","インストール、ビルド、リリース タスク間の依存関係を管理する","特定のプロジェクト ニーズに合わせたカスタム Magefiles を作成する"],"ko":["Go 프로젝트의 빌드 프로세스를 자동화하는 것","설치, 빌드, 릴리즈 작업 간의 의존성을 관리하는 것","특정 프로젝트 요구에 맞게 사용자 정의 Magefilesを作成하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar los procesos de compilación para proyectos de Go","Gestionar dependencias entre tareas de instalación, compilación y lanzamiento","Crear Magefiles personalizados para necesidades de proyecto específicas"],"fr":["Automatiser les processus de construction pour les projets Go","Gérer les dépendances entre les tâches d''installation, de construction et de publication","Créer des Magefiles personnalisés pour les besoins spécifiques des projets"],"de":["Automatisierung von Build-Prozessen für Go-Projekte","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten zwischen Installations-, Build- und Release-Aufgaben","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Magefiles für spezifische Projektanforderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de compilação para projetos Go","Gerenciar dependências entre tarefas de instalação, compilação e lançamento","Criar arquivos Mage personalizados para necessidades de projeto específicas"],"ru":["Автоматизация процессов сборки для проектов Go","Управление зависимостями между задачами установки, сборки и выпуска","Создание пользовательских файлов Mage для конкретных потребностей проекта"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات البناء للمشاريع Go","إدارة الإعتماديات بين مهام التثبيت والبناء والإصدار","إنشاء ملفات Mage مخصصة لاحتياجات المشروع المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go SDK for tachograph (.DDD) files","Limited to Go-based projects","Needs //go:build mage or +build mage directive in Go files"],"zh":["需要 Go SDK 来支持 tachograph (.DDD) 文件","仅限于 Go 基础项目","需要在 Go 文件中添加 //go:build mage 或 +build mage 指令"],"ja":["tachograph (.DDD) ファイルをサポートするために Go SDK が必要","Go ベースのプロジェクトに限定される","Go ファイルに //go:build mage または +build mage ディレクティブが必要"],"ko":["tachograph (.DDD) 파일을 지원하기 위해 Go SDK가 필요함","Go 기반 프로젝트에만 제한됨","Go 파일에 //go:build mage 또는 +build mage 지시어가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere Go SDK para archivos de tacógrafo (.DDD)","Limitado a proyectos basados en Go","Necesita la directiva //go:build mage o +build mage en los archivos Go"],"fr":["Nécessite le SDK Go pour les fichiers de tachygraphe (.DDD)","Limité aux projets basés sur Go","Nécessite la directive //go:build mage ou +build mage dans les fichiers Go"],"de":["Benötigt Go-SDK für Tachographen-Dateien (.DDD)","Begrenzt auf Go-basierte Projekte","Benötigt die Direktive //go:build mage oder +build mage in den Go-Dateien"],"pt":["Exige SDK do Go para arquivos de tacógrafo (.DDD)","Limitado a projetos baseados em Go","Necessita de diretiva //go:build mage ou +build mage em arquivos Go"],"ru":["Требует SDK Go для файлов тахографа (.DDD)","Ограничен проектами на основе Go","Требует директивы //go:build mage или +build mage в файлах Go"],"ar":["يتطلب SDK Go لملفات التاكوجراف (.DDD)","محدود لمشاريع قائمة على Go","يحتاج إلى توجيه //go:build mage أو +build mage في ملفات Go"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('charl-kruger/charl/agents-sdk', 'community', 'charl-kruger', 'charl', 'charl-kruger/charl', 'agents-sdk', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:16:19.062Z', NULL, '{"id":"charl-kruger/charl/agents-sdk","name":"agents-sdk","description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Agents SDK, build persistent, stateful AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the agents npm package.","ja":"Cloudflare Agents SDK, Cloudflare Workersagents npm","ko":"Cloudflare Agents SDK, Cloudflare Workersagents npm","es":"El SDK de Cloudflare Agents permite a los desarrolladores crear agentes de IA estado que se ejecutan en Cloudflare Workers. Aprende a instalar y utilizar el paquete npm ''agents''.","fr":"Le SDK Cloudflare Agents permet aux développeurs de créer des agents IA étatiques qui s''exécutent sur Cloudflare Workers. Découvrez comment installer et utiliser le paquete npm ''agents''.","de":"Das Cloudflare Agents SDK ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Zustandsbehaftete KI-Agenten zu erstellen, die auf Cloudflare Workers ausgeführt werden. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie das npm-Paket ''agents'' installieren und verwenden.","pt":"Cloudflare Agents SDK permite desenvolver agentes de IA persistentes e stateful. Aprenda a instalar e utilizar.","ru":"Cloudflare Agents SDK позволяет разрабатывать агенты ИИ с сохранением состояния. Узнайте, как установить и использовать.","ar":"Cloudflare Agents SDK يسمح بإنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي متواصلين ومتحكمين في الحالة. تعلم كيفية التثبيت والاستخدام.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Cloudflare Agents SDK","ja":"Cloudflare Agents SDK","ko":"Cloudflare Agents SDK","es":"SDK de Agentes de Cloudflare: Desarrolla Agentes de IA Es...","fr":"SDK Cloudflare Agents : Créez des Agents IA Étatiques","de":"Cloudflare Agents SDK: Erstellen Sie Zustandsbehaftete KI...","pt":"Desenvolva Agentes de IA com Cloudflare Agents SDK","ru":"Разработка агентов ИИ с Cloudflare Agents SDK","ar":"طور وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام Cloudflare Agents SDK","en":"agents-sdk"},"description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Agents SDK, build persistent, stateful AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the agents npm package.","ja":"Cloudflare Agents SDK, Cloudflare Workersagents npm","ko":"Cloudflare Agents SDK, Cloudflare Workersagents npm","es":"El SDK de Cloudflare Agents permite a los desarrolladores crear agentes de IA estado que se ejecutan en Cloudflare Workers. Aprende a instalar y utilizar el ...","fr":"Le SDK Cloudflare Agents permet aux développeurs de créer des agents IA étatiques qui s''exécutent sur Cloudflare Workers. Découvrez comment installer et util...","de":"Das Cloudflare Agents SDK ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Zustandsbehaftete KI-Agenten zu erstellen, die auf Cloudflare Workers ausgeführt werden. Erfahren Sie, w...","pt":"Cloudflare Agents SDK permite desenvolver agentes de IA persistentes e stateful. Aprenda a instalar e utilizar.","ru":"Cloudflare Agents SDK позволяет разрабатывать агенты ИИ с сохранением состояния. Узнайте, как установить и использовать.","ar":"Cloudflare Agents SDK يسمح بإنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي متواصلين ومتحكمين في الحالة. تعلم كيفية التثبيت والاستخدام.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Build persistent, stateful AI agents on Cloudflare Workers","Use the agents npm package","Supports durable objects and SQLite storage","Requires binding in wrangler.jsonc","Supports migrations for Agent classes"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workers","agents npm","durable objectsSQLite","wrangler.jsonc","Agent"],"ko":["Cloudflare Workers","agents npm","durable objectsSQLite","wrangler.jsonc","Agent"],"es":["Crea agentes de IA estado que se ejecutan en Cloudflare Workers","Utiliza el paquete npm ''agents'' para desarrollar aplicaciones escalables","Binding en wrangler.jsonc para configurar los agentes","Soporte para almacenamiento en SQLite","Permite la creación de aplicaciones estado con funcionalidades avanzadas"],"fr":["Créez des agents IA étatiques qui s''exécutent sur Cloudflare Workers","Utilisez le paquete npm ''agents'' pour développer des applications évolutives","Binding dans wrangler.jsonc pour configurer les agents","Prise en charge du stockage en SQLite","Permet la création d''applications état avec des fonctionnalités avancées"],"de":["Erstellen Sie Zustandsbehaftete KI-Agenten, die auf Cloudflare Workers ausgeführt werden","Verwenden Sie das npm-Paket ''agents'', um skalierbare Anwendungen zu entwickeln","Binding in wrangler.jsonc zur Konfiguration der Agenten","Unterstützung für Speicherung in SQLite","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Zustandsanwendungen mit erweiterten Funktionen"],"pt":["Criação de agentes de IA persistentes","Suporte a estado stateful","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Uso do pacote npm ''agents''","Requer binding em ''wrangler.jsonc''","Suporte a armazenamento SQLite"],"ru":["Создание агентов ИИ с сохранением состояния","Поддержка состояния stateful","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Использование пакета npm ''agents''","Требуется привязка в ''wrangler.jsonc''","Поддержка хранилища SQLite"],"ar":["إنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي متواصلين","دعم الحالة المتحكمة","التكامل مع Cloudflare Workers","استخدام حزمة npm ''agents''","التركيب المطلوب في ''wrangler.jsonc''","دعم تخزين SQLite"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare Agents SDK","Cloudflare Workers","AI agents","stateful AI","persistent AI","agents npm package","durable objects","SQLite storage"],"ja":["Cloudflare Agents SDK","Cloudflare Workers","AI","stateful AI","persistent AI","agents npm","durable objects","SQLite"],"ko":["Cloudflare Agents SDK","Cloudflare Workers","AI","stateful AI","persistent AI","agents npm","durable objects","SQLite"],"es":["SDK de Cloudflare Agents","Agentes de IA estado","Cloudflare Workers","Desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables","npm paquete agents","Almacenamiento en SQLite"],"fr":["SDK Cloudflare Agents","Agents IA étatiques","Cloudflare Workers","Développement d''applications évolutives","Paquete npm agents","Stockage en SQLite"],"de":["Cloudflare Agents SDK","Zustandsbehaftete KI-Agenten","Cloudflare Workers","Entwicklung von skalierbaren Anwendungen","npm-Paket agents","Speicherung in SQLite"],"pt":["Cloudflare Agents SDK","Desenvolvimento de IA","Agentes de IA","Cloudflare Workers","npm agents","wrangler.jsonc","SQLite","Estado stateful","Persistência de dados"],"ru":["Cloudflare Agents SDK","Разработка ИИ","Агенты ИИ","Cloudflare Workers","пакет npm agents","wrangler.jsonc","SQLite","Состояние stateful","Сохранение данных"],"ar":["Cloudflare Agents SDK","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","Cloudflare Workers","حزمة npm agents","wrangler.jsonc","SQLite","الحالة المتحكمة","استمرارية البيانات"]}},"owner":"charl-kruger","repo":"charl","repoPath":"charl-kruger/charl","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agents-sdk","description":"Build stateful AI agents using the Cloudflare Agents SDK. Load when creating agents with persistent state, scheduling, RPC, MCP servers, email handling, or streaming chat. Covers Agent class, AIChatAgent, state management, and Code Mode for reduced token usage.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Agents SDK\n\nBuild persistent, stateful AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the `agents` npm package.\n\n## FIRST: Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install agents\n```\n\nAgents require a binding in `wrangler.jsonc`:\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"durable_objects\": {\n    // \"class_name\" must match your Agent class name exactly\n    \"bindings\": [{ \"name\": \"Counter\", \"class_name\": \"Counter\" }]\n  },\n  \"migrations\": [\n    // Required: list all Agent classes for SQLite storage\n    { \"tag\": \"v1\", \"new_sqlite_","body":"# Cloudflare Agents SDK\n\nBuild persistent, stateful AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the `agents` npm package.\n\n## FIRST: Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install agents\n```\n\nAgents require a binding in `wrangler.jsonc`:\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"durable_objects\": {\n    // \"class_name\" must match your Agent class name exactly\n    \"bindings\": [{ \"name\": \"Counter\", \"class_name\": \"Counter\" }]\n  },\n  \"migrations\": [\n    // Required: list all Agent classes for SQLite storage\n    { \"tag\": \"v1\", \"new_sqlite_classes\": [\"Counter\"] }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Choosing an Agent Type\n\n| Use Case                      | Base Class    | Package               |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------- | --------------------- |\n| Custom state + RPC, no chat   | `Agent`       | `agents`              |\n| Chat with message persistence | `AIChatAgent` | `@cloudflare/ai-chat` |\n| Building an MCP server        | `McpAgent`    | `agents/mcp`          |\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- **Agent** base class provides state, scheduling, RPC, MCP, and email capabilities\n- **AIChatAgent** adds streaming chat with automatic message persistence and resumable streams\n- **Code Mode** generates executable code instead of tool calls—reduces token usage significantly\n- **this.state / this.setState()** - automatic persistence to SQLite, broadcasts to clients\n- **this.schedule()** - schedule tasks at Date, delay (seconds), or cron expression\n- **@callable** decorator - expose methods to clients via WebSocket RPC\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task            | API                                                        |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Persist state   | `this.setState({ count: 1 })`                              |\n| Read state      | `this.state.count`                                         |\n| Schedule task   | `this.schedule(60, \"taskMethod\", payload)`                 |\n| Schedule cron   | `this.schedule(\"0 * * * *\", \"hourlyTask\")`                 |\n| Cancel schedule | `this.cancelSchedule(id)`                                  |\n| Queue task      | `this.queue(\"processItem\", payload)`                       |\n| SQL query       | `` this.sql`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${id}` ``       |\n| RPC method      | `@callable() async myMethod() { ... }`                     |\n| Streaming RPC   | `@callable({ streaming: true }) async stream(res) { ... }` |\n\n## Minimal Agent\n\n```typescript\nimport { Agent, routeAgentRequest, callable } from \"agents\";\n\ntype State = { count: number };\n\nexport class Counter extends Agent<Env, State> {\n  initialState = { count: 0 };\n\n  @callable()\n  increment() {\n    this.setState({ count: this.state.count + 1 });\n    return this.state.count;\n  }\n}\n\nexport default {\n  fetch: (req, env) =>\n    routeAgentRequest(req, env) ?? new Response(\"Not found\", { status: 404 })\n};\n```\n\n## Streaming Chat Agent\n\nUse `AIChatAgent` for chat with automatic message persistence and resumable streaming.\n\n**Install additional dependencies first:**\n\n```bash\nnpm install @cloudflare/ai-chat ai @ai-sdk/openai\n```\n\n**Add wrangler.jsonc config** (same pattern as base Agent):\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"durable_objects\": {\n    \"bindings\": [{ \"name\": \"Chat\", \"class_name\": \"Chat\" }]\n  },\n  \"migrations\": [{ \"tag\": \"v1\", \"new_sqlite_classes\": [\"Chat\"] }]\n}\n```\n\n```typescript\nimport { AIChatAgent } from \"@cloudflare/ai-chat\";\nimport { routeAgentRequest } from \"agents\";\nimport { streamText, convertToModelMessages } from \"ai\";\nimport { openai } from \"@ai-sdk/openai\";\n\nexport class Chat extends AIChatAgent<Env> {\n  async onChatMessage(onFinish) {\n    const result = streamText({\n      model: openai(\"gpt-4o\"),\n      messages: await convertToModelMessages(this.messages),\n      onFinish\n    });\n    return result.toUIMessageStreamResponse();\n  }\n}\n\nexport default {\n  fetch: (req, env) =>\n    routeAgentRequest(req, env) ?? new Response(\"Not found\", { status: 404 })\n};\n```\n\n**Client** (React):\n\n```tsx\nimport { useAgent } from \"agents/react\";\nimport { useAgentChat } from \"@cloudflare/ai-chat/react\";\n\nconst agent = useAgent({ agent: \"Chat\", name: \"my-chat\" });\nconst { messages, input, handleSubmit } = useAgentChat({ agent });\n```\n\n## Detailed References\n\n- **[references/state-scheduling.md](references/state-scheduling.md)** - State persistence, scheduling, queues\n- **[references/streaming-chat.md](references/streaming-chat.md)** - AIChatAgent, resumable streams, UI patterns\n- **[references/codemode.md](references/codemode.md)** - Generate code instead of tool calls (token savings)\n- **[references/mcp.md](references/mcp.md)** - MCP server integration\n- **[references/email.md](references/email.md)** - Email routing and handling\n\n## When to Use Code Mode\n\nCode Mode generates executable JavaScript instead of making individual tool calls. Use it when:\n\n- Chaining multiple tool calls in sequence\n- Complex conditional logic across tools\n- MCP server orchestration (multiple servers)\n- Token budget is constrained\n\nSee [references/codemode.md](references/codemode.md) for setup and examples.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Prefer streaming**: Use `streamText` and `toUIMessageStreamResponse()` for chat\n2. **Use AIChatAgent for chat**: Handles message persistence and resumable streams automatically\n3. **Type your state**: `Agent<Env, State>` ensures type safety for `this.state`\n4. **Use @callable for RPC**: Cleaner than manual WebSocket message handling\n5. **Code Mode for complex workflows**: Reduces round-trips and token usage\n6. **Schedule vs Queue**: Use `schedule()` for time-based, `queue()` for sequential processing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:16:19.062Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloudflare Agents needing persistent, stateful functionality using the agents npm package.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 agents npm 包实现持久化、有状态功能的 Cloudflare Agents。","ja":"エージェントの npm パッケージを使用して、永続的でステートフルな機能を必要とする Cloudflare エージェントに最適です。","ko":"agents npm 패키지를 사용하여 지속적이고 상태를 유지하는 기능이 필요한 Cloudflare Agents에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para los agentes de Cloudflare que necesitan funcionalidad persistente y con estado, utilizando el paquete npm de los agentes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloudflare ayant besoin de fonctionnalités persistantes et à état, en utilisant le paquet npm des agents.","de":"Perfekt für Cloudflare-Agents, die persistente, Zustands-funktionen benötigen, indem sie das npm-Paket der Agents verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cloudflare que necessitam de funcionalidade persistente e com estado, utilizando o pacote npm dos agentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Cloudflare, которым необходима постоянная, сочетающая состояние функциональность с использованием пакета npm агентов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Cloudflare الذي يحتاج إلى وظيفة مستمرة وحالة باستخدام حزمة npm للعميل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable applications on Cloudflare Workers, leveraging durable objects and SQLite storage for seamless data management, with bindings in wrangler.jsonc and support for custom Agent class names.","zh":"赋能代理在 Cloudflare Workers 上构建可扩展的应用程序，利用 Durable Objects 和 SQLite 存储实现无缝数据管理，支持在 wrangler.jsonc 中进行绑定并支持自定义 Agent 类名。","ja":"Durable Objects と SQLite ストレージを活用したシームレスなデータ管理により、エージェントが Cloudflare Workers 上でスケーラブルなアプリケーションを構築できるようにします。wrangler.jsonc でのバインディングとカスタム Agent クラス名のサポートを含みます。","ko":"Durable Objects와 SQLite 스토리지를 활용한 원활한 데이터 관리로 Cloudflare Workers에서 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, wrangler.jsonc의 바인딩과 사용자 정의 Agent 클래스 이름 지원을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones escalables en Cloudflare Workers, aprovechando objetos duraderos y almacenamiento de SQLite para una gestión de datos sin problemas, con enlaces en wrangler.jsonc y soporte para nombres de clase de agentes personalizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications escalables sur Cloudflare Workers, en exploitant les objets durables et le stockage SQLite pour une gestion de données transparente, avec des liaisons dans wrangler.jsonc et un support pour les noms de classe d''agent personnalisés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, auf Cloudflare Workers skalierbare Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem sie dauerhafte Objekte und SQLite-Speicher für eine nahtlose Datenverwaltung nutzen, mit Bindungen in wrangler.jsonc und Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Agenten-Klassennamen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações escaláveis no Cloudflare Workers, aproveitando objetos duráveis e armazenamento SQLite para gerenciamento de dados sem interrupção, com vinculações em wrangler.jsonc e suporte a nomes personalizados de classe de agente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать масштабируемые приложения на Cloudflare Workers, используя прочные объекты и хранилище SQLite для бесперебойного управления данными, с привязками в wrangler.jsonc и поддержкой пользовательских имен классов агентов.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع على Cloudflare Workers، واستخدام كائنات متينة وتخزين SQLite لإدارة البيانات دون انقطاع، مع ربطات في wrangler.jsonc ودعم لأسماء فئات وكلاء مخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building persistent AI agents on Cloudflare Workers","Creating stateful applications with durable objects","Managing data storage with SQLite migrations"],"zh":["在 Cloudflare Workers 上构建持久化 AI 代理","使用 Durable Objects 创建有状态应用程序","使用 SQLite 迁移管理数据存储"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workers 上での永続的な AI エージェントの構築","Durable Objects を使用したステートフルアプリケーションの作成","SQLite マイグレーションによるデータストレージの管理"],"ko":["Cloudflare Workers에서 지속적인 AI 에이전트 구축","Durable Objects를 사용한 상태 저장 애플리케이션 생성","SQLite 마이그레이션으로 데이터 스토리지 관리"],"es":["Creación de agentes de inteligencia artificial persistentes en Cloudflare Workers","Creación de aplicaciones con estado con objetos duraderos","Gestión de almacenamiento de datos con migraciones de SQLite"],"fr":["Création d''agents d''intelligence artificielle persistants sur Cloudflare Workers","Création d''applications à état avec des objets durables","Gestion du stockage de données avec des migrations SQLite"],"de":["Erstellung von persistenten künstlichen Intelligenz-Agents auf Cloudflare Workers","Erstellung von Zustands-anwendungen mit dauerhaften Objekten","Verwaltung von Daten-Speicherung mit SQLite-Migrationen"],"pt":["Construção de agentes de IA persistentes no Cloudflare Workers","Criação de aplicações com estado com objetos duráveis","Gerenciamento de armazenamento de dados com migrações SQLite"],"ru":["Создание постоянных агентов ИИ на Cloudflare Workers","Создание приложений со состоянием с помощью прочных объектов","Управление хранилищем данных с помощью миграций SQLite"],"ar":["بناء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي مستمرين على Cloudflare Workers","إنشاء تطبيقات بحالة باستخدام كائنات متينة","إدارة تخزين البيانات باستخدام هجرات SQLite"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation of agents package","Needs specific binding configuration in wrangler.jsonc","Limited to Cloudflare Workers environment"],"zh":["需要安装 agents 包的 npm","需要在 wrangler.jsonc 中进行特定的绑定配置","仅限于 Cloudflare Workers 环境"],"ja":["agents パッケージの npm インストールが必要","wrangler.jsonc での特定のバインディング設定が必要","Cloudflare Workers 環境に限定される"],"ko":["agents 패키지의 npm 설치 필요","wrangler.jsonc에서 특정 바인딩 구성 필요","Cloudflare Workers 환경으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación de npm del paquete de agentes","Necesita una configuración de enlace específica en wrangler.jsonc","Limitado al entorno de Cloudflare Workers"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm du paquet d''agents","Nécessite une configuration de liaison spécifique dans wrangler.jsonc","Limité à l''environnement Cloudflare Workers"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von npm des Agents-Pakets","Benötigt eine spezifische Bindungskonfiguration in wrangler.jsonc","Begrenzt auf die Cloudflare Workers-Umgebung"],"pt":["Exige instalação do npm do pacote de agentes","Necessita de configuração de vinculação específica em wrangler.jsonc","Limitado ao ambiente Cloudflare Workers"],"ru":["Требует установки пакета агентов npm","Требует конкретной настройки привязки в wrangler.jsonc","Ограничен средой Cloudflare Workers"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت حزمة npm للوكيل","يحتاج إلى تكوين ربط محدد في wrangler.jsonc","محدود ببيئة Cloudflare Workers"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
