ing, ATS optimization, interview prep, and strategic job search."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"面试准备生成器 - 技术求职辅助","ja":"インタビュープレップジェネレーター - エンジニアのための求人支援","ko":"면접 준비 생성기 - 개발자 위한 취업 지원","es":"Generador de Preparación para Entrevistas","fr":"Générateur de Préparation d''Entretien","de":"Interview-Vorbereitungs-Generator","pt":"Gerador de Preparação para Entrevista","ru":"Генератор Подготовки к Собеседованию","ar":"مولد تحضير للمقابلات","en":"Interview Prep Generator"},"description":{"zh":"面试准备生成器是一种AI技能，帮助开发者优化简历，练习面试问题，创建STAR故事，提高求职成功率","ja":"インタビュープレップジェネレーターは、エンジニアのためのAIスキルで、履歴書を最適化し、面接問題を練習し、STARストーリーを作成して、求人成功率を高める","ko":"면접 준비 생성기는 개발자를 위한 AI 스킬로 이력서를 최적화하고 면접 문제를 연습하고 STAR 스토리를 생성하여 취업 성공률을 높입니다","es":"El Generador de Preparación para Entrevistas es una herramienta que ayuda a los desarrolladores a prepararse para las entrevistas de trabajo, creando pregunt...","fr":"Le Générateur de Préparation d''Entretien est un outil qui aide les développeurs à se préparer aux entretiens d''embauche, en créant des questions et des répon...","de":"Der Interview-Vorbereitungs-Generator ist ein Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, sich auf Vorstellungsgespräche vorzubereiten, indem es individuelle Fragen und Ant...","pt":"O Gerador de Preparação para Entrevista é uma coleção de habilidades de agente de IA que ajudam na otimização de currículos, inscrições de trabalhos e desenv...","ru":"Генератор Подготовки к Собеседованию - это коллекция навыков агента ИИ, которые помогают в оптимизации резюме, подаче заявок на работу и развитии карьеры.","ar":"مولد تحضير للمقابلات هو مجموعة من مهارات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تساعد في تحسين السيرة الذاتية وطلبات العمل وتطوير المسار الوظيفي.","en":"A collection of AI agent skills focused on resume optimization, job applications, and career development. Built for job seekers, career changers, and profess..."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of AI agent skills focused on resume optimization, job applications, and career development. Built for job seekers, career changers, and professionals who want Claude Code to help with resume writing, ATS optimization, interview prep, and strategic job search."},"features":{"zh":["生成角色特定面试问题","从简历项目创建STAR故事","预测特定角色面试问题","优化简历","练习面试问题"],"ja":["役割特定の面接問題を生成する","履歴書の項目からSTARストーリーを作成する","特定の役割の面接問題を予測する","履歴書を最適化する","面接問題を練習する"],"ko":["역할 특정 면접 문제 생성","이력서 항목에서 STAR 스토리 생성","특정 역할 면접 문제 예측","이력서 최적화","면접 문제 연습"],"es":["Generación de preguntas de entrevista personalizadas","Creación de historias STAR a partir de experiencias laborales","Predicción de preguntas para roles específicos","Práctica de respuestas a preguntas comportamentales","Optimización de currículos para sistemas de seguimiento de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Génération de questions d''entretien personnalisées","Création d''histoires STAR à partir d''expériences professionnelles","Prédiction de questions pour des rôles spécifiques","Pratique de réponses à des questions comportementales","Optimisation de CV pour les systèmes de suivi de candidatures"],"de":["Generierung von individuellen Vorstellungsgesprächsfragen","Erstellung von STAR-Geschichten aus beruflichen Erfahrungen","Vorhersage von Fragen für bestimmte Rollen","Übung von Antworten auf Verhaltensfragen","Optimierung von Lebensläufen für Bewerber-Management-Systeme"],"pt":["Geração de perguntas de entrevista específicas para cada cargo","Criação de histórias STAR a partir de currículos","Previsão de perguntas para cada função","Otimização de currículos para sistemas de rastreamento de aplicativos","Prática de respostas para perguntas comportamentais"],"ru":["Генерация вопросов для собеседования для каждой конкретной должности","Создание историй STAR из резюме","Прогнозирование вопросов для каждой роли","Оптимизация резюме для систем отслеживания заявок","Практика ответов на поведенческие вопросы"],"ar":["توليد أسئلة مقابلة محددة لكل وظيفة","إنشاء قصص STAR من السيرة الذاتية","توقعات الأسئلة لكل دور","تحسين السيرة الذاتية لأنظمة تتبع الطلبات","ممارسة الإجابات على الأسئلة السلوكية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["面试准备","简历优化","面试问题","STAR故事","求职成功率","开发者求职","AI求职辅助"],"ja":["面接準備","履歴書最適化","面接問題","STARストーリー","求人成功率","エンジニア求人","AI求人支援"],"ko":["면접 준비","이력서 최적화","면접 문제","STAR 스토리","취업 성공률","개발자 취업","AI 취업 지원"],"es":["preparación para entrevistas","entrevistas de trabajo","generador de preguntas","historias STAR","preguntas comportamentales","optimización de currículos","desarrollo de carrera"],"fr":["préparation d''entretien","entretiens d''embauche","générateur de questions","histoires STAR","questions comportementales","optimisation de CV","développement de carrière"],"de":["Vorbereitung auf Vorstellungsgespräche","Vorstellungsgespräche","Generierung von Fragen","STAR-Geschichten","Verhaltensfragen","Optimierung von Lebensläufen","Karriereentwicklung"],"pt":["preparação para entrevista","gerador de entrevista","otimização de currículos","histórias STAR","perguntas de entrevista","desenvolvimento de carreira","busca de emprego"],"ru":["подготовка к собеседованию","генератор собеседования","оптимизация резюме","истории STAR","вопросы для собеседования","развитие карьеры","поиск работы"],"ar":["تحضير للمقابلات","مولد المقابلات","تحسين السيرة الذاتية","قصص STAR","أسئلة المقابلة","تطوير المسار الوظيفي","بحث عن عمل"]}},"owner":"Paramchoudhary","repo":"ResumeSkills","repoPath":"Paramchoudhary/ResumeSkills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Interview Prep Generator","description":"Generate STAR stories, practice questions, and talking points from resume","bodyPreview":"# Interview Prep Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user wants to:\n- Prepare for a job interview\n- Practice answering interview questions\n- Create STAR stories from their experience\n- Anticipate questions for a specific role\n- Mentions: \"interview prep\", \"prepare for interview\", \"STAR stories\", \"interview questions\", \"behavioral questions\"\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n- Generate role-specific interview questions\n- Create STAR stories from resume bullets\n- Predict questions b","body":"# Interview Prep Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user wants to:\n- Prepare for a job interview\n- Practice answering interview questions\n- Create STAR stories from their experience\n- Anticipate questions for a specific role\n- Mentions: \"interview prep\", \"prepare for interview\", \"STAR stories\", \"interview questions\", \"behavioral questions\"\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n- Generate role-specific interview questions\n- Create STAR stories from resume bullets\n- Predict questions based on job description\n- Prepare answers for common questions\n- Create talking points for each experience\n- Identify potential concerns and prepare responses\n\n## Interview Preparation Framework\n\n### Phase 1: Role Analysis\n- Extract likely questions from job description\n- Identify skills that will be tested\n- Research company interview style\n\n### Phase 2: Story Banking\n- Convert resume bullets into STAR stories\n- Create stories for common competencies\n- Practice concise delivery\n\n### Phase 3: Mock Preparation\n- Practice common questions\n- Prepare questions to ask\n- Research company-specific topics\n\n## The STAR Method Detailed\n\n### Structure\n- **S**ituation: Set the context (1-2 sentences)\n- **T**ask: Describe your responsibility (1 sentence)\n- **A**ction: Explain what YOU did (2-3 sentences)\n- **R**esult: Share the outcome with metrics (1-2 sentences)\n\n### STAR Story Template\n\n```\nSITUATION: \"At [Company], we faced [specific challenge/context]...\"\n\nTASK: \"I was responsible for [specific ownership]...\"\n\nACTION: \"I [specific action 1], [specific action 2], and [specific action 3]...\"\n\nRESULT: \"As a result, [quantified outcome]. This led to [business impact].\"\n```\n\n### Example STAR Story\n\n**Question:** \"Tell me about a time you led a team through a difficult project.\"\n\n**Answer:**\n```\nSITUATION: \"At TechCorp, our main product was losing customers to a competitor who had launched a better mobile experience. We were seeing 5% monthly churn, up from our normal 2%.\"\n\nTASK: \"As the product manager, I was responsible for turning around our mobile product to stop the bleeding and win back customers.\"\n\nACTION: \"I started by interviewing 30 churned customers to understand exactly why they left. Based on that research, I prioritized 5 critical features that would achieve parity with competitors. I then worked with engineering to restructure our roadmap, negotiated with leadership to add 2 contract developers, and implemented weekly sprint reviews to keep the project on track. I also started a beta program with 50 of our best customers to get feedback before full launch.\"\n\nRESULT: \"We launched the improved mobile app in 3 months, reducing churn from 5% back to 2% within 60 days. We recovered 35% of churned customers and the NPS for our mobile app increased from 32 to 58. This project was recognized in our company all-hands as a turnaround success.\"\n```\n\n**Time:** 90 seconds to 2 minutes\n\n## Story Banking Process\n\n### Step 1: Identify Core Competencies\n\n**Leadership Stories Needed:**\n- Led a team through challenge\n- Managed conflict\n- Made a difficult decision\n- Delegated effectively\n- Developed/mentored someone\n\n**Problem-Solving Stories Needed:**\n- Solved complex technical problem\n- Fixed a process that was broken\n- Handled unexpected obstacle\n- Made decision with incomplete information\n- Improved something proactively\n\n**Collaboration Stories Needed:**\n- Worked with difficult colleague\n- Aligned cross-functional stakeholders\n- Built consensus\n- Partnered with other teams\n- Influenced without authority\n\n**Achievement Stories Needed:**\n- Exceeded goals/expectations\n- Delivered under pressure\n- Went above and beyond\n- Took initiative\n- Accomplished something proud of\n\n**Failure/Growth Stories Needed:**\n- Made a mistake and learned\n- Received critical feedback\n- Failed and recovered\n- Changed approach based on learning\n\n### Step 2: Map Resume to Stories\n\nFor each resume bullet, create a full STAR story:\n\n```\nRESUME BULLET: \"Led cross-functional team of 12 to deliver $2M product launch\"\n\nSTAR EXPANSION:\n\nSITUATION: Our company was losing market share to a competitor, and leadership decided we needed to launch a new product line within 6 months.\n\nTASK: As Product Manager, I was tasked with leading the product from concept to launch, coordinating across engineering, design, marketing, and sales teams (12 people total).\n\nACTION: \n- I established weekly cross-functional syncs and a shared Notion workspace\n- Created a detailed project plan with milestones and dependencies\n- Implemented a rapid prototyping process with 2-week design sprints\n- Personally resolved 3 major conflicts between engineering and marketing\n- Presented monthly updates to leadership to maintain alignment\n\nRESULT: \n- Launched on time and under budget\n- Generated $2M revenue in first year\n- Acquired 50 new enterprise customers\n- Team received company innovation award\n```\n\n### Step 3: Create Multiple Versions\n\nEach story should have:\n- **Full version:** 2 minutes (for \"tell me about a time...\")\n- **Short version:** 60 seconds (for follow-ups)\n- **One-liner:** 15 seconds (for \"give me an example\")\n\n## Common Interview Questions by Category\n\n### Behavioral Questions\n\n**Leadership:**\n- \"Tell me about a time you led a team.\"\n- \"Describe a situation where you had to make an unpopular decision.\"\n- \"How have you developed team members?\"\n- \"Tell me about a time you dealt with a difficult team member.\"\n\n**Problem-Solving:**\n- \"Describe a complex problem you solved.\"\n- \"Tell me about a time something didn''t go as planned.\"\n- \"How do you approach problems with incomplete information?\"\n- \"Give an example of an innovative solution you developed.\"\n\n**Collaboration:**\n- \"Tell me about working with someone difficult.\"\n- \"Describe a time you had to influence someone without authority.\"\n- \"How do you handle disagreements with colleagues?\"\n- \"Tell me about a successful cross-functional project.\"\n\n**Achievement:**\n- \"What''s your proudest professional accomplishment?\"\n- \"Tell me about a time you exceeded expectations.\"\n- \"Describe a goal you achieved against the odds.\"\n- \"What''s the biggest impact you''ve had in your career?\"\n\n**Failure/Growth:**\n- \"Tell me about a time you failed.\"\n- \"What''s the biggest mistake you''ve made at work?\"\n- \"How do you handle criticism?\"\n- \"What would you do differently in your career?\"\n\n### Role-Specific Questions\n\n**Product Management:**\n- \"How do you prioritize features?\"\n- \"Walk me through how you''d approach [product problem].\"\n- \"How do you measure product success?\"\n- \"Tell me about a product you shipped from 0 to 1.\"\n\n**Engineering:**\n- \"Describe your experience with [specific technology].\"\n- \"How do you approach code reviews?\"\n- \"Tell me about a technical challenge you solved.\"\n- \"How do you balance technical debt vs. features?\"\n\n**Marketing:**\n- \"How do you measure campaign success?\"\n- \"Tell me about a campaign that didn''t work.\"\n- \"How do you allocate budget across channels?\"\n- \"Describe your approach to brand building.\"\n\n**Sales:**\n- \"Walk me through your sales process.\"\n- \"Tell me about a deal you lost and why.\"\n- \"How do you handle objections?\"\n- \"Describe your largest closed deal.\"\n\n### Standard Questions\n\n**About You:**\n- \"Tell me about yourself.\" (2 min pitch)\n- \"Walk me through your resume.\"\n- \"Why are you looking for a new role?\"\n- \"Where do you see yourself in 5 years?\"\n\n**About the Role:**\n- \"Why this role?\"\n- \"What interests you about this position?\"\n- \"What do you think this role entails?\"\n- \"What would you do in your first 90 days?\"\n\n**About the Company:**\n- \"Why this company?\"\n- \"What do you know about us?\"\n- \"Why do you want to work here?\"\n- \"What excites you about our mission?\"\n\n## Questions to Ask Interviewers\n\n### For Hiring Manager\n- \"What does success look like in this role at 30/60/90 days?\"\n- \"What are the biggest challenges facing the team?\"\n- \"How is performance measured?\"\n- \"What''s the team structure?\"\n\n### For Team Members\n- \"What''s a typical day/week like?\"\n- \"What do you enjoy most about working here?\"\n- \"How do teams collaborate?\"\n- \"What would you want a new hire to know?\"\n\n### For Executives\n- \"What''s the company''s strategy for the next year?\"\n- \"How does this team contribute to company goals?\"\n- \"What keeps you excited about the company?\"\n\n### To Avoid\n- ❌ Questions about salary/benefits (save for HR)\n- ❌ Questions you could easily Google\n- ❌ Negative questions about company problems\n- ❌ Yes/no questions (ask open-ended)\n\n## Handling Difficult Questions\n\n### \"What''s your greatest weakness?\"\n\n**Formula:** Real weakness + Self-awareness + Improvement steps\n\n```\n\"I tend to be overly detail-oriented, which can sometimes slow me down. I''ve recognized this and now set time limits for tasks and ask for feedback on when good enough is good enough. In my current role, I''ve also learned to delegate detailed work when appropriate.\"\n```\n\n### \"Why are you leaving your current job?\"\n\n**Keep it:**\n- Positive (growth-focused)\n- Forward-looking (not complaint-based)\n- Brief (don''t over-explain)\n\n```\n\"I''ve learned a lot at [Company], but I''m looking for [specific opportunity] that I don''t see available in my current path. This role at [Company] offers exactly that - the chance to [specific thing].\"\n```\n\n### \"Tell me about a time you failed\"\n\n**Must include:**\n- Real failure (not humble brag)\n- What you learned\n- How you applied the learning\n\n```\n\"In my first year as a PM, I launched a feature without sufficient user research. The feature was technically sound but users found it confusing. Only 10% adopted it. I learned the hard way that building the right thing matters more than building the thing right. Since then, I never skip user research - I now always do at least 10 user interviews before major feature decisions.\"\n```\n\n### Salary Questions\n\n**Deflect until you have to answer:**\n\n```\n\"I''m flexible on compensation and more focused on finding the right role. Can you share the range budgeted for this position?\"\n```\n\n**If pressed:**\n```\n\"Based on my research and experience, I''m looking for something in the range of $X-$Y, but I''m open to discussing the full compensation package.\"\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen generating interview prep:\n\n```markdown\n# INTERVIEW PREP: [POSITION] AT [COMPANY]\n\n## Role Analysis\n**Key competencies they''ll test:**\n1. [Competency] - Evidence: [From JD]\n2. [Competency] - Evidence: [From JD]\n3. [Competency] - Evidence: [From JD]\n\n## Predicted Questions\n\n### High Probability (prepare thoroughly)\n1. [Question] → Use story: [Story name]\n2. [Question] → Use story: [Story name]\n3. [Question] → Use story: [Story name]\n\n### Medium Probability\n1. [Question]\n2. [Question]\n\n## Your STAR Story Bank\n\n### Story 1: [Name - e.g., \"Product Launch Success\"]\n**Use for:** Leadership, Achievement, Cross-functional\n**STAR:**\n- S: [Situation]\n- T: [Task]\n- A: [Action]\n- R: [Result with metrics]\n**Short version:** [60 second version]\n\n### Story 2: [Name]\n[Same structure]\n\n## \"Tell Me About Yourself\" Script\n[2-minute pitch tailored to this role]\n\n## Questions to Ask\n**For Hiring Manager:**\n1. [Question]\n2. [Question]\n\n**For Team:**\n1. [Question]\n2. [Question]\n\n## Company Research Notes\n- Recent news: [Item]\n- Key facts to reference: [Facts]\n- Potential concerns: [Items to be ready for]\n\n## Red Flag Answers to Avoid\n- Don''t mention: [Topics]\n- Don''t criticize: [Past employer aspects]\n- Watch out for: [Potential trap questions]\n```\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\nFor complete interview prep:\n1. ✅ Analyze job description for competencies\n2. ✅ Create 8-10 STAR stories covering all competencies\n3. ✅ Write \"tell me about yourself\" pitch\n4. ✅ Prepare answers for likely questions\n5. ✅ Research company thoroughly\n6. ✅ Prepare thoughtful questions to ask\n7. ✅ Practice out loud (time yourself)\n8. ✅ Prepare logistics (outfit, route, tech check)\n9. ✅ Review the day before interview\n10. ✅ Send thank you notes after\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:17:09.925Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Career Development Agents seeking to enhance job seekers'' interview preparation with tailored STAR stories and role-specific questions.","zh":"适用于寻求通过定制的STAR故事和角色特定问题来提高求职者面试准备的职业发展代理。","ja":"求職者の面接準備をカスタマイズされたSTARストーリーと役割特有の質問で強化したいキャリア開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"求직者の 면접 준비를 맞춤형 STAR 이야기와 역할 특정 질문으로 강화하려는 경력 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de carrera que buscan mejorar la preparación para las entrevistas de los buscadores de empleo con historias STAR personalizadas y preguntas específicas del rol.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement de carrière qui cherchent à améliorer la préparation aux entretiens des chercheurs d''emploi avec des histoires STAR personnalisées et des questions spécifiques au rôle.","de":"Ideal für Karriereentwicklungsagenten, die die Bewerbungsvorbereitung von Jobsuchenden mit maßgeschneiderten STAR-Geschichten und rollenspezifischen Fragen verbessern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Carreira que buscam melhorar a preparação para entrevistas de candidatos com histórias personalizadas STAR e perguntas específicas de função.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по развитию карьеры, стремящихся улучшить подготовку соискателей к интервью с помощью адаптированных историй STAR и ролевых вопросов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير المسار الوظيفي التي تسعى إلى تعزيز استعداد الباحثين عن عمل للاجتماعات التحضيرية مع قصص STAR المخصصة وأسئلة محددة الدور."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate role-specific interview questions, create STAR stories from resume bullets, and predict behavioral questions using natural language processing, providing a strategic edge in job search and career advancement through optimized interview prep and ATS optimization.","zh":"赋予代理人生成角色特定面试问题、从简历项目创建STAR故事以及使用自然语言处理预测行为问题的能力，通过优化的面试准备和ATS优化提供求职和职业晋升的战略优势。","ja":"エージェントに役割特有の面接質問を生成し、履歴書の項目からSTARストーリーを作成し、自然言語処理を使用して行動質問を予測する機能を提供し、最適化された面接準備とATS最適化を通じてジョブサーチとキャリアアドバンスに戦略的な優位性を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 역할 특정 면접 질문을 생성하고 이력서 항목에서 STAR 이야기를 만들고 자연어 처리를 사용하여 행동 질문을 예측하는 기능을 제공하여 최적화된 면접 준비와 ATS 최적화를 통해 일자리 검색과 경력 진보에 전략적인 우위를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar preguntas de entrevista específicas del rol, a crear historias STAR a partir de puntos del currículum y a predecir preguntas comportamentales utilizando el procesamiento de lenguaje natural, lo que proporciona una ventaja estratégica en la búsqueda de empleo y el avance profesional a través de una preparación para las entrevistas optimizada y una optimización del sistema de seguimiento de solicitudes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des questions d''entretien spécifiques au rôle, de créer des histoires STAR à partir de points de CV et de prédire des questions comportementales en utilisant le traitement automatique des langues, ce qui offre un avantage stratégique dans la recherche d''emploi et le développement de carrière grâce à une préparation aux entretiens optimisée et à une optimisation du système de suivi des candidatures.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, rollenspezifische Interviewfragen zu generieren, STAR-Geschichten aus Lebenslauf-Punkten zu erstellen und Verhaltensfragen unter Verwendung von natürlicher Sprachverarbeitung vorherzusagen, was einen strategischen Vorteil in der Jobsuche und Karriereentwicklung durch optimierte Bewerbungsvorbereitung und ATS-Optimierung bietet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar perguntas de entrevista específicas de função, criar histórias STAR a partir de bullets de currículo e prever perguntas comportamentais usando processamento de linguagem natural, fornecendo uma vantagem estratégica na busca de emprego e avanço na carreira por meio de preparação de entrevista otimizada e otimização do sistema de rastreamento de candidatos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать ролевые вопросы для интервью, создавать истории STAR из пунктов резюме и предсказывать поведенческие вопросы с использованием обработки естественного языка, обеспечивая стратегическое преимущество в поиске работы и карьерном росте за счет оптимизированной подготовки к интервью и оптимизации системы отслеживания заявок.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد أسئلة مقابلة محددة الدور، وإنشاء قصص STAR من النقاط الرئيسية في السيرة الذاتية، وتوقّع الأسئلة السلوكية باستخدام معالجة اللغة الطبيعية، وthus تقديم حافز استراتيجي في البحث عن وظيفة والتقدم في المسار الوظيفي من خلال تحضير مقابلة محسّن وتنظيم نظام تتبع الطلبات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating customized interview questions for specific job roles","Creating compelling STAR stories from resume bullets for effective interview responses","Anticipating and preparing for common behavioral questions in job interviews"],"zh":["为特定工作角色生成定制的面试问题","从简历项目中创建令人信服的STAR故事以有效地应对面试问题","预测和准备工作面试中常见的行为问题"],"ja":["特定のジョブロールのカスタマイズされた面接質問を生成する","履歴書の項目から説得力のあるSTARストーリーを作成して面接の回答に効果的に対応する","ジョブ面接で一般的な行動質問を予測して準備する"],"ko":["특정 직무 역할을 위한 맞춤형 면접 질문 생성","이력서 항목에서 설득력 있는 STAR 이야기를 만들어서 면접 응답에 효과적으로 대처하기","일자리 면접에서 일반적인 행동 질문을 예측하고 준비하기"],"es":["Generar preguntas de entrevista personalizadas para roles de trabajo específicos","Crear historias STAR convincentes a partir de puntos del currículum para respuestas efectivas en las entrevistas","Prever y prepararse para preguntas comportamentales comunes en las entrevistas de trabajo"],"fr":["Générer des questions d''entretien personnalisées pour des rôles de travail spécifiques","Créer des histoires STAR convaincantes à partir de points de CV pour des réponses efficaces aux entretiens","Prévoir et se préparer aux questions comportementales courantes dans les entretiens d''embauche"],"de":["Generieren von maßgeschneiderten Interviewfragen für bestimmte Jobrollen","Erstellen von überzeugenden STAR-Geschichten aus Lebenslauf-Punkten für effektive Antworten im Vorstellungsgespräch","Vorhersage und Vorbereitung auf häufige Verhaltensfragen im Bewerbungsgespräch"],"pt":["Geração de perguntas de entrevista personalizadas para funções de trabalho específicas","Criação de histórias STAR convincentes a partir de bullets de currículo para respostas de entrevista eficazes","Antecipação e preparação para perguntas comportamentais comuns em entrevistas de emprego"],"ru":["Генерация индивидуальных вопросов для интервью для конкретных ролей","Создание убедительных историй STAR из пунктов резюме для эффективных ответов на интервью","Предвидение и подготовка к обычным поведенческим вопросам на собеседованиях"],"ar":["توليد أسئلة مقابلة مخصصة لأدوار lavoro محددة","إنشاء قصص STAR مقنعة من النقاط الرئيسية في السيرة الذاتية للاستجابات الفعالة في المقابلات","التوقع والاستعداد للأسئلة السلوكية الشائعة في المقابلات الوظيفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for resume bullets and job role specifications","Effectiveness depends on the quality of user-provided data and resume content"],"zh":["需要用户输入简历项目和工作角色规范","效果取决于用户提供的数据和简历内容的质量"],"ja":["履歴書の項目とジョブロールの仕様のユーザー入力を必要とする","効果はユーザーが提供するデータと履歴書の内容の質によって異なります"],"ko":["이력서 항목 및 직무 역할 사양에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요함","효과는 사용자가 제공하는 데이터 및 이력서 내용의 품질에 따라 다름"],"es":["Requiere la entrada del usuario para puntos del currículum y especificaciones del rol","La efectividad depende de la calidad de los datos y el contenido del currículum proporcionados por el usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour les points de CV et les spécifications de rôle","L''efficacité dépend de la qualité des données et du contenu du CV fournis par l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzereingaben für Lebenslauf-Punkte und Rollenspezifikationen","Die Effektivität hängt von der Qualität der vom Benutzer bereitgestellten Daten und des Lebenslaufinhalts ab"],"pt":["Exige entrada de usuário para bullets de currículo e especificações de função","A eficácia depende da qualidade dos dados fornecidos pelo usuário e do conteúdo do currículo"],"ru":["Требует ввода данных пользователя для пунктов резюме и ролевых спецификаций","Эффективность зависит от качества данных, предоставляемых пользователем, и содержания резюме"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال بيانات المستخدم لنقاط السيرة الذاتية ومواصفات الدور","تعتمد الفعالية على جودة البيانات المقدمة من قبل المستخدم ومحتوى السيرة الذاتية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
