Doc Sync: Automatisierung von Überprüfungen","pt":"Atlan Review Doc Sync - Ferramenta de Revisão de Documentos","ru":"Atlan Review Doc Sync - Инструмент для синхронизации доку...","ar":"Atlan Review Doc Sync - أداة مزامنة الوثائق","en":"atlan-review-doc-sync"},"description":{"zh":"Atlan Review Doc Sync 是一个样本应用程序，用于产生高信号审查发现和保持文档同步","ja":"Atlan ドキュメント同期レビューは、ハイシグナル レビューの発見とドキュメントの同期を実現するサンプル アプリケーション","ko":"Atlan 문서 동기화 리뷰는 높은 신호 리뷰 발견과 문서 동기화를 위한 샘플 애플리케이션","es":"Atlan Review Doc Sync es una aplicación de ejemplo que utiliza el SDK de Atlan para producir resultados de revisión de alta calidad y mantener los documentos...","fr":"Atlan Review Doc Sync est une application exemple qui utilise le SDK Atlan pour produire des résultats de révision de haute qualité et maintenir les document...","de":"Atlan Review Doc Sync ist eine Beispielanwendung, die das Atlan-SDK verwendet, um Überprüfungsergebnisse von hoher Qualität zu produzieren und die Dokumente ...","pt":"A ferramenta Atlan Review Doc Sync é uma aplicação de exemplo construída com o SDK do Atlan, que ajuda a manter documentos atualizados e alinhados com o código","ru":"Инструмент Atlan Review Doc Sync представляет собой образец приложения, построенного с помощью SDK Atlan, который помогает поддерживать документы в актуально...","ar":"أداة Atlan Review Doc Sync هي تطبيق عينة مبني على SDK Atlan، الذي يساعد في الحفاظ على تحديث الوثائق وتوافقها مع الكود","en":"Sample application built using Atlan Application SDK"},"definition":{"en":"Sample application built using Atlan Application SDK"},"features":{"zh":["审查代码和测试","报告发现和变更摘要","更新应用级文档","运行事实验证门","验证实现与质量标准"],"ja":["コードとテストのレビュー","発見と変更の概要の報告","アプリケーションレベルのドキュメントの更新","事実検証ゲートの実行","実装の検証と品質基準"],"ko":["코드와 테스트의 리뷰","발견과 변경 요약의 보고","애플리케이션 레벨의 문서 업데이트","사실 검증 게이트의 실행","구현의 검증과 품질 표준"],"es":["Revisión de código y pruebas con prioridad de errores/riesgos/regresión","Informes de resultados de revisión y resumen de cambios","Actualización de documentación de nivel de aplicación","Verificación de hechos con atlan-fact-verification-gate","Validación de la implementación contra el nivel de calidad seleccionado"],"fr":["Révision de code et de tests avec priorité d''erreurs/risques/régression","Rapports de résultats de révision et résumé de modifications","Mise à jour de la documentation de niveau d''application","Vérification de faits avec atlan-fact-verification-gate","Validation de la mise en œuvre contre le niveau de qualité sélectionné"],"de":["Überprüfung von Code und Tests mit Priorität von Fehlern/Risiken/Regression","Berichte über Überprüfungsergebnisse und Änderungszusammenfassung","Aktualisierung der Dokumentation auf Anwendungsebene","Überprüfung von Fakten mit atlan-fact-verification-gate","Validierung der Implementierung gegen den ausgewählten Qualitätsstandard"],"pt":["Revisão de código e testes com prioridade de bug/risco/regressão","Relatório de achados e resumo de alterações","Atualização de documentos de nível de aplicativo","Verificação de fatos com gate de verificação","Validação da implementação contra tier de qualidade selecionado"],"ru":["Проверка кода и тестов с приоритетом баг/риска/регрессии","Отчет о находках и краткое описание изменений","Обновление документов уровня приложения","Проверка фактов с помощью шлюза верификации","Проверка реализации против выбранного качества tier"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود والاختبارات بأولوية خطأ/مخاطر/انحدار","تقرير النتائج وملخص التغييرات","تحديث وثائق مستوى التطبيق","تحقق الحقائق مع بوابة التحقق","التحقق من التنفيذ ضد تصنيف الجودة المحدد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Atlan","文档同步","审查发现","应用程序开发","代码审查","测试审查","文档更新"],"ja":["Atlan","ドキュメント同期","レビューの発見","アプリケーション開発","コードレビュー","テストレビュー","ドキュメントの更新"],"ko":["Atlan","문서 동기화","리뷰 발견","애플리케이션 개발","코드 리뷰","테스트 리뷰","문서 업데이트"],"es":["Atlan Review Doc Sync","automatización de revisiones","calidad de código","documentación de aplicación","verificación de hechos","nivel de calidad","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Atlan Review Doc Sync","automatisation des révisions","qualité de code","documentation d''application","vérification de faits","niveau de qualité","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Atlan Review Doc Sync","Automatisierung von Überprüfungen","Code-Qualität","Dokumentation auf Anwendungsebene","Überprüfung von Fakten","Qualitätsstandard","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Atlan Review Doc Sync","ferramenta de revisão de documentos","SDK do Atlan","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de documentos","sincronização de documentos"],"ru":["Atlan Review Doc Sync","инструмент синхронизации документов","SDK Atlan","разработка программного обеспечения","управление документами","синхронизация документов"],"ar":["Atlan Review Doc Sync","أداة مزامنة الوثائق","SDK Atlan","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة الوثائق","مزامنة الوثائق"]}},"owner":"atlanhq","repo":"atlan-sample-apps","repoPath":"atlanhq/atlan-sample-apps","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"atlan-review-doc-sync","description":"Run findings-first review for Atlan app changes and synchronize app documentation with implemented behavior. Use when completing a change set, preparing handoff, or auditing regressions.","bodyPreview":"# Atlan Review Doc Sync\n\nProduce high-signal review findings and keep docs aligned.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Review code and tests with bug/risk/regression priority.\n2. Report findings first, then brief change summary.\n3. Update app-level docs (README, architecture notes, test notes) to match actual behavior.\n4. Run `atlan-fact-verification-gate` if behavior-critical claims need source confirmation.\n5. Validate implementation against selected quality tier from `../_shared/references/app-quality-bar.md`.","body":"# Atlan Review Doc Sync\n\nProduce high-signal review findings and keep docs aligned.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Review code and tests with bug/risk/regression priority.\n2. Report findings first, then brief change summary.\n3. Update app-level docs (README, architecture notes, test notes) to match actual behavior.\n4. Run `atlan-fact-verification-gate` if behavior-critical claims need source confirmation.\n5. Validate implementation against selected quality tier from `../_shared/references/app-quality-bar.md`.\n6. Confirm SDK/CLI remain untouched.\n7. If CLI mismatch surfaced during review, append proposal entry.\n\n## Rules\n- Prioritize correctness, regression risk, and missing tests.\n- Keep review findings concrete with file references.\n- Do not modify SDK or CLI docs/code.\n\n## References\n- Review checklist: `references/review-checklist.md`\n- Quality bar: `../_shared/references/app-quality-bar.md`\n- CLI proposals: `../_shared/references/cli-change-proposals.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:16:50.448Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing to synchronize documentation with code changes and validate against quality tiers.","zh":"非常适合需要将文档与代码更改同步并验证质量等级的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードの変更と文書を同期させ、品質階層に対して検証する必要があるコードレビューエージェントに最適です。","ko":"코드 변경과 문서를 동기화하고 품질 티어에 대해 유효성을 검사해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan sincronizar la documentación con los cambios de código y validar contra niveles de calidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code ayant besoin de synchroniser la documentation avec les modifications de code et de valider contre les niveaux de qualité.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die die Dokumentation mit Code-Änderungen synchronisieren und gegen Qualitätsstufen validieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam sincronizar a documentação com alterações de código e validar contra níveis de qualidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым необходимо синхронизировать документацию с изменениями кода и проверять на соответствие уровням качества.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المراجعة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى مزامنة الوثائق مع تغييرات الكود والتحقق من صحتها مقابل مستويات الجودة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce high-signal review findings, update app-level documents like README and architecture notes, and validate implementation against selected quality tiers using Atlan Application SDK and protocols like running `atlan-fact-verification-gate` for behavior-critical claims.","zh":"赋予代理生成高信号审查发现、更新应用级文档（如README和架构说明）并使用Atlan Application SDK和协议（如运行`atlan-fact-verification-gate`用于行为关键声明）验证实施是否符合所选的质量等级。","ja":"エージェントに、高信号のレビュー結果を生成し、READMEやアーキテクチャノートなどのアプリケーションレベルのドキュメントを更新し、Atlan Application SDKや`atlan-fact-verification-gate`などのプロトコルを使用して、実装を選択した品質階層と照合することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 높은 신호 리뷰 결과를 생성하고 README 및 아키텍처 노트와 같은 애플리케이션 수준의 문서를 업데이트하며 Atlan Application SDK 및 `atlan-fact-verification-gate`와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 선택한 품질 티어와의 구현을 확인할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir resultados de revisión de alta señal, actualizar documentos a nivel de aplicación como README y notas de arquitectura, y validar la implementación contra los niveles de calidad seleccionados utilizando Atlan Application SDK y protocolos como la ejecución de `atlan-fact-verification-gate` para afirmaciones críticas de comportamiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire des résultats de révision à haute signal, de mettre à jour les documents au niveau de l''application comme README et les notes d''architecture, et de valider la mise en œuvre contre les niveles de qualité sélectionnés en utilisant Atlan Application SDK et des protocoles comme l''exécution de `atlan-fact-verification-gate` pour les affirmations critiques de comportement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Review-Ergebnisse mit hoher Signalstärke zu produzieren, auf Anwendungsebene Dokumente wie README und Architekturhinweise zu aktualisieren und die Implementierung gegen ausgewählte Qualitätsstufen unter Verwendung von Atlan Application SDK und Protokollen wie dem Ausführen von `atlan-fact-verification-gate` für verhaltenskritische Behauptungen zu validieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a produzir resultados de revisão de alta qualidade, atualizar documentos de nível de aplicativo como README e notas de arquitetura, e validar a implementação contra níveis de qualidade selecionados usando o SDK do Atlan Application e protocolos como a execução do `atlan-fact-verification-gate` para alegações críticas de comportamento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью производить результаты проверки высокого качества, обновлять документы уровня приложения, такие как README и заметки об архитектуре, и проверять реализацию на соответствие выбранным уровням качества, используя SDK приложения Atlan и протоколы, такие как выполнение `atlan-fact-verification-gate` для критических утверждений о поведении.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنتاج نتائج مراجعة ذات إشارة عالية، و تحديث وثائق المستوى التطبيقي مثل README و ملاحظات الهندسة المعمارية، و التحقق من التنفيذ مقابل مستويات الجودة المحددة باستخدام SDK التطبيق Atlan و البروتوكولات مثل تشغيل `atlan-fact-verification-gate` من أجل المطالبات الحاسمة السلوكية."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing code and tests with bug/risk/regression priority","Updating documentation to match actual behavior","Validating implementation against quality tiers"],"zh":["审查带有错误/风险/回归优先级的代码和测试","更新文档以匹配实际行为","验证实施是否符合质量等级"],"ja":["バグ/リスク/リグレッション優先度のあるコードとテストのレビュー","実際の動作に合わせてドキュメントを更新する","実装を品質階層と照合する"],"ko":["버그/위험/회귀 우선순위가 있는 코드 및 테스트의 리뷰","실제 동작과 일치하도록 문서를 업데이트하는","구현을 품질 티어와 확인"],"es":["Revisar código y pruebas con prioridad de errores/riesgos/regresión","Actualizar la documentación para que coincida con el comportamiento real","Validar la implementación contra los niveles de calidad"],"fr":["Réviser le code et les tests avec une priorité de bogues/risques/régession","Mettre à jour la documentation pour qu''elle corresponde au comportement réel","Valider la mise en œuvre contre les niveaux de qualité"],"de":["Code und Tests mit Fehlern/Risiken/Regression-Priorität überprüfen","Dokumentation aktualisieren, um dem tatsächlichen Verhalten zu entsprechen","Implementierung gegen Qualitätsstufen validieren"],"pt":["Revisar código e testes com prioridade de bug/risco/regressão","Atualizar documentação para combinar com comportamento real","Validar implementação contra níveis de qualidade"],"ru":["Проверка кода и тестов с приоритетом баг/риск/регрессия","Обновление документации для соответствия фактическому поведению","Проверка реализации на соответствие уровням качества"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود والاختبارات مع أولوية خطأ/مخاطر/انحدار","تحديث الوثائق لتطابق السلوك الفعلي","التحقق من التنفيذ مقابل مستويات الجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Atlan Application SDK","Needs access to app-level documents like README and architecture notes"],"zh":["需要Atlan Application SDK","需要访问应用级文档，如README和架构说明"],"ja":["Atlan Application SDKが必要","READMEやアーキテクチャノートなどのアプリケーションレベルのドキュメントへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Atlan Application SDK가 필요합니다.","README 및 아키텍처 노트와 같은 애플리케이션 수준의 문서에 액세스해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere Atlan Application SDK","Necesita acceso a documentos a nivel de aplicación como README y notas de arquitectura"],"fr":["Nécessite Atlan Application SDK","A besoin d''accès à des documents au niveau de l''application comme README et les notes d''architecture"],"de":["Benötigt Atlan Application SDK","Benötigt Zugriff auf auf Anwendungsebene Dokumente wie README und Architekturhinweise"],"pt":["Requer o SDK do Atlan Application","Necessita acesso a documentos de nível de aplicativo como README e notas de arquitetura"],"ru":["Требует SDK приложения Atlan","Требует доступа к документам уровня приложения, таким как README и заметки об архитектуре"],"ar":["يتطلب SDK التطبيق Atlan","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى وثائق المستوى التطبيقي مثل README و ملاحظات الهندسة المعمارية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('codefastlabs/codefast/tanstack-router', 'community', 'codefastlabs', 'codefast', 'codefastlabs/codefast', 'tanstack-router', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z', '2026-02-18T09:17:09.472Z', NULL, '{"id":"codefastlabs/codefast/tanstack-router","name":"tanstack-router","description":{"zh":"TanStack Router 是一个类型安全、基于文件的路由库，支持 React 单页应用。它提供了 route-level 数据加载和 TanStack Query 集成","ja":"TanStack Router は、型安全でファイルベースのルーティングライブラリであり、React シングルページアプリケーションをサポートします。ルートレベルのデータローディングと TanStack Query の統合を提供します","ko":"TanStack Router는 타입 안전 및 파일 기반 라우팅 라이브러리로서 React 单页 애플리케이션을 지원합니다. 라우트 레벨의 데이터 로딩 및 TanStack Query 통합을 제공","es":"TanStack Router ofrece enrutamiento tipo seguro y basado en archivos para aplicaciones de una sola página de React, con carga de datos a nivel de ruta y integración con TanStack Query","fr":"TanStack Router propose un routage sécurisé et basé sur des fichiers pour les applications à page unique React, avec chargement de données au niveau de la route et intégration à TanStack Query","de":"TanStack Router bietet typsicheres und dateibasiertes Routing für React-Single-Page-Anwendungen, mit Datenladeaufteilung auf Routenebene und Integration mit TanStack Query","pt":"O TanStack Router é uma solução de roteamento para aplicações React que oferece carregamento de dados e integração com TanStack Query.","ru":"TanStack Router — это решение для маршрутизации React-приложений, которое обеспечивает загрузку данных и интеграцию с TanStack Query.","ar":"TanStack Router هو حل لمسار تطبيقات React التي توفر تحميل البيانات وتكامل TanStack Query.","en":"✨ Accessible, mobile friendly, modern UI components."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"TanStack Router - 基于文件的路由","ja":"TanStack Router - ファイルベースのルーティング","ko":"TanStack Router - 파일 기반 라우팅","es":"TanStack Router: Enrutamiento tipo seguro para React","fr":"TanStack Router: Routage sécurisé pour React","de":"TanStack Router: Typsicheres Routing für React","pt":"TanStack Router: Roteamento para React","ru":"TanStack Router: Маршрутизация для React","ar":"TanStack Router: مسار React","en":"tanstack-router"},"description":{"zh":"TanStack Router 是一个类型安全、基于文件的路由库，支持 React 单页应用。它提供了 route-level 数据加载和 TanStack Query 集成","ja":"TanStack Router は、型安全でファイルベースのルーティングライブラリであり、React シングルページアプリケーションをサポートします。ルートレベルのデータローディングと TanStack Query の統合を提供します","ko":"TanStack Router는 타입 안전 및 파일 기반 라우팅 라이브러리로서 React 单页 애플리케이션을 지원합니다. 라우트 레벨의 데이터 로딩 및 TanStack Query 통합을 제공","es":"TanStack Router ofrece enrutamiento tipo seguro y basado en archivos para aplicaciones de una sola página de React, con carga de datos a nivel de ruta y inte...","fr":"TanStack Router propose un routage sécurisé et basé sur des fichiers pour les applications à page unique React, avec chargement de données au niveau de la ro...","de":"TanStack Router bietet typsicheres und dateibasiertes Routing für React-Single-Page-Anwendungen, mit Datenladeaufteilung auf Routenebene und Integration mit ...","pt":"O TanStack Router é uma solução de roteamento para aplicações React que oferece carregamento de dados e integração com TanStack Query.","ru":"TanStack Router — это решение для маршрутизации React-приложений, которое обеспечивает загрузку данных и интеграцию с TanStack Query.","ar":"TanStack Router هو حل لمسار تطبيقات React التي توفر تحميل البيانات وتكامل TanStack Query.","en":"✨ Accessible, mobile friendly, modern UI components."},"definition":{"en":"✨ Accessible, mobile friendly, modern UI components."},"features":{"zh":["类型安全的路由","基于文件的路由","route-level 数据加载","TanStack Query 集成","支持 React 单页应用"],"ja":["型安全なルーティング","ファイルベースのルーティング","ルートレベルのデータローディング","TanStack Query の統合","React シングルページアプリケーションのサポート"],"ko":["타입 안전한 라우팅","파일 기반 라우팅","라우트 레벨의 데이터 로딩","TanStack Query 통합","React 单页 애플리케이션 지원"],"es":["Enrutamiento tipo seguro","Basado en archivos","Carga de datos a nivel de ruta","Integración con TanStack Query","Compatibilidad con Vite"],"fr":["Routage sécurisé","Basé sur des fichiers","Chargement de données au niveau de la route","Intégration à TanStack Query","Compatibilité avec Vite"],"de":["Typsicheres Routing","Dateibasiert","Datenladeaufteilung auf Routenebene","Integration mit TanStack Query","Kompatibilität mit Vite"],"pt":["Roteamento baseado em arquivos","Carregamento de dados em nível de rota","Integração com TanStack Query","Tipagem segura","Suporte a React SPAs"],"ru":["Маршрутизация на основе файлов","Загрузка данных на уровне маршрута","Интеграция с TanStack Query","Безопасная типизация","Поддержка React SPAs"],"ar":["مسار يستند إلى الملفات","تحميل البيانات على مستوى المسار","التكامل مع TanStack Query","نوع آمن","دعم تطبيقات React SPAs"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TanStack Router","React 路由","类型安全路由","基于文件的路由","单页应用路由","TanStack Query"],"ja":["TanStack Router","React ルーティング","型安全なルーティング","ファイルベースのルーティング","シングルページアプリケーションルーティング","TanStack Query"],"ko":["TanStack Router","React 라우팅","타입 안전한 라우팅","파일 기반 라우팅","单页 애플리케이션 라우팅","TanStack Query"],"es":["enrutamiento react","rutas seguras","carga de datos","tanstack query","vite config","react spa","enrutamiento basado en archivos"],"fr":["routage react","routes sécurisées","chargement de données","tanstack query","vite config","react spa","routage basé sur des fichiers"],"de":["react routing","sichere routen","datenladeaufteilung","tanstack query","vite konfiguration","react spa","dateibasiertes routing"],"pt":["TanStack Router","Roteamento React","Carregamento de dados","TanStack Query","React SPAs","Tipagem segura"],"ru":["TanStack Router","Маршрутизация React","Загрузка данных","TanStack Query","React SPAs","Безопасная типизация"],"ar":["TanStack Router","مسار React","تحميل البيانات","TanStack Query","تطبيقات React SPAs","نوع آمن"]}},"owner":"codefastlabs","repo":"codefast","repoPath":"codefastlabs/codefast","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.475Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tanstack-router","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# TanStack Router\n\nType-safe, file-based routing for React SPAs with route-level data loading and TanStack Query integration\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-09\n**Version**: @tanstack/react-router@1.146.2\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/react-router @tanstack/router-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/router-plugin\n# Optional: Zod validation adapter\nnpm install @tanstack/zod-adapter zod\n```\n\n**Vite Config** (TanStackRouterVite MUST come before react()):\n```typescript\n// vite.config.t","body":"# TanStack Router\n\nType-safe, file-based routing for React SPAs with route-level data loading and TanStack Query integration\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-09\n**Version**: @tanstack/react-router@1.146.2\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/react-router @tanstack/router-devtools\nnpm install -D @tanstack/router-plugin\n# Optional: Zod validation adapter\nnpm install @tanstack/zod-adapter zod\n```\n\n**Vite Config** (TanStackRouterVite MUST come before react()):\n```typescript\n// vite.config.ts\nimport { TanStackRouterVite } from ''@tanstack/router-plugin/vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [TanStackRouterVite(), react()], // Order matters!\n})\n```\n\n**File Structure**:\n```\nsrc/routes/\n├── __root.tsx         → createRootRoute() with <Outlet />\n├── index.tsx          → createFileRoute(''/'')\n└── posts.$postId.tsx  → createFileRoute(''/posts/$postId'')\n```\n\n**App Setup**:\n```typescript\nimport { createRouter, RouterProvider } from ''@tanstack/react-router''\nimport { routeTree } from ''./routeTree.gen'' // Auto-generated by plugin\n\nconst router = createRouter({ routeTree })\n<RouterProvider router={router} />\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n**Type-Safe Navigation** (routes auto-complete, params typed):\n```typescript\n<Link to=\"/posts/$postId\" params={{ postId: ''123'' }} />\n<Link to=\"/invalid\" /> // ❌ TypeScript error\n```\n\n**Route Loaders** (data fetching before render):\n```typescript\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts/$postId'')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => ({ post: await fetchPost(params.postId) }),\n  component: ({ useLoaderData }) => {\n    const { post } = useLoaderData() // Fully typed!\n    return <h1>{post.title}</h1>\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**TanStack Query Integration** (prefetch + cache):\n```typescript\nconst postOpts = (id: string) => queryOptions({\n  queryKey: [''posts'', id],\n  queryFn: () => fetchPost(id),\n})\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts/$postId'')({\n  loader: ({ context: { queryClient }, params }) =>\n    queryClient.ensureQueryData(postOpts(params.postId)),\n  component: () => {\n    const { postId } = Route.useParams()\n    const { data } = useQuery(postOpts(postId))\n    return <h1>{data.title}</h1>\n  },\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Virtual File Routes (v1.140+)\n\nProgrammatic route configuration when file-based conventions don''t fit your needs:\n\n**Install**: `npm install @tanstack/virtual-file-routes`\n\n**Vite Config**:\n```typescript\nimport { tanstackRouter } from ''@tanstack/router-plugin/vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackRouter({\n      target: ''react'',\n      virtualRouteConfig: ''./routes.ts'', // Point to your routes file\n    }),\n    react(),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**routes.ts** (define routes programmatically):\n```typescript\nimport { rootRoute, route, index, layout, physical } from ''@tanstack/virtual-file-routes''\n\nexport const routes = rootRoute(''root.tsx'', [\n  index(''home.tsx''),\n  route(''/posts'', ''posts/posts.tsx'', [\n    index(''posts/posts-home.tsx''),\n    route(''$postId'', ''posts/posts-detail.tsx''),\n  ]),\n  layout(''first'', ''layout/first-layout.tsx'', [\n    route(''/nested'', ''nested.tsx''),\n  ]),\n  physical(''/classic'', ''file-based-subtree''), // Mix with file-based\n])\n```\n\n**Use Cases**: Custom route organization, mixing file-based and code-based, complex nested layouts.\n\n---\n\n## Search Params Validation (Zod Adapter)\n\nType-safe URL search params with runtime validation:\n\n**Basic Pattern** (inline validation):\n```typescript\nimport { z } from ''zod''\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/products'')({\n  validateSearch: (search) => z.object({\n    page: z.number().catch(1),\n    filter: z.string().catch(''''),\n    sort: z.enum([''newest'', ''oldest'', ''price'']).catch(''newest''),\n  }).parse(search),\n})\n```\n\n**Recommended Pattern** (Zod adapter with fallbacks):\n```typescript\nimport { zodValidator, fallback } from ''@tanstack/zod-adapter''\nimport { z } from ''zod''\n\nconst searchSchema = z.object({\n  query: z.string().min(1).max(100),\n  page: fallback(z.number().int().positive(), 1),\n  sortBy: z.enum([''name'', ''date'', ''relevance'']).optional(),\n})\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/search'')({\n  validateSearch: zodValidator(searchSchema),\n  // Type-safe: Route.useSearch() returns typed params\n})\n```\n\n**Why `.catch()` over `.default()`**: Use `.catch()` to silently fix malformed params. Use `.default()` + `errorComponent` to show validation errors.\n\n---\n\n## Error Boundaries\n\nHandle errors at route level with typed error components:\n\n**Route-Level Error Handling**:\n```typescript\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts/$postId'')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => {\n    const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n    if (!post) throw new Error(''Post not found'')\n    return { post }\n  },\n  errorComponent: ({ error, reset }) => (\n    <div>\n      <p>Error: {error.message}</p>\n      <button onClick={reset}>Retry</button>\n    </div>\n  ),\n})\n```\n\n**Default Error Component** (global fallback):\n```typescript\nconst router = createRouter({\n  routeTree,\n  defaultErrorComponent: ({ error }) => (\n    <div className=\"error-page\">\n      <h1>Something went wrong</h1>\n      <p>{error.message}</p>\n    </div>\n  ),\n})\n```\n\n**Not Found Handling**:\n```typescript\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts/$postId'')({\n  notFoundComponent: () => <div>Post not found</div>,\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Authentication with beforeLoad\n\nProtect routes before they load (no flash of protected content):\n\n**Single Route Protection**:\n```typescript\nimport { redirect } from ''@tanstack/react-router''\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/dashboard'')({\n  beforeLoad: async ({ context }) => {\n    if (!context.auth.isAuthenticated) {\n      throw redirect({\n        to: ''/login'',\n        search: { redirect: location.pathname }, // Save for post-login\n      })\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Protect Multiple Routes** (layout route pattern):\n```typescript\n// routes/(authenticated)/route.tsx - protects all children\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/(authenticated)'')({\n  beforeLoad: async ({ context }) => {\n    if (!context.auth.isAuthenticated) {\n      throw redirect({ to: ''/login'' })\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Passing Auth Context** (from React hooks):\n```typescript\n// main.tsx - pass auth state to router\nfunction App() {\n  const auth = useAuth() // Your auth hook\n\n  return (\n    <RouterProvider\n      router={router}\n      context={{ auth }} // Available in beforeLoad\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **20** documented issues:\n\n### Issue #1: Devtools Dependency Resolution\n- **Error**: Build fails with `@tanstack/router-devtools-core` not found\n- **Fix**: `npm install @tanstack/router-devtools`\n\n**Issue #2: Vite Plugin Order** (CRITICAL)\n- **Error**: Routes not auto-generated, `routeTree.gen.ts` missing\n- **Fix**: TanStackRouterVite MUST come before react() in plugins array\n- **Why**: Plugin processes route files before React compilation\n\n**Issue #3: Type Registration Missing**\n- **Error**: `<Link to=\"...\">` not typed, no autocomplete\n- **Fix**: Import `routeTree` from `./routeTree.gen` in main.tsx to register types\n\n**Issue #4: Loader Not Running**\n- **Error**: Loader function not called on navigation\n- **Fix**: Ensure route exports `Route` constant: `export const Route = createFileRoute(''/path'')({ loader: ... })`\n\n**Issue #5: Memory Leak with TanStack Form** (FIXED)\n- **Error**: Production crashes when using TanStack Form + Router\n- **Source**: GitHub Issue #5734 (closed Jan 5, 2026)\n- **Resolution**: Fixed in latest versions of @tanstack/form and @tanstack/react-start. Update both packages to resolve.\n\n**Issue #6: Virtual Routes Index/Layout Conflict**\n- **Error**: route.tsx and index.tsx conflict when using `physical()` in virtual routing\n- **Source**: GitHub Issue #5421\n- **Fix**: Use pathless route instead: `_layout.tsx` + `_layout.index.tsx`\n\n**Issue #7: Search Params Type Inference**\n- **Error**: Type inference not working with `zodSearchValidator`\n- **Source**: GitHub Issue #3100 (regression since v1.81.5)\n- **Fix**: Use `zodValidator` from `@tanstack/zod-adapter` instead\n\n**Issue #8: TanStack Start Validators on Reload**\n- **Error**: `validateSearch` not working on page reload in TanStack Start\n- **Source**: GitHub Issue #3711\n- **Note**: Works on client-side navigation, fails on direct page load\n\n### Issue #9: Server Function Validation Errors Lose Structure\n\n**Error**: `inputValidator` Zod errors stringified, losing structure on client\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6428](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6428)\n**Why It Happens**: TanStack Start server function error serialization converts Zod issues array to JSON string in `error.message`, making it unusable without manual parsing.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// Server function with input validation\nexport const myFn = createServerFn({ method: ''POST'' })\n  .inputValidator(z.object({\n    name: z.string().min(2),\n    age: z.number().min(18),\n  }))\n  .handler(async ({ data }) => data)\n\n// Client: Workaround to parse stringified issues\ntry {\n  await mutation.mutate({ data: invalidData })\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error.message.startsWith(''['')) {\n    const issues = JSON.parse(error.message)\n    // Now can use structured error data\n    issues.forEach(issue => {\n      console.log(issue.path, issue.message)\n    })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Official Status**: Known issue, tracking PR for fix\n\n### Issue #10: useParams({ strict: false }) Returns Unparsed Values\n\n**Error**: Params typed as parsed but returned as strings after navigation\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6385](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6385)\n**Why It Happens**: In v1.147.3+, `match.params` is no longer parsed when using `strict: false`. First render works correctly, but after navigation values are stored as strings instead of parsed types.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// Route with param parsing\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts/$postId'')({\n  params: {\n    parse: (params) => ({\n      postId: z.coerce.number().parse(params.postId),\n    }),\n  },\n})\n\n// Component: Use strict mode (default) for parsed params\nfunction Component() {\n  const { postId } = useParams() // ✓ Parsed as number\n  // const { postId } = useParams({ strict: false }) // ✗ String!\n\n  // Or manually parse when using strict: false\n  const params = useParams({ strict: false })\n  const postId = Number(params.postId)\n}\n```\n\n**Official Status**: Known issue, workaround required\n\n### Issue #11: Pathless Route notFoundComponent Not Rendering\n\n**Error**: `notFoundComponent` on pathless layout routes ignored\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6351](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6351), [GitHub Issue #4065](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/4065)\n**Why It Happens**: Pathless routes (e.g., `routes/(authenticated)/route.tsx`) don''t render their `notFoundComponent`. Instead, the `defaultNotFoundComponent` from router config is triggered. This has been broken since April 2025.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// ✗ Doesn''t work: notFoundComponent on pathless layout\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/(authenticated)'')({\n  beforeLoad: ({ context }) => {\n    if (!context.auth) throw redirect({ to: ''/login'' })\n  },\n  notFoundComponent: () => <div>Protected 404</div>, // Not rendered!\n})\n\n// ✓ Works: Define on child routes instead\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/(authenticated)/dashboard'')({\n  notFoundComponent: () => <div>Protected 404</div>,\n})\n```\n\n**Official Status**: Known issue, workaround required\n\n### Issue #12: Aborted Loader Renders errorComponent with Undefined Error\n\n**Error**: Rapid navigation aborts previous loader and renders errorComponent with `undefined` error\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6388](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6388)\n**Why It Happens**: Side effect introduced after PR #4570. When user rapidly navigates (e.g., clicking through list items), aborted fetch requests trigger errorComponent without passing the abort error.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts/$postId'')({\n  loader: async ({ params, abortController }) => {\n    await fetch(`/api/posts/${params.postId}`, {\n      signal: abortController.signal,\n    })\n  },\n  errorComponent: ({ error, reset }) => {\n    // Check for undefined error (aborted request)\n    if (!error) {\n      return null // Or show loading state\n    }\n    return <div>Error: {error.message}</div>\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Official Status**: Known issue, workaround required\n\n### Issue #13: Vitest Cannot Read Properties of Null (useState)\n\n**Error**: `Cannot read properties of null (reading ''useState'')` when running tests with Vitest\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6262](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6262), [PR #6074](https://github.com/TanStack/router/pull/6074)\n**Why It Happens**: TanStack Start''s `tanstackStart()` plugin conflicts with Vitest''s React hooks rendering. This is a known duplicate issue with a PR in progress.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// Temporary workaround: Comment out tanstackStart() for tests\n// vite.config.ts\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    // tanstackStart(), // Disable for tests\n    react(),\n  ],\n  test: { environment: ''jsdom'' },\n})\n```\n\n**Official Status**: PR #6074 in progress to fix\n\n### Issue #14: Throwing Error in Streaming SSR Loader Crashes Dev Server\n\n**Error**: Dev server crashes when route loader throws error without awaiting (using `void` instead of `await`)\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6200](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6200)\n**Why It Happens**: SSR streaming mode can''t handle unawaited promise rejections. The error escapes the loader context and crashes the worker process.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// ✗ Wrong: void + throw crashes dev server\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts'')({\n  loader: async () => {\n    void fetch(''/api/posts'').then(r => {\n      throw new Error(''boom'') // Crashes!\n    })\n  },\n})\n\n// ✓ Correct: Always await or catch\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts'')({\n  loader: async () => {\n    try {\n      const data = await fetch(''/api/posts'')\n      return data\n    } catch (error) {\n      throw error // Caught by errorComponent\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Official Status**: Known issue, workaround required\n\n### Issue #15: Prerender Hangs Indefinitely if Filter Returns Zero Results\n\n**Error**: Build step hangs when `prerender.filter` returns zero routes\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6425](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6425)\n**Why It Happens**: TanStack Start prerendering doesn''t handle empty route sets gracefully - it waits indefinitely for routes that never come.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// ✗ Wrong: Empty filter causes hang\ntanstackStart({\n  prerender: {\n    enabled: true,\n    filter: (route) => false, // No routes → hangs!\n  },\n})\n\n// ✓ Correct: Ensure at least one route or disable\ntanstackStart({\n  prerender: {\n    enabled: true,\n    filter: (route) => route.path === ''/'' || route.path.startsWith(''/posts''),\n  },\n})\n\n// Or temporarily disable\ntanstackStart({\n  prerender: { enabled: false },\n})\n```\n\n**Official Status**: Known issue, workaround required\n\n### Issue #16: Prerendering Does Not Work in Docker\n\n**Error**: Build fails in Docker with \"Unable to connect\" during prerender step\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6275](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6275), [PR #6305](https://github.com/TanStack/router/pull/6305)\n**Why It Happens**: Vite preview server used for prerendering is not accessible in Docker environment.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// vite.config.ts - Make preview server accessible in Docker\nexport default defineConfig({\n  preview: {\n    host: true, // Bind to 0.0.0.0 instead of localhost\n  },\n  plugins: [\n    devtools(),\n    // nitro({ preset: \"bun\" }), // Remove temporarily if issues persist\n    tanstackStart(),\n    react(),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**Official Status**: PR #6305 in progress\n\n### Issue #17: Route Head Function Executes Before Loader Finishes\n\n**Error**: Meta tags generated with incomplete data when `head()` runs before `loader()`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6221](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6221)\n**Why It Happens**: The `head()` function can execute before the route `loader()` finishes, causing meta tags to use placeholder or undefined data.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// ✗ Wrong: loaderData may not be available yet\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts/$postId'')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => {\n    const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n    return { post }\n  },\n  head: ({ loaderData }) => ({\n    meta: [\n      { title: loaderData.post.title }, // May be undefined!\n    ],\n  }),\n})\n\n// ✓ Correct: Explicitly await if needed\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts/$postId'')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => {\n    const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n    return { post }\n  },\n  head: async ({ loaderData }) => {\n    await loaderData // Ensure loaded\n    return {\n      meta: [{ title: loaderData.post.title }],\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Official Status**: Known issue, workaround required\n\n### Issue #18: Virtual Routes Don''t Support Manual Lazy Loading (Community-sourced)\n\n**Error**: `createLazyFileRoute` automatically replaced with `createFileRoute` in virtual routes\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6396](https://github.com/TanStack/router/issues/6396)\n**Why It Happens**: Virtual file routes are designed for automatic code splitting only. Manual lazy routes are not supported - the plugin silently replaces them.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// Virtual routes: Use automatic code splitting\n// vite.config.ts\ntanstackRouter({\n  target: ''react'',\n  virtualRouteConfig: ''./routes.ts'',\n  autoCodeSplitting: true, // Use automatic splitting\n})\n\n// Don''t use createLazyFileRoute in virtual routes\n// It will be replaced with createFileRoute automatically\n```\n\n**Official Status**: By design (documented behavior)\n\n### Issue #19: NavigateOptions Type Safety Inconsistency (Community-sourced)\n\n**Error**: `NavigateOptions` type doesn''t enforce required params like `useNavigate()` does\n**Source**: [TkDodo''s Blog: The Beauty of TanStack Router](https://tkdodo.eu/blog/the-beauty-of-tan-stack-router)\n**Why It Happens**: Type definitions differ between runtime hook and type helper. `NavigateOptions` is less strict.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// ✗ Wrong: NavigateOptions doesn''t catch missing params\nconst options: NavigateOptions = {\n  to: ''/posts/$postId'', // No TS error, but params required!\n}\n\n// ✓ Correct: Use useNavigate() return type\nconst navigate = useNavigate()\ntype NavigateFn = typeof navigate\n// Now type-safe across all usages\n```\n\n**Verified**: Cross-referenced with TanStack Query maintainer analysis\n\n### Issue #20: Missing Leading Slash in Route Paths (Community-sourced)\n\n**Error**: Routes fail to match when path defined without leading slash\n**Source**: [Official Debugging Guide](https://tanstack.com/router/latest/docs/framework/react/how-to/debug-router-issues)\n**Why It Happens**: Very common beginner mistake - using `''about''` instead of `''/about''` causes route matching failures.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```typescript\n// ✗ Wrong: Missing leading slash\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''about'')({ /* ... */ })\n\n// ✓ Correct: Always start with /\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/about'')({ /* ... */ })\n```\n\n**Verified**: Official documentation, common debugging issue\n\n---\n\n## Cloudflare Workers Integration\n\n**Vite Config** (add @cloudflare/vite-plugin):\n```typescript\nimport { cloudflare } from ''@cloudflare/vite-plugin''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [TanStackRouterVite(), react(), cloudflare()],\n})\n```\n\n**API Routes Pattern** (fetch from Workers backend):\n```typescript\n// Worker: functions/api/posts.ts\nexport async function onRequestGet({ env }) {\n  const { results } = await env.DB.prepare(''SELECT * FROM posts'').all()\n  return Response.json(results)\n}\n\n// Router: src/routes/posts.tsx\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/posts'')({\n  loader: async () => fetch(''/api/posts'').then(r => r.json()),\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n**Related Skills**: tanstack-query (data fetching), react-hook-form-zod (form validation), cloudflare-worker-base (API backend), tailwind-v4-shadcn (UI)\n\n**Related Packages**: @tanstack/zod-adapter (search validation), @tanstack/virtual-file-routes (programmatic routes)\n\n---\n\n**Last verified**: 2026-01-20 | **Skill version**: 2.0.0 | **Changes**: Added 12 new issues from community research (inputValidator structure loss, useParams parsing bug, pathless notFoundComponent, aborted loader errors, Vitest conflicts, SSR streaming crashes, Docker prerender issues, head/loader timing, virtual routes lazy loading limitation, NavigateOptions type inconsistency, leading slash common mistake). Increased error prevention from 8 to 20 documented issues.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:17:09.472Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing type-safe, file-based routing for React Single-Page Applications (SPAs).","zh":"非常适合需要类型安全、基于文件的路由的React单页应用（SPAs）的前端代理。","ja":"Reactシングルページアプリケーション（SPAs）でタイプセーフでファイルベースのルーティングが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 싱글 페이지 애플리케이션(SPA)에서 타입 안전 파일 기반 라우팅이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan enrutamiento basado en archivos y de tipo seguro para aplicaciones de página única de React (SPAs).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un routage basé sur des fichiers et de type sécurisé pour les applications à page unique React (SPAs).","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die typsicheres, dateibasiertes Routing für React-Einzelseitenanwendungen (SPAs) benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de roteamento baseado em arquivos e tipo seguro para Aplicações de Página Única do React (SPAs).","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуется типобезопасный, файловый маршрутизация для одностраничных приложений React (SPA).","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تحويل م系ased على الملفات وأمان النوع لمواقع الويب ذات الصفحة الواحدة من رياضيات (SPAs)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage route-level data loading and seamless TanStack Query integration, utilizing libraries like @tanstack/react-router and @tanstack/router-devtools, while also supporting Zod validation for robust data validation.","zh":"赋予代理使用路由级数据加载和无缝的TanStack Query集成的能力，利用像@tanstack/react-router和@tanstack/router-devtools这样的库，同时还支持Zod验证以实现强大的数据验证。","ja":"エージェントにルートレベルのデータロードとシームレスなTanStack Queryの統合を可能にし、@tanstack/react-routerや@tanstack/router-devtoolsなどのライブラリを利用するだけでなく、Zodの検証をサポートして堅牢なデータ検証を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 라우트 수준 데이터 로딩과 심리스한 TanStack Query 통합을 사용할 수 있도록 하며, @tanstack/react-router 및 @tanstack/router-devtools와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하면서도 Zod 검증을 지원하여 강력한 데이터 검증을 실현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar la carga de datos a nivel de ruta y una integración perfecta con TanStack Query, utilizando bibliotecas como @tanstack/react-router y @tanstack/router-devtools, y también admite la validación Zod para una validación de datos robusta.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter le chargement de données au niveau de la route et une intégration transparente de TanStack Query, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme @tanstack/react-router et @tanstack/router-devtools, tout en supportant la validation Zod pour une validation de données robuste.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Routenebene-Datenladefunktionen und eine nahtlose TanStack-Query-Integration zu nutzen, indem Bibliotheken wie @tanstack/react-router und @tanstack/router-devtools verwendet werden, und unterstützt auch Zod-Validierung für eine robuste Datenvalidierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem o carregamento de dados de nível de rota e a integração perfeita do TanStack Query, utilizando bibliotecas como @tanstack/react-router e @tanstack/router-devtools, além de suportar a validação Zod para uma validação de dados robusta.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать маршрутизацию на уровне маршрута и бесшовную интеграцию с TanStack Query, используя библиотеки seperti @tanstack/react-router и @tanstack/router-devtools, а также поддержку проверки Zod для надежной проверки данных.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من تحميل البيانات على مستوى المسار والدمج السلس ل TanStack Query، باستخدام مكتبات مثل @tanstack/react-router و @tanstack/router-devtools، بالإضافة إلى دعم التحقق من Zod للتحقق من البيانات القوي."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing accessible, mobile-friendly routing for modern UI components","Enabling efficient route-level data loading for enhanced user experience","Integrating TanStack Query for optimized data fetching and caching"],"zh":["实现现代UI组件的可访问、移动友好的路由","启用路由级数据加载以增强用户体验","集成TanStack Query以优化数据获取和缓存"],"ja":["モダンUIコンポーネントのアクセス可能でモバイルフレンドリーなルーティングを実現する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるためのルートレベルのデータロードを有効にする","データ取得とキャッシングを最適化するためのTanStack Queryの統合"],"ko":["모던 UI 컴포넌트에 대한 접근 가능한 모바일 친화적인 라우팅을 구현하는 것","사용자 경험을 향상시키기 위한 라우트 수준 데이터 로딩을 활성화하는 것","데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱을 최적화하기 위한 TanStack Query 통합"],"es":["Implementar enrutamiento accesible y compatible con dispositivos móviles para componentes de interfaz de usuario modernos","Habilitar la carga de datos eficiente a nivel de ruta para una experiencia de usuario mejorada","Integrar TanStack Query para una búsqueda y almacenamiento en caché de datos optimizados"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre un routage accessible et compatible avec les appareils mobiles pour les composants d''interface utilisateur modernes","Activer le chargement de données efficace au niveau de la route pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","Intégrer TanStack Query pour une recherche et un stockage en cache de données optimisés"],"de":["Zugängliches und mobiles Routing für moderne Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten implementieren","Effizientes Routenebene-Datenladen für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung aktivieren","TanStack Query integrieren für optimierte Datenabruf und -caching"],"pt":["Implementação de roteamento acessível e amigável para dispositivos móveis para componentes de interface de usuário modernos","Habilitação de carregamento eficiente de dados de nível de rota para experiência do usuário aprimorada","Integração do TanStack Query para busca e armazenamento em cache de dados otimizados"],"ru":["Реализация доступного и дружественного маршрутизации для современных компонентов пользовательского интерфейса","Включение эффективной загрузки данных на уровне маршрута для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Интеграция TanStack Query для оптимизированной загрузки и кэширования данных"],"ar":["تنفيذ تحويل مرن ومرن للهواتف المحمولة لمكونات واجهة المستخدم الحديثة","تمكين تحميل بيانات كفء على مستوى المسار لتجربة مستخدم محسّنة","دمج TanStack Query لاسترجاع البيانات والذاكرة المؤقتة الأمثل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React setup","Needs @tanstack/react-router and @tanstack/router-devtools installation","Vite config must prioritize TanStackRouterVite before react()"],"zh":["需要React设置","需要@tanstack/react-router和@tanstack/router-devtools的安装","Vite配置必须优先考虑TanStackRouterVite而不是react()"],"ja":["Reactの設定が必要","@tanstack/react-routerと@tanstack/router-devtoolsのインストールが必要","Viteの設定でTanStackRouterViteをreact()よりも優先する必要がある"],"ko":["React 설정이 필요합니다","@tanstack/react-router 및 @tanstack/router-devtools 설치가 필요합니다","Vite 구성에서 react()보다 TanStackRouterVite를 우선시해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de React","Necesita la instalación de @tanstack/react-router y @tanstack/router-devtools","La configuración de Vite debe priorizar TanStackRouterVite antes de react()"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration React","Nécessite l''installation de @tanstack/react-router et @tanstack/router-devtools","La configuration de Vite doit prioriser TanStackRouterVite avant react()"],"de":["Benötigt React-Konfiguration","Benötigt die Installation von @tanstack/react-router und @tanstack/router-devtools","Die Vite-Konfiguration muss TanStackRouterVite vor react() priorisieren"],"pt":["Exige configuração do React","Necessita de instalação do @tanstack/react-router e @tanstack/router-devtools","Configuração do Vite deve priorizar TanStackRouterVite antes de react()"],"ru":["Требует настройки React","Требует установки @tanstack/react-router и @tanstack/router-devtools","Настройка Vite должна отдавать приоритет TanStackRouterVite перед react()"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد رياضيات","يحتاج إلى تثبيت @tanstack/react-router و @tanstack/router-devtools","يجب أن تعطي إعداد Vite الأسبقية ل TanStackRouterVite قبل react()"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
