crear animaciones y escenas. Aprende a utilizarla con nuestros recursos y ejemplos de código.","fr":"Manimce est un outil pour créer des animations et des scènes. Apprenez à l''utiliser avec nos ressources et exemples de code.","de":"Manimce ist ein Tool zur Erstellung von Animationen und Szenen. Lernen Sie, es mit unseren Ressourcen und Codebeispielen zu verwenden.","pt":"O Manimce é uma ferramenta para criar animações matemáticas. Aprenda a usá-lo com as nossas melhores práticas","ru":"Manimce - это инструмент для создания математических анимаций. Узнайте, как им пользоваться с помощью наших лучших практик","ar":"Manimce هو أداة لإنشاء الرسوم المتحركة الرياضية. تعلم كيفية استخدامه باستخدام أفضل الممارسات لدينا","en":"@connorads dotfiles 🟢"},"definition":{"en":"@connorads dotfiles 🟢"},"features":{"zh":["核心概念：场景结构、构造方法和场景类型","动画技巧：动画类、播放动画和时序","创建和转换：创建动画、写入动画和渐隐动画"],"ja":["コアコンセプト：シーン構造、コンストラクタメソッド、シーンタイプ","アニメーションテクニック：アニメーションクラス、プレイアニメーション、タイミング","作成と変換：作成アニメーション、書き込みアニメーション、フェードアニメーション"],"ko":["핵심 개념: 장면 구조, 생성 방법 및 장면 유형","애니메이션 기술: 애니메이션 클래스, 애니메이션 재생 및 타이밍","생성 및 변환: 생성 애니메이션, 쓰기 애니메이션 및 페이드 애니메이션"],"es":["Estructura de escenas y métodos de construcción","Tipos de mobjects y grupos","Clases de animaciones y temporización","Creación y transformación de objetos","Ejemplos de código y reglas detalladas"],"fr":["Structure de scènes et méthodes de construction","Types de mobjects et groupes","Classes d''animations et temporisation","Création et transformation d''objets","Exemples de code et règles détaillées"],"de":["Szenenstruktur und Konstruktionsmethoden","Mobject-Typen und Gruppen","Animationsklassen und Zeitsteuerung","Erstellung und Transformation von Objekten","Codebeispiele und detaillierte Regeln"],"pt":["Conceitos básicos de cena e objeto","Criação e transformação de cenas e objetos","Animações personalizadas","Suporte a diferentes tipos de objetos","Controle de tempo e sincronização"],"ru":["Базовые понятия сцены и объекта","Создание и трансформация сцен и объектов","Пользовательские анимации","Поддержка разных типов объектов","Контроль времени и синхронизация"],"ar":["مفاهيم أساسية للمشهد والكائن","إنشاء وتحويل المشاهد والكائنات","الرسوم المتحركة المخصصة","دعم أنواع مختلفة من الكائنات","مراقبة الوقت والتزامن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ManimCE","动画制作","最佳实践","核心概念","场景结构","动画技巧","创建和转换"],"ja":["ManimCE","アニメーション制作","ベストプラクティス","コアコンセプト","シーン構造","アニメーションテクニック","作成と変換"],"ko":["ManimCE","애니메이션 제작","최적의 사용법","핵심 개념","장면 구조","애니메이션 기술","생성 및 변환"],"es":["manimce","animaciones","escenas","mobjects","grupos","clases de animaciones","temporización","creación de objetos","transformación de objetos"],"fr":["manimce","animations","scènes","mobjects","groupes","classes d''animations","temporisation","création d''objets","transformation d''objets"],"de":["manimce","animationen","szenen","mobjects","gruppen","animationsklassen","zeitsteuerung","erstellung von objekten","transformation von objekten"],"pt":["manimce","animações matemáticas","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de código aberto","criação de cenas","transformação de objetos"],"ru":["manimce","математические анимации","разработка программного обеспечения","открытые инструменты","создание сцен","трансформация объектов"],"ar":["manimce","الرسوم المتحركة الرياضية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات مفتوحة المصدر","إنشاء مشاهد","تحويل الكائنات"]}},"owner":"connorads","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"connorads/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"manimce-best-practices","description":"|","bodyPreview":"## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n### Core Concepts\n- [rules/scenes.md](rules/scenes.md) - Scene structure, construct method, and scene types\n- [rules/mobjects.md](rules/mobjects.md) - Mobject types, VMobject, Groups, and positioning\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Animation classes, playing animations, and timing\n\n### Creation & Transformation\n- [rules/creation-animations.md](rules/creation-animations.md) - Create, Write, Fade","body":"## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n### Core Concepts\n- [rules/scenes.md](rules/scenes.md) - Scene structure, construct method, and scene types\n- [rules/mobjects.md](rules/mobjects.md) - Mobject types, VMobject, Groups, and positioning\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Animation classes, playing animations, and timing\n\n### Creation & Transformation\n- [rules/creation-animations.md](rules/creation-animations.md) - Create, Write, FadeIn, DrawBorderThenFill\n- [rules/transform-animations.md](rules/transform-animations.md) - Transform, ReplacementTransform, morphing\n- [rules/animation-groups.md](rules/animation-groups.md) - AnimationGroup, LaggedStart, Succession\n\n### Text & Math\n- [rules/text.md](rules/text.md) - Text mobjects, fonts, and styling\n- [rules/latex.md](rules/latex.md) - MathTex, Tex, LaTeX rendering, and coloring formulas\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Write, AddTextLetterByLetter, TypeWithCursor\n\n### Styling & Appearance\n- [rules/colors.md](rules/colors.md) - Color constants, gradients, and color manipulation\n- [rules/styling.md](rules/styling.md) - Fill, stroke, opacity, and visual properties\n\n### Positioning & Layout\n- [rules/positioning.md](rules/positioning.md) - move_to, next_to, align_to, shift methods\n- [rules/grouping.md](rules/grouping.md) - VGroup, Group, arrange, and layout patterns\n\n### Coordinate Systems & Graphing\n- [rules/axes.md](rules/axes.md) - Axes, NumberPlane, coordinate systems\n- [rules/graphing.md](rules/graphing.md) - Plotting functions, parametric curves\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - ThreeDScene, 3D axes, surfaces, camera orientation\n\n### Animation Control\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Rate functions, easing, run_time, lag_ratio\n- [rules/updaters.md](rules/updaters.md) - Updaters, ValueTracker, dynamic animations\n- [rules/camera.md](rules/camera.md) - MovingCameraScene, zoom, pan, frame manipulation\n\n### Configuration & CLI\n- [rules/cli.md](rules/cli.md) - Command-line interface, rendering options, quality flags\n- [rules/config.md](rules/config.md) - Configuration system, manim.cfg, settings\n\n### Shapes & Geometry\n- [rules/shapes.md](rules/shapes.md) - Circle, Square, Rectangle, Polygon, and geometric primitives\n- [rules/lines.md](rules/lines.md) - Line, Arrow, Vector, DashedLine, and connectors\n\n## Working Examples\n\nComplete, tested example files demonstrating common patterns:\n\n- [examples/basic_animations.py](examples/basic_animations.py) - Shape creation, text, lagged animations, path movement\n- [examples/math_visualization.py](examples/math_visualization.py) - LaTeX equations, color-coded math, derivations\n- [examples/updater_patterns.py](examples/updater_patterns.py) - ValueTracker, dynamic animations, physics simulations\n- [examples/graph_plotting.py](examples/graph_plotting.py) - Axes, functions, areas, Riemann sums, polar plots\n- [examples/3d_visualization.py](examples/3d_visualization.py) - ThreeDScene, surfaces, 3D camera, parametric curves\n\n## Scene Templates\n\nCopy and modify these templates to start new projects:\n\n- [templates/basic_scene.py](templates/basic_scene.py) - Standard 2D scene template\n- [templates/camera_scene.py](templates/camera_scene.py) - MovingCameraScene with zoom/pan\n- [templates/threed_scene.py](templates/threed_scene.py) - 3D scene with surfaces and camera rotation\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Basic Scene Structure\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass MyScene(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Create mobjects\n        circle = Circle()\n\n        # Add to scene (static)\n        self.add(circle)\n\n        # Or animate\n        self.play(Create(circle))\n\n        # Wait\n        self.wait(1)\n```\n\n### Render Command\n```bash\n# Basic render with preview\nmanim -pql scene.py MyScene\n\n# Quality flags: -ql (low), -qm (medium), -qh (high), -qk (4k)\nmanim -pqh scene.py MyScene\n```\n\n### Key Differences from 3b1b/ManimGL\n\n| Feature | Manim Community | 3b1b/ManimGL |\n|---------|-----------------|--------------|\n| Import | `from manim import *` | `from manimlib import *` |\n| CLI | `manim` | `manimgl` |\n| Math text | `MathTex(r\"\\pi\")` | `Tex(R\"\\pi\")` |\n| Scene | `Scene` | `InteractiveScene` |\n| Package | `manim` (PyPI) | `manimgl` (PyPI) |\n\n### Jupyter Notebook Support\n\nUse the `%%manim` cell magic:\n\n```python\n%%manim -qm MyScene\nclass MyScene(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        self.play(Create(Circle()))\n```\n\n### Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n1. **Version confusion** - Ensure you''re using `manim` (Community), not `manimgl` (3b1b version)\n2. **Check imports** - `from manim import *` is ManimCE; `from manimlib import *` is ManimGL\n3. **Outdated tutorials** - Video tutorials may be outdated; prefer official documentation\n4. **manimpango issues** - If text rendering fails, check manimpango installation requirements\n5. **PATH issues (Windows)** - If `manim` command not found, use `python -m manim` or check PATH\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# Install Manim Community\npip install manim\n\n# Check installation\nmanim checkhealth\n```\n\n### Useful Commands\n\n```bash\nmanim -pql scene.py Scene    # Preview low quality (development)\nmanim -pqh scene.py Scene    # Preview high quality\nmanim --format gif scene.py  # Output as GIF\nmanim checkhealth            # Verify installation\nmanim plugins -l             # List plugins\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:17:26.200Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Animation and Graphics Agents needing advanced scene management and animation capabilities with Manim.","zh":"非常适合需要高级场景管理和动画功能的动画和图形代理，特别是使用Manim。","ja":"Manimを使用して高度なシーン管理とアニメーション機能を必要とするアニメーションとグラフィックスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Manim을 사용하여 고급 시цен 관리와 애니메이션 기능이 필요한 애니메이션 및 그래픽 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Animación y Gráficos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión de escenas y animación con Manim.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Animation et de Graphisme nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion de scène et d''animation avec Manim.","de":"Perfekt für Animations- und Grafik-Agenten, die erweiterte Szenenverwaltung und Animationsfähigkeiten mit Manim benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Animação e Gráficos que necessitam de gerenciamento de cena avançado e capacidades de animação com Manim.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анимации и графики, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления сценой и анимацией с Manim.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الرسوم المتحركة والرسومات الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مشهد متقدمة وقدرات الرسوم المتحركة مع Manim."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex animations using scene structure, mobject types, and animation classes, while following best practices for creation and transformation, including VMobject, Groups, and positioning, as well as playing animations with precise timing.","zh":"赋予代理创建复杂动画的能力，使用场景结构、物体类型和动画类，同时遵循创建和转换的最佳实践，包括VMobject、组和定位，以及具有精确时序的动画播放。","ja":"シーン構造、オブジェクトタイプ、クラスを使用して複雑なアニメーションを作成し、作成と変換のベストプラクティスに従い、VMobject、グループ、位置指定、および正確なタイミングでのアニメーション再生を行うエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"에이전트가 시цен 구조, 오브젝트 유형 및 애니메이션 클래스를 사용하여 복잡한 애니메이션을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 생성 및 변환의 모범 사례를 따르며, VMobject, 그룹, 위치 지정 및 정확한 타이밍의 애니메이션 재생을 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear animaciones complejas utilizando la estructura de escena, tipos de mobjects y clases de animación, siguiendo las mejores prácticas para la creación y transformación, incluyendo VMobject, Grupos y posicionamiento, así como reproducir animaciones con temporización precisa.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations complexes en utilisant la structure de scène, les types de mobjects et les classes d''animation, tout en suivant les meilleures pratiques pour la création et la transformation, y compris VMobject, les Groupes et le positionnement, ainsi que la lecture d''animations avec un timing précis.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten die Erstellung komplexer Animationen unter Verwendung der Szenenstruktur, Mobject-Typen und Animationsklassen, unter Beachtung der Best Practices für Erstellung und Transformation, einschließlich VMobject, Gruppen und Positionierung, sowie das Abspielen von Animationen mit präziser Zeitsteuerung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem animações complexas usando estrutura de cena, tipos de mobject e classes de animação, seguindo as melhores práticas para criação e transformação, incluindo VMobject, Grupos e posicionamento, bem como reproduzir animações com temporização precisa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложные анимации, используя структуру сцены, типы mobject и классы анимации, следуя лучшим практикам создания и преобразования, включая VMobject, Группы и позиционирование, а также воспроизведение анимаций с точным таймингом.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء رسوم متحركة معقدة باستخدام هيكل المشهد وأنواع المادة والفئات الرسومية، مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات لإنشاء التحويل، بما في ذلك VMobject والمجموعات والتحديد، وكذلك تشغيل الرسوم المتحركة بدقة التوقيت."},"useCases":{"en":["Constructing scenes with multiple mobjects and animations","Generating creation animations, such as Create, Write, and Fade","Debugging scene structure and animation timing issues"],"zh":["构建具有多个物体和动画的场景","生成创建动画，例如创建、写入和渐入","调试场景结构和动画时序问题"],"ja":["複数のオブジェクトとアニメーションを含むシーンを構築する","Create、Write、Fadeなどの作成アニメーションを生成する","シーン構造とアニメーションタイミングの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["여러 개의 오브젝트와 애니메이션을 포함하는 시цен을 구축하는 것","생성, 작성, 페이드와 같은 생성 애니메이션을 생성하는 것","시цен 구조 및 애니메이션 타이밍 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Construcción de escenas con múltiples mobjects y animaciones","Generación de animaciones de creación, como Create, Write y Fade","Depuración de problemas de estructura de escena y temporización de animación"],"fr":["Construction de scènes avec plusieurs mobjects et animations","Génération d''animations de création, telles que Create, Write et Fade","Débogage des problèmes de structure de scène et de timing d''animation"],"de":["Konstruktion von Szenen mit mehreren Mobjects und Animationen","Erzeugung von Erstellungsanimationen, wie Create, Write und Fade","Debugging von Szenenstruktur- und Animationszeitproblemen"],"pt":["Construir cenas com vários mobjects e animações","Gerar animações de criação, como Criar, Escrever e Desvanecer","Depurar problemas de estrutura de cena e temporização de animação"],"ru":["Создание сцен с несколькими mobject и анимациями","Генерация анимаций создания, таких как Создать, Написать и Исчезнуть","Отладка проблем структуры сцены и тайминга анимации"],"ar":["بناء المشاهد مع مادة متعددة والرسوم المتحركة","إنشاء رسوم متحركة لإنشاء مثل الإنشاء والكتابة والتلاشي","تصحيح أخطاء هيكل المشهد وتوقيت الرسوم المتحركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Manim installation and configuration","Limited to 2D animation and graphics capabilities","Python programming knowledge necessary for implementation"],"zh":["需要Manim安装和配置","仅限2D动画和图形功能","需要Python编程知识来实现"],"ja":["Manimのインストールと設定が必要","2Dアニメーションとグラフィックス機能のみ","実装にはPythonプログラミング知識が必要"],"ko":["Manim 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다","2D 애니메이션 및 그래픽 기능만 가능합니다","구현을 위해 Python 프로그래밍 지식이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de Manim","Limitado a capacidades de animación y gráficos 2D","Se necesitan conocimientos de programación en Python para su implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Manim","Limité aux capacités d''animation et de graphisme 2D","Des connaissances en programmation Python sont nécessaires pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von Manim","Beschränkt auf 2D-Animations- und Grafikfähigkeiten","Python-Programmierkenntnisse sind für die Implementierung erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Manim","Limitado a capacidades de animação e gráficos 2D","Conhecimento de programação em Python necessário para implementação"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Manim","Ограничен возможностями анимации и графики 2D","Необходимо знание программирования на Python для реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Manim","محدود بقدرات الرسوم المتحركة والرسومات ثنائية الأبعاد","معارف برمجة بايتون ضرورية للتطبيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
