LI permet l''exécution parallèle de tâches et améliore l''efficacité des projets","de":"Die Delegierung an Gemini CLI ermöglicht die parallele Ausführung von Aufgaben und verbessert die Effizienz von Projekten","pt":"O Gemini CLI é uma ferramenta para delegar tarefas para execução paralela","ru":"Gemini CLI — это инструмент для делегирования задач для параллельного выполнения","ar":"Gemini CLI هي أداة لتفويض المهام للتنفيذ المتوازي","en":"chaotic rebirth, from the chrysalis of knowledge"},"definition":{"en":"chaotic rebirth, from the chrysalis of knowledge"},"features":{"zh":["并行任务执行","提高工作效率","支持多个独立任务","提供新鲜的上下文和代理视角","支持任务并发执行"],"ja":["並列タスク実行","作業効率の向上","複数の独立タスクをサポート","新しいコンテキストとエージェントの視点を提供","タスクの並行実行をサポート"],"ko":["병렬 작업 실행","작업 효율성 향상","複数의 독립적인 작업을 지원","새로운 컨텍스트와 에이전트의 관점을 제공","작업의 병렬 실행을 지원"],"es":["Ejecución paralela de tareas","Mejora de la eficiencia de los proyectos","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Fácil integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Soporte para tareas independientes"],"fr":["Exécution parallèle de tâches","Amélioration de l''efficacité des projets","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Intégration facile avec des outils de développement","Prise en charge de tâches indépendantes"],"de":["Parallele Ausführung von Aufgaben","Verbesserung der Effizienz von Projekten","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Einfache Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für unabhängige Aufgaben"],"pt":["Execução paralela de tarefas","Delegação de tarefas independentes","Perspectiva fresca de contexto/agente","Offloading de trabalho para execução concorrente"],"ru":["Параллельное выполнение задач","Делегирование независимых задач","Свежий контекст/агент перспектива","Offloading работы для параллельного выполнения"],"ar":["تنفيذ متوازي للمهام","تفويض مهام مستقلة","منظور سياق/وكلاء جديد","إيقاف تشغيل العمل للتنفيذ المتوازي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Gemini CLI","并行任务执行","命令行工具","工作效率","任务管理","并发执行"],"ja":["Gemini CLI","並列タスク実行","コマンドラインツール","作業効率","タスク管理","並行実行"],"ko":["Gemini CLI","병렬 작업 실행","명령줄 도구","작업 효율성","작업 관리","병렬 실행"],"es":["delegación a Gemini CLI","ejecución paralela","eficiencia de proyectos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","tareas independientes"],"fr":["délégation à Gemini CLI","exécution parallèle","efficacité des projets","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","tâches indépendantes"],"de":["Delegierung an Gemini CLI","parallele Ausführung","Effizienz von Projekten","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","unabhängige Aufgaben"],"pt":["Gemini CLI","delegação de tarefas","execução paralela","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","programação paralela"],"ru":["Gemini CLI","делегирование задач","параллельное выполнение","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","параллельное программирование"],"ar":["Gemini CLI","تفويض المهام","التنفيذ المتوازي","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","البرمجة المتوازية"]}},"owner":"Diogenesoftoronto","repo":"chrysalis-forge","repoPath":"Diogenesoftoronto/chrysalis-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"delegating-to-gemini-cli","description":"Delegates coding tasks to the Gemini CLI agent. Use when asked to use gemini, gemini-cli, or to spawn external agents for parallel work on multiple issues.","bodyPreview":"# Delegating to Gemini CLI\n\nOrchestrates work delegation to the Gemini CLI agent for parallel task execution.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User explicitly asks to use \"gemini\", \"gemini cli\", or \"gemini-cli\"\n- Multiple independent issues need fixing in parallel\n- Tasks benefit from a fresh context/agent perspective\n- Offloading work to run concurrently while continuing other tasks\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nVerify gemini CLI is installed:\n```bash\nwhich gemini && gemini --version\n```\n\n## Model Selection\n\nAlways spe","body":"# Delegating to Gemini CLI\n\nOrchestrates work delegation to the Gemini CLI agent for parallel task execution.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User explicitly asks to use \"gemini\", \"gemini cli\", or \"gemini-cli\"\n- Multiple independent issues need fixing in parallel\n- Tasks benefit from a fresh context/agent perspective\n- Offloading work to run concurrently while continuing other tasks\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nVerify gemini CLI is installed:\n```bash\nwhich gemini && gemini --version\n```\n\n## Model Selection\n\nAlways specify the model explicitly with `-m`. Only use Gemini 3 models:\n\n```bash\ngemini -m gemini-3-pro-preview \"task description\"\n```\n\n**Allowed models:**\n- `gemini-3-pro-preview` - Best for complex coding tasks, refactoring, multi-file changes\n- `gemini-3-flash` - Fast for simpler tasks, single-file fixes, quick edits\n\n**Never use:** `gemini-2.5-pro`, `gemini-2.0-flash`, or any 2.x models.\n\n## Execution Patterns\n\n### Single Task (Direct)\n```bash\ngemini -m gemini-3-pro-preview -y \"Fix the bug in src/foo.rkt on line 42. Read the file first, then implement the fix and run tests.\"\n```\n\n### Parallel Tasks (Via Subagents)\nUse the `Task` tool to spawn subagents, each invoking gemini:\n\n```\n<Task>\n  <description>Fix Issue #1: Description</description>\n  <prompt>Use the gemini CLI to fix Issue #1.\n\nRun this command:\n```bash\ncd /path/to/project && gemini -m gemini-3-pro-preview -y \"Detailed task description with:\n1. Files to read\n2. Specific changes needed\n3. Tests to run after\"\n```\n\nReport back what changes were made.</prompt>\n</Task>\n```\n\n### Key Flags\n\n| Flag | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `-m MODEL` | Specify model (required for consistent results) |\n| `-y` | Auto-accept all actions (YOLO mode) - use for automated tasks |\n| `-d` | Debug mode for troubleshooting |\n| `-s` | Sandbox mode for safer execution |\n| `--approval-mode auto_edit` | Auto-approve edits only, prompt for other actions |\n\n## Task Description Best Practices\n\nStructure prompts for gemini with:\n\n1. **Context**: What file(s) to read first\n2. **Requirements**: Numbered list of specific changes\n3. **Verification**: Test command to run after changes\n4. **Scope**: Be explicit about what NOT to change\n\nExample:\n```\n\"Fix the ANSI parser in src/tui/text/ansi.rkt to support 256-color codes.\n\nRequirements:\n1. Read the current implementation first\n2. Add parsing for 38;5;N (256-color) sequences\n3. Add parsing for 38;2;R;G;B (TrueColor) sequences\n4. Add tests for new functionality\n5. Do NOT modify existing 16-color handling\n\nAfter changes, run: raco test src/tui/text/ansi.rkt\"\n```\n\n## Creating GitHub Issues First\n\nBefore delegating, create detailed issues with `gh`:\n\n```bash\ngh issue create \\\n  --title \"[Component] Brief description\" \\\n  --label \"bug\" \\\n  --body ''Detailed markdown with:\n- Problem description\n- File locations with line numbers\n- Root cause analysis\n- Proposed solution\n- Acceptance criteria''\n```\n\nThen reference issues in gemini prompts for traceability.\n\n## Workflow: Issue Batch Processing\n\n1. **Analyze codebase** for issues (grep TODOs, review docs, find bugs)\n2. **Create GitHub issues** with `gh issue create` including file:line references\n3. **Spawn subagents** each running gemini for one issue\n4. **Collect results** from subagent summaries\n5. **Verify** with build/test commands\n6. **Report** consolidated status to user\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf gemini hits quota limits:\n```\nThe model is overloaded. Please try again later.\n```\n\nFallback options:\n1. Switch to `gemini-3-flash` if using pro (or vice versa)\n2. Implement the fix directly in the subagent\n3. Queue the task for retry\n\n## Verification After Delegation\n\nAlways verify gemini''s work:\n```bash\n# Build check\nraco make main.rkt\n\n# Run tests\nraco test src/\n\n# Check for uncommitted changes\ngit status\ngit diff --stat\n```\n\n## Example: Full Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create issues\ngh issue create --title \"[TUI] Fix scroll bug\" --label \"bug\" --body ''...''\n\n# 2. Spawn subagent with gemini task\n# (via Task tool in Amp)\n\n# 3. Verify results\nraco test src/tui/\ngit diff\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:17:17.049Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring efficient task delegation and parallel execution via the Gemini CLI","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的高级 AI 代理，需要通过 Gemini CLI 实现高效的任务委托和并行执行","ja":"Gemini CLI を介したタスクの委任と並列実行を効率的に行う必要がある AutoGPT や LangChain などの高度な AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"Gemini CLI를 통해 작업 위임 및 병렬 실행을 효율적으로 수행해야 하는 AutoGPT 및 LangChain과 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren una delegación de tareas eficiente y una ejecución paralela a través de la CLI de Gemini","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une délégation de tâches efficace et une exécution parallèle via la CLI Gemini","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine effiziente Aufgabenverteilung und eine parallele Ausführung über die Gemini-CLI erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como AutoGPT e LangChain que requerem delegação de tarefas eficiente e execução paralela via o CLI Gemini","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих эффективной делегации задач и параллельного выполнения через CLI Gemini","ar":"مثالي لعمليات 智能 الاصطناعي المتقدمة مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب تفويض مهام فعالا وتشغيلا متوازيا عن طريق واجهة سطر الأوامر Gemini"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate work delegation to the Gemini CLI for parallel task execution, leveraging fresh context and agent perspectives, and utilizing the Gemini CLI''s capabilities for concurrent task offloading","zh":"赋予代理以编排工作委托至 Gemini CLI 进行并行任务执行的能力，利用最新的上下文和代理视角，并利用 Gemini CLI 的功能进行并发任务卸载","ja":"エージェントが Gemini CLI への作業の委任をオーケストレートし、並列タスク実行を実行する能力を提供します。新しいコンテキストとエージェントの視点を活用し、Gemini CLI の機能を使用してコンカレント タスク オフロードを実現します","ko":"에이전트가 Gemini CLI로 작업 위임을 오케스트레이션하고 병렬 작업 실행을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, 최신 컨텍스트와 에이전트 관점을 활용하고 Gemini CLI의 기능을 사용하여 병렬 작업 오프로드를 수행합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a orquestar la delegación de trabajo a la CLI de Gemini para la ejecución de tareas paralelas, aprovechando el contexto fresco y las perspectivas del agente, y utilizando las capacidades de la CLI de Gemini para la descarga de tareas concurrentes","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer la délégation de travail à la CLI Gemini pour l''exécution de tâches parallèles, en exploitant le contexte frais et les perspectives de l''agent, et en utilisant les capacités de la CLI Gemini pour le déchargement de tâches concurrentes","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Arbeit an die Gemini-CLI zu übertragen, um Aufgaben parallel auszuführen, den frischen Kontext und die Perspektiven des Agents zu nutzen und die Fähigkeiten der Gemini-CLI für die gleichzeitige Auslagerung von Aufgaben zu verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar a delegação de trabalho para o CLI Gemini para execução de tarefas paralelas, aproveitando o contexto fresco e as perspectivas dos agentes, e utilizando as capacidades do CLI Gemini para descarregar tarefas concorrentes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать делегирование работы в CLI Gemini для параллельного выполнения задач, используя свежий контекст и перспективы агентов, и используя возможности CLI Gemini для конкрутного卸载 задач","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنسيق تفويض العمل لواجهة سطر الأوامر Gemini من أجل تنفيذ مهام متوازي، واستخدام السياق الحديث ومنظور العميل، واستخدام إمكانيات واجهة سطر الأوامر Gemini لتفريغ المهام المتزامنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Offloading multiple independent issues for parallel fixing","Executing tasks concurrently while maintaining other agent activities","Utilizing Gemini CLI for tasks benefiting from a fresh agent perspective"],"zh":["为并行修复多个独立问题进行卸载","在维护其他代理活动的同时并发执行任务","利用 Gemini CLI 处理从新代理视角受益的任务"],"ja":["並列で修正するための複数の独立した問題をオフロードする","他のエージェント アクティビティを維持しながらタスクをコンカレントに実行する","新しいエージェントの視点から利益のあるタスクに Gemini CLI を使用する"],"ko":["병렬로 수정하기 위한 여러 개의 독립적인 문제를 오프로드하는 것","다른 에이전트 활동을 유지하면서 작업을 병렬로 실행하는 것","신규 에이전트 관점에서 이익을 얻는 작업에 Gemini CLI를 사용하는 것"],"es":["Descargar múltiples problemas independientes para su reparación paralela","Ejecutar tareas de forma concurrente mientras se mantienen otras actividades del agente","Utilizar la CLI de Gemini para tareas que se benefician de una perspectiva fresca del agente"],"fr":["Décharger plusieurs problèmes indépendants pour une correction parallèle","Exécuter des tâches de manière concurrente tout en maintenant d''autres activités de l''agent","Utiliser la CLI Gemini pour des tâches qui bénéficient d''une perspective fraîche de l''agent"],"de":["Mehrere unabhängige Probleme zur parallelen Behebung auslagern","Aufgaben gleichzeitig ausführen, während andere Agenten-Aktivitäten aufrechterhalten werden","Die Gemini-CLI für Aufgaben verwenden, die von einer frischen Agenten-Perspektive profitieren"],"pt":["Descarregar várias questões independentes para correção paralela","Executar tarefas concorrentemente enquanto mantém outras atividades do agente","Utilizar o CLI Gemini para tarefas que se beneficiam de uma perspectiva fresca do agente"],"ru":["Отгрузка нескольких независимых вопросов для параллельного исправления","Выполнение задач одновременно, сохраняя другие действия агента","Использование CLI Gemini для задач, которые выигрывают от свежей перспективы агента"],"ar":["إفراغ قضايا متعددة مستقلة لتصحيح متوازي","تنفيذ مهام متزامنة مع الحفاظ على أنشطة وكلاء أخرى","استخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر Gemini للمهام التي تستفيد من منظور وكلاء حديث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Gemini CLI installation","Dependent on Gemini CLI version and compatibility"],"zh":["需要安装 Gemini CLI","依赖于 Gemini CLI 的版本和兼容性"],"ja":["Gemini CLI のインストールが必要","Gemini CLI のバージョンと互換性に依存する"],"ko":["Gemini CLI 설치가 필요함","Gemini CLI 버전 및 호환성에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de Gemini","Depende de la versión y la compatibilidad de la CLI de Gemini"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI Gemini","Dépend de la version et de la compatibilité de la CLI Gemini"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der Gemini-CLI","Hängt von der Version und der Kompatibilität der Gemini-CLI ab"],"pt":["Requer instalação do CLI Gemini","Depende da versão e compatibilidade do CLI Gemini"],"ru":["Требует установки CLI Gemini","Зависит от версии и совместимости CLI Gemini"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر Gemini","يعتمد على إصدار واجهة سطر الأوامر Gemini وتوافقيته"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('richiefi/richie-news-wordpress-plugin/wp-block-development', 'community', 'richiefi', 'richie-news-wordpress-plugin', 'richiefi/richie-news-wordpress-plugin', 'wp-block-development', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z', '2026-02-18T09:17:38.197Z', NULL, '{"id":"richiefi/richie-news-wordpress-plugin/wp-block-development","name":"wp-block-development","description":{"zh":"WP 块开发工具是 WordPress 中用于创建和管理块的插件，支持块的创建、更新和渲染","ja":"WP ブロック開発ツールは、WordPress でブロックを作成および管理するためのプラグインです。ブロックの作成、更新、レンダリングをサポートします","ko":"WP 블록 개발 도구는 WordPress에서 블록을 생성하고 관리하기 위한 플러그인입니다. 블록의 생성, 업데이트, 렌더링을 지원합니다","es":"El desarrollo de bloques WP permite a los desarrolladores crear y personalizar bloques para WordPress. Aprende a crear bloques personalizados para mejorar tu sitio web","fr":"Le développement de blocs WP permet aux développeurs de créer et de personnaliser des blocs pour WordPress. Apprenez à créer des blocs personnalisés pour améliorer votre site Web","de":"Die WP-Block-Entwicklung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Blöcke für WordPress zu erstellen und anzupassen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie benutzerdefinierte Blöcke erstellen können, um Ihre Website zu verbessern","pt":"O desenvolvimento de blocos WP é uma habilidade fundamental para criar experiências personalizadas no WordPress.","ru":"Разработка блоков WP является фундаментальным навыком для создания персонализированных trải nghiệm в WordPress.","ar":"تطوير الكتل هو مهارة أساسية لإنشاء تجارب مخصصة على الووردبريس.","en":"Wordpress plugin for Richie News"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"WP 块开发工具","ja":"WP ブロック開発","ko":"WP 블록 개발","es":"Desarrollo de bloques WP: crea y personaliza bloques para...","fr":"Développement de blocs WP : créez et personnalisez des bl...","de":"WP-Block-Entwicklung: Erstellen und Anpassen von Blöcken ...","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Blocos WP","ru":"Разработка блоков WP","ar":"تطوير كتلة الووردبريس","en":"wp-block-development"},"description":{"zh":"WP 块开发工具是 WordPress 中用于创建和管理块的插件，支持块的创建、更新和渲染","ja":"WP ブロック開発ツールは、WordPress でブロックを作成および管理するためのプラグインです。ブロックの作成、更新、レンダリングをサポートします","ko":"WP 블록 개발 도구는 WordPress에서 블록을 생성하고 관리하기 위한 플러그인입니다. 블록의 생성, 업데이트, 렌더링을 지원합니다","es":"El desarrollo de bloques WP permite a los desarrolladores crear y personalizar bloques para WordPress. Aprende a crear bloques personalizados para mejorar tu...","fr":"Le développement de blocs WP permet aux développeurs de créer et de personnaliser des blocs pour WordPress. Apprenez à créer des blocs personnalisés pour amé...","de":"Die WP-Block-Entwicklung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Blöcke für WordPress zu erstellen und anzupassen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie benutzerdefinierte Blöcke erstell...","pt":"O desenvolvimento de blocos WP é uma habilidade fundamental para criar experiências personalizadas no WordPress.","ru":"Разработка блоков WP является фундаментальным навыком для создания персонализированных trải nghiệm в WordPress.","ar":"تطوير الكتل هو مهارة أساسية لإنشاء تجارب مخصصة على الووردبريس.","en":"Wordpress plugin for Richie News"},"definition":{"en":"Wordpress plugin for Richie News"},"features":{"zh":["创建和更新块","支持块的动态渲染","管理块的属性和版本","支持块的废弃和迁移","集成 build 工具"],"ja":["ブロックの作成と更新","ブロックの動的レンダリングをサポート","ブロックの属性とバージョンの管理","ブロックの廃止と移行をサポート","ビルドツールの統合"],"ko":["블록의 생성과 업데이트","블록의 동적 렌더링 지원","블록의 속성과 버전 관리","블록의 폐기와 마이그레이션 지원","빌드 도구 통합"],"es":["Crear bloques personalizados para WordPress","Personalizar bloques existentes","Agregar renderizado dinámico","Deprecar y migrar versiones de bloques","Utilizar herramientas de compilación para bloques","Crear bloques con WordPress Scripts y Create Block"],"fr":["Créer des blocs personnalisés pour WordPress","Personnaliser des blocs existants","Ajouter un rendu dynamique","Déprécier et migrer des versions de blocs","Utiliser des outils de construction pour les blocs","Créer des blocs avec WordPress Scripts et Create Block"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Blöcken für WordPress","Anpassen von bestehenden Blöcken","Hinzufügen von dynamischem Rendering","Veraltet und migrieren von Blockversionen","Verwenden von Build-Tools für Blöcke","Erstellen von Blöcken mit WordPress Scripts und Create Block"],"pt":["Criação de blocos personalizados","Atualização de blocos existentes","Edição de arquivos block.json","Adição de renderização dinâmica","Depreciação e migração de blocos","Ferramentas de build para blocos"],"ru":["Создание персонализированных блоков","Обновление существующих блоков","Редактирование файлов block.json","Добавление динамической отрисовки","Устаревание и миграция блоков","Инструменты сборки для блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل مخصصة","تحديث الكتل الحالية","تحرير ملفات block.json","إضافة توجيه ديناميكي","إلغاء وتحويل الكتل","أدوات بناء للكتل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WordPress 块开发","WP 块开发工具","块创建","块更新","块渲染","块管理","WordPress 插件"],"ja":["WordPress ブロック開発","WP ブロック開発ツール","ブロック作成","ブロック更新","ブロックレンダリング","ブロック管理","WordPress プラグイン"],"ko":["WordPress 블록 개발","WP 블록 개발 도구","블록 생성","블록 업데이트","블록 렌더링","블록 관리","WordPress 플러그인"],"es":["desarrollo de bloques WP","wordpress","bloques personalizados","renderizado dinámico","deprecación de bloques","herramientas de compilación","wordpress scripts","create block"],"fr":["développement de blocs WP","wordpress","blocs personnalisés","rendu dynamique","dépréciation de blocs","outils de construction","wordpress scripts","create block"],"de":["WP-Block-Entwicklung","wordpress","benutzerdefinierte Blöcke","dynamisches Rendering","Veraltung von Blöcken","Build-Tools","WordPress Scripts","Create Block"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de blocos wp","wordpress plugin","blocos personalizados","richie news","criação de blocos","atualização de blocos","block.json","renderização dinâmica","depreciação de blocos"],"ru":["разработка блоков wp","плагин wordpress","персонализированные блоки","richie news","создание блоков","обновление блоков","block.json","динамическая отрисовка","устаревание блоков"],"ar":["تطوير الكتل","إضافة الووردبريس","الكتل المخصصة","ريشي نيوز","إنشاء الكتل","تحديث الكتل","block.json","التوجيه الديناميكي","إلغاء الكتل"]}},"owner":"richiefi","repo":"richie-news-wordpress-plugin","repoPath":"richiefi/richie-news-wordpress-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wp-block-development","description":"Use when developing WordPress (Gutenberg) blocks: block.json metadata, register_block_type(_from_metadata), attributes/serialization, supports, dynamic rendering (render.php/render_callback), deprecations/migrations, viewScript vs viewScriptModule, and @wordpress/scripts/@wordpress/create-block build and test workflows.","bodyPreview":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inpu","body":"# WP Block Development\n\n## When to use\n\nUse this skill for block work such as:\n\n- creating a new block, or updating an existing one\n- changing `block.json` (scripts/styles/supports/attributes/render/viewScriptModule)\n- fixing “block invalid / not saving / attributes not persisting”\n- adding dynamic rendering (`render.php` / `render_callback`)\n- block deprecations and migrations (`deprecated` versions)\n- build tooling for blocks (`@wordpress/scripts`, `@wordpress/create-block`, `wp-env`)\n\n## Inputs required\n\n- Repo root and target (plugin vs theme vs full site).\n- The block name/namespace and where it lives (path to `block.json` if known).\n- Target WordPress version range (especially if using modules / `viewScriptModule`).\n\n## Procedure\n\n### 0) Triage and locate blocks\n\n1. Run triage:\n   - `node skills/wp-project-triage/scripts/detect_wp_project.mjs`\n2. List blocks (deterministic scan):\n   - `node skills/wp-block-development/scripts/list_blocks.mjs`\n3. Identify the block root (directory containing `block.json`) you’re changing.\n\nIf this repo is a full site (`wp-content/` present), be explicit about *which* plugin/theme contains the block.\n\n### 1) Create a new block (if needed)\n\nIf you are creating a new block, prefer scaffolding rather than hand-rolling structure:\n\n- Use `@wordpress/create-block` to scaffold a modern block/plugin setup.\n- If you need Interactivity API from day 1, use the interactive template.\n\nRead:\n- `references/creating-new-blocks.md`\n\nAfter scaffolding:\n\n1. Re-run the block list script and confirm the new block root.\n2. Continue with the remaining steps (model choice, metadata, registration, serialization).\n\n### 2) Ensure apiVersion 3 (WordPress 6.9+)\n\nWordPress 6.9 enforces `apiVersion: 3` in the block.json schema. Blocks with apiVersion 2 or lower trigger console warnings when `SCRIPT_DEBUG` is enabled.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- WordPress 7.0 will run the post editor in an iframe regardless of block apiVersion.\n- apiVersion 3 ensures your block works correctly inside the iframed editor (style isolation, viewport units, media queries).\n\n**Migration:** Changing from version 2 to 3 is usually as simple as updating the `apiVersion` field in `block.json`. However:\n- Test in a local environment with the iframe editor enabled.\n- Ensure any style handles are included in `block.json` (styles missing from the iframe won''t apply).\n- Third-party scripts attached to a specific `window` may have scoping issues.\n\nRead:\n- `references/block-json.md` (apiVersion and schema details)\n\n### 3) Pick the right block model\n\n- **Static block** (markup saved into post content): implement `save()`; keep attributes serialization stable.\n- **Dynamic block** (server-rendered): use `render` in `block.json` (or `render_callback` in PHP) and keep `save()` minimal or `null`.\n- **Interactive frontend behavior**:\n  - Prefer `viewScriptModule` for modern module-based view scripts where supported.\n  - If you''re working primarily on `data-wp-*` directives or stores, also use `wp-interactivity-api`.\n\n### 4) Update `block.json` safely\n\nMake changes in the block’s `block.json`, then confirm registration matches metadata.\n\nFor field-by-field guidance, read:\n- `references/block-json.md`\n\nCommon pitfalls:\n\n- changing `name` breaks compatibility (treat it as stable API)\n- changing saved markup without adding `deprecated` causes “Invalid block”\n- adding attributes without defining source/serialization correctly causes “attribute not saving”\n\n### 5) Register the block (server-side preferred)\n\nPrefer PHP registration using metadata, especially when:\n\n- you need dynamic rendering\n- you need translations (`wp_set_script_translations`)\n- you need conditional asset loading\n\nRead and apply:\n- `references/registration.md`\n\n### 6) Implement edit/save/render patterns\n\nFollow wrapper attribute best practices:\n\n- Editor: `useBlockProps()`\n- Static save: `useBlockProps.save()`\n- Dynamic render (PHP): `get_block_wrapper_attributes()`\n\nRead:\n- `references/supports-and-wrappers.md`\n- `references/dynamic-rendering.md` (if dynamic)\n\n### 7) Inner blocks (block composition)\n\nIf your block is a “container” that nests other blocks, treat Inner Blocks as a first-class feature:\n\n- Use `useInnerBlocksProps()` to integrate inner blocks with wrapper props.\n- Keep migrations in mind if you change inner markup.\n\nRead:\n- `references/inner-blocks.md`\n\n### 8) Attributes and serialization\n\nBefore changing attributes:\n\n- confirm where the attribute value lives (comment delimiter vs HTML vs context)\n- avoid the deprecated `meta` attribute source\n\nRead:\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md`\n\n### 9) Migrations and deprecations (avoid \"Invalid block\")\n\nIf you change saved markup or attributes:\n\n1. Add a `deprecated` entry (newest → oldest).\n2. Provide `save` for old versions and an optional `migrate` to normalize attributes.\n\nRead:\n- `references/deprecations.md`\n\n### 10) Tooling and verification commands\n\nPrefer whatever the repo already uses:\n\n- `@wordpress/scripts` (common) → run existing npm scripts\n- `wp-env` (common) → use for local WP + E2E\n\nRead:\n- `references/tooling-and-testing.md`\n\n## Verification\n\n- Block appears in inserter and inserts successfully.\n- Saving + reloading does not create “Invalid block”.\n- Frontend output matches expectations (static: saved markup; dynamic: server output).\n- Assets load where expected (editor vs frontend).\n- Run the repo’s lint/build/tests that triage recommends.\n\n## Failure modes / debugging\n\nIf something fails, start here:\n\n- `references/debugging.md` (common failures + fastest checks)\n- `references/attributes-and-serialization.md` (attributes not saving)\n- `references/deprecations.md` (invalid block after change)\n\n## Escalation\n\nIf you’re uncertain about upstream behavior/version support, consult canonical docs first:\n\n- WordPress Developer Resources (Block Editor Handbook, Theme Handbook, Plugin Handbook)\n- Gutenberg repo docs for bleeding-edge behaviors\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:17:38.197Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in WordPress plugin development and block customization.","zh":"适合专门从事WordPress插件开发和块定制的前端代理。","ja":"WordPressプラグイン開発とブロックのカスタマイズを専門とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"워드프레스 플러그인 개발 및 블록 사용자 정의를 전문으로 하는 프런트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que se especializan en el desarrollo de plugins de WordPress y la personalización de bloques.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend spécialisés dans le développement de plugins WordPress et la personnalisation de blocs.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf die Entwicklung von WordPress-Plugins und die Anpassung von Blöcken spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend especializados em desenvolvimento de plugins do WordPress e personalização de blocos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на разработке плагинов WordPress и настройке блоков.","ar":"مثالية لوفاء الطرف الأمامي المتخصصة في تطوير إضافات ووردبريس وتخصيص الكتلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and update custom WordPress blocks, leveraging tools like @wordpress/scripts and @wordpress/create-block, while managing block deprecations and migrations through deprecated versions, and enhancing dynamic rendering with render.php and render_callback.","zh":"赋予代理创建和更新自定义WordPress块的能力，利用@wordpress/scripts和@wordpress/create-block等工具，同时通过弃用版本管理块弃用和迁移，并通过render.php和render_callback增强动态渲染。","ja":"エージェントがカスタムWordPressブロックを作成および更新できるようにし、@wordpress/scriptsや@wordpress/create-blockなどのツールを利用し、非推奨バージョンを介してブロックの非推奨および移行を管理し、render.phpおよびrender_callbackを介して動的レンダリングを強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 정의 워드프레스 블록을 만들고 업데이트할 수 있도록 하며 @wordpress/scripts 및 @wordpress/create-block와 같은 도구를 활용하여 블록 사용 중단 및 마이그레이션을廃止 버전을 통해 관리하고 render.php 및 render_callback를 통해 동적 렌더링을增強합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y actualizar bloques personalizados de WordPress, aprovechando herramientas como @wordpress/scripts y @wordpress/create-block, mientras gestionan las depreciaciones y migraciones de bloques a través de versiones obsoletas, y mejoran la representación dinámica con render.php y render_callback.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de mettre à jour des blocs WordPress personnalisés, en exploitant des outils tels que @wordpress/scripts et @wordpress/create-block, tout en gérant les dépréciations et les migrations de blocs à travers les versions obsolètes, et en améliorant le rendu dynamique avec render.php et render_callback.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, benutzerdefinierte WordPress-Blöcke zu erstellen und zu aktualisieren, indem sie Tools wie @wordpress/scripts und @wordpress/create-block nutzen, während sie Block-Veraltungen und -Migrationen durch veraltete Versionen verwalten und die dynamische Darstellung mit render.php und render_callback verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e atualizar blocos personalizados do WordPress, utilizando ferramentas como @wordpress/scripts e @wordpress/create-block, enquanto gerencia a descontinuação e migração de blocos por meio de versões descontinuadas, e melhora a renderização dinâmica com render.php e render_callback.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и обновлять пользовательские блоки WordPress, используя инструменты как @wordpress/scripts и @wordpress/create-block, а также управлять устареванием и миграцией блоков через устаревшие версии, и улучшать динамическую отрисовку с помощью render.php и render_callback.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء كتل ووردبريس المخصصة وتحديثها، باستخدام أدوات مثل @wordpress/scripts و @wordpress/create-block، مع إدارة الإيقاف والمهاجر إلى الإصدارات القديمة، وتحسين العرض الديناميكي مع render.php و render_callback."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new blocks with custom attributes and rendering","Updating existing blocks with changed block.json configurations","Debugging block invalidation and attribute persistence issues","Implementing dynamic rendering for custom blocks"],"zh":["使用自定义属性和渲染创建新块","使用更改的block.json配置更新现有块","调试块失效和属性持久性问题","为自定义块实现动态渲染"],"ja":["カスタム属性とレンダリングを使用して新しいブロックを作成する","変更されたblock.json構成を使用して既存のブロックを更新する","ブロックの無効化と属性の永続性の問題をデバッグする","カスタムブロック用の動的レンダリングを実装する"],"ko":["사용자 정의 속성 및 렌더링을 사용하여 새 블록を作成합니다","변경된 block.json 구성으로 기존 블록을 업데이트합니다","블록 무효화 및 속성 영속성 문제를 디버깅합니다","사용자 정의 블록을 위한 동적 렌더링을 구현합니다"],"es":["Crear nuevos bloques con atributos personalizados y representación","Actualizar bloques existentes con configuraciones de block.json cambiadas","Depurar problemas de invalidación de bloques y persistencia de atributos","Implementar representación dinámica para bloques personalizados"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux blocs avec des attributs personnalisés et un rendu","Mettre à jour des blocs existants avec des configurations de block.json modifiées","Déboguer les problèmes d''invalidation de blocs et de persistance d''attributs","Implémenter un rendu dynamique pour des blocs personnalisés"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen Blöcken mit benutzerdefinierten Attributen und Darstellung","Aktualisieren von bestehenden Blöcken mit geänderten block.json-Konfigurationen","Beheben von Problemen mit der Block-Invalidierung und Attribut-Persistenz","Implementieren der dynamischen Darstellung für benutzerdefinierte Blöcke"],"pt":["Criar novos blocos com atributos personalizados e renderização","Atualizar blocos existentes com configurações alteradas do block.json","Depurar problemas de invalidação de blocos e persistência de atributos","Implementar renderização dinâmica para blocos personalizados"],"ru":["Создание новых блоков с пользовательскими атрибутами и рендерингом","Обновление существующих блоков с измененными конфигурациями block.json","Отладка проблем с неверной блокировкой и сохранением атрибутов","Реализация динамической отрисовки для пользовательских блоков"],"ar":["إنشاء كتل جديدة مع سمات مخصصة وعرض","تحديث الكتل الحالية مع تكوينات محدثة من block.json","تصحيح أخطاء إلغاء صلاحية الكتلة واستمرار السمة","تنفيذ عرض ديناميكي للكتلة المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress environment and block development tooling","Specific to WordPress block development, not applicable to other CMS platforms"],"zh":["需要WordPress环境和块开发工具","仅适用于WordPress块开发，不适用于其他CMS平台"],"ja":["WordPress環境とブロック開発ツールが必要","WordPressブロック開発専用で、他のCMSプラットフォームには適用されません"],"ko":["워드프레스 환경 및 블록 개발 도구가 필요합니다","워드프레스 블록 개발 전용으로 다른 CMS 플랫폼에는 적용되지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de WordPress y herramientas de desarrollo de bloques","Específico para el desarrollo de bloques de WordPress, no aplicable a otras plataformas de CMS"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement WordPress et des outils de développement de blocs","Spécifique au développement de blocs WordPress, non applicable à d''autres plateformes de CMS"],"de":["Benötigt eine WordPress-Umgebung und Block-Entwicklungstools","Spezifisch für die Entwicklung von WordPress-Blöcken, nicht anwendbar auf andere CMS-Plattformen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente do WordPress e ferramentas de desenvolvimento de blocos","Específico para desenvolvimento de blocos do WordPress, não se aplica a outras plataformas de CMS"],"ru":["Требует среды WordPress и инструментов разработки блоков","Конкретно для разработки блоков WordPress, не применимо к другим платформам CMS"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة ووردبريس وأدوات تطوير الكتلة","محدد لتطوير كتل ووردبريس، لا ينطبق على منصات إدارة المحتوى الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
