la perception de la marque.","de":"Der Popup CRO ist eine Technik, um Popups und Modale zu optimieren, um die Konvertierung zu verbessern, ohne die Markenwahrnehmung zu schädigen.","pt":"O popup CRO é uma técnica de otimização que visa criar popups que convertem sem prejudicar a percepção da marca.","ru":"Попап CRO - это техника оптимизации, направленная на создание попапов, которые конвертируют без ущерба для восприятия бренда.","ar":"نوافذ منبثقة CRO هي تقنية تحسين تهدف إلى إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة تحول دون المساس بالصورة العامه للعلامة التجارية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["popup","CRO"," ","email","newsletter"],"ja":["popup","CRO","","email","newsletter"],"ko":["popup","CRO","","email","newsletter"],"es":["Optimización de popups para mejorar la conversión","Creación de popups personalizados para cada tipo de usuario","Análisis de datos para mejorar la eficacia de los popups","Integración con herramientas de marketing para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","Diseño responsivo para garantizar la compatibilidad con dispositivos móviles"],"fr":["Optimisation des popups pour améliorer la conversion","Création de popups personnalisés pour chaque type d''utilisateur","Analyse des données pour améliorer l''efficacité des popups","Intégration avec des outils de marketing pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Conception réactive pour garantir la compatibilité avec les appareils mobiles"],"de":["Optimierung von Popups zur Verbesserung der Konvertierung","Erstellung von personalisierten Popups für jeden Benutzertyp","Datenanalyse zur Verbesserung der Effizienz von Popups","Integration mit Marketing-Tools zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Responsives Design zur Gewährleistung der Kompatibilität mit mobilen Geräten"],"pt":["Otimização de popups para conversão","Criação de popups personalizados","Análise de desempenho de popups","Otimização para dispositivos móveis","Integração com marketing de produto"],"ru":["Оптимизация попапов для конверсии","Создание индивидуальных попапов","Анализ производительности попапов","Оптимизация для мобильных устройств","Интеграция с маркетингом продукта"],"ar":["تحسين نوافذ منبثقة للتحويل","إنشاء نوافذ منبثقة مخصصة","تحليل أداء نوافذ منبثقة","تحسين لاجهزة الموبايل","التكامل مع تسويق المنتج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["popup-cro","CRO","popup","email","newsletter"," ","seo"],"ja":["popup-cro","CRO","popup","email","newsletter","","seo"],"ko":["popup-cro","CRO","popup","email","newsletter","","seo"],"es":["popup CRO","optimización de popups","conversión de popups","popups personalizados","análisis de datos de popups","integración de popups con marketing","diseño responsivo de popups"],"fr":["popup CRO","optimisation des popups","conversion des popups","popups personnalisés","analyse des données de popups","intégration des popups avec le marketing","conception réactive des popups"],"de":["Popup CRO","Optimierung von Popups","Konvertierung von Popups","personalisierte Popups","Datenanalyse von Popups","Integration von Popups mit Marketing","responsives Design von Popups"],"pt":["popup CRO","otimização de popup","conversão de popup","marketing de produto","análise de desempenho","otimização para dispositivos móveis"],"ru":["попап CRO","оптимизация попапа","конверсия попапа","маркетинг продукта","анализ производительности","оптимизация для мобильных устройств"],"ar":["نوافذ منبثقة CRO","تحسين نوافذ منبثقة","تحويل نوافذ منبثقة","تسويق المنتج","تحليل الأداء","تحسين لاجهزة الموبايل"]}},"owner":"slavochek2","repo":"claritypledge","repoPath":"slavochek2/claritypledge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"popup-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize popups, modals, overlays, slide-ins, or banners for conversion purposes. Also use when the user mentions exit intent, popup conversions, modal optimization, lead capture popup, email popup, announcement banner, or overlay. For forms outside of popups, see form-cro. For general page conversion optimization, see page-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter cap","body":"# Popup CRO\n\nYou are an expert in popup and modal optimization. Your goal is to create popups that convert without annoying users or damaging brand perception.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Popup Purpose**\n   - Email/newsletter capture\n   - Lead magnet delivery\n   - Discount/promotion\n   - Announcement\n   - Exit intent save\n   - Feature promotion\n   - Feedback/survey\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Existing popup performance?\n   - What triggers are used?\n   - User complaints or feedback?\n   - Mobile experience?\n\n3. **Traffic Context**\n   - Traffic sources (paid, organic, direct)\n   - New vs. returning visitors\n   - Page types where shown\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Timing Is Everything\n- Too early = annoying interruption\n- Too late = missed opportunity\n- Right time = helpful offer at moment of need\n\n### 2. Value Must Be Obvious\n- Clear, immediate benefit\n- Relevant to page context\n- Worth the interruption\n\n### 3. Respect the User\n- Easy to dismiss\n- Don''t trap or trick\n- Remember preferences\n- Don''t ruin the experience\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Strategies\n\n### Time-Based\n- **Not recommended**: \"Show after 5 seconds\"\n- **Better**: \"Show after 30-60 seconds\" (proven engagement)\n- Best for: General site visitors\n\n### Scroll-Based\n- **Typical**: 25-50% scroll depth\n- Indicates: Content engagement\n- Best for: Blog posts, long-form content\n- Example: \"You''re halfway through—get more like this\"\n\n### Exit Intent\n- Detects cursor moving to close/leave\n- Last chance to capture value\n- Best for: E-commerce, lead gen\n- Mobile alternative: Back button or scroll up\n\n### Click-Triggered\n- User initiates (clicks button/link)\n- Zero annoyance factor\n- Best for: Lead magnets, gated content, demos\n- Example: \"Download PDF\" → Popup form\n\n### Page Count / Session-Based\n- After visiting X pages\n- Indicates research/comparison behavior\n- Best for: Multi-page journeys\n- Example: \"Been comparing? Here''s a summary...\"\n\n### Behavior-Based\n- Add to cart abandonment\n- Pricing page visitors\n- Repeat page visits\n- Best for: High-intent segments\n\n---\n\n## Popup Types\n\n### Email Capture Popup\n**Goal**: Newsletter/list subscription\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear value prop (not just \"Subscribe\")\n- Specific benefit of subscribing\n- Single field (email only)\n- Consider incentive (discount, content)\n\n**Copy structure:**\n- Headline: Benefit or curiosity hook\n- Subhead: What they get, how often\n- CTA: Specific action (\"Get Weekly Tips\")\n\n### Lead Magnet Popup\n**Goal**: Exchange content for email\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Show what they get (cover image, preview)\n- Specific, tangible promise\n- Minimal fields (email, maybe name)\n- Instant delivery expectation\n\n### Discount/Promotion Popup\n**Goal**: First purchase or conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Clear discount (10%, $20, free shipping)\n- Deadline creates urgency\n- Single use per visitor\n- Easy to apply code\n\n### Exit Intent Popup\n**Goal**: Last-chance conversion\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Acknowledge they''re leaving\n- Different offer than entry popup\n- Address common objections\n- Final compelling reason to stay\n\n**Formats:**\n- \"Wait! Before you go...\"\n- \"Forget something?\"\n- \"Get 10% off your first order\"\n- \"Questions? Chat with us\"\n\n### Announcement Banner\n**Goal**: Site-wide communication\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Top of page (sticky or static)\n- Single, clear message\n- Dismissable\n- Links to more info\n- Time-limited (don''t leave forever)\n\n### Slide-In\n**Goal**: Less intrusive engagement\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Enters from corner/bottom\n- Doesn''t block content\n- Easy to dismiss or minimize\n- Good for chat, support, secondary CTAs\n\n---\n\n## Design Best Practices\n\n### Visual Hierarchy\n1. Headline (largest, first seen)\n2. Value prop/offer (clear benefit)\n3. Form/CTA (obvious action)\n4. Close option (easy to find)\n\n### Sizing\n- Desktop: 400-600px wide typical\n- Don''t cover entire screen\n- Mobile: Full-width bottom or center, not full-screen\n- Leave space to close (visible X, click outside)\n\n### Close Button\n- Always visible (top right is convention)\n- Large enough to tap on mobile\n- \"No thanks\" text link as alternative\n- Click outside to close\n\n### Mobile Considerations\n- Can''t detect exit intent (use alternatives)\n- Full-screen overlays feel aggressive\n- Bottom slide-ups work well\n- Larger touch targets\n- Easy dismiss gestures\n\n### Imagery\n- Product image or preview\n- Face if relevant (increases trust)\n- Minimal for speed\n- Optional—copy can work alone\n\n---\n\n## Copy Formulas\n\n### Headlines\n- Benefit-driven: \"Get [result] in [timeframe]\"\n- Question: \"Want [desired outcome]?\"\n- Command: \"Don''t miss [thing]\"\n- Social proof: \"Join [X] people who...\"\n- Curiosity: \"The one thing [audience] always get wrong about [topic]\"\n\n### Subheadlines\n- Expand on the promise\n- Address objection (\"No spam, ever\")\n- Set expectations (\"Weekly tips in 5 min\")\n\n### CTA Buttons\n- First person works: \"Get My Discount\" vs \"Get Your Discount\"\n- Specific over generic: \"Send Me the Guide\" vs \"Submit\"\n- Value-focused: \"Claim My 10% Off\" vs \"Subscribe\"\n\n### Decline Options\n- Polite, not guilt-trippy\n- \"No thanks\" / \"Maybe later\" / \"I''m not interested\"\n- Avoid manipulative: \"No, I don''t want to save money\"\n\n---\n\n## Frequency and Rules\n\n### Frequency Capping\n- Show maximum once per session\n- Remember dismissals (cookie/localStorage)\n- 7-30 days before showing again\n- Respect user choice\n\n### Audience Targeting\n- New vs. returning visitors (different needs)\n- By traffic source (match ad message)\n- By page type (context-relevant)\n- Exclude converted users\n- Exclude recently dismissed\n\n### Page Rules\n- Exclude checkout/conversion flows\n- Consider blog vs. product pages\n- Match offer to page context\n\n---\n\n## Compliance and Accessibility\n\n### GDPR/Privacy\n- Clear consent language\n- Link to privacy policy\n- Don''t pre-check opt-ins\n- Honor unsubscribe/preferences\n\n### Accessibility\n- Keyboard navigable (Tab, Enter, Esc)\n- Focus trap while open\n- Screen reader compatible\n- Sufficient color contrast\n- Don''t rely on color alone\n\n### Google Guidelines\n- Intrusive interstitials hurt SEO\n- Mobile especially sensitive\n- Allow: Cookie notices, age verification, reasonable banners\n- Avoid: Full-screen before content on mobile\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Impression rate**: Visitors who see popup\n- **Conversion rate**: Impressions → Submissions\n- **Close rate**: How many dismiss immediately\n- **Engagement rate**: Interaction before close\n- **Time to close**: How long before dismissing\n\n### What to Track\n- Popup views\n- Form focus\n- Submission attempts\n- Successful submissions\n- Close button clicks\n- Outside clicks\n- Escape key\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Email popup: 2-5% conversion typical\n- Exit intent: 3-10% conversion\n- Click-triggered: Higher (10%+, self-selected)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Popup Design\n- **Type**: Email capture, lead magnet, etc.\n- **Trigger**: When it appears\n- **Targeting**: Who sees it\n- **Frequency**: How often shown\n- **Copy**: Headline, subhead, CTA, decline\n- **Design notes**: Layout, imagery, mobile\n\n### Multiple Popup Strategy\nIf recommending multiple popups:\n- Popup 1: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Popup 2: [Purpose, trigger, audience]\n- Conflict rules: How they don''t overlap\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Common Popup Strategies\n\n### E-commerce\n1. Entry/scroll: First-purchase discount\n2. Exit intent: Bigger discount or reminder\n3. Cart abandonment: Complete your order\n\n### B2B SaaS\n1. Click-triggered: Demo request, lead magnets\n2. Scroll: Newsletter/blog subscription\n3. Exit intent: Trial reminder or content offer\n\n### Content/Media\n1. Scroll-based: Newsletter after engagement\n2. Page count: Subscribe after multiple visits\n3. Exit intent: Don''t miss future content\n\n### Lead Generation\n1. Time-delayed: General list building\n2. Click-triggered: Specific lead magnets\n3. Exit intent: Final capture attempt\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Placement & Format Experiments\n\n**Banner Variations**\n- Top bar vs. banner below header\n- Sticky banner vs. static banner\n- Full-width vs. contained banner\n- Banner with countdown timer vs. without\n\n**Popup Formats**\n- Center modal vs. slide-in from corner\n- Full-screen overlay vs. smaller modal\n- Bottom bar vs. corner popup\n- Top announcements vs. bottom slideouts\n\n**Position Testing**\n- Test popup sizes on desktop and mobile\n- Left corner vs. right corner for slide-ins\n- Test visibility without blocking content\n\n---\n\n### Trigger Experiments\n\n**Timing Triggers**\n- Exit intent vs. 30-second delay vs. 50% scroll depth\n- Test optimal time delay (10s vs. 30s vs. 60s)\n- Test scroll depth percentage (25% vs. 50% vs. 75%)\n- Page count trigger (show after X pages viewed)\n\n**Behavior Triggers**\n- Show based on user intent prediction\n- Trigger based on specific page visits\n- Return visitor vs. new visitor targeting\n- Show based on referral source\n\n**Click Triggers**\n- Click-triggered popups for lead magnets\n- Button-triggered vs. link-triggered modals\n- Test in-content triggers vs. sidebar triggers\n\n---\n\n### Messaging & Content Experiments\n\n**Headlines & Copy**\n- Test attention-grabbing vs. informational headlines\n- \"Limited-time offer\" vs. \"New feature alert\" messaging\n- Urgency-focused copy vs. value-focused copy\n- Test headline length and specificity\n\n**CTAs**\n- CTA button text variations\n- Button color testing for contrast\n- Primary + secondary CTA vs. single CTA\n- Test decline text (friendly vs. neutral)\n\n**Visual Content**\n- Add countdown timers to create urgency\n- Test with/without images\n- Product preview vs. generic imagery\n- Include social proof in popup\n\n---\n\n### Personalization Experiments\n\n**Dynamic Content**\n- Personalize popup based on visitor data\n- Show industry-specific content\n- Tailor content based on pages visited\n- Use progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n\n**Audience Targeting**\n- New vs. returning visitor messaging\n- Segment by traffic source\n- Target based on engagement level\n- Exclude already-converted visitors\n\n---\n\n### Frequency & Rules Experiments\n\n- Test frequency capping (once per session vs. once per week)\n- Cool-down period after dismissal\n- Test different dismiss behaviors\n- Show escalating offers over multiple visits\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the primary goal for this popup?\n2. What''s your current popup performance (if any)?\n3. What traffic sources are you optimizing for?\n4. What incentive can you offer?\n5. Are there compliance requirements (GDPR, etc.)?\n6. Mobile vs. desktop traffic split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **form-cro**: For optimizing the form inside the popup\n- **page-cro**: For the page context around popups\n- **email-sequence**: For what happens after popup conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing popup variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:18:05.838Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversion Rate Optimization Agents seeking to refine popup and modal interactions for enhanced user experience.","zh":"适用于寻求改进弹出窗口和模态交互以增强用户体验的转化率优化代理。","ja":"コンバージョンレート最適化エージェントがポップアップとモーダルインタラクションを改善してユーザーエクスペリエンスを高めるのに最適です。","ko":"개선된 사용자 경험을 위해 팝업 및 모달 상호 작용을 tinh chỉnh하는 전환률 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de optimización de la tasa de conversión que buscan refinar las interacciones de los popups y modales para mejorar la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''optimisation du taux de conversion qui cherchent à affiner les interactions des popups et modales pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Ideal für Conversion Rate Optimization Agents, die die Interaktionen von Popups und Modals verfeinern möchten, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Otimização de Taxa de Conversão que buscam aprimorar as interações de popup e modal para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации коэффициента конверсии, стремящихся усовершенствовать взаимодействия с всплывающими окнами и модальными окнами для улучшения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين معدل التحويل الذي يسعى لتحسين التفاعلات المنبثقة والتفاعلات المودال لتحسين تجربة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft targeted popups that convert without alienating users, leveraging context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` to inform optimization strategies and ensure brand integrity, utilizing modal optimization techniques and email/newsletter capture best practices.","zh":"赋予代理人创建有针对性的弹出窗口的能力，这些弹出窗口可以在不疏远用户的情况下转化，利用 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 中的上下文来指导优化策略并确保品牌完整性，利用模态优化技术和电子邮件/新闻稿捕获最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーを疎外せずにコンバージョンできるターゲットを絞ったポップアップを作成できるようにし、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のコンテキストを利用して最適化戦略を導き、ブランドの完全性を確保し、モーダル最適化テクニックとメール/ニュースレターのキャプチャに関するベストプラクティスを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자를 외면하지 않고 전환할 수 있는 타겟팅된 팝업을 만들 수 있도록 하며, `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`의 문脈을 사용하여 최적화 전략을 안내하고 브랜드 무결성을 보장하며, 모달 최적화 기술과 이메일/소식지 캡처 최선의 실수를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear popups dirigidos que conviertan sin alienar a los usuarios, aprovechando el contexto de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para informar las estrategias de optimización y garantizar la integridad de la marca, utilizando técnicas de optimización de modales y mejores prácticas de captura de correos electrónicos y boletines.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des popups ciblés qui convertissent sans aliéner les utilisateurs, en exploitant le contexte de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour éclairer les stratégies d''optimisation et assurer l''intégrité de la marque, en utilisant des techniques d''optimisation de modales et des meilleures pratiques de capture d''emails et de newsletters.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, gezielte Popups zu erstellen, die ohne die Vereinnahmung von Nutzern konvertieren, unter Nutzung des Kontexts von `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, um Optimierungsstrategien zu informieren und die Markenintegrität sicherzustellen, unter Anwendung von Modal-Optimierungstechniken und Best-Practices für die Erfassung von E-Mails und Newslettern.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem popups direcionados que convertem sem alienar os usuários, utilizando o contexto de `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para informar estratégias de otimização e garantir a integridade da marca, utilizando técnicas de otimização de modal e práticas recomendadas de captura de e-mail/informativo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать целевые всплывающие окна, которые конвертируют без отталкивания пользователей, используя контекст из `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для информирования стратегий оптимизации и обеспечения целостности бренда, используя техники оптимизации модального окна и лучшие практики по захвату электронной почты/новостей.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء نافذة منبثقة مستهدفة تتحول دون إبعاد المستخدمين، مستخدمًا السياق من `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لإبلاغ استراتيجيات التحسين وضمان سلامة العلامة التجارية، مستخدمًا تقنيات تحسين المودال وأفضل الممارسات لالتقاط البريد الإلكتروني والنشرة الإخبارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing non-intrusive email capture popups","Optimizing modal interactions for improved conversion rates","Analyzing user feedback to refine popup strategies"],"zh":["设计非侵入式电子邮件捕获弹出窗口","优化模态交互以提高转化率","分析用户反馈以改进弹出窗口策略"],"ja":["侵入性のないメールキャプチャーポップアップを設計する","モーダルインタラクションを最適化してコンバージョン率を向上させる","ユーザーフィードバックを分析してポップアップ戦略を改善する"],"ko":["침입하지 않는 이메일 캡처 팝업을 설계함","모달 상호 작용을 최적화하여 전환률을 개선","사용자 피드백을 분석하여 팝업 전략을 tinh chỉnh"],"es":["Diseñar popups de captura de correos electrónicos no intrusivos","Optimizar las interacciones de los modales para mejorar las tasas de conversión","Analizar la retroalimentación de los usuarios para refinar las estrategias de popups"],"fr":["Concevoir des popups de capture d''emails non intrusifs","Optimiser les interactions de modales pour améliorer les taux de conversion","Analyser les réactions des utilisateurs pour affiner les stratégies de popups"],"de":["Entwerfen von nicht aufdringlichen E-Mail-Erfassungs-Popups","Optimieren von Modal-Interaktionen für verbesserte Konversionsraten","Analysieren von Nutzerfeedback, um Popup-Strategien zu verfeinern"],"pt":["Projetar popups de captura de e-mail não intrusivos","Otimizar interações de modal para taxas de conversão melhoradas","Analisar feedback do usuário para aprimorar estratégias de popup"],"ru":["Проектировать незаметные всплывающие окна для захвата электронной почты","Оптимизировать взаимодействия с модальным окном для улучшения коэффициента конверсии","Анализировать обратную связь пользователей для усовершенствования стратегий всплывающих окон"],"ar":["تصميم نافذة منبثقة لالتقاط البريد الإلكتروني غير غازية","تحسين التفاعلات المودالية لتحسين معدل التحويل","تحليل ملاحظات المستخدم لتحسين استراتيجيات النافذة المنبثقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for context","Limited to popup and modal optimization scope"],"zh":["需要访问 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 以获取上下文","仅限于弹出窗口和模态优化范围"],"ja":["`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` へのアクセスがコンテキストを取得するために必要","ポップアップとモーダル最適化の範囲のみに制限"],"ko":["`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`에 접근하여 문맥을 얻는 것이 필요","팝업 및 모달 최적화 범위에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto","Limitado al alcance de la optimización de popups y modales"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour le contexte","Limité à la portée de l''optimisation des popups et modales"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für Kontext","Begrenzt auf den Umfang der Optimierung von Popups und Modals"],"pt":["Requer acesso a `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto","Limitado ao escopo de otimização de popup e modal"],"ru":["Требует доступа к `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для контекста","Ограничен областью оптимизации всплывающих окон и модального окна"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` للسياق","محدود بنطاق تحسين النافذة المنبثقة والمودال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('davzucky/iceberg-explorer/prd', 'community', 'davzucky', 'iceberg-explorer', 'davzucky/iceberg-explorer', 'prd', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z', '2026-02-18T09:18:07.403Z', NULL, '{"id":"davzucky/iceberg-explorer/prd","name":"prd","description":{"zh":"PRD 生成器帮助您创建详细的产品需求文档，包括功能描述、澄清问题和结构化的 PRD 文档","ja":"PRD ジェネレーターは、機能の説明、明確化の質問、および構造化された PRD ドキュメントを含む詳細な製品要件文書を作成します","ko":"PRD 생성기는 기능 설명, 澄清 질문 및 구조화된 PRD 문서를 포함하는詳細한 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성합니다","es":"El generador de PRD crea documentos de requisitos de producto detallados y claros para implementación.","fr":"Le générateur de PRD crée des documents de spécifications de produit détaillés et clairs pour la mise en œuvre.","de":"Der PRD-Generator erstellt detaillierte und klare Produktanforderungsdokumente für die Implementierung.","pt":"O Gerador de PRD cria documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados e claros para implementação. Receba descrições de recursos, faça perguntas esclarecedoras e gere PRDs estruturados.","ru":"Генератор PRD создает подробные и ясные документы требований к продукту для реализации. Получите описания функций, задайте уточняющие вопросы и сгенерируйте структурированные PRD.","ar":"مولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج ي创建 وثائق متطلبات منتج مفصلة وواضحة للتنفيذ. استلم وصفات الميزات، اطرح أسئلة توضيحية، و أنشئ وثائق متطلبات منتج منسقة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PRD 生成器：创建详细的产品需求文档","ja":"PRD ジェネレーター：実装可能な明確な製品要件文書を作成","ko":"PRD 생성기: 구현 가능한 명확한 제품 요구 사항 문서 생성","es":"Generador de PRD: Crea documentos de requisitos de producto","fr":"Générateur de PRD: Créez des documents de spécifications ...","de":"PRD-Generator: Erstelle detaillierte Produktanforderungsd...","pt":"Gerador de PRD: Crie Documentos de Requisitos de Produto","ru":"Генератор PRD: Создавайте подробные документы требований ...","ar":"مولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج: قم بإنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج...","en":"prd"},"description":{"zh":"PRD 生成器帮助您创建详细的产品需求文档，包括功能描述、澄清问题和结构化的 PRD 文档","ja":"PRD ジェネレーターは、機能の説明、明確化の質問、および構造化された PRD ドキュメントを含む詳細な製品要件文書を作成します","ko":"PRD 생성기는 기능 설명, 澄清 질문 및 구조화된 PRD 문서를 포함하는詳細한 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성합니다","es":"El generador de PRD crea documentos de requisitos de producto detallados y claros para implementación.","fr":"Le générateur de PRD crée des documents de spécifications de produit détaillés et clairs pour la mise en œuvre.","de":"Der PRD-Generator erstellt detaillierte und klare Produktanforderungsdokumente für die Implementierung.","pt":"O Gerador de PRD cria documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados e claros para implementação. Receba descrições de recursos, faça perguntas esclarecedora...","ru":"Генератор PRD создает подробные и ясные документы требований к продукту для реализации. Получите описания функций, задайте уточняющие вопросы и сгенерируйте ...","ar":"مولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج ي创建 وثائق متطلبات منتج مفصلة وواضحة للتنفيذ. استلم وصفات الميزات، اطرح أسئلة توضيحية، و أنشئ وثائق متطلبات منتج منسقة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建详细的产品需求文档","包括功能描述和澄清问题","生成结构化的 PRD 文档","保存为 Markdown 文件","适合开发团队使用"],"ja":["詳細な製品要件文書を作成","機能の説明と明確化の質問を含む","構造化された PRD ドキュメントを生成","Markdown ファイルとして保存","開発チームが使用するための適切なツール"],"ko":["詳細한 제품 요구 사항 문서 생성","기능 설명 및澄清 질문 포함","구조화된 PRD 문서 생성","Markdown 파일로 저장","개발 팀에서 사용하기 위한 적합한 도구"],"es":["Crea documentos de requisitos de producto detallados","Hace preguntas clarificadoras para asegurar la precisión","Genera un documento estructurado para implementación","Guarda el documento en formato Markdown","No requiere implementación, solo creación del PRD"],"fr":["Crée des documents de spécifications de produit détaillés","Pose des questions clarificatrices pour assurer la précision","Génère un document structuré pour la mise en œuvre","Enregistre le document au format Markdown","Nécessite pas de mise en œuvre, seulement la création du PRD"],"de":["Erstellt detaillierte Produktanforderungsdokumente","Stellt klärende Fragen, um die Genauigkeit zu gewährleisten","Erzeugt ein strukturiertes Dokument für die Implementierung","Speichert das Dokument im Markdown-Format","Erfordert keine Implementierung, nur die Erstellung des PRD"],"pt":["Criação de PRDs personalizados","Perguntas esclarecedoras para garantir clareza","Geração de PRDs estruturados","Salvar PRDs em formato Markdown"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных PRD","Уточняющие вопросы для обеспечения ясности","Генерация структурированных PRD","Сохранение PRD в формате Markdown"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق متطلبات منتج مخصصة","أسئلة توضيحية لضمان الوضوح","إنشاء وثائق متطلبات منتج منسقة","حفظ وثائق متطلبات المنتج في تنسيق Markdown"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PRD 生成器","产品需求文档","功能描述","澄清问题","结构化 PRD","开发团队","Markdown 文件"],"ja":["PRD ジェネレーター","製品要件文書","機能の説明","明確化の質問","構造化された PRD","開発チーム","Markdown ファイル"],"ko":["PRD 생성기","제품 요구 사항 문서","기능 설명","澄明 질문","구조화된 PRD","개발 팀","Markdown 파일"],"es":["generador de PRD","documento de requisitos de producto","desarrollo de software","creación de PRD","automatización de PRD","herramienta de PRD"],"fr":["générateur de PRD","document de spécifications de produit","développement de logiciel","création de PRD","automatisation de PRD","outil de PRD"],"de":["PRD-Generator","Produktanforderungsdokument","Softwareentwicklung","Erstellung von PRD","Automatisierung von PRD","PRD-Tool"],"pt":["Gerador de PRD","Documentos de Requisitos de Produto","Desenvolvimento de Software","Requisitos de Produto","PRD Generator"],"ru":["Генератор PRD","Документы требований к продукту","Разработка программного обеспечения","Требования к продукту","PRD Генератор"],"ar":["مولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج","وثائق متطلبات المنتج","تطوير البرمجيات","متطلبات المنتج","مولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج"]}},"owner":"davzucky","repo":"iceberg-explorer","repoPath":"davzucky/iceberg-explorer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd","description":"Generate a Product Requirements Document (PRD) for a new feature. Use when planning a feature, starting a new project, or when asked to create a PRD. Triggers on: create a prd, write prd for, plan this feature, requirements for, spec out.","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt i","body":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt is ambiguous. Focus on:\n\n- **Problem/Goal:** What problem does this solve?\n- **Core Functionality:** What are the key actions?\n- **Scope/Boundaries:** What should it NOT do?\n- **Success Criteria:** How do we know it''s done?\n\n### Format Questions Like This:\n\n```\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Other: [please specify]\n\n2. Who is the target user?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Just the backend/API\n   D. Just the UI\n```\n\nThis lets users respond with \"1A, 2C, 3B\" for quick iteration.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: PRD Structure\n\nGenerate the PRD with these sections:\n\n### 1. Introduction/Overview\nBrief description of the feature and the problem it solves.\n\n### 2. Goals\nSpecific, measurable objectives (bullet list).\n\n### 3. User Stories\nEach story needs:\n- **Title:** Short descriptive name\n- **Description:** \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\"\n- **Acceptance Criteria:** Verifiable checklist of what \"done\" means\n\nEach story should be small enough to implement in one focused session.\n\n**Format:**\n```markdown\n### US-001: [Title]\n**Description:** As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit].\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Specific verifiable criterion\n- [ ] Another criterion\n- [ ] Typecheck/lint passes\n- [ ] **[UI stories only]** Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n```\n\n**Important:** \n- Acceptance criteria must be verifiable, not vague. \"Works correctly\" is bad. \"Button shows confirmation dialog before deleting\" is good.\n- **For any story with UI changes:** Always include \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\" as acceptance criteria. This ensures visual verification of frontend work.\n\n### 4. Functional Requirements\nNumbered list of specific functionalities:\n- \"FR-1: The system must allow users to...\"\n- \"FR-2: When a user clicks X, the system must...\"\n\nBe explicit and unambiguous.\n\n### 5. Non-Goals (Out of Scope)\nWhat this feature will NOT include. Critical for managing scope.\n\n### 6. Design Considerations (Optional)\n- UI/UX requirements\n- Link to mockups if available\n- Relevant existing components to reuse\n\n### 7. Technical Considerations (Optional)\n- Known constraints or dependencies\n- Integration points with existing systems\n- Performance requirements\n\n### 8. Success Metrics\nHow will success be measured?\n- \"Reduce time to complete X by 50%\"\n- \"Increase conversion rate by 10%\"\n\n### 9. Open Questions\nRemaining questions or areas needing clarification.\n\n---\n\n## Writing for Junior Developers\n\nThe PRD reader may be a junior developer or AI agent. Therefore:\n\n- Be explicit and unambiguous\n- Avoid jargon or explain it\n- Provide enough detail to understand purpose and core logic\n- Number requirements for easy reference\n- Use concrete examples where helpful\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `tasks/`\n- **Filename:** `prd-[feature-name].md` (kebab-case)\n\n---\n\n## Example PRD\n\n```markdown\n# PRD: Task Priority System\n\n## Introduction\n\nAdd priority levels to tasks so users can focus on what matters most. Tasks can be marked as high, medium, or low priority, with visual indicators and filtering to help users manage their workload effectively.\n\n## Goals\n\n- Allow assigning priority (high/medium/low) to any task\n- Provide clear visual differentiation between priority levels\n- Enable filtering and sorting by priority\n- Default new tasks to medium priority\n\n## User Stories\n\n### US-001: Add priority field to database\n**Description:** As a developer, I need to store task priority so it persists across sessions.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Add priority column to tasks table: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'' (default ''medium'')\n- [ ] Generate and run migration successfully\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n\n### US-002: Display priority indicator on task cards\n**Description:** As a user, I want to see task priority at a glance so I know what needs attention first.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Each task card shows colored priority badge (red=high, yellow=medium, gray=low)\n- [ ] Priority visible without hovering or clicking\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-003: Add priority selector to task edit\n**Description:** As a user, I want to change a task''s priority when editing it.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Priority dropdown in task edit modal\n- [ ] Shows current priority as selected\n- [ ] Saves immediately on selection change\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-004: Filter tasks by priority\n**Description:** As a user, I want to filter the task list to see only high-priority items when I''m focused.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Filter dropdown with options: All | High | Medium | Low\n- [ ] Filter persists in URL params\n- [ ] Empty state message when no tasks match filter\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- FR-1: Add `priority` field to tasks table (''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'', default ''medium'')\n- FR-2: Display colored priority badge on each task card\n- FR-3: Include priority selector in task edit modal\n- FR-4: Add priority filter dropdown to task list header\n- FR-5: Sort by priority within each status column (high to medium to low)\n\n## Non-Goals\n\n- No priority-based notifications or reminders\n- No automatic priority assignment based on due date\n- No priority inheritance for subtasks\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n- Reuse existing badge component with color variants\n- Filter state managed via URL search params\n- Priority stored in database, not computed\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Users can change priority in under 2 clicks\n- High-priority tasks immediately visible at top of lists\n- No regression in task list performance\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Should priority affect task ordering within a column?\n- Should we add keyboard shortcuts for priority changes?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore saving the PRD:\n\n- [ ] Asked clarifying questions with lettered options\n- [ ] Incorporated user''s answers\n- [ ] User stories are small and specific\n- [ ] Functional requirements are numbered and unambiguous\n- [ ] Non-goals section defines clear boundaries\n- [ ] Saved to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:18:07.403Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured product requirement documentation generation.","zh":"适合需要生成结构化产品需求文档的开发代理。","ja":"構造化された製品要件文書を生成する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서 생성이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan generar documentación de requisitos de producto estructurada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin de générer une documentation de spécifications de produit structurée.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die strukturierte Produktanforderungsdokumentationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de geração de documentação de requisitos de produto estruturada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов развития, нуждающихся в создании структурированной документации требований к продукту.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق متطلبات المنتج المنظّم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate detailed Product Requirements Documents in Markdown format, utilizing feature descriptions and clarifying questions to create actionable implementation guides, saving them as .md files.","zh":"能够让代理生成详细的产品需求文档（PRD），以Markdown格式书写，利用功能描述和澄清问题创建可执行的实施指南，并将其保存为.md文件。","ja":"エージェントが詳細な製品要件文書（PRD）を生成できるようにし、Markdown形式で機能説明と明確化の質問を利用して実行可能な実装ガイドを作成し、それを.mdファイルとして保存します。","ko":"에이전트가 자세한 제품 요구 사항 문서(PRD)를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 기능 설명과 명확화 질문을 사용하여 실행 가능한 구현 가이드를 만들고, 이를 .md 파일로 저장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar documentos de requisitos de producto detallados en formato Markdown, utilizando descripciones de características y preguntas aclaratorias para crear guías de implementación accionables, guardándolos como archivos .md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents de spécifications de produit détaillés au format Markdown, en utilisant des descriptions de fonctionnalités et des questions de clarification pour créer des guides d''implémentation actionnables, les enregistrant sous forme de fichiers .md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, detaillierte Produktanforderungsdokumente im Markdown-Format zu erstellen, indem sie Funktionsbeschreibungen und Klarstellungsfragen verwenden, um handhabbare Implementierungsanleitungen zu erstellen und sie als .md-Dateien zu speichern.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados no formato Markdown, utilizando descrições de recursos e perguntas esclarecedoras para criar guias de implementação ação, salvando-os como arquivos .md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать подробные документы требований к продукту в формате Markdown, используя описания функций и уточняющие вопросы для создания действенных руководств по реализации, сохраняя их в виде файлов .md.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج المفصلة بتنسيق ماركداون، باستخدام وصفات الميزات والأسئلة التوضيحية لإنشاء دلائل تنفيذ قابلة للتنفيذ، وحفظها كملفات .md."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs for new feature implementations","Creating structured documentation for development teams","Automating requirement gathering with clarifying questions"],"zh":["为新功能实现生成PRD","为开发团队创建结构化文档","使用明确化问题自动收集需求"],"ja":["新機能の実装のためのPRDを生成する","開発チームのための構造化された文書を作成する","明確化の質問を使用して要件を自動収集する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 구현을 위한 PRD 생성","개발 팀을 위한 구조화된 문서 생성","명확화 질문을 사용하여 요구 사항 수집 자동화"],"es":["Generación de PRD para la implementación de nuevas características","Creación de documentación estructurada para equipos de desarrollo","Automatización de la recopilación de requisitos con preguntas aclaratorias"],"fr":["Génération de PRD pour la mise en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Création de documentation structurée pour les équipes de développement","Automatisation de la collecte de spécifications avec des questions de clarification"],"de":["Erstellung von PRD für die Implementierung neuer Funktionalitäten","Erstellung von strukturierter Dokumentation für Entwicklungsteams","Automatisierung der Anforderungssammlung mit Klarstellungsfragen"],"pt":["Geração de PRDs para implementações de novos recursos","Criação de documentação estruturada para equipes de desenvolvimento","Automação da coleta de requisitos com perguntas esclarecedoras"],"ru":["Генерация документов требований к продукту для реализации новых функций","Создание структурированной документации для команд разработки","Автоматизация сбора требований с помощью уточняющих вопросов"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج لتنفيذ ميزات جديدة","إنشاء توثيق منظم للفرق التطويرية","أتمتة جمع المتطلبات باستخدام الأسئلة التوضيحية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not support implementation, only PRD generation","Requires user input for feature descriptions and answers to clarifying questions","Saves files in a specific directory structure (tasks/prd-[feature-name].md)"],"zh":["不支持实现，只支持PRD生成","需要用户输入功能描述和明确化问题的答案","将文件保存在特定的目录结构中（tasks/prd-[功能名称].md）"],"ja":["実装はサポートされず、PRDの生成のみをサポートする","機能説明と明確化の質問の回答についてはユーザー入力を必要とする","ファイルを特定のディレクトリ構造（tasks/prd-[機能名].md）で保存する"],"ko":["구현을 지원하지 않으며, PRD 생성만을 지원합니다.","기능 설명 및 명확화 질문의 답변에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요합니다.","파일을 특정한 디렉토리 구조(tasks/prd-[기능 이름].md)에서 저장합니다."],"es":["No admite la implementación, solo la generación de PRD","Requiere la entrada del usuario para las descripciones de características y las respuestas a las preguntas aclaratorias","Guarda los archivos en una estructura de directorios específica (tareas/prd-[nombre-de-característica].md)"],"fr":["Ne prend pas en charge la mise en œuvre, mais seulement la génération de PRD","Requiert une entrée utilisateur pour les descriptions de fonctionnalités et les réponses aux questions de clarification","Enregistre les fichiers dans une structure de répertoires spécifique (tâches/prd-[nom-de-fonctionnalité].md)"],"de":["Unterstützt keine Implementierung, nur die Erstellung von PRD","Benötigt Benutzereingaben für Funktionsbeschreibungen und Antworten auf Klarstellungsfragen","Speichert Dateien in einer bestimmten Verzeichnisstruktur (Aufgaben/prd-[Funktionsname].md)"],"pt":["Não suporta implementação, apenas geração de PRD","Requer entrada do usuário para descrições de recursos e respostas a perguntas esclarecedoras","Salva arquivos em uma estrutura de diretório específica (tarefas/prd-[nome-do-recurso].md)"],"ru":["Не поддерживает реализацию, только генерацию документов требований к продукту","Требует ввода пользователя для описаний функций и ответов на уточняющие вопросы","Сохраняет файлы в конкретной структуре директории (tasks/prd-[имя-функции].md)"],"ar":["لا يدعم التنفيذ، بل إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج فقط","يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لوصف الميزات والإجابة على الأسئلة التوضيحية","يحفظ الملفات في هيكل دليلي معين (مهمات/prd-[اسم-الميزة].md)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
