on de composants","Développement d''applications web interactives avec C#"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Komponenten","Verwaltung von Lebenszyklusereignissen","Verwendung von Parametern und Kaskadewerten","Rendern von Komponenten","Entwicklung interaktiver Webanwendungen mit C#"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de componentes","Gerenciamento de eventos de ciclo de vida","Uso de parâmetros e valores em cascata","Renderização de componentes","Criação de aplicativos web interativos"],"ru":["Разработка компонентов","Управление событиями жизненного цикла","Использование параметров и каскадных значений","Рендеринг компонентов","Создание интерактивных веб-приложений"],"ar":["تطوير المكونات","إدارة أحداث دورة الحياة","استخدام المعلمات والقيم المتسلسلة","تحويل المكونات","إنشاء تطبيقات الويب التفاعلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Blazor","C#","交互式 Web UI","组件结构","生命周期方法","Blazor 框架","Web 开发","交互式 UI"],"ja":["Blazor","C#","インタラクティブ Web UI","コンポーネント構造","ライフサイクルメソッド","Blazor フレームワーク","Web 開発","インタラクティブ UI"],"ko":["Blazor","C#","상호작용 웹 UI","컴포넌트 구조","라이프사이클 메서드","Blazor 프레임워크","웹 개발","상호작용 UI"],"es":["Blazor","Desarrollo de aplicaciones web","C#","Interfaces de usuario web interactivas","Framework de Microsoft","Componentes personalizados","Gestión de eventos de ciclo de vida"],"fr":["Blazor","Développement d''applications web","C#","Interfaces utilisateur web interactives","Framework Microsoft","Composants personnalisés","Gestion des événements de cycle de vie"],"de":["Blazor","Entwicklung von Webanwendungen","C#","Interaktive Webbenutzeroberflächen","Microsoft-Framework","Benutzerdefinierte Komponenten","Verwaltung von Lebenszyklusereignissen"],"pt":["Blazor","Desenvolvimento web","C#","Interface de usuário","Aplicativos web interativos","Framework Microsoft","Componentes","Ciclo de vida","Parâmetros","Valores em cascata"],"ru":["Blazor","Веб-разработка","C#","Интерфейс пользователя","Интерактивные веб-приложения","Фреймворк Microsoft","Компоненты","Жизненный цикл","Параметры","Каскадные значения"],"ar":["بلزور","تطوير الويب","سي شارب","واجهة المستخدم","تطبيقات الويب التفاعلية","إطار عمل مايكروسوفت","المكونات","دورة الحياة","المعلمات","القيم المتسلسلة"]}},"owner":"vip32","repo":"TaskFlow","repoPath":"vip32/TaskFlow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"blazor-expert","description":"Comprehensive Blazor development expertise covering Blazor Server, WebAssembly, and Hybrid apps. Use when building Blazor components, implementing state management, handling routing, JavaScript interop, forms and validation, authentication, or optimizing Blazor applications. Includes best practices, architecture patterns, and troubleshooting guidance.","version":"2.0","bodyPreview":"# Blazor Expert - Orchestration Hub\n\nExpert-level guidance for developing applications with Blazor, Microsoft''s framework for building interactive web UIs using C# instead of JavaScript.\n\n## Quick Reference: When to Load Which Resource\n\n| Task | Load Resource | Key Topics |\n|------|---------------|-----------|\n| **Build components, handle lifecycle events** | [components-lifecycle.md](resources/components-lifecycle.md) | Component structure, lifecycle methods, parameters, cascading values, Rende","body":"# Blazor Expert - Orchestration Hub\n\nExpert-level guidance for developing applications with Blazor, Microsoft''s framework for building interactive web UIs using C# instead of JavaScript.\n\n## Quick Reference: When to Load Which Resource\n\n| Task | Load Resource | Key Topics |\n|------|---------------|-----------|\n| **Build components, handle lifecycle events** | [components-lifecycle.md](resources/components-lifecycle.md) | Component structure, lifecycle methods, parameters, cascading values, RenderFragment composition |\n| **Manage component state, handle events** | [state-management-events.md](resources/state-management-events.md) | Local state, EventCallback, data binding, cascading state, service-based state |\n| **Configure routes, navigate between pages** | [routing-navigation.md](resources/routing-navigation.md) | Route parameters, constraints, navigation, NavLink, query strings, layouts |\n| **Build forms, validate user input** | [forms-validation.md](resources/forms-validation.md) | EditForm, input components, DataAnnotations validation, custom validators |\n| **Setup authentication & authorization** | [authentication-authorization.md](resources/authentication-authorization.md) | Auth setup, AuthorizeView, Authorize attribute, policies, claims |\n| **Optimize performance, use JavaScript interop** | [performance-advanced.md](resources/performance-advanced.md) | Rendering optimization, virtualization, JS interop, lazy loading, WASM best practices |\n\n## Orchestration Protocol\n\n### Phase 1: Task Analysis\n\nIdentify your primary objective:\n- **UI Building** → Load components-lifecycle.md\n- **State Handling** → Load state-management-events.md\n- **Navigation** → Load routing-navigation.md\n- **Data Input** → Load forms-validation.md\n- **User Access** → Load authentication-authorization.md\n- **Speed/Efficiency** → Load performance-advanced.md\n\n### Phase 2: Resource Loading\n\nOpen the recommended resource file(s) and search for your specific need using Ctrl+F. Each resource is organized by topic with working code examples.\n\n### Phase 3: Implementation & Validation\n\n- Follow code patterns from the resource\n- Adapt to your specific requirements\n- Test in appropriate hosting model (Server/WASM/Hybrid)\n- Review troubleshooting section if issues arise\n\n## Blazor Hosting Models Overview\n\n### Blazor Server\n- **How**: Runs on server via SignalR\n- **Best For**: Line-of-business apps, need full .NET runtime, small download size\n- **Trade-offs**: High latency, requires connection, server resource intensive\n\n### Blazor WebAssembly\n- **How**: Runs in browser via WebAssembly\n- **Best For**: PWAs, offline apps, no server dependency, client-heavy applications\n- **Trade-offs**: Large initial download, limited .NET APIs, slower cold start\n\n### Blazor Hybrid\n- **How**: Runs in MAUI/WPF/WinForms with Blazor UI\n- **Best For**: Cross-platform desktop/mobile apps\n- **Trade-offs**: Platform-specific considerations, additional dependencies\n\n**Decision**: Choose based on deployment environment, offline requirements, and server constraints.\n\n## Common Implementation Workflows\n\n### Scenario 1: Build a Data-Entry Component\n\n1. Read [components-lifecycle.md](resources/components-lifecycle.md) - Component structure section\n2. Read [state-management-events.md](resources/state-management-events.md) - EventCallback pattern\n3. Read [forms-validation.md](resources/forms-validation.md) - EditForm component\n4. Combine: Create component with parameters → capture user input → validate → notify parent\n\n### Scenario 2: Implement User Authentication & Protected Pages\n\n1. Read [authentication-authorization.md](resources/authentication-authorization.md) - Setup section\n2. Read [routing-navigation.md](resources/routing-navigation.md) - Layouts section\n3. Read [authentication-authorization.md](resources/authentication-authorization.md) - AuthorizeView section\n4. Combine: Configure auth → create login page → protect routes → check auth in components\n\n### Scenario 3: Build Interactive List with Search/Filter\n\n1. Read [routing-navigation.md](resources/routing-navigation.md) - Query strings section\n2. Read [state-management-events.md](resources/state-management-events.md) - Data binding section\n3. Read [performance-advanced.md](resources/performance-advanced.md) - Virtualization section\n4. Combine: Capture search input → update URL query → fetch filtered data → virtualize if large\n\n### Scenario 4: Optimize Performance of Existing App\n\n1. Read [performance-advanced.md](resources/performance-advanced.md) - All sections\n2. Identify bottlenecks:\n   - Unnecessary renders? → ShouldRender override, @key directive\n   - Large lists? → Virtualization\n   - JS latency? → Module isolation pattern\n3. Apply targeted optimizations from resource\n\n## Key Blazor Concepts\n\n### Component Architecture\n- **Components**: Self-contained UI units with optional logic\n- **Parameters**: Inputs to components, enable reusability\n- **Cascading Values**: Share state with descendants without explicit parameters\n- **Events**: Child-to-parent communication via EventCallback\n- **Layouts**: Parent wrapper for consistent page structure\n\n### State Management\n- **Local State**: Component-specific fields and properties\n- **Cascading Values**: Share state to descendants\n- **Services**: Application-wide state via dependency injection\n- **Event Binding**: React to user interactions\n- **Data Binding**: Two-way synchronization with UI\n\n### Routing & Navigation\n- **@page Directive**: Make component routable\n- **Route Parameters**: Pass data via URL (`{id:int}`)\n- **Navigation**: Programmatic navigation via NavigationManager\n- **NavLink**: UI component that highlights active route\n- **Layouts**: Wrap pages with common structure\n\n### Forms & Validation\n- **EditForm**: Form component with validation support\n- **Input Components**: Typed controls (InputText, InputNumber, etc.)\n- **Validators**: DataAnnotations attributes or custom logic\n- **EventCallback**: Notify parent of form changes\n- **Messages**: Display validation errors to user\n\n### Authentication & Authorization\n- **Claims & Roles**: Identify users and define access levels\n- **Policies**: Fine-grained authorization rules\n- **Authorize Attribute**: Protect pages from unauthorized access\n- **AuthorizeView**: Conditional rendering based on permissions\n- **AuthenticationStateProvider**: Get current user information\n\n### Performance Optimization\n- **ShouldRender()**: Prevent unnecessary re-renders\n- **@key Directive**: Help diffing algorithm match list items\n- **Virtualization**: Render only visible items in large lists\n- **JS Interop**: Call JavaScript from C# and vice versa\n- **AOT/Trimming**: Reduce WASM download size (production)\n\n## Best Practices Highlights\n\n### Component Design\n✅ **Single Responsibility** - Each component has one clear purpose\n✅ **Composition** - Use RenderFragments for flexible layouts\n✅ **Parameter Clarity** - Use descriptive names, mark required with `[EditorRequired]`\n✅ **Proper Disposal** - Implement `IDisposable` to clean up resources\n✅ **Event-Based Communication** - Use `EventCallback` for child-to-parent updates\n\n### State Management\n✅ **EventCallback Over Action** - Proper async handling\n✅ **Immutable Updates** - Create new objects/collections, don''t mutate\n✅ **Service-Based State** - Use scoped services for shared state\n✅ **Unsubscribe from Events** - Prevent memory leaks in Dispose\n✅ **InvokeAsync for Background Threads** - Thread-safe state updates\n\n### Routing & Navigation\n✅ **Route Constraints** - Use `:int`, `:guid`, etc. to validate formats\n✅ **NavLink Component** - Automatic active state highlighting\n✅ **forceLoad After Logout** - Clear client-side state\n✅ **ReturnUrl Pattern** - Redirect back after login\n✅ **Query Strings** - Preserve filters/pagination across navigation\n\n### Forms & Validation\n✅ **EditForm + DataAnnotationsValidator** - Built-in validation\n✅ **ValidationMessage** - Show field-level errors\n✅ **Custom Validators** - Extend for complex rules\n✅ **Async Validation** - Check server availability before submit\n✅ **Loading State** - Disable submit button while processing\n\n### Authentication & Authorization\n✅ **Server Validation** - Never trust client-side checks alone\n✅ **Policies Over Roles** - More flexible authorization rules\n✅ **Claims for Details** - Store user attributes in claims\n✅ **Cascading AuthenticationState** - Available in all components\n✅ **Error Boundaries** - Graceful error handling\n\n### Performance\n✅ **@key on Lists** - Optimize item matching\n✅ **ShouldRender Override** - Prevent unnecessary renders\n✅ **Virtualization for Large Lists** - Only render visible items\n✅ **JS Module Isolation** - Load and cache JS modules efficiently\n✅ **AOT for WASM** - Production deployments\n\n## Common Troubleshooting\n\n### Component Not Re-rendering\n- **Cause**: Mutation instead of reassignment\n- **Fix**: Create new object/collection: `items = items.Append(item).ToList()`\n- **Or**: Call `StateHasChanged()` manually\n\n### Parameter Not Updating\n- **Cause**: Parent not re-rendering or same object reference\n- **Fix**: Parent must re-render, ensure new reference for objects\n- **Debug**: Check OnParametersSet is firing\n\n### JS Interop Errors\n- **Cause**: Called before script loaded or wrong function name\n- **Fix**: Use `firstRender` check, verify JS file path\n- **Pattern**: Use module isolation: `await JS.InvokeAsync(\"import\", \"./script.js\")`\n\n### Authentication State Not Available\n- **Cause**: Cascading parameter not provided or timing issue\n- **Fix**: Ensure AuthenticationStateProvider configured\n- **Pattern**: Always null-check and use `await AuthStateTask!` in code block\n\n### Large List Performance Issues\n- **Cause**: Rendering all items in DOM\n- **Fix**: Use Virtualize component for 1000+ items\n- **Alternative**: Paginate with buttons/infinite scroll\n\n### Blazor Server Connection Issues\n- **Cause**: SignalR connection dropped or configuration issue\n- **Fix**: Implement reconnection UI, increase timeout\n- **Config**: Adjust `CircuitOptions.DisconnectedCircuitRetentionPeriod`\n\n## Resource Files Summary\n\n### components-lifecycle.md\nComplete guide to component structure, lifecycle methods, parameters, cascading values, and composition patterns. Essential for understanding Blazor component fundamentals.\n\n### state-management-events.md\nComprehensive coverage of local and service-based state, event handling with EventCallback, data binding patterns, and component communication. Core for interactive UI building.\n\n### routing-navigation.md\nComplete routing reference including route parameters, constraints, programmatic navigation, query strings, and layout management. Essential for multi-page apps.\n\n### forms-validation.md\nFull forms API with EditForm component, input controls, DataAnnotations validation, custom validators, and form patterns. Required for data entry scenarios.\n\n### authentication-authorization.md\nComplete auth setup for Server and WASM, AuthorizeView, policies, claims-based access control, and login/logout patterns. Necessary for secured applications.\n\n### performance-advanced.md\nPerformance optimization techniques including ShouldRender, virtualization, JavaScript interop patterns, lazy loading, and WASM best practices. Vital for production apps.\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Approach\n\nWhen implementing Blazor features:\n\n1. **Identify Your Task** - Match against the decision table above\n2. **Load Relevant Resource** - Read the appropriate .md file\n3. **Find Code Example** - Search resource for similar implementation\n4. **Adapt to Your Context** - Modify for your specific requirements\n5. **Test Thoroughly** - Verify in your hosting model\n6. **Reference Troubleshooting** - Consult resource if issues arise\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- **New to Blazor?** Start with [components-lifecycle.md](resources/components-lifecycle.md)\n- **Building Data App?** Move through: components → state → forms → validation\n- **Scaling Existing App?** Focus on [performance-advanced.md](resources/performance-advanced.md)\n- **Adding Security?** Follow [authentication-authorization.md](resources/authentication-authorization.md)\n\n---\n\n**Version**: 2.0 - Modular Orchestration Pattern  \n**Last Updated**: December 4, 2025  \n**Status**: Production Ready ✅\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:18:11.435Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing expertise in building interactive web UIs with C# and Blazor.","zh":"非常适合需要使用C#和Blazor构建交互式Web UI的Web开发代理。","ja":"C#とBlazorを使用してインタラクティブなWeb UIを構築する必要があるWeb開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"C#와 Blazor를 사용하여 상호작용형 웹 UI를 구축하는 데 전문성을 필요로 하는 웹 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan experiencia en la creación de interfaces de usuario web interactivas con C# y Blazor.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web ayant besoin d''expertise dans la création d''interfaces utilisateur web interactives avec C# et Blazor.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die Expertenwissen im Aufbau interaktiver Web-Benutzeroberflächen mit C# und Blazor benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento web que precisam de especialização em construir interfaces de usuário interativas da web com C# e Blazor.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходима экспертиза в создании интерактивных веб-интерфейсов с помощью C# и Blazor.","ar":"مثالي لوجوهات تطوير الويب التي تحتاج إلى خبرة في بناء واجهات المستخدم التفاعلية على الويب باستخدام C# و Blazor."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop scalable and maintainable web applications using Blazor''s component structure, lifecycle methods, and parameters, while leveraging Microsoft''s framework for building interactive web UIs with C# instead of JavaScript, including handling lifecycle events and utilizing cascading values and rendering.","zh":"赋予代理开发可扩展和可维护的Web应用程序的能力，使用Blazor的组件结构、生命周期方法和参数，同时利用Microsoft的框架以C#代替JavaScript构建交互式Web UI，包括处理生命周期事件和利用级联值和渲染。","ja":"エージェントに、Blazorのコンポーネント構造、ライフサイクルメソッド、パラメーターを使用して、拡張可能で維持可能なWebアプリケーションを開発する能力を付与します。Microsoftのフレームワークを使用して、JavaScriptではなくC#でインタラクティブなWeb UIを構築します。ライフサイクルイベントの処理やカスケード値とレンダリングの利用も含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 Blazor의 컴포넌트 구조, 라이프사이클 메서드 및 매개 변수를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 유지 보수할 수 있는 웹 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다. Microsoft의 프레임워크를 사용하여 JavaScript 대신 C#로 상호작용형 웹 UI를 구축하며, 라이프사이클 이벤트 처리 및 캐스케이드 값 및 렌더링 사용도 포함됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones web escalables y mantenibles utilizando la estructura de componentes de Blazor, métodos de ciclo de vida y parámetros, aprovechando al mismo tiempo el marco de Microsoft para construir interfaces de usuario web interactivas con C# en lugar de JavaScript, incluyendo el manejo de eventos de ciclo de vida y la utilización de valores en cascada y renderizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications web évolutives et maintenables en utilisant la structure de composants Blazor, les méthodes de cycle de vie et les paramètres, tout en exploitant le framework Microsoft pour créer des interfaces utilisateur web interactives avec C# au lieu de JavaScript, y compris la gestion des événements de cycle de vie et l''utilisation de valeurs en cascade et de rendu.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare und wartbare Webanwendungen mithilfe der Komponentenstruktur von Blazor, Lebenszyklusmethoden und Parametern zu entwickeln, während sie gleichzeitig Microsofts Framework für den Aufbau interaktiver Web-Benutzeroberflächen mit C# anstelle von JavaScript nutzen, einschließlich der Verarbeitung von Lebenszyklusereignissen und der Nutzung von Cascade-Werten und Rendering.","pt":"Concede poderes aos agentes para desenvolver aplicações web escaláveis e mantenedoras utilizando a estrutura de componentes do Blazor, métodos de ciclo de vida e parâmetros, aproveitando o framework da Microsoft para construir interfaces de usuário interativas da web com C# em vez de JavaScript, incluindo tratamento de eventos de ciclo de vida e utilização de valores em cascata e renderização.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать масштабируемые и поддерживаемые веб-приложения, используя структуру компонентов Blazor, методы жизненного цикла и параметры, а также использует фреймворк Microsoft для создания интерактивных веб-интерфейсов с помощью C# вместо JavaScript, включая обработку событий жизненного цикла и использование каскадных значений и рендеринга.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تطوير تطبيقات الويب القابلة للتطوير والصيانة باستخدام هيكل مكونات بلазور وأساليب دورة الحياة والمعاملات، مع الاستفادة من إطار مايكروسوفت لبناء واجهات المستخدم التفاعلية على الويب باستخدام C# بدلاً من جافاسكريبت، بما في ذلك معالجة أحداث دورة الحياة وتحقيق القيم المتسلسلة والتحديث."},"useCases":{"en":["Building reusable UI components with Blazor","Handling lifecycle events and parameters in Blazor applications","Debugging and optimizing Blazor component rendering"],"zh":["使用Blazor构建可复用UI组件","在Blazor应用程序中处理生命周期事件和参数","调试和优化Blazor组件渲染"],"ja":["Blazorを使用して再利用可能なUIコンポーネントを構築する","Blazorアプリケーションでライフサイクルイベントとパラメーターを処理する","Blazorコンポーネントのレンダリングをデバッグして最適化する"],"ko":["Blazor를 사용하여 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 구축하는 것","Blazor 애플리케이션에서 라이프사이클 이벤트 및 매개 변수를 처리하는 것","Blazor 컴포넌트 렌더링을 디버깅하고 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Creación de componentes de UI reutilizables con Blazor","Manejo de eventos y parámetros de ciclo de vida en aplicaciones Blazor","Depuración y optimización del renderizado de componentes Blazor"],"fr":["Création de composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables avec Blazor","Gestion des événements et des paramètres de cycle de vie dans les applications Blazor","Débogage et optimisation du rendu de composants Blazor"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Blazor","Verarbeitung von Lebenszyklusereignissen und -parametern in Blazor-Anwendungen","Fehlerbehebung und Optimierung der Komponenten-Renderung in Blazor"],"pt":["Construir componentes de UI reutilizáveis com Blazor","Tratar eventos de ciclo de vida e parâmetros em aplicações Blazor","Depurar e otimizar renderização de componentes Blazor"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов UI с помощью Blazor","Обработка событий жизненного цикла и параметров в приложениях Blazor","Отладка и оптимизация рендеринга компонентов Blazor"],"ar":["بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع بلازور","معالجة أحداث دورة الحياة والمعاملات في تطبيقات بلازور","تصحيح الأخطاء وضبط أداء تحديث مكونات بلازور"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of C# and .NET ecosystem","Blazor-specific, not compatible with other web frameworks"],"zh":["需要C#和.NET生态系统的知识","特定于Blazor，不兼容其他Web框架"],"ja":["C#と.NETエコシステムの知識が必要","Blazor専用で、他のWebフレームワークと互換性がない"],"ko":["C# 및 .NET 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요","Blazor 전용으로, 다른 웹 프레임워크와 호환되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de C# y del ecosistema .NET","Específico de Blazor, no compatible con otros frameworks web"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en C# et dans l''écosystème .NET","Spécifique à Blazor, non compatible avec d''autres frameworks web"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in C# und im .NET-Ökosystem","Blazor-spezifisch, nicht kompatibel mit anderen Webframeworks"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de C# e ecossistema .NET","Específico do Blazor, não compatível com outros frameworks da web"],"ru":["Требует знания C# и экосистемы .NET","Спецефичен для Blazor, не совместим с другими веб-фреймворками"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة C# ونظام بيئي .NET","محدد لبلازور، غير متوافق مع إطارات العمل الويب الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
