erung von URL-Aktualisierungen","42 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für die Code-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado de consulta de URL seguro","Integração com Server Components","Configuração de parsers para parâmetros de URL","Otimização de atualizações de URL","Guia de melhores práticas para Next.js","42 regras em 8 categorias"],"ru":["Безопасное управление состоянием URL-запроса","Интеграция с Server Components","Настройка парсеров для параметров URL","Оптимизация обновлений URL","Руководство по лучшим практикам для Next.js","42 правила в 8 категориях"],"ar":["إدارة حالة استعلام URL بأمان","التكامل مع Server Components","تكوين المُحللين ل매개변ات URL","تحسين تحديثات URL","دليل أفضل الممارسات لـ Next.js","42 قاعدة في 8 فئات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["nuqs","Next.js","类型安全","URL 查询状态管理","代码生成","代码审查","服务器组件","URL 参数解析"],"ja":["nuqs","Next.js","タイプセーフ","URL クエリ状態管理","コード生成","コードレビュー","サーバーコンポーネント","URL パラメーターの解析"],"ko":["nuqs","Next.js","유형 안전","URL 쿼리 상태 관리","코드 생성","코드 리뷰","서버 컴포넌트","URL 파라미터 해석"],"es":["nuqs","Next.js","gestión de estado de URL","estado basado en URL","configuración de analizadores","integración con componentes del servidor","optimización de URL","mejores prácticas para nuqs"],"fr":["nuqs","Next.js","gestion d''état d''URL","état basé sur l''URL","configuration d''analyseurs","intégration avec les composants serveur","optimisation d''URL","meilleures pratiques pour nuqs"],"de":["nuqs","Next.js","URL-Zustandsverwaltung","URL-basierter Zustand","Konfiguration von Parsern","Integration mit Server-Komponenten","Optimierung von URL","Best Practices für nuqs"],"pt":["nuqs","Next.js","gerenciamento de estado de consulta de URL","segurança","Server Components","parsers","otimização de URL","melhores práticas"],"ru":["nuqs","Next.js","управление состоянием URL-запроса","безопасность","Server Components","парсеры","оптимизация URL","лучшие практики"],"ar":["nuqs","Next.js","إدارة حالة استعلام URL","أمان","Server Components","مُحللين","تحسين URL","أفضل الممارسات"]}},"owner":"not-ani","repo":"elevated-school-takehome","repoPath":"not-ani/elevated-school-takehome","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nuqs","description":"nuqs (type-safe URL query state) best practices for Next.js applications. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring code that uses nuqs for URL state management. Triggers on tasks involving useQueryState, useQueryStates, search params, URL state, query parameters, nuqs parsers, or Next.js routing with state.","bodyPreview":"# Community nuqs Best Practices for Next.js\n\nComprehensive guide for type-safe URL query state management with nuqs in Next.js applications. Contains 42 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide code generation, refactoring, and code review.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Implementing URL-based state with nuqs\n- Setting up nuqs in a Next.js project\n- Configuring parsers for URL parameters\n- Integrating URL state with Server Components\n- Optimizing URL updat","body":"# Community nuqs Best Practices for Next.js\n\nComprehensive guide for type-safe URL query state management with nuqs in Next.js applications. Contains 42 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide code generation, refactoring, and code review.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Implementing URL-based state with nuqs\n- Setting up nuqs in a Next.js project\n- Configuring parsers for URL parameters\n- Integrating URL state with Server Components\n- Optimizing URL update performance\n- Debugging nuqs-related issues\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Parser Configuration | CRITICAL | `parser-` |\n| 2 | Adapter & Setup | CRITICAL | `setup-` |\n| 3 | State Management | HIGH | `state-` |\n| 4 | Server Integration | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 5 | Performance Optimization | MEDIUM | `perf-` |\n| 6 | History & Navigation | MEDIUM | `history-` |\n| 7 | Debugging & Testing | LOW-MEDIUM | `debug-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Parser Configuration (CRITICAL)\n\n- [`parser-use-typed-parsers`](references/parser-use-typed-parsers.md) - Use typed parsers for non-string values\n- [`parser-with-default`](references/parser-with-default.md) - Use withDefault for non-nullable state\n- [`parser-enum-validation`](references/parser-enum-validation.md) - Use enum parsers for constrained values\n- [`parser-array-format`](references/parser-array-format.md) - Choose correct array parser format\n- [`parser-json-validation`](references/parser-json-validation.md) - Validate JSON parser input\n- [`parser-date-format`](references/parser-date-format.md) - Select appropriate date parser\n- [`parser-index-offset`](references/parser-index-offset.md) - Use parseAsIndex for 1-based URL display\n- [`parser-hex-colors`](references/parser-hex-colors.md) - Use parseAsHex for color values\n\n### 2. Adapter & Setup (CRITICAL)\n\n- [`setup-nuqs-adapter`](references/setup-nuqs-adapter.md) - Wrap app with NuqsAdapter\n- [`setup-use-client`](references/setup-use-client.md) - Add ''use client'' directive for hooks\n- [`setup-import-server`](references/setup-import-server.md) - Import server utilities from nuqs/server\n- [`setup-nextjs-version`](references/setup-nextjs-version.md) - Ensure compatible Next.js version\n- [`setup-shared-parsers`](references/setup-shared-parsers.md) - Define shared parsers in dedicated file\n\n### 3. State Management (HIGH)\n\n- [`state-use-query-states`](references/state-use-query-states.md) - Use useQueryStates for related parameters\n- [`state-functional-updates`](references/state-functional-updates.md) - Use functional updates for derived state\n- [`state-clear-with-null`](references/state-clear-with-null.md) - Clear URL parameters with null\n- [`state-controlled-inputs`](references/state-controlled-inputs.md) - Handle controlled input value properly\n- [`state-avoid-derived`](references/state-avoid-derived.md) - Avoid derived state from URL parameters\n- [`state-options-inheritance`](references/state-options-inheritance.md) - Use withOptions for parser-level configuration\n- [`state-setter-return`](references/state-setter-return.md) - Use setter return value for URL access\n\n### 4. Server Integration (HIGH)\n\n- [`server-search-params-cache`](references/server-search-params-cache.md) - Use createSearchParamsCache for Server Components\n- [`server-shallow-false`](references/server-shallow-false.md) - Use shallow:false to trigger server re-renders\n- [`server-use-transition`](references/server-use-transition.md) - Integrate useTransition for loading states\n- [`server-parse-before-get`](references/server-parse-before-get.md) - Call parse() before get() in Server Components\n- [`server-share-parsers`](references/server-share-parsers.md) - Share parsers between client and server\n- [`server-next15-async`](references/server-next15-async.md) - Handle async searchParams in Next.js 15+\n\n### 5. Performance Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- [`perf-throttle-updates`](references/perf-throttle-updates.md) - Throttle rapid URL updates\n- [`perf-clear-on-default`](references/perf-clear-on-default.md) - Use clearOnDefault for clean URLs\n- [`perf-avoid-rerender`](references/perf-avoid-rerender.md) - Memoize components using URL state\n- [`perf-serialize-utility`](references/perf-serialize-utility.md) - Use createSerializer for link URLs\n- [`perf-debounce-search`](references/perf-debounce-search.md) - Debounce search input before URL update\n\n### 6. History & Navigation (MEDIUM)\n\n- [`history-push-navigation`](references/history-push-navigation.md) - Use history:push for navigation-like state\n- [`history-replace-ephemeral`](references/history-replace-ephemeral.md) - Use history:replace for ephemeral state\n- [`history-scroll-behavior`](references/history-scroll-behavior.md) - Control scroll behavior on URL changes\n- [`history-back-sync`](references/history-back-sync.md) - Handle browser back/forward navigation\n\n### 7. Debugging & Testing (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- [`debug-enable-logging`](references/debug-enable-logging.md) - Enable debug logging for troubleshooting\n- [`debug-common-errors`](references/debug-common-errors.md) - Diagnose common nuqs errors\n- [`debug-testing`](references/debug-testing.md) - Test components with URL state\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- [`advanced-custom-parsers`](references/advanced-custom-parsers.md) - Create custom parsers for complex types\n- [`advanced-url-keys`](references/advanced-url-keys.md) - Use urlKeys for shorter URLs\n- [`advanced-eq-function`](references/advanced-eq-function.md) - Implement eq function for object parsers\n- [`advanced-framework-adapters`](references/advanced-framework-adapters.md) - Use framework-specific adapters\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual reference files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [Section definitions](references/_sections.md) - Category structure and impact levels\n- [Rule template](assets/templates/_template.md) - Template for adding new rules\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) | Complete compiled guide with all rules |\n| [references/_sections.md](references/_sections.md) | Category definitions and ordering |\n| [assets/templates/_template.md](assets/templates/_template.md) | Template for new rules |\n| [metadata.json](metadata.json) | Version and reference information |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:18:57.911Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Next.js Agents requiring type-safe URL query state management with nuqs","zh":"适用于需要使用nuqs进行类型安全的URL查询状态管理的Next.js代理","ja":"Next.jsエージェントがnuqsを使用したタイプセーフのURLクエリ状態管理を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"nuqs를 사용하여 안전한 URL 쿼리 상태 관리가 필요한 Next.js 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Next.js que requieren una gestión de estado de consulta de URL segura con nuqs","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Next.js nécessitant une gestion d''état de requête d''URL sécurisée avec nuqs","de":"Ideal für Next.js-Agents, die eine typesichere URL-Abfragezustandsverwaltung mit nuqs erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Next.js que requerem gerenciamento de estado de consulta de URL com tipo seguro com nuqs","ru":"Идеально для агентов Next.js, требующих безопасного по типу управления состоянием URL-запроса с nuqs","ar":"مثالي لعميل Next.js الذي يتطلب إدارة حالة استعلام URL آمنة من النوع مع nuqs"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage URL-based state with nuqs, providing comprehensive guidelines for code generation, refactoring, and code review, including configuring parsers for URL parameters and integrating URL state with Server Components using Next.js","zh":"赋予代理管理基于URL的状态的能力，使用nuqs提供代码生成、重构和代码审查的综合指南，包括为URL参数配置解析器以及使用Next.js将URL状态与服务器组件集成","ja":"nuqsを使用して、エージェントがURLベースの状態を管理できるようにすることで、コード生成、リファクタリング、コードレビューのための包括的なガイドラインを提供し、URLパラメータのパーサーを構成し、Next.jsを使用してURL状態をサーバーコンポーネントと統合します","ko":"nuqs를 사용하여 URL 기반 상태를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트를 활성화하여 코드 생성, 리팩토링, 코드 리뷰에 대한 포괄적인 지침을 제공하고 URL 매개 변수의 구문 분석기를 구성하며 Next.js를 사용하여 URL 상태를 서버 구성 요소와 통합합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado basado en URL con nuqs, proporcionando directrices completas para la generación de código, refactorización y revisión de código, incluyendo la configuración de analizador de parámetros de URL y la integración del estado de URL con componentes de servidor utilizando Next.js","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état basé sur l''URL avec nuqs, en fournissant des lignes directrices complètes pour la génération de code, la refactorisation et la révision de code, y compris la configuration d''analyseurs de paramètres d''URL et l''intégration de l''état d''URL avec des composants de serveur à l''aide de Next.js","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den URL-basierten Zustand mit nuqs zu verwalten und bietet umfassende Richtlinien für die Codegenerierung, Refactoring und Codeüberprüfung, einschließlich der Konfiguration von Parsern für URL-Parameter und der Integration des URL-Zustands mit Serverkomponenten unter Verwendung von Next.js","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o estado baseado em URL com nuqs, fornecendo diretrizes abrangentes para geração de código, refatoração e revisão de código, incluindo a configuração de analisadores para parâmetros de URL e a integração do estado de URL com Componentes de Servidor usando Next.js","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять состоянием на основе URL с помощью nuqs, предоставляя всесторонние рекомендации по генерации кода, рефакторингу и проверке кода, включая настройку парсеров для параметров URL и интеграцию состояния URL с серверными компонентами с использованием Next.js","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إدارة حالة المستندة إلى URL مع nuqs، وتوفر إرشادات شاملة لإنشاء التعليمات البرمجية وإعادة هيكلتها ومراجعة التعليمات البرمجية، بما في ذلك تكوين المفسрин ل매개 변수 URL وتكامل حالة URL مع مكونات الخادم باستخدام Next.js"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing URL-based state with nuqs in Next.js applications","Configuring parsers for URL parameters to optimize URL updates","Integrating URL state with Server Components for enhanced performance"],"zh":["在Next.js应用程序中使用nuqs实现基于URL的状态管理","配置URL参数的解析器以优化URL更新","将URL状态与服务器组件集成以提高性能"],"ja":["Next.jsアプリケーションでnuqsを使用してURLベースの状態管理を実装する","URLパラメータのパーサーを構成してURLの更新を最適化する","サーバーコンポーネントと統合してURL状態を使用し、パフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["Next.js 애플리케이션에서 nuqs를 사용하여 URL 기반 상태 관리를 구현하는 것","URL 매개 변수의 구문 분석기를 구성하여 URL 업데이트를 최적화하는 것","서버 구성 요소와 통합하여 URL 상태를 사용하고 성능을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Implementación de estado basado en URL con nuqs en aplicaciones Next.js","Configuración de analizador de parámetros de URL para optimizar las actualizaciones de URL","Integración del estado de URL con componentes de servidor para un rendimiento mejorado"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''un état basé sur l''URL avec nuqs dans les applications Next.js","Configuration d''analyseurs de paramètres d''URL pour optimiser les mises à jour d''URL","Intégration de l''état d''URL avec des composants de serveur pour améliorer les performances"],"de":["Implementierung von URL-basiertem Zustand mit nuqs in Next.js-Anwendungen","Konfiguration von Parsern für URL-Parameter zur Optimierung von URL-Aktualisierungen","Integration des URL-Zustands mit Serverkomponenten für verbesserte Leistung"],"pt":["Implementar estado baseado em URL com nuqs em aplicações Next.js","Configurar analisadores para parâmetros de URL para otimizar atualizações de URL","Integrar estado de URL com Componentes de Servidor para desempenho aprimorado"],"ru":["Реализация состояния на основе URL с nuqs в приложениях Next.js","Настройка парсеров для параметров URL для оптимизации обновлений URL","Интеграция состояния URL с серверными компонентами для повышения производительности"],"ar":["تنفيذ حالة المستندة إلى URL مع nuqs في تطبيقات Next.js","تكوين المفسрин ل매개 변수 URL لتحسين تحديثات URL","دمج حالة URL مع مكونات الخادم لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js project setup","Specific to nuqs library","Limited to URL query state management"],"zh":["需要Next.js项目设置","特定于nuqs库","仅限于URL查询状态管理"],"ja":["Next.jsプロジェクトの設定が必要","nuqsライブラリに特有","URLクエリ状態管理のみ"],"ko":["Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요함","nuqs 라이브러리에 특정됨","URL 쿼리 상태 관리에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto Next.js","Específico de la biblioteca nuqs","Limitado a la gestión de estado de consulta de URL"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Next.js","Spécifique à la bibliothèque nuqs","Limité à la gestion d''état de requête d''URL"],"de":["Benötigt Next.js-Projektsetup","Spezifisch für die nuqs-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung des URL-Abfragezustands"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto Next.js","Específico para a biblioteca nuqs","Limitado ao gerenciamento de estado de consulta de URL"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Next.js","Конкретно для библиотеки nuqs","Ограничен управлением состоянием URL-запроса"