dung von JUnit 5 und Mockito für Einheitstests","Refaktorisierung mit grünen Tests","Implementierung von Datenzugriffslogik und Sicherheitsregeln"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações Spring Boot com TDD","Testes unitários e de integração com JUnit 5 e Mockito","Cobertura de 80%+ com JaCoCo","Refatoração de código com testes verdes","Implementação de lógica de acesso a dados e regras de segurança"],"ru":["Разработка приложений Spring Boot с использованием TDD","Модульные и интеграционные тесты с JUnit 5 и Mockito","Покрытие 80%+ с JaCoCo","Рефакторинг кода с зелеными тестами","Реализация логики доступа к данным и правил безопасности"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات سبرينج بوت باستخدام تي دي دي","الاختبارات الوحدوية والدمج مع جيونيت 5 وموكيتو","التغطية 80%+ مع جاكوكو","إعادة هيكلة الشفرة مع الاختبارات الخضراء","تنفيذ منطق الوصول إلى البيانات وقواعد الأمان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spring Boot TDD","测试驱动开发","高覆盖率测试","JUnit 5","Mockito","JaCoCo","代码质量","单元测试","集成测试"],"ja":["Spring Boot TDD","テスト駆動開発","高カバレッジテスト","JUnit 5","Mockito","JaCoCo","コード品質","ユニットテスト","統合テスト"],"ko":["스프링 부트 TDD","테스트 驱动 개발","높은 커버리지 테스트","JUnit 5","Mockito","JaCoCo","코드 품질","유닛 테스트","통합 테스트"],"es":["Spring Boot","TDD","Desarrollo de software","Pruebas unitarias","Pruebas de integración","JUnit 5","Mockito","Cobertura de código"],"fr":["Spring Boot","TDD","Développement de logiciels","Tests unitaires","Tests d''intégration","JUnit 5","Mockito","Couverture de code"],"de":["Spring Boot","TDD","Softwareentwicklung","Einheitstests","IntegrationsTests","JUnit 5","Mockito","Codeabdeckung"],"pt":["Spring Boot TDD","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Testes unitários","Testes de integração","Cobertura de código","JaCoCo","JUnit 5","Mockito"],"ru":["Spring Boot TDD","Разработка приложений","Модульные тесты","Интеграционные тесты","Покрытие кода","JaCoCo","JUnit 5","Mockito"],"ar":["سبرينج بوت تي دي دي","تطوير التطبيقات","الاختبارات الوحدوية","الاختبارات الدمج","التغطية الشفرة","جاكوكو","جيونيت 5","موكيتو"]}},"owner":"vonomarap","repo":"kanokna","repoPath":"vonomarap/kanokna","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"springboot-tdd","description":"Test-driven development for Spring Boot using JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, and JaCoCo. Use when adding features, fixing bugs, or refactoring.","bodyPreview":"# Spring Boot TDD Workflow\n\nTDD guidance for Spring Boot services with 80%+ coverage (unit + integration).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New features or endpoints\n- Bug fixes or refactors\n- Adding data access logic or security rules\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Write tests first (they should fail)\n2) Implement minimal code to pass\n3) Refactor with tests green\n4) Enforce coverage (JaCoCo)\n\n## Unit Tests (JUnit 5 + Mockito)\n\n```java\n@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)\nclass MarketServiceTest {\n  @Mock MarketRepository r","body":"# Spring Boot TDD Workflow\n\nTDD guidance for Spring Boot services with 80%+ coverage (unit + integration).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New features or endpoints\n- Bug fixes or refactors\n- Adding data access logic or security rules\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Write tests first (they should fail)\n2) Implement minimal code to pass\n3) Refactor with tests green\n4) Enforce coverage (JaCoCo)\n\n## Unit Tests (JUnit 5 + Mockito)\n\n```java\n@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)\nclass MarketServiceTest {\n  @Mock MarketRepository repo;\n  @InjectMocks MarketService service;\n\n  @Test\n  void createsMarket() {\n    CreateMarketRequest req = new CreateMarketRequest(\"name\", \"desc\", Instant.now(), List.of(\"cat\"));\n    when(repo.save(any())).thenAnswer(inv -> inv.getArgument(0));\n\n    Market result = service.create(req);\n\n    assertThat(result.name()).isEqualTo(\"name\");\n    verify(repo).save(any());\n  }\n}\n```\n\nPatterns:\n- Arrange-Act-Assert\n- Avoid partial mocks; prefer explicit stubbing\n- Use `@ParameterizedTest` for variants\n\n## Web Layer Tests (MockMvc)\n\n```java\n@WebMvcTest(MarketController.class)\nclass MarketControllerTest {\n  @Autowired MockMvc mockMvc;\n  @MockBean MarketService marketService;\n\n  @Test\n  void returnsMarkets() throws Exception {\n    when(marketService.list(any())).thenReturn(Page.empty());\n\n    mockMvc.perform(get(\"/api/markets\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isOk())\n        .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.content\").isArray());\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Tests (SpringBootTest)\n\n```java\n@SpringBootTest\n@AutoConfigureMockMvc\n@ActiveProfiles(\"test\")\nclass MarketIntegrationTest {\n  @Autowired MockMvc mockMvc;\n\n  @Test\n  void createsMarket() throws Exception {\n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/api/markets\")\n        .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)\n        .content(\"\"\"\n          {\"name\":\"Test\",\"description\":\"Desc\",\"endDate\":\"2030-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"categories\":[\"general\"]}\n        \"\"\"))\n      .andExpect(status().isCreated());\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Persistence Tests (DataJpaTest)\n\n```java\n@DataJpaTest\n@AutoConfigureTestDatabase(replace = AutoConfigureTestDatabase.Replace.NONE)\n@Import(TestContainersConfig.class)\nclass MarketRepositoryTest {\n  @Autowired MarketRepository repo;\n\n  @Test\n  void savesAndFinds() {\n    MarketEntity entity = new MarketEntity();\n    entity.setName(\"Test\");\n    repo.save(entity);\n\n    Optional<MarketEntity> found = repo.findByName(\"Test\");\n    assertThat(found).isPresent();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Testcontainers\n\n- Use reusable containers for Postgres/Redis to mirror production\n- Wire via `@DynamicPropertySource` to inject JDBC URLs into Spring context\n\n## Coverage (JaCoCo)\n\nMaven snippet:\n```xml\n<plugin>\n  <groupId>org.jacoco</groupId>\n  <artifactId>jacoco-maven-plugin</artifactId>\n  <version>0.8.14</version>\n  <executions>\n    <execution>\n      <goals><goal>prepare-agent</goal></goals>\n    </execution>\n    <execution>\n      <id>report</id>\n      <phase>verify</phase>\n      <goals><goal>report</goal></goals>\n    </execution>\n  </executions>\n</plugin>\n```\n\n## Assertions\n\n- Prefer AssertJ (`assertThat`) for readability\n- For JSON responses, use `jsonPath`\n- For exceptions: `assertThatThrownBy(...)`\n\n## Test Data Builders\n\n```java\nclass MarketBuilder {\n  private String name = \"Test\";\n  MarketBuilder withName(String name) { this.name = name; return this; }\n  Market build() { return new Market(null, name, MarketStatus.ACTIVE); }\n}\n```\n\n## CI Commands\n\n- Maven: `mvn -T 4 test` or `mvn verify`\n- Gradle: `./gradlew test jacocoTestReport`\n\n**Remember**:\n- Keep tests fast, isolated, and deterministic. Test behavior, not implementation details.\n- Implement tests for each FUNCTION_CONTRACT test case (TC-...).\n- If a test case references undefined error codes or missing contract details, stop and raise BlueprintIssueReport.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:18:47.674Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Java-based Agents needing robust test-driven development for Spring Boot applications.","zh":"非常适合需要为 Spring Boot 应用程序提供强大的测试驱动开发的基于 Java 的代理。","ja":"Java ベースのエージェントが Spring Boot アプリケーションに堅牢なテスト駆動開発を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"스프링 부트 애플리케이션에 대한 강력한 테스트 주도 개발이 필요한 자바 기반 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en Java que necesitan un desarrollo dirigido por pruebas robusto para aplicaciones Spring Boot.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur Java nécessitant un développement piloté par des tests robustes pour les applications Spring Boot.","de":"Perfekt für Java-basierte Agenten, die ein robustes testgetriebenes Entwicklung für Spring-Boot-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes baseados em Java que necessitam de desenvolvimento orientado a testes robusto para aplicações Spring Boot.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов на основе Java, которым требуется надежное тестирование, управляемое разработкой, для приложений Spring Boot.","ar":"مثالي لعميل جافا الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير قوي للاختبار الموجه للطريقة للبرامج التي تعمل على سبرينج بوت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure 80%+ test coverage using JUnit 5 and Mockito, enforcing reliable unit and integration testing for Spring Boot services, including data access logic and security rules via JaCoCo.","zh":"赋予代理确保使用 JUnit 5 和 Mockito 的 80%+ 测试覆盖率，强制执行可靠的单元和集成测试，用于 Spring Boot 服务，包括通过 JaCoCo 的数据访问逻辑和安全规则。","ja":"JUnit 5 と Mockito を使用して 80% を超えるテストカバレッジを確保することで、エージェントにスプリングブートサービス、JaCoCo 経由でのデータアクセスロジックとセキュリティルールを含む、信頼性の高いユニットおよび統合テストの実施を可能にします。","ko":"JUnit 5와 Mockito를 사용하여 80% 이상의 테스트 커버리지를 보장하여 에이전트가 스프링 부트 서비스의 신뢰할 수 있는 유닛 및 통합 테스트를 강제로 실행할 수 있도록 하며, JaCoCo를 통해 데이터 액세스 논리 및 보안 규칙을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para garantizar una cobertura de pruebas del 80%+ utilizando JUnit 5 y Mockito, aplicando pruebas de unidad y de integración confiables para los servicios de Spring Boot, incluyendo la lógica de acceso a datos y las reglas de seguridad a través de JaCoCo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir une couverture de tests de 80%+ en utilisant JUnit 5 et Mockito, imposant des tests d''unité et d''intégration fiables pour les services Spring Boot, y compris la logique d''accès aux données et les règles de sécurité via JaCoCo.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine Testabdeckung von 80%+ sicherzustellen, indem JUnit 5 und Mockito verwendet werden, wodurch zuverlässige Unit- und Integrationstests für Spring-Boot-Dienste durchgesetzt werden, einschließlich der Datenzugriffslogik und der Sicherheitsregeln über JaCoCo.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir uma cobertura de teste de 80% ou mais usando JUnit 5 e Mockito, aplicando testes de unidade e integração confiáveis para serviços Spring Boot, incluindo lógica de acesso a dados e regras de segurança via JaCoCo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить тестовую покрытие 80% и выше с помощью JUnit 5 и Mockito, обеспечивая надежное модульное и интеграционное тестирование для сервисов Spring Boot, включая логику доступа к данным и правила безопасности через JaCoCo.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من ضمان تغطية اختبار بنسبة 80% أو أكثر باستخدام JUnit 5 و Mockito، وتطبيق اختبارات وحداتية وتكاملية موثوقة لخدمات سبرينج بوت، بما في ذلك منطق الوصول إلى البيانات وقواعد الأمان عبر JaCoCo."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing test-driven development for new Spring Boot features","Debugging and refactoring existing services with high test coverage","Enforcing security rules and data access logic through comprehensive testing"],"zh":["为新的 Spring Boot 功能实现测试驱动开发","使用高测试覆盖率调试和重构现有的服务","通过全面测试强制执行安全规则和数据访问逻辑"],"ja":["新しいスプリングブート機能のテスト駆動開発の実装","高いテストカバレッジを持つ既存のサービスをデバッグしてリファクタリングする","包括的なテストを通じてセキュリティルールとデータアクセスロジックを強制する"],"ko":["新的 스프링 부트 기능의 테스트 주도 개발 구현","높은 테스트 커버리지를 갖는 기존 서비스의 디버깅 및 리팩토링","전체적인 테스트를 통해 보안 규칙 및 데이터 액세스 논리를 강제 적용"],"es":["Implementar el desarrollo dirigido por pruebas para nuevas características de Spring Boot","Depurar y refactorizar servicios existentes con una alta cobertura de pruebas","Aplicar reglas de seguridad y lógica de acceso a datos a través de pruebas exhaustivas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le développement piloté par des tests pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités de Spring Boot","Déboguer et refactoriser les services existants avec une couverture de tests élevée","Imposer des règles de sécurité et une logique d''accès aux données via des tests exhaustifs"],"de":["Implementierung des testgetriebenen Entwicklungs für neue Spring-Boot-Features","Fehlerbehebung und Refactoring bestehender Dienste mit hoher Testabdeckung","Durchsetzung von Sicherheitsregeln und Datenzugriffslogik durch umfassende Tests"],"pt":["Implementar desenvolvimento orientado a testes para novos recursos do Spring Boot","Depurar e reestruturar serviços existentes com alta cobertura de teste","Aplicar regras de segurança e lógica de acesso a dados por meio de testes abrangentes"],"ru":["Реализация тестирования, управляемого разработкой, для новых функций Spring Boot","Отладка и рефакторинг существующих сервисов с высокой тестовой покрытией","Внедрение правил безопасности и логики доступа к данным посредством комплексного тестирования"],"ar":["تنفيذ تطوير موجه للاختبار لسمات سبرينج بوت الجديدة","تصحيح الأخطاء وإعادة هيكلة الخدمات الحالية التي تملك تغطية اختبار عالية","تطبيق قواعد الأمان ومنطق الوصول إلى البيانات من خلال اختبارات شاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Java environment","Specific to Spring Boot applications","Dependent on JUnit 5 and Mockito libraries"],"zh":["需要 Java 环境","仅限于 Spring Boot 应用程序","依赖于 JUnit 5 和 Mockito 库"],"ja":["Java 環境が必要","スプリングブートアプリケーションに限定される","JUnit 5 と Mockito ライブラリに依存する"],"ko":["자바 환경이 필요","스프링 부트 애플리케이션에만 해당","JUnit 5 및 Mockito 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Java","Específico para aplicaciones Spring Boot","Dependiente de las bibliotecas JUnit 5 y Mockito"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Java","Spécifique aux applications Spring Boot","Dépendant des bibliothèques JUnit 5 et Mockito"],"de":["Benötigt eine Java-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Spring-Boot-Anwendungen","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken JUnit 5 und Mockito"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Java","Específico para aplicações Spring Boot","Dependente das bibliotecas JUnit 5 e Mockito"],"ru":["Требует среды Java","Специфичен для приложений Spring Boot","Зависит от библиотек JUnit 5 и Mockito"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة جافا","محدد للتطبيقات التي تعمل على سبرينج بوت","يعتمد على مكتبات JUnit 5 و Mockito"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('thesampaton/durable-streams-reference/m05-type-driven', 'community', 'thesampaton', 'durable-streams-reference', 'thesampaton/durable-streams-reference', 'm05-type-driven', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z', '2026-02-18T09:19:28.908Z', NULL, '{"id":"thesampaton/durable-streams-reference/m05-type-driven","name":"m05-type-driven","description":{"zh":"m05-type-driven 是 Rust 中的 Durable Streams 协议参考实现，采用 axum 和 tokio 构建，支持流式读取和生产者冗余等特性","ja":"m05-type-driven は Rust で実装された Durable Streams プロトコルのリファレンス実装で、axum と tokio を使用して構築されています。ストリーミング読み取りやプロデューサー冗長性などの特徴をサポート","ko":"m05-type-driven은 러스트에서 구현한 듀러블 스트림 프로토콜의 참조 구현입니다. axum과 tokio를 사용하여 구축되었으며 스트리밍 읽기와 생산자 중복성 등을 지원합니다","es":"m05-type-driven es una implementación de referencia del protocolo Durable Streams en Rust, que utiliza axum y tokio para prevenir estados inválidos","fr":"m05-type-driven est une mise en œuvre de référence du protocole Durable Streams en Rust, qui utilise axum et tokio pour prévenir les états invalides","de":"m05-type-driven ist eine Referenzimplementierung des Durable Streams-Protokolls in Rust, die axum und tokio verwendet, um ungültige Zustände zu vermeiden","en":"  Reference implementation of the Durable Streams protocol in Rust, built with axum and tokio. Supports streaming reads (long-poll, SSE), producer idempotency, JSON batch mode, TTL "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"m05-type-driven：Rust 中的 Durable Streams 协议实现","ja":"m05-type-driven：Rust で実装された Durable Streams プロトコル","ko":"m05-type-driven: 러스트에서 구현한 듀러블 스트림 프로토콜","es":"Diseño Dirigido por Tipos con m05-type-driven","fr":"Conception Dirigée par les Types avec m05-type-driven","de":"Typgetriebenes Design mit m05-type-driven","en":"m05-type-driven"},"description":{"zh":"m05-type-driven 是 Rust 中的 Durable Streams 协议参考实现，采用 axum 和 tokio 构建，支持流式读取和生产者冗余等特性","ja":"m05-type-driven は Rust で実装された Durable Streams プロトコルのリファレンス実装で、axum と tokio を使用して構築されています。ストリーミング読み取りやプロデューサー冗長性などの特徴をサポート","ko":"m05-type-driven은 러스트에서 구현한 듀러블 스트림 프로토콜의 참조 구현입니다. axum과 tokio를 사용하여 구축되었으며 스트리밍 읽기와 생산자 중복성 등을 지원합니다","es":"m05-type-driven es una implementación de referencia del protocolo Durable Streams en Rust, que utiliza axum y tokio para prevenir estados inválidos","fr":"m05-type-driven est une mise en œuvre de référence du protocole Durable Streams en Rust, qui utilise axum et tokio pour prévenir les états invalides","de":"m05-type-driven ist eine Referenzimplementierung des Durable Streams-Protokolls in Rust, die axum und tokio verwendet, um ungültige Zustände zu vermeiden","en":"  Reference implementation of the Durable Streams protocol in Rust, built with axum and tokio. Supports streaming reads (long-poll, SSE), producer idempotenc..."},"definition":{"en":"  Reference implementation of the Durable Streams protocol in Rust, built with axum and tokio. Supports streaming reads (long-poll, SSE), producer idempotency, JSON batch mode, TTL "},"features":{"zh":["流式读取（长轮询、SSE）","生产者冗余","JSON 批处理","TTL 支持","采用 axum 和 tokio 构建"],"ja":["ストリーミング読み取り（長いポーリング、SSE）","プロデューサー冗長性","JSON バッチモード","TTL サポート","axum と tokio を使用して構築"],"ko":["스트리밍 읽기（긴 폴링, SSE）","생산자 중복성","JSON 배치 모드","TTL 지원","axum과 tokio를 사용하여 구축"],"es":["Implementación de Durable Streams en Rust","Soporte para lecturas de streaming (long-poll, SSE)","Idempotencia del productor","Modo de lote JSON","TTL (Tiempo de Vida)"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de Durable Streams en Rust","Prise en charge des lectures de streaming (long-poll, SSE)","Idempotence du producteur","Mode de lot JSON","TTL (Durée de Vie)"],"de":["Implementierung von Durable Streams in Rust","Unterstützung für Streaming-Lesevorgänge (long-poll, SSE)","Idempotenz des Produzenten","JSON-Batch-Modus","TTL (Lebensdauer)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust","Durable Streams","axum","tokio","流式读取","生产者冗余","JSON 批处理","TTL"],"ja":["Rust","Durable Streams","axum","tokio","ストリーミング読み取り","プロデューサー冗長性","JSON バッチモード","TTL"],"ko":["러스트","듀러블 스트림","axum","tokio","스트리밍 읽기","생산자 중복성","JSON 배치 모드","TTL"],"es":["diseño dirigido por tipos","sistema de tipos","Rust","Durable Streams","axum","tokio","seguridad","previsibilidad"],"fr":["conception dirigée par les types","système de types","Rust","Durable Streams","axum","tokio","sécurité","prévisibilité"],"de":["typgetriebenes Design","Typsystem","Rust","Durable Streams","axum","tokio","Sicherheit","Vorhersehbarkeit"]}},"owner":"thesampaton","repo":"durable-streams-reference","repoPath":"thesampaton/durable-streams-reference","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m05-type-driven","description":"CRITICAL: Use for type-driven design. Triggers: type state, PhantomData, newtype, marker trait, builder pattern, make invalid states unrepresentable, compile-time validation, sealed trait, ZST, 类型状态, 新类型模式, 类型驱动设计","bodyPreview":"# Type-Driven Design\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**How can the type system prevent invalid states?**\n\nBefore reaching for runtime checks:\n- Can the compiler catch this error?\n- Can invalid states be unrepresentable?\n- Can the type encode the invariant?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Pattern | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|---------|----------------|-------------|\n| Primitive obsession | \"It''s just a string\" | What does this value represent? |\n| Boolean flags | \"A","body":"# Type-Driven Design\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**How can the type system prevent invalid states?**\n\nBefore reaching for runtime checks:\n- Can the compiler catch this error?\n- Can invalid states be unrepresentable?\n- Can the type encode the invariant?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Pattern | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|---------|----------------|-------------|\n| Primitive obsession | \"It''s just a string\" | What does this value represent? |\n| Boolean flags | \"Add an is_valid flag\" | Can states be types? |\n| Optional everywhere | \"Check for None\" | Is absence really possible? |\n| Validation at runtime | \"Return Err if invalid\" | Can we validate at construction? |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore adding runtime validation:\n\n1. **Can the type encode the constraint?**\n   - Numeric range → bounded types or newtypes\n   - Valid states → type state pattern\n   - Semantic meaning → newtype\n\n2. **When is validation possible?**\n   - At construction → validated newtype\n   - At state transition → type state\n   - Only at runtime → Result with clear error\n\n3. **Who needs to know the invariant?**\n   - Compiler → type-level encoding\n   - API users → clear type signatures\n   - Runtime only → documentation\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nWhen type design is unclear:\n\n```\n\"Need to validate email format\"\n    ↑ Ask: Is this a domain value object?\n    ↑ Check: m09-domain (Email as Value Object)\n    ↑ Check: domain-web (validation requirements)\n```\n\n| Situation | Trace To | Question |\n|-----------|----------|----------|\n| What types to create | m09-domain | What''s the domain model? |\n| State machine design | m09-domain | What are valid transitions? |\n| Marker trait usage | m04-zero-cost | Static or dynamic dispatch? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nFrom design to implementation:\n\n```\n\"Need type-safe wrapper for primitives\"\n    ↓ Newtype: struct UserId(u64);\n\n\"Need compile-time state validation\"\n    ↓ Type State: Connection<Connected>\n\n\"Need to track phantom type parameters\"\n    ↓ PhantomData: PhantomData<T>\n\n\"Need capability markers\"\n    ↓ Marker Trait: trait Validated {}\n\n\"Need gradual construction\"\n    ↓ Builder: Builder::new().field(x).build()\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Purpose | Example |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| Newtype | Type safety | `struct UserId(u64);` |\n| Type State | State machine | `Connection<Connected>` |\n| PhantomData | Use unused type params / variance | `PhantomData<State>`, `PhantomData<&''a T>` |\n| Marker Trait | Capability flag | `trait Validated {}` |\n| Builder | Gradual construction | `Builder::new().name(\"x\").build()` |\n| Sealed Trait | Prevent external impl | `mod private { pub trait Sealed {} }` |\n\n## Pattern Examples\n\n### Newtype\n\n```rust\nstruct Email(String);  // Not just any string\n\nimpl Email {\n    pub fn new(s: &str) -> Result<Self, ValidationError> {\n        // Validate once, trust forever\n        validate_email(s)?;\n        Ok(Self(s.to_string()))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Type State\n\n```rust\nstruct Connection<State>(TcpStream, PhantomData<State>);\n\nstruct Disconnected;\nstruct Connected;\nstruct Authenticated;\n\nimpl Connection<Disconnected> {\n    fn connect(self) -> Connection<Connected> { ... }\n}\n\nimpl Connection<Connected> {\n    fn authenticate(self) -> Connection<Authenticated> { ... }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Decision Guide\n\n| Need | Pattern |\n|------|---------|\n| Type safety for primitives | Newtype |\n| Compile-time state validation | Type State |\n| Lifetime/variance markers | PhantomData |\n| Capability flags | Marker Trait |\n| Gradual construction | Builder |\n| Closed set of impls | Sealed Trait |\n| Zero-sized type marker | ZST struct |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why Bad | Better |\n|--------------|---------|--------|\n| Boolean flags for states | Runtime errors | Type state |\n| String for semantic types | No type safety | Newtype |\n| Option for \"not yet initialized\" fields | Unclear invariant | Builder (Option is fine for genuinely optional data) |\n| Public fields with invariants | Invariant violation | Private + validated new() |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Domain modeling | m09-domain |\n| Trait design | m04-zero-cost |\n| Error handling in constructors | m06-error-handling |\n| Anti-patterns | m15-anti-pattern |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:19:28.908Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Rust-based AI Agents requiring robust and type-safe implementation of the Durable Streams protocol with axum and tokio.","zh":"适合需要使用Rust实现Durable Streams协议的AI代理，具有强大的类型安全保证和axum及tokio支持。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントで、Durable Streamsプロトコルをaxumとtokioで実装するために、堅牢で型安全な実装が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"Rust 기반 AI 에이전트에서 Durable Streams 프로토콜을 axum과 tokio로 구현하기 위해 강력하고 타입 안전한 구현이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Rust que requieren una implementación robusta y segura de tipos del protocolo Durable Streams con axum y tokio.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Rust nécessitant une mise en œuvre robuste et seguro de type du protocole Durable Streams avec axum et tokio.","de":"Ideal für Rust-basierte KI-Agents, die eine robuste und typsichere Implementierung des Durable Streams-Protokolls mit axum und tokio erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em Rust que exigem implementação robusta e segura de tipos do protocolo Durable Streams com axum e tokio.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Rust, требующих надежной и безопасной реализации протокола Durable Streams с axum и tokio.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى روست الذي يتطلب تنفيذاً قوياً وآمناً من نوع البروتوكول Durable Streams مع axum و tokio."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure producer idempotency, support streaming reads via long-poll and SSE, and handle JSON batch mode with TTL, all while leveraging Rust''s type system to prevent invalid states at compile-time.","zh":"赋予代理确保生产者幂等性、通过长轮询和SSE支持流读取以及处理JSON批处理模式和TTL的能力，同时利用Rust的类型系统在编译时防止无效状态。","ja":"エージェントがプロデューサーの冪等性を確保し、ロングポーリングとSSE経由でストリーミング読み取りをサポートし、JSONバッチモードとTTLを処理する能力を提供する，同时、Rustの型システムを利用してコンパイル時には無効な状態を防ぐ。","ko":"에이전트가 생산자 중복 제거를 보장하고 장기 폴링 및 SSE를 통해 스트리밍 읽기를 지원하며 JSON 배치 모드 및 TTL을 처리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며,同時에 Rust의 타입 시스템을 활용하여 컴파일 시无效 상태를 방지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes garantizar la idempotencia del productor, admitir lecturas de transmisión a través de long-poll y SSE, y manejar el modo de lote JSON con TTL, todo mientras aprovecha el sistema de tipos de Rust para prevenir estados no válidos en tiempo de compilación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir l''idempotence du producteur, de prendre en charge les lectures de diffusion via long-poll et SSE, et de gérer le mode de lot JSON avec TTL, le tout en exploitant le système de types de Rust pour prévenir les états non valides au moment de la compilation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Idempotenz des Produzenten sicherzustellen, Streaming-Lesevorgänge über long-poll und SSE zu unterstützen und den JSON-Batch-Modus mit TTL zu verwalten, all dies unter Ausnutzung des Rust-Typsystems, um ungültige Zustände zur Compile-Zeit zu verhindern.","pt":"Permite que os agentes garantam a idempotência do produtor, suportem leituras de transmissão via long-poll e SSE e lidem com o modo de lote JSON com TTL, tudo isso aproveitando o sistema de tipos do Rust para prevenir estados inválidos em tempo de compilação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам гарантировать идемпотентность производителя, поддерживать потоковые чтения через long-poll и SSE, и обрабатывать режим пакетной обработки JSON с TTL, все это при использовании системы типов Rust для предотвращения недопустимых состояний во время компиляции.","ar":"يمكن للعميل من ضمان إمكانية إعادة إنتاج المصنع، ودعم قراءات البث عبر long-poll و SSE، ومعالجة وضع Batch JSON مع TTL، وكل ذلك بالاستفادة من نظام أنواع روست لمنع الحالات غير الصالحة في وقت الترجمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing type-driven design for preventing invalid states in Durable Streams","Building robust streaming systems with axum and tokio","Ensuring producer idempotency in distributed systems"],"zh":["为Durable Streams实现类型驱动设计以防止无效状态","使用axum和tokio构建强大的流媒体系统","在分布式系统中确保生产者幂等性"],"ja":["Durable Streamsで無効な状態を防ぐために型駆動設計を実装する","axumとtokioを使用して堅牢なストリーミングシステムを構築する","分散システムでプロデューサーの冪等性を確保する"],"ko":["Durable Streams에서 유효하지 않은 상태를 방지하기 위한 타입 주도 설계 구현","axum과 tokio를 사용하여 강력한 스트리밍 시스템 구축","분산 시스템에서 생산자 중복 제거 보장"],"es":["Implementación de un diseño basado en tipos para prevenir estados no válidos en Durable Streams","Construcción de sistemas de transmisión robustos con axum y tokio","Garantía de la idempotencia del productor en sistemas distribuidos"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''une conception pilotée par les types pour prévenir les états non valides dans Durable Streams","Construction de systèmes de diffusion robustes avec axum et tokio","Garantie de l''idempotence du producteur dans les systèmes distribués"],"de":["Implementierung eines typgetriebenen Designs zur Vermeidung von ungültigen Zuständen in Durable Streams","Aufbau von robusten Streaming-Systemen mit axum und tokio","Sicherstellung der Idempotenz des Produzenten in verteilten Systemen"],"pt":["Implementação de design orientado a tipo para prevenir estados inválidos em Durable Streams","Construção de sistemas de transmissão robustos com axum e tokio","Garantia da idempotência do produtor em sistemas distribuídos"],"ru":["Реализация типо-ориентированного проектирования для предотвращения недопустимых состояний в Durable Streams","Строительство надежных систем потоковой передачи с axum и tokio","Обеспечение идемпотентности производителя в распределенных системах"],"ar":["تنفيذ تصميم موجه للنوع لمنع الحالات غير الصالحة في Durable Streams","بناء أنظمة بث قوية مع axum و tokio","ضمان إمكانية إعادة إنتاج المصنع في الأنظمة الموزعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming language","Dependent on axum and tokio libraries","Limited to Durable Streams protocol implementation"],"zh":["需要Rust编程语言","依赖axum和tokio库","仅限Durable Streams协议实现"],"ja":["Rustプログラミング言語が必要","axumとtokioライブラリに依存","Durable Streamsプロトコル実装に限定"],"ko":["Rust 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","axum 및 tokio 라이브러리에 종속","Durable Streams 프로토콜 구현에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Rust","Dependiente de las bibliotecas axum y tokio","Limitado a la implementación del protocolo Durable Streams"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Rust","Dépendant des bibliothèques axum et tokio","Limité à la mise en œuvre du protocole Durable Streams"],"de":["Erfordert die Programmiersprache Rust","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken axum und tokio","Begrenzt auf die Implementierung des Durable Streams-Protokolls"],"pt":["Exige linguagem de programação Rust","Dependente das bibliotecas axum e tokio","Limitado à implementação do protocolo Durable Streams"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Rust","Зависит от библиотек axum и tokio","Ограничен реализацией протокола Durable Streams"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة البرمجة روست","يعتمد على مكتبات axum و tokio","محدود بتنفيذ بروتوكول Durable Streams"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
