estは、インフラストラクチャの管理を必要とせずに長期的なワークフローを実現する、信頼性の高いバックグラウンド処理を構築するための専門技術です","ko":"Inngest는 인프라스트ラク처 관리 없이 장기 실행 워크플로를 구현할 수 있는 안정적인 백그라운드 처리를 구축하기 위한 전문 기술입니다","es":"Inngest es una solución para procesamiento en segundo plano confiable sin gestión de infraestructura, ideal para desarrolladores","fr":"Inngest est une solution pour le traitement en arrière-plan fiable sans gestion d''infrastructure, idéale pour les développeurs","de":"Inngest ist eine Lösung für zuverlässige Hintergrundverarbeitung ohne Infrastrukturverwaltung, ideal für Entwickler","pt":"O Inngest é uma ferramenta para processamento de fundo confiável sem gerenciar infraestrutura, permitindo workflows duráveis e longos.","ru":"Inngest - это инструмент для надежной фоновой обработки без управления инфраструктурой, позволяющий создавать прочные и долгие рабочие процессы","ar":"Inngest هو أداة لمعالجة الخلفية الموثوقة بدون إدارة البنية التحتية، مما يسمح بعمليات عمل دائمة وطويلة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["可靠的后台处理","长期运行的工作流","无需管理基础设施","可靠的步骤","支持AI管道和事件驱动系统"],"ja":["信頼性の高いバックグラウンド処理","長期的なワークフロー","インフラストラクチャの管理不要","信頼性の高いステップ","AIパイプラインとイベントドリブンシステムをサポート"],"ko":["안정적인 백그라운드 처리","장기 실행 워크플로","인프라스트ラク처 관리 필요 없음","안정적인 단계","AI 파이프라인과 이벤트 구동 시스템 지원"],"es":["Procesamiento en segundo plano confiable","Sin gestión de infraestructura","Flujos de trabajo duraderos","Pipelines de inteligencia artificial","Flujos de incorporación","Sistemas de eventos"],"fr":["Traitement en arrière-plan fiable","Sans gestion d''infrastructure","Flux de travail durables","Pipelines d''intelligence artificielle","Flux d''intégration","Systèmes d''événements"],"de":["Zuverlässige Hintergrundverarbeitung","Ohne Infrastrukturverwaltung","Langlebige Workflows","Künstliche Intelligenz-Pipelines","Onboarding-Flüsse","Ereignissysteme"],"pt":["Processamento de fundo confiável sem infraestrutura","Workflows duráveis e longos","Pipelines de IA e fluxos de ativação","Eventos driven systems","Checkpoints para sobrevivência a falhas"],"ru":["Надежная фоновая обработка без инфраструктуры","Прочные и долгие рабочие процессы","Трубопроводы ИИ и потоки активации","Событийно-ориентированные системы","Контрольные точки для выживания при сбоях"],"ar":["معالجة الخلفية الموثوقة بدون بنية تحتية","عمليات عمل دائمة وطويلة","خطوط أنابيب الذكاء الاصطناعي وعمليات التنشيط","نظم مدفوعة بالأحداث","نقاط تحقق للبقاء على قيد الحياة في caso de falhas"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Inngest","后台处理","无服务器","长期运行的工作流","可靠的步骤","AI管道","事件驱动系统"],"ja":["Inngest","バックグラウンド処理","サーバーレス","長期的なワークフロー","信頼性の高いステップ","AIパイプライン","イベントドリブンシステム"],"ko":["Inngest","백그라운드 처리","서버리스","장기 실행 워크플로","안정적인 단계","AI 파이프라인","이벤트 구동 시스템"],"es":["inngest","procesamiento en segundo plano","infraestructura","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","arquitectura de software","diseño de software","desarrollo de aplicaciones","integración de sistemas"],"fr":["inngest","traitement en arrière-plan","infrastructure","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","architecture de logiciels","conception de logiciels","développement d''applications","intégration de systèmes"],"de":["inngest","hintergrundverarbeitung","infrastruktur","softwareentwicklung","softwareingenieurwesen","softwarearchitektur","softwaredesign","anwendungsentwicklung","systemintegration"],"pt":["inngest","processamento de fundo","workflows duráveis","pipelines de ia","fluxos de ativação","eventos driven systems","serverless","infraestrutura como código"],"ru":["inngest","фоновая обработка","прочные рабочие процессы","трубопроводы ИИ","потоки активации","событийно-ориентированные системы","serverless","инфраструктура как код"],"ar":["inngest","معالجة الخلفية","عمليات عمل دائمة","خطوط أنابيب الذكاء الاصطناعي","عمليات التنشيط","نظم مدفوعة بالأحداث","serverless","البنية التحتية كتعليمات برمجية"]}},"owner":"Hunt-Gather-Create","repo":"_R1","repoPath":"Hunt-Gather-Create/_R1","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"inngest","description":"Inngest expert for serverless-first background jobs, event-driven workflows, and durable execution without managing queues or workers. Use when: inngest, serverless background job, event-driven workflow, step function, durable execution.","bodyPreview":"# Inngest Integration\n\nYou are an Inngest expert who builds reliable background processing without\nmanaging infrastructure. You understand that serverless doesn''t mean you can''t\nhave durable, long-running workflows - it means you don''t manage the workers.\n\nYou''ve built AI pipelines that take minutes, onboarding flows that span days,\nand event-driven systems that process millions of events. You know that the\nmagic of Inngest is in its steps - each one a checkpoint that survives failures.\n\nYour co","body":"# Inngest Integration\n\nYou are an Inngest expert who builds reliable background processing without\nmanaging infrastructure. You understand that serverless doesn''t mean you can''t\nhave durable, long-running workflows - it means you don''t manage the workers.\n\nYou''ve built AI pipelines that take minutes, onboarding flows that span days,\nand event-driven systems that process millions of events. You know that the\nmagic of Inngest is in its steps - each one a checkpoint that survives failures.\n\nYour core philosophy:\n1. Event\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- inngest-functions\n- event-driven-workflows\n- step-functions\n- serverless-background-jobs\n- durable-sleep\n- fan-out-patterns\n- concurrency-control\n- scheduled-functions\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Basic Function Setup\n\nInngest function with typed events in Next.js\n\n### Multi-Step Workflow\n\nComplex workflow with parallel steps and error handling\n\n### Scheduled/Cron Functions\n\nFunctions that run on a schedule\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Not Using Steps\n\n### ❌ Huge Event Payloads\n\n### ❌ Ignoring Concurrency\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `nextjs-app-router`, `vercel-deployment`, `supabase-backend`, `email-systems`, `ai-agents-architect`, `stripe-integration`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:19:13.550Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents needing reliable serverless background processing and durable workflow management","zh":"适用于需要可靠的无服务器后台处理和耐用工作流管理的云代理","ja":"信頼性の高いサーバーレスバックグラウンド処理と耐久性のあるワークフローマネジメントが必要なクラウドエージェントに最適","ko":"안정적인 서버리스 백그라운드 처리 및 지속적인 워크플로우 관리가 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes en la nube que necesitan procesamiento en segundo plano sin servidor confiable y gestión de flujo de trabajo duradera","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant un traitement en arrière-plan sans serveur fiable et une gestion de workflow durable","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die ein zuverlässiges serverloses Hintergrundverarbeitung und eine langlebige Workflow-Verwaltung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que necessitam de processamento em segundo plano sem servidor confiável e gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho durável","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, которым требуется надежная безсерверная фоновая обработка и прочный менеджмент рабочих процессов","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة خلفية موثوقة بدون خادم وإدارة تدفق عمل متينة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build resilient AI pipelines with long-running workflows, leveraging Inngest''s step-based checkpoints for failure survival and event-driven systems processing millions of events, all without managing infrastructure or workers","zh":"赋予代理构建具有长期运行工作流的强大AI流水线的能力，利用Inngest的基于步骤的检查点实现故障恢复和事件驱动系统处理数百万事件，无需管理基础设施或工作人员","ja":"エージェントが長時間実行されるワークフローを備えた堅牢なAIパイプラインを構築する能力を付与し、Inngestのステップベースのチェックポイントを使用して障害耐性とイベントドリブンシステムで数百万のイベントを処理する、インフラストラクチャーやワーカーを管理せずに","ko":"에이전트가 장기 실행 워크플로를 갖춘 강력한 AI 파이프라인을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Inngest의 단계별 체크포인트를 사용하여 장애 생존 및 이벤트 驅動 시스템에서 수백만 개의 이벤트를 처리하도록 하며, 인프라스트ラク처나 작업자를 관리할 필요가 없음","es":"Permite a los agentes crear tuberías de IA resistentes con flujos de trabajo de larga duración, aprovechando los puntos de control basados en pasos de Inngest para la supervivencia a fallos y el procesamiento de sistemas basados en eventos que procesan millones de eventos, todo sin administrar infraestructura o trabajadores","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des pipelines d''IA résistants avec des flux de travail de longue durée, en exploitant les points de contrôle basés sur les étapes d''Inngest pour la survie aux défaillances et le traitement des systèmes basés sur les événements qui traitent des millions d''événements, le tout sans gérer d''infrastructure ou de travailleurs","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, widerstandsfähige KI-Pipelines mit lang laufenden Workflows zu erstellen, indem es Inngests schrittbasierende Prüfpunkte für Ausfallsüberleben und Ereignisgesteuerte Systemverarbeitung von Millionen von Ereignissen nutzt, all dies ohne Infrastruktur oder Arbeiter verwalten zu müssen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir pipelines de IA resilientes com fluxos de trabalho de longa duração, aproveitando os pontos de verificação baseados em etapas do Inngest para sobrevivência a falhas e processamento de sistemas acionados por eventos que processam milhões de eventos, tudo sem gerenciar infraestrutura ou trabalhadores","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать прочные AI-пipelines с долгосрочными рабочими процессами, используя систему чекпоинтов на основе шагов Inngest для выживания при сбоях и обработки событийных систем, обрабатывающих миллионы событий, все это без управления инфраструктурой или работниками","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء أنابيب AI متينة ذات تدفقات عمل طويلة الأمد، مع استخدام نظام نقاط التحقق القائم على الخطوات من Inngest من أجل البقاء عند الفشل ومعالجة الأنظمة المفعلة بالأحداث التي تعالج ملايين الأحداث، كل ذلك دون إدارة البنية التحتية أو العمال"},"useCases":{"en":["Building AI pipelines that span minutes or days","Creating onboarding flows with multiple steps","Developing event-driven systems for large-scale event processing"],"zh":["构建跨分钟或天的AI流水线","创建具有多个步骤的入职流程","开发