сть","GCP","Облако","Технологии"],"ar":["تخزين جوجل كلاود","Google Cloud Storage","حاوية","أمان","تناسب","أداء","جوجل كلاود","السحابة","التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gcp-cloud-storage","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# GCP Cloud Storage\n\nCloud Storage is Google Cloud''s object storage foundation for durable and scalable file workflows. This skill helps the agent design secure bucket strategies, efficient object access, and operationally safe lifecycle controls.\n\n## How to design bucket strategy\n\n1. Create buckets per environment and data classification boundary.\n2. Choose region/multi-region based on latency and compliance needs.\n3. Define naming conventions that reflect domain and ownership.\n4. Separate publ","body":"# GCP Cloud Storage\n\nCloud Storage is Google Cloud''s object storage foundation for durable and scalable file workflows. This skill helps the agent design secure bucket strategies, efficient object access, and operationally safe lifecycle controls.\n\n## How to design bucket strategy\n\n1. Create buckets per environment and data classification boundary.\n2. Choose region/multi-region based on latency and compliance needs.\n3. Define naming conventions that reflect domain and ownership.\n4. Separate public, private, and archival use cases.\n\n## How to upload and download objects safely\n\n1. Validate content type, size limits, and checksum handling.\n2. Use resumable uploads for large files.\n3. Set metadata explicitly (cache headers, content disposition, retention tags).\n4. Prefer server-side generation workflows for trusted uploads.\n\n## How to secure object access\n\n1. Use IAM and least privilege for service accounts.\n2. Prefer Uniform bucket-level access unless object ACLs are required.\n3. Use signed URLs for controlled temporary client access.\n4. Rotate credentials and audit storage access logs.\n\n## How to control retention and lifecycle\n\n1. Define lifecycle rules for transition and deletion policies.\n2. Use object versioning where recovery requirements demand it.\n3. Apply retention policies and legal holds when needed.\n4. Test lifecycle impact before production rollout.\n\n## How to integrate event-driven workflows\n\n1. Emit object events to Pub/Sub/Eventarc for downstream processing.\n2. Make processors idempotent for duplicate event tolerance.\n3. Track object processing status in durable metadata store.\n4. Add dead-letter handling for failed processors.\n\n## Common Warnings & Pitfalls\n\n- Mixing unrelated data domains in the same bucket.\n- Public access exposure by policy misconfiguration.\n- Missing lifecycle controls causing cost growth.\n- Overwriting objects unintentionally without generation checks.\n- Assuming object events are exactly-once.\n\n## Common Errors and Fixes\n\n| Symptom | Root Cause | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| `403 AccessDenied` on read/write | IAM role missing or wrong principal | Grant required role to correct identity and verify project/bucket scope |\n| Unexpected overwrite | No object precondition checks | Use generation-match preconditions for safe writes |\n| Download URL expires too soon | Signed URL TTL too short | Tune expiration window by client workflow |\n| Storage cost spikes | No retention/lifecycle governance | Add lifecycle policies and monitor bucket growth trends |\n\n## Advanced Tips\n\n- Use checksum validation for critical data integrity workflows.\n- Keep object keys partition-friendly for large-scale listing patterns.\n- Add object-level business metadata for downstream indexing/search.\n- Combine Cloud Storage with CDN for high-volume public delivery.\n\n## How to use extended references\n\n- Read [Version History](references/version-history.md) before upgrades, migrations, or compatibility decisions.\n- Read [Java and Kotlin Examples](references/java-kotlin-examples.md) for implementation-ready snippets and language-specific guidance.\n- Read [Advanced Techniques](references/advanced-techniques.md) for specialist playbooks, incident tactics, and performance patterns.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:19:06.668Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring secure and scalable object storage solutions with Google Cloud Platform","zh":"适用于需要安全且可扩展的对象存储解决方案的Google Cloud Platform云管理代理的理想选择","ja":"Google Cloud Platformを使用した安全でスケーラブルなオブジェクトストレージソリューションを必要とするクラウド管理エージェントに適している","ko":"구글 클라우드 플랫폼을 사용한 보안이 강화되고 확장 가능한 객체 저장 솔루션을 필요로 하는 클라우드 관리 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Administración de Nube que requieren soluciones de almacenamiento de objetos seguras y escalables con Google Cloud Platform","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Gestion Cloud nécessitant des solutions de stockage d''objets sécurisées et évolutives avec Google Cloud Platform","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Management-Agents, die sichere und skalierbare Objekt-Speicherlösungen mit Google Cloud Platform erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de gerenciamento de nuvem que exigem soluções de armazenamento de objetos seguras e escaláveis com a Google Cloud Platform","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления облачными службами, требующих безопасных и масштабируемых решений для хранения объектов с платформой Google Cloud","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل إدارة السحابة التي تتطلب حلول تخزين كائنات آمنة وقابلة للتوسع مع منصة جوجل سحابية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design secure bucket strategies, optimize object access, and implement operationally safe lifecycle controls using Google Cloud Storage, ensuring durable and scalable file workflows with region/multi-region support and compliance-driven naming conventions","zh":"赋予代理设计安全的存储桶策略、优化对象访问、使用Google Cloud Storage实施操作上安全的生命周期控制，确保具有区域/多区域支持和遵从驱动命名约定的耐用和可扩展的文件工作流","ja":"エージェントがセキュアなバケット戦略を設計し、オブジェクトアクセスを最適化し、Google Cloud Storageを使用して運用上安全なライフサイクル制御を実施することを可能にし、地域/マルチリージョンサポートとコンプライアンス駆動の命名規則を備えた耐久性とスケーラブルなファイルワークフローを保証する","ko":"에이전트가 보안 버킷 전략을 설계하고 객체 접근을 최적화하며 구글 클라우드 스토리지를 사용하여 운영 상 안전한 수명주기 제어를 구현할 수 있도록 하여 지역/다중 지역 지원과 컴플라이언스 주도 命名 규칙을 갖춘 내구성과 확장 가능한 파일 워크플로를 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar estrategias de cubeta seguras, optimizar el acceso a objetos y implementar controles de ciclo de vida operacionalmente seguros mediante Google Cloud Storage, garantizando flujos de trabajo de archivos duraderos y escalables con soporte de región/multi-región y convenciones de nomenclatura impulsadas por el cumplimiento","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des stratégies de bucket sécurisées, d''optimiser l''accès aux objets et de mettre en œuvre des contrôles de cycle de vie opérationnellement sûrs en utilisant Google Cloud Storage, garantissant ainsi des flux de travail de fichiers durables et évolutifs avec une prise en charge de région/multi-région et des conventions de dénomination impulsées par la conformité","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere Bucket-Strategien zu entwerfen, den Objektzugriff zu optimieren und operationell sichere Lebenszyklussteuerungen mithilfe von Google Cloud Storage umzusetzen, wodurch sichere und skalierbare Datei-Workflows mit Region-/Mehrregionen-Unterstützung und konformitätsgetriebenen Benennungskonventionen gewährleistet werden","pt":"Possibilita que os agentes projetem estratégias de bucket seguras, otimizem o acesso a objetos e implementem controles de ciclo de vida operacionalmente seguros usando o Armazenamento em Nuvem do Google, garantindo fluxos de trabalho de arquivos duráveis e escaláveis com suporte a região/multi-região e convenções de nomenclatura impulsionadas por conformidade","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать безопасные стратегии bucket, оптимизировать доступ к объектам и реализовывать операционно безопасные контролы жизненного цикла с помощью сервиса Хранилище Google Cloud, обеспечивая прочные и масштабируемые рабочие процессы файлов с поддержкой региона/много регионов и соглашениями об именах,驱ляемые соответствием требованиям","ar":"تمكين الوكالات من تصميم استراتيجيات حاوية آمنة وتحسين الوصول إلى الكائنات وتنفيذ ضوابط دورة حياة آمنة تشغيليًا باستخدام تخزين جوجل سحابي، مما يضمن تدفقات عمل ملفات متينة وقابلة للتوسع مع دعم المنطقة / المناطق المتعددة وأسماء الت対 وفقًا لمتطلبات الامتثال"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing secure bucket strategies for sensitive data","Optimizing object access for low-latency applications","Implementing lifecycle controls for data retention and compliance"],"zh":["为敏感数据设计安全的存储桶策略","为低延迟应用程序优化对象访问","为数据保留和遵从实施生命周期控制"],"ja":["機密データのためのセキュアなバケット戦略を設計する","低遅延アプリケーションのためのオブジェクトアクセスを最適化する","データ保管とコンプライアンスのためのライフサイクル制御を実施する"],"ko":["민감한 데이터를 위한 보안 버킷 전략을 설계","저지연 애플리케이션을 위한 객체 접근 최적화","데이터 보관 및 컴플라이언스 위한 수명주기 제어 구현"],"es":["Diseñar estrategias de cubeta seguras para datos sensibles","Optimizar el acceso a objetos para aplicaciones de baja latencia","Implementar controles de ciclo de vida para la retención y el cumplimiento de datos"],"fr":["Concevoir des stratégies de bucket sécurisées pour les données sensibles","Optimiser l''accès aux objets pour les applications à faible latence","Mettre en œuvre des contrôles de cycle de vie pour la rétention et la conformité des données"],"de":["Sichere Bucket-Strategien für sensible Daten entwerfen","Den Objektzugriff für Anwendungen mit geringer Latenz optimieren","Lebenszyklussteuerungen für die Datenspeicherung und -konformität umsetzen"],"pt":["Projetar estratégias de bucket seguras para dados sensíveis","Otimizar o acesso a objetos para aplicações de baixa latência","Implementar controles de ciclo de vida para retenção e conformidade de dados"],"ru":["Проектирование безопасных стратегий bucket для чувствительных данных","Оптимизация доступа к объектам для приложений с низкой задержкой","Реализация контролей жизненного цикла для хранения и соответствия требованиям данных"],"ar":["تصميم استراتيجيات حاوية آمنة للبيانات الحساسة","تحسين الوصول إلى الكائنات لتطبيقات التأخير المنخفض","تنفيذ ضوابط دورة حياة للاحتفاظ والامتثال لبيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google Cloud Platform account","Dependent on region/multi-region availability and compliance needs"],"zh":["需要Google Cloud Platform账户","依赖于区域/多区域可用性和遵从需求"],"ja":["Google Cloud Platformアカウントが必要","リージョン/マルチリージョンの可用性とコンプライアンス要件に依存する"],"ko":["구글 클라우드 플랫폼 계정 필요","지역/다중 지역 가용성 및 컴플라이언스 필요에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Google Cloud Platform","Depende de la disponibilidad y las necesidades de cumplimiento de la región/multi-región"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Google Cloud Platform","Dépend de la disponibilité et des besoins de conformité de la région/multi-région"],"de":["Benötigt ein Konto von Google Cloud Platform","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit und den Konformitätsanforderungen der Region/Mehrregion ab"],"pt":["Exige conta da Google Cloud Platform","Depende da disponibilidade da região/multi-região e das necessidades de conformidade"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи платформы Google Cloud","Зависит от доступности региона/много регионов и потребностей в соответствии требованиям"],"ar":["يتطلب حسابًا على منصة جوجل سحابية","يعتمد على توافر المنطقة / المناطق المتعددة واحتياجات الامتثال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
