e de design","Intégration avec Stitch"],"de":["Erstellung von DESIGN.md-Dateien","Generierung von Bildschirmen, die mit der bestehenden Designsprache übereinstimmen","Interpretation von Design durch visuelle Beschreibungen","Unterstützung für spezifische Farbwerte","Wahrheitsquelle für die Designsprache","Integration mit Stitch"],"pt":["Criação de arquivos DESIGN.md","Sistema de Design Semântico","Geração de novas telas alinhadas","Linguagem de design consistente","Integração com Stitch"],"ru":["Создание файлов DESIGN.md","Семантическая система дизайна","Генерация новых экранов, идеально соответствующих","Последовательный язык дизайна","Интеграция со Stitch"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات DESIGN.md","نظام تصميم семантиك","إنشاء شاشات جديدة متوافقة","لغة تصميم متسقة","التكامل مع Stitch"]},"keywords":{"zh":["设计-md","语义设计系统","设计语言","开发效率","视觉描述","颜色值"],"ja":["デザイン-md","シマンティック デザイン システム","デザイン言語","開発効率","視覚的な説明","色値"],"ko":["디자인-md","의미있는 디자인 시스템","디자인 언어","개발 효율성","视覚적 설명","색상 값"],"es":["diseño de sistemas semánticos","DESIGN.md","generación de pantallas","lenguaje de diseño","descripciones visuales","valores de color","Stitch","sistemas de diseño","semántica de diseño"],"fr":["conception de systèmes de design sémantiques","DESIGN.md","génération d''écrans","langage de design","descriptions visuelles","valeurs de couleur","Stitch","systèmes de design","sémantique de design"],"de":["Entwurf von semantischen Design-Systemen","DESIGN.md","Generierung von Bildschirmen","Designsprache","visuelle Beschreibungen","Farbwerte","Stitch","Design-Systeme","Semantik von Design"],"pt":["design-md","Sistema de Design Semântico","arquivos DESIGN.md","Stitch","linguagem de design","geração de telas"],"ru":["design-md","семантическая система дизайна","файлы DESIGN.md","Stitch","язык дизайна","генерация экранов"],"ar":["design-md","نظام تصميم семантиك","ملفات DESIGN.md","Stitch","لغة تصميم","إنشاء شاشات"]}},"owner":"Nexprove-Team","repo":"hykehyre","repoPath":"Nexprove-Team/hykehyre","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-md","description":"Analyze Stitch projects and synthesize a semantic design system into DESIGN.md files","bodyPreview":"# Stitch DESIGN.md Skill\n\nYou are an expert Design Systems Lead. Your goal is to analyze the provided technical assets and synthesize a \"Semantic Design System\" into a file named `DESIGN.md`.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you create `DESIGN.md` files that serve as the \"source of truth\" for prompting Stitch to generate new screens that align perfectly with existing design language. Stitch interprets design through \"Visual Descriptions\" supported by specific color values.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Acc","body":"# Stitch DESIGN.md Skill\n\nYou are an expert Design Systems Lead. Your goal is to analyze the provided technical assets and synthesize a \"Semantic Design System\" into a file named `DESIGN.md`.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you create `DESIGN.md` files that serve as the \"source of truth\" for prompting Stitch to generate new screens that align perfectly with existing design language. Stitch interprets design through \"Visual Descriptions\" supported by specific color values.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Access to the Stitch MCP Server\n- A Stitch project with at least one designed screen\n- Access to the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\n## The Goal\n\nThe `DESIGN.md` file will serve as the \"source of truth\" for prompting Stitch to generate new screens that align perfectly with the existing design language. Stitch interprets design through \"Visual Descriptions\" supported by specific color values.\n\n## Retrieval and Networking\n\nTo analyze a Stitch project, you must retrieve screen metadata and design assets using the Stitch MCP Server tools:\n\n1. **Namespace discovery**: Run `list_tools` to find the Stitch MCP prefix. Use this prefix (e.g., `mcp_stitch:`) for all subsequent calls.\n\n2. **Project lookup** (if Project ID is not provided):\n   - Call `[prefix]:list_projects` with `filter: \"view=owned\"` to retrieve all user projects\n   - Identify the target project by title or URL pattern\n   - Extract the Project ID from the `name` field (e.g., `projects/13534454087919359824`)\n\n3. **Screen lookup** (if Screen ID is not provided):\n   - Call `[prefix]:list_screens` with the `projectId` (just the numeric ID, not the full path)\n   - Review screen titles to identify the target screen (e.g., \"Home\", \"Landing Page\")\n   - Extract the Screen ID from the screen''s `name` field\n\n4. **Metadata fetch**:\n   - Call `[prefix]:get_screen` with both `projectId` and `screenId` (both as numeric IDs only)\n   - This returns the complete screen object including:\n     - `screenshot.downloadUrl` - Visual reference of the design\n     - `htmlCode.downloadUrl` - Full HTML/CSS source code\n     - `width`, `height`, `deviceType` - Screen dimensions and target platform\n     - Project metadata including `designTheme` with color and style information\n\n5. **Asset download**:\n   - Use `web_fetch` or `read_url_content` to download the HTML code from `htmlCode.downloadUrl`\n   - Optionally download the screenshot from `screenshot.downloadUrl` for visual reference\n   - Parse the HTML to extract Tailwind classes, custom CSS, and component patterns\n\n6. **Project metadata extraction**:\n   - Call `[prefix]:get_project` with the project `name` (full path: `projects/{id}`) to get:\n     - `designTheme` object with color mode, fonts, roundness, custom colors\n     - Project-level design guidelines and descriptions\n     - Device type preferences and layout principles\n\n## Analysis & Synthesis Instructions\n\n### 1. Extract Project Identity (JSON)\n\n- Locate the Project Title\n- Locate the specific Project ID (e.g., from the `name` field in the JSON)\n\n### 2. Define the Atmosphere (Image/HTML)\n\nEvaluate the screenshot and HTML structure to capture the overall \"vibe.\" Use evocative adjectives to describe the mood (e.g., \"Airy,\" \"Dense,\" \"Minimalist,\" \"Utilitarian\").\n\n### 3. Map the Color Palette (Tailwind Config/JSON)\n\nIdentify the key colors in the system. For each color, provide:\n\n- A descriptive, natural language name that conveys its character (e.g., \"Deep Muted Teal-Navy\")\n- The specific hex code in parentheses for precision (e.g., \"#294056\")\n- Its specific functional role (e.g., \"Used for primary actions\")\n\n### 4. Translate Geometry & Shape (CSS/Tailwind)\n\nConvert technical `border-radius` and layout values into physical descriptions:\n\n- Describe `rounded-full` as \"Pill-shaped\"\n- Describe `rounded-lg` as \"Subtly rounded corners\"\n- Describe `rounded-none` as \"Sharp, squared-off edges\"\n\n### 5. Describe Depth & Elevation\n\nExplain how the UI handles layers. Describe the presence and quality of shadows (e.g., \"Flat,\" \"Whisper-soft diffused shadows,\" or \"Heavy, high-contrast drop shadows\").\n\n## Output Guidelines\n\n- **Language:** Use descriptive design terminology and natural language exclusively\n- **Format:** Generate a clean Markdown file following the structure below\n- **Precision:** Include exact hex codes for colors while using descriptive names\n- **Context:** Explain the \"why\" behind design decisions, not just the \"what\"\n\n## Output Format (DESIGN.md Structure)\n\n```markdown\n# Design System: [Project Title]\n\n**Project ID:** [Insert Project ID Here]\n\n## 1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere\n\n(Description of the mood, density, and aesthetic philosophy.)\n\n## 2. Color Palette & Roles\n\n(List colors by Descriptive Name + Hex Code + Functional Role.)\n\n## 3. Typography Rules\n\n(Description of font family, weight usage for headers vs. body, and letter-spacing character.)\n\n## 4. Component Stylings\n\n- **Buttons:** (Shape description, color assignment, behavior).\n- **Cards/Containers:** (Corner roundness description, background color, shadow depth).\n- **Inputs/Forms:** (Stroke style, background).\n\n## 5. Layout Principles\n\n(Description of whitespace strategy, margins, and grid alignment.)\n```\n\n## Usage Example\n\nTo use this skill for the Furniture Collection project:\n\n1. **Retrieve project information:**\n\n   ```\n   Use the Stitch MCP Server to get the Furniture Collection project\n   ```\n\n2. **Get the Home page screen details:**\n\n   ```\n   Retrieve the Home page screen''s code, image, and screen object information\n   ```\n\n3. **Reference best practices:**\n\n   ```\n   Review the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide at:\n   https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n   ```\n\n4. **Analyze and synthesize:**\n   - Extract all relevant design tokens from the screen\n   - Translate technical values into descriptive language\n   - Organize information according to the DESIGN.md structure\n\n5. **Generate the file:**\n   - Create `DESIGN.md` in the project directory\n   - Follow the prescribed format exactly\n   - Ensure all color codes are accurate\n   - Use evocative, designer-friendly language\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Be Descriptive:** Avoid generic terms like \"blue\" or \"rounded.\" Use \"Ocean-deep Cerulean (#0077B6)\" or \"Gently curved edges\"\n- **Be Functional:** Always explain what each design element is used for\n- **Be Consistent:** Use the same terminology throughout the document\n- **Be Visual:** Help readers visualize the design through your descriptions\n- **Be Precise:** Include exact values (hex codes, pixel values) in parentheses after natural language descriptions\n\n## Tips for Success\n\n1. **Start with the big picture:** Understand the overall aesthetic before diving into details\n2. **Look for patterns:** Identify consistent spacing, sizing, and styling patterns\n3. **Think semantically:** Name colors by their purpose, not just their appearance\n4. **Consider hierarchy:** Document how visual weight and importance are communicated\n5. **Reference the guide:** Use language and patterns from the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide\n\n## Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n- ❌ Using technical jargon without translation (e.g., \"rounded-xl\" instead of \"generously rounded corners\")\n- ❌ Omitting color codes or using only descriptive names\n- ❌ Forgetting to explain functional roles of design elements\n- ❌ Being too vague in atmosphere descriptions\n- ❌ Ignoring subtle design details like shadows or spacing patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:19:45.066Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Description Agents needing advanced design system integration and Semantic Design System creation","zh":"适合需要高级设计系统集成和语义设计系统创建的视觉描述代理","ja":"高度なデザインシステム統合とセマンティクスデザインシステムの作成が必要なビジュアル説明エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 디자인 시스템 통합 및 시맨틱 디자인 시스템 생성이 필요한 시각적 설명 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Descripción Visual que necesitan una integración avanzada de sistema de diseño y creación de Sistema de Diseño Semántico","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Description Visuelle ayant besoin d''une intégration avancée de système de conception et de création de Système de Conception Sémantique","de":"Perfekt für Visuelle Beschreibungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Designsystemintegration und eine semantische Designsystemerstellung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Descrição Visual que precisam de integração avançada de sistema de design e criação de Sistema de Design Semântico","ru":"Идеально для визуальных описательных агентов, требующих продвинутой интеграции системы дизайна и создания Семантической системы дизайна","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكلاء الوصف المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متقدم لنظام التصميم وإنشاء نظام تصميم семантиكي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to synthesize Visual Descriptions into a DESIGN.md file, serving as the source of truth for generating new screens that align with existing design language, supported by specific color values and design system principles","zh":"赋予代理人将视觉描述合成到 DESIGN.md 文件的能力，作为生成与现有设计语言一致的新屏幕的真实来源，支持特定的颜色值和设计系统原则","ja":"エージェントにビジュアル説明を DESIGN.md ファイルに合成する能力を与え、既存のデザイン言語と一致する新しいスクリーンを生成するための真実のソースとなり、特定の色値とデザインシステムの原則をサポートする","ko":"에이전트에게 시각적 설명을 DESIGN.md 파일로 합성하는 능력을 부여하여, 기존 디자인 언어와 일관성 있는 새로운 화면을 생성하기 위한 진실한 출처 역할을 하며, 특정 색상 값과 디자인 시스템 원칙을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a sintetizar Descripciones Visuales en un archivo DESIGN.md, que sirve como fuente de verdad para generar nuevas pantallas que se alinean con el lenguaje de diseño existente, respaldado por valores de colores específicos y principios del sistema de diseño","fr":"Permet aux agents de synthétiser des Descriptions Visuelles dans un fichier DESIGN.md, servant de source de vérité pour générer de nouveaux écrans qui s''alignent sur le langage de conception existant, pris en charge par des valeurs de couleurs spécifiques et des principes de système de conception","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Visuelle Beschreibungen in eine DESIGN.md-Datei zu synthetisieren, die als Wahrheitsquelle für die Generierung neuer Bildschirme dient, die mit der bestehenden Designsprache übereinstimmen, unterstützt durch spezifische Farbwerte und Designsystemprinzipien","pt":"Habilita os agentes a sintetizar Descrições Visuais em um arquivo DESIGN.md, que serve como fonte de verdade para gerar novas telas que se alinham com a linguagem de design existente, apoiada por valores de cor específicos e princípios do sistema de design","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью синтезировать визуальные описания в файл DESIGN.md, который служит источником истины для генерации новых экранов, соответствующих существующему языку дизайна, поддерживаемому конкретными цветовыми значениями и принципами системы дизайна","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل الوصف المرئي إلى ملف DESIGN.md، الذي يُعد مصدر الحقيقة لإنشاء شاشات جديدة تتماشى مع لغة التصميم الحالية، مدعومة بقيم màu محددة ومبادئ نظام التصميم"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating DESIGN.md files for consistent design language","Creating Visual Descriptions for new screen generation","Aligning existing design assets with a Semantic Design System"],"zh":["为一致的设计语言生成 DESIGN.md 文件","为新屏幕生成创建视觉描述","将现有的设计资产与语义设计系统对齐"],"ja":["一貫したデザイン言語のための DESIGN.md ファイルを生成する","新しいスクリーン生成のためのビジュアル説明を作成する","既存のデザイン資産をセマンティクスデザインシステムと整列させる"],"ko":["일관된 디자인 언어를 위한 DESIGN.md 파일 생성","새로운 화면 생성을 위한 시각적 설명 생성","기존 디자인 자산을 시맨틱 디자인 시스템과 일치시키기"],"es":["Generación de archivos DESIGN.md para un lenguaje de diseño coherente","Creación de Descripciones Visuales para la generación de nuevas pantallas","Alineación de los activos de diseño existentes con un Sistema de Diseño Semántico"],"fr":["Génération de fichiers DESIGN.md pour un langage de conception cohérent","Création de Descriptions Visuelles pour la génération de nouveaux écrans","Alignement des actifs de conception existants sur un Système de Conception Sémantique"],"de":["Erzeugung von DESIGN.md-Dateien für eine konsistente Designsprache","Erstellung von Visuellen Beschreibungen für die Generierung neuer Bildschirme","Ausrichtung der bestehenden Designanlagen mit einem semantischen Designsystem"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos DESIGN.md para linguagem de design consistente","Criação de Descrições Visuais para geração de novas telas","Alinhamento de ativos de design existentes com um Sistema de Design Semântico"],"ru":["Генерация файлов DESIGN.md для согласованного языка дизайна","Создание визуальных описаний для генерации новых экранов","Совмещение существующих активов дизайна с Семантической системой дизайна"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات DESIGN.md للغة تصميم متسقة","إنشاء وصف مرئي لإنشاء شاشات جديدة","مواءمة موارد تصميم موجودة مع نظام تصميم семантиكي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires technical assets for analysis","Limited to design system integration through DESIGN.md files"],"zh":["需要技术资产进行分析","仅限通过 DESIGN.md 文件的设计系统集成"],"ja":["分析のために技術資産が必要","DESIGN.md ファイルを介したデザインシステム統合に限定される"],"ko":["분석을 위한 기술 자산이 필요","DESIGN.md 파일을 통한 디자인 시스템 통합으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere activos técnicos para el análisis","Limitado a la integración del sistema de diseño a través de archivos DESIGN.md"],"fr":["Nécessite des actifs techniques pour l''analyse","Limité à l''intégration du système de conception via des fichiers DESIGN.md"],"de":["Benötigt technische Assets für die Analyse","Begrenzt auf die Integration des Designsystems über DESIGN.md-Dateien"],"pt":["Requer ativos técnicos para análise","Limitado à integração do sistema de design por meio de arquivos DESIGN.md"],"ru":["Требует технических активов для анализа","Ограничен интеграцией системы дизайна через файлы DESIGN.md"],"ar":["يتطلب موارد تقنية للتحليل","محدود بدمج نظام التصميم من خلال ملفات DESIGN.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
