on":{"zh":"系统调试是一种技术问题解决方法，强调找到问题的根源，而不是简单地修复症状","ja":"体系的デバッグは、技術的な問題を解決するための手法であり、根本原因を特定することよりも、症状を修正することに重点を置いていない","ko":"시스템 디버깅은 기술적인 문제를 해결하는 방법으로 문제의 근본 원인을 찾는 것을 강조합니다","es":"La depuración sistemática es un enfoque para encontrar y solucionar errores de manera eficiente. Siempre encuentra la causa raíz antes de intentar soluciones","fr":"Le débogage systématique est une approche pour trouver et résoudre les erreurs de manière efficace. Trouvez toujours la cause profonde avant d''essayer des so...","de":"Die systematische Fehlersuche ist ein Ansatz, um Fehler effizient zu finden und zu beheben. Finden Sie immer die Ursache, bevor Sie Lösungen versuchen","pt":"A depuração sistemática é uma abordagem estruturada para identificar e resolver problemas técnicos, garantindo que as soluções sejam eficazes e duradouras","ru":"Системная отладка - это структурированный подход к выявлению и решению технических проблем, гарантирующий, что решения будут эффективными и долговечными","ar":"التصحيح المنهجي هو نهج منظم لتحديد ومعالجة المشاكل الفنية، مما يضمن أن الحلول تكون فعالة ومستدامة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["找到问题的根源","避免随机修复","减少新 bug 的产生","提高调试效率","适用于任何技术问题"],"ja":["根本原因を特定する","ランダムな修正を避ける","新しいバグの产生を減らす","デバッグの効率を高める","すべての技術的な問題に適用可能"],"ko":["문제의 근본 원인을 찾기","무작위 수정을 피하기","새로운 버그의 발생을 줄이기","디버깅 효율을 높이기","모든 기술적인 문제에 적용 가능"],"es":["Encontrar la causa raíz de los errores","Evitar soluciones temporales","Solucionar errores de manera eficiente","Reducir el tiempo de depuración","Mejorar la calidad del código"],"fr":["Trouver la cause profonde des erreurs","Éviter les solutions temporaires","Résoudre les erreurs de manière efficace","Réduire le temps de débogage","Améliorer la qualité du code"],"de":["Die Ursache von Fehlern finden","Temporäre Lösungen vermeiden","Fehler effizient beheben","Die Debugging-Zeit reduzieren","Die Code-Qualität verbessern"],"pt":["Identificação da causa raiz dos problemas","Abordagem estruturada para resolução de problemas","Garantia de soluções eficazes e duradouras","Redução do tempo gasto com depuração","Melhoria da qualidade do código"],"ru":["Выявление корневой причины проблем","Структурированный подход к решению проблем","Гарантия эффективных и долговечных решений","Сокращение времени, затраченного на отладку","Улучшение качества кода"],"ar":["تحديد السبب الجذري للمشاكل","نهج منظم لمعالجة المشاكل","ضمان حلول فعالة ومستدامة","تقليل الوقت المستغرق في التصحيح","تحسين جودة الشيفرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["系统调试","技术问题解决","根源分析","随机修复","新 bug 产生","调试效率","技术问题"],"ja":["体系的デバッグ","技術的な問題を解決","根本原因を特定","ランダムな修正","新しいバグの产生","デバッグの効率","技術的な問題"],"ko":["시스템 디버깅","기술적인 문제 해결","근본 원인 분석","무작위 수정","새로운 버그 발생","디버깅 효율","기술적인 문제"],"es":["depuración sistemática","encontrar causa raíz","solucionar errores","eficiencia en la depuración","calidad del código","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","depuración de errores"],"fr":["débogage systématique","trouver la cause profonde","résoudre les erreurs","efficacité de débogage","qualité du code","développement de logiciel","tests de logiciel","débogage d''erreurs"],"de":["systematische Fehlersuche","Ursache finden","Fehler beheben","Effizienz bei der Fehlersuche","Code-Qualität","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Tests","Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["depuração sistemática","resolução de problemas","causa raiz","soluções eficazes","qualidade do código","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["системная отладка","решение проблем","корневая причина","эффективные решения","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التصحيح المنهجي","معالجة المشاكل","السبب الجذري","حلول فعالة","جودة الشيفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"OrwinZavaleta","repo":"Lingq-orwin","repoPath":"OrwinZavaleta/Lingq-orwin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"systematic-debugging","description":"Use when encountering any bug, test failure, or unexpected behavior, before proposing fixes","bodyPreview":"# Systematic Debugging\n\n## Overview\n\nRandom fixes waste time and create new bugs. Quick patches mask underlying issues.\n\n**Core principle:** ALWAYS find root cause before attempting fixes. Symptom fixes are failure.\n\n**Violating the letter of this process is violating the spirit of debugging.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO FIXES WITHOUT ROOT CAUSE INVESTIGATION FIRST\n```\n\nIf you haven''t completed Phase 1, you cannot propose fixes.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse for ANY technical issue:\n- Test failures\n- Bugs","body":"# Systematic Debugging\n\n## Overview\n\nRandom fixes waste time and create new bugs. Quick patches mask underlying issues.\n\n**Core principle:** ALWAYS find root cause before attempting fixes. Symptom fixes are failure.\n\n**Violating the letter of this process is violating the spirit of debugging.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO FIXES WITHOUT ROOT CAUSE INVESTIGATION FIRST\n```\n\nIf you haven''t completed Phase 1, you cannot propose fixes.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse for ANY technical issue:\n- Test failures\n- Bugs in production\n- Unexpected behavior\n- Performance problems\n- Build failures\n- Integration issues\n\n**Use this ESPECIALLY when:**\n- Under time pressure (emergencies make guessing tempting)\n- \"Just one quick fix\" seems obvious\n- You''ve already tried multiple fixes\n- Previous fix didn''t work\n- You don''t fully understand the issue\n\n**Don''t skip when:**\n- Issue seems simple (simple bugs have root causes too)\n- You''re in a hurry (rushing guarantees rework)\n- Manager wants it fixed NOW (systematic is faster than thrashing)\n\n## The Four Phases\n\nYou MUST complete each phase before proceeding to the next.\n\n### Phase 1: Root Cause Investigation\n\n**BEFORE attempting ANY fix:**\n\n1. **Read Error Messages Carefully**\n   - Don''t skip past errors or warnings\n   - They often contain the exact solution\n   - Read stack traces completely\n   - Note line numbers, file paths, error codes\n\n2. **Reproduce Consistently**\n   - Can you trigger it reliably?\n   - What are the exact steps?\n   - Does it happen every time?\n   - If not reproducible → gather more data, don''t guess\n\n3. **Check Recent Changes**\n   - What changed that could cause this?\n   - Git diff, recent commits\n   - New dependencies, config changes\n   - Environmental differences\n\n4. **Gather Evidence in Multi-Component Systems**\n\n   **WHEN system has multiple components (CI → build → signing, API → service → database):**\n\n   **BEFORE proposing fixes, add diagnostic instrumentation:**\n   ```\n   For EACH component boundary:\n     - Log what data enters component\n     - Log what data exits component\n     - Verify environment/config propagation\n     - Check state at each layer\n\n   Run once to gather evidence showing WHERE it breaks\n   THEN analyze evidence to identify failing component\n   THEN investigate that specific component\n   ```\n\n   **Example (multi-layer system):**\n   ```bash\n   # Layer 1: Workflow\n   echo \"=== Secrets available in workflow: ===\"\n   echo \"IDENTITY: ${IDENTITY:+SET}${IDENTITY:-UNSET}\"\n\n   # Layer 2: Build script\n   echo \"=== Env vars in build script: ===\"\n   env | grep IDENTITY || echo \"IDENTITY not in environment\"\n\n   # Layer 3: Signing script\n   echo \"=== Keychain state: ===\"\n   security list-keychains\n   security find-identity -v\n\n   # Layer 4: Actual signing\n   codesign --sign \"$IDENTITY\" --verbose=4 \"$APP\"\n   ```\n\n   **This reveals:** Which layer fails (secrets → workflow ✓, workflow → build ✗)\n\n5. **Trace Data Flow**\n\n   **WHEN error is deep in call stack:**\n\n   See `root-cause-tracing.md` in this directory for the complete backward tracing technique.\n\n   **Quick version:**\n   - Where does bad value originate?\n   - What called this with bad value?\n   - Keep tracing up until you find the source\n   - Fix at source, not at symptom\n\n### Phase 2: Pattern Analysis\n\n**Find the pattern before fixing:**\n\n1. **Find Working Examples**\n   - Locate similar working code in same codebase\n   - What works that''s similar to what''s broken?\n\n2. **Compare Against References**\n   - If implementing pattern, read reference implementation COMPLETELY\n   - Don''t skim - read every line\n   - Understand the pattern fully before applying\n\n3. **Identify Differences**\n   - What''s different between working and broken?\n   - List every difference, however small\n   - Don''t assume \"that can''t matter\"\n\n4. **Understand Dependencies**\n   - What other components does this need?\n   - What settings, config, environment?\n   - What assumptions does it make?\n\n### Phase 3: Hypothesis and Testing\n\n**Scientific method:**\n\n1. **Form Single Hypothesis**\n   - State clearly: \"I think X is the root cause because Y\"\n   - Write it down\n   - Be specific, not vague\n\n2. **Test Minimally**\n   - Make the SMALLEST possible change to test hypothesis\n   - One variable at a time\n   - Don''t fix multiple things at once\n\n3. **Verify Before Continuing**\n   - Did it work? Yes → Phase 4\n   - Didn''t work? Form NEW hypothesis\n   - DON''T add more fixes on top\n\n4. **When You Don''t Know**\n   - Say \"I don''t understand X\"\n   - Don''t pretend to know\n   - Ask for help\n   - Research more\n\n### Phase 4: Implementation\n\n**Fix the root cause, not the symptom:**\n\n1. **Create Failing Test Case**\n   - Simplest possible reproduction\n   - Automated test if possible\n   - One-off test script if no framework\n   - MUST have before fixing\n   - Use the `superpowers:test-driven-development` skill for writing proper failing tests\n\n2. **Implement Single Fix**\n   - Address the root cause identified\n   - ONE change at a time\n   - No \"while I''m here\" improvements\n   - No bundled refactoring\n\n3. **Verify Fix**\n   - Test passes now?\n   - No other tests broken?\n   - Issue actually resolved?\n\n4. **If Fix Doesn''t Work**\n   - STOP\n   - Count: How many fixes have you tried?\n   - If < 3: Return to Phase 1, re-analyze with new information\n   - **If ≥ 3: STOP and question the architecture (step 5 below)**\n   - DON''T attempt Fix #4 without architectural discussion\n\n5. **If 3+ Fixes Failed: Question Architecture**\n\n   **Pattern indicating architectural problem:**\n   - Each fix reveals new shared state/coupling/problem in different place\n   - Fixes require \"massive refactoring\" to implement\n   - Each fix creates new symptoms elsewhere\n\n   **STOP and question fundamentals:**\n   - Is this pattern fundamentally sound?\n   - Are we \"sticking with it through sheer inertia\"?\n   - Should we refactor architecture vs. continue fixing symptoms?\n\n   **Discuss with your human partner before attempting more fixes**\n\n   This is NOT a failed hypothesis - this is a wrong architecture.\n\n## Red Flags - STOP and Follow Process\n\nIf you catch yourself thinking:\n- \"Quick fix for now, investigate later\"\n- \"Just try changing X and see if it works\"\n- \"Add multiple changes, run tests\"\n- \"Skip the test, I''ll manually verify\"\n- \"It''s probably X, let me fix that\"\n- \"I don''t fully understand but this might work\"\n- \"Pattern says X but I''ll adapt it differently\"\n- \"Here are the main problems: [lists fixes without investigation]\"\n- Proposing solutions before tracing data flow\n- **\"One more fix attempt\" (when already tried 2+)**\n- **Each fix reveals new problem in different place**\n\n**ALL of these mean: STOP. Return to Phase 1.**\n\n**If 3+ fixes failed:** Question the architecture (see Phase 4.5)\n\n## your human partner''s Signals You''re Doing It Wrong\n\n**Watch for these redirections:**\n- \"Is that not happening?\" - You assumed without verifying\n- \"Will it show us...?\" - You should have added evidence gathering\n- \"Stop guessing\" - You''re proposing fixes without understanding\n- \"Ultrathink this\" - Question fundamentals, not just symptoms\n- \"We''re stuck?\" (frustrated) - Your approach isn''t working\n\n**When you see these:** STOP. Return to Phase 1.\n\n## Common Rationalizations\n\n| Excuse | Reality |\n|--------|---------|\n| \"Issue is simple, don''t need process\" | Simple issues have root causes too. Process is fast for simple bugs. |\n| \"Emergency, no time for process\" | Systematic debugging is FASTER than guess-and-check thrashing. |\n| \"Just try this first, then investigate\" | First fix sets the pattern. Do it right from the start. |\n| \"I''ll write test after confirming fix works\" | Untested fixes don''t stick. Test first proves it. |\n| \"Multiple fixes at once saves time\" | Can''t isolate what worked. Causes new bugs. |\n| \"Reference too long, I''ll adapt the pattern\" | Partial understanding guarantees bugs. Read it completely. |\n| \"I see the problem, let me fix it\" | Seeing symptoms ≠ understanding root cause. |\n| \"One more fix attempt\" (after 2+ failures) | 3+ failures = architectural problem. Question pattern, don''t fix again. |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Phase | Key Activities | Success Criteria |\n|-------|---------------|------------------|\n| **1. Root Cause** | Read errors, reproduce, check changes, gather evidence | Understand WHAT and WHY |\n| **2. Pattern** | Find working examples, compare | Identify differences |\n| **3. Hypothesis** | Form theory, test minimally | Confirmed or new hypothesis |\n| **4. Implementation** | Create test, fix, verify | Bug resolved, tests pass |\n\n## When Process Reveals \"No Root Cause\"\n\nIf systematic investigation reveals issue is truly environmental, timing-dependent, or external:\n\n1. You''ve completed the process\n2. Document what you investigated\n3. Implement appropriate handling (retry, timeout, error message)\n4. Add monitoring/logging for future investigation\n\n**But:** 95% of \"no root cause\" cases are incomplete investigation.\n\n## Supporting Techniques\n\nThese techniques are part of systematic debugging and available in this directory:\n\n- **`root-cause-tracing.md`** - Trace bugs backward through call stack to find original trigger\n- **`defense-in-depth.md`** - Add validation at multiple layers after finding root cause\n- **`condition-based-waiting.md`** - Replace arbitrary timeouts with condition polling\n\n**Related skills:**\n- **superpowers:test-driven-development** - For creating failing test case (Phase 4, Step 1)\n- **superpowers:verification-before-completion** - Verify fix worked before claiming success\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nFrom debugging sessions:\n- Systematic approach: 15-30 minutes to fix\n- Random fixes approach: 2-3 hours of thrashing\n- First-time fix rate: 95% vs 40%\n- New bugs introduced: Near zero vs common\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:19:49.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Agents needing structured issue resolution through systematic debugging methodologies.","zh":"适合需要通过系统调试方法论进行结构化问题解决的技术代理","ja":"技術エージェントが体系的な問題解決を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"기술 에이전트가 체계적인 문제 해결을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Técnicos que necesitan una resolución de problemas estructurada a través de metodologías de depuración sistemáticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents techniques ayant besoin d''une résolution de problèmes structurée grâce à des méthodologies de débogage systématiques.","de":"Perfekt für technische Agenten, die eine strukturierte Problemlösung durch systematische Fehlersuche-Methoden benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Técnicos que necessitam de resolução de problemas estruturada por meio de metodologias de depuração sistemáticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для технических агентов, которым требуется структурированное решение проблем посредством систематических методов отладки.","ar":"مثالي للموكلين الفنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى حل مشكلات منظم من خلال منهجيات فحص منهجية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify root causes of technical issues using the Iron Law of NO FIXES WITHOUT ROOT CAUSE INVESTIGATION FIRST, ensuring thorough investigation of test failures and bugs before proposing fixes.","zh":"赋予代理识别技术问题的根源的能力，使用铁律，即在提出解决方案之前必须先进行根源原因调查，确保对测试失败和错误进行彻底的调查","ja":"エージェントが技術的な問題の根本原因を特定する能力を付与します。根本原因の調査を先に実施することを鉄則とすることで、テストの失敗やバグについて提案する前に徹底的な調査を行うことを保証します","ko":"기술적인 문제의 근본적인 원인을 식별할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다. 해결책을 제안하기 전에 먼저 근본적인 원인 조사를 수행해야 한다는 철칙을 따름으로써 테스트 실패 및 버그에 대한 철저한 조사를 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar las causas raíz de los problemas técnicos utilizando la Ley de Hierro de NO ARREGLAR SIN INVESTIGAR LA CAUSA RAÍZ PRIMERO, garantizando una investigación exhaustiva de los fallos de prueba y errores antes de proponer soluciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les causes profondes des problèmes techniques en utilisant la Loi de Fer de PAS DE CORRECTIONS SANS ENQUÊTE SUR LA CAUSE PROFONDE EN PREMIER, assurant une investigation approfondie des défaillances de test et des bogues avant de proposer des correctifs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Ursachen technischer Probleme mithilfe des Eisernen Gesetzes von KEINE REPARIERUNG OHNE UNTERSUCHUNG DER URSAChE ERST zu identifizieren, sicherstellend, dass eine gründliche Untersuchung von Testfehlern und Fehlern vor der Vorschlag von Reparaturen durchgeführt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar as causas raiz dos problemas técnicos usando a Lei de Ferro de NENHUMA CORREÇÃO SEM INVESTIGAÇÃO DA CAUSA RAIZ EM PRIMEIRO LUGAR, garantindo uma investigação minuciosa das falhas de teste e bugs antes de propor correções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять коренные причины технических проблем с помощью Железного закона НЕТ ИСПРАВЛЕНИЙ БЕЗ РАССЛЕДОВАНИЯ КОРЕННОЙ ПРИЧИНЫ СНАЧАЛА, обеспечивая тщательное расследование неисправностей тестирования и ошибок перед предложением исправлений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد الأسباب الجذرية للمشكلات الفنية باستخدام قانون الحديد لا إصلاح بدون تحقيق السبب الجذري أولاً، مما يضمن التحقيق الشامل لأخطاء الاختبار والعيوب قبل اقتراح الإصلاحات"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex software issues by systematically identifying root causes","Resolving test failures through methodical investigation and analysis","Analyzing and fixing bugs in codebases using a structured approach"],"zh":["通过系统地识别根源原因来调试复杂的软件问题","通过有条不紊的调查和分析来解决测试失败","使用结构化方法来分析和修复代码库中的错误"],"ja":["根本原因を体系的に特定することで複雑なソフトウェアの問題をデバッグする","方法的な調査と分析によってテストの失敗を解決する","構造化アプローチを使用してコードベース内のバグを分析および修復する"],"ko":["체계적으로 근본적인 원인을 식별함으로써 복잡한 소프트웨어 문제를 디버깅하는 것","체계적인 조사 및 분석을 통해 테스트 실패를 해결하는 것","구조화된 접근 방식을 사용하여 코드베이스 내의 버그를 분석 및 수정하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de software complejos identificando sistemáticamente las causas raíz","Resolución de fallos de prueba a través de una investigación y análisis metódicos","Análisis y reparación de errores en bases de código utilizando un enfoque estructurado"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes de logiciel complexes en identifiant systématiquement les causes profondes","Résolution des défaillances de test par le biais d''une investigation et d''une analyse méthodiques","Analyse et correction de bogues dans les bases de code en utilisant une approche structurée"],"de":["Fehlersuche bei komplexen Softwareproblemen durch systematische Identifizierung der Ursachen","Behebung von Testfehlern durch methodische Untersuchung und Analyse","Analyse und Behebung von Fehlern in Codebasen unter Verwendung eines strukturierten Ansatzes"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de software complexos identificando sistematicamente as causas raiz","Resolução de falhas de teste por meio de investigação e análise metódica","Análise e correção de bugs em repositórios de código usando uma abordagem estruturada"],"ru":["Отладка сложных проблем программного обеспечения путем систематического выявления коренных причин","Решение неисправностей тестирования посредством методического расследования и анализа","Анализ и исправление ошибок в базах кода с помощью структурированного подхода"],"ar":["فحص مشاكل برمجية معقدة من خلال تحديد الأسباب الجذرية بطريقة منهجية","حل أخطاء الاختبار من خلال التحقيق والتحليل المنهجي","تحليل وإصلاح العيوب في مخازن الشفرة البرمجية باستخدام نهج منظم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the Iron Law of systematic debugging","Must complete Phase 1 investigation before proposing fixes"],"zh":["需要遵守系统调试的铁律","必须完成第一阶段的调查后才能提出解决方案"],"ja":["体系的なデバッグの鉄則に従う必要がある","提案する前に第1段階の調査を完了する必要がある"],"ko":["체계적인 디버깅의 철칙을 따라야 함","제안하기 전에 第1단계의 조사 완료해야 함"],"es":["Requiere adherencia a la Ley de Hierro de la depuración sistemática","Debe completar la Fase 1 de la investigación antes de proponer soluciones"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à la Loi de Fer de la débogage systématique","Doit compléter la Phase 1 de l''enquête avant de proposer des correctifs"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des Eisernen Gesetzes der systematischen Fehlersuche","Muss Phase 1 der Untersuchung abschließen, bevor Reparaturen vorgeschlagen werden"],"pt":["Exige aderência à Lei de Ferro da depuração sistemática","Deve concluir a investigação da Fase 1 antes de propor correções"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения Железного закона систематической отладки","Необходимо завершить расследование Фазы 1, прежде чем предлагать исправления"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بقانون الحديد لعمليات الفحص المنهجية","يجب إكمال التحقيق في المرحلة 1 قبل اقتراح الإصلاحات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('filiphric/hydration-error-demo/replay-mcp', 'community', 'filiphric', 'hydration-error-demo', 'filiphric/hydration-error-demo', 'replay-mcp', 0, 0, 20, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z', '2026-02-18T09:19:59.885Z', NULL, '{"id":"filiphric/hydration-error-demo/replay-mcp","name":"replay-mcp","description":{"zh":"Replay MCP ","ja":"Replay MCP","ko":"Replay MCP ","es":"Replay MCP es una herramienta para inspeccionar grabaciones web y analizar el comportamiento de aplicaciones. Permite explorar y investigar el comportamiento de una aplicación como si se tuviera una máquina del tiempo.","fr":"Replay MCP est un outil pour inspecter des enregistrements web et analyser le comportement des applications. Il permet d''explorer et d''enquêter sur le comportement d''une application comme si on avait une machine à remonter le temps.","de":"Replay MCP ist ein Werkzeug zur Inspektion von Web-Aufzeichnungen und Analyse des Verhaltens von Anwendungen. Es ermöglicht die Exploration und Untersuchung des Verhaltens einer Anwendung, als hätte man eine Zeitmaschine.","pt":"Replay MCP é uma ferramenta para analisar gravações de aplicações web, permitindo explorar e investigar o comportamento da aplicação","ru":"Replay MCP - это инструмент для анализа записей веб-приложений, позволяющий исследовать и изучать поведение приложения","ar":"ريبلاي إم سي بي هو أداة لتحليل التسجيلات للتطبيقات الويب، مما يسمح باستكشاف ودراسة سلوك التطبيق","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Replay MCP ","ja":"Replay MCP","ko":"Replay MCP ","es":"Replay MCP: herramientas de inspección de grabaciones web","fr":"Replay MCP : outils d''inspection d''enregistrements web","de":"Replay MCP: Werkzeuge zur Inspektion von Web-Aufzeichnungen","pt":"Replay MCP: Ferramenta de Análise de Gravações","ru":"Replay MCP: Инструмент для анализа записей","ar":"ريبلاي إم سي بي: أداة تحليل التسجيلات","en":"replay-mcp"},"description":{"zh":"Replay MCP ","ja":"Replay MCP","ko":"Replay MCP ","es":"Replay MCP es una herramienta para inspeccionar grabaciones web y analizar el comportamiento de aplicaciones. Permite explorar y investigar el comportamiento...","fr":"Replay MCP est un outil pour inspecter des enregistrements web et analyser le comportement des applications. Il permet d''explorer et d''enquêter sur le compor...","de":"Replay MCP ist ein Werkzeug zur Inspektion von Web-Aufzeichnungen und Analyse des Verhaltens von Anwendungen. Es ermöglicht die Exploration und Untersuchung ...","pt":"Replay MCP é uma ferramenta para analisar gravações de aplicações web, permitindo explorar e investigar o comportamento da aplicação","ru":"Replay MCP - это инструмент для анализа записей веб-приложений, позволяющий исследовать и изучать поведение приложения","ar":"ريبلاي إم سي بي هو أداة لتحليل التسجيلات للتطبيقات الويب، مما يسمح باستكشاف ودراسة سلوك التطبيق","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Replay MCP","HTTPS","","Replay MCP","Replay MCP"],"ja":["Replay MCP","HTTPS","","Replay MCP","Replay MCP"],"ko":["Replay MCP","HTTPS","","Replay MCP","Replay MCP"],"es":["Inspección de grabaciones web","Análisis del comportamiento de aplicaciones","Exploración y investigación del comportamiento de aplicaciones","Resolución de preguntas sobre el comportamiento de aplicaciones","Uso de una máquina del tiempo para analizar el comportamiento de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Inspection d''enregistrements web","Analyse du comportement des applications","Exploration et enquête sur le comportement des applications","Résolution de questions sur le comportement des applications","Utilisation d''une machine à remonter le temps pour analyser le comportement des applications"],"de":["Inspektion von Web-Aufzeichnungen","Analyse des Verhaltens von Anwendungen","Exploration und Untersuchung des Verhaltens von Anwendungen","Beantwortung von Fragen zum Verhalten von Anwendungen","Verwendung einer Zeitmaschine zur Analyse des Verhaltens von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Análise de gravações de aplicações web","Investigação do comportamento da aplicação","Exploração de dados de gravação","Análise de problemas de desempenho","Depuração de erros"],"ru":["Анализ записей веб-приложений","Изучение поведения приложения","Изучение данных записи","Анализ проблем производительности","Отладка ошибок"],"ar":["تحليل التسجيلات للتطبيقات الويب","دراسة سلوك التطبيق","استكشاف بيانات التسجيل","تحليل مشاكل الأداء","تصحيح الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Replay MCP","HTTPS","Replay","MCP","Replay MCP","Replay"],"ja":["Replay MCP","HTTPS","Replay","MCP","Replay MCP","Replay"],"ko":["Replay MCP","HTTPS","Replay","MCP","Replay MCP","Replay"],"es":["Replay MCP","inspección de grabaciones web","análisis del comportamiento de aplicaciones","desarrollo web","herramientas de desarrollo","depuración de aplicaciones","análisis de rendimiento","optimización de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Replay MCP","inspection d''enregistrements web","analyse du comportement des applications","développement web","outils de développement","débogage d''applications","analyse de performances","optimisation d''applications"],"de":["Replay MCP","Inspektion von Web-Aufzeichnungen","Analyse des Verhaltens von Anwendungen","Web-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Fehlerbehebung von Anwendungen","Leistungsanalyse","Optimierung von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Replay MCP","análise de gravações","aplicações web","comportamento da aplicação","desempenho","depuração de erros"],"ru":["Replay MCP","анализ записей","веб-приложения","поведение приложения","производительность","отладка ошибок"],"ar":["ريبلاي إم سي بي","تحليل التسجيلات","التطبيقات الويب","سلوك التطبيق","الأداء","تصحيح الأخطاء"]}},"owner":"filiphric","repo":"hydration-error-demo","repoPath":"filiphric/hydration-error-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"replay-mcp","description":"Use Replay MCP to inspect the contents of https://replay.io recordings.","bodyPreview":"# Overview\n\nThis document provides an overview of the tools available when using Replay MCP\nand how to use these tools to investigate recordings.\n\nReplay MCP is used to inspect the contents of https://replay.io recordings.\nThese recordings perfectly capture everything that happened when a browser\nvisited an app or other web page. You can explore and investigate the app''s behavior\nas if you are a detective with a time machine.\n\nAny question about the app behaved can be answered precisely using da","body":"# Overview\n\nThis document provides an overview of the tools available when using Replay MCP\nand how to use these tools to investigate recordings.\n\nReplay MCP is used to inspect the contents of https://replay.io recordings.\nThese recordings perfectly capture everything that happened when a browser\nvisited an app or other web page. You can explore and investigate the app''s behavior\nas if you are a detective with a time machine.\n\nAny question about the app behaved can be answered precisely using data from the\nrecording. The most important thing to remember when using Replay MCP to investigate\na recording is to not jump to conclusions:\n\n1. Frame your task in the form of a question that you need to answer.\n1. Use exploratory tools to identify things that happened in the recording related\n   to the question.\n2. Use explanatory tools to understand why those things happened.\n3. Form a hypothesis and identify data you gathered which justifies that hypothesis.\n4. Explain the answer referring to the data supporting your conclusion.\n\n## Terms\n\nThe recording is essentially a gigantic database containing everything that happened\nwhile the app executed. A couple terms are useful for understanding this database:\n\n* Point: A specific point in the execution of the app. There is a unique point created\nfor every time a JS statement executes or any other interesting event with potential\nside effects on the app''s state.\n\n* Element: A reference for a particular DOM element that is independent of any particular point.\nEach DOM element has a lifetime for some portion of the recording.\n\n# Exploratory Tools\n\nExploratory tools are used to discover what happened in the recording and when.\n\n## Errors\n\nError tools identify major errors that occurred in the app which may cause it to break.\n\n* UncaughtException: An exception was thrown and not caught by anything.\n* ReactException: An exception was thrown while rendering a React component, causing the tree to unmount.\n\n## Timeline\n\nTimeline tools describe sequences of events for what happened across the recording.\n\n* Timeline: Combines data from other timeline tools to show interesting events in order.\n* ConsoleMessages: Shows all messages logged to the console.\n* LocalStorage: Shows all accesses made to local storage.\n* NetworkRequest: Shows all network requests made, or details about a specific request.\n* ReactRenders: Shows all React renders and the rendered components.\n\n## Sources\n\nSource tools get information about the JS sources in the app and what code executed.\nWhen showing source code in these and other tools, hit counts are shown for each line.\nA blank value is used for lines that have no breakpoints.\n\n* ListSources: Find source files by name.\n* ReadSource: Read the contents of a source and show what code executed.\n* SearchSources: Search the contents of all sources for a pattern and show what code executed.\n\n# Explanatory Tools\n\nExplanatory tools are used to understand why particular things happened in the recording.\n\n## Dependencies\n\nDependency tools track happens-before relationships between events in the recording.\nThis is useful to understand why particular events happened or didn''t happen.\n\n* GetStack: Show the on stack frames at a point.\n* ControlDependency: Describe the events in a recording that triggered execution of a point.\n\n## Details\n\nDetail tools show additional details about the app''s state at particular points.\n\n* DescribePoint: Describe a point''s location and variable values.\n* InspectElement: Describe a DOM element''s details.\n* ReactComponents: Describe the React component tree at a point.\n* Logpoint: Show the points and values of an expression every time a statement executed.\n* Evaluate: Evaluate an expression at a particular point.\n\n# Tips\n\nWhen understanding JS behavior it is a good idea to find code relevant to the question being answered,\nsee whether that code executed at all, and get details about the times when it executed.\nThe Logpoint tool is extremely useful for this: see the value of the same expression whenever a\nstatement executed, look for anything unexpected, and continue investigating from there.\n\nWhen understanding the timing around a particular event (e.g. why it happened later than desired),\nfind a point in the recording associated with the event and use the ControlDependency tool to explore\nthe events that had to happen first and any associated delays.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:19:59.885Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Analysis Agents needing advanced browser recording inspection capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级浏览器录制检查功能的Web分析代理。","ja":"Web分析エージェントが高度なブラウザレコーディングの検査機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 브라우저 녹화 검사 기능이 필요한 웹 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis web que necesitan capacidades de inspección de grabación de navegador avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Web nécessitant des capacités de surveillance de l''enregistrement du navigateur avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Browser-Aufzeichnungs-Inspektionsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise da Web que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de inspeção de gravação de navegador.","ru":"Идеально подходит для веб-агентов анализа, которым требуются продвинутые возможности инспекции записей браузера.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الويب التي تحتاج إلى khảيات متقدمة لتفحص تسجيل المتصفح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to precisely investigate app behavior using https://replay.io recordings, inspecting browser interactions and debugging issues with time-machine-like functionality via Replay MCP.","zh":"赋予代理精确调查应用程序行为的能力，使用https://replay.io录制，检查浏览器交互并通过Replay MCP的类时间机器功能调试问题。","ja":"エージェントに、https://replay.ioのレコーディングを使用して、アプリの動作を正確に調査し、ブラウザの相互作用を検査し、Replay MCPのタイムマシンような機能を介して問題をデバッグする能力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 https://replay.io 녹화를 사용하여 애플리케이션 동작을 정확하게 조사하고 브라우저 상호 작용을 검사하며 Replay MCP의 시간 머신 같은 기능을 통해 문제를 디버깅할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes investigar con precisión el comportamiento de las aplicaciones utilizando grabaciones de https://replay.io, inspeccionando las interacciones del navegador y depurando problemas con funcionalidad similar a una máquina del tiempo a través de Replay MCP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enquêter avec précision sur le comportement des applications en utilisant des enregistrements https://replay.io, en inspectant les interactions du navigateur et en déboguant les problèmes avec une fonctionnalité similaire à une machine à remonter le temps via Replay MCP.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, das Verhalten von Apps präzise zu untersuchen, indem sie Aufzeichnungen von https://replay.io verwenden, Browser-Interaktionen inspizieren und Probleme mit einer zeitschienenähnlichen Funktionalität über Replay MCP debuggen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a investigar com precisão o comportamento dos aplicativos usando gravações https://replay.io, inspecionando interações do navegador e depurando problemas com funcionalidade semelhante a uma máquina do tempo via Replay MCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью точно расследовать поведение приложений с помощью записей https://replay.io, инспектируя взаимодействия браузера и отлаживая проблемы с функциональностью, подобной машине времени, через Replay MCP.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من التحقيق بدقة في سلوك التطبيقات باستخدام تسجيلات https://replay.io، ويفحص التفاعلات المتصفح ويعمل على исправة المشاكل مع وظيفة شبيهة بالemachine الزمنية عبر Replay MCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Inspecting browser recordings","Debugging app behavior","Investigating web page interactions"],"zh":["检查浏览器录制","调试应用程序行为","调查网页交互"],"ja":["ブラウザレコーディングの検査","アプリの動作のデバッグ","ウェブページの相互作用の調査"],"ko":["브라우저 녹화 검사","애플리케이션 동작 디버깅","웹 페이지 상호 작용 조사"],"es":["Inspeccionar grabaciones del navegador","Depurar el comportamiento de la aplicación","Investigar interacciones de la página web"],"fr":["Inspecter les enregistrements du navigateur","Déboguer le comportement de l''application","Enquêter sur les interactions de la page Web"],"de":["Browser-Aufzeichnungen inspizieren","App-Verhalten debuggen","Webseiten-Interaktionen untersuchen"],"pt":["Inspecionar gravações de navegador","Depurar comportamento de aplicativos","Investigar interações de página da web"],"ru":["Просмотр записей браузера","Отладка поведения приложений","Расследование взаимодействий веб-страниц"],"ar":["استعراض تسجيلات المتصفح","تصحيح أخطاء سلوك التطبيقات","التحقيق في التفاعلات مع صفحات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to https://replay.io recordings","Replay MCP specific"],"zh":["需要访问https://replay.io录制","Replay MCP特定"],"ja":["https://replay.ioのレコーディングへのアクセスが必要","Replay MCP特有"],"ko":["https://replay.io 녹화에 대한 액세스가 필요","Replay MCP 특정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a grabaciones de https://replay.io","Específico de Replay MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux enregistrements https://replay.io","Spécifique à Replay MCP"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf https://replay.io-Aufzeichnungen","Replay MCP-spezifisch"],"pt":["Exige acesso a gravações https://replay.io","Específico do Replay MCP"],"ru":["Требует доступа к записям https://replay.io","Спецефичен для Replay MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تسجيلات https://replay.io","محدد لبرنامج Replay MCP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
