itación de requisitos","Especificación de calidad","Validación y trazabilidad","Definición de arquitectura y límites","Establecimiento de contratos explícitos","Separación de comportamiento de dominio y detalles de infraestructura"],"fr":["Élicitation des exigences","Spécification de qualité","Validation et traçabilité","Définition d''architecture et de limites","Établissement de contrats explicites","Séparation du comportement de domaine et des détails d''infrastructure"],"de":["Anforderungsermittlung","Qualitätsspezifikation","Validierung und Nachverfolgbarkeit","Definition von Architektur und Grenzen","Festlegung von expliziten Verträgen","Trennung von Domänenverhalten und Infrastrukturdetails"],"pt":["Elicitação de requisitos","Especificação de qualidade","Validação de requisitos","Rastreabilidade de requisitos","Definição de arquitetura e limites","Compatibilidade de política"],"ru":["Сбор требований","Спецификация качества","Проверка требований","Отслеживание требований","Определение архитектуры и границ","Политика совместимости"],"ar":["استخلاص المتطلبات","تصميم الجودة","تحقق المتطلبات","تمييز المتطلبات","تعريف الهندسة والحدود","سياسة التكامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["需求工程","系统需求分析","需求获取","规范质量","验证","可追溯性","架构决策","实现一致性"],"ja":["要件工学","システム要件分析","要件の取得","仕様の品質","検証","追跡可能性","アーキテクチャの決定","実装の一貫性"],"ko":["요구사항 엔지니어링","시스템 요구사항 분석","요구사항 도출","규격 품질","검증","추적 가능성","아키텍처 결정","구현 일관성"],"es":["ingeniería de requisitos","desarrollo de software","requisitos de sistema","análisis de requisitos","especificación de requisitos","validación de requisitos","trazabilidad de requisitos"],"fr":["ingénierie des exigences","développement de logiciels","exigences de système","analyse des exigences","spécification des exigences","validation des exigences","traçabilité des exigences"],"de":["Anforderungsingenieurwesen","Software-Entwicklung","Systemanforderungen","Anforderungsanalyse","Anforderungsspezifikation","Anforderungsvalidierung","Anforderungsnachverfolgung"],"pt":["engenharia de requisitos","requisitos de software","elicitação de requisitos","especificação de qualidade","validação de requisitos","rastreabilidade de requisitos","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["инженерия требований","требования программного обеспечения","сбор требований","спецификация качества","проверка требований","отслеживание требований","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["هندسة المتطلبات","متطلبات البرمجيات","استخلاص المتطلبات","تصميم الجودة","تحقق المتطلبات","تمييز المتطلبات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"KrystianYCSilva","repo":"hefesto-skill-generator","repoPath":"KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"requirements-engineering","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Requirements Engineering\n\nThis skill supports professional execution in: requirement elicitation, specification quality, validation, and traceability.\nUse it to keep architecture decisions explicit, implementation consistent, and operations reliable.\n\n## How to define architecture and boundaries\n\n- Establish explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership.\n- Keep domain behavior separate from infrastructure details and framework glue.\n- Define compatibility policy before intr","body":"# Requirements Engineering\n\nThis skill supports professional execution in: requirement elicitation, specification quality, validation, and traceability.\nUse it to keep architecture decisions explicit, implementation consistent, and operations reliable.\n\n## How to define architecture and boundaries\n\n- Establish explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership.\n- Keep domain behavior separate from infrastructure details and framework glue.\n- Define compatibility policy before introducing schema or contract changes.\n- Document tradeoffs and decisions in architecture records.\n\n## How to implement with Java and Kotlin\n\n- Prefer constructor injection and explicit DTOs in service boundaries.\n- Enforce nullability and serialization consistency between Java and Kotlin modules.\n- Keep cross-module interfaces small, typed, and version-aware.\n- Add contract tests for external integrations and critical internal boundaries.\n\n## How to operate and harden in production\n\n- Define SLOs and alert thresholds tied to user-facing outcomes.\n- Implement staged rollout and rollback strategy for every critical change.\n- Track dependency saturation, retries, and failure amplification indicators.\n- Keep runbooks updated with tested mitigation steps.\n\n## How to use extended references\n\n- Read [Version History](references/version-history.md) before upgrades, migrations, or compatibility decisions.\n- Read [Java and Kotlin Examples](references/java-kotlin-examples.md) for implementation-ready snippets and language-specific guidance.\n- Read [Advanced Techniques](references/advanced-techniques.md) for specialist playbooks, incident tactics, and performance patterns.\n\n## Common Warnings & Pitfalls\n\n- Architecture decisions are implicit and undocumented, causing long-term drift.\n- Operational controls are added late, increasing incident recovery time.\n- Compatibility strategy is missing for evolving integrations and schemas.\n- Quality gates are inconsistent across environments and release stages.\n\n## Common Errors and Fixes\n\n| Symptom | Root Cause | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| Production regression after deployment | Configuration or contract drift across environments | Add compatibility checks, staged rollout, and rollback criteria. |\n| Latency spikes under load | Missing timeout and backpressure policies | Define budgets, tune pools, and monitor saturation indicators. |\n| Integration failures after change | Versioning and contract tests not enforced | Apply contract governance and CI compatibility gates. |\n\n## Keywords\n\n- functional requirements\n- non-functional requirements\n- acceptance criteria\n- traceability\n- change control\n\n## References\n\n- [Official Documentation](https://www.iiba.org/standards-and-resources/babok/)\n- [Official Documentation](https://www.ireb.org/en/)\n- [Official Documentation](https://www.volere.org/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:20:27.888Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured requirement elicitation and specification quality assurance.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化需求获取和规格质量保证的开发代理。","ja":"構造化された要件の取得と仕様の品質保証が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 요구사항 도출과 사양 품질 보증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una elicitation de requisitos estructurada y una aseguramiento de la calidad de la especificación.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin d''une élicitation de requisits structurée et d''une assurance de la qualité de la spécification.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel benötigende strukturierte Anforderungsermittlung und Spezifikationsqualitätssicherung.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de elicitação de requisitos estruturada e garantia de qualidade de especificação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима структурированная выявление требований и обеспечение качества спецификации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى استخلاص متطلبات منظم وضمان جودة المواصفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to establish explicit contracts for core interfaces, data flows, and ownership, ensuring implementation consistency and operations reliability through requirement validation and traceability, following the agentskills.io standard.","zh":"赋予代理建立核心接口、数据流和所有权的明确合同，通过需求验证和可追溯性确保实现的一致性和操作的可靠性，遵循agentskills.io标准。","ja":"コアインターフェイス、データフロー、所有権の明示的な契約をエージェントが確立できるようにし、要件の検証と追跡可能性を通じて、実装の一貫性と運用の信頼性を確保します。これは、agentskills.ioの標準に従ったものです。","ko":"핵심 인터페이스, 데이터 흐름 및 소유권에 대한 명확한 계약을 에이전트가 설정할 수 있도록 하여 요구사항 검증 및 추적 가능성을 통해 구현 일관성 및 운영 신뢰성을 보장하며, agentskills.io 표준을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a establecer contratos explícitos para interfaces básicas, flujos de datos y propiedad, garantizando la consistencia de implementación y la confiabilidad de las operaciones a través de la validación y trazabilidad de requisitos, siguiendo el estándar agentskills.io.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''établir des contrats explicites pour les interfaces de base, les flux de données et la propriété, assurant ainsi la cohérence de la mise en œuvre et la fiabilité des opérations grâce à la validation et à la traçabilité des exigences, suivant la norme agentskills.io.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, explizite Verträge für Kernschnittstellen, Datenflüsse und Eigentum zu etablieren, um die Implementierungskonsistenz und die Betriebssicherheit durch Anforderungsvalidierung und Nachvollziehbarkeit sicherzustellen, unter Einhaltung des agentskills.io-Standards.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estabelecer contratos explícitos para interfaces centrais, fluxos de dados e propriedade, garantindo a consistência da implementação e a confiabilidade das operações por meio da validação e rastreabilidade dos requisitos, seguindo o padrão agentskills.io.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устанавливать явные контракты для основных интерфейсов, потоков данных и собственности, обеспечивая последовательность реализации и надежность эксплуатации посредством проверки и отслеживаемости требований, в соответствии со стандартом agentskills.io.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء عقود صريحة للواجهات الأساسية وحركة البيانات والملكية، مما يضمن συνέ협ية التنفيذ وموثوقية العمليات من خلال التحقق والقابلية للتسلسل للمتطلبات، اتباعًا لمعيار agentskills.io."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining architecture and boundaries for complex systems","Validating requirements for consistency and completeness","Ensuring traceability of implementation to initial requirements"],"zh":["定义复杂系统的架构和边界","验证需求的一致性和完整性","确保实现到初始需求的可追溯性"],"ja":["複雑なシステムのアーキテクチャと境界の定義","要件の一貫性と完全性の検証","実装から初期要件への可追跡性の確保"],"ko":["복잡한 시스템의 아키텍처 및 경계 정의","요구사항 일관성 및 완전성 검증","구현에서 초기 요구사항까지의 추적 가능성 보장"],"es":["Definir la arquitectura y los límites para sistemas complejos","Validar requisitos para la coherencia y la completitud","Garantizar la trazabilidad de la implementación a los requisitos iniciales"],"fr":["Définir l''architecture et les limites pour les systèmes complexes","Valider les exigences pour la cohérence et l''exhaustivité","Assurer la traçabilité de la mise en œuvre aux exigences initiales"],"de":["Definieren der Architektur und der Grenzen für komplexe Systeme","Validieren der Anforderungen für Konsistenz und Vollständigkeit","Sicherstellen der Nachvollziehbarkeit der Implementierung zu den ursprünglichen Anforderungen"],"pt":["Definir arquitetura e limites para sistemas complexos","Validar requisitos para consistência e completude","Garantir rastreabilidade da implementação para requisitos iniciais"],"ru":["Определение архитектуры и границ для сложных систем","Проверка требований на последовательность и полноту","Обеспечение отслеживаемости реализации к первоначальным требованиям"],"ar":["تحديد الهيكل والمحددات لنظم معقدة","التحقق من المتطلبات للاستمرارية والكامل","ضمان القابلية للتسلسل لتنفيذ المتطلبات الأولية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to agentskills.io standard","Domain behavior separation from infrastructure details necessary"],"zh":["需要遵循agentskills.io标准","需要将领域行为与基础设施细节分离"],"ja":["agentskills.ioの標準に従う必要がある","ドメインの動作とインフラストラクチャの詳細を分離する必要がある"],"ko":["agentskills.io 표준을 따라야 함","도메인 동작과 인프라스트ラク처 세부 사항을 분리해야 함"],"es":["Requiere adherirse al estándar agentskills.io","Separación del comportamiento del dominio de los detalles de infraestructura necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite de se conformer à la norme agentskills.io","Séparation du comportement de domaine des détails d''infrastructure nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des agentskills.io-Standards","Trennung des Domänenverhaltens von den Infrastrukturdetails erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao padrão agentskills.io","Separação do comportamento do domínio de detalhes de infraestrutura necessária"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения стандарта agentskills.io","Необходимо разделение поведения домена от деталей инфраструктуры"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمعيار agentskills.io","فصل سلوك المجال من تفاصيل البنية التحتية ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
