","es":"Automatiza tus pruebas de aplicaciones web con scripts de Python para tests de navegador y accesibilidad","fr":"Automatisez vos tests d''applications web avec des scripts Python pour les tests de navigateur et l''accessibilité","de":"Automatisieren Sie Ihre Web-App-Tests mit Python-Skripten für Browser-Tests und Barrierefreiheit","pt":"O teste de aplicativos web é fundamental para garantir a qualidade e a estabilidade do seu aplicativo. Com scripts de runtime, você pode automatizar os teste...","ru":"Тестирование веб-приложений имеет важное значение для обеспечения качества и стабильности вашего приложения. С помощью скриптов runtime вы можете автоматизир...","ar":"اختبار تطبيقات الويب ضروري لضمان جودة واستقرار تطبيقك. مع سكريبتات زمن التشغيل، يمكنك تطبيق الاختبارات بالكامل وتترك ничего بدون اختبار.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化浏览器测试","支持截图功能","支持无障碍检查","可自定义测试脚本","支持多种浏览器"],"ja":["自動化ブラウザーテスト","スクリーンショット機能のサポート","アクセシビリティーのチェックのサポート","テストスクリプトのカスタマイズ","複数ブラウザーのサポート"],"ko":["자동화 브라우저 테스트","스크린샷 기능 지원","접근성 확인 지원","테스트 스크립트 커스터마이징","다중 브라우저 지원"],"es":["Ejecución de tests de navegador automatizados","Captura de pantalla para análisis visual","Comprobación de accesibilidad para cumplir con los estándares","Personalización de scripts para adaptarse a necesidades específicas","Compatibilidad con múltiples navegadores y sistemas operativos"],"fr":["Exécution de tests de navigateur automatisés","Capture d''écran pour analyse visuelle","Vérification de l''accessibilité pour respecter les normes","Personnalisation de scripts pour s''adapter à des besoins spécifiques","Compatibilité avec plusieurs navigateurs et systèmes d''exploitation"],"de":["Ausführung von automatisierten Browser-Tests","Bildschirmaufnahme für visuelle Analyse","Überprüfung der Barrierefreiheit zur Einhaltung der Standards","Anpassung von Skripten an spezifische Anforderungen","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Browsern und Betriebssystemen"],"pt":["Testes automatizados de navegador","Captura de tela para depuração","Verificação de acessibilidade","Execução de scripts de runtime","Testes de funcionalidade e estabilidade"],"ru":["Автоматизированное тестирование браузера","Сделать скриншот для отладки","Проверка доступности","Выполнение скриптов runtime","Тестирование функциональности и стабильности"],"ar":["اختبارات متصفح خود động","التقاط الشاشة لتصحيح الأخطاء","فحص إمكانية الوصول","تشغيل سكريبتات زمن التشغيل","اختبارات الوظائف والاستقرار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web应用程序测试","自动化浏览器测试","截图功能","无障碍检查","测试脚本","浏览器兼容性","Web开发","测试工具"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションテスト","自動化ブラウザーテスト","スクリーンショット","アクセシビリティー","テストスクリプト","ブラウザーの互換性","Web開発","テストツール"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션 테스트","자동화 브라우저 테스트","스크린샷","접근성","테스트 스크립트","브라우저 호환성","웹 개발","테스트 도구"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones web","automatización de tests","tests de navegador","accesibilidad web","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","testing de software"],"fr":["tests d''applications web","automatisation de tests","tests de navigateur","accessibilité web","développement d''applications web","test de logiciel"],"de":["Web-App-Tests","Automatisierung von Browser-Tests","Barrierefreiheit","Web-Entwicklung","Software-Testen","Automatisierte Tests"],"pt":["teste de aplicativos web","automatização de testes","scripts de runtime","testes de navegador","acessibilidade","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web","qualidade de software","estabilidade de aplicativos"],"ru":["тестирование веб-приложений","автоматизация тестирования","скрипты runtime","тестирование браузера","доступность","разработка веб-приложений","качество программного обеспечения","стабильность приложений"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب","الآليّة للاختبارات","سكريبتات زمن التشغيل","اختبارات المتصفح","إمكانية الوصول","تطوير تطبيقات الويب","جودة البرمجيات","استقرار التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"cyhinverse","repo":"YiBu","repoPath":"cyhinverse/YiBu","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Web application testing principles. E2E, Playwright, deep audit strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Web App Testing\n\n> Discover and test everything. Leave no route untested.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for automated browser testing:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/playwright_runner.py` | Basic browser test | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py https://example.com` |\n| | With screenshot | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --screenshot` |\n| | Accessibility check | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --a11y` |\n\n**Requires:** `","body":"# Web App Testing\n\n> Discover and test everything. Leave no route untested.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for automated browser testing:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/playwright_runner.py` | Basic browser test | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py https://example.com` |\n| | With screenshot | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --screenshot` |\n| | Accessibility check | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --a11y` |\n\n**Requires:** `pip install playwright && playwright install chromium`\n\n---\n\n## 1. Deep Audit Approach\n\n### Discovery First\n\n| Target | How to Find |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Routes | Scan app/, pages/, router files |\n| API endpoints | Grep for HTTP methods |\n| Components | Find component directories |\n| Features | Read documentation |\n\n### Systematic Testing\n\n1. **Map** - List all routes/APIs\n2. **Scan** - Verify they respond\n3. **Test** - Cover critical paths\n\n---\n\n## 2. Testing Pyramid for Web\n\n```\n        /\\          E2E (Few)\n       /  \\         Critical user flows\n      /----\\\n     /      \\       Integration (Some)\n    /--------\\      API, data flow\n   /          \\\n  /------------\\    Component (Many)\n                    Individual UI pieces\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. E2E Test Principles\n\n### What to Test\n\n| Priority | Tests |\n|----------|-------|\n| 1 | Happy path user flows |\n| 2 | Authentication flows |\n| 3 | Critical business actions |\n| 4 | Error handling |\n\n### E2E Best Practices\n\n| Practice | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| Use data-testid | Stable selectors |\n| Wait for elements | Avoid flaky tests |\n| Clean state | Independent tests |\n| Avoid implementation details | Test user behavior |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Playwright Principles\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Page Object Model | Encapsulate page logic |\n| Fixtures | Reusable test setup |\n| Assertions | Built-in auto-wait |\n| Trace Viewer | Debug failures |\n\n### Configuration\n\n| Setting | Recommendation |\n|---------|----------------|\n| Retries | 2 on CI |\n| Trace | on-first-retry |\n| Screenshots | on-failure |\n| Video | retain-on-failure |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Visual Testing\n\n### When to Use\n\n| Scenario | Value |\n|----------|-------|\n| Design system | High |\n| Marketing pages | High |\n| Component library | Medium |\n| Dynamic content | Lower |\n\n### Strategy\n\n- Baseline screenshots\n- Compare on changes\n- Review visual diffs\n- Update intentional changes\n\n---\n\n## 6. API Testing Principles\n\n### Coverage Areas\n\n| Area | Tests |\n|------|-------|\n| Status codes | 200, 400, 404, 500 |\n| Response shape | Matches schema |\n| Error messages | User-friendly |\n| Edge cases | Empty, large, special chars |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Test Organization\n\n### File Structure\n\n```\ntests/\n├── e2e/           # Full user flows\n├── integration/   # API, data\n├── component/     # UI units\n└── fixtures/      # Shared data\n```\n\n### Naming Convention\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Feature-based | `login.spec.ts` |\n| Descriptive | `user-can-checkout.spec.ts` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. CI Integration\n\n### Pipeline Steps\n\n1. Install dependencies\n2. Install browsers\n3. Run tests\n4. Upload artifacts (traces, screenshots)\n\n### Parallelization\n\n| Strategy | Use |\n|----------|-----|\n| Per file | Playwright default |\n| Sharding | Large suites |\n| Workers | Multiple browsers |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Test implementation | Test behavior |\n| Hardcode waits | Use auto-wait |\n| Skip cleanup | Isolate tests |\n| Ignore flaky tests | Fix root cause |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** E2E tests are expensive. Use them for critical paths only.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:20:34.039Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automated Testing Agents needing advanced browser testing capabilities with Playwright","zh":"非常适合需要高级浏览器测试功能的自动化测试代理，具有 Playwright 浏览器测试能力","ja":"Playwright を使用した高度なブラウザテスト機能を必要とする自動テストエージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright를 사용한 고급 브라우저 테스트 기능이 필요한 자동화 테스트 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Pruebas Automatizadas que necesitan capacidades de prueba de navegador avanzadas con Playwright","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Test Automatisés ayant besoin de capacités de test de navigateur avancées avec Playwright","de":"Perfekt für automatisierte Testagenten, die erweiterte Browser-Testfunktionen mit Playwright benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Testes Automatizados que necessitam de capacidades de teste de navegador avançadas com Playwright","ru":"Идеально для автоматизированных агентов тестирования, которым требуются расширенные возможности тестирования браузера с помощью Playwright","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين للاختبار الذين يحتاجون إلى возможات متقدمة لاختبار المتصفح باستخدام Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute automated browser tests with screenshot and accessibility check capabilities using Python and the Playwright library, supporting protocols like HTTPS and handling various URLs","zh":"赋予代理执行自动化浏览器测试的能力，包括截图和无障碍检查功能，使用 Python 和 Playwright 库，支持 HTTPS 等协议，处理各种 URL","ja":"Python と Playwright ライブラリを使用して、スクリーンショットとアクセシビリティチェック機能を備えた自動ブラウザテストを実行するエージェントを可能にし、HTTPS などのプロトコルをサポートし、さまざまな URL を処理","ko":"Python 및 Playwright 라이브러리를 사용하여 스크린샷 및 접근성 확인 기능을 갖춘 자동화 브라우저 테스트를 실행할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 HTTPS 등의 프로토콜을 지원하고 다양한 URL을 처리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas de navegador automatizadas con capacidades de captura de pantalla y comprobación de accesibilidad utilizando Python y la biblioteca Playwright, que admite protocolos como HTTPS y maneja varias URLs","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests de navigateur automatisés avec des fonctionnalités de capture d''écran et de vérification d''accessibilité en utilisant Python et la bibliothèque Playwright, qui prend en charge des protocoles comme HTTPS et gère différentes URL","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, automatisierte Browser-Tests mit Screenshot- und Barrierefreiheitsprüffunktionen auszuführen, indem sie Python und die Playwright-Bibliothek verwenden, die Protokolle wie HTTPS unterstützt und verschiedene URLs handhabt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes de navegador automatizados com capacidades de captura de tela e verificação de acessibilidade usando Python e a biblioteca Playwright, suportando protocolos como HTTPS e lidando com vários URLs","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять автоматизированные тесты браузера с возможностями создания скриншотов и проверки доступности, используя Python и библиотеку Playwright, поддерживая протоколы, такие как HTTPS, и обрабатывая различные URL-адреса","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل الاختبارات المتصفح الآلية مع القدرات على التقاط الشاشة وفحص سهولة الوصول باستخدام بايثون ومكتبة Playwright، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS ومعالجة عناوين URL المختلفة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser testing for web applications","Generating screenshots for visual regression testing","Debugging accessibility issues with a11y checks"],"zh":["为 Web 应用程序自动化浏览器测试","生成截图用于视觉回归测试","使用 a11y 检查调试无障碍问题"],"ja":["Web アプリケーションのブラウザテストを自動化する","ビジュアル回帰テスト用のスクリーンショットを生成する","a11y チェックを使用してアクセシビリティの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 브라우저 테스트 자동화","시각적 회귀 테스트를 위한 스크린샷 생성","a11y 확인을 사용한 접근성 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de navegador para aplicaciones web","Generación de capturas de pantalla para pruebas de regresión visual","Depuración de problemas de accesibilidad con comprobaciones de a11y"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de navigateur pour les applications Web","Génération de captures d''écran pour les tests de régression visuelle","Débogage des problèmes d''accessibilité avec des vérifications a11y"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browser-Tests für Webanwendungen","Erzeugung von Screenshots für visuelle Regressionstests","Fehlerbehebung bei Barrierefreiheitsproblemen mit a11y-Prüfungen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de navegador para aplicações web","Gerar capturas de tela para testes de regressão visual","Depurar problemas de acessibilidade com verificações de a11y"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования браузера для веб-приложений","Генерация скриншотов для визуального тестирования регрессии","Отладка проблем доступности с помощью проверок a11y"],"ar":["تحسين اختبارات المتصفح الآلية لتطبيقات الويب","إنشاء لقطات شاشة لاختبارات الانحدار المرئي","تصحيح أخطاء سهولة الوصول باستخدام فحوصات a11y"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Playwright installation needed","Limited to browser testing with provided scripts"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境","需要安装 Playwright","仅限于使用提供的脚本进行浏览器测试"],"ja":["Python 環境が必要","Playwright のインストールが必要","提供されたスクリプトを使用したブラウザテストに限定される"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요","Playwright 설치가 필요","제공된 스크립트를 사용한 브라우저 테스트에 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Se necesita instalación de Playwright","Limitado a pruebas de navegador con scripts proporcionados"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","L''installation de Playwright est nécessaire","Limité aux tests de navigateur avec les scripts fournis"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Playwright-Installation erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Browser-Tests mit bereitgestellten Skripten"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Instalação do Playwright necessária","Limitado a testes de navegador com scripts fornecidos"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Необходимо установить Playwright","Ограничен тестированием браузера с помощью предоставленных скриптов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","تحتاج إلى تثبيت Playwright","محدود باختبارات المتصفح باستخدام البرامج النصية المقدمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/anti-reversing-techniques', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'anti-reversing-techniques', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z', '2026-02-18T09:20:39.229Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/anti-reversing-techniques","name":"anti-reversing-techniques","description":{"zh":"反逆向技术是一种保护软件免受逆向工程的安全技术，需要验证授权和合法性","ja":"反逆向技術は、ソフトウェアを逆向きエンジニアリングから保護するためのセキュリティ技術です。認証と合法性の確認が必要です","ko":"역추적 차단 기술은 소프트웨어를 역추적 공학에서 보호하기 위한 보안 기술입니다. 인증 및 법적 준수를 확인해야 합니다","es":"Técnicas anti-reversing para proteger el software contra el análisis y la ingeniería inversa. Aprende a implementar estas técnicas para asegurar tu código","fr":"Techniques anti-reversing pour protéger les logiciels contre l''analyse et l''ingénierie inverse. Apprenez à mettre en œuvre ces techniques pour sécuriser votre code","de":"Anti-Reversing-Techniken zum Schutz von Software vor Analyse und Reverse-Engineering. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese Techniken implementieren, um Ihren Code zu sichern","pt":"Técnicas anti-reversing são métodos utilizados para proteger códigos contra engenharia reversa. São essenciais para desenvolvedores que desejam manter sua propriedade intelectual segura.","ru":"Техники анти-реверс-инжиниринга являются методами, используемыми для защиты кодов от обратной разработки. Они необходимы для разработчиков, которые хотят сохранить свою интеллектуальную собственность в безопасности.","ar":"تقنيات مكافحة العكس هي طرق تستخدم لحماية الرموز من الهندسة العكسية. هي أساسية لمطوري الذين يرغبون في الحفاظ على ملكية فكرية آمنة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"反逆向技术","ja":"反逆向技術","ko":"역추적 차단 기술","es":"Técnicas anti-reversing para desarrolladores","fr":"Techniques anti-reversing pour les développeurs","de":"Anti-Reversing-Techniken für Entwickler","pt":"Técnicas Anti-Reversing: Proteja Seu Código","ru":"Техники Анти-Реверс-Инжиниринга: Защитите Свой Код","ar":"تقنيات مكافحة العكس: حمي رمزك","en":"anti-reversing-techniques"},"description":{"zh":"反逆向技术是一种保护软件免受逆向工程的安全技术，需要验证授权和合法性","ja":"反逆向技術は、ソフトウェアを逆向きエンジニアリングから保護するためのセキュリティ技術です。認証と合法性の確認が必要です","ko":"역추적 차단 기술은 소프트웨어를 역추적 공학에서 보호하기 위한 보안 기술입니다. 인증 및 법적 준수를 확인해야 합니다","es":"Técnicas anti-reversing para proteger el software contra el análisis y la ingeniería inversa. Aprende a implementar estas técnicas para asegurar tu código","fr":"Techniques anti-reversing pour protéger les logiciels contre l''analyse et l''ingénierie inverse. Apprenez à mettre en œuvre ces techniques pour sécuriser votr...","de":"Anti-Reversing-Techniken zum Schutz von Software vor Analyse und Reverse-Engineering. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie diese Techniken implementieren, um Ihren Code zu ...","pt":"Técnicas anti-reversing são métodos utilizados para proteger códigos contra engenharia reversa. São essenciais para desenvolvedores que desejam manter sua pr...","ru":"Техники анти-реверс-инжиниринга являются методами, используемыми для защиты кодов от обратной разработки. Они необходимы для разработчиков, которые хотят сох...","ar":"تقنيات مكافحة العكس هي طرق تستخدم لحماية الرموز من الهندسة العكسية. هي أساسية لمطوري الذين يرغبون في الحفاظ على ملكية فكرية آمنة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["验证授权","记录范围","合规法律","防止逆向工程","保护软件安全"],"ja":["認証の確認","範囲の記録","法令遵守","逆向きエンジニアリングの防止","ソフトウェアのセキュリティ保護"],"ko":["인증 확인","범위 기록","법적 준수","역추적 공학 방지","소프트웨어 보안 보호"],"es":["Técnicas de ofuscamiento de código","Protección contra ingeniería inversa","Métodos de detección de depuradores","Técnicas de anti-debugging","Protección de datos sensibles"],"fr":["Techniques de brouillage de code","Protection contre l''ingénierie inverse","Méthodes de détection de débogueurs","Techniques d''anti-debugging","Protection des données sensibles"],"de":["Techniken zur Verschleierung von Code","Schutz vor Reverse-Engineering","Methoden zur Erkennung von Debuggern","Techniken zum Anti-Debugging","Schutz von sensiblen Daten"],"pt":["Verificação de autorização","Documentação de escopo","Conformidade legal","Técnicas de ofuscação","Proteção contra engenharia reversa","Análise de segurança"],"ru":["Проверка авторизации","Документация области","Юридическая соответствие","Техники офускации","Защита от обратной разработки","Анализ безопасности"],"ar":["التحقق من التصريح","توثيق النطاق","الامتثال القانوني","تقنيات التعتيم","حماية من الهندسة العكسية","تحليل الأمان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["反逆向技术","软件安全","逆向工程","授权验证","法律合规"],"ja":["反逆向技術","ソフトウェアのセキュリティ","逆向きエンジニアリング","認証の確認","法令遵守"],"ko":["역추적 차단 기술","소프트웨어 보안","역추적 공학","인증 확인","법적 준수"],"es":["técnicas anti-reversing","protección de software","ingeniería inversa","análisis de software","seguridad de código","ofuscamiento de código"],"fr":["techniques anti-reversing","protection de logiciels","ingénierie inverse","analyse de logiciels","sécurité de code","brouillage de code"],"de":["Anti-Reversing-Techniken","Schutz von Software","Reverse-Engineering","Software-Analyse","Code-Sicherheit","Code-Verschleierung"],"pt":["técnicas anti-reversing","proteção de código","engenharia reversa","segurança de software","desenvolvimento de software","proteção de propriedade intelectual","autorização de software","conformidade legal"],"ru":["техники анти-реверс-инжиниринга","защита кода","обратная разработка","безопасность программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","защита интеллектуальной собственности","авторизация программного обеспечения","юридическая соответствие"],"ar":["تقنيات مكافحة العكس","حماية الرمز","الهندسة العكسية","أمان البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","حماية الملكية الفكرية","تصريح البرمجيات","الامتثال القانوني"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"anti-reversing-techniques","description":"Understand anti-reversing, obfuscation, and protection techniques encountered during software analysis. Use when analyzing protected binaries, bypassing anti-debugging for authorized analysis, or understanding software protection mechanisms.","bodyPreview":"> **AUTHORIZED USE ONLY**: This skill contains dual-use security techniques. Before proceeding with any bypass or analysis:\n>\n> 1. **Verify authorization**: Confirm you have explicit written permission from the software owner, or are operating within a legitimate security context (CTF, authorized pentest, malware analysis, security research)\n> 2. **Document scope**: Ensure your activities fall within the defined scope of your authorization\n> 3. **Legal compliance**: Understand that unauthorized","body":"> **AUTHORIZED USE ONLY**: This skill contains dual-use security techniques. Before proceeding with any bypass or analysis:\n>\n> 1. **Verify authorization**: Confirm you have explicit written permission from the software owner, or are operating within a legitimate security context (CTF, authorized pentest, malware analysis, security research)\n> 2. **Document scope**: Ensure your activities fall within the defined scope of your authorization\n> 3. **Legal compliance**: Understand that unauthorized bypassing of software protection may violate laws (CFAA, DMCA anti-circumvention, etc.)\n>\n> **Legitimate use cases**: Malware analysis, authorized penetration testing, CTF competitions, academic security research, analyzing software you own/have rights to\n\n# Anti-Reversing Techniques\n\nUnderstanding protection mechanisms encountered during authorized software analysis, security research, and malware analysis. This knowledge helps analysts bypass protections to complete legitimate analysis tasks.\n\n## Anti-Debugging Techniques\n\n### Windows Anti-Debugging\n\n#### API-Based Detection\n\n```c\n// IsDebuggerPresent\nif (IsDebuggerPresent()) {\n    exit(1);\n}\n\n// CheckRemoteDebuggerPresent\nBOOL debugged = FALSE;\nCheckRemoteDebuggerPresent(GetCurrentProcess(), &debugged);\nif (debugged) exit(1);\n\n// NtQueryInformationProcess\ntypedef NTSTATUS (NTAPI *pNtQueryInformationProcess)(\n    HANDLE, PROCESSINFOCLASS, PVOID, ULONG, PULONG);\n\nDWORD debugPort = 0;\nNtQueryInformationProcess(\n    GetCurrentProcess(),\n    ProcessDebugPort,        // 7\n    &debugPort,\n    sizeof(debugPort),\n    NULL\n);\nif (debugPort != 0) exit(1);\n\n// Debug flags\nDWORD debugFlags = 0;\nNtQueryInformationProcess(\n    GetCurrentProcess(),\n    ProcessDebugFlags,       // 0x1F\n    &debugFlags,\n    sizeof(debugFlags),\n    NULL\n);\nif (debugFlags == 0) exit(1);  // 0 means being debugged\n```\n\n**Bypass Approaches:**\n\n```python\n# x64dbg: ScyllaHide plugin\n# Patches common anti-debug checks\n\n# Manual patching in debugger:\n# - Set IsDebuggerPresent return to 0\n# - Patch PEB.BeingDebugged to 0\n# - Hook NtQueryInformationProcess\n\n# IDAPython: Patch checks\nida_bytes.patch_byte(check_addr, 0x90)  # NOP\n```\n\n#### PEB-Based Detection\n\n```c\n// Direct PEB access\n#ifdef _WIN64\n    PPEB peb = (PPEB)__readgsqword(0x60);\n#else\n    PPEB peb = (PPEB)__readfsdword(0x30);\n#endif\n\n// BeingDebugged flag\nif (peb->BeingDebugged) exit(1);\n\n// NtGlobalFlag\n// Debugged: 0x70 (FLG_HEAP_ENABLE_TAIL_CHECK |\n//                 FLG_HEAP_ENABLE_FREE_CHECK |\n//                 FLG_HEAP_VALIDATE_PARAMETERS)\nif (peb->NtGlobalFlag & 0x70) exit(1);\n\n// Heap flags\nPDWORD heapFlags = (PDWORD)((PBYTE)peb->ProcessHeap + 0x70);\nif (*heapFlags & 0x50000062) exit(1);\n```\n\n**Bypass Approaches:**\n\n```assembly\n; In debugger, modify PEB directly\n; x64dbg: dump at gs:[60] (x64) or fs:[30] (x86)\n; Set BeingDebugged (offset 2) to 0\n; Clear NtGlobalFlag (offset 0xBC for x64)\n```\n\n#### Timing-Based Detection\n\n```c\n// RDTSC timing\nuint64_t start = __rdtsc();\n// ... some code ...\nuint64_t end = __rdtsc();\nif ((end - start) > THRESHOLD) exit(1);\n\n// QueryPerformanceCounter\nLARGE_INTEGER start, end, freq;\nQueryPerformanceFrequency(&freq);\nQueryPerformanceCounter(&start);\n// ... code ...\nQueryPerformanceCounter(&end);\ndouble elapsed = (double)(end.QuadPart - start.QuadPart) / freq.QuadPart;\nif (elapsed > 0.1) exit(1);  // Too slow = debugger\n\n// GetTickCount\nDWORD start = GetTickCount();\n// ... code ...\nif (GetTickCount() - start > 1000) exit(1);\n```\n\n**Bypass Approaches:**\n\n```\n- Use hardware breakpoints instead of software\n- Patch timing checks\n- Use VM with controlled time\n- Hook timing APIs to return consistent values\n```\n\n#### Exception-Based Detection\n\n```c\n// SEH-based detection\n__try {\n    __asm { int 3 }  // Software breakpoint\n}\n__except(EXCEPTION_EXECUTE_HANDLER) {\n    // Normal execution: exception caught\n    return;\n}\n// Debugger ate the exception\nexit(1);\n\n// VEH-based detection\nLONG CALLBACK VectoredHandler(PEXCEPTION_POINTERS ep) {\n    if (ep->ExceptionRecord->ExceptionCode == EXCEPTION_BREAKPOINT) {\n        ep->ContextRecord->Rip++;  // Skip INT3\n        return EXCEPTION_CONTINUE_EXECUTION;\n    }\n    return EXCEPTION_CONTINUE_SEARCH;\n}\n```\n\n### Linux Anti-Debugging\n\n```c\n// ptrace self-trace\nif (ptrace(PTRACE_TRACEME, 0, NULL, NULL) == -1) {\n    // Already being traced\n    exit(1);\n}\n\n// /proc/self/status\nFILE *f = fopen(\"/proc/self/status\", \"r\");\nchar line[256];\nwhile (fgets(line, sizeof(line), f)) {\n    if (strncmp(line, \"TracerPid:\", 10) == 0) {\n        int tracer_pid = atoi(line + 10);\n        if (tracer_pid != 0) exit(1);\n    }\n}\n\n// Parent process check\nif (getppid() != 1 && strcmp(get_process_name(getppid()), \"bash\") != 0) {\n    // Unusual parent (might be debugger)\n}\n```\n\n**Bypass Approaches:**\n\n```bash\n# LD_PRELOAD to hook ptrace\n# Compile: gcc -shared -fPIC -o hook.so hook.c\nlong ptrace(int request, ...) {\n    return 0;  // Always succeed\n}\n\n# Usage\nLD_PRELOAD=./hook.so ./target\n```\n\n## Anti-VM Detection\n\n### Hardware Fingerprinting\n\n```c\n// CPUID-based detection\nint cpuid_info[4];\n__cpuid(cpuid_info, 1);\n// Check hypervisor bit (bit 31 of ECX)\nif (cpuid_info[2] & (1 << 31)) {\n    // Running in hypervisor\n}\n\n// CPUID brand string\n__cpuid(cpuid_info, 0x40000000);\nchar vendor[13] = {0};\nmemcpy(vendor, &cpuid_info[1], 12);\n// \"VMwareVMware\", \"Microsoft Hv\", \"KVMKVMKVM\", \"VBoxVBoxVBox\"\n\n// MAC address prefix\n// VMware: 00:0C:29, 00:50:56\n// VirtualBox: 08:00:27\n// Hyper-V: 00:15:5D\n```\n\n### Registry/File Detection\n\n```c\n// Windows registry keys\n// HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\VMware, Inc.\\VMware Tools\n// HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Oracle\\VirtualBox Guest Additions\n// HKLM\\HARDWARE\\ACPI\\DSDT\\VBOX__\n\n// Files\n// C:\\Windows\\System32\\drivers\\vmmouse.sys\n// C:\\Windows\\System32\\drivers\\vmhgfs.sys\n// C:\\Windows\\System32\\drivers\\VBoxMouse.sys\n\n// Processes\n// vmtoolsd.exe, vmwaretray.exe\n// VBoxService.exe, VBoxTray.exe\n```\n\n### Timing-Based VM Detection\n\n```c\n// VM exits cause timing anomalies\nuint64_t start = __rdtsc();\n__cpuid(cpuid_info, 0);  // Causes VM exit\nuint64_t end = __rdtsc();\nif ((end - start) > 500) {\n    // Likely in VM (CPUID takes longer)\n}\n```\n\n**Bypass Approaches:**\n\n```\n- Use bare-metal analysis environment\n- Harden VM (remove guest tools, change MAC)\n- Patch detection code\n- Use specialized analysis VMs (FLARE-VM)\n```\n\n## Code Obfuscation\n\n### Control Flow Obfuscation\n\n#### Control Flow Flattening\n\n```c\n// Original\nif (cond) {\n    func_a();\n} else {\n    func_b();\n}\nfunc_c();\n\n// Flattened\nint state = 0;\nwhile (1) {\n    switch (state) {\n        case 0:\n            state = cond ? 1 : 2;\n            break;\n        case 1:\n            func_a();\n            state = 3;\n            break;\n        case 2:\n            func_b();\n            state = 3;\n            break;\n        case 3:\n            func_c();\n            return;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Analysis Approach:**\n\n- Identify state variable\n- Map state transitions\n- Reconstruct original flow\n- Tools: D-810 (IDA), SATURN\n\n#### Opaque Predicates\n\n```c\n// Always true, but complex to analyze\nint x = rand();\nif ((x * x) >= 0) {  // Always true\n    real_code();\n} else {\n    junk_code();  // Dead code\n}\n\n// Always false\nif ((x * (x + 1)) % 2 == 1) {  // Product of consecutive = even\n    junk_code();\n}\n```\n\n**Analysis Approach:**\n\n- Identify constant expressions\n- Symbolic execution to prove predicates\n- Pattern matching for known opaque predicates\n\n### Data Obfuscation\n\n#### String Encryption\n\n```c\n// XOR encryption\nchar decrypt_string(char *enc, int len, char key) {\n    char *dec = malloc(len + 1);\n    for (int i = 0; i < len; i++) {\n        dec[i] = enc[i] ^ key;\n    }\n    dec[len] = 0;\n    return dec;\n}\n\n// Stack strings\nchar url[20];\nurl[0] = ''h''; url[1] = ''t''; url[2] = ''t''; url[3] = ''p'';\nurl[4] = '':''; url[5] = ''/''; url[6] = ''/'';\n// ...\n```\n\n**Analysis Approach:**\n\n```python\n# FLOSS for automatic string deobfuscation\nfloss malware.exe\n\n# IDAPython string decryption\ndef decrypt_xor(ea, length, key):\n    result = \"\"\n    for i in range(length):\n        byte = ida_bytes.get_byte(ea + i)\n        result += chr(byte ^ key)\n    return result\n```\n\n#### API Obfuscation\n\n```c\n// Dynamic API resolution\ntypedef HANDLE (WINAPI *pCreateFileW)(LPCWSTR, DWORD, DWORD,\n    LPSECURITY_ATTRIBUTES, DWORD, DWORD, HANDLE);\n\nHMODULE kernel32 = LoadLibraryA(\"kernel32.dll\");\npCreateFileW myCreateFile = (pCreateFileW)GetProcAddress(\n    kernel32, \"CreateFileW\");\n\n// API hashing\nDWORD hash_api(char *name) {\n    DWORD hash = 0;\n    while (*name) {\n        hash = ((hash >> 13) | (hash << 19)) + *name++;\n    }\n    return hash;\n}\n// Resolve by hash comparison instead of string\n```\n\n**Analysis Approach:**\n\n- Identify hash algorithm\n- Build hash database of known APIs\n- Use HashDB plugin for IDA\n- Dynamic analysis to resolve at runtime\n\n### Instruction-Level Obfuscation\n\n#### Dead Code Insertion\n\n```asm\n; Original\nmov eax, 1\n\n; With dead code\npush ebx           ; Dead\nmov eax, 1\npop ebx            ; Dead\nxor ecx, ecx       ; Dead\nadd ecx, ecx       ; Dead\n```\n\n#### Instruction Substitution\n\n```asm\n; Original: xor eax, eax (set to 0)\n; Substitutions:\nsub eax, eax\nmov eax, 0\nand eax, 0\nlea eax, [0]\n\n; Original: mov eax, 1\n; Substitutions:\nxor eax, eax\ninc eax\n\npush 1\npop eax\n```\n\n## Packing and Encryption\n\n### Common Packers\n\n```\nUPX          - Open source, easy to unpack\nThemida      - Commercial, VM-based protection\nVMProtect    - Commercial, code virtualization\nASPack       - Compression packer\nPECompact    - Compression packer\nEnigma       - Commercial protector\n```\n\n### Unpacking Methodology\n\n```\n1. Identify packer (DIE, Exeinfo PE, PEiD)\n\n2. Static unpacking (if known packer):\n   - UPX: upx -d packed.exe\n   - Use existing unpackers\n\n3. Dynamic unpacking:\n   a. Find Original Entry Point (OEP)\n   b. Set breakpoint on OEP\n   c. Dump memory when OEP reached\n   d. Fix import table (Scylla, ImpREC)\n\n4. OEP finding techniques:\n   - Hardware breakpoint on stack (ESP trick)\n   - Break on common API calls (GetCommandLineA)\n   - Trace and look for typical entry patterns\n```\n\n### Manual Unpacking Example\n\n```\n1. Load packed binary in x64dbg\n2. Note entry point (packer stub)\n3. Use ESP trick:\n   - Run to entry\n   - Set hardware breakpoint on [ESP]\n   - Run until breakpoint hits (after PUSHAD/POPAD)\n4. Look for JMP to OEP\n5. At OEP, use Scylla to:\n   - Dump process\n   - Find imports (IAT autosearch)\n   - Fix dump\n```\n\n## Virtualization-Based Protection\n\n### Code Virtualization\n\n```\nOriginal x86 code is converted to custom bytecode\ninterpreted by embedded VM at runtime.\n\nOriginal:     VM Protected:\nmov eax, 1    push vm_context\nadd eax, 2    call vm_entry\n              ; VM interprets bytecode\n              ; equivalent to original\n```\n\n### Analysis Approaches\n\n```\n1. Identify VM components:\n   - VM entry (dispatcher)\n   - Handler table\n   - Bytecode location\n   - Virtual registers/stack\n\n2. Trace execution:\n   - Log handler calls\n   - Map bytecode to operations\n   - Understand instruction set\n\n3. Lifting/devirtualization:\n   - Map VM instructions back to native\n   - Tools: VMAttack, SATURN, NoVmp\n\n4. Symbolic execution:\n   - Analyze VM semantically\n   - angr, Triton\n```\n\n## Bypass Strategies Summary\n\n### General Principles\n\n1. **Understand the protection**: Identify what technique is used\n2. **Find the check**: Locate protection code in binary\n3. **Patch or hook**: Modify check to always pass\n4. **Use appropriate tools**: ScyllaHide, x64dbg plugins\n5. **Document findings**: Keep notes on bypassed protections\n\n### Tool Recommendations\n\n```\nAnti-debug bypass:    ScyllaHide, TitanHide\nUnpacking:           x64dbg + Scylla, OllyDumpEx\nDeobfuscation:       D-810, SATURN, miasm\nVM analysis:         VMAttack, NoVmp, manual tracing\nString decryption:   FLOSS, custom scripts\nSymbolic execution:  angr, Triton\n```\n\n### Ethical Considerations\n\nThis knowledge should only be used for:\n\n- Authorized security research\n- Malware analysis (defensive)\n- CTF competitions\n- Understanding protections for legitimate purposes\n- Educational purposes\n\nNever use to bypass protections for:\n\n- Software piracy\n- Unauthorized access\n- Malicious purposes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:20:39.229Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Security Agents requiring expertise in bypassing and analyzing anti-reversing techniques for legitimate security contexts, such as CTF, authorized pentest, or malware analysis.","zh":"适用于需要绕过和分析反逆向技术专业知识的高级安全代理，例如用于合法安全背景的CTF、授权渗透测试或恶意软件分析。","ja":"CTF、認可済みペネトレーションテスト、またはマルウェア分析などの合法的なセキュリティコンテキストで反逆向技術をバイパスおよび分析する専門知識を必要とする高度なセキュリティエージェントに適しています。","ko":"CTF, 승인된 침투 테스트 또는 악성 코드 분석과 같은 합법적인 보안 컨텍스트에서 역공학 기술을 우회하고 분석하는 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 고급 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Seguridad Avanzados que requieren experiencia en eludir y analizar técnicas anti-reversing para contextos de seguridad legítimos, como CTF, pruebas de penetración autorizadas o análisis de malware.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Sécurité Avancés nécessitant une expertise dans la contournement et l''analyse des techniques anti-reversing pour des contextes de sécurité légitimes, tels que CTF, test de pénétration autorisé ou analyse de logiciels malveillants.","de":"Ideal für Fortgeschrittene Sicherheitsagenten, die Erfahrung im Umgehen und Analysieren von Anti-Reversing-Techniken für legale Sicherheitskontexte benötigen, wie z. B. CTF, autorisierte Penetrationstests oder Malware-Analyse.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança Avançados que exigem expertise em contornar e analisar técnicas anti-reversão para contextos de segurança legítimos, como CTF, teste de penetração autorizado ou análise de malware.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов безопасности, требующих экспертизы в обходе и анализе анти-реверсивных техник для легитимных контекстов безопасности, таких как CTF, уполномоченный пен-тест или анализ вредоносного ПО.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمنيين المتقدمين الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في تجاوز وتحليل تقنيات منع العكس للأمثلة الأمنية الشرعية، مثل CTF أو اختبار الاختراق المصرح به أو تحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to understand and counter dual-use security techniques, including verifying authorization, documenting scope, and ensuring legal compliance, leveraging knowledge of software owner permissions and legitimate security protocols like CTF and authorized pentesting.","zh":"赋予代理理解和对抗双用途安全技术的能力，包括验证授权、记录范围和确保合法合规，利用软件所有者权限和合法安全协议（如CTF和授权渗透测试）的知识。","ja":"認可の検証、範囲の文書化、法令遵守の確保など、双用途のセキュリティ技術に対する理解と対抗をエージェントに可能にし、CTFや認可済みペネトレーションテストなどのソフトウェア所有者の権限や合法なセキュリティプロトコルの知識を活用します。","ko":"대리人が 쌍용 보안 기술을 이해하고 대응할 수 있도록 하는데, 이는 승인 확인, 범위 기록 및 법적 준수를 보장하기 위한 것이며, 소프트웨어 소유자 권한 및 합법적인 보안 프로토콜(예: CTF 및 승인된 침투 테스트)의 지식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a comprender y contrarrestar las técnicas de seguridad de doble uso, incluyendo la verificación de autorización, la documentación del alcance y el aseguramiento del cumplimiento legal, aprovechando el conocimiento de los permisos de los propietarios de software y los protocolos de seguridad legítimos como CTF y pruebas de penetración autorizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de comprendre et de contrer les techniques de sécurité à double usage, y compris la vérification de l''autorisation, la documentation de la portée et l''assurance de la conformité légale, en exploitant les connaissances des autorisations des propriétaires de logiciels et des protocoles de sécurité légitimes comme CTF et tests de pénétration autorisés.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Dual-Use-Sicherheitstechniken zu verstehen und zu kontern, einschließlich der Überprüfung der Autorisierung, der Dokumentation des Umfangs und der Gewährleistung der rechtlichen Konformität, unter Ausnutzung der Kenntnisse der Software-Eigentümer-Berechtigungen und legitimer Sicherheitsprotokolle wie CTF und autorisierte Penetrationstests.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a entenderem e contra-atacarem técnicas de segurança de uso duplo, incluindo verificar autorização, documentar o escopo e garantir conformidade legal, aproveitando o conhecimento das permissões do proprietário do software e protocolos de segurança legítimos como CTF e teste de penetração autorizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью понимать и противостоять техникам двойного использования безопасности, включая проверку авторизации, документирование области действия и обеспечение правовой соответствия, используя знания разрешений владельца программного обеспечения и легитимных протоколов безопасности, таких как CTF и уполномоченный пен-тест.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فهم وتعطيل تقنيات الأمن ثنائية الاستخدام، بما في ذلك التحقق من التصريح وتصوير النطاق وضمان التأثير القانوني، مستفيداً من معرفة صلاحيات مالك البرمجيات وبروتوكولات الأمن الشرعية مثل CTF واختبار الاختراق المصرح به."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing malware with anti-reversing protections","Bypassing security controls for authorized pentesting","Conducting security research on dual-use techniques"],"zh":["分析具有反逆向保护的恶意软件","为授权渗透测试绕过安全控制","对双用途技术进行安全研究"],"ja":["反逆向保護を搭載したマルウェアの分析","認可済みペネトレーションテストのためのセキュリティコントロールのバイパス","双用途技術に関するセキュリティ研究の実施"],"ko":["역공학 보호가 있는 악성 코드 분석","승인된 침투 테스트를 위한 보안 제어 우회","쌍용 기술에 대한 보안 연구 수행"],"es":["Análisis de malware con protecciones anti-reversing","Eludir controles de seguridad para pruebas de penetración autorizadas","Realización de investigaciones de seguridad sobre técnicas de doble uso"],"fr":["Analyse de logiciels malveillants avec protections anti-reversing","Contournement des contrôles de sécurité pour des tests de pénétration autorisés","Réalisations de recherches de sécurité sur les techniques à double usage"],"de":["Analyse von Malware mit Anti-Reversing-Schutz","Umgehung von Sicherheitskontrollen für autorisierte Penetrationstests","Durchführung von Sicherheitsforschung zu Dual-Use-Techniken"],"pt":["Analisar malware com proteções anti-reversão","Contornar controles de segurança para teste de penetração autorizado","Realizar pesquisas de segurança sobre técnicas de uso duplo"],"ru":["Анализ вредоносного ПО с анти-реверсивными защитами","Обход мер безопасности для уполномоченного пен-теста","Проведение исследований безопасности по техникам двойного использования"],"ar":["تحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة بالحماية من العكس","تجاوز ضوابط الأمن لاختبار الاختراق المصرح به","إجراء بحوث الأمن حول تقنيات الاستخدام المزدوج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit written permission from software owners or legitimate security context","Must comply with legal requirements and regulations"],"zh":["需要软件所有者或合法安全背景的明确书面许可","必须遵守法律要求和法规"],"ja":["ソフトウェア所有者または合法なセキュリティコンテキストからの明示的な書面による許可が必要","法律の要件や規制に従う必要がある"],"ko":["소프트웨어 소유자 또는 합법적인 보안 컨텍스트로부터의 명확한 서면 승인이 필요","법적 요구 사항 및 규정 준수 필요"],"es":["Requiere permiso escrito explícito de los propietarios de software o contexto de seguridad legítimo","Debe cumplir con los requisitos y regulaciones legales"],"fr":["Nécessite une autorisation écrite explicite des propriétaires de logiciels ou un contexte de sécurité légitime","Doit se conformer aux exigences et réglementations légales"],"de":["Benötigt eine explizite schriftliche Genehmigung der Software-Eigentümer oder einen legitimen Sicherheitskontext","Muss den gesetzlichen Anforderungen und Vorschriften entsprechen"],"pt":["Exige permissão escrita explícita dos proprietários do software ou contexto de segurança legítimo","Deve cumprir com os requisitos legais e regulamentações"],"ru":["Требует явного письменного разрешения от владельцев программного обеспечения или легитимного контекста безопасности","Должно соответствовать правовым требованиям и регламенту"],"ar":["يتطلب إذناً كتابياً صريحاً من مالكي البرمجيات أو سياق أمني شرعي","يجب أن يمتثل للطلبات القانونية واللوائح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
