n de code fonctionnel avec focus sur la conception","Attention aux détails et options créatives","Conception de composants et de pages web","Développement d''applications web et mobiles"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Implementierung von funktionierendem Code mit Designfokus","Aufmerksamkeit für Details und kreative Optionen","Entwicklung von Webkomponenten und -seiten","Entwicklung von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Atenção especial aos detalhes estéticos","Escolhas criativas e inovadoras","Desenvolvimento de soluções web e móveis","Integração com tecnologias de backend"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных пользовательских интерфейсов","Особенное внимание к деталям","Творческие и инновационные решения","Разработка веб- и мобильных приложений","Интеграция с технологиями бэкенда"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","اهتمام خاص بال细يات الجمالية","خيارات إبداعية ومبتكرة","تطوير حلول الوب وموبايل","التكامل مع تقنيات الباك إيند"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","实用代码","创意选择","AI风格","设计思考","开发技能"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクションレベルのインターフェース","実用的なコード","創造的な選択","AIスタイル","デザイン思考","開発スキル"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 인터페이스","실용적인 코드","창의적인 선택","AI 스타일","디자인 사고","개발 스킬"],"es":["diseño frontend","desarrollo web","interfaces de usuario","creación de aplicaciones","diseño de componentes","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["conception frontend","développement web","interfaces utilisateur","création d''applications","conception de composants","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Webentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen","Erstellung von Anwendungen","Entwicklung von Komponenten","Entwicklung von Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["frontend-design","desenvolvimento de frontend","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","design de interface do usuário","desenvolvimento web","desenvolvimento móvel"],"ru":["frontend-design","разработка frontend","индивидуальные пользовательские интерфейсы","дизайн пользовательского интерфейса","веб-разработка","мобильная разработка"],"ar":["تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تطوير الوب","تطوير موبايل"]}},"owner":"thongnt0208","repo":"portfolio","repoPath":"thongnt0208/portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, artifacts, posters, or applications (examples include websites, landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS layouts, or when styling/beautifying any web UI). Generates creative, polished code and UI design that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n\n-","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n- Follows Feature-Sliced Design\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:20:41.013Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual AI Agents needing production-grade frontend interface design with exceptional aesthetic details and creative choices.","zh":"非常适合需要生产级前端界面设计的视觉AI代理，具有异常的美学细节和创意选择。","ja":"生産級のフロントエンドインターフェースデザインが必要なビジュアルAIエージェントに最適です。優れた美的細部と創造的な選択肢を備えています。","ko":"생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스 디자인이 필요한 시각 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 예외적인 미적 세부 사항과 창의적인 선택이 가능합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA visuales que necesitan un diseño de interfaz de usuario de frontend de grado de producción con detalles estéticos excepcionales y opciones creativas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA visuels ayant besoin d''une conception d''interface utilisateur frontend de grade de production avec des détails esthétiques exceptionnels et des choix créatifs.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle KI-Agents, die ein Produktions-Grade-Frontend-Interface-Design mit außergewöhnlichen ästhetischen Details und kreativen Auswahlmöglichkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Visuais que necessitam de design de interface de usuário de produção de ponta com detalhes estéticos excepcionais e escolhas criativas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для визуальных агентов ИИ, которым необходим дизайн frontend-интерфейса высокого уровня с исключительными эстетическими деталями и творческими решениями.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الإيائي البصري الذي يحتاج إلى تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية من الدرجة الأولى مع تفاصيل جمالية استثنائية وخيارات إبداعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create distinctive, real working code with attention to aesthetic details, implementing bold aesthetic directions using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, and generating interfaces in various formats such as .html, .css, and .js.","zh":"赋予代理创建独特的、真正可运行的代码，注重美学细节，使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript实现大胆的美学方向，同时避免通用的''AI乱码''美学，并以.html、.css和.js等多种格式生成接口。","ja":"エージェントが独自の、実際に動作するコードを作成できるようにし、美的細部に注目し、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用して大胆な美的方向性を実現し、汎用的な「AIスロップ」美観を避け、.html、.css、.jsなどの様々な形式でインターフェイスを生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 독특하고 실제로 작동하는 코드를 생성할 수 있도록 해주며, 미적 세부 사항에 주목하여 HTML, CSS, 자바스크립트를 사용하여 대담한 미적 방향을 구현하고, 일반적인 ''AI 슬롭'' 미학을 피하고, .html, .css, .js 등의 다양한 형식으로 인터페이스를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear código de trabajo real y distintivo, con atención a los detalles estéticos, implementando direcciones estéticas audaces utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript, evitando estéticas genéricas de ''slop'' de IA y generando interfaces en varios formatos como .html, .css y .js.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du code de travail réel et distinctif, avec attention aux détails esthétiques, en mettant en œuvre des directions esthétiques audacieuses en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript, tout en évitant les esthétiques génériques de ''slop'' d''IA et en générant des interfaces dans divers formats tels que .html, .css et .js.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, eindeutiges, funktionierendes Code zu erstellen, mit Aufmerksamkeit auf ästhetische Details, indem es kühne ästhetische Richtungen mithilfe von HTML, CSS und JavaScript umsetzt, wobei es genérica ''AI-Slop''-Ästhetik vermeidet und Schnittstellen in verschiedenen Formaten wie .html, .css und .js generiert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem código de trabalho real distinto, com atenção aos detalhes estéticos, implementando direções estéticas ousadas usando HTML, CSS e JavaScript, enquanto evitam estética genérica ''slop'' de IA e geram interfaces em vários formatos, como .html, .css e .js.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительный, реальный рабочий код с учетом эстетических деталей, реализуя смелые эстетические направления с использованием HTML, CSS и JavaScript, избегая при этом общей эстетики ''сlop'' ИИ и генерируя интерфейсы в различных форматах, таких как .html, .css и .js.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إنشاء رمز عمل حقيقي متميز مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية وتنفيذ اتجاهات جمالية جريئة باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript، مع تجنب جماليات AI العادية وتوليد واجهات في تنسيقات مختلفة مثل .html و .css و .js."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web applications","Building custom UI components","Creating interactive web pages"],"zh":["设计响应式网页应用","构建自定义UI组件","创建交互式网页"],"ja":["レスポンシブWebアプリケーションの設計","カスタムUIコンポーネントの構築","インタラクティブWebページの作成"],"ko":["반응형 웹 애플리케이션 설계","사용자 정의 UI 컴포넌트 구축","대화형 웹 페이지 생성"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones web responsivas","Crear componentes de UI personalizados","Crear páginas web interactivas"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications web responsives","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés","Créer des pages web interactives"],"de":["Responsive Webanwendungen entwerfen","Benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten erstellen","Interaktive Webseiten erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações web responsivas","Construir componentes de IU personalizados","Criar páginas web interativas"],"ru":["Проектировать отзывчивые веб-приложения","Построить пользовательские компоненты интерфейса","Создавать интерактивные веб-страницы"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات ويب ذات استجابة","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","إنشاء صفحات ويب تفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements","Dependent on technical constraints and context"],"zh":["需要用户提供的前端要求","依赖于技术约束和上下文"],"ja":["ユーザー提供のフロントエンド要件が必要","技術的制約とコンテキストに依存する"],"ko":["사용자 제공 프론트엔드 요구 사항 필요","기술적 제약 및 컨텍스트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere requisitos de frontend proporcionados por el usuario","Dependiente de limitaciones técnicas y contexto"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences de frontend fournies par l''utilisateur","Dépend des contraintes techniques et du contexte"],"de":["Benötigt vom Benutzer bereitgestellte Frontend-Anforderungen","Abhängig von technischen Einschränkungen und Kontext"],"pt":["Exige requisitos de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Dependente de restrições técnicas e contexto"],"ru":["Требует предоставления пользователем требований к frontend","Зависит от технических ограничений и контекста"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المقدمة من قبل المستخدم","يعتمد على القيود الفنية والسياق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/business-analyst', 'community', 'xiangteng007', 'XXT-AGENT', 'xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT', 'business-analyst', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z', '2026-02-18T09:21:21.244Z', NULL, '{"id":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT/business-analyst","name":"business-analyst","description":{"zh":"Business Analyst 技术提供业务分析最佳实践和工作流指导","ja":"ビジネス・アナリスト スキルは、業務分析のベストプラクティスとワークフローの最適化を提供","ko":"비즈니스 분석가 기술은 비즈니스 분석 최적화 및 워크플로우 개선을 제공","es":"El skill de business-analyst te ayuda a mejorar tus tareas y flujos de trabajo de análisis de negocios con mejores prácticas y verificación de resultados","fr":"Le skill de business-analyst vous aide à améliorer vos tâches et flux de travail d''analyse d''entreprise avec des meilleures pratiques et une vérification des résultats","de":"Das business-analyst-Skill hilft Ihnen, Ihre Aufgaben und Workflows für die Geschäftsanalyse mit besten Praktiken und Ergebnisverifizierung zu verbessern","pt":"O skill de business-analyst ajuda a otimizar processos de negócios e fornecer orientação para analistas de negócios","ru":"Навык бизнес-аналитика помогает оптимизировать бизнес-процессы и предоставляет руководство для бизнес-аналитиков","ar":"مهارة محلل الأعمال تساعد على تحسين عمليات الأعمال وتقديم إرشادات للمحللين التجاريين","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Business Analyst 技术","ja":"ビジネス・アナリスト スキル","ko":"비즈니스 분석가 기술","es":"Análisis de Negocios: Mejora tus Procesos","fr":"Analyse d''Entreprise : Améliorez vos Processus","de":"Business-Analyse: Optimieren Sie Ihre Prozesse","pt":"Analista de Negócios: Otimização de Processos","ru":"Бизнес-аналитик: Оптимизация Процессов","ar":"محلل الأعمال: تحسين العمليات","en":"business-analyst"},"description":{"zh":"Business Analyst 技术提供业务分析最佳实践和工作流指导","ja":"ビジネス・アナリスト スキルは、業務分析のベストプラクティスとワークフローの最適化を提供","ko":"비즈니스 분석가 기술은 비즈니스 분석 최적화 및 워크플로우 개선을 제공","e