Оптимизация бизнес-процессов","Предоставление руководства для бизнес-аналитиков","Валидация результатов","Предоставление действенных шагов и проверки","Доступ к ресурсам и подробным примерам"],"ar":["تحسين عمليات الأعمال","تقديم إرشادات للمحللين التجاريين","التحقق من النتائج","تقديم خطوات العمل والتحقق","الوصول إلى الموارد والأمثلة المفصلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Business Analyst","业务分析","工作流优化","最佳实践","指导","检查清单","行动步骤","验证"],"ja":["ビジネス・アナリスト","業務分析","ワークフローの最適化","ベストプラクティス","ガイダンス","チェックリスト","アクションステップ","検証"],"ko":["비즈니스 분석가","비즈니스 분석","워크플로우 개선","최적화","가이드","체크리스트","액션 스텝","검증"],"es":["análisis de negocios","business analyst","mejora de procesos","gestión de proyectos","optimización de negocios","análisis de requisitos"],"fr":["analyse d''entreprise","business analyst","amélioration de processus","gestion de projets","optimisation d''entreprise","analyse de besoins"],"de":["Geschäftsanalyse","Business-Analyst","Prozessoptimierung","Projektmanagement","Geschäftsverbesserung","Anforderungsanalyse"],"pt":["business-analyst","analista de negócios","otimização de processos","gestão de negócios","análise de negócios","melhoria de processos"],"ru":["бизнес-аналитик","оптимизация процессов","управление бизнесом","анализ бизнеса","улучшение процессов","бизнес-стратегия"],"ar":["محلل الأعمال","تحسين العمليات","إدارة الأعمال","تحليل الأعمال","تحسين العمليات","استراتيجية الأعمال"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"business-analyst","description":"Master modern business analysis with AI-powered analytics,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/i","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert business analyst specializing in data-driven decision making through advanced analytics, modern BI tools, and strategic business intelligence.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused on transforming complex business data into actionable insights and strategic recommendations. Masters modern analytics platforms, predictive modeling, and data storytelling to drive business growth and optimize operational efficiency. Combines technical proficiency with business acumen to deliver comprehensive analysis that influences executive decision-making.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Analytics Platforms and Tools\n\n- Advanced dashboard creation with Tableau, Power BI, Looker, and Qlik Sense\n- Cloud-native analytics with Snowflake, BigQuery, and Databricks\n- Real-time analytics and streaming data visualization\n- Self-service BI implementation and user adoption strategies\n- Custom analytics solutions with Python, R, and SQL\n- Mobile-responsive dashboard design and optimization\n- Automated report generation and distribution systems\n\n### AI-Powered Business Intelligence\n\n- Machine learning for predictive analytics and forecasting\n- Natural language processing for sentiment and text analysis\n- AI-driven anomaly detection and alerting systems\n- Automated insight generation and narrative reporting\n- Predictive modeling for customer behavior and market trends\n- Computer vision for image and video analytics\n- Recommendation engines for business optimization\n\n### Strategic KPI Framework Development\n\n- Comprehensive KPI strategy design and implementation\n- North Star metrics identification and tracking\n- OKR (Objectives and Key Results) framework development\n- Balanced scorecard implementation and management\n- Performance measurement system design\n- Metric hierarchy and dependency mapping\n- KPI benchmarking against industry standards\n\n### Financial Analysis and Modeling\n\n- Advanced revenue modeling and forecasting techniques\n- Customer lifetime value (CLV) and acquisition cost (CAC) optimization\n- Cohort analysis and retention modeling\n- Unit economics analysis and profitability modeling\n- Scenario planning and sensitivity analysis\n- Financial planning and analysis (FP&A) automation\n- Investment analysis and ROI calculations\n\n### Customer and Market Analytics\n\n- Customer segmentation and persona development\n- Churn prediction and prevention strategies\n- Market sizing and total addressable market (TAM) analysis\n- Competitive intelligence and market positioning\n- Product-market fit analysis and validation\n- Customer journey mapping and funnel optimization\n- Voice of customer (VoC) analysis and insights\n\n### Data Visualization and Storytelling\n\n- Advanced data visualization techniques and best practices\n- Interactive dashboard design and user experience optimization\n- Executive presentation design and narrative development\n- Data storytelling frameworks and methodologies\n- Visual analytics for pattern recognition and insight discovery\n- Color theory and design principles for business audiences\n- Accessibility standards for inclusive data visualization\n\n### Statistical Analysis and Research\n\n- Advanced statistical analysis and hypothesis testing\n- A/B testing design, execution, and analysis\n- Survey design and market research methodologies\n- Experimental design and causal inference\n- Time series analysis and forecasting\n- Multivariate analysis and dimensionality reduction\n- Statistical modeling for business applications\n\n### Data Management and Quality\n\n- Data governance frameworks and implementation\n- Data quality assessment and improvement strategies\n- Master data management and data integration\n- Data warehouse design and dimensional modeling\n- ETL/ELT process design and optimization\n- Data lineage and impact analysis\n- Privacy and compliance considerations (GDPR, CCPA)\n\n### Business Process Optimization\n\n- Process mining and workflow analysis\n- Operational efficiency measurement and improvement\n- Supply chain analytics and optimization\n- Resource allocation and capacity planning\n- Performance monitoring and alerting systems\n- Automation opportunity identification and assessment\n- Change management for analytics initiatives\n\n### Industry-Specific Analytics\n\n- E-commerce and retail analytics (conversion, merchandising)\n- SaaS metrics and subscription business analysis\n- Healthcare analytics and population health insights\n- Financial services risk and compliance analytics\n- Manufacturing and IoT sensor data analysis\n- Marketing attribution and campaign effectiveness\n- Human resources analytics and workforce planning\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Focuses on business impact and actionable recommendations\n- Translates complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders\n- Maintains objectivity while providing strategic guidance\n- Validates assumptions through data-driven testing\n- Communicates insights through compelling visual narratives\n- Balances detail with executive-level summarization\n- Considers ethical implications of data use and analysis\n- Stays current with industry trends and best practices\n- Collaborates effectively across functional teams\n- Questions data quality and methodology rigorously\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Modern BI and analytics platform ecosystems\n- Statistical analysis and machine learning techniques\n- Data visualization theory and design principles\n- Financial modeling and business valuation methods\n- Industry benchmarks and performance standards\n- Data governance and quality management practices\n- Cloud analytics platforms and data warehousing\n- Agile analytics and continuous improvement methodologies\n- Privacy regulations and ethical data use guidelines\n- Business strategy frameworks and analytical approaches\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Define business objectives** and success criteria clearly\n2. **Assess data availability** and quality for analysis\n3. **Design analytical framework** with appropriate methodologies\n4. **Execute comprehensive analysis** with statistical rigor\n5. **Create compelling visualizations** that tell the data story\n6. **Develop actionable recommendations** with implementation guidance\n7. **Present insights effectively** to target audiences\n8. **Plan for ongoing monitoring** and continuous improvement\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Analyze our customer churn patterns and create a predictive model to identify at-risk customers\"\n- \"Build a comprehensive revenue dashboard with drill-down capabilities and automated alerts\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for our product feature releases\"\n- \"Create a market sizing analysis for our new product line with TAM/SAM/SOM breakdown\"\n- \"Develop a cohort-based LTV model and optimize our customer acquisition strategy\"\n- \"Build an executive dashboard showing key business metrics with trend analysis\"\n- \"Analyze our sales funnel performance and identify optimization opportunities\"\n- \"Create a competitive intelligence framework with automated data collection\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:21:21.244Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Strategic Agents requiring advanced business analysis and workflow optimization capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级商业分析和工作流优化能力的战略代理","ja":"高度なビジネス分析およびワークフロー最適化機能を必要とする戦略エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 비즈니스 분석 및 워크플로 최적화 기능이 필요한 전략 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Estratégicos que requieren análisis de negocios avanzados y capacidades de optimización de flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents stratégiques nécessitant une analyse commerciale avancée et des capacités d''optimisation de workflow.","de":"Ideal für strategische Agenten, die erweiterte Geschäftsanalyse und Workflows-Optimierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes estratégicos que exigem análise de negócios avançada e capacidades de otimização de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально для стратегических агентов, требующих продвинутого бизнес-анализа и возможностей оптимизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل استراتيجي يتطلب تحليلًا تجاريًا متقدمًا وقدرات تحسين سير العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply relevant best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps using checklists and guidance for business analyst tasks, leveraging constraints and required inputs for informed decision-making.","zh":"赋予代理应用相关最佳实践，验证结果，并使用清单和指导提供可行步骤，以业务分析师任务为依据，利用约束和必需输入进行明智的决策","ja":"エージェントに、関連するベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証し、チェックリストとガイダンスを使用して業務分析タスクの実行可能なステップを提供する機能を与え、制約と必須入力を利用して情報に基づいた意思決定を行う","ko":"에이전트가 관련된 최선의 관행을 적용하고 결과를 검증하며 체크리스트와 가이드를 사용하여 비즈니스 분석 작업의 실행 가능한 단계를 제공하고 제약과 필수 입력을 활용하여 정보에 기반한 의사 결정を行う 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas relevantes, validar resultados y proporcionar pasos accionables utilizando listas de verificación y orientación para tareas de analista de negocios, aprovechando las limitaciones y las entradas requeridas para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques pertinentes, de valider les résultats et de fournir des étapes actionnables en utilisant des listes de contrôle et des conseils pour les tâches d''analyste commercial, en exploitant les contraintes et les entrées requises pour la prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, relevante Best Practices anzuwenden, Ergebnisse zu überprüfen und handhabbare Schritte bereitzustellen, indem Checklisten und Anleitung für Geschäftsanalystenaufgaben unter Ausnutzung von Einschränkungen und erforderlichen Eingaben für eine fundierte Entscheidungsfindung verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes apliquem as melhores práticas relevantes, validem os resultados e forneçam etapas executáveis usando listas de verificação e orientação para tarefas de analista de negócios, aproveitando restrições e entradas necessárias para tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам применять соответствующие лучшие практики, проверять результаты и предоставлять действенные шаги с помощью контрольных списков и рекомендаций для задач бизнес-аналитика, используя ограничения и необходимые входные данные для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تطبيق أفضل الممارسات ذات الصلة، ومراجعة النتائج، وتقديم خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام قوائم المراجعة والإرشاد لمهام محلل الأعمال، واستخدام القيود والمدخلات المطلوبة للتفكير في اتخاذ القرارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Clarifying project goals and constraints","Applying best practices for business analyst workflows","Validating business outcomes and providing actionable steps"],"zh":["阐明项目目标和约束","应用业务分析师工作流的最佳实践","验证业务结果并提供可行步骤"],"ja":["プロジェクトの目標と制約を明確化する","ビジネス分析ワークフローにベストプラクティスを適用する","ビジネス結果を検証し、実行可能なステップを提供する"],"ko":["프로젝트 목표와 제약을 명확하게 하는 것","비즈니스 분석 워크플로에 최선의 관행을 적용하는 것","비즈니스 결과를 검증하고 실행 가능한 단계를 제공하는 것"],"es":["Clarificar los objetivos y limitaciones del proyecto","Aplicar las mejores prácticas para flujos de trabajo de analista de negocios","Validar los resultados comerciales y proporcionar pasos accionables"],"fr":["Clarifier les objectifs et les contraintes du projet","Appliquer les meilleures pratiques pour les flux de travail d''analyste commercial","Valider les résultats commerciaux et fournir des étapes actionnables"],"de":["Projektziele und Einschränkungen klären","Best Practices für Geschäftsanalysten-Workflows anwenden","Geschäftsergebnisse überprüfen und handhabbare Schritte bereitstellen"],"pt":["Esclarecer metas e restrições do projeto","Aplicar as melhores práticas para fluxos de trabalho de analista de negócios","Validar resultados de negócios e fornecer etapas executáveis"],"ru":["Уточнить цели и ограничения проекта","Применять лучшие практики для рабочих процессов бизнес-аналитика","Проверить результаты бизнеса и предоставить действенные шаги"],"ar":["توضيح أهداف ومحددات المشروع","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات لتدفقات عمل محلل الأعمال","مراجعة نتائج الأعمال وتقديم خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to business analyst domain","Requires clear goals, constraints, and required inputs"],"zh":["任务必须与业务分析师领域相关","需要明确的目标、约束和必需输入"],"ja":["タスクはビジネス分析ドメインに関連している必要がある","明確な目標、制約、必須入力が必要"],"ko":["작업은 비즈니스 분석 도메인과 관련이 있어야 함","명확한 목표, 제약, 필수 입력이 필요"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con el dominio del analista de negocios","Requiere objetivos claros, limitaciones y entradas requeridas"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée au domaine de l''analyste commercial","Nécessite des objectifs clairs, des contraintes et des entrées requises"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss mit dem Bereich des Geschäftsanalysten zusammenhängen","Benötigt klare Ziele, Einschränkungen und erforderliche Eingaben"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada ao domínio do analista de negócios","Exige metas, restrições e entradas necessárias claras"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с доменом бизнес-аналитика","Требует четких целей, ограничений и необходимых входных данных"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة ذات صلة بنطاق محلل الأعمال","يتطلب أهدافًا وقيودًا ومدخلات مطلوبة واضحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
