建全面性AI代理文件夹结构，包括会话跟踪、任务管理和安全清单","ja":"agent-folder-initスキルはAI優先開発ワークフローに包括的なAIエージェントフォルダ構造を作成し、セッション追跡、タスク管理、セキュリティチェックリストを含む","ko":"agent-folder-init 스킬은 AI 우선 개발 워크플로우에 포괄적인 AI 에이전트 폴더 구조를 생성하여 세션 추적, 작업 관리 및 보안 체크리스트를 포함","es":"El skill ''agent-folder-init'' crea una estructura de carpeta de agente integral para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de IA","fr":"Le skill ''agent-folder-init'' crée une structure de dossier d''agent complète pour les flux de travail de développement d''IA","de":"Das Skill ''agent-folder-init'' erstellt eine umfassende Agent-Ordner-Struktur für AI-Entwicklung-Workflows","pt":"O skill agent-folder-init cria uma estrutura de pasta de agente abrangente para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de IA.","ru":"Навык agent-folder-init создает полную структуру папки агента для потоков разработки ИИ.","ar":"مهارة agent-folder-init تنشئ هيكلاً شاملاً لمجلد العامل لتدفقات عمل التطوير الاصطناعي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["会话跟踪","任务管理","安全清单","编码标准","架构决策记录"],"ja":["セッション追跡","タスク管理","セキュリティチェックリスト","コーディング規約","アーキテクチャ決定レコード"],"ko":["세션 추적","작업 관리","보안 체크리스트","코딩 표준","아키텍처 결정 기록"],"es":["Seguimiento de sesiones diarias","Gestión de tareas","Estándares y reglas de codificación","Registros de decisiones de arquitectura","Listas de verificación de seguridad","Configuración de carpetas de agente"],"fr":["Suivi de sessions quotidiennes","Gestion de tâches","Normes et règles de codage","Enregistrements de décisions d''architecture","Listes de vérification de sécurité","Configuration des dossiers d''agent"],"de":["Sitzungsverfolgung täglich","Aufgabenmanagement","Codierungsstandards und -regeln","Architektur-Entscheidungsaufzeichnungen","Sicherheits-Checklisten","Agent-Ordner-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Criação de estrutura de pasta de agente completa","Rastreamento de sessão (arquivos diários)","Gerenciamento de tarefas","Padrões e regras de codificação","Registros de decisões de arquitetura","Listas de verificação de segurança"],"ru":["Создание полной структуры папки агента","Отслеживание сессии (ежедневные файлы)","Управление задачами","Стандарты и правила кодирования","Записи решений по архитектуре","Чек-листы безопасности"],"ar":["إنشاء هيكل مجلد العامل الشامل","تتبع الجلسة (ملفات يومية)","إدارة المهام","معايير وقيود البرمجة","سجلات قرارات الهندسة المعمارية","قوائم مراجعة الأمان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理","agent-folder-init","AI开发工作流","会话跟踪","任务管理","安全清单"],"ja":["AIエージェント","agent-folder-init","AI開発ワークフロー","セッション追跡","タスク管理","セキュリティチェックリスト"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","agent-folder-init","AI 개발 워크플로우","세션 추적","작업 관리","보안 체크리스트"],"es":["desarrollo de IA","flujos de trabajo de IA","inicialización de carpeta de agente","gestión de tareas","seguridad de IA","estándares de codificación","registros de decisiones de arquitectura","configuración de agente"],"fr":["développement d''IA","flux de travail d''IA","initialisation du dossier d''agent","gestion de tâches","sécurité de l''IA","normes de codage","enregistrements de décisions d''architecture","configuration d''agent"],"de":["Entwicklung von künstlicher Intelligenz","AI-Entwicklung-Workflows","Agent-Ordner-Initialisierung","Aufgabenmanagement","Sicherheit von künstlicher Intelligenz","Codierungsstandards","Architektur-Entscheidungsaufzeichnungen","Agent-Konfiguration"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de ia","fluxos de trabalho de ia","estrutura de pasta de agente","rastreamento de sessão","gerenciamento de tarefas","padrões de codificação","segurança de ia","arquitetura de ia","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["разработка ИИ","потоки разработки ИИ","структура папки агента","отслеживание сессии","управление задачами","стандарты кодирования","безопасность ИИ","архитектура ИИ","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات الذكية","تدفقات عمل التطوير الاصطناعي","هيكل مجلد العامل","تتبع الجلسة","إدارة المهام","معايير البرمجة","أمان البرمجيات الذكية","هندسة البرمجيات الذكية","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Clecio013","repo":"lumes","repoPath":"Clecio013/lumes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-folder-init","description":"Initialize a comprehensive .agent/ folder structure for AI-first development. Use this skill when starting a new project that needs AI agent documentation, session tracking, task management, and coding standards. Generates full structure based on proven patterns from production projects.","bodyPreview":"# Agent Folder Init\n\nCreate a comprehensive `.agent/` folder structure for AI-first development workflows.\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill scaffolds a complete AI agent documentation system including:\n\n- Session tracking (daily files)\n- Task management\n- Coding standards and rules\n- Architecture decision records\n- Security checklists\n- SOPs for common workflows\n- Agent config folders (.claude, .codex, .cursor) with commands, rules, and agents\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Starting a new proje","body":"# Agent Folder Init\n\nCreate a comprehensive `.agent/` folder structure for AI-first development workflows.\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill scaffolds a complete AI agent documentation system including:\n\n- Session tracking (daily files)\n- Task management\n- Coding standards and rules\n- Architecture decision records\n- Security checklists\n- SOPs for common workflows\n- Agent config folders (.claude, .codex, .cursor) with commands, rules, and agents\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Starting a new project that will use AI coding assistants\n- Setting up AI-first development workflows\n- Migrating an existing project to use structured AI documentation\n\n## Usage\n\nRun the scaffold script:\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/agent-folder-init/scripts/scaffold.py --help\n\n# Basic usage\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/agent-folder-init/scripts/scaffold.py \\\n  --root /path/to/project \\\n  --name \"My Project\"\n\n# With custom options\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/agent-folder-init/scripts/scaffold.py \\\n  --root /path/to/project \\\n  --name \"My Project\" \\\n  --tech \"nextjs,nestjs\" \\\n  --allow-outside\n```\n\n## Generated Structure\n\n### Documentation (.agent/)\n\n```\n.agent/\n├── README.md                    # Navigation hub\n├── SYSTEM/\n│   ├── README.md\n│   ├── RULES.md                 # Coding standards\n│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md          # What''s implemented\n│   ├── SUMMARY.md               # Current state\n│   ├── PRD.md                   # Product Requirements Document\n│   ├── ENTITIES.md              # Entity documentation\n│   ├── ai/\n│   │   ├── SESSION-QUICK-START.md\n│   │   ├── SESSION-DOCUMENTATION-PROTOCOL.md\n│   │   └── USER-PREFERENCES.md\n│   ├── architecture/\n│   │   ├── DECISIONS.md         # ADRs\n│   │   └── PROJECT-MAP.md\n│   ├── critical/\n│   │   ├── CRITICAL-NEVER-DO.md\n│   │   └── CROSS-PROJECT-RULES.md\n│   └── quality/\n│       └── SECURITY-CHECKLIST.md\n├── TASKS/\n│   ├── README.md\n│   └── INBOX.md\n├── SESSIONS/\n│   ├── README.md\n│   └── TEMPLATE.md\n├── SOP/\n│   └── README.md\n├── EXAMPLES/\n│   └── README.md\n└── FEEDBACK/\n    └── README.md\n```\n\n### Agent Configs\n\n```\n.claude/\n├── commands/                    # Slash commands (project-specific)\n│   ├── start.md\n│   ├── end.md\n│   ├── new-session.md\n│   ├── commit-summary.md\n│   ├── code-review.md\n│   ├── bug.md\n│   ├── quick-fix.md\n│   ├── refactor-code.md\n│   ├── inbox.md\n│   ├── task.md\n│   ├── validate.md\n│   └── clean.md\n├── agents/                      # Specialized agents (project-specific)\n│   ├── senior-backend-engineer.md\n│   └── senior-frontend-engineer.md\n└── skills/                      # Project-specific skills\n\n.codex/\n├── commands/\n└── skills/\n\n.cursor/\n└── commands/\n```\n\n**Note:** Agent configs (agents/, commands/) are copied from the library root (e.g., `~/.claude/agents/`) to ensure projects get the latest version. Rules are NOT copied because they''re inherited from `~/.claude/rules/` at the library/personal level - this prevents duplication and ensures all projects use consistent rules.\n\n### Root Files\n\n- `AGENTS.md` - Points to `.agent/README.md`\n- `CLAUDE.md` - Claude-specific entry point\n- `CODEX.md` - Codex-specific entry point\n- `.editorconfig` - Editor configuration\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n- **Top-level directories**: ALL-CAPS (`SYSTEM/`, `TASKS/`, `SESSIONS/`)\n- **Files**: ALL-CAPS for critical files (`README.md`, `RULES.md`), kebab-case for others\n\n### Session Files\n\n- **One file per day**: `YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- Multiple sessions same day use Session 1, Session 2, etc. in the same file\n\n## Customization\n\nAfter scaffolding, customize:\n\n1. `SYSTEM/PRD.md` - Fill in your product requirements (use with fullstack-workspace-init)\n2. `SYSTEM/ENTITIES.md` - Document your data entities\n3. `SYSTEM/RULES.md` - Add project-specific coding standards\n4. `SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE.md` - Document your architecture\n5. `SYSTEM/critical/CRITICAL-NEVER-DO.md` - Add project-specific violations\n6. `SOP/` - Add your standard operating procedures\n7. `.claude/rules/` - Add project-specific rules\n8. `.claude/commands/` - Add project-specific commands\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n\n| Skill | How It Works Together |\n|-------|----------------------|\n| `fullstack-workspace-init` | Use PRD.md to define requirements before scaffolding |\n| `linter-formatter-init` | Sets up quality tooling in the scaffolded project |\n| `husky-test-coverage` | Enforces test coverage in pre-commit hooks |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:21:31.549Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agent Developers needing a structured project setup with comprehensive documentation and configuration management","zh":"适合需要结构化项目设置的全面文档和配置管理的AI代理开发人员","ja":"構造化されたプロジェクト設定と包括的なドキュメントおよび構成管理が必要なAIエージェント開発者に最適","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 설정과 포괄적인 문서 및 구성 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트 개발자를 위한 최적의 솔루션","es":"Ideal para desarrolladores de agentes de IA que necesitan una configuración de proyecto estructurada con documentación completa y gestión de configuración","fr":"Idéal pour les développeurs d''agents IA ayant besoin d''une configuration de projet structurée avec une documentation complète et une gestion de configuration","de":"Ideal für AI-Agent-Entwickler, die eine strukturierte Projektsetup mit umfassender Dokumentation und Konfigurationsmanagement benötigen","pt":"Ideal para desenvolvedores de agentes de IA que precisam de uma configuração de projeto estruturada com documentação abrangente e gerenciamento de configuração","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков агентов ИИ, которым необходима структурированная настройка проекта с полной документацией и управлением конфигурацией","ar":"مثالية لمطوري وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد مشروع منظم مع документات شاملة وإدارة التكوين"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scaffold a complete AI agent documentation system, including session tracking, task management, and security checklists, utilizing standardized folder structures like .claude, .codex, and .cursor config folders","zh":"赋予代理创建完整的AI代理文档系统的能力，包括会话跟踪、任务管理和安全清单，利用标准化的文件夹结构，如.claude、.codex和.cursor配置文件夹","ja":"セッション追跡、タスク管理、セキュリティチェックリストを含む完全なAIエージェントドキュメントシステムの作成をエージェントに可能にし、.claude、.codex、.cursor構成フォルダなどの標準化されたフォルダ構造を利用","ko":"에이전트가 세션 추적, 작업 관리 및 보안 체크리스트를 포함하는 완전한 AI 에이전트 문서 시스템을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, .claude, .codex 및 .cursor 구성 폴더와 같은 표준화된 폴더 구조를 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear un sistema de documentación de agente de IA completo, incluyendo seguimiento de sesiones, gestión de tareas y listas de verificación de seguridad, utilizando estructuras de carpetas estandarizadas como carpetas de configuración .claude, .codex y .cursor","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un système de documentation d''agent IA complet, incluant le suivi de sessions, la gestion de tâches et les listes de vérification de sécurité, en utilisant des structures de dossiers standardisées comme les dossiers de configuration .claude, .codex et .cursor","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ein vollständiges AI-Agenten-Dokumentationssystem zu erstellen, einschließlich Sitzungsverfolgung, Aufgabenmanagement und Sicherheitsprüflisten, unter Verwendung standardisierter Ordnerstrukturen wie .claude-, .codex- und .cursor-Konfigurationsordner","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar um sistema de documentação completo de agentes de IA, incluindo rastreamento de sessões, gerenciamento de tarefas e listas de verificação de segurança, utilizando estruturas de pastas padronizadas como pastas de configuração .claude, .codex e .cursor","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать полную систему документации агентов ИИ, включая отслеживание сессий, управление задачами и контрольные списки безопасности, используя стандартизированные папки, такие как папки конфигурации .claude, .codex и .cursor","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء نظام وثائق كامل للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي، بما في ذلك تتبع الجلسات وإدارة المهام وقوائم التحقق من الأمان، باستخدام هياكل المجلدات المعيارية مثل مجلدات التكوين .claude و .codex و .cursor"},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new AI agent projects with comprehensive folder structures","Managing architecture decision records and coding standards","Implementing security checklists and SOPs for common workflows"],"zh":["使用全面文件夹结构初始化新的AI代理项目","管理架构决策记录和编码标准","为常见工作流实现安全清单和SOP"],"ja":["包括的なフォルダ構造を使用して新しいAIエージェントプロジェクトを初期化","アーキテクチャの決定レコードとコード規約を管理","一般的なワークフローにセキュリティチェックリストとSOPを実装"],"ko":["포괄적인 폴더 구조를 사용하여 새로운 AI 에이전트 프로젝트를 초기화","아키텍처 결정 레코드 및 코딩 표준 관리","일반적인 워크플로우에 보안 체크리스트 및 표준운영절차(SOP) 구현"],"es":["Inicialización de nuevos proyectos de agentes de IA con estructuras de carpetas completas","Gestión de registros de decisiones de arquitectura y estándares de codificación","Implementación de listas de verificación de seguridad y procedimientos operativos estándar para flujos de trabajo comunes"],"fr":["Initialisation de nouveaux projets d''agents IA avec des structures de dossiers complètes","Gestion des enregistrements de décisions d''architecture et des normes de codage","Mise en œuvre de listes de vérification de sécurité et de procédures opérationnelles standard pour les flux de travail courants"],"de":["Initialisierung neuer AI-Agenten-Projekte mit umfassenden Ordnerstrukturen","Verwaltung von Architekturentscheidungsprotokollen und Codierungsstandards","Implementierung von Sicherheitsprüflisten und Standardarbeitsanweisungen für gängige Workflows"],"pt":["Inicializando novos projetos de agentes de IA com estruturas de pastas abrangentes","Gerenciando registros de decisões arquiteturais e padrões de codificação","Implementando listas de verificação de segurança e procedimentos operacionais padrão para fluxos de trabalho comuns"],"ru":["Инициализация новых проектов агентов ИИ с полными структурами папок","Управление записями об архитектурных решениях и стандартах кодирования","Реализация контрольных списков безопасности и стандартных операционных процедур для общих рабочих процессов"],"ar":["ت初ييذ مشاريع جديدة من وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مع هياكل مجلدات شاملة","إدارة سجلات قرارات الهندسة المعمارية ومعايير البرمجة","تنفيذ قوائم التحقق من الأمان والإجراءات التشغيلية المعيارية للتدفقات العملية الشائعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual configuration of agent config folders","Limited to AI-first development workflows","No automated integration with external project management tools"],"zh":["需要手动配置代理配置文件夹","仅限AI优先开发工作流","没有与外部项目管理工具的自动集成"],"ja":["エージェント構成フォルダの手動設定が必要","AI優先の開発ワークフローに限定","外部のプロジェクト管理ツールとの自動統合がない"],"ko":["에이전트 구성 폴더의 수동 구성이 필요","AI 우선 개발 워크플로에만 제한","외부 프로젝트 관리 도구와의 자동 통합 없음"],"es":["Requiere configuración manual de las carpetas de configuración de los agentes","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de IA en primer lugar","No tiene integración automática con herramientas de gestión de proyectos externas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration manuelle des dossiers de configuration des agents","Limité aux flux de travail de développement d''IA en premier lieu","N''a pas d''intégration automatique avec les outils de gestion de projet externes"],"de":["Benötigt manuelle Konfiguration der Agenten-Konfigurationsordner","Begrenzt auf AI-erstes Entwicklungswerkzeuge","Keine automatische Integration mit externen Projektmanagement-Tools"],"pt":["Exige configuração manual de pastas de configuração do agente","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de IA em primeiro lugar","Nenhuma integração automática com ferramentas de gerenciamento de projetos externas"],"ru":["Требует ручной настройки папок конфигурации агента","Ограничен для рабочих процессов разработки ИИ в первую очередь","Нет автоматической интеграции с внешними инструментами управления проектами"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين يدوي لمجلدات تكوين الوكيل","محدود بالأساس لسير عمل تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","لا يوجد دمج تلقائي مع أدوات إدارة المشاريع الخارجية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('contatomaycon/underchat/fastify-typescript', 'community', 'contatomaycon', 'underchat', 'contatomaycon/underchat', 'fastify-typescript', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z', '2026-02-18T09:21:36.342Z', NULL, '{"id":"contatomaycon/underchat/fastify-typescript","name":"fastify-typescript","description":{"zh":"Fastify TypeScript开发是构建高性能、类型安全的API的最佳实践，包括基本原则、类型声明和文档编写","ja":"Fastify TypeScript開発は、高パフォーマンスとタイプセーフのAPIを構築するためのベストプラクティスであり、基本原則、タイプ宣言、ドキュメント作成が含まれる","ko":"Fastify TypeScript 개발은 높은 성능과 유형 안전한 API를 구축하는 베스트 프랙티스로, 기본 원칙, 유형 선언 및 문서 작성이 포함됩니다","es":"Fastify con TypeScript permite el desarrollo de APIs de alto rendimiento y seguras. Aprende a aprovechar sus beneficios.","fr":"Fastify avec TypeScript permet le développement d''API haute performance et sécurisées. Apprenez à en tirer parti.","de":"Fastify mit TypeScript ermöglicht die Entwicklung von Hochleistungs- und sicheren APIs. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie deren Vorteile nutzen können.","pt":"Desenvolvimento de APIs de alto desempenho e seguras com Fastify e TypeScript. Aprenda a usar tipos e JSDoc para melhorar seu código.","ru":"Разработка высокопроизводительных и безопасных API с помощью Fastify и TypeScript. Узнайте, как использовать типы и JSDoc для улучшения вашего кода.","ar":"تطوير واجهات برمجة تطبيقات عالية الأداء وأمنة باستخدام Fastify وTypeScript. تعرف على كيفية استخدام الأنواع وJSDoc لتحسين кодك.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Fastify TypeScript开发最佳实践","ja":"Fastify TypeScript開発のベストプラクティス","ko":"Fastify TypeScript 개발 가이드","es":"Desarrollo de Fastify con TypeScript","fr":"Développement Fastify avec TypeScript","de":"Fastify-Entwicklung mit TypeScript","pt":"Desenvolvimento Fastify com TypeScript","ru":"Разработка Fastify с TypeScript","ar":"تطوير Fastify باستخدام TypeScript","en":"fastify-typescript"},"description":{"zh":"Fastify TypeScript开发是构建高性能、类型安全的API的最佳实践，包括基本原则、类型声明和文档编写","ja":"Fastify TypeScript開発は、高パフォーマンスとタイプセーフのAPIを構築するためのベストプラクティスであり、基本原則、タイプ宣言、ドキュメント作成が含まれる","ko":"Fastify TypeScript 개발은 높은 성능과 유형 안전한 API를 구축하는 베스트 프랙티스로, 기본 원칙, 유형 선언 및 문서 작성이 포함됩니다","es":"Fastify con TypeScript permite el desarrollo de APIs de alto rendimiento y seguras. Aprende a aprovechar sus beneficios.","fr":"Fastify avec TypeScript permet le développement d''API haute performance et sécurisées. Apprenez à en tirer parti.","de":"Fastify mit TypeScript ermöglicht die Entwicklung von Hochleistungs- und sicheren APIs. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie deren Vorteile nutzen können.","pt":"Desenvolvimento de APIs de alto desempenho e seguras com Fastify e TypeScript. Aprenda a usar tipos e JSDoc para melhorar seu código.","ru":"Разработка высокопроизводительных и безопасных API с помощью Fastify и TypeScript. Узнайте, как использовать типы и JSDoc для улучшения вашего кода.","ar":"تطوير واجهات برمجة تطبيقات عالية الأداء وأمنة باستخدام Fastify وTypeScript. تعرف على كيفية استخدام الأنواع وJSDoc لتحسين кодك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用English编写代码和文档","声明变量和函数的类型","避免使用any类型","使用JSDoc编写文档","编写简洁、可维护的代码"],"ja":["英語でコードとドキュメントを書く","変数と関数のタイプを宣言する","anyタイプの使用を避ける","JSDocを使用してドキュメントを書く","簡潔で保守可能なコードを書く"],"ko":["영어로 코드와 문서를 작성","변수와 함수의 유형을 선언","any 유형의 사용을 피함","JSDoc를 사용하여 문서를 작성","간결하고 유지 보수가 가능한 코드를 작성"],"es":["Desarrollo de APIs de alto rendimiento","Tipos seguros con TypeScript","Documentación con JSDoc","Código mantenible y conciso","Evitación del tipo ''any''","Declaración de tipos para variables y funciones"],"fr":["Développement d''API haute performance","Types sécurisés avec TypeScript","Documentation avec JSDoc","Code maintenable et concis","Évitement du type ''any''","Déclaration de types pour les variables et les fonctions"],"de":["Entwicklung von Hochleistungs-APIs","Sichere Typen mit TypeScript","Dokumentation mit JSDoc","Wartbares und präzises Code","Vermeidung des ''any''-Typs","Deklaration von Typen für Variablen und Funktionen"],"pt":["Criação de APIs de alto desempenho","Uso de tipos para melhorar a segurança","Documentação com JSDoc","Desenvolvimento de código conciso e mantenedor","Uso de princípios básicos de TypeScript"],"ru":["Создание высокопроизводительных API","Использование типов для улучшения безопасности","Документация с помощью JSDoc","Разработка концензного и поддерживаемого кода","Использование основных принципов TypeScript"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات عالية الأداء","استخدام الأنواع لتحسين الأمان","توثيق باستخدام JSDoc","تطوير код منسق وقابل للصيانة","استخدام المبادئ الأساسية لTypeScript"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Fastify","TypeScript","高性能API","类型安全","API开发","Fastify开发","TypeScript开发"],"ja":["Fastify","TypeScript","高パフォーマンスAPI","タイプセーフ","API開発","Fastify開発","TypeScript開発"],"ko":["Fastify","TypeScript","높은 성능 API","유형 안전","API 개발","Fastify 개발","TypeScript 개발"],"es":["Fastify","TypeScript","API de alto rendimiento","Desarrollo de API","Tipos seguros","JSDoc","Código mantenible","Desarrollo de software","Programación con TypeScript"],"fr":["Fastify","TypeScript","API haute performance","Développement d''API","Types sécurisés","JSDoc","Code maintenable","Développement de logiciels","Programmation avec TypeScript"],"de":["Fastify","TypeScript","Hochleistungs-API","API-Entwicklung","Sichere Typen","JSDoc","Wartbares Code","Software-Entwicklung","Programmierung mit TypeScript"],"pt":["Fastify","TypeScript","Desenvolvimento de APIs","Alto desempenho","Segurança","JSDoc","Tipos","Código conciso"],"ru":["Fastify","TypeScript","Разработка API","Высокая производительность","Безопасность","JSDoc","Типы","Концензный код"],"ar":["Fastify","TypeScript","تطوير واجهات برمجة تطبيقات","أداء عالي","أمان","JSDoc","أنواع","كود منسق"]}},"owner":"contatomaycon","repo":"underchat","repoPath":"contatomaycon/underchat","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fastify-typescript","description":"Guidelines for building high-performance APIs with Fastify and TypeScript, covering validation, Prisma integration, and testing best practices","bodyPreview":"# Fastify TypeScript Development\n\nYou are an expert in Fastify and TypeScript development with deep knowledge of building high-performance, type-safe APIs.\n\n## TypeScript General Guidelines\n\n### Basic Principles\n\n- Use English for all code and documentation\n- Always declare types for variables and functions (parameters and return values)\n- Avoid using `any` type - create necessary types instead\n- Use JSDoc to document public classes and methods\n- Write concise, maintainable, and technically accu","body":"# Fastify TypeScript Development\n\nYou are an expert in Fastify and TypeScript development with deep knowledge of building high-performance, type-safe APIs.\n\n## TypeScript General Guidelines\n\n### Basic Principles\n\n- Use English for all code and documentation\n- Always declare types for variables and functions (parameters and return values)\n- Avoid using `any` type - create necessary types instead\n- Use JSDoc to document public classes and methods\n- Write concise, maintainable, and technically accurate code\n- Use functional and declarative programming patterns; avoid classes\n- Prefer iteration and modularization to adhere to DRY principles\n\n### Nomenclature\n\n- Use PascalCase for types and interfaces\n- Use camelCase for variables, functions, and methods\n- Use kebab-case for file and directory names\n- Use UPPERCASE for environment variables\n- Use descriptive variable names with auxiliary verbs: `isLoading`, `hasError`, `canDelete`\n- Start each function with a verb\n\n### Functions\n\n- Write short functions with a single purpose\n- Use arrow functions for simple operations\n- Use async/await consistently throughout the codebase\n- Use the RO-RO pattern (Receive an Object, Return an Object) for multiple parameters\n\n### Types and Interfaces\n\n- Prefer interfaces over types for object shapes\n- Avoid enums; use maps or const objects instead\n- Use Zod for runtime validation with inferred types\n- Use `readonly` for immutable properties\n- Use `import type` for type-only imports\n\n## Fastify-Specific Guidelines\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n  routes/\n    {resource}/\n      index.ts\n      handlers.ts\n      schemas.ts\n  plugins/\n    auth.ts\n    database.ts\n    cors.ts\n  services/\n    {domain}Service.ts\n  repositories/\n    {entity}Repository.ts\n  types/\n    index.ts\n  utils/\n  config/\n  app.ts\n  server.ts\n```\n\n### Route Organization\n\n- Organize routes by resource/domain\n- Use route plugins for modular registration\n- Define schemas alongside route handlers\n- Use route prefixes for API versioning\n\n```typescript\nimport { FastifyPluginAsync } from ''fastify'';\n\nconst usersRoutes: FastifyPluginAsync = async (fastify) => {\n  fastify.get(''/'', { schema: listUsersSchema }, listUsersHandler);\n  fastify.get(''/:id'', { schema: getUserSchema }, getUserHandler);\n  fastify.post(''/'', { schema: createUserSchema }, createUserHandler);\n  fastify.put(''/:id'', { schema: updateUserSchema }, updateUserHandler);\n  fastify.delete(''/:id'', { schema: deleteUserSchema }, deleteUserHandler);\n};\n\nexport default usersRoutes;\n```\n\n### Schema Validation with JSON Schema / Ajv\n\n- Define JSON schemas for all request/response validation\n- Use @sinclair/typebox for type-safe schema definitions\n- Leverage Fastify''s built-in Ajv integration\n\n```typescript\nimport { Type, Static } from ''@sinclair/typebox'';\n\nconst UserSchema = Type.Object({\n  id: Type.String({ format: ''uuid'' }),\n  name: Type.String({ minLength: 1 }),\n  email: Type.String({ format: ''email'' }),\n  createdAt: Type.String({ format: ''date-time'' }),\n});\n\ntype User = Static<typeof UserSchema>;\n\nconst createUserSchema = {\n  body: Type.Object({\n    name: Type.String({ minLength: 1 }),\n    email: Type.String({ format: ''email'' }),\n  }),\n  response: {\n    201: UserSchema,\n    400: ErrorSchema,\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Plugins and Decorators\n\n- Use plugins for shared functionality\n- Decorate Fastify instance with services and utilities\n- Register plugins with proper encapsulation\n\n```typescript\nimport fp from ''fastify-plugin'';\n\nconst databasePlugin = fp(async (fastify) => {\n  const prisma = new PrismaClient();\n\n  await prisma.$connect();\n\n  fastify.decorate(''prisma'', prisma);\n\n  fastify.addHook(''onClose'', async () => {\n    await prisma.$disconnect();\n  });\n});\n\nexport default databasePlugin;\n```\n\n### Prisma Integration\n\n- Use Prisma as the ORM for database operations\n- Create repository classes for data access\n- Use transactions for complex operations\n\n```typescript\nclass UserRepository {\n  constructor(private prisma: PrismaClient) {}\n\n  async findById(id: string): Promise<User | null> {\n    return this.prisma.user.findUnique({ where: { id } });\n  }\n\n  async create(data: CreateUserInput): Promise<User> {\n    return this.prisma.user.create({ data });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\n- Use Fastify''s built-in error handling\n- Create custom error classes for domain errors\n- Return consistent error responses\n\n```typescript\nimport { FastifyError } from ''fastify'';\n\nclass NotFoundError extends Error implements FastifyError {\n  code = ''NOT_FOUND'';\n  statusCode = 404;\n\n  constructor(resource: string, id: string) {\n    super(`${resource} with id ${id} not found`);\n    this.name = ''NotFoundError'';\n  }\n}\n\n// Global error handler\nfastify.setErrorHandler((error, request, reply) => {\n  const statusCode = error.statusCode || 500;\n\n  reply.status(statusCode).send({\n    error: error.name,\n    message: error.message,\n    statusCode,\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Testing with Jest\n\n- Write unit tests for services and handlers\n- Use integration tests for routes\n- Mock external dependencies\n\n```typescript\nimport { build } from ''../app'';\n\ndescribe(''Users API'', () => {\n  let app: FastifyInstance;\n\n  beforeAll(async () => {\n    app = await build();\n  });\n\n  afterAll(async () => {\n    await app.close();\n  });\n\n  it(''should list users'', async () => {\n    const response = await app.inject({\n      method: ''GET'',\n      url: ''/api/users'',\n    });\n\n    expect(response.statusCode).toBe(200);\n    expect(JSON.parse(response.payload)).toBeInstanceOf(Array);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Performance\n\n- Fastify is one of the fastest Node.js frameworks\n- Use schema validation for automatic serialization optimization\n- Enable logging only when needed in production\n- Use connection pooling for database connections\n\n### Security\n\n- Use @fastify/helmet for security headers\n- Implement rate limiting with @fastify/rate-limit\n- Use @fastify/cors for CORS configuration\n- Validate all inputs with JSON Schema\n- Use JWT for authentication with @fastify/jwt\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:21:36.342Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Node.js Agents needing high-performance, type-safe API development with Fastify and TypeScript.","zh":"适合需要高性能、类型安全的 API 开发的 Node.js 代理，使用 Fastify 和 TypeScript。","ja":"Node.js エージェントが高性能でタイプセーフな API 開発を必要とする場合に最適です。Fastify と TypeScript を使用します。","ko":"고성능 및 타입 안전한 API 개발이 필요한 Node.js 에이전트에 적합합니다. Fastify 및 TypeScript를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Node.js que necesitan un desarrollo de API de alto rendimiento y seguro con Fastify y TypeScript.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Node.js nécessitant un développement d''API haute performance et sécurisé avec Fastify et TypeScript.","de":"Ideal für Node.js-Agents, die eine hochleistungs- und typesichere API-Entwicklung mit Fastify und TypeScript benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Node.js que necessitam de desenvolvimento de API de alto desempenho e segurança de tipos com Fastify e TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Node.js, которым требуется разработка API с высокими показателями производительности и безопасностью типов с помощью Fastify и TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Node.js الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات عالية الأداء وأمان النوع باستخدام Fastify و TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable and maintainable APIs using Fastify, with strict type checking and documentation through JSDoc, avoiding the use of the ''any'' type and ensuring concise code.","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展且可维护的 API 的能力，使用 Fastify，并通过 JSDoc 实现严格的类型检查和文档记录，避免使用 ''any'' 类型，确保代码简洁。","ja":"エージェントが Fastify を使用してスケーラブルで維持可能な API を構築できるようになり、JSDoc を介して厳格なタイプチェックとドキュメント化を行い、''any'' タイプの使用を避け、コードを簡潔に保つことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 확장 가능하고 유지 보수 가능한 API를 구축할 수 있도록 해줍니다. Fastify를 사용하고 JSDoc을 통해 엄격한 유형 검사 및 문서화가 가능하며 ''any'' 유형의 사용을 피하고 코드를 간결하게 유지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear APIs escalables y mantenibles utilizando Fastify, con una verificación estricta de tipos y documentación a través de JSDoc, evitando el uso del tipo ''any'' y asegurando un código conciso.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des API évolutives et maintenables en utilisant Fastify, avec une vérification stricte des types et une documentation via JSDoc, en évitant l''utilisation du type ''any'' et en assurant un code concis.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, skalierbare und wartbare APIs mit Fastify zu erstellen, mit strenger Typprüfung und Dokumentation durch JSDoc, unter Vermeidung des Typs ''any'' und Gewährleistung eines knappen Codes.","pt":"Permite que os agentes construam APIs escaláveis e mantidas usando Fastify, com verificação rigorosa de tipos e documentação por meio do JSDoc, evitando o uso do tipo ''any'' e garantindo códigos concisos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать масштабируемые и поддерживаемые API с помощью Fastify, с строгой проверкой типов и документацией через JSDoc, избегая использования типа ''any'' и обеспечивая краткий код.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من بناء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات القابلة للتحجيم والصيانة باستخدام Fastify، مع التحقق الصارم من الأنواع ووثائق عبر JSDoc، وتجنب استخدام نوع ''any'' وضمان كود متconcise."},"useCases":{"en":["Building high-performance RESTful APIs with strict type safety","Creating and documenting maintainable and scalable server-side applications using Fastify and TypeScript","Developing type-safe plugins for Fastify using TypeScript"],"zh":["构建具有严格类型安全性的高性能 RESTful API","使用 Fastify 和 TypeScript 创建和文档记录可维护且可扩展的服务器端应用程序","使用 TypeScript 为 Fastify 开发类型安全的插件"],"ja":["厳格なタイプセーフティーを備えた高性能 RESTful API の構築","Fastify と TypeScript を使用してメンテナンス可能でスケーラブルなサーバーサイドアプリケーションを作成およびドキュメント化する","TypeScript を使用して Fastify 用のタイプセーフなプラグインを開発する"],"ko":["严格한 유형 안전성을 갖춘 고성능 RESTful API 구축","Fastify 및 TypeScript를 사용하여 유지 보수 가능한 확장 가능한 서버 측 애플리케이션 구축 및 문서화","TypeScript를 사용하여 Fastify용 유형 안전한 플러그인 개발"],"es":["Creación de APIs RESTful de alto rendimiento con seguridad de tipos estricta","Creación y documentación de aplicaciones de servidor mantenibles y escalables utilizando Fastify y TypeScript","Desarrollo de plugins seguros con TypeScript para Fastify"],"fr":["Création d''API RESTful haute performance avec une sécurité de type stricte","Création et documentation d''applications serveur maintenables et évolutives en utilisant Fastify et TypeScript","Développement de plugins sécurisés avec TypeScript pour Fastify"],"de":["Erstellung von RESTful-APIs mit hoher Leistung und strenger Typsicherheit","Erstellung und Dokumentation von wartbaren und skalierbaren Server-Anwendungen mit Fastify und TypeScript","Entwicklung von typesicheren Plugins für Fastify mit TypeScript"],"pt":["Construção de APIs RESTful de alto desempenho com segurança de tipos rigorosa","Criação e documentação de aplicações de servidor lado servidor mantidas e escaláveis usando Fastify e TypeScript","Desenvolvimento de plugins seguros de tipo para Fastify usando TypeScript"],"ru":["Построение высокопроизводительных RESTful-API с строгой безопасностью типов","Создание и документация поддерживаемых и масштабируемых серверных приложений с помощью Fastify и TypeScript","Разработка плагинов с безопасностью типов для Fastify с помощью TypeScript"],"ar":["بناء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful عالية الأداء مع أمان النوع الصارم","إنشاء وتوثيق تطبيقات جانب الخادم القابلة للصيانة والتحجيم باستخدام Fastify و TypeScript","تطوير البرامج المساعدة آمنة النوع ل Fastify باستخدام TypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Dependent on Fastify and TypeScript versions","Needs strict adherence to TypeScript guidelines and best practices"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 环境","依赖于 Fastify 和 TypeScript 版本","需要严格遵循 TypeScript 指南和最佳实践"],"ja":["Node.js 環境が必要","Fastify と TypeScript のバージョンに依存する","TypeScript のガイドラインとベストプラクティスに厳格に従う必要がある"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요합니다.","Fastify 및 TypeScript 버전에 종속됩니다.","TypeScript 가이드라인 및 모범 사례를 엄격히 준수해야 함"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Node.js","Dependiente de las versiones de Fastify y TypeScript","Necesita una estricta adherencia a las pautas y mejores prácticas de TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Dépendant des versions de Fastify et TypeScript","Nécessite une adhésion stricte aux directives et aux meilleures pratiques de TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node.js-Umgebung","Abhängig von den Versionen von Fastify und TypeScript","Benötigt eine strikte Einhaltung der Richtlinien und Best Practices von TypeScript"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js","Dependente das versões do Fastify e TypeScript","Necessita de adesão rigorosa às diretrizes e práticas recomendadas do TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Зависит от версий Fastify и TypeScript","Требует строгого соблюдения руководств и рекомендаций по TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","يعتمد على إصدارات Fastify و TypeScript","يحتاج إلى الالتزام الصارم بإرشادات وأفضل الممارسات الخاصة ب TypeScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
