تسويق","en":"positioning-angles"},"description":{"zh":"帮助开发者找到产品的独特卖点，通过定位角度策略提高销售额","ja":"開発者がユニークなアングルを見つけて売上を上げるためのポジショニング戦略を提供する","ko":"개발자가 제품의 唯一의 판매 포인트를 찾고 판매량을 높이는 것을 도와주는 기술","es":"El skill de positioning-angles te ayuda a encontrar el ángulo de marketing único que maximiza la demanda. Aprende a actuar como estratega de posicionamiento ...","fr":"Le skill de positioning-angles vous aide à trouver l''angle de marketing unique qui maximise la demande. Apprenez à agir comme stratège de positionnement et à...","de":"Das Skill positioning-angles hilft Ihnen, den einzigartigen Marketingwinkel zu finden, der die Nachfrage maximiert. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie als Positionierungs...","pt":"O ângulo de posicionamento é crucial para o sucesso de um produto. Aprenda a encontrar o ângulo certo com nossa ferramenta.","ru":"Угол позиционирования имеет решающее значение для успеха продукта. Узнайте, как найти правильный угол с нашей помощью.","ar":"زاوية التموضع حاسمة لنجاح المنتج. تعلم كيف تجد الزاوية الصحيحة باستخدام أداةنا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["市场阶段匹配","机制发现","角度选择","测试和优化","提高销售额"],"ja":["マーケットステージのマッチング","メカニズムの発見","アングルの選択","テストと最適化","売上の向上"],"ko":["시장 단계 매칭","메커니즘 발견","각도 선택","테스트 및 최적화","판매량 증가"],"es":["Análisis de etapas de mercado","Descubrimiento de mecanismos","Selección de ángulos","Pruebas y optimización"],"fr":["Analyse des étapes de marché","Découverte de mécanismes","Sélection d''angles","Tests et optimisation"],"de":["Marktstufenanalyse","Mechanismenerkennung","Winkelauswahl","Tests und Optimierung"],"pt":["Análise de estágios de mercado","Descoberta de mecanismos","Seleção de ângulos","Testes e otimização"],"ru":["Анализ стадий рынка","Обнаружение механизмов","Выбор углов","Тесты и оптимизация"],"ar":["تحليل مراحل السوق","اكتشاف الآليات","اختيار الزوايا","الاختبارات والتحسين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["定位角度","独特卖点","市场阶段匹配","机制发现","角度选择","测试和优化"],"ja":["ポジショニングアングル","ユニークなアングル","マーケットステージのマッチング","メカニズムの発見","アングルの選択","テストと最適化"],"ko":["포지셔닝 각도"," 唯一의 판매 포인트","시장 단계 매칭","메커니즘 발견","각도 선택","테스트 및 최적화"],"es":["posicionamiento de marketing","ángulos de marketing","maximizar la demanda","estrategia de posicionamiento","análisis de mercado","descubrimiento de mecanismos"],"fr":["positionnement de marketing","angles de marketing","maximiser la demande","stratégie de positionnement","analyse de marché","découverte de mécanismes"],"de":["Marketingpositionierung","Marketingwinkel","Nachfragemaximierung","Positionierungsstrategie","Marktanalyse","Mechanismenerkennung"],"pt":["ângulos de posicionamento","marketing de produtos","otimização de marketing","estágios de mercado","mecanismos de marketing","testes de marketing"],"ru":["углы позиционирования","маркетинг продуктов","оптимизация маркетинга","стадии рынка","механизмы маркетинга","тесты маркетинга"],"ar":["زوايا التموضع","تسويق المنتجات","تحسين التسويق","مراحل السوق","آليات التسويق","اختبارات التسويق"]}},"owner":"Clecio013","repo":"lumes","repoPath":"Clecio013/lumes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"positioning-angles","description":"Use this skill when users need to find their unique marketing angle, differentiate from competitors, or transform their positioning. Activates for find my angle, how do I stand out, why isnt this selling, we sound like everyone else, or positioning strategy questions.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Positioning Angles - Find Your Unique Angle\n\n## Overview\n\nAct as a positioning strategist. Help users find the marketing angle that transforms \"why isn''t this selling\" into \"we can''t keep up with demand.\" Guide them through market stage matching, mechanism discovery, angle selection, and testing.\n\n**Core Principle:** \"One angle will outperform others 3-10x. Test, don''t guess.\"\n\n**Role:** Find angles. Name mechanisms. Differentiate positioning.\n\n## When This Activates\n\nThis skill auto-activates","body":"# Positioning Angles - Find Your Unique Angle\n\n## Overview\n\nAct as a positioning strategist. Help users find the marketing angle that transforms \"why isn''t this selling\" into \"we can''t keep up with demand.\" Guide them through market stage matching, mechanism discovery, angle selection, and testing.\n\n**Core Principle:** \"One angle will outperform others 3-10x. Test, don''t guess.\"\n\n**Role:** Find angles. Name mechanisms. Differentiate positioning.\n\n## When This Activates\n\nThis skill auto-activates when:\n\n- User says \"why isn''t this selling\"\n- User asks \"how do I stand out\"\n- User says \"we sound like everyone else\"\n- User asks \"what''s my unique angle\"\n- User mentions \"I need differentiation\"\n- User asks \"how do I position this\"\n- User says \"competitors are saying the same thing\"\n- User mentions low conversion or sales issues\n\n## The Framework: Positioning Angles\n\n**The 4-Step Process:**\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     POSITIONING ANGLES                          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  1. MATCH MARKET STAGE  →  What promise fits your market?      │\n│  2. FIND MECHANISM      →  What do you do that others skip?    │\n│  3. PICK ANGLE          →  Which angle type differentiates?    │\n│  4. TEST IT             →  Specific? Differentiated? Believable?│\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Execution Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Match Your Market Stage\n\nAsk the user:\n\n> **Tell me about your market:**\n>\n> 1. What do you sell? (Quick description)\n> 2. How aware is your audience of solutions like yours?\n> 3. How many competitors are saying similar things?\n> 4. Has your audience been burned before by similar promises?\n\n**Market Stage Matrix:**\n\n| Stage | Description | Promise Strategy | Template |\n|-------|-------------|------------------|----------|\n| **NEW** | Audience doesn''t know solution exists | Simple promise | \"Now you can [X]\" |\n| **GROWING** | Audience knows solution, few competitors | Bigger claim | \"[X] in [specific time]\" |\n| **CROWDED** | Many competitors, similar claims | Show mechanism | \"The [method] that works\" |\n| **JADED** | Audience skeptical, been burned before | Prove it | \"[Data/proof] that shows\" |\n| **MATURE** | Solution commoditized, price wars | Sell identity | \"For [people who are X]\" |\n\n**Stage Indicators:**\n\n| Stage | Signs You''re Here |\n|-------|-------------------|\n| NEW | \"What is this?\" / Little competition / Educating market |\n| GROWING | Competition emerging / Claims escalating / Features matter |\n| CROWDED | \"I''ve seen this before\" / Many alternatives / Trust declining |\n| JADED | \"I''ve tried everything\" / Cynicism / Needs proof |\n| MATURE | Price is main factor / Commoditized / Identity-based buying |\n\n**Discovery Questions:**\n\n- When you describe what you do, do people say \"what''s that?\" (NEW) or \"oh yeah, like [competitor]\" (CROWDED)?\n- Are competitors making bold claims, or is everyone cautious?\n- Has your audience tried and failed with similar solutions?\n\n### Step 2: Find Your Mechanism\n\nThe mechanism is what you do that competitors skip.\n\n> **What makes your approach different:**\n>\n> 1. What''s one thing you do that others don''t bother with?\n> 2. What step do competitors skip that you insist on?\n> 3. What would your best customer say about why you''re different?\n> 4. What''s the \"unfair advantage\" in your process?\n\n**Mechanism Discovery Framework:**\n\n```\nCOMPETITORS DO:         YOU DO:\n────────────────        ────────────\n[Generic approach]  →   [Your specific thing]\n[Skip this step]    →   [You always do this]\n[Rush this part]    →   [You spend extra time here]\n```\n\n**Naming Your Mechanism:**\n\n| Bad (Generic) | Good (Specific) |\n|---------------|-----------------|\n| \"Our unique approach\" | \"The [X] Method\" |\n| \"Our proven system\" | \"The [X] Framework\" |\n| \"Our special process\" | \"The [X] Protocol\" |\n| \"What we do differently\" | \"[Name] Technique\" |\n\n**Mechanism Formula:**\n\n```\n\"The [Descriptive Adjective] [Core Action] [Framework Type]\"\n\nExamples:\n- \"The Reverse Funnel Framework\"\n- \"The 3-Layer Positioning Protocol\"\n- \"The Rapid Validation Method\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Pick Your Angle\n\nPresent 5 angle types. Generate variations for their situation.\n\n**Angle Types:**\n\n| Angle | When to Use | Template | Example |\n|-------|-------------|----------|---------|\n| **CONTRARIAN** | Audience believes wrong thing | \"Everything you know about [X] is wrong\" | \"Everything you know about dieting is wrong—it''s not about eating less\" |\n| **TRANSFORMATION** | Clear before/after exists | \"From [painful state] to [desired state]\" | \"From scattered freelancer to $20k/month agency owner\" |\n| **ENEMY** | External blame resonates | \"Stop letting [X] steal your [Y]\" | \"Stop letting algorithm changes steal your traffic\" |\n| **SPEED** | Time is the constraint | \"[Outcome] in [time] without [sacrifice]\" | \"Launch in 7 days without hiring developers\" |\n| **SPECIFICITY** | Crowded market, need niche | \"For [exact person] who wants [exact thing]\" | \"For B2B SaaS founders who want enterprise clients\" |\n\n**Angle Selection Questions:**\n\n- Does your audience believe something wrong? → CONTRARIAN\n- Is there a clear before/after? → TRANSFORMATION\n- Can you blame something external? → ENEMY\n- Is speed a key desire? → SPEED\n- Is your market crowded? → SPECIFICITY\n\n**Generate 3 Variations:**\n\nFor each angle type that fits, generate a specific version:\n\n```\nANGLE 1 (Primary recommendation):\n\"[Complete angle statement]\"\nType: [Angle Type]\nWhy: [Why this fits their situation]\n\nANGLE 2 (Alternative):\n\"[Complete angle statement]\"\nType: [Angle Type]\nWhy: [Why this could work]\n\nANGLE 3 (Alternative):\n\"[Complete angle statement]\"\nType: [Angle Type]\nWhy: [Why this could work]\n```\n\n### Step 4: Test It\n\nRun each angle through the 3-point test:\n\n**The 3-Point Angle Test:**\n\n| Test | Question | Pass Criteria | Fail Example |\n|------|----------|---------------|--------------|\n| **Specific?** | Can I visualize the result? | Numbers, timeframes, concrete outcomes | \"Better results\" (vague) |\n| **Differentiated?** | Can a competitor say the same? | Only this brand can make this claim | \"We help you grow\" (anyone can say) |\n| **Believable?** | Does mechanism/proof support it? | Evidence backs the claim | \"10x your business overnight\" (no proof) |\n\n**Scoring:**\n\n| Score | Rating | Action |\n|-------|--------|--------|\n| 3/3 | Strong | Test this angle |\n| 2/3 | Weak | Strengthen the failing point |\n| 1/3 | Very Weak | Pick different angle |\n| 0/3 | Don''t Use | Complete rework needed |\n\n**Specificity Upgrade Examples:**\n\n| Before (Vague) | After (Specific) |\n|----------------|------------------|\n| \"Better results\" | \"20 lbs in 6 weeks\" |\n| \"More revenue\" | \"$50k MRR in 90 days\" |\n| \"Save time\" | \"2 hours back every day\" |\n| \"Grow your business\" | \"Add 10 enterprise clients this quarter\" |\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# Positioning Angle Analysis: [Product/Service]\n\n## Market Stage Assessment\n\n**Current Stage:** [NEW/GROWING/CROWDED/JADED/MATURE]\n\n**Evidence:**\n- [Sign 1]\n- [Sign 2]\n- [Sign 3]\n\n**Recommended Promise Strategy:** [Strategy from matrix]\n\n---\n\n## Your Mechanism\n\n**What You Do That Others Skip:**\n> [Description of unique approach]\n\n**Mechanism Name:** \"The [X] [Method/Framework/Protocol]\"\n\n**Why This Works:**\n> [Brief explanation]\n\n---\n\n## Angle Recommendations\n\n### Primary Angle (Recommended)\n\n**Statement:**\n> \"[Complete angle statement]\"\n\n**Type:** [Angle Type]\n\n**Test Results:**\n| Test | Result | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| Specific? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Differentiated? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Believable? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n\n**Score:** [X/3]\n\n---\n\n### Alternative Angle 1\n\n**Statement:**\n> \"[Complete angle statement]\"\n\n**Type:** [Angle Type]\n\n**Test Results:**\n| Test | Result | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| Specific? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Differentiated? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Believable? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n\n**Score:** [X/3]\n\n---\n\n### Alternative Angle 2\n\n**Statement:**\n> \"[Complete angle statement]\"\n\n**Type:** [Angle Type]\n\n**Test Results:**\n| Test | Result | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| Specific? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Differentiated? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n| Believable? | ✅/❌ | [Details] |\n\n**Score:** [X/3]\n\n---\n\n## Testing Recommendation\n\n**Angle to Test First:** [Primary recommendation]\n\n**Why:** [Rationale]\n\n**How to Test:**\n1. [ ] Use in headline A/B test\n2. [ ] Test in cold outreach subject lines\n3. [ ] Try in social media hooks\n4. [ ] Use in ad copy\n\n**Success Metrics:**\n- Click-through rate improvement\n- Conversion rate improvement\n- Response rate improvement\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. [ ] Test primary angle in [specific context]\n2. [ ] If underperforms, test alternative angles\n3. [ ] Once validated, use in all messaging\n4. [ ] Build offer around winning angle with `offer-architect`\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Before/After Transformations\n\n**❌ Before (Weak Angles):**\n\n| Product | Weak Angle | Problem |\n|---------|-----------|---------|\n| Marketing agency | \"We help you grow\" | Generic, anyone can say it |\n| Fitness app | \"Get fit faster\" | Vague, not specific |\n| SaaS tool | \"Save time on [task]\" | No differentiation |\n| Course | \"Learn [skill]\" | No transformation shown |\n\n**✅ After (Strong Angles):**\n\n| Product | Strong Angle | Why It Works |\n|---------|-------------|--------------|\n| Marketing agency | \"For B2B SaaS founders who want enterprise clients in 90 days using the Account Penetration Method\" | SPECIFICITY + SPEED + MECHANISM |\n| Fitness app | \"20 lbs in 6 weeks without giving up the foods you love, using the Metabolic Reset Protocol\" | SPEED + MECHANISM + SPECIFIC |\n| SaaS tool | \"Stop letting manual data entry steal 2 hours of your day\" | ENEMY + SPECIFIC |\n| Course | \"From complete beginner to first paid client in 30 days\" | TRANSFORMATION + SPEED |\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n| Skill | When to Use Together |\n|-------|---------------------|\n| `offer-architect` | After finding angle, build complete offer around it |\n| `copywriter` | Write headlines and copy using the angle |\n| `expert-architect` | Build authority positioning that supports the angle |\n| `funnel-architect` | Design funnel messaging using the angle |\n| `channel-validator` | Validate where to distribute the angle |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n1. **Skipping market stage analysis** - Different stages need different promise types\n2. **Generic mechanisms** - \"Our unique approach\" tells nothing\n3. **Testing only one angle** - One angle outperforms by 3-10x, multiple tests are required\n4. **Vague specificity** - \"Better results\" isn''t an angle\n5. **Claims without proof** - JADED markets need evidence\n6. **Identity-selling too early** - Save this for MATURE markets\n7. **Copying competitor angles** - If they say it, differentiation is impossible\n\n## When to Route Elsewhere\n\n- If user needs to **build complete expert positioning** → `expert-architect`\n- If user needs to **validate their positioning** → `expert-validator`\n- If user needs to **build the offer** → `offer-architect`\n- If user needs to **write copy** → `copywriter`\n- If user is **stuck on execution** → `execution-accelerator`\n- If user needs to **validate market size** → `market-sizer`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:21:24.580Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced positioning strategy capabilities to transform product demand.","zh":"非常适合需要高级定位策略能力来转化产品需求的营销代理","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが製品需要を変革するための高度なポジショニング戦略機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"제품 수요를 변革하기 위한 고급 포지셔닝 전략 기능이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan capacidades de estrategia de posicionamiento avanzadas para transformar la demanda de productos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing qui ont besoin de capacités de stratégie de positionnement avancées pour transformer la demande de produits.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte Positionierungsstrategie-Fähigkeiten benötigen, um die ProduktNachfrage zu transformieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de capacidades de estratégia de posicionamento avançadas para transformar a demanda do produto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности стратегии позиционирования для трансформации спроса на продукт.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام التسويقية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات استراتيجية تحديد المواقع المتقدمة لتحويل إقبال المنتج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover high-performing market angles through mechanism discovery, angle selection, and testing, utilizing core principles like ''One angle will outperform others 3-10x'' and leveraging market stage matching to drive demand.","zh":"赋予代理商通过机制发现、角度选择和测试发现高性能市场角度的能力，利用诸如''一个角度将比其他角度表现好3-10倍''的核心原则，并利用市场阶段匹配来驱动需求","ja":"メカニズムの発見、アングル選択、テストを利用して、高パフォーマンスのマーケットアングルを発見するエージェントをEmpower化し、''1つのアングルは他のアングルより3〜10倍優れています''などのコア原則を利用し、マーケットステージのマッチングを利用して需要を促進する","ko":"메커니즘 발견, 각도 선택 및 테스트를 통해 고성능 시장 각도를 발견할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고 ''하나의 각도는 다른 각도보다 3~10배 더 잘 수행됩니다''와 같은 핵심 원리를 활용하여 시장 단계 매칭을 통해 수요를 창출하는 능력","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descubrir ángulos de mercado de alto rendimiento a través del descubrimiento de mecanismos, la selección de ángulos y las pruebas, utilizando principios básicos como ''Un ángulo superará a los demás 3-10 veces'' y aprovechando la coincidencia de la etapa del mercado para impulsar la demanda.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir des angles de marché à haute performance grâce à la découverte de mécanismes, à la sélection d''angles et à des tests, en utilisant des principes de base tels que ''Un angle surpassera les autres 3-10 fois'' et en exploitant la correspondance de la phase de marché pour stimuler la demande.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochleistungsfähige Marktwinkele durch Mechanismenerkennung, Winkelwahl und Tests zu entdecken, wobei grundlegende Prinzipien wie ''Ein Winkel wird die anderen 3-10 Mal überbieten'' verwendet werden und die Markstadienübereinstimmung genutzt wird, um die Nachfrage zu steuern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrirem ângulos de mercado de alto desempenho por meio da descoberta de mecanismos, seleção de ângulos e testes, utilizando princípios básicos como ''Um ângulo superará os outros 3-10x'' e aproveitando a correspondência de estágios de mercado para impulsionar a demanda.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать рыночные углы с высоким показателем эффективности посредством открытия механизмов, выбора углов и тестирования, используя основные принципы, такие как ''Один угол будет в 3-10 раз превосходить другие'' и используя сопоставление стадий рынка для стимулирования спроса.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من اكتشاف زوايا السوق ذات الأداء العالي من خلال اكتشاف الآليات واختيار الزوايا والاختبار، باستخدام المبادئ الأساسية مثل ''زاوية واحدة ستتفوق على الأخرى 3-10 مرات'' وتحقيق مطابقة مرحلة السوق لتعزيز الطلب."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating market research to find unique selling angles","Generating positioning strategies to differentiate products","Testing and validating marketing angles for optimal performance"],"zh":["自动化市场研究以找到独特的销售角度","生成定位策略以区分产品","测试和验证市场角度以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["ユニークなセールスアングルを見つけるためのマーケットリサーチの自動化","製品の違いを作るためのポジショニング戦略の生成","最適なパフォーマンスを実現するためのマーケットアングルのテストと検証"],"ko":["독특한 판매 각도를 찾기 위한 시장 연구 자동화","제품을 차별화하기 위한 포지셔닝 전략 생성","최적의 성능을 달성하기 위한 시장 각도 테스트 및 검증"],"es":["Automatizar la investigación de mercados para encontrar ángulos de venta únicos","Generar estrategias de posicionamiento para diferenciar productos","Probar y validar ángulos de marketing para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Automatiser la recherche de marché pour trouver des angles de vente uniques","Générer des stratégies de positionnement pour différencier les produits","Tester et valider les angles de marketing pour une performance optimale"],"de":["Automatisierung der Marktforschung, um einzigartige Verkaufswinkel zu finden","Erzeugen von Positionierungsstrategien, um Produkte zu differenzieren","Testen und Validieren von Marketingwinkeln für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Automatizar a pesquisa de mercado para encontrar ângulos de venda exclusivos","Gerar estratégias de posicionamento para diferenciar produtos","Testar e validar ângulos de marketing para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать исследование рынка для нахождения уникальных углов продаж","Генерировать стратегии позиционирования для дифференциации продуктов","Тестировать и подтверждать маркетинговые углы для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["أتمتة البحث السوقي لإيجاد زوايا بيع فريدة","توليد استراتيجيات تحديد المواقع لتمييز المنتجات","اختبار وتأكيد زوايا التسويق للأداء الأمثل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for market data and product information","Dependent on accurate market stage matching and mechanism discovery"],"zh":["需要用户输入市场数据和产品信息","依赖于准确的市场阶段匹配和机制发现"],"ja":["マーケットデータと製品情報のユーザー入力を必要とする","正確なマーケットステージのマッチングとメカニズムの発見に依存"],"ko":["시장 데이터 및 제품 정보에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요","정확한 시장 단계 일치 및 메커니즘 발견에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la entrada del usuario para datos de mercado y información de producto","Dependiente de la coincidencia precisa de la etapa del mercado y del descubrimiento de mecanismos"],"fr":["Nécessite la saisie de l''utilisateur pour les données de marché et les informations de produit","Dépend de la correspondance précise de la phase de marché et de la découverte de mécanismes"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzereingaben für Marktdaten und Produktinformationen","Abhängig von genauer Markstadienübereinstimmung und Mechanismenerkennung"],"pt":["Requer entrada do usuário para dados de mercado e informações de produto","Depende da correspondência precisa de estágios de mercado e descoberta de mecanismos"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для рыночных данных и информации о продукте","Зависит от точного соответствия стадий рынка и открытия механизмов"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لبيانات السوق ومعلومات المنتج","يعتمد على مطابقة دقيقة لمرحلة السوق واكتشاف الآليات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
