para experiências relevantes","Criação de múltiplas versões de currículos","Ênfase em habilidades específicas"],"ru":["Анализ описаний вакансий","Создание индивидуальных резюме","Оптимизация для систем отслеживания кандидатов","Подчеркивание релевантного опыта","Создание множественных версий резюме","Акцент на конкретных навыках"],"ar":["تحليل وصفات الوظائف","إنشاء سير ذاتية مخصصة","تحسين برامج تتبع المرشحين","تأكيد الخبرات ذات الصلة","إنشاء نسخ متعددة من السيرة الذاتية","التركيز على المهارات المحددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["个性化简历","简历生成器","ATS优化","求人描述分析","职位定制","简历写作"],"ja":["カスタムResume","Resume生成ツール","ATS最適化","求人描述分析","職種別カスタマイズ","Resume作成"],"ko":["맞춤형 이력서","이력서 생성기","ATS 최적화","직무 설명 분석","직무별 맞춤형","이력서 작성"],"es":["generador de currículums","currículum personalizado","análisis de descripciones de trabajo","optimización para ATS","creación de currículums","currículum para diferentes sectores"],"fr":["générateur de CV","CV sur mesure","analyse des descriptions de travail","optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures","création de CV","CV pour différents secteurs"],"de":["Lebenslauf-Generator","individueller Lebenslauf","Analyse von Stellenbeschreibungen","Optimierung für Bewerber-Trackingsysteme","Erstellung von Lebensläufen","Lebenslauf für verschiedene Branchen"],"pt":["gerador de currículos","currículo personalizado","vagas de emprego","sistemas de rastreamento de candidatos","otimização de currículos","desenvolvimento de carreira"],"ru":["генератор резюме","индивидуальное резюме","вакансии","системы отслеживания кандидатов","оптимизация резюме","карьерное развитие"],"ar":["مولد السيرة الذاتية","السيرة الذاتية المخصصة","الوظائف الشاغرة","برامج تتبع المرشحين","تحسين السيرة الذاتية","التطوير المهني"]}},"owner":"CuCryptos","repo":"sixroundsdeep","repoPath":"CuCryptos/sixroundsdeep","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailored-resume-generator","description":"Analyzes job descriptions and generates tailored resumes that highlight relevant experience, skills, and achievements to maximize interview chances","bodyPreview":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifi","body":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifications, and keywords from job postings\n2. **Identifies Priorities**: Determines what employers value most based on the job description language and structure\n3. **Tailors Content**: Reorganizes and emphasizes relevant experience, skills, and achievements\n4. **Optimizes Keywords**: Incorporates ATS-friendly keywords naturally throughout the resume\n5. **Formats Professionally**: Creates clean, professional resume layouts suitable for various formats\n6. **Provides Recommendations**: Suggests improvements and highlights gaps to address\n\n## How to Use\n\n### Basic Usage\nProvide a job description and your background information:\n\n```\nI''m applying for this job:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nHere''s my background:\n- 5 years as software engineer at TechCorp\n- Led team of 3 developers on mobile app project\n- Expert in Python, JavaScript, React\n- Computer Science degree from State University\n```\n\n### With Existing Resume\nUpload or paste your current resume along with the job description:\n\n```\nPlease tailor my resume for this position:\n\nJob Description:\n[paste job description]\n\nMy Current Resume:\n[paste resume content]\n```\n\n### Career Transition\nWhen changing industries or roles:\n\n```\nI''m transitioning from marketing to product management.\nHere''s the job I''m applying for:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nMy transferable experience:\n- 7 years in digital marketing\n- Led cross-functional teams\n- Managed product launches\n- Data analysis and A/B testing\n```\n\n## Example\n\n**User Request:**\n```\nI need a tailored resume for this job:\n\nSenior Data Analyst Position\n\nRequirements:\n- 5+ years experience in data analysis\n- Expert in SQL, Python, and data visualization tools\n- Experience with A/B testing and statistical analysis\n- Strong communication skills to present findings\n- Healthcare industry experience preferred\n\nMy background:\n- Data Analyst at RetailCo (2019-2024)\n- Created dashboards using Tableau and Power BI\n- Built Python scripts for data automation\n- Worked with marketing team on campaign analysis\n- Business Analytics degree\n- Also did 1 year internship at HealthPlus clinic\n```\n\n**Generated Output:**\n\n```markdown\n# JOHN DOE\nEmail: john.doe@email.com | Phone: (555) 123-4567 | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/johndoe\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nResults-driven Data Analyst with 5+ years of experience leveraging SQL, Python, and advanced\nvisualization tools to deliver actionable insights. Proven track record in statistical analysis,\nA/B testing, and cross-functional collaboration. Healthcare industry experience with strong\nability to communicate complex data findings to stakeholders.\n\n## TECHNICAL SKILLS\n- **Data Analysis & Programming**: SQL, Python, Statistical Analysis, A/B Testing\n- **Visualization Tools**: Tableau, Power BI, Advanced Dashboard Development\n- **Data Management**: Data Automation, ETL Processes, Database Optimization\n- **Business Intelligence**: Campaign Analytics, Performance Metrics, KPI Tracking\n\n## PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\n\n**Data Analyst** | RetailCo | 2019 - 2024\n- Designed and implemented 50+ SQL queries and Python automation scripts, reducing manual\n  data processing time by 60%\n- Conducted rigorous A/B testing and statistical analysis for marketing campaigns,\n  improving campaign ROI by 35%\n- Built interactive Tableau and Power BI dashboards for executive team, enabling\n  data-driven decision making\n- Presented analytical findings to cross-functional stakeholders including marketing,\n  operations, and executive leadership\n- Collaborated with marketing team to analyze customer behavior patterns and optimize\n  targeting strategies\n\n**Data Analysis Intern** | HealthPlus Clinic | 2018 - 2019\n- Supported healthcare analytics initiatives by analyzing patient data and operational metrics\n- Gained exposure to healthcare industry data management and HIPAA compliance requirements\n- Assisted in creating reports for clinical staff to improve patient care workflows\n\n## EDUCATION\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Business Analytics**\nState University | Graduated 2018\n\n## KEY ACHIEVEMENTS\n- Reduced data processing time by 60% through Python automation\n- Improved marketing campaign ROI by 35% through A/B testing and optimization\n- Created data visualization system now used across entire organization\n```\n\n**Additional Recommendations:**\n- Consider adding any specific healthcare projects or certifications\n- Quantify more achievements with metrics when possible\n- If you have experience with R or advanced statistical methods, add them\n- Consider mentioning any familiarity with healthcare regulations (HIPAA, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests resume tailoring:\n\n### 1. Gather Information\n\n**Job Description Analysis**:\n- Request the full job description if not provided\n- Ask for the company name and job title\n\n**Candidate Background**:\n- If user provides existing resume, use it as the foundation\n- If not, request:\n  - Work history (job titles, companies, dates, responsibilities)\n  - Education background\n  - Key skills and technical proficiencies\n  - Notable achievements and metrics\n  - Certifications or awards\n  - Any other relevant information\n\n### 2. Analyze Job Requirements\n\nExtract and prioritize:\n- **Must-have qualifications**: Years of experience, required skills, education\n- **Key skills**: Technical tools, methodologies, competencies\n- **Soft skills**: Communication, leadership, teamwork\n- **Industry knowledge**: Domain-specific experience\n- **Keywords**: Repeated terms, phrases, and buzzwords for ATS optimization\n- **Company values**: Cultural fit indicators from job description\n\nCreate a mental map of:\n- Priority 1: Critical requirements (deal-breakers)\n- Priority 2: Important qualifications (strongly desired)\n- Priority 3: Nice-to-have skills (bonus points)\n\n### 3. Map Candidate Experience to Requirements\n\nFor each job requirement:\n- Identify matching experience from candidate''s background\n- Find transferable skills if no direct match\n- Note gaps that need to be addressed or de-emphasized\n- Identify unique strengths to highlight\n\n### 4. Structure the Tailored Resume\n\n**Professional Summary** (3-4 lines):\n- Lead with years of experience in the target role/field\n- Include top 3-4 required skills from job description\n- Mention industry experience if relevant\n- Highlight unique value proposition\n\n**Technical/Core Skills Section**:\n- Group skills by category matching job requirements\n- List required tools and technologies first\n- Use exact terminology from job description\n- Only include skills you can substantiate with experience\n\n**Professional Experience**:\n- For each role, emphasize responsibilities and achievements aligned with job requirements\n- Use action verbs: Led, Developed, Implemented, Optimized, Managed, Created, Analyzed\n- **Quantify achievements**: Include numbers, percentages, timeframes, scale\n- Reorder bullet points to prioritize most relevant experience\n- Use keywords naturally from job description\n- Format: **[Action Verb] + [What] + [How/Why] + [Result/Impact]**\n\n**Education**:\n- List degrees, certifications relevant to position\n- Include relevant coursework if early career\n- Add certifications that match job requirements\n\n**Optional Sections** (if applicable):\n- Certifications & Licenses\n- Publications or Speaking Engagements\n- Awards & Recognition\n- Volunteer Work (if relevant to role)\n- Projects (especially for technical roles)\n\n### 5. Optimize for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n\n- Use standard section headings (Professional Experience, Education, Skills)\n- Incorporate exact keywords from job description naturally\n- Avoid tables, graphics, headers/footers, or complex formatting\n- Use standard fonts and bullet points\n- Include both acronyms and full terms (e.g., \"SQL (Structured Query Language)\")\n- Match job title terminology where truthful\n\n### 6. Format and Present\n\n**Format Options**:\n- **Markdown**: Clean, readable, easy to copy\n- **Plain Text**: ATS-optimized, safe for all systems\n- **Tips for Word/PDF**: Provide formatting guidance\n\n**Resume Structure Guidelines**:\n- Keep to 1 page for <10 years experience, 2 pages for 10+ years\n- Use consistent formatting and spacing\n- Ensure contact information is prominent\n- Use reverse chronological order (most recent first)\n- Maintain clean, scannable layout with white space\n\n### 7. Provide Strategic Recommendations\n\nAfter presenting the tailored resume, offer:\n\n**Strengths Analysis**:\n- What makes this candidate competitive\n- Unique qualifications to emphasize in cover letter or interview\n\n**Gap Analysis**:\n- Requirements not fully met\n- Suggestions for addressing gaps (courses, projects, reframing experience)\n\n**Interview Preparation Tips**:\n- Key talking points aligned with resume\n- Stories to prepare based on job requirements\n- Questions to ask that demonstrate fit\n\n**Cover Letter Hooks**:\n- Suggest 2-3 opening lines for cover letter\n- Key achievements to expand upon\n\n### 8. Iterate and Refine\n\nAsk if user wants to:\n- Adjust emphasis or tone\n- Add or remove sections\n- Generate alternative versions for different roles\n- Create format variations (traditional vs. modern)\n- Develop role-specific versions (if applying to multiple similar positions)\n\n### 9. Best Practices to Follow\n\n**Do**:\n- Be truthful and accurate - never fabricate experience\n- Use industry-standard terminology\n- Quantify achievements with specific metrics\n- Tailor each resume to specific job\n- Proofread for grammar and consistency\n- Keep language concise and impactful\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Include personal information (age, marital status, photo unless requested)\n- Use first-person pronouns (I, me, my)\n- Include references (\"available upon request\" is outdated)\n- List every job if career is 20+ years (focus on relevant, recent experience)\n- Use generic templates without customization\n- Exceed 2 pages unless very senior role\n\n### 10. Special Considerations\n\n**Career Changers**:\n- Use functional or hybrid resume format\n- Emphasize transferable skills\n- Create compelling narrative in summary\n- Focus on relevant projects and coursework\n\n**Recent Graduates**:\n- Lead with education\n- Include relevant coursework, projects, internships\n- Emphasize leadership in student organizations\n- Include GPA if 3.5+\n\n**Senior Executives**:\n- Lead with executive summary\n- Focus on leadership and strategic impact\n- Include board memberships, speaking engagements\n- Emphasize revenue growth, team building, vision\n\n**Technical Roles**:\n- Include technical skills section prominently\n- List programming languages, frameworks, tools\n- Include GitHub, portfolio, or project links\n- Mention methodologies (Agile, Scrum, etc.)\n\n**Creative Roles**:\n- Include link to portfolio\n- Highlight creative achievements and campaigns\n- Mention tools and software proficiencies\n- Consider more creative formatting (while maintaining ATS compatibility)\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n- **Be specific**: Provide complete job descriptions and detailed background information\n- **Share metrics**: Include numbers, percentages, and quantifiable achievements when describing your experience\n- **Indicate format preference**: Let the skill know if you need ATS-optimized, creative, or traditional format\n- **Mention constraints**: Share any specific requirements (page limits, sections to include/exclude)\n- **Iterate**: Don''t hesitate to ask for revisions or alternative approaches\n- **Multiple applications**: Generate separate tailored versions for different roles\n\n## Privacy Note\n\nThis skill processes your personal and professional information to generate tailored resumes. Always review the output before submitting to ensure accuracy and appropriateness. Remove or modify any information you prefer not to share with potential employers.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:22:39.225Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Career Guidance Agents needing advanced resume customization and ATS optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级简历自定义和申请跟踪系统优化能力的职业指导代理。","ja":"キャリアガイダンスエージェントが高度な履歴書カスタマイズとATS最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 이력서 사용자 지정 및 ATS 최적화 기능이 필요한 경력 가이드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de orientación profesional que necesitan personalización avanzada de currículos y capacidades de optimización de sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes (ATS).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''orientation de carrière ayant besoin d''une personnalisation de CV avancée et de capacités d''optimisation des systèmes de suivi des candidatures (ATS).","de":"Perfekt für Karriereberatungsagenten, die erweiterte Bewerbungsunterlagen-Anpassung und ATS-Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Orientação de Carreira que necessitam de personalização avançada de currículos e capacidades de otimização do Sistema de Rastreamento de Candidatos (ATS).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по карьерному консультированию, которым требуются продвинутые возможности настройки резюме и оптимизации системы отслеживания заявок (ATS).","ar":"مثالي لوسائل مساعدة التوجيه المهني التي تحتاج إلى تخصيص متقدم لاستئناف العمل وتحسين نظام تتبع المتقدمين (ATS)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze job descriptions, extract key requirements, and generate tailored resumes using Natural Language Processing (NLP) and Applicant Tracking System (ATS) protocols, optimizing for specific job positions and industries.","zh":"赋予代理分析职位描述、提取关键要求并使用自然语言处理（NLP）和申请跟踪系统（ATS）协议生成定制简历的能力，针对特定工作职位和行业进行优化。","ja":"エージェントが職務説明を分析し、重要な要件を抽出し、自然言語処理（NLP）とアプリケーショントラッキングシステム（ATS）プロトコルを使用してカスタマイズされた履歴書を生成する機能を提供し、特定の仕事のポジションと業界に最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 작업 설명을 분석하고 주요 요구 사항을 추출하여 자연어 처리(NLP)와 신청자 추적 시스템(ATS) 프로토콜을 사용하여 맞춤형 이력서를 생성하여 특정 작업 위치와 산업을 최적화하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar descripciones de trabajo, extraer requisitos clave y generar currículos personalizados utilizando Procesamiento de Lenguaje Natural (NLP) y protocolos de sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes (ATS), optimizando para puestos de trabajo y sectores específicos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les descriptions de poste, d''extraire les exigences clés et de générer des CV personnalisés en utilisant le traitement automatique des langues (NLP) et les protocoles des systèmes de suivi des candidatures (ATS), en optimisant pour des postes et des secteurs spécifiques.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Stellenbeschreibungen zu analysieren, Schlüsselanforderungen zu extrahieren und maßgeschneiderte Bewerbungen unter Verwendung von Natural Language Processing (NLP) und Anforderungen an Bewerberverfolgungssysteme (ATS) zu generieren, um spezifische Stellen und Branchen zu optimieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem descrições de trabalho, extraiam requisitos-chave e gerem currículos personalizados usando Processamento de Linguagem Natural (NLP) e protocolos do Sistema de Rastreamento de Candidatos (ATS), otimizando para posições e indústrias específicas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать описания работы, извлекать ключевые требования и генерировать индивидуальные резюме с помощью обработки естественного языка (NLP) и протоколов системы отслеживания заявок (ATS), оптимизируя для конкретных вакансий и отраслей.","ar":"يمكن للوسائل مساعدة التوجيه المهني تحليل وصفات العمل، واستخراج المتطلبات الرئيسية، وتوليد سير ذاتية مخصصة باستخدام معالجة اللغة الطبيعية (NLP) وبروتوكولات نظام تتبع المتقدمين (ATS)، وتحسينها لمناصب وصناعات محددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating resume generation for career transitions","Generating multiple resume versions for different job applications","Optimizing resumes for ATS compatibility and keyword extraction"],"zh":["自动为职业转换生成简历","为不同工作申请生成多个简历版本","优化简历以适应ATS兼容性和关键词提取"],"ja":["キャリア転換のための履歴書の自動生成","さまざまな仕事の申し込みのための複数の履歴書バージョンの生成","ATSの互換性とキーワード抽出のための履歴書の最適化"],"ko":["경력 전환을 위한 이력서 자동 생성","다양한 작업 신청을 위한 여러 이력서 버전 생성","ATS 호환성 및 키워드 추출을 위한 이력서 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de currículos para transiciones profesionales","Generación de múltiples versiones de currículos para diferentes solicitudes de trabajo","Optimización de currículos para la compatibilidad con ATS y la extracción de palabras clave"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de CV pour les transitions professionnelles","Génération de plusieurs versions de CV pour différentes candidatures","Optimisation des CV pour la compatibilité avec les ATS et l''extraction de mots clés"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Bewerbungen für Karriereübergänge","Erstellung mehrerer Bewerberversionen für verschiedene Bewerbungen","Optimierung von Bewerbungen für die Kompatibilität mit ATS und die Extraktion von Schlüsselwörtern"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de currículos para transições de carreira","Gerar múltiplas versões de currículos para diferentes solicitações de trabalho","Otimizar currículos para compatibilidade com o ATS e extração de palavras-chave"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию резюме для карьерных переходов","Генерировать несколько версий резюме для разных заявок на работу","Оптимизировать резюме для совместимости с ATS и извлечения ключевых слов"],"ar":["توفير توليد سير ذاتية آلي لتحولات مهنية","توليد نسخ متعددة من السير الذاتية لطلبات عمل مختلفة","تحسين السير الذاتية لتوافق نظام تتبع المتقدمين واستخراج الكلمات الرئيسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires job description input","Limited to resume generation for specific job positions and industries"],"zh":["需要工作描述输入","仅限为特定工作职位和行业生成简历"],"ja":["職務説明の入力が必要","特定の仕事のポジションと業界のための履歴書の生成のみ"],"ko":["작업 설명 입력이 필요","특정 작업 위치 및 산업을 위한 이력서 생성만"],"es":["Requiere la entrada de descripciones de trabajo","Limitado a la generación de currículos para puestos de trabajo y sectores específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite la saisie de descriptions de poste","Limité à la génération de CV pour des postes et des secteurs spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt die Eingabe von Stellenbeschreibungen","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Bewerbungen für bestimmte Stellen und Branchen"],"pt":["Requer entrada de descrição de trabalho","Limitado à geração de currículos para posições e indústrias específicas"],"ru":["Требует ввода описания работы","Ограничен генерацией резюме для конкретных вакансий и отраслей"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال وصف العمل","محدود بتوليد السير الذاتية لمناصب وصناعات محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('agentuity/sdk-explorer/agentuity-cli-auth-whoami', 'community', 'agentuity', 'sdk-explorer', 'agentuity/sdk-explorer', 'agentuity-cli-auth-whoami', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z', '2026-02-18T09:22:29.486Z', NULL, '{"id":"agentuity/sdk-explorer/agentuity-cli-auth-whoami","name":"agentuity-cli-auth-whoami","description":{"zh":"Agentuity Auth Whoami","ja":"Agentuity Auth Whoami","ko":"Agentuity Auth Whoami JSON","es":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami es una herramienta de línea de comandos que muestra información sobre el usuario autenticado. Permite personalizar la salida utilizando opciones como --json","fr":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami est un outil de ligne de commande qui affiche des informations sur l''utilisateur authentifié. Il permet de personnaliser la sortie en utilisant des options comme --json","de":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami ist ein Befehlszeilen-Tool, das Informationen über den authentifizierten Benutzer anzeigt. Es ermöglicht die Anpassung der Ausgabe mithilfe von Optionen wie --json","pt":"O Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami é uma ferramenta de demonstração que exibe informações do usuário autenticado. Ele fornece uma forma fácil de verificar as credenciais do usuário.","ru":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami — демонстрационный инструмент, который отображает информацию об аутентифицированном пользователе. Он предоставляет простой способ проверить учетные данные пользователя.","ar":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami هو أداة عرض توضح معلومات المستخدم المُصادق. يوفر طريقة سهلة للتحقق من بيانات الاعتماد للمستخدم.","en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami","ja":"Agentuity CLI ","ko":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami","es":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami: Información de usuario autenti...","fr":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami: Informations sur l''utilisateur...","de":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami: Informationen zum authentifizi...","pt":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami: Ferramenta de Autenticação","ru":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami: Инструмент Аутентификации","ar":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami: أداة التحقق","en":"agentuity-cli-auth-whoami"},"description":{"zh":"Agentuity Auth Whoami","ja":"Agentuity Auth Whoami","ko":"Agentuity Auth Whoami JSON","es":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami es una herramienta de línea de comandos que muestra información sobre el usuario autenticado. Permite personalizar la salida utiliz...","fr":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami est un outil de ligne de commande qui affiche des informations sur l''utilisateur authentifié. Il permet de personnaliser la sortie ...","de":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami ist ein Befehlszeilen-Tool, das Informationen über den authentifizierten Benutzer anzeigt. Es ermöglicht die Anpassung der Ausgabe ...","pt":"O Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami é uma ferramenta de demonstração que exibe informações do usuário autenticado. Ele fornece uma forma fácil de verificar as creden...","ru":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami — демонстрационный инструмент, который отображает информацию об аутентифицированном пользователе. Он предоставляет простой способ п...","ar":"Agentuity CLI Auth Whoami هو أداة عرض توضح معلومات المستخدم المُصادق. يوفر طريقة سهلة للتحقق من بيانات الاعتماد للمستخدم.","en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"definition":{"en":"A demo project showcasing the Agentuity platform (SDK, tools, and runtime)"},"features":{"zh":["Agentuity Auth Whoami","JSON","Agentuity Auth Whoami","Agentuity Auth Whoami JSON"],"ja":["Agentuity Auth Whoami","JSON","Agentuity Auth Whoami","Agentuity Auth Whoami JSON"],"ko":["Agentuity Auth Whoami","JSON","Agentuity Auth Whoami","Agentuity Auth Whoami JSON"],"es":["Muestra información sobre el usuario autenticado","Permite personalizar la salida utilizando opciones como --json","Soporta autenticación con Agentuity Auth","Proporciona salida en formato JSON","Es compatible con la plataforma Agentuity"],"fr":["Affiche des informations sur l''utilisateur authentifié","Permet de personnaliser la sortie en utilisant des options comme --json","Prend en charge l''authentification avec Agentuity Auth","Fournit une sortie au format JSON","Est compatible avec la plateforme Agentuity"],"de":["Zeigt Informationen über den authentifizierten Benutzer an","Ermöglicht die Anpassung der Ausgabe mithilfe von Optionen wie --json","Unterstützt die Authentifizierung mit Agentuity Auth","Bietet Ausgabe im JSON-Format","Ist kompatibel mit der Agentuity-Plattform"],"pt":["Exibe informações do usuário autenticado","Fornece saída em formato JSON","Requer autenticação com `agentuity auth login`","Permite uso com `bunx @agentuity/cli`","Retorna objeto JSON com informações do usuário"],"ru":["Отображает информацию об аутентифицированном пользователе","Предоставляет вывод в формате JSON","Требует аутентификации с `agentuity auth login`","Позволяет использовать с `bunx @agentuity/cli`","Возвращает объект JSON с информацией о пользователе"],"ar":["يعرض معلومات المستخدم المُصادق","يوفر الإخراج في تنسيق JSON","يتطلب مصادقة مع `agentuity auth login`","يسمح باستخدامه مع `bunx @agentuity/cli`","يعيد كائن JSON مع معلومات المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agentuity Auth Whoami","Agentuity CLI","Auth Whoami","JSON","Agentuity Auth","Agentuity"],"ja":["Agentuity Auth Whoami","Agentuity CLI","Auth Whoami","JSON","Agentuity Auth","Agentuity"],"ko":["Agentuity Auth Whoami","Agentuity CLI","Auth Whoami","JSON","Agentuity Auth","Agentuity"],"es":["Agentuity CLI","Auth Whoami","usuario autenticado","información de usuario","autenticación","JSON","Agentuity Auth","plataforma Agentuity"],"fr":["Agentuity CLI","Auth Whoami","utilisateur authentifié","informations utilisateur","authentification","JSON","Agentuity Auth","plateforme Agentuity"],"de":["Agentuity CLI","Auth Whoami","authentifizierter Benutzer","Benutzerinformationen","Authentifizierung","JSON","Agentuity Auth","Agentuity-Plattform"],"pt":["Agentuity CLI","Auth Whoami","Autenticação","Desenvolvimento","Ferramenta de linha de comando","JSON","Credenciais do usuário"],"ru":["Agentuity CLI","Auth Whoami","Аутентификация","Разработка","Инструмент командной строки","JSON","Учетные данные пользователя"],"ar":["Agentuity CLI","Auth Whoami","التحقق","التطوير","أداة سطر الأوامر","JSON","بيانات الاعتماد للمستخدم"]}},"owner":"agentuity","repo":"sdk-explorer","repoPath":"agentuity/sdk-explorer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agentuity-cli-auth-whoami","description":"Display information about the currently authenticated user. Requires authentication. Use for managing authentication credentials","version":"0.1.2","tags":"read-only fast requires-auth","bodyPreview":"# Auth Whoami\n\nDisplay information about the currently authenticated user\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity auth whoami\n```\n\n## Examples\n\nShow current user:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli auth whoami\n```\n\nShow output in JSON format:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli --json auth whoami\n```\n\n## Output\n\nReturns JSON object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"userId\": \"string\",\n  \"firstName\": \"string\",\n  \"lastName\": \"string\",\n  \"organizations\": \"array\"\n}\n```\n\n| Field |","body":"# Auth Whoami\n\nDisplay information about the currently authenticated user\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Authenticated with `agentuity auth login`\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nagentuity auth whoami\n```\n\n## Examples\n\nShow current user:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli auth whoami\n```\n\nShow output in JSON format:\n\n```bash\nbunx @agentuity/cli --json auth whoami\n```\n\n## Output\n\nReturns JSON object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"userId\": \"string\",\n  \"firstName\": \"string\",\n  \"lastName\": \"string\",\n  \"organizations\": \"array\"\n}\n```\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| `userId` | string | Unique user identifier |\n| `firstName` | string | User first name |\n| `lastName` | string | User last name |\n| `organizations` | array | Organizations the user belongs to |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:22:29.486Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Authenticated Agents needing to verify and display user information in JSON format.","zh":"非常适合需要验证并以JSON格式显示用户信息的认证代理。","ja":"ユーザー情報を検証し、JSON形式で表示する必要がある認証済みエージェントに最適です。","ko":"사용자 정보를 검증하고 JSON 형식으로 표시해야 하는 인증된 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Autenticados que necesitan verificar y mostrar información de usuario en formato JSON.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents authentifiés ayant besoin de vérifier et d''afficher des informations utilisateur au format JSON.","de":"Perfekt für authentifizierte Agenten, die Benutzerinformationen in JSON-Format überprüfen und anzeigen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autenticados que precisam verificar e exibir informações do usuário em formato JSON.","ru":"Идеально для Аутентифицированных Агентов, которым необходимо проверить и отобразить информацию о пользователе в формате JSON.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المؤمنين الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق من وعرض معلومات المستخدم بطريقة JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to retrieve and display authenticated user details, including user ID, first and last name, and associated organizations, using the `agentuity auth whoami` command with optional JSON output.","zh":"使代理能够使用带有可选JSON输出的`agentuity auth whoami`命令检索和显示认证用户的详细信息，包括用户ID、姓名以及关联的组织。","ja":"オプションのJSON出力を備えた`agentuity auth whoami`コマンドを使用して、ユーザーID、姓名、関連組織を含む認証済みユーザーの詳細を取得および表示する機能をエージェントに提供します。","ko":"선택적 JSON 출력을 사용하는 `agentuity auth whoami` 명령을 통해 사용자 ID, 이름, 성以及 관련 조직을 포함한 인증된 사용자 세부 정보를 검색하고 표시하는 기능을 에이전트에 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar y mostrar detalles de usuario autenticado, incluyendo ID de usuario, nombre y apellido, y organizaciones asociadas, utilizando el comando `agentuity auth whoami` con salida JSON opcional.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer et d''afficher les détails de l''utilisateur authentifié, y compris l''ID utilisateur, le nom et le prénom, ainsi que les organisations associées, en utilisant la commande `agentuity auth whoami` avec une sortie JSON optionnelle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, authentifizierte Benutzerdetails abzurufen und anzuzeigen, einschließlich Benutzer-ID, Vor- und Nachname sowie assoziierten Organisationen, mithilfe des Befehls `agentuity auth whoami` mit optionaler JSON-Ausgabe.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a recuperar e exibir detalhes do usuário autenticado, incluindo ID do usuário, primeiro e último nome e organizações associadas, usando o comando `agentuity auth whoami` com saída JSON opcional.","ru":"Позволяет агентам получать и отображать детали аутентифицированного пользователя, включая идентификатор пользователя, имя и фамилию, а также связанные организации, используя команду `agentuity auth whoami` с опциональным выводом JSON.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء استرداد وعرض تفاصيل المستخدم المؤمن، بما في ذلك معرف المستخدم، الاسم الأول والاسم الأخير والمنظمات المرتبطة، باستخدام الأمر `agentuity auth whoami` مع إخراج JSON اختياري."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying current user authentication","Displaying user information in CLI tools","Parsing user details in JSON format for further processing"],"zh":["验证当前用户认证","在CLI工具中显示用户信息","解析JSON格式的用户详细信息以供进一步处理"],"ja":["現在のユーザー認証の確認","CLIツールでのユーザー情報の表示","さらなる処理のためのJSON形式でのユーザー詳細情報の解析"],"ko":["현재 사용자 인증 확인","CLI 도구에서 사용자 정보 표시","추가 처리를 위해 JSON 형식의 사용자 세부 정보 파싱"],"es":["Verificar la autenticación del usuario actual","Mostrar información de usuario en herramientas de línea de comandos","Analizar detalles de usuario en formato JSON para un procesamiento posterior"],"fr":["Vérifier l''authentification de l''utilisateur actuel","Afficher les informations utilisateur dans les outils de ligne de commande","Analyser les détails de l''utilisateur au format JSON pour un traitement ultérieur"],"de":["Überprüfen der Authentifizierung des aktuellen Benutzers","Anzeigen von Benutzerinformationen in Befehlszeilenwerkzeugen"," Parsen von Benutzerdetails im JSON-Format für eine weitere Verarbeitung"],"pt":["Verificar a autenticação do usuário atual","Exibir informações do usuário em ferramentas da CLI","Analise de detalhes do usuário em formato JSON para processamento adicional"],"ru":["Проверка аутентификации текущего пользователя","Отображение информации о пользователе в инструментах CLI","Парсинг деталей пользователя в формате JSON для дальнейшей обработки"],"ar":["التحقق من مصادقة المستخدم الحالي","عرض معلومات المستخدم في أدوات CLI","تحليل تفاصيل المستخدم في تنسيق JSON لمعالجة إضافية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires prior authentication with `agentuity auth login`","Limited to displaying information about the currently authenticated user"],"zh":["需要事先使用`agentuity auth login`进行认证","仅限于显示当前认证用户的信息"],"ja":["事前に`agentuity auth login`による認証が必要","現在認証されているユーザーに関する情報の表示に限定される"],"ko":["`agentuity auth login`을 통한 사전 인증 필요","현재 인증된 사용자에 대한 정보 표시로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una autenticación previa con `agentuity auth login`","Limitado a mostrar información sobre el usuario autenticado actualmente"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification préalable avec `agentuity auth login`","Limité à l''affichage d''informations sur l''utilisateur actuellement authentifié"],"de":["Benötigt eine vorherige Authentifizierung mit `agentuity auth login`","Begrenzt auf die Anzeige von Informationen über den derzeit authentifizierten Benutzer"],"pt":["Requer autenticação prévia com `agentuity auth login`","Limitado a exibir informações sobre o usuário autenticado atualmente"],"ru":["Требуется предварительная аутентификация с помощью `agentuity auth login`","Ограничен отображением информации только о текущем аутентифицированном пользователе"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة سابقة باستخدام `agentuity auth login`","محدود بعرض معلومات حول المستخدم المؤمن الحالي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
