 Effect: نمذجة القدرات","en":"effect-service-architecture"},"description":{"zh":"Effect 服务架构是一种简化服务定义和依赖管理的方法，通过使用 Effect.Service 来组合层和管理资源","ja":"Effect サービスアーキテクチャは、Effect.Service を使用して層を組み合わせてリソースを管理することで、サービス定義と依存関係の管理を簡素化する方法です","ko":"Effect 서비스 아키텍처는 Effect.Service를 사용하여 계층을 조합하고 리소스를 관리함으로써 서비스 정의와 의존성 관리를 단순화하는 방법입니다","es":"La arquitectura de servicio efecto permite modelar capacidades con Effect.Service y componer capas en la frontera de la aplicación","fr":"L''architecture de service effect permet de modéliser des capacités avec Effect.Service et de composer des couches à la frontière de l''application","de":"Die Effekt-Service-Architektur ermöglicht die Modellierung von Kapazitäten mit Effect.Service und die Zusammensetzung von Schichten an der Anwendungs-Grenze","pt":"A Arquitetura de Serviço Effect é uma abordagem para modelar capacidades com Effect.Service e compor camadas na fronteira da aplicação","ru":"Эффект Сервис Архитектура - это подход к моделированию возможностей с помощью Effect.Service и составлению слоев на границе приложения","ar":"هندسة الخدمة Effect هي نهج لنمذجة القدرات باستخدام Effect.Service وتركيب طبقات على حدود التطبيق","en":"Fresh project with everything (I) might need."},"definition":{"en":"Fresh project with everything (I) might need."},"features":{"zh":["简化服务定义","组合层和管理资源","提高代码可维护性和可扩展性","支持引入可复用能力","支持管理多个依赖项","支持资源的获取和释放"],"ja":["サービス定義の簡素化","層の組み合わせとリソースの管理","コードの保守性と拡張性の向上","再利用可能な機能の導入のサポート","複数の依存関係の管理のサポート","リソースの取得と解放のサポート"],"ko":["서비스 정의 단순화","계층 조합과 리소스 관리","코드 유지 보수성과 확장성 향상","재사용 가능한 기능 도입 지원","다중 의존성 관리 지원","리소스 취득과 해제 지원"],"es":["Modelar capacidades con Effect.Service","Componer capas en la frontera de la aplicación","Simplificar definiciones de servicios","Introducir capacidades reutilizables","Administrar recursos que requieren adquisición y liberación"],"fr":["Modéliser des capacités avec Effect.Service","Composer des couches à la frontière de l''application","Simplifier les définitions de services","Introduire des capacités réutilisables","Gérer des ressources qui nécessitent acquisition et libération"],"de":["Kapazitäten mit Effect.Service modellieren","Schichten an der Anwendungs-Grenze zusammensetzen","Service-Definitionen vereinfachen","Wiederverwendbare Kapazitäten einführen","Ressourcen verwalten, die Erwerb und Freigabe erfordern"],"pt":["Modelagem de capacidades com Effect.Service","Composição de camadas na fronteira da aplicação","Simplificação de definições de serviço","Reutilização de capacidades","Gerenciamento de recursos","Refatoração de lógica"],"ru":["Моделирование возможностей с помощью Effect.Service","Составление слоев на границе приложения","Упрощение определений сервисов","Переиспользование возможностей","Управление ресурсами","Рефакторинг логики"],"ar":["نمذجة القدرات باستخدام Effect.Service","تركيب طبقات على حدود التطبيق","تسهيل تعريفات الخدمة","إعادة استخدام القدرات","إدارة الموارد","إعادة هيكلة المنطق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Effect 服务架构","服务定义","依赖管理","代码可维护性","代码可扩展性","软件设计模式","Effect.Service"],"ja":["Effect サービスアーキテクチャ","サービス定義","依存関係の管理","コードの保守性","コードの拡張性","ソフトウェア設計パターン","Effect.Service"],"ko":["Effect 서비스 아키텍처","서비스 정의","의존성 관리","코드 유지 보수성","코드 확장성","소프트웨어 설계 패턴","Effect.Service"],"es":["arquitectura de servicio efecto","Effect.Service","modelado de capacidades","composición de capas","definiciones de servicios","capacidades reutilizables","administración de recursos"],"fr":["architecture de service effect","Effect.Service","modélisation de capacités","composition de couches","définitions de services","capacités réutilisables","gestion de ressources"],"de":["Effekt-Service-Architektur","Effect.Service","Modellierung von Kapazitäten","Zusammensetzung von Schichten","Service-Definitionen","wiederverwendbare Kapazitäten","Ressourcenverwaltung"],"pt":["Arquitetura de Serviço Effect","Desenvolvimento de Capabilidades","Effect.Service","Simplificação de Definições de Serviço","Reutilização de Código","Gerenciamento de Recursos","Refatoração de Lógica","Desenvolvimento de Software"],"ru":["Эффект Сервис Архитектура","Разработка Возможностей","Effect.Service","Упрощение Определений Сервисов","Переиспользование Код","Управление Ресурсами","Рефакторинг Логики","Разработка Программного Обеспечения"],"ar":["هندسة الخدمة Effect","نمذجة القدرات","Effect.Service","تسهيل تعريفات الخدمة","إعادة استخدام الكود","إدارة الموارد","إعادة هيكلة المنطق","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"rayhanadev","repo":"fresh","repoPath":"rayhanadev/fresh","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"effect-service-architecture","description":"Designs non-trivial Effect modules using Effect.Service with generated tags and layers, dependency wiring, and one provide boundary. Use when introducing reusable capabilities, external integrations, or resource-managed components.","bodyPreview":"# Effect Service Architecture\n\nUse this skill to model capabilities with `Effect.Service` first, then compose layers at the application boundary.\nThis reflects the Layer docs guidance for simplifying service definitions with `Effect.Service`.\n\n## When To Use\n\n- Introducing a reusable capability (repository, client, adapter)\n- Wiring multiple dependencies into one workflow\n- Managing resources that need acquisition and release\n- Refactoring logic that currently uses scattered `Effect.provide(...)","body":"# Effect Service Architecture\n\nUse this skill to model capabilities with `Effect.Service` first, then compose layers at the application boundary.\nThis reflects the Layer docs guidance for simplifying service definitions with `Effect.Service`.\n\n## When To Use\n\n- Introducing a reusable capability (repository, client, adapter)\n- Wiring multiple dependencies into one workflow\n- Managing resources that need acquisition and release\n- Refactoring logic that currently uses scattered `Effect.provide(...)`\n\n## Prerequisite Checks\n\n- Confirm the capability is reused across modules or operations.\n- Confirm dependencies can be consumed through Effect context.\n- Confirm there is a single bootstrap boundary for layer provisioning.\n\n## Preferred Pattern: `Effect.Service`\n\nDefine services with:\n\n- `sync` or `succeed` for static services\n- `effect` for dynamic construction\n- `scoped` for lifecycle-managed resources\n- `dependencies` for automatic dependency wiring\n- `accessors: true` when static accessor functions improve ergonomics\n\nGenerated artifacts from `Effect.Service`:\n\n- The service tag itself (use with `yield* ServiceName`)\n- `.Default` layer\n- `.DefaultWithoutDependencies` when `dependencies` are defined\n- `.make`/`.use` helpers and optional accessors\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Define the service as `class X extends Effect.Service<X>()(\"X\", { ... }) {}`.\n2. Choose constructor mode: `sync`, `succeed`, `effect`, or `scoped`.\n3. Declare `dependencies` instead of manually threading layers when possible.\n4. Keep business programs dependent on service interfaces only.\n5. Provide composed layers once at the application boundary.\n6. In tests, replace dependencies/services with test layers.\n\n## Example: Simplified Service Definition\n\n```typescript\nimport { Effect } from \"effect\";\n\nclass Prefix extends Effect.Service<Prefix>()(\"Prefix\", {\n  sync: () => ({ prefix: \"PRE\" }),\n}) {}\n\nclass Logger extends Effect.Service<Logger>()(\"Logger\", {\n  accessors: true,\n  effect: Effect.gen(function* () {\n    const { prefix } = yield* Prefix;\n    return {\n      info: (message: string) =>\n        Effect.sync(() => {\n          console.log(`[${prefix}] ${message}`);\n        }),\n    };\n  }),\n  dependencies: [Prefix.Default],\n}) {}\n\nconst program = Logger.info(\"service started\").pipe(\n  Effect.provide(Logger.Default),\n);\n```\n\n## Testing And Mocking With Service Layers\n\nWhen dependencies are declared, use `.DefaultWithoutDependencies` to inject test dependencies.\n\n```typescript\nimport { Effect, Layer } from \"effect\";\n\nconst PrefixTest = Layer.succeed(\n  Prefix,\n  { prefix: \"TEST\" } as const,\n);\n\nconst testProgram = Logger.info(\"hello\").pipe(\n  Effect.provide(Logger.DefaultWithoutDependencies),\n  Effect.provide(PrefixTest),\n);\n```\n\nFor direct service replacement tests:\n\n```typescript\nconst LoggerTest = Layer.succeed(\n  Logger,\n  {\n    info: (_: string) => Effect.void,\n  } as const,\n);\n```\n\n## `Effect.Service` vs `Context.Tag`\n\nUse `Effect.Service` by default when you want tag + layer generation and simpler setup.\nUse `Context.Tag` directly for advanced custom patterns where auto-generated layers/accessors are not desired.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Building service tags manually when `Effect.Service` would suffice.\n- Providing layers deep in business logic instead of app bootstrap.\n- Mixing construction styles inconsistently without clear rationale.\n- Returning untyped (`any`/lazy `unknown`) service APIs.\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n- Service classes use `Effect.Service` with an intentional constructor mode.\n- Dependencies are declared via `dependencies` where appropriate.\n- `.Default` is used at runtime bootstrap.\n- Tests use layer overrides (`.DefaultWithoutDependencies` or direct replacement layers).\n- Business logic depends on service contracts, not concrete implementations.\n\n## References\n\n- https://effect.website/docs/requirements-management/layers/#simplifying-service-definitions-with-effectservice\n- https://effect.website/docs/requirements-management/layers/\n- https://effect-ts.github.io/effect/effect/Effect.ts.html\n- https://effect-ts.github.io/effect/effect/Layer.ts.html\n- https://effect-ts.github.io/effect/effect/Context.ts.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:23:20.010Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing structured service definitions with Effect.Service","zh":"适用于需要结构化服务定义的高级 AI 代理，具有 Effect.Service","ja":"Effect.Service を使用した構造化サービス定義を必要とする高度な AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"구조화된 서비스 정의가 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며 Effect.Service를 사용합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial avanzados que necesitan definiciones de servicio estructuradas con Effect.Service","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle avancés nécessitant des définitions de service structurées avec Effect.Service","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents, die strukturierte Dienstdefinitionen mit Effect.Service benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de definições de serviço estruturadas com Effect.Service","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, требующих структурированных определений сервисов с Effect.Service","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يحتاجون إلى تعريفات خدمة منظمة مع Effect.Service"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to model capabilities with Effect.Service, simplifying service definitions and composing layers at the application boundary using Effect.Service, enabling efficient management of resources and dependencies with protocols like acquisition and release","zh":"赋予代理以 Effect.Service 建模能力，简化服务定义，并使用 Effect.Service 在应用边界组合层，以协议如获取和释放来实现资源和依赖的高效管理","ja":"エージェントに Effect.Service を使用して機能をモデル化する能力を与え、サービス定義を簡素化し、Effect.Service を使用してアプリケーション境界で層を合成し、取得や解放などのプロトコルを使用してリソースと依存関係を効率的に管理する","ko":"에이전트가 Effect.Service를 사용하여 기능을 모델링할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 서비스 정의를 단순화하고 Effect.Service를 사용하여 애플리케이션 경계에서 계층을 구성하여 취득 및 해제와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 리소스 및 종속성을 효율적으로 관리합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a modelar capacidades con Effect.Service, simplificando las definiciones de servicio y componiendo capas en el límite de la aplicación utilizando Effect.Service, lo que permite una gestión eficiente de los recursos y dependencias con protocolos como adquisición y liberación","fr":"Permet aux agents de modéliser les capacités avec Effect.Service, simplifiant les définitions de service et composant les couches à la limite de l''application en utilisant Effect.Service, permettant ainsi une gestion efficace des ressources et des dépendances avec des protocoles tels que l''acquisition et la libération","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Fähigkeiten mit Effect.Service zu modellieren, vereinfacht Dienstdefinitionen und kombiniert Schichten an der Anwendungs-Grenze unter Verwendung von Effect.Service, ermöglicht so eine effiziente Verwaltung von Ressourcen und Abhängigkeiten mit Protokollen wie Erwerb und Freigabe","pt":"Habilita os agentes a modelar capacidades com Effect.Service, simplificando as definições de serviço e compondo camadas na fronteira da aplicação usando Effect.Service, permitindo a gestão eficiente de recursos e dependências com protocolos como aquisição e liberação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью моделировать возможности с Effect.Service, упрощая определения сервисов и составляя слои на границе приложения с помощью Effect.Service, обеспечивая эффективное управление ресурсами и зависимостями с протоколами, такими как приобретение и освобождение","ar":"يُمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نمذجة القدرات مع Effect.Service، وبذلك يُبسط تعريفات الخدمة ويتألف Layers في حدود التطبيق باستخدام Effect.Service، وتمكين الإدارة الفعالة للموارد والاعتماديات بروتوكولات مثل الاستحواذ والإطلاق"},"useCases":{"en":["Introducing reusable capabilities with repository, client, or adapter services","Wiring multiple dependencies into one workflow for streamlined operations","Refactoring logic to utilize Effect.Service instead of scattered Effect.provide(...)"],"zh":["引入可重用的功能，使用存储库、客户端或适配器服务","将多个依赖项连接到一个工作流中以简化操作","重构逻辑以使用 Effect.Service 而不是分散的 Effect.provide(...)"],"ja":["リポジトリ、クライアント、またはアダプタサービスを使用して再利用可能な機能を導入する","複数の依存関係を 1 つのワークフローに接続して操作を簡素化する","分散した Effect.provide(...) の代わりに Effect.Service を使用するようにロジックをリファクタリングする"],"ko":["저장소, 클라이언트 또는 어댑터 서비스를 사용하여 재사용 가능한 기능을 도입합니다","스트림라인된 작업을 위해 여러 종속성을 하나의 워크플로에 연결합니다","분산된 Effect.provide(...) 대신 Effect.Service를 사용하도록 논리를 리팩토링합니다"],"es":["Presentar capacidades reutilizables con servicios de repositorio, cliente o adaptador","Conectar múltiples dependencias en un flujo de trabajo para operaciones optimizadas","Reestructurar la lógica para utilizar Effect.Service en lugar de Effect.provide(...) disperso"],"fr":["Présenter des capacités réutilisables avec des services de référentiel, client ou adaptateur","Relier plusieurs dépendances en un flux de travail pour des opérations optimisées","Réorganiser la logique pour utiliser Effect.Service au lieu de Effect.provide(...) dispersé"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare Fähigkeiten mit Repository-, Client- oder Adapter-Diensten einführen","Mehrere Abhängigkeiten in einem Arbeitsablauf für optimierte Operationen verbinden","Logik neu strukturieren, um Effect.Service anstelle von verteilter Effect.provide(...) zu verwenden"],"pt":["Apresentar capacidades reutilizáveis com serviços de repositório, cliente ou adaptador","Conectar várias dependências em um fluxo de trabalho para operações simplificadas","Reestruturar a lógica para utilizar Effect.Service em vez de Effect.provide(...) dispersos"],"ru":["Введение повторно используемых возможностей с сервисами хранилища, клиента или адаптера","Подключение нескольких зависимостей к одному рабочему процессу для оптимизации операций","Перестановка логики для использования Effect.Service вместо рассредоточенных Effect.provide(...)"],"ar":["تقديم قدرات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع خدمات المستودع أو العميل أو المُحوّل","ربط الاعتماديات المتعددة في تدفق عمل واحد من أجل عمليات مبسطة","إعادة هيكلة المنطق لاستخدام Effect.Service بدلاً من Effect.provide(...) المتناثرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Effect.Service and its application boundary","Limited to projects utilizing the Effect.Service architecture"],"zh":["需要理解 Effect.Service 及其应用边界","仅限于使用 Effect.Service 架构的项目"],"ja":["Effect.Service 及びそのアプリケーション境界を理解する必要がある","Effect.Service アーキテクチャを使用するプロジェクトのみに限定される"],"ko":["Effect.Service 및その 애플리케이션 경계를 이해해야 함","Effect.Service 아키텍처를 사용하는 프로젝트에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de Effect.Service y su límite de aplicación","Limitado a proyectos que utilizan la arquitectura Effect.Service"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de Effect.Service et de sa limite d''application","Limité aux projets utilisant l''architecture Effect.Service"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis von Effect.Service und seiner Anwendungs-Grenze","Begrenzt auf Projekte, die die Effect.Service-Architektur verwenden"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de Effect.Service e sua fronteira de aplicação","Limitado a projetos que utilizam a arquitetura Effect.Service"],"ru":["Требует понимания Effect.Service и его границы приложения","Ограничен проектами, использующими архитектуру Effect.Service"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم Effect.Service وحدوده التطبيق","محدود للمشاريع التي تستخدم هندسة Effect.Service"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
