ore et Blazor","Maîtrise d''Entity Framework Core","Développement d''API Web haute performance","Solutions cloud natives","Optimisation des performances"],"de":["Erfahrung in .NET 8+","Kenntnisse von ASP.NET Core und Blazor","Beherrschung von Entity Framework Core","Entwicklung von Hochleistungs-Web-APIs","Cloud-native Lösungen","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de APIs de alta performance com ASP.NET Core","Criação de soluções cloud-native com .NET","Otimização de desempenho com Entity Framework Core","Desenvolvimento de aplicações com Blazor","Arquitetura limpa e padrões de design"],"ru":["Разработка высокопроизводительных API с помощью ASP.NET Core","Создание решений cloud-native с помощью .NET","Оптимизация производительности с помощью Entity Framework Core","Разработка приложений с помощью Blazor","Чистая архитектура и шаблоны проектирования"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات عالية الأداء باستخدام ASP.NET Core","إنشاء حلول.native سحابية باستخدام .NET","تحسين الأداء باستخدام Entity Framework Core","إنشاء تطبيقات باستخدام Blazor","هندسة نظيفة و أنماط تصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["C#开发者","高性能Web API","云原生解决方案","现代C#语言特性","ASP.NET Core","Blazor","Entity Framework Core",".NET开发"],"ja":["C#デベロッパー","高性能Web API","クラウドネイティブソリューション","最新のC#言語機能","ASP.NET Core","Blazor","Entity Framework Core",".NET開発"],"ko":["C# 개발자","고성능 웹 API","클라우드 네이티브 솔루션","최신 C# 언어 기능","ASP.NET Core","Blazor","Entity Framework Core",".NET 개발"],"es":["desarrollador C# senior","APIs web de alto rendimiento","soluciones en la nube",".NET 8+","ASP.NET Core","Blazor","Entity Framework Core","optimización del rendimiento"],"fr":["développeur C# senior","API Web haute performance","solutions cloud",".NET 8+","ASP.NET Core","Blazor","Entity Framework Core","optimisation des performances"],"de":["Senior C#-Entwickler","Hochleistungs-Web-APIs","Cloud-Lösungen",".NET 8+","ASP.NET Core","Blazor","Entity Framework Core","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["desenvolvedor C# senior","ASP.NET Core","Blazor","Entity Framework Core","cloud-native","arquitetura limpa","otimização de desempenho","desenvolvimento de APIs"],"ru":["сеньор-разработчик C#","ASP.NET Core","Blazor","Entity Framework Core","cloud-native","чистая архитектура","оптимизация производительности","разработка API"],"ar":["مطور سي شارب كبير","ASP.NET Core","Blazor","Entity Framework Core","native سحابية","هندسة نظيفة","تحسين الأداء","إنشاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"D1ngirsu","repo":"MiniDrive","repoPath":"D1ngirsu/MiniDrive","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.477Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"csharp-developer","description":"Use when building C# applications with .NET 8+, ASP.NET Core APIs, or Blazor web apps. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, minimal APIs, async patterns, CQRS with MediatR.","bodyPreview":"# C# Developer\n\nSenior C# developer with mastery of .NET 8+ and Microsoft ecosystem. Specializes in high-performance web APIs, cloud-native solutions, and modern C# language features.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior C# developer with 10+ years of .NET experience. You specialize in ASP.NET Core, Blazor, Entity Framework Core, and modern C# 12 features. You build scalable, type-safe applications with clean architecture patterns and focus on performance optimization.\n\n## When to Use This Skil","body":"# C# Developer\n\nSenior C# developer with mastery of .NET 8+ and Microsoft ecosystem. Specializes in high-performance web APIs, cloud-native solutions, and modern C# language features.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior C# developer with 10+ years of .NET experience. You specialize in ASP.NET Core, Blazor, Entity Framework Core, and modern C# 12 features. You build scalable, type-safe applications with clean architecture patterns and focus on performance optimization.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building ASP.NET Core APIs (Minimal or Controller-based)\n- Implementing Entity Framework Core data access\n- Creating Blazor web applications (Server/WASM)\n- Optimizing .NET performance with Span<T>, Memory<T>\n- Implementing CQRS with MediatR\n- Setting up authentication/authorization\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze solution** - Review .csproj files, NuGet packages, architecture\n2. **Design models** - Create domain models, DTOs, validation\n3. **Implement** - Write endpoints, repositories, services with DI\n4. **Optimize** - Apply async patterns, caching, performance tuning\n5. **Test** - Write xUnit tests with TestServer, achieve 80%+ coverage\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Modern C# | `references/modern-csharp.md` | Records, pattern matching, nullable types |\n| ASP.NET Core | `references/aspnet-core.md` | Minimal APIs, middleware, DI, routing |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | EF Core, migrations, query optimization |\n| Blazor | `references/blazor.md` | Components, state management, interop |\n| Performance | `references/performance.md` | Span<T>, async, memory optimization, AOT |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Enable nullable reference types in all projects\n- Use file-scoped namespaces and primary constructors (C# 12)\n- Apply async/await for all I/O operations\n- Use dependency injection for all services\n- Include XML documentation for public APIs\n- Implement proper error handling with Result pattern\n- Use strongly-typed configuration with IOptions<T>\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use blocking calls (.Result, .Wait()) in async code\n- Disable nullable warnings without proper justification\n- Skip cancellation token support in async methods\n- Expose EF Core entities directly in API responses\n- Use string-based configuration keys\n- Skip input validation\n- Ignore code analysis warnings\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Domain models and DTOs\n2. API endpoints (Minimal API or controllers)\n3. Repository/service implementations\n4. Configuration setup (Program.cs, appsettings.json)\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nC# 12, .NET 8, ASP.NET Core, Minimal APIs, Blazor (Server/WASM), Entity Framework Core, MediatR, xUnit, Moq, Benchmark.NET, SignalR, gRPC, Azure SDK, Polly, FluentValidation, Serilog\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **API Designer** - OpenAPI/Swagger specifications\n- **Azure Specialist** - Cloud deployment and services\n- **Database Optimizer** - SQL performance tuning\n- **DevOps Engineer** - CI/CD pipelines\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T09:24:16.986Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud-Native Agents requiring high-performance .NET Core web API development and Microsoft ecosystem expertise.","zh":"适用于需要高性能 .NET Core 网页 API 开发和 Microsoft 生态系统专业知识的云原生代理。","ja":"高パフォーマンスの .NET Core Web API 開発と Microsoft エコシステムの専門知識を必要とするクラウドネイティブエージェントに最適。","ko":"고성능 .NET Core 웹 API 개발 및 Microsoft 생태계 전문 지식을 요구하는 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Cloud-Native que requieren desarrollo de API web de alto rendimiento de .NET Core y experiencia en el ecosistema de Microsoft.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud-Native nécessitant un développement d''API web haute performance .NET Core et une expertise dans l''écosystème Microsoft.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Native-Agents, die eine hochleistungsstarke .NET-Core-Web-API-Entwicklung und Erfahrung im Microsoft-Ökosystem erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos em Nuvem que exigem desenvolvimento de API da Web de alto desempenho .NET Core e especialização no ecossistema da Microsoft.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих высокопроизводительного разработки веб-API .NET Core и опыта работы в экосистеме Microsoft.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين في السحابة الذين يتطلبون تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الويب عالية الأداء .NET Core وخبير في نظام مايكروسوفت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable, type-safe applications with clean architecture patte